Hajime ni kami wa ten to chi to o souzou sareta.
Chi wa katachi naku, munashiku, yami ga fuchi no omote ni ari, kami no rei ga mizu no omote o ootte ita.
Kami wa "Hikari are" to iwareta. Suru to hikari ga atta.
Kami wa sono hikari o mite, yoshi to sareta. Kami wa sono hikari to yami to o wakerareta.
Kami wa hikari o hiru to nazuke, yami o yoru to nazukerareta. Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Daiichi nichi de aru.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Mizu no aida ni oozora ga atte, mizu to mizu to o wakeyo".
Sono you ni natta. Kami wa oozora o tsukutte, oozora no shita no mizu to oozora no ue no mizu to o wakerareta.
Kami wa sono oozora o ten to nazukerareta. Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Daini nichi de aru.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Ten no shita no mizu wa hitotsu tokoro ni atsumari, kawaita chi ga arawareyo". Sono you ni natta.
Kami wa sono kawaita chi o riku to nazuke, mizu no atsumatta tokoro o umi to nazukerareta. Kami wa mite, yoshi to sareta.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Chi wa aokusa to, tane o motsu kusa to, shurui ni shitagatte tane no aru mi o musubu kaju to o chi no ue ni wa e sase yo". Sono you ni natta.
Chi wa aokusa to, shurui ni shitagatte tane o motsu kusa to, shurui ni shitagatte tane no aru mi o musubu ki to o haesaseta. Kami wa mite, yoshi to sareta.
Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Daisan nichi de aru.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Ten no oozora ni hikari ga atte hiru to yoru to o wake, shirushi no tame, kisetsu no tame, hi no tame, toshi no tame ni nari,
Ten no oozora ni atte chi o terasu hikari to nare". Sono you ni natta.
Kami wa futatsu no ookina hikari o tsukuri, ookii hikari ni hiru o tsukasadorase, chiisai hikari ni yoru o tsukasadorase, mata hoshi o tsukurareta.
Kami wa korera o ten no oozora ni oite chi o terasase,
Hiru to yoru to o tsukasadorase, hikari to yami to o wakesaserareta. Kami wa mite, yoshi to sareta.
Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Daiyonnichi de aru.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Mizu wa ikimono no mure de michi, tori wa chi no ue, ten no oozora o tobe".
Kami wa umi no ooinaru kemono to, mizu ni muragaru subete no ugoku ikimono to o, shurui ni shitagatte souzou shi, mata tsubasa no aru subete no tori o, shurui ni shitagatte souzou sareta. Kami wa mite, yoshi to sareta.
Kami wa korera o shukufuku shite iwareta, "Umeyo, fue yo, umi no mizu ni michiyo, mata tori wa chi ni fue yo".
Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Daigo nichi de aru.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Chi wa ikimono o shurui ni shitagatte idase. Kachiku to, hau mono to, chi no kemono to o shurui ni shitagatte idase". Sono you ni natta.
Kami wa chi no kemono o shurui ni shitagai, kachiku o shurui ni shitagai, mata chi ni hau subete no mono o shurui ni shitagatte tsukurareta. Kami wa mite, yoshi to sareta.
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Wareware no katachi ni, wareware ni katadotte hito o tsukuri, kore ni umi no uo to, sora no tori to, kachiku to, chi no subete no kemono to, chi no subete no hau mono to o osamesaseyou".
Kami wa jibun no katachi ni hito o souzou sareta. Sunawachi, kami no katachi ni souzou shi, otoko to onna to ni souzou sareta.
Kami wa karera o shukufuku shite iwareta, "Umeyo, fue yo, chi ni michiyo, chi o shitagawase yo. Mata umi no uo to, sora no tori to, chi ni ugoku subete no ikimono to o osameyo".
Kami wa mata iwareta, "Watashi wa zenchi no omote ni aru tane o motsu subete no kusa to, tane no aru mi o musubu subete no ki to o anata gata ni ataeru. Kore wa anata gata no shokumotsu to narude arou.
Mata chi no subete no kemono, sora no subete no tori, chi o hau subete no mono, sunawachi inochi aru mono ni wa, shokumotsu to shite subete no aokusa o ataeru". Sono you ni natta.
Kami ga tsukutta subete no mono o mirareta tokoro, sore wa, hanahada yokatta. Yuu to nari, mata asa to natta. Dairoku nichi de aru.
Kou shite ten to chi to, sono banshou to ga kansei shita.
Kami wa dainana nichi ni sono sagyou o oerareta. Sunawachi, sono subete no sagyou o owatte dainana nichi ni yasumareta.
Kami wa sono dainana nichi o shukufuku shite, kore o seibetsu sareta. Kami ga kono hi ni, sono subete no souzou no waza o owatte yasumaretakara de aru.
Kore ga tenchi souzou no yurai de aru. Shu naru kami ga chi to ten to o tsukurareta toki,
Chi ni wa mada no no ki mo naku, mata no no kusa mo haete inakatta. Shu naru kami ga chi ni ame o furasezu, mata tsuchi o tagayasu hito mo nakattakara de aru.
Shikashi chi kara izumi ga wakiagatte tsuchi no zenmen o uruoshite ita.
Shu naru kami wa tsuchi no chiri de hito o tsukuri, inochi no iki o sono hana ni fuki irerareta. Soko de hito wa ikita mono to natta.
Shu naru kami wa higashi no kata, Eden ni hitotsu no sono o moukete, sono tsukutta hito o soko ni okareta.
Mata Shu naru kami wa, mite utsukushiku, taberu ni yoi subete no ki o tsuchi kara wa e sase, sarani sono no chuuou ni inochi no ki to, zen'aku o shiru ki to o haesaserareta.
Mata hitotsu no kawa ga Eden kara nagaredete sono o uruoshi, soko kara wakarete yontsu no kawa to natta.
Sono daiichi no na wa Pison to ii, kin no aru Habira no zenchi o meguru mono de,
Sono chi no kin wa yoku, mata soko wa Budoraku to, shima menou to o sanshita.
Daini no kawa no na wa Gihon to ii, Kushi no zenchi o meguru mono.
Daisan no kawa no na wa Hidekeru to ii, ASsuriya no higashi o nagareru mono. Daiyon no kawa wa Yufurate de aru.
Shu naru kami wa hito o tsurete itte Eden no sono ni oki, kore o tagayasase, kore o mamoraserareta.
Shu naru kami wa sono hito ni meijite iwareta, "Anata wa sono no dono ki kara de mo kokoro no mama ni totte tabete yoroshii.
Shikashi zen'aku o shiru ki kara wa totte tabete wa naranai. Sore o totte taberuto, kitto shinude arou".
Mata Shu naru kami wa iwareta, "Hito ga hitori de iru no wa yoku nai. Kare no tame ni, fusawashii tasukete o tsukurou".
Soshite Shu naru kami wa no no subete no kemono to, sora no subete no tori to o tsuchi de tsukuri, hito no tokoro e tsurete kite, kare ga sore ni donna na o tsukeru ka o mirareta. Hito ga subete ikimono ni ataeru na wa, sono na to naru no de atta.
Sore de hito wa, subete no kachiku to, sora no tori to, no no subete no kemono to ni na o tsuketaga, hito ni wa fusawashii tasukete ga mitsukaranakatta.
Soko de Shu naru kami wa hito o fukaku nemurase, nemutta toki ni, sono abarabone no hitotsu o totte, sono tokoro o niku de fusagareta.
Shu naru kami wa hito kara totta abarabone de hitori no onna o tsukuri, hito no tokoro e tsurete korareta.
Sono toki, hito wa itta. "Kore koso, tsuini watashi no hone no hone, watashi no niku no niku. Otoko kara totta mono dakara, kore o onna to nazukeyou".
Sore de hito wa sono chichi to haha o hanarete, tsuma to musubiai, ittai to naru no de aru.
Hito to sono tsuma to wa, futaritomo hadaka de attaga, hazukashii to wa omowanakatta.
Sate Shu naru kami ga tsukurareta no no ikimono no uchi de, hebi ga mottomo koukatsu de atta. Hebi wa onna ni itta, "Sono ni aru dono ki kara mo totte taberu na to, hontou ni kami ga iwareta no desu ka".
Onna wa hebi ni itta, "Watashitachi wa sono no kinomi o taberu koto wa yurusarete imasuga,
Tadasono no chuuou ni aru kinomi ni tsuite wa, kore o totte taberu na, kore ni fureru na, shinde wa ikenaikara to, kami wa iwaremashita".
Hebi wa onna ni itta, "Anata gata wa kesshite shinu koto wa naideshou.
Sore o taberuto, anata gata no me ga hirake, kami no you ni zen'aku o shiru mono to naru koto o, kami wa shitte orareru no desu".
Onna ga sono ki o miruto, sore wa taberu ni yoku, me ni wa utsukushiku, kashikoku naru ni wa konomashii to omowaretakara, sono mi o totte tabe, mata tomo ni ita otto ni mo ataeta no de, kare mo tabeta.
Suruto, futari no me ga hirake, jibuntachi no hadaka de aru koto ga wakatta no de, ichijiku no ha o tsuzuriawasete, koshi ni maita.
Karera wa, hi no suzushii kaze no fuku koro, sono no naka ni Shu naru kami no ayumareru oto o kiita. Soko de, hito to sono tsuma to wa Shu naru kami no kao o sakete, sono no kinoaida ni mi o kakushita.
Shu naru kami wa hito ni yobikakete iwareta, "Anata wa doko ni iru no ka".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Sono no naka de anata no ayumareru oto o kiki, watashi wa hadaka datta no de, osorete mi o kakushita no desu".
Kami wa iwareta, "Anata ga hadaka de aru no o, dare ga shiraseta no ka. Taberu na to, meijite oita ki kara, anata wa totte tabeta no ka".
Hito wa kotaeta, "Watashi to issho ni shite kudasatta ano onna ga, ki kara totte kureta no de, watashi wa tabeta no desu".
Soko de Shu naru kami wa onna ni iwareta, "Anata wa, nan to iu koto o shita no desu". Onna wa kotaeta, "Hebi ga watashi o damashita no desu. Sore de watashi wa tabemashita".
Shu naru kami wa hebi ni iwareta, "Omae wa, kono koto o, shita no de, subete no kachiku, no no subete no kemono no uchi, mottomo norowareru. Omae wa hara de, hai aruki, isshou, chiri o taberude arou.
Watashi wa urami o oku, omae to onna to no aida ni, omae no sue to onna no sue to no aida ni. Kare wa omae no kashira o kudaki, omae wa kare no kakato o kudakude arou".
Tsugi ni onna ni iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no umi no kurushimi o ooini masu. Anata wa kurushinde ko o umu. Sore de mo nao, anata wa otto o shitai, kare wa anata o osamerude arou".
Sarani hito ni iwareta, "Anata ga tsuma no kotoba o kiite, taberu na to, watashi ga meijita ki kara totte tabeta no de, chi wa anata no tame ni noroware, anata wa isshou, kurushinde chi kara shokumotsu o toru.
Chi wa anata no tame ni, ibara to azami to o shouji, anata wa no no kusa o taberude arou.
Anata wa kao ni ase shite pan o tabe, tsuini tsuchi ni kaeru, anata wa tsuchi kara torareta no dakara. Anata wa, chiri dakara, chiri ni kaeru".
Sate, hito wa sono tsuma no na o Eba to nazuketa. Kanojo ga subete ikita mono no haha dakara de aru.
Shu naru kami wa hito to sono tsuma to no tame ni kawa no kimono o tsukutte, karera ni kiserareta.
Shu naru kami wa iwareta, "Miyo, hito wa wareware no hitori no you ni nari, zen'aku o shiru mono to natta. Kare wa te o nobe, inochi no ki kara mo totte tabe, eikyuu ni ikiru ka mo shirenai".
Soko de Shu naru kami wa kare o Eden no sono kara oidashite, hito ga tsukurareta sono tsuchi o tagayasaserareta.
Kami wa hito o oidashi, Eden no sono no higashi ni, kerubimu to, mawaru honoo no tsurugi to o oite, inochi no ki no michi o mamoraserareta.
Hito wa sono tsuma Eba o shitta. Kanojo wa migomori, Kain o unde itta, "Watashi wa Shu ni yotte, hitori no hito o eta".
Kanojo wa mata, sono otouto Aberu o unda. Aberu wa hitsuji o kau mono to nari, Kain wa tsuchi o tagayasu mono to natta.
Hi ga tatte, Kain wa chi no sanbutsu o motte kite, Shu ni sonaemono to shita.
Aberu mo mata, sono mure no ui go to koeta mono to o motte kita. Shu wa Aberu to sono sonaemono to o kaerimirareta.
Shikashi Kain to sono sonaemono to wa kaerimirarenakatta no de, Kain wa ooini ikidootte, kao o fuseta.
Soko de Shu wa Kain ni iwareta, "Naze anata wa ikidooru no desu ka, naze kao o fuseru no desu ka.
Tadashii koto o shite iru no deshitara, kao o agetara yoideshou. Moshi tadashii koto o shite inai no deshitara, tsumi ga kadoguchi ni machibusete imasu. Sore wa anata o shitaimotomemasuga, anata wa sore o osamenakereba narimasen".
Kain wa otouto Aberu ni itta, "Saa, nohara e ikou". Karera ga no ni ita toki, Kain wa otouto Aberu ni tachi kakatte, kore o koroshita.
Shu wa Kain ni iwareta, "Otouto Aberu wa, doko ni imasu ka". Kain wa kotaeta, "Shirimasen. Watashi ga otouto no bannin deshou ka".
Shu wa iwareta, "Anata wa nani o shita no desu. Anata no otouto no chi no koe ga tsuchi no naka kara watashi ni sakende imasu.
Ima anata wa norowarete kono tochi o hanarenakereba narimasen. Kono tochi ga kuchi o akete, anata no te kara otouto no chi o uketakara desu.
Anata ga tochi o tagayashite mo, tochi wa, mohaya anata no tame ni mi o musubimasen. Anata wa chijou no hourousha to narudeshou".
Kain wa Shu ni itta, "Watashi no batsu wa omokute oi kiremasen.
Anata wa, kyou, watashi o chi no omote kara tsuihou saremashita. Watashi wa anata o hanarete, chijou no hourousha to naraneba narimasen. Watashi o mitsukeru hito wa dare de mo watashi o korosudeshou".
Shu wa Kain ni iwareta, "Iya, sou de wa nai. Dare de mo Kain o korosu mono wa nana bai no fukushuu o ukerudeshou". Soshite Shu wa Kain o mitsukeru mono ga, dare mo kare o uchikorosu koto no nai you ni, kare ni hitotsu no shirushi o tsukerareta.
Kain wa Shu no mae o satte, Eden no higashi, Nodo no chi ni sunda.
Kain wa sono tsuma o shitta. Kanojo wa migomotte Enoku o unda. Kain wa machi o tate, sono machi no na o sono ko no na ni shitagatte, Enoku to nazuketa.
Enoku ni wa Irade ga umareta. Irade no ko wa Mehoyaeru, Mehoyaeru no ko wa Metosaeru, Metosaeru no ko wa Remeku de aru.
Remeku wa futari no tsuma o metotta. Hitori no na wa Ada to ii, hitori no na wa Chira to itta.
Ada wa Yabaru o unda. Kare wa tenmaku ni sunde, kachiku o kau mono no senzo to natta.
Sono otouto no na wa Yubaru to itta. Kare wa koto ya fue o toru subete no mono no senzo to natta.
Chira mo mata Tobarukain o unda. Kare wa seidou ya tetsu no subete no hamono o kitaeru mono to natta. Tobarukain no imouto o Naama to itta.
Remeku wa sono tsumatachi ni itta, "Ada to Chira yo, watashi no koe o kike, Remeku no tsumatachi yo, watashi no kotoba ni mimi o katamukeyo. Watashi wa ukeru kizu no tame ni, hito o koroshi, ukeru uchikizu no tame ni, watashi wa wakamono o korosu.
Kain no tame no fukushuu ga nana bai naraba, Remeku no tame no fukushuu wa nanajuu nana bai".
Adamu wa mata sono tsuma o shitta. Kanojo wa otokonoko o umi, sono na o Setsu to nazukete itta, "Kain ga Aberu o koroshita no de, kami wa Aberu no kawari ni, hitori no ko o watashi ni sazukeraremashita".
Setsu ni mo mata otokonoko ga umareta. Kare wa sono na o Enosu to nazuketa. Kono toki, hitobito wa Shu no na o yobi hajimeta.
Adamu no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kami ga hito o souzou sareta toki, kami o katadotte tsukuri,
Karera o otoko to onna to ni souzou sareta. Karera ga souzou sareta toki, kami wa karera o shukufuku shite, sono na o Adamu to nazukerareta.
Adamu wa hyaku sanjuusai ni natte, jibun ni katadori, jibun no katachi no you na otokonoko o umi, sono na o Setsu to nazuketa.
Adamu ga Setsu o unde nochi, ikita toshi wa happyaku nen de atte, hoka ni danshi to joshi o unda.
Adamu no ikita toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku sanjuusai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Setsu wa hyaku gosai ni natte, Enosu o unda.
Setsu wa Enosu o unda nochi, happyaku shichi nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Setsu no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku juu nisai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Enosu wa kyuujuusai ni natte, Kainan o unda.
Enosu wa Kainan o unda nochi, happyaku juu go nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Enosu no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku gosai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Kainan wa nanajuusai ni natte, Maharareru o unda.
Kainan wa Maharareru o unda nochi, happyaku yonjuu nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Kainan no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku juusai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Maharareru wa rokujuu gosai ni natte, Yaredo o unda.
Maharareru wa Yaredo o unda nochi, happyaku sanjuu nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Maharareru no toshi wa awasete happyaku kyuujuu gosai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Yaredo wa hyaku rokujuu nisai ni natte, Enoku o unda.
Yaredo wa Enoku o unda nochi, happyaku nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Yaredo no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku rokujuu nisai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Enoku wa rokujuu gosai ni natte, Metosera o unda.
Enoku wa Metosera o unda nochi, sanbyaku nen, kami to tomo ni ayumi, danshi to joshi o unda.
Enoku no toshi wa awasete sanbyaku rokujuu gosai de atta.
Enoku wa kami to tomo ni ayumi, kami ga kare o torareta no de, inaku natta.
Metosera wa hyaku hachijuu nanasai ni natte, Remeku o unda.
Metosera wa Remeku o unda nochi, nanahyaku hachijuu ni nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Metosera no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku rokujuu kyuusai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Remeku wa hyaku hachijuu nisai ni natte, otokonoko o umi,
"Kono ko koso, Shu ga chi o norowareta tame, honeori hataraku wareware o nagusameru mono" to itte, sono na o Noa to nazuketa.
Remeku wa Noa o unda nochi, gohyaku kyuujuu go nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Remeku no toshi wa awasete nanahyaku nanajuu nanasai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Noa wa gohyakusai ni natte, Semu, Hamu, Yapete o unda.
Hito ga chi no omote ni fue hajimete, musumetachi ga karera ni umareta toki,
Kami no kotachi wa hito no musumetachi no utsukushii no o mite, jibun no konomu mono o tsuma ni metotta.
Soko de Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi no rei wa nagaku hito no naka ni todomaranai. Kare wa niku ni suginai no da. Shikashi, kare no toshi wa hyaku nijuu nen de arou".
Sono koro, mata sono nochi ni mo, chi ni Nepirimu ga ita. Kore wa kami no kotachi ga hito no musumetachi no tokoro ni haitte, musumetachi ni umaseta mono de aru. Karera wa mukashi no yuushi de ari, yuumei na hitobito de atta.
Shu wa hito no aku ga chi ni habikori, subete sono kokoro ni omoi hakaru koto ga, itsu mo warui koto bakari de aru no o mirareta.
Shu wa chi no ue ni hito o tsukutta no o kuite, kokoro o itame,
"Watashi ga souzou shita hito o chi no omote kara nuguisarou. Hito mo kemono mo, hau mono mo, sora no tori made mo. Watashi wa, korera o tsukutta koto o kuiru" to iwareta.
Shikashi, Noa wa Shu no mae ni megumi o eta.
Noa no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Noa wa sono jidai no hitobito no naka de tadashiku, katsu mattakihito de atta. Noa wa kami to tomo ni ayunda.
Noa wa Semu, Hamu, Yapete no sannin no ko o unda.
Toki ni yo wa kami no mae ni midarete, bougyaku ga chi ni michita.
Kami ga chi o mirareruto, sore wa midarete ita. Subete no hito ga chi no ue de sono michi o midashitakara de aru.
Soko de kami wa Noa ni iwareta, "Watashi wa, subete no hito o tayasou to kesshin shita. Karera wa chi o bougyaku de mitashitakara, watashi wa karera o chi to tomo ni horobosou.
Anata wa, itosugi no ki de hakobune o tsukuri, hakobune no naka ni heya o mouke, Asufaruto de sono uchi soto o nuri nasai.
Sono tsukurikata wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi hakobune no nagasa wa sanbyaku kyubito, haba wa gojuu kyubito, takasa wa sanjuu kyubito to shi,
Hakobune ni yane o tsukuri, ue e ichi kyubito ni sore o shiage, mata hakobune no toguchi o sono yoko ni moukete, ichi kai to ni kai to san kai no aru hakobune o tsukuri nasai.
Watashi wa chi no ue ni kouzui o okutte, inochi no iki no aru niku naru mono o, mina ten no shita kara horoboshisaru. Chi ni aru mono wa, mina shinitaerude arou.
Tadashi, watashi wa anata to keiyaku o musubou. Anata wa kora to, tsuma to, kora no tsumatachi to tomo ni hakobune ni hairi nasai.
Mata subete no ikimono, subete no niku naru mono no naka kara, sorezore futatsu zutsu o hakobune ni irete, anata to tomo ni sono inochi o tamotase nasai. Sorera wa osu to mesu to de nakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, tori wa sono shurui ni shitagai kemono wa sono shurui ni shitagai, mata chi no subete no hau mono mo, sono shurui ni shitagatte, sorezore futatsu zutsu, anata no tokoro ni irete, inochi o tamotase nasai.
Mata, subete no shokumotsu to naru mono o totte, anata no tokoro ni takuwae, anata to korera no mono to no shokumotsu to shi nasai".
Noa wa subete kami no meijirareta you ni shita.
Shu wa Noa ni iwareta, "Anata to kazoku to wa mina hakobune ni hairi nasai. Anata ga kono jidai no hitobito no naka de, watashi no mae ni tadashii hito de aru to watashi wa mitometakara de aru.
Anata wa subete no kiyoi kemono no naka kara osu to mesu to o nanatsu zutsu tori, kiyoku nai kemono no naka kara osu to mesu to o futatsu zutsu tori,
Mata sora no tori no naka kara osu to mesu to o nanatsu zutsu totte, sono shurui ga zenchi no omote ni ikinokoru you ni shi nasai.
Nanuka no nochi, watashi wa yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, chi ni ame o furasete, watashi no tsukutta subete no ikimono o, chi no omote kara nuguisarimasu".
Noa wa subete Shu ga meijirareta you ni shita.
Sate kouzui ga chi ni tatta toki, Noa wa roppyakusai de atta.
Noa wa kora to, tsuma to, kora no tsumatachi to tomo ni kouzui o sakete hakobune ni haitta.
Mata kiyoi kemono to, kiyoku nai kemono to, tori to, chi ni hau subete no mono to no,
Osu to mesu to ga, futatsu zutsu Noa no moto ni kite, kami ga Noa ni meijirareta you ni hakobune ni haitta.
Kou shite nanuka no nochi, kouzui ga chi ni tatta.
Sore wa Noa no roppyakusai no ni gatsu juu nana nichi de atte, sono hi ni ooinaru fuchi no minamoto wa, kotogotoku yabure, ten no mado ga hirakete,
Ame wa yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, chi ni furisosoida.
Sono onaji hi ni, Noa to, Noa no ko Semu, Hamu, Yapete to, Noa no tsuma to, sono kora no sannin no tsuma to wa tomo ni hakobune ni haitta.
Mata subete no shurui no kemono mo, subete no shurui no kachiku mo, chi no subete no shurui no hau mono mo, subete no shurui no tori mo, subete no tsubasa aru mono mo, mina wa itta.
Sunawachi inochi no iki no aru subete no niku naru mono ga, futatsu zutsu Noa no moto ni kite, hakobune ni haitta.
Sono haitta mono wa, subete niku naru mono no osu to mesu to deatte, kami ga kare ni meijirareta you ni haitta. Soko de Shu wa kare no ushiro no to o tozasareta.
Kouzui wa yonjuu nichi no aida chijou ni atta. Mizu ga mashite hakobune o ukabeta no de, hakobune wa chi kara takaku agatta.
Mata mizu ga minagiri, chi ni mashita no de, hakobune wa mizu no omote ni tadayotta.
Mizu wa mata, masumasu chi ni minagiri, ten no shita no takai yamayama wa mina oowareta.
Mizu wa sono ue, sarani juu go kyubito minagitte, yamayama wa mattaku oowareta.
Chi no ue ni ugoku subete niku naru mono wa, tori mo kachiku mo kemono mo, chi ni muragaru subete no hau mono mo, subete no hito mo mina horobita.
Sunawachi hana ni inochi no iki no aru subete no mono, riku ni ita subete no mono wa shinda.
Chi no omote ni ita subete no ikimono wa, hito mo kachiku mo, hau mono mo, sora no tori mo mina chi kara nuguisararete, tada Noa to, kare to tomo ni hakobune ni ita mono dake ga nokotta.
Mizu wa hyaku gojuu nichi no aida chijou ni minagitta.
Kami wa Noa to, hakobune no naka ni ita subete no ikimono to, subete no kachiku to o kokoro ni tomerareta. Kami ga kaze o chi no ue ni fukaserareta no de, mizu wa shirizoita.
Mata fuchi no minamoto to, ten no mado to wa tozasarete, ten kara ame ga furanaku natta.
Sore de mizu wa shidai ni chi no ue kara hiite, hyaku gojuu nichi no nochi ni wa mizu ga heri,
Hakobune wa nana gatsu juu nana nichi ni Ararate no yama ni todomatta.
Mizu wa shidai ni hette, juu gatsu ni nari, juu gatsu tsuitachi ni yamayama no itadaki ga arawareta.
Yonjuu nichi tatte, Noa wa sono tsukutta hakobune no mado o hiraite,
Karasu o hanatta tokoro, karasu wa chi no ue kara mizu ga kawaki kiru made, achirakochira e tobimawatta.
Noa wa mata chi no omote kara, mizu ga hiita ka dou ka o miyou to, kare no tokoro kara, hato o hanattaga,
Hato wa ashi no ura o todomeru tokoro ga mitsukaranakatta no de, hakobune no Noa no moto ni kaette kita. Mizu ga mada zenchi no omote ni attakara de aru. Kare wa te o nobete, kore o torae, hakobune no naka no kare no moto ni hikiireta.
Sore kara nanuka matte futatabi hato o hakobune kara hanatta.
Hato wa yuugata ni natte kare no moto ni kaette kita. Miruto, sono kuchibashi ni wa, oribu no wakaba ga atta. Noa wa chi kara mizu ga hiita no o shitta.
Sarani nanuka matte mata, hato o hanatta tokoro, mohaya kare no moto ni wa kaette konakatta.
Roppyaku ichisai no ichi gatsu tsuitachi ni natte, chi no ue no mizu wa kareta. Noa ga hakobune no ooi o torinozoite miruto, tsuchi no omote wa, kawaite ita.
Ni gatsu nijuu shichi nichi ni natte, chi wa mattaku kawaita.
Kono toki, kami wa Noa ni iwareta,
"Anata wa tsuma to, kora to, kora no tsumatachi to tomo ni hakobune o de nasai.
Anata wa, tomo ni iru niku naru subete no ikimono, sunawachi tori to kachiku to, chi no subete no hau mono to o tsurete dete, korera no mono ga chi ni muragari, chi no ue ni fue hirogaru you ni shi nasai".
Noa wa tomo ni ita kora to, tsuma to, kora no tsumatachi to o tsurete deta.
Mata subete no kemono, subete no hau mono, subete no tori, subete chi no ue ni ugoku mono wa mina, shurui ni shitagatte hakobune o deta.
Noa wa Shu ni saidan o kizuite, subete no kiyoi kemono to, subete no kiyoi tori to no uchi kara totte, hansai o saidan no ue ni sasageta.
Shu wa sono koubashii kaori o kaide, kokoro ni iwareta, "Watashi wa mohaya ni do to hito no yue ni chi o norowanai. Hito ga kokoro ni omoi hakaru koto wa, osanai toki kara waruikara de aru. Watashi wa, kono tabi shita you ni, mou ni do to, subete no ikita mono o horobosanai.
Chi no aru kagiri, tanemaki no toki mo, kariire no toki mo, atsusa samusa mo, natsufuyu mo, hiru mo yoru mo yamu koto wa naide arou".
Kami wa Noa to sono kora to o shukufuku shite karera ni iwareta, "Umeyo, fue yo, chi ni michi yo.
Chi no subete no kemono, sora no subete no tori, chi ni hau subete no mono, umi no subete no uo wa osoreononoite, anata gata no shihai ni fukushi,
Subete ikite ugoku mono wa anata gata no shokumotsu to narude arou. Saki ni aokusa o anata gata ni ataeta you ni, watashi wa korera no mono o mina anata gata ni ataeru.
Shikashi niku o, sono inochi de aru chi no mama de, tabete wa naranai.
Anata gata no inochi no chi o nagasu mono ni wa, watashi wa kanarazu houfuku surude arou. Ikanaru kemono ni mo houfuku suru. Kyoudai de aru hito ni mo, watashi wa hito no inochi no tame ni, houfuku surude arou.
Hito no chi o nagasu mono wa, hito ni chi o nagasareru, kami ga jibun no katachi ni hito o tsukurareta yue ni.
Anata gata wa, umeyo, fue yo, chi ni muragari, chi no ue ni fue yo".
Kami wa Noa oyobi tomo ni iru kora ni iwareta,
"Watashi wa anata gata oyobi anata gata no nochi no shison to keiyaku o tateru.
Mata anata gata to tomo ni iru subete no ikimono, anata gata to tomo ni iru tori, kachiku, chi no subete no kemono, sunawachi, subete hakobune kara deta mono wa, chi no subete no kemono ni itaru made, watashi wa sore to keiyaku o tateyou.
Watashi ga anata gata to tateru kono keiyaku ni yori, subete niku naru mono wa, mohaya kouzui ni yotte horobosareru koto wa naku, mata chi o horobosu kouzui wa, futatabi okoranaide arou".
Sarani kami wa iwareta, "Kore wa watashi to, anata gata oyobi anata gata to tomo ni iru subete no ikimono to no aida ni yoyo kagirinaku, watashi ga tateru keiyaku no shirushi de aru.
Sunawachi, watashi wa kumo no naka ni, niji o oku. Kore ga watashi to chi to no aida no keiyaku no shirushi to naru.
Watashi ga kumo o chi no ue ni okosu toki, niji wa kumo no naka ni arawareru.
Kou shite, watashi wa, watashi to anata gata, oyobi subete niku naru arayuru ikimono to no aida ni tateta keiyaku o omoiokosu yue, mizu wa futatabi, subete niku naru mono o horobosu kouzui to wa naranai.
Niji ga kumo no naka ni arawareru toki, watashi wa kore o mite, kami ga chijou ni aru subete niku naru arayuru ikimono to no aida ni tateta eien no keiyaku o omoiokosude arou".
Soshite kami wa Noa ni iwareta, "Kore ga watashi to chi ni aru subete niku naru mono to no aida ni, watashi ga tateta keiyaku no shirushi de aru".
Hakobune kara deta Noa no kora wa Semu, Hamu, Yapete de atta. Hamu wa Kanan no chichi de aru.
Kono sannin wa Noa no kora de, zenchi no tami wa karera kara dete, hirogatta no de aru.
Sate Noa wa noufu to nari, budou hatake o tsukuri hajimetaga,
Kare wa budoushu o nonde yoi, tenmaku no naka de hadaka ni natte ita.
Kanan no chichi Hamu wa chichi no hadaka o mite, soto ni iru futari no kyoudai ni tsugeta.
Semu to Yapete to wa kimono o totte, kata ni kake, ushiromuki ni ayumiyotte, chichi no hadaka o ooi, kao o somukete chichi no hadaka o minakatta.
Yagate Noa wa yoi ga samete, sue no ko ga kare ni shita koto o shitta toki,
Kare wa itta, "Kanan wa noroware yo. Kare wa shimobe no shimobe to natte, sono kyoudaitachi ni tsukaeru".
Mata itta, "Semu no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na, Kanan wa sono shimobe to nare.
Kami wa Yapete o ooinarashime, Semu no tenmaku ni kare o sumawaserareru you ni. Kanan wa sono shimobe to nare".
Noa wa kouzui no nochi, nao sanbyaku gojuu nen ikita.
Noa no toshi wa awasete kyuuhyaku gojuusai de atta. Soshite kare wa shinda.
Noa no ko Semu, Hamu, Yapete no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kouzui no nochi, karera ni ko ga umareta.
Yapete no shison wa Gomeru, Magogu, Madai, Yawan, Tobaru, Meseku, Terasu de atta.
Gomeru no shison wa Ashikenazu, Ripate, Togaruma.
Yawan no shison wa Erisha, Tarushishi, KiTtemu, Dodanimu de atta.
Korera kara umizoi no chi no kokumin ga wakarete, onoono sono tochi ni ori, sono gengo ni shitagai, sono shizoku ni shitagatte, sono kuniguni ni sunda.
Hamu no shison wa Kushi, Mitsuraimu, Pute, Kanan de atta.
Kushi no shison wa Seba, Habira, Sabuta, Raama, Sabuteka de ari, Raama no shison wa Shiba to Dedan de atta.
Kushi no ko wa Nimurode de atte, kono Nimurode wa yo no kenryokusha to natta saisho no hito de aru.
Kare wa Shu no mae ni chikara aru shuryousha de atta. Kore kara "Shu no mae ni chikara aru shuryousha Nimurode no gotoshi" to iu kotowaza ga tatta.
Kare no kuni wa saisho Shinaru no chi ni aru Baberu, Ereku, Akade, Karune de atta.
Kare wa sono chi kara ASsuriya ni dete, Ninebe, Rehoboteiri, Kara,
Oyobi Ninebe to Kara to no aida ni aru ooinaru machi Resen o tateta.
Mitsuraimu kara Rudezoku, Anamizoku, Rehabizoku, Nafutozoku,
Paterosuzoku, Kasuruzoku, Kafutorizoku ga deta. Kafutorizoku kara Perishitezoku ga deta.
Kanan kara sono choushi Shidon ga dete, mata Hete ga deta.
Sono ta Ebusu bi to, Amori bi to, Girugashi bi to,
Hibi bi to, Aruki bi to, Seni bi to,
Aruwade bi to, Zemari bi to, Hamate bito ga deta. Nochi ni natte Kanan bito no shizoku ga hirogatta.
Kanan bito no sakai wa Shidon kara geraru o hete Gaza ni itari, Sodomu, Gomora, Adema, Zeboimu o hete, Resha ni oyonda.
Korera wa Hamu no shison de atte, sono shizoku to sono gengo to ni shitagatte, sono tochi to, sono kuniguni ni ita.
Semu ni mo ko ga umareta. Semu wa Eberu no subete no shison no senzo de atte, Yapete no ani de atta.
Semu no shison wa Eramu, Ashuru, Arupakusade, Rude, Aramu de atta.
Aramu no shison wa Uzu, Horu, Geteru, Mashi de atta.
Arupakusade no ko wa Shira, Shira no ko wa Eberu de aru.
Eberu ni futari no ko ga umareta. Sono hitori no na o Peregu to itta. Kore wa kare no yo ni chi no tami ga wakaretakara de aru. Sono otouto no na o Yokutan to itta.
Yokutan ni Arumodade, Sharefu, Hazarumaute, Era,
Hadoramu, Uzaru, Dekura,
Obaru, Abimaeru, Shiba,
Ofuru, Habira, Yobabu ga umareta. Korera wa mina Yokutan no ko de atta.
Karera ga sunda tokoro wa Mesha kara higashi no sanchi Separu ni oyonda.
Korera wa Semu no shison de atte, sono shizoku to sono gengo to ni shitagatte, sono tochi to, sono kuniguni ni ita.
Korera wa Noa no kora no shizoku de atte, kettou ni shitagatte kuniguni ni sunde itaga, kouzui no nochi, korera kara chijou no shokokumin ga wakareta no de aru.
Zenchi wa onaji hatsuon, onaji kotoba de atta.
Toki ni hitobito wa higashi ni utsuri, Shinaru no chi ni heiya o ete, soko ni sunda.
Karera wa tagai ni itta, "Saa, renga o tsukutte, yoku yakou". Kou shite karera wa ishi no kawari ni, renga o e, shikkui no kawari ni, Asufaruto o eta.
Karera wa mata itta, "Saa, machi to tou to o tatete, sono itadaki o ten ni todokaseyou. Soshite wareware wa na o agete, zenchi no omote ni chiru no o manukareyou".
Toki ni Shu wa kudatte, hito no kotachi no tateru machi to tou to o mite,
Iwareta, "Tami wa hitotsu de, mina onaji kotoba de aru. Karera wa sudeni kono koto o shi hajimeta. Karera ga shiyou to suru koto wa, mohaya nanigoto mo todome enaide arou.
Saa, wareware wa kudatte itte, soko de karera no kotoba o midashi, tagai ni kotoba ga tsuujinai you ni shiyou".
Kou shite Shu ga karera o soko kara zenchi no omote ni chirasareta no de, karera wa machi o tateru no o yameta.
Kore ni yotte sono machi no na wa Baberu to yobareta. Shu ga soko de zenchi no kotoba o midasaretakara de aru. Shu wa soko kara karera o zenchi no omote ni chirasareta.
Semu no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Semu wa hyakusai ni natte kouzui no ni nen no nochi ni Arupakusade o unda.
Semu wa Arupakusade o unde nochi, gohyaku nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Arupakusade wa sanjuu gosai ni natte Shira o unda.
Arupakusade wa Shira o unde nochi, yonhyaku san nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Shira wa sanjuusai ni natte Eberu o unda.
Shira wa Eberu o unde nochi, yonhyaku san nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Eberu wa sanjuu yonsai ni natte Peregu o unda.
Eberu wa Peregu o unde nochi, yonhyaku sanjuu nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Peregu wa sanjuusai ni natte Riu o unda.
Peregu wa Riu o unde nochi, nihyaku kyuu nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Riu wa sanjuu nisai ni natte Serugu o unda.
Riu wa Serugu o unde nochi, nihyaku nana nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Serugu wa sanjuusai ni natte Nahoru o unda.
Serugu wa Nahoru o unde nochi, nihyaku nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Nahoru wa nijuu kyuusai ni natte Tera o unda.
Nahoru wa Tera o unde nochi, hyaku juu kyuu nen ikite, danshi to joshi o unda.
Tera wa nanajuusai ni natte Aburamu, Nahoru oyobi Haran o unda.
Tera no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Tera wa Aburamu, Nahoru oyobi Haran o umi, Haran wa Roto o unda.
Haran wa chichi Tera ni sakidatte, sono umareta chi, Karudeya no Uru de shinda.
Aburamu to Nahoru wa tsuma o metotta. Aburamu no tsuma no na wa Sarai to ii, Nahoru no tsuma no na wa Miruka to itte Haran no musume de aru. Haran wa Miruka no chichi, mata Isuka no chichi de aru.
Sarai wa umazume de, ko ga nakatta.
Tera wa sono ko Aburamu to, Haran no ko de aru mago Roto to, ko Aburamu no tsuma de aru yome Sarai to o tsurete, Kanan no chi e ikou to Karudeya no Uru o detaga, Haran ni tsuite soko ni sunda.
Tera no toshi wa nihyaku gosai de atta. Tera wa Haran de shinda.
Toki ni Shu wa Aburamu ni iwareta, "Anata wa kuni o dete, shinzoku ni wakare, chichi no ie o hanare, watashi ga shimesu chi ni iki nasai.
Watashi wa anata o ooinaru kokumin to shi, anata o shukufuku shi, anata no na o ookiku shiyou. Anata wa shukufuku no motoi to narude arou.
Anata o shukufuku suru mono o watashi wa shukufuku shi, anata o no roumono o watashi wa norou. Chi no subete no yakara wa, anata ni yotte shukufuku sareru".
Aburamu wa Shu ga iwareta you ni idetatta. Roto mo kare to tomo ni itta. Aburamu wa Haran o deta toki nanajuu gosai de atta.
Aburamu wa tsuma Sarai to, otouto no ko Roto to, atsumeta subete no zaisan to, Haran de eta hitobito to o tazusaete Kanan ni ikou to shite idetachi, Kanan no chi ni kita.
Aburamu wa sono chi o tootte Shikemu no tokoro, More no Terebin no ki no moto ni tsuita. Sono koro Kanan bito ga sono chi ni ita.
Toki ni Shu wa Aburamu ni arawarete iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no shison ni kono chi o ataemasu". Aburamu wa kare ni arawareta Shu no tame ni, soko ni saidan o kizuita.
Kare wa soko kara Beteru no higashi no yama ni utsutte tenmaku o hatta. Nishi ni wa Beteru, higashi ni wa Ai ga atta. Soko ni kare wa Shu no tame ni saidan o kizuite, Shu no na o yonda.
Aburamu wa nao susunde Negebu ni utsutta.
Sate, sono chi ni kikin ga atta no de Aburamu wa Ejiputo ni kiryuu shiyou to, soko ni kudatta. Kikin ga sono chi ni hageshikattakara de aru.
Ejiputo ni hairou to shite, soko ni chikazuita toki, kare wa tsuma Sarai ni itta, "Watashi wa anata ga utsukushii onna de aru no o shitte imasu.
Sore de Ejiputo bito ga anata o miru toki, kore wa kare no tsuma de aru to itte watashi o koroshi, anata o ikashite okudeshou.
Dou ka anata wa, watashi no imouto da to itte kudasai. Sou sureba watashi wa anata no okage de buji de ari, watashi no inochi wa anata ni yotte tasukarudeshou".
Aburamu ga Ejiputo ni haitta toki Ejiputo bi to wa kono onna o mite, taisou utsukushii hito de aru to shi,
Mata Paro no koukantachi mo kanojo o mite Paro no mae de hometa no de, onna wa Paro no ie ni meshiirerareta.
Paro wa kanojo no yue ni Aburamu o atsuku motenashita no de, Aburamu wa ooku no hitsuji, ushi, shiyuu no roba, danjo no dorei oyobi, rakuda o eta.
Tokoro de Shu wa Aburamu no tsuma Sarai no yue ni, hageshii ekibyou o Paro to sono ie ni kudasareta.
Paro wa Aburamu o meshiyosete itta, "Anata wa watashi ni nan to iu koto o shita no desu ka. Naze kanojo ga tsuma de aru no o watashi ni tsugenakatta no desu ka.
Anata wa naze, kanojo wa watashi no imouto desu to itta no desu ka. Watashi wa kanojo o tsuma ni shiyou to shite imashita. Saa, anata no tsuma wa koko ni imasu. Tsurete itte kudasai".
Paro wa kare no koto ni tsuite hitobito ni meiji, kare to sono tsuma oyobi sono subete no mochimono o okuri saraseta.
Aburamu wa tsuma to subete no mochimono o tazusae, Ejiputo o dete, Negebu ni nobotta. Roto mo kare to tomo ni nobotta.
Aburamu wa kachiku to kingin ni hijou ni tonde ita.
Kare wa Negebu kara tabiji o susumete Beteru ni mukai, Beteru to Ai no aida no, saki ni tenmaku o hatta tokoro ni itta.
Sunawachi kare ga hajime ni kizuita saidan no tokoro ni iki, sono tokoro de Aburamu wa Shu no na o yonda.
Aburamu to tomo ni itta Roto mo hitsuji, ushi oyobi tenmaku o motte ita.
Sono chi wa karera o sasaete tomo ni sumaseru koto ga dekinakatta. Karera no zaisan ga ookatta tame, tomo ni sumenakatta no de aru.
Aburamu no kachiku no bokushatachi to Roto no kachiku no bokushatachi no aida ni arasoi ga atta. Sono koro Kanan bito to Periji bito ga sono chi ni sunde ita.
Aburamu wa Roto ni itta, "Watashitachi wa miuchi no mono desu. Watashi to anata no aida ni mo, watashi no bokushatachi to anata no bokushatachi no aida ni mo arasoi ga nai you ni shimashou.
Zenchi wa anata no mae ni aru de wa arimasen ka. Dou ka watashi to wakarete kudasai. Anata ga hidari ni ikeba watashi wa migi ni ikimasu. Anata ga migi ni ikeba watashi wa hidari ni ikimashou".
Roto ga me o agete Yorudan no teichi o amaneku miwatasuto, Shu ga Sodomu to Gomora o horobosareru mae de attakara, Zoaru made Shu no sono no you ni, mata Ejiputo no chi no you ni, sumizumi made yoku uruotte ita.
Soko de Roto wa Yorudan no teichi o kotogotoku erabitotte higashi ni utsutta. Kou shite karera wa tagai ni wakareta.
Aburamu wa Kanan no chi ni sundaga, Roto wa teichi no machimachi ni sumi, tenmaku o Sodomu ni utsushita.
Sodomu no hitobito wa waruku, Shu ni taishite, hanahadashii tsumibito de atta.
Roto ga Aburamu ni wakareta nochi ni, Shu wa Aburamu ni iwareta, "Me o agete anata no iru tokoro kara kita, minami, higashi, nishi o miwatashi nasai.
Subete anata ga miwatasu chi wa, eikyuu ni anata to anata no shison ni ataemasu.
Watashi wa anata no shison o chi no chiri no you ni ooku shimasu. Moshi hito ga chi no chiri o kazoeru koto ga dekirunara, anata no shison mo kazoerareru koto ga dekimashou.
Anata wa tatte, sono chi o tateyoko ni iki meguri nasai. Watashi wa sore o anata ni ataemasu".
Aburamu wa tenmaku o utsushite Heburon ni aru Mamure no Terebin no ki no katawara ni sumi, sono tokoro de Shu ni saidan o kizuita.
Shinaru no ou Amuraperu, Erasaru no ou Arioku, Eramu no ou Kedaraomeru oyobi Goimu no ou Tedaru no yo ni,
Korera no ou wa Sodomu no ou Bera, Gomora no ou Birusha, Adema no ou Shinabu, Zeboimu no ou Semeberu, oyobi Bera sunawachi Zoaru no ou to tatakatta.
Korera gonin no ou wa mina doumei shite Shidemu no tani, sunawachi shio no umi ni mukatte itta.
Sunawachi karera wa juu ni nen no aida Kedaraomeru ni tsukaetaga, juu san nenme ni somuita no de,
Juu yon nenme ni Kedaraomeru wa kare to rengou shita outachi to tomo ni kite, Ashitarote Karunaimu de Repaimu bito o, Hamu de Zuji bito o, Shabe Kiriataimu de Emi bi to o uchi,
Seiru no sanchi de Hori bito o utte, arano no hotori ni aru Eru Paran ni oyonda.
Karera wa hikikaeshite En Mishipate sunawachi Kadeshi e itte, Amareku bito no kuni o kotogotoku uchi, mata hazazon tamaru ni sumu Amori bito o mo utta.
Soko de Sodomu no ou, Gomora no ou, Adema no ou, Zeboimu no ou oyobi Bera sunawachi Zoaru no ou wa dete Shidemu no tani de karera ni mukai, tatakai no jin o shiita.
Sunawachi Eramu no ou Kedaraomeru, Goimu no ou Tedaru, Shinaru no ou Amuraperu, Erasaru no ou Arioku no yonnin no ou ni taisuru gonin no ou de atta.
Shidemu no tani ni wa Asufaruto no ana ga ookatta no de, Sodomu no ou to Gomora no ou wa nigete soko ni ochitaga, nokori no mono wa yama ni nogareta.
Soko de karera wa Sodomu to Gomora no zaisan to shokuryou to o kotogotoku ubatte sari,
Mata Sodomu ni sunde ita Aburamu no otouto no ko Roto to sono zaisan o ubatte satta.
Toki ni, hitori no hito ga nogarete kite, Heburu bi to Aburamu ni tsugeta. Kono toki Aburamu wa Eshikoru no kyoudai, mata Aneru no kyoudai de aru Amori bi to Mamure no Terebin no ki no katawara ni sunde ita. Karera wa Aburamu to doumei shite ita.
Aburamu wa miuchi no mono ga horyo ni natta no o kiki, kunren shita ienoko sanbyaku juu hachinin o hikitsurete Dan made otte iki,
Sono shimobetachi o wakete, yoru karera o seme, kore o utte Damasuko no kita, Hoba made karera o otta.
Soshite kare wa subete no zaisan o torikaeshi, mata miuchi no mono Roto to sono zaisan oyobi onnatachi to tami to o torikaeshita.
Aburamu ga Kedaraomeru to sono rengou no outachi o uchiyabutte kaetta toki, Sodomu no ou wa Shabe no tani, sunawachi ou no tani ni dete kare o mukaeta.
Sono toki, Saremu no ou Merukizedeku wa pan to budoushu to o motte kita. Kare hai to takaki kami no saishi de aru.
Kare wa Aburamu o shukufuku shite itta, "Negawaku wa tenchi no Shu naruito takaki kami ga, Aburamu o shukufuku sareru you ni.
Negawaku wa anata no teki o anata no te ni watasaretai to takaki kami ga agamerareru you ni". Aburamu wa kare ni subete no mono no juubun no ichi o okutta.
Toki ni Sodomu no ou wa Aburamu ni itta, "Watashi ni wa hito o kudasai. Zaisan wa anata ga tori nasai".
Aburamu wa Sodomu no ou ni itta, "Tenchi no Shu naruito takaki kami, Shu ni te o agete, watashi wa chikaimasu.
Watashi wa ito ichipon de mo, kutsu himo ichipon de mo, anata no mono wa nanini mo ukemasen. Aburamu o tomaseta no wa watashi dato, anata ga iwanai you ni.
Tadashi wakamonotachi ga sudeni tabeta mono wa betsu desu. Soshite watashi to tomo ni itta hitobito Aneru to Eshikoru to Mamure to ni wa sono bun o torase nasai".
Korera no koto no nochi, Shu no kotoba ga maboroshi no uchi ni Aburamu ni nozonda, "Aburamu yo osorete wa naranai, watashi wa anata no tate de aru. Anata no ukeru mukui wa, hanahada ookiide arou".
Aburamu wa itta, "Shu naru kami yo, watashi ni wa ko ga naku, watashi no ie o tsugu mono wa Damasuko no Eriezeru de aru no ni, anata wa watashi ni nani o kudasarou to suru no desu ka".
Aburamu wa mata itta, "Anata wa watashi ni ko o tamawaranai no de, watashi no ie ni umareta shimobe ga, atotsugi to narudeshou".
Kono toki, Shu no kotoba ga kare ni nozonda, "Kono mono wa anata no atotsugi to narubekide wa arimasen. Anata no mi kara deru mono ga atotsugi to narubeki desu".
Soshite Shu wa kare o soto ni tsuredashite iwareta, "Ten o aoide, hoshi o kazoeru koto ga dekirunara, kazoete mi nasai". Mata kare ni iwareta, "Anata no shison wa ano you ni narudeshou".
Aburamu wa Shu o shinjita. Shu wa kore o kare no gi to mitomerareta.
Mata Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi wa kono chi o anata ni ataete, kore o tsugaseyou to, anata o Karudeya no Uru kara michibikidashita Shu desu".
Kare wa itta, "Shu naru kami yo, watashi ga kore o tsugu no o dou shite shiru koto ga dekimasu ka".
Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Sansai no meushi to, sansai no me yagi to, sansai no ohitsuji to, yamabato to, iebato no hina to o watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai".
Kare wa korera o mina tsurete kite, futatsu ni saki, saita mono o tagai ni mukaiawasete oita. Tadashi, tori wa sakanakatta.
Arai tori ga shitai no ue ni oriru toki, Aburamu wa kore o oiharatta.
Hi no iru koro, Aburamu ga fukai nemuri ni osowareta toki, ookina osoroshii kurayami ga kare ni nozonda.
Toki ni Shu wa Aburamu ni iwareta, "Anata wa yoku kokoro ni tomete oki nasai. Anata no shison wa ta no kuni ni tabibito to natte, sono hitobito ni tsukae, sono hitobito wa karera o yonhyaku nen no aida, nayamasudeshou.
Shikashi, watashi wa karera ga tsukaeta sono kokumin o sabakimasu. Sono nochi karera wa ooku no zaisan o tazusaete dete kurudeshou.
Anata wa yasuraka ni senzo no moto ni ikimasu. Soshite kourei ni tasshite houmurarerudeshou.
Yon daime ni natte karera wa koko ni kaette kurudeshou. Amori bito no aku ga mada michinaikara desu".
Yagate hi wa iri, kurayami ni natta toki, kemuri no tatsu kamado, honoo no derutaimatsuga, saita mono no aida o toorisugita.
Sono hi, Shu wa Aburamu to keiyaku o musunde iwareta, "Watashi wa kono chi o anata no shison ni ataeru. Ejiputo no kawa kara, kano ookawa Yufurate made.
Sunawachi Keni bi to, Keniji bi to, Kadomoni bi to,
Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Repaimu bi to,
Amori bi to, Kanan bi to, Girugashi bi to, Ebusu bito no chi o ataeru".
Aburamu no tsuma Sarai wa ko o umanakatta. Kanojo ni hitori no tsukaeme ga atta. Ejiputo no onna de na o Hagaru to itta.
Sarai wa Aburamu ni itta, "Shu wa watashi ni ko o osazuke ni narimasen. Douzo, watashi no tsukaeme no tokoro ni ohairi kudasai. Kanojo ni yotte watashi wa ko o motsu koto ni narudeshou". Aburamu wa Sarai no kotoba o kikiireta.
Aburamu no tsuma Sarai wa sono tsukaeme Ejiputo no onna Hagaru o totte, otto Aburamu ni tsuma to shite ataeta. Kore wa Aburamu ga Kanan no chi ni juu nen sunda nochi de atta.
Kare wa Hagaru no tokoro ni hairi, Hagaru wa ko o haranda. Kanojo wa jibun no haranda no o mite, onnashujin o misageru you ni natta.
Soko de Sarai wa Aburamu ni itta, "Watashi ga uketa gai wa anata no sekinin desu. Watashi no tsukaeme o anata no futokoro ni ataeta no ni, kanojo wa jibun no haranda no o mite, watashi o misage masu. Dou ka, Shu ga anata to watashi no aida o osabaki ni naru you ni".
Aburamu wa Sarai ni itta, "Anata no tsukaeme wa anata no te no uchi ni aru. Anata no suki na you ni kanojo ni shi nasai". Soshite Sarai ga kanojo o kurushimeta no de, kanojo wa Sarai no kao o sakete nigeta.
Shu no tsukai wa arano ni aru izumi no hotori, sunawachi Shuru no michi ni aru izumi no hotori de, kanojo ni ai,
Soshite itta, "Sarai no tsukaeme Hagaru yo, anata wa doko kara kita no desu ka, mata doko e iku no desu ka". Kanojo wa itta, "Watashi wa onnashujin Sarai no kao o sakete nigete iru no desu".
Shu no tsukai wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa onnashujin no moto ni kaette, sono te ni mi o makase nasai".
Shu no tsukai wa mata kanojo ni itta, "Watashi wa ooini anata no shison o mashite, kazoe kirenai hodo ni ooku shimashou".
Shu no tsukai wa mata kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa, migomotte imasu. Anata wa otokonoko o umudeshou. Na o Ishimaeru to nazuke nasai. Shu ga anata no kurushimi o kikareta no desu.
Kare wa no roba no you na hitotonari, sono te wa subete no hito ni sakarai, subete no hito no te wa kare ni sakarai, kare wa subete no kyoudai ni tekishite sumudeshou".
Soko de, Hagaru wa jibun ni katarareta Shu no na o yonde, "Anata wa Eru Roi desu" to itta. Kanojo ga "Koko de mo, watashi o mite irareru kata no ushiro o ogameta no ka" to itta koto ni yoru.
Sore de sono ido wa "Beeru rahai roi" to yobareta. Kore wa Kadeshi to Berede no aida ni aru.
Hagaru wa Aburamu ni otokonoko o unda. Aburamu wa Hagaru ga unda ko no na o Ishimaeru to nazuketa.
Hagaru ga Ishimaeru o Aburamu ni unda toki, Aburamu wa hachijuu rokusai de atta.
Aburamu no kyuujuu kyuusai no toki, Shu wa Aburamu ni arawarete iwareta, "Watashi wa zennou no kami de aru. Anata wa watashi no mae ni ayumi, mattakimono de are.
Watashi wa anata to keiyaku o musubi, ooini anata no shison o masude arou".
Aburamu wa, hirefushita. Kami wa mata kare ni iwareta,
"Watashi wa anata to keiyaku o musubu. Anata wa ooku no kokumin no chichi to narude arou.
Anata no na wa, mohaya Aburamu to wa iwarezu, anata no na wa Aburahamu to yobarerude arou. Watashi wa anata o ooku no kokumin no chichi to surukara de aru.
Watashi wa anata ni ooku no shison o esase, kuniguni no tami o anata kara okosou. Mata, outachi mo anata kara derude arou.
Watashi wa anata oyobinochi no yoyo no shison to keiyaku o tatete, eien no keiyaku to shi, anata to nochi no shison to no kami to narude arou.
Watashi wa anata to nochi no shison to ni anata no yadotte iru kono chi, sunawachi Kanan no zenchi o eikyuu no shoyuu to shite ataeru. Soshite watashi wa karera no kami to narude arou".
Kami wa mata Aburahamu ni iwareta, "Anata to nochi no shison to wa tomo ni yoyo watashi no keiyaku o mamoranakereba naranai. Anata gata no uchi
Danshi wa mina katsurei o ukenakereba naranai. Kore wa watashi to anata gata oyobinochi no shison to no aida no watashi no keiyaku de atte, anata gata no mamorubeki mono de aru.
Anata gata wa mae no kawa ni katsurei o ukenakereba naranai. Sore ga watashi to anata gata to no aida no keiyaku no shirushi to narude arou.
Anata gata no uchi no danshi wa mina yoyo, ie ni umareta mono mo, mata ihoujin kara gin de kaitotta, anata no shison de nai mono mo, umarete youkame ni katsurei o ukenakereba naranai.
Anata no ie ni umareta mono mo, anata ga gin de kaitotta mono mo kanarazu katsurei o ukenakereba naranai. Kou shite watashi no keiyaku wa anata gata no mi ni atte eien no keiyaku to narude arou.
Katsurei o ukenai danshi, sunawachi mae no kawa o kiranai mono wa watashi no keiyaku o yaburu yue, sono hito wa tami no uchi kara tatarerude arou".
Kami wa mata Aburahamu ni iwareta, "Anata no tsuma Sarai wa, mohaya na o Sarai to iwazu, na o Sara to ii nasai.
Watashi wa kanojo o shukufuku shi, mata kanojo ni yotte, anata ni hitori no otokonoko o sazukeyou. Watashi wa kanojo o shukufuku shi, kanojo o kuniguni no tami no haha to shiyou. Kanojo kara, moromoro no tami no outachi ga derude arou".
Aburahamu wa hirefushite warai, kokoro no naka de itta, "Hyakusai no mono ni dou shite ko ga umareyou. Sara wa mata kyuujuusai ni mo natte, dou shite umu koto ga dekiyou ka".
Soshite Aburahamu wa kami ni itta, "Dou ka Ishimaeru ga anata no mae ni ikinagaraemasu you ni".
Kami wa iwareta, "Iya, anata no tsuma Sara wa anata ni otokonoko o umudeshou. Na o Isaku to nazuke nasai. Watashi wa kare to keiyaku o tatete, nochi no shison no tame ni eien no keiyaku to shiyou.
Mata Ishimaeru ni tsuite wa anata no negai o kiita. Watashi wa kare o shukufuku shite ooku no shison o esase, ooini sore o masude arou. Kare wa juu ninin no kimitachi o umude arou. Watashi wa kare o ooinaru kokumin to shiyou.
Shikashi watashi wa rainen no imagoro Sara ga anata ni umu Isaku to, watashi no keiyaku o taterude arou".
Kami wa Aburahamu to katari oe, kare o hanarete, noborareta.
Aburahamu wa kami ga jibun ni iwareta you ni, kono hi sono ko Ishimaeru to, subete ie ni umareta mono oyobi subete gin de kaitotta mono, sunawachi Aburahamu no ie no hitobito no uchi, subete no danshi o tsurete kite, mae no kawa ni katsurei o hodokoshita.
Aburahamu ga mae no kawa ni katsurei o uketa toki wa kyuujuu kyuusai,
Sono ko Ishimaeru ga mae no kawa ni katsurei o uketa toki wa juu sansai de atta.
Kono hi Aburahamu to sono ko Ishimaeru wa katsurei o uketa.
Mata sono ie no hitobito wa ie ni umareta mono mo, gin de ihoujin kara kaitotta mono mo mina, kare to tomo ni katsurei o uketa.
Shu wa Mamure no Terebin no ki no katawara de Aburahamu ni arawarerareta. Sore wa hiru no atsui koro de, kare wa tenmaku no iriguchi ni suwatte itaga,
Me o agete miruto, sannin no hito ga kare ni mukatte tatte ita. Kare wa kore o mite, tenmaku no iriguchi kara hashitte itte karera o mukae, chi ni mi o kagamete,
Itta, "Waga Shu yo, moshi watashi ga anata no mae ni megumi o ete irunara, douzo shimobe o toorisugosanaide kudasai.
Mizu o sukoshi totte kosasemasukara, anata gata wa ashi o aratte, kono ki no shita de oyasumi kudasai.
Watashi wa hitokuchi no pan o totte kimasu. Genki o tsukete, sore kara odekake kudasai. Sekkaku shimobe no tokoro ni oide ni natta no desukara". Karera wa itta, "Okotoba doori ni shite kudasai".
Soko de Aburahamu wa isoide tenmaku ni iri, Sara no tokoro ni itte itta, "Isoide komakai mugiko san Seya o tori, konete pan o tsukuri nasai".
Aburahamu wa ushi no mure ni hashitte iki, yawaraka na yoi koushi o totte wakamono ni watashita no de, isoide chouri shita.
Soshite Aburahamu wa gyounyuu to gyuunyuu oyobi koushi no chouri shita mono o totte, karera no mae ni sonae, ki no shita de karera no katawara ni tatte kyuuji shi, karera wa shokuji shita.
Karera wa Aburahamu ni itta, "Anata no tsuma Sara wa doko ni oraremasu ka". Kare wa itta, "Tenmaku no naka desu".
Sono hitori ga itta, "Rainen no haru, watashi wa kanarazu anata no tokoro ni kaette kimashou. Sono toki, anata no tsuma Sara ni wa otokonoko ga umarete irudeshou". Sara wa ushiro no hou no tenmaku no iriguchi de kiite ita.
Sate Aburahamu to Sara to wa toshi ga susumi, roujin to nari, Sara wa onna no tsuki no mono ga, sudeni tomatte ita.
Sore de Sara wa kokoro no naka de waratte itta, "Watashi wa otoroe, shujin mo mata roujin de aru no ni, watashi ni tanoshimi nado ari eyou ka".
Shu wa Aburahamu ni iwareta, "Naze Sara wa, watashi wa roujin de aru no ni, dou shite ko o umu koto ga dekiyou ka to itte waratta no ka.
Shu ni totte fukanou na koto ga arimashou ka. Rainen no haru, sadame no toki ni, watashi wa anata no tokoro ni kaette kimasu. Sono toki Sara ni wa otokonoko ga umarete irudeshou".
Sara wa osoreta no de, kore o uchikeshite itta, "Watashi wa waraimasen". Shu wa iwareta, "Iya, anata wa waraimashita".
Sono hitobito wa soko o tatte Sodomu no hou ni mukatta no de, Aburahamu wa karera o miokutte tomo ni itta.
Toki ni Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi no shiyou to suru koto o Aburahamu ni kakushite yoide arou ka.
Aburahamu wa kanarazu ookina tsuyoi kokumin to natte, chi no subete no tami ga mina, kare ni yotte shukufuku o ukeru no de wa nai ka.
Watashi wa kare ga nochi no kora to kazoku to ni meijite Shu no michi o mamorase, seigi to koudou to o okonawaseru tame ni kare o shitta no de aru. Kore wa Shu ga katsute Aburahamu ni tsuite itta koto o kare no ue ni nozomaseru tame de aru".
Shu wa mata iwareta, "Sodomu to Gomora no sakebi wa ookiku, mata sono tsumi wa hijou ni omoi no de,
Watashi wa ima kudatte, watashi ni todoita sakebi no toori ni, subete karera ga okonatte iru ka dou ka o mite, sore o shirou".
Sono hitobito wa soko kara mi o megurashite Sodomu no hou ni ittaga, Aburahamu wa nao, Shu no mae ni tatte ita.
Aburahamu wa chikayotte itta, "Makoto ni anata wa tadashii mono o, warui mono to issho ni horobosareru no desu ka.
Tatoi, ano machi ni gojuunin no tadashii mono ga atte mo, anata wa nao, sono tokoro o horoboshi, sono naka ni iru gojuunin no tadashii mono no tame ni kore o yurusarenai no desu ka.
Tadashii mono to warui mono to o issho ni korosu you na koto o, anata wa kesshite nasaranaideshou. Tadashii mono to warui mono to o onaji you ni suru koto mo, anata wa kesshite nasaranaideshou. Zenchi o sabaku mono wa kougi o okonaubekide wa arimasen ka".
Shu wa iwareta, "Moshi Sodomu de machi no naka ni gojuunin no tadashii mono ga attara, sono hitobito no tame ni sono tokoro o subete yuru sou".
Aburahamu wa kotaete itta, "Watashi wa chiri hai ni sugimasenga, aete waga Shu ni moushimasu.
Moshi gojuunin no tadashii mono no uchi gonin kaketanara, sono gonin kaketa tame ni machi o mattaku horobosaremasu ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Moshi soko ni yonjuu gonin itara, horobosanaide arou".
Aburahamu wa mata kasanete Shu ni itta, "Moshi soko ni yonjuunin itara". Shu wa iwareta, "Sono yonjuunin no tame ni, kore o shinaide arou".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, dou ka oikari ni naranu you. Watashi wa moushimasu. Moshi soko ni sanjuunin itara". Shu wa iwareta, "Soko ni sanjuunin itara, kore o shinaide arou".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Ima watashi wa aete waga Shu ni moushimasu. Moshi soko ni nijuunin itara". Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi wa sono nijuunin no tame ni horobosanaide arou".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, dou ka oikari ni naranu you. Watashi wa ima ichi do moushimasu, moshi soko ni juunin itara". Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi wa sono juunin no tame ni horobosanaide arou".
Shu wa Aburahamu to katari owari, satte ikareta. Aburahamu wa jibun no tokoro ni kaetta.
Sono futari no mitsukai wa yuugure ni Sodomu ni tsuita. Sono toki Roto wa Sodomu no mon ni suwatte ita. Roto wa karera o mite, tatte mukae, chi ni fushite,
Itta, "Waga Shu yo, douzo shimobe no ie ni tachiyotte ashi o arai, otomari kudasai. Soshite asa hayaku okite otachi kudasai". Karera wa itta, "Iya, wareware wa hiroba de yo o sugoshimasu".
Shikashi Roto ga shiite susumeta no de, karera wa tsuini kare no tokoro ni yori, ie ni haitta. Roto wa karera no tame ni furumai o mouke, tane irenu pan o yaite tabesaseta.
Tokoro ga karera no nenai uchi ni, Sodomu no machi no hitobito wa, wakai mono mo roujin mo, tami ga mina shihou kara kite, sono ie o kakomi,
Roto ni sakende itta, "Kon'ya omae no tokoro ni kita hitobito wa doko ni iru ka. Sore o koko ni dashi nasai. Wareware wa karera o shirude arou".
Roto wa iriguchi ni oru karera no tokoro ni dete iki, ushiro no to o tojite,
Itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, dou ka warui koto wa shinaide kudasai.
Watashi ni mada otoko o shiranai musume ga futari arimasu. Watashi wa kore o anata gata ni, sashidashimasukara, suki na you ni shite kudasai. Tada, watashi no yane no shita ni haitta kono hitotachi ni wa, nani mo shinaide kudasai".
Karera wa itta, "Shirizoke". Mata itta, "Kono otoko wa watatte kita yosomono de aru no ni, itsu mo, sabaki bito ni narou to suru. Sore de, wareware wa karera ni kuwaeru yori mo, omae ni ooku no gai o kuwaeyou". Karera wa Roto no mi ni hageshiku semari, susumiyotte to o yaburou to shita.
Sono toki, kano futari wa te o nobete Roto o ie no uchi ni hikiire, to o tojita.
Soshite ie no iriguchi ni oru hitobito o, rounyaku no betsu naku utte me o kuramashita no de, karera wa iriguchi o sagasu no ni tsukareta.
Futari wa Roto ni itta, "Hoka ni anata no miuchi no mono ga koko ni orimasu ka. Anata no muko, musuko, musume oyobi kono machi ni oru anata no miuchi no mono o, mina koko kara tsuredashi nasai.
Wareware ga kono tokoro o horobosou to shite irukara desu. Hitobito no sakebi ga Shu no mae ni ookiku nari, Shu wa kono tokoro o horobosu tame ni, wareware o tsukawasareta no desu".
Soko de Roto wa dete itte, sono musumetachi o metoru mukotachi ni tsugete itta, "Tatte kono tokoro kara de nasai. Shu ga kono machi o horobosaremasu". Shikashi sore wa mukotachi ni wa tawamumuregoto ni omoeta.
Yo ga akete, mitsukaitachi wa Roto o unagashite itta "Tatte, koko ni iru anata no tsuma to futari no musume to o tsuredashi nasai. Sou shinakereba, anata mo kono machi no fugi no tame ni horobosarerudeshou".
Kare wa tameratte itaga, Shu wa kare ni awaremi o hodokosareta no de, kano futari wa kare no te to, sono tsuma no te to, futari no musume no te o totte tsuredashi, machi no soto ni oita.
Karera o soto ni tsuredashita toki sono hitori wa itta, "Nogarete, jibun no inochi o sukui nasai. Ushiro o furikaette mite wa naranai. Teichi ni wa doko ni mo tachidomatte wa naranai. Yama ni nogare nasai. Sou shinakereba, anata wa horobimasu".
Roto wa karera ni itta, "Waga Shu yo, dou ka, sou sasenaide kudasai.
Shimobe wa sudeni anata no mae ni megumi o emashita. Anata wa watashi no inochi o sukutte, ooinaru itsukushimi o hodokosaremashita. Shikashi watashi wa yama made wa nogareru koto ga dekimasen. Wazawai ga mi ni oisematte watashi wa shinudeshou.
Ano machi o goran nasai. Nigete iku no ni chikaku, mata chiisai machi desu. Dou ka watashi o soko ni nogaresasete kudasai. Sore wa chiisaide wa arimasen ka. Sou sureba watashi no inochi wa tasukarudeshou".
Mitsukai wa kare ni itta, "Watashi wa kono koto de mo anata no negai o irete, anata no iu sono machi wa horoboshimasen.
Isoide soko e nogare nasai. Anata ga soko ni tsuku made wa, watashi wa nanigoto mo suru koto ga dekimasen". Kore ni yotte, sono machi no na wa Zoaru to yobareta.
Roto ga Zoaru ni tsuita toki, hi wa chi no ue ni nobotta.
Shu wa iou to hi to o Shu no tokoro sunawachi ten kara Sodomu to Gomora no ue ni furasete,
Korera no machi to, subete no teichi to, sono machimachi no subete no juumin to, sono chi ni haete iru mono o, kotogotoku horobosareta.
Shikashi Roto no tsuma wa ushiro o kaerimita no de shio no hashira ni natta.
Aburahamu wa asa hayaku oki, saki ni Shu no mae ni tatta tokoro ni itte,
Sodomu to Gomora no hou, oyobi teichi no zenmen o nagameruto, sono chi no kemuri ga, kamado no kemuri no you ni tachinobotte ita.
Kou shite kami ga teichi no machimachi o ko bota reta toki, sunawachi Roto no sunde ita machimachi o horobosareta toki, kami wa Aburahamu o oboete, sono horobi no naka kara Roto o sukuidasareta.
Roto wa Zoaru o dete nobori, futari no musume to tomo ni yama ni sunda. Zoaru ni sumu no o osoretakara de aru. Kare wa futari no musume to tomo ni, horaana no naka ni sunda.
Toki ni ane ga imouto ni itta, "Watashitachi no chichi wa oi, mata kono chi ni wa yo no narawashi no you ni, watashitachi no tokoro ni kuru otoko wa imasen.
Saa, chichi ni sake o nomase, tomo ni nete, chichi ni yotte ko o nokoshimashou".
Kanojotachi wa sono yo, chichi ni sake o nomase, ane ga hai tte chichi to tomo ni neta. Roto wa musume ga neta no mo, okita no mo shiranakatta.
Akuruhi, ane wa imouto ni itta, "Watashi wa sakuya, chichi to nemashita. Watashitachi wa kon'ya mo mata chichi ni sake o nomasemashou. Soshite anata ga hai tte tomo ni ne nasai. Watashitachi wa chichi ni yotte ko o nokoshimashou".
Karera wa sono yo mo mata chichi ni sake o nomase, imouto ga itte chichi to tomo ni neta. Roto wa musume no neta no mo, okita no mo shiranakatta.
Kou shite Roto no futari no musumetachi wa chichi ni yotte haranda.
Anemusume wa ko o umi, sono na o Moabu to nazuketa. Kore wa ima no Moabu bito no senzo de aru.
Imouto mo mata ko o unde, sono na o Benianmi to nazuketa. Kore wa ima no Anmon bito no senzo de aru.
Aburahamu wa soko kara Negebu no chi ni utsutte, Kadeshi to Shuru no aida ni sunda. Kare ga geraru ni todomatte ita toki,
Aburahamu wa tsuma Sara no koto o, "Kore wa watashi no imouto desu" to itta no de, geraru no ou Abimereku wa, hito o tsukawashite Sara o meshiireta.
Tokoro ga kami wa yo no yume ni Abimereku ni nozonde iwareta, "Anata wa meshiireta ano onna no yue ni shinaneba naranai. Kanojo wa otto no aru mi de aru".
Abimereku wa mada kanojo ni chikazuite inakatta no de itta, "Shu yo, anata wa tadashii tami de mo korosareru no desu ka.
Kare wa watashi ni, kore wa watashi no imouto desu to ittade wa arimasen ka. Mata kanojo mo jibun de, kare wa watashi no ani desu to iimashita. Watashi wa kokoro mo kiyoku, te mo isagiyoku, kono koto o shimashita".
Kami wa mata yume de kare ni iwareta, "Sou desu, anata ga kiyoi kokoro o motte kono koto o shita no o shitte itakara, watashi mo anata o mamotte, watashi ni taishite tsumi o okasasezu, kanojo ni fureru koto o yurusanakatta no desu.
Ima kare no tsuma o kaeshi nasai. Kare wa yogensha desukara, anata no tame ni inotte, inochi o tamotaserudeshou. Moshi kaesanainara, anata mo miuchi no mono mo mina kanarazu shinuto shiranakereba narimasen".
Soko de Abimereku wa asa hayaku oki, shimobetachi o kotogotoku meshiatsumete, korera no koto o mina katarikikaseta no de, hitobito wa hijou ni osoreta.
Soshite Abimereku wa Aburahamu o meshite itta, "Anata wa wareware ni nani o suru no desu ka. Anata ni taishite watashi ga donna tsumi o okashita tame ni, anata wa watashi to watashi no kuni to ni, ookina tsumi o owaseru no desu ka. Anata wa shite wa naranu koto o watashi ni shita no desu".
Abimereku wa mata Aburahamu ni itta, "Anata wa nan to omotte, kono koto o shita no desu ka".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Kono tokoro ni wa kami o osoreru to iu koto ga, mattaku nai no de, watashi no tsuma no yue ni hitobito ga watashi o korosu to omottakara desu.
Mata kanojo wa hontou ni watashi no imouto na no desu. Watashi no chichi no musume desuga, haha no musume de wa arimasen. Soshite, watashi no tsuma ni natta no desu.
Kami ga watashi ni chichi no ie o hanarete, iki meguraseta toki, watashi wa kanojo ni, anata wa watashitachi no iku sakizaki de watashi o ani de aru to itte kudasai. Kore wa anata ga watashi ni hodokosu megumi de aru to iimashita".
Soko de Abimereku wa hitsuji, ushi oyobi danjo no dorei o totte Aburahamu ni atae, sono tsuma Sara o kare ni kaeshita.
Soshite Abimereku wa itta, "Watashi no chi wa anata no mae ni arimasu. Anata no suki na tokoro ni sumi nasai".
Mata Sara ni itta, "Watashi wa anata no ani ni gin sen shikeru o ataemashita. Kore wa anata no mi ni tatta subete no koto ni tsuite, anata ni tsugunai o suru mono desu. Kou shite subete no hito ni anata wa tadashii to mitomeraremasu".
Soko de Aburahamu wa kami ni inotta. Kami wa Abimereku to sono tsuma oyobi, hashi tametachi o iyasareta no de, karera wa ko o umu you ni natta.
Kore wa Shu ga saki ni Aburahamu no tsuma Sara no yue ni, Abimereku no ie no subete no mono no tai o, kataku tozasaretakara de aru.
Shu wa, saki ni iwareta you ni Sara o kaerimi, tsugerareta you ni Sara ni okonawareta.
Sara wa migomori, kami ga Aburahamu ni tsugerareta toki ni natte, toshioita Aburahamu ni otokonoko o unda.
Aburahamu wa umareta ko, Sara ga unda otokonoko no na o Isaku to nazuketa.
Aburahamu wa kami ga meijirareta you ni youkame ni sono ko Isaku ni katsurei o hodokoshita.
Aburahamu wa sono ko Isaku ga umareta toki hyakusai de atta.
Soshite Sara wa itta, "Kami wa watashi o warawasete kudasatta. Kiku mono wa mina watashi no koto de waraudeshou".
Mata itta, "Sara ga ko ni chichi o nomaserudarou to, dare ga Aburahamu ni ii etade arou. Sore na no ni, watashi wa kare ga toshi totte kara, ko o unda".
Sate, osanago wa sodatte chibanare shita. Isaku ga chibanare shita hi ni Aburahamu wa sakan na furumai o mouketa.
Sara wa Ejiputo no onna Hagaru no Aburahamu ni unda ko ga, jibun no ko Isaku to asobu no o mite,
Aburahamu ni itta, "Kono hashi tame to sono ko o oidashite kudasai. Kono hashi tame no ko wa watashi no ko Isaku to tomo ni, yotsugi to narubeki mono de wa arimasen".
Kono koto de, Aburahamu wa sono ko no tame ni hijou ni shinpai shita.
Kami wa Aburahamu ni iwareta, "Ano warabe no tame, mata anata no hashi tame no tame ni shinpai suru koto wa nai. Sara ga anata ni iu koto wa subete kikiire nasai. Isaku ni umareru mono ga, anata no shison to tonaerarerukara desu.
Shikashi, hashi tame no ko mo anata no ko desukara, kore o mo, hitotsu no kokumin to shimasu".
Soko de Aburahamu wa akuru asa hayaku okite, pan to mizu no kawabukuro to o tori, Hagaru ni ataete, kata ni owase, sono ko o tsurete saraseta. Hagaru wa satte Beerushiba no arano ni samayotta.
Yagate kawabukuro no mizu ga tsukita no de, kanojo wa sono ko o ki no shita ni oki,
"Watashi wa kono ko no shinu no o miru ni shinobinai" to itte, ya no todoku hodo hanarete iki, kodomo no hou ni muite suwatta. Kanojo ga kodomo no hou ni muite suwatta toki, kodomo wa koe o agete naita.
Kami wa warabe no koe o kikare, kami no tsukai wa ten kara Hagaru o yonde itta, "Hagaru yo, dou shita no ka. Osorete wa ikenai. Kami wa asoko ni iru warabe no koe o kikareta.
Tatte iki, warabe o toriagete anata no te ni daki nasai. Watashi wa kare o ooinaru kokumin to surude arou".
Kami ga Hagaru no me o hirakareta no de, kanojo wa mizu no ido no aru no o mita. Kanojo wa itte kawabukuro ni mizu o mitashi, warabe ni nomaseta.
Kami wa warabe to tomo ni imashi, warabe wa seichou shita. Kare wa arano ni sunde yumi o iru mono to natta.
Kare wa Paran no arano ni sunda. Haha wa kare no tame ni Ejiputo no kuni kara tsuma o mukaeta.
Sono koro Abimereku to sono gunzei no chouPikoru wa Aburahamu ni itta, "Anata ga nanigoto o nasatte mo, kami wa anata to tomo ni orareru.
Sore yue, ima koko de watashi o mo, watashi no ko o mo, mago o mo azamukanaito, kami o sashite watashi ni chikatte kudasai. Watashi ga anata ni shinsetsu ni shita you ni, anata mo watashi to, kono anata no kiryuu no chi to ni, shinakereba narimasen".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Watashi wa chikaimasu".
Aburahamu wa Abimereku no keraitachi ga, mizu no ido o ubaitotta koto ni tsuite Abimeruku o semeta.
Shikashi Abimereku wa itta, "Dare ga kono koto o shita ka watashi wa shirimasen. Anata mo watashi ni tsugeta koto wa naku, watashi mo kyou made kikimasendeshita".
Soko de Aburahamu wa hitsuji to ushi to o totte Abimereku ni atae, futari wa keiyaku o musunda.
Aburahamu ga mesu no kohitsuji nanatou o wakete oita tokoro,
Abimereku wa Aburahamu ni itta, "Anata ga korera no mesu no kohitsuji nanatou o wakete oita no wa, nan no tame desu ka".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Anata wa watashi no te kara korera no mesu no kohitsuji nanatou o uketotte, watashi ga kono ido o hotta koto no shouko to shite kudasai".
Kore ni yotte sono tokoro o Beerushiba to nazuketa. Karera ga futari soko de chikai o shitakara de aru.
Kono you ni karera wa Beerushiba de keiyaku o musubi, Abimereku to sono gunzei no chouPikoru wa tatte Perishite no chi ni kaetta.
Aburahamu wa Beerushiba ni ichipon no gi ryuu no ki o ue, sono tokoro de eien no kami, Shu no na o yonda.
Kou shite Aburahamu wa nagai aida Perishite bito no chi ni todomatta.
Korera no koto no nochi, kami wa Aburahamu o kokoromite kare ni iwareta, "Aburahamu yo". Kare wa itta, "Koko ni orimasu".
Kami wa iwareta, "Anata no ko, anata no aisuru hitoriko Isaku o tsurete Moriya no chi ni iki, watashi ga shimesu yama de kare o hansai to shite sasage nasai".
Aburahamu wa asa hayaku okite, roba ni kura o oki, futari no wakamono to, sono ko Isaku to o tsure, mata hansai no takigi o wari, tatte kami ga shimesareta tokoro ni dekaketa.
Mikkame ni, Aburahamu wa me o agete, haruka ni sono basho o mita.
Soko de Aburahamu wa wakamonotachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa, roba to issho ni koko ni i nasai. Watashi to warabe wa mukou e itte reihai shi, sono nochi, anata gata no tokoro ni kaette kimasu".
Aburahamu wa hansai no takigi o totte, sono ko Isaku ni owase, te ni hi to hamono to o totte, futari issho ni itta.
Yagate Isaku wa chichi Aburahamu ni itta, "Chichi yo". Kare wa kotaeta, "Ko yo, watashi wa koko ni imasu". Isaku wa itta, "Hi to takigi to wa arimasuga, hansai no kohitsuji wa doko ni arimasu ka".
Aburahamu wa itta, "Ko yo, kami mizukara hansai no kohitsuji o sonaete kudasarude arou". Kou shite futari wa issho ni itta.
Karera ga kami no shimesareta basho ni kita toki, Aburahamu wa soko ni saidan o kizuki, takigi o narabe, sono ko Isaku o shibatte saidan no takigi no ue ni noseta.
Soshite Aburahamu ga te o sashinobe, hamono o totte sono ko o korosou to shita toki,
Shu no tsukai ga ten kara kare o yonde itta, "Aburahamu yo, Aburahamu yo". Kare wa kotaeta, "Hai, koko ni orimasu".
Mitsukai ga itta, "Warabe o te ni kakete wa naranai. Mata nani mo kare ni shite wa naranai. Anata no ko, anata no hitori ko o sae, watashi no tame ni oshimanai no de, anata ga kami o osoreru mono de aru koto o watashi wa ima shitta".
Kono toki Aburahamu ga me o agete miruto, ushiro ni, tsuno o yabu ni kakete iru ichitou no ohitsuji ga ita. Aburahamu wa itte sono ohitsuji o torae, sore o sono ko no kawari ni hansai to shite sasageta.
Sore de Aburahamu wa sono tokoro no na o Adonai Ere to yonda. Kore ni yori, hitobito wa konnichi mo nao "Shu no yama ni sonae ari" to iu.
Shu no tsukai wa futatabi ten kara Aburahamu o yonde,
Itta, "Shu wa iwareta, 'Watashi wa jibun o sashite chikau. Anata ga kono koto o shi, anata no ko, anata no hitori ko o mo oshimanakatta no de,
Watashi wa ooini anata o shukufuku shi, ooini anata no shison o fuyashite, ten no hoshi no you ni, hamabe no suna no you ni suru. Anata no shison wa teki no mon o uchitori,
Mata chi no moromoro no kokumin wa anata no shison ni yotte shukufuku o erude arou. Anata ga watashi no kotoba ni shitagattakara de aru' ".
Aburahamu wa wakamonotachi no tokoro ni kaeri, mina tatte, tomo ni Beerushiba e itta. Soshite Aburahamu wa Beerushiba ni sunda.
Korera no koto no nochi, aru hito ga Aburahamu ni tsugete itta, "Miruka mo mata anata no kyoudai Nahoru ni kodomo o umimashita.
Chounan wa Uzu, otouto wa Buzu, tsugi wa Aramu no chichi Kemueru,
Tsugi wa Kesede, Hazo, Pirudashi, Ederafu, Betoeru desu".
Betoeru no ko wa Ribeka de atte, korera hachinin wa Miruka ga Aburahamu no kyoudai Nahoru ni unda no de aru.
Nahoru no sobame de, na o Ruma to iu onna mo mata Teba, Gahamu, Tahashi oyobi Maaka o unda.
Sara no isshou wa hyaku nijuu shichi nen de atta. Kore ga Sara no ikinagaraeta toshi de aru.
Sara wa Kanan no chi no kiriate aruba sunawachi Heburon de shinda. Aburahamu wa naka ni haitte Sara no tame ni kanashimi naita.
Aburahamu wa shinin no soba kara tatte, Hete no hitobito ni itta,
"Watashi wa anata gata no uchi no tabi no mono de kiryuusha desuga, watashi no shinin o dashite houmuru tame, anata gata no uchi ni watashi no shoyuu to shite hitotsu no bochi o kudasai".
Hete no hitobito wa Aburahamu ni kotaete itta,
"Waga Shu yo, okiki nasai. Anata wa wareware no uchi ni orarete, kami no you na shukun desu. Wareware no bochi no mottomo yoi tokoro ni anata no shinin o houmuri nasai. Sono bochi o kobande, anata ni sono shinin o houmurasenai mono wa wareware no uchi ni wa, hitori mo naideshou".
Aburahamu wa tachiagari, sono chi no tami Hete no hitobito ni rei o shite,
Karera ni itta, "Moshi watashi no shinin o houmuru no ni doui sarerunara, watashi no negai o irete, watashi no tame ni Zoharu no ko Efuron ni tanomi,
Kare ga motte iru hatake no hashi no Makupera no horaana o juubun na daika de watashi ni atae, anata gata no uchi ni bochi o motasete kudasai".
Toki ni Efuron wa Hete no hitobito no uchi ni suwatte ita. Soko de Hete bito Efuron wa Hete no hitobito, sunawachi subete sono machi no mon ni hairu hitobito no kiite iru tokoro de, Aburahamu ni kotaete itta,
"Iie, waga Shu yo, okiki nasai. Watashi wa ano hatake o anata ni sashiagemasu. Mata sono naka ni aru horaana mo sashiagemasu. Watashi no tami no hitobito no mae de, sore o sashiagemasu. Anata no shinin o houmuri nasai".
Aburahamu wa sono chi no tami no mae de rei o shi,
Sono chi no tami no kiite iru tokoro de Efuron ni itta, "Anata ga sore o shoudaku sarerunara, okiki nasai. Watashi wa sono hatake no daika o haraimasu. Ouketori kudasai. Watashi no shinin o soko ni houmurimashou".
Efuron wa Aburahamu ni kotaete itta,
"Waga Shu yo, okiki nasai. Ano chi wa gin yonhyaku shikeru desuga, kore wa watashi to anata no aida de, nani hodo no koto deshou. Anata no shinin o houmuri nasai".
Soko de Aburahamu wa Efuron no kotoba ni shitagai, Efuron ga Hete no hitobito no kiite iru tokoro de itta gin, sunawachi shounin no tsuuyou gin yonhyaku shikeru o hakatte Efuron ni ataeta.
Kou shite Mamure no mae no Makupera ni aru Efuron no hatake wa, hatake mo, sono naka no horaana mo, hatake no naka oyobi sono shuui no sakai ni aru subete no ki mo mina,
Hete no hitobito no mae, sunawachi sono machi no mon ni wa iru subete no hitobito no mae de, Aburahamu no shoyuu to kimatta.
Sono nochi, Aburahamu wa sono tsuma Sara o Kanan no chi ni aru Mamure, sunawachi Heburon no mae no Makupera no hatake no horaana ni houmutta.
Kono you ni hatake to sono naka ni aru horaana to wa Hete no hitobito ni yotte Aburahamu no shoyuu no bochi to sadamerareta.
Aburahamu wa toshi ga susunde roujin to natta. Shu wa subete no koto ni Aburahamu o megumareta.
Sate Aburahamu wa shoyuu no subete o kanri sasete ita ie no nenchou no shimobe ni itta, "Anata no te o watashi no momo no shita ni ire nasai.
Watashi wa anata ni tenchi no kami, Shu o sashite chikawaseru. Anata wa watashi ga ima issho ni sunde iru Kanan bito no uchi kara, musume o watashi no ko no tsuma ni metotte wa naranai.
Anata wa watashi no kuni e iki, shinzoku no tokoro e itte, watashi no ko Isaku no tame ni tsuma o metoranakereba naranai".
Shimobe wa kare ni itta, "Moshi sono onna ga watashi ni tsuite kono chi ni kuru koto o konomanai toki wa, watashi wa anata no ko o anata no shusshin chi ni tsurekaerubekideshou ka".
Aburahamu wa kare ni itta, "Watashi no ko wa kesshite mukou e tsurekaette wa naranai.
Ten no kami, Shu wa watashi o chichi no ie, shinzoku no chi kara michibikidashite watashi ni katari, watashi ni chikatte, omae no shison ni kono chi o ataeru to iwareta. Shu wa, mitsukai o anata no mae ni tsukawasarerude arou. Anata wa asoko kara watashi no ko ni tsuma o metoraneba naranai.
Keredo mo sono onna ga anata ni tsuite kuru koto o konomanainara, anata wa kono chikai o tokareru. Tada watashi no ko o mukou e tsurekaette wa naranai".
Soko de shimobe wa te o shujin Aburahamu no momo no shita ni ire, kono koto ni tsuite kare ni chikatta.
Shimobe wa shujin no rakuda no uchi kara juutou no rakuda o totte dekaketa. Sunawachi shujin no samazama no yoi mono o tazusae, tatte Aramu Naharaimu ni mukai, Nahoru no machi e itta.
Kare wa rakuda o machi no soto no, mizu no ido no soba ni fusaseta. Toki wa yuugure de, onnatachi ga mizu o kumi ni deru jikoku de atta.
Kare wa itta, "Shujin Aburahamu no kami, Shu yo, dou ka, kyou, watashi ni shiawase o sazuke, shujin Aburahamu ni megumi o hodokoshite kudasai.
Watashi wa izumi no soba ni tatte imasu. Machi no hitobito no musumetachi ga mizu o kumi ni dete kita toki,
Musume ni mukatte 'Onegai desu, anata no mizugame o katamukete watashi ni nomasete kudasai' to ii, musume ga kotaete, 'Onomi kudasai. Anata no rakuda ni mo nomasemashou' to ittanara, sono mono koso, anata ga shimobe Isaku no tame ni sadamerareta mono to iu koto ni shite kudasai. Watashi wa kore ni yotte, anata ga watashi no shujin ni megumi o hodokosareru koto o shirimashou".
Kare ga mada ii owaranai uchi ni, Aburahamu no kyoudai Nahoru no tsuma Miruka no ko Betoeru no musume Ribeka ga, mizugame o kata ni nosete dete kita.
Sono musume wa hijou ni utsukushiku, otoko o shiranu shojo de atta. Kanojo ga izumi ni furite, mizugame o mitashi, agatte kita toki,
Shimobe wa hashiriyotte, kanojo ni atte itta, "Onegai desu. Anata no mizugame no mizu o sukoshi nomasete kudasai".
Suruto kanojo wa "Waga Shu yo, onomi kudasai" to itte, isoide mizugame o jibun no te ni torioroshite kare ni nomaseta.
Nomase owatte, kanojo wa itta, "Anata no rakuda mo mina nomi owaru made, watashi wa mizu o kumimashou".
Kanojo wa isoide kame no mizu o mizu bune ni ake, futatabi mizu o kumi ni ido ni hashitte itte, subete no rakuda no tame ni mizu o kunda.
Sono kan sono hito wa Shu ga kare no tabi no shukufuku sareru ka, dou ka o shirouto, damatte kanojo o mitsumete ita.
Rakuda ga nomi owatta toki, sono hito wa omosa han shikeru no kin no hanawa hitotsu to, omosa juu shikeru no kin no udewa futatsu o totte,
Itta, "Anata wa dare no musume ka, watashi ni hanashite kudasai. Anata no chichi no ie ni watashidomo no tomaru basho ga arimashou ka".
Kanojo wa kare ni itta, "Watashi wa Nahoru no tsuma Miruka no ko Betoeru no musume desu".
Mata kare ni itta, "Watashidomo ni wa, wara mo, kaiba mo takusan arimasu. Mata tomaru basho mo arimasu".
Sono hito wa tou o sage, Shu o haishite,
Itta, "Shujin Aburahamu no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa watashi no shujin ni itsukushimito, makoto to o oshimarenakatta. Soshite Shu wa tabi ni aru watashi o shujin no kyoudai no ie ni michibikareta".
Musume wa hashitte itte, haha no ie no mono ni korera no koto o tsugeta.
Ribeka ni hitori no ani ga atte, na o Raban to itta. Raban wa izumi no soba ni iru sono hito no tokoro e hashitte itta.
Kare wa hanawa to imouto no te ni aru udewa to o mi, mata imouto Ribeka ga "Sono hito wa watashi ni kou itta" to iu no o kiite, sono hito no tokoro e itte miruto, sono hito wa izumi no hotori de, rakuda no soba ni tatte ita.
Soko de sono hito ni itta, "Shu ni shukufuku sareta hito yo, ohairi kudasai. Naze soto ni tatte oraremasu ka. Watashi wa ie o junbi shi, rakuda no tame ni mo basho o junbi shite okimashita".
Sono hito wa ie ni haitta. Raban wa rakuda no ni o toite, wara to kaiba o rakuda ni atae, mata mizu o ataete sono hito no ashi to, sono juushatachi no ashi o arawaseta.
Soshite kare no mae ni shokumotsu o sonaetaga, kare wa itta, "Watashi wa youmuki o hanasu made wa tabemasen". Raban wa itta, "Ohanashi kudasai".
Soko de kare wa itta, "Watashi wa Aburahamu no shimobe desu.
Shu wa watashi no shujin o ooini shukufuku shite, ooinaru mono to saremashita. Shu wa mata kare ni hitsuji, ushi, gin, kin, danjo no dorei, raku da, roba o ataeraremashita.
Shujin no tsuma Sara wa toshioite kara, shujin ni otokonoko o umimashita. Shujin wa sono shoyuu o mina kore ni ataemashita.
Tokoro de shujin wa watashi ni chikawasete iimashita, 'Watashi no sunde iru chi no Kanan bito no musume o, watashi no ko no tsuma ni metotte wa naranai.
Omae wa watashi no chichi no ie, shinzoku no tokoro e itte, watashi no ko ni tsuma o metoranakereba naranai'.
Watashi wa shujin ni iimashita, 'Moshi sono onna ga watashi ni tsuite konai toki wa dou itashimashou ka'.
Shujin wa watashi ni iimashita, 'Watashi no tsukaete iru Shu wa, mitsukai o omae to issho ni tsukawashite, omae no tabi ni saiwai o ataerarerude arou. Omae wa watashi no shinzoku, watashi no chichi no ie kara watashi no ko ni tsuma o metoranakereba naranai.
Sono toki, omae wa watashi ni shita chikaikara tokarerude arou. Mata omae ga watashi no shinzoku ni iku toki, karera ga omae ni sono musume o ataenainara, omae wa watashi ni shita chikaikara tokarerude arou'.
Watashi wa kyou, izumi no tokoro ni kite iimashita, 'Shujin Aburahamu no kami, Shu yo, dou ka ima watashi no yuku michi ni saiwai o ataete kudasai.
Watashi wa kono izumi no soba ni tatte imasuga, mizu o kumi ni dete kuru musume ni mukatte, "Onegai desu. Anata no mizugame no mizu o sukoshi nomasete kudasai" to ii,
"Onomi kudasai. Anata no rakuda no tame ni mo, kumimashou" to watashi ni iunara, sono musume koso, Shu ga watashi no shujin no ko no tame ni sadamerareta onna to iu koto ni shite kudasai'.
Watashi ga kokoro no uchi de sou ii owaranai uchi ni, Ribeka ga mizugame o kata ni nosete dete kite, mizu o kumi ni izumi ni furita no de, watashi wa 'Onegai desu, nomasete kudasai' to iimasuto,
Kanojo wa isoide mizugame o kata kara oroshi, 'Onomi kudasai. Watashi wa anata no rakuda ni mo nomasemashou' to iimashita. Sore de watashi wa nomimashitaga, kanojo wa rakuda ni mo nomasemashita.
Watashi wa kanojo ni tazunete, 'Anata wa dare no musume desu ka' to iimasuto, 'Nahoru to sono tsuma Miruka no ko Betoeru no musume desu' to kotaemashita. Soko de watashi wa kanojo no hana ni hanawa o tsuke, te ni udewa o tsukemashita.
Soshite watashi wa atama o sagete Shu o haishi, shujin Aburahamu no kami, Shu o hometataemashita. Shu wa shujin no kyoudai no musume o ko ni metoraseyou to, watashi o tadashii michi ni michibikaretakara desu.
Anata ga taga, moshi watashi no shujin ni itsukushimito, makoto o tsukusou to omowarerunara, sou to watashi ni ohanashi kudasai. Sou de nakereba, sou de nai to ohanashi kudasai. Sore ni yotte watashi wa migi ka hidari ni kimemashou".
Raban to Betoeru wa kotaete itta, "Kono koto wa Shu kara deta koto desukara, watashidomo wa anata ni yoshiashi o iu koto ga dekimasen.
Ribeka ga koko ni orimasukara tsurete itte, Shu ga iwareta you ni, anata no shujin no ko no tsuma ni shite kudasai".
Aburahamu no shimobe wa karera no kotoba o kiite, chi ni fushi, Shu o haishita.
Soshite shimobe wa gin no kazari to, kin no kazari, oyobi ifuku o toridashite Ribeka ni atae, sono ani to haha to ni mo atai no takai shinajina o ataeta.
Kare to juushatachi wa nomikui shite yadottaga, akuru asa karera ga okita toki, shimobe wa itta, "Watashi o shujin no moto ni kaerasete kudasai".
Ribeka no ani to haha to wa itta, "Musume wa suujitsu, sukunakutomo tooka, watashidomo to tomo ni ite, sore kara ikasemashou".
Shimobe wa karera ni itta, "Shu wa watashi no michi ni saiwai o ataeraremashitakara, watashi o hikitomezu ni, shujin no moto ni kaerasete kudasai".
Karera wa itta, "Musume o yonde kiite mimashou".
Karera wa Ribeka o yonde itta, "Anata wa kono hito to issho ni ikimasu ka". Kanojo wa itta, "Ikimasu".
Soko de karera wa imouto Ribeka to, sono uba to, Aburahamu no shimobe to, sono juusha to o okuri saraseta.
Karera wa Ribeka o shukufuku shite kanojo ni itta, "Imouto yo, anata wa, chi yorozu no hito no haha to nare. Anata no shison wa sono teki no mon o uchitore".
Ribeka wa tatte jijotachi to tomo ni rakuda ni nori, sono hito ni shitagatte itta. Shimobe wa Ribeka o tsurete tachisatta.
Sate Isaku wa beeru rahai roi kara kite, Negebu no chi ni sunde ita.
Isaku wa yuugure, no ni dete aruite itaga, me o agete, rakuda no kuru no o mita.
Ribeka wa me o agete Isaku o mi, raku dakara orite,
Shimobe ni itta, "Watashitachi ni mukatte, no o aruite kuru ano hito wa dare deshou". Shimobe wa itta, "Are wa watashi no shujin desu". Suruto Ribeka wa, kazuki de mi o ootta.
Shimobe wa jibun ga shita koto no subete o Isaku ni hanashita.
Isaku wa Ribeka o tenmaku ni tsurete iki, Ribeka o metotte tsuma to shi, kanojo o aishita. Kou shite Isaku wa haha no shigo, nagusame o eta.
Aburahamu wa futatabi tsuma o metotta. Na o Ketora to iu.
Kanojo wa Jimuran, Yokushan, Medan, Midean, Ishibaku oyobi Shuwa o unda.
Yokushan no ko wa Shiba to Dedan. Dedan no shison wa Ashuri bi to, Retoshi bi to, Reumi bito de aru.
Midean no shison wa epa, Eperu, Henoku, Abida, Erudaa de atte, korera wa mina Ketora no shison de atta.
Aburahamu wa sono shoyuu o kotogotoku Isaku ni ataeta.
Mata sono sobametachi no kora ni mo Aburahamu wa mono o atae, nao ikite iru aida ni karera o sono ko Isaku kara hanashite, higashi no hou, higashi no kuni ni utsuraseta.
Aburahamu no ikinagaraeta toshi wa hyaku nanajuu go nen de aru.
Aburahamu wa kourei ni tasshi, roujin to nari, toshi ga michite iki tae, shinde sono tami ni kuwaerareta.
Sono ko Isaku to Ishimaeru wa kare o Hete bito Zoharu no ko Efuron no hatake ni aru Makupera no horaana ni houmutta. Kore wa Mamure no mukai ni ari,
Aburahamu ga Hete no hitobito kara, kaitotta hatake de atte, soko ni Aburahamu to sono tsuma Sara ga houmurareta.
Aburahamu ga shinda nochi, kami wa sono ko Isaku o shukufuku sareta. Isaku wa beeru rahai roi no hotori ni sunda.
Sara no tsukaeme Ejiputo bi to Hagaru ga Aburahamu ni unda Aburahamu no ko Ishimaeru no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Ishimaeru no kora no na o sedai ni shitagatte, sono na o ieba tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Ishimaeru no choushi wa Nebayote, tsugi wa Kedaru, Adebieru, Mibusamu,
Mishima, Doma, Massa,
Hadade, Tema, Etoru, Nefushi, Kedema.
Kore wa Ishimaeru no kora de ari, mura to shukuei to ni yoru na de atte, sono shizoku ni yoru juu ninin no kimitachi de aru.
Ishimaeru no yowai wa hyaku sanjuu nana nen de aru. Kare wa iki taete shini, sono tami ni kuwaerareta.
Ishimaeru no kora wa Habira kara Ejiputo no higashi, Shuru made no aida ni sunde, Ashuru ni oyonda. Ishimaeru wa subete no kyoudai no higashi ni sunda.
Aburahamu no ko Isaku no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Aburahamu no ko wa Isaku de atte,
Isaku wa yonjuusai no toki, Padanaramu no Aramu bi to Betoeru no musume de, Aramu bito Raban no imouto Ribeka o tsuma ni metotta.
Isaku wa tsuma ga ko o umanakatta no de, tsuma no tame ni Shu ni inori negatta. Shu wa sono negai o kikare, tsuma Ribeka wa migomotta.
Tokoro ga sono kora ga tainai de oshiatta no de, Ribeka wa itta, "Konna koto de wa, watashi wa dou narudeshou". Kanojo wa itte Shu ni tazuneta.
Shu wa kanojo ni iwareta, "Futatsu no kokumin ga anata no tainai ni ari, futatsu no tami ga anata no hara kara wakarete deru. Hitotsu no tami wa ta no tami yori mo tsuyoku, ani wa otouto ni tsukaerude arou".
Kanojo no shussan no hi ga kita toki, tainai ni wa futago ga atta.
Saki ni deta no wa akakute zenshin kegoromo no you de atta. Sore de na o Esau to nazuketa.
Sono nochi ni otouto ga deta. Sono te wa Esau no kakato o tsukande ita. Sore de na o Yakobu to nazuketa. Ribeka ga karera o unda toki, Isaku wa rokujuusai de atta.
Sate sono kora wa seichou shi, Esau wa takumi na shuryousha to nari, no no hito to nattaga, Yakobu wa odayaka na hito de, tenmaku ni sunde ita.
Isaku wa, shika no niku ga suki datta no de, Esau o aishitaga, Ribeka wa Yakobu o aishita.
Aru hi Yakobu ga, atsumono o nite ita toki, Esau wa uetsukarete no kara kaette kita.
Esau wa Yakobu ni itta, "Watashi wa uetsukareta. Onegai da. Akai mono, sono akai mono o watashi ni tabesasete kure". Kare ga na o Edomu to yobareta no wa kono tame de aru.
Yakobu wa itta, "Mazu anata no choushi no tokken o watashi ni uri nasai".
Esau wa itta, "Watashi wa shini sou da. Choushi no tokken nado watashi ni nani ni narou".
Yakobu wa mata itta, "Mazu watashi ni chikai nasai". Kare wa chikatte choushi no tokken o Yakobu ni utta.
Soko de Yakobu wa pan to Renzu mame no atsumono to o Esau ni ataeta no de, kare wa nomikui shite, tachisatta. Kono you ni shite Esau wa choushi no tokken o karonjita.
Aburahamu no toki ni atta hajime no kikin no hoka, mata kikin ga sono kuni ni atta no de, Isaku wa geraru ni iru Perishite bito no ou Abimereku no tokoro e itta.
Sono toki, Shu wa kare ni arawarete iwareta, "Ejiputo e kudatte wa naranai. Watashi ga anata ni shimesu chi ni todomari nasai.
Anata ga kono chi ni todomarunara, watashi wa anata to tomo ni ite, anata o shukufuku shi, korera no kuni o kotogotoku anata to, anata no shison to ni atae, watashi ga anata no chichi Aburahamu ni chikatta chikai o hatasou.
Mata watashi wa anata no shison o mashite ten no hoshi no you ni shi, anata no shison ni korera no chi o mina ataeyou. Soshite chi no subete no kokumin wa anata no shison ni yotte shukufuku o erude arou.
Aburahamu ga watashi no kotoba ni shitagatte watashi no satoshi to, imashime to, sadame to, okite to o mamottakara de aru".
Kou shite Isaku wa geraru ni sunda.
Sono tokoro no hitobito ga kare no tsuma no koto o tazuneta toki, "Kanojo wa watashi no imouto desu" to kare wa itta. Ribeka wa utsukushikatta no de, sono tokoro no hitobito ga Ribeka no yue ni jibun o korosu ka mo shirenai to omotte, "Watashi no tsuma desu" to iu no o osoretakara de aru.
Isaku wa nagaraku soko ni itaga, aru hi Perishite bito no ou Abimereku wa mado kara soto o nagamete ite, Isaku ga sono tsuma Ribeka to tawamurete iru no o mita.
Soko de Abimereku wa Isaku o meshite itta, "Kanojo wa tashika ni anata no tsuma desu. Anata wa dou shite 'Kanojo wa watashi no imouto desu' to iwareta no desu ka". Isaku wa kare ni itta, "Watashi wa kanojo no yue ni korosareru ka mo shirenai to omottakara desu".
Abimereku wa itta, "Anata wa dou shite konna koto o wareware ni sareta no desu ka. Tami no hitori ga karugarushiku anata no tsuma to neru you na koto ga areba, sono toki anata wa wareware ni tsumi o owaserudeshou".
Sore de Abimereku wa subete no tami ni meijite itta, "Kono hito, mata wa sono tsuma ni sawaru mono wa kanarazu shinanakereba naranai".
Isaku wa sono chi ni tane o maite, sono toshi ni hyaku bai no shuukaku o eta. Kono you ni Shu ga kare o shukufuku sareta no de,
Kare wa tomi, mata masumasu sakaete hijou ni yuufuku ni nari,
Hitsuji no mure, ushi no mure oyobi ooku no shimobe o motsu you ni natta no de, Perishite bi to wa kare o netanda.
Mata Perishite bi to wa kare no chichi Aburahamu no toki ni, chichi no shimobetachi ga hotta subete no ido o fusagi, tsuchi de umeta.
Abimereku wa Isaku ni itta, "Anata wa wareware yori mo, haruka ni tsuyoku nararetakara, wareware no tokoro o satte kudasai".
Isaku wa soko o sari, geraru no tani ni tenmaku o hatte sono tokoro ni sunda.
Soshite Isaku wa chichi Aburahamu no toki ni hitobito no hotta mizu no ido o futatabi hotta. Aburahamu no shigo, Perishite bito ga fusaidakara de aru. Isaku wa chichi ga tsuketa na ni shitagatte sorera ni na o tsuketa.
Shikashi Isaku no shimobetachi ga tani no naka o hotte, soko ni wakideru mizu no ido o mitsuketa toki,
Geraru no hitsujikaitachi wa, "Kono mizu wa wareware no mono da" to itte, Isaku no hitsujikaitachi to arasotta no de, Isaku wa sono ido no na o Eseku to nazuketa. Karera ga kare to arasottakara de aru.
Karera wa mata hitotsu no ido o hottaga, kore o mo arasotta no de, na o Shitena to nazuketa.
Isaku wa soko kara utsutte mata hitotsu no ido o hottaga, karera wa kore o arasowanakatta no de, sono na o Rehobote to nazukete itta, "Ima Shu ga wareware no basho o hirogeraretakara, wareware wa kono chi ni fuerude arou".
Kare wa soko kara Beerushiba ni nobotta.
Sono yo, Shu wa kare ni arawarete iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no chichi Aburahamu no kami de aru. Anata wa osorete wa naranai. Watashi wa anata to tomo ni otte, anata o shukufuku shi, watashi no shimobe Aburahamu no yue ni anata no shison o masude arou".
Sore de kare wa sono tokoro ni saidan o kizuite, Shu no na o yobi, soko ni tenmaku o hatta. Mata Isaku no shimobetachi wa soko ni hitotsu no ido o hotta.
Toki ni Abimereku ga sono tomo Ahozate to, gunzei no chouPikoru to tomo ni geraru kara Isaku no moto ni kita no de,
Isaku wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi o nikunde, anata gata no naka kara watashi o oidasareta no ni, dou shite watashi no tokoro ni korareta no desu ka".
Karera wa itta, "Wareware wa Shu ga anata to tomo ni orareru no o, hakkiri mimashita no de, ima wareware no aida, sunawachi wareware to anata to no aida ni hitotsu no chikai o tatete, anata to keiyaku o musubou to omoimasu.
Wareware wa anata ni gai o kuwaeta koto wa naku, tada yoi koto dake o shite, yasuraka ni saraseta no desukara, anata wa wareware ni warui koto o shite wa narimasen. Makoto ni anata wa Shu ni shukufuku sareta kata desu".
Soko de Isaku wa karera no tame ni furumai o mouketa. Karera wa nomikui shi,
Akuru asa, hayaku okite tagai ni chikatta. Kou shite Isaku wa karera o saraseta no de, karera wa Isaku no moto kara odayaka ni satta.
Sono hi, Isaku no shimobetachi ga kite, jibuntachi ga hotta ido ni tsuite kare ni tsugete itta, "Watashitachi wa mizu o mitsukemashita".
Isaku wa sore o Shiba to nazuketa. Kore ni yotte sono machi no na wa konnichi ni itaru made Beerushiba to iwarete iru.
Esau wa yonjuusai no toki, Hete bito Beeri no musume Yudete to Hete bito Eron no musume Basumate to o tsuma ni metotta.
Kanojotachi wa Isaku to Ribeka ni totte kokoro no itami to natta.
Isaku wa toshioi, me ga kasunde mienaku natta toki, choushi Esau o yonde itta, "Ko yo". Kare wa kotaete itta, "Koko ni orimasu".
Isaku wa itta. "Watashi wa toshioite, itsu shinu ka mo shirenai.
Sore de anata no buki, yumiya o motte no ni dekake, watashi no tame ni, shika no niku o totte kite,
Watashi no suki na oishii tabemono o tsukuri, motte kite tabesase yo. Watashi wa shinu mae ni anata o shukufuku shiyou".
Isaku ga sono ko Esau ni kataru no o Ribeka wa kiite ita. Yagate Esau ga, shika no niku o eyou to no ni dekaketa toki,
Ribeka wa sono ko Yakobu ni itta, "Watashi wa kiite imashitaga, chichi wa ani Esau ni,
'Watashi no tame ni, shika no niku o totte kite, oishii tabemono o tsukuri, watashi ni tabesase yo. Watashi wa shinu mae ni, Shu no mae de anata o shukufuku shiyou' to iimashita.
Sore de, ko yo, watashi no kotoba ni shitagai, watashi no iu toori ni shi nasai.
Mure no tokoro e itte, soko kara yagi no ko no yoi no o nitou watashi no tokoro ni totte ki nasai. Watashi wa sore de chichi no tame ni, chichi no suki na oishii tabemono o tsukurimashou.
Anata wa sore o motte itte chichi ni tabesase nasai. Chichi wa shinu mae ni anata o shukufuku surudeshou".
Yakobu wa haha Ribeka ni itta, "Ani Esau wa kebukai hito desuga, watashi wa nameraka desu.
Osoraku chichi wa watashi ni sawatte mirudeshou. Sou sureba watashi wa chichi o azamuku mono to omoware, shukufuku o ukezu, kaette noroi o ukerudeshou".
Haha wa kare ni itta, "Ko yo, anata ga ukeru noroi wa watashi ga ukemasu. Tada, watashi no kotoba ni shitagai, itte totte ki nasai".
Soko de kare wa itte yagi no ko o tori, haha no tokoro ni motte kita no de, haha wa chichi no suki na oishii tabemono o tsukutta.
Ribeka wa ie ni atta choushi Esau no haregi o totte, otouto Yakobu ni kise,
Mata koyagi no kawa o te to kubi no nameraka na tokoro to ni tsukesase,
Kanojo ga tsukutta oishii tabemono to pan to o sono ko Yakobu no te ni watashita.
Soko de Yakobu wa chichi no tokoro e itte itta, "Chichi yo". Suru to chichi wa itta, "Watashi wa koko ni iru. Ko yo, anata wa dare ka".
Yakobu wa chichi ni itta, "Choushi Esau desu. Anata ga watashi ni iwareta toori ni itashimashita. Douzo okite, suwatte watashi no shika no niku o tabe, anata mizukara watashi o shukufuku shite kudasai".
Isaku wa sono ko ni itta, "Ko yo, dou shite anata wa konna ni hayaku te ni ireta no ka". Kare wa itta, "Anata no kami, Shu ga watashi ni shiawase o sazukeraretakara desu".
Isaku wa Yakobu ni itta, "Ko yo, chikayori nasai. Watashi wa, sawatte mite, anata ga tashika ni waga ko Esau de aru ka dou ka o miyou".
Yakobu ga, chichi Isaku ni chikayotta no de, Isaku wa kare ni sawatte mite itta, "Koe wa Yakobu no koe daga, te wa Esau no te da".
Yakobu no te ga ani Esau no te no you ni kebukakatta tame, Isaku wa Yakobu o miwakeru koto ga dekinakatta no de, kare o shukufuku shita.
Isaku wa itta, "Anata wa tashika ni waga ko Esau desu ka". Kare wa itta, "Sou desu".
Isaku wa itta, "Watashi no tokoro e motte ki nasai. Waga ko no shika no niku o tabete, watashi mizukara, anata o shukufuku shiyou". Yakobu ga sore o kare no tokoro ni motte kita no de, kare wa tabeta. Mata budoushu o motte kita no de, kare wa nonda.
Soshite chichi Isaku wa kare ni itta, "Ko yo, saa, chikayotte watashi ni kuchizuke shi nasai".
Kare ga chikayotte kuchizuke shita toki, Isaku wa sono kimono no kaori o kagi, kare o shukufuku shite itta, "Aa, waga ko no kaori wa, Shu ga shukufuku sareta no no kaori no you da.
Dou ka kami ga, ten no tsuyu to, chi no koeta tokoro to, ooku no kokumotsu to, atarashii budoushu to o anata ni tamawaru you ni.
Moromoro no tami wa anata ni tsukae, moromoro no kuni wa anata ni mi o kagameru. Anata wa kyoudaitachi no Shu to nari, anata no haha no kora wa, anata ni mi o kagamerude arou. Anata o no roumono wa noroware, anata o shukufuku suru mono wa shukufuku sareru".
Isaku ga Yakobu o shukufuku shi owatte, Yakobu ga chichi Isaku no mae kara dete ikuto sugu, ani Esau ga kari kara kaette kita.
Kare mo mata oishii tabemono o tsukutte, chichi no tokoro ni motte kite, itta, "Chichi yo, okite anata no ko no shika no niku o tabe, anata mizukara, watashi o shukufuku shite kudasai".
Chichi Isaku wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa, dare ka". Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa anata no ko, choushi Esau desu".
Isaku wa hageshiku furuete itta, "Sore de wa, ano shika no niku o totte, watashi ni motte kita mono wa dare ka. Watashi wa anata ga kuru mae ni, minna tabete kare o shukufuku shita. Yue ni kare ga shukufuku o erude arou".
Esau wa chichi no kotoba o kiita toki, oogoe o age, hageshiku sakende, chichi ni itta, "Chichi yo, watashi o, watashi o mo shukufuku shite kudasai".
Isaku wa itta, "Anata no otouto ga itsuwatte yatte kite, anata no shukufuku o ubatte shimatta".
Esau wa itta, "Yoku mo Yakobu to nazuketa mono da. Kare wa ni do made mo watashi o oshinoketa. Saki ni wa, watashi no choushi no tokken o ubai, kondo wa watashi no shukufuku o ubatta". Mata itta, "Anata wa watashi no tame ni shukufuku o nokoshite okaremasendeshita ka".
Isaku wa kotaete Esau ni itta, "Watashi wa kare o anata no shujin to shi, kyoudaitachi o mina shimobe to shite kare ni atae, mata kokumotsu to budoushu o kare ni sazuketa. Waga ko yo, ima to natte wa, anata no tame ni nani ga dekiyou ka".
Esau wa chichi ni itta, "Chichi yo, anata no shukufuku wa tada hitotsu dake desu ka. Chichi yo, watashi o, watashi o mo shukufuku shite kudasai". Esau wa koe o agete naita.
Chichi Isaku wa kotaete kare ni itta, "Anata no sumika wa chi no koeta tokoro kara hanare, mataue naru ten no tsuyu kara hanarerude arou.
Anata wa tsurugi o motte yo o watari, anata no otouto ni tsukaerude arou. Shikashi, anata ga isamitatsu toki, kubi kara, sono kubiki o furiotosude arou".
Kou shite Esau wa chichi ga Yakobu ni ataeta shukufuku no yue ni Yakobu o nikunda. Esau wa kokoro no uchi de itta, "Chichi no mo no hi mo tooku wa naide arou. Sono toki, otouto Yakobu o korosou".
Shikashi Ribeka wa choushi Esau no kono kotoba o hitozute ni kiita no de, hito o yari, otouto Yakobu o yonde itta, "Ani Esau wa anata o korosou to kangaete, mizukara nagusamete imasu.
Ko yo, ima watashi no kotoba ni shitagatte, sugu Haran ni iru watashi no ani Raban no moto ni nogare,
Anata no ani no ikari ga tokeru made, shibaraku kare no tokoro ni i nasai.
Ani no ikidoori ga tokete, anata no shita koto o ani ga wasureru you ni nattanaraba, watashi wa hito o yatte, anata o soko kara mukaemashou. Dou shite, watashi wa tsuitachi no uchi ni anata gata futari o ushinatte yoideshou ka".
Ribeka wa Isaku ni itta, "Watashi wa Hete bito no musumedomo no koto de, ikite iru no ga iya ni narimashita. Moshi Yakobu ga kono chi no, ano musumedomo no you na Hete bito no musume o tsuma ni metorunara, watashi wa ikite ite, nani ni narimashou".
Isaku wa Yakobu o yonde, kore o shukufuku shi, meijite itta, "Anata wa Kanan no musume o tsuma ni metotte wa naranai.
Tatte Padanaramu e iki, anata no haha no chichi Betoeru no ie ni itte, soko de anata no haha no ani Raban no musume o tsuma ni metori nasai.
Zennou no kami ga, anata o shukufuku shi, ooku no ko o esase, katsu fue sasete, ooku no kokumin to shi,
Mata Aburahamu no shukufuku o anata to shison to ni ataete, kami ga Aburahamu ni sazukerareta anata no kiryuu no chi o tsugasete kudasaru you ni".
Kou shite Isaku wa Yakobu o okuridashita. Yakobu wa Padanaramu ni mukai, Aramu bi to Betoeru no ko de, Yakobu to Esau to no haha Ribeka no ani Raban no moto e itta.
Sate Esau wa, Isaku ga Yakobu o shukufuku shite, Padanaramu ni tsukawashi, soko kara tsuma o metoraseyou to shita koto, kare o shukufuku shi, meijite "Anata wa Kanan no musume o tsuma ni metotte wa naranai" to itta koto,
Soshite Yakobu ga fubo no kotoba ni shitagatte, Padanaramu e itta koto o shitta toki,
Kare wa Kanan no musume ga chichi Isaku no kokoro ni kanawanai no o mita.
Soko de Esau wa Ishimaeru no tokoro ni iki, sudeni aru tsumatachi no hoka ni Aburahamu no ko Ishimaeru no musume de, Nebayote no imouto Maharate o tsuma ni metotta.
Sate Yakobu wa Beerushiba o tatte, Haran e mukattaga,
Hitotsu no tokoro ni tsuita toki, hi ga kureta no de, soko ni ichiya o sugoshi, sono tokoro no ishi o totte makura to shi, soko ni fushite neta.
Toki ni kare wa yume o mita. Hitotsu no hashigo ga chi no ue ni tatte ite, sono itadaki wa ten ni tasshi, kami no tsukaitachi ga sore o noborikudari shite iru no o mita.
Soshite Shu wa kare no soba ni tatte iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no chichi Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Shu de aru. Anata ga fushite iru chi o, anata to shison to ni ataeyou.
Anata no shison wa chi no chiri no you ni ooku natte, nishi, higashi, kita, minami ni hirogari, chi no shozoku wa anata to shison to ni yotte shukufuku o ukerude arou.
Watashi wa anata to tomo ni ite, anata ga doko e iku ni mo anata o mamori, anata o kono chi ni tsurekaerude arou. Watashi wa kesshite anata o sutezu, anata ni katatta koto o okonaude arou".
Yakobu wa nemuri kara samete itta, "Makoto ni Shu ga kono tokoro ni orareru no ni, watashi wa shiranakatta".
Soshite kare wa osorete itta, "Kore wa nan to iu osorubeki tokoro darou. Kore wa kami no ie de aru. Kore wa ten no mon da".
Yakobu wa asa hayaku okite, makura to shite ita ishi o tori, sore o tatete hashira to shi, sono itadaki ni abura o sosoide,
Sono tokoro no na o Beteru to nazuketa. Sono machi no na wa hajime wa Ruzu to itta.
Yakobu wa chikai o tatete itta, "Kami ga watashi to tomo ni imashi, watashi no iku kono michi de watashi o mamori, taberu pan to kiru kimono o tamai,
Yasuraka ni chichi no ie ni kaerasete kudasarunara, Shu o watashi no kami to itashimashou.
Mata watashi ga hashira ni tateta kono ishi o kami no ie to itashimashou. Soshite anata ga kudasaru subete no mono no juubun no ichi o, watashi wa kanarazu anata ni sasagemasu".
Yakobu wa sono tabi o tsuzukete higashi no tami no chi e itta.
Miruto no ni hitotsu no ido ga atte, sono katawara ni hitsuji no mittsu no mure ga fushite ita. Hitobito wa sono ido kara mure ni mizu o nomaseru no de attaga, ido no kuchi ni wa ookina ishi ga atta.
Mure ga mina soko ni atsumaruto, hitobito wa ido no kuchi kara ishi o korogashite hitsuji ni mizu o nomase, sono ishi o mata ido no kuchi no moto no tokoro ni kaeshite oku no de aru.
Yakobu wa hitobito ni itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, anata gata wa doko kara korareta no desu ka". Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi wa Haran kara desu".
Yakobu wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa Nahoru no ko Raban o shitte imasu ka". Karera wa itta, "Shitte imasu".
Yakobu wa mata karera ni itta, "Kare wa buji desu ka". Karera wa itta, "Buji desu. Goran nasai. Kare no musume Rakeru wa ima hitsuji to issho ni koko e kimasu".
Yakobu wa itta, "Hi wa mada takaishi, kachiku o atsumeru toki de mo nai. Anata gata wa hitsuji ni mizu o nomasete kara, mata itte kai nasai".
Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi wa sore wa dekinai no desu. Mure ga mina atsumatta ue de, ido no kuchi kara ishi o korogashi, sore kara hitsuji ni mizu o nomaseru no desu".
Yakobu ga nao karera to katatte iru toki ni, Rakeru wa chichi no hitsuji to issho ni kita. Kanojo wa hitsuji o katte itakara de aru.
Yakobu wa haha no ani Raban no musume Rakeru to haha no ani Raban no hitsuji to o mita. Soshite Yakobu wa susumiyotte ido no kuchi kara ishi o korogashi, haha no ani Raban no hitsuji ni mizu o nomaseta.
Yakobu wa Rakeru ni kuchizuke shi, koe o agete naita.
Yakobu wa Rakeru ni, jibun ga Rakeru no chichi no oi de ari, Ribeka no ko de aru koto o tsugeta no de, kanojo wa hashitte itte chichi ni hanashita.
Raban wa imouto no ko Yakobu ga kita to iu shirase o kikuto sugu, hashitte itte Yakobu o mukae, kore o daite kuchizuke shi, ie ni tsurete kita. Soko de Yakobu wa subete no koto o Raban ni hanashita.
Raban wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa hontou ni watashi no kotsuniku desu". Yakobu wa ichi kagetsu no aida kare to tomo ni ita.
Toki ni Raban wa Yakobu ni itta, "Anata wa watashi no oi dakara to itte, tada de watashi no tame ni hataraku koto mo naideshou. Donna houshuu o nozomimasu ka, watashi ni itte kudasai".
Sate Raban ni wa futari no musume ga atta. Ane no na wa Rea to ii, imouto no na wa Rakeru to itta.
Rea wa me ga yowakattaga, Rakeru wa utsukushikute airashikatta.
Yakobu wa Rakeru o aishita no de, "Watashi wa, anata no imoutomusume Rakeru no tame ni shichi nen anata ni tsukaemashou" to itta.
Raban wa itta, "Kanojo o tanin ni yaru yori mo anata ni yaru hou ga yoi. Watashi to issho ni i nasai".
Kou shite, Yakobu wa nana nen no aida Rakeru no tame ni hataraitaga, kanojo o aishita no de, tada suujitsu no you ni omowareta.
Yakobu wa Raban ni itta, "Kijitsu ga michitakara, watashi no tsuma o ataete, tsuma no tokoro ni hairasete kudasai".
Soko de Raban wa sono tokoro no hitobito o mina atsumete, furumai o mouketa.
Yuugure to natta toki, musume Rea o Yakobu no moto ni tsurete kita no de, Yakobu wa kanojo no tokoro ni haitta.
Raban wa mata jibun no tsukaeme Jirupa o musume Rea ni tsukaeme to shite ataeta.
Asa ni natte, miruto, sore wa Rea de atta no de, Yakobu wa Raban ni itta, "Anata wa dou shite konna koto o watashi ni sareta no desu ka. Watashi wa Rakeru no tame ni hataraita no de wa arimasen ka. Dou shite anata wa watashi o azamuita no desu ka".
Raban wa itta, "Imouto o ane yori saki ni totsugaseru koto wa wareware no kuni de wa shimasen.
Mazu kono musume no tame ni ichi shuukan o sugoshi nasai. Sou sureba ano musume mo anata ni ageyou. Anata wa, sono tame sarani nana nen watashi ni tsukaenakereba naranai".
Yakobu wa sono toori ni shite, sono ichi shuukan ga owatta no de, Raban wa musume Rakeru o mo tsuma to shite kare ni ataeta.
Raban wa mata jibun no tsukaeme Biruha o musume Rakeru ni tsukaeme to shite ataeta.
Yakobu wa mata Rakeru no tokoro ni haitta. Kare wa Rea yori mo Rakeru o aishite, sarani nana nen Raban ni tsukaeta.
Shu wa Rea ga kirawareru no o mite, sono tai o hirakaretaga, Rakeru wa, migomoranakatta.
Rea wa, migomotte ko o umi, na o Ruben to nazukete, itta, "Shu ga watashi no nayami o kaerimiraretakara, ima wa otto mo watashi o aisurudarou".
Kanojo wa mata, migomotte ko o umi, "Shu wa watashi ga kirawareru no o okiki ni natte, watashi ni kono ko o mo tamawatta" to itte, na o Shimeon to nazuketa.
Kanojo wa mata, migomotte ko o umi, "Watashi wa kare ni sannin no ko o undakara, kondo koso wa otto mo watashi ni shitashimudarou" to itte, na o Rebi to nazuketa.
Kanojo wa mata, migomotte ko o umi, "Watashi wa ima, Shu o hometataeru" to itte na o Yuda to nazuketa. Soko de kanojo no, ko o umu koto wa yanda.
Rakeru wa jibun ga Yakobu ni ko o umanai no o shitta toki, ane o netande Yakobu ni itta, "Watashi ni kodomo o kudasai. Samo naito, watashi wa shinimasu".
Yakobu wa Rakeru ni mukai ika tte itta, "Anata no tai ni kodomo o yadorasenai no wa kami desu. Watashi ga kami ni kawaru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Rakeru wa itta, "Watashi no tsukaeme Biruha ga imasu. Kanojo no tokoro ni ohairi nasai. Kanojo ga ko o unde, watashi no hiza ni okimasu. Sou sureba, watashi mo mata kanojo ni yotte ko o motsudeshou".
Rakeru wa tsukaeme Biruha o kare ni ataete, tsuma to saseta no de, Yakobu wa kanojo no tokoro ni haitta.
Biruha wa, migomotte Yakobu ni ko o unda.
Soko de Rakeru wa, "Kami wa watashi no uttae ni kotae, mata watashi no koe o kiite, watashi ni ko o tamawatta" to itte, na o Dan to nazuketa.
Rakeru no tsukaeme Biruha wa mata, migomotte daini no ko o Yakobu ni unda.
Soko de Rakeru wa, "Watashi wa hageshii arasoi de, ane to arasotte katta" to itte, na o Nafutari to nazuketa.
Sate Rea wa jibun ga ko o umu koto no yanda no o mita toki, tsukaeme Jirupa o tori, tsuma to shite Yakobu ni ataeta.
Rea no tsukaeme Jirupa wa Yakobu ni ko o unda.
Soko de Rea wa, "Kouun ga kita" to itte, na o Gado to nazuketa.
Rea no tsukaeme Jirupa wa daini no ko o Yakobu ni unda.
Soko de Rea wa, "Watashi wa, shiawase desu. Musumetachi wa watashi o shiawase na mono to iudeshou" to itte, na o Aseru to nazuketa.
Sate Ruben wa mugikari no hi ni no ni dete, no de koi nasubi o mitsuke, sore o haha Rea no moto ni motte kita. Rakeru wa Rea ni itta, "Anata no ko no koi nasubi o douzo watashi ni kudasai".
Rea wa Rakeru ni itta, "Anata ga watashi no otto o totta no wa chiisana koto deshou ka. Sono ue, anata wa mata watashi no ko no koi nasubi o mo torou to suru no desu ka". Rakeru wa itta, "Sore de wa anata no ko no koi nasubi ni kaete, kon'ya kare o anata to tomo ni nesasemashou".
Yuugata ni natte, Yakobu ga no kara kaette kita no de, Rea wa kare o demukaete itta, "Watashi no ko no koi nasubi o motte, watashi ga anata o yatotta no desukara, anata wa watashi no tokoro ni, hairanakereba narimasen". Yakobu wa sono yo Rea to tomo ni neta.
Kami wa Rea no negai o kikareta no de, kanojo wa migomotte go banme no ko o Yakobu ni unda.
Soko de Rea wa, "Watashi ga tsukaeme o otto ni ataetakara, kami ga watashi ni sono atai o tamawatta no desu" to itte, na o Issakaru to nazuketa.
Rea wa mata, migomotte roku banme no ko o Yakobu ni unda.
Soko de Rea wa, "Kami wa watashi ni yoi tamamono o tamawatta. Watashi wa rokunin no ko o otto ni undakara, ima koso kare wa watashi to issho ni sumudeshou" to itte, sono na o Zeburun to nazuketa.
Sono nochi, kanojo wa hitori no musume o unde, na o Dena to nazuketa.
Tsugi ni kami wa Rakeru o kokoro ni tomerare, kanojo no negai o kiki, sono tai o hirakareta no de,
Kanojo wa, migomotte otokonoko o umi, "Kami wa watashi no haji o susuide kudasatta" to itte,
Na o Yosefu to nazuke, "Shu ga watashi ni, nao hitori no ko o kuwaerareru you ni" to itta.
Rakeru ga Yosefu o unda toki, Yakobu wa Raban ni itta, "Watashi o sarasete, watashi no kokyou, watashi no kuni e ikasete kudasai.
Anata ni tsukaete eta watashi no saishi o, watashi ni ataete ikasete kudasai. Watashi ga anata no tame ni hataraita honeori wa, anata ga gozonji desu".
Raban wa kare ni itta, "Moshi, anata no kokoro ni kanaunara, todomatte kudasai. Watashi wa Shu ga anata no yue ni, watashi o megumareru shirushi o mimashita".
Mata itta, "Anata no houshuu o moushidete kudasai. Watashi wa sore o haraimasu".
Yakobu wa kare ni itta, "Watashi ga dono you ni anata ni tsukaeta ka, mata dono you ni anata no kachiku o katta ka wa, anata ga gozonji desu.
Watashi ga kuru mae ni wa, anata no motte orareta mono wa wazuka deshitaga, fuete ooku narimashita. Shu wa watashi no iku tokoro doko de mo, anata o megumaremashita. Shikashi, itsu ni nattara watashi mo jibun no ie o nasu you ni narudeshou ka".
Kare wa itta, "Nani o anata ni ageyou ka". Yakobu wa itta, "Nani mo watashi ni kudasaru ni oyobimasen. Moshi anata ga, watashi no tame ni kono hitotsu no koto o shite kudasarunara, watashi wa ima ichi do anata no mure o kai, mamorimashou.
Watashi wa kyou, anata no mure o mina mawatte mite, sono naka kara subete buchi to madara no hitsuji, oyobi subete kuroi kohitsuji to, yagi no naka no madara no mono to, buchi no mono to o utsushimasuga, kore o watashi no houshuu to shimashou.
Ato de, anata ga kite, anata no mae de watashi no houshuu o shiraberu toki, watashi no tadashii koto ga shoumei sarerudeshou. Moshi mo, yagi no naka ni buchi no nai mono, madara de nai mono ga at tari, kohitsuji no naka ni kuroku nai mono ga areba, sore wa mina watashi ga nusunda mono to narudeshou".
Raban wa itta, "Yoroshii. Anata no iwareru toori ni shimashou".
Soko de Raban wa sono hi, o yagi no shima no aru mono, madara no mono, subete me yagi no buchi no mono, madara no mono, subete shiromi o obite iru mono, mata subete kohitsuji no naka no kuroi mono o utsushite kora no te ni watashi,
Yakobu to no aida ni mikkaji no hedatari o mouketa. Yakobu wa Raban no nokori no mure o katta.
Yakobu wa, hakoyanagi to, a mendou to, suzukake no ki no nama no eda o tori, kawa o haide sore ni shiroi suji o tsukuri, eda no shiroi tokoro o arawashi,
Kawa o haida eda o, mure ga kite mizu o nomu hachi, sunawachi mizu bune no naka ni, mure ni mukawasete oita. Mure wa mizu o nomi ni kita toki ni, haranda.
Sunawachi mure wa eda no mae de, harande, shima no aru mono, buchi no mono, madara no mono o unda.
Yakobu wa sono kohitsuji o betsu ni oita. Kare wa mata mure no kao o Raban no mure no shima no aru mono to, subete kuroi mono to ni mukawaseta. Soshite jibun no mure o betsu ni matomete oite, Raban no mure ni wa, irenakatta.
Mata mure no tsuyoi mono ga hatsujou shita toki ni wa, Yakobu wa mizu bune no naka ni, sono mure no me no mae ni, kano eda o oite, eda no aida de, haramaseta.
Keredo mo mure no yowai mono no toki ni wa, sore o okanakatta. Kou shite yowai mono wa Raban no mono to nari, tsuyoi mono wa Yakobu no mono to natta no de,
Kono hito wa ooini tomi, ooku no mure to, danjo no dorei, oyobi raku da, roba o motsu you ni natta.
Sate Yakobu wa Raban no kora ga, "Yakobu wa wareware no chichi no mono o kotogotoku ubai, chichi no mono ni yotte ano subete no tomi o eta no da" to itte iru no o kiita.
Mata Yakobu ga Raban no kao o miru no ni, sore wa jibun ni taishite izen no you de wa nakatta.
Shu wa Yakobu ni iwareta, "Anata no senzo no kuni e kaeri, shinzoku no moto ni iki nasai. Watashi wa anata to tomo ni irude arou".
Soko de Yakobu wa hito o yatte, Rakeru to Rea to o, no ni iru jibun no mure no tokoro ni maneki,
Kanojora ni itta, "Watashi ga anata gata no chichi no kao o miru no ni, watashi ni taishite izen no you de wa nai. Shikashi, watashi no chichi no kami wa watashi to tomo ni orareru.
Anata gata ga shitte iru you ni, watashi wa chikara no kagiri, anata gata no chichi ni tsukaete kita.
Shikashi, anata gata no chichi wa watashi o azamuite, juu do mo watashi no houshuu o kaeta. Keredo mo kami wa kare ga watashi ni gai o kuwaeru koto o oyurushi ni naranakatta.
Moshi kare ga, 'Buchi no mono wa anata no houshuu da' to ieba, mure wa mina buchi no mono o unda. Moshi kare ga, 'Shima no aru mono wa anata no houshuu da' to ieba, mure wa mina shima no aru mono o unda.
Kou shite kami wa anata gata no chichi no kachiku o totte watashi ni ataerareta.
Mata mure ga hatsujou shita toki, watashi ga yume ni me o agete miruto, mure no ue ni notte iru o yagi wa mina shima no aru mono, buchi no mono, shimofuri no mono de atta.
Sono toki, kami no tsukai ga yume no naka de watashi ni itta, 'Yakobu yo'. Watashi wa kotaeta, 'Koko ni orimasu'.
Kami no tsukai wa itta, 'Me o agete mite goran. Mure no ue ni notte iru o yagi wa mina shima no aru mono, buchi no mono, shimofuri no mono desu. Watashi wa Raban ga anata ni shita koto o mina mite imasu.
Watashi wa Beteru no kami desu. Katsute anata wa asoko de hashira ni abura o sosoide, watashi ni chikai o tatemashitaga, ima tatte kono chi o dete, anata no umareta kuni e kaeri nasai' ".
Rakeru to Rea wa kotaete itta, "Watashitachi no chichi no ie ni, nao watashitachi no u kubeki bun, mata shigyou ga arimashou ka.
Watashitachi wa chichi ni tanin no you ni omowarete irude wa arimasen ka. Kare wa watashitachi o utta bakari de naku, watashitachi no sono kane o sae tsukai hatashita no desu.
Kami ga watashitachi no chichi kara toriagerareta tomi wa, mina watashitachi to watashitachi no kodomo no mono desu. Dakara nanigoto de mo kami ga anata ni otsuge ni natta koto o shite kudasai".
Soko de Yakobu wa tatte, kora to tsumatachi o rakuda ni nose,
Mata subete no kachiku, sunawachi kare ga Padanaramu de eta kachiku to, subete no zaisan o tazusaete, Kanan no chi ni oru chichi Isaku no moto e omomuita.
Sono toki Raban wa hitsuji no ke o kiru tame ni dete ita no de, Rakeru wa chichi no shoyuu no terapimu o nusumidashita.
Mata Yakobu wa Aramu bito Raban o azamuki, jibun no nigesaru no o kare ni tsugenakatta.
Kou shite kare wa subete no mochimono o tazusaete nige, tatte kawa o watari, Gireade no sanchi e mukatta.
Mikkame ni natte, Yakobu no nigesatta koto ga, Raban ni kikoeta no de,
Kare wa ichizoku o hikiite, nanuka no aida sono ato o oi, Gireade no sanchi de oitsuita.
Shikashi, kami wa yo no yume ni Aramu bito Raban ni arawarete iwareta, "Anata wa kokoro shite Yakobu ni, yoshiashi o itte wa narimasen".
Raban wa tsuini Yakobu ni oitsuitaga, Yakobu ga yama ni tenmaku o hatte ita no de, Raban mo ichizoku to tomo ni Gireade no yama ni tenmaku o hatta.
Raban wa Yakobu ni itta, "Anata wa nan to iu koto o shita no desu ka. Anata wa watashi o azamuite watashi no musumetachi o ikusa no toriko no you ni hiite ikimashita.
Naze anata wa watashi ni tsugezu ni, hisoka ni nigesatte watashi o azamuita no desu ka. Watashi wa te tsuzumi ya koto de yorokobiutatte anata o okuridasou to shite ita no ni.
Naze watashi no mago ya musume ni watashi ga kuchizuke suru no o yurusanakatta no desu ka. Anata wa oroka na koto o shimashita.
Watashi wa anata gata ni gai o kuwaeru chikara o motte iruga, anata gata no chichi no kami ga sakuya watashi ni tsugete, 'Omae wa kokoro shite, Yakobu ni yoshiashi o iu na' to iwaremashita.
Ima anata ga nigedashita no wa chichi no ie ga hijou ni koishiku nattakara deshouga, naze anata wa watashi no kami o nusunda no desu ka".
Yakobu wa Raban ni kotaeta, "Tabun anata ga musumetachi o watashi kara ubaitorudarou to omotte watashi wa osoretakara desu.
Dare no tokoro ni de mo anata no kami ga mitsukattara, sono mono o ikashite wa okimasen. Nani ka anata no mono ga watashi no tokoro ni aru ka, wareware no ichizoku no mae de, shirabete mite, sore o otori kudasai". Rakeru ga kami o nusunda koto o Yakobu wa shiranakattakara de aru.
Soko de Raban wa Yakobu no tenmaku ni hairi, mata Rea no tenmaku ni hairi, sarani futari no hashi tame no tenmaku ni haitte mitaga, mitsukaranakatta no de, Rea no tenmaku o dete Rakeru no tenmaku ni haitta.
Shikashi, Rakeru wa sudeni terapimu o totte, rakuda no kura no shita ni ire, sono ue ni suwatte ita no de, Raban wa, kumanaku tenmaku no naka o sagashitaga, mitsukaranakatta.
Sono toki Rakeru wa chichi ni itta, "Watashi wa onna no tsune no koto ga atte, anata no mae ni tachiagaru koto ga dekimasen. Waga Shu yo, dou ka oikari ni naranu you". Kare wa sagashitaga Terapimu wa mitsukaranakatta.
Soko de Yakobu wa ikatte Raban o semeta. Soshite Yakobu wa Raban ni itta, "Watashi ni donna ayamachi ga ari, donna tsumi ga atte, anata wa watashi no ato o hageshiku otta no desu ka.
Anata wa watashi no mono o kotogotoku saguraretaga, nani ka anata no ie no mono ga mitsukarimashita ka. Sore o, koko ni, watashi no ichizoku to, anata no ichizoku no mae ni oite, wareware futari no aida o sabakasemashou.
Watashi wa kono nijuu nen, anata to issho ni imashitaga, sono kan anata no mehitsuji mo me yagi mo ko o umi sokoneta koto wa naku, mata watashi wa anata no mure no ohitsuji o tabeta koto mo arimasendeshita.
Mata yajuu ga, kami saita mono wa, anata no moto ni motte konaide, jibun de sore o tsugunaimashita. Mata hiru nusumareta mono mo, yoru nusumareta mono mo, anata wa watashi ni sono tsugunai o motomeraremashita.
Watashi no koto o ieba, hiru wa atsusa ni, yoru wa samusa ni nayamasarete, nemuru koto mo dekimasendeshita.
Watashi wa kono nijuu nen anata no kazoku no hitori de arimashita. Watashi wa anata no futari no musume no tame ni juu yon nen, mata anata no mure no tame ni roku nen, anata ni tsukaemashitaga, anata wa juu do mo watashi no houshuu o kaeraremashita.
Moshi, watashi no chichi no kami, Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kashikomu mono ga watashi to tomo ni orarenakattanara, anata wa kitto watashi o, kara te de sarasetadeshou. Kami wa watashi no nayami to, watashi no rouku to o kaerimirarete sakuya anata o imashimerareta no desu".
Raban wa kotaete Yakobu ni itta, "Musumetachi wa watashi no musume, kodomotachi wa watashi no mago desu. Mata mure wa watashi no mure, anata no miru mono wa mina watashi no mono desu. Korera no watashi no musumetachi no tame, mata karera ga unda kodomotachi no tame, kyou watashi wa nani o suru koto ga dekimashou ka.
Saa, sore de wa watashi to anata to keiyaku o musunde, kore o watashi to anata to no aida no shouko to shimashou".
Soko de Yakobu wa ishi o tori, sore o tatete hashira to shita.
Yakobu wa mata ichizoku no mono ni itta, "Ishi o atsumete kudasai". Karera wa ishi o totte, hitotsu no ishizuka o tsukutta. Kou shite karera wa sono ishizuka no katawara de shokuji o shita.
Raban wa kore o egaru sahadota to nazuke, Yakobu wa kore o Garuedo to nazuketa.
Soshite Raban wa itta, "Kono ishizuka wa kyou watashi to anata to no aida no shouko to narimasu". Sore de sono na wa Garuedo to yobareta.
Mata Mizupa to mo yobareta. Kare ga kou ittakara de aru, "Wareware ga tagai ni wakareta nochi mo, dou ka Shu ga watashi to anata to no aida o mimamorareru you ni.
Moshi anata ga watashi no musume o gyakutai shi tari, watashi no musume no hoka ni tsuma o metoru koto ga areba, tatoi soko ni dare hitori inakute mo, kami wa watashi to anata to no aida no shounin de iraserareru".
Sarani Raban wa Yakobu ni itta, "Anata to watashi to no aida ni watashi ga tateta kono ishizuka o goran nasai, kono hashira o goran nasai.
Kono ishizuka o koete watashi ga anata ni gai o kuwaezu, mata kono ishizuka to kono hashira o koete anata ga watashi ni gai o kuwaenai you ni, dou ka kono ishizuka ga akashi to nari, kono hashira ga akashi to naru you ni.
Dou ka Aburahamu no kami, Nahoru no kami, karera no chichi no kami ga wareware no aida o sabakareru you ni". Yakobu wa chichi Isaku no kashikomu mono ni yotte chikatta.
Soshite Yakobu wa yama de gisei o sasage, ichizoku o maneite, shokuji o shita. Karera wa shokuji o shite yama ni yadotta.
Akuru asa Raban wa hayaku oki, mago to musumetachi ni kuchizuke shite karera o shukufuku shi, satte ie ni kaetta.
Sate, Yakobu ga tabiji ni susunda toki, kami no tsukaitachi ga kare ni atta.
Yakobu wa karera o mite, "Kore wa kami no jin'ei desu" to itte, sono tokoro no na o Mahanaimu to nazuketa.
Yakobu wa Seiru no chi, Edomu no no ni sumu ani Esau no moto ni, sakidatte shisha o tsukawashita.
Sunawachi sore ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa watashi no shujin Esau ni kou ii nasai, 'Anata no shimobe Yakobu wa kou iimashita. Watashi wa Raban no moto ni kiryuu shite ima made todomarimashita.
Watashi wa ushi, roba, hitsuji, danjo no dorei o motte imasu. Sore de waga Shu ni moushiagete, anata no mae ni megumi o eyou to hito o tsukawashita no desu' ".
Shisha wa Yakobu no moto ni kaette itta, "Watashitachi wa anata no ani Esau no moto e ikimashita. Kare mo mata anata o mukaeyou to yonhyakunin o hikiite kimasu".
Soko de Yakobu wa ooini osore, kurushimi, tomo ni iru tami oyobi hitsuji, ushi, rakuda o futatsu no kumi ni wakete,
Itta, "Tatoi, Esau ga kite, hitotsu no kumi o utte mo, nokori no kumi wa nogareru de arou".
Yakobu wa mata itta, "Chichi Aburahamu no kami, chichi Isaku no kami yo, katsute watashi ni 'Omae no kuni e kaeri, omae no shinzoku ni ike. Watashi wa omae o megumou' to iwareta Shu yo,
Anata ga shimobe ni hodokosareta subete no megumi to makoto o watashi wa ukeru ni tarinai mono desu. Watashi wa, tsue no hoka nani mo motanaide kono Yorudan o watarimashitaga, ima wa futatsu no kumi ni mo narimashita.
Douzo, ani Esau no te kara watashi o osukui kudasai. Watashi wa kare ga kite, watashi o uchi, haha ya kodomotachi ni made oyobu no o osoremasu.
Anata wa, katsute, 'Watashi wa kanarazu omae o megumi, omae no shison o umi no suna no kazoegatai hodo ooku shiyou' to iwaremashita".
Kare wa sono yo soko ni yadori, mochimono no uchi kara ani Esau e no okurimono o eranda.
Sunawachi me yagi nihyaku, o yagi nijuu, mehitsuji nihyaku, ohitsuji nijuu,
Chichirakuda sanjuu to sono ko, meushi yonjuu, oushi juu, me roba nijuu, o roba juu.
Kare wa korera o sorezore no mure ni wakete, shimobetachi no te ni watashi, shimobetachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi no saki ni susumi nasai, soshite mure to mure to no aida ni wa hedatari o oki nasai".
Mata sentou no mono ni meijite itta, "Moshi, ani Esau ga anata ni atte 'Dare no shimobe de, doko e iku no ka. Anata no mae ni aru korera no mono wa dare no mono ka' to tazunetara,
'Anata no shimobe Yakobu no mono de, waga Shu Esau ni okuru okurimono desu. Kare mo watashitachi no ushiro ni orimasu' to ii nasai".
Kare wa daini no mono ni mo, daisan no mono ni mo, mata mure mure ni tsuite iku subete no mono ni mo meijite itta, "Anata gata ga Esau ni au toki wa, onaji you ni kare ni tsugete,
'Anata no shimobe Yakobu mo wareware no ushiro ni orimasu' to ii nasai". Yakobu wa, "Watashi ga saki ni okuru okurimono o motte mazu kare o nadame, sore kara, kare no kao o miyou. Sou sureba, kare wa watashi o mukaete kurerude arou" to omottakara de aru.
Kou shite okurimono wa kare ni sakidatte watari, kare wa sono yo, shukuei ni yadotta.
Kare wa sono yo okite, futari no tsuma to futari no tsukaeme to juu ichinin no kodomo to o tsurete Yaboku no watashi o watatta.
Sunawachi karera o michibiite kawa o watarase, mata kare no mochimono o wataraseta.
Yakobu wa hitori ato ni nokottaga, hitori no hito ga, yoake made kare to kumiuchi shita.
Tokoro de sono hito wa Yakobu ni katenai no o mite, Yakobu no momo no tsugai ni sawatta no de, Yakobu no momo no tsugai ga, sono hito to kumiuchi suru aida ni hazureta.
Sono hito wa itta, "Yo ga akerukara watashi o sarasete kudasai". Yakobu wa kotaeta, "Watashi o shukufuku shite kudasaranainara, anata o sarasemasen".
Sono hito wa kare ni itta, "Anata no na wa nan to iimasu ka". Kare wa kotaeta, "Yakobu desu".
Sono hito wa itta, "Anata wa mohaya na o Yakobu to iwazu, Isuraeru to ii nasai. Anata ga kami to hito to ni, chikara o arasotte kattakara desu".
Yakobu wa tazunete itta, "Dou ka watashi ni anata no na o shirasete kudasai". Suruto sono hito wa, "Naze anata wa watashi no na o kiku no desu ka" to ittaga, sono tokoro de kare o shukufuku shita.
Soko de Yakobu wa sono tokoro no na o Penieru to nazukete itta, "Watashi wa kao to kao o awasete kami o mitaga, nao ikite iru".
Kou shite kare ga Penieru o sugiru toki, hi wa kare no ue ni nobottaga, kare wa sono momo no yue ni bikko o hiite ita.
Sono tame, Isuraeru no kora wa konnichi made, momo no tsugai no ue ni aru koshi no suji o tabenai. Kano hito ga Yakobu no momo no tsugai, sunawachi koshi no suji ni sawattakara de aru.
Sate Yakobu wa me o age, Esau ga yonhyakunin o hikiite kuru no o mita. Soko de kare wa kodomotachi o wakete Rea to Rakeru to futari no tsukaeme to ni watashi,
Tsukaeme to sono kotomotachi o massaki ni oki, Rea to sono kotomotachi o tsugi ni oki, Rakeru to Yosefu o saigo ni oite,
Mizukara karera no mae ni susumi, nana tabi mi o chi ni kagamete, ani ni chikazuita.
Suruto Esau wa hashitte kite mukae, kare o daki, sono kubi o kakaete kuchizuke shi, tomo ni naita.
Esau wa me o agete onna to kodomotachi o mite itta, "Anata to issho ni iru korera no mono wa dare desu ka". Yakobu wa itta, "Kami ga shimobe ni sazukerareta kodomotachi desu".
Soko de tsukaemetachi wa sono kotomotachi to tomo ni chikayotte ojigi shita.
Rea mo mata sono kotomotachi to tomo ni chikayotte ojigi shi, sore kara Yosefu to Rakeru ga chikayotte ojigi shita.
Suruto Esau wa itta, "Watashi ga deatta ano subete no mure wa dou shita no desu ka". Yakobu wa itta, "Waga Shu no mae ni megumi o eru tame desu".
Esau wa itta, "Otouto yo, watashi wa juubun motte iru. Anata no mono wa anata no mono ni shi nasai".
Yakobu wa itta, "Iie, moshi watashi ga anata no mae ni megumi o erunara, dou ka, watashi no te kara okurimono o ukete kudasai. Anata ga yorokonde watashi o mukaete kudasaru no de, anata no kao o mite, kami no kao o miru you ni omoimasu.
Dou ka watashi ga motte kita okurimono o ukete kudasai. Kami ga watashi o megumareta no de, watashi wa juubun motte imasukara". Kou shite kare ga shi ita no de, kare wa uketotta.
Soshite Esau wa itta, "Saa, tatte ikou. Watashi ga saki ni iku".
Yakobu wa kare ni itta, "Gozonji no you ni, kodomotachi wa, kayowaku, mata chichi o nomasete iru hitsuji ya ushi o watashi ga sewa o shite imasu. Moshi tsuitachi de mo arukase sugitara mure wa mina shinde shimaimasu.
Waga Shu yo, dou ka, shimobe no saki ni oide kudasai. Watashi wa watashi no mae ni iru kachiku to kodomotachi no ayumi ni awasete, yukkuri aruite iki, Seiru de waga Shu to issho ni narimashou".
Esau wa itta, "Sore nara watashi ga tsurete iru monodomo no uchi ikuhito ka o anata no moto ni nokoshimashou". Yakobu wa itta, "Iie, sore ni wa oyobimasen. Waga Shu no mae ni megumi o esasete kudasai".
Sono hi Esau wa Seiru e no kito ni tsuita.
Yakobu wa tatte Sukote ni iki, jibun no tame ni ie o tate, mata kachiku no tame ni koya o tsukutta. Kore ni yotte sono tokoro no na wa Sukote to yobarete iru.
Kou shite Yakobu wa Padanaramu kara kite, buji Kanan no chi no Shikemu no machi ni tsuki, machi no mae ni shukuei shita.
Kare wa tenmaku o hatta no no ichibu o Shikemu no chichi Hamoru no kora no te kara hyaku Keshita de kaitori,
Soko ni saidan o tatete, kore o Eru Eroe Isuraeru to nazuketa.
Rea ga Yakobu ni unda musume Dena wa sono chi no onnatachi ni aou to dekakete ittaga,
Sono chi no tsukasa, Hibi bi to Hamoru no ko Shikemu ga kanojo o mite, hikiire, kore to nete hazukashimeta.
Kare wa fukaku Yakobu no musume Dena o shitai, kono musume o aishite, nengoro ni musume ni katatta.
Shikemu wa chichi Hamoru ni itta, "Kono musume o watashi no tsuma ni metotte kudasai".
Sate Yakobu wa Shikemu ga, musume Dena o kegashita koto o kiitakeredo mo, sono kora ga kachiku o tsurete no ni ita no de, karera no kaeru made damatte ita.
Shikemu no chichi Hamoru wa Yakobu to hanashiaouto, Yakobu no tokoro ni dete kita.
Yakobu no kora wa no kara kaeri, kono koto o kiite, kanashimi, katsu hijou ni ikatta. Shikemu ga Yakobu no musume to nete, Isuraeru ni oroka na koto o shita tame de, konna koto wa, shite wa naranu koto dakara de aru.
Hamoru wa karera to katatte itta, "Watashi no ko Shikemu wa anata gata no musume o kokoro ni shitatte imasu. Dou ka kanojo o kare no tsuma ni kudasai.
Anata gata wa watashitachi to kon'in shi, anata gata no musume o watashitachi ni atae, watashitachi no musume o anata gata ni metotte kudasai.
Kou shite anata gata to watashitachi to wa issho ni sumimashou. Chi wa anata gata no mae ni arimasu. Koko ni sunde torihiki shi, koko de zaisan o e nasai".
Shikemu wa mata Dena no chichi to kyoudaitachi to ni itta, "Anata gata no mae ni megumi o esasete kudasai. Anata gata ga watashi ni iwareru mono wa, nan de mo sashiagemashou.
Takusan no yuinou kin to okurimono to o omotome ni natte mo, anata gata no iwareru toori sashiagemasu. Tada kono musume wa watashi no tsuma ni kudasai".
Shikashi, Yakobu no kora wa Shikemu ga karera no imouto Dena o kegashita no de, Shikemu to sono chichi Hamoru ni itsuwatte kotae,
Karera ni itta, "Wareware wa katsurei o ukenai mono ni imouto o yaru koto wa dekimasen. Sore wa wareware no haji to suru tokoro desukara.
Tada, kou nasareba wareware wa anata gata ni doui shimasu. Moshi anata gata no uchi danshi ga mina katsurei o ukete, wareware no you ni narunara,
Wareware no musume o anata gata ni atae, anata gata no musume o wareware ni metorimashou. Soshite wareware wa anata gata to issho ni sunde hitotsu no tami to narimashou.
Keredo mo, moshi anata gata ga wareware ni kikazu, katsurei o ukenainara, wareware wa musume o tsurete ikimasu".
Karera no kotoba ga Hamoru to Hamoru no ko Shikemu to no kokoro ni kanatta no de,
Wakamono wa, tamerawazu ni kono koto o shita. Kare ga Yakobu no musume o aishitakara de aru. Mata kare wa chichi no ie no uchi de ichiban omonjirareta mono de atta.
Soko de Hamoru to sono ko Shikemu to wa machi no mon ni iki, machi no hitobito ni katatte itta,
"Kono hitobito wa wareware to shitashiikara, kono chi ni sumawasete, koko de torihiki o saseyou. Chi wa hiroku, karera o ireru ni juubun de aru. Soshite wareware wa karera no musume o tsuma ni metori, wareware no musume o karera ni ataeyou.
Karera ga katsurei o ukete iru you ni, moshi wareware no uchi no danshi ga mina, katsurei o ukerunara, tada kono koto dake de, kono hitobito wa wareware ni doui shi, wareware to issho ni sunde hitotsu no tami to naru no da.
Sou sureba karera no kachiku to zaisan to subete no kemono to wa, wareware no mono to narude wa nai ka. Tada wareware ga karera ni doui sureba, karera wa wareware to issho ni sumude arou".
Soko de machi no mon ni deiri suru mono wa mina Hamoru to sono ko Shikemu to ni kikishitagatte, machi no mon ni deiri suru subete no danshi wa katsurei o uketa.
Mikkame ni natte karera ga itami o oboete iru toki, Yakobu no futari no ko, sunawachi Dena no kyoudai Shimeon to Rebi to wa, onoono tsurugi o totte, fui ni machi o osoi, danshi o kotogotoku koroshi,
Mata tsurugi no ha ni kakete Hamoru to sono ko Shikemu to o koroshi, Shikemu no ie kara Dena o tsuredashita.
Soshite Yakobu no kora wa korosareta hitobito o hagi, machi o kasumeta. Karera ga imouto o kegashitakara de aru.
Sunawachi hitsuji, ushi, roba oyobi machi ni aru mono to, no ni aru mono,
Narabi ni subete no kazai o ubai, sono koonna to tsumatachi o mina toriko ni shi, ie no naka ni aru mono o kotogotoku kasumeta.
Soko de Yakobu wa Shimeon to Rebi to ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi o kono chi no juumin, Kanan bito to Periji bito ni imikirawase, watashi ni meiwaku o kaketa. Watashi wa, ninzuu ga sukunaikara, karera ga atsumatte watashi o seme utsunaraba, watashi mo kazoku mo horobosarerude arou".
Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi no imouto o yuujo no you ni kare ga atsukatte yoi no desu ka".
Toki ni kami wa Yakobu ni iwareta, "Anata wa tatte Beteru ni nobori, soko ni sunde, anata ga saki ni ani Esau no kao o sakete nogareru toki, anata ni arawareta kami ni saidan o tsukuri nasai".
Yakobu wa, sono kazoku oyobi tomo ni iru subete no mono ni itta, "Anata gata no uchi ni aru kotonaru kamigami o sute, mi o kiyomete kimono o kigae nasai.
Wareware wa tatte Beteru ni nobori, sono tokoro de watashi no kunan no hi ni watashi ni kotae, katsu watashi no iku michi de tomo ni orareta kami ni saidan o tsukurou".
Soko de karera wa motte iru kotonaru kamigami to, mimi ni tsukete iru mimiwa o kotogotoku Yakobu ni ataeta no de, Yakobu wa kore o Shikemu no hotori ni aru Terebin no ki no shita ni umeta.
Soshite karera wa, idetattaga, ooinaru osore ga shuui no machimachi ni tatta no de, Yakobu no kora no ato o ou mono wa nakatta.
Kou shite Yakobu wa tomo ni ita subete no hitobito to issho ni Kanan no chi ni aru Ruzu, sunawachi Beteru ni kita.
Kare wa soko ni saidan o kizuki, sono tokoro o Eru Beteru to nazuketa. Kare ga ani no kao o sakete nogareru toki, kami ga soko de kare ni arawaretakara de aru.
Toki ni Ribeka no uba Debora ga shinde, Beteru no shi mono, kashi no ki no shita ni houmurareta. Kore ni yotte sono ki no na o Aron Bakute to yobareta.
Sate Yakobu ga Padanaramu kara kaette kita toki, kami wa futatabi kare ni arawarete kare o shukufuku sareta.
Kami wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata no na wa Yakobu de aru. Shikashi anata no na o mohaya Yakobu to yonde wa naranai. Anata no na o Isuraeru to shi nasai". Kou shite kare o Isuraeru to nazukerareta.
Kami wa mata kare ni iwareta, "Watashi wa zennou no kami de aru. Anata wa umeyo, mata fue yo. Hitotsu no kokumin, mata ooku no kokumin ga anata kara dete, outachi ga anata no mi kara derude arou.
Watashi wa Aburahamu to Isaku to ni ataeta chi o, anata ni ataeyou. Mata anata no nochi no shison ni sono chi o ataeyou".
Kami wa kare to katatte orareta sono basho kara kare o hanarete noborareta.
Soko de Yakobu wa kami ga jibun to katarareta sono basho ni, ichipon no ishi no hashira o tate, sono ue ni kansai o sasage, mata abura o sosoida.
Soshite Yakobu wa kami ga jibun to katarareta sono basho o Beteru to nazuketa.
Kou shite karera wa Beteru o tattaga, Efurata ni ikitsuku made ni, nao hedatari no aru tokoro de Rakeru wa sankezuki, sono san wa omokatta.
Sono nanzan ni atatte, sanba wa kanojo ni itta, "Shinpai suru koto wa arimasen. Kondo mo otokonoko desu".
Kanojo wa shi ni nozomi, tamashii no sarou to suru toki, ko no na o Benoni to yonda. Shikashi, chichi wa kore o Beniyamin to nazuketa.
Rakeru wa shinde Efurata, sunawachi Betsurehemu no michi ni houmurareta.
Yakobu wa sono haka ni hashira o tateta. Kore wa Rakeru no haka no hashira de atte, konnichi ni itatte iru.
Isuraeru wa mata, idetatte migudaru edaru no mukou ni tenmaku o hatta.
Isuraeru ga sono chi ni sunde ita toki, Ruben wa chichi no sobame Biruha no tokoro e itte, kore to neta. Isuraeru wa kore o kiita. Sate Yakobu no kora wa juu ninin de atta.
Sunawachi Rea no kora wa Yakobu no choushi Ruben to Shimeon, Rebi, Yuda, Issakaru, Zeburun.
Rakeru no kora wa Yosefu to Beniyamin.
Rakeru no tsukaeme Biruha no kora wa Dan to Nafutari.
Rea no tsukaeme Jirupa no kora wa Gado to Aseru. Korera wa Yakobu no kora de atte, Padanaramu de kare ni umareta mono de aru.
Yakobu wa kiriate aruba, sunawachi Heburon no Mamure ni iru chichi Isaku no moto e itta. Koko wa Aburahamu to Isaku to ga kiryuu shita tokoro de aru.
Isaku no toshi wa hyaku hachijuusai de atta.
Isaku wa toshioi, hi michite iki tae, shinde, sono tami ni kuwaerareta. Sono ko Esau to Yakobu to wa, kore o houmutta.
Esau, sunawachi Edomu no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Esau wa Kanan no musumetachi no uchi kara tsuma o metotta. Sunawachi Hete bito Eron no musume Ada to, Hibi bito Jibeon no ko Ana no musume Ahoribama to de aru.
Mata, Ishimaeru no musume Nebayote no imouto Basumate o metotta.
Ada wa Eripazu o Esau ni umi, Basumate wa Riueru o umi,
Ahoribama wa Eushi, Yaramu, Kora o unda. Korera wa Esau no ko de atte, Kanan no chi de kare ni umareta mono de aru.
Esau wa tsuma to ko to musume to ie no subete no hito, kachiku to subete no kemono, mata Kanan no chi de eta subete no zaisan o tazusae, kyoudai Yakobu o hanarete hoka no chi e itta.
Karera no zaisan ga ookute, issho ni iru koto ga dekinakattakara de aru. Sunawachi karera ga kiryuu shita chi wa karera no kachiku no yue ni, karera o sasaeru koto ga dekinakatta no de aru.
Kou shite Esau wa Seiru no sanchi ni sunda. Esau wa sunawachi Edomu de aru.
Seiru no sanchi ni otta Edomu bito no senzo Esau no keizu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Esau no kora no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Esau no tsuma Ada no ko wa Eripazu. Esau no tsuma Basumate no ko wa Riueru.
Eripazu no kora wa Teman, Omaru, Zepo, Gatamu, Kenazu de aru.
Temuna wa Esau no ko Eripazu no sobame de, Amareku o Eripazu ni unda. Korera wa Esau no tsuma Ada no kora de aru.
Riueru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Nahate, Zera, Shanma, Miza de atte, korera wa Esau no tsuma Basumate no kora de aru.
Jibeon no ko Ana no musume de, Esau no tsuma Ahoribama no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi kanojo wa Eushi, Yaramu, Kora o Esau ni unda.
Esau no kora no naka de, zokuchou taru mono wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Esau no choushi Eripazu no kora wa Teman no zokuchou, Omaru no zokuchou, Zepo no zokuchou, Kenazu no zokuchou,
Kora no zokuchou, Gatamu no zokuchou, Amareku no zokuchou de aru. Korera wa Eripazu kara deta zokuchou de, Edomu no chi ni otta. Korera wa Ada no kora de aru.
Esau no ko Riueru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Nahate no zokuchou, Zera no zokuchou, Shanma no zokuchou, Miza no zokuchou. Korera wa Riueru kara deta zokuchou de, Edomu no chi ni otta. Korera wa Esau no tsuma Basumate no kora de aru.
Esau no tsuma Ahoribama no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Eushi no zokuchou, Yaramu no zokuchou, Kora no zokuchou. Korera wa Ana no musume de, Esau no tsuma Ahoribama kara deta zokuchou de aru.
Korera wa Esau sunawachi Edomu no kora de, zokuchou taru mono de aru.
Kono chi no juumin Hori bi to Seiru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Rotan, Shobaru, Jibeon, Ana,
Deshon, Ezeru, Deshan. Korera wa Seiru no ko Hori bito kara deta zokuchou de, Edomu no chi ni otta.
Rotan no kora wa Hori, Hemamu de ari, Rotan no imouto wa Temuna de atta.
Shobaru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Aruwan, manahate, Ebaru, Shipo, Onamu.
Jibeon no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Aya to Ana. Kono Ana wa chichi Jibeon no roba o katte ita toki, arano de onsen o hakken shita mono de aru.
Ana no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Deshon to Ahoribama. Ahoribama wa Ana no musume de aru.
Deshon no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Hemudan, Eshiban, Iteran, Keran.
Ezeru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Biruhan, Zawan, Akan.
Deshan no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Uzu to Aran.
Hori bito kara deta zokuchou wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Rotan no zokuchou, Shobaru no zokuchou, Jibeon no zokuchou, Ana no zokuchou,
Deshon no zokuchou, Ezeru no zokuchou, Deshan no zokuchou. Korera wa Hori bito kara deta zokuchou de atte, sono shizoku ni shitagatte Seiru no chi ni otta mono de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito o osameru ou ga mada nakatta toki, Edomu no chi o osameta outachi wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Beoru no ko Bera wa Edomu o osame, sono miyako no na wa Denaba de atta.
Bera ga shinde, Bozura no Zera no ko Yobabu ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Yobabu ga shinde, Teman bito no chi no Hoshamu ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Hoshamu ga shinde, Bedade no ko Hadade ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta. Kare wa Moabu no no de Midean o utta mono de aru. Sono miyako no na wa Abite de atta.
Hadade ga shinde, Masureka no Samura ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Samura ga shinde Yufurate kawa no hotori ni aru Rehobote no Sauru ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Sauru ga shinde Akuboru no ko Baaru Hanan ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Akuboru no ko Baaru Hanan ga shinde, Hadaru ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta. Sono miyako no na wa Pau de atta. Sono tsuma no na wa Mehetaberu to itte, Mezahabu no musume Materede no musume de atta.
Esau kara deta zokuchou no na wa, sono shizoku to juusho to na ni shitagatte ieba tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Temuna no zokuchou, Aruwa no zokuchou, Etete no zokuchou,
Ahoribama no zokuchou, Era no zokuchou, Pinon no zokuchou,
Kenazu no zokuchou, Teman no zokuchou, Mibuzaru no zokuchou,
Magudeeru no zokuchou, Iramu no zokuchou. Korera wa Edomu no zokuchoutachi de atte, sono ryouchiuchi no juusho ni shitagatte itta mono de aru. Edomu bito no senzo wa Esau de aru.
Yakobu wa chichi no kiryuu no chi, sunawachi Kanan no chi ni sunda.
Yakobu no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Yosefu wa juu nanasai no toki, kyoudaitachi to tomo ni hitsuji no mure o katte ita. Kare wa mada kodomo de, chichi no tsumatachi Biruha to Jirupa to no kora to tomo ni itaga, Yosefu wa karera no warui uwasa o chichi ni tsugeta.
Yosefu wa toshiyori ko de attakara, Isuraeru wa ta no dono ko yori mo kare o aishite, kare no tame ni nagasode no kimono o tsukutta.
Kyoudaitachi wa chichi ga dono kyoudai yori mo kare o aisuru no o mite, kare o nikumi, odayaka ni kare ni kataru koto ga dekinakatta.
Aru toki, Yosefu wa yume o mite, sore o kyoudaitachi ni hanashita no de, karera wa, masumasu kare o nikunda.
Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Douzo watashi ga mita yume o kiite kudasai.
Watashitachi ga hatake no naka de taba o yuwaete ita toki, watashi no taba ga okite tatsuto, anata gata no taba ga mawari ni kite, watashi no taba o ogamimashita".
Suruto kyoudaitachi wa kare ni mukatte, "Anata wa hontou ni watashitachi no ou ni naru no ka. Anata wa jissai watashitachi o osameru no ka" to itte, kare no yume to sono kotoba no yue ni masumasu kare o nikunda.
Yosefu wa mata hitotsu no yume o mite, sore o kyoudaitachi ni katatte itta, "Watashi wa mata yume o mimashita. Hi to tsuki to juu ichi no hoshi to ga watashi o ogamimashita".
Kare wa kore o chichi to kyoudaitachi ni katatta no de, chichi wa kare o togamete itta, "Anata ga mita sono yume wa dou iu no ka. Hontou ni watashi to anata no haha to, kyoudaitachi to ga itte chi ni fushi, anata o ogamu no ka".
Kyoudaitachi wa kare o netanda. Shikashi chichi wa kono kotoba o kokoro ni tometa.
Sate kyoudaitachi ga Shikemu ni itte, chichi no hitsuji no mure o katte ita toki,
Isuraeru wa Yosefu ni itta, "Anata no kyoudaitachi wa Shikemu de hitsuji o katte irude wa nai ka. Saa, anata o karera no tokoro e tsukawasou". Yosefu wa chichi ni itta, "Hai, ikimasu".
Chichi wa kare ni itta, "Dou ka, itte, anata no kyoudaitachi wa buji de aru ka, mata mure wa buji de aru ka mite kite, watashi ni shirasete kudasai". Chichi ga kare o Heburon no tani kara tsukawashita no de, kare wa Shikemu ni itta.
Hitori no hito ga kare ni ai, kare ga no o samayotte ita no de, sono hito wa kare ni tazunete itta, "Anata wa nani o sagashite iru no desu ka".
Kare wa itta, "Kyoudaitachi o sagashite iru no desu. Karera ga, doko de hitsuji o katte iru no ka, douzo watashi ni shirasete kudasai".
Sono hito wa itta, "Karera wa koko o sarimashita. Karera ga 'Dotan e ikou' to iu no o watashi wa kikimashita". Soko de Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi no ato o otte itte, Dotan de karera ni atta.
Yosefu ga karera ni chikazukanai uchi ni, karera wa haruka ni Yosefu o mite, kore o korosou to hakari,
Tagai ni itta, "Ano yumemi ru mono ga yatte kuru.
Saa, kare o koroshite ana ni nageire, warui kemono ga kare o kutta to iou. Soshite kare no yume ga dou naru ka miyou".
Ruben wa kore o kiite, Yosefu o karera no te kara sukuidasou to shite itta, "Wareware wa kare no inochi o totte wa naranai".
Ruben wa mata karera ni itta, "Chi o nagashite wa ikenai. Kare o arano no kono ana ni nageireyou. Kare ni te o kudashite wa naranai". Kore wa Yosefu o karera no te kara sukuidashite chichi ni kaesu tame de atta.
Sate, Yosefu ga kyoudaitachi no moto e ikuto, karera wa Yosefu no kimono, kare ga kite ita nagasode no kimono o hagitori,
Kare o toraete ana ni nageireta. Sono ana wa kara de, sono naka ni mizu wa nakatta.
Kou shite karera wa suwatte pan o tabeta. Toki ni karera ga me o agete miruto, Ishimaeru bito no taishou ga, rakuda ni kouryou to, nyuukou to, motsu yaku to o owasete Ejiputo e kudari ikou to Gireade kara yatte kita.
Soko de Yuda wa kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Wareware ga otouto o koroshi, sono chi o kakushite nani no eki ga arou.
Saa, wareware wa kare o Ishimaeru bito ni urou. Kare wa wareware no kyoudai, wareware no niku mi dakara, kare ni te o kudashite wa naranai". Kyoudaitachi wa kore o kikiireta.
Toki ni Midean bito no shounintachi ga toorikakatta no de, karera wa Yosefu o ana kara hikiage, gin nijuu shikeru de Yosefu o Ishimaeru bito ni utta. Karera wa Yosefu o Ejiputo e tsurete itta.
Sate Ruben wa ana ni kaette mitaga, Yosefu ga ana no naka ni inakatta no de, kare wa ifuku o saki,
Kyoudaitachi no moto ni kaette itta, "Ano ko wa inai. Aa, watashi wa doko e iku koto ga dekiyou".
Karera wa Yosefu no kimono o tori, o yagi o koroshite, kimono o sono chi ni hitashi,
Sono nagasode no kimono o chichi ni mochikaette itta, "Watashitachi wa kore o mitsukemashitaga, kore wa anata no ko no kimono ka, dou ka misadamete kudasai".
Chichi wa kore o misadamete itta, "Waga ko no kimono da. Warui kemono ga kare o kutta no da. Tashika ni Yosefu wa kami sakareta no da".
Soko de Yakobu wa ifuku o saki, aranuno o koshi ni matotte, nagai aida sono ko no tame ni nageita.
Kora to musumera to wa mina tatte kare o nagusameyou to shitaga, kare wa nagusamerareru no o kobande itta, "Iya, watashi wa nagekinagara yomi ni kudatte, waga ko no moto e ikou". Kou shite chichi wa kare no tame ni naita.
Sate, kano Midean bitora wa Ejiputo de Paro no yakunin, jieichou Poteparu ni Yosefu o utta.
Sono koro Yuda wa kyoudaitachi o hanarete kudari, Adoramu bito de, na o Hira to iu mono no tokoro e itta.
Yuda wa sono tokoro de, na o Shua to iu Kanan bito no musume o mite, kore o metori, sono tokoro ni haitta.
Kanojo wa migomotte otokonoko o unda no de, Yuda wa na o Eru to nazuketa.
Kanojo wa futatabi migomotte otokonoko o umi, na o Onan to nazuketa.
Mata kasanete, otokonoko o umi, na o Shira to nazuketa. Kanojo wa kono otokonoko o unda toki, Kujibu ni otta.
Yuda wa choushi Eru no tame ni, na o Tamaru to iu tsuma o mukaeta.
Shikashi Yuda no choushi Eru wa Shu no mae ni warui mono de atta no de, Shu wa kare o korosareta.
Soko de Yuda wa Onan ni itta, "Ani no tsuma no tokoro ni haitte, kanojo o metori, ani ni kodomo o esase nasai".
Shikashi Onan wa sono ko ga jibun no mono to naranai no o shitte ita no de, ani no tsuma no tokoro ni haitta toki, ani ni ko o esasenai tame ni chi ni morashita.
Kare no shita koto wa Shu no mae ni warukatta no de, Shu wa kare o mo korosareta.
Soko de Yuda wa sono ko no tsuma Tamaru ni itta, "Watashi no ko Shira ga seijin suru made, kafu no mama de, anata no chichi no ie ni i nasai". Kare wa, Shira mo mata kyoudaitachi no you ni shinu ka mo shirenaito, omottakara de aru. Sore de Tamaru wa itte chichi no ie ni otta.
Hi ga tatte Shua no musume Yuda no tsuma wa shinda. Sono nochi, Yuda wa mo o owatte sono tomo Adoramu bito Hira to tomo ni Temuna ni nobori, jibun no hitsuji no ke o kiru mono no tokoro e itta.
Toki ni, hitori no hito ga Tamaru ni tsugete, "Anata no shuuto ga hitsuji no ke o kiru tame ni Temuna ni nobotte kuru" to itta no de,
Kanojo wa kafu no ifuku o nugisute, kazuki de mi o ooikakushite, Temuna e iku michi no katawara ni aru Enaimu no iriguchi ni suwatte ita. Kanojo wa Shira ga seijin shita no ni, jibun ga sono tsuma ni sarenai no o shittakara de aru.
Yuda wa kanojo o mita toki, kanojo ga kao o ootte ita tame, yuujo da to omoi,
Michi no katawara de kanojo ni mukatte itta, "Saa, anata no tokoro ni hairasete okure". Kare wa kono onna ga waga ko no tsuma de aru koto o shiranakattakara de aru. Kanojo wa itta, "Watashi no tokoro ni wa iru tame, nani o kudasaimasu ka".
Yuda wa itta, "Mure no uchi no yagi no ko o anata ni ageyou". Kanojo wa itta, "Sore o kudasaru made, shirushi o watashi ni kudasaimasu ka".
Yuda wa itta, "Donna shirushi o ageyou ka". Kanojo wa itta, "Anata no in to himo to, anata no te ni arutsue to o". Kare wa korera o ataete kanojo no tokoro ni haitta. Kanojo wa Yuda ni yotte migomotta.
Kanojo wa okite sari, kazuki o nuide kafu no ifuku o kita.
Yagate Yuda wa sono onna kara shirushi o torimodosou to, sono tomo Adoramu bito ni takushite yagi no ko o okuttakeredo mo, sono onna o miidasenakatta.
Soko de kare wa sono tokoro no hitobito ni tazunete itta, "Enaimu de michi no katawara ni ita yuujo wa doko ni imasu ka". Karera wa itta, "Koko ni wa yuujo wa imasen".
Kare wa Yuda no moto ni kaette itta, "Watashi wa kanojo o miidasemasendeshita. Mata sono tokoro no hitobito wa, 'Koko ni wa yuujo wa inai' to iimashita".
Soko de Yuda wa itta, "Onna ni motasete okou. Watashitachi wa haji o kakuto ikenaikara. Tonikaku, watashi wa kono yagi no ko o okuttaga, anata wa kanojo o miidasenakatta no da".
Tokoro ga san gatsu hodo tatte, hitori no hito ga Yuda ni itta, "Anata no yome Tamaru wa kan'in shimashita. Sono ue, kanojo wa kan'in ni yotte migomorimashita". Yuda wa itta, "Kanojo o hikidashite yaite shimae".
Kanojo wa hikidasareta toki, sono shuuto ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "Watashi wa kore o motte iru hito ni yotte, migomorimashita". Kanojo wa mata itta, "Dou ka, kono in to, himo to, tsue to wa dare no mono ka, misadamete kudasai".
Yuda wa kore o misadamete itta, "Kanojo wa watashi yori mo tadashii. Watashi ga kanojo o waga ko Shira ni ataenakatta tame de aru". Kare wa futatabi kanojo o shiranakatta.
Sate kanojo no shussan no toki ga kitaga, tainai ni wa, futago ga atta.
Shussan no toki ni, hitori no ko ga te o dashita no de, sanba wa, "Kore ga saki ni deta" to ii, hi no ito o totte, sono te ni musunda.
Soshite, sono ko ga te o hikkomeruto, sono otouto ga deta no de, "Dou shite anata wa jibun de yabutte deru no ka" to itta. Kore ni yotte na wa Perezu to yobareta.
Sono nochi, te ni hi no ito no aru ani ga deta no de, na wa Zera to yobareta.
Sate Yosefu wa tsurerarete Ejiputo ni kudattaga, Paro no yakunin de jieichou de atta Ejiputo bito Poteparu wa, kare o soko ni tsure kudatta Ishimaeru bi tora no te kara kaitotta.
Shu ga Yosefu to tomo ni orareta no de, kare wa kouun na mono to nari, sono shujin Ejiputo bito no ie ni otta.
Sono shujin wa Shu ga kare to tomo ni orareru koto to, Shu ga kare no te no suru koto o subete sakaesaserareru no o mita.
Soko de, Yosefu wa kare no mae ni megumi o e, sono soba chikaku tsukaeta. Kare wa Yosefu ni ie o tsukasadorase, mochimono o mina kare no te ni yudaneta.
Kare ga Yosefu ni ie to subete no mochimono o tsukasadoraseta toki kara, Shu wa Yosefu no yue ni sono Ejiputo bito no ie o megumareta no de, Shu no megumi wa kare no ie to hatake to ni aru subete no mochimono ni oyonda.
Soko de kare wa mochimono o mina Yosefu no te ni yudanete, jibun ga taberu mono no hoka wa, nani o mo kaeriminakatta. Sate Yosefu wa sugata ga yoku, kao ga utsukushikatta.
Korera no koto no nochi, shujin no tsuma wa Yosefu ni me o tsukete itta, "Watashi to ne nasai".
Yosefu wa kobande, shujin no tsuma ni itta, "Goshujin wa watashi ga iru no de ie no naka no nani o mo kaerimizu, sono mochimono o mina watashi no te ni yudaneraremashita.
Kono ie ni wa watashi yori mo ooinaru mono wa arimasen. Mata goshujin wa anata o nozoite wa, nani o mo watashi ni kinjiraremasendeshita. Anata ga goshujin no tsuma de arukara desu. Dou shite watashi wa kono ookina aku o okonatte, kami ni tsumi o okasu koto ga dekimashou".
Kanojo wa mainichi Yosefu ni iiyottakeredo mo, Yosefu wa kikiirezu, kanojo to nenakatta. Mata tomo ni inakatta.
Aru hi Yosefu ga tsutome o suru tame ni ie ni haitta toki, ie no mono ga hitori mo soko ni inakatta no de,
Kanojo wa Yosefu no kimono o toraete, "Watashi to ne nasai" to itta. Yosefu wa kimono o kanojo no te ni nokoshite soto ni nogaredeta.
Kanojo wa Yosefu ga kimono o jibun no te ni nokoshite soto ni nogareta no o mite,
Sono ie no monodomo o yobi, karera ni tsugete itta, "Shujin ga watashitachi no tokoro ni tsurete kita Heburu bi to wa, watashitachi ni tawamuremasu. Kare wa watashi to neyou to shite, watashi no tokoro ni haitta no de, watashi wa oogoe de sakebimashita.
Kare wa watashi ga koe o agete sakebu no o kikuto, kimono o watashi no tokoro ni nokoshite soto ni nogaredemashita".
Kanojo wa sono kimono o katawara ni oite, shujin no kaette kuru no o matta.
Soshite kanojo wa tsugi no you ni shujin ni tsugeta, "Anata ga watashitachi ni tsurete korareta Heburu no shimobe wa watashi ni tawamureyou to shite, watashi no tokoro ni haitte kimashita.
Watashi ga koe o agete sakenda no de, kare wa kimono o watashi no tokoro ni nokoshite soto ni nogaremashita".
Shujin wa sono tsuma ga "Anata no shimobe wa, watashi ni konna koto o shita" to tsugeru kotoba o kiite, hageshiku ikatta.
Soshite Yosefu no shujin wa kare o toraete, ou no shuujin o tsunagu gokuya ni nageireta. Kou shite Yosefu wa gokuya no naka ni ottaga,
Shu wa Yosefu to tomo ni orarete kare ni itsukushimi o tare, gokuya ban no megumi o ukesaserareta.
Gokuya ban wa gokuya ni oru subete no shuujin o Yosefu no te ni yudaneta no de, kare wa soko de suru subete no koto o okonatta.
Gokuya ban wa kare no te ni yudaneta koto wa issai kaeriminakatta. Shu ga Yosefu to tomo ni oraretakara de aru. Shu wa kare no nasu koto o sakaesaserareta.
Korera no koto no nochi, Ejiputo ou no kyuuji yaku to ryouri yaku to ga sono shukun Ejiputo ou ni tsumi o okashita.
Paro wa futari no yakunin, sunawachi kyuuji yaku no chou to ryouri yaku no chou ni mukatte ikidoori,
Jieichou no ie no kankinjo, sunawachi Yosefu ga tsunagarete iru gokuya ni ireta.
Jieichou wa Yosefu ni meijite karera to tomo ni oraseta no de, Yosefu wa karera ni tsukaeta. Kou shite karera wa kankinjo de ikunichi ka o sugoshita.
Sate gokuya ni tsunagareta Ejiputo ou no kyuuji yaku to ryouri yaku no futari wa ichiya no uchi ni sorezore imi no aru yume o mita.
Yosefu ga asa, karera no tokoro e itte miruto, karera wa kanashimi ni shizunde ita.
Soko de Yosefu wa jibun to issho ni shujin no ie no kankinjo ni iru Paro no yakunintachi ni tazunete itta, "Dou shite, kyou, anata gata no kaoiro ga warui no desu ka".
Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi wa yume o mimashitaga, toite kureru mono ga imasen". Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Toku koto wa kami ni yoru no de wa arimasen ka. Douzo, watashi ni hanashite kudasai".
Kyuuji yaku no chou wa sono yume o Yosefu ni hanashite itta, "Watashi ga mita yume de, watashi no mae ni ichipon no budou no ki ga arimashita.
Sono budou no ki ni mittsu no eda ga atte, me o dashi, hana ga saki, budou no fusa ga jukushimashita.
Toki ni watashi no te ni, Paro no sakazuki ga atte, watashi wa sono budou o tori, sore o Paro no sakazuki ni shibori, sono sakazuki o Paro no te ni sasagemashita".
Yosefu wa itta, "Sono tokiakashi wa kou desu. Mittsu no eda wa mikka desu.
Ima kara mikka no uchi ni Paro wa anata no atama o agete, anata o moto no yakume ni kaesudeshou. Anata wa saki ni kyuuji yaku datta toki ni sareta you ni, Paro no te ni sakazuki o sasagerarerudeshou.
Sore de, anata ga shiawase ni nararetara, watashi o oboete ite, dou ka watashi ni megumi o hodokoshi, watashi no koto o Paro ni hanashite, kono ie kara watashi o dashite kudasai.
Watashi wa, mi wa Heburu bito no chi kara sarawarete kita mono desu. Mata koko de mo watashi wa chika no gokuya ni irerareru you na koto wa shinakatta no desu".
Ryouri yaku no chou wa sono tokiakashi no yokatta no o mite, Yosefu ni itta, "Watashi mo yume o mitaga, shiroi pan no kago ga mittsu, watashi no atama no ue ni atta.
Ichiban ue no kago ni wa ryouri yaku ga Paro no tame ni tsukutta samazama no shokumotsu ga attaga, tori ga watashi no atama no ue no kago kara sore o tabete ita".
Yosefu wa kotaete itta, "Sono tokiakashi wa kou desu. Mittsu no kago wa mikka desu.
Ima kara mikka no uchi ni Paro wa anata no atama o age hanashite, anata o ki ni kakerudeshou. Soshite tori ga anata no niku o kui torudeshou".
Sate mikkame wa Paro no tanjou hi de atta no de, Paro wa subete no kerai no tame ni furumai o mouke, kerai no uchi no kyuuji yaku no chou no atama to, ryouri yaku no chou no atama o ageta.
Sunawachi Paro wa kyuuji yaku no chou o kyuuji yaku no shoku ni kaeshita no de, kare wa Paro no te ni sakazuki o sasageta.
Shikashi Paro wa ryouri yaku no chou o ki ni kaketa. Yosefu ga karera ni tokiakashita toori de aru.
Tokoro ga, kyuuji yaku no chou wa Yosefu o omoidasazu, wasurete shimatta.
Ni nen no nochi Paro wa yume o mita. Yume ni, kare wa Nairu kawa no hotori ni tatte ita.
Suruto, sono kawa kara utsukushii, koefutotta nanatou no meushi ga agatte kite ashi o kutte ita.
Sono nochi, mata minikui, yasehosotta ta no nanatou no meushi ga kawa kara agatte kite, kawa no kishi ni ita meushi no soba ni tachi,
Sono minikui, yasehosotta meushi ga, ano utsukushii, koeta nanatou no meushi o kuitsuku shita. Koko de Paro wa me ga sameta.
Kare wa mata nemutte, futatabi yume o mita. Yume ni, ichipon no kuki ni futotta yoi nanatsu no ho ga dete kita.
Sono nochi mata, yasete, higashikaze ni yaketa nanatsu no ho ga dete kite,
Sono yaseta ho ga, ano futotte minotta nanatsu no ho o nomi tsukushita. Koko de Paro wa me ga sametaga, sore wa yume de atta.
Asa ni natte, Paro wa kokoro ga sawagi, hito o tsukawashite, Ejiputo no subete no majutsushi to subete no chisha to o yobiyose, karera ni yume o tsugetaga, kore o Paro ni tokiakashi uru mono ga nakatta.
Sono toki kyuuji yaku no chou wa Paro ni tsugete itta, "Watashi wa kyou, jibun no ayamachi o omoidashimashita.
Katsute Paro ga shimobera ni mukatte ikidoori, watashi to ryouri yaku no chou to o jieichou no ie no kankinjo ni oire ni natta toki,
Watashi mo kare mo ichiya no uchi ni yume o mi, sorezore imi no aru yume o mimashitaga,
Soko ni jieichou no shimobe de, hitori no wakai Heburu bito ga wareware to tomo ni ita no de, kare ni hanashita tokoro, kare wa wareware no yume o tokiakashi, sono yume ni yotte, sorezore tokiakashi o shimashita.
Soshite kare ga tokiakashita toori ni natte, Paro wa watashi o shoku ni kaeshi, kare o ki ni kakeraremashita".
Soko de Paro wa hito o tsukawashite Yosefu o yonda. Hitobito wa isoide kare o chika no gokuya kara dashita. Yosefu wa, hige o sori, kimono o kigaete Paro no moto ni itta.
Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Watashi wa yume o mitaga, kore o tokiakasu mono ga nai. Kiku tokoro ni yoruto, anata wa yume o kiite, tokiakashiga dekiru sou da".
Yosefu wa Paro ni kotaete itta, "Iie, watashi de wa arimasen. Kami ga Paro ni heian o otsuge ni narimashou".
Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Yume ni watashi wa kawa no kishi ni tatte ita.
Sono kawa kara koefutotta, utsukushii nanatou no meushi ga agatte kite ashi o kutte ita.
Sono nochi, yowaku, hijou ni minikui, yasehosotta ta no nanatou no meushi ga mata uegatte kita. Watashi wa Ejiputo zenkoku de, kono you na minikui mono o mada mita koto ga nai.
Tokoro ga sono yaseta minikui meushi ga, hajime no nanatou no koeta meushi o kuitsuku shitaga,
Hara ni haitte mo, hara ni haitta koto ga shirezu, yahari hajime no you ni minikukatta. Koko de watashi wa me ga sameta.
Watashi wa mata yume o mita. Ichipon no kuki ni nanatsu no mitta yoi ho ga dete kita.
Sono nochi, yaseotoroete, higashikaze ni yaketa nanatsu no ho ga dete kitaga,
Sono yaseta ho ga, ano nanatsu no yoi ho o nomi tsukushita. Watashi wa majutsushi ni hanashitaga, watashi ni sono wake o shimeshi uru mono wa nakatta".
Yosefu wa Paro ni itta, "Paro no yume wa hitotsu desu. Kami ga kore kara shiyou to suru koto o Paro ni shimesareta no desu.
Nanatou no yoi meushi wa nana nen desu. Nanatsu no yoi ho mo nana nen de, yume wa hitotsu desu.
Ato ni tsuzuite, agatte kita nanatou no yaseta minikui meushi wa nana nen de, higashikaze ni yaketa mi no iranai nanatsu no ho wa nana nen no kikin desu.
Watashi ga Paro ni moushiageta you ni, kami ga kore kara shiyou to suru koto o Paro ni shimesareta no desu.
Ejiputo zenkoku ni shichi nen no daihousaku ga ari,
Sono nochi shichi nen no kikin ga okori, sono housaku wa mina Ejiputo no kuni de wasurerarete, sono kikin wa kuni o horobosudeshou.
Nochi ni kuru sono kikin ga, hijou ni hageshiikara, sono housaku wa kuni no uchi de kioku sarenaku narudeshou.
Paro ga ni do kasanete yume o mirareta no wa, kono koto ga kami ni yotte sadamerare, kami ga sumiyaka ni kore o sarerukara desu.
Sore yue Paro wa ima, satoku, katsu kashikoi hito o tazunedashite Ejiputo no kuni o osamesase nasai.
Paro wa kou shite kunijyuu ni kantoku o oki, sono nana nen no housaku no uchi ni, Ejiputo no kuni no sanbutsu no gobun no ichi o tori,
Tsuzuite kuru yoi nennen no subete no shokuryou o karera ni atsumesase, kokumotsu o shokuryou to shite, Paro no te de machimachi ni takuwae mamorase nasai.
Kou sureba shokuryou wa, Ejiputo no kuni ni nozomu nana nen no kikin ni sonaete, kono kuni no tame ni takuwae to nari, kono kuni wa kikin ni yotte horobiru koto ga naideshou".
Kono koto wa Paro to sono subete no keraitachi no me ni kanatta.
Soko de Paro wa keraitachi ni itta, "Wareware wa kami no rei o motsu kono you na hito o, hoka ni miidashi eyou ka".
Mata Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Kami ga kore o mina anata ni shimesareta. Anata no you ni satoku kashikoi mono wa nai.
Anata wa watashi no ie o osamete kudasai. Watashi no tami wa mina anata no kotoba ni shitagaudeshou. Watashi wa tada ou no kurai de dake anata ni masaru".
Paro wa sarani Yosefu ni itta, "Watashi wa anata o Ejiputo zenkoku no tsukasa to suru".
Soshite Paro wa yubiwa o te kara hazushite, Yosefu no te ni hame, amanuno no ifuku o kise, kin no kusari o kubi ni kake,
Jibun no daini no kuruma ni kare o nose, "Hizamazuke" to sono mae ni yobawarase, kou shite kare o Ejiputo zenkoku no tsukasa to shita.
Tsuide Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Watashi wa Paro de aru. Anata no yurushi ga nakereba Ejiputo zenkoku de, dare mo teashi o ageru koto wa dekinai".
Paro wa Yosefu no na o zafunate panea to yobi, On no saishi Potepera no musume Asenate o tsuma to shite kare ni ataeta. Yosefu wa Ejiputo no kuni o megutta.
Yosefu ga Ejiputo no ou Paro no mae ni tatta toki wa sanjuusai de atta. Yosefu wa Paro no mae o dete, Ejiputo zenkoku o amaneku megutta.
Sate nana nen no housaku no uchi ni chi wa yutaka ni mono o sanshita.
Soko de Yosefu wa Ejiputo no kuni ni dekita sono nana nenkan no shokuryou o kotogotoku atsume, sono shokuryou o machimachi ni osamesaseta. Sunawachi machi no shuui ni aru hatake no shokuryou o sono machi no naka ni osamesaseta.
Yosefu wa kokumotsu o umi no suna no you ni, hijou ni ooku takuwae, hakari kirenaku natta no de, tsuini hakaru koto o yameta.
Kikin no toshi no kuru mae ni Yosefu ni futari no ko ga umareta. Korera wa On no saishi Potepera no musume Asenate ga unda no de aru.
Yosefu wa choushi no na o Manase to nazukete itta, "Kami ga watashi ni subete no kunan to chichi no ie no subete no koto o wasuresaserareta".
Mata tsugi no ko no na o Efuraimu to nazukete itta, "Kami ga watashi o nayami no chi de yutaka ni serareta".
Ejiputo no kuni ni atta nana nen no housaku ga owari,
Yosefu no itta you ni shichi nen no kikin ga hajimatta. Sono kikin wa subete no kuni ni attaga, Ejiputo zenkoku ni wa shokumotsu ga atta.
Yagate Ejiputo zenkoku ga ueta toki, tami wa Paro ni shokumotsu o sakebi motometa. Soko de Paro wa subete no Ejiputo bito ni itta, "Yosefu no moto ni iki, kare no iu you ni seyo".
Kikin ga chi no zenmen ni atta no de, Yosefu wa subete no kokugura o hiraite, Ejiputo bito ni utta. Kikin wa masumasu Ejiputo no kuni ni hageshiku natta.
Kikin ga zenchi ni hageshiku natta no de, shokoku no hitobito ga Ejiputo no Yosefu no moto ni kokumotsu o kau tame ni kita.
Yakobu wa Ejiputo ni kokumotsu ga aru to shitte, musukotachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa naze kao o miawasete iru no desu ka".
Mata itta, "Ejiputo ni kokumotsu ga aru to iu koto daga, anata gata wa soko e kudatte itte, soko kara, wareware no tame kokumotsu o katte ki nasai. Sou sureba, wareware wa ikinagaraete, shi o manukarerude arou".
Soko de Yosefu no juunin no kyoudai wa kokumotsu o kau tame ni Ejiputo e kudatta.
Shikashi, Yakobu wa Yosefu no otouto Beniyamin o kyoudaitachi to issho ni yaranakatta. Kare ga wazawai ni au no o osoretakara de aru.
Kou shite Isuraeru no kora wa kokumotsu o kaou to hitobito ni majitte yatte kita. Kanan no chi ni kikin ga attakara de aru.
Toki ni Yosefu wa kuni no tsukasa de atte, kuni no subete no tami ni kokumotsu o uru koto o shite ita. Yosefu no kyoudaitachi wa kite, chi ni hirefushi, kare o haishita.
Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi o mite, sore to shittaga, karera ni mukatte wa shiranu mono no you ni shi, araarashiku katatta. Sunawachi karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa doko kara kita no ka". Karera wa kotaeta, "Shokuryou o kau tame ni Kanan no chi kara kimashita".
Yosefu wa, kyoudaitachi de aru no o shitte itaga, karera wa Yosefu to wa shiranakatta.
Yosefu wa katsute karera ni tsuite mita yume o omoidashite, karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa mawashimono de, kono kuni no suki o ukagau tame ni kita no desu".
Karera wa Yosefu ni kotaeta, "Iie, waga Shu yo, shimobera wa tada shokuryou o kau tame ni kita no desu.
Wareware wa mina, hitori no hito no ko de, shinjitsu na mono desu. Shimobera wa mawashimono de wa arimasen".
Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Iya, anata gata wa kono kuni no suki o ukagau tame ni kita no desu".
Karera wa itta, "Shimobera wa juu ninin kyoudai de, Kanan no chi ni iru hitori no hito no ko desu.sue no otouto wa ima, chichi to issho ni imasuga, ta no hitori wa inaku narimashita".
Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Watashi ga itta toori, anata gata wa mawashimono desu.
Anatagata o kou shite tameshite miyou. Paro no inochi ni kakete chikaimasu.sue no otouto ga koko ni konakereba, anata gata wa koko o deru koto wa dekimasen.
Anata gata no hitori o yatte otouto o tsurete kosase nasai. Sore made anatagata o tsunaide oite, anata gata ni seijitsu ga aru ka dou ka, anata gata no kotoba o tameshite miyou. Paro no inochi ni kakete chikaimasu. Anata gata wa tashika ni mawashimono desu".
Yosefu wa karera o mina issho ni mikka no aida, kankinjo ni ireta.
Mikkame ni Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Kou sureba anata gata wa tasukarudeshou. Watashi wa kami o osoremasu.
Moshi anata gata ga shinjitsu na mono nara, kyoudai no hitori o anata gata no iru kankinjo ni nokoshi, anata gata wa kokumotsu o tazusaete itte, kazoku no ue o sukui nasai.
Soshite sue no otouto o watashi no moto ni tsurete ki nasai. Sou sureba anata gata no kotoba no hontou de aru koto ga wakatte, shi o manukarerudeshou". Karera wa sono you ni shita.
Karera wa tagai ni itta, "Tashika ni wareware wa otouto no koto de tsumi ga aru. Kare ga shikiri ni negatta toki, sono kokoro no kurushimi o minagara, wareware wa kikiirenakatta. Sore de kono kurushimi ni au no da".
Ruben ga karera ni kotaete itta, "Watashi wa anata gata ni, kono kodomo ni tsumi o okasu na to ittade wa nai ka. Sore ni mo kakawarazu, anata gata wa kikiirenakatta. Sore de kare no chi no mukui o ukeru no desu".
Karera wa Yosefu ga kikiwakete iru no o shiranakatta. Sougo no aida ni tsuuyakusha ga itakara de aru.
Yosefu wa karera o hanarete itte naki, mata kaette kite karera to katari, sono hitori Shimeon o toraete, karera no me no mae de shibatta.
Soshite Yosefu wa hitobito ni meijite, karera no fukuro ni kokumotsu o mitashi, meimei no gin o fukuro ni kaeshi, douchuu no shokuryou o ataesaseta. Yosefu wa kono you ni karera ni shita.
Karera wa kokumotsu o roba ni owasete soko o satta.
Sono hitori ga yado de, roba ni kaiba o yaru tame fukuro o akete miruto, fukuro no kuchi ni jibun no gin ga atta.
Kare wa kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Watashi no gin wa kaeshite aru. Shikamo miyo, sore wa fukuro no naka ni aru". Soko de karera wa hijou ni odoroki, tagai ni furuenagara itta, "Kami ga wareware ni sareta kono koto wa nanigoto darou".
Kou shite karera wa Kanan no chi ni iru chichi Yakobu no moto ni kaeri, sono mi ni tatta koto o kotogotoku tsugete itta,
"Ano kuni no kimi wa, wareware ni araarashiku katari, kuni o ukagau mawashimono da to iimashita.
Wareware wa kare ni kotaemashita, 'Wareware wa shinjitsu na mono de atte mawashimono de wa nai.
Wareware wa juu ninin kyoudai de, onaji chichi no ko de aru. Hitori wa inaku nari, sue no otouto wa ima chichi to tomo ni Kanan no chi ni iru'.
Sono kuni no kimi de aru sono hito wa wareware ni iimashita, 'Watashi wa kou shite anata gata no shinjitsu na mono de aru no o shirou. Anata gata wa kyoudai no hitori o watashi no moto ni nokoshi, kokumotsu o tazusaete itte, kazoku no ue o sukui nasai.
Soshite sue no otouto o watashi no moto ni tsurete ki nasai. Sou sureba anata gata ga mawashimono de wa naku, shinjitsu na mono de aru no o shitte, anata gata no kyoudai o kaeshi, kono kuni de anata gata ni torihiki sasemashou' ".
Karera ga fukuro no mono o dashite miruto, meimei no kanetsutsumi ga fukuro no naka ni atta no de, karera mo chichi mo kanetsutsumi o mite osoreta.
Chichi Yakobu wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi ni ko o ushinawaseta. Yosefu wa inaku nari, Shimeon mo inaku natta. Kondo wa Beniyamin o mo torisaru. Korera wa mina watashi no mi ni furikakatte kuru no da".
Ruben wa chichi ni itta, "Moshi watashi ga kare o anata no moto ni tsurete kaeranakattara, watashi no futari no ko o koroshite kudasai. Tada kare o watashi no te ni makasete kudasai. Watashi wa kitto, anata no moto ni kare o tsurete kaerimasu".
Yakobu wa itta, "Watashi no ko wa anata gata to tomo ni kudatte itte wa naranai. Kare no ani wa shini, tada hitori kare ga nokotte iru no dakara. Moshi anata gata no iku michi de kare ga wazawai ni aeba, anata gata wa, shiraga no watashi o kanashinde yomi ni kudaraserude arou".
Kikin wa sono chi ni hageshikatta.
Karera ga Ejiputo kara tazusaete kita kokumotsu o kui tsukushita toki, chichi wa karera ni itta, "Mata itte, wareware no tame ni sukoshi no shokuryou o katte ki nasai".
Yuda wa chichi ni kotaete itta, "Ano hito wa wareware o kibishiku imashimete, otouto ga issho de nakereba, watashi no kao o mite wa naranai to iimashita.
Moshi anata ga otouto o wareware to issho ni yatte kudasarunara, wareware wa kudatte itte, anata no tame ni shokuryou o katte kimashou.
Shikashi, moshi kare o yararenainara, wareware wa kudatte ikimasen. Ano hito ga wareware ni, otouto ga issho de nakereba watashi no kao o mite wa naranai to itta no desukara".
Isuraeru wa itta, "Naze, mou hitori no otouto ga aru to ano hito ni itte, watashi o kurushimeru no ka".
Karera wa itta, "Ano hito ga wareware to ichizoku to no koto o toitadashite, chichi wa mada ikite iru ka, mou hitori no otouto ga aru ka to itta no de, towareru mama ni kotaemashitaga, sono hito ga, otouto o tsurete koi to iou to wa, dou shite shiru koto ga dekitadeshou".
Yuda wa chichi Isuraeru ni itta, "Ano ko o watashi to issho ni yatte kudasareba, wareware wa tatte ikimashou. Soshite wareware mo anata mo, wareware no kodomora mo ikinagarae, shi o manukaremashou.
Watashi ga kare no mi o ukeaimasu. Watashi no te kara kare o motome nasai. Moshi watashi ga kare o anata no moto ni tsurekaette, anata no mae ni okanakattara, watashi wa anata ni taishite eikyuu ni tsumi o oimashou.
Moshi wareware ga konna ni tamerawanakattara, imagoro wa ni do mo itte kitadeshou".
Chichi Isuraeru wa karera ni itta, "Sore de wa kou shi nasai. Kono kuni no meisan o utsuwa ni ire, tazusae kudatte sono hito ni okurimono ni shi nasai. Sunawachi sukoshi no nyuukou, sukoshi no mitsu, kouryou, motsu yaku, fusu dashi u, a mendou.
Soshite sono ue ni, baigaku no gin o te ni motte iki nasai. Mata fukuro no kuchi ni kaeshite atta gin wa motte itte kaeshi nasai. Tabun sore wa ayamari de atta no deshou.
Otouto mo tsure, tatte, mata sono hito no tokoro e iki nasai.
Dou ka zennou no kami ga sono hito no mae de anatagata o awaremi, mou hitori no kyoudai to Beniyamin to o, kaesasete kudasaru you ni. Moshi watashi ga ko o ushinawanakereba naranai no nara, ushinatte mo yoi".
Soko de sono hitobito wa okurimono o tori, mata baigaku no gin o tazusae, Beniyamin o tsure, tatte Ejiputo e kudari, Yosefu no mae ni tatta.
Yosefu wa Beniyamin ga karera to tomo ni iru no o mite, ie zukasa ni itta, "Kono hitobito o ie ni tsurete iki, kemono o hofutte, shitaku suru you ni. Kono hitobito wa hiru, watashi to issho ni shokuji o shimasu".
Sono hito wa Yosefu no itta you ni shite, kono hitobito o Yosefu no ie e tsurete itta.
Tokoro ga kono hitobito wa Yosefu no ie e tsurete ikareta no de osorete itta, "Hajime no toki ni fukuro ni kaeshite atta ano gin no yue ni, wareware o hikiireta no desu. Soshite wareware o osoi, seme, toraete dorei to shi, wareware no roba o mo ubau no desu".
Karera wa Yosefu no ie zukasa ni chikazuite, ie no iriguchi de, itta,
"Aa, waga Shu yo, wareware wa saisho, shokuryou o kau tame ni kudatte kita no desu.
Tokoro ga yado ni itte fukuro o akete miruto, meimei no gin wa fukuro no kuchi ni atte, gin no omosa wa moto no mama deshita. Sore de wareware wa sore o motte mairimashita.
Soshite shokuryou o kau tame ni, hoka no gin o mo motte kudatte kimashita. Wareware no gin o fukuro ni ireta mono ga, dare de aru ka wa wakarimasen".
Kare wa itta, "Anshin shi nasai. Osorete wa ikemasen. Sono takara wa anata gata no kami, anata gata no chichi no kami ga, anata gata no fukuro ni irete anata gata ni tamawatta no desu. Anata gata no gin wa watashi ga uketorimashita". Soshite kare wa Shimeon o karera no tokoro e tsurete kita.
Kou shite sono hito wa kono hitobito o Yosefu no ie e michibiki, mizu o ataete ashi o arawase, mata, roba ni kaiba o ataeta.
Karera wa sono tokoro de shokuji o suru no da to kiki, okurimono o totonoete, hiru ni Yosefu no kuru no o matta.
Sate Yosefu ga ie ni kaette kita no de, karera wa sono ie ni tazusaete kita okurimono o Yosefu ni sasage, chi ni fushite, kare o haishita.
Yosefu wa karera no anpi o toute itta, "Anata gata no chichi, anata gata ga saki ni hanashite ita sono roujin wa buji desu ka. Nao ikinagaraete oraremasu ka".
Karera wa kotaeta, "Anata no shimobe, wareware no chichi wa buji de, nao ikinagaraete imasu". Soshite karera wa, tou o sagete haishita.
Yosefu wa me o agete onaji haha no ko de aru otouto Beniyamin o mite itta, "Kore wa anata gata ga mae ni watashi ni hanashita sue no otouto desu ka". Mata itta, "Waga ko yo, dou ka kami ga anata o megumareru you ni".
Yosefu wa otouto natsukashisa ni kokoro ga semari, isoide naku basho o tazune, heya ni haitte naita.
Yagate kare wa kao o aratte dete kita. Soshite jibun o seishite itta, "Shokuji ni shiyou".
Soko de Yosefu wa Yosefu, karera wa karera, baishoku no Ejiputo bi to wa Ejiputo bi to, to betsubetsu ni seki ni tsuita. Ejiputo bi to wa Heburu bito to tomo ni shokuji suru koto ga dekinakatta. Sore wa Ejiputo bito no imu tokoro de attakara de aru.
Kou shite karera wa Yosefu no mae ni, choushi wa choushi to shite, otouto wa otouto to shite suwaraserareta no de, sono hitobito wa tagai ni odoroita.
Mata Yosefu no mae kara, meimei no bun ga hakobaretaga, Beniyamin no bun wa ta no izure no mono no bun yori mo go bai ookatta. Kou shite karera wa nomi, Yosefu to tomo ni tanoshinda.
Sate Yosefu wa ie zukasa ni meijite itta, "Kono hitobito no fukuro ni, hakoberu dake ooku no shokuryou o mitashi, meimei no gin o fukuro no kuchi ni irete oki nasai.
Mata watashi no sakazuki, gin no sakazuki o ano toshishita no mono no fukuro no kuchi ni, kokumotsu no daikin to tomo ni irete oki nasai". Ie zukasa wa Yosefu no kotoba no toori ni shita.
Yo ga akeruto, sono hitobito to, roba to wa okuridasaretaga,
Machi o dete, mada tooku e ikanai uchi ni, Yosefu wa ie zukasa ni itta, "Tatte, ano hitobito no ato o oi nasai. Oitsuite, karera ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa naze aku o motte zen ni mukuiru no desu ka. Naze watashi no gin no sakazuki o nusunda no desu ka.
Kore wa watashi no shujin ga nomu toki ni tsukai, mata itsu mo uranai ni mochiiru mono de wa arimasen ka. Anata gata no shita koto wa warui koto desu' ".
Ie zukasa ga karera ni oitsuite, korera no kotoba o karera ni tsugeta toki,
Karera wa itta, "Waga Shu wa, dou shite sono you na koto o iwareru no desu ka. Shimobera wa kesshite sono you na koto wa itashimasen.
Fukuro no kuchi de mitsuketa gin de sae, Kanan no chi kara anata no tokoro ni mochikaetta hodo desu. Dou shite, wareware wa goshujin no ie kara gin ya kin o nusumimashou.
Shimobera no uchi no dare no tokoro de sore ga mitsukatte mo, sono mono wa shini, mata wareware wa waga Shu no dorei to narimashou".
Ie zukasa wa itta, "Sore de wa anata gata no kotoba no you ni shiyou. Sakazuki no mitsukatta mono wa watashi no dorei to naranakereba naranai. Hoka no mono wa muzai desu".
Soko de karera wa, meimei isoide fukuro o chi ni oroshi, hitorihitori sono fukuro o hiraita.
Ie zukasa wa toshiue kara sagashi hajimete toshishita ni owattaga, sakazuki wa Beniyamin no fukuro no naka ni atta.
Soko de karera wa ifuku o saki, onoono, roba ni ni o owasete machi ni hikikaeshita.
Yuda to kyoudaitachi to wa, Yosefu no ie ni haittaga, Yosefu ga nao soko ni ita no de, karera wa sono mae de chi ni hirefushita.
Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no kono shiwaza wa nanigoto desu ka. Watashi no you na hito wa, kanarazu uranai ateru koto o shiranai no desu ka".
Yuda wa itta, "Wareware wa waga Shu ni nani o ii, nani o nobe emashou. Dou shite wareware wa mi no keppaku o arawashi emashou. Kami ga shimobera no tsumi o abakaremashita. Wareware to, sakazuki o motte ita mono to wa tomo ni waga Shu no dorei to narimashou".
Yosefu wa itta, "Watashi wa kesshite sono you na koto wa shinai. Sakazuki o motte iru mono dake ga watashi no dorei to naranakereba naranai. Hoka no mono wa anzen ni chichi no moto e nobotte iki nasai".
Kono toki Yuda wa kare ni chikazuite itta, "Aa, waga Shu yo, douzo waga Shu no mimi ni hitokoto iwasete kudasai. Shimobe o okoranaide kudasai. Anata wa Paro no you na kata desu.
Waga Shu wa shimobera ni tazunete, 'Chichi ga aru ka, mata otouto ga aru ka' to iwareta no de,
Wareware wa waga Shu ni iimashita, 'Wareware ni wa rourei no chichi ga ari, mata toshiyori ko no otouto ga arimasu. Sono ani wa shinde, onaji haha no ko de nokotte iru no wa, tada kore dake desukara chichi wa kore o aishite imasu'.
Sono toki anata wa shimobera ni iwaremashita, 'Sono mono o watashi no tokoro e tsurete ki nasai. Watashi wa kono me de kare o miyou'.
Wareware wa waga Shu ni iimashita. 'Sono kotomo wa chichi o hanareru koto ga dekimasen. Moshi chichi o hanaretara chichi wa shinudeshou'.
Shikashi, anata wa shimobera ni iwaremashita, 'Sue no otouto ga issho ni kudatte konakereba, omaetachi wa futatabi watashi no kao o miru koto wa dekinai'.
Sore de anata no shimobe de aru chichi no moto ni nobotte, waga Shu no kotoba o kare ni tsugemashita.
Tokoro de, chichi ga 'Omaetachi wa futatabi itte, wareware no tame ni sukoshi no shokuryou o katte kuru you ni' to itta no de,
Wareware wa iimashita, 'Wareware wa kudatte ikemasen. Moshi sue no otouto ga issho de areba ikimashou.sue no otouto ga issho de nakereba, ano hito no kao o miru koto ga dekimasen'.
Anata no shimobe de aru chichi wa iimashita, 'Omaetachi no shitte iru toori, tsuma wa watashi ni futari no ko o unda.
Hitori wa soto e detaga, kitto saki korosareta no da to omou. Watashi wa ima ni natte mo kare o minai.
Moshi omaetachi ga kono ko o mo watashi kara totte itte, kare ga wazawai ni aeba, omaetachi wa, shiraga no watashi o kanashinde yomi ni kudaraserude arou'.
Watashi ga anata no shimobe de aru chichi no moto ni kaette iku toki, moshi kono kodomo ga issho ni inakattara, dou narudeshou. Chichi no tamashii wa kodomo no tamashii ni musubarete iru no desu.
Kono kodomo ga wareware to issho ni inai no o mitara, chichi wa shinudeshou. Sou sureba shimobera wa, anata no shimobe de aru shiraga no chichi o kanashinde yomi ni kudaraseru koto ni narudeshou.
Shimobe wa chichi ni kono kodomo no mi o ukeatte 'Moshi watashi ga kono ko o anata no moto ni tsurekaeranakattara, watashi wa chichi ni taishite eikyuu ni tsumi o oimashou' to itta no desu.
Dou ka, shimobe o kono kodomo no kawari ni, waga Shu no dorei to shite todomarase, kono kodomo o kyoudaitachi to issho ni nobori ikasete kudasai,
Kono kodomo o tsurezu ni, dou shite watashi wa chichi no moto ni nobori iku koto ga dekimashou. Chichi ga wazawai ni au no o miru ni shinobimasen".
Soko de Yosefu wa soba ni tatte iru subete no hito no mae de, jibun o seishi kirenaku natta no de, "Hito wa mina koko kara dete kudasai" to yobawatta. Sore yue Yosefu ga kyoudaitachi ni jibun no koto o akashita toki, hitori mo kare no soba ni tatte iru mono wa nakatta.
Yosefu wa koe o agete naita. Ejiputo bi to wa kore o kiki, Paro no ie mo kore o kiita.
Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Watashi wa Yosefu desu. Chichi wa mada ikinagaraete imasu ka". Kyoudaitachi wa kotaeru koto ga dekinakatta. Karera wa odorokiosoretakara de aru.
Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Watashi ni chikayotte kudasai". Karera ga chikayotta no de kare wa itta, "Watashi wa anata gata no otouto Yosefu desu. Anata gata ga Ejiputo ni utta mono desu.
Shikashi watashi o koko ni utta no o nageku koto mo, kuyamu koto mo irimasen. Kami wa inochi o sukuu tame ni, anata ga tayori saki ni watashi o tsukawasareta no desu.
Kono ni nen no aida, kunijyuu ni kikin ga attaga, nao go nen no aida wa tagayasu koto mo kariireru koto mo naideshou.
Kami wa, anata gata no sue o chi ni nokosu tame, mata ooinaru sukui o motte anata gata no inochi o tasukeru tame ni, watashi o anata ga tayori saki ni tsukawasareta no desu.
Sore yue watashi o koko ni tsukawashita no wa anatagata de wa naku, kami desu. Kami wa watashi o Paro no chichi to shi, sono zenka no Shu to shi, mata Ejiputo zenkoku no tsukasa to saremashita.
Anata gata wa chichi no moto ni isogi nobotte ii nasai, 'Anata no ko Yosefu ga, kou iimashita. Kami ga watashi o Ejiputo zenkoku no Shu to saretakara, tamerawazu ni watashi no tokoro e kudatte ki nasai.
Anata wa Gosen no chi ni sumi, anata mo, anata no kora mo, magotachi mo, hitsuji mo ushi mo, sono ta no mono mo mina, watashi no chikaku ni orasemasu.
Kikin wa nao go nen tsuzukimasukara, anata mo, kazoku mo, sono ta no mono mo, mina komaranai you ni, watashi wa soko de yashinaimashou'.
Anata gata to otouto Beniyamin ga me ni miruto ori, anata gata ni kuchizukara katatte iru no wa kono watashi desu.
Anata gata wa Ejiputo de no, watashi no issai no sakae to, anata gata ga miru issai no koto o watashi no chichi ni tsuge, isoide watashi no chichi o koko e tsure kudari nasai".
Soshite Yosefu wa otouto Beniyamin no kubi o daite naki, Beniyamin mo kare no kubi o daite naita.
Mata Yosefu wa subete no kyoudaitachi ni kuchizuke shi, karera o daite naita. Soshite nochi, kyoudaitachi wa kare to katatta.
Toki ni, "Yosefu no kyoudaitachi ga kita" to iu uwasa ga Paro no ie ni kikoeta no de, Paro to sono keraitachi to wa yorokonda.
Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Kyoudaitachi ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa, kou shi nasai. Kemono ni ni o owasete Kanan no chi e iki,
Chichi to kazoku to o tsurete watashi no moto e ki nasai. Watashi wa anata gata ni, Ejiputo no chi no yoi mono o ataemasu. Anata gata wa, kono kuni no mottomo yoi mono o taberudeshou'.
Mata karera ni meiji nasai, 'Anata gata wa, kou shi nasai. Osanagotachi to tsumatachi no tame ni Ejiputo no chi kara kuruma o motte iki, chichi o tsurete ki nasai.
Kazai ni kokoro o hikarete wa narimasen. Ejiputo zenkoku no yoi mono wa, anata gata no mono dakara desu' ".
Isuraeru no kora wa sono you ni shita. Yosefu wa Paro no inochi ni shitagatte karera ni kuruma o atae, mata tochuu no shokuryou o mo ataeta.
Mata meimei ni haregi o ataetaga, Beniyamin ni wa gin sanbyaku shikeru to haregi go chaku to o ataeta.
Mata kare wa chichi ni tsugi no you na mono o okutta. Sunawachi Ejiputo no yoi mono o owasetaroba juutou to, kokumotsu, pan oyobi chichi no douchuu no shokuryou o owaseta me roba juutou.
Kou shite Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi o okuri sarase, karera ni itta, "Tochuu de arasotte wa narimasen".
Karera wa Ejiputo kara nobotte Kanan no chi ni iri, chichi Yakobu no moto e itte,
Kare ni itta, "Yosefu wa nao ikite ite Ejiputo zenkoku no tsukasa desu". Yakobu wa ki ga tooku natta. Karera no iu koto ga shinjirarenakattakara de aru.
Soko de karera wa Yosefu ga katatta kotoba o nokorazu kare ni tsugeta. Chichi Yakobu wa Yosefu ga jibun o noseru tame ni okutta kuruma o mite motoki zuita.
Soshite Isuraeru wa itta, "Manzoku da. Waga ko Yosefu ga mada ikite iru. Watashi wa shinu mae ni itte kare o miyou".
Isuraeru wa sono mochimono o kotogotoku tazusaete tabidachi, Beerushiba ni itte, chichi Isaku no kami ni gisei o sasageta.
Kono toki, kami wa yo no maboroshi no uchi ni Isuraeru ni katatte iwareta, "Yakobu yo, Yakobu yo". Kare wa itta, "Koko ni imasu".
Kami wa iwareta, "Watashi wa kami, anata no chichi no kami de aru. Ejiputo ni kudaru no o osorete wa naranai. Watashi wa asoko de anata o ooinaru kokumin ni suru.
Watashi wa anata to issho ni Ejiputo ni kudari, mata kanarazu anata o michibiki noborude arou. Yosefu ga tezukara anata no me o tojirude arou".
Soshite Yakobu wa Beerushiba o tatta. Isuraeru no kora wa Yakobu o noseru tame ni Paro no okutta kuruma ni, chichi Yakobu to osanakotachi to tsumatachi o nose,
Mata sono kachiku to Kanan no chi de eta zaisan o tazusae, Yakobu to sono shison wa mina tomo ni Ejiputo e itta.
Kou shite Yakobu wa sono ko to, mago oyobi musume to magomusume nado sono shison o mina tsurete, Ejiputo e itta.
Isuraeru no kora de Ejiputo e itta mono no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Yakobu to sono kora de aruga, Yakobu no choushi wa Ruben.
Ruben no kora wa Hanoku, Paru, Hezuron, Karumi.
Shimeon no kora wa Emueru, Yamin, Ohade, Yakin, Zoharu oyobi Kanan no onna no unda ko Shauru.
Rebi no kora wa Gerushon, Kohate, Merari.
Yuda no kora wa Eru, Onan, Shira, Perezu, Zera. Eru to Onan wa Kanan no chi de shinda. Perezu no kora wa Hezuron to Hamuru.
Issakaru no kora wa Tora, Puwa, Yobu, Shimuron.
Zeburun no kora wa Serede, Eron, Yarieru.
Korera to musume Dena to wa Rea ga Padanaramu de Yakobu ni unda kora de aru. Sono kora to musumera wa awasete sanjuu sannin.
Gado no kora wa Zepon, Hagi, Shuni, Ezubon, Eri, Arode, Areri.
Aseru no kora wa Emuna, Ishiwa, Isui, Beria oyobi imouto Sara. Beria no kora wa Heberu to Marukieru.
Korera wa Raban ga musume Rea ni ataeta Jirupa no kora de aru. Kanojo wa korera o Yakobu ni unda. Awasete juu rokunin.
Yakobu no tsuma Rakeru no kora wa Yosefu to Beniyamin to de aru.
Ejiputo no kuni de Yosefu ni Manase to Efuraimu to ga umareta. Kore wa On no saishi Potepera no musume Asenate ga kare ni unda mono de aru.
Beniyamin no kora wa Bera, Bekeru, Ashiberu, gera, Naaman, Ehi, Roshi, MuPpimu, Hopamu, Arude.
Korera wa Rakeru ga Yakobu ni unda kora de aru. Awasete juu yonnin.
Dan no ko wa Hoshimu.
Nafutari no kora wa Yajieru, Guni, Ezeru, Shiremu.
Korera wa Raban ga musume Rakeru ni ataeta Biruha no kora de aru. Kanojo wa korera o Yakobu ni unda. Awasete shichinin.
Yakobu to tomo ni Ejiputo e itta subete no mono, sunawachi kare no mi kara deta mono wa Yakobu no kora no tsuma o nozoite, awasete rokujuu rokunin de atta.
Ejiputo de Yosefu ni umareta ko ga futari atta. Ejiputo e itta Yakobu no ie no mono wa awasete nanajuunin de atta.
Sate Yakobu wa Yuda o saki ni Yosefu ni tsukawashite, Gosen de aou to iwaseta. Soshite karera wa Gosen no chi e itta.
Yosefu wa kuruma o totonoete, chichi Isuraeru o mukaeru tame ni Gosen ni nobori, chichi ni ai, sono kubi o daki, kubi o kakaete hisashiku naita.
Toki ni, Isuraeru wa Yosefu ni itta, "Anata ga nao ikite ite, watashi wa anata no kao o mita no de ima wa shinde mo yoi".
Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi to chichi no kazoku to ni itta, "Watashi wa nobotte Paro ni iou, 'Kanan no chi ni ita watashi no kyoudaitachi to chichi no kazoku to ga watashi no tokoro e kimashita.
Kono monora wa hitsuji o kau mono, kachiku no bokusha de, sono hitsuji, ushi oyobi mochimono o mina tazusaete kimashita'.
Moshi Paro ga anatagata o meshite, 'Anata gata no shokugyou wa nani ka' to iwaretara,
'Shimobera wa osanai toki kara, zutto kachiku no bokusha desu. Wareware mo, wareware no senzo mo sou desu' to ii nasai. Sou sureba anata gata wa Gosen no chi ni sumu koto ga dekimashou. Hitsujikai wa subete, Ejiputo bito no imu mono dakara desu".
Yosefu wa itte, Paro ni itta, "Watashi no chichi to kyoudaitachi, sono hitsuji, ushi oyobi subete no mochimono ga Kanan no chi kara kite, ima Gosen no chi ni orimasu".
Soshite sono kyoudai no uchi no gonin o tsurete itte, Paro ni awaseta.
Paro wa Yosefu no kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Anata gata no shokugyou wa nani ka". Karera wa Paro ni itta, "Shimobera wa hitsuji o kau mono desu. Wareware mo, wareware no senzo mo sou desu".
Karera wa mata Paro ni itta, "Kono kuni ni kiryuu shiyou to shite kimashita. Kanan no chi wa kikin ga hageshiku, shimobera no mure no tame no bokusou ga nai no desu. Dou ka shimobera o Gosen no chi ni sumasete kudasai".
Paro wa Yosefu ni itta, "Anata no chichi to kyoudaitachi to ga anata no tokoro ni kita.
Ejiputo no chi wa anata no mae ni aru. Chi no mottomo yoi tokoro ni anata no chichi to kyoudaitachi to o sumase nasai. Gosen no chi ni karera o sumase nasai. Moshi anata ga karera no uchi ni yuunou na mono ga aru no o shitte irunara, sono mono ni watashi no kachiku o tsukasadorase nasai".
Soko de Yosefu wa chichi Yakobu o michibiite Paro no mae ni tataseta. Yakobu wa Paro o shukufuku shita.
Paro wa Yakobu ni itta, "Anata no toshi wa ikutsu ka".
Yakobu wa Paro ni itta, "Watashi no tabiji no toshitsuki wa, hyaku sanjuu nen desu. Watashi no yowai no hi wa wazuka de, fushiawase de, watashi no senzotachi no yowai no hi to tabiji no hi ni wa oyobimasen".
Yakobu wa Paro o shukufuku shi, Paro no mae o satta.
Yosefu wa Paro no meijita you ni, chichi to kyoudaitachi to no sumai o sadame, karera ni Ejiputo no kuni de mottomo yoi chi, Ramesesu no chi o shoyuu to shite ataeta.
Mata Yosefu wa chichi to kyoudaitachi to chichi no zenka to ni, kazoku no kazu ni shitagai, shokumotsu o ataete yashinatta.
Sate, kikin ga hijou ni hageshikatta no de, zenchi ni shokumotsu ga naku, Ejiputo no kuni mo Kanan no kuni mo, kikin no tame ni otoroeta.
Sore de Yosefu wa hitobito ga katta kokumotsu no daikin to shite Ejiputo no kuni to Kanan no kuni ni atta gin o mina atsume, sono gin o Paro no ie ni osameta.
Kou shite Ejiputo no kuni to Kanan no kuni ni gin ga tsukita toki, Ejiputo bi to wa mina Yosefu no moto ni kite itta, "Shokumotsu o kudasai. Gin ga tsukitakara tote, dou shite anata no mae de shinde yoideshou".
Yosefu wa itta, "Anata gata no kachiku o dashi nasai. Gin ga tsukita no nara, anata gata no kachiku to hikikae de shokumotsu o watasou".
Karera wa Yosefu no tokoro e kachiku o hiite kita no de, Yosefu wa uma to hitsuji no mure to ushi no mure oyobi roba to hikikae de, shokumotsu o karera ni watashita. Kou shite kare wa sono toshi, subete no kachiku to hikikaeta shokumotsu de karera o yashinatta.
Yagate sono toshi wa kure, tsugi no toshi, hitobito wa mata Yosefu no tokoro e kite itta, "Waga Shu ni wa nanigoto mo kakushimasen. Wareware no gin wa tsuki, kemono no mure mo waga Shu no mono ni natte, wareware no karada to denchi no hoka wa waga Shu no mae ni nani mo nokotte imasen.
Wareware wa dou shite denchi to issho ni, anata no me no mae de horonde yoideshou. Wareware to denchi to o shokumotsu to hikikae de katte kudasai. Wareware wa denchi to issho ni Paro no dorei to narimashou. Mata tane o kudasai. Sou sureba wareware wa ikinagarae, shi o manukarete, denchi mo arenaideshou".
Soko de Yosefu wa Ejiputo no denchi o mina Paro no tame ni kaitotta. Kikin ga Ejiputo bito ni, kibishikatta no de, meimei sono tahata o uttakara de aru. Kou shite chi wa Paro no mono to natta.
Soshite Yosefu wa Ejiputo no kokkyou no kono hashi kara ka no hashi made tami o dorei to shita.
Tada saishi no denchi wa kaitoranakatta. Saishi ni wa Paro no kyuuyo ga atte, Paro ga ataeru kyuuyo de seikatsu shite ita no de, sono denchi o uranakattakara de aru.
Yosefu wa tami ni itta, "Watashi wa kyou, anata gata to sono denchi to o kaitotte, Paro no mono to shita. Anata ga tani tane o agerukara chi ni maki nasai.
Shuukaku no toki wa, sono gobun no ichi o Paro ni osame, gobun no yon o jibun no mono to shite tahata no tane to shi, jibun to kazoku no shokuryou to shi, mata kodomo no shokuryou to shi nasai".
Karera wa itta, "Anata wa wareware no inochi o osukui kudasatta. Dou ka waga Shu no mae ni megumi o esasete kudasai. Wareware wa Paro no dorei ni narimashou".
Yosefu wa Ejiputo no denchi ni tsuite, shuukaku no gobun no ichi o Paro ni osameru koto o okite to shitaga, sore wa konnichi ni oyonde iru. Tadashi saishi no denchi dake wa Paro no mono to naranakatta.
Sate Isuraeru wa Ejiputo no kuni de Gosen no chi ni sumi, soko de zaisan o e, ko o umi, ooini fueta.
Yakobu wa Ejiputo no kuni de juu nana nen ikinagaraeta. Yakobu no yowai no hi wa hyaku yonjuu nana nen de atta.
Isuraeru wa shinu toki ga chikazuita no de, sono ko Yosefu o yonde itta, "Moshi watashi ga anata no mae ni megumi o erunara, dou ka te o watashi no momo no shita ni irete chikai, shinsetsu to seijitsu to o motte watashi o toriatsukatte kudasai. Dou ka watashi o Ejiputo ni wa houmuranaide kudasai.
Watashi ga senzotachi to tomo ni nemuru toki ni wa, watashi o Ejiputo kara hakobidashite senzotachi no haka ni houmutte kudasai". Yosefu wa itta, "Anata no iwareta you ni itashimasu".
Yakobu ga mata, "Watashi ni chikatte kudasai" to itta no de, kare wa chikatta. Isuraeru wa yuka no kashira de oganda.
Korera no koto no nochi ni, "Anata no chichi wa, ima byouki desu" to Yosefu ni tsugeru mono ga atta no de, kare wa futari no ko, Manase to Efuraimu to o tsurete itta.
Toki ni hito ga Yakobu ni tsugete, "Anata no ko Yosefu ga anata no moto ni kimashita" to itta no de, Isuraeru wa tsutomete yuka no ue ni suwatta.
Soshite Yakobu wa Yosefu ni itta, "Saki ni zennou no kami ga Kanan no chi Ruzu de watashi ni araware, watashi o shukufuku shite,
Iwareta, 'Watashi wa omae ni ooku no ko o esase, omae o fuyashi, omae o ooku no kokumin to shiyou. Mata, kono chi o omae no nochi no shison ni ataete eikyuu no shoyuu to saseru'.
Ejiputo ni iru anata no tokoro ni watashi ga kuru mae ni, Ejiputo no kuni de umareta anata no futari no ko wa ima watashi no ko to shimasu. Sunawachi Efuraimu to Manase to wa Ruben to Shimeon to onaji you ni watashi no ko to shimasu.
Tadashi karera no nochi ni anata ni umareta kora wa anata no mono to narimasu. Shikashi, sono shigyou wa sono kyoudai no na de yobarerudeshou.
Watashi ga Padan kara kaette kuru tochuu Rakeru wa Kanan no chi de shini, watashi wa kanashinda. Soko wa Efurata ni iku made ni wa, nao hedatari ga atta. Watashi wa Efurata, sunawachi Betsurehemu e iku michi no katawara ni kanojo o houmutta".
Tokoro de, Isuraeru wa Yosefu no kora o mite itta, "Kore wa dare desu ka".
Yosefu wa chichi ni itta, "Kami ga koko de watashi ni kudasatta kodomo desu". Chichi wa itta, "Karera o watashi no tokoro ni tsurete kite, watashi ni shukufuku sasete kudasai".
Isuraeru no me wa rourei no yue ni, kasunde mienakattaga, Yosefu ga karera o chichi no tokoro ni chikayoraseta no de, chichi wa karera ni kuchizuke shi, karera o daita.
Soshite Isuraeru wa Yosefu ni itta, "Anata no kao ga mirareyou to wa omowanakatta no ni, kami wa anata no kora o mo watashi ni misasete kudasatta".
Soko de Yosefu wa karera o Yakobu no hiza no aida kara toridashi, chi ni fushite haishita.
Yosefu wa Efuraimu o migi no te ni totte Isuraeru no hidari no te ni mukawase, Manase o hidari no te ni totte Isuraeru no migi no te ni mukawase, futari o chikayoraseta.
Suruto, Isuraeru wa migi no te o nobete otouto Efuraimu no atama ni oki, hidari no te o Manase no atama ni oita. Manase wa choushi de aruga, kotosara sono you ni te o oita no de aru.
Soshite Yosefu o shukufuku shite itta, "Waga senzo Aburahamu to Isaku no tsukaeta kami, umarete kara kyou made watashi o yashinawareta kami,
Subete no wazawai kara watashi o aganawareta mitsukai yo, kono kodomotachi o shukufuku shite kudasai. Mata waga na to senzo Aburahamu to Isaku no na to ga, karera ni yotte tonaeraremasu you ni, mata karera ga chi no ue ni fue hirogarimasu you ni".
Yosefu wa chichi ga migi no te o Efuraimu no atama ni oite iru no o mite fuman ni omoi, chichi no te o totte Efuraimu no atama kara Manase no atama e utsusou to shita.
Soshite Yosefu wa chichi ni itta, "Chichi yo, sou de wa arimasen. Kochira ga choushi desu. Sono atama ni migi no te o oite kudasai".
Chichi wa kobande itta, "Wakatte iru. Ko yo, watashi ni wa wakatte iru. Kare mo mata hitotsu no tami to nari, mata ooinaru mono to narude arou. Shikashi otouto wa kare yori mo ooinaru mono to nari, sono shison wa ooku no kokumin to narude arou".
Kou shite kare wa kono hi, karera o shukufuku shite itta, "Anata o sashite, Isuraeru wa, hito o shukufuku shite iude arou, 'Kami ga anata o Efuraimu no gotoku, mata Manase no gotokuni serareru you ni' ". Kono you ni, kare wa Efuraimu o Manase no saki ni tateta.
Isuraeru wa mata Yosefu ni itta, "Watashi wa yagate shinimasu. Shikashi, kami wa anata gata to tomo ni orarete, anatagata o senzo no kuni ni michibiki kaesarerude arou.
Nao watashi wa hitotsu no bun o kyoudai yori mo ooku anata ni ataeru. Kore wa watashi ga tsurugi to yumi to o motte Amori bito no te kara totta mono de aru".
Yakobu wa sono kora o yonde itta, "Atsumari nasai. Nochi no hi ni, anata gata no ue ni okoru koto o, tsugemashou,
Yakobu no kora yo, atsumatte kike. Chichi Isuraeru no kotoba o kike.
Ruben yo, anata wa waga choushi, waga ikioi, waga chikara no hajime, ikou no sugureta mono, kenryoku no sugureta mono.
Shikashi, wakitatsu mizu no you dakara, mohaya, sugureta mono de wa ari enai. Anata wa chichi no yuka ni nobotte kegashita. Aa, anata wa waga nedoko ni nobotta.
Shimeon to Rebi to wa kyoudai. Karera no tsurugi wa bougyaku no buki.
Waga tamashii yo, karera no kaigi ni nozomu na. Waga sakae yo, karera no tsudoi ni tsuranaru na. Karera wa ikari ni makasete hito o koroshi, hoshiimama ni oushi no ashi no suji o kitta.
Karera no ikari wa, hageshii yue ni noroware, karera no ikidoori wa, hanahadashii yue ni norowareru. Watashi wa karera o Yakobu no uchi ni wake, Isuraeru no uchi ni chirasou.
Yuda yo, kyoudaitachi wa anata o homeru. Anata no te wa teki no kubi o osae, chichi no kora wa anata no mae ni mi o kagamerude arou.
Yuda wa, shishi no ko. Waga ko yo, anata wa emono o motte nobotte kuru. Kare wa o jishi no you ni uzukumari, me jishi no you ni mi o fuseru. Dare ga kore o okosu koto ga dekiyou.
Tsue wa Yuda o hanarezu, rippousha no tsue wa sono ashi no aida o hanareru koto naku, Shiro no kuru toki made ni oyobude arou. Moromoro no tami wa kare ni shitagau.
Kare wa sono roba no ko o budou no ki ni tsunagi, sono me roba no ko o yoki budou no ki ni tsunagu. Kare wa sono ifuku o budoushu de arai, sono kimono o budou no shiru de araude arou.
Sono me wa budoushu ni yotte akaku, sono ha wa chichi ni yotte shiroi.
Zeburun wa umibe ni sumi, fune no tomaru minato to natte, sono sakai wa Shidon ni oyobude arou.
Issakaru wa takumashii roba, kare wa hitsuji no ori no aida ni fushite iru.
Kare wa teijuu no chi o mite yoshi to shi, sono kuni o mite tanoshi to shita. Kare wa sono kata o sagete ni nai, dorei to natte oitsukawareru.
Dan wa onore no tami o sabakude arou, Isuraeru no hoka no buzoku no you ni.
Dan wa michi no katawara no hebi, michi no hotori no mamushi. Uma no kakato o kande, noru mono o ushiro ni otosude arou.
Shu yo, watashi wa anata no sukui o machinozomu.
Gado ni wa ryakudatsusha ga semaru. Shikashi kare wa kaette teki no kakato ni semarude arou.
Aseru wa sono shokumotsu ga yutaka de, ou no bimi o idasude arou.
Nafutari wa hanatareta me ji ka, kare wa utsukushii ko jika o umude arou.
Yosefu wa mi o musubu wakagi, izumi no hotori no mi o musubu wakagi. Sono eda wa, kakine o koerude arou.
Iru mono wa kare o hageshiku seme, kare o i, kare o itaku nayamashita.
Shikashi kare no yumi wa nao tsuyoku, kare no ude wa subayai. Kore wa Yakobu no zennousha no te ni yori, Isuraeru no iwa naru bokusha no na ni yori,
Anata o tasukeru chichi no kami ni yori, mataue naru ten no shukufuku, shita ni yokotawaru fuchi no shukufuku, chibusa to tai no shukufuku o motte, anata o megumareru zennousha ni yoru.
Anata no chichi no shukufuku wa eien no yama no shukufuku ni masari, eikyuu no oka no tamamono ni masaru. Korera no shukufuku wa Yosefu no kashira ni kishi, sono kyoudaitachi no kimi taru mono no atama no itadaki ni kisuru.
Beniyamin wa kakisaku ookami, asa ni sono emono o kurai, yuu ni sono bun torimono o wakerude arou".
Subete korera wa Isuraeru no juu ni no buzoku de aru. Soshite kore wa karera no chichi ga karera ni katari, karera o shukufuku shita mono de, kare wa shukufuku subeki tokoro ni shitagatte, karera onoono o shukufuku shita.
Kare wa mata karera ni meijite itta, "Watashi wa waga tami ni kuwaerareyou to shite iru. Anata gata wa Hete bito Efuron no hatake ni aru horaana ni, watashi no senzotachi to tomo ni watashi o houmutte kudasai.
Sono horaana wa Kanan no chi no Mamure no higashi ni aru Makupera no hatake ni ari, Aburahamu ga Hete bito Efuron kara hatake to tomo ni kaitori, shoyuu no bochi to shita mono de,
Soko ni Aburahamu to tsuma Sara to ga houmurare, Isaku to tsuma Ribeka mo soko ni houmuraretaga, watashi wa mata soko ni Rea o houmutta.
Ano hatake to sono naka ni aru horaana to wa Hete no hitobito kara katta mono desu".
Kou shite Yakobu wa kora ni meiji owatte, ashi o yuka ni osame, iki taete, sono tami ni kuwaerareta.
Yosefu wa chichi no kao ni fushite naki, kuchizuke shita.
Soshite Yosefu wa kare no shimobe de aru ishatachi ni, chichi ni kusuri o nuru koto o meijita no de, ishatachi wa Isuraeru ni kusuri o nutta.
Kono tame ni yonjuu nichi o tsuiyashita. Kusuri o nuru ni wa kore hodo no hikazu o yousuru no de aru. Ejiputo bi to wa nanajuu nichi no aida, kare no tame ni naita.
Kare no tame ni naku hi ga sugite, Yosefu wa Paro no ie no mono ni itta, "Ima moshi watashi ga anata gata no mae ni megumi o erunara, dou ka Paro ni tsutaete kudasai.
'Watashi no chichi wa watashi ni chikawasete iimashita "Watashi wa yagate shinimasu. Kanan no chi ni, watashi ga hotte oita haka ni houmutte kudasai". Sore de, dou ka watashi o nobotte ikase, chichi o houmurasete kudasai. Sou sureba, watashi wa mata kaette kimasu' ".
Paro wa itta, "Anata no chichi ga anata ni chikawaseta you ni nobotte itte kare o houmuri nasai".
Soko de Yosefu wa chichi o houmuru tame ni nobotte itta. Kare to tomo ni nobotta mono wa Paro no moromoro no keraitachi, Paro no ie no chouroutachi, Ejiputo no kuni no moromoro no chouroutachi,
Yosefu no zenka to sono kyoudaitachi oyobi sono chichi no kazoku de atta. Tada kodomo to hitsuji to ushi wa Gosen no chi ni nokoshita.
Mata sensha to kihei mo kare to tomo ni nobotta no de, sono gyouretsu wa taisou sakan de atta.
Karera wa Yorudan no mukou no Atade no uchi ba ni ikitsuite, soko de ooini nageki, hijou ni kanashinda. Soshite Yosefu wa nanuka no aida chichi no tame ni nageita.
Sono chi no juumin, Kanan bito ga Atade no uchi ba no nageki o mite, "Kore wa Ejiputo bito no ooinaru nageki da" to itta no de, sono tokoro no na wa Aberu Mitsuraimu to yobareta. Kore wa Yorudan no mukou ni aru.
Yakobu no kora wa meijirareta you ni Yakobu ni okonatta.
Sunawachi sono kora wa kare o Kanan no chi e hakonde itte, Makupera no hatake no horaana ni houmutta. Kono horaana wa Mamure no higashi ni atte, Aburahamu ga Hete bito Efuron kara hatake to tomo ni katte, shoyuu no bochi to shita mono de aru.
Yosefu wa chichi o houmutta nochi, sono kyoudaitachi oyobi subete chichi o houmuru tame ni issho ni nobotta mono to tomo ni Ejiputo ni kaetta.
Yosefu no kyoudaitachi wa chichi no shinda no o mite itta, "Yosefu wa koto ni yoruto wareware o nikunde, wareware ga kare ni shita subete no aku ni, shikaeshi suru ni chigai nai".
Soko de karera wa kotozuke shite Yosefu ni itta, "Anata no chichi wa shinu mae ni meijite iwaremashita,
'Omaetachi wa Yosefu ni ii nasai, "Anata no kyoudaitachi wa anata ni aku o okonattaga, dou ka sono toga to tsumi o yurushite yatte kudasai"'. Ima dou ka anata no chichi no kami ni tsukaeru shimobera no toga o yurushite kudasai". Yosefu wa kono kotoba o kiite naita.
Yagate kyoudaitachi mo kite, kare no mae ni fushite itta, "Kono toori, watashitachi wa anata no shimobe desu".
Yosefu wa karera ni itta, "Osoreru koto hairimasen. Watashi ga kami ni kawaru koto ga dekimashou ka.
Anata gata wa watashi ni taishite aku o takurandaga, kami wa sore o yoki ni kawarasete, konnichi no you ni ooku no tami no inochi o sukuou to hakarawaremashita.
Sore yue osoreru koto hairimasen. Watashi wa anata gata to anata gata no kodomotachi o yashinaimashou". Kare wa karera o nagusamete, shinsetsu ni katatta.
Kono you ni shite Yosefu wa chichi no kazoku to tomo ni Ejiputo ni sunda. Soshite Yosefu wa hyaku juu nen ikinagaraeta.
Yosefu wa Efuraimu no san dai no shison o mita. Manase no ko Makiru no kora mo umarete Yosefu no hiza no ue ni okareta.
Yosefu wa kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Watashi wa yagate shinimasu. Kami wa kanarazu anatagata o kaerimite, kono kuni kara tsuredashi, Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikawareta chi ni michibiki noborarerudeshou".
Sarani Yosefu wa, "Kami wa kanarazu anatagata o kaerimirareru. Sono toki, anata gata wa watashi no hone o koko kara tazusae nobori nasai" to itte Isuraeru no kora ni chikawaseta.
Kou shite Yosefu wa hyaku toosai de shinda. Karera wa kore ni kusuri o nuri, kan ni osamete, Ejiputo ni oita.
Sate, Yakobu to tomo ni, onoono sono kazoku o tomonatte, Ejiputo e itta Isuraeru no kora no na wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Sunawachi Ruben, Shimeon, Rebi, Yuda,
Issakaru, Zeburun, Beniyamin,
Dan, Nafutari, Gado, Aseru de atta.
Yakobu no koshi kara deta mono wa, awasete nanajuunin. Yosefu wa sudeni Ejiputo ni ita.
Soshite, Yosefu wa shini, kyoudaitachi mo, sono jidai no hitobito mo mina shinda.
Keredo mo Isuraeru no shison wa ooku no ko o umi, masumasu fue, hanahada tsuyoku natte, kuni ni michiru you ni natta.
Koko ni, Yosefu no koto o shiranai atarashii ou ga, Ejiputo ni tatta.
Kare wa sono tami ni itta, "Miyo, Isuraeru bi to naru kono tami wa, wareware ni totte, amari ni mo ooku, mata tsuyo sugiru.
Saa, wareware wa, nukari naku karera o toriatsukaou. Karera ga ooku nari, tatakai no okoru toki, teki ni mikata shite, wareware to tatakai, tsuini kono kuni kara nigesaru koto no nai you ni shiyou".
Soko de Ejiputo bi to wa karera no ue ni kantoku o oki, omoi roueki o motte karera o kurushimeta. Karera wa Paro no tame ni souko no machi Pitomu to Ramesesu o tateta.
Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito ga kurushimerareru ni shitagatte, iyoiyo fue hirogaru no de, karera wa Isuraeru no hitobito no yue ni osore o nashita.
Ejiputo bi to wa Isuraeru no hitobito o kibishiku tsukai,
Tsurai tsutome o motte sono seikatsu o kurushimeta. Sunawachi, shikkui kone, renga tsukuri, oyobi tahata no arayuru tsutome ni atarasetaga, sono subete no roueki wa kibishikatta.
Mata Ejiputo no ou wa, Heburu no onna no tame ni toriage o suru josanpu de hitori wa na o Shifura to ii, ta no hitori wa na o Pua to iu mono ni satoshite,
Itta, "Heburu no onna no tame ni josan o suru toki, umi dai no ue o mite, moshi otokonoko naraba sore o koroshi, onnanoko naraba ikashite oki nasai".
Shikashi josanpu tachi wa kami o osore, Ejiputo no ou ga karera ni meijita you ni wa sezu, otokonoko o ikashite oita.
Ejiputo no ou wa josanpu tachi o meshite itta, "Anata gata wa naze kono you na koto o shite, otokonoko o ikashite oita no ka".
Josanpu tachi wa Paro ni itta, "Heburu no onna wa Ejiputo no onna to wa chigai, kanojotachi wa sukoyaka de josanpu ga iku mae ni unde shimaimasu".
Sore de kami wa josanpu tachi ni megumi o hodokosareta. Soshite tami wa fue, hijou ni tsuyoku natta.
Josanpu tachi wa kami o osoreta no de, kami wa kanojotachi no ie o sakaesaserareta.
Soko de Paro wa sono subete no tami ni meijite itta, "Heburu bito ni otokonoko ga umaretanaraba, mina Nairu kawa ni nagekome. Shikashi onnanoko wa mina ikashite oke".
Sate, Rebi no ie no hitori no hito ga itte Rebi no musume o metotta.
Onna wa migomotte, otokonoko o undaga, sono uruwashii no o mite, san tsuki no aida kakushite ita.
Shikashi, mou kakushi kirenaku natta no de, Papirusu de anda kago o tori, sore ni Asufaruto to jushi to o nutte, ko o sono naka ni ire, kore o Nairu kawa no kishi no ashi no naka ni oita.
Sono ane wa, kare ga dou sareru ka o shirouto, tooku hanarete tatte ita.
Toki ni Paro no musume ga mi o araouto, kawa ni furite kita. Jijotachi wa kawabe o aruite itaga, kanojo wa, ashi no naka ni kago no aru no o mite, tsukaeme o yari, sore o totte kosase,
Akete miruto kodomo ga ita. Miyo, osanago wa naite ita. Kanojo wa kawaisou ni omotte itta, "Kore wa Heburu bito no kodomo desu".
Sono toki osanago no ane wa Paro no musume ni itta, "Watashi ga itte Heburu no onna no uchi kara, anata no tame ni, kono ko ni chichi o nomaseru uba o yonde mairimashou ka".
Paro no musume ga "Itte kite kudasai" to iuto, shoujo wa itte sono ko no haha o yonde kita.
Paro no musume wa kanojo ni itta, "Kono ko o tsurete itte, watashi ni kawari, chichi o nomasete kudasai. Watashi wa sono houshuu o sashiagemasu". Onna wa sono ko o hikitotte, kore ni chichi o ataeta.
Sono ko ga seichou shita no de, kanojo wa kore o Paro no musume no tokoro ni tsurete itta. Soshite kare wa sono ko to natta. Kanojo wa sono na o Moose to nazukete itta, "Mizu no naka kara watashi ga hikidashitakara desu".
Moose ga seichou shite nochi, aru hi no koto, douhou no tokoro ni dete itte, sono hageshii roueki o mita. Kare wa hitori no Ejiputo bito ga, douhou no hitori de aru Heburu bito o utsu no o mita no de,
Sayuu o mimawashi, hito no inai no o mite, sono Ejiputo bito o uchikoroshi, kore o suna no naka ni kakushita.
Tsugi no hi mata dete itte, futari no Heburu bito ga tagai ni arasotte iru no o mi, warui hou no otoko ni itta, "Anata wa naze, anata no tomo o utsu no desu ka".
Kare wa itta, "Dare ga anata o tatete, wareware no tsukasa, mata saibannin to shita no desu ka. Ejiputo bito o koroshita you ni, anata wa watashi o korosou to omou no desu ka". Moose wa osoreta. Soshite ano koto ga kitto shireta no da to omotta.
Paro wa kono koto o kiite, Moose o korosou to shita. Shikashi Moose wa Paro no mae o nogarete, Mideyan no chi ni iki, ido no katawara ni zashite ita.
Sate, Mideyan no saishi ni shichinin no musume ga atta. Kanojotachi wa kite mizu o kumi, suisou ni mitashite chichi no hitsuji no mure ni nomaseyou to shitaga,
Hitsujikaitachi ga kite kanojora o oiharatta no de, Moose wa tachiagatte kanojotachi o tasuke, sono hitsuji no mure ni mizu o nomaseta.
Kanojotachi ga chichi Riueru no tokoro ni kaetta toki, chichi wa itta, "Kyou wa, dou shite, konna ni hayaku kaette kita no ka".
Kanojotachi wa itta, "Hitori no Ejiputo bito ga, watashitachi o hitsujikaitachi no te kara tasukedashi, sono ue, mizu o takusankun de, hitsuji no mure ni nomasete kureta no desu".
Kare wa musumetachi ni itta, "Sono kata wa doko ni orareru ka. Naze, sono kata o oite kita no ka. Yonde kite, shokuji o sashiage nasai".
Moose ga kono hito to tomo ni oru koto o kononda no de, kare wa musume no Chippora o tsuma to shite Moose ni ataeta.
Kanojo ga otokonoko o unda no de, Moose wa sono na o Gerushomu to nazuketa. "Watashi wa gaikoku ni kiryuusha to natte iru" to ittakara de aru.
Ooku no hi o hete, Ejiputo no ou wa shinda. Isuraeru no hitobito wa, sono kueki no tsutome no yue ni umeki, mata sakendaga, sono kueki no yue no sakebi wa kami ni todoita.
Kami wa karera no umeki o kiki, kami wa Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu to no keiyaku o oboe,
Kami wa Isuraeru no hitobito o kaerimi, kami wa karera o shiroshimesareta.
Moose wa tsuma no chichi, Mideyan no saishi Etero no hitsuji no mure o katte itaga, sono mure o arano no oku ni michibiite, kami no yama Horebu ni kita.
Toki ni Shu no tsukai wa, shiba no naka no honoo no uchi ni kare ni arawareta. Kare ga miruto, shiba wa hi ni moete iru no ni, sono shiba wa nakunaranakatta.
Moose wa itta, "Itte kono ookina mimono o mi, naze shiba ga moete shimawanai ka o shirou".
Shu wa kare ga kite misadameyou to suru no o mi, kami wa shiba no naka kara kare o yonde, "Moose yo, Moose yo" to iwareta. Kare wa "Koko ni imasu" to itta.
Kami wa iwareta, "Koko ni chikazuite wa ikenai. Ashi kara kutsu o nugi nasai. Anata ga tatte iru sono basho wa sei naru chi dakara de aru".
Mata iwareta, "Watashi wa, anata no senzo no kami, Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami de aru". Moose wa kami o miru koto o osoreta no de kao o kakushita.
Shu wa mata iwareta, "Watashi wa, Ejiputo ni iru watashi no tami no nayami o, tsubusani mi, mata oitsukau mono no yue ni karera no sakebu no o kiita. Watashi wa karera no kurushimi o shitte iru.
Watashi wa kudatte, karera o Ejiputo bito no te kara sukuidashi, kore o kano chi kara michibiki nobotte, yoi hiroi chi, chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi, sunawachi Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no oru tokoro ni itaraseyou to shite iru.
Ima Isuraeru no hitobito no sakebi ga watashi ni todoita. Watashi wa mata Ejiputo bito ga karera o shi etageru, sono shi etage o mita.
Saa, watashi wa, anata o Paro ni tsukawashite, watashi no tami, Isuraeru no hitobito o Ejiputo kara michibikidasaseyou".
Moose wa kami ni itta, "Watashi wa, ittai nanimono deshou. Watashi ga Paro no tokoro e itte, Isuraeru no hitobito o Ejiputo kara michibikidasu no deshou ka".
Kami wa iwareta, "Watashi wa kanarazu anata to tomo ni iru. Kore ga, watashi no anata o tsukawashita shirushi de aru. Anata ga tami o Ejiputo kara michibikidashita toki, anata gata wa kono yama de kami ni tsukaerude arou".
Moose wa kami ni itta, "Watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito no tokoro e itte, karera ni 'Anata gata no senzo no kami ga, watashi o anata gata no tokoro e tsukawasaremashita' to iu toki, karera ga 'Sono na wa nan to iu no desu ka' to watashi ni kikunaraba, nan to kotaemashou ka".
Kami wa Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa, atte aru mono". Mata iwareta, "Isuraeru no hitobito ni kou ii nasai, '"Watashi wa aru" to iu kata ga, watashi o anata gata no tokoro e tsukawasaremashita' to".
Kami wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Isuraeru no hitobito ni kou ii nasai 'Anata gata no senzo no kami, Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami de aru Shu ga, watashi o anata gata no tokoro e tsukawasaremashita' to. Kore wa eien ni watashi no na, kore wa yoyo no watashi no yobina de aru.
Anata wa itte, Isuraeru no chouroutachi o atsumete ii nasai, 'Anata gata no senzo no kami, Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu no kami de aru Shu wa, watashi ni arawarete iwaremashita, "Watashi wa anatagata o kaerimi, anata gata ga Ejiputo de sarete iru koto o tashika ni mita.
Sore de watashi wa anatagata o, Ejiputo no nayami kara michibikidashite, Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no chi, chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi e tazusae noborou to kesshin shita" to'.
Karera wa anata no koe ni kikishitagaude arou. Anata wa Isuraeru no chouroutachi to issho ni Ejiputo no ou no tokoro e itte ii nasai, 'Heburu bito no kami, Shu ga watashitachi ni arawareraremashita. Sore de, watashitachi o, mikka no michinori hodo arano ni ikasete, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni gisei o sasageru koto o yurushite kudasai' to.
Shikashi, Ejiputo no ou wa tsuyoi te o motte semaranakereba, anatagata o ikasenai no o watashi wa shitte iru.
Sore de, watashi wa te o nobete, Ejiputo no uchi ni okonaou to suru, samazama no fushigi o motte Ejiputo o utou. Sono nochi ni kare wa anatagata o saraserude arou.
Watashi wa kono tami ni Ejiputo bito no koui o esaseru. Anata gata wa saru toki ni, munashite de satte wa naranai.
Onna wa mina, sono tonari no onna to, ie ni yadotte iru onna ni, gin no kazari, kin no kazari, mata ifuku o motome nasai. Soshite korera o, anata gata no musuko, musume ni tsukesase nasai. Kono you ni Ejiputo bito no mono o ubaitori nasai".
Moose wa itta, "Shikashi, karera wa watashi o shinzezu, mata watashi no koe ni kikishitagawanaide iudeshou, 'Shu wa anata ni arawarenakatta' to".
Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata no te ni aru sore wa nani ka". Kare wa itta, "Tsue desu".
Mata iwareta, "Sore o chi ni nage nasai". Kare ga sore o chi ni nageruto, hebi ni natta no de, Moose wa sono mae kara mi o saketa.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata no te o nobashite, sono o o tori nasai. - - soko de te o nobashite sore o toruto, te no naka de tsue to natta. - -
Kore wa, karera no senzotachi no kami, Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami de aru Shu ga, anata ni arawareta no o, karera ni shinjisaseru tame de aru".
Shu wa mata kare ni iwareta, "Anata no te o futokoro ni ire nasai". Kare ga te o futokoro ni ire, sore o dasuto, te wa, raibyou ni kakatte, yuki no you ni shiroku natte ita.
Shu wa iwareta, "Te o futokoro ni modoshi nasai". Kare wa te o futokoro ni modoshi, sore o futokoro kara dashite miruto, kaifuku shite, moto no niku no you ni natte ita.
Shu wa iwareta, "Karera ga moshi anata o shinzezu, mata hajime no shirushi o mitomenainaraba, nochi no shirushi wa shinjirude arou.
Karera ga moshi kono futatsu no shirushi o mo shinzezu, anata no koe ni kikishitagawanainaraba, anata wa Nairu kawa no mizu o totte, kawaita chi ni sosogi nasai. Anata ga Nairu kawa kara totta mizu wa, kawaita chi de chi to narude arou".
Moose wa Shu ni itta, "Aa Shu yo, watashi wa izen ni mo, mata anata ga, shimobe ni katararete kara nochi mo, kotoba no hito de wa arimasen. Watashi wa kuchi mo omoku, shita mo omoi no desu".
Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Dare ga hito ni kuchi o sazuketa no ka. Oshi, mimi shii, meaki, me shii ni dare ga suru no ka. Shu naru watashi de wa nai ka.
Sore yue iki nasai. Watashi wa anata no kuchi to tomo ni atte, anata no iubeki koto o oshierude arou".
Moose wa itta, "Aa, Shu yo, dou ka, hoka no tekitou na hito o otsukawashi kudasai".
Soko de, Shu wa Moose ni mukatte ikari o hasshite iwareta, "Anata no kyoudai Rebi bi to Aron ga irude wa nai ka. Watashi wa kare ga kotoba ni sugurete iru no o shitte iru. Miyo, kare wa anata ni aou to shite dete kite iru. Kare wa anata o mite kokoro ni yorokobude arou.
Anata wa kare ni katatte kotoba o sono kuchi ni sazuke nasai. Watashi wa anata no kuchi to tomo ni ari, kare no kuchi to tomo ni atte, anata gata no nasubeki koto o oshie,
Kare wa anata ni kawatte tami ni katarude arou. Kare wa anata no kuchi to nari, anata wa kare no tame ni, kami ni kawarude arou.
Anata wa sono tsue o te ni tori, sore o motte, shirushi o okonai nasai".
Moose wa tsuma no chichi Etero no tokoro ni kaette kare ni itta, "Dou ka watashi o, Ejiputo ni iru miuchi no mono no tokoro ni kaerase, karera ga mada ikinagaraete iru ka, dou ka o misasete kudasai". Etero wa Moose ni itta, "Yasunjite iki nasai".
Shu wa Mideyan de Moose ni iwareta, "Ejiputo ni kaette iki nasai. Anata no inochi o motometa hitobito wa mina shinda".
Soko de Moose wa tsuma to kodomotachi o tori, roba ni nosete, Ejiputo no chi ni kaetta. Moose wa te ni kami no tsue o totta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata ga Ejiputo ni kaetta toki, watashi ga anata no te ni sazuketa fushigi o, mina Paro no mae de okonai nasai. Shikashi, watashi ga kare no kokoro o katakuna ni suru no de, kare wa tami o sarasenaide arou.
Anata wa Paro ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru. Isuraeru wa watashi no ko, watashi no choushi de aru.
Watashi wa anata ni iu. Watashi no ko o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai. Moshi kare o saraseru no o kobamunaraba, watashi wa anata no ko, anata no choushi o korosude arou' to".
Sate Moose ga tochuu de yadotte iru toki, Shu wa kare ni atte kare o korosou to sareta.
Sono toki Chippora wa hiuchi ishi no kogatana o totte, sono otokonoko no mae no kawa o kiri, sore o Moose no ashi ni tsukete itta, "Anata wa makoto ni, watashi ni totte chi no hanamuko desu".
Soko de, Shu wa Moose o yurusareta. Kono toki "Chi no hanamuko desu" to Chippora ga itta no wa katsurei no yue de aru.
Shu wa Aron ni iwareta, "Arano ni itte Moose ni ai nasai". Kare wa itte kami no yama de Moose ni ai, kore ni kuchizuke shita.
Moose wa jibun o tsukawasareta Shu no subete no kotoba to, meijirareta subete no shirushi o Aron ni tsugeta.
Soko de Moose to Aron wa itte Isuraeru no hitobito no chouroutachi o mina atsumeta.
Soshite Aron wa Shu ga Moose ni katarareta kotoba o, kotogotoku tsugeta. Mata kare wa tami no mae de shirushi o okonatta no de,
Tami wa shinjita. Karera wa Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito o kaerimi, sono kurushimi o mirareta no o kiki, fushite reihai shita.
Sono nochi, Moose to Aron wa itte Paro ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Watashi no tami o sarase, arano de, watashi no tame ni matsuri o sase nasai' to".
Paro wa itta, "Shu to wa ittai nanimono ka. Watashi ga sono koe ni kikishitagatte Isuraeru o sarasenakereba naranai no ka. Watashi wa Shu o shiranai. Mata Isuraeru o sarase wa shinai".
Karera wa itta, "Heburu bito no kami ga watashitachi ni arawaremashita. Dou ka, watashitachi o mikka no michinori hodo arano ni ikase, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni gisei o sasagesasete kudasai. Sou shinakereba Shu wa ekibyou ka, tsurugi o motte, watashitachi o nayamasarerukara desu".
Ejiputo no ou wa karera ni itta, "Moose to Aron yo, anata gata wa, naze tami ni hataraki o yamesaseyou to suru no ka. Jibun no roueki ni tsuku ga yoi".
Paro wa mata itta, "Miyo, ima ya domin no kazu wa ooi. Shikamo, anata gata wa karera ni roueki o yasumaseyou to suru no ka".
Sono hi, Paro wa tami o oitsukau mono to, tami no kashiratachi ni meijite itta,
"Anata gata wa, renga o tsukuru tame no wara o, mohaya, ima made no you ni, kono tami ni ataete wa naranai. Karera ni jibun de itte, wara o atsumesase nasai.
Mata mae ni tsukutte ita, renga no kazu doori ni karera ni tsukurase, sore o herashite wa naranai. Karera wa namakemono da. Sore dakara, karera wa sakende, 'Itte watashitachi no kami ni gisei o sasagesaseyo' to iu no da.
Kono hitobito no roueki o omoku shite, hatarakase, itsuwari no kotoba ni kokoro o yosesasenu you ni shi nasai".
Soko de tami o oitsukau monotachi to, tami no kashiratachi wa dete itte, tami ni itta, "Paro wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata ni, wara wa ataenai.
Jibun de itte, mitsukaru tokoro kara, wara o totte kuru ga yoi. Shikashi hataraki wa sukoshi mo herashite wa naranai' to".
Soko de tami wa Ejiputo no zenchi ni chitte, wara no kawari ni, karikabu o atsumeta.
Oitsukau monotachi wa, karera o sekitatete itta, "Wara ga atta toki to onaji you ni, anata gata no hataraki no, higoto no bun o shiagenakereba naranai".
Paro no oitsukau monotachi ga Isuraeru no hitobito no ue ni tateta kashiratachi wa, utarete, "Naze, anata gata wa, renga tsukuri no shigoto o, kyou mo, mae no you ni shiagenai no ka" to iwareta.
Soko de, Isuraeru no hitobito no kashiratachi wa Paro no tokoro ni iki, sakende itta, "Anata wa naze, shimobedomo ni konna koto o nasaru no desu ka.
Shimobedomo wa, wara o ataerarezu, shikamo karera wa watashitachi ni, 'Renga wa tsukure' to iu no desu. Sono ue, shimobedomo wa utarete imasu. Tsumi wa anata no tami ni aru no desu".
Paro wa itta, "Anata gata wa, namakemono da, namakemono da. Sore dakara, 'Itte, Shu ni gisei o sasagesaseyo' to iu no da.
Saa, itte hataraki nasai. Wara wa ataenaiga, nao anata gata wa sadameta kazu no renga o osamenakereba naranai".
Isuraeru no hitobito no kashiratachi wa, "Renga no higoto no bun o herashite wa naranai" to iwareta no de, warui jitai ni natta koto o shitta.
Karera ga Paro o hanarete dete kita toki, karera ni aou to shite tatte ita Moose to Aron ni atta no de,
Karera ni itta, "Shu ga anatagata o goran ni natte, sabakaremasu you ni. Anata gata wa, watashitachi o Paro to sono keraitachi ni kirawase, tsurugi o karera no te ni watashite, korosaseyou to shite orareru no desu".
Moose wa Shu no moto ni kaette itta, "Shu yo, anata wa, naze kono tami o hidoi me ni awasareru no desu ka. Nan no tame ni watashi o tsukawasareta no desu ka.
Watashi ga Paro no moto ni itte, anata no na ni yotte katatte kara konokata, kare wa kono tami o hidoi me ni awaseru bakari desu. Mata, anata wa, sukoshi mo anata no tami o sukuou to nasaimasen".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Ima, anata wa, watashi ga Paro ni nani o shiyou to shite iru ka o mirude arou. Sunawachi Paro wa tsuyoi te ni shi irarete, karera o saraserude arou. Ina, kare wa tsuyoi te ni shi irarete, karera o kuni kara oidasude arou".
Kami wa Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa Shu de aru.
Watashi wa Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni wa zennou no kami to shite arawaretaga, Shu to iu na de wa, jibun o karera ni shirasenakatta.
Watashi wa mata Kanan no chi, sunawachi karera ga kiryuu shita sono kiryuu no chi o, karera ni ataeru to iu keiyaku o karera to tateta.
Watashi wa mata, Ejiputo bito ga dorei to shite iru Isuraeru no hitobito no umeki o kiite, watashi no keiyaku o omoidashita.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Watashi wa Shu de aru. Watashi wa anatagata o Ejiputo bito no roueki no shita kara michibikidashi, dorei no tsutome kara sukui, mata nobeta ude to ooinaru sabaki o motte, anatagata o aganaude arou.
Watashi wa anatagata o totte watashi no tami to shi, watashi wa anata gata no kami to naru. Watashi ga Ejiputo bito no roueki no shita kara anatagata o michibikidasu anata gata no kami, Shu de aru koto o, anata gata wa shirude arou.
Watashi wa Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni ataeruto te o agete chikatta sono chi ni anatagata o hairase, sore o shoyuu to shite, ataerude arou. Watashi wa Shu de aru' to".
Moose wa kono you ni Isuraeru no hitobito ni katattaga, karera wa kokoro no itami to, kibishii dorei no tsutome no yue ni, Moose ni kikishitagawanakatta.
Sate Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Ejiputo no ou Paro no tokoro ni itte, kare ga Isuraeru no hitobito o sono kuni kara saraseru you ni hanashi nasai".
Moose wa Shu ni muka tte itta, "Isuraeru no hitobito de sae, watashi no iu koto o kikanakatta no ni, dou shite, kuchibiru ni katsurei no nai watashi no iu koto o, Paro ga kikiiremashou ka".
Shikashi, Shu wa Moose to Aron ni katatte, Isuraeru no hitobito to, Ejiputo no ou Paro no moto ni ikase, Isuraeru no hitobito o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidase to meijirareta.
Karera no senzo no ie no shuchoutachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Isuraeru no choushi Ruben no kora wa Hanoku, Paru, Hezuron, Karumi de, korera wa Ruben no ichizoku de aru.
Shimeon no kora wa Emueru, Yamin, Ohade, Yakin, Zoharu, oyobi Kanan no onna kara umareta Shauru de, korera wa Shimeon no ichizoku de aru.
Rebi no kora no na wa, sono sedai ni shitagaeba, Gerushon, Kohate, Merari de, Rebi no isshou wa hyaku sanjuu nana nen de atta.
Gerushon no kora no ichizoku wa Ribuni to Shimei de aru.
Kohate no kora wa Amuramu, Izuharu, Heburon, Ujieru de, Kohate no isshou wa hyaku sanjuu san nen de atta.
Merari no kora wa Maheri to Mushi de aru. Korera wa sono sedai ni yoru Rebi no ichizoku de aru.
Amuramu wa chichi no imouto Yokebede o tsuma to shitaga, kanojo wa Aron to Moose o kare ni unda. Amuramu no isshou wa hyaku sanjuu nana nen de atta.
Izuharu no kora wa Kora, Nepegu, Jikuri de aru.
Ujieru no kora wa Misaeru, Eruzapan, Shiteri de aru.
Aron wa Nashon no shimai, Aminadabu no musume Eriseba o tsuma to shita. Eriseba wa kare ni Nadabu, Abiu, Ereazaru, Itamaru o unda.
Kora no kora wa ASshiru, Erukana, Abiasafu de, korera wa Kora bito no ichizoku de aru.
Aron no ko Ereazaru wa Puteeru no musume no hitori o tsuma to shita. Kanojo wa Pinehasu o kare ni unda. Korera wa, sono ichizoku ni yoru Rebi bito no senzo no ie no shuchoutachi de aru.
Shu ga, "Isuraeru no hitobito o sono gundan ni shitagatte, Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashi nasai" to iwareta no wa, kono Aron to Moose de aru.
Karera wa Isuraeru no hitobito o Ejiputo kara michibikidasu koto ni tsuite, Ejiputo no ou Paro ni katatta mono de, sunawachi kono Moose to Aron de aru.
Shu ga Ejiputo no chi de Moose ni katarareta hi ni,
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa Shu de aru. Watashi ga anata ni kataru koto wa, mina Ejiputo no ou Paro ni katari nasai".
Shikashi Moose wa Shu ni muka tte itta, "Goran no toori, watashi wa, kuchibiru ni katsurei no nai mono desu. Paro ga dou shite watashi no iu koto o kikiiremashou ka".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa anata o Paro ni taishite kami no gotoki mono to suru. Anata no kyoudai Aron wa anata no yogensha to narude arou.
Anata wa watashi ga meijiru koto o, kotogotoku kare ni tsugenakereba naranai. Soshite anata no kyoudai Aron wa Paro ni tsugete, Isuraeru no hitobito o sono kuni kara saraseru you ni sasenakereba naranai.
Shikashi, watashi wa Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni suru no de, watashi no shirushi to fushigi o Ejiputo no kuni ni ooku okonatte mo,
Paro wa anata gata no iu koto o kikanaide arou. Sore de watashi wa te o Ejiputo no ue ni kuwae, ooinaru sabaki o kudashite, watashi no gundan, watashi no tami Isuraeru no hitobito o, Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidasude arou.
Watashi ga te o Ejiputo no ue ni sashinobete, Isuraeru no hitobito o karera no uchi kara michibikidasu toki, Ejiputo bi to wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni narude arou".
Moose to Aron wa sono you ni okonatta. Sunawachi Shu ga karera ni meijirareta you ni okonatta.
Karera ga Paro to katatta toki, Moose wa hachijuusai, Aron wa hachijuu sansai de atta.
Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta,
"Paro ga anata gata ni, 'Fushigi o okonatte shouko o shimese' to iu toki, anata wa Aron ni ii nasai, 'Anata no tsue o totte, Paro no mae ni nage nasai' to. Suruto sore wa hebi ni narude arou".
Sore de, Moose to Aron wa Paro no tokoro ni iki, Shu no meijirareta toori ni okonatta. Sunawachi Aron wa sono tsue o, Paro to sono keraitachi no mae ni nageruto, sore wa hebi ni natta.
Soko de Paro mo mata chisha to mahoutsukai o meshiyoseta. Korera no Ejiputo no majutsushira mo mata, sono hijutsu o motte onaji you ni okonatta.
Sunawachi karera wa, onoono sono tsue o nagetaga, sorera wa hebi ni natta. Shikashi, Aron no tsue wa karera no tsue o, nomi tsukushita.
Keredo mo, Paro no kokoro wa katakuna ni natte, Shu no iwareta you ni, karera no iu koto o kikanakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Paro no kokoro wa katakuna de, kare wa tami o saraseru koto o kobande iru.
Anata wa, asu no asa, Paro no tokoro ni iki nasai. Miyo, kare wa mizu no tokoro ni dete iru. Anata wa, hebi ni kawatta ano tsue o te ni tori, Nairu kawa no kishi ni tatte kare ni ai,
Soshite kare ni ii nasai, 'Heburu bito no kami, Shu ga watashi o anata ni tsukawashite iwaremasu, "Watashi no tami o sarase, arano de, watashi ni tsukaeru you ni sase yo" to. Shikashi ima mo nao, anata ga kikiireyou to sarenai no de,
Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, "Kore ni yotte watashi ga Shu de aru koto o, anata wa shirudeshou. Miyo, watashi ga te ni aru tsue de Nairu kawa no mizu o utsuto, sore wa chi ni kawarude arou.
Soshite kawa no uo wa shini, kawa wa kusaku nari, Ejiputo bi to wa kawa no mizu o nomu koto o itoude arou"' to".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Aron ni ii nasai, 'Anata no tsue o totte, te o Ejiputo no mizu no ue, kawa no ue, nagare no ue, ikenoue, mata sono subete no mizutamari no ue ni sashinobete, sore o chi ni narase nasai. Ejiputo zenkoku ni watatte, ki no utsuwa, ishi no utsuwa ni mo, chi ga aru you ni narudeshou' to".
Moose to Aron wa Shu no meijirareta you ni okonatta. Sunawachi, kare wa Paro to sono keraitachi no me no mae de, tsue o agete Nairu kawa no mizu o utsuto, kawa no mizu wa, kotogotoku chi ni kawatta.
Sore de kawa no uo wa shini, kawa wa kusaku nari, Ejiputo bi to wa kawa no mizu o nomu koto ga dekinaku natta. Soshite Ejiputo zenkoku ni watatte chi ga atta.
Ejiputo no majutsushira mo hijutsu o motte onaji you ni okonatta. Shikashi, Shu no iwareta you ni, Paro no kokoro wa katakuna ni nari, karera no iu koto o kikanakatta.
Paro wa mi o megurashite ie ni iri, mata kono koto o mo kokoro ni tomenakatta.
Subete no Ejiputo bi to wa Nairu kawa no mizu ga nomenakatta no de, nomu mizu o eyou to, kawa no mawari o hotta.
Shu ga Nairu kawa o utarete nochi nanuka o heta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Paro no tokoro ni itte ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, "Watashi no tami o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai.
Shikashi, saraseru koto o kobamunaraba, miyo, watashi wa, kaeru o motte, anata no ryoudo o, kotogotoku utsude arou.
Nairu kawa ni kaeru ga muragari, nobotte, anata no ie, anata no shinshitsu ni hairi, shindai ni nobori, anata no kerai to tami no ie ni hairi, mata anata no kamado ya, konehachi ni hairi,
Anata to, anata no tami to, subete no kerai no karada ni, haiagarude arou" to' ".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Aron ni ii nasai, 'Tsue o motte, te o kawa no ue, nagare no ue,, ikenoue ni sashinobe, kaeru o Ejiputo no chi ni noborase nasai' to".
Aron ga te o Ejiputo no mizu no ue ni sashinobeta no de, kaeru wa nobotte Ejiputo no chi o ootta.
Majutsushira mo hijutsu o motte onaji you ni okonai, kaeru o Ejiputo no chi ni noboraseta.
Paro wa Moose to Aron o meshite itta, "Kaeru o watashi to, watashi no tami kara torisaru you ni Shu ni negatte kudasai. Sono toki watashi wa kono tami o sarasete, Shu ni gisei o sasagesaserudeshou".
Moose wa Paro ni itta, "Anata to, anata no kerai to, anata no tami no tame ni, watashi ga itsu negatte, kono kaeru o, anata to anata no ie kara tatte, Nairu kawa dake ni todomaraserubeki ka, kimete kudasai".
Paro wa itta, "Myounichi". Moose wa itta, "Oose no toori ni natte, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni narabu mono no nai koto o, anata ga shiraremasu you ni.
Soshite, kaeru wa anata to, anata no ie to, anata no kerai to, anata no tami o hanarete Nairu kawa ni dake todomarudeshou".
Kou shite Moose to Aron wa Paro o hanarete deta. Moose wa Shu ga Paro ni tsukawasareta kaeru no koto ni tsuite, Shu ni yobimotometa no de,
Shu wa Moose no kotoba no you ni sare, kaeru wa ie kara, niwa kara, mata hatake kara shinitaeta.
Kore o hito yama hito yama ni tsunda no de, chi wa kusaku natta.
Tokoro ga Paro wa iki tsuku hima no dekita no o mite, Shu ga iwareta you ni, sono kokoro o katakuna ni shite karera no iu koto o kikanakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Aron ni ii nasai, 'Anata no tsue o sashinobete chi no chiri o uchi, sore o Ejiputo no zenkoku ni watatte, buyo to narase nasai' to".
Karera wa sono you ni okonatta. Sunawachi Aron wa sono tsue o totte te o sashinobe, chi no chiri o utta no de, buyo wa hito to kachiku ni tsuita. Sunawachi, chi no chiri wa mina Ejiputo no zenkoku ni watatte, buyo to natta.
Majutsushira mo hijutsu o motte onaji you ni okonai, buyo o dasou to shitaga, karera ni wa dekinakatta. Buyo ga hito to kachiku ni tsuita no de,
Majutsushira wa Paro ni itta, "Kore wa kami no yubi desu". Shikashi Shu no iwareta you ni, Paro no kokoro wa katakuna ni natte, karera no iu koto o kikanakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa asa hayaku okite Paro no mae ni tachi nasai. Choudo kare wa mizu no tokoro ni dete irukara kare ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi no tami o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai.
Anata ga watashi no tami o sarasenainaraba, watashi wa, anata to anata no kerai to, anata no tami to anata no ie to ni, abu no mure o tsukawasude arou. Ejiputo bito no ieie wa, abu no mure de michi, karera no fumu chi mo mata, sou narude arou.
Sono hi watashi wa, watashi no tami no sumu Gosen no chi o kubes shite, soko ni abu no mure o irenaide arou. Kuni no naka de watashi ga Shu de aru koto o anata ga shiru tame de aru.
Watashi wa watashi no tami to anata no tami no aida ni kubetsu o oku. Kono shirushi wa, asu okorude arou" to' ".
Shu wa sono you ni sareta no de, obitadashii abu ga, Paro no ie to, sono kerai no ie to, Ejiputo no zenkoku ni haitte kite, chi wa abu no mure no tame ni gai o uketa.
Soko de, Paro wa Moose to Aron o meshite itta, "Anata gata wa itte kono kuni no uchi de, anata gata no kami ni gisei o sasage nasai".
Moose wa itta, "Sou suru koto wa dekimasen. Watashitachi wa Ejiputo bito no imu mono o gisei to shite, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni sasagerukara desu. Moshi, Ejiputo bito no me no mae de, karera no imu mono o gisei ni sasagerunaraba, karera wa watashitachi o ishi de utanaideshou ka.
Watashitachi wa mikka no michinori hodo, arano ni haitte, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni gisei o sasage, Shu ga watashitachi ni meijirareru you ni shinakereba narimasen".
Paro wa itta, "Watashi wa anatagata o sarase, arano de, anata gata no kami, Shu ni gisei o sasagesaseyou. Tada amari tooku e itte wa naranai. Watashi no tame ni kigan shi nasai".
Moose wa itta, "Watashi wa anata no moto kara dete itte Shu ni kigan shimashou. Asu abu no mure ga Paro to, sono kerai to, sono tami kara hanarerudeshou. Tada Paro wa mata azamuite, tami ga Shu ni gisei o sasage ni iku no o tomenai you ni shite kudasai".
Kou shite Moose wa Paro no moto o dete, Shu ni kigan shita no de,
Shu wa Moose no kotoba no you ni sareta. Sunawachi, abu no mure o Paro to, sono kerai to, sono tami kara torisarareta no de, hitotsu mo nokoranakatta.
Shikashi Paro wa kondo mo mata, sono kokoro o katakuna ni shite tami o sarasenakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Paro no moto ni itte, kare ni ii nasai, 'Heburu bito no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi no tami o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai.
Anata ga moshi karera o saraseru koto o kobande, nao karera o tomeokunaraba,
Shu no te wa mottomo hageshii ekibyou o motte, no ni iru anata no kachiku, sunawachi uma, roba, raku da, ushi, hitsuji no ue ni nozomude arou.
Shikashi, Shu wa Isuraeru no kachiku to, Ejiputo no kachiku o kubetsu sare, subete Isuraeru no hitobito ni zokusuru mono ni wa ichitou mo shinu mono ga naide arou" to' ".
Shu wa, mata, toki o sadamete ooserareta, "Asu, Shu wa kono koto o kuni ni okonaude arou".
Akuruhi, Shu wa kono koto o okonawareta no de, Ejiputo bito no kachiku wa mina shinda. Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito no kachiku wa ichitou mo shinanakatta.
Paro wa hito o tsukawashite misasetaga, Isuraeru no kachiku wa ichitou mo shinde inakatta. Sore de mo Paro no kokoro wa katakuna de, tami o sarasenakatta.
Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, kamado no susu o ryoute ippai tori, sore o Moose wa Paro no me no mae de ten ni mukatte, makichirashi nasai.
Sore wa Ejiputo no zenkoku ni watatte, komakai chiri to nari, Ejiputo zenkoku de hito to kemono ni tsuite, umi no deru haremono to narude arou".
Soko de karera wa, kamado no susu o totte Paro no mae ni tachi, Moose wa ten ni mukatte kore o makichirashita no de, hito to kemono ni tsuite, umi no deru haremono to natta.
Majutsushira wa, haremono no tame ni Moose no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekinakatta. Haremono ga majutsushira to, subete no Ejiputo bito ni shoujitakara de aru.
Shikashi, Shu wa Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni sareta no de, kare wa Shu ga Moose ni katarareta you ni, karera no iu koto o kikanakatta.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Asa hayaku oki, Paro no mae ni tatte, kare ni ii nasai, 'Heburu bito no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi no tami o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai.
Watashi wa, kondo wa, moromoro no wazawai o, anata to, anata no kerai to, anata no tami ni kudashi, watashi ni narabu mono ga zenchi ni nai koto o shiraserude arou.
Watashi ga moshi, te o sashinobe, ekibyou o motte, anata to, anata no tami o utte itanaraba, anata wa chi kara tachi horobosarete itade arou.
Shikashi, watashi ga anata o nagaraesaseta no wa, anata ni watashi no chikara o misaseru tame, soshite, watashi no na ga zenchi ni nobetsutaerareru tame ni hoka naranai.
Sore ni, anata wa nao, watashi no tami ni mukatte, onore o takaku shi, karera o saraseyou to shinai.
Yue ni, asu no imagoro, watashi wa osoroshiku ookina hyou o furaserude arou. Sore wa Ejiputo no kuni ga hajimatta hi kara ima made, katsute nakatta hodo no mono de aru.
Sore yue, ima, hito o yatte, anata no kachiku to, anata ga no ni motte iru subete no mono o, nogare sase nasai. Hito mo kemono mo, subete no ni atte ie ni kaeranai mono wa furu hyou ni utarete shinude arou" to' ".
Paro no kerai no uchi, Shu no kotoba o osoreru mono wa, sono shimobe to kachiku o ie ni nogaresasetaga,
Shu no kotoba o i ni tomenai mono wa, sono shimobe to kachiku o no ni nokoshite oita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata no te o ten ni mukatte sashinobe, Ejiputo no zenkoku ni watatte, Ejiputo no chi ni iru hito to kemono to hatake no subete no aomono no ue ni hyou o furase nasai".
Moose ga ten ni mukatte tsue o sashinoberuto, Shu wa kaminari to hyou o okurare, hi wa chi ni mukatte, hasekudatta. Kou shite Shu wa, hyou o Ejiputo no chi ni furasareta.
Soshite hyou ga furi, hyou no aida ni hi ga hirameki watatta. Hyou wa osoroshiku ookiku, Ejiputo zenkoku ni wa, kuni o nashite konokata, katsute nai mono de atta.
Hyou wa Ejiputo zenkoku ni watatte, subete hatake ni iru hito to kemono o utta. Hyou wa mata hatake no subete no aomono o uchi, no no moromoro no ki o ori kudaita.
Tada Isuraeru no hitobito no ita Gosen no chi ni wa, hyou ga furanakatta.
Soko de, Paro wa hito o tsukawashi, Moose to Aron o meshite itta, "Watashi wa kondo wa tsumi o okashita. Shu wa tadashiku, watashi to, watashi no tami wa warui.
Shu ni kigan shite kudasai. Kono kaminari to hyou wa mou juubun desu. Watashi wa anatagata o sarasemasu. Mohaya todomaranakute mo yoroshii".
Moose wa kare ni itta, "Watashi wa machi o deruto, sugu, Shu ni mukatte watashi no te o nobe hirogemasu. Suru to kaminari wa yami, hyou wa mohaya furanaku nari, anata wa, chi ga Shu no mono de aru koto o shiraremashou.
Shikashi, anata to anata no keraitachi wa, nao, kami naru Shu o osorenai koto o, watashi wa shitte imasu".
- - ama to oomugi wa uchitaosareta. Oomugi wa ho o dashi, ama wa hana ga saite itakara de aru.
Komugi to Superuta mugi wa okute de aru tame uchitaosarenakatta. - -
Moose wa Paro no moto o sari, machi o dete, Shu ni mukatte te o nobe hirogeta no de, kaminari to hyou wa yami, ame wa chi ni furanaku natta.
Tokoro ga Paro wa ame to hyou to kaminari ga yanda no o mite, mata mo tsumi o okashi, kokoro o katakuna ni shita. Kare mo kerai mo, sou de atta.
Sunawachi Paro wa kokoro o katakuna ni shi, Shu ga Moose ni yotte katarareta you ni, Isuraeru no hitobito o sarasenakatta.
Soko de, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Paro no moto ni iki nasai. Watashi wa kare no kokoro to sono keraitachi no kokoro o katakuna ni shita. Kore wa, watashi ga korera no shirushi o, karera no naka ni okonau tame de aru.
Mata, watashi ga Ejiputo bito o ashiratta koto, mata karera no naka ni watashi ga okonatta shirushi o, anata ga taga, ko ya mago no mimi ni kataritsutaeru tame de aru. Soshite anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shirude arou".
Moose to Aron wa Paro no moto ni itte kare ni itta, "Heburu bito no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Itsu made, anata wa, watashi ni kuppuku suru koto o kobamu no desu ka. Tami o sarasete, watashi ni tsukaesase nasai.
Moshi, watashi no tami o saraseru koto o kobamunaraba, miyo, asu, watashi wa inago o, anata no ryoudo ni hairaserude arou.
Sore wa chi no omote o ooi, hito ga chi o miru koto mo dekinai hodo ni narude arou. Soshite hyou o manukarete, nokosarete iru mono o kui tsukushi, no ni haete iru anata gata no ki o mina kui tsukusude arou.
Mata sore wa anata no ie to anata no subete no kerai no ie, oyobi, subete no Ejiputo bito no ie ni michirude arou. Kono you na koto wa, anata no chichitachi mo, mata, sofutachi mo, karera ga chijou ni atta hi kara konnichi ni itaru made, katsute mita koto no nai mono de aru' to". Soshite kare wa mi o megurashite, Paro no moto o dete itta.
Paro no keraitachi wa ou ni itta, "Itsu made, kono hito wa wareware no wana to naru no deshou. Kono hitobito o sarase, karera no kami naru Shu ni tsukaesasete wa, dou deshou. Ejiputo ga horobite shimau koto ni, mada kizukarenai no desu ka".
Soko de, Moose to Aron wa, mata, Paro no moto ni meshidasareta. Paro wa karera ni itta, "Itte, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukae nasai. Shikashi, iku mono wa daredare ka".
Moose wa itta, "Watashitachi wa osanai mono mo, oita mono mo ikimasu. Musuko mo musume mo tazusae, hitsuji mo ushi mo tsurete ikimasu. Watashitachi wa Shu no matsuri o toriokonawanakereba naranai no desukara".
Paro wa karera ni itta, "Man'ichi, watashi ga, anata gata ni kodomo o tsurete made saraseru you na koto ga areba, Shu ga anata gata to tomo ni imasu ga yoi. Anata gata wa warui takurami o shite iru.
Sore wa ikenai. Anata gata wa otoko dake itte Shu ni tsukaeru ga yoi. Sore ga, anata gata no youkyuu de atta". Karera wa, tsuini Paro no mae kara oidasareta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata no te o Ejiputo no chi no ue ni sashinobete, Ejiputo no chi ni inago o noborase, chi no subete no aomono, sunawachi, hyou ga uchi nokoshita mono o, kotogotoku tabesase nasai".
Soko de Moose wa Ejiputo no chi no ue ni, tsue o sashinobeta no de, Shu wa shuujitsu, shuuya, higashikaze o chi ni fukaserareta. Asa to natte, higashikaze wa, inago o hakonde kita.
Inago wa Ejiputo zenkoku ni nozomi, Ejiputo no zenryoudo ni todomari, sono kazu ga hanahada ooku, kono you na inago wa mae ni mo naku, mata nochi ni mo naide arou.
Inago wa chi no zenmen o ootta no de, chi wa kuraku natta. Soshite chi no subete no aomono to, hyou no uchi nokoshita kinomi o, kotogotoku tabeta no de, Ejiputo zenkoku ni watatte, ki ni mo hatake no aomono ni mo, midori no mono tote wa nani mo nokoranakatta.
Soko de, Paro wa, isoide Moose to Aron o meshite itta, "Watashi wa, anata gata no kami, Shu ni taishi, mata, anata gata ni taishite tsumi o okashimashita.
Sore de, dou ka, mou ichi do dake, watashi no tsumi o yurushite kudasai. Soshite anata gata no kami, Shu ni kigan shite, tada, kono shi o watashi kara hanaresasete kudasai".
Soko de kare wa Paro no tokoro kara dete, Shu ni kigan shita no de,
Shu wa, hanahada tsuyoi nishikaze ni kawarase, inago o fukiagete, kore o koukai ni oiyarareta no de, Ejiputo zendo ni wa hitotsu no inago mo nokoranakatta.
Shikashi, Shu ga Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni sareta no de, kare wa Isuraeru no hitobito o sarasenakatta.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Ten ni mukatte anata no te o sashinobe, Ejiputo no kuni ni, kurayami o kosase nasai. Sono kurayami wa, sawareru hodo de aru".
Moose ga ten ni mukatte te o sashinobeta no de, koi kurayami wa, Ejiputo zenkoku ni nozomi mikka ni oyonda.
Mikka no aida, hitobito wa tagai ni miru koto mo dekizu, mata dare mo sono tokoro kara tatsu mono mo nakatta. Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito ni wa, mina, sono sumu tokoro ni hikari ga atta.
Soko de Paro wa Moose o meshite itta, "Anata gata wa itte Shu ni tsukae nasai. Anata gata no kodomo mo tsurete itte mo yoroshii. Tada, anata gata no hitsuji to ushi wa nokoshite oki nasai".
Shikashi, Moose wa itta, "Anata wa, mata, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni sasageru gisei to hansai no mono o mo, watashitachi ni kudasaranakereba narimasen.
Watashitachi wa kachiku mo tsurete ikimasu. Hizume hitotsu mo nokoshimasen. Watashitachi wa, sono uchi kara totte, watashitachi no kami, Shu ni tsukaeneba narimasen. Mata watashitachi wa, sono basho ni iku made wa, nani o motte, Shu ni tsukaerubeki ka o shiranaikara desu".
Keredo mo, Shu ga Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni sareta no de, Paro wa karera o saraseyou to shinakatta.
Sore de Paro wa Moose ni itta, "Watashi no tokoro kara sari nasai. Kokoro shite, watashi no kao wa ni do to mite wa naranai. Watashi no kao o miru hi ni wa, anata no inochi wa naide arou".
Moose wa itta, "Yoku zo ooseraremashita. Watashi wa, ni do to, anata no kao o minaideshou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa, nao hitotsu no wazawai o, Paro to Ejiputo no ue ni kudashi, sono nochi, kare wa anatagata o koko kara saraserude arou. Kare ga saraseru toki, kare wa anatagata o, kotogotoku koko kara oidasude arou.
Anata wa tami no mimi ni katatte, otoko wa tonari no otoko kara, onna wa tonari no onna kara, sorezore gin no kazari, kin no kazari o koimotomesase nasai".
Shu wa tami ni Ejiputo bito no koui o esaserareta. Mata Moose sono hito wa, Ejiputo no kuni de, Paro no keraitachi no me to tami no me to ni, hanahada ooinaru mono to mieta.
Moose wa itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Mayonaka goro, watashi wa Ejiputo no naka e dete ikude arou.
Ejiputo no kuni no uchi no ui go wa, kurai ni zasuru Paro no ui go o hajime, hikiusu no nochi ni iru, hashi tame no ui go ni itaru made, mina shini, mata kachiku no ui go mo mina shinude arou.
Soshite Ejiputo zenkoku ni ooinaru sakebi ga okorude arou. Kono you na koto wa katsute naku, mata, futatabi naide arou' to.
Shikashi, subete, Isuraeru no hitobito ni mukatte wa, hito ni mukatte mo, kemono ni mukatte mo, inu sae sono shita o narasanaide arou. Kore ni yotte Shu ga Ejiputo bito to Isuraeru bito to no aida no kubetsu o sareru no o, anata gata wa shirude arou.
Korera no anata no keraitachi wa, mina, watashi no moto ni kudatte kite, hirefushite iude arou, 'Anata mo anata ni shitagau tami mo mina dete itte kudasai' to. Sono nochi, watashi wa dete ikimasu". Kare wa hageshiku ikatte Paro no moto kara dete itta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Paro wa anata gata no iu koto o kikanaide arou. Sore yue, watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni ni fushigi o mashikuwaerude arou".
Moose to Aron wa, subete korera no fushigi o Paro no mae ni ittaga, Shu ga Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni sareta no de, kare wa Isuraeru no hitobito o sono kuni kara sarasenakatta.
Shu wa Ejiputo no kuni de, Moose to Aron ni tsugete iwareta,
"Kono tsuki o anata gata no hajime no tsuki to shi, kore o toshi no shougatsu to shi nasai.
Anata gata wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu ni ii nasai, 'Kono tsuki no tooka ni onoono, sono chichi no iegoto ni kohitsuji o toranakereba naranai. Sunawachi, ichi kazoku ni kohitsuji ichitou o toranakereba naranai.
Moshi kazoku ga sukunakute ichitou no kohitsuji o tabe kirenai toki wa, ie no sugu tonari no hito to tomo ni, ninzuu ni shitagatte ichitou o tori, onoono taberu tokoro ni oujite, kohitsuji o mihakarawanakereba naranai.
Kohitsuji wa kizu no nai mono de, ichisai no osu de nakereba naranai. Hitsuji mata wa yagi no uchi kara, kore o toranakereba naranai.
Soshite kono tsuki no juu yonka made, kore o mamotte oki, Isuraeru no kaishuu wa mina, yuugure ni kore o hofuri,
Sono chi o tori, kohitsuji o shokusuru ie no iriguchi no futatsu no hashira to, kamoi ni sore o nuranakereba naranai.
Soshite sono yoru, sono niku o hi ni yaite tabe, tane irenu pan to nigana o soete tabenakereba naranai.
Nama de mo, mizu de nite mo, tabete wa naranai. Hi ni yaite, sono atama o ashi to naizou to tomo ni tabenakereba naranai.
Asa made sore o nokoshite oite wa naranai. Asa made nokoru mono wa hi de yaki tsukusanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, kou shite, sore o tabenakereba naranai. Sunawachi koshi o hiki karage, ashi ni kutsu o haki, te ni tsue o totte, isoide sore o tabenakereba naranai. Kore wa Shu no sugikoshi de aru.
Sono yoru watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni o megutte, Ejiputo no kuni ni oru hito to kemono to no, subete no ui go o uchi, mata Ejiputo no subete no kamigami ni shinpan o okonaude arou. Watashi wa Shu de aru.
Sono chi wa anata gata no oru ieie de, anata gata no tame ni, shirushi to nari, watashi wa sono chi o mite, anata gata no tokoro o sugi kosude arou. Watashi ga Ejiputo no kuni o utsu toki, wazawai ga nozonde, anatagata o horobosu koto wa naide arou.
Kono hi wa anata gata ni kinen to nari, anata gata wa Shu no matsuri to shite kore o mamori, yoyo, eikyuu no sadame to shite kore o mamoranakereba naranai.
Nanuka no aida anata gata wa tane irenu pan o tabenakereba naranai. Sono hajime no hi ni ie kara pan dane o surinozokanakereba naranai. Daiichi nichi kara dainananichi made ni, tane o ireta pan o taberu hito wa mina Isuraeru kara tatarerude arou.
Katsu, anata gata wa daiichi nichi ni seikai o, mata dainana nichi ni seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Korera no hi ni wa, nan no shigoto mo shite wa naranai. Tada, onoono no tabemono dake wa tsukuru koto ga dekiru.
Anata gata wa, tane irenu pan no matsuri o mamoranakereba naranai. Choudo, kono hi, watashi ga anata gata no gunzei o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidashitakara de aru. Sore yue, anata gata wa yoyo, eikyuu no sadame to shite, sono hi o mamoranakereba naranai.
Shougatsu ni, sono tsuki no juu yonka no yuugata ni, anata gata wa tane irenu pan o tabe, sono tsuki no nijuu ichi nichi no yuugata made tsuzukenakereba naranai.
Nanuka no aida, ie ni pan dane o oite wa naranai. Tane o ireta mono o taberu mono wa, kiryuu no takokujin de are, kuni ni umareta mono de are, subete, Isuraeru no kaishuu kara tatarerude arou.
Anata gata wa tane o ireta mono wa nani mo tabete wa naranai. Subete anata gata no sumai ni oite tane irenu pan o tabenakereba naranai' ".
Soko de Moose wa Isuraeru no chourou o mina yobiyosete itta, "Anata gata wa isoide kazokugoto ni hitotsu no kohitsuji o tori, sono sugikoshi no kemono o hofuranakereba naranai.
Mata hito taba no hisopu o totte hachi no chi ni hitashi, hachi no chi o, kamoi to iriguchi no futatsu no hashira ni tsukenakereba naranai. Asa made anata gata wa, hitori mo ie no to no soto ni dete wa naranai.
Shu ga iki megutte Ejiputo bito o utareru toki, kamoi to iriguchi no futatsu no hashira ni aru chi o mite, Shu wa sono iriguchi o sugikoshi, horobosu mono ga, anata gata no ie ni haitte, utsu no o yurusarenaide arou.
Anata gata wa kono koto o, anata to shison no tame no sadame to shite, eikyuu ni mamoranakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, Shu ga yakusoku sareta you ni, anata gata ni tamawaru chi ni itaru toki, kono gishiki o mamoranakereba naranai.
Moshi, anata gata no kodomotachi ga 'Kono gishiki wa donna imi desu ka' to tounaraba,
Anata gata wa ii nasai, 'Kore wa Shu no sugikoshi no gisei de aru. Ejiputo bito o utareta toki, Ejiputo ni ita Isuraeru no hitobito no ie o sugikoshi te, wareware no ie o sukuwareta no de aru' ". Tami wa kono toki, fushite reihai shita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa itte sono you ni shita. Sunawachi Shu ga Moose to Aron ni meijirareta you ni shita.
Yonaka ni natte Shu wa Ejiputo no kuni no, subete no ui go, sunawachi kurai ni zasuru Paro no ui go kara, chika no hito ya ni oru horyo no ui go ni itaru made, mata, subete no kachiku no ui go o utareta.
Sore de Paro to sono kerai oyobi Ejiputo bi to wa mina yoru no uchi ni okiagari, Ejiputo ni ooinaru sakebi ga atta. Shinin no nai ie ga nakattakara de aru.
Soko de Paro wa yoru no uchi ni Moose to Aron o yobiyosete itta, "Anata gata to Isuraeru no hitobito wa tatte, watashi no tami no naka kara dete iku ga yoi. Soshite anata gata no iu you ni, itte Shu ni tsukae nasai.
Anata gata no iu you ni hitsuji to ushi to o totte iki nasai. Mata, watashi o shukufuku shi nasai".
Kou shite Ejiputo bi to wa tami o sekitatete, sumiyaka ni kuni o saraseyou to shita. Karera wa "Wareware wa mina shinu" to omottakara de aru.
Tami wa mada pan dane o irenai neriko o, kobachi no mama kimono ni tsutsunde kata ni otta.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Moose no kotoba no you ni shite, Ejiputo bito kara gin no kazari, kin no kazari, mata ifuku o koimotometa.
Shu wa tami ni Ejiputo bito no jou o esase, karera no koimotometa mono o ataesaserareta. Kou shite karera wa Ejiputo bito no mono o ubaitotta.
Sate, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Ramesesu o shuttatsu shite Sukote ni mukatta. Onna to kodomo o nozoite toho no danshi wa yakurokujuu mannin de atta.
Mata ooku no irimajitta gunshuu oyobi hitsuji, ushi nado hijou ni ooku no kachiku mo karera to tomo ni nobotta.
Soshite karera wa Ejiputo kara tazusaete deta neriko o motte, tane irenu pan no kashi o yaita. Mada pan dane o irete inakattakara de aru. Sore wa karera ga Ejiputo kara oidasarete todokooru koto ga dekizu, mata, nani no shokuryou o mo totonoete inakattakara de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo ni sunde ita aida wa, yonhyaku sanjuu nen de atta.
Yonhyaku sanjuu nen no owari to natte, choudo sono hi ni, Shu no zengun wa Ejiputo no kuni o deta.
Kore wa karera o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidasu tame ni Shu ga nezu no ban o sareta yoru de atta. Yue ni kono yoru, subete no Isuraeru no hitobito wa yoyo, Shu no tame ni nezu no ban o shinakereba naranai.
Shu wa Moose to Aron to ni iwareta, "Sugikoshi no matsuri no sadame wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi, ihoujin wa dare mo kore o tabete wa naranai.
Shikashi, onoono ga kane de katta shimobe wa, kore ni katsurei o itte nochi, kore o tabesaseru koto ga dekiru.
Kari zumai no mono to, yatoinin to wa, kore o tabete wa naranai.
Hitotsu no ie de kore o tabenakereba naranai. Sono niku o sukoshi mo ie no soto ni mochidashite wa naranai. Mata, sono hone o otte wa naranai.
Isuraeru no zenkaishuu wa kore o mamoranakereba naranai.
Kiryuu no gaikokujin ga anata no moto ni todomatte ite, Shu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o mamorou to suru toki wa, sono danshi wa mina katsurei o ukete nochi, chikazuite kore o mamoru koto ga dekiru. Sou sureba kare wa kuni ni umareta mono no you ni narude arou. Shikashi, mukatsurei no mono wa dare mo kore o tabete wa naranai.
Kono rippou wa kuni ni umareta mono ni mo, anata gata no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru gaikokujin ni mo douitsu de aru".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, mina kono you ni shi, Shu ga Moose to Aron ni meijirareta you ni shita.
Choudo sono hi ni, Shu wa Isuraeru no hitobito o, sono gundan ni shitagatte Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidasareta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi de, subete no ui go, sunawachi subete hajime ni tai o hiraita mono o, hito de are, kemono de are, mina, watashi no tame ni seibetsu shinakereba naranai. Sore wa watashi no mono de aru".
Moose wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa, Ejiputo kara, dorei no ie kara deru kono hi o oboe nasai. Shu ga tsuyoi te o motte, anatagata o koko kara michibikidasarerukara de aru. Tane o ireta pan o tabete wa naranai.
Anata gata wa Abibu no tsuki no kono hi ni deru no de aru.
Shu ga anata ni ataeruto, anata no senzotachi ni chikawareta Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no chi, chichi to mitsu to no nagareru chi ni, michibikiirerareru toki, anata wa kono tsuki ni kono gishiki o mamoranakereba naranai.
Nanuka no aida tane irenu pan o tabe, nanuka me ni wa Shu ni matsuri o shinakereba naranai.
Tane irenu pan o nanuka no aida tabenakereba naranai. Tane o ireta pan o anata no tokoro ni oite wa naranai. Mata, anata no chiku no doko de mo, anata no tokoro ni pan dane o oite wa naranai.
Sono hi, anata no ko ni tsugete ii nasai, 'Kore wa watashi ga Ejiputo kara deru toki ni, Shu ga watashi ni nasareta koto no tame de aru'.
Soshite, kore o, te ni tsukete, shirushi to shi, me no aida ni oite kinen to shi, Shu no rippou o anata no kuchi ni okanakereba naranai. Shu ga tsuyoi te o motte, anata o Ejiputo kara michibikidasarerukara de aru.
Sore yue, anata wa kono sadame o nennen sono kisetsu ni mamoranakereba naranai.
Shu ga anata to anata no senzotachi ni chikawareta you ni, anata o Kanan bito no chi ni michibiite, sore o anata ni tamawaru toki,
Anata wa, subete hajime ni tai o hiraita mono, oyobi anata no kachiku no umu ui go wa, kotogotoku Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi, sorera no dansei no mono wa Shu ni kiseshimenakereba naranai.
Mata, subete, roba no, hajimete tai o hiraita mono wa, kohitsuji o motte, aganawanakereba naranai. Moshi, aganawanainaraba, sono kubi o oranakereba naranai. Anata no kora no uchi, subete, otoko no ui go wa, aganawanakereba naranai.
Nochi ni natte, anata no ko ga 'Kore wa donna imi desu ka' to tounaraba, kore ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Shu ga tsuyoi te o motte, wareware o Ejiputo kara, dorei no ie kara michibikidasareta.
Sono toki Paro ga, katakuna de, wareware o sarasenakatta tame, Shu wa Ejiputo no kuni no ui go o, hito no ui go mo kachiku no ui go mo, kotogotoku korosareta. Sore yue, hajimete tai o hiraku dansei no mono wa mina, Shu ni gisei to shite sasageruga, watashi no kodomo no uchi no ui go wa, subete aganau no de aru'.
Soshite, kore o te ni tsukete, shirushi to shi, me no aida ni oite oboe to shinakereba naranai. Shu ga tsuyoi te o motte, wareware o Ejiputo kara michibikidasaretakara de aru".
Sate, Paro ga tami o saraseta toki, Perishite bito no kuni no michi wa chikakattaga, kami wa karera o sore ni michibikarenakatta. Tami ga tatakai o mireba kuite Ejiputo ni kaerude arouto, kami wa omowaretakara de aru.
Kami wa koukai ni sou arano no michi ni, tami o mawarasareta. Isuraeru no hitobito wa busou shite Ejiputo no kuni o dete, nobotta.
Sono toki Moose wa Yosefu no igai o tazusaete ita. Yosefu ga, "Kami wa kanarazu anatagata o kaerimirarerude arou. Sono toki, anata gata wa, watashi no igai o tazusaete, koko kara nobotte ikanakereba naranai" to itte, Isuraeru no hitobito ni kataku chikawasetakara de aru.
Kou shite karera wa sarani Sukote kara susunde, arano no hashi ni aru Etamu ni shukuei shita.
Shu wa karera no mae ni ikare, hiru wa kumo no hashira o motte karera o michibiki, yoru wa hi no hashira o motte karera o tera shi, hiru mo yoru mo karera o susumi ikaserareta.
Hiru wa kumo no hashira, yoru wa hi no hashira ga, tami no mae kara hanarenakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsuge, hikikaeshite, Migudoru to umi to no aida ni aru Pihahirote no mae, Baaruzepon no mae ni shukuei sase nasai. Anata gata wa sore ni mukatte, umi no katawara ni shukuei shinakereba naranai.
Paro wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsuite, 'Karera wa sono chi de mayotte iru. Arano wa karera o tojikomete shimatta' to iude arou.
Watashi ga Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni surukara, Paro wa karera no ato o oude arou. Watashi wa Paro to sono subete no gunzei o yabutte homare o e, Ejiputo bito ni watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiraserude arou". Karera wa sono you ni shita.
Tami no nigesatta koto ga, Ejiputo no ou ni tsutaerareta no de, Paro to sono keraitachi to wa, tami ni taisuru kangae o kaete itta, "Wareware wa naze kono you ni Isuraeru o sarasete, wareware ni tsukaesasenai you ni shita no de arou".
Sore de Paro wa sensha o totonoe, mizukara sono tami o hikii,
Mata, erinuki no sensha roppyaku to, Ejiputo no subete no sensha oyobi subete no shikisha tachi o hikiita.
Shu ga Ejiputo no ou Paro no kokoro o katakuna ni sareta no de, kare wa Isuraeru no hitobito no ato o otta. Isuraeru no hitobito wa ikiyouyou to deta no de aru.
Ejiputo bi to wa karera no ato o oi, Paro no subete no uma to sensha oyobi sono kihei to gunzei to wa, Baaruzepon no mae ni aru Pihahirote no atari de, umi no katawara ni shukuei shite iru karera ni oitsuita.
Paro ga chikayotta toki, Isuraeru no hitobito wa me o agete Ejiputo bito ga karera no ato ni susunde kite iru no o mite, hijou ni osoreta. Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni mukatte sakebi,
Katsu Moose ni itta, "Ejiputo ni haka ga nai no de, arano de shinaseru tame ni, watashitachi o tazusae dashita no desu ka. Naze watashitachi o Ejiputo kara michibikidashite, konna ni suru no desu ka.
Watashitachi ga Ejiputo de anata ni tsugete, 'Watashitachi o sutete oite, Ejiputo bito ni tsukaesasete kudasai' to itta no wa, kono koto de wa arimasen ka. Arano de shinu yori mo Ejiputo bito ni tsukaeru hou ga, watashitachi ni wa yokatta no desu".
Moose wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa osorete wa naranai. Kataku tatte, Shu ga kyou, anata gata no tame ni nasareru sukui o mi nasai. Kyou, anata gata wa Ejiputo bito o miruga, mohaya eikyuu ni, ni do to karera o minaide arou.
Shu ga anata gata no tame ni tatakawarerukara, anata gata wa mokushite i nasai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa, naze watashi ni mukatte sakebu no ka. Isuraeru no hitobito ni katatte karera o susumi ikase nasai.
Anata wa tsue o age, te o umi no ue ni sashinobete sore o wake, Isuraeru no hitobito ni umi no naka no kawaita chi o ikase nasai.
Watashi ga Ejiputo bito no kokoro o katakuna ni surukara, karera wa sono ato o otte wa irude arou. Kou shite watashi wa Paro to sono subete no gunzei oyobi sensha to kihei to o uchiyabutte homare o eyou.
Watashi ga Paro to sono sensha to sono kihei to o uchiyabutte homare o eru toki, Ejiputo bi to wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shirude arou".
Kono toki, Isuraeru no butai no mae ni iku kami no tsukai wa utsutte karera no ushiro ni itta. Kumo no hashira mo karera no mae kara utsutte karera no ushiro ni tachi,
Ejiputo bito no butai to Isuraeru bito no butai to no aida ni kita no de, soko ni kumo to yami ga ari yomosugara, kare to kore to chikazuku koto naku, yoru ga sugita.
Moose ga te o umi no ue ni sashinobeta no de, Shu wa yomosugara tsuyoi higashikaze o motte umi o shirizokase, umi o rikuchi to sare, mizu wa wakareta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa umi no naka no kawaita chi o okonattaga, mizu wa karera no migi to hidari ni, kaki to natta.
Ejiputo bi to wa otte kite, Paro no subete no uma to sensha to kihei to wa, karera no ato ni tsuite umi no naka ni haitta.
Akatsuki no sarani, Shu wa hi to kumo no hashira no uchi kara Ejiputo bito no gunzei o mioroshite, Ejiputo bito no gunzei o midashi,
Sono sensha no wa o kishirasete, susumu no ni omoku sareta no de, Ejiputo bi to wa itta, "Wareware wa Isuraeru o hanarete nigeyou. Shu ga karera no tame ni Ejiputo bito to tatakau".
Sono toki Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata no te o umi no ue ni sashinobete, mizu o Ejiputo bito to, sono sensha to kihei to no ue ni nagare kaerase nasai".
Moose ga te o umi no ue ni sashinoberuto, yoake ni natte umi wa itsu mo no nagare ni kaeri, Ejiputo bi to wa kore ni mukatte nigetaga, Shu wa Ejiputo bito o umi no naka ni nagekomareta.
Mizu wa nagare kaeri, Isuraeru no ato o otte umi ni haitta sensha to kihei oyobi Paro no subete no gunzei o ooi, hitori mo nokoranakatta.
Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa umi no naka no kawaita chi o okonattaga, mizu wa karera no migi to hidari ni, kaki to natta.
Kono you ni, Shu wa kono hi Isuraeru o Ejiputo bito no te kara sukuwareta. Isuraeru wa Ejiputo bito ga umibe ni shinde iru no o mita.
Isuraeru wa mata, Shu ga Ejiputo bito ni okonawareta ooinaru miwaza o mita. Sore de tami wa Shu o osore, Shu to sono shimobe Moose to o shinjita.
Soko de Moose to Isuraeru no hitobito wa, kono uta o Shu ni muka tte utatta. Karera wa uta tte itta, "Shu ni mukatte watashi wa utaou, kare wa kagayakashiku mo kachi o erareta, kare wa uma to norite o umi ni nagekomareta.
Shu wa watashi no chikaramata uta, watashi no sukui to narareta, kare koso watashi no kami, watashi wa kare o tataeru, kare wa watashi no chichi no kami, watashi wa kare o agameru.
Shu wa iku sabi to, sono na wa Shu.
Kare wa Paro no sensha to sono gunzei to o umi ni nagekomareta, sono sugureta shikisha tachi wa koukai ni shizunda.
Oomizu wa karera o ooi, karera wa ishi no you ni fuchi ni kudatta.
Shu yo, anata no migi no te wa chikara o motte eikou ni kagayaku, Shu yo, anata no migi no te wa teki o uchikudaku.
Anata wa ooinaru ikou o motte, anata ni tachimukau mono o uchiyaburareta. Anata ga ikari o hasserareruto, karera wa, wara no you ni yaki tsukusareta.
Anata no hana no iki ni yotte mizu wa tsumikasanari, nagare wa tsutsumi to natte tachi, oomizu wa umi no monaka ni korikatamatta.
Teki wa itta, 'Watashi wa oi iki, oitsuite, bundori mono o wakachi torou, watashi no yokubou o karera ni yotte mitasou, tsurugi o nukou, watashi no te wa karera o horobosou'.
Anata ga iki o fukareruto, umi wa karera o ooi, karera wa namari no you ni, oomizu no naka ni shizunda.
Shu yo, kamigami no uchi, dare ga anata ni kuraberareyou ka, dare ga anata no you ni, sei ni shite sakae aru mono, ho mubeku shite osorubeki mono, kusu shiki waza o okonau mono de arou ka.
Anata ga migi no te o noberareruto, chi wa karera o nonda.
Anata wa, aganawareta tami o megumi o motte michibiki, michikara o motte, anata no sei naru sumai ni tomonawareta.
Moromoro no tami wa kiite furue, Perishite no juumin wa kurushimi ni osowareta.
Edomu no zokuchoura wa, odoroki, Moabu no shuchoura wa, wananaki, Kanan no juumin wa, mina tokesatta.
Osore to, ononoki to wa karera ni nozomi, miude no ooinaru yue ni, karera wa ishi no you ni mokushita, Shu yo, anata no tami no toori sugiru made, anata ga kaitorareta tami no toori sugiru made.
Anata wa karera o michibiite, anata no shigyou no yama ni uerareru. Shu yo, kore koso anata no sumai to shite, mizukara tsukurareta tokoro, Shu yo, mite ni yotte taterareta seijo.
Shu wa eien ni subeosamerareru".
Paro no uma ga, sono sensha oyobi kihei to tomo ni umi ni hairuto, Shu wa umi no mizu o karera no ue ni nagare kaera saretaga, Isuraeru no hitobito wa umi no naka no kawaita chi o okonatta.
Sono toki, Aron no ane, onna yogensha Miriamu wa Tanbarin o te ni tori, onnatachi mo mina Tanbarin o totte, odorinagara, sono ato ni shitagatte dete kita.
Soko de Miriamu wa karera ni washite utatta, "Shu ni mukatte utae, kare wa kagayakashiku mo kachi o erareta, kare wa uma to norite o umi ni nagekomareta".
Sate, Moose wa Isuraeru o koukai kara tabidataseta. Karera wa Shuru no arano ni iri, mikka no aida arano o aruitaga, mizu o enakatta.
Karera wa Mera ni tsuitaga, Mera no mizu wa nigakute nomu koto ga dekinakatta. Sore de, sono tokoro no na wa Mera to yobareta.
Toki ni, tami wa Moose ni tsubuyaite itta, "Watashitachi wa nani o nomu no desu ka".
Moose wa Shu ni sakenda. Shu wa kare ni ichipon no ki o shimesareta no de, sore o mizu ni nageireruto, mizu wa amaku natta. Sono tokoro de Shu wa tami no tame ni sadame to, okite o taterare, karera o kokoromite,
Iwareta, "Anata ga, moshi anata no kami, Shu no koe ni yoku kikishitagai, sono me ni tadashii to mirareru koto o okonai, sono imashime ni mimi o katamuke, subete no sadame o mamorunaraba, watashi wa, katsute Ejiputo bito ni kudashita yamai o hitotsu mo anata ni kudasanaide arou. Watashi wa Shu de atte, anata o iyasu mono de aru".
Kou shite karera wa Erimu ni tsuita. Soko ni wa mizu no izumi juuni to, natsume yashi no ki nanajuupon ga atta. Sono tokoro de karera wa mizu no hotori ni shukuei shita.
Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa Erimu o shuppatsu shi, Ejiputo no chi o dete ni kagetsume no juu go nichi ni, Erimu to Shinai to no aida ni aru Shin no arano ni kitaga,
Sono arano de Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa, Moose to Aron ni tsubuyaita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa karera ni itta, "Wareware wa Ejiputo no chi de, niku no nabe no katawara ni zashi, akiru hodo pan o tabete ita toki ni, Shu no te ni kakatte shinde itara yokatta. Anata gata wa, wareware o kono arano ni michibikidashite, zenkaishuu o gashi saseyou to shite iru".
Sono toki Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no tame ni, ten kara pan o furaseyou. Tami wa dete hibi no bun o higoto ni atsumenakereba naranai. Kou shite karera ga watashi no rippou ni shitagau ka dou ka o kokoromiyou.
Muikame ni wa, karera ga toriireta mono o chouri suruto, sore wa higoto ni atsumeru mono no ni bai arude arou".
Moose to Aron wa, Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ni itta, "Yuugure ni wa, anata gata wa, Ejiputo no chi kara anatagata o michibikidasareta no ga, Shu de aru koto o shirude arou.
Mata, asa ni wa, anata gata wa Shu no eikou o mirude arou. Shu wa anata gata ga Shu ni mukatte tsubuyaku no o kikaretakara de aru. Anata gata wa, ittai wareware o nanimono to shite, wareware ni mukatte tsubuyaku no ka".
Moose wa mata itta, "Shu wa yuugure ni wa anata gata ni niku o ataete tabesase, asa ni wa pan o ataete akitaraserarerude arou. Shu wa anata ga taga, Shu ni mukatte tsubuyaku tsubuyaki o kikaretakara de aru. Ittai wareware wa nanimono na no ka. Anata gata no tsubuyaku no wa, wareware ni mukatte de naku, Shu ni mukatte de aru".
Moose wa Aron ni itta, "Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa Shu no mae ni chikazuki nasai. Shu ga anata gata no tsubuyaki o kikaretakara de aru' to".
Sore de Aron ga Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu ni katatta toki, karera ga arano no hou o nozomuto, miyo, Shu no eikou ga kumo no uchi ni arawarete ita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito no tsubuyaki o kiita. Karera ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa yuu ni wa niku o tabe, asa ni wa pan ni akitarirude arou. Sou shite watashi ga anata gata no kami, Shu de aru koto o shirude arou' to".
Yuube ni naruto, uzura ga tonde kite shukuei o ootta. Mata, asa ni naruto, shukuei no shuui ni tsuyu ga furita.
Sono furita tsuyu ga kawakuto, arano no men ni wa, usui uroko no you na mono ga ari, choudo chi ni musubu usui shimo no you de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa sore o mite tagai ni itta, "Kore wa nan de arou". Karera wa sore ga nan de aru no ka shiranakattakara de aru. Moose wa karera ni itta, "Kore wa Shu ga anata gata no shokumotsu to shite tamawaru pan de aru.
Shu ga meijirareru no wa kou de aru, 'Anata gata wa, onoono sono taberu tokoro ni shitagatte sore o atsume, anata gata no ninzuu ni shitagatte, hitori ichi Omeru zutsu, onoono sono tenmaku ni oru mono no tame ni sore o tori nasai' to".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa sono you ni shite, aru mono wa ooku, aru mono wa sukunaku atsumeta.
Shikashi, Omeru de sore o hakatte miruto, ooku atsumeta mono ni mo amarazu, sukunaku atsumeta mono ni mo fusoku shinakatta. Onoono sono taberu tokoro ni shitagatte atsumete ita.
Moose wa karera ni itta, "Dare mo asa made sore o nokoshite oite wa naranai".
Shikashi karera wa Moose ni kikishitagawanaide, aru mono wa asa made sore o nokoshite oitaga, mushi ga tsuite kusaku natta. Moose wa karera ni mukatte ikatta.
Karera wa, onoono sono taberu tokoro ni shitagatte, asagoto ni sore o atsumetaga, hi ga atsuku naruto sore wa toketa.
Muikame ni wa, karera wa ni bai no pan, sunawachi hitori ni ni Omeru o atsumeta. Soko de, kaishuu no choutachi wa mina kite, Moose ni tsugetaga,
Moose wa karera ni itta, "Shu no katarareta no wa kou de aru, 'Asu wa Shu no seiansokunichi de yasumi de aru. Kyou, yakou to suru mono o yaki, niyou to suru mono o ni nasai. Nokotta mono wa mina asa made takuwaete hozon shi nasai' to".
Karera wa Moose no meijita you ni, sore o asa made hozon shitaga, kusaku narazu, mata mushi mo tsukanakatta.
Moose wa itta, "Kyou, sore o tabe nasai. Kyou wa Shu no ansokunichi de arukara, kyou wa no de sore o erarenaide arou.
Muika no aida wa sore o atsumenakereba naranai. Nanuka me wa ansokunichi de arukara, sono hi ni wa naide arou".
Tokoro ga tami no uchi ni wa, nanuka me ni dete atsumeyou to shita mono ga attaga, erarenakatta.
Soko de Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, itsu made watashi no imashime to, rippou to o mamoru koto o kobamu no ka.
Miyo, Shu wa anata gata ni ansokunichi o ataerareta. Yue ni muikame ni wa, futsu ka bun no pan o anata gata ni tamawaru no de aru. Onoono sono tokoro ni todomari, nanuka me ni wa sono tokoro kara dete wa naranai".
Kou shite tami wa nanuka me ni yasunda.
Isuraeru no ie wa sono mono no na o mana to yonda. Sore wa Koendoro no mi no you de shiroku, sono aji wa mitsu o ireta senbei no you de atta.
Moose wa itta, "Shu no meijirareru koto wa kou de aru, 'Sore o ichi Omeru anata gata no shison no tame ni takuwaete oki nasai. Sore wa watashi ga, anatagata o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita toki, arano de anata gata ni tabesaseta pan o karera ni misaseru tame de aru' to".
Soshite Moose wa Aron ni itta "Hitotsu no tsubo o tori, mana ichi Omeru o sono naka ni ire, sore o Shu no mae ni oite, shison no tame ni takuwae nasai".
Soko de Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni, Aron wa sore o akashi no hako no mae ni oite takuwaeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa hito no sumu chi ni tsuku made yonjuu nen no aida mana o tabeta. Sunawachi, karera wa Kanan no chi no sakai ni itaru made mana o tabeta.
Ichi Omeru wa ichi Epa no juubun no ichi de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa, Shu no inochi ni shitagatte, Shin no arano o shuppatsu shi, tabiji o kasanete, Repidemu ni shukuei shitaga, soko ni wa tami no nomu mizu ga nakatta.
Sore de, tami wa Moose to arasotte itta, "Watashitachi ni nomu mizu o kudasai". Moose wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa naze watashi to arasou no ka, naze Shu o kokoromiru no ka".
Tami wa sono tokoro de mizu ni kawaki, Moose ni tsubuyaite itta, "Anata wa naze watashitachi o Ejiputo kara michibikidashite, watashitachi o, kodomo ya kachiku to issho ni, kawaki ni yotte shinaseyou to suru no desu ka".
Kono toki Moose wa Shu ni sakende itta, "Watashi wa kono tami o dou sureba yoi no deshou. Karera wa, ima ni mo, watashi o ishi de uchikorosou to shite imasu".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa tami no mae ni susumi iki, Isuraeru no chouroutachi o tomonai, anata ga Nairu kawa o utta, tsue o te ni totte iki nasai.
Miyo, watashi wa Horebu no iwa no ue de anata no mae ni tatsude arou. Anata wa iwa o uchi nasai. Mizu ga sore kara dete, tami wa sore o nomu koto ga dekiru". Moose wa Isuraeru no chouroutachi no me no mae de, sono you ni okonatta.
Soshite kare wa sono tokoro no na o Massa, mata Meriba to yonda. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga arasotta yue, mata karera ga "Shu wa watashitachi no uchi ni orareru ka dou ka" to itte Shu o kokoromitakara de aru.
Toki ni Amareku ga kite, Isuraeru to Repidemu de tatakatta.
Moose wa Yoshua ni itta, "Wareware no tame ni hito o erabi, dete Amareku to tatakai nasai. Watashi wa asu kami no tsue o te ni totte, oka no itadaki ni tatsude arou".
Yoshua wa Moose ga kare ni itta you ni shi, Amareku to tatakatta. Moose to Aron oyobi Horu wa oka no itadaki ni nobotta.
Moose ga te o agete iruto Isuraeru wa kachi, te o sageruto Amareku ga katta.
Shikashi Moose no te ga omoku natta no de, Aron to Horu ga ishi o totte, Moose no ashimoto ni okuto, kare wa sono ue ni zashita. Soshite hitori wa kochira ni, hitori wa achira ni ite, Moose no te o sasaeta no de, kare no te wa nichibotsu made sagaranakatta.
Yoshua wa, tsurugi ni kakete Amareku to sono tami o uchi yabutta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kore o shomotsu ni shirushite kinen to shi, sore o Yoshua no mimi ni ire nasai. Watashi wa amegashita kara Amareku no kioku o kanzen ni keshisarude arou".
Moose wa hitotsu no saidan o kizuite sono na o "Shu wa waga hata" to yonda.
Soshite Moose wa itta, "Shu no hata ni mukatte te o ageru, Shu wa yoyo Amareku to tatakawareru".
Sate, Moose no shuuto, Midean no saishi Etero wa, kami ga Moose to, mitami Isuraeru to ni sareta subete no koto, Shu ga Isuraeru o Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta koto o kiita.
Sore de Moose no shuuto, Etero wa, saki ni okurikaesarete ita Moose no tsuma Chippora to,
Sono futari no ko to o tsurete kita. Sono hitori no na wa Gerushomu to itta. Moose ga, "Watashi wa gaikoku de kiryuusha to natte iru" to ittakara de aru.
Hoka no hitori no na wa Eriezeru to itta. "Watashi no chichi no kami wa watashi no tasuke de atte, Paro no tsurugi kara watashi o sukuwareta" to ittakara de aru.
Kou shite Moose no shuuto, Etero wa, Moose no saishi o tomonatte, arano ni iki, kami no yama ni shukuei shite iru Moose no tokoro ni kita.
Sono toki, aru hito ga Moose ni itta, "Goran nasai. Anata no shuuto, Etero wa, anata no tsuma to sono futari no ko o tsurete, anata no tokoro ni koraremasu".
Soko de Moose wa shuuto o demukaete, mi o kagame, kare ni kuchizuke shite, tagai ni anpi o toi, tomo ni tenmaku ni haitta.
Soshite Moose wa, Shu ga Isuraeru no tame ni, Paro to Ejiputo bito to ni sareta subete no koto, michi de deatta subete no kurushimi, mata Shu ga karera o sukuwareta koto o, shuuto ni monogatatta no de,
Etero wa Shu ga Isuraeru o Ejiputo bito no te kara sukuidashite, moromoro no megumi o tamawatta koto o yorokonda.
Soshite Etero wa itta, "Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa anatagata o Ejiputo bito no te to, Paro no te kara sukuidashi, tami o Ejiputo bito no te no shita kara sukuidasareta.
Ima koso watashi wa shitta. Jitsu ni karera wa Isuraeru bito ni mukatte kouman ni furumattaga, Shu wa arayuru kamigami ni masatte ooini imasu koto o".
Soshite Moose no shuuto Etero wa hansai to gisei o kami ni sonae, Aron to Isuraeru no chouroutachi mo mi nakite, Moose no shuuto to tomo ni kami no mae de shokuji o shita.
Akuruhi Moose wa zashite tami o sabaitaga, tami wa asa kara ban made, Moose no mawari ni tatte ita.
Moose no shuuto wa, kare ga subetetami ni shite iru koto o mite, itta, "Anata ga tami ni shite iru kono koto wa nan desu ka. Anata hitori ga zashi, tami wa mina asa kara ban made, anata no mawari ni tatte iru no wa naze desu ka".
Moose wa shuuto ni itta, "Tami ga kami ni ukagaou to shite, watashi no tokoro ni kurukara desu.
Karera wa koto ga areba, watashi no tokoro ni kimasu. Watashi wa sougo no aida o sabaite, kami no sadame to hanketsu o shiraseru no desu".
Moose no shuuto wa kare ni itta, "Anata no shite iru koto wa yoku nai.
Anata mo, anata to issho ni iru kono tami mo, kanarazu tsukare haterude arou. Kono koto wa anata ni omo sugirukara, hitori de suru koto ga dekinai.
Ima watashi no iu koto o kiki nasai. Watashi wa anata ni jogen suru. Dou ka kami ga anata to tomo ni imasu you ni. Anata wa tami no tame ni kami no mae ni ite, jiken o kami ni nobe nasai.
Anata wa karera ni sadame to hanketsu o oshie, karera no ayumubeki michi to, nasubeki koto o karera ni shirase nasai.
Mata, subete no tami no uchi kara, yuunou na hito de, kami o osore, seijitsu de fugi no ri o nikumu hito o erabi, sore o tami no ue ni tatete, sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, gojuunin no chou, juunin no chou to shi nasai.
Heiso wa karera ni tami o sabakase, daijijiken wa subete anata no tokoro ni motte kosase, shoujiken wa subete karera ni sabakase nasai. Kou shite anata o migaru ni shi, anata to tomo ni karera ni, ni o owase nasai.
Anata ga, moshi kono koto o okonai, kami mo mata anata ni meijirarerunaraba, anata wa taeru koto ga deki, kono tami mo mata, mina yasunjite sono tokoro ni kaeru koto ga dekiyou".
Moose wa shuuto no kotoba ni shitagai, subete iwareta you ni shita.
Sunawachi, Moose wa subete no Isuraeru no uchi kara yuunou na hito o erande, tami no ue ni chou to shite tate, sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, gojuunin no chou, juunin no chou to shita.
Heiso wa karera ga tami o sabaki, muzukashii jiken wa Moose ni motte kitaga, chiisai jiken wa subete karera mizukara sabaita.
Kou shite Moose wa shuuto o okurikaeshita no de, sono kuni ni kaette itta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, Ejiputo no chi o dete nochi san tsukime no sono hi ni, Shinai no arano ni haitta.
Sunawachi karera wa Repidemu o shuttatsu shite Shinai no arano ni iri, arano ni shukuei shita. Isuraeru wa sono tokoro de yama no mae ni shukuei shita.
Sate, Moose ga kami no moto ni noboruto, Shu wa yama kara kare o yonde iwareta, "Kono you ni, Yakobu no ie ni ii, Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsuge nasai,
'Anata gata wa, watashi ga Ejiputo bito ni shita koto to, anatagata o washi no tsubasa ni nosete watashi no tokoro ni kosaseta koto o mita.
Sore de, moshi anata ga taga, makoto ni watashi no koe ni kikishitagai, watashi no keiyaku o mamorunaraba, anata gata wa subete no tami ni masatte, watashi no takara to narude arou. Zenchi wa watashi no shoyuu dakara de aru.
Anata gata wa watashi ni taishite saishi no kuni to nari, mata sei naru tami to narude arou'. Kore ga anata no Isuraeru no hitobito ni katarubeki kotoba de aru".
Sore de Moose wa itte tami no chouroutachi o yobi, Shu ga meijirareta korera no kotoba o, subete sono mae ni nobeta no de,
Tami wa mina tomo ni kotaete itta, "Wareware wa Shu ga iwareta koto o, mina okonaimasu". Moose wa tami no kotoba o Shu ni tsugeta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa koi kumo no uchi ni atte, anata ni nozomude arou. Sore wa watashi ga anata to kataru no o tami ni kikasete, karera ni nagaku anata o shinjisaseru tame de aru". Moose wa tami no kotoba o Shu ni tsugeta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa tami no tokoro ni itte, kyou to asu, karera o kiyome, karera ni sono ifuku o arawase,
Mikkame made ni sonaesase nasai. Mikkame ni Shu ga, subete no tami no me no mae de, Shinai san ni kudarukara de aru.
Anata wa tami no tame ni, shuui ni sakai o moukete ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa chuui shite, yama ni noborazu, mata, sono kyoukai ni furenai you ni shi nasai. Yama ni fureru mono wa kanarazu korosarerude arou.
Te o sore ni furete wa naranai. Fureru mono wa kanarazu ishi de uchikorosareru ka, shasatsu sarerude arou. Kemono de mo hito de mo ikiru koto wa dekinai'. Rappa ga nagaku hibiita toki, karera wa yama ni noboru koto ga dekiru" to.
Soko de Moose wa yama kara tami no tokoro ni kudari, tami o kiyometa. Karera wa sono ifuku o aratta.
Moose wa tami ni itta, "Mikkame made ni sonae o shi nasai. Onna ni chikazuite wa naranai".
Mikkame no asa to natte, kaminari to, inazuma to atsui kumo to ga, yama no ue ni ari, rappa no oto ga, hanahada takaku hibiita no de, shukuei ni oru tami wa mina furueta.
Moose ga tami o kami ni awaseru tame ni, shukuei kara michibikidashita no de, karera wa yama no fumoto ni tatta.
Shinai san wa zenzan kemutta. Shu ga hi no naka ni atte, sono ue ni kudararetakara de aru. Sono kemuri wa, kamado no kemuri no you ni tachinobori, zenzan hageshiku furueta.
Rappa no oto ga, iyoiyo takaku natta toki, Moose wa katari, kami wa, kaminari o motte, kare ni kotaerareta.
Shu wa Shinai san no itadaki ni kudarareta. Soshite Shu ga Moose o yama no itadaki ni mesareta no de, Moose wa nobotta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kuda tte itte tami o imashime nasai. Tami ga oshiyabutte, Shu no tokoro ni kite, miyou to shi, ooku no mono ga shinu koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru.
Shu ni chikazuku saishitachi ni mo mata, sono mi o kiyomesase nasai. Shu ga karera o utsu koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru".
Moose wa Shu ni itta, "Tami wa Shinai san ni noboru koto wa dekinaideshou. Anata ga watashitachi o imashimete 'Yama no mawari ni sakai o mouke, sore o kiyomeyo' to iwaretakara desu".
Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Ike, kudare. Soshite anata wa Aron to tomo ni nobotte ki nasai. Tadashi, saishitachi to tami to ga, oshiyabutte Shu no tokoro ni noboru koto no nai you ni shi nasai. Shu ga karera o utsu koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru".
Moose wa tami no tokoro ni kudatte itte karera ni tsugeta.
Kami wa kono subete no kotoba o katatte iwareta.
"Watashi wa anata no kami, Shu de atte, anata o Ejiputo no chi, dorei no ie kara michibikidashita mono de aru.
Anata wa watashi no hoka ni, nanimono o mo kami to shite wa naranai.
Anata wa jibun no tame ni, kizanda zou o tsukutte wa naranai. Ue wa ten ni aru mono, shita wa chi ni aru mono, mata chi no shita no mizu no naka ni aru mono no, donna katachi o mo tsukutte wa naranai.
Sore ni hirefushite wa naranai. Sore ni tsukaete wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu de aru watashi wa, netamu kami de arukara, watashi o nikumu mono wa, chichi no tsumi o ko ni mukuite, san shi dai ni oyoboshi,
Watashi o aishi, watashi no imashime o mamoru mono ni wa, megumi o hodokoshite, chiyo ni itarude arou.
Anata wa, anata no kami, Shu no na o, midari ni tonaete wa naranai. Shu wa, mina o midari ni tonaeru mono o, basshinaide wa okanaide arou.
Ansokunichi o oboete, kore o sei to seyo.
Muika no aida hataraite anata no subete no waza o seyo.
Nanuka me wa anata no kami, Shu no ansoku de arukara, nan no waza o mo shite wa naranai. Anata mo anata no musuko, musume, shimobe, hashi tame, kachiku, mata anata no mon no uchi ni iru takoku no hito mo sou de aru.
Shu wa muika no uchi ni, ten to chi to umi to, sono naka no subete no mono o tsukutte, nanuka me ni yasumaretakara de aru. Sore de Shu wa ansokunichi o shukufuku shite sei to sareta.
Anata no chichi to haha o uyamae. Kore wa, anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi de, anata ga nagaku ikiru tame de aru.
Anata wa koroshite wa naranai.
Anata wa kan'in shite wa naranai.
Anata wa nusunde wa naranai.
Anata wa rinjin ni tsuite, gishou shite wa naranai.
Anata wa rinjin no ie o musabotte wa naranai. Rinjin no tsuma, shimobe, hashi tame, ushi, roba, mata subete rinjin no mono o musabotte wa naranai".
Tami wa mina, kaminari to, inazuma to, rappa no oto to, yama no kemutte iru no to o mita. Tami wa osoreononoki, tooku hanarete tatta.
Karera wa Moose ni itta, "Anata ga watashitachi ni katatte kudasai. Watashitachi wa kikishitagaimasu. Kami ga watashitachi ni katararenu you ni shite kudasai. Sore de nakereba, watashitachi wa shinudeshou".
Moose wa tami ni itta, "Osorete wa naranai. Kami wa anatagata o kokoromiru tame, mata sono osore o anata gata no me no mae ni oite, anata gata ga tsumi o okasanai you ni suru tame ni nozomareta no de aru".
Soko de, tami wa tooku hanarete tattaga, Moose wa kami no orareru koi kumo ni chikazuite itta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni kou ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa, watashi ga ten kara anata gata to kataru no o mita.
Anata gata wa watashi to narabete, nani o mo tsukutte wa naranai. Gin no kamigami mo, kin no kamigami mo, anata gata no tame ni, tsukutte wa naranai.
Anata wa watashi no tame ni tsuchi no saidan o kizuki, sono ue ni anata no hansai, shuuonsai, hitsuji, ushi o sasagenakereba naranai. Watashi no na o oboesaseru subete no tokoro de, watashi wa anata ni nozonde, anata o shukufuku surude arou.
Anata ga moshi watashi ni ishi no saidan o tsukurunaraba, kiriishi de kizuite wa naranai. Anata ga moshi, nomi o sore ni aterunaraba, sore o kegasukara de aru.
Anata wa kaidan ni yotte, watashi no saidan ni nobotte wa naranai. Anata no kakushitokoro ga, sono ue ni arawareru koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru'.
Kore wa anata ga karera no mae ni shimesubeki okite de aru.
Anata ga Heburu bito de aru dorei o kau toki wa, roku nen no aida tsukaesase, nana nenme ni wa mushou de jiyuu no mi to shite sarasenakereba naranai.
Kare ga moshi dokushin dekitanaraba, dokushin de saranakereba naranai. Moshi tsuma o motte itanaraba, sono tsuma wa kare to tomo ni saranakereba naranai.
Moshi sono shujin ga kare ni tsuma o ataete, kare ni otokonoko mata onnanoko o undanaraba, tsuma to sono kotomo wa shujin no mono to nari, kare wa dokushin de saranakereba naranai.
Dorei ga moshi 'Watashi wa, watashi no shujin to, watashi no tsuma to kodomo o aishimasu. Watashi wa jiyuu no mi to natte saru koto o konomimasen' to meigen surunaraba,
Sono shujin wa kare o kami no moto ni tsurete iki, to aruiha hashira no tokoro ni tsurete itte, shujin wa, kiri de kare no mimi o sashitoosanakereba naranai. Sou sureba kare wa itsu made mo kore ni tsukaerude arou.
Moshi hito ga sono musume o onnadorei to shite urunaraba, sono musume wa otoko dorei ga saru you ni satte wa naranai.
Kanojo ga moshi kanojo o jibun no mono to sadameta shujin no ki ni iranai toki wa, sono shujin wa kanojo ga, aganawareru koto o, kore ni yurusanakereba naranai. Kare wa kore o azamuita no de arukara, kore o takoku no tami ni uru kenri wa nai.
Kare ga moshi kanojo o jibun no ko no mono to sadamerunaraba, kore o musume no you ni atsukawanakereba naranai.
Kare ga, tatoi, hoka ni onna o metoru koto ga atte mo, mae no onna ni shokumotsu to ifuku o ataeru koto to, sono fuufu no michi to o taesasete wa naranai.
Kare ga moshi kono mittsu o okonawanainaraba, kanojo wa kane o tsugunawazu ni saru koto ga dekiru.
Hito o utte shinaseta mono wa, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Shikashi, hito ga takumu koto o shinai no ni, kami ga kare no te ni hito o watasareru koto no aru toki wa, watashi wa anata no tame ni hitotsu no tokoro o sadameyou. Kare wa sono tokoro e nogareru koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi hito ga moshi, koto sarani sono rinjin o azamuite korosu toki wa, sono mono o watashi no saidan kara de mo, toraete itte korosanakereba naranai.
Jibun no chichi mata wa haha o utsu mono wa, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Hito o kadowakashita mono wa, kore o utte ite mo, nao kare no te ni atte mo, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Jibun no chichi mata wa haha o no roumono wa, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Hito ga tagai ni arasoi, sono hitori ga ishi mata wa, kobushi de aite o utta toki, kore ga shinanaide toko ni tsuki,
Futatabi okiagatte, tsue ni sugari, soto o aruku you ni narunaraba, kore o utta mono wa, yurusarerude arou. Tada sono shigoto o yasunda sonshitsu o tsugunai, katsu kore ni juubun chiryou sasenakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga tsue o motte, jibun no otoko dorei mata wa onnadorei o uchi, sono te no shita ni shinunaraba, kanarazu basserarenakereba naranai.
Shikashi, kare ga moshi tsuitachi ka, futsu ka ikinobirunaraba, sono hito wa basserarenai. Dorei wa kare no zaisan dakara de aru.
Moshi hito ga tagai ni arasotte, migomotta onna o uchi, kore ni ryuuzan saserunaraba, hoka no gai ga nakutomo, kare wa kanarazu sono onna no otto no motomeru bakkin o kaserare, saibannin no sadameru toori ni shiharawanakereba naranai.
Shikashi, hoka no gai ga aru toki wa, inochi ni wa inochi,
Me ni wa me, ha ni wa ha, te ni wa te, ashi ni wa ashi,
Yakikizu ni wa yakikizu, kizu ni wa kizu, uchikizu ni wa uchikizu o motte tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga jibun no otoko dorei no katame, mata wa onnadorei no katame o uchi, kore o tsubusunaraba, sono me no tame ni kore o jiyuu no mi to shite sarasenakereba naranai.
Mata, moshi sono otoko dorei no ichipon no ha, mata wa sono onna dorei no ichipon no ha o uchiotosunaraba, sono ha no tame ni kore o jiyuu no mi to shite sarasenakereba naranai.
Moshi ushi ga otoko mata wa onna o tsuite korosunaraba, sono ushi wa kanarazu ishi de uchikorosarenakereba naranai. Sono niku wa tabete wa naranai. Shikashi, sono ushi no mochinushi wa tsumi ga nai.
Ushi ga moshi izen kara tsuku kuse ga atte, sono mochinushi ga chuui sarete mo, kore o mamori okanakatta tame ni, otoko mata wa onna o koroshitanaraba, sono ushi wa ishi de uchikorosare, sono mochinushi mo mata korosarenakereba naranai.
Kare ga moshi, a ga nai no kane o kaseraretanaraba, subete kaserareta hodo no mono o, inochi no tsugunai ni shiharawanakereba naranai.
Otokonoko o tsuite mo, onnanoko o tsuite mo, kono sadame ni shitagatte shochi sarenakereba naranai.
Ushi ga moshi otoko dorei mata wa onnadorei o tsukunaraba, sono shujin ni gin sanjuu shikeru o shiharawanakereba naranai. Mata sono ushi wa ishi de uchikorosarenakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga ana o aketa mama ni oki, aruiha ana o hotte kore ni ooi o shinai tame ni, ushi mata wa, roba ga kore ni ochikomu koto ga areba,
Ana no mochinushi wa kore o tsugunai, kane o sono mochinushi ni shiharawanakereba naranai. Shikashi, sono shinda kemono wa kare no mono to narude arou.
Aru hito no ushi ga, moshi tanin no ushi o tsuite korosunaraba, karera wa sono ikite iru ushi o utte, sono atai o wake, mata sono shinda mono o mo wakenakereba naranai.
Aruiha sono ushi ga izen kara tsuku kuse no aru koto ga shirarete iru no ni, sono mochinushi ga kore o mamori okanakattanaraba, sono hito wa kanarazu sono ushi no tame ni ushi o motte tsugunawanakereba naranai. Shikashi, sono shinda kemono wa kare no mono to narude arou.
Moshi hito ga ushi mata wa hitsuji o nusunde, kore o koroshi, aruiha kore o urunaraba, kare wa ichitou no ushi no tame ni gotou no ushi o motte, ichitou no hitsuji no tame ni yontou no hitsuji o motte tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshinusu bito ga ana o akete wa iru no o mite, kore o utte koroshita toki wa, sono hito ni wa chi o nagashita tsumi wa nai.
Kare wa kanarazu tsugunawanakereba naranai. Moshi kare ni nani mo nai toki wa, kare wa sono nusunda mono no tame ni mi o urarerude arou. Shikashi hi ga nobotte nochi naraba, sono hito ni chi o nagashita tsumi ga aru.
Moshi sono nusunda mono ga nao ikite, kare no temoto ni areba, sore wa ushi, roba, hitsuji no izure ni seyo, kore o ni bai ni shite tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga hatake mata wa budou hatake no mono o kuwase, sono kachiku o hanatte tanin no hatake no mono o kuwaseta toki wa, jibun no hatake no mottomo yoi mono to, budou hatake no mottomo yoi mono o motte, kore o tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi hi ga dete, ibara ni utsuri, tsumiageta mugi taba, mata wa ta ho, mata wa hatake o yaitanaraba, sono hi o moyashita mono wa, kanarazu kore o tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga kinsen mata wa buppin no hokan o rinjin ni takushi, sore ga rinjin no ie kara nusumareta toki, sononusu bito ga mitsukeraretanaraba, kore o ni bai ni shite tsugunawasenakereba naranai.
Moshinusu bito ga mitsukerarenakereba, ie no shujin o kami no mae ni tsurete kite, kare ga rinjin no mochimono ni te o kaketa ka dou ka o, tashikamenakereba naranai.
Ushi de are, roba de are, hitsuji de are, ifuku de are, aruiha donna ushinatta mono de are, sore ni tsuite iiarasoi ga okori 'Kore ga sore desu' to iu mono ga areba, sono souhou no iibun o, kami no mae ni mochidasanakereba naranai. Soshite kami ga yuuzai to sadamerareru mono wa, sore o ni bai ni shite sono aite ni tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga, roba, mata wa ushi, mata wa hitsuji, mata wa donna kachiku de mo, sore o rinjin ni azukete, sore ga shinu ka, kizutsuku ka, aruiha ubaisararete mo, sore o mita mono ga nakereba,
Souhou no aida ni, rinjin no mochimono ni te o kakenakatta to iu chikai ga, Shu no mae ni nasarenakereba naranai. Sou sureba, mochinushi wa kore o ukeire, rinjin wa tsugunau ni oyobanai.
Keredo mo, sore ga masashiku jibun no tokoro kara nusumareta toki wa, sono mochinushi ni tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi sore ga saki korosareta toki wa, sore o shouko to shite motte kurunaraba, sono saki korosareta mono wa tsugunau ni oyobanai.
Moshi hito ga rinjin kara kachiku o karite, sore ga kizutsuki, mata wa shinu baai, sono mochinushi ga sore to tomo ni inai toki wa, kanarazu kore o tsugunawanakereba naranai.
Moshi sono mochinushi ga sore to tomo ni oreba, sore o tsugunau ni oyobanai. Moshi sore ga chingari shita mono naraba, sono ka chin o sore ni atenakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga mada kon'yaku shinai shojo o sasotte, kore to netanaraba, kare wa kanarazu kore ni hanayomeryou o haratte, tsuma to shinakereba naranai.
Moshi sono chichi ga kore o sono hito ni ataeru koto o kataku kobamunaraba, kare wa shojo no hanayomeryou ni ataru hodo no kane o harawanakereba naranai.
Mahoutsukai no onna wa, kore o ikashite oite wa naranai.
Subete kemono o okasu mono wa, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Shu no hoka, ta no kamigami ni gisei o sasageru mono wa, tachi horobosarenakereba naranai.
Anata wa kiryuu no takokujin o kurushimete wa naranai. Mata, kore o shi etagete wa naranai. Anata gata mo, katsute Ejiputo no kuni de, kiryuu no takokujin de attakara de aru.
Anata gata wa subete kafu, mata wa koji o nayamashite wa naranai.
Moshi anata ga karera o nayamashite, karera ga watashi ni mukatte sakebunaraba, watashi wa kanarazu sono sakebi o kikude arou.
Soshite watashi no ikari wa moetachi, tsurugi o motte anatagata o korosude arou. Anata gata no tsuma wa kafu to nari, anata gata no kodomotachi wa koji to narude arou.
Anata ga, tomo ni oru watashi no tami no mazushii mono ni kane o kasu toki wa, kore ni taishite kanekashi no you ni natte wa naranai. Kore kara rishi o totte wa naranai.
Moshi rinjin no uwagi o shitsu ni torunaraba, hi no iru made ni sore o kaesanakereba naranai.
Kore wa kare no mi o oou, tada hitotsu no mono, kare no hada no tame no kimono dakara de aru. Kare wa nani o kite neru koto ga dekiyou. Kare ga watashi ni mukatte sakebunaraba, watashi wa kore ni kikude arou. Watashi wa awaremi fukaikara de aru.
Anata wa kami o nonoshitte wa naranai. Mata tami no tsukasa o norotte wa naranai.
Anata no yutaka na kokumotsu to, afureru sake to o sasageru ni, tameratte wa naranai. Anata no ui go o, watashi ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata, anata no ushi to hitsuji o mo douyou ni shinakereba naranai. Nanuka no aida sono haha to tomo ni oite, youkame ni sore o watashi ni, sasagenakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, watashi ni taishite sei naru tami to naranakereba naranai. Anata gata wa, no de saki korosareta mono no niku o tabete wa naranai. Sore wa inu ni nageataenakereba naranai.
Anata wa itsuwari no uwasa o iifurashite wa naranai. Anata wa akunin to te o tazusaete, akui no aru shounin ni natte wa naranai.
Anata wa tasuu ni shitagatte aku o okonatte wa naranai. Anata wa soshou ni oite, tasuu ni shitagatte katayori, seigi o mageru you na shougen o shite wa naranai.
Mata mazushii hito o sono soshou ni oite, magete kabatte wa naranai.
Moshi, anata ga teki no ushi mata wa, roba no mayotte iru no ni au toki wa, kanarazu kore o kare no tokoro ni tsurete itte, kisanakereba naranai.
Moshi anata o nikumu mono no roba ga, sono nimotsu no shita ni taorefushite iru no o miru toki wa, kore o misutete okanai you ni ki o tsuke, kanarazu sono hito ni te o kashite, kore o okosanakereba naranai.
Anata wa mazushii mono no soshou ni oite, saiban o magete wa naranai.
Anata wa itsuwari koto ni toozakaranakereba naranai. Anata wa tsumi no nai mono to tadashii mono to o koroshite wa naranai. Watashi wa akunin o gi to suru koto wa naikara de aru.
Anata wa wairo o totte wa naranai. Wairo wa hito no me o kuramashi, tadashii mono no jiken o mo mage saserukara de aru.
Anata wa kiryuu no takokujin o shi etagete wa naranai. Anata gata wa Ejiputo no kuni de kiryuu no takokujin de atta no de, kiryuu no takokujin no kokoro o shitte irukara de aru.
Anata wa roku nen no aida, chi ni tane o maki, sono sanbutsu o toriireru koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi, nana nenme ni wa, kore o yasumasete, tagayasazu ni okanakereba naranai. Sou sureba, anata no tami no mazushii mono ga kore o tabe, sono nokori wa no no kemono ga taberu koto ga dekiru. Anata no budou hatake mo, oribu hatake mo douyou ni shinakereba naranai.
Anata wa muika no aida, shigoto o shi, nanuka me ni wa yasumanakereba naranai. Kore wa anata no ushi oyobi, roba ga yasumi o e, mata anata no hashi tame no ko oyobi kiryuu no takokujin o yasumaseru tame de aru.
Watashi ga, anata gata ni itta subete no koto ni kokoro o tome nasai. Ta no kamigami no na o tonaete wa naranai. Mata, kore o anata no kuchibiru kara kikoesasete wa naranai.
Anata wa nen ni san do, watashi no tame ni matsuri o okonawanakereba naranai.
Anata wa tane irenu pan no matsuri o mamoranakereba naranai. Watashi ga, anata ni meijita you ni, Abibu no tsuki no sadame no toki ni nanuka no aida, tane irenu pan o tabenakereba naranai. Sore wa sono tsuki ni anata ga Ejiputo kara detakara de aru. Dare mo, munashite de watashi no mae ni dete wa naranai.
Mata, anata ga hatake ni maite eta mono no kinrou no hatsuho o sasageru kariire no matsuri to, anata no kinrou no mi o hatake kara toriireru nen no owari ni, toriire no matsuri o okonawanakereba naranai.
Danshi wa mina, nen ni san do, Shu naru kami no mae ni denakereba naranai.
Anata wa watashi no gisei no chi o, tane o ireta pan to tomo ni sasagete wa naranai. Mata, watashi no matsuri no shibou o yokuasa made nokoshite oite wa naranai.
Anata no tochi no hatsuho no mottomo yoi mono o, anata no kami, Shu no ie ni tazusaete konakereba naranai. Anata wa koyagi o, sono haha no chichi de nite wa naranai.
Miyo, watashi wa tsukai o anata no mae ni tsukawashi, anata o michi de mamorase, watashi ga sonaeta tokoro ni michibikaserude arou.
Anata wa sono mae ni tsutsushimi, sono kotoba ni kikishitagai, kare ni somuite wa naranai. Watashi no na ga kare no uchi ni aru yue ni, kare wa anata gata no toga o yurusanaide arou.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga kare no koe ni yoku kikishitagai, subete watashi ga kataru koto o okonaunaraba, watashi wa anata no teki o teki to shi, anata no ada o ada to surude arou.
Watashi no tsukai wa anata no mae ni itte, anata o Amori bi to, Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Kanan bi to, Hibi bi to, oyobi Ebusu bito no tokoro ni michibiki, watashi wa karera o horobosude arou.
Anata wa karera no kamigami o ogande wa naranai. Kore ni tsukaete wa naranai. Mata karera no okonai ni naratte wa naranai. Anata wa karera o mattaku uchitaoshi, sono ishi no hashira o uchikudakanakereba naranai.
Anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukaenakereba naranai. Sou sureba, watashi wa anata gata no pan to mizu o shukushi, anata gata no uchi kara yamai o nozokisarude arou.
Anata no kuni no uchi ni wa ryuuzan suru onna mo naku, funin no onna mo naku, watashi wa anata no hi no kazu o michi taraserude arou.
Watashi wa anata no saki ni, watashi no osore o tsukawashi, anata ga iku tokoro no tami o, kotogotoku uchi yaburi, subete no teki ni, sono se o anata no hou e mukesaserude arou.
Watashi wa mata, kumabachi o anata no saki ni tsukawasude arou. Kore wa Hibi bi to, Kanan bi to, oyobi Hete bito o anata no mae kara oiharaude arou.
Shikashi, watashi wa karera o ichi nen no uchi ni wa, anata no mae kara oiharawanaide arou. Tochi ga are sutare, no no kemono ga mashite, anata o gaisuru koto no nai tame de aru.
Watashi wa jojo ni karera o anata no mae kara oiharaude arou. Anata wa, tsuini fue hirogatte, kono chi o tsugu you ni narude arou.
Watashi wa koukai kara Perishite bito no umi ni itaru made to, arano kara Yufurate kawa ni itaru made o, anata no ryouiki to shi, kono chi ni sunde iru mono o anata no te ni watasude arou. Anata wa karera o anata no mae kara oiharaude arou.
Anata wa karera, oyobi karera no kamigami to keiyaku o musunde wa naranai.
Karera wa anata no kuni ni sunde wa naranai. Karera ga anata o izanatte, watashi ni taishite tsumi o okasaseru koto no nai tame de aru. Moshi, anata ga karera no kami ni tsukaerunaraba, sore wa kanarazu anata no wana to narude arou".
Mata, Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa Aron, Nadabu, Abiu oyobi Isuraeru no nanajuunin no chouroutachi to tomo ni, Shu no moto ni nobotte ki nasai. Soshite anata gata wa tooku hanarete reihai shi nasai.
Tada Moose hitori ga Shu ni chikazuki, ta no mono wa chikazuite wa naranai. Mata, tami mo kare to tomo ni nobotte wa naranai".
Moose wa kite, Shu no subete no kotoba to, subete no okite to o tami ni tsugeta. Tami wa mina douon ni kotaete itta, "Watashitachi wa Shu no ooserareta kotoba o mina, okonaimasu".
Soshite Moose wa Shu no kotoba o, kotogotoku kakishirushi, asa hayaku okite yama no fumoto ni saidan o kizuki, Isuraeru no juu ni buzoku ni shitagatte juu ni no hashira o tate,
Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no wakamonotachi o tsukawashite, Shu ni hansai o sasagesase, mata shuuonsai to shite oushi o sasagesaseta.
Sono toki Moose wa sono chi no nakaba o totte, hachi ni ire, mata, sono chi no nakaba o saidan ni sosogi kaketa.
Soshite keiyaku no sho o totte, kore o tami ni yomikikaseta. Suruto, karera wa kotaete itta, "Watashitachi wa Shu ga ooserareta koto o mina, juujun ni okonaimasu".
Soko de Moose wa sono chi o totte, tami ni sosogi kake, soshite itta, "Miyo, kore wa Shu ga korera no subete no kotoba ni motozuite, anata gata to musubareru keiyaku no chi de aru".
Kou shite Moose wa Aron, Nadabu, Abiu oyobi Isuraeru no nanajuunin no chouroutachi to tomo ni nobotte itta.
Soshite, karera ga Isuraeru no kami o miruto, sono ashi no shita ni wa Safaia no shikiishi no gotoki mono ga ari, sumi wataru oozora no you de atta.
Kami wa Isuraeru no hitobito no shidousha tachi o te ni kakerarenakatta no de, karera wa kami o mite, nomikui shita.
Toki ni Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Yama ni nobori, watashi no tokoro ni kite, soko ni i nasai. Karera o oshieru tame ni, watashi ga rippou to imashime to o kakishirushita ishi no ita o anata ni sazukerude arou".
Soko de Moose wa juusha Yoshua to tomo ni tachiagari, Moose wa kami no yama ni nobotta.
Kare wa chouroutachi ni itta, "Watashitachi ga anata gata no tokoro ni kaette kuru made, koko de matte i nasai. Miyo, Aron to Horu to ga, anata gata to tomo ni irukara, koto aru mono wa, dare de mo karera no tokoro e iki nasai".
Kou shite Moose wa yama ni nobottaga, kumo wa yama o ootte ita.
Shu no eikou ga Shinai san no ue ni todomari, kumo wa muika no aida, yama o ootte itaga, nanuka me ni Shu wa kumo no naka kara Moose o yobareta.
Shu no eikou wa yama no itadaki de, moeru hi no you ni Isuraeru no hitobito no me ni mietaga,
Moose wa kumo no naka ni haitte, yama ni nobotta. Soshite Moose wa yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, yama ni ita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsugete, watashi no tame ni sasagemono o tazusaete kosase nasai. Subete, kokoro kara yorokonde suru mono kara, watashi ni sasageru mono o uketori nasai.
Anata gata ga karera kara uketorubeki sasagemono wa kore de aru. Sunawachi kin, gin, seidou,
Aoito, murasakiito, hi ito, ama no nenshi, yagi no keito,
Akane some no ohitsuji no kawa, jugon no kawa, akashiyazai,
Tomoshi abura, sosogi abura to koubashii kunkou no tame no kouryou,
Shima menou, Epode to muneate ni hameru houseki.
Mata, karera ni watashi no tame ni seijo o tsukurase nasai. Watashi ga karera no uchi ni sumu tame de aru.
Subete anata ni shimesu makuya no kata oyobi, sono moromoro no utsuwa no kata ni shitagatte, kore o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Karera wa akashiyazai de hako o tsukuranakereba naranai. Nagasa wa ni kyubito han, haba wa ichi kyubito han, takasa wa ichi kyubito han.
Anata wa junkin de kore o oowanakereba naranai. Sunawachi naigai tomo ni kore o ooi, sono ue no shuui ni kin no kazari fuchi o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Mata kin no kanyontsu o ite, sono yon sumi ni toritsukenakereba naranai. Sunawachi futatsu no kan o kochiragawa ni, futatsu no kan o achiragawa ni tsukenakereba naranai.
Mata akashiyazai no sao o tsukuri, kin de kore o oowanakereba naranai.
Soshite sono sao o hako no sokumen no kan ni tooshi, sore de hako o katsuganakereba naranai.
Sao wa hako no kan ni sashite oki, sore o nukihanashite wa naranai.
Soshite sono hako ni, watashi ga anata ni ataeru akashi no ita o osamenakereba naranai.
Mata junkin no shokuzaisho o tsukuranakereba naranai. Nagasa wa ni kyubito han, haba wa ichi kyubito han.
Mata futatsu no kin no kerubimu o tsukuranakereba naranai. Kore o uchimono tsukuri to shi, shokuzaisho no ryouhashi ni okanakereba naranai.
Hitotsu no kerubu o kono hashi ni, hitotsu no kerubu o kano hashi ni tsukuri, kerubimu o shokuzaisho no ichibu to shite sono ryouhashi ni tsukuranakereba naranai.
Kerubimu wa tsubasa o takaku nobe, sono tsubasa o motte shokuzaisho o ooi, kao wa tagai ni mukaiai, kerubimu no kao wa shokuzaisho ni mukawanakereba naranai.
Anata wa shokuzaisho o hako no ue ni oki, hako no naka ni wa watashi ga sazukeru akashi no ita o osamenakereba naranai.
Sono tokoro de watashi wa anata ni ai, shokuzaisho no ue kara, akashi no hako no ue ni aru futatsu no kerubimu no aida kara, Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni, watashi ga meijiyou to suru moromoro no koto o, anata ni katarude arou.
Anata wa mata akashiyazai no tsukue o tsukuranakereba naranai. Nagasa wa ni kyubito, haba wa ichi kyubito, takasa wa ichi kyubito han.
Junkin de kore o ooi, shuui ni kin no kazari fuchi o tsukuri,
Mata sono shuui ni tehaba no san o tsukuri, sono san no shuui ni kin no kazari fuchi o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Mata, sono tame ni kin no kanyontsu o tsukuri, sono yontsu no ashi no sumi yon kasho ni sono kan o toritsukenakereba naranai.
Kan wa san no waki ni tsukete, tsukue o katsugu sao o ireru tokoro to shinakereba naranai.
Mata akashiyazai no sao o tsukuri, kin de kore o ooi, sore o motte, tsukue o katsuganakereba naranai.
Mata, sono sara, nyuukou o moru hai oyobi kansai o sosogu tame no bin to hachi o tsukuri, korera wa junkin de tsukuranakereba naranai.
Soshite tsukue no ue ni wa sonae no pan o oite, tsune ni watashi no mae ni aru you ni shinakereba naranai.
Mata junkin no shokudai o tsukuranakereba naranai. Shokudai wa uchimono tsukuri to shi, sono dai, miki, gaku, fushi, hana o hitotsu ni tsuranarasenakereba naranai.
Mata muitsu no eda o sono waki kara dasase, shokudai no mittsu no eda o kono gawa kara, shokudai no mittsu no eda o kano gawa kara dasasenakereba naranai.
A mendou no hana no katachi o shita mittsu no gaku ga, sorezore fushi to hana o motte hitotsu no eda ni ari, mata, a mendou no hana no katachi o shita mittsu no gaku ga, sorezore fushi to hana o motte hoka no eda ni aru you ni shi, shokudai kara deru muitsu no eda o, mina sono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Mata, shokudai no miki ni wa, a mendou no hana no katachi o shita yontsu no gaku o tsuke, sono gaku ni wa sorezore fushi to hana o motase nasai.
Sunawachi futatsu no eda no shita ni hitotsu no fushi o toritsuke, tsugi no futatsu no eda no shita ni hitotsu no fushi o toritsuke, sarani tsugi no futatsu no eda no shita ni hitotsu no fushi o toritsuke, shokudai no miki kara deru muitsu no eda ni, mina sono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Sorera no fushi to eda o hitotsu ni tsurane, kotogotoku junkin no uchimono tsukuri ni shinakereba naranai.
Mata, sore no tomoshibi zara o nanatsu tsukuri, sono tomoshibi zara ni hi o tomoshite, sono zenpou o tera sasenakereba naranai.
Sono shinkiri basami to, shin torizara wa junkin de tsukuranakereba naranai.
Sunawachi junkin ichi taranto de shokudai to, korera no moromoro no utsuwa to ga tsukurarenakereba naranai.
Soshite anata ga yama de shimesareta kata ni shitagai, chuui shite kore o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata juumai no maku o motte makuya o tsukuranakereba naranai. Sunawachi ama no nenshi, aoito, murasakiito, hi ito de maku o tsukuri, takumi na waza o motte, sore ni kerubimu o oridasanakereba naranai.
Maku no nagasa wa, onoono nijuu hachi kyubito, maku no haba wa, onoono yon kyubito de, maku wa mina onaji sunpou de nakereba naranai.
Sono maku gomai o tagai ni tsurane awase, mata ta no gomai no maku o mo tagai ni tsurane awasenakereba naranai.
Sono ichiren no hashi ni aru maku no fuchi ni aoiro no chi o tsuke, mata ta no ichiren no hashi ni aru maku no fuchi ni mo sono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Anata wa, sono ichimai no maku ni chi gojuu o tsuke, mata ta no ichiren no maku no hashi ni mo chi gojuu o tsuke, sono chi o tagai ni aimukawasenakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata kin no wa gojuu o tsukuri, sono wa de maku o tagai ni tsurane awasete hitotsu no makuya ni shinakereba naranai.
Mata makuya o oou tenmaku no tame ni yagi no keito de maku o tsukuranakereba naranai. Sunawachi maku juu ichimai o tsukuri,
Sono ichimai no maku no nagasa wa sanjuu kyubito, sono ichimai no maku no haba wa yon kyubito de, sono juu ichimai no maku wa onaji sunpou de nakereba naranai.
Soshite, sono maku gomai o hitotsu ni tsurane awase, mata sono maku rokumai o hitotsu ni tsurane awasete, sono rokumaime no maku o tenmaku no mae de orikasanenakereba naranai.
Mata sono ichiren no hashi ni aru maku no fuchi ni chi gojuu o tsuke, ta no ichiren no maku no fuchi ni mo chi gojuu o tsuke nasai.
Soshite seidou no wa gojuu o tsukuri, sono wa o chi ni kake, sono tenmaku o tsurane awasete hitotsu ni shi,
Sono tenmaku no maku no nokori no tareru bubun, sunawachi sono nokori no han maku o makuya no ushiro ni taresasenakereba naranai.
Soshite tenmaku no maku no take de amaru mono no, kochira no kyubito to, achira no kyubito to wa, makuya o oou you ni, sono ryougawa no kochira to achira to ni taresasenakereba naranai.
Mata, akane zome no ohitsuji no kawa de tenmaku no ooito, jugon no kawa de sono ue ni kakeru ooi to o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Anata wa makuya no tame ni, akashiyazai de tatewaku o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Waku no nagasa o juu kyubito, waku no haba o ichi kyubito han to shi,
Wakugoto ni futatsu no hozo o tsukutte, kare to kore to o kuiawasase, makuya no subete no waku ni kono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Anata wa makuya no tame ni waku o tsukuri, minamigawa no tame ni waku nijuu to shi,
Sono nijuu no waku no shita ni gin no za yonjuu o tsukutte, kono waku no shita ni, sono futatsu no hozo no tame ni futatsu no za o oki, kano waku no shita ni mo sono futatsu no hozo no tame ni futatsu no za o okanakereba naranai.
Mata makuya no ta no gawa, sunawachi kitagawa no tame ni mo waku nijuu o tsukuri,
Sono gin no za yonjuu o tsukutte, kono waku no shita ni, futatsu no za o oki, kano waku no shita ni mo futatsu no za o okanakereba naranai.
Mata makuya no ushiro, sunawachi nishigawa no tame ni waku muitsu o tsukuri,
Makuya no ushiro no futatsu no sumi no tame ni waku futatsu o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Korera wa shita de kasanariai, onajiku sono itadaki de mo daiichi no kan made kasanariau you ni shi, sono futatsutomo sono you ni shinakereba naranai. Sorera wa futatsu no sumi no tame ni moukeru mono de aru.
Kou shite sono waku wa youtsu, sono gin no za wa juu roku, kono waku no shita ni futatsu no za, kano waku no shita ni mo futatsu no za o okanakereba naranai.
Mata akashiyazai de yokogi o tsukuranakereba naranai. Sunawachi makuya no kono gawa no waku no tame ni itsutsu,
Mata makuya no ka no gawa no waku no tame ni yokogi itsutsu, makuya no ushiro no nishigawa no waku no tame ni yokogi itsutsu o tsukuri,
Waku no mannaka ni aru chuuou no yokogi wa hashi kara hashi made tooru you ni shinakereba naranai.
Soshite sono waku o kin de ooi, mata yokogi o toosu sono kan o kin de tsukuri, mata, sono yokogi o kin de oowanakereba naranai.
Kou shite anata wa yama de shimesareta youshiki ni shitagatte makuya o tatenakereba naranai.
Mata aoito, murasakiito, hi ito, ama no nenshi de taremaku o tsukuri, takumi na waza o motte, sore ni kerubimu o oridasanakereba naranai.
Soshite kin de ootta yontsu no akashiyazai no hashira no kin no koma ni kore o kake, sono hashira wa yontsu no gin no za no ue ni suenakereba naranai.
Sono taremaku no wa o koma ni kake, sono taremaku no uchi ni akashi no hako o osame nasai. Sono taremaku wa anata gata no tame ni seijo to shiseijo to o hedate wakerude arou.
Mata shiseijo ni aru akashi no hako no ue ni shokuzaisho o okanakereba naranai.
Soshite sono taremaku no soto ni tsukue o oki, makuya no minamigawa ni, tsukue ni mukaiawasete shokudai o okanakereba naranai. Tadashi tsukue wa kitagawa ni okanakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata tenmaku no iriguchi no tame ni aoito, murasakiito, hi ito, ama no nenshi de, iro toridori ni otta tobari o tsukuranakereba naranai.
Anata wa sono tobari no tame ni akashiyazai no hashira itsutsu o tsukuri, kore o kin de ooi, sono koma o kin de tsukuri, mata sono hashira no tame ni seidou no za itsutsu o ite tsukuranakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata akashiyazai de saidan o tsukuranakereba naranai. Nagasa go kyubito, haba go kyubito no shikaku de, takasa wa san kyubito de aru.
Sono yon sumi no ue ni sono ichibu to shite sore no tsuno o tsukuri, seidou de saidan o oowanakereba naranai.
Mata hai o toru tsubo, juunou, hachi, nikumata, hizara o tsukuri, sono utsuwa wa mina seidou de tsukuranakereba naranai.
Mata saidan no tame ni seidou no ami zaiku no koushi o tsukuri, sono yon sumi de, ami no ue ni seidou no kan o yontsu toritsukenakereba naranai.
Sono ami o saidan no debari no shita ni toritsuke, kore o saidan no takasa no nakaba ni tassuru you ni shinakereba naranai.
