Aron wa nen ni ichi do sono tsuno ni chi o tsukete a ga nai o shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi, a ga nai no zaisai no chi o motte yoyo ni watari, nen ni ichi do kore ga tame ni, a ga nai o shinakereba naranai. Kore wa Shu ni mottomo sei naru mono de aru".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata ga Isuraeru no hitobito no kazu no soukei o toru ni atari, onoono sono kazoerareru toki, sono inochi no a ga nai o Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai. Kore wa kazoerareru toki, karera no uchi ni wazawai no okoranai tame de aru.
Subete kazu ni iru mono wa seijo no shikeru de, han shikeru o harawanakereba naranai. Ichi shikeru wa nijuu gera de atte, onoono han shikeru o Shu ni sasagemono to shinakereba naranai.
Subete kazu ni iru nijuusai ijou no mono wa, Shu ni sasagemono o shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata no inochi o aganau tame ni, Shu ni sasagemono o suru toki, tomeru mono mo han shikeru yori ooku dashite wa narazu, mazushii mono mo sore yori sukunaku dashite wa naranai.
Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito kara, a ga nai no gin o totte, kore o kaiken no makuya no you ni atenakereba naranai. Kore wa Shu no mae ni Isuraeru no hitobito no tame kinen to natte, anata gata no inochi o aganaude arou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa mata arau tame ni senban to, sono dai o seidou de tsukuri, sore o kaiken no makuya to saidan to no aida ni oite, sono naka ni mizu o ire,
Aron to sono kotachi wa, sore de te to ashi to o arawanakereba naranai.
Karera wa kaiken no makuya ni wa iru toki, mizu de aratte, shinanai you ni shinakereba naranai. Mata saidan ni chikazuite, sono tsutome o nashi, kasai o Shu ni sasageru toki ni mo, sou shinakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, sono te, sono ashi o aratte, shinanai you ni shinakereba naranai. Kore wa kare to sono shison no yoyo ni wataru eikyuu no sadame de nakereba naranai".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa mata mottomo yoi kouryou o tori nasai. Sunawachi ekitai no motsuyaku gohyaku shikeru, koubashii nikkei o sono nakaba, sunawachi nihyaku gojuu shikeru, nioi shoubu nihyaku gojuu shikeru,
Keishi gohyaku shikeru o seijo no shikeru de tori, mata, oribu no abura ichi hin o tori nasai.
Anata wa kore o sei naru sosogi abura, sunawachi kouyu o tsukuru waza ni shitagai, mazeawasete, nioi abura ni tsukuranakereba naranai. Kore wa sei naru sosogi abura de aru.
Anata wa kono abura o kaiken no makuya to, akashi no hako to ni sosogi,
Tsukue to, sono moromoro no utsuwa, shokudai to, sono moromoro no utsuwa, kou no saidan,
Hansai no saidan to, sono moromoro no utsuwa, senban to, sono dai to ni abura o sosogi,
Korera o kiyomete mottomo sei naru mono to shinakereba naranai. Subete kore ni fureru mono wa sei to narude arou.
Anata wa Aron to sono kotachi ni abura o sosoide, karera o seibetsu shi, saishi to shite watashi ni tsukaesasenakereba naranai.
Soshite anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Kore wa anata gata no yoyo ni wataru, watashi no sei naru sosogi abura de atte,
Tsune no hito no mi ni kore o sosoide wa naranai. Mata kono wariai o motte, kore to hitoshii mono o tsukutte wa naranai. Kore wa sei naru mono de arukara, anata gata ni totte mo sei naru mono de nakereba naranai.
Subete kore to hitoshii mono o tsukuru mono, aruiha kore o saishi igai no hito ni tsukeru mono wa, tami no uchi kara tatarerude arou' ".
Shu wa mata, Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa kouryou, sunawachi sogou kou, Shikerete kou, fuushi kou, junsui no nyuukou no kouryou o tori nasai. Onoono onaji ryou de nakereba naranai.
Anata wa kore o motte kou, sunawachi kouryou o tsukuru waza ni shitagatte kunkou o tsukuri, shio o kuwae, jun ni shite sei naru mono to shi nasai.
Mata, sono ikubun o komaka ni kudaki, watashi ga anata to au kaiken no makuya ni aru, akashi no hako no mae ni kore o sonaenakereba naranai. Kore wa anata gata ni mottomo sei naru mono de aru.
Anata ga tsukuru kou no onaji wariai o motte, sore o jibun no tame ni tsukutte wa naranai. Kore wa anata ni totte Shu ni sei naru mono de nakereba naranai.
Subete kore to hitoshii mono o tsukutte, kore o kagu mono wa tami no uchi kara tatarerude arou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Miyo, watashi wa Yuda no buzoku ni zokusuru Horu no ko naru Uri no ko Bezareru o nazashi te meshi,
Kore ni kami no rei o mitashite, chie to satori to chishiki to shoshu no kousaku ni chouzeshime,
Kufuu o korashite kin, gin, seidou no saiku o sase,
Mata houseki o kiri hame, ki o choukoku suru nado, shoshu no kousaku o saserude arou.
Miyo, watashi wa mata Dan no buzoku ni zokusuru Ahisamaku no ko Ahoriabu o kare to tomo narase, soshite subete kashikoi mono no kokoro ni chie o sazuke, watashi ga anata ni meijita mono o, kotogotoku karera ni tsukuraserude arou.
Sunawachi kaiken no makuya, akashi no hako, sono ue ni aru shokuzaisho, makuya no moromoro no utsuwa,
Tsukue to sono utsuwa, junkin no shokudai to, sono moromoro no utsuwa, kou no saidan,
Hansai no saidan to sono moromoro no utsuwa, senban to sono dai,
Amimono no fuku, sunawachi saishi no tsutome o suru tame no saishi Aron no sei naru fuku, oyobi sono kotachi no fuku,
Sosogi abura, seijo no tame no koubashii kou nado o, subete watashi ga anata ni meijita you ni tsukuraserude arou".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa kanarazu watashi no ansokunichi o mamoranakereba naranai. Kore wa watashi to anata gata to no aida no, yoyo ni wataru shirushi de atte, watashi ga anatagata o seibetsu suru Shu de aru koto o, shiraseru tame no mono de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa ansokunichi o mamoranakereba naranai. Kore wa anata gata ni sei naru hi de aru. Subete kore o kegasu mono wa kanarazu korosare, subete kono hi ni shigoto o suru mono wa, tami no uchi kara tatarerude arou.
Muika no aida wa shigoto o shi nasai. Nanuka me wa mattaki yasumi no ansokunichi de, Shu no tame ni sei de aru. Subete ansokunichi ni shigoto o suru mono wa kanarazu korosarerude arou.
Yue ni, Isuraeru no hitobito wa ansokunichi o oboe, eien no keiyaku to shite, yoyo ansokunichi o mamoranakereba naranai.
Kore wa eien ni watashi to Isuraeru no hitobito to no aida no shirushi de aru. Sore wa Shu ga muika no aida ni tenchi o tsukuri, nanuka me ni yasumi, katsu, ikowaretakara de aru' ".
Shu wa Shinai san de Moose ni katari oerareta toki, akashi no ita nimai, sunawachi kami ga yubi o motte kakareta ishi no ita o Moose ni sazukerareta.
Tami wa Moose ga yama o kudaru koto no osoi no o mite, Aron no moto ni atsumatte kare ni itta, "Saa, watashitachi ni sakidatte yuku kami o, watashitachi no tame ni tsukutte kudasai. Watashitachi o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta hito, ano Moose wa dou natta no ka wakaranaikara desu".
Aron wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no tsuma, musuko, musumera no kin no mimiwa o hazushite watashi ni motte ki nasai".
Soko de tami wa mina sono kin no mimiwa o hazushite Aron no moto ni motte kita.
Aron ga kore o karera no te kara uketori, kougu de kata o tsukuri, ite koushi to shita no de, karera wa itta, "Isuraeru yo, kore wa anata o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta anata no kami de aru".
Aron wa kore o mite, sono mae ni saidan o kizuita. Soshite Aron wa fukoku shite itta, "Asu wa Shu no matsuri de aru".
Soko de hitobito wa akuru asa hayaku okite hansai o sasage, shuuonsai o sonaeta. Tami wa zashite kui nomi shi, tatte zareta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Isoide kudari nasai. Anata ga Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta anata no tami wa warui koto o shita.
Karera wa hayaku mo watashi ga meijita michi o hanare, jibun no tame ni imono no koushi o tsukuri, kore o ogami, kore ni gisei o sasagete, 'Isuraeru yo, kore wa anata o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta anata no kami de aru' to itte iru".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa kono tami o mita. Kore wa katakuna na tami de aru.
Sore de, watashi o tomeru na. Watashi no ikari wa karera ni mukatte moe, karera o horoboshi tsukusude arou. Shikashi, watashi wa anata o ooinaru kokumin to surude arou".
Moose wa sono kami, Shu o nadamete itta, "Shu yo, ooinaru chikara to tsuyokite o motte, Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidasareta anata no tami ni mukatte, naze anata no ikari ga moeru no deshou ka.
Dou shite Ejiputo bito ni 'Kare wa akui o motte karera o michibikidashi, karera o sanchi de koroshi, chi no men kara tachi horobosu no da' to iwasete yoideshou ka. Dou ka anata no hageshii ikari o yame, anata no tami ni kudasou to sareru kono wazawai o omoinaoshi,
Anata no shimobe Aburahamu, Isaku, Isuraeru ni, anata ga gojishin o sashite chikai, 'Watashi wa ten no hoshi no you ni, anata gata no shison o mashi, watashi ga yakusoku shita kono chi o mina anata gata no shison ni ataete, nagaku kore o shoyuu saserude arou' to karera ni ooserareta koto o oboete kudasai".
Sore de, Shu wa sono tami ni kudasu to iwareta wazawai ni tsuite omoinaosareta.
Moose wa mi o tenjite yama o kudatta. Kare no te ni wa, kano nimai no akashi no ita ga atta. Ita wa sono ryoumen ni moji ga atta. Sunawachi, kono men ni mo, kano men ni mo moji ga atta.
Sono ita wa kami no saku, sono moji wa kami no moji de atte, ita ni hotta mono de aru.
Yoshua wa tami no yobawaru koe o kiite, Moose ni itta, "Shukuei no naka ni tatakai no koe ga shimasu".
Shikashi, Moose wa itta, "Kachidoki no koe de naku, haiboku no sakebigoe de mo nai. Watashi no kiku no wa uta no koe de aru".
Moose ga shukuei ni chikazukuto, koushi to odori to o mita no de, kare wa ikari ni moe, te kara ka no ita o nageuchi, kore o yama no fumoto de kudaita.
Mata karera ga tsukutta koushi o totte hi ni yaki, konagona ni kudaki, kore o mizu no ue ni maite, Isuraeru no hitobito ni nomaseta.
Moose wa Aron ni itta, "Kono tami ga anata ni nani o shita no de, anata wa karera ni ooinaru tsumi o okasaseta no desu ka".
Aron wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, hageshiku ikaranaide kudasai. Kono tami no warui no wa, anata ga gozonji desu.
Karera wa watashi ni iimashita, 'Watashitachi ni sakidatte iku kami o, watashitachi no tame ni tsukutte kudasai. Watashitachi o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta hito, ano Moose wa, dou natta no ka wakaranaikara desu'.
Soko de watashi wa 'Dare de mo, kin o motte iru mono wa, sore o torihazushi nasai' to karera ni iimashita. Karera ga sore o watashi ni watashita no de, watashi ga kore o hi ni nageireruto, kono koushi ga dete kita no desu".
Moose wa tami ga hoshiimama ni furumatta no o mita. Aron wa karera ga hoshiimama ni furumau ni makase, teki no naka ni monowarai to nattakara de aru.
Moose wa shukuei no mon ni tatte itta, "Subete Shu ni tsuku mono wa watashi no moto ni ki nasai". Rebi no kotachi wa mina kare no moto ni atsumatta.
Soko de Moose wa karera ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Anata gata wa, onoono koshi ni tsurugi o obi, shukuei no naka o mon kara mon e iki megutte, onoono sono kyoudai, sono tomo, sono rinjin o korose' ".
Rebi no kotachi wa Moose no kotoba doori ni shita no de, sono hi, tami no uchi, ooyoso sanzennin ga taoreta.
Soko de, Moose wa itta, "Anata gata wa, onoono sono ko, sono kyoudai ni sakaratte, kyou, Shu ni mi o sasageta. Sore de Shu wa, kyou, anata gata ni shukufuku o ataerarerude arou".
Akuruhi, Moose wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa ooinaru tsumi o okashita. Sore de ima, watashi wa Shu no moto ni nobotte iku. Anata gata no tsumi o tsugunau koto ga, dekiru ka mo shirenai".
Moose wa Shu no moto ni kaette, soshite itta, "Aa, kono tami wa ooinaru tsumi o okashi, jibun no tame ni kin no kami o tsukurimashita.
Ima moshi anata ga, karera no tsumi o yurusaremasunaraba - -. Shikashi, moshi kanawanakereba, douzo anata ga kakishirusareta fumi kara, watashi no na o keshisatte kudasai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Subete watashi ni tsumi o okashita mono wa, kore o watashi no fumi kara keshisarude arou.
Shikashi, ima anata wa itte, watashi ga anata ni tsugeta tokoro ni tami o michibiki nasai. Miyo, watashi no tsukai wa anata ni sakidatte ikude arou. Tadashi keibatsu no hi ni, watashi wa karera no tsumi o bassurude arou".
Soshite Shu wa tami o utareta. Karera ga koushi o tsukuttakara de aru. Sore wa Aron ga tsukutta no de aru.
Sate, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata to, anata ga Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta tami to wa, koko o tatte watashi ga Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikatte, 'Kore o anata no shison ni ataeru' to itta chi ni nobori nasai.
Watashi wa hitori no tsukai o tsukawashite anata ni sakidatase, Kanan bi to, Amori bi to, Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito o oiharaude arou.
Anata gata wa chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi ni nobori nasai. Shikashi, anata gata wa, katakuna na tami de arukara, watashi ga michi de anatagata o horobosu koto no nai you ni, anata gata no uchi ni atte issho ni wa noboranaide arou".
Tami wa kono warui shirase o kiite urei, hitori mo sono kazari o mi ni tsukeru mono wa nakatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa, katakuna na tami de aru. Moshi watashi ga ikkoku de mo, anata gata no uchi ni atte, issho ni nobotte ikunaraba, anatagata o horobosude arou. Yue ni, ima, anata gata no kazari o mi kara torisari nasai. Sou sureba watashi wa anata gata ni nasubeki koto o shirude arou' ".
Sore de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Horebu yama irai sono kazari o torinozoite ita.
Moose wa makuya o totte, kore o shukuei no soto ni, shukuei o hanarete hari, kore o kaiken no makuya to nazuketa. Subete Shu ni ukagai koto no aru mono wa dete, shukuei no soto ni aru kaiken no makuya ni itta.
Moose ga dete, makuya ni iku toki ni wa, tami wa mina tachiagari, Moose ga makuya ni hairu made, onoono sono tenmaku no iriguchi ni tatte kare o miokutta.
Moose ga makuya ni hairuto, kumo no hashira ga kudatte makuya no iriguchi ni tatta. Soshite Shu wa Moose to katarareta.
Tami wa mina makuya no iriguchi ni kumo no hashira ga tatsu no o miruto, tatte onoono jibun no tenmaku no iriguchi de reihai shita.
Hito ga sono tomo to kataru you ni, Shu wa Moose to kao o awasete katarareta. Kou shite Moose wa shukuei ni kaettaga, sono juusha naru wakamono, Nun no ko Yoshua wa makuya o hanarenakatta.
Moose wa Shu ni itta, "Goran kudasai. Anata wa 'Kono tami o michibiki nobore' to watashi ni iinagara, watashi to issho ni tsukawasareru mono o shirasete kudasaimasen. Shikamo, anata wa katsute 'Watashi wa omae o eranda. Omae wa mata watashi no mae ni megumi o eta' to oose ni narimashita.
Sore de ima, watashi ga moshi, anata no mae ni megumi o emasunaraba, dou ka, anata no michi o shimeshi, anata o watashi ni shirase, anata no mae ni megumi o esasete kudasai. Mata, kono kokumin ga anata no tami de aru koto o oboete kudasai".
Shu wa iwareta "Watashi jishin ga issho ni ikude arou. Soshite anata ni ansoku o ataerude arou".
Moose wa Shu ni itta "Moshi anata jishin ga issho ni ikarenainaraba, watashitachi o koko kara noborasenaide kudasai.
Watashi to anata no tami to ga, anata no mae ni megumi o eru koto wa, nani ni yotte shiraremashou ka. Sore wa anata ga watashitachi to issho ni ikarete, watashi to anata no tami to ga, chi no men ni aru shomin to kotonaru mono ni narukara de wa arimasen ka".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa watashi no mae ni megumi o e, mata watashi wa na o motte anata o shirukara, anata no itta kono koto o mo surude arou".
Moose wa itta, "Douzo, anata no eikou o watashi ni oshimeshi kudasai".
Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi wa watashi no moromoro no zen o anata no mae ni toorase, Shu no na o anata no mae ni noberude arou. Watashi wa megumou to suru mono o megumi, awaremou to suru mono o awaremu".
Mata iwareta, "Shikashi, anata wa watashi no kao o miru koto wa dekinai. Watashi o mite, nao ikite iru hito wa naikara de aru".
Soshite Shu wa iwareta, "Miyo, watashi no katawara ni hitotsu no tokoro ga aru. Anata wa iwa no ue ni tachi nasai.
Watashi no eikou ga soko o toorisugiru toki, watashi wa anata o iwa no sakeme ni irete, watashi ga toorisugiru made, te de anata o ooude arou.
Soshite watashi ga te o nokeru toki, anata wa watashi no ushiro o miruga, watashi no kao wa minaide arou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa mae no you na ishi no ita nimai o, kitte tsukuri nasai. Watashi wa anata ga kudaita hajime no ita ni atta kotoba o, sono ita ni kakude arou.
Anata wa asa made ni sonae o shi, asa no uchi ni Shinai san ni nobotte, yama no itadaki de watashi no mae ni tachi nasai.
Dare mo anata to tomo ni nobotte wa naranai. Mata, dare mo yama no naka ni ite wa naranai. Mata yama no mae de hitsuji ya ushi o katte ite wa naranai".
Soko de Moose wa mae no you na ishi no ita nimai o, kitte tsukuri, asa hayaku okite, Shu ga kare ni meijirareta you ni Shinai san ni nobotta. Kare wa sono te ni ishi no ita nimai o totta.
Toki ni Shu wa kumo no naka ni atte kudari, kare to tomo ni soko ni tatte Shu no na o noberareta.
Shu wa kare no mae o sugite noberareta. "Shu, Shu, awaremi ari, megumi ari, ikaru koto osoku, itsukushimito, makoto to no yutaka naru kami,
Itsukushimi o chiyo made mo hodokoshi, aku to, toga to, tsumi to o yurusu mono, shikashi, batsusubeki mono woba kesshite yurusazu, chichi no tsumi o ko ni mukui, ko no ko ni mukuite, san'yon dai ni oyobosu mono".
Moose wa isogi chi ni fushite haishi,
Soshite itta, "Aa Shu yo, watashi ga moshi, anata no mae ni megumi o emasunaraba, katakuna na tami desukeredo mo, dou ka Shu ga watashitachi no uchi ni atte issho ni itte kudasai. Soshite watashitachi no aku to tsumi to o yurushi, watashitachi o anata no mono to shite kudasai".
Shu wa iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa keiyaku o musubu. Watashi wa chi no izuko ni mo, ikanaru tami no uchi ni mo, imada okonawareta koto no nai fushigi o, anata no subete no tami no mae ni okonaude arou. Anata ga tomo ni sumu tami wa mina, Shu no waza o mirude arou. Watashi ga anata no tame ni nasou to suru koto wa, osorubeki mono dakara de aru.
Watashi ga, kyou, anata ni meijiru koto o mamori nasai. Miyo, watashi wa Amori bi to, Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito o, anata no mae kara oiharaude arou.
Anata ga yuku kuni ni sunde iru mono to, keiyaku o musubanai you ni, ki o tsukenakereba naranai. Osoraku karera wa anata no uchi ni atte, wana to narude arou.
Mushiro anata gata wa, karera no saidan o taoshi, ishi no hashira o kudaki, Ashira zou o kiritaosanakereba naranai.
Anata wa ta no kami o ogande wa naranai. Shu wa sono na o 'Netami' to itte, netamu kami dakara de aru.
Osoraku anata wa sono kuni ni sumu mono to keiyaku o musubi, karera no kamigami o shitatte kan'in o okonai, sono kamigami ni gisei o sasage, manekarete karera no gisei o tabe,
Mata sono musumetachi o, anata no musukotachi ni metori, sono musumetachi ga jibuntachi no kamigami o shitatte kan'in o okonai, mata, anata no musukotachi o shite, karera no kamigami o shitawase, kan'in o okonawaseru ni itarude arou.
Anata wa jibun no tame ni imono no kamigami o tsukutte wa naranai.
Anata wa tane irenu pan no matsuri o mamoranakereba naranai. Sunawachi, watashi ga anata ni meijita you ni, Abibu no tsuki no sadame no toki ni, nanuka no aida, tane irenu pan o tabenakereba naranai. Anata ga Abibu no tsuki ni Ejiputo o detakara de aru.
Subete hajime ni umareru mono wa, watashi no mono de aru. Subete anata no kachiku no ui go no osu wa, ushi mo hitsuji mo sou de aru.
Tadashi, roba no ui go wa kohitsuji de aganawanakereba naranai. Moshi aganawanainaraba, sono kubi o oranakereba naranai. Anata no musuko no uchi no ui go wa, mina aganawanakereba naranai. Munashite de watashi no mae ni dete wa naranai.
Anata wa muika no aida hataraki, nanuka me ni wa yasumanakereba naranai. Tagayashi doki ni mo, kariire doki ni mo yasumanakereba naranai.
Anata wa nana shuu no matsuri, sunawachi komugikari no hatsuho no matsuri o okonawanakereba naranai. Mata nen no owari ni toriire no matsuri o okonawanakereba naranai.
Nen ni san do, danshi wa mina Shu naru kami, Isuraeru no kami no mae ni denakereba naranai.
Watashi wa kuniguni no tami o anata no mae kara oiharatte, anata no sakai o hiroku surude arou. Anata ga nen ni san do nobotte, anata no kami, Shu no mae ni deru toki ni wa, dare mo anata no kuni o okasu koto wa naide arou.
Anata wa gisei no chi o, tane o ireta pan to tomo ni sonaete wa naranai. Mata sugikoshi no matsuri no gisei o, yokuasa made nokoshite oite wa naranai.
Anata no tochi no hatsuho no mottomo yoi mono o, anata no kami, Shu no ie ni tazusaete konakereba naranai. Anata wa koyagi o sono haha no chichi de nite wa naranai".
Mata Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Korera no kotoba o kakishirushi nasai. Watashi wa korera no kotoba ni motozuite, anata oyobi Isuraeru to keiyaku o musundakara de aru".
Moose wa Shu to tomo ni, yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, soko ni itaga, pan mo tabezu, mizu mo nomanakatta. Soshite kare wa keiyaku no kotoba, jikkai o ita no ue ni kaita.
Moose wa sono akashi no ita nimai o te ni shite, Shinai san kara kudattaga, sono yama o kudatta toki, Moose wa, saki ni Shu to katatta yue ni, kao no kawa ga hikari o hanatte iru no o shiranakatta.
Aron to Isuraeru no hitobito to ga mina, Moose o miruto, kare no kao no kawa ga hikari o hanatte ita no de, karera wa osorete kore ni chikazukanakatta.
Moose wa karera o yonda. Aron to kaishuu no kashiratachi to ga mina, Moose no moto ni kaette kita no de, Moose wa karera to katatta.
Sono nochi, Isuraeru no hitobito ga mina chikayotta no de, Moose wa Shu ga Shinai san de kare ni katarareta koto o, kotogotoku karera ni satoshita.
Moose wa karera to katari oeta toki, kao ooi o kao ni ateta.
Shikashi Moose wa Shu no mae ni itte Shu to kataru toki wa, deru made kao ooi o torinozoite ita. Soshite dete kuruto, sono meijirareta koto o Isuraeru no hitohito ni tsugeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Moose no kao o miruto, Moose no kao no kawa ga hikari o hanatte ita. Moose wa itte Shu to kataru made, mata kao ooi o kao ni ateta.
Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu o atsumete itta, "Kore wa Shu ga okonae to meijirareta kotoba de aru.
Muika no aida wa shigoto o shi nasai. Nanuka me wa anata gata no seijitsu de, Shu no mattaki yasumi no ansokunichi de arukara, kono hi ni shigoto o suru mono wa dare de mo korosarenakereba naranai.
Ansokunichi ni wa anata gata no sumai no doko de mo hi o taite wa naranai".
Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu ni itta, "Kore wa Shu ga meijirareta koto de aru.
Anata gata no mochimono no uchi kara, Shu ni sasageru mono o tori nasai. Subete, kokoro kara yorokonde suru mono wa, Shu ni sasageru mono o motte ki nasai. Sunawachi kin, gin, seidou.
Aoito, murasakiito, hi ito, ama ito, yagi no keito.
Akane zome no ohitsuji no kawa, jugon no kawa, akashiyazai,
Tomoshi abura, sosogi abura to koubashii kunkou to no tame no kouryou,
Shima menou, Epode to muneate to ni hameru houseki.
Subete anata gata no uchi, kokoro ni chie aru mono wa kite, Shu no meijirareta mono o mina tsukuri nasai.
Sunawachi makuya, sono tenmaku to, sono ooi, sono koma to, sono waku, sono yokogi, sono hashira to, sono za,
Hako to, sono sao, shokuzaisho, hedate no taremaku,
Tsukue to, sono sao, oyobi sono moromoro no utsuwa, sonae no pan,
Mata, tomoshibi no tame no shokudai to, sono utsuwa, tomoshibi zara to, tomoshi abura,
