Zaisai ni tsukau o yagi ichitou.
Shuuonsai no gisei ni tsukau oushi nitou. Ohitsuji gotou, o yagi gotou, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji gotou de atte, kore wa Enan no ko Ahira no sonaemono de atta.
Ijou wa saidan ni abura o sosogu hi ni, Isuraeru no tsukasatachi ga, saidan o hounou suru sonaemono to shite, sasageta mono de aru. Sunawachi, gin no sara juu ni, gin no hachi juu ni, kin no sakazuki juu ni.
Gin no sara wa sorezore hyaku sanjuu shikeru, hachi wa sorezore nanajuu shikeru, seijo no shikeru ni yoreba, kono gin no utsuwa wa awasete nisen yonhyaku shikeru.
Mata kunkou no michite iru juu ni no kin no sakazuki wa, seijo no shikeru ni yoreba, sorezore juu shikeru, sono sakazuki no kin wa awasete hyaku nijuu shikeru de atta.
Mata hansai ni tsukau oushi wa awasete juu ni, ohitsuji wa juu ni, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji wa juu ni, kono hoka ni sono sosai no mono ga atta. Mata zaisai ni tsukau o yagi wa juu ni.
Shuuonsai no gisei ni tsukau oushi wa awasete nijuu yon, ohitsuji wa rokujuu, o yagi wa rokujuu, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji wa rokujuu de atte, kore wa saidan ni abura o sosoida nochi ni, saidan hounou no sonaemono to shite sasageta mono de aru.
Sate Moose wa Shu to kataru tame ni, kaiken no makuya ni haitte, akashi no hako no ue no, shokuzaisho no ue, futatsu no kerubimu no aida kara jibun ni katarareru koe o kiita. Sunawachi, Shu wa kare ni katarareta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Aron ni ii nasai, 'Anata ga tomoshihi o tomosu toki wa, nanatsu no tomoshihi de shokudai no zenpou o tera su you ni shi nasai' ".
Aron wa sono you ni shita. Sunawachi, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni, shokudai no zenpou o tera su you ni, tomoshihi o tomoshita.
Shokudai no tsukuri wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sore wa kin no uchimono de, sono dai mo sono hana mo tomo ni uchimono tsukuri de atta. Moose wa Shu ni shimesareta kata ni shitagatte, sono you ni sono shokudai o tsukutta.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Rebi bito o Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara totte, karera o kiyome nasai.
Anata wa kono you ni shite karera o kiyomenakereba naranai. Sunawachi, tsumi o kiyomeru mizu o karera ni sosogi kake, karera ni zenshin o sorase, ifuku o arawasete, mi o kiyomesase,
Soshite karera ni wakai oushi ichitou to, abura o mazeta mugiko no sosai to o torase nasai. Anata wa mata, hoka ni wakai oushi o zaisai no tame ni toranakereba naranai.
Soshite, anata wa Rebi bito o kaiken no makuya no mae ni tsurete kite, Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu o atsume,
Rebi bito o Shu no mae ni susumase, Isuraeru no hitobito o shite, te o Rebi bito no ue ni okasenakereba naranai.
Soshite Aron wa, Rebi bito o Isuraeru no hitobito no sasageru yousai to shite, Shu no mae ni sasagenakereba naranai. Kore wa karera ni Shu no tsutome o saseru tame de aru.
Sore kara anata wa Rebi bito o shite, te o kano oushi no atama no ue ni okase, sono hitotsu o zaisai to shi, hitotsu o hansai to shite Shu ni sasage, Rebi bito no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shinakereba naranai.
Anata wa Rebi bito o, Aron to sono kotachi no mae ni tatase, kore o yousai to shite Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Kou shite, anata wa Rebi bito o Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara wakachi, Rebi bito o watashi no mono to shinakereba naranai.
Kou shite nochi Rebi bi to wa kaiken no makuya ni haitte tsutome ni tsuku koto ga dekiru. Anata wa karera o kiyome, karera o sasagete yousai to shinakereba naranai.
Karera wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara, mattaku watashi ni sasagerareta mono dakara de aru. Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no hajime ni umareta mono, sunawachi, subete no ui go no kawari ni, watashi wa karera o totte watashi no mono to shita.
Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no ui go wa, hito mo kemono mo, mina watashi no mono dakara de aru. Watashi wa Ejiputo no chi de, subete no ui go o uchikoroshita hi ni, karera o seibetsu shite watashi no mono to shita.
Sore de watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no, subete no ui go no kawari ni Rebi bito o totta.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara Rebi bito o totte, Aron to sono kotachi ni atae, karera ni kaiken no makuya de, Isuraeru no hitobito ni kawatte tsutome o sase, mata Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o saserude arou. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga, seijo ni chikazuite, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni wazawai no okoru koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru".
Moose to Aron, oyobi Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa, subete Shu ga Rebi bito no koto ni tsuki, Moose ni meijirareta tokoro ni shitagatte, Rebi bito ni itta, sunawachi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, sono you ni karera ni itta.
Soko de Rebi bi to wa mi o kiyome, sono ifuku o aratta. Aron wa karera o Shu no mae ni sasagete yousai to shita. Aron wa mata karera no tame ni, tsumi no a ga nai o shite karera o kiyometa.
Kou shite nochi, Rebi bi to wa kaiken no makuya ni haitte, Aron to sono kotachi ni tsukaete tsutome o shita. Sunawachi, karera wa Rebi bito no koto ni tsuite, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta tokoro ni shitagatte, sono you ni karera ni itta.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Rebi bi to wa tsugi no you ni shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi, nijuu gosai ijou no mono wa tsutome ni tsuki, kaiken no makuya no hataraki o shinakereba naranai.
Shikashi, gojuusai kara wa tsutome no hataraki o shirizoki, kasanete tsutome o shite wa naranai.
Tada, kaiken no makuya de sono kyoudaitachi no tsutome no tasuke o suru koto ga dekiru. Shikashi, tsutome o shite wa naranai. Anata ga Rebi bito ni sono tsutome o saseru ni wa, kono you ni shinakereba naranai".
Ejiputo no kuni o deta tsugi no toshi no shougatsu, Shu wa Shinai no arano de Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni, sugikoshi no matsuri o sadame no toki ni okonawase nasai.
Kono tsuki no juu yonka no yuugure, sadame no toki ni, sore o okonawanakereba naranai. Anata gata wa, sono subete no sadame to, sono subete no okite ni shitagatte, sore o okonawanakereba naranai".
Soko de Moose ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni, sugikoshi no matsuri o okonawanakereba naranai to itta no de,
Karera wa shougatsu no juu yonka no yuugure, Shinai no arano de sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta. Sunawachi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, subete Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni okonatta.
Tokoro ga hito no shitai ni furete mi o kegashita tame ni, sono hi ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonau koto no dekinai hitobito ga atte, sono hi Moose to Aron no mae ni kite,
Sono hitobito wa kare ni itta, "Watashitachi wa hito no shitai ni furete mi o kegashimashitaga, naze sono sadame no toki ni, Isuraeru no hitobito to tomo ni, Shu ni sonaemono o sasageru koto ga dekinai no desu ka".
Moose wa karera ni itta, "Shibaraku mate. Shu ga anata gata ni tsuite, dou oose ni naru ka o kikou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata no uchi, mata, anata gata no shison no uchi, shitai ni furete mi o kegashita hito mo, tooi tabiji ni aru hito mo, nao, sugikoshi no matsuri o Shu ni taishite okonau koto ga dekirude arou.
Sunawachi, ni nigatsu no juu yonka no yuugure, sore o okonai, tane irenu pan to kuna o soete, sore o tabenakereba naranai.
Kore o sukoshi de mo asa made nokoshite oite wa naranai. Mata sono hone wa ichipon de mo otte wa naranai. Sugikoshi no matsuri no subete no sadame ni shitagatte kore o okonawanakereba naranai.
Shikashi, sono mi wa kiyoku, tabi ni dete mo inai no ni, sugikoshi no matsuri o okonawanai toki wa, sono hito wa tami no uchi kara tatarerude arou. Kono you na hito wa, sadame no toki ni Shu no sonaemono o sasagenai yue, sono tsumi o owanakereba naranai.
Moshi takoku no hito ga, anata gata no uchi ni kiryuu shite ite, Shu ni taishite sugikoshi no matsuri o okonaou to surunaraba, sugikoshi no matsuri no sadame ni yori, sono okite ni shitagatte, kore o okonawanakereba naranai. Anata gata wa takoku no hito ni mo, jikoku no hito ni mo, douitsu no sadame o mochiinakereba naranai' ".
Makuya o tateta hi ni, kumo wa makuya o ootta. Sure wa sunawachi, akashi no makuya de atte, yuu ni wa, makuya no ue ni, kumo wa hi no you ni miete, asa ni made oyonda.
Tsune ni sou de atte, hiru wa kumo ga sore o ooi, yoru wa hi no you ni mieta.
Kumo ga makuya o hanarete noboru toki wa, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, tadachini michi ni susunda. Mata kumo ga todomaru tokoro ni, Isuraeru no hitobito wa shukuei shita.
Sunawachi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, Shu no mei ni yotte michi ni susumi, Shu no mei ni yotte shukuei shi, makuya no ue ni kumo ga todomatte iru aida wa, shukuei shite ita.
Makuya no ue ni, hi hisashiku kumo no todomaru toki wa, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu no iitsuke o mamotte, michi ni susumanakatta.
Mata makuya no ue ni, kumo no todomaru hi no sukunai toki mo attaga, karera wa, tada Shu no mei ni shitagatte shukuei shi, Shu no mei ni shitagatte, michi ni susunda.
Mata kumo wa yuu kara asa made, todomaru koto mo attaga, asa ni natte, kumo ga noboru toki wa, karera wa michi ni susunda. Mata hiru de mo yoru de mo, kumo ga noboru toki wa, karera wa michi ni susunda.
Futsu ka de mo, ichi kagetsu de mo, aruiha sore ijou de mo, makuya no ue ni, kumo ga todomatte iru aida wa, Isuraeru no hitobito wa shukuei shite ite, michi ni susumanakattaga, sore ga noboruto michi ni susunda.
Sunawachi, karera wa Shu no mei ni shitagatte shukuei shi, Shu no mei ni shitagatte michi ni susumi, Moose ni yotte, Shu ga meijirareta toori ni, Shu no iitsuke o mamotta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Gin no rappa o nihon tsukuri nasai. Sunawachi, uchimono tsukuri to shi, sore de kaishuu o yobiatsume, mata shukuei o susumase nasai.
Kono futatsu o fuku toki wa, zenkaishuu ga kaiken no makuya no iriguchi ni, anata no tokoro ni atsumatte konakereba naranai.
Moshi sono hitotsu dake o fuku toki wa, Isuraeru no shizoku no chou de aru tsukasatachi ga, anata no tokoro ni atsumatte konakereba naranai.
Mata anata gata ga keihou o fukinarasu toki wa, higashi no hou no shukuei ga, michi ni susumanakereba naranai.
Ni dome no keihou o fukinarasu toki wa, minami no hou no shukuei ga, michi ni susumanakereba naranai. Subete michi ni susumu toki wa, keihou o fukinarasanakereba naranai.
Mata kaishuu o atsumeru toki ni mo, rappa o fukinarasuga, keihou wa fukinarashite wa naranai.
Aron no ko de aru saishitachi ga, rappa o fukanakereba naranai. Kore wa anata ga taga, yoyo nagaku mamorubeki sadame to shinakereba naranai.
Mata, anata gata no kuni de, anatagata o shi etageru ada to no tatakai ni deru toki wa, rappa o motte, keihou o fukinarasanakereba naranai. Sou surunaraba, anata gata wa, anata gata no kami, Shu ni oboerarete, anata gata no teki kara sukuwarerude arou.
Mata, anata gata no yorokobi no hi, anata gata no iwai no toki, oyobi tsukizuki no daiichi nichi ni wa, anata gata no hansai to shuuonsai no gisei o sasageru ni atatte, rappa o fukinarasanakereba naranai. Sou surunaraba, anata gata no kami wa, sore ni yotte, anatagata o oboerarerude arou. Watashi wa anata gata no kami, Shu de aru".
Daini nen no ni nigatsu hatsuka ni, kumo ga akashi no makuya o hanarete nobotta no de,
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, Shinai no arano o dete, sono tabiji ni susundaga, Paran no arano ni itatte, kumo wa todomatta.
Kou shite karera wa, Shu ga Moose ni yotte, meijirareta tokoro ni shitagatte, michi ni susumu koto o hajimeta.
Sentou ni wa, Yuda no kotachi no shukuei no hata ga, sono butai o shitagaete susunda. Yuda no butai no chou wa Aminadabu no ko Nashon,
Issakaru no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Tsuaru no ko Netanieru,
Zeburun no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Heron no ko Eriabu de atta.
Soshite makuya wa torikuzusare, Gerushon no kotachi, oyobi Merari no kotachi wa makuya o hakobi susunda.
Tsugi ni Ruben no shukuei no hata ga, sono butai o shitagaete susunda. Ruben no butai no chou wa Shideuru no ko Erizuru,
Shimeon no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Tsurishadai no ko Shirumieru,
Gado no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Deueru no ko Eriasafu de atta.
Soshite Kohate bito wa sei naru mono o hakobi susunda. Kore ga tsuku made ni, hitobito wa makuya o tate owaru no de aru.
Tsugi ni Efuraimu no kotachi no shukuei no hata ga, sono butai o shitagaete susunda. Efuraimu no butai no chou wa Amihode no ko Erishama,
Manase no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Padazuru no ko Gamarieru,
Beniyamin no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Gideoni no ko Abidan de atta.
Tsugi ni Dan no kotachi no shukuei no hata ga, sono butai o shitagaete susunda. Kono butai wa subete no shukuei no shingari de atta. Dan no butai no chou wa Amishadai no ko Ahiezeru,
Aseru no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Okuran no ko Pagieru,
Nafutari no kotachi no buzoku no butai no chou wa Enan no ko Ahira de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, sono michi ni susumu toki wa, kono you ni, sono butai ni shitagatte susunda.
Sate, Moose wa, tsuma no chichi, Mideyan bito Riueru no ko Hobabu ni itta, "Watashitachi wa, katsute Shu ga omaetachi ni ataeru to yakusoku sareta tokoro ni mukatte susunde imasu. Anata mo issho ni oide kudasai. Anata ga koufuku ni narareru you ni itashimashou. Shu ga Isuraeru ni koufuku o yakusoku sareta no desukara".
Kare wa Moose ni itta, "Watashi wa ikimasen. Watashi wa kuni ni kaette, shinzoku no moto ni ikimasu".
Moose wa mata itta, "Dou ka watashitachi o misutenaide kudasai. Anata wa, watashitachi ga arano no doko ni shukuei subeki ka o gozonji desukara, watashitachi no me to natte kudasai.
Moshi anata ga issho ni oide kudasarunara, Shu ga watashitachi ni tamawaru koufuku o anata ni mo oyoboshimashou".
Kou shite karera wa Shu no yama o satte, mikka no koutei o susunda. Shu no keiyaku no hako wa, sono mikka no koutei no aida, karera ni sakidatte iki, karera no tame ni yasumu tokoro o tazune motometa.
Karera ga shukuei o dete, michi ni susumu toki, hiru wa Shu no kumo ga karera no ue ni atta.
Keiyaku no hako no susumu toki Moose wa itta, "Shu yo, tachiagatte kudasai. Anata no teki wa uchichirasare, anata o nikumu monodomo wa, anata no mae kara nigesarimasu you ni".
Mata sono todomaru toki, kare wa itta, "Shu yo, kaette kite kudasai, Isuraeru nochi yorozu no hito ni".
Sate, tami wa sainan ni atte iru hito no you ni, Shu no mimi ni tsubuyaita. Shu wa kore o kiite ikari o hasserare, Shu no hi ga karera no uchi ni moeagatte, shukuei no hashi o yaita.
Soko de tami wa Moose ni mukatte sakenda. Moose ga Shu ni inotta no de, sono hi wa shizumatta.
Shu no hi ga karera no uchi ni moeagatta koto ni yotte, sono tokoro no na wa Tabera to yobareta.
Mata karera no uchi ni ita ooku no yoriatsumari bi to wa yokushin o okoshi, Isuraeru no hitobito mo mata futatabi naite itta, "Aa, niku ga tabetai.
Wareware wa omoiokosuga, Ejiputo de wa, tada de, uo o tabeta. Kyuuri mo, suika mo, nira mo, tamanegi mo, soshite, ninniku mo.
Shikashi, ima, wareware no seikon wa tsukita. Wareware no me no mae ni wa, kono mana no hoka nani mo nai".
Mana wa, koe n doro no mi no you de, iro wa Budoraku no iro no you de atta.
Tami wa aruki mawatte, kore o atsume, hikiusu de hiki, mata wa, usu de tsuki, ka made nite, kore o mochi to shita. Sono aji wa abura kashi no aji no you de atta.
Yoru, shukuei no tsuyu ga oriru toki, mana wa sore to tomo ni futta.
Moose wa, tami ga iegoto ni, onoono sono tenmaku no iriguchi de naku no o kiita. Soko de Shu wa hageshiku ikarare, mata Moose wa fukai ni omotta.
Soshite, Moose wa Shu ni itta, "Anata wa naze, shimobe ni warui shiuchi o sareru no desu ka. Dou shite watashi wa anata no mae ni megumi o enaide, kono subete no tami no omoni o owasareru no desu ka.
Watashi ga kono subete no tami o, haranda no desu ka. Watashi ga kore o unda no desu ka. Sou de wa nai no ni, anata wa naze watashi ni 'Yashinaioya ga nyuuji o daku you ni, karera o futokoro ni daite, anata ga karera no senzotachi ni chikawareta chi ni ike' to iwareru no desu ka.
Watashi wa doko kara niku o ete, kono subete no tami ni ataeru koto ga dekimashou ka. Karera wa naite, 'Niku o tabesase yo' to watashi ni itte iru no desu.
Watashi hitori de wa, kono subete no tami o ou koto ga dekimasen. Sore wa watashi ni wa omo sugimasu.
Moshi watashi ga anata no mae ni megumi o emasunaraba, watashi ni kono you na shiuchi o sareru yori wa, mushiro, hitoomoi ni koroshi, kono ue kurushimi ni awasenaide kudasai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Isuraeru no chouroutachi no uchi, tami no chourou to nari, tsukasa to narubeki koto o, anata ga shitte iru mono nanajuunin o watashi no moto ni atsume, kaiken no makuya ni tsurete kite, soko ni anata to tomo ni tatase nasai.
Watashi wa kudatte, sono tokoro de, anata to katari, mata watashi wa anata no ue ni aru rei o, karera ni mo wakeataerude arou. Karera wa anata to tomo ni, tami no omoni o oi, anata ga, tada hitori de, sore o ou koto no nai you ni surude arou.
Anata wa mata tami ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa mi o kiyomete, asu o machi nasai. Anata gata wa niku o taberu koto ga dekirude arou. Anata gata ga naite Shu no mimi ni, watashitachi wa niku ga tabetai. Ejiputo ni ita toki wa yokatta to ittakara de aru. Sore yue, Shu wa anata gata ni niku o ataete tabesaserarerude arou.
Anata gata ga sore o taberu no wa, ichi nichi ya futsuka ya itsuka ya tooka ya hatsuka de wa naku,
Ichi kagetsu ni oyobi, tsuini anata gata no hana kara deru you ni nari, anata gata wa, sore ni aki haterude arou. Sore wa anata gata no uchi ni orareru Shu o karunjite, sono mae ni naki, naze, watashitachi wa Ejiputo kara dete kita no darou to ittakara de aru' ".
Moose wa itta, "Watashi to tomo ni oru tami wa toho no danshi dake de mo rokujuu man desu. Tokoro ga anata wa, 'Watashi wa karera ni niku o ataete ichi kagetsu no aida tabesaseyou' to iwaremasu.
Hitsuji to ushi no mure o karera no tame ni hofutte, karera o akisaseru to iu no desu ka. Umi no subete no uo o karera no tame ni atsumete, karera o akisaseru to iu no desu ka".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Shu no te wa mijikakarou ka. Anata wa, ima, watashi no kotoba no naru ka dou ka o mirude arou".
Kono toki Moose wa dete, Shu no kotoba o tami ni tsuge, tami no chouroutachi nanajuunin o atsumete, makuya no shuui ni tataseta.
Shu wa kumo no uchi ni atte kudari, Moose to katarare, Moose no ue ni aru rei o, sono nanajuunin no chouroutachi ni mo wakeataerareta. Sono rei ga karera no ue ni todomatta toki, karera wa yogen shita. Tadashi, sono nochi wa kasanete yogen shinakatta.
Sono toki futari no mono ga, shukuei ni todomatte itaga, hitori no na wa Erudade to ii, hitori no na wa Medade to itta. Karera no ue ni mo rei ga todomatta. Karera wa na o shirusareta mono de attaga, makuya ni ikanakatta no de, shukuei no uchi de yogen shita.
Toki ni hitori no wakamono ga hashitte kite, Moose ni tsugete itta, "Erudade to Medade to ga shukuei no uchi de yogen shite imasu".
Wakai toki kara Moose no juusha de atta Nun no ko Yoshua wa kotaete itta, "Waga Shu, Moose yo, karera o sashitomete kudasai".
Moose wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa, watashi no tame o omotte, netami o okoshite iru no ka. Shu no tami ga mina yogensha to nari, Shu ga sono rei o karera ni ataerareru koto wa, negawashii koto da".
Kou shite Moose wa Isuraeru no chouroutachi to tomo ni, shukuei ni hikiageta.
Sate, Shu no moto kara kaze ga okori, umi no mukou kara, uzura o hakonde kite, kore o shukuei no chikaku ni otoshita. Sono ochita han'i wa, shukuei no shuui de, kochiragawa mo, ooyoso ichi nichi no koutei, achiragawa mo, ooyoso ichi nichi no koutei, jimen kara takasa ooyoso ni kyubito de atta.
Soko de tami wa tachiagatte sono hi wa shuujitsu, sono yo wa shuuya, mata sono tsugi no hi mo shuujitsu, uzura o atsumetaga, atsumeru koto no mottomo sukunai mono mo, juu homeru hodo atsumeta. Karera wa mina, sore o shukuei no shuui ni hirogete oita.
Sono niku ga nao, karera no ha no aida ni atte tabe tsukusanai uchi ni, Shu wa tami ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, Shu wa hijou ni hageshii ekibyou o motte tami o utareta.
Kore ni yotte, sono tokoro no na wa kiburote hattawa to yobareta. Yokushin o okoshita tami o, soko ni umetakara de aru.
Kiburote hattawa kara, tami wa Hazerote ni susumi, Hazerote ni todomatta.
Moose wa Kushi no onna o metotte itaga, sono Kushi no onna o metotta yue o motte, Miriamu to Aron wa Moose o hinan shita.
Karera wa itta, "Shu wa tada Moose ni yotte katarareru no ka. Wareware ni yotte mo katarareru no de wa nai no ka". Shu wa kore o kikareta.
Moose wa sono hitotonari nyuuwa na koto, chijou no subete no hito ni masatte ita.
Soko de, Shu wa totsuzen Moose to Aron, oyobi Miriamu ni mukatte "Anata gata sannin, kaiken no makuya ni dete ki nasai" to iwareta no de, karera sannin wa dete kitaga,
Shu wa kumo no hashira no uchi ni atte kudari, makuya no iriguchi ni tatte, Aron to Miriamu o yobareta. Karera futari ga susumideruto,
Karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, ima, watashi no kotoba o kiki nasai. Anata gata no uchi ni, moshi, yogensha ga arunaraba, Shu naru watashi wa maboroshi o motte, kore ni watashi o shirase, mata yume o motte, kore to katarude arou.
Shikashi, watashi no shimobe Moose to wa, sou de wa nai. Kare wa watashi no zenka ni chuushin naru mono de aru.
Kare to wa, watashi wa kuchizukara katari, akiraka ni itte, nazo o tsukawanai. Kare wa mata Shu no katachi o miru no de aru. Naze, anata gata wa watashi no shimobe Moose o osorezu hinan suru no ka".
Shu wa karera ni mukai ikari o hasshite sarareta.
Kumo ga makuya no ue o hanaresatta toki, Miriamu wa, raibyou to nari, sono mi wa yuki no you ni shiroku natta. Aron ga furikaette Miriamu o miruto, kanojo wa raibyou ni natte ita.
Soko de, Aron wa Moose ni itta, "Aa, waga Shu yo, watashitachi wa oroka na koto o shite tsumi o okashimashita. Douzo, sono batsu o watashitachi ni ukesasenaide kudasai.
Douzo kanojo o haha no tai kara niku ga nakaba horobi usete deru shinin no you ni shinaide kudasai".
Sono toki Moose wa Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Aa, kami yo, douzo kanojo o iyashite kudasai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kanojo no chichi ga kanojo no kao ni tsubaki shite sae, kanojo wa nanuka no aida, hajite mi o kakusude wa nai ka. Kanojo o nanuka no aida, shukuei no soto de tojikomete okanakereba naranai. Sono nochi, tsuremodoshite mo yoi".
Soko de Miriamu wa nanuka no aida, shukuei no soto de tojikomerareta. Tami wa Miriamu ga tsuremodosareru made wa, michi ni susumanakatta.
Sono nochi, tami wa Hazerote o tatte susumi, Paran no arano ni shukuei shita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Hito o tsukawashite, watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeru Kanan no chi o sagurase nasai. Sunawachi, sono fuso no buzokugoto ni, subete karera no uchi no tsukasa taru mono hitori zutsu o tsukawashi nasai".
Moose wa Shu no mei ni shitagatte, Paran no arano kara karera o tsukawashita. Sono hitobito wa mina Isuraeru no hitobito no kashiratachi de atta.
Karera no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Ruben no buzoku de wa ZaKkuru no ko Shanma,
Shimeon no buzoku de wa Hori no koShapate,
Yuda no buzoku de wa Efunne no ko Karebu,
Issakaru no buzoku de wa Yosefu no ko Igaru,
Efuraimu no buzoku de wa Nun no ko Hosea,
Beniyamin no buzoku de wa Rafu no ko Parute,
Zeburun no buzoku de wa Sode no ko Gadeeru,
Yosefu no buzoku sunawachi, Manase no buzoku de wa Sushi no ko Gade,
Dan no buzoku de wa Gemari no ko Anmieru,
Aseru no buzoku de wa Mikaeru no ko Setoru,
Nafutari no buzoku de wa Wafushi no ko Nahebi,
Gado no buzoku de wa Maki no ko Giueru.
Ijou wa Moose ga sono chi o saguraseru tame ni tsukawashita hitobito no na de aru. Soshite Moose wa Nun no ko Hosea o Yoshua to nazuketa.
Moose wa karera o tsukawashi, Kanan no chi o saguraseyou to shite, kore ni itta, "Anata gata wa Negebu ni itte, yama ni nobori,
Sono chi no yousu o mi, soko ni sumu tami wa, tsuyoi kayowai ka, sukunai ka ooi ka,
Mata karera no sunde iru chi wa, yoi ka warui ka. Hitobito no sunde iru machimachi wa, tenmaku ka, jouheki no aru machi ka,
Sono chi wa, koete iru ka, yasete iru ka, soko ni wa, ki ga aru ka nai ka o mi nasai. Anata gata wa, isande itte, sono chi no kudamono o totte ki nasai". Toki wa, budou no jukushi hajimeru kisetsu de atta.
Soko de, karera wa nobotte itte, sono chi o Chin no arano kara Hamate no iriguchi ni chikai Rehobu made sagutta.
Karera wa Negebu ni nobotte, Heburon made itta. Soko ni wa Anaku no shison de aru Ahiman, Seshai, oyobi Tarumai ga ita. Heburon wa Ejiputo no Zoan yori mo nana nen mae ni taterareta mono de aru.
Tsuini karera wa Eshikoru no tani ni itte, soko de ichi fusa no budou no eda o kiritori, kore o bou o motte, futari de katsugi, mata, zakuro to ichijiku o mo totta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, soko de kiritotta budou no ichi fusani chinande, sono tokoro wa Eshikoru no tani to yobareta.
Yonjuu nichi no nochi, karera wa sono chi o saguri owatte kaette kita.
Soshite, Paran no arano ni aru Kadeshi ni ita Moose to Aron, oyobi Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu no moto ni itte, karera to zenkaishuu to ni fukumei shi, sono chi no kudamono o karera ni miseta.
Karera wa Moose ni itta, "Watashitachi wa anata ga, tsukawashita chi e ikimashita. Soko wa makoto ni chichi to mitsu no nagarete iru chi desu. Kore wa sono kudamono desu.
Shikashi, sono chi ni sumu tami wa tsuyoku, sono machimachi wa kengo de hijou ni ookiku, watashitachi wa soko ni Anaku no shison ga iru no o mimashita.
Mata Negebu no chi ni wa, Amareku bito ga sumi, sanchi ni wa Hete bi to, Ebusu bi to, Amori bito ga sumi, umibe to Yorudan no kishibe ni wa, Kanan bito ga sunde imasu".
Sono toki, Karebu wa Moose no mae de, tami o shizumete itta, "Watashitachi wa sugu ni nobotte, semetorimashou. Watashitachi wa kanarazu katsu koto ga dekimasu".
Shikashi, kare to tomo ni nobotte itta hitobito wa itta, "Watashitachi wa sono tami no tokoro e semenoboru koto wa dekimasen. Karera wa watashitachi yori mo tsuyoikara desu".
Soshite karera wa sono sagutta chi no koto o, Isuraeru no hitobito ni waruku iifurashite itta, "Watashitachi ga iki megutte sagutta chi wa, soko ni sumu mono o horobosu chi desu. Mata sono tokoro de watashitachi ga mita tami wa mina se no takai hitobito desu.
Watashitachi wa mata soko de, Nepirimu kara deta Anaku no shison Nepirimu o mimashita. Watashitachi ni wa jibun ga, inago no you ni omoware, mata karera ni mo, sou mieta ni chigai arimasen".
Soko de, kaishuu wa mina koe o agete sakebi, tami wa sono yo, nakiakashita.
Mata Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina Moose to Aron ni mukatte tsubuyaki, zenkaishuu wa karera ni itta, "Aa, watashitachi wa Ejiputo no kuni de shinde itara yokatta no ni. Kono arano de shinde itara yokatta no ni.
Naniyue, Shu wa watashitachi o kono chi ni tsurete kite, tsurugi ni taoresase, mata watashitachi no saishi o ejiki to sareru no de arou ka. Ejiputo ni kaeru hou ga, mushiro yoide wa nai ka".
Karera wa tagai ni itta, "Watashitachi wa hitori no kashira o tatete, Ejiputo ni kaerou".
Soko de, Moose to Aron wa Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu no mae de hirefushita.
Kono toki, sono chi o sagutta mono no uchi no Nun no ko Yoshua to Efunne no ko Karebu wa, sono ifuku o saki,
Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu ni itta, "Watashitachi ga iki megutte sagutta chi wa hijou ni yoi chi desu.
Moshi, Shu ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, watashitachi o sono chi ni michibiite itte, sore o watashitachi ni kudasarudeshou. Sore wa chichi to mitsu no nagarete iru chi desu.
Tada, Shu ni somuite wa narimasen. Mata sono chi no tami o osorete wa narimasen. Karera wa watashitachi no kuimono ni sugimasen. Karera o mamoru mono wa surinozokaremasu. Shu ga watashitachi to tomo ni oraremasukara, karera o osorete wa narimasen".
Tokoro ga kaishuu wa mina ishi de karera o uchikorosou to shita. Sono toki, Shu no eikou ga, kaiken no makuya kara Isuraeru no subete no hito ni arawareta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kono tami wa itsu made watashi o anadoru no ka. Watashi ga moromoro no shirushi o karera no uchi ni itta no ni, karera wa itsu made watashi o shinjinai no ka.
Watashi wa ekibyou o motte karera o uchi horoboshi, anata o karera yori mo ooinaru tsuyoi kokumin to shiyou".
Moose wa Shu ni itta, "Ejiputo bi to wa, anata ga chikara o motte, kono tami o karera no uchi kara michibikidasareta koto o kiite,
Kono chi no juumin ni tsugerudeshou. Karera wa, Shu naru anata ga, kono tami no uchi ni orare, Shu naru anata ga, manoatari araware, anata no kumo ga, karera no ue ni todomari, hiru wa kumo no hashira no uchi ni, yoru wa hi no hashira no uchi ni atte, karera no mae ni ikareru no o kiita no desu.
Ima, moshi, anata ga kono tami o hitori nokorazu korosarerunaraba, anata no koto o kiita kokumin wa katatte,
'Shu wa ataeru to chikatta chi ni, kono tami o michibikiireru koto ga dekinakatta tame, karera o arano de koroshita no da' to iudeshou.
Douzo, anata ga yakusoku sareta you ni, ima Shu no ooinaru chikara o arawashite kudasai.
Anata wa katsute, 'Shu wa ikaru koto osoku, itsukushimi ni tomi, tsumi to toga o yurusu mono, shikashi, batsusubeki mono wa, kesshite yurusazu, chichi no tsumi o ko ni mukuite, san'yon dai ni oyobosu mono de aru' to iwaremashita.
Douzo, anata no ooinaru itsukushimi ni yotte, Ejiputo kara konokata, ima ni itaru made, kono tami o yurusareta you ni, kono tami no tsumi o oyurushi kudasai".
Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no kotoba no toori ni yurusou.
Shikashi, watashi wa ikite iru. Mata Shu no eikou ga, zensekai ni michite iru.
Watashi no eikou to, watashi ga Ejiputo to arano de itta shirushi o minagara, kono you ni juu do mo watashi o kokoromite, watashi no koe ni kiki shitagawanakatta hitobito wa hitori mo,
Watashi ga katsute karera no senzotachi ni ataeru to chikatta chi o minaide arou. Mata watashi o anadotta hitobito mo, sore o minaide arou.
Tadashi, watashi no shimobe Karebu wa chigatta kokoro o motte ite, watashi ni kanzen ni shitagatta no de, watashi wa kare ga itte kita chi ni kare o michibikiirerude arou. Kare no shison wa sore o shoyuu suru ni itarude arou.
Tani ni wa Amareku bito to Kanan bito ga sunde irukara, anata gata wa, asu, mi o megurashite koukai no michi o arano e susumi nasai".
Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta,
"Watashi ni mukatte tsubuyaku kono warui kaishuu o itsu made shinobu koto ga dekiyou ka. Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga, watashi ni mukatte tsubuyaku no o kiita.
Anata wa karera ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi wa ikite iru. Anata ga taga, watashi no mimi ni katatta you ni, watashi wa anata gata ni surude arou.
Anata gata wa shitai to natte, kono arano ni taorerude arou. Anata gata no uchi, watashi ni mukatte tsubuyaita mono, sunawachi, subete kazoerareta nijuusai ijou no mono wa mina taorerude arou.
Efunne no ko Karebu to, Nun no ko Yoshua no hoka wa, watashi ga katsute, anatagata o sumawaseyou to, te o agete chikatta chi ni, hairu koto ga dekinaide arou.
Shikashi, anata ga taga, ejiki ni narude arou to itta anata gata no kodomo wa, watashi ga michibiite, hairude arou. Karera wa anata ga taga, iyashimeta chi o shiru you ni narude arou.
Shikashi anata gata wa shitai to natte kono arano ni taorerude arou.
Anata gata no kotachi wa, anata gata no shitai ga arano ni kuchi hateru made yonjuu nen no aida, arano de hitsujikai to nari, anata gata no fushin no tsumi o oude arou.
Anata gata wa, kano chi o sagutta yonjuu nichi no hikazu ni shitagai, sono tsuitachi o ichi nen to shite, yonjuu nen no aida, jibun no tsumi o oi, watashi ga anatagata o toozakatta koto o shirude arou".
Shu naru watashi ga kore o iu. Watashi wa kanarazu watashi ni sakaratte atsumatta kono warui kaishuu ni, kore o kotogotoku okonaude arou. Karera wa kono arano ni kuchi, koko de shinude arou' ".
Kou shite, Moose ni tsukawasare, kano chi o saguri ni iki, kaette kite, sono chi o waruku ii, zenkaishuu o, Moose ni mukatte, tsubuyakaseta hitobito,
Sunawachi, sono chi o waruku iifurashita hitobito wa, ekibyou ni kakatte Shu no mae ni shindaga,
Sono chi o saguri ni itta hitobito no uchi, Nun no ko Yoshua to, Efunne no ko Karebu to wa ikinokotta.
Moose ga, korera no koto o, Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ni tsugeta toki, tami wa hijou ni kanashimi,
Asa hayaku okite yama no itadaki ni nobotte itta, "Watashitachi wa koko ni iru. Saa, Shu ga yakusoku sareta tokoro e nobotte ikou. Watashitachi wa tsumi o okashita no dakara".
Moose wa itta, "Anata gata wa, sore o nashitogeru koto mo dekinai no ni, dou shite, sono you ni Shu no mei ni somuku no ka.
Anata gata wa nobotte itte wa naranai. Shu ga anata gata no uchi ni orarenaikara, anata gata wa teki no mae ni, uchiyaburarerude arou.
Soko ni wa, Amareku bito to, Kanan bito ga anata gata no mae ni irukara, anata gata wa, tsurugi ni taorerude arou. Anata gata ga somuite, Shu ni shitagawanakatta yue, Shu wa anata gata to tomo ni orarenaikara de aru".
Shikashi, karera wa, hoshiimama ni yama no itadaki ni nobotta. Tadashi, Shu no keiyaku no hako to, Moose to wa, shukuei no naka kara denakatta.
Soko de, sono yama ni sunde ita Amareku bito to, Kanan bito ga kudatte kite, karera o uchiyaburi, Horuma made otte kita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Anata ga taga, watashi no ataete sumaseru chi ni itte,
Shu ni kasai o sasageru toki, sunawachi tokubetsu no seigan no sonaemono, aruiha jihatsu no sonaemono, aruiha shuku no toki no sonaemono to shite, ushi mata wa hitsuji o hansai mata wa gisei to shite sasage, Shu ni koubashii kaori to suru toki,
[4-5] Sono sonaemono o Shu ni sasageru mono wa, hansai mata wa gisei to tomo ni, kohitsuji ichitougoto ni, mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no ichi ni, abura ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o mazeta mono o, sosai to shite sasage, budoushu ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o, kansai to shite sasagenakereba naranai.
[4-5] Sono sonaemono o Shu ni sasageru mono wa, hansai mata wa gisei to tomo ni, kohitsuji ichitougoto ni, mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no ichi ni, abura ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o mazeta mono o, sosai to shite sasage, budoushu ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o, kansai to shite sasagenakereba naranai.
Moshi, mata ohitsuji o mochiiru toki wa, mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no ni ni, abura ichi hin no sanbun no ichi o mazeta mono o, sosai to shite sasage,
Mata, budoushu ichi hin no sanbun no ichi o, kansai to shite sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai.
Mata anata ga tokubetsu no seigan no sonaemono, aruiha shuuonsai o, Shu ni sasageru toki, wakai oushi o, hansai mata wa gisei to surunaraba,
Mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no san ni, abura ichi hin no nibun no ichi o mazeta mono o, sosai to shite, wakai oushi to tomo ni sasage,
Mata, budoushu ichi hin no nibun no ichi o, kansai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Kore wa kasai de atte, Shu ni koubashii kaori to suru mono de aru.
Oushi, aruiha ohitsuji, aruiha kohitsuji, aruiha koyagi wa, ichitougoto ni, kono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, anata gata no sasageru kazu ni terashi, sono kazu ni shitagatte, ichitougoto ni, kono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Subetekuni ni umareta mono ga, kasai o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to suru toki wa, kono you ni, korera no koto o okonawanakereba naranai.
Mata anata gata no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin, mata wa anata gata no uchi ni, yoyo nagaku sumu mono ga, kasai o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shiyou to suru toki wa, anata gata ga suru you ni, sono hito mo shinakereba naranai.
Kaishuu taru mono wa, anata gata mo, anata gata no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin mo, douitsu no sadame ni shitagawanakereba naranai. Kore wa, anata gata ga yoyo nagaku mamorubeki sadame de aru. Takoku no hito mo, Shu no mae ni wa, anata gata to hitoshiku nakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, anata gata mo, anata gata no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin mo, douitsu no rippou, douitsu no okite ni shitagawanakereba naranai' ".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Watashi ga michibiite iku chi ni, anata gata ga haitte,
Sono chi no shokumotsu o taberu toki, anata gata wa, sasagemono o Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, mugiko no hatsumono de tsukutta kashi o, sasagemono to shinakereba naranai. Kore o, uchi ba kara no sasagemono no you ni, sasagenakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa yoyo sono mugiko no hatsumono de, Shu ni sasagemono o shinakereba naranai.
Anata ga taga, moshi ayamatte, Shu ga Moose ni tsugerareta kono subete no imashime o okonawazu,
Shu ga Moose ni yotte imashime o ataerareta hi kara konokata, yoyo ni watari, anata gata ni meijirareta subete no koto o okonawanai toki,
Sunawachi, kaishuu ga shirazu ni, ayamatte okashita toki wa, zenkaishuu wa wakai oushi ichitou o, hansai to shite sasage, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shi, kore ni sosai to kansai to o sadame no you ni kuwae, mata o yagi ichitou o, zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai.
Soshite saishi wa, Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu no tame ni, tsumi no a ga nai o shinakereba naranai. Sou sureba, karera wa yurusarerude arou. Sore wa kashitsu dakara de aru. Karera wa sono kashitsu no tame ni, sono sonaemono to shite, kasai o Shu ni sasage, mata zaisai o Shu no mae ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Sou sureba, Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa yurusare, mata karera no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin mo, yurusarerude arou. Tami wa mina kashitsu o okashitakara de aru.
Moshi hito ga ayamatte tsumi o okasu toki wa, ichisai no me yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai.
Soshite saishi wa, hito ga ayamatte tsumi o okashita toki, sono ayamatte tsumi o okashita hito no tame ni, Shu no mae ni tsumi no a ga nai o shite, sono tsumi o aganawanakereba naranai. Sou sureba, kare wa yurusarerude arou.
Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no, kuni ni umareta mono de mo, sono uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin de mo, ayamatte tsumi o okasu mono ni wa, anata gata wa douitsu no rippou o mochiinakereba naranai.
Shikashi, kuni ni umareta mono de mo, takoku no hito de mo, koi ni tsumi o okasu mono wa Shu o kegasu mono de, sono hito wa tami no uchi kara tatarenakereba naranai.
Kare wa Shu no kotoba o anadori, sono imashime o yabutta no de arukara, kanarazu tatare, sono tsumi o owanakereba naranai' ".
Isuraeru no hitobito ga arano ni oru toki, ansokunichi ni hitori no hito ga, takigi o atsumeru no o mita.
Sono takigi o atsumeru no o mita hitobito wa, sono hito o Moose to Aron, oyobi zenkaishuu no moto ni tsurete kitaga,
Dou toriatsukaubeki ka, mada shimeshi o ukete inakatta no de, kare o tojikomete oita.
Sono toki, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Sono hito wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai. Zenkaishuu wa shukuei no soto de, kare o ishi de uchikorosanakereba naranai".
Soko de, zenkaishuu wa kare o shukuei no soto ni tsuredashi, kare o ishi de uchikoroshi, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni shita.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite, yoyo sono ifuku no suso no yon sumi ni fusa o tsuke, sono fusa o ao himo de, suso no yon sumi ni tsukesase nasai.
Anata ga taga, sono fusa o mite, Shu no moromoro no imashime o omoiokoshite, sore o okonai, anata gata ga jibun no kokoro to, me no yoku ni shitagatte, midara na okonai o shinai tame de aru.
Kou shite, anata gata wa, watashi no moromoro no imashime o omoiokoshite, sore o okonai, anata gata no kami ni sei naru mono to naranakereba naranai.
Watashi wa anata gata no kami, Shu de atte, anata gata no kami to naru tame ni, anatagata o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidashita mono de aru. Watashi wa anata gata no kami, Shu de aru".
Koko ni, Rebi no ko Kohate no ko naru Izuharu no ko Kora to, Ruben no ko naru Eriabu no ko Datan oyobi Abiramu to, Ruben no ko naru Perete no ko On to ga aimusubi,
Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi, kaishuu no uchi kara erabarete, tsukasa to natta na no aru hitobito nihyaku gojuunin to tomo ni tatte, Moose ni sakaratta.
Karera wa atsumatte, Moose to Aron to ni sakaratte itta, "Anata gata wa, bun o koete imasu. Zenkaishuu wa, kotogotoku sei naru mono de atte, Shu ga sono uchi ni orareru no ni, dou shite anata gata wa, Shu no kaishuu no ue ni tatsu no desu ka".
Moose wa kore o kiite hirefushita.
Yagate kare wa Kora to, sono subete no nakama to ni itta, "Asu, Shu wa, Shu ni tsuku mono wa dare, sei naru mono wa dare de aru ka o shimeshite, sono hito o mimoto ni chikazukerarerude arou. Sunawachi, sono eranda hito o, mimoto ni chikazukerarerude arou.
Sore de, tsugi no you ni shi nasai. Kora to sono subete no nakama to wa, hi zara o tori,
Sono naka ni hi o ire, sore ni kunkou o motte, asu, Shu no mae ni de nasai. Sono toki, Shu ga erabareru hito wa sei naru mono de aru. Rebi no kotachi yo, anata gata koso, bun o koete iru".
Moose wa mata Kora ni itta, "Rebi no kotachi yo, kiki nasai.
Isuraeru no kami wa anatagata o Isuraeru no kaishuu no uchi kara wakachi, Shu ni chikazukasete, Shu no makuya no tsutome o sase, katsu kaishuu no mae ni tatte tsukaesaserareru. Kore wa anata gata ni totte, chiisai koto de arou ka.
Kami wa anata to anata no kyoudai naru Rebi no kotachi o mina chikazukerareta. Anata gata wa nao, sono ue ni saishi to naru koto o motomeru no ka.
Anata to anata no nakama wa, mina sono tame ni atsumatte Shu ni tekishite iru. Anata gata wa Aron o nan to omotte, kare ni taishite tsubuyaku no ka".
Moose wa hito o yatte, Eriabu no ko Datan to Abiramu to o yobasetaga, karera wa itta, "Watashitachi wa mairimasen.
Anata wa chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi kara, watashitachi o michibikidashite, arano de watashitachi o korosou to shite iru. Kore wa chiisai koto deshou ka. Sono ue, anata wa watashitachi ni kunrin shiyou to shite iru.
Katsu mata, anata wa watashitachi o, chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi ni michibiite ikazu, hatake to, budou hatake to o shigyou to shite atae mo shinai. Korera no hitobito no me o kuramasou to suru no desu ka. Watashitachi wa mairimasen".
Moose wa ooini ikatte, Shu ni itta, "Karera no sonaemono o kaeriminaide kudasai. Watashi wa karera kara, roba ichitou o mo totta koto naku, mata karera no hitori o mo gaishita koto wa arimasen".
Soshite Moose wa Kora ni itta, "Anata to anata no nakama wa mina Aron to issho ni, asu, Shu no mae ni de nasai.
Anata gata wa, onoono hi zara o totte, sore ni kunkou o mori, onoono sono hi zara o Shu no mae ni tazusaete iki nasai. Sono hi zara wa awasete nihyaku gojuu. Anata to Aron mo, onoono hi zara o tazusaete iki nasai".
Karera wa, onoono hi zara o tori, hi o sono naka ni ire, sore ni kunkou o mori, Moose to Aron mo tomo ni, kaiken no makuya no iriguchi ni tatta.
Sono toki, Kora wa kaishuu o, kotogotoku kaiken no makuya no iriguchi ni atsumete, karera futari ni sakarawaseyou to shitaga, Shu no eikou wa zenkaishuu ni arawareta.
Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta,
"Anata gata wa kono kaishuu o hanare nasai. Watashi wa tadachini karera o horobosude arou".
Karera futari wa, hirefushite itta, "Kami yo, subete no niku naru mono no inochi no kami yo, kono hitori no hito ga, tsumi o okashitakara to itte, anata wa zenkaishuu ni taishite ikarareru no desu ka".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa kaishuu ni tsugete, Kora to Datan to Abiramu no sumai no shuui o sare to ii nasai".
Moose wa tatte Datan to Abiramu no moto ni ittaga, Isuraeru no chouroutachi mo, kare ni shitagatte itta.
Moose wa kaishuu ni itta, "Douzo, anata gata wa korera no warui hitobito no tenmaku o hanarete kudasai. Karera no mono ni wa nanini mo furete wa naranai. Karera no moromoro no tsumi ni yotte, anata gata mo horobosarete wa ikenaikara".
Soko de hitobito wa Kora to Datan to Abiramu no sumai no shuui o hanaresatta. Soshite, Datan to Abiramu to wa, tsuma, ko, oyobi youji to issho ni dete, tenmaku no iriguchi ni tatta.
Moose wa itta, "Anata gata wa Shu ga korera no subete no koto o saseru tame ni, watashi o tsukawasareta koto, mata watashi ga, kore o jibun no kokoro ni shitagatte okonau mono de nai koto o, tsugi no koto ni yotte shirude arou.
Sunawachi, moshi korera no hitobito ga, futsuu no shinikata de shini, futsuu no unmei ni au no de areba, Shu ga watashi o tsukawasareta no de wa nai.
Shikashi, Shu ga atarashii koto o sare, chi ga kuchi o hiraite, korera no hitobito to, sore ni zokusuru mono to o, kotogotoku nomi tsukushite, ikinagara yomi ni kudaraserarerunaraba, anata gata wa korera no hitobito ga, Shu o anadotta no de aru koto o shiranakereba naranai".
Moose ga, korera no subete no kotoba o nobe owatta toki, karera no shita no tochi ga sake,
Chi wa kuchi o hiraite, karera to sono kazoku, narabi ni Kora ni zokusuru subete no hitobito to, subete no shoyuubutsu o nomi tsukushita.
Sunawachi, karera to, karera ni zokusuru mono wa, mina ikinagara yomi ni kudari, chi wa sono ue o tojifusaide, karera wa kaishuu no uchi kara, tachi horobosareta.
Kono toki, sono shuui ni ita Isuraeru no hitobito wa, mina karera no sakebi o kiite nigesari, "Osoraku chi wa watashitachi o mo, nomi tsukusude arou" to itta.
Mata Shu no moto kara hi ga dete, kunkou o sonaeru nihyaku gojuunin o mo yaki tsukushita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa saishi Aron no ko Ereazaru ni tsugete, sono moeru hi no naka kara, kano hi zara o toridasase, sono naka no hi o tooku hiroku makichirasase nasai. Sorera no hi zara wa sei to nattakara,
Tsumi o okashite inochi o ushinatta hitobito no, korera no hi zara o, hiroi nobeita to shite, saidan no ooi to shi nasai. Kore wa Shu no mae ni sasagerarete, sei to nattakara de aru. Kou shite, kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni, shirushi to narude arou".
Soko de saishi Ereazaru wa, kano yakikorosareta hitobito ga sonaeta seidou no hi zara o tori, kore o hiroku uchi nobashite, saidan no ooi to shi,
Kore o Isuraeru no hitobito no kinen no mono to shita. Kore wa Aron no shison de nai hoka no hito ga, Shu no mae ni chikazuite, kunkou o taku koto no nai you ni suru tame, mata sono hito ga Kora, oyobi sono nakama no you ni naranai tame de aru. Sunawachi, Shu ga Moose ni yotte Ereazaru ni iwareta toori de aru.
Sono yokujitsu, Isuraeru no hitobito no kaishuu wa, mina Moose to Aron to ni tsubuyaite itta, "Anata gata wa Shu no tami o koroshimashita".
Kaishuu ga atsumatte, Moose to Aron to ni sakaratta toki, kaiken no makuya o nozomimiruto, kumo ga kore o ooi, Shu no eikou ga arawarete ita.
Moose to Aron to ga, kaiken no makuya no mae ni ikuto,
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata gata wa kono kaishuu o hanare nasai. Watashi wa tadachini karera o horobosou". Soko de karera futari wa, hirefushita.
Moose wa Aron ni itta, "Anata wa hi zara o totte, sore ni saidan kara totta hi o ire, sono ue ni kunkou o mori, isoide sore o kaishuu no moto ni motte itte, karera no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shi nasai. Shu ga ikari o hasserare, ekibyou ga sudeni hajimattakara desu".
Soko de, Aron wa Moose no itta you ni, sore o totte kaishuu no naka ni hashitte ittaga, ekibyou wa sudeni tami no uchi ni hajimatte ita no de, kunkou o taite, tami no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shi,
Sudeni shinda mono to, nao ikite iru mono to no aida ni tatsuto, ekibyou wa yanda.
Kora no koto ni yotte shinda mono no hoka ni, kono ekibyou ni yotte shinda mono wa ichi man yonsen nanahyakunin de atta.
Aron wa kaiken no makuya no iriguchi ni iru Moose no moto ni kaetta. Kou shite ekibyou wa yanda.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsugete, karera no uchi kara, onoono no fuso no ie ni shitagatte, tsue ichipon zutsu o tori nasai. Sunawachi, sono subete no tsukasatachi kara, fuso no ie ni shitagatte, tsue juu nihon o tori, sono hitobito no na o, onoono sono tsue ni kakishirushi,
Rebi no tsue ni wa Aron no na o kakishirushi nasai. Fuso no ie no kashira wa, onoono no tsue ichipon o dasu no dakara de aru.
Soshite, korera no tsue o, watashi ga anata gata ni au kaiken no makuya no naka no, akashi no hako no mae ni oki nasai.
Watashi no eranda hito no tsue ni wa, me ga derude arou. Kou shite, watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga, anata gata ni mukatte, tsubuyaku no o yame saserude arou".
Moose ga, kono you ni Isuraeru no hitobito ni katatta no de, tsukasatachi wa mina, sono fuso no ie ni shitagatte, onoono, tsue ichipon zutsu o kare ni watashita. Sono tsue wa awasete juu nihon. Aron no tsue mo, sono tsue no uchi ni atta.
Moose wa, sorera no tsue o, akashi no makuya no naka no, Shu no mae ni oita.
Sono yokujitsu, Moose ga, akashi no makuya ni haitte miruto, Rebi no ie no tame ni dashita Aron no tsue wa me o fuki, tsubomi o dashi, hana ga saite, a mendou no mi o musunde ita.
Moose ga sorera no tsue o, kotogotoku Shu no mae kara, Isuraeru no subete no hito no tokoro ni mochidashita no de, karera wa mite, onoono jibun no tsue o totta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Aron no tsue o, akashi no hako no mae ni mochikaeri, soko ni hozon shite, somuku monodomo no tame ni, shirushi to shi nasai. Kou shite, karera no watashi ni taisuru tsubuyaki o yamesase, karera no shinu no o manukaresasenakereba naranai".
Moose wa sono you ni shite, Shu ga kare ni meijirareta toori ni okonatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, Moose ni itta, "Aa, watashitachi wa shinu. Hametsu desu, zenmetsu desu.
Shu no makuya ni chikazuku mono ga, mina shinu no de areba, watashitachi wa shinitaerude wa arimasen ka".
Soko de, Shu wa Aron ni iwareta, "Anata to anata no kotachi, oyobi anata no fuso no ie no mono wa, seijo ni kansuru tsumi o owanakereba naranai. Mata, anata to anata no kotachi to wa, saishi shoku ni kansuru tsumi o owanakereba naranai.
Anata wa mata, anata no kyoudai naru Rebi no buzoku no mono, sunawachi, anata no fuso no buzoku no monodomo o, anata ni chikazukase, anata ni tsuranari, anata ni tsukaesasenakereba naranai. Tadashi, anata to anata no kotachi to wa, tomo ni akashi no makuya no mae de tsukaenakereba naranai.
Karera wa, anata no tsutome to, subete no makuya no tsutome to o mamoranakereba naranai. Tadashi, seijo no utsuwa to, saidan to ni chikazuite wa naranai. Karera mo anata gata mo, shinu koto no nai tame de aru.
Karera wa anata ni tsuranatte, kaiken no makuya no tsutome o mamori, makuya no moromoro no hataraki o shinakereba naranai. Hoka no mono wa, anata gata ni chikazuite wa naranai.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa, seijo no tsutome to, saidan no tsutome to o mamoranakereba naranai. Sou sureba, Shu no hageshii ikari wa, kasanete Isuraeru no hitobito ni nozomanaide arou.
Watashi wa anata gata no kyoudai taru Rebi bito o, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara tori, Shu no tame ni, kore o tamamono to shite, anata gata ni atae, kaiken no makuya no hataraki o saseru.
Anata to anata no kotachi wa tomo ni saishi shoku o mamotte, saidan to, taremaku no uchi no subete no koto o toriokonai, tomo ni tsutomenakereba naranai. Watashi wa saishi no shokumu o tamamono to shite, anata gata ni ataeru. Hoka no hito de chikazuku mono wa korosarerude arou".
Shu wa mata Aron ni iwareta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito no, subete no sei naru sonaemono de, watashi ni sasageru mono no ichibu o anata ni ataeru. Sunawachi, watashi wa kore o anata to, anata no kotachi ni, sono wakemae to shite atae, eikyuu ni u kubeki bun to suru.
Ito sei naru sonaemono no uchi, hi de yakazu ni, anata ni kisubeki mono wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi, watashi ni sasageru subete no sonaemono, sosai, zaisai, kensai wa mina, ito sei naru mono de atte, anata to anata no kotachi ni kisurude arou.
Ito sei naru tokoro de, sore o tabenakereba naranai. Danshi wa mina, sore o taberu koto ga dekiru. Sore wa anata ni kisubeki sei naru mono de aru.
Mata anata ni kisubeki mono wa kore de aru. Sunawachi, Isuraeru no hitobito no sasageru sonaemono no uchi, subete yousai to suru mono de atte, kore o anata to anata no musuko musume ni ataete, eikyuu ni u kubeki bun to suru. Anata no ie no mono no uchi, kiyoi mono wa mina, kore o taberu koto ga dekiru.
Subete abura no mottomo yoi mono, oyobi subete atarashii budoushu to, kokumotsu no mottomo yoi mono nado, hitobito ga Shu ni sasageru hatsuho o anata ni ataeru.
Kuni no subete no sanbutsu no hatsumono de, hitobito ga Shu no moto ni tazusaete kita mono wa, anata ni kisurude arou. Anata no ie no mono no uchi, kiyoi mono wa mina, kore o taberu koto ga dekiru.
Isuraeru no uchi no hounoubutsu wa mina, anata ni kisuru.
Subete niku naru mono no ui go de atte, Shu ni sasagerareru mono wa mina, hito de mo kemono de mo, anata ni kisuru. Tadashi, hito no ui go wa kanarazu aganawanakereba naranai. Mata kegareta kemono no ui go mo, aganawanakereba naranai.
Hito no ui go wa seigo ichi kagetsu de, aganawanakereba naranai. Sono aganaikin wa anata no ne zumori ni yori, seijo no shikeru ni shitagatte, gin go shikeru de nakereba naranai. Ichi shikeru wa nijuu gera de aru.
Shikashi, ushi no ui go, hitsuji no ui go, yagi no ui go wa, aganatte wa naranai. Korera wa sei naru mono de aru. Sono chi o saidan ni sosogi kake, sono shibou o yaite kasai to shi, koubashii kaori to shite, Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono niku wa anata ni kisuru. Sore wa yousai no mune ya migi no momo to onajiku, anata ni kisuru.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, Shu ni sasageru sei naru sonaemono wa mina, anata to anata no musuko musume to ni ataete, eikyuu ni ukeru bun to suru. Kore wa Shu no mae ni atte, anata to anata no shison to ni taishi, eien ni kawaranu shio no keiyaku de aru".
Shu wa mata Aron ni iwareta, "Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito no chi no uchi ni, shigyou o motte wa naranai. Mata karera no uchi ni, nani no bun o mo motte wa naranai. Karera no uchi ni atte, watashi ga anata no bun de ari, anata no shigyou de aru.
Watashi wa Rebi no shison ni wa Isuraeru ni oite, subete juubun no ichi o shigyou to shite atae, sono hataraki, sunawachi, kaiken no makuya no hataraki ni mukuiru.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, kasanete kaiken no makuya ni chikazuite wa naranai. Tsumi o ete shinanai tame de aru.
Rebi bito dake ga kaiken no makuya no hataraki o shinakereba naranai. Karera ga sono tsumi o oude arou. Karera ga Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni, shigyou no chi o motanai koto o motte, anata gata no yoyo nagaku mamorubeki sadame to shinakereba naranai.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga sonaemono to shite Shu ni sasageru juubun no ichi o, Rebi bito ni shigyou to shite ataeta. Sore de 'Karera wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni, shigyou no chi o motte wa naranai' to, watashi wa karera ni itta no de aru".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Rebi bito ni ii nasai, 'Watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito kara totte, shigyou to shite ataeru juubun no ichi o ukeru toki, anata gata wa sono juubun no ichi no juubun no ichi o, Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Anata gata no sasagemono wa, uchi ba kara no kokumotsu ya, saka bune kara no budoushu to onaji you ni minasarerude arou.
Sono you ni anata gata mo mata, Isuraeru no hitobito kara ukeru subete no juubun no ichi no mono no uchi kara, Shu ni sonaemono o sasage, Shu ni sasageta sono sonaemono o, saishi Aron ni ataenakereba naranai.
Anata gata no ukeru subete no okurimono no uchi kara, sono yoi tokoro, sunawachi, sei naru bubun o totte, kotogotoku sonaemono to shite, Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai'.
Anata wa mata karera ni ii nasai, 'Anata ga taga, sono uchi kara yoi tokoro o totte sasageru toki, sono nokori no bubun wa Rebi bito ni wa, uchi ba no sanbutsu ya, saka bune no sanbutsu to onaji you ni minasarerude arou.
Anata gata to, anata gata no kazoku to wa, doko de sore o tabete mo yoi. Kore wa kaiken no makuya de anata gata ga suru hataraki no houshuu de aru.
Anata ga taga, sono yoi tokoro o sasageru toki wa, sore ni yotte, anata gata wa tsumi o owanaide arou. Anata gata wa Isuraeru no hitobito no sei naru sonaemono o kegashite wa naranai. Shi o manukareru tame de aru' ".
Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta,
"Shu no meijirareta rippou no sadame wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi 'Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsugete, kanzen de, kizu ga naku, mada kubiki o otta koto no nai akai meushi o, anata no moto ni hiite kosase,
Kore o saishi Ereazaru ni watashite, shukuei no soto ni hikidasase, kare no mae de kore o hofurasenakereba naranai.
Soshite saishi Ereazaru wa, yubi o motte sono chi o tori, kaiken no makuya no hyou ni mukatte, sono chi o nana tabi furikakenakereba naranai.
Tsuide sono meushi o jibun no me no mae de yakase, sono kawa to niku to chi to wa, sono obutsu to tomo ni yakanakereba naranai.
Soshite saishi wa kouhaku no ki to, hisopu to, hi no ito to o totte meushi no moete iru naka ni nageirenakereba naranai.
Soshite saishi wa ifuku o arai, mizu ni mi o susuide nochi, shukuei ni, hairu koto ga dekiru. Tadashi saishi wa yuu made kegareru.
Mata sono meushi o yaita mono mo mizu de ifuku o arai, mizu ni mi o susuganakereba naranai. Kare mo yuu made kegareru.
Sore kara mi no kiyoi mono ga hitori, sono meushi no hai o atsume, shukuei no soto no kiyoi tokoro ni takuwaete okanakereba naranai. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito no kaishuu no tame, kegare o kiyomeru mizu o tsukuru tame ni sonaeru mono de atte, tsumi o kiyomeru mono de aru.
Sono meushi no hai o atsumeta mono wa ifuku o arawanakereba naranai. Sono hito wa yuu made kegareru. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito to, sono uchi ni yadotte iru takokujin to no, eikyuu ni mamorubeki sadame to shinakereba naranai.
Subete hito no shitai ni fureru mono wa, nanuka no aida kegareru.
Sono hito wa mikkame to nanuka me to ni, kono hai no mizu o motte mi o kiyomenakereba naranai. Sou sureba kiyoku narude arou. Shikashi, moshi mikkame to nanuka me to ni, mi o kiyomenainaraba, kiyoku naranaide arou.
Subete shinin no shitai ni furete, mi o kiyomenai mono wa Shu no makuya o kegasu mono de, sono hito wa Isuraeru kara tatarenakereba naranai. Kegare o kiyomeru mizu ga sono mi ni sosogi kakerarenai yue, sono hito wa kiyoku narazu, sono kegare wa, nao, sono mi ni arukara de aru.
Hito ga tenmaku no naka de shinda toki ni mochiiru rippou wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi, subete sono tenmaku ni haitta mono, oyobi subete sono tenmaku ni ita mono wa nanuka no aida kegareru.
Futa de ue o oowanai utsuwa wa mina kegareru.
Tsurugi de korosareta mono, mata wa shinda mono, mata wa hito no hone, mata wa haka nado ni, yagai de fureru mono wa mina, nanuka no aida kegareru.
Kegareta mono ga atta toki ni wa, tsumi o kiyomeru yaita meushi no hai o totte utsuwa ni ire, nagare no mizu o kore ni kuwae,
Mi no kiyoi mono ga hitori hisopu o totte, sono mizu ni hitashi, kore o sono tenmaku to, subete no utsuwa to, soko ni ita hitobito to, hone, aruiha korosareta mono, aruiha shinda mono, aruiha haka nado ni fureta mono to ni furikakenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi sono mi no kiyoi hito wa mikkame to nanuka me to ni sono kegareta mono ni, sore o furikakenakereba naranai. Soshite nanuka me ni sono hito wa mi o kiyome, ifuku o arai, mizu ni mi o susuganakereba naranai. Sou sureba yuu ni natte kiyoku narude arou.
Shikashi, kegarete mi o kiyomenai hito wa Shu no seijo o kegasu mono de, sono hito wa kaishuu no uchi kara tatarenakereba naranai. Kegare o kiyomeru mizu ga sono mi ni sosogi kakerarenai yue, sono hito wa kegarete irukara de aru.
Kore wa karera no eikyuu ni mamorubeki sadame to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi kegare o kiyomeru mizu o furikaketa mono wa ifuku o arawanakereba naranai. Mata kegare o kiyomeru mizu ni fureta mono mo yuu made kegarerude arou.
Subete kegareta hito no fureru mono wa kegareru. Mata sore ni fureru hito mo yuu made kegarerude arou' ".
Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa shougatsu ni natte Chin no arano ni haitta. Soshite tami wa Kadeshi ni todomattaga, Miriamu ga soko de shinda no de, kanojo o soko ni houmutta.
Sono koro kaishuu wa mizu ga erarenakatta tame, aiatsumatte Moose to Aron ni sematta.
Sunawachi tami wa Moose to arasotte itta, "Saki ni wareware no kyoudaitachi ga Shu no mae ni shinda toki, wareware mo shinde itara yokatta mono o.
Naze, anata gata wa Shu no kaishuu o kono arano ni michibiite, wareware to, wareware no kachiku to o, koko de shinaseyou to suru no desu ka.
Dou shite anata gata wa wareware o Ejiputo kara noborasete, kono warui tokoro ni michibikiireta no desu ka. Koko ni wa tane o makutokoro mo naku, ichijiku mo naku, budou mo naku, zakuro mo naku, mata nomu mizu mo arimasen".
Soko de Moose to Aron wa kaishuu no mae o sari, kaiken no makuya no iriguchi e itte hirefushita. Suru to Shu no eikou ga karera ni araware,
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa, tsue o tori, anata no kyoudai Aron to tomo ni kaishuu o atsume, sono me no mae de iwa ni meijite mizu o dasase nasai. Kou shite anata wa karera no tame ni iwa kara mizu o dashite, kaishuu to sono kachiku ni nomase nasai".
Moose wa meijirareta you ni Shu no mae ni aru tsue o totta.
Moose wa Aron to tomo ni kaishuu o iwa no mae ni atsumete karera ni itta, "Somuku hitotachi yo, kiki nasai. Wareware ga anata gata no tame ni kono iwa kara mizu o dasanakereba naranai no de arou ka".
Moose wa te o age, tsue de iwa o ni do utsuto, mizu ga takusan wakideta no de, kaishuu to sono kachiku wa tomo ni nonda.
Sono toki Shu wa Moose to Aron ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa watashi o shinjinaide, Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni watashi no sei naru koto o arawasanakattakara, kono kaishuu o watashi ga karera ni ataeta chi ni michibikiireru koto ga dekinaide arou".
Kore ga Meriba no mizu de atte, Isuraeru no hitobito wa koko de Shu to arasottaga, Shu wa jibun no sei naru koto o karera no uchi ni arawasareta.
Sate, Moose wa Kadeshi kara Edomu no ou ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Anata no kyoudai, Isuraeru wa kou moushimasu, 'Anata wa watashitachi ga souguu shita subete no kannan o gozonji desu.
Watashitachi no senzo wa Ejiputo ni kudatte itte, watashitachi wa toshi hisashiku Ejiputo ni sunde imashitaga, Ejiputo bito ga watashitachi to, watashitachi no senzo o nayamashita no de,
Watashitachi ga Shu ni yobawatta toki, Shu wa watashitachi no koe o kiki, hitori no ten no tsukai o tsukawashite, watashitachi o Ejiputo kara michibikidasaremashita. Watashitachi wa ima anata no ryouchi no hashi ni aru Kadeshi no machi ni orimasu.
Douzo, watashitachi ni anata no kuni o toorasete kudasai. Watashitachi wa hatake mo budou hatake mo toorimasen. Mata ido no mizu mo nomimasen. Tada ou no ooji o toori, anata no ryouchi o sugiru made wa migi ni mo hidari ni mo magarimasen' ".
Shikashi, Edomu wa Moose ni itta, "Anata wa watashi no ryouchi o tootte wa narimasen. Samo naito, watashi wa tsurugi o motte dete, anata ni tachimukaudeshou".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Edomu ni itta, "Watashitachi wa ooji o toorimasu. Moshi watashitachi to watashitachi no kachiku to ga, anata no mizu o nomu koto ga areba, sono atai o haraimasu. Watashi wa toho de tooru dake desukara nanigoto mo naideshou".
Shikashi, Edomu wa "Anata wa tooru koto wa narimasen" to itte, ooku no tami to tsuyoi gunzei to o hikii, dete, kore ni tachimukatte kita.
Kono you ni Edomu wa Isuraeru ni, sono ryouchi o tooru koto o kobanda no de, Isuraeru wa Edomu kara hoka ni mukatta.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa Kadeshi kara susunde Horu yama ni tsuita.
Shu wa Edomu no kokkyou ni chikai Horu yama de, Moose to Aron ni iwareta,
"Aron wa sono tami ni tsuranaranakereba naranai. Kare wa watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeta chi ni, hairu koto ga dekinai. Kore wa Meriba no mizu de, anata gata ga watashi no kotoba ni somuitakara de aru.
Anata wa Aron to sono ko Ereazaru o tsurete Horu yama ni nobori,
Aron ni ifuku o nugasete, sore o sono ko Ereazaru ni kise nasai. Aron wa sono tokoro de shinde, sono tami ni tsuranarude arou".
Moose wa Shu ga meijirareta toori ni shi, tsuredatte zenkaishuu no me no mae de Horu yama ni nobotta.
Soshite Moose wa Aron ni ifuku o nugase, sore o sono ko Ereazaru ni kiseta. Aron wa sono yama no itadaki de shinda. Soshite Moose to Ereazaru wa yama kara kudattaga,
Zenkaishuu ga Aron no shinda no o mita toki, Isuraeru no zenka wa sanjuu nichi no aida Aron no tame ni naita.
Toki ni Negebu ni sunde ita Kanan bito Arade no ou wa, Isuraeru ga Atarimu no michi o tootte kuru to kiite, Isuraeru o kougeki shi, sono uchi no suunin o horyo ni shita.
Soko de Isuraeru wa Shu ni chikai o tatete itta, "Moshi, anata ga kono tami o watashi no te ni watashite kudasarunaraba, watashi wa sono machimachi o kotogotoku horoboshimashou".
Shu wa Isuraeru no kotoba o kikiire, Kanan bito o watasareta no de, Isuraeru wa sono Kanan bito to, sono machimachi to o kotogotoku horoboshita. Sore de sono tokoro no na wa Horuma to yobareta.
Tami wa Horu yama kara susumi, koukai no michi o tootte, Edomu no chi o mawarou to shitaga, tami wa sono michi ni taegataku natta.
Tami wa kami to Moose to ni mukai, tsubuyaite itta, "Anata gata wa naze watashitachi o Ejiputo kara michibiki nobotte, arano de shinaseyou to suru no desu ka. Koko ni wa shokumotsu mo naku, mizu mo arimasen. Watashitachi wa kono soaku na shokumotsu wa iya ni narimashita".
Soko de Shu wa, hi no hebi o tami no uchi ni okurareta. Hebi wa tami o kanda no de, Isuraeru no tami no uchi, ooku no mono ga shinda.
Tami wa Moose no moto ni itte itta, "Watashitachi wa Shu ni mukai, mata anata ni mukai, tsubuyaite tsumi o okashimashita. Douzo hebi o watashitachi kara torisarareru you ni Shu ni inotte kudasai". Moose wa tami no tame ni inotta.
Soko de Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Hi no hebi o tsukutte, sore o sao no ue ni kake nasai. Subete no kamareta mono ga aoide, sore o mirunaraba ikirude arou".
Moose wa seidou de hitotsu no hebi o tsukuri, sore o sao no ue ni kakete oita. Subete hebi ni kamareta mono wa sono seidou no hebi o aoide mite ikita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa michi o susunde Obote ni shukuei shita.
Mata Obote kara susunde higashi no hou, Moabu no mae ni aru arano ni oite, Ieabarimu ni shukuei shita.
Mata soko kara susunde Zerede no tani ni shukuei shi,
Sarani soko kara susunde Arunon kawa no kanata ni shukuei shita. Arunon kawa wa Amori bito no sakai kara nobihirogaru arano o nagareru mono de, Moabu to Amori bito to no aida ni atte, Moabu no sakai o nashite ita.
Sore yue ni, "Shu no tatakai no sho" ni kou iwarete iru. "Supa no Wahebu, Arunon no tanidani,
Tanidani no shamen, Aru no machi made katamuki, Moabu no sakai ni yorikakaru".
Karera wa soko kara Beeru e susunde itta. Kore wa Shu ga Moose ni mukatte, "Tami o atsumeyo. Watashi wa karera ni mizu o ataerude arou" to iwareta ido de aru.
Sono toki Isuraeru wa kono uta o utatta. "Ido no mizu yo, wakiagare, hitobito yo, kono ido no tame ni utae,
Shaku to tsue to o motte tsukasatachi ga kono ido o hori, tami no osatachi ga kore o hotta". Soshite karera wa arano kara Mattana ni susumi,
MaTtana kara Naharieru ni, Naharieru kara Bamote ni,
Bamote kara Moabu no no ni aru tani ni iki, arano o miorosu Pisuga no itadaki ni tsuita.
Koko de Isuraeru wa Amori bito no ou Shihon ni shisha o tsukawashite iwaseta,
"Watashi ni anata no kuni o toorasete kudasai. Watashitachi wa hatake ni mo budou hatake ni mo, hairimasen. Mata ido no mizu mo nomimasen. Watashitachi wa anata no ryouchi o toorisugiru made, tada ou no ooji o toorimasu".
Shikashi, Shihon wa Isuraeru ni jibun no ryouchi o tooru koto o yurusanakatta. Soshite Shihon wa tami o kotogotoku atsume, arano ni dete, Isuraeru o semeyou to shi, Yahazu ni kite Isuraeru to tatakatta.
Isuraeru wa, yai ba de kare o uchi yaburi, Arunon kara Yaboku made kare no chi o senryou shi, Anmon bito no sakai ni oyonda. Yazeru wa Anmon bito no sakai dakara de aru.
Kou shite Isuraeru wa korera no machimachi o kotogotoku totta. Soshite Isuraeru wa Amori bito no subete no machimachi ni sumi, Heshibon to sore ni fuzoku suru subete no muramura ni ita.
Heshibon wa Amori bito no ou Shihon no miyako de atte, Shihon wa Moabu no izen no ou to tatakatte, kare no chi o Arunon made, kotogotoku sono te kara ubaitotta no de aru.
Sore yue ni uta ni utawarete iru. "Hitobito yo, Heshibon ni kitare, Shihon no machi o kizukitate yo.
Heshibon kara hi ga moe dashi, Shihon no miyako kara honoo ga dete, Moabu no Aru o yaki tsukushi, Arunon no kouchi no kimitachi o horoboshitakara da.
Moabu yo, omae wa wazawai naru ka na, Kemoshi no tami yo, omae wa horobosarerude arou. Kare wa, musukora o nigesarase, musumera o Amori bito no ou Shihon no horyo to naraseta.
Karera no kora wa horobisatta, Heshibon kara Debon made. Wareware wa arashita, hi wa tsuite Medeba ni oyonda".
Kou shite Isuraeru wa Amori bito no chi ni sundaga,
Moose wa mata hito o tsukawashite Yazeru o sagurase, tsuini sono muramura o totte, soko ni ita Amori bito o oidashi,
Tenjite Bashan no michi ni nobotte ittaga, Bashan no ou Ogu wa, sono tami o kotogotoku hikii, Ederei de tatakaou to shite demukaeta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kare o osorete wa naranai. Watashi wa kare to sono tami to sono chi to o, kotogotoku anata no te ni watasu. Anata wa Heshibon ni sunde ita Amori bito no ou Shihon ni shita you ni kare ni mo surude arou".
Soko de kare to sono ko to subete no tami to o, hitori nokorazu uchikoroshite, sono chi o senryou shita.
Sate, Isuraeru no hitobito wa mata michi o susunde, Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no kanata no Moabu no heiya ni shukuei shita.
ChiPporu no ko Baraku wa Isuraeru ga Amori bito ni shita subete no koto o mita no de,
Moabu wa ooini Isuraeru no tami o osoreta. Sono kazu ga ookatta tame de aru. Moabu wa Isuraeru no hitobito o hijou ni osoreta no de,
Midean no chouroutachi ni itta, "Kono gunshuu wa ushi ga no no kusa o name tsukusu you ni, wareware no shuui no mono o mina, name tsukusou to shite iru". ChiPporu no ko Baraku wa kono toki Moabu no ou de atta.
Kare wa Anmon bito no kuni no Yufurate kawa no hotori ni aru Petoru ni shisha o tsukawashi, Beoru no ko Baramu o manekou to shite iwaseta, "Ejiputo kara dete kita tami ga ari, chi no omote o ootte watashi no mae ni imasu.
Douzo ima kite watashi no tame ni kono tami o norotte kudasai. Karera wa watashi yori mo tsuyoi no desu. Sou shite kudasareba, wareware wa karera o utte, kono kuni kara oiharau koto ga dekiru ka mo shiremasen. Anata ga shukufuku suru mono wa shukufuku sare, anata ga no roumono wa norowareru koto o watashi wa shitte imasu".
Moabu no chouroutachi to Midean no chouroutachi wa uranai no reimotsu o te ni shite shuppatsu shi, Baramu no moto e itte, Baraku no kotoba o tsugeta.
Baramu wa karera ni itta, "Kon'ya koko ni tomari nasai. Shu ga watashi ni tsugerareru toori ni, anata gata ni hentou shimashou". Sore de Moabu no tsukasatachi wa Baramu no moto ni todomatta.
Toki ni kami wa Baramu ni nozonde iwareta, "Anata no tokoro ni iru kono hitobito wa dare desu ka".
Baramu wa kami ni itta, "Moabu no ou Chipporu no ko Baraku ga, watashi ni hito o yokoshite iimashita.
'Ejiputo kara dete kita tami ga ari, chi no omote o ootte imasu. Douzo ima kite watashi no tame ni karera o norotte kudasai. Sou sureba watashi wa tatakatte, karera o oiharau koto ga dekiru ka mo shiremasen' ".
Kami wa Baramu ni iwareta, "Anata wa karera to issho ni itte wa naranai. Mata sono tami o norotte wa naranai. Karera wa shukufuku sareta mono dakara de aru".
Akuru asa okite, Baramu wa Baraku no tsukasatachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa kuni ni okaeri nasai. Shu wa watashi ga anata gata to issho ni iku koto o, oyurushi ni narimasen".
Moabu no tsukasatachi wa tatte Baraku no moto ni itte itta, "Baramu wa watashitachi to issho ni kuru koto o shouchi shimasen".
Baraku wa mata mae no mono yori mo mibun no takai tsukasatachi o mae yori mo ooku tsukawashita.
Karera wa Baramu no tokoro e itte itta, "ChiPporu no ko Baraku wa kou moushimasu, 'Donna samatage o mo kaerimizu, douzo watashi no tokoro e oide kudasai.
Watashi wa anata o ooini yuuguu shimasu. Soshite anata ga watashi ni iwareru koto wa nan de mo itashimasu. Douzo kite watashi no tame ni kono tami o norotte kudasai' ".
Shikashi, Baramu wa Baraku no keraitachi ni kotaeta, "Tatoi Baraku ga sono ie ni michiru hodo no kingin o watashi ni ataeyoutomo, koto no daishou o towazu, watashi no kami, Shu no kotoba o koete wa nani mo suru koto ga dekimasen.
Sore de, douzo, anata gata mo kon'ya koko ni todomatte, Shu ga kono ue, watashi ni nan to ooserareru ka o tashikamesasete kudasai".
Yoru ni nari, kami wa Baramu ni nozonde iwareta, "Kono hitobito wa anata o maneki ni kita no dakara, tatte kono hitobito to issho ni iki nasai. Tadashi watashi ga tsugeru koto dake o okonawanakereba naranai".
Akuru asa okite Baramu wa, roba ni kura o oki, Moabu no tsukasatachi to issho ni itta.
Shikaru ni kami wa kare ga itta tame ni ikari o hasserare, Shu no tsukai wa kare o samatageyou to shite, michi ni tachifusagatte ita. Baramu wa, roba ni nori, sono shimobe futari mo kare to tomo ni itaga,
Roba wa Shu no tsukai ga, te ni nukimi no tsurugi o motte, michi ni tachifusagatte iru no o mi, michi o sorete hatake ni haitta no de, Baramu wa, roba o utte michi ni kaesou to shita.
Shikaru ni Shu no tsukai wa mata budou hatake no aida no semai michi ni tachifusagatte ita. Michi no ryougawa ni wa ishigaki ga atta.
Roba wa Shu no tsukai o mite, ishigaki ni suriyori, Baramu no ashi o ishigaki ni oshitsuketa no de, Baramu wa, mata, roba o utta.
Shu no tsukai wa mata saki ni susunde, semai tokoro ni tachifusagatte ita. Soko wa migi ni mo hidari ni mo, magaru michi ga nakatta no de,
Roba wa Shu no tsukai o mite Baramu no shita ni fushita. Soko de Baramu wa ikari o hasshi, tsue de roba o utta.
Suruto, Shu ga, roba no kuchi o hirakareta no de, roba wa Baramu ni mukatte itta, "Watashi ga anata ni nani o shita to iu no desu ka. Anata wa san do mo watashi o utta no desu".
Baramu wa, roba ni itta, "Omae ga watashi o anadottakara da. Watashi no te ni tsurugi ga areba, ima, omae o koroshite shimau no daga".
Roba wa mata Baramu ni itta, "Watashi wa anata ga, kyou made nagai aida norareta roba de wa arimasen ka. Watashi wa itsu de mo, anata ni kono you ni shitadeshou ka". Baramu wa itta, "Iya, shinakatta".
Kono toki Shu ga Baramu no me o hirakareta no de, kare wa Shu no tsukai ga te ni nukimi no tsurugi o motte, michi ni tachifusagatte iru no o mite, tou o tarete hirefushita.
Shu no tsukai wa kare ni itta, "Naze anata wa san do mo roba o utta no ka. Anata ga ayamatte michi o iku no de, watashi wa anata o samatageyou to shite dete kita no da.
Roba wa watashi o mite san do mo mi o megurashite watashi o saketa. Moshi, roba ga mi o megurashite watashi o sakenakattanara, watashi wa kitto ima anata o koroshite, roba o ikashite oitade arou".
Baramu wa Shu no tsukai ni itta, "Watashi wa tsumi o okashimashita. Anata ga watashi o todomeyou to shite, michi ni tachifusagatte orareru no o, watashi wa shirimasendeshita. Sore de ima, moshi, oki ni mesanai no de areba, watashi wa kaerimashou".
Shu no tsukai wa Baramu ni itta, "Kono hitobito to issho ni iki nasai. Tadashi, watashi ga tsugeru koto nomi o nobenakereba naranai". Kou shite Baramu wa Baraku no tsukasatachi to issho ni itta.
Sate, Baraku wa Baramu ga kita to kiite, kokkyou no Arunon kawa no hotori, kokkyou no ittan ni aru Moabu no machi made dete itte mukaeta.
Soshite Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Watashi wa hito o tsukawashite anata o maneitade wa arimasen ka. Anata wa naze watashi no tokoro e kimasendeshita ka. Watashi wa jissai anata o yuuguu suru koto ga dekinaideshou ka".
Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Goran nasai. Watashi wa anata no tokoro ni kite imasu. Shikashi, ima, nanigoto ka o mizukara iu koto ga dekimashou ka. Watashi wa tada kami ga watashi no kuchi ni sazukerareru koto o nobenakereba narimasen".
Kou shite Baramu wa Baraku to issho ni iki, kiriate hozote ni kita toki,
Baraku wa ushi to hitsuji to o hofutte, Baramu oyobi kare to tomo ni ita Baramu o tsurete kita tsukasatachi ni okutta.
Akuru asa Baraku wa Baramu o tomonatte Bamotebaaru ni nobori, soko kara Isuraeru no tami no shukuei no ittan o nagamesaseta.
Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Watashi no tame ni, koko ni nanatsu no saidan o kizuki, nanatou no oushi to nanatou no ohitsuji to o totonoe nasai".
Baraku wa Baramu no itta toori ni shita. Soshite Baraku to Baramu to wa, sono saidangoto ni oushi ichitou to ohitsuji ichitou to o sasageta.
Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Anata wa hansai no katawara ni tatte ite kudasai. Sono aida ni watashi wa itte kimasu. Shu wa tabun watashi ni atte kudasarudeshou. Soshite, Shu ga watashi ni shimesareru koto wa nan de mo anata ni tsugemashou". Kou shite kare wa hitotsu no hageyama ni nobotta.
Kami ga Baramu ni awareta no de, Baramu wa kami ni itta, "Watashi wa nanatsu no saidan o mouke, saidangoto ni oushi ichitou to ohitsuji ichitou to o sasagemashita".
Shu wa Baramu no kuchi ni kotoba o sazukete iwareta, "Baraku no moto ni kaette kou ii nasai".
Kare ga Baraku no moto ni kaette miruto, Baraku wa Moabu no subete no tsukasatachi to tomo ni hansai no katawara ni tatte ita.
Baramu wa kono takusen o nobeta. "Baraku wa watashi o Aramu kara manekiyose, Moabu no ou wa watashi o higashi no yama kara manekiyosete iu, 'Kite watashi no tame ni Yakobu o noroe, kite Isuraeru o noroe' to.
Kami no norowanai mono o, watashi ga dou shite noroe you. Shu no norowanai mono o, watashi ga dou shite noroe you.
Iwa no itadaki kara nagame, oka no ue kara mitaga, kore wa hitori hanarete sumu tami, moromoro no kokumin no uchi ni narabu mono wa nai.
Dare ga Yakobu no gunshuu o kazoe, Isuraeru no musuu no tami o kazoe eyou. Watashi wa gijin no you ni shini, watashi no owari wa karera no owari no you de aritai".
Soko de Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Anata wa watashi ni nani o suru no desu ka. Watashi wa teki o norou tame ni, anata o maneita no ni, anata wa kaette teki o shukufuku suru bakari desu".
Baramu wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa, Shu ga watashi no kuchi ni sazukerareru koto dake o kataru you ni chuui subekide wa naideshou ka".
Baraku wa kare ni itta, "Watashi to issho ni hoka no tokoro e itte, soko kara karera o goran kudasai. Anata wa tada karera no ittan o miru dake de, zentai o miru koto wa dekinaideshouga, soko kara watashi no tame ni karera o norotte kudasai".
Soshite kare wa Baramu o tsurete Zopimu no no ni iki, Pisuga no itadaki ni nobotte, soko ni nanatsu no saidan o kizuki, saidangoto ni oushi ichitou to ohitsuji ichitou to o sasageta.
Toki ni wa Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Anata wa koko de, hansai no katawara ni tatte ite kudasai. Watashi wa mukou e itte, Shu ni ukagaimasukara".
Shu wa Baramu ni nozomi, kotoba o kuchi ni sazukete iwareta, "Baraku no moto ni kaette kou ii nasai".
Kare ga Baraku no tokoro e itte miruto, Baraku wa hansai no katawara ni tachi, Moabu no tsukasatachi mo tomo ni ita. Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Shu wa nan to iwaremashita ka".
Soko de Baramu wa mata kono takusen o nobeta. "Baraku yo, tatte kike, ChiPporu no ko yo, watashi ni mimi o katamukeyo.
Kami wa hito no you ni itsuwaru koto wa naku, mata hito no ko no you ni kuiru koto mo nai. Itta koto de, okonawanai koto ga arou ka, katatta koto de, shitogenai koto ga arou ka.
Shukufuku seyo to no mei o watashi wa uketa, sudeni kami ga shukufuku sareta mono o, watashi wa kaeru koto ga dekinai.
Dare mo Yakobu no uchi ni wazawai no aru no o minai, mata Isuraeru no uchi ni nayami no aru no o minai. Karera no kami, Shu ga tomo ni imashi, ou o tataeru koe ga sono naka ni kikoeru.
Kami wa karera o Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta, karera wa yagyuu no tsuno no you da.
Yakobu ni wa majutsu ga naku, Isuraeru ni wa uranai ga nai. Kami ga sono nasu tokoro o toki ni oujite Yakobu ni tsuge, Isuraeru ni shimesarerukara da.
Miyo, kono tami wa me jishi no you ni tachiagari, o jishi no you ni mi o okosu. Kore wa sono emono o kurai, sono koroshita mono no chi o nomu made wa mi o yokotaenai".
Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Anata wa karera o norou koto mo shukufuku suru koto mo, yamete kudasai".
Baramu wa kotaete Baraku ni itta, "Shu no iwareru koto wa, nan de mo shinakereba naranaito, watashi wa anata ni tsugemasendeshita ka".
Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Douzo, oide kudasai. Watashi wa anata o hoka no tokoro e otsure shimashou. Kami wa anata ga soko kara watashi no tame ni karera o norou koto o yurusareru ka mo shiremasen".
Soshite Baraku wa Baramu o tsurete, arano o miorosu Peoru no itadaki ni itta.
Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Watashi no tame ni koko ni nanatsu no saidan o kizuki, oushi nanatou to, ohitsuji nanatou to o totonoe nasai".
Baraku wa Baramu no itta toori ni shi, sono saidangoto ni oushi ichitou to ohitsuji ichitou to o sasageta.
Baramu wa Isuraeru o shukufuku suru koto ga Shu no kokoro ni kanau no o mita no de, kondo wa itsu mo no you ni itte majutsu o motomeru koto o sezu, kao o arano ni muke,
Me o agete, Isuraeru ga sorezore buzoku ni shitagatte shukuei shite iru no o mita. Sono toki, kami no rei ga nozonda no de,
Kare wa kono takusen o nobeta. "Beoru no ko Baramu no kotoba, me o tojita hito no kotoba,
Kami no kotoba o kiku mono, zennousha no maboroshi o miru mono, taorefushite, me no hirakareta mono no kotoba.
Yakobu yo, anata no tenmaku wa uruwashii, Isuraeru yo, anata no sumai wa, uruwashii.
Sore wa tooku hirogaru tanidani no you, kawabe no sono no you, Shu ga uerareta jinkouju no you, nagare no hotori no kouhaku no you da.
Mizu wa karera no kame kara afure, karera no tane wa mizu no uruoi ni sodatsude arou. Karera no ou wa Agagu yori mo takaku nari, karera no kuni wa agamerarerude arou.
Kami wa karera o Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta, karera wa yagyuu no tsuno no you da. Karera wa teki naru kuniguni no tami o horoboshi, sono hone o kudaki, ya o motte tsukitoosude arou.
Karera wa o jishi no you ni mi o kagame, me jishi no you ni fushite iru. Dare ga karera o okoshi eyou. Anata o shukufuku suru mono wa shukufuku sare, anata o no roumono wa norowarerude arou".
Soko de Baraku wa Baramu ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, te o uchinarashita. Soshite Baraku wa Baramu ni itta, "Teki o norou tame ni maneita no ni, anata wa kaette san do made mo karera o shukufuku shita.
Sore de ima anata wa isoide jibun no tokoro e kaette kudasai. Watashi wa anata o ooini yuuguu shiyou to omotta. Shikashi, Shu wa sono yuuguu o anata ni esasenai you ni saremashita".
Baramu wa Baraku ni itta, "Watashi wa anata ga tsukawasareta shishatachi ni ittade wa arimasen ka,
'Tatoi Baraku ga sono ie ni michiru hodo no kingin o watashi ni ataeyoutomo, Shu no kotoba o koete kokoro no mama ni zen mo aku mo okonau koto wa dekimasen. Watashi wa Shu no iwareru koto o noberu dake desu'.
Watashi wa ima watashi no tami no tokoro e kaette ikimasu. Sore de watashi wa kono tami ga nochi no hi ni anata no tami ni donna koto o suru ka o ooshirase shimashou".
Soshite kono takusen o nobeta. "Beoru no ko Baramu no kotoba, me o tojita hito no kotoba.
Kami no kotoba o kiku mono, ito takaki mono no chishiki o motsu mono, zennousha no maboroshi o mi, taorefushite, me no hirakareta mono no kotoba.
Watashi wa kare o miru, shikashi ima de wa nai. Watashi wa kare o nozomimiru, shikashi chikaku de wa nai. Yakobu kara hitotsu no hoshi ga de, Isuraeru kara ichipon no tsue ga okori, Moabu no komekami to, Setsu no subete no kora no nouten o utsude arou.
Teki no Edomu wa ryouchi to nari, Seiru mo mata ryouchi to narude arou. Soshite Isuraeru wa shouri o erude arou.
Ken o toru mono ga Yakobu kara de, ikinokotta mono o machi kara tachi horobosude arou".
Baramu wa mata Amareku o nozomimite, kono takusen o nobeta. "Amareku wa shokokumin no uchi no saisho no mono, shikashi, tsuini horobisarude arou".
Mata Keni bi to o nozomimite kono takusen o nobeta. "Omae no sumika wa kengo da, iwa ni, omae wa su o tsukutte iru.
Shikashi, Kain wa horobosarerude arou. Ashuru wa itsu made omae o horyo to surude arou ka".
Kare wa mata kono takusen o nobeta. "Aa, kami ga sadamerareta ijou, dare ga ikinobiru koto ga dekiyou.
KiTtemu no kaigan kara fune ga kite, Ashuru o seme nayamashi, Eberu o seme nayamasude arou. Soshite kare mo mata tsuini horobisarude arou".
Kou shite Baramu wa tachiagatte, jibun no tokoro e kaette itta. Baraku mo mata tachisatta.
Isuraeru wa Shittemu ni todomatte itaga, tami wa Moabu no musumetachi to, midara na koto o shi hajimeta.
Sono musumetachi ga kamigami ni gisei o sasageru toki ni tami o manekuto, tami wa issho ni sore o tabe, musumetachi no kamigami o oganda.
Isuraeru wa kou shite Peoru no Baaru ni tsukishitagatta no de, Shu wa Isuraeru ni mukatte ikari o hasserareta.
Soshite Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Tami no shuryou o kotogotoku torae, hi no aru uchi ni sono hitobito o Shu no mae de shokei shi nasai. Sou sureba Shu no ikari wa Isuraeru o hanarerude arou".
Moose wa Isuraeru no sabaki bitotachi ni mukatte itta, "Anata gata wa onoono, haika no monodomo de Peoru no Baaru ni tsukishitagatta mono o koroshi nasai".
Moose to Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu to ga kaiken no makuya no iriguchi de naite ita toki, karera no me no mae de, hitori no Isuraeru bito ga, sono kyoudaitachi no naka ni, hitori no Midean no onna o tsurete kita.
Saishi Aron no ko naru Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu wa kore o mite, kaishuu no uchi kara tachiagari, yari o te ni tori,
Sono Isuraeru no hito no ato o otte, oku no ma ni iri, sono Isuraeru no hito o tsuki, mata sono onna no hara o tsukitooshite, futari o koroshita. Kou shite ekibyou ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni oyobu no ga yanda.
Shikashi, sono ekibyou de shinda mono wa ni man yonsennin de atta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Saishi Aron no ko naru Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu wa jibun no koto no you ni, watashi no fungeki o Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni arawashi, watashi no ikari o sono uchi kara torisatta no de, watashi wa fungeki shite, Isuraeru no hitobito o horobosu koto o shinakatta.
Kono yue ni anata wa ii nasai, 'Watashi wa heiwa no keiyaku o kare ni sazukeru.
Kore wa kare to sono nochi no shison ni eien no saishi shoku no keiyaku to narude arou. Kare wa sono kami no tame ni nesshin de atte, Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shitakara de aru' to".
Midean no onna to tomo ni korosareta Isuraeru no hito no na wa Jimuri to ii, Saru no ko de, Shimeon bito no uchi no ichizoku no tsukasa de atta.
Mata sono korosareta Midean no onna no na wa Kozubi to ii, Tsuru no musume de atta. Tsuru wa Midean no tami no ichizoku no kashira de atta.
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Midean bito o uchi nayamashi nasai.
Karera wa takurami o motte, anatagata o nayamashi, Peoru no koto to, karera no shimai, Midean no tsukasa no musume Kozubi, sunawachi Peoru no koto ni yori, ekibyou no okotta hi ni korosareta onna no koto to ni yotte, anatagata o madowashitakara de aru".
Ekibyou no nochi, Shu wa Moose to saishi Aron no ko Ereazaru to ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu no sousuu o sono fuso no ie ni shitagatte shirabe, Isuraeru ni oite, subete sensou ni deru koto no dekiru nijuusai ijou no mono o kazoe nasai".
Soko de Moose to saishi Ereazaru to wa, Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori ni aru Moabu no heiya de karera ni itta,
"Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni, anata gata no uchi no nijuusai ijou no mono o kazoe nasai". Ejiputo no chi kara dete kita Isuraeru no hitobito wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Ruben wa Isuraeru no choushi de aru. Ruben no shison wa, Henoku kara Henoku bito no shizoku ga de, Paru kara Paru bito no shizoku ga de,
Hezuron kara Hezuron bito no shizoku ga de, Karumi kara Karumi bi to no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Ruben bito no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa yon man sanzen nanahyaku sanjuunin de atta.
Mata Paru no ko wa Eriabu.
Eriabu no ko wa Nemueru, Datan, Abiramu de aru. Kono Datan to Abiramu to wa kaishuu no uchi kara erabidasareta mono de, Kora no tomo gara to tomo ni Moose to Aron to ni sakaratte Shu to arasotta toki,
Chi wa kuchi o hiraite karera to Kora to o nomi, sono nakama wa shinda. Sono toki nihyaku gojuunin ga hi ni yakihorobosarete, imashime no kagami to natta.
Tadashi, Kora no kotachi wa shinanakatta.
Shimeon no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Nemueru kara Nemueru bito no shizoku ga de, Yaminkara Yamin bito no shizoku ga de, Yakin kara Yakin bito no shizoku ga de,
Zera kara Zera bito no shizoku ga de, Shauru kara Shauru bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Shimeon bito no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa ni man nisen nihyakunin de atta.
Gado no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Zepon kara Zepon bito no shizoku ga de, Hagi kara Hagi bito no shizoku ga de, Shuni kara Shuni bi to no shizoku ga de,
Ozuni kara Ozuni bi to no shizoku ga de, Eri kara Eri bito no shizoku ga de,
Arodo kara Arodo bito no shizoku ga de, Arerikara Areri bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Gado no shison no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa yon man gohyakunin de atta.
Yuda no kora wa Eru to Onan to deatte, Eru to Onan to wa Kanan no chi de shinda.
Yuda no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Shira kara Shira bito no shizoku ga de, Perezu kara Perezu bito no shizoku ga de, Zera kara Zera bito no shizoku ga deta.
Perezu no shison wa, Hezuron kara Hezuron bito no shizoku ga de, Hamuru kara Hamuru bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Yuda no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa nana man rokusen gohyakunin de atta.
Issakaru no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Tora kara Tora bito no shizoku ga de, Puwa kara Puwa bito no shizoku ga de,
Yashubu kara Yashubu bito no shizoku ga de, Shimuron kara Shimuron bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Issakaru no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa roku man yonsen sanbyakunin de atta.
Zeburun no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Serede kara Serede bito no shizoku ga de, Eronkara Eron bi to no shizoku ga de, Yarieru kara Yarieru bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Zeburun bito no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa roku man gohyakunin de atta.
Yosefu no kora wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Manase to Efuraimu to deatte,
Manase no shison wa, Makiru kara Makiru bito no shizoku ga deta. Makiru kara Gireade ga umare, Gireade kara Gireade bito no shizoku ga deta.
Gireade no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Iezeru kara Iezeru bito no shizoku ga de, Hereku kara Hereku bito no shizoku ga de,
Asurieru kara Asurieru bito no shizoku ga de, Shikemu kara Shikemu bito no shizoku ga de,
Semidakara Semida bito no shizoku ga de, Heperu kara Heperu bito no shizoku ga deta.
Heperu no ko Zeropehade ni wa otokonoko ga naku, tada onnanoko nomi de, Zeropehade no onnanoko no na wa Maara, Noa, Hogura, Miruka, Teruza to itta.
Korera wa Manase no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa go man nisen nanahyakunin de atta.
Efuraimu no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, tsugi no toori de aru. Shutera kara wa Shutera bito no shizoku ga de, Bekeru kara Bekeru bito no shizoku ga de, Tahan kara Tahan bi to no shizoku ga deta.
Mata Shutera no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Eran kara Eran bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Efuraimu no shison no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa san man nisen gohyakunin de atta. Ijou wa Yosefu no shison de, sono shizoku ni yoru mono de aru.
Beniyamin no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Bera kara Bera bito no shizoku ga de, Ashiberu kara Ashiberu bito no shizoku ga de, Ahiramu kara Ahiramu bito no shizoku ga de,
Shupamukara Shupamu bi to no shizoku ga de, Hopamu kara Hopamu bi to no shizoku ga deta.
Bera no ko wa Arude to Naaman to deatte, Arude kara Arude bito no shizoku ga de, Naaman kara Naaman bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Beniyamin no shison de atte, sono shizoku ni yoreba kazoerareta mono wa yon man gosen roppyakunin de atta.
Dan no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, tsugi no toori de aru. Shuhamu kara Shuhamu bito no shizoku ga deta. Korera wa Dan no shizoku de atte, sono shizoku ni yoru mono de aru.
Shuhamu bito no subete no shizoku no uchi, kazoerareta mono wa roku man yonsen yonhyakunin de atta.
Aseru no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Emuna kara Emuna bi to no shizoku ga de, Esui kara Esui bi to no shizoku ga de, Beria kara Beria bito no shizoku ga deta.
Beria no shison no uchi Eberu kara Heberu bito no shizoku ga de, Marukieru kara Marukieru bito no shizoku ga deta.
Aseru no musume no na wa Sara to itta.
Korera wa Aseru no shison no shizoku de atte, kazoerareta mono wa go man sanzen yonhyakunin de atta.
Nafutari no shison wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba, Yajieru kara Yajieru bito no shizoku ga de, Guni kara Guni bito no shizoku ga de,
Ezeru kara Ezeru bito no shizoku ga de, Shiremu kara Shiremu bito no shizoku ga deta.
Korera wa Nafutari no shizoku de atte, sono shizoku ni yori, kazoerareta mono wa yon man gosen yonhyakunin de atta.
Korera wa Isuraeru no shison no kazoerareta mono de atte, rokujuu man issen hyaku sanjuunin de atta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Korera no hitobito ni, sono na no kazu ni shitagatte chi o wakeatae, shigyou to sase nasai.
Ookii buzoku ni wa ooku no shigyou o atae, chiisai buzoku ni wa sukoshi no shigyou o atae nasai. Sunawachi kazoerareta kazu ni shitagatte, onoono no buzoku ni sono shigyou o ataenakereba naranai.
Tadashi chi wa, kuji o motte wake, sono fuso no buzoku no na ni shitagatte, sore o tsuganakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, kuji o motte sono shigyou o ookii mono to, chiisai mono to ni wakenakereba naranai".
Rebi bito no sono shizoku ni shitagatte kazoerareta mono wa tsugi no toori de aru. Gerushon kara Gerushon bito no shizoku ga de, Kohate kara Kohate bito no shizoku ga de, Merari kara Merari bito no shizoku ga deta.
Rebi no shizoku wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Ribuni bito no shizoku, Heburon bito no shizoku, Maheri bito no shizoku, Mushi bito no shizoku, Kora bito no shizoku de atte, Kohate kara Amuramu ga umareta.
Amuramu no tsuma no na wa Yokebede to itte, Rebi no musume de aru. Kanojo wa Ejiputo de Rebi ni umareta mono de aruga, Amuramu ni totsuide, Aron to Moose oyobi sono shimai Miriamu o unda.
Aron ni wa Nadabu, Abiu, Ereazaru oyobi Itamaru ga umareta.
Nadabu to Abiu wa kotobi o Shu no mae ni sasageta toki ni shinda.
Sono kazoerareta ichi kagetsu ijou no subete no danshi wa ni man sanzennin de atta. Karera wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni shigyou o ataerarenakatta tame, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni kazoerarenakatta mono de aru.
Korera wa Moose to saishi Ereazaru ga, Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori ni aru Moabu no heiya de kazoeta Isuraeru no hitobito no kazu de aru.
Tadashi sono uchi ni wa, Moose to saishi Aron ga Shinai no arano de Isuraeru no hitobito o kazoeta toki ni kazoerareta mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Sore wa Shu ga katsute karera ni tsuite "Karera wa kanarazu arano de shinude arou" to iwaretakara de aru. Sore de karera no uchi Efunne no ko Karebu to Nun no ko Yoshua no hoka, hitori mo nokotta mono wa nakatta.
Sate, Yosefu no ko Manase no shizoku no uchi no Heperu no ko, Zeropehade no musumetachi ga uttaete kita. Heperu wa Gireade no ko, Gireade wa Makiru no ko, Makiru wa Manase no ko de aru. Sono musumetachi wa na o Maara, Noa, Hogura, Miruka, Teruza to ittaga,
Karera wa kaiken no makuya no iriguchi de Moose to, saishi Ereazaru to, tsukasatachi to zenkaishuu to no mae ni tatte itta,
"Watashitachi no chichi wa arano de shinimashita. Kare wa, Kora no nakama to natte Shu ni sakaratta monodomo no nakama no uchi ni wa kuwawarimasendeshita. Kare wa jibun no tsumi ni yotte shinda no desuga, otokonoko ga arimasendeshita.
Otokonoko ga naikara to itte, dou shite watashitachi no chichi no na ga sono shizoku no uchi kara kezurarenakereba naranai no deshou ka. Watashitachi no chichi no kyoudai to onaji you ni, watashitachi ni mo shoyuu chi o ataete kudasai".
Moose ga sono koto o Shu no mae ni noberuto,
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Zeropehade no musumetachi no iu koto wa tadashii. Anata wa kanarazu karera no chichi no kyoudaitachi to onaji you ni, karera ni mo shigyou no shoyuu chi o ataenakereba naranai. Sunawachi, sono chichi no shigyou o karera ni watasanakereba naranai.
Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai, 'Moshi hito ga shinde, otokonoko ga nai toki wa, sono shigyou o musume ni watasanakereba naranai.
Moshi mata musume mo nai toki wa, sono shigyou o kyoudai ni ataenakereba naranai.
Moshi kyoudai mo nai toki wa, sono shigyou o chichi no kyoudai ni ataenakereba naranai.
Moshi mata chichi ni kyoudai ga nai toki wa, sono shizoku no uchi de kare ni mottomo chikai shinzoku ni sono shigyou o ataete shoyuu sasenakereba naranai'. Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni Isuraeru no hitobito wa, kore o okite no sadame to shinakereba naranai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kono Abarimu no yama ni nobotte, watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeru chi o mi nasai.
Anata wa sore o mite kara, kyoudai Aron no you ni sono tami ni kuwaerarerude arou.
Kore wa kaishuu ga Chin no arano de sakarai arasotta toki, anata gata wa watashi no mei ni somuki, ano mizu no katawara de karera no me no mae ni watashi no sei naru koto o arawasanakattakara de aru". Kore wa Chin no arano ni aru Kadeshi no Meriba no mizu de aru.
Moose wa Shu ni itta,
"Subete no niku naru mono no inochi no kami, Shu yo, douzo, kono kaishuu no ue ni hitori no hito o tate,
Karera no mae ni deiri shi, karera o michibikidashi, karera o michibikiireru mono to shi, Shu no kaishuu o bokusha no nai hitsuji no you ni shinaide kudasai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Kami no rei no yadotte iru Nun no ko Yoshua o erabi, anata no te o sono ue ni oki,
Kare o saishi Ereazaru to zenkaishuu no mae ni tatasete, karera no mae de shoku ni ninji nasai.
Soshite kare ni anata no ken'i o wakeatae, Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu o kare ni shitagawase nasai.
Kare wa saishi Ereazaru no mae ni tachi, Ereazaru wa kare no tame ni Urimu o motte, Shu no mae ni handan o motomenakereba naranai. Yoshua to Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu to wa Ereazaru no kotoba ni shitagatte ide, Ereazaru no kotoba ni shitagatte hairanakereba naranai".
Soko de Moose wa Shu ga meijirareta you ni shi, Yoshua o erande, saishi Ereazaru to zenkaishuu no mae ni tatase,
Kare no ue ni te o oki, Shu ga Moose ni yotte katarareta toori ni kare o ninmei shita.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa koubashii kaori to shite watashi ni sasageru kasai, sunawachi, watashi no sonaemono, watashi no shokumotsu o sadame no toki ni watashi ni sasageru koto o okotatte wa naranai'.
Mata karera ni ii nasai, 'Anata gata ga Shu ni sasagubeki kasai wa kore de aru. Sunawachi ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji nitou o mainichi sasagete jouhansai to shinakereba naranai.
Sunawachi ichitou no kohitsuji o asa ni sasage, ichitou no kohitsuji o yuu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no ichi ni, kudaite totta abura ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o mazete sosai to shinakereba naranai.
Kore wa Shinai san de sadamerareta jouhansai de atte, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shite sasageru kasai de aru.
Mata sono kansai wa kohitsuji ichitou ni tsuite ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi seijo ni oite Shu no tame ni koi sake o sosoide kansai to shinakereba naranai.
Yuu ni wa ta no ichitou no kohitsuji o sasagenakereba naranai. Sono sosai to kansai to wa asa no mono to onaji you ni shi, sono kohitsuji o kasai to shite sasage, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai.
Mata ansokunichi ni wa ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji nitou to, mugiko ichi Epa no juun no ni ni abura o mazeta sosai to, sono kansai to o sasagenakereba naranai.
Kore wa ansokunichi goto no hansai de atte, jouhansai to sono kansai to ni kuwaerarubeki mono de aru.
Mata anata gata wa tsukizuki no daiichi nichi ni hansai o Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi nitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji nanatou o sasage,
Oushi ichitou ni wa mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no san ni abura o mazeta mono o sosai to shi, ohitsuji ichitou ni wa mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no ni ni abura o mazeta mono o sosai to shi,
Kohitsuji ichitou ni wa mugiko juubun no ichi ni abura o mazeta mono o sosai to shi, kore o koubashii kaori no hansai to shite Shu no tame ni kasai to shinakereba naranai.
Mata sono kansai wa oushi ichitou ni tsuite budoushu ichi hin no nibun no ichi, ohitsuji ichitou ni tsuite ichi hin no sanbun no ichi, kohitsuji ichitou ni tsuite ichi hin no yonbun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai. Kore wa nen no tsukizuki o tsuujite, shingetsugoto ni sasagubeki hansai de aru.
Mata jouhansai to sono kansai to no hoka ni, o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Shougatsu no juu yonka wa Shu no sugikoshi no matsuri de aru.
Mata sono tsuki no juu go nichi wa saijitsu to shinakereba naranai. Nanuka no aida tane irenu pan o tabenakereba naranai.
Sono hajime no hi ni wa seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki o mo shite wa naranai.
Anata gata wa kasai to shite Shu ni hansai o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi nitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji nanatou o sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa mina mattakimono de nakereba naranai.
Sono sosai ni wa abura o mazeta mugiko o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi oushi ichitou ni tsuki mugiko ichi Epa no juubun no san, ohitsuji ichitou ni tsuki juubun no ni o sasage,
Mata nanatou no kohitsuji ni wa sono ichitougoto ni juubun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasage, anata gata no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa asa ni sasageru jouhansai no hansai no hoka ni, korera o sasagenakereba naranai.
Kono you ni anata gata wa nanuka no aida mainichi, kasai no shokumotsu o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai. Kore wa jouhansai to sono kansai to no hoka ni sasagubeki mono de aru.
Soshite dainana nichi ni, anata gata wa seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki o mo shite wa naranai.
Anata gata wa nana shuu no matsuri, sunawachi atarashii sosai o Shu ni sasageru hatsuho no hi ni mo seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki o mo shite wa naranai.
Anata gata wa hansai o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi nitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji nanatou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono sosai ni wa abura o mazeta mugiko o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi oushi ichitou ni tsuki ichi Epa no juubun no san, ohitsuji ichitou ni tsuki juubun no ni o sasage,
Mata nanatou no kohitsuji ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o sasagete anata gata no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa jouhansai to sono sosai to sono kansai to no hoka ni, korera o sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa mina, mattakimono de nakereba naranai.
Nana gatsu ni wa, sono tsuki no daiichi nichi ni seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki o mo shite wa naranai. Kore wa anata gata ga rappa o fuku hi de aru.
Anata gata wa hansai o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi ichitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji nanatou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono sosai ni wa abura o mazeta mugiko o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi oushi ichitou ni tsuite ichi Epa no juubun no san, ohitsuji ichitou ni tsuite juubun no ni o sasage,
Mata nanatou no kohitsuji ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasage, anata gata no tame ni tsumi no a ga nai o shinakereba naranai.
Kore wa shingetsu no hansai to sono sosai, jouhansai to sono sosai, oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de atte, korera no mono no sadame ni shitagai, koubashii kaori to shite, Shu ni kasai to shinakereba naranai.
Mata sono nana gatsu no tooka ni seikai o hiraki, katsu anata gata no mi o nayamasanakereba naranai. Nan no shigoto mo shite wa naranai.
Anata gata wa Shu ni hansai o sasagete, koubashii kaori to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi ichitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji nanatou o sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa mina mattakimono de nakereba naranai.
Sono sosai ni wa abura o mazeta mugiko o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi oushi ichitou ni tsuki ichi Epa no juubun no san, ohitsuji ichitou ni tsuki juubun no ni o sasage,
Mata nanatou no kohitsuji ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa shokuzai no zaisai to jouhansai to sono sosai, oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Nana gatsu no juu go nichi ni seikai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki mo shite wa naranai. Nanuka no aida Shu no tame ni matsuri o shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa hansai o sasagete, Shu ni koubashii kaori no kasai to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi wakai oushi juu santou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa mina mattakimono de nakereba naranai.
Sono sosai ni wa abura o mazeta mugiko o sasagenakereba naranai. Sunawachi juu santou no oushi ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no san, sono nitou no ohitsuji ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no ni o sasage,
Sono juu yontou no kohitsuji ni wa ichitougoto ni juubun no ichi o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Daini nichi ni wa wakai oushi juu nitou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa sono kazu ni shitagatte, sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Daisan nichi ni wa oushi juu ichitou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Daiyonnichi ni wa oushi juutou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Daigo nichi ni wa oushi kyuutou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Dairoku nichi ni wa oushi yazu, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Dainana nichi ni wa oushi nanatou, ohitsuji nitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji juu yontou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Daihachi ka ni wa mata shuukai o hirakanakereba naranai. Nan no roueki o mo shite wa naranai.
Anata gata wa hansai o sasagete Shu ni koubashii kaori no kasai to shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi oushi ichitou, ohitsuji ichitou, ichisai no osu no mattaki kohitsuji nanatou o sasagenakereba naranai.
Sono oushi to ohitsuji to kohitsuji to no tame no sosai to kansai to wa, sono kazu ni shitagatte sadame no you ni sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata o yagi ichitou o zaisai to shite sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa jouhansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai no hoka no mono de aru.
Anata gata wa sadame no matsuri no toki ni, korera no mono o Shu ni sasagenakereba naranai. Korera wa anata gata no seigan, mata wa jihatsu no sonaemono to shite sasageru hansai, sosai, kansai oyobi shuuonsai no hoka no mono de aru' ".
Moose wa Shu ga meijirareta koto o kotogotoku Isuraeru no hitobito ni tsugeta.
Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku no kashiratachi ni itta, "Kore wa Shu ga meijirareta koto de aru.
Moshi hito ga Shu ni seigan o kake, mata wa sono mi ni monodachi o shiyou to chikai o surunaraba, sono kotoba o yabutte wa naranai. Kuchi de itta toori ni subete okonawanakereba naranai.
Mata moshi onna ga mada wakaku, chichi no ie ni ite, Shu ni seigan o kake, mata wa sono mi ni monodachi o shiyou to suru toki,
Chichi ga kanojo no seigan, mata wa kanojo no mi ni tatta monodachi no koto o kiite, kanojo ni nani mo iwanainaraba, kanojo wa subete seigan o okonai, mata sono mi ni tatta monodachi o subete mamoranakereba naranai.
Shikashi, kanojo no chichi ga sore o kiita hi ni, sore o shounin shinai toki wa, kanojo wa sono seigan, mata wa sono mi ni tatta monodachi o subete yameru koto ga dekiru. Chichi ga shounin shinai no de arukara, Shu wa kanojo o yurusarerude arou.
Mata moshi otto no aru mi de, mizukara seigan o kake, mata wa sono mi ni monodachi o shiyou to, karugarushiku kuchi de itta baai,
Otto ga sore o kiki, sore o kiita hi ni kanojo ni nani mo iwanainaraba, kanojo wa sono seigan o okonai, sono mi ni tatta monodachi o mamoranakereba naranai.
Shikashi, moshi otto ga sore o kiita hi ni, sore o shounin shinainaraba, otto wa sono onna ga kaketa seigan, mata wa sono mi ni monodachi o shiyou to, karugarushiku kuchi ni itta koto o yamesaseru koto ga dekiru. Shu wa sono onna o yurusarerude arou.
Shikashi, kafu aruiha rien sareta onna no seigan, subete sono mi ni tatta monodachi wa, sore o mamoranakereba naranai.
Moshi onna ga otto no ie de seigan o kake, mata wa sono mi ni monodachi o shiyou to chikatta toki,
Otto ga sore o kiite, kanojo ni nani mo iwazu, mata sore ni hantai shinainaraba, sono seigan wa subete okonawanakereba naranai. Mata sono mi ni tatta monodachi wa subete mamoranakereba naranai.
Shikashi, moshi otto ga sore o kiita hi ni sore o mitomenainaraba, kanojo no seigan, mata wa mi no monodachi ni tsuite, kanojo ga kuchi de itta koto wa, subete yameru koto ga dekiru. Otto ga sore o mitomenakatta no dakara, Shu wa sono onna o yurusarerude arou.
Subete no seigan oyobi subete sono mi o nayamasu monodachi no seiyaku wa, otto ga sore o mamoraseru koto ga deki, mata wa otto ga sore o yamesaseru koto ga dekiru.
Moshi otto ga kanojo ni nani mo iwazu ni hi o okurunaraba, kare wa tsuma ga shita seigan, mata wa monodachi o subete mitometa no de aru. Kare wa sore o kiita hi ni tsuma ni nani mo iwanakatta no dakara, sore o mitometa no de aru.
Shikashi, moshi otto ga sore o kiki, ato ni natte, sore o mitomenainaraba, kare wa tsuma no tsumi o owanakereba naranai".
Korera wa Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta sadame de atte, otto to tsuma to no aida, oyobi chichi to mada wakakute chichi no ie ni iru musume to no aida ni kansuru mono de aru.
Sate Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Midean bito ni Isuraeru no hitobito no ada o mukui nasai. Sono nochi, anata wa anata no tami ni kuwaerarerude arou".
Moose wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata no uchi kara hito o erande tatakai no tame ni busou sase, Midean bito o semete, Shu no tame Midean bito ni fukushuu shi nasai.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no subete no buzoku kara, buzokugoto ni sennin zutsu o tatakai ni okuridasanakereba naranai".
Soko de Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi kara buzokugoto ni sennin zutsu o erabi, ichi man nisennin o ete, tatakai no tame ni busou saseta.
Moose wa kakubuzoku kara sennin zutsu o tatakai ni tsukawashi, mata saishi Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu ni, sei naru utsuwa to fukinarasu rappa to o torasete, tomo ni tatakai ni tsukawashita.
Karera wa Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni Midean bito to tatakatte, sono danshi o minakoroshi ta.
Sono koroshita mono no hoka ni mata Midean no ou gonin o koroshita. Sono na wa Ebi, Rekemu, Tsuru, Furu, Reba de aru. Mata Beoru no ko Baramu o mo, tsurugi ni kakete koroshita.
Mata Isuraeru no hitobito wa Midean no onnatachi to sono kotomotachi o horyo ni shi, sono kachiku to, hitsuji no mure to, kazai to o kotogotoku ubaitori,
Sono sumai no aru machimachi to, sono buraku to o, kotogotoku hi de yaita.
Kou shite karera wa subete ubatta mono to, kasumeta mono to wa hito o mo kachiku o mo tori,
Sono namakedotta mono to, kasumeta mono to, ubatta mono to o tazusaete, Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya no shukuei ni oru Moose to saishi Ereazaru to Isuraeru no hitobito no kaishuu no moto e modotte kita.
Toki ni Moose to saishi Ereazaru to kaishuu no tsukasatachi wa mina shukuei no soto ni dete mukaetaga,
Moose wa gunzei no shoutachi, sunawachi senjou kara kaette kita sennin no choutachi to, hyakunin no choutachi ni taishite ikatta.
Moose wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa onnatachi o mina ikashite oita no ka.
Karera wa Baramu no hakarigoto ni yotte, Isuraeru no hitobito ni, Peoru no koto de Shu ni tsumi o okasase, tsuini Shu no kaishuu no uchi ni ekibyou o okosu ni itatta.
Sore de ima, kono kodomotachi no uchi no otokonoko o minakoroshi, mata otoko to nete, otoko o shitta onna o minakoroshi nasai.
Tadashi, mada otoko to nezu, otoko o shiranai musume wa subete anata gata no tame ni ikashite oki nasai.
Soshite anata gata wa nanuka no aida shukuei no soto ni todomari nasai. Anata gata no uchi subete hito o koroshita mono, oyobi subete korosareta mono ni fureta mono wa, anata gata jishin mo, anata gata no horyo mo tomo ni, mikkame to nanuka me to ni mi o kiyomenakereba naranai.
Mata subete no ifuku to, subete no kawa no utsuwa to, subete yagi no ke de tsukutta mono to, subete no ki no utsuwa to o kiyomenakereba naranai".
Saishi Ereazaru wa tatakai ni detai kusabi to tachi ni itta, "Kore wa Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta rippou no sadame de aru.
Kin, gin, seidou, tetsu, suzu, namari nado,
Subete hi ni taeru mono wa hi no naka o toosanakereba naranai. Sou sureba kiyoku narude arou. Nao sono ue, kegare o kiyomeru mizu de, kiyomenakereba naranai. Shikashi, subete hi ni taenai mono wa mizu no naka o toosanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa nanuka me ni ifuku o arawanakereba naranai. Soshite kiyoku nari, sono nochi shukuei ni hairu koto ga dekiru".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata to saishi Ereazaru oyobi kaishuu no shizoku no kashiratachi wa, sono namakedotta hito to kachiku no emono no sousuu o shirabe,
Sono emono o tatakai ni deta yuushi to, zenkaishuu to ni seppan shi nasai.
Soshite tatakai ni detai kusabi to ni, hito mata wa ushi, mata haroba, mata wa hitsuji o, onoono gohyakugoto ni hitotsu o tori, mitsugi to shite Shu ni sasagesase nasai.
Sunawachi karera ga ukeru hanbun no naka kara, sore o tori, Shu ni sasageru mono to shite saishi Ereazaru ni watashi nasai.
Mata Isuraeru no hitobito ga ukeru hanbun no naka kara, sono eta hito mata wa ushi, mata haroba, mata wa hitsuji nado no kachiku o, onoono gojuugoto ni hitotsu o tori, Shu no makuya no tsutome o suru Rebi bito ni atae nasai".
Moose to saishi Ereazaru to wa Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta toori ni itta.
Soko de sono emono, sunawachi, iku sabi to tachi ga ubaitotta mono no nokori wa hitsuji rokujuu nana man gosen,
Ushi nana man nisen,
Roba roku man issen,
Hito san man nisen, kore wa mina otoko to nezu, otoko o shiranai onna de atta.
Soshite sono hanbun, sunawachi tatakai ni deta mono no bun wa hitsuji sanjuu san man nanasen gohyaku,
Shu ni mitsugi to shita hitsuji wa roppyaku nanajuu go.
Ushi wa san man rokusen, sono uchi kara Shu ni mitsugi to shita mono wa nanajuu ni.
Roba wa san man gohyaku, sono uchi kara Shu ni mitsugi to shita mono wa rokujuu ichi.
Hito wa ichi man rokusen, sono uchi kara Shu ni mitsugi to shita mono wa sanjuu ninin de atta.
Moose wa sono mitsugi o Shu ni sasageru mono to shite saishi Ereazaru ni watashita. Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta toori de aru.
Moose ga tatakai ni deta hitobito to wa betsu ni Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeta hanbun,
Sunawachi kaishuu no uketa hanbun wa hitsuji sanjuu san man nanasen gohyaku,
Ushi san man rokusen,
Roba san man gohyaku,
Hito ichi man rokusen de atte,
Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uketa hanbun no naka kara, hito oyobi kemono o onoono gojuugoto ni hitotsu o totte, Shu no makuya no tsutome o suru Rebi bito ni ataeta. Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta toori de aru.
Toki ni gunzei no shou de atta monodomo, sunawachi sennin no choutachi to hyakunin no choutachi to ga Moose no tokoro ni kite,
Moose ni itta, "Shimobera wa, shikika no iku sabi to o kazoemashitaga, wareware no uchi, hitori mo kaketa mono wa arimasendeshita.
Sore de, wareware wa, onoono te ni ireta kin no kazarimono, sunawachi udekazari, udewa, yubiwa, mimiwa, kubikazari nado o Shu ni tazusaete kite sonaemono to shi, Shu no mae ni wareware no inochi no a ga nai o shiyou to omoimasu".
Moose to saishi Ereazaru to wa, karera kara saiku o hodokoshita kin no kazarimono o uketotta.
Sennin no choutachi to hyakunin no choutachi to ga, Shu ni sasage mono to shita kin wa awasete ichi man rokusen nanahyaku gojuu shikeru.
Iku sabi to wa, onoono jibun no bundori mono o eta.
Moose to saishi Ereazaru to wa, sennin no choutachi to hyakunin no choutachi to kara, sono kin o uketori, sore o tazusaete kaiken no makuya ni iri, Shu no mae ni oite Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni kinen to shita.
Ruben no shison to Gado no shison to wa hijou ni ooku no kachiku no mure o motte ita. Karera ga Yazeru no chi to, Gireade no chi to o miruto, soko wa kachiku o kau no ni tekishite ita no de,
Gado no shison to Ruben no shison to ga kite, Moose to, saishi Ereazaru to, kaishuu no tsukasatachi to ni itta,
"Atarote, Debon, Yazeru, Nimura, Heshibon, Ereare, Shibamu, Nebo, Beon,
Sunawachi Shu ga Isuraeru no kaishuu no mae ni uchi horobosareta kuni wa, kachiku o kau no ni tekishita chi desuga, shimobera wa kachiku o motte imasu".
Karera wa mata itta, "Sore de mo shi, anata no megumi o eraremasunara, douzo kono chi o shimobera no ryouchi ni shite, wareware ni Yorudan o watarasenaide kudasai".
Moose wa Gado no shison to Ruben no shison to ni itta, "Anata gata wa kyoudai ga tatakai ni iku no ni, koko ni suwatte iyou to iu no ka.
Dou shite anata gata wa Isuraeru no hitobito no kokoro o kujiite, Shu ga karera ni ataerareru chi ni wataru koto ga dekinai you ni suru no ka.
Anata gata no senzo mo, watashi ga kadeshi barunea kara, sono chi o miru tame ni tsukawashita toki ni, onaji you na koto o shita.
Sunawachi karera wa Eshikoru no tani ni itte, sono chi o mita toki, Isuraeru no hitobito no kokoro o kujiite, Shu ga ataerareru chi ni iku koto ga dekinai you ni shita.
Soko de sono toki, Shu wa ikari o hasshi, chikatte iwareta,
'Ejiputo kara dete kita hitobito de nijuusai ijou no mono wa hitori mo watashi ga Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikatta chi o miru koto wa dekinai. Karera wa watashi ni shitagawanakattakara de aru.
Tada Kenizu bi to Efunne no ko Karebu to Nun no ko Yoshua to wa sou de wa nai. Kono futari wa mattaku Shu ni shitagattakara de aru'.
Shu wa kono you ni Isuraeru ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, karera o yonjuu nen no aida arano ni samayowa sareta no de, Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta sono sedai no hitobito wa, tsuini mina horobita.
Anata gata wa sono chichi ni kawatte tatta tsumibito no yakara de atte, Shu no Isuraeru ni taisuru hageshii ikari o sarani masou to shite iru.
Anata gata ga moshi somuite Shu ni shitagawanainaraba, Shu wa mata kono tami o arano ni suteokarerude arou. Sou sureba anata gata wa kono tami o kotogotoku horobosu ni itarude arou".
Karera wa Moose no tokoro e susumiyotte itta, "Wareware wa kono tokoro ni, mure no tame ni hitsuji no ori o tate, mata kodomotachi no tame ni machimachi o tateyou to omoimasu.
Shikashi, wareware wa busou shite Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni susumi, karera o sono tokoro e michibiite ikimashou. Tada wareware no kodomotachi wa, kono chi no juumin no gai o nogareru tame, kengo na machimachi ni sumasete okanakereba narimasen.
Wareware wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga, onoono sono shigyou o ukeru made wa, ie ni kaerimasen.
Mata wareware wa Yorudan no kanata de karera to tomo ni wa shigyou o ukemasen. Wareware wa Yorudan no konata, sunawachi higashi no hou de shigyou o ukerukara desu".
Moose wa karera ni itta, "Moshi, anata gata ga sono you ni shi, mina busou shite Shu no mae ni itte tatakai,
Mina busou shite Shu no mae ni itte Yorudan gawa o watari, Shu ga sono teki o jibun no mae kara oiharawarete,
Kono kuni ga Shu no mae ni seifuku sarete nochi, kaette kurunaraba, anata gata wa Shu no mae ni mo, Isuraeru no mae ni mo, togame wa naide arou. Soshite kono chi wa Shu no mae ni anata gata no shoyuu to narude arou.
Shikashi, sou shinainaraba, anata gata wa Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashita mono to nari, sono tsumi wa kanarazu mi ni oyobu koto o shiranakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa kodomotachi no tame ni machimachi o tate, hitsuji no tame ni, ori o tate nasai. Shikashi, anata gata wa yakusoku shita koto wa okonawanakereba naranai".
Gado no shison to Ruben no shison to wa, Moose ni itta, "Shimobera wa anata no meijirareta toori ni itashimasu.
Wareware no kodomotachi to tsuma to hitsuji to, subete no kachiku to wa, kono Gireade no machimachi ni nokoshimasu.
Shikashi, shimobera wa mina busou shite, anata no iwareru toori, Shu no mae ni watatte itte tatakaimasu".
Moose wa karera no koto ni tsuite, saishi Ereazaru to, Nun no ko Yoshua to, Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku no uchi no shizoku no kashiratachi to ni meijita.
Soshite Moose wa karera ni itta, "Gado no shison to, Ruben no shison to ga, onoono busou shite anata gata to issho ni Yorudan o watari, Shu no mae ni tatakatte, sono chi o anata gata ga seifuku surunaraba, anata gata wa karera ni Gireade no chi o ryouchi to shite ataenakereba naranai.
Shikashi, moshi karera ga busou shite anata gata to issho ni watatte ikanainaraba, karera wa Kanan no chi de anata gata no uchi ni ryouchi o enakereba naranai".
Gado no shison to, Ruben no shison to wa kotaete itta, "Shimobera wa Shu ga iwareta toori ni itashimasu.
Wareware wa busou shite, Shu no mae ni Kanan no chi e watatte ikimasuga, Yorudan no konata de, wareware no shigyou o motsu koto ni shimasu".
Soko de Moose wa Gado no shison to, Ruben no shison to, Yosefu no ko Manase no buzoku no nakaba to ni, Amori bito no ou Shihon no kuni to, Bashan no ou Ogu no kuni to o ataeta. Sunawachi, sono kuni oyobi sono ryounai no machimachi to sono machimachi no shuui no chi to o ataeta.
Kou shite Gado no shison wa, Debon, Atarote, Aroeru,
Aterote shopan, Yazeru, Yogubeha,
Betenimura, Beteharan nado no kengo na machimachi o tate, hitsuji no ori o tateta.
Mata Ruben no shison wa, Heshibon, Ereare, Kiriyataimu,
Oyobi nochi ni na o aratameta Nebo to, Baaru Meon no machi o tate, mata Shibuma no machi o tateta. Karera wa tateta machimachi ni atarashii na o ataeta.
Mata Manase no ko Makiru no shison wa Gireade ni itte, soko o tori, sono juumin Amori bito o oiharatta no de,
Moose wa Gireade o Manase no ko Makiru ni ataete soko ni sumawaseta.
Mata Manase no koYairu wa itte muramura o tori, sore o Haoteyairu to nazuketa.
Mata Noba wa itte Kenate to sono muramura o tori, jibun no na ni shitagatte, sore o Noba to nazuketa.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, Moose to Aron to ni michibikare, sono butai ni shitagatte, Ejiputo no kuni o dete kara heta tabiji wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Moose wa Shu no mei ni yori, sono tabiji ni shitagatte shukueki o kakitometa. Sono shukueki ni shitagaeba tabiji wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Karera wa shougatsu no juu go nichi ni Ramesesu o shuttatsu shita. Sunawachi sugikoshi no yokujitsu Isuraeru no hitobito wa, subete no Ejiputo bito no me no mae o ikiyouyou to shuttatsu shita.
Sono toki Ejiputo bi to wa, Shu ni uchikorosareta subete no ui go o houmutte ita. Shu wa mata karera no kamigami ni mo batsu o kuwaerareta.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Ramesesu o shuttatsu shite Sukote ni shukuei shi,
Sukote o shuttatsu shite arano no hashi ni aru Etamu ni shukuei shi,
Etamu o shuttatsu shite baaru zepon no mae ni aru Pihahirote ni hikikaeshite Migudoru no mae ni shukuei shi,
Pihahirote o shuttatsu shite, umi no naka o tootte arano ni iri, Etamu no arano o mikkaji hodo itte, Mera ni shukuei shi,
Mera o shuttatsu shi, Erimu ni itte shukuei shita. Erimu ni wa mizu no izumi juuni to, natsume yashi nanajuuhon to ga atta.
Erimu o shuttatsu shite koukai no hotori ni shukuei shi,
Koukai o shuttatsu shite Shin no arano ni shukuei shi,
Shin no arano o shuttatsu shite Dofuka ni shukuei shi,
Dofuka o shuttatsu shite Arushi ni shukuei shi,
Arushi o shuttatsu shite Repidemu ni shukuei shita. Soko ni wa tami no nomu mizu ga nakatta.
Repidemu o shuttatsu shite Shinai no arano ni shukuei shi,
Shinai no arano o shuttatsu shite kiburote hattawa ni shukuei shi,
Kiburote hattawa o shuttatsu shite Hazerote ni shukuei shi,
Hazerote o shuttatsu shite Ritema ni shukuei shi,
Ritema o shuttatsu shite rinmon paretsu ni shukuei shi,
Rinmon paretsu o shuttatsu shite Ribuna ni shukuei shi,
Ribuna o shuttatsu shite RiSsa ni shukuei shi,
RiSsa o shuttatsu shite Keherata ni shukuei shi,
Keherata o shuttatsu shite Shaperuyama ni shukuei shi,
Shaperuyama o shuttatsu shite Harada ni shukuei shi,
Harada o shuttatsu shite Makerote ni shukuei shi,
Makerote o shuttatsu shite Tahate ni shukuei shi,
Tahate o shuttatsu shite Tera ni shukuei shi,
Tera o shuttatsu shite Miteka ni shukuei shi,
Miteka o shuttatsu shite Hashimona ni shukuei shi,
Hashimona o shuttatsu shite Mosera ni shukuei shi,
Mosera o shuttatsu shite Beneyakan ni shukuei shi,
Beneyakan o shuttatsu shite horu hagidegade ni shukuei shi,
Horu hagidegade o shuttatsu shite Yotebata ni shukuei shi,
Yotebata o shuttatsu shite Aburona ni shukuei shi,
Aburona o shuttatsu shite ejion geberu ni shukuei shi,
Ejion geberu o shuttatsu shite Chin no arano sunawachi Kadeshi ni shukuei shi,
Kadeshi o shuttatsu shite Edomu no kuni no hashi ni aru Horu yama ni shukuei shita.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo no kuni o dete yonjuu nenme no go gatsu tsuitachi ni, saishi Aron wa Shu no mei ni yori Horu yama ni nobotte, sono tokoro de shinda.
Aron wa Horu yama de shinda toki hyaku nijuu sansai de atta.
Kanan no chi no Negebu ni sunde ita Kanan bito Arade no ou wa, Isuraeru no hitobito no kuru no o kiita.
Tsui de, Horu yama o shuttatsu shite Zarumona ni shukuei shi,
Zarumona o shuttatsu shite Punon ni shukuei shi,
Punon o shuttatsu shite Obote ni shukuei shi,
Obote o shuttatsu shite Moabu no sakai ni aru Ie Abarimu ni shukuei shi,
Ie Abarimu o shuttatsu shite Debon Gado ni shukuei shi,
Debon Gado o shuttatsu shite arumon deburataimu ni shukuei shi,
Arumon deburataimu o shuttatsu shite Nebo no mae ni aru Abarimu no yama ni shukuei shi,
Abarimu no yama o shuttatsu shite Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya ni shukuei shita.
Sunawachi Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya de, Beteeshimote to Aberu Shittemu to no aida ni shukuei shita.
Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya de, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai. Anata gata ga Yorudan o watatte Kanan no chi ni wa iru toki wa,
Sono chi no juumin o kotogotoku anata gata no mae kara oiharai, subete no sekizou o ko bo chi, subete no izou o ko bo chi, subete no takaki tokoro o hakai shinakereba naranai.
Mata anata gata wa sono chi no tami o oiharatte, soko ni sumanakereba naranai. Watashi ga sono chi o anata gata no shoyuu to shite ataetakara de aru.
Anata gata wa, onoono shizokugoto ni kuji o hiki, sono chi o wakete shigyou to shinakereba naranai. Ookii buzoku ni wa ooku no shigyou o atae, chiisai buzoku ni wa sukoshi no shigyou o ataenakereba naranai. Sono kuji no atatta tokoro ga sono shoyuu to narude arou. Anata gata wa fuso no buzoku ni shitagatte, sore o tsuganakereba naranai.
Shikashi, sono chi no juumin o anata gata no mae kara oiharawanainaraba, sono nokoshite oita mono wa anata gata no me ni toge to nari, anata gata no waki ni ibara to nari, anata gata no sumu kuni ni oite, anatagata o nayamasude arou.
Mata, watashi wa karera ni shiyou to omotta toori ni, anata gata ni surude arou".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite ii nasai. Anata gata ga Kanan no chi ni wa iru toki, anata gata no shigyou to narubeki chi wa Kanan no chi de, sono zen'iki wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Minami no hou wa Edomu ni sessuru Chin no arano ni hajimari, minami no sakai wa, higashi wa shio no umi no hashi ni hajimaru.
Sono sakai wa Akurabimu no saka no minami o megutte Chin ni mukai, kadeshi barunea no minami ni itari, hazaru adaru ni susumi, Azumon ni oyobu.
Sono sakai wa mata Azumon kara tenjite Ejiputo no kawa ni itari, umi ni oyonde tsukiru.
Nishi no sakai wa ooumi to sono engan de, kore ga anata gata no nishi no sakai de aru.
Anata gata no kita no sakai wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi ooumi kara Horu yama made sen o hiki,
Horu yama kara Hamate no iriguchi made sen o hiki, sono sakai o Zedade ni itarase,
Mata sono sakai wa Jifuron ni susumi, hazaru enon ni itatte tsukiru. Kore ga anata gata no kita no sakai de aru.
Anata gata no higashi no sakai wa, hazaru enon kara Shipamu made sen o hiki,
Mata sono sakai wa Ain no higashi no hou de, Shipamu kara Ribura ni kudari, mata sono sakai wa kudatte Kinnerete no umi no higashi no shamen ni itari,
Mata sono sakai wa Yorudan ni kudari, shio no umi ni itatte tsukiru. Anata gata no kuni no shuui no sakai wa ijou no toori de aru".
Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite itta, "Kore wa anata ga taga, kuji ni yotte tsugubeki chi de aru. Shu wa kore o kokonotsu no buzoku to han buzoku to ni ataeyo to meijirareta.
Sore wa Ruben no shison no buzoku to Gado no shison no buzoku to ga tomo ni fuso no ie ni shitagatte, sudeni sono shigyou o uke, mata Manase no han buzoku mo sono shigyou o ukete itakara de aru.
Kono futatsu no buzoku to han buzoku to wa Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no kanata, sunawachi higashi no hou, hi no deru hou de, sono shigyou o uketa".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata gata ni, shigyou to shite chi o wakeataeru hitobito no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi saishi Ereazaru to, Nun no ko Yoshua to de aru.
Anata gata wa mata, onoono buzoku kara, tsukasa hitori zutsu o erande, chi o wakeataesasenakereba naranai.
Sono hitobito no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Yuda no buzoku de wa Efunne no ko Karebu,
Shimeon no shison no buzoku de wa Amihode no ko Samueru,
Beniyamin no buzoku de wa Kisuron no ko Eridade,
Dan no shison no buzoku de wa Yoguri no ko tsu ka sa BuKki,
Yosefu no shison, sunawachi Manase no buzoku de wa Epode no ko tsukasa Hanieru,
Efuraimu no shison no buzoku de wa Shifutan no ko tsukasa Kemueru,
Zeburun no shison no buzoku de wa Parunaku no ko tsukasa Erizapan,
Issakaru no shison no buzoku de wa Azan no ko tsukasa Paruteeru,
Aseru no shison no buzoku de wa Shiromi no ko tsukasa Ahiude,
Nafutari no shison no buzoku de wa, Amihode no ko tsukasa Padaheru.
Kanan no chi de Isuraeru no hitobito ni shigyou o wakeataeru koto o Shu ga meijirareta hitobito wa ijou no toori de aru".
Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya de, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite, sono eta shigyou no uchi kara, Rebi bito ni sumubeki machimachi o ataesase nasai. Mata, anata gata wa, sono machimachi no shuui no houboku chi o Rebi bito ni ataenakereba naranai.
Sono machimachi wa karera no sumu tokoro, sono houboku chi wa karera no kachiku to mure, oyobi subete no kemono no tame de aru.
Anata gata ga Rebi bito ni ataeru machimachi no houboku chi wa, machi no ishigaki kara issen kyubito no shuui to shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa machi no soto de higashigawa ni nisen kyubito, minamigawa ni nisen kyubito, nishigawa ni nisen kyubito, kitagawa ni nisen kyubito o hakari, machi wa sono chuuou ni shinakereba naranai. Karera no machi no houboku chi wa kono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Anata gata ga Rebi bito ni ataeru machimachi wa muitsu de, nogare no machi to shi, hito o koroshita mono ga nogareru tokoro to shinakereba naranai. Nao kono hoka ni yonjuu ni no machi o ataenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi anata gata ga Rebi bito ni ataeru machi wa awasete yonjuu hachi de, kore o sono houboku chi to tomo ni ataenakereba naranai.
Anata gata ga Isuraeru no hitobito no shoyuu no uchi kara Rebi bito ni machimachi o ataeru ni wa, ookii buzoku kara wa ooku tori, chiisai buzoku kara wa sukunaku tori, onoono ukeru shigyou ni shitagatte, sono machimachi o Rebi bito ni ataenakereba naranai".
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai. Anata gata ga Yorudan o watatte Kanan no chi ni wa iru toki wa,
Anata gata no tame ni machi o erande, nogare no machi to shi, ayamatte hito o koroshita mono o, soko ni nogaresasenakereba naranai.
Kore wa anata gata ga fukushuu suru mono o sakete nogareru machi de atte, hito o koroshita mono ga kaishuu no mae ni tatte, sabaki o ukenai uchi ni, korosareru koto no nai tame de aru.
Anata gata ga ataeru machimachi no uchi, muitsu o nogare no machi to shinakereba naranai.
Sunawachi Yorudan no kanata de mittsu no machi o atae, Kanan no chi de mittsu no machi o ataete, nogare no machi to shinakereba naranai.
Korera no muitsu no machi wa, Isuraeru no hitobito to, takoku no hito oyobi kiryuusha no tame ni, nogare no basho to shinakereba naranai. Subete ayamatte hito o koroshita mono ga, soko ni nogareru tame de aru.
Moshi hito ga tetsu no utsuwa de, hito o utte shinasetanaraba, sono hito wa kosatsujin de aru. Kosatsujin wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Mata moshi hito o koroseru hodo no ishi o totte, hito o utte shinasetanaraba, sono hito wa kosatsujin de aru. Kosatsujin wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Aruiha hito o koroseru hodo no ki no utsuwa o totte, hito o utte shinasetanaraba, sono hito wa kosatsujin de aru. Kosatsujin wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Chi no fukushuu o suru mono wa, jibun de sono kosatsujin o korosu koto ga dekiru. Sunawachi kare ni deau toki, kare o korosu koto ga dekiru.
Mata moshi urami no tame ni hito o tsuki, aruiha koi ni hito ni mono o nagetsukete shinase,
Aruiha urami ni yotte te de hito o utte shinasetanaraba, sono utta mono wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai. Kare wa kosatsujin dakara de aru. Chi no fukushuu o suru mono wa, sono kosatsujin ni deau toki korosu koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi, moshi urami mo nai no ni omowazu hito o tsuki, mata wa, nanigokoro naku hito ni mono o nagetsuke,
Aruiha hito no iru no mo mizu ni, hito o koroseru hodo no ishi o nagetsukete shinaseta baai, sono hito ga sono teki de mo naku, mata gai o kuwaeyou to shita no de mo nai toki wa,
Kaishuu wa korera no okite ni yotte, sono hito o koroshita mono to, chi no fukushuu o suru mono to no aida o sabakanakereba naranai.
Sunawachi kaishuu wa sono hito o koroshita mono o chi no fukushuu o suru mono no te kara sukuidashite, nigete itta nogare no machi ni kaesanakereba naranai. Sono mono wa sei naru abura o sosogareta daisaishi no shinu made, soko ni inakereba naranai.
Shikashi, moshi hito o koroshita mono ga, sono nigete itta nogare no machi no sakai o deta baai,
Chi no fukushuu o suru mono wa, nogare no machi no sakai no soto de, kore ni deai, chi no fukushuu o suru mono ga, sono hito o koroshita mono o koroshite mo, kare ni wa chi o nagashita tsumi wa nai.
Kare wa daisaishi no shinu made, sono nogare no machi ni orubeki mono dakara de aru. Daisaishi no shinda nochi wa, hito o koroshita mono wa jibun no shoyuu no chi ni kaeru koto ga dekiru.
Korera no koto wa subete anata gata no sumu tokoro de, yoyo anata gata no tame no okite no sadame to shinakereba naranai.
Hito o koroshita mono, sunawachi kosatsujin wa subete shounin no shougen ni shitagatte korosarenakereba naranai. Shikashi, dare mo tada hitori no shougen ni yotte korosareru koto wa nai.
Anata gata wa shi ni ataru tsumi o okashita kosatsujin no inochi no a ga nai shiro o totte wa naranai. Kare wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai.
Mata, nogare no machi ni nogareta mono no tame ni, a ga nai shiro o totte daisaishi no shinu mae ni kare o jibun no chi ni kaeri sumawasete wa naranai.
Anata gata wa sono oru tokoro no chi o kegashite wa naranai. Ryuuketsu wa chi o kegasukara de aru. Chi no ue ni nagasareta chi wa, sore o nagashita mono no chi ni yoranakereba aganau koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata wa, sono sumu tokoro no chi, sunawachi watashi no oru chi o kegashite wa naranai. Shu naru watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni sunde irukara de aru".
Yosefu no shison no shizoku no uchi, Manase no ko Makiru no ko de aru Gireade no kora no shizoku no kashiratachi ga kite, Moose to Isuraeru no hitobito no kashira de aru tsukasatachi to no mae de katatte,
Itta, "Isuraeru no hitobito ni, sono shigyou no chi o kuji ni yotte ataeru koto o Shu wa anata ni meijirare, anata mo mata, wareware no kyoudai Zeropehade no shigyou o, sono musumetachi ni ataeru you, Shu ni yotte meijiraremashita.
Sono musumetachi ga moshi, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no ta no buzoku no musukotachi ni totsugunaraba, kanojotachi no shigyou wa, wareware no fuso no shigyou no uchi kara surinozokarete, sono totsugu buzoku no shigyou ni kuwaerarerudeshou. Kou shite sore wa wareware no shigyou no bun kara surinozokarerudeshou.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito no Yoberu no toshi ga kita toki, kanojotachi no shigyou wa, sono totsuida buzoku no shigyou ni kuwaerarerudeshou. Kou shite kanojotachi no shigyou wa, wareware no fuso no buzoku no shigyou no uchi kara surinozokarerudeshou".
Moose wa Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte, Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijite itta, "Yosefu no shison no buzoku no iu tokoro wa tadashii.
Zeropehade no musumetachi ni tsuite, Shu ga meijirareta koto wa kou de aru. Sunawachi 'Kanojotachi wa sono kokoro ni kanau mono ni totsuide mo yoiga, tada sono fuso no buzoku no ichizoku ni nomi, totsuganakereba naranai.
Sou sureba Isuraeru no hitobito no shigyou wa, buzoku kara buzoku ni utsuru you na koto wa naide arou. Isuraeru no hitobito wa, onoono sono fuso no buzoku no shigyou o kataku tamotsubekidakara de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku no uchi, shigyou o motte iru musume wa mina, sono chichi no buzoku ni zokusuru ichizoku ni totsuganakereba naranai. Sou sureba Isuraeru no hitobito wa, onoono sono fuso no shigyou o tamotsu koto ga dekiru.
Kou shite shigyou wa hitotsu no buzoku kara ta no buzoku ni utsuru koto wa nakarou. Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku wa onoono sono shigyou o kataku tamotsubekidakara de aru' ".
Soko de Zeropehade no musumetachi wa, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta you ni shita.
Sunawachi Zeropehade no musumetachi, Maara, Teruza, Hogura, Miruka oyobi Noa wa, sono chichi no kyoudai no musukotachi ni totsuida.
Kanojotachi wa Yosefu no ko Manase no musukotachi no ichizoku ni totsuida no de, sono shigyou wa sono chichi no ichizoku no zokusuru buzoku ni todomatta.
Korera wa Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no hotori no Moabu no heiya de, Shu ga Moose ni yotte Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijirareta meirei to okite de aru.
Kore wa Yorudan no mukou no arano, Paran to, Toperu, Raban, Hazerote, Dezahabu to no aida no, Sufu no mae ni aru Araba ni oite, Moose ga Isuraeru no subete no hito ni tsugeta kotoba de aru.
Horebu kara Seiruyama no michi o hete, kadeshi barunea ni tassuru ni wa, juu ichi nichi no michinori de aru.
Daiyonjuu nen no juu ichi gatsu to nari, sono tsuki no tsuitachi ni, Moose wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni mukatte, Shu ga karera no tame kare ni sazukerareta meirei o, kotogotoku tsugeta.
Kore wa Moose ga Heshibon ni sunde ita Amori bito no ou Shihon, oyobi Ashitarote to Ederei to ni sunde ita Bashan no ou Ogu o koroshita nochi de atta.
Sunawachi Moose wa Yorudan no mukou no Moabu no chi de, mizukara, kono rippou no setsumei ni atatta, soshite itta,
"Wareware no kami, Shu wa Horebu ni oite, wareware ni iwareta, 'Anata gata wa sudeni hisashiku, kono yama ni todomatte itaga,
Mi o megurashite michi ni susumi, Amori bito no sanchi ni iki, sono kinrin no subete no tokoro, Araba, sanchi, teichi, Negebu, umibe, Kanan bito no chi, mata Rebanon ni iki, ookawa Yufurate ni made iki nasai.
Miyo, watashi wa kono chi o anata gata no mae ni oita. Kono chi ni haitte, sore o jibun no mono to shi nasai. Kore wa Shu ga, anata gata no senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikatte, karera to sono nochi no shison ni ataeru to iwareta tokoro de aru'.
Ano toki, watashi wa anata gata ni itta, 'Watashi wa hitori de anatagata o ou koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata no kami, Shu wa anatagata o ooku sareta no de, anata gata wa, kyou, sora no hoshi no you ni ooi.
- - douzo, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu ga anatagata o, ima aru yori sen bai mo ooku shi, mata anata gata ni yakusoku sareta you ni, anatagata o megunde kudasaru you ni. - -
Watashi hitori de, dou shite, anatagata o oi, anata gata no omoni to, anata gata no arasoi o shori suru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Anata gata wa, onoono buzokugoto ni, chie ga ari, chishiki ga atte, hito ni shirarete iru hitobito o erabidashi nasai. Watashi wa sono hitobito o, anata gata no kashira to surude arou'.
Sono toki, anata gata wa watashi ni kotaeta, 'Anata ga shiyou to iwareru koto wa yoi koto desu'.
Soko de, watashi wa, anata gata no uchi kara, chie ga ari, hito ni shirarete iru hitobito o totte, anata gata no kashira to shita. Sunawachi sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, gojuunin no chou, juunin no chou to shi, mata, anata gata no buzoku no tsukasa bito to shita.
Mata, ano toki, watashi wa anata gata no sabaki bitotachi ni meijite itta, 'Anata gata wa, kyoudaitachi no aida no uttae o kiki, hito to sono kyoudai, mata wa kiryuu no takokujin to no aida o, tadashiku sabakanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, sabaki o suru toki, hito o katayori mite wa naranai. Chiisai mono ni mo ooinaru mono ni mo kikanakereba naranai. Hito no kao o osorete wa naranai. Sabaki wa kami no koto dakara de aru. Anatagata de kimeru no ni muzukashii koto wa, watashi no tokoro ni motte konakereba naranai. Watashi wa sore o kikude arou'.
Watashi wa mata, ano toki, anata gata ga shinakereba naranai koto o, kotogotoku meijita.
Wareware no kami, Shu ga meijirareta you ni, wareware wa, Horebu o shuttatsu shite, anata gata ga mita, ano ookina osoroshii arano o toori, Amori bito no sanchi e yuku michi ni yotte, kadeshi barunea ni kita.
Sono toki watashi wa anata gata ni itta, 'Anata gata wa, wareware no kami, Shu ga oatae ni naru Amori bito no sanchi ni tsuita.
Miyo, anata no kami, Shu wa kono chi o anata no mae ni okareta. Anata no senzo no kami, Shu ga tsugerareta you ni, nobotte itte, kore o jibun no mono to shi nasai. Osorete wa naranai. Ononoite wa naranai'.
Anata gata wa mina watashi ni chikayotte itta, 'Wareware wa hito o saki ni tsukawashite, sono chi o sagurase, dono michi kara noborubeki ka, dono machimachi ni irubeki ka o, fukumei sasemashou'.
Kono koto wa yoi to omotta no de, watashi wa anata gata no uchi, onoono no buzoku kara, hitori zutsu juu ninin no mono o eranda.
Karera wa mi o megurashite, sanchi ni nobotte iki, Eshikoru no tani e itte sore o saguri,
Sono chi no kudamono o te ni totte, wareware no tokoro ni motte kudari, fukumei shite itta, 'Wareware no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi wa yoi chi desu'.
Shikashi, anata gata wa nobotte iku koto o konomanaide, anata gata no kami, Shu no meirei ni somuita.
Soshite tenmaku de tsubuyaite itta. 'Shu wa wareware o nikunde Amori bito no te ni watashi, horobosou to shite Ejiputo no kuni kara michibikidasareta no da.
Wareware wa doko e nobotte iku no ka. Kyoudaitachi wa, "Sono tami wa wareware yori mo ookikute, se mo takai. Machimachi wa ookiku, sono ishigaki wa ten ni todoite iru. Wareware wa, mata Anaku bi to no shison o sono tokoro de mita" to itte, wareware no kokoro o kujiita'.
Sono toki, watashi wa anata gata ni itta, 'Karera o kowagatte wa naranai. Mata osorete wa naranai.
Saki ni tatte ikareru anata gata no kami, Shu wa Ejiputo ni oite, anata gata no me no mae de, subete no koto o okonawareta you ni, anata gata no tame ni tatakawarerude arou.
Anata gata wa mata arano de, anata no kami, Shu ga, hito no sono ko o daku you ni, anata o dakareru no o mita. Anata ga taga, kono tokoro ni kuru made, sono michisugara, itsu mo sou de atta'.
Kono you ni itte mo, anata gata wa nao, anata gata no kami, Shu o shinjinakatta.
Shu wa michimichi anata gata no saki ni tatte iki, anata gata ga shukuei suru basho o sagashi, yoru wa hi no uchi ni ari, hiru wa kumo no uchi ni atte, anata gata ni yukubeki michi o shimesareta.
Shu wa, anata gata no kotoba o kiite ikari, chikatte iwareta,
'Kono warui sedai no hitobito no uchi ni wa, watashi ga, anata gata no senzotachi ni ataeru to chikatta ano yoi chi o miru mono wa, hitori mo naide arou.
Tada Efunne no ko Karebu dake wa sore o miru koto ga dekirude arou. Kare ga funda chi o, watashi wa kare to sono shison ni ataerude arou. Kare ga mattaku Shu ni shitagattakara de aru'.
Shu wa mata, anata gata no yue ni, watashi o mo ikatte iwareta, 'Omae mo mata, soko ni hairu koto ga dekinaide arou.
Omae ni tsukaete iru Nun no ko Yoshua ga, soko ni hairude arou. Kare o chikarazukeyo. Kare wa Isuraeru ni sore o esaserude arou.
Mata anata ga taga, kasumerarerude arou to itta anata gata no osanagotachi, oyobi sono hi ni mada zen'aku o wakimaenai anata gata no kodomotachi ga, soko ni hairude arou. Watashi wa sore o karera ni ataeru. Karera wa sore o shoyuu to surude arou.
Anata gata wa mi o megurashi, koukai no michi ni yotte, arano ni susunde iki nasai'.
Shikashi, anata gata wa watashi ni kotaete itta, 'Wareware wa Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashimashita. Wareware no kami, Shu ga meijirareta you ni, wareware wa nobotte itte tatakaimashou'. Soshite, onoono buki o mi ni obite, karugarushiku sanchi e nobotte ikou to shita.
Sono toki, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Karera ni ii nasai, "Anata gata wa nobotte itte wa naranai. Mata tatakatte wa naranai. Watashi wa anata gata no uchi ni inai. Osoraku, anata gata wa teki ni uchi yaburarerude arou"'.
Kono you ni watashi ga tsugeta no ni, anata gata wa kikanaide Shu no meirei ni somuki, hoshiimama ni sanchi e nobotte ittaga,
Sono sanchi ni sunde iru Amori bito ga, anata gata ni mukatte dete kite, hachi ga ou you ni, anatagata o oikake, Seiru de uchi yabutte, Horuma ni made oyonda.
Anata gata wa kaette kite, Shu no mae de naitaga, Shu wa anata gata no koe o kikazu, anata gata ni mimi o katamukerarenakatta.
Kou shite anata gata wa, hi hisashiku Kadeshi ni todomatta. Anata gata no soko ni todomatta nissuu no toori de aru.
Sore kara, wareware wa mi o megurashi, Shu ga watashi ni tsugerareta you ni, koukai no hou ni mukatte arano ni susumiiri, hi hisashiku Seiruyama o iki megutte itaga,
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta,
'Anata gata wa sudeni hisashiku kono yama o iki megutte iruga, mi o megurashite kita ni susumi nasai.
Omae wa mata tami ni meijite ie, "Anata gata wa, Esau no shison, sunawachi Seiru ni sunde iru anata gata no kyoudai no ryounai o toorou to shite iru. Karera wa anatagata o osorerude arou. Sore yue, anata gata wa mizukara fukaku tsutsushimi,
Karera to arasotte wa naranai. Karera no chi wa, ashi no ura de fumu hodo de mo, anata gata ni ataenaide arou. Watashi ga Seiruyama o Esau ni ataete, ryouchi to sasetakara de aru.
Anata gata wa karera kara kane de shokumotsu o katte tabe, mata kane de mizu o katte nomanakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu ga, anata no suru subete no koto ni oite, anata o megumi, anata ga kono ooinaru arano o tooru no o, mimamoraretakara de aru. Anata no kami, Shu ga kono yonjuu nen no aida, anata to tomo ni orareta no de, anata wa nani mo toboshii koto ga nakatta"'.
Kou shite wareware wa, Esau no shison de Seiru ni sunde iru kyoudai o hanare, Araba no michi o sake, Erate to ejion geberu o hanarete susunda. Wareware wa tenjite, Moabu no arano no hou ni mukatte susunda.
Sono toki, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Moabu o tekishi shite wa naranai. Mata sore to arasoi tatakatte wa naranai. Karera no chi wa, ryouchi to shite anata ni ataenai. Roto no shison ni Aru o ataete, ryouchi to sasetakara de aru.
(mukashi, Emi bi to ga kono tokoro ni sunde ita. Kono tami wa ooinaru tami de atte, kazu mo ooku, Anaku bi to no you ni se mo takaku,
Mata Anaku bi to to onajiku Repaimu de aruto, minasarete itaga, Moabu bito wa, kore o Emi bi to to yonde ita.
Hori bito mo, mukashi wa Seiru ni sunde itaga, Esau no shison ga kore o oiharai, kore o horoboshi, karera ni kawatte soko ni sunda. Shu ga tamawatta shoyuu no chi ni, Isuraeru ga okonatta no to onaji de aru.)
Anata gata wa, ima, tachiagatte Zerede gawa o watari nasai'. Soko de wareware wa Zerede gawa o watatta.
Kadeshi barunea o dete konokata, Zerede gawa o wataru made no aida no hi wa sanjuu hachi nen de atte, sono sedai no iku sabi to wa mina shinitaete, shukuei no uchi ni inaku natta. Shu ga karera ni chikawareta toori de aru.
Makoto ni Shu no te ga karera o seme, shukuei no uchi kara horoboshisarareta no de, karera wa tsuini shinitaeta.
Iku sabi to ga minatami no uchi kara shinitaeta toki,
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta,
'Omae wa, kyou, Moabu no ryouchi Aru o toorou to shite iru.
Anmon no shison ni chikazuku toki, omae wa karera o tekishi shite wa naranai. Mata arasotte wa naranai. Watashi wa Anmon no shison no chi o ryouchi to shite, omae ni ataenai. Sore o Roto no shison ni ryouchi to shite ataetakara de aru.
(kore mo mata Repaimu no kuni to minasareta. Mukashi, Repaimu ga koko ni sunde itakara de aru. Shikashi, Anmon bito wa karera o Zamuzumi bito to yonda.
Kono tami wa ooinaru tami de atte kazu mo ooku, Anaku bi to no you ni se mo takakattaga, Shu wa Anmon bito no mae kara, kore o horobosare, Anmon bito ga kore o oiharatte, karera ni kawatte soko ni sunda.
Kono koto wa, Seiru ni sunde iru Esau no shison no tame ni sono mae kara, Hori bito o horobosareta no to onaji de aru. Karera wa Hori bito o oiharai, kore ni kawatte konnichi made soko ni sunde iru.
Mata Kafutoru kara deta Kafutoru bi to wa, Gaza ni made oyobu muramura ni sunde ita Abi bito o horoboshite, kore ni kawatte soko ni sunde iru.)
Anata gata wa tachiagari, susunde Arunon gawa o watari nasai. Watashi wa Heshibon no ou Amori bito Shihon to sono kuni to o, omae no te ni watashita. Sore o seifuku shi hajime yo. Kare to arasotte tatakae.
Kyou kara, watashi wa zentenka no tami ni, omae o obie osore saserude arou. Karera wa omae no uwasa o kiite furue, omae no tame ni kurushimude arou'.
Soko de watashi wa, Kedemote no arano kara, Heshibon no ou Shihon ni shisha o tsukawashi, heiwa no kotoba o nobesaseta.
'Anata no kuni o toorasete kudasai. Watashi wa ooji o tootte ikimasu, migi ni mo hidari ni mo magarimasen.
Kane de shokumotsu o utte watashi ni tabesase, kane o totte mizu o ataete watashi ni nomasete kudasai. Toho de toorasete kudasaru dake de yoi no desu.
Seiru ni sumu Esau no shison to, Aru ni sumu Moabu bito ga, watashi ni shita you ni shite kudasai. Sou sureba, watashi wa Yorudan o watatte, wareware no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi ni ikimasu'.
Shikashi, Heshibon no ou Shihon wa, wareware o tooraseru no o konomanakatta. Anata no kami, Shu ga kare o anata no te ni watasu tame, sono ki o tsuyoku shi, sono kokoro o katakuna ni saretakara de aru. Konnichi miru toori de aru.
Toki ni Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Watashi wa Shihon to, sono chi to o, omae ni watashi hajimeta. Omae wa sore o seifuku shi hajime, sono chi o jibun no mono to seyo'.
Soko de Shihon wa, wareware o semeyou to shite, sono tami o kotogotoku hikii, dete kite Yahazu de tatakattaga,
Wareware no kami, Shu ga kare o watasareta no de, wareware wa kare to sono kora to, sono subete no tami to o uchikoroshita.
Sono toki, wareware wa kare no subete no machi o tori, sono subete no machi no otoko, onna oyobi kodomo o mattaku horoboshite, hitori o mo nokosanakatta.
Tada sono kachiku wa, wareware ga totta machimachi no bundori mono to tomo ni, wareware ga ete jibun no mono to shita.
Arunon no tani no hotori ni aru Aroeru oyobi tani no naka ni aru machi kara Gireade ni itaru made, wareware ga semete torenakatta machi wa hitotsu mo nakatta. Wareware no kami, Shu ga kotogotoku wareware ni watasareta no de aru.
Tada Anmon no shison no chi, sunawachi Yaboku gawa no zenkishi, oyobi sanchi no machimachi, mata subete wareware no kami, Shu ga kinjirareta tokoro ni wa chikayoranakatta.
Soshite wareware wa mi o megurashite, Bashan no michi o nobotte ittaga, Bashan no ou Ogu wa, wareware o mukaeutou to shite, sono tami o kotogotoku hikii, dete kite Ederei de tatakatta.
Toki ni Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Kare o osorete wa naranai. Watashi wa kare to, sono subete no tami to, sono chi o omae no te ni watashite iru. Omae wa Heshibon ni sunde ita Amori bito no ou Shihon ni shita you ni, kare ni surude arou'.
Kou shite wareware no kami, Shu wa Bashan no ou Ogu to, sono subete no tami o, wareware no te ni watasareta no de, wareware wa kore o uchikoroshite, hitori o mo nokosanakatta.
Sono toki, wareware wa kare no machimachi o, kotogotoku totta. Wareware ga toranakatta machi wa hitotsu mo nakatta. Totta machi wa rokujuu. Arugobu no zenchihou de atte, Bashan ni okeru Ogu no kuni de aru.
Korera wa mina, takai ishigaki ga ari, mon ga ari, kannoki no aru kengo na machi de atta. Kono hoka ni ishigaki no nai machi wa, hijou ni ookatta.
Wareware wa Heshibon no ou Shihon ni shita you ni, korera o mattaku horoboshi, sono subete no machi no otoko, onna oyobi kodomo o kotogotoku horoboshita.
Tadashi, sono subete no kachiku to, sono machimachi kara no bundori mono to wa, wareware ga ete jibun no mono to shita.
Sono toki wareware wa Yorudan no mukougawa ni iru Amori bito no futari no ou no te kara, Arunon gawa kara Herumon zan made no chi o totta.
(Shidon bito wa Herumon o Shirion to yobi, Amori bi to wa kore o Seniru to yonde iru.)
Sunawachi kougen no subete no machi, Gireade no zenchi, Bashan no zenchi, Saruka oyobi Ederei made, Bashan ni aru Ogu no kuni no machimachi o kotogotoku totta.
(Bashan no ou Ogu wa Repaimu no tada hitori no seizonsha de atta. Kare no shindai wa tetsu no shindai de atta. Kore wa ima nao Anmon bito no Raba ni aru de wa nai ka. Kore wa futsuu no kyubito shaku de, nagasa kyuu kyubito, haba yon kyubito de aru.)
Sono toki wareware wa, kono chi o eta. Soshite watashi wa Arunon gawa no hotori no Aroeru kara hajimaru chi to, Gireade no sanchi no nakaba to, sono machimachi to wa, Ruben bito to, Gado bi to to ni ataeta.
Watashi wa mata Gireade no nokori no chi to, Ogu no kuni de atta Bashan no zenchi to wa, Manase no han buzoku ni ataeta. Sunawachi Arugobu no zenchihou de aru. (sono Bashan no zenchi wa Repaimu no kuni to tonaerareru.
Manase no koYairu wa, Arugobu no zenchihou o totte, Geshuru bito to, Maaka bi to no sakai ni made tasshi, jibun no na ni shitagatte, Bashan o habote yairu to nazuketa. Kono na wa konnichi ni made oyonde iru.)
Mata watashi wa Makiru ni wa Gireade o ataeta.
Ruben bito to, Gado bi to to ni wa, Gireade kara Arunon gawa made o atae, sono kawa no mannaka o motte sakai to shi, mata Anmon bito no sakai de aru Yaboku gawa ni made tasseshimeta.
Mata Yorudan o sakai to shite, Kinnerete kara Araba no umi sunawachi shio no umi made, Araba o kore ni ataete, higashi no hou Pisuga no fumoto ni tasseshimeta.
Sono toki watashi wa anata gata ni meijite itta, 'Anata gata no kami, Shu wa kono chi o anata gata ni ataete, kore o esaserarerukara, anata gata yuushi wa mina busou shite, kyoudai de aru Isuraeru no hitobito ni sakidatte, watatte ikanakereba naranai.
Tadashi, anata gata no tsuma to, kodomo to, kachiku to wa, watashi ga ataeta machimachi ni todomaranakereba naranai. (watashi wa anata gata ga ooku no kachiku o motte iru no o shitte iru.)
Shu ga sudeni anata gata ni ataerareta you ni, anata gata no kyoudai ni mo ansoku o ataerarete, karera mo mata Yorudan no mukougawa de, anata gata no kami, Shu ga ataerareru chi o eru you ni nattanaraba, anata gata wa onoono watashi ga anata gata ni ataeta ryouchi ni kaeru koto ga dekiru'.
Sono toki watashi wa Yoshua ni meijite itta, 'Anata no me wa anata gata no kami, Shu ga kono futari no ou ni okonawareta subete no koto o mita. Shu wa mata anata ga watatte iku moromoro no kuni ni mo, onaji you ni okonawarerude arou.
Karera o osorete wa naranai. Anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata no tame ni tatakawarerukara de aru'.
Sono toki watashi wa Shu ni negatte itta,
'Shu naru kami yo, anata no ooinaru koto to, anata no tsuyoi te to o, tatta ima, shimobe ni shimeshi hajimeraremashita. Ten ni mo chi ni mo, anata no you na waza o nashi, anata no you na chikara aru waza no dekiru kami ga, hoka ni arimashou ka.
Douzo, watashi ni Yorudan o watatte ikase, sono mukougawa no yoi chi, ano yoi sanchi, oyobi Rebanon o miru koto no dekiru you ni shite kudasai'.
Shikashi Shu wa anata gata no yue ni watashi o ikari, watashi ni kikarenakatta. Soshite Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Omae wa mohaya tarite iru. Kono koto ni tsuite wa, kasanete watashi ni itte wa naranai.
Omae wa Pisuga no itadaki ni nobori, me o agete nishi, kita, minami, higashi o nozomimi yo. Omae wa kono Yorudan o wataru koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Shikashi, omae wa Yoshua ni meiji, kare o hagemashi, kare o tsuyoku seyo. Kare wa kono tami ni sakidatte watatte iki, karera ni omae no miru chi o tsugaserude arou'.
Kou shite wareware wa Betepeoru ni taisuru tani ni todomatte ita.
Isuraeru yo, ima, watashi ga anata gata ni oshieru sadame to, okite to o kiite, kore o okonai nasai. Sou sureba, anata gata wa ikiru koto ga deki, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi ni haitte, sore o jibun no mono to suru koto ga dekiyou.
Watashi ga anata gata ni meijiru kotoba ni tsukekuwaete wa naranai. Mata herashite wa naranai. Watashi ga meijiru anata gata no kami, Shu no meirei o mamoru koto no dekiru tame de aru.
Anata gata no me wa, Shu ga Baaru Peoru de okonawareta koto o mita. Peoru no Baaru ni shitagatta hitobito wa, anata no kami, Shu ga kotogotoku, anata no uchi kara horoboshi tsukusareta no de aru.
Shikashi, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukishitagatta anata gata wa mina, kyou, ikinagaraete iru.
Watashi wa watashi no kami, Shu ga meijirareta toori ni, sadame to, okite to o, anata gata ni oshieru. Anata gata ga haitte, jibun no mono to suru chi ni oite, sono you ni okonau tame de aru.
Anata gata wa, kore o mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Kore wa, moromoro no tami ni anata gata no chie, mata chishiki o shimesu koto de aru. Karera wa, kono moromoro no sadame o kiite, 'Kono ooinaru kokumin wa, makoto ni chie ari, chishiki aru tami de aru' to iude arou.
Wareware no kami, Shu wa, wareware ga yobimotomeru toki, tsune ni wareware ni chikaku orareru. Izure no ooinaru kokumin ni, kono you ni chikaku oru kami ga arude arou ka.
Mata, izure no ooinaru kokumin ni, kyou, watashi ga anata gata no mae ni tateru kono subete no rippou no you na tadashii sadame to, okite to ga arude arou ka.
Tada anata wa mizukara tsutsushimi, mata anata jishin o yoku mamori nasai. Soshite me ni mita koto o wasurezu, ikinagaraete iru aida, sorera no koto o anata no kokoro kara hanashite wa naranai. Mata sorera no koto o, anata no shison ni shirasenakereba naranai.
Anata ga Horebu ni oite, anata no kami, Shu no mae ni tatta hi ni, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Tami o watashi no moto ni atsumeyo. Watashi wa karera ni watashi no kotoba o kikase, chijou ni ikinagaraeru aida, karera ni watashi o osoreru koto o manabase, mata sono kotomo o oshieru koto no dekiru you ni saseyou'.
Soko de anata gata wa chikazuite, yama no fumoto ni tattaga, yama wa hi de yakete, sono honoo wa chuuten ni tasshi, ankoku to kumo to koi kumo to ga atta.
Toki ni Shu wa hi no naka kara, anata gata ni katararetaga, anata gata wa kotoba no koe o kiitakeredo mo, koe bakari de, nan no katachi mo minakatta.
Shu wa sono keiyaku o nobete, sore o okonau you ni, anata gata ni meijirareta. Sore wa sunawachi jikkai de atte, Shu wa sore o nimai no ishi no ita ni kakishirusareta.
Sono toki, Shu wa watashi ni meijite, anata gata ni sadame to, okite to o oshiesaserareta. Anata gata ga watatte itte jibun no mono to suru chi de, okonawaseru tame de atta.
Sore yue, anata gata wa mizukara fukaku tsutsushimanakereba naranai. Horebu de Shu ga hi no naka kara anata gata ni katarareta hi ni, anata gata wa nan no katachi mo minakatta.
Sore de anata gata wa michi o ayamatte, jibun no tame ni, donna katachi no kizanda zou o mo tsukutte wa naranai. Otoko mata wa onna no zou o tsukutte wa naranai.
Sunawachi chi no ue ni oru moromoro no kemono no zou, sora o tobu moromoro no tori no zou,
Chi ni hau moromoro no mono no zou, chi no shita no mizu no naka ni oru moromoro no uo no zou o tsukutte wa naranai.
Anata wa mata me o agete ten o nozomi, hi, tsuki, hoshi sunawachi subete ten no banshou o mi, yuuwaku sarete sore o ogami, sore ni tsukaete wa naranai. Sorera no mono wa, anata no kami, Shu ga zentenka no banmin ni wakerareta mono de aru.
Shikashi, Shu wa anatagata o totte, tetsu no ro sunawachi Ejiputo kara michibikidashi, jibun no shoyuu no tami to sareta. Kyou, miru toori de aru.
Tokoro de Shu wa anata gata no yue ni, watashi o ikari, watashi ga Yorudan o watatte iku koto ga dekinai koto to, anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite anata ni tamawaru yoi chi ni hairu koto ga dekinai koto to o chikawareta.
Watashi wa kono chi de shinu. Yorudan o watatte iku koto wa dekinai. Shikashi anata gata wa watatte itte, ano yoi chi o erude arou.
Anata gata wa tsutsushimi, anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata to musubareta keiyaku o wasurete, anata no kami, Shu ga kinjirareta donna katachi no kizanda zou o mo tsukutte wa naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu wa yaki tsukusu hi, netamu kami de aru.
Anata gata ga ko o umi, mago o e, nagaku sono chi ni oru uchi ni, michi o ayamatte, subete nani ka no katachi ni kizanda zou o tsukuri, anata no kami, Shu no me no mae ni aku o nashite, sono ikidoori o hikiokosu koto ga areba,
Watashi wa, kyou, ten to chi o yonde anata gata ni taishite akashi to suru. Anata gata wa Yorudan o watatte itte eru chi kara, tachimachi zenmetsu surude arou. Anata gata wa sono tokoro de nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekizu, mattaku horobosarerude arou.
Shu wa anatagata o kuniguni ni chirasarerude arou. Soshite Shu ga anatagata o oiyarareru kokumin no uchi ni, anata gata no nokoru mono no kazu wa sukunaide arou.
Sono tokoro de anata gata wa hito ga te de tsukutta, miru koto mo, kiku koto mo, taberu koto mo, kagu koto mo nai ki ya ishi no kamigami ni tsukaerude arou.
Shikashi, sono tokoro kara anata no kami, Shu o motome, moshi kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite, Shu o motomerunaraba, anata wa Shu ni aude arou.
Nochi no hi ni natte, anata ga nayami ni ai, korera no subete no koto ga, anata ni nozomu toki, moshi anata no kami, Shu ni tachikaette sono koe ni kiki shitagaunaraba,
Anata no kami, Shu wa itsukushimi no fukai kami de arukara, anata o sutezu, anata o horobosazu, mata anata no senzo ni chikatta keiyaku o wasurerarenaide arou.
Kokoromi ni anata no mae ni sugisatta hi ni tsuite toe. Kami ga chijou ni hito o tsukurareta hi kara konokata, ten no kono hashi kara, kano hashi made ni, katsute kono you ni ooinaru koto ga attade arou ka. Kono you na koto o kiita koto ga attade arou ka.
Hi no naka kara katarareru kami no koe o anata ga kiita you ni, kiite nao ikite ita tami ga katsute attade arou ka.
Aruiha mata, anata gata no kami, Shu ga Ejiputo ni oite, anata gata no me no mae ni, anata gata no tame ni moromoro no koto o nasareta you ni, kokoromi to, shirushi to, fushigi to, tatakai to, tsuyoi te to, nobashita ude to, ooinaru osorubeki koto to o motte nozomi, hitotsu no kokumin o ta no kokumin no uchi kara hikidashite, jibun no tami to sareta kami ga, katsute attade arou ka.
Anata ni kono koto o shimeshita no wa, Shu koso kami de atte, hoka ni kami no nai koto o shiraseru tame de atta.
Anata o kunren suru tame ni, Shu wa ten kara sono koe o kikase, chijou de wa, mata sono ooinaru hi o shimesareta. Anata wa sono kotoba ga hi no naka kara deru no o kiita.
Shu wa anata no senzotachi o aisareta no de, sono nochi no shison o erabi, ooinaru chikara o motte, mizukara anata o Ejiputo kara michibikidashi,
Anata yori mo ookiku, katsu tsuyoi moromoro no kokumin o, anata no mae kara oiharai, anata o sono chi ni michibikiirete, kore o shigyou to shite anata ni ataeyou to sareru koto, konnichi miru toori de aru.
Sore yue, anata wa, kyou shitte, kokoro ni tomenakereba naranai. Ue wa ten, shita wa chi ni oite, Shu koso kami ni imashi, hoka ni kami no nai koto o.
Anata wa, kyou, watashi ga meijiru Shu no sadame to meirei to o mamoranakereba naranai. Sou sureba, anata to anata no nochi no shison wa saiwai o e, anata no kami, Shu ga eikyuu ni anata ni tamawaru chi ni oite, nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekirude arou".
Sore kara Moose wa Yorudan no mukougawa, higashi no hou ni mittsu no machimachi o shitei shita.
Kako no urami ni yoru no de wa naku, ayamatte rinjin o koroshita mono o soko ni nogaresase, sono machi no hitotsu ni nogarete, inochi o mattou saseru tame de atta.
Sunawachi Ruben bito no tame ni wa arano no naka no kouchi ni aru Bezeru o, Gado bi to no tame ni wa Gireade no Ramote o, Manase bito no tame ni wa Bashan no Goran o sadameta.
Moose ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni shimeshita rippou wa kore de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo kara deta toki, Moose ga karera ni nobeta akashi to, sadame to, okite to wa kore de aru.
Sunawachi Yorudan no mukougawa, Amori bito no ou Shihon no kuni no Betepeoru ni taisuru tani ni oite kore o nobeta. Shihon wa Heshibon ni sunde itaga, Moose to Isuraeru no hitobito ga, Ejiputo o dete kita toki, kore o uchi yabutte,
Sono kuni o e, mata Bashan no ou Ogu no kuni o eta. Kono futari wa Amori bito no ou de atte, Yorudan no mukougawa, higashi no hou ni otta.
Karera no eta chi wa Arunon gawa no hotori ni aru Aroeru kara Shirionzan sunawachi Herumon ni oyobi,
Yorudan no higashigawa no Araba no zenbu o kanete, Araba no umi ni tasshi, Pisuga no fumoto ni oyonda.
Sate Moose wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o meshiyosete itta, "Isuraeru yo, kyou, watashi ga anata gata no mimi ni kataru sadame to, okite o kiki, kore o manabi, kore o mamotte okonae.
Wareware no kami, Shu wa Horebu de, wareware to keiyaku o musubareta.
Shu wa kono keiyaku o wareware no senzotachi to wa musubazu, kyou, koko ni ikinagaraete iru wareware subete no mono to musubareta.
Shu wa yama de hi no naka kara, anata gata to kao o awasete katarareta.
Sono toki, watashi wa Shu to anata gata to no aida ni tatte Shu no kotoba o anata gata ni tsutaeta. Anata gata wa hi no yue ni osorete yama ni noboru koto ga dekinakattakara de aru. Shu wa iwareta,
'Watashi wa anata no kami, Shu de atte, anata o Ejiputo no chi, dorei no ie kara michibikidashita mono de aru.
Anata wa watashi no hoka ni nanimono o mo kami to shite wa naranai.
Anata wa jibun no tame ni kizanda zou o tsukutte wa naranai. Ue wa ten ni aru mono, shita wa chi ni aru mono, mata chi no shita no mizu no naka ni aru mono no, dono you na katachi o mo tsukutte wa naranai.
Sore o ogande wa naranai. Mata sore ni tsukaete wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu de aru watashi wa, netamu kami de arukara, watashi o nikumu mono ni wa, chichi no tsumi o ko ni mukuite san, yon dai ni oyoboshi,
Watashi o aishi, watashi no imashime o mamoru mono ni wa megumi o hodokoshite sendai ni itarude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu no na o midari ni tonaete wa naranai. Shu wa sono na o midari ni tonaeru mono o basshinaide wa okanaide arou.
Ansokunichi o mamotte kore o sei to shi, anata no kami, Shu ga anata ni meijirareta you ni seyo.
Muika no aida hataraite, anata no subete no waza o shinakereba naranai.
Nanuka me wa anata no kami, Shu no ansoku de arukara, nan no waza o mo shite wa naranai. Anata mo, anata no musuko, musume, shimobe, hashi tame, ushi, roba, moromoro no kachiku mo, anata no mon no uchi ni oru takoku no hito mo onaji de aru. Kou shite anata no shimobe, hashi tame o, anata to onaji you ni yasumasenakereba naranai.
Anata wa katsute Ejiputo no chi de dorei de attaga, anata no kami, Shu ga tsuyoi te to, nobashita ude to o motte, soko kara anata o michibikidasareta koto o oboenakereba naranai. Sore yue, anata no kami, Shu wa ansokunichi o mamoru koto o meijirareru no de aru.
Anata no kami, Shu ga meijirareta you ni, anata no chichi to haha to o uyamae. Anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi de, anata ga nagaku inochi o tamochi, saiwai o eru koto no dekiru tame de aru.
Anata wa koroshite wa naranai.
Anata wa kan'in shite wa naranai.
Anata wa nusunde wa naranai.
Anata wa rinjin ni tsuite gishou shite wa naranai.
Anata wa rinjin no tsuma o musabotte wa naranai. Mata rinjin no ie, hatake, shimobe, hashi tame, ushi, roba, mata subete rinjin no mono o hoshigatte wa naranai'.
Shu wa korera no kotoba o yama de hi no naka, kumo no naka, koi kumo no naka kara, ooinaru koe o motte, anata gata no zenkaishuu ni otsuge ni nattaga, kono hoka no koto wa iwarezu, nimai no ishi no ita ni kore o kakishirushite, watashi ni sazukerareta.
Toki ni yama wa hi de moete itaga, anata gata ga ankoku no uchi kara kikoeru koe o kiku ni oyonde, anata gata no buzoku no subete no kashira to chouroutachi wa, watashi ni chikayotte,
Itta, 'Wareware no kami, Shu ga sono eikou to, sono ooinaru koto to o, wareware ni shimesarete, wareware wa hi no naka kara deru sono koe o kikimashita. Kyou, wareware wa kami ga hito to katarare, shikamo nao sono hito ga ikite iru no o mimashita.
Wareware wa naze shinanakereba naranaideshou ka. Kono ooinaru hi wa wareware o yakihorobosou to shite imasu. Moshi kono ue nao wareware no kami, Shu no koe o kikunaraba, wareware wa shinde shimaudeshou.
Oyoso niku naru mono no uchi, dare ga, hi no naka kara katarareru ikeru kami no koe o, wareware no you ni kiite nao ikite iru mono ga arimashou ka.
Anata wa douzo chikaku susunde itte, wareware no kami, Shu ga iwareru koto o mina kiki, wareware no kami, Shu ga anata ni otsuge ni naru koto o subete wareware ni tsugete kudasai. Wareware wa kiite okonaimasu'.
Anata gata ga watashi ni katatte iru toki, Shu wa anata gata no kotoba o kiite, watashi ni iwareta, 'Watashi wa kono tami ga omae ni katatte iru kotoba o kiita. Karera no itta koto wa mina yoi.
Tada negawashii koto wa, karera ga tsune ni kono you na kokoro o motte watashi o osore, watashi no subete no meirei o mamotte, karera mo sono shison mo eikyuu ni saiwai o eru ni itaru koto de aru.
Omae wa itte karera ni, "Anata gata wa onoono sono tenmaku ni kaere" to ie.
Shikashi, omae wa kono tokoro de watashi no soba ni tate. Watashi wa subete no meirei to, sadame to, okite to o omae ni tsuge shimesude arou. Omae wa kore o karera ni oshie, watashi ga karera ni ataete esaseru chi ni oite, kore o okonawasenakereba naranai'.
Sore yue, anata gata no kami, Shu ga meijirareta toori ni, tsutsushinde okonawanakereba naranai. Soshite hidari ni mo migi ni mo magatte wa naranai.
Anata gata no kami, Shu ga meijirareta michi ni ayumanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata gata wa ikiru koto ga deki, katsu saiwai o ete, anata gata no eru chi ni oite, nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekirude arou.
Kore wa anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata ni oshieyo to meijirareta meirei to, sadame to, okite de atte, anata gata wa watatte itte eru chi de, kore o okonawanakereba naranai.
Kore wa anata ga ko ya mago to tomo ni, anata no ikinagaraeru hi no aida, tsune ni anata no kami, Shu o osorete, watashi ga meijiru moromoro no sadame to, meirei to o mamoraseru tame, mata anata ga nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto no dekiru tame de aru.
Sore yue, Isuraeru yo, kiite, sore o mamori okonae. Sou sureba, anata wa saiwai o e, anata no senzo no kami, Shu ga anata ni iwareta you ni, chichi to mitsu no nagareru kuni de, anata no kazu wa ooini masude arou.
Isuraeru yo kike. Wareware no kami, Shu wa yuiitsu no Shu de aru.
Anata wa kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, chikara o tsukushite, anata no kami, Shu o aisanakereba naranai.
Kyou, watashi ga anata ni meijiru korera no kotoba o anata no kokoro ni tome,
Tsutomete kore o anata no kora ni oshie, anata ga ie ni zashite iru toki mo, michi o aruku toki mo, neru toki mo, okiru toki mo, kore ni tsuite kataranakereba naranai.
Mata anata wa kore o anata no te ni tsukete shirushi to shi, anata no me no aida ni oite oboe to shi,
Mata anata no ie no iriguchi no hashira to, anata no mon to ni kakishirusanakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu wa, anata no senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni mukatte, anata ni ataeru to chikawareta chi ni, anata o hairaserareru toki, anata ga tateta mono de nai ookina utsukushii machimachi o esase,
Anata ga mitashita mono de nai moromoro no yoi mono o mitashita ie o esase, anata ga hotta mono de nai hori ido o esase, anata ga ueta mono de nai budou hatake to oribu no hatake to o esaserarerude arou. Anata wa tabete akirude arou.
Sono toki, anata wa mizukara tsutsushimi, Ejiputo no chi, dorei no ie kara michibikidasareta Shu o wasurete wa naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu o osorete kore ni tsukae, sono na o sashite chikawanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa ta no kamigami sunawachi shuui no tami no kamigami ni shitagatte wa naranai.
Anata no uchi ni orareru anata no kami, Shu wa netamu kami de arukara, osoraku, anata ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, chi no omote kara anata o horoboshisararerude arou.
Anata gata ga Massa deshita you ni, anata gata no kami, Shu o kokoromite wa naranai.
Anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata ni meijirareta meirei to, akashi to, sadame to o, tsutomete mamoranakereba naranai.
Anata wa Shu ga mite tadashii to shi, yoi to sareru koto o okonawanakereba naranai. Sou sureba, anata wa saiwai o e, katsu Shu ga anata no senzo ni chikawareta, ano yoi chi ni haitte, jibun no mono to suru koto ga dekirude arou.
Mata Shu ga ooserareta you ni, anata no teki o mina anata no mae kara oiharawarerude arou.
Nochi no hi to natte, anata no ko ga anata ni toute iude arou, 'Wareware no kami, Shu ga anata gata ni meijirareta kono akashi to, sadame to, okite to wa, nan no tame desu ka'.
Sono toki anata wa sono ko ni iwanakereba naranai. 'Wareware wa Ejiputo de Paro no dorei de attaga, Shu wa tsuyoi te o motte, wareware o Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta.
Shu wa wareware no me no mae de, ookina osoroshii shirushi to fushigi to o Ejiputo to, Paro to sono zenka to ni shimesare,
Wareware o soko kara michibikidashi, katsute wareware no senzo ni chikawareta chi ni hairase, sore o wareware ni tamawatta.
Soshite Shu wa kono subete no sadame o okonae to, wareware ni meijirareta. Kore wa wareware no kami, Shu o osorete, wareware ga, tsune ni saiwai de ari, mata konnichi no you ni, Shu ga wareware o mamotte inochi o tamotaseru tame de aru.
Moshi wareware ga, meijirareta toori ni, kono subete no meirei o wareware no kami, Shu no mae ni mamotte okonaunaraba, sore wa wareware no gi to narude arou'.
Anata no kami, Shu ga, anata no itte toru chi ni anata o michibikiire, ooku no kuniguni no tami, Hete bi to, Girugashi bi to, Amori bi to, Kanan bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, oyobi Ebusu bi to, sunawachi anata yori mo kazuooku, mata chikara no aru nanatsu no tami o, anata no mae kara oiharawareru toki,
Sunawachi anata no kami, Shu ga karera o anata ni watashite, kore o utaserareru toki wa, anata wa karera o mattaku horobosanakereba naranai. Karera to nan no keiyaku o mo shite wa naranai. Karera ni nani no awaremi o mo shimeshite wa naranai.
Mata karera to kon'in o shite wa naranai. Anata no musume o kare no musuko ni ataete wa naranai. Kare no musume o anata no musuko ni metotte wa naranai.
Sore wa karera ga anata no musuko o madowashite watashi ni shitagawasezu, hoka no kamigami ni tsukaesase, sono tame Shu wa anata gata ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, sumiyaka ni anatagata o horobosareru koto to narukara de aru.
Mushiro, anata gata wa kono you ni karera ni okonawanakereba naranai. Sunawachi karera no saidan o ko bo chi, sono ishi no hashira o uchikudaki, sono Ashira zou o kiritaoshi, sono kizanda zou o hi de yakanakereba naranai.
Anata wa anata no kami, Shu no sei naru tami de aru. Anata no kami, Shu wa chi no omote no subete no tami no uchi kara anata o erande, jibun no takara no tami to sareta.
Shu ga anatagata o aishi, anatagata o erabareta no wa, anata gata ga dono kokumin yori mo kazu ga ookattakara de wa nai. Anata gata wa yorozu no tami no uchi, mottomo kazu no sukunai mono de atta.
Tada Shu ga anatagata o aishi, mata anata gata no senzo ni chikawareta chikai o mamorou to shite, Shu wa tsuyoi te o motte anatagata o michibikidashi, dorei no ie kara, Ejiputo no ou Paro no te kara, aganai dasareta no de aru.
Sore yue anata wa shiranakereba naranai. Anata no kami, Shu wa kami ni mashimashi, shinjitsu no kami ni mashimashite, kare o aishi, sono meirei o mamoru mono ni wa, keiyaku o mamori, megumi o hodokoshite sendai ni oyobi,
Mata kare o nikumu mono ni wa, meimei ni mukuite horobosareru koto o. Shu wa jibun o nikumu mono ni wa yuuyo suru koto naku, meimei ni mukuirareru.
Sore yue, kyou watashi ga anata ni meijiru meirei to, sadame to, okite to o mamotte, kore o okonawanakereba naranai.
Anata gata ga korera no okite o kiite mamori okonaunaraba, anata no kami, Shu wa anata no senzotachi ni chikawareta keiyaku o mamori, itsukushimi o hodokosarerude arou.
Anata o aishi, anata o shukufuku shi, anata no kazu o mashi, anata ni ataeruto senzotachi ni chikawareta chi de, anata no shijo o shukufuku shi, anata no chi no sanbutsu, kokumotsu, sake, abura, mata ushi no ko, hitsuji no ko o masarerude arou.
Anata wa banmin ni masatte shukufuku sarerude arou. Anata no uchi, otoko mo onna mo ko no nai mono wa naku, mata anata no kachiku ni mo ko no nai mono wa naide arou.
Shu wa mata subete no yamai o anata kara torisari, anata no shitte iru, ano Ejiputo no akueki ni kakarasezu, tada anata o nikumu subete no mono ni sore o nozomaserarerude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu ga anata ni watasareru kokumin o horoboshi tsukushi, karera o mite awarende wa naranai. Mata karera no kamigami ni tsukaete wa naranai. Sore ga anata no wana to narukara de aru.
Anata wa kokoro no uchi de 'Korera no kokumin wa watashi yori mo ooikara, dou shite kore o oiharau koto ga dekiyou ka' to iu no ka.
Karera o osorete wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu ga Paro to, subete no Ejiputo bito to ni sareta koto o, yoku oboe nasai.
Sunawachi, anata ga me de mita ooinaru kokoromi to, shirushi to, fushigi to, tsuyoi te to, nobashita ude to o oboe nasai. Anata no kami, Shu wa korera o motte, anata o michibikidasareta no de aru. Mata sono you ni, anata no kami, Shu wa anata ga osorete iru subete no tami ni sarerude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu wa mata, kumabachi o karera no uchi ni okutte, nao nokotte iru mono to nigekakurete iru mono o horoboshi tsukusarerude arou.
Anata wa karera o osorete wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu de aru ooinaru osorubeki kami ga anata no uchi ni orarerukara de aru.
Anata no kami, Shu wa korera no kokumin o jojo ni anata no mae kara oiharawarerude arou. Anata wa sumiyaka ni karera o horoboshi tsukushite wa naranai. Sou de nakereba, no no kemono ga mashite anata o gaisurude arou.
Shikashi, anata no kami, Shu wa karera o anata ni watashi, ooinaru konran ni otoshiirete, tsuini horobosarerude arou.
Mata karera no outachi o anata no te ni watasarerude arou. Anata wa karera no na o ten no shita kara keshisarude arou. Anata ni tachimukau mono wa naku, anata wa tsuini karera o horobosu ni itarude arou.
Anata wa karera no kamigami no chouzou o hi ni yakanakereba naranai. Sore ni kiseta gin mata wa kin o musabotte wa naranai. Kore o totte jibun no mono ni shite wa naranai. Sou de nakereba, anata wa kore ni yotte, wana ni kakarude arou. Kore wa anata no kami ga imikirawareru mono dakara de aru.
Anata wa imubeki mono o ie ni mochikonde, sore to onaji you ni anata jishin mo, norowareta mono to natte wa naranai. Anata wa sore o mattaku imikirawanakereba naranai. Sore wa norowareta mono dakara de aru.
Watashi ga, kyou, meijiru kono subete no meirei o, anata gata wa mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata gata wa ikiru koto ga deki, katsu fue mashi, Shu ga anata gata no senzo ni chikawareta chi ni haitte, sore o jibun no mono to suru koto ga dekirude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu ga kono yonjuu nen no aida, arano de anata o michibikareta sono subete no michi o oboenakereba naranai. Sore wa anata o kurushimete, anata o kokoromi, anata no kokoro no uchi o shiri, anata ga sono meirei o mamoru ka, dou ka o shiru tame de atta.
Sore de Shu wa anata o kurushime, anata o uesase, anata mo shirazu, anata no senzotachi mo shiranakatta mana o motte, anata o yashinawareta. Hito wa pan dake de wa ikizu, hito wa Shu no kuchi kara deru subete no kotoba ni yotte ikiru koto o anata ni shiraseru tame de atta.
Kono yonjuu nen no aida, anata no kimono wa surikirezu, anata no ashi wa, harenakatta.
Anata wa mata hito ga sono ko o kunren suru you ni, anata no kami, Shu mo anata o kunren sareru koto o kokoro ni tomenakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu no meirei o mamori, sono michi ni ayunde, kare o osorenakereba naranai.
Sore wa anata no kami, Shu ga anata o yoi chi ni michibikiirerarerukara de aru. Soko wa tani ni mo yama ni mo wakideru mizu no nagare, izumi, oyobi fuchi no aru chi,
Komugi, oomugi, budou, ichijiku oyobi zakuro no aru chi, abura no oribu no ki, oyobi mitsu no aru chi,
Anata ga taberu shokumotsu ni kakeru koto naku, nan no toboshii koto mo nai chi de aru. Sono chi no ishi wa tetsu de atte, sono yama kara wa dou o horitoru koto ga dekiru.
Anata wa tabete aki, anata no kami, Shu ga sono yoi chi o tamawatta koto o kansha surude arou.
Anata wa, kyou, watashi ga meijiru Shu no meirei to, okite to, sadame to o mamorazu, anata no kami, Shu o wasureru koto no nai you ni tsutsushimanakereba naranai.
Anata wa tabete aki, uruwashii ie o tatete sumi,
Mata ushi ya hitsuji ga fue, kingin ga mashi, mochimono ga mina mashi kuwawaru toki,
Osoraku kokoro ni takaburi, anata no kami, Shu o wasurerude arou. Shu wa anata o Ejiputo no chi, dorei no ie kara michibikidashi,
Anata o michibiite, ano ookina osoroshii arano, sunawachi hi no hebi ya, sasori ga ite, mizu no nai, kawaita chi o toori, anata no tame ni katai iwa kara mizu o dashi,
Senzotachi mo shiranakatta mana o arano de anata ni tabesaserareta. Sore wa anata o kurushime, anata o kokoromite, tsuini wa anata o saiwai ni suru tame de atta.
Anata wa kokoro no uchi ni 'Jibun no chikara to jibun no te no hataraki de, watashi wa kono tomi o eta' to itte wa naranai.
Anata wa anata no kami, Shu o oboenakereba naranai. Shu wa anata no senzotachi ni chikawareta keiyaku o konnichi no you ni okonau tame ni, anata ni tomi o eru chikara o ataerarerukara de aru.
Moshi anata no kami, Shu o wasurete ta no kamigami ni shitagai, kore ni tsukae, kore o ogamunaraba, - - watashi wa, kyou, anata gata ni keikoku suru. - - anata gata wa kitto horobirude arou.
Shu ga anata gata no mae kara horoboshisarareru kuniguni no tami no you ni, anata gata mo horobirude arou. Anata gata no kami, Shu no koe ni shitagawanaikara de aru.
Isuraeru yo, kiki nasai. Anata wa, kyou, Yorudan o watatte itte, anata yori mo ookiku, katsu tsuyoi kuniguni o torou to shite iru. Sono machimachi wa ookiku, ishigaki wa ten ni tasshite iru.
Sono tami wa, anata no shitte iru Anaku bi to no shison de atte, ookiku, mata se ga takai. Anata wa mata 'Anaku no shison no mae ni, dare ga tatsu koto ga dekiyou ka' to hito no iu no o kiita.
Sore yue, anata wa, kyou, anata no kami, Shu wa yaki tsukusu hi de atte, anata no mae ni susumareru koto o shiranakereba naranai. Shu wa karera o horoboshi, karera o anata no mae ni kuppuku saserarerude arou. Shu ga anata ni iwareta you ni, karera o oiharai, sumiyaka ni horobosanakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu ga anata no mae kara karera o oiharawareta nochi ni, anata wa kokoro no naka de 'Watashi ga tadashiikara Shu wa watashi o kono chi ni michibikiirete kore o esaserareta' to itte wa naranai. Kono kuniguni no tami ga waruikara, Shu wa kore o anata no mae kara oiharawareru no de aru.
Anata ga itte sono chi o eru no wa, anata ga tadashiikara de wa naku, mata anata no kokoro ga massugu dakara de mo nai. Kono kuniguni no tami ga waruikara, anata no kami, Shu wa karera o anata no mae kara oiharawareru no de aru. Kore wa Shu ga anata no senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikawareta kotoba o okonawareru tame de aru.
Sore de anata wa, anata no kami, Shu ga anata ni kono yoi chi o ataete kore o esaserareru no wa, anata ga tadashiikara de wa nai koto o shiranakereba naranai. Anata wa goujou na tami de aru.
Anata wa arano de anata no kami, Shu o ikaraseta koto o oboe, sore o wasurete wa naranai. Anata gata wa Ejiputo no chi o deta hi kara kono tokoro ni kuru made, itsu mo Shu ni somuita.
Mata Horebu ni oite sae, anata gata ga Shu o ikaraseta no de, Shu wa ikatte anatagata o horobosou to sareta.
Watashi ga ishi no ita sunawachi Shu ga anata gata to musubareta keiyaku no ita o ukeru tame ni yama ni nobotta toki, watashi wa yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, yama ni ite, pan mo tabezu mizu mo nomanakatta.
Shu wa kami no yubi o motte kakishirushita ishi no ita nimai o watashi ni sazukerareta. Sono ue ni wa, shuukai no hi ni Shu ga yama de hi no naka kara, anata gata ni tsugerareta kotoba ga, kotogotoku kaite atta.
Sunawachi yonjuu nichi yonjuuya ga owatta toki, Shu wa watashi ni sono keiyaku no ita de aru ishi no ita nimai o sazuke,
Soshite Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Omae wa tatte, sumiyaka ni kono tokoro kara furi nasai. Omae ga Ejiputo kara michibikidashita tami wa aku o okonattakara de aru. Karera wa watashi ga meijita michi o hayaku mo hanarete, ita zou o jibuntachi no tame ni tsukutta'.
Shu wa mata watashi ni iwareta, 'Kono tami o miru no ni, kore wa goujou na tami de aru.
Watashi o tomeru na. Watashi wa karera o horoboshi, karera no na o ten no shita kara keshisari, omae o karera yori mo tsuyoku, katsu ooinaru kokumin to shiyou'.
Soko de watashi wa mi o megurashite yama o oritaga, yama wa hi de yakete ita. Keiyaku no ita nimai wa watashi no ryoute ni atta.
Soshite watashi ga miruto, anata gata wa, anata gata no kami, Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, jibuntachi no tame ni imono no koushi o tsukutte, Shu ga meijirareta michi o hayaku mo hanareta no de,
Watashi wa sono nimai no ita o tsukande, ryoute kara nagedashi, anata gata no me no mae de kore o kudaita.
Soshite watashi wa mae no you ni yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, Shu no mae ni hirefushi, pan mo tabezu, mizu mo nomanakatta. Kore wa anata gata ga Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, tsumi o okashite Shu o ikaraseta subete no tsumi ni yoru no de aru.
Shu wa ikari o hasshi, ikidoori o okoshi, anatagata o ikatte horobosou to sareta no de, watashi wa osoretaga, sono toki mo mata Shu wa watashi no negai o kikareta.
Shu wa mata, hanahadashiku Aron o ikatte, kare o horobosou to saretaga, watashi wa sono toki mo mata Aron no tame ni inotta.
Watashi wa anata gata ga tsukutte tsumi o eta koushi o tori, sore o hi de yaki, sore o uchikudaki, yoku hiite komakai chiri to shi, sono chiri o yama kara nagarekudaru tanigawa ni nagesuteta.
Anata gata wa Tabera, Massa oyobi kiburote hattawa ni oite mo mata Shu o ikaraseta.
Mata Shu wa kadeshi barunea kara, anatagata o tsukawasou to sareta toki, 'Nobotte itte, watashi ga ataeru chi o senryou seyo' to iwareta. Tokoro ga, anata gata wa anata gata no kami, Shu no meirei ni somuki, kare o shinzezu, mata kare no koe ni kikishitagawanakatta.
Watashi ga anatagata o shitta sono hi kara konokata, anata gata wa itsu mo Shu ni somuita.
Soshite watashi wa, saki ni hirefushita you ni, yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, Shu no mae ni hirefushita. Shu ga anatagata o horobosu to iwaretakara de aru.
Watashi wa Shu ni inotte itta, 'Shu naru kami yo, anata ga ooinaru chikara o motte aganai, tsuyoi te o motte Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta anata no tami, anata no shigyou o horobosanaide kudasai.
Anata no shimobe Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu o oboete kudasai. Kono tami no goujou to aku to tsumi to ni me o tomenaide kudasai.
Anata ga wareware o michibikidasareta kuni no hito wa osoraku, "Shu wa, yakusoku shita chi ni karera o michibikiireru koto ga dekizu, mata karera o nikunda no de, karera o michibikidashite arano de koroshita no da" to iudeshou.
Shikashi karera wa, anata no tami, anata no shigyou de atte, anata ga ooinaru chikara to nobashita ude to o motte michibikidasareta no desu'.
Sono toki, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Omae wa, mae no you na ishi no ita nimai o kitte tsukuri, yama ni nobotte, watashi no moto ni ki nasai. Mata ki no hako hitotsu o tsukuri nasai.
Saki ni omae ga kudaita nimai no ita ni kaite atta kotoba o, watashi wa sono ita ni kakishirusou. Omae wa sore o sono hako ni osamenakereba naranai'.
Soko de watashi wa akashiyazai no hako hitotsu o tsukuri, mata mae no you na ishi no ita nimai o kitte tsukuri, sono nimai no ita o te ni motte yama ni nobotta.
Shu wa katsute, kano shuukai no hi ni yama de hi no naka kara anata gata ni tsugerareta jikkai o kakishirusareta you ni, sono ita ni kakishirushi, sore o Shu wa watashi ni sazukerareta.
Sore de watashi wa mi o megurashite yama kara ori, sono ita o, watashi ga tsukutta hako ni osameta. Ima nao sono naka ni aru. Shu ga watashi ni meijirareta toori de aru.
(kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa beerote bene yakan o shuttatsu shite Mosera ni tsuita. Aron wa sono tokoro de shinde soko ni houmurare, sono ko Ereazaru ga kare ni kawatte saishi to natta.
Mata soko o shuttatsu shite Gudegoda ni itari, Gudegoda o shuttatsu shite Yotebata ni tsuita. Kono chi ni wa ooku no mizu no nagare ga atta.
Sono toki, Shu wa Rebi no buzoku o erande, Shu no keiyaku no hako o katsugi, Shu no mae ni tatte tsukae, mata Shu no na o motte shukufuku suru koto o saserareta. Kono koto wa konnichi ni oyonde iru.
Sono tame Rebi wa kyoudaitachi to issho ni wa wakemae ga naku, shigyou mo nai. Anata no kami, Shu ga kare ni iwareta toori, Shu mizukara ga kare no shigyou de atta.)
Watashi wa mae no toki no you ni yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, yama ni ottaga, Shu wa sono toki ni mo watashi no negai o kikareta. Shu wa anata o horobosu koto o nozomarenakatta.
Soshite Shu wa watashi ni 'Omae wa tachiagari, tami ni sakidatte susumi iki, watashi ga karera ni ataeruto, sono senzo ni chikatta chi ni karera o hairase, sore o torase yo' to iwareta.
Isuraeru yo, ima, anata no kami, Shu ga anata ni motomerareru koto wa nan de aru ka. Tada kore dake de aru. Sunawachi anata no kami, Shu o osore, sono subete no michi ni ayunde, kare o aishi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata no kami, Shu ni tsukae,
Mata, watashi ga kyou anata ni meijiru Shu no meirei to sadame to o mamotte, saiwai o eru koto de aru.
Miyo, ten to, moromoro no ten no ten, oyobi chi to, chi ni aru mono to wa mina, anata no kami, Shu no mono de aru.
Sou de aru no ni, Shu wa tada anata no senzotachi o yorokobi aishi, sono nochi no shison de aru anatagata o banmin no uchi kara erabareta. Konnichi miru toori de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa kokoro ni katsurei o okonai, mohaya goujou de atte wa naranai.
Anata gata no kami de aru Shu wa, kami no kami, Shu no Shu, ooini shite chikara aru osorubeki kami ni mashimashi, hito o katayori mizu, mata, mainai o torazu,
Minashiko to yamome no tame ni tadashii sabaki o okonai, mata kiryuu no takokujin o aishite, shokumotsu to kimono o ataerarerukara de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa kiryuu no takokujin o aishi nasai. Anata gata mo Ejiputo no kuni de kiryuu no takokujin de atta.
Anata no kami, Shu o osore, kare ni tsukae, kare ni shitagai, sono na o sashite chikawanakereba naranai.
Kare wa anata nosan bi subeki mono, mata anata no kami de atte, anata ga me ni mita korera no ooinaru osorubeki koto o, anata no tame ni okonawareta.
Anata no senzotachi wa, wazuka nanajuunin de Ejiputo ni kudattaga, ima, anata no kami, Shu wa anata o ten no hoshi no you ni ooku sareta.
Sore yue, anata no kami, Shu o aishi, tsune ni sono satoshi to, sadame to, okite to, imashime to o mamoranakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, kyou, tsugi no koto o shiranakereba naranai. Watashi ga kataru no wa, anata gata no kodomotachi ni taishite de wa nai. Karera wa anata gata no kami, Shu no kunren to, Shu no ooinaru koto to, sono tsuyoi te to, nobeta ude to o shirazu, mata minakatta.
Mata karera wa Shu ga Ejiputo de, Ejiputo ou Paro to sono zenkoku ni taishite okonawareta shirushi to, waza,
Mata Shu ga Ejiputo no gunzei to sono uma to sensha to ni okonawareta koto, sunawachi karera ga anata gata no ato o otte kita toki ni, koukai no mizu o karera no ue ni afuresase, karera o horobosarete, konnichi ni itatta koto,
Mata anata gata ga kono tokoro ni kuru made, Shu ga arano de, anata gata ni okonawareta koto,
Oyobi Ruben no ko no Eriabu no ko, Datan to Abiramu to ni sareta koto, sunawachi Isuraeru no subete no hitobito no naka de, chi ga kuchi o hiraki, karera to, sono kazoku to, tenmaku to, karera ni shitagau subete no mono o, nomi tsukushita koto nado o karera wa shirazu, mata minakatta.
Shikashi, anata gata wa Shu ga okonawareta korera no ooinaru koto o, kotogotoku me ni mita no de aru.
Yue ni, watashi ga, kyou, anata gata ni meijiru imashime o, kotogotoku mamoranakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata gata wa tsuyoku nari, watatte itte torou to suru chi ni haitte, sore o toru koto ga deki,
Katsu, Shu ga senzotachi ni chikatte karera to sono shison to ni ataeyou to iwareta chi, chichi to mitsu no nagareru kuni ni oite, nagaku ikiru koto ga dekirude arou.
Anata gata ga itte torou to suru chi wa, anata gata ga dete kita Ejiputo no chi no you de wa nai. Asoko de wa, aomono batake de suru you ni, anata gata wa tane o maki, ashi de sore ni mizu o sosoida.
Shikashi, anata gata ga watatte itte toru chi wa, yama to tani no ooi chi de, ten kara furu ame de uruotte iru.
Sono chi wa, anata no kami, Shu ga kaerimirareru tokoro de, toshi no hajime kara toshi no owari made, anata no kami, Shu no me ga tsune ni sono ue ni aru.
Moshi, kyou, anata gata ni meijiru watashi no meirei ni yoku kikishitagatte, anata gata no kami, Shu o aishi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite tsukaerunaraba,
Shu wa anata gata no chi ni ame o, aki no ame, haru no ame tomo ni, toki ni shitagatte furase, kokumotsu to, budoushu to, abura o toriiresase,
Mata kachiku no tame ni no ni kusa o haesaserarerude arou. Anata wa akiru hodo taberu koto ga dekirude arou.
Anata gata wa kokoro ga mayoi, hanaresatte, ta no kamigami ni tsukae, sore o ogamu koto no nai you, tsutsushimanakereba naranai.
Osoraku Shu wa anata gata ni mukai ikari o hasshite, ten o tozasarerude arou. Sono tame ame wa furazu, chi wa sanbutsu o dasazu, anata gata wa Shu ga tamawaru yoi chi kara, sumiyaka ni horobi userude arou.
Sore yue, korera no watashi no kotoba o kokoro to tamashii ni osame, mata sore o te ni tsukete, shirushi to shi, me no aida ni oite oboe to shi,
Kore o kodomotachi ni oshie, ie ni zashite iru toki mo, michi o aruku toki mo, neru toki mo, okiru toki mo, sore ni tsuite katari,
Mata ie no iriguchi no hashira to, mon ni sore o kakishirusanakereba naranai.
Sou sureba, Shu ga senzotachi ni ataeyou to chikawareta chi ni, anata gata no sumu nissuu oyobi anata gata no kodomotachi no sumu nissuu wa, ten ga chi o oou nissuu no you ni ooide arou.
Moshi watashi ga anata gata ni meijiru kono subete no meirei o yoku mamotte okonai, anata gata no kami, Shu o aishi, sono subete no michi ni ayumi, Shu ni tsukishitagaunaraba,
Shu wa kono kuniguni no tami o mina, anata gata no mae kara oiharaware, anata gata wa anata ga tayori mo ookiku, katsu tsuyoi kuniguni o toru ni itarude arou.
Anata gata ga ashi no ura de fumu tokoro wa mina, anata gata no mono to nari, anata gata no ryouiki wa arano kara Rebanon ni oyobi, mata ookawa Yufurate kara nishi no umi ni oyobude arou.
Dare mo anata gata ni tachimukau koto no dekiru mono wa naide arou. Anata gata no kami, Shu wa, katsute iwareta you ni, anata gata no fumiiru chi no hitobito ga, anatagata o osoreononoku you ni sarerude arou.
Miyo, watashi wa, kyou, anata gata no mae ni shukufuku to, noroi to o oku.
Moshi, kyou, watashi ga anata gata ni meijiru anata gata no kami, Shu no meirei ni kikishitagaunaraba, shukufuku o ukerude arou.
