Anata no kami, Shu ga subete no buzoku no uchi kara kare o erabidashite, kare to sono shison o nagaku Shu no na ni yotte tatte tsukaesaserarerukara de aru.
Rebi bi to wa Isuraeru no zenchi no uchi, doko ni iru mono de mo, kare ga yadotte iru machi o dete, Shu ga erabareru basho ni ikunaraba,
Kare wa Shu no mae ni tatte iru subete no kyoudai Rebi bito to onaji you ni, sono kami, Shu no na ni yotte tsukaeru koto ga dekiru.
Kare ga taberu bun wa karera to onaji de aru. Tadashi kare wa kono hoka ni chichi no isan o utte eta mono o motsu koto ga dekiru.
Anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi ni haittanaraba, sono kuniguni no tami no nikumubeki koto o narai okonatte wa naranai.
Anata gata no uchi ni, jibun no musuko, musume o hi ni yaite sasageru mono ga atte wa naranai. Mata uranai o suru mono, bokusha, ekisha, mahoutsukai,
Jumon o tonaeru mono, kuchiyose, kannagi, shinin ni tou koto o suru mono ga atte wa naranai.
Shu wa subete korera no koto o suru mono o nikumarerukara de aru. Soshite korera no nikumubeki koto no yue ni anata no kami, Shu wa karera o anata no mae kara oiharawareru no de aru.
Anata no kami, Shu no mae ni anata wa mattakimono de nakereba naranai.
Anata ga oiharau ka no kuniguni no tami wa bokusha, uranai o suru mono ni kikishitagaukara de aru. Shikashi, anata ni wa, anata no kami, Shu wa sou suru koto o yurusarenai.
Anata no kami, Shu wa anata no uchi kara, anata no douhou no uchi kara, watashi no you na hitori no yogensha o anata no tame ni okosarerude arou. Anata gata wa kare ni kikishitagawanakereba naranai.
Kore wa anata ga shuukai no hi ni Horebu de anata no kami, Shu ni motometa koto de aru. Sunawachi anata wa 'Watashi ga shinu koto no nai you ni watashi no kami, Shu no koe o ni do to watashi ni kikasenaide kudasai. Mata kono ooinaru hi o ni do to misasenaide kudasai' to itta.
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Karera ga itta koto wa tadashii.
Watashi wa karera no douhou no uchi kara, omae no you na hitori no yogensha o karera no tame ni okoshite, watashi no kotoba o sono kuchi ni sazukeyou. Kare wa watashi ga meijiru koto o, kotogotoku karera ni tsugerude arou.
Kare ga watashi no na ni yotte, watashi no kotoba o kataru no ni, moshi kore ni kikishitagawanai mono ga arunaraba, watashi wa sore o bassurude arou.
Tadashi yogensha ga, watashi ga katare to meijinai koto o, watashi no na ni yotte hoshii mama ni katari, aruiha ta no kamigami no na ni yotte katarunaraba, sono yogensha wa korosanakereba naranai'.
Anata wa kokoro no uchi ni 'Wareware wa, sono kotoba ga Shu no iwareta mono de naito, dou shite shiri eyou ka' to iude arou.
Moshi yogensha ga atte, Shu no na ni yotte katatte mo, sono kotoba ga jouju sezu, mata sono koto ga okoranai toki wa, sore wa Shu ga katarareta kotoba de wa naku, sono yogensha ga hoshiimama ni katatta no de aru. Sono yogensha o osoreru ni oyobanai.
Anata no kami, Shu ga kuniguni no tami o horoboshi tsukushite, anata no kami, Shu ga sono chi o tamawari, anata ga sore o ete, sono machimachi to, sono ieie ni sumu you ni naru toki wa,
Anata no kami, Shu ga ataete esaserareru chi no uchi ni, mittsu no machi o anata no tame ni shitei shinakereba naranai.
Soshite soko ni iku michi o sonae, mata anata no kami, Shu ga anata ni tsugaserareru chi no ryouiki o san ku ni wake, subete hito o koroshita mono o soko ni nogaresasenakereba naranai.
Hito o koroshita mono ga soko ni nogarete, inochi o mattou subeki baai wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi izen kara nikumu koto mo nai no ni, shiranaide sono rinjin o koroshita baai,
Tatoeba hito ga ki o kirou to shite, rinjin to issho ni hayashi ni iri, te ni ono o totte, ki o kiritaosou to uchi orosu toki, sono atama ga e kara nuke, rinjin ni atatte, shinaseta you na baai ga sore de aru. Sou iu hito wa korera no machi no hitotsu ni nogarete, inochi o mattou suru koto ga dekiru.
Sou shinakereba, fukushuu suru mono ga ikatte, sono koroshita mono o oikake, michi ga nagai tame ni, tsuini oitsuite korosude arou. Shikashi, sono hito wa izen kara kare o nikunde ita mono de naikara, korosareru riyuu wa nai.
Sore de watashi wa anata ni meijite 'Mittsu no machi o anata no tame ni shitei shinakereba naranai' to itta no de aru.
Anata no kami, Shu ga senzotachi ni chikawareta you ni, anata no ryouiki o hirome, senzotachi ni ataeru to iwareta chi o, kotogotoku tamawaru toki, - -
Watashi ga, kyou, meijiru kono subete no imashime o mamotte, sore o okonai, anata no kami, Shu o aishite, tsune ni sono michi ni ayumu toki - - anata wa korera mittsu no machi no hoka ni, mata mittsu no machi o anata no tame ni mashikuwaenakereba naranai.
Kore wa anata no kami, Shu ga ataete shigyou to sareru chi no uchi de, tsumi no nai mono no chi ga nagasarenai you ni suru tame de aru. Sou shinakereba, sono chi o nagashita to ga wa, anata ni kisurude arou.
Shikashi, moshi hito ga rinjin o nikunde sore o tsukenerai, tachi kakatte sono hito o uchikoroshi, soshite korera no machi no hitotsu ni nogarerunaraba,
Sono machi no chouroutachi wa hito o tsukawashite kare o soko kara hiite kosase, fukushuu suru mono ni watashite korosasenakereba naranai.
Kare o awarende wa naranai. Tsumi no nai mono no chi o nagashita toga o, Isuraeru kara nozokanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata ni saiwai ga arude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu ga ataete esaserareru chi de, anata ga tsugu shigyou ni oite, senzo no sadameta anata no rinjin no tochi no sakai o utsushite wa naranai.
Donna fusei de are, donna toga de are, subete hito no okasu tsumi wa, tada hitori no shounin ni yotte sadamete wa naranai. Futari no shounin no shougen ni yori, mata wa sannin no shounin no shougen ni yotte, sono koto o sadamenakereba naranai.
Moshi akui no aru shounin ga tatte, hito ni taishite warui shougen o suru koto ga areba,
Sono aiarasou futari no mono wa Shu no mae ni itte, sono toki no saishi to saibannin no mae ni tatanakereba naranai.
Sono toki, saibannin wa shousai ni sore o shirabenakereba naranai. Soshite sono shounin ga moshi itsuwari no shounin de atte, kyoudai ni mukatte itsuwari no shougen o shita mono de arunaraba,
Anata gata wa kare ga kyoudai ni shiyou to shita koto o kare ni okonai, kou shite anata gata no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Sou sureba ta no hitotachi wa kiite osore, sono nochi futatabi sono you na aku o anata gata no uchi ni okonawanaide arou.
Awarende wa naranai. Inochi ni wa inochi, me ni wa me, ha ni wa ha, te ni wa te, ashi ni wa ashi o motte tsugunawasenakereba naranai.
Anata ga teki to tatakau tame ni deru toki, uma to sensha to, anata yori mo daizei no guntai o mite mo, karera o osorete wa naranai. Anata o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki noborareta anata no kami, Shu ga tomo ni orarerukara de aru.
Anata gata ga tatakai ni nozomu toki, saishi wa susumidete tami ni tsugete,
Karera ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Isuraeru yo kike. Anata gata wa, kyou, teki to tatakaou to shite iru. Kiokure shite wa naranai. Osorete wa naranai. Awatete wa naranai. Karera ni odoroite wa naranai.
Anata gata no kami, Shu ga tomo ni ikare, anata gata no tame ni teki to tatakatte, anatagata o sukuwarerukara de aru'.
Tsugi ni tsukasatachi wa tami ni tsugete iwanakereba naranai. 'Atarashii ie o tatete, mada sore o sasagete inai mono ga areba, sono hito o ie ni kaerasenakereba naranai. Sou shinakereba, kare ga tatakai ni shinda toki, hoka no hito ga sore o sasageru you ni narude arou.
Budou hatake o tsukutte, mada sono mi o tabete inai mono ga areba, sono hito o ie ni kaerasenakereba naranai. Sou shinakereba kare ga tatakai ni shinda toki, hoka no hito ga sore o taberu you ni narude arou.
Onna to kon'yaku shite, mada sono onna o metotte inai mono ga areba, sono hito o ie ni kaerasenakereba naranai. Sou shinakereba kare ga tatakai ni shinda toki, hoka no hito ga kanojo o metoru you ni narude arou'.
Tsukasatachi wa, mata tami ni tsugete iwanakereba naranai. 'Osorete kiokure suru mono ga arunaraba, sono hito o ie ni kaerasenakereba naranai. Sou shinakereba, kyoudaitachi no kokoro ga kare no kokoro no you ni kujikerude arou'.
Tsukasatachi ga kono you ni tami ni tsuge owattanaraba, gunzei no kashiratachi o tatete tami o hikiisasenakereba naranai.
Hitotsu no machi e susunde itte, sore o semeyou to suru toki wa, mazu odayaka ni koufuku suru koto o susumenakereba naranai.
Moshi sono machi ga odayaka ni koufuku shiyou to kotaete, mon o hirakunaraba, soko ni iru subete no tami ni, mitsugi o osamesase, anata ni tsukaesasenakereba naranai.
Moshi odayaka ni koufuku sezu, tatakaou to surunaraba, anata wa sore o semenakereba naranai.
Soshite anata no kami, Shu ga sore o anata no te ni watasareru toki, tsurugi o motte sono uchi no otoko o mina uchikorosanakereba naranai.
Tadashi onna, kodomo, kachiku oyobi subete machi no uchi ni aru mono, sunawachi bundori mono wa mina, senrihin to shite toru koto ga dekiru. Mata teki kara bundotta mono wa anata no kami, Shu ga tamawatta mono dakara, anata wa sore o mochiiru koto ga dekiru.
Tooku hanarete iru machimachi, sunawachi korera no kuniguni ni zokusanai machimachi ni wa, subete kono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Tadashi, anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite ataerareru korera no tami no machimachi de wa, iki no aru mono o hitori mo ikashite oite wa naranai.
Sunawachi Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Kanan bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito wa mina horoboshite, anata no kami, Shu ga meijirareta toori ni shinakereba naranai.
Kore wa karera ga sono kamigami o ogande okonatta subete no nikumubeki koto o, anata gata ni oshiete, sore o okonawase, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsumi o okasaseru koto no nai tame de aru.
Nagaku machi o semekakonde, sore o torou to suru toki de mo, ono o furutte, soko no ki o kiri karashite wa naranai. Sore wa anata no shoku to naru mono dakara, kiritaoshite wa naranai. Anata wa den'ya no ki made mo, hito no you ni semenakereba naranaide arou ka.
Tadashi mi o musubanai ki to wakatte iru ki wa kiritaoshite, anata to tatakatte iru machi ni mukai, sore o motte toride o kizuki, kanraku suru made, sore o semeru koto ga dekiru.
Anata no kami, Shu ga ataete esaserareru chi de, korosarete no ni taorete iru hito ga atte, dare ga koroshita no ka wakaranai toki wa,
Chouroutachi to, sabaki bitotachi ga dete kite, sono korosareta mono no aru tokoro kara, shuui no machimachi made no kyori o hakaranakereba naranai.
Soshite sono korosareta mono no aru tokoro ni mottomo chikai machi no chouroutachi wa, mada tsukawanai, mada kubiki o owasete hiita koto no nai wakai meushi o tori,
Sono machi no chouroutachi wa sono meushi o, tagayasu koto mo, tane maku koto mo shinai, taezu mizu no nagarete iru tani e hiite itte, sono tani de meushi no kubi o oranakereba naranai.
Sono toki Rebi no shison de aru saishitachi wa, soko ni susumidenakereba naranai. Karera wa anata no kami, Shu ga jibun ni tsukaesase, mata Shu no na ni yotte shukufuku saseru tame ni erabareta mono de, subete no ronsou to, subete no boukou wa karera no kotoba ni yotte kaiketsu sarerukara de aru.
Soshite sono korosareta mono no aru tokoro ni mottomo chikai machi no chouroutachi wa mina, karera ga tani de kubi o otta meushi no ue de te o arai,
Shougen shite iwanakereba naranai, 'Wareware no te wa kono chi o nagasazu, wareware no me mo sore o minakatta.
Shu yo, anata ga aganawareta tami Isuraeru o oyurushi kudasai. Tsumi no nai mono no chi o nagashita toga o, anata no tami Isuraeru no uchi ni todomenaide kudasai. Soshite chi o nagashita toga o oyurushi kudasai'.
Kono you ni shite, anata wa Shu ga tadashii to mirareru koto o okonai, tsumi no nai mono no chi o nagashita toga o, anata gata no uchi kara nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Anata ga dete teki to tatakau sai, anata no kami, Shu ga sore o anata no te ni watasare, anata ga sore o horyo to shita toki,
Moshi horyo no uchi ni utsukushii onna no aru no o mite, sore o konomi, tsuma ni metorou to surunaraba,
Sono onna o anata no ie ni tsurete kaeranakereba naranai. Onna wa kami o sori, tsume o kiri,
Mata horyo no kimono o nugisutete, anata no ie ni ori, jibun no fubo no tame ni ichi kagetsu no aida nagekanakereba naranai. Soshite nochi, anata wa kanojo no tokoro ni haitte, sono otto to nari, kanojo o tsuma to suru koto ga dekiru.
Sono nochi anata ga moshi kanojo o konomanaku nattanaraba, kanojo o jiyuu ni sarasenakereba naranai. Kesshite kane de utte wa naranai. Anata wa sudeni kanojo o hazukashimeta no dakara, kanojo o dorei no you ni ashiratte wa naranai.
Hito ga futari no tsuma o mochi, sono hitori wa aisuru mono, hitori wa ki ni iranai mono de atte, sono aisuru mono to ki ni iranai mono no futari ga, tomo ni otokonoko o umi, moshi sono choushi ga, ki ni iranai onna no unda mono de aru toki wa,
Sono kotachi ni jibun no zaisan o tsugaseru toki, ki ni iranai onna no unda choushi o sashioite, aisuru onna no unda ko o choushi to suru koto wa dekinai.
Kanarazu sono ki ni iranai mono no unda ko ga choushi de aru koto o mitome, jibun no zaisan o wakeru toki ni wa, kore ni ni bai no wakemae o ataenakereba naranai. Kore wa jibun no chikara no hajime de atte, choushi no tokken o motte irukara de aru.
Moshi, wagamama de, te ni oenai ko ga atte, chichi no kotoba ni mo, haha no kotoba ni mo shitagawazu, fubo ga kore o korashite mo kikanai toki wa,
Sono fubo wa kore o toraete, sono machi no mon ni iki, machi no chouroutachi no mae ni dashi,
Machi no chouroutachi ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Watashitachi no kono ko wa wagamama de, te ni oemasen. Watashitachi no kotoba ni shitagawazu, mimochi ga waruku, daisakenomi desu'.
Sono toki, machi no hito wa mina, kare o ishi de uchikoroshi, anata gata no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai. Sou sureba, Isuraeru wa mina kiite osorerude arou.
Moshi hito ga shi ni ataru tsumi o okashite korosare, anata ga sore o ki no ue ni kakeru toki wa,
Yokuasa made sono shitai o ki no ue ni tomete oite wa naranai. Kanarazu sore o sono hi no uchi ni umenakereba naranai. Ki ni kakerareta mono wa kami ni norowareta mono dakara de aru. Anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite tamawaru chi o kegashite wa naranai.
Anata no kyoudai no ushi, mata wa hitsuji no mayotte iru no o mite, sore o misutete oite wa naranai. Kanarazu sore o kyoudai no tokoro e tsurete kaeranakereba naranai.
Moshi sono kyoudai ga chikaku no mono de naku, shiranai hito de arunaraba, sore o jibun no ie ni hiite kite, anata no tokoro ni oki, sono kyoudai ga tazunete kita toki ni, sore o kare ni kaesanakereba naranai.
Anata no kyoudai no roba no baai mo, sou shinakereba naranai. Kimono no baai mo, sou shinakereba naranai. Mata subete anata no kyoudai no ushinatta mono o mitsuketa baai mo, sou shinakereba naranai. Sore o misutete oku koto wa dekinai.
Anata no kyoudai no roba mata wa ushi ga michi ni taorete iru no o mite, misutete oite wa naranai. Kanarazu sore o tasukeokosanakereba naranai.
Onna wa otoko no kimono o kite wa naranai. Mata otoko wa onna no kimono o kite wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu wa sono you na koto o suru mono o imikirawarerukara de aru.
Moshi anata ga michi de, ki no ue, mata wa jimen ni tori no su no aru no o mitsuke, sono naka ni hiyoko mata wa tamago ga atte, hahatori ga sono hiyoko mata wa tamago o daite irunaraba, hahatori o hiyoko to issho ni totte wa naranai.
Kanarazu hahatori o sarase, tada hiyoko dake o toranakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata wa saiwai o e, nagaku ikinagaraeru koto ga dekirude arou.
Atarashii ie o tateru toki wa, yane ni rankan o moukenakereba naranai. Sore wa hito ga yane kara ochite, chi no toga o anata no ie ni kisuru koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru.
Budou hatake ni ni shu no tane o mazete maite wa naranai. Sou sureba anata ga ma ita tane kara sansuru mono mo, budou hatake kara deru mono mo, mina imubeki mono to narude arou.
Ushi to, roba to o kumiawasete tagayashite wa naranai.
Youmou to ama ito o mazete otta kimono o kite wa naranai.
Mi ni matou uwagi no yon sumi ni, fusa o tsukenakereba naranai.
Moshi hito ga tsuma o metori, tsuma no tokoro ni haitte nochi, sono onna o kirai,
'Watashi wa kono onna o metotte chikazuita toki, kanojo ni shojo no shouko o minakatta' to itte kyogi no hinan o motte, sono onna ni akumei o owaserunaraba,
Sono onna no chichi to haha wa, kanojo no shojo no shouko o totte, mon ni oru machi no chouroutachi ni sashidashi,
Soshite kanojo no chichi wa chouroutachi ni iwanakereba naranai. 'Watashi wa kono hito ni musume o ataete tsuma ni sasemashitaga, kono hito wa musume o kirai,
Kyogi no hinan o motte, "Watashi wa anata no musume ni shojo no shouko o minakatta" to iimasu. Shikashi, kore ga watashi no musume no shojo no shouko desu' to itte, sono fubo wa kano nuno o machi no chouroutachi no mae ni hirogenakereba naranai.
Sono toki, machi no chouroutachi wa, sono hito o toraete uchi korashi,
Mata gin hyaku shikeru no bakkin o kashi, sore o onna no chichi ni ataenakereba naranai. Kare wa Isuraeru no shojo ni akumei o owasetakara de aru. Kare wa sono onna o tsuma to shi, isshou sono onna o dasu koto wa dekinai.
Shikashi, kono hinan ga shinjitsu de atte, sono onna ni shojo no shouko ga mirarenai toki wa,
Sono onna o chichi no ie no iriguchi ni hikidashi, machi no hitobito wa kanojo o ishi de uchikorosanakereba naranai. Kanojo wa chichi no ie de, midara na koto o okonai, Isuraeru no uchi ni oroka na koto o shitakara de aru. Anata wa kou shite anata gata no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Moshi otto no aru onna to nete iru otoko o mitsuketanaraba, sono onna to neta otoko oyobi sono onna o issho ni koroshi, kou shite Isuraeru no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Moshi shojo de aru onna ga, hito to kon'yaku shita nochi, ta no otoko ga machi no uchi de sono onna ni ai, kore o okashitanaraba,
Anata gata wa sono futari o machi no mon ni hikidashite, ishi de uchikorosanakereba naranai. Kore wa sono onna ga machi no uchi ni orinagara sakebanakattakara de ari, mata sono otoko wa rinjin no tsuma o hazukashimetakara de aru. Anata wa kou shite anata gata no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Shikashi, otoko ga, hito to kon'yaku shita onna ni no de ai, sono onna o toraete kore o okashitanaraba, sono otoko dake o korosanakereba naranai.
Sono onna ni wa nani mo shite wa naranai. Onna ni wa shi ni ataru tsumi ga nai. Hito ga sono rinjin ni tachimukatte, sore o koroshita to onaji jiken dakara de aru.
Kore wa otoko ga no de onna ni atta no de, hito to kon'yaku shita sono onna ga sakendakeredo mo, sukuu mono ga nakatta no de aru.
Mada hito to kon'yaku shinai shojo de aru onna ni, otoko ga ai, kore o toraete okashi, futari ga mitsukeraretanaraba,
Onna o okashita otoko wa onna no chichi ni gin gojuu shikeru o ataete, onna o jibun no tsuma to shinakereba naranai. Kare wa sono onna o hazukashimeta yue ni, isshou sono onna o dasu koto wa dekinai.
Dare mo chichi no tsuma o metotte wa naranai. Chichi no tsuma to nete wa naranai.
Subete kyosei shita danshi wa Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawatte wa naranai.
Shiseiji wa Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawatte wa naranai. Sono shison wa juu dai made mo Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawatte wa naranai.
Anmon bito to Moabu bito wa Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawatte wa naranai. Karera no shison wa juu dai made mo, itsu made mo Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawatte wa naranai.
Kore wa anata gata ga Ejiputo kara dete kita toki ni, karera ga pan to mizu o tazusaete anatagata o michi ni mukaezu, Aramu Naharaimu no Petoru kara Beoru no ko Baramu o yatotte, anata o norowaseyou to shitakara de aru.
Shikashi, anata no kami, Shu wa Baramu no iu koto o kikou to mo sezu, anata no kami, Shu wa anata no tame ni, sono noroi o kaete, shukufuku to sareta. Anata no kami, Shu ga anata o aisaretakara de aru.
Anata wa isshou itsu made mo karera no tame ni heian o mo, koufuku o mo motomete wa naranai.
Anata wa Edomu bito o nikunde wa naranai. Kare wa anata no kyoudai dakara de aru. Mata Ejiputo bito o nikunde wa naranai. Anata wa katsute sono kuni no kiryuusha de attakara de aru.
Soshite karera ga unda kodomo wa san daime ni wa, Shu no kaishuu ni kuwawaru koto ga dekiru.
Teki o semeru tame ni dete jin'ei ni oru toki wa, subete no kegareta mono o sakenakereba naranai.
Anata gata no uchi ni, yoru no omoigakenai koto ni yotte mi no kegareta hito ga arunaraba, jin'ei no soto ni denakereba naranai. Jin'ei no uchi ni, haitte wa naranai.
Shikashi, yuugata ni natte, mizu de mi o arai, hi ga bosshite nochi, jin'ei no uchi ni, hairu koto ga dekiru.
Anata wa mata jin'ei no soto ni hitotsu no tokoro o moukete oite, you o tasu toki, soko ni dete ikanakereba naranai.
Mata buki to tomo ni, kuwa o sonae, soto ni dete, kagamu toki, sore o motte tsuchi o hori, muki o kaete, deta mono o oowanakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu ga anata o sukui, teki o anata ni watasou to, jin'ei no naka o ayumarerukara de aru. Yue ni jin'ei wa sei naru tokoro to shite tamotanakereba naranai. Shu ga anata no uchi ni kitanai mono no aru no o mite, hanaresarareru koto no nai tame de aru.
Shujin o sakete, anata no tokoro ni nigete kita dorei o, sono shujin ni watashite wa naranai.
Sono mono o anata gata no uchi ni, anata to tomo ni orase, machi no hitotsu no uchi, kare ga kononde erabu basho ni sumasenakereba naranai. Kare o gyakutai shite wa naranai.
Isuraeru no joshi wa shinden shoufu to natte wa naranai. Mata Isuraeru no danshi wa shinden danshou to natte wa naranai.
Shoufu no eta atai mata wa danshou no atai o anata no kami, Shu no ie ni tazusaete itte, donna seigan ni mo mochiite wa naranai. Kore wa tomo ni anata no kami, Shu no nikumareru mono dakara de aru.
Kyoudai ni risoku o totte kashite wa naranai. Kinsen no risoku, shokumotsu no risoku nado subete kashite risoku no tsuku mono no risoku o totte wa naranai.
Gaikokujin ni wa risoku o totte kashite mo yoi. Tada kyoudai ni wa risoku o totte kashite wa naranai. Kore wa anata ga, hai tte toru chi de, anata no kami, Shu ga subete anata no suru koto ni shukufuku o ataerareru tame de aru.
Anata no kami, Shu ni seigan o kakeru toki, sore o hatasu koto o okotatte wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu wa kanarazu sore o anata ni motomerarerukara de aru. Sore o okotaru toki wa tsumi o erude arou.
Shikashi, anata ga seigan o kakenainaraba, tsumi o eru koto wa nai.
Anata ga kuchi de itta koto wa mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Anata ga kuchi de yakusoku shita koto wa, anata no kami, Shu ni anata ga jihatsumato ni seigan shita no dakara de aru.
Anata ga rinjin no budou hatake ni wa iru toki, sono budou o kokoro ni makasete akiru hodo tabete mo yoi. Shikashi, anata no utsuwa no naka ni toriirete wa naranai.
Anata ga rinjin no mugibatake ni wa iru toki, te de sono ho o tsunde tabete mo yoi. Shikashi, anata no rinjin no mugibatake ni kama o irete wa naranai.
Hito ga tsuma o metotte, kekkon shita nochi ni, sono onna ni hazubeki koto no aru no o mite, konomanaku nattanaraba, rienjou o kaite kanojo no te ni watashi, ie o sarasenakereba naranai.
Onna ga sono ie o dete nochi, itte, hoka no hito ni totsugi,
Nochi no otto mo kanojo o kiratte, rienjou o kaki, sono te ni watashite ie o saraseru ka, mata wa tsuma ni metotta nochi no otto ga shinda toki wa,
Kanojo wa sudeni mi o kegashita nochi de arukara, kanojo o saraseta saki no otto wa, futatabi kanojo o tsuma ni metoru koto wa dekinai. Kore wa Shu no mae ni nikumubeki koto dakara de aru. Anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite anata ni ataerareru chi ni tsumi o owasete wa naranai.
Hito ga arata ni tsuma o metotta toki wa, sensou ni dashite wa naranai. Mata nani no tsutome mo kore ni owasete wa naranai. Sono hito wa ichi nen no aida, sokubaku naku ie ni ite, sono metotta tsuma o nagusamenakereba naranai.
Hikiusu, mata wa sono uwaishi o shitsu ni totte wa naranai. Kore wa inochi o tsunagu mono o shitsu ni toru koto dakara de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no douhou no hitori o kadowakashite, kore o dorei no you ni ashirai, mata wa kore o uru mono o mitsuketanaraba, sono kadowakashita mono o koroshite, anata gata no uchi kara aku o nozokisaranakereba naranai.
Raibyou no tatta toki wa ki o tsukete, subete Rebi bito taru saishi ga oshieru koto o, yoku mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Sunawachi watashi ga karera ni meijita you ni, anata gata wa sore o mamotte okonawanakereba naranai.
Anata gata ga Ejiputo kara dete kita toki, michi de anata no kami, Shu ga Miriamu ni sareta koto o kioku shinakereba naranai.
Anata ga rinjin ni mono o kasu toki wa, jibun de sono ie ni haitte, shichimono o totte wa naranai.
Anata wa soto ni tatte ite, karita hito ga shichimono o soto ni iru anata no tokoro e mochidasanakereba naranai.
Moshi sono hito ga mazushii hito de aru toki wa, anata wa sono shichimono o tomeoite nete wa naranai.
Sono shichimono wa hi no iru made ni, kanarazu kaesanakereba naranai. Sou sureba kare wa jibun no uwagi o kakete neru koto ga dekite, anata o shukufuku surude arou. Sore wa anata no kami, Shu no mae ni anata no gi to narude arou.
Mazushiku toboshii yatoinin wa, douhou de are, mata wa anata no kuni de, machi no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin de are, sore o gyakutai shite wa naranai.
Chingin wa sono hi no uchi ni harai, sore o hi no iru made nobashite wa naranai. Kare wa mazushii mono de, sono kokoro o kore ni kakete irukara de aru. Sou shinakereba kare wa anata o Shu ni uttaete, anata wa tsumi o erude arou.
Chichi wa ko no yue ni korosarubekide wa nai. Ko wa chichi no yue ni korosarubekide wa nai. Onoono jibun no tsumi no yue ni korosarubekide aru.
Kiryuu no takokujin mata wa koji no sabaki o magete wa naranai. Kafu no kimono o shitsu ni totte wa naranai.
Anata wa katsute Ejiputo de dorei de attaga, anata no kami, Shu ga soko kara anata o sukuidasareta koto o kioku shinakereba naranai. Sore de watashi wa anata ni kono koto o seyo to meijiru no de aru.
Anata ga hatake de kokumotsu o karu toki, moshi sono hitotaba o hatake ni oki wasuretanaraba, sore o tori ni hikikaeshite wa naranai. Sore wa kiryuu no takokujin to koji to kafu ni torasenakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata no kami, Shu wa subete anata ga suru koto ni oite, anata o shukufuku sarerude arou.
Anata ga oribu no mi o uchi otosu toki wa, futatabi sono eda o sagashite wa naranai. Sore o kiryuu no takokujin to koji to kafu ni torasenakereba naranai.
Mata budou hatake no budou o tsumitoru toki wa, sono nokotta mono o, futatabi sagashite wa naranai. Sore o kiryuu no takokujin to koji to kafu ni torasenakereba naranai.
Anata wa katsute Ejiputo no kuni de dorei de atta koto o kioku shinakereba naranai. Sore de watashi wa anata ni kono koto o seyo to meijiru no de aru.
Hito to hito to no aida ni arasoikoto ga atte, sabaki o motomete kitanaraba, saba kibi to wa kore o sabaite, tadashii mono o tadashii to shi, warui mono o warui to shinakereba naranai.
Sono warui mono ga, muchiutsubeki mono de arunaraba, saba kibi to wa kare o fusase, jibun no mae de, sono tsumi ni shitagai, kazoete kare o muchiutasenakereba naranai.
Kare o muchiutsu ni wa yonjuu o koete wa naranai. Moshi sore o koete, sore yori mo ooku muchi o utsu toki wa, anata no kyoudai wa anata no me no mae de, hazukashimerareru koto ni narude arou.
Dakkoku o suru ushinikutsuko o kakete wa naranai.
Kyoudai ga issho ni sunde ite, sono uchi no hitori ga shinde ko no nai toki wa, sono shinda mono no tsuma wa dete, tanin ni totsuide wa naranai. Sono otto no kyoudai ga kanojo no tokoro ni hairi, metotte tsuma to shi, otto no kyoudai to shite no michi o kanojo ni tsukusanakereba naranai.
Soshite sono onna ga hajime ni umu otokonoko ni, shinda kyoudai no na o tsugase, sono na o Isuraeru no uchi ni tayasanai you ni shinakereba naranai.
Shikashi sono hito ga kyoudai no tsuma o metoru no o konomanainaraba, sono kyoudai no tsuma wa machi no mon e itte, chouroutachi ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Watashi no otto no kyoudai wa sono kyoudai no na o Isuraeru no uchi ni nokosu no o kobande, otto no kyoudai to shite no michi o tsukusu koto o konomimasen'.
Sono toki machi no chouroutachi wa kare o yobiyosete, satosanakereba naranai. Moshi kare ga koshitsu shite, 'Watashi wa kanojo o metoru koto o konomimasen' to iunaraba,
Sono kyoudai no tsuma wa chouroutachi no me no mae de, kare no soba ni iki, sono ashi no kutsu o nugase, sono kao ni tsubaki shite, kotaete iwanakereba naranai. 'Kyoudai no ie o tatenai mono ni wa, kono you ni subeki desu'.
Soshite kare no ie no na wa, kutsu o nugasareta mono no ie to, Isuraeru no uchi de yobarerude arou.
Futari no hito ga tagai ni arasou toki ni, sono hitori no hito no tsuma ga, utsu mono no te kara otto o sukuou to shite chikazuki, te o nobete, sono hito no kakushitokoro o tsukamaerunaraba,
Sono onna no te o kiriotosanakereba naranai. Awaremi o kakete wa naranai.
Anata no fukuro ni daishou ni shu no omori ishi o irete oite wa naranai.
Anata no ie ni daishou ni shu no masu o oite wa naranai.
Fusoku no nai tadashii omori ishi o mochi, mata fusoku no nai tadashii masu o motanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi de, anata wa nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekirude arou.
Subete kono you na fusei o suru mono o, anata no kami, Shu ga nikumarerukara de aru.
Anata ga Ejiputo kara dete kita toki, michi de Amareku bito ga anata ni shita koto o kioku shinakereba naranai.
Sunawachi karera wa michi de anata ni deai, anata ga umitsukarete iru toki, ushiro ni tsuite kite ita subete no yowatte iru mono o seme utta. Kono you ni karera wa kami o osorenakatta.
Sore de, anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite tamawaru chi de, anata no kami, Shu ga anata no shuui no subete no teki o seifuku shite, anata ni ansoku o ataerareru toki, anata wa Amareku no na o ten no shita kara keshisaranakereba naranai. Kono koto o wasurete wa naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu ga shigyou to shite tamawaru kuni ni haitte, sore o shoyuu shi, soko ni sumu toki wa,
Anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru kuni ni dekiru, chi no subete no mi no hatsumono o totte kago ni ire, anata no kami, Shu ga sono na o oku tame ni erabareru tokoro e tazusaete ikanakereba naranai.
Soshite sono toki no saishi no tokoro e itte kare ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Kyou, anata no kami, Shu ni watashi wa moushimasu. Shu ga wareware ni ataeruto senzotachi ni chikawareta kuni ni, watashi wa hairu koto ga dekimashita'.
Sono toki saishi wa anata no te kara sono kago o uketotte anata no kami, Shu no saidan no mae ni okanakereba naranai.
Soshite, anata wa anata no kami, Shu no mae ni nobete iwanakereba naranai, 'Watashi no senzo wa, sasurai no ichi Aramu bito de arimashitaga, wazuka no hito o tsurete Ejiputo e kudatte itte, sono tokoro ni kiryuu shi, tsuini soko de ookiku, tsuyoi, ninzuu no ooi kokumin ni narimashita.
Tokoro ga Ejiputo bi to wa wareware o shi etage, mata nayamashite, tsurai roueki o owasemashitaga,
Wareware ga senzotachi no kami, Shu ni sakenda no de, Shu wa wareware no koe o kiki, wareware no nayami to, honeori to, shi etage to o kaerimi,
Shu wa tsuyoi te to, nobeta ude to, ooinaru osorubeki koto to, shirushi to, fushigi to o motte, wareware o Ejiputo kara michibikidashi,
Wareware o kono tokoro e tsurete kite, chichi to mitsu no nagareru kono chi o wareware ni tamawarimashita.
Shu yo, goran kudasai. Anata ga watashi ni tamawatta chi no mi no hatsumono o, ima tazusaete kimashita'. Soshite anata wa sore o anata no kami, Shu no mae ni oite, anata no kami, Shu no mae ni reihai shi,
Anata no kami, Shu ga anata to anata no ie to ni tamawatta subete no yoi mono o motte, Rebi bi to oyobi anata no naka ni iru kiryuu no takokujin to tomo ni yorokobitanoshimanakereba naranai.
Daisan nen sunawachi juubun no ichi o osameru toshi ni, anata ga subete no sanbutsu no juubun no ichi o osame owatte, sore o Rebi bito to kiryuu no takokujin to koji to kafu to ni atae, machi no uchi de karera ni akiru hodo tabesaseta toki,
Anata no kami, Shu no mae de iwanakereba naranai, 'Watashi wa sono sei naru mono o ie kara toridashi, mata Rebi bito to kiryuu no takokujin to koji to kafu to ni sore o atae, subete anata ga meijirareta meirei no toori ni itashimashita. Watashi wa anata no meirei ni somukazu, mata sore o wasuremasendeshita.
Watashi wa sono sei naru mono o mo no uchi de tabeta koto ga naku, mata kegareta mi de sore o toridashita koto ga naku, mata shinin ni sore o sonaeta koto ga arimasendeshita. Watashi wa watashi no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagai, subete anata ga watashi ni meijirareta toori ni itashimashita.
Anata no sei naru sumika de aru ten kara miso nawa shite, anata no tami Isuraeru to, anata ga wareware ni ataerareta chi to o shukufuku shite kudasai. Kore wa anata ga wareware no senzo ni chikawareta chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi desu'.
Kyou, anata no kami, Shu wa korera no sadame to, okite to o okonau koto o anata ni meijirareru. Sore yue, anata wa kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite sore o mamori okonawanakereba naranai.
Kyou, anata wa Shu o anata no kami to shi, katsu sono michi ni ayumi, sadame to, imashime to, okite to o mamori, sono koe ni kikishitagau koto o meigen shita.
Soshite, Shu wa saki ni yakusoku sareta you ni, kyou, anata o jibun no takara no tami to sareru koto, mata, anata ga sono subete no meirei o mamorubeki koto o meigen sareta.
Shu wa homare to yoki na to sakae to o anata ni ataete, Shu no tsukurareta subete no kokumin ni masaru mono to sarerude arou. Anata wa Shu ga iwareta you ni, anata no kami, Shu no sei naru tami to narude arou".
Moose to Isuraeru no chouroutachi to wa tami ni meijite itta, "Watashi ga, kyou, anata gata ni meijiru subete no imashime o mamori nasai.
Anata gata ga Yorudan o watatte anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru kuni ni wa iru toki, anata wa ookina ishi suuko o tatete, sore ni shikkui o nuri,
Soshite anata ga watatte, anata no senzotachi no kami, Shu ga yakusoku sareta you ni anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi, sunawachi chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi ni wa iru toki, kono rippou no subete no kotoba o sono ue ni kakishirusanakereba naranai.
Sunawachi, anata ga taga, Yorudan o watattanaraba, watashi ga, kyou, anata gata ni meijiru sorera no ishi o Ebaru yama ni tate, sore ni shikkui o nuranakereba naranai.
Mata soko ni anata no kami, Shu no tame ni, saidan, sunawachi ishi no saidan o kizukanakereba naranai. Tetsu no utsuwa o ishi ni atezu,
Shizen no mama no ishi de anata no kami, Shu no tame ni saidan o kizuki, sono ue de anata no kami, Shu ni hansai o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata shuuonsai no gisei o sasagete, sono tokoro de tabe, anata no kami, Shu no mae de yorokobitanoshimanakereba naranai.
Anata wa kono rippou no subete no kotoba o sono ishi no ue ni akiraka ni kakishirusanakereba naranai".
Mata Moose to Rebi bito taru saishitachi to wa, Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ni itta, "Isuraeru yo, shizuka ni kiki nasai. Anata wa, kyou, anata no kami, Shu no tami to natta.
Sore yue, anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagai, watashi ga, kyou, meijiru imashime to sadame to o okonawanakereba naranai".
Sono hi mata Moose wa tami ni meijite itta,
"Anata gata ga Yorudan o watatta toki, tsugi no hitotachi wa Gerijimuyama ni tatte tami o shukufuku shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi Shimeon, Rebi, Yuda, Issakaru, Yosefu oyobi Beniyamin.
Mata tsugi no hitotachi wa Ebaru yama ni tatte norowanakereba naranai. Sunawachi Ruben, Gado, Aseru, Zeburun, Dan oyobi Nafutari.
Soshite Rebi bi to wa oogoe de Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ni tsugete iwanakereba naranai.
'Koujin no te no saku de aru kizanda zou, mata wa ita zou wa, Shu ga nikumareru mono de arukara, sore o tsukutte, hisoka ni anchi suru mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa, mina kotaete amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Chichi ya haha o karonzuru mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Rinjin to no tochi no sakai o utsusu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Moujin o michi ni mayowasu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Kiryuu no takokujin ya koji, kafu no sabaki o mageru mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Chichi no tsuma o okasu mono wa, chichi o hazukashimeru no de arukara norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Subete kemono o okasu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Chichi no musume, mata wa haha no musume de aru jibun no shimai o okasu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Tsuma no haha o okasu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Hisoka ni rinjin o uchikorosu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Mainai o totte tsumi naki mono o korosu mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
'Kono rippou no kotoba o mamori okonawanai mono wa norowareru'. Tami wa mina amen to iwanakereba naranai.
Moshi anata ga, anata no kami, Shu no koe ni yoku kikishitagai, watashi ga, kyou, meijiru subete no imashime o mamori okonaunaraba, anata no kami, Shu wa anata o chi no moromoro no kokumin no ue ni tataserarerude arou.
Moshi, anata ga anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagaunaraba, kono moromoro no shukufuku wa anata ni nozomi, anata ni oyobude arou.
Anata wa machi no uchi de mo shukufuku sare, hatake de mo shukufuku sarerude arou.
Mata anata no mi kara umareru mono, chi ni sansuru mono, kachiku no umu mono, sunawachi ushi no ko, hitsuji no ko wa shukufuku sarerude arou.
Mata anata no kago to, kone bachi wa shukufuku sarerude arou.
Anata wa, hairu ni mo shukufuku sare, deru ni mo shukufuku sarerude arou.
Teki ga tatte anata o semeru toki wa, Shu wa anata ni sore o uchi yaburaserarerude arou. Karera wa hitotsu no michi kara semete kuruga, anata no mae de nanatsu no michi kara nigesarude arou.
Shu wa meijite shukufuku o anata no kura to, anata no te no subete no waza ni kudashi, anata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi de anata o shukufuku sarerude arou.
Moshi, anata no kami, Shu no imashime o mamori, sono michi o ayumunaraba, Shu wa chikawareta you ni anata o tatete, sono sei naru tami to sarerude arou.
Sou sureba chi no subete no tami wa mina anata ga Shu no na o motte tonaerareru no o mite anata o osorerude arou.
Shu ga anata ni ataeruto senzo ni chikawareta chi de, Shu wa yoi mono, sunawachi anata no mi kara umareru mono, kachiku no umu mono, chi ni sansuru mono o yutaka ni sarerude arou.
Shu wa sono takara no kura de aru ten o anata no tame ni hiraite, ame o kisetsu ni shitagatte anata no chi ni furase, anata no te no subete no waza o shukufuku sarerude arou. Anata wa ooku no kokumin ni kasu you ni nari, kariru koto wa naide arou.
Shu wa anata o kashira to narase, o to wa naraserarenaide arou. Anata wa tada sakaete otoroeru koto wa naide arou. Kyou, watashi ga meijiru anata no kami, Shu no imashime ni kikishitagatte, kore o mamori okonaunaraba, anata wa kanarazu kono you ni narude arou.
Kyou, watashi ga meijiru kono subete no kotoba o hanarete migi mata wa hidari ni magari, ta no kamigami ni shitagai, sore ni tsukaete wa naranai.
Shikashi, anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, kyou, watashi ga meijiru subete no imashime to sadame to o mamori okonawanainaraba, kono moromoro no noroi ga anata ni nozomi, anata ni oyobude arou.
Anata wa machi no uchi de mo noroware, hatake de mo noroware,
Anata no kago mo, kone bachi mo noroware,
Anata no mi kara umareru mono, chi ni sansuru mono, ushi no ko, hitsuji no ko mo norowarerude arou.
Anata wa, hairu ni mo noroware, deru ni mo norowarerude arou.
Shu wa anata ga te o kudasu subete no hataraki ni noroito, konran to, kora shime to o okurare, anata wa tsuini horobi, sumiyaka ni use haterude arou. Kore wa anata ga aku o okonatte watashi o sutetakara de aru.
Shu wa ekibyou o anata no mi ni tsukase, anata ga itte toru chi kara, tsuini anata o tachi horobosarerude arou.
Shu wa mata haibyou to netsubyou to enshou to aidaketsu netsu to, kanbatsu to, tachigare to, kusari ho to o motte anata o utarerude arou. Korera no mono wa anata o oi, tsuini anata o horobosude arou.
Anata no atama no ue no ten wa seidou to nari, anata no shita no chi wa tetsu to narude arou.
Shu wa anata no chi no ame o, chiri to, hokori ni kawarase, sore ga ten kara anata no ue ni kudatte, tsuini anata o horobosude arou.
Shu wa anata o teki no mae de yaburesaserarerude arou. Anata wa hitotsu no michi kara karera o semete ikuga, karera no mae de nanatsu no michi kara nigesarude arou. Soshite anata wa chi no moromoro no kuni ni osorubeki miseshime to narude arou.
Mata anata no shitai wa sora no moromoro no tori to, chi no kemono to no ejiki to nari, shikamo sore o oiharau mono wa naide arou.
Shu wa Ejiputo no haremono to kaiyou to kaiketsubyou to hizen to o motte anata o utare, anata wa iyasareru koto wa naide arou.
Mata Shu wa anata o utte ki o kuruwase, me o mienakushi, kokoro o konran saserarerude arou.
Anata wa moujin ga kurayami ni tesaguri suru you ni, mahiru ni mo tesaguri surude arou. Anata wa yuku michi de sakaeru koto ga naku, tada tsune ni shi etagerare, kasumerareru dake de, anata o sukuu mono wa naide arou.
Anata wa tsuma o metotte mo, hoka no hito ga kanojo to nerude arou. Ie o tatete mo, sono naka ni sumanaide arou. Budou hatake o tsukutte mo, sono mi o tsumitoru koto ga naide arou.
Anata no ushi ga me no mae de hofurarete mo, anata wa sore o taberu koto ga dekizu, anata no roba ga me no mae de ubawarete mo, kaesarenaide arou. Anata no hitsuji ga teki no mono ni natte mo, sore o sukutte anata ni kaesu mono wa naide arou.
Anata no musuko ya musume wa takokumin ni watasareru. Anata no me wa sore o mi, shuujitsu, karera o shitatte otoroeruga, anata wa te o hodokosu sube mo naide arou.
Anata no chi no sanbutsu oyobi anata no roushite eta mono wa mina anata no shiranai tami ga taberude arou. Anata wa, tada tsune ni shi etagerare, kurushimerareru nomi de arou.
Kou shite anata wa me ni miru kotogara ni yotte, ki ga kuruu ni itarude arou.
Shu wa anata no hiza to, hagi to ni warui, iyashi enai haremono o shoujisasete, ashi no ura kara atama no itadaki ni made oyobosarerude arou.
Shu wa anata to anata ga tateta ou to o tazusaete, anata mo anata no senzo mo shiranai kuni ni utsusarerude arou. Anata wa soko de ki ya ishi de tsukutta hoka no kamigami ni tsukaerude arou.
Anata wa Shu ga anata o oiyarareru moromoro no tami no naka de odoroki to nari, kotowaza to nari, waraigusa to narude arou.
Anata ga ooku no tane o hatake ni tazusaete dete mo, sono shuukaku wa sukunaide arou. Inago ga sore o kui tsukusukara de aru.
Anata ga budou hatake o tsukuri, sore ni tsuchikatte mo, sono budoushu o nomu koto ga dekizu, sono mi o atsumeru koto mo naide arou. Mushi ga sore o taberukara de aru.
Anata no kuni ni wa amaneku oribu no ki ga arude arou. Shikashi, anata wa sono abura o mi ni nuru koto ga dekinaide arou. Sono mi ga mina ochite shimaukara de aru.
Musuko ya, musume ga anata ni umarete mo, anata no mono ni naranaide arou. Karera wa toraerarete ikukara de aru.
Anata no moromoro no ki, oyobi chi no sanbutsu wa, inago ga totte taberude arou.
Anata no uchi ni kiryuu suru takokujin wa, masumasu takaku nari, anata no ue ni dete, anata wa masumasu hikuku narude arou.
Kare wa anata ni kashi, anata wa kare ni kasu koto ga dekinai. Kare wa kashira to nari, anata wa o to narude arou.
Kono moromoro no noroi ga, anata ni nozomi, anata o oi, tsuini oitsuite, anata o horobosude arou. Kore wa anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, anata ni meijirareta imashime to sadame to o, anata ga mamoranakattakara de aru.
Korera no koto wa nagaku anata to anata no shison no ue ni atte, shirushi to nari, mata fushigi to narude arou.
Anata ga subete no mono ni yutaka ni nari, anata no kami, Shu ni kokoro kara yorokobitanoshinde tsukaenai no de,
Anata wa ue, kawaki, hadaka ni nari, subete no mono ni toboshiku natte, Shu ga anata ni tsukawasareru teki ni tsukaerude arou. Teki wa tetsu no kubiki o anata no kubi ni kake, tsuini anata o horobosude arou.
Sunawachi Shu wa tooi tokoro kara, chi no hate kara hitotsu no tami o, hagetaka ga tobi kakeru you ni, anata ni seme kitara serarerude arou. Kore wa anata ga sono kotoba o shiranai tami,
Kao no osoroshii tami de atte, karera wa roujin no mi o kaerimizu, osanai mono o awaremazu,
Anata no kachiku ga umu mono ya, chi no sanbutsu o kutte, anata o horoboshi, kokumotsu o mo, sake o mo, abura o mo, ushi no ko o mo, hitsuji no ko o mo, anata no tokoro ni nokosazu, tsuini anata o mattaku horobosude arou.
Sono tami wa zenkoku de subete no machi o semekakomi, tsuini anata ga tanomi to suru, kengo na takai ishigaki o kotogotoku uchi kuzushi, anata no kami, Shu ga tamawatta kuni no uchi no subete no machimachi o semekakomude arou.
Anata wa teki ni kakomare, hageshiku seme nayamasarete, tsuini anata no kami, Shu ga tamawatta anata no mi kara umareta mono, musuko, musume no niku o taberu ni itarude arou.
Anata gata no uchi no yasashii, onwa na otoko de sae mo, jibun no kyoudai, jibun no futokoro no tsuma, saigo ni nokotte iru kodomo ni mo shokumotsu o oshinde ataezu,
Jibun ga jibun no kodomo o tabe, sono niku o sukoshi de mo, kono hitobito no dare ni mo ataeyou to wa shinaide arou. Kore wa teki ga anata no subete no machimachi o kakomi, hageshiku seme nayamashite, nani o mo sono hito ni nokosanaikara de aru.
Mata anata gata no uchi no yasashii, nyuuwa na onna, sunawachi nyuuwa de, yasashiku, ashi no ura o tsuchi ni tsukeyou to mo shinai mono de mo, jibun no futokoro no otto ya, musuko, musume ni mo kakushite,
Jibun no ashi no aida kara deru gosan ya, jibun no umu ko o hisoka ni taberude arou. Teki ga anata no machimachi o kakomi, hageshiku seme nayamashite, subete no mono ga ketsubou surukara de aru.
Moshi anata ga, kono shomotsu ni shirusarete iru kono rippou no subete no kotoba o mamori okonawazu, anata no kami, Shu to iu kono sakae aru osorubeki na o osorenainaraba,
Shu wa anata to sono shison no ue ni hageshii wazawai o kudasarerude arou. Sono wazawai wa kibishiku, katsu hisashiku, sono byouki wa omoku, katsu hisashiide arou.
Shu wa mata, anata ga osoreta byouki, sunawachi Ejiputo no moromoro no byouki o futatabi nozomasete, anata no mi ni tsukaserarerude arou.
Mata kono rippou no sho ni nosetenai moromoro no byouki to, moromoro no wazawai to o, Shu wa anata ga horobiru made, anata no ue ni kudasarerude arou.
Anata gata wa ten no hoshi no you ni ookattaga, anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagawanakattakara, nokoru mono ga sukunaku narude arou.
Saki ni Shu ga anatagata o yoku ashirai, anatagata o ooku suru no o yorokobareta you ni, Shu wa ima anatagata o horoboshi tayasu no o yorokobarerude arou. Anata gata wa, hai tte toru chi kara nukisararerude arou.
Shu wa chi no kono hate kara, kano hate made no moromoro no tami no uchi ni anatagata o chirasarerude arou. Sono tokoro de, anata mo anata no senzotachi mo shiranakatta ki ya ishi de tsukutta hoka no kamigami ni anata wa tsukaerude arou.
Sono kuniguni no tami no uchi de anata wa yasuki o ezu, mata ashi no ura o yasumeru tokoro mo erarenaide arou. Shu wa sono tokoro de, anata no kokoro o ononokase, me o otoroesase, seishin o uchishioresaserarerude arou.
Anata no inochi wa hosoi ito ni kakatte iru you ni nari, yoruhiru osoreononoite, sono inochi mo obotsukanaku omoude arou.
Anata ga kokoro ni idaku osore to, me ni miru mono ni yotte, asa ni wa 'Aa yuu de areba yoi no ni' to ii, yuu ni wa 'Aa asa de areba yoi no ni' to iude arou.
Shu wa anata o fune ni nose, katsute watashi ga anata ni tsugete, 'Anata wa futatabi kore o miru koto wa nai' to itta michi ni yotte, anata o Ejiputo e tsuremodosarerude arou. Anata gata wa soko de danjo no dorei to shite teki ni urareruga, dare mo kau mono wa naide arou".
Kore wa Shu ga Moose ni meijite, Moabu no chi de Isuraeru no hitobito to musubaserareta keiyaku no kotoba de atte, Horebu de karera to musubareta keiyaku no hoka no mono de aru.
Moose wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o yobiatsumete itta, "Anata gata wa Shu ga Ejiputo no chi de, Paro to, sono subete no kerai to, sono zenchi to ni serareta subete no koto o manoatari mita.
Sunawachi sono ookina kokoromi to, shirushi to, ookina fushigi to o manoatari mita no de aru.
Shikashi, konnichi made Shu wa anata gata no kokoro ni satorasezu, me ni misasezu, mimi ni kikaserarenakatta.
Watashi wa yonjuu nen no aida, anatagata o michibiite arano o toorasetaga, anata gata no mi ni tsuketa kimono wa furubizu, ashi no kutsu wa furubinakatta.
Anata gata wa mata pan mo tabezu, budoushu mo koi sake mo nomanakatta. Kou shite anata gata wa, watashi ga anata gata no kami, Shu de aru koto o shiru ni itatta.
Anata gata ga kono tokoro ni kita toki, Heshibon no ou Shihon to, Bashan no ou Ogu ga wareware o mukaete tatakattaga, wareware wa karera o uchi yabutte,
Sono chi o tori, kore o Ruben bito to, Gado bi to to, Manase bito no nakaba to ni, shigyou to shite ataeta.
Sore yue, anata gata wa kono keiyaku no kotoba o mamotte, sore o okonawanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata gata no suru subete no koto wa sakaerude arou.
Anata gata wa mina, kyou, anata gata no kami, Shu no mae ni tatte iru. Sunawachi anata gata no buzoku no kashiratachi, chouroutachi, tsukasatachi nado, Isuraeru no subete no hitobito,
Anata gata no chiisai monotachi mo, tsumatachi mo, shukuei no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin mo, anata no tame ni, takigi o waru mono mo, mizu o kumu mono mo, mina Shu no mae ni tatte,
Anata no kami, Shu ga, kyou, anata to musubareru anata no kami, Shu no keiyaku to chikai to ni, hairou to shite iru.
Kore wa Shu ga saki ni anata ni yakusoku sareta you ni, mata anata no senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni chikawareta you ni, kyou, anata o tatete jibun no tami to shi, mata mizukara anata no kami to narareru tame de aru.
Watashi wa tada anata gata to dake, kono keiyaku to chikai to o musubu no de wa nai.
Kyou, koko de, wareware no kami, Shu no mae ni wareware to tomo ni tatte iru mono narabi ni, kyou, koko ni wareware to tomo ni inai mono to mo musubu no de aru.
Wareware ga dono you ni Ejiputo no kuni ni sunde ita ka, dono you ni kuniguni no tami no naka o tootte kita ka, sore wa anata gata ga shitte iru.
Mata anata gata wa ki ya ishi ya gin ya kin de tsukutta nikumubeki mono to guuzou to ga, karera no uchi ni aru no o mita.
Sore yue, anata gata no uchi ni, kyou, sono kokoro ni wareware no kami, Shu o hanarete sorera no kokumin no kamigami ni itte tsukaeru otoko ya onna, shizoku ya buzoku ga atte wa naranai. Mata anata gata no uchi ni, dokusou ya, nigayomogi o shouzuru ne ga atte wa naranai.
Sono you na hito wa kono chikai no kotoba o kiite mo, kokoro ni jibun o shukufuku shite 'Kokoro o katakuna ni shite ayunde mo watashi ni wa heian ga aru' to iude arou. Sou sureba uruotta mono mo, kawaita mono mo hitoshiku horobirude arou.
Shu wa sono you na hito o yurusu koto o konomarenai. Kaette Shu wa sono hito ni ikari to netami o hasshi, kono shomotsu ni shirusareta subete no noroi o kare no ue ni kuwae, Shu wa tsuini sono hito no na o ten no shita kara keshisararerude arou.
Shu wa Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara sono hito o kubes shite wazawai o kudashi, kono rippou no sho ni shirusareta keiyaku no naka no moromoro no noroi no you ni sarerude arou.
Nochi no yo no hito, sunawachi anata gata no nochi ni okoru anata gata no shison oyobi tooi kuni kara kuru gaikokujin wa, kono chi no wazawai o mi, Shu ga kono chi ni kudasareta byouki o mite iude arou.
- - zenchi wa iou to nari, shio to nari, yaketsuchi to natte, tane mo makarezu, mi mo musubazu, nan no kusa mo shoujinaku natte, mukashi Shu ga ikari to ikidoori o motte horobosareta Sodomu, Gomora, Adema, Zeboimu no hametsu no you de aru. - -
Sunawachi, moromoro no kokumin wa iude arou, 'Naze, Shu wa kono chi ni kono you na koto o sareta no ka. Kono hageshii ooinaru ikari wa naniyue ka'.
Sono toki hitobito wa iude arou, 'Karera wa sono senzo no kami, Shu ga Ejiputo no kuni kara karera o michibikidashite karera to musubareta keiyaku o sute,
Itte karera no shiranai, mata sazukaranai, hoka no kamigami ni tsukaete, sore o ogandakara de aru.
Sore yue Shu wa kono chi ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, kono shomotsu ni shirusareta moromoro no noroi o kore ni kudashi,
Soshite Shu wa ikari to, hageshii ikari to ooinaru ikidoori to o motte karera o kono chi kara nukitotte, hoka no kuni ni nageyarareta. Konnichi miru toori de aru'.
Kakureta koto wa wareware no kami, Shu ni zokusuru mono de aru. Shikashi arawasareta koto wa nagaku wareware to wareware no shison ni zokushi, wareware ni kono rippou no subete no kotoba o okonawaseru no de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata no mae ni nobeta kono moromoro no shukufuku to, noroi no koto ga anata ni nozomi, anata ga anata no kami, Shu ni oiyarareta moromoro no kokumin no naka de kono koto o kokoro ni kangaete,
Anata mo anata no kodomo mo tomo ni anata no kami, Shu ni tachikaeri, watashi ga, kyou, meijiru subete no koto ni oite, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite, Shu no koe ni kikishitagaunaraba,
Anata no kami, Shu wa anata o futatabi sakaesase, anata o awaremi, anata no kami, Shu wa anata o chirasareta kuniguni kara futatabi atsumerarerude arou.
Tatoi anata ga ten no hate ni oiyararete mo, anata no kami, Shu wa soko kara anata o atsume, soko kara anata o tsurekaerarerude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu wa anata no senzo ga shoyuu shita chi ni anata o kaerase, anata wa sore o shoyuu suru ni itarude arou. Shu wa mata anata o sakaesase, kazu o mashite senzotachi yori mo ooku sarerude arou.
Soshite anata no kami, Shu wa anata no kokoro to anata no shison no kokoro ni katsurei o hodokoshi, anata o shite, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata no kami, Shu o aisase, kou shite anata ni inochi o esaserarerude arou.
Anata no kami, Shu wa mata, anata o hakugai suru teki to, anata o nikumu mono to ni, kono moromoro no noroi o koumuraserarerude arou.
Shikashi, anata wa futatabi Shu no koe ni kikishitagai, watashi ga, kyou, anata ni meijiru subete no imashime o mamorude arou.
Sou sureba anata no kami, Shu wa anata no suru subete no koto to, anata no mi kara umareru mono to, kachiku no umu mono to, chi ni sansuru mono o yutaka ni ataete, anata o sakaesaserarerude arou. Sunawachi Shu wa anata no senzotachi o yorokobareta you ni futatabi anata o yorokonde, anata o sakaesaserarerude arou.
Kore wa anata ga, anata no kami, Shu no koe ni kiki shitagai, kono rippou no sho ni shirusareta imashime to sadame to o mamori, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata no kami, Shu ni kisurukara de aru.
Watashi ga, kyou, anata ni meijiru kono imashime wa, muzukashii mono de wa naku, mata tooi mono de mo nai.
Kore wa ten ni aru no de wa naikara, 'Dare ga wareware no tame ni ten ni nobori, sore o wareware no tokoro e motte kite, wareware ni kikase, okonawaserude arou ka' to iu ni oyobanai.
Mata kore wa umi no kanata ni aru no de wa naikara, 'Dare ga wareware no tame ni umi o watatte iki, sore o wareware no tokoro e tazusaete kite, wareware ni kikase, okonawaserude arou ka' to iu ni oyobanai.
Kono kotoba wa anata ni, hanahada chikaku atte anata no kuchi ni ari, mata anata no kokoro ni arukara, anata wa kore o okonau koto ga dekiru.
Miyo, watashi wa, kyou, inochi to saiwai, oyobi shi to wazawai o anata no mae ni oita.
Sunawachi watashi wa, kyou, anata ni anata no kami, Shu o aishi, sono michi ni ayumi, sono imashime to sadame to, okite to o mamoru koto o meijiru. Sore ni shitagaunaraba, anata wa ikinagarae, sono kazu wa ooku narude arou. Mata anata no kami, Shu wa anata ga itte toru chi de anata o shukufuku sarerude arou.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga kokoro o somukete kikishitagawazu, sasowarete ta no kamigami o ogami, sore ni tsukaerunaraba,
Watashi wa, kyou, anata gata ni tsugeru. Anata gata wa kanarazu horobirude arou. Anata gata wa Yorudan o watari, hai tte itte toru chi de nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekinaide arou.
Watashi wa, kyou, ten to chi o yonde anata gata ni taisuru shounin to suru. Watashi wa inochi to shi oyobi shukufuku to noroi o anata no mae ni oita. Anata wa inochi o erabanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata to anata no shison wa ikinagaraeru koto ga dekirude arou.
Sunawachi anata no kami, Shu o aishite, sono koe o kiki, Shu ni tsukishitagawanakereba naranai. Sou sureba anata wa inochi o e, katsu nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga deki, Shu ga senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni ataeru to chikawareta chi ni sumu koto ga dekirude arou".
Soko de Moose wa tsuzuite kono kotoba o Isuraeru no subete no hito ni tsugete,
Karera ni itta, "Watashi wa, kyou, sudeni hyaku nijuusai ni nari, mohaya deiri suru koto wa dekinai. Mata Shu wa watashi ni 'Omae wa kono Yorudan o wataru koto wa dekinai' to iwareta.
Anata no kami, Shu wa mizukara anata ni sakidatte watari, anata no mae kara, korera no kuniguni no tami o horoboshisatte, anata ni kore o esaserarerude arou. Mata Shu ga katsute iwareta you ni, Yoshua wa anata o hikiite watarude arou.
Shu ga saki ni Amori bito no ou Shihon to Ogu oyobi sono chi ni sareta you ni, karera ni mo okonatte karera o horobosarerude arou.
Shu wa karera o anata gata ni watasarerukara, anata gata wa watashi ga meijita subete no meirei no toori ni karera ni okonawanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa tsuyoku, katsu isamashiku nakereba naranai. Karera o osore, ononoite wa naranai. Anata no kami, Shu ga anata to tomo ni ikarerukara de aru. Shu wa kesshite anata o mihanasazu, mata anata o misuterarenaide arou".
Moose wa Yoshua o yobi, Isuraeru no subete no hito no me no mae de kare ni itta, "Anata wa kono tami to tomo ni iki, Shu ga karera no senzotachi ni ataeru to chikawareta chi ni iru no de arukara, anata wa tsuyoku, katsu isamashiku nakereba naranai. Anata wa karera ni sore o esaserude arou.
Shu wa mizukara anata ni sakidatte iki, mata anata to tomo ni ori, anata o mihanasazu, misuterarenaide arou. Osorete wa naranai, ononoite wa naranai".
Moose wa kono rippou o kaite, Shu no keiyaku no hako o katsugu Rebi no shison de aru saishi oyobi Isuraeru no subete no chouroutachi ni sazuketa.
Soshite Moose wa karera ni meijite itta, "Nana nen no owarigoto ni, sunawachi, yurushi no toshi no sadame no toki ni nari, karii ono matsuri ni,
Isuraeru no subete no hito ga anata no kami, Shu no mae ni deru tame, Shu no erabareru basho ni kuru toki, anata wa Isuraeru no subete no hito no mae de kono rippou o yonde kikasenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi otoko, onna, kodomo oyobi anata no machi no uchi ni kiryuu shite iru takokujin nado tami o atsume, karera ni kore o kikase, katsu manabasenakereba naranai. Sou sureba karera wa anata gata no kami, Shu o osorete kono rippou no kotoba o, kotogotoku mamori okonaude arou.
Mata karera no kodomotachi de kore o shiranai mono mo kiite, anata gata no kami, Shu o osoreru koto o manabude arou. Anata gata ga Yorudan o watatte itte toru chi ni nagaraeru hi no aida tsune ni sou shinakereba naranai".
Shu wa mata Moose ni iwareta, "Anata no shinu hi ga chikazuite iru. Yoshua o meshite tomo ni kaiken no makuya ni tachi nasai. Watashi wa kare ni tsutome o meijirude arou". Moose to Yoshua ga itte kaiken no makuya ni tatsuto,
Shu wa makuya de kumo no hashira no uchi ni arawarerareta. Sono kumo no hashira wa makuya no iriguchi no katawara ni todomatta.
Shu wa Moose ni iwareta, "Anata wa ma mo naku nemutte senzotachi to issho ni narude arou. Sono toki kono tami wa tachiagari, hai tte iku chi no kotonaru kamigami o shitatte kan'in o okonai, watashi o sute, watashi ga karera to musunda keiyaku o yaburude arou.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa karera ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, karera o sute, watashi no kao o karera ni kakusu yue ni, karera wa horoboshi tsukusare, ooku no wazawai to nayami ga karera ni nozomude arou. Soko de sono hi, karera wa iude arou, 'Korera no wazawai ga wareware ni nozomu no wa, wareware no kami ga wareware no uchi ni orarenaikara de wa nai ka'.
Shikamo karera ga hoka no kamigami ni kishite, moromoro no aku o okonau yue ni, watashi wa sono hi ni wa kanarazu watashi no kao o kakusude arou.
Sore de anata gata wa ima, kono uta o kakishirushi, Isuraeru no hitobito ni oshiete sono kuchi ni tonaesase, kono uta o Isuraeru no hitobito ni taisuru watashi no akashi to narase nasai.
Watashi ga karera no senzotachi ni chikatta, chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi ni karera o michibikiireru toki, karera wa tabete aki, koefutoru ni oyonde, hoka no kamigami ni kishi, sore ni tsukaete, watashi o karonji, watashi no keiyaku o yaburude arou.
Kou shite ooku no wazawai to nayami to ga karera ni nozomu toki, kono uta wa karera ni taishite, akashi to narude arou. (sore wa kono uta ga karera no shison no kuchi ni atte, karera wa sore o wasurenaikara de aru.) watashi ga chikatta chi ni karera o michibikiireru mae, sudeni karera ga omoi hakatte iru koto o watashi wa shitte irukara de aru".
Moose wa sono hi, kono uta o kaite Isuraeru no hitobito ni oshieta.
Shu wa Nun no ko Yoshua ni meijite iwareta, "Anata wa Isuraeru no hitobito o watashi ga karera ni chikatta chi ni michibikiirenakereba naranai. Sore yue tsuyoku katsu isamashiku are. Watashi wa anata to tomo ni irude arou".
Moose ga kono rippou no kotoba o, kotogotoku shomotsu ni kaki owatta toki,
Moose wa Shu no keiyaku no hako o katsugu Rebi bito ni meijite itta,
"Kono rippou no sho o totte, anata gata no kami, Shu no keiyaku no hako no katawara ni oki, sono tokoro de anata ni mukatte akashi o suru mono to shi nasai.
Watashi wa anata no somuku koto to, katakuna na koto to o shitte iru. Kyou, watashi ga ikinagaraete, anata gata to issho ni iru aida de sura, anata gata wa Shu ni somuita. Mashite watashi ga shinda ato wa donna de arou.
Anata gata no buzoku no subete no chouroutachi to, tsukasatachi o watashi no moto ni atsume nasai. Watashi wa korera no kotoba o karera ni katarikikase, ten to chi to o yonde karera ni mukatte akashisaseyou.
Watashi wa shitte iru. Watashi ga shinda nochi, anata gata wa kanarazu warui koto o shite, watashi ga meijita michi o hanareru. Soshite nochi no hi ni wazawai ga anata gata ni nozomude arou. Kore wa Shu no aku to mirareru koto o okonai, anata gata no suru koto o motte Shu o ikaraserukara de aru".
Soshite Moose wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu ni tsugi no uta no kotoba o, kotogotoku katarikikaseta.
"Ten yo, mimi o katamukeyo, watashi wa kataru, chi yo, watashi no kuchi no kotoba o kike.
Watashi no oshie wa ame no you ni furisosogi, watashi no kotoba wa tsuyu no you ni shitatarude arou. Wakakusa no ue ni furu kosame no you ni, aokusa no ue ni kudaru yuudachi no you ni.
Watashi wa Shu no na o nobeyou, wareware no kami ni eikou o kaese yo.
Shu wa iwa de atte, sono miwaza wa mattaku, sono michi wa mina tadashii. Shu wa shinjitsu naru kami de atte, itsuwari naku, gi de atte, sei de aru.
Karera wa Shu ni mukatte aku o okonai, sono kizu no yue ni, mohaya Shu no kora de wa naku, yokoshima de, magatta yakara de aru.
Oroka na chie no nai tami yo, anata gata wa kono you ni shite Shu ni mukuiru no ka. Shu wa anata o umi, anata o tsukuri, anata o kataku taterareta anata no chichi de wa nai ka.
Inishie no hi o oboe, yoyo no toshi o omoe. Anata no chichi ni toe, kare wa anata ni tsugerude arou. Chouroutachi ni toe, karera wa anata ni katarude arou.
Ito takaki mono wa hito no kora o wake, shokokumin ni sono shigyou o ataerareta toki, Isuraeru no kora no kazu ni tera shite, moromoro no tami no sakai o sadamerareta.
Shu no bun wa sono tami de atte, Yakobu wa sono sadamerareta shigyou de aru.
Shu wa kore o arano no chi de miidashi, kemono no hoeru arechi de ai, kore o meguri kakonde itawari, me no hitomi no you ni mamorareta.
Washi ga sono su no hina o yobiokoshi, sono ko no ue ni mai kakeri, sono hane o hirogete karera o nose, sono tsubasa no ue ni kore o ou you ni,
Shu wa tada hitori de kare o michibikarete, hoka no kamigami wa azukaranakatta.
Shu wa kare ni chi no takaki tokoro o nori toorase, tahata no sanbutsu o kuwase, iwa no naka kara mitsu o suwase, katai iwa kara abura o suwase,
Ushi no gyounyuu, hitsuji no chichi, kohitsuji to ohitsuji no shibou, Bashan no ushi to o yagi, komugi no yoi mono o kuwaserareta. Mata anata wa budou no shiru no awatatsu sake o nonda.
Shikaru ni Eshurun wa koefutotte, ashi de ketta. Anata wa koefutotte, tsuyayaka ni nari, jibun o tsukutta kami o sute, sukui no iwa o anadotta.
Karera wa hoka no kamigami ni tsukaete, Shu no netami o okoshi, nikumubeki okonai o motte Shu no ikari o hikiokoshita.
Karera wa kami de mo nai akurei ni gisei o sasageta. Sore wa karera ga katsute shiranakatta kamigami, chikagoro deta atarashii kamigami, senzotachi no osoreru koto mo shinakatta mono de aru.
Anata wa jibun o unda iwa o karonji, jibun o tsukutta kami o wasureta.
Shu wa kore o mi, sono musuko, musume o ikatte sore o suterareta.
Soshite iwareta, 'Watashi wa watashi no kao o karera ni kakusou. Watashi wa karera no owari ga dou naru ka o miyou. Karera wa somuki, motoruyakara, shinjitsu no nai kora de aru.
Karera wa kami de mo nai mono o motte, watashi ni netami o okosase, guuzou o motte, watashi o ikaraseta. Sore yue, watashi wa tami to mo ienai mono o motte, karera ni netami o okosase, oroka na tami o motte, karera o ikaraserude arou.
Watashi no ikari ni yotte, hi wa moe ide, yomi no fukami ni made moe iki, chi to sono sanbutsu to o yakitsukushi, yamayama no motoi o moyasude arou.
Watashi wa karera no ue ni wazawai o tsumikasane, watashi no ya o karera ni mukatte itsu kusu de arou.
Karera wa uete, yaseotoroe, netsubyou to warui ekibyou ni yotte horobirude arou. Watashi wa karera o kemono no ha ni kakarase, chi ni hau mono no doku ni ataraserude arou.
Soto ni wa tsurugi, uchi ni wa osore ga atte, wakaki otoko mo wakaki onna mo, chi nomi go mo, shiraga no hito mo horobirude arou.
Watashi wa masani iou to shita, "Karera o tooku chirashi, karera no koto o hitobito ga kioku shinai you ni shiyou".
Shikashi, watashi wa teki ga hokoru no o osoreru. A da bi to wa machigaete iude arou, "Wareware no te ga kachi o eta no da. Kore wa mina Shu ga sareta koto de wa nai"'.
Karera wa shiryo no kaketa tami, sono uchi ni wa chishiki ga nai.
Moshi, karera ni chie ga areba, kore o satori, sono mi no owari o wakimaetade arou ni.
Karera no iwa ga karera o urazu, Shu ga karera o watasarenakattanaraba, dou shite, hitori de sennin o oi, futari de mannin o yaburu koto ga dekitade arou.
Karera no iwa wa warera no iwa ni oyobanai. Warera no teki mo kore o mitomete iru.
Karera no budou no ki wa, Sodomu no budou no ki kara deta mono, mata Gomora no no kara deta mono, sono budou wa doku budou, sono fusa wa nigai.
Sono budoushu wa hebi no doku no you, mamushi no osoroshii doku no you de aru.
Kore wa watashi no moto ni takuwaerare, watashi no kura ni fuujikomerarete irude wa nai ka.
Karera no ashi ga suberu toki, watashi wa ada o kaeshi, mukui o surude arou. Karera no wazawai no hi wa chikaku, karera no hametsu wa, sumiyaka ni kurude arou.
Shu wa tsuini sono tami o sabaki, sono shimobera ni awaremi o kuwaerarerude arou. Kore wa karera no chikara ga use sari, tsunagareta mono mo tsunagarenai mono mo, mohaya inaku natta no o, Shu ga mirarerukara de aru.
Sono toki Shu wa iwarerude arou, 'Karera no kamigami wa doko ni iru ka, karera no tanomi to shita iwa wa doko ni aru ka.
Karera no gisei no abura o kui, kansai no sake o nonda mono wa doko ni iru ka. Tachiagatte anatagata o tasukesase yo, anatagata o mamorase yo.
Imami yo, watashi koso wa kare de aru. Watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai. Watashi wa koroshi, mata ikashi, kizutsuke, mata iyasu. Watashi no te kara sukuidashi uru mono wa nai.
Watashi wa ten ni mukai te o agete chikau, "Watashi wa eien ni ikiru.
Watashi ga kirameku tsurugi o togi, te ni sabaki o nigiru toki, watashi wa teki ni ada o kaeshi, watashi o nikumu mono ni houfuku surude arou.
Watashi no ya o chi ni yowase, watashi no tsurugi ni niku o kuwaserude arou. Korosareta mono to toraerareta mono no chi o nomase, teki no chouhatsu no atama no niku o kuwaserude arou"'.
Kuniguni no tami yo, Shu no tami no tame ni yorokobiutae. Shu wa sono shimobe no chi no tame ni houfuku shi, sono teki ni ada o kaeshi, sono tami no chi no kegare o kiyomerarerukara de aru".
Moose to Nun no ko Yoshua wa tomo ni itte, kono uta no kotoba o, kotogotoku tami ni yomikikaseta.
Moose wa kono kotoba o, kotogotoku Isuraeru no subete no hito ni tsuge owatte,
Karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi ga, kyou, anata gata ni meijiru kono subete no kotoba o kokoro ni osame, kodomotachi ni mo kono rippou no subete no kotoba o mamori okonau koto o meijinakereba naranai.
Kono kotoba wa anata gata ni totte, munashii kotoba de wa nai. Kore wa anata gata no inochi de aru. Kono kotoba ni yori, anata gata wa Yorudan o watatte itte toru chi de, nagaku inochi o tamotsu koto ga dekirude arou".
Kono hi, Shu wa Moose ni iwareta,
"Anata wa Eriko ni taisuru Moabu no chi ni aru Abarimuyama sunawachi Neboyama ni nobori, watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataete esaseru Kanan no chi o miwa tase.
Anata wa nobotte iku sono yama de shini, anata no tami ni tsuranarude arou. Anata no kyoudai Aron ga Horu yama de shinde sono tami ni tsuranatta you ni narude arou.
Kore wa anata gata ga Chin no arano ni aru meribate kadeshi no mizu no hotori de, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi de watashi ni somuki, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi de watashi o sei naru mono to shite uyamawanakattakara de aru.
Sore de anata wa watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeru chi o, me no mae ni mirude arou. Shikashi, sono chi ni, hairu koto wa dekinai".
Kami no hito Moose wa shinu mae ni Isuraeru no hitobito o shukufuku shita. Shukufuku no kotoba wa tsugi no toori de aru.
"Shu wa Shinai kara korare, Seiru kara wareware ni mukatte noborare, Paran no yama kara hikari o hanatare, chi yorozu no seija no naka kara korareta. Sono migi no te ni wa moeru hi ga atta.
Makoto ni Shu wa sono tami o aisareru. Subete Shu ni seibetsu sareta mono wa, mite no uchi ni aru. Karera wa anata no ashimoto ni zashite, oshie o ukeru.
Moose wa wareware ni rippou o sazukete, Yakobu no kaishuu no shoyuu to saseta.
Tami no kashiratachi ga atsumari, Isuraeru no buzoku ga mina atsumatta toki, Shu wa Eshurun no uchi ni ou to narareta".
"Ruben wa ikiru, shi ni wa shinai. Shikashi, sono ninzuu wa sukunaku narude arou".
Yuda ni tsuite wa, kou itta, "Shu yo, Yuda no koe o kiite, kare o sono tami ni michibiki kaeshite kudasai. Mite o motte, kare no tame ni tatakatte kudasai. Kare o tasukete, teki ni atarasete kudasai".
Rebi ni tsuite wa itta, "Anata no tonmimu o Rebi ni ataete kudasai. Urimu o anata ni tsukaeru hito ni ataete kudasai. Katsute anata wa Massa de kare o kokoromi, Meriba no mizu no hotori de kare to arasowareta.
Kare wa sono chichi, sono haha ni tsuite itta, 'Watashi wa karera o kaeriminai'. Kare wa jibun no kyoudai o mo mitomezu, jibun no kodomo o mo kaeriminakatta. Karera wa anata no kotoba ni shitagai, anata no keiyaku o mamottakara de aru.
Karera wa anata no okite o Yakobu ni oshie, anata no rippou o Isuraeru ni oshie, kunkou o anata no mae ni sonae, hansai o saidan no ue ni sasageru.
Shu yo, kare no chikara o shukufuku shi, kare no te no waza o yorokobi ukete kudasai. Kare ni sakarau mono to, kare o nikumu mono to no koshi o uchikudaite, tachiagaru koto no dekinai you ni shite kudasai".
Beniyamin ni tsuite wa itta, "Shu ni aisareru mono, kare wa yasuraka ni Shu no soba ni ori, Shu wa shuujitsu, kare o mamori, sono kata no aida ni sumai o itonamarerude arou".
Yosefu ni tsuite wa itta, "Douzo Shu ga kare no chi o shukufuku sareru you ni. Ue naru ten no tamamono to tsuyu, shita ni yokotawaru fuchi no tamamono,
Hi ni yotte sansuru tattoi tamamono, tsuki ni yotte shouzuru tattoi tamamono,
Inishie no yamayama no sansuru tamamono, tokoshie no oka no tattoi tamamono,
Chi to sore ni michiru tattoi tamamono, shiba no naka ni orareta mono no megumi ga, Yosefu no atama ni nozomi, sono kyoudaitachi no kun taru mono no atama no itadaki ni kudaru you ni.
Kare no ushi no ui go wa igen ga ari, sono tsuno wa yagyuu no tsuno no you, kore o motte kuniguni no tami o kotogotoku tsukitaoshi, chi no hate ni made oyobu. Kono you na mono wa Efuraimu ni iku man to ari, mata kono you na mono wa Manase ni iku sen to aru".
Zeburun ni tsuite wa itta, "Zeburun yo, anata wa soto ni dete tanoshimi o e yo. Issakaru yo, anata wa tenmaku ni ite tanoshimi o e yo.
Karera wa kuniguni no tami o yama ni maneki, sono tokoro de tadashii gisei o sasagerude arou. Karera wa umi no tomi o sui, suna ni kakureta takara o torukara de aru".
Gado ni tsuite wa itta, "Gado o ookiku suru mono wa, ho mubeki ka na. Gado wa, shishi no you ni fushi, ude ya atama no itadaki o kakisakude arou.
Kare wa hatsuho no chi o jibun no tame ni eranda. Soko ni wa shougun no bun mo toriokarete ita. Kare wa tami no kashiratachi to tomo ni kite, Isuraeru to tomo ni Shu no seigi to shinpan to o okonatta".
Dan ni tsuite wa itta, "Dan wa shishi no ko de atte, Bashan kara odorideru".
Nafutari ni tsuite wa itta, "Nafutari yo, anata wa megumi ni mitasare, Shu no shukufuku ni michite, mizuumi to sono minami no chi o shoyuu suru".
Aseru ni tsuite wa itta, "Aseru wa ta no kora ni masatte shukufuku sareru. Kare wa sono kyoudaitachi ni aiserare, sono ashi o abura ni hitasu koto ga dekiru you ni.
Anata no kannoki wa tetsu to seidou, anata no chikara wa anata no toshi to tomo ni tsuzukude arou".
"Eshurun yo, kami ni narabu mono wa hoka ni nai. Anata o tasukeru tame ni ten ni nori, ikou o motte sora o toorareru.
Tokoshie ni imasu kami wa anata no sumika de ari, shita ni wa eien no ude ga aru. Teki o anata no mae kara oiharatte, 'Horobose' to iwareta.
Isuraeru wa yasuraka ni sumi, Yakobu no izumi wa kokumotsu to budoushu no chi ni, hitori irude arou. Mata ten wa tsuyu o kudasude arou.
Isuraeru yo, anata wa shiawase de aru. Dare ga anata no you ni, Shu ni sukuwareta tami ga arude arou ka. Shu wa anata o tasukeru tate, anata no ikou no tsurugi, anata no teki wa anata ni hetsurai fukushi, anata wa karera no takaki tokoro o fumisusumude arou".
Moose wa Moabu no heiya kara Neboyama ni nobori, Eriko no mukai no Pisuga no itadaki e itta. Soko de Shu wa kare ni Gireade no zenchi o Dan made shimeshi,
Nafutari no zenbu, Efuraimu to Manase no chi oyobi Yuda no zenchi o nishi no umi made shimeshi,
Negebu to teichi, sunawachi, shuro no machi Eriko no tani o Zoaru made shimesareta.
Soshite Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi ga Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ni, kore o anata no shison ni ataeru to itte chikatta chi wa kore de aru. Watashi wa kore o anata no me ni miseruga, anata wa soko e watatte iku koto wa dekinai".
Kou shite Shu no shimobe Moose wa Shu no kotoba no toori ni Moabu no chi de shinda.
Shu wa kare o Betepeoru ni taisuru Moabu no chi no tani ni houmuraretaga, konnichi made sono haka o shiru hito wa nai.
Moose wa shinda toki, hyaku nijuusai de attaga, me wa kasumazu, kiryoku wa otoroete inakatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Moabu no heiya de sanjuu nichi no aida Moose no tame ni naita. Soshite Moose no tame ni nakikanashimu hi wa tsuini owatta.
Nun no ko Yoshua wa chie no rei ni michita hito de atta. Moose ga kare no ue ni te o oitakara de aru. Isuraeru no hitobito wa kare ni kikishitagai, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta toori ni okonatta.
Isuraeru ni wa, kono nochi Moose no you na yogensha wa okoranakatta. Moose wa Shu ga kao o awasete shirareta mono de atta.
Shu wa Ejiputo no chi de kare o Paro to sono subete no kerai oyobi sono zenchi ni tsukawashite, moromoro no shirushi to fushigi o okonawaserareta.
Moose wa Isuraeru no subete no hito no mae de ooinaru chikara o arawashi, ooinaru osorubeki koto o okonatta.
Shu no shimobe Moose ga shinda nochi, Shu wa Moose no juusha, Nun no ko Yoshua ni iwareta,
"Watashi no shimobe Moose wa shinda. Sore yue, ima anata to, kono subete no tami to wa, tomo ni tatte, kono Yorudan o watari, watashi ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni ataeru chi ni iki nasai.
Anata ga taga, ashi no ura de fumu tokoro wa mina, watashi ga Moose ni yakusoku shita you ni, anata gata ni ataerude arou.
Anata gata no ryouiki wa, arano kara Rebanon ni oyobi, mata ookawa Yufurate kara Hete bito no zenchi ni watari, hi no iru hou no taikai ni tassurude arou.
Anata ga ikinagaraeru hi no aida, anata ni ataru koto no dekiru mono wa, hitori mo naide arou. Watashi wa, Moose to tomo ni ita you ni, anata to tomo ni orude arou. Watashi wa anata o mihanasu koto mo, misute ru koto mo shinai.
Tsuyoku, mata ooshiku are. Anata wa kono tami ni, watashi ga karera ni ataeruto, sono senzotachi ni chikatta chi o esasenakereba naranai.
Tada tsuyoku, mata ooshiku atte, watashi no shimobe Moose ga anata ni meijita rippou o kotogotoku mamotte okonai, kore o hanarete migi ni mo hidari ni mo magatte wa naranai. Sore wa subete anata ga iku tokoro de, shouri o eru tame de aru.
Kono rippou no sho o anata no kuchi kara hanasu koto naku, hiru mo yoru mo sore o omoi, sono uchi ni shirusarete iru koto o, kotogotoku mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Sou surunaraba, anata no michi wa sakae, anata wa shouri o erude arou.
Watashi wa anata ni meijitade wa nai ka. Tsuyoku, mata ooshiku are. Anata ga doko e iku ni mo, anata no kami, Shu ga tomo ni orareru yue, osorete wa naranai, ononoite wa naranai".
Soko de Yoshua wa tami no tsukasatachi ni meijite itta,
"Shukuei no naka o megutte tami ni meijite ii nasai, 'Ryoushoku no sonae o shi nasai. Mikka no uchi ni, anata gata wa kono Yorudan o watatte, anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata ni ataete esaseyou to sareru chi o eru tame ni, susumi ikanakereba naranaikara de aru' ".
Yoshua wa mata Ruben bi to, Gado bi to, oyobi Manase no han buzoku ni itta,
"Shu no shimobe Moose ga anata gata ni meijite, 'Anata gata no kami, Shu wa anata gata no tame ni ansoku no basho o sonae, kono chi o anata gata ni tamawarude arou' to itta kotoba o kioku shi nasai.
Anata gata no saishi to kachiku to wa, Moose ga anata gata ni ataeta Yorudan no kochiragawa no chi ni todomaranakereba naranai. Shikashi, anata gata no uchi no yuushi wa mina busou shite, kyoudaitachi no saki ni tatte watari, kore o tasukenakereba naranai.
Soshite Shu ga anata gata ni tamawatta you ni, anata gata no kyoudaitachi ni mo ansoku o tamawari, karera mo anata gata no kami, Shu ga tamawaru chi o eru you ni narunaraba, anata gata wa, Shu no shimobe Moose kara ataerareta, Yorudan no kochiragawa, hinode no hou ni aru, anata gata no shoyuu no chi ni kaette, sore o tamotsu koto ga dekirude arou".
Karera wa Yoshua ni kotaeta, "Anata ga wareware ni meijirareta koto o mina okonaimasu. Anata ga tsukawasareru tokoro e wa, doko e de mo ikimasu.
Wareware wa subete no koto o Moose ni kikishitagatta you ni, anata ni kikishitagaimasu. Tada, douzo, anata no kami, Shu ga Moose to tomo ni orareta you ni, anata to tomo ni oraremasu you ni.
Dare de atte mo, anata no meirei ni somuki, anata no meijirareru kotoba ni kikishitagawanai mono ga areba, ikashite wa okimasen. Tada, tsuyoku, mata ooshiku atte kudasai".
Nun no ko Yoshua wa, Shittemu kara, hisoka ni futari no sekkou o tsukawashite karera ni itta, "Itte, sono chi, tokuni Eriko o saguri nasai". Karera wa itte, na o Rahabu to iu yuujo no ie ni hairi, soko ni tomattaga,
Eriko no ou ni, "Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi no suu mei no mono ga kon'ya kono chi o saguru tame ni, haitte kimashita" to iu mono ga atta no de,
Eriko no ou wa hito o yatte Rahabu ni itta, "Anata no tokoro ni kite, anata no ie ni haitta hitobito o koko e dashi nasai. Karera wa kono kuni no subete o saguru tame ni kita no desu".
Shikashi, onna wa sudeni sono futari no hito o irete karera o kakushite ita. Soshite kanojo wa itta, "Tashika ni sono hitobito wa watashi no tokoro ni kimashita. Shikashi, watashi wa sono hitobito ga doko kara kita no ka shirimasendeshitaga,
Tasogaretoki, mon no tojiru koro ni, sono hitobito wa dete ikimashita. Doko e itta no ka watashi wa shirimasen. Isoide ato o oi nasai. Oitsukerudeshou".
Sono jitsu, kanojo wa sudeni karera o tsurete yane ni nobori, okujou ni narabete atta ama no kuki no naka ni karera o kakushite ita no de aru.
Soko de sono hitobito wa karera no ato o otte Yorudan no michi o susumi, watashiba e mukatta. Ato o ou mono ga dete ikuto sugu mon wa tozasareta.
Futari no hito ga mada nenai uchi, Rahabu wa okujou ni nobotte karera no tokoro ni kita.
Soshite karera ni itta, "Shu ga kono chi o anata gata ni tamawatta koto, watashitachi ga anatagata o hijou ni osorete iru koto, soshite kono chi no tami ga mina anata gata no mae ni furueononoite iru koto o watashi wa shitte imasu.
Anata gata ga Ejiputo kara dete korareta toki, Shu ga anata gata no mae de koukai no mizu o hosareta koto, oyobi anata ga taga, Yorudan no mukougawa ni ita Amori bito no futari no ou Shihon to Ogu ni sareta koto, sunawachi futari o, zenmetsu sareta koto o, watashitachi wa kiitakara desu.
Watashitachi wa sore o kikuto, kokoro wa kie, anata gata no yue ni hitobito wa mattaku yuuki o ushinatte shimaimashita. Anata gata no kami, Shu wa ue no ten ni mo, shita no chi ni mo, kami de iraserarerukara desu.
Sore de, dou ka, watashi ga anatagata o shinsetsu ni atsukatta you ni, anata gata mo, watashi no chichi no ie o shinsetsu ni atsukawareru koto o ima Shu o sashite chikai, tashika na shirushi o kudasai.
Soshite watashi no fubo, kyoudai, shimai oyobi subete karera ni zokusuru mono o ikinagaraesase, watashitachi no inochi o sukutte, shi o manukaresasete kudasai".
Futari no hito wa kanojo ni itta, "Moshi anata ga taga, wareware no kono koto o ta ni morasanainaraba, wareware wa inochi ni kakete, anatagata o sukuimasu. Mata Shu ga wareware ni kono chi o tamawaru toki, anatagata o shinsetsu ni atsukai, shinjitsu o tsukushimashou".
Soko de Rahabu wa tsuna o motte karera o mado kara tsurioroshita. Sono ie ga machi no jouheki no ue ni tatte ite, kanojo wa sono jouheki no ue ni sunde itakara de aru.
Rahabu wa karera ni itta, "Otte ni awanai you ni, anata gata wa yama e itte, mikka no aida soko ni mi o kakushi, otte no kaette iku no o matte, sore kara satte iki nasai".
Futari no hito wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata ga wareware ni chikawaseta kono chikai ni tsuite, wareware wa tsumi o okashimasen.
Wareware ga kono chi ni uchiiru toki, watashitachi o tsurioroshita mado ni, kono akai ito no himo o musubitsuke, mata anata no fubo, kyoudai, oyobi anata no chichi no kazoku o mina anata no ie ni atsume nasai.
Hitori de mo ie no toguchi kara soto e dete, chi o nagasareru koto ga areba, sono seme wa sono hito jishin no koube ni kisudeshou. Wareware ni tsumi wa arimasen. Shikashi anata no ie no naka ni iru hito ni te o kakete chi o nagasu koto ga areba, sono seme wa wareware no koube ni kisudeshou.
Mata anata ga, wareware no kono koto o ta ni morasunaraba, anata ga wareware ni chikawaseta chikai ni tsuite wa, wareware ni tsumi wa arimasen".
Rahabu wa itta, "Anata gata no oose no toori ni itashimashou". Kou shite karera o okuridashita no de, karera wa satta. Soshite kanojo wa akai himo o mado ni musunda.
Karera wa tachisatte yama ni hairi, otte ga kaeru no o matte, mikka no aida soko ni todomatta. Otte wa karera o amaneku michi ni sagashitaga, tsuini mitsukeru koto ga dekinakatta.
Kou shite futari no hito wa mata yama o kudari, kawa o watatte, Nun no ko Yoshua no moto ni kite, sono mi ni tatta koto o tsubusani nobeta.
Soshite Yoshua ni itta, "Hontou ni Shu wa kono kuni o kotogotoku wareware no te ni oatae ni narimashita. Kono kuni no juumin wa mina wareware no mae ni furueononoite imasu".
Yoshua wa asa hayaku oki, Isuraeru no hitobito subete to tomo ni Shittemu o shuttatsu shite, Yorudan ni iki, sore o watarazu ni, soko ni yadotta.
Mikka no nochi, tsukasatachi wa shukuei no naka o iki meguri,
Tami ni meijite itta, "Rebi bito de aru saishitachi ga, anata gata no kami, Shu no keiyaku no hako o kakiageru no o mirunaraba, anata gata wa sono tokoro o shuttatsu shite, sono ato ni shitagawanakereba naranai.
Sou sureba, anata gata wa ikubeki michi o shiru koto ga dekirude arou. Anata gata wa mae ni kono michi o tootta koto ga naikara de aru. Shikashi, anata gata to hako to no aida ni wa, ooyoso nisen kyubito no kyori o okanakereba naranai. Sore ni chikazuite wa naranai".
Yoshua wa mata tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa mi o kiyome nasai. Asu, Shu ga anata gata no uchi ni fushigi o okonawarerukara de aru".
Yoshua wa saishitachi ni itta, "Keiyaku no hako o kaki, tami ni sakidatte watari nasai". Soko de karera wa keiyaku no hako o kaki, tami ni sakidatte susunda.
Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Kyou kara watashi wa subete no Isuraeru no mae ni anata o tattoi mono to surude arou. Kou shite watashi ga Moose to tomo ni ita you ni, anata to tomo ni oru koto o karera ni shiraserude arou.
Anata wa keiyaku no hako o kaku saishitachi ni meijite iwanakereba naranai, 'Anata gata wa, Yorudan no mizugiwa e ikuto, sugu, Yorudan no naka ni tachi todomaranakereba naranai' ".
Yoshua wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Anata gata wa koko ni chikazuite, anata gata no kami, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai".
Soshite Yoshua wa itta, "Ikeru kami ga anata gata no uchi ni oide ni nari, anata gata no mae kara, Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Hibi bi to, Periji bi to, Girugashi bi to, Amori bi to, Ebusu bito o, kanarazu oiharawareru koto o, tsugi no koto ni yotte, anata gata wa shirude arou.
Goran nasai. Zenchi no Shu no keiyaku no hako wa, anata gata ni sakidatte Yorudan o watarou to shite iru.
Sore yue, ima, Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi kara, buzokugoto ni hitori zutsu, awasete juu ninin o erabi nasai.
Zenchi no Shu naru kami no hako o kaku saishitachi no ashi no ura ga, Yorudan no mizu no naka ni fumitodomaru toki, Yorudan no mizu wa nagare o sekitomerare, ue kara nagarekudaru mizu wa todomatte, uzutakaku narude arou".
Kou shite tami wa Yorudan o watarou to shite tenmaku o idetachi, saishitachi wa keiyaku no hako o kaki, tami ni sakidatte ittaga,
Hako o kaku mono ga Yorudan ni kite, hako o kaku saishitachi no ashi ga mizugiwa ni hitaruto douji ni, - - Yorudan wa kariire no aidajyuu, kishi ichimen ni afureru no de aruga, - -
Ue kara nagarekudaru mizu wa todomatte, haruka tooku no Zaretan no katawara ni aru machi Adamu no atari de, uzutakaku tachi, Araba no umi sunawachi shio no umi no hou ni nagarekudaru mizu wa mattaku sekitomerareta no de, tami wa Eriko ni mukatte watatta.
Subete no Isuraeru ga, kawaita chi o watatte iku aida, Shu no keiyaku no hako o kaku saishitachi wa, Yorudan no naka no kawaita chi ni tatte ita. Soshite tsuini tami wa mina Yorudan o watari owatta.
Tami ga mina, Yorudan o watari owatta toki, Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta,
"Tami no uchi kara, buzokugoto ni hitori zutsu, awasete juu ninin o erabi,
Karera ni meijite ii nasai, 'Yorudan no naka de saishitachi ga ashi o fumi todometa sono tokoro kara, ishi juu ni o tori, sore o tazusaete watari, kon'ya anata gata ga yadoru basho ni sue nasai' ".
Soko de Yoshua wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi kara, buzokugoto ni, hitori zutsu, kanete sadamete oita juu ninin no mono o meshiyose,
Yoshua wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no kami, Shu no keiyaku no hako no mae ni tatte iki, Yorudan no naka ni susumihairi, Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku no kazu ni shitagatte, onoono ishi hitotsu o toriage, kata ni nosete hakobi nasai.
Kore wa anata gata no uchi ni, shirushi to narude arou. Nochi no hi ni natte, anata gata no kodomotachi ga, 'Korera no ishi wa, dou shita wake desu ka' to tounaraba,
Sono toki anata gata wa karera ni, mukashi Yorudan no mizu ga, Shu no keiyaku no hako no mae de, sekitomerareta koto, sunawachi sono hako ga Yorudan o watatta toki, Yorudan no mizu ga, sekitomerareta koto o tsugenakereba naranai. Kou shite, sorera no ishi wa eikyuu ni Isuraeru no hitobito no kinen to narude arou".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Yoshua ga meijita you ni shi, Shu ga Yoshua ni iwareta you ni, Isuraeru no hitobito no buzoku no kazu ni shitagatte, Yorudan no naka kara juu ni no ishi o tori, sore o tazusaete watari, karera no yadoru basho e itte, soko ni sueta.
Yoshua wa mata Yorudan no naka de, keiyaku no hako o kaku saishitachi ga, ashi o fumi todometa tokoro ni, juu ni no ishi o tatetaga, konnichi made, soko ni nokotte iru.
Hako o kaku saishitachi wa, Shu ga Yoshua ni meijite, tami ni tsugesaserareta koto ga, subete okonawarete shimau made, Yorudan no naka ni tatte ita. Subete Moose ga Yoshua ni meijita toori de aru. Tami wa isoide watatta.
Tami ga mina watari owatta toki, Shu no hako to saishitachi to wa, tami no miru mae de watatta.
Ruben no shison to Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no buzoku no nakaba wa, Moose ga karera ni meijite ita you ni busou shite, Isuraeru no hitobito ni sakidatte watari,
Tatakai no tame ni busou shita ooyoso yon man no mono ga tatakau tame, Shu no mae ni watatte, Eriko no heiya ni tsuita.
Kono hi, Shu wa Isuraeru no subete no hito no mae ni Yoshua o tattoi mono to sareta no de, karera wa mina Moose o uyamatta you ni, Yoshua o isshou no aida uyamatta.
Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta,
"Akashi no hako o kaku saishitachi ni meijite, Yorudan kara agatte kosase nasai".
Yoshua wa saishitachi ni meijite itta, "Yorudan kara agatte ki nasai".
Shu no keiyaku no hako o kaku saishitachi wa Yorudan no naka kara agatte kitaga, saishitachi no ashi no ura ga kawaita chi ni agaruto douji ni, Yorudan no mizu wa moto no tokoro ni nagare kaette, izen no you ni, sono kishi ni kotogotoku afureta.
Tami wa shougatsu no tooka ni, Yorudan kara agatte kite, Eriko no higashi no sakai ni aru Girugaru ni shukuei shita.
Soshite Yoshua wa, hitobito ga Yorudan kara totte kita juu ni no ishi o Girugaru ni tate,
Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Nochi no hi ni anata gata no kodomotachi ga, sono chichi ni 'Korera no ishi wa, dou shita wake desu ka' to tazunetanaraba,
'Mukashi Isuraeru ga kono Yorudan o, kawaita chi ni sarete watatta no da' to itte, sono kodomotachi ni shirasenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi anata gata no kami, Shu wa Yorudan no mizu o, anata gata no tame ni hoshi kara shite, anatagata o watarasete kudasatta. Sore wa atakamo, anata gata no kami, Shu ga, wareware no tame ni koukai o hoshi kara shite, wareware o watarasete kudasatta no to onaji de aru.
Kono you ni sareta no wa, chi no subete no tami ni, Shu no te ni chikara no aru koto o shirase, anata gata no kami, Shu o tsune ni osoresaseru tame de aru".
Yorudan no mukougawa, sunawachi nishi no hou ni oru Amori bito no outachi to, umibe ni oru Kanan bito no outachi to wa mina, Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae de, Yorudan no mizu o hoshi kara shite, karera o wataraserareta to kiite, Isuraeru no hitobito no yue ni, kokoro wa kie, karera no uchi ni, mohaya genki mo nakunatta.
Sono toki, Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Hiuchiishi no kogatana o tsukuri, kasanete mata Isuraeru no hitobito ni katsurei o okonai nasai".
Soko de Yoshua wa hiuchiishi no kogatana o tsukuri, you hi no oka de, Isuraeru no hitobito ni katsurei o okonatta.
Yoshua ga hitobito ni katsurei o okonatta riyuu wa kou de aru. Ejiputo kara dete kita tami no uchi no, subete no danshi, sunawachi, iku sabi to tachi wa mina, Ejiputo o deta nochi, tochuu, arano de shindaga,
Sono dete kita tami wa mina, katsurei o uketa mono de atta. Shikashi, Ejiputo o deta nochi ni, tochuu, arano de umareta tami wa, mina katsurei o ukete inakatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa yonjuu nen no aida, arano o aruite ite, sono Ejiputo kara dete kita tami, sunawachi, iku sabi to tachi wa, mina shinitaeta. Kore wa karera ga Shu no koe ni kikishitagawanakatta no de, Shu wa karera no senzotachi ni chikatte, wareware ni ataeru to ooserareta chi, chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi o, karera ni misasenai to chikawaretakara de aru.
Yoshua ga katsurei o okonatta no wa, kono hitobito ni tsuide okosareta sono kodomotachi de atta. Karera wa tochuu de katsurei o ukete inakatta no de, mukatsurei no mono de attakara de aru.
Subete no tami ni katsurei o okonau koto ga owatta no de, tami wa shukuei no uchi no jibun no tokoro ni todomatte kizu no naoru no o matta.
Sono toki, Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Kyou, watashi wa Ejiputo no hazukashime o, anata gata kara korogashi satta". Sore de sono tokoro no na wa, konnichi made Girugaru to yobarete iru.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Girugaru ni shukuei shite itaga, sono tsuki no juu yonka no yuugure, Eriko no heiya de sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta.
Soshite sugikoshi no matsuri no yokujitsu, sono chi no kokumotsu, sunawachi tane irenu pan oyobi iri mugi o, sono hi ni tabetaga,
Sono chi no kokumotsu o tabeta yokujitsu kara, mana no furu koto wa yami, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, mohaya mana o enakatta. Sono toshi wa Kanan no chi no sanbutsu o tabeta.
Yoshua ga Eriko no chikaku ni ita toki, me o agete miruto, hitori no hito ga nukimi no tsurugi o te ni mochi, kochira ni mukatte tatte ita no de, Yoshua wa sono hito no tokoro e itte itta, "Anata wa wareware o tasukeru no desu ka. Sore to mo wareware no teki o tasukeru no desu ka".
Kare wa itta, "Iya, watashi wa Shu no gunzei no shou to shite ima kita no da". Yoshua wa chi ni hirefushi haishite itta, "Waga Shu wa nani o shimobe ni tsugeyou to sareru no desu ka".
Suru to Shu no gunzei no shou wa Yoshua ni itta, "Anata no ashi no kutsu o nugi nasai. Anata ga tatte iru tokoro wa sei naru tokoro de aru". Yoshua wa sono you ni shita.
Sate Eriko wa, Isuraeru no hitobito no yue ni, kataku tozashite, deiri suru mono ga nakatta.
Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa Eriko to, sono ou oyobi daiyuushi o, anata no te ni watashite iru.
Anata gata, iku sabi to wa mina, machi o megutte, machi no shuui o ichi do mawaranakereba naranai. Muika no aida sono you ni shinakereba naranai.
Shichinin no saishitachi wa, onoono ohitsuji no tsuno no rappa o tazusaete, hako ni sakidatanakereba naranai. Soshite nanuka me ni wa nana do machi o meguri, saishitachi wa rappa o fukinarasanakereba naranai.
Soshite saishitachi ga ohitsuji no tsuno o nagaku fukinarashi, sono rappa no oto ga, anata gata ni kikoeru toki, tami wa mina oogoe ni yobawari, sakebanakereba naranai. Sou sureba, machi no shuui no ishigaki wa, kuzureochi, tami wa mina tadachini susunde, semenoboru koto ga dekiru".
Nun no ko Yoshua wa saishitachi o meshite itta, "Anata gata wa keiyaku no hako o kaki, shichinin no saishitachi wa ohitsuji no tsuno no rappa nanahon o tazusaete, Shu no hako ni sakidatanakereba naranai".
Soshite tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa susunde itte machi o meguri nasai. Busou shita mono wa Shu no hako ni sakidatte susumanakereba naranai".
Yoshua ga tami ni meijita you ni, shichinin no saishitachi wa, ohitsuji no tsuno no rappa nanahon o tazusaete, Shu ni sakidatte susumi, rappa o fukinarashita. Shu no keiyaku no hako wa sono ato ni shitagatta.
Busou shita mono wa rappa o fukinarasu saishitachi ni sakidatte iki, shingari wa hako ni shitagatta. Rappa wa taema naku narihibiita.
Shikashi, Yoshua wa tami ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa yobawatte wa naranai. Anata gata no koe o kikoesasete wa naranai. Mata kuchi kara kotoba o dashite wa naranai. Tada, watashi ga yobaware to meijiru hi ni, anata gata wa yobawaranakereba naranai".
Kou shite Shu no hako o motte, machi o megurase, sono shuui o ichi do mawaraseta. Hitobito wa shukuei ni kaeri, yoru o shukuei de sugoshita.
Yokuasa Yoshua wa hayaku oki, saishitachi wa Shu no hako o kaki,
Shichinin no saishitachi wa, ohitsuji no tsuno no rappa nanahon o tazusaete, Shu no hako ni sakidachi, taezu, rappa o fukinarashite susumi, busou shita mono wa kore ni sakidatte iki, shingari wa Shu no hako ni shitagatta. Rappa wa taema naku narihibiita.
Sono tsugi no hi ni mo, machi no shuui o ichi do megutte shukuei ni kaetta. Muika no aida sono you ni shita.
Nanuka me ni wa, yoake ni, hayaku oki, onaji you ni shite, machi o shichi do megutta. Machi o shichi do megutta no wa kono hi dake de atta.
Nana dome ni, saishitachi ga rappa o fuita toki, Yoshua wa tami ni itta, "Yobawari nasai. Shu wa kono machi o anata gata ni tamawatta.
Kono machi to, sono naka no subete no mono wa, Shu e no hounoubutsu to shite horobosarenakereba naranai. Tadashi yuujo Rahabu to, sono ie ni tomo ni oru mono wa mina ikashite okanakereba naranai. Wareware ga okutta shishatachi o kakumattakara de aru.
Mata, anata gata wa, hounoubutsu ni te o furete wa naranai. Hounou ni atari, sono hounoubutsu o mizukara totte, Isuraeru no shukuei o, horobosarubeki mono to shi, sore o nayamasu koto no nai tame de aru.
Tadashi, gin to kin, seidou to tetsu no utsuwa wa, mina Shu ni sei naru mono de arukara, Shu no kura ni tazusae irenakereba naranai".
Soko de tami wa yobawari, saishitachi wa rappa o fukinarashita. Tami wa rappa no oto o kikuto douji ni, mina oogoe o agete yobawatta no de, ishigaki wa kuzureochita. Soko de tami wa mina, sugu ni nobotte machi ni hairi, machi o semetotta.
Soshite machi ni aru mono wa, otoko mo, onna mo, wakai mono mo, oita mono mo, mata ushi, hitsuji, roba o mo, kotogotoku tsurugi ni kakete horoboshita.
Sono toki Yoshua wa, kono chi o sagutta futari no hito ni itta, "Ano yuujo no ie ni haitte, sono onna to kanojo ni zokusuru subete no mono o tsuredashi, kanojo ni chikatta you ni shi nasai".
Sekkou to natta sono wakai hitotachi wa hai tte, Rahabu to sono fubo, kyoudai, sono hoka kanojo ni zokusuru subete no mono o tsuredashi, sono shinzoku o mina tsuredashite, Isuraeru no shukuei no soto ni oita.
Soshite hi de machi to sono naka no subete no mono o yaita. Tada, gin to kin, seidou to tetsu no utsuwa wa, Shu no ie no kura ni osameta.
Shikashi, yuujo Rahabu to sono chichi no ie no ichizoku to kanojo ni zokusuru subete no mono to wa, Yoshua ga ikashite oita no de, Rahabu wa konnichi made Isuraeru no uchi ni sunde iru. Kore wa Yoshua ga Eriko o saguraseru tame ni tsukawashita shishatachi o kakumatta tame de aru.
Yoshua wa, sono toki, hitobito ni chikai o tatete itta, "Ooyoso tatte, kono Eriko no machi o saiken suru hito wa, Shu no mae ni norowarerude arou. Sono ishizue o sueru hito wa choushi o ushinai, sono mon o tateru hito wa sue no ko o ushinaude arou".
Shu wa Yoshua to tomo ni orare, Yoshua no meisei wa, amaneku sono chi ni hirogatta.
Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa hounoubutsu ni tsuite tsumi o okashita. Sunawachi Yuda no buzoku no uchi no, Zera no ko Zabude no ko de aru Karumi no ko Akanga hounoubutsu o totta no de aru. Sore de Shu wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni mukatte ikari o hasserareta.
Yoshua wa Eriko kara hitobito o tsukawashi, Beteru no higashi, Beteaben no chikaku ni aru Ai ni ikaseyou to shite, sono hitobito ni itta, "Nobotte itte, kano chi o sagutte ki nasai". Hitobito wa nobotte itte, Ai o saguttaga,
Yoshua no moto ni kaette kite itta, "Tami o kotogotoku ikaseru ni wa oyobimasen. Tada ni, sanzennin o noborasete, Ai o utase nasai. Karera wa sukunai no desukara, tami o kotogotoku asoko e yatte honeori o saseru ni wa oyobimasen".
Soko de tami no uchi, ooyoso sanzennin ga soko ni nobottaga, tsuini Ai no hitobito no mae kara nigedashita.
Ai no hitobito wa karera no uchi, ooyoso sanjuu rokunin o koroshi, sarani karera o mon no mae kara Shibarimu made otte, kudarizaka de karera o koroshita no de, tami no kokoro wa kiete mizu no you ni natta.
Sono tame Yoshua wa ifuku o saki, Isuraeru no chouroutachi to tomo ni, Shu no hako no mae de, yuugata made chi ni hirefushi, chiri o kabutta.
Yoshua wa itta, "Aa, Shu naru kami yo, anata wa naniyue, kono tami ni Yorudan o watarase, wareware o Amori bito no te ni watashite horobosaserareru no desu ka. Wareware wa Yorudan no mukou ni, yasunjite todomareba yokatta no desu.
Aa, Shu yo. Isuraeru ga sudeni teki ni se o muketa ima to natte, watashi wa mata nani o ii emashou.
Kanan bi to, oyobi kono chi ni sumu subete no mono wa, kore o kiite, wareware o seme kakomi, wareware no na o chi kara tachi satte shimaudeshou. Sore de anata wa, anata no ooinaru na no tame ni, nani o shiyou to sareru no desu ka".
Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Tachi nasai. Anata wa dou shite, sono you ni hirefushite iru no ka.
Isuraeru wa tsumi o okashi, watashi ga karera ni meijite oita keiyaku o yabutta. Karera wa hounoubutsu o tori, nusumi, katsu itsuwatte, sore o jibun no shoyuubutsu no uchi ni ireta.
Sore de Isuraeru no hitobito wa teki ni ataru koto ga dekizu, teki ni se o muketa. Karera mo horobosarerubeki mono to nattakara de aru. Anata ga taga, sono horobosarerubeki mono o, anata gata no uchi kara horoboshisaru no de nakereba, watashi wa mohaya anata gata to wa tomo ni inaide arou.
Tatte, tami o kiyomete ii nasai, 'Anata gata wa mi o kiyomete, asu no tame ni sonae nasai. Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Isuraeru yo, anata gata no uchi ni, horobosarerubeki mono ga aru. Sono horobosarerubeki mono o, anata gata no uchi kara nozokisaru made wa, teki ni ataru koto wa dekinaide arou".
Sore yue, asu no asa, anata gata wa buzokugoto ni susumidenakereba naranai. Soshite Shu ga kuji o aterareru buzoku wa, shizokugoto ni susumi ide, Shu ga kuji o aterareru shizoku wa, kazokugoto ni susumi ide, Shu ga kuji o aterareru kazoku wa, otoko hitoribitori susumidenakereba naranai.
Soshite sono horobosarerubeki mono o motte ite, kuji o aterareta mono wa, sono mochimono zenbu to tomo ni, hi de yakarenakereba naranai. Shu no keiyaku o yaburi Isuraeru no uchi ni oroka na koto o okonattakara de aru' ".
Kou shite Yoshua wa asa hayaku oki, Isuraeru o buzokugoto ni susumi dasaseta tokoro, Yuda no buzoku ga kuji ni atari,
Yuda no moromoro no shizoku o susumi dasaseta tokoro, Zera bito no shizoku ga, kuji ni atatta. Zera bito no shizoku o kazokugoto ni susumi dasaseta tokoro, Zabude no kazoku ga, kuji ni atatta.
Zabude no kazoku o otoko hitoribitori susumidasaseta tokoro, Akan ga kuji ni atatta. Akan wa Yuda no buzoku no uchi no, Zera no ko, Zabude no ko naru Karumi no ko de aru.
Sono toki Yoshua wa Akan ni itta, "Waga ko yo, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni eikou o kishi, mata Shu osan bishi, anata no shita koto o ima watashi ni tsuge nasai. Watashi ni kakushite wa naranai".
Akan wa Yoshua ni kotaeta, "Hontou ni watashi wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashimashita. Watashi ga shita no wa kou desu.
Watashi wa bundori mono no uchi ni, Shinaru no utsukushii gaitou ichimai to gin nihyaku shikeru to, mekata gojuu shikeru no kin no nobebou ichipon no aru no o mite, hoshiku nari, sore o torimashita. Watashi no tenmaku no naka ni, chi ni kakushite arimasu. Gin wa sono shita ni arimasu".
Soko de Yoshua wa shishatachi o tsukawashita. Shishatachi ga tenmaku ni hashitte itte miruto, sore wa kare no tenmaku ni kakushite atte, gin mo sono shita ni atta.
Karera wa sore o tenmaku no naka kara toridashite, Yoshua to Isuraeru no subete no hitobito no tokoro ni tazusaete kita no de, sore o Shu no mae ni oita.
Yoshua wa subete no Isuraeru bito to tomo ni, Zera no ko Akan o torae, kano gin to gaitou to kin no nobebou, oyobi kare no musuko, musume, ushi, roba, hitsuji, tenmaku nado, kare no mochimono o kotogotoku totte, Akoru no tani e hiite itta.
Soshite Yoshua wa itta, "Naze anata wa wareware o nayamashita no ka. Shu wa, kyou, anata o nayamasarerude arou". Yagate subete no Isuraeru bi to wa ishi de kare o uchikoroshi, mata kare no kazoku o mo ishi de uchikoroshi, hi o motte yaita.
Soshite Akan no ue ni ishizuka o ookiku tsumiagetaga, sore wa konnichi made nokotte iru. Soshite Shu wa hageshii ikari o yameraretaga, kono koto ni yotte, sono tokoro no na wa konnichi made Akoru no tani to yobarete iru.
Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Osorete wa naranai, ononoite wa naranai. Iku sabi to o mina, hikii, tatte, Ai ni semenobori nasai. Watashi wa Ai no ou to sono tami, sono machi, sono chi o anata no te ni sazukeru.
Anata wa, saki ni Eriko to sono ou ni shita toori, Ai to sono ou to ni shinakereba naranai. Tadashi, bundori mono to kachiku to wa senrihin to shite anata gata no mono to suru koto ga dekirude arou. Anata wa mazu, machi no ushiro ni fukuhei o oki nasai".
Yoshua wa tatte, subete no iku sabi to to tomo ni, Ai ni semenoborou to shite, mazu daiyuushi san mannin o erabi, sore o yoru no uchi ni tsukawashita.
Yoshua wa karera ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa machi ni mukatte, machi no ushiro ni fusete inakereba naranai. Machi o tooku hanarenaide, mina sonae o shite inakereba naranai.
Watashi to watashi ni shitagau tami to wa mina tomo ni, machi ni semeyoseyou. Soshite karera ga mae no you ni wareware ni mukatte dete kuru toki, wareware wa karera no mae kara nigerude arou.
Sou sureba karera wa wareware o otte dete kurude aroukara, wareware wa tsuini karera o machi kara obikidasu koto ga dekiru. Karera wa iude arou, 'Kono hitobito wa mata mae no you ni, wareware no mae kara nigete iku'. Kou shite wareware wa karera no mae kara nigerude arou.
Sono toki, anata gata wa fusete iru tokoro kara tachiagatte, machi o toranakereba naranai. Anata gata no kami, Shu ga sore o anata gata no te ni ataerarerukara de aru.
Anata ga taga, machi o tottanaraba, machi ni hi o hanachi, Shu ga meijirareta you ni shinakereba naranai. Watashi wa kou, anata gata ni meijiru no de aru".
Sou shite Yoshua ga karera o tsukawashita no de, karera wa Ai no seihou, Beteru to Ai no aida no machibuse suru basho ni itte mi o fuseta. Yoshua wa sono yoru, tami no naka ni yadotta.
Yoshua wa akuru asa, hayaku okite, tami o atsume, Isuraeru no chouroutachi to tomo ni, tami ni sakidatte, Ai ni nobotte itta.
Kare to tomo ni itai kusabi to tachi mo mina nobotte itte, machi no mae ni chikazuki, Ai no kita ni jin o totta. Karera to Ai no aida ni wa, hitotsu no tani ga atta.
Yoshua wa ooyoso gosennin o totte, machi no seihou, Beteru to Ai no aida ni, fusete oita.
Kou shite tami no shuryoku o machi no kita ni oki, shingari o machi no nishi ni oita. Yoshua wa sono yo, tani no naka de yadotta.
Ai no ou wa kore o mite, subete no tami to tomo ni, isoide, hayaku oki, Araba ni iku kudarizaka ni susumidete, Isuraeru to tatakatta. Shikashi, ou wa machi no ushiro ni, suki o ukagau fukuhei no oru koto o shiranakatta.
Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hitobito to tomo ni, karera ni uchiyaburareta furi o shite, arano no houkou e nigedashita no de,
Sono machi no tami wa mina yobawari atsumatte karera no ato o oi, Yoshua no ato o otte machi kara obikidasare,
Ai ni mo Beteru ni mo nokotte iru mono wa hitori mo naku, mina dete Isuraeru no ato o oi, machi o akehanashite, Isuraeru no ato o otta.
Sono toki, Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Anata no te ni aru nageyari o, Ai no hou ni sashinobe nasai. Watashi wa sono machi o anata no te ni ataerude arou". Soko de Yoshua ga te ni shite ita nageyari o, Ai no hou ni sashinoberuto,
Fukuhei wa tachimachi sono basho kara tachiagari, Yoshua ga te o noberuto douji ni, hashitte machi ni hairi, sore o totte, tadachini machi ni hi o kaketa.
Sore de Ai no hitobito ga, ushiro o furikaette miruto, machi no yakeru kemuri ga ten ni tachinobotte ita no de, kochira e mo achira e mo nigeru sube ga nakatta. Arano e nigete itta tami mo mi o kaeshite, otte kita mono ni sematta.
Yoshua to subete no Isuraeru bi to wa, fukuhei ga machi o tori, machi no yakeru kemuri ga tachinoboru no o mite, mi o kaeshite Ai no hitobito o utta.
Mata machi o totta mono wa machi o dete karera ni mukatta no de, karera wa, kochira to achira to kara Isuraeru no naka ni hasamareta. Kou shite Isuraeru bito ga karera o utta no de, ikinokotta mono, nige ooseta mono wa, hitori mo nakatta.
Soshite Ai no ou o ikedori ni shite, Yoshua no moto e tsurete kita.
Isuraeru bi to wa, arano ni tsuigeki shite kita Ai no juumin o kotogotoku no de koroshi, tsurugi o motte hitori mo nokosazu uchitaoshite nochi, mina Ai ni kaeri, tsurugi o motte sono machi o uchi horoboshita.
Sono hi Ai no hitobito wa kotogotoku taoreta. Sono kazu wa danjo awasete ichi man nisennin de atta.
Yoshua wa Ai no juumin o kotogotoku horoboshi tsukusu made wa, nageyari o sashinobeta te o hikkomenakatta.
Tadashi, sono machi no kachiku oyobi, bundori hin wa Isuraeru bito ga jibuntachi no senrihin to shite totta. Shu ga Yoshua ni meijirareta kotoba ni shitagatta no de aru.
Kou shite Yoshua wa Ai o yaite, eikyuu ni aratsuka to shitaga, sore wa konnichi made arechi to natte iru.
Yoshua wa mata, Ai no ou o yuugata made ki ni kakete sarashi, hi no iru koro, meijite, sono shitai o ki kara torioroshi, machi no mon no iriguchi ni nagesute, sono ue ni ishi no ootsuka o tsumiagesasetaga, sore wa konnichi made nokotte iru.
Soshite Yoshua wa Ebaru yama ni Isuraeru no kami, Shu no tame ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuita.
Kore wa Shu no shimobe Moose ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni meijita koto ni motozuki, Moose no rippou no sho ni shirusarete iru you ni, tetsu no dougu o atenai shizen no mama no ishi no saidan de atte, hitobito wa sono ue de, Shu ni hansai o sasage, shuuonsai o sonaeta.
Sono tokoro de, Yoshua wa mata Moose no kakishirushita rippou o, Isuraeru no hitobito no mae de, ishi ni kakiutsushita.
Kou shite subete no Isuraeru bi to wa, hongokujin mo, kiryuu no takokujin mo, chourou, tsukasa bi to, sabaki bito to tomo ni, Shu no keiyaku no hako o kaku Rebi bito de aru saishitachi no mae de, hako no konata to kanata ni wakarete, nakaba wa Gerijimuyama no mae ni, nakaba wa Ebaru yama no mae ni tatta. Kore wa Shu no shimobe Moose ga saki ni meijita you ni, Isuraeru no tami o shukufuku suru tame de atta.
Soshite nochi, Yoshua wa subete no rippou no sho ni shirusarete iru tokoro ni shitagatte, shukufuku to, noroi to ni kansuru rippou no kotoba o kotogotoku yonda.
Moose ga meijita subete no kotoba no uchi, Yoshua ga Isuraeru no zenkaishuu oyobi onna to kodomotachi, narabi ni Isuraeru no uchi ni sumu kiryuu no takokujin no mae de, yomanakatta mono wa hitotsu mo nakatta.
Sate, Yorudan no nishigawa no, sanchi, heichi, oyobi Rebanon made no taikai no engan ni sumu moromoro no outachi, sunawachi Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Kanan bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no outachi wa, kore o kiite,
Kokoro o awase, aiatsumatte, Yoshua oyobi Isuraeru to tatakaou to shita.
Shikashi, Gibeon no juumintachi wa, Yoshua ga Eriko to Ai ni okonatta koto o kiite,
Jibuntachi mo sakuryaku o megurashi, itte shokuryouhin o junbi shi, furubita fukuro to, furubite yabureta no o tsukurotta budoushu no kawabukuro to o, roba ni owase,
Tsukurotta furu gutsu o ashi ni haki, furubita kimono o mi ni tsuketa. Karera no shokuryou no pan wa, mina kawaite, kudakete ita.
Karera wa Girugaru no jin'ei no Yoshua no tokoro ni kite, kare to Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Wareware wa tooi kuni kara mairimashita. Sore de ima wareware to keiyaku o musunde kudasai".
Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa sono Hibi bitotachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa wareware no uchi ni sunde iru no ka mo shirenaikara, wareware wa dou shite anata gata to keiyaku ga musubemashou".
Karera wa Yoshua ni itta, "Wareware wa anata no shimobe desu". Yoshua wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa dare desu ka. Doko kara kita no desu ka".
Karera wa Yoshua ni itta, "Shimobedomo wa anata no kami, Shu no na no yue ni, hijou ni tooi kuni kara mairimashita. Wareware wa Shu no meisei, oyobi Shu ga Ejiputo de okonawareta subete no koto o kiki,
Mata Shu ga Yorudan no mukougawa ni ita Amori bito no futari no ou, sunawachi Heshibon no ou Shihon, oyobi Ashitarote ni otta Bashan no ou Ogu ni okonawareta subete no koto o kiitakara desu.
Sore de, wareware no chouroutachi, oyobi kuni no juumin wa mina wareware ni iimashita, 'Omaetachi wa tabiji no shokuryou o te ni tazusaete itte, karera ni atte ii nasai, "Wareware wa anata gata no shimobe desu. Sore de ima wareware to keiyaku o musunde kudasai"'.
Koko ni aru kono pan wa, anata gata no tokoro ni kuru tame, wareware ga shuttatsu suru hi ni, onoono ie kara, mada atataka na no o tabi no shokuryou to shite junbi shita no desuga, ima wa mou kawaite kudakete imasu.
Mata budoushu o mitashita korera no kawabukuro mo, atarashikatta no desuga, yaburemashita. Wareware no kono kimono mo, kutsu mo, tabiji ga hijou ni nagakatta no de, furubite shimaimashita".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa karera no shokuryouhin o tomo ni tabe, Shu no sashizu o motomeyou to wa shinakatta.
Soshite Yoshua wa karera to wa o kouji, keiyaku o musunde, karera o ikashite oita. Kaishuu no choutachi wa karera ni chikai o tateta.
Keiyaku o musunde mikka no nochi ni, karera wa sono hitobito ga chikaku no hitobito de, jibuntachi no uchi ni sunde iru to iu koto o kiita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa susunde, mikkame ni sono machimachi ni tsuita. Sono machimachi to wa, Gibeon, Kepira, Beerote oyobi kiriate yarimu de atta.
Tokoro de kaishuu no choutachi ga, sudeni Isuraeru no kami, Shu o sashite karera ni chikai o tatete ita no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa karera o korosanakatta. Soko de kaishuu wa mina, choutachi ni mukatte tsubuyaita.
Shikashi, choutachi wa mina, zenkaishuu ni itta, "Wareware wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu o sashite karera ni chikatta. Sore yue ima, karera ni furete wa naranai.
Wareware wa, kou shite karera o ikashite okou. Sou sureba, wareware ga karera ni tateta chikai no yue ni, ikari ga wareware ni nozomu koto wa naide arou".
Choutachi wa mata hitobito ni "Karera o ikashite okou" to itta no de, karera wa tsuini, zenkaishuu no tame ni, takigi o kiri, mizu o kumu mono to natta. Choutachi ga karera ni itta toori de aru.
Yoshua wa karera o yobiyosete itta, "Anata gata wa, wareware no uchi ni suminagara, naze 'Wareware wa anata gata kara wa tooku hanarete iru' to itte, wareware o damashita no ka.
Sore de anata gata wa ima noroware, dorei to natte watashi no kami no ie no tame ni, takigi o kiri, mizu o kumu mono ga, taezu anata gata no uchi kara derude arou".
Karera wa Yoshua ni kotaete itta, "Anata no kami, Shu ga sono shimobe Moose ni, kono chi o kotogotoku anata gata ni atae, kono chi ni sumu tami o kotogotoku anata gata no mae kara horoboshisaru you ni to, omeiji ni natta koto o, shimobedomo wa akiraka ni tsutaekikimashita no de, anata gata no yue ni, inochi ga ayauito, wareware wa hijou ni osorete, kono koto o shita no desu.
Wareware wa, ima, anata no te no uchi ni arimasu. Wareware ni anata ga shite yoi to omoi, tadashii to omou koto o shite kudasai".
Soko de Yoshua wa, karera ni sono you ni shi, karera o Isuraeru no hitobito no te kara sukutte korosasenakatta.
Shikashi, Yoshua wa, sono hi, karera o, kaishuu no tame, mata Shu no saidan no tame, Shu ga erabareru basho de, takigi o kiri, mizu o kumu mono to shita. Kore wa konnichi made tsuzuite iru.
Erusaremu no ou Adonizedeku wa, Yoshua ga Ai o semetotte, sore o mattaku horoboshi, saki ni Eriko to sono ou to ni shita you ni, Ai to sono ou ni mo shita koto, mata Gibeon no juumin ga, Isuraeru to wa o koujite, sono uchi ni oru koto o kiki,
Ooini osoreta. Sore wa, Gibeon ga ookina machi de atte, ou no miyako ni mo hitoshii mono de ari, mata Ai yori ookikute, sono uchi no hitobito ga, subete tsuyokattakara de aru.
Sore de Erusaremu no ou Adonizedeku wa, Heburon no ou Hohamu, Yarumute no ou Piramu, Rakishi no ou Yapia, oyobi Eguron no ou Debiru ni hito o tsukawashite itta,
"Watashi no tokoro ni nobotte kite, watashi o tasukete kudasai. Wareware wa Gibeon o uchimashou. Gibeon wa Yoshua oyobi Isuraeru no hitobito to wa o koujitakara desu".
Amori bito no gonin no ou, sunawachi Erusaremu no ou, Heburon no ou, Yarumute no ou, Rakishi no ou, oyobi Eguron no ou wa hei o atsume, sono subete no gunzei o hikiite nobotte kite, Gibeon ni mukatte jin o tori, sore o semete tatakatta.
Gibeon no hitobito wa, Girugaru no jin'ei ni hito o tsukawashi, Yoshua ni itta, "Anata no te o hikanaide, shimobedomo o tasukete kudasai. Hayaku, wareware no tokoro ni nobotte kite, wareware o sukui, tasukete kudasai. Sanchi ni sumu Amori bito no outachi ga mina atsumatte, wareware o semerukara desu".
Soko de Yoshua wa subete no iku sabi to to, subete no daiyuushi o hikiite, Girugaru kara nobotte itta.
Sono toki, Shu wa Yoshua ni iwareta, "Karera o osorete wa naranai. Watashi ga karera o anata no te ni watashitakara de aru. Karera no uchi ni wa, anata ni ataru koto no dekiru mono wa, hitori mo naide arou".
Yoshua wa, Girugaru kara, yomosugara susumi nobotte, niwaka ni karera ni semeyoseta tokoro,
Shu wa karera o, Isuraeru no mae ni, osore awatesaserareta no de, Isuraeru wa Gibeon de karera o obitadashiku uchikoroshi, Betehoron no noborizaka o tootte nigeru karera o, Azeka to MaKkeda made tsuigeki shita.
Karera ga Isuraeru no mae kara nigehashitte, Betehoron no kudarizaka o orite ita toki, Shu wa ten kara karera no ue ni ooishi o furashi, Azeka ni itaru made mo sou sareta no de, ooku no hitobito ga shinda. Isuraeru no hitobito ga tsurugi o motte koroshita mono yori mo, hyou ni utarete shinda mono no hou ga ookatta.
Shu ga Amori bito o Isuraeru no hitobito ni watasareta hi ni, Yoshua wa Isuraeru no hitobito no mae de Shu ni muka tte itta, "Hi yo, Gibeon no ue ni todomare, tsuki yo, Ayaron no tani ni yasurae".
Tami ga sono teki o uchiyaburu made, hi wa todomari, tsuki wa ugokanakatta. Kore wa Yasharu no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka. Hi ga ten no chuukuu ni todomatte, isoide bosshinakatta koto, ooyoso ichi nichi de atta.
Kore yori saki ni mo, ato ni mo, Shu ga kono you ni hito no kotoba o kikiirerareta hi wa tsuitachi mo nakatta. Shu ga Isuraeru no tame ni tatakawaretakara de aru.
Kou shite Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hito to tomo ni Girugaru no jin'ei ni kaetta.
Kano gonin no outachi wa nigete itte, MaKkeda no horaana ni kakuretaga,
Gonin no outachi ga MaKkeda no horaana ni kakurete iru no ga mitsukatta to, Yoshua ni tsugeru mono ga atta no de,
Yoshua wa itta, "Horaana no kuchi ni ooishi o korogashi, sono soba ni hito o oite, mamorase nasai.
Tadashi, anata gata wa, soko ni todomaranaide, teki no ato o oi, sono shingari o uchi, karera o sono machi ni hairasete wa naranai. Anata gata no kami, Shu ga karera o anata gata no te ni watasaretakara de aru".
Yoshua to Isuraeru no hitobito wa, ooini karera o uchikoroshi, tsuini karera o horoboshi tsukushitaga, karera no uchi nogarete ikinokotta monodomo wa, kengo na machimachi ni nigekonda no de,
Tami wa mina yasuraka ni Makkeda no jin'ei no Yoshua no moto ni kaette kitaga, Isuraeru no hitobito ni mukatte shita o narasu mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Sono toki Yoshua wa itta, "Horaana no kuchi o hiraite, horaana kara, kano gonin no outachi o, watashi no moto ni hikidashi nasai".
Yagate, sono you ni shite, kano gonin no outachi, sunawachi, Erusaremu no ou, Heburon no ou, Yarumute no ou, Rakishi no ou, oyobi Eguron no ou o, horaana kara kare no moto ni hikidashita.
Kono outachi o Yoshua no moto ni hikidashita toki, Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hitobito o yobiyose, jibun to tomo ni ittai kusabi to no choutachi ni itta, "Chikayotte, kono outachi no kubi ni ashi o kake nasai". Soko de chikayotte, sono outachi no kubi ni ashi o kaketa no de,
Yoshua wa karera ni itta, "Osoreononoite wa naranai. Tsuyoku mata ooshiku are. Anata gata ga semete tatakau subete no teki ni wa, Shu ga kono you ni sareru no de aru".
Soshite nochi Yoshua wa karera o utte shinase, gohon no ki ni kakete, yuugure made ki no ue ni sarashite oitaga,
Hi no iru koro ni natte, Yoshua ga meijita no de, kore o ki kara oroshi, karera ga kakurete ita horaana ni nageire, horaana no kuchi ni ooishi o oita. Kore wa konnichi made nokotte iru.
Sono hi Yoshua wa Makkeda o tori, tsurugi o motte, sore to, sono ou to o uchi, sono naka no subete no hito o, kotogotoku horoboshite, hitori mo nokosazu, Eriko no ou ni shita you ni, MaKkeda no ou ni mo shita.
Kou shite Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, MaKkeda kara Ribuna ni susumi, Ribuna o semete tatakatta.
Shu ga, sore to, sono ou o mo, Isuraeru no te ni watasareta no de, tsurugi o motte, sore to, sono naka no subete no hito o uchi horoboshite, hitori mo sono naka ni nokosazu, Eriko no ou ni shita you ni, sono ou ni mo shita.
Yoshua wa mata Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, Ribuna kara Rakishi ni susumi, kore ni mukatte jin o shiki, seme tatakatta.
Shu ga Rakishi o Isuraeru no te ni watasareta no de, futsu ka me ni kore o tori, tsurugi o motte, sore to, sono naka no subete no hito o uchi horoboshita. Subete Ribuna ni shita toori de atta.
Sono toki, Gezeru no ou Horamu ga, Rakishi o tasukeru tame ni nobotte kita no de, Yoshua wa kare to, sono tami to o uchi horoboshite, tsuini hitori mo nokosanakatta.
Yoshua wa mata Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, Rakishi kara Eguron ni susumi, kore ni mukatte jin o shiki, seme tatakatta.
Sono hi kore o tori, tsurugi o motte, kore o uchi, sono naka no subete no hito o, kotogotoku sono hi ni horoboshita. Subete Rakishi ni shita toori de atta.
Yoshua wa mata Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, Eguron kara Heburon ni susumi nobori, kore o semete tatakai,
Sore o totte, sore to, sono ou, oyobi sono subete no machimachi to, sono naka no subete no hito o, tsurugi o motte uchi horoboshi, hitori mo nokosanakatta. Subete Eguron ni shita toori de atta. Sunawachi, sore to sono naka no subete no hito o, kotogotoku horoboshita.
Mata Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, Debiru e hikikaeshi, kore o semete tatakai,
Sore to, sono ou, oyobi sono subete no machimachi o tori, tsurugi o motte sore o uchi, sono naka no subete no hito o, kotogotoku horoboshi, hitori mo nokosanakatta. Kare ga Debiru to, sono ou ni shita koto wa, Heburon ni shita toori de ari, mata Ribuna to, sono ou ni shita toori de atta.
Kou shite Yoshua wa sono chi no zenbu, sunawachi, sanchi, Negebu, heichi, oyobi sanpuku no chi to, sono subete no outachi o uchi horoboshite, hitori mo nokosazu, subete iki no aru mono wa, kotogotoku horoboshita. Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga meijirareta toori de atta.
Yoshua wa kadeshi barunea kara Gaza made no kuniguni, oyobi Gosen no zenchi o uchi horoboshite, Gibeon ni made oyonda.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga Isuraeru no tame ni tatakawareta no de, Yoshua wa korera subete no outachi to, sono chi o ichidoki ni totta.
Soshite Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o hikiite, Girugaru no jin'ei ni kaetta.
Hazoru no ouYabin wa, kore o kiite, Madon no ou Yobabu, Shimuron no ou, oyobi Akusafu no ou,
Mata kita no sanchi, Kinnerote no minami no Araba, heichi, nishi no hou no Doru no kouchi ni oru outachi,
