Sono ta no Rebi bito de aru, Merari bito no shizoku ni ataerareta machi wa, Zeburun no buzoku no uchi kara wa, Yokuneamu to sono houboku chi, Karuta to sono houboku chi,
Demuna to sono houboku chi, Nahararu to sono houboku chi nado, yontsu no machi de aru.
Ruben no buzoku no uchi kara wa, Bezeru to sono houboku chi, Yahazu to sono houboku chi,
Kedemote to sono houboku chi, Mepaate to sono houboku chi nado, yontsu no machi de aru.
Gado no buzoku no uchi kara wa, hito o koroshita mono no, nogareru machi de aru Gireade no Ramote to sono houboku chi, Mahanaimu to sono houboku chi,
Heshibon to sono houboku chi, Yazeru to sono houboku chi nado, awasete yontsu no machi de aru.
Korera wa mina, hoka no Rebi bito de aru Merari bito ga, sono shizoku ni shitagatte, kuji o motte eta machi de atte, awasete juu ni de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito no shoyuu no uchi ni, Rebi bito ga motta machimachi wa, awasete yonjuu hachi de atte, sore ni zokusuru houboku chi ga atta.
Korera no machimachi wa, sorezore sono shuui ni houboku chi ga atta. Korera no machimachi wa minasoude atta.
Kono you ni, Shu ga, Isuraeru ni ataeruto, sono senzotachi ni chikawareta chi o, kotogotoku ataerareta no de, karera wa sore o ete, soko ni sunda.
Shu wa karera no senzotachi ni chikawareta you ni, shihou ni ansoku o tamawatta no de, subete no teki no uchi, hitori mo karera ni temukau mono wa nakatta. Shu ga teki o kotogotoku karera no te ni watasaretakara de aru.
Shu ga Isuraeru no ie ni yakusoku sareta subete no yoi koto wa, hitotsu to shite tagawazu, mina jitsugen shita.
Toki ni Yoshua wa, Ruben bi to, Gado bi to, oyobi Manase no buzoku no nakaba o yobiatsumete,
Itta, "Anata gata wa Shu no shimobe Moose ga meijita koto o, kotogotoku mamori, mata watashi no meijita subete no koto ni mo, watashi no kotoba ni kiki shitagaimashita.
Konnichi made nagai toshitsuki no aida, anata gata no kyoudaitachi o sutezu, anata gata no kami, Shu no meirei o, yoku mamotte kimashita.
Ima wa sudeni, anata gata no kami, Shu ga, anata gata no kyoudaitachi ni, saki ni yakusoku sareta toori, ansoku o tamawaru you ni narimashita. Sore de, anata gata wa mi o kaeshite, Shu no shimobe Moose ga, anata gata ni ataeta Yorudan no mukougawa no shoyuu no chi ni iki, jibuntachi no tenmaku ni kaeri nasai.
Tada Shu no shimobe Moose ga, anata gata ni meijita imashime to, rippou to o tsutsushinde okonai, anata gata no kami, Shu o aishi, sono subete no michi ni ayumi, sono meirei o mamotte, Shu ni tsukishitagai, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite, Shu ni tsukae nasai".
Soshite Yoshua ga karera o shukufuku shite saraseta no de, karera wa sono tenmaku ni kaetta.
Manase no buzoku no nakaba ni wa, sudeni Moose ga Bashan de shoyuu chi o ataetaga, ta no nakaba ni wa, Yoshua ga Yorudan no kochiragawa, nishi no hou de, sono kyoudaitachi no uchi ni, shoyuu chi o ataeta. Yoshua wa, karera o sono tenmaku ni okurikaesu toki, karera o shukufuku shite,
Itta, "Anata gata wa ooku no kazai to, obitadashii kazu no kachiku to, kin, gin, seidou, tetsu, oyobi ooku no ifuku o motte tenmaku ni kaeri, teki kara eta bundori mono o kyoudaitachi ni wake nasai".
Kou shite Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no buzoku no nakaba wa, Shu ga Moose ni yotte meijirareta you ni, sudeni jibun no shoyuu chi to natte iru Gireade no chi ni ikouto, Kanan no chi no Shiro de, Isuraeru no hitobito to wakarete kaette itta.
Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no buzoku no nakaba ga, Kanan no chi no Yorudan no hotori ni kita toki, sono tokoro de, Yorudan no kishibe ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuita. Sore wa ookikute tooku kara mieru saidan de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa, "Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no buzoku no nakaba ga, Kanan no chi no kokkyou, Yorudan no hotori no Isuraeru no hitobito ni zokusuru hou de, hitotsu no saidan o kizuita" to iu uwasa o kiita.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, sore o kikuto hitoshiku, Isuraeru no hitobito no zenkaishuu wa Shiro ni atsumatte, karera no tokoro ni semenoborou to shita.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa, saishi Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu o Gireade no chi no Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no han buzoku no tokoro ni tsukawashi,
Isuraeru no kakubuzoku no uchi kara, fuso no ie no tsukasa, hitori zutsu o agete, awasete juunin no tsukasatachi o, kare to tomo ni ikaseta. Korera wa mina Isuraeru no shizoku no uchi de, fuso no ie no kashira taru hitobito de atta.
Karera wa Gireade no chi ni iki, Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no han buzoku ni katatte itta,
"Shu no zenkaishuu wa kou iimasu, 'Anata gata ga Isuraeru no kami ni mukatte, toga o okashi, konnichi, hirugaette Shu ni shitagau koto o yame, jibun no tame ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuite, konnichi, Shu ni somukou to suru no wa nanigoto ka.
Peoru de okashita tsumi de, nao tarinai to suru no ka. Sore ga tame ni Shu no kaishuu ni wazawai ga kudattaga, wareware wa konnichi mo nao, sono tsumi kara kiyomerarete inai.
Shikamo anata gata wa, konnichi, hirugaette Shu ni shitagau koto o yameyou to suru no ka. Anata ga taga, kyou, Shu ni somukunaraba, asu, Shu wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu ni mukatte ikararerude arou.
Moshi anata gata no shoyuu no chi ga kiyoku nai no de areba, Shu no makuya no tatte iru Shu no shoyuu no chi ni watatte kite, wareware no uchi ni, shoyuu no chi o e nasai. Tada, wareware no kami, Shu no saidan no hoka ni, jibun no tame ni saidan o kizuite, Shu ni somuki, mata wareware o somuku mono to narasenaide kudasai.
Zera no ko Akan wa, norowareta mono ni tsuite, toga o okashi, sore ga tame Isuraeru no zenkaishuu ni, ikari ga nozondade wa nai ka. Mata sono tsumi ni yotte horobita mono wa, kare hitori de wa nakatta' ".
Sono toki, Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no han buzoku wa, Isuraeru no shizoku no kashiratachi ni kotaete itta,
"Chikara aru mono, kami, Shu. Chikara aru mono, kami, Shu. Shu wa shiroshimesu. Isuraeru mo mata shiranakereba naranai. Moshi sore ga somuku koto de ari, aruiha Shu ni tsumi o okasu koto de arunaraba, kyou, wareware o yurusanaide kudasai.
Wareware ga saidan o kizuita koto ga, moshi Shu ni shitagau koto o yameru tame de ari, mata sono ue ni, hansai, sosai o sasageru tame de ari, aruiha mata sono ue ni, shuuonsai no gisei o sasageru tame de attanaraba, Shu mizukara, sono tsumi o toitadashite kudasai.
Shikashi, wareware wa tsugi no koto o kangaete shita no desu. Sunawachi, nochi no hi ni natte, anata gata no shison ga, wareware no shison ni mukatte iu koto ga aru ka mo shiremasen, 'Anata gata wa, Isuraeru no kami, Shu to, nan no kankei ga aru no desu ka.
Ruben no shison to, Gado no shison yo, Shu wa, anata gata to, wareware to no aida ni, Yorudan o sakai to saremashita. Anata gata wa Shu no tami no tokken ga arimasen'. Kou itte, anata gata no shison ga, wareware no shison ni, Shu o ogamu koto o yamesaseru ka mo shirenai no de,
Wareware wa iimashita, 'Saa, wareware wa hitotsu no saidan o kizukou. Hansai no tame de wa naku, mata gisei no tame de mo naku,
Tada anata gata to, wareware to no aida, oyobi wareware no nochi no shison no aida ni, shouko to narasete, wareware ga, hansai to gisei, oyobi shuuonsai o motte, Shu no mae de, Shu ni tsutome o suru tame de aru. Kou sureba, nochi no hi ni natte, anata gata no shison ga, wareware no shison ni, "Anata gata wa Shu no tami no tokken ga arimasen" to wa iwanaide arou'.
Mata wareware wa iimashita, 'Nochi no hi ni, wareware, mata wareware no shison ga, moshi sono you na koto o iwarerunaraba, sono toki, wareware wa iou, "Wareware no senzo ga tsukutta Shu no saidan no kata o goran nasai. Kore wa hansai no tame de wa naku, mata gisei no tame de mo naku, anata gata to, wareware to no aida no shouko de aru".
Shu ni somuki, hirugaette konnichi, Shu ni shitagau koto o yamete, wareware no kami, Shu no makuya no mae ni aru saidan no hoka ni, hansai, sosai, mata wa gisei o sasageru tame no saidan o kizuku you na koto wa, kesshite itashimasen' ".
Saishi Pinehasu, oyobi kaishuu no tsukasatachi, sunawachi kare to tomo ni itta Isuraeru no shizoku no kashiratachi wa, Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no shison ga katatta kotoba o kiite, sore o yoshi to shita.
Soshite saishi Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu wa, Ruben no shison, Gado no shison, oyobi Manase no shison ni itta, "Konnichi, wareware wa, Shu ga wareware no uchi ni imasu koto o shitta. Anata ga taga, Shu ni mukatte, kono toga o okasanakattakara de aru. Anata gata wa ima, Isuraeru no hitobito o, Shu no te kara sukuidashita no desu".
Kou shite saishi Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu to, tsukasatachi wa, Ruben no shison, oyobi Gado no shison ni wakarete, Gireade no chi kara Kanan no chi ni kaeri, Isuraeru no hitobito no tokoro ni itte fukumei shita no de,
Isuraeru no hitobito wa sore o yoshi to shita. Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa kami o hometatae, Ruben no shison, oyobi Gado no shison no sunde iru kuni o horobosu tame ni semenoborou to wa, mohaya iwanakatta.
Ruben no shison to Gado no shison wa, sono saidan o "Akashi" to nazukete itta, "Kore wa, wareware no aida ni atte, Shu ga kami ni imasu to iu akashi o suru mono de aru".
Shu ga Isuraeru no shuui no teki o, kotogotoku nozoite, Isuraeru ni ansoku o tamawatte nochi, hisashiku tachi, Yoshua mo toshi ga susunde oita.
Yoshua wa Isuraeru no subete no hito, sono chourou, kashiratachi, saba kibi to, tsukasa bitotachi o yobiatsumete itta, "Watashi wa nen mo susunde roujin to natta.
Anata gata wa, sudeni anata gata no kami, Shu ga, kono moromoro no kunibito ni okonawareta subete no koto o mita. Anata gata no tame ni tatakawareta no wa, anata gata no kami, Shu de aru.
Miyo, watashi wa Yorudan kara, hi no iru hou, taikai made no, kono moromoro no nokotte iru kuniguni to, sudeni watashi ga horoboshisatta subete no kuniguni o, kuji o motte, anata gata ni wakeatae, anata gata no kakubuzoku no shigyou to saseta.
Anata gata no mae kara, sono kokumin o uchiharai, anata gata no me no mae kara oiharawareru no wa, anata gata no kami, Shu de aru. Soshite anata gata no kami, Shu ga yakusoku sareta you ni, anata gata wa karera no chi o erude arou.
Sore yue, anata gata wa kataku tatte, Moose no rippou no sho ni shirusarete iru koto o, kotogotoku mamotte okonawanakereba naranai. Sore o hanarete migi ni mo hidari ni mo magatte wa naranai.
Anata gata no uchi ni nokotte iru, korera no kokumin to majitte wa naranai. Karera no kamigami no na o tonaete wa naranai. Sore o sashite chikatte wa naranai. Mata sore ni tsukae, sore o ogande wa naranai.
Tada, konnichi made shite kita you ni, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukishitagawanakereba naranai.
Shu ga ooinaru tsuyoki kokumin o, anata gata no mae kara oiharawareta. Anata gata ni wa konnichi made, tachimukau koto no dekiru mono wa, hitori mo nakatta.
Anata gata no hitori wa, sennin o oiharau koto ga dekirude arou. Anata gata no kami, Shu ga yakusoku sareta you ni, mizukara anata gata no tame ni tatakawarerukara de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa fukaku tsutsushinde, anata gata no kami, Shu o aisanakereba naranai.
Shikashi, anata gata ga moshi hirugaette, korera no kokumin no, ikinokotte, anata gata no naka ni todomaru monodomo to shitashiku nari, kore to kon'in shi, yukiki surunaraba,
Anata gata wa, shikato shiranakereba naranai. Anata gata no kami, Shu wa, mohaya, korera no kokumin o anata gata no mae kara, oiharau koto o sarenaide arou. Karera wa, kaette, anata gata no wana to nari, ami to nari, anata gata no waki ni, muchi to nari, anata gata no me ni, toge to natte, anata gata wa tsuini, anata gata no kami, Shu ga tamawatta kono yoi chi kara, horobi userude arou.
Miyo, konnichi, watashi wa yo no hito no mina iku michi o ikou to suru. Anata gata ga mina, kokoro no uchi ni mata, kimo ni meijite shitte iru you ni, anata gata no kami, Shu ga, anata gata ni tsuite yakusoku sareta moromoro no yoi koto de, hitotsu mo kaketa mono wa nakatta. Mina anata gata ni nozonde, hitotsu mo kaketa mono wa nakatta.
Shikashi, anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata ni tsuite yakusoku sareta, moromoro no yoi koto ga, anata gata ni nozonda you ni, Shu wa mata, moromoro no warui koto o anata gata ni kudashite, anata gata no kami, Shu ga tamawatta kono yoi chi kara, tsuini, anatagata o horoboshi tatarerude arou.
Moshi, anata gata no kami, Shu ga meijirareta sono keiyaku o okashi, itte ta no kamigami ni tsukae, sore o ogamunaraba, Shu wa anata gata ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, anata gata wa, Shu ga tamawatta yoi chi kara, sumiyaka ni horobi userude arou".
Yoshua wa, Isuraeru no subete no buzoku o Shikemu ni atsume, Isuraeru no chourou, kashira, saba kibi to, tsukasatachi o meshiyosete, tomo ni kami no mae ni susumideta.
Soshite Yoshua wa subete no tami ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata no senzotachi, sunawachi Aburahamu no chichi, Nahoru no chichi Tera wa, mukashi, Yufurate kawa no mukou ni sumi, mina, hoka no kamigami ni tsukaete itaga,
Watashi wa, anata gata no senzo Aburahamu o, kawa no mukou kara tsuredashite, Kanan no zenchi o michibiki toori, sono shison o mashita. Watashi wa kare ni Isaku o atae,
Isaku ni Yakobu to Esau o atae, Esau ni wa Seiru no sanchi o ataete, shoyuu to sasetaga, Yakobu to sono kotomotachi wa Ejiputo ni kudatta.
Watashi wa Moose to Aron o tsukawashi, mata Ejiputo no uchi ni fushigi o okonatte, kore ni wazawai o kudashi, sono nochi anatagata o michibikidashita.
Watashi wa anata gata no chichitachi o, Ejiputo kara michibikidashi, anata gata ga umi ni kita toki, Ejiputo bi to wa, sensha to kihei to o motte, anata gata no chichitachi o koukai ni otte kita.
Sono toki, anata gata no chichitachi ga Shu ni yobawatta no de, Shu wa kurayami o anata gata to Ejiputo bito to no aida ni oki, umi o karera no ue ni katamukete karera o oowareta. Anata gata wa, watashi ga Ejiputo deshita koto o me de mita. Soshite nagai aida, arano ni sunde ita.
Watashi wa mata Yorudan no mukougawa ni sunde ita Amori bito no chi ni, anatagata o michibikiireta. Karera wa anata gata to tatakatta no de, watashi wa karera o anata gata no te ni watashite, karera no chi o esase, karera o anata gata no mae kara horoboshisatta.
Tsui de, Moabu no ou Chipporu no ko Baraku ga tatte, Isuraeru ni tekishi, hito o tsukawashi, Beoru no ko Baramu o maneki, anatagata o norowaseyou to shitaga,
Watashi ga Baramu ni kikou to shinakatta no de, kare wa, kaette, anatagata o shukufuku shita. Kou shite watashi wa kare no te kara anatagata o sukuidashita.
Soshite anata gata wa, Yorudan o watatte, Eriko ni kitaga, Eriko no hitobito wa anata gata to tatakai, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Girugashi bi to, Hibi bi to, oyobi Ebusu bito mo, anata gata to tatakattaga, watashi wa karera o anata gata no te ni watashita.
Watashi wa, anata gata no mae ni, kumabachi o okutte, ano Amori bito no futari no ou o, anata gata no mae kara oiharatta. Kore wa anata gata no tsurugi, mata wa, anata gata no yumi ni yotte de wa nakatta.
Soshite watashi wa, anata gata ga jibun de roushinakatta chi o, anata gata ni atae, anata gata ga tatenakatta machi o, anata gata ni ataeta. Soshite anata gata wa ima sono tokoro ni sunde iru. Anata gata wa mata jibun de tsukuranakatta budou hatake to, oribu hatake no mi o tabete iru'.
Sore yue, ima, anata gata wa Shu o osore, makoto to, magokoro to, shinjitsu to o motte, Shu ni tsukae, anata gata no senzo ga, kawa no mukou, oyobi Ejiputo de tsukaeta ta no kamigami o nozokisatte, Shu ni tsukae nasai.
Moshi anata gata ga Shu ni tsukaeru koto o, kokoro yoshi to shinai no naraba, anata gata no senzo ga, kawa no mukou de tsukaeta kamigami de mo, mata wa, ima anata gata no sumu chi no Amori bito no kamigami de mo, anata gata no tsukaeru mono o, kyou, erabi nasai. Tadashi, watashi to watashi no ie to wa tomo ni Shu ni tsukaemasu".
Sono toki, tami wa kotaete itta, "Shu o sutete, ta no kamigami ni tsukaeru nado, wareware wa kesshite itashimasen.
Wareware no kami, Shu ga mizukara wareware to, wareware no senzo to o, Ejiputo no chi, dorei no ie kara michibiki nobori, mata wareware no me no mae de, ano ooinaru shirushi o okonai, wareware no iku subete no michi de mamori, wareware ga tootta subete no kokumin no naka de wareware o mamoraretakara desu.
Shu wa mata, kono chi ni sunde ita Amori bito nado, subete no tami o, wareware no mae kara oiharawaremashita. Sore yue, wareware mo Shu ni tsukaemasu. Shu wa wareware no kami dakara desu".
Shikashi, Yoshua wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa Shu ni tsukaeru koto wa dekinaide arou. Shu wa sei naru kami de ari, netamu kami de atte, anata gata no tsumi, anata gata no toga o, yurusarenaikara de aru.
Moshi anata gata ga Shu o sutete, kotonaru kamigami ni tsukaerunaraba, anata gata ni saiwai o kudasareta nochi ni mo, hirugaette anata gata ni wazawai o kudashi, anatagata o horoboshi tsukusarerude arou".
Tami wa Yoshua ni itta, "Iie, wareware wa Shu ni tsukaemasu".
Soko de Yoshua wa tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa Shu o erande, Shu ni tsukaeru to itta. Anata gata mizukara sono shounin de aru". Karera wa itta, "Wareware wa shounin desu".
Yoshua wa mata itta, "Sore naraba, anata gata no uchi ni aru, kotonaru kamigami o nozokisari, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni, kokoro o katamuke nasai".
Tami wa Yoshua ni itta, "Wareware no kami, Shu ni, wareware wa tsukae, sono koe ni kiki shitagaimasu".
Kou shite Yoshua wa, sono hi, tami to keiyaku o musubi, Shikemu ni oite, sadame to, okite o, karera no tame ni mouketa.
Yoshua wa korera no kotoba o kami no rippou no sho ni shirushi, ookina ishi o totte, sono tokoro de, Shu no seijo ni aru kashi no ki no shita ni sore o tate,
Yoshua wa, subete no tami ni itta, "Miyo, kono ishi wa wareware no akashi to narude arou. Shu ga wareware ni katarareta subete no kotoba o, kiitakara de aru. Sore yue, anata gata ga jibun no kami o suteru koto no nai tame ni, kono ishi ga, anata gata no akashi to narude arou".
Kou shite Yoshua wa tami o, onoono sono shigyou no chi ni kishi saraseta.
Korera no koto no nochi, Shu no shimobe, Nun no ko Yoshua wa hyaku toosai de shinda,
Hitobito wa kare o sono shigyou no chi no uchi no temunate sera ni houmutta. Temunate sera wa, Efuraimu no sanchi de, Gaashi yama no kita ni aru.
Isuraeru wa Yoshua no yo ni aru hi no aida, mata Shu ga Isuraeru no tame ni okonawareta moromoro no koto o shitte ite, Yoshua no ato ni ikinokotta chouroutachi ga yo ni aru hi no aida, tsune ni Shu ni tsukaeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga, Ejiputo kara tazusae nobotta Yosefu no hone wa, mukashi Yakobu ga gin hyakumai de, Shikemu no chichi Hamoru no kora kara kaitotta Shikemu no uchi no jisho no ichibu ni houmurareta. Kore wa Yosefu no shison no shigyou to natta.
Aron no ko Ereazaru mo shinda. Hitobito wa kare o, sono ko Pinehasu ni ataerareta machi de, Efuraimu no sanchi ni aru Gibea ni houmutta.
Yoshua ga shinda nochi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni toute itta, "Watashitachi no uchi, dare ga saki ni semenobotte, Kanan bito to tatakaimashou ka".
Shu wa iwareta, "Yuda ga noborubekide aru. Watashi wa kono kuni o kare no te ni watashita".
Yuda wa sono kyoudai Shimeon ni itta, "Watashi to issho ni, watashi ni wariaterareta ryouchi e nobotte itte, Kanan bito to tatakatte kudasai. Sou sureba watashi mo anata to issho ni, anata ni wariaterareta ryouchi e ikimashou". Soko de Shimeon wa kare to issho ni itta.
Yuda ga nobotte ikuto, Shu wa karera no te ni Kanan bito to Periji bito to o watasareta no de, karera wa Bezeku de ichi mannin o uchiyaburi,
Mata Bezeku de Adonibezeku ni ai, kare to tatakatte Kanan bito to Periji bito to o uchiyabutta.
Adonibezeku wa nigetaga, karera wa sono ato o otte kare o torae, sono teashi no oyayubi o kirihanatta.
Adonibezeku wa itta, "Katsute nanajuunin no outachi ga teashi no oyayubi o kirarete, watashi no shokutaku no shita de, kuzu o hirotta koto ga attaga, kami wa watashi ga shita you ni, watashi ni mukuirareta no da". Hitobito wa kare o Erusaremu e tsurete ittaga, kare wa soko de shinda.
Yuda no hitobito wa Erusaremu o semete, kore o tori, tsurugi o motte kore o uchi, machi ni hi o hanatta.
Sono nochi, Yuda no hitobito wa sanchi to Negebu to heichi ni sunde iru Kanan bito to tatakau tame ni kudattaga,
Yuda wa mazu Heburon ni sunde iru Kanan bito o semete, Seshai to Ahiman to Tarumai o uchiyabutta. Heburon no moto no na wa kiriate aruba de atta.
Mata soko kara susunde Debiru no juumin o semeta. (Debiru no moto no na wa kiriate seperu de atta.)
Toki ni Karebu wa itta, "Kiriate seperu o utte, kore o toru mono ni wa, watashi no musume Akusa o tsuma to shite ataerude arou".
Karebu no otouto Kenazu no ko Otenieru ga sore o totta no de, Karebu wa musume Akusa o tsuma to shite kare ni ataeta.
Akusa wa iku toki kanojo no chichi ni hatake o motomeru koto o otto ni susumerareta no de, Akusa ga roba kara oriruto, Karebu wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa nani o nozomu no ka".
Akusa wa kare ni itta, "Watashi ni okurimono o kudasai. Anata wa watashi o Negebu no chi e yarareru no desukara, izumi o mo kudasai". Sore de Karebu wa ue no izumi to shita no izumi to o kanojo ni ataeta.
Moose no shuuto de aru Keni bi to no shison wa Yuda no hitobito to tomo ni, shuro no machi kara Arado ni chikai Negebu ni aru Yuda no no ni nobotte kite, Amareku bito to tomo ni sunda.
Soshite Yuda wa sono kyoudai Shimeon to tomo ni itte, Zepate ni sunde ita Kanan bito o uchi, sore o kotogotoku horoboshita. Kore ni yotte sono machi no na wa Horuma to yobareta.
Yuda wa mata Gaza to sono chiiki, Ashikeron to sono chiiki, Ekuron to sono chiiki o totta.
Shu ga Yuda to tomo ni orareta no de, Yuda wa tsuini sanchi o te ni iretaga, heichi ni sunde ita tami wa tetsu no sensha o motte ita no de, kore o oidasu koto ga dekinakatta.
Hitobito wa Moose ga katsute itta you ni, Heburon o Karebu ni ataeta no de, Karebu wa sono tokoro kara Anaku no sannin no ko o oidashita.
Beniyamin no hitobito wa Erusaremu ni sunde ita Ebusu bito o oidasanakatta no de, Ebusu bito wa konnichi made Beniyamin no hitobito to tomo ni Erusaremu ni sunde iru.
Yosefu no ichizoku wa mata Beteru ni semenobottaga, Shu wa karera to tomo ni orareta.
Sunawachi Yosefu no ichizoku wa hito o yatte Beteru o saguraseta. Kono machi no moto no na wa Ruzu de atta.
Sono sekkoutachi wa machi kara dete kita hito o mite, itta, "Douzo kono machi ni hairu michi o oshiete kudasai. Sou sureba watashitachi wa anata ni megumi o hodokoshimashou".
Kare ga machi ni hairu michi o oshieta no de, karera wa tsurugi o motte machi o utta. Shikashi, kano hito to sono kazoku wa jiyuu ni saraseta.
Sono hito wa Hete bito no chi ni itte machi o tate, sore o Ruzu to nazuketa. Kore wa konnichi made sono na de aru.
Manase wa Beteshan to sono murazato no juumin, Taanaku to sono murazato no juumin, Doru to sono murazato no juumin, Ibureamu to sono murazato no juumin, Megido to sono murazato no juumin o oidasanakatta no de, Kanan bito wa hikitsuzuite sono chi ni sunde itaga,
Isuraeru wa tsuyoku natta toki, Kanan bito o kyousei roudou ni fukusase, karera o kotogotoku wa oidasanakatta.
Mata Efuraimu wa Gezeru ni sunde ita Kanan bito o oidasanakatta no de, Kanan bito wa Gezeru ni oite karera no uchi ni sunde ita.
Zeburun wa Kiteron no juumin oyobi Nahararu no juumin o oidasanakatta no de, Kanan bito wa karera no uchi ni sunde kyousei roudou ni fukushita.
Aseru wa Akko no juumin oyobi Shidon, Aherabu, Akujibu, Heruba, Apiku, Rehobu no juumin o oidasanakatta no de,
Aseru bi to wa, sono chi no juumin de aru Kanan bito no uchi ni sunde ita. Karera ga oidasanakattakara de aru.
Nafutari wa Beteshimeshi no juumin oyobi Beteanate no juumin o oidasazu ni, sono chi no juumin de aru Kanan bito no uchi ni sunde ita. Shikashi Beteshimeshi to Beteanate no juumin wa, tsuini karera no kyousei roudou ni fukushita.
Amori bi to wa Dan no hitobito o sanchi ni oikonde heichi ni kudaru koto o yurusanakatta.
Amori bi to wa hikitsuzuite Haruheresu, Ayaron, Sharabimu ni sunde itaga, Yosefu no ichizoku no te ga tsuyoku natta no de, karera wa kyousei roudou ni fukushita.
Amori bito no sakai wa Akurabimu no saka kara sera o hete ue no hou ni oyonda.
Shu no tsukai ga Girugaru kara Bokimu ni nobotte itta, "Watashi wa anatagata o Ejiputo kara noborasete, anata gata no senzo ni chikatta chi ni tsurete kite, itta, 'Watashi wa anata to musunda keiyaku o kesshite yaburu koto wa nai.
Anata gata wa kono kuni no juumin to keiyaku o musunde wa naranai. Karera no saidan o ko bota nakereba naranai' to. Shikashi, anata gata wa watashi no meirei ni shitagawanakatta. Anata gata wa, nan to iu koto o shita no ka.
Sore de watashi wa iu, 'Watashi wa anata gata no mae kara karera o oiharawanaide arou. Karera wa kaette anata gata no teki to nari, karera no kamigami wa anata gata no wana to narude arou' to".
Shu no tsukai ga korera no kotoba o Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ni tsugeta no de, tami wa koe o agete naita.
Sore de sono tokoro no na o Bokimu to yonda. Soshite karera wa sono tokoro de Shu ni gisei o sasageta.
Yoshua ga tami o saraseta no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa onoono sono ryouchi e itte tochi o eta.
Tami wa Yoshua no zaiseichuu mo, mata Yoshua no ato ni ikinokotta chouroutachi, sunawachi Shu ga katsute Isuraeru no tame ni okonawareta subete no ooinaru waza o mita hitobito no zaiseichuu mo Shu ni tsukaeta.
Kou shite Shu no shimobe Nun no ko Yoshua wa hyaku toosai de shinda.
Hitobito wa kare o Efuraimu no sanchi no Gaashi yama no kita no temunate heresu ni aru kare no ryouchiuchi ni houmutta.
Soshite sono jidai no mono mo mata kotogotoku sono senzotachi no moto ni atsumerareta. Sono nochi hoka no jidai ga tattaga, kore wa Shu o shirazu, mata Shu ga Isuraeru no tame ni okonawareta waza o mo shiranakatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu no mae ni aku o okonai, moromoro no Baaru ni tsukae,
Katsute Ejiputo no chi kara karera o michibikidasareta senzotachi no kami, Shu o sutete, hoka no kamigami sunawachi shuui ni aru kokumin no kamigami ni shitagai, sore ni hizamazuite, Shu no ikari o hikiokoshita.
Sunawachi karera wa Shu o sutete, Baaru to Ashitarote ni tsukaeta no de,
Shu no ikari ga Isuraeru ni taishite moe, kasume ubau mono no te ni watashite, kasume ubawase, katsu shuui no moromoro no teki no te ni urareta no de, karera wa futatabi sono teki ni tachimukau koto ga dekinakatta.
Karera ga doko e itte mo, Shu no te wa karera ni wazawai o shita. Kore wa Shu ga katsute iware, mata Shu ga karera ni chikawareta toori de, karera wa hidoku nayanda.
Sono toki, Shu wa sabaki zukasa o okoshite, karera o kasume ubau mono no te kara sukuidasareta.
Shikashi karera wa sono sabaki zukasa ni mo shitagawazu, kaette hoka no kamigami o shitatte sore to kan'in o okonai, sore ni hizamazuki, senzotachi ga Shu no meirei ni shitagatte ayunda michi o, ichihayaku hanaresatte, sono you ni wa okonawanakatta.
Shu ga karera no tame ni sabaki zukasa o okosareta toki, sono sabaki zukasa no zaiseichuu, Shu wa sabaki zukasa to tomo ni orarete, karera o teki no te kara sukuidasareta. Kore wa karera ga jibun o shi etage nayamashita mono no yue ni, umeki kanashinda no de, Shu ga karera o awaremaretakara de aru.
Shikashi sabaki zukasa ga shinuto, karera wa somuite, senzotachi ni masatte aku o okonai, hoka no kamigami ni shitagatte sore ni tsukae, sore ni hizamazuite sono okonai o yamezu, katakuna na michi o hanarenakatta.
Sore de Shu wa Isuraeru ni taishi hageshiku ikatte iwareta, "Kono tami wa watashi ga katsute senzotachi ni meijita keiyaku o okashi, watashi no meirei ni shitagawanai yue,
Watashi mo mata Yoshua ga shinda toki ni nokoshite oita kokumin o, kono nochi, karera no mae kara oiharawanaide arou.
Kore wa Isuraeru ga, senzotachi no mamotta you ni Shu no michi o mamotte sore ni ayumu ka dou ka o watashi ga kokoromiru tame de aru".
Sore yue Shu wa korera no kokumin o isoide oiharawazu ni nokoshite oite, Yoshua no te ni watasarenakatta no de aru.
Subete Kanan no moromoro no sensou o shiranai Isuraeru no hitobito o kokoromiru tame ni, Shu ga nokoshite okareta kokumin wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Kore wa tada Isuraeru no yoyo no shison, tokuni mada sensou o shiranai mono ni, sore o oshie shiraseru tame de aru.
Sunawachi Perishite bito no gonin no kimitachi to, subete no Kanan bito to, Shidon bito oyobi Rebanonyama ni sunde, Baaru Herumon yama kara Hamate no iriguchi made o shimete ita Hibi bito nado de atte,
Korera o motte Isuraeru o kokoromi, Shu ga Moose ni yotte senzotachi ni meijirareta meirei ni, karera ga shitagau ka dou ka o shirou to sareta no de aru.
Shikaru ni Isuraeru no hitobito wa Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no uchi ni sunde,
Karera no musume o tsuma ni metori, mata jibuntachi no musume o karera no musuko ni ataete, karera no kamigami ni tsukaeta.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu no mae ni aku o okonai, jibuntachi no kami, Shu o wasurete, Baaru oyobi Ashira ni tsukaeta.
Soko de Shu wa Isuraeru ni taishite hageshiku ikari, karera o Mesopotamiya no ou kushan rishataimu no te ni uriwatasareta no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa hachi nen no aida, kushan rishataimu ni tsukaeta.
Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito ga Shu ni yobawatta toki, Shu wa Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni, hitori no kyuujosha o okoshite karera o sukuwareta. Sunawachi Karebu no otouto, Kenazu no ko Otenieru de aru.
Shu no rei ga Otenieru ni nozonda no de, kare wa Isuraeru o sabaita. Kare ga tatakai ni deruto, Shu wa Mesopotamiya no ou kushan rishataimu o sono te ni watasareta no de, Otenieru no te wa kushan rishataimu ni kachi,
Kuni wa yonjuu nen no aida taihei de atta. Kenazu no ko Otenieru wa tsuini shinda.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mata Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta. Sunawachi karera ga Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta no de, Shu wa Moabu no ou Eguron o tsuyomete, Isuraeru ni tekitai saserareta.
Eguron wa Anmon oyobi Amareku no hitobito o atsume, kite Isuraeru o uchi, shuro no machi o senryou shita.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa juu hachi nen no aida Moabu no ou Eguron ni tsukaeta.
Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito ga Shu ni yobawatta toki, Shu wa karera no tame ni, hitori no kyuujosha o okosareta. Sunawachi Beniyamin bi to, gera no ko, hidarikiki no Ehode de aru. Isuraeru no hitobito wa kare ni yotte Moabu no ou Eguron ni, mitsugi mono o okutta.
Ehode wa nagasa ichi kyubito no moroha no tsurugi o tsukurase, sore o koromo no shita, migi no momo no ue ni obite,
Moabu no ou Eguron ni mitsugi mono o motte kita. Eguron wa hijou ni koeta hito de atta.
Ehode ga mitsugi mono o sasage owatta toki, kare wa mitsugi mono o ni natte kita tami o kaerase,
Kare jishin wa Girugaru ni chikai sekizou no aru tokoro kara hikikaeshite itta, "Ou yo, watashi wa anata ni moushiageru kimitsu o motte imasu". Soko de ou wa "Sagatte ore" to itta no de, katawara ni tatte iru mono wa mina dete itta.
Ehode ga ou no tokoro ni haitte kuruto, ou wa hitori de suzumi no takadono ni zashite ita no de, Ehode ga "Watashi wa kami no inochi ni yotte anata ni moushiageru koto ga arimasu" to iuto, ou wa za kara tachiagatta.
Sono toki Ehode wa hidari no te o nobashi, migi no momo kara tsurugi o totte ou no hara o sashita.
Tsurugi no tsuka mo ha to tomo ni haittaga, tsurugi o hara kara nukidasanakatta no de, shibou ga ha o fusaida. Soshite obutsu ga deta.
Ehode wa rouka ni dete, ou no oru takadono no to o toji, jou o oroshita.
Kare ga deta nochi, ou no shimobedomo ga kite, takadono no to ni jou no orosarete aru no o mite, "Ou wa kitto suzumidono no heya de ashi o ootte orareru no da" to omotta.
Shimobedomo wa nagai aida matte itaga, ou ga nao takadono no to o hirakanai no de, shinpai shite kagi o totte hiraite miruto, ou wa yuka ni taorete shinde ita.
Ehode wa karera no tamerau ma ni, nogarete sekizou no aru tokoro o sugi, Seira ni nigete itta.
Kare ga itte Efuraimu no sanchi ni rappa o fukinarashita no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa kare to tomo ni sanchi kara kudatte Ehode ni shitagatta.
Ehode wa karera ni itta, "Watashi ni tsuite ki nasai. Shu wa anata gata no teki Moabu bito o anata gata no te ni watasaremasu". Soko de karera wa Ehode ni shitagatte kudari, Yorudan no watashiba o osae, Moabu bito o hitori mo watarasenakatta.
Sono toki karera wa Moabu bito ooyoso ichi mannin o koroshita. Kore wa izure mo koefutotta yuushi de atte, hitori mo, nogareta mono ga nakatta.
Kou shite Moabu wa sono hi Isuraeru no te ni fukushi, kuni wa hachijuu nen no aida taihei de atta.
Ehode no nochi, Anate no ko Shamugaru ga okori, ushi no muchi o motte Perishite bito roppyakunin o koroshita. Kono hito mo mata Isuraeru o sukutta.
Ehode ga shinda nochi, Isuraeru no hitobito ga mata Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta no de,
Shu wa, Hazoru de yo o osamete ita Kanan no ouYabin no te ni karera o uriwatasareta. Yabin no gunzei no chou wa harosete goimu ni sunde ita Shisera de atta.
Kare wa tetsu no sensha kyuuhyaku ryou o mochi, nijuu nen no aida Isuraeru no hitobito o hageshiku shi etageta no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni mukatte yobawatta.
Sono koro Rapidote no tsuma, onna yogensha Debora ga Isuraeru o sabaite ita.
Kanojo wa Efuraimu no sanchi no Rama to Beteru no aida ni aru Debora no shuro no ki no shita ni zashi, Isuraeru no hitobito wa kanojo no moto ni nobotte kite, sabaki o uketa.
Debora wa hito o tsukawashite, Nafutari no Kedeshi kara Abinoamu no ko Baraku o maneite itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa anata ni, kou meijirarerude wa arimasen ka, 'Nafutari no buzoku to Zeburun no buzoku kara ichi mannin o hikii, itte, Taboruyama ni jin o shike.
Watashi wa Yabin no gunzei no chouShisera to sono sensha to guntai to o Kishon kawa ni hikiyosete, anata ni deawase, kare o anata no te ni watasude arou' ".
Baraku wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata ga moshi issho ni itte kudasareba, watashi wa ikimasu. Shikashi, issho ni itte kudasaranainaraba, ikimasen".
Debora wa itta, "Kanarazu anata to issho ni ikimasu. Shikashi anata wa ima iku michi de wa homare o enaideshou. Shu wa Shisera o onna no te ni watasarerukara desu". Debora wa tatte Baraku to issho ni Kedeshi ni itta.
Baraku wa Zeburun to Nafutari o Kedeshi ni yobiatsume, ichi mannin o shitagaete nobotta. Debora mo kare to tomo ni nobotta.
Toki ni Keni bi to Heberu wa Moose no shuuto Hobabu no shison de aru Keni bito kara wakarete, Kedeshi ni chikai Zaanaimu no kashi no ki made mo tooku itte tenmaku o hatte ita.
Abinoamu no ko Baraku ga Taboruyama ni nobotta to, hitobito ga Shisera ni tsugeta no de,
Shisera wa jibun no sensha no zenbu sunawachi tetsu no sensha kyuuhyaku ryou to, jibun to tomo ni oru subete no tami o Harosete Goimu kara Kishon kawa ni yobiatsumeta.
Debora wa Baraku ni itta, "Saa, tachiagari nasai. Kyou wa Shu ga Shisera o anata no te ni watasareru hi desu. Shu wa anata ni sakidatte derarerude wa arimasen ka". Soko de Baraku wa ichi mannin o shitagaete Taboru yama kara kudatta.
Shu wa tsurugi o motte Shisera to subete no sensha oyobi gunzei o kotogotoku Baraku no mae ni uchi yaburareta no de, Shisera wa sensha kara tobiori, toho de nigesatta.
Baraku wa sensha to gunzei to o tsuigeki shite Harosete Goimu made itta. Shisera no gunzei wa kotogotoku tsurugi ni taorete, nokotta mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Shikashi Shisera wa toho de nigesatte, Keni bi to Eberu no tsumaYaeru no tenmaku ni itta. Hazoru no ouYabin to Keni bi to Eberu no ie to wa tagai ni mutsumajikattakara de aru.
Yaeru wa dete kite Shisera o mukae, kare ni itta, "Ohairi kudasai. Shu yo, douzo uchi e ohairi kudasai. Osoreru ni wa oyobimasen". Shisera ga tenmaku ni haitta no de, Yaeru wa moufu o motte kare o ootta.
Shisera wa Yaeru ni itta, "Douzo, watashi ni mizu o sukoshi nomasete kudasai. Nodo ga kawakimashitakara". Yaeru wa chichi no kawabukuro o hiraite kare ni nomase, mata kare o ootta.
Shisera wa mata Yaeru ni itta, "Tenmaku no iriguchi ni tatte ite kudasai. Moshi hito ga kite, anata ni 'Dare ka, koko ni orimasu ka' to tounaraba 'Orimasen' to kotaete kudasai".
Shikashi kare ga tsukarete jukusui shita toki, Heberu no tsumaYaeru wa tenmaku no kugi o tori, te ni tsuchi o tazusaete kare ni shinobiyori, komekami ni kugi o uchikonde chi ni sashitooshita no de, kare wa iki taete shinda.
Baraku ga Shisera o otte kita toki, Yaeru wa kare o demukaete itta, "Oide nasai. Anata ga motomete iru hito o omise shimashou". Kare ga Yaeru no tenmaku ni haitte miruto, Shisera wa komekami ni kugi o utarete taorete shinde ita.
Kou shite sono hi, kami wa Kanan no ouYabin o Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni uchi yaburareta.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito no te wa masumasu Kanan bito no ouYabin no ue ni omoku natte, tsuini Kanan no ouYabin o horobosu ni itatta.
Sono hi Debora to Abinoamu no ko Baraku wa uta tte itta.
"Isuraeru no shidousha tachi wa saki ni tachi, tami wa yorokobiisande susumideta. Shu osan bi seyo.
Moromoro no ou yo kike, moromoro no kimi yo, mimi o katamukeyo. Watashi wa Shu ni mukatte utaou, watashi wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu o hometataeyou.
Shu yo, anata ga Seiru o de, Edomu no chi kara susumareta toki, chi wa furui, ten wa shita tari, kumo wa mizu o shitataraseta.
Moromoro no yama wa Shu no mae ni yuri ugoki, Shinai no Shu, sunawachi Isuraeru no kami, Shu no mae ni yuri ugoita.
Anate no ko Shamugaru no toki, Yaeru no toki ni wa taishou wa tae, tabibito wa wakimichi o tootta.
Isuraeru ni wa noumin ga tae, karera wa tae hatetaga, Debora yo, tsuini anata wa tachiagari, tatte Isuraeru no haha to natta.
Hitobito ga atarashii kamigami o eranda toki, tatakai wa mon ni oyonda. Isuraeru no yon mannin no uchi ni, tate aruiha yari no mirareta koto ga atta ka.
Watashi no kokoro wa tami no uchi no yorokobiisande susumideta Isuraeru no tsukasatachi to tomo ni aru. Shu osan bi seyo.
Chairo no roba ni noru mono, mousen no ue ni suwaru mono, oyobi michi o ayumu mono yo, tomo ni utae.
Gakujin no shirabe wa mizu kumu tokoro ni kikoeru. Karera wa soko de Shu no sukui o tonae, Isuraeru no noumin no sukui o tonaete iru. Sono toki, Shu no tami wa mon ni kudatte itta.
Okiyo, okiyo, Debora. Okiyo, okiyo, uta o utae. Tateyo, Baraku, toriko o toraeyo, Abinoamu no ko yo.
Sono toki, nokotta mono wa tattoi mono no you ni kudatte iki, Shu no tami wa yuushi no you ni kudatte itta.
Karera wa Efuraimu kara dete tani ni susumi, kyoudai Beniyamin wa anata no tami no uchi ni aru. Makiru kara wa tsukasatachi ga kudatte iki, Zeburun kara wa shiki o toru mono ga kudatte itta.
Issakaru no kimitachi wa Debora to tomo ni ori, Issakaru wa Baraku to onajiku, tadachini sono ato ni tsuite tani ni tosshin shita. Shikashi Ruben no shizoku wa ooini shian shita.
Naze, anata wa, ori no aida ni todomatte, hitsuji no mure ni fue fuku no o kiite iru no ka. Ruben no shizoku wa ooini shian shita.
Gireade wa Yorudan no mukou ni todomatte ita. Naze, Dan wa fune no katawara ni todomatta ka. Aseru wa hamabe ni zashi, sono hatoba no katawara ni todomatte ita.
Zeburun wa inochi o sutete, shi o osorenu tami de aru. No no takai tokoro ni oru Nafutari mo mata sou de atta.
Moromoro no outachi wa kite tatakatta. Sono toki Kanan no outachi wa, Megido no mizu no hotori no Taanaku de tatakatta. Karera wa ippen no gin o mo enakatta.
Moromoro no hoshi wa ten yori tatakai, sono kidou o hanarete Shisera to tatakatta.
Kishon no kawa wa karera o oshinagashita, hageshiku nagareru kawa, Kishon no kawa. Waga tamashii yo, isamashiku susume.
Sono toki, gunba wa hase kakeri, uma no hizume wa chi o fuminarashita.
Shu no tsukai wa itta, 'Merozu o noroe, hageshiku sono tami o noroe, karera wa kite Shu o tasukezu, Shu o tasukete yuushi o semenakattakara de aru'.
Keni bi to Eberu no tsumaYaeru wa, onna no uchi no mottomo megumareta mono, tenmaku ni sumu onna no uchi mottomo megumareta mono de aru.
Shisera ga mizu o motomeruto, Yaeru wa chichi o ataeta. Sunawachi kichou na hachi ni gyounyuu o motte sasageta.
Yaeru wa kugi ni te o kake, migite ni omoi tsuchi o totte, Shisera o uchi, sono atama o kudaki, konagona ni shite, sono komekami o uchitsuranuita.
Shisera wa Yaeru no ashimoto ni kagande taorefushi, sono ashimoto ni kagande taore, sono kaganda tokoro ni taorete shinda.
Shisera no haha wa mado kara nagame, koushi mado kara sakende itta, 'Dou shite kare no kuruma no kuru no ga osoi no ka, dou shite kare no kuruma no ayumi ga hakadoranai no ka'.
Sono jijotachi no kashikoi mono wa kotae, haha mata mizukara onore ni kotaete itta,
'Karera wa emono o ete, sore o wakete iru no de wa nai ka, hitogoto ni hitori, futari no onago o tori, Shisera no emono wa iro zome no koromo, nuitori shita iro zome no koromo no emono de arou. Sunawachi nuitori shita iro zome no koromo futatsu o, emono to shite sono kubi ni matoude arou'.
Shu yo, anata no teki wa mina kono you ni horobi, anata o aisuru mono o taiyou no ikioi yoku noboru you ni shite kudasai". Kou shite nochi, kuni wa yonjuu nen no aida taihei de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mata Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta no de, Shu wa karera o shichi nen no aida Midean bito no te ni watasareta.
