Shikashi ichijiku no ki wa karera ni itta, 'Watashi wa dou shite watashi no kanmi to, watashi no yoi kajitsu to o sutete itte, moromoro no ki o osameru koto ga dekimashou'.
Moromoro no ki wa mata budou no ki ni itta, 'Kite watashitachi no ou ni natte kudasai'.
Shikashi, budou no ki wa karera ni itta, 'Watashi wa dou shite kami to hito to o yorokobaseru watashi no budoushu o sutete itte, moromoro no ki o osameru koto ga dekimashou'.
Soko de subete no ki wa ibara ni itta, 'Kite watashitachi no ou ni natte kudasai'.
Ibara wa moromoro no ki ni itta, 'Anata gata ga shinjitsu ni watashi o tatete ou ni surunaraba, kite watashi no kage ni nan o sake nasai. Sou shinakereba, ibara kara hi ga dete Rebanon no kouhaku o yaki tsukusudeshou'.
Anata gata ga Abimereku o tatete ou ni shita koto wa, shinjitsu to keii to o motte shita mono desu ka. Anata gata wa Erubaaru to sono ie o yoku atsukai, kare no okonai ni oujite shita no desu ka.
Watashi no chichi wa anata gata no tame ni tatakai, jibun no inochi o nagedashite, anatagata o Midean no te kara sukuidashita no ni,
Anata gata wa, kyou, watashi no chichi no ie ni hankou shite okori, sono ko nanajuunin o hitotsu no ishi no ue de koroshi, sono koshimoto no ko Abimereku o anata gata no miuchi no mono de aru yue ni tatete, Shikemu no hitobito no ou ni shimashita.
Anata ga taga, kyou, Erubaaru to sono ie ni nasareta koto ga shinjitsu to keii o motte shita mono de arunaraba, Abimereku no tame ni yorokobi nasai. Kare mo mata anata gata no tame ni yorokobudeshou.
Shikashi, sou de nakereba, Abimereku kara hi ga dete, Shikemu no hitobito to Betemiro to o yakitsukushi, mata Shikemu no hitobito to Betemiro kara mo hi ga dete Abimereku o yaki tsukusudeshou".
Kou shite Yotamu wa hashitte nigesari, Beeru ni iki, kyoudai Abimereku no kao o sakete soko ni sunda.
Abimereku wa san nen no aida Isuraeru o osametaga,
Kami wa Abimereku to Shikemu no hitobito no aida ni akurei o okurareta no de, Shikemu no hitobito wa Abimereku o azamuku you ni natta.
Kore wa Erubaaru no nanajuunin no ko ga uketa bougyaku to karera no chi ga, karera o koroshita kyoudai Abimereku no ue to, kare no te o tsuyomete sono kyoudai o korosaseta Shikemu no hitobito no ue to ni mukui to natte kita no de aru.
Shikemu no hitobito wa kare ni tekishite machibuse suru mono o yamayama no itadaki ni oki, subete sono michi o toorisugiru mono o ryakudatsu saseta. Kono koto ga Abimereku ni tsugeshirasareta.
Sate Ebede no ko Gaaru wa sono miuchi no hitobito to issho ni Shikemu ni ijuu shitaga, Shikemu no hitobito wa kare o shin'you shita.
Hitobito wa hatake ni dete budou o toriire, sore o fumi shibotte matsuri o shi, kami no miya ni itte nomikui shite Abimereku o norotta.
Soshite Ebede no ko Gaaru wa itta, "Abimereku wa nanimono ka. Shikemu no wareware wa nani mo no nareba kare ni tsukaenakereba naranai no ka. Erubaaru no ko to sono yakunin Zeburu wa Shikemu no senzo Hamoru no ichizoku ni tsukaetade wa nai ka. Wareware wa dou shite kare ni tsukaenakereba naranai no ka.
Aa, kono tami ga watashi no te no shita ni attara yoi no daga. Sou sureba watashi wa Abimereku o yamesase, Abimereku ni mukatte 'Omae no gunzei o mashite dete koi' to iude arou".
Machi no tsukasa Zeburu wa Ebede no ko Gaaru no kotoba o kiite ikari o hasshi,
Shisha o Aruma ni oru Abimereku ni tsukawashite iwaseta, "Ebede no ko Gaaru to sono miuchi no hitobito ga Shikemu ni kite, machi o sawagase, anata ni somukaseyou to shite imasu.
Sore de anata to, anata to tomo ni oru hitobito ga yoru no uchi ni itte, no ni mi o fuse,
Asa ni natte, hi no noboru toki, hayaku okidete machi o osounaraba, Gaaru to, kare to tomo ni oru tami wa dete kite, anata ni teikou surudeshou. Sono toki anata wa hata o ete, karera o utsu koto ga dekirudeshou".
Abimereku to, kare to tomo ni ita subete no tami wa yoru no uchi ni okidete, yon kumi ni wakare, mi o fusete Shikemu o ukagatta.
Ebede no ko Gaaru ga dete, machi no mon no iriguchi ni tatta toki, Abimereku to, kare to tomo ni ita tami ga mi o fusete ita tokoro kara tachiagatta no de,
Gaaru wa tami o mite Zeburu ni itta, "Goran nasai. Tami ga yamayama no itadaki kara orite kimasu". Zeburu wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa yamayama no kage o hito no you ni miru no desu".
Gaaru wa futatabi itta, "Goran nasai. Tami ga kuni no chuuou bu kara orite kimasu. Ichi kumi wa uranaishi no Terebin no ki no hou kara kimasu".
Zeburu wa kare ni itta, "Anata ga katsute 'Abimereku wa nanimono ka. Wareware wa nani mo no nareba kare ni tsukaenakereba naranai no ka' to itta anata no kuchi wa ima doko ni arimasu ka. Kore wa anata ga anadotta tami de wa arimasen ka. Ima, dete karera to tatakai nasai".
Soko de Gaaru wa Shikemu no hitobito o hikii, dete Abimereku to tatakattaga,
Abimereku wa kare o otta no de, Gaaru wa kare no mae kara nigeta. Soshite kizutsuki taoreru mono ga ooku, mon no iriguchi ni made oyonda.
Kou shite Abimereku wa hikitsuzuite Aruma ni itaga, Zeburu wa Gaaru to sono miuchi no hitobito o oidashite Shikemu ni orasenakatta.
Yokujitsu, tami ga hatake ni deruto, sono koto ga Abimereku ni kikoeta.
Abimereku wa jibun no tami o hikii, sore o san kumi ni wake, no ni mi o fusete, ukagatte iruto, tami ga machi kara dete kita no de, tachiagatte kore o utta.
Abimereku to, kare to tomo ni ita kumi no mono wa osotte itte, machi no mon no iriguchi ni tachi, ta no ni kumi wa no ni ita subete no mono o osotte, sore o koroshita.
Abimereku wa sono hi, shuujitsu, machi o seme, tsuini machi o totte, sono uchi no tami o koroshi, machi o hakai shite, shio o maita.
Shikemu no yagura no hitobito wa mina kore o kiite, Eruberite no miya no tou ni haitta.
Shikemu no yagura no hitobito ga mina atsumatta koto ga Abimereku ni kikoeta no de,
Abimereku wa jibun to issho ni ita tami o kotogotoku hikiite Zarumon san ni nobori, Abimereku wa te ni ono o totte, ki no eda o kiriotoshi, sore o toriagete jibun no kata ni nose, issho ni ita tami ni mukatte itta, "Anata gata wa watashi ga shita koto o mita toori ni isoide shi nasai".
Soko de tami mo mata mina onoono sono eda o kiriotoshi, Abimereku ni shitagatte itte, eda o tou ni yosekake, tou ni hi o tsukete karera o semeta. Kou shite Shikemu no yagura no hitobito mo mata kotogotoku shinda. Danjo ooyoso issennin de atta.
Tsuide Abimereku wa Tebetsu ni iki, Tebetsu ni mukatte jin o hari, kore o semetottaga,
Machi no naka ni hitotsu no kengo na yagura ga atte, subete no danjo sunawachi machi no hitobito ga mina soko ni nigekomi, ato o tozashite, yagura no yane ni nobotta no de,
Abimereku wa yagura no moto ni oshiyosete kore o seme, yagura no iriguchi ni chikazuite, hi o tsukete yakou to shita toki,
Hitori no onna ga Abimereku no atama ni, usu no uwaishi o nagete, sono zu gaikotsu o kudaita.
Abimereku wa jibun no buki o motsu wakamono o isogi yonde itta, "Tsurugi o nuite watashi o korose. Samo nai to hitobito wa watashi o, onna ni korosareta no da to iude arou". Sono wakamono ga kare o sashitooshita no de kare wa shinda.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Abimereku no shinda no o mite, onoono satte ie ni kaetta.
Kono you ni kami wa Abimereku ga sono kyoudai nanajuunin o koroshite, jibun no chichi ni taishite okashita aku ni mukuirareta.
Mata kami wa Shikemu no hitobito no subete no aku o karera no koube ni mukuirareta. Kou shite Erubaaru no ko Yotamu no noroi ga, karera ni nozonda no de aru.
Abimereku no nochi, Issakaru no hito de, Dodo no ko de aru Puwa no ko Tora ga tatte Isuraeru o sukutta. Kare wa Efuraimu no sanchi no Shamiru ni sumi,
Nijuu san nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaitaga, tsuini shinde Shamiru ni houmurareta.
Kare no nochi ni Gireade bitoYairu ga tatte nijuu ni nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Kare ni sanjuunin no ko ga atta. Karera wa sanjuutou no roba ni nori, mata sanjuu no machi o motte ita. Gireade no chi de konnichi made, habote yairu to yobarete iru mono ga sore de aru.
Yairu wa shinde, Kamon ni houmurareta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa futatabi Shu no mae ni aku o okonai, Baaru to Ashitarote oyobi Suriya no kamigami, Shidon no kamigami, Moabu no kamigami, Anmon bito no kamigami, Perishite bito no kamigami ni tsukae, Shu o sutete kore ni tsukaenakatta.
Shu wa Isuraeru ni taishite ikari o hasshi, karera o Perishite bito no te oyobi Anmon bito no te ni uriwatasareta no de,
Karera wa sono nen Isuraeru no hitobito o shi etage nayamashita. Sunawachi karera wa Yorudan no mukou no Gireade ni aru Amori bito no chi ni ita subete no Isuraeru bito o juu hachi nen no aida nayamashita.
Mata Anmon no hitobito ga Yuda to Beniyamin to Efuraimu no shizoku o semeru tame ni Yorudan o watatte kita no de, Isuraeru wa hijou ni nayamasareta.
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Watashitachi wa watashitachi no kami o sutete Baaru ni tsukae, anata ni tsumi o okashimashita".
Shu wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni iwareta, "Watashi wa katsute Ejiputo bi to, Amori bi to, Anmon bi to, Perishite bito kara anatagata o sukuidashitade wa nai ka.
Mata Shidon bi to, Amareku bi to oyobi Maon bito ga anatagata o shi etageta toki, watashi ni yobawatta no de, anatagata o karera no te kara sukuidashita.
Shikashi anata gata wa watashi o sutete, hoka no kamigami ni tsukaeta. Sore yue, watashi wa kasanete anatagata o sukuwanaide arou.
Anata gata ga eranda kamigami ni itte yobawari, anata gata no nayami no toki, karera ni anatagata o sukuwaseru ga yoi".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni itta, "Watashitachi wa tsumi o okashimashita. Nan de mo anata ga yoi to omowareru koto o shite kudasai. Tada douzo, kyou, watashitachi o sukutte kudasai".
Sou shite karera wa jibuntachi no uchi kara kotonaru kamigami o torinozoite, Shu ni tsukaeta. Sore de Shu no kokoro wa Isuraeru no nayami o miru ni shinobinaku natta.
Toki ni Anmon no hitobito wa shoushuu sarete Gireade ni jin o tottaga, Isuraeru no hitobito wa atsumatte Mizupa ni jin o totta.
Sono toki, tami to Gireade no kimitachi to wa tagai ni itta, "Dare ga Anmon no hitobito ni mukatte tatakai o hajimeru ka. Sono hito wa Gireade no subete no tami no kashira to narude arou".
Sate Gireade bito Efuta wa tsuyoi yuushi de attaga yuujo no ko de, Efuta no chichi wa Gireade de atta.
Gireade no tsuma mo kodomo o undaga, sono tsuma no kodomotachi ga seichou shita toki, karera wa Efuta o oidashite kare ni itta, "Anata wa hoka no onna no unda ko dakara, watashitachi no chichi no ie o tsugu koto wa dekimasen".
Sore de Efuta wa sono kyoudaitachi no moto kara nigesatte, Tobu no chi ni sunde iruto, yakuzamono ga Efuta no moto ni atsumatte kite, kare to issho ni dekakete ryakudatsu o koto to shite ita.
Hi gata tte nochi, Anmon no hitobito wa Isuraeru to tatakau koto ni nari,
Anmon no hitobito ga Isuraeru to tatakatta toki, Gireade no chouroutachi wa itte Efuta o Tobu no chi kara tsurete koyou to shite,
Efuta ni itta, "Kite, watashitachi no taishou ni natte kudasai. Sou sureba watashitachi wa Anmon no hitobito to tatakau koto ga dekimasu".
Efuta wa Gireade no chouroutachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa watashi o nikunde, watashi no chichi no ie kara oidashitade wa arimasen ka. Shikaru ni ima anata gata ga komatte iru toki to wa ie, watashi no tokoro ni kuru to wa dou iu wake desu ka".
Gireade no chouroutachi wa Efuta ni itta, "Sore de watashitachi wa ima, anata ni kaetta no desu. Douzo, watashitachi to issho ni itte, Anmon no hitobito to tatakatte kudasai. Soshite watashitachi to Gireade ni sunde iru subete no mono to no kashira ni natte kudasai".
Efuta wa Gireade no chouroutachi ni itta, "Moshi anata ga taga, watashi o tsurete kaette, Anmon no hitobito to tatakawaseru toki, Shu ga karera o watashi ni watasarerunaraba, watashi wa anata gata no kashira to narimashou".
Gireade no chouroutachi wa Efuta ni itta, "Shu wa anata to watashitachi no aida no shounin desu. Watashitachi wa kanarazu anata no iwareru toori ni shimashou".
Soko de Efuta wa Gireade no chouroutachi to issho ni itta. Tami wa kare o tatete jibuntachi no kashira to shi, taishou to shita. Sore de Efuta wa Mizupa de, jibun no kotoba o kotogotoku Shu no mae ni nobeta.
Kakute Efuta wa Anmon no hitobito no ou ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Anata wa watashi to nan no kakawari ga atte, watashi no tokoro e semete kite, watashi no kuni to tatakaou to suru no desu ka".
Anmon no hitobito no ou wa Efuta no shisha ni kotaeta, "Mukashi, Isuraeru ga Ejiputo kara nobotte kita toki, Arunon kara Yaboku ni oyobi, mata Yorudan ni oyobu watashi no kuni o ubaitottakara desu. Sore yue ima, odayaka ni sore o kaeshi nasai".
Efuta wa mata shisha o Anmon no hitobito no ou ni tsukawashite,
Iwaseta, "Efuta wa kou moushimasu, 'Isuraeru wa Moabu no chi mo, mata Anmon no hitobito no chi mo torimasendeshita.
Isuraeru wa Ejiputo kara nobotte kita toki, arano o tootte koukai ni i tari, Kadeshi ni kimashita.
Soshite Isuraeru wa shisha o Edomu no ou ni tsukawashite "Douzo, wareware ni anata no kuni o toorasete kudasai" to iwasemashitaga, Edomu no ou wa kikiiremasendeshita. Mata onaji you ni hito o Moabu no ou ni tsukawashitaga, kare mo shoudaku shinakatta no de, Isuraeru wa Kadeshi ni todomarimashita.
Sore kara arano o tootte, Edomu no chi to Moabu no chi o mawari, Moabu no chi no toubu ni tasshi, Arunon no mukou ni shukuei shimashitaga Moabu no ryouiki ni wa, hairimasendeshita. Arunon wa Moabu no sakai dakara desu.
Tsugi ni Isuraeru wa Heshibon no ou sunawachi Amori bito no ou Shihon ni shisha o tsukawashi, Shihon ni mukatte "Douzo, wareware ni anata no kuni o tootte, wareware no mokuteki chi e ikasete kudasai" to iwasemashita.
Tokoro ga Shihon wa Isuraeru o shinzezu, sono ryouiki o toorasenai bakari ka, kaette subete no tami o atsumete Yahazu ni jin o tori, Isuraeru to tatakaimashitaga,
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa Shihon to sono subete no tami o Isuraeru no te ni watasareta no de, Isuraeru wa karera o uchiyabutte, sono tochi ni sunde ita Amori bito no chi o kotogotoku senryou shi,
Arunon kara Yaboku made to, arano kara Yorudan made, Amori bito no ryouiki o kotogotoku senryou shimashita.
Kono you ni Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa sono tami Isuraeru no mae kara Amori bito o oiharawareta no ni, anata wa sore o torou to suru no desu ka.
Anata wa, anata no kami Kemoshi ga anata ni toraseru mono o toranai no desu ka. Wareware wa wareware no kami, Shu ga wareware no mae kara oiharawareta mono no tochi o toru no desu.
Anata wa Moabu no ou Chipporu no ko Baraku ni masaru mono desu ka. Baraku wa katsute Isuraeru to arasotta koto ga arimasu ka. Katsute karera to tatakatta koto ga arimasu ka.
Isuraeru wa Heshibon to sono murazato ni sumi, mata Aroeru to sono murazato oyobi Arunon no kishi ni sou subete no machimachi ni sumu koto sanbyaku nen ni narimasuga, anata gata wa dou shite sono kan ni sore o torimodosanakatta no desu ka.
Watashi wa anata ni nani mo warui koto o shita koto mo nai no ni, anata wa watashi to tatakatte, watashi ni gai o kuwaeyou to shimasu. Shinpansha de arareru Shu yo, douzo, kyou, Isuraeru no hitobito to Anmon no hitobito to no aida o osabaki kudasai' ".
Shikashi Anmon no hitobito no ou wa Efuta ga ii tsukawashita kotoba o kikiirenakatta.
Toki ni Shu no rei ga Efuta ni nozomi, Efuta wa Gireade oyobi Manase o tootte, Gireade no Mizupa ni iki, Gireade no Mizupa kara susunde Anmon no hitobito no tokoro ni itta.
Efuta wa Shu ni seigan o tatete itta, "Moshi anata ga Anmon no hitobito o watashi no te ni watasarerunaraba,
Watashi ga Anmon no hitobito ni katte kaeru toki ni, watashi no ie no toguchi kara dete kite, watashi o mukaeru mono wa dare de mo Shu no mono to shi, sono mono o hansai to shite sasagemashou".
Efuta wa Anmon no hitobito no tokoro ni susunde itte, karera to tatakattaga, Shu wa karera o Efuta no te ni watasareta no de,
Aroeru kara Minnite no fukin made, nijuu no machi o uchi hairi, Aberu Keramimu ni itaru made, hijou ni ooku no hito o koroshita. Kou shite Anmon no hitobito wa Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni semefuserareta.
Yagate Efuta wa Mizupa ni kaeri, jibun no ie ni kuruto, kare no musume ga tsuzumi o mochi, maiodotte kare o demukaeta. Kanojo wa Efuta no hitori ko de, hoka ni danshi mo joshi mo nakatta.
Efuta wa kanojo o miruto, koromo o saite itta, "Aa, musume yo, anata wa mattaku watashi o uchinomeshita. Watashi o nayamasu mono to natta. Watashi ga Shu ni chikatta no dakara aratameru koto wa dekinai no da".
Musume wa itta, "Chichi yo, anata wa Shu ni chikawareta no desukara, Shu ga anata no tame ni, anata no teki Anmon no hitobito ni houfuku sareta ima, anata ga iwareta toori ni watashi ni shite kudasai".
Musume wa mata chichi ni itta, "Douzo, kono koto o watashi ni sasete kudasai. Sunawachi ni kagetsu no aida watashi o yurushi, tomodachi to issho ni itte, yamayama o yuki meguri, watashi no shojo de aru koto o nagekasete kudasai".
Efuta wa "Iki nasai" to itte, kanojo o ni kagetsu no aida, dashite yatta. Kanojo wa tomodachi to issho ni itte, yama no ue de jibun no shojo de aru koto o nageitaga,
Ni kagetsu no nochi, chichi no moto ni kaette kita no de, chichi wa chikatta seigan no toori ni kanojo ni okonatta. Kanojo wa tsuini otoko o shiranakatta.
Kore ni yotte nennen Isuraeru no musumetachi wa itte, nen ni yonka hodo Gireade bito Efuta no musume no tame ni nageku koto ga Isuraeru no narawashi to natta.
Efuraimu no hitobito wa atsumatte Zapon ni iki, Efuta ni itta, "Naze anata wa susunde itte Anmon no hitobito to tatakainagara, wareware o maneite issho ni ikasemasendeshita ka. Wareware wa anata no ie ni hi o tsukete anata o issho ni yaite shimaimasu".
Efuta wa karera ni itta, "Katsute watashi to watashi no tami ga Anmon no hitobito to ooini arasotta toki, anatagata o yondaga, anata gata wa watashi o karera no te kara sukutte kuremasendeshita.
Anata gata ga sukutte kurenai no o mitakara, watashi wa inochigake de Anmon no hitobito no tokoro e semete ikimasuto, Shu wa karera o watashi no te ni watasareta no desu. Dou shite anata gata wa, kyou, watashi no tokoro ni nobotte kite, watashi to tatakaou to suru no desu ka".
Soko de Efuta wa Gireade no hitobito o kotogotoku atsumete Efuraimu to tatakai, Gireade no hitobito wa Efuraimu o uchiyabutta. Kore wa Efuraimu ga "Gireade bito yo, anata gata wa Efuraimu to Manase no uchi ni iru Efuraimu no ochiudo da" to ittakara de aru.
Soshite Gireade bito wa Efuraimu ni wataru Yorudan no watashiba o osaeta no de, Efuraimu no ochiudo ga "Watarasete kudasai" to iu toki, Gireade no hitobito wa "Anata wa Efuraimu bito desu ka" to toi, sono hito ga moshi "Sou de wa arimasen" to iunaraba,
Mata sono hito ni "De wa 'Shiborete' to itte goran nasai" to ii, sono hito ga sore o tadashiku hatsuon suru koto ga dekinaide "Seborete" to iu toki wa, sono hito o toraete, Yorudan no watashiba de koroshita. Sono toki Efuraimu bito no taoreta mono wa yon man nisennin de atta.
Efuta wa roku nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita. Gireade bito Efuta wa tsuini shinde, Gireade no jibun no machi ni houmurareta.
Kare no nochi ni Betsurehemu no Ibuzan ga Isuraeru o sabaita.
Kare ni sanjuunin no musuko ga atta. Mata sanjuunin no musume ga attaga, sore o jibun no shizoku igai no mono ni totsugase, musukotachi no tame ni wa sanjuunin no musume o hoka karametotta. Kare wa nana nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Ibuzan wa tsuini shinde, Betsurehemu ni houmurareta.
Kare no nochi ni Zeburun bi to Eron ga Isuraeru o sabaita. Kare wa juu nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Zeburun bito Eron wa tsuini shinde, Zeburun no chi no Ayaron ni houmurareta.
Kare no nochi ni Piraton bito Hireru no ko Abudon ga Isuraeru o sabaita.
Kare ni yonjuunin no musuko oyobi sanjuunin no mago ga ari, nanajuutou no roba ni notta. Kare wa hachi nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Piraton bito Hireru no ko Abudon wa tsuini shinde, Efuraimu no chi no Amareku bito no sanchi ni aru Piraton ni houmurareta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga mata Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta no de, Shu wa karera o yonjuu nen no aida Perishite bito no te ni watasareta.
Koko ni Dan bito no shizoku no mono de, na o Manoa to iu Zora no hito ga atta. Sono tsuma wa umazume de, ko o unda koto ga nakatta.
Shu no tsukai ga sono onna ni arawarete itta, "Anata wa umazume de, ko o unda koto ga arimasen. Shikashi, anata wa migomotte otokonoko o umudeshou.
Sore de anata wa ki o tsukete, budoushu mata wa koi sake o nonde wa narimasen. Mata subete kegareta mono o tabete wa narimasen.
Anata wa migomotte otokonoko o umudeshou. Sono atama ni kamisori o atete wa narimasen. Sono ko wa umareta toki kara kami ni sasagerareta Najiru bito desu. Kare wa Perishite bito no te kara Isuraeru o sukui hajimerudeshou".
Soko de sono onna wa kite otto ni itta, "Kami no hito ga watashi no tokoro ni kimashita. Sono kaokatachi wa kami no tsukai no kaokatachi no you de, taisou osoroshuu gozaimashita. Watashi wa sono hito ga, doko kara kita no ka tazunemasendeshitaga, sono hito mo watashi ni na o tsugemasendeshita.
Shikashi sono hito wa watashi ni 'Anata wa migomotte otokonoko o umudeshou. Sore de anata wa budoushu mata wa koi sake o nonde wa narimasen. Mata subete kegareta mono o tabete wa narimasen. Sono ko wa umareta toki kara shinu hi made kami ni sasagerareta Najiru bito desu' to moushimashita".
Soko de Manoa wa Shu ni negaimotomete itta, "Aa, Shu yo, douzo, anata ga saki ni tsukawasareta kami no hito o mou ichi do watashitachi ni nozomasete, watashitachi ga sono umareru ko ni nasubeki koto o oshiesasete kudasai".
Kami ga Manoa no negai o kikareta no de, kami no tsukai wa onna ga hatake ni zashite ita toki, futatabi kanojo ni nozonda. Shikashi otto Manoa wa issho ni inakatta.
Onna wa isogi hashitte itte otto ni itta, "Sakigoro, watashi ni nozomareta hito ga mata watashi ni arawaremashita".
Manoa wa tatte tsuma no ato ni tsuite iki, sono hito no moto ni itte itta, "Anata wa katsute kono onna ni otsuge ni natta okata desu ka". Sono hito wa itta, "Sou desu".
Manoa wa itta, "Anata no iwareta koto ga jijitsu to natta toki, sono ko no sodatekata oyobi kore ni nasubeki koto wa nan deshou ka".
Shu no tsukai wa Manoa ni itta, "Watashi ga saki ni onna ni itta koto wa mina, mamorasenakereba narimasen.
Sunawachi budou no ki kara sansuru mono wa subete tabete wa narimasen. Mata budoushu to koi sake o nonde wa narimasen. Mata subete kegareta mono o tabete wa narimasen. Watashi ga kanojo ni meijita koto wa mina, mamorasenakereba narimasen".
Manoa wa Shu no tsukai ni itta, "Douzo, watashitachi ni, anata o hikitomesase, anata no tame ni koyagi o sonaesasete kudasai".
Shu no tsukai wa Manoa ni itta, "Anata ga watashi o hikitomete mo, watashi wa anata no shokumotsu o tabemasen. Shikashi anata ga hansai o sonaeyou to nasaru no de areba, Shu ni sore o sasage nasai". Manoa wa kare ga Shu no tsukai de aru no o shiranakattakara de aru.
Manoa wa Shu no tsukai ni itta, "Anata no na wa nan to iimasu ka. Anata no iwareta koto ga jijitsu to natta toki, watashitachi wa anata o agamemashou".
Shu no tsukai wa kare ni itta, "Watashi no na wa fushigi desu. Dou shite anata wa sore o tazuneru no desu ka".
Soko de Manoa wa koyagi to sosai to o tori, iwa no ue de sore o Shu ni sasageta. Shu wa fushigi na koto o sare, Manoa to sono tsuma wa sore o mita.
Sunawachi honoo ga saidan kara ten ni agatta toki, Shu no tsukai wa saidan no honoo no uchi ni atte nobotta. Manoa to sono tsuma wa mite, chi ni hirefushita.
Shu no tsukai wa futatabi Manoa to sono tsuma ni arawarenakatta. Sono toki Manoa wa kare ga Shu no tsukai de aru koto o shitta.
Manoa wa tsuma ni mukatte itta, "Watashitachi wa kami o mitakara, kitto shinude arou".
Tsuma wa kare ni itta, "Shu ga moshi, watashitachi o korosou to omowareta no naraba, watashitachi no te kara hansai to sosai o ouke ni naranakattadeshou. Mata korera no subete no koto o watashitachi ni oshimeshi ni naru hazu wa naku, mata ima watashitachi ni kono you na koto o otsuge ni naranakattadeshou".
Yagate onna wa otokonoko o unde, sono na o Samuson to yonda. Sono ko wa seichou shi, Shu wa kare o megumareta.
Shu no rei wa Zora to Eshitaoru no aida no Mahanedan ni oite hajimete kare o kandou saseta.
Samuson wa Temuna ni kudatte iki, Perishite bito no musume de, Temuna ni sumu hitori no onna o mita.
Kare wa kaette kite fubo ni itta, "Watashi wa Perishite bito no musume de, Temuna ni sumu hitori no onna o mimashita. Kanojo o metotte watashi no tsuma ni shite kudasai".
Fubo wa itta, "Anata ga itte, katsurei o ukenai Perishite bito no uchi kara tsuma o mukaeyou to suru no wa, miuchi no musumetachi no uchi ni, aruiha watashitachi no subete no tami no uchi ni onna ga nai tame na no desu ka". Shikashi Samuson wa chichi ni itta, "Kanojo o watashi ni metotte kudasai. Kanojo wa watashi no kokoro ni kanaimasukara".
Fubo wa kono koto ga Shu kara deta mono de aru koto o shiranakatta. Samuson wa Perishite bito o semeyou to, ori o ukagatte itakara de aru. Sono koro Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru o osamete ita.
Kakute Samuson wa fubo to tomo ni Temuna ni kudatte itta. Kare ga Temuna no budou hatake ni tsukuto, ichitou no wakai shishi ga hoe takette kare ni mukatte kita.
Toki ni Shu no rei ga hageshiku kare ni nozonda no de, kare wa atakamo koyagi o saku you ni sono shishi o saitaga, te ni wa nan no buki mo motte inakatta. Shikashi Samuson wa sono shita koto o chichi ni mo haha ni mo tsugenakatta.
Samuson wa kudatte itte onna to hanashiattaga, onna wa Samuson no kokoro ni kanatta.
Hi gata tte nochi, Samuson wa kanojo o metorou to shite kaettaga, michi o tenjite, kano shishi no shikabane o miruto, shishi no karada ni, hachi no mure to, mitsu ga atta.
Kare wa sore o kakiatsume, te ni totte arukinagara tabe, fubo no moto ni kaette, karera ni ataeta no de, karera mo sore o tabeta. Shikashi, shishi no karada kara sono mitsu o kakiatsumeta koto wa karera ni tsugenakatta.
Soko de chichi ga kudatte, onna no moto ni itta no de, Samuson wa soko ni furumai o mouketa. Sou suru koto wa hanamuko no narawashi de attakara de aru.
Hitobito wa Samuson o miruto, sanjuunin no kyaku o tsurete kite, douseki saseta.
Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Watashi wa anata gata ni hitotsu no nazo o dashimashou. Anata gata ga moshi nanuka no furumai no uchi ni sore o toite, watashi ni tsugeru koto ga dekitanara, watashi wa anata gata ni ama no kimono sanjuu to, haregi sanjuu o sashiagemashou.
Shikashi anata ga taga, sore o watashi ni tsugeru koto ga dekinakereba, ama no kimono sanjuu to haregi sanjuu o watashi ni kurenakereba narimasen". Karera wa Samuson ni itta, "Nazo o dashi nasai. Watashitachi wa sore o kikimashou".
Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Kurau mono kara kuimono ga de, tsuyoi mono kara amai mono ga deta". Karera wa mikka no aida nazo o toku koto ga dekinakatta.
Yonkame ni natte, karera wa Samuson no tsuma ni itta, "Anata no otto o tokisusumete, nazo o watashitachi ni akasu you ni shite kudasai. Sou shinakereba, watashitachi wa hi o tsukete anata to anata no chichi no ie o yaite shimaimasu. Anata wa watashitachi no mono o toru tame ni, watashitachi o maneita no desu ka".
Soko de Samuson no tsuma wa Samuson no mae ni naite itta, "Anata wa tada watashi o nikumu dake de, aishite kuremasen. Anata wa watashi no kuni no hitobito ni nazo o dashite, sore o watashi ni tokiakashimasendeshita". Samuson wa kanojo ni itta, "Watashi wa jibun no chichi ni mo haha ni mo tokiakasanakatta. Dou shite anata ni tokiakaseyou".
Kanojo wa nanuka no furumai no aida, kare no mae ni naite itaga, nanuka me ni natte, Samuson wa tsuini kanojo ni tokiakashita. Hidoku kare ni semattakara de aru. Soko de kanojo wa nazo o jibun no kuni no hitobito ni akashita.
Nanuka me ni natte, hi no bossuru mae ni machi no hitobito wa Samuson ni itta, "Mitsu yori amai mono ni nani ga arou. Shishi yori tsuyoi mono ni nani ga arou". Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Watashi no wakai meushi de tagayasanakattanara, watashi no nazo wa tokenakatta".
Kono toki, Shu no rei ga hageshiku Samuson ni nozonda no de, Samuson wa Ashikeron ni kudatte itte, sono machi no mono sanjuunin o koroshi, karera kara hagitotte, kano nazo o toita hitobito ni, sono haregi o atae, hageshiku ikatte chichi no ie ni kaetta.
Samuson no tsuma wa hanamuko tsukisoinin de atta kyaku no tsuma to natta.
Hi gata tte nochi, mugikari no toki ni Samuson wa koyagi o tazusaete tsuma o otozure, "Heya ni haitte, tsuma ni aimashou" to ittaga, tsuma no chichi wa hairu koto o yurusanakatta.
Soshite chichi wa itta, "Anata ga tashika ni kanojo o kiratta ni soui nai to omotta no de, watashi wa kanojo o anata no kyaku de atta mono ni yarimashita. Kanojo no imouto wa kanojo yori mo kirei de wa arimasen ka. Douzo, kanojo no kawari ni imouto o metotte kudasai".
Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Kondo wa watashi ga Perishite bito ni gai o kuwaete mo, karera no koto de wa, watashi ni tsumi ga nai".
Soko de Samuson wa itte, kitsune sanbyakuhiki o torae, taimatsu o tori, o to o o awasete, sono futatsu no o no aida ni hitotsu no taimatsu o musubitsuke,
Taimatsu ni hi o tsukete, sono kitsune o Perishite bito no mada karanai mugi no naka ni hanashi ire, sono tabane tsunda mono to, mada karanai mono to o yaki, oribu hatake o mo yaita.
Perishite bi to wa itta, "Kore wa dare no shiwaza ka". Hitobito wa itta, "Temuna bito no muko Samuson da. Sono shuuto ga Samuson no tsuma o torikaeshite, sono kyaku de atta mono ni ataetakara da". Soko de Perishite bi to wa nobotte kite kanojo to sono chichi no ie o hi de yakiharatta.
Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata ga sonna koto o surunaraba, watashi wa anata gata ni shikaeshi sezu ni wa okanai".
Soshite Samuson wa karera o, sanzan ni utte daizei koroshita. Kou shite Samuson wa kudatte itte, Etamu no iwa no sakeme ni sunde ita.
Soko de Perishite bi to wa nobotte kite, Yuda ni jin o tori, Rehi o semeta no de,
Yuda no hitobito wa itta, "Anata gata wa dou shite wareware no tokoro ni semenobotte kita no desu ka". Karera wa itta, "Wareware wa Samuson o shibari, kare ga wareware ni shita you ni, kare ni suru tame ni nobotte kita no desu".
Soko de Yuda no hitobito sanzennin ga Etamu no iwa no sakeme ni kudatte itte, Samuson ni itta, "Perishite bi to wa wareware no shihaisha de aru koto o anata wa shiranai no desu ka. Anata wa dou shite wareware ni konna koto o shita no desu ka". Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Karera ga watashi ni shita you ni, watashi wa karera ni shita no desu".
Karera wa mata Samuson ni itta, "Wareware wa anata o shibatte, Perishite bito no te ni watasu tame ni kudatte kita no desu". Samuson wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata jishin wa watashi o utanai to iu koto o chikai nasai".
Karera wa Samuson ni itta, "Iya, wareware wa tada, anata o shibatte, Perishite bito no te ni watasu dake desu. Kesshite anata o koroshimasen". Karera wa nihon no atarashii tsuna o motte kare o shibatte, iwa kara hikiageta.
Samuson ga Rehi ni kita toki, Perishite bi to wa koe o agete, kare ni chikazuita. Sono toki, Shu no rei ga hageshiku kare ni nozonda no de, kare no ude ni kakatte ita tsuna wa hi ni yaketa ama no you ni natte, sono nawame ga te kara tokete ochita.
Kare wa roba no atarashii agohone hitotsu o mitsuketa no de, te o nobete tori, sore o motte issennin o uchikoroshita.
Soshite Samuson wa itta, "Roba no agohone o motte yama mata yama o kizuki, roba no agohone o motte issennin o uchikoroshita".
Kare wa ii owaruto, sono te kara agohone o nagesuteta. Kore ga tame ni sono tokoro wa "Agohone no oka" to yobareta.
Toki ni kare wa hidoku kawaki o oboeta no de, Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Anata wa shimobe no te o motte, kono ookina sukui o hodokosareta no ni, watashi wa ima, kawaite shini, katsurei o ukenai mono no te ni ochiirou to shite imasu".
Soko de kami wa Rehi ni aru kubonda tokoro o sakareta no de, soko kara mizu ga nagaredeta. Samuson ga sore o nomuto kare no rei wa moto ni kaette motoki zuita. Sore de sono na o "Yobawatta mono no izumi" to yonda. Kore wa konnichi made Rehi ni aru.
Samuson wa Perishite bito no jidai ni nijuu nen no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Samuson wa Gaza e itte, soko de hitori no yuujo o mi, sono onna no tokoro ni haitta.
"Samuson ga koko ni kita" to, Gaza no hitobito ni tsugeru mono ga atta no de, Gaza no hitobito wa sono tokoro o torikakomi, yodooshi machi no mon de machibuse shi, "Wareware wa asa made matte kare o korosou" to itte, yodooshi shizuka ni shite ita.
Samuson wa yonaka made netaga, yonaka ni okite, machi no mon no tobira to futatsu no monchuu ni te o kakete, kannoki morotomo ni hikinuki, kata ni nosete, Heburon no mukai ni aru yama no itadaki ni hakonde itta.
Kono nochi, Samuson wa Soreku no tani ni iru Derira to iu onna o aishita.
Perishite bito no kimitachi wa sono onna no tokoro ni kite itta, "Anata wa Samuson o tokisusumete, kare no dairiki wa doko ni aru no ka, mata wareware wa dou sureba kare ni katte, kare o shibari kurushimeru koto ga dekiru ka o mitsuke nasai. Sou sureba wareware wa onoono gin sen hyakumai zutsu o anata ni sashiagemashou".
Soko de Derira wa Samuson ni itta, "Anata no dairiki wa doko ni aru no ka, mata dou sureba anata o shibatte kurushimeru koto ga dekiru ka, douzo watashi ni kikasete kudasai".
Samuson wa onna ni itta, "Hitobito ga moshi, kawaita koto no nai nanahon no atarashii yumizuru o motte watashi o shibarunara, watashi wa yowaku natte hoka no hito no you ni narudeshou".
Soko de Perishite bito no kimitachi ga, kawaita koto no nai nanahon no atarashii yumizuru o onna ni motte kita no de, onna wa sore o motte Samuson o shibatta.
Onna wa kanete oku no heya ni hito o shinobasete oite, Samuson ni itta, "Samuson yo, Perishite bito ga anata ni sematte imasu". Shikashi Samuson wa sono yumizuru o, atakamo ama ito ga hi ni atte tatareru you ni tachikitta. Kou shite kare no chikara no himitsu wa shirenakatta.
Derira wa Samuson ni itta, "Anata wa watashi o azamuite, uso o iimashita. Dou shitara anata o shibaru koto ga dekiru ka, douzo ima watashi ni kikasete kudasai".
Samuson wa onna ni itta, "Moshi hitobito ga mada mochiita koto no nai atarashii tsuna o motte, watashi o shibarunara, yowaku natte hoka no hito no you ni narudeshou".
Soko de Derira wa atarashii tsuna o tori, sore o motte kare o shibari, soshite kare ni itta, "Samuson yo, Perishite bito ga anata ni sematte imasu". Toki ni hitobito wa oku no heya ni shinonde itaga, Samuson wa sono tsuna o ito no you ni ude kara tachi otoshita.
Soko de Derira wa Samuson ni itta, "Anata wa ima made, watashi o azamuite, uso o iimashitaga, dou shitara anata o shibaru koto ga dekiru ka, watashi ni kikasete kudasai". Kare wa onna ni itta, "Anata ga moshi, watashi no kaminoke nana fusa o hata no tateito to issho ni otte, kugi de sore o tomete okunaraba, watashi wa yowaku natte hoka no hito no you ni narudeshou". Soko de kare ga nemutta toki, Derira wa Samuson no kaminoke, nana fusa o totte, sore o hata no tateito ni orikomi,
Kugi de sore o tomete oite, kare ni itta, "Samuson yo, Perishite bito ga anata ni sematte imasu". Shikashi Samuson wa me o samashite, kugi to hata to tateito to o hikinuita.
Soko de onna wa Samuson ni itta, "Anata no kokoro ga watashi o hanarete iru no ni, dou shite 'Omae o aisuru' to iu koto ga dekimasu ka. Anata wa sudeni san do mo watashi o azamuki, anata no dairiki ga doko ni aru ka o watashi ni tsugemasendeshita".
Onna wa mainichi sono kotoba o motte kare ni semari unagashita no de, kare no tamashii wa shinu bakari ni kurushinda.
Kare wa tsuini sono kokoro o kotogotoku uchiakete onna ni itta, "Watashi no atama ni wa kamisori o ateta koto ga arimasen. Watashi wa umareta toki kara kami ni sasagerareta Najiru bito dakara desu. Moshi kami o sori otosaretanara, watashi no chikara wa satte yowaku nari, hoka no hito no you ni narudeshou".
Derira wa Samuson ga sono kokoro o kotogotoku uchiaketa no o mi, hito o tsukawashite Perishite bito no kimitachi o yonde itta, "Samuson wa sono kokoro o kotogotoku watashi ni uchiakemashitakara, kondo koso nobotte oide nasai". Soko de Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, gin o tazusaete onna no moto ni nobotte kita.
Onna wa jibun no hiza no ue ni Samuson o nemurase, hito o yonde kaminoke, nana fusa o sori otosase, kare o kurushime hajimetaga, sono chikara wa kare o satte ita.
Soshite onna ga "Samuson yo, Perishite bito ga anata ni sematte imasu" to itta no de, kare wa me o samashite itta, "Watashi wa itsu mo no you ni dete itte, karada o yusurou". Kare wa Shu ga jibun o sarareta koto o shiranakatta.
Soko de Perishite bi to wa kare o toraete, ryoume o eguri, Gaza ni hiite itte, seidou no ashikase o kakete kare o tsunaida. Kou shite Samuson wa gokuya no naka de, usu o hiite itaga,
Sono kaminoke wa sori otosareta nochi, futatabi nobi hajimeta.
Sate Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, karera no kami Dagon ni ooinaru gisei o sasagete shuku o shiyou to, tomo ni atsumatte itta, "Wareware no kami wa, teki Samuson o wareware no te ni watasareta".
Tami wa Samuson o mite, jibuntachi no kami o hometataete itta, "Wareware no kami wa, wareware no kuni o arashi, wareware o ooku koroshita teki o wareware no te ni watasareta".
Karera wa mata kokoro ni yorokonde itta, "Samuson o yonde, wareware no tame ni zaregoto o saseyou". Karera wa gokuya kara Samuson o yobidashite, karera no mae ni zaregoto o saseta. Karera ga Samuson o hashira no aida ni tataseruto,
Samuson wa jibun no te o hiite iru wakamono ni itta, "Watashi no te o hanashite, kono ie o sasaete iru hashira o sagurase, sore ni yorikakarasete kudasai".
Sono ie ni wa danjo ga michi, Perishite bito no kimitachi mo mina soko ni ita. Mata yane no ue ni wa sanzennin bakari no danjo ga ite, Samuson no zaregoto o suru no o mite ita.
Samuson wa Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Aa, Shu naru kami yo, douzo, watashi o oboete kudasai. Aa, kami yo, douzo mou ichi do, watashi o tsuyoku shite, watashi no futatsu no me no hitotsu no tame ni de mo Perishite bito ni ada o mukuisasete kudasai".
Soshite Samuson wa, sono ie o sasaete iru futatsu no naka hashira no hitotsu o migi no te ni, hitotsu o hidari no te ni kakaete, mi o sore ni yose,
"Watashi wa Perishite bito to tomo ni shinou" to itte, chikara o komete mi o kagameruto, ie wa sono naka ni ita kimitachi to, subete no tami no ue ni taoreta. Kou shite Samuson ga shinu toki ni koroshita mono wa, ikite iru toki ni koroshita mono yori mo ookatta.
Yagate kare no miuchi no hitotachi oyobi chichi no kazoku no mono ga mina kudatte kite, kare o hikitori, tazusae nobo tte, Zora to Eshitaoru no aida ni aru chichi Manoa no haka ni houmutta. Samuson ga Isuraeru o sabaita no wa nijuu nen de atta.
Koko ni Efuraimu no sanchi no hito de, na o Mika to yobu mono ga atta.
Kare wa haha ni itta, "Anata wa katsute gin sen hyakumai o torareta no de, sore o noroi, watashi ni mo hanasaremashitaga, sono gin wa watashi ga motte imasu. Watashi ga sore o totta no desu". Haha wa itta, "Douzo Shu ga waga ko o shukufuku saremasu you ni".
Soshite kare ga gin sen hyakumai o haha ni kaeshita no de, haha wa itta, "Watashi wa watashi no ko no tame ni hitotsu no kizanda zou to, hitotsu no ita zou o tsukuru tame ni sono gin o watashi no te kara Shu ni kennou shimasu. Sore de ima sore o anata ni kaeshimashou".
Mika ga sono gin o haha ni kaeshita no de, haha wa sono gin nihyakumai o totte, sore o gin zaikunin ni atae, hitotsu no kizanda zou to, hitotsu no ita zou o tsukuraseta. Sono zou wa Mika no ie ni atta.
Kono Mika to iu hito wa kami no miya o mochi, Epode to terapimu o tsukuri, sono ko no hitori o tatete, jibun no saishi to shita.
Sono koro Isuraeru ni wa ou ga nakatta no de, hitobito wa onoono jibuntachi no me ni tadashii to omou koto o okonatta.
Sate koko ni Yuda no shizoku no mono de, Yuda no Betsurehemu kara kita hitori no wakamono ga atta. Kare wa Rebi bito de atte, soko ni kiryuu shite ita no de aru.
Kono hito wa jibun no sumubeki tokoro o tazunete, Yuda no Betsurehemu no machi o sari, tabi shite Efuraimu no sanchi no Mika no ie ni kita.
Mika wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa doko kara oide ni narimashita ka". Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa Yuda no Betsurehemu no Rebi bito desuga, sumubeki tokoro o tazunete tabi o shite iru no desu".
Mika wa itta, "Watashi to issho ni ite, watashi no tame ni chichitomo saishi to mo natte kudasai. Sou sureba nen ni gin juumai to ifuku hitosoroi to shokumotsu to o sashiagemashou".
Rebi bi to wa tsuini sono hito to issho ni sumu koto o shoudaku shita. Soshite sono wakamono wa kare no ko no hitori no you ni natta.
Mika wa Rebi bito de aru kono wakamono o tatete jibun no saishi to shita no de, kare wa Mika no ie ni ita.
Sore de Mika wa itta, "Ima watashi wa Rebi bito o saishi ni motsu you ni natta no de, Shu ga watashi o omegumi kudasaru koto ga wakarimashita".
Sono koro Isuraeru ni wa ou ga nakatta. Sono koro Dan bito no buzoku wa Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi ni atte, sono hi made mada shigyou no chi o enakatta no de jibuntachi no sumubeki shigyou no chi o motomete ita.
Sore de Dan no hitobito wa jibun no buzoku no souzei no uchi kara, yuusha gonin o Zora to Eshitaoru kara tsukawashite tochi o ukagai saguraseta. Sunawachi karera ni itta, "Itte tochi o sagutte ki nasai". Karera wa Efuraimu no sanchi ni iki, Mika no ie ni tsuite, soko ni yadorou to shita.
Karera ga Mika no ie ni chikazuita toki, Rebi bito de aru wakamono no koe o kikiwaketa no de, mi o megurashite soko ni haitte kare ni itta, "Dare ga anata o koko ni tsurete kita no desu ka. Anata wa koko de nani o shite iru no desu ka. Koko ni nan no you ga aru no desu ka".
Wakamono wa karera ni itta, "Mika ga, kayou kayou ni shite watashi o yatotta no de, watashi wa sono saishi to natta no desu".
Karera wa itta, "Douzo, kami ni ukagatte, wareware ga iku michi ni shiawase ga aru ka dou ka o shirasete kudasai".
Sono saishi wa karera ni itta, "Anshin shite iki nasai. Anata gata ga iku michi wa Shu ga mimamotte oraremasu".
Soko de gonin no mono wa satte Raishi ni iki, soko ni iru tami o miruto, karera wa yasuraka ni sumai, sono odayaka de yasuraka na koto Shidon bito no you de atte, kono kuni ni wa hitotsu to shite kaketa mono ga naku, tomi o mochi, mata Shidon bito to tooku hanarete ori, hoka no tami to majiwaru koto ga nakatta.
Kakute karera ga Zora to Eshitaoru ni oru kyoudaitachi no moto ni kaette kuruto, kyoudaitachi wa karera ni itta, "Ikaga deshita ka".
Karera wa itta, "Tatte karera no tokoro ni semenoborimashou. Wareware wa kano chi o mitaga, hijou ni yutaka desu. Anata gata wa naze jitto shite iru no desu ka. Tamerawazu ni susunde itte, kano chi o tori nasai.
Anata gata ga ikeba, yasuraka ni oru tami no tokoro ni ikudeshou. Sono chi wa hiroku, kami wa sore o anata gata no te ni tamawaru no desu. Soko ni wa chi ni aru mono hitotsu to shite kakete iru mono wa arimasen".
Soko de Dan no shizoku no mono roppyakunin ga buki o obite, Zora to Eshitaoru o shuppatsu shi,
Nobotte itte Yuda no kiriate yarimu ni jin o hatta. Kono yue ni, sono tokoro wa konnichi made Mahanedan to yobareru. Sore wa kiriate yarimu no nishi ni aru.
Karera wa soko kara Efuraimu no sanchi ni susumi, Mika no ie ni tsuita.
Kano Raishi no kuni o ukagai ni itta gonin no mono wa sono kyoudaitachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa korera no ie ni Epode to Terapimu to kizanda zou to ita zou no aru no o shitte imasu ka. Sore de anata gata wa ima, nasubeki koto o kime nasai".
Soko de karera wa sono hou e mi o megurashite, kano Rebi bito no wakamono no ie sunawachi Mika no ie ni itte, kare ni anpi o touta.
Shikashi buki o obita roppyakunin no Dan no hitobito wa mon no iriguchi ni tatte ita.
Kano tochi o ukagai ni itta gonin no mono wa nobotte itte, soko ni hairi, kizanda zou to Epode to Terapimu to ita zou to o tottaga, saishi wa buki o obita roppyakunin no mono to tomo ni mon no iriguchi ni tatte ita.
Karera ga Mika no ie ni haitte kizanda zou to Epode to Terapimu to ita zou to o totta toki, saishi wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa nani o nasaimasu ka".
Karera wa itta, "Damari nasai. Anata no te o kuchi ni atete, wareware to issho ni kite, wareware no tame ni chichitomo saishi to mo nari nasai. Hitori no ie no saishi de aru no to, Isuraeru no ichibuzoku, ichi shizoku no saishi de aru no to, dochira ga yoi desu ka".
Saishi wa yorokonde, Epode to Terapimu to kizanda zou to o tori, tami no naka ni kuwawatta.
Kakute karera wa mi o megurashite sari, sono kotomotachi to kachiku to kazai o saki ni tatete susundaga,
Mika no ie o haruka ni hanareta toki, Mika wa ie ni chikai ie no hitobito o atsume, Dan no hitobito ni oitsuki,
Dan no hitobito o yonda no de, karera wa furimuite Mika ni itta, "Anata ga sono you ni nakama o tsurete kita no wa, dou shita no desu ka".
Kare wa itta, "Anata ga taga, watashi no tsukutta kamigami oyobi saishi o ubaisatta no de, watashi ni nani ga nokotte imasu ka. Shikaru ni anata gata ga watashi ni mukatte 'Dou shita no desu ka' to iwareru to wa nanigoto desu ka".
Dan no hitobito wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa ookina koe o dasanai ga yoi. Ki no arai renchuu ga anata ni uchi kakatte, anata wa jibun no inochi to kazoku no inochi o ushinau you ni narudeshou".
Kou shite Dan no hitobito wa satte ittaga, Mika wa karera no tsuyoi no o mite, kubisu o kaeshite jibun no ie ni kaetta.
Sate karera wa Mika ga tsukutta mono to, Mika to tomo ni ita saishi to o ubatte Raishi ni omomuki, odayaka de, yasuraka na tami no tokoro e itte, tsurugi o motte karera o uchi, hi o tsukete sono machi o yaitaga,
Shidon o tooku hanarete ori, hoka no tami to no majiwari ga nakatta no de, sore o sukuu mono ga nakatta. Sono machi wa Beterehobu ni zokusuru tani ni atta. Karera wa machi o tatenaoshite soko ni sumi,
Isuraeru ni umareta senzo Dan no na ni shitagatte, sono machi no na o Dan to nazuketa. Sono machi no na wa moto wa Raishi de atta.
Soshite Dan no hitobito wa kizanda zou o jibuntachi no tame ni anchi shi, Moose no mago sunawachi Gerushomu no ko Yonatan to sono shison ga Dan bito no buzoku no saishi to natte, kuni ga hoshuu to naru hi ni made oyonda.
Kami no ie ga Shiro ni atta aida, tsune ni karera wa Mika ga tsukutta sono kizanda zou o kazatte oita.
Sono koro, Isuraeru ni ou ga nakatta toki, Efuraimu no sanchi no oku ni hitori no Rebi bito ga kiryuu shite ita. Kare wa Yuda no Betsurehemu kara hitori no onna o mukaete, mekake to shite itaga,
Sono mekake wa ikatte, kare no tokoro o sari, Yuda no Betsurehemu no chichi no ie ni kaette, soko ni yon kagetsu bakari sugoshita.
Soko de otto wa kanojo o nadamete tsurekaerouto, shimobe to nitou no roba o shitagae, tatte kanojo no ato o otte itta. Kare ga onna no chichi no ie ni tsuita toki, musume no chichi wa kare o mite, yorokonde mukaeta.
Musume no chichi de aru shuuto ga hikitometa no de, kare wa mikka tomo ni ori, mina nomikui shite soko ni yadotta.
Yonkame ni karera wa asa hayaku oki, kare ga tachisarou to shita no de, musume no chichi wa muko ni itta, "Sukoshi shokuji o shite genki o tsuke, sore kara dekake nasai".
Soko de futari wa zashite tomo ni nomikui shitaga, musume no chichi wa sono hito ni itta, "Douzo mou hitoban tomatte tanoshiku sugoshi nasai".
Sono hito wa tatte sarou to shitaga, shuuto ga shi ita no de, tsuini mata soko ni yadotta.
Itsukame ni natte, asa hayaku okite sarou to shitaga, musume no chichi wa itta, "Douzo, genki o tsukete, hi ga katamuku made todomari nasai". Soko de karera futari wa shokuji o shita.
Sono hito ga tsuini mekake oyobi shimobe to tomo ni sarou to shite tachiagatta toki, musume no chichi de aru shuuto wa kare ni itta, "Hi mo kureyou to shite iru. Douzo mou ichi ban tomari nasai. Hi wa katamuita. Koko ni yadotte tanoshiku sugoshi nasai. Soshite ashita no asa hayaku okite shuttatsu shi, ie ni kaeri nasai".
Shikashi, sono hito wa tomaru koto o konomanai no de, tatte sari, Ebusu sunawachi Erusaremu no mukai ni tsuita. Kura o oita nitou no roba to kare no mekake mo issho de atta.
Karera ga Ebusu ni chikazuita toki, hi wa sudeni bosshita no de, shimobe wa shujin ni itta, "Saa, wareware wa michi o tenjite Ebusu bito no kono machi ni haitte, soko ni yadorimashou".
Shujin wa kare ni itta, "Wareware wa michi o tenjite, Isuraeru no hitobito no machi de nai gaikokujin no machi ni, haitte wa naranai. Gibea made ikou".
Kare wa mata shimobe ni itta, "Saa, wareware wa Gibea ka Rama ka, sono uchi no hitotsu ni tsuite soko ni yadorou".
Karera wa susunde ittaga, Beniyamin ni zokusuru Gibea no chikaku de hi ga kureta no de,
Gibea e itte yadorouto, soko ni michi o tenji, machi ni haitte, sono hiroba ni zashita. Dare mo karera o ie ni mukaete tomete kureru mono ga nakattakara de aru.
Toki ni hitori no roujin ga yuugure ni hatake no shigoto kara kaette kita. Kono hito wa Efuraimu no sanchi no mono de, Gibea ni kiryuu shite ita no de aru. Tadashi kono tokoro no hitobito wa Beniyamin bito de atta.
Kare wa me o agete, machi no hiroba ni tabibito no oru no o mita. Roujin wa itta, "Anata wa doko e ikareru no desu ka. Doko kara oide ni narimashita ka".
Sono hito wa itta, "Wareware wa Yuda no Betsurehemu kara, Efuraimu no sanchi no oku e iku mono desu. Watashi wa asoko no mono de, Yuda no Betsurehemu e iki, ima watashi no ie ni kaeru tokoro desuga, dare mo watashi o ie ni tomete kureru mono ga arimasen.
Wareware ni wa, roba no wara mo kaiba mo ari, mata watashi to, hashi tame to, shimobe to tomo ni iru wakamono to no shokumotsu mo sake mo atte, nani mo kakete iru mono wa arimasen".
Roujin wa itta, "Anshin shi nasai. Anata no hitsuyou na mono wa nan de mo sonaemashou. Tada hiroba de yoru o sugoshite wa narimasen".
Soshite kare o ie ni tsurete itte, roba ni kaiba o ataeta. Karera wa ashi o aratte nomikui shita.
Karera ga tanoshiku sugoshite ita toki, machi no hitobito no warui monodomo ga sono ie o torikakomi, to o uchitataite, ie no aruji de aru roujin ni itta, "Anata no ie ni kita hito o dashi nasai. Wareware wa sono mono o shirude arou".
Shikashi ie no aruji wa karera no tokoro ni dete itte itta, "Iie, kyoudaitachi yo, douzo, sonna warui koto o shinaide kudasai. Kono hito wa sudeni watashi no ie ni haitta no dakara, sonna tsumaranai koto o shinaide kudasai.
Koko ni shojo de aru watashi no musume to, kono hito no mekake ga imasu. Ima sore o dashimasukara, sore o hazukashime, anata gata no suki na you ni shi nasai. Shikashi kono hito ni wa sono you na tsumaranai koto o shinaide kudasai".
Shikashi hitobito ga kikiirenakatta no de, sono hito wa jibun no mekake o totte karera no tokoro ni dashita. Karera wa sono onna o okashite asa made shuuya hazukashime, hi no noboru koro ni natte hanashi kaeraseta.
Asa ni natte onna wa jibun no shujin o yadoshite kureta hito no ie no toguchi ni kite taorefushi, yoru no akeru made ni oyonda.
Kanojo no shujin wa asa okite ie no to o hiraki, dete tabidatou to suruto, sono mekake de aru onna ga ie no toguchi ni, te o shikii ni kakete taorete ita.
Kare wa onna ni mukatte, "Okiyo, ikou" to ittakeredo mo, nan no kotae mo nakatta. Soko de sono hito wa onna o roba ni nose, tatte jibun no ie ni omomuitaga,
Sono ie ni tsuita toki, katana o tori, mekake o toraete, sono karada o juu ni kire ni tachikiri, sore o Isuraeru no zenryouiki ni amaneku okutta.
Sore o mita mono wa mina itta, "Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo no chi kara nobotte kita hi kara konnichi made, kono you na koto wa tatta koto mo naku, mata mita koto mo nai. Kono koto o yoku kangae, kyougi shite iu koto o kimeyo".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa, Dan kara Beerushiba made, mata Gireade no chi kara mo mina dete kite, sono kaishuu wa hitori no you ni Mizupa de Shu no moto ni atsumatta.
Tami no shuryoutachi, sunawachi Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no shuryoutachi wa, mizukara kami no tami no shuugou ni deta. Tsurugi o obite iru hohei ga yonjuu mannin atta.
Beniyamin no hitobito wa, Isuraeru no hitobito ga Mizupa ni nobotta koto o kiita. Isuraeru no hitobito wa itta, "Dou shite, kono akuji ga okotta no ka, wareware ni hanashite kudasai".
Korosareta onna no otto de aru Rebi bi to wa kotaete itta, "Watashi wa, mekake to issho ni Beniyamin ni zokusuru Gibea e itte yadorimashitaga,
Gibea no hitobito wa tatte watashi o seme, yo no ma ni, watashi no oru ie o torikakonde, watashi o korosou to kuwadate, tsuini watashi no mekake o hazukashimete, shinasemashita.
Sore de watashi wa mekake o toraete tachikiri, sore o Isuraeru no shigyou no subete no chihou ni amaneku okurimashita. Karera ga Isuraeru ni oite nikumubeki midara na koto o okonattakara desu.
Isuraeru no hitobito yo, anata gata wa minajibun no iken to kangae o koko ni nobete kudasai".
Tami wa mina hitori no you ni tatte itta, "Wareware wa dare mo jibun no tenmaku ni ikimasen. Mata dare mo jibun no ie ni kaerimasen.
Wareware ga ima Gibea ni taishite shiyou to suru koto wa kore desu. Wareware wa kuji o hiite, Gibea ni semenoborimashou.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no subete no buzoku kara hyakunin ni tsuite juunin, sennin ni tsuite hyakunin, bannin ni tsuite sennin o erande, tami no ryoushoku o torase, tami wa Beniyamin no Gibea ni itte, Beniyamin bito ga Isuraeru ni oite okonatta subete no midara na koto ni taishite, houfuku shimashou".
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina atsumari, itchi kessoku shite machi o semeyou to shita.
Isuraeru no moromoro no buzoku wa hitobito o amaneku Beniyamin no buzoku no uchi ni tsukawashite iwaseta, "Anata gata no uchi ni tatta kono koto wa, nantaru akuji deshou ka.
Sore de ima Gibea ni iru ano warui hitobito o watashi nasai. Wareware wa karera o koroshite, Isuraeru kara aku o nozokisarimashou". Shikashi Beniyamin no hitobito wa sono kyoudai de aru Isuraeru no hitobito no kotoba o kikiirenakatta.
Kaette Beniyamin no hitobito wa machimachi kara Gibea ni atsumari, dete Isuraeru no hitobito to tatakaou to shita.
Sono hi, machimachi kara atsumatta Beniyamin no hitobito wa tsurugi o obite iru mono ni man rokusennin ari, hoka ni Gibea no juumin de atsumatta seihei ga nanahyakunin atta.
Kono subete no tami no uchi ni hidarikiki no seihei ga nanahyakunin atte, izure mo ichipon no kesuji o neratte ishi o nagete mo, hazureru koto ga nakatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito no atsumatta mono wa Beniyamin o nozoite, tsurugi o obite iru mono yonjuu mannin ari, izure mo gunjin de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa tachiagatte Beteru ni nobori, kami ni tazuneta, "Wareware no uchi, izure ga saki ni nobotte, Beniyamin no hitobito to tatakaimashou ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Yuda ga saki ni".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa, asa okite, Gibea ni taishi jin o totta.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no hitobito wa Beniyamin to tatakau tame ni dete itte, Gibea de karera ni taishite tatakai no sonae o shitaga,
Beniyamin no hitobito wa Gibea kara dete kite, sono hi Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni man nisennin o chi ni uchitaoshita.
Shikashi Isuraeru no tami no hitobito wa furuitatte hajime no hi ni sonae o shita tokoro ni futatabi tatakai no sonae o shita.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa nobotte itte Shu no mae ni yuugure made naki, Shu ni tazuneta, "Wareware wa futatabi wareware no kyoudai de aru Beniyamin no hitobito to tatakai o majierubekideshou ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Semenobore".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa, tsugi no hi mata Beniyamin no hitobito no tokoro ni semeyosetaga,
Beniyamin wa tsugi no hi mata Gibea kara dete, kore o mukae, futatabi Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ichi man hassennin o chi ni uchitaoshita. Korera wa mina tsurugi o obite iru mono de atta.
Kore ga tame ni Isuraeru no subete no hitobito sunawachi zengun wa Beteru ni nobotte itte naki, sono tokoro de Shu no mae ni zashite, sono hi yuugure made danjiki shi, hansai to shuuonsai o Shu no mae ni sasageta.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Shu ni tazune, - - sono koro kami no keiyaku no hako wa soko ni atte,
Aron no ko Ereazaru no ko de aru Pinehasu ga, sore ni tsukaete ita - - soshite itta, "Wareware wa nao futatabi dete, wareware no kyoudai de aru Beniyamin no hitobito to tatakaubekideshou ka. Aruiha yamerubekideshou ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Nobore. Watashi wa asu karera o anata gata no te ni watasude arou".
Soko de Isuraeru wa Gibea no shuui ni fukuhei o oki,
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa mikkame ni mata Beniyamin no hitobito no tokoro ni semenobori, mae no you ni Gibea ni taishite sonae o shita.
Beniyamin no hitobito wa dete, tami o mukaetaga, tsuini machi kara obikidasareta no de, karera wa mae no you ni ooji de tami o uchi hajime, mata no de Isuraeru no hito o sanjuunin bakari koroshita. Sono ooji wa, hitotsu wa Beteru ni itari, hitotsu wa Gibea ni itaru mono de atta.
Beniyamin no hitobito wa itta, "Karera wa hajime no you ni, wareware no mae ni uchiyaburareru". Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito wa itta, "Wareware wa nigete, karera o machi kara ooji ni obikidasou".
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina sono tokoro kara tatte Baaru Tamaru ni sonae o shita. Sono kan ni machibusete ita Isuraeru no hitobito ga sono tokoro kara, sunawachi Geba no nishi kara arawaredeta.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no zengun no uchi kara seihei ichi mannin ga kite, Gibea o osoi, sono tatakai wa hageshikatta. Shikashi Beniyamin no hitobito wa wazawai no jibuntachi ni sematte iru no o shiranakatta.
Shu ga Isuraeru no mae ni Beniyamin o uchi yaburareta no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa, sono hi Beniyamin bito ni man gosen ichi hyakunin o koroshita. Korera wa mina tsurugi o obite iru mono de atta.
Kou shite Beniyamin no hitobito wa jibuntachi no uchi yaburareta no o mita. Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa Gibea ni taishite mouketa fukuhei o tanonde, Beniyamin bito o sakete shirizoita.
Fukuhei wa isoide Gibea ni tsukiiri, susunde tsurugi o motte machi o kotogotoku utta.
Isuraeru no hitobito to fukuhei no aida ni sadameta aizu wa, machi kara ooinaru noroshi ga agaru toki,
Isuraeru no hitobito ga tatakai ni tenjiru koto de atta. Sate Beniyamin wa hajime Isuraeru no hitobito o utte sanjuunin bakari o koroshita no de itta, "Makoto ni karera wa saisho no tatakai no you ni wareware no mae ni uchi yaburareru".
Shikashi, noroshi ga kemuri no hashira to natte machi kara nobori hajimeta no de, Beniyamin no hitobito ga ushiro o miruto, machi wa mina kemuri to natte ten ni nobotte ita.
Sono toki Isuraeru no hitobito ga muki o kaeta no de, Beniyamin no hitobito wa wazawai ga jibuntachi ni sematta no o mite, urotae,
Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara mi o megurashite arano no hou ni mukattaga, tatakai ga karera ni oisemari, machi kara dete kita monodomo wa, karera o naka ni hasande koroshita.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no hitobito wa Beniyamin no hitobito o kiritaoshi, oiuchi, fuminijitte, Noha kara higashi no hou Gibea no mukai ni made oyonda.
Beniyamin no taoreta mono wa ichi man hassennin de, mina yuushi de atta.
Karera wa mi o megurashite arano no hou, Rinmon no iwa made nigetaga, Isuraeru no hitobito wa ooji de sono uchi gosennin o kiritaoshi, nao mo tsuigeki shite Gidomu ni itari, sono uchi no nisennin o koroshita.
Kou shite sono hi Beniyamin no taoreta mono wa tsurugi o obite iru mono awasete ni man gosennin de, mina yuushi de atta.
Shikashi roppyakunin no mono wa mi o megurashite arano no hou, Rinmon no iwa made nigete, yon kagetsu no aida Rinmon no iwa ni sunda.
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa mata mi o kaeshite Beniyamin no hitobito o seme, tsurugi o motte hito mo kemono mo subete mitsuketa mono o uchikoroshi, mata mitsuketa subete no machi ni hi o kaketa.
Katsute Isuraeru no hitobito wa Mizupa de, "Wareware no uchi hitori mo sono musume o Beniyamin bito no tsuma to shite ataeru mono ga atte wa naranai" to itte chikatta no de,
Tami wa Beteru ni itte, soko de yuugure made kami no mae ni zashi, koe o agete hageshiku naite,
Itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, dou shite Isuraeru ni kono you na koto ga tatte, konnichi Isuraeru ni hitotsu no buzoku ga kakeru you ni natta no desu ka".
Yokujitsu, tami wa hayaku okite, soko ni saidan o kizuki, hansai to shuuonsai o sasageta.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa itta, "Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi de shuukai ni nobotte, Shu no moto ni ikanakatta mono wa dare ka". Kore wa karera ga Mizupa ni nobotte, Shu no moto ni ikanai mono no koto ni tsuite ooinaru chikai o tatete, "Sono hito wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai" to ittakara de aru.
Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito wa kyoudai Beniyamin o awarende itta, "Konnichi Isuraeru ni hitotsu no buzoku ga taeta.
Wareware wa Shu o sashite, wareware no musume o karera ni tsuma to shite ataenai to chikatta no de, kano nokotta monodomo ni tsuma o metoraseru ni wa dou shitara yoide arou ka".
Karera wa mata itta, "Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi de, Mizupa ni nobotte Shu no moto ni ikanakatta no wa dono buzoku ka". Tokoro ga yabeshi gireade kara wa hitori mo jin'ei ni kite shuukai ni nozonda mono ga nakatta.
Sunawachi tami o atsumete miruto, yabeshi gireade no juumin wa hitori mo soko ni inakatta.
Soko de kaishuu wa yuushi ichi man nisennin o kashiko ni tsukawashi, kore ni meijite itta, "Yabeshi gireade ni itte, sono juumin o, onna, kodomo morotomo tsurugi o motte ute.
Soshite kono you ni shinakereba naranai. Sunawachi otoko oyobi otoko to neta onna wa kotogotoku horobosanakereba naranai".
Kou shite karera wa yabeshi gireade no juumin no uchi de yonhyakunin no wakai shojo o eta. Kore wa mada otoko to neta koto ga naku, otoko o shiranai mono de aru. Karera wa kore o Kanan no chi ni aru Shiro no jin'ei ni tsurete kita.
Soko de zenkaishuu wa hito o tsukawashite, Rinmon no iwa ni oru Beniyamin no hitobito ni heiwa o tsugeta.
Beniyamin no hitobito ga sono toki, kaette kita no de, karera wa yabeshi gireade no onna no uchi kara ikashite oita onna o kore ni ataetaga, nao tarinakatta.
Kou shite tami wa, Shu ga Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi ni kekkan o tsukurareta koto no tame ni, Beniyamin o awarenda.
Kaishuu no chouroutachi wa itta, "Beniyamin no onna ga taeta no de, kano nokori no monodomo ni tsuma o metoraseru ni wa dou shitara yoideshou ka".
Karera wa mata itta, "Isuraeru kara hitotsu no buzoku ga kieusenai tame ni Beniyamin no uchi no nokori no monodomo ni, atotsugi ga nakereba naranai.
Shikashi, wareware no musume o karera no tsuma ni ataeru koto wa dekinai. Isuraeru no hitobito ga 'Beniyamin ni tsuma o ataeru mono wa norowareru' to itte chikattakara de aru".
Sore de karera wa itta, "Nennen Shiro ni Shu no matsuri ga aru". Shiro wa Beteru no kita ni atte, Beteru kara Shikemu ni noboru ooji no higashi, Rebana no minami ni aru.
Soshite karera wa Beniyamin no hitobito ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa itte, budou hatake ni machibuse shite,
Ukagai nasai. Moshi Shiro no musumetachi ga odori o odori ni dete kitanaraba, budou hatake kara dete, Shiro no musumetachi no uchi kara, meimei jibun no tsuma o totte, Beniyamin no chi ni tsurete iki nasai.
Moshi sono chichi aruiha kyoudai ga kite, wareware ni uttaerunaraba, wareware wa karera ni, 'Wareware no tame ni karera o yurushite kudasai. Sensou no toki ni wareware wa, karera onoono ni tsuma o totte yaranakattashi, mata anata gata mo karera ni ataenakattakara desu. Moshi ataetanaraba, anata gata wa tsumi o okashita koto ni narukara deshita' to iimashou".
Beniyamin no hitobito wa sono you ni okonai, odotte iru monodomo no uchi kara jibuntachi no kazu ni shitagatte tsuma o tori, sore o tsurete ryouchi ni kaeri, machimachi o tatenaoshite, soko ni sunda.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa, sono toki soko o satte, onoono sono buzoku oyobi shizoku ni kaetta. Sunawachi soko o tatte, onoono sono shigyou no chi ni kaetta.
Sono koro, Isuraeru ni wa ou ga nakatta no de, onoono jibun no me ni tadashii to miru tokoro o okonatta.
Sabaki zukasa ga yo o osamete iru koro, kuni ni kikin ga atta no de, hitori no hito ga sono tsuma to futari no otokonoko o tsurete Yuda no Betsurehemu o sari, Moabu no chi e itte soko ni taizai shita.
Sono hito no na wa Erimereku, tsuma no na wa Naomi, futari no otokonoko no na wa Maron to Kirion to ii, Yuda no Betsurehemu no Efurata bito de atta. Karera wa Moabu no chi e itte, soko ni ottaga,
Naomi no otto Erimereku wa shinde, Naomi to futari no otokonoko ga nokosareta.
Futari no otokonoko wa sorezore Moabu no onna o tsuma ni mukaeta. Sono hitori no na wa Orupa to ii, hitori no na wa Rutsu to itta. Karera wa soko ni juu nen hodo sunde itaga,
Maron to Kirion no futari mo mata shinda. Kou shite Naomi wa futari no ko to otto to ni sakidatareta.
Sono toki, Naomi wa Moabu no chi de, Shu ga sono tami o kaerimite, sudeni shokumotsu o oatae ni natte iru koto o kiita no de, sono yome to tomo ni tatte, Moabu no chi kara furusato e kaerou to shita.
Soko de kanojo wa ima iru tokoro o shuttatsu shi, Yuda no chi e kaerouto, futari no yome o tsurete michi ni susunda.
Shikashi Naomi wa futari no yome ni itta, "Anata gata wa, sorezore jibun no haha no ie ni kaette iki nasai. Anata ga taga, shinda futari no ko to watashi ni shinsetsu o tsukushita you ni, douzo, Shu ga anata gata ni, itsukushimi o tamawarimasu you.
Douzo, Shu ga anata gata ni otto o atae, otto no ie de, sorezore mi no ochitsukidokoro o esaserareru you ni". Kou itte, futari no yome ni kuchizuke shita no de, karera wa koe o agete naki,
Naomi ni itta, "Iie, watashitachi wa issho ni anata no tami no tokoro e kaerimasu".
Shikashi Naomi wa itta, "Musumetachi yo, kaette iki nasai. Dou shite, watashi to issho ni ikou to iu no desu ka. Anata gata no otto to naru ko ga mada watashi no tainai ni iru to omou no desu ka.
Musumetachi yo, kaette iki nasai. Watashi wa toshi o totte iru no de, otto o motsu koto wa dekimasen. Tatoi, watashi ga kon'ya, otto o mochi, mata ko o umu nozomi ga aru to shite mo,
Sono tame ni anata gata wa, kodomo no seichou suru made matte iru tsumori na no desu ka. Anata gata wa, sono tame ni otto o motazu ni iru tsumori na no desu ka. Musumetachi yo, sore wa ikemasen. Shu no te ga watashi ni nozomi, watashi o semerareta koto de, anata gata no tame ni, watashi wa hijou ni kokoro o itamete iru no desu".
Karera wa mata koe o agete naita. Soshite Orupa wa sono shuutome ni kuchizuke shitaga, Rutsu wa shuutome o hanarenakatta.
Soko de Naomi wa itta, "Goran nasai. Anata no aiyome wa jibun no tami to jibun no kamigami no moto e kaette ikimashita. Anata mo aiyome no ato ni tsuite kaeri nasai".
Shikashi Rutsu wa itta, "Anata o sute, anata o hanarete kaeru koto o watashi ni susumenaide kudasai. Watashi wa anata no ikareru tokoro e iki, mata anata no yadorareru tokoro ni yadorimasu. Anata no tami wa watashi no tami, anata no kami wa watashi no kami desu.
Anata no shinareru tokoro de watashi mo shinde, sono katawara ni houmuraremasu. Moshi shiniwakare de naku, watashi ga anata to wakarerunaraba, Shu yo, douzo watashi o ikue ni mo basshite kudasai".
Naomi wa Rutsu ga jibun to issho ni ikouto, kataku kesshin shite iru no o mita no de, sono ue iu koto o yameta.
Soshite futari wa tabi o tsuzukete, tsuini Betsurehemu ni tsuita. Karera ga Betsurehemu ni tsuita toki, machi wa kozotte karera no tame ni sawagitachi, onnatachi wa itta, "Kore wa Naomi desu ka".
Naomi wa karera ni itta, "Watashi o Naomi (tanoshimi) to yobazu ni, Mara (kurushimi) to yonde kudasai. Naze nara zennousha ga watashi o hidoku kurushimeraretakara desu.
Watashi wa dete iku toki wa yutaka de arimashitaga, Shu wa watashi o kara te de kaesaremashita. Shu ga watashi o nayamashi, zennousha ga watashi ni wazawai o kudasareta no ni, dou shite watashi o Naomi to yobu no desu ka".
Kou shite Naomi wa, Moabu no chi kara kaetta yome, Moabu no onna Rutsu to issho ni kaette kite, oomugikari no hajime ni Betsurehemu ni tsuita.
Sate Naomi ni wa, otto Erimereku no ichizoku de, hijou ni yuufuku na hitori no shinseki ga atte, sono na o Boazu to itta.
Moabu no onna Rutsu wa Naomi ni itta, "Douzo, watashi o hatake ni ikasete kudasai. Dare ka shinsetsu na hito ga miatarunaraba, watashi wa sono kata no ato ni tsuite ochibo o hiroimasu". Naomi ga kanojo ni "Musume yo, iki nasai" to itta no de,
Rutsu wa itte, karu hitotachi no ato ni shitagai, hatake de ochibo o hirottaga, kanojo wa hakarazu mo Erimereku no ichizoku de aru Boazu no hatake no bubun ni kita.
Sono toki Boazu wa, Betsurehemu kara kite, karu monodomo ni itta, "Shu ga anata gata to tomo ni oraremasu you ni". Karera wa kotaeta, "Shu ga anata o shukufuku saremasu you ni".
Boazu wa karu hitotachi o kantoku shite iru shimobe ni itta, "Kore wa dare no musume desu ka".
Karu hitotachi o kantoku shite iru shimobe wa kotaeta, "Are wa Moabu no onna de, Moabu no chi kara Naomi to issho ni kaette kita no desuga,
Kanojo wa 'Douzo, watashi ni, karu hitotachi no ato ni tsuite, taba no aida de, ochibo o hiroiatsumesasete kudasai' to iimashita. Soshite kanojo wa asa hayaku kite, ima made hataraite, sukoshi no aida mo yasumimasendeshita".
Boazu wa Rutsu ni itta, "Musume yo, okiki nasai. Hoka no hatake ni ho o hiroi ni itte wa ikemasen. Mata koko o satte wa narimasen. Watashi no tokoro de hataraku onnatachi o hanarenaide, koko ni i nasai.
Hitobito ga karitotte iru hatake ni me o tomete, sono ato ni tsuite iki nasai. Watashi wa wakamonotachi ni meijite, anata no jama o shinai you ni to, itte oitade wa arimasen ka. Anata ga kawaku toki ni wa mizugame no tokoro e itte, wakamonotachi no kunda no o nomi nasai".
Kanojo wa chi ni fushite haishi, kare ni itta, "Dou shite anata wa, watashi no you na gaikokujin o kaerimite, shinsetsu ni shite kudasaru no desu ka".
Boazu wa kotaete kanojo ni itta, "Anata no otto ga shinde konokata, anata ga shuutome ni tsukushita koto, mata jibun no fubo to umareta kuni o hanarete, katsute shiranakatta tami no tokoro ni kita koto wa mina watashi ni kikoemashita.
Douzo, Shu ga anata no shita koto ni mukuirareru you ni. Douzo, Isuraeru no kami, Shu, sunawachi anata ga sono tsubasa no shita ni mi o yoseyou to shite kita Shu kara juubun no mukui o erareru you ni".
Kanojo wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, makoto ni arigatou gozaimasu. Watashi wa anata no hashi tame no hitori ni mo oyobanai no ni, anata wa konna ni watashi o nagusame, hashi tame ni nengoro ni katararemashita".
Shokuji no toki, Boazu wa kanojo ni itta, "Koko e kite, pan o tabe, anata no taberu mono o su ni hitashi nasai". Kanojo ga karu hitobito no katawara ni suwatta no de, Boazu wa yakimugi o kanojo ni ataeta. Kanojo wa akiru hodo tabete nokoshita.
Soshite kanojo ga mata ho o hiroou to tachiagatta toki, Boazu wa wakamonotachi ni meijite itta, "Kanojo ni wa tabanoaida de mo ho o hirowase nasai. Togamete wa naranai.
Mata kanojo no tame ni taba kara wazato nuki otoshite oite hirowase nasai. Shikatte wa naranai".
Kou shite kanojo wa yuugure made hatake de ochibo o hirotta. Soshite hirotta ho o utsuto, oomugi wa ichi epa hodo atta.
Kanojo wa sore o tazusaete machi ni hairi, shuutome ni sono hirotta mono o mise, katsu tabeakite, nokoshite mochikaetta mono o toridashite ataeta.
Shuutome wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa, kyou, doko de ho o hiroimashita ka. Doko de hatarakimashita ka. Anata o sono you ni kaerimite kudasatta kata ni, dou ka shukufuku ga aru you ni". Soko de kanojo wa jibun ga dare no tokoro de hataraita ka o, shuutome ni tsugete, "Watashi ga, kyou hataraita no wa Boazu to iu na no hito no tokoro desu" to itta.
Naomi wa yome ni itta, "Ikite iru mono o mo, shinda mono o mo, kaerimite, itsukushimi o tamawaru Shu ga, douzo sono hito o shukufuku saremasu you ni". Naomi wa mata kanojo ni itta, "Sono hito wa watashitachi no enja de, mottomo chikai shinseki no hitori desu".
Moabu no onna Rutsu wa itta, "Sono hito wa mata watashi ni 'Anata wa watashi no tokoro no kariire ga zenbu owaru made, watashi no shimobetachi no soba ni tsuite i nasai' to iimashita".
Naomi wa yome Rutsu ni itta, "Musume yo, sono hito no tokoro de hataraku onnatachi to issho ni dekakeru no wa kekkou desu. Sou sureba hoka no hatake de hito ni ijimerareru no o manukarerudeshou".
Sore de kanojo wa Boazu no tokoro de hataraku onnatachi no soba ni tsuite ite ho o hiroi, oomugikari to komugikari no owaru made sou shita. Kou shite kanojo wa shuutome to issho ni kurashita.
Toki ni shuutome Naomi wa kanojo ni itta, "Musume yo, watashi wa anata no ochitsukidokoro o motomete, anata o shiawase ni subekide wa naideshou ka.
Anata ga issho ni hataraita onnatachi no shujin Boazu wa watashitachi no shinseki de wa arimasen ka. Kare wa kon'ya, uchi ba de oomugi o aogi wakemasu.
Sore de anata wa mi o aratte abura o nuri, haregi o matotte uchi ba ni kudatte iki nasai. Tada, anata wa sono hito ga nomikui o owaru made, sono hito ni shirarete wa narimasen.
Soshite sono hito ga neru toki, sono neru basho o misadame, hai tte itte, sono ashi no tokoro o makutte, soko ni ne nasai. Kare wa anata no subeki koto o shiraserudeshou".
Rutsu wa shuutome ni itta, "Anata no ossharu koto o mina itashimashou".
Kou shite kanojo wa uchi ba ni kudari, subete shuutome ga meijita toori ni shita.
Boazu wa nomikui shite, kokoro o tanoshimaseta ato de, mugi o tsunde aru basho no katawara e itte neta. Soko de kanojo wa hisoka ni iki, Boazu no ashi no tokoro o makutte, soko ni neta.
Yonaka ni natte, sono hito wa odoroki, oki kaette miruto, hitori no onna ga ashi no tokoro ni nete ita no de,
"Anata wa dare desu ka" to iuto, kanojo wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa anata no hashi tame Rutsu desu. Anata no suso de, hashi tame o ootte kudasai. Anata wa mottomo chikai shinseki desu".
Boazu wa itta, "Musume yo, douzo, Shu ga anata o shukufuku sareru you ni. Anata wa hinpu ni kakawarazu wakai hito ni shitagai yuku koto wa sezu, anata ga saigo ni shimeshita kono shinsetsu wa, saki ni shimeshita shinsetsu ni masatte imasu.
Sore de, musume yo, anata wa osoreru ni oyobimasen. Anata ga motomeru koto wa mina, anata no tame ni itashimashou. Watashi no machi no hitobito wa mina, anata ga rippa na onna de aru koto o shitte irukara desu.
Tashika ni watashi wa chikai shinseki de wa arimasuga, watashi yori mo, motto chikai shinseki ga arimasu.
Kon'ya wa koko ni todomari nasai. Asa ni natte, moshi sono hito ga, anata no tame ni shinseki no gimu o tsukusunaraba, yoroshii, sono hito ni sase nasai. Shikashi Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Sono hito ga, anata no tame ni shinseki no gimu o tsukusu koto o konomanainaraba, watashi wa anata no tame ni shinseki no gimu o tsukushimashou. Asa made koko ni oyasumi nasai".
Rutsu wa asa made kare no ashi no tokoro ni netaga, darekare no miwakegatai koro ni okiagatta. Sore wa Boazu ga "Kono onna no uchi ba ni kita koto ga hito ni shirarete wa naranai" to ittakara de aru.
Soshite Boazu wa itta, "Anata no kiru gaitou o motte kite, sore o hiroge nasai". Kanojo ga sore o hirogeruto, Boazu wa oomugi roku Omeru o hakatte kanojo ni owaseta. Kanojo wa machi ni kaeri,
Shuutome no tokoro e ikuto, shuutome wa itta, "Musume yo, dou deshita ka". Soko de Rutsu wa sono hito ga kanojo ni shita koto o kotogotoku tsugete,
Itta, "Ano kata wa watashi ni mukatte, kara te de, shuutome no tokoro e kaette wa naranai to itte, kono oomugi roku Omeru o watashi ni kudasaimashita".
Shuutome wa itta, "Musume yo, kono koto ga dou naru ka wakaru made omachi nasai. Ano hito wa, kyou, sono koto o kettei shinakereba ochitsukanaideshou".
Boazu wa machi no mon no tokoro e nobotte itte, soko ni suwatta. Suruto, saki ni Boazu ga itta shinseki no hito ga toorisugiyou to shita no de, Boazu wa sono hito ni itta, "Tomo yo, kochira e kite, koko ni osuwari kudasai". Kare wa kite suwatta.
Boazu wa mata machi no chourou juunin o maneite itta, "Koko ni osuwari kudasai". Karera ga suwatta toki,
Boazu wa shinseki no hito ni itta, "Moabu no chi kara kaette kita Naomi wa, wareware no shinzoku Erimereku no jisho o urou to shite imasu.
Sore de watashi wa sono koto o anata ni shirasete, koko ni suwatte iru hitobito to, tami no chouroutachi no mae de, sore o kai nasai to, anata ni iou to omoimashita. Moshi, anata ga, sore o aganaou to omowarerunaraba, aganatte kudasai. Shikashi, anata ga sore o aganawanainaraba, watashi ni sou itte shirasete kudasai. Sore o aganau hito wa, anata no hoka ni wa naku, watashi wa anata no tsugi desukara". Kare wa itta, "Watashi ga aganaimashou".
Soko de Boazu wa itta, "Anata ga Naomi no te kara sono jisho o kau toki ni wa, shinda mono no tsuma de atta Moabu no onna Rutsu o mo katte, shinda mono no na o okoshite sono shigyou o tsutaenakereba narimasen".
Sono shinseki no hito wa itta, "Sore de wa, watashi ni wa aganau koto ga dekimasen. Sonna koto o sureba jibun no shigyou o sokonaimasu. Anata ga watashi ni kawatte, jibun de aganatte kudasai. Watashi wa aganau koto ga dekimasenkara".
Mukashi Isuraeru de wa, mono o aganau koto to, kenri no jouto ni tsuite, banji o kettei suru toki no narawashi wa kou de atta. Sunawachi, sono hito wa, jibun no kutsu o nuide, aite no hito ni watashita. Kore ga Isuraeru de no shoumei no houhou de atta.
Soko de shinseki no hito ga Boazu ni mukai "Anata ga jibun de aganai nasai" to itte, sono kutsu o nuida no de,
Boazu wa chouroutachi to subete no tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa, kyou, watashi ga Erimereku no subete no mono oyobi Kirion to Maron no subete no mono o Naomi no te kara kaitotta koto no shounin desu.
Mata watashi wa Maron no tsuma de atta Moabu no onna Rutsu o mo katte, watashi no tsuma to shimashita. Kore wa ano shinda mono no na o okoshite sono shigyou o tsutae, shinda mono no na ga sono ichizoku kara, mata sono kyouri no mon kara danzetsu shinai you ni suru tame desu. Kyou anata gata wa, sono shounin desu".
Suruto mon ni ita subete no tami to chouroutachi wa itta, "Watashitachi wa shounin desu. Douzo, Shu ga anata no ie ni hairu onna o, Isuraeru no ie o tateta Rakeru to Rea no futari no you ni saremasu you. Douzo, anata ga Efurata de tomi o e, Betsurehemu de na o ageraremasu you ni.
Douzo, Shu ga kono wakai onna ni yotte anata ni tamawaru kodomo ni yori, anata no ie ga, kano Tamaru ga Yuda ni unda Perezu no ie no you ni narimasu you ni".
Kou shite Boazu wa Rutsu o metotte tsuma to shi, kanojo no tokoro ni haitta. Shu wa kanojo o migomoraserareta no de, kanojo wa hitori no otokonoko o unda.
Sono toki, onnatachi wa Naomi ni itta, "Shu wa ho mubeki ka na, Shu wa anata o misutezu ni, kyou, anata ni hitori no kinshin o osazuke ni narimashita. Douzo, sono ko no na ga Isuraeru no uchi ni takaku ageraremasu you ni.
Kare wa anata no inochi o arata ni shi, anata no rounen o yashinau mono to narudeshou. Anata o aisuru anata no yome, shichinin no musuko ni mo masaru kanojo ga kare o unda no desukara".
Soko de Naomi wa sono ko o tori, futokoro ni oite, yashinaisodateta.
Kinjo no onnatachi wa "Naomi ni otokonoko ga umareta" to itte, kare ni na o tsuke, sono na o Obede to yonda. Kare wa Dabide no chichi de aru Essai no chichi to natta.
Sate Perezu no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Perezu kara Hezuron ga umare,
Hezuron kara Ramu ga umare, Ramu kara Aminadabu ga umare,
Aminadabu kara Nashon ga umare, Nashon kara Sarumon ga umare,
Sarumon kara Boazu ga umare, Boazu kara Obede ga umare,
Obede kara Essai ga umare, Essai kara Dabide ga umareta.
Efuraimu no sanchi no Ramataimu Zopimu ni, Erukana to iu na no hito ga atta. Efuraimu bito de, Erohamu no ko de atta. Erohamu wa Eriu no ko, Eriu wa Tofu no ko, Tofu wa Tsufu no ko de aru.
Erukana ni wa, futari no tsuma ga atte, hitori no na wa Hanna to ii, hitori no na wa Peninna to itta. Peninna ni wa kodomo ga attaga, Hanna ni wa kodomo ga nakatta.
Kono hito wa toshigoto ni, sono machi kara Shiro ni nobotte itte, bangun no Shu o haishi, Shu ni gisei o sasageru no o tsune to shita. Shiro ni wa, Eri no futari no ko, Hofuni to Pinehasu to ga ite, Shu ni tsukaeru saishi de atta.
Erukana wa, gisei o sasageru hi, tsuma Peninna to sono musuko musume ni wa mina, sono wakemae o ataeta.
Erukana wa Hanna o aishite itaga, kanojo ni wa, tada hitotsu no wakemae o ataeru dake de atta. Shu ga sono tai o tozasaretakara de aru.
Mata kanojo o nikunde iru ta no tsuma wa, hidoku kanojo o nayamashite, Shu ga sono tai o tozasareta koto o uramaseyou to shita.
Kou shite toshi wa kure, toshi wa aketaga, Hanna ga Shu no miya ni noboru goto ni, Peninna wa kanojo o nayamashita no de, Hanna wa naite taberu koto mo shinakatta.
Otto Erukana wa kanojo ni itta, "Hanna yo, naze naku no ka. Naze tabenai no ka. Dou shite kokoro ni kanashimu no ka. Watashi wa anata ni totte juunin no kodomo yori mo masatte irude wa nai ka".
Shiro de karera ga nomikui shita nochi, Hanna wa tachiagatta. Sono toki, saishi Eri wa Shu no shinden no hashira no katawara no za ni suwatte ita.
Hanna wa kokoro ni fukaku kanashimi, Shu ni inotte, hageshiku naita.
Soshite chikai o tatete itta, "Bangun no Shu yo, makoto ni, hashi tame no nayami o kaerimi, watashi o oboe, hashi tame o wasurezu ni, hashi tame ni otokonoko o tamawarimasunara, watashi wa sono ko o isshou no aida Shu ni sasage, kamisori o sono atama ni atemasen".
Kanojo ga Shu no mae de nagaku inotte ita no de, Eri wa kanojo no kuchi ni me o tometa.
Hanna wa kokoro no uchi de mono o itte ita no de, kuchibiru ga ugoku dake de, koe wa kikoenakatta. Sore yue Eri wa, yotte iru no da to omotte,
Kanojo ni itta, "Itsu made yotte iru no ka. Yoi o samashi nasai".
Shikashi Hanna wa kotaeta, "Iie, waga Shu yo. Watashi wa fukou na onna desu. Budoushu mo koi sake mo nonda no de wa arimasen. Tada Shu no mae ni kokoro o sosogi dashite ita no desu.
Hashi tame o, warui onna to omowanaide kudasai. Tsumoru urei to nayami no yue ni, watashi wa ima made mono o itte ita no desu".
Soko de Eri wa kotaeta, "Anshin shite iki nasai. Dou ka Isuraeru no kami ga anata no motomeru negai o kikitodokerareru you ni".
Kanojo wa itta, "Douzo, hashi tame ni mo, anata no mae ni megumi o esasete kudasai". Kou shite, sono onna wa satte shokuji shi, sono kao wa, mohaya kanashige de wa nakunatta.
Karera wa asa hayaku okite, Shu no mae ni reihai shi, soshite, Rama ni aru ie ni kaette itta. Erukana wa tsuma Hanna o shiri, Shu ga kanojo o kaerimirareta no de,
Kanojo wa migomori, sono toki ga megutte kite, otokonoko o umi, "Watashi ga kono ko o Shu ni motometakara da" to itte, sono na o Samueru to nazuketa.
Erukana sono hito to sono kazoku to wa mina nobotte itte, toshigoto no gisei to, chikai no sonaemono to o sasageta.
Shikashi Hanna wa nobotte ikazu, otto ni itta, "Watashi wa kono ko ga chibanare shite kara, Shu no mae ni tsurete itte, itsu made mo, soko ni orasemashou".
Otto Erukana wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata ga yoi to omou you ni shite, kono ko no chibanare suru made machi nasai. Tada dou ka Shu ga sono iwareta koto o jitsugen shite kudasaru you ni". Kou shite sono onna wa todomatte, sono ko ni chichi o nomase, chibanare suru no o matte itaga,
Chibanare shita toki, sansai no oushi ichitou, mugiko ichi epa, budoushu no haitta kawabukuro hitotsu o tori, sono ko o tsurete, Shiro ni aru Shu no miya ni itta. Sono ko wa nao osanakatta.
Soshite karera wa sono ushi o koroshi, kodomo o Eri no moto e tsurete itta.
Hanna wa itta, "Waga kimi yo, anata wa ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa, katsute koko ni tatte, anata no mae de, Shu ni inotta onna desu.
Kono ko o ataete kudasai to, watashi wa inorimashitaga, Shu wa watashi no motometa negai o kikitodokeraremashita.
Sore yue, watashi mo kono ko o Shu ni sasagemasu. Kono ko wa isshou no aida Shu ni sasageta mono desu". Soshite karera wa soko de Shu o reihai shita.
Hanna wa inotte itta, "Watashi no kokoro wa Shu ni yotte yorokobi, watashi no chikara wa Shu ni yotte tsuyomerareta, watashi no kuchi wa teki o azawarau, anata no sukui ni yotte watashi wa tanoshimukara de aru.
Shu no you ni sei naru mono wa nai, anata no hoka ni wa, dare mo nai, wareware no kami no you na iwa wa nai.
Anata gata wa kasanete kouman ni katatte wa naranai, takaburi no kotoba o kuchi ni suru koto o yameyo. Shu wa subete o shiru kami de atte, moromoro no okonai wa Shu ni yotte hakarareru.
Yuushi no yumi wa ore, yowaki mono wa chikara o obiru.
Akitarita mono wa shoku no tame ni yatoware, ueta mono wa, mohaya ueru koto ga nai. Umazume wa nananin no ko o umi, ooku no ko o motsu onna wa kodoku to naru.
Shu wa koroshi, mata ikashi, yomi ni kudashi, mata uegerareru.
Shu wa mazushiku shi, mata tomase, hikuku shi, mata takaku sareru.
Mazushii mono o, chiri no naka kara tachiagarase, toboshii mono o, akuta no naka kara hikiagete, oukou to tomo ni suwarase, eiyo no kurai o tsugaserareru. Chi no hashira wa Shu no mono de atte, sono hashira no ue ni, sekai o sueraretakara de aru.
Shu wa sono seitotachi no ashi o mamorareru, shikashi warui monodomo wa ankoku no uchi ni horobiru. Hito wa chikara o motte katsu koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Shu to arasou mono wa konagona ni kudakarerude arou, Shu wa karera ni mukatte ten kara kaminari o todorokashi, chi no hate made mo sabaki, ou ni chikara o atae, abura sosogareta mono no chikara o tsuyoku sarerude arou".
Erukana wa Rama ni aru ie ni kaettaga, osanako wa saishi Eri no mae ni ite Shu ni tsukaeta.
Sate, Eri no kora wa, yokoshima na hitobito de, Shu o osorenakatta.
Tami no sasagemono ni tsuite no saishi no narawashi wa kou de aru. Hito ga gisei o sasageru toki, sono niku o niru aida ni, saishi no shimobe wa, mitsumata no nikusashi o te ni motte kite,
Sore o kama, mata wa na be, mata wa oogama, mata wa hachi ni tsukiire, nikusashi no hikiageru mono wa saishi ga mina jibun no mono to shita. Karera wa Shiro de, soko ni kuru subete no Isuraeru no hito ni, kono you ni shita.
Hitobito ga shibou o yaku mae ni mo mata, saishi no shimobe ga kite, gisei o sasageru hito ni iu no de atta, "Saishi no tame ni yaku niku o atae yo. Saishi wa anata kara nita niku o ukenai. Nama no niku ga yoi".
Sono hito ga, "Mazu shibou o yakasemashou. Sono nochi hoshii dake totte kudasai" to iuto, shimobe wa, "Iya, ima moraitai. Kurenainara, watashi wa chikara zukude, sore o torou" to iu.
Kono you ni, sono wakamonotachi no tsumi wa, Shu no mae ni hijou ni ookikatta. Kono hitobito ga Shu no sonaemono o karonjitakara de aru.
Samueru wa mada osanaku, mi ni amanuno no Epode o tsukete, Shu no mae ni tsukaete ita.
Haha wa kare no tame ni chiisai uwagi o tsukuri, toshigoto ni, otto to tomo ni sono toshi no gisei o sasageru tame ni noboru toki, sore o motte kita.
Eri wa itsu mo Erukana to sono tsuma o shukufuku shite itta, "Kono onna ga Shu ni sasageta mono no kawari ni, Shu ga kono onna ni yotte anata ni ko o ataerareru you ni". Soshite karera wa sono ie ni kaeru no o tsune to shita.
Kou shite Shu ga Hanna o kaerimirareta no de, Hanna wa migomotte, sannin no otokonoko to futari no onnanoko o unda. Warabe Samueru wa Shu no mae de sodatta.
Eri wa hijou ni toshi o totta. Soshite sono kora ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni shitai roiro no koto o kiki, mata kaiken no makuya no iriguchi de tsutomete ita onnatachi to neta koto o kiite,
Karera ni itta, "Naniyue, sono you na koto o suru no ka. Watashi wa kono subete no tami kara, anata gata no warui okonai no koto o kiku.
Waga kora yo, sore wa ikenai. Watashi no kiku, Shu no tami no iifurashite iru fuusetsu wa yoku nai.
Moshi hito ga hito ni taishite tsumi o okasunaraba, kami ga chuusai sarerude arou. Shikashi hito ga Shu ni taishite tsumi o okasunaraba, dare ga, sono torinashi o suru koto ga dekiyou ka". Shikashi karera wa chichi no iu koto ni mimi o katamukeyou to mo shinakatta. Shu ga karera o korosou to saretakara de aru.
Warabe Samueru wa sodatte iki, Shu ni mo, hitobito ni mo, masumasu aiserareta.
Kono toki, hitori no kami no hito ga, Eri no moto ni kite itta, "Shu wa kaku ooserareru, 'Anata no senzo no ie ga Ejiputo de Paro no ie no dorei de atta toki, watashi wa sono senzo no ie ni mizukara o arawashita.
Soshite Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara sore o erabidashite, watashi no saishi to shi, watashi no saidan ni nobotte, kou o takase, watashi no mae de Epode o tsukesase, mata, Isuraeru no hitobito no kasai o kotogotoku anata no senzo no ie ni ataeta.
Sore ni dou shite anata gata wa, watashi ga meijita gisei to sonaemono o musabori no me o motte miru no ka. Mata naniyue, watashi yori mo jibun no kora o tattobi, watashi no tami Isuraeru no sasageru moromoro no sonaemono no, mottomo yoki bubun o motte jibun o koyasu no ka'.
Sore yue Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ooserareru, 'Watashi wa katsute, "Anata no ie to anata no chichi no ie to wa, eikyuu ni watashi no mae ni ayumude arou" to itta'. Shikashi ima, Shu wa ooserareru, 'Kesshite sou wa shinai. Watashi o tattobu mono o, watashi wa tattobi, watashi o iyashimeru mono wa, karonzerarerude arou.
Miyo, hi ga kurude arou. Sono hi, watashi wa anata no chikara to, anata no chichi no ie no chikara o tachi, anata no ie ni toshioita mono o nakusurude arou.
Sono toki, anata wa wazawai no uchi ni atte, Isuraeru ni ataerareru moromoro no han'ei o, netami mirude arou. Anata no ie ni wa eikyuu ni toshioita mono ga inaku narude arou.
Shikashi anata no ichizoku no hitori o, watashi no saidan kara tatanaide arou. Kare wa nokosarete sono me o nakiharashi, kokoro o itamerude arou. Mata anata no ie ni umarederu mono wa, mina tsurugi ni shinude arou.
Anata no futari no ko Hofuni to Pinehasu no mi ni okoru koto ga, anata no tame ni sono shirushi to narude arou. Sunawachi sono futari wa tomo ni onaji hi ni shinude arou.
Watashi wa jibun no tame ni, hitori no chuujitsu na saishi o okosu. Sono hito wa watashi no kokoro to omoi to ni shitagatte okonaude arou. Watashi wa sono ie o kakuritsu shiyou. Sono hito wa watashi ga abura sosoida mono no mae ni tsune ni ayumude arou.
Soshite anata no ie de ikinokotte iru hitobito wa mina kite, kare ni ichimai no gin to ichiko no pan o koimotome, "Douzo, watashi o saishi no shoku no hitotsu ni ninji, hitokuchi no pan de mo taberu koto ga dekiru you ni shite kudasai" to iude arou' ".
Warabe Samueru wa, Eri no mae de, Shu ni tsukaete ita. Sono koro, Shu no kotoba wa mare de, mokushi mo tsune de wa nakatta.
Sate Eri wa, shidai ni me ga kasunde, miru koto ga dekinaku nari, sono toki jibun no heya de nete ita.
Kami no tomoshibi wa mada kiezu, Samueru ga kami no hako no aru Shu no shinden ni nete ita toki,
Shu wa "Samueru yo, Samueru yo" to yobareta. Kare wa "Hai, koko ni orimasu" to itte,
Eri no tokoro e hashitte itte itta, "Anata ga ooyobi ni narimashita. Watashi wa, koko ni orimasu". Shikashi Eri wa itta, "Watashi wa yobanai. Kaette ne nasai". Kare wa itte neta.
Shu wa mata kasanete "Samueru yo, Samueru yo" to yobareta. Samueru wa okite Eri no moto e itte itta, "Anata ga ooyobi ni narimashita. Watashi wa, koko ni orimasu". Eri wa itta, "Ko yo, watashi wa yobanai. Mou ichi do ne nasai".
Samueru wa mada Shu o shirazu, Shu no kotoba ga mada kare ni arawasarenakatta.
Shu wa mata san dome ni Samueru o yobareta no de, Samueru wa okite Eri no moto e itte itta, "Anata ga ooyobi ni narimashita. Watashi wa, koko ni orimasu". Sono toki, Eri wa Shu ga warabe o yobareta no de aru koto o satotta.
Soshite Eri wa Samueru ni itta, "Itte ne nasai. Moshi anata o yobaretara, 'Shimobe wa kikimasu. Shu yo, ohanashi kudasai' to ii nasai". Samueru wa itte jibun no tokoro de neta.
Shu wa kite tachi, mae no you ni, "Samueru yo, Samueru yo" to yobareta no de, Samueru wa itta, "Shimobe wa kikimasu. Ohanashi kudasai".
Sono toki, Shu wa Samueru ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa Isuraeru no uchi ni hitotsu no koto o suru. Sore o kiku mono wa mina, mimi ga futatsu to mo narude arou.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi ga, katsute Eri no ie ni tsuite hanashita koto o, hajime kara owari made kotogotoku, Eri ni okonaude arou.
Watashi wa Eri ni, kare ga shitte iru akuji no yue ni, sono ie o eikyuu ni bassuru koto o tsugeru. Sono kora ga kami o kegashite iru no ni, kare ga sore o tomenakattakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Eri no ie ni chikau. Eri no ie no aku wa, gisei ya sonaemono o motte shite mo, eikyuu ni aganawarenaide arou".
Samueru wa asa made nete, Shu no miya no to o aketaga, Samueru wa sono maboroshi no koto o Eri ni kataru no o osoreta.
Shikashi Eri wa Samueru o yonde itta, "Waga ko Samueru yo". Samueru wa itta, "Hai, koko ni orimasu".
Eri wa itta, "Nanigoto o otsuge ni natta no ka. Kakusazu hanashite kudasai. Moshi otsuge ni natta koto o hitotsu de mo kakushite, watashi ni iwanainaraba, douzo kami ga anata o basshi, sarani omoku basserareru you ni".
Soko de Samueru wa, sono koto o kotogotoku hanashite, nani mo kare ni kakusanakatta. Eri wa itta, "Sore wa Shu de aru. Douzo Shu ga, yoi to omou koto o okonawareru you ni".
Samueru wa sodatte itta. Shu ga kare to tomo ni orarete, sono kotoba o hitotsu mo chi ni ochinai you ni sareta no de,
Dan kara Beerushiba made, Isuraeru no subete no hito wa, Samueru ga Shu no yogensha to sadamerareta koto o shitta.
Shu wa futatabi Shiro de arawarerareta. Sunawachi Shu wa Shiro de, Shu no kotoba ni yotte, Samueru ni mizukara o arawasareta. Kou shite Samueru no kotoba wa, amaneku Isuraeru no hitobito ni oyonda.
Isuraeru bi to wa dete Perishite bito to tatakaou to shite, Ebenezeru no hotori ni jin o shiki, Perishite bi to wa Apeku ni jin o shiita.
Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru bito ni mukatte jin sonae o shitaga, tatakau ni oyonde, Isuraeru bi to wa Perishite bito no mae ni yabure, Perishite bi to wa senjou ni oite, ooyoso yonsennin o koroshita.
Tami ga jin'ei ni shirizoita toki, Isuraeru no chouroutachi wa itta, "Naniyue, Shu wa kyou, Perishite bito no mae ni wareware o yaburareta no ka. Shiro e itte Shu no keiyaku no hako o koko e tazusaete kuru koto ni shiyou. Soshite Shu o wareware no uchi ni mukaete, teki no te kara sukutte itadakou".
Soko de tami wa hito o Shiro ni tsukawashi, kerubimu no ue ni zashite orareru bangun no Shu no keiyaku no hako o, soko kara tazusaete kosaseta. Sono toki Eri no futari no ko, Hofuni to Pinehasu wa kami no keiyaku no hako to tomo ni, sono tokoro ni ita.
Shu no keiyaku no hako ga jin'ei ni tsuita toki, Isuraeru bi to wa mina oogoe de sakenda no de, chi wa narihibiita.
Perishite bi to wa, sono sakebigoe o kiite itta, "Heburu bito no jin'ei no, kono ookina sakebigoe wa nanigoto ka". Soshite Shu no hako ga, jin'ei ni tsuita koto o shitta toki,
Perishite bi to wa osorete itta, "Kamigami ga jin'ei ni kita no da". Karera wa mata itta, "Aa, wareware wa wazawai de aru. Kono you na koto wa ima made nakatta.
Aa, wareware wa wazawai de aru. Dare ga wareware o korera no tsuyoi kamigami no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou ka. Korera no kamigami wa, moromoro no wazawai o motte Ejiputo bito o arano de utta no da.
Perishite bito yo, yuuki o dashite otokorashiku seyo. Heburu bito ga anata gata ni tsukaeta you ni, anata gata ga karera ni tsukaeru koto no nai tame ni, otokorashiku tatakae".
Kou shite Perishite bito ga tatakatta no de, Isuraeru bi to wa yaburete, onoono sono ie ni nigete kaetta. Senshisha wa hijou ni ooku, Isuraeru no hohei de taoreta mono wa san man de atta.
Mata kami no hako wa ubaware, Eri no futari no ko, Hofuni to Pinehasu wa korosareta.
Sono hi hitori no Beniyamin bito ga, ifuku o saki, atama ni tsuchi o kabutte, senjou kara hashitte Shiro ni kita.
Kare ga tsuita toki, Eri wa michi no katawara ni aru jibun no za ni suwatte machikamaete ita. Sono kokoro ni kami no hako no koto o kizukatte itakara de aru. Sono hito ga machi ni haitte, jouhou o tsutaeta no de, machi wa kozotte sakenda.
Eri wa sono sakebigoe o kiite itta, "Kono sawagi koe wa nani ka". Sono hito wa isoide Eri no tokoro e kite Eri ni tsugeta.
Sono toki Eri wa kyuujuu hachisai de, sono me wa katamatte miru koto ga dekinakatta.
Sono hito wa Eri ni itta, "Watashi wa senjou kara kita mono desu. Kyou senjou kara nogareta no desu". Eri wa itta, "Waga ko yo, yousu wa dou de atta ka".
Shirase o motarashita sono hito wa kotaete itta, "Isuraeru bi to wa, Perishite bito no mae kara nige, tami no uchi ni wa mata ooku no senshisha ga ari, anata no futari no ko, Hofuni to Pinehasu mo shini, kami no hako wa ubawaremashita".
Kare ga kami no hako no koto o itta toki, Eri wa sono za kara, aomuke ni mon no katawara ni ochi, kubi o otte shinda. Oite mi ga omokattakara de aru. Kare no Isuraeru o sabaita no wa yonjuu nen de atta.
Kare no yome, Pinehasu no tsuma wa migomotte shussan no toki ga chikazuite itaga, kami no hako ga ubawareta koto, shuuto to otto ga shinda to iu shirase o kiita toki, jintsuu ga okori mi o kagamete ko o unda.
Kanojo ga shinikakatte iru toki, sewa o shite ita onna ga kanojo ni itta, "Osoreru koto wa arimasen. Otokonoko ga umaremashita". Shikashi kanojo wa kotae mo sezu, mata kaerimi mo shinakatta.
Tada kanojo wa "Eikou wa Isuraeru o satta" to itte, sono ko o Ikabode to nazuketa. Kore wa kami no hako no ubawareta koto, mata kanojo no shuuto to otto no koto ni yoru no de aru.
Kanojo wa mata, "Eikou wa Isuraeru o satta. Kami no hako ga ubawaretakara desu" to itta.
Perishite bi to wa kami no hako o bundotte, Ebenezeru kara Ashidodo ni hakonde kita.
Soshite Perishite bi to wa sono kami no hako o totte Dagon no miya ni hakobikomi, Dagon no katawara ni oita.
Ashidodo no hitobito ga, tsugi no hi, hayaku okite miruto, Dagon ga Shu no hako no mae ni, utsumuki ni chi ni taorete ita no de, karera wa Dagon o okoshite, sore o moto no tokoro ni oita.
Sono tsugi no asa mata hayaku okite miruto, Dagon wa mata, Shu no hako no mae ni, utsumuki ni chi ni taorete ita. Soshite Dagon no atama to ryoute to wa kirete hanare, shikii no ue ni ari, Dagon wa tada doutai dake to natte ita.
Sore yue Dagon no saishitachi ya Dagon no miya ni hairu hitobito wa, dare mo konnichi ni itaru made, Ashidodo no Dagon no shikii o fumanai.
Soshite Shu no te wa Ashidodo bito no ue ni kibishiku nozomi, Shu wa haremono o motte Ashidodo to sono ryouiki no hitobito o osoresase, mata nayamasareta.
Ashidodo no hitobito wa, kono arisama o mite itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako o, wareware no tokoro ni, todome oite wa naranai. Sono kami no te ga, wareware to, wareware no kami Dagon no ue ni kibishiku nozomukara de aru".
Soko de karera wa hito o tsukawashite, Perishite bito no kimitachi o atsumete itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako o dou shimashou". Karera wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako wa Gate ni utsusou". Hitobito wa Isuraeru no kami no hako o soko ni utsushita.
Karera ga sore o utsusuto, Shu no te ga sono machi ni nozomi, hijou na sawagi ga tatta. Soshite rounyaku o towazu machi no hitobito o utareta no de, karera no mi ni haremono ga dekita.
Soko de hitobito wa kami no hako o Ekuron ni okuttaga, kami no hako ga Ekuron ni tsuita toki, Ekuron no hitobito wa sakende itta, "Karera ga Isuraeru no kami no hako o wareware no tokoro ni utsushita no wa, wareware to tami o horobosu tame de aru".
Soko de karera wa hito o tsukawashite, Perishite bito no kimitachi o mina atsumete itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako o okuridashite, moto no tokoro ni kaeshi, wareware to tami o horobosu koto no nai you ni shiyou". Osoroshii sawagi ga machijyuu ni tatte itakara de aru. Soko ni wa kami no te ga hijou ni kibishiku nozonde ita no de,
Shinanai hito wa haremono o motte utare, machi no sakebi wa ten ni tasshita.
Shu no hako wa nana kagetsu no aida Perishite bito no chi ni atta.
Perishite bi to wa, saishi ya uranaishi o yonde itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako o dou shimashou ka. Dono you ni shite, sore o moto no tokoro e okurikaeseba yoi ka tsugete kudasai".
Karera wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami no hako o okurikaesu toki ni wa, sore o munashiku kaeshite wa naranai. Kanarazu kare ni toga no sonaemono o motte tsugunai o shinakereba naranai. Sou sureba, anata gata wa iyasare, mata kare no te ga naze anatagata o hanarenai ka o shiru koto ga dekirude arou".
Hitobito wa itta, "Wareware ga tsugunau toga no sonaemono ni wa nani o shimashou ka". Karera wa kotaeta, "Perishite bito no kimitachi no kazu ni shitagatte, kin no haremono itsutsu to kin no nezumi itsutsu de aru. Anata gata subete to, kimitachi ni nozonda wazawai wa hitotsu dakara de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata no haremono no zou to, chi o arasu nezumi no zou o tsukuri, Isuraeru no kami ni eikou o kisurunaraba, tabun kare wa, anata gata, oyobi anata gata no kamigami to, anata gata no chi ni, sono te o kuwaeru koto o karuku sarerude arou.
Naniyue, anata gata wa Ejiputo bito to Paro ga sono kokoro o katakuna ni shita you ni, jibun no kokoro o katakuna ni suru no ka. Kami ga karera o nayamashita no de, karera wa tami o ikase, tami wa sattade wa nai ka.
Sore yue ima, atarashii kuruma ichiryou o tsukuri, mada kubiki o tsuketa koto no nai nyuugyuu nitou o tori, sono ushi o kuruma ni tsunagi, sono onoono no koushi o nyuugyuu kara hanashite ie ni tsurekaeri,
Shu no hako o totte, sore o sono kuruma ni nose, anata gata ga toga no sonaemono to shite kare ni tsugunau kin no tsukurimono o hitotsu no hako ni osamete sono katawara ni oki, sore o okutte sarase nasai.
Soshite mite ite, sore ga jibun no ryouchi e iku michi o, Beteshimeshi e noborunaraba, kono ooinaru wazawai o, wareware ni kudashita no wa kare de aru. Shikashi, sou shinai toki wa, wareware o utta no wa kare no te de wa naku, sono koto no guuzen de atta koto o shirude arou".
Hitobito wa sono you ni shita. Sunawachi, karera wa nitou no nyuugyuu o totte, kore o kuruma ni tsunagi, sono onoono no koushi o ie ni tojikome,
Shu no hako, oyobi kin no nezumi to, haremono no zou o osameta hako to o kuruma ni noseta.
Suru to meushi wa massugu ni Beteshimeshi no houkou e, hitosuji ni ooji o ayumi, nakinagara susunde itte, migi ni mo hidari ni mo magaranakatta. Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, Beteshimeshi no sakai made sono ato ni tsuite itta.
Toki ni Beteshimeshi no hitobito wa tani de komugi o kariirete itaga, me o agete, sono hako o mi, sore o mukaete yorokonda.
Kuruma wa Beteshimeshi bito Yoshua no hatake ni haitte, soko ni todomatta. Sono tokoro ni ookina ishi ga atta. Hitobito wa kuruma no ki o wari, sono meushi o hansai to shite Shu ni sasageta.
Rebi bi to wa Shu no hako to, sono katawara no, kin no tsukurimono o osameta hako o torioroshi, sore o ooishi no ue ni oita. Soshite Beteshimeshi no hitobito wa, sono hi, Shu ni hansai o sonae, gisei o sasageta.
Perishite bito no gonin no kimitachi wa kore o mite, sono hi, Ekuron ni kaetta.
Perishite bito ga, toga no sonaemono to shite, Shu ni tsugunai o shita kin no haremono wa, tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Ashidodo no tame ni hitotsu, Gaza no tame ni hitotsu, Ashikeron no tame ni hitotsu, Gate no tame ni hitotsu, Ekuron no tame ni hitotsu de atta.
Mata kin no nezumi wa, jouheki o megurashita machi kara jouheki no nai murazato ni itaru made, subete gonin no kimitachi ni zokusuru Perishite bito no machi no kazu ni shitagatte tsukutta. Shu no hako o oroshita tokoro no katawara ni atta ooishi wa, konnichi ni itaru made, Beteshimeshi bi to Yoshua no hatake ni atte, akashi to natte iru.
Beteshimeshi no hitobito de Shu no hako no naka o mita mono ga atta no de, Shu wa kore o utareta. Sunawachi tami no uchi nanajuunin o utareta. Shu ga tami o utte ooku no mono o korosareta no de, tami wa nagekikanashinda.
Beteshimeshi no hitobito wa itta, "Dare ga, kono sei naru kami, Shu no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiyou ka. Shu wa wareware o hanarete dare no tokoro e nobotte ikaretara yoi no ka".
Soshite karera wa, shisha o kiriate yarimu no hitobito ni tsukawashite itta, "Perishite bito ga Shu no hako o kaeshitakara, kudatte kite, sore o anata gata no tokoro e tazusae nobotte kudasai".
Kiriate yarimu no hitobito wa, kite, Shu no hako o tazusae nobori, oka no ue no Abinadabu no ie ni motte kite, sono ko Ereazaru o seibetsu shite, Shu no hako o mamoraseta.
Sono hako wa hisashiku kiriate yarimu ni todomatte, nijuu nen o heta. Isuraeru no zenka wa Shu o shitatte nageita.
Sono toki Samueru wa Isuraeru no zenka ni tsugete itta, "Moshi, anata gata ga isshin ni Shu ni tachikaeru no de areba, hoka no kamigami to Ashitarote o, anata gata no uchi kara sutesari, kokoro o Shu ni muke, Shu ni nomi tsukaenakereba naranai. Sou sureba, Shu wa anatagata o Perishite bito no te kara sukuidasarerude arou".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa Baaru to Ashitarote o sutesari, tada Shu ni nomi tsukaeta.
Samueru wa mata itta, "Isuraeru bito o, kotogotoku Mizupa ni atsume nasai. Watashi wa anata gata no tame ni Shu ni inorimashou".
Hitobito wa Mizupa ni atsumari, mizu o kunde sore o Shu no mae ni sosogi, sono hi, danjiki shite sono tokoro de itta, "Wareware wa Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashita". Samueru wa Mizupa de Isuraeru no hitobito o sabaita.
Isuraeru no hitobito no Mizupa ni atsumatta koto ga Perishite bito ni kikoeta no de, Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, Isuraeru ni semenobotte kita. Isuraeru no hitobito wa sore o kiite, Perishite bito o osoreta.
Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa Samueru ni itta, "Wareware no tame, wareware no kami, Shu ni sakebu koto o, yamenaide kudasai. Sou sureba Shu ga Perishite bito no te kara wareware o sukuidasarerudeshou".
Soko de Samueru wa chichi o nomu kohitsuji ichitou o tori, kore o mattaki hansai to shite Shu ni sasageta. Soshite Samueru wa Isuraeru no tame ni Shu ni sakenda no de, Shu wa kore ni kotaerareta.
Samueru ga hansai o sasagete ita toki, Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru to tatakaou to shite chikazuite kita. Shikashi Shu wa sono hi, ooinaru kaminari o Perishite bito no ue ni todorokasete, karera o midasareta no de, karera wa Isuraeru bito no mae ni yaburete nigeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Mizupa o dete Perishite bito o oi, kore o utte, Betekaru no shita made itta.
Sono toki Samueru wa hitotsu no ishi o totte Mizupa to Eshana no aida ni sue, "Shu wa ima ni itaru made wareware o tasukerareta" to itte, sono na o Ebenezeru to nazuketa.
Kou shite Perishite bi to wa seifuku sare, futatabi Isuraeru no ryouchi ni, hairanakatta. Samueru no isshou no aida, Shu no te ga, Perishite bito o fuseida.
Perishite bito ga Isuraeru kara totta machimachi wa, Ekuron kara Gate made, Isuraeru ni kaeri, Isuraeru wa sono shuui no chi o mo Perishite bito no te kara torikaeshita. Mata Isuraeru to Amori bito to no aida ni wa heiwa ga atta.
Samueru wa isshou no aida Isuraeru o sabaita.
Toshigoto ni Samueru wa Beteru to Girugaru, oyobi Mizupa o megutte, sono tokorodokoro de Isuraeru o sabaki,
Rama ni kaetta. Soko ni kare no ie ga attakara de aru. Sono tokoro de mo kare wa Isuraeru o sabaki, mata soko de Shu ni saidan o kizuita.
Samueru wa toshioite, sono kora o Isuraeru no sabaki zukasa to shita.
Choushi no na wa Yoeru to ii, tsugi no ko no na wa Abiya to itta. Karera wa Beerushiba de sabaki zukasa de atta.
Shikashi sono kora wa chichi no michi o ayumanaide, ri ni mukai, mainai o totte, sabaki o mageta.
Kono toki, Isuraeru no chouroutachi wa mina atsumatte Rama ni oru Samueru no moto ni kite,
Itta, "Anata wa toshioi, anata no kotachi wa anata no michi o ayumanai. Ima hoka no kuniguni no you ni, wareware o sabaku ou o, wareware no tame ni tatete kudasai".
Shikashi karera ga, "Wareware o sabaku ou o, wareware ni ataeyo" to iu no o kiite, Samueru wa yorokobanakatta. Soshite Samueru ga Shu ni inoruto,
Shu wa Samueru ni iwareta, "Tami ga, subete anata ni iu tokoro no koe ni kikishitagai nasai. Karera ga suteru no wa anata de wa naku, watashi o sutete, karera no ue ni watashi ga ou de aru koto o mitomenai no de aru.
Karera wa, watashi ga Ejiputo kara tsurenobotta hi kara, kyou made, watashi o sutete hoka no kamigami ni tsukae, samazama no koto o watashi ni shita you ni, anata ni mo shite iru no de aru.
Ima sono koe ni kikishitagai nasai. Tadashi, fukaku karera o imashimete, karera o osameru ou no narawashi o karera ni shimesanakereba naranai".
Samueru wa ou o tateru koto o motomeru tami ni Shu no kotoba o kotogotoku tsugete,
Itta, "Anatagata o osameru ou no narawashi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kare wa anata gata no musuko o totte, senshatai ni ire, kihei to shi, jibun no sensha no mae ni hashiraserude arou.
Kare wa mata sore o sennin no chou, gojuunin no chou ni ninji, mata sono chi o tagayasase, sono sakumotsu o karase, mata sono buki to sensha no soubi o tsukuraserude arou.
Mata, anata gata no musume o totte, kou o tsukuru mono to shi, ryouri o suru mono to shi, pan o yaku mono to surude arou.
Mata, anata gata no hatake to budou hatake to oribu hatake no mottomo yoi mono o totte, sono kerai ni atae,
Anata gata no kokumotsu to, budou hatake no, juubun no ichi o totte, sono yakunin to kerai ni atae,
Mata, anata gata no danjo no dorei oyobi, anata gata no mottomo yoi ushitoro ba o totte, jibun no tame ni hatarakase,
Mata, anata gata no hitsuji no juubun no ichi o tori, anata gata wa, sono dorei to narude arou.
Soshite sono hi anata gata wa jibun no tame ni eranda ou no yue ni yobawarude arou. Shikashi Shu wa sono hi ni anata gata ni kotaerarenaide arou".
Tokoro ga tami wa Samueru no koe ni kikishitagau koto o kobande itta, "Iie, wareware o osameru ou ga nakereba naranai.
Wareware mo ta no kuniguni no you ni nari, ou ga wareware o sabaki, wareware o hikiite, wareware no tatakai ni tatakau no de aru".
Samueru wa tami no kotoba o kotogotoku kiite, sore o Shu no mimi ni tsugeta.
Shu wa Samueru ni iwareta, "Karera no koe ni kikishitagai, karera no tame ni ou o tateyo". Samueru wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Anata gata wa, meimei sono machi ni kaeri nasai".
Sate, Beniyamin no hito de, Kishi to iu na no yuufuku na hito ga atta. Kishi wa Abieru no ko, Abieru wa Zeroru no ko, Zeroru wa Bekorate no ko, Bekorate wa Apiya no ko, Apiya wa Beniyamin bito de aru.
Kishi ni wa Sauru to iu na no ko ga atta. Wakakute uruwashiku, Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni kare yori mo uruwashii hito wa naku, tami no dare yori mo kata kara ue, se ga takakatta.
Sauru no chichi Kishi no suutou no roba ga inaku natta. Soko de Kishi wa, sono ko Sauru ni itta, "Shimobe o hitori tsurete, tatte iki, roba o sagashite ki nasai".
Soko de futari wa Efuraimu no sanchi o toorisugi, Sharisha no chi o toorisugitakeredo mo miatarazu, Sharimu no chi o toorisugitakeredo mo orazu, Beniyamin no chi o toorisugitakeredo mo miataranakatta.
Karera ga Tsufu no chi ni kita toki, Sauru wa tsurete kita shimobe ni itta, "Saa, kaerou. Chichi wa, roba no koto yori mo, wareware no koto o shinpai surudarou".
Tokoro ga, shimobe wa itta, "Kono machi ni wa kami no hito ga oraremasu. Tattoi hito de, sono iwareru koto wa mina sono toori ni narimasu. Sono tokoro e ikimashou. Wareware no dete kita tabi no koto ni tsuite nani ka shimesarerudeshou".
Sauru wa shimobe ni itta, "Shikashi iku no de areba, sono hito ni nani o okurou ka. Fukuro no pan wa mohaya, nakunari, kami no hito ni motte iku okurimono ga nai. Nani ka arimasu ka".
Shimobe wa, mata Sauru ni kotaeta, "Watashi no te ni yonbun no ichi shikeru no gin ga arimasu. Watashi wa kore o, kami no hito ni ataete, wareware no michi o shimeshite moraimashou".
- - mukashi Isuraeru de wa, kami ni tou tame ni iku toki ni wa, kou itta, "Saa, wareware wa senkensha no tokoro e ikou". Ima no yogensha wa, mukashi wa senkensha to iwarete ita no de aru. - -
Sauru wa sono shimobe ni itta, "Sore wa yoi. Saa, ikou". Kou shite karera wa, kami no hito no iru sono machi e itta.
Karera wa machi e iku saka o nobotte iru toki, mizu o kumu tame ni dete kuru otometachi ni deatta no de, karera ni itta, "Senkensha wa koko ni oraremasu ka".
Otometachi wa kotaeta, "Oraremasu. Goran nasai, kono saki desu. Isoide iki nasai. Tami ga kyou takaki tokoro de gisei o sasageru no de, tatta ima, machi ni korareta tokoro desu.
Anata gata wa, machi ni hairuto sugu, ano kata ga takaki tokoro ni nobotte shokuji sareru mae ni aerudeshou. Tami wa sono kata ga korareru made wa shokuji o shimasen. Ano kata ga gisei o shukufuku sarete kara, manekareta hitobito ga shokuji o suru no desu. Saa, nobotte iki nasai. Sugu ni aerudeshou".
Kou shite karera wa machi ni nobotte itta. Soshite machi no naka ni, hairou to shita toki, Samueru wa takaki tokoro ni noboru tame karera no hou ni mukatte dete kita.
Sate Sauru ga kuru ichi nichi mae ni, Shu wa Samueru no mimi ni tsugete iwareta,
"Asu no imagoro, anata no tokoro ni, Beniyamin no chi kara, hitori no hito o tsukawasude arou. Anata wa sono hito ni abura o sosoide, watashi no tami Isuraeru no kimi to shi nasai. Kare wa watashi no tami o Perishite bito no te kara sukuidasude arou. Watashi no tami no sakebi ga watashi ni todoki, watashi ga sono nayami o kaerimirukara de aru".
Samueru ga Sauru o mita toki, Shu wa iwareta, "Miyo, watashi no itta no wa kono hito de aru. Kono hito ga watashi no tami o osamerude arou".
Sono toki Sauru wa, mon no naka de Samueru ni chikazuite itta, "Senkensha no ie wa doko desu ka. Dou ka oshiete kudasai".
Samueru wa Sauru ni kotaeta, "Watashi ga sono senkensha desu. Watashi no mae ni itte, takaki tokoro ni nobori nasai. Anata gata wa, kyou, watashi to issho ni shokuji shi nasai. Watashi wa asu no asa anata o kaerase, anata no kokoro ni aru koto o mina shimeshimashou.
Mikka mae ni, inaku natta anata no roba wa, mohaya mitsukatta no de kokoro ni kakenakute mo yoroshii. Shikashi Isuraeru no subete no nozomashi kimono wa dare no mono desu ka. Sore wa anata no mono, anata no chichi no ie no subete no hito no mono de wa arimasen ka".
Sauru wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru no uchi no mottomo chiisai buzoku no Beniyamin bito de atte, watashi no ichizoku wa mata Beniyamin no dono ichizoku yori mo iyashii mono de wa arimasen ka. Dou shite anata wa, sono you na koto o watashi ni iwareru no desu ka".
Samueru wa Sauru to sono shimobe o michibiite, heya ni hairi, manekareta sanjuunin hodo no uchi no kamiza ni suwaraseta.
Soshite Samueru wa ryourinin ni itta, "Anata ni watashite, torinokete oku you ni to itte oita bun o motte ki nasai".
Ryourinin wa, momo to sono ue no bubun o toriagete, sore o Sauru no mae ni oita. Soshite Samueru wa itta, "Goran nasai. Totte oita mono ga, anata no mae ni okarete imasu. Meshiagatte kudasai. Anata ga kyakujintachi to issho ni shokuji ga dekiru you ni, kono toki made, anata no tame ni totte oita mono desu". Kou shite Sauru wa sono hi Samueru to issho ni shokuji o shita.
Soshite karera ga takaki tokoro o kudatte machi ni haitta toki, Sauru no tame ni okujou ni toko ga moukerare, kare wa sono ue ni mi o yokotaete neta.
Soshite yoake ni natte, Samueru wa okujou no Sauru ni yobawatte itta, "Oki nasai. Anata o ookuri shimasu". Sauru wa okiagatta. Soshite Sauru to Samueru no futari wa, tomo ni soto ni deta.
Karera ga machihazure ni kudatta toki, Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Anata no shimobe ni saki ni iku you ni ii nasai. Shimobe ga saki ni ittara, anata wa, shibaraku koko ni tachi todomatte kudasai. Kami no kotoba o shirasemashou".
Sono toki Samueru wa abura no bin o totte, Sauru no atama ni sosogi, kare ni kuchizuke shite itta, "Shu wa anata ni abura o sosoide, sono tami Isuraeru no kimi to saretade wa arimasen ka. Anata wa Shu no tami o osame, shuui no teki no te kara karera o sukuwanakereba naranai. Shu ga anata ni abura o sosoide, sono shigyou no kimi to sareta koto no, shirushi wa tsugi no toori desu.
Anata ga kyou, watashi o hanarete, satte iku toki, Beniyamin no ryouchi no Zeruza ni aru Rakeru no haka no katawara de, futari no hito ni audeshou. Soshite karera wa anata ni iimasu, 'Anata ga sagashi ni ikareta roba wa mitsukarimashita. Ima chichiue wa, roba yori mo anata gata no koto o shinpai shite, "Waga ko no koto wa, dou shiyou" to itte oraremasu'.
Anata ga, soko kara nao susunde, Taboru no kashi no ki no tokoro e ikuto, soko de Beteru ni nobotte kami o ogamou to suru sannin no mono ni audeshou. Hitori wa santou no koyagi o tsure, hitori wa mittsu no pan o tazusae, hitori wa, budoushu no haitta kawabukuro hitotsu o tazusaete iru.
Karera wa anata ni aisatsu shi, futatsu no pan o kurerudeshou. Anata wa sore o, sono te kara ukenakereba naranai.
Sono nochi, anata wa kami no Gibea e iku. Soko wa Perishite bito no shubi hei no iru tokoro de aru. Anata wa sono tokoro e itte, machi ni wa iru toki, tategoto, te tsuzumi, fue, koto o toru hitobito o saki ni ikasete, yogen shinagara takaki tokoro kara furite kuru ichigun no yogensha ni audeshou.
Sono toki, Shu no rei ga anata no ue ni mo hageshiku kudatte, anata wa karera to issho ni yogen shi, kawatte atarashii hito to narudeshou.
Korera no shirushi ga, anata no mi ni tattanaraba, anata wa teatari shidai ni nan de mo shi nasai. Kami ga anata to issho ni orarerukara desu.
Anata wa watashi ni sakidatte Girugaru ni kudaranakereba naranai. Watashi wa anata no moto ni kudatte itte, hansai o sonae, shuuonsai o sasagerudeshou. Watashi ga anata no moto ni itte, anata no shinakereba naranai koto o anata ni shimesu made, nanuka no aida matanakereba naranai".
Sauru ga se o kaeshite Samueru o hanareta toki, kami wa kare ni atarashii kokoro o ataerareta. Korera no shirushi wa mina sono hi ni tatta.
Karera wa Gibea ni kita toki, yogensha no ichigun ni deatta. Soshite kami no rei ga, hageshiku Sauru no ue ni kudari, kare wa karera no uchi ni ite yogen shita.
Moto kara Sauru o shitte ita hitobito wa mina, Sauru ga yogensha tachi to tomo ni yogen suru no o mite tagai ni itta, "Kishi no ko ni nanigoto ga tatta no ka. Sauru mo mata yogensha tachi no uchi ni iru no ka".
Sono tokoro no hitori no mono ga kotaeta, "Karera no chichi wa dare na no ka". Sore de "Sauru mo mata yogensha tachi no uchi ni iru no ka" to iu no ga, kotowaza to natta.
Sauru wa yogen suru koto o oete, takaki tokoro e itta.
Sauru no oji ga, Sauru to sono shimobe to ni itta, "Anata gata wa, doko e itta no ka". Sauru wa itta, "Roba o sagashi ni itta no desuga, doko ni mo inai no de, Samueru no moto ni ikimashita".
Sauru no oji wa itta, "Samueru ga, donna koto o itta ka, douzo hanashite kudasai".
Sauru wa oji ni itta, "Roba ga mitsukatta to, hakkiri, watashitachi ni iimashita". Shikashi Samueru ga itta oukoku no koto ni tsuite, oji ni wa nani mo tsugenakatta.
Sate, Samueru wa tami o Mizupa de Shu no mae ni atsume,
Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa Isuraeru o Ejiputo kara michibikidashi, anatagata o Ejiputo bito no te, oyobi subete anatagata o shi etageru oukoku no te kara sukuidashita'.
Shikashi anata gata wa, kyou, anatagata o sono nayami to kurushimi no naka kara sukuwareru anata gata no kami o sute, sono ue, 'Iie, wareware no ue ni ou o tateyo' to iu. Sore yue ima, anata gata wa, buzoku ni shitagai, mata shizoku ni shitagatte, Shu no mae ni de nasai".
Kou shite Samueru ga Isuraeru no subete no buzoku o yobiyoseta toki, Beniyamin no buzoku ga, kuji ni atatta.
Mata Beniyamin no buzoku o sono shizoku ni shitagatte yobiyoseta toki, Materi no shizoku ga, kuji ni atari, Materi no shizoku o hitogoto ni yobiyoseta toki, Kishi no ko Sauru ga, kuji ni atatta. Shikashi hitobito ga kare o sagashita toki, mitsukaranakatta.
Soko de mata Shu ni "Sono hito wa koko ni kite iru no desu ka" to touto, Shu wa iwareta, "Kare wa nimotsu no aida ni kakurete iru".
Hitobito wa hashitte itte, kare o soko kara tsurete kita. Kare wa tami no naka ni tattaga, kata kara ue wa, tami no dono hito yori mo takakatta.
Samueru wa subete no tami ni itta, "Shu ga erabareta hito o goran nasai. Tami no uchi ni kare no you na hito wa naide wa arimasen ka". Tami wa mina "Ou banzai" to sakenda.
Sono toki Samueru wa oukoku no narawashi o tami ni katari, sore o sho ni shirushite, Shu no mae ni osameta. Kou shite Samueru wa subete no tami o sorezore ie ni kaeraseta.
Sauru mo mata Gibea ni aru kare no ie ni kaetta. Soshite kami ni sono kokoro o ugokasareta yuushitachi mo kare to tomo ni itta.
Shikashi, yokoshima na hitobito wa "Kono otoko ga dou shite wareware o sukuu koto ga dekiyou" to itte, kare o karonji, okurimono o shinakatta. Shikashi Sauru wa damatte ita.
Anmon bito Nahashi wa nobotte kite, yabeshi gireade o semekakonda. Yabeshi no hitobito wa Nahashi ni itta, "Wareware to keiyaku o musubi nasai. Sou sureba wareware wa anata ni tsukaemasu".
Shikashi Anmon bito Nahashi wa karera ni itta, "Tsugi no jouken de anata gata to keiyaku o musubou. Sunawachi, watashi ga, anata gata subete no migi no me o eguritotte, zenIsuraeru o hazukashimeru to iu koto da".
Yabeshi no chouroutachi wa kare ni itta, "Wareware ni nanuka no yuuyo o atae, Isuraeru no zenryoudo ni shisha o okuru koto o yurushite kudasai. Soshite moshi wareware o sukuu mono ga nai toki wa koufuku shimasu".
Kou shite shisha ga, Sauru no Gibea ni kite, kono koto o tami no mimi ni tsugeta no de, tami wa mina koe o agete naita.
Sono toki Sauru wa hatake kara ushi no ato ni tsuite kita. Soshite Sauru wa itta, "Tami ga naite iru no wa, dou shita no ka". Hitobito wa kare ni Yabeshi no hitobito no koto o tsugeta.
Sauru ga kono kotoba o kiita toki, kami no rei ga hageshiku kare no ue ni nozonda no de, kare no ikari wa hanahadashiku moeta.
Kare wa ichi kubiki no ushi o tori, sore o kirisaki, shisha no te ni yotte Isuraeru no zenryoudo ni okutte iwaseta, "Dare de atte mo Sauru to Samueru to ni shitagatte denai mono wa, sono ushi ga kono you ni sarerude arou". Tami wa Shu o osorete, hitori no you ni dete kita.
Sauru wa Bezeku de sore o kazoetaga, Isuraeru no hitobito wa sanjuu man, Yuda no hitobito wa san man de atta.
Soshite hitobito wa, kita shishatachi ni itta, "Yabeshi gireade no hito ni kou ii nasai, 'Asu, hi no atsuku naru koro, anata gata wa sukui o erude arou' to". Shisha ga kaette, Yabeshi no hitobito ni tsugeta no de, karera wa yorokonda.
Soko de Yabeshi no hitobito wa itta, "Asu, wareware wa koufuku shimasu. Nan de mo, anata gata ga yoi to omou koto o, wareware ni shite kudasai".
Akuruhi, Sauru wa tami o mittsu no butai ni wake, akatsuki ni teki no jin'ei ni semeiri, hi no atsuku naru koro made, Anmon bito o koroshita. Ikinokotta mono wa chirijiri ni natte, futari issho ni iru mono wa nakatta.
Sono toki, tami wa Samueru ni itta, "Saki ni, 'Sauru ga dou shite wareware o osameru koto ga dekiyou ka' to itta mono wa dare deshou ka. Sono hitobito o hikidashite kudasai. Wareware wa sono hitobito o koroshimasu".
Shikashi Sauru wa itta, "Shu wa kyou, Isuraeru ni sukui o hodokosareta no desukara, kyou wa hito o koroshite wa narimasen".
Soko de Samueru wa tami ni itta, "Saa, Girugaru e itte, asoko de oukoku o isshin shiyou".
Kou shite tami wa mina Girugaru e itte, sono tokoro de Shu no mae ni Sauru o ou to shi, shuuonsai o Shu no mae ni sasage, Sauru to Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina, sono tokoro de ooini iwatta.
Samueru wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni itta, "Miyo, watashi wa, anata gata no kotoba ni kikishitagatte, anata gata no ue ni ou o tateta.
Miyo ou wa ima, anata gata no mae ni ayumu. Watashi wa toshioite kami wa shiroku natta. Watashi no kora mo anata gata to tomo ni iru. Watashi wa wakai toki kara, kyou made, anata gata no mae ni ayunda.
Watashi wa koko ni iru. Shu no mae to, sono abura sosogareta mono no mae ni, watashi o uttae yo. Watashi ga, dare no ushi o totta ka. Dare no roba o totta ka. Dare o azamuita ka. Dare o shi etageta ka. Dare no te kara, mainai o totte, jibun no me o kuramashita ka. Moshi sono you na koto ga areba, watashi wa sore o, anata gata ni tsugunaou".
Karera wa itta, "Anata wa, wareware o azamuita koto mo, shi etageta koto mo arimasen. Mata hito no te kara nani mo totta koto wa arimasen".
Samueru wa karera ni itta, "Anata ga taga, watashi no te no uchi ni, nan no fusei o mo miidasanai koto o, Shu wa anata gata ni akashi sareru. Sono abura sosogareta mono mo, kyou sore o akashi suru". Karera wa itta, "Akashi saremasu".
Samueru wa tami ni itta, "Moose to Aron o tatete, anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidasareta Shu ga shounin desu.
Sore yue, anata gata wa ima, tachi nasai. Watashi wa Shu ga, anata gata to anata gata no senzo no tame ni okonawareta subete no sukui no waza ni tsuite, Shu no mae ni, anata gata to ronjiyou.
Yakobu ga Ejiputo ni itte, Ejiputo bito ga, karera o, shi etageta toki, anata gata no senzo wa Shu ni yobawatta no de, Shu wa Moose to Aron o tsukawasareta. Soko de karera wa, anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo kara michibikidashite, kono tokoro ni sumawaseta.
Shikashi, karera ga sono kami, Shu o wasureta no de, Shu wa karera o Hazoru no ouYabin no gun no chouShisera no te ni watashi, mata Perishite bito no te to Moabu no ou no te ni watasareta. Soko de karera ga Isuraeru o semeta no de,
Tami wa Shu ni yobawatte itta, 'Wareware wa Shu o sute, Baaru to Ashitarote ni tsukaete, tsumi o okashimashita. Ima, wareware o teki no te kara sukuidashite kudasai. Wareware wa anata ni tsukaemasu'.
Shu wa Erubaaru to Baraku to Efuta to Samueru o tsukawashite, anatagata o shuui no teki no te kara sukuidasareta no de, anata gata wa yasuraka ni sumu koto ga dekita.
Tokoro ga, Anmon bito no ou Nahashi ga semete kuru no o mita toki, anata gata no kami, Shu ga anata gata no ou de aru no ni, anata gata wa watashi ni, 'Iie, wareware o osameru ou ga nakereba naranai' to itta.
Sore yue, ima anata gata no eranda ou, anata gata ga motometa ou o mi nasai. Shu wa anata gata no ue ni ou o taterareta.
Moshi, anata gata ga Shu o osore, Shu ni tsukaete, sono koe ni kikishitagai, Shu no imashime ni somukazu, anata gata mo, anatagata o osameru ou mo tomo ni, anata gata no kami, Shu ni shitagaunaraba, sore de yoi.
Shikashi, moshi anata gata ga Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, Shu no imashime ni somukunaraba, Shu no te wa, anata gata to anata gata no ou o semerude arou.
Sore yue, ima, anata gata wa tatte, Shu ga, anata gata no me no mae de okonawareru, kono ooinaru koto o mi nasai.
Kyou wa komugikari no toki de wa nai ka. Watashi wa Shu ni yobawarude arou. Sono toki Shu wa kaminari to ame o kudashite, anata gata ga ou o motomete, Shu no mae ni okashita tsumi no ooinaru koto o misase, mata shiraserarerude arou".
Soshite Samueru ga Shu ni yobawatta no de, Shu wa sono hi, kaminari to ame o kudasareta. Tami wa mina hijou ni Shu to Samueru to o osoreta.
Tami wa mina Samueru ni itta, "Shimobera no tame ni, anata no kami, Shu ni inotte, wareware no shinanai you ni shite kudasai. Wareware wa, moromoro no tsumi o okashita ue ni, mata ou o motomete, aku o kuwaemashita".
Samueru wa tami ni itta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Anata gata wa, kono subete no aku o okonatta. Shikashi Shu ni shitagau koto o yamezu, kokoro o tsukushite Shu ni tsukae nasai.
Munashii mono ni mayotte itte wa naranai. Sore wa, anatagata o tasukeru koto mo sukuu koto mo dekinai munashii mono dakara de aru.
Shu wa, sono ooinaru na no yue ni, sono tami o suterarenaide arou. Shu ga, anatagata o jibun no tami to suru koto o yoshi to sarerukara de aru.
Mata, watashi wa, anata gata no tame ni inoru koto o yamete Shu ni tsumi o okasu koto wa, kesshite shinaide arou. Watashi wa mata yoi, tadashii michi o, anata gata ni oshierude arou.
Anata gata wa, tada Shu o osore, kokoro o tsukushite, seijitsu ni Shu ni tsukaenakereba naranai. Soshite Shu ga donna ni ookii koto o anata gata no tame ni sareta ka o kangaenakereba naranai.
Shikashi, anata ga taga, nao mo aku o okonaunaraba, anata gata mo, anata gata no ou mo, tomo ni horobosarerude arou".
Sauru wa sanjuusai de ou no kurai ni tsuki, ni nen Isuraeru o osameta.
Sate Sauru wa Isuraeru bi to sanzen o eranda. Nisen wa Sauru to tomo ni Mikumashi, oyobi Beteru no sanchi ni ori, issen wa Yonatan to tomo ni Beniyamin no Gibea ni ita. Sauru wa sono ta no tami o, onoono, sono tenmaku ni kaeraseta.
Yonatan wa, Geba ni aru Perishite bito no shubi hei o yabutta. Perishite bi to wa sono koto o kiita. Soko de, Sauru wa kunijyuu ni, amaneku tsunobue o fukinarashite iwaseta, "Heburu bito yo, kike".
Isuraeru no hito wa mina, Sauru ga Perishite bito no shubi hei o yabutta koto, soshite Isuraeru ga Perishite bito ni nikumareru you ni natta koto o kiita. Kou shite tami wa mesarete, Girugaru no Sauru no moto ni atsumatta.
Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru to tatakau tame ni atsumatta. Sensha sanzen, kihei rokusen, tami wa hamabe no suna no you ni ookatta. Karera wa nobotte kite, Beteaben no higashi no Mikumashi ni jin o hatta.
Isuraeru bi to wa, hidoku appaku sare, mikata ga ayauku natta no o mite, horaana ni, tateana ni, iwa ni, haka ni, tameike ni mi o kakushita.
Mata, aru Heburu bi to wa Yorudan o watatte, Gado to Gireade no chi e itta. Shikashi Sauru wa nao Girugaru ni ite, tami wa mina, furuenagara kare ni shitagatta.
Sauru wa, Samueru ga sadameta you ni, nanuka no aida mattaga, Samueru ga Girugaru ni konakatta no de, tami wa kare o hanarete chitte itta.
Soko de Sauru wa itta, "Hansai to shuuonsai o watashi no tokoro ni motte ki nasai". Kou shite kare wa hansai o sasageta.
Sono hansai o sasage owaruto, Samueru ga kita. Sauru wa aisatsu o shiyou to, kare o mukae ni deta.
Sono toki Samueru wa itta, "Anata wa nani o shita no desu ka". Sauru wa itta, "Tami wa watashi o hanarete chitte iki, anata wa sadamatta hi no uchi ni korarenai no ni, Perishite bito ga Mikumashi ni atsumatta no o mita no de,
Watashi wa, Perishite bito ga ima ni mo, Girugaru ni kudatte kite, watashi o osou ka mo shirenai no ni, watashi wa mada Shu no megumi o motomeru koto o shite inai to omoi, yamu o ezu hansai o sasagemashita".
Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Anata wa oroka na koto o shita. Anata wa, anata no kami, Shu no meijirareta meirei o mamoranakatta. Moshi mamottanaraba, Shu wa ima anata no oukoku o nagaku Isuraeru no ue ni kakuho saretade arou.
Shikashi ima wa, anata no oukoku wa tsuzukanaide arou. Shu wa jibun no kokoro ni kanau hito o motomete, sono hito ni tami no kimi to naru koto o meijirareta. Anata ga Shu no meijirareta koto o mamoranakattakara de aru".
Kou shite Samueru wa tatte, Girugaru kara Beniyamin no Gibea ni nobotte itta. Sauru wa tomo ni iru tami o kazoete mitaga, ooyoso roppyakunin atta.
Sauru to sono ko Yonatan, narabi ni, tomo ni iru tami wa, Beniyamin no Geba ni ori, Perishite bi to wa Mikumashi ni jin o hatte ita.
Soshite Perishite bito no jin kara mittsu no butai ni wakareta ryakudatsutai ga dete kite, ichi butai wa Ofura no hou ni mukatte, Shuaru no chi ni iki,
Ichi butai wa Betehoron no hou ni mukai, ichi butai wa arano no hou no Zeboimu no tani o miorosu sakai no hou ni mukatta.
Sono koro, Isuraeru no chi ni wa doko ni mo tekkou ga inakatta. Perishite bito ga "Heburu bi to wa tsurugi mo, yari mo tsukutte wa naranai" to ittakara de aru.
Tadashi Isuraeru no hito wa mina, sono sukiza ki, kuwa, ono, kama ni ha o tsukeru toki wa, Perishite bito no tokoro e kudatte itta.
Sukiza kito, kuwa no tame no ryoukin wa ichi Pimu de ari, ono ni ha o tsukeru no to, toge no aru muchi o naosu no wa sanbun no ichi shikeru de atta.
Sore de kono tatakai no hi ni wa, Sauru oyobi Yonatan to tomo ni ita tami no te ni wa, tsurugi mo yari mo naku, tada Sauru to sono ko Yonatan to ga sore o motte ita.
Perishite bito no senjin wa Mikumashi no watari ni susumideta.
Aru hi, Sauru no ko Yonatan wa, sono buki o toru wakamono ni "Saa, wareware wa mukougawa no, Perishite bito no senjin e watatte ikou" to itta. Shikashi Yonatan wa chichi ni wa tsugenakatta.
Sauru wa Gibea no hazure de, Miguron ni aru, zakuro no ki no shita ni todomatte itaga, tomo ni ita tami wa ooyoso roppyakunin de atta.
Mata Ahiya wa Epode o mi ni tsukete tomo ni ita. Ahiya wa Ahitobu no ko, Ahitobu wa Ikabode no kyoudai, Ikabode wa Pinehasu no ko, Pinehasu wa Shiro ni oite Shu no saishi de atta Eri no ko de aru. Tami wa Yonatan ga dekakeru koto o shiranakatta.
Yonatan ga Perishite bito no senjin ni watatte ikou to suru watari ni wa, ippou ni kewashii iwa ga ari, tahou ni mo kewashii iwa ga ari, ippou no na o Bozezu to ii, tahou no na o Sene to itta.
Iwa no hitotsu wa Mikumashi no mae ni atte kita ni ari, hitotsu wa Geba no mae ni atte minami ni atta.
Yonatan wa sono buki o toru wakamono ni itta, "Saa, wareware wa, kono katsurei naki monodomo no senjin e watatte ikou. Shu ga wareware no tame ni nani ka okonawarerude arou. Ooku no hito o motte sukuu no mo, sukunai hito o motte sukuu no mo, Shu ni totte wa, nan no samatage mo naikara de aru".
Buki o toru mono wa kare ni itta, "Anata no nozomi doori ni shi nasai. Watashi wa issho ni imasu. Watashi wa anata to onaji kokoro desu".
Yonatan wa mata itta, "Wareware wa, ano hitobito no tokoro ni watatte itte, karera ni mi o arawasou.
Soshite, moshi karera ga wareware ni, 'Kochira kara iku made mate' to iunaraba, wareware wa sono ba ni todomari, karera no tokoro ni nobotte ikanaide arou.
Shikashi, moshi karera ga 'Wareware no tokoro e nobotte koi' to iunaraba, wareware wa nobotte ikou. Shu ga karera o wareware no te ni watasarerukara de aru. Kore o motte shirushi to shiyou".
Kou shite futari wa Perishite bito no senjin ni, sono mi o arawashita no de, Perishite bi to wa itta, "Miyo, Heburu bito ga, kakurete ita ana kara dete kuru".
Senjin no hitobito wa Yonatan to, sono buki o toru mono ni sakende itta, "Wareware no tokoro ni nobotte koi. Me ni, mono misete kureyou". Yonatan wa, sono buki o toru mono ni itta, "Watashi no ato ni tsuite nobotte ki nasai. Shu wa karera o Isuraeru no te ni watasareta no da".
Soshite Yonatan wa yojinobori, buki o toru mono mo sono ato ni tsuite nobotta. Perishite bi to wa Yonatan no mae ni taoreta. Buki o toru mono mo, ato ni tsuite itte Perishite bito o koroshita.
Yonatan to sono buki o toru mono to ga, tehajime ni koroshita mono wa, ooyoso nijuunin de atte, kono koto wa ichi kubiki no ushi no tagayasu hatake no ooyoso hanbun no uchi de okonawareta.
Soshite jin'ei ni iru mono, no ni iru mono, oyobi subete no tami wa kyoufu ni osoware, senjin no mono, oyobi ryakudatsutai made mo, osoreononoita. Mata chi wa furui ugoki, hijou ni ookina kyoufu to natta.
Beniyamin no Gibea ni ita Sauru no banpeitachi ga miruto, Perishite bito no gunshuu wa kuzurete uousaou shite ita.
Sono toki Sauru wa, tomo ni iru tami ni itta, "Ninzuu o shirabete, wareware no uchi no dare ga dete itta ka o miyo". Ninzuu o shirabeta tokoro, Yonatan to sono buki o toru mono to ga soko ni inakatta.
Sauru wa Ahiya ni itta, "Epode o koko ni motte ki nasai". Sono toki, Ahiya wa Isuraeru no hitobito no mae de Epode o mi ni tsukete itakara de aru.
Sauru ga saishi ni katatte iru aida ni mo, Perishite bito no jin'ei no sawagi wa masumasu ookiku natta no de, Sauru wa saishi ni itta, "Te o hiki nasai".
Kou shite Sauru oyobi tomo ni iru tami wa mina, atsumatte tatakai ni deta. Perishite bi to wa tsurugi o motte doushi uchi shita no de, hijou ni ookina konran to natta.
Mata saki ni Perishite bito to tomo ni ite, karera to tomo ni jin'ei ni kite ita Heburu bitotachi mo, hirugaette Sauru oyobi Yonatan to tomo ni iru Isuraeru bito ni tsuku you ni natta.
Mata Efuraimu no sanchi ni mi o kakushite ita Isuraeru bitotachi mo mina, Perishite bito ga nigeru to kiite, karera mo mata tatakai ni dete, sore o tsuigeki shita.
Kou shite Shu wa sono hi Isuraeru o sukuwareta. Soshite tatakai wa Beteaben ni utsutta.
Shikashi sono hi Isuraeru no hitobito wa kurushinda. Kore wa Sauru ga tami ni chikawasete "Yuugata made, watashi ga teki ni ada o kaesu made, shokumotsu o taberu mono wa, norowareru" to ittakara de aru. Sore yuetami no uchi ni wa, hitori mo shokumotsu o kuchi ni shita mono wa nakatta.
Tokoro de, tami ga mina mori no naka ni hairuto, chi no omote ni mitsu ga atta.
Tami wa mori ni haitta toki, mitsu no shitatatte iru no o mita. Shikashi dare mo sore o te ni totte kuchi ni tsukeru mono ga nakatta. Tami ga chikai o osoretakara de aru.
Shikashi Yonatan wa, chichi ga tami ni chikawaseta koto o kikanakatta no de, te o nobete tsue no saki o mitsu bachi no su ni hitashi, te ni totte kuchi ni tsuketa. Suruto kare wa me ga hakkiri shita.
Sono toki, tami no hitori ga itta, "Anata no chichi wa, kataku tami ni chikawasete 'Kyou, shokumotsu o taberu mono wa, norowareru' to iwaremashita. Sore de tami wa tsukarete iru no desu".
Yonatan wa itta, "Chichi wa kuni o nayamasemashita. Goran nasai. Kono mitsu o sukoshi nameta bakari de, watashi no me ga konna ni, hakkiri shita de wa arimasen ka.
Mashite, tami ga kyou teki kara bundotta mono o, juubun tabete itanaraba, sarani ooku no Perishite bito o koroshite itadeshou ni".
Sono hi Isuraeru bi to wa, Perishite bito o utte, Mikumashi kara Ayaron ni oyonda. Soshite tami wa, hijou ni tsukareta no de,
Bundori mono ni, hase kakatte, hitsuji, ushi, koushi o totte, sore o chi no ue ni koroshi, chi no mama de sore o tabeta.
Hitobito wa Sauru ni itta, "Tami wa chi no mama de tabete, Shu ni tsumi o okashite imasu". Sauru wa itta, "Anata gata wa somuite iru. Kono tokoro e, watashi no moto ni ookina ishi o korogashite ki nasai".
Sauru wa mata itta, "Anata gata wa wakarete, tami no naka ni haitte, karera ni ii nasai, 'Onoono ushi mata wa, hitsuji o hiite kite koko de hofutte tabe nasai. Chi no mama de tabete, Shu ni tsumi o okashite wa naranai' ". Soko de tami wa mina, sono yoru, onoono ushi o hiite kite, sore o, sono tokoro de hofutta.
Kou shite Sauru wa Shu ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuita. Kore wa Sauru ga Shu no tame ni kizuita saisho no saidan de aru.
Sauru wa itta, "Wareware wa yoru no uchi ni Perishite bito o otte kudari, yoake made karera o kasumete, hitori mo nokoranu you ni shiyou". Hitobito wa itta, "Yoi to omowareru koto o, nan de mo shite kudasai". Shikashi saishi wa itta, "Wareware wa, koko de, kami ni tazunemashou".
Soko de Sauru wa kami ni ukagatta, "Watashi wa Perishite bito o otte kudarubekideshou ka. Anata wa karera o Isuraeru no te ni watasarerudeshou ka". Shikashi kami wa sono hi wa kotaerarenakatta.
Soko de Sauru wa itta, "Tami no choutachi yo, mina kono tokoro ni chikayori nasai. Anata gata wa, yoku mikiwamete, kyou no kono tsumi ga okita wake o shiranakereba naranai.
Isuraeru o sukuu Shu wa ikite orareru. Tatoi, sore ga watashi no ko Yonatan de atte mo, kanarazu shinanakereba naranai". Shikashi tami no uchi ni wa hitori mo, kore ni kotaeru mono ga inakatta.
Sauru wa Isuraeru no subete no hito ni itta, "Anata gata wa mukougawa ni i nasai. Watashi to watashi no ko Yonatan wa kochiragawa ni imashou". Tami wa Sauru ni itta, "Yoi to omowareru koto o shite kudasai".
Soko de Sauru wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata wa kyou, naniyue shimobe ni kotaerarenakatta no desu ka. Moshi kono tsumi ga watashi ni aru ka, mata wa watashi no ko Yonatan ni aru no deshitara, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, Urimu o oatae kudasai. Shikashi, moshi kono tsumi ga, anata no tami Isuraeru ni aru no deshitara tonmimu o oatae kudasai". Kou shite Yonatan to Sauru to ga, kuji ni atari, tami wa nogareta.
Sauru wa itta, "Watashi ka, watashi no ko Yonatan ka o kimeru tame ni, kuji o hiki nasai". Kuji wa Yonatan ni atatta.
Sauru wa Yonatan ni itta, "Anata ga shita koto o, watashi ni ii nasai". Yonatan wa itta, "Watashi wa tashika ni te ni atta tsue no saki ni sukoshi bakari no mitsu o tsukete, namemashita. Watashi wa koko ni imasu. Shi wa kakugo shite imasu".
Sauru wa itta, "Kami ga watashi o ikue ni mo basshite kudasaru you ni. Yonatan yo, anata wa kanarazu shinanakereba naranai".
Sono toki, tami wa Sauru ni itta, "Isuraeru no uchi ni kono ooinaru shouri o motarashita Yonatan ga shinanakereba naranai no desu ka. Kesshite sou de wa arimasen. Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Yonatan no kaminoke hitosuji mo chi ni otoshite wa narimasen. Kare wa kami to tomo ni kyou hataraita no desu". Kou shite tami wa Yonatan o sukutta no de kare wa shi o manukareta.
Sauru wa Perishite bito o ou koto o yamete hikiage, Perishite bi to wa sono kuni e kaetta.
Sauru wa Isuraeru no ou to natte, shuui no moromoro no teki, sunawachi Moabu, Anmon no hitobito, Edomu, Zoba no outachi oyobi Perishite bito to tatakai, subete mukau tokoro de shouri o eta.
Sauru wa isamashiku hataraki, Amareku bito o utte, Isuraeru bito o ryakudatsusha no te kara sukuidashita.
Sate, Sauru no musukotachi wa Yonatan, Esui, oyobi Marukishua de aru. Futari no musume no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi ane no na wa Merabu, imouto no na wa Mikaru de aru.
Sauru no tsuma no na wa Ahinoamu to ii, Ahimaazu no musume de aru. Mata gun no chou no na wa Abuneru to ii, Sauru no oji Neru no ko de aru.
Sauru no chichi Kishi to Abuneru no chichi Neru to wa, Abieru no ko de aru.
Sauru no isshou no aida, Perishite bito to hageshii tatakai ga atta. Sauru wa chikara no tsuyoi hito ya yuuki no aru hito o mirugoto ni, sore o meshikakaeta.
Sate, Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Shu wa, watashi o tsukawashi, anata ni abura o sosoide, sono tami Isuraeru no ou to saremashita. Sore yue, ima, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa, Amareku ga Isuraeru ni shita koto, sunawachi Isuraeru ga Ejiputo kara nobotte kita toki, sono tochuu de tekitai shita koto ni tsuite karera o bassurude arou.
Ima, itte Amareku o uchi, sono subete no mochimono o horoboshi tsukuse. Karera o yurusu na. Otoko mo onna mo, osanako mo chinomi go mo, ushi mo hitsuji mo, rakuda mo, roba mo mina, korose' ".
Sauru wa tami o yobiatsume, Teraimu de ninzuu o shirabeta tokoro, hohei wa nijuu man, Yuda no hito wa ichi man de atta.
Soshite Sauru wa Amareku no machi e itte, tani ni hei o fuseta.
Sauru wa Keni bi to ni itta, "Saa, anata gata wa Amareku bito o hanarete, kudatte itte kudasai. Karera to issho ni anatagata o horobosu you na koto ga atte wa naranai. Anata gata wa, Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo kara nobotte kita toki, shinsetsu ni shite kureta no desukara". Soko de Keni bi to wa Amareku bito o hanarete itta.
Sauru wa Amareku bito o utte, Habira kara Ejiputo no higashi ni aru Shuru ni made oyonda.
Soshite Amareku bito no ou Agagu o ikedori, tsurugi o motte sono tami o kotogotoku horoboshita.
Shikashi Sauru to tami wa Agagu o yurushi, mata hitsuji to ushi no mottomo yoi mono, koeta mono narabi ni kohitsuji to, subete no yoi mono o nokoshi, sorera o horoboshi tsukusu koto o konomazu, tada neuchi no nai, tsumaranai mono o horoboshi tsukushita.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Samueru ni nozonda,
"Watashi wa Sauru o ou to shita koto o kuiru. Kare ga somuite, watashi ni shitagawazu, watashi no kotoba o okonawanakattakara de aru". Samueru wa ikatte, yodooshi, Shu ni yobawatta.
Soshite asa Sauru ni au tame, hayaku okitaga, Samueru ni tsugeru hito ga atta, "Sauru wa Karumeru ni kite, jibun no tame ni senshou kinenhi o tate, mi o kaeshite susumi, Girugaru e kudatte ikimashita".
Samueru ga Sauru no moto e kuruto, Sauru wa kare ni itta, "Douzo, Shu ga anata o shukufuku saremasu you ni. Watashi wa Shu no kotoba o jikkou shimashita".
Samueru wa itta, "Sore naraba, watashi no mimi ni hairu, kono hitsuji no koe to, watashi no kiku ushi no koe wa, ittai, nan desu ka".
Sauru wa itta, "Hitobito ga Amareku bito no tokoro kara hiite kita no desu. Tami wa, anata no kami, Shu ni sasageru tame ni, hitsuji to ushi no mottomo yoi mono o nokoshita no desu. Sono hoka wa, wareware ga horoboshi tsukushimashita".
Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Oyame nasai. Sakuya, Shu ga watashi ni iwareta koto o, anata ni tsugemashou". Sauru wa kare ni itta, "Itte kudasai".
Samueru wa itta, "Tatoi, jibun de wa chiisai to omotte mo, anata wa Isuraeru no shobuzoku no chou de wa arimasen ka. Shu wa anata ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to sareta.
Soshite Shu wa anata ni shimei o sazuke, tsukawashite iwareta, 'Itte, tsumibito naru Amareku bito o horoboshi tsukuse. Karera o minagoroshi ni suru made tatakae'.
Sore de aru no ni, dou shite anata wa Shu no koe ni kikishitagawanaide, bundori mono ni tobikakari, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta no desu ka".
Sauru wa Samueru ni itta, "Watashi wa Shu no koe ni kikishitagai, Shu ga tsukawasareta shimei o obite iki, Amareku no ou Agagu o tsurete kite, Amareku bito o horoboshi tsukushimashita.
Shikashi tami wa horoboshi tsukusubeki mono no uchi mottomo yoi mono o, Girugaru de, anata no kami, Shu ni sasageru tame, bundori mono no uchi kara hitsuji to ushi o torimashita".
Samueru wa itta, "Shu wa sono mikotoba ni kikishitagau koto o yorokobareru you ni, hansai ya gisei o yorokobarerude arou ka. Miyo, shitagau koto wa gisei ni masari, kiku koto wa ohitsuji no shibou ni masaru.
Somuku koto wa uranai no tsumi ni hitoshiku, goujou wa guuzou reihai no tsumi ni hitoshiikara de aru. Anata ga Shu no kotoba o suteta no de, Shu mo mata anata o sutete, ou no kurai kara shirizokerareta".
Sauru wa Samueru ni itta, "Watashi wa Shu no meirei to anata no kotoba ni somuite tsumi o okashimashita. Tami o osorete, sono koe ni kikishitagattakara desu.
Douzo, ima watashi no tsumi o yurushi, watashi to issho ni kaette, Shu o ogamasete kudasai".
Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Anata to issho ni kaerimasen. Anata ga Shu no kotoba o suteta no de, Shu mo anata o sutete, Isuraeru no oui kara shirizokeraretakara desu".
Kou shite Samueru ga sarou to shite mi o kaeshita toki, Sauru ga Samueru no uwagi no suso o toraeta no de, sore wa saketa.
Samueru wa kare ni itta, "Shu wa kyou, anata kara Isuraeru no oukoku o saki, motto yoi anata no rinjin ni ataerareta.
Mata Isuraeru no eikou wa itsuwaru koto mo naku, kuiru koto mo nai. Kare wa hito de wa naikara kuiru koto wa nai".
Sauru wa itta, "Watashi wa tsumi o okashimashitaga, douzo, tami no chouroutachi, oyobi Isuraeru no mae de, watashi o tattobi, watashi to issho ni kaette, anata no kami, Shu o ogamasete kudasai".
Soko de Samueru wa Sauru no ato ni tsuite kaetta. Soshite Sauru wa Shu o oganda.
Toki ni Samueru wa itta, "Watashi no tokoro ni Amareku bito no ou Agagu o hiite ki nasai". Agagu wa ureshi sou ni Samueru no tokoro ni kita. Agagu wa "Shi no kurushimi wa kitto sugisatta no da" to omotta.
Samueru wa itta, "Anata no tsurugi wa ooku no onna ni kodomo o ushinawaseta. Sono you ni anata no haha mo onna no uchi de mottomo muzan ni kodomo o ushinau mono to narude arou". Samueru wa Girugaru de Shu no mae ni, Agagu o sundan shita.
Soshite Samueru wa Rama ni iki, Sauru wa kokyou no Gibea ni nobotte, sono ie ni kaetta.
Samueru wa shinu hi made, ni do to Sauru o minakatta. Shikashi Samueru wa Sauru no tame ni kanashinda. Mata Shu wa Sauru o Isuraeru no ou to shita koto o kuirareta.
Sate Shu wa Samueru ni iwareta, "Watashi ga sudeni Sauru o sutete, Isuraeru no oui kara shirizoketa no ni, anata wa itsu made kare no tame ni kanashimu no ka. Tsuno ni abura o mitashi, sore o motte iki nasai. Anata o Betsurehemu bi to Essai no moto ni tsukawashimasu. Watashi wa sono kotachi no uchi ni hitori no ou o sagashi etakara de aru".
Samueru wa itta, "Dou shite watashi wa iku koto ga dekimashou. Sauru ga sore o kikeba, watashi o korosudeshou". Shu wa iwareta, "Ichitou no koushi o hiite itte, 'Shu ni gisei o sasageru tame ni kimashita' to ii nasai.
Soshite Essai o gisei no basho ni yobi nasai. Sono toki watashi wa anata no suru koto o shimeshimasu. Watashi ga anata ni tsugeru hito ni abura o sosoganakereba naranai".
Samueru wa Shu ga meijirareta you ni shite, Betsurehemu e itta. Machi no chouroutachi wa, osorenagara dete, kare o mukae, "Odayaka na koto no tame ni korareta no desu ka" to itta.
Samueru wa itta, "Odayaka na koto no tame desu. Watashi wa Shu ni gisei o sasageru tame ni kimashita. Mi o kiyomete, gisei no basho ni watashi to tomo ni kite kudasai". Soshite Samueru wa Essai to sono kotachi o kiyomete gisei no ba ni maneita.
Karera ga kita toki, Samueru wa Eriabu o mite, "Jibun no mae ni iru kono hito koso, Shu ga abura o sosogareru hito da" to omotta.
Shikashi Shu wa Samueru ni iwareta, "Kaokatachi ya mi no take o mite wa naranai. Watashi wa sudeni sono hito o suteta. Watashi ga miru tokoro wa hito to wa kotonaru. Hito wa soto no kaokatachi o mi, Shu wa kokoro o miru".
Soko de Essai wa Abinadabu o yonde Samueru no mae o tooraseta. Samueru wa itta, "Shu ga erabareta no wa kono hito de mo nai".
Essai wa Shanma o toorasetaga, Samueru wa itta, "Shu ga erabareta no wa kono hito de mo nai".
Essai wa nananin no ko ni Samueru no mae o toorasetaga, Samueru wa Essai ni itta, "Shu ga erabareta no wa kono hitotachi de wa nai".
Samueru wa Essai ni itta, "Anata no musukotachi wa mina koko ni imasu ka". Kare wa itta, "Mada sue no ko ga nokotte imasuga hitsuji o katte imasu". Samueru wa Essai ni itta, "Hito o yatte kare o tsurete ki nasai. Kare ga koko ni kuru made, wareware wa shokutaku ni tsukimasen".
Soko de hito o yatte kare o tsurete kita. Kare wa kesshoku no yoi, me no kirei na, sugata no utsukushii hito de atta. Shu wa iwareta, "Tatte kore ni abura o sosoge. Kore ga sono hito de aru".
Samueru wa abura no tsuno o totte, sono kyoudaitachi no naka de, kare ni abura o sosoida. Kono hi kara nochi, Shu no rei wa, hageshiku Dabide no ue ni nozonda. Soshite Samueru wa tatte Rama e itta.
Sate Shu no rei wa Sauru o hanare, Shu kara kuru akurei ga kare o nayamashita.
Sauru no keraitachi wa kare ni itta, "Goran nasai. Kami kara kuru akurei ga anata o nayamashite iru no desu.
Douzo, wareware no shukun ga, anata no mae ni tsukaete iru keraitachi ni meijite, jouzu ni koto o hiku mono hitori o sagasasete kudasai. Kami kara kuru akurei ga anata ni nozomu toki, kare ga te de koto o hikunaraba, anata wa yoku nararerudeshou".
Soko de Sauru wa keraitachi ni itta, "Jouzu ni koto o hiku mono o sagashite, watashi no moto ni tsurete ki nasai".
Sono toki, hitori no wakamono ga kotaeta, "Watashi wa Betsurehemu bi to Essai no ko o mimashitaga, koto ga jouzu de, yuuki mo ari, iku sabi to de, benzetsu ni hiide, sugata no utsukushii hito desu. Mata Shu ga kare to tomo ni oraremasu".
Soko de Sauru wa Essai no moto ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Hitsuji o katte iru anata no ko Dabide o watashi no moto ni yokoshi nasai".
Essai wa, roba ni pan o owase, kawabukuro ni ireta budoushu ichi fukuro to, yagi no ko to o totte, sono ko Dabide no te ni yotte Sauru ni okutta.
Dabide wa Sauru no moto ni kite, kare ni tsukaeta. Sauru wa hijou ni kore o aishite, sono buki o toru mono to shita.
Mata Sauru wa hito o tsukawashite Essai ni itta, "Dabide o watashi ni tsukaesasete kudasai. Kare wa watashi no kokoro ni kanaimashita".
Kami kara deru akurei ga Sauru ni nozomu toki, Dabide wa koto o tori, te de sore o hikuto, Sauru wa ki ga shizumari, yoku natte, akurei wa kare o hanareta.
Sate Perishite bi to wa, gun o atsumete tatakaou to shi, Yuda ni zokusuru Soko ni atsumatte, Soko to Azeka no aida ni aru epesu damimu ni jindotta.
Sauru to Isuraeru no hitobito wa atsumatte Era no tani ni jindori, Perishite bito ni taishite senretsu o shiita.
Perishite bi to wa mukou no yama no ue ni tachi, Isuraeru wa kochira no yama no ue ni tatta. Sono kan ni tani ga atta.
Toki ni, Perishite bito no jin kara, Gate no Goriate to iu na no, tatakai o idomu mono ga dete kita. Mi no take wa roku kyubito han.
Atama ni wa seidou no kabuto o itadaki, mi ni wa, uroko to ji no yoroi o kite ita. Sono yoroi wa seidou de omosa gosen shikeru.
Mata ashi ni wa seidou no sunetou o tsuke, kata ni wa seidou no nageyari o seotte ita.
Te ni motte iru yari no e wa, hata no makibou no you de ari, yari no ho no tetsu wa roppyaku shikeru de atta. Kare no mae ni wa, tate o toru mono ga susunda.
Goriate wa tatte Isuraeru no senretsu ni mukatte sakenda, "Naniyue senretsu o tsukutte dete kita no ka. Watashi wa Perishite bi to, omaetachi wa Sauru no kerai de wa nai ka. Omaetachi kara, hitori o erande, watashi no tokoro e kudatte kosaseyo.
Moshi sono hito ga tatakatte watashi o korosu koto ga dekitara, wareware wa omaetachi no kerai to naru. Shikashi watashi ga katte sono hito o koroshitara, omaetachi wa, wareware no kerai ni natte tsukaenakereba naranai".
Mata kono Perishite bi to wa itta, "Watashi wa, kyou Isuraeru no senretsu ni idomu. Hitori o dashite, watashi to tatakawaseyo".
Sauru to Isuraeru no subete no hito wa, Perishite bito no kono kotoba o kiite odoroki, hijou ni osoreta.
Sate, Dabide wa Yuda no Betsurehemu ni ita Efurata bi to Essai to iu na no hito no ko de, kono hito ni hachinin no ko ga attaga, Sauru no yo ni wa toshi ga susunde, sudeni toshioite ita.
Essai no kora no uchi, ue no sannin wa Sauru ni shitagatte sensou ni deta. Sono tatakai ni deta sannin no ko no na wa, choushi o Eriabu to ii, tsugi o Abinadabu to ii, daisan o Shanma to itta.
Dabide wa sue no ko de atte, ani sannin wa Sauru ni shitagatta.
Dabide wa Sauru no tokoro kara it tari ki tari shite, Betsurehemu de chichi no hitsuji o katte ita.
Ano Perishite bi to wa yonjuu nichi no aida, asayuu dete kite, karera no mae ni tatta.
Toki ni, Essai wa sono ko Dabide ni itta, "Anitachi no tame, kono iri mugi ichi Epa to, kono juuko no pan o totte, isoide jin'ei ni iru ani no tokoro e motte iki nasai.
Mata kono juu no kanraku o totte, sennin no chou ni motte iki, anitachi no anpi o mitodokete, sono shirushi o moratte ki nasai".
Sate Sauru to karera oyobi Isuraeru no subete no hito wa, Era no tani de Perishite bito to tatakatte ita.
Dabide wa asa hayaku okite, hitsuji o bannin ni takushi, Essai ga meijita you ni shokuryouhin o tazusaete itta. Kare ga jin'ei ni tsuita toki, gunzei wa, toki no koe o agete sensen ni deyou to shite ita.
Soshite Isuraeru to Perishite bito to wa senretsu o shiite, gun to gun to mukiatta.
Dabide wa nimotsu o oroshite, nimotsu o mamoru mono ni azuke, senretsu no hou e hashitte, anitachi no tokoro e iki, karera no anpi o tazuneta.
Anitachi to katatte iru toki, Perishite bito no senretsu kara, Gate no Perishite bito de, na o Goriate to iu, ano tatakai o idomu mono ga nobotte kite, mae to onaji kotoba o itta no de, Dabide wa sore o kiita.
Isuraeru no subete no hito wa, sono hito o mite, sakete nige, hijou ni osoreta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mata itta, "Anata gata wa, ano nobotte kita hito o mita ka. Tashika ni Isuraeru ni idomu tame ni nobotte kita no da. Kare o korosu hito wa, ou ga ooinaru tomi o ataete tomase, sono musume o atae, sono chichi no ie ni wa Isuraeru no uchi de zei o manukaresaserude arou".
Dabide wa katawara ni tatte iru hitobito ni itta, "Kono Perishite bito o koroshi, Isuraeru no haji o susugu hito ni wa, dou sareru no desu ka. Kono katsurei naki Perishite bi to wa nanimono na no de, ikeru kami no gun o idomu no ka".
Tami wa mae to onaji you ni, "Kare o korosu hito ni wa kou sarerude arou" to kotaeta.
Ue no ani Eriabu wa Dabide ga hitobito to kataru no o kiite, Dabide ni mukai ikari o hasshite itta, "Nan no tame ni kudatte kita no ka. No ni iru wazuka no hitsuji wa dare ni takushita no ka. Anata no wagamama to warui kokoro wa wakatte iru. Tatakai o miru tame ni kudatte kita no da".
Dabide wa itta, "Watashi ga ima, nani o shita to iu no desu ka. Tada hitokoto itta dake de wa arimasen ka".
Mata furimuite, hoka no hito ni mae no you ni katatta tokoro, tami wa mata onaji you ni kotaeta.
Hitobito wa Dabide no katatta kotoba o kiite, sore o Sauru ni tsugeta no de, Sauru wa kare o yobiyoseta.
Dabide wa Sauru ni itta, "Dare mo kare no yue ni ki o otoshite wa narimasen. Shimobe ga itte ano Perishite bito to tatakaimashou".
Sauru wa Dabide ni itta, "Itte, ano Perishite bito to tatakau koto wa dekinai. Anata wa nenshou daga, kare wa wakai toki kara no gunjin dakara desu".
Shikashi Dabide wa Sauru ni itta, "Shimobe wa chichi no hitsuji o katte ita no desuga, shishi, aruiha kuma ga kite, mure no kohitsuji o totta toki,
Watashi wa sono ato o otte, kore o uchi, kohitsuji o sono kuchi kara sukuidashimashita. Sono kemono ga watashi ni tobikakatte kita toki wa, hige o tsukamaete, sore o uchikoroshimashita.
Shimobe wa sudeni, shishi to, kuma o koroshimashita. Kono katsurei naki Perishite bito mo, ikeru kami no gun o idonda no desukara, ano kemono no ichitou no you ni narudeshou".
Dabide wa mata itta, "Shishi no tsume, kuma no tsume kara watashi o sukuidasareta Shu wa, mata watashi o, kono Perishite bito no te kara sukuidasarerudeshou". Sauru wa Dabide ni itta, "Iki nasai. Douzo Shu ga anata to tomo ni orareru you ni".
Soshite Sauru wa jibun no ikusa koromo o Dabide ni kise, seidou no kabuto o, sono atama ni kaburase, mata, uroko to ji no yoroi o mi ni matowaseta.
Dabide wa, ikusa koromo no ue ni, tsurugi o obite ikou to shitaga, dekinakatta. Sore ni narete inakattakara de aru. Soko de Dabide wa Sauru ni itta, "Watashi wa korera no mono o tsukete iku koto wa dekimasen. Narete inaikara desu".
Dabide wa sorera o nugisute, te ni tsue o tori, tanima kara nameraka na ishi goko o erabitotte jibun no motte iru hitsujikai no fukuro ni ire, te ni ishinage o totte, ano Perishite bito ni chikazuita.
Sono Perishite bi to wa susunde kite Dabide ni chikazuita. Sono tate o toru mono ga kare no mae ni ita.
Perishite bi to wa mimawashite Dabide o mi, kore o anadotta. Mada wakakute kesshoku ga yoku, sugata ga utsukushikattakara de aru.
Perishite bi to wa Dabide ni itta, "Tsue o motte, mukatte kuruga, watashi wa inu na no ka". Perishite bi to wa, mata kamigami no na ni yotte Dabide o norotta.
Perishite bi to wa Dabide ni itta, "Saa, mukatte koi. Omae no niku o, sora no tori, no no kemono no ejiki ni shite kureyou".
Dabide wa Perishite bito ni itta, "Omae wa tsurugi to, yarito, nageyari o motte, watashi ni mukatte kuruga, watashi wa bangun no Shu no na, sunawachi, omae ga idonda, Isuraeru no gun no kami no na ni yotte, omae ni tachimukau.
Kyou, Shu wa, omae o watashi no te ni watasarerude arou. Watashi wa, omae o utte, kubi o hane, Perishite bito no gunzei no shi kabane o, kyou, sora no tori, chi no yajuu no ejiki ni shi, Isuraeru ni, kami ga orareru koto o zenchi ni shiraseyou.
Mata kono zenkaishuu mo, Shu wa sukui o hodokosu no ni, tsurugi to yari o mochiirarenai koto o shirude arou. Kono tatakai wa Shu no tatakai de atte, Shu ga wareware no te ni omaetachi o watasarerukara de aru".
Sono Perishite bito ga tachiagari, chikazuite kite Dabide ni tachimukatta no de, Dabide wa isogi sensen ni hashiridete, Perishite bito ni tachimukatta.
Dabide wa te o fukuro ni irete, sono naka kara hitotsu no ishi o tori, ishinage de nagete, Perishite bito no hitai o utta no de, ishi wa sono hitai ni tsukihairi, utsumuki ni chi ni taoreta.
Kou shite Dabide wa ishinage to ishi o motte Perishite bito ni kachi, Perishite bito o utte, kore o koroshita. Dabide no te ni tsurugi ga nakatta no de,
Dabide wa hashiriyotte Perishite bito no ue ni nori, sono tsurugi o totte, saya kara nukihanashi, sore o motte kare o koroshi, sono kubi o haneta. Perishite no hitobito wa, sono yuushi ga shinda no o mite nigeta.
Isuraeru to Yuda no hitobito wa tachiagari, toki o agete, Perishite bito o tsuigeki shi, Gate oyobi Ekuron no mon ni made oyonda. Sono tame Perishite bito no fushousha wa, Sharaimu kara Gate oyobi Ekuron ni iku michi no ue ni taoreta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Perishite bito no tsuigeki o oete kaeri, sono jin'ei o ryakudatsu shita.
Dabide wa, ano Perishite bito no kubi o totte Erusaremu e motte ittaga, sono buki wa jibun no tenmaku ni oita.
Sauru wa Dabide ga ano Perishite bito ni mukatte dete iku no o mite, gun no chouAbuneru ni itta, "Abuneru yo, kono wakamono wa dare no ko ka". Abuneru wa itta, "Ou yo, anata no inochi ni kakete chikaimasu. Watashi wa shiranai no desu".
Ou wa itta, "Kono wakamono ga dare no ko ka, tazunete mi yo".
Dabide ga, ano Perishite bito o koroshite kaette kita toki, Abuneru wa, Perishite bito no kubi o te ni motte iru kare o, Sauru no mae ni tsurete itta.
Sauru wa kare ni itta, "Wakamono yo, anata wa dare no ko ka". Dabide wa kotaeta, "Anata no shimobe, Betsurehemu bi to Essai no ko desu".
Dabide ga Sauru ni katari oeta toki, Yonatan no kokoro wa Dabide no kokoro ni musubitsuki, Yonatan wa jibun no inochi no you ni Dabide o aishita.
Kono hi, Sauru wa Dabide o meshikakaete, chichi no ie ni kaerasenakatta.
Yonatan to Dabide to wa keiyaku o musunda. Yonatan ga jibun no inochi no you ni Dabide o aishitakara de aru.
Yonatan wa jibun ga kite ita uwagi o nuide Dabide ni ataeta. Mata, sono ikusa koromo, oyobi tsurugi mo yumi mo obi mo, sono you ni shita.
Dabide wa doko de mo Sauru ga tsukawasu tokoro ni dete itte, tegara o tateta no de, Sauru wa kare o hei no taichou to shita. Sore wa subete no tami no kokoro ni kanai, mata Sauru no keraitachi no kokoro ni mo kanatta.
Hitobito ga hikiagete kita toki, sunawachi Dabide ga, kano Perishite bito o koroshite kaetta toki, onnatachi wa Isuraeru no machimachi kara dete kite, te tsuzumi to iwaiuta to mitsuito no koto o motte, uta itsu mai tsu, Sauru ou o mukaeta.
Onnatachi wa odorinagara tagai ni utai kawashita, "Sauru wa sen o uchikoroshi, Dabide wa man o uchikoroshita".
Sauru wa, hijou ni ikari, kono kotoba ni ki o waruku shite itta, "Dabide ni wa man to ii, watashi ni wa sen to iu. Kono ue, kare ni ataeru mono wa, kuni no hoka naide wa nai ka".
Sauru wa, kono hi kara nochi Dabide o ukagatta.
Tsugi no hi, kami kara kuru akurei ga Sauru ni hageshiku nozonde, Sauru ga ie no naka de kurui wameita no de, Dabide wa, itsu mo no you ni, te de koto o hiita. Sono toki, Sauru no te ni yari ga atta no de,
Sauru wa "Dabide o kabe ni sashitoosou" to omotte, sono yari o furiageta. Shikashi Dabide wa ni do mi o kawashite Sauru o saketa.
Shu ga Sauru o hanarete, Dabide to tomo ni orareta no de, Sauru wa Dabide o osoreta.
Sore yue Sauru wa, Dabide o toozakete, sennin no chou to shita no de, Dabide wa tami no saki ni tatte deiri shita.
Mata Dabide wa, subete sono suru koto ni, tegara o tateta. Shu ga tomo ni oraretakara de aru.
Sauru wa Dabide ga ookina tegara o tateru no o mite kare o osoretaga,
Isuraeru to Yuda no subete no hito wa Dabide o aishita. Kare ga tami no saki ni tatte deiri shitakara de aru.
Sono toki Sauru wa Dabide ni itta, "Watashi no choujo Merabu o, anata ni tsuma to shite ataeyou. Tada, anata wa watashi no tame ni isamashiku, Shu no tatakai o tatakai nasai". Sauru wa "Jibun no te de kare o korosanaide, Perishite bito no te de korosou" to omottakara de aru.
Dabide wa Sauru ni itta, "Watashi wa nanimono na no deshou. Watashi no shinzoku, watashi no chichi no ichizoku wa Isuraeru no uchi de nanimono na no deshou. Sono watashi ga, dou shite ou no muko ni naru koto ga dekimashou".
Shikashi Sauru no musume Merabu wa, Dabide ni totsugubeki toki ni natte, Mehora bito Aderieru ni tsuma to shite ataerareta.
Sauru no musume Mikaru wa Dabide o aishita. Hitobito ga sore o Sauru ni tsugeta toki, Sauru wa sono koto o yorokonda.
Sauru wa "Mikaru o kare ni ataete, kare o azamuku tedate to shi, Perishite bito no te de kare o korosou" to omotta no de, Sauru wa futatabi Dabide ni itta, "Anata o, kyou, watashi no muko ni shimasu".
Soshite Sauru wa keraitachi ni meijita, "Hisoka ni Dabide ni ii nasai, 'Ou wa anata ga ki ni iri, ou no keraitachi mo mina anata o aishite imasu. Sore yue ou no muko ni nari nasai' ".
Soko de Sauru no keraitachi wa kono kotoba o Dabide no mimi ni katatta no de, Dabide wa itta, "Watashi no you na mazushiku, iyashii mono ga, ou no muko ni naru koto wa, anata gata ni wa, tayasui koto to omowaremasu ka".
Sauru no keraitachi wa Sauru ni, "Dabide wa kou itta" to tsugeta.
Sauru wa itta, "Anata gata wa Dabide ni kou ii nasai, 'Ou wa nani mo yuinou o nozomarenai. Tada Perishite bito no you no kawa ichi hyaku o ete, ou no ada o utsu koto o nozomareru' ". Kore wa Sauru ga, Dabide o Perishite bito no te ni yotte taosou to omottakara de aru.
Sauru no keraitachi ga, kono kotoba o Dabide ni tsugeta toki, Dabide wa ou no muko ni naru koto o yoshi to shita. Soshite sadameta hi ga mada konai uchi ni,
Dabide wa juusha o tsurete, tatte iki, Perishite bito nihyakunin o koroshite, sono you no kawa o tazusae kaeri, ou no muko ni naru tame ni, sore o kotogotoku ou ni sasageta. Soko de Sauru wa musume Mikaru o kare ni tsuma to shite ataeta.
Shikashi Sauru wa mite, Shu ga Dabide to tomo ni orareru koto, mata Isuraeru no subete no hito ga Dabide o aisuru no o shitta toki,
Sauru wa, masumasu Dabide o osoreta. Kou shite Sauru wa taezu Dabide ni tekishita.
Sate Perishite bito no kimitachi ga semete kitaga, Dabide wa, karera ga semete kuru goto ni, Sauru no dono kerai yori mo ooku no tegara o tateta no de, sono na wa hijou ni sonkei sareta.
Sauru wa sono ko Yonatan oyobi subete no keraitachi ni Dabide o korosu you ni to itta. Shikashi Sauru no ko Yonatan wa fukaku Dabide o aishite ita.
Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Chichi Sauru wa anata o korosou to shite imasu. Sore yue asu no asa, ki o tsukete, wakaranai basho ni mi o kakushite ite kudasai.
Watashi wa dete itte, anata ga iru nohara de chichi no katawara ni tachi, chichi ni anata no koto o hanashimashou. Soshite, nani ka watashi ni wakareba, anata ni tsugemashou".
Yonatan wa chichi Sauru ni Dabide no koto o homete itta, "Ou yo, dou ka kerai Dabide ni taishite tsumi o okasanaide kudasai. Kare wa, anata ni tsumi o okasazu, mata kare no shita koto wa, anata no tame ni naru koto deshita.
Kare wa inochi o kakete, ano Perishite bito o koroshi, Shu wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni ooinaru shouri o ataerareta no desu. Anata wa sore o mite yorokobaremashita. Sore de aru no ni, dou shite yue naku Dabide o koroshi, tsumi naki mono no chi o nagashite tsumi o okasou to sareru no desu ka".
Sauru wa Yonatan no kotoba o kikiireta. Soshite Sauru wa chikatta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Watashi wa kesshite kare o korosanai".
Yonatan wa Dabide o yonde korera no koto o mina Dabide ni tsugeta. Soshite Yonatan ga Dabide o Sauru no moto ni tsurete kita no de, Dabide wa, moto no you ni Sauru no mae ni ita.
Tokoro ga mata sensou ga okotte, Dabide wa dete Perishite bito to tatakai, ooini karera o koroshita no de, karera wa sono mae kara nigesatta.
Sate Sauru ga ie ni ite te ni yari o motte suwatte ita toki, Shu kara kuru akurei ga Sauru ni nozonda no de, Dabide wa koto o hiite itaga,
Sauru wa sono yari o motte Dabide o kabe ni sashitoosou to shita. Shikashi kare wa Sauru no mae ni mi o kawashita no de, yari wa kabe ni tsukisasatta. Soshite Dabide wa nigesatta.
Sono yoru, Sauru wa Dabide no ie ni shishatachi o tsukawashite mihari o sase, asa ni natte kare o korosaseyou to shita. Shikashi Dabide no tsuma Mikaru wa Dabide ni itta, "Moshi kon'ya no uchi ni, anata ga jibun no inochi o sukuwanainaraba, asu wa korosarerudeshou".
Soshite Mikaru ga Dabide o mado kara tsurioroshita no de, kare wa nigesatta.
Mikaru wa hitotsu no zou o totte, nedoko no ue ni yokotae, sono atama ni yagi no ke no ami o kake, kimono o motte sore o ootta.
Sauru wa Dabide o toraeru tame shishatachi o tsukawashitaga, kanojo wa itta, "Ano hito wa byouki desu".
Soko de Sauru wa, Dabide o misaseyou to shishatachi o tsukawashite itta, "Kare o nedoko no mama, watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai. Watashi ga kare o korosou".
Shishatachi ga haitte miruto, nedoko ni wa zou ga yokotaete atte, sono atama ni wa, yagi no ke no ami ga kakete atta.
Sauru wa Mikaru ni itta, "Anata wa dou shite, kono you ni watashi o azamuite, watashi no teki o nigashita no ka". Mikaru wa Sauru ni kotaeta, "Ano hito wa watashi ni 'Nigashite kure. Samo naito, omae o korosu' to iimashita".
Dabide wa nigesari, Rama ni iru Samueru no moto e itte, Sauru ga jibun ni shita subete no koto o kare ni tsugeta. Soshite Dabide to Samueru wa itte Nayote ni sunda.
Aru hito ga Sauru ni "Dabide wa Rama no Nayote ni imasu" to tsugeta no de,
Sauru wa, Dabide o toraeru tame ni, shishatachi o tsukawashita. Karera wa yogensha no ichigun ga yogen shite ite, Samueru ga, sono uchi no, kashira to natte tatte iru no o mitaga, sono toki, kami no rei wa Sauru no shishatachi ni mo nozonde, karera mo mata yogen shita.
Sauru wa, kono koto o kiite, ta no shishatachi o tsukawashitaga, karera mo mata yogen shita. Sauru wa san tabi shishatachi o tsukawashitaga, karera mo mata yogen shita.
Soko de Sauru wa mizukara Rama ni iki, Seku no ooido ni tsuita toki, toute itta, "Samueru to Dabide wa, doko ni oru ka". Hitori no hito ga kotaeta, "Karera wa Rama no Nayote ni imasu".
Soko de Sauru wa soko kara Rama no Nayote ni ittaga, kami no rei wa mata kare ni mo nozonde, kare wa Rama no Nayote ni tsuku made arukinagara yogen shita.
Soshite kare mo mata kimono o nuide, onaji you ni Samueru no mae de yogen shi, ichi nichi ichiya, hadaka de taorefushite ita. Hitobito ga "Sauru mo mata yogensha tachi no uchi ni iru no ka" to iu no wa kono tame de aru.
Dabide wa Rama no Nayote kara nigete kite, Yonatan ni itta, "Watashi ga nani o shi, dono you na warui koto ga ari, anata no chichi no mae ni donna tsumi o okashita no de, watashi o korosou to sareru no deshou ka".
Yonatan wa kare ni itta, "Kesshite korosareru koto wa arimasen. Chichi wa koto no daishou o towazu, watashi ni tsugenaide suru koto wa arimasen. Dou shite chichi ga watashi ni sono koto o kakushimashou. Sono you na koto wa arimasen".
Shikashi Dabide wa kotaeta, "Anata no chichi wa, watashi ga anata no koui o ete iru koto o yoku shitte oraremasu. Sore de 'Yonatan ga kanashimu koto no nai you ni, kore o shirasenaide okou' to omotte orareru no desu. Shikashi, Shu wa ikite orare, anata no tamashii wa ikite imasu. Watashi to shi to no aida wa, tada ichi po desu".
Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Anata ga iwareru koto wa nan de mo shimasu".
Dabide wa Yonatan ni itta, "Asu wa, tsuitachi desukara, watashi wa ou to issho ni shokuji o shinakereba narimasen. Shikashi watashi o ikasete mikkame no yuugata made, nohara ni kakureru koto o yurushite kudasai.
Moshi anata no chichi ga watashi no koto o tazunerarerunaraba, sono toki, itte kudasai, 'Dabide wa furusato no machi Betsurehemu e isoide iku koto o yurushite kudasai to, shikiri ni watashi ni motomemashita. Soko de zenka no toshimatsuri ga arukara desu'.
Moshi kare ga "Yoshi" to iwarerunara, shimobe wa anzen desuga, ikararerunara, watashi ni gai o kuwaeru kesshin de orareru no o shitte kudasai.
Anata wa, Shu no mae de, shimobe to keiyaku o musunde kudasaimashita. Sore de douzo shimobe ni itsukushimi o hodokoshite kudasai. Shikashi, moshi watashi ni warui koto ga arunaraba, anata mizukara watashi o koroshite kudasai. Dou shite anata no chichi no moto e watashi o hiite ikanakereba naranaideshou".
Yonatan wa itta, "Sono you na koto wa kesshite arimasen. Chichi ga anata ni gai o kuwaeru kesshin o shite iru koto ga watashi ni wakatte irunaraba, watashi wa sore o anata ni tsugenaide okimashou ka".
Dabide wa Yonatan ni itta, "Anata no chichi ga araarashiku anata ni kotaerareru toki, dare ga watashi ni tsugerudeshou ka".
Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Saa, nohara e dete ikou". Kou shite futari wa nohara e dete itta.
Soshite Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga, shounin desu. Myounichi ka myougonichi no imagoro, watashi ga chichi no kokoro o sagutte, chichi ga Dabide ni taishite yoi no o minagara, hito o tsukawashite anata ni shirasenai you na koto o surudeshou ka.
Shikashi, moshi chichi ga anata ni gai o kuwaeyou to omotte iru no ni, sore o anata ni shirasezu, anata o nigashite, anzen ni sarasenainaraba, Shu yo, douzo ikue ni mo, kono Yonatan o basshite kudasai. Douzo Shu ga chichi to tomo ni orareta you ni, anata to tomo ni oraremasu you ni.
Moshi watashi ga nao ikinagaraete irunaraba, Shu no itsukushimi o watashi ni hodokoshi, shi o manukaresasete kudasai.
Mata watashi no ie o mo, nagaku anata no itsukushimi ni azukarasete kudasai. Shu ga Dabide no teki o kotogotoku chi no omote kara tachi horobosareru toki,
Yonatan no na o Dabide no ie kara tayasanaide kudasai. Douzo Shu ga Dabide no teki ni, ada o kaesareru you ni".
Soshite Yonatan wa kasanete Dabide ni chikawaseta. Kare o aishitakara de aru. Yonatan wa jibun no inochi no you ni kare o aishite ita.
Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Asu wa tsuitachi desu. Anata no seki ga aite iru no de, dou shita no ka to tazunerarerudeshou.
Mikkame ni wa, kibishiku tazunerarerudeshoukara, saki ni anata ga kakureta basho e itte, mukou no ishizuka no katawara ni ite kudasai.
Watashi wa mato o iru you ni shite, ya o sanhon, sono soba ni hanachimasu.
Soshite, 'Itte ya o sagashite ki nasai' to itte kodomo o tsukawashimashou. Watashi ga kodomo ni, 'Ya wa temae ni aru. Sore o totte ki nasai' to iunaraba, sono toki anata wa kite kudasai. Shu ga ikite orareru you ni, anata wa anzen de, nani mo kiken ga naikara desu.
Shikashi watashi ga sono kotomo ni, 'Ya wa mukou ni aru' to iunaraba, sono toki, anata wa satte iki nasai. Shu ga anata o saraserareru no desu.
Anata to watashi to de hanashiatta koto ni tsuite wa, Shu ga tsune ni anata to watashi to no aida ni oraremasu".
Soko de Dabide wa nohara ni mi o kakushita. Sate, tsuitachi ni natta no de, ou wa shokuji o suru tame seki ni tsuita.
Ou wa itsu mo no you ni kabeyori ni seki ni tsuki, Yonatan wa sono mukaigawa no seki ni tsuki, Abuneru wa Sauru no yoko no seki ni tsuitaga, Dabide no basho ni wa dare mo inakatta.
Tokoro ga sono hi Sauru wa nani mo iwanakatta, "Kare ni nani ka tatte kegareta no darou. Kitto kegareta no ni chigai nai" to omottakara de aru.
Shikashi, futsu ka me sunawachi, tsuitachi no akuruhi mo, Dabide no basho wa aite ita no de, Sauru wa, sono ko Yonatan ni itta, "Dou shite Essai no ko wa, kinou mo kyou mo shokuji ni konai no ka".
Yonatan wa Sauru ni kotaeta, "Dabide wa, Betsurehemu e iku koto o yurushite kudasai to, shikiri ni watashi ni motomemashita.
Kare wa iimashita, 'Watashi ni ikasete kudasai. Wareware no ichizoku ga machi de matsuri o suru no de, ani ga watashi ni kuru you ni to meijimashita. Sore de mo shi, anata no mae ni megumi o emasunaraba, douzo, watashi ni iku koto o yurushi, kyoudaitachi ni awasete kudasai'. Sore de kare wa ou no shokutaku ni konakatta no desu".
Sono toki Sauru wa Yonatan ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, kare ni itta, "Anata wa kokoro no magatta, somuku onna no unda ko da. Anata ga Essai no ko o erande, jibun no mi o hazukashime, mata haha no mi o hazukashimete iru koto o watashi ga shiranai to omou no ka.
Essai no ko ga konoyo ni ikinagaraete iru aida wa, anata mo, anata no oukoku mo kataku tatte iku koto wa dekinai. Sore yue ima, hito o tsukawashite, kare o watashi no moto ni tsurete kosase nasai. Kare wa kanarazu shinanakereba naranai".
Yonatan wa chichi Sauru ni kotaeta, "Dou shite kare wa korosarenakereba naranai no desu ka. Kare wa nani o shita no desu ka".
Tokoro ga Sauru wa Yonatan o utou to shite, yari o kare ni mukatte furiageta no de, Yonatan wa chichi ga Dabide o korosou to, kokoro ni kimete iru no o shitta.
Yonatan wa hageshiku ikatte seki o tachi, sono tsuki no futsu ka ni wa shokuji o shinakatta. Chichi ga Dabide o hazukashimeta no de, Dabide no tame ni ureetakara de aru.
Akuru asa, Yonatan wa, hitori no chiisai kodomo o tsurete, Dabide to uchiawaseta you ni nohara ni dete itta.
Soshite sono kotomo ni itta, "Hashitte itte, watashi no iru ya o sagashi nasai". Kodomo ga hashitte iku aida ni, Yonatan wa ya o kare no mae no hou ni hanatta.
Soshite kodomo ga, Yonatan no hanatta ya no tokoro e itta toki, Yonatan wa kodomo no ushiro kara yobawatte, "Ya wa mukou ni aru de wa nai ka" to itta.
Yonatan wa mata, sono kotomo no ushiro kara yobawatte itta, "Hayaku seyo, isoge. Todomaru na". Sono kotomo wa ya o hiroiatsumete shujin Yonatan no moto ni kita.
Shikashi kodomo wa nani mo shirazu, Yonatan to Dabide dake ga sono koto o shitte ita.
Yonatan wa jibun no buki o sono kotomo ni watashite itta, "Anata wa kore o machi e hakonde iki nasai".
Kodomo ga itte shimauto Dabide wa ishizuka no katawara o hanarete tachiide, chi ni hirefushite san do keirei shita. Soshite, futari wa tagai ni kuchizuke shi, tagai ni naita. Yagate Dabide wa kokoro ga ochitsuita.
Sono toki Yonatan wa Dabide ni itta, "Buji ni iki nasai. Wareware futari wa, 'Shu ga tsune ni watashi to anata no aida ni orare, mata, watashi no shison to anata no shison no aida ni orareru' to itte, Shu no na o sashite chikatta no desu". Kou shite Dabide wa tachisari, Yonatan wa machi ni haitta.
Dabide wa Nobu ni iki, saishi Ahimereku no tokoro e itta. Ahimereku wa ononokinagara Dabide o mukaete itta, "Dou shite anata wa hitori desu ka. Dare mo tomo ga inai no desu ka".
Dabide wa saishi Ahimereku ni itta, "Ou ga watashi ni hitotsu no koto o meijite, 'Watashi ga omae o tsukawashite saseru koto, mata watashi ga meijita koto ni tsuite wa, nani o mo hito ni shirasete wa naranai' to iwaremashita. Soko de watashi wa, aru basho ni wakamonotachi o matasete arimasu.
Tokoro de ima anata no temoto ni pan goko de mo areba, sore o watashi ni kudasai. Nakereba nan de mo, aru mono o kudasai".
Saishi wa Dabide ni kotaete itta, "Tsune no pan wa watashi no temoto ni arimasen. Tada sono wakamonotachi ga onna o tsutsushinde sae ita no deshitara, seibetsu shita pan ga arimasu".
Dabide wa saishi ni kotaeta, "Watashi ga tatakai ni deru itsu mo no toki no you ni, wareware wa tashika ni onnatachi o chikazukete imasen. Wakamonotachi no utsuwa wa, tsune no tabi de atta to shite mo, kiyoi no desu. Mashite, kyou, karera no utsuwa wa kiyoku naideshou ka".
Soko de saishi wa kare ni seibetsu shita pan o ataeta. Sono tokoro ni, sonae no pan no hoka ni pan ga naku, kono pan wa, kore o torisageru hi ni, atatakai pan to okikaeru tame, Shu no mae kara tori tori sageta mono de aru.
Sono hi, sono tokoro ni, Sauru no shimobe no hitori ga, Shu no mae ni tomeokarete ita. Sono na wa Doegu to ii, Edomu bito de atte, Sauru no bokusha no chou de atta.
Dabide wa mata Ahimereku ni itta, "Koko ni, anata no temoto ni, yari ka tsurugi ga arimasen ka. Ou no koto ga kyuu o youshita no de, watashi wa tsurugi mo buki mo motte konakatta no desu".
Saishi wa itta, "Anata ga Era no tani de koroshita Perishite bi to Goriate no tsurugi ga, nuno ni tsutsunde Epode no ushiro ni arimasu. Moshi anata ga kore o torou to omowarerunara, otori kudasai. Koko ni wa sono hoka ni wa arimasen". Dabide wa itta, "Sore ni masaru mono wa arimasen. Sore o watashi ni kudasai".
Dabide wa sono hi Sauru o osorete, tatte Gate no ou Akishi no tokoro e nigete itta.
Akishi no keraitachi wa Akishi ni itta, "Kore wa ano kuni no ou Dabide de wa arimasen ka. Hitobito ga odorinagara, tagai ni utai kawashite, 'Sauru wa sen o uchikoroshi, Dabide wa man o uchikoroshita' to itta no wa, kono hito no koto de wa arimasen ka".
Dabide wa, korera no kotoba o kokoro ni oki, Gate no ou Akishi o, hijou ni osoreta no de,
Hitobito no mae de, wazato kyodou o kae, toraerarete kichigai no furi o shi, mon no tobira o uchitataki, yodare o nagashite, hige ni tsutawaraseta.
Akishi wa keraitachi ni itta, "Anata gata no miru you ni, kono hito wa kichigai da. Dou shite kare o watashi no tokoro e tsurete kita no ka.
Watashi ni kichigai ga hitsuyou na no ka. Kono mono o tsurete kite, watashi no mae de kuruwaseyou to iu no ka. Kono mono o watashi no ie e ireyou to suru no ka".
Kou shite Dabide wa sono tokoro o sari, Adoramu no horaana e nogareta. Kare no kyoudaitachi to chichi no ie no mono wa mina, kore o kiki, sono tokoro ni kudatte kare no moto ni kita.
Mata, shi etagerarete iru hitobito, fusai no aru hitobito, kokoro ni fuman no aru hitobito mo mina, kare no moto ni atsumatte kite, kare wa sono chou to natta. Ooyoso yonhyakunin no hitobito ga kare to tomo ni atta.
Dabide wa soko kara Moabu no Mizupa e iki, Moabu no ou ni itta, "Kami ga watashi no tame ni donna koto o sareru ka wakaru made, douzo watashi no fubo o anata no tokoro ni orasete kudasai".
Soshite kare wa Moabu no ou ni karera o takushita no de, karera wa Dabide ga yougai ni oru aida, ou no tokoro ni otta.
Sate, yogensha Gado wa Dabide ni itta, "Yougai ni todomatte inaide, satte Yuda no chi e iki nasai". Soko de Dabide wa satte, Harete no mori e itta.
Sauru wa, Dabide oyobi kare to tomo ni iru hitobito ga mitsukatta to iu koto o kiita. Sauru wa Gibea de, yari o te ni motte, oka no gi ryuu no ki no shita ni suwatte ori, keraitachi wa mina sono mawari ni tatte ita.
Sauru wa mawari ni tatte iru keraitachi ni itta, "Anata gata Beniyamin bi to wa kiki nasai. Essai no ko mo mata, anata gata onoono ni hatake ya budou hatake o atae, onoono o sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou ni surude arou ka.
Anata gata wa mina tomo ni hakatte watashi ni tekishita. Watashi no ko ga Essai no ko to keiyaku o musunde mo, sore o watashi ni tsugeru mono wa naku, mata anata gata no uchi, hitori mo watashi no tame ni ureezu, kyou no you ni, watashi no ko ga watashi no shimobe o sosonokashite watashi ni sakarawase, michi de kare ga watashi o machibuse suru you ni natte mo, watashi ni tsugeru mono wa nai".
Sono toki Edomu bito Doegu wa, Sauru no keraitachi no soba ni tatte itaga, kotaete itta, "Watashi wa Essai no ko ga Nobu ni iru Ahitobu no ko Ahimereku no tokoro ni kita no o mimashita.
Ahimereku wa kare no tame ni Shu ni toi, mata kare ni shokumotsu o atae, Perishite bi to Goriate no tsurugi o ataemashita".
Soko de ou wa hito o tsukawashite, Ahitobu no ko saishi Ahimereku to sono chichi no ie no subete no mono, sunawachi Nobu no saishitachi o meshita no de, mina ou no tokoro ni kita.
Sauru wa itta, "Ahitobu no ko yo, kiki nasai". Kare wa kotaeta, "Waga Shu yo, watashi wa koko ni orimasu".
Sauru wa kare ni itta, "Dou shite anata wa Essai no ko to tomo ni hakatte watashi ni tekishi, kare ni pan to tsurugi o atae, kare no tame ni kami ni toi, kyou no you ni kare o watashi ni sakaratte tatase, michi de machibuse saseru no ka".
Ahimereku wa ou ni kotaete itta, "Anata no kerai no uchi, Dabide no you ni chuugi na mono ga hoka ni arimasu ka. Kare wa ou no musumemuko de ari, konoe hei no chou de atte, anata no ie de tattobareru hito de wa arimasen ka.
Kare no tame ni kami ni touta no wa, kyou hajimete deshou ka. Iie, kesshite sou de wa arimasen. Ou yo, douzo, shimobe to chichi no zenka ni tsumi o owasenaide kudasai. Shimobe wa, kore ni tsuite wa, koto no daishou o towazu, nani o mo shiranakatta no desu".
Ou wa itta, "Ahimereku yo, anata wa kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai. Anata no chichi no zenka mo onaji de aru".
Soshite ou wa mawari ni tatte iru konoe no hei ni itta, "Mi o hirugaeshite, Shu no saishitachi o koroshi nasai. Karera mo Dabide to kyouryoku shite ite, Dabide no nigeta no o shirinagara, sore o watashi ni tsugenakattakara desu". Tokoro ga ou no keraitachi wa Shu no saishitachi o korosu tame ni te o kudasou to wa shinakatta.
Soko de ou wa Doegu ni itta, "Anata ga mi o hirugaeshite, saishitachi o koroshi nasai". Edomu bito Doegu wa mi o hirugaeshite saishitachi o uchi, sono hiama nuno no Epode o mi ni tsukete iru mono hachijuu gonin o koroshita.
Kare wa mata, tsurugi o motte saishi no machi Nobu o uchi, tsurugi o motte otoko, onna, osanako, chinomi go, ushi, roba, hitsuji o koroshita.
Shikashi Ahitobu no ko Ahimereku no kotachi no hitori de, na o Abiyataru to iu hito wa, nogarete Dabide no tokoro ni hashitta.
Soshite Abiyataru wa, Sauru ga Shu no saishitachi o koroshita koto o Dabide ni tsugeta no de,
Dabide wa Abiyataru ni itta, "Ano hi, Edomu bito Doegu ga asoko ni ita no de, watashi wa kare ga kitto Sauru ni tsugerude arou to omotta. Watashi ga anata no chichi no ie no hitobito no inochi o ushinawaseru moto to natta no desu.
Anata wa watashi no tokoro ni todomatte kudasai. Osoreru koto wa arimasen. Anata no inochi o motomeru mono wa, watashi no inochi o mo motomete iru no desu. Watashi no tokoro ni orarerunaraba, anata wa anzen deshou".
Sate hitobito wa Dabide ni tsugete itta, "Perishite bito ga Keira o semete, uchi ba no kokumotsu o kasumete imasu".
Soko de Dabide wa Shu ni toute itta, "Watashi ga itte, kono Perishite bito o uchimashou ka". Shu wa Dabide ni iwareta, "Itte Perishite bito o uchi, Keira o sukui nasai".
Shikashi Dabide no juushatachi wa kare ni itta, "Wareware wa, Yuda no koko ni otte sae, osorete iru no ni, mashite Keira e itte, Perishite bito no gun ni ataru koto ga dekimashou ka".
Dabide ga kasanete Shu ni touta tokoro, Shu wa kare ni kotaete iwareta, "Tatte, Keira e kudari nasai. Watashi wa Perishite bito o anata no te ni watashimasu".
Dabide to sono juushatachi wa Keira e itte, Perishite bito to tatakai, karera no kachiku o ubaitori, karera o ooku uchikoroshita. Kou shite Dabide wa Keira no juumin o sukutta.
Ahimereku no ko Abiyataru wa, Keira ni iru Dabide no moto ni nogarete kita toki, te ni Epode o motte kudatte kita.
Sate Dabide no Keira ni kita koto ga Sauru ni kikoeta no de, Sauru wa itta, "Kami wa watashi no te ni kare o watasareta. Kare wa mon to kannoki no aru machi ni haitte, jibun de mi o tojikometakara de aru".
Soko de Sauru wa subete no tami o tatakai ni yobiatsumete, Keira ni kudari, Dabide to sono juusha o semekakomou to shita.
Dabide wa Sauru ga jibun ni gai o kuwaeyou to shite iru no o shitte, saishi Abiyataru ni itta, "Epode o motte kite kudasai".
Soshite Dabide wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, shimobe wa Sauru ga Keira ni kite, watashi no tame ni, kono machi o horobosou to shite iru koto o tashika ni kikimashita.
Keira no hitobito wa watashi o kare no te ni watasudeshou ka. Shimobe no kiita you ni, Sauru wa kudatte kurudeshou ka. Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, douzo, shimobe ni tsugete kudasai". Shu wa iwareta, "Kare wa kudatte kuru".
Dabide wa itta, "Keira no hitobito wa watashi to juushatachi o Sauru no te ni watasudeshou ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Karera wa anatagata o watasude arou".
Soko de Dabide to sono roppyakunin hodo no juushatachi wa tatte, Keira o sari, izuko to mo naku samayotta. Dabide no Keira kara nigesatta koto ga Sauru ni kikoeta no de, Sauru wa tatakai ni deru koto o yameta.
Dabide wa arano ni aru yougai ni ori, mata Jifu no arano no sanchi ni otta. Sauru wa hibi ni kare o tazunemotometaga, kami wa kare o sono te ni watasarenakatta.
Sate Dabide wa Sauru ga jibun no inochi o motomete dete kita no de osoreta. Sono toki Dabide wa Jifu no arano no Horeshi ni itaga,
Sauru no ko Yonatan wa tatte, Horeshi ni iru Dabide no moto ni iki, kami ni yotte kare o chikarazuketa.
Soshite Yonatan wa kare ni itta, "Osoreru ni wa oyobimasen. Chichi Sauru no te wa anata ni todokanaideshou. Anata wa Isuraeru no ou to nari, watashi wa anata no tsugi to narudeshou. Kono koto wa chichi Sauru mo shitte imasu".
Kou shite karera futari wa Shu no mae de keiyaku o musubi, Dabide wa Horeshi ni todomari, Yonatan wa ie ni kaetta.
Sono toki Jifu bi to wa Gibea ni iru Sauru no moto ni nobotte iki, soshite itta, "Dabide wa, arano no minami ni aru Hakira no oka no ue no Horeshi no yougai ni kakurete, wareware to tomo ni irude wa arimasen ka.
Sore yue ou yo, anata ga kudatte ikou to iu nozomi no toori, ima kudatte kite kudasai. Wareware wa kare o ou no te ni watashimasu".
Sauru wa itta, "Anata gata wa watashi ni doujou o yosete kureta no desu. Douzo Shu ga anatagata o shukufuku sareru you ni.
Anata gata wa itte, nao tashikamete kudasai. Kare no yoku iku tokoro to dare ga soko de kare o mita ka o mikiwamete kudasai. Hito no kataru tokoro ni yoruto, kare wa hijou ni warugashikoi sou da.
Sore de, anata gata wa kare ga kakureru kakure basho o mina mikiwame, tashika na shirase o motte watashi no tokoro ni kaette ki nasai. Sono toki watashi wa anata gata to tomo ni ikimasu. Moshi kare ga kono chi ni irunaraba, watashi wa Yuda no shizoku o amaneku tazunete kare o sagashidashimasu".
Karera wa tatte, Sauru ni sakidatte Jifu e itta. Sate Dabide to sono juushatachi wa arano no minami no Araba ni aru Maon no arano ni ita.
Soshite Sauru to sono juushatachi wa kite kare o sagashita. Hitobito ga kore o Dabide ni tsugeta no de, Dabide wa Maon no arano ni aru iwa no tokoro e kudatte itta. Sauru wa kore o kiite, Maon no arano ni kite Dabide o otta.
Sauru wa yama no kochiragawa o iki, Dabide to sono juushatachi to wa yama no mukougawa o okonatta. Soshite Dabide wa isoide Sauru kara nogareyou to shita. Sauru to sono juushatachi ga, Dabide to sono juushatachi o kakonde toraeyou to shitakara de aru.
Sono toki, Sauru no tokoro ni, hitori no shisha ga kite itta, "Perishite bito ga kuni o okashite imasu. Isoide kite kudasai".
Soko de Sauru wa Dabide o ou koto o yamete kaeri, itte Perishite bito ni atatta. Sore de hitobito wa, sono tokoro o "Nogare no iwa" to nazuketa.
Dabide wa soko kara nobotte Engede no yougai ni ita.
Sauru ga Perishite bito o ou koto o yamete kaette kita toki, hitobito wa kare ni tsugete itta, "Dabide wa Engede no no ni imasu".
Soko de Sauru wa, zenIsuraeru kara eranda sanzen no hito o hikii, Dabide to sono juushatachi to o sagasu tame, "Yagi no iwa" no mae e dekaketa.
Tochuu, hitsuji no ori no tokoro ni kitaga, soko ni, horaana ga ari, Sauru wa ashi o oou tame ni, sono naka ni haitta. Sono toki, Dabide to sono juushatachi wa, horaana no oku ni ita.
Dabide no juushatachi wa kare ni itta, "Shu ga anata ni tsugete, 'Watashi wa anata no teki o anata no te ni watasu. Anata wa jibun no yoi to omou koto o kare ni suru koto ga dekiru' to iwareta hi ga kita no desu". Soko de Dabide wa tatte, hisoka ni, Sauru no uwagi no suso o kitta.
Shikashi nochi ni natte, Dabide wa Sauru no uwagi no suso o kitta koto ni, kokoro no seme o kanjita.
Dabide wa juushatachi ni itta, "Shu ga abura o sosogareta waga kimi ni, watashi ga kono koto o suru no o Shu wa kinjirareru. Kare wa Shu ga abura o sosogareta mono de arukara, kare ni tekishite, watashi no te o noberu no wa yoku nai".
Dabide wa korera no kotoba o motte juushatachi o sashitome, Sauru o utsu koto o yurusanakatta. Sauru wa tatte, horaana o sari, michi o susunda.
Dabide mo mata, sono ato kara tachi, horaana o dete, Sauru no ushiro kara yobawatte, "Waga kimi, ou yo" to itta. Sauru ga ushiro o furimuita toki, Dabide wa chi ni hirefushite haishita.
Soshite Dabide wa Sauru ni itta, "Dou shite, anata wa 'Dabide ga anata o gaishiyou to shite iru' to iu hitobito no kotoba o kikareru no desu ka.
Anata wa, kono hi, jibun no me de, Shu ga anata o kyou, horaana no naka de watashi no te ni watasareta no o goran ni narimashita. Hitobito wa watashi ni anata o korosu koto o susumeta no desuga, watashi wa koroshimasendeshita. 'Waga kimi wa Shu ga abura o sosogareta kata de arukara, kore ni tekishite te o noberu koto wa shinai' to watashi wa iimashita.
Waga chichi yo, goran nasai. Anata no uwagi no suso wa, watashi no te ni arimasu. Watashi ga anata no uwagi no suso o kiri, shikamo, anata o korosanakatta koto ni yotte, anata wa, watashi no te ni akumo, toga mo nai koto o mite shirarerudeshou. Anata wa watashi no inochi o torouto, neratte oraremasuga, watashi wa anata ni taishite tsumi o okashita koto wa nai no desu.
Douzo Shu ga watashi to anata no aida o sabakaremasu you ni. Mata Shu ga watashi no tame ni, anata ni mukuiraremasu you ni. Shikashi, watashi wa anata ni te o kudasu koto o shinaideshou.
Mukashi kara, kotowaza ni itte iru you ni, 'Aku wa akunin kara deru'. Shikashi, watashi wa anata ni te o kudasu koto o shinaideshou.
Isuraeru no ou wa, dare o otte dete korareta no desu ka. Anata wa, dare o otte orareru no desu ka. Shinda inu o otte orareru no desu. Ichipiki no nomi o otte orareru no desu.
Douzo Shu ga sabaki bito to natte, watashi to anata no aida o sabaki, katsu mite, watashi no uttae o kiki, watashi o anata no te kara sukuidashite kudasaru you ni".
Dabide ga korera no kotoba o Sauru ni katari owatta toki, Sauru wa itta, "Waga ko Dabide yo, kore wa, anata no koe de aru ka". Soshite Sauru wa koe o agete naita.
Sauru wa mata Dabide ni itta, "Anata wa watashi yori mo tadashii. Watashi ga anata ni aku o mukuita no ni, anata wa watashi ni zen o mukuiru.
Kyou, anata wa ikani yoku watashi o atsukatta ka o akiraka ni shimashita. Sunawachi Shu ga watashi o anata no te ni watasareta no ni, anata wa watashi o korosanakatta no desu.
Hito wa teki ni atta toki, teki o buji ni saraserudeshou ka. Anata ga, kyou, watashi ni shita koto no yue ni, douzo Shu ga anata ni yoi mukui o ataerareru you ni.
Ima watashi wa, anata ga kanarazu ou to naru koto o shirimashita. Mata Isuraeru no oukoku ga, anata no te ni yotte kataku tatsu koto o shirimashita.
Sore yue, anata wa watashi no ato ni, watashi no shison o tatazu, mata watashi no chichi no ie kara, watashi no na o horoboshisaranaito, ima Shu o sashite, watashi ni chikatte kudasai".
Soko de Dabide wa Sauru ni, sono you ni chikatta. Soshite Sauru wa ie ni kaeri, Dabide to sono juushatachi wa yougai ni nobotte itta.
Sate Samueru ga shinda no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina atsumatte, kare no tame ni hijou ni kanashimi, Rama ni aru sono ie ni kare o houmutta. Soshite Dabide wa tatte Paran no arano ni kudatte itta.
Maon ni, hitori no hito ga atte, Karumeru ni sono shoyuu ga ari, hijou ni yuufuku de, hitsuji sanzentou, yagi issentou o motte ita. Kare wa Karumeru de hitsuji no ke o kitte ita.
Sono hito no na wa Nabaru to ii, tsuma no na wa Abigairu to itta. Abigairu wa kashikokute utsukushikattaga, sono otto wa goujou de, sobou de atta. Kare wa Karebu bito de atta.
Dabide wa arano ni ite, Nabaru ga sono hitsuji no ke o kitte iru koto o kiita no de,
Juunin no wakamono o tsukawashi, sono wakamonotachi ni itta, "Karumeru ni nobotte itte Nabaru no tokoro e iki, watashi no na o motte kare ni aisatsu shi,
Kare ni kou ii nasai, 'Douzo anata ni heian ga aru you ni. Anata no ie ni heian ga aru you ni. Mata anata no subete no mochimono ni heian ga aru you ni.
Watashi wa anata ga hitsuji no ke o kitte orareru koto o kikimashita. Anata no hitsujikaitachi wa wareware to issho ni ita no desuga, wareware wa karera o sukoshi mo gaishimasendeshita. Mata karera wa Karumeru ni iru aida ni, nani hitotsu ushinatta koto wa arimasen.
Anata no wakamonotachi ni kiite mirarerunaraba, wakarimasu. Sore yue, watashi no wakamonotachi ni, anata no koui o shimeshite kudasai. Wareware wa shuku no hi ni kita no desu. Douzo, anata no temoto ni aru mono o, okurimono to shite, shimobedomo to anata no ko Dabide ni kudasai' ".
Dabide no wakamonotachi wa itte, Dabide no na o motte, korera no kotoba o Nabaru ni katari, soshite matte ita.
Nabaru wa Dabide no wakamonotachi ni kotaete itta, "Dabide to wa dare ka. Essai no ko to wa dare ka. Konogoro wa, shujin o sutete nigeru shimobe ga ooi.
Dou shite watashi no pan to mizu, mata watashi no hitsuji no ke o kiru hitobito no tame ni hofutta niku o totte, doko kara kita no ka wakaranai hitobito ni ataeru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Dabide no wakamonotachi wa, soko o sari, kaette kite, kare ni kono subete no koto o tsugeta.
Soko de Dabide wa juushatachi ni itta, "Onoono, tsurugi o obi nasai". Karera wa onoono tsurugi o obi, Dabide mo mata tsurugi o obita. Soshite ooyoso yonhyakunin ga Dabide ni shitagatte nobotte iki, nihyakunin wa nimotsu no tokoro ni todomatta.
Tokoro de, hitori no wakamono ga Nabaru no tsuma Abigairu ni itta, "Dabide ga arano kara shisha o tsukawashite, shujin ni aisatsu o shita no ni, shujin wa sono shishatachi o nonoshiraremashita.
Shikashi, ano hitobito wa wareware ni daihen yoku shite kurete, wareware wa sukoshi mo gai o ukezu, mata wareware ga no ni ita toki, karera to tomo ni ita aida wa, nani hitotsu ushinatta koto wa arimasendeshita.
Wareware ga hitsuji o katte karera to tomo ni iru aida, karera wa yoru mo hiru mo wareware no kaki to natte kuremashita.
Sore de, anata wa ima sore o shitte, jibun no suru koto o kangaete kudasai. Shujin to sono ikka ni wazawai ga okirukara desu. Shikamo shujin wa yokoshima na hito de, hanashikakeru koto mo dekimasen".
Sono toki, Abigairu wa isoide pan nihyaku, budoushu no kawabukuro futatsu, chouri shita hitsuji gotou, iri mugi go Sea, hoshi budou hyakufu sa, hoshi ichijiku no katamari nihyaku o totte, roba ni nose,
Wakamonotachi ni itta, "Watashi no saki ni susumi nasai. Watashi wa anata gata no ushiro ni, tsuite ikimasu". Shikashi kanojo wa otto Nabaru ni wa tsugenakatta.
Abigairu ga, roba ni notte yamakage o kudatte kita toki, Dabide to juushatachi wa kanojo no hou ni mukatte furite kita no de, kanojo wa sono hitobito ni deatta.
Sate, Dabide wa saki ni kou itta, "Watashi wa kono hito ga arano de motte iru mono o mina mamotte, sono hito ni zokusuru mono o nani hitotsu nakunaranai you ni shitaga, sore wa mattaku muda de atta. Kare wa watashi no shita shinsetsu ni aku o motte mukuita.
Moshi watashi ga asu no asa made, Nabaru ni zokusuru subete no mono no uchi, hitori no otoko de mo nokoshite okunaraba, kami ga ikue ni mo Dabide o basshite kudasaru you ni".
Abigairu wa Dabide o mite, isoide, roba o furi, Dabide no mae de chi ni hirefushi,
Sono ashimoto ni fushite itta, "Waga kimi yo, kono toga o watashi dake ni owasete kudasai. Shikashi douzo, hashi tame ni, anata no mimi ni kataru koto o yurushi, hashi tame no kotoba o okiki kudasai.
Waga kimi yo, douzo, kono yokoshima na hito Nabaru no koto o ki ni kakenaide kudasai. Ano hito wa sono na no toori desu. Na wa Nabaru de, oroka na mono desu. Anata no hashi tame de aru watashi wa, waga kimi naru anata ga tsukawasareta wakamonotachi o minakatta no desu.
Sore yue ima, waga kimi yo, Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Mata anata wa ikite oraremasu. Shu wa, anata ga kite chi o nagashi, mata tezukara, ada o mukuiru no o todomeraremashita. Douzo ima, anata no teki, oyobi waga kimi ni gai o kuwaeyou to suru mono wa, Nabaru no gotokuni narimasu you ni.
Ima, anata no tsukaeme ga, waga kimi ni tazusaete kita okurimono o, waga kimi ni shitagau wakamonotachi ni ataete kudasai.
Douzo, hashi tame no toga o yurushite kudasai. Shu wa kanarazu waga kimi no tame ni tashika na ie o tsukurarerudeshou. Waga kimi ga Shu no ikusa o tatakai, mata konoyo ni ikinagaraerareru aida, anata no uchi ni warui koto ga miidasarenaikara desu.
Tatoi hito ga tatte anata o oi, anata no inochi o motomete mo, waga kimi no inochi wa, ikite iru mono no taba ni tabanerarete, anata no kami, Shu no moto ni mamorarerudeshou. Shikashi Shu wa anata no teki no inochi o, ishinage no naka kara nageru you ni, nagesuterarerudeshou.
Soshite Shu ga anata ni tsuite katarareta subete no yoi koto o waga kimi ni okonai, anata o Isuraeru no tsukasa ni ninjirareru toki,
Anata ga, yue naku chi o nagashi, mata waga kimi ga mizukara ada o mukuita to iu koto de, sore ga anata no tsumazuki to nari, mata waga kimi no kokoro no seme to naru koto no nai you ni shite kudasai. Shu ga waga kimi o yoku serareru toki, kono hashi tame o omoidashite kudasai".
Dabide wa Abigairu ni itta, "Kyou, anata o tsukawashite, watashi o mukaesaserareta Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na.
Anata no chie wa ho mubeki ka na. Mata anata wa ho mubeki ka na. Anata wa, kyou, watashi ga kite chi o nagashi, tezukara ada o mukuiru koto o todomerareta no desu.
Watashi ga anata o gaisuru koto o todomerareta Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa makoto ni ikite orareru. Moshi anata ga isoide watashi ni ai ni konakattanaraba, asu no asa made ni wa, Nabaru no tokoro ni, hitori no otoko mo nokoranakattadeshou".
Dabide wa Abigairu ga tazusaete kita mono o sono te kara ukete, kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa buji ni nobotte, ie ni kaeri nasai. Watashi wa anata no koe o kikiire, anata no negai o yurushimasu".
Kou shite Abigairu wa Nabaru no moto ni kitaga, miyo, kare wa sono ie de, ou no shuen no you na shuen o hiraite ita. Nabaru wa kokoro ni tanoshimi, hijou ni yotte ita no de, Abigairu wa akuru asa made koto no daishou o towazu nani o mo kare ni tsugenakatta.
Asa ni natte Nabaru no yoi ga sameta toki, sono tsuma ga kare ni korera no koto o tsugeruto, kare no kokoro wa sono uchi ni shinde, kare wa ishi no you ni natta.
Tooka bakari shite Shu ga Nabaru o utareta no de kare wa shinda.
Dabide wa Nabaru ga shinda to kiite itta, "Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa watashi ga Nabaru no te kara uketa bujoku ni mukuite, shimobe ga aku o okonawanai you ni sareta. Shu wa Nabaru no akugyou o sono koube ni mukuirareta no da". Dabide wa Abigairu o tsuma ni metorouto, hito o tsukawashite kanojo ni moushikonda.
Dabide no shimobetachi wa Karumeru ni iru Abigairu no tokoro ni kite, kanojo ni itta, "Dabide wa anata o tsuma ni metorouto, wareware o anata no tokoro e tsukawashita no desu".
Abigairu wa tachi, chi ni hirefushi haishite itta, "Hashi tame wa, waga kimi no shimobetachi no ashi o arau tsukaeme desu".
Abigairu wa isoide tachi, roba ni notte, gonin no jijotachi o tsure, Dabide no shishatachi ni shitagatte iki, Dabide no tsuma to natta.
Dabide wa mata Ezureru no Ahinoamu o metotta. Kanojotachi wa futaritomo Dabide no tsuma to natta.
Tokoro de Sauru wa sono musume, Dabide no tsuma Mikaru o, Garimu no hito de aru Raishi no ko Parute ni ataeta.
Sono koro Jifu bito ga Gibea ni oru Sauru no moto ni kite itta, "Dabide wa arano no mae ni aru Hakira no yama ni kakurete irude wa arimasen ka".
Sauru wa tatte, Jifu no arano de Dabide o sagasu tame ni, Isuraeru no uchi kara eranda sanzennin o hikitsurete, Jifu no arano ni kudatta.
Sauru wa arano no mae no michi no katawara ni aru Hakira no yama ni jin o totta. Dabide wa arano ni todomatte itaga, Sauru ga jibun no ato o otte arano ni kita no o mite,
Sekkou o dashi, Sauru ga tashika ni kita no o shitta.
Soshite Dabide wa tatte, Sauru ga jin o totte iru tokoro e itte, Sauru to sono gun no chou, Neru no ko Abuneru no nete iru basho o mita. Sauru wa jinsho no uchi ni nete ite, tami wa sono shuui ni shukuei shite ita.
Dabide wa, Hete bito Ahimereku, oyobi Zeruya no ko de, Yoabu no kyoudai de aru Abishai ni itta, "Dare ga watashi to tomo ni Sauru no jin ni kudatte iku ka". Abishai wa itta, "Watashi ga issho ni kudatte ikimasu".
Kou shite Dabide to Abishai to ga yoru, tami no tokoro e itte miruto, Sauru wa jinsho no uchi ni mi o yokotaete nete ori, sono yari wa makuramoto ni chi ni tsukisashite atta. Soshite Abuneru to tamira to wa sono shuui ni nete ita.
Abishai wa Dabide ni itta, "Kami wa kyou teki o anata no te ni watasaremashita. Douzo watashi ni, kare no yari o motte hito tsuki de kare o chi ni sashi toosasete kudasai. Futatabi tsuku ni wa oyobimasen".
Shikashi Dabide wa Abishai ni itta, "Kare o koroshite wa naranai. Shu ga abura o sosogareta mono ni mukatte, te o nobe, tsumi o enai mono ga arou ka".
Dabide wa mata itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Shu ga kare o utarerude arou. Aruiha kare no shinu hi ga kurude arou. Aruiha tatakai ni kudatte itte horobirude arou.
Shu ga abura o sosogareta mono ni mukatte, watashi ga te o noberu koto o Shu wa kinjirareru. Shikashi ima, sono makuramoto ni aru yari to mizu no bin o tori nasai. Soshite wareware wa sarou".
Kou shite Dabide wa Sauru no makuramoto kara, yari to mizu no bin o totte karera wa sattaga, dare mo sore o mizu, dare mo shirazu, mata, dare mo me o samasazu, mina nemutte ita. Shu ga karera o fukaku nemurasaretakara de aru.
Dabide wa mukougawa ni watatte itte, tooku hanarete yama no itadaki ni tatta. Karera no aida no hedatari wa ookikatta.
Dabide wa tami to Neru no ko Abuneru ni yobawatte itta, "Abuneru yo, anata wa kotaenai no ka". Abuneru wa kotaete itta, "Ou o yonde iru anata wa dare ka".
Dabide wa Abuneru ni itta, "Anata wa otoko de wa nai ka. Isuraeru no uchi ni, anata ni oyobu hito ga arou ka. Sore de aru no ni, dou shite anata wa shukun de aru ou o mamoranakatta no ka. Tami no hitori ga, anata no shukun de aru ou o korosou to shite, hairikondade wa nai ka.
Anata ga shita kono koto wa yoku nai. Shu wa ikite orareru. Anata gata wa, masani shini atai suru. Shu ga abura o sosogareta, anata no shukun o mamoranakattakara da. Ima ou no yari ga doko ni aru ka. Sono makuramoto ni atta mizu no bin ga doko ni aru ka o mi nasai".
Sauru wa Dabide no koe o kikiwakete itta, "Waga ko Dabide yo, kore wa anata no koe ka". Dabide wa itta, "Ou, waga kimi yo, watashi no koe desu".
Dabide wa mata itta, "Waga kimi wa dou shite shimobe no ato o owareru no desu ka. Watashi ga nani o shita no desu ka. Watashi no te ni nan no warui koto ga aru no desu ka.
Ou, waga kimi yo, douzo, ima shimobe no kotoba o kiite kudasai. Moshi Shu ga anata o ugokashite, watashi no teki to sareta no de areba, douzo Shu ga sonaemono o ukete yawaraide kudasaru you ni. Moshi, sore ga hito de arunaraba, douzo sono hitobito ga Shu no mae ni noroi o ukeru you ni. Karera ga 'Omae wa itte ta no kamigami ni tsukae nasai' to itte, kyou, watashi o oidashi, Shu no shigyou ni azukaru koto ga dekinai you ni shitakara desu.
Sore yue ima, Shu no mae o hanarete, watashi no chi ga chi ni ochiru koto no nai you ni shite kudasai. Isuraeru no ou wa, hito ga yama de, shako o ou you ni, watashi no inochi o torou to shite dete korareta no desu".
Sono toki, Sauru wa itta, "Watashi wa tsumi o okashita. Waga ko Dabide yo, kaette kite kudasai. Kyou, watashi no inochi ga anata no me ni tattoku mirareta yue, watashi wa, mohaya anata ni gai o kuwaenaide arou. Watashi wa oroka na koto o shite, hijou na machigai o shita".
Dabide wa kotaeta, "Ou no yari wa, koko ni arimasu. Hitori no wakamono ni watatte kosase, kore o mochikaerasete kudasai.
Shu wa hito onoono ni sono gi to shinjitsu to ni shitagatte mukuiraremasu. Shu ga kyou, anata o watashi no te ni watasareta no ni, watashi wa Shu ga abura o sosogareta mono ni mukatte, te o noberu koto o shinakatta no desu.
Kyou, watashi ga anata no inochi o omonjita you ni, douzo Shu ga watashi no inochi o omonjite, moromoro no kunan kara sukuidashite kudasaru you ni".
Sauru wa Dabide ni itta, "Waga ko Dabide yo, anata wa ho mubeki ka na. Anata wa ooku no koto o okonatte, sore o nashitogerude arou". Kou shite Dabide wa sono michi o iki, Sauru wa jibun no tokoro e kaetta.
Dabide wa kokoro no uchi ni itta, "Watashi wa, itsu ka wa Sauru no te ni kakatte horobosarerude arou. Hayaku Perishite bito no chi e nogareru hoka wa nai. Sou sureba Sauru wa kono ue Isuraeru no chi ni watashi o kumanaku sagasu koto wa yame, watashi wa kare no te kara nogareru koto ga dekirude arou".
Kou shite Dabide wa, tomo ni ita roppyakunin to issho ni, tatte Gate no ou Maoku no ko Akishi no tokoro e itta.
Dabide to juushatachi wa, onoono sono kazoku to tomo ni, Gate de Akishi to tomo ni sunda. Dabide wa sono futari no tsuma, sunawachi Ezureru no onna Ahinoamu to, Karumeru no onna de Nabaru no tsuma de atta Abigairu to tomo ni otta.
Dabide ga Gate ni nogareta koto ga Sauru ni kikoeta no de, Sauru wa mohaya kare o sagasanakatta.
Sate Dabide wa Akishi ni itta, "Moshi watashi ga anata no mae ni megumi o erunaraba, douzo, inaka ni aru machi no uchi de hitotsu no basho o watashi ni ataete soko ni sumawasete kudasai. Dou shite shimobe ga anata to tomo ni ou no machi ni sumu koto ga dekimashou ka".
Akishi wa sono hi Chikuragu o kare ni ataeta. Kou shite Chikuragu wa konnichi ni itaru made Yuda no ou ni zokushite iru.
Dabide ga Perishite bito no kuni ni sunda hi no kazu wa ichi nen to yon kagetsu de atta.
Sate Dabide wa juusha to tomo ni nobotte, Geshuru bi to, Gezeru bi to oyobi Amareku bito o osotta. Korera wa mukashi kara Shuru ni itaru made no chi no juumin de atte, Ejiputo ni itaru made no chi ni sunde ita.
Dabide wa sono chi o utte, otoko mo onna mo ikashi okazu, hitsuji to ushitoro bato raku da to ifuku to o totte, Akishi no moto ni kaette kita.
Akishi ga "Anata wa kyou doko o osoimashita ka" to tazuneruto, Dabide wa, sono tokidoki, "Yuda no Negebu desu", "Erameru bito no Negebu desu" "Keni bi to no Negebu desu" to itta.
Dabide wa otoko mo onna mo ikashi okazu, hitori o mo Gate ni hiite ikanakatta. Sore wa Dabide ga, "Osoraku wa, karera ga, 'Dabide wa kou shita' to itte, wareware no koto o tsugerude arou" to omottakara de aru. Dabide wa Perishite bito no inaka ni sunde iru aida wa kou suru no ga tsune de atta.
Akishi wa Dabide o shinjite itta, "Kare wa jibun o mattaku sono tami Isuraeru ni nikumareru you ni shita. Sore yue kare wa eikyuu ni watashi no shimobe to narude arou".
Sono koro, Perishite bito ga Isuraeru to tatakaou to shite, ikusa no tame ni gunzei o atsumeta no de, Akishi wa Dabide ni itta, "Anata wa, shikato shouchi shite kudasai. Anata to anata no juushatachi to wa, watashi to tomo ni dete, gunzei ni kuwawaranakereba narimasen".
Dabide wa Akishi ni itta, "Yoroshii, anata wa shimobe ga nani o suru ka o shirarerudeshou". Akishi wa Dabide ni itta, "Yoroshii, anata o shuushin watashi no goei no chou to shiyou".
Sate Samueru wa sudeni shinde, Isuraeru no subete no hito wa kare no tame ni kanashimi, sono machi Rama ni houmutta. Mata saki ni Sauru wa kuchiyose ya uranaishi o sono chi kara tsuihou shita.
Perishite bito ga atsumatte kite Shunemu ni jin o totta no de, Sauru wa Isuraeru no subete no hito o atsumete, Giruboa ni jin o totta.
Sauru wa Perishite bito no gunzei o mite osore, sono kokoro wa itaku ononoita.
Soko de Sauru wa Shu ni ukagai o tatetaga, Shu wa yume ni yotte mo, Urimu ni yotte mo, yogensha ni yotte mo kare ni kotaerarenakatta.
Sauru wa shimobetachi ni itta, "Watashi no tame ni, kuchiyose no onna o sagashidashi nasai. Watashi wa itte sono onna ni tazuneyou". Shimobetachi wa kare ni itta, "Miyo, Endoru ni hitori no kuchiyose ga imasu".
Sauru wa sugata o kaete hoka no kimono o matoi, futari no juusha o tomonatte iki, yoru no aida ni, sono onna no tokoro ni kita. Soshite Sauru wa itta, "Watashi no tame ni kuchiyose no jutsu o itte, watashi ga anata ni tsugeru hito o yobiokoshite kudasai".
Onna wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa Sauru ga shita koto o gozonjideshou. Kare wa kuchiyose ya uranaishi o sono kuni kara tachi horoboshimashita. Dou shite anata wa, watashi no inochi ni wana o kakete, watashi o shinaseyou to suru no desu ka".
Sauru wa Shu o sashite kanojo ni chikatte itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Kono koto no tame ni anata ga batsu o ukeru koto wa naideshou".
Onna wa itta, "Anata no tame ni dare o yobiokoshimashou ka". Sauru wa itta, "Samueru o yobiokoshite kudasai".
Onna wa Samueru o mita toki, oogoe de sakenda. Soshite sono onna wa Sauru ni itta, "Dou shite anata wa watashi o azamukareta no desu ka. Anata wa Sauru desu".
Ou wa kanojo ni itta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Anata ni wa nani ga mieru no desu ka". Onna wa Sauru ni itta, "Kami no you na kata ga chi kara noborareru no ga miemasu".
Sauru wa kanojo ni itta, "Sono hito wa donna yousu o shite imasu ka". Kanojo wa itta, "Hitori no roujin ga nobotte koraremasu. Sono hito wa uwagi o matotte oraremasu". Sauru wa sono hito ga Samueru de aru no o shiri, chi ni hirefushite haishita.
Samueru wa Sauru ni itta, "Naze, watashi o yobiokoshite, watashi o wazurawasu no ka". Sauru wa itta, "Watashi wa, hijou ni nayande imasu. Perishite bito ga watashi ni mukatte ikusa o okoshi, kami wa watashi o hanarete, yogensha ni yotte mo, yume ni yotte mo, mohaya watashi ni kotaerarenai no desu. Sore de, watashi no subeki koto o shiru tame ni, anata o yobimashita".
Samueru wa itta, "Shu ga anata o hanarete, anata no teki to narareta no ni, dou shite anata wa watashi ni tou no desu ka.
Shu wa, watashi ni yotte katarareta toori ni anata ni okonawareta. Shu wa oukoku o, anata no te kara saki hanashite, anata no rinjin de aru Dabide ni ataerareta.
Anata wa Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, Shu no hageshii ikari ni shitagatte, Amareku bito o uchi horobosanakatta yue ni, Shu wa kono koto o, kono hi, anata ni okonawareta no de aru.
Shu wa mata Isuraeru o mo, anata to tomo ni, Perishite bito no te ni watasarerude arou. Asu wa, anata mo anata no kora mo watashi to issho ni narude arou. Mata Shu wa Isuraeru no gunzei o mo Perishite bito no te ni watasareru".
Sono toki Sauru wa, tadachini, chi ni nobi, taore, Samueru no kotoba no tame ni, hijou ni osore, mata sono chikara wa usete shimatta. Sono tsuitachi ichiya, shokumotsu o totte inakattakara de aru.
Onna wa Sauru no moto ni kite, kare no ononoite iru no o mite itta, "Anata no tsukaeme wa, anata no koe ni kikishitagai, watashi no inochi o kakete, anata no iwareta kotoba ni shitagaimashita.
Sore yue ima anata mo, tsukaeme no koe ni kikishitagai, hitokuchi no pan o anata no mae ni sonaesasete kudasai. Anata wa sore o meshiagatte chikara o tsuke, michi o itte kudasai".
Tokoro ga Sauru wa kotowatte itta, "Watashi wa tabemasen". Shikashi kare no shimobetachi mo, sono onna mo shiite susumeta no de, Sauru wa sono kotoba o kikiire, chi kara okiagari, toko no ue ni suwatta.
Sono onna wa ie ni koeta koushi ga atta no de, isoide sore o hofuri, mata mugiko o tori, konete, tane irenu pan o yaki,
Sauru to sono shimobetachi no mae ni motte kita no de, karera wa tabeta. Soshite karera wa tachiagatte, sono yoru no uchi ni satta.
Sate Perishite bi to wa, sono gunzei o kotogotoku Apeku ni atsumeta. Isuraeru bi to wa Ezureru ni aru izumi no katawara ni jin o totta.
Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, aruiha hyakunin, aruiha sennin o hikiite susumi, Dabide to sono juushatachi wa Akishi to tomo ni, shingari ni natte susunda.
Sono toki, Perishite bito no kimitachi wa itta, "Korera no Heburu bi to wa koko de nani o shite iru no ka". Akishi wa Perishite bitotachi ni itta, "Kore wa Isuraeru no ou Sauru no shimobe Dabide de wa nai ka. Kare wa kono higoro, kono toshigoro, watashi to tomo ni itaga, nigeochite kita hi kara kyou made, watashi wa kare ni ayamachi ga atta no o mita koto ga nai".
Shikashi Perishite bito no kimitachi wa kare ni mukatte ikatta. Soshite Perishite bito no kimitachi wa kare ni itta, "Kono hito o kaerasete, anata ga kare o oita moto no tokoro e ikase nasai. Wareware to issho ni kare o tatakai ni kudarasete wa naranai. Tatakai no toki, kare ga wareware no teki to naru ka mo shirenaikara de aru. Kono mono wa nani o motte sono shukun to yawaragu koto ga dekiyou ka. Koko ni iru hitobito no kubi o motte suru hoka wa arumai.
Kore wa, katsute hitobito ga odori no uchi ni utai kawashite, 'Sauru wa sen o uchikoroshi, Dabide wa man o uchikoroshita' to itta, ano Dabide de wa nai ka".
Soko de Akishi wa Dabide o yonde itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Anata wa tadashii hito de aru. Anata ga watashi to issho ni tatakai ni deiri suru koto o watashi wa yoi to omotte iru. Sore wa anata ga watashi no tokoro ni kita hi kara kono hi made, watashi wa, anata ni warui koto ga atta no o mita koto ga naikara de aru. Shikashi Perishite bito no kimitachi wa anata o yoku iwanai.
Sore yue ima yasuraka ni kaette iki nasai. Karera ga warui to omou koto wa shinai ga yokarou".
Dabide wa Akishi ni itta, "Shikashi watashi ga nani o shita to iu no desu ka. Watashi ga anata ni tsukae hajimeta hi kara kono hi made ni, anata wa shimobe no mi ni nani o mirareta no de, watashi wa itte, watashi no shukun de aru ou no teki to tatakau koto ga dekinai no desu ka".
Akishi wa Dabide ni kotaeta, "Watashi wa mite, anata ga kami no tsukai no you ni rippa na hito de aru koto o shitte iru. Shikashi, Perishite bito no kimitachi wa, 'Wareware to issho ni kare o tatakai ni noborasete wa naranai' to itte iru.
Sore de, anata wa, issho ni kita anata no shukun no shimobetachi to tomo ni asa hayaku oki nasai. Soshite asa hayaku oki, yoru ga akete kara sari nasai".
Kou shite Dabide to sono juushatachi to wa tomo ni Perishite bito no chi e kaerouto, asa hayaku okite shuttatsu shitaga, Perishite bi to wa Ezureru e nobotte itta.
Sate Dabide to sono juushatachi ga mikkame ni Chikuragu ni kita toki, Amareku bi to wa sudeni Negebu to Chikuragu o osotte ita. Karera wa Chikuragu o uchi, hi o hanatte kore o yaki,
Sono naka ni ita onnatachi oyobi subete no mono o horyo ni shi, chiisai mono o mo ookii mono o mo, hitori mo korosazu ni, hiite, sono michi ni itta.
Dabide to juushatachi wa sono machi ni kite, machi ga hi de yakare, sono tsuma to musuko musumera wa horyo to natta no o mita.
Dabide oyobi kare to tomo ni ita tami wa koe o agete naki, tsuini naku chikara mo nakunatta.
Dabide no futari no tsuma sunawachi Ezureru no onna Ahinoamu to, Karumeru bito Nabaru no tsuma de atta Abigairu mo horyo ni natta.
Sono toki, Dabide wa hijou ni nayanda. Sore wa tami ga mina onoono sono musuko musume no tame ni kokoro o itameta tame, Dabide o ishi de utou to ittakara de aru. Shikashi Dabide wa sono kami, Shu ni yotte jibun o chikarazuketa.
Dabide wa Ahimereku no ko, saishi Abiyataru ni, "Epode o watashi no tokoro ni motte ki nasai" to itta no de, Abiyataru wa, Epode o Dabide no tokoro ni motte kita.
Dabide wa Shu ni ukagai o tatete itta, "Watashi wa kono guntai no ato o oubeki desu ka. Watashi wa sore ni oitsuku koto ga dekimashou ka". Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Oi nasai. Anata wa kanarazu oitsuite, tashika ni sukuidasu koto ga dekirude arou".
Soko de Dabide wa, issho ni ita roppyakunin no mono to tomo ni shuttatsu shite Besoru kawa e ittaga, ato ni nokoru mono wa soko ni todomatta.
Sunawachi Dabide wa yonhyakunin to tomo ni tsuigeki o tsuzuketaga, tsukarete Besoru kawa o watarenai mono nihyakunin wa todomatta.
Karera wa no de, hitori no Ejiputo bito o mite, sore o Dabide no moto ni hiite kite, pan o tabesase, mizu o nomaseta.
Mata karera wa hoshi ichijiku no katamari hitotsu to, hoshi budou ni fusa o kare ni ataeta. Kare wa tabete genki o kaifuku shita. Kare wa mikka san yo, pan o tabezu, mizu o nonde inakattakara de aru.
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa dare no mono ka. Doko kara kita no ka". Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa Ejiputo no wakamono de, Amareku bito no dorei desu. Mikka mae ni watashi ga byouki ni natta no de, shujin wa watashi o sutete ikimashita.
Watashidomo wa, Kerete bito no Negebu to, Yuda ni zokusuru chi to, Karebu no Negebu o osoi, mata hi de Chikuragu o yakiharaimashita".
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa sono guntai no tokoro e watashi o michibiki kudatte kureru ka". Kare wa itta, "Anata wa watashi o korosanai koto, mata watashi o shujin no te ni watasanai koto o, kami o sashite watashi ni chikatte kudasai. Sou sureba anata o sono guntai no tokoro e michibiki kudarimashou".
Kare wa Dabide o michibiki kudattaga, miyo, karera wa Perishite bito no chi to Yuda no chi kara ubaitotta samazama no ooku no bundori mono no yue ni, kui nomi, katsu odorinagara, chi no omote ni amaneku chiri hirogatte ita.
Dabide wa yuugure kara yokujitsu no yuugata made, karera o utta no de, rakuda ni notte nigeta yonhyakunin no wakamonotachi no hoka ni wa, hitori mo nogareta mono wa nakatta.
Kou shite Dabide wa Amareku bito ga ubaitotta mono o mina torimodoshita. Mata Dabide wa sono futari no tsuma o sukuidashita.
Soshite karera ni zokusuru mono wa, chiisai mono mo ookii mono mo, musuko mo musume mo bundori mono mo, Amareku bito ga ubaisatta mono wa nani o mo ushinawanaide, Dabide ga mina torimodoshita.
Dabide wa mata subete no hitsuji to ushi o totta. Hitobito wa korera no kachiku o kare no mae ni otte ikinagara, "Kore wa Dabide no bundori mono da" to itta.
Soshite Dabide ga, ano tsukarete Dabide ni tsuite iku koto ga dekizu ni, Besoru kawa no hotori ni todomatte ita nihyakunin no mono no tokoro e kita toki, karera wa dete kite Dabide o mukae, mata Dabide to tomo ni iru tami o mukaeta. Dabide wa tami ni chikazuite sono anpi o touta.
Sono toki Dabide to tomo ni itta hitobito no uchi de, waruku, katsu yokoshima na monodomo wa mina itta, "Karera wa wareware to tomo ni ikanakatta no dakara, wareware wa sono hitobito ni wareware no torimodoshita bundori mono o wakeataeru koto wa dekinai. Tada onoono ni sono saishi o ataete, tsurete ikasemashou".
Shikashi Dabide wa itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, Shu wa wareware o mamotte, semete kita guntai o wareware no te ni watasareta. Sono Shu ga tamawatta mono o, anata gata wa sono you ni shite wa naranai.
Dare ga kono koto ni tsuite, anata gata ni kikishitagaimasu ka. Tatakai ni kudatte itta mono no wakemae to, nimotsu no katawara ni todomatte ita mono no wakemae o douyou ni shinakereba naranai. Karera wa hitoshiku wakemae o ukerubekide aru".
Kono hi irai, Dabide wa kore o Isuraeru no sadame to shi, okite to shite konnichi ni oyonde iru.
Dabide wa Chikuragu ni kite, sono bundori mono no ichibu o Yuda no chourou de aru yuujintachi ni okutte itta, "Kore wa Shu no teki kara totta bundori mono no uchi kara anata gata ni okuru okurimono de aru".
Sono okurisaki wa, Beteru ni iru hitobito, Negebu no Ramote ni iru hitobito, YaTteru ni iru hitobito,
Aroeru ni iru hitobito, Shifumote ni iru hitobito, Eshitemoa ni iru hitobito, Rakaru ni iru hitobito,
Erameru bito no machimachi ni iru hitobito, Keni bi to no machimachi ni iru hitobito,
Horuma ni iru hitobito, Borashan ni iru hitobito, Ataku ni iru hitobito,
Heburon ni iru hitobito, oyobi Dabide to sono juushatachi ga, samayoi aruita subete no tokoro ni iru hitobito de atta.
Sate Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru to tatakatta. Isuraeru no hitobito wa Perishite bito no mae kara nige, ooku no mono wa kizutsuite Giruboa yama ni taoreta.
Perishite bi to wa Sauru to sono kora ni semeyori, soshite Perishite bi to wa Sauru no ko Yonatan, Abinadabu, oyobi Marukishua o koroshita.
Tatakai wa hageshiku Sauru ni semari, yumi o iru monodomo ga Sauru o mitsukete, kare o ita no de, Sauru wa iru monotachi ni hidoi kizu o owasareta.
Soko de Sauru wa sono buki o toru mono ni itta, "Tsurugi o nuki, sore o motte watashi o sase. Samo naito, korera no mukatsurei no monodomo ga kite, watashi o sashi, watashi o naburigoroshi ni surude arou". Shikashi sono buki o toru mono wa, hijou ni osorete, sore ni oujinakatta no de, Sauru wa, tsurugi o totte, sono ue ni fushita.
Buki o toru mono wa Sauru ga shinda no o mite, jibun mo mata tsurugi no ue ni fushite, kare to tomo ni shinda.
Kou shite Sauru to sono sannin no kotachi, oyobi Sauru no buki o toru mono, narabi ni sono juushatachi wa mina, kono hitomo ni shinda.
Isuraeru no hitobito de, tani no mukougawa, oyobi Yorudan no mukougawa ni iru mono ga, Isuraeru no hitobito no nigeru no o mi, mata Sauru to sono kotachi no shinda no o mite machimachi o sutete nigeta no de, Perishite bi to wa kite sono naka ni sunda.
Akuruhi, Perishite bi to wa korosareta mono kara, hagitoru tame ni kitaga, Sauru to sono sannin no kotachi ga Giruboa yama ni taorete iru no o mitsuketa.
Karera wa Sauru no kubi o kiri, sono yoroi o hagitori, Perishite bito no zenchi ni hito o tsukawashite, kono yoi shirase o, sono guuzou to tami to ni tsutaesaseta.
Mata karera wa, sono yoroi o Ashitarote no shinden ni oki, kare no karada o Beteshan no jouheki ni kugizuke ni shita.
Yabeshi gireade no juumintachi wa, Perishite bito ga Sauru ni shita koto o kiite,
Yuushitachi wa mina tachi, yomosugara itte, Sauru no karada to, sono kotachi no karada o Beteshan no jouheki kara torioroshi, Yabeshi ni kite, kore o soko de yaki,
Sono hone o totte, Yabeshi nogi ryuu no ki no shita ni houmuri, nanuka no aida, danjiki shita.
Sauru ga shinda nochi, Dabide wa Amareku bito o utte kaeri, futsu ka no aida Chikuragu ni todomatte itaga,
Mikkame to natte, hitori no hito ga, sono kimono o saki, atama ni tsuchi o kabutte, Sauru no jin'ei kara kita. Soshite Dabide no moto ni kite, chi ni fushite haishita.
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa doko kara kita no ka". Kare wa Dabide ni itta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru no jin'ei kara, nogarete kita no desu".
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Yousu wa dou de atta ka hanashi nasai". Kare wa kotaeta, "Tami wa tatakai kara nige, tami no ooku wa taorete shini, Sauru to sono ko Yonatan mo mata shinimashita".
Dabide wa jibun to hanashite iru wakamono ni itta, "Anata wa Sauru to sono ko Yonatan ga shinda no o, dou shite shitta no ka".
Kare ni hanashite iru wakamono wa itta, "Watashi wa, hakarazu mo, Giruboa yama ni imashitaga, Sauru wa sono yari ni yori kakatte ori, sensha to kihei to ga kare ni semeyorou to shite imashita.
Sono toki, kare wa ushiro o furimuite watashi o mi, watashi o yobimashita no de, 'Koko ni imasu' to watashi wa kotaemashita.
Kare wa 'Omae wa dare ka' to iimashita no de, 'Amareku bito desu' to kotaemashita.
Kare wa mata watashi ni iimashita, 'Soba ni kite koroshite kudasai. Watashi wa kurushimi ni taenai. Mada inochi ga arukara desu'.
Soko de, watashi wa sono soba ni itte kare o koroshimashita. Kare ga sudeni taorete, ikiru koto no dekinai no o shittakara desu. Soshite watashi wa kare no atama ni atta kanmuri to, ude ni tsukete ita udewa to o totte, sore o waga Shu no moto ni tazusaete kita no desu".
Sono toki Dabide wa jibun no kimono o tsukande sore o saki, kare to tomo ni ita hitobito mo mina onaji you ni shita.
Karera wa Sauru no tame, mata sono ko Yonatan no tame, mata Shu no tami no tame, mata Isuraeru no ie no tame ni kanashimi naite, yuugure made shoku o tatta. Sore wa karera ga tsurugi ni taoretakara de aru.
Dabide wa jibun to hanashite ita wakamono ni itta, "Anata wa doko no hito desu ka". Kare wa itta, "Amareku bito de, kiryuu no takokujin no ko desu".
Dabide wa mata kare ni itta, "Dou shite anata wa te o nobete Shu no abura o sosogareta mono o korosu koto o osorenakatta no desu ka".
Dabide wa hitori no wakamono o yobi, "Chikayotte kare o ute" to itta. Soko de kare o utta no de shinda.
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Anata no nagashita chi no seme wa anata ni kisuru. Anata ga jibun no kuchi kara, 'Watashi wa Shu no abura o sosogareta mono o koroshita' to itte, jishin ni mukatte shouko o tatetakara de aru".
Dabide wa kono kanashimi no uta o motte, Sauru to sono ko Yonatan no tame ni aitou shita. - -
Kore wa, Yuda no hitobito ni oshieru tame no yumi no uta de, Yasharu no sho ni shirusarete iru. - - kare wa itta,
"Isuraeru yo, anata no eikou wa, anata no takaki tokoro de korosareta. Aa, yuushitachi wa, tsuini taoreta.
Gate ni kono koto o tsugete wa ikenai. Ashikeron no chimata ni tsutaete wa naranai. Osoraku wa Perishite bito no musumetachi ga yorokobi, katsurei naki mono no musumetachi ga kachihokorude arou.
Giruboa no yama yo, tsuyu wa omae no ue ni oriru na. Shi no no yo, ame mo omae no ue ni furu na. Sono tokoro ni yuushitachi no tate wa suterare, Sauru no tate wa abura o nurazu ni suterareta.
Koroshita mono no chi o nomazu ni wa, Yonatan no yumi wa shirizokazu, yuushi no shibou o tabenaide wa, Sauru no tsurugi wa, munashiku wa kaeranakatta.
Sauru to Yonatan to wa, aisare, katsu yorokobareta. Karera wa ikiru ni mo, shinu ni mo hanarezu, washi yori mo hayaku, shishi yori mo tsuyokatta.
Isuraeru no musumetachi yo, Sauru no tame ni nake. Kare wa hiiro no kimono o motte, hanayaka ni anatagata o yosooi, anata gata no kimono ni kin no kazari o tsuketa.
Aa, yuushitachi wa tatakai no sanaka ni taoreta. Yonatan wa, anata no takaki tokoro de korosareta.
Waga kyoudai Yonatan yo, anata no tame watashi wa kanashimu. Anata wa watashi ni totte, itomo tanoshii mono de atta. Anata ga watashi o aisuru no wa yo no tsune no you de naku, onna no ai ni mo masatte ita.
Aa, yuushitachi wa taoreta. Tatakai no utsuwa wa useta".
Kono nochi, Dabide wa Shu ni toute itta, "Watashi wa Yuda no hitotsu no machi ni noborubekideshou ka". Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Nobori nasai". Dabide wa itta, "Doko e noborubekideshou ka". Shu wa iwareta, "Heburon e".
Soko de Dabide wa sono tokoro e nobotta. Kare no futari no tsuma, Ezureru no onna Ahinoamu to, Karumeru bito Nabaru no tsuma de atta Abigairu mo nobotta.
Dabide wa mata jibun to tomo ni ita hitobito o, mina sono kazoku to tomo ni tsurete nobotta. Soshite karera wa Heburon no machimachi ni sunda.
Toki ni Yuda no hitobito ga kite, sono tokoro de Dabide ni abura o sosogi, Yuda no ie no ou to shita. Hitobito ga Dabide ni tsugete, "Sauru o houmutta no wa yabeshi gireade no hitobito de aru" to itta no de,
Dabide wa shisha o yabeshi gireade no hitobito ni tsukawashite karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa, shukun Sauru ni kono chuusei o arawashite kare o houmutta. Douzo Shu ga anatagata o shukufuku sareru you ni.
Douzo Shu ga ima anata gata ni, itsukushimi to shinjitsu o shimesareru you ni. Anata ga taga, kono koto o shita no de, watashi mo mata anata gata ni koui o shimesude arou.
Ima anata gata wa te o tsuyoku shi, ooshiku are. Anata gata no shukun Sauru wa shini, Yuda no ie ga watashi ni abura o sosoide, karera no ou to shitakara de aru".
Sate Sauru no gun no chou, Neru no ko Abuneru wa, saki ni Sauru no ko Ishibosete o tori, Mahanaimu ni tsurete watari,
Kare o Gireade, Ashuru bi to, Ezureru, Efuraimu, Beniyamin oyobi zenIsuraeru no ou to shita.
Sauru no ko Ishibosete wa Isuraeru no ou to natta toki, yonjuusai de atte, ni nen no aida, yo o osametaga, Yuda no ie wa Dabide ni shitagatta.
Dabide ga Heburon ni ite Yuda no ie no ou de atta nissuu wa nana nen to roku kagetsu de atta.
Neru no ko Abuneru, oyobi Sauru no ko Ishibosete no keraitachi wa Mahanaimu o dete Gibeon e itta.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu to Dabide no keraitachi mo dete itte, Gibeon no ike no soba de karera to deai, ippou wa ike no kochiragawa ni, ippou wa ike no achiragawa ni suwatta.
Abuneru wa Yoabu ni itta, "Saa, wakamonotachi o tatasete, wareware no mae de shoubu o saseyou". Yoabu wa itta, "Karera o tataseyou".
Kou shite Sauru no ko Ishibosete to Beniyamin bito to no tame ni juu ninin, oyobi Dabide no keraitachi juu ninin o kazoete dashita. Karera wa tatte susumi,
Onoono aite no atama o torae, tsurugi o aite no wakibara ni sashi, kou shite karera wa tomo ni taoreta. Sore yue, sono tokoro wa herukate hazurimu to yobareta. Sore wa Gibeon ni aru.
Sono hi, tatakai wa hijou ni hageshiku, Abuneru to Isuraeru no hitobito wa Dabide no keraitachi no mae ni yabureta.
Sono tokoro ni Zeruya no sannin no ko, Yoabu, Abishai, oyobi Asaheru ga itaga, Asaheru wa ashi no hayai koto, no no kamoshika no you de atta.
Asaheru wa Abuneru no ato o otte ittaga, iku no ni migi ni mo hidari ni mo magaru koto naku, Abuneru no ato ni hashitta.
Abuneru wa ushiro o furimuite itta, "Anata wa Asaheru de atta ka". Asaheru wa kotaeta, "Watashi desu".
Abuneru wa kare ni itta, "Migi ka hidari ni magatte, wakamono no hitori o torae, sono yoroi o ubai nasai". Shikashi Asaheru wa Abuneru o ou koto o yamezu, hoka ni mukaou to mo shinakatta.
Abuneru wa futatabi Asaheru ni itta, "Watashi o ou koto o yamete, hoka ni mukai nasai. Anata o chi ni uchitaosu koto nado, dou shite watashi ni dekiyou ka. Sore o sureba, watashi wa, dou shite anata no ani Yoabu ni kao o awaseru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Sore de mo nao kare wa, hoka ni mukau koto o kobanda no de, Abuneru wa, yari no ishitsuki de kare no hara o tsuita no de, yari wa sono senaka ni deta. Kare wa soko ni taorete, sono ba de shinda. Soshite Asaheru ga taorete shinde iru basho ni kuru mono wa mina tachi todomatta.
Shikashi Yoabu to Abishai to wa, nao Abuneru no ato o ottaga, karera ga Gibeon no arano no michi no hotori, Gia no mae ni aru Anma no yama ni kita toki, hi wa kureta.
Beniyamin no hitobito wa Abuneru no ato ni tsuite kite, atsumari, ittai to natte, hitotsu no yama no itadaki ni tatta.
Sono toki Abuneru wa Yoabu ni yobawatte itta, "Itsu made mo tsurugi o motte horobosou to suru no ka. Anata wa sono kekka no hisan na no o shiranai no ka. Itsu made tami ni sono kyoudai o ou koto o yameyo to meijinai no ka".
Yoabu wa itta, "Kami wa ikite orareru. Moshi anata ga ii dasanakattanaraba, tami wa onoono sono kyoudai o owazu ni, asa no uchi ni satte itade arou".
Kou shite Yoabu wa tsunobue o fuita no de, tami wa mina tachi todomatte, mohaya Isuraeru no ato o owazu, mata kasanete tatakawanakatta.
Abuneru to sono juushatachi wa, yomosugara, Araba o tootte iki, Yorudan o watari, hiru made koushin o tsuzukete Mahanaimu ni tsuita.
Yoabu wa Abuneru o ou koto o yamete kaeri, tami o mina atsumetaga, Dabide no keraitachi juu kyuuhito to Asaheru to ga miataranakatta.
Shikashi, Dabide no keraitachi wa, Abuneru no juusha de aru Beniyamin no hitobito sanbyaku rokujuunin o uchikoroshita.
Hitobito wa Asaheru o toriagete Betsurehemu ni aru sono chichi no haka ni houmutta. Yoabu to sono juushatachi wa, yomosugara itte, yoake ni Heburon ni tsuita.
Sauru no ie to Dabide no ie to no aida no sensou wa hisashiku tsuzuki, Dabide wa masumasu tsuyoku nari, Sauru no ie wa masumasu yowaku natta.
Heburon de Dabide ni otokonoko ga umareta. Kare no choushi wa Ezureru no onna Ahinoamu no unda Amunon,
Sono tsugi wa Karumeru bito Nabaru no tsuma de atta Abigairu no unda Kireabu, daisan wa Geshuru no ou Tarumai no musume Maaka no ko Abusaromu,
Daiyon wa Hagite no ko Adoniya, daigo wa Abitaru no ko Shipateya,
Dairoku wa Dabide no tsuma Egura no unda Itereamu. Korera no ko ga Heburon de Dabide ni umareta.
Sauru no ie to Dabide no ie to ga tatakai o tsuzukete iru aida ni, Abuneru wa Sauru no ie de, tsuyoku natte kita.
Sate Sauru ni wa, hitori no sobame ga atta. Sono na o Rizupa to ii, Aya no musume de attaga, Ishibosete wa Abuneru ni itta, "Anata wa naze watashi no chichi no sobame no tokoro ni haitta no desu ka".
Abuneru wa Ishibosete no kotoba o kiki, hijou ni ikatte itta, "Watashi wa Yuda no inu no kashira desu ka. Watashi wa kyou, anata no chichi Sauru no ie to, sono kyoudai to, sono yuujin to ni chuusei o arawashite, anata o Dabide no te ni watasu koto o shinakatta no ni, anata wa kyou, onna no koto no ayamachi o agete watashi o semerareru.
Shu ga Dabide ni chikawareta koto o, watashi ga kare no tame ni nashitogenainaraba, kami ga Abuneru o ikue ni mo basshirareru you ni.
Sunawachi oukoku o Sauru no ie kara utsushi, Dabide no kurai o Dan kara Beerushiba ni itaru made, Isuraeru to Yuda no ue ni tataserarerude arou".
Ishibosete wa Abuneru o osoreta no de, hitokoto mo kare ni kotaeru koto ga dekinakatta.
Abuneru wa Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Kuni wa dare no mono desu ka. Watashi to keiyaku o musubi nasai. Watashi wa anata ni chikarazoe shite, Isuraeru o kotogotoku anata no mono ni shimashou".
Dabide wa itta, "Yoroshii. Watashi wa, anata to keiyaku o musubimashou. Tadashi hitotsu no koto o anata ni motomemasu. Anata ga kite watashi no kao o miru toki, mazu Sauru no musume Mikaru o tsurete kuru no de nakereba, watashi no kao o miru koto wa dekimasen".
Sore kara Dabide wa shisha o Sauru no ko Ishibosete ni tsukawashite itta, "Perishite bito no you no kawa ichi hyaku o motte metotta watashi no tsuma Mikaru o hikiwatashi nasai".
Soko de Ishibosete wa hito o yatte kanojo o sono otto, Raishi no ko Paruteeru kara totta no de,
Sono otto wa kanojo to tomo ni iki, nakinagara kanojo no ato ni tsuite, Bahorimu made ittaga, Abuneru ga kare ni "Kaette ike" to itta no de kare wa kaetta.
Abuneru wa Isuraeru no chouroutachi to kyougi shite itta, "Anata gata wa izen kara Dabide o anata gata no ou to suru koto o motomete imashitaga,
Ima sore o shi nasai. Shu ga Dabide ni tsuite, 'Watashi no shimobe Dabide no te ni yotte, watashi no tami Isuraeru o Perishite bito no te, oyobi moromoro no teki no te kara sukuidasude arou' to iwaretakara desu".
Abuneru wa mata Beniyamin ni mo katatta. Soshite Abuneru wa, Isuraeru to Beniyamin no zenka ga yoi to omou koto o mina, Heburon de Dabide ni tsugeyou to shite shuppatsu shita.
Abuneru ga nijuunin o shitagaete Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni itta toki, Dabide wa Abuneru to kare ni shitagatte iru juushatachi no tame ni shuen o mouketa.
Abuneru wa Dabide ni itta, "Watashi wa tatte iki, Isuraeru o kotogotoku, waga Shu, ou no moto ni atsumete, anata to keiyaku o musubase, anata no nozomu mono o kotogotoku osamerareru you ni itashimashou". Kou shite Dabide wa Abuneru o okuri kaeraseta no de kare wa anzen ni satte itta.
Choudo sono toki, Dabide no keraitachi wa Yoabu to tomo ni ooku no bundori mono o tazusaete ryakudatsu kara kaette kita. Shikashi Abuneru wa Heburon no Dabide no moto ni wa inakatta. Dabide ga kare o kaerasete kare ga anzen ni sattakara de aru.
Yoabu oyobi kare to tomo ni ita gunzei ga mina kaette kita toki, hitobito wa Yoabu ni itta, "Neru no ko Abuneru ga ou no moto ni kitaga, ou ga kare o kaeraseta no de kare wa anzen ni satta".
Soko de Yoabu wa ou no moto ni itte itta, "Anata wa nani o nasatta no desu ka. Abuneru ga anata no tokoro ni kita no ni, anata wa dou shite, kare o kaeshi saraserareta no desu ka.
Neru no ko Abuneru ga anata o azamuku tame ni kita koto, soshite anata no deiri o shiri, mata anata no nasatte iru koto o, kotogotoku shiru tame ni kita koto o anata wa gozonji desu".
Yoabu wa Dabide no tokoro kara dete kite, shisha o tsukawashi, Abuneru o owaseta no de, karera wa Shira no ido kara kare o tsurete kaetta. Shikashi Dabide wa sono koto o shiranakatta.
Abuneru ga Heburon ni kaette kita toki, Yoabu wa hisoka ni katarou to itte kare o mon no uchi ni tsurete iki, sono tokoro de kare no hara o sashite shinase, jibun no kyoudai Asaheru no chi o mukuita.
Sono nochi Dabide wa kono koto o kiite itta, "Watashi to watashi no oukoku to wa, Neru no ko Abuneru no chi ni kanshite, Shu no mae ni eikyuu ni tsumi wa nai.
Douzo, sono tsumi ga Yoabu no atama to, sono chichi no zenka ni kisuru you ni. Mata Yoabu no ie ni wa ryuushutsu o yamu mono, raibyounin, tsue ni tayoru mono, tsurugi ni taoreru mono, mata wa shokumotsu no toboshii mono ga taenai you ni".
Kou shite Yoabu to sono otouto Abishai to wa Abuneru o koroshitaga, sore wa kare ga Gibeon no tatakai de karera no kyoudai Asaheru o koroshita tame de atta.
Dabide wa Yoabu oyobi jibun to tomo ni iru subete no tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa kimono o saki, aranuno o matoi, Abuneru no mae ni nagekinagara iki nasai". Soshite Dabide ou wa sono kan no ato ni shitagatta.
Hitobito wa Abuneru o Heburon ni houmutta. Ou wa Abuneru no haka de koe o agete naki, tami mo mina naita.
Ou wa Abuneru no tame ni kanashimi no uta o tsukutte itta, "Oroka na hito no shinu you ni, Abuneru ga dou shite shinda no ka.
Anata no te wa shibararezu, ashi ni wa ashikase mo kakerarenai no ni, akunin no mae ni taoreru hito no you ni, anata wa taoreta". Soshite tami wa mina, futatabi kare no tame ni naita.
Tami wa mina kite, hi no aru uchi ni, Dabide ni pan o tabesaseyou to shitaga, Dabide wa chikatte itta, "Moshi watashi ga hi no iru mae ni, pan de mo, hoka no mono de mo ajiwaunaraba, kami ga watashi o ikue ni mo basshirareru you ni".
Tami wa mina sore o mite manzoku shita. Subete ou no suru koto wa tami o manzoku saseta.
Sono hi subete no tami oyobi Isuraeru wa mina, Neru no ko Abuneru o koroshita no wa, ou no ishi ni yoru mono de nai koto o shitta.
Ou wa sono keraitachi ni itta, "Kono hi Isuraeru de, hitori no idai naru shougun ga taoreta no o anata gata wa shiranai no ka.
Watashi wa abura o sosogareta ou de arukeredo mo, konnichi nao yowai. Zeruya no ko de aru korera no hitobito wa watashi no te ni oenai. Douzo Shu ga aku o okonau mono ni, sono aku ni shitagatte mukuirareru you ni".
Sauru no ko Ishibosete wa, Abuneru ga Heburon de shinda koto o kiite, sono chikara o ushinai, Isuraeru wa mina awateta.
Sauru no ko Ishibosete ni wa futari no ryakudatsutai no taichou ga atta. Hitori no na wa Baana, ta no hitori no na wa Rekabu to itte, Beniyamin no shison de aru Berote bito Rinmon no kotachi de atta. (sore wa Berote mo mata Beniyamin no uchi ni kazoerarete irukara de aru.
Berote bito wa GiTtaimu ni nigete itte, konnichi made sono tokoro ni kiryuu shite iru).
Sate Sauru no ko Yonatan ni ashi no naeta ko ga hitori atta. Ezureru kara Sauru to Yonatan no koto no shirase ga kita toki, kare wa gosai de atta. Uba ga kare o daite nigetaga, isoide nigeru toki, sono ko wa ochite ashi na e to natta. Sono na wa Mepibosete to itta.
Berote bito Rinmon no kotachi, Rekabu to Baana to wa shuttatsu shite, hi no atsui koro Ishibosete no ie ni kitaga, Ishibosete wa hirune o shite ita.
Ie no mon o mamoru onna wa mugi o aogi wakete itaga, nemuku natte nete shimatta. Soko de Rekabu to sono kyoudai Baana wa, hisoka ni naka ni haitta.
Karera ga ie ni haitta toki, Ishibosete wa shinshitsu de yuka no ue ni nete ita no de, karera wa sore o utte koroshi, sono kubi o hane, sono kubi o totte, yomosugara Araba no michi o iki,
Ishibosete no kubi o Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni tazusaete itte ou ni itta, "Anata no inochi o motometa anata no teki Sauru no ko Ishibosete no kubi desu. Shu wa kyou, waga kimi, ou no tame ni Sauru to sono sue to ni houfuku saremashita".
Dabide wa Berote bito Rinmon no ko Rekabu to sono kyoudai Baana ni kotaeta, "Watashi no inochi o, moromoro no kunan kara sukuwareta Shu wa ikite orareru.
Watashi wa katsute, hito ga watashi ni tsugete, 'Miyo, Sauru wa shinda' to itte, mizukara yoi otozure o tsutaeru mono to omotte ita mono o toraete Chikuragu de koroshi, sono otozure ni mukuita no da.
Akunin ga tadashii hito o sono ie no yuka no ue de koroshita toki wa, naosara no koto da. Ima watashi ga, kare no chi o nagashita tsumi o mukui, anatagata o, kono chi kara tachi horobosanaide okude arou ka".
Soshite Dabide wa wakamonotachi ni meijita no de, wakamonotachi wa karera o koroshi, sono teashi o kirihanashi, Heburon no ike no hotori de ki ni kaketa. Hitobito wa Ishibosete no kubi o motte itte, Heburon ni aru Abuneru no haka ni houmutta.
Isuraeru no subete no buzoku wa Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni kite itta, "Wareware wa, anata no kotsuniku desu.
Saki ni Sauru ga wareware no ou de atta toki ni mo, anata wa Isuraeru o hikiite deiri saremashita. Soshite Shu wa anata ni, 'Anata wa watashi no tami Isuraeru o boku surude arou. Mata anata wa Isuraeru no kimi to narude arou' to iwaremashita".
Kono you ni Isuraeru no chouroutachi ga mina, Heburon ni iru ou no moto ni kita no de, Dabide ou wa Heburon de Shu no mae ni karera to keiyaku o musunda. Soshite karera wa Dabide ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to shita.
Dabide wa ou to natta toki sanjuusai de, yonjuu nen no aida, yo o osameta.
Sunawachi Heburon de nana nen roku kagetsu Yuda o osame, mata Erusaremu de sanjuu san nen, zenIsuraeru to Yuda o osameta.
Ou to sono juushatachi to wa Erusaremu e itte, sono chi no juumin Ebusu bito o semeta. Ebusu bito wa Dabide ni itta, "Anata wa kesshite, koko ni semeiru koto wa dekinai. Kaette, meshi iya ashi na e de mo, anata o oiharaude arou". Karera ga "Dabide wa koko ni semeiru koto wa dekinai" to omottakara de aru.
Tokoro ga Dabide wa Shion no yougai o totta. Kore ga Dabide no machi de aru.
Sono hi Dabide wa, "Dare de mo Ebusu bito o utou to suru hito wa, mizu o kumiageru tateana o nobotte itte, Dabide ga kokoro ni nikunde iru ashi na e yame shii o ute" to itta. Sore yue ni hitobito wa, "Meshi iya ashi nae wa, miya ni haitte wa naranai" to iinarawashite iru.
Dabide wa sono yougai ni sunde, kore o Dabide no machi to nazuketa. Mata Dabide wa Miro kara uchi no shuui ni jouheki o kizuita.
Kou shite Dabide wa masumasu ooinaru mono to nari, katsu bangun no kami, Shu ga kare to tomo ni orareta.
Tsuro no ou Hiramu wa Dabide ni shisha o tsukawashite, kouhaku oyobi daiku to ishiku o okutta. Karera wa Dabide no tame ni ie o tateta.
Soshite Dabide wa Shu ga jibun o kataku tatete Isuraeru no ou to sareta koto, Shu ga sono tami Isuraeru no tame ni sono oukoku o okosareta koto o satotta.
Dabide wa Heburon kara kite nochi, sarani Erusaremu de tsuma to sobame o ireta no de, musuko to musume ga mata Dabide ni umareta.
Erusaremu de kare ni umareta mono no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Shanmua, Shobabu, Natan, Soromon,
Ibuharu, Erishua, Nepegu, Yapia,
Erishama, Eriada, oyobi Eriperete.
Sate Perishite bi to wa, Dabide ga abura o sosogarete Isuraeru no ou ni natta koto o kiki, mina nobotte kite Dabide o sagashitaga, Dabide wa sore o kiite yougai ni kudatte itta.
Perishite bi to wa kite, Repaimu no tani ni hirogatte ita.
Dabide wa Shu ni toute itta, "Perishite bito ni mukatte noborubekideshou ka. Anata wa karera o watashi no te ni watasarerudeshou ka". Shu wa Dabide ni iwareta, "Noboru ga yoi. Watashi wa kanarazu Perishite bito o anata no te ni watasude arou".
Soko de Dabide wa Baaru Perajimu e itte, karera o sono tokoro de uchiyaburi, soshite itta, "Shu wa, yaburi deru mizu no you ni, teki o watashi no mae ni yaburareta". Sore yue ni sono tokoro no na wa Baaru Perajimu to yobarete iru.
Perishite bi to wa sono tokoro ni karera no guuzou o sutete itta no de, Dabide to sono juushatachi wa sore o hakobisatta.
Perishite bito ga, futatabi nobotte kite, Repaimu no tani ni hirogatta no de,
Dabide wa Shu ni toutaga, Shu wa iwareta, "Nobotte wa naranai. Karera no ushiro ni mawari, Barusamu no ki no mae kara karera o osoi nasai.
Barusamu no ki no ue ni koushin no oto ga kikoetanaraba, anata wa furuitatanakereba naranai. Sono toki, Shu ga anata no mae ni dete, Perishite bito no gunzei o utarerukara de aru".
Dabide wa, Shu ga meijirareta you ni shite, Perishite bito o uchi, Geba kara Gezeru ni oyonda.
Dabide wa futatabi Isuraeru no erinuki no mono san mannin o kotogotoku atsumeta.
Soshite Dabide wa tatte, jibun to tomo ni iru subete no tami to tomo ni Baare Yuda e itte, kami no hako o soko kara kaki noborou to shita. Kono hako wa kerubimu no ue ni zashite orareru bangun no Shu no na o motte yobarete iru.
Karera wa kami no hako o atarashii kuruma ni nosete, yama no ue ni aru Abinadabu no ie kara hakobidashita.
Abinadabu no kotachi, Uza to Ahio to ga kami no hako o noseta atarashii kuruma o shiki shi, Uza wa kami no hako no katawara ni soi, Ahio wa hako no mae ni susunda.
Dabide to Isuraeru no zenka wa koto to tategoto to te tsuzumi to suzu to Shinbaru to o motte uta o utai, chikara o kiwamete, Shu no mae ni odotta.
Karera ga Nakon no uchi ba ni kita toki, Uza wa kami no hako ni te o nobete, sore o osaeta. Ushi ga tsumazuitakara de aru.
Suru to Shu wa Uzani mukatte ikari o hasshi, kare ga te o hako ni nobeta no de, kare o sono ba de utareta. Kare wa kami no hako no katawara de shinda.
Shu ga Uza o utareta no de, Dabide wa ikatta. Sono tokoro wa konnichi made perezu uza to yobarete iru.
Sono hi Dabide wa Shu o osorete itta, "Dou shite Shu no hako ga watashi no tokoro ni kuru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Dabide wa Shu no hako o Dabide no machi ni ireru koto o konomazu, kore o utsushite Gate bito Obedeedomu no ie ni hakobaseta.
Kami no hako wa Gate bito Obedeedomu no ie ni san kagetsu todomatta. Shu wa Obedeedomu to sono zenka o shukufuku sareta.
Shikashi Dabide ou wa, "Shu ga kami no hako no yue ni, Obedeedomu no ie to sono subete no shoyuu o shukufuku sarete iru" to kiki, Dabide wa itte, yorokobi o motte, kami no hako o Obedeedomu no ie kara Dabide no machi ni kaki nobotta.
Shu no hako o kaku mono ga roku ho susunda toki, Dabide wa ushi to koeta mono o gisei to shite sasageta.
Soshite Dabide wa chikara o kiwamete, Shu no hako no mae de odotta. Sono toki Dabide wa amanuno no Epode o tsukete ita.
Kou shite Dabide to Isuraeru no zenka to wa, yorokobi no sakebi to tsunobue no oto o motte, kami no hako o kaki nobotta.
Shu no hako ga Dabide no machi ni haitta toki, Sauru no musume Mikaru wa mado kara nagame, Dabide ou ga Shu no mae ni maiodoru no o mite, kokoro no uchi ni Dabide o sagesunda.
Hitobito wa Shu no hako o kakiirete, Dabide ga sono tame ni hatta tenmaku no naka no sono basho ni oita. Soshite Dabide wa hansai to shuuonsai o Shu no mae ni sasageta.
Dabide wa hansai to shuuonsai o sasage owatta toki, bangun no Shu no na ni yotte tami o shukufuku shita.
Soshite subete no tami, Isuraeru no zenminshuu ni, otoko ni mo onna ni mo, onoono pan no kashi ichiko, niku hito kire, hoshi budou hitokatamari o wakeataeta. Kou shite tami wa mina onoono sono ie ni kaetta.
Dabide ga kazoku o shukufuku shiyou to shite kaette kita toki, Sauru no musume Mikaru wa Dabide o demukaete itta, "Kyou Isuraeru no ou wa nan to igen no atta koto deshou. Itazura mono ga, haji mo shirazu, sono mi o arawasu you ni, kyou keraitachi no hashi tamera no mae ni jibun no mi o arawasaremashita".
Dabide wa Mikaru ni itta, "Anata no chichi yori mo, mata sono zenka yori mo, mushiro watashi o erande, Shu no tami Isuraeru no kimi to serareta Shu no mae ni odotta no da. Watashi wa mata Shu no mae ni odorude arou.
Watashi wa kore yori mo motto karonjirareru you ni shiyou. Soshite anata no me ni wa iyashimerarerude arou. Shikashi watashi wa, anata ga saki ni itta, hashi tametachi ni homare o erude arou".
Kou shite Sauru no musume Mikaru wa shinu hi made kodomo ga nakatta.
Sate, ou ga jibun no ie ni sumi, mata Shu ga shuui no teki o kotogotoku uchishirizokete kare ni ansoku o tamawatta toki,
Ou wa yogensha Natan ni itta, "Miyo, ima watashi wa, kouhaku no ie ni sunde iruga, kami no hako wa nao makuya no uchi ni aru".
Natan wa ou ni itta, "Shu ga anata to tomo ni oraremasukara, itte, subete anata no kokoro ni aru tokoro o okonai nasai".
Sono yo, Shu no kotoba ga Natan ni nozonde itta,
"Itte, watashi no shimobe Dabide ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru. Anata wa watashi no sumu ie o tateyou to suru no ka.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito o Ejiputo kara michibikidashita hi kara konnichi made, ie ni sumawazu, tenmaku o sumai to shite ayunde kita.
Watashi ga Isuraeru no subete no hitobito to tomo ni ayunda subete no tokoro de, watashi ga watashi no tami Isuraeru o boku suru koto o meijita Isuraeru no sabaki zukasa no hitori ni, hitokoto de mo "Dou shite anata gata wa watashi no tame ni kouhaku no ie o tatenai no ka" to, itta koto ga arude arou ka'.
Sore yue, ima anata wa, watashi no shimobe Dabide ni kou ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru. Watashi wa anata o makiba kara, hitsuji ni shitagatte iru tokoro kara totte, watashi no tami Isuraeru no kimi to shi,
Anata ga doko e iku ni mo, anata to tomo ni ori, anata no subete no teki o anata no mae kara tachi satta. Watashi wa mata chijou no ooinaru mono no na no you na ooinaru na o anata ni esaseyou.
Soshite watashi no tami Isuraeru no tame ni hitotsu no tokoro o sadamete, karera o uetsuke, karera o jibun no tokoro ni sumase, kasanete ugoku koto no nai you ni surude arou.
Mata mae no you ni, watashi ga watashi no tami Isuraeru no ue ni sabaki zukasa o tateta hi kara konokata no you ni, akunin ga kasanete kore o nayamasu koto wa nai. Watashi wa anata no moromoro no teki o uchishirizokete, anata ni ansoku o ataerude arou. Shu wa mata "Anata no tame ni ie o tsukuru" to ooserareru.
Anata ga hi ga michite, senzotachi to tomo ni nemuru toki, watashi wa anata no mi kara deru ko o, anata no ato ni tatete, sono oukoku o kataku surude arou.
Kare wa watashi no na no tame ni ie o tateru. Watashi wa nagaku sono kuni no kurai o kataku shiyou.
Watashi wa kare no chichi to nari, kare wa watashi no ko to narude arou. Moshi kare ga tsumi o okasunaraba, watashi wa hito no tsue to hito no ko no muchi o motte kare o korasu.
Shikashi watashi wa watashi no itsukushimi o, watashi ga anata no mae kara nozoita Sauru kara torisatta you ni, kare kara wa torisaranai.
Anata no ie to oukoku wa watashi no mae ni nagaku tamotsude arou. Anata no kurai wa nagaku katou serareru' ".
Natan wa subete korera no kotoba no you ni, mata subete kono maboroshi no you ni Dabide ni katatta.
Sono toki Dabide ou wa, hai tte Shu no mae ni zashite itta, "Shu naru kami yo, watashi ga dare, watashi no ie ga nani de aru no de, anata wa kore made watashi o michibikareta no desu ka.
Shu naru kami yo, kore wa nao anata no me ni wa chiisai koto desu. Shu naru kami yo, anata wa mata shimobe no ie no, haruka nochi no koto o katatte, kitarubeki yoyo no koto o shimesaremashita.
Dabide wa kono ue nani o anata ni moushiageru koto ga dekimashou. Shu naru kami yo, anata wa shimobe o shitte orareru no desu.
Anata no yakusoku no yue ni, mata anata no kokoro ni shitagatte, anata wa kono moromoro no ooinaru koto o okonai, shimobe ni sore o shiraseraremashita.
Shu naru kami yo, anata wa idai desu. Sore wa, wareware ga subete mimi ni kiita tokoro ni yoreba, anata no you na mono wa naku, mata anata no hoka ni kami wa naikara desu.
Chi no dono kokumin ga, anata no tami Isuraeru no you de arimashou ka. Kore wa kami ga itte, jibun no tame ni aganatte tami to shi, mizukara no na o agerareta mono, mata karera no tame ni ooinaru osorubeki koto o nashi, sono tami no mae kara kunibito to sono kamigami to o oidasareta mono desu.
Soshite anata no tami Isuraeru o eien ni anata no tami to shite, jibun no tame ni, sadameraremashita. Shu yo, anata wa karera no kami to narareta no desu.
Shu naru kami yo, ima anata ga, shimobe to shimobe no ie to ni tsuite katarareta kotoba o nagaku katou shite, anata no iwareta toori ni shite kudasai.
Sou sureba, anata no na wa tokoshie ni agamerarete, 'Bangun no Shu wa Isuraeru no kami de aru' to iware, anata no shimobe Dabide no ie wa, anata no mae ni kataku tatsu koto ga dekimashou.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami yo, anata wa shimobe ni shimeshite, 'Omae no tame ni ie o tateyou' to iwaremashita. Sore yue, shimobe wa kono inori o anata ni sasageru yuuki o eta no desu.
Shu naru kami yo, anata wa kami ni mashimashi, anata no kotoba wa shinjitsu desu. Anata wa kono yoki koto o shimobe ni yakusoku saremashita.
Douzo ima, shimobe no ie o shukufuku shi, anata no mae ni nagaku tsuzukasete kudasaru you ni. Shu naru kami yo, anata ga sore o iwareta no desu. Douzo anata no shukufuku ni yotte, shimobe no ie ga nagaku shukufuku saremasu you ni".
Kono nochi Dabide wa Perishite bito o utte, kore o seifuku shita. Dabide wa mata Perishite bito no te kara metegu anma o totta.
Kare wa mata Moabu o uchi, karera o chi ni fusase, nawa o motte karera o hakatta. Sunawachi ni suji no nawa o motte korosubeki mono o hakari, hitosuji no nawa o motte ikashite oku mono o hakatta. Soshite Moabu bito wa, Dabide no shimobe to natte, mitsugi o osameta.
Dabide wa mataRehobu no ko de aru Zoba no ou Hadadezeru ga, Yufurate kawa no hotori ni sono seiryoku o kaifuku shiyou to shite iku tokoro o utta.
Soshite Dabide wa kare kara kihei sen nanahyakunin, hohei ni mannin o totta. Dabide wa mata ichi hyaku no sensha no uma o nokoshite, sono hoka no sensha no uma wa mina sono ashi no suji o kitta.
Damasuko no Suriya bito ga, Zoba no ou Hadadezeru o tasukeru tame ni kita no de, Dabide wa Suriya bito ni man nisennin o koroshita.
Soshite Dabide wa Damasuko no Suriya ni shubitai o oita. Suriya bi to wa, Dabide no shimobe to natte, mitsugi o osameta. Shu wa Dabide ni subete sono iku tokoro de shouri o ataerareta.
Dabide wa Hadadezeru no shimobera ga motte ita kin no tate o ubatte, Erusaremu ni motte kita.
Dabide ou wa mata Hadadezeru no machi, Beta to Berotai kara, hijou ni ooku no seidou o totta.
Toki ni Hamate no ou Toi wa, Dabide ga Hadadezeru no subete no gunzei o uchiyabutta koto o kiki,
Sono ko Yoramu o Dabide ou no moto ni tsukawashite, kare ni aisatsu shi, katsu shuku o nobesaseta. Hadadezeru wa katsute shibashiba Toi to tatakai o majietaga, Dabide ga Hadadezeru to tatakatte kore o uchiyabuttakara de aru. Yoramu ga gin no utsuwa to kin no utsuwa to seidou no utsuwa o tazusaete kita no de,
Dabide ou wa seifuku shita subete no kokumin kara totte sasageta kingin to tomo ni korera o mo Shu ni sasageta.
Sunawachi Edomu, Moabu, Anmon no hitobito, Perishite bi to, Amareku kara eta mono, oyobi Zoba no ou Rehobu no ko Hadadezeru kara eta bundori mono to tomo ni kore o sasageta.
Kou shite Dabide wa meisei o eta. Kare wa kaette kite kara shio no tani de Edomu bito ichi man hassennin o uchikoroshita.
Soshite Edomu ni shubitai o oita. Sunawachi Edomu no zenchi ni shubitai o oki, Edomu bi to wa mina Dabide no shimobe to natta. Shu wa Dabide ni subete sono iku tokoro de shouri o ataerareta.
Kou shite Dabide wa Isuraeru no zenchi o osame, sono subete no tami ni seigi to kouhei o okonatta.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu wa gun no chou, Ahirude no ko Yoshapate wa shikan,
Ahitobu no ko Zadoku to Abiyataru no ko Ahimereku wa saishi, Seraya wa shokikan,
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa Kerete bito to Perete bito no chou, Dabide no kotachi wa saishi de atta.
Toki ni Dabide wa itta, "Sauru no ie no hito de, nao nokotte iru mono ga aru ka. Watashi wa Yonatan no tame ni, sono hito ni megumi o hodokosou".
Sate, Sauru no ie ni Jiba to iu na no shimobe ga attaga, hitobito ga kare o Dabide no moto ni yobiyoseta no de, ou wa kare ni itta, "Anata ga Jiba ka". Kare wa itta, "Shimobe ga sou desu".
Ou wa itta, "Sauru no ie no hito ga mada nokotte imasen ka. Watashi wa sono hito ni kami no megumi o hodokosou to omou". Jiba wa ou ni itta, "Yonatan no ko ga mada orimasu. Ashi na e desu".
Ou wa kare ni itta, "Sono hito wa doko ni iru no ka". Jiba wa ou ni itta, "Kare wa ro debaru no Anmieru no ko Makiru no ie ni orimasu".
Dabide ou wa hito o tsukawashite, ro debaru no Anmieru no ko Makiru no ie kara, kare o tsurete kosaseta.
Sauru no ko Yonatan no ko de aru Mepibosete wa Dabide no moto ni kite, hirefushite haishita. Dabide ga, "Mepibosete yo" to itta no de, kare wa, "Shimobe wa, koko ni orimasu" to kotaeta.
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Watashi wa kanarazu anata no chichi Yonatan no tame ni anata ni megumi o hodokoshimashou. Anata no chichi Sauru no chi o mina anata ni kaeshimasu. Mata anata wa tsune ni watashi no shokutaku de shokuji o shi nasai".
Kare wa haishite itta, "Anata wa, shimobe o nan to oboshimeshite, shinda inu no you na watashi o kaerimirareru no desu ka".
Ou wa Sauru no shimobe Jiba o yonde itta, "Subete Sauru to sono ie ni zokusuru mono o mina, watashi wa anata no shujin no ko ni ataeta.
Anata to, anata no kotachi to, shimobetachi to wa, kare no tame ni chi o tagayashite, anata no shujin no ko ga taberu shokumotsu o toriirenakereba naranai. Shikashi anata no shujin no ko Mepibosete wa itsu mo watashi no shokutaku de shokuji o surude arou". Jiba ni wa juu gonin no otokonoko to nijuunin no shimobe ga atta.
Jiba wa ou ni itta, "Subete ou waga shukun ga shimobe ni meijirareru toori ni, shimobe wa itashimashou". Kou shite Mepibosete wa ou no ko no hitori no you ni Dabide no shokutaku de shokuji o shita.
Mepibosete ni wa chiisai ko ga atte, na o Mika to itta. Soshite Jiba no ie ni sunde iru mono wa mina Mepibosete no shimobe to natta.
Mepibosete wa Erusaremu ni sunda. Kare ga itsu mo ou no shokutaku de shokuji o shitakara de aru. Kare wa ryouashi tomo ni, naete ita.
Kono nochi Anmon no hitobito no ou ga shinde, sono ko Hanun ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Sono toki Dabide wa itta, "Watashi wa Nahashi no ko Hanun ni, sono chichi ga watashi ni megumi o hodokoshita you ni, megumi o hodokosou". Soshite Dabide wa kare o, sono chichi no yue ni nagusameyou to, shimobe o tsukawashita. Dabide no shimobetachi wa Anmon no hitobito no chi ni ittaga,
Anmon no hitobito no tsukasatachi wa sono shukun Hanun ni itta, "Dabide ga nagusameru mono o anata no moto ni tsukawashita no wa kare ga anata no chichi o tattobu tame da to omowaremasu ka. Dabide ga anata no moto ni, shimobetachi o tsukawashita no wa, kono machi o ukagai, sore o sagutte, horobosu tame de wa arimasen ka".
Soko de Hanun wa Dabide no shimobetachi o torae, onoono, hige no nakaba o sori otoshi, sono kimono o nakahodo kara tachikiri koshi no tokoro made ni shite, karera o kaeraseta.
Hitobito ga kore o Dabide ni tsugeta no de, Dabide wa hito o tsukawashite karera o mukaesaseta. Sono hitobito wa hijou ni hajitakara de aru. Soko de ou wa itta, "Hige ga nobiru made Eriko ni todomatte, sono nochi, kaeri nasai".
Anmon no hitobito wa jibuntachi ga Dabide ni nikumarete iru koto ga wakatta no de, hito o tsukawashite, bete rehobu no Suriya bito to Zoba no Suriya bito to no hohei ni mannin oyobi Maaka no ou to sono issennin, Tobu no hito ichi man nisennin o yatoiireta.
Dabide wa sore o kiite, Yoabu to yuushi no zengun o tsukawashita no de,
Anmon no hitobito wa dete, mon no iriguchi ni tatakai no sonae o shita. Zoba to Rehobu to no Suriya bi to, oyobi Tobuto Maaka no hitobito wa betsu ni no ni ita.
Yoabu wa tatakai ga zengo kara jibun ni sematte kuru no o mite, Isuraeru no erinuki no heishi no uchi kara erande, kore o Suriya bito ni taishite sonae,
Sono hoka no tami o jibun no kyoudai Abishai no te ni watashite, Anmon no hitobito ni taishite sonaesase,
Soshite itta, "Moshi Suriya bito ga watashi ni tegowai toki wa, watashi o tasukete kudasai. Moshi Anmon no hitobito ga anata ni tegowai toki wa, itte anata o tasukemashou.
Isamashiku shite kudasai. Wareware no tami no tame, wareware no kami no machimachi no tame, isamashiku shimashou. Douzo Shu ga yoi to omowareru koto o sareru you ni".
Yoabu ga jibun to issho ni iru tami to tomo ni, Suriya bito ni mukatte tatakaou to shite chikazuita toki, Suriya bi to wa kare no mae kara nigeta.
Anmon no hitobito wa Suriya bito ga nigeru no o mite, karera mo mata Abishai no mae kara nigete machi ni haitta. Soko de Yoabu wa Anmon no hitobito o utsu koto o yamete Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Shikashi Suriya bi to wa jibuntachi no Isuraeru ni uchi yaburareta no o mite, tomo ni atsumatta.
Soshite Hadadezeru wa hito o tsukawashi, Yufurate kawa no mukougawa ni iru Suriya bito o hikiite Eramu ni kosaseta. Hadadezeru no gun no chouShobaku ga kore o hikiita.
Kono koto ga Dabide ni kikoeta no de, kare wa Isuraeru o kotogotoku atsume, Yorudan o watatte Eramu ni kita. Suriya bi to wa Dabide ni mukatte sonae o shite kare to tatakatta.
Shikashi Suriya bito ga Isuraeru no mae kara nigeta no de, Dabide wa Suriya bito no sensha no hei nanahyaku, kihei yon man o koroshi, mata sono gun no chouShobaku o utta no de, kare wa sono tokoro de shinda.
Hadadezeru no kerai de atta outachi wa mina, jibuntachi ga Isuraeru ni uchi yaburareta no o mite, Isuraeru to wa o kouji, kore ni tsukaeta. Kou shite Suriya bi to wa osorete futatabi Anmon no hitobito o tasukeru koto o shinakatta.
Haru ni natte, outachi ga tatakai ni deru ni oyonde, Dabide wa Yoabu oyobi jibun to tomo ni iru keraitachi, narabi ni Isuraeru no zengun o tsukawashita. Karera wa Anmon no hitobito o horoboshi, Raba o houi shita. Shikashi Dabide wa Erusaremu ni todomatte ita.
Sate, aru hi no yuugure, Dabide wa yuka kara okidete, ou no ie no okujou o aruite itaga, okujou kara, hitori no onna ga karada o aratte iru no o mita. Sono onna wa hijou ni utsukushikatta.
Dabide wa hito o tsukawashite sono onna no koto o sagurasetaga, aru hito wa itta, "Kore wa Eriamu no musume de, Hete bito Uriya no tsuma Bateshiba de wa arimasen ka".
Soko de Dabide wa shisha o tsukawashite, sono onna o tsurete kita. Onna wa kare no tokoro ni kite, kare wa sono onna to neta. (onna wa mi no kegare o kiyomete ita no de aru.) kou shite onna wa sono ie ni kaetta.
Onna wa ninshin shita no de, hito o tsukawashite Dabide ni tsugete itta, "Watashi wa ko o haramimashita".
Soko de Dabide wa Yoabu ni, "Hete bito Uriya o watashi no tokoro ni tsukawase" to itte yatta no de, Yoabu wa Uriya o Dabide no tokoro ni tsukawashita.
Uriya ga Dabide no tokoro ni kita no de, Dabide wa, Yoabu wa dou shite iru ka, tami wa dou shite iru ka, tatakai wa umaku itte iru ka to tazuneta.
Soshite Dabide wa Uriya ni itta, "Anata no ie ni itte, ashi o arai nasai". Uriya wa ou no ie o dete ittaga, ou no okurimono ga kare no nochi ni shitagatta.
Shikashi Uriya wa ou no ie no iriguchi de shukun no keraitachi to tomo ni nete, jibun no ie ni kaeranakatta.
Hitobito ga Dabide ni, "Uriya wa jibun no ie ni kaerimasendeshita" to tsugeta no de, Dabide wa Uriya ni itta, "Tabi kara kaette kita no de wa nai ka. Dou shite ie ni kaeranakatta no ka".
Uriya wa Dabide ni itta, "Kami no hako mo, Isuraeru mo, Yuda mo, koya no naka ni sumi, watashi no shujin Yoabu to, waga shukun no keraitachi ga no no omote ni jin o totte iru no ni, watashi wa dou shite ie ni kaette kui nomi shi, tsuma to neru koto ga dekimashou. Anata wa ikite oraremasu. Anata no tamashii wa ikite imasu. Watashi wa kono koto o itashimasen".
Dabide wa Uriya ni itta, "Kyou mo, koko ni todomari nasai. Watashi wa asu, anata o sarasemashou". Soko de Uriya wa sono hi to tsugi no hi Erusaremu ni todomatta.
Dabide wa kare o maneite jibun no mae de kui nomisase, kare o yowaseta. Yuugure ni natte kare wa dete itte, sono yuka ni, shukun no keraitachi to tomo ni neta. Soshite jibun no ie ni wa kudatte ikanakatta.
Asa ni natte Dabide wa Yoabu ni ateta tegami o kaki, Uriya no te ni takushite sore o okutta.
Kare wa sono tegami ni, "Anata gata wa Uriya o hageshii tatakai no saizensen ni dashi, kare no ushiro kara shirizoite, kare o uchijini saseyo" to kaita.
Yoabu wa machi o kakonde ita no de, yuushitachi ga iru to shitte ita basho ni Uriya o oita.
Machi no hitobito ga dete kite Yoabu to tatakatta no de, tami no uchi, Dabide no keraitachi ni mo, taoreru mono ga ari, Hete bito Uriya mo shinda.
Yoabu wa hito o tsukawashite tatakai no koto o tsubusani Dabide ni tsugeta.
Yoabu wa sono shisha ni meijite itta, "Anata ga tatakai no koto o tsubusani ou ni katari owatta toki,
Moshi ou ga ikari o okoshite, 'Anata gata wa naze tatakaou to shite sonna ni machi ni chikazuita no ka. Karera ga jouheki no ue kara iru no o shiranakatta no ka.
Erubesete no ko Abimereku o utta no wa dare ka. Hitori no onna ga jouheki no ue kara ishiusu no uwaishi o nagete kare o Tebetsu de koroshita no de wa nakatta ka. Anata gata wa naze sonna ni jouheki ni chikazuita no ka' to iwaretanaraba, sono toki anata wa, 'Anata no shimobe, Hete bito Uriya mo mata shinimashita' to ii nasai".
Kou shite shisha wa iki, Dabide no moto ni kite, Yoabu ga ii tsukawashita koto o kotogotoku tsugeta.
Shisha wa Dabide ni itta, "Teki wa wareware yori mo yuuri na ichi o shime, dete kite wareware o no de sememashitaga, wareware wa machi no iriguchi made karera o oikaeshimashita.
Sono toki, shashudomo wa jouheki kara anata no keraitachi o imashita no de, ou no kerai no aru mono wa shini, mata, anata no kerai Hete bito Uriya mo shinimashita".
Dabide wa shisha ni itta, "Anata wa Yoabu ni kou ii nasai, 'Kono koto de shinpai suru koto wa nai. Tsurugi wa kore o mo kare o mo onajiku horobosukara de aru. Tsuyoku machi o semete tatakai, sore o semeotoshi nasai' to. Soshite Yoabu o hagemashi nasai".
Uriya no tsuma wa otto Uriya ga shinda koto o kiite, otto no tame ni kanashinda.
Sono mo ga sugita toki, Dabide wa hito o tsukawashite kanojo o jibun no ie ni meshiireta. Kanojo wa kare no tsuma to natte otokonoko o unda. Shikashi Dabide ga shita kono koto wa Shu o ikaraseta.
Shu wa Natan o Dabide ni tsukawasareta no de, kare wa Dabide no tokoro ni kite itta, "Aru machi ni futari no hito ga atte, hitori wa tomi, hitori wa mazushikatta.
Tonde iru hito wa hijou ni ooku no hitsuji to ushi o motte itaga,
Mazushii hito wa jibun ga katta ichitou no chiisai mesu no kohitsuji no hoka wa nani mo motte inakatta. Kare ga sore o sodateta no de, sono kohitsuji wa kare oyobi kare no kodomotachi to tomo ni seichou shi, kare no shokumotsu o tabe, kare no wan kara nomi, kare no futokoro de nete, kare ni totte wa musume no you de atta.
Toki ni, hitori no tabibito ga, sono tonde iru hito no moto ni kitaga, jibun no hitsuji mata wa ushi no uchi kara ichiittou o totte, jibun no tokoro ni kita tabibito no tame ni chouri suru koto o oshimi, sono mazushii hito no kohitsuji o totte, kore o jibun no tokoro ni kita hito no tame ni chouri shita".
Dabide wa sono hito no koto o hijou ni ikatte Natan ni itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Kono koto o shita sono hito wa shinubekide aru.
Katsu sono hito wa kono koto o shita tame, mata awaremanakatta tame, sono kohitsuji o yon bai ni shite tsugunawanakereba naranai".
Natan wa Dabide ni itta, "Anata ga sono hito desu. Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa anata ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to shi, anata o Sauru no te kara sukuidashi,
Anata ni shujin no ie o atae, shujin no tsumatachi o anata no futokoro ni atae, mata Isuraeru to Yuda no ie o anata ni ataeta. Moshi sukunakattanaraba, watashi wa motto ooku no mono o anata ni mashikuwaetade arou.
Dou shite anata wa Shu no kotoba o karonji, sono me no mae ni akuji o okonatta no desu ka. Anata wa tsurugi o motte Hete bito Uriya o koroshi, sono tsuma o totte jibun no tsuma to shita. Sunawachi Anmon no hitobito no tsurugi o motte kare o koroshita.
Anata ga watashi o karonjite Hete bito Uriya no tsuma o tori, jibun no tsuma to shita no de, tsurugi wa itsu made mo anata no ie o hanarenaide arou'.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Miyo, watashi wa anata no ie kara anata no ue ni wazawai o okosude arou. Watashi wa anata no me no mae de anata no tsumatachi o totte, tonaribito ni ataerude arou. Sono hito wa kono taiyou no mae de tsumatachi to issho ni nerude arou.
Anata wa hisoka ni sore o shitaga, watashi wa zenIsuraeru no mae to, taiyou no mae ni kono koto o suru no de aru' ".
Dabide wa Natan ni itta, "Watashi wa Shu ni tsumi o okashimashita". Natan wa Dabide ni itta, "Shu mo mata anata no tsumi o nozokaremashita. Anata wa shinu koto wa naideshou.
Shikashi anata wa kono okonai ni yotte ooini Shu o anadotta no de, anata ni umareru kodomo wa kanarazu shinudeshou".
Kou shite Natan wa ie ni kaetta. Sate Shu wa, Uriya no tsuma ga Dabide ni unda ko o utareta no de, byouki ni natta.
Dabide wa sono ko no tame ni kami ni tangan shita. Sunawachi Dabide wa danjiki shite, heya ni hairi shuuya chi ni fushita.
Dabide no ie no chouroutachi wa, kare no katawara ni tatte kare o chi kara okosou to shitaga, kare wa okiyou to wa sezu, mata karera to issho ni shokuji o shinakatta.
Nanuka me ni sono ko wa shinda. Dabide no keraitachi wa sono ko ga shinda koto o Dabide ni tsugeru no o osoreta. Sore wa karera ga, "Miyo, ko no nao ikite iru aida ni, wareware ga kare ni katatta no ni kare wa sono kotoba o kikiirenakatta. Dou shite kare ni sono ko no shinda koto o tsugeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Kare wa mizukara o gaisuru ka mo shirenai" to omottakara de aru.
Shikashi Dabide wa, keraitachi ga tagai ni sasayakiau no o mite, sono ko no shinda no o satori, keraitachi ni itta, "Ko wa shinda no ka". Karera wa itta, "Shinaremashita".
Soko de, Dabide wa chi kara okiagari, mi o arai, abura o nuri, sono kimono o kaete, Shu no ie ni haitte haishita. Sono nochi jibun no ie ni iki, motomete jibun no tame ni shokumotsu o sonaesasete tabeta.
Keraitachi wa kare ni itta, "Anata no nasatta kono koto wa nan deshou ka. Anata wa ko no ikite iru aida wa sono ko no tame ni danjiki shite nakaremashita. Shikashi ko ga shinuto, anata wa okite shokuji o nasaimashita".
Dabide wa itta, "Ko no ikite iru aida ni, watashi ga danjiki shite naita no wa, 'Shu ga watashi o awarende, kono ko o ikashite kudasaru ka mo shirenai' to omottakara desu.
Shikashi ima wa shinda no de, watashi wa dou shite danjiki shinakereba naranaideshou ka. Watashi wa futatabi kare o kaeraseru koto ga dekimasu ka. Watashi wa kare no tokoro ni ikudeshouga, kare wa watashi no tokoro ni kaette konaideshou".
Dabide wa tsuma Bateshiba o nagusame, kanojo no tokoro ni haitte, kanojo to tomo ni neta no de, kanojo wa otokonoko o unda. Dabide wa sono na o Soromon to nazuketa. Shu wa kore o aisareta.
Soshite yogensha Natan o tsukawashi, meijite sono na o Ededea to yobaserareta.
Sate Yoabu wa Anmon no hitobito no Raba o semete ou no machi o totta.
Yoabu wa shisha o Dabide ni tsukawashite itta, "Watashi wa Raba o semete mizu no machi o torimashita.
Anata wa ima, nokori no tami o atsume, kono machi ni mukatte jin o shiki, kore o tori nasai. Watashi ga kono machi o totte, hito ga watashi no na o motte, kore o yobu you ni naranai tame desu".
Soko de Dabide wa tami o kotogotoku atsumete Raba e iki, semete kore o totta.
Soshite Dabide wa karera no ou no kanmuri o sono atama kara tori hanashita. Sore wa kin de omosa wa ichi taranto de atta. Houseki ga hamete ari, sore o Dabide no atama ni oita. Dabide wa sono machi kara bundori mono o hijou ni ooku mochidashita.
Mata Dabide wa sono uchi no tami o hikidashite, karera o nokogiri ya, tetsu no tsuruhashi, tetsu no ono o tsukau shigoto ni tsukase, mata, renga tsukuri no roueki ni tsukaseta. Kare wa Anmon no hitobito no subete no machi ni kono you ni shita. Soshite Dabide to tami to wa mina Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Sate Dabide no ko Abusaromu ni wa na o Tamaru to iu utsukushii imouto ga attaga, sono nochi Dabide no ko Amunon wa kore o koi shita.
Amunon wa imouto Tamaru no tame ni nayande tsuini wazuratta. Sore wa Tamaru ga shojo de atte, Amunon wa kanojo ni nanigoto mo suru koto ga dekinai to omottakara de aru.
Tokoro ga Amunon ni wa hitori no tomodachi ga atta. Na o Yonadabu to ii, Dabide no kyoudai Shimea no ko de aru. Yonadabu wa hijou ni kashikoi hito de atta.
Kare wa Amunon ni itta, "Ouji yo, anata wa, dou shite asagoto ni, sonna ni yaseotoroeru no desu ka. Watashi ni hanasanai no desu ka". Amunon wa kare ni itta, "Watashi wa kyoudai Abusaromu no imouto Tamaru o koi shite iru no desu".
Yonadabu wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa yamai to itsuwari, nedoko ni yokotawatte, anata no chichi ga kite anata o miru toki kare ni ii nasai, 'Douzo, watashi no imouto Tamaru o kosase, watashi no tokoro ni shokumotsu o hakobasete kudasai. Soshite kanojo ga watashi no me no mae de shokumotsu o totonoe, kanojo no te kara watashi ga taberu koto no dekiru you ni sasete kudasai' ".
Soko de Amunon wa yoko ni natte yamai to itsuwattaga, ou ga kite kare o mita toki, Amunon wa ou ni itta, "Douzo watashi no imouto Tamaru o kosase, watashi no me no mae de futatsu no kashi o tsukurasete, kanojo no te kara watashi ga taberu koto no dekiru you ni shite kudasai".
Dabide wa Tamaru no ie ni hito o tsukawashite iwaseta, "Anata no ani Amunon no ie e itte, kare no tame ni shokumotsu o totonoe nasai".
Soko de Tamaru wa sono ani Amunon no ie e itta tokoro, Amunon wa nete ita. Tamaru wa kona o totte, kore o kone, kare no me no mae de, kashi o tsukuri, sono kashi o yaki,
Nabe o totte kare no mae ni sore o aketa. Shikashi kare wa taberu koto o kobanda. Soshite Amunon wa, "Mina, watashi o hanarete dete kudasai" to itta no de, mina, kare o hanarete deta.
Amunon wa Tamaru ni itta, "Shokumotsu o shinshitsu ni motte kite kudasai. Watashi wa anata no te kara tabemasu". Soko de Tamaru wa jibun no tsukutta kashi o totte, shinshitsu ni hairi ani Amunon no tokoro e motte itta.
Tamaru ga kare ni tabesaseyou to shite chikaku ni motte itta toki, kare wa Tamaru o toraete kanojo ni itta, "Imouto yo, kite, watashi to ne nasai".
Tamaru wa itta, "Iie, ani ue yo, watashi o hazukashimete wa narimasen. Kono you na koto wa Isuraeru de wa okonawaremasen. Kono oroka na koto o shite wa narimasen.
Watashi no haji o watashi wa doko e motte iku koto ga dekimashou. Anata wa Isuraeru no orokamono no hitori to narudeshou. Sore yue, douzo ou ni hanashite kudasai. Ou ga watashi o anata ni ataenai koto wa naideshou".
Shikashi Amunon wa kanojo no iu koto o kikou to mo sezu, Tamaru yori mo tsuyokatta no de, Tamaru o hazukashimete kore to tomo ni neta.
Sore kara Amunon wa, hijou ni fukaku Tamaru o nikumu you ni natta. Kanojo o nikumu nikushimi wa, kanojo o koi shita koi yori mo ookikatta. Amunon wa kanojo ni itta, "Tatte, iki nasai".
Tamaru wa Amunon ni itta, "Iie, ani ue yo, watashi o kaesu koto wa, anata ga saki ni watashi ni nasatta koto yori mo ookii aku desu". Shikashi Amunon wa kanojo no iu koto o kikou to mo sezu,
Kare ni tsukaete iru wakamono o yonde itta, "Kono onna o watashi no tokoro kara soto ni okuridashi, sono ato ni to o tozasu ga yoi".
Kono toki, Tamaru wa nagasode no kimono o kite ita. Mukashi, ou no himetachi no shojo de aru mono wa kono you na kimono o kitakara de aru. Amunon no shimobe wa kanojo o soto ni dashite, sono ato ni to o tozashita.
Tamaru wa hai o atama ni kaburi, kite ita nagasode no kimono o saki, te o atama ni nosete, sakebinagara satte itta.
Ani Abusaromu wa kanojo ni itta, "Ani Amunon ga anata to issho ni ita no ka. Shikashi imouto yo, ima wa damatte i nasai. Kare wa anata no ani desu. Kono koto o kokoro ni tomenakute yoroshii". Kou shite Tamaru wa ani Abusaromu no ie ni sabishiku sunde ita.
Dabide ou wa korera no koto o kotogotoku kiite, hijou ni ikatta.
Abusaromu wa Amunon ni yoi koto mo warui koto mo kataru koto o shinakatta. Sore wa Amunon ga Abusaromu no imouto Tamaru o hazukashimeta no de, Abusaromu ga kare o nikunde itakara de aru.
Man ni nen no nochi, Abusaromu wa Efuraimu no chikaku ni aru Baaru Hazoru de hitsuji no ke o kirasete ita toki, ou no kotachi o kotogotoku maneita.
Soshite Abusaromu wa ou no moto ni kite itta, "Miyo, shimobe wa hitsuji no ke o kirasete orimasu. Douzo ou mo ou no keraitachi mo, shimobe to tomo ni kite kudasai".
Ou wa Abusaromu ni itta, "Iie, waga ko yo, wareware ga mina itte wa naranai. Anata no omoni ni naruto ikenaikara". Abusaromu wa Dabide ni shiite negatta. Shikashi Dabide wa iku koto o shouchi sezu kare ni shukufuku o ataeta.
Soko de Abusaromu wa itta, "Sore de wa, douzo watashi no ani Amunon o wareware to tomo ni ikasete kudasai". Ou wa kare ni itta, "Dou shite kare ga anata to tomo ni ikanakereba naranai no ka".
Shikashi Abusaromu wa kare ni shiite negatta no de, tsuini Amunon to ou no kotachi o mina, Abusaromu to tomo ni ikaseta.
Soko de Abusaromu wa wakamonotachi ni meijite itta, "Amunon ga sake o nonde, kokoro tanoshiku natta toki o misumashi, watashi ga anata gata ni, 'Amunon o ute' to iu toki, kare o koroshi nasai. Osoreru koto wa nai. Watashi ga meijiru no de wa nai ka. Ooshiku shi nasai. Isamashiku shi nasai".
Abusaromu no wakamonotachi wa Abusaromu no meijita you ni Amunon ni okonatta no de, ou no kotachi wa mina tatte, onoono sono raba ni notte nigeta.
Karera ga mada tsukanai uchi ni, "Abusaromu wa ou no kotachi o kotogotoku koroshite, hitori mo nokotte iru mono ga nai" to iu shirase ga Dabide ni tasshita no de,
Ou wa tachi, sono kimono o saite, chi ni fushita. Sono katawara ni tatte ita keraitachi mo mina sono kimono o saita.
Shikashi Dabide no kyoudai Shimea no ko Yonadabu wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, ou no kotachi de aru wakamonotachi ga mina korosareta to, okangae ni natte wa narimasen. Amunon dake ga shinda no desu. Kore wa kare ga Abusaromu no imouto Tamaru o hazukashimeta hi kara, Abusaromu no inochi ni yotte sadamerarete ita koto na no desu.
Sore yue, waga Shu, ou yo, ou no kotachi ga mina shinda to omotte, kono koto o kokoro ni tomerarete wa narimasen. Amunon dake ga shinda no desu".
Abusaromu wa nogareta. Toki ni mihari o shite ita wakamono ga me o agete miruto, yama no katawara no Horonaimu no michi kara ooku no tami no kuru no ga mieta.
Yonadabu wa ou ni itta, "Miyo, ou no kotachi ga kimashita. Shimobe no itta toori desu".
Kare ga kataru koto o owatta toki, ou no kotachi wa kite koe o agete naita. Ou mo sono keraitachi mo mina, hijou ni hageshiku naita.
Shikashi Abusaromu wa nogarete, Geshuru no ou Amihode no ko Tarumai no moto ni itta. Dabide wa hibi sono ko no tame ni kanashinda.
Abusaromu wa nogarete Geshuru ni iki, san nen no aida soko ni ita.
Ou wa kokoro ni, Abusaromu ni au koto o, setsu ni nozonda. Amunon wa shinde shimai, Dabide ga kare no koto wa akiramete itakara de aru.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu wa ou no kokoro ga Abusaromu ni mukatte iru no o shitta.
Soko de Yoabu wa Tekoa ni hito o tsukawashite, soko kara hitori no kashikoi onna o tsurete kosase, sono onna ni itta, "Anata wa kanashimi no uchi ni aru hito o yosootte, mofuku o ki, abura o mi ni nurazu, shinda hito no tame ni nagai aida kanashinde iru onna no you ni, yosootte,
Ou no moto ni iki, shikajika to kare ni katari nasai". Kou shite Yoabu wa sono kotoba o kanojo no kuchi ni sazuketa.
Tekoa no onna wa ou no moto ni iki, chi ni fushite haishi, "Ou yo, otasuke kudasai" to itta.
Ou wa onna ni itta, "Dou shita no ka". Onna wa itta, "Makoto ni watashi wa kafu de arimashite, otto wa shinimashita.
Tsukaeme ni wa futari no kodomo ga ari, futari wa no de arasoimashitaga, dare mo karera o hikiwakeru mono ga nakatta no de, hitori wa tsuini ta no mono o utte koroshimashita.
Suru to zenkazoku ga tsukaeme ni sakarai tatte, 'Kyoudai o uchikoroshita mono o hiki wa tasu ga yoi. Wareware wa kare ga koroshita sono kyoudai no inochi no tame ni kare o korosou' to ii, karera wa yotsugi o mo korosou to shimashita. Kou shite karera wa nokotte iru watashi no sumibi o keshite, watashi no otto no na o mo, atotsugi o mo, chi no omote ni todomenai you ni shiyou to shite imasu".
Ou wa onna ni itta, "Ie ni kaeri nasai. Watashi wa anata no koto ni tsuite meirei o kudashimasu".
Tekoa no onna wa ou ni itta, "Waga Shu, ou yo, watashi to watashi no chichi no ie ni sono tsumi o kishite kudasai. Douzo ou to ou no kurai ni wa tsumi ga arimasen you ni".
Ou wa itta, "Moshi anata ni nani ka iu mono ga areba, watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai. Sou sureba, sono hito wa kasanete anata ni fureru koto wa naideshou".
Onna wa itta, "Douzo ou ga, anata no kami, Shu o oboete, chi no houfuku o suru mono ni kasanete horobosu koto o sasezu, watashi no ko no korosareru koto no nai you ni shite kudasai". Ou wa itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Anata no ko no kaminoke hitosuji mo chi ni ochiru koto wa naideshou".
Onna wa itta, "Douzo, tsukaeme ni hitokoto, waga Shu, ou ni iwasete kudasai". Dabide wa itta, "Ii nasai".
Onna wa itta, "Anata wa, sore naraba dou shite, kami no tami ni mukatte kono you na koto o hakarareta no desu ka. Ou wa ima kono koto o iwareta koto ni yotte jibun o tsumi aru mono to sarete imasu. Sore wa ou ga tsuihou sareta mono o kaeraserarenaikara desu.
Watashitachi wa mina shinanakereba narimasen. Chi ni koboreta mizu no futatabi atsumeru koto no dekinai no to onaji desu. Shikashi kami wa, tsuihou sareta mono ga suterarenai you ni, tedate o moukeru hito no inochi o toru koto wa nasaimasen.
Watashi ga kono koto o ou, waga Shu ni iou to shite kita no wa, watashi ga tami o osoretakara desu. Tsukaeme wa, kou omotta no desu, 'Ou ni moushiageyou. Ou wa, hashi tame no negai no you ni shite kudasaru ka mo shirenai.
Ou wa kiite kudasaru. Watashi to watashi no ko o tomo ni horoboshite kami no shigyou kara hanaresaseyou to suru hito no te kara, hashi tame o sukuidashite kudasaru no dakara'.
Tsukaeme wa mata, kou omotta no desu, 'Ou, waga Shu no kotoba wa watashi o anshin saserude arou' to. Sore wa ou, waga Shu wa kami no tsukai no you ni zen to aku o kikiwakerarerukara desu. Douzo anata no kami, Shu ga anata to tomo ni oraremasu you ni".
Ou wa onna ni kotaete itta, "Watashi ga tou koto ni kakusazu kotaete kudasai". Onna wa itta, "Ou, waga Shu yo, douzo itte kudasai".
Ou wa itta, "Kono subete no koto ni oite, Yoabu no te ga anata to tomo ni arimasu ka". Onna wa kotaeta, "Anata wa tashika ni ikite oraremasu. Ou, waga Shu yo, subete ou, waga Shu no iwareta koto kara hito wa migi ni mo hidari ni mo magaru koto wa dekimasen. Watashi ni meijita no wa, anata no shimobe Yoabu desu. Kare ga tsukaeme no kuchi ni, korera no kotoba o kotogotoku sazuketa no desu.
Koto no nariyuki o kaeru tame, anata no shimobe Yoabu ga kono koto o shita no desu. Waga kimi ni wa kami no tsukai no chie no you na chie ga atte, chi no ue no subete no koto o shitte oraremasu".
Soko de ou wa Yoabu ni itta, "Kono koto o yurusu. Itte, wakamono Abusaromu o tsurekaeru ga yoi".
Yoabu wa chi ni hirefushite haishi, ou o shukufuku shita. Soshite Yoabu wa itta, "Waga Shu, ou yo, ou ga shimobe no negai o yurusareta no de, kyou shimobe wa, anata no mae ni megumi o eta koto o shirimashita".
Soko de Yoabu wa tatte Geshuru ni iki, Abusaromu o Erusaremu ni tsurete kita.
Ou wa itta, "Kare o jibun no ie ni hikikomoraseru ga yoi. Watashi no kao o mite wa naranai". Kou shite Abusaromu wa jibun no ie ni hikikomori, ou no kao o minakatta.
Sate zenIsuraeru no uchi ni Abusaromu no you ni, utsukushisa no tame homerareta hito wa nakatta. Sono ashi no ura kara atama no itadaki made kare ni wa kizu ga nakatta.
Abusaromu ga sono atama o karu toki, sono kaminoke o hakattaga, ou no hakari de nihyaku shikeru atta. Mainen no owari ni sore o karu no o tsune to shita. Sore ga omoku naruto, kare wa sore o katta no de aru.
Abusaromu ni sannin no musuko to, Tamaru to iu na no hitori no musume ga umareta. Tamaru wa utsukushii onna de atta.
Kou shite Abusaromu wa man ni nen no aida Erusaremu ni sundaga, ou no kao o minakatta.
Soko de Abusaromu wa Yoabu o ou no moto ni tsukawasou to shite, Yoabu no tokoro ni hito o tsukawashitaga, Yoabu wa kare no tokoro ni koyou to wa shinakatta. Kare wa futatabi hito o tsukawashitaga Yoabu wa koyou to wa shinakatta.
Soko de Abusaromu wa sono kerai ni itta, "Yoabu no hatake wa watashi no hatake no tonari ni atte, soko ni oomugi ga aru. Itte sore ni hi o hanachi nasai". Abusaromu no keraitachi wa sono hatake ni hi o hanatta.
Yoabu wa tatte Abusaromu no ie ni kite kare ni itta, "Dou shite anata no keraitachi wa watashi no hatake ni hi o hanatta no desu ka".
Abusaromu wa Yoabu ni itta, "Watashi wa anata ni hito o tsukawashite, koko e kuru you ni to itta no desu. Anata o ou no moto ni tsukawashi, 'Nan no tame ni watashi wa Geshuru kara kita no desu ka. Nao asoko ni itanaraba yokattadeshou ni' to iwaseyou to shita no desu. Sore yue ima watashi ni ou no kao o misasete kudasai. Moshi watashi ni tsumi ga arunara ou ni watashi o korosasete kudasai".
Soko de Yoabu wa ou no moto e itte tsugeta no de, ou wa Abusaromu o me shiyoseta. Kare wa ou no moto ni kite, ou no mae ni chi ni hirefushite haishita. Ou wa Abusaromu ni kuchizuke shita.
Kono nochi, Abusaromu wa jibun no tame ni sensha to uma, oyobi jibun no mae ni kakeru mono gojuunin o sonaeta.
Abusaromu wa hayaku okite mon no michi no katawara ni tatsu no o tsune to shita. Hito ga uttae ga atte ou ni saiban o motome ni kuruto, Abusaromu wa sono hito o yonde itta, "Anata wa dono machi no mono desu ka". Sono hito ga "Shimobe wa Isuraeru no kore kore no buzoku no mono desu" to iuto,
Abusaromu wa sono hito ni itta, "Miyo, anata no youkyuu wa yoku, mata tadashii. Shikashi anata no koto o kikubeki hito wa ou ga mada tatete inai".
Abusaromu wa mata itta, "Aa, watashi ga kono chi no sabaki bito de attanaraba yoi no ni. Sou sureba uttae, mata wa moushitate no aru mono wa, mina watashi no tokoro ni kite, watashi wa kore ni kouhei na sabaki o okonau koto ga dekiru no daga".
Soshite hito ga kare ni keirei shiyou to shite chikazukuto, kare wa te o nobe, sono hito o dakikakaete kuchizuke shita.
Abusaromu wa ou ni sabaki o motomete kuru subete no Isuraeru bito ni kono you ni shita. Kou shite Abusaromu wa Isuraeru no hitobito no kokoro o jibun no mono to shita.
Soshite yon nen no owari ni, Abusaromu wa ou ni itta, "Douzo watashi o ikase, Heburon de, katsute Shu ni tateta chikai o hatasasete kudasai.
Sore wa, shimobe ga Suriya no Geshuru ni ita toki, chikai o tatete, 'Moshi Shu ga hontou ni watashi o Erusaremu ni tsurekaette kudasarunaraba, watashi wa Shu ni reihai o sasagemasu' to ittakara desu".
Ou ga kare ni, "Yasuraka ni iki nasai" to itta no de, kare wa tatte Heburon e itta.
Soshite Abusaromu wa misshi o Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi ni tsukawashite itta, "Rappa no hibiki o kikunaraba, 'Abusaromu ga Heburon de ou to natta' to ii nasai".
Nihyakunin no manekareta mono ga Erusaremu kara Abusaromu to tomo ni itta. Karera wa nani kokoronaku iki, nanigoto o mo shiranakatta.
Abusaromu wa gisei o sasagete iru aida ni hito o tsukawashite, Dabide no gikan Giro bito Ahitoperu o, sono machi Giro kara yobiyoseta. Totou wa tsuyoku, tami wa shidai ni Abusaromu ni kuwawatta.
Hitori no shisha ga Dabide no tokoro ni kite, "Isuraeru no hitobito no kokoro wa Abusaromu ni shitagaimashita" to itta.
Dabide wa, jibun to issho ni Erusaremu ni iru subete no kerai ni itta, "Tate, wareware wa nigeyou. Sou shinakereba Abusaromu no mae kara nogareru koto wa dekinaku narude arou. Isoide iku ga yoi. Samo naito, karera ga isogi oitsuite, wareware ni gai o koumurase, tsurugi o motte machi o utsude arou".
Ou no shimobetachi wa ou ni itta, "Shimobetachi wa, waga shukun, ou no erabareru tokoro o subete okonaimasu".
Kou shite ou wa dete iki, sono zenka wa kare ni shitagatta. Ou wa juunin no mekake o nokoshite ie o mamoraseta.
Ou wa dete iki, tami wa mina kare ni shitagatta. Karera wa machihazure no ie ni todomatta.
Kare no shimobetachi wa mina, kare no katawara o susumi, subete no Kerete bito to, subete no Perete bi to, oyobi kare ni shitagatte Gate kara kita roppyakunin no Gate bito wa mina, ou no mae ni susunda.
Toki ni ou wa Gate bito ITtai ni itta, "Dou shite anata mo mata, wareware to tomo ni iku no desu ka. Anata wa kaette ou to tomo ni i nasai. Anata wa gaikokujin de, mata jibun no kuni kara tsuihou sareta mono dakara desu.
Anata wa, kinou kita bakari desu. Watashi wa jibun no iku tokoro o shirazu ni iku no ni, dou shite kyou, anata o, wareware to tomo ni samayowasete yoideshou. Anata wa kaeri nasai. Anata no kyoudaitachi mo tsurete kaeri nasai. Douzo Shu ga megumi to shinjitsu o anata ni shimeshite kudasaru you ni".
Shikashi ITtai wa ou ni kotaeta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Waga kimi, ou wa ikite orareru. Waga kimi, ou no orareru tokoro ni, shinu mo ikiru mo, shimobe mo mata soko ni orimasu".
Dabide wa ITtai ni itta, "De wa susunde iki nasai". Soko de Gate bito ITtai wa susumi, mata kare no subete no juusha oyobi kare to tomo ni ita kodomotachi mo mina, susunda.
Kunijyuu mi na oogoe de naita. Tami wa mina susunda. Ou mo mata Kideron no tani o watatte susumi, tami wa mina susunde arano no hou ni mukatta.
Soshite Abiyataru mo nobotte kita. Miyo, Zadoku oyobi kare to tomo ni iru subete no Rebi bito mo mata, kami no keiyaku no hako o kaite kita. Karera wa kami no hako o oroshite, tami ga kotogotoku machi o dete shimau no o matta.
Soko de ou wa Zadoku ni itta, "Kami no hako o machi ni kaki mo dosu ga yoi. Moshi watashi ga Shu no mae ni megumi o erunaraba, Shu wa watashi o tsurekaette, watashi ni sono hako to sono sumai to o misasete kudasarude arou.
Shikashi moshi Shu ga, 'Watashi wa omae o yorokobanai' to sou iwareru no de areba, douzo Shu ga yoshi to omowareru koto o watashi ni shite kudasaru you ni. Watashi wa koko ni orimasu".
Ou wa mata saishi Zadoku ni itta, "Miyo, anata mo Abiyataru mo, futari no kotachi, sunawachi anata no ko Ahimaazu to Abiyataru no ko Yonatan o tsurete, yasuraka ni machi ni kaeri nasai.
Watashi wa anata gata kara kotoba ga atte shirase o ukeru made, arano no watashiba ni todomarimasu".
Soko de Zadoku to Abiyataru wa kami no hako o Erusaremu ni kaki modori, soko ni todomatta.
Dabide wa oribuyama no sakamichi o nobottaga, noboru toki ni naki, sono atama o ooi, hadashi de itta. Kare to tomo ni iru tami mo mina atama o ootte nobori, nakinagara nobotta.
Toki ni, "Ahitoperu ga Abusaromu to kyoubou shita mono no uchi ni iru" to Dabide ni tsugeru hito ga atta no de Dabide wa itta, "Shu yo, douzo Ahitoperu no keiryaku o oroka na mono ni shite kudasai".
Dabide ga yama no itadaki ni aru kami o reihai suru basho ni kita toki, miyo, Aruki bito Hoshai wa sono uwagi o saki, atama ni tsuchi o kaburi, kite Dabide o mukaeta.
Dabide wa kare ni itta, "Moshi anata ga watashi to tomo ni susumunaraba, watashi no omoni to narude arou.
Shikashi moshi anata ga machi ni kaette Abusaromu ni mukai, 'Ou yo, watashi wa anata no shimobe to narimasu. Watashi ga kore made, anata no chichi no shimobe de atta you ni, watashi wa ima anata no shimobe to narimasu' to iunaraba, anata wa watashi no tame ni Ahitoperu no keiryaku o yaburu koto ga dekirude arou.
Saishitachi, Zadoku to Abiyataru to wa, anata to tomo ni asoko ni irude wa nai ka. Sore yue, anata wa ou no ie kara kiku koto o kotogotoku saishitachi, Zadoku to Abiyataru to ni tsuge nasai.
Asoko ni wa karera to tomo ni sono futari no kotachi, sunawachi Zadoku no ko Ahimaazu to Abiyataru no ko Yonatan to ga iru. Anata gata wa kiita koto o kotogotoku karera no te ni yotte watashi ni tsuuhou shi nasai".
Soko de Dabide no tomo Hoshai wa machi ni haitta. Sono toki Abusaromu wa sudeni Erusaremu ni haitte ita.
Dabide ga yama no itadaki o sugite, sukoshi itta toki, Mepibosete no shimobe Jiba wa, kura o oita nitou no roba o hiki, sono ue ni pan nihyakuko, hoshi bu dou hyakufu sa, natsu no kudamono ichi hyaku, budoushu ichi fukuro o nosete kite Dabide o mukaeta.
Ou wa Jiba ni itta, "Anata wa dou shite korera no mono o motte kita no desu ka". Jiba wa kotaeta, "Roba wa ou no kazoku ga noru tame, pan to natsu no kudamono wa wakamonotachi ga taberu tame, budoushu wa arano de yowatta mono ga nomu tame desu".
Ou wa itta, "Anata no shujin no ko wa doko ni oru no desu ka". Jiba wa ou ni itta, "Erusaremu ni todomatte imasu. Kare wa, 'Isuraeru no ie wa kyou, watashi no chichi no kuni o watashi ni kaesude arou' to omotta no desu".
Ou wa Jiba ni itta, "Miyo, Mepibosete no mono wa kotogotoku anata no mono desu". Jiba wa itta, "Watashi wa keii o arawashimasu. Waga Shu, ou yo, anata no mae ni itsu made mo megumi o esasete kudasai".
Dabide ou ga Bahorimu ni kita toki, Sauru no ie no ichizoku no mono ga hitori soko kara dete kita. Sono na o Shimei to ii, gera no ko de aru. Kare wa dete kinagara taezu norotta.
Soshite kare wa Dabide to Dabide ou no moromoro no kerai ni mukatte ishi o nageta. Sono toki, tami to yuushitachi wa mina ou no sayuu ni ita.
Shimei wa norou toki ni kou itta, "Chi o nagasu hito yo, yokoshima na hito yo, tachisare, tachisare.
Anata ga kawatte ou to natta Sauru no ie no chi o subete Shu ga anata ni mukuirareta no da. Shu wa oukoku o anata no ko Abusaromu no te ni watasareta. Miyo, anata wa chi o nagasu hito dakara, wazawai ni au no da".
Toki ni Zeruya no ko Abishai wa ou ni itta, "Kono shinda inu ga dou shite waga Shu, ou o norotte yokarou ka. Watashi ni, itte kare no kubi o torasete kudasai".
Shikashi ou wa itta, "Zeruya no kotachi yo, anata gata to, nan no kakawari ga aru no ka. Kare ga norou no wa, Shu ga kare ni, 'Dabide o noroe' to iwaretakara de arunaraba, dare ga, 'Anata wa dou shite kou iu koto o suru no ka' to itte yoide arou ka".
Dabide wa mata Abishai to jibun no subete no kerai to ni itta, "Watashi no mi kara deta waga ko ga watashi no inochi o motomete iru. Ima, kono Beniyamin bito to shite wa naosara da. Kare o yurushite norowasete oki nasai. Shu ga kare ni meijirareta no da.
Shu wa watashi no nayami o kaerimite kudasaru ka mo shirenai. Mata Shu wa kyou kare no noroi ni kaete, watashi ni zen o mukuite kudasaru ka mo shirenai".
Kou shite Dabide to sono juushatachi to wa michi o ittaga, Shimei wa Dabide ni narande mukai no yama no chuufuku o iki, ikinagara noroi, mata kare ni mukatte ishi ya, chiri o nagetsuketa.
Ou oyobi tomo ni iru tami wa mina tsukarete Yorudan ni tsuki, kare wa sono tokoro de iki o tsuida.
Sate Abusaromu to subete no tami, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Erusaremu ni kita. Ahitoperu mo Abusaromu to tomo ni ita.
Dabide no tomo de aru Aruki bito Hoshai ga Abusaromu no moto ni kita toki, Hoshai wa Abusaromu ni "Ou banzai, ou banzai" to itta.
Abusaromu wa Hoshai ni itta, "Kore wa anata ga sono tomo ni shimesu shinjitsu na no ka. Anata wa dou shite anata no tomo to issho ni ikanakatta no ka".
Hoshai wa Abusaromu ni itta, "Iie, Shu to kono tami to Isuraeru no subete no hitobito ga eranda mono ni watashi wa zokushi, katsu sono hito to issho ni orimasu.
Katsu mata watashi wa dare ni tsukaerubeki desu ka. Sono ko no mae ni tsukaerubekide wa arimasen ka. Anata no chichi no mae ni tsukaeta you ni, watashi wa anata no mae ni tsukaemasu".
Soko de Abusaromu wa Ahitoperu ni itta, "Anata gata wa, wareware ga dou shitara yoi no ka, hakarigoto o nobe nasai".
Ahitoperu wa Abusaromu ni itta, "Anata no chichi ga ie o mamoru tame ni nokosareta, mekaketachi no tokoro ni hairi nasai. Sou sureba Isuraeru wa mina anata ga chichiue ni nikumareru koto o kikudeshou. Soshite anata to issho ni iru mono no te wa tsuyoku narudeshou".
Kou shite karera ga Abusaromu no tame ni okujou ni tenmaku o hatta no de, Abusaromu wa zenIsuraeru no me no mae de chichi no mekaketachi no tokoro ni haitta.
Sono koro Ahitoperu ga sazukeru hakarigoto wa hito ga kami no mitsuge o ukagau you de atta. Ahitoperu no hakarigoto wa mina Dabide ni mo Abusaromu ni mo tomo ni sono you ni omowareta.
Toki ni Ahitoperu wa Abusaromu ni itta, "Watashi ni ichi man nisen no hito o erabidasasete kudasai. Watashi wa tatte, kon'ya Dabide no ato o oi,
Kare ga tsukarete te ga yowaku natte iru tokoro o osotte, kare o awatesasemashou. Soshite kare to tomo ni iru tami ga mina nigeru toki, watashi wa ou hitori o uchitori,
Subete no tami o hanayome ga sono otto no moto ni kaeru you ni anata ni kaerasemashou. Anata ga motomete orareru no wa tada hitori no inochi dake desukara, tami wa mina odayaka ni narudeshou".
Kono kotoba wa Abusaromu to Isuraeru no subete no chourou no kokoro ni kanatta.
Soko de Abusaromu wa itta, "Aruki bito Hoshai o mo yobiyose nasai. Wareware wa kare no iu koto o kikimashou".
Hoshai ga Abusaromu no moto ni kita toki, Abusaromu wa kare ni itta, "Ahitoperu wa kono you ni itta. Wareware wa kare no kotoba no you ni okonaubeki ka. Ikenai no de areba, ii nasai".
Hoshai wa Abusaromu ni itta, "Kono tabi Ahitoperu ga sazuketa hakarigoto wa yoku arimasen".
Hoshai wa mata itta, "Gozonji no you ni, anata no chichi to sono juushatachi to wa yuushi desu. Sono ue karera wa, no de ko o ubawareta kuma no you ni, hidoku ikatte imasu. Mata, anata no chichi wa iku sabi to desukara, tami to tomo ni yadoranaideshou.
Kare wa ima de mo ana no naka ka, doko ka hoka no tokoro ni kakurete imasu. Moshi tami no uchi no ikuhito ka ga tehajime ni taorerunaraba, sore o kiku mono wa dare de mo, 'Abusaromu ni shitagau tami no uchi ni senshisha ga atta' to iudeshou.
Sou sureba, shishi no kokoro no you na kokoro no aru isamashii hito de atte mo, osorete kiesatte shimaudeshou. Sore wa Isuraeru no subete no hito ga, anata no chichi no yuushi de aru koto, mata kare to tomo ni iru mono ga, isamashii hitobito de aru koto o shitte irukara desu.
Tokoro de watashi no hakarigoto wa, Isuraeru o Dan kara Beerushiba made, umibe no suna no you ni ooku anata no moto ni atsumete, anata mizukara tatakai ni nozomu koto desu.
Kou shite wareware wa kare no mitsukaru basho de kare o osoi, tsuyu ga chi ni oriru you ni kare no ue ni kudaru. Soshite kare oyobi kare to tomo ni iru subete no hito o hitori mo nokosanaideshou.
Moshi kare ga izure ka no machi ni shirizokunaraba, zenIsuraeru wa sono machi ni nawa o kake, wareware wa sore o tani ni hikitaoshite, soko ni hitotsu no koishi mo mirarenai you ni surudeshou".
Abusaromu to Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina, "Aruki bito Hoshai no hakarigoto wa, Ahitoperu no hakarigoto yori mo yoi" to itta. Sore wa Shu ga Abusaromu ni wazawai o kudasou to shite, Ahitoperu no yoi hakarigoto o yaburu koto o sadameraretakara de aru.
Soko de Hoshai wa saishitachi, Zadoku to Abiyataru to ni itta, "Ahitoperu wa Abusaromu to Isuraeru no chouroutachi no tame ni kou iu hakarigoto o shita. Mata watashi wa kou iu hakarigoto o shita.
Sore yue, anata gata wa sumiyaka ni hito o tsukawashite Dabide ni tsuge, 'Kon'ya, arano no watashiba ni yadoranaide, kanarazu watatte iki nasai. Samo nai to ou oyobi tomo ni iru tami wa mina, horobosarerudeshou' to ii nasai".
Toki ni, Yonatan to Ahimaazu wa Enrogeru de matte ita. Hitori no tsukaeme ga itte karera ni tsuge, karera wa itte Dabide ou ni tsugeru no ga tsune de atta. Sore wa karera ga machi ni wa iru no o mirarenai you ni suru tame de aru.
Tokoro ga hitori no wakamono ga karera o mite Abusaromu ni tsugeta no de, karera futari wa isoide sari, Bahorimu no, aru hitori no hito no ie ni kita. Sono hito no niwa ni ido ga atte, karera wa sono naka ni kudatta no de,
Onna wa ooi o totte kite ido no kuchi no ue ni hiroge, mugi o sono ue ni makichirashita. Sore yue sono koto wa nani mo shirenakatta.
Abusaromu no shimobetachi wa sono onna no ie ni kite itta, "Ahimaazu to Yonatan wa doko ni imasu ka". Onna wa karera ni itta, "Ano hitobito wa ogawa o watatte ikimashita". Karera wa tazunetaga miataranakatta no de Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Karera ga satta nochi, hitobito wa ido kara nobori, itte Dabide ou ni tsugeta. Sunawachi karera wa Dabide ni itta, "Tatte, sumiyaka ni kawa o watari nasai. Ahitoperu ga anata gata ni taishite kou iu hakarigoto o shitakara desu".
Soko de Dabide wa tatte, tomo ni iru subete no tami to issho ni Yorudan o watatta. Yoake ni wa, Yorudan o wataranai mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Ahitoperu wa, jibun no hakarigoto ga okonawarenai no o mite, roba ni kura o oki, tatte jibun no machi ni iki, sono ie ni kaetta. Soshite ie no hito ni yuigon shite mizukara kubirete shini, sono chichi no haka ni houmurareta.
Dabide wa Mahanaimu ni kita. Mata Abusaromu wa jibun to tomo ni iru Isuraeru no subete no hitobito to issho ni Yorudan o watatta.
Abusaromu wa Amasa o Yoabu no kawari ni gun no chou to shita. Amasa wa kano Nahashi no musume de Yoabu no haha Zeruya no imouto de aru Abigaru o metotta Ishimaeru bi to, na wa Itora to iu hito no ko de aru.
Soshite Isuraeru to Abusaromu wa Gireade no chi ni jindotta.
Dabide ga Mahanaimu ni kita toki, Anmon no hitobito no uchi no Raba no Nahashi no ko Shobi to, ro debaru no Anmieru no ko Makiru, oyobi Rogerimu no Gireade bito Barujirai wa,
Nedoko to hachi, doki, komugi, oomugi, kona, iri mugi, mame, Renzu mame,
Mitsu, gyounyuu, hitsuji, kanraku o Dabide oyobi tomo ni iru tami ga taberu tame ni motte kita. Sore wa karera ga, "Tami wa arano de uetsukare kawaite iru" to omottakara de aru.
Sate Dabide wa jibun to tomo ni iru tami o shirabete, sono ue ni sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou o tateta.
Soshite Dabide wa tami o tsukawashi, sanbun no ichi o Yoabu no te ni, sanbun no ichi o Zeruya no ko Yoabu no kyoudai Abishai no te ni, sanbun no ichi o Gate bito ITtai no te ni azuketa. Kou shite ou wa tami ni itta, "Watashi mo mata kanarazu anata gata to issho ni demasu".
Shikashi tami wa itta, "Anata wa dete wa narimasen. Sore wa wareware ga donna ni nigete mo, karera wa wareware ni kokoro o tomezu, wareware no nakaba ga shinde mo, wareware ni kokoro o tomenaikara desu. Shikashi anata wa wareware no ichi man ni hitoshii no desu. Sore yue anata wa machi no naka kara wareware o tasukete kudasaru hou ga yoroshii".
Ou wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no mottomo yoi to omou koto o watashi wa shimashou". Kou shite ou wa mon no katawara ni tachi, tami wa mina aruiha hyakunin, aruiha sennin to natte dete itta.
Ou wa Yoabu, Abishai oyobi ITtai ni meijite, "Watashi no tame, wakamono Abusaromu o odayaka ni atsukau you ni" to itta. Ou ga Abusaromu no koto ni tsuite subete no choutachi ni meijite iru toki, tami wa mina kiite ita.
Kou shite tami wa Isuraeru ni mukatte no ni dete iki, Efuraimu no mori de tatakattaga,
Isuraeru no tami wa sono tokoro de Dabide no keraitachi no mae ni yabureta. Sono hi sono tokoro ni senshisha ga ooku, ni man ni oyonda.
Soshite tatakai wa amaneku sono chi no omote ni hirogatta. Kono hi, mori no horoboshita mono wa, tsurugi no horoboshita mono yori mo ookatta.
Sate Abusaromu wa Dabide no keraitachi ni ikiatta. Sono toki Abusaromu wa raba ni notte itaga, raba wa ookii kashi no ki no, shigetta eda no shita o tootta no de, Abusaromu no atama ga sono kashi no ki ni kakatte, kare wa tenchi no aida ni tsurisagatta. Raba wa kare o sutete sugite itta.
Hitori no hito ga sore o mite Yoabu ni tsugete itta, "Watashi wa Abusaromu ga, kashi no ki ni kakatte iru no o mimashita".
Yoabu wa sore o tsugeta hito ni itta, "Anata wa sore o mita to iu no ka. Sore nara, dou shite anata wa kare o sono tokoro de, chi ni uchiotosanakatta no ka. Watashi wa anata ni gin juu shikeru to obi hitosuji o ataetade arou ni".
Sono hito wa Yoabu ni itta, "Tatoi watashi no te ni gin sen shikeru o ukete mo, te o dashite ou no ko ni tekisuru koto wa shimasen. Ou wa wareware ga kiite iru tokoro de, anata to Abishai to ITtai ni, 'Watashi no tame wakamono Abusaromu o hogo seyo' to meijiraretakara desu.
Moshi watashi ga somuite kare no inochi o sokonatta no de areba, nanigoto mo ou ni kakureru koto wa arimasenkara, anata wa mizukara tatte watashi o semeraretadeshou".
Soko de, Yoabu wa "Kou shite anata to tomo ni todomatte wa orarenai" to itte, te ni misuji no nageyari o tori, ano kashi no ki ni kakatte, nao ikite iru Abusaromu no shinzou ni kore o tsukitooshita.
Yoabu no buki o toru juunin no wakamonotachi wa torimaite, Abusaromu o uchikoroshita.
Kou shite Yoabu ga rappa o fuita no de, tami wa Isuraeru no ato o ou koto o yamete kaetta. Yoabu ga tami o hikitometakara de aru.
Hitobito wa Abusaromu o totte, mori no naka no ookina ana ni nageire, sono ue ni hijou ni ookii ishizuka o tsumiageta. Soshite Isuraeru wa mina onoono sono tenmaku ni nigekaetta.
Sate Abusaromu wa ikite iru aida ni, ou no tani ni jibun no tame ni hitotsu no hashira o tateta. Sore wa kare ga, "Watashi wa jibun no na o tsutaeru ko ga nai" to omottakara de aru. Kare wa sono hashira ni jibun no na o tsuketa. Sono hashira wa konnichi made Abusaromu no ishibumi to tonaerarete iru.
Sate Zadoku no ko Ahimaazu wa itta, "Watashi wa hashitte itte, Shu ga ou o teki no te kara sukuidasareta otozure o ou ni tsutaemashou".
Yoabu wa kare ni itta, "Kyou wa, otozure o tsutaete wa naranai. Otozure o tsutaeru no wa, hoka no hi ni shi nasai. Kyou wa ou no ko ga shinda no de, otozure o tsutaete wa naranai".
Yoabu wa Kushi bito ni itta, "Itte, anata no mita koto o ou ni tsuge nasai". Kushi bi to wa Yoabu ni rei o shite hashitte itta.
Zadoku no ko Ahimaazu wa kasanete Yoabu ni itta, "Nanigoto ga aroutomo, watashi ni mo Kushi bito no ato kara hashitte ikasete kudasai". Yoabu wa itta, "Ko yo, otozure no mukui o erarenai no ni, dou shite anata wa hashitte ikou to suru no ka".
Kare wa itta, "Nanigoto ga aroutomo, watashi wa hashitte ikimasu". Yoabu wa kare ni itta, "Hashitte iki nasai". Soko de Ahimaazu wa teichi no michi o hashitte iki, Kushi bito o oikoshita.
Toki ni Dabide wa futatsu no mon no aida ni suwatte ita. Soshite mihari no mono ga jouheki no mon no yane ni nobori, me o agete mite iruto, tada hitori de hashitte kuru mono ga atta.
Mihari no mono ga yobawatte ou ni tsugeta no de, ou wa itta, "Moshi hitori naraba, sono kuchi ni otozure ga arude arou". Sono hito wa isoide kite chikazuita.
Mihari no mono wa, hoka ni mata hitori hashitte kuru no o mita no de, mon no hou ni yobawatte itta, "Miyo, hoka ni tada hitori de hashitte kuru mono ga arimasu". Ou wa itta, "Kare mo mata otozure o motte kuru no da".
Mihari no mono wa itta, "Massaki ni hashitte kuru hito wa Zadoku no ko Ahimaazu no you desu". Ou wa itta, "Kare wa yoi hito da. Yoi otozure o motte kurude arou".
Toki ni Ahimaazu wa yobawatte ou ni itta, "Heian de iraseraremasu you ni". Soshite ou no mae ni chi ni hirefushite itta, "Anata no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa ou, waga kimi ni tekishite te o ageta hitobito o hikiwatasaremashita".
Ou wa itta, "Wakamono Abusaromu wa heian desu ka". Ahimaazu wa kotaeta, "Yoabu ga shimobe o tsukawasu toki, watashi wa ookina sawagi o mimashitaga, nanigoto de atta ka shirimasen".
Ou wa itta, "Waki e itte, soko ni tatte i nasai". Kare wa waki e itte tatta.
Sono toki Kushi bito ga kita. Soshite sono Kushi bi to wa itta, "Waga kimi, ou ga yoi otozure o ouke kudasaru you. Shu wa kyou, subete anata ni tekishite tatta monodomo no te kara, anata o sukuidasareta no desu".
Ou wa Kushi bito ni itta, "Wakamono Abusaromu wa heian desu ka". Kushi bi to wa kotaeta, "Ou, waga kimi no teki, oyobi subete anata ni tekishite tachi, gai o shiyou to suru mono wa, ano wakamono no you ni narimasu you ni".
Ou wa hijou ni kanashimi, mon no ue no heya ni nobotte naita. Kare wa ikinagara kono you ni itta, "Waga ko Abusaromu yo. Waga ko, waga ko Abusaromu yo. Aa, watashi ga kawatte shineba yokatta no ni. Abusaromu, waga ko yo, waga ko yo".
Toki ni Yoabu ni tsugeru mono ga atte, "Miyo, ou wa Abusaromu no tame ni nakikanashinde iru" to itta.
Kou shite sono hi no shouri wa subete no tami no kanashimi to natta. Sore wa sono hi, tami ga, "Ou wa sono ko no tame ni kanashinde iru" to hito no iu no o kiitakara de aru.
Soshite tami wa sono hi, tatakai ni nigete hajite iru tami ga hisoka ni, hairu you ni, hisoka ni machi ni haitta.
Ou wa kao o ootta. Soshite ou wa oogoe ni sakende, "Waga ko Abusaromu yo. Abusaromu, waga ko yo, waga ko yo" to itta.
Toki ni Yoabu wa ie ni hairi, ou no moto ni kite itta, "Anata wa, kyou, anata no inochi to, anata no musuko musumetachi no inochi, oyobi anata no tsumatachi no inochi to, mekaketachi no inochi o sukutta subete no kerai no kao o hazukashimeraremashita.
Sore wa anata ga jibun o nikumu mono o aishi, jibun o aisuru mono o nikumarerukara desu. Anata wa, kyou, gun no choutachi o mo, shimobetachi o mo kaeriminai koto o shimesaremashita. Kyou, watashi wa shirimashita. Moshi, Abusaromu ga ikite ite, wareware ga mina kyou shinde itara, anata no me ni kanattadeshou.
Ima tatte dete itte, shimobetachi ni nengoro ni katatte kudasai. Watashi wa Shu o sashite chikaimasu. Moshi anata ga derarenainaraba, kon'ya anata to tomo ni todomaru mono wa hitori mo naideshou. Kore wa anata ga wakai toki kara ima made ni koumurareta subete no wazawai yori mo, anata ni totte waruideshou".
Soko de ou wa tatte mon no uchi no za ni tsuita. Hitobito wa subete no tami ni, "Miyo, ou wa mon ni zashite iru" to tsugeta no de, tami wa mina ou no mae ni kita. Sate Isuraeru wa onoono sono tenmaku ni nigekaetta.
Soshite Isuraeru no moromoro no buzoku no naka de tami wa mina arasotte itta, "Ou wa wareware o teki no te kara sukuidashi, mata wareware o Perishite bito no te kara tasukedasareta. Shikashi ima wa Abusaromu no tame ni kuni no soto ni nigete orareru.
Mata wareware ga abura o sosoide, wareware no ue ni tateta Abusaromu wa tatakai de shinda. Sore de aru no ni, dou shite anata gata wa ou o michibiki kaeru koto ni tsuite, nani o mo iwanai no ka".
Dabide ou wa saishitachi Zadoku to Abiyataru to ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "Yuda no chouroutachi ni ii nasai, 'ZenIsuraeru no kotoba ga ou ni tasshita no ni, dou shite anata gata wa ou o sono ie ni michibiki kaeru saigo no mono to naru no desu ka.
Anata gata wa watashi no kyoudai, watashi no kotsuniku desu. Sore ni dou shite ou o michibiki kaeru saigo no mono to naru no desu ka'.
Mata Amasa ni ii nasai, 'Anata wa watashi no kotsuniku de wa arimasen ka. Kore kara nochi anata o Yoabu ni kaete, watashi no gun no chou to shimasu. Moshi sou shinai toki wa, kami ga ikue ni mo watashi o basshite kudasaru you ni' ".
Kou shite Dabide wa Yuda no subete no hito no kokoro o, hitori no you ni jibun ni katamukesaseta no de, karera wa ou ni, "Douzo anata mo, subete no keraitachi mo kaette kite kudasai" to ii okutta.
Soko de ou wa kaette kite Yorudan made kuruto, Yuda no hitohito wa ou o mukaeru tame Girugaru ni kite, ou ni Yorudan o wataraseta.
Bahorimu no Beniyamin bi to, gera no ko Shimei wa, isoide Yuda no hitobito to tomo ni kudatte kite, Dabide ou o mukaeta.
Issennin no Beniyamin bito ga kare to tomo ni ita. Mata Sauru no ie no shimobe Jiba mo sono juu gonin no musuko to, nijuunin no shimobe o shitagaete, ou no mae ni Yorudan ni kakekudatta.
Soshite ou no kazoku o watashi, ou no kokoro ni kanau koto o shiyou to watashiba o watatta. Gera no ko Shimei wa Yorudan o watarou to suru toki, ou no mae ni hirefushi,
Ou ni itta, "Douzo waga kimi ga, tsumi o watashi ni kishirarenai you ni. Mata waga kimi, ou no Erusaremu o derareta hi ni, shimobe ga okonatta warui koto o omoidasarenai you ni. Douzo ou ga sore o kokoro ni tomerarenai you ni.
Shimobe wa jibun ga tsumi o okashita koto o shitte imasu. Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa kyou, Yosefu no zenka no massaki ni kudatte kite, waga Shu, ou o mukaeru no desu".
Zeruya no ko Abishai wa kotaete itta, "Shimei wa Shu ga abura o sosogareta mono o norotta no de, sono tame ni korosarerubekide wa arimasen ka".
Dabide wa itta, "Anata gata Zeruya no kotachi yo, anata gata to nani no kakawari ga atte, anata gata wa kyou watashi ni tekitai suru no ka. Kyou, Isuraeru no uchi de hito o koroshite yokarou ka. Watashi ga, kyou Isuraeru no ou to natta koto o, dou shite jibun de shiranai koto ga arou ka".
Kou shite ou wa Shimei ni, "Anata o korosanai" to itte, ou wa kare ni chikatta.
Sauru no ko Mepibosete wa kudatte kite ou o mukaeta. Kare wa ou ga satta hi kara yasuraka ni kaeru hi made, sono ashi o kazarazu, sono hige o totonoezu, mata sono kimono o arawanakatta.
Kare ga Erusaremu kara kite ou o mukaeta toki, ou wa kare ni itta, "Mepibosete yo, anata wa dou shite watashi to tomo ni ikanakatta no ka".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Waga Shu, ou yo, watashi no kerai ga watashi o azamuita no desu. Shimobe wa kare ni, 'Watashi no tame ni, roba ni kura o oke. Watashi wa sore ni notte ou to tomo ni iku' to itta no desu. Shimobe wa ashi nae dakara desu.
Tokoro ga kare wa shimobe no koto o waga Shu, ou no mae ni, ashizama ni itta no desu. Shikashi, waga Shu, ou wa kami no tsukai no you de iraseraremasu. Sore de, anata no yoi to omowareru koto o shite kudasai.
Watashi no chichi no zenka wa waga Shu, ou no mae ni wa mina shinda hito ni suginai no ni, anata wa shimobe o, anata no shokutaku de shokuji o suru hitobito no uchi ni okaremashita. Watashi ni nan no kenri ga atte, kasanete ou ni uttaeru koto ga dekimashou".
Ou wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa dou shite nao mo jibun no koto o iu no desu ka. Watashi wa kimemashita. Anata to Jiba to wa sono tochi o wake nasai".
Mepibosete wa ou ni itta, "Waga Shu, ou ga yasuraka ni ie ni kaerareta no desukara, kare ni sore o mina torasete kudasai".
Sate Gireade bito Barujirai wa Rogerimu kara kudatte kite, Yorudan de ou o miokuru tame, ou to tomo ni Yorudan ni susunda.
Barujirai wa, hijou ni toshioita hito de hachijuu sai de atta. Kare wa mata, hijou ni yuufuku na hito de atta no de, ou ga Mahanaimu ni todomatte iru aida, ou o yashinatta.
Ou wa Barujirai ni itta, "Watashi to issho ni watatte iki nasai. Watashi wa Erusaremu de anata o watashi to tomo ni orasete yashinaimashou".
Barujirai wa ou ni itta, "Watashi wa, nao nani nen ikinagaraeru no de, ou to tomo ni Erusaremu ni noboru no desu ka.
Watashi wa konnichi hachijuusai desu. Watashi ni, yoi koto warui koto ga wakimaerarerudeshou ka. Shimobe wa taberu mono, nomu mono o ajiwau koto ga dekimashou ka. Watashi wa utau otoko ya utau onna no koe o mada kiku koto ga dekimashou ka. Sore de aru no ni, shimobe wa dou shite nao waga Shu, ou no omoni to natte yoroshiideshou ka.
Shimobe wa ou to tomo ni Yorudan o watatte, tada sukoshi ikimashou. Dou shite ou wa kono you na mukui o watashi ni mukuirarenakereba naranai no deshou ka.
Douzo shimobe o kaerasete kudasai. Watashi wa jibun no machi de, fubo no haka no chikaku de shinimasu. Tadashi, anata no shimobe Kimuhamu ga koko ni orimasu. Waga Shu, ou to tomo ni kare o watatte ikasete kudasai. Mata anata ga yoi to omowareru koto o kare ni shite kudasai".
Ou wa kotaeta, "Kimuhamu wa watashi to tomo ni watatte ikasemasu. Watashi wa, anata ga yoi to omowareru koto o kare ni shimashou. Mata anata ga nozomareru koto wa mina, anata no tame ni itashimasu".
Kou shite tami wa mina Yorudan o watatta. Ou wa watatta toki, Barujirai ni kuchizuke shite, shukufuku shita no de, kare wa jibun no ie ni kaette itta.
Ou wa Girugaru ni susunda. Kimuhamu mo kare to tomo ni susunda. Yuda no tami wa mina ou o okuri, Isuraeru no tami no nakaba mo mata sou shita.
Sate Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina ou no tokoro ni kite, ou ni itta, "Wareware no kyoudai de aru Yuda no hitobito wa, naniyue ni anata o nusumisatte, ou to sono kazoku, oyobi Dabide ni tomonatte iru subete no juusha ni Yorudan o wataraseta no desu ka".
Yuda no hitobito wa mina Isuraeru no hitobito ni kotaeta, "Ou wa wareware no kinshin dakara desu. Anata gata wa dou shite kono koto de ikarareru no desu ka. Wareware ga sukoshi de mo ou no mono o tabeta koto ga arimasu ka. Ou ga nani ka tamamono o wareware ni ataeta koto ga arimasu ka".
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Yuda no hitobito ni kotaeta, "Wareware wa ou no uchi ni juu no bun o motte imasu. Mata Dabide no uchi ni mo wareware wa anata ga tayori mo ooku o motte imasu. Sore de aru no ni, dou shite anata gata wa wareware o karonjita no desu ka. Warera no ou o michibiki kaerou to saisho ni itta no wa wareware de wa nai no desu ka". Shikashi Yuda no hitobito no kotoba wa Isuraeru no hitobito no kotoba yori mo hageshikatta.
Sate, sono tokoro ni hitori no yokoshima na hito ga atte, na o Shiba to itta. Bikuri no ko de, Beniyamin bito de atta. Kare wa rappa o fuite itta, "Wareware wa Dabide no uchi ni bun ga nai. Mata Essai no ko no uchi ni shigyou o motanai. Isuraeru yo, onoono sono tenmaku ni kaeri nasai".
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina Dabide ni shitagau koto o yamete, Bikuri no ko Shiba ni shitagatta. Shikashi Yuda no hitobito wa sono ou ni tsukishitagatte, Yorudan kara Erusaremu e itta.
Dabide wa Erusaremu no jibun no ie ni kita. Soshite ou wa ie o mamoru tame ni nokoshite oita juunin no mekaketachi o totte, hitotsu no ie ni irete mamori, mata yashinattaga, kanojotachi no tokoro ni wa, hairanakatta. Kanojotachi wa shinu hi made tojikomerare isshou, kafu to shite sugoshita.
Ou wa Amasa ni itta, "Watashi no tame mikka no uchi ni Yuda no hitobito o yobiatsumete, koko ni ki nasai".
Amasa wa Yuda o yobiatsumeru tame ni ittaga, kare wa sadamerareta toki yori mo okureta.
Dabide wa Abishai ni itta, "Bikuri no ko Shiba wa ima wareware ni Abusaromu yori mo ooku no gai o surude arou. Anata no shukun no keraitachi o hikiite, kare no ato o oi nasai. Samo naito kare wa kengo na machimachi o ete, wareware o nayamasude arou".
Kou shite Yoabu to Kerete bito to Perete bi to, oyobi subete no yuushi wa Abishai ni shitagatte deta. Sunawachi karera wa Erusaremu o dete, Bikuri no ko Shiba no ato o otta.
Karera ga Gibeon ni aru ooishi no tokoro ni ita toki, Amasa ga kite karera ni atta. Toki ni Yoabu wa gunpuku o kite, obi o shime, sono ue ni saya ni osameta tsurugi o koshi ni musunde obite itaga, kare ga susumideta toki tsurugi wa nukeochita.
Yoabu wa Amasa ni, "Kyoudai yo, anata wa yasuraka desu ka" to itte, Yoabu wa migi no te o motte Amasa no hige o toraete kare ni kuchizuke shiyou to shitaga,
Amasa wa Yoabu no te ni tsurugi ga aru koto ni kizukanakatta no de, Yoabu wa sore o motte Amasa no fukubu o sashite, sono harawata o chi ni nagashidashi, kasanete utsu koto mo naku kare o koroshita. Kou shite Yoabu to sono kyoudai Abishai wa Bikuri no ko Shiba no ato o otta.
Toki ni Yoabu no wakamono no hitori ga Amasa no katawara ni tatte itta, "Yoabu ni mikata suru mono, Dabide ni tsuku mono wa Yoabu no ato ni shitagai nasai".
Amasa wa chi ni shinde ooji no naka ni korogatte ita no de, sono soba ni kuru mono wa mina kare o mite tachidomatta. Kono hito wa tami ga mina tachidomaru no o mite, Amasa o ooji kara hatake ni utsushi, ifuku o sono ue ni kaketa.
Amasa ga ooji kara utsusareta no de, tami wa mina Yoabu ni shitagatte susumi, Bikuri no ko Shiba no ato o otta.
Shiba wa Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi o tootte Betemaaka no Aberu ni kita. Bikuri bi to wa mina, atsumatte kite kare ni shitagatta.
Soko de Yoabu to tomo ni ita subete no hitobito ga kite, kare o Betemaaka no Aberu ni kakomi, machi ni mukatte tsuchirui o kizuita. Sore wa toride ni mukatte taterareta. Kou shite karera wa jouheki o kuzusou to shite kore o utta.
Sono toki, hitori no kashikoi onna ga machi kara yobawatta, "Anata gata wa kiki nasai. Anata gata wa kiki nasai. Yoabu ni, 'Koko ni kite kudasai. Watashi wa anata ni iu koto ga arimasu' to itte kudasai".
Kare ga sono onna ni chikayoruto, onna wa "Anata ga Yoabu desu ka" to itta. Kare wa "Sou desu" to kotaeta. Suru to onna wa kare ni "Hashi tame no kotoba o okiki kudasai" to itta no de, "Kikimashou" to kare wa itta.
Soko de onna wa itta, "Mukashi, hitobito wa itsu mo, 'Aberu de tazune nasai' to itte, koto o sadamemashita.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no uchi no heiwa na, chuusei na mono desu. Sou de aru no ni, anata wa Isuraeru no uchi de haha to mo iubeki machi o horobosou to shite oraremasu. Dou shite Shu no shigyou o, nomi tsukusou to sareru no desu ka".
Yoabu wa kotaeta, "Iie, kesshite sou de wa naku, watashi ga, nomi tsukushi tari, horoboshi tari suru koto wa arimasen.
Jijitsu wa sou de wa naku, Efuraimu no sanchi no hito Bikuri no ko, na o Shiba to iu mono ga te o agete ou Dabide ni somuita no desu. Anata gata ga kare hitori o watasunaraba, watashi wa kono machi o sarimasu". Onna wa Yoabu ni itta, "Kare no kubi wa jouheki no ue kara anata no tokoro e nagerarerudeshou".
Kou shite kono onna ga chie o motte, subete no tami no tokoro ni itta no de, karera wa Bikuri no ko Shiba no kubi o hanete Yoabu no tokoro e nagedashita. Soko de Yoabu wa rappa o fukinarashita no de, hitobito wa chitte machi o sari, onoono ie ni kaetta. Yoabu wa Erusaremu ni iru ou no moto ni kaetta.
Yoabu wa Isuraeru no zengun no chou de atta. Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa Kerete bi to, oyobi Perete bito no chou,
Adoramu wa choubonin no chou, Ahirude no ko Yoshapate wa shikan,
Shiwa wa shokikan, Zadoku to Abiyataru to wa saishi.
Mata Yairu bito Ira wa Dabide no saishi de atta.
Dabide no yo ni, toshi mata toshi to san nen, kikin ga atta no de, Dabide ga Shu ni tazuneta tokoro, Shu wa iwareta, "Sauru to sono ie to ni, chi o nagashita tsumi ga aru. Sore wa katsute kare ga Gibeon bito o koroshita tame de aru".
Soko de ou wa Gibeon bito o me shiyoseta. Gibeon bito wa Isuraeru no shison de wa naku, Amori bito no nokori de atte, Isuraeru no hitobito wa karera to chikai o tatete, sono inochi o tasuketa. Tokoro ga Sauru wa Isuraeru to Yuda no hitobito no tame ni nesshin de atta no de, karera o korosou to shita no de aru.
Sore de Dabide wa Gibeon bito ni itta, "Watashi wa anata gata no tame ni, nani o sureba yoi no desu ka. Donna tsugunai o sureba, anata gata wa Shu no shigyou o shukufuku suru no desu ka".
Gibeon bito wa kare ni itta, "Kore wa wareware to, Sauru mata wa sono ie to no aida no kingin no mondai de wa arimasen. Mata Isuraeru no uchi no hitori de mo, wareware ga korosou to iu no de mo arimasen". Dabide wa itta, "Watashi ga anata gata no tame ni nani o sureba yoi to iu no desu ka".
Karera wa ou ni itta, "Wareware o horoboshita hito, wareware o horoboshite Isuraeru no ryouiki no doko ni mo orasenai you ni to, takuranda hito,
Sono hito no shison nananin o hikiwatashite kudasai. Wareware wa Shu no yama ni aru Gibeon de, karera o Shu no mae ni ki ni kakemashou". Ou wa itta, "Hikiwatashimashou".
Shikashi ou wa Sauru no ko Yonatan no ko de aru Mepibosete o oshinda. Karera no aida, sunawachi Dabide to Sauru no ko Yonatan to no aida ni, Shu o sashite tateta chikai ga attakara de aru.
Ou wa Aya no musume Rizupa ga Sauru ni unda futari no ko Arumoni to Mepibosete, oyobi Sauru no musume Merabu ga Mehora bito Barujirai no ko Aderieru ni unda gonin no ko o totte,
Karera o Gibeon bito no te ni hikiwatashita no de, Gibeon bito wa karera o yama de Shu no mae ni ki ni kaketa. Karera nananin wa tomo ni taoreta. Karera wa kariire no hajime no hi, sunawachi oomugikari no hajime ni korosareta.
Aya no musume Rizupa wa aranuno o totte, sore o jibun no tame ni iwa no ue ni shiki, kariire no hajime kara, sono hitobito no shitai no ue ni ten kara ame ga furu made, hiru wa sora no tori ga shitai no ue ni konai you ni shi, yoru wa no no kemono o chikayorasenakatta.
Aya no musume de Sauru no mekake de atta Rizupa no shita koto ga Dabide ni kikoeta no de,
Dabide wa itte Sauru no hone to sono ko Yonatan no hone o, Yabeshigireade no hitobito no tokoro kara totte kita. Kore wa Perishite bito ga Sauru o Giruboa de koroshita hi ni, ki ni kaketa Beteshan no hiroba kara, karera ga nusunde ita mono de aru.
Dabide wa soko kara Sauru no hone to, sono ko Yonatan no hone o tazusaete nobotta. Mata hitobito wa sono kakerareta monodomo no hone o atsumeta.
Kou shite karera wa Sauru to sono ko Yonatan no hone o, Beniyamin no chi no Zera ni aru sono chichi Kishi no haka ni houmuri, subete ou no meijita you ni shita. Kono nochi, kami wa sono chi no tame ni, inori o kikareta.
Perishite bi to wa mata Isuraeru to sensou o shita. Dabide wa sono keraitachi to tomo ni kudatte Perishite bito to tatakattaga, Dabide wa tsukarete ita.
Toki ni Ishibibenobu wa Dabide o korosou to omotta. Ishibibenobu wa kyojin no shison de, sono yari wa seidou de omosa sanbyaku shikeru ari, kare wa atarashii tsurugi o obite ita.
Shikashi Zeruya no ko Abishai wa Dabide o tasukete, sono Perishite bito o uchikoroshita. Soko de Dabide no juushatachi wa kare ni chikatte itta, "Anata wa wareware to tomo ni, kasanete sensou ni dete wa narimasen. Samo naito, anata wa Isuraeru no tomoshihi o kesudeshou".
Kono nochi, futatabi Gobu de Perishite bito to no tatakai ga atta. Toki ni Hosha bi to Shibekai wa kyojin no shison no hitori Safu o koroshita.
Koko ni mata Gobu de, Perishite bito to no tatakai ga attaga, soko de wa Betsurehemu bito Yareoregimu no ko Eruhanan wa, Gate bi to Goriate o koroshita. Sono yari no e wa hata no makibou no you de atta.
Mata Gate de futatabi tatakai ga attaga, soko ni hitori no se no takai hito ga ari, sono te no yubi to ashi no yubi wa rokupon zutsu de, sono kazu wa awasete nijuu yonhon de atta. Kare mo mata kyojin kara umareta mono de atta.
Kare wa Isuraeru o nonoshitta no de, Dabide no kyoudai Shimea no ko Yonatan ga kare o koroshita.
Korera no yonnin wa Gate de kyojin kara umareta mono de attaga, Dabide no te to sono keraitachi no te ni taoreta.
Dabide wa Shu ga moromoro no teki no te to Sauru no te kara, jibun o sukuidasareta hi ni, kono uta no kotoba o Shu ni mukatte nobe,
Kare wa itta, "Shu wa waga iwa, waga shiro, watashi o sukuu mono,
Waga kami, waga iwa. Watashi wa kare ni yori tanomu. Waga tate, waga sukui no tsuno, waga takaki yagura, waga sakedokoro, waga sukuinushi. Anata wa watashi o bougyaku kara sukuwareru.
Watashi wa, home matsurubeki Shu ni yobawatte, watashi no teki kara sukuwareru.
Shi no nami wa watashi o torimaki, horobi no oomizu wa watashi o osotta.
Yomi no tsuna wa watashi o torikakomi, shi no wana wa watashi ni, tachimukatta.
Kunan no uchi ni watashi wa Shu o yobi, mata waga kami ni yobawatta. Shu ga sono miya kara watashi no koe o kikarete, watashi no sakebi wa sono mimi ni todoita.
Sono toki chi wa furui ugoki, ten no motoi wa yurugi furueta. Kare ga ikararetakara de aru.
Kemuri wa sono hana kara tachinobori, hi wa sono kuchi kara dete yakitsukushi, hakunetsu no sumi wa kare kara moe deta.
Kare wa ten o hikuku shite kudarare, kurayami ga kare no ashi no shita ni atta.
Kare wa kerubu ni notte tobi, kaze no tsubasa ni notte arawareta.
Kare wa sono shuui ni makuya to shite, yami to koki kumo to mizu no atsumari to o okareta.
Sono mimae no kagayaki kara sumibi ga moe deta.
Shu wa ten kara kaminari o todorokase, ito takaki mono wa koe o dasareta.
Kare wa mata ya o hanatte karera o chirashi, inazuma o hanatte karera o uchiyaburareta.
Shu no togame to, sono hana no ibuki to ni yotte, umi no soko wa araware, sekai no motoi ga, arawa ni natta.
Kare wa takaki tokoro kara te o nobete watashi o torae, oomizu no naka kara watashi o hikiage,
Watashi no tsuyoi teki to, watashi o nikumu mono to kara watashi o sukuwareta. Karera wa watashi ni totte, amari ni mo tsuyokattakara da.
Karera wa watashi no wazawai no hi ni watashi ni, tachimukatta. Shikashi Shu wa watashi no shichuu to narareta.
Kare wa mata watashi o hiroi tokoro e hikidasare, watashi o yorokobarete, sukutte kudasatta.
Shu wa watashi no gi ni shitagatte watashi ni mukui, watashi no te no kiyo ki ni shitagatte watashi ni mukui kaesareta.
Sore wa, watashi ga Shu no michi o mamori, aku o okonawazu, waga kami kara hanareta koto ga naikara de aru.
Sono subete no okite wa watashi no mae ni atte, watashi wa sono, misadame o hanareta koto ga nai.
Watashi wa Shu no mae ni kaketa tokoro naku, mizukara o mamotte tsumi o okasanakatta.
Sore yue, Shu wa watashi no gi ni shitagai, sono me no mae ni watashi no kiyo ki ni shitagatte, watashi ni mukuirareta.
Chuujitsu na mono ni wa, anata wa chuujitsu na mono to nari, kaketa tokoro no nai hito ni wa, anata wa kaketa tokoro no nai mono to nari,
Kiyoi mono ni wa, anata wa kiyoi mono to nari, magatta mono ni wa, kata iji na mono to narareru.
Anata wa herikudaru tami o sukuwareru, shikashi anata no me wa takaburu mono o mite kore o hikuku serareru.
Makoto ni, Shu yo, anata wa watashi no tomoshibi, waga kami wa watashi no yami o tera sareru.
Makoto ni, anata ni yotte watashi wa tekigun o fumi horoboshi, waga kami ni yotte ishigaki o tobikoeru koto ga dekiru.
Kono kami koso, sono michi wa hi no uchi dokoro naku, Shu no yakusoku wa shinjitsu de aru. Kare wa subete kare ni yori tanomu mono no tate de aru.
Shu no hoka ni, dare ga kami ka, warera no kami no hoka, dare ga iwa de aru ka.
Kono kami koso watashi no kengo na sake dokoro de ari, watashi no michi o anzen ni sareta.
Watashi no ashi o mejika no ashi no you ni shite, watashi o takai tokoro ni anzen ni tatase,
Watashi no te o tatakai ni narasareta no de, watashi no ude wa seidou no yumi o hiku koto ga dekiru.
Anata wa sono sukui no tate o watashi ni atae, anata no tasuke wa, watashi o ooinaru mono to sareta.
Anata wa watashi ga aruku hiroi basho o ataerareta no de, watashi no ashi wa suberanakatta.
Watashi wa teki o otte, kore o horoboshi, kore o tayasu made wa kaeranakatta.
Watashi wa karera o tayashi, karera o kudaita no de karera wa tatsu koto ga dekizu, watashi no ashimoto ni taoreta.
Anata wa tatakai no tame ni, watashi ni chikara o obisase watashi o semeru mono o watashi no shita ni kagamaserareta.
Anata ni yotte, teki wa sono ushiro o watashi ni muketa no de, watashi o nikumu mono o watashi wa horoboshita.
Karera wa mimawashitaga, sukuu mono wa inakatta. Karera wa Shu ni sakendaga, karera ni wa kotaerarenakatta.
Watashi wa karera o chi no chiri no you ni komaka ni uchikudaki, chimata no doro no you ni, fuminijitta.
Anata wa watashi o kuniguni no tami to no arasoi kara sukuidashi, watashi o moromoro no kokumin no kashira to sareta. Watashi no shiranakatta tami ga watashi ni tsukaeta.
Ikoku no hitotachi wa kite watashi ni kobi, watashi no koto o kikuto sugu watashi ni shitagatta.
Ikoku no hitotachi wa, uchishiorete sono shiro kara furuenagara dete kita.
Shu wa ikite orareru. Waga iwa wa ho mubeki ka na. Waga kami, waga sukui no iwa wa a ga mu beki ka na.
Kono kami wa watashi no tame ni, ada o mukui, moromoro no tami o watashi no shita ni okareta.
Mata watashi o teki kara sukuidashi, ada no ue ni watashi o age, bougyaku no hitobito kara watashi o sukuidasareta.
Sore yue, Shu yo, watashi wa moromoro no kunitami no naka de, anata o tatae, anata no, mina o home utaude arou.
Shu wa sono ou ni ooinaru shouri o atae, abura o sosogareta mono ni, Dabide to sono shison to ni, tokoshie ni, itsukushimi o hodokosareru".
Kore wa Dabide no saigo no kotoba de aru. Essai no ko Dabide no takusen, sunawachi takaku agerareta hito, Yakobu no kami ni abura o sosogareta hito, Isuraeru no yoki utabito no takusen.
"Shu no rei wa watashi ni yotte kataru, sono kotoba wa watashi no shita no ue ni aru.
Isuraeru no kami wa katarareta, Isuraeru no iwa wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Hito o tadashiku osameru mono, kami o osorete, osameru mono wa,
Asa no hikari no you ni, kumo no nai asa ni, kagayakideru taiyou no you ni, chi ni wakakusa o mebaesaseru ame no you ni hito ni nozomu'.
Makoto ni, wagaya wa sono you ni, kami to tomo ni aru de wa nai ka. Sore wa, kami ga, yorozu sonawatte tashika na tokoshie no keiyaku o watashi to musubaretakara da. Dou shite kare wa watashi no sukui to negai o, mina nashitogerarenu koto ga arou ka.
Shikashi, yokoshima na hito wa, ibara no you de, te o motte toru koto ga dekinai yue, mina tomo ni suterarerude arou.
Kore ni fureyou to suru hito wa tetsu ya, yari no e o motte busou suru, karera wa kotogotoku hi de yakarerude arou".
Dabide no yuushitachi no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Takumon bito yosebu bassebete haka no sannin no uchi no chou de attaga, kare wa ichi ji ni happyakunin ni mukatte, yari o furui, sore o koroshita.
Kare no tsugi wa Ahoa bi to Dodo no ko Ereazaru de atte, san yuushi no hitori de aru. Kare wa, tatakaou to shite soko ni atsumatta Perishite bito ni mukatte tatakai o idomi, Isuraeru no hitobito ga shirizoita toki, Dabide to tomo ni itaga,
Tatte Perishite bito o uchi, tsuini te ga tsukare, te ga tsurugi ni tsuite hanarenai hodo ni natta. Sono hi, Shu wa ooinaru shouri o ataerareta. Tami wa kare no ato ni kaette kite, tada korosareta mono o hagitoru bakari de atta.
Kare no tsugi wa Hararu bi to Age no ko Shanma de atta. Aru toki, Perishite bi to wa Rehi ni atsumatta. Soko ni ichimen ni Renzu mame o tsukutta jisho ga atta. Tami wa Perishite bito no mae kara nigetaga,
Kare wa sono jisho no naka ni tatte, kore o fusegi, Perishite bito o koroshita. Soshite Shu wa ooinaru sukui o ataerareta.
Sanjuunin no choutachi no uchi no sannin wa kudatte itte kariire no koro ni, Adoramu no horaana ni iru Dabide no moto ni kita. Toki ni Perishite bito no ittai wa Repaimu no tani ni jin o totte ita.
Sono toki Dabide wa yougai ni ori, Perishite bito no senjin wa Betsurehemu ni attaga,
Dabide wa, setsu ni nozonde, "Dare ka Betsurehemu no mon no katawara ni aru ido no mizu o watashi ni nomasete kureruto yoi no daga" to itta.
Soko de sono sannin no yuushitachi wa Perishite bito no jin o tsukitootte, Betsurehemu no mon no katawara ni aru ido no mizu o kumitotte, Dabide no moto ni tazusaete kita. Shikashi Dabide wa sore o nomou to wa sezu, Shu no mae ni sore o sosoide,
Itta, "Shu yo, watashi wa danjite nomu koto o itashimasen. Inochi o kakete itta hitobito no chi o, dou shite watashi wa nomu koto ga dekimashou". Kou shite kare wa sore o nomou to wa shinakatta. San yuushi wa korera no koto o okonatta.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu no kyoudai Abishai wa sanjuunin no chou de atta. Kare wa sanbyakunin ni mukatte, yari o furui, sore o koroshita. Soshite, kare wa sannin to tomo ni na o eta.
Kare wa sanjuunin no uchi mottomo tattobareta mono de, karera no chou to natta. Shikashi, kano sannin ni wa oyobanakatta.
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa Kabujieru shusshin no yuushi de atte, ooku no tegara o tateta. Kare wa Moabu no Arieru no futari no ko o uchikoroshita. Kare wa mata yuki no hi ni kudatte itte, ana no naka de shishi o uchikoroshita.
Kare wa mata sugata no uruwashii Ejiputo bito o uchikoroshita. Sono Ejiputo bi to wa te ni yari o motte itaga, Benaya wa tsue o totte sono tokoro ni kudatte iki, Ejiputo bito no te kara yari o mogitotte, sono yari o motte koroshita.
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa korera no koto o shite san yuushi to tomo ni na o eta.
Kare wa sanjuunin no uchi ni yuumei de attaga, kano sannin ni wa oyobanakatta. Dabide wa kare o jiei no chou to shita.
Sanjuunin no uchi ni atta no wa, Yoabu no kyoudai Asaheru. Betsurehemu shusshin no Dodo no ko Eruhanan.
Harode shusshin no Shanma. Harode shusshin no Erika.
Parute bito Herezu. Tekoa shusshin no IKkeshi no ko Ira.
Anatote shusshin no Abiezeru. Hosha bi to Mebunnai.
Ahoa bi to Zarumon. Netopa shusshin no Maharai.
Netopa shusshin no Baana no ko Erebu. Beniyamin bito no Gibea kara deta Ribai no ko ITtai.
Piraton no Benaya. Gaashi no tani shusshin no Hidai.
Arubate bito Abiarubon. Bahorimu shusshin no Azumaute.
Sharubon shusshin no Eriyaba. Yasen no kotachi. Yonatan.
Hararu bi to Shanma. Hararu bi to Shararu no ko Ahiamu.
Maaka shusshin no Ahasubai no ko Eriperete. Giro shusshin no Ahitoperu no ko Eriamu.
Karumeru shusshin no Hezuro. Aruba bito Paarai.
Zoba shusshin no Natan no ko Igaru. Gado bi to Bani.
Anmon bito Zereku. Zeruya no ko Yoabu no buki o toru mono, Beerote shusshin no Naharai.
Iteru bi to Ira. Iteru bito Garebu.
Hete bito Uriya. Awasete sanjuu nananin de aru.
Shu wa futatabi Isuraeru ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, Dabide o kandou shite karera ni sakarawase, "Itte Isuraeru to Yuda to o kazoeyo" to iwareta.
Soko de ou wa Yoabu oyobi Yoabu to tomo ni iru gun no choutachi ni itta, "Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi o, Dan kara Beerushiba made iki megutte tami o kazoe, watashi ni tami no kazu o shirase nasai".
Yoabu wa ou ni itta, "Douzo anata no kami, Shu ga, tami o ima yori mo hyaku bai ni mashite kudasaimasu you ni. Soshite ou, waga Shu ga manoatari, sore o miraremasu you ni. Shikashi ou, waga Shu wa naniyue ni kono koto o yorokobareru no desu ka".
Shikashi ou no kotoba ga Yoabu to gun no choutachi to ni katta no de, Yoabu to gun no choutachi to wa ou no mae o shirizoki, Isuraeru no tami o kazoeru tame ni dete itta.
Karera wa Yorudan o watari, Aroeru kara, sunawachi tani no naka ni aru machi kara hajimete, Gado ni mukai, Yazeru ni susunda.
Sore kara Gireade ni iki, mata Hete bito no chi ni aru Kadeshi ni iki, sore kara Dan ni itari, Dan kara Shidon ni mawari,
Mata Tsuro no yougai ni iki, Hibi bi to, oyobi Kanan bito no subete no machi ni iki, Yuda no Negebu ni dete Beerushiba e itta.
Kou shite karera wa kuni o amaneku iki megutte, kyuu kagetsu to hatsunichi o hete Erusaremu ni kita.
Soshite Yoabu wa tami no sousuu o ou ni tsugeta. Sunawachi Isuraeru ni wa, tsurugi o nuku yuushitachi ga hachijuu man atta. Tadashi Yuda no hitobito wa gojuu man de atta.
Shikashi Dabide wa tami o kazoeta nochi, kokoro ni semerareta. Soko de Dabide wa Shu ni itta, "Watashi wa kore o okonatte ookina tsumi o okashimashita. Shikashi Shu yo, ima douzo shimobe no tsumi o torisatte kudasai. Watashi wa hijou ni oroka na koto o itashimashita".
Dabide ga asa okita toki, Shu no kotoba wa Dabide no senkensha de aru yogensha Gade ni nozonde itta,
"Itte Dabide ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi wa mittsu no koto o shimesu. Anata wa sono hitotsu o erabu ga yoi. Watashi wa sore o anata ni okonaude arou" to' ".
Gade wa Dabide no moto ni kite, kare ni itta, "Anata no kuni ni san nen no kikin o kosaseyou ka. Anata ga teki ni owarete san kagetsu teki no mae ni nigeru you ni shiyou ka. Sore to mo, anata no kuni ni mikka no ekibyou o okurou ka. Anata wa kangaete, watashi ga dono kotae o, watashi o tsukawasareta kata ni nasubeki ka o kime nasai".
Dabide wa Gade ni itta, "Watashi wa hijou ni nayande imasuga, Shu no awaremi wa ookii yue, wareware o Shu no te ni ochiirasete kudasai. Watashi o hito no te ni wa ochiirasenaide kudasai".
Soko de Shu wa asa kara sadame no toki made ekibyou o Isuraeru ni kudasareta. Dan kara Beerushiba made ni tami no shinda mono wa nana mannin atta.
Ten no tsukai ga te o Erusaremu ni nobete kore o horobosou to shitaga, Shu wa kono gaiaku o kui, tami o horoboshite iru ten no tsukai ni iwareta, "Mohaya, juubun de aru. Ima anata no te o todomeru ga yoi". Sono toki, Shu no tsukai wa Ebusu bito Arauna no uchi ba no katawara ni ita.
Dabide wa tami o utte iru ten no tsukai o mita toki, Shu ni itta, "Watashi wa tsumi o okashimashita. Watashi wa aku o okonaimashita. Shikashi korera no hitsujitachi wa nani o shita no desu ka. Douzo anata no te o watashi to watashi no chichi no ie ni mukete kudasai".
Sono hi Gade wa Dabide no tokoro ni kite kare ni itta, "Nobotte itte Ebusu bito Arauna no uchi ba de Shu ni saidan o tate nasai".
Dabide wa Gade no kotoba ni shitagai, Shu no meijirareta you ni nobotte itta.
Arauna wa mioroshite, ou to sono shimobetachi ga jibun no hou ni susunde kuru no o mita no de, Arauna wa dete kite ou no mae ni chi ni hirefushite haishita.
Soshite Arauna wa itta, "Dou shite ou waga Shu wa, shimobe no tokoro ni koraremashita ka". Dabide wa itta, "Anata kara uchi ba o kaitori, Shu ni saidan o kizuite tami ni kudaru wazawai o todomeru tame desu".
Arauna wa Dabide ni itta, "Douzo ou, waga Shu no yoi to omowareru mono o totte sasagete kudasai. Hansai ni suru ushi mo arimasu. Takigi ni suru dakoku ki mo ushi no kubiki mo arimasu.
Ou yo, Arauna wa kore o kotogotoku ou ni sasagemasu". Arauna wa mata ou ni, "Anata no kami, Shu ga anata o ukeireraremasu you ni" to itta.
Shikashi ou wa Arauna ni itta, "Iie, daika o shiharatte sore o anata kara kaitorimasu. Watashi wa hiyou o kakezu ni hansai o watashi no kami, Shu ni sasageru koto wa shimasen". Kou shite Dabide wa gin gojuu shikeru de uchi ba to ushi to o kaitotta.
Dabide wa sono tokoro de Shu ni saidan o kizuki, hansai to shuuonsai o sasageta. Soko de Shu wa sono chi no tame ni inori o kikareta no de, wazawai ga Isuraeru ni kudaru koto wa todomatta.
Dabide ou wa toshi ga susunde oi, yogi o kisete mo atatamaranakatta no de,
Sono keraitachi wa kare ni itta, "Ou waga Shu no tame ni, hitori no wakai otome o sagashimotomete ou ni haberase, ou no tsukisoi to shi, anata no futokoro ni nete, ou waga Shu o atatamesasemashou".
Soshite karera wa amaneku Isuraeru no ryoudo ni utsukushii otome o sagashimotomete, Shunami bi to Abishagu o e, ou no moto ni tsurete kita.
Otome wa hijou ni utsukushiku, ou no tsukisoi to natte ou ni tsukaetaga, ou wa kanojo o shiru koto ga nakatta.
Sate Hagite no ko Adoniya wa takabutte, "Watashi wa ou to narou" to ii, jibun no tame ni sensha to kihei oyobi jibun no mae ni kakeru mono gojuunin o sonaeta.
Kare no chichi wa kare ga umarete konokata ichi do mo "Naze, sono you na koto o suru no ka" to itte kare o tashinameta koto ga nakatta. Adoniya mo mata hijou ni sugata no yoi hito de atte, Abusaromu no tsugi ni umareta mono de aru.
Kare ga Zeruya no ko Yoabu to saishi Abiyataru to ni soudan shita no de, karera wa Adoniya ni shitagatte kare o tasuketa.
Shikashi saishi Zadoku to, Ehoyada no ko Benaya to, yogensha Natan oyobi Shimei to Rei, narabi ni Dabide no yuushitachi wa Adoniya ni shitagawanakatta.
Adoniya wa Enrogeru no hotori ni aru "Hebi no ishi" no katawara de, hitsuji to ushi to koeta kachiku o hofutte, ou no ko de aru jibun no kyoudaitachi, oyobi ou no kerai de aru Yuda no hitobito o kotogotoku maneita.
Shikashi yogensha Natan to, Benaya to, yuushitachi to, jibun no kyoudai Soromon to wa manekanakatta.
Toki ni Natan wa Soromon no haha Bateshiba ni itta, "Hagite no ko Adoniya ga ou to natta no o okiki ni narimasendeshita ka. Wareware no Shu Dabide wa sore o gozonjinai no desu.
Sore de ima, anata ni hakarigoto o sazukete, anata no inochi to, anata no ko Soromon no inochi o sukuu you ni itashimashou.
Anata wa sugu Dabide ou no tokoro e itte, 'Ou waga Shu yo, anata wa, hashi tame ni chikatte, omae no ko Soromon ga, watashi ni tsuide ou to nari, watashi no kurai ni zasurude arou to iwaretade wa arimasen ka. Sou de aru no ni, dou shite Adoniya ga ou to natta no desu ka' to ii nasai.
Anata ga nao ou to hanashite orareru aida ni, watashi mo mata, anata no ato kara, hai tte itte, anata no kotoba o kakunin shimashou".
Soko de Bateshiba wa shinshitsu ni haitte ou no tokoro e itta. (ou wa hijou ni oite, Shunami bi to Abishagu ga ou ni tsukaete ita).
Bateshiba wa mi o kagamete ou o haishita. Ou wa itta, "Nani no you ka".
Kanojo wa ou ni itta, "Waga Shu yo, anata wa, anata no kami, Shu o sashite, hashi tame ni chikai, 'Omae no ko Soromon ga watashi ni tsuide ou to nari, watashi no kurai ni zasurude arou' to iwaremashita.
Sou de aru no ni, goran nasai, ima Adoniya ga ou to narimashita. Ou waga Shu yo, anata wa sore o gozonjinai no desu.
Kare wa ushi to koeta kachiku to hitsuji o takusan hofutte, ou no kotachi, oyobi saishi Abiyataru to, gun no chouYoabu o manekimashitaga, anata no shimobe Soromon wa manekimasendeshita.
Ou waga Shu yo, Isuraeru no subete no me wa anata ni sosogare, dare ga anata ni tsuide, ou waga Shu no kurai ni zasubeki ka o tsugerareru no o nozonde imasu.
Ou waga Shu ga senzo to tomo ni nemurareru toki, watashi to, watashi no ko Soromon wa muhonhito to minasarerudeshou".
Bateshiba ga nao ou to hanashite iru uchi ni, yogensha Natan ga haitte kita.
Hitobito wa ou ni tsugete, "Yogensha Natan ga koko ni orimasu" to itta. Kare wa ou no mae ni hairi, chi ni fushite ou o haishita.
Soshite Natan wa itta, "Ou waga Shu yo, anata wa, 'Adoniya ga watashi ni tsuide ou to nari, watashi no kurai ni zasurude arou' to ooseraremashita ka.
Kare wa kyou kudatte itte, ushi to, koeta kachiku to hitsuji o takusan hofutte, ou no kotachi to, gun no chouYoabu to, saishi Abiyataru o manekimashita. Karera wa Adoniya no mae de kui nomi shite, 'Adoniya banzai' to iimashita.
Shikashi, anata no shimobe de aru watashi to, saishi Zadoku to, Ehoyada no ko Benaya to, anata no shimobe Soromon o manekimasendeshita.
Kono koto wa ou waga Shu ga saserareta koto desu ka. Anata wa shimobetachi ni, dare ga anata ni tsuide ou waga Shu no kurai ni zasubeki ka o tsugeraremasendeshita".
Dabide ou wa kotaete itta, "Bateshiba o watashi no tokoro ni yobi nasai". Kanojo wa ou no mae ni haitte kite, ou no mae ni tatta.
Suruto ou wa chikatte itta, "Watashi no inochi o subete no kunan kara sukuwareta Shu wa ikite orareru.
Watashi ga Isuraeru no kami, Shu o sashite anata ni chikai, 'Anata no ko Soromon ga watashi ni tsuide ou to nari, watashi ni kawatte, watashi no kurai ni zasurude arou' to itta you ni, watashi wa kyou, sono you ni shiyou".
Soko de Bateshiba wa mi o kagame, chi ni fushite ou o haishi, "Waga Shu Dabide ou ga, tokoshie ni ikinagaraeraremasu you ni" to itta.
Dabide wa itta, "Saishi Zadoku to, yogensha Natan oyobi Ehoyada no ko Benaya o watashi no tokoro ni yobi nasai". Yagate karera wa ou no mae ni kita.
Ou wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no shukun no keraitachi o tsure, waga ko Soromon o watashi no raba ni nose, kare o michibiite Gihon ni kudari,
Sono tokoro de saishi Zadoku to yogensha Natan wa kare ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to shi nasai. Soshite rappa o fuite, 'Soromon ou banzai' to ii nasai.
Sore kara, anata gata wa kare ni shitagatte nobotte ki nasai. Kare wa kite, watashi no kurai ni zashi, watashi ni kawatte ou to narude arou. Watashi wa kare o tatete Isuraeru to Yuda no ue ni shukun to suru".
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa ou ni kotaete itta, "Amen, negawaku wa, ou waga shukun no kami, Shu mo mata sou ooseraremasu you ni.
Negawaku wa, Shu ga ou waga shukun to tomo ni orareta you ni, Soromon to tomo ni orarete, sono kurai o waga shukun Dabide ou no kurai yori mo ookiku seraremasu you ni".
Soko de saishi Zadoku to yogensha Natan oyobi Ehoyada no ko Benaya, narabi ni Kerete bito to, Perete bito wa kudatte itte, Soromon o Dabide ou no raba ni nose, kare o Gihon ni michibiite itta.
Saishi Zadoku wa makuya kara abura no tsuno o totte kite, Soromon ni abura o sosoida. Soshite rappa o fukinarashi, tami wa mina "Soromon ou banzai" to itta.
Tami wa mina kare ni shitagatte nobori, fue o fuite ooini yorokobiiwatta. Chi wa karera no koe de sakeru bakari de atta.
Adoniya oyobi kare to tomo ni ita kyakutachi wa mina shokuji o owatta toki, kore o kiita. Yoabu wa rappa no oto o kiite itta, "Machi no naka no ano sawagi wa nani ka".
Kare no kotoba no nao owaranai uchi ni, soko e saishi Abiyataru no ko Yonatan ga kita no de, Adoniya wa kare ni itta, "Hairi nasai. Anata wa yuukan na hito de, yoi shirase o motte kita no deshou".
Yonatan wa kotaete Adoniya ni itta, "Iie, shukun Dabide ou wa Soromon o ou to seraremashita.
Ou wa saishi Zadoku to yogensha Natan oyobi Ehoyada no ko Benaya, narabi ni Kerete bito to, Perete bito o Soromon to tomo ni tsukawasareta no de, karera wa Soromon o ou no raba ni nosete iki,
Saishi Zadoku to yogensha Natan wa Gihon de kare ni abura o sosoide ou to shimashita. Soshite karera ga soko kara yorokonde nobotte kuru no de, machi ga sawagashii no desu. Anata ga kiita koe wa sore na no desu.
Kou shite Soromon wa ou no kurai ni zashi,
Katsu ou no keraitachi ga kite, shukun Dabide ou ni iwai o nobete, 'Negawaku wa, anata no kami ga Soromon no na o anata no na yori mo takaku shi, kare no kurai o anata no kurai yori mo ookiku saremasu you ni' to iimashita. Soshite ou wa yuka no ue de haisaremashita.
Ou wa mata kou iwaremashita, 'Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa kyou, watashi no kurai ni zasuru hitori no ko o ataete, kore o watashi ni misete kudasatta' to".
Sono toki Adoniya to tomo ni ita kyaku wa mina odoroki, tatte onoono jibun no michi ni satte itta.
Soshite Adoniya wa Soromon o osore, tatte itte saidan no tsuno o tsukanda.
Aru hito ga kore o Soromon ni tsugete itta, "Adoniya wa Soromon o osore, ima kare wa saidan no tsuno o tsukande, 'Douzo, Soromon ou ga kyou, tsurugi o motte shimobe o korosanaito watashi ni chikatte kudasaru you ni' to itte imasu".
Soromon wa itta, "Moshi kare ga yoi hito to narunaraba, sono kaminoke hitosuji mo chi ni ochiru koto wa nakarou. Shikashi kare no uchi ni aku no aru koto ga wakarunaraba, kare wa shinanakereba naranai".
Soromon wa hito o tsukawashite kare o saidan kara tsurete kudaraseta. Kare ga kite Soromon o haishita no de, Soromon wa kare ni "Ie ni kaeri nasai" to itta.
Dabide no shinu hi ga chikazuita no de, kare wa sono ko Soromon ni meijite itta,
"Watashi wa yo no subete no hito no iku michi o ikou to shite iru. Anata wa tsuyoku, otokorashiku nakereba naranai.
Anata no kami, Shu no satoshi o mamori, sono michi ni ayumi, sono sadame to imashime to, okite to akashi to o, Moose no rippou ni shirusarete iru toori ni mamoranakereba naranai. Sou sureba, anata ga suru subete no koto to, anata no mukau subete no tokoro de, anata wa sakaerude arou.
Mata Shu ga saki ni watashi ni tsuite katatte 'Moshi omae no kotachi ga, sono michi o tsutsushimi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite shinjitsu o motte, watashi no mae ni ayumunaraba, omae ni tsuide Isuraeru no kurai ni noboru hito ga, kakeru koto wa nakarou' to iwareta kotoba o kakujitsu ni sarerude arou.
Mata anata wa Zeruya no ko Yoabu ga watashi ni shita koto, sunawachi kare ga Isuraeru no futari no gun no chouNeru no ko Abuneru to, Eteru no ko Amasa ni shita koto o shitte iru. Kare wa kono futari o koroshite, sensou de nagashita chi o taihei no toki ni mukui, tsumi no nai mono no chi o watashi no koshi no mawari no obi to, watashi no ashi no kutsu ni tsuketa.
Sore yue, anata no chie ni shitagatte koto o okonai, kare no shiraga o yasuraka ni yomi ni kudarasete wa naranai.
Tadashi Gireade bito Barujirai no kora ni wa megumi o hodokoshi, karera o anata no shokutaku de shokuji suru hitobito no uchi ni kuwae nasai. Karera wa watashi ga anata no kyoudai Abusaromu o sakete nigeta toki, watashi o mukaete kuretakara de aru.
Mata Bahorimu no Beniyamin bito gera no ko Shimei ga anata to tomo ni iru. Kare wa watashi ga Mahanaimu e itta toki, hageshii noroi no kotoba o motte watashi o norotta. Shikashi kare ga Yorudan e kudatte kite, watashi o mukaeta no de, watashi wa Shu o sashite kare ni chikai, 'Watashi wa tsurugi o motte anata o korosanai' to itta.
Shikashi kare o tsumi no nai mono to shite wa naranai. Anata wa chie no aru hito de arukara, kare ni nasubeki koto o shitte iru. Anata wa kare no shiraga o chi ni zomete yomi ni kudarasenakereba naranai".
Dabide wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni houmurareta.
Dabide ga Isuraeru o osameta nissuu wa yonjuu nen de atta. Sunawachi Heburon de nana nen, Erusaremu de sanjuu san nen, ou de atta.
Kono you ni shite Soromon wa chichi Dabide no kurai ni zashi, kuni wa kataku sadamatta.
Sate, Hagite no ko Adoniya ga Soromon no haha Bateshiba no tokoro e kita no de, Bateshiba wa itta, "Anata wa odayaka na koto no tame ni kita no desu ka". Kare wa itta, "Odayaka na koto no tame desu".
Kare wa mata itta, "Anata ni moushiageru koto ga arimasu". Bateshiba wa itta, "Ii nasai".
Kare wa itta, "Gozonji no you ni, kuni wa watashi no mono de, Isuraeru no hito wa mina watashi ga ou ni naru mono to kitai shite imashita. Shikashi kuni wa tenjite, watashi no kyoudai no mono to narimashita. Kare no mono to natta no wa, Shu kara deta koto desu.
Ima watashi wa anata ni hitotsu no onegai ga arimasu. Kotowaranaide kudasai". Bateshiba wa kare ni itta, "Ii nasai".
Kare wa itta, "Dou ka Soromon ou ni koute, - - ou wa anata ni kotowaru you na koto wa naideshoukara - - Shunami bi to Abishagu o watashi ni ataete tsuma ni sasete kudasai".
Bateshiba wa itta, "Yoroshii. Watashi wa anata no tame ni ou ni hanashimashou".
Bateshiba wa Adoniya no tame ni Soromon ou ni hanasu tame, ou no moto e itta. Ou wa tatte mukae, kanojo o haishite ouza ni tsuki, ouhaha no tame ni za o moukesaseta no de, kanojo wa ou no migi ni zashita.
Soko de Bateshiba wa itta, "Anata ni hitotsu no chiisai onegai ga arimasu. Okotowari ni naranaide kudasai". Ou wa kanojo ni itta, "Hahaue yo, anata no negai o itte kudasai. Watashi wa kotowaranaideshou".
Kanojo wa itta, "Douzo, Shunami bi to Abishagu o anata no kyoudai Adoniya ni ataete, tsuma ni sasete kudasai".
Soromon ou wa kotaete haha ni itta, "Dou shite Adoniya no tame ni Shunami bi to Abishagu o motomerareru no desu ka. Kare no tame ni wa kuni o mo motome nasai. Kare wa watashi no ani de, kare no mikata ni wa saishi Abiyataru to Zeruya no ko Yoabu ga iru no desukara".
Soshite Soromon ou wa Shu o sashite chikatte itta, "Moshi Adoniya ga kono kotoba ni yotte jibun no inochi o ushinau no de nakereba, donna nide mo watashi o basshite kudasai.
Watashi o tatete, chichi Dabide no kurai ni noborase, Shu ga yakusoku sareta you ni, watashi ni ikka o ataete kudasatta Shu wa ikite orareru. Adoniya wa kyou satsusarenakereba naranai".
Soromon ou wa Ehoyada no ko Benaya o tsukawashita no de, kare wa Adoniya o utte koroshita.
Ou wa mata saishi Abiyataru ni itta, "Anata no ryouchi Anatote e iki nasai. Anata wa shi ni ataru mono desuga, saki ni watashi no chichi Dabide no mae ni kami, Shu no hako o katsugi, mata subete watashi no chichi ga uketa kurushimi o, anata mo tomo ni kurushinda no de, watashi wa, kyou wa, anata o koroshimasen".
Soshite Soromon wa Abiyataru o Shu no saishi shoku kara tsuihou shita. Kou shite Shu ga Shiro de Eri no ie ni tsuite iwareta Shu no kotoba ga jouju shita.
Sate kono shirase ga Yoabu ni tasshita no de, Yoabu wa Shu no makuya ni nogarete, saidan no tsuno o tsukanda. Yoabu wa Abusaromu o shiji shinakattakeredo mo, Adoniya o shiji shitakara de aru.
Yoabu ga Shu no makuya ni nogarete, saidan no katawara ni iru koto o, Soromon ou ni tsugeru mono ga atta no de, Soromon ou wa Ehoyada no ko Benaya o tsukawashi, "Itte kare o ute" to itta.
Benaya wa Shu no makuya e itte kare ni itta, "Ou wa anata ni, dete kuru you ni to mousaremasu". Shikashi kare wa itta, "Iya, watashi wa koko de shinimasu". Benaya wa ou ni fukumei shite itta, "Yoabu wa kou moushimashita. Mata watashi ni kou kotaemashita".
Soko de ou wa Benaya ni itta, "Kare ga iu you ni shi, kare o uchikoroshite houmuri, Yoabu ga yue naku nagashita chi no toga o watashi to, watashi no chichi no ie kara nozokisari nasai.
Shu wa mata Yoabu ga chi o nagashita koui o, kare jishin no koube ni mukuirarerude arou. Kore wa kare ga jibun yori mo tadashii sugureta futari no hito, sunawachi Isuraeru no gun no chouNeru no ko Abuneru to, Yuda no gun no chouEteru no ko Amasa o, tsurugi o motte uchikoroshi, watashi no chichi Dabide no azukarishiranai koto o shitakara de aru.
Sore yue, karera no chi wa eien ni Yoabu no koube to, sono shison no koube ni kisude arou. Shikashi Dabide to, sono shison to, sono ie to, sono kurai to ni wa, Shu kara tamawaru heian ga eikyuu ni arude arou".
Soko de Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa nobotte itte, kare o uchikoroshita. Kare wa arano ni aru jibun no ie ni houmurareta.
Ou wa Ehoyada no ko Benaya o, Yoabu ni kawatte gun no chou to shita. Ou wa mata saishi Zadoku o Abiyataru ni kawaraseta.
Mata ou wa hito o tsukawashi, Shimei o meshite itta, "Anata wa Erusaremu no uchi ni, jibun no tame ni ie o tatete, soko ni sumi, soko kara doko e mo dete wa naranai.
Anata ga dete, Kideron kawa o wataru hi ni wa kanarazu korosareru koto o, shikato shiranakereba naranai. Anata no chi wa anata no koube ni kisude arou".
Shimei wa ou ni itta, "Okotoba wa kekkou desu. Ou, waga Shu no ooserareru toori ni, shimobe wa itashimashou". Kou shite Shimei wa hisashiku Erusaremu ni sunda.
Tokoro ga san nen no nochi, Shimei no futari no dorei ga, Gate no ou Maaka no ko Akishi no tokoro e nigesatta. Hitobito ga Shimei ni tsugete, "Goran nasai, anata no dorei wa Gate ni imasu" to itta no de,
Shimei wa tatte, roba ni kura o oki, Gate no Akishi no tokoro e itte, sono dorei o tazuneta. Sunawachi Shimei wa itte sono dorei o Gatekara tsurete kitaga,
Shimei ga Erusaremu kara Gate e itte kaetta koto ga Soromon ou ni kikoeta no de,
Ou wa hito o tsukawashi, Shimei o meshite itta, "Watashi wa anata ni Shu o sashite chikawase, katsu ogosoka ni anata o imashimete, 'Anata ga dete, doko ka e yuku hi ni wa, kanarazu korosareru koto o, shikato shiranakereba naranai' to ittade wa nai ka. Soshite anata wa, watashi ni 'Okotoba wa kekkou desu. Shitagaimasu' to itta.
Tokoro de, anata wa naze Shu ni taisuru chikaito, watashi ga meijita meirei o mamoranakatta no ka".
Ou wa mata Shimei ni itta, "Anata wa jibun no kokoro ni, anata ga watashi no chichi Dabide ni shita moromoro no aku o shitte iru. Shu wa anata no aku o anata no koube ni mukuirarerude arou.
Shikashi Soromon ou wa shukufuku o uke, Dabide no kurai wa eikyuu ni Shu no mae ni kataku tatsude arou".
Ou ga Ehoyada no ko Benaya ni meijita no de, kare wa dete itte Shimei o uchikoroshita. Kou shite kuni wa Soromon no te ni kataku tatta.
Soromon ou wa Ejiputo no ou Paro to fuchi o musubi, Paro no musume o metotte Dabide no machi ni tsurete kite, jibun no ie to, Shu no miya to, Erusaremu no shuui no jouheki o tate owaru made soko ni oraseta.
Sono koro made Shu no na no tame ni tateta miya ga nakatta no de, tami wa takaki tokoro de gisei o sasagete ita.
Soromon wa Shu o aishi, chichi Dabide no sadame ni ayundaga, tada kare wa takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Aru hi, ou wa Gibeon e itte, soko de gisei o sasageyou to shita. Sore ga shuyou na takaki tokoro de attakara de aru. Soromon wa issen no hansai o sono saidan ni sasageta.
Gibeon de Shu wa yo no yume ni Soromon ni arawarete iwareta, "Anata ni nani o ataeyou ka, motome nasai".
Soromon wa itta, "Anata no shimobe de aru watashi no chichi Dabide ga anata ni taishite seijitsu to kougi to magokoro to o motte, anata no mae ni ayunda no de, anata wa ooinaru itsukushimi o kare ni shimesaremashita. Mata anata wa kare no tame ni, kono ooinaru itsukushimi o takuwaete, konnichi, kare no kurai ni zasuru ko o sazukeraremashita.
Waga kami, Shu yo, anata wa kono shimobe o, watashi no chichi Dabide ni kawatte ou to naraseraremashita. Shikashi, watashi wa chiisai kodomo de atte, deiri suru koto o shirimasen.
Katsu, shimobe wa anata ga erabareta, anata no tami, sunawachi sono kazu ga ookute, kazoeru koto mo, shiraberu koto mo dekinai hodo no obitadashii tami no naka ni orimasu.
Sore yue, kikiwakeru kokoro o shimobe ni ataete, anata no tami o sabakase, watashi ni zen'aku o wakimaeru koto o esasete kudasai. Dare ga, anata no kono ooinaru tami o sabaku koto ga dekimashou".
Soromon wa kono koto o motometa no de, sono koto ga Shu no mikokoro ni kanatta.
Soko de kami wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata wa kono koto o motomete, jibun no tame ni choumei o motomezu, mata jibun no tame ni tomi o motomezu, mata jibun no teki no inochi o mo motomezu, tada uttae o kikiwakeru chie o motometa yue ni,
Miyo, watashi wa anata no kotoba ni shitagatte, kashikoi, eimei na kokoro o ataeru. Anata no saki ni wa anata ni narabu mono ga naku, anata no nochi ni mo anata ni narabu mono wa okoranaide arou.
Watashi wa mata anata no motomenai mono, sunawachi tomi to homare o mo anata ni ataeru. Anata no ikite iru kagiri, outachi no uchi ni anata ni narabu mono wa naide arou.
Moshi anata ga, anata no chichi Dabide no ayunda you ni, watashi no michi ni ayunde, watashi no sadame to meirei to o mamorunaraba, watashi wa anata no hi o nagaku surude arou".
Soromon ga me o samashite miruto, sore wa yume de atta. Soko de kare wa Erusaremu e iki, Shu no keiyaku no hako no mae ni tatte hansai to shuuonsai o sasage, subete no kerai no tame ni shukuen o mouketa.
Sate, futari no yuujo ga ou no tokoro ni kite, ou no mae ni tatta.
Hitori no onna wa itta, "Aa, waga Shu yo, kono onna to watashi to wa hitotsu no ie ni sunde imasuga, watashi wa kono onna to issho ni ie ni iru toki, ko o umimashita.
Tokoro ga watashi no unda nochi, mikkame ni kono onna mo mata ko o umimashita. Soshite watashitachi wa issho ni imashitaga, ie ni wa hoka ni dare mo watashitachi to tomo ni ita mono wa naku, tada watashitachi futari dake deshita.
Tokoro ga kono onna wa jibun no ko no ue ni fushita no de, yoru no uchi ni sono ko wa shinimashita.
Kanojo wa yonaka ni okite, hashi tame no nemutte iru aida ni, watashi no ko o watashi no katawara kara totte, jibun no futokoro ni nekase, jibun no shinda ko o watashi no futokoro ni nekasemashita.
Watashi wa asa, ko ni chichi o nomaseyou to shite okite miruto shinde imashita. Shikashi asa ni natte yoku miruto, sore wa watashi ga unda ko de wa arimasendeshita".
Hoka no onna wa itta, "Iie, ikite iru no ga watashi no ko desu. Shinda no wa anata no ko desu". Hajime no onna wa itta, "Iie, shinda no ga anata no ko desu. Ikite iru no wa watashi no ko desu". Karera wa kono you ni ou no mae ni iiatta.
Kono toki, ou wa itta, "Hitori wa 'Kono ikite iru no ga watashi no ko de, shinda no ga anata no ko da' to ii, mata hitori wa 'Iie, shinda no ga anata no ko de, ikite iru no wa watashi no ko da' to iu".
Soko de ou wa "Katana o motte ki nasai" to itta no de, katana o ou no mae ni motte kita.
Ou wa itta, "Ikite iru ko o futatsu ni wakete, hanbun o kochira ni, hanbun o achira ni ataeyo".
Suruto ikite iru ko no haha de aru onna wa, sono ko no tame ni kokoro ga yakeru you ni natte, ou ni itta, "Aa, waga Shu yo, ikite iru ko o kanojo ni ataete kudasai. Kesshite sore o korosanaide kudasai". Shikashi hoka no hitori wa itta, "Sore o watashi no mono ni mo, anata no mono ni mo shinaide, wakete kudasai".
Suruto ou wa kotaete itta, "Ikite iru ko o hajime no onna ni atae yo. Kesshite koroshite wa naranai. Kanojo wa sono haha na no da".
Isuraeru wa minaou ga ataeta hanketsu o kiite ou o osoreta. Kami no chie ga kare no uchi ni atte, sabaki o suru no o mitakara de aru.
Soromon ou wa Isuraeru no zenchi no ou de atta.
Kare no koukantachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Zadoku no ko Azariya wa saishi.
Shisha no ko Erihorefu to Ahiya wa shokikan. Ahirude no ko Yoshabate wa shikan.
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa gun no chou. Zadoku to Abiyataru wa saishi.
Natan no ko Azariya wa daikan no chou. Natan no ko Zabude wa saishi de, ou no tomo de atta.
Ahisharu wa kunaikyou. Abuda no ko Adoniramu wa choubo no chou de atta.
Soromon wa mata Isuraeru no zenchi ni juu ninin no daikan o oita. Sono hitobito wa ou to sono ie no tame ni shokumotsu o sonaeta. Sunawachi onoono ichi nen ni ichi tsuki zutsu shokumotsu o sonaeru no de atta.
Sono na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Efuraimu no sanchi ni wa Benhoru.
Makazu to, Sharabimu to, Beteshimeshi to, eron betehanan ni wa Bendekeru.
Arubote ni wa Benhesede, (kare wa Soko to Eperu no zenchi o tantou shita).
Doru no kouchi no zenbu ni wa Ben Abinadabu, (kare wa Soromon no musume Tapate o tsuma to shita).
Ahirude no ko Baana wa Taanaku to Megido to, Ezureru no shita, Zaretan no katawara ni aru Beteshan no zenchi o tantou shite, Beteshan kara Aberu Mehora ni itari, Yokumeamu no mukou ni made oyonda.
Ramote gireade ni wa Bengeberu, (kare wa Gireade ni aru Manase no koYairu no muramura o tantou shi, mata Bashan ni aru Arugobu no chihou no jouheki to seidou no kannoki no aru ookina machi rokujuu o tantou shita).
Mahanaimu ni wa Ido no ko Ahinadabu.
Nafutari ni wa Ahimaazu, (kare mo Soromon no musume Basumate o tsuma ni metotta).
Aseru to Bearote ni wa Hoshai no ko Baana.
Issakaru ni wa Parua no ko Yoshapate.
Beniyamin ni wa Era no ko Shimei.
Amori bito no ou Shihon no chi oyobi Bashan no ou Ogu no chi naru Gireade no chi ni wa Uri no ko Geberu. Kare wa sono chi no tada hitori no daikan de atta.
Yuda to Isuraeru no hitobito wa ookute, umibe no suna no you de attaga, karera wa nomikui shite tanoshinda.
Soromon wa Yufurate kawa kara Perishite bito no chi to, Ejiputo no sakai ni itaru made no shokoku o osameta no de, mina mitsugi mono o tazusaete kite, Soromon no isshou no aida tsukaeta.
Sate Soromon no tsuitachi no shokumotsu wa komakai mugiko sanjuu koru, arai mugiko rokujuu koru,
Koeta ushi juutou, makiba no ushi nijuutou, hitsuji hyakutou de, sono hoka ni o ji ka, kamoshika, koji ka, oyobi koeta tori ga atta.
Kore wa Soromon ga Yufurate kawa no nishi no chihou o Tefusa kara Gaza made, kotogotoku osametakara de aru. Sunawachi kare wa Yufurate kawa no nishi no shoou o kotogotoku osame, shuui itarutokoro ni heian o eta.
Soromon no isshou no aida, Yuda to Isuraeru wa Dan kara Beerushiba ni itaru made, yasuraka ni onoono jibuntachi no budou no ki no shita to, ichijiku no ki no shita ni sunda.
Soromon wa mata sensha no uma no, uma ya yonsen to, kihei ichi man nisen o motte ita.
Soshite sorera no daikantachi wa onoono touban no tsuki ni Soromon ou no tame, oyobi subete Soromon ou no shokutaku ni tsuranaru mono no tame ni, shokumotsu o sonaete kakeru koto no nai you ni shita.
Mata karera wa onoono sono wariate ni shitagatte uma oyobi hayauma ni kuwaseru oomugi to wara o, sono uma no iru tokoro ni motte kita.
Kami wa Soromon ni hijou ni ooku no chie to satori o sazuke, mata umibe no sunahara no you ni hiroi kokoro o sazukerareta.
Soromon no chie wa higashi no hitobito no chie to Ejiputo no subete no chie ni masatta.
Kare wa subete no hito yori mo kashikoku, Ezura bi to Etan yori mo, mata Mahoru no ko Eman, Karukoru, Daruda yori mo kashikoku, sono meisei wa shuui no subete no kuniguni ni kikoeta.
Kare wa mata shingen sanzen o toita. Mata sono uta wa issen go shu atta.
Kare wa mata kusaki no koto o ronjite Rebanon no kouhaku kara ishigaki ni haeru hisopu ni made oyonda. Kare wa mata kemono to tori to hau mono to uo no koto o ronjita.
Shokoku no hitobito wa Soromon no chie o kiku tame ni kita. Chi no shoou wa Soromon no chie o kiite hito o tsukawashita.
Sate Tsuro no ou Hiramu wa, Soromon ga abura o sosogare, sono chichi ni kawatte, ou to natta no o kiite, kerai o Soromon ni tsukawashita. Hiramu wa tsune ni Dabide o aishitakara de aru.
Soko de Soromon wa Hiramu ni hito o tsukawashite itta,
"Anata no shirareru toori, chichi Dabide wa sono shuui ni atta teki to no tatakai no yue ni, kare no kami, Shu no na no tame ni miya o tateru koto ga dekizu, Shu ga karera o sono ashi no ura no shita ni okareru no o machimashita.
Tokoro ga ima waga kami, Shu wa watashi ni shihou no taihei o tamawatte, teki mo naku, wazawai mo nakunatta no de,
Shu ga chichi Dabide ni 'Omae ni kawatte, omae no kurai ni, watashi ga tsukaseru omae no ko, sono hito ga waga na no tame ni miya o taterude arou' to iwareta you ni, waga kami, Shu no na no tame ni miya o tateyou to omoimasu.
Sore yue, anata wa meirei o kudashite, Rebanon no kouhaku o watashi no tame ni kiridasasete kudasai. Watashi no shimobetachi o anata no shimobetachi to issho ni hatarakasemasu. Mata watashi wa subete anata no ossharu toori, anata no shimobetachi no chingin o anata ni haraimasu. Anata no shirareru toori, watashitachi no uchi ni wa Shidon bito no you ni ki o kiru ni takumi na hito ga naikara desu".
Hiramu wa Soromon no kotoba o kiite ooini yorokobi, "Kyou, Shu wa a ga mu beki ka na. Shu wa kono obitadashii tami o osameru kashikoi ko o Dabide ni tamawatta" to itta.
Soshite Hiramu wa Soromon ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "Watashi wa anata ga moushi okurareta koto o kikimashita. Kouhaku no zaimoku to, itosugi no zaimoku ni tsuite wa, subete onozomi no you ni itashimasu.
Watashi no shimobedomo ni sore o Rebanon kara umi ni hakobiorosasemashou. Watashi wa sore o ikada ni kunde, kairo, anata no shiji sareru basho made okuri, soko de sore o kuzushimashou. Anata wa sore o uketotte kudasai. Mata, anata wa watashi no ie no tame ni shokumotsu o kyoukyuu shite, watashi no nozomi o kanaete kudasai".
Kou shite Hiramu wa Soromon ni subete nozomi no you ni kouhaku no zaimoku to, itosugi no zaimoku o ataeta.
Mata Soromon wa Hiramu ni sono ie no shokumotsu to shite komugi ni man koru o atae, mata oribu o tsubushite totta abura ni man koru o ataeta. Kono you ni Soromon wa nennen Hiramu ni ataeta.
Shu wa yakusoku sareta you ni Soromon ni chie o tamawatta. Mata Hiramu to Soromon no aida wa heiwa de atte, karera futari wa jouyaku o musunda.
Soromon ou wa Isuraeru no zenchi kara kyouseiteki ni roudousha o choubo shita. Sono choubo jin'in wa san mannin de atta.
Soromon wa karera o ichi kagetsu koutai ni ichi mannin zutsu Rebanon ni tsukawashita. Sunawachi ichi kagetsu Rebanon ni, ni kagetsuie ni ari, Adoniramu wa choubo no kantoku de atta.
Soromon ni wa mata ni o ou mono ga nana mannin, yama de ishi o kiru mono ga hachi mannin atta.
Hoka ni Soromon ni wa kouji o kantoku suru uwayaku no kanri ga sanzen sanbyakunin atte, kouji ni hataraku tami o kantoku shita.
Ou wa meijite ookii kouka na ishi o kiridasase, kiriishi o motte miya no motoi o suesaseta.
Kou shite Soromon no kenchikusha to, Hiramu no kenchikusha oyobi Gebaru bi to wa ishi o kiri, zaimoku to ishi to o miya o tateru tame ni sonaeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo no chi o dete nochi yonhyaku hachijuu nen, Soromon ga Isuraeru no ou to natte daiyon nen no Jifu no tsuki sunawachi ni gatsu ni, Soromon wa Shu no tame ni miya o tateru koto o hajimeta.
Soromon ou ga Shu no tame ni tateta miya wa nagasa rokujuu kyubito, haba nijuu kyubito, takasa sanjuu kyubito de atta.
Miya no haiden no mae no rou wa miya no haba ni shitagatte nagasa nijuu kyubito, sono haba wa miya no mae de juu kyubito de atta.
Kare wa miya ni, uchigawa no hiroi waku no mado o tsukutta.
Mata miya no kabe ni tsukete shuui ni wakiya o mouke, miya no kabe sunawachi haiden to honden no kabe no shuui ni tate megurashi, miya no shuui ni wakima ga aru you ni shita.
Shita no wakima wa hirosa go kyubito, naka no hirosa roku kyubito, daisan no wa hirosa nana kyubito de atta. Miya no sotogawa ni wa kabe ni dan o tsukutte, hari o miya no kabe no naka ni sashikomanai you ni shita.
Miya wa tateru toki ni, ishikiri ba de kiritotonoeta ishi o motte tsukutta no de, tatete iru aida wa miya no uchi ni wa, tsuchi mo, ono mo, sono ta no tekki mo sono oto ga kikoenakatta.
Shita no wakima no iriguchi wa miya no migigawa ni ari, mawari kaidan ni yotte naka no wakima ni, naka no wakima kara daisan no wakima ni nobotta.
Kou shite kare wa miya o tate owari, kouhaku no taruki to ita o motte miya no tenjou o tsukutta.
Mata miya ni tsukete, onoono takasa go kyubito no wakima no aru wakiya o tate megurashi, kouhaku no zaimoku o motte miya ni setsuzoku saseta.
Soko de Shu no kotoba ga Soromon ni nozonda,
"Anata ga tateru kono miya ni tsuite wa, moshi anata ga watashi no sadame ni ayumi, okite o okonai, subete no imashime o mamori, sore ni shitagatte ayumunaraba, watashi wa anata no chichi Dabide ni yakusoku shita koto o jouju suru.
Soshite watashi wa Isuraeru no hitobito no uchi ni sumi, watashi no tami Isuraeru o suteru koto wa nai".
Kou shite Soromon wa miya o tate owatta.
Kare wa kouhaku no ita o motte miya no kabe no uchigawa o hatta. Sunawachi miya no yuka kara tenjou no taruki made kouhaku no ita de hatta. Mata, itosugi no ita o motte miya no yuka o hatta.
Mata miya no oku ni nijuu kyubito no shitsu o yuka kara tenjou no taruki made kouhaku no ita o motte tsukutta. Sunawachi miya no uchi ni shiseijo to shite no hondou o tsukutta.
Miya sunawachi honden no mae ni aru haiden wa nagasa yonjuu kyubito de atta.
Miya no uchigawa no kouhaku no ita wa, hisago no katachi to, saita hana o ukiboriri ni shita mono de, mina kouhaku no ita de, ishi wa mienakatta.
Soshite Shu no keiyaku no hako o oku tame ni, miya no uchi no oku ni honden o mouketa.
Honden wa nagasa nijuu kyubito, haba nijuu kyubito, takasa nijuu kyubito de atte, junkin de kore o ootta. Mata kouhaku no saidan o tsukutta.
Soromon wa junkin o motte miya no uchigawa o ooi, honden no mae ni kin no kusari o motte hedate o tsukuri, kin o motte kore o ootta.
Mata kin o motte nokorazu miya o ooi, tsuini miya o kazaru koto o kotogotoku oeta. Mata honden ni zokusuru saidan o kotogotoku kin de ootta.
Honden no uchi ni oribu no ki o motte futatsu no kerubimu o tsukutta. Sono takasa wa onoono juu kyubito.
Sono kerubu no hitotsu no tsubasa no nagasa wa go kyubito, mata sono kerubu no ta no tsubasa no nagasa mo go kyubito de atta. Hitotsu no tsubasa no hashi kara ta no tsubasa no hashi made wa juu kyubito atta.
Ta no kerubu mo juu kyubito de atte, futatsu no kerubimu wa onaji sunpou, onaji katachi de atta.
Kono kerubu no takasa wa juu kyubito, kano kerubu no takasa mo onaji de atta.
Soromon wa miya no uchi no oku ni kerubimu o sueta. Kerubimu no tsubasa o nobashita tokoro, kono kerubu no tsubasa wa kono kabe ni tasshi, kano kerubu no tsubasa wa kano kabe ni tasshi, ta no futatsu no tsubasa wa miya no naka de tagai ni fureatta.
Kare wa kin o motte sono kerubimu o ootta.
Kare wa miya no shuui no kabe ni, naigai no shitsutomo mina kerubimu to, shuro no ki to, saita hana no katachi no horimono o kizami,
Miya no yuka wa, naigai no shitsutomo kin de ootta.
Honden no iriguchi ni wa oribu no ki no tobira o tsukutta. Sono tobira no ue no kamachi to wakibashira to de go henkei o nashite ita.
Sono futatsu no tobira mo oribu no ki de atte, Soromon wa sono ue ni kerubimu to, shuro no ki to, saita hana no katachi o kizami, kin o motte ootta. Sunawachi kerubimu to, shuro no ki no ue ni kin o kiseta.
Kou shite Soromon wa mata haiden no iriguchi no tame ni oribu no ki de shikaku no katachi ni wakibashira o tsukutta.
Sono futatsu no tobira wa ito sugide atte, hitotsu no tobira wa futatsu ni tatamu orito de ari, ta no tobira mo futatsu ni tatamu orito de atta.
Soromon wa sono ue ni kerubimu to, shuro no ki to, saita hana o kizami, kin o motte horimono no ue o katachi doori ni ootta.
Mata kiriishi san kasane to, kouhaku no kakuzai hito kasane to o motte uchiniwa o tsukutta.
Daiyon nen no Jifu no tsuki ni Shu no miya no motoi o sue,
Daijuu ichi nen no Buru no tsuki sunawachi hachi gatsu ni, miya no subete no bubun ga sekkei doori ni kansei shita. Soromon wa kore o tateru no ni shichi nen o youshita.
Mata Soromon wa jibun no ie o tatetaga, juu san nen kakatte sono ie o zenbu tate owatta.
Kare wa Rebanon no mori no ie o tateta. Nagasa hyaku kyubito, haba gojuu kyubito, takasa sanjuu kyubito de, san retsu no kouhaku no hashira ga ari, sono hashira no ue ni kouhaku no hari ga atta.
Yonjuu gohon no hashira no ue ni aru shitsu wa kouhaku no ita de ootta. Hashira wa kakuretsu juu gohon atta.
Mata madowaku ga san retsu atte, mado to mado to san dan ni mukaiatte ita.
Toguchi to mado wa mina shikaku no waku o mochi, mado to mado to san dan ni mukaiatta.
Mata hashira no hiroma o tsukutta. Nagasa gojuu kyubito, haba sanjuu kyubito de atta. Hashira no mae ni hitotsu no hiroma ga ari, sono genkan ni hashira to hisashi ga atta.
Mata Soromon wa mizukara shinpan o suru tame ni gyokuza no hiroma, sunawachi shinpan no hiroma o tsukutta. Yuka kara taruki made kouhaku o motte ootta.
Soromon ga sunda kyuuden wa sono hiroma no ushiro no ta no niwa ni atte, sono zousa wa onaji de atta. Soromon wa mata kare ga metotta Paro no musume no tame ni ie o tatetaga, sono hiroma to onaji de atta.
Korera wa mina naigaitomo, dodai kara noki made, mata Shu no miya no niwa kara ooniwa made, sunpou ni awasete kitta ishi, sunawachi, nokogiri de hiita kouka na ishi de tsukurareta.
Mata dodai wa kouka na ishi, ookina ishi, sunawachi hachi kyubito no ishi, juu kyubito no ishi de atta.
Sono ue ni wa sunpou ni awasete kitta kouka na ishi to kouhaku to ga atta.
Mata ooniwa no shuui ni wa san kasane no kiriishi to, ichi kasane no kouhaku no kakuzai ga atta. Shu no miya no uchiniwa to kyuuden no hiroma no niwa no baai to onaji de aru.
Soromon ou wa hito o tsukawashite Tsuro kara Hiramu o yonde kita.
Kare wa Nafutari no buzoku no kafu no ko de atte, sono chichi wa Tsuro no hito de, seidou no saikunin de atta. Hiramu wa seidou no iroiro na saiku o suru chie to satori to chishiki ni michita mono de attaga, Soromon ou no tokoro ni kite, sono subete no saiku o shita.
Kare wa seidou no hashira nihon o ita. Ichipon no hashira no takasa wa juu hachi kyubito, sono mawari wa tsuna o motte hakaruto juu ni kyubito ari, yubi yonhon no atsusa de kuudou de atta. Ta no hashira mo onaji de aru.
Mata seidou o tokashite chuutou futatsu o tsukuri, hashira no itadaki ni sueta. Sono hitotsu no chuutou no takasa wa go kyubito, ta no chuutou no takasa mo go kyubito de atta.
Hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no tame ni kusari ni anda kazarihimo de ichimatsu moyou no ami zaiku futatsu o tsukutta. Sunawachi kono chuutou no tame ni hitotsu, kano chuutou no tame ni hitotsu o tsukutta.
Mata zakuro o tsukutta. Sunawachi ni narabi no zakuro o hitotsu no ami zaiku no ue no mawari ni tsukutte, hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou o maita. Ta no chuutou ni mo onaji you ni shita.
Kono rou no hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no ue ni yon kyubito no yuri no hana no saiku ga atta.
Futatsu no hashira no joutan no marui tosshutsu bu no ue ni aru ami zaiku no chuutou no shuui ni wa, onoono nihyaku no zakuro ga ni narabi ni natte ita.
Kono hashira o shinden no rou ni tateta. Sunawachi minami ni hashira o tatete, sono na o Yakin to nazuke, kita ni hashira o tatete, sono na o Boazu to nazuketa.
Sono hashira no itadaki ni wa yuri no hana no saiku ga atta. Kou shite sono hashira no zousa ga dekiagatta.
Mata umi o ite tsukutta. Fuchi kara fuchi made juu kyubito de atte, shuui wa enkei o nashi, takasa go kyubito de, sono shuui wa tsuna o motte hakaruto sanjuu kyubito de atta.
Sono fuchinoshita ni wa sanjuu kyubito no shuui o meguru hisago ga atte, umi no shuui o kakonde ita. Sono hisago wa ni narabi de, umi o iru toki ni ita mono de aru.
Sono umi wa juu ni no ushi no ue ni okare, sono mittsu wa kita ni mukai, mittsu wa nishi ni mukai, mittsu wa minami ni mukai, mittsu wa higashi ni mukatte ita. Umi wa sono ue ni okare, ushi no ushiro wa minauchi ni mukatte ita.
Umi no atsusa wa te no haba de, sono fuchi wa hai no fuchi no you ni, yuri no hana ni nisete tsukurareta. Umi ni wa mizu ga nisen bate haitta.
Mata seidou no dai o juuko tsukutta. Dai wa nagasa yon kyubito, haba yon kyubito, takasa san kyubito de atta.
Sono dai no kouzou wa tsugi no toori de aru. Dai ni wa kagamiita ga ari, kagamiita wa waku no naka ni atta.
Waku no naka ni aru kagamiita ni wa, shishi to ushi to kerubimu to ga ari, mata, shishi to ushi no ue to shita ni aru waku no shamen ni wa hanakazari ga saiku shite atta.
Mata dai ni wa onoono yontsu no seidou no sharin to, seidou no shajiku ga ari, sono yon sumi ni wa senban no sasae ga atta. Sono sasae wa, onoono hanakazari no katawara ni ite tsukuri tsukete atta.
Sono kuchi wa ichi kyubito ue ni tsukidete, dai no itadaki no uchi ni ari, sono kuchi wa maruku, daiza no you ni tsukurare, fukasa ichi kyubito han de atta. Mata sono kuchi ni wa horimono ga atta. Sono kagamiita wa shikaku de, maruku nakatta.
Yontsu no sharin wa kagamiita no shita ni ari, shajiku wa dai ni toritsukete ari, sharin no takasa wa onoono ichi kyubito han de atta.
Sharin no kouzou wa sensha no sharin no kouzou to onaji de, sono shajiku to fuchi to ya to koshiki to wa mina imono de atta.
Onoono no dai no yon sumi ni yontsu no sasae ga ari, sono sasae wa dai no ichibu o nashite ita.
Dai no ue ni wa takasa han kyubito no marui obiwa ga atta. Soshite dai no ue ni aru sono shichuu to kagamiita to wa sono ichibu o nashite ita.
Sono shichuu no hyoumen to kagamiita ni wa sorezore no basho ni, kerubimu to, shishi to, shuro o kizami, mata sono shuui ni hanakazari o hodokoshita.
Kono you ni shite juuko no dai o tsukutta. Sore wa mina onaji ikata, onaji sunpou, onaji katachi de atta.
Mata seidou no senban o juuko tsukutta. Senban wa onoono yonjuu bate no mizu ga hairi, senban wa onoono yon kyubito de atta. Juuko no dai no ue ni wa onoono hitotsu zutsu no senban ga atta.
Sono dai no goko o miya no minami no hou ni, goko o miya no kita no hou ni oki, miya no tounan no hou ni umi o sueta.
Hiramu wa mata tsubo to juunou to hachi o tsukutta. Kou shite Hiramu wa Soromon ou no tame ni Shu no miya no subete no saiku o nashi oeta.
Sunawachi nihon no hashira to, sono hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no futatsu no tama to, hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no futatsu no tama o oou futatsu no ami zaiku to,
Sono futatsu no ami zaiku no tame no zakuro yonhyaku. Kono zakuro wa hitotsu no ami zaiku ni, ni narabi ni tsukete, hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no futatsu no tama o maita.
Mata juuko no dai to, sono dai no ue no juuko no senban to,
Hitotsu no umi to, sono umi no shita no juu ni no ushi to de atta.
Sate tsubo to juunou to hachi, sunawachi Hiramu ga Soromon ou no tame ni tsukutta Shu no miya no korera no utsuwa wa mina hikari no aru seidou de atta.
Ou wa Yorudan no teichi de, Sukote to Zaretan no aida no nendo no chi de korera o ita.
Soromon wa sono utsuwa ga hijou ni ookatta no de, mina sore o hakarazu ni oita. Sono seidou no omosa wa, hakari enakatta.
Mata Soromon wa Shu no miya ni aru moromoro no utsuwa o tsukutta. Sunawachi kin no saidan to, sonae no pan o noseru kin no tsukue,
Oyobi junkin no shokudai. Kono shokudai wa honden no mae ni, itsutsu wa minami ni, itsutsu wa kita ni atta. Mata kin no hana to, tomoshibi sara to, kokorokaki to,
Junkin no sara to, shinkiri basami to, hachi to, kou no hai to, shinto rizara to, shiseijo de aru miya no oku no tobira no tame oyobi, miya no haiden no tobira no tame ni, kin no hiji tsubo o tsukutta.
Kou shite Soromon ou ga Shu no miya no tame ni tsukuru subete no saiku wa owatta. Soshite Soromon wa chichi Dabide ga sasageta mono, sunawachi kingin oyobi utsuwamono o tazusae hairi, Shu no miya no houzou no naka ni takuwaeta.
Soromon wa Shu no keiyaku no hako o Dabide no machi, sunawachi Shion kara katsugi noborou to shite, Isuraeru no chouroutachi to, subete no buzoku no kashiratachi to, Isuraeru no hitobito no shizoku no choutachi o Erusaremu de Soromon ou no moto ni meshiatsumeta.
Isuraeru no hito wa mina Etanimu no tsuki sunawachi nana gatsu no matsuri ni Soromon ou no moto ni atsumatta.
Isuraeru no chouroutachi ga mina kita no de, saishitachi wa hako o toriageta.
Soshite karera wa Shu no hako to, kaiken no makuya to, makuya ni aru subete no sei naru utsuwa o katsugi nobotta. Sunawachi saishi to Rebi bito ga korera no mono o katsugi nobotta.
Soromon ou oyobi kare no moto ni atsumatta Isuraeru no kaishuu wa mina kare to tomo ni hako no mae de, hitsuji to ushi o sasagetaga, sono kazu ga ookute shiraberu koto mo kazoeru koto mo dekinakatta.
Saishitachi wa Shu no keiyaku no hako o sono basho ni katsugi ireta. Sunawachi miya no honden de aru shiseijo no uchi no kerubimu no tsubasa no shita ni oita.
Kerubimu wa tsubasa o hako no tokoro ni nobete ita no de, kerubimu wa ue kara hako to sono sao o ootta.
Sao wa nagakatta no de, sao no hashi ga honden no mae no seijo kara mieta. Shikashi soto ni wa mienakatta. Sono sao wa konnichi made soko ni aru.
Hako no uchi ni wa futatsu no ishi no ita no hoka nani mo nakatta. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo no chi kara deta toki, Shu ga karera to keiyaku o musubareta toki ni, Moose ga Horebu de, sore ni osameta mono de aru.
Soshite saishitachi ga seijo kara deta toki, kumo ga Shu no miya ni michita no de,
Saishitachi wa kumo no tame ni tatte tsukaeru koto ga dekinakatta. Shu no eikou ga Shu no miya ni michitakara de aru.
Soko de Soromon wa itta, "Shu wa hi o ten ni okareta. Shikamo Shu wa mizukara koki kumo no naka ni sumaou to iwareta.
Watashi wa anata no tame ni takaki ie, tokoshie no misumai o tateta".
Ou wa mi o megurashite, Isuraeru no subete no kaishuu o shukufuku shita. Sono toki Isuraeru no subete no kaishuu wa tatte ita.
Kare wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa sono kuchi o motte watashi no chichi Dabide ni yakusoku sareta koto o, sono te o motte nashitogerareta. Shu wa iwareta,
'Waga tami Isuraeru o Ejiputo kara michibikidashita hi kara, watashi wa watashi no na o okubeki miya o tateru tame ni, Isuraeru no moromoro no buzoku no uchi kara, dono machi o mo eranda koto ga nakatta. Tada Dabide o erande, waga tami Isuraeru no ue ni tataseta' to.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na no tame ni miya o tateru koto wa, watashi no chichi Dabide no kokoro ni atta.
Shikashi Shu wa watashi no chichi Dabide ni iwareta, 'Watashi no na no tame ni miya o tateru koto wa anata no kokoro ni atta. Anata no kokoro ni kono koto no atta no wa kekkou de aru.
Keredo mo anata wa sono miya o tatete wa naranai. Anata no mi kara deru anata no ko ga watashi no na no tame ni miya o taterude arou' to.
Soshite Shu wa sono iwareta kotoba o okonawareta. Sunawachi watashi wa chichi Dabide ni kawatte tachi, Shu ga iwareta you ni, Isuraeru no kurai ni zashi, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na no tame ni miya o tateta.
Watashi wa mata soko ni Shu no keiyaku o osameta hako no tame ni hitotsu no basho o mouketa. Sono keiyaku wa Shu ga wareware no senzo o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidasareta toki ni, karera to musubareta mono de aru".
Soromon wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu no mae de, Shu no saidan no mae ni tachi, te o ten ni nobete,
Itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, ue no ten ni mo, shita no chi ni mo, anata no you na kami wa arimasen. Anata wa keiyaku o mamorare, kokoro o tsukushite anata no mae ni ayumu anata no shimobera ni, itsukushimi o hodokoshi,
Anata no shimobe de aru watashi no chichi Dabide ni yakusoku sareta koto o mamoraremashita. Anata ga kuchi o motte yakusoku sareta koto o, te o motte nashitogerareta koto wa, konnichi miru toori de arimasu.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata no shimobe de aru watashi no chichi Dabide ni, anata ga yakusoku shite 'Omae ga watashi no mae ni ayunda you ni, omae no shison ga, sono michi o tsutsushinde, watashi no mae ni ayumunaraba, omae ni wa Isuraeru no kurai ni zasuru hito ga, watashi no mae ni kakeru koto wa naide arou' to iwareta koto o, Dabide no tame ni mamotte kudasai.
Isuraeru no kami yo, douzo, anata no shimobe de aru watashi no chichi Dabide ni iwareta kotoba o kakunin shite kudasai.
Shikashi kami wa, hatashite chijou ni sumawarerudeshou ka. Miyo, ten mo, ito takaki ten mo anata o ireru koto wa dekimasen. Mashite watashi no tateta kono miya wa naosara desu.
Shikashi waga kami, Shu yo, shimobe no inori to negai o kaerimite, shimobe ga kyou, anata no mae ni sasageru sakebi to inori o okiki kudasai.
Anata ga 'Watashi no na o soko ni oku' to iwareta tokoro, sunawachi, kono miya ni mukatte yoruhiru anata no me o ohiraki kudasai. Shimobe ga kono tokoro ni mukatte inoru inori o okiki kudasai.
Shimobe to, anata no tami Isuraeru ga kono tokoro ni mukatte inoru toki ni, sono negai o okiki kudasai. Anata no sumika de aru ten de kiki, kiite oyurushi kudasai.
Moshi hito ga sono tonaribito ni taishite tsumi o okashi, chikai o suru koto o motomerareru toki, kite kono miya de anata no saidan no mae ni chikaunaraba,
Anata wa ten de kiite okonai, anata no shimobera o sabaki, akunin o basshite, sono okonai no mukui o sono koube ni kishi, gijin o gi to shite, sono gi ni shitagatte, sono hito ni mukuite kudasai.
Moshi anata no tami Isuraeru ga, anata ni taishite tsumi o okashita tame ni teki no mae ni yabureta toki, anata ni tachikaette, anata no na o agame, kono miya de anata ni inori negaunaraba,
Anata wa ten ni atte kiki, anata no tami Isuraeru no tsumi o yurushite, anata ga karera no senzo ni tamawatta chi ni karera o kaerasete kudasai.
Moshi karera ga anata ni tsumi o okashita tame ni, ten ga tozasarete ame ga naku, anata ga karera o kurushimerareru toki, karera ga kono tokoro ni mukatte inori, anata no na o agame, sono tsumi o hanarerunaraba,
Anata wa ten de kiki, anata no shimobe, anata no tami Isuraeru no tsumi o yurushi, karera ni ayumubeki yoi michi o oshiete, anata ga, anata no tami ni shigyou to shite ataerareta chi ni ame o furasete kudasai.
Moshi kuni ni kikin ga aru ka, moshikuha ekibyou, tachigare, kusari ho, inago, aomushi ga aru ka, moshikuha teki no tame ni machi no naka ni semekakomareru koto ga aru ka, donna saigai, donna byouki ga atte mo,
Moshi, dare de mo, anata no tami Isuraeru ga mina, onoono sono kokoro no nayami o shitte, kono miya ni mukai, te o noberunaraba, donna inori, donna negai de mo,
Anata wa, anata no sumika de aru ten de kiite yurushi, katsu okonai, onoono no hito ni, sono kokoro o shitte orareru yue, sono subete no michi ni shitagatte mukuite kudasai. Tada, anata dake, subete no hito no kokoro o shitte orarerukara desu.
Anata ga, wareware no senzo ni tamawatta chi ni, karera no ikinagaraeru hi no aida, tsune ni anata o osoresasete kudasai.
Mata anata no tami Isuraeru no mono de naku, anata no na no tame ni tooi kuni kara kuru ihoujin ga,
- - sore wa karera ga anata no ooinaru na to, tsuyoi te to, nobeta ude to ni tsuite kikioyobukara desu, - - moshi kite, kono miya ni mukatte inorunaraba,
Anata wa, anata no sumika de aru ten de kiki, subete ihoujin ga anata ni yobimotomeru koto o kanaesasete kudasai. Sou sureba, chi no subete no tami wa, anata no tami Isuraeru no you ni, anata no na o shiri, anata o osore, mata watashi ga tateta kono miya ga anata no na ni yotte yobareru koto o shiru ni itarudeshou.
Anata no tami ga teki to tatakau tame ni, anata ga tsukawasareru michi o tootte dete iku toki, moshi karera ga anata no erabareta machi, watashi ga anata no na no tame ni tateta miya no hou ni mukatte, Shu ni inorunaraba,
Anata wa ten de, karera no inori to negai o kiite karera o otasuke kudasai.
Karera ga anata ni taishite tsumi o okasu koto ga atte, - - hito wa tsumi o okasanai mono wa nai no desu, - - anata ga karera o ikari, karera o teki ni watashi, teki ga karera o horyo to shite enkin ni kakawarazu, teki no chi ni hiite iku toki,
Moshi karera ga torawarete itta chi de, mizukara kaerimite kui, jibun o toraete itta mono no chi de, anata ni negai, 'Wareware wa tsumi o okashimashita, somuite aku o okonaimashita' to ii,
Jibun o toraete itta teki no chi de, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata ni tachikaeri, anata ga karera no senzo ni ataerareta chi, anata ga erabareta machi, watashi ga anata no na no tame ni tateta miya no hou ni mukatte, anata ni inorunaraba,
Anata no sumika de aru ten de, karera no inori to negai o kiite, karera o tasuke,
Anata no tami ga, anata ni taishite okashita tsumi to, anata ni taishite itta subete no ayamachi o yurushi, karera o toraete itta mono no mae de, karera ni awaremi o esase, sono hitobito ga karera o awaremu you ni shite kudasai.
(karera wa anata ga Ejiputo kara, tetsu no kamado no naka kara michibikidasareta anata no tami, anata no shigyou de arukara desu).
Douzo, shimobe no negai to, anata no tami Isuraeru no negai ni, anata no me o hiraki, subete anata ni yobimotomeru toki, karera no negai o okiki kudasai.
Anata wa karera o chi no subete no tami no uchi kara kubes shite, anata no shigyou to saretakara desu. Shu naru kami yo, anata ga wareware no senzo o Ejiputo kara michibikidasareta toki, Moose ni yotte iwareta toori desu".
Soromon wa kono inori to negai o kotogotoku Shu ni sasage owaruto, sore made ten ni mukatte te o nobe, hizamazuite ita Shu no saidan no mae kara tachiagari,
Tatte oogoe de Isuraeru no zenkaishuu o shukufuku shite itta,
"Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa subete yakusoku sareta you ni, sono tami Isuraeru ni taihei o tamawatta. Sono shimobe Moose ni yotte ooserareta sono yoki yakusoku wa mina hitotsu mo tagawanakatta.
Wareware no kami ga wareware no senzo to tomo ni orareta you ni, wareware to tomo ni orareru you ni. Wareware o hanarezu, mata wareware o misuterarenai you ni.
Wareware no kokoro o Shu ni katamukete, Shu no subete no michi ni ayumase, wareware no senzo ni meijirareta imashime to sadame to, okite to o mamoraserareru you ni.
Shu no mae ni watashi ga nobeta korera no negai no kotoba ga, nichiya wareware no kami, Shu ni oboerareru you ni. Soshite Shu wa hibi no koto ni, shimobe o tasuke, Shu no tami Isuraeru o tasukerareru you ni.
Sou sureba, chi no subete no tami wa Shu ga kami de aru koto to, hoka ni kami no nai koto o shiru ni itarude arou.
Sore yue, anata gata wa, konnichi no you ni wareware no kami, Shu ni taishite, kokoro wa mattaku shinjitsu de ari, Shu no sadame ni ayumi, Shu no imashime o mamoranakereba naranai".
Soshite ou oyobi ou to tomo ni iru subete no Isuraeru bi to wa Shu no mae ni gisei o sasageta.
Soromon wa shuuonsai to shite ushi ni man nisentou, hitsuji juu ni mantou o Shu ni sasageta. Kou shite ou to Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina Shu no miya o houken shita.
Sono hi, ou wa Shu no miya no mae ni aru niwa no naka o seibetsu shi, sono tokoro de hansai to sosai to shuuonsai no shibou o sasageta. Kore wa Shu no mae ni aru seidou no saidan ga sosai to shuuonsai no shibou to o ukeru ni tarinakattakara de aru.
Sono toki Soromon wa nanuka no aida wareware no kami, Shu no mae ni matsuri o okonatta. Hamate no iriguchi kara Ejiputo no kawa ni itaru made no subete no Isuraeru bito no ooinaru kaishuu ga kare to tomo ni ita.
Youkame ni Soromon wa tami o kaeraseta. Tami wa ou o shukufuku shi, Shu ga sono shimobe Dabide to, sono tami Isuraeru to ni hodokosareta moromoro no megumi o yorokobi, kokoro ni tanoshinde sono tenmaku ni kaette itta.
Soromon ga Shu no miya to ou no kyuuden oyobi Soromon ga tateyou to nozonda subete no mono o tate owatta toki,
Shu wa katsute Gibeon de Soromon ni arawarerareta you ni futatabi arawarete,
Kare ni iwareta, "Anata ga, watashi no mae ni negatta inori to negai to o kiita. Watashi wa anata ga tateta kono miya o seibetsu shite, watashi no na o eikyuu ni soko ni oku. Watashi no me to, watashi no kokoro wa tsune ni soko ni arude arou.
Anata ga moshi, anata no chichi Dabide ga ayunda you ni mattaki kokoro o motte tadashiku watashi no mae ni ayumi, subete watashi ga meijita you ni okonatte, watashi no sadame to, okite to o mamorunaraba,
Watashi wa, anata no chichi Dabide ni yakusoku shite 'Isuraeru no oui ni noboru hito ga anata ni kakeru koto wa naide arou' to itta you ni, anata no Isuraeru ni ou taru kurai o nagaku kakuho surude arou.
Shikashi, anata gata, mata wa anata gata no shison ga somuite watashi ni shitagawazu, watashi ga anata gata no mae ni oita imashime to sadame to o mamorazu, ta no kamigami ni itte, sore ni tsukae, sore o ogamunaraba,
Watashi wa Isuraeru o, watashi ga ataeta chi no omote kara tatsude arou. Mata watashi no na no tame ni seibetsu shita miya o watashi no mae kara nagesuterude arou. Soshite Isuraeru wa moromoro no tami no uchi ni kotowaza to nari, waraigusa to narude arou.
Katsu, kono miya wa aratsuka to nari, sono katawara o sugiru mono wa mina odoroki, usobuite 'Naniyue, Shu wa kono chi to, kono miya to ni kono you ni sareta no ka' to iude arou.
Sono toki hitobito wa kotaete 'Karera wa jibun no senzo o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita karera no kami, Shu o sutete, ta no kamigami ni tsukishitagai, sore o ogami, sore ni tsukaeta tame ni, Shu wa kono subete no wazawai o karera no ue ni kudashita no de aru' to iude arou".
Soromon wa nijuu nen o hete futatsu no ie sunawachi Shu no miya to ou no kyuuden to o tate owatta toki,
Tsuro no ou Hiramu ga Soromon no nozomi ni makasete kouhaku to, ito sugito, kin to o kyoukyuu shita no de, Soromon ou wa Gariraya no chi no machi nijuu o Hiramu ni ataeta.
Shikashi Hiramu ga Tsuro kara kite, Soromon ga kare ni ataeta machimachi o mita toki, sorera wa kare no ki ni iranakatta no de,
Kare wa, "Kyoudai yo, anata ga kudasatta korera no machimachi wa, ittai na n desu ka" to itta. Sore de, soko wa konnichi made Kaburu no chi to yobarete iru.
Hiramu wa katsute kin hyaku nijuu taranto o ou ni okutta.
Soromon ou ga kyouseiteki ni roudousha o choubo shita no wa kou de aru. Sunawachi Shu no miya to jibun no kyuuden to, Miro to Erusaremu no jouheki to, Hazoru to Megido to Gezeru o tateru tame de atta.
(Ejiputo no ou Paro wa katsute nobotte kite, Gezeru o tori, hi de kore o yaki, sono machi ni sunde ita Kanan bito o koroshi, kore o Soromon no tsuma de aru jibun no musume ni ataete kon'in no okurimono to shita no de,
Soromon wa sono Gezeru o tatenaoshita). Mata shita Betehoron to,
Baarate to Yuda no kuni no arano ni aru Tamaru,
Oyobi Soromon ga motte ita souko no machimachi, sensha no machimachi, kihei no machimachi narabi ni Soromon ga Erusaremu, Rebanon oyobi sono subete no ryouchi ni oite tateyou to nozonda mono o kotogotoku tateru tame de atta.
Subete Isuraeru no shison de nai Amori bi to, Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no nokotta mono,
Sono chi ni atte karera no ato ni nokotta shison sunawachi Isuraeru no hitobito no horoboshi tsukusu koto no dekinakatta mono o, Soromon wa kyouseiteki ni dorei to shite choubo o okonai, konnichi ni itatte iru.
Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito o Soromon wa hitori mo dorei to shinakatta. Karera wa gunjin, mata kare no yakunin, shireikan, shikikan, senshataichou, kiheitai chou de attakara de aru.
Soromon no kouji o kantoku suru uwayaku no kanri wa gohyaku gojuunin de atte, kouji ni hataraku tami o osameta.
Paro no musume wa Dabide no machi kara nobotte, Soromon ga kanojo no tame ni tateta ie ni sunda. Sono toki Soromon wa Miro o tateta.
Soromon wa Shu no tame ni kizuita saidan no ue ni nen ni san do hansai to shuuonsai o sasage, mata Shu no mae ni kou o taita. Kou shite Soromon wa miya o kansei shita.
Soromon ou wa Edomu no chi, koukai no kishi no Erate ni chikai ejion geberu de suuseki no fune o tsukutta.
Hiramu wa umi no koto o shitte iru sen'in de aru sono shimobe o Soromon no shimobe to tomo ni sono fune de tsukawashita.
Karera wa Ofuru e itte, soko kara kin yonhyaku nijuu taranto o totte, Soromon ou no tokoro ni motte kita.
Shiba no joou wa Shu no na ni kakawaru Soromon no meisei o kiita no de, nanmon o motte Soromon o kokoromiyou to tazunete kita.
Kanojo wa ooku no juusha o tsure, kouryou to, takusan no kin to houseki to o rakuda ni owasete Erusaremu ni kita. Kanojo wa Soromon no moto ni kite, sono kokoro ni aru koto o kotogotoku kare ni tsugetaga,
Soromon wa sono subete no toi ni kotaeta. Ou ga shiranaide kanojo ni setsumei no dekinai koto wa hitotsu mo nakatta.
Shiba no joou wa Soromon no moromoro no chie to, Soromon ga tateta kyuuden,
Sono shokutaku no shokumotsu to, retsuza no keraitachi to, sono jishintachi no shikouburi, karera no fukusou to, kare no kyuujitachi, oyobi kare ga Shu no miya de sasageru hansai o mite, mattaku ki o ubawarete shimatta.
Kanojo wa ou ni itta, "Watashi ga kuni de anata no koto to, anata no chie ni tsuite kiita koto wa shinjitsu de arimashita.
Shikashi watashi ga kite, me ni miru made wa, sono kotoba o shinjimasendeshitaga, imami ruto sono hanbun mo watashi wa shirasarete inakatta no desu. Anata no chie to han'ei wa watashi ga kiita uwasa ni masatte imasu.
Anata no okugatatachi wa saiwai desu. Tsune ni anata no mae ni tatte, anata no chie o kiku keraitachi wa saiwai desu.
Anata no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa anata o yorokobi, anata o Isuraeru no kurai ni noboraseraremashita. Shu wa eikyuu ni Isuraeru o aiserareru yue, anata o ou to shite koudou to seigi to o okonawaserareru no desu".
Soshite kanojo wa kin hyaku nijuu taranto oyobi ooku no kouryou to houseki to o ou ni okutta. Shiba no joou ga Soromon ou ni okutta you na ooku no kouryou wa futatabi konakatta.
Ofuru kara kin o nosete kita Hiramu no fune wa, mata Ofuru kara takusan no bi kudan no ki to houseki to o hakonde kita no de,
Ou wa bi kudan no ki o motte Shu no miya to ou no kyuuden no tame ni hekichuu o tsukuri, mata utau hitobito no tame ni koto to tategoto to o tsukutta. Kono you na bi kudan no ki wa, katsute kita koto mo naku, mata konnichi made mita koto mo nakatta.
Soromon ou wa sono yutaka na no ni shitagatte Shiba no joou ni okurimono o shita hoka ni, kanojo no nozomi ni makasete, subete sono motomeru mono o okutta. Soshite kanojo wa sono keraitachi to tomo ni jibun no kuni e kaette itta.
Sate ichi nen no aida ni Soromon no tokoro ni, haitte kita kin no mekata wa roppyaku rokujuu roku taranto de atta.
Sono hoka ni boueki shou oyobi shounin no torihiki, narabi ni Arabiya no shoou to kuni no daikantachi kara mo, haitte kita.
Soromon ou wa nobekin no oodate nihyaku o tsukutta. Sono oodate ni wa onoono roppyaku shikeru no kin o mochiita.
Mata nobekin no kodate sanbyaku o tsukutta. Sono kodate ni wa onoono san mina no kin o mochiita. Ou wa korera o Rebanon no mori no ie ni oita.
Ou wa mata ookina zouge no gyokuza o tsukuri, junkin o motte kore o ootta.
Sono gyokuza ni muitsu no dan ga ari, gyokuza no nochi ni koushi no atama ga ari, zaseki no ryougawa ni hijikake ga atte, hijikake no waki ni futatsu no shishi ga tatte ita.
Mata muitsu no dan no onoono no ryougawa ni juu ni no shishi ga tatte ita. Kono you na mono wa doko no kuni de mo tsukurareta koto ga nakatta.
Soromon ou ga nomu toki ni mochiita utsuwa wa mina kin de atta. Mata Rebanon no mori no ie no utsuwa mo mina junkin de atte, gin no mono wa nakatta. Gin wa Soromon no yo ni wa kaerimirarenakatta.
Kore wa ou ga umi ni Tarushishi no sentai o shoyuu shite, Hiramu no sentai to issho ni koukai sase, Tarushishi no sentai ni san nen ni ichi do, kin, gin, zouge, saru, kujaku o nosete kosasetakara de aru.
Kono you ni Soromon ou wa tomi mo chie mo, chi no subete no ou ni masatte ita no de,
Zenchi no hitobito wa kami ga Soromon no kokoro ni sazukerareta chie o kikou to shite Soromon ni ekken o motometa.
Hitobito wa onoono okurimono o tazusaete kita. Sunawachi gin no utsuwa, kin no utsuwa, ifuku, motsuyaku, kouryou, uma, raba nado nennen sadamatte ita.
Soromon wa sensha to kihei to o atsumetaga, sensha issen yonhyaku ryou, kihei ichi man nisen atta. Soromon wa kore o sensha no machi to Erusaremu no ou no moto ni oita.
Ou wa Erusaremu de, gin o ishi no you ni mochii, kouhaku o heichi ni aru ichijiku kuwa no you ni ooku mochiita.
Soromon ga uma o yunyuu shita no wa Ejiputo to Kue kara de atta. Sunawachi ou no boueki shou wa Kue kara daika o haratte uketotte kita.
Ejiputo kara yunyuu sareru sensha ichiryou wa gin roppyaku shikeru, uma wa hyaku gojuu shikeru de atta. Kono you ni shite, korera no mono ga ou no boueki shou ni yotte, Hete bito no subete no outachi oyobi Suriya no outachi ni yushutsu sareta.
Soromon ou wa ooku no gaikoku no onna o aishita. Sunawachi Paro no musume, Moabu bi to, Anmon bi to, Edomu bi to, Shidon bi to, Hete bito no onna o aishita.
Shu wa katsute korera no kokumin ni tsuite, Isuraeru no hitobito ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa karera to majiwatte wa naranai. Karera mo mata anata gata to majiwatte wa naranai. Karera wa kanarazu anata gata no kokoro o tenjite karera no kamigami ni shitagawaserukara de aru". Shikashi Soromon wa karera o aishite hanarenakatta.
Kare ni wa ouhi to shite no tsuma nanahyakunin, sobame sanbyakunin ga atta. Sono tsumatachi ga kare no kokoro o tenjita no de aru.
Soromon ga toshioita toki, sono tsumatachi ga kare no kokoro o tenjite ta no kamigami ni shitagawaseta no de, kare no kokoro wa chichi Dabide no kokoro no you ni wa, sono kami, Shu ni shinjitsu de nakatta.
Kore wa Soromon ga Shidon bito no megami Ashitarote ni shitagai, Anmon bito no kami de aru nikumubeki mono Mirukomu ni shitagattakara de aru.
Kono you ni Soromon wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, chichi Dabide no you ni mattaku wa Shu ni shitagawanakatta.
Soshite Soromon wa Moabu no kami de aru nikumubeki mono Kemoshi no tame ni, mata Anmon no hitobito no kami de aru nikumubeki mono Moreku no tame ni Erusaremu no higashi no yama ni takaki tokoro o kizuita.
Kare wa mata gaikoku no subete no tsumatachi no tame ni mo sou shita no de, kanojotachi wa sono kamigami ni kou o taki, gisei o sasageta.
Kono you ni Soromon no kokoro ga tenjite, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o hanareta tame, Shu wa kare o ikarareta. Sunawachi Shu ga katsute ni do kare ni araware,
Kono koto ni tsuite kare ni, ta no kamigami ni shitagatte wa naranai to meijirareta no ni, kare wa Shu no meijirareta koto o mamoranakattakara de aru.
Sore yue, Shu wa Soromon ni iwareta, "Kore ga anata no honshin de ari, watashi ga meijita keiyaku to sadame to o mamoranakatta no de, watashi wa kanarazu anata kara kuni o saki hanashite, sore o anata no kerai ni ataeru.
Shikashi anata no chichi Dabide no tame ni, anata no yo ni wa sore o shinaiga, anata no ko no te kara sore o saki hanasu.
Tadashi, watashi wa kuni o kotogotoku wa saki hanasazu, watashi no shimobe Dabide no tame ni, mata watashi ga eranda Erusaremu no tame ni hitotsu no buzoku o anata no ko ni ataerude arou".
Kou shite Shu wa Edomu bito Hadade o okoshite, Soromon no teki to sareta. Kare wa Edomu no ouie no mono de atta.
Saki ni Dabide wa Edomu ni itaga, gun no chouYoabu ga nobotte itte, senshi shita mono o houmuri, Edomu no danshi o kotogotoku uchikoroshita toki,
(Yoabu wa Isuraeru no hitobito to tomo ni roku kagetsu soko ni todomatte, Edomu no danshi o kotogotoku tatta).
Hadade wa sono chichi no shimobe de aru suunin no Edomu bito to tomo ni nigete Ejiputo e ikou to shita. Sono toki Hadade wa mada shounen de atta.
Karera ga Midean o tatte Paran e iki, Paran kara hitobito o tomonatte Ejiputo e iki, Ejiputo no ou Paro no tokoro e ikuto, Paro wa kare ni ie o atae, shokuryou o sadame, katsu tochi o ataeta.
Hadade wa ooini Paro no kokoro ni kanatta no de, Paro wa jibun no tsuma no imouto sunawachi ouhi Tapenesu no imouto o tsuma to shite kare ni ataeta.
Tapenesu no imouto wa kare ni otokonoko Genubate o unda no de, Tapenesu wa sono ko o Paro no ie no uchi de chibanare saseta. Genubate wa Paro no ie de, Paro no kodomotachi to issho ni ita.
Sate Hadade wa Ejiputo de, Dabide ga sono senzo to tomo ni nemutta koto to, gun no chouYoabu ga shinda koto o kiita no de, Hadade wa Paro ni itta, "Watashi o sarasete, kuni e kaerasete kudasai".
Paro wa kare ni itta, "Watashi to tomo ni ite, nan no fusoku ga atte kuni e kaeru koto o motomeru no desu ka". Kare wa itta, "Tada, watashi o kaerasete kudasai".
Kami wa mata Eriada no ko Rezon o okoshite Soromon no teki to sareta. Kare wa sono shujin Zoba no ou Hadadezeru no moto o nigesatta mono de atta.
Dabide ga Zoba no hitobito o koroshita nochi, kare wa hitobito o jibun no mawari ni atsumete ryakudatsutai no shuryou to natta. Karera wa Damasuko e itte, soko ni sumi, Damasuko de kare o ou to shita.
Kare wa Soromon no isshou no aida, Isuraeru no teki to natte, Hadade ga shita you ni gai o nashi, Isuraeru o nikunde Suriya o osameta.
Zereda no Efuraimu bito Nebate no ko Yarabeamu wa Soromon no kerai de attaga, sono haha no na wa Zeruya to itte kafu de atta. Kare mo mata sono te o agete ou ni tekishita.
Kare ga te o agete, ou ni tekishita jijou wa kou de aru. Soromon wa Miro o kizuki, chichi Dabide no machi no yabure kuchi o fusaide ita.
Yarabeamu wa hijou ni shuwan no aru hito de attaga, Soromon wa kono wakamono ga yoku hataraku no o mite, kare ni Yosefu no ie no subete no kyousei roudou no kantoku o saseta.
Sono koro, Yarabeamu ga Erusaremu o deta toki, Shiro bito de aru yogensha Ahiya ga michi de kare ni atta. Ahiya wa atarashii kimono o kite ita. Soshite karera futari dake ga no ni ita.
Ahiya wa kite iru kimono o tsukande, sore o juu ni kire ni saki,
Yarabeamu ni itta, "Anata wa juu kire o tori nasai. Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Miyo, watashi wa kuni o Soromon no te kara saki hanashite, anata ni juu buzoku o ataeyou.
(tadashi kare wa watashi no shimobe Dabide no tame ni, mata watashi ga Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara eranda machi Erusaremu no tame ni, hitotsu no buzoku o motsude arou).
Sore wa kare ga watashi o sutete, Shidon bito no megami Ashitarote to, Moabu no kami Kemoshi to, Anmon no hitobito no kami Mirukomu o ogami, chichi Dabide no you ni, watashi no michi ni ayunde, watashi no me ni kanau koto o okonai, watashi no sadame to, okite o mamoru koto o shinakattakara de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa kuni o kotogotoku wa kare no te kara toranai. Watashi ga eranda, watashi no shimobe Dabide ga, watashi no meirei to sadame to o mamotta no de, watashi wa kare no tame ni Soromon o isshou no aida, kimi to shiyou.
Soshite, watashi wa sono ko no te kara kuni o totte, sono juu buzoku o anata ni ataeru.
Sono ko ni wa hitotsu no buzoku o ataete, watashi no na o oku tame ni eranda machi Erusaremu de, watashi no shimobe Dabide ni, watashi no mae ni tsune ni hitotsu no tomoshibi o tamotaserude arou.
Watashi ga anata o erabi, anata wa subete kokoro no nozomu tokoro o osamete, Isuraeru no ue ni ou to narude arou.
Moshi, anata ga, watashi no meijiru subete no koto o kiite, watashi no michi ni ayumi, watashi no me ni kanau koto o okonai, watashi no shimobe Dabide ga shita you ni, watashi no sadame to imashime to o mamorunaraba, watashi wa anata to tomo ni ite, watashi ga Dabide no tame ni tateta you ni, anata no tame ni kengo na ie o tatete, Isuraeru o anata ni ataeyou.
Watashi wa kono tame ni Dabide no shison o kurushimeru. Shikashi eikyuu ni de wa nai' ".
Soromon wa Yarabeamu o korosou to shitaga, Yarabeamu wa tatte Ejiputo ni nogare, Ejiputo ou Shishaku no tokoro e itte, Soromon no shinu made Ejiputo ni ita.
Soromon no sono hoka no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi sono chie wa, Soromon no jiseki no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Soromon ga Erusaremu de Isuraeru no zenchi o osameta hi wa yonjuu nen de atta.
Soromon wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, chichi Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Rehabeamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Rehabeamu wa Shikemu e itta. Subete no Isuraeru bito ga kare o ou ni shiyou to Shikemu e ittakara de aru.
Nebate no ko Yarabeamu wa Soromon o sakete Ejiputo ni nogare, nao soko ni itaga, kore o kiite Ejiputo kara kaetta no de,
Hitobito wa hito o tsukawashite kare o maneita. Soshite Yarabeamu to Isuraeru no kaishuu wa mina Rehabeamu no tokoro ni kite itta,
"Chichiue wa wareware no kubiki o omoku saremashitaga, ima chichiue no kibishii shieki to, chichiue ga wareware ni owaserareta omoi kubiki to o karuku shite kudasai. Sou sureba wareware wa anata ni tsukaemasu".
Rehabeamu wa karera ni itta, "Satte, mikka sugite kara, mata watashi no tokoro ni ki nasai". Sore de tami wa tachisatta.
Rehabeamu ou wa chichi Soromon no zonmeinaka Soromon ni tsukaeta roujintachi ni soudan shite itta, "Kono tami ni dou hentou sureba yoi to omoimasu ka".
Karera wa Rehabeamu ni itta, "Moshi, anata ga, kyou, kono tami no shimobe to natte karera ni tsukae, karera ni kotaeru toki, nengoro ni katararerunaraba, karera wa eikyuu ni anata no shimobe to narudeshou".
Shikashi kare wa roujintachi ga ataeta susume o sutete, jibun to issho ni ookiku natte jibun ni tsukaete iru wakamonotachi ni soudan shite,
Karera ni itta, "Kono tami ga watashi ni mukatte 'Anata no chichi ga wareware ni owaseta kubiki o karuku shite kudasai' to iu no ni, wareware wa nan to hentou sureba yoi to omoimasu ka".
Kare to issho ni ookiku natta wakamonotachi wa kare ni itta, "Anata ni mukatte 'Chichiue wa wareware no kubiki o omoku saremashitaga, anata wa, sore o wareware no tame ni karuku shite kudasai' to iu kono tami ni, kou ii nasai, 'Watashi no koyubi wa chichi no koshi yori mo futoi.
Chichi wa anata gata ni omoi kubiki o owasetaga, watashi wa sarani, anata gata no kubiki o omoku shiyou. Chichi wa muchi de anatagata o korashitaga, watashi wa sasori o motte anatagata o korasou' to".
Sate Yarabeamu to tami wa mina, ou ga "Mikkame ni futatabi watashi no tokoro ni kuru you ni" to itta toori ni, mikkame ni Rehabeamu no tokoro ni kita.
Ou wa araarashiku tami ni kotae, roujintachi ga ataeta susume o sutete,
Wakamonotachi no susume ni shitagai, karera ni tsugete itta, "Chichi wa anata gata no kubiki o omoku shitaga, watashi wa anata gata no kubiki o, sarani omoku shiyou. Chichi wa muchi de anatagata o korashitaga, watashi wa sasori o motte anatagata o korasou".
Kono you ni ou wa tami no iu koto o kikiirenakatta. Kore wa katsute Shu ga Shiro bi to Ahiya ni yotte, Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ni iwareta kotoba o jouju suru tame ni, Shu ga shimukerareta koto de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina, ou ga jibuntachi no iu koto o kikiirenai no o mita no de, tami wa ou ni kotaete itta, "Wareware wa Dabide no uchi ni nani no bun ga arou ka, Essai no ko no uchi ni shigyou ga nai. Isuraeru yo, anata gata no tenmaku e kaere. Dabide yo, imajibun no ie no koto o miyo". Soshite Isuraeru wa sono tenmaku e satte itta.
Shikashi Rehabeamu wa Yuda no machimachi ni sunde iru Isuraeru no hitobito o osameta.
Rehabeamu ou wa choubo no kantoku de atta Adoramu o tsukawashitaga, Isuraeru ga mina, kare o ishi de uchikoroshita no de, Rehabeamu ou wa isoide kuruma ni nori, Erusaremu e nigeta.
Kou shite Isuraeru wa Dabide no ie ni somuite konnichi ni itatta.
Isuraeru wa mina Yarabeamu no kaette kita no o kiki, hito o tsukawashite kare o shuukai ni maneki, Isuraeru no zenka no ue ni ou to shita. Yuda no buzoku no hoka wa Dabide no ie ni shitagau mono ga nakatta.
Soromon no ko Rehabeamu wa Erusaremu ni kite, Yuda no zenka to Beniyamin no buzoku no mono, sunawachi erinuki no gunjin juu hachi man o atsume, kuni o torimodosu tame ni, Isuraeru no ie to tatakaou to shitaga,
Kami no kotoba ga kami no hito Shimaya ni nozonda,
"Soromon no ko de aru Yuda no ou Rehabeamu, oyobi Yuda to Beniyamin no zenka, narabi ni sono hoka no tami ni ii nasai,
'Shu wa kou ooserareru. Anata gata wa nobotte itte wa naranai. Anata gata no kyoudai de aru Isuraeru no hitobito to tatakatte wa naranai. Onoono ie ni kaeri nasai. Kono koto wa watashi kara deta no de aru' ". Sore de karera wa Shu no kotoba o kiki, Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte kaette itta.
Yarabeamu wa Efuraimu no sanchi ni Shikemu o tatete, soko ni sunda. Kare wa mata soko kara dete Penueru o tateta.
Shikashi Yarabeamu wa sono kokoro no uchi ni itta, "Kuni wa ima Dabide no ie ni modorude arou.
Moshi kono tami ga Erusaremu ni aru Shu no miya ni gisei o sasageru tame ni noborunaraba, kono tami no kokoro wa Yuda no ou de aru karera no shukun Rehabeamu ni kaeri, watashi o koroshite, Yuda no ou Rehabeamu ni kaerude arou".
Soko de ou wa soudan shite, futatsu no kin no koushi o tsukuri, tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa mohaya Erusaremu ni noboru ni wa, oyobanai. Isuraeru yo, anatagata o Ejiputo no kuni kara michibiki nobotta anata gata no kami o miyo".
Soshite kare wa hitotsu o Beteru ni sue, hitotsu o Dan ni oita.
Kono koto wa tsumi to natta. Tami ga Beteru e itte hitotsu o reihai shi, Dan e itte hitotsu o reihai shitakara de aru.
Kare wa mata takaki tokoro ni ie o tsukuri, Rebi no shison de nai ippan no tami o saishi ni ninmei shita.
Mata Yarabeamu wa Yuda de okonau matsuri to onaji matsuri o hachi gatsu no juu go nichi ni sadame, soshite saidan ni nobotta. Kare wa Beteru de sono you ni okonai, kare ga tsukutta koushi ni gisei o sasageta. Mata jibun no tsukutta takaki tokoro no saishi o Beteru ni tateta.
Kou shite kare wa Beteru ni tsukutta saidan ni hachi gatsu no juu go nichi ni nobotta. Kore wa kare ga jibun de katte ni kangaetsuita tsuki de atta. Soshite kare wa Isuraeru no hitobito no tame ni matsuri o sadame, saidan ni nobotte kou o taita.
Miyo, kami no hito ga Shu no inochi ni yotte Yuda kara Beteru ni kita. Sono toki Yarabeamu wa saidan no ue ni tatte kou o taite ita.
Kami no hito wa saidan ni mukai Shu no inochi ni yotte yobawatte itta, "Saidan yo, saidan yo, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Miyo, Dabide no ie ni hitori no ko ga umareru. Sono na o Yoshiya to iu. Kare wa omae no ue de kou o taku takaki tokoro no saishira o, omae no ue ni sasageru. Mata hito no hone ga omae no ue de yakareru' ".
Sono hi, kare wa mata hitotsu no shirushi o shimeshite itta, "Shu no iwareta shirushi wa kore de aru, 'Miyo, saidan wa sake, sono ue ni aru hai wa koborederude arou' ".
Yarabeamu ou wa, kami no hito ga Beteru ni aru saidan ni mukatte yobawaru kotoba o kiita toki, saidan kara te o nobashite, "Kare o toraeyo" to ittaga, kare ni mukatte nobashita te ga karete, hikkomeru koto ga dekinakatta.
Soshite kami no hito ga Shu no kotoba o motte shimeshita shirushi no you ni saidan wa sake, hai wa saidan kara koboredeta.
Ou wa kami no hito ni itta, "Anata no kami, Shu ni negai, watashi no tame ni inotte, watashi no te o moto ni kaerasete kudasai". Kami no hito ga Shu ni negatta no de, ou no te wa moto ni kaette, mae no you ni natta.
Soko de ou wa kami no hito ni itta, "Watashi to issho ni ie ni kite, mi o yasume nasai. Anata ni sharei o sashiagemashou".
Kami no hito wa ou ni itta, "Tatoi, anata no ie no nakaba o kudasatte mo, watashi wa anata to issho ni mairimasen. Mata kono tokoro de wa, pan mo tabezu mizu mo nomimasen.
Shu no kotoba ni yotte watashi wa, 'Pan o tabete wa naranai, mizu o nonde wa naranai. Mata kita michi kara kaette wa naranai' to meijirarete irukara desu".
Kou shite kare wa hoka no michi o iki, Beteru ni kita michi kara wa kaeranakatta.
Sate Beteru ni hitori no toshioita yogensha ga sunde itaga, sono musukotachi ga kite, sono hikami no hito ga Beteru deshita kotodomo o kare ni hanashita. Mata kami no hito ga ou ni itta kotoba o mo sono chichi ni hanashita.
Chichi ga karera ni "Sono hito wa dono michi o itta ka" to kiita no de, musukotachi wa Yuda kara kita kami no hito no itta michi o chichi ni shimeshita.
Chichi wa musukotachi ni itta, "Watashi no tame ni roba ni kura o oki nasai". Karera ga roba ni kura o oita no de, kare wa sore ni nori,
Kami no hito no ato o otte iki, kashi no ki no shita ni suwatte iru no o mite, sono hito ni itta, "Anata wa Yuda kara korareta kami no hito desu ka". Sono hito wa itta, "Sou desu".
Soko de kare wa sono hito ni itta, "Watashi to issho ni ie ni kite pan o tabete kudasai".
Sono hito wa itta, "Watashi wa anata to issho ni hikikaesu koto wa dekimasen. Anata to issho ni iku koto wa dekimasen. Mata watashi wa kono tokoro de anata to issho ni pan mo tabezu mizu mo nomimasen.
Shu no kotoba ni yotte watashi wa, 'Sono tokoro de pan o tabete wa naranai, mizu o nonde wa naranai. Mata kita michi kara kaette wa naranai' to iwarete irukara desu".
Kare wa sono hito ni itta, "Watashi mo anata to onaji yogensha desuga, ten no tsukai ga Shu no inochi ni yotte watashi ni tsugete, 'Sono hito o issho ni ie ni tsurekaeri, pan o tabesase, mizu o nomase yo' to iimashita". Kore wa kare ga sono hito o azamuita no de aru.
Soko de sono hito wa kare to issho ni hikikaeshi, sono ie de pan o tabe, mizu o nonda.
Karera ga shokutaku ni tsuite ita toki, Shu no kotoba ga, sono hito o tsurete kaetta yogensha ni nozonda no de,
Kare wa Yuda kara kita kami no hito ni mukai yobawatte itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anata ga Shu no kotoba ni somuki, anata no kami, Shu ga omeiji ni natta meirei o mamorazu,
Hikikaeshite, Shu ga anata ni, pan o tabete wa naranai, mizu o nonde wa naranai, to iwareta basho de pan o tabe, mizu o nonda yue, anata no shitai wa anata no senzo no haka ni ikanaide arou' ".
Soshite sono hito ga pan o tabe, mizu o nonda nochi, kare wa sono hito no tame, sunawachi tsurekaetta yogensha no tame ni roba ni kura o oita.
Kou shite sono hito wa tachisattaga, michi de shishi ga kare ni atte kare o koroshita. Soshite sono shitai wa michi ni suterare, roba wa sono katawara ni tachi, shishi mo mata shitai no katawara ni tatte ita.
Hitobito wa soko o tootte, michi ni suterarete iru shitai to, shitai no katawara ni tatte iru shishi o mite, kano rouyogensha no sunde iru machi ni kite sore o hanashita.
Sono hito o michi kara tsurete kaetta yogensha wa sore o kiite itta, "Sore wa Shu no kotoba ni somuita kami no hito da. Shu ga kare ni iwareta kotoba no you ni, Shu wa kare o shishi ni watasare, shishi ga kare o saki koroshita no da".
Soshite musukotachi ni itta, "Watashi no tame ni roba ni kura o oki nasai". Karera ga kura o oita no de,
Kare wa itte, shitai ga michi ni suterare, roba to shishi ga shitai no katawara ni tatte iru no o mita. Shishi wa sono shitai o tabezu, roba mo saite inakatta.
Soko de yogensha wa kami no hito no shitai o toriage, sore o roba ni nosete machi ni mochikaeri, kanashinde sore o houmutta.
Sunawachi sono shitai o jibun no haka ni osame, mina kore ga tame ni "Aa, waga kyoudai yo" to itte kanashinda.
Kare wa sore o houmutte nochi, musukotachi ni itta, "Watashi ga shinda toki wa, kami no hito o houmutta haka ni houmuri, watashi no hone o kare no hone no katawara ni osame nasai.
Kare ga Shu no inochi ni yotte, Beteru ni aru saidan ni mukai, mataSamariya no machimachi ni aru takaki tokoro no subete no ie ni mukatte yobawatta kotoba wa kanarazu jouju suru no desu".
Kono koto no nochi mo, Yarabeamu wa sono warui michi o hanarete tachikaeru koto o sezu, mata ippan no tami o, takaki tokoro no saishi ni ninmei shita. Sunawachi, dare de mo konomu mono wa, sore o tatete takaki tokoro no saishi to shita.
Kono koto wa Yarabeamu no ie no tsumi to natte, tsuini kore o chi no omote kara tachi horobosu you ni natta.
Sono koro Yarabeamu no ko Abiya ga byouki ni natta no de,
Yarabeamu wa tsuma ni itta, "Tatte sugata o kae, Yarabeamu no tsuma de aru koto no shirarenai you ni shite Shiro e iki nasai. Watashi ga kono tami no ou to naru koto o, watashi ni tsugeta yogensha Ahiya ga soko ni imasu.
Pan juuko to kashi suuko oyobi, mitsu ichi bin o tazusaete kare no tokoro e iki nasai. Kare wa kono ko ga dou naru ka o anata ni tsugerudeshou".
Yarabeamu no tsuma wa sono you ni shite, tatte Shiro e iki, Ahiya no ie ni tsuitaga, Ahiya wa toshioita tame, me ga kasunde miru koto ga dekinakatta.
Shikashi Shu wa Ahiya ni iwareta, "Yarabeamu no tsuma ga kodomo no koto o anata ni tazuneru tame ni kuru. Kodomo wa byouki da. Anata wa kanojo ni kou kou iwanakereba naranai". Kanojo wa kuru toki, tanin o yosootte ita.
Shikashi kanojo ga toguchi ni haitte kita toki, Ahiya wa sono ashioto o kiite itta, "Yarabeamu no tsuma yo, hairi nasai. Naze, tanin o yosoou no desu ka. Watashi wa anata ni kibishii koto o tsugeru you, meijirarete imasu.
Itte Yarabeamu ni ii nasai, 'Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi wa anata o tami no uchi kara age, watashi no tami Isuraeru no ue ni tatete kimi to shi,
Kuni o Dabide no ie kara saki hanashite, sore o anata ni ataeta no ni, anata wa watashi no shimobe Dabide ga, watashi no meirei o mamotte isshin ni watashi ni shitagai, tada watashi no me ni kanatta koto nomi o okonatta you nide wa naku,
Anata yori mo saki ni ita subete no mono ni masatte aku o nashi, itte jibun no tame ni ta no kamigami to ita zou o tsukuri, watashi o ikarase, watashi o ushiro ni sutesatta.
Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa Yarabeamu no ie ni wazawai o kudashi, Yarabeamu ni zokusuru otoko wa, Isuraeru ni tsuite, tsunagareta mono mo, jiyuu na mono mo kotogotoku tachi, hito ga akuta o nokori naku yaki tsukusu you ni, Yarabeamu no ie o mattaku tachi horobosude arou.
Yarabeamu ni zokusuru mono wa, machi de shinu mono o inu ga tabe, no de shinu mono o sora no tori ga taberude arou. Shu ga kore o iwareru no de aru"'.
Anata wa tatte, ie e kaeri nasai. Anata no ashi ga machi ni wa iru toki ni, kodomo wa shinimasu.
Soshite Isuraeru wa mina, kare no tame ni kanashinde kare o houmurudeshou. Yarabeamu ni zokusuru mono wa, tada kare dake haka ni houmurarerudeshou. Yarabeamu no ie no uchi de, kare wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni mukatte yoi omoi o idaite itakara desu.
Shu wa Isuraeru no ue ni hitori no ou o okosaremasu. Kare wa sono hi Yarabeamu no ie o tatsudeshou.
Sono nochi Shu wa Isuraeru o utte, mizu ni yuragu ashi no you ni shi, Isuraeru o, sono senzo ni tamawatta kono yoi chi kara nukisatte, Yufurate kawa no mukou ni chirasarerudeshou. Karera ga Ashira zou o tsukutte Shu o ikarasetakara desu.
Shu wa Yarabeamu no tsumi no yue ni, sunawachi kare ga mizukara okashi, mata Isuraeru ni okasaseta sono tsumi no yue ni Isuraeru o suterarerudeshou".
Yarabeamu no tsuma wa tatte sari, Teruza e itte, ie no shikii o mataida toki, kodomo wa shinda.
Isuraeru wa mina kare o houmuri, kare no tame ni kanashinda. Shu ga sono shimobe yogensha Ahiya ni yotte iwareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Yarabeamu no sono ta no jiseki, kare ga dono you ni tatakai, dono you ni yo o osameta ka wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Yarabeamu ga yo o osameta hi wa nijuu ni nen de atta. Kare wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, sono ko Nadabu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Soromon no ko Rehabeamu wa Yuda de yo o osameta. Rehabeamu wa ou to natta toki yonjuu ichisai de attaga, Shu ga sono na o oku tame ni, Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara erabareta machi Erusaremu de, juu nana nenyo o osameta. Sono haha no na wa Naama to itte Anmon bito de atta.
Yuda no hitobito wa sono senzo no okonatta subete no koto ni masatte, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, sono okashita tsumi ni yotte Shu no ikari o hikiokoshita.
Karera mo subete no takai oka no ue to, subete no aoki no shita ni, takaki tokoro to ishi no hashira to Ashira zou to o tatetakara de aru.
Sono kuni ni wa mata shinden danshoutachi ga ita. Karera wa Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta kokumin no subete no nikumubeki koto o narai itta.
Rehabeamu no ou no daigo nen ni Ejiputo no ou Shishaku ga Erusaremu ni semenobotte kite,
Shu no miya no houmotsu to, ou no kyuuden no houmotsu o ubaisatta. Kare wa sore o kotogotoku ubaisari, mata Soromon no tsukutta kin no tate o mina ubaisatta.
Rehabeamu wa sono kawari ni seidou no tate o tsukutte, ou no kyuuden no mon o mamoru jieichou no te ni watashita.
Ou ga Shu no miya ni hairugoto ni, jiei wa sore o tazusae, mata, sore o jiei no heya e mochikaetta.
Rehabeamu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Rehabeamu to Yarabeamu no aida ni wa taezu sensou ga atta.
Rehabeamu wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte senzo to tomo ni Dabide no machi ni houmurareta. Sono haha no na wa Naama to itte Anmon bito de atta. Sono ko Abiyamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ou no daijuu hachi nen ni Abiyamu ga Yuda no ou to nari,
Erusaremu de san nenyo o osameta. Sono haha no na wa Maaka to itte, Abusaromu no musume de atta.
Kare wa sono chichi ga saki ni okonatta moromoro no tsumi o okonai, sono kokoro wa chichi Dabide no kokoro no you ni sono kami, Shu ni taishite mattaku shinjitsu de wa nakatta.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu, sono kami, Shu wa Dabide no tame ni, Erusaremu ni oite kare ni hitotsu no tomoshibi o atae, sono ko o kare no ato ni tatete, Erusaremu o katamerareta.
Sore wa Dabide ga Hete bito Uriya no koto no hoka, isshou no aida, Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonai, Shu ga meijirareta subete no koto ni, somukanakattakara de aru.
Rehabeamu to Yarabeamu no aida ni wa isshou no aida, sensou ga atta.
Abiyamu no sono ta no koui to, kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka. Abiyamu to Yarabeamu no aida ni mo sensou ga atta.
Abiyamu wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Asa ga kawatte ou to natta.
Isuraeru no ou Yarabeamu no dainijuu nen ni Asa wa Yuda no ou to nari,
Erusaremu de yonjuu ichi nenyo o osameta. Sono haha no na wa Maaka to itte Abusaromu no musume de atta.
Asa wa sono chichi Dabide ga shita you ni Shu no me ni kanau koto o shi,
Shinden danshou o kuni kara oidashi, senzotachi no tsukutta moromoro no guuzou o nozoita.
Kare wa mata sono haha Maaka ga, Ashira no tame ni nikumubeki zou o tsukuraseta no de, kanojo o taikou no kurai kara shirizoketa. Soshite Asa wa sono nikumubeki zou o kiritaoshite Kideron no tani de yakisuteta.
Tadashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta. Keredo mo Asa no kokoro wa isshou no aida, Shu ni taishite mattaku shinjitsu de atta.
Kare wa chichi no kennou shita mono to jibun no kennou shita mono, kingin oyobi utsuwamono o Shu no miya ni tazusae ireta.
Asa to Isuraeru no ou Baasha no aida ni wa isshou no aida, sensou ga atta.
Isuraeru no ou Baasha wa Yuda ni semenobori, Yuda no ou Asa no tokoro ni, dare o mo deiri sasenai tame ni Rama o kizuita.
Soko de Asa wa Shu no miya no houzou to, ou no kyuuden no houzou ni nokotte iru kingin o kotogotoku totte, kore o keraitachi no te ni watashi, soshite Asa ou wa karera o Damasuko ni sunde iru Suriya no ou, Hejon no ko Taburimon no ko de aru Benehadade ni tsukawashite iwaseta,
"Watashi no chichi to anata no chichi to no aida ni musubarete ita you ni, watashi to anata no aida ni doumei o musubimashou. Watashi wa anata ni kingin no okurimono o sashiagemasu. Itte, anata to Isuraeru no ou Baasha to no doumei o haki shi, kare o watashi no tokoro kara tettai sasete kudasai".
Benehadade wa Asa ou no iu koto o kiki, jibun no gunzei no choutachi o tsukawashite Isuraeru no machimachi o seme, Iyon to Dan to Aberu bete maaka oyobi Kinnerete no zenchi to, Nafutari no zenchi o utta.
Baasha wa kore o kiki, Rama o kizuku koto o yamete, Teruza ni todomatta.
Soko de Asa ou wa Yuda zenkoku ni fukoku o hasshita. Hitori mo manukareru mono wa nakatta. Sunawachi Baasha ga Rama o kizuku tame ni mochiita ishi to zaimoku o hakobikosa se, Asa ou wa sore o mochiite, Beniyamin no Geba to Mizupa o kizuita.
Asa no sono ta no jiseki to sono subete no kunkou to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi kare ga tateta machimachi wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka. Kare wa rounen ni natte ashi o yanda.
Asa wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, chichi Dabide no machi ni senzo to tomo ni houmurare, sono ko Yoshapate ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Asa no daini nen ni Yarabeamu no ko Nadabu ga Isuraeru no ou to natte, ni nen Isuraeru o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, sono chichi no michi ni ayumi, chichi ga Isuraeru ni okasaseta tsumi o okonatta.
Issakaru no ie no Ahiya no ko Baasha wa kare ni taishite muhon o kuwadate, Perishite bito ni zokusuru Gibeton de kare o utta. Kore wa Nadabu to Isuraeru ga mina Gibeton o kakonde itakara de aru.
Kou shite Yuda no ou Asa no daisan nen ni Baasha wa kare o koroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Kare wa ou to naruto sugu Yarabeamu no zenka o uchi, iki no aru mono o hitori mo Yarabeamu no ie ni nokosazu, kotogotoku horoboshita. Shu ga sono shimobe Shiro bi to Ahiya ni yotte iwareta kotoba no toori de atte,
Kore wa Yarabeamu ga mizukara okashi, mata Isuraeru ni okasaseta tsumi no tame, mata kare ga Isuraeru no kami, Shu o ikaraseta sono ikari ni yoru no de atta.
Nadabu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Asa to Isuraeru no ou Baasha no aida ni wa isshou no aida sensou ga atta.
Yuda no ou Asa no daisan nen ni Ahiya no ko Baasha wa Teruza de Isuraeru no zenchi no ou to natte, nijuu yon nenyo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Yarabeamu no michi ni ayumi, Yarabeamu ga Isuraeru ni okasaseta tsumi o okonatta.
Soko de Shu no kotoba ga Hanani no ko Ehiu ni nozomi, Baasha o semete itta,
"Watashi wa anata o chiri no naka kara agete, watashi no tami Isuraeru no ue ni kimi to shitaga, anata wa Yarabeamu no michi ni ayumi, watashi no tami Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasase, sono tsumi o motte watashi o ikaraseta.
Sore de watashi wa, Baasha to sono ie o mattaku horoboshisari, anata no ie o Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no ie no you ni suru.
Baasha ni zokusuru mono de, machi de shinu mono wa inu ga tabe, kare ni zokusuru mono de, no de shinu mono wa sora no tori ga taberude arou".
Baasha no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita koto to, sono kunkou to wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Baasha wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, Teruza ni houmurare, sono ko Era ga kawatte ou to natta.
Shu no kotoba wa mata Hanani no ko yogensha Ehiu ni yotte nozomi, Baasha to sono ie o semeta. Kore wa kare ga Shu no me no mae ni, moromoro no aku o okonai, sono te no waza o motte Shu o ikarase, Yarabeamu no ie ni naratta tame de ari, mata kare ga Yarabeamu no ie o horoboshita tame de atta.
Yuda no ou Asa no dainijuu roku nen ni Baasha no ko Era wa Teruza de Isuraeru no ou to nari, ni nenyo o osameta.
Kare ga Teruza ni ite, Teruza no kyuuden no tsukasa Aruza no ie de sake o nonde yotta toki, sono kerai de senshatai no nakaba o shiki shite ita Jimuri ga, kare ni somuita.
Soshite Yuda no ou Asa no dainijuu shichi nen ni Jimuri wa, haitte kite kare o uchikoroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Jimuri wa ou to natte, kurai ni tsuita toki, Baasha no zenka o koroshi, sono shinzoku mata wa tomodachi no danshi wa, hitori mo nokosanakatta.
Kou shite Jimuri wa Baasha no zenka o horoboshita. Shu ga yogensha Ehiu ni yotte Baasha o semete iwareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Kore wa Baasha no moromoro no tsumi to, sono ko Era no tsumi no tame de atte, karera ga tsumi o okashi, mata Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasase, karera no guuzou o motte Isuraeru no kami, Shu o ikarasetakara de aru.
Era no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yuda no ou Asa no dainijuu shichi nen ni Jimuri wa Teruza de nanuka no aida, yo o osameta. Tami wa Perishite bito ni zokusuru Gibeton ni mukatte jindotte itaga,
Sono jindotte ita tami ga "Jimuri wa muhon o okoshite ou o koroshita" to hito no iu no o kiita no de, Isuraeru wa mina sono hi jin'ei de, gun no chouOmuri o Isuraeru no ou to shita.
Soko de Omuri wa Isuraeru no hitobito to tomo ni Gibeton kara nobotte Teruza o kakonda.
Jimuri wa sono machi no ochiiru no o mite, ou no kyuuden no tenshu ni hairi, ou no kyuuden ni hi o kakete sono naka de shinda.
Kore wa kare ga okashita tsumi no tame de atte, kare ga Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Yarabeamu no michi ni ayumi, Yarabeamu ga Isuraeru ni okasaseta sono tsumi o okonattakara de aru.
Jimuri no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga kuwadateta inbou wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Sono toki Isuraeru no tami wa futatsu ni wakare, tami no nakaba wa Ginate no ko Tebuni ni shitagatte, kore o ou to shiyou to shi, nakaba wa Omuri ni shitagatta.
Shikashi Omuri ni shitagatta tami wa Ginate no ko Tebuni ni shitagatta tami ni katte, Tebuni wa shini, Omuri ga ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Asa no daisanjuu ichi nen ni Omuri wa Isuraeru no ou to natte juu ni nenyo o osameta. Kare wa Teruza de roku nen ou de atta.
Kare wa gin ni taranto de Semeru kara Samariya no yama o kai, sono ue ni machi o tate, sono tateta machi no na o sono yama no mochinushi de atta Semeru no na ni shitagatte Samariya to yonda.
Omuri wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, kare yori mo saki ni ita subete no mono ni masatte warui koto o shita.
Kare wa Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no subete no michi ni ayumi, Yarabeamu ga Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasase, karera no guuzou o motte Isuraeru no kami, Shu o ikaraseta sono tsumi o okonatta.
Omuri ga itta sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga arawashita kunkou to wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Omuri wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, Samariya ni houmurare, sono ko Ahabu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Asa no daisanjuu hachi nen ni Omuri no ko Ahabu ga Isuraeru no ou to natta. Omuri no ko Ahabu wa Samariya de nijuu ni nen Isuraeru o osameta.
Omuri no ko Ahabu wa kare yori mo saki ni ita subete no mono ni masatte, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Kare wa Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o okonau koto o, karui koto to shi, Shidon bito no ou Etebaaru no musume Izeberu o tsuma ni metori, itte Baaru ni tsukae, kore o oganda.
Kare wa Samariya ni tateta Baaru no miya ni, Baaru no tame ni saidan o kizuita.
Ahabu wa mata Ashira zou o tsukutta. Ahabu wa kare yori mo saki ni ita Isuraeru no subete no ou ni masatte Isuraeru no kami, Shu o ikaraseru koto o okonatta.
Kare no yo ni Beteru bito Hieru wa Eriko o tateta. Kare wa sono motoi o sueru toki ni choushi Abiramu o ushinai, sono mon o tateru toki ni sue no ko Segubu o ushinatta. Shu ga Nun no ko Yoshua ni yotte iwareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Gireade no Teshibe ni sumu Teshibe bito Eriya wa Ahabu ni itta, "Watashi no tsukaete iru Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Watashi no kotoba no nai uchi wa, suunen ame mo tsuyu mo naideshou".
Shu no kotoba ga Eriya ni nozonda,
"Koko o satte higashi ni omomuki, Yorudan no higashi ni aru Kerite kawa no hotori ni mi o kakushi nasai.
Soshite sono kawa no mizu o nomi nasai. Watashi wa karasu ni meijite, soko de anata o yashinawaseyou".
Eriya wa itte, Shu no kotoba no toori ni shita. Sunawachi itte, Yorudan no higashi ni aru Kerite kawa no hotori ni sunda.
Suruto, karasu ga asagoto ni kare no tokoro ni pan to niku o hakobi, mata yuugoto ni pan to niku o hakonde kita. Soshite kare wa sono kawa no mizu o nonda.
Shikashi kuni ni ame ga nakatta no de, shibaraku shite sono kawa wa kareta.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga kare ni nozonde itta,
"Tatte Shidon ni zokusuru Zarepate e itte, soko ni sumi nasai. Watashi wa sono tokoro no yamome onna ni meijite anata o yashinawaseyou".
Soko de kare wa tatte Zarepate e ittaga, machi no mon ni tsuita toki, hitori no yamome onna ga, sono tokoro de takigi o hirotte ita. Kare wa sono onna ni koe o kakete itta, "Utsuwa ni mizu o sukoshi motte kite, watashi ni nomasete kudasai".
Kanojo ga itte, sore o motte koyou to shita toki, kare wa kanojo o yonde itta, "Te ni hitokuchi no pan o motte kite kudasai".
Kanojo wa itta, "Anata no kami, Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Watashi ni wa pan wa arimasen. Tada, kame ni hitonigiri no kona to, bin ni sukoshi no abura ga aru dake desu. Ima watashi wa takigi ni, sanbon o hiroi, uchi e kaette, watashi to kodomo no tame ni sore o chouri shi, sore o tabete shinou to shite iru no desu".
Eriya wa kanojo ni itta, "Osoreru ni wa oyobanai. Itte, anata ga itta toori ni shi nasai. Shikashi mazu, sore de watashi no tame ni chiisai pan o, hitotsu tsukutte motte ki nasai. Sono nochi, anata to, anata no kodomo no tame ni tsukuri nasai.
'Shu ga ame o chi no omote ni furasu hi made, kame no kona wa tsukizu, bin no abura wa taenai' to Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga iwarerukara desu".
Kanojo wa itte, Eriya ga itta toori ni shita. Kanojo to kare oyobi kanojo no kazoku wa hisashiku tabeta.
Shu ga Eriya ni yotte iwareta kotoba no you ni, kame no kona wa tsukizu, bin no abura wa taenakatta.
Korera no koto no nochi, sono ie no shufu de aru kono onna no otokonoko ga byouki ni natta. Sono byouki wa taisou omoku, iki ga taeta no de,
Kanojo wa Eriya ni itta, "Kami no hito yo, anata wa watashi ni, nani no urami ga aru no desu ka. Anata wa watashi no tsumi o omoidasaseru tame, mata watashi no ko o shinaseru tame ni oide ni natta no desu ka".
Eriya wa kanojo ni itta, "Ko o watashi ni yokoshi nasai". Soshite kanojo no futokoro kara kodomo o tori, jibun no iru okujou no heya e kakaete nobori, jibun no shindai ni nekase,
Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Waga kami, Shu yo, anata wa watashi ga yadotte iru ie no yamome ni sae wazawai o kudashite, kodomo o korosareru no desu ka".
Soshite san do sono kotomo no ue ni mi o nobashi, Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Waga kami, Shu yo, kono kodomo no tamashii o moto ni kaerasete kudasai".
Shu wa Eriya no koe o kikiirerareta no de, sono kotomo no tamashii wa moto ni kaette, kare wa ikikaetta.
Eriya wa sono kotomo o totte okujou no heya kara ie no naka ni tsurete furi, sono haha ni watashite itta, "Goran nasai. Anata no ko wa ikikaerimashita".
Onna wa Eriya ni itta, "Ima watashi wa anata ga kami no hito de aru koto to, anata no kuchi ni aru Shu no kotoba ga shinjitsu de aru koto o shirimashita".
Ooku no hi o hete, san nenme ni Shu no kotoba ga Eriya ni nozonda, "Itte, anata no mi o Ahabu ni shimeshi nasai. Watashi wa ame o chi ni furaseru".
Eriya wa sono mi o Ahabu ni shimesou to shite itta. Sono toki, Samariya ni kikin ga hageshikatta.
Ahabu wa ie zukasa Obadeya o meshita. (Obadeya wa fukaku Shu o osoreru hito de,
Izeberu ga Shu no yogensha o tachi horoboshita toki, Obadeya wa hyakunin no yogensha o sukuidashite gojuunin zutsu horaana ni kakushi, pan to mizu o motte karera o yashinatta).
Ahabu wa Obadeya ni itta, "Kunijyuu no subete no mizu no minamoto to, subete no kawa ni itte miru ga yoi. Uma to raba o ikashite oku tame no kusa ga aru ka mo shirenai. Sou sureba, wareware wa kachiku o iku bun de mo ushinawazu ni sumude arou".
Karera wa iki meguru chi o futari de wake, Ahabu wa hitori de kono michi o iki, Obadeya wa hitori de ta no michi o okonatta.
Obadeya ga michi o susunde ita toki, Eriya ga kare ni atta. Kare wa Eriya o mitomete fushite itta, "Waga Shu Eriya yo, anata wa koko ni orareru no desu ka".
Eriya wa kare ni itta, "Sou desu. Itte, anata no shujin ni, Eriya wa koko ni iru to tsuge nasai".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi ni donna tsumi ga atte, anata wa shimobe o Ahabu no te ni watashite korosou to sareru no desu ka.
Anata no kami, Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Watashi no shujin ga anata o tazuneru tame ni, hito o tsukawasanai tami wa naku, kuni mo arimasen. Soshite Eriya wa inai to iu toki wa, sono kuni, sono tami ni, anata ga mitsukaranai to iu chikai o saseru no desu.
Anata wa ima 'Itte, Eriya wa koko ni iru to shujin ni tsugeyo' to iwaremasu.
Shikashi watashi ga anata o hanarete ikuto, Shu no rei wa anata o, watashi no shiranai tokoro e tsurete ikudeshou. Watashi ga itte Ahabu ni tsuge, kare ga anata o mitsukeru koto ga dekinakereba, kare wa watashi o korosudeshou. Shikashi, shimobe wa osanai toki kara Shu o osorete iru mono desu.
Izeberu ga Shu no yogensha o koroshita toki ni, watashi ga shita koto, sunawachi, watashi ga Shu no yogensha no uchi hyakunin o gojuunin zutsu horaana ni kakushite, pan to mizu o motte yashinatta koto o, waga Shu wa kikaremasendeshita ka.
Tokoro ga ima anata wa 'Itte, Eriya wa koko ni iru to shujin ni tsugeyo' to iwaremasu. Sono you na koto o sureba kare wa watashi o korosudeshou".
Eriya wa itta, "Watashi no tsukaeru bangun no Shu wa ikite orareru. Watashi wa kanarazu, kyou, watashi no mi o kare ni shimesude arou".
Obadeya wa itte Ahabu ni ai, kare ni tsugeta no de, Ahabu wa Eriya ni aou to shite itta.
Ahabu wa Eriya o mita toki, kare ni itta, "Isuraeru o nayamasu mono yo, anata wa koko ni iru no desu ka".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Watashi ga Isuraeru o nayamasu no de wa arimasen. Anata to, anata no chichi no ie ga nayamashita no desu. Anata gata ga Shu no meirei o sute, Baaru ni shitagatta tame desu.
Sore de ima, hito o tsukawashite Isuraeru no subete no hito oyobi Baaru no yogensha yonhyaku gojuunin, narabi ni Ashira no yogensha yonhyakunin, Izeberu no shokutaku de shokuji suru monotachi o Karumeruyama ni atsumete, watashi no tokoro ni kosase nasai".
Soko de Ahabu wa Isuraeru no subete no hito ni hito o tsukawashite, yogensha tachi o Karumeruyama ni atsumeta.
Sono toki Eriya wa subete no tami ni chikazuite itta, "Anata gata wa itsu made futatsu no mono no aida ni mayotte iru no desu ka. Shu ga kami naraba sore ni shitagai nasai. Shikashi Baaru ga kami naraba, sore ni shitagai nasai". Tami wa hitokoto mo kare ni kotaenakatta.
Eriya wa tami ni itta, "Watashi wa tada hitori nokotta Shu no yogensha desu. Shikashi Baaru no yogensha wa yonhyaku gojuunin arimasu.
Wareware ni nitou no ushi o kudasai. Soshite ichitou no ushi o karera ni erabase, sore o kirisaite, takigi no ue ni nose, sore ni hi o tsukezu ni okase nasai. Watashi mo ichitou no ushi o totonoe, sore o takigi no ue ni nosete hi o tsukezu ni okimashou.
Kou shite anata gata wa anata gata no kami no na o yobi nasai. Watashi wa Shu no na o yobimashou. Soshite hi o motte kotaeru kami o kami to shimashou". Tami wa mina kotaete "Sore ga yokarou" to itta.
Soko de Eriya wa Baaru no yogensha tachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa daizei dakara hajime ni ichitou no ushi o erande, sore o totonoe, anata gata no kami no na o yobi nasai. Tadashi hi o tsukete wa narimasen".
Karera wa ataerareta ushi o totte totonoe, asa kara hiru made Baaru no na o yonde "Baaru yo, kotaete kudasai" to itta. Shikashi nan no koe mo naku, mata kotaeru mono mo nakatta no de, karera wa jibuntachi no tsukutta saidan no mawari ni odotta.
Hiru ni natte Eriya wa karera o azakette itta, "Kare wa kami dakara, oogoe o agete yobi nasai. Kare wa kangae ni fukette iru no ka, yoso e itta no ka, tabi ni deta no ka, mata wa nemutte ite okosarenakereba naranai no ka".
Soko de karera wa oogoe ni yobawari, karera no narawashi ni shitagatte, katana to yaride mi o kizutsuke, chi o sono mi ni nagasu ni itatta.
Kou shite hiru ga sugite mo karera wa nao sakebi tsuzukete, yuu no sonaemono o sasageru toki ni made oyonda. Shikashi nan no koe mo naku, kotaeru mono mo naku, mata kaerimiru mono mo nakatta.
Sono toki Eriya wa subete no tami ni mukatte "Watashi ni chikayori nasai" to itta no de, tami wa mina kare ni chikayotta. Kare wa kowarete iru Shu no saidan o tsukurotta.
Soshite Eriya wa mukashi, Shu no kotoba ga Yakobu ni nozonde, "Isuraeru o anata no na to seyo" to iwareta Yakobu no kora no buzoku no kazu ni shitagatte juu ni no ishi o tori,
Sono ishi de Shu no na ni yotte saidan o kizuki, saidan no shuui ni tane ni Seya o ireru hodo no ookisa no, mizo o tsukutta.
Mata, takigi o narabe, ushi o kirisaite takigi no ue ni nosete itta, "Yontsu no kame ni mizu o mitashi, sore o hansai to takigi no ue ni sosoge".
Mata itta, "Sore o ni do seyo". Ni do sore o suruto, mata itta, "San do sore o seyo". San do sore o shita.
Mizu wa saidan no shuui ni nagareta. Mata mizo ni mo mizu o mitashita.
Yuu no sonaemono o sasageru toki ni natte, yogensha Eriya wa chikayotte itta, "Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu no kami, Shu yo, Isuraeru de wa, anata ga kami de aru koto, watashi ga anata no shimobe de atte, anata no kotoba ni shitagatte kono subete no koto o okonatta koto o, konnichi shirasete kudasai.
Shu yo, watashi ni kotaete kudasai, watashi ni kotaete kudasai. Shu yo, kono tami ni anata ga kami de aru koto, mata anata ga karera no kokoro o hirugaesareta no de aru koto o shirasete kudasai".
Sono toki Shu no hi ga kudatte hansai to, takigi to, ishi to, chiri to o yakitsukushi, mata mizo no mizu o name tsukushita.
Tami wa mina mite, hirefushite itta, "Shu ga kami de aru. Shu ga kami de aru".
Eriya wa karera ni itta, "Baaru no yogensha o torae yo. Sono hitori mo nigashite wa naranai". Soko de karera o toraeta no de, Eriya wa karera o Kishon kawa ni tsure kudatte, soko de karera o koroshita.
Eriya wa Ahabu ni itta, "Ooame no oto ga surukara, nobotte itte, kui nomi shi nasai".
Ahabu wa kui nomi suru tame ni nobotte itta. Shikashi Eriya wa Karumeru no itadaki ni nobori, chi ni fushite kao o hiza no aida ni irete itaga,
Kare wa shimobe ni itta, "Nobotte itte umi no hou o mi nasai". Kare wa nobotte itte, mite, "Nani mo arimasen" to itta no de, Eriya wa "Mou ichi do iki nasai" to itte nana do ni oyonda.
Nana dome ni shimobe wa itta, "Umi kara hito no te hodo no chiisana kumo ga tatte imasu". Eriya wa itta, "Nobotte itte, 'Ame ni todomerarenai you ni kuruma o totonoete kudare' to Ahabu ni ii nasai".
Suruto ma mo naku, kumo to kaze ga okori, sora ga kuroku natte ooame ga futte kita. Ahabu wa kuruma ni notte Ezureru e itta.
Mata Shu no te ga Eriya ni nozonda no de, kare wa koshi o karage, Ezureru no iriguchi made Ahabu no mae ni hashitte itta.
Ahabu wa Eriya no shita subete no koto, mata kare ga subete no yogensha o katana de koroshita koto o Izeberu ni tsugeta no de,
Izeberu wa shisha o Eriya ni tsukawashite itta, "Moshi watashi ga, asu no imagoro, anata no inochi o ano hitobito no hitori no inochi no you ni shite inainaraba, kamigami ga donna nide mo, watashi o basshite kudasaru you ni".
Soko de Eriya wa osorete, jibun no inochi o sukuu tame ni tatte nige, Yuda ni zokusuru Beerushiba e itte, shimobe o soko ni nokoshi,
Jibun wa tsuitachi no michinori hodo arano ni haitte itte, redama no ki no shita ni zashi, jibun no shi o motomete itta, "Shu yo, mohaya, juubun desu. Ima watashi no inochi o totte kudasai. Watashi wa senzo ni masaru mono de wa arimasen".
Kare wa redama no ki no shita ni fushite nemuttaga, ten no tsukai ga kare ni sawari, "Okite tabe nasai" to itta no de,
Okite miruto, tou no soba ni, yakeishi no ue de yaita pan ichiko to, ichi bin no mizu ga atta. Kare wa tabe, katsu nonde mata neta.
Shu no tsukai wa futatabi kite, kare ni sawatte itta, "Okite tabe nasai. Michi ga tookute taerarenaideshoukara".
Kare wa okite tabe, katsu nomi, sono shokumotsu de chikara zuite yonjuu nichi yonjuu yai tte, kami no yama Horebu ni tsuita.
Sono tokoro de kare wa horaana ni haitte, soko ni yadottaga, Shu no kotoba ga kare ni nozonde, kare ni iwareta, "Eriya yo, anata wa koko de nani o shite iru no ka".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa bangun no kami, Shu no tame ni hijou ni nesshin de arimashita. Isuraeru no hitobito wa anata no keiyaku o sute, anata no saidan o kowashi, katana o motte anata no yogensha tachi o koroshita no desu. Tada watashi dake nokorimashitaga, karera wa watashi no inochi o torou to shite imasu".
Shu wa iwareta, "Dete, yama no ue de Shu no mae ni, tachi nasai". Sono toki Shu wa toorisugirare, Shu no mae ni ookina tsuyoi kaze ga fuki, yama o saki, iwa o kudaita. Shikashi Shu wa kaze no naka ni orarenakatta. Kaze no nochi ni jishin ga attaga, jishin no naka ni mo Shu wa orarenakatta.
Jishin no nochi ni hi ga attaga, hi no naka ni mo Shu wa orarenakatta. Hi no nochi ni shizuka na hosoi koe ga kikoeta.
Eriya wa sore o kiite kao o gaitou ni tsutsumi, dete horaana no kuchi ni tatsuto, kare ni kataru koe ga kikoeta, "Eriya yo, anata wa koko de nani o shite iru no ka".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa bangun no kami, Shu no tame ni hijou ni nesshin de arimashita. Isuraeru no hitobito wa anata no keiyaku o sute, anata no saidan o kowashi, katana de anata no yogensha tachi o koroshitakara desu. Tada watashi dake nokorimashitaga, karera wa watashi no inochi o torou to shite imasu".
Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata no michi o kaette itte, Damasuko no arano ni omomuki, Damasuko ni tsuite, Hazaeru ni abura o sosogi, Suriya no ou to shi nasai.
Mata Nimushi no ko Ehiu ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to shi nasai. Mata Aberumehora no Shapate no ko Erisha ni abura o sosoide, anata ni kawatte yogensha to shi nasai.
Hazaeru no tsurugi o nogareru mono o Ehiu ga koroshi, Ehiu no tsurugi o nogareru mono o Erisha ga korosude arou.
Mata, watashi wa Isuraeru no uchi ni nanasennin o nokosude arou. Mina Baaru ni hiza o kagamezu, sore ni kuchizuke shinai mono de aru".
Sate Eriya wa soko o satte itte, Shapate no ko Erisha ni atta. Kare wa juu ni kubiki no ushi o mae ni ikase, jibun wa juu ni banme no kubiki to tomo ni ite tagayashite ita. Eriya wa kare no katawara o toorisugite gaitou o kare no ue ni kaketa.
Erisha wa ushi o sute, Eriya no ato ni hashitte kite itta, "Watashi no fubo ni kuchizuke sasete kudasai. Soshite nochi anata ni shitagaimashou". Eriya wa kare ni itta, "Itte ki nasai. Watashi wa anata ni nani o shimashita ka".
Erisha wa kare o hanarete kaeri, hito kubiki no ushi o totte koroshi, ushi no kubiki o moyashite sono niku o ni, sore o tami ni ataete tabesase, tatte itte Eriya ni shitagai, kare ni tsukaeta.
Suriya no ou Benehadade wa sono gunzei o kotogotoku atsumeta. Sanjuu ninin no ou ga kare to tomo ni ori, mata uma to sensha mo atta. Kare wa nobotte Samariya o kakomi, kore o semeta.
Mata kare wa machi ni shisha o tsukawashi, Isuraeru no ou Ahabu ni itta, "Benehadade wa kou moushimasu,
'Anata no kingin wa watashi no mono, mata anata no tsumatachi to kodomotachi no mottomo utsukushii mono mo watashi no mono desu' ".
Isuraeru no ou wa kotaeta, "Ou, waga Shu yo, oose no toori, watashi to, watashi no mochimono wa mina anata no mono desu".
Shisha wa futatabi kite itta, "Benehadade wa kou moushimasu, 'Watashi wa saki ni hito o tsukawashite, anata no kingin, saishi o hikiwatase to iimashita.
Shikashi, asu no imagoro, shimobetachi o anata ni tsukawashimasu. Karera wa anata no ie to, anata no kerai no ie o sagutte, subete karera no ki ni iru mono o te ni irete ubaisarudeshou' ".
Soko de Isuraeru no ou wa kuni no chourou o kotogotoku meshite itta, "Yoku chuui shite, kono hito ga muri na koto o motomete iru no o shiri nasai. Kare wa hito o tsukawashite, watashi no saishi to kingin o motometaga, watashi wa sore o kobamanakatta".
Subete no chourou oyobi tami wa mina kare ni itta, "Kiite wa narimasen. Shoudaku shite wa narimasen".
Sore de kare wa Benehadade no shisha ni itta, "Ou, waga Shu ni tsuge nasai. 'Anata ga hajime ni youkyuu sareta koto wa mina itashimashou. Shikashi kondo no koto wa dekimasen' ". Shisha wa satte fukumei shita.
Benehadade wa kare ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "MoshiSamariya no chiri ga, watashi ni shitagau subete no tami no te o mitasu ni tarirunaraba, kamigami ga donna nide mo, watashi o basshite kudasaru you ni".
Isuraeru no ou wa kotaeta, " 'Bugu o obiru mono wa, sore o nugu mono no you ni hokotte wa naranai' to tsuge nasai".
Benehadade wa kari goya de, outachi to sake o nonde itaga, kono koto o kiite, sono keraitachi ni itta, "Tatakai no sonae o seyo". Karera wa machi ni mukatte tatakai no sonae o shita.
Kono toki hitori no yogensha ga Isuraeru no ou Ahabu no moto ni kite itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata wa kono taigun o mita ka. Watashi wa kyou, kore o anata no te ni watasu. Anata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o, shiru you ni narude arou' ".
Ahabu wa itta, "Dare ni sasemashou ka". Kare wa itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Chihou no daikan no keraitachi ni sase yo' ". Ahabu wa itta, "Dare ga tatakai o hajimemashou ka". Kare wa kotaeta, "Anata desu".
Soko de Ahabu wa chihou no daikan no keraitachi o shirabeta tokoro nihyaku sanjuu ninin atta. Tsugi ni subete no tami, sunawachi Isuraeru no subete no hito o shirabeta tokoro nanasennin atta.
Karera wa hirugoro dete ittaga, Benehadade wa kari goya de, mikata no sanjuu ninin no outachi to tomo ni sake o nonde yotte ita.
Chihou no daikan no keraitachi ga saki ni dete itta. Benehadade wa sekkou o tsukawashitaga, karera wa "Samariya kara hitobito ga dete kita" to houkoku shita no de,
Kare wa itta, "Wakai no tame ni dete kita no de atte mo, ikedori ni seyo. Mata tatakai no tame ni dete kita no de atte mo, ikedori ni seyo".
Chihou no daikan no keraitachi to, sore ni shitagau gunzei ga machi kara dete itte,
Onoono sono aite o uchikoroshita no de, Suriya bi to wa nigeta. Isuraeru wa kore o ottaga, Suriya no ou Benehadade wa uma ni nori, kihei o shitagaete nogareta.
Isuraeru no ou wa dete itte, uma to sensha o bundori, mata ooini Suriya bito o uchikoroshita.
Toki ni, kano yogensha ga Isuraeru no ou no moto ni kite itta, "Itte, chikara o yashinai, nasubeki koto o yoku kangae nasai. Rainen no haru ni wa Suriya no ou ga, anata no tokoro ni semenobotte kurukara desu".
Suriya no ou no keraitachi wa ou ni itta, "Karera no kamigami wa yamanokami desukara karera ga wareware yori mo tsuyokatta no desu. Moshi wareware ga heichi de tatakaunaraba, kanarazu karera yori mo tsuyoideshou.
Sore de kou shi nasai. Outachi o onoono sono chii kara shirizokase, soutoku o oite sore ni kawarase nasai.
Mata anata ga ushinatta gunzei ni hitoshii gunzei o atsume, uma wa uma, sensha wa sensha o motte oginai nasai. Kou shite wareware ga heichi de tatakaunaraba kanarazu karera yori mo tsuyoideshou". Kare wa sono kotoba o kikiirete, sono you ni shita.
Haru ni natte, Benehadade wa Suriya bito o atsumete, Isuraeru to tatakau tame ni, Apeku ni nobotte kita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa shoushuu sare, ryoushoku o ukete karera o mukaeutsu tame ni dekaketa. Isuraeru no hitobito wa yagi no futatsu no chiisai mure no you ni karera no mae ni jindottaga, Suriya bi to wa sono chi ni michite ita.
Sono toki kami no hito ga kite, Isuraeru no ou ni itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Suriya bito ga, Shu wa yamanokami de atte, tani no kami de wa nai to itte irukara, watashi wa kono subete no taigun o anata no te ni watasu. Anata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni narude arou' ".
Karera wa nanuka no aida, tagai ni mukaiatte jindori, nanuka me ni natte tatakai o majietaga, Isuraeru no hitobito wa tsuitachi ni Suriya bito no hohei juu mannin o koroshita.
Sono hoka no mono wa Apeku no machi ni nige kon daga, jouheki ga kuzurete, sono nokotta ni man nanasennin no ue ni taoreta. Benehadade wa nigete machi ni hairi, oku no aida ni haitta.
Keraitachi wa kare ni itta, "Isuraeru no ie no outachi wa awaremi fukai ou de aru to kiite imasu. Sore de wareware no koshi ni aranuno o tsuke, kubi ni nawa o kakete, Isuraeru no ou no tokoro e ikasete kudasai. Tabun kare wa anata no inochi o tasukerudeshou".
Soko de karera wa aranuno o koshi ni maki, nawa o kubi ni kakete Isuraeru no ou no tokoro e itte itta, "Anata no shimobe Benehadade ga 'Douzo, watashi no inochi o tasukete kudasai' to moushite imasu". Ahabu wa itta, "Kare wa mada ikite iru no desu ka. Kare wa watashi no kyoudai desu".
Sono hitobito wa kore o kitchou to shite sumiyaka ni kare no kotoba o uke, "Sou desu. Benehadade wa anata no kyoudai desu" to itta no de, kare wa itta, "Itte kare o tsurete ki nasai". Sore de Benehadade wa kare no tokoro ni dete kita no de, kare wa kore o jibun no kuruma ni noseta.
Benehadade wa kare ni itta, "Watashi no chichi ga, anata no chichiue kara totta machimachi wa kaeshimasu. Mata watashi no chichi ga Samariya ni tsukutta you ni, anata wa Damasuko ni, anata no tame ni shijou o mouke nasai". Ahabu wa itta, "Watashi wa kono keiyaku o motte anata o kaerasemashou". Kou shite Ahabu wa kare to keiyaku o musubi, kare o kaeraseta.
Sate yogensha no tomo gara no hitori ga Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte sono nakama ni itta, "Douzo, watashi o utte kudasai". Shikashi sono hito wa utsu koto o kobanda no de,
Kare wa sono hito ni itta, "Anata wa Shu no kotoba ni kikishitagawanai yue, watashi o hanarete ikuto sugu, shishi ga anata o korosudeshou". Sono hito ga kare no soba o hanarete ikuto sugu, shishi ga kare ni atte kare o koroshita.
Kare wa mata hoka no hito ni atte itta, "Douzo, watashi o utte kudasai". Suruto sono hito wa kare o uchi, utte kizutsuketa.
Kou shite sono yogensha wa itte, michi no katawara de ou o machi, me ni houtai o atete sugata o kaete ita.
Ou ga toorisugiru toki, ou ni yobawatte itta, "Shimobe wa ikusa no naka ni dete ikimashitaga, aru gunjin ga, hitori no hito o watashi no tokoro ni tsurete kite iimashita, 'Kono hito o mamotte i nasai. Moshi kare ga inaku nareba, anata no inochi o kare no inochi ni kaeru ka, mata wa gin ichi taranto o harawanakereba naranai'.
Tokoro ga, shimobe wa achirakochira to isogashiku shite ita no de, tsuini kare wa inaku narimashita". Isuraeru no ou wa kare ni itta, "Anata wa sono toori ni sabakarenakereba naranai. Anata ga jibun de sore o sadameta no desu".
Soko de kare ga isoide me no houtai o torinozoita no de, Isuraeru no ou wa sore ga yogensha no hitori de aru koto o shitta.
Kare wa ou ni itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi ga horobosou to sadameta hito o, anata wa jibun no te kara hanashite ikaseta no de, anata no inochi wa kare no inochi ni kawari, anata no tami wa kare no tami ni kawarude arou' to".
Isuraeru no ou wa kanashimi, katsu ikatte jibun no ie ni omomuki, Samariya ni kaetta.
Sate Ezureru bito Nabote wa Ezureru ni budou hatake o motte itaga, Samariya no ou Ahabu no kyuuden no katawara ni atta no de,
Ahabu wa Nabote ni itta, "Anata no budou hatake wa watashi no ie no chikaku ni aru no de, watashi ni yuzutte aomono hatake ni sasete kudasai. Sono kawari, watashi wa sore yori mo yoi budou hatake o anata ni agemashou. Moshi onozominaraba, sono atai o kin de sashiagemashou".
Nabote wa Ahabu ni itta, "Watashi wa senzo no shigyou o anata ni yuzuru koto o danjite itashimasen".
Ahabu wa Ezureru bito Nabote ga itta kotoba o kiite, kanashimi, katsu ikatte ie ni haitta. Nabote ga "Watashi wa senzo no shigyou o anata ni yuzurimasen" to ittakara de aru. Ahabu wa toko ni fushi, kao o somukete shokuji o shinakatta.
Tsuma Izeberu wa kare no tokoro ni kite, itta, "Anata wa nani o sonna ni kanashinde, shokuji o nasaranai no desu ka".
Kare wa kanojo ni itta, "Watashi wa Ezureru bito Nabote ni 'Anata no budou hatake o kane de yuzutte kudasai. Moshi nozomunaraba, sono kawari ni, hoka no budou hatake o ageyou' to ittaga, kare wa kotaete 'Watashi wa budou hatake o yuzurimasen' to ittakara da".
Tsuma Izeberu wa kare ni itta, "Anata ga ima Isuraeru o osamete iru no desu ka. Okite shokuji o shi, genki o dashite kudasai. Watashi ga Ezureru bito Nabote no budou hatake o anata ni agemasu".
Kanojo wa Ahabu no na de tegami o kaki, kare no shirushi o oshite, Nabote to onaji you ni, sono machi ni sunde iru chouroutachi to mibun no tattoi hitobito ni, sono tegami o okutta.
Kanojo wa sono tegami ni kakishirushita, "Danjiki o fukoku shite, Nabote o tami no uchi no takai tokoro ni suwarase,
Mata futari no yokoshima na mono o kare no mae ni suwarase, soshite kare o uttaete, 'Anata wa kami to ou to o norotta' to iwase nasai. Kou shite kare o hikidashi, ishi de uchikoroshi nasai".
Sono machi no hitobito, sunawachi, sono machi ni sunde iru chouroutachi oyobi mibun no tattoi hitobito wa, Izeberu ga ii tsukawashita you ni shita. Kanojo ga karera ni okutta tegami ni kakishirusarete ita you ni,
Karera wa danjiki o fukoku shite, Nabote o tami no uchi no takai tokoro ni suwaraseta.
Soshite futari no yokoshima na mono ga haitte kite, sono mae ni suwari, sono yokoshima na monotachi ga tami no mae de Nabote o uttaete, "Nabote wa kami to ou to o norotta" to itta. Soko de hitobito wa kare o machi no soto ni hikidashi, ishi de uchikoroshita.
Soshite hitobito wa Izeberu ni "Nabote wa ishi de uchikorosareta" to iiokutta.
Izeberu wa Nabote ga ishi de uchikorosareta no o kikuto sugu, Ahabu ni itta, "Tatte, ano Ezureru bito Nabote ga, anata ni kane de yuzuru koto o kobanda budou hatake o tori nasai. Nabote wa ikite imasen. Shinda no desu".
Ahabu wa Nabote no shinda no o kikuto sugu, tatte, Ezureru bito Nabote no budou hatake o toru tame ni, soko e kudatte itta.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Teshibe bito Eriya ni nozonda,
"Tatte, kudatte iki, Samariya ni iru Isuraeru no ou Ahabu ni ai nasai. Kare wa Nabote no budou hatake o torou to shite soko e kudatte iru.
Anata wa kare ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata wa koroshita no ka, mata totta no ka' to. Mata kare ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, inu ga Nabote no chi o nameta basho de, inu ga anata no chi o namerude arou' ".
Ahabu wa Eriya ni itta, "Waga teki yo, tsuini, watashi o mitsuketa no ka". Kare wa itta, "Mitsukemashita. Anata ga Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonau koto ni mi o yudaneta yue,
Watashi wa anata ni wazawai o kudashi, anata o mattaku horoboshi, Ahabu ni zokusuru otoko wa, Isuraeru ni ite tsunagareta mono mo, jiyuu na mono mo kotogotoku tachi,
Mata anata no ie o Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no ie no you ni shi, Ahiya no ko Baasha no ie no you ni surudeshou. Kore wa anata ga watashi o ikaraseta ikari no yue, mata Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta yue desu.
Izeberu ni tsuite, Shu wa mata iwaremashita, 'Inu ga Ezureru no chiiki de Izeberu o kuude arou' to.
Ahabu ni zokusuru mono wa, machi de shinu mono o inu ga kui, no de shinu mono o sora no tori ga kuudeshou".
Ahabu no you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonau koto ni mi o yudaneta mono wa nakatta. Sono tsuma Izeberu ga kare o sosonokashita no de aru.
Kare wa Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta Amori bito ga shita you ni guuzou ni shitagatte, hanahada nikumubeki koto o okonatta.
Ahabu wa korera no kotoba o kiita toki, koromo o saki, aranuno o mi ni matoi, shoku o tachi, aranuno ni fushi, uchishiorete aruita.
Kono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Teshibe bito Eriya ni nozonda,
"Ahabu ga watashi no mae ni herikudatte iru no o mita ka. Kare ga watashi no mae ni herikudatte iru yue, watashi wa anoyo ni wa wazawai o kudasanai. Sono ko no yo ni wazawai o sono ie ni kudasude arou".
Suriya to Isuraeru no aida ni sensou ga nakute san nen o heta.
Shikashi san nenme ni Yuda no ou Yoshapate ga Isuraeru no ou no tokoro e kudatte itta no de,
Isuraeru no ou wa sono keraitachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa, ramote gireade ga wareware no shoyuu de aru koto o shitte imasu ka. Shikamo nao wareware wa Suriya no ou no te kara sore o torazu ni damatte iru no desu".
Kare wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Ramote gireade de tatakau tame ni watashi to issho ni ikaremasen ka". Yoshapate wa Isuraeru no ou ni itta, "Watashi wa anata to hitotsu desu. Watashi no tami wa anata no tami to hitotsu desu. Watashi no uma wa anata no uma to hitotsu desu".
Yoshapate wa mata Isuraeru no ou ni itta, "Mazu, Shu no kotoba o ukagai nasai".
Soko de Isuraeru no ou wa yogensha yonhyakunin bakari o atsumete, karera ni itta, "Watashi wa ramote gireade ni tatakai ni ikubekideshou ka, aruiha hikaerubekideshou ka". Karera wa itta, "Nobotte iki nasai. Shu wa sore o ou no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Yoshapate wa itta, "Koko ni wa, wareware no toubeki Shu no yogensha ga hoka ni imasen ka".
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Wareware ga Shu ni tou koto no dekiru hito ga, mada hitori imasu. Imura no ko Mikaya desu. Kare wa watashi ni tsuite yoi koto o yogen sezu, tada warui koto dake o yogen suru no de, watashi wa kare o nikunde imasu". Yoshapate wa itta, "Ou yo, sou iwanaide kudasai".
Soko de Isuraeru no ou wa yakunin o yonde, "Isoide Imura no ko Mikaya o tsurete ki nasai" to itta.
Sate Isuraeru no ou oyobi Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa ou no fuku o kite, Samariya no mon no iriguchi no hiroba ni, onoono sono ouza ni suwari, yogensha tachi wa mina sono mae de yogen shite ita.
Kenaana no ko Zedekiya wa tetsu no tsuno o tsukutte itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anata wa korera no tsuno o motte Suriya bito o tsuite karera o horoboshi nasai' ".
Yogensha tachi wa mina sono you ni yogen shite itta, "Ramote gireade ni nobotte itte shouri o e nasai. Shu wa sore o ou no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Sate Mikaya o yobi ni itta shisha wa kare ni itta, "Yogensha tachi wa itchi shite ou ni yoi koto o iimashita. Douzo, anata mo, karera no hitori no kotoba no you ni shite, yoi koto o itte kudasai".
Mikaya wa itta, "Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Shu ga watashi ni iwareru koto o moushimashou".
Kare ga ou no tokoro e ikuto, ou wa kare ni itta, "Mikaya yo, wareware wa ramote gireade ni tatakai ni ikubekideshou ka, aruiha hikaerubekideshou ka". Kare wa ou ni itta, "Nobotte itte shouri o e nasai. Shu wa sore o ou no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Shikashi ou wa kare ni itta, "Iku tabi anata o chikawasetara, anata wa Shu no na o motte, tada shinjitsu nomi o watashi ni tsugerudeshou ka".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru ga mina, bokusha no nai hitsuji no you ni, yama ni chitte iru no o mimashita. Suru to Shu wa 'Korera no mono wa kainushi ga inai. Karera o sorezore yasuraka ni, sono ie ni kaerase yo' to iwaremashita".
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Kare ga watashi ni tsuite yoi koto o yogen sezu, tada warui koto dake o yogen suruto, anata ni tsugeta de wa arimasen ka".
Mikaya wa itta, "Sore yue Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Watashi wa Shu ga sono gyokuza ni suwari, ten no bangun ga sono katawara ni, migihidari ni tatte iru no o mitaga,
Shu wa 'Dare ga Ahabu o izanatte ramote gireade ni noborase, kare o taoresaserude arou ka' to iwaremashita. Suruto hitori wa kono koto o ii, hitori wa hoka no koto o iimashita.
Sono toki hitotsu no rei ga susumidete, Shu no mae ni tachi, 'Watashi ga kare o izanaimashou' to iimashita.
Shu wa 'Dono you na houhou de suru no ka' to iwareta no de, kare wa 'Watashi ga dete itte, itsuwari o iu rei to natte, subete no yogensha no kuchi ni yadorimashou' to iimashita. Soko de Shu wa 'Omae wa kare o izanatte, sore o nashitogerude arou. Dete itte, sou shi nasai' to iwaremashita.
Sore de Shu wa itsuwari o iu rei o anata no subete no yogensha no kuchi ni ire, mata Shu wa anata no mi ni okoru wazawai o tsugerareta no desu".
Suruto Kenaana no ko Zedekiya wa chikayotte, Mikaya no hoo o utte itta, "Dono you ni shite Shu no rei ga watashi o hanarete, anata ni katarimashita ka".
Mikaya wa itta, "Anata ga oku no aida ni haitte mi o kakusu sono hi ni, wakarudeshou".
Isuraeru no ou wa itta, "Mikaya o torae, machi no tsukasa Amon to, ou no ko Yoashi no tokoro e hiite kaette,
Ii nasai, 'Ou ga kou iimasu, kono mono o gokuya ni ire, wazuka no pan to mizu o motte kare o yashinai, watashi ga shouri o ete kaette kuru no o mate' ".
Mikaya wa itta, "Moshi anata ga shouri o ete kaette korarerunaraba, Shu ga watashi ni yotte katararenakatta no desu". Mata kare wa itta, "Anata gata, subete no tami yo, kiki nasai".
Kou shite Isuraeru no ou to Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa ramote gireade ni nobotte itta.
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Watashi wa sugata o kaete, tatakai ni ikimasu. Anata wa ou no fuku o tsuke nasai". Isuraeru no ou wa sugata o kaete tatakai ni itta.
Sate, Suriya no ou wa, sono senshachou sanjuu ninin ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa, chiisai monotomo ookii mono to mo tatakawanaide, tada Isuraeru no ou to dake tatakai nasai".
Senshachoura wa Yoshapate o mita toki, kore wa kitto Isuraeru no ou da to omotta no de, mi o megurashite, kore to tatakaou to suruto, Yoshapate wa yobawatta.
Senshachoura wa kare ga Isuraeru no ou de nai no o mita no de, kare o ou koto o yamete hikikaeshita.
Shikashi, hitori no hito ga nani kokoronaku yumi o hiite, Isuraeru no ou no muneate to kusazuri no aida o ita no de, kare wa sono sensha no gyosha ni itta, "Watashi wa kizu o uketa. Sensha o megurashite, watashi o senjou kara hakobidase".
Sono hi tatakai wa hageshiku natta. Ou wa sensha no naka ni sasaerarete tachi, Suriya bito ni mukatte itaga, tsuini, yuugure ni natte shinda. Kizu no chi wa sensha no soko ni nagareta.
Hi no bossuru koro, gunzei no naka ni yobawaru koe ga shita, "Meimei sono machi e, meimei sono kuni e kaere".
Ou wa shinde, Samariya e tazusae ikareta. Hitobito wa ou o Samariya ni houmutta.
Mata sono sensha o Samariya no ike de arattaga, inu ga sono chi o nameta. Mata yuujo ga soko de mi o aratta. Shu ga iwareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Ahabu no sono hoka no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto to, sono tateta zouge no ie to, sono tateta subete no machi wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Kou shite Ahabu wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, sono ko Ahajiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Asa no ko Yoshapate wa Isuraeru no ou Ahabu no daiyon nen ni Yuda no ou to natta.
Yoshapate wa ou to natta toki, sanjuu gosai de attaga, Erusaremu de nijuu go nenyo o osameta. Sono haha no na wa Azuba to ii, Shiruhi no musume de atta.
Yoshapate wa chichi Asa no subete no michi ni ayumi, sore o hanareru koto naku, Shu no me ni kanau koto o shita. Tadashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta no de, tami wa nao takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Yoshapate wa mata Isuraeru no ou to, yoshimi o musunda.
Yoshapate no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga arawashita kunkou oyobi sono sensou ni tsuite wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Kare wa chichi Asa no yo ni nao nokotte ita shinden danshoutachi o kuni no uchi kara oiharatta.
Sono koro Edomu ni wa ou ga naku, daikan ga ou de atta.
Yoshapate wa Tarushishi no fune o tsukutte, kin o eru tame ni Ofuru ni ikaseyou to shitaga, sono fune wa ejion geberu de nanpa shita tame, tsuini ikanakatta.
Soko de Ahabu no ko Ahajiya wa Yoshapate ni "Watashi no kerai o anata no kerai to issho ni fune de ikase nasai" to ittaga, Yoshapate wa shouchi shinakatta.
Yoshapate wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutte, chichi Dabide no machi ni senzo to tomo ni houmurare, sono ko Yoramu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Ahabu no ko Ahajiya wa Yuda no ou Yoshapate no daijuu nana nen ni Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, ni nen Isuraeru o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, sono chichi no michi to, sono haha no michi, oyobi kano Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no michi ni ayumi,
Baaru ni tsukaete, sore o ogami, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o ikaraseta. Subete kare no chichi ga shita toori de atta.
Ahabu ga shinda nochi, Moabu wa Isuraeru ni somuita.
Sate Ahajiya wa Samariya ni aru takadono no rankan kara ochite byouki ni natta no de, shisha o tsukawashi, "Itte Ekuron no kami baaru zebubu ni, kono byouki ga naoru ka dou ka o tazune yo" to meijita.
Toki ni, Shu no tsukai wa Teshibe bito Eriya ni itta, "Tatte, nobotte iki, Samariya no ou no shisha ni atte ii nasai, 'Anata gata ga Ekuron no kami baaru zebubu ni tazuneyou to shite iku no wa, Isuraeru ni kami ga nai tame ka'.
Sore yue Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata wa, nobotta shindai kara oriru koto naku, kanarazu shinude arou' ". Soko de Eriya wa nobotte itta.
Shishatachi ga Ahajiya no moto ni kaette kita no de, Ahajiya wa karera ni itta, "Naze kaette kita no ka".
Karera wa itta, "Hitori no hito ga nobotte kite, wareware ni atte iimashita, 'Omaetachi o tsukawashita ou no tokoro e kaette ii nasai. Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata ga Ekuron no kami baaru zebubu ni tazuneyou to shite hito o tsukawasu no wa, Isuraeru ni kami ga nai tame na no ka. Sore yue anata wa, nobotta shindai kara oriru koto naku, kanarazu shinude arou' ".
Ahajiya wa karera ni itta, "Nobotte kite, anata gata ni atte, korera no koto o tsugeta hito wa donna hito de atta ka".
Karera wa kotaeta, "Sono hito wa kegoromo o kite, koshi ni kawa no obi o shimete imashita". Kare wa itta, "Sono hito wa Teshi be bito Eriya da".
Soko de ou wa gojuunin no chou o, buka no gojuunin to tomo ni Eriya no tokoro e tsukawashita. Kare ga Eriya no tokoro e nobotte ikuto, Eriya wa yama no itadaki ni suwatte ita no de, Eriya ni itta, "Kami no hito yo, ou ga anata ni, kudatte kuru you ni to iwaremasu".
Shikashi Eriya wa gojuunin no chou ni kotaeta, "Watashi ga moshi kami no hito de arunaraba, hi ga ten kara kudatte, anata to buka no gojuunin to o yaki tsukusudeshou". Sono you ni hi ga ten kara kudatte, kare to buka no gojuunin to o yaki tsukushita.
Ou wa mata ta no gojuunin no chou o, buka no gojuunin to tomo ni Eriya ni tsukawashita. Kare wa nobotte itte Eriya ni itta, "Kami no hito yo, ou ga kou meijiraremasu, 'Sumiyaka ni kudatte ki nasai' ".
Shikashi Eriya wa karera ni kotaeta, "Watashi ga moshi kami no hito de arunaraba, hi ga ten kara kudatte, anata to buka no gojuunin to o yaki tsukusudeshou". Sono you ni kami no hi ga ten kara kudatte, kare to buka no gojuunin to o yaki tsukushita.
Ou wa mata daisan no gojuunin no chou o buka no gojuunin to tomo ni tsukawashita. Daisan no gojuunin no chou wa nobotte itte, Eriya no mae ni hizamazuki, kare ni negatte itta, "Kami no hito yo, douzo, watashi no inochi to, anata no shimobe de aru kono gojuunin no inochi o anata no me ni tattoi mono to minashite kudasai.
Goran nasai, hi ga ten kara kudatte, saki no gojuunin no chou futari to, sono buka no gojuunin zutsu to o yaki tsukushimashita. Shikashi ima watashi no inochi o anata no me ni tattoi mono to minashite kudasai".
Sono toki, Shu no tsukai wa Eriya ni itta, "Kare to tomo ni kudari nasai. Kare o osorete wa naranai". Soko de Eriya wa tatte, kare to tomo ni kudari, ou no moto e itte,
Ou ni itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anata wa Ekuron no kami baaru zebubu ni tazuneyou to shisha o tsukawashitaga, sore wa Isuraeru ni, sono kotoba o motomubeki kami ga nai tame de aru ka. Sore yue anata wa, nobotta shindai kara oriru koto naku, kanarazu shinude arou' ".
Kare wa Eriya ga itta Shu no kotoba no toori ni shindaga, kare ni ko ga nakatta no de, sono kyoudai Yoramu ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta. Kore wa Yuda no ou Yoshapate no ko Yoramu no daini nen de aru.
Ahajiya no sono ta no jiseki wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Shu ga tsumujikaze o motte Eriya o ten ni noboraseyou to sareta toki, Eriya wa Erisha to tomo ni Girugaru o dete itta.
Eriya wa Erisha ni itta, "Douzo, koko ni todomatte kudasai. Shu wa watashi o Beteru ni tsukawasareru no desukara". Shikashi Erisha wa itta, "Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Mata anata mo ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa anata o hanaremasen". Soshite karera wa Beteru e kudatta.
Beteru ni iru yogensha no tomo gara ga, Erisha no moto ni dete kite kare ni itta, "Shu ga kyou, anata no shiji suru shujin o anata kara torareru no o shitte imasu ka". Kare wa itta, "Hai, shitte imasu. Anata gata wa damatte ite kudasai".
Eriya wa kare ni itta, "Erisha yo, douzo, koko ni todomatte kudasai. Shu wa watashi o Eriko ni tsukawasareru no desukara". Shikashi Erisha wa itta, "Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Mata anata mo ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa anata o hanaremasen". Soshite karera wa Eriko e itta.
Eriko ni ita yogensha no tomo gara ga, Erisha no moto ni kite kare ni itta, "Shu ga kyou, anata no shiji suru shujin o anata kara torareru no o shitte imasu ka". Kare wa itta, "Hai, shitte imasu. Anata gata wa damatte ite kudasai".
Eriya wa mata kare ni itta, "Douzo, koko ni todomatte kudasai. Shu wa watashi o Yorudan ni tsukawasareru no desukara". Shikashi kare wa itta, "Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Mata anata mo ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa anata o hanaremasen". Soshite futari wa susunde itta.
Yogensha no tomogara gojuunin mo itte, karera ni mukatte, haruka ni hanarete tatte ita. Karera futari wa, Yorudan no hotori ni tattaga,
Eriya wa gaitou o tori, sore o maite mizu o utsuto, mizu ga sayuu ni wakareta no de, futari wa kawaita tsuchi no ue o wataru koto ga dekita.
Karera ga watatta toki, Eriya wa Erisha ni itta, "Watashi ga torarete, anata o hanareru mae ni, anata no shite hoshii koto o motome nasai". Erisha wa itta, "Douzo, anata no rei no futatsu no bun o watashi ni tsugasete kudasai".
Eriya wa itta, "Anata wa muzukashii koto o motomeru. Anata ga moshi, watashi ga torarete, anata o hanareru no o mirunaraba, sono you ni narude arou. Shikashi minainaraba, sono you ni wa naranai".
Karera ga susuminagara katatte ita toki, hinokuruma to hi no uma ga arawarete, futari o hedateta. Soshite Eriya wa tsumujikaze ni notte ten ni nobotta.
Erisha wa kore o mite "Waga chichi yo, waga chichi yo, Isuraeru no sensha yo, sono kihei yo" to sakendaga, futatabi kare o minakatta. Soko de Erisha wa jibun no kimono o tsukande, sore o futatsu ni saki,
Mata Eriya no mi kara ochita gaitou o toriage, kaette kite Yorudan no kishi ni tatta.
Soshite Eriya no mi kara ochita sono gaitou o totte mizu o uchi, "Eriya no kami, Shu wa doko ni oraremasu ka" to ii, kare ga mizu o utsuto, mizu wa sayuu ni wakareta no de, Erisha wa watatta.
Eriko ni iru yogensha no tomo gara wa kare no chikazuite kuru no o mite, "Eriya no rei ga Erisha no ue ni todomatte iru" to itta. Soshite karera wa kite kare o mukae, sono mae ni chi ni fushite,
Kare ni itta, "Shimobera no tokoro ni chikara no tsuyoi mono ga gojuunin imasu. Douzo karera o tsukawashite, anata no shujin o tazunesasete kudasai. Shu no rei ga kare o hikiagete, kare o yama ka tani ni nageta no ka mo shiremasen". Erisha wa "Tsukawashite wa naranai" to ittaga,
Kare no hajiru made, shi ita no de, kare wa "Tsukawashi nasai" to itta. Sore de karera wa gojuunin no mono o tsukawashi, mikka no aida tazunetaga, kare o miidasanakatta.
Erisha no nao Eriko ni todomatte iru toki, karera ga kaette kita no de, Erisha wa karera ni itta, "Watashi wa, anata gata ni, itte wa naranai to tsugeta de wa nai ka".
Machi no hitobito wa Erisha ni itta, "Mirareru toori, kono machi no basho wa yoiga mizu ga warui no de, kono chi wa ryuuzan o okosu no desu".
Erisha wa itta, "Atarashii sara ni shio o motte, watashi ni motte ki nasai". Karera wa motte kita.
Erisha wa mizu no minamoto e dete itte, shio o soko ni nageirete itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa kono mizu o yoi mizu ni shita. Mohaya koko ni wa shi mo ryuuzan mo okoranaide arou' ".
Kou shite sono mizu wa Erisha no itta toori ni yoi mizu ni natte konnichi ni itatte iru.
Kare wa soko kara Beteru e nobottaga, nobotte iku tochuu, chiisai kodomora ga machi kara dete kite kare o azakeri, kare ni mukatte "Hageatama yo, nobore. Hageatama yo, nobore" to itta no de,
Kare wa furikaette karera o mi, Shu no na o motte karera o norotta. Suru to hayashi no naka kara nitou no me guma ga dete kite, sono kotomora no uchi yonjuu ninin o saita.
Kare wa soko kara Karumeruyama e iki, soko kara Samariya ni kaetta.
Yuda no ou Yoshapate no daijuu hachi nen ni Ahabu no ko Yoramu wa Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, juu ni nenyo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonattaga, sono fubo no you de wa nakatta. Kare ga sono chichi no tsukutta Baaru no sekichuu o nozoitakara de aru.
Shikashi kare wa Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi ni tsukishitagatte, sore o hanarenakatta.
Moabu no ou Mesha wa hitsuji no shiikumono de, juu man no kohitsuji to, juu man no ohitsuji no ke to o nennen Isuraeru no ou ni osamete itaga,
Ahabu ga shinda nochi, Moabu no ou wa Isuraeru no ou ni somuita.
Soko de Yoramu ou wa sono tokiSamariya o dete, Isuraeru bito o kotogotoku atsume,
Mata, hito o Yuda no ou Yoshapate ni tsukawashi, "Moabu no ou wa watashi ni somukimashita. Anata wa Moabu to tatakau tame ni, watashi to issho ni ikaremasen ka" to iwaseta. Kare wa itta, "Ikimashou. Watashi wa anata to hitotsu desu. Watashi no tami wa anata no tami to hitotsu desu. Watashi no uma wa anata no uma to hitotsu desu".
Kare wa mata itta, "Wareware wa dono michi o noboru no desu ka". Yoramu wa kotaeta, "Edomu no arano no michi o noborimashou".
Kou shite Isuraeru no ou wa Yuda no ou oyobi Edomu no ou to tomo ni dete itta. Shikashi karera wa mawarimichi o shite, nanuka no aida susundaga, gunzei to sore ni shitagau kachiku no nomu mizu ga nakatta no de,
Isuraeru no ou wa itta, "Aa, Shu wa, kono sannin no ou o Moabu no te ni watasou to shite meshiatsumerareta no da".
Yoshapate wa itta, "Wareware ga Shu ni tou koto no dekiru Shu no yogensha wa koko ni imasen ka". Isuraeru no ou no hitori no kerai ga kotaeta, "Eriya no te ni mizu o sosoida Shapate no ko Erisha ga koko ni imasu".
Yoshapate wa itta, "Shu no kotoba ga kare ni arimasu". Soko de Isuraeru no ou to Yoshapate to Edomu no ou to wa kare no moto e kudatte itta.
Erisha wa Isuraeru no ou ni itta, "Watashi wa anata to nan no kakawari ga arimasu ka. Anata no chichiue no yogensha tachi to hahaue no yogensha tachi no tokoro e iki nasai". Isuraeru no ou wa kare ni itta, "Iie, Shu ga kono sannin no ou o Moabu no te ni watasou to shite meshiatsumerareta no desu".
Erisha wa itta, "Watashi no tsukaeru bangun no Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa Yuda no ou Yoshapate no tame ni suru no de nakereba, anata o kaerimi, anata ni au koto wa shinai no daga,
Ima gakujin o watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai". Soko de gakujin ga gaku o sousuruto, Shu no te ga kare ni nozonde,
Kare wa itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa kono tani o mizutamari de mitasou'.
Kore wa Shu ga kou ooserarerukara de aru, 'Anata gata wa kaze mo ame mo minai no ni, kono tani ni mizu ga michite, anata gata to, sono kachiku oyobi kemono ga nomude arou'.
Kore wa Shu no me ni wa chiisai koto de aru. Shu wa Moabu bito o mo, anata gata no te ni watasareru.
Soshite anata gata wa subete no kengo na machi to, subete no yoi machi o uchi, subete no yoi ki o kiritaoshi, subete no mizu no ido o fusagi, ishi o motte chi no subete no yoi tokoro o arasude arou".
Akuru asa ni natte, sonaemono o sasageru toki ni, mizu ga Edomu no hou kara nagarete kite, mizu wa kuni ni michita.
Sate Moabu bito wa mina, outachi ga jibuntachi o semeru tame ni nobotte kita no o kiita no de, yoroi o kiru koto no dekiru mono o, oi mo wakaki mo kotogotoku shoushuu shite, kokkyou ni haichi shitaga,
Asa hayaku okite, taiyou ga nobotte mizu o tera shita toki, Moabu bito wa me no mae ni chi no you ni akai mizu o mita no de,
Karera wa itta, "Kore wa chi da, kitto outachi ga tagai ni tatakatte koroshiatta no da. Dakara, Moabu yo, bundori ni iki nasai".
Shikashi Moabu bito ga Isuraeru no jin'ei ni ikuto, Isuraeru bi to wa tachiagatte Moabu bito o utta no de, karera wa Isuraeru no mae kara nigesatta. Isuraeru bi to wa susunde, Moabu bito o uchi, sono kuni ni haitte,
Machimachi o horoboshi, onoono ishi o hitotsu zutsu, chi no subete no yoi tokoro ni nagete, kore ni mitashi, mizu no ido o kotogotoku fusagi, yoi ki o kotogotoku kiritaoshite, tada kiru harasete wa sono na o nokosu nomi to nattaga, ishi o nageru mono ga kore o kakonde uchi horoboshita.
Moabu no ou wa tatakai ga amari ni hageshiku, atarigatai no o mite, tsurugi o nuku mono nanahyakunin o hikii, Edomu no ou no tokoro ni tsukihairou to shitaga, hatasanakatta no de,
Jibun no kurai o tsugubeki sono choushi o totte jouheki no ue de hansai to shite sasageta. Sono toki Isuraeru ni ooinaru ikidoori ga nozonda no de, karera wa kare o sutete jibun no kuni ni kaetta.
Yogensha no tomo gara no, hitori no tsuma ga Erisha ni yobawatte itta, "Anata no shimobe de aru watashi no otto ga shinimashita. Gozonji no you ni, anata no shimobe wa Shu o osoreru mono de arimashitaga, ima, saishu ga kite, watashi no futari no kodomo o totte dorei ni shiyou to shite iru no desu".
Erisha wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata no tame ni nani o shimashou ka. Anata no ie ni donna mono ga aru ka, ii nasai". Kanojo wa itta, "Ichi bin no abura no hoka wa, hashi tame no ie ni nani mo arimasen".
Kare wa itta, "Hoka e itte, tonari no hitobito kara utsuwa o kari nasai. Aita utsuwa o kari nasai. Sukoshi bakari de wa ikemasen.
Soshite uchi ni haitte, anata no kodomotachi to issho ni to no uchi ni tojikomori, sono subete no utsuwa ni abura o tsuide, ippai ni natta toki, hitotsu zutsu sore o torinokete oki nasai".
Kanojo wa kare o hanarete sari, kodomotachi to issho ni to no uchi ni tojikomori, kodomotachi no motte kuru utsuwa ni abura o tsuida.
Abura ga michita toki, kanojo wa kodomo ni "Motto utsuwa o motte ki nasai" to ittaga, kodomo ga "Utsuwa wa mou arimasen" to itta no de, abura wa tomatta.
Soko de kanojo wa kami no hito no tokoro ni kite tsugeta no de, kare wa itta, "Itte, sono abura o utte fusai o harai nasai. Anata to, anata no kodomotachi wa sono nokori de kurasu koto ga dekimasu".
Aru hi Erisha wa Shunemu e ittaga, soko ni hitori no yuufuku na fujin ga ite, shikiri ni kare ni shokuji o susumeta no de, kare wa soko o toorugoto ni, soko ni yotte shokuji o shita.
Sono onna wa otto ni itta, "Itsu mo watashitachi no tokoro o tooru ano hito wa tashika ni kami no sei naru hito desu.
Watashitachi wa okujou ni kabe no aru hitotsu no chiisai heya o tsukuri, soko ni shindai to tsukue to isu to shokudai to o kare no tame ni sonaemashou. Sou sureba kare ga watashitachi no tokoro ni kuru toki, soko ni, hairu koto ga dekimasu".
Sate, aru hi Erisha wa soko ni kite, sono heya ni hairi, soko ni yasundaga,
Kare wa sono shimobe Gehaji ni "Kono Shunemu no onna o yonde ki nasai" to itta. Kare ga sono onna o yobuto, kanojo wa kite Erisha no mae ni tatta no de,
Erisha wa Gehaji ni itta, "Kanojo ni ii nasai, 'Anata wa konna ni nengoro ni, watashitachi no tame ni kokoro o mochiiraretaga, anata no tame ni wa nani o shitara yoideshou ka. Ou mata wa gunzei no chou ni anata no koto o yoroshiku tanomu koto o onozomi desu ka' ". Kanojo wa kotaete itta, "Watashi wa jibun no tami no uchi ni sunde imasu".
Erisha wa itta, "Sore de wa kanojo no tame ni nani o shiyou ka". Gehaji wa itta, "Kanojo ni wa kodomo ga naku, sono otto wa oite imasu".
Suru to Erisha ga "Kanojo o yobi nasai" to itta no de, kanojo o yobuto, kite toguchi ni tatta.
Erisha wa itta, "Rainen no imagoro, anata wa hitori no ko o dakudeshou". Kanojo wa itta, "Iie, waga Shu yo, kami no hito yo, hashi tame o azamukanaide kudasai".
Shikashi onna wa tsuini migomotte, Erisha ga kanojo ni itta you ni, tsugi no nen no sono koro ni ko o unda.
Sono ko ga seichou shite, aru hi, kariire bito no tokoro e dete itte, chichi no moto e ittaga,
Chichi ni mukatte "Atama ga, atama ga" to itta no de, chichi wa shimobe ni "Kare o haha no moto e seotte iki nasai" to itta.
Kare o seotte haha no moto e ikuto, hiru made haha no hiza no ue ni suwatte itaga, tsuini shinda.
Haha wa agatte itte, kore o kami no hito no shindai no ue ni oki, to o tojite dete kita.
Soshite otto o yonde itta, "Douzo, shimobe hitori to, roba ichitou o watashi ni ka shite kudasai. Isoide kami no hito no tokoro e itte, mata kaette kimasu".
Otto wa itta, "Dou shite kyou kare no tokoro e ikou to suru no ka. Kyou wa, tsuitachi de mo naku, ansokunichi de mo nai". Kanojo wa itta, "Yoroshii no desu".
Soshite kanojo wa roba ni kura o oite, shimobe ni itta, "Hayaku kakesase nasai. Watashi ga meijiru toki de nakereba, hochou o yurumete wa narimasen".
Kou shite kanojo wa shuppatsu shite Karumeruyama e iki, kami no hito no tokoro e itta. Kami no hito wa kanojo no chikazuite kuru no o mite, shimobe Gehaji ni itta, "Mukou kara, ano Shunemu no onna ga kuru.
Sugu hashitte itte, kanojo o mukaete ii nasai, 'Anata wa buji desu ka. Anata no otto wa buji desu ka. Anata no kodomo wa buji desu ka' ". Kanojo wa kotaeta, "Buji desu".
Tokoro ga kanojo wa yama ni kite, kami no hito no tokoro e kuruto Erisha no ashi ni sugaritsuita. Gehaji ga kanojo o oinokeyou to chikayotta toki, kami no hito wa itta, "Kamawazu ni oki nasai. Kanojo wa kokoro ni kurushimi ga aru no dakara. Shu wa sore o kakushite, mada watashi ni otsuge ni naranai no da".
Soko de kanojo wa itta, "Watashi ga anata ni ko o motomemashita ka. Watashi o azamukanaide kudasai to ittade wa arimasen ka".
Erisha wa Gehaji ni itta, "Koshi o hiki karage, watashi no tsue o te ni motte iki nasai. Dare ni atte mo, aisatsu shite wa naranai. Mata anata ni aisatsu suru mono ga atte mo, sore ni kotaete wa naranai. Watashi no tsue o kodomo no kao no ue ni oki nasai".
Kodomo no haha wa itta, "Shu wa ikite oraremasu. Anata mo ikite oraremasu. Watashi wa anata o hanaremasen". Soko de Erisha wa tsuini tachiagatte kanojo no ato ni tsuite itta.
Gehaji wa karera no saki ni itte, tsue o kodomo no kao no ue ni oitaga, nan no koe mo naku, ikikaetta shirushi mo nakatta no de, kaette kite Erisha ni ai, kare ni tsugete "Kodomo wa mada me o samashimasen" to itta.
Erisha ga ie ni haitte miruto, kodomo wa shinde, shindai no ue ni yokotawatte ita no de,
Kare wa hai tte to o toji, karera futari dake uchi ni ite Shu ni inotta.
Soshite Erisha ga agatte kodomo no ue ni fushi, jibun no kuchi o kodomo no kuchi no ue ni, jibun no me o kodomo no me no ue ni, jibun no ryoute o kodomo no ryoute no ue ni ate, sono mi o kodomo no ue ni nobashita toki, kodomo no karada wa atataka ni natta.
Kou shite Erisha wa futatabi okiagatte, ie no naka o achirakochira to ayumi, mata uegatte, sono mi o kodomo no ue ni nobasuto, kodomo wa nana tabi kushami o shite me o hiraita.
Erisha wa tadachini Gehaji o yonde, "Ano Shunemu no onna o yobe" to itta no de, kanojo o yonda. Kanojo ga haitte kuruto Erisha wa itta, "Anata no kodomo o tsurete iki nasai".
Kanojo wa haitte kite, Erisha no ashimoto ni fushi, chi ni mi o kagameta. Soshite sono kotomo o toriagete dete itta.
Erisha wa Girugaru ni kaettaga, sono chi ni kikin ga atta. Yogensha no tomo gara ga kare no mae ni zashite ita no de, Erisha wa sono shimobe ni itta, "Ookina kama o suete, yogensha no tomo gara no tame ni yasai no nimono o tsukuri nasai".
Karera no uchi no hitori ga hatake ni dete itte aomono o tsundaga, tsurukusa no aru no o mite, sono nouri o ichitsutsumi tsun dekite, nimono no kama no naka ni kirikonda. Karera wa sore ga nani de aru ka o shiranakattakara de aru.
Yagate kore o motte hitobito ni tabesaseyou to shitaga, karera ga sono nimono o tabeyou to shita toki, sakende, "Aa kami no hito yo, kama no naka ni, taberu to shinu mono ga haitte imasu" to itte, taberu koto ga dekinakatta no de,
Erisha wa "Sore de wa kona o motte ki nasai" to itte, sore o kama ni nageire, "Motte hitobito ni tabesase nasai" to itta. Kama no naka ni wa, nan no dokubutsu mo nakunatta.
Sono toki, Baaru Sharisha kara hito ga kite, hatsuho no pan to, oomugi no pan nijuuko to, shinkoku hito fukuro to o kami no hito no moto ni motte kita no de, Erisha wa "Hitobito ni ataete tabesase nasai" to ittaga,
Sono meshitsukai wa itta, "Dou shite kore o hyakunin no mae ni sonaeru no desu ka". Shikashi kare wa itta, "Hitobito ni ataete tabesase nasai. Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Karera wa tabete nao amasude arou' ".
Soko de kare wa sore o karera no mae ni sonaeta no de, karera wa tabete nao amashita. Shu no kotoba no toori de atta.
Suriya ou no gunzei no chouNaaman wa sono shukun ni omonjirareta yuuryoku na hito de atta. Shu ga katsute kare o mochiite Suriya ni shouri o esaseraretakara de aru. Kare wa daiyuushi de attaga, raibyou o wazuratte ita.
Saki ni Suriya bito ga ryakudatsutai o kunde dete kita toki, Isuraeru no chi kara hitori no shoujo o toraete itta. Kanojo wa Naaman no tsuma ni tsukaetaga,
Sono onna shujin ni mukatte, "Aa, goshujin ga Samariya ni iru yogensha to tomo ni oraretara yokattadeshou ni. Kare wa sono raibyou o iyashita koto deshou" to itta no de,
Naaman wa itte, sono shukun ni, "Isuraeru no chi kara kita musume ga kou iu koto o iimashita" to tsugeruto,
Suriya ou wa itta, "Sore de wa iki nasai. Watashi wa Isuraeru no ou ni tegami o kakimashou". Soko de kare wa gin juu taranto to, kin rokusen shikeru to, haregi juu chaku o tazusaete itta.
Kare ga Isuraeru no ou ni motte itta tegami ni wa, "Kono tegami ga anata ni todoitanaraba, watashi no kerai Naaman o, anata ni tsukawashita koto to goshouchi kudasai. Anata ni kare no raibyou o iyashite itadaku tame desu" to atta.
Isuraeru no ou wa sono tegami o yonda toki, koromo o saite itta, "Watashi wa koroshi tari, ikashi tari suru koto no dekiru kami de arou ka. Dou shite kono hito wa, raibyounin o watashi ni tsukawashite, sore o iyase to iu no ka. Anata gata wa, kare ga watashi ni arasoi o shikakete iru no o shitte keikai suru ga yoi".
Kami no hito Erisha wa, Isuraeru no ou ga sono koromo o saita koto o kiki, ou ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "Dou shite anata wa koromo o saita no desu ka. Kare o watashi no moto ni kosase nasai. Sou sureba kare wa Isuraeru ni yogensha no aru koto o shiru you ni narudeshou".
Soko de Naaman wa uma to kuruma to o shitagaete kite, Erisha no ie no iriguchi ni tatta.
Suru to Erisha wa kare ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Anata wa Yorudan e itte nana tabi mi o arai nasai. Sou sureba, anata no niku wa moto ni kaette kiyoku narudeshou".
Shikashi Naaman wa ikatte sari, soshite itta, "Watashi wa, kare ga kitto watashi no moto ni dete kite tachi, sono kami, Shu no na o yonde, sono kasho no ue ni te o ugokashite, raibyou o iyasu no darou to omotta.
Damasuko no kawa Abana to Paruparu wa Isuraeru no subete no kawamizu ni masaru de wa nai ka. Watashi wa korera no kawa ni mi o aratte kiyomaru koto ga dekinai no de arou ka". Kou shite kare wa mi o megurashi, ikatte satta.
Sono toki, shimobetachi wa kare ni chikayotte itta, "Waga chichi yo, yogensha ga anata ni, nani ka ookina koto o seyo to meijite mo, anata wa sore o nasaranakattadeshou ka. Mashite kare wa anata ni 'Mi o aratte kiyoku nare' to iu dake de wa arimasen ka".
Soko de Naaman wa kudatte itte, kami no hito no kotoba no you ni nana tabi Yorudan ni mi o hitasuto, sono niku ga moto ni kaette osanago no niku no you ni nari, kiyoku natta.
Kare wa subete no juusha o tsurete kami no hito no moto ni kaette kite, sono mae ni tatte itta, "Watashi wa ima, Isuraeru no hoka, zenchi no doko ni mo kami no orarenai koto o shirimashita. Sore yue, douzo, shimobe no okurimono o ukete kudasai".
Erisha wa itta, "Watashi no tsukaeru Shu wa ikite orareru. Watashi wa nani mo ukemasen". Kare wa shiite ukesaseyou to shitaga, sore o kobanda.
Soko de Naaman wa itta, "Moshi ouke ni naranai no de areba, douzo raba ni ni da no tsuchi o shimobe ni kudasai. Kore kara nochi shimobe wa, ta no kami ni wa hansai mo gisei mo sasagezu, tada Shu ni nomi sasagemasu.
Douzo Shu ga kono koto o, shimobe ni oyurushi kudasaru you ni. Sunawachi, watashi no shukun ga Rinmon no miya ni haitte, soko de reihai suru toki, watashi no te ni yori kakaru koto ga ari, mata watashi mo Rinmon no miya de mi o kagameru koto ga arimashou. Watashi ga Rinmon no miya de mi o kagameru toki, douzo Shu ga sono koto o, shimobe ni oyurushi kudasaru you ni".
Erisha wa kare ni itta, "Yasunjite iki nasai". Naaman ga Erisha o hanarete sukoshi itta toki,
Kami no hito Erisha no shimobeGehaji wa itta, "Shujin wa kono Suriya bi to Naaman o itawatte, kare ga tazusaete kita mono o ukenakatta. Shu wa ikite orareru. Watashi wa kare no ato o oikakete, kare kara sukoshi, mono o ukeyou".
Soshite Gehaji wa Naaman no ato o ottaga, Naaman wa jibun no ato kara kare ga hashitte kuru no o mite, kuruma kara furi, kare o mukaete, "Kawatta koto ga aru no desu ka" to iuto,
Kare wa itta, "Buji desu. Shujin ga watashi o tsukawashite iwasemasu, 'Tadaima Efuraimu no sanchi kara, yogensha no tomo gara no futari no wakamono ga, watashi no moto ni kimashita no de, douzo karera ni gin ichi taranto to haregi ni chaku o ataete kudasai' ".
Naaman wa, "Douzo ni taranto o ukete kudasai" to itte kare ni shii, gin ni taranto o futatsu no fukuro ni ire, haregi ni chaku o soete, jibun no futari no shimobe ni watashita no de, karera wa sore o otte Gehaji no saki ni tatte susundaga,
Kare wa oka ni kita toki, sore o karera no te kara uketotte ie no uchi ni osame, hitobito o okurikaeshita no de, karera wa satta.
Kare ga hai tte shujin no mae ni tatsuto, Erisha wa kare ni itta, "Gehaji yo, doko e itte kita no ka". Kare wa itta, "Shimobe wa doko e mo ikimasen".
Erisha wa itta, "Ano hito ga kuruma o hanarete, anata o mukaeta toki, watashi no kokoro wa anata to issho ni soko ni itade wa nai ka. Ima wa kin o uke, kimono o uke, oribu hatake, budou hatake, hitsuji, ushi, shimobe, hashi tame o ukeru toki de arou ka.
Sore yue, Naaman no raibyou wa anata ni tsuki, nagaku anata no shison ni oyobude arou". Kare ga Erisha no mae o dete iku toki, raibyou ga hasshite yuki no you ni shiroku natte ita.
Sate yogensha no tomo gara wa Erisha ni itta, "Watashitachi ga anata to tomo ni sunde iru tokoro wa semaku narimashita no de,
Watashitachi o Yorudan ni ikase, soko kara meimei ichipon zutsu zaimoku o totte kite, watashitachi no sumu basho o tsukurasete kudasai". Erisha wa itta, "Iki nasai".
Toki ni sono hitori ga, "Douzo anata mo, shimobera to issho ni itte kudasai" to itta no de, Erisha wa "Ikimashou" to kotaeta.
Soshite Erisha wa karera to issho ni itta. Karera wa Yorudan e itte ki o kiritaoshitaga,
Hitori ga zaimoku o kiritaoshite iru toki, ono no atama ga mizu no naka ni ochita no de, kare wa sakende itta. "Aa, waga Shu yo. Kore wa karita mono desu".
Kami no hito wa itta, "Sore wa doko ni ochita no ka". Kare ga sono basho o shiraseruto, Erisha wa ichipon no eda o kiriotoshi, soko ni nageirete, sono ono no atama o ukabase,
"Sore o toriage yo" to itta no de, sono hito wa te o nobete sore o totta.
Katsute Suriya no ou ga Isuraeru to tatakatte ita toki, keraitachi to hyougi shite "Shikajika no tokoro ni watashi no jin o harou" to iuto,
Kami no hito wa Isuraeru no ou ni "Anata wa youjin shite, kono tokoro o tootte wa narimasen. Suriya bito ga soko ni kudatte kimasukara" to iiokutta.
Sore de Isuraeru no ou wa kami no hito ga jibun ni tsugete kureta tokoro ni hito o tsukawashi, keikai shita no de, sono tokoro de mizukara o fusegi eta koto wa ichini kai ni todomaranakatta.
Suriya no ou wa kono koto no tame ni kokoro o nayamashi, keraitachi o meshite itta, "Wareware no uchi, dare ga Isuraeru no ou to tsuujite iru no ka, watashi ni tsugeru mono wa nai ka".
Hitori no kerai ga itta, "Ou, waga Shu yo, dare mo tsuujite iru mono wa imasen. Tada Isuraeru no yogensha Erisha ga, anata ga shinshitsu de katarareru kotoba de mo Isuraeru no ou ni tsugeru no desu".
Ou wa itta, "Kare ga doko ni iru ka itte sagashi nasai. Watashi wa hito o yatte kare o toraeyou". Toki ni "Kare wa Dotan ni iru" to ou ni tsugeru mono ga atta no de,
Ou wa soko ni uma to sensha oyobi taigun o tsukawashita. Karera wa yoru no uchi ni kite, sono machi o kakonda.
Kami no hito no meshitsukai ga asa hayaku okite dete miruto, gunzei ga uma to sensha o motte machi o kakonde ita no de, sono wakamono wa Erisha ni itta, "Aa, waga Shu yo, watashitachi wa dou shimashou ka".
Erisha wa itta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Wareware to tomo ni iru mono wa karera to tomo ni iru mono yori mo ooi no dakara".
Soshite Erisha ga inotte "Shu yo, douzo, kare no me o hiraite misasete kudasai" to iuto, Shu wa sono wakamono no me o hirakareta no de, kare ga miruto, hi no uma to hi no sensha ga yama ni michite Erisha no mawari ni atta.
Suriya bito ga Erisha no tokoro ni kudatte kita toki, Erisha wa Shu ni inotte itta, "Douzo, kono hitobito no me o kuramashite kudasai". Suru to Erisha no kotoba no toori ni karera no me o kuramasareta.
Soko de Erisha wa karera ni "Kore wa sono michi de wa nai. Kore wa sono machi de mo nai. Watashi ni tsuite ki nasai. Watashi wa anatagata o, anata gata no tazuneru hito no tokoro e tsurete ikimashou" to itte, karera o Samariya e tsurete itta.
Karera ga Samariya ni haitta toki, Erisha wa itta, "Shu yo, kono hitobito no me o hiraite misasete kudasai". Shu wa karera no me o hirakareta no de, karera ga miruto, miyo, karera wa Samariya no uchi ni kite ita.
Isuraeru no ou wa karera o mite, Erisha ni itta, "Waga chichi yo, karera o uchikoroshimashou ka. Karera o uchikoroshimashou ka".
Erisha wa kotaeta, "Uchikoroshite wa naranai. Anata wa tsurugi to yumi o motte, horyo ni shita monodomo o uchikorosudeshou ka. Pan to mizu o karera no mae ni sonaete kui nomisase, sono shukun no moto e ikase nasai".
Soko de ou wa karera no tame ni sakan na furumai o mouketa. Karera ga kui nomi o owaruto karera o saraseta no de, sono shukun no tokoro e kaetta. Suriya no ryakudatsutai wa futatabi Isuraeru no chi ni konakatta.
Kono nochi Suriya no ou Benehadade wa sono zengun o atsume, nobotte kite Samariya o semekakonda no de,
Samariya ni hageshii kikin ga tatta. Sunawachi karera ga kore o semekakonda no de, tsuini, roba no atama hitotsu ga gin hachijuu shikeru de urare, hato no fun ichi Kabu no yonbun no ichi ga gin go shikeru de urareru you ni natta.
Isuraeru no ou ga jouheki no ue o tootte ita toki, hitori no onna ga kare ni yobawatte, "Waga Shu, ou yo, tasukete kudasai" to itta no de,
Kare wa itta, "Moshi Shu ga anata o tasukerarenainaraba, nani o motte watashi ga anata o tasukeru koto ga dekiyou. Uchi ba no mono o motte ka, saka bune no mono o motte ka".
Soshite ou wa onna ni tazuneta, "Nanigoto na no desu ka". Kanojo wa kotaeta, "Kono onna wa watashi ni mukatte 'Anata no ko o kudasai. Watashitachi wa, kyou sore o tabe, asu, watashi no ko o tabemashou' to iimashita.
Sore de watashitachi wa, mazu watashi no ko o nite tabemashitaga, tsugi no hi watashi ga kanojo ni mukatte 'Anata no ko o kudasai. Watashitachi wa sore o tabemashou' to iimasuto, kanojo wa sono ko o kakushimashita".
Ou wa sono onna no kotoba o kiite, koromo o saki, - - ou wa jouheki no ue o tootte itaga, tami ga miruto, sono mi ni aranuno o tsukete ita - -
Soshite ou wa itta "Kyou, Shapate no ko Erisha no kubi ga sono kata no ue ni suwatte irunaraba, kami ga donna nide mo watashi o basshite kudasaru you ni".
Sate Erisha wa sono ie ni zashite itaga, chouroutachi mo kite kare to tomo ni zashita. Ou wa jibun no tokoro kara hito o tsukawashitaga, Erisha wa sono shisha ga mada tsukanai uchi ni chouroutachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa, kono hito o korosu mono ga watashi no kubi o toru tame ni, hito o tsukawasu no o mimasu ka. Sono shisha ga kitanaraba, to o tojite, uchi ni irete wa narimasen. Kare no ushiro ni, sono shukun no ashioto ga surude wa arimasen ka".
Kare ga nao karera to katatte iru uchi ni, ou wa kare no moto ni kudatte kite itta, "Kono wazawai wa Shu kara deta no desu. Watashi wa dou shite kono ue, Shu o matanakereba naranaideshou ka".
Erisha wa itta, "Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Asu no imagoroSamariya no mon de, mugiko ichi Sea o ichi shikeru de uri, oomugi ni Sea o ichi shikeru de uru you ni narude arou' ".
Toki ni hitori no fukukan sunawachi ou ga sono hito no te ni yori kakatte ita mono ga kami no hito ni kotaete itta, "Tatoi Shu ga ten ni mado o hirakarete mo, sonna koto ga ari emashou ka". Erisha wa itta, "Anata wa jibun no me o motte sore o mirude arou. Shikashi sore o taberu koto wa nakarou".
Sate machi no mon no iriguchi ni yonnin no raibyounin ga itaga, karera wa tagai ni itta, "Wareware wa dou shite koko ni zashite shi o mataneba naranai no ka.
Wareware ga moshi machi ni hairou to ieba, machi ni wa shokumotsu ga tsukite irukara, wareware wa soko de shinude arou. Shikashi koko ni zashite ite mo shinu no da. Isso no koto, wareware wa Suriya bito no jin'ei e nigete ikou. Moshi karera ga wareware o ikashite oite kurerunaraba, tasukaruga, tatoi wareware o koroshite mo shinu bakari da".
Soko de karera wa Suriya bito no jin'ei e ikouto, tasogare ni tachiagattaga, Suriya bito no jin'ei no hotori ni itte miruto, soko ni wa dare mo inakatta.
Kore wa Shu ga Suriya bito no gunzei ni sensha no oto, uma no oto, taigun no oto o kikaserareta no de, karera wa tagai ni "Miyo, Isuraeru no ou ga wareware o semeru tame ni, Hete bito no outachi oyobi Ejiputo no outachi o yatotte kite, wareware o osou no da" to itte,
Tasogare ni tatte nige, sono tenmaku to, uma to, roba o sute, jin'ei o sono mama ni shite oite, inochi o mattou shiyou to nigetakara de aru.
Soko de raibyounin tachi wa jin'ei no hotori ni iki, hitotsu no tenmaku ni haitte kui nomi shi, soko kara kingin, ifuku o mochidashite sore o kakushi, mata kite, ta no tenmaku ni hairi, soko kara mo mochidashite sore o kakushita.
Soshite karera wa tagai ni itta, "Wareware no shite iru koto wa yoku nai. Kyou wa yoi otozure no aru hi de aru no ni, damatte ite, yoake made matsunaraba, wareware wa batsu o koumurude arou. Saa, wareware wa itte ou no kazoku ni tsugeyou".
Soko de karera wa kite, machi no mon o mamoru mono o yonde itta, "Watashitachi ga Suriya bito no jin'ei ni itte miruto, soko ni wa dare no sugata mo miezu, mata hitogoe mo naku, tada, uma to roba ga tsunaide ari, tenmaku wa sono mama deshita".
Soko de mon o mamoru mono wa yobawatte, sore o ou no kazoku no uchi ni shiraseta.
Ou wa yoru no uchi ni okite, keraitachi ni itta, "Suriya bito ga wareware ni taishite hakatte iru koto o anata gata ni tsugeyou. Karera wa, wareware no uete iru no o shitte, jin'ei o dete no ni kakure, 'Isuraeru bito ga machi o detara, ikedori ni shite, machi ni oshiirou' to kangaete iru no da".
Kerai no hitori ga kotaete itta, "Hitobito ni, koko ni nokotte iru uma no uchi gotou o tsurete kosasete kudasai. Koko ni nokotte iru korera no hitobito wa, sudeni horobi useta Isuraeru no zengunshuu to onaji unmei ni au no desukara. Watashitachi wa hito o yatte ukagawasemashou".
Soko de karera wa futari no kihei o eranda. Ou wa sore o tsukawashi, "Itte miyo" to itte, Suriya bito no gunzei no ato o tsukesaseta no de,
Karera wa sono ato o otte Yorudan made ittaga, michi ni wa subete, Suriya bito ga awatete nigeru toki ni sutete itta ifuku to buki ga chirabatte ita. Sono shisha wa kaette kite, kore o ou ni tsugeta.
Soko de tami ga dete itte, Suriya bito no jin'ei o kasumeta no de, mugiko ichi Sea wa ichi shikeru de urare, oomugi ni Sea wa ichi shikeru de urare, Shu no kotoba no toori ni natta.
Ou wa jibun ga sono hito no te ni yori kakatte ita, ano fukukan o tatete mon o kanri sasetaga, tami wa mon de kare o fumitsuketa no de, kare wa shinda. Sunawachi, ou ga kami no hito no tokoro ni kudatte kita toki, kami no hito ga itta toori de atta.
Kore wa kami no hito ga ou ni mukatte, "Asu no imagoro, Samariya no mon de oomugi ni Sea o ichi shikeru de uri, mugiko ichi Sea o ichi shikeru de uru you ni narude arou" to itta toki ni,
Sono fukukan ga kami no hito ni kotaete, "Tatoi Shu ga ten ni mado o hirakarete mo, sonna koto ga ari eyou ka" to ittakara de aru. Sono toki kami no hito wa "Anata wa jibun no me o motte sore o mirude arou. Shikashi sore o taberu koto wa nakarou" to ittaga,
Kore wa sono toori kare ni nozonda. Sunawachi tami ga mon de kare o fumitsuketa no de kare wa shinda.
Erisha wa katsute, sono ko o ikikaerasete yatta onna ni itta koto ga aru. "Anata wa, koko o tatte, anata no kazoku to tomo ni iki, kiryuu shiyou to omou tokoro ni kiryuu shi nasai. Shu ga kikin o yobi kudasareta no de, nana nen no aida sore ga kono chi ni nozomukara".
Soko de onna wa tatte kami no hito no kotoba no you ni shi, sono kazoku to tomo ni itte Perishite bito no chi ni shichi nen kiryuu shita.
Nana nen tatte nochi, onna wa Perishite bito no chi kara kaette kite, jibun no ie to hatake no tame ni ou ni uttaeyou to dete itta.
Toki ni ou wa kami no hito no shimobe Gehaji ni mukatte "Erisha ga shita moromoro no ookina koto o watashi ni hanashite kudasai" to itte, kare to monogatatte ita.
Sunawachi Erisha ga shinin o ikikaeraseta koto o, Gehaji ga ou to monogatatte ita toki, sono ko o ikikaerasete moratta onna ga, jibun no ie to hatake no tame ni ou ni uttaete kita no de, Gehaji wa itta, "Waga Shu, ou yo, kore ga sono onna desu. Mata kore ga sono ko de, Erisha ga ikikaeraseta no desu".
Ou ga sono onna ni tazuneruto, kanojo wa ou ni hanashita no de, ou wa kanojo no tame ni hitori no yakunin ni meijite itta, "Subete kanojo ni zokusuru mono, narabi ni kanojo ga kono chi o satta hi kara ima made no sono hatake no sanbutsu o kotogotoku kanojo ni kaeshi nasai".
Sate Erisha wa Damasuko ni kita. Toki ni Suriya no ou Benehadade wa byouki de attaga, "Kami no hito ga koko ni kita" to tsugeru mono ga atta no de,
Ou wa Hazaeru ni itta, "Okurimono o tazusaete itte kami no hito o mukae, kare ni yotte Shu ni 'Watashi no kono byouki wa naorimashou ka' to itte tazune nasai".
Soko de Hazaeru wa kare o mukaeyou to, Damasuko no moromoro no yoi mono o rakuda yonjuutou ni nose, okurimono to shite tazusae iki, Erisha no mae ni tatte itta, "Anata no ko, Suriya no ou Benehadade ga watashi o anata ni tsukawashite, 'Watashi no kono byouki wa naorimashou ka' to iwasete imasu".
Erisha wa kare ni itta, "Itte kare ni 'Anata wa kanarazu naorimasu' to tsuge nasai. Tadashi Shu wa watashi ni, kare ga kanarazu shinu koto o shimesaremashita".
Soshite kami no hito ga hitomi o sadamete kare no hajiru made ni mitsume, yagate naki dashita no de,
Hazaeru wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, dou shite nakareru no desu ka". Erisha wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa anata ga Isuraeru no hitobito ni shiyou to suru gaiaku o shitte irukara desu. Sunawachi, anata wa karera no shiro ni hi o kake, tsurugi o motte wakamono o koroshi, osanago o nageuchi, ninshin no onna o hikisakudeshou".
Hazaeru wa itta, "Shimobe wa ichipiki no inu ni suginai no ni, dou shite sonna ookina koto o suru koto ga dekimashou". Erisha wa itta, "Shu ga watashi ni shimesaremashita. Anata wa Suriya no ou to narudeshou".
Kare ga Erisha no moto o satte, shukun no tokoro e ikuto, "Erisha wa anata ni nan to itta ka" to tazunerareta no de, "Anata ga kanarazu naorudeshouto, kare wa watashi ni tsugemashita" to kotaeta.
Shikashi yokujitsu ni natte Hazaeru wa nuno o totte mizu ni hitashi, sore o motte ou no kao o ootta no de, ou wa shinda. Hazaeru wa kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Isuraeru no ou Ahabu no ko Yoramu no daigo nen ni, Yuda no ou Yoshapate no ko Yoramu ga kurai ni tsuita.
Kare wa ou to natta toki sanjuu nisai de, hachi nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta.
Kare wa Ahabu no ie ga shita you ni Isuraeru no outachi no michi ni ayunda. Ahabu no musume ga kare no tsuma de attakara de aru. Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonattaga,
Shu wa shimobe Dabide no tame ni Yuda o horobosu koto o konomarenakatta. Sunawachi Shu wa kare to sono shison ni tsune ni tomoshibi o ataeruto, kare ni yakusoku saretakara de aru.
Yoramu no yo ni Edomu ga somuite Yuda no shihai o dasshi, mizukara ou o tateta no de,
Yoramu wa subete no sensha o shitagaete Zairu ni watatte iki, sono sensha no shikikantachi to tomo ni, yo no uchi ni tachiagatte, kare o houi shite iru Edomu bito o utta. Shikashi Yoramu no guntai wa tenmaku ni nigekaetta.
Edomu wa kono you ni somuite Yuda no shihai o dasshi, konnichi ni itatte iru. Ribuna mo mata douji ni somuita.
Yoramu no sono ta no jiseki oyobi kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yoramu wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni sono senzotachi to tomo ni houmurare, sono ko Ahajiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Isuraeru no ou Ahabu no ko Yoramu no daijuu ni nen ni Yuda no ou Yoramu no ko Ahajiya ga kurai ni tsuita.
Ahajiya wa ou to natta toki nijuu nisai de, Erusaremu de ichi nenyo o osameta. Sono haha wa na o Atariya to itte, Isuraeru no ou Omuri no magomusume de atta.
Ahajiya wa mata Ahabu no ie no michi ni ayumi, Ahabu no ie ga shita you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta. Kare wa Ahabu no ie no muko de attakara de aru.
Kare wa Ahabu no ko Yoramu to tomo ni itte, Suriya no ou Hazaeru to ramote gireade de tatakattaga, Suriya bitora wa Yoramu ni kizu o owaseta.
Yoramu ou wa sono Suriya no ou Hazaeru to tatakau toki ni Rama de Suriya bito ni owasareta kizu o iyasu tame, Ezureru ni kaettaga, Yuda no ou Yoramu no ko Ahajiya wa Ahabu no ko Yoramu ga yande ita no de, Ezureru ni kudatte kare o otozureta.
Toki ni yogensha Erisha wa yogensha no tomo gara no hitori o yonde itta, "Koshi o hiki karage, kono abura no bin o tazusaete, ramote gireade e iki nasai.
Soko ni tsuitanaraba, Nimushi no ko Yoshapate no ko de aru Ehiu o tazunedashi, uchi ni haitte kare o sono douryoutachi no uchi kara tatasete, oku no aida ni tsurete iki,
Abura no bin o totte, sono atama ni sosogi, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa anata ni abura o sosoide Isuraeru no ou to suru' to ii, soshite to o akete nigesari nasai. Todomatte wa naranai".
Soko de yogensha de aru sono wakamono wa ramote gireade e ittaga,
Kite miruto, gunzei no choutachi ga kaigichuu de atta no de, kare wa "Shougun yo, watashi wa anata ni moushiageru koto ga arimasu" to iuto, Ehiu ga kotaete, "Wareware subete no uchi no, dare ni desu ka" to itta no de, kare wa "Shougun yo, anata ni desu" to itta.
Suru to Ehiu ga tachiagatte ie ni haitta no de, wakamono wa sono atama ni abura o sosoide kare ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Watashi wa anata ni abura o sosoide, Shu no tami Isuraeru no ou to suru.
Anata wa shukun Ahabu no ie o uchi horobosanakereba naranai. Sore ni yotte watashi wa, watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi no chi to, Shu no subete no shimobetachi no chi o Izeberu ni mukuiru.
Ahabu no zenka wa horobirude arou. Ahabu ni zokusuru otoko wa, Isuraeru ni ite, tsunagareta mono mo, jiyuu na mono mo, kotogotoku watashi wa tachi,
Ahabu no ie o Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no you ni shi, Ahiya no ko Baasha no ie no you ni suru.
Inu ga Izureru no chiiki de Izeberu o kui, kanojo o houmuru mono wa naide arou' ". Soshite kare wa to o akete nigesatta.
Yagate Ehiu ga shukun no keraitachi no tokoro e dete kuruto, karera wa Ehiu ni itta, "Kawatta koto wa arimasen ka. Ano kichigai wa, nan no tame ni anata no tokoro ni kita no desu ka". Ehiu wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa, ano hito o shitte imasu. Mata sono iu koto mo shitte imasu".
Karera wa itta, "Sore wa chigaimasu. Douzo wareware ni hanashite kudasai". Soko de Ehiu wa itta, "Kare wa kou kou, watashi ni tsugete iimashita, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa anata ni abura o sosoide, Isuraeru no ou to suru' ".
Suruto karera wa isoide, onoono ifuku o tori, sore o kaidan no ue no Ehiu no shita ni shiki, rappa o fuite "Ehiu wa ou de aru" to itta.
Kou shite Nimushi no ko de aru Yoshapate no ko Ehiu wa Yoramu ni somuita. (Yoramu wa Isuraeru o kotogotoku hikiite, ramote gireade de Suriya no ou Hazaeru o fuseidaga,
Yoramu ou wa Suriya no ou Hazaeru to tatakatta toki ni, Suriya bito ni owasareta kizu o iyasu tame, Ezureru ni kaette ita.) Ehiu wa itta, "Moshi kore ga anata gata no honshin de arunaraba, hitori mo kono machi kara shinobidete, kore o Ezureru ni tsugete wa naranai".
Soshite Ehiu wa kuruma ni notte Ezureru e itta. Yoramu ga soko ni fushite itakara de aru. Mata Yuda no ou Ahajiya wa Yoramu o mimau tame ni kudatte ita.
Sate Ezureru no yagura ni, hitori no monomi ga tatte itaga, Ehiu no gunshuu ga kuru no o mite, "Gunshuu ga mieru" to itta no de, Yoramu wa itta, "Hitori o uma ni nosete tsukawashi, sore ni awasete 'Heian desu ka' to iwase nasai".
Soko de hitori ga uma ni notte iki, kare ni atte itta, "Ou wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Heian desu ka' ". Ehiu itta, "Anata wa heian to nan no kankei ga arimasu ka. Watashi no ato ni tsuite ki nasai". Monomi wa mata tsugete itta, "Shisha wa karera no tokoro e ikimashitaga, kaette kimasen".
Soko de futatabi hito o uma de tsukawashita no de, karera no tokoro e itte itta, "Ou wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Heian desu ka' ". Ehiu wa kotaete itta, "Anata wa heian to nan no kankei ga arimasu ka. Watashi no ato ni tsuite ki nasai".
Monomi wa mata tsugete itta, "Kare mo, karera no tokoro e ikimashitaga kaette kimasen. Ano kuruma no soujuu wa Nimushi no ko Ehiu no soujuu suru no ni nite, mouretsu na ikioi de soujuu shite kimasu".
Soko de Yoramu ga "Kuruma o youi seyo" to itta no de, kuruma o youi suruto, Isuraeru no ou Yoramu to, Yuda no ou Ahajiya wa, onoono sono kuruma de dete itta. Sunawachi Ehiu ni au tame ni dete itte, Ezureru bito Nabote no jisho de kare ni atta.
Yoramu wa Ehiu o mite itta, "Ehiu yo, heian desu ka". Ehiu wa kotaeta, "Anata no haha Izeberu no kan'in to majutsu to ga, konna ni ooi no ni, dou shite heian de ari emashou ka".
Sono toki Yoramu wa kuruma o megurashite nige, Ahajiya ni mukatte, "Ahajiya yo, hangyaku desu" to iuto,
Ehiu wa te ni yumi o hikishibotte, Yoramu no ryoukata no aida o ita no de, ya wa kare no shinzou o tsuranuki, kare wa kuruma no naka ni taoreta.
Ehiu wa sono fukukan Bidekaru ni itta, "Kare o toriagete, Ezureru bito Nabote no hatake ni nagesute nasai. Katsute, watashi to anata to, futari tomo ni notte, kare no chichi Ahabu ni shitagatta toki, Shu ga kare ni tsuite, kono yogen o sareta koto o kioku shi nasai.
Sunawachi Shu wa iwareta, 'Makoto ni, watashi wa kinou Nabote no chi to, sono kora no chi o mita'. Mata Shu wa iwareta, 'Watashi wa kono jisho de anata ni houfuku suru' to. Sore yue kare o toriagete, sono jisho ni nagesute, Shu no kotoba no you ni shi nasai".
Yuda no ou Ahajiya wa kore o mite Betehagan no hou e nigetaga, Ehiu wa sono ato o oi, "Kare o mo ute" to itta no de, Ibureamu no hotori no Guru no saka de kuruma no naka no kare o utta. Kare wa Megido made nigete itte, soko de shinda.
Sono keraitachi wa kare o kuruma ni nosete Erusaremu ni hakobi, Dabide no machi de kare no haka ni sono senzotachi to tomo ni houmutta.
Ahabu no ko Yoramu no daijuu ichi nen ni Ahajiya wa Yuda no ou to natta no de aru.
Ehiu ga Ezureru ni kita toki, Izeberu wa sore o kiite, sono me o nuri, kami o kazatte mado kara nozomimitaga,
Ehiu ga mon ni haitte kita no de, "Shukun o koroshita Jimuri yo, buji desu ka" to itta.
Suru to Ehiu wa kao o agete mado ni mukai, "Dare ka, watashi ni mikata suru mono ga aru ka. Dare ka aru ka" to iuto, nisannin no kangan ga Ehiu o nozomimita no de,
Ehiu wa "Kanojo o nageotose" to itta. Karera wa kanojo o nageotoshita no de, sono chi ga kabe to uma to ni hane kakatta. Soshite uma wa kanojo o fumitsuketa.
Ehiu wa uchi ni haitte kui nomi shi, soshite itta, "Ano norowareta onna o mi, kanojo o houmuri nasai. Kanojo wa ou no musume na no da".
Shikashi karera ga kanojo o houmurou to shite itte miruto, zugaikotsu to, ashi to, tanagokoro no hoka nani mo nakatta no de,
Kaette, kare ni tsugeruto, kare wa itta, "Kore wa Shu ga, sono shimobe, Teshibe bito Eriya ni yotte otsuge ni natta kotoba de aru. Sunawachi 'Ezureru no chi de inu ga Izeberu no niku o kuude arou.
Izeberu no shitai wa Ezureru no chi de, fundo no you ni no no omote ni suterarete, dare mo, kore wa Izeberu da, to iu koto ga dekinaide arou' ".
Ahabu wa Samariya ni nanajuunin no kodomo ga atta. Ehiu wa tegami o shitatamete Samariya ni okuri, machi no tsukasatachi to, chouroutachi to, Ahabu no kodomo no moriyakutachi to ni tsutaete itta,
"Anata gata no shukun no kodomotachi ga anata gata to tomo ni ori, mata sensha mo uma mo, kengo na machi mo buki mo aru no dakara, kono tegami ga anata gata no moto ni todoitanaraba, sugu,
Anata gata wa shukun no kodomotachi no uchi mottomo sugureta, mottomo tekitou na mono o erande, sono chichi no kurai ni sue, shukun no ie no tame ni tatakai nasai".
Karera wa ooini osorete itta, "Futari no outachi ga sudeni kare ni ataru koto ga dekinakatta no ni, wareware ga dou shite ataru koto ga dekiyou".
Soko de kyuutei no tsukasa, machi no tsukasa, chouroutachi to moriyakutachi wa Ehiu ni hito o tsukawashite itta, "Watashitachi wa, anata no shimobe desu. Subete anata ga meijirareru koto o itashimasu. Watashitachi wa ou o tateru koto o konomimasen. Anata ga yoi to omowareru koto o shite kudasai".
Soko de Ehiu wa futatabi karera ni tegami o kakiokutte itta, "Moshi anata ga taga, watashi ni mikata shi, watashi ni shitagaou to surunaraba, anata gata no shukun no kodomotachi no kubi o totte, asu no imagoro Ezureru ni iru watashi no moto ni motte ki nasai". Sono koro, ou no kodomotachi nanajuunin wa karera o sodatete ita machi no omo datta hitobito to tomo ni ita.
Karera wa sono tegami o uketoruto, ou no kodomotachi o toraete, sono nanajuunin o kotogotoku koroshi, sono kubi o kago ni tsumete, Ezureru ni iru Ehiu no moto ni okutta.
Shisha ga kite, Ehiu ni tsuge, "Hitobito ga ou no kodomotachi no kubi o motte kimashita" to iuto, "Akuru asa made sore o mon no iriguchi ni, futa yama ni tsunde oke" to itta.
Asa ni naruto, kare wa dete itte tachi, subete no tami ni itta, "Anata gata wa tadashii. Shukun ni somuite kare o koroshita no wa watashi desu. Shikashi kono subete no monodomo o koroshita no wa dare desu ka.
Kore de anata gata wa, Shu ga Ahabu no ie ni tsuite tsugerareta Shu no kotoba wa hitotsu mo chi ni ochinai koto o shiri nasai. Shu wa, sono shimobe Eriya ni yotte otsuge ni natta koto o nashitogerareta no desu".
Kou shite Ehiu wa, Ahabu no ie ni zokusuru mono de Ezureru ni nokotte iru mono o kotogotoku koroshi, mata sono subete no omo datta mono, sono shitashii mono oyobi sono saishitachi o koroshite, kare ni zokusuru mono wa hitori mo nokosanakatta.
Sate Ehiu wa tatte Samariya e ittaga, tochuu, bokusha no atsumari ba de,
Yuda no ou Ahajiya no miuchi no hitobito ni ai, "Anata gata wa donata desu ka" to iuto, "Watashitachi wa Ahajiya no miuchi no mono desuga, ou no kodomotachi to, ouhaha no kodomotachi no anpi o tou tame ni kudatte kita no desu" to kotaeta no de,
Ehiu wa "Karera o ikedore" to meijita. Soko de karera o ikedotte, atsumari ba no ana no katawara de karera yonjuu ninin o kotogotoku koroshi, hitori o mo nokosanakatta.
Ehiu wa soko o tatte ittaga, jibun o mukae ni kita Rekabu no ko Yonadabu ni atta no de, kare ni aisatsu shite, "Anata no kokoro wa, watashi ga anata ni taisuru you ni shinjitsu desu ka" to iuto, Yonadabu wa "Shinjitsu desu" to kotaeta. Suru to Ehiu wa "Sore naraba, anata no te o watashi ni nobe nasai" to itta no de, sono te o noberuto, kare o hiite jibun no kuruma ni noborase,
"Watashi to issho ni kite, watashi ga Shu ni nesshin na no o mi nasai" to itta. Soshite kare o jibun no kuruma ni nose,
Samariya e itte, Ahabu ni zokusuru mono de, Samariya ni nokotte iru mono o kotogotoku koroshite, sono ichizoku o horoboshita. Shu ga Eriya ni otsuge ni natta kotoba no toori de aru.
Tsuide Ehiu wa tami o kotogotoku atsumete karera ni itta, "Ahabu wa sukoshi bakari Baaru ni tsukaetaga, Ehiu wa ooini kore ni tsukaerude arou.
Sore yue, ima Baaru no subete no yogensha, subete no reihaisha, subete no saishi o watashi no moto ni meshi nasai. Hitori mo konai mono no nai you ni shi nasai. Watashi wa ooinaru gisei o Baaru ni sasageyou to shite iru. Subete konai mono wa ikashite okanai". Shikashi Ehiu wa Baaru no reihaisha tachi o horobosu tame ni itsuwatte kou shita no de aru.
Soshite Ehiu wa "Baaru no tame ni seikai o moyooshi nasai" to meijita no de, karera wa kore o fukoku shita.
Ehiu wa amaneku Isuraeru ni hito o tsukawashita no de, Baaru no reihaisha tachi wa kotogotoku kita. Konaide nokotta mono wa hitori mo nakatta. Karera wa Baaru no miya ni haitta no de, Baaru no miya wa tan kara tan made ippai ni natta.
Sono toki Ehiu wa ishou o tsukasadoru mono ni "Saifuku o toridashite Baaru no subete no reihaisha ni ataeyo" to itta no de, karera no tame ni saifuku o toridashita.
Soshite Ehiu wa Rekabu no ko Yonadabu to tomo ni Baaru no miya ni hairi, Baaru no reihaisha tachi ni itta, "Shirabete mite, koko ni wa tada Baaru no reihaisha nomi de, Shu no shimobe wa hitori mo, anata gata no uchi ni inai you ni shi nasai".
Kou shite kare wa gisei to hansai to o sasageru tame ni haitta. Sate Ehiu wa hachijuunin no mono o soto ni oite itta, "Watashi ga anata gata no te ni watasu mono o hitori de mo nogasu mono wa, jibun no inochi o motte sono hito no inochi ni kaenakereba naranai".
Kou shite hansai o sasageru koto ga owatta toki, Ehiu wa sono jiei to shoukoutachi ni itta, "Hai tte karera o korose. Hitori mo nigashite wa naranai". Jiei to shoukoutachi wa tsurugi o motte karera o uchikoroshi, sore o nagedashite, Baaru no miya no honden ni hairi,
Baaru no miya ni aru hashira no zou o toridashite, sore o yaita.
Mata karera wa Baaru no sekichuu o kowashi, Baaru no miya o kowashite, kawaya to shitaga konnichi made nokotte iru.
Kono you ni Ehiu wa Isuraeru no uchi kara Baaru o issou shita.
Shikashi Ehiu wa Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi, sunawachi Beteru to Dan ni aru kin no koushi ni tsukaeru koto o yamenakatta.
Shu wa Ehiu ni iwareta, "Anata wa watashi no me ni kanau koto o okonau ni atatte, yoku sore o okonai, mata watashi no kokoro ni aru subete no koto o Ahabu no ie ni shita no de, anata no shison wa yon dai made Isuraeru no kurai ni zasurude arou".
Shikashi Ehiu wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu no rippou o kokoro o tsukushite mamori okonaou to wa sezu, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Yarabeamu no tsumi o hanarenakatta.
Kono toki ni atatte, Shu wa Isuraeru no ryouchi o kiritoru koto o hajimerareta. Sunawachi Hazaeru wa Isuraeru no subete no ryouiki o okashi,
Yorudan no higashi de, Gireade no zenchi, Kado bi to, Ruben bi to, Manase bito no chi o okashi, Arunon kawa no hotori ni aru Aroeru kara Gireade to Bashan ni oyonda.
Ehiu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi sono buyuu wa, kotogotoku Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Ehiu wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, kare o Samariya ni houmutta. Sono ko Ehoahazu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Ehiu ga Samariya de Isuraeru o osameta no wa nijuu hachi nen de atta.
Sate Ahajiya no haha Atariya wa sono ko no shinda no o mite, tatte ou no ichizoku o kotogotoku horoboshitaga,
Yoramu ou no musume de, Ahajiya no shimai de aru Ehoshiba wa Ahajiya no ko Yoashi o, korosareyou to shite iru ou no kotachi no uchi kara nusumitori, kare to sonou bato o shinshitsu ni irete, Atariya ni kakushita no de, kare wa tsuini korosarenakatta.
Yoashi wa uba to tomo ni roku nen no aida, Shu no miya ni kakurete itaga, sono kan Atariya ga kuni o osameta.
Dainana nen ni natte Ehoyada wa hito o tsukawashite, Kari bito to konoe hei to no taishoutachi o manekiyose, Shu no miya ni iru jibun no moto ni kosase, karera to keiyaku o musubi, Shu no miya de karera ni chikai o sasete ou no ko o mise,
Meijite itta, "Anata gata no suru koto wa kore desu, sunawachi, ansokunichi ni hiban to natte ou no ie o mamoru anata gata no sanbun no ichi wa,
Kyuuden o mamoranakereba naranai. (ta no sanbun no ichi wa Suru no mon ni ori, sanbun no ichi wa konoe hei no ushiro no mon ni oru).
Subete ansokunichi ni touban de Shu no miya o mamoru anata gata no futatsu no butai wa,
Onoono no buki o te ni totte ou no mawari ni tatanakereba naranai. Subete retsu ni chikayoru mono wa korosarenakereba naranai. Anata gata wa ou ga deru toki ni mo, wa iru toki ni mo ou to tomo ni inakereba naranai".
Soko de sono taishoutachi wa saishi Ehoyada ga subete meijita toori ni okonatta. Sunawachi karera wa onoono ansokunichi ni hiban to naru mono to, ansokunichi ni touban to naru mono to o hikiite saishi Ehoyada no moto ni kita no de,
Saishi wa Shu no miya ni aru Dabide ou no yari to tate o taishoutachi ni watashita.
Konoe hei wa onoono te ni buki o totte Shu no miya no minamigawa kara kitagawa made, saidan to miya o torimaite tatta.
Soko de Ehoyada wa ou no ko o tsuredashite kanmuri o itadakase, rippou no sho o watashi, kare o ou to sengen shite abura o sosoida no de, hitobito wa te o utte "Ou banzai" to itta.
Atariya wa konoe hei to tami no koe o kiite, Shu no miya ni hairi, tami no tokoro e itte,
Miruto, ou wa kanrei ni shitagatte hashira no katawara ni tachi, ou no katawara ni wa taishoutachi to rappa tetachi ga tachi, mata kuni no tami wa mina yorokonde rappa o fuite ita no de, Atariya wa sono koromo o saite, "Hangyaku desu, hangyaku desu" to sakenda.
Sono toki saishi Ehoyada wa gunzei o shiki shite ita taishoutachi ni meijite, "Kanojo o retsu no aida o tootte dete ikase, kanojo ni shitagau mono o tsurugi o motte koroshi nasai" to itta. Kore wa saishi ga saki ni "Kanojo o Shu no miya de koroshite wa naranai" to ittakara de aru.
Soko de karera wa kanojo o torae, ou no ie no umamichi e tsurete ittaga, kanojo wa tsuini soko de korosareta.
Kakute Ehoyada wa Shu to ou oyobi tami to no aida ni, mina Shu no tami to naru to iu keiyaku o tatesase, mata ou to tami to no aida ni mo sore o tatesaseta.
Soko de kuni no tami wa mina Baaru no miya ni itte, kore o kowashi, sono saidan to sono zou o uchikudaki, Baaru no saishi Mattan o sono saidan no mae de koroshita. Soshite saishi wa Shu no miya ni kanrihito o oita.
Tsuide Ehoyada wa taishoutachi to, Kari bito to, konoe hei to kuni no subete no tami o hikiite, Shu no miya kara ou o michibiki kudari, konoe hei no mon no michi kara ou no ie ni hairi, ou no kurai ni zaseshimeta.
Kou shite kuni no tami wa mina yorokobi, machi wa Atariya ga ou no ie de tsurugi o motte korosarete nochi, odayaka ni natta.
Yoashi wa kurai ni tsuita toki nanasai de atta.
Yoashi wa Ehiu no dainana nen ni kurai ni tsuki, Erusaremu de yonjuu nen no aida, yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Beerushiba no shusshin de, na o Jibia to itta.
Yoashi wa isshou no aida, Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonatta. Saishi Ehoyada ga kare o oshietakara de aru.
Shikashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta no de, tami wa nao sono takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Yoashi wa saishitachi ni itta, "Subete Shu no miya ni seibetsu shite sasageru gin, sunawachi onoono ga kaserarete, wariate ni shitagatte hitobito no dasu gin, oyobi hitobito ga kokoro kara negatte Shu no miya no motte kuru gin wa,
Kore o saishitachi ga onoono sono shiru hito kara uketori, doko de mo Shu no miya ni yabure no mieru toki wa, sore o motte sono yabure o tsukurowanakereba naranai".
Tokoro ga Yoashi ou no nijuu san nen ni itaru made, saishitachi wa Shu no miya no yabure o tsukurowanakatta.
Sore de, Yoashi ou wa saishi Ehoyada oyobi ta no saishitachi o meshite itta, "Naze, anata gata wa Shu no miya no yabure o tsukurowanai no ka. Anata gata wa mohaya chijin kara gin o ukete wa naranai. Shu no miya no yabure o tsukurou tame ni sore o watashi nasai".
Saishitachi wa kasanete tami kara gin o ukenai koto to, Shu no miya no yabure o tsukurowanai koto to ni doui shita.
Soko de saishi Ehoyada wa hitotsu no hako o tori, sono futa ni ana o akete, sore o Shu no miya no iriguchi no migigawa, saidan no katawara ni oita. Soshite mon o mamoru saishitachi wa Shu no miya ni haitte kuru gin o kotogotoku sono naka ni ireta.
Kou shite sono hako no naka ni gin ga ooku natta no o miruto, ou no shokikan to daisaishi ga nobotte kite, Shu no miya ni aru gin o kazoete fukuro ni tsumeta.
Soshite sono kazoeta gin o, kouji o tsukasadoru Shu no miya no kantokumono no te ni watashita no de, karera wa sore o Shu no miya ni hataraku mokkou to kenchikushi ni harai,
Ishiku oyobi ishikiri ni harai, mata sore o motte Shu no miya no yabure o tsukurou zaimoku to kiriishi o kai, Shu no miya o tsukurou tame ni mochiiru subete no mono no tame ni tsuiyashita.
Tadashi, Shu no miya ni haitte kuru sono gin o motte Shu no miya no tame ni gin no tarai, shinkiri basami, hachi, rappa, kin no utsuwa, gin no utsuwa nado o tsukuru koto wa shinakatta.
Tada kore o kouji o suru mono ni watashite, sore de Shu no miya o tsukurowaseta.
Mata sono gin o watashite kouji o suru mono ni harawaseta hitobito to keisan suru koto wa shinakatta. Karera wa shoujiki ni koto o okonattakara de aru.
Kensai no gin to zaisai no gin wa Shu no miya ni, hairanaide, saishi ni kishita.
Sono koro, Suriya no ou Hazaeru ga nobotte kite, Gate o semete kore o totta. Soshite Hazaeru ga Erusaremu ni semenoborou to shite, sono kao o muketa toki,
Yuda no ou Yoashi wa sono senzo, Yuda no ou Yoshapate, Yoramu, Ahajiya ga seibetsu shite sasageta subete no mono, oyobi Yoashi jishin ga seibetsu shite sasageta mono, narabi ni Shu no miya no kura to, Shu no miya ni aru kin o kotogotoku totte, Suriya ou no Hazaeru ni okutta no de, Hazaeru wa Erusaremu o hanaresatta.
Yoashi no sono ta no jiseki oyobi kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yoashi no keraitachi wa tatte totou o musubi, Shira ni kudaru michi ni aru Miro no ie de Yoashi o koroshita.
Sunawachi sono kerai Shimeate no ko Yozakaru to, Shomeru no ko Yozabade ga kare o utte koroshi, kare o sono senzo to onajiku, Dabide no machi ni houmutta. Sono ko Amajiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Ahajiya no ko Yoashi no dainijuu san nen ni Ehiu no ko Ehoahazu wa Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, juu nana nenyo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o okonai tsuzukete, sore o hanarenakatta.
Soko de Shu wa Isuraeru ni taishite ikari o hasshi, Ehoahazu no chisei no aida, taezu Isuraeru o Suriya no ou Hazaeru no te ni watashi, mata Hazaeru no ko Benehadade no te ni watasareta.
Shikashi Ehoahazu ga Shu ni negaimotometa no de, Shu wa tsuini kore o kikiirerareta. Suriya no ou ni yotte nayamasareta Isuraeru no nayami o miraretakara de aru.
Sore de Shu ga hitori no kyuujosha o Isuraeru ni tamawatta no de, Isuraeru no hitobito wa Suriya bito no te o nogare, mae no you ni jibuntachi no tenmaku ni sumu you ni natta.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu, karera wa Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Yarabeamu no ie no tsumi o hanarezu, sore o okonai tsuzuketa. Mata Ashira no zou mo Samariya ni tatta mama de atta.
Saki ni Suriya no ou ga karera o horoboshi, fumikudaku chiri no you ni shita no de Ehoahazu no gunzei de nokotta mono wa, tada kihei gojuunin, sensha juu ryou, hohei ichi mannin nomi de atta.
Ehoahazu sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi sono buyuu wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Ehoahazu wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, kare o Samariya ni houmutta. Sono ko Yoashi ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Yoashi no daisanjuu nana nen ni, Ehoahazu no ko Yoashi wa Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, juu roku nenyo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no moromoro no tsumi o hanarezu, sore ni ayunda.
Yoashi no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi Yuda no ou Amajiya to tatakatta sono buyuu wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yoashi wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Yarabeamu ga sono kurai ni zashita. Soshite Yoashi wa Isuraeru no outachi to onajikuSamariya ni houmurareta.
Sate Erisha wa shinu byouki ni kakatte itaga, Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa kudatte kite kare no kao no ue ni namida o nagashi, "Waga chichi yo, waga chichi yo, Isuraeru no sensha yo, sono kihei yo" to itta.
Erisha wa kare ni "Yumi to ya o tori nasai" to itta no de, yumi to ya o totta.
Erisha wa mata Isuraeru no ou ni "Yumi ni te o kake nasai" to itta no de, te o kaketa. Suru to Erisha wa jibun no te o ou no te no ue ni oki,
"Higashimuki no mado o ake nasai" to itta no de, sore o akeruto, Erisha wa mata "I nasai" to itta. Kare ga iruto, Erisha wa itta, "Shu no sukui no ya, Suriya ni taisuru sukui no ya. Anata wa Apeku de Suriya bito o uchiyaburi, karera o horoboshi tsukusude arou".
Erisha wa mata "Ya o tori nasai" to itta no de, sore o totta. Erisha wa mata Isuraeru no ou ni "Sore o motte chi o i nasai" to itta no de, san do ite yameta.
Suru to kami no hito wa ikatte itta, "Anata wa go do mo roku do mo irubekide atta. Sou shitanaraba, anata wa Suriya o uchiyaburi, sore o horoboshi tsukusu koto ga dekitade arou. Shikashi ima anata wa sou shinakatta no de, Suriya o uchiyaburu koto wa tada san do dake de arou".
Kou shite Erisha wa shinde houmurareta. Sate Moabu no ryakudatsutai wa toshi ga aratamaru goto ni, kuni ni haitte kuru no o tsune to shita.
Toki ni, hitori no hito o houmurou to suru mono ga attaga, ryakudatsutai o mita no de, sono hito o Erisha no haka ni nageirete satta. Sono hito wa Erisha no hone ni fureruto sugu ikikaette tachiagatta.
Suriya no ou Hazaeru wa Ehoahazu no isshou no aida, Isuraeru o nayamashitaga,
Shu wa Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu to musubareta keiyaku no yue ni Isuraeru o megumi, kore o awaremi, kore o kaerimite horobosu koto o konomazu, nao kore o mimae kara suterarenakatta.
Suriya no ou Hazaeru wa tsuini shinde, sono ko Benehadade ga kawatte ou to natta.
Soko de Ehoahazu no ko Yoashi wa, chichi Ehoahazu ga Hazaeru ni semetorareta machimachi o, Hazaeru no ko Benehadade no te kara torikaeshita. Sunawachi Yoashi wa san do kare o uchiyabutte, Isuraeru no machimachi o torikaeshita.
Isuraeru no ou Ehoahazu no ko Yoashi no daini nen ni, Yuda no ou Yoashi no ko Amajiya ga ou to natta.
Kare wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, nijuu kyuu nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Erusaremu no shusshin de, na o Ehoadan to itta.
Amajiya wa Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonattaga, senzo Dabide no you de wa nakatta. Kare wa subete no koto o chichi Yoashi ga okonatta you ni okonatta.
Tadashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta no de, tami wa nao sono takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Kare wa kuni ga kare no te no uchi ni tsuyoku natta toki, chichi Yoashi ou o satsugai shita keraitachi o koroshitaga,
Sono satsugaisha no kodomotachi wa korosanakatta. Kore wa Moose no rippou no sho ni shirusarete iru tokoro ni shitagatta no de atte, soko ni Shu wa meijite "Chichi wa ko no yue ni korosarubekide wa nai. Ko wa chichi no yue ni korosarubekide wa nai. Onoono jibun no tsumi no yue ni korosarubekide aru" to iwarete iru.
Amajiya wa mata shio no tani de Edomu bito ichi mannin o koroshita. Mata sera o semetotte, sono na o Yokuteru to nazuketaga, konnichi made sono toori de aru.
Soko de Amajiya ga Ehiu no ko Ehoahazu no ko de aru Isuraeru no ou Yoashi ni shisha o tsukawashite, "Saa, wareware wa tagai ni kao o awaseyou" to iwaseta no de,
Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa Yuda no ou Amajiya ni iiokutta, "Katsute Rebanon no ibara ga Rebanon no kouhaku ni, 'Anata no musume o watashi no musuko no tsuma ni kudasai' to iiokutta koto ga attaga, Rebanon no yajuu ga tootte, sono ibara o fumitaoshita.
Anata wa ooini Edomu o utte, kokoro ni takabutte iruga, sono eiyo ni manzoku shite ie ni todomari nasai. Naniyue, anata wa wazawai o hikiokoshite, jibun mo Yuda mo tomo ni horobiru you na koto o suru no desu ka".
Shikashi Amajiya ga kikiirenakatta no de, Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa nobotte kita. Soko de kare to Yuda no ou Amajiya wa Yuda no Beteshimeshi de tagai ni kao o awasetaga,
Yuda wa Isuraeru ni yaburarete, onoono sono tenmaku ni nigekaetta.
Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa Ahajiya no ko Yoashi no ko de aru Yuda no ou Amajiya o Beteshimeshi de torae, Erusaremu ni kite, Erusaremu no jouheki o Efuraimu no mon kara sumi no mon made, ooyoso yonhyaku kyubito ni watatte kowashi,
Mata Shu no miya to ou no ie no kura ni aru kingin oyobi moromoro no utsuwa o kotogotoku tori, katsu hitojichi o totte Samariya ni kaetta.
Yoashi no sono ta no jiseki to, sono buyuu oyobi kare ga Yuda no ou Amajiya to tatakatta koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yoashi wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Isuraeru no outachi to tomo ni Samariya ni houmurare, sono ko Yarabeamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yoashi no ko de aru Yuda no ou Amajiya wa, Ehoahazu no ko de aru Isuraeru no ou Yoashi ga shinde nochi, nao juu go nen ikinagaraeta.
Amajiya no sono ta no jiseki wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Toki ni hitobito ga Erusaremu de totou o musubi, kare ni tekitai shita no de, kare wa Rakishi ni nigete ittaga, sono hitobito wa Rakishi ni hito o tsukawashite kare o soko de korosaseta.
Hitobito wa kare o uma ni nosete hakonde kite, Erusaremu de kare o senzotachi to tomo ni Dabide no machi ni houmutta.
Soshite Yuda no tami wa mina Azariya o chichi Amajiya no kawari ni ou to shita. Toki ni nen juu rokusai de atta.
Kare wa Erate no machi o tatete, kore o Yuda ni fukki saseta. Kore wa kano ou ga sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta nochi de atta.
Yuda no ou Yoashi no ko Amajiya no daijuu go nen ni, Isuraeru no ou Yoashi no ko Yara be Amu ga Samariya de ou to natte yonjuu ichi nen no aida, yo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o hanarenakatta.
Kare wa Hamate no iriguchi kara Araba no umi made, Isuraeru no ryouiki o kaifuku shita. Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga Gateheperu no Amitai no ko de aru, sono shimobe yogensha Yona ni yotte iwareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Shu wa Isuraeru no nayami no hijou ni hageshii no o mirareta. Soko ni wa tsunagareta mono mo, jiyuu na mono mo inaku nari, mata Isuraeru o tasukeru mono mo inakatta.
Shikashi Shu wa Isuraeru no na o amegashita kara keshisarou to wa iwarenakatta. Soshite karera o Yoashi no ko Yarabeamu no te ni yotte sukuwareta.
Yarabeamu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto oyobi sono buyuu, sunawachi kare ga sensou o shita koto oyobi, katsute Yuda ni zokushite ita Damasuko to Hamate o, Isuraeru ni fukki saseta koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yarabeamu wa sono senzo de aru Isuraeru no outachi to tomo ni nemutte, sono ko Zekariya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Isuraeru no ou Yarabeamu no dainijuu shichi nen ni, Yuda no ou Amajiya no ko Azariya ga ou to natta.
Kare ga ou to natta toki wa juu rokusai de, gojuu ni nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Erusaremu no shusshin de, na o Ekoria to itta.
Kare wa Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonai, subete no koto o chichi Amajiya ga itta you ni okonatta.
Tadashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta no de, tami wa nao sono takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Shu ga ou o utareta no de, sono shinu hi made, raibyounin to natte, hanareya ni sunda. Ou no ko Yotamu ga ie no koto o kanri shi, kuni no tami o sabaita.
Azariya no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Azariya wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, kare o Dabide no machi ni sono senzotachi to tomo ni houmutta. Sono ko Yotamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Azariya no daisanjuu hachi nen ni Yarabeamu no ko Zekariya ga Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, roku kagetsuyo o osameta.
Kare wa sono senzotachi ga okonatta you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o hanarenakatta.
Yabeshi no ko Sharumu ga totou o musunde kare ni tekishi, Ibureamu de kare o uchikoroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Zekariya no sono ta no jiseki wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Shu wa katsute Ehiu ni, "Anata no shison wa yon dai made Isuraeru no kurai ni zasurude arou" to tsugeraretaga, hatashite sono toori ni natta.
Yabeshi no ko Sharumu wa Yuda no ou Ujiya no daisanjuu kyuu nen ni ou to nari, Samariya de ichi kagetsuyo o osameta.
Toki ni Gade no ko Menahemu ga Teruza kara Samariya ni nobotte kite, Yabeshi no ko Sharumu o Samariya de uchikoroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Sharumu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga totou o musunda koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Sono toki Menahemu wa Teruza kara susunde itte, TaPpua to, sono uchi ni iru subete no mono, oyobi sono ryouiki o utta. Sunawachi karera ga kare no tame ni hirakanakatta no de, kore o utte, sono uchi no ninshin no onna o kotogotoku hikisaita.
Yuda no ou Azariya no daisanjuu kyuu nen ni, Gade no ko Menahemu wa Isuraeru no ou to nari, Samariya de juu nen no aida, yo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o isshou no aida, hanarenakatta.
Toki ni ASsuriya no ou Puru ga kuni ni semete kita no de, Menahemu wa gin issen taranto o Puru ni ataeta. Kore wa kare ga Puru no tasuke o ete, kuni o jibun no te no uchi ni tsuyoku suru tame de atta.
Sunawachi Menahemu wa sono gin o Isuraeru no subete no tomeru mono ni kashi, sono hitobito ni onoono gin gojuu shikeru o dasasete ASsuriya no ou ni ataeta. Kou shite ASsuriya no ou wa kuni ni todomaranaide kaette itta.
Menahemu no sono ta no jiseki to kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Menahemu wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemuri, sono ko Pekahiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Menahemu no ko Pekahiya wa Yuda no ou Azariya no daigojuu nen ni, Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, ni nen no aida, yo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o hanarenakatta.
Toki ni kare no fukukan de atta Remariya no Peka ga, Gireade bito gojuunin to tomo ni totou o musunde kare ni tekishi, Samariya no, ou no kyuuden no tenshu de kare o uchikoroshita. Sunawachi Peka wa kare o koroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Pekahiya no sono ta no jiseki to kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Remariya no ko Peka wa Yuda no ou Azariya no daigojuu ni nen ni, Samariya de Isuraeru no ou to nari, nijuu nen no aida, yo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonai, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu no tsumi o hanarenakatta.
Isuraeru no ou Peka no yo ni, ASsuriya no ou Teguratepireseru ga kite, Iyon, Aberu Betemaaka, Yanoa, Kedeshi, Hazoru, Gireade, Gariraya, Nafutari no zenchi o tori, hitobito o ASsuriya e toraeutsushita.
Toki ni Era no ko Hosea wa totou o musunde, Remariya no ko Peka ni tekishi, kare o uchikoroshi, kare ni kawatte ou to natta. Kore wa Ujiya no ko Yotamu no dainijuu nen de atta.
Peka no sono ta no jiseki to kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Isuraeru no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Remariya no ko Isuraeru no ou Peka no daini nen ni, Yuda no ou Ujiya no ko Yotamu ga ou to natta.
Kare wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de attaga, Erusaremu de juu roku nen no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Zadoku no musume de, na o Erusha to itta.
Kare wa Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonai, subete chichi Ujiya no itta you ni okonatta.
Tadashi takaki tokoro wa nozokanakatta no de, tami wa nao sono takaki tokoro de gisei o sasage, kou o taita. Kare wa Shu no miya no ue no mon o tateta.
Yotamu no sono ta no jiseki to kare ga shita subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Sono koro, Shu wa Suriya no ou Rejin to Remariya no ko Peka o Yuda ni seme kosaserareta.
Yotamu wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, sono senzo Dabide no machi ni senzotachi to tomo ni houmurare, sono ko Ahazu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Remariya no ko Peka no daijuu nana nen ni Yuda no ou Yotamu no ko Ahazu ga ou to natta.
Ahazu wa ou to natta toki hatachi de, Erusaremu de juu roku nen no aida, yo o osametaga, sono kami, Shu no me ni kanau koto o senzo Dabide no you ni wa okonawanakatta.
Kare wa Isuraeru no outachi no michi ni ayumi, mata Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta ihoujin no nikumubeki okonai ni shitagatte, jibun no ko o hi ni yaite sasagemono to shita.
Katsu kare wa takaki tokoro, mata oka no ue, subete no aoki no shita de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Sono koro, Suriya no ou Rejin oyobi Remariya no ko de aru Isuraeru no ou Peka ga Erusaremu ni semenobotte, Ahazu o kakondaga, katsu koto ga dekinakatta.
Sono toki Edomu no ou wa Erate o kaifuku shite Edomu no shoryou to shi, Yuda no hitobito o Erate kara oidashita. Soshite Edomu bito ga Erate ni kite, soko ni sumi, konnichi ni itatte iru.
Soko de Ahazu wa shisha o ASsuriya no ou Teguratepireseru ni tsukawashite iwaseta, "Watashi wa anata no shimobe, anata no ko desu. Suriya no ou to Isuraeru no ou ga watashi o semekakonde imasu. Douzo nobotte kite, karera no te kara watashi o sukuidashite kudasai".
Soshite Ahazu wa Shu no miya to ou no ie no kura ni aru kin to gin o tori, kore o okurimono to shite ASsuriya no ou ni okutta no de,
ASsuriya no ou wa kare no negai o kikiireta. Sunawachi ASsuriya no ou wa Damasuko ni semenobotte, kore o tori, sono tami o Kiru ni toraeutsushi, mata Rejin o koroshita.
Ahazu ou wa ASsuriya no ou Teguratepireseru ni aou to Damasuko e ittaga, Damasuko ni aru saidan o mita no de, Ahazu ou wa sono saidan no tsukuri ni shitagatte, sono kuwashii zumen to, hinagata to o tsukutte, saishi Uriya ni okutta.
Soko de saishi Uriya wa Ahazu ou ga Damasuko kara okutta mono ni shitagatte saidan o tateta. Sunawachi saishi Uriya wa Ahazu ou ga Damasuko kara kaeru made ni sono toori ni tsukutta.
Ou wa Damasuko kara kaette kite, sono saidan o mi, saidan ni chikazuite sono ue ni nobori,
Hansai to sosai o yaki, kansai o sosogi, shuuonsai no chi o saidan ni sosogi kaketa.
Kare wa mata Shu no mae ni atta seidou no saidan o miya no mae kara utsushita. Sunawachi sore o atarashii saidan to Shu no miya no aida kara utsushite, atarashii saidan no kita no hou ni sueta.
Soshite Ahazu ou wa saishi Uriya ni meijite itta, "Asa no hansai to yuu no sosai oyobi ou no hansai to sono sosai, narabi ni kunijyuu no tami no hansai to sono sosai oyobi kansai wa, kono ookina saidan no ue de yaki nasai. Mata hansai no chi to gisei no chi wa subete kore ni sosogi kake nasai. Ano seidou no saidan o watashi wa ukagai o tateru no ni mochiiyou".
Saishi Uriya wa Ahazu ou ga subete meijita toori ni okonatta.
Mata Ahazu ou wa dai no kagamiita o kiritotte, senban o sono ue kara utsushi, mata umi o sono shita ni aru seidou no ushi no ue kara oroshite, ishi no za no ue ni sue,
Mata miya no uchi ni tsukurarete ita ansokunichi you no ooi no aru michi, oyobi ou no mochiiru soto no iriguchi o ASsuriya no ou no tame ni Shu no miya kara nozoita.
Ahazu no sono ta no jiseki wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Ahazu wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni sono senzotachi to tomo ni houmurare, sono ko Hizekiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yuda no ou Ahazu no daijuu ni nen ni Era no ko Hosea ga ou to nari, Samariya de kyuu nen no aida, Isuraeru o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonattaga, kare izen no Isuraeru no outachi no you de wa nakatta.
ASsuriya no ou Sharumaneseru ga semenobotta no de, Hosea wa kare ni reizoku shite, mitsugi o osametaga,
ASsuriya no ou wa Hosea ga tsuini jibun ni somuita no o shitta. Sore wa Hosea ga shisha o Ejiputo no ou So ni tsukawashi, mata nennen osamete ita mitsugi o, ASsuriya no ou ni osamenakattakara de aru. Soko de ASsuriya no ou wa kare o kankin shi, gokuya ni tsunaida.
Soshite ASsuriya no ou wa semenobotte kunijyuu o okashi, Samariya ni nobotte kite san nen no aida, kore o semekakonda.
Hosea no daikyuu nen ni natte, ASsuriya no ou wa tsuiniSamariya o tori, Isuraeru no hitobito o ASsuriya ni toraete itte, Hara to, Gozan no kawa Haboru no hotori to, Medea no machimachi ni oita.
Kono koto ga tatta no wa, Isuraeru no hitobito ga, jibuntachi o Ejiputo no chi kara michibiki nobotte, Ejiputo no ou Paro no te o nogaresaserareta sono kami, Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, ta no kamigami o uyamai,
Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta ihoujin no narawashi ni shitagatte ayumi, mata Isuraeru no outachi ga sadameta narawashi ni shitagatte ayundakara de aru.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa sono kami, Shu ni mukatte tadashikara nu koto o hisoka ni okonai, mihari dai kara kengo na machi ni itaru made, subete no machimachi ni takaki tokoro o tate,
Mata subete no takai oka no ue, subete no aoki no shita ni ishi no hashira to Ashira zou o tate,
Shu ga karera no mae kara toraeutsusareta ihoujin ga shita you ni, subete no takaki tokoro de kou o taki, akuji o itte, Shu o ikaraseta.
Mata Shu ga karera ni "Anata gata wa kono koto o shite wa naranai" to iwareta no ni guuzou ni tsukaeta.
Shu wa subete no yogensha, subete no senkensha ni yotte Isuraeru to Yuda o imashime, "Hirugaette, anata gata no warui michi o hanare, watashi ga anata gata no senzotachi ni meiji, mata watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte anata gata ni tsutaeta subete no rippou no toori ni, watashi no imashime to sadame to o mamore" to ooseraretaga,
Karera wa kikiirezu, karera no senzotachi ga sono kami, Shu o shinjinaide, goujou de atta you ni, karera wa goujou de atta.
Soshite karera wa Shu no sadame o sute, Shu ga karera no senzotachi to musubareta keiyaku o yaburi, mata karera ni ataerareta keikoku o karunji, katsu munashii guuzou ni shitagatte munashiku nari, mata shuui no ihoujin ni shitagatta. Kore wa Shu ga, karera no you ni okonatte wa naranaito karera ni meijirareta mono de aru.
Karera wa sono kami, Shu no subete no imashime o sute, jibun no tame ni futatsu no koushi no zou o ite tsukuri, mata Ashira zou o tsukuri, ten no banshou o ogami, katsu Baaru ni tsukae,
Mata sono musuko, musume o hi ni yaite sasagemono to shi, uranai oyobi majinai o nashi, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonau koto ni mi o yudanete, Shu o ikaraseta.
Sore yue, Shu wa ooini Isuraeru o ikari, karera o mimae kara nozokareta no de, Yuda no buzoku no hoka nokotta mono wa nakatta.
Tokoro ga Yuda mo mata sono kami, Shu no imashime o mamorazu, Isuraeru ga sadameta narawashi ni ayunda no de,
Shu wa Isuraeru no shison o kotogotoku sute, karera o kurushime, karera o ryakudatsusha no te ni watashite, tsuini karera o mimae kara uchisuterareta.
Shu wa Isuraeru o Dabide no ie kara saki hanasareta no de, Isuraeru wa Nebate no ko Yarabeamu o ou to shitaga, Yarabeamu wa Isuraeru ni, Shu ni shitagau koto o yamesase, ookina tsumi o okasaseta.
Isuraeru no hitobito ga Yarabeamu no okonatta subete no tsumi o okonai tsuzukete, sore o hanarenakatta no de,
Tsuini Shu wa sono shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte iwareta you ni, Isuraeru o mimae kara nozokisarareta. Kou shite Isuraeru wa jibun no kuni kara ASsuriya ni utsusarete konnichi ni itatte iru.
Kakute ASsuriya no ou wa Babiron, Kuta, Awa, Hamate oyobi Separuwaimu kara hitobito o tsurete kite, kore o Isuraeru no hitobito no kawari ni Samariya no machimachi ni oraseta no de, sono hitobito wa Samariya o ryouyuu shite, sono machimachi ni sunda.
Karera ga soko ni sumi hajimeta toki, Shu o uyamau koto o shinakatta no de, Shu wa karera no uchi ni shishi o okuri, shishi wa karera no uchi no suunin o koroshita.
Soko de hitobito wa ASsuriya no ou ni tsugete itta, "Anata ga utsushite Samariya no machimachi ni oraserareta ano kuniguni no tami wa, sono chi no kami no okite o shiranai yue ni, sono kami wa karera no uchi ni shishi o okuri, shishi wa karera o koroshita. Kore wa karera ga, sono chi no kami no okite o shiranai tame desu".
ASsuriya no ou wa meijite itta, "Anata gata ga asoko kara utsushita saishi no hitori o asoko e tsurete iki nasai. Kare o asoko e yatte sumawase, sono kuni no kami no okite o sono hitobito ni oshiesase nasai".
Soko de Samariya kara utsusareta saishi no hitori ga kite Beteru ni sumi, dono you ni Shu o uyamaubeki ka o karera ni oshieta.
Shikashi sono tami wa onoono jibun no kamigami o tsukutte, sore o Samariya bito ga tsukutta takaki tokoro no ie ni anchi shita. Tami wa mina sunde iru machimachi de sono you ni okonatta.
Sunawachi Babiron no hitobito wa sukote benote o tsukuri, Kuta no hitobito wa Nerugaru o tsukuri, Hamate no hitobito wa Ashima o tsukuri,
Awa no hitobito wa Nibuhazu to Tarutaku o tsukuri, Separuwaimu bito wa sono ko o hi ni yaite, Separuwaimu no kami Aderanmereku oyobi Ananmereku ni sasageta.
Kare wa mata Shu o uyamai, jibuntachi no uchi kara ippan no tami o tatete takaki tokoro no saishi to shita no de, sono hitobito wa takaki tokoro no ie de tsutome o shita.
Kono you ni karera wa Shu o uyamattaga, mata karera ga dete kita kuniguni no narawashi ni shitagatte, jibuntachi no kamigami ni mo tsukaeta.
Konnichi ni itaru made karera wa saki no narawashi ni shitagatte okonatte iru. Karera wa Shu o uyamawazu, mata Shu ga Isuraeru to nazukerareta Yakobu no shison ni meijirareta sadame ni mo, okite ni mo, rippou ni mo, imashime ni mo shitagawanai.
Shu wa katsute karera to keiyaku o musubi, karera ni meijite iwareta, "Anata gata wa ta no kamigami o uyamatte wa naranai. Mata karera o ogami, karera ni tsukae, karera ni gisei o sasagete wa naranai.
Tada ookina chikara to nobeta ude to o motte, anatagata o Ejiputo no chi kara michibiki nobotta Shu o nomi uyamai, kore o ogami, kore ni gisei o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata anata gata no tame ni kakishirusareta sadame to, okite to, rippou to, imashime to o, tsutsushinde tsune ni mamoranakereba naranai. Ta no kamigami o uyamatte wa naranai.
Watashi ga anata gata to musunda keiyaku o wasurete wa naranai. Mata ta no kamigami o uyamatte wa naranai.
Tada anata gata no kami, Shu o uyamawanakereba naranai. Shu wa anatagata o sono subete no teki no te kara sukuidasarerude arou".
Shikashi karera wa kikiirezu, kaette saki no narawashi ni shitagatte okonatta.
Kono you ni, korera no tami wa Shu o uyamai, mata sono kizanda zou ni mo tsukaetaga, sono kotachi mo, magotachi mo douyou de atte, karera wa sono senzo ga okonatta you ni konnichi made okonatte iru.
Isuraeru no ou Era no ko Hosea no daisan nen ni Yuda no ou Ahazu no ko Hizekiya ga ou to natta.
Kare wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, Erusaremu de nijuu kyuu nen no aida, yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Zekariya no musume de, na o Abi to itta.
Hizekiya wa subete senzo Dabide ga okonatta you ni Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonai,
Takaki tokoro o nozoki, sekichuu o kowashi, Ashira zou o kiritaoshi, Moose no tsukutta seidou no hebi o uchikudaita. Isuraeru no hitobito wa kono toki made sono hebi ni mukatte kou o taite itakara de aru. Hitobito wa kore o Nehoshitan to yonda.
Hizekiya wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni shinrai shita. Sono tame ni kare no ato ni mo kare no saki ni mo, Yuda no subete no ou no uchi ni kare ni oyobu mono wa nakatta.
Sunawachi kare wa kataku Shu ni shitagatte hanareru koto naku, Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta meirei o mamotta.
Shu ga kare to tomo ni orareta no de, subete kare ga dete tatakau tokoro de kou o arawashita. Kare wa ASsuriya no ou ni somuite, kare ni tsukaenakatta.
Kare wa Perishite bito o uchi haitte, Gaza to sono ryouiki ni made tasshi, mihari dai kara kengo na machi ni made oyonda.
Hizekiya ou no daiyon nen sunawachi Isuraeru no ou Era no ko Hosea no dainana nen ni, ASsuriya no ou Sharumaneseru wa Samariya ni semenobotte, kore o kakondaga,
San nen no nochi tsuini kore o totta.Samariya ga torareta no wa Hizekiya no dairoku nen de, sore wa Isuraeru no ou Hosea no daikyuu nen de atta.
ASsuriya no ou wa Isuraeru no hitobito o ASsuriya ni toraete itte, Hara to, Gozan no kawa Haboru no hotori to, Medea no machimachi ni oita.
Kore wa karera ga sono kami, Shu no kotoba ni shitagawazu, sono keiyaku o yaburi, Shu no shimobe Moose no meijita subete no koto ni mimi o katamukezu, mata okonawanakattakara de aru.
Hizekiya ou no daijuu yon nen ni ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu ga semenobotte Yuda no subete no kengo na machimachi o totta no de,
Yuda no ou Hizekiya wa hito o Rakishi ni tsukawashite ASsuriya no ou ni itta, "Watashi wa tsumi o okashimashita. Douzo hikiagete kudasai. Watashi ni kaserareru koto wa nan de mo itashimasu". ASsuriya no ou wa gin sanbyaku taranto to kin sanjuu taranto o Yuda no ou Hizekiya ni kashita.
Hizekiya wa Shu no miya to ou no ie no kura to ni aru gin o kotogotoku kare ni ataeta.
Kono toki Yuda no ou Hizekiya wa mata Shu no shinden no to oyobi hashira kara jibun ga kiseta kin o hagitotte, ASsuriya no ou ni ataeta.
ASsuriya no ou wa mata Tarutan, Rabusarisu oyobi Rabushake o, Rakishi kara taigun o hikiite Erusaremu ni iru Hizekiya ou no moto ni tsukawashita. Karera wa nobotte Erusaremu ni kita. Karera wa Erusaremu ni tsukuto, nuno sarashiba ni iku ooji ni sotte iru ue no ike no suidou no katawara e itte, soko ni tatta.
Soshite karera ga ou o yonda no de, Hirukiya no ko de aru kunaikyou Eriakimu, shokikan Sebuna, oyobi Asafu no ko de aru shikan Yoa ga karera no tokoro ni dete kita.
Rabushake wa karera ni itta, "Hizekiya ni ii nasai, 'Daiou, ASsuriya no ou wa kou ooserareru. Anata ga tanomi to suru mono wa nani ka.
Kuchisaki dake no kotoba ga sensou o suru keiryaku to chikara da to kangaeru no ka. Anata wa ima dare ni tayotte, watashi ni somuita no ka.
Ima anata wa, ano ore kakete iru ashi no tsue, Ejiputo o tanomi to shite iruga, sore wa hito ga yorikakaru toki, sono hito no te o sashitoosude arou. Ejiputo no ou Paro wa subeteyori tanomu mono ni sono you ni suru.
Shikashi anata ga moshi "Wareware wa, wareware no kami, Shu o tanomu" to watashi ni iu no de areba, sono kami wa Hizekiya ga Yuda to Erusaremu ni tsugete, "Anata gata wa Erusaremu de, kono saidan no mae ni reihai shinakereba naranai" to itte, sono takaki tokoro to saidan to o nozoita mono de wa nai ka.
Saa, watashi no shukun Assuriya no ou to kake o seyo. Moshi anata no hou ni noru hito ga arunaraba, watashi wa uma nisentou o ataeyou.
Anata wa Ejiputo o tanomi, sensha to kihei o koimotomete iruga, watashi no shukun no kerai no uchi no mottomo chiisai ichi taichou de sae, dou shite gekitai suru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi ga kono tokoro o horobosu tame ni nobotte kita no wa, Shu no yurushi nashi ni shita koto de arou ka. Shu ga watashi ni kono chi ni semenobotte kore o horobose to iwareta no da' ".
Sono toki Hirukiya no ko Eriakimu oyobi Sebuna to Yoa wa Rabushake ni itta, "Douzo, Aramu go de shimobedomo ni hanashite kudasai. Watashitachi wa, sore ga wakarukara desu. Jouheki no ue ni iru tami no kiite iru tokoro de, watashitachi ni Yudaya no kotoba de hanasanaide kudasai".
Shikashi Rabushake wa karera ni itta, "Watashi no shukun wa, anata no shukun to anata ni dake de naku, jouheki no ue ni zashite iru hitobito ni mo, kono kotoba o tsugeru tame ni watashi o tsukawashita no de wa nai ka. Karera mo, anata gata to tomo ni jibun no funnyou o kui nomi suru ni itarude arou".
Soshite Rabushake wa tachiagari, Yudaya no kotoba de oogoe ni yobawatte itta. "Daiou, ASsuriya no ou no kotoba o kike.
Ou wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata wa Hizekiya ni azamukarete wa naranai. Kare wa anatagata o watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto wa dekinai.
Hizekiya ga "Shu wa kanarazu wareware o sukuidasareru. Kono machi wa ASsuriya ou no te ni ochiiru koto wa nai" to itte mo, anata gata wa Shu o tanomi to shite wa naranai'.
Anata gata wa Hizekiya no kotoba o kiite wa naranai. ASsuriya no ou wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata wa watashi to wakai shite, watashi ni koufuku seyo. Sou sureba anata gata wa onoono jibun no budou no mi o tabe, onoono jibun no ichijiku no mi o tabe, onoono jibun no ido no mizu o nomu koto ga dekirude arou.
Yagate watashi ga kite, anatagata o hitotsu no kuni e tsurete iku. Sore wa anata gata no kuni no you ni kokumotsu to budoushu no aru chi, pan to budou hatake no aru chi, oribu no ki to mitsu no aru chi de aru. Anata gata wa ikinagaraeru koto ga deki, shinu koto wa nai. Hizekiya ga "Shu wa wareware o sukuwareru" to itte, anatagata o madowashite mo kare ni kiite wa naranai.
Shokokumin no kamigami no uchi, dono kami ga sono kuni o ASsuriya no ou no te kara sukutta ka.
Hamate ya Arupade no kamigami wa doko ni iru no ka. Separuwaimu, Hena oyobi Iwa no kamigami wa doko ni iru no ka. Karera wa Samariya o watashi no te kara sukuidashita ka.
Kuniguni no subete no kamigami no uchi, sono kuni o watashi no te kara sukuidashita mono ga atta ka. Shu ga dou shite Erusaremu o watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou' ".
Shikashi tami wa mokushite, hitokoto mo kare ni kotaenakatta. Ou ga meijite "Kare ni kotaete wa naranai" to itte oitakara de aru.
Kou shite Hirukiya no ko de aru kunaikyou Eriakimu, shokikan Sebuna, oyobi Asafu no ko de aru shikan Yoa wa koromo o saki, Hizekiya no moto ni kite, Rabushake no kotoba o kare ni tsugeta.
Hizekiya ou wa kore o kiite, koromo o saki, aranuno o mi ni matotte Shu ni miya ni hairi,
Kunaikyou Eriakimu to shokikan Sebuna oyobi saishi no uchi no nenchousha tachi ni aranuno o matowasete, Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya no moto ni tsukawashita.
Karera wa Izaya ni itta, "Hizekiya wa kou mousaremasu, 'Kyou wa nayami to, kora shimeto, hazukashime no hi desu. Taiji ga masani umareyou to shite, kore o umidasu chikara ga nai no desu.
Anata no kami, Shu wa Rabushake ga sono shukun Assuriya no ou ni tsukawasarete, ikeru kami o soshitta moromoro no kotoba o kikareta ka mo shiremasen. Soshite anata no kami, Shu wa sono kiita kotoba o togamerareru ka mo shiremasen. Sore yue, kono nokotte iru mono no tame ni inori o sasagete kudasai' ".
Hizekiya ou no keraitachi ga Izaya no moto ni kita toki,
Izaya wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no shukun ni kou ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, ASsuriya no ou no keraitachi ga, watashi o soshitta kotoba o kiite osoreru ni wa oyobanai.
Miyo, watashi wa hitotsu no rei o karera no uchi ni okutte, hitotsu no uwasa o kikase, kare o jibun no kuni e kaerasete, jibun no kuni de tsurugi ni taoresaserude arou' ".
Rabushake wa hikikaeshite, ASsuriya no ou ga Ribuna o semete iru tokoro e itta. Kare ga ou no Rakishi o satta koto o kiitakara de aru.
Kono toki ASsuriya no ou wa Echiopiya no ou Teruhaka ni tsuite, "Kare wa anata to tatakau tame ni dete kita" to hitobito ga iu no o kiita no de, futatabi shisha o Hizekiya ni tsukawashite itta,
"Yuda no ou Hizekiya ni kou ii nasai, 'Anata wa, Erusaremu wa ASsuriya no ou no te ni ochiiru koto wa nai, to iu anata no shinrai suru kami ni azamukarete wa naranai.
Anata wa ASsuriya no outachi ga moromoro no kuniguni ni shita koto, karera o mattaku horoboshita koto o kiite iru. Dou shite anata ga sukuwareru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi no chichitachi wa Gozan, Haran, Rezefu, oyobi Terasaru ni ita Eden no hitobito o horoboshitaga, sono kuniguni no kamigami wa karera o sukutta ka.
Hamate no ou, Arupade no ou, Separuwaimu no machi no ou, Hena no ou oyobi Iwa no ou wa doko ni iru no ka' ".
Hizekiya wa shisha no te kara tegami o uketotte sore o yomi, Shu no miya ni nobotte itte, Shu no mae ni sore o hiroge,
Soshite Hizekiya wa Shu no mae ni inotte itta, "Kerubimu no ue ni zashite orareru Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, chi no subete no kuni no uchi de, tada anata dake ga kami de iraseraremasu. Anata wa ten to chi o tsukuraremashita.
Shu yo, mimi o katamukete kiite kudasai. Shu yo, me o hiraite goran kudasai. Senakeribu ga ikeru kami o soshiru tame ni kakiokutta kotoba o okiki kudasai.
Shu yo, makoto ni ASsuriya no outachi wa moromoro no tami to sono kuniguni o horoboshi,
Mata sono kamigami o hi ni nageiremashita. Sorera wa kami de wa naku, hito no te no tsukutta mono de, ki ya ishi dakara horobosareta no desu.
Wareware no kami, Shu yo, douzo, ima wareware o kare no te kara sukuidashite kudasai. Sou sureba chi no kuniguni wa mina, Shu de aru anata dake ga kami de iraserareru koto o shiru you ni narudeshou".
Sono toki Amotsu no ko Izaya wa hito o tsukawashite Hizekiya ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu ni tsuite anata ga watashi ni inotta koto wa kiita'.
Shu ga kare ni tsuite katarareta kotoba wa kou de aru, 'Shojo de aru Shion no musume wa anata o anadori, anata o azakeru. Erusaremu no musume wa anata no ushiro de atama o furu.
Anata wa dare o soshiri, dare o nonoshitta no ka. Anata wa dare ni mukatte koe o age, me o takaku ageta no ka. Isuraeru no seija ni mukatte shita no da.
Anata wa shisha o motte Shu o soshitte itta, "Watashi wa ooku no sensha o hikiite yamayama no itadaki ni nobori, Rebanon no oku ni iki, take no takai kouhaku to mottomo yoi itosugi o kiritaoshi, mata sono hate no yaei chi ni iki, sono mitsurin ni haitta.
Watashi wa ido o hotte gaikoku no mizu o nonda. Watashi wa ashi no ura de, Ejiputo no subete no kawa o fumi karashita".
Anata wa kikanakatta ka, mukashi watashi ga kore o sadameta koto o. Kengo na machimachi o anata ga aratsuka to suru koto mo, inishie no hi kara watashi ga keikaku shite ima kore o okonau no da.
Sono uchi ni sumu tami wa chikara yowaku ononoki, haji o idaite, no no kusa no you ni, aona no you ni nari, sodatanaide kareru yane no kusa no you ni natta.
Watashi wa anata no suwaru koto, deiri suru koto, watashi ni mukatte ikari sakenda koto o mo shitte iru.
Anata ga watashi ni mukatte ikari sakenda koto to, anata no kouman ga watashi no mimi ni haitta tame, watashi wa anata no hana ni wa o tsuke, anata no kuchi ni kutsuwa o hamete, anata o mo to kita michi e hikimodosude arou'.
'Anata ni ataeru shirushi wa kore de aru. Sunawachi, kotoshi wa ochibo kara haeta mono o tabe, ni nenme ni wa mata sono ochibo kara haeta mono o tabe, san nenme ni wa tane o maki, kariire, budou hatake o tsukutte sono mi o taberude arou.
Yuda no ie no nogarete nokoru mono wa futatabi shita ni ne o hari, ue ni mi o musubude arou.
Sunawachi nokoru mono ga Erusaremu kara dete ki, nogareta mono ga Shion no yama kara dete kurude arou. Shu no nesshin ga kore o sarerude arou'.
Sore yue, Shu wa ASsuriya no ou ni tsuite, kou ooserareru, 'Kare wa kono machi ni konai, mata koko ni ya o hanatanai, tate o motte sono mae ni kuru koto naku, mata rui o kizuite kore o semeru koto wa nai.
Kare wa kita michi o kaette, kono machi ni, hairu koto wa nai. Shu ga kore o iu.
Watashi wa jibun no tame, mata watashi no shimobe Dabide no tame ni kono machi o mamotte, kore o sukuude arou' ".
Sono yoru, Shu no tsukai ga dete, ASsuriya no jin'ei de juu hachi man gosennin o uchikoroshita. Hitobito ga asa hayaku okite miruto, karera wa mina, shitai to natte ita.
ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu wa tachisari, kaette itte Ninebe ni itaga,
Sono kami Nisuroku no shinden de reihai shite ita toki, sono ko Aderanmereku to Sharezeru ga, tsurugi o motte kare o koroshi, tomo ni Ararate no chi e nigete itta. Soko de sono ko Esaruhadon ga kawatte ou to natta.
Sono koro, Hizekiya wa byouki ni natte shinikakatte ita. Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya wa kare no tokoro ni kite itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Ie no hito ni yuigon o nasai. Anata wa shinimasu. Ikinagaraeru koto wa dekimasen' ".
Soko de Hizekiya wa kao o kabe ni mukete Shu ni inotte itta,
"Aa Shu yo, watashi ga shinjitsu o magokoro o motte anata no mae ni ayumi, anata no me ni kanau koto o okonatta no o douzo omoiokoshite kudasai". Soshite Hizekiya wa hageshiku naita.
Izaya ga mada nakaniwa o denai uchi ni Shu no kotoba ga kare ni nozonda,
"Hikikaeshite, watashi no tami no kimi Hizekiya ni ii nasai, 'Anata no chichi Dabide no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa anata no inori o kiki, anata no namida o mita. Miyo, watashi wa anata o iyasu. Mikkame ni wa anata wa Shu no miya ni noborude arou.
Katsu, watashi wa anata no yowai o juu go nen masu. Watashi wa anata to, kono machi to o ASsuriya no ou no te kara sukui, watashi no na no tame, mata watashi no shimobe Dabide no tame ni kono machi o mamorude arou' ".
Soshite Izaya wa itta, "Hoshi ichijiku no hitokatamari o motte kite, sore o haremono ni tsukesase nasai. Sou sureba naorudeshou".
Hizekiya wa Izaya ni itta, "Shu ga watashi o iyasareru koto to, mikkame ni watashi ga Shu no ie ni noboru koto ni tsuite, donna shirushi ga arimashou ka".
Izaya wa itta, "Shu ga yakusoku sareta koto o okonawareru koto ni tsuite wa, Shu kara kono shirushi o erarerudeshou. Sunawachi hikage ga juu do susumu ka, aruiha juu do shirizoku ka desu".
Hizekiya wa kotaeta, "Hikage ga juu do susumu koto wa tayasui koto desu. Mushiro hikage o juu do shirizokasete kudasai".
Soko de yogensha Izaya ga Shu ni yobawaruto, Ahazu no hi tokei no ue ni susunda hikage o, juu do shirizokaserareta.
Sono koro, Baradan no ko de aru Babiron no ou Merodakubaradan wa, tegami to okurimono o motasete shisetsu o Hizekiya ni tsukawashita. Kore wa Hizekiya ga yande iru koto o kiitakara de aru.
Hizekiya wa karera o yorokobimukaete, houmotsu no kura, kingin, kouryou, kichou na abura oyobi bukikura, narabi ni sono souko ni aru subete no mono o karera ni miseta. Ie ni aru mono mo, kuni ni aru mono mo, Hizekiya ga karera ni misenai mono wa hitotsu mo nakatta.
Sono toki, yogensha Izaya wa Hizekiya ou no moto ni kite itta, "Ano hitobito wa nani o iimashita ka. Doko kara kita no desu ka". Hizekiya wa itta, "Karera wa tooi kuni kara, Babiron kara kita no desu".
Izaya wa itta, "Karera wa anata no ie de nani o mimashita ka". Hizekiya wa kotaete itta, "Watashi no ie ni aru mono o mina mimashita. Watashi no souko no uchi ni wa, watashi ga karera ni misenai mono wa hitotsu mo arimasen".
Soko de Izaya wa Hizekiya ni itta, "Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai,
'Shu wa iwareru, miyo, subete anata no ie ni aru mono, oyobi, anata no senzotachi ga konnichi made ni tsumi takuwaeta mono no, Babiron ni hakobisarareru hi ga kuru. Nani mo nokoru mono wa naide arou.
Mata, anata no mi kara deru anata no kotachi mo tsuresarare, Babiron no ou no kyuuden de kangan to narude arou' ".
Hizekiya wa Izaya ni itta, "Anata ga iwareta Shu no kotoba wa kekkou desu". Kare wa "Semete jibun ga yo ni aru aida, heiwa to anzen ga areba yoi koto de wa nakarou ka" to omottakara de aru.
Hizekiya no sono ta no jiseki to sono buyuu oyobi, kare ga chosuichi to suidou o tsukutte, machi ni mizu o hiita koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Hizekiya wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, sono ko Manase ga kawatte ou to natta.
Manase wa juu nisai de ou to nari, gojuu go nen no aida, Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Haha no na wa Hefujiba to itta.
Manase wa Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta kuniguni no tami no nikumubeki okonai ni naratte, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Kare wa chichi Hizekiya ga kowashita takaki tokoro o tatenaoshi, mata Isuraeru no ou Ahabu ga shita you ni Baaru no tame ni saidan o kizuki, Ashira zou o tsukuri, katsu ten no banshou o ogande, kore ni tsukaeta.
Mata Shu no miya no uchi ni suuko no saidan o kizuita. Kore wa Shu ga "Watashi no na o Erusaremu ni okou" to iwareta sono miya de aru.
Kare wa mata Shu no miya no futatsu no niwa ni ten no banshou no tame ni saidan o kizuita.
Mata sono ko o hi ni yaite sasagemono to shi, uranai o shi, majutsu o okonai, kuchiyose to mahoutsukai o mochii, Shu no me no mae ni ooku no aku o itte, Shu no ikari o hikiokoshita.
Kare wa mata Ashira no chouzou o tsukutte Shu no miya ni oita. Shu wa kono miya ni tsuite Dabide to sono ko Soromon ni iwareta koto ga aru, "Watashi wa kono miya to, watashi ga Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara eranda Erusaremu to ni, watashi no na o eien ni oku.
Moshi, karera ga watashi ga meijita subete no koto, oyobi watashi no shimobe Moose ga meijita subete no rippou o mamori okonaunaraba, Isuraeru no ashi o, watashi ga karera no senzotachi ni ataeta chi kara, kasanete mayoidasasenaide arou".
Shikashi karera wa kikiirenakatta. Manase ga hitobito o izanatte aku o okonatta koto wa, Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni horobosareta kuniguni no tami yori mo hanahadashikatta.
Soko de Shu wa sono shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte iwareta,
"Yuda no ou Manase ga korera no nikumubeki koto o okonai, kare no saki ni atta Amori bito no itta subete no koto yori mo warui koto o okonai, mata sono guuzou o motte Yuda ni tsumi o okasaseta no de,
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa Erusaremu to Yuda ni wazawai o kudasou to shite iru. Kore o kiku mono wa, sono mimi ga futatsunagara narude arou.
Watashi wa Samariya o hakatta hakari nawa to, Ahabu no ie ni mochiita sagefuri o Erusaremu ni hodokoshi, hito ga sara o nugui, kore o nugutte fuseru you ni, Erusaremu o nuguisaru.
Watashi wa, watashi no shigyou no tami no nokori o sute, karera o teki no te ni watasu. Karera wa moromoro no teki no ejiki to nari, ryakudatsu ni aude arou.
Kore wa karera no senzotachi ga Ejiputo o deta hi kara konnichi ni itaru made, karera ga watashi no me no mae ni aku o itte, watashi o ikaraseta tame de aru".
Manase wa mata Shu no me no mae ni aku o itte, Yuda ni tsumi o okasaseta sono tsumi no hoka ni, tsumi naki mono no chi o ooku nagashite, Erusaremu no kono hate kara, kano hate ni made mitashita.
Manase no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga okonatta subete no koto oyobi sono okashita tsumi wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Manase wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, sono ie no sono sunawachi Uza no sono ni houmurare, sono ko Amon ga kawatte ou to natta.
Amon wa ou to natta toki nijuu nisai de atte, Erusaremu de ni nen no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Yoteba no Harutsu no musume de, na o Meshuremete to itta.
Amon wa sono chichi Manase no okonatta you ni, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Sunawachi kare wa subete sono chichi no ayunda michi ni ayumi, chichi no tsukaeta guuzou ni tsukaete, kore o ogami,
Senzotachi no kami, Shu o sutete, Shu no michi ni ayumanakatta.
Amon no keraitachi wa tsuini kare ni tekishite totou o musubi, ou o sono ie de koroshitaga,
Kuni no tami wa, Amon ou ni tekishite totou o musunda mono o kotogotoku uchikoroshita. Soshite kuni no tami wa Amon no ko Yoshiya o ou to shite Amon ni kawaraseta.
Amon no sono ta no jiseki wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Amon wa Uza no sono ni aru haka ni houmurare, sono ko Yoshiya ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yoshiya wa hachisai de ou to nari, Erusaremu de sanjuu ichi nen no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Bozukate no Adaya no musume de, na o Ededa to itta.
Yoshiya wa Shu no me ni kanau koto o okonai, senzo Dabide no michi ni ayunde migi ni mo hidari ni mo magaranakatta.
Yoshiya ou no daijuu hachi nen ni ou wa Meshuramu no ko Azariya no ko de aru shokikan Shapan o Shu no miya ni tsukawashite itta,
"Daisaishi Hirukiya no moto e nobotte itte, Shu ni miya ni haitte kita gin, sunawachi mon o mamoru mono ga tami kara atsumeta mono no sougaku o kare ni kazoesase,
Sore o kouji o tsukasadoru Shu no miya no kantokumono no te ni watasase, karera kara Shu no miya de kouji o suru mono ni sore o watashite, miya no yabure o tsukurowase nasai.
Sunawachi mokkou to kenchikushi to ishiku ni sore o watashi, mata miya o tsukurou zaimoku to kiriishi o kawase nasai.
Tadashi karera wa shoujiki ni koto o okonaukara, karera ni watashita gin ni tsuite wa karera to keisan suru ni oyobanai".
Sono toki daisaishi Hirukiya wa shokikan Shapan ni itta, "Watashi wa Shu no miya de rippou no sho o mitsukemashita". Soshite Hirukiya ga sono shomotsu o Shapan ni watashita no de, kare wa sore o yonda.
Shokikan Shapan wa ou no moto e iki, ou ni houkoku shite itta, "Shimobedomo wa miya ni atta gin o mina dashite, sore o kouji o tsukasadoru Shu no miya no kantokumono no te ni watashimashita".
Shokikan Shapan wa mata ou ni tsugete "Saishi Hirukiya wa watashi ni hitotsu no shomotsu o watashimashita" to ii, sore o ou no mae de yonda.
Ou wa sono rippou no sho no kotoba o kikuto, sono koromo o saita.
Soshite ou wa saishi Hirukiya to, Shapan no ko Ahikamu to, Mikaya no ko Akuboru to, shokikan Shapan to, ou no daijin Asaya to ni meijite itta,
"Anata gata wa itte, kono mitsukatta shomotsu no kotoba ni tsuite, watashi no tame, tami no tame, mata Yuda zenkoku no tame ni Shu ni tazune nasai. Wareware no senzotachi ga kono shomotsu no kotoba ni kikishitagawazu, subete wareware ni tsuite shirusarete iru koto o okonawanakatta tame ni, Shu wa wareware ni mukatte, ooinaru ikari o hasshite orarerukara desu".
Soko de saishi Hirukiya, Ahikamu, Akuboru, Shapan oyobi Asaya wa Sharumu no tsuma de aru onna yogensha Horuda no moto e itta. Sharumu wa Haruhasu no ko de aruTekuwa no ko de, ishou beya o mamoru mono de atta. Sono toki Horuda wa Erusaremu no shitamachi ni sunde ita. Karera ga Horuda ni tsugeta no de,
Horuda wa karera ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anatagata o watashi ni tsukawashita hito ni ii nasai.
Shu wa kou iwaremasu, miyo, watashi wa Yuda no ou ga yonda ano shomotsu no subete no kotoba ni shitagatte, wazawai o kono tokoro to, koko ni sunde iru tami ni kudasou to shite iru.
Karera ga watashi o sutete ta no kamigami ni kou o taki, jibuntachi no te de tsukutta moromoro no mono o motte, watashi o ikarasetakara de aru. Sore yue, watashi wa kono tokoro ni mukatte ikari no hi o hassuru. Kore wa kieru koto ga naide arou'.
Tadashi Shu ni tazuneru tame ni, anatagata o tsukawashita Yuda no ou ni wa kou ii nasai, 'Anata ga kiita kotoba ni tsuite Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu,
Anata wa, watashi ga kono tokoro to, koko ni sunde iru tami ni mukatte, kore wa arechi to nari, noroi to narude arou to iu no o kiita toki, kokoro ni kui, Shu no mae ni herikudari, koromo o saite watashi no mae ni naita yue, watashi mo mata anata no iu koto o kiita no de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa anata o senzotachi no moto ni atsumeru. Anata wa yasuraka ni haka ni atsumerare, watashi ga kono tokoro ni kudasu moromoro no wazawai o me ni miru koto wa naide arou' ". Karera wa kono kotoba o ou ni mochikaetta.
Soko de ou wa hito o tsukawashite Yuda to Erusaremu no chouroutachi o kotogotoku atsumeta.
Soshite ou wa Yuda no moromoro no hitobito to, Erusaremu no subete no juumin oyobi saishi, yogensha narabi ni daishou no subete no tami o shitagaete Shu no miya ni nobori, Shu no miya de mitsukatta keiyaku no sho no kotoba o kotogotoku karera ni yomikikaseta.
Tsuide ou wa hashira no katawara ni tatte, Shu no mae ni keiyaku o tate, Shu ni shitagatte ayumi, kokoro o tsukushi seishin o tsukushite, Shu no imashime to, akashi to, sadame to o mamori, kono shomotsu ni shirusarete iru kono keiyaku no kotoba o okonau koto o chikatta. Tami wa mina sono keiyaku ni kuwawatta.
Kou shite ou wa daisaishi Hirukiya to, sore ni tsugu saishitachi oyobi mon o mamoru monodomo ni meijite, Shu no shinden kara Baaru to Ashira to ten no banshou to no tame ni tsukutta moromoro no utsuwa o toridasase, Erusaremu no soto no Kideron no no de sore o yaki, sono hai o Beteru ni motte ikaseta.
Mata, Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu no shuui ni aru takaki tokoro de kou o taku tame ni Yuda no outachi ga ninmei shita saishitachi o haishi, mata Baaru to hi to tsuki to seishuku to ten no banshou to ni kou o taku monodomo o mo haishita.
Kare wa mata Shu no miya kara Ashira zou o toridashi, Erusaremu no soto no Kideron kawa ni motte itte, Kideron kawa de sore o yaki, sore o uchikudaite kona to shi, sono kona o tami no haka ni nagesuteta.
Mata Shu no miya ni atta shinden danshou no ie o kowashita. Soko wa onnatachi ga Ashira zou no tame ni kake maku o oru tokoro de atta.
Kare wa mata Yuda no machimachi kara saishi o kotogotoku me shiyose, mata saishi ga kou o taita Geba kara Beerushiba made no takaki tokoro o kegashi, mata mon ni aru takaki tokoro o kowashita. Korera no takaki tokoro wa machi no tsukasa Yoshua no mon no iriguchi ni ari, machi no mon ni hairu hito no hidari ni atta.
Takaki tokoro no saishitachi wa Erusaremu de Shu no saidan ni noboru koto o shinakattaga, sono kyoudaitachi no uchi ni atte tane irenu pan o tabeta.
Ou wa mata, dare mo sono musuko musume o hi ni yaite, Moreku ni sasagemono to suru koto no nai you ni, Benhinnomu no tani ni aru Topete o kegashita.
Mata Yuda no outachi ga taiyou ni sasagete Shu no miya no mon ni oita uma o, keidai ni aru jijuu Natanmereku no heya no katawara ni utsushi, taiyou no kuruma o hi de yaita.
Mata ou wa Yuda no outachi ga Ahazu no takadono no okujou ni tsukutta saidan to, Manase ga Shu no miya no futatsu no niwa ni tsukutta saidan to o kowashite, sore o uchikudaki, kudaketa mono o Kideron kawa ni nagesuteta.
Mata ou wa Isuraeru no ou Soromon ga mukashi Shidon bito no nikumubeki mono Ashitarote to, Moabu bito no nikumubeki mono Kemoshi to, Anmon no hitobito no nikumubeki mono Mirukomu no tame ni Erusaremu no higashi, metsubou no yama no minami ni kizuita takaki tokoro o kegashita.
Mata moromoro no sekichuu o uchikudaki, Ashira zou o kiritaoshi, hito no hone o motte sono tokoro o mitashita.
Mata, Beteru ni aru saidan to, Isuraeru ni tsumi o okasaseta Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ga tsukutta takaki tokoro, sunawachi sono saidan to takaki tokoro to o kare wa kowashi, sono ishi o uchikudaite kona to shi, katsu Ashira zou o yaita.
Soshite Yoshiya wa mi o megurashite yama ni haka no aru no o mi, hito o tsukawashite sono haka kara hone o torase, sore o sono saidan no ue de yaite, sore o kegashita. Mukashi, kami no hito ga Shu no kotoba to shite kono koto o yobawari tsugetaga, sono toori ni natta.
Sono toki Yoshiya wa "Asoko ni mieru sekihi wa nani ka" to tazuneta. Machi no hitobito ga kare ni "Are wa anata ga Beteru no saidan ni taishite okonawareta korera no koto o, Yuda kara kite yogen shita kami no hito no haka desu" to itta no de,
Kare wa itta, "Sono mama ni shite oki nasai. Dare mo sono hone o utsushite wa naranai". Sore de sono hone to, Samariya kara kita yogensha no hone ni wa te o tsukenakatta.
Mata Isuraeru no outachi ga Samariya no machimachi ni tsukutte, Shu o ikaraseta takaki tokoro no ie mo mina Yoshiya wa torinozoite, kare ga subete Beteru ni itta you ni kore ni itta.
Kare wa mata, soko ni atta takaki tokoro no saishitachi o minasaidan no ue de koroshi, hito no hone o saidan no ue de yaita. Kou shite kare wa Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Soshite ou wa subete no tami ni meijite, "Anata gata wa kono keiyaku no sho ni shirusarete iru you ni, anata gata no kami, Shu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o toriokonai nasai" to itta.
Sabaki zukasa ga Isuraeru o sabaita hi kara konokata, mata Isuraeru no outachi to Yuda no outachi no yo ni mo, kono you na sugikoshi no matsuri o toriokonatta koto wa nakattaga,
Yoshiya ou no daijuu hachi nen ni, Erusaremu de kono sugikoshi no matsuri o Shu ni toriokonatta no de aru.
Yoshiya wa mata saishi Hirukiya ga Shu no miya de mitsuketa shomotsu ni shirusarete iru rippou no kotoba o kakujitsu ni okonau tame ni, kuchiyose to uranaishi to, Terapimu to guuzou oyobi Yuda no chi to Erusaremu ni mirareru moromoro no nikumubeki mono o torinozoita.
Yoshiya no you ni kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, chikara o tsukushite Moose no subete no rippou ni shitagai, Shu ni yori tayonda ou wa Yoshiya no saki ni wa naku, mata sono nochi ni mo kare no you na mono wa okoranakatta.
Keredo mo Shu wa nao Yuda ni mukatte hasserareta hageshii ooinaru ikari o yamerarenakatta. Kore wa Manase ga moromoro no haradatashii okonai o motte Shu o ikaraseta tame de aru.
Sore yue Shu wa iwareta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru o utsushita you ni, Yuda o mo watashi no me no mae kara utsushi, watashi ga eranda kono Erusaremu no machi to, watashi no na o soko ni okou to itta kono miya to o suterude arou".
Yoshiya no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga itta subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Yoshiya no yo ni Ejiputo no ou Paro Neko ga, ASsuriya no ou no tokoro e ikouto, Yufurate kawa o sashite nobotte kita no de, Yoshiya ou wa kare o mukaeutou to dete ittaga, Paro Neko wa kare o miru ya, Megido ni oite kare o koroshita.
Sono keraitachi wa kare no shitai o kuruma ni nose, Megido kara Erusaremu ni hakonde kare no haka ni houmutta. Kuni no tami wa Yoshiya no ko Ehoahazu o tate, kare ni abura o sosogi, ou to shite chichi ni kawaraseta.
Ehoahazu wa ou to natta toki nijuu sansai de, Erusaremu de san kagetsu no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Ribuna no Eremiya no musume de, na o Hamutaru to itta.
Ehoahazu wa senzotachi ga subete itta you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonattaga,
Paro Neko wa kare o Hamate no chi no Ribura ni tsunaide oite, Erusaremu de yo o osameru koto ga dekinai you ni shita. Mata gin hyaku taranto to kin ichi taranto nomi tsugi o kuni ni kashita.
Soshite Paro Neko wa Yoshiya no ko Eriakimu o chichi Yoshiya ni kawatte ou to narase, na o Ehoyakimu to aratame, Ehoahazu o Ejiputo e hiite itta. Ehoahazu wa Ejiputo e itte soko de shinda.
Ehoyakimu wa kingin o Paro ni okutta. Shikashi kare wa Paro no inochi ni shitagatte kane o okuru tame ni kuni ni zei o kashi, kuni no tami onoono kara sono kazei ni shitagatte kingin o kibishiku toritatete, sore o Paro Neko ni okutta.
Ehoyakimu wa nijuu gosai de ou to nari, Erusaremu de juu ichi nen no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Ruma no Pedaya no musume de, na o Zebida to itta.
Ehoyakimu wa senzotachi ga subete itta you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Ehoyakimu no yo ni Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga nobotte kita no de, Ehoyakimu wa kare ni reizoku shite san nen o hetaga, tsuini hirugaette kare ni somuita.
Shu wa Karudeya bito no ryakudatsutai, Suriya bito no ryakudatsutai, Moabu bito no ryakudatsutai, Anmon bito no ryakudatsutai o tsukawashite Ehoyakimu o semerareta. Sunawachi Yuda o seme, kore o horobosu tame ni karera o tsukawasareta. Shu ga sono shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte katarareta kotoba no toori de aru.
Kore wa mattaku Shu no inochi ni yotte Yuda ni nozonda mono de, Yuda o Shu no me no mae kara harainozoku tame de atta. Sunawachi Manase ga subete okonatta sono tsumi no tame,
Mata kare ga tsumi naki hito no chi o nagashi, tsumi naki hito no chi o Erusaremu ni mitashita tame de atte, Shu wa sono tsumi o yurusou to wa sarenakatta.
Ehoyakimu no sono ta no jiseki to, kare ga okonatta subete no koto wa, Yuda no ou no rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Ehoyakimu wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemuri, sono ko Ehoyakin ga kawatte ou to natta.
Ejiputo no ou wa futatabi sono kuni kara dete konakatta. Babiron no ou ga Ejiputo no kawa kara Yufurate kawa made, subete Ejiputo no ou ni zokusuru mono o tottakara de aru.
Ehoyakin wa ou to natta toki juu hachisai de, Erusaremu de san kagetsu no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Erusaremu no Erunatan no musume de, na o Nehoshita to itta.
Ehoyakin wa subete sono chichi ga okonatta you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Sono koro, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no keraitachi wa Erusaremu ni semenobotte, machi o kakonda.
Sono keraitachi ga machi o kakonde ita toki, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru mo mata machi ni semete kita.
Yuda no ou Ehoyakin wa sono haha, sono kerai, sono tsukasatachi, oyobi jijuutachi to tomo ni dete, Babiron no ou ni koufuku shita no de, Babiron no ou wa kare o horyo to shita. Kore wa Nebukadenezaru no chisei no daihachi nen de atta.
Kare wa mata Shu no miya no moromoro no houmotsu oyobi ou no ie no houmotsu o kotogotoku mochidashi, Isuraeru no ou Soromon ga tsukutte Shu no shinden ni oita moromoro no kin no utsuwa o kiri kowashita. Shu ga iwareta toori de aru.
Kare wa mata Erusaremu no subete no shimin, oyobi subete no tsukasa to subete no yuushi, narabi ni subete no mokkou to kaji ichi mannin o toraete itta. Nokotta mono wa kuni no tami no mazushii mono nomi de atta.
Sarani kare wa Ehoyakin o Babiron ni toraete iki, mata ou no haha, ou no tsumatachi, oyobi jijuu to kuni no uchi no omona hitobito o mo, Erusaremu kara Babiron e toraete itta.
Mata Babiron no ou wa subete yuukan na mono nanasennin, mokkou to kaji issennin narabi ni tsuyokute yoku tatakau mono o mina toraete Babiron e tsurete itta.
Soshite Babiron no ou wa Ehoyakin no chichi no kyoudai Mattaniya o ou to shite Ehoyakin ni kae, na o Zedekiya to aratameta.
Zedekiya wa nijuu ichisai de ou to nari, Erusaremu de juu ichi nen no aida, yo o osameta. Haha wa Ribuna no Eremiya no musume de, na o Hamutaru to itta.
Zedekiya wa subete Ehoyakimu ga okonatta you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Erusaremu to Yuda ni kono you na koto no tatta no wa Shu no ikari ni yoru no de, Shu wa tsuini karera o mimae kara harai suterareta. Sate Zedekiya wa Babiron no ou ni somuita.
Soko de Zedekiya no chisei no daikyuu nen no juu gatsu tooka ni, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru wa moromoro no gunzei o hikii, Erusaremu ni kite, kore ni mukatte jin o hari, shuui ni toride o kizuite kore o semeta.
Kou shite machi wa kakomarete, Zedekiya ou no daijuu ichi nen ni made oyondaga,
Sono yon gatsu kokonoka ni natte, machi no uchi ni kikin ga hageshiku nari, sono chi no tami ni shokumotsu ga nakunatta.
Machi no ikkaku ga tsuini yabureta no de, ou wa subete no heishi to tomo ni, ou no sono no katawara ni aru futatsu no jouheki no aida no mon no michi kara yoru no uchi ni nigedashite, Karudeya bito ga machi o kakonde iru aida ni, Araba no hou e ochinobita.
Shikashi Karudeya bito no gunzei wa ou o oi, Eriko no heichi de kare ni oitsuita. Kare no gunzei wa mina kare o hanarete chiri satta no de,
Karudeya bito wa ou o torae, kare o Ribura ni iru Babiron no ou no moto e hiite itte kare no tsumi o sadame,
Zedekiya no kotachi o Zedekiya no me no mae de koroshi, Zedekiya no me o eguri, ashikase o kakete Babiron e tsurete itta.
Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no daijuu kyuu nen no go gogatsu nanuka ni, Babiron no ou no shin, jiei no chouNebuzaradan ga Erusaremu ni kite,
Shu no miya to ou no ie to Erusaremu no subete no ie o yaita. Sunawachi hi o motte subete no ookina ie o yaita.
Mata jiei no chou to tomo ni ita Karudeya bito no subete no gunzei wa Erusaremu no shuui no jouheki o hakai shita.
Soshite jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa, machi ni nokosareta tami oyobi Babiron ou ni koufuku shita mono to nokori no gunshuu o toraeutsushita.
Tadashi jiei no chou wa sono chi no mazushii mono o nokoshite, budou o tsukuru mono to shi, noufu to shita.
Karudeya bito wa mata Shu no miya no seidou no hashira to, Shu no miya no senban no dai to, seidou no umi o kudaite, sono seidou o Babiron ni hakobi,
Mata tsubo to, juunou to, shinkiri basami to, kou o moru sara oyobi subete shinden no tsutome ni mochiiru seidou no utsuwa,
Mata shinto rizara to hachi o torisatta. Jiei no chou wa mata kin de tsukutta mono to gin de tsukutta mono o torisatta.
Soromon ga Shu no miya no tame ni tsukutta futatsu no hashira to, hitotsu no umi to senban no dai nado, korera no moromoro no utsuwa no seidou no omosa wa hakaru koto ga dekinakatta.
Hitotsu no hashira no takasa wa juu hachi kyubito de, sono ue ni seidou no chuutou ga ari, chuutou no takasa wa san kyubito de, chuutou no shuui ni ami saiku to zakuro ga atte, mina seidou de atta. Ta no hashira mo sono ami saiku mo kore to onaji de atta.
Jiei no chou wa saishi chou Seraya to jiseki no saishi Zepaniya to sannin no mon o mamoru mono o torae,
Mata heishi o tsukasadoru hitori no yakunin to, ou no mae ni haberu mono no uchi, machi de mitsukatta mono gonin to, sono chi no tami o tsunotta gunzei no chou no shokikan to, machi de mitsukatta sono chi no tami rokujuunin o machi kara torae satta.
Jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa karera o toraete, Ribura ni iru Babiron no ou no moto e tsurete itta no de,
Babiron no ou wa Hamate no chi no Ribura de karera o uchikoroshita. Kono you ni shite Yuda wa sono chi kara toraeutsusareta.
Sate Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru wa Yuda no chi ni nokoshite todomaraseta tami no ue ni, Shapan no ko Ahikamu no ko de aru Gedariya o tatete soutoku to shita.
Toki ni gunzei no choutachi oyobi sono buka no hitobito wa, Babiron no ou ga Gedariya o soutoku to shita koto o kiite, Mizupa ni iru Gedariya no moto ni kita. Sunawachi Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru, Kareya no ko Yohanan, Netopa bi to Tanhomete no ko Seraya, Maaka bi to no ko Yazaniya oyobi sono buka no hitobito ga Gedariya no moto ni kita.
Gedariya wa karera to sono buka no hitobito ni chikatte itta, "Anata gata wa Karudeya bito no shimobe to naru koto o osorete wa naranai. Kono chi ni sunde, Babiron no ou ni tsukae nasai. Sou sureba anata gata wa koufuku o erudeshou".
Tokoro ga nana gatsu ni natte, ou no kettou no Erishama no ko de aru Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa juunin no mono to tomo ni kite, Gedariya o uchikoroshi, mata kare to tomo ni Mizupa ni ita Yudayahito to, Karudeya bito o koroshita.
Sono tame, daishou no tami oyobi gunzei no choutachi wa, mina tatte Ejiputo e itta. Karera wa Karudeya bito o osoretakara de aru.
Yuda no ou Ehoyakin ga toraeutsusarete nochi sanjuu nana nen no juu ni gatsu nijuu shichi nichi, sunawachi Babiron no ou Ebirumerodaku no chisei no daiichi nen ni, ou wa Yuda no ou Ehoyakin o gokuya kara dashite
Nengoro ni kare o nagusame, sono kurai o kare to tomo ni Babiron ni iru outachi no kurai yori mo takaku shita.
Kou shite Ehoyakin wa sono gokuya no koromo o nugi, isshou no aida, tsune ni ou no mae de shokuji shita.
Kare wa isshou no aida, taezu hibi no bun o ou kara tamawatte, sono shokumotsu to shita.
Adamu, Setsu, Enosu,
Kenan, Maharareru, Yaredo,
Enoku, Metosera, Rameku,
Noa, Semu, Hamu, Yapete.
Yapete no kora wa Gomeru, Magogu, Madai, Yawan, Tobaru, Meseku, Terasu.
Gomeru no kora wa Ashikenazu, Depate, Togaruma.
Yawan no kora wa Erisha, Tarushishi, KiTtemu, Rodanimu.
Hamu no kora wa Kushi, Ejiputo, Pute, Kanan.
Kushi no kora wa Seba, Habira, Sabuta, Raama, Sabuteka. Raama no kora wa Shiba to Dedan.
Kushi wa Nimurode o unda. Nimurode wa hajimete yo no kenryoku aru mono to natta.
Ejiputo wa Rude bi to, Anamu bi to, Rehabu bi to, Nafuto bi to,
Paterosu bi to, Kasuru bi to, Kafutoru bito o unda. Kafutoru bito kara Perishite bito ga deta.
Kanan wa choushi Shidon to Hete o unda.
Mata Ebusu bi to, Amori bi to, Girugashi bi to,
Hibi bi to, Aruki bi to, Seni bi to,
Aruwade bi to, Zemari bi to, Hamate bito o unda.
Semu no kora wa Eramu, Ashuru, Arupakusade, Rude, Aramu, Uzu, Horu, Geteru, Meseku de aru.
Arupakusade wa Shira o umi, Shira wa Eberu o unda.
Eberu ni futari no ko ga umareta. Hitori no na wa Peregu - - kare no yo ni chi no tami ga chiri wakaretakara de aru - - sono otouto no na wa Yokutan to itta.
Yokutan wa Arumodade, Sharefu, hazaru maute, Era,
Hadoramu, Uzaru, Dekura,
Ebaru, Abimaeru, Shiba,
Ofuru, Habira, Yobabu o unda. Korera wa mina Yokutan no ko de aru.
Semu, Arupakusade, Shira,
Eberu, Peregu, Riu,
Serugu, Nahoru, Tera,
Aburamu sunawachi Aburahamu de aru.
Aburahamu no kora wa Isaku to Ishimaeru de aru.
Karera no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Ishimaeru no choushi wa Nebayote, tsugi wa Kedaru, Adebieru, Mibusamu,
Mishima, Doma, Massa, Hadade, Tema,
Etoru, Nefushi, Kedema. Korera wa Ishimaeru no shison de aru.
Aburahamu no sobame Ketora no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kanojo wa Jimuran, Yokushan, Medan, Midean, Ishibaku, Shuwa o unda. Yokushan no kora wa Shiba to Dedan de aru.
Midean no kora wa epa, Eperu, Henoku, Abida, Erudaa. Korera wa mina Ketora no shison de aru.
Aburahamu wa Isaku o unda. Isaku no kora wa Esau to Isuraeru.
Esau no kora wa Eripazu, Riueru, Eushi, Yaramu, Kora.
Eripazu no kora wa Teman, Omaru, Zepi, Gatamu, Kenazu, Temuna, Amareku.
Riueru no kora wa Nahate, Zera, Shanma, MiZza.
Seiru no kora wa Rotan, Shobaru, Jibeon, Ana, Deshon, Ezeru, Deshan.
Rotan no kora wa Hori to Homamu. Rotan no imouto wa Temuna.
Shobaru no kora wa Aruyan, manahate, Ebaru, Shipi, Onamu. Jibeon no kora wa Aya to Ana.
Ana no ko wa Deshon. Deshon no kora wa Hamuran, Eshiban, Iteran, Keran.
Ezeru no kora wa Biruhan, Zawan, Yakan. Deshan no kora wa Uzu to Aran.
Isuraeru no hitobito o osameru ou ga mada nakatta toki, Edomu no chi o osameta outachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Beoru no ko Bera. Sono miyako no na wa Denaba to itta.
Bera ga shinde, Bozura no Zera no ko Yobabu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yobabu ga shinde, Teman bito no chi no Hoshamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Hoshamu ga shinde, Bedate no ko Hadade ga kawatte ou to natta. Kare wa Moabu no no de Midean o utta. Kare no miyako no na wa Abite to itta.
Hadade ga shinde, Masureka no Samura ga kawatte ou to natta.
Samura ga shinde, Yufurate kawa no hotori no Rehobote no Sauru ga kawatte ou to natta.
Sauru ga shinde, Akuboru no ko Baaru Hanan ga kawatte ou to natta.
Baaru Hanan ga shinde, Hadade ga kawatte ou to natta. Kare no miyako no na wa Pai to itta. Kare no tsuma wa Materede no musume de atte, na o Mehetaberu to itta. Materede wa Mezahabu no musume de aru.
Hadade mo shinda. Edomu no zokuchou wa, Temunakou, Aruyakou, Etetekou,
Ahoribamakou, Erakou, Pinonkou,
Kenazukou, Temankou, Mibuzarukou,
Magudeerukou, Iramukou. Korera wa Edomu no zokuchou de aru.
Isuraeru no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Ruben, Shimeon, Rebi, Yuda, Issakaru, Zeburun,
Dan, Yosefu, Beniyamin, Nafutari, Gado, Aseru.
Yuda no kora wa Eru, Onan, Shira de aru. Kono sannin wa Kanan no onna Bateshua ga Yuda ni yotte unda mono de aru. Yuda no choushi Eru wa Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta no de, Shu wa kare o korosareta.
Yuda no yome Tamaru wa Yuda ni yotte Perezu to Zera o unda. Yuda no kora wa awasete gonin de aru.
Perezu no kora wa Hezuron to Hamuru.
Zera no kora wa Jimuri, Etan, Heman, Karukoru, Dara de, awasete gonin de aru.
Karumi no ko wa Akaru. Akaru wa hounoubutsu ni tsuite tsumi o okashi, Isuraeru o nayamashita mono de aru.
Etan no ko wa Azariya de aru.
Hezuron ni umareta kora wa Erameru, Ramu, Kerubai de aru.
Ramu wa Aminadabu o umi, Aminadabu wa Yuda no shison no tsukasa Nashon o unda.
Nashon wa Saruma o umi, Saruma wa Boazu o umi,
Boazu wa Obede o umi, Obede wa Essai o unda.
Essai wa choushi Eriabu, tsugi ni Abinadabu, daisan ni Shimea,
Daiyon ni Netan'eru, daigo ni Radai,
Dairoku ni Ozemu, dainana ni Dabide o unda.
Karera no shimai wa Zeruya to Abigairu de aru. Zeruya no unda ko wa Abishai, Yoabu, Asaheru no sannin de aru.
Abigairu wa Amasa o unda. Amasa no chichi wa Ishimaeru bi to Eteru de aru.
Hezuron no ko Karebu wa sono tsuma Azuba oyobi Eriote ni yotte ko o mouketa. Sono kora wa Eshiru, Shobabu, Arudon de aru.
Karebu wa Azuba ga shinda no de Efurata o metotta. Efurata wa Karebu ni yotte Horu o unda.
Horu wa Uri o umi, Uri wa Bezareru o unda.
Sono nochi Hezuron wa Gireade no chichi Makiru no musume no tokoro ni haitta. Kare ga kanojo o metotta toki wa rokujuusai de atta. Kanojo wa Hezuron ni yotte Segubu o unda.
Segubu wa Yairu o unda. Yairu wa Gireade no chi ni nijuu san no machi o motte ita.
Shikashi Geshuru to Aramu wa karera kara habote yairu oyobi Kenate to sono murazato nado awasete rokujuu no machi o totta. Korera wa mina Gireade no chichi Makiru no shison de atta.
Hezuron ga shinda nochi, Karebu wa chichi Hezuron no tsuma Efurata no tokoro ni haitta. Kanojo wa kare ni Tekoa no chichi Ashuru o unda.
Hezuron no choushi Erameru no kora wa choushi Ramu, tsugi wa Buna, Oren, Ozemu, Ahiya de aru.
Erameru wa mata hoka no tsuma o motte ita. Na o Atara to itte, Onamu no haha de aru.
Erameru no choushi Ramu no kora wa Maatsu, Yamin, Ekeru de aru.
Onamu no kora wa Shanmai to Yada de aru. Shanmai no kora wa Nadabu to Abishuru de aru.
Abishuru no tsuma no na wa Abihairu to itte, Aban to Moride o unda.
Nadabu no kora wa Serede to Appaimu de aru. Serede wa ko o motazu ni shinda.
Appaimu no ko wa Ishi, Ishi no ko wa Seshan, Seshan no ko wa Aherai de aru.
Shanmai no kyoudai Yada no kora wa Eteru to Yonatan de aru. Eteru wa ko o motazu ni shinda.
Yonatan no kora wa Perete to Zaza de aru. Ijou wa Erameru no shison de aru.
Seshan ni wa otokonoko wa naku, tada onnanoko nomi de attaga, kare wa Yaruha to yobu Ejiputo bito no dorei o motte ita no de,
Seshan wa musume o dorei Yaruha ni ataete sono tsuma to saseta. Kanojo wa Yaruha ni yotte ATtai o unda.
ATtai wa Natan o umi, Natan wa Zabade o umi,
Zabade wa Efuraru o umi, Efuraru wa Obede o umi,
Obede wa Ehiu o umi, Ehiu wa Azariya o umi,
Azariya wa Herezu o umi, Herezu wa Ereasa o umi,
Ereasa wa Shisumai o umi, Shisumai wa Sharumu o umi,
Sharumu wa Ekamiya o umi, Ekamiya wa Erishama o unda.
Erameru no kyoudai de aru Karebu no kora wa choushi o Maresha to itte Jifu no chichi de aru. Maresha no ko wa Heburon.
Heburon no kora wa Kora, TaPpua, Rekemu, Shima de aru.
Shima wa Rahamu o unda. Rahamu wa Yorukamu no chichi de aru. Mata Rekemu wa Shanmai o unda.
Shanmai no ko wa Maon. Maon wa Betezuru no chichi de aru.
Karebu no sobame Epa wa Haran, Moza, Gazezu o unda. Haran wa Gazezu o unda.
Edai no kora wa Regemu, Yotamu, Geshan, Perete, Epa, Shafu de aru.
Karebu no sobame Maaka wa Shiberu to Teruhana o umi,
Mata Mademanna no chichi Shafu oyobi Makubena to Gibea no chichi Shiwa o unda. Karebu no musume wa Akusa de aru.
Korera wa Karebu no shison de atta. Efurata no choushi Horu no kora wa kiriate yarimu no chichiShobaru,
Betsurehemu no chichi Saruma oyobi Betegaderu no chichi Harefu de aru.
Kiriate yarimu no chichi Shobaru kora wa Haroe to Menukote bito no nakaba de aru.
Kiriate yarimu no shizoku wa Iteru bi to, Pute bi to, Shuma bi to, Mishira bito de atte, korera kara Zarea bi to oyobi Eshitaoru bito ga deta.
Saruma no kora wa Betsurehemu, Netopa bi to, atarote bete yoabu, Manahate bito no nakaba oyobi Zori bito de aru.
Mata Yabezu ni sunde ita shoki no shizoku Terate bi to, Shimeate bi to, Sukate bito de aru. Korera wa Keni bi to deatte Rekabu no ie no senzo Hamate kara deta mono de aru.
Heburon de umareta Dabide no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Choushi wa Amunon de Ezureru bito Ahinoamu kara umare, tsugi wa Danieru de Karumeru bi to Abigairu kara umare,
Daisan wa Abusaromu de Geshuru no ou Tarumai no musume Maaka no unda ko, daiyon wa Adoniya de Hagite no unda ko,
Daigo wa Shipateya de Abitaru kara umare, dairoku wa Itereamu de, kare no tsuma Egura kara umareta.
Kono rokunin wa Heburon de kare ni umareta. Dabide ga soko de ou to natte ita no wa nana nen roku kagetsu, Erusaremu de ou to natte ita no wa sanjuu san nen de atta.
Erusaremu de umareta mono wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Shimea, Shobabu, Natan, Soromon. Kono yonnin wa Anmieru no musume Bateshua kara umareta.
Mata Ibuharu, Erishama, Eriperete,
Noga, Nepegu, Yapia,
Erishama, Eriada, Eriperete no kyuunin,
Korera wa mina Dabide no ko de aru. Kono hoka ni, sobamedomo no unda kora ga ari, Tamaru wa karera no shimai de atta.
Soromon no ko wa Rehabeamu, sono ko wa Abiya, sono ko wa Asa, sono ko wa Yoshapate,
Sono ko wa Yoramu, sono ko wa Ahajiya, sono ko wa Yoashi,
Sono ko wa Amajiya, sono ko wa Azariya, sono ko wa Yotamu,
Sono ko wa Ahazu, sono ko wa Hizekiya, sono ko wa Manase,
Sono ko wa Amon, sono ko wa Yoshiya,
Yoshiya no kora wa choushi Yohanan, tsugi wa Ehoyakimu, daisan wa Zedekiya, daiyon wa Sharumu de aru.
Ehoyakimu no shison wa sono ko wa Ekonia, sono ko wa Zedekiya de aru.
Horyo to natta Ekoniya no kora wa sono ko Sharuteru,
Marukiramu, Pedaya, Senazaru, Ekamia, Hoshama, Nedabiya de aru.
Pedaya no kora wa Zerubaberu to Shimei de aru. Zerubaberu no kora wa Meshuramu to Hananiya. Shiromite wa karera no shimai de aru.
Mata Hashuba, Oheru, Berekiya, Hasadeya, yusabu hesede no gonin ga aru.
Hananiya no kora wa Perateya to Eshaya, sono ko Repaya, sono ko Arunan, sono ko Obadeya, sono ko Shikaniya de aru.
Shikaniya no kora wa Shimaya. Shimaya no kora wa Hattoshi, Igaru, Baria, Neariya, Shapate no rokunin de aru.
Neariya no kora wa Erioenai, Hizekiya, Azurikamu no sannin de aru.
Erioenai no kora wa Hodaya, Eriashibu, Peraya, Akkubu, Yohanan, Deraya, Anani no shichinin de aru.
Yuda no kora wa Perezu, Hezuron, Karumi, Horu, Shobaru de aru.
Shobaru no ko Reaya wa Yahate o umi, Yahate wa Ahomai to Rahade o unda. Korera wa Zarea bito no ichizoku de aru.
Etamu no kora wa Ezureru, Ishima oyobi Idebashi, karera no shimai no na wa Hazereruponi de aru.
Gedoru no chichi wa Penueru, Hosha no chichi wa Ezeru de aru. Korera wa Betsurehemu no chichi Efurata no choushi Horu no kora de aru.
Tekoa no chichi Ashuru ni wa futari no tsuma Hera to Naara to ga atta.
Naara wa Ashuru ni yotte Ahozamu, Heperu, Temeni oyobi Ahashitari o unda. Korera wa Naara no ko de aru.
Hera no kora wa Zerete, Ezoaru, Etenan de aru.
Kozu wa Anubu to Zobeba o unda. Mata Harumu no ko Aharuheru no shizoku mo kare kara deta.
Yabezu wa sono kyoudai no uchi de mottomo tattobareta mono de atta. Sono haha ga "Watashi wa kurushinde kono ko o undakara" to itte sono na o Yabezu to nazuketa no de aru.
Yabezu wa Isuraeru no kami ni yobawatte itta, "Dou ka, anata ga yutaka ni watashi o megumi, watashi no kokkyou o hiroge, anata no te ga watashi to tomo ni atte, watashi o wazawai kara manukaresase, kurushimi o ukesaserarenai you ni". Kami wa kare no motomeru tokoro o yurusareta.
Shuwa no kyoudai kerubu wa Mehiru o unda. Mehiru wa Eshiton no chichi,
Eshiton wa Beterapa, Pasea oyobi Irunahashi no chichi Tehinna o unda. Korera wa Reka no hitobito de aru.
Kenazu no kora wa Otenieru to Seraya. Otenieru no kora wa Hatate to Meonotai.
Meonotai wa Ofura o umi, Seraya wa Geharashimu no chichi Yoabu o unda. Karera wa koujin de atta no de Geharashimu to yobareta no de aru.
Efunne no ko Karebu no kora wa Iru, Era oyobi Naamu. Era no ko wa Kenazu.
Eharereru no kora wa Jifu, Jiba, Teria, Asareru de aru.
Ezura no kora wa Eteru, Merede, Eperu, Yaron. Tsugi no mono wa Merede ga metotta Paro no musume Biteya no kora de aru. Sunawachi kanojo wa migomotte Miriamu, Shanmai oyobi Ishiba o unda. Ishiba wa Eshitemoa no chichi de aru.
Kare no tsuma wa Yudayahito de, Gedoru no chichi Erede to Soko no chichi Eberu to Zanoa no chichi Ekuteeru o unda.
Nahamu no shimai de aru Hodeya no tsuma no kora wa Garumu bito Keira no chichi oyobi Maaka bi to Eshitemoa de aru.
Shimon no kora wa Amunon, Rinna, Benehanan, Teron de aru. Ishi no kora wa Zohete to Benezohete de aru.
Yuda no ko Shira no kora wa Reka no chichi Eru, Maresha no chichi Rada oyobi Beteashibea no amanuno ori no ie no ichizoku,
Narabi ni Moabu o osamete Rehemu ni kaetta Yokimu, Kozeba no hitobito, Yoashi oyobiSarafu de aru. Sono kiroku wa furui.
Korera no mono wa touki o tsukuru hito de, Netaimu oyobi Gedera ni sumi, ou no you o suru tame, ou to tomo ni, soko ni sunda.
Shimeon no kora wa Nemueru, Yamin, Yaribu, Zera, Shauru.
Shauru no ko wa Sharumu, sono ko wa Mibusamu, sono ko wa Mishima.
Mishima no shison wa, sono ko wa Hamueru, sono ko wa ZaKkuru, sono ko wa Shimei.
Shimei ni wa otokonoko juu rokunin, onnanoko rokunin attaga, sono kyoudaitachi ni wa ooku no ko wa nakatta. Mata sono shizoku no mono wa subete Yuda no shison hodo ni wa fuenakatta.
Karera no sunda tokoro wa Beerushiba, Morada, hazaru shuaru,
Biruha, Ezemu, Torade,
Betoeru, Horuma, Chikuragu,
Bete marukabote, hazaru sushimu, bete biri, oyobi Sharaimu de aru. Korera wa Dabide no yo ni itaru made karera no machi de atta.
Sono murazato wa Etamu, Ain, Rinmon, Token, Ashan no itsutsu no machi de aru.
Mata korera no machimachi no shuui ni ooku no mura ga atte, Baaru made oyonda. Karera no sumika wa ijou no toori de, karera wa onoono keizu o motte ita.
Meshobabu, Yamureku, Amajiya no ko Yosha,
Yoeru, Ashieru no hiko, Seraya no mago, Yoshibia no ko Ehiu.
Erioenai, Yakoba, Eshohaya, Asaya, Adeeru, Eshimieru, Benaya,
Oyobi Shipi no ko Jiza. Shipi wa Aron no ko, Aron wa Edaya no ko, Edaya wa Shimuri no ko, Shimuri wa Shimaya no ko de aru.
Koko ni na o ageta monodomo wa sono shizoku no chou de atte, sorera no shizoku wa ooini fue hirogatta.
Karera wa mure no tame ni makiba o motomete Gedoru no iriguchi ni iki, tani no higashi no hou made susumi,
Tsuini yutaka na yoi makiba o miidashita. Sono chi wa hiroku odayaka de, yasuraka de atta. Sono chi no mae no juumin wa Hamu bito de attakara de aru.
Korera no na o shirushita monodomo wa Yuda no ou Hizekiya no yo ni itte, karera no tenmaku to, soko ni ita Meuni bito o uchiyaburi, karera o kotogotoku horoboshite konnichi ni itatte iru. Soko ni wa, mure no tame no makiba ga atta no de, karera wa soko ni sunda.
Mata Shimeon bito no uchi no gohyakunin wa Ishi no kora Perateya, Neariya, Repaya, Ujieru o kashira to shite Seiruyama ni iki,
Amareku bito de, nogarete nokotte ita mono o uchi horoboshite, konnichi made soko ni sunde iru.
Isuraeru no choushi Ruben no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. - - Ruben wa choushi de attaga chichi no toko o kegashita no de, choushi no ken wa Isuraeru no ko Yosefu no kora ni ataerareta. Sore de choushi no ken ni yoru keizu ni shirusarete inai.
Mata Yuda wa kyoudaitachi ni masaru mono to nari, sono naka kara kun taru mono ga detaga choushi no ken wa Yosefu no mono to natta no de aru. - -
Sunawachi Isuraeru no choushi Ruben no kora wa Hanoku, Paru, Hezuron, Karumi.
Yoeru no kora wa sono ko wa Shimaya, sono ko wa Gogu, sono ko wa Shimei,
Sono ko wa Mika, sono ko wa Reaya, sono ko wa Baaru,
Sono ko wa Beera de aru. Kono Beera wa ASsuriya no ou terugate piruneseru ga toraeutsushita mono de aru. Kare wa Ruben bito no tsukasa de atta.
Kare no kyoudaitachi wa, sono shizoku ni yori, sono rekidai no keizu ni yoreba, kashira Eieru oyobi Zekariya,
Bera nado de aru. Bera wa Azazu no ko, Shima no mago, Yoeru no hiko de aru. Kare wa Aroeru ni sumi, Nebo oyobi Baaru Meon made oyonde itaga,
Gireade no chi de kare no kachiku ga fue mashita no de, kare wa higashi no hou Yufurate kawa no konata no arano no iriguchi ni made sunda.
Mata Sauru no toki, karera wa Hagaru bito to tatakatte, kore o uchitaoshi, Gireade no higashi no zenbu ni watatte karera no tenmaku ni sunda.
Gado no shison wa kore to aitai shite Bashan no chi ni sumi, Saruka made oyonde ita.
Sono kashira wa Yoeru, tsugi wa Shapamu, Yaanai, Shapate de, tomo ni Bashan ni sunda.
Karera no kyoudaitachi wa, sono shizoku ni yoreba Mikaeru, Meshuramu, Shiba, Yorai, Yakan, Jia, Eberu no shichinin de aru.
Korera wa Hori no ko Abihairu no kora de aru. Hori wa Yaroa no ko, Yaroa wa Gireade no ko, Gireade wa Mikaeru no ko, Mikaeru wa Eshisai no ko, Eshisai wa Yado no ko, Yado wa Buzu no ko de aru.
Ahiwa Abuderu no ko, Abuderu wa Guni no ko, Guni wa sono shizoku no chou de aru.
Karera wa Gireade to Bashan to sono murazato to Sharon no subete no houboku chi ni sunde, sono shihou no sakai ni made oyonde ita.
Korera wa mina Yuda no ou Yotamu no yo to Isuraeru no ou Yarabeamu no yo ni keizu ni noserareta.
Ruben bito to, Gado bi to to, Manase no han buzoku ni wa dete tatakai uru mono yon man yonsen nanahyaku rokujuunin ari, minayuushi de, tate to tsurugi o tori, yumi o hiki, tatakai ni takumi na hitobito de atta.
Karera wa Hagaru bi to oyobi Etoru, Nefushi, Nodabu nado to tatakattaga,
Tasuke o ete kore o semeta no de, Hagaru bi to oyobi kore to tomo ni ita mono wa mina, karera no te ni watasareta. Kore wa karera ga tatakai ni atatte kami ni yobawari, kami ni yori tayonda no de kami wa sono negai o kikaretakara de aru.
Karera wa sono kachiku o ubaitottaga, rakuda go man, hitsuji nijuu go man, roba nisen ari, mata hito wa juu mannin atta.
Kore wa sono tatakai ga kami ni yotta no de, ooku no mono ga korosarete taoretakara de aru. Soshite karera wa toraeutsusareru toki made, kore ni kawatte sono tokoro ni sunda.
Manase no han buzoku no hitobito wa kono chi ni sumi, fue hirogatte, tsuini Bashan kara Baaru Herumon, Seniru oyobi Herumon yama ni made oyonda.
Sono shizoku no choutachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi, Eperu, Ishi, Erieru, Azurieru, Eremiya, Hodaya, Yadeeru. Korera wa mina sono shizoku no chou de nadakai daiyuushi de atta.
Karera wa senzotachi no kami ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, kami ga, katsute karera no mae kara horobosareta kuni no tami no kamigami o shitatte, kore to kan'in shita no de,
Isuraeru no kami wa, ASsuriya no ou Puru no kokoro o furuiokoshi, mata ASsuriya no ou terugate piruneseru no kokoro o furuiokosareta no de, kare wa tsuini Ruben bito to, Gado bi to to, Manase no han buzoku o toraete iki, Haura to Haboru to Hara to Gozan kawa no hotori ni utsushite konnichi ni itatte iru.
Rebi no kora wa Gerushon, Kohate, Merari.
Kohate no kora wa Amuramu, Izuharu, Heburon, Ujieru.
Amuramu no kora wa Aron, Moose, Miriamu. Aron no kora wa Nadabu, Abiu, Ereazaru, Itamaru.
Ereazaru wa Pinehasu o umi, Pinehasu wa Abishua o umi,
Abishua wa BuKki o umi, BuKki wa Uji o umi,
Uji wa Zerahiya o umi, Zerahiya wa Merayote o umi,
Merayote wa Amariya o umi, Amariya wa Ahitobu o umi,
Ahitobu wa Zadoku o umi, Zadoku wa Ahimaazu o umi,
Ahimaazu wa Azariya o umi, Azariya wa Yonahan o umi,
Yonahan wa Azariya o unda. Kono Azariya wa Soromon ga Erusaremu ni tateta miya de saishi no tsutome o shita mono de aru.
Azariya wa Amariya o umi, Amariya wa Ahitobu o umi,
Ahitobu wa Zatoku o umi, Zatoku wa Sharumu o umi,
Sharumu wa Hirukiya o umi, Hirukiya wa Azariya o umi,
Azariya wa Seraya o umi, Seraya wa Yozadaku o unda.
Yozadaku wa Shu ga Nebukadenezaru no te ni yotte Yuda to Erusaremu no hito o toraeutsusareta toki ni toraerarete itta.
Rebi no kora wa Gerushon, Kohate oyobi Merari.
Gerushon no kora no na wa Ribuni to Shimei.
Kohate no kora wa Amuramu, Izuharu, Heburon, Ujieru de aru.
Merari no kora wa Maheri to Mushi. Korera wa Rebi bito no sono iesuji ni yoru shizoku de aru.
Gerushon no ko wa Ribuni, sono ko wa Yahate, sono ko wa Jinma,
Sono ko wa Yoa, sono ko wa Ido, sono ko wa Zera, sono ko wa Yaterai.
Kohate no ko wa Aminadabu, sono ko wa Kora, sono ko wa Ashiru,
Sono ko wa Erukana, sono ko wa Ebiasafu, sono ko wa Ashiru,
Sono ko wa Tahate, sono ko wa Urieru, sono ko wa Ujiya, sono ko wa Shauru.
Erukana no kora wa Amasai to Ahimote,
Sono ko wa Erukana, sono ko wa Zopai, sono ko wa Nahate,
Sono ko wa Eriabu, sono ko wa Erohamu, sono ko wa Erukana.
Samueru no kora wa, choushi wa Yoeru, tsugi wa Abiya.
Merari no ko wa Maheri, sono ko wa Ribuni, sono ko wa Shimei, sono ko wa Uza,
Sono ko wa Shimea, sono ko wa Hagiya, sono ko wa Asaya de aru.
Keiyaku no hako o anchi shita nochi, Dabide ga Shu no miya de uta o utau koto o tsukasadoraseta hitobito wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Karera wa kaiken no makuya no mae de uta o motte tsukaetaga, Soromon ga Erusaremu ni Shu no miya o tatete kara wa, ittei no chitsujo ni shitagatte tsutome o okonatta.
Sono tsutome o shita mono, oyobi sono kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kohate bito no kora no uchi Eman wa uta o utau mono, Heman wa Yoeru no ko, Yoeru wa Samueru no ko,
Samueru wa Erukana no ko, Erukana wa Erohamu no ko, Erohamu wa Erieru no ko, Erieru wa Toa no ko,
Toa wa Zufu no ko, Zufu wa Erukana no ko, Erukana wa Mahate no ko, Mahate wa Amasai no ko,
Amasai wa Erukana no ko, Erukana wa Yoeru no ko, Yoeru wa Azariya no ko, Azariya wa Zepaniya no ko,
Zepaniya wa Tahate no ko, Tahate wa Ashiru no ko, Ashiru wa Ebiasafu no ko, Ebiasafu wa Kora no ko,
Kora wa Izuharu no ko, Izuharu wa Kohate no ko, Kohate wa Rebi no ko, Rebi wa Isuraeru no ko de aru.
Heman no kyoudai Asafu wa Heman no migi ni tatta. Asafu wa Berekiya no ko, Berekiya wa Shimea no ko,
Shimea wa Mikaeru no ko, Mikaeru wa Baaseya no ko, Baaseya wa Marukiya no ko,
Marukiya wa Eteni no ko, Eteni wa Zera no ko, Zera wa Adaya no ko,
Adaya wa Etan no ko, Etan wa Jinma no ko, Jinma wa Shimei no ko,
Shimei wa Yahate no ko, Yahate wa Gerushon no ko, Gerushon wa Rebi no ko de aru.
Mata karera no kyoudai de aru Merari no kora ga hidari ni tatta. Sono uchi no Etan wa Kishi no ko, Kishi wa Abude no ko, Abude wa Maruku no ko,
Maruku wa Hashabiya no ko, Hashabiya wa Amajiya no ko, Amajiya wa Hirukiya no ko,
Hirukiya wa Amuji no ko, Amuji wa Bani no ko, Bani wa Semeru no ko,
Semeru wa Maheri no ko, Maheri wa Mushi no ko, Mushi wa Merari no ko, Merari wa Rebi no ko de aru.
Karera no kyoudai de aru Rebi bitotachi wa, kami no miya no makuya no moromoro no tsutome ni ninjirareta.
Aron to sono kora wa hansai no dan to kou no saidan no ue ni sasageru koto o nashi, mata shiseijo no subete no waza o nashi, katsu Isuraeru no tame ni aganai o nashita. Subete kami no shimobe Moose no meijita toori de aru.
Aron no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Aron no ko wa Ereazaru, sono ko wa Pinehasu, sono ko wa Abishua,
Sono ko wa BuKki, sono ko wa Uji, sono ko wa Zerahiya,
Sono ko wa Merayote, sono ko wa Amariya, sono ko wa Ahitobu,
Sono ko wa Zadoku, sono ko wa Ahimaazu de aru.
Aron no shison no sumu tokoro wa sono sakai no uchi ni aru shukuei ni yotte ieba tsugi no toori de aru. Mazu Kohate bito no shizoku ga kuji ni yotte eta tokoro,
Sunawachi karera ga ataerareta tokoro wa, Yuda no chi ni aru Heburon to sono shuui no houboku chi de aru.
Tadashi, sono machi no tahata to sono muramura wa, Efunne no ko Karebu ni ataerareta.
Soshite Aron no shison ni ataerareta mono wa, nogare no machi de aru Heburon oyobi Ribuna to sono houboku chi, YaTteru oyobi Eshitemoa to sono houboku chi,
Hirento sono houboku chi, Debiru to sono houboku chi,
A shanto sono houboku chi, Beteshimeshi to sono houboku chi de aru.
Mata Beniyamin no buzoku no uchi kara wa Geba to sono houboku chi, Aremete to sono houboku chi, Anatote to sono houboku chi o ataerareta. Karera no machi wa, subete sono shizoku no uchi ni juu san atta.
Mata Kohate no shison no nokori no mono wa buzoku no shizoku no uchi kara to, han buzoku sunawachi Manase no han buzoku no uchi kara kuji ni yotte juu no machi o ataerareta.
Mata Gerushon no shison wa sono shizoku ni yotte Issakaru no buzoku, Aseru no buzoku, Nafutari no buzoku, oyobi Bashan no Manase no buzoku no uchi kara juu san no machi ga ataerareta.
Merari no shison wa sono shizoku ni yotte Ruben no buzoku, Gado no buzoku, oyobi Zeburun no buzoku no uchi kara kuji ni yotte juu ni no machi ga ataerareta.
Kono you ni Isuraeru no hitobito wa Rebi bito ni machimachi to sono houboku chi to o ataeta.
Sunawachi Yuda no shison no buzoku to Shimeon no buzoku no shison to, Beniyamin no shison no buzoku no uchi kara koko ni na o ageta korera no machi o kuji ni yotte ataeta.
Kohate no shison no shizoku wa mata Efuraimu no buzoku no uchi kara mo machimachi o ete sono ryouchi to shita.
Sunawachi karera ga ataerareta, nogare no machi wa Efuraimu no sanchi ni aru Shikemu to sono houboku chi, Gezeru to sono houboku chi,
Yokumeamu to sono houboku chi, Betehoron to sono houboku chi,
Ayaron to sono houboku chi, Gaterinmon to sono houboku chi de aru.
Mata Manase no han buzoku no uchi kara wa, Aneru to sono houboku chi oyobi Bireamu to sono houboku chi o, Kohate no shison no shizoku no nokori no mono ni ataeta.
Gerushon no shison ni ataerareta mono wa Manase no han buzoku no uchi kara wa Bashan no Goran to sono houboku chi, Ashitarote to sono houboku chi.
Issakaru no buzoku no uchi kara wa Kedeshi to sono houboku chi, Daberate to sono houboku chi,
Ramote to sono houboku chi, Anemu to sono houboku chi.
Aseru no buzoku no uchi kara wa Masharu to sono houboku chi, Abudon to sono houboku chi,
Hokoku to sono houboku chi, Rehobu to sono houboku chi.
Nafutari no buzoku no uchi kara wa Gariraya no Kedeshi to sono houboku chi, Hanmon to sono houboku chi, Kiriataimu to sono houboku chi de aru.
Kono hoka no mono, sunawachi Merari no shison ni ataerareta mono wa Zeburun no buzoku no uchi kara Rinmon to sono houboku chi, Taboru to sono houboku chi,
Eriko ni chikai Yorudan no kanata, sunawachi Yorudan no higashi de wa Ruben no buzoku no uchi kara wa arano no Bezeru to sono houboku chi, Yaza to sono houboku chi,
Kedemote to sono houboku chi, Mepaate to sono houboku chi.
Gado no buzoku no uchi kara wa Gireade no Ramote to sono houboku chi, Mahanaimu to sono houboku chi,
Heshibon to sono houboku chi, Yazeru to sono houboku chi de aru.
Issakaru no kora wa Tora, Puwa, Yashubu, Shimuromu no yonnin.
Tora no kora wa Uji, Repaya, Erieru, Yamai, Ebusamu, Samueru. Kore wa mina Tora no ko de, sono shizoku no chou de aru. Sono shison no daiyuushi taru mono wa Dabide no yo ni wa sono kazu ni man nisen roppyakunin de atta.
Uji no ko wa Izurahiya, Izurahiya no kora wa Mikaeru, Obadeya, Yoeru, Ishia no gonin de, mina choutaru mono de atta.
Sono shison no uchi ni, sono shizoku ni shitagaeba gunzei no shisotsu san man rokusennin atta. Kore wa karera ga saishi o ooku motte itakara de aru.
Issakaru no subete no shizoku no uchi no kyoudaitachi de keizu ni yotte kazoerareta daiyuushi wa awasete hachi man nanasennin atta.
Beniyamin no kora wa Bera, Bekeru, Edeaeru no sannin.
Bera no kora wa Ezubon, Uji, Ujieru, Eremote, Iri no gonin de, mina sono shizoku no chou de aru. Sono keizu ni yotte kazoerareta daiyuushi wa ni man nisen sanjuu yonnin atta.
Bekeru no kora wa Zemira, Yoashi, Eriezeru, Erioenai, Omuri, Eremote, Abiya, Anatote, Aramete de mina Bekeru no kora de aru.
Sono shison no uchi, sono shizoku no chou to shite keizu ni yotte kazoerareta daiyuushi wa ni man nihyakunin atta.
Edeaeru no ko wa Biruhan. Biruhan no kora wa Eushi, Beniyamin, Ehode, Kenaana, Zetan, Tarushishi, Ahishaharu.
Mina Edeaeru no kora de shizoku no chou de atta. Sono shison no uchi ni wa, ikusa ni dete yoku tatakau daiyuushi ga ichi man nanasen nihyakunin atta.
Mata Iru no kora wa Shupamu to Hopamu. Aheru no ko wa Hoshimu de aru.
Nafutari no kora wa Yahajieru, Guni, Ezeru, Sharumu de mina Biruha no unda ko de aru.
Manase no kora wa sono sobame de aru Suriya no onna no unda Asurieru. Kanojo wa mata Gireade no chichi Makiru o unda.
Makiru wa Hopamu to Shupamu no imouto Maaka to iu mono o tsuma ni metotta. Ni banme no ko wa Zeropehade to iu. Zeropehade ni wa onnanoko dake ga atta.
Makiru no tsuma Maaka wa otokonoko o unde na o Pereshi to nazuketa. Sono otouto no na wa Shareshi. Shareshi no kora wa Uramu to Rakemu de aru.
Uramu no ko wa Bedan. Korera wa Manase no ko Makiru no ko de aru Gireade no kora de aru.
Sono imouto Hanmorekete wa Ishihode, Abiezeru, Mahera o unda.
Semida no kora wa Ahian, Shikemu, Riki, Aniamu de aru.
Efuraimu no ko wa Shutera, sono ko wa Berede, sono ko wa Tahate, sono ko wa Erada, sono ko wa Tahate,
Sono ko wa Zabade, sono ko wa Shutera de aru. Ezeru to Ereade wa Gate no dojinra ni korosareta. Kore wa karera ga kudatte itte sono kachiku o ubaou to shitakara de aru.
Chichi Efuraimu ga hi hisashiku kono tame ni kanashinda no de, sono kyoudaitachi ga kite kare o nagusameta.
Sono nochi, Efuraimu wa tsuma no tokoro ni haitta. Tsuma wa harande otokonoko o umi, sono na o Beria to nazuketa. Sono ie ni wazawai ga attakara de aru.
Efuraimu no musume sera wa ue to shita no Betehoron oyobi uzen sera o tateta.
Beria no ko wa Repa, sono ko wa Resefu, sono ko wa Tera, sono ko wa Tahan,
Sono ko wa Radan, sono ko wa Amihode, sono ko wa Erishama,
Sono ko wa Nun, sono ko wa Yoshua.
Efuraimu no shison no ryouchi to juusho wa Beteru to sono muramura, mata higashi no hou de wa Naaran, nishi no hou de wa Gezeru to sono muramura, mata Shikemu to sono muramura, Awa to sono muramura.
Mata Manase no shison no kokkyou ni sotte, Beteshan to sono muramura, Taanaku to sono muramura, Megidon to sono muramura, Doru to sono muramura de, Isuraeru no ko Yosefu no shison wa korera no tokoro ni sunda.
Aseru no kora wa Imuna, Ishiwa, Esui, Beria oyobi sono shimai sera.
Beria no kora wa Heberu to Marukieru. Marukieru wa Biruzahite no chichi de aru.
Heberu wa Yafurete, Shomeru, Hotamu oyobi sono shimai Shua o unda.
Yafurete no kora wa Pasaku, Bimuharu, Ashiwate. Korera wa Yarefute no kora de aru.
Kare no kyoudaiShomeru no kora wa Roga, Hoba oyobi Aramu.
Shomeru no kyoudai Heremu no kora wa Zopa, Imuna, Shireshi, Amaru.
Zopa no kora wa Sua, Haruneperu, Shuaru, Beri, Imura,
Bezeru, Hodo, Shanma, Shirusha, Iteran, Beera.
Eteru no kora wa Efunne, Pisupa oyobi Ara.
Ura no kora wa Ara, Hanieru, oyobi Rijia.
Korera wa mina Aseru no shison de atte, sono shizoku no chou, erinuki no daiyuushi, tsukasatachi no kashira de atta. Sono keizu ni yotte kazoerareta mono de, ikusa ni dete yoku tatakau mono no kazu wa ni man rokusennin de atta.
Beniyamin no unda mono wa choushi wa Bera, sono tsugi wa Ashiberu, daisan wa Ahara,
Daiyon wa Noha, daigo wa Rapa.
Bera no kora wa Adaru, gera, Abiude,
Abishua, Naaman, Ahoa,
Gera, Shifupamu, Hiramu.
Ehode no kora wa tsugi no toori de aru. (korera wa Geba no juumin no shizoku no chou de atte, Manahate ni toraeutsusareta mono de aru.)
Sunawachi Naaman, Ahiya, gera sunawachi Heguramu. Gera wa Uza to Ahifude no chichi de atta.
Shaharaimu wa tsuma Hoshimu to Baara o ribetsu shite nochi, Moabu no kuni de kora o mouketa.
Kare ga tsuma Hodeshi ni yotte mouketa kora wa Yobabu, Jibia, Mesha, Marukamu,
Euzu, Shakiya, Miruma. Korera wa sono kora de atte shizoku no chou de aru.
Kare wa mata Hoshimu ni yotte Abitobuto Erupaaru o mouketa.
Erupaaru no kora wa Eberu, Mishamu oyobi Semedo. Kare wa Ono to Rodo to sono muramura o tateta mono de aru.
Mata Beria to Shima ga atta. (kore wa Ayaron no juumin no shizoku no chou de atte, Gate no juumin o oiharatta mono de aru.)
Mata Ahio, Shashaku, Eremote.
Zebadeya, Arade, Aderu,
Mikaeru, Ishipa oyobi Yoha wa Beria no kora de atta.
Zebadeya, Meshuramu, Hezeki, Heberu,
Ishimerai, Ezuria oyobi Yobabu wa Erupaaru no kora de atta.
Yakin, Jikuri, Zabede,
Erienai, Chirutai, Erieru,
Adaya, Beraya oyobi Shimurate wa Shima no kora de atta.
Ishipan, Heberu, Erieru,
Abudon, Jikuri, Hanan,
Hananiya, Eramu, Antoteya,
Ipedeya oyobi Penueru wa Shashaku no kora de atta.
Shamuserai, Shiharia, Atariya,
Yaresha, Eriya oyobi Jikuri wa Erohamu no kora de atta.
Korera wa rekidai no shizoku no chou de ari, mata kashira de atte, Erusaremu ni sunda.
Gibeon no chichi Eieru wa Gibeon ni sumi, sono tsuma no na wa Maaka to itta.
Sono choushi wa Abudon de, tsugi wa Tsuru, Kishi, Baaru, Nadabu,
Gedoru, Ahio, Zakeru,
Oyobi Mikurote. Mikurote wa Shimea o unda. Korera mo mata kyoudaitachi to mukaiatte Erusaremu ni sunda.
Neru wa Kishi o umi, Kishi wa Sauru o umi, Sauru wa Yonatan, Marukishua, Abinadabu, Eshibaaru o unda.
Yonatan no ko wa Meribaaru de, Meribaaru wa Mikaeru o unda.
Mika no kora wa Piton, Mereku, Tarea, Ahazu de aru.
Ahazu wa Ehoada o umi, Ehoada wa Aremete, Azumaute, Jimuri o umi, Jimuri wa Moza o umi,
Moza wa Binea o unda. Binea no ko wa Rapa, Rapa no ko wa Ereasa, Ereasa no ko wa Azeru de aru.
Azeru ni wa rokunin no ko ga ari, sono na wa Azurikamu, Bokeru, Ishimaeru, Shariya, Obadeya, Hanan de, mina Azeru no ko de aru.
Sono kyoudai Eseku no kora wa, choushi wa Uramu, tsugi wa Eushi, daisan wa Eriperete de aru.
Uramu no kora wa daiyuushi de, yoku yumi o iru mono de atta. Kare wa ooku no ko to mago o mochi, hyaku gojuunin mo atta. Korera wa mina Beniyamin no shison de aru.
Kono you ni subete no Isuraeru bi to wa keizu ni yotte kazoerareta. Korera wa Isuraeru no retsuouki ni shirusarete iru. Yuda wa sono fushin no yue ni Babiron ni hoshuu to natta.
Sono ryouchi no machimachi ni saisho ni sunda mono wa Isuraeru bi to, saishi, Rebi bi to oyobimiya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi de atta.
Mata Erusaremu ni wa Yuda no shison, Beniyamin no shison oyobi Efuraimu to Manase no shison ga sunde ita.
Sunawachi Yuda no ko Perezu no shison no uchi de wa Amihode no ko Utai. Amihode wa Omuri no ko, Omuri wa Imuri no ko, Imuri wa Bani no ko de aru.
Shiro bito no uchi de wa choushi Asaya to sono hoka no kotachi.
Zera no shison no uchi de wa Yueru to sono kyoudai roppyaku kyuujuunin.
Beniyamin no shison no uchi de wa Hasenua no ko Hodabiya no ko de aru Meshuramu no ko Saru,
Erohamu no ko Ibuniya, Mikuri no ko de aru Uji no ko Era oyobi Ibuniya no ko Riueru no ko de aru Shipateya no ko Meshuramu,
Narabi ni karera no kyoudaitachi de, sono keizu ni yoreba awasete kyuuhyaku gojuu rokunin. Korera no hitobito wa mina sono shizoku no chou de atta.
Saishi no uchi de wa Edaya, Yoaribu, Yakin,
Oyobi Hirukiya no ko Azariya, Hirukiya wa Meshuramu no ko, Meshuramu wa Zadoku no ko, Zadoku wa Merayote no ko, Merayote wa Ahitobu no ko de aru. Azariya wa kami no miya no tsukasa de aru.
Mata Erohamu no ko Adaya, Erohamu wa Pashuru no ko, Pashuru wa Marukiya no ko de aru. Mata Adeeru no ko wa Maaseya, Adeeru wa Yazera no ko, Yazera wa Meshuramu no ko, Meshuramu wa Meshiremote no ko, Meshiremote wa Inmeru no ko de aru.
Sono hoka ni karera no kyoudaitachi mo atta. Korera wa sono shizoku no chou de, awasete issen nanahyaku rokujuunin, mina kami no miya no tsutome o suru no ni, hanahada chikara no aru hitobito de atta.
Rebi bito no uchi de wa Hashubu no ko Shimaya, Hashubu wa Azurikamu no ko, Azurikamu wa Hashabiya no ko de, korera wa Merari no shison de aru.
Mata Bakubakkaru, Hereshi, Gararu, oyobi Asafu no ko Jikuri no ko de aru Mika no ko Mattaniya,
Narabi ni Edoton no ko Gararu no ko de aru Shimaya no ko Obadeya oyobi Erukana no ko de aru Asa no ko Berekiya, Erukana wa Netopa bi to no murazato ni sunda mono de aru.
Mon o mamoru mono wa Sharumu, Akkubu, Tarumon, Ahiman oyobi sono kyoudaitachi de, Sharumu wa sono chou de atta.
Kare wa konnichi made higashi no hou ni aru ou no mon o mamotte iru. Korera wa Rebi no shison de ei no mon o mamoru mono de aru.
Kora no ko Ebiyasafu no ko de aru Kore no ko Sharumu oyobi sono shizoku no kyoudaitachi nado no Kora bi to wa makuya no moromoro no mon o mamoru tsutome o tsukasadotta. Sono senzotachi wa Shu no ei o tsukasadori, sono iriguchi o mamoru mono de atta.
Ereazaru no ko Pinehasu ga, mukashi karera no tsukasa de atta. Shu wa kare to tomo ni orareta.
Meshiremiya no ko Zekariya wa kaiken no makuya no mon o mamoru mono de atta.
Korera wa mina erabarete mon o mamoru mono de, awasete nihyaku juu ninin atta. Karera wa sono muramura de keizu ni yotte kazoerareta mono de, Dabide to senkensha Samueru ga karera o shoku ni ninjita no de aru.
Kou shite karera to sono shison wa kanshunin to shite, Shu no ie de aru makuya no ie no mon o tsukasadotta.
Mon o mamoru mono wa touzai nanboku no shihou ni ita.
Mata sono muramura ni iru kyoudaitachi wa nanuka goto ni kawari, kite karera o tasuketa.
Mon o mamoru mono no chou de aru yonnin no Rebi bi to wa kami no ie no moromoro no shitsu to takara to o tsukasadotta.
Karera wa kami no ie o mamoru mi de arukara, sono mawari ni yadotta. Soshite asagoto ni kore o hiraku koto o shita.
Sono uchi ni tsutome no utsuwa o tsukasadoru mono ga atta. Karera wa sono kazu o shirabete tazusae hairi, mata sono kazu o shirabete tazusae dashita.
Mata sono hoka no hin, subete no sei naru utsuwa oyobi mugiko, budoushu, abura, nyuukou, kouryou o tsukasadoru mono ga atta.
Mata saishi no tomo gara no uchi ni kouryou o mazeru mono ga atta.
Kora bi to Sharumu no choushi de Rebi bito no hitori de aru Matateya wa senbei o tsukuru tsutome o tsukasadotta.
Mata Kohate bito no shison de aru sono kyoudaitachi no uchi ni sonae no pan o tsukasadotte, ansokunichi goto ni kore o totonoeru monodomo ga atta.
Rebi bito no shizoku no chou de aru korera no mono wa uta utau mono de atte, miya no moromoro no shitsu ni sumi, hoka no tsutome wa shinakatta. Karera wa nichiya jibun no tsutome ni shitagattakara de aru.
Korera wa Rebi bito no rekidai no shizoku no chou de atte, kashira taru hitobito de atta. Karera wa Erusaremu ni sunda.
Gibeon no chichi Ehieru wa Gibeon ni sunde ita. Sono tsuma no na wa Maaka to itta.
Kare no choushi wa Abudon, tsugi wa Tsuru, Kishi, Baaru, Neru, Nadabu,
Gedoru, Ahio, Zekariya, Mikurote de aru.
Mikurote wa Shimeamu o unda. Karera mo sono kyoudaitachi to tomo ni Erusaremu ni sunde, sono kyoudaitachi to mukaiatte ita.
Neru wa Kishi o umi, Kishi wa Sauru o umi, Sauru wa Yonatan, Marukishua, Abinadabu, Eshibaaru o unda.
Yonatan no ko wa Meribaaru de, Meribaaru wa Mika o unda.
Mika no kora wa Piton, Mereku, Tarea oyobi Ahazu de aru.
Ahazu wa Yara o umi, Yara wa Aremete, Azumaute oyobi Jimuri o umi, Jimuri wa Moza o umi,
Moza wa Binea o unda. Binea no ko wa Repaya, sono ko wa Ereasa, sono ko wa Azeru de aru.
Azeru ni rokunin no otokonoko ga atta. Sono na wa Azurikamu, Bokeru, Ishimaeru, Shariya, Obadeya, Hanan. Korera wa mina Azeru no kora de atta.
Sate Perishite bi to wa Isuraeru to tatakattaga, Isuraeru no hitobito ga Perishite bito no mae kara nige, Giruboa yama de korosarete taoreta no de,
Perishite bi to wa Sauru to sono kotachi no ato o oi, Sauru no ko Yonatan, Abinadabu oyobi Marukishua o koroshita.
Tatakai wa hageshiku Sauru ni oshisemari, ite no monodomo ga tsuini Sauru o mitsuketa no de, kare wa te no monodomo ni kizu o owasareta.
Soko de Sauru wa sono buki o toru mono ni itta, "Tsurugi o nuki, sore o motte watashi o sase. Samo naito, korera no katsurei naki mono ga kite, watashi o hazukashimerude arou". Shikashi sono buki o toru mono ga itaku osorete kikiirenakatta no de, Sauru wa tsurugi o totte sono ue ni fushita.
Buki o toru mono wa Sauru no shinda no o mite, jibun mo mata tsurugi no ue ni fushite shinda.
Kou shite Sauru to sannin no kora oyobi sono kazoku wa mina tomo ni shinda.
Tani ni ita Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina karera no nigeru no o mi, mata Sauru to sono kora no shinda no o mite, machimachi o sutete nigeta no de, Perishite bito ga kite sono uchi ni sunda.
Akuruhi Perishite bi to wa korosareta mono kara, hagitoru tame ni kite, Sauru to sono kora no Giruboa yama ni taorete iru no o mi,
Sauru o haide sono kubi to, yoroikabuto o tori, Perishite bito no kuni no shihou ni hito o tsukawashite, kono yoki shirase o sono guuzou to tami ni tsugesaseta.
Soshite Sauru no yoroikabuto o karera no kami no ie ni oki, kubi o Dagon no shinden ni kugizuke ni shita.
Shikashi yabeshi gireade no hitobito wa mina Perishite bito ga Sauru ni shita koto o kiita no de,
Yuushitachi ga mina tachiagari, Sauru no karada to sono kora no karada o totte, kore o Yabeshi ni motte kite, Yabeshi no kashi no ki no shita ni sono hone o houmuri, nanuka no aida, danjiki shita.
Kou shite Sauru wa Shu ni mukatte okashita tsumi no tame ni shinda. Sunawachi kare wa Shu no kotoba o mamorazu, mata kuchiyose ni tou koto o shite,
Shu ni tou koto o shinakatta. Sore de Shu wa kare o koroshi, sono kuni o utsushite Essai no ko Dabide ni ataerareta.
Koko ni Isuraeru no hito wa mina Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni atsumatte kite itta, "Wareware wa, anata no kotsuniku desu.
Saki ni Sauru ga ou de atta toki ni mo, anata wa Isuraeru o hikiite deiri saremashita. Soshite anata no kami, Shu wa anata ni 'Anata wa waga tami Isuraeru o boku suru mono to nari, waga tami Isuraeru no kimi to narude arou' to iwaremashita".
Kono you ni Isuraeru no chourou ga mina Heburon ni iru ou no moto ni kita no de, Dabide wa Heburon de Shu no mae ni karera to keiyaku o musunda. Soshite karera wa, Samueru ni yotte katarareta Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte Dabide ni abura o sosogi, Isuraeru no ou to shita.
Dabide to subete no Isuraeru wa Erusaremu e itta. Erusaremu wa sunawachi Ebusu de atte, soko ni wa sono chi no juumin de aru Ebusu bito ga ita.
Ebusu no juumin wa Dabide ni itta, "Anata wa koko ni haitte wa naranai". Shikashi, Dabide wa Shion no yougai o totta. Kore ga sunawachi Dabide no machi de aru.
Kono toki Dabide wa itta, "Dare de mo daiichi ni Ebusu bito o utsu mono o, kashira to shi, shou to suru". Zeruya no ko Yoabu ga daiichi ni nobotte itta no de, kashira to natta.
Soshite Dabide ga sono yougai ni sunda no de hitobito wa kore o Dabide no machi to nazuketa.
Dabide wa mata sono machi no shuui sunawachi Miro kara shihou ni ishigaki o kizuki, Yoabu wa machi no hoka no bubun o tsukurotta.
Kou shite Dabide wa masumasu ooinaru mono to natta. Bangun no Shu ga kare to tomo ni oraretakara de aru.
Dabide no yuushi no omona mono wa tsugi no toori de aru. Karera wa Isuraeru no subete no hito to tomo ni Dabide ni chikara o soete kuni o esase, Shu ga Isuraeru ni tsuite iwareta kotoba ni shitagatte, kare o ou to shita hitobito de aru.
Dabide no yuushi no kazu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi sannin no chou de aru Hakumoni bito no ko Yashobeamu, kare wa yari o furutte sanbyakunin ni mukai, ichi do ni kore o koroshita mono de aru.
Kare no tsugi wa Ahoa bi to Dodo no ko Ereazaru de, san yuushi no hitori de aru.
Kare wa Dabide to tomo ni Pasudamimu ni itaga, Perishite bito ga soko ni atsumatte kite tatakatta. Soko ni ichimen ni oomugi no haeta jisho ga atta. Tami wa Perishite bito no mae kara nigeta.
Shikashi kare wa jisho no naka ni tatte kore o fusegi, Perishite bito o koroshita. Soshite Shu wa ooinaru shouri o ataete karera o sukuwareta.
Sanjuunin no choutachi no uchi no sannin wa kudatte itte Adoramu no horaana no iwa no tokoro ni iru Dabide no moto e itta. Toki ni Perishite bito no gunzei wa Repaimu no tani ni jin o totte ita.
Sono toki Dabide wa yougai ni ori, Perishite bito no senjin wa Betsurehemu ni attaga,
Dabide wa setsu ni nozonde, "Dare ka Betsurehemu no mon no katawara ni aru ido no mizu o watashi ni nomasete kureruto yoi no daga" to itta.
Soko de sono sannin wa Perishite bito no jin o tsukitootte, Betsurehemu no mon no katawara ni aru ido no mizu o kumitotte, Dabide no moto ni tazusaete kita. Shikashi Dabide wa sore o nomou to wa sezu, sore o Shu no mae ni sosoide,
Itta, "Waga kami yo, watashi wa danjite kore o itashimasen. Inochi o kakete itta kono hitotachi no chi o dou shite watashi wa nomu koto ga dekimashou. Karera wa inochi o kakete kono mizu o totte kita no desu". Sore yue, Dabide wa kono mizu o nomou to wa shinakatta. San yuushi wa kono koto o okonatta.
Yoabu no kyoudai Abishai wa sanjuunin no chou de atta. Kare wa yari o furutte sanbyakunin ni tachimukai, kore o koroshite sannin no hoka ni na o eta.
Kare wa sanjuunin no uchi, mottomo tattobareta mono de, karera no kashira to natta. Shikashi, kano sannin ni wa oyobanakatta.
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa, Kabujieru shusshin no yuushi de atte, ooku no tegara o tateta. Kare wa Moabu no Arieru no futari no ko o uchikoroshita. Kare wa mata yuki no hi ni kudatte itte, ana no naka de shishi o uchikoroshita.
Kare wa mata mi no take go kyubito bakari no Ejiputo bito o uchikoroshita. Sono Ejiputo bi to wa te ni hata no makibou hodo no yari o motte itaga, Benaya wa tsue o totte kare no tokoro e kudatte iki, Ejiputo bito no te kara, yari o mogitori, sono yari o motte kare o koroshita.
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa, korera no koto o itte san yuushi no hoka ni na o eta.
Kare wa sanjuunin no uchi ni yuumei de attaga, kano sannin ni wa oyobanakatta. Dabide wa kare o jiei no chou to shita.
Gundan no uchi no yuushi wa Yoabu no kyoudai Asaheru. Betsurehemu shusshin no Dodo no ko Eruhanan.
Harode shusshin no Shanma. Peron bi to Herezu.
Tekoa shusshin no IKkeshi no ko Ira. Anatote shusshin no Abiezeru.
Hoshate bito Shibekai. Ahoa bi to Irai.
Netopa shusshin no Maharai. Netopa shusshin no Baana no ko Herede.
Beniyamin bito no Gibea kara deta Ribai no ko Itai. Piraton no Benaya.
Gaashi no tani no Horai. Arubate bito Abieru.
Baharumu shusshin no Azumaute. Sharubon shusshin no Eriyaba.
Gizon bito Hasemu. Hararu bi to Shage no ko Yonatan.
Hararu bi to Sakaru no ko Ahiamu. Uru no ko Eriparu.
Mekerate bito Eperu. Peron bi to Ahiya.
Karumeru shusshin no Hezuro. Ezubai no ko Naarai.
Natan no kyoudai Yoeru. Haguri no ko Mibuharu.
Anmon bito Zereku. Zeruya no ko Yoabu no buki o toru mono, Beerote shusshin no Naharai.
Iteru bi to Ira. Iteru bito Garebu.
Hete bito Uriya. Aharai no ko Zabade.
Ruben bi to Shiza no ko Adena. Kare wa Ruben bito no chou de atte, sanjuunin o hikiita.
Mata Maaka no ko Hanan. Miteni bito Yoshapate.
Ashiterate bito Ujiya. Aroeru bito Hotamu no koraShama to Eieru.
Teji bi to Shimuri no ko Edeaeru oyobi sono kyoudai Yoha.
Mahabu bi to Erieru. Erunaamu no kora Eribai oyobi Yoshabiya. Moabu bito Itema.
Erieru, Obede oyobi Mezoba bitoYashieru de aru.
Dabide ga Kishi no ko Sauru ni shirizokerarete, nao Chikuragu ni ita toki, tsugi no hitobito ga kare no moto ni kita. Karera wa Dabide o tasukete tatakatta yuushitachi no uchi ni ari,
Yumi o yoku suru mono, sayuu izure no te o motte mo yoku ya o i, ishi o nageru mono de, tomo ni Beniyamin bito de, Sauru no douzoku de aru.
Sono kashira wa Ahiezeru, tsugi wa Yoashi de, tomo ni Gibea shusshin no Shimaa no kotachi de aru. Mata Ejieru to Perete de, tomo ni Azumaute no kotachi de aru. Mata Beraka oyobi Anatote shusshin no Ehiu.
Mata Gibeon shusshin no Ishimaya, kare wa sanjuunin no uchi no yuushi de, sono sanjuunin no chou de aru. Mata Eremiya, Yahajieru, Yohanan, Gedera shusshin no Yozabade,
Eruzai, Erimote, Beariya, Shimariya, Harifu bito Shipateya,
Erukana, Ishia, Azarieru, Yoezeru, Yashobeamu de, korera wa Kora bito de aru.
Mata Gedoru no Erohamu no kotachi de aru Yoera oyobi Zebadeya de aru.
Gado bi to no uchi kara arano no yougai ni kite, Dabide ni tsuita mono wa minayuushi de, yoku tatakau gunjin, yoku tate to yari o tsukau mono, sono kao wa shishi no kao no you de, sono hayai koto wa yama ni iru shi ka no you de atta.
Karera no kashira wa Ezeru, tsugi wa Obadeya, daisan wa Eriabu,
Daiyon wa Mishimanna, daigo wa Eremiya,
Dairoku wa ATtai, dainana wa Erieru,
Daihachi wa Yonahan, daikyuu wa Eruzabade,
Daijuu wa Eremiya, daijuu ichi wa Makubanai de aru.
Korera wa Gado no shison de gunzei no choutaru mono, sono mottomo chiisai mono de mo hyakunin ni atari, sono mottomo ooinaru mono wa sennin ni atatta.
Shougatsu, Yorudan ga sono zenkishi ni afureta toki, karera wa kore o watatte, tanidani ni iru mono o kotogotoku higashi ni nishi ni nigehashiraseta.
Beniyamin to Yuda no shison no uchi no hitobito ga yougai ni kite, Dabide ni tsuita.
Dabide wa dete karera o mukaete itta, "Anata gata ga koui o motte, watashi o tasukeru tame ni kita no naraba, watashi no kokoro mo anata gata to, hitotsu ni narimashou. Shikashi, watashi no te ni nan no akuji mo nai no ni, moshi anata ga taga, watashi o azamuite, teki ni watasu tame de arunaraba, wareware no senzo no kami ga douzo miso nawa shite, anatagata o semeraremasu you ni".
Toki ni rei ga sanjuunin no chouAmasai ni nozomi, Amasai wa itta, "Dabide yo, wareware wa anata no mono. Essai no ko yo, wareware wa anata to tomo ni aru. Heian are, anata ni heian are. Anata o tasukeru mono ni heian are. Anata no kami ga anata o tasukerareru". Soko de Dabide wa karera o ukeirete butai no chou to shita.
Saki ni Dabide ga Perishite bito to tomo ni Sauru to tatakaou to semete kita toki, Manase bito suunin ga Dabide ni tsuita. (tadashi Dabide wa tsuini Perishite bito o tasukenakatta. Sore wa Perishite bito no kimitachi ga aihakatte, "Kare wa wareware no kubi o totte, sono shukun Sauru no moto ni kaerude arou" to itte, kare o sarasetakara de aru.)
Dabide ga Chikuragu e itta toki, Manase bito Adena, Yozabade, Edeaeru, Mikaeru, Yozabade, Eriu, Jirutai ga kare ni tsuita. Mina Manase bito no sennin no chou de atta.
Karera wa Dabide o tasukete tekigun ni atatta. Karera wa mina daiyuushi de gunzei no chou de atta.
Dabide o tasukeru mono ga hi ni hi ni kuwawatte, tsuini taigun to nari, kami no gunzei no you ni natta.
Shu no kotoba ni shitagai, Sauru no kuni o Dabide ni ataeyou to shite, Heburon ni iru Dabide no moto ni kita busou shita guntai no kazu wa, tsugi no toori de aru.
Yuda no shison de tate to yari o tori, busou shita mono rokusen happyakunin,
Shimeon no shison de, yoku tatakau yuushi nanasen hyakunin,
Rebi no shison kara wa yonsen roppyakunin.
Ehoyada wa Aron no ie no tsukasa de, kare ni zokusuru mono wa sanzen nanahyakunin.
Zadoku wa nen wakai yuushi de, kare no shizoku kara deta shougun wa nijuu ninin.
Sauru no douzoku, Beniyamin no shison kara wa sanzennin, Beniyamin bito no ooku wa nao Sauru no ie ni chuugi o tsukushite ita.
Efuraimu no shison kara wa ni man happyakunin, minayuushi de, sono shizoku no na aru hitobito de atta.
Manase no han buzoku kara wa ichi man hassennin, mina Dabide o ou ni tateyou to shite nobotte kite, na o tsuraneta mono de aru.
Issakaru no shison kara wa yoku jisei ni tsuuji, Isuraeru no nasubeki koto o wakimaeta hitobito ga kita. Sono choutaru mono ga nihyakunin atte, sono kyoudaitachi wa mina sono shiki ni shitagatta.
Zeburun kara wa go mannin, mina kunren o heta guntai de, moromoro no bugu de mi o yoroi, isshin ni Dabide o tasuketa mono de aru.
Nafutari kara wa shou taru mono issennin oyobi tate to yari o totte kore ni shitagau mono san man nanasennin.
Dan bito kara wa busou shita mono ni man hassen roppyakunin.
Aseru kara wa tatakai no sonae o shita jukuren no mono yon mannin.
Mata Yorudan no kanata Ruben bi to, Gado bi to, Manase no han buzoku kara wa moromoro no bugu de mi o yorotta mono juu ni mannin de atta.
Subete korera no tatakai no sonae o shitai kusabi tora wa magokoro o motte Heburon ni kite, Dabide o zenIsuraeru no ou ni shiyou to shita. Kono hoka no Isuraeru bito mo mata, kokoro o hitotsu ni shite Dabide o ou ni shiyou to shita.
Karera wa Heburon ni Dabide to tomo ni mikka ite, kui nomi shita. Sono kyoudaitachi wa karera no tame ni sonae o shitakara de aru.
Mata karera ni chikai hitobito wa Issakaru, Zeburun, Nafutari nado no tooi tokoro no mono made, roba, raku da, raba, ushi nado ni shokumotsu o owasete kita. Sunawachi mugiko no shokumotsu, hi ichijiku, hoshi bu dou, budoushu, abura, ushi, hitsuji nado o ooku tazusaete kita. Kore wa Isuraeru ni yorokobi ga attakara de aru.
Koko ni Dabide wa sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou nado no shoshou to aihakari,
Soshite Dabide wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu ni itta, "Moshi, kono koto o anata gata ga yoshi to shi, wareware no kami, Shu ga kore o yurusarerunaraba, wareware wa, Isuraeru no kakuchi ni nokotte iru wareware no kyoudai narabi ni, houboku chi no tsuite iru machimachi ni iru saishi to Rebi bito ni, tsukai o tsukawashi, wareware no tokoro ni yobiatsumemashou.
Mata kami no hako o wareware no tokoro ni utsushimashou. Wareware wa Sauru no yo ni wa kore o orosoka ni shitakara desu".
Kaishuu wa ichidou "Sou shimashou" to itta. Kono koto ga subete no tami no me ni tadashikattakara de aru.
Soko de Dabide wa kiriate yarimu kara kami no hako o hakonde kuru tame, Ejiputo no Shihoru kara Hamate no iriguchi made no Isuraeru o kotogotoku yobiatsumeta.
Soshite Dabide to subete no Isuraeru wa Baara sunawachi Yuda no kiriate yarimu ni nobori, kerubimu no ue ni zashite orareru Shu no na o motte yobarete iru kami no hako o soko kara kaki noborouto,
Kami no hako o atarashii kuruma ni nosete, Abinadabu no ie kara hikidashi, Uza to Ahiyo ga sono kuruma o gyoshita.
Dabide oyobi subete no Isuraeru wa uta to koto to tategoto to, te tsuzumi to, Shinbaru to, rappa o motte, chikara o kiwamete kami no mae ni odotta.
Karera ga Kidon no uchi ba ni kita toki, Uza wa te o nobete hako o osaeta. Ushi ga tsumazuitakara de aru.
Uza ga te o hako ni tsuketa koto ni yotte, Shu wa kare ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, kare o utareta no de, kare wa sono tokoro de kami no mae ni shinda.
Shu ga Uza o utareta no de, Dabide wa ikatta. Sono tokoro wa konnichi made perezu uza to yobarete iru.
Sono hi Dabide wa kami o osorete itta, "Dou shite kami no hako o, watashi no tokoro e kaite ikeyou ka".
Sore de Dabide wa sono hako o jibun no tokoro Dabide no machi e wa utsusazu, kore o tenjite Gate bito Obede Edomu no ie ni hakobaseta.
Kami no hako wa san kagetsu no aida, Obede Edomu no ie ni, sono kazoku to tomo ni todomatta. Shu wa Obede Edomu no kazoku to sono subete no mochimono o shukufuku sareta.
Tsuro no ou Hiramu wa Dabide ni shisha o tsukawashi, kare no tame ni ie o tatesaseyou to kouhaku oyobi ishiku to mokkou o okutta.
Dabide wa Shu ga jibun o kataku tatete Isuraeru no ou to sareta koto to, sono tami Isuraeru no tame ni kare no kuni o ooini okosareta koto o satotta.
Dabide wa Erusaremu de mata tsumatachi o metotta. Soshite Dabide ni mata musuko, musume ga umareta.
Kare ga Erusaremu de eta kotachi no na wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Shanma, Shobabu,, Natan, Soromon,
Ibuharu, Erishua, Eruperete,
Noga, Nepegu, Yapia,
Erishama, Beeriada, Eriperete de aru.
Sate Perishite bi to wa Dabide ga abura o sosogarete zenIsuraeru no ou ni natta koto o kiita no de, Perishite bi to wa mina nobotte kite Dabide o sagashita. Dabide wa kore o kiite kore ni atarou to dete ittaga,
Perishite bi to wa sudeni kite, Repaimu no tani o okashita.
Dabide wa kami ni toute itta, "Perishite bito ni mukatte noborubekideshou ka. Anata wa karera o watashi no te ni watasarerudeshou ka". Shu wa Dabide ni iwareta, "Nobori nasai. Watashi wa karera o anata no te ni watasou".
Soko de kare wa Baaru Perajimu e nobotte itta. Sono tokoro de Dabide wa karera o uchi hairi, soshite itta, "Kami wa yaburi deru mizu no you ni, watashi no te de teki o yaburareta". Sore yue, sono tokoro no na wa Baaru Perajimu to yobarete iru.
Karera ga jibuntachi no kami o soko ni nokoshite shirizoita no de, Dabide wa meijite kore o hi de yakaseta.
Perishite bi to wa futatabi tani o okashita.
Dabide ga futatabi kami ni touta no de kami wa iwareta, "Anata wa karera o otte nobotte wa naranai. Toomawari shite Barusamu no ki no mae kara karera o osoi nasai.
Barusamu no ki no ue ni koushin no oto ga kikoetanaraba, anata wa itte tatakai nasai. Kami ga anata no mae ni dete Perishite bito no gunzei o utarerukara desu".
Dabide wa kami ga meijirareta you ni shite, Perishite bito no gunzei o uchiyaburi, Gibeon kara Gezeru ni oyonda.
Soko de Dabide no na wa subete no kuniguni ni kikoe watari, Shu wa subete no kunibito ni kare o osoresaserareta.
Dabide wa Dabide no machi no uchi ni jibun no tame ni ie o tate, mata kami no hako no tame ni tokoro o sonae, kore ga tame ni makuya o hatta.
Dabide wa itta, "Kami no hako o kakubeki mono wa tada Rebi bito nomi de aru. Shu ga Shu no hako o kakase, mata Shu ni nagaku tsukaesaseru tame ni karera o erabaretakara de aru".
Dabide wa Shu no hako o kore ga tame ni sonaeta tokoro ni kaki noboru tame, Isuraeru o kotogotoku Erusaremu ni atsumeta.
Dabide wa mata Aron no shison to Rebi bito o atsumeta.
Sunawachi, Kohate no shison no uchi kara wa Urieru o chou to shite sono kyoudai hyaku nijuunin,
Merari no shison no uchi kara wa Asaya o chou to shite sono kyoudai nihyaku nijuunin,
Gerushomu no shison no uchi kara wa Yoeru o chou to shite sono kyoudai hyaku sanjuunin,
Erizapan no shison no uchi kara wa Shimaya o chou to shite sono kyoudai nihyakunin,
Heburon no shison no uchi kara wa Erieru o chou to shite sono kyoudai hachijuunin,
Ujieru no shison no uchi kara wa Aminadabu o chou to shite sono kyoudai hyaku juu ninin de aru.
Dabide wa saishi Zadoku to Abiyataru, oyobi Rebi bi to Urieru, Asaya, Yoeru, Shimaya, Erieru, Aminadabu o meshi,
Karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa Rebi bito no shizoku no chou de aru. Anata gata to anata gata no kyoudai wa tomo ni mi o kiyome, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no hako o watashi ga sono tame ni sonaeta tokoro ni kaki nobori nasai.
Saki ni kore o kaita mono ga anata ga tadenakatta no de, wareware no kami, Shu wa wareware o utaremashita. Kore wa wareware ga sono sadame ni shitagatte sore o atsukawanakattakara desu".
Soko de saishitachi to Rebi bitotachi wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu no hako o kaki noboru tame ni mi o kiyome,
Rebi bitotachi wa Moose ga Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte meijita you ni, kami no hako o sao o motte kata ni ni natta.
Dabide wa mata Rebi bito no choutachi ni, sono kyoudaitachi o erande uta utau mono to nashi, tategoto to koto to Shinbaru nado no gakki o uchihayashi, yorokobi no koe o ageru koto o meijita.
Soko de Rebi bi to wa Yoeru no ko Eman to, sono kyoudai Berekiya no ko Asafu oyobi Merari no shison de aru karera no kyoudai Kushaya no ko Etan o eranda.
Mata kore ni tsugu sono kyoudaitachi ga kore to tomo ni ita. Sunawachi Zekariya, Yajieru, Semiramote, Eieru, Unni, Eriabu, Benaya, Maaseya, Mattateya, Eripereho, Mikuneya oyobi mon o mamoru mono Obede Edomu to Eieru.
Uta utau mono Eman, Asafu oyobi Etan wa seidou no Shinbaru o uchihayasu mono de atta.
Zekariya, Ajieru, Semiramote, Eieru, Unni, Eriabu, Maaseya, Benaya wa Aramote ni shitagatte tategoto o sousuru mono de atta.
Shikashi Mattateya, Eripereho, Mikuneya, Obede Edomu, Eieru, Azajiya wa Seminite ni shitagatte koto o motte shiki suru mono de atta.
Kenaniya wa Rebi bito no gakuchou de, ongaku ni tsuujite ita no de, kore o shiki shita.
Berekiya to Erukana wa hako no tame ni mon o mamoru mono de atta.
Saishi Shibaniya, Yoshapate, Netaneru, Amasai, Zekariya, Benaya, Eriezerura wa kami no hako no mae de rappa o fuki, Obede Edomu to Ehia wa hako no tame ni mon o mamoru mono de atta.
Dabide to Isuraeru no chouroutachi oyobi sennin no choutachi wa itte, Obede Edomu no ie kara Shu no keiyaku no hako o yorokobiisande kaki nobotta.
Kami ga Shu no keiyaku no hako o kaku Rebi bito o tasukerareta no de, karera wa oushi nanatou, ohitsuji nanatou o sasageta.
Dabide wa amanuno no ifuku o kite ita. Hako o kaku subete no Rebi bi to wa, uta utau mono, ongaku o tsukasadoru Kenaniya mo douyou de aru. Dabide wa mata amanuno no Epode o kite ita.
Kou shite Isuraeru wa mina, koe o age, tsunobue o fukinarashi, rappa to, Shinbaru to, tategoto to koto o motte uchihayashite Shu no keiyaku no hako o kaki nobotta.
Shu no keiyaku no hako ga Dabide no machi ni haitta toki, Sauru no musume Mikaru ga mado kara nagame, Dabide ou no maiodoru no o mite, kokoro no uchi ni kare o iyashimeta.
Hitobito wa kami no hako o kakiirete, Dabide ga sono tame ni hatta makuya no uchi ni oki, soshite hansai to shuuonsai o kami no mae ni sasageta.
Dabide wa hansai to shuuonsai o sasage oeta toki, Shu no na o motte tami o shukufuku shi,
Isuraeru no hitobito ni otoko ni mo onna ni mo onoono pan hitotsu, niku hito kire, hoshi bu dou hitokatamari o wakeataeta.
Dabide wa mata Rebi bito no uchi kara Shu no hako no mae ni tsukaeru mono o tatete, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o agame, kansha shi, hometataesaseta.
Gakuchou wa Asafu, sono tsugi wa Zekariya, Eieru, Semiramote, Ehieru, Mattateya, Eriabu, Benaya, Obede Edomu, Eieru de, karera wa tategoto to koto o danji, Asafu wa Shinbaru o uchinarashi,
Saishi Benaya to Yahajieru wa kami no keiyaku no hako no mae de tsune ni rappa o fuita.
Sono hi Dabide wa hajimete Asa futo kare no kyoudaitachi o tatete, Shu ni kansha o sasagesaseta.
Shu ni kansha shi, sono mina o yobi, sono miwaza o moromoro no tami no naka ni shirase yo.
Shu ni mukatte utae, Shu o home utae. Sono moromoro no kusu shikimi waza o katare.
Sono sei naru mina o hokore. Dou ka Shu o motomeru mono no kokoro ga yorokobu you ni.
Shu to sono michikara to o motomeyo. Tsune ni sono mikao o tazune yo.
[12-13] Sono shimobe Aburahamu no sue yo, sono erabareta Yakobu no kora yo. Shu no nasareta kusu shikimi wazato, sono kiseki to, sono mikuchi no sabaki to o kokoro ni tomeyo.
[12-13] Sono shimobe Aburahamu no sue yo, sono erabareta Yakobu no kora yo. Shu no nasareta kusu shikimi wazato, sono kiseki to, sono mikuchi no sabaki to o kokoro ni tomeyo.
Kare wa wareware no kami, Shu ni imasu. Sono sabaki wa zenchi ni aru.
Shu wa tokoshie ni sono keiyaku o mikokoro ni tomerareru. Kore wa yorozu yo ni meijirareta mikotoba de atte,
Aburahamu to musubareta keiyaku, Isaku ni chikawareta yakusoku de aru.
Shu wa kore o kataku tatete Yakobu no tame ni sadame to shi, Isuraeru no tame ni tokoshie no keiyaku to shite,
Iwareta, "Anata ni Kanan no chi o ataete, anata gata no ukeru shigyou no wakemae to suru" to.
Sono toki, karera no kazu wa sukunakute, kazoeru ni tarazu, kano kuni de tabibito to nari,
Kuni kara kuni e iki, kono kuni kara hoka no tami e itta.
Shu wa hito no karera o shi etageru no o yurusarezu, karera no tame ni outachi o kora shimete,
Iwareta, "Waga abura sosogareta monotachi ni sawatte wa naranai. Waga yogensha tachi ni gai o kuwaete wa naranai" to.
Zenchi yo, Shu ni mukatte utae. Higoto ni sono sukui o nobetsutae yo.
Moromoro no kuni no naka ni sono eikou o arawashi, moromoro no tami no naka ni kusu shikimi waza o arawase.
Shu wa ooinaru kata ni imashite, ito home tataubeki mono, moromoro no kami ni masatte, osorubeki mono dakara de aru.
Moromoro no tami no subete no kami wa munashii. Shikashi Shu wa ten o tsukurareta.
Homare to igen to wa sono mimae ni ari, chikara to yorokobi to wa sono seijo ni aru.
Moromoro no tami no yakara yo, Shu ni kiseyo, eikou to chikara to o Shu ni kise yo.
Sono mina ni fusawashii eikou o Shu ni kise yo. Sonaemono o tazusaete Shu no mimae ni kitare. Sei naru yosooi o shite Shu o ogame.
Zenchi yo, sono mimae ni ononoke. Sekai wa kataku tatte, ugokasareru koto wa nai.
Ten wa yorokobi, chi wa tanoshimi, moromoro no kunitami no naka ni ie, "Shu wa ou de arareru" to.
Umi to sono naka ni mitsuru mono to wa nari doyomeki, tahata to sono naka no subete no mono wa yorokobe.
Sono toki hayashi no moromoro no ki mo Shu no mimae ni yorokobiutau. Shu wa chi o sabaku tame ni korarerukara de aru.
Shu ni kansha seyo, Shu wa megumi fukaku, sono itsukushimi wa tokoshie ni taeru koto ga nai.
Mata ie, "Wareware no sukui no kami yo, wareware o sukui, moromoro no kunitami no naka kara wareware o atsumete osukui kudasai. Sou sureba anata no sei naru mina ni kansha shi, anata no homare o hokorudeshou.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa, tokoshie kara tokoshie made ho mubeki ka na" to. Sono toki subete no tami wa "Amen" to itte Shu o hometataeta.
Dabide wa Asa futo sono kyoudaitachi o Shu no keiyaku no hako no mae ni tomeoite, tsune ni hako no mae ni tsukae, hibi no waza o okonawaseta.
Obede Edomu to sono kyoudaitachi wa awasete rokujuu hachinin de aru. Mata Edoton no ko obede edomu oyobi Hosa wa kadomori de atta.
Saishi Zadoku to sono kyoudai de aru saishitachi wa Gibeon ni aru takaki tokoro de Shu no makuya no mae ni tsukae,
Shu ga Isuraeru ni meijirareta rippou ni shirusareta subete no koto ni shitagatte hansai no dan no ue ni asayuu taezu hansai o Shu ni sasageta.
Mata karera to tomo ni Heman, Edoton oyobi hoka no erabarete na o shirusareta monodomo ga ite, Shu no itsukushimi no yoyo kagirinaki koto ni tsuite Shu ni kansha shita.
Sunawachi Heman oyobi Edoton wa karera to tomo ni ite, rappa, Shinbaru oyobi sono ta no seika no tame no gakki o totte ongaku o soushi, Edoton no kora wa mon o mamotta.
Kou shite tami wa mina onoono ie ni kaeri, Dabide wa sono kazoku o shukufuku suru tame ni kaette itta.
Sate Dabide wa jibun no ie ni sumu you ni natta toki, yogensha Natan ni itta, "Miyo, watashi wa kouhaku no ie ni sunde iruga, Shu no keiyaku no hako wa tenmaku no uchi ni aru".
Natan wa Dabide ni itta, "Kami ga anata to tomo ni orarerukara, subete anata no kokoro ni aru tokoro o okonai nasai".
Sono yoru, kami no kotoba ga Natan ni nozonde itta,
"Itte watashi no shimobe Dabide ni tsugeyo, 'Shu wa kou iwareru, watashi no sumu ie o tatete wa naranai.
Watashi wa Isuraeru o michibiki nobotta hi kara konnichi made, ie ni sumawazu, tenmaku kara tenmaku ni, makuya kara makuya ni utsutta no de aru.
Watashi ga subete no Isuraeru to tomo ni ayunda subete no tokoro de, watashi no tami o boku suru koto o meijita Isuraeru no sabaki zukasa no hitori ni, hitokoto de mo, "Dou shite anata gata wa, watashi no tame ni kouhaku no ie o tatenai no ka" to itta koto ga arudarou ka' to.
Sore yue ima anata wa, watashi no shimobe Dabide ni kou ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Watashi wa anata o makiba kara, hitsuji ni shitagatte iru tokoro kara totte, watashi no tami Isuraeru no kimi to shi,
Anata ga doko e iku ni mo anata to tomo ni ori, anata no subete no teki o anata no mae kara tachi satta. Watashi wa mata chi no ue no ooinaru mono no na no you na na o anata ni esaseyou.
Soshite watashi wa waga tami Isuraeru no tame ni hitotsu no tokoro o sadamete, karera o uetsuke, karera o jibun no tokoro ni sumase, kasanete ugoku koto no nai you ni shiyou.
Mata mae no you ni, sunawachi watashi ga waga tami Isuraeru no ue ni sabaki zukasa o tateta toki kara konokata no you ni, warui hito ga kasanete kore o arasu koto wa naide arou. Watashi wa mata anata no moromoro no teki o seifuku suru. Katsu watashi wa Shu ga anata no tame ni ie o taterareru koto o tsugeru.
Anata no hi ga michi, anata no senzotachi no tokoro e ikaneba naranu toki, watashi wa anata no ko, sunawachi anata no kora no hitori o, anata no ato ni tatete, sono oukoku o kataku suru.
Kare wa watashi no tame ni ie o taterude arou. Watashi wa nagaku kare no kurai o kataku suru.
Watashi wa kare no chichi to nari, kare wa watashi no ko to naru. Watashi wa, watashi no itsukushimi o, anata no saki ni atta mono kara torisatta you ni, kare kara wa torisaranai.
Kaette, watashi wa kare o nagaku watashi no ie ni, watashi no oukoku ni sueoku. Kare no kurai wa tokoshie ni kataku tatsude arou' ".
Natan wa subete korera no kotoba no you ni, mata subete kono maboroshi no you ni Dabide ni katatta.
Soko de, Dabide ou wa, hai tte Shu no mae ni zashite itta, "Shu naru kami yo, watashi ga dare, watashi no ie ga nan de aru no de, anata wa kore made watashi o michibikareta no desu ka.
Kami yo, kore wa anata no me ni wa chiisana koto desu. Shu naru kami yo, anata wa shimobe no ie ni tsuite, haruka nochi no koto o katatte, kitarubeki yoyo no koto o shimesaremashita.
Shimobe no meiyo ni tsuite wa, Dabide wa kono ue anata ni nani o moushiageru koto ga dekimashou. Anata wa shimobe o shitte orarerukara desu.
Shu yo, anata wa shimobe no tame ni, mata anata no kokoro ni shitagatte, kono moromoro no ooinaru koto o nashi, subete no ooinaru koto o shirasaremashita.
Shu yo, wareware ga subete mimi ni kiita tokoro ni yoreba, anata no you na mono wa naku, mata anata no hoka ni kami wa arimasen.
Mata chijou no dono kokumin ga, anata no tami Isuraeru no you de arimashou ka. Kore wa kami ga itte, jibun no tame ni aganatte tami to shi, Ejiputo kara anata ga aganai dasareta anata no tami no mae kara kuniguni no tami o oiharai, ooinaru osorubeki koto o itte, na o erareta mono de wa arimasen ka.
Anata wa anata no tami Isuraeru o nagaku anata no tami to saremashita. Shu yo, anata wa karera no kami to narareta no desu.
Sore yue Shu yo, anata ga shimobe to, shimobe no ie ni tsuite katarareta kotoba o nagaku kataku shite, anata no iwareta toori ni shite kudasai.
Sou sureba anata no na wa tokoshie ni kataku sare, agamerarete, 'Isuraeru no kami, bangun no Shu wa Isuraeru no kami de aru' to iware, mata anata no shimobe Dabide no ie wa anata no mae ni kataku tatsu koto ga dekirudeshou.
Waga kami yo, anata wa kare no tame ni ie o tateruto, shimobe ni shimesaremashita. Sore yue, shimobe wa anata no mae ni inoru yuuki o emashita.
Shu yo, anata wa kami ni imashi, kono yoki koto o shimobe ni yakusoku saremashita.
Sore yue douzo ima, shimobe no ie o shukufuku shi, anata no mae ni nagaku tsuzukasete kudasaru you ni. Shu yo, anata no shukufuku sareru mono wa nagaku shukufuku o ukerukara desu".
Kono nochi Dabide wa Perishite bito o utte kore o seifuku shi, Perishite bito no te kara Gate to sono muramura o totta.
Kare wa mata Moabu o utta. Moabu bito wa Dabide no shimobe to natte, mitsugi o osameta.
Dabide wa mata, Hamate no Zoba no ou Hadadezeru ga Yufurate kawa no hotori ni, sono kinenhi o tateyou to shite itta toki kare o utta.
Soshite Dabide wa kare kara sensha issen, kihei nanasennin, hohei ni mannin o totta. Dabide wa ichi hyaku no sensha no uma o nokoshite, sono hoka no sensha no uma wa mina sono ashi no suji o kitta.
Sono toki Damasuko no Suriya bito ga Zoba no ou Hadadezeru o tasukeru tame ni kita no de, Dabide wa sono Suriya bito ni man nisennin o koroshita.
Soshite Dabide wa Damasuko no Suriya ni shubitai o oita. Suriya bi to wa mitsugi o osamete Dabide no shimobe to natta. Shu wa Dabide ni subete sono iku tokoro de shouri o ataerareta.
Dabide wa Hadadezeru no shimobera ga motte ita kin no tate o ubatte, Erusaremu ni motte kita.
Mata Hadadezeru no machi Tebuhate toKun kara Dabide wa hijou ni ooku no seidou o totta. Soromon wa sore o mochiite seidou no umi, hashira oyobi seidou no utsuwa o tsukutta.
Toki ni Hamate no ou Toi wa Dabide ga Zoba no ou Hadadezeru no subete no gunzei o uchiyabutta koto o kiki,
Sono ko Hadoramu o Dabide ou ni tsukawashite, kare ni aisatsu sase, katsu shuku o nobesaseta. Hadadezeru wa katsute shibashiba Toi to tatakai o majietaga, Dabide wa Hadadezeru to tatakatte, kore o uchiyabuttakara de aru. Hadoramu wa kin, gin oyobi seidou no samazama no utsuwa o okutta no de,
Dabide ou wa kore o Edomu, Moabu, Anmon no hitobito, Perishite bi to, Amakure nado no shokokumin no uchi kara totte kita kingin to tomo ni, Shu ni sasageta.
Zeruya no ko Abishai wa shio no tani de, Edomu bito ichi man hassen o uchikoroshita.
Dabide wa Edomu ni shubitai o oki, Edomu bi to wa mina Dabide no shimobe to natta. Shu wa Dabide ni subete sono iku tokoro de shouri o ataerareta.
Kou shite Dabide wa Isuraeru no zenchi o osame, sono subete no tami ni koudou to seigi o okonatta.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu wa gun no chou, Ahirude no ko Yoshapate wa shikan,
Ahitobu no ko Zadoku to Abiyataru no ko Abimereku wa saishi, Shausha wa shokikan,
Ehoyada no ko Benaya wa Kerete bito to Perete bito no chou, Dabide no kotachi wa ou no katawara ni haberu daijin de atta.
Kono nochi Anmon no hitobito no ou Nahashi ga shinde, sono ko ga kore ni kawatte ou to natta.
Sono toki Dabide wa itta, "Watashi wa Nahashi no ko Hanun ni, kare no chichi ga watashi ni megumi o hodokoshita you ni, megumi o hodokosou". Soshite Dabide wa kare o sono chichi no yue ni nagusameyou to shite shisha o tsukawashita. Dabide no shimobetachi wa Hanun o nagusameru tame Anmon no hitobito no chi ni kitaga,
Anmon no hitobito no tsukasatachi wa Hanun ni itta, "Dabide ga nagusameru mono o anata no moto ni tsukawashita koto ni yotte, anata wa kare ga anata no chichi o tattobu no da to omowaremasu ka. Kare no shimobetachi ga kita no wa, kono kuni o ukagai, sagutte horobosu tame de wa arimasen ka".
Soko de Hanun wa Dabide no shimobetachi o toraete, sono hige o sori otoshi, sono kimono o nakahodo kara tachikitte koshi no tokoro made ni shite karera o kaeshite yatta.
Aru hitobito ga kite, kono hitotachi no sareta koto o Dabide ni tsugeta no de, kare wa hito o tsukawashite, karera o mukaesaseta. Sono hitobito ga hijou ni hajitakara de aru. Soko de ou wa itta, "Hige ga nobiru made Eriko ni todomatte, sono nochi kaeri nasai".
Anmon no hitobito wa jibuntachi ga Dabide ni nikumareru koto o shita to wakatta no de, Hanun oyobi Anmon no hitobito wa gin sen taranto o okutte Mesopotamiya to Aramu Maaka, oyobi Zoba kara sensha to kihei o yatoiireta.
Sunawachi sensha san man nisen oyobi Maaka no ou to sono guntai o yatoiireta no de, karera wa kite Medeba no mae ni jin o hatta. Soko de Anmon no hitobito wa machimachi kara yoriatsumatte, tatakai ni shutsudou shita.
Dabide wa kore o kiite Yoabu to yuushi no zengun o tsukawashita no de,
Anmon no hitobito wa dete kite machi no iriguchi ni tatakai no sonae o shita. Mata tasuke ni kita outachi wa betsu ni no ni ita.
Toki ni Yoabu wa tatakai ga zengo kara jibun ni mukatte iru no o mite, Isuraeru no erinuki no heishi no uchi kara erande, kore o Suriya bito ni taishite sonae,
Sono hoka no tami o jibun no kyoudai Abishai no te ni watashite, Anmon no hitobito ni taishite sonaesase,
Soshite itta, "Moshi Suriya bito ga watashi ni tegowai toki wa, watashi o tasukete kudasai. Moshi Anmon no hitobito ga anata ni tegowai toki wa, anata o tasukemashou.
Isamashiku shite kudasai. Wareware no tami no tame to, wareware no kami no machimachi no tame ni, isamashiku shimashou. Dou ka, Shu ga yoi to omowareru koto o sareru you ni".
Kou shite Yoabu ga jibun to issho ni iru tami to tomo ni Suriya bito ni mukatte tatakaou to shite chikazuita toki, Suriya bi to wa kare no mae kara nigeta.
Anmon no hitobito wa Suriya bito no nigeru no o mite, karera mo mata Yoabu no kyoudai Abishai no mae kara nigete machi ni haitta. Soko de Yoabu wa Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Shikashi Suriya bi to wa jibuntachi ga Isuraeru no mae ni uchi yaburareta no o mite, shisha o tsukawashi, Hadadezeru no gun no chouShopaku no hikiiru Yufurate kawa no mukougawa ni iru Suriya bito o hikidashita.
Kono koto ga Dabide ni kikoeta no de, kare wa Isuraeru o kotogotoku atsume, Yorudan o watari, karera no tokoro ni kite, kore ni mukatte tatakai no sonae o shita. Dabide ga kono you ni Suriya bito ni taishite tatakai no sonae o shita toki, kare wa Dabide to tatakatta.
Shikashi Suriya bito ga Isuraeru no mae kara nigeta no de, Dabide wa Suriya bito no sensha no hei nanasen, hohei yon man o koroshi, mata gun no chouShopaku o mo koroshita.
Hadadezeru no shimobetachi wa mikata no mono ga Isuraeru ni uchi yaburareta no o mite, Dabide to wa o kouji, kare ni tsukaeta. Suriya bi to wa futatabi Anmon bito o tasukeru koto o shinakatta.
Haru ni natte, outachi ga tatakai ni deru ni oyonde, Yoabu wa gunzei o hikiite Anmon bito no chi o arashi, itte Raba o houi shita. Shikashi Dabide wa Erusaremu ni todomatta. Yoabu wa Raba o utte, kore o horoboshita.
Soshite Dabide wa karera no ou no kanmuri o sono atama kara tori hanashita. Sono kin no omosa o hakatte miruto ichi taranto, mata sono naka ni houseki ga atta. Kore o Dabide no atama ni oita. Dabide wa mata sono machi no bundori mono o hijou ni ooku mochidashita.
Mata kare wa sono uchi no tami o hikidashite, kore o nokogiri to, tetsu no tsuruhashi to, ono o tsukau shigoto ni tsukaseta. Dabide wa Anmon bito no subete no machimachi ni kono you ni itta. Soshite Dabide to tami to wa mina Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Kono nochi Gezeru de Perishite bito to tatakai ga tatta. Sono toki Hosha bi to Shibekai ga kyojin no shison no hitori Shipai o koroshita. Karera wa tsuini seifuku sareta.
Koko ni mata Perishite bito to tatakai ga attaga, Yairu no ko Eruhanan wa Gate bito Goriate no kyoudai Rami o koroshita. Sono yari no e wa hata no makibou no you de atta.
Mata Gate ni tatakai ga attaga, soko ni hitori no se no takai hito ga ita. Sono te no yubi to ashi no yubi wa rokupon zutsu de, awasete nijuu yonhon atta. Kare mo mata kyojin kara umareta mono de atta.
Kare wa Isuraeru o nonoshitta no de, Dabide no kyoudai Shimea no ko Yonatan ga kore o koroshita.
Korera wa Gate de kyojin kara umareta mono de attaga, Dabide no te to sono keraitachi no te ni taoreta.
Toki ni Satan ga tatte Isuraeru ni tekishi, Dabide o ugokashite Isuraeru o kazoesaseyou to shita.
Dabide wa Yoabu to gun no shoukoutachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa itte, Beerushiba kara Dan made no Isuraeru o kazoe, sono kazu o shirabete watashi ni shirase nasai".
Yoabu wa itta, "Sore ga dono kurai atte mo, dou ka Shu ga sono tami o hyaku bai ni masareru you ni. Shikashi ou waga Shu yo, karera wa mina anata no shimobe de wa arimasen ka. Dou shite waga Shu wa kono koto o motomerareru no desu ka. Dou shite Isuraeru ni tsumi o esaserareru no desu ka".
Shikashi ou no kotoba ga Yoabu ni katta no de, Yoabu wa dete itte, Isuraeru o amaneku iki meguri, Erusaremu ni kaette kita.
Soshite Yoabu wa tami no sousuu o Dabide ni tsugeta. Sunawachi Isuraeru ni wa tsurugi o nuku mono ga hyaku juu mannin, Yuda ni wa tsurugi o nuku mono ga yonjuu nana mannin atta.
Shikashi Yoabu wa ou no meirei o kokoroyo shi to shinakatta no de, Rebi to Beniyamin to wa sono naka ni kazoenakatta.
Kono koto ga kami no me ni warukatta no de, kami wa Isuraeru o utareta.
Soko de Dabide wa kami ni itta, "Watashi wa kono koto o itte ooini tsumi o okashimashita. Shikashi ima dou ka, shimobe no tsumi o nozoite kudasai. Watashi wa hijou ni oroka na koto o itashimashita".
Shu wa Dabide no senkensha Gade ni tsugete iwareta,
"Itte Dabide ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa mittsu no koto o shimesu. Anata wa sono hitotsu o erabi nasai. Watashi wa sore o anata ni okonaou' to".
Gade wa Dabide no moto ni kite itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anata wa erabi nasai.
Sunawachi san nen no kikin ka, aruiha san gatsu no aida, anata no ada no mae ni yaburete, teki no tsurugi ni oitsukareru ka, aruiha mikka no aida, Shu no tsurugi sunawachi ekibyou ga kono kuni ni atte, Shu no tsukai ga Isuraeru no zenryouiki ni watatte horobosu koto o suru ka'. Ima, watashi ga dou iu kotae o watashi o tsukawashita mono ni nasubeki ka kime nasai".
Dabide wa Gade ni itta, "Watashi wa hijou ni nayande iruga, Shu no awaremi wa ookii yue, watashi o Shu no te ni ochiirasete kudasai. Shikashi watashi o hito no te ni ochiirasenaide kudasai".
Soko de Shu wa Isuraeru ni ekibyou o kudasareta no de, Isuraeru bito no uchi nana mannin ga taoreta.
Kami wa mata mitsukai o Erusaremu ni tsukawashite, kore o horobosou to saretaga, mitsukai ga masani horobosou to shita toki, Shu wa mirarete, kono wazawai o kui, sono horobosu mitsukai ni iwareta, "Mou juubun da. Ima anata no te o todomeyo". Sono toki Shu no tsukai wa Ebusu bi to Orunan no uchi ba no katawara ni tatte ita.
Dabide ga me o agete miruto, Shu no tsukai ga chi to ten no aida ni tatte, te ni nuita tsurugi o mochi, Erusaremu no ue ni sashinobete ita no de, Dabide to chouroutachi wa aranuno o kite, hirefushita.
Soshite Dabide wa kami ni itta, "Tami o kazoeyo to meijita no wa watashi de wa arimasen ka. Tsumi o okashi, warui koto o shita no wa watashi desu. Shikashi korera no hitsuji wa nani o shimashita ka. Waga kami, Shu yo, douzo anata no te o watashi to, watashi no chichi no ie ni mukete kudasai. Shikashi wazawai o anata no tami ni kudasanaide kudasai".
Toki ni Shu no tsukai wa Gade ni meiji, Dabide ga nobotte itte, Ebusu bi to Orunan no uchi ba de Shu no tame ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuku you ni tsugesaseta.
Soko de Dabide wa Gade ga Shu no na o motte tsugeta kotoba ni shitagatte nobotte itta.
Sono toki Orunan wa mugi o utte itaga, furikaette mi tsukai o mita no de, tomo ni ita kare no yonnin no ko wa mi o kakushita.
Dabide ga Orunan ni chikazukuto, Orunan wa me o agete Dabide o mi, uchi ba kara dete kite chi ni hirefushite Dabide o haishita.
Dabide wa Orunan ni itta, "Kono uchi ba no tokoro o watashi ni atae nasai. Watashi wa wazawai ga tami ni kudaru no o todomeru tame, soko ni Shu no tame ni hitotsu no saidan o kizukimasu. Anata wa, sono juubun na atai o totte kore o watashi ni atae nasai".
Orunan wa Dabide ni itta, "Douzo kore o otori nasai. Soshite ou waga Shu no yoshi to mirareru tokoro o okonai nasai. Watashi wa ushi o hansai no tame ni, dakok ki o takigi no tame ni, mugi o sosai no tame ni sasagemasu. Watashi wa mina kore o sasagemasu".
Dabide ou wa Orunan ni itta, "Iie, watashi wa juubun na daika o haratte kore o kaimasu. Watashi wa Shu no tame ni anata no mono o toru koto o shimasen. Mata, tsuie nashi ni hansai o sasageru koto o itashimasen".
Sore de Dabide wa sono tokoro no tame ni kin roppyaku shikeru o hakatte, Orunan ni haratta.
Kou shite Dabide wa Shu no tame ni, sono tokoro ni hitotsu no saidan o kizuki, hansai to shuuonsai o sasagete, Shu o yonda. Shu wa hansai no saidan no ue ni ten kara hi o kudashite kotaerareta.
Mata Shu ga mitsukai ni meijirareta no de, kare wa tsurugi o saya ni osameta.
Sono toki Dabide wa Shu ga Ebusu bi to Orunan no uchi ba de jibun ni kotaerareta no o mita no de, sono tokoro de gisei o sasageta.
Moose ga arano de tsukutta Shu no makuya to hansai no saidan to wa, sono toki Gibeon no takaki tokoro ni attakara de aru.
Shikashi Dabide wa sono mae e itte kami ni motomeru koto ga dekinakatta. Kare ga Shu no tsukai no tsurugi o osoretakara de aru.
Sore de Dabide wa itta, "Shu naru kami no ie wa kore de aru, Isuraeru no tame no hansai no saidan wa kore de aru" to.
Dabide wa meijite Isuraeru no chi ni iru takokujin o atsumesase, mata kami no ie o tateru no ni mochiiru ishi o kiru tame ni ishiku o sadameta.
Dabide wa mata mon no tobira no kugi, oyobi kasugai ni mochiiru tetsu o obitadashiku sonaeta. Mata seidou o hakaru koto mo dekinai hodo obitadashiku sonaeta.
Mata kouhaku o kazoe kirenu hodo sonaeta. Kore wa Shidon bito to Tsuro no hitobito ga obitadashiku kouhaku o Dabide no tokoro ni motte kitakara de aru.
Dabide wa itta, "Waga ko Soromon wa wakaku, katsu keiken ga nai. Mata Shu no tame ni tateru ie wa kiwamete soudai de, bankoku ni na o e, sakae o eru mono de nakereba naranai. Sore yue, watashi wa sono junbi o shite okou" to. Kou shite Dabide wa shinu mae ni ooku no busshi o junbi shita.
Soshite kare wa sono ko Soromon o meshite, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no tame ni ie o tateru koto o meijita.
Sunawachi Dabide wa Soromon ni itta, "Waga ko yo, watashi wa waga kami, Shu no na no tame ni ie o tateyou to kokorozashite ita.
Tokoro ga Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde iwareta, 'Omae wa ooku no chi o nagashi, ooinaru sensou o shita. Omae wa watashi no mae de ooku no chi o chi ni nagashitakara, waga na no tame ni ie o tatete wa naranai.
Miyo, otokonoko ga omae ni umareru. Kare wa heiwa no hito de aru. Watashi wa kare ni heian o ataete, shuui no moromoro no teki ni wazurawasarenai you ni shiyou. Kare no na wa Soromon to yobare, anoyo ni watashi wa Isuraeru ni heian to seion to o ataeru.
Kare wa waga na no tame ni ie o taterude arou. Kare wa waga ko to nari, watashi wa kare no chichi to naru. Watashi wa kare no oui o nagaku Isuraeru no ue ni kataku surude arou'.
Sore de waga ko yo, dou ka Shu ga anata to tomo ni imashi, anata o sakaesasete, Shu ga anata ni tsuite iwareta you ni, anata no kami, Shu no ie o tatesasete kudasaru you ni.
Tada, dou ka Shu ga anata ni funbetsu to chie o tamai, anata o Isuraeru no ue ni tataserareru toki, anata no kami, Shu no rippou o, anata ni mamorasete kudasaru you ni.
Anata ga moshi, Shu ga Isuraeru ni tsuite Moose ni meijirareta sadame to okite to o tsutsushinde mamorunaraba, anata wa sakaerude arou. Kokoro o tsuyoku shi, isame. Osorete wa naranai, ononoite wa naranai.
Miyo, watashi wa kunan no uchi ni atte Shu no ie no tame ni kin juu man taranto, gin hyaku man taranto o sonae, mata seidou to tetsu o hakaru koto mo dekinai hodo obitadashiku sonaeta. Mata zaimoku to ishi o mo sonaeta. Anata wa mata kore ni kuwaenakereba naranai.
Anata ni wa mata tasuu no shokunin, sunawachi ishi ya ki o kirikizamu mono, kousaku ni takumi na kakushu no mono ga aru.
Kin, gin, seidou, tetsu mo obitadashiku aru. Tatte okonai nasai. Dou ka Shu ga anata to tomo ni orareru you ni".
Dabide wa mata Isuraeru no subete no tsukasatachi ni sono ko Soromon o tasukeru you ni meijite itta,
"Anata gata no kami, Shu wa anata gata to tomo ni orarerude wa nai ka. Shihou ni taihei o tamawattade wa nai ka. Shu wa kono chi no tami o watashi no te ni watasareta no de, kono chi wa Shu no mae to sono tami no mae ni fukushite iru.
Sore de anata gata wa kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata gata no kami, Shu o motome nasai. Tatte Shu naru kami no seijo o tate, Shu no na no tame ni tateru sono ie ni, Shu no keiyaku no hako to kami no sei naru moromoro no utsuwa o tazusae ire nasai".
Dabide wa oi, sono hi ga michita no de, sono ko Soromon o Isuraeru no ou to shita.
Dabide wa Isuraeru no subete no tsukasa oyobi saishi to Rebi bito o atsumeta.
Rebi bito no sanjuusai ijou no mono o kazoeruto, sono otoko no kazu ga san man hassennin atta.
Dabide wa itta, "Sono uchi ni man yonsennin wa Shu no ie no shigoto o tsukasadori, rokusenninhatsu ka sabi to, oyobi sabaki bito to nari,
Yonsennin wa mon o mamoru mono to nari, mata yonsennin wasan bi no tame ni watashi no tsukutta gakki de Shu o tataeyo".
Soshite Dabide wa karera o Rebi no kora ni shitagatte Gerushon, Kohate, Merari no kumi ni waketa.
Gerushon no kora wa Radan to Shimei.
Radan no kora wa, kashira no Ehieru to Zetamu to Yoeru no sannin.
Shimei no kora wa Shiromite, Hajieru, Haran no sannin. Korera wa Radan no shizoku no chou de atta.
Shimei no kora wa Yahate, Jina, Eushi, Beria no yonnin. Mina Shimei no ko de,
Yahate wa kashira, Jiza wa sono tsugi, Eushi to Beria wa ko ga ooku nakatta no de, tomo ni kazoerarete hitotsu no shizoku to natta.
Kohate no kora wa Amuramu, Izuharu, Heburon, Ujieru no yonnin.
Amuramu no kora wa Aron to Moose de aru. Aron wa sono kora to tomo ni, nagaku ito sei naru mono o seibetsu suru tame ni wakatarete, Shu no mae ni kou o taki, Shu ni tsukae, tsune ni Shu no na o motte shukufuku suru koto o nashita.
Kami no hito Moose no kora wa Rebi no buzoku no uchi ni kazoerareta.
Moose no kora wa Gerushon to Eriezeru.
Gerushon no kora wa, kashira wa Shibueru.
Eriezeru no kora wa, kashira wa Rehabiya. Eriezeru ni wa kono hoka ni ko ga nakatta. Shikashi Rehabiya no kora wa hijou ni ookatta.
Izuharu no kora wa, kashira wa Shiromite.
Heburon no kora wa choushi wa Eriya, tsugi wa Amariya, daisan wa Yahajieru, daiyon wa Ekameamu.
Ujieru no kora wa, kashira wa Mika, tsugi wa Ishia de aru.
Merari no kora wa Maheri to Mushi. Maheri no kora wa Ereazaru to Kishi.
Ereazaru wa otokonoko ga nakute shini, tada musumetachi dake de attaga, Kishi no ko de aru sono miuchi no otokotachi ga kanojotachi o metotta.
Mushi no kora wa Maheri, Ederu, Eremote no sannin de aru.
Korera wa sono shizoku ni yoru Rebi no shison de atte, sono ninzuu ga kazoerare, sono na ga shirusarete, Shu no ie no tsutome o nashita nijuusai ijou no mono de, shizoku no chou de atta.
Dabide wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa sono tami ni heian o atae, nagaku Erusaremu ni sumawareru.
Rebi bi to wa kasanete makuya oyobi sono tsutome no utsuwamono o katsugu koto wa nai.
- - Dabide no saigo no kotoba ni yotte, Rebi bi to wa nijuusai ijou no mono ga kazoerareta - -
Karera no tsutome wa Aron no shison o tasukete Shu no ie no hataraki o shi, niwa to heya no shigoto oyobi subete no sei naru mono o kiyomeru koto, sono hoka, subete kami no ie no hataraki o suru koto de aru.
Mata sonae no pan, sosai no mugiko, tane irenu kashi, yaita sonaemono, abura o mazeta sonaemono o tsukasadori, mata subete bunryou oyobi ookisa o hakaru koto o tsukasadori,
Mata asagoto ni tatte Shu ni kansha shi,san bishi, yuu ni mo mata sono you ni shi,
Mata ansokunichi to shingetsu to saijitsu ni, Shu ni moromoro no hansai o sasageru toki wa, taezu Shu no mae ni sono meijirareta kazu ni shitagatte sasagenakereba naranai.
Kono you ni shite karera wa kaiken no makuya to seijo no tsutome o mamori, Shu no ie no hataraki no tame ni sono kyoudai de aru Aron no kora ni tsukaenakereba naranai".
Aron no shison no kumi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Aron no kora wa Nadabu, Abiu, Ereazaru, Itamaru.
Nadabu to Abiu wa sono chichi ni sakidatte shini, ko ga nakatta no de, Ereazaru to Itamaru ga saishi to natta.
Dabide wa Ereazaru no shison Zadoku to Itamaru no shison Ahimereku no tasuke ni yotte karera o wakete, sorezore no tsutome ni tsuketa.
Ereazaru no shison no uchi ni wa Itamaru no shison no uchi yori mo choutaru hitobito ga ookatta. Sore de Ereazaru no shison de shizoku no chou de aru juu rokunin to, Itamaru no shison de shizoku no chou de aru mono hachinin ni kore o waketa.
Kono you ni karera wa mina hitoshiku, kuji ni yotte wakerareta. Seijo no tsukasa, oyobi kami no tsukasa wa, tomo ni Ereazaru no shison to Itamaru no shison kara detakara de aru.
Rebi bito Netaneru no ko de aru shoki Shimaya wa, ou to tsukasatachi to saishi Zadoku to Abiyataru no ko Ahimereku to saishi oyobi Rebi bito no shizoku no choutachi no mae de, kore o kakishirushita. Sunawachi Ereazaru no tame ni shizoku hitotsu o toreba, Itamaru no tame ni mo hitotsu o totta.
Daiichi no kuji wa Yoaribu ni atari, daini wa Edaya ni atari,
Daisan wa Harimu ni, daiyon wa Seorimu ni,
Daigo wa Marukiya ni, dairoku wa Miyamin ni,
Dainana wa Hakkozu ni, daihachi wa Abiya ni,
Daikyuu wa Eshua ni, daijuu wa Shikaniya ni,
Daijuu ichi wa Eriashibu ni, daijuu ni wa Yakimu ni,
Daijuu san wa Hoppa ni, daijuu yon wa Eshibabu ni,
Daijuu go wa Biruga ni, daijuu roku wa Inmeru ni,
Daijuu nana wa Hejiru ni, daijuu hachi wa Hapisetsu ni,
Daijuu kyuu wa Petahiya ni, dainijuu wa Ezekieru ni,
Dainijuu ichi wa Yakin ni, dainijuu ni wa Gamuru ni,
Dainijuu san wa Deraya ni, dainijuu yon wa Maajiya ni atatta.
Kore wa, karera no senzo Aron ni yotte moukerareta sadame ni shitagai, Shu no ie ni haitte tsutome o nasu junjo de atte, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no kare ni meijirareta toori de aru.
Kono hoka no Rebi no shison wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Amuramu no kora no uchi de wa Shubaeru. Shubaeru no kora no uchi de wa Edeya.
Rehabiya ni tsuite wa, Rehabiya no kora no uchi de wa choushi Ishia.
Izuhari bito no uchi de wa Shiromite. Shiromite no kora no uchi de wa Yahate.
Heburon no kora wa choushi wa Eriya, tsugi wa Amariya, daisan wa Yahajieru, daiyon wa Ekameamu.
Ujieru no kora no uchi de wa Mika. Mika no kora no uchi de wa Shamiru.
Mika no kyoudai wa Ishia. Ishia no kora no uchi de wa Zekariya.
Merari no kora wa Maheri to Mushi. Yajia no kora wa Beno.
Merari no shison no Yajia kara deta mono wa Beno, Shohamu, ZaKkuru, Iburi.
Maheri kara Ereazaru ga deta. Kare ni wa ko ga nakatta.
Kishi ni tsuite wa, Kishi no ko wa Erameru.
Mushi no kora wa Maheri, Ederu, Erimote. Korera wa Rebi bito no shison de, sono shizoku ni yotte itta mono de aru.
Korera no mono mo mata shizoku no ani mo sono otouto mo douyou ni, Dabide ou to, Zadoku to, Ahimereku to, saishi oyobi Rebi bito no shizoku no choutachi no mae de, Aron no shison de aru sono kyoudaitachi no you ni kuji o hiita.
Dabide to gun no choutachi wa mata Asafu, Heman oyobi Edoton no kora o tsutome no tame ni wakachi, koto to, tategoto to, Shinbaru o motte yogen suru mono ni shita. Sono tsutome o nashita hitobito no kazu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Asafu no kotachi wa ZaKkuru, Yosefu, Netaniya, Asarera de atte, Asafu no shiki no moto ni ou no inochi ni yotte yogen shita mono de aru.
Edoton ni tsuite wa, Edoton no kotachi wa Gedariya, Zeri, Esaya, Hashabiya, Mattateya no rokunin de, koto o motte Shu ni kansha shi, katsu hometataete yogen shita sono chichi Edoton no shiki no shita ni atta.
Heman ni tsuite wa, Heman no kotachi wa Bukkiya, MaTtaniya, Ujieru, Shibueru, Eremote, Hananiya, Hanani, Eriata, Gidarute, romamute ezeru, Yoshibekasha, Marote, Hoteru, Mahajiote de aru.
Korera wa mina, kami ga gojishin no yakusoku ni shitagatte takaku sareta ou no senkensha Eman no kotachi de atta. Kami wa Heman ni otokonoko juu yonnin, onnanoko sannin o ataerareta.
Korera no mono wa mina sono chichi no shiki no shita ni atte, Shu no miya de uta o utai, Shinbaru to tategoto to koto o motte kami no miya no tsutome o shita. Asafu, Edoton oyobi Heman wa ou no inochi no shita ni atta.
Karera oyobi Shu ni uta o utau koto no tame ni kunren sare, subete jukuren shita kyoudaitachi no kazu wa nihyaku hachijuu hachinin de atta.
Karera wa shounaru mono mo, dai naru mono mo, kyoushi mo seito mo mina hitoshiku sono tsutome no tame ni kuji o hiita.
Daiichi no kuji wa Asafu no tame ni Yosefu ni atari, daini wa Gedariya ni atatta. Kare to sono kyoudaitachi oyobi sono kotachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daisan wa ZaKkuru ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daiyon wa Izuri ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daigo wa Netaniya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dairoku wa Bukkiya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainana wa Asarera ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daihachi wa Esaya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daikyuu wa MaTtaniya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu wa Shimei ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu ichi wa Azarieru ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu ni wa Hashabiya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu san wa Shubaeru ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu yon wa Mattateya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu go wa Eremote ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu roku wa Hananiya ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu nana wa Yoshibekasha ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu hachi wa Hanani ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Daijuu kyuu wa Marote ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainijuu wa Eriata ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainijuu ichi wa Hoteru ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainijuu ni wa Gidarute ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainijuu san wa Mahajiote ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin.
Dainijuu yon wa romamute ezeru ni atatta. Sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi, awasete juu ninin de atta.
Mon o mamoru mono no kumi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Kora bito no uchi de wa, Asafu no shison no uchi no Kore no ko Meshiremiya.
Meshiremiya no kotachi wa, choushi wa Zekariya, tsugi wa Edeaeru, daisan wa Zebadeya, daiyon wa Yatenieru,
Daigo wa Eramu, dairoku wa Yohanan, dainana wa Eriyoenai de aru.
Obede Edomu no kotachi wa, choushi wa Shimaya, tsugi wa Yozabade, daisan wa Yoa, daiyon wa Sakaru, daigo wa Netaneru,
Dairoku wa Anmieru, dainana wa Issakaru, daihachi wa Piuretai de aru. Kami ga kare o shukufuku saretakara de aru.
Kare no ko Shimaya ni mo suunin no ko ga umare, yuunou na hitobito de atta no de, sono chichi no ie o osameru mono to natta.
Sunawachi Shimaya no kotachi wa Oteni, Repaeru, Obede, Eruzabade de, Eruzabade no kyoudai Eriu to Semakiya wa chikara aru hitobito de atta.
Korera wa mina Obede Edomu no shison de aru. Karera wa sono kotachi oyobi sono kyoudaitachi to tomo ni sono tsutome ni tekishita chikara aru hitobito de, awasete rokujuu ninin, mina Obede Edomu ni zokusuru mono de aru.
Meshiremiya ni mo kotachi to kyoudaitachi awasete juu hachinin atte, mina chikara aru hitobito de atta.
Merari no shison Hosa ni mo kotachi ga atta. Sono kashira wa Shimuri, kore wa choushi de wa nakattaga, chichi wa kore o kashira ni shita no de atta.
Tsugi wa Hirukiya, daisan wa Tebariya, daiyon wa Zekariya de aru. Hosa no kotachi to kyoudaitachi wa awasete juu sannin de aru.
Korera wa mon o mamoru mono no kumi no choutaru hitobito de atte, sono kyoudaitachi to douyou ni tsutome o nashite, Shu no miya ni tsukaeta.
Karera wa sorezore mon no tame ni shounaru mono mo, dai naru mono mo hitoshiku, sono shizoku ni shitagatte kuji o hiita.
Higashi no mon no kuji wa Shiremiya ni atatta. Mata kare no ko de shiryo fukai gishi Zekariya no tame ni kuji o hiitaga, kita no mon no kuji ga kore ni atatta.
Obede Edomu ni wa minami no mon no kuji, sono kotachi ni wa kura no kuji,
Shupamu to Hosa ni wa nishi no mon no kuji ga atatta. Kore wa saka no ooji ni aru Sharekete no mon no katawara ni atta. Mamoru mono to mamoru mono to ga aitai shite ita.
Higashi no hou ni wa mainichi rokunin, kita no hou ni wa mainichi yonnin, minami no hou ni wa mainichi yonnin, kura ni wa futari to futari,
Nishi no hou Parubaru ni wa ooji ni yonnin, Parubaru ni futari.
Mon o mamoru mono no kumi wa ijou no toori de, Kora no shison to Merari no shison de atta.
Rebi bito no uchi Ahiya wa kami no miya no kura oyobi sei naru mono no kura o tsukasadotta.
Radan no shison sunawachi Radan kara deta Gerushon bito no shison de, Gerushon bito no shizoku no chou wa Ehieri de aru.
Ehieri, Zetamu oyobi sono kyoudai Yoeru no kotachi wa Shu no miya no kura o tsukasadotta.
Amuramu bi to, Izuharu bi to, Heburon bi to, Ujieru bito no uchi de wa tsugi no toori de atta.
Sunawachi Moose no ko Gerushomu no ko Shibueru wa kura no tsukasa de atta.
Sono kyoudai de Eriezeru kara deta mono wa, sono ko wa Rehabiya, sono ko wa Esaya, sono ko wa Yoramu, sono ko wa Jikuri, sono ko wa Shiromite de aru.
Kono Shiromite to sono kyoudaitachi wa subete no sei naru mono no kura o tsukasadotta. Kore wa Dabide ou to, shizoku no chou to, sennin no chou to, hyakunin no chou to, gun no choutachi no sasageta mono de aru.
Sunawachi karera ga tatakai de eta bundori mono no uchi kara Shu no miya no shuuzen no tame ni sasageta mono de aru.
Mata subete senkensha Samueru, Kishi no ko Sauru, Neru no ko Abuneru, Zeruya no ko Yoabu nado ga sasageta mono. Subete korera no sasagemono wa Shiromite to sono kyoudaitachi ga kanri shita.
Izuharu bito no uchi de wa, Kenaniya to sono kotachi ga, tsukasa oyobi sabaki bito to shite Isuraeru no gaiji no tame ni erabareta.
Heburon bito no uchi de wa, Hashabiya oyobi sono kyoudai nado yuushi sen nanahyakunin ga atte, Yorudan no konata, sunawachi nishi no hou de Isuraeru no kantoku to nari, Shu no subete no koto o okonai, ou ni houshi shita.
Heburon bito no uchi de wa, keizu to shizoku ni yotte Eriya ga Heburon bito no chou de attaga, Dabide no chisei no daiyonjuu nen ni karera o tazunemotome, Gireade no Yazeru de karera no uchi kara daiyuushi o eta.
Dabide ou wa kare to sono kyoudai nado shizoku no choutachi nisen nanahyakunin no yuushi o Ruben bi to, Gado bi to, Manase bito no han buzoku no kantoku to nashi, subete kami ni tsukeru koto to ou no koto to o tsukasadoraseta.
Isuraeru no shison no uchi de shizoku no chou, sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, oyobi tsukasatachi wa nen no subete no tsuki no aida, tsukigoto ni koutai shite kumi no subete no koto o nashite ou ni tsukaetaga, sono kazu ni shitagaeba kakukumi ni man yonsennin atta.
Mazu daiichi no kumi sunawachi shougatsu no bun wa Zabudeeru no ko Yashobeamu ga kore o hikiita. Sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Kare wa Perezu no shison de, shougatsu no gundan no subete no shoutachi no kashira de atta.
Ni gatsu no kumi wa Ahoa bi to Dodai ga kore o hikiita. Sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
San gatsu no daisan no shou wa saishi Ehoyada no ko Benaya ga chou de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Kono Benaya wa kano sanjuunin no uchi no yuushi de atte sanjuunin o hikii, sono ko Amizabade ga sono kumi ni atta.
Yon gatsu no daiyon no shou wa Yoabu no kyoudai Asaheru de atte, sono ko Zebadeya ga kore ni tsuida. Sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Go gatsu no daigo no shou wa Izurahi bito Shanmote de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Roku gatsu no dairoku no shou wa Tekoa bi to IKkeshi no ko Ira de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Nana gatsu no dainana no shou wa Efuraimu no shison de aru Peron bi to Herezu de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Hachi gatsu no daihachi no shou wa Zera bito no shison de aru Hosha bi to Shibekai de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Kyuu gatsu no daikyuu no shou wa Beniyamin no shison de aru Anatote bito Abiezeru de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Juu gatsu no daijuu no shou wa Zera bito no shison de aru Netopa bi to Maharai de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Juu ichi gatsu no daijuu ichi no shou wa Efuraimu no shison de aru Piraton bi to Benaya de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Juu ni gatsu no daijuu ni no shou wa Otenieru no shison de aru Netopa bi to Herudai de atte, sono kumi ni wa ni man yonsennin atta.
Nao Isuraeru no buzoku o osameru monotachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Ruben bito no tsukasa wa Jikuri no ko Eriezeru. Shimeon bito no tsukasa wa Maaka no ko Shipateya.
Rebi bito no tsukasa wa Kemueru no ko Hashabiya. Aron bito no tsukasa wa Zadoku.
Yuda no tsukasa wa Dabide no kyoudai no hitori Eriu. Issakaru no tsukasa wa Mikaeru no ko Omuri.
Zeburun no tsukasa wa Obadeya no ko Ishimaya. Nafutari no tsukasa wa Azurieru no ko Eremote.
Efuraimu no shison no tsukasa wa Azajiya no ko Hosea. Manase no han buzoku no tsukasa wa Pedaya no ko Yoeru.
Gireade ni aru Manase no han buzoku no tsukasa wa Zekariya no ko Ido. Beniyamin no tsukasa wa Abuneru no koYashieru.
Dan no tsukasa wa Erohamu no ko Azarieru. Korera wa Isuraeru no buzoku no tsukasatachi de atta.
Shikashi Dabide wa nijuusai ika no mono wa kazoenakatta. Shu ga katsute Isuraeru o ten no hoshi no you ni ooku suru to iwaretakara de aru.
Zeruya no ko Yoabu wa kazoe hajimetaga, kore o nashi oenakatta. Sono kazoeru koto ni yotte ikari ga Isuraeru no ue ni nozonda. Mata sono kazu wa Dabide ou no rekidaishi ni nosenakatta.
Adeeru no ko Azumaute wa ou no kura o tsukasadori, Ujiya no ko Yonatan wa den'ya, machimachi, muramura, moromoro no tou ni aru kura o tsukasadori,
Kerubu no ko Ezuri wa chi o tagayasu noufu o tsukasadori,
Ramate bito Shimei wa budou hatake o tsukasadori, Shipumi bito Zabude wa budou hatake kara totta budoushu no kura o tsukasadori,
Gederu bi to Baaru Hanan wa heiya no oribu no ki to ichijiku kuwa no ki o tsukasadori, Yoashi wa abura no kura o tsukasadori,
Sharon bi to Shiterai wa Sharon de kau ushi no mure o tsukasadori, Aderai no koShapate wa moromoro no tani ni oru ushi no mure o tsukasadori,
Ishimaeru bi to Obiru wa rakuda o tsukasadori, Meronote bito Edeya wa roba o tsukasadori,
Hagaru bi to Yajizu wa hitsuji no mure o tsukasadotta. Karera wa mina Dabide ou no zaisan no tsukasa de atta.
Mata Dabide no oji Yonatan wa gikan de, chie aru hito de ari, gakusha de atta. Mata kare to Hakumoni no ko Ehieru wa ou no kotachi no hosa de atta.
Ahitoperu wa ou no gikan. Aruki bito Hoshai wa ou no tomo de atta.
Ahitoperu ni tsugu mono wa Benaya no ko Ehoyada oyobi Abiyataru. Ou no gun no chou wa Yoabu de atta.
Dabide wa Isuraeru no subete no choukan, sunawachi buzoku no chou, ou ni tsukaeta kumi no chou, sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, ou to sono kotachi no subete no zaisan oyobi kachiku no tsukasa, kangan, yuuryokusha, yuushi nado o kotogotoku Erusaremu ni meshiatsumeta.
Soshite Dabide ou wa sono ashi de tachiagatte itta, "Waga kyoudaitachi, waga tami yo, watashi ni kiki nasai. Watashi wa Shu no keiyaku no hako no tame, wareware no kami no ashidai no tame ni anjuu no ie o tateyou to no kokorozashi o mochi, sudeni kore o tateru junbi o shita.
Shikashi kami wa watashi ni iwareta, 'Omae wa waga na no tame ni ie o tatete wa naranai. Omae wa gunjin de atte, ooku no chi o nagashitakara de aru' to.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu, Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa watashi no chichi no zenka no uchi kara watashi o erande nagaku Isuraeru no ou to serareta. Sunawachi Yuda o erande kashira to shi, Yuda no ie no uchi de, watashi no chichi no ie o erabi, watashi no chichi no kora no uchi de, watashi o yorokobi, zenIsuraeru no ou to serareta.
Soshite Shu wa watashi ni ooku no ko o tamawari, sono subete no kora no uchi kara waga ko Soromon o erabi, kore o Shu no kuni no kurai ni suwarasete, Isuraeru o osamesaseyou to serareta.
Shu wa mata watashi ni iwareta, 'Omae no ko Soromon ga wagaya oyobi waga niwa o tsukurude arou. Watashi wa kare o erande waga ko to nashitakara de aru. Watashi wa kare no chichi to naru.
Kare ga moshi konnichi no you ni, waga imashime to waga okite o kataku mamotte okonaunaraba, watashi wa sono kuni o itsu made mo kataku surude arou' to.
Sore yue ima, Shu no kaishuu naru zenIsuraeru no me no mae oyobi wareware no kami no kikareru tokoro de anata gata ni susumeru. Anata gata wa sono kami, Shu no subete no imashime o mamori, kore o motome nasai. Sou sureba anata gata wa kono yoki chi o shoyuu shi, kore o anata gata no nochi no shison ni nagaku shigyou to shite tsutaeru koto ga dekiru.
Waga ko Soromon yo, anata no chichi no kami o shiri, mattaki kokoro o motte yorokobiisande kare ni tsukae nasai. Shu wa subete no kokoro o saguri, subete no omoi o satorarerukara de aru. Anata ga moshi kare o motomerunaraba au koto ga dekiru. Shikashi anata ga moshi kare o suterunaraba kare wa nagaku anata o suterarerude arou.
Sore de anata wa tsutsushimi nasai. Shu wa anata o erande seijo to subeki ie o tatesaseyou to sareru no dakara kokoro o tsuyoku shite kore o okonai nasai".
Kou shite Dabide wa shinden no rou oyobi sono ie, sono kura, sono ue no shitsu, sono uchi no shitsu, shokuzaisho no shitsu nado no keikaku o sono ko Soromon ni sazuke,
Mata sono kokoro ni atta subete no mono, sunawachi Shu no miya no niwa, shuui no subete no shitsu, kami no ie no kura, sasagemono no kura nado no keikaku o sazuke,
Mata saishi oyobi Rebi bito no kumi to, Shu no miya no moromoro no tsutome no shigoto to, Shu no miya no moromoro no tsutome no utsuwamono ni tsuite sazuke,
Mata moromoro no tsutome ni mochiiru subete no kin no utsuwa o tsukuru kin no mekata, oyobi moromoro no tsutome ni mochiiru gin no utsuwa no mekata o sadameta.
Sunawachi kin no shokudai to, sono tomoshibi sara no mekata, onoono no shokudai to, sono tomoshibi sara no kin no mekata o sadame, mata gin no shokudai ni tsuite mo onoono no shokudai no youhou ni shitagatte shokudai to, sono tomoshibi sara no gin no mekata o sadameta.
Mata sonae no pan no tsukue ni tsuite wa, sono onoono no tsukue no tame ni kin no mekata o sadame, mata gin no tsukue no tame ni mo gin o sadame,
Mata niku sashi, hachi, kame ni mochiiru junkin no mekata o sadame, kin no taihai ni tsuite mo onoono no mekata o sadame, gin no taihai ni tsuite mo onoono no mekata o sadame,
Mata kou no saidan no tame ni seikin no mekata o sadame, mata tsubasa o nobete Shu no keiyaku no hako o ootte iru kerubimu no kin no kuruma no hinagata no kin o sadameta.
Dabide wa subete no kousaku ga keikaku ni shitagatte nasareru tame, kore ni tsuite Shu no te ni yotte kakareta mono ni yori, kore o kotogotoku akiraka ni shita.
Dabide wa sono ko Soromon ni itta, "Anata wa kokoro o tsuyoku shi, isande kore o okonai nasai. Osorete wa naranai. Ononoite wa naranai. Shu naru kami, watashi no kami ga anata to tomo ni orarerukara de aru. Shu wa anata o hanarezu, anata o sutezu, tsuini Shu no miya no tsutome no subete no kouji o nashi oesaserarerudeshou.
Miyo, kami no miya no subete no tsutome no tame ni wa saishi to Rebi bito no kumi ga aru. Mata moromoro no tsutome no tame ni subete no shigoto o yorokonde suru takumi na mono ga mina anata to tomo ni aru. Mata tsukasatachi oyobi subete no tami mo anata no meijiru tokoro o kotogotoku okonaudeshou".
Dabide ou wa mata zenkaishuu ni itta, "Waga ko Soromon wa kami ga tada hitori o erabareta mono de aruga, mada wakakute keiken ga naku, kono jigyou wa ookii. Kono miya wa hito no tame de wa naku, Shu naru kami no tame dakara de aru.
Soko de watashi wa chikara o tsukushite kami no miya no tame ni sonaeta. Sunawachi kin no mono o tsukuru tame ni kin, gin no mono no tame ni gin, seidou no mono no tame ni seidou, tetsu no mono no tame ni tetsu, ki no mono no tame ni ki o sonaeta. Sono ta shima menou, hame ishi, Anchimonii, iro no tsuita ishi, samazama no houseki, dairiseki nado obitadashii.
Nao watashi wa waga kami no miya ni nesshin naru ga yue ni, sei naru ie no tame ni sonaeta subete no mono ni kuwaete, watashi no motte iru kingin no zaihou o waga kami no miya ni sasageru.
Sunawachi Ofuru no kin sanzen taranto, sei gin nanasen taranto o sono moromoro no tatemono no kabe o oou tame ni sasageru.
Kin wa kin no mono no tame ni, gin wa gin no mono no tame ni, subete koujin ni yotte tsukurareru mono no tame ni mochiiru. Dare ka kyou, Shu ni sono mi o sasageru mono no you ni yorokonde sasagemono o surudarou ka".
Soko de shizoku no choutachi, Isuraeru no buzoku no tsukasatachi, sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou oyobi ou no kouji o tsukasadoru monotachi wa yorokonde sasagemono o shita.
Kou shite karera wa kami no miya no tsutome no tame ni kin gosen taranto ichi man Dariku, gin ichi man taranto, seidou ichi man hassen taranto, tetsu juu man taranto o sasageta.
Houseki o motte iru mono wa sore o Gerushon bito Ehieru no te ni yotte kami no miya no kura ni osameta.
Karera ga kono you ni magokoro kara mizukara susunde Shu ni sasageta no de, tami wa sono mizukara susunde sasageta no o yorokonda. Dabide ou mo mata ooini yorokonda.
Soko de Dabide wa zenkaishuu no mae de Shu o hometataeta. Dabide wa itta, "Wareware no senzo Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata wa tokoshie ni ho mubeki kata desu.
Shu yo, ooinaru koto to, chikara to, eikou to, shouri to, ikou to wa anata no mono desu. Ten ni aru mono, chi ni aru mono mo mina anata no mono desu. Shu yo, kuni mo mata anata no mono desu. Anata wa ban'yuu no kashira to shite, agameraremasu.
Tomi to homare to wa anata kara demasu. Anata wa ban'yuu o tsukasadoraremasu. Anata no te ni wa ikioi to chikara ga arimasu. Anata no te wa subete no mono o ooinarashime, tsuyoku saremasu.
Wareware no kami yo, wareware wa, ima, anata ni kansha shi, anata no kouei aru na o tataemasu.
Shikashi wareware ga kono you ni yorokonde sasageru koto ga dekite mo, watashi wa nanimono deshou. Watashi no tami wa nani deshou. Subete no mono wa anata kara demasu. Wareware wa anata kara ukete, anata ni sasageta no desu.
Wareware wa anata no mae de wa subete no senzotachi no you ni, tabibito desu, kiryuusha desu. Wareware no yo ni aru hi wa kage no you de, nagaku todomaru koto wa dekimasen.
Wareware no kami, Shu yo, anata no sei naru na no tame ni, anata ni ie o tateyou to shite wareware ga sonaeta kono ooku no mono wa mina anata no te kara deta mono, mata mina anata no mono desu.
Waga kami yo, anata wa kokoro o tameshi, mata shoujiki o yorokobareru koto o, watashi wa shitte imasu. Watashi wa tadashii kokoro de, kono subete no mono o yorokonde sasagemashita. Ima watashi wa mata, koko ni oru anata no tami ga yorokonde, mizukara susunde anata ni sasagemono o suru no o mimashita.
Wareware no senzo Aburahamu, Isaku, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata no tami no kokoro ni kono ishi to seishin to o itsu made mo tamotase, sono kokoro o anata ni mukesasete kudasai.
Mata waga ko Soromon ni kokoro o tsukushite anata no meirei to, anata no akashi to, anata no sadame to o mamorasete, kore o kotogotoku okonawase, watashi ga sonae o shita miya o tatesasete kudasai".
Soshite Dabide ga zenkaishuu ni mukatte, "Anata gata no kami, Shu o hometataeyo" to itta no de, zenkaishuu wa senzotachi no kami, Shu o hometatae, fushite Shu o haishi, ou ni keirei shita.
Soshite sono yokujitsu karera wa zenIsuraeru no tame ni Shu ni gisei o sasageta. Sunawachi hansai to shite oushi issen, ohitsuji issen, kohitsuji issen o sono kansai to tomo ni Shu ni sasage, obitadashii gisei o sasageta.
Soshite sono hi, karera wa ooinaru yorokobi o motte Shu no mae ni kui nomi shita. Karera wa sarani aratamete Dabide no ko Soromon o ou to nashi, kore ni abura o sosoide Shu no kimi to nashi, mata Zadoku o saishi to shita.
Kou shite Soromon wa sono chichi Dabide ni kawari, ou to shite Shu no kurai ni zashita. Kare wa sakae, Isuraeru wa mina kare ni shitagatta.
Mata subete no tsukasatachi, yuushitachi, oyobi Dabide ou no oujitachi mo mina Soromon ou ni chuusei o chikatta.
Shu wa zenIsuraeru no me no mae de Soromon o hijou ni ooinarashime, kare yori mae no Isuraeru no dono ou mo eta koto no nai oui o kare ni ataerareta.
Kono you ni Essai no ko Dabide wa zenIsuraeru o osameta.
Kare ga Isuraeru o osameta kikan wa yonjuu nen de atta. Sunawachi Heburon de nana nenyo o osame, Erusaremu de sanjuu san nenyo o osameta.
Kare wa kourei ni tasshi, nen mo tomi mo homare mo michitarite shinda. Sono ko Soromon ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Dabide ou no shijuu no koui wa, senkensha Samueru no sho, yogensha Natan no sho oyobi senkensha Gado no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Sono uchi ni wa kare no subete no sei to, sono chikara oyobi kare to Isuraeru to ta no subete no kuniguni ni nozonda kotodomo o shirushite iru.
Dabide no ko Soromon wa sono kuni ni jibun no chii o kakuritsu shita. Sono kami, Shu ga tomo ni imashite kare o hijou ni ooinaru mono ni sareta.
Soromon wa subete no Isuraeru bi to, sunawachi sennin no chou, hyakunin no chou, saba kibi to oyobi Isuraeru no zenchi no subete no tsukasa, shizoku no kashiratachi ni tsugeta.
Soshite Soromon to Isuraeru no zenkaishuu wa tomo ni Gibeon ni aru takaki tokoro e itta. Shu no shimobe Moose ga arano de tsukutta kami no kaiken no makuya ga soko ni attakara de aru.
(shikashi kami no hako wa Dabide ga sudeni kiriate yarimu kara, kore no tame ni sonaeta tokoro ni hakobi noborasete atta. Dabide wa saki ni, Erusaremu de kore no tame ni tenmaku o hatte oitakara de aru.)
Mata Horu no ko de aru Uri no ko Bezareru ga tsukutta seidou no saidan ga sono tokoro no Shu no makuya no mae ni ari, Soromon oyobi kaishuu wa Shu ni motometa.
Soromon wa soko ni nobotte itte, kaiken no makuya no uchi ni aru Shu no mae no seidou no saidan ni hansai issen o sasageta.
Sono yoru, kami wa Soromon ni arawarete iwareta, "Anata ni nani o ataeyou ka, motome nasai".
Soromon wa kami ni itta, "Anata wa watashi no chichi Dabide ni ooinaru itsukushimi o shimeshi, mata watashi o kare ni kawatte ou to saremashita.
Shu naru kami yo, douzo waga chichi Dabide ni yakusoku sareta koto o hatashite kudasai. Anata wa chi no chiri no you na ooku no tami no ue ni watashi o tatete ou to saretakara desu.
Kono tami no mae ni deiri suru koto no dekiru you ni ima watashi ni chie to chishiki to o ataete kudasai. Dare ga kono you na ooinaru anata no tami o sabaku koto ga dekimashou ka".
Kami wa Soromon ni iwareta, "Kono koto ga anata no kokoro ni atte, tomi o mo, takara o mo, homare o mo, mata anata o nikumu mono no inochi o mo motomezu, mata choumei o mo motomezu, tada watashi ga anata o tatete ou to shita watashi no tami o sabaku tame ni chie to chishiki to o jibun no tame ni motometa no de,
Chie to chishiki to wa anata ni ataerarete iru. Watashi wa mata anata no mae no outachi no, mada eta koto no nai hodo no tomi to takara to homare to o anata ni ataeyou. Anata no nochi no mono mo, kono you na mono o enaideshou".
Sore kara Soromon wa Gibeon no takaki tokoro o sari, kaiken no makuya no mae o satte, Erusaremu ni kaeri, Isuraeru o osameta.
Soromon wa sensha to kihei to o atsumetaga, sensha issen yonhyaku ryou, kihei ichi man nisennin atta. Soromon wa kore o sensha no machimachi to, Erusaremu no ou no moto to ni oita.
Ou wa gin to kin o ishi no you ni Erusaremu ni ooku shi, kouhaku o heiya no ichijiku kuwa no you ni ooku shita.
Soromon ga uma o yunyuu shita no wa Ejiputo to Kue kara de atta. Sunawachi ou no boueki shounin ga Kue kara daika o haratte uketotte kita.
Karera wa Ejiputo kara sensha ichiryou o gin roppyaku shikeru de yunyuu shi, uma ichitou o gin hyaku gojuu de yunyuu shita. Onaji you ni korera no mono ga karera ni yotte Hete bito no subete no outachi, oyobi Suriya no outachi ni mo yushutsu sareta.
Sate Soromon wa Shu no na no tame ni hitotsu no miya o tate, mata jibun no tame ni hitotsu no oukyuu o tateyou to omotta.
Soshite Soromon wa ni o ou mono nana mannin, yama de ishi o kiridasu mono hachi mannin, korera o kantoku suru mono sanzen roppyakunin o kazoe dashita.
Soromon wa mazu Tsuro no Hiramu ni hito o tsukawashite iwaseta, "Anata wa watashi no chichi Dabide ni, sono sumubeki ie o tateru tame ni kouhaku o okuraremashita. Douzo kare ni sareta you ni, watashi ni mo shite kudasai.
Miyo, watashi wa waga kami, Shu no na no tame ni hitotsu no ie o tate, kore o seibetsu shite kare ni sasage, kare no mae ni koubashii kou o taki, jouku no pan o sonae, mata hansai o ansokunichi, shingetsu, oyobi warera no kami, Shu no sadame no matsuri ni asayuu sasage, kore o Isuraeru no nagaku mamorubeki sadame ni shiyou to shite imasu.
Mata watashi no tateru ie wa ookina ie desu. Warera no kami wa subete no kami yori mo ooinaru kami dakara desu.
Shikashi, ten mo, shoten no ten mo kare o ireru koto ga dekinai no ni, dare ga kare no tame ni ie o tateru koto ga dekimashou ka. Watashi wa nanimono desu ka, kare no tame ni ie o tateru to iu no mo, tada kare no mae ni kou o takutokoro ni, hoka naranai no desu.
Sore de, douzo kin, gin, seidou, tetsu no saiku oyobi murasakiito, hi ito, aoito no orimono ni kuwashiku, mata choukoku no jutsu ni takumi na koujin hitori o watashi ni okutte, chichi Dabide ga sonaete oita Yuda to Erusaremu no watashi no koujintachi to issho ni hatarakasete kudasai.
Mata douzo Rebanon kara kouhaku, ito sugi, bi kudan o okutte kudasai. Watashi wa anata no shimobetachi ga Rebanon de ki o kiru koto o yoku wakimaete iru no o shitte imasu. Watashi no shimobetachi mo, anata no shimobetachi to issho ni hatarakase,
Watashi no tame ni takusan no zaimoku o sonaesasete kudasai. Watashi no tateru ie wa hijou ni koudai na mono desukara.
Watashi wa ki o kiru anata no shimobetachi ni kudaita komugi ni man koru, oomugi ni man koru, budoushu ni man bate, abura ni man bate o ataemasu".
Soko de Tsuro no ou Hiramu wa tegami o Soromon ni okutte kotaeta, "Shu wa sono tami o aisuru yue ni, anata o karera no ou to saremashita".
Hiramu wa mata itta, "Tenchi o tsukurareta Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Kare wa Dabide ou ni kashikoi ko o atae, kore ni funbetsu to chie o sazukete, Shu no tame ni miya o tate, mata jibun no tame ni, oukyuu o tateru koto o saserareta.
Ima watashi wa tatsujin Hiramu to iu chie no aru koujin o tsukawashimasu.
Kare wa Dan no shison de aru onna o haha to shi, Tsuro no hito o chichi to shi, kingin, seidou, tetsu, ishi, ki no saiku oyobi murasakiito, aoito, ama ito, hi ito no orimono ni kuwashiku, mata yoku moromoro no choukoku o shi, ishou o korashite moromoro no kousaku o shimasu. Kare o mochiite anata no koujin oyobi anata no chichi, waga Shu Dabide no koujin to issho ni hatarakase nasai.
Sore de imawa ga Shu no iwareta komugi, oomugi, abura oyobi budoushu o sono shimobedomo ni okutte kudasai.
Anata no motomerareru zaimoku wa Rebanon kara kiridashi, ikada ni kunde, umi kara Yoppa ni okurimasu. Anata wa sore o Erusaremu ni hakobiage nasai".
Soko de Soromon wa sono chichi Dabide ga kazoeta you ni Isuraeru no kuni ni iru subete no takokujin o kazoetaga, awasete juu go man sanzen roppyakunin atta.
Kare wa sono nana mannin o ni o ou mono to shi, hachi mannin o yama de ki ya ishi o kiru mono to shi, sanzen roppyakunin o tami o hatarakaseru kantokusha to shita.
Soromon wa Erusaremu no Moria no yama ni Shu no miya o tateru koto o hajimeta. Soko wa chichi Dabide ni Shu ga arawarerareta tokoro, sunawachi Ebusu bi to Orunan no uchi ba ni Dabide ga sonaeta tokoro de aru.
Soromon ga miya o tate hajimeta no wa, sono chisei no yon nen no ni gatsu de atta.
Soromon no tateta kami no miya no motoi no sunpou wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi mukashi no shakudo ni yoreba nagasa rokujuu kyubito, haba nijuu kyubito,
Miya no mae no rou wa miya no haba ni shitagatte nagasa nijuu kyubito takasa hyaku nijuu kyubito de, sono naibu wa junkin de ootta.
Mata sono haiden wa itosugi no ita de hari, seikin o motte kore o ooi, sono ue ni shuro to kusari no katachi o hodokoshita.
Mata houseki o hamekonde miya o kazatta. Sono kin wa Paruwaimu no kin de atta.
Kare wa mata kin o motte sono miya, sunawachi, hari, shikii, kabe oyobi to o ooi, kabe no ue ni kerubimu o horitsuketa.
Kare wa mata shiseijo o tsukutta. Sono nagasa wa miya no nagasa ni shitagatte nijuu kyubito, haba mo nijuu kyubito de aru. Kare wa seikin roppyaku taranto o motte kore o ootta.
Sono kugi no kin no omosa wa gojuu shikeru de atta. Kare wa mata kaijou no shitsu mo kin de ootta.
Kare wa shiseijo ni ki o kizanda kerubimu no zou o futatsu tsukuri, kore o kin de ootta.
Kerubimu no tsubasa no nagasa wa awasete nijuu kyubito atta. Sunawachi hitotsu no kerubu no hitotsu no tsubasa wa go kyubito de, miya no kabe ni todoki, hoka no tsubasa mo go kyubito de, ta no kerubu no tsubasa ni todoki,
Ta no kerubu no hitotsu no tsubasa mo go kyubito de, miya no kabe ni todoki, hoka no tsubasa mo go kyubito de, saki no kerubu no tsubasa ni sesshite ita.
Korera no kerubimu no tsubasa wa hirogeruto nijuu kyubito atta. Karera wa tomo ni ashi de tachi, sono kao wa haiden ni mukatte ita.
Soromon wa mata aoito, murasakiito, hi ito oyobi ama ito de taremaku o tsukuri, sono ue ni kerubimu no nuitori o hodokoshita.
Kare wa miya no mae ni hashira o nihon tsukutta. Sono takasa wa sanjuu go kyubito, onoono no hashira no itadaki ni go kyubito no chuutou o tsukutta.
Kare wa kubi kazari no you na kusari o tsukutte, hashira no itadaki ni tsuke, zakuro hyaku o tsukutte sono kusari no ue ni tsuketa.
Kare wa kono hashira o shinden no mae ni, ichipon o minami no hou ni, ichipon o kita no hou ni tate, minami no hou no o Yakin to nazuke, kita no hou no o Boazu to nazuketa.
Soromon wa mata seidou no saidan o tsukutta. Sono nagasa nijuu kyubito, haba nijuu kyubito, takasa juu kyubito de aru.
Kare wa mata umi o ite tsukutta. Fuchi kara fuchi made juu kyubito de atte, shuui wa enkei o nashi, takasa go kyubito de, sono shuui wa tsuna o motte hakaruto sanjuu kyubito atta.
Umi no shita ni wa sanjuu kyubito no shuui o meguru hisago no katachi ga atte, umi no shuui o kakonde ita. Sono hisago wa ni narabi de, umi o iru toki ni ita mono de aru.
Sono umi wa juu ni no ushi no ue ni okare, sono mittsu wa kita ni mukai, mittsu wa nishi ni mukai, mittsu wa minami ni mukai, mittsu wa higashi ni mukatte ita. Umi wa sono ue ni okare, ushi no ushiro wa minauchi ni mukatte ita.
Umi no atsusa wa te no haba de, sono fuchi wa hai no fuchi no you ni, yuri no hana ni nisete tsukurareta. Umi ni wa mizu o sanzen bate ireru koto ga dekita.
Kare wa mata mono o arau tame ni senban juuko o tsukutte, goko o minamigawa ni, goko o kitagawa ni oita. Sono naka de hansai ni mochiiru mono o aratta. Shikashi umi wa saishi ga sono naka de mi o arau tame de atta.
Kare wa mata kin no shokudai juuko o sono sadame ni shitagatte tsukuri, haiden no naka no minamigawa ni goko, kitagawa ni goko o oki,
Mata tsukue juuko o tsukuri, shinden no naka no minamigawa ni goko, kitagawa ni goko o oki, mata kin no hachi hyaku o tsukutta.
Kare wa mata saishi no niwa to ooniwa oyobi niwa no to o tsukuri, sono to o seidou de ootta.
Kare wa umi o miya no tounan no sumi ni sueta.
Hiramu wa mata tsubo to juunou to hachi to o tsukutta. Kou shite Hiramu wa Soromon ou no tame, kami no miya no kouji o oeta.
Sunawachi nihon no hashira to tama to, hashira no itadaki ni aru futatsu no chuutou to, hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no futatsu no tama o oou futatsu no ami zaiku to,
Sono futatsu no ami zaiku no tame no zakuro yonhyaku, kono zakuro wa onoono ami zaiku ni ni narabi ni tsukete, hashira no itadaki ni aru chuutou no futatsu no tama o maite ita.
Kare wa mata dai to dai no ue no senban to,
Hitotsu no umi to sono shita no juu ni no ushi o tsukutta.
Tsubo, juunou, niku sashi nado subete korera no utsuwamono o, tatsujin Hiramu wa Soromon ou no tame, Shu no miya no tame ni, hikari no aru seidou de tsukutta.
Ou wa Yorudan no teichi de, Sukote to Zereda no aida no nendo no chi de kore o ita.
Kono you ni Soromon wa korera no subete no utsuwamono o hijou ni ooku tsukutta no de, sono seidou no juuryou wa, hakaru koto ga dekinakatta.
Kou shite Soromon wa kami no miya no subete no utsuwamono o tsukutta. Sunawachi kin no saidan to, sonae no pan o noseru tsukue,
Mata sadame no you ni honden no mae de hi o tomosu junkin no shokudai to, sono tomoshibi sara o tsukutta.
Sono hana, tomoshibi sara, kokorokaki wa seikin de atta.
Mata shinkiri basami, hachi, kou no hai, shinto rizara wa junkin de atta. Mata miya no to, sunawachi shiseijo no naibu no to oyobi haiden no to no hiji tsubo wa kin de atta.
Kou shite Soromon wa Shu no miya no tame ni shita subete no kouji o owatta. Soshite Soromon wa chichi Dabide ga sasageta mono, sunawachi kingin oyobi moromoro no utsuwamono o tazusaete itte kami no miya no houzou ni osameta.
Soromon wa Shu no keiyaku no hako o Dabide no machi Shion kara katsugi noborou to shite, Isuraeru no chouroutachi to, subete no buzoku no kashiratachi to, Isuraeru no hitobito no shizoku no choutachi o Erusaremu ni meshiatsumeta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina shichi gatsu no matsuri ni ou no moto ni atsumatta.
Isuraeru no chouroutachi ga mina kita no de, Rebi bitotachi wa hako o toriageta.
Karera wa hako to, kaiken no makuya to, makuya ni aru subete sei naru utsuwa o katsugi nobotta. Sunawachi saishi to Rebi bito ga korera no mono o katsugi nobotta.
Soromon ou oyobi kare no moto ni atsumatta Isuraeru no kaishuu wa mina hako no mae de hitsuji to ushi o sasagetaga, sono kazu ga ookute, shiraberu koto mo kazoeru koto mo dekinakatta.
Kou shite saishitachi wa Shu no keiyaku no hako o sono basho ni katsugi ire, miya no honden de aru shiseijo no uchi no kerubimu no tsubasa no shita ni oita.
Kerubimu wa tsubasa o hako no tokoro no ue ni nobete ita no de, kerubimu wa ue kara hako to sono sao o ootta.
Sao wa nagakatta no de, sao no hashi ga honden no mae no seijo kara mieta. Shikashi gaibu ni wa mienakatta. Sao wa konnichi made soko ni aru.
Hako no uchi ni wa nimai no ita no hoka nani mo nakatta. Kore wa Isuraeru no hitobito ga Ejiputo kara dete kita toki, Shu ga karera to keiyaku o musubare, Moose ga Horebu de sore o osameta mono de aru.
Soshite saishitachi ga seijo kara deta toki (koko ni ita saishitachi wa mina, sono kumi no jun ni kakawarazu mi o kiyometa.
Mata Rebi bito no uta utau mono, sunawachi Asafu, Heman, Edoton oyobi karera no kotachi to kyoudaitachi wa mina amanuno o ki, Shinbaru to, tategoto to, koto o totte saidan no higashi ni tachi, hyaku nijuunin no saishi wa karera to issho ni tatte rappa o fuita.
Rappa fuku mono to utauta u mono to wa, hitori no you ni koe o awasete Shu o home, kansha shita), soshite karera ga rappa to, Shinbaru to sono ta no gakki o motte koe o furiage, Shu o homete "Shu wa megumi ari, sono awaremi wa tokoshie ni taeru koto ga nai" to itta toki, kumo wa sono miya sunawachi Shu no miya ni michita.
Saishitachi wa kumo no yue ni tatte tsutome o suru koto ga dekinakatta. Shu no eikou ga kami no miya ni michitakara de aru.
Soko de Soromon wa itta, "Shu wa mizukara koki kumo no naka ni sumaou to iwareta.
Shikashi watashi wa anata no tame ni takaki ie, tokoshie no misumai o tateta".
Soshite ou wa kao o furimukete Isuraeru no zenkaishuu o shukufuku shita. Sono toki Isuraeru no zenkaishuu wa tatte ita.
Kare wa itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa kuchi o motte waga chichi Dabide ni yakusoku sareta koto o, sono te o motte nashitogerareta. Sunawachi Shu wa iwareta,
'Waga tami o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita hi kara, watashi wa waga na o okubeki ie o tateru tame ni, Isuraeru no moromoro no buzoku no uchi kara, dono machi o mo eranda koto ga naku, mata ta no dare o mo waga tami Isuraeru no kimi to shite eranda koto ga nai.
Waga na o oku tame ni, tada Erusaremu dake o erabi, mata waga tami Isuraeru o osamesaseru tame ni, tada Dabide dake o eranda'.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na no tame ni ie o tateru koto wa, chichi Dabide no kokoro ni atta.
Shikashi Shu wa chichi Dabide ni iwareta, 'Watashi no na no tame ni ie o tateru koto wa anata no kokoro ni atta. Anata no kokoro ni kono koto no atta no wa kekkou de aru.
Shikashi anata wa sono ie o tatete wa naranai. Anata no koshi kara deru anata no ko ga watashi no na no tame ni ie o taterude arou'.
Soshite Shu wa sou iwareta kotoba o okonawareta. Sunawachi watashi wa chichi Dabide ni kawatte tachi, Shu ga iwareta you ni, Isuraeru no kurai ni zashi, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na no tame ni ie o tateta.
Watashi wa mata, Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito to musubareta Shu no keiyaku o ireta hako o soko ni osameta".
Soromon wa Isuraeru no zenkaishuu no mae, Shu no saidan no mae ni tatte, te o nobeta.
Soromon wa saki ni nagasa go kyubito, haba go kyubito, takasa san kyubito no seidou no dai o tsukutte, niwa no mannaka ni suete oita no de, kare wa sono ue ni tachi, Isuraeru no zenkaishuu no mae de hiza o kagame, sono te o ten ni nobete,
Itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, ten ni mo chi ni mo, anata no you na kami wa arimasen. Anata wa keiyaku o mamorare, kokoro o tsukushite anata no mae ni ayumu anata no shimobera ni, itsukushimi o hodokoshi,
Anata no shimobe, watashi no chichi Dabide ni yakusoku sareta koto o mamoraremashita. Anata ga kuchi o motte yakusoku sareta koto o, te o motte nashitogerareta koto wa, konnichi miru toori de arimasu.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata no shimobe, watashi no chichi Dabide ni, anata ga yakusoku shite, 'Omae ga watashi no mae ni ayunda you ni, omae no shison ga sono michi o tsutsushinde, watashi no okite ni ayumunaraba, omae ni wa Isuraeru no kurai ni zasuru hito ga watashi no mae ni kakeru koto wa nai' to iwareta koto o, Dabide no tame ni omamori kudasai.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, douzo, anata no shimobe Dabide ni iwareta kotoba o kakunin shite kudasai.
Shikashi kami wa, hatashite hito to tomo ni chijou ni sumawarerudeshou ka. Miyo, ten mo, ito takaki ten mo anata o ireru koto wa dekimasen. Watashi no tateta kono ie nado naosara desu.
Shikashi waga kami, Shu yo, shimobe no inori to negai o kaerimite, shimobe ga anata no mae ni sasageru sakebi to inori o okiki kudasai.
Douzo, anata no me o hiru mo yoru mo kono ie ni, sunawachi, anata no na o soko ni oku to iwareta tokoro ni mukatte ohiraki kudasai. Douzo, shimobe ga kono tokoro ni mukatte sasageru inori o okiki kudasai.
Douzo, shimobe to, anata no tami Isuraeru ga kono tokoro ni mukatte inoru toki ni, sono negai o okiki kudasai. Anata no sumika de aru ten kara kiki, kiite oyurushi kudasai.
Moshi hito ga sono tonaribito ni taishite tsumi o okashi, chikai o suru koto o motomerareru toki, kite kono miya de, anata no saidan no mae ni chikaunaraba,
Anata wa ten kara kiite, okonai, anata no shimobera o sabaki, akunin ni mukui o nashite, sono okonai no mukui o sono koube ni kishi, gijin o gi to shite, sono gi ni shitagatte sono hito ni mukuite kudasai.
Moshi anata no tami Isuraeru ga, anata ni taishite tsumi o okashita tame ni, teki no mae ni yabureta toki, anata ni tachikaette, anata no na o agame, kono miya de anata no mae ni inori negaunaraba,
Anata wa ten kara kiki, anata no tami Isuraeru no tsumi o yurushite, anata ga karera to sono senzo ni ataerareta chi ni karera o kaerasete kudasai.
Moshi karera ga anata ni tsumi o okashita tame ni, ten ga tozasarete, ame ga naku, anata ga karera o kurushimerareru toki, karera ga kono tokoro ni mukatte inori, anata no na o agame, sono tsumi o hanarerunaraba,
Anata wa ten ni atte kiki, anata no shimobe, anata no tami Isuraeru no tsumi o yurushite, karera ni ayumubeki yoi michi o oshie, anata no tami ni shigyou to shite tamawatta chi ni ame o furasete kudasai.
Moshi kuni ni kikin ga aru ka, moshikuha ekibyou, tachigare, kusari ho, inago, aomushi ga aru ka, mata wa teki no tame ni machi no mon no naka ni semekakomareru koto ga aru ka, donna saigai, donna byouki ga atte mo,
Moshi, hitori ka, aruiha anata no tami Isuraeru ga mina onoono sono kokoro no nayami o shitte, kono miya ni mukai, te o noberunaraba, donna inori, donna negai de mo,
Anata wa sono sumika de aru ten kara kiite yurushi, onoono no hito ni, sono kokoro o shitte orareru yue, sono subete no michi ni shitagatte mukuite kudasai. Tada anata dake ga subete no hito no kokoro o shitte orarerukara desu.
Anata ga wareware no senzotachi ni tamawatta chi ni, karera no ikinagaraeru hi no aida, tsune ni anata o osoresase, anata no michi ni ayumasete kudasai.
Mata anata no tami Isuraeru no mono de naku, takokujin de, anata no ooinaru na to, tsuyoi te to, nobeta ude no tame ni tooi kuni kara kite, kono miya ni mukatte inorunaraba,
Anata wa, anata no sumika de aru ten kara kiki, subete takokujin ga anata ni yobimotomeru you ni shite kudasai. Sou sureba chi no subete no tami wa anata no tami Isuraeru no you ni, anata no na o shiri, anata o osore, mata watashi ga tateta kono miya ga, anata no na ni yotte yobareru koto o shiru ni itarudeshou.
Anata no tami ga teki to tatakau tame ni, anata ga tsukawasareru michi ni yotte deru toki, moshi karera ga anata no erabareta kono machi to, watashi ga anata no na no tame ni tateta kono miya ni mukatte anata ni inorunaraba,
Anata wa ten kara karera no inori to negai to o kiite karera o otasuke kudasai.
Karera ga anata ni taishite tsumi o okasu koto ga atte, - - tsumi o okasanai hito wa nai yue, - - anata ga karera o ikatte, teki ni watashi, teki ga karera o horyo to shite tooi chi aruiha chikai chi ni hiite iku toki,
Moshi, karera ga torawarete itta chi de, mizukara kaerimite kui, sono toraware no chi de anata ni negai, 'Wareware wa tsumi o okashi, yokoshima na koto o shi, aku o okonaimashita' to ii,
Sono toraware no chi de kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite anata ni tachikaeri, anata ga karera no senzo ni ataerareta chi, anata ga erabareta machi, watashi ga anata no na no tame ni tateta kono miya ni mukatte inorunaraba,
Anata no sumika de aru ten kara, karera no inori to negai to o kiite karera o tasuke, anata ni mukatte tsumi o okashita anata no tami o oyurushi kudasai.
Waga kami yo, douzo, kono tokoro de sasageru inori ni anata no me o hiraki, anata no mimi o katamukete kudasai.
Shu naru kami yo, ima anata to, anata no chikara no hako ga tatte, anata no ansokujo ni ohairi kudasai. Shu naru kami yo, douzo anata no saishitachi ni sukui no koromo o kise, anata no seitotachi ni megumi o yorokobasete kudasai.
Shu naru kami yo, douzo anata no abura sosogareta mono no kao o shirizokenaide kudasai. Anata no shimobe Dabide ni shimesareta itsukushimi o oboete kudasai".
Soromon ga inori owatta toki, ten kara hi ga kudatte hansai to gisei o yaki, Shu no eikou ga miya ni michita.
Shu no eikou ga Shu no miya ni michita no de, saishitachi wa Shu no miya ni, hairu koto ga dekinakatta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina hi ga kudatta no o mi, mata Shu no eikou ga miya ni nozonda no o mite, shikiishi no ue de chi ni hirefushite haishi, Shu ni kansha shite itta, "Shu wa megumi fukaku, sono itsukushimi wa tokoshie ni taeru koto ga nai".
Soshite ou to tami wa mina Shu no mae ni gisei o sasageta.
Soromon ou no sasageta gisei wa, ushi ni man nisentou, hitsuji juu ni mantou de atta. Kou shite ou to tami wa minakami no miya o sasageta.
Saishi wa sono mochiba ni tachi, Rebi bito mo Shu no gakki o totte tatta. Sono gakki wa Dabide ou ga Shu ni kansha suru tame ni tsukutta mono de, Dabide ga karera no te ni yotte sa n bi o sasageru toki, "Sono itsukushimi wa, tokoshie ni taeru koto ga nai" to tonaesaseta mono de aru. Saishi wa karera no mae de rappa o fuki, subete no Isuraeru bi to wa tatte ita.
Soromon wa mata Shu no miya no mae ni aru niwa no naka o seibetsu shi, sono tokoro de, hansai to shuuonsai no abura o sasageta. Kore wa Soromon ga tsukutta seidou no saidan ga, sono hansai to sosai to abura to o noseru ni tarinakattakara de aru.
Sono toki Soromon wa nanuka no aida matsuri o okonatta. Hamate no iriguchi kara Ejiputo no kawa ni itaru made no subete no Isuraeru bito ga kare to tomo ni ari, hijou ni ookina kaishuu de atta.
Soshite youkame ni seikai o hiraita. Karera wa nanuka no aida, saidan houken no rei o okonai, nanuka no aida matsuri o okonattaga,
Nana gatsu nijuu san nichi ni itatte Soromon wa tami o sono tenmaku ni kaeraseta. Mina Shu ga Dabide, Soromon oyobi sono tami Isuraeru ni hodokosareta megumi no tame ni yorokobi, katsu kokoro ni tanoshinde satta.
Kou shite Soromon wa Shu no ie to ou no ie to o tsukuri oeta. Sunawachi kare wa Shu no ie to jibun no ie ni tsuite, shiyou to keikaku shita subete no koto o shubi yoku nashitogeta.
Toki ni Shu wa yoru Soromon ni arawarete iwareta, "Watashi wa anata no inori o kiki, kono tokoro o watashi no tame ni erande, gisei o sasageru ie to shita.
Watashi ga ten o tojite ame o nakushi, mata wa watashi ga inago ni meijite chi no mono o kuwase, mata wa ekibyou o tami no naka ni okuru toki,
Watashi no na o motte tonaerareru watashi no tami ga, moshi herikudari, inotte, watashi no kao o motome, sono warui michi o hanarerunaraba, watashi wa ten kara kiite, sono tsumi o yurushi, sono chi o iyasu.
Ima kono tokoro ni sasagerareru inori ni watashi no me o hiraki, mimi o katamukeru.
Ima watashi wa watashi no na o nagaku koko ni todomeru tame ni, kono miya o erabi, katsu seibetsu shita. Watashi no me to watashi no kokoro wa tsune ni koko ni aru.
Anata ga moshi chichi Dabide no ayunda you ni watashi no mae ni ayumi, watashi ga meijita toori ni subete itte, watashi no sadame to okite to o mamorunaraba,
Watashi wa anata no chichi Dabide ni keiyaku shite 'Isuraeru o osameru hito wa anata ni kakeru koto ga nai' to itta toori ni, anata no ou no kurai o kataku suru.
Shikashi, anata gata ga moshi hirugaette, watashi ga anata gata no mae ni oita sadame to imashime to o sute, itte ta no kamigami ni tsukae, sore o ogamunaraba,
Watashi wa anatagata o watashi no ataeta chi kara nukisari, mata watashi no na no tame ni seibetsu shita kono miya o watashi no mae kara nagesutete, moromoro no tami no uchi ni kotowaza to shi, waraigusa to suru.
Mata kono miya wa takaikeredo mo, tsuini wa, sono katawara o sugiru mono wa mina odoroite, 'Naniyue Shu wa kono chi to, kono miya to ni kono you ni sareta no ka' to iude arou.
Sono toki, hitobito wa kotaete 'Karera wa sono senzotachi o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita karera no kami, Shu o sutete, ta no kamigami ni tsukishitagai, sore o ogami, sore ni tsukaeta tame ni, Shu wa kono subete no wazawai o karera no ue ni kudashita no de aru' to iude arou".
Soromon wa nijuu nen o hete, Shu no ie to jibun no ie to o tate owatta.
Mata Soromon wa Hiramukara okurareta machimachi o tatenaoshite, soko ni Isuraeru no hitobito o sumaseta.
Soromon wa mata hamate zoba o semete, kore o totta.
Kare wa mata arano ni Tademoru o tate, moromoro no kura no machi o Hamate ni tateta.
Mata jouheki, mon, kannoki no aru kengo na machi, ue Betehoron to shita Betehoron o tateta.
Soromon wa mata Baarate to jibun no motte ita subete no kura no machi to, subete no sensha no machi to, kihei no machi, narabi ni Erusaremu, Rebanon oyobi jibun no osameru zenchihou ni tateyou to nozonda mono o, kotogotoku tateta.
Subete Isuraeru no shison de nai Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Hibi bi to, Ebusu bito no nokotta tami,
Sono chi ni atte karera no ato ni nokotta sono shison, sunawachi Isuraeru no shison ga horoboshi tsukusanakatta tami ni, Soromon wa kyousei choubo o okonatte konnichi ni oyonde iru.
Shikashi, Isuraeru no hitobito o Soromon wa sono kouji no tame ni wa, hitori mo dorei to shinakatta. Karera wa heishi to nari, shoukou to nari, sensha to, kihei no chou to natta.
Korera wa Soromon ou no omona kanri de, nihyaku gojuunin ari, tami o osameta.
Soromon wa Paro no musume o Dabide no machi kara tsurenobotte, kanojo no tame ni tateta ie ni irete itta, "Shu no hako o mukaeta tokoro wa shinsei de arukara, watashi no tsuma wa Isuraeru no ou Dabide no ie ni sunde wa naranai".
Soromon wa rou no mae ni kizuite oita Shu no saidan no ue de Shu ni hansai o sasageta.
Sunawachi Moose no meirei ni shitagatte, mainichi sadame no you ni sasage, ansokunichi, shingetsu oyobi nen ni san do no matsuri, sunawachi tane irenu pan no matsuri, nana shuu no matsuri, kariio no matsuri ni kore o sasageta.
Soromon wa, sono chichi Dabide no okite ni shitagatte, saishi no kumi o sadamete sono shoku ni ninji, mata Rebi bito o sono tsutome ni ninjite, mainichi sadame no you ni saishi no mae desan bito houshi o sase, mata mon o mamoru mono ni, sono kumi ni shitagatte, moromoro no mon o mamoraseta. Kore wa kami no hito Dabide ga kono you ni meijitakara de aru.
Saishi to Rebi bi to wa subete no koto ni tsuki, mata kura no koto ni tsuite, ou no meirei ni somukanakatta.
Kono you ni Soromon wa, Shu no miya no motoi o sueta hi kara kore o nashi oeta toki made, sono kouji no junbi o kotogotoku nashita no de, Shu no miya wa kansei shita.
Sore kara Soromon wa Edomu no chi no umibe ni aru ejion geberu oyobi Erote e itta.
Toki ni Hiramu wa sono shimobedomo no te ni yotte sendan o kare ni okuri, mata umi no koto ni nareta shimobedomo o tsukawashita no de, karera wa Soromon no shimobera to tomo ni Ofuru e iki, soko kara kin yonhyaku gojuu taranto o totte, kore o Soromon ou no moto ni tazusaete kita.
Shiba no joou wa Soromon no meisei o kiita no de, nanmon o motte Soromon o kokoromiyou to, hijou ni ooku no juusha o tsure, kouryou to hijou ni takusan no kin to houseki to o rakuda ni owasete, Erusaremu no Soromon no moto ni kite, sono kokoro ni aru koto o kotogotoku kare ni tsugeta.
Soromon wa kanojo no subete no toi ni kotaeta. Soromon ga shiranaide kanojo ni setsumei no dekinai koto wa hitotsu mo nakatta.
Shiba no joou wa Soromon no chie to, kare ga tateta ie o mi,
Mata sono shokutaku no shokumotsu to, retsuza no keraitachi to, sono jishintachi no shikoufuri to karera no fukusou, oyobi kare no kyuujitachi to sono fukusou, narabi ni kare ga Shu no miya de sasageru hansai o mite, mattaku ki o ubawarete shimatta.
Kanojo wa ou ni itta, "Watashi ga kuni de anata no koto to, anata no chie ni tsuite kiita uwasa wa shinjitsu deshita.
Shikashi watashi wa kite me ni miru made wa, sono uwasa o shinjimasendeshitaga, imami ruto, anata no chie no ooinaru koto wa sono hanbun mo watashi ni shirasaremasendeshita. Anata wa watashi no kiita uwasa ni masatte imasu.
Anata no okugatatachi wa saiwai desu. Tsune ni anata no mae ni tatte, anata no chie o kiku kono anata no keraitachi wa saiwai desu.
Anata no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa anata o yorokobi, anata o sono kurai ni tsukase, anata no kami, Shu no tame ni ou to saremashita. Anata no kami wa Isuraeru o aishite, tokoshie ni kore o kataku suru tame ni, anata o sono ou to sare, koudou to seigi o okonawareru no desu".
Soshite kanojo wa kin hyaku nijuu taranto, oyobi hijou ni ooku no kouryou to houseki to o ou ni okutta. Shiba no joou ga Soromon ni okutta you na kouryou wa, imada katsute nakatta.
Ofuru kara kin o tazusaete kita Hiramu no shimobetachi to Soromon no shimobetachi wa mata, bi kudan no ki to houseki o mo tazusaete kita.
Ou wa sono bi kudan no ki de, Shu no miya to ou no ie to ni kaidan o tsukuri, mata uta utau mono no tame ni koto to tategoto o tsukutta. Kono you na mono wa katsute Yuda no chi de mita koto ga nakatta.
Soromon ou wa, Shiba no joou ga okutta mono ni mukuita hoka ni, kanojo no nozomi ni makasete, subete sono motomeru mono o okutta. Soshite kanojo wa sono keraitachi to tomo ni jibun no kuni e kaette itta.
Sate ichi nen no aida ni Soromon no tokoro ni haitte kita kin no mekata wa roppyaku rokujuu roku taranto de atta.
Kono hoka ni boueki shou oyobi shounin no tazusaete kita mono ga atta. Mata Arabiya no subete no outachi oyobi kuni no daikantachi mo kingin o Soromon ni tazusaete kita.
Soromon ou wa nobekin no oodate nihyaku o tsukutta. Sono oodate ni wa onoono roppyaku shikeru no nobekin o mochiita.
Mata nobekin no kodate sanbyaku o tsukutta. Kodate ni wa onoono sanbyaku shikeru no kin o mochiita. Ou wa korera o Rebanon no mori no ie ni oita.
Ou wa mata ookina zouge no gyokuza o tsukuri, junkin de kore o ootta.
Sono gyokuza ni wa muitsu no dan ga ari, mata kin no ashidai ga atte tomo ni gyokuza ni tsuranari, sono zasuru tokoro no ryouhou ni, hijikake ga atte, hijikake no waki ni futatsu no shishi ga tatte ita.
Mata juu ni no shishi ga muitsu no dan no onoono no ryougawa ni tatte ita. Kono you na mono wa doko no kuni de mo tsukurareta koto ga nakatta.
Soromon ou ga nomu toki ni mochiita utsuwa wa mina kin de atta. Mata Rebanon no mori no ie no utsuwa mo mina junkin de atte, gin wa Soromon no yo ni wa tattobarenakatta.
Kore wa ou no fune ga Hiramu no shimobetachi o nosete Tarushishi e iki, san nengoto ni ichi do, sono Tarushishi no fune ga kin, gin, zouge, saru, kujaku o nosete kitakara de aru.
Kono you ni Soromon ou wa tomi to chie ni oite, chi no subete no ou ni masatte ita no de,
Chi no subete no ou wa kami ga Soromon no kokoro ni sazukerareta chie o kikou to shite Soromon ni ekken o motometa.
Hitobito wa onoono okurimono o tazusaete kita. Sunawachi gin no utsuwa, kin no utsuwa, ifuku, motsuyaku, kouryou, uma, raba nado nennen sadamatte ita.
Soromon wa uma to sensha no tame ni umaya yonsen to kihei ichi man nisen o mochi, kore o sensha no machi ni oki, mata Erusaremu no ou no moto ni oita.
Kare wa Yufurate kawa kara Perishite bito no chi to, Ejiputo no sakai ni itaru made no subete no ou o osameta.
Ou wa mata gin o ishi no you ni Erusaremu ni ooku shi, kouhaku o heiya no ichijiku kuwa no you ni ooku shita.
Mata hitobito wa Ejiputo oyobi shokoku kara uma o Soromon no tame ni yunyuu shita.
Soromon no sono hoka no shijuu no koui wa, yogensha Natan no sho to, Shiro bi to Ahiya no yogen to, senkensha Ido ga Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ni tsuite nobeta mokushi no naka ni, shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Soromon wa Erusaremu de yonjuu nen no aida Isuraeru no zenchi o osameta.
Soromon wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, chichi Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Rehabeamu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Rehabeamu wa Shikemu e itta. Subete no Isuraeru bito ga kare o ou ni shiyou to Shikemu e ittakara de aru.
Nebate no ko Yarabeamu wa, Soromon o sakete Ejiputo ni nogarete itaga, kore o kiite Ejiputo kara kaetta no de,
Hitobito wa hito o tsukawashite kare o maneita. Soko de Yarabeamu to subete no Isuraeru wa kite, Rehabeamu ni itta,
"Anata no chichi wa, wareware no kubiki o omoku shimashitaga, ima anata no chichi no kibishii shieki to, anata no chichi ga, wareware ni owaseta omoi kubiki o karuku shite kudasai. Sou sureba watashitachi wa anata ni tsukaemashou".
Rehabeamu wa karera ni kotaeta, "Mikka no nochi, mata watashi no tokoro ni ki nasai". Sore de tami wa satta.
Rehabeamu ou wa chichi Soromon no zonmeichuu Soromon ni tsukaeta chouroutachi ni soudan shite itta, "Anata gata wa kono tami ni dou hentou sureba yoi to omoimasu ka".
Karera wa Rehabeamu ni itta, "Anata ga moshi kono tami o shinsetsu ni atsukai, karera o yorokobase, nengoro ni katararerunaraba karera wa nagaku anata no shimobe to narudeshou".
Shikashi kare wa chouroutachi ga ataeta susume o sutete, jibun to issho ni ookiku natte jibun ni tsukaete iru wakamonotachi ni soudan shite,
Karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa, kono tami ga watashi ni mukatte, 'Anata no chichiue ga, wareware ni owaseta kubiki o karuku shite kudasai' to iu no ni, wareware wa nan to hentou sureba yoi to omoimasu ka".
Kare to issho ni ookiku natta wakamonotachi wa kare ni itta, "Anata ni mukatte, 'Anata no chichi wa, wareware no kubiki o omoku shitaga, anata wa, sore o wareware no tame ni karuku shite kudasai' to itta kono tami ni, kou ii nasai, 'Watashi no koyubi wa chichi no koshi yori mo futoi,
Chichi wa anata gata ni omoi kubiki o owasetaga, watashi wa sarani, anata gata no kubiki o omoku shiyou. Chichi wa muchi de anatagata o korashitaga, watashi wa sasori de anatagata o korasou' ".
Sate Yarabeamu to tami wa mina, ou ga "Mikkame ni watashi no tokoro ni ki nasai" to itta toori ni, mikkame ni Rehabeamu no tokoro e itta.
Ou wa araarashiku karera ni kotaeta. Sunawachi Rehabeamu ou wa chouroutachi no susume o sute,
Wakamonotachi no susume ni shitagai, karera ni tsugete itta, "Chichi wa anata gata no kubiki o omoku shitaga, watashi wa sarani kore o omoku shiyou. Chichi wa muchi de anatagata o korashitaga, watashi wa sasori de anatagata o korasou".
Kono you ni ou wa tami no iu koto o kikiirenakatta. Kore wa Shu ga, katsute Shiro bi to Ahiya ni yotte, Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ni iwareta kotoba o jouju suru tame ni, kami ga nasareta no de atta.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina, ou ga jibuntachi no iu koto o kikiirenai no o mita no de, tami wa ou ni kotaete itta, "Wareware wa Dabide no uchi ni nani no bun ga arou ka. Wareware wa Essai no ko no uchi ni shigyou ga nai. Isuraeru yo, meimei no tenmaku ni kaere. Dabide yo, ima anata no ie o miyo". Soshite Isuraeru wa mina karera no tenmaku e satte itta.
Shikashi Rehabeamu wa Yuda no machimachi ni sunde iru Isuraeru no hitobito o osameta.
Rehabeamu ou wa choubonin no kantoku de atta Adoramu o tsukawashitaga, Isuraeru no hitobito ga ishi de kare o uchikoroshita no de, Rehabeamu ou wa isoide kuruma ni nori, Erusaremu ni nigeta.
Kou shite Isuraeru wa Dabide no ie ni somuite konnichi ni itatta.
Rehabeamu wa Erusaremu ni kite, Yuda to Beniyamin no ie no mono, sunawachi, erinuki no gunjin juu hachi mannin o atsume, kuni o torimodosu tame ni Isuraeru to tatakaou to shitaga,
Shu no kotoba ga kami no hito Shimaya ni nozonde itta,
"Soromon no ko, Yuda no ou Rehabeamu oyobi Yuda to Beniyamin ni iru subete no Isuraeru no hitobito ni ii nasai,
'Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata gata wa nobotte wa naranai. Anata gata no kyoudai to tatakatte wa naranai. Onoono jibun no ie ni kaeri nasai. Kono koto wa watashi kara deta no de aru' ". Sore de hitobito wa Shu no kotoba o kiki, Yarabeamu o seme ni iku no o yamete kaetta.
Rehabeamu wa Erusaremu ni sunde, Yuda ni bouei no machimachi o tateta.
Sunawachi Betsurehemu, Etamu, Tekoa,
Betezuru, Soko, Adoramu,
Gate, Maresha, Jifu,
Adoraimu, Rakishi, Azeka,
Zora, Ayaron, oyobi Heburon. Korera wa Yuda to Beniyamin ni atte yougai no machimachi de aru.
Kare wa sono yougai o kengo ni shi, kore ni gunchou o oki, ryoushoku to abura to budoushu o takuwae,
Mata sono subete no machi ni tate to yari o sonaete, kore o hijou ni kyouka shi, soshite Yuda to Beniyamin o kakuho shita.
Isuraeru no zenchi no saishi to Rebi bi to wa shihou no sakai kara kite Rehabeamu ni mi o yoseta.
Sunawachi Rebi bi to wa jibun no houboku chi to ryouchi o hanarete Yuda to Erusaremu ni kita. Kore wa Yarabeamu to sono kora ga karera o haiseki shite, Shu no mae ni saishi no tsutome o sasenakatta tame de aru.
Yarabeamu wa takaki tokoro to, midara na kami to, jibun de tsukutta koushi no tame ni jibun no saishi o tateta.
Mata Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi de, subete sono kokoro o katamukete, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o motomeru mono wa senzo no kami, Shu ni gisei o sasageru tame ni, Rebi bito ni shitagatte Erusaremu ni kita.
Kono you ni karera wa Yuda no kuni o kataku shi, Soromon no ko Rehabeamu o san nen no aida tsuyoku shita. Karera wa san nen no aida Dabide to Soromon no michi ni ayundakara de aru.
Rehabeamu wa Dabide no ko Eremote no musume Maharate o tsuma ni metotta. Maharate wa Essai no ko Eriabu no musume Abihairu ga unda mono de aru.
Kanojo wa Eushi, Shimariya oyobi Zahamu no mitsugo o unda.
Kare wa mata kanojo no nochi ni Abusaromu no musume Maaka o metotta. Maaka ha Abiya, ATtai, Jiza oyobi Shiromite o unda.
Rehabeamu wa Abusaromu no musume Maaka o subete no tsuma to sobame ni masatte aishita. Kare wa tsuma juu hachinin, sobame rokujuunin o metotte, otokonoko nijuu hachinin to onnanoko rokujuunin o mouketa.
Rehabeamu wa Maaka no ko Abiya o tatete kashira to shi, sono kyoudai no chou to shita. Kare wa Abiya o ou ni shiyou to omottakara de aru.
Sore de ou wa kashikoku toriokonai, sono musukotachi o kotogotoku, Yuda to Beniyamin no zenchihou ni aru subete no yougai no machi ni sanzai sase, karera ni ryoushoku o ooku atae, mata ooku no tsuma o esaseta.
Rehabeamu wa sono kuni ga kataku tachi, tsuyoku naru ni oyonde, Shu no okite o suteta. Isuraeru mo mina kare ni naratta.
Karera ga kono you ni Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashita no de, Rehabeamu ou no go nen ni Ejiputo no ou Shishaku ga Erusaremu ni semenobotte kita.
Sono sensha wa issen nihyaku, kihei wa roku man, mata kare ni shitagatte Ejiputo kara kita tami, sunawachi Ribia bi to, Suki bi to, Echiopiya bito wa musuu de atta.
Shishaku wa Yuda no yougai no machimachi o tori, Erusaremu ni sematte kita.
Soko de yogensha Shimaya wa, Rehabeamu oyobi Shishaku no yue ni, Erusaremu ni atsumatta Yuda no tsukasatachi no moto ni kite itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata wa watashi o suteta no de, watashi mo anatagata o sutete Shishaku ni watashita' to".
Soko de Isuraeru no tsukasatachi, oyobi ou wa herikudatte, "Shu wa tadashii" to itta.
Shu wa karera no herikudaru no o mirareta no de, Shu no kotoba ga Shimaya ni nozonde itta, "Karera ga herikudattakara, watashi wa karera o horobosanaide, ma mo naku sukui o hodokosu. Watashi wa Shishaku no te ni yotte, ikari o Erusaremu ni sosogu koto o shinai.
Shikashi karera wa Shishaku no shimobe ni naru. Kore wa karera ga watashi ni tsukaeru koto to, kuniguni no outachi ni tsukaeru koto to no soui o shiru tame de aru".
Ejiputo no ou Shishaku wa Erusaremu ni semenobotte, Shu no miya no houmotsu to, ou no ie no houmotsu to o ubaisatta. Sunawachi sorera o kotogotoku ubaisari, mata Soromon no tsukutta kin no tate o mo ubaisatta.
Sore de Rehabeamu ou wa, sono kawari ni seidou no tate o tsukutte, ou no ie no mon o mamoru jieichoutachi no te ni watashita.
Ou ga Shu no miya ni hairugoto ni jiei wa kite, kore o oi, mata kore o jiei no heya e motte kaetta.
Rehabeamu ga herikudatta no de Shu no ikari wa kare o hanare, kare o kotogotoku horobosou to wa sarenakatta. Mata Yuda no jijou mo yoku natta.
Rehabeamu ou wa Erusaremu de jibun no chii o kakuritsu shi, yo o osameta. Sunawachi Rehabeamu wa yonjuu ichisai no toki kurai ni tsuki, juu nana nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Erusaremu wa Shu ga sono na o oku tame ni Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara erabareta machi de aru. Kare no haha wa Anmon no onna de, na o Naama to itta.
Rehabeamu wa Shu o motomeru koto ni kokoro o katamukenaide, warui koto o okonatta.
Rehabeamu no shijuu no koui wa, yogensha Shimaya oyobi senkensha Ido no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka. Rehabeamu to Yarabeamu to no aida ni wa taezu sensou ga atta.
Rehabeamu wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Abiya ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Yarabeamu ou no daijuu hachi nen ni Abiya ga Yuda no ou to natta.
Kare wa san nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Kare no haha wa Gibea no Urieru no musume de, na o Mikaya to itta.
Koko ni Abiya to Yarabeamu to no aida ni sensou ga okori, Abiya wa yonjuu man no seihei kara naru yuukan na gunzei o motte tatakai ni ide, Yarabeamu mo daiyuushi kara naru hachijuu man no seihei o motte, kore ni mukatte tatakai no sonae o shita.
Toki ni Abiya wa Efuraimu no sanchi ni aru Zemaraimu yama no ue ni tatte itta, "Yarabeamu oyobi Isuraeru no hitobito yo mina kike.
Anata gata wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga shio no keiyaku o motte Isuraeru no kuni o nagaku Dabide to sono shison ni tamawatta koto o shiranai no ka.
Tokoro ga Dabide no ko Soromon no kerai de aru Nebate no ko Yarabeamu ga tatte, sono shukun ni somuki,
Mata iyashii burai no tomo gara ga atsumatte kare ni kumishi, Soromon no ko Rehabeamu ni tekishitaga, Rehabeamu wa wakaku, katsu ishi ga yowakute kore ni ataru koto ga dekinakatta.
Ima mata, anata gata wa taigun o tanomi, mata Yarabeamu ga tsukutte, anata gata no kami to shita kin no koushi o tanonde, Dabide no shison note ni aru Shu no kuni ni tekitai shiyou to shite iru.
Mata anata gata wa Aron no shison de aru Shu no saishi to Rebi bito to o oidashite, ta no kuniguni no tami ga suru you ni saishi o tatetade wa nai ka. Sunawachi dare de mo wakai oushi ichitou, ohitsuji nanatou o tazusaete kite, jibun o seibetsu suru mono wa mina ano kami de nai mono no saishi to suru koto ga dekita.
Shikashi wareware ni oite wa, Shu ga wareware no kami de atte, wareware wa kare o sutenai. Mata Shu ni tsukaeru saishi wa Aron no shison de ari, hataraki o nasu mono wa Rebi bito de aru.
Karera wa asagoto yuugoto ni Shu ni hansai to, koubashii kou o sasage, sonae no pan o junkin no tsukue no ue ni sonae, mata kin no shokudai to sono tomoshibi sara o totonoete, yuugoto ni tomosu no de aru. Kono you ni wareware wa wareware no kami, Shu no tsutome o mamotte iruga, anata gata wa kare o suteta.
Miyo, kami wa mizukara wareware to tomo ni orarete, wareware no kashira to narare, mata, sono saishitachi wa rappa o fukinarashite, anatagata o semeru. Isuraeru no hitobito yo, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu ni tekishite tatakatte wa naranai. Anata gata wa seikou shinai".
Yarabeamu wa fukuhei o karera no ushiro ni mawaraseta no de, kare no guntai wa Yuda no mae ni ari, fukuhei wa karera no ushiro ni atta.
Yuda wa ushiro o miruto, teki ga mae to ushiro to ni atta no de, Shu ni mukatte yobawari, saishitachi wa rappa o fuita.
Soko de Yuda no hitobito wa toki no koe o ageta. Yuda no hitobito ga toki no koe o ageruto, kami wa Yarabeamu to Isuraeru no hitobito o Abiya to Yuda no mae ni uchi yaburareta no de,
Isuraeru no hitobito wa Yuda no mae kara nigeta. Kami ga karera o Yuda no te ni watasareta no de,
Abiya to sono tami wa, karera o obitadashiku uchikoroshita. Isuraeru no korosarete taoreta mono wa gojuu mannin, minaseihei de atta.
Kono you ni, kono toki Isuraeru no hitobito wa uchimakasare, Yuda no hitobito wa kachi o eta. Karera ga sono senzo no kami, Shu o tanondakara de aru.
Abiya wa Yarabeamu o tsuigeki shite suuko no machi o kare kara totta. Sunawachi Beteru to sono murazato, Eshana to sono murazato, Efuron to sono murazato de aru.
Yarabeamu wa, Abiya no yo ni wa futatabi chikara o eru koto ga dekizu, Shu ni utarete shinda.
Shikashi Abiya wa tsuyoku nari, tsuma juu yonnin o metori, musuko nijuu ninin, musume juu rokunin o mouketa.
Abiya no sono ta no koui sunawachi sono koudou to kotoba wa, yogensha Ido no chuushaku ni shirusarete iru.
Abiya wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutte, Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Asa ga kawatte ou to natta. Asa no chisei ni kuni wa juu nen no aida, odayaka de atta.
Asa wa sono kami, Shu no me ni yoshi to mie, mata tadashi to mieru koto o okonatta.
Kare wa kotonaru saidan to, moromoro no takaki tokoro o torinozoki, sekichuu o kowashi, Ashira zou o kiritaoshi,
Yuda ni meijite sono senzotachi no kami, Shu o motomesase, okite to imashime to o okonawase,
Yuda no subete no machimachi kara, takaki tokoro to kou no saidan to o torinozoita. Soshite kuni wa kare no moto ni odayaka de atta.
Kare wa kuni ga odayaka de atta no de, yougai no machi suuko o Yuda ni tateta. Mata Shu ga kare ni heian o tamawatta no de, kono toshigoro sensou ga nakatta.
Kare wa Yuda ni itta, "Wareware wa korera no machi o tate, sono shuui ni ishigaki o kizuki, yagura o tate, mon to kannoki o moukeyou. Wareware ga wareware no kami, Shu o motometa no de, kono kuni wa nao wareware no mono de ari, wareware ga kare o motometa no de, shihou ni oite, wareware ni heian o tamawatta". Kou shite karera wa todokoori naku tate owatta.
Asa no guntai wa Yuda kara deta mono sanjuu mannin atte, tate to yari o tori, Beniyamin kara deta mono nijuu hachi mannin atte, kodate o tori, yumi o hiita. Kore wa mina daiyuushi de atta.
Echiopiya bito Zera ga, hyaku man no guntai to sanbyaku no sensha o hikiite, Maresha made semete kita.
Asa wa dete, kore o mukae, Maresha no Zepata no tani ni tatakai no sonae o shita.
Toki ni Asa wa sono kami, Shu ni mukatte yobawatte itta, "Shu yo, chikara no aru mono o tasukeru koto mo, chikara no nai mono o tasukeru koto mo, anata ni oite wa kotonaru koto wa arimasen. Wareware no kami, Shu yo, wareware o otasuke kudasai. Wareware wa anata ni yoritanomi, anata no na ni yotte kono taigun ni atarimasu. Shu yo, anata wa wareware no kami desu. Douzo hito o anata ni katasenaide kudasai".
Soko de Shu wa Asa no mae to Yuda no mae de Echiopiya bito o uchi yaburareta no de, Echiopiya bito wa nigesatta.
Asa to kare ni shitagau tami wa karera o geraru made tsuigeki shita no de, Echiopiya bito wa taorete, ikinokotta mono wa hitori mo nakatta. Shu to Shu no gunzei no mae ni uchiyaburaretakara de aru. Yuda no hitobito no eta bundori mono wa hijou ni ookatta.
Karera wa mata, geraru no shuui no machimachi o kotogotoku uchiyabutta. Shu no osore ga karera no ue ni nozondakara de aru. Soshite karera wa sono subete no machi o kasume ubatta. Sono uchi ni ooku no mono ga attakara de aru.
Mata kachiku o motte iru mono no tenmaku o osoi, ooku no hitsuji to rakuda o ubaitotte, Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Toki ni kami no rei ga Odede no ko Azariya ni nozonda no de,
Kare wa dete itte Asa o mukae, kore ni itta, "Asa oyobi Yuda to Beniyamin no hitobito yo, watashi ni kiki nasai. Anata gata ga Shu to tomo ni oru aida wa, Shu mo anata gata to tomo ni oraremasu. Anata ga taga, moshi kare o motomerunaraba, kare ni audeshou. Shikashi, kare o suterunaraba, kare mo anatagata o suterarerudeshou.
Somosomo, Isuraeru ni wa nagai aida, makoto no kami ga naku, oshie o nasu saishi mo naku, rippou mo nakatta.
Shikashi, nayami no toki, karera ga Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni tachikaeri, kare o motometa no de kare ni atta.
Sono koro wa, deru mono ni mo iru mono ni mo, heian ga naku, ooinaru souran ga kuniguni no subete no juumin o nayamashita.
Kuni wa kuni ni, machi wa machi ni uchikudakareta. Kami ga moromoro no nayami o motte karera o kurushimeraretakara desu.
Shikashi anata gata wa yuuki o dashi nasai. Te o yowaku shite wa naranai. Anata gata no waza ni wa mukui ga arukara desu".
Asa wa korera no kotoba sunawachi Odede no ko Azariya no yogen o kiite yuuki o e, nikumubeki guuzou o Yuda to Beniyamin no zenchi kara nozoki, mata kare ga Efuraimu no sanchi de eta machimachi kara nozoki, Shu no miya no rou no mae ni atta Shu no saidan o saikou shita.
Kare wa mata Yuda to Beniyamin no hitobito oyobi Efuraimu, Manase, Shimeon kara kite, karera no aida ni kiryuu shite ita mono o atsumeta. Sono kami, Shu ga Asa to tomo ni orareru no o mite, Isuraeru kara Asa no moto ni kudatta mono ga ooku attakara de aru.
Karera wa Asa no chisei no juu go nen no san gatsu ni Erusaremu ni atsumari,
Tazusaete kita bundori mono no uchi kara ushi nanahyakutou, hitsuji nanasentou o sono hi Shu ni sasageta.
Soshite karera wa keiyaku o musubi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite senzo no kami, Shu o motomeru koto to,
Subete Isuraeru no kami, Shu o motomenai mono wa rouyou danjo no betsu naku korosarubeki koto o yakushita.
Soshite karera wa oogoe o agete sakebi, rappa o fuki, tsunobue o narashite, Shu ni chikai o tateta.
Yuda wa mina sono chikai o yorokonda. Karera wa kokoro o tsukushite chikai o tate, seishin o tsukushite Shu o motometa no de, Shu wa karera ni ai, shihou de karera ni ansoku o tamawatta.
Asa ou no haha Maaka ga Ashira no tame ni nikumubeki zou o tsukutta no de, Asa wa kanojo o otoshite taikou to sezu, sono nikumubeki zou o kiritaoshite konagona ni kudaki, Kideron kawa de sore o yaita.
Tadashi takaki tokoro wa Isuraeru kara nozokanakattaga, Asa no kokoro wa isshou no aida, tadashikatta.
Kare wa mata, sono chichi no sasageta mono oyobi jibun no sasageta mono, sunawachi gin, kin narabi ni utsuwamono nado o Shu no miya ni tazusae ireta.
Soshite Asa no chisei no sanjuu go nen made wa futatabi sensou ga nakatta.
Asa no chisei no sanjuu roku nen ni Isuraeru no ou Baasha wa Yuda ni semenobori, Yuda no ou Asa no tokoro ni dare o mo deiri sasenai tame ni Rama o kizuita.
Soko de Asa wa Shu no miya to ou no ie no houzou kara kingin o toridashi, Damasuko ni sunde iru Suriya no ou Benehadade ni okutte itta,
"Watashi no chichi to anata no chichi no aida no you ni, watashi to anata no aida ni doumei o musubimashou. Watashi wa anata ni kingin o okurimasu. Itte, anata to Isuraeru no ou Baasha to no doumei o yaburi, kare o watashi kara tettai sasete kudasai".
Benehadade wa Asa ou no iu koto o kiki, jibun no gunzei no choutachi o tsukawashite Isuraeru no machimachi o seme, Iyon to Dan to Aberu Maimu oyobi Nafutari no subete no kura no machi o utta.
Baasha wa kore o kiite, Rama o kizuku koto o yame, sono kouji o haishita.
Soko de Asa ou wa Yuda no zenkoku no hitobito o hikitsure, Baasha ga Rama o tateru tame ni mochiita ishi to mokuzai o hakonde kosase, sore o motte Geba to Mizupa o tateta.
Sono koro senkensha Hanani ga Yuda no ou Asa no moto ni kite itta, "Anata ga Suriya no ou ni yori tanonde, anata no kami, Shu ni yori tanomanakatta no de, Suriya ou no gunzei wa anata no te kara nogarete shimatta.
Kano Echiopiya bito to, Ribia bi to wa taigun de, sono sensha to kihei wa, hanahada ookattade wa nai ka. Shikashi anata ga Shu ni yori tanonda no de, Shu wa karera o anata no te ni watasareta.
Shu no me wa amaneku zenchi o iki meguri, jibun ni mukatte kokoro o mattou suru mono no tame ni chikara o arawasareru. Kondo no koto de wa, anata wa oroka na koto o shita. Yue ni kono nochi, anata ni sensou ga nozomude arou".
Suru to Asa wa sono senkensha o ikatte, gokuya ni ireta. Kono koto no tame ni hageshiku kare o ikattakara de aru. Asa wa mata sono korotami no aru mono o shi etageta.
Miyo, Asa no shijuu no koui wa, Yuda to Isuraeru no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Asa wa sono chisei no sanjuu kyuu nen ni ashi o yami, sono yamai wa hageshiku nattaga, sono yamai no toki ni mo, Shu o motomenaide isha o motometa.
Asa wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemuri, sono chisei no yonjuu ichi nen ni shinda.
Hitobito wa kare ga jibun no tame ni Dabide no machi ni hotte oita haka ni houmuri, sei kou no jutsu o motte tsukutta samazama no kouryou o mitashita toko ni yokotae, kare no tame ni obitadashiku kou o taita.
Asa no ko Yoshapate ga Asa ni kawatte ou to nari, Isuraeru ni mukatte jibun o tsuyoku shi,
Yuda no subete no kengo na machimachi ni guntai o oki, mata Yuda no chi oyobi sono chichi Asa ga totta Efuraimu no machimachi ni shubitai o oita.
Shu wa Yoshapate to tomo ni orareta. Kare ga sono chichi Dabide no saisho no michi ni ayunde, Baaru ni motomezu,
Sono chichi no kami ni motomete, sono imashime ni ayumi, Isuraeru no okonai ni narawanakattakara de aru.
Sore yue, Shu wa kuni o kare no te ni kataku taterare, mata Yuda no hitobito wa mina Yoshapate ni okurimono o motte kita. Kare wa ooinaru tomi to homare to o eta.
Soko de kare wa Shu no michi ni kokoro o hagemashi, sarani takaki tokoro to Ashira zou to o Yuda kara nozoita.
Kare wa mata sono chisei no san nen ni, tsukasatachi Benehairu, Obadeya, Zekariya, Netan'eru oyobi Mikaya o tsukawashite Yuda no machimachi de oshiesase,
Mata karera to tomo ni Rebi bito no uchi kara Shimaya, Netaniya, Zebadeya, Asaheru, Semiramote, Yonatan, Adoniya, Tobiya, Tobadoniya o tsukawashi, mata korera no Rebi bito to tomo ni saishi Erishama to Yoramu o mo tsukawashita.
Karera wa Shu no rippou no sho o tazusaete, Yuda de oshie o nashi, mata Yuda no machimachi o kotogotoku junkai shite, tami no aida ni oshie o nashita.
Soko de Yuda no shuui no kuniguni wa mina Shu o osore, Yoshapate to tatakau koto o shinakatta.
Mata, Perishite bito no uchi de okurimono ya, mitsugi no gin o Yoshapate no tokoro ni motte kuru mono ga ari, mata Arabiya bito wa ohitsuji nanasen nanahyakutou, o yagi nanasen nanahyakutou o kare ni motte kita.
Kou shite Yoshapate wa masumasu ooini nari, Yuda ni yougai oyobi kura no machi o tate,
Yuda no machimachi ni ooku no gunju hin o mochi, mata Erusaremu ni daiyuushi de aru gunjintachi o motte ita.
Karera o sono shizoku ni yotte kazoereba tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Yuda kara deta sennin no chou no uchi de wa, Adena to iu gunchou to kare ni shitagau daiyuushi sanjuu mannin,
Sono tsugi wa gunchou Yohanan to kare ni shitagau mono nijuu hachi mannin,
Sono tsugi wa yorokonde sono mi o Shu ni sasageta mono Jikuri no ko Amajiya to kare ni shitagau daiyuushi nijuu mannin.
Beniyamin kara deta mono no uchi de wa, Eriada to iu daiyuushi to kare ni shitagau yumi oyobi tate o motsu mono nijuu mannin,
Sono tsugi wa Yozabade to kare ni shitagau tatakai no sonae aru mono juu hachi mannin de aru.
Korera wa minaou ni tsukaeru monotachi de, kono hoka ni mata Yuda zenkoku no kengo na machimachi ni, ou ga chuuzai saseta mono ga atta.
Yoshapate wa ooinaru tomi to homare to o mochi, Ahabu to fuchi o musunda.
Kare wa suunen no nochi, Samariya ni kudatte, Ahabu o otozureta. Ahabu wa kare to kare ni shitagatte kita tami no tame ni hitsuji to ushi o ooku hofuri, ramote gireade ni issho ni semenoboru koto o kare ni susumeta.
Isuraeru no ou Ahabu wa Yuda no ou Yoshapate ni itta, "Anata wa watashi to issho ni ramote gireade ni semete ikimasu ka". Yoshapate wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa anata to hitotsu desu, watashi no tami wa anata no tami to hitotsu desu. Watashi wa anata to issho ni tatakai ni nozomimashou".
Yoshapate wa mata Isuraeru no ou ni itta, "Mazu Shu no kotoba o motome nasai".
Soko de Isuraeru no ou wa yogensha yonhyakunin o atsumete karera ni itta, "Wareware wa ramote gireade ni, tatakai ni ikubeki ka, aruiha hikaerubeki ka". Karera wa itta, "Nobotte iki nasai. Kami wa sore o ou no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Yoshapate wa itta, "Hoka ni wareware ga toubeki Shu no yogensha wa koko ni imasen ka".
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Hoka ni nao hitori imasu. Wareware wa kono hito ni yotte Shu ni tou koto ga dekimasuga, kare wa watashi ni tsuite yoi koto o yogen shita koto ga naku, tsune ni warui koto dake o yogen suru no de, watashi wa kare o nikumimasu. Sono mono wa Imura no ko Mikaya desu". Yoshapate wa itta, "Ou yo, sou wa iwanaide kudasai".
Soko de Isuraeru no ou wa hitori no yakunin o yonde, "Imura no ko Mikaya o isoide tsurete ki nasai" to itta.
Sate Isuraeru no ou oyobi Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa ou no koromo o kite, Samariya no mon no iriguchi no hiroba ni onoono sono gyokuza ni zashi, yogensha tachi wa mina sono mae de yogen shite ita.
Kenaana no ko Zedekiya wa tetsu no tsuno o tsukutte itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anata wa korera no tsuno o motte Suriya bito o tsuite horoboshi tsukushi nasai' ".
Yogensha tachi wa mina sono you ni yogen shite itta, "Ramote gireade ni nobotte itte shouri o e nasai. Shu wa sore o ou no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Sate Mikaya o yobi ni itta shisha wa kare ni itta, "Yogensha tachi wa itchi shite ou ni yoi koto o iimashita. Douzo, anata no kotoba mo, karera no hitori no kotoba no you ni shi, yoi koto o itte kudasai".
Mikaya wa itta, "Shu wa ikite orareru. Waga kami no iwareru koto o watashi wa moushimasu".
Kare ga ou no tokoro e ikuto, ou wa kare ni itta, "Mikaya yo, wareware wa ramote gireade ni tatakai ni ikubeki ka, aruiha hikaerubeki ka". Kare wa itta, "Nobotte itte shouri o e nasai. Karera wa anata no te ni watasarerudeshou".
Shikashi ou wa kare ni itta, "Iku tabi anata o chikawasetara, anata wa Shu no na o motte, tada shinjitsu nomi o watashi ni tsugerudarou ka".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa Isuraeru ga minabokusha no nai hitsuji no you ni yama ni chitte iru no o mimashita. Suru to Shu wa 'Korera no mono wa shujin o motte inai. Karera o sorezore yasuraka ni, sono ie ni kaerase yo' to iwaremashita".
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Watashi wa anata ni, kare wa watashi ni tsuite yoi koto o yogen sezu, tada warui koto dake o yogen suru to tsugeta de wa arimasen ka".
Mikaya wa itta, "Sore dakara Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Watashi wa Shu ga sono gyokuza ni zashi, ten no bangun ga sono migihidari ni tatte iru no o mitaga,
Shu wa, 'Dare ga Isuraeru no ou Ahabu o izanatte, ramote gireade ni noborase, kare o taoresaserude arou ka' to iwareta. Suruto hitori wa, kou shiyou to ii, hitori wa, aa shiyou to itta.
Sono toki hitotsu no rei ga susumidete, Shu no mae ni tachi, 'Watashi ga kare o izanaimashou' to itta no de, Shu wa kare ni 'Nani o motte suru ka' to iwareta.
Kare wa 'Watashi ga dete itte, itsuwari o iu rei to natte, subete no yogensha no kuchi ni yadorimashou' to itta. Soko de Shu wa 'Omae wa kare o izanatte, sore o nashitogerude arou. Dete itte, sou shi nasai' to iwareta.
Sore yue, Shu wa itsuwari o iu rei o kono yogensha tachi no kuchi ni ire, mata Shu wa anata ni tsuite wazawai o tsugerareta no desu".
Suruto Kenaana no ko Zedekiya ga chikayotte Mikaya no hoo o utte itta, "Shu no rei ga dono michi kara watashi o hanarete itte, anata ni katarimashita ka".
Mikaya wa itta, "Anata ga oku no aida ni haitte mi o kakusu hi ni mirudeshou".
Isuraeru no ou wa itta, "Mikaya o torae, machi no tsukasa Amon to ou no ko Yoashi no tokoro e hiite itte,
Ii nasai, 'Ou wa kou iu, kono mono o gokuya ni ire, sukoshi bakari no pan to mizu o motte kare o yashinai, watashi ga shouri o ete kaette kuru no o mate' to".
Mikaya wa itta, "Anata ga moshi shouri o ete kaerunaraba, Shu wa watashi ni yotte katararenakatta no desu". Mata kare wa itta, "Anata gata subete no tami yo, kiki nasai".
Kou shite Isuraeru no ou to Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa, ramote gireade ni nobotta.
Isuraeru no ou wa Yoshapate ni itta, "Watashi wa sugata o kaete tatakai ni ikimashou. Shikashi anata wa ou no koromo o tsuke nasai". Isuraeru no ou wa sugata o kaete tatakai ni itta.
Sate, Suriya no ou wa, sono senshataichou tachi ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa chiisai monotomo, ookii mono to mo tatakatte wa naranai. Tada Isuraeru no ou to nomi tatakai nasai".
Senshataichou ra wa Yoshapate o mita toki, kore wa kitto Isuraeru no ou da to omotta no de, mi o megurashite kore to tatakaou to shita. Shikashi Yoshapate ga yobawatta no de, Shu wa kore o tasukerareta. Sunawachi kami wa teki o kare kara hanaresaserareta.
Senshataichou ra wa kare ga Isuraeru no ou de nai no o mita no de, kare o ou koto o yamete hikikaeshita.
Shikashi, hitori no hito ga, nanigokoro naku yumi o hiite, Isuraeru no ou no muneate to,kusa zuri no aida o ita no de, kare wa sono kuruma no gyosha ni itta, "Watashi wa kizu o uketakara, kuruma o megurashite, watashi o gunchuu kara hakobidase".
Sono hi tatakai wa hageshiku natta. Isuraeru no ou wa kuruma no naka ni jibun o sasaete tachi, yuugure made Suriya bito ni mukatte itaga, hi no iru koro ni natte shinda.
Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa, tsutsuganaku Erusaremu no jibun no ie ni kaetta.
Sono toki, senkensha Hanani no ko Ehiu ga dete Yoshapate o mukaete itta, "Anata wa akunin o tasuke, Shu o nikumu mono o aishite yoi no desu ka. Sore yue ikari ga Shu no mae kara dete, anata no ue ni nozomimasu.
Shikashi anata ni wa, nao yoi koto mo arimasu. Anata wa Ashira zou o kuni no naka kara nozoki, kokoro o katamukete kami o motomeraremashita".
Yoshapate wa Erusaremu ni sunde itaga, mata dete, Beerushiba kara Efuraimu no sanchi made tami no naka o meguri, senzotachi no kami, Shu ni karera o michibiki kaeshita.
Kare wa mata Yuda no kunijyuu, subete no kengo na machigoto ni saibannin o oita.
Soshite saibannin tachi ni itta, "Anata gata wa jibun no suru koto ni ki o tsuke nasai. Anata gata wa hito no tame ni saiban suru no de wa naku, Shu no tame ni suru no desu. Anata gata ga saiban suru toki ni wa, Shu wa anata gata to tomo ni oraremasu.
Dakara anata gata wa Shu o osore, tsutsushinde okonai nasai. Wareware no kami, Shu ni wa fugi ga naku, hito o katayori miru koto naku, mainai o toru koto mo naikara desu".
Yoshapate wa mata Rebi bi to, saishi, oyobi Isuraeru no shizoku no choutachi o erande Erusaremu ni oki, Shu no tame ni saiban o okonai, sougi no kaiketsu ni ataraseta. Karera wa Erusaremu ni kyojuu shita.
Yoshapate wa karera ni meijite itta, "Anata gata wa Shu o osore, shinjitsu to magokoro to o motte okonawanakereba naranai.
Subete sono machimachi ni sunde iru anata gata no kyoudaitachi kara, chi o nagashita koto mata wa rippou to imashime, sadame to okite nado no koto ni tsuite uttaete kitanaraba, karera o satoshite, Shu no mae ni tsumi o okasasezu, ikari ga anata gata to, anata gata no kyoudaitachi ni nozomanai you ni shi nasai. Sono you ni sureba, anata gata wa tsumi o okasu koto ga naideshou.
Miyo, saishi chou Amariya wa, anata gata no ue ni ite, Shu no koto o subete tsukasadori, Ishimaeru no ko, Yuda no ie no tsukasa Zebadeya wa ou no koto o subete tsukasadori, mata Rebi bi to wa anata gata no mae ni atte yakunin to narimasu. Ooshiku koudou shi nasai. Shu wa shoujiki na hito to tomo ni oraremasu".
Kono nochi Moabu bi to, Anmon bito oyobi Meuni bitora ga Yoshapate to tatakaou to semete kita.
Sono toki aru hito ga kite, Yoshapate ni tsugete itta, "Umi no kanata no Edomu kara taigun ga anata ni semete kimasu. Miyo, karera wa hazazon tamaru (sunawachi Engede) ni imasu".
Soko de Yoshapate wa osore, Shu ni kao o mukete tasuke o motome, Yuda zenkoku ni danjiki o furesaseta.
Sore de Yuda wa kozotte atsumari, Shu no tasuke o motometa. Sunawachi Yuda no subete no machi kara hitobito ga kite Shu o motometa.
Soko de Yoshapate wa Shu no miya no atarashii niwa no mae de, Yuda to Erusaremu no kaishuu no naka ni tatte,
Itta, "Wareware no senzo no kami, Shu yo, anata wa ten ni imasu kami de wa arimasen ka. Ihoujin no subete no kuni o osamerarerude wa arimasen ka. Anata no te ni wa chikara ga ari, ikioi ga atte, anata ni sakarai uru mono wa arimasen.
Wareware no kami yo, anata wa kono kuni no tami o anata no tami Isuraeru no mae kara oiharatte, anata no tomo Aburahamu no shison ni, kore o eien ni ataeraretade wa arimasen ka.
Karera wa koko ni sumi, anata no na no tame ni koko ni seijo o tatete iimashita,
'Tsurugi, shinpan, ekibyou, kikin nado no wazawai ga wareware ni nozomu toki, wareware wa kono miya no mae ni tatte, anata no mae ni ori, sono nayami no naka de anata ni yobawarimasu. Suruto, anata wa kiite tasukeraremasu. Anata no na wa kono miya ni arukara desu' to.
Ima Anmon, Moabu, oyobi Seiruyama no hitobito o goran nasai. Mukashi Isuraeru ga Ejiputo no kuni kara dete kita toki, anata wa Isuraeru ni karera o okasu koto o yurusarenakatta no de, Isuraeru wa karera o hanarete, horoboshimasendeshita.
Karera ga wareware ni mukuiru tokoro o goran kudasai. Karera wa kite, anata ga wareware ni tamawatta anata no ryouchi kara wareware o oiharaou to shite imasu.
Wareware no kami yo, anata wa karera o sabakarenai no desu ka. Wareware wa kono you ni semete kuru taigun ni ataru chikara ga naku, mata ikani nasubeki ka o shirimasen. Tada, anata o aogi nozomu nomi desu".
Yuda no hitobito wa sono osanako, sono tsuma, oyobi kodomotachi to tomo ni mina Shu no mae ni tatte ita.
Sono toki Shu no rei ga kaishuu no naka de Asafu no shison de aru Rebi bito Yahajieru ni nozonda. Yahajieru wa Zekariya no ko, Zekariya wa Benaya no ko, Benaya wa Eieru no ko, Eieru wa MaTtaniya no ko de aru.
Yahajieru wa itta, "Yuda no hitobito, Erusaremu no juumin, oyobi Yoshapate ou yo, kiki nasai. Shu wa anata gata ni kou ooserareru, 'Kono taigun no tame ni osorete wa naranai. Ononoite wa naranai. Kore wa anata gata no tatakai de wa naku, Shu no tatakai dakara de aru.
Asu, karera no tokoro e semekudari nasai. Miyo, karera wa Jizu no saka kara nobotte kuru. Anata gata wa Erueru no no no higashi, tani no tan de kore ni aude arou.
Kono tatakai ni wa, anata gata wa tatakau ni oyobanai. Yuda oyobi Erusaremu yo, anata gata wa susumidete tachi, anata gata to tomo ni orareru Shu no shouri o mi nasai. Osorete wa naranai. Ononoite wa naranai. Asu, karera no tokoro ni semete iki nasai. Shu wa anata gata to tomo ni orarerukara de aru' ".
Yoshapate wa chi ni hirefushita. Yuda no hitobito oyobi Erusaremu no tami mo Shu no mae ni fushite, Shu o haishita.
Sono toki Kohate bito no shison, oyobi Kora bito no shison de aru Rebi bito ga tachiagari, oogoe o agete Isuraeru no kami, Shu osan bi shita.
Karera wa asa hayaku okite Tekoa no no ni dete itta. Sono dete iku toki, Yoshapate wa tatte itta, "Yuda no hitobito oyobi Erusaremu no tami yo, watashi ni kiki nasai. Anata gata no kami, Shu o shinji nasai. Sou sureba anata gata wa kataku tatsu koto ga dekiru. Shu no yogensha o shinji nasai. Sou sureba anata gata wa seikou surudeshou".
Kare wa mata tami to soudan shite hitobito o ninmei shi, sei naru kazari o tsukete gunzei no mae ni susumase, Shu ni mukatte uta o utai, katsusan bi sase, "Shu ni kansha seyo, sono itsukushimi wa tokoshie ni taeru koto ga nai" to iwaseta.
Soshite karera ga uta o utai,san bi shi hajimeta toki, Shu wa fukuhei o mouke, kano Yuda ni semete kita Anmon, Moabu, Seiruyama no hitobito ni mukawaserareta no de, karera wa uchi yaburareta.
Sunawachi Anmon to Moabu no hitobito wa tachiagatte, Seiruyama no tami ni tekishi, karera o koroshite mattaku horoboshitaga, Seiru no tami o koroshi tsukusu ni oyonde, karera mo onoono tagai ni tasukete horoboshi atta.
Yuda no hitobito wa no no monomi yagura e itte, kano gunshuu o mitaga, chi ni taoreta shitai dake de atte, hitori mo nogareta mono wa nakatta.
Sore de Yoshapate to sono tami wa karera no mono o ubau tame ni kite miruto, tasuu no kachiku, zaihou, ifuku oyobi houseki nado obitadashiku atta no de, onoono sore o hagitottaga, hakobi kirenai hodo takusan de, kasumetoru ni mikka mo kakatta. Sore hodo mono ga ookatta no de aru.
Yonkame ni karera wa Beraka no tani ni atsumari, sono tokoro de Shu o shukufuku shita. Sore de sono tokoro no na o konnichi made Beraka no tani to yonde iru.
Soshite Yuda to Erusaremu no hitobito wa mina Yoshapate o saki ni tate, yorokonde Erusaremu ni kaette kita. Shu ga karera ni sono teki no koto ni yotte yorokobi o ataeraretakara de aru.
Sunawachi karera wa tategoto, koto oyobi rappa o motte Erusaremu no Shu no miya ni kita.
Soshite moromoro no kuni no tami wa Shu ga Isuraeru no teki to tatakawareta koto o kiite kami o osoreta.
Kou shite kami ga shihou ni ansoku o tamawatta no de, Yoshapate no kuni wa odayaka de atta.
Kono you ni Yoshapate wa Yuda o osameta. Kare wa sanjuu gosai no toki, ou to nari, nijuu go nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Kare no haha no na wa Azuba to itte Shiruhi no musume de aru.
Yoshapate wa chichi Asa no michi o ayunde sore o hanarezu, Shu no me ni tadashii to mirareru koto o okonatta.
Shikashi takaki tokoro wa nozokazu, mata tami wa sono senzo no kami ni kokoro o katamukenakatta.
Yoshapate no sono ta no shijuu no koui wa, Hanani no ko Ehiu no sho ni shirusare, Isuraeru no retsuou no sho ni noserarete aru.
Kono nochi Yuda no ou Yoshapate wa Isuraeru no ou Ahajiya to aimusunda. Ahajiya wa aku o okonatta.
Yoshapate wa Tarushishi e iku fune o tsukuru tame ni Ahajiya to aimusubi, ejion geberu de issho ni funesuuseki o tsukutta.
Sono toki Maresha no Dodawa no ko Eriezeru wa Yoshapate ni mukatte yogen shi, "Anata wa Ahajiya to aimusunda no de, Shu wa anata no tsukutta mono o kowasaremasu" to ittaga, sono fune wa nanpa shite, Tarushishi e iku koto ga dekinakatta.
Yoshapate wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemuri, senzotachi to tomo ni Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Yoramu ga kawatte ou to natta.
Yoshapate no ko de aru sono kyoudaitachi wa Azariya, Ehieru, Zekariya, Azariya, Mikaeru oyobi Shipateya de, mina Yuda no ou Yoshapate no kotachi de atta.
Sono chichi wa karera ni kin, gin, houmotsu no tamamono o ooku atae, mata Yuda no yougai no machimachi o ataetaga, Yoramu wa choushi na no de, kuni wa Yoramu ni ataeta.
Yoramu wa sono chichi no kurai ni nobotte tsuyoku natta toki, sono kyoudaitachi o kotogotoku tsurugi ni kakete koroshi, mata Yuda no tsukasatachi suunin o koroshita.
Yoramu wa kurai ni tsuita toki sanjuu nisai de, Erusaremu de hachi nen no aidayo o osameta.
Kare wa Ahabu no ie ga shita you ni Isuraeru no outachi no michi ni ayunda. Ahabu no musume o tsuma to shitakara de aru. Kono you ni kare wa Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonattaga,
Shu wa saki ni Dabide to musubareta keiyaku no yue ni, mata kare to sono shison to ni nagaku, tomoshibi o ataeru to yakusoku sareta koto ni yotte, Dabide no ie o horobosu koto o konomarenakatta.
Yoramu no yo ni Edomu ga somuite, Yuda no shihai o dasshi, mizukara ou o tateta no de,
Yoramu wa sono shoukoutachi, oyobi subete no sensha o shitagaete watatte iki, yoru no uchi ni tachiagatte, jibun o houi shite iru Edomu bito to sono sensha no taichoutachi o utta.
Edomu wa kono you ni somuite Yuda no shihai o dasshi, konnichi ni itatte iru. Sono koro Ribuna mo mata somuite Yuda no shihai o dasshita. Yoramu ga senzotachi no kami, Shu o sutetakara de aru.
Kare wa mata Yuda no sanchi ni takaki tokoro o tsukutte, Erusaremu no tami ni kan'in o okonawase, Yuda o madowashita.
Sono toki yogensha Eriya kara tsugi no you na ichitsuu no tegami ga Yoramu no moto ni kita, "Anata no senzo Dabide no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata wa chichi Yoshapate no michi ni ayumazu, mata Yuda no ou Asa no michi ni ayumanaide,
Isuraeru no outachi no michi ni ayumi, Yuda to Erusaremu no tami ni, kano Ahabu no ie ga Isuraeru ni kan'in o okonawaseta you ni, kan'in o okonawase, mata anata no chichi no ie no mono de, anata ni masatte iru anata no kyoudaitachi o koroshita yue,
Shu wa ooinaru wazawai o motte anata no tami to kodomo to tsumatachi to, subete no shoyuu o utareru.
Anata wa mata naizou no byouki ni kakatte taibyou ni nari, sore ga hi ni hi ni omoku natte, tsuini naizou ga deru you ni naru' ".
Sono toki, Shu wa Yoramu ni taishite Echiopiya bito no chikaku ni sunde iru Perishite bito to Arabiya bito no rei o furiokosareta no de,
Karera wa Yuda ni semenobotte, kore o okashi, ou no ie ni aru kazai o kotogotoku ubaisari, mata Yoramu no kodomo to tsumatachi o mo ubaisatta no de, sue no ko Ehoahazu no hoka ni wa, hitori mo nokotta mono ga nakatta.
Kono moromoro no koto no nochi, Shu wa kare o utte naizou ni iegatai byouki o okosaserareta.
Toki ga tatte, ni nen no owari ni nari, sono naizou ga byouki no tame ni dete, omoi byouku ni yotte shinda. Tami wa kare no senzo no tame ni kou o taita you ni, kare no tame ni kou o takanakatta.
Yoramu wa sono kurai ni tsuita toki sanjuu nisai de, hachi nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osame, tsuini shinda. Hitori mo kare o oshimu mono ga nakatta. Hitobito wa kare o Dabide no machi ni houmuttaga, outachi no haka ni de wa nakatta.
Erusaremu no tami wa Yoramu no sue no ko Ahajiya o kare no kawari ni ou to shita. Katsute Arabiya bito to issho ni jin'ei ni semete kita ittai no mono ga ue no kotachi o kotogotoku koroshita no de, Yuda no ou Yoramu no ko Ahajiya ga ou to natta no de aru.
Ahajiya wa ou to natta toki yonjuu nisai de, Erusaremu de ichi nen no aidayo o osameta. Sono haha wa Omuri no musume de na o Atariya to itta.
Ahajiya mo mata Ahabu no ie no michi ni ayunda. Sono haha ga kare no soudan aite to natte aku o okonawasetakara de aru.
Kare wa mata Ahabu no ie ga shita you ni Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta. Sunawachi sono chichi ga shinda nochi, Ahabu no ie no mono ga sono soudan'yaku to natta no de, kare wa tsuini jibun o horobosu ni itatta.
Ahajiya wa mata karera no susume ni shitagatte, Isuraeru no ou Ahabu no ko Yoramu to tomo ni ramote gireade e iki, Suriya no ou Hazaeru to tatakattaga, Suriya bi to wa Yoramu ni kizu o owaseta.
Soko de Yoramu wa Suriya no ou Hazaeru to tatakatta toki, Rama de otta sono kizu o iyasu tame ni Ezureru ni kaetta. Yuda no ou Yoramu no ko Ahajiya wa Ahabu no ko Yoramu ga byouki na no de Ezureru ni kudatte kore o mimatta.
Ahajiya ga Yoramu o mimai ni itta koto ni yotte horobi ni itatta no wa kami ni yotte sadamerareta koto de aru. Sunawachi kare ga soko ni tsuita toki, Yoramu to issho ni dete, Nimushi no ko Ehiu o mukaeta. Ehiu wa Shu ga Ahabu no ie o tachi horobosu tame ni abura o sosogareta mono de aru.
Ehiu wa Ahabu no ie o bassuru ni atatte, Yuda no tsukasatachi, oyobi Ahajiya no kyoudaitachi no kora ga Ahajiya ni tsukaete iru no o mita no de, karera o mo koroshita.
Ahajiya wa Samariya ni kakurete itaga, Ehiu ga kare o sagashimotometa no de, hitobito wa kare o torae, Ehiu no moto ni hiite kite, kare o koroshita. Tadashi "Kare wa kokoro o tsukushite Shu o motometa Yoshapate no ko de aru" to hitobito wa itta no de kore o houmutta. Kou shite Ahajiya no ie ni wa kuni o subeosame uru mono ga nakunatta.
Ahajiya no haha Atariya wa jibun no ko no shinda no o mite, tatte Yuda no ie no ouji o kotogotoku horoboshitaga,
Ou no musume Ehoshiba wa Ahajiya no ko Yoashi o ou no kotachi no korosareru mono no uchi kara nusumitori, kare to sono uba o shinshitsu ni oita. Kou shite Ehoshiba ga Yoashi o Atariya kara kakushita no de, Atariya wa Yoashi o korosanakatta. Ehoshiba wa Yoramu ou no musume, mata Ahajiya no imouto de, saishi Ehoyada no tsuma de aru.
Kou shite Yoashi wa kami no miya ni kakurete karera to tomo ni oru koto roku nen, sono kan Atariya ga kuni o osameta.
Dainana nen ni natte, Ehoyada wa yuuki o dashite Erohamu no ko Azariya, Yohanan no ko Ishimaeru, Obede no ko Azariya, Adaya no ko Maaseya, Jikuri no ko Erishapate nado no hyakunin no choutachi o maneite keiyaku o musubaseta.
Soko de karera wa Yuda o iki megutte, Yuda no subete no machi kara Rebi bito o atsume, mata Isuraeru no shizoku no choutachi o atsumete, Erusaremu ni kita.
Soshite sono kaishuu wa minakami no miya de ou to keiyaku o musunda. Sono toki Ehoyada wa karera ni itta, "Shu ga Dabide no shison no koto ni tsuite iwareta you ni, ou no ko ga kurai ni tsukubeki desu.
Anata gata no nasubeki koto wa kore desu. Sunawachi anata gata saishi oyobi Rebi bito no ansokunichi ni haitte kuru mono no, sanbun no ichi wa mon o mamoru mono to nari,
Sanbun no ichi wa ou no ie ni ori, sanbun no ichi wa ishizue no mon ni ori, tami wa mina, Shu no miya no niwa ni i nasai.
Saishi to, tsutome o suru Rebi bito no hoka wa, dare mo Shu no miya ni, haitte wa naranai. Karera wa sei naru mono de arukara, hairu koto ga dekiru. Tami wa mina, Shu no meirei o mamoranakereba naranai.
Rebi bi to wa meimeite ni buki o totte ou no mawari ni tatanakereba naranai. Miya ni hairu mono o subete koroshi nasai. Anata gata wa ou ga hairu toki ni mo deru toki ni mo, ou to tomo ni i nasai".
Soko de Rebi bi to oyobi Yuda no hitobito wa, saishi Ehoyada ga subete meijita you ni okonai, meimei sono kumi no mono de, ansokunichi ni haitte kurubeki mono to, ansokunichi ni dete ikubeki mono o hikiite ita. Saishi Ehoyada ga kumi no mono o sarasenakattakara de aru.
Mata saishi Ehoyada wa, kami no miya ni aru Dabide ou no yari oyobi oodate, kodate o hyakunin no choutachi ni watashi,
Mata ou o mamoru tame ni, subete no tami ni meimeite ni buki o torase, miya no minamigawa kara kitagawa ni watatte, saidan to miya ni sotte tataseta.
Kou shite ou no ko o tsuredashite, kore ni kanmuri o itadakase, akashi no sho o watashite ou to nashi, Ehoyada oyobi sono kotachi ga kare ni abura o sosoida. Soshite "Ou banzai" to itta.
Atariya wa tami no hashirinagara ou o homeru koe o kiita no de, Shu no miya ni iri, tami no tokoro e itte,
Miruto, ou wa iriguchi de hashira no katawara ni tachi, ou no katawara ni wa shouguntachi to rappate ga tatte ori, mata kuni no tami wa mina yorokonde rappa o fuki, uta o utau mono wa gakki o motte sa n bi shite ita no de, Atariya wa koromo o saite "Hangyaku da, hangyaku da" to sakenda.
Sono toki Ehoyada wa gunzei o tousotsu suru hyakunin no choutachi o yobidashi, "Retsu no aida kara kanojo o tsuredase, kanojo ni shitagau mono o tsurugi de korose" to itta. Saishi ga kanojo o Shu no miya de koroshite wa naranai to ittakara de aru.
Soko de hitobito wa kanojo ni te o kake, ou no ie no uma no mon no iriguchi made tsurete iki, sono tokoro de kanojo o koroshita.
Ehoyada wa jibun to subete no tami to ou to no aida ni, karera wa mina, Shu no tami to naru to no keiyaku o musunda.
Soko de subete no tami wa Baaru no ie ni itte, sore o kowashi, sono saidan to sono zou to o uchikudaki, Baaru no saishi Mattan o saidan no mae de koroshita.
Ehoyada wa mata Shu no miya no shuei o, saishi to Rebi bito no shiki no moto ni oita. Kono Rebi bi to wa mukashi Dabide ga Moose no rippou ni shirusarete iru you ni, yorokobi to uta to o motte Shu ni hansai o sasageru tame ni, Shu no miya ni haichi shita mono de atte, ima sono Dabide no rei ni naratta mono de aru.
Kare wa mata Shu no miya no moromoro no mon ni mon'ei o oki, kegareta mono wa nani ni yotte kegareta mono de mo, hairasenai you ni shita.
Kou shite Ehoyada wa hyakunin no choutachi, kizokutachi, tami no tsukasatachi oyobi kuni no subete no tami o hikiite, Shu no miya kara ou o tsure kudari, ue no mon kara ou no ie ni susumi, ou o kuni no kurai ni tsukaseta.
Kuni no tami wa mina yorokonda. Machi wa Atariya ga tsurugi de korosareta nochi, odayaka de atta.
Yoashi wa kurai ni tsuita toki nanasai de, Erusaremu de yonjuu nen no aida, yo o osameta. Kare no haha wa Beerushiba kara deta mono de na o Jibia to itta.
Yoashi wa saishi Ehoyada no yo ni aru hi no aida wa tsune ni Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o okonatta.
Ehoyada wa kare no tame ni futari no tsuma o metori, kare ni danshi to joshi ga umareta.
Kono nochi Yoashi wa Shu no miya o shuuzen shiyou to kokorozashite,
Saishi to Rebi bito o atsumete itta, "Yuda no machimachi e itte, anata gata no kami no miya o nennen shuuzen suru shikin o subete no Isuraeru bito kara atsume nasai. Sono koto o isoide shi nasai". Tokoro ga Rebi bi to wa kore o isoide shinakatta.
Sore de ou wa kashira de aru Ehoyada o meshite itta, "Anata wa naze Rebi bito ni motomete, Shu no shimobe Moose ga akashi no makuya no tame ni Isuraeru no kaishuu ni kashita zeikin o Yuda to Erusaremu kara toritatesasenai no ka".
Kano warui onna Atariya no kora ga kami no miya ni shinnyuu shite Shu no miya no moromoro no hounoubutsu o tori, Baaru no tame ni mochiitakara de aru.
Soko de ou wa meijite ichiko no hako o tsukurase, kore o Shu no miya no mon no soto ni oki,
Yuda to Erusaremu ni furete, kami no shimobe Moose ga arano de Isuraeru ni kashita zeikin o Shu no tame ni motte kosaseta.
Subete no tsukasatachi oyobi subete no tami wa mina yorokonde sono zeikin o motte kite, sono hako ni nageireta no de, tsuini hako wa ippai ni natta.
Rebi bi to wa sono hako ni kin ga ooku aru no o mite, ou no yakunin no tokoro e motte ikuto, ou no shoki to saishichou no shitayaku to ga kite, sono hako o katamuke, kore o totte moto no tokoro ni kaeshita. Karera wa hibi kono you ni shite kin o obitadashiku atsumeta.
Ou to Ehoyada wa kore o Shu no miya no kouji o nasu mono ni watashi, ishiku oyobi mokkou o yatotte, Shu no miya o shuuzen sase, mata tekkou oyobi seidou kou o yatotte, Shu no miya o shuufuku saseta.
Koujintachi wa hataraita no de, shuufuku no kouji wa karera no te ni yotte hakadori, kami no miya o, moto no joutai ni fukushi, kore o kengo ni shita.
Sore o nashi owatta toki, amatta kin o ou to Ehoyada no mae ni motte kita no de, sore o motte Shu no miya no tame ni utsuwamono o tsukutta. Sunawachi tsutome no utsuwa, hansai no utsuwa, kou no sara, oyobi kingin no utsuwa o tsukutta. Ehoyada no yo ni aru hi no aida wa, taezu Shu no miya de hansai o sasageta.
Shikashi Ehoyada wa toshioi, hi ga michite shinda. Sono shinda toki wa hyaku sanjuusai de atta.
Hitobito wa kare o Dabide no machi de outachi no naka ni houmutta. Kare wa Isuraeru ni oite kami to sono miya to ni yoi koto o okonattakara de aru.
Ehoyada no shinda nochi, Yuda no tsukasatachi ga kite, uyauyashiku ou ni keii o arawashita. Ou wa karera ni kikishitagatta.
Karera wa sono senzo no kami, Shu no miya o sutete, Ashira zou oyobi guuzou ni tsukaeta no de, sono toga no tame ni, ikari ga Yuda to Erusaremu ni nozonda.
Shu wa karera o gojibun ni hikikaesou to shite, yogensha tachi o tsukawashi, karera ni mukatte akashi o saseraretaga, mimi o katamukenakatta.
Soko de kami no rei ga saishi Ehoyada no ko Zekariya ni nozonda no de, kare wa tami no mae ni tachiagatte itta, "Kami wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata ga Shu no imashime o okashite, wazawai o maneku no wa dou iu wake de aru ka. Anata gata ga Shu o suteta tame ni, Shu mo anatagata o suterareta no de aru' ".
Shikashi hitobito wa kare o gaishiyou to hakari, ou no inochi ni yotte, ishi o motte kare o Shu no miya no niwa de uchikoroshita.
Kono you ni Yoashi ou wa Zekariya no chichi Ehoyada ga jibun ni hodokoshita megumi o omowazu, sono ko o koroshita. Zekariya wa shinu toki, "Douzo Shu ga kore o miso nawa shite basserareru you ni" to itta.
Nen no owari ni natte, Suriya no gunzei wa Yoashi ni mukatte semenobori, Yuda to Erusaremu ni kite, tami no tsukasatachi o kotogotoku tami no uchi kara horoboshi, sono bundori mono o mina Damasuko no ou ni okutta.
Kono toki Suriya no gunzei wa shousuu de kita no de aruga, Shu wa taigun o karera no te ni watasareta. Kore wa karera ga sono senzo no kami, Shu o suteta tame de aru. Kono you ni karera wa Yoashi o basshita.
Suriya gun wa Yoashi ni daikizu o owasete sutesattaga, Yoashi no keraitachi wa saishi Ehoyada no ko no chi no tame ni, tou o musunde kare ni somuki, kare o toko no ue ni koroshite, shinaseta. Hitobito wa kare o Dabide no machi ni houmuttaga, ou no haka ni wa houmuranakatta.
Tou o musunde kare ni somuita mono wa, Anmon no onna Shimeate no ko Zabade oyobi Moabu no onna Shimurite no ko Yozabade de atta.
Yoashi no kora no koto, Yoashi ni taisuru ooku no yogen oyobi kami no miya no shuuri no koto nado wa, retsuou no sho no chuushaku ni shirusarete iru. Yoashi no ko Amajiya ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Amajiya wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, nijuu kyuu nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Erusaremu no mono de, na o Ehoadan to itta.
Amajiya wa Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o okonattaga, mattaki kokoro o motte de wa nakatta.
Kare wa, kuni ga kare no te no uchi ni tsuyoku natta toki, chichi Yoashi ou o satsugai shita keraitachi o koroshita.
Shikashi sono kotomotachi wa korosanakatta. Kore wa Moose no rippou no sho ni shirusarete iru tokoro ni shitagatta no de atte, soko ni Shu wa meijite, "Chichi wa ko no yue ni korosarerubekide wa nai. Ko wa chichi no yue ni korosarerubekide wa nai. Onoono jibun no tsumi no yue ni korosarerubekide aru" to iwarete iru.
Amajiya wa Yuda no hitobito o atsume, sono shizoku ni shitagatte, sennin no chou ni fuzoku sase, mata wa hyakunin no chou ni fuzoku saseta. Yuda to Beniyamin no subete ni itta. Soshite nijuusai ijou no mono o kazoeta tokoro, yari to tate o totte tatakai ni nozomi uru seihei sanjuu mannin o eta.
Kare wa mata gin hyaku taranto o motte Isuraeru kara daiyuushi juu mannin o yatotta.
Sono toki, kami no hito ga kare no tokoro ni kite itta, "Ou yo, Isuraeru no gunzei o anata to tomo ni ikasete wa ikemasen. Shu wa Isuraeru bi to, sunawachi Efuraimu no subete no hitobito to wa tomo ni orarenaikara desu.
Moshi anata ga kono you na houhou de tatakai ni tsuyoku narou to omounaraba, kami wa anata o teki no mae ni taosarerudeshou. Kami ni wa tasukeru chikara ga ari, mata taosu chikara ga arukara desu".
Amajiya wa kami no hito ni itta, "Sore de wa watashi ga Isuraeru no guntai ni ataeta hyaku taranto o dou shimashou ka". Kami no hito wa kotaeta, "Shu wa sore yori mo ooi mono o anata ni oatae ni naru koto ga dekimasu".
Soko de Amajiya wa Efuraimu kara kite jibun ni kuwawatta guntai o bunri shite kaeraseta no de, karera wa Yuda ni taishite hageshii ikari o hasshi, hi no you ni ikatte jibun no tokoro ni kaetta.
Shikashi Amajiya wa yuuki o dashi, sono tami o hikiite shio no tani e iki, Seiru bito ichi mannin o uchikoroshita.
Mata Yuda no hitobito wa kono hoka ni ichi mannin o ikedori, iwa no itadaki ni hiite itte iwa no itadaki kara karera o nageotoshita no de, mina konagona ni kudaketa.
Tokoro ga Amajiya ga jibun to tomo ni tatakai ni ikasenaide kishite yatta heisotsura ga, Samariya kara Betehoron made no, Yuda no machimachi o osotte sanzennin o koroshi, ooku no mono o ubaitotta.
Amajiya wa Edomu bito o koroshite kaetta toki, Seiru bito no kamigami o tazusaete kite, kore o anchi shite jibun no kami to shi, kore o reihai shi, kore ni sasagemono o nashita.
Sore yue, Shu wa Amajiya ni mukatte ikari o hasshi, yogensha o kare ni tsukawashite iwaserareta, "Kano tami no kamigami wa jibun no tami o anata no te kara sukuu koto ga dekinakatta no ni, anata wa dou shite sore o motometa no ka".
Kare ga kou ou ni kataruto, ou wa kare ni, "Wareware wa anata o ou no komon ni shita no desu ka. Yame nasai. Anata wa dou shite korosareyou to suru no desu ka" to itta no de, yogensha wa yamete itta, "Anata wa kono koto o itte, watashi no isame o kikiirenai yue, kami wa anata o horobosou to sadamerareta koto o watashi wa shitte imasu".
Soko de Yuda no ou Amajiya wa kyougi no kekka, hito o Ehiu no ko Ehoahazu no ko de aru Isuraeru no ou Yoashi ni tsukawashi, "Saa, wareware wa tagai ni kao o awaseyou" to iwaseta tokoro,
Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa Yuda no ou Amajiya ni iiokutta, "Rebanon no ibara ga, katsute Rebanon no kouhaku ni, 'Anata no musume o watashi no musuko no tsuma ni ataeyo' to iiokutta tokoro ga, Rebanon no yajuu ga toorikakatte, sono ibara o fumitaoshita.
Anata wa 'Miyo, watashi wa Edomu o uchiyabutta' to itte kokoro ni hokori takabutte iru. Shikashi anata wa jibun no ie ni todomatte i nasai. Dou shite anata wa wazawai o hikiokoshite, jibun mo Yuda mo tomo ni horobiyou to suru no ka".
Shikashi Amajiya wa kikiirenakatta. Kore wa kami kara deta no de atte, karera ga Edomu no kamigami o motometa no de kami wa karera o teki no te ni watasareru tame de aru.
Soko de Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa nobotte kite, Yuda no Beteshimeshi de Yuda no ou Amajiya to kao o awasetaga,
Yuda wa Isuraeru ni uchiyaburare, onoono sono tenmaku ni nigekaetta.
Sono toki Isuraeru no ou Yoashi wa Ehoahazu no ko Yoashi no ko de aru Yuda no ou Amajiya o Beteshimeshi de toraete, Erusaremu ni hiite iki, Erusaremu no jouheki o Efuraimu mon kara, sumi no mon made yonhyaku kyubito hodo o kowashi,
Mata kami no miya no uchi de, Obedeedomu ga mamotte ita subete no kingin oyobi moromoro no utsuwamono narabi ni ou no ie no zaihou o ubai, mata hitojichi o totte, Samariya ni kaetta.
Yuda no ou Yoashi no ko Amajiya wa Isuraeru no ou Ehoahazu no ko Yoashi ga shinde nochi nao juu go nen ikinagaraeta.
Amajiya no sono ta no shijuu no koui wa, Yuda to Isuraeru no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete irude wa nai ka.
Amajiya ga somuite, Shu ni shitagawanaku natta toki kara, hitobito wa Erusaremu ni oite tou o musubi, kare ni tekishita no de, kare wa Rakishi ni nigete ittaga, sono hitobito wa Rakishi ni hito o yatte, kare o sono tokoro de korosaseta.
Hitobito wa kore o uma ni owasete motte kite, Yuda no machi de sono senzotachi to tomo ni kore o houmutta.
Soko de Yuda no tami wa mina Ujiya o totte ou to nashi, sono chichi Amajiya ni kawaraseta. Toki ni juu rokusai de atta.
Kare wa Erate o tatete, kore o futatabi Yuda no mono ni shita. Kore wa kano ou ga sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta nochi de atta.
Ujiya wa ou to natta toki juu rokusai de, Erusaremu de gojuu ni nen no aidayo o osameta. Sono haha wa Erusaremu no mono de na o Ekoriya to itta.
Ujiya wa chichi Amajiya ga shita you ni, subete Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o okonatta.
Kare wa kami o osoreru koto o jibun ni oshieta Zekariya no yo ni aru hi no aida, kami o motomeru koto ni tsutometa. Kare ga Shu o motometa aida, kami wa kare o sakaesaserareta.
Kare wa dete Perishite bito to tatakai, Gate no jouheki, Yabune no jouheki oyobi Ashidodo no jouheki o kuzushi, Ashidodo no chi to Perishite bito no naka ni machi o tateta.
Kami wa kare o tasukete Perishite bito to, Gurubaaru ni sumu Arabiya bito oyobi Meuni bito o seme utaserareta.
Anmon bi to wa Ujiya ni mitsugi o osameta. Ujiya wa hijou ni tsuyoku natta no de, sono na wa Ejiputo no iriguchi made mo hiromatta.
Ujiya wa mata Erusaremu no sumi no mon, tani no mon oyobi jouheki no magarikado ni yagura o tatete, kore o kengo ni shita.
Kare wa mata arano ni yagura o tate, mata ooku no mizu tame o hotta. Kare wa heiya ni mo heichi ni mo takusan no kachiku o motte itakara de aru. Kare wa mata nouji o kononda no de, yamayama oyobi koeta hatake ni wa noufu to budou o tsukuru mono o motte ita.
Ujiya wa mata yoku tatakau ichi gundan o motte ita. Karera wa shoki Eieru to, tsukasa Maaseya ni yotte shirabeta kazu ni shitagatte kumigumi ni wakare, minaou no gunchou no hitori Hananiya no shikishita ni atta.
Sono shizoku no chou de aru daiyuushi no kazu wa awasete nisen roppyakunin de atta.
Sono shikishita ni aru gunzei wa sanjuu man nanasen gohyakunin de, mina ooinaru chikara o motte tatakai, ou o tasukete teki ni atatta.
Ujiya wa sono zengun no tame ni tate, yari, kabu to, yoroi, yumi oyobi ishinage no ishi o sonaeta.
Kare wa mata Erusaremu de gijutsumono no kouan shita kikai o tsukutte, kore o yagura oyobi jouheki no sumizumi ni sue, kore o motte ya oyobi ooishi o shashutsushita. Kou shite kare no meisei wa tooku made hiromatta. Kare ga odoroku hodo kami no tasuke o ete tsuyoku nattakara de aru.
Tokoro ga kare wa tsuyoku naru ni oyonde, sono kokoro ni takaburi, tsuini jibun o horobosu ni itatta. Sunawachi kare wa sono kami, Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, Shu no miya ni haitte kou no saidan no ue ni kou o takou to shita.
Sono toki, saishi Azariya wa Shu no saishi de aru yuushi hachijuunin o hikiite, kare no ato ni shitagatte hairi,
Ujiya ou o hikitomete itta, "Ujiya yo, Shu ni kou o taku koto wa anata no nasubeki koto de wa naku, tada Aron no shison de, kou o taku tame ni kiyomerareta saishitachi no suru koto desu. Sugu seijo kara de nasai. Anata wa tsumi o okashimashita. Anata wa Shu naru kami kara sakae o eru koto wa dekimasen".
Suru to Ujiya wa ikari o hasshi, kouro o te ni totte kou o takou to shitaga, kare ga saishi ni mukatte ikari o hasshite iru aida ni, raibyou ga sono hitai ni tatta. Toki ni kare wa Shu no miya de saishitachi no mae, kou no saidan no katawara ni ita.
Saishi no chou Azariya oyobi subete no saishitachi ga kare o miruto, kare no hitai ni raibyou ga shoujite ita no de, isoide kare o soko kara oidashita. Kare jishin mo mata Shu ni utareta koto o shitte, isoide dete itta.
Ujiya ou wa, shinu hi made raibyounin de atta. Kare wa raibyounin de atta no de, hanaredono ni sunda. Shu no miya kara tataretakara de aru. Sono ko Yotamu ga ou no ie o tsukasadori, kuni no tami o osameta.
Ujiya no sono ta no shijuu no koui wa, Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya ga kore o kakishirushita.
Ujiya wa senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, hitobito wa "Kare wa raibyounin de aru" to itte, outachi no haka ni tsuranaru bochi ni, sono senzotachi to tomo ni houmutta. Sono ko Yotamu ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Yotamu wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, juu roku nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Zadoku no musume de na o Erusha to itta.
Yotamu wa sono chichi Ujiya ga shita you ni Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o shita. Shikashi Shu no miya ni wa, hairanakatta. Tami wa nao aku o okonatta.
Kare wa Shu no miya no ue no mon o tate, Operu no ishigaki o ooku kizuki mashi,
Mata Yuda no sanchi ni suuko no machi o tate, hayashi no aida ni shiro to yagura o kizuita.
Kare wa Anmon bito no ou to tatakatte kore ni katta. Sono nen Anmon no hitobito wa gin hyaku taranto, komugi ichi man koru, oomugi ichi man koru o kare ni okutta. Anmon no hitobito wa daini nen ni mo daisan nen ni mo onaji you ni kare ni osameta.
Yotamu wa sono kami, Shu no mae ni sono okonai o kataku shita no de chikara aru mono to natta.
Yotamu no sono ta no koui, sono subete no tatakai oyobi sono okonai nado wa, Isuraeru to Yuda no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Kare wa ou to natta toki, nijuu gosai de, juu roku nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta.
Yotamu wa sono senzo to tomo ni nemutta no de, Dabide no machi ni houmurare, sono ko Ahazu ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Ahazu wa ou to natta toki hatachi de, juu roku nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osametaga, sono chichi Dabide to wa chigatte, Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o okonawazu,
Isuraeru no outachi no michi ni ayumi, mata moromoro no Baaru no tame ni ita zou o tsukuri,
Benhinnomu no tani de kou o taki, sono kora o hi ni yaite sonaemono to suru nado, Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta ihoujin no nikumubeki okonai ni narai,
Mata takaki tokoro no ue, oka no ue, subete no aoki no shita de gisei o sasage, kou o taita.
Sore yue, sono kami, Shu wa kare o Suriya no ou no te ni watasareta no de, Suriya bi to wa kare o uchiyaburi, sono tami o ooku horyo to shite, Damasuko ni hiite itta. Kare wa mata Isuraeru no ou no te ni mo watasareta no de, Isuraeru no ou mo kare o uchiyabutte ooini koroshita.
Sunawachi Remariya no ko Peka wa Yuda de ichi nichi no uchi ni juu ni mannin o koroshita. Minayuushi de atta. Kore wa karera ga sono senzo no kami, Shu o suteta tame de aru.
Sono toki, Efuraimu no yuushi Jikuri to iu mono ga ou no ko Maaseya, kunai daijin Azurikamu oyobi ou ni tsugu hito Erukana o koroshita.
Isuraeru no hitobito wa tsuini sono kyoudai no uchi kara fujin narabi ni danshi, joshi nado nijuu mannin o horyo ni shi, mata ooku no bundori mono o tori, sono bundori mono o Samariya ni motte itta.
Sono toki soko ni na o Odede to iu Shu no yogensha ga atte, Samariya ni kaette kita gunzei no mae ni susumidete itta, "Miyo, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu wa Yuda o ikatte, kore o anata gata no te ni watasaretaga, anata gata wa ten ni tassuru hodo no ikari o motte kore o koroshita.
Sore bakari de naku, anata gata wa ima, Yuda to Erusaremu no hitobito o shitagawasete, jibun no danjo no dorei ni shiyou to omotte iru. Shikashi anata gata jishin mo mata, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsumi o okashite irude wa nai ka.
Ima watashi ni kiki, anata gata ga sono kyoudai no uchi kara toraete kita horyo o hanachi kaerase nasai. Shu no hageshii ikari ga anata gata no ue ni nozonde irukara desu".
Soko de Efuraimu bito no omo naru hitobito, sunawachi Yohanan no ko Azariya, Meshiremote no ko Berekiya, Sharumu no ko Hizekiya, Haderai no ko Amasara mo mata, sensou kara kaetta monodomo ni mukatte tachiagari,
Karera ni itta, "Horyo o koko ni hikiirete wa naranai. Anata gata wa watashidomo ni Shu ni taisuru toga o esasete, sarani wareware no tsumitoga o mashikuwaeyou to shite iru. Wareware no toga wa ookiku, hageshii ikari ga Isuraeru no ue ni nozonde irukara desu".
Soko de heisotsudomo ga sono horyo to bundori mono o tsukasatachi to zenkaishuu no mae ni sutete oita no de,
Mae ni na o ageta hitobito ga tatte horyo o uketori, bundori mono no uchi kara ifuku o totte, hadaka no mono ni kise, mata, kutsu o hakase, kui nomisase, abura o sosogi nado shi, sono yowai mono o minaroba ni nose, kou shite karera o shuro no machi Eriko ni tsurete itte, sono kyoudaitachi ni watashi, soshite Samariya ni kaette kita.
Sono toki Ahazu ou wa hito o ASsuriya no ou ni tsukawashite tasuke o motomesaseta.
Edomu bito ga futatabi shinnyuu shite Yuda o uchi, tami o torae sattakara de aru.
Perishite bito mo mata heiya no machimachi oyobi Yuda no Negebu no machimachi o okashite, Beteshimeshi, Ayaron, Gederote oyobi Soko to sono murazato, Temuna to sono murazato, Gimuzo to sono murazato o totte, soko ni sunda.
Kore wa Isuraeru no ou Ahazu no yue ni, Shu ga Yuda o hikuku sareta no de atte, kare ga Yuda no uchi ni midara na koto o okonai, Shu ni mukatte ooini tsumi o okashitakara de aru.
ASsuriya no ou terugade piruneseru wa kare no tokoro ni kitaga, kare ni chikara o soenaide, kaette kare o nayamashita.
Ahazu wa Shu no miya to ou no ie, oyobi tsukasatachi no ie no mono o totte ASsuriya no ou ni ataetaga, sore wa Ahazu no tasuke ni wa naranakatta.
Kono Ahazu ou wa sono nayami no toki ni atatte, masumasu Shu ni tsumi o okashita.
Sunawachi, kare wa jibun o utta Damasuko no kamigami ni, gisei o sasagete itta, "Suriya no outachi no kamigami wa sono outachi o tasukerukara, watashi mo sore ni gisei o sasageyou. Sou sureba karera wa watashi o tasukerude arou" to. Shikashi, karera wa kaette Ahazu to Isuraeru zenkoku to o taosu mono to natta.
Ahazu wa kami no miya no utsuwamono o atsumete, kami no miya no utsuwamono o kiriyaburi, Shu no miya no to o toji, Erusaremu no subete no sumizumi ni saidan o tsukuri,
Yuda no subete no machimachi ni takaki tokoro o tsukutte, ta no kamigami ni kou o taki nado shite, senzo no kami, Shu no ikari o hikiokoshita.
Ahazu no sono ta no shijuu no koui oyobi sono subete no koudou wa, Yuda to Isuraeru no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Ahazu wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, Erusaremu no machi ni kore o houmutta. Shikashi, Isuraeru no outachi no haka ni wa motte ikanakatta. Sono ko Hizekiya ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Hizekiya wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, nijuu kyuu nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Sono haha wa Abiya to itte, Zekariya no musume de aru.
Hizekiya wa chichi Dabide ga subete nashita you ni Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o shita.
Kare wa sono chisei no daiichi nen no ichi gatsu ni Shu no miya no to o hiraki, katsu kore o tsukurotta.
Kare wa saishi to Rebi bito o tsurete itte, higashi no hiroba ni atsume,
Karera ni itta, "Rebi bito yo, kiki nasai. Anata gata wa ima, mi o kiyomete, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu no miya o kiyome, seijo kara kegare o nozokisari nasai.
Wareware no senzo wa tsumi o okashi, wareware no kami, Shu no aku to mirareru koto o itte, Shu o sute, Shu no sumai ni kao o somuke, ushiro o muketa.
Mata rou no to o toji, tomoshibi o keshi, seijo de Isuraeru no kami ni kou o takazu, hansai o sasagenakatta.
Sore yue, Shu no ikari wa Yuda to Erusaremu ni nozomi, anata gata ga me ni miru you ni, Shu wa karera o osore to odoroki to monowarai ni sareta.
Miyo, wareware no chichitachi wa tsurugi ni taore, wareware no musukotachi, musumetachi, tsumatachi wa kore ga tame ni horyo to natta.
Ima watashi wa, Isuraeru no kami, Shu to keiyaku o musubu kokorozashi o motte iru. Sou sureba sono hageshii ikari wa, wareware o hanarerude arou.
Waga kora yo, ima wa okotatte wa naranai. Shu wa anatagata o erande, Shu no mae ni tatte tsukaesase, gojibun ni tsukaeru mono to nashi, mata kou o taku mono to saretakara de aru".
Soko de Rebi bi to wa tachiagatta. Sunawachi Kohate bito no shison no uchi de wa, Amasai no ko Mahate oyobi Azariya no ko Yoeru. Merari no shison de wa, Abude no ko Kishi oyobi Eharereru no ko Azariya. Gerushon bito no uchi de wa, Jinma no ko Yoa oyobi Yoa no ko Eden.
Erizapan no shison no uchi de wa, Shimuri to Eieru. Asafu no shison no uchi de wa, Zekariya to MaTtaniya.
Heman no shison no uchi de wa, Ehieru to Shimei. Edoton no shison no uchi de wa, Shimaya to Ujieru de aru.
Karera wa sono kyoudaitachi o atsumete mi o kiyome, Shu no kotoba ni yoru ou no meirei ni shitagatte, Shu no miya o kiyomeru tame ni haitte kita.
Saishitachi ga Shu no miya no oku ni haitte kore o kiyome, Shu no miya ni atta kegareta mono o kotogotoku Shu no miya no niwa ni hakobidasuto, Rebi bi to wa sore o ukete soto ni dashi, Kideron kawa ni motte itta.
Karera wa shougatsu no ganjitsu ni kiyomeru koto o hajimete, sono tsuki no youka ni Shu no miya no rou ni tasshita. Sore kara Shu no miya o kiyomeru no ni youka o tsuiyashi, shougatsu no juu roku nichi ni kore o owatta.
Soko de karera wa Hizekiya ou no tokoro e itte itta, "Wareware wa Shu no miya o kotogotoku kiyome, mata hansai no dan to sono subete no utsuwamono, oyobi sonae no pan no tsukue to sono subete no utsuwamono to o kiyomemashita.
Mata Ahazu ou ga sono chisei ni tsumi o okashite suteta subete no utsuwamono o mo totonoete kiyomemashita. Sorera wa Shu no saidan no mae ni arimasu".
Soko de Hizekiya ou wa asa hayaku oki ide, machi no tsukasatachi o atsumete, Shu no miya ni nobotte iki,
Oushi nanatou, ohitsuji nanatou, kohitsuji nanatou, o yagi nanatou o hiite kosase, kuni to seijo to Yuda no tame ni kore o zaisai to shi, Aron no shison de aru saishitachi ni meijite kore o Shu no saidan no ue ni sasagesaseta.
Sunawachi, oushi o hofuruto, saishitachi wa sono chi o ukete saidan ni furikake, mata ohitsuji o hofuruto, sono chi o saidan ni furikake, mata kohitsuji o hofuruto, sono chi o saidan ni furikaketa.
Soshite zaisai no o yagi o ou to kaishuu no mae ni hiite kita no de, karera wa sono ue ni te o oita.
Soshite saishitachi wa kore o hofuri, sono chi o zaisai to shite saidan no ue ni sasagete Isuraeru zenkoku no tame ni aganai o shita. Kore wa ou ga Isuraeru zenkoku no tame ni hansai oyobi zaisai o sasageru koto o meijita tame de aru.
Ou wa mata Rebi bito o Shu no miya ni oki, Dabide oyobi ou no senkensha Gado to yogensha Natan no meirei ni shitagatte, kore ni Shinbaru, tategoto oyobi koto o toraseta. Kore wa Shu ga sono yogensha ni yotte meijirareta tokoro de aru.
Kou shite Rebi bi to wa Dabide no gakki o tori, saishi wa rappa o totte tatta.
Soko de Hizekiya wa hansai o saidan no ue ni sasageru koto o meijita. Hansai o sasage hajimeta toki, Shu no uta o utai, rappa o fuki, Isuraeru no ou Dabide no gakki o narashi hajimeta.
Soshite kaishuu wa mina reihai shi, uta utau mono wa uta o utai, rappate wa rappa o fukinarashi, hansai ga owaru made subete kono you de attaga,
Sasageru koto ga owaruto, ou oyobi kare to tomo ni ita mono wa mina mi o kagamete reihai shita.
Mata Hizekiya ou oyobi tsukasatachi wa Rebi bito ni meijite, Dabide to senkensha Asafu no kotoba o motte Shu osan bi saseta. Karera wa yorokondesan bishi, tou o sagete reihai shita.
Sono toki, Hizekiya wa itta, "Anata gata wa sudeni Shu ni tsukaeru tame ni mi o kiyometa no de arukara, susumiyotte, Shu no miya ni gisei to kansha no sonaemono o tazusaete ki nasai" to. Soko de kaishuu wa gisei to kansha no sonaemono o tazusaete kita. Mata kokorozashi aru mono wa minahansai o tazusaete kita.
Kaishuu no tazusaete kita hansai no kazu wa oushi nanajuutou, ohitsuji hyakutou, kohitsuji nihyakutou, korera wa mina Shu ni hansai to shite sasageru mono de atta.
Mata hounoubutsu wa ushi roppyakutou, kohitsuji sanzentou de atta.
Tokoro ga saishi ga sukunakute sono hansai no mono no kawa o, hagi tsukusu koto ga dekinakatta no de, sono kyoudai de aru Rebi bito ga kore o tasukete, sono waza o nashi oe, sono kan ni ta no saishitachi wa mi o kiyometa. Kore wa Rebi bito ga saishitachi yori mo, mi o kiyomeru koto ni, kichoumen de attakara de aru.
Kono hoka obitadashii hansai ga ari, mata, shuuonsai no shibou oyobi hansai no kansai mo atta. Kou shite, Shu no miya no tsutome wa kaifuku sareta.
Kono koto wa, niwaka ni nasaretakeredo mo, kami ga kono you ni tami no tame ni sonae o sareta no de, Hizekiya oyobi subete no tami wa yorokonda.
Hizekiya wa Isuraeru to Yuda ni amaneku hito o tsukawashi, mata tegami o Efuraimu to Manase ni kakiokuri, Erusaremu ni aru Shu no miya ni kite, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonau you ni susumeta.
Ou wa sudeni tsukasatachi oyobi Erusaremu ni oru zenkaishuu ni hakatte, ni gatsu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonau koto o sadameta.
- - kore wa mi o kiyometa saishi no kazu ga tarazu, tami mo mata, Erusaremu ni atsumaranakatta no de, shougatsu ni kore o okonau koto ga dekinakattakara de aru - -
Kono koto ga, ou ni mo zenkaishuu ni mo yokatta no de,
Kono koto o sadamete, Beerushiba kara Dan made Isuraeru ni amaneku fure shimeshi, Erusaremu ni kite, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonau koto o susumeta. Kore wa shirusarete iru you ni, kore o okonau mono ga ooku nakatta yue de aru.
Soko de hikyakutachi wa, ou to sono tsukasatachi kara uketa tegami o motte, Isuraeru to Yuda o amaneku iki meguri, ou no inochi o tsutaete itta, "Isuraeru no hitobito yo, anata gata wa Aburahamu, Isaku, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni tachikaeri nasai. Sou sureba Shu wa, ASsuriya no outachi no te kara nogareta nokori no anata gata ni, kaerarerudeshou.
Anata gata no chichitachi oyobi kyoudaitachi no you ni natte wa naranai. Karera wa sono senzotachi no kami, Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashita no de, anata gata no miru you ni Shu wa karera o horobi ni watasareta no desu.
Anata gata no chichitachi no you ni goujou ni naranaide, Shu ni kifuku shi, Shu ga tokoshie ni seibetsu sareta seijo ni iri, anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukae nasai. Sou sureba, sono hageshii ikari ga anatagata o hanarerudeshou.
Moshi anata gata ga Shu ni tachikaerunaraba, anata gata no kyoudai oyobi kodomo wa, kore o toraete itta mono no mae ni awaremi o ete, kono kuni ni kaeru koto ga dekirudeshou. Anata gata no kami, Shu wa megumi ari, awaremi aru kata de arareru yue, anata gata ga kare ni tachikaerunaraba, kao o anata gata ni somukerareru koto wa arimasen".
Kono you ni hikyakutachi wa, Efuraimu to Manase no kuni ni haitte, machi kara machi ni iki meguri, tsuini, Zeburun made ittaga, hitobito wa kore o azakeriwaratta.
Tadashi Aseru, Manase, Zeburun no uchi ni wa mi o hikuku shite, Erusaremu ni kita hitobito mo atta.
Mata Yuda ni oite wa kami no te ga hitobito ni hitotsu kokoro o ataete, ou to tsukasatachi ga Shu no kotoba ni yotte meijita koto o okonawaseta.
Kou shite ni gatsu ni natte, ooku no tami wa, tane irenu pan no matsuri o okonau tame Erusaremu ni atsumattaga, hijou ni ookina kaishuu de atta.
Karera wa tatte Erusaremu ni aru moromoro no saidan o torinozoki, mata subete no kou o taku saidan o torinozoite Kideron kawa ni nagesute,
Ni gatsu no juu yonka ni sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofutta. Soko de saishitachi oyobi Rebi bi to wa mizukara haji, mi o kiyomete Shu no miya ni hansai o tazusaete kita.
Karera wa kami no hito Moose no rippou ni shitagai, itsu mo no you ni sono tokoro ni tachi, saishitachi wa, Rebi bito no te kara chi o ukete sosoida.
Toki ni, kaishuu no uchi ni mada mi o kiyomete inai mono ga ookatta no de, Rebi bi to wa sono kiyoku nai subete no hitobito ni kawatte sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofuri, Shu ni kiyomete sasageta.
Ooku no tami sunawachi Efuraimu, Manase, Issakaru, Zeburun kara kita ooku no mono wa mada mi o kiyomete inai no ni, kakishirusareta toori ni shinaide sugikoshi no mono o tabeta. Sore de Hizekiya wa, karera no tame ni inotte itta, "Megumi fukaki Shu yo, karera o yurushite kudasai.
Karera wa seijo no kiyome no kitei doori ni shinakattakeredo mo, sono kokoro o katamukete kami o motome, sono senzo no kami, Shu o motometa no desu".
Shu wa Hizekiya ni kiite, tami o iyasareta.
Soko de Erusaremu ni kite ita Isuraeru no hitobito wa ooinaru yorokobi o idaite, nanuka no aida tane irenu pan no matsuri o okonatta. Mata Rebi bito to saishitachi wa hibi ni Shu osan bishi, chikara o tsukushite Shu o tataeta.
Soshite Hizekiya wa Shu no tsutome ni yoku tsuujite iru subete no Rebi bito o fukaku negiratta. Kou shite hitobito wa shuuonsai no gisei o sasage, sono senzo no kami, Shu ni kansha shite, nanuka no aida matsuri no sonaemono o tabeta.
Nao zenkaishuu wa aihakatte, sarani nanuka no aida matsuri o mamoru koto o sadame, yorokobi o motte mata nanuka no aida mamotta.
Toki ni Yuda no ou Hizekiya wa oushi issentou, hitsuji nanasentou o kaishuu ni okuri, mata, tsukasatachi wa oushi issentou, hitsuji ichi mantou o kaishuu ni okutta. Saishi mo mata ooku mi o kiyometa.
Yuda no zenkaishuu oyobi saishi, Rebi bi to, narabi ni Isuraeru kara kita zenkaishuu, oyobi Isuraeru no chi kara kita takokujin to, Yuda ni sumu takokujin wa mina yorokonda.
Kono you ni Erusaremu ni ooinaru yorokobi ga atta. Isuraeru no ou Dabide no ko Soromon no toki kara konokata, kono you na koto wa Erusaremu ni nakatta.
Kono toki saishitachi to Rebi bi to wa tatte, tami o shukufuku shitaga, sono koe wa kikare, sono inori wa Shu no sei naru sumika de aru ten ni tasshita.
Kono koto ga subete owatta toki, soko ni ita Isuraeru bi to wa mina, Yuda no machimachi ni dete itte, sekichuu o kudaki, Ashira zou o kiritaoshi, Yuda to Beniyamin no zenchi, oyobi Efuraimu to Manase ni aru takaki tokoro to saidan to o torikowashi, tsuini kore o kotogotoku hakai shita. Soshite Isuraeru no hitobito wa onoono sono machimachi, sono shoryou ni kaetta.
Hizekiya wa saishi oyobi Rebi bito no han o sadame, hangoto ni onoono sono tsutome ni shitagatte, saishi to Rebi bito ni hansai to shuuonsai o sasagesase, Shu no ei no mon de tsutome o shi, kansha o shi,san bi o saseta.
Mata hansai no tame ni jibun no zaisan no uchi kara ou no bun o dashita. Sunawachi asayuu no hansai oyobi ansokunichi, shingetsu, sadame no matsuri nado no hansai no tame ni dashite, Shu no rippou ni shirusarete iru toori ni shita.
Mata Erusaremu ni sumu tami ni, saishi to Rebi bito ni sono bun o ataeru koto o meijita. Kore wa karera o shite Shu no rippou ni mi o yudanesaseru tame de aru.
Sono meirei ga tsutawaru ya ina ya, Isuraeru no hitobito wa kokumotsu, sake, abura, mitsu narabi ni hatake no moromoro no sanbutsu no hatsumono o ooku sasage, mata subete no mono no juubun no ichi o obitadashiku tazusaete kita.
Yuda no machimachi ni sunde ita Isuraeru to Yuda no hitobito mo mata ushi, hitsuji no juubun no ichi narabi ni sono kami, Shu ni sasagerareta hounoubutsu o tazusaete kite, kore o tsumikasaneta.
San gatsu ni kore o tsumikasaneru koto o hajime, nana gatsu ni kore o owatta.
Hizekiya oyobi tsukasatachi wa kite, sono tsumikasaneta mono o mi, Shu to sono tami Isuraeru o shukufuku shita.
Soshite Hizekiya ga sono tsumikasaneta mono ni tsuite saishi oyobi Rebi bito ni toitazuneta toki,
Zadoku no ie kara deta saishi no chou Azariya wa kare ni kotaete itta, "Tami ga Shu no miya ni sonaemono o tazusaete kuru koto o hajimete kara konokata, wareware wa akiru hodo tabetaga, takusan nokorimashita. Shu ga sono tami o megumaretakara desu. Sore de wareware wa, kono you ni ooku no nokotta mono o motte iru no desu".
Soko de Hizekiya wa Shu no miya no uchi ni shitsu o moukeru koto o meijita no de, karera wa kore o mouke,
Sono sonaemono no juubun no ichi oyobi hounoubutsu o chuujitsu ni tazusae ireta. Kore o tsukasadoru mono no kashira wa Rebi bito Konaniya de, sono kyoudaiShimei wa kare ni tsugu mono to nari,
Ehieru, Azajiya, Nahate, Asaheru, Eremote, Yozabade, Erieru, Isumakiya, Mahate, Benayara wa, Hizekiya ou oyobi kami no miya no tsukasa Azariya no ninmei ni yotte, Konaniya oyobi sono kyoudaiShimei o tasukete, sono kantokusha to natta.
Higashi no mon o mamoru mono Rebi bito Imuna no ko Kore wa, kami ni sasageru jihatsu no sasagemono o tsukasadori, Shu no sonaemono oyobi mottomo sei naru mono o bunpai shita.
Kare o tasukeru mono wa Eden, Miniyamin, Eshua, Shimaya, Amariya oyobi Shikaniya de, minasaishi no machimachi de sono kyoudaitachi ni, han ni yotte, rounyaku hitoshiku chuujitsu ni bunpai shita.
Tadashi subete touroku sareta sansai ijou no danshi de Shu no miya ni iri, sono han ni shitagatte hibi no shokubun o tsukushi, sono ukemochi no tsutome o nasu mono wa nozokareta.
Saishi no touroku wa sono shizoku ni yotte nasare, nijuusai ijou no Rebi bito no touroku wa sono han ni yori, sono ukemochi ni shitagatte nasareta.
Mata saishi wa sono osanako, sono tsuma, sono musuko, sono musume, zenkaishuu to tomo ni touroku shita. Karera wa chuujitsu ni mi o sei naru koto ni sasagetakara de aru.
Mata machimachi no houboku chi ni oru Aron no shison de aru saishitachi no tame ni wa, machigoto ni hito o nazashi erande, saishi no uchi no subete no otoko oyobi Rebi bito no uchi no touroku sareta subete no mono ni, sono bun o ataesaseta.
Hizekiya wa Yuda zenkoku ni kono you ni shi, yoi koto, tadashii koto, chuujitsu na koto o sono kami, Shu no mae ni itta.
Kare ga sono kami o motomeru tame ni kami no miya no tsutome ni tsuki, rippou ni tsuki, imashime ni tsuite hajimeta waza wa, kotogotoku kokoro o tsukushite okonai, kore o nashitogeta.
Hizekiya ga korera no koto o chuujitsu ni itta nochi, ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu ga kite Yuda ni shinnyuu shi, kengo na machimachi ni mukatte jin o hari, kore o semetorou to shita.
Hizekiya wa Senakeribu ga kite, Erusaremu o semeyou to suru no o mita no de,
Sono tsukasatachi oyobi yuushitachi to soudan shite, machi no soto ni aru izumi no mizu o, fusagou to shita. Karera wa kore o tasuketa.
Ooku no tami wa atsumatte, subete no izumi oyobi kuni no naka o nagareru tanigawa o fusaide itta, "ASsuriya no outachi ga kite, ooku no mizu o erareru you na koto o shite oite iidarou ka".
Hizekiya wa mata yuuki o dashite, yabureta jouheki o kotogotoku kizukinaoshite, sono ue ni yagura o tate, sono soto ni mata jouheki o megurashi, Dabide no machi no Miro o kengo ni shi, buki oyobi tate o ooku tsukuri,
Gunchou o tami no ue ni oki, machi no mon no hiroba ni tami o atsumete, kore o hagemashite itta,
"Kokoro o tsuyoku shi, isamitachi nasai. ASsuriya no ou o mo, kare to tomo ni iru subete no gunshuu o mo osorete wa naranai. Ononoite wa naranai. Wareware to tomo ni oru mono wa karera to tomo ni oru mono yori mo ooinaru mono dakara de aru.
Kare to tomo ni oru mono wa niku no ude de aru. Shikashi wareware to tomo ni oru mono wa wareware no kami, Shu de atte, wareware o tasuke, wareware ni kawatte tatakawareru". Tami wa Yuda no ou Hizekiya no kotoba ni anshin shita.
Kono nochi ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu wa sono zengun o motte Rakishi o kakonde itaga, sono kerai o Erusaremu ni tsukawashite, Yuda no ou Hizekiya oyobi Erusaremu ni iru subete no Yuda no hito ni tsugesasete itta,
"ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu wa kou iimasu, 'Anata gata wa nani o tanonde Erusaremu ni komotte iru no ka.
Hizekiya wa "Wareware no kami, Shu ga ASsuriya no ou no te kara, wareware o sukutte kudasaru" to itte, anatagata o sosonokashi, ue to, kawaki o motte, anatagata o shinaseyou to shite iru no de wa nai ka.
Kono Hizekiya wa Shu no moromoro no takaki tokoro to saidan o torinozoki, Yuda to Erusaremu ni meijite, "Anata gata wa tada hitotsu no saidan no mae de reihai shi, sono ue ni gisei o sasagenakereba naranai" to itta mono de wa nai ka.
Anata gata wa, watashi oyobi watashi no senzotachi ga, ta no kuniguni no subete no tami ni shita koto o shiranai no ka. Sorera no kuniguni no tami no kamigami wa, sukoshi de mo sono kuni o, watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekita ka.
Watashi no senzotachi ga horoboshi tsukushita sorera no kokumin no moromoro no kami no uchi, dare ka jibun no tami o watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto no dekita mono ga aru ka. Sore de, dou shite anata gata no kami ga, anatagata o watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou.
Sore yue, anata gata wa Hizekiya ni azamukarete wa naranai. Sosonokasarete wa naranai. Mata kare o shinjite wa naranai. Izure no tami, izure no kuni no kami mo sono tami o watashi no te, mata wa, watashi no senzo no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekinakatta no dakara, mashite anata gata no kami ga, dou shite watashi no te kara anatagata o sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou ka' ".
Senakeribu no kerai wa, kono hoka ni mo ooku Shu naru kami, oyobi sono shimobe Hizekiya o soshitta.
Senakeribu wa mata tegami o kakiokutte, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o azakeri, katsu soshitte itta, "Shokoku no tami no kamigami ga, sono tami o watashi no te kara sukuidasanakatta you ni, Hizekiya no kami mo, sono tami o watashi no te kara sukuidasanaide arou" to.
Soshite karera wa oogoe o age, Yudaya no kotoba o motte, jouheki no ue ni iru Erusaremu no tami ni mukatte sakebi, kore o odoshi, katsu obiyakashita. Karera wa machi o toru tame de aru.
Kono you ni karera ga Erusaremu no kami ni tsuite kataru koto, hito no te no waza de aru chijou no tami no kamigami ni tsuite kataru you de atta.
Soko de Hizekiya ou oyobi Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya wa tomo ni inotte, ten ni yobawatta no de,
Shu wa hitori no mitsukai o tsukawashite, ASsuriya ou no jin'ei ni iru subete no daiyuushi to shoukan, gunchoura o horobosareta. Sore de ou wa sekimen shite jibun no kuni ni kaettaga, sono kami no ie ni haitta toki, sono ko no hitori ga, tsurugi o motte kare o sono tokoro de koroshita.
Kono you ni Shu wa, Hizekiya to Erusaremu no juumin o ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu no te oyobi subete no teki no te kara sukuidashi, itaru tokoro de karera o mamorareta.
Soko de ooku no hitobito wa sasagemono o Erusaremu ni tazusaete kite Shu ni sasage, mata houmotsu o Yuda no ou Hizekiya ni okutta. Kono nochi Hizekiya wa bankoku no tami ni tattobareta.
Sono koro, Hizekiya wa yande shinu bakari de attaga, Shu ni inotta no de, Shu wa kore ni kotaete, shirushi o tamawatta.
Shikashi Hizekiya wa sono uketa megumi ni mukuiru koto o sezu, sono kokoro ga takabutta no de, ikari ga kare to Yuda oyobi Erusaremu ni nozomou to shitaga,
Hizekiya wa sono kokoro no takaburi o kuite herikudari, mata Erusaremu no juumin mo douyou ni shita no de, Shu no ikari wa, Hizekiya no yo ni wa karera ni nozomanakatta.
Hizekiya wa tomi to eiyo o kiwame, houzou o tsukutte, kin, gin, houseki, kouryou, tate oyobi kakushu no tattoi utsuwamono o osame,
Mata souko o tsukutte kokumotsu, sake, abura nado no sanbutsu o osame, koya o tsukutte shuju no kachiku o oki, ori o tsukutte hitsuji no mure o oki,
Mata tasuu no machi o mouke, katsu hitsuji to ushi o obitadashiku shoyuu shita. Kami ga hijou ni ooku no kazai o kare ni tamawattakara de aru.
Kono Hizekiya wa mata Gihon no mizu no ue no minamoto o fusaide, kore o Dabide no machi no nishi no hou ni massugu ni hikikudashita. Kono you ni Hizekiya wa sono subete no waza o nashitogeta.
Shikashi Babiron no kimitachi ga shisha o tsukawashite, kono kuni ni atta, shirushi ni tsuite tazunesaseta toki ni wa, kami wa kare o kokoromite, kare no kokoro ni aru koto o, kotogotoku shiru tame ni kare o suteokareta.
Hizekiya no sono ta no koui oyobi sono tokkou wa, Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya no mokushi to Yuda to Isuraeru no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Hizekiya wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, Dabide no shison no haka no uchi no takai tokoro ni houmurareta. Yuda no hitobito oyobi Erusaremu no juumin wa mina sono shi ni atatte kare ni keii o arawashita. Sono ko Manase ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Manase wa juu nisai de ou to nari, gojuu go nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae kara oiharawareta kuniguni no tami no nikumubeki okonai ni minaratte, Shu no me no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Sunawachi, sono chichi Hizekiya ga kowashita takaki tokoro o futatabi kizuki, mata moromoro no Baaru no tame ni saidan o mouke, Ashira zou o tsukuri, ten no banshou o ogande, kore ni tsukae,
Mata Shu ga "Waga na wa eien ni Erusaremu ni aru" to iwareta Shu no miya no uchi ni suuko no saidan o kizuki,
Shu no miya no futatsu no niwa ni ten no banshou no tame ni saidan o kizuita.
Kare wa mata Benhinnomu no tani de sono kotomo o hi ni yaite sonaemono to shi, uranai o shi, mahou o tsukai, majinai o okonai, kuchiyose to, uranaishi o nin'you suru nado, Shu no mae ni ooku no aku o itte, sono ikari o hikiokoshita.
Kare wa mata kizanda guuzou o tsukutte kami no miya ni anchi shita. Kami wa kono miya ni tsuite Dabide to sono ko Soromon ni iwareta koto ga aru, "Watashi wa kono miya to, watashi ga Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no uchi kara eranda Erusaremu to ni, watashi no na o eien ni oku.
Karera ga moshi, watashi ga subete meijita koto, sunawachi, Moose ga tsutaeta subete no rippou to sadame to okite to o tsutsushinde okonaunaraba, watashi ga anata gata no senzo no tame ni sadameta chi kara, kasanete Isuraeru no ashi o utsusu koto o shinai" to.
Manase wa kono you ni Yuda to Erusaremu no juumin o mayowase, Shu ga Isuraeru no hitobito no mae ni horobosareta kuniguni no tami ni mo masatte aku o okonawaseta.
Shu wa Manase oyobi sono tami ni tsugeraretaga, karera wa kokoro ni tomenakatta.
Sore yue, Shu wa ASsuriya no ou no gunzei no shoshou o kore ni seme kosaserareta no de, karera wa Manase o kagi de torae, seidou no kase ni tsunaide, Babiron ni hiite itta.
Kare wa nayami ni au ni oyonde, sono kami, Shu ni negaimotome, sono senzo no kami no mae ni ooini mi o hikuku shite,
Kami ni inotta no de, kami wa sono inori o ukeire, sono negai o kiki, kare o Erusaremu ni tsurekaette, futatabi kuni ni nozomaserareta. Kore ni yotte Manase wa Shu koso, makoto ni kami ni imasu koto o shitta.
Kono nochi, kare wa Dabide no machi no soto no ishigaki o Gihon no nishi no hou no tani no uchi ni kizuki, uo no mon no iriguchi ni made oyoboshi, mata Operu ni ishigaki o megurashite, hijou ni takaku kore o kizukiage, Yuda no subete no kengo na machi ni gunchou o oki,
Mata Shu no miya kara, ihou no kamigami oyobi guuzou o torinozoki, Shu no miya no yama to Erusaremu ni jibun de kizuita subete no saidan o torinozoite, machi no soto ni nagesute,
Shu no saidan o kizukinaoshite, shuuonsai oyobi kansha no gisei o, sono ue ni sasage, Yuda ni meijite Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni tsukaesaseta.
Shikashi tami wa, nao takaki tokoro de gisei o sasageta. Tadashi sono kami, Shu ni nomi sasageta.
Manase no sono hoka no koui, sono kami ni sasageta inori, oyobi Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na o motte kare ni tsugeta senkensha tachi no kotoba wa, Isuraeru no retsuou no kiroku no uchi ni shirusarete iru.
Mata sono inori to, inori no kikareta koto, sono moromoro no tsumi to, to ga, sono mi o hikuku suru mae ni takaki tokoro o kizuite, Ashira zou oyobi kizanda zou o tateta basho nado wa, senkensha no kiroku no uchi ni shirusarete iru.
Manase wa sono senzotachi to tomo ni nemutta no de, sono ie ni houmurareta. Sono ko Amon ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Amon wa ou to natta toki nijuu nisai de, ni nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta.
Kare wa sono chichi Manase no shita you ni Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta. Sunawachi Amon wa sono chichi Manase ga tsukutta moromoro no kizanda zou ni gisei o sasagete, kore ni tsukae,
Sono chichi Manase ga mi o hikuku shita you ni Shu no mae ni mi o hikuku shinakatta. Kaette kono Amon wa, iyoiyo sono toga o mashita.
Sono keraitachi wa tou o musunde kare ni somuki, kare o sono ie de koroshita.
Shikashi kuni no tami wa, tou o musunde Amon ou ni somuita monodomo o kotogotoku uchikoroshita. Soshite kuni no tami wa sono ko Yoshiya o ou to nashite, sono ato o tsugaseta.
Yoshiya wa hachisai no toki ou to nari, Erusaremu de sanjuu ichi nen no aidayo o osameta.
Kare wa Shu no yoshi to mirareru koto o nashi, sono chichi Dabide no michi o ayunde, migi ni mo hidari ni mo magaranakatta.
Kare wa mada wakakattaga, sono chisei no daihachi nen ni chichi Dabide no kami o motomeru koto o hajime, sono juu ni nen ni wa takaki tokoro, Ashira zou, kizanda zou, ita zou nado o nozoite, Yuda to Erusaremu o kiyomeru koto o hajime,
Moromoro no Baaru no saidan o, jibun no mae de uchikowasase, sono ue ni tatte ita kou no saidan o kiritaoshi, Ashira zou, kizanda zou, ita zou o uchikudaite konagona ni shi, korera no zou ni gisei o sasageta monodomo no haka no ue ni sore o makichirashi,
Saishira no hone o sono moromoro no saidan no ue de yaki, kou shite Yuda to Erusaremu o kiyometa.
Mata Manase, Efuraimu, Shimeon oyobi Nafutari no areta machimachi ni mo kono you ni shi,
Moromoro no saidan o kowashi, Ashira zou oyobi moromoro no kizanda zou o konagona ni uchikudaki, Isuraeru zenkoku no kou no saidan o kotogotoku kiritaoshite, Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Yoshiya wa sono chisei no juu hachi nen ni, kuni to miya to o kiyometa toki, sono kami, Shu no miya o tsukurowaseyou to, Azariya no ko Shapan, machi no tsukasa Maaseya oyobi Yoahazu no ko shikan Yoa o tsukawashita.
Karera wa daisaishi Hirukiya no moto e itte, kami no miya ni haitta kane o watashita. Kore wa mon o mamoru Rebi bito ga Manase, Efuraimu oyobi sono ta no subete no Isuraeru, narabi ni Yuda to Beniyamin no subete no hito, oyobi Erusaremu no juumin no te kara atsumeta mono de aru.
Karera wa kore o Shu no miya o kantoku suru shokkoura no te ni watashita no de, Shu no miya de hataraku shokkoura wa, kore o miya o tsukuroi naosu tame ni shiharatta.
Sunawachi, daiku oyobi kenchikusha ni kore o watashite, Yuda no outachi ga yabutta tatemono no tame ni, kiriishi oyobi honegumi no zaimoku o kawase, harizai o totonoesaseta.
Sono hitobito wa chuujitsu ni shigoto o shita. Sono kantokusha wa Merari no shison de aru Rebi bito Yahate to Obadeya, oyobi Kohate bito no shison de aru Zekariya to Meshuramu de atte, kouji o tsukasadotta. Mata gakki ni takumi na Rebi bito ga kore ni tomonatta.
Karera wa mata ni o ou mono o kantoku shi, samazama no shigoto ni hataraku subete no mono o tsukasadotta. Mata ta no Rebi bi to wa shoki to nari, yakunin to nari, mata mon'ei to natta.
Sate karera ga Shu no miya ni haitta kane o toridashita toki, saishi Hirukiya wa Moose no tsutaeta Shu no rippou no sho o hakken shita.
Soko de Hirukiya wa shokikan Shapan ni itta, "Watashi wa Shu no miya de rippou no sho o hakken shimashita" to. Soshite Hirukiya wa sono sho o Shapan ni watashita.
Shapan wa sono sho o ou no moto ni motte iki, sarani ou ni fukumei shite itta, "Shimobera wa yudanerareta koto o kotogotoku nashi,
Shu no miya ni atta kane o akete, kantokusha no te oyobi shokkou no te ni watashimashita".
Shokikan Shapan wa mata ou ni tsugete, "Saishi Hirukiya wa watashi ni hitotsu no shomotsu o watashimashita" to ii, Shapan wa sore o ou no mae de yonda.
Ou wa sono rippou no kotoba o kiite koromo o saita.
Soshite ou wa Hirukiya oyobi Shapan no ko Ahikamu to Mika no ko Abudon to shokikan Shapan to ou no kerai Asaya to ni meijite itta,
"Anata gata wa itte, kono hakken sareta shomotsu no kotoba ni tsuite watashi no tame ni, mata Isuraeru to Yuda no nokori no mono no tame ni Shu ni toi nasai. Wareware no senzotachi ga Shu no kotoba o mamorazu, subete kono shomotsu ni shirusarete iru koto o okonawanakatta no de, Shu wa wareware ni ooinaru ikari o sosogarerukara desu".
Soko de Hirukiya oyobi ou no tsukawashita hitobito wa, Sharumu no tsuma de aru onna yogensha Horuda no moto e itta. Sharumu wa Hasura no ko de aru Tokuhate no ko de, ishou o mamoru mono de aru. Toki ni Horuda wa, Erusaremu no daini ku ni sunde ita. Karera wa Horuda ni sono shui o katatta no de,
Horuda wa karera ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, 'Anatagata o watashi ni tsukawashita hito ni tsuge nasai.
Shu wa kou ooseraremasu. Miyo, watashi wa Yuda no ou no mae de yonda shomotsu ni shirusarete iru moromoro no noroi, sunawachi wazawai o kono tokoro to, koko ni sumu mono ni kudasu.
Karera wa watashi o sutete, ta no kamigami ni kou o taki, jibun no te de tsukutta moromoro no mono o motte, watashi no ikari o hikiokosou to shitakara de aru. Sore yue, watashi no ikari wa, kono tokoro ni sosogarete kienai.
Shikashi anatagata o tsukawashite, Shu ni towaseru Yuda no ou ni wa kou ii nasai. Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru. Anata ga kiita kotoba ni tsuite wa,
Kono tokoro to, koko ni sumu mono o semeru kami no kotoba o, anata ga kiita toki, kokoro ni kui, kami no mae ni mi o hikuku shi, watashi no mae ni herikudari, koromo o saite, watashi no mae ni naita no de, watashi mo mata, anata ni kiita, to Shu wa iwareru.
Miyo, watashi wa anata o senzotachi no moto ni atsumeru. Anata wa yasuraka ni anata no haka ni atsumerareru. Anata wa watashi ga kono tokoro to, koko ni sumu mono ni kudasu moromoro no wazawai o me ni miru koto ga nai' to". Karera wa ou ni fukumei shita.
Soko de ou wa hito o tsukawashite Yuda to Erusaremu no chourou o kotogotoku atsume,
Soshite ou wa Shu no miya ni nobotte itta. Yuda no subete no hitobito, Erusaremu no juumin, saishi, Rebi bi to, oyobi subete no tami wa, oita mono mo wakai mono mo kotogotoku kare ni shitagatta. Soko de ou wa Shu no miya de hakken shita keiyaku no sho no kotoba o, kotogotoku karera no mimi ni yomikikase,
Soshite ou wa jibun no tokoro ni tatte, Shu no mae ni keiyaku o tate, Shu ni shitagatte ayumi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushite, sono imashime to, akashi to sadame to o mamori, kono sho ni shirusareta keiyaku no kotoba o okonaou to ii,
Erusaremu oyobi Beniyamin no hitobito o mina kore ni kuwawaraseta. Erusaremu no juumin wa senzo no kami de aru sono kami no keiyaku ni shitagatte itta.
Yoshiya wa Isuraeru no hitobito ni zokusuru subete no chi kara, nikumubeki mono o kotogotoku torinozoki, Isuraeru ni iru subete no hito o sono kami, Shu ni tsukaesaseta. Yoshiya ga yo ni aru hi no aida wa, karera wa senzo no kami, Shu ni shitagatte hanarenakatta.
Yoshiya wa Erusaremu de Shu ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta. Sunawachi shougatsu no juu yonka ni sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofurase,
Saishi ni sono shokumu o toriokonawase, karera o hagemashite Shu no miya no tsutome o sase,
Mata Shu no sei naru mono to natte subete no Isuraeru bito o oshieru Rebi bito ni itta, "Anata gata wa Isuraeru no ou Dabide no ko Soromon no tateta miya ni, sei naru hako o oki nasai. Futatabi kore o kata ni ninau ni oyobanai. Anata gata no kami, Shu oyobi sono tami Isuraeru ni tsukae nasai.
Anata gata wa Isuraeru no ou Dabide no sho, oyobi sono ko Soromon no sho ni motozuite shizoku ni shitagai, sono han ni yotte, mizukara sonae o nashi,
Anata gata no kyoudai de aru tami no hitobito no shizoku no kubun ni shitagatte seijo ni tachi, kono tame ni Rebi bito no shizoku no bun ga kakeru koto no nai you ni shi nasai.
Anata gata wa sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofuri, mi o kiyome, anata gata no kyoudai no tame ni sonae o shi, Moose ga tsutaeta Shu no kotoba ni shitagatte okonai nasai".
Yoshiya wa, kohitsuji oyobi koyagi o tami no hitobito ni okutta. Kore wa mina sono tokoro ni iru subete no hito no tame no sugikoshi no sonaemono de atte, sono kazu san man, mata oushi sanzen o okutta. Sorera wa ou no shoyuu kara dashita no de aru.
Sono tsukasatachi mo tami to saishi to Rebi bito ni magokoro kara okutta. Mata kami no miya no tsukasatachi Hirukiya, Zekariya, Ehieru mo kohitsuji to koyagi nisen roppyakutou, ushi sanbyakutou o saishi ni ataete sugikoshi no sonaemono to shita.
Mata Rebi bito no chou de aru hitobito sunawachi Konaniya oyobi sono kyoudai Shimaya, Netan'eru narabi ni Hashabiya, Eieru, Yozabade nado mo kohitsuji to koyagi gosentou, ushi gohyakutou o Rebi bito ni okutte sugikoshi no sonaemono to shita.
Kono you ni tsutome no koto ga sonawatta no de, ou no inochi ni shitagatte saishitachi wa sono mochiba ni tachi, Rebi bi to wa sono han ni shitagatte tsukae,
Yagate sugikoshi no kohitsuji ga hofurareta no de, saishi wa sono chi o uketotte sosoida. Rebi bi to wa sono kawa o haida.
Sore kara hansai no mono o toriwake, sore o tami no hitobito no shizoku no kubun ni shitagatte watashi, Shu ni sasagesaseta. Kore wa Moose no sho ni shirusareta toori de aru. Mata ushi o mo kono you ni shita.
Soshite sadame ni shitagatte sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hi de aburi, sono ta no sei naru sonaemono o fukanabe, kama, asanabe nado ni nite, isoide subete no tami no hitobito ni kubatta.
Sono nochi, karera wa jibun no tame to, saishitachi no tame ni sonae o shita. Aron no shison de aru saishitachi wa, hansai to shibou o sasageru no ni isogashikute, yoru ni nattakara de aru. Sore de Rebi bi to wa jibuntachi no tame to, Aron no shison de aru saishitachi no tame ni sonaeta no de aru.
Asafu no shison de aru uta utau monotachi wa, Dabide, Asafu, Heman oyobi ou no senkensha Edoton no inochi ni shitagatte sono mochiba ni ori, mon'eitachi wa onoono mon ni ite, sono shokumu o hanareru ni oyobanakatta. Kyoudai de aru Rebi bito ga karera no tame ni sonaetakara de aru.
Kono you ni sono hi, Shu no tsutome no koto ga kotogotoku sonawatta no de, Yoshiya ou no inochi ni shitagatte sugikoshi no matsuri o okonai, Shu no saidan ni hansai o sasageta.
Koko ni kite ita Isuraeru no hitobito wa, sono toki sugikoshi no matsuri o okonai, mata nanuka no aida, tane irenu pan no matsuri o okonatta.
Yogensha Samueru no hi kara konokata, Isuraeru de kono you na sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta koto wa nakatta. Mata Isuraeru no shoou no uchi ni wa, Yoshiya ga, saishi, Rebi bi to, narabi ni soko ni kita Yuda to Isuraeru no subete no hitobito, oyobi Erusaremu no juumin to tomo ni itta you na sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Kono sugikoshi no matsuri wa Yoshiya no chisei no daijuu hachi nen ni okonawareta.
Kono you ni Yoshiya ga miya o totonoeta nochi, Ejiputo no ou Neko wa Yufurate kawa no hotori ni aru Karukemishi de tatakau tame ni nobotte kita no de, Yoshiya wa kore o fusegou to dete itta.
Shikashi Neko wa kare ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Yuda no ou yo, wareware wa otagai ni nani no azukaru tokoro ga arimasu ka. Watashi wa kyou, anata o semeyou to shite kita no de wa arimasen. Watashi no teki no ie o semeyou to shite kita no desu. Kami ga watashi ni meijite isogasete imasu. Watashi to tomo ni orareru kami ni sakarau koto o yame nasai. Sou shinaito, kami wa anata o horobosarerudeshou".
Shikashi Yoshiya wa hikikaesu koto o konomazu, kaette kare to tatakau tame ni, sugata o kae, kami no kuchi kara deta Neko no kotoba o kikiirezu, itte Megido no tani de tatakattaga,
Shashu no monodomo ga Yoshiya o iateta no de, ou wa sono keraitachi ni, "Watashi o tasukedase. Watashi wa hidoku kizutsuita" to itta.
Soko de keraitachi wa kare o kuruma kara tasukedashi, ou no motte ita daini no kuruma ni nosete Erusaremu ni tsurete ittaga, tsuini shinda no de, sono senzo no haka ni kore o houmutta. Soshite Yuda to Erusaremu wa mina Yoshiya no tame ni kanashinda.
Toki ni Eremiya wa Yoshiya no tame ni aika o tsukutta. Uta utau otoko, uta utau onna wa konnichi ni itaru made, sono aika no uchi ni Yoshiya no koto o nobe, Isuraeru no uchi ni kore o rei to shita. Kore wa aika no uchi ni shirusarete iru.
Yoshiya no sono ta no koui, Shu no rippou ni shirusareta tokoro ni shitagatte itta tokkou,
Oyobi sono shijuu no okonai nado wa, Isuraeru to Yuda no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Kuni no tami wa Yoshiya no ko Ehoahazu o tate, Erusaremu de sono chichi ni kawatte ou to naraseta.
Ehoahazu wa ou to natta toki nijuu sansai de, Erusaremu de san tsuki no aida, yo o osametaga,
Ejiputo no ou wa Erusaremu de kare o haishi, katsu gin hyaku taranto, kin ichi taranto no bakkin o kuni ni kashita.
Soshite Ejiputo ou wa kare no kyoudai Eriakimu o Yuda to Erusaremu no ou to shi, sono na o Ehoyakimu to aratame, sono kyoudai Ehoahazu o toraete Ejiputo e hiite itta.
Ehoyakimu wa ou to natta toki nijuu gosai de, juu ichi nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta. Kare wa sono kami, Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Toki ni, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga kare no tokoro ni semenobori, kare o Babiron ni hiite ikou to shite, kase ni tsunaida.
Nebukadenezaru wa mata Shu no miya no utsuwamono o Babiron ni hakonde itte, Babiron ni aru sono kyuuden ni sore o osameta.
Ehoyakimu no sono ta no koui, sono itta nikumubeki koto oyobi kare ga hisoka ni itta koto nado wa, Isuraeru to Yuda no retsuou no sho ni shirusarete iru. Sono ko Ehoyakin ga kare ni kawatte ou to natta.
Ehoyakin wa ou to natta toki hachisai de, Erusaremu de san tsuki to tooka no aida, yo o osame, Shu no mae ni aku o okonatta.
Toshi ga aratamari haru ni natte, Nebukadenezaru ou wa hito o tsukawashite, kare o Shu no miya no tattoi utsuwamono to tomo ni Babiron ni tsurete ikase, sono kyoudai Zedekiya o Yuda to Erusaremu no ou to shita.
Zedekiya wa ou to natta toki nijuu ichisai de, juu ichi nen no aida Erusaremu de yo o osameta.
Kare wa sono kami, Shu no mae ni aku o okonai, Shu no kotoba o tsutaeru yogensha Eremiya no mae ni, mi o hikuku shinakatta.
Kare wa mata, kare ni kami o sashite chikawaseta Nebukadenezaru ou ni mo somuita. Kare wa goujou de, sono kokoro o katakuna ni shite, Isuraeru no kami, Shu ni tachikaeranakatta.
Saishi no kashiratachi oyobi tamira mo mata, subete ihoujin no moromoro no nikumubeki koui ni naratte, hanahadashiku tsumi o okashi, Shu ga Erusaremu ni seibetsu shite okareta Shu no miya o kegashita.
Sono senzo no kami, Shu wa sono tami to, sumika o awaremuga yue ni, shikiri ni, sono shisha o karera ni tsukawasaretaga,
Karera ga kami no shishatachi o azakeri, sono kotoba o karonji, sono yogensha tachi o nonoshitta no de, Shu no ikari ga sono tami ni mukatte okori, tsuini sukuu koto ga dekinai you ni natta.
Soko de Shu wa Karudeya bito no ou o karera ni seme kosaserareta no de, kare wa sono seijo no ie de tsurugi o motte wakamonotachi o koroshi, wakamono o mo, shojo o mo, roujin o mo, shiraga no mono o mo awaremanakatta. Shu wa karera o kotogotoku kare no te ni watasareta.
Kare wa kami no miya no moromoro no daishou no utsuwamono, Shu no miya no kazai, ou to sono tsukasatachi no kazai nado, subete kore o Babiron ni tazusaete iki,
Kami no miya o yaki, Erusaremu no jouheki o kuzushi, sono uchi no kyuuden o kotogotoku hi de yaki, sono uchi no tattoi utsuwamono o kotogotoku kowashita.
Kare wa mata tsurugi o nogareta monodomo o, Babiron ni toraete itte, kare to sono kora no kerai to nashi, Perusha no kuni no okoru made, sou shite oita.
Kore wa Eremiya no kuchi ni yotte tsutaerareta Shu no kotoba no jouju suru tame de atta. Kou shite kuni wa tsuini sono ansoku o uketa. Sunawachi kore wa sono arete iru aida, ansoku shite, tsuini nanajuu nen ga michita.
Perusha ou Kurosu no gannen ni atari, Shu wa Eremiya no kuchi ni yotte tsutaeta Shu no kotoba o jouju suru tame, Perusha ou Kurosu no rei o kandou sareta no de, ou wa amaneku kunijyuu ni fure shimeshi, mata sore o kakishimeshite itta,
"Perusha no ou Kurosu wa kou iu, 'Ten no kami, Shu wa chijou no kuniguni o kotogotoku watashi ni tamawatte, Shu no miya o Yuda ni aru Erusaremu ni tateru koto o watashi ni meijirareta. Anata gata no uchi, sono tami de aru mono wa mina, sono kami, Shu no tasuke o ete nobotte iki nasai' ".
Perusha ou Kurosu no gannen ni, Shu wa saki ni Eremiya no kuchi ni yotte tsutaerareta Shu no kotoba o jouju suru tame, Perusha ou Kurosu no kokoro o kandou sareta no de, ou wa zenkoku ni fukoku o hasshi, mata shousho o motte tsugete itta,
"Perusha ou Kurosu wa kono you ni iu, ten no kami, Shu wa chijou no kuniguni o kotogotoku watashi ni kudasatte, Shu no miya o Yuda ni aru Erusaremu ni tateru koto o watashi ni meijirareta.
Anata gata no uchi, sono tami de aru mono wa mina sono kami no tasuke o ete, Yuda ni aru Erusaremu ni nobotte iki, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no miya o fukkou seyo. Kare wa Erusaremu ni imasu kami de aru.
Subete ikinokotte, doko ni yadotte iru mono de mo, sono tokoro no hitobito wa kin, gin, kazai, kachiku o motte tasuke, sono hoka ni mata Erusaremu ni aru kami no miya no tame ni magokoro yori no sonaemono o sasageyo".
Soko de Yuda to Beniyamin no shizoku no chou, saishi oyobi Rebi bito nado, subete kami ni sono kokoro o kandou sareta mono wa, Erusaremu ni aru Shu no miya o fukkou suru tame ni nobotte ikou to tachiagatta.
Sono shuui no hitobito wa mina, gin no utsuwa, kin, kazai, kachiku oyobi takaramono o ataete karera o chikarazuke, sono hoka ni mata, moromoro no mono o oshige naku sasageta.
Kurosu ou wa mata Nebukadenezaru ga, saki ni Erusaremu kara tazusae dashite jibun no kami no miya ni osameta Shu no miya no utsuwa o toridashita.
Sunawachi Perusha ou Kurosu wa kura zukasa Miteredate no te ni yotte kore o toridashite, Yuda no tsukasa Seshibazaru ni kazoe watashita.
Sono kazu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Kin no tarai issen, gin no tarai issen, kouro nijuu kyuu,
Kin no hachi sanjuu, gin no hachi nisen yonhyaku juu, sono ta no utsuwa issen,
Kingin no utsuwa wa awasete gosen yonhyaku rokujuu kyuu attaga, Seshibazaru wa hoshuu o tsurete Babiron kara Erusaremu ni nobotta toki, korera no mono o kotogotoku tazusaete nobotta.
Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ni toraerarete, Babiron ni utsusareta mono no uchi, hoshuu o yurusarete Erusaremu oyobi Yuda ni nobotte, onoono jibun no machi ni kaetta kono shuu no hitobito wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Karera wa Zerubaberu, Eshua, Nehemiya, Seraya, Reeraya, Morudekai, Birushan, Misuparu, Biguwai, Rehomu, Baana to tomo ni kaette kita. Sono Isuraeru no tami no ninzuu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
