Miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi to Soromon no shimobetachi no shison to wa awasete sanbyaku kyuujuu ninin.
Tsugi ni ageru hitobito wa teru mera, Teru Haresa, kerubu, Adan oyobi Inmeru kara nobotte kita mono de attaga, karera wa sono shizoku to sono kettou to o shimeshite, sono Isuraeru no mono de aru koto o akiraka ni suru koto ga dekinakatta.
Sunawachi Deraya no shison, Tobiya no shison, Nekoda no shison de awasete roppyaku gojuu ninin.
Saishi no shison no uchi ni wa Habaya no shison, Hakkozu no shison, Barujirai no shison ga atta. Barujirai wa Gireade bito Barujirai no musumetachi no uchi kara tsuma o metotta no de, sono na de yobareru koto ni natta.
Korera no mono wa keifu ni notta monotachi no uchi ni jibun no na o tazunetaga miidasarenakatta no de, kegareta mono to shite, saishi no shoku kara nozokareta.
Soutoku wa karera ni tsugete, Urimu to tonmimu o mi ni tsukeru saishi no okoru made wa, ito sei naru mono o tabete wa naranai to itta.
Kaishuu wa awasete yon man nisen sanbyaku rokujuunin de atta.
Kono hoka ni, shimobe oyobi wa shi tame awasete nanasen sanbyaku sanjuu nananin, mata uta utau danjo nihyakunin atta.
Sono uma wa nanahyaku sanjuu rokutou, sono raba wa nihyaku yonjuu gotou,
Sono rakuda wa yonhyaku sanjuu gotou, sono roba wa rokusen nanahyaku nijuutou atta.
Shizoku no chousuunin wa Erusaremu ni aru Shu no miya no tokoro ni kita toki, kami no miya o moto no tokoro ni tateru tame ni magokoro yori no sonaemono o sasageta.
Sunawachi, sono chikara ni shitagatte kouji no tame ni kura ni osameta mono wa, kin roku man issen Dariku, gin gosen mina, saishi no ifuku hyaku kasane de atta.
Saishi, Rebi bi to, oyobi tami no aru mono wa Erusaremu oyobi sono kinkou ni sumi, uta utau mono, mon'ei oyobi miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi wa sono machimachi ni sumi, ippan no Isuraeru bi to wa jibuntachi no machimachi ni sunda.
Kou shite Isuraeru no hitobito wa sono machimachi ni sunde itaga, nana gatsu ni natte, tami wa hitori no you ni Erusaremu ni atsumatta.
Soko de Yozadaku no ko Eshua to sono nakama no saishitachi, oyobi Sharuteru no ko Zerubaberu to sono kyoudaitachi wa tatte, Isuraeru no kami no saidan o kizuita. Kore wa kami no hito Moose no rippou ni shirusareta tokoro ni shitagatte, sono ue ni hansai o sasageru tame de atta.
Karera wa kuniguni no tami o osorete ita no de, saidan o moto no tokoro ni mouketa. Soshite sono ue de hansai o Shu ni sasage, asayuu sore o sasageta.
Mata, shirusareta tokoro ni shitagatte kariho no matsuri o okonai, okite ni shitagatte, mainichi sasagubeki kazu no toori ni, hibi no hansai o sasageta.
Soshite sono nochi wa jouhansai, shingetsu to Shu no subete sadamerareta matsuri to ni sasageru sonaemono oyobi kakuji ga Shu ni sasageru magokoro yori no sonaemono o sasageta.
Sunawachi nana gatsu tsuitachi kara hansai o Shu ni sasageru koto o hajimetaga, Shu no miya no kiso wa mada sueraretenakatta.
Soko de ishiku to mokkou ni kane o watashi, mata Shidon to Tsuro no hitobito ni kuimono, nomimono oyobi abura o ataete, Perusha ou Kurosu kara eta kyoka ni shitagatte, Rebanon kara Yoppa no umi ni kouhaku o hakobaseta.
Sate Erusaremu no kami no miya ni kaetta tsugi no nen no ni gatsu ni, Sharuteru no ko Zerubaberu to Yozadaku no ko Eshua wa sono kyoudai de aru ta no saishi, Rebi bi to oyobi hoshuu kara Erusaremu ni kaette kita subete no hitobito to tomo ni kouji o hajime, nijuusai ijou no Rebi bito o tatete, Shu no miya no kouji o kantoku saseta.
Soko de Yuda no shison de aru Eshua to sono kora oyobi sono kyoudai, Kademieru to sono kora wa tomo ni tatte, kami no miya de kouji o nasu mono o kantoku shita. Henadade no kora oyobi Rebi bito no kora to, sono kyoudaitachi mo mata issho de atta.
Kou shite kenchikusha ga Shu no miya no kiso o sueta toki, saishitachi wa reifuku o tsukete rappa o tori, Asafu no kora de aru Rebi bi to wa Shinbaru o tori, Isuraeru no ou Dabide no shirei ni shitagatte Shu osan bi shita.
Karera wa tagai ni utai atte Shu o home, katsu kansha shi, "Shu wa megumi fukaku, sono itsukushimi wa tokoshie ni Isuraeru ni taeru koto ga nai" to itta. Soshite tami wa mina Shu osan bi suru toki, oogoe o agete sakenda. Shu no miya no kiso ga sueraretakara de aru.
Shikashi saishi, Rebi bi to, shizoku no chou de aru ooku no hitobito no uchi ni, moto no miya o mita roujintachi ga attaga, ima kono miya no kiso no suerareru no o mita toki, oogoe o agete naita. Mata yorokobi no tame ni koe o agete sakebu mono mo ookatta.
Sore de, hitobito wa tami no yorokobisakebu koe to, tami no naku koe to o kikiwakeru koto ga dekinakatta. Tami ga oogoe ni sakenda no de, sono koe ga tooku made kikoetakara de aru.
Yuda to Beniyamin no teki de aru monotachi wa hoshuu kara kaette kita hitobito ga, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no tame ni shinden o tatete iru koto o kiki,
Zerubaberu to shizoku no choutachi no moto ni kite itta, "Wareware mo, anata gata to issho ni kore o tatesasete kudasai. Wareware wa anata gata to onajiku, anata gata no kami o reihai shimasu. ASsuriya no ou esaru hadon ga wareware o koko ni tsurete kita hi kara konokata, wareware wa kare ni gisei o sasagete kimashita".
Shikashi Zerubaberu, Eshua oyobi sono ta no Isuraeru no shizoku no choutachi wa, karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa, wareware no kami ni miya o tateru koto ni azukatte wa narimasen. Perusha no ou Kurosu ou ga wareware ni meijita you ni, wareware dake de, Isuraeru no kami, Shu no tame ni tateru no desu".
Soko de sono chi no tami wa Yuda no tami no te o yowarasete, sono kenchiku o samatage,
Sono kuwadate o yaburu tame ni yakunin o baishuu shite karera ni tekiseshime, Perusha ou Kurosu no yo kara Perusha ou Dariyosu no chisei ni made oyonda.
Ahasuerosu no chisei, sunawachi sono chisei no hajime ni, karera wa Yuda to Erusaremu no juumin o uttaeru kokusojou o kaita.
Mata Arutashasuta no yo ni Bishiramu, Miteredate, Tabieru oyobi sono ta no douryou mo, Perusha ou Arutashasuta ni tegami o kaita. Sono tegami no bun wa Aramu go de kakarete yakusarete ita.
Choukan Rehomu to shokikan Shimushai wa Arutashasuta ou ni Erusaremu o uttaete tsugi no you na tegami o shitatameta.
Sunawachi choukan Rehomu to shokikan Shimushai oyobi sono ta no douryou, sunawachi saibankan, chiji, yakunin, Perushahito, Ereku no hitobito, Babironhito, Susa no hitobito sunawachi Eramu bi to,
Oyobi sono ta no tami sunawachi ooinaru tattoi Osunaparu ga, utsushite Samariya no machimachi oyobi kawamukou no sono ta no chi ni sumaseta monodomo ga,
Okutta tegami no utsushi wa kore de aru. - - "Arutashasuta ou e, kawamukou no anata no shimobedomo, aisatsu o moushiagemasu.
Ou yo, goshouchi kudasai. Anata no moto kara, watashitachi no tokoro ni nobotte kita Yudayahitora wa Erusaremu ni kite, kano somuita warui machi o tatenaoshi, sono jouheki o kizukiage, sono kiso o tsukurotte imasu.
Ou yo, ima goshouchi kudasai. Moshi kono machi o tate, jouheki o kizukiagerunaraba, karera wa mitsugi, kanzei, zeikin o osamenaku narimasu. Sou sureba ou no shuunyuu ga herudeshou.
Wareware wa oukyuu no shio o hamu mono desukara, ou no fumeiyo o miru ni shinobinai no de, hito o tsukawashite ou ni okikase suru no desu.
Rekidai no kiroku o oshirabe kudasai. Sono kiroku no sho ni oite, kono machi wa somuita machi de, shoou to shoshuu ni gai o oyoboshita mono de aru koto o mi, sono naka ni korai, muhon no okonawareta koto o shirarerudeshou. Kono machi ga horobosareta no wa kore ga tame na no desu.
Wareware wa ou ni ooshirase itashimasu. Moshi kono machi ga taterare, jouheki ga kizukiageraretanara, ou wa kawamukou no ryouchi o ushinau ni itarudeshou".
Ou wa hensho o okutte itta, "Choukan Rehomu, shokikan Shimushai, sono taSamariya oyobi kawamukou no hoka no tokoro ni sunde iru douryou ni, aisatsu o suru. Ima,
Anata gata ga wareware ni okutta tegami o, watashi no mae ni akiraka ni yomaseta.
Watashi wa meirei o kudashite chousa saseta tokoro, kono machi wa korai, shoou ni somuita koto, sono naka ni hanran, muhon no atta koto o miidashita.
Mata Erusaremu ni wa ooinaru outachi ga atte, kawamukou no chi o kotogotoku osame, mitsugi, kanzei, zeikin o osamesaseta koto mo atta.
Sore de anata gata wa meirei o tsutaete, sono hitobito o todome, watashi no meirei no kudaru made, kono machi o tatesasete wa naranai.
Anata gata wa tsutsushinde kono koto ni tsuite okotaru koto no nai you ni shi nasai. Dou shite songai o mashite, ou ni gai o oyoboshite yokarou ka".
Arutashasuta ou no tegami no utsushi ga Rehomu oyobi shokikan Shimushai to sono douryou no mae ni yomiagerareta no de, karera wa isoide Erusaremu no Yudayahito no moto ni omomuki, wanryoku to kenryoku to o motte karera o yamesaseta.
Sore de Erusaremu ni aru kami no miya no kouji wa chuushi sareta. Sunawachi Perusha ou Dariyosu no chisei no ni nen made chuushi sareta.
Sate yogensha Hagai oyobi Ido no ko Zekariya no futari no yogensha wa, Yuda to Erusaremu ni iru Yudayahito ni mukatte, karera no ue ni imasu Isuraeru no kami no na ni yotte yogen shita.
Soko de Sharuteru no ko Zerubaberu oyobi Yozadaku no ko Eshua wa tachiagatte, Erusaremu ni aru kami no miya o tate hajimeta. Kami no yogensha tachi mo, karera to tomo ni ite karera o tasuketa.
Sono toki, kawamukou no shuu no chiji Tatenai oyobi setaru bozunai to sono douryou wa karera no tokoro ni kite kou itta, "Dare ga anata gata ni kono miya o tate, kono jouheki o kizukiageru koto o meijita no ka".
Mata "Kono tatemono o tatete iru hitobito no na wa nan to iu no ka" to tazuneta.
Shikashi Yudayahito no chouroutachi no ue ni wa, kami no me ga sosogarete ita no de, karera wa kore o yamesaseru koto ga dekizu, sono koto o Dariyosu ni soushite, sono hentou no kuru no o matta.
Kawamukou no shuu no chiji Tatenai oyobi setaru bozunai to sono douryou de aru kawamukou no shuu no chijitachi ga, Dariyosu ou ni okutta tegami no utsushi wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Sunawachi, karera ga ou ni okutta tegami ni wa, tsugi no you ni shirusarete atta. "Negawaku wa Dariyosu ou ni mattaki heian ga aru you ni.
Ou ni tsugi no koto o ooshirase itashimasu. Sunawachi, wareware ga Yudaya shuu e iki, kano ooinaru kami no miya e itte mita tokoro, sore wa ookina ishi o motte taterare, zaimoku o kunde kabe o tsukuri, sono kouji wa kinben ni okonaware, karera no te ni yotte ooini hakadotte imasu.
Soko de wareware wa sono chouroutachi ni tazunete kou iimashita, 'Dare ga anata gata ni kono miya o tate, kono jouheki o kizukiageru koto o meijita no ka' to.
Wareware wa mata karera no kashira taru hitobito no na o kakishirushite, anata ni ooshirase suru tame ni, sono na o tazunemashita.
Suruto, karera wa wareware ni kotaete kou iimashita, 'Wareware wa tenchi no kami no shimobe de atte, toshi hisashii mukashi ni taterareta miya o, futatabi tateru no desu. Kore wa moto, Isuraeru no ooinaru ou no tate ageta mono desuga,
Wareware no senzotachi ga, ten no kami no ikari o hikiokoshita tame, kami wa karera o, Karudeya bito Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no te ni watasareta no de, kare wa kono miya o kowashi, tami o Babiron ni toraete ikimashita.
Tokoro ga Babiron no ou Kurosu no gannen ni, Kurosu ou wa kami no kono miya o futatabi tateru koto no meirei o kudasaremashita.
Mata Kurosu ou wa saki ni Nebukadenezaru ga, Erusaremu no miya kara Babiron no shinden ni utsushita kami no miya no kingin no utsuwa o, Babiron no shinden kara toridashite, kare ga soutoku ni ninjita Seshibazaru to iu na no mono ni watashite,
Kare ni iwaremashita, "Korera no utsuwa o tazusaete itte, Erusaremu ni aru miya ni osame, kami no miya o moto no tokoro ni tateyo" to.
Soko de kono Seshibazaru wa kite Erusaremu ni aru kami no miya no kiso o suemashita. Sono toki kara ima ni itaru made, kenchiku o tsuzukete imasuga, mada kansei shinai no desu' to.
Sore de ima, moshi ou ga yoshi to mirarerunaraba, Babiron ni aru ou no houko o shirabete, Erusaremu no kami no kono miya o tateru koto no meirei ga, hatashite Kurosu ou kara dete iru ka dou ka o tashikame, kono koto ni tsuite no ou no okangae o wareware ni tsutaete kudasai".
Soko de Dariyosu ou wa mei o kudashite, Babiron no uchi de, komonjo o osamete aru shoko o shirabesaseta tokoro,
Medeya shuu no miyako Ekubatana de, hitotsu no makimono o miidashita. Sono uchi ni kou shirusarete aru. "Kiroku.
Kurosu ou no gannen ni Kurosu ou wa mei o kudashita, 'Erusaremu ni aru kami no miya ni tsuite wa, gisei o sasage, hansai o sonaeru tokoro no miya o tate, sono miya no takasa o rokujuu kyubito ni shi, sono haba o rokujuu kyubito ni seyo.
Ooinaru ishi no sou o san dan ni shi, ki no sou o ichi dan ni seyo. Sono hiyou wa ou no ie kara ataerareru.
Mata Nebukadenezaru ga, Erusaremu no miya kara Babiron ni utsushita kami no miya no kingin no utsuwamono wa, kore o kaeshite, Erusaremu ni aru miya no moto no tokoro ni motte iki, kore o kami no miya ni osameyo' ".
"Sore de kawamukou no shuu no chiji Tatenai oyobi setaru bozunai to sono douryou de aru kawamukou no shuu no chijitachi yo, anata gata wa kore ni toozakari,
Kami no kono miya no kouji o karera ni makase, Yudayahito no chiji to Yudayahito no chouroutachi ni, kami no kono miya o moto no tokoro ni tatesase yo.
Watashi wa mata mei o kudashi, kami no kono miya o tateru koto ni tsuite, anata gata ga korera no Yudayahito no chouroutachi ni nasubeki koto o shimesu. Ou no zaisan, sunawachi kawamukou no shuu kara osameru mitsugi no naka kara, sono hiyou o juubun sorera no hitobito ni ataete, sono kouji o todokooranai you ni seyo.
Mata sono hitsuyou to suru mono, sunawachi ten no kami ni sasageru hansai no koushi, ohitsuji oyobi kohitsuji narabi ni mugi, shio, sake, abura nado Erusaremu ni iru saishitachi no motome ni shitagatte, hibi okotari naku karera ni atae,
Karera ni koubashii gisei o ten no kami ni sasagesase, ou to oujitachi no chouju o inorase yo.
Watashi wa mata mei o kudasu. Dare de mo kono meizuru tokoro o aratameru mono ga arunaraba, sono ie no hari wa nukitorare, kare wa sono ue ni kugizuke ni sare, sono ie wa mata, kore ga tame ni obutsu no yama to sarerude arou.
Kore o aratameyou to suru mono, aruiha Erusaremu ni aru kami no kono miya o horobosou to shite te o dasu ou aruiha tami wa, kashiko ni sono na o todomerareru kami yo, negawaku wa kore o taosareru you ni. Ware Dariyosu wa mei o kudasu. Kokoro shite kore o okonae".
Dariyosu ou ga kou iiokutta no de, kawamukou no shuu no chiji Tatenai oyobi setaru bozunai to sono douryoutachi wa kokoro shite kore o okonatta.
Soshite Yudayahito no chouroutachi wa, yogensha Hagai oyobi Ido no ko Zekariya no yogen ni yotte tate, kore o nashitogeta. Karera wa Isuraeru no kami no meirei ni yori, mata Kurosu, Dariyosu oyobi Perusha ou Arutashasuta no mei ni yotte, kore o tate owatta.
Kono miya wa Dariyosu ou no chisei no roku nen Adaru no tsuki no mikka ni kansei shita.
Soko de Isuraeru no hitobito, saishitachi, Rebi bi to oyobi sono ta no hoshuu kara kaetta hitobito wa, yorokonde kami no kono miya no houken shiki o okonatta.
Sunawachi kami no kono miya no houken shiki ni oite, oushi ichi hyakutou, ohitsuji nihyakutou, kohitsuji yonhyakutou o sasage, mata Isuraeru no buzoku no kazu ni shitagatte, o yagi juu nitou o sasagete, subete no Isuraeru bito no tame no zaisai to shita.
Mata Moose no sho ni shirusarete aru you ni saishi o kumi betsu ni yori, Rebi bito o han betsu ni yotte tate, Erusaremu de kami ni tsukaesaseta.
Kou shite hoshuu kara kaette kita hitobito wa, shougatsu no juu yonka ni sugikoshi no matsuri o okonatta.
Sunawachi saishi, Rebi bitotachi wa tomo ni mi o kiyomete mina kiyoku nari, subete hoshuu kara kaette kita hitobito no tame, sono kyoudai de aru saishitachi no tame, mata karera jishin no tame ni sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofutta.
Soshite hoshuu kara kaette kita Isuraeru no hitobito, oyobi sono chi no ihoujin no kegare o sutete karera ni tsuranari, Isuraeru no kami, Shu o haishiyou to suru mono wa subete kore o tabe,
Yorokonde nanuka no aida, tane irenu pan no matsuri o okonatta. Kore wa Shu ga karera o yorokobase, mata ASsuriya no ou no kokoro o karera ni mukawase, kare ni Isuraeru no kami ni imasu kami no miya no kouji o tasukesaseraretakara de aru.
Korera no koto no nochi Perusha ou Arutashasuta no chisei ni Ezura to iu mono ga atta. Ezura wa Seraya no ko, Seraya wa Azariya no ko, Azariya wa Hirukiya no ko,
Hirukiya wa Sharumu no ko, Sharumu wa Zadoku no ko, Zadoku wa Ahitobu no ko,
Ahitobu wa Amariya no ko, Amariya wa Azariya no ko, Azariya wa Merayote no ko,
Merayote wa Zerahiya no ko, Zerahiya wa Uji no ko, Uji wa BuKki no ko,
BuKki wa Abishua no ko, Abishua wa Pinehasu no ko, Pinehasu wa Ereazaru no ko, Ereazaru wa saishichou Aron no ko de aru.
Kono Ezura wa Babiron kara nobotte kita. Kare wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga osazuke ni natta Moose no rippou ni seitsuu shita gakusha de atta. Sono kami, Shu no te ga kare no ue ni atta no de, sono motomeru koto o ou wa kotogotoku yurushita.
Arutashasuta ou no nana nen ni mata Isuraeru no hitobito oyobi saishi, Rebi bi to, uta utau mono, mon'ei, miya ni tsukaeru shimobe nado Erusaremu ni nobotta.
Soshite ou no nana nen no go gatsu ni Ezura wa Erusaremu ni kita.
Sunawachi shougatsu no tsuitachi ni Babiron o shuttatsu shite, go gatsu tsuitachi ni Erusaremu ni tsuita. Sono kami no megumi no te ga kare no ue ni attakara de aru.
Ezura wa kokoro o komete Shu no rippou o shirabe, kore o okonai, katsu Isuraeru no uchi ni sadame to okite to o oshieta.
Shu no imashime no kotoba, oyobi Isuraeru ni tamawatta sadame ni tsuujita gakusha de, saishi de aru Ezura ni Arutashasuta ou no ataeta tegami no utsushi wa, tsugi no toori de aru.
"Shoou no ou Arutashasuta, ten no kami no rippou no gakusha de aru saishi Ezura ni okuru. Ima,
Watashi wa mei o kudasu. Waga kuni no uchi ni iru Isuraeru no tami oyobi sono saishi, Rebi bito no uchi, subete Erusaremu e ikou to nozomu mono wa mina, anata to tomo ni iku koto ga dekiru.
Anata wa, jibun no te ni aru anata no kami no rippou ni tera shite, Yuda to Erusaremu no jijou o shiraberu tame ni, ou oyobi nananin no gikan ni yotte tsukawasareru no de aru.
Katsu anata wa ou oyobi sono gikanra ga, Erusaremu ni imasu Isuraeru no kami ni magokoro kara sasageru gin to kin o tazusae,
Mata Babiron zenshuu de anata ga eru subete no kingin, oyobi tami to saishi to ga, Erusaremu ni aru sono kami no miya no tame ni, magokoro kara sasageta sonaemono o tazusaete iku.
Sore de anata wa sono kane o motte oushi, ohitsuji, kohitsuji oyobi sono sosai to kansai no shinajina o ki o tsukete kai, Erusaremu ni aru anata gata no kami no miya no saidan no ue ni, kore o sasagenakereba naranai.
Mata, anata to anata no kyoudaitachi ga, sono amatta kingin de shiyou to omou yoi koto ga arunaraba, anata gata no kami no mimune ni shitagatte sore o okonae.
Mata anata no kami no miya no tsutome koto no tame ni anata ga ataerareta utsuwa wa, Erusaremu no kami no mae ni osameyo.
Sono hoka anata no kami no miya no tame ni mochi u beki hitsuyou na mono ga areba, sore o ou no kura kara dashite mochii yo.
Ware, Arutashasuta ou wa kawamukou no shuu no subete no kura zukasa ni mei o kudashite iu, 'Ten no kami no rippou no gakusha de aru saishi Ezura ga anata gata ni motomeru koto wa, subete kore o kokoro shite okonae.
Sunawachi gin wa hyaku taranto made, komugi wa hyaku koru made, budoushu wa hyaku bate made, abura wa hyaku bate made, shio wa seigen naku atae yo.
Ten no kami no miya no tame ni, ten no kami no meijiru tokoro wa, subete tadashiku kore o okonae. Sou shinai to kami no ikari ga, ou to ou no kora no kuni ni nozomude arou'.
Wareware wa, mata anata gata ni tsugeru, 'Saishi, Rebi bi to, uta utau mono, mon'ei, miya ni tsukaeru shimobe, oyobi kami no kono miya no tsukae bitotachi ni wa, mitsugi, sozei, zeikin o kashite wa naranu'.
Ezura yo, anata wa anata no te ni aru kami no chie ni yotte, tsukasa oyobi saibannin o tate, kawamukou no shuu no subete no tami, sunawachi anata no kami no rippou o shitte iru monotachi o, kotogotoku sabakase yo. Anata gata wa mata kore o shiranai mono o oshie yo.
Anata no kami no rippou oyobi ou no rippou o mamoranai mono o, kibishiku sono tsumi ni sadamete, aruiha shikei ni, aruiha tsuihou ni, aruiha zaisan bosshuu ni, aruiha tougoku ni shoseyo".
Wareware no senzo no kami, Shu wa ho mubeki ka na. Shu wa kono you ni, ou no kokoro ni, Erusaremu ni aru Shu no miya o kazaru kokoro o okosase,
Mata ou no mae to, sono gikan no mae to ou no daijin no mae de, watashi ni megumi o esaserareta. Watashi wa waga kami, Shu no te ga watashi no ue ni aru no de chikara o e, Isuraeru no uchi kara shuryou taru hitobito o atsumete, watashi to tomo ni noboraseta.
Arutashasuta ou no chisei ni, Babiron kara watashi to issho ni nobotte kita mono no shizoku no chou, oyobi sono keifu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Pinehasu no shison no uchi de wa Gerushomu. Itamaru no shison no uchi de wa Danieru. Dabide no shison no uchi de wa Shikaniya no ko Hattoshi.
Paroshi no shison no uchi de wa Zekariya oyobi kare to tomo ni keifu ni noserareta otoko hyaku gojuunin.
Pahate Moabu no shison no uchi de wa Zerahiya no ko Eriyoenai oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko nihyakunin.
Zattsu no shison no uchi de wa Yahajieru no ko Shikaniya oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko sanbyakunin.
Aden no shison no uchi de wa Yonatan no ko Ebede oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko gojuunin.
Eramu no shison no uchi de wa Atariya no ko Esaya oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko nanajuunin.
Shipateya no shison no uchi de wa Mikaeru no ko Zebadeya oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko hachijuunin.
Yoabu no shison no uchi de wa Ehieru no ko Obadeya oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko nihyaku juu hachinin.
Bani no shison no uchi de wa Yoshipia no ko Shiromite oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko hyaku rokujuunin.
Bebai no shison no uchi de wa Bebai no ko Zekariya oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko nijuu hachinin.
Azugade no shison no uchi de wa HaKkatan no ko Yohanan oyobi kare to tomo ni aru otoko hyaku juunin.
Adonikamu no shison no uchi de wa nochi ni kita monodomo de, sono na wa Eriperete, Yueru, Shimaya oyobi karera to tomo ni aru otoko rokujuunin.
Biguwai no shison no uchi de wa Utai to Zakkuru oyobi karera to tomo ni aru otoko nanajuunin de aru.
Watashi wa karera o Ahawa ni nagareru kawa no hotori ni atsumete, soko ni mikka no aida roei shita. Watashi wa tami to saishi to o shirabetaga, soko ni wa Rebi no shison wa hitori mo inakatta no de,
Hito o tsukawashite Eriezeru, Arieru, Shimaya, Erunatan, Yaribu, Erunatan, Natan, Zekariya, Meshuramu to iu kubichou taru hitobito o maneki, mata Yoyaribu, oyobi Erunatan no you na kenshiki no aru hitobito o maneita.
Soshite watashi wa Kashipia to iu tokoro no shuchou Ido no moto ni karera o tsukawashi, Kashipia to iu tokoro ni iru Ido to, sono kyoudai de aru miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi ni tsugubeki kotoba o, karera ni sazuke, wareware no kami no miya no tame ni, tsukae hito o wareware ni tsurete koi to itta.
Wareware no kami ga yoku wareware o tasukerareta no de, karera wa Isuraeru no ko, Rebi no ko, Maheri no shison no uchi no shiryo fukai hito, sunawachi Serebiya oyobi sono kora to sono kyoudaitachi juu hachinin o, wareware ni tsurete ki,
Mata Hashabiya oyobi kare to tomo ni, Merari no shison no Esaya to sono kyoudai oyobi sono kora nijuunin,
Oyobi miya ni tsukaeru shimobe, sunawachi Dabide to sono tsukasatachi ga, Rebi bito ni tsukaesaseru tame ni eranda miya ni tsukaeru shimobe nihyaku nijuunin o tsurete kita. Korera no mono wa mina sono na o itte kiroku sareta.
Soko de watashi wa, kashiko no Ahawa kawa no hotori de danjiki o fukoku shi, wareware no kami no mae de mi o hikuku shi, wareware to, wareware no osanaki mono to, wareware no subete no kazai no tame ni, tadashii michi o shimesareru you ni kami ni motometa.
Kore wa, wareware ga saki ni ou ni tsugete, "Wareware no kami no te wa, kami o motomeru subete no mono no ue ni yasashiku kudari, sono iryoku to ikari to wa subete kami o suteru mono no ue ni kudaru" to itta no de, watashi wa douchuu no teki ni taishite, wareware o mamorubeki hohei to kihei to o, ou ni tanomu koto o hajitakara de aru.
Soko de wareware wa danjiki shite, kono koto o wareware no kami ni motometa tokoro, kami wa sono negai o kikiirerareta.
Watashi wa omo datta saishi juu ninin sunawachi Serebiya, Hashabiya oyobi sono kyoudai juunin o erabi,
Kingin oyobi utsuwamono, sunawachi ou to, sono gikan to, sono shokou oyobi subete zairyuu no Isuraeru bito ga, wareware no kami no miya no tame ni sasageta hounoubutsu o hakatte karera ni watashita.
Watashi ga hakatte karera no te ni watashita mono wa, gin roppyaku gojuu taranto, gin no utsuwa hyaku taranto, kin hyaku taranto de atta.
Mata kin no oosakazuki ga nijuu atte, issen Dariku ni ataru. Mata hikarikagayaku seidou no utsuwa niko atte, sono tattoi kotokin no you de aru.
Soshite watashi wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa Shu ni seibetsu sareta mono de aru. Kono utsuwamono mo sei de aru. Mata kono kingin wa, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu ni sasageta magokoro yori no sonaemono de aru.
Anata gata wa Erusaremu de, Shu no miya no heya no naka de, saishichou, Rebi bi to oyobi Isuraeru no shizoku no kashiratachi no mae de, kore o hakaru made, mihari, katsu mamori nasai".
Soko de saishi oyobi Rebi bitotachi wa, sono kingin oyobi utsuwamono o, Erusaremu ni aru wareware no kami no miya ni tazusaete iku tame, sono omosa no mono o uketotta.
Wareware wa shougatsu no juu ni nichi ni, Ahawa gawa o shuttatsu shite Erusaremu ni mukattaga, wareware no kami no te wa, wareware no ue ni atte, teki no te oyobi michi ni machibuse suru mono no te kara, wareware o sukuwareta.
Wareware wa Erusaremu ni tsuite, mikka soko ni itaga,
Yonkame ni wareware no kami no miya no uchi de, sono kingin oyobi utsuwamono o, Uriya no ko saishi Meremote no te ni hakatte watashita. Pinehasu no ko Ereazaru ga kare to tomo ni ita. Mata Eshua no ko Yozabade, oyobi Binnui no ko Noadeya no futari no Rebi bito mo, karera to tomo ni ita.
Sunawachi sono subete no kazu to omosa to o shirabe, sono omosa wa mina kakitomerareta.
Sono toki hoshuu no hitobito de hoshuu kara kaette kita mono wa, Isuraeru no kami ni hansai o sasageta. Sunawachi Isuraeru zentai no tame ni oushi juu nitou, ohitsuji kyuujuu rokutou, kohitsuji nanajuu nanatou o sasage, mata zaisai to shite o yagi juu nitou o sasageta. Korera wa mina, Shu ni sasageta hansai de aru.
Karera wa mata ou no meireisho o, ou no soutokutachi, oyobi kawamukou no shuu no chijitachi ni watashita no de, karera wa tami to kami no miya to o enjo shita.
Korera no koto ga nasareta nochi, tsukasatachi wa, watashi no moto ni kite itta, "Isuraeru no tami, saishi oyobi Rebi bi to wa shokoku no tami to hanarenaide, Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Periji bi to, Ebusu bi to, Anmon bi to, Moabu bi to, Ejiputo bi to, Amori bito nado no nikumubeki koto o okonaimashita.
Sunawachi, karera no musumetachi o mizukara metori, mata sono musukotachi ni metotta no de, sei naru tane ga shokoku no tami to majirimashita. Soshite tsukasa taru mono, choutaru mono ga sakidatte, kono toga o okashimashita".
Watashi wa kono koto o kiita toki, kimono to uwagi to o saki, kaminoke to hige o nuki, odorokiakirete suwatta.
Isuraeru no kami no kotoba ni ononoku mono wa mina, hoshuu kara kaette kita hitobito no toga no yue ni, watashi no moto ni atsumattaga, watashi wa yuu no sonaemono no toki made, odorokiakirete suwatta.
Yuu no sonaemono no toki ni natte, watashi wa danjiki kara tachiagari, kimono to uwagi o saita mama, hiza o kagamete, waga kami, Shu ni mukatte te o sashinobete,
Itta, "Waga kami yo, watashi wa anata ni mukatte kao o ageru no o hajite, sekimen shimasu. Wareware no fugi wa tsutte atama yori mo takaku nari, wareware no toga wa kasanatte ten ni tasshitakara desu.
Wareware no senzo no hi kara konnichi made, wareware wa ooinaru toga o oi, wareware no fugi ni yotte, wareware to wareware no outachi, oyobi saishitachi wa kuniguni no outachi no te ni watasare, tsurugi ni kakerare, torae yukare, kasumerare, haji o koumurimashita. Konnichi no toori desu.
Tokoro ga ima, wareware no kami, Shu wa, shibashi megumi o hodokoshite, nogare nokorubeki mono o wareware no uchi ni oki, sono seijo no uchi ni tashika na yoridokoro o atae, kou shite wareware no kami wa wareware no me o akiraka ni shi, wareware o sono dorei no uchi ni atte, sukoshiku ikikaeraseraremashita.
Wareware wa dorei no mi de arimasuga, sono dorei taru toki ni mo kami wa wareware o misuterarezu, kaette Perusha outachi no me no mae de itsukushimi o hodokoshite, wareware o ikikaerase, wareware no kami no miya o tatesase, sono hakai o tsukurowase, Yuda to Erusaremu de wareware ni hogo o ataeraremashita.
Wareware no kami yo, kono nochi, nani o iu koto ga dekimashou. Wareware wa, anata no imashime o sutetakara desu.
Anata wa katsute, anata no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte meijite ooseraremashita, 'Omaetachi ga itte eyou to suru chi wa, kakuchi no tami no kegare ni yori, sono nikumubeki waza ni yotte kegareta chi de, kono hate kara, kano hate made, sono kegare ni michite iru.
Sore de omaetachi no musume o, karera no musuko ni ataete wa naranai. Karera no musume o, omaetachi no musuko ni metotte wa naranai. Mata eikyuu ni karera no heian o mo fukushi o mo motomete wa naranai. Sou sureba omaetachi wa tsuyoku nari, sono chi no yoki mono o tabe, kore o eikyuu ni omaetachi no shison ni tsutaete shigyou to saseru koto ga dekiru' to.
Wareware no warui okonai ni yori, ooinaru toga ni yotte, korera subete no koto ga, sudeni wareware ni nozomimashitaga, wareware no kami naru anata wa, wareware no fugi yori mo karui batsu o kudashite, kono you ni nokori no mono o ataete kudasatta no o minagara,
Wareware wa futatabi anata no meirei o yabutte, korera no nikumubeki waza o okonau tami to fuchi o musunde yoideshou ka. Anata wa wareware o ikatte, tsuini horoboshi tsukushi, nokoru mono mo, nogareru mono mo nai you ni sareru no de wa naideshou ka.
Aa, Isuraeru no kami, Shu yo, anata wa tadashiku iraseraremasu. Wareware wa nogarete nokoru koto konnichi no toori desu. Wareware wa, toga o motte anata no mae ni arimasu. Sore yue dare mo anata no mae ni tatsu koto wa dekimasen".
Ezura ga kami no miya no mae ni nakifushite inori, katsu zange shite ita toki, otoko, onna oyobi kodomo no ooinaru gunshuu ga Isuraeru no uchi kara kare no moto ni atsumatte kita. Tami wa itaku nakikanashinda.
Toki ni Eramu no shison no uchi no Ehieru no ko Shikaniya ga, Ezura ni tsugete itta, "Wareware wa kami ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, kono chi no tami kara ihou no onna o metorimashita. Shikashi, kono koto ni tsuite wa Isuraeru ni, ima na onozomi ga arimasu.
Sore de wareware wa waga Shu no oshie to, wareware no kami no meirei ni ononoku hitobito no oshie to ni shitagatte, korera no tsuma narabi ni sono kotomotachi o, kotogotoku oidasu to iu keiyaku o, wareware no kami ni tatemashou. Soshite rippou ni shitagatte kore o okonaimashou.
Tachiagatte kudasai, kono koto wa anata no shigoto desu. Wareware wa anata o tasukemasu. Kokoro o tsuyoku shite kore o okonai nasai".
Ezura wa tatte, omo datta saishi, Rebi bi to oyobi subete no Isuraeru bito ni, kono kotoba no you ni okonau koto o chikawaseta no de, karera wa chikatta.
Ezura wa kami no miya no mae kara dete, Eriashibu no ko Yohanan no heya ni haittaga, soko e itte mo kare wa pan mo tabezu, mizu mo nomazu ni yoru o sugoshita. Kore wa kare ga, hoshuu kara kaetta hitobito no toga o nageitakara de aru.
Soshite Yuda oyobi Erusaremu ni amaneku fukoku o dashi, hoshuu kara kaetta subete no mono ni tsugete, Erusaremu ni atsumarubeki koto to,
Tsu ka sa oyobi chouroutachi no satoshi ni shitagatte, mikka no uchi ni konai mono wa dare de mo sono zaisan wa kotogotoku bosshuu sare, sono hito jishin wa toraware bito no kai kara hamon sareru to itta.
Soko de Yuda to Beniyamin no hitobito wa mina mikka no uchi ni Erusaremu ni atsumatta. Kore wa kyuu gatsu no hatsuka de atta. Subete no tami wa kami no miya no mae no hiroba ni zashite, kono koto no tame, mata ooame no tame ni furueononoite ita.
Toki ni saishi Ezura wa tatte karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa tsumi o okashi, ihou no onna o metotte, Isuraeru no toga o mashita.
Sore de ima, anata gata no senzo no kami, Shu ni zange shite, sono mimune o okonai nasai. Anata gata wa kono chi no tami oyobi ihou no onna to hanare nasai".
Suruto kaishuu wa mina oogoe o agete kotaeta, "Anata no iwareta toori, wareware wa kanarazu okonaimasu.
Shikashi tami wa ooku, mata ooame no kisetsu desukara, soto ni tatte iru koto wa dekimasen. Mata kore wa tsuitachi ya futsu ka no shigoto de wa arimasen. Wareware wa kono koto ni tsuite ooini tsumi o okashitakara desu.
Sore de douzo, wareware no tsukasatachi wa zenkaishuu no tame ni tatte kudasai. Wareware no machi no uchi ni, moshi ihou no onna o metotta mono ga arunaraba, mina sadame no toki ni kosase nasai. Mata onoono no machi no chourou oyobi saibannin mo, sore to issho ni kosase nasai. Sou sureba kono koto ni yoru wareware no kami no hageshii ikari wa, tsuini wareware o hanarerudeshou".
Tokoro ga Asaheru no ko Yonatan oyobi Tekuwa no ko Yahajia wa kore ni hantai shita. Soshite Meshuramu oyobi Rebi bi to Shabetai wa karera o shiji shita.
Soko de hoshuu kara kaette kita hitobito wa kono you ni itta. Sunawachi saishi Ezura wa, shizoku no choutachi o sono shizoku ni shitagai, onoono sono na o sashite eranda. Karera wa juu gatsu no tsuitachi kara zashite kono koto o shirabe,
Shougatsu no tsuitachi ni natte, ihou no onna o metotta hitobito o kotogotoku shirabe owatta.
Saishi no shison no uchi de ihou no onna o metotta koto no arawareta mono wa, Yozadaku no ko Eshua no kora, oyobi sono kyoudaitachi no uchi de wa Maaseya, Eriezeru, Yaribu, Gedariya de atta.
Karera wa sono tsuma o rien shiyou to iu chikai o nashi, sudeni tsumi o okashita to iu no de, sono toga no tame ni ohitsuji ichitou o sasageta.
Inmeru no kora no uchi de wa Hanani oyobi Zebadeya.
Harimu no kora no uchi de wa Maaseya, Eriya, Shimaya, Ehieru, Ujiya.
Pashuru no kora no uchi de wa Erioenai, Maaseya, Ishimaeru, Netan'eru, Yozabade, Erasa.
Rebi bito no uchi de wa Yozabate, Shimei, Keraya (sunawachi Kerita), Petahiya, Yuda, Eriezeru.
Uta utau mono no uchi de wa Eriashibu. Mon'ei no uchi de wa Sharumu, Teremu, Uri.
Isuraeru no uchi, Paroshi no kora no uchi de wa Ramiya, Ejia, Marukiya, Miyamin, Ereazaru, Hashabiya, Benaya.
Eramu no kora no uchi de wa MaTtaniya, Zekariya, Ehieru, Abude, Eremote, Eriya.
Zatto no kora no uchi de wa Erioenai, Eriashibu, MaTtaniya, Eremote, Zabade, Ajiza.
Bebai no kora no uchi de wa Yohanan, Hananiya, Zabai, Aterai.
Bani no kora no uchi de wa Meshuramu, Maruku, Adaya, Yashubu, Shiyaru, Eremote.
Pahate Moabu no kora no uchi de wa Adena, Keraru, Benaya, Maaseya, MaTtaniya, Bezareru, Binnui, Manase.
Harimu no kora no uchi de wa Eriezeru, Ishiya, Marukiya, Shimaya, Shimeon,
Beniyamin, Maruku, Shimariya.
Hashumu no kora no uchi de wa Mattenai, Mattata, Zabade, Eriparete, Eremai, Manase, Shimei.
Bani no kora no uchi de wa Maadai, Amuramu, Ueru,
Benaya, Bedeya, Keruhi,
Wania, Meremote, Eriashibu,
MaTtaniya, Mattenai, Yaasu.
Binnui no kora no uchi de wa Shimei,
Shiremiya, Natan, Adaya,
Makunadebai, Shashai, Sharai,
Azarieru, Shiremiya, Shimariya,
Sharumu, Amariya, Yosefu.
Nebo no kora de wa Eieru, Mattateya, Zabade, Zebina, Yaddai, Yoeru, Benaya.
Korera no mono wa minaihou no onna o metotta mono de aru. Karera wa sono onnatachi o sono kotomo to tomo ni rien shita.
Hakariya no ko Nehemiya no kotoba. Dainijuu nen no Kisureu no tsuki ni, watashi ga shuto Susa ni ita toki,
Watashi no kyoudai no hitori Hanani ga suunin no mono to tomo ni Yuda kara kita no de, watashi wa hoshuu o manukarete ikinokotta Yudayahito no koto oyobi Erusaremu no koto o tazuneta.
Karera wa watashi ni itta, "Kano shuu de hoshuu o manukarete ikinokotta mono wa ooinaru nayami to, hazukashime no uchi ni ari, Erusaremu no jouheki wa kuzusare, sono mon wa hi de yakareta mama de arimasu" to.
Watashi wa korera no kotoba o kiita toki, suwatte naki, suujitsu no aida nagekikanashimi, danjiki shite ten no kami no mae ni inotte,
Itta, "Ten no kami, Shu, onore o aishi, sono imashime o mamoru mono ni wa keiyaku o mamori, itsukushimi o hodokosareru ooinaru osorubeki kami yo,
Douzo mimi o katamuke, me o hiraite shimobe no inori o kiite kudasai. Watashi wa ima, anata no shimobe de aru Isuraeru no shison no tame ni, hiru mo yoru mo mimae ni inori, wareware Isuraeru no shison ga, anata ni taishite okashita tsumi o zange itashimasu. Makoto ni watashi mo, watashi no chichi no ie mo tsumi o okashimashita.
Wareware wa anata ni taishite ooini warui koto o okonai, anata no shimobe Moose ni meijirareta imashime o mo, sadame o mo, okite o mo mamorimasendeshita.
Douzo, anata no shimobe Moose ni meijirareta kotoba o, omoiokoshite kudasai. Sunawachi anata wa iwaremashita, 'Moshi anata gata ga tsumi o okasunaraba, watashi wa anatagata o, moromoro no tami no aida ni chirasu.
Shikashi, anata gata ga watashi ni tachikaeri, watashi no imashime o mamotte, kore o okonaunaraba, tatoi anata gata no uchi no chirasareta mono ga, ten no hate ni ite mo, watashi wa soko kara karera o atsume, watashi no na o sumawaseru tame ni eranda tokoro ni tsurete kuru' to.
Karera wa, anata ga ooinaru chikara to tsuyoi te o motte, aganawareta anata no shimobe, anata no tami desu.
Shu yo, douzo shimobe no inori to, anata no na o osoreru koto o yorokobu anata no shimobera no inori ni mimi o katamukete kudasai. Douzo, kyou, shimobe o megumi, kono hito no me no mae de awaremi o esasete kudasai". Kono toki, watashi wa ou no kyuuji yaku de atta.
Arutashasuta ou no dainijuu nen, Nisan no tsuki ni, ou no mae ni sake ga deta toki, watashi wa sake o tsuide ou ni sasageta. Kore made watashi wa ou no mae de kanashige na kao o shite ita koto wa nakatta.
Ou wa watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa byouki de mo nai no ni dou shite kanashige na kao o shite iru no ka. Nani ka kokoro ni kanashimi o motte iru ni chigai nai". Soko de watashi wa ooini osorete,
Ou ni moushiageta, "Douzo ou yo, nagaiki saremasu you ni. Watashi no senzo no funbo no chi de aru ano machi wa kouhai shi, sono mon ga hi de yakareta mama de aru no ni, dou shite watashi wa kanashige na kao o shinaide iraremashou ka".
Ou wa watashi ni mukatte, "Sore de wa, anata wa nani o negau no ka" to iwareta no de, watashi wa ten no kami ni inotte,
Ou ni moushiageta, "Moshi ou ga yoshi to sare, shimobe ga anata no mae ni megumi o emasunaraba, dou ka watashi o, Yuda ni aru watashi no senzo no funbo no machi ni tsukawashite, sore o saiken sasete kudasai".
Toki ni ouhi mo katawara ni zashite itaga, ou wa watashi ni iwareta, "Anata no tabi no kikan wa dore hodo desu ka. Itsugoro kaette kimasu ka". Kou shite ou ga watashi o tsukawasu koto o yoshi to sareta no de, watashi wa kikan o sadamete ou ni moushiageta.
Watashi wa mata ou ni moushiageta, "Moshi ou ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, kawamukou no shuu no chijitachi ni ataeru tegami o watashi ni tamawari, watashi ga Yuda ni ikitsuku made, karera ga watashi o tsuuka saseru you ni shite kudasai.
Mata ou no sanrin o kanri suru Asafu ni ataeru tegami o mo tamawari, shinden ni zokusuru shiro no mon o tateru tame, mata machi no ishigaki, oyobi watashi no sumubeki ie o tateru tame ni mochiiru zaimoku o watashi ni ataeru you ni shite kudasai". Watashi no kami ga yoku watashi o tasukerareta no de, ou wa watashi no negai o yurusareta.
Soko de watashi wa kawamukou no shuu no chijitachi no tokoro e itte, ou no tegami o watashita. Nao ou wa gun no chou oyobi kihei o watashi to tomo ni tsukawashita.
Tokoro ga Horoni bito Sanbarate oyobi Anmon bito dorei Tobiya wa kore o kiki, Isuraeru no shison no fukushi o motomeru hito ga kita to iu no de, ooini kanjou o gaishita.
Watashi wa Erusaremu ni tsuite, soko ni mikka taizai shita nochi,
Yonaka ni okideta. Suunin no mono ga watashi ni tomonattaga, watashi wa, kami ga Erusaremu no tame ni nasou to shite, watashi no kokoro ni irerareta koto o, dare ni mo tsugeshirasezu, mata watashi ga notta kemono no hoka ni wa, kemono o tsurete ikanakatta.
Watashi wa yonaka ni dete tani no mon o toori, ryuu no ido oyobi fun no mon ni itte, Erusaremu no kuzureta jouheki ya, hi ni yakareta mon o chousa shi,
Mata izumi no mon oyobi ou no ike ni ittaga, watashi no notte iru kemono no toorubeki tokoro mo nakatta.
Watashi wa mata sono yoru no uchi ni tani ni sotte nobori, jouheki o chousa shita ue, mi o megurashite, tani no mon o tootte kaetta.
Tsukasatachi wa, watashi ga doko e itta ka, nani o shita ka o shiranakatta. Watashi wa mata Yudayahito ni mo, saishitachi ni mo, tattoi hitotachi ni mo, tsukasatachi ni mo, sono ta kouji o suru hitobito ni mo mada shirasenakatta.
Shikashi watashi wa tsuini karera ni itta, "Anata gata no miruto ori, wareware wa nankyoku ni aru. Erusaremu wa kouhai shi, sono mon wa hi ni yakareta. Saa, wareware wa futatabi yo no hazukashime o ukeru koto no nai you ni, Erusaremu no jouheki o kizukou".
Soshite, watashi no kami ga yoku watashi o tasukerareta koto o karera ni tsuge, mata ou ga watashi ni katarareta kotoba o mo tsugeta no de, karera wa "Saa, tachiagatte kizukou" to ii, furuitatte, kono yoki waza ni chakushu shiyou to shita.
Tokoro ga Horoni bito Sanbarate, Anmon bito dorei Tobiya oyobi Arabiya bito Gashimu ga kore o kiite, wareware o azakeri, wareware o anadotte itta, "Anata gata wa nani o suru no ka, ou ni hangyaku shiyou to suru no ka".
Watashi wa karera ni kotaete itta, "Ten no kami ga wareware o megumareru no de, sono shimobe de aru wareware wa furuitatte kizuku no de aru. Shikashi anata gata wa Erusaremu ni nani no bun mo naku, kenri mo naku, kinen mo nai".
Kakute daisaishi Eriashibu wa, sono kyoudai de aru saishitachi to tomo ni tatte hitsuji no mon o tate, kore o seibetsu shite sono tobira o mouke, sarani kore o seibetsu shite, Hanmea no bourou ni oyoboshi, mata Hananeru no bourou ni made oyoboshita.
Kare no tsugi ni wa Eriko no hitobito ga tate, sono tsugi ni wa Imuri no ko Zakkuru ga tateta.
Uo no mon wa Hassenaa no kora ga tate, sono hari o oki, sono tobira to yokogi to kannoki to o mouketa.
Sono tsugi ni Hakkozu no ko Uriya no ko Meremote ga shuuri shi, sono tsugi ni Meshizaberu no ko Berekiya no ko Meshuramu ga shuuri shi, sono tsugi ni Baana no ko Zadoku ga shuuri shita.
Sono tsugi ni Tekoa bi tora ga shuuri shitaga, sono kijintachi wa sono Shu no kouji ni fukusanakatta.
Furui mon wa Pasea no ko Yoiada oyobi Besodeya no ko Meshuramu ga kore o shuuri shi, sono hari o oki, sono tobira to yokogi to kannoki to o mouketa.
Sono tsugi ni Gibeon bito Merateya, Meronote bitoYadon, oyobi kawamukou no shuu no chiji no gyouseika ni aru Gibeon to Mizupa no hitobito ga shuuri shita.
Sono tsugi ni Haruhaya no ko Ujieru nado no kin zaikunin ga shuuri shi, sono tsugi ni seikousha no hitori Hananiya ga shuuri shita. Kou shite karera wa Erusaremu o jouheki no hiroi tokoro made fukkyuu shita.
Sono tsugi ni Erusaremu no han kuiki no chiji Horu no ko Repaya ga shuuri shi,
Sono tsugi ni Harumafu no ko Edaya ga jibun no ie to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shi, sono tsugi ni wa Hashabuniya no ko Hattoshi ga shuuri shita.
Harimu no ko Marukiya oyobi bahate moabu no ko Hashubu mo ta no bubun oyobi ro no bourou o shuuri shita.
Sono tsugi ni Erusaremu no ta no han kuiki no chiji Haroheshi no ko Sharumu ga sono musumetachi to tomo ni shuuri shita.
Tani no mon wa Hanun ga Zanoa no tami to tomo ni kore o shuuri shi, kore o tatenaoshite, sono tobira to yokogi to kannoki to o mouke, mata fun no mon made jouheki issen kyubito o shuuri shita.
Fun no mon wa bete hakeremu no kuiki no chiji Rekabu no ko Marukiya ga kore o shuuri shi, kore o tatenaoshite, sono tobira to yokogi to kannoki to o mouketa.
Izumi no mon wa Mizupa no kuiki no chiji Korohoze no ko Sharun ga kore o shuuri shi, kore o tatenaoshite, ooi o hodokoshi, sono tobira to yokogi to kannoki to o mouketa. Kare wa mata ou no sono no hotori no Shira no ike ni sotta ishigaki o shuuri shite, Dabide no machi kara kudaru kaidan ni made oyonda.
Sono nochi ni Betezuru no han kuiki no chiji Azubuku no ko Nehemiya ga shuuri shite, Dabide no haka to mukaiatta tokoro ni oyobi, horiike to yuushi no taku ni made oyonda.
Sono nochi ni Bani no ko Rehomu nado no Rebi bito ga shuuri shi, sono tsugi ni Keira no han kuiki no chiji Hashabiya ga sono kuiki no tame ni shuuri shita.
Sono nochi ni Keira no han kuiki no chiji Henadade no ko Bawai nado sono kyoudaitachi ga shuuri shi,
Sono tsugi ni Eshua no ko de Mizupa no chiji de aru Ezeru ga, jouheki no magarikado ni aru bukikura ni noboru tokoro to mukaiatta ta no bubun o shuuri shi,
Sono nochi ni Zabai no ko Baruku ga, chikara o tsukushite jouheki no magarikado kara daisaishi Eriashibu no ie no mon made no ta no bubun o shuuri shi,
Sono nochi ni Hakkozu no ko Uriya no ko Meremote ga, Eriashibu no ie no mon kara Eriashibu no ie no tan made no ta no bubun o shuuri shi,
Kare no nochi ni teichi no hitobito de aru saishitachi ga shuuri shi,
Sono nochi ni Beniyamin oyobi Hashubu ga, jibuntachi no ie to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shi, sono nochi ni Ananiya no ko Maaseya no ko Azariya ga, jibun no ie no fukin o shuuri shi,
Sono nochi ni Henadade no ko Binnui ga, Azariya no ie kara jouheki no magarikado, oyobi sumi made no ta no bubun o shuuri shita.
Uzai no ko Pararu wa, jouheki no magarikado to mukaiatte iru tokoro, oyobi kanshi no niwa ni chikai ou no ue no ie kara tsukidete iru bourou to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shita. Sono nochi ni Paroshi no ko Pedaya,
Oyobi Operu ni sunde iru miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi ga, higashi no hou no mizu no mon to mukaiatte iru tokoro, oyobi tsukidete iru bourou to mukaiatte iru tokoro made shuuri shita.
Sono nochi ni Tekoa bi to ga, tsukidete iru daibourou to mukaiatte iru ta no bubun o shuuri shi, Operu no jouheki ni made oyonda.
Uma no mon kara ue no hou wa saishitachi ga, onoono jibun no ie to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shita.
Sono nochi ni Inmeru no ko Zadoku ga, jibun no ie to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shi, sono nochi ni Shikaniya no ko Shimaya to iu higashi no mon o mamoru mono ga shuuri shi,
Sono nochi ni Shiremiya no ko Hananiya oyobi Zarafu no dairoku no ko Hanun ga ta no bubun o shuuri shi, sono nochi ni Berekiya no ko Meshuramu ga, jibun no heya to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shita.
Sono nochi ni kin zaikunin no hitori Marukiya to iu mono ga, shoushuu no mon to mukaiatte iru tokoro o shuuri shite, sumi no ni kai no heya ni itari, miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi oyobi shounin no ie ni made oyonda.
Mata sumi no ni kai no heya to hitsuji no mon no aida wa kin zaikunin to shounintachi ga kore o shuuri shita.
Sanbarate wa wareware ga jouheki o kizuku no o kiite ikari, ooini ikidootte Yudayahito o azaketta.
Kare wa sono kyoudaitachi oyobiSamariya no heitai no mae de katatte itta, "Kono yowayowashii Yudayahito wa nani o shite iru no ka. Jibun de saikou shiyou to suru no ka. Gisei o sasageyou to suru no ka. Tsuitachi de koto o oeyou to suru no ka. Chirizuka no naka no ishi wa sudeni yakete iru no ni, kore o toridashite ikasou to suru no ka".
Mata Anmon bito Tobiya wa, kare no katawara ni ite itta, "Sou da, karera no kizuite iru jouheki wa, kitsune ichipiki ga nobotte mo kuzurerude arou" to.
"Wareware no kami yo, kiite kudasai. Wareware wa anadorarete imasu. Karera no hazukashime o karera no koube ni kaeshi, karera o hoshuu no chi de bundori mono ni shite kudasai.
Karera no toga o oowazu, karera no tsumi o mimae kara keshisaranaide kudasai. Karera wa kizuki tateru mono no mae de anata o ikarasetakara desu".
Kou shite wareware wa jouheki o kizuitaga, ishigaki wa mina aitsuranatte, sono takasa no nakaba ni made tasshita. Tami ga kokoro o komete hataraitakara de aru.
Tokoro ga Sanbarate, Tobiya, Arabiya bi to, Anmon bi to, Ashidodo bitora wa, Erusaremu no jouheki no shuuri ga shinten shi, sono wareme mo fusagari hajimeta to kiite ooini ikari,
Mina tomo ni aihakari, Erusaremu o semete, sono naka ni konran o okosou to shita.
Soko de wareware wa kami ni inori, mata nichiya mihari o oite karera ni sonaeta.
Sono toki, Yuda bi to wa itta, "Ni o ou mono no chikara wa otoroe, sono ue, haitsuchi ga obitadashii no de, wareware wa jouheki o kizuku koto ga dekinai".
Mata wareware no teki wa itta, "Karera no shiranai uchi ni, mata minai uchi ni, karera no naka ni hairikonde karera o koroshi, sono kouji o yamesaseyou".
Mata karera no chikaku ni sunde iru Yudayahitotachi wa kite, juu tabi mo wareware ni itta, "Karera wa sono sunde iru subete no tokoro kara wareware ni semenoborudeshou" to.
Soko de watashi wa tami ni tsurugi, yari oyobi yumi o motase, jouheki no nochi no hikui tokoro, sunawachi kuuchi ni sono kazoku ni shitagatte tataseta.
Watashi wa mi meguri, tatte tattoi hitobito, tsukasatachi, oyobi sono ta no tamira ni itta, "Anata gata wa karera o osorete wa naranai. Ooinaru osorubeki Shu o oboe, anata gata no kyoudai, musuko, musume, tsuma oyobi ie no tame ni tatakai nasai".
Wareware no teki wa jibuntachi no koto ga, wareware ni satorareta koto o kiki, mata kami ga karera no hakarigoto o yaburareta koto o kiita no de, wareware wa mina jouheki ni kaeri, onoono sono kouji o tsuzuketa.
Sono hi kara nochi wa, watashi no shimobe no hansuu wa kouji ni hataraki, hansuu wa yari, tate, yumi, yoroi o motte busou shita. Soshite tsukasatachi wa jouheki o kizuite iru Yuda no zenka no ushiro ni tatta.
Ni o oi hakobu mono wa onoono katate de kouji o nashi, katate ni buki o totta.
Kizuki tateru mono wa onoono sono koshi ni tsurugi o obite kizukitate, rappa o fuku mono wa watashi no katawara ni ita.
Watashi wa tattoi hitobito, tsukasatachi, oyobi sono ta no tami ni itta, "Kouji wa ookiku katsu hirogatte iru no de, wareware wa jouheki no ue de tagai ni tooku hanarete iru.
Doko de de mo rappa no oto o kiitanara, soko ni iru wareware no tokoro ni atsumatte hoshii. Wareware no kami wa wareware no tame ni tatakawaremasu".
Kono you ni shite, wareware wa kouji o susumetaga, hansuu no mono wa yoake kara hoshi no deru toki made, yari o totte ita.
Sono toki watashi wa mata tami ni tsugete, "Onoono sono shimobe to tomo ni Erusaremu no uchi ni yadori, yoru wa wareware no goeisha to nari, hiru wa kouji o suru you ni" to itta.
Soshite, watashi mo, watashi no kyoudaitachi mo, watashi no shimobetachi mo, watashi o goei suru hitobito mo, wareware no uchi hitori mo, sono koromo o nugazu, onoono te ni buki o totte ita.
Sate, koko ni tami ga sono tsuma to tomo ni, sono kyoudai de aru Yudayahito ni mukatte ooini sakebi uttaeru koto ga atta.
Sunawachi, aru hitobito wa itta, "Wareware wa musuko musume to tomo ni daizei desu. Wareware wa kokumotsu o ete, tabete ikite ikanakereba narimasen".
Mata aru hitobito wa itta, "Wareware wa ue no tame ni, kokumotsu o eyou to tahata mo, budou hatake mo, ie mo teitou ni irete imasu".
Aru hitobito wa itta, "Wareware wa ou no zeikin no tame ni, wareware no tahata oyobi budou hatake o motte kane o karimashita.
Genni wareware no niku wa wareware no kyoudai no niku ni hitoshiku, wareware no kodomo mo karera no kodomo ni hitoshii no ni, miyo, wareware wa musuko musume o hito no dorei to suru you ni shi irarete imasu. Wareware no musume no uchi ni wa, sudeni hito no dorei ni natta mono mo arimasuga, wareware no tahata mo, budou hatake mo tanin no mono ni natte iru no de, wareware ni wa dou suru chikara mo arimasen".
Watashi wa karera no sakebi to, korera no kotoba o kiite ooini ikatta.
Watashi wa mizukara kangaeta sue, tattoi hitobito oyobi tsukasatachi o semete itta, "Anata gata wa meimei sono kyoudai kara risoku o totte iru". Soshite watashi wa karera no koto ni tsuite taikai o hiraki,
Karera ni itta, "Wareware wa ihoujin ni urareta wareware no kyoudai Yudayahito o, wareware no chikara ni shitagatte aganatta. Shikaru ni anata gata wa jibun no kyoudai o urou to suru no ka. Karera wa wareware ni urareru no ka". Karera wa mokushite hitokoto mo iwanakatta.
Watashi wa mata itta, "Anata gata no suru koto wa yoku nai. Anata gata wa, wareware no teki de aru ihoujin no so shiri o yamesaseru tame ni, wareware no kami o osoretsutsu koto o nasubekide wa nai ka.
Watashi mo watashi no kyoudaitachi mo, watashi no shimobetachi mo onajiku kane to kokumotsu to o kashite iruga, wareware wa kono risoku o yameyou.
Douzo, anata gata wa, kyou ni mo karera no tahata, budou hatake, oribu hatake oyobi kaoku o karera ni kaeshi, mata anata gata ga karera kara totte ita kinsen, kokumotsu, budoushu, abura nado no hyakubun no ichi o kaeshi nasai".
Suruto karera wa "Wareware wa sore o kaeshimasu. Karera kara nani o mo youkyuu shimasen. Anata no iu you ni shimasu" to itta. Soko de watashi wa saishitachi o yobi, karera ni kono kotoba no toori ni okonau to iu chikai o tatesaseta.
Watashi wa mata watashi no futokoro o uchiharatte itta, "Kono yakusoku o jikkou shinai mono o, douzo kami ga kono you ni uchiharatte, sono ie oyobi sono shigoto o hanaresaserareru you ni. Sono hito wa kono you ni uchiharawarete munashiku naru you ni". Kaishuu wa mina "Amen" to itte, Shu osan bi shita. Soshite tami wa kono yakusoku no toori ni itta.
Mata watashi wa, Yuda no chi no soutoku ni ninzerareta toki kara, sunawachi Arutashasuta ou no dainijuu nen kara daisanjuu ni nen made, juu ni nen no aida, watashi mo watashi no kyoudaitachi mo, soutoku to shite no teate o ukenakatta.
Watashi yori izen no soutokura wa tami ni omoni o owase, karera kara gin yonjuu shikeru no hoka ni pan to budoushu o tori, mata karera no shimobetachi mo tami o appaku shita. Shikashi watashi wa kami o osoreru no de, sono you na koto wa shinakatta.
Watashi wa kaette, kono jouheki no kouji ni mi o yudane, donna tochi o mo katta koto wa nai. Watashi no shimobetachi wa mina soko ni atsumatte kouji o shita.
Mata watashi no shokutaku ni wa Yudayahito to, tsukasatachi hyaku gojuunin mo ari, sono hoka ni, wareware no shuui no ihoujin no uchi kara kita hitobito mo atta.
Kore ga tame ni ichi nichi ni ushi ichitou, koeta hitsuji rokutou o sonae, mata niwatori o mo watashi no tame ni sonae, tookagoto ni takusan no budoushu o sonaetaga, watashi wa kono tami no roueki ga omokatta no de, soutoku to shite no teate o motomenakatta.
Waga kami yo, watashi ga kono tami no tame ni shita subete no koto o oboete, watashi o omegumi kudasai.
Sanbarate, Tobiya, Arabiya bito Gashimu oyobi sono ta no wareware no teki wa, watashi ga jouheki o kizuki owatte, hitotsu no yabure mo nokoranai to kiita. (shikashi sono toki ni wa mada mon no tobira o tsukete inakatta no de aru.)
Soko de Sanbarate to Gashimu wa watashi ni shisha o tsukawashite itta, "Saa, wareware wa Ono no heiya ni aru hitotsu no mura de kaiken shiyou" to. Karera wa watashi ni kigai o kuwaeyou to kangaete ita no de aru.
Sore de watashi wa karera ni shisha o tsukawashite iwaseta, "Watashi wa ooinaru kouji o shite irukara kudatte iku koto wa dekinai. Dou shite kono kouji o sashioite, anata gata no tokoro e kudatte iki, sono kan, kouji o yameru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Karera wa yon do made kono you ni watashi ni hito o tsukawashitaga, watashi wa onaji you ni karera ni kotaeta.
Tokoro ga, Sanbarate wa go dome ni sono shimobe o mae no you ni watashi ni tsukawashita. Sono te ni wa kaifuu no tegami o tazusaete ita.
Sono naka ni tsugi no you ni shirushite atta, "Shokokumin no aida ni iitsutaerare, mata Gashimu mo itte iruga, anata wa Yudayahito to tomo ni hanran o kuwadate, kore ga tame ni jouheki o kizuite iru. Mata sono iu tokoro ni yoreba, anata wa karera no ou ni narou to shite iru.
Mata anata wa yogensha o tatete, anata no koto o Erusaremu ni nobetsutaesase, 'Yuda ni ou ga aru' to iwasete iruga, sono koto wa kono kotoba no toori ou ni kikoerudeshou. Sore yue, ima oide nasai. Wareware wa tomo ni soudan shimashou".
Soko de watashi wa kare ni hito o tsukawashite iwaseta, "Anata no iu you na koto wa shite imasen. Anata wa sore o jibun no kokoro kara tsukuridashita no desu" to.
Karera wa mina "Karera no te ga yowatte kouji o yameru you ni nareba, kouji wa jouju shinaidarou" to kangaete, wareware o odosou to shita no de aru. Shikashi kami yo, douzo ima watashi no te o tsuyomete kudasai.
Sate watashi wa Mehetaberu no ko Deraya no ko Shimaya no ie ni itta tokoro, kare wa tojikomotte ite itta, "Wareware wa kami no miya sunawachi shinden no naka de kaigou shi, shinden no to o tojite okimashou. Karera wa anata o korosou to shite kurukara desu. Kitto yoru no uchi ni anata o korosou to shite kurudeshou".
Watashi wa itta, "Watashi no you na mono ga dou shite nigerareyou. Watashi no you na mono de dare ga shinden ni haitte inochi o mattou suru koto ga dekiyou. Watashi wa hairanai".
Watashi wa satotta. Kami ga kare o tsukawasareta no de wa nai. Kare ga watashi ni mukatte kono yogen o tsutaeta no wa, Tobiya to Sanbarate ga kare o baishuu shita tame de aru.
Kare ga baishuu sareta no wa kono koto no tame de aru. Sunawachi watashi o osoresase, watashi ni kono you ni sasete, tsumi o okasase, watashi ni akumei o kisete bujoku suru tame de atta.
Waga kami yo, Tobiya, Sanbarate oyobi onna yogensha Noadeya narabi ni sono ta no yogensha nado, subete watashi o osoresaseyou to suru monotachi o oboete, karera ga itta korera no waza ni mukuite kudasai.
Kou shite jouheki wa gojuu futanichi o hete, Eruru no tsuki no nijuu go nichi ni kansei shita.
Wareware no teki ga mina kore o kiita toki, wareware no shuui no ihoujin wa mina osore, ooini menboku o ushinatta. Karera wa kono kouji ga, wareware no kami no tasuke ni yotte jouju shita koto o satottakara de aru.
Mata sono koro, Yuda no tattoi hitobito wa ooku no tegami o Tobiya ni okutta. Tobiya no tegami mo mata karera ni kita.
Tobiya wa Ara no ko Shikaniya no muko de atta no de, Yuda no uchi no ooku no mono ga kare to chikai o tatete itakara de aru. Tobiya no ko Yohanan mo Berekiya no ko Meshuramu no musume o tsuma ni metotta.
Karera wa mata Tobiya no zenkou o watashi no mae ni katari, mata watashi no kotoba o kare ni tsutaeta. Tobiya wa tabitabi tegami o okutte, watashi o osoresaseyou to shita.
Jouheki ga kizukarete, tobira o mouke, sarani mon'ei, uta utau mono oyobi Rebi bito o ninmei shita no de,
Watashi wa, watashi no kyoudai Hanani to, shiro no tsukasa Hananiya ni meijite, Erusaremu o osamesaseta. Kare wa ooku no mono ni masatte chuushin na, kami o osoreru mono de attakara de aru.
Watashi wa karera ni itta, "Hi no atsuku naru made wa Erusaremu no moromoro no mon o hiraite wa naranai. Hitobito ga tatte mamotte iru aida ni mon o tojisase, kannoki o sase. Mata Erusaremu no juumin no naka kara banpei o tatete, onoono ni sono tokoro o mamorase, mata onoono no ie to mukaiau tokoro o mamorase yo".
Machi wa hirokute ookikattaga, sono uchi no tami wa sukunaku, ieie wa mada taterarete inakatta.
Toki ni kami wa watashi no kokoro ni, tattoi hitobito, tsukasa oyobi tami o atsumete, kakei ni yotte sono meibo o shirabeyou to no omoi o okosareta. Watashi wa saisho ni nobotte kita hitobito no keizu o hakken shi, sono naka ni kono you ni shirushite aru no o miidashita.
Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga toraeutsushita hoshuu no uchi, yurusarete Erusaremu oyobi Yuda ni nobori, onoono jibun no machi ni kaetta kono shuu no hitobito wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Karera wa Zerubaberu, Eshua, Nehemiya, Azariya, Raamiya, Nahamani, Morudekai, Birushan, Misuperete, Biguwai, Nehomu, Baana to issho ni kaette kita monotachi de aru. Sono Isuraeru no tami no ninzuu wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Paroshi no shison wa nisen hyaku nanajuu ninin.
Shipateya no shison wa sanbyaku nanajuu ninin.
Ara no shison wa roppyaku gojuu ninin.
Pahate Moabu no shison sunawachi Eshua to Yoabu no shison wa nisen happyaku juu hachinin.
Eramu no shison wa issen nihyaku gojuu yonnin.
Zatto no shison wa happyaku yonjuu gonin.
ZaKkai no shison wa nanahyaku rokujuunin.
Binnui no shison wa roppyaku yonjuu hachinin.
Bebai no shison wa roppyaku nijuu hachinin.
Azugade no shison wa nisen sanbyaku nijuu ninin.
Adonikamu no shison wa roppyaku rokujuu nananin.
Biguwai no shison wa nisen rokujuu nananin.
Aden no shison wa roppyaku gojuu gonin.
Hizekiya no ie no Ateru no shison wa kyuujuu hachinin.
Hashumu no shison wa sanbyaku nijuu hachinin.
Bezai no shison wa sanbyaku nijuu yonnin.
Harifu no shison wa hyaku juu ninin.
Gibeon no shison wa kyuujuu gonin.
Betsurehemu oyobi Netopa no hitobito wa hyaku hachijuu hachinin.
Anatote no hitobito wa hyaku nijuu hachinin.
Bete azumaute no hitobito wa yonjuu ninin.
Kiriate yarimu, Kepira oyobi Beerote no hitobito wa nanahyaku yonjuu sannin.
Rama oyobi Geba no hitobito wa roppyaku nijuu ichinin.
Mikumashi no hitobito wa hyaku nijuu ninin.
Beteru oyobi Ai no hitobito wa hyaku nijuu sannin.
Hoka no Nebo no hitobito wa gojuu ninin.
Hoka no Eramu no shison wa issen nihyaku gojuu yonnin.
Harimu no shison wa sanbyaku nijuunin.
Eriko no hitobito wa sanbyaku yonjuu gonin.
Rodo, Hadede oyobi Ono no hitobito wa nanahyaku nijuu ichinin.
Senaa no shison wa sanzen kyuuhyaku sanjuunin.
Saishi de wa, Eshua no ie no Edaya no shison ga kyuuhyaku nanajuu sannin.
Inmeru no shison ga issen gojuu ninin.
Pashuru no shison ga issen nihyaku yonjuu nananin.
Harimu no shison ga issen juu shichinin.
Rebi bito de wa, Eshua no shison sunawachi Hodewa no shison no uchi no Kademieru no shison ga nanajuu yonnin.
Uta utau mono de wa, Asafu no shison ga hyaku yonjuu hachinin.
Mon'ei de wa, Sharumu no shison, Ateru no shison, Tarumon no shison, Akkubu no shison, Hateta no shison oyobi Shobai no shison awasete hyaku sanjuu hachinin.
Miya ni tsukaeru shimobe de wa, Jiha no shison, Hasupa no shison, Tabaote no shison,
Kerosu no shison, Shia no shison, Padon no shison,
Rebana no shison, Hagaba no shison, Sarumai no shison,
Hanan no shison, Gideru no shison, Gaharu no shison,
Reaya no shison, Rejin no shison, Nekoda no shison,
Gazamu no shison, Uza no shison, Pasea no shison,
Besai no shison, Meunimu no shison, Nefuseshimu no shison,
Bakubuku no shison, Hakupa no shison, Haruhoru no shison,
Bazurite no shison, Mehida no shison, Harusha no shison,
Barukosu no shison, Shisera no shison, Tema no shison,
Nejia no shison oyobi Hatepa no shison.
Soromon no shimobe de atta monotachi no shison de wa, Sotai no shison, Soperete no shison, Perida no shison,
Yaara no shison, Darukon no shison, Gideru no shison,
Shipateya no shison, HaTteru no shison, pokerete hazzebaimu no shison, Amon no shison.
Miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi to Soromon no shimobe de atta monotachi no shison to wa awasete sanbyaku kyuujuu ninin.
Terumera, Teruharesa, kerubu, Adon oyobi Inmeru kara nobotte kita mono ga attaga, sono shizoku to, kettou to o shimeshite, Isuraeru no mono de aru koto o akiraka ni suru koto ga dekinakatta. Sono hitobito wa tsugi no toori de aru.
Sunawachi Deraya no shison, Tobiya no shison, Nekoda no shison de atte, awasete roppyaku yonjuu ninin.
Mata saishi no uchi ni Hobaya no shison, Hakkozu no shison, Barujirai no shison ga aru. Barujirai wa Gireade bito Barujirai no musumetachi no uchi kara tsuma o metotta no de, sono na de yobareta.
Korera no mono wa kono keizu ni notta mono no uchi ni, jibun no seki o tazunetaga, nakatta no de, kegareta mono to shite saishi no shoku kara nozokareta.
Soutoku wa karera ni tsugete, Urimu to tonmimu o obiru saishi no okoru made wa, ito sei naru mono o tabete wa naranu to itta.
Kaishuu wa awasete yon man nisen sanbyaku rokujuunin de atta.
Kono hoka ni danjo no dorei ga nanasen sanbyaku sanjuu nananin, uta utau mono ga danjo awasete nihyaku yonjuu gonin atta.
Sono uma wa nanahyaku sanjuu rokutou, sono raba wa nihyaku yonjuu gotou,
Sono rakuda wa yonhyaku sanjuu gotou, sono roba wa rokusen nanahyaku nijuutou de atta.
Shizoku no chou no uchi kouji no tame ni sasagemono o shita hitobito ga atta. Soutoku wa kin issen Dariku, hachi gojuu, saishi no ifuku gohyaku sanjuu kasane o kura ni osameta.
Mata shizoku no chou no uchi no aru hitobito wa kin ni man Dariku, gin nisen nihyaku mina o kouji no tame ni kura ni osameta.
Sono ta no tami no osameta mono wa kin ni man Dariku, gin nisen mina, saishi no ifuku rokujuu nana kasane de atta.
Kou shite saishi, Rebi bi to, mon'ei, uta utau mono, tami no uchi no aru hitobito, miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi, oyobi Isuraeru bi to wa mina sono machimachi ni sunda. Isuraeru no hitobito wa sono machimachi ni sunde nana gatsu ni natta.
Sono tokitami wa mina hitori no you ni natte mizu no mon no mae no hiroba ni atsumari, Shu ga Isuraeru ni ataerareta Moose no rippou no sho o motte kuru you ni, gakusha Ezura ni motometa.
Saishi Ezura wa nana gatsu no tsuitachi ni rippou o tazusaete kite, danjo no kaishuu oyobi subete kiite satoru koto no dekiru hitobito no mae ni araware,
Mizu no mon no mae ni aru hiroba de, akebono kara shougo made, danjo oyobi satoru koto no dekiru hitobito no mae de kore o yonda. Tami wa mina rippou no sho ni mimi o katamuketa.
Gakusha Ezura wa kono koto no tame ni, kanete mouketa ki no dai no ue ni tattaga, kare no katawara ni wa migi no hou ni Mattateya, Shima, Anaya, Uriya, Hirukiya oyobi Maaseya ga tachi, hidari no hou ni wa Pedaya, Misaeru, Marukiya, Hashumu, Hashibadana, Zekariya oyobi Meshuramu ga tatta.
Ezura wa subete no tami no mae ni sono sho o hiraita. Kare wa subete no tami yori mo takai tokoro ni itakara de aru. Kare ga sho o hirakuto, subete no tami wa kiritsu shita.
Ezura wa ooinaru kami, Shu o home, tami wa mina sono te o agete, "Amen, amen" to itte kotae, koube o tare, chi ni hirefushite Shu o haishita.
Eshua, Bani, Serebiya, Yamin, Akkubu, Shabetai, Hodeya, Maaseya, Kerita, Azariya, Yozabade, Hanan, Peraya oyobi Rebi bitotachi wa tami ni rippou o satoraseta. Tami wa sono tokoro ni tatte ita.
Karera wa sono sho, sunawachi kami no rippou o meiryou ni yomi, sono imi o tokiakashite sono yomu tokoro o satoraseta.
Soutoku de aru Nehemiya to, saishi de ari, gakusha de aru Ezura to, tami o oshieru Rebi bitotachi wa subete no tami ni mukatte "Kono hi wa anata gata no kami, Shu no sei naru hi desu. Nagei tari, nai tari shite wa naranai" to itta. Subete no tami ga rippou no kotoba o kiite naitakara de aru.
Soshite karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa satte, koeta mono o tabe, amai mono o nomi nasai. Sono sonae no nai mono ni wa wakete yari nasai. Kono hi wa wareware no Shu no sei naru hi desu. Ureete wa naranai. Shu o yorokobu koto wa anata gata no chikara desu".
Rebi bito mo mata subete no tami o shizumete, "Naku koto o yame nasai. Kono hi wa sei naru hi desu. Ureete wa naranai" to itta.
Subete no tami wa satte kui nomi shi, mata wakeataete, ooini yorokonda. Kore wa karera ga yomikikasareta kotoba o satottakara de aru.
Tsugi no hi, subete no tami no shizoku no choutachi, saishi, Rebi bitora wa rippou no kotoba o manabu tame ni gakusha Ezura no moto ni atsumatte kite,
Rippou no uchi ni Shu ga Moose ni meijirareta koto, sunawachi Isuraeru no hitobito wa nana gatsu no matsuri no aida, kariio no naka ni sumubeki koto ga shirusarete iru no o miidashita.
Mata subete no machimachi oyobi Erusaremu ni nobetsutaete, "Anata gata wa yama ni dete itte, oribu to yasei no oribu, Mirutosu, natsume yashi, oyobi shigetta ki no eda o totte kite, shirusarete aru to ori, kariio o tsukure" to itte aru no o miidashita.
Sore de tami wa dete itte, sore o motte kaeri, onoono sono ie no yane no ue, sono niwa, kami no miya no niwa, mizu no mon no hiroba, Efuraimu no mon no hiroba nado ni kariio o tsukutta.
Hoshuu kara kaette kita kaishuu wa mina kariio o tsukutte, kariio ni sunda. Nun no ko Yoshua no hi kara kono hi made, Isuraeru no hitobito wa kono you ni itta koto ga nakatta. Sore de sono yorokobi wa hijou ni ookikatta.
Ezura wa hajime no hi kara owari no hi made, mainichi kami no rippou no sho o yonda. Hitobito wa nanuka no aida, matsuri o okonai, youka me ni natte, okite ni shitagatte seikai o hiraita.
Sono tsuki no nijuu yonka ni Isuraeru no hitobito wa atsumatte danjiki shi, aranuno o matoi, tsuchi o kabutta.
Soshite Isuraeru no shison wa, subete no ihoujin o hanare, tatte jibun no tsumi to senzo no fugi to o zange shita.
Karera wa sono tokoro ni tatte, sono hi no yonbun no ichi o motte sono kami, Shu no rippou no sho o yomi, ta no yonbun no ichi o motte zange o nashi, sono kami, Shu o haishita.
Sono toki Eshua, Bani, Kademieru, Shibaniya, Bunni, Serebiya, Bani, Kenanira wa Rebi bito no dai no ue ni tachi, oogoe o agete, sono kami, Shu ni yobawatta.
Sore kara mata Eshua, Kademieru, Bani, Hashabuniya, Serebiya, Hodeya, Sebaniya, Petahiya nado no Rebi bi to wa itta, "Tachiagatte eien kara eien ni imasu anata gata no kami, Shu o home nasai. Anata no tattoi mina wa ho mubeki ka na. Kore wa subete no shukufuku tosan bi o koeru mono desu".
Mata Ezura wa itta, "Anata wa, tada anata nomi, Shu de iraseraremasu. Anata wa ten to shoten no ten to, sono banshou, chi to sono ue no subete no mono, umi to sono naka no subete no mono o tsukuri, kore o kotogotoku tamotaremasu. Ten no bangun wa anata o haishimasu.
Anata wa Shu, kami de iraseraremasu. Anata wa mukashi Aburamu o erande Karudeya no Uru kara michibikidashi, kare ni Aburahamu to iu na o atae,
Kare no kokoro ga anata no mae ni chuushin na no o mirarete, kare to keiyaku o musubi, sono shison ni Kanan bi to, Hete bi to, Amori bi to, Periji bi to, Ebusu bito oyobi Girugashi bito no chi o ataeru to iwaretaga, tsuini anata wa sono yakusoku o jouju saremashita. Anata wa tadashiku iraserarerukara desu.
Anata wa wareware no senzo ga Ejiputo de kunan o ukeru no o kaerimirare, mata koukai no hotori de yobawari sakebu no o kikiirerare,
Shirushi to fushigi to o arawashite Paro to, sono subete no kerai to, sono kuni no subete no tami o semeraremashita. Karera ga wareware no senzo ni taishite, gouman ni furumatta koto o shiraretakara desu. Soshite anata ga na o agerareta koto konnichi no you desu.
Anata wa mata karera no mae de umi o wake, karera ni, kawaita chi o funde umi no naka o toorase, karera o ou mono o, ishi o oomizu ni nageireru you ni fuchi ni nageire,
Hiru wa kumo no hashira o motte karera o michibiki, yoru wa hi no hashira o motte sono yukubeki michi o tera saremashita.
Anata wa mata Shinai san no ue ni kudari, ten kara karera to katari, tadashii okite to, makoto no rippou oyobi yoki sadame to imashime to o sazuke,
Anata no sei naru ansokunichi o karera ni shimeshi, anata no shimobe Moose ni yotte imashime to, sadame to, rippou to o karera ni meiji,
Ten kara shokumotsu o ataete sono ue o todome, iwa kara mizu o dashite sono kawaki o uruoshi, mata, karera ni ataeru to chikawareta sono kuni ni haitte, kore o eru you ni karera ni meijiraremashita.
Shikashi karera, sunawachi wareware no senzo wa gouman ni furumai, katakuna de, anata no imashime ni shitagawazu,
Shitagau koto o kobami, anata ga karera no naka de okonawareta kiseki o kokoro ni tomezu, kaette katakuna ni nari, mizukara hitori no kashira o tatete, Ejiputo no dorei no seikatsu ni kaerou to shimashita. Shikashi anata wa tsumi o yurusu kami, megumi ari, awaremi ari, ikaru koto osoku, itsukushimi yutaka ni mashimashite, karera o suteraremasendeshita.
Mata karera ga mizukara hitotsu no imono no koushi o tsukutte, 'Kore wa anatagata o Ejiputo kara michibiki nobotta anata gata no kami de aru' to itte, ooini kegashi koto o okonatta toki ni mo,
Anata wa ooinaru awaremi o motte karera o arano ni misuterarezu, hiru wa kumo no hashira o karera no ue kara hanasanaide michimichi karera o michibiki, yoru wa hi no hashira o motte karera no yukubeki michi o tera saremashita.
Mata anata wa yoki mitama o tamawatte karera o oshie, anata no mana o tsune ni karera no kuchi ni atae, mata mizu o karera ni ataete, kawaki o todome,
Yonjuu nen no aida karera o arano de yashinawareta no de, karera wa nan no kakeru tokoro mo naku, sono ifuku mo furubizu, sono ashi mo haremasendeshita.
Soshite anata wa karera ni shokoku, shomin o ataete, kore o subete wa kachitoraseraremashita. Karera wa Heshibon no ou Shihon no ryouchi, oyobi Bashan no ou Ogu no ryouchi o emashita.
Mata karera no shison o mashite sora no hoshi no you ni shi, karera no senzotachi ni, hai tte eyo to iwareta chi ni karera o michibikiirerareta no de,
Sono shison wa, haitte kono chi o emashita. Anata wa mata, kono chi ni sumu Kanan bito o karera no mae ni seifuku shi, sono outachi oyobi sono chi no tami o karera no te ni watashite, i no mama ni atsukawaseraremashita.
Sore de karera wa kengo na machimachi oyobi koeta chi o tori, moromoro no yoi mono no michita ie, horiike, budou hatake, oribu hatake oyobi ooku no kaju o e, tabete aki, koefutori, anata no ooinaru megumi ni yotte tanoshimimashita.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu karera wa fujuujun de, anata ni somuki, anata no rippou o nochi ni nagesute, karera o imashimete, anata ni tachikaeraseyou to shita yogensha tachi o koroshi, ooini kegashi koto o okonaimashita.
Soko de anata wa karera o teki no te ni watashite kurushimeraremashitaga, karera ga sono kunan no toki ni anata ni yobawatta no de, anata wa ten kara kore o kikare, ooinaru awaremi o motte karera ni sukuu mono o atae, teki no te kara sukuwaseraremashita.
Tokoro ga karera wa ansoku o eru ya ina ya, mata anata no mae ni akuji o okonatta no de, anata wa karera o teki no te ni suteoite, kore ni osamesaseraremashitaga, karera ga mata tachikaette anata ni yobawatta no de, anata wa ten kara kore o kiki, awaremi o motte shibashiba karera o sukuidashi,
Karera o imashimete, anata no rippou ni hikimodosou to saremashita. Keredo mo karera wa gouman ni furumai, anata no imashime ni shitagawazu, hito ga kore o okonaunaraba, kore ni yotte ikiru to iu anata no okite o yabutte tsumi o okashi, kata o sobiyakashi, katakuna ni natte, kikishitagaou to wa shimasendeshita.
Sore de mo anata wa toshi hisashiku karera o shinobi, anata no yogensha tachi ni yori, anata no mitama o motte karera o imashimeraremashitaga, karera wa mimi o katamukenakatta no de, karera o kuniguni no tami no te ni watasaremashita.
Shikashi anata wa ooinaru awaremi ni yotte karera o tayasazu, mata karera o suteraremasendeshita. Anata wa megumi ari, awaremi aru kami de iraserarerukara desu.
Sore yue, wareware no kami, keiyaku o tamochi, itsukushimi o hodokosareru ooini shite chikarazuyoku, osorubeki kami yo, ASsuriya no outachi no toki kara konnichi made, wareware to wareware no outachi, tsukasatachi, saishitachi, yogensha tachi, senzotachi, oyobi anata no subete no tami ni nozonda moromoro no kunan o chiisai koto to minaide kudasai.
Wareware ni nozonda subete no koto ni tsuite, anata wa tadashii no desu. Anata wa seijitsu o motte okonawareta no ni, wareware wa aku o okonatta no desu.
Wareware no outachi, tsukasatachi, saishitachi, senzotachi wa anata no rippou o okonawazu, anata ga oatae ni natta meirei to imashime to ni kikishitagaimasendeshita.
Sunawachi karera wa onore no kuni ni ori, anata ga kudasatta ookina megumi no uchi ni ori, mata anata ga oatae ni natta hiroi koeta chi ni orinagara, anata ni tsukaezu, mata jibun no warui waza o yameru koto o shimasendeshita.
Wareware wa konnichi dorei desu. Anata ga wareware no senzo ni ataete, sono mi to sono yoki mono to o tabesaseyou to sareta chi de, wareware wa dorei to natte iru no desu.
Soshite kono chi wa wareware no tsumi no yue ni, anata ga wareware no ue ni taterareta outachi no tame ni ooku no sanbutsu o dashite imasu. Katsu karera wa wareware no mi o mo, wareware no kachiku o mo i no mama ni sayuu suru koto ga dekiru no de, wareware wa ooinaru kunan no uchi ni aru no desu".
Kono moromoro no koto no tame ni wareware wa katai keiyaku o musunde, kore o kiroku shi, wareware no tsukasatachi, Rebi bitotachi saishitachi wa kore ni in o oshita.
In o oshita mono wa Hakariya no ko de aru soutoku Nehemiya, oyobi Zedekiya,
Seraya, Azariya, Eremiya,
Pashuru, Amariya, Marukiya,
Hattoshi, Shibaniya, Maruku,
Harimu, Meremote, Obadeya,
Danieru, Ginneton, Baruku,
Meshuramu, Abiya, Miyamin,
Maajiya, Birugai, Shimaya de, korera wa saishi de aru.
Rebi bito de wa Azaniya no ko Eshua, Henadade no kora no uchi no Binnui, Kademieru,
Oyobi sono kyoudai Shibaniya, Hodeya, Kerita, Peraya, Hanan,
Mika, Rehobu, Hashabiya,
ZaKkuru, Serebiya, Shibaniya,
Hodeya, Bani, Beninu de aru.
Tami no kashira de wa Paroshi, Pahate Moabu, Eramu, Zatto, Bani,
Bunni, Azugade, Bebai,
Adoniya, Biguwai, Aden,
Ateru, Hizekiya, Azuru,
Hodeya, Hashumu, Bezai,
Harifu, Anatote, Nobai,
Magupiashi, Meshuramu, Hejiru,
Meshizaberu, Zadoku, Yadoa,
Perateya, Hanan, Ananiya,
Hosea, Hananiya, Hashubu,
Haroheshi, Piruha, Shobeku,
Rehomu, Hashabuna, Maaseya,
Ahiya, Hanan, Anan,
Maruku, Harimu, Baana de aru.
Sono ta no tami, saishi, Rebi bi to, mon o mamoru mono, uta utau mono, miya ni tsukaeru shimobe, narabi ni subete kuniguni no tami to hanarete kami no rippou ni shitagatta mono oyobi sono tsuma, musuko, musume nado subete chishiki to satori no aru mono wa,
Sono kyoudai de aru tattoi hitobito ni tsukishitagai, kami no shimobe Moose ni yotte sazukerareta kami no rippou ni ayumi, wareware no Shu, Shu no subete no imashime to, okite to, sadame to o mamori okonau tame ni, noroi to chikai to ni kuwawatta.
Wareware wa kono chi no tamira ni wareware no musume o ataezu, wareware no musuko ni karera no musume o metoranai.
Mata kono chi no tamira ga tatoi shinamono mata wa kokumotsu o ansokunichi ni tazusaete kite urou to shite mo, wareware wa ansokunichi mata wa seijitsu ni wa sore o kawanai. Mata nana nengoto ni kousaku o yame, subete no fusai o yurusu.
Wareware wa mata mizukara kitei o moukete, wareware no kami no miya no you no tame ni nennen shikeru no sanbun no ichi o dashi,
Sonae no pan, jousosai, jouhansai no tame, ansokunichi, shingetsu oyobi sadame no matsuri no sonaemono no tame, sei naru mono no tame, Isuraeru no a ga nai o nasu zaisai, oyobi wareware no kami no miya no moromoro no waza no tame ni mochiiru koto ni shita.
Mata wareware saishi, Rebi bi to oyobitami wa kuji o hiite, rippou ni shirusarete aru you ni wareware no kami, Shu no saidan no ue ni takubeki takigi no sonaemono o, nennen sadamerareta toki ni shizoku ni shitagatte, wareware no kami no miya ni osameru mono o sadameta.
Mata wareware no tochi no hatsunari, oyobi kakushu no kinomi no hatsunari o, nennen Shu no miya ni tazusaete kuru koto o chikai,
Mata rippou ni shirushite aru you ni, wareware no kodomo oyobi kachiku no ui go, oyobi wareware no ushi ya hitsuji no ui go o, wareware no kami no miya ni tazusaete kite, wareware no kami no miya ni tsukaeru saishi ni watashi,
Wareware no mugiko no hatsumono, wareware no sonaemono, kakushu no kinomi, budoushu oyobi abura o saishi no moto ni tazusaete itte, wareware no kami no miya no heya ni osame, mata wareware no tochi no sanbutsu no juubun no ichi o Rebi bito ni ataeru koto ni shita. Rebi bi to wa wareware no subete no nousaku o nasu machi ni oite, sono juubun no ichi o u kubeki mono dakara de aru.
Rebi bito ga juubun no ichi o ukeru toki ni wa, Aron no shison de aru saishi ga, sono Rebi bito to tomo ni inakereba naranai. Soshite mata Rebi bi to wa sono juubun no ichi no juubun no ichi o, wareware no kami no miya ni tazusae nobo tte, heya mata wa kura ni osamenakereba naranai.
Sunawachi Isuraeru no hitobito oyobi Rebi no shison wa kokumotsu, budoushu, oyobi abura no sonaemono o tazusaete itte, seijo no utsuwamono oyobi tsutome o suru saishi, mon'ei, uta utau monotachi no iru heya ni kore o osamenakereba naranai. Kou shite wareware wa, wareware no kami no miya o naozari ni shinai.
Tami no tsukasatachi wa Erusaremu ni sumi, sono ta no tami wa kuji o hiite, juunin no uchi kara hitori zutsu o, seito Erusaremu ni kite sumase, kyuunin o ta no machimachi ni sumaseta.
Mata subete mizukara susumidete Erusaremu ni sumu koto o moushideta hitobito wa, tami wa kore o shukufuku shita.
Sate Erusaremu ni sunda kono shuu no choutachi wa tsugi no toori de aru. Tadashi Yuda no machimachi de wa onoono sono machimachi ni aru jibun no shoyuu chi ni sunda. Sunawachi Isuraeru bi to, saishi, Rebi bi to, miya ni tsukaeru shimobe, oyobi Soromon no shimobe de atta monotachi no shison de aru.
Soshite Erusaremu ni wa Yuda no shison oyobi Beniyamin no shison no uchi no aru monotachi ga sunda. Sunawachi Yuda no shison de wa Ujiya no ko Ataya de, Ujiya wa Zekariya no ko, Zekariya wa Amariya no ko, Amariya wa Shipateya no ko, Shipateya wa Maharareru no ko, Maharareru wa Perezu no shison de aru.
Mata Baruku no ko Maaseya de, Baruku wa Korohoze no ko, Korohoze wa Hazaya no ko, Hazaya wa Adaya no ko, Adaya wa Yoyaribu no ko, Yoyaribu wa Zekariya no ko, Zekariya wa Shironi bito no ko de aru.
Perezu no shison de Erusaremu ni sunda mono wa awasete yonhyaku rokujuu hachinin de, mina yuukan na hitobito de aru.
Beniyamin no shison de wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Meshuramu no ko Saru de, Meshuramu wa Yoede no ko, Yoede wa Pedaya no ko, Pedaya wa Koraya no ko, Koraya wa Maaseya no ko, Maaseya wa Iteeru no ko, Iteeru wa Esaya no ko de aru.
Sono tsugi wa Gabai oyobi Sarai nado de awasete kyuuhyaku nijuu hachinin.
Jikuri no ko Yoeru ga karera no kantoku de aru. Hassenua no ko Yuda ga sono fukukan to shite machi o osameta.
Saishi de wa Yoyaribu no ko Edaya, Yakin,
Oyobi kami no miya no tsukasa Seraya de, Seraya wa Hirukiya no ko, Hirukiya wa Meshuramu no ko, Meshuramu wa Zadoku no ko, Zadoku wa Merayote no ko, Merayote wa Ahitobu no ko de aru.
Miya no tsutome o suru sono kyoudai wa happyaku nijuu ninin ari, mata, Erohamu no ko Adaya ga aru. Erohamu wa Perariya no ko, Perariya wa Amuji no ko, Amuji wa Zekariya no ko, Zekariya wa Pashihoru no ko, Pashihoru wa Marukiya no ko de aru.
Adaya no kyoudai de, shizoku no choutaru mono wa nihyaku yonjuu ninin ari, mata Azarieru no ko Amashisai ga aru. Azarieru wa Ahazai no ko, Ahazai wa Meshiremote no ko, Meshiremote wa Inmeru no ko de aru.
Sono kyoudai de aru yuushi wa hyaku nijuu hachinin ari, sono kantoku wa Haggedorimu no ko Zabudeeru de aru.
Rebi bito de wa Hashubu no ko Shimaya de, Hashubu wa Azurikamu no ko, Azurikamu wa Hashabiya no ko, Hashabiya wa Bunni no ko de aru.
Mata Shabetai oyobi Yozabade ga aru. Korera wa Rebi bito no kashira de atte, kami no miya no soto no waza o tsukasadotta.
Mata Mika no ko Mattaniya ga aru. Mika wa Zabude no ko, Zabude wa Asafu no ko de aru. MaTtaniya wa inori no toki ni kansha no kotoba o tonae hajimeru mono de aru. Sono kyoudai no uchi no Bakubukiya wa kare ni tsugu mono de atta. Mata Shanma no ko Abuda ga aru. Shanma wa Gararu no ko, Gararu wa Edoton no ko de aru.
Seito ni oru Rebi bi to wa awasete nihyaku hachijuu yonnin de atta.
Mon'ei de wa mon o mamoru Akkubu, Tarumon oyobi sono kyoudaitachi awasete hyaku nanajuu ninin de aru.
Sono ta no Isuraeru bi to, saishi, Rebi bitotachi wa mina Yuda no subete no machimachi ni atte, onoono jibun no shigyou ni todomatta.
Tadashi miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi wa Operu ni sumi, Jiha oyobi Gishipa ga miya ni tsukaeru shimobetachi o kantoku shite ita.
Erusaremu ni oru Rebi bito no kantoku wa Uji de aru. Uji wa Bani no ko, Bani wa Hashabiya no ko, Hashabiya wa MaTtaniya no ko, MaTtaniya wa Mika no ko de aru. Mika wa uta utau mono naru Asafu no shison de aru. Uji wa kami no miya no waza o kantoku shita.
Karera ni tsuite wa ou kara no meirei ga atte, uta utau mono ni hibi no sadamatta bun o ataesaseta.
Mata Yuda no ko Zera no shison de aru Meshizaberu no ko Petahiya wa ou no te ni zokushite tami ni kansuru subete no koto o toriatsukatta.
Mata muramura to sono tahata ni tsuite wa, Yuda no shison no mono wa kiriate aruba to sono muramura, Debon to sono muramura, Ekabujieru to sono muramura ni sumi,
Eshua, Morada oyobi Beteperete ni sumi,
Hazaru shuaru oyobi Beerushiba to sono muramura ni sumi,
Chikuragu oyobi Mekona to sono muramura ni sumi,
Enrinmon, Zarea, Yarumute ni sumi,
Zanoa, Adoramu oyobi sorera no muramura, Rakishi to sono den'ya, Azeka to sono muramura ni sunda. Kou shite karera wa Beerushiba kara Hinnomu no tani ni made shukuei shita.
Beniyamin no shison wa mata Geba kara Mikumashi, Aya oyobi Beteru to sono muramura ni sumi,
Anatote, Nobu, Ananiya,
Hazoru, Rama, GiTtaimu,
Hadede, Zeboimu, Nebarate,
Rodo, Ono, koujin no tani ni sunda.
Rebi bito no kumi no Yuda ni aru mono no uchi Beniyamin ni awashita mono mo atta.
Sharuteru no ko Zerubaberu oyobi Eshua to issho ni nobotte kita saishi to Rebi bi to wa tsugi no toori de aru. Sunawachi Seraya, Eremiya, Ezura,
Amariya, Maruku, Hattoshi,
Shikaniya, Rehomu, Meremote,
Ido, Ginnetoi, Abiya,
Miyamin, Maadeya, Biruga,
Shimaya, Yoyaribu, Edaya,
Sarai, Amoku, Hirukiya, Edaya de, korera no mono wa Eshua no jidai ni saishi oyobi sono kyoudaira no kashira de atta.
Rebi bito de wa Eshua, Binnui, Kademieru, Serebiya, Yuda, Mattaniya de, MaTtaniya wa sono kyoudaira to tomo ni kansha no koto o tsukasadotta.
Mata karera no kyoudai de aru Bagubukiya oyobi Unno wa karera no mukai ni tatte tsutome o shita.
Eshua no ko wa Yoakimu, Yoakimu no ko wa Eriashibu, Eriashibu no ko wa Yoiada,
Yoiada no ko wa Yonatan, Yonatan no ko wa Yadoa de aru.
Yoakimu no jidai ni saishi de shizoku no chou de atta mono wa Seraya no shizoku de wa Meraya, Eremiya no shizoku de wa Hananiya,
Ezura no shizoku de wa Meshuramu, Amariya no shizoku de wa Yohanan,
Maruki no shizoku de wa Yonatan, Shibaniya no shizoku de wa Yosefu,
Harimu no shizoku de wa Adena, Merayote no shizoku de wa Herukai,
Ido no shizoku de wa Zekariya, Ginneton no shizoku de wa Meshuramu,
Abiya no shizoku de wa Jikuri, Miniyamin no shizoku, Moadeya no shizoku de wa Pirutai,
Biruga no shizoku de wa Shanma, Shimaya no shizoku de wa Yonatan,
Yoyaribu no shizoku de wa Mattenai, Edaya no shizoku de wa Uji,
Sarai no shizoku de wa Karai, Amoku no shizoku de wa Eberu,
Hirukiya no shizoku de wa Hashabiya, Edaya no shizoku de wa Netan'eru de aru.
Rebi bito ni tsuite wa, Eriashibu, Yoiada, Yohanan oyobiYadoa no jidai ni, sono shizoku no choutachi ga touroku sareta. Mata saishitachi mo Perusha ou Dariyosu no chisei made touroku sareta.
Rebi no shison de shizoku no choutaru mono wa, Eriashibu no ko Yohanan no yo made rekidaishi no sho ni shirusarete iru.
Rebi bito no kashira wa Hashabiya, Serebiya oyobi Kademieru no ko Eshua de atte, sono kyoudaitachi aimukaiai, kumi to kumi to taiou shite kami no hito Dabide no meirei ni shitagai,san bito kansha o sasageta.
Matsutaniya, Bakubukiya, Obadeya, Meshuramu, Tarumon oyobi Akkubu wa mon o mamoru mono de mon no uchi no kura o kantoku shita.
Korera wa Yozadaku no ko Eshua no ko Yoakimu no jidai, mata soutoku Nehemiya oyobi gakusha de aru saishi Ezura no jidai ni ita hitobito de aru.
Sate Erusaremu no jouheki no rakusei shiki ni atatte, Rebi bito o, sono subete no tokoro kara maneite Erusaremu ni kosase, kansha to, uta to, Shinbaru to, tategoto to, koto to o motte yorokonde rakusei shiki o okonaou to shita.
Soko de, uta utau hitobito wa Erusaremu no shuui no chihou, Netopa bi to no muramura kara atsumatte kita.
Mata Betegirugaru oyobi Geba to Azumaute no chihou kara mo atsumatte kita. Kono uta utau monotachi wa Erusaremu no shuui ni jibun no muramura o tatete itakara de aru.
Soshite saishi to Rebi bitotachi wa mi o kiyome, mata tami oyobi moromoro no mon to jouheki to o kiyometa.
Soko de watashi wa Yuda no tsukasatachi o jouheki no ue ni noborase, mata kansha suru mono no futatsu no ookina kumi o tsukutte, koushin saseta. Sono hitotsu wa jouheki no ue o migi ni fun no mon o sashite susunda.
Sono ato ni shitagatte susunda mono wa Hoshaya, oyobi Yuda no tsukasatachi no nakaba,
Narabi ni Azariya, Ezura, Meshuramu,
Yuda, Beniyamin, Shimaya, Eremiya de atta.
Mata suunin no saishi ga rappa o motte shitagatta. Sunawachi Yonatan no ko Zekariya. Yonatan wa Shimaya no ko, Shimaya wa MaTtaniya no ko, MaTtaniya wa Mikaya no ko, Mikaya wa ZaKkuru no ko, ZaKkuru wa Asafu no ko de aru.
Mata Zekariya no kyoudaitachi Shimaya, Azarieru, Mirarai, Girarai, Maai, Netan'eru, Yuda, Hanani nado de atte, kami no hito Dabide no gakki o motte shitagatta. Soshite gakusha Ezura wa karera no saki ni susunda.
Karera wa izumi no mon o hete, massugu ni susumi, jouheki no noborikuchi de, Dabide no machi no kaidan kara nobori, Dabide no ie no ue o sugite higashi no hou, mizu no mon ni itatta.
Ta no ichi kumi no kansha suru mono wa hidari ni susunda. Watashi wa tami no nakaba to tomo ni karera no ato ni shitagatta. Soshite jouheki no ue o iki, ro no bourou no ue o sugite, jouheki no hiroi tokoro ni itari,
Efuraimu no mon no ue o toori, furui mon o sugi, uo no mon oyobi Hananeru no bourou to Hanmea no bourou o sugite, hitsuji no mon ni itari, konoe no mon ni tachidomatta.
Kou shite ni kumi no kansha suru mono wa kami no miya ni haitte tatta. Watashi mo soko ni tachi, tsukasatachi no nakaba mo watashi to tomo ni tatta.
Mata saishi Eriakimu, Maaseya, Miniyamin, Mikaya, Erioenai, Zekariya, Hananiyara wa rappa o mochi,
Maaseya, Shimaya, Ereazaru, Uji, Yohanan, Marukiya, Eramu oyobi Ezeru mo tomo ni ita. Soshite uta utau monotachi wa koe takaku utatta. Ezurahiya wa sono kantoku de atta.
Kou shite karera wa sono hi, ooinaru gisei o sasagete yorokonda. Kami ga karera o ooini yorokobitanoshimaseraretakara de aru. Onnakodomo made mo yorokonda. Sore de Erusaremu no yorokobi no koe wa tooku made kikoeta.
Sono hi, kura no moromoro no heya o tsukasadoru hitobito o erabi, sasagemono, hatsumono, juubun no ichi nado rippou no sadameru tokoro no saishi oyobi Rebi bito no bun o machimachi no tahata ni shitagatte toriatsumete, heya ni ireru koto o tsukasadoraseta. Kore wa saishi oyobi Rebi bito no tsukaeru no o, Yuda bito ga yorokondakara de aru.
Karera wa Dabide oyobi sono ko Soromon no meirei ni shitagatte, kami no tsutome oyobi kiyome goto no tsutome o shita. Uta utau mono oyobi mon o mamoru mono mo sono you ni itta.
Mukashi Dabide oyobi Asafu no hi ni wa, uta utau mono no kashira ga hitori ite, kami nisan bito kansha o sasageru koto ga atta.
Mata Zerubaberu no hi oyobi Nehemiya no hi ni wa, Isuraeru bi to wa mina uta utau mono to mon o mamoru mono ni hibi no bun o atae, mata Rebi bito ni mono o seibetsu shite atae, Rebi bi to wa mata kore o seibetsu shite Aron no shison ni ataeta.
Sono hi Moose no sho o yonde tami ni kikasetaga, sono naka ni Anmon bi to, oyobi Moabu bito wa, itsu made mo kami no kai ni, haitte wa naranaito shirusarete iru no o miidashita.
Kore wa karera ga katsute, pan to mizu o motte Isuraeru no hitobito o mukaezu, kaette kore o norowaseru tame ni Baramu o yatottakara de aru. Shikashi wareware no kami wa sono noroi o kaete shukufuku to sareta.
Hitobito wa kono rippou o kiita toki, konketsu no tami o kotogotoku Isuraeru kara wake hanashita.
Kore yori saki, wareware no kami no miya no heya o tsukasadotte ita saishi Eriashibu wa, Tobiya to engumi shita no de,
Tobiya no tame ni ookina heya o sonaeta. Sono heya wa moto, sosai no mono, nyuukou, utsuwamono oyobi kitei ni yotte Rebi bi to, uta utau mono oyobi mon o mamoru monotachi ni ataeru kokumotsu, budoushu, abura no juubun no ichi, narabi ni saishi no tame no sasagemono o oita tokoro de aru.
Sono touji, watashi wa Erusaremu ni inakatta. Watashi wa Babiron no ou Arutashasuta no sanjuu ni nen ni ou no tokoro e ittaga, shibaraku tatte ou ni itoma o koi,
Erusaremu ni kite, Eriashibu ga Tobiya no tame ni shita akuji, sunawachi kare no tame ni kami no miya no niwa ni hitotsu no heya o sonaeta koto o hakken shita.
Watashi wa hijou ni ikari, Tobiya no ie no utsuwamono o kotogotoku sono heya kara nagedashi,
Meijite, subete no heya o kiyomesase, soshite kami no miya no utsuwamono oyobi sosai, nyuukou nado o futatabi soko ni tazusae ireta.
Watashi wa mata Rebi bito ga sono u kubeki bun o ataerarete inakatta koto o shitta. Kore ga tame ni sono tsutome o nasu Rebi bi to oyobi uta utau monotachi wa, onoono jibun no hatake ni nigekaetta.
Sore de watashi wa tsukasatachi o semete itta, "Naze kami no miya o sutesaseta no ka". Soshite Rebi bito o manekiatsumete, sono mochiba ni fukki saseta.
Soko de Yuda no hitobito wa mina, kokumotsu, budoushu, abura no juubun no ichi o kura ni tazusaete kita.
Watashi wa saishi Shiremiya, gakusha Zadoku oyobi Rebi bito Pedaya o kura no tsukasa to shi, mata MaTtaniya no ko Zakkuru no ko Hanan o sono joshu to shite kura o tsukasadoraseta. Karera wa chuujitsu na mono to omowaretakara de aru. Karera no ninmu wa kyoudaitachi ni bunpai suru koto de atta.
Waga kami yo, kono koto no tame ni watashi o oboete kudasai. Waga kami no miya to sono tsutome no tame ni watashi ga itta yoki waza o nuguisaranaide kudasai.
Sono koro watashi wa Yuda no uchi de ansokunichi ni saka bune o fumu mono, mugi taba o motte kite, roba ni owasu mono, mata budoushu, budou, ichijiku oyobi samazama no ni o ansokunichi ni Erusaremu ni hakobiireru mono o mita no de, watashi wa karera ga shokumotsu o utte ita sono hi ni karera o imashimeta.
Soko ni sunde ita Tsuro no hitobito mo mata uo oyobi samazama no shinamono o motte kite, ansokunichi ni Yuda no hitobito ni uri, Erusaremu de shoubai shita.
Soko de watashi wa Yuda no tattoi hitobito o semete itta, "Anata gata wa naze kono akuji o itte, ansokunichi o kegasu no ka.
Anata gata no senzo mo, kono you ni itta no de, wareware no kami wa kono subete no wazawai o, wareware to kono machi ni kudasaretade wa nai ka. Tokoro ga anata gata wa ansokunichi o kegashite, sarani ooinaru ikari o Isuraeru no ue ni maneku no de aru".
Soko de ansokunichi no mae ni, Erusaremu no moromoro no mon ga kuraku nari hajimeta toki, watashi wa meijite sono tobira o tojisase, ansokunichi ga owaru made kore o hiraite wa naranai to meiji, watashi no shimobe suunin o mon ni oite, ansokunichi ni ni o tazusae iresasenai you ni shita.
Kore ga tame ni, shounin oyobi samazama no shinamono o uru monodomo wa ichini kai Erusaremu no soto ni yadotta.
Watashi wa karera o imashimete itta, "Anata gata wa naze jouheki no mae ni yadoru no ka. Moshi anata gata ga kasanete sono you na koto o surunaraba, watashi wa anatagata o shobas suru" to. Sono toki irai, karera wa ansokunichi ni wa konakatta.
Watashi wa mata Rebi bito ni meijite, sono mi o kiyomesase, kite mon o mamorasete, ansokunichi o seibetsu shita. Waga kami yo, watashi no tame ni mata, kono koto o oboe, anata no ooinaru itsukushimi o motte, watashi o awarende kudasai.
Sono koro mata, watashi wa Ashidodo, Anmon, Moabu no onna o metotta Yudayahito o mita.
Karera no kodomo no hanbun wa Ashidodo no kotoba o katatte, Yudaya no kotoba o kataru koto ga dekizu, onoono sono hahaoya no deta tami no kotoba o katatta.
Watashi wa karera o seme, mata nonoshiri, sono uchi no suunin o utte, sono ke o nuki, kami no na o sashite chikawasete itta, "Anata gata wa karera no musuko ni jibun no musume o ataete wa naranai. Mata anata gata no musuko, mata wa anata gata jishin no tame ni karera no musume o metotte wa naranai.
Isuraeru no ou Soromon wa korera no koto ni yotte tsumi o okashitade wa nai ka. Kare no you na ou wa ooku no kokumin no uchi ni mo naku, kami ni aiserareta mono de aru. Kami wa kare o Isuraeru zenkoku no ou to serareta. Tokoro ga ihou no onnatachi wa kare ni tsumi o okasaseta.
Sore yue anata gata ga ihou no onna o metori, kono subete no ooinaru aku o itte, wareware no kami ni tsumi o okasu no o, wareware wa kikinagashi ni shite okeyou ka".
Daisaishi Eriashibu no ko Yoiada no hitori no ko wa Horoni bito Sanbarate no muko de atta no de, watashi wa kare o watashi no tokoro kara oidashita.
Waga kami yo, karera no koto o oboete kudasai. Karera wa saishi no shoku o kegashi, mata saishi oyobi Rebi bito no keiyaku o kegashimashita.
Kono you ni, watashi wa karera o kiyomete, ihou no mono o kotogotoku sutesase, saishi oyobi Rebi bito no tsutome o sadamete, onoono sono waza ni tsukaseta.
Mata sadamerareta toki ni, takigi no sonaemono o sasagesase, mata hatsumono o sasagesaseta. Waga kami yo, watashi o oboe, watashi o omegumi kudasai.
Ahashuerosu sunawachi Indo kara Echiopiya made hyaku nijuu nana shuu o osameta Ahashuerosu no yo,
Ahashuerosu ou ga shuto Susa de, sono kuni no kurai ni zashite ita koro,
Sono chisei no daisan nen ni, kare wa sono daijin oyobi jishintachi no tame ni shuen o mouketa. Perusha to Medea no shougun oyobi kizoku narabi ni shoshuu no daijintachi ga sono mae ni ita.
Sono toki, ou wa sono sakan na kuni no tomi to, sono oui no kagayaki to, hanayakasa o shimeshite ooku no hi o kasane, hyaku hachijuu nichi ni oyonda.
Korera no hi ga owatta toki, ou wa ou no kyuuden no sono no niwa de, shuto Susa ni iru daishou no subete no tami no tame ni nanuka no aida, shuen o mouketa.
Soko ni wa shiro menpu no taremaku to aoiro no tobari to ga atte, murasakiiro no hosonuno no himo de gin no wa oyobi dairiseki no hashira ni tsunagarete ita. Mata nagai su wa kingin de tsukurare, sekkou to dairiseki to shinjugai oyobi houseki no kiri hame zaiku no yuka no ue ni okarete ita.
Sake wa kin no sakazuki de tamawari, sono sakazuki wa sorezore chigatta mono de, ou no ookina doryou ni fusawashiku, ou no mochiiru sake o oshiminaku tamawatta.
Sono nomu koto wa hou ni kanai, dare mo shi irareru koto wa nakatta. Kore wa ou ga hitobito ni onoono jibun no konomu you ni saseyo to kyuutei no subete no yakunin ni meijite oitakara de aru.
Ouhi Washite mo mata Ahashuerosu ou ni zokusuru oukyuu no uchi de onnatachi no tame ni shuen o mouketa.
Nanuka me ni Ahashuerosu ou wa sake no tame ni kokoro ga tanoshiku nari, ou no mae ni tsukaeru nananin no jijuu Mehoman, Bizuta, Harubona, Biguta, Abaguta, Zetaru oyobi Karukasu ni meijite,
Ouhi Washite ni ouhi no kanmuri o kaburasete ou no mae ni kosaseyo to itta. Kore wa kanojo ga utsukushikatta no de, sono utsukushisa o tamira to daijintachi ni miseru tame de atta.
Tokoro ga, ouhi Washite wa jijuu ga tsutaeta ou no meirei ni shitagatte kuru koto o kobanda no de, ou wa ooini ikidoori, sono ikari ga kare no uchi ni moeta.
Soko de ou wa toki o shitte iru chisha ni itta, - - ou wa subete houritsu to shinpan ni tsuujite iru mono ni soudan suru no o tsune to shita.
Toki ni ou no tsugi ni ita hitobito wa Perusha oyobi Medea no shichinin no daijin Karushina, Setaru, Ademata, Tarushishi, Meresu, Marusena, Memukan de atta. Karera wa minaou no kao o miru mono de, kuni no shui ni zasuru hitobito de atta - -
"Ouhi Washite wa, Ahashuerosu ou ga jijuu o motte tsutaeta meirei o okonawanai yue, houritsu ni shitagatte kanojo ni dou shitara yokarou ka".
Memukan wa ou to daijintachi no mae de itta, "Ouhi Washite wa tada ou ni mukatte warui koto o shita bakari de naku, subete no daijin oyobi Ahashuerosu ou no kakushuu no subete no tami ni mukatte mo shita no desu.
Ouhi no kono okonai wa amaneku subete no onnatachi ni kikoete, karera wa tsuini sono me ni otto o iyashime, 'Ahashuerosu ou wa ouhi Washite ni, kare no mae ni kuru you ni meijitaga konakatta' to iudeshou.
Ouhi no kono okonai o kiita Perusha to Medea no daijin no fujintachi mo mata, konnichi, ou no subete no daijintachi ni kono you ni iudeshou. Sou sureba kanarazu iyashime to ikari ga ooku okorimasu.
Moshi ou ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, Washite wa kono nochi, futatabi Ahashuerosu ou no mae ni kite wa naranai to iu ou no meirei o kudashi, kore o Perusha to Medea no houritsu no naka ni kakiirete kawaru koto no nai you ni shi, soshite ouhi no kurai o kanojo ni masaru ta no mono ni atae nasai.
Ou no kudasareru mikotonori ga kono ookina kuni ni amaneku tsuge shimesareru toki, tsuma taru mono wa kotogotoku, sono otto o kouge no betsu naku tomo ni uyamau you ni narudeshou".
Ou to daijintachi wa kono kotoba o yoshi to shita no de, ou wa Memukan no kotoba no toori ni okonatta.
Ou wa ou no shoshuu ni amaneku sho o okuri, kakushuu ni wa sono monji ni shitagai, kakuminzoku ni wa sono gengo ni shitagatte kakiokuri, subete danshi taru mono wa sono ie no Shu to narubeki koto, mata jibun no tami no gengo o mochiite katarubeki koto o satoshita.
Korera no koto no nochi, Ahashuerosu ou no ikari ga toke, ou wa Washite oyobi kanojo no shita koto, mata kanojo ni taishite sadameta koto o omoiokoshita.
Toki ni ou ni tsukaeru jishintachi wa itta, "Utsukushii wakai shojotachi o ou no tame ni tazunemotomemashou.
Douzo ou wa kono kuni no kakushuu ni oite yakunin o erabi, utsukushii wakai shojo o kotogotoku shuto Susa ni aru fujin no kyoshitsu ni atsumesase, fujin o tsukasadoru ou no jijuu Egai no kanri no moto ni oite, keshou no tame no shinajina o karera ni ataete kudasai.
Kou shite gyoi ni kanau otome o totte, Washite no kawari ni ouhi to shite kudasai". Ou wa kono koto o yoshi to shi, sono you ni itta.
Sate shuto Susa ni hitori no Yudayajin ga ita. Na o Morudekai to ii, Kishi no hiko, Shimei no mago, Yairu no ko de, Beniyamin bito de atta.
Kare wa Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga toraete itta Yuda no ou Ekoniya to tomo ni toraerarete itta horyo no hitori de, Erusaremu kara toraeutsusareta mono de aru.
Kare wa sono oji no musume Hadassa sunawachi Esuteru o yashinaisodateta. Kanojo ni wa chichi mo haha mo nakattakara de aru. Kono otome wa utsukushiku, kawairashikattaga, sono fubo no shigo, Morudekai wa kanojo o hikitotte jibun no musume to shita no de aru.
Ou no meirei to mikotonori ga tsutaerare, ooku no otome ga shuto Susa ni atsumerarete, Egai no kanri no moto ni okareta toki, Esuteru mo mata oukyuu ni tazusae yukare, fujin o tsukasadoru Egai no kanri no moto ni okareta.
Kono otome wa Egai no kokoro ni kanatte, sono itsukushimi o eta. Sunawachi Egai wa sumiyaka ni kanojo ni keshou no shinajina oyobi shokumotsu no wakemae o atae, mata kyuuchuu kara shichinin no sugureta jijo o erande kanojo ni tsukisowase, kanojo to sono jijotachi o fujin no kyoshitsu no uchi no mottomo yoi tokoro ni utsushita.
Esuteru wa jibun no tami no koto o mo, jibun no douzoku no koto o mo hito ni shirasenakatta. Morudekai ga kore o shirasu na to kanojo ni meijitakara de aru.
Morudekai wa Esuteru no yousu oyobi kanojo ga dou shite iru ka o shirouto, mainichi fujin no kyoshitsu no niwa no mae o aruita.
Otometachi wa onoono fujin no tame no kitei ni shitagatte juu ni kagetsu o hete nochi, junban ni Ahashuerosu ou no tokoro e iku no de atta. Kore wa karera no keshou no kikan to shite, motsuyaku no abura o mochiiru koto roku kagetsu, kouryou oyobi fujin no keshou ni tsukau shinajina o mochiiru koto roku kagetsu ga sadamerarete itakara de aru.
Kou shite otome wa ou no tokoro e iku no de atta. Soshite otome ga fujin no kyoshitsu o dete oukyuu e iku toki ni wa, subete sono nozomu mono ga ataerareta.
Soshite yuugata itte, akuru asa daini no fujin no kyoshitsu ni kaeri, sobametachi o tsukasadoru ou no jijuu Shashigazu no kanri ni utsusareta. Ou ga sono onna o yorokobi, nazashi te mesu no de nakereba, futatabi ou no tokoro e iku koto wa nakatta.
Sate Morudekai no oji Abihairu no musume, sunawachi Morudekai ga hikitotte jibun no musume to shita Esuteru ga ou no tokoro e yuku junban to nattaga, kanojo wa fujin o tsukasadoru ou no jijuu Egai ga susumeta mono no hoka nani o mo motomenakatta. Esuteru wa subete kanojo o miru mono ni yorokobareta.
Esuteru ga Ahashuerosu ou ni mesarete oukyuu e itta no wa, sono chisei no dainana nen no juu gatsu, sunawachi Tebete no tsuki de atta.
Ou wa subete no fujin ni masatte Esuteru o aishita no de, kanojo wa subete no shojo ni masatte ou no mae ni megumi to itsukushimi to o eta. Ou wa tsuini ouhi no kanmuri o kanojo no atama ni itadakase, Washite ni kawatte ouhi to shita.
Soshite ou wa ooinaru shuen o moyooshite, subete no daijin to jishin o motenashita. Esuteru no shuen ga kore de aru. Mata shoshuu ni menzei o okonai, ou no ookina doryou ni shitagatte okurimono o ataeta.
Ni dome ni shojotachi ga atsumerareta toki, Morudekai wa ou no mon ni suwatte ita.
Esuteru wa Morudekai ga meijita you ni, mada jibun no douzoku no koto o mo jibun no tami no koto o mo hito ni shirasenakatta. Esuteru wa Morudekai no kotoba ni shitagau koto, kare ni yashinaisodaterareta toki to sukoshi mo kawaranakatta.
Sono koro, Morudekai ga ou no mon ni suwatte ita toki, ou no jijuu de, ou no heya no to o mamoru mono no uchi no Bigutan to Tereshi no futari ga ikari no amari Ahashuerosu ou o korosou to neratte itaga,
Sono koto ga Morudekai ni shireta no de, kare wa kore o ouhi Esuteru ni tsuge, Esuteru wa kore o Morudekai no na o motte ou ni tsugeta.
Sono koto ga shiraberarete, sore ni soui nai koto ga arawareta no de, karera futari wa ki ni kakerareta. Kono koto wa ou no mae de nisshi no sho ni kakishirusareta.
Korera no koto no nochi, Ahashuerosu ou wa Agagu bito Hanmedata no ko Haman o omonji, kore o shoushin sasete, jibun to tomo ni iru subete no daijintachi no ue ni sono seki o sadamesaseta.
Ou no mon no uchi ni iru ou no jishintachi wa mina hizamazuite Haman ni keirei shita. Kore wa ou ga kare ni tsuite kou suru koto o meijitakara de aru. Shikashi Morudekai wa hizamazukazu, mata keirei shinakatta.
Soko de ou no mon ni iru ou no jishintachi wa Morudekai ni mukatte, "Anata wa dou shite ou no meirei ni somuku no ka" to itta.
Karera wa mainichi Morudekai ni kou iukeredo mo kikiirenakatta no de, sono koto ga yurusareru ka dou ka o miyou to, kore o Haman ni tsugeta. Naze nara Morudekai wa sudeni jibun no Yudayajin de aru koto o karera ni katattakara de aru.
Haman wa Morudekai no hizamazukazu, mata jibun ni keirei shinai no o mite ikari ni mitasaretaga,
Tada Morudekai dake o korosu koto o isagiyoshi to shinakatta. Karera ga Morudekai no zokusuru tami o Haman ni shiraseta no de, Haman wa Ahashuerosu no kuni no uchi ni iru subete no Yudayajin, sunawachi Morudekai no zokusuru tami o kotogotoku horobosou to hakatta.
Ahashuerosu ou no daijuu ni nen no shougatsu sunawachi Nisan no tsuki ni, Haman no mae de, juu ni gatsu sunawachi Adaru no tsuki made, ichi nichi tsuitachi no tame, ichi tsuki ichi tsuki no tame ni, Puru sunawachi kuji o nagesaseta.
Soshite Haman wa Ahashuerosu ou ni itta, "Okuni no kakushuu ni iru shomin no uchi ni, chirasarete, wakarewakare ni natte iru hitotsu no tami ga imasu. Sono houritsu wa ta no subete no tami no mono to kotonari, mata karera wa ou no houritsu o mamorimasen. Sore yue karera o yurushite oku koto wa ou no tame ni narimasen.
Moshi ou ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, karera o horobose to mikotonori o okaki kudasai. Sou sureba watashi wa ou no koto o tsukasadoru monotachi no te ni gin ichi man taranto o hakari watashite, ou no kinko ni iresasemashou".
Soko de ou wa te kara yubiwa o hazushi, Agagu bito Hanmedata no ko de, Yudayahito no teki de aru Haman ni watashita.
Soshite ou wa Haman ni itta, "Sono gin wa anata ni ataeru. Sono tami mo mata anata ni ataerukara, yoi to omou you ni shi nasai".
Soko de shougatsu no juu san nichi ni ou no shokikan ga meshiatsumerare, ou no soutoku, kakushuu no chiji oyobi shomin no tsukasatachi ni Haman ga meijita koto o kotogotoku kakishirushita. Sunawachi kakushuu ni okuru mono ni wa sono monji o mochii, shomin ni okuru mono ni wa sono gengo o mochii, onoono Ahashuerosu ou no na o motte sore o kaki, ou no yubiwa o motte sore ni in o oshita.
Soshite kyuushi o motte sono sho o ou no shoshuu ni okuri, juu ni gatsu sunawachi Adaru no tsuki no juu san nichi ni, ichi nichi no uchi ni subete no Yudayahito o, wakai mono, oita mono, kodomo, onna no betsu naku, kotogotoku horoboshi, koroshi, tayashi, katsu sono kazai o ubaitore to meijita.
Kono bunsho no utsushi o mikotonori to shite kakushuu ni tsutae, subete no tami ni kouji shite, sono hi no tame ni sonaesaseyou to shita.
Kyuushi wa ou no meirei ni yori isoide dete itta. Kono mikotonori wa shuto Susa de happu sareta. Toki ni ou to Haman wa zashite sake o nonde itaga, Susa no miyako wa awatemadotta.
Morudekai wa subete kono nasareta koto o shitta toki, sono koromo o saki, aranuno o matoi, hai o kaburi, machi no naka e itte oogoe o age, hageshiku sakende,
Ou no mon no iriguchi made itta. Aranuno o matotte wa ou no mon no uchi ni hairu koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Subete ou no meirei to mikotonori o uketotta kakushuu de wa Yudayahito no uchi ni ooinaru kanashimi ga ari, danjiki, nageki, sakebi ga okori, mata aranuno o matoi, hai no ue ni zasuru mono ga ookatta.
Esuteru no jijotachi oyobi jijuutachi ga kite, kono koto o tsugeta no de, ouhi wa hijou ni kanashimi, Morudekai ni kimono o okuri, sore o kisete, aranuno o nugaseyou to shitaga ukenakatta.
Soko de Esuteru wa ou no jijuu no hitori de, ou ga jibun ni haberaseta Hataku o meshi, Morudekai no moto e itte, sore wa nanigoto de aru ka, naniyue de aru ka o tazunete kuru you ni to meijita.
Hataku wa dete, ou no mon no mae ni aru machi no hiroba ni iru Morudekai no moto e ikuto,
Morudekai wa jibun no mi ni okotta subete no koto o kare ni tsuge, katsu Haman ga Yudayahito o horobosu koto no tame ni ou no kinko ni hakari ireru to yakusoku shita gin no seikaku na gaku o tsugeta.
Mata karera o horobosaseru tame ni, Susa de happu sareta shousho no utsushi o kare ni watashi, sore o Esuteru ni mise, katsu tokiakashi, kanojo ga ou no moto e itte sono tami no tame ni ou no awaremi o koi, ou no mae ni negaimotomeru you ni kanojo ni iitsutaeyo to itta.
Hataku ga kaette kite Morudekai no kotoba o Esuteru ni tsugeta no de,
Esuteru wa Hataku ni meiji, Morudekai ni kotoba o tsutaesasete itta,
"Ou no jishin oyobi ou no shoshuu no tami wa mina, otoko de mo onna de mo, subete mesarenai no ni uchiniwa ni haitte ou no moto e yuku mono wa, kanarazu korosarenakereba naranai to iu hitotsu no houritsu no aru koto o shitte imasu. Tadashi ou ga sono mono ni kin no shaku o nobereba ikiru koto ga dekiru no desu. Shikashi watashi wa kono sanjuu nichi no aida, ou no moto e ikubeki meshi o koumuranai no desu".
Esuteru no kotoba o Morudekai ni tsugeta no de,
Morudekai wa meijite Esuteru ni kotaesasete itta, "Anata wa oukyuu ni iru yue, subete no Yudayahito to kotonari, nan o manukarerudarou to omotte wa naranai.
Anata ga moshi, kono you na toki ni damatte irunaraba, hoka no tokoro kara, tasuke to sukui ga Yudayahito no tame ni okorudeshou. Shikashi, anata to anata no chichi no ie to wa horobirudeshou. Anata ga kono kuni ni mukaerareta no wa, kono you na toki no tame de nakatta to dare ga shirimashou".
Soko de Esuteru wa meijite Morudekai ni kotaesaseta,
"Anata wa itte Susa ni iru subete no Yudayahito o atsume, watashi no tame ni danjiki shite kudasai. Mikka no aida yoru mo hiru mo kui nomi shite wa narimasen. Watashi to watashi no jijotachi mo douyou ni danjiki shimashou. Soshite watashi wa houritsu ni somuku koto desuga ou no moto e ikimasu. Watashi ga moshi shinaneba naranai no nara, shinimasu".
Morudekai wa itte, Esuteru ga subete jibun ni meijita toori ni okonatta.
Mikkame ni Esuteru wa ouhi no fuku o ki, oukyuu no uchiniwa ni hairi, ou no hiroma ni mukatte tatta. Ou wa oukyuu no gyokuza ni zashite oukyuu no iriguchi ni mukatte itaga,
Ouhi Esuteru ga niwa ni tatte iru no o mite kanojo ni megumi o shimeshi, sono te ni aru kin no shaku o Esuteru no hou ni nobashita no de, Esuteru wa susumiyotte sono shaku no atama ni sawatta.
Ou wa kanojo ni itta, "Ouhi Esuteru yo, nani o motomeru no ka. Anata no negai wa nani ka. Kuni no nakaba de mo anata ni ataeyou".
Esuteru wa itta, "Moshi ou ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, kyou watashi ga ou no tame ni mouketa shuen ni, Haman to goissho ni onozomi kudasai".
Soko de ou wa "Haman o hayaku tsurete kite, Esuteru no iu you ni seyo" to ii, yagate ou to Haman wa Esuteru no mouketa shuen ni nozonda.
Shuen no toki, ou wa Esuteru ni itta, "Anata no motomeru koto wa nani ka. Kanarazu kikareru. Anata no negai wa nani ka. Kuni no nakaba de mo kikitodokerareru".
Esuteru wa kotaete itta, "Watashi no motome, watashi no negai wa kore desu.
Moshi watashi ga ou no me no mae ni megumi o e, mata ou ga moshi watashi no motome o yurushi, watashi no negai o kikitodokeru no o yoshi to sarerunaraba, Haman to goissho ni, asu mata, watashi ga moukeyou to suru shuen ni, onozomi kudasai. Watashi wa asu ou no okotoba doori ni itashimashou".
Kou shite Haman wa sono hi, kokoro ni yorokobitanoshinde dete kitaga, Haman wa Morudekai ga ou no mon ni ite, jibun ni mukatte tachiagari mo sezu, mata miugoki mo shinai no o mita no de, Morudekai ni taishi ikari ni mitasareta.
Shikashi Haman wa taeshinonde ie ni kaeri, hito o yatte sono tomodachi oyobi tsuma Zereshi o yonde kosase,
Soshite Haman wa sono tomi no eiga to, sono musukotachi no ooi koto to, subete ou ga jibun o omonjirareta koto, mata ou no daijin oyobi jishintachi ni masatte jibun o shoushin saserareta koto o karera ni katatta.
Haman wa mata itta, "Ouhi Esuteru wa shuen o mouketaga, watashi no hoka wa dare mo ou to tomo ni kore ni nozomasenakatta. Asu mo mata watashi wa ou to tomo ni ouhi ni manekarete iru.
Shikashi Yudayahito Morudekai ga ou no mon ni zashite iru no o miru aida wa, korera no koto mo watashi ni wa tanoshiku nai".
Sono toki, tsuma Zereshi to subete no tomo wa kare ni itta, "Takasa gojuu kyubito no ki o tatesase, asu no asa, Morudekai o sono ue ni kakeru you ni ou ni moushiage nasai. Soshite ou to issho ni tanoshinde sono shuen ni oide nasai". Haman wa kono koto o yoshi to shite, sono ki o tatesaseta.
Sono yoru, ou wa nemuru koto ga dekinakatta no de, meijite hibi no koto o shirushita kiroku no sho o motte kosase, ou no mae de yomasetaga,
Sono naka ni, Morudekai ga katsute ou no jijuu de, ou no heya no to o mamoru mono no uchi no Bigutana to Tereshi no futari ga, Ahashuerosu ou o korosou to neratte iru koto o tsugeta, to shirusarete iru no o miidashita.
Soko de ou wa itta, "Kono koto no tame ni, donna eiyo to shakui o Morudekai ni ataeta ka". Ou ni tsukaeru jishintachi wa itta, "Nani mo kare ni ataete imasen".
Ou wa itta, "Niwa ni iru no wa dare ka". Kono toki Haman wa Morudekai no tame ni mouketa ki ni Morudekai o kakeru koto o ou ni moushiageyou to oukyuu no sotoniwa ni haitte kite ita.
Ou no jishintachi ga "Haman ga niwa ni tatte imasu" to ou ni itta no de, ou wa "Koko e, hairase yo" to itta.
Yagate Haman ga haitte kuruto ou wa itta, "Ou ga eiyo o ataeyou to omou hito ni wa dou shitara yokarou ka". Haman wa kokoro no uchi ni itta, "Ou wa watashi igai ni dare ni eiyo o ataeyou to omowarerudarou ka".
Haman wa ou ni itta, "Ou ga eiyo o ataeyou to omowareru hito no tame ni wa,
Ou no kirareta ifuku o motte kosase, mata ou no norareta uma, sunawachi sono atama ni oukan o itadaita uma o hiite kosase,
Sono ifuku to uma to o ou no mottomo tattoi daijin no hitori no te ni watashite, ou ga eiyo o ataeyou to omowareru hito ni sono ifuku o kisase, mata sono hito o uma ni nose, machi no hiroba o michibiite toorase, 'Ou ga eiyo o ataeyou to omou hito ni wa kou suru no da' to sono mae ni yobawarase nasai".
Sore de ou wa Haman ni itta, "Isoide anata ga itta you ni, sono ifuku to uma to o toriyose, ou no mon ni zashite iru Yudayahito Morudekai ni sou shi nasai. Anata ga itta koto o hitotsu mo kaite wa naranai".
Soko de Haman wa ifuku to uma to o toriyose, Morudekai ni sono ifuku o kise, kare o uma ni nosete machi no hiroba o toorase, sono mae ni yobawatte, "Ou ga eiyo o ataeyou to omou hito ni wa kou suru no da" to itta.
Kou shite Morudekai wa ou no mon ni kaette kitaga, Haman wa uree nayami, tou o ootte isoide ie ni kaetta.
Soshite Haman wa jibun no mi ni tatta koto o kotogotoku sono tsuma Zereshi to tomodachi ni tsugeta. Suruto sono chishatachi oyobi tsuma Zereshi wa kare ni itta, "Ano Morudekai, sunawachi anata ga sono hito no mae ni yabure hajimeta mono ga, moshi Yudayajin no shison de arunaraba, anata wa kare ni katsu koto wa dekinai. Kanarazu kare no mae ni yaburerudeshou".
Karera ga nao Haman to hanashite iru toki, ou no jijuutachi ga kite Haman o unagashi, Esuteru ga mouketa shuen ni nozomaseta.
Ou to Haman wa ouhi Esuteru no shuen ni nozonda.
Kono futsu ka me no shuen ni ou wa mata Esuteru ni itta, "Ouhi Esuteru yo, anata no motomeru koto wa nani ka. Kanarazu kikareru. Anata no negai wa nani ka. Kuni no nakaba de mo kikitodokerareru".
Ouhi Esuteru wa kotaete itta, "Ou yo, moshi watashi ga ou no me no mae ni megumi o e, mata ou ga moshi yoshi to sarerunaraba, watashi no motome ni shitagatte watashi no inochi o watashi ni atae, mata watashi no negai ni shitagatte watashi no tami o watashi ni ataete kudasai.
Watashi to watashi no tami wa urarete horobosare, korosare, tayasareyou to shite imasu. Moshi watashitachi ga danjo no dorei to shite urareta dake nara, watashi wa damatte itadeshou. Watashitachi no nangi wa ou no sonshitsu to wa hikaku ni naranaikara desu".
Ahashuerosu ou wa ouhi Esuteru ni itta, "Sonna koto o shiyou to kokoro ni takurande iru mono wa dare ka. Mata doko ni iru no ka".
Esuteru wa itta, "Sono ada, sono teki wa kono warui Haman desu". Soko de Haman wa ou to ouhi no mae ni osoreononoita.
Ou wa ikatte shuen no seki o tachi, kyuuden no sono e ittaga, Haman wa nokotte ouhi Esuteru ni inochigoi o shita. Kare wa ou ga jibun ni gai o kuwaeyou to sadameta no o mitakara de aru.
Ou ga kyuuden no sono kara shuen no basho ni kaette miruto, Esuteru no ita nagai su no ue ni Haman ga fushite ita no de, ou wa itta, "Kare wa mata watashi no ie de, shikamo watashi no mae de ouhi o hazukashimeyou to suru no ka". Kono kotoba ga ou no kuchi kara deta toki, hitobito wa, Haman no kao o ootta.
Sono toki, ou ni tsukisotte ita hitori no jijuu Harubona ga "Ou no tame ni yoi koto o tsugeta ano Morudekai no tame ni Haman ga youi shita takasa gojuu kyubito no ki ga Haman no ie ni tatte imasu" to itta no de, ou wa "Kare o sore ni kakeyo" to itta.
Soko de hitobito wa Haman o Morudekai no tame ni sonaete atta sono ki ni kaketa. Kou shite ou no ikari wa yawaraida.
Sono hi Ahashuerosu ou wa, Yudayajin no teki Haman no ie o ouhi Esuteru ni ataeta. Morudekai wa ou no mae ni kita. Kore wa Esuteru ga jibun to Morudekai ga donna kankei no mono de aru ka o tsugetakara de aru.
Ou wa Haman kara torikaeshita jibun no yubiwa o hazushite, Morudekai ni ataeta. Esuteru wa Morudekai ni Haman no ie o kanri saseta.
Esuteru wa futatabi ou no mae ni soushi, sono ashimoto ni hirefushite, Agagu bi to Haman no inbou sunawachi kare ga Yudayajin ni taishite kuwadateta sono keikaku o nozoku koto o namidanagara ni koimotometa.
Ou wa Esuteru ni mukatte kin no shaku o nobeta no de, Esuteru wa mi o okoshite ou no mae ni tachi,
Soshite itta, "Moshi ou ga yoshi to sare, watashi ga ou no mae ni megumi o e, mata kono koto ga ou no mae ni tadashii to mie, katsu watashi ga ou no me ni kanaunaraba, Agagu bito Hanmedata no ko Haman ga ou no shoshuu ni iru Yudayajin o horobosou to hakatte kakiokutta sho o torikesu mune o kakasete kudasai.
Dou shite watashi wa, watashi no tami ni nozomou to suru wazawai o, damatte mite iru koto ga dekimashou ka. Dou shite watashi no douzoku no horobiru no o, damatte mite iru koto ga dekimashou ka".
Ahashuerosu ou wa ouhi Esuteru to Yudayajin Morudekai ni itta, "Haman ga Yudayajin o korosou to shita no de, watashi wa Haman no ie o Esuteru ni atae, mata Haman o ki ni kakesaseta.
Anata gata wa jibuntachi no omou mama ni ou no na o motte Yudayajin ni tsuite no sho o tsukuri, ou no yubiwa o motte sore ni in o osu ga yoi. Ou no na o motte kaki, ou no yubiwa o motte in o oshita sho wa dare mo torikesu koto ga dekinai".
Sono toki ou no shokikan ga meshiatsumerareta. Sore wa san gatsu sunawachi Shiwan no tsuki no nijuu san nichi de atta. Soshite Indo kara Echiopiya made no hyaku nijuu nana shuu ni iru soutoku, shoshuu no chiji oyobi daijintachi ni, Morudekai ga Yudayajin ni tsuite meijita toori ni kakiokutta. Sunawachi kakushuu ni wa sono moji o mochii, kakuminzoku ni wa sono gengo o mochiite kakiokuri, Yudayajin ni okuru mono ni wa sono moji to gengo to o mochiita.
Sono sho wa Ahashuerosu ou no na o motte kakare, ou no yubiwa o motte in o oshi, ou no goyou uma to shite, sono umaya ni sodatta hayauma ni noru kyuushi ni yotte okurareta.
Sono naka de, ou wa subete no machi ni iru Yudayajin ni, karera ga aiatsumatte jibuntachi no seimei o hogo shi, jibuntachi o osoou to suru shokoku, shoshuu no subete no busou shita tami o, sono saishi morotomo ni horoboshi, koroshi, tayashi, katsu sono kazai o ubaitoru koto o yurushita.
Tadashi kono koto o Ahashuerosu ou no shoshuu ni oite, juu ni gatsu sunawachi Adaru no tsuki no juu san nichi ni, ichi nichi no uchi ni okonau koto o meijita.
Kono kaita mono no utsushi o mikotonori to shite kakushuu ni tsutae, subete no tami ni kouji shite, Yudayajin ni, sono hi no tame ni sonae shite, sono teki ni ada o kaesaseyou to shita.
Ou no goyou uma de aru hayauma ni notta kyuushi wa, ou no mei ni yotte iso ga sare, sekitaterarete dete itta. Kono mikotonori wa shuto Susa de dasareta.
Morudekai wa ao to shiro no chou fuku o ki, ookina kin no kanmuri o itadaki, murasakiiro no hosonuno no uwagi o matotte ou no mae kara dete itta. Susa no machijyuu, koe o agete yorokonda.
Yudayajin ni wa hikari to yorokobi to tanoshimi to homare ga atta.
Izure no shuu de mo, izure no machi de mo, subete ou no meirei to mikotonori no dentatsu sareta tokoro de wa, Yudayajin wa yorokobitanoshimi, shuen o hiraite kono hi o shukujitsu to shita. Soshite kono kuni no tami no uchi ooku no mono ga Yudayajin to natta. Kore wa Yudayajin o osoreru kokoro ga karera no uchi ni tattakara de aru.
Juu ni gatsu sunawachi Adaru no tsuki no juu san nichi, ou no meirei to mikotonori no okonawareru toki ga chikazuita toki, sunawachi Yudayajin no teki ga, Yudayajin o uchifuseyou to nozonde ita no ni, kaette Yudayajin ga jibuntachi o nikumu mono o uchifuseru koto to natta sono hi ni,
Yudayajin wa Ahashuerosu ou no kakushuu ni aru jibuntachi no machimachi ni atsumari, jibuntachi ni gai o kuwaeyou to suru mono o korosou to shitaga, dare mo Yudayajin ni sakarau koto no dekiru mono wa nakatta. Subete no tami ga Yudayajin o osoretakara de aru.
Shoshuu no daijin, soutoku, chiji oyobi ou no koto o tsukasadoru mono wa mina Yudayajin o tasuketa. Karera wa Morudekai o osoretakara de aru.
Morudekai wa ou no ie de ooinaru mono to nari, sono meisei wa kakushuu ni kikoe watatta. Kono hito Morudekai ga masumasu seiryoku aru mono to nattakara de aru.
Soko de Yudayajin wa tsurugi o motte subete no teki o utte koroshi, horoboshi, jibuntachi o nikumu mono ni taishi kokoro no mama ni itta.
Yudayajin wa mata shuto Susa ni oite mo gohyakunin o koroshi, horoboshita.
Mata Parushandata, Darupon, Asupata,
Porata, Adariya, Aridata,
Parumashita, Arisai, Aridai, Waezata,
Sunawachi Hanmedata no ko de, Yudayajin no teki de aru Haman no juunin no ko o mo koroshita. Shikashi, sono bundori mono ni wa te o kakenakatta.
Sono hi, shuto Susa de korosareta mono no kazu ga ou ni houkoku sareruto,
Ou wa ouhi Esuteru ni itta, "Yudayajin wa shuto Susa de gohyakunin o koroshi, mata Haman no juunin no ko o koroshita. Ou no sono ta no shoshuu de wa donna ni karera wa koroshita koto de arou. Sate anata no motomeru koto wa nani ka. Kanarazu kikareru. Sarani anata no negai wa nani ka. Kanarazu kikitodokerareru".
Esuteru wa itta, "Moshi ou ga yoshi to sarerunaraba, douzo Susa ni iru Yudayajin ni asu mo, kyou no mikotonori no you ni okonau koto o yurushite kudasai. Katsu Haman no juunin no ko o ki ni kakesasete kudasai".
Ou wa sou seyo to meijita no de, Susa ni oite mikotonori ga dete, Haman no juunin no ko wa ki ni kakerareta.
Adaru no tsuki no juu yonka ni mata Susa ni iru Yudayajin ga atsumari, Susa de sanbyakunin o koroshita. Shikashi, sono bundori mono ni wa te o kakenakatta.
Ou no shoshuu ni iru ta no Yudayajin mo mata atsumatte, jibuntachi no seimei o hogo shi, sono teki ni katte heian o e, jibuntachi o nikumu mono nana man gosennin o koroshita. Shikashi, sono bundori mono ni wa te o kakenakatta.
Kore wa Adaru no tsuki no juu san nichi de atte, sono juu yonka ni yasunde, sono hi o shuen to yorokobi no hi to shita.
Shikashi Susa ni iru Yudayajin wa juu san nichi to juu yonka ni atsumari, juu go nichi ni yasunde, sono hi o shuen to yorokobi no hi to shita.
Sore yue muramura no Yudayajin sunawachi jouheki no nai machimachi ni sumu mono wa Adaru no tsuki no juu yonka o yorokobi no hi, shuen no hi, shukujitsu to shi, tagai ni tabemono o okuru hi to shita.
Morudekai wa korera no koto o kakishirushite Ahashuerosu ou no shoshuu ni iru subete no Yudayajin ni, chikai mono ni mo tooi mono ni mo sho o okuri,
Adaru no tsuki no juu yonka to juu go nichi to o nennen iwau koto o meijita.
Sunawachi kono ryoujitsu ni Yudayajin ga sono teki ni katte heian o e, mata kono tsuki wa karera no tame ni ureikara yorokobi ni kawari, kanashimi kara shukujitsu ni kawatta no de, korera o shuen to yorokobi no hi to shite, tagai ni tabemono o okuri, mazushii mono ni hodokoshi o suru hi to seyo to satoshita.
Soko de Yudayajin wa karera ga sudeni hajimeta you ni, mata Morudekai ga karera ni kakiokutta you ni, okonau koto o yakusoku shita.
