Naniyue, watashi wa tai kara dete, shinanakatta no ka. Hara kara deta toki iki ga taenakatta no ka.
Naniyue, hiza ga, watashi o uketa no ka. Naniyue, chibusa ga atte, watashi wa sore o sutta no ka.
Sou shinakattanaraba, watashi wa fushite yasumi, nemuttade arou. Sou sureba watashi wa yasunjite ori,
Jibun no tame ni are ato o kizukinaoshita chi no outachi, sangitachi,
Aruiha, kogane o mochi, shirogane o ie ni mitashita kimitachi to issho ni itade arou.
