Watashi no nageki wa waga shokumotsu ni kawatte kitari, watashi no umeki wa mizu no you ni nagarederu.
Watashi no osoreru mono ga, watashi ni nozomi, watashi no osoreononoku mono ga, waga mi ni oyobu.
Watashi wa yasuraka de naku, mata odayaka de nai. Watashi wa yasumi o enai, tada nayami nomi ga kuru".
Sono toki, Teman bi to Eripazu ga kotaete itta,
"Moshi hito ga anata ni mukatte iken o noberunaraba, anata wa hara o taterudeshou ka. Shikashi dare ga damatte oremashou.
Miyo, anata wa ooku no hito o oshiesatoshi, otoroeta te o tsuyoku shita.
Anata no kotoba wa tsumazuku mono o tasukeokoshi, kayowai hiza o tsuyoku shita.
Tokoro ga ima, kono koto ga anata ni nozomuto, anata wa tae enai. Kono koto ga anata ni fureruto, anata wa oji madou.
Anata ga kami o osorete iru koto wa, anata no yoridokoro de wa nai ka. Anata no michi no mattakiko to wa, anata no nozomi de wa nai ka.
Kangaete miyo, dare ga tsumi no nai no ni, horobosareta mono ga aru ka. Doko ni tadashii mono de, tachi horobosareta mono ga aru ka.
Watashi no mita tokoro ni yoreba, fugi o tagayashi, gaiaku o maku mono wa, sore o karitotte iru.
Karera wa kami no ibuki ni yotte horobi, sono ikari no iki ni yotte kieuseru.
Shishi no hoeru koe, takeki shishi no koe wa tomo ni yami, wakaki shishi no kiba wa orare,
O jishi wa emono o ezu ni horobi, me jishi no ko wa chirasareru.
Sate, watashi ni, kotoba ga hisoka ni nozonda, watashi no mimi wa sono sasayaki o kiita.
Sunawachi hito no jukusui suru koro, yoru no maboroshi ni yotte omoimidarete iru toki,
Osore ga watashi ni nozonda no de, ononoki, watashi no hone wa kotogotoku furueta.
Toki ni, rei ga atte, watashi no kao no mae o sugita no de, watashi no minoke wa yodatta.
Sono mono wa tachidomattaga, watashi wa sono sugata o miwakeru koto ga dekinakatta. Hitotsu no katachi ga, watashi no me no mae ni atta. Watashi wa shizuka na koe o kiita,
'Hito wa kami no mae ni tadashiku ari eyou ka. Hito wa sono tsukurinushi no mae ni kiyoku ari eyou ka.
Miyo, kare wa sono shimobe o saetanomi to sezu, sono tenshi o mo ayamareru mono to minasareru.
Mashite, doro no ie ni sumu mono, chiri o sono motoi to suru mono, shimi no you ni tsubusareru mono.
Karera wa asa kara yuu made no aida ni uchikudakare, kaerimiru mono mo naku, eien ni horobiru.
Moshi sono tenmaku no tsuna ga karera no uchi ni torisararerunara, tsuini satoru koto mo naku, shi ni userude wa nai ka'.
Kokoromi ni yonde miyo, dare ka anata ni kotaeru mono ga aru ka. Dono seija ni anata wa tanomou to suru no ka.
Tashika ni, ikidoori wa oroka na mono o koroshi, netami wa asahaka na mono o shinaseru.
Watashi wa oroka na mono no ne o haru no o mita, shikashi watashi wa, niwaka ni sono sumika o norotta.
Sono kora wa yasuki o ezu, machi no mon deshi e tagerarete mo, kore o sukuu mono ga nai.
Sono shuukaku wa ueta hito ga tabe, ibara no naka kara sae, kore o ubau. Mata, kawaita mono wa sono zaisan o aegi motomeru.
Kurushimi wa, chiri kara okoru mono de naku, nayami wa tsuchi kara shoujiru mono de nai.
Hito ga umarete nayami o ukeru no wa, hi no ko ga ue ni tobu ni hitoshii.
Shikashi, watashi de arunaraba, kami ni motome, kami ni, watashi no koto o makaseru.
Kare wa ooinaru koto o sareru kata de, hakarishirenai, sono fushigi na miwaza wa kazoegatai.
Kare wa chi ni ame o furase, no ni mizu o okurareru.
Kare wa hikui mono o takaku age, kanashimu mono o hikiagete, anzen ni sareru.
Kare wa warugashikoi mono no hakarigoto o yaburareru. Sore de nanigoto mo sono te ni nashitogeru koto wa dekinai.
Kare wa kashikoi mono o, karera jishin no warudakumi ni yotte torae, magatta mono no hakarigoto o kutsugaesareru.
Karera wa hiru mo, yami ni ai, mahiru ni mo, yoru no you ni tesaguri suru.
Kare wa mazushii mono o karera no kuchi no tsurugi kara sukui, mata tsuyoi mono no te kara sukuwareru.
Sore yue toboshii mono ni nozomi ga ari, fugi wa sono kuchi o tojiru.
Miyo, kami ni imashimerareru hito wa saiwai da. Sore yue zennousha no kora shime o karonjite wa naranai.
Kare wa kizutsuke, mata tsutsumi, uchi, mata sono te o motte iyasareru.
Kare wa anata o muitsu no nayami kara sukui, nanatsu no uchi de mo, wazawai wa anata ni fureru koto ga nai.
Kikin no toki ni wa, anata o aganatte, shi o manukaresase, ikusa no toki ni wa, tsurugi no chikara o manukaresaserareru.
Anata wa shita o motte muchiutareru toki ni mo, ooikakusare, horobi ga kuru toki de mo, osoreru koto wa nai.
Anata wa horobito, kikin to o warai, chi no kemono o mo osoreru koto wa nai.
Anata wa no no ishi to keiyaku o musubi, no no kemono wa anata to yawaragukara de aru.
Anata wa jibun no tenmaku no anzen na koto o shiri, jibun no kachiku no ori o mimawatte mo, kaketa mono ga naku,
Mata, anata no shison no ooku nari, sono sue ga chi no kusa no you ni naru no o shirude arou.
Anata wa kourei ni tasshite haka ni hairu, atakamo mugi taba o sono kisetsu ni natte uchi ba ni hakobiageru you ni narude arou.
Miyo, wareware no tazune kiwameta tokoro wa kono toori da. Anata wa kore o kiite, mizukara shiru ga yoi".
Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Dou ka watashi no ikidoori ga tadashiku hakarare, douji ni watashi no wazawai mo, hakari ni kakerareru you ni.
Sou sureba, kore wa umi no suna yori mo omoi ni soui nai. Sore yue, watashi no kotoba ga keisotsu de atta no da.
Zennousha no ya ga, watashi no uchi ni ari, watashi no rei wa sono doku o nomi, kami no osorubeki gunzei ga, watashi o osoi semete iru.
No roba wa, aokusa no aru no ni nakude arou ka. Ushi wa kaiba no ue de unarude arou ka.
Aji no nai mono wa shio ga nakute taberareyou ka. Suberihiyu no shiru wa aji ga arou ka.
Watashi no shokuyoku wa kore ni fureru koto o kobamu. Kore wa, watashi no kirau shokumotsu no you da.
Dou ka watashi no motomeru mono ga erareru you ni. Dou ka kami ga watashi no nozomu mono o kudasaru you ni.
Dou ka kami ga watashi o uchihorobosu koto o yoshi to shi, mite o nobete watashi o tatareru you ni.
Sou sureba, watashi wa nao nagusame o e, hageshii kurushimi no naka ni atte mo yorokobude arou. Watashi wa sei naru mono no kotoba o inanda koto ga naikara da.
Watashi ni donna chikara ga atte, nao mataneba naranai no ka. Watashi ni donna owari ga aru no de, nao taeshinobaneba naranai no ka.
Watashi no chikara wa ishi no chikara no you de aru no ka. Watashi no niku wa seidou no you de aru no ka.
Makoto ni, watashi no uchi ni tasuke wa naku, sukuwareru nozomi wa, watashi kara oiyarareta.
Sono tomo ni taisuru itsukushimi o sashihikaeru mono wa, zennousha o osoreru koto o suteru.
Waga kyoudaitachi wa tanigawa no you ni, sugisaru demizu no you ni azamuku.
Kore wa koori no tame ni kuroku nari, sono uchi ni yuki ga kakureru.
Kore wa atataka ni naruto kiesari, atsuku naruto sono tokoro kara nakunaru.
Taishou wa sono michi o tenji, munashii tokoro e itte horobiru.
Tema no taishou wa kore o nozomi, Shiba no tabibito wa kore o shitau.
Karera wa kore ni tayotta tame ni shitsubou shi, soko ni kite mite, awateru.
Anata gata wa ima watashi ni wa kono you na mono to natta. Anata gata wa watashi no sainan o mite osoreta.
Watashi wa itta koto ga aru ka, 'Watashi ni ataeyo' to, aruiha 'Anata gata no zaisan no uchi kara watashi no tame ni, mainai o okure' to,
Aruiha 'Ada no te kara watashi o sukuidase' to, aruiha 'Shi etageru mono no te kara watashi o aganae' to.
Watashi ni oshieyo, sou sureba watashi wa damarude arou. Watashi no ayamatte iru tokoro o watashi ni satorase yo.
Tadashii kotoba wa ikani chikara no aru mono ka. Shikashi anata gata no imashime wa nani o imashimeru no ka.
Anata gata wa kotoba o imashime uru to omou no ka. Nozomi no taeta mono no kataru koto wa kaze no you na mono da.
Anata gata wa, minashigo no tame ni kuji o hiki, anata gata no tomo o sae urikai surude arou.
Ima, douzo watashi o mirareyo, watashi wa anata gata no kao ni mukatte itsuwaranai.
Douzo, omoinaose, machigatte wa naranai. Sarani omoinaose, watashi no gi wa, nao watashi no uchi ni aru.
Watashi no shita ni fugi ga aru ka. Watashi no kuchi wa wazawai o wakimaeru koto ga dekinude arou ka.
Chijou no hito ni wa, hageshii roumu ga aru de wa nai ka. Mata sono hi wa yatoinin no hi no you de wa nai ka.
Dorei ga yuugure o shitau you ni, yatoinin ga sono chingin o nozomu you ni,
Watashi wa, munashii tsuki o motaserare, nayami no yoru o ataerareru.
Watashi wa neru toki ni iu, 'Itsu okirudarou ka' to. Shikashi yoru wa nagaku, akatsuki made korobi mawaru.
Watashi no niku wa uji to tsuchikure to o matoi, watashi no kawa wa katamatte wa, mata kuzureru.
Watashi no hi wa hata no hiyori mo hayaku, nozomi o motazu ni kiesaru.
Kioku seyo, watashi no inochi wa iki ni suginai koto o. Watashi no me wa futatabi saiwai o miru koto ga nai.
Watashi o miru mono no me wa, kasanete watashi o miru koto ga naku, anata ga watashi ni me o mukerarete mo, watashi wa inai.
Kumo ga kiete, nakunaru you ni, yomi ni kudaru mono wa agatte kuru koto ga nai.
Kare wa futatabi sono ie ni kaerazu, kare no tokoro mo, mohaya kare o mitomenai.
Sore yue, watashi wa waga kuchi o osaezu, watashi no rei no modae ni yotte katari, watashi no tamashii no kurushisa ni yotte nageku.
Watashi wa umi de aru no ka, ryuu de aru no ka, anata wa watashi no ue ni mihari o okareru.
'Watashi no toko wa watashi o nagusame, watashi no nedoko wa waga nageki o karuku suru' to watashi ga iu toki,
Anata wa yume o motte watashi o odorokashi, maboroshi o motte watashi o osoresaserareru.
Sore yue, watashi wa iki no tomaru koto o negai, waga hone yori mo mushiro shi o erabu.
Watashi wa inochi o itou. Watashi wa nagaku ikiru koto o nozomanai. Watashi ni kamawanaide kudasai. Watashi no hi wa iki ni suginai no dakara.
Hito wa nanimono na no de, anata wa kore o ookina mono to shi, kore ni mikokoro o tome,
Asagoto ni, kore o tazune, taema naku, kore o kokoromirareru no ka.
Itsu made, anata wa watashi ni me o hanasazu, tsuba o nomu ma mo, watashi o sutete okarenai no ka.
Hito o kanshi sareru mono yo, watashi ga tsumi o okashitatote, anata ni nani o nashi eyou ka. Naniyue, watashi o anata no mato to shi, watashi o anata no omoni to sareru no ka.
Naniyue, watashi no toga o yurusazu, watashi no fugi o nozokarenai no ka. Watashi wa ima tsuchi no naka ni yokotawaru. Anata ga watashi o tazunerarete mo, watashi wa inaideshou".
Toki ni Shuhi bi to Birudade ga kotaete itta,
"Itsu made anata wa, sono you na koto o iu no ka. Anata no kuchi no kotoba wa arai kaze de wa nai ka.
Kami wa kougi o magerarerude arou ka. Zennousha wa seigi o magerarerude arou ka.
Anata no kotachi ga kare ni tsumi o okashita no de, karera o sono toga no te ni watasareta no da.
Anata ga moshi kami ni motome, zennousha ni inorunaraba,
Anata ga moshi kiyoku, tadashiku arunaraba, kare wa kanarazu anata no tame ni tatte, anata no tadashii sumika o sakaesaserareru.
Anata no hajime wa chiisaku atte mo, anata no owari wa hijou ni ookiku narude arou.
Saki no yo no hito ni toute miyo, senzotachi no tazune kiwameta koto o manabe.
Wareware wa tada, kinou kara atta mono de, nani mo shiranai, wareware no yo ni aru hi wa, kage no you na mono de aru.
Karera wa anata ni oshie, anata ni katari, sono satori kara kotoba o dasanaide arou ka.
Kami gusa wa doro no nai tokoro ni seichou suru koto ga dekiyou ka. Ashi wa mizu no nai tokoro ni oishigeru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Kore wa nao aokute, mada kararenai no ni, subete no kusa ni sakidatte kareru.
Subete kami o wasureru mono no michi wa kono toori da. Kami o shinjinai mono no nozomi wa horobiru.
Sono tanomu tokoro wa tatare, sono yoru tokoro wa, kumo no su no you da.
Sono ie ni yori kakarou to sureba, ie wa tatazu, sore ni sugarou to shite mo, sore wa taenai.
Kare wa hi no mae ni aoao to shigeri, sono wakaeda o sono ni habikorase,
Sono ne o ishizuka ni karamase, iwa no aida ni ikite ite mo,
Moshi sono tokoro kara torinozokarereba, sono tokoro wa kare o kobande iude arou, 'Watashi wa anata o mita koto ga nai' to.
Miyo, kore koso kare no michi no yorokobi de aru, soshite hoka no mono ga chi kara shoujirude arou.
Miyo, kami wa mattakihito o suterarenai. Mata aku o okonau mono no te o shiji sarenai.
Kare wa warai o motte anata no kuchi o mitashi, yorokobi no koe o motte anata no kuchibiru o mitasareru.
Anata o nikumu mono wa haji o kiserare, ashiki mono no tenmaku wa naku naru".
Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Makoto ni watashi wa, sono koto no sono toori de aru koto o shitte iru. Shikashi hito wa dou shite kami no mae ni tadashiku ari eyou ka.
Yoshi kare to arasoou to shite mo, sen ni hitotsu mo kotaeru koto ga dekinai.
Kare wa kokoro kashikoku, chikarazuyoku arareru. Dare ga kare ni mukai, onore o katakuna ni shite, sakaeta mono ga aru ka.
Kare wa, yama o utsusareruga, yama wa shiranai. Kare wa ikari o motte, korera o kutsugaesareru.
Kare ga, chi o furui ugokashite sono tokoro o hanaresaserareruto, sono hashira wa yuragu.
Kare ga hi ni meijirareruto, hi wa denai. Kare wa mata hoshi o tojikomerareru.
Kare wa tada hitori ten o hari, umi no nami o fumareta.
Kare wa hokuto, Orion, Pureadesu oyobi minami no misshitsu o tsukurareta.
Kare ga ooinaru koto o sareru koto wa hakarigataku, fushigi na koto o sareru koto wa kazu shirenai.
Miyo, kare ga watashi no katawara o toorarete mo, watashi wa kare o minai. Kare wa susumi ikareruga, watashi wa kare o mitomenai.
Miyo, kare ga ubaisarareru no ni, dare ga kare o habamu koto ga dekiru ka. Dare ga kare ni mukatte 'Anata wa nani o suru no ka' to iu koto ga dekiru ka.
Kami wa sono ikari o yamerarenai. Rahabu o tasukeru monodomo wa kare no moto ni kaganda.
Dou shite watashi wa kare ni kotae, kotoba o erande, kare to giron suru koto ga dekiyou.
Tatoi watashi wa tadashikute mo kotaeru koto ga dekinai. Watashi o semerareru mono ni awaremi o kowanakereba naranai.
Tatoi watashi ga yobawari, kare ga watashi ni kotaerarete mo, watashi no koe ni mimi o katamukerareta to wa shinjinai.
Kare wa ookaze o motte watashi o uchikudaki, yue naku, watashi ni ooku no kizu o owase,
Watashi ni iki o tsukasezu, nigai mono o motte watashi o mitasareru.
Chikara no arasoi de arunaraba, kare o miyo, sabaki no koto de arunaraba, dare ga kare o yobidasu koto ga dekiyou.
Tatoi watashi wa tadashikute mo, watashi no kuchi wa watashi o tsumi aru mono to suru. Tatoi watashi wa tsumi ga nakute mo, kare wa watashi o magatta mono to suru.
Watashi wa tsumi ga nai, shikashi watashi wa jibun o shiranai. Watashi wa jibun no inochi o itou.
Mina douitsu de aru. Sore yue, watashi wa iu, 'Kare wa tsumi no nai mono to, ashiki mono to o tomo ni horobosareru no da' to.
Wazawai ga niwaka ni hito o korosu you na koto ga aruto, kare wa tsumi no nai mono no kunan o azawarawareru.
Yo wa akunin no te ni watasarete aru. Kare wa sono saibannin no kao o oowareru. Moshi kare de nakereba, kore wa dare no shiwaza ka.
Watashi no hi wa hikyaku yori mo hayaku, tobisatte saiwai o minai.
Kore wa hashiru koto ashibune no gotoku, ejiki ni osoikakaru, washi no you da.
Tatoi watashi wa 'Waga nageki o wasure, ureigao o kaete genki yoku narou' to itte mo,
Watashi wa waga moromoro no kurushimi o osoreru. Anata ga watashi o tsumi naki mono to sarenai koto o watashi wa shitte irukara da.
Watashi wa tsumi aru mono to sarete iru. Dou shite, itazura ni rousuru hitsuyou ga aru ka.
Tatoi watashi wa yuki de mi o arai, aku de te o kiyomete mo,
Anata wa watashi o, mizo no naka ni nagekomareru no de, watashi no kimono mo, watashi o itou you ni naru.
Kami wa watashi no you ni hito de wa nai yue, watashi wa kare ni kotaeru koto ga dekinai. Wareware wa tomo ni sabaki ni nozomu koto ga dekinai.
Wareware no aida ni wa, wareware futari no ue ni te o okubeki chuusaisha ga nai.
Dou ka kare ga sono tsue o watashi kara torihanashi, sono ikari o motte, watashi o osoresaserarenai you ni.
Sou sureba, watashi wa katatte, kare o osoreru koto wa nai. Watashi wa mizukara sono you na mono de wa naikara da.
Watashi wa jibun no inochi o itou. Watashi wa jibun no nageki o tsutsumazu iiarawashi, waga tamashii no kurushimi ni yotte katarou.
Watashi wa kami ni mousou, watashi o tsumi aru mono to sarenai you ni. Naze watashi to arasowareru ka o shirasete hoshii.
Anata wa shi etage o nashi, mite no waza o sute, akunin no keikaku o tera sukoto o yoshi to sareru no ka.
Anata no motte orareru no wa niku no me ka, anata wa hito ga miru you ni mirareru no ka.
Anata no hi wa hito no hi no gotoku, anata no toshi wa hito no nen no you de aru no ka.
Anata wa naniyue watashi no toga o tazune, watashi no tsumi o shiraberareru no ka.
Anata wa watashi no tsumi no nai koto o shitte orareru. Mata anata no te kara sukuidashi uru mono wa nai.
Anata no te wa watashi o katadori, watashi o tsukutta. Tokoro ga ima anata wa kaette, watashi o horobosareru.
Douzo oboete kudasai, anata wa tsuchikure o motte watashi o tsukurareta koto o. Tokoro ga, watashi o chiri ni kaesou to sareru no ka.
Anata wa watashi o chichi no you ni sosogi, kanraku no you ni korikatamarasetade wa nai ka.
Anata wa niku to kawa to o watashi ni kise, hone to suji to o motte watashi o ami,
Inochi to itsukushimi to o watashi ni sazuke, watashi o kaerimite waga rei o mamorareta.
Shikashi anata wa korera no koto o mikokoro ni himeokareta. Kono koto ga anata no kokoro no uchi ni atta koto o watashi wa shitte iru.
Watashi ga moshi tsumi o okaseba, anata wa watashi ni me o tsukete, watashi o tsumi kara tokihanasarenai.
Watashi ga moshi warukereba watashi wa wazawai da. Tatoi watashi ga tadashikute mo, watashi wa atama o ageru koto ga dekinai. Watashi wa haji ni michi, nayami o mite irukara da.
Moshi atama o agereba, anata wa, shishi no you ni watashi o oi, watashi ni mukatte futatabi kusu shiki chikara o arawasareru.
Anata wa shounin o irekaete watashi o seme, watashi ni mukatte anata no ikari o mashi, arata ni gunzei o dashite watashi o semerareru.
Naniyue anata wa watashi o tai kara dasareta ka, watashi wa iki taete me ni mirareru koto naku,
Tai kara haka ni hakobarete, hajime kara nakatta mono no you de attanara, yokatta no ni.
Watashi no inochi no hi wa ikubaku mo naide wa nai ka. Douzo, shibashi watashi o hanarete, sukoshiku nagusame o esaserareru you ni.
Watashi ga itte, kaeru koto no nai sono mae ni, kore o esaserareru you ni. Watashi wa kuraki chi, ankoku no chi e iku.
Kore wa kuraki chi de, yami ni hitoshiku, ankoku de chitsujo naku, hikari mo yami no you da".
Soko de Naama bi to Zoparu wa kotaete itta,
"Kotoba ga ookereba, kotae nashi ni sumasarerudarou ka. Kuchi no tassha na hito wa gi to sarerudarou ka.
Anata no munashii kotoba wa hito o chinmoku saserudarou ka. Anata ga azakeru toki, hito wa anata o hajisasenaidarou ka.
Anata wa iu, 'Watashi no oshie wa tadashii, watashi wa kami no me ni isagiyoi' to.
Douzo kami ga kotoba o dashi, anata ni mukatte kuchibiru o hiraki,
Chie no himitsu o anata ni shimesareru you ni. Kami wa samazama no chishiki o motarerukara de aru. Sore de anata wa shiru gayoi, kami wa anata no tsumi yori mo karuku anata o basserareru koto o.
Anata wa kami no fukai koto o kiwameru koto ga dekiru ka. Zennousha no genkai o kiwameru koto ga dekiru ka.
Sore wa ten yori mo takai, anata wa nani o nashi uru ka. Sore wa yomi yori mo fukai, anata wa nani o shiri uru ka.
Sono ryou wa chi yori mo nagaku, umi yori mo hiroi.
Kare ga moshi yuki megutte hito o torae, sabaki ni meshiatsumerareru toki, dare ga kare o habamu koto ga dekiyou.
Kare wa iyashii ningen o shitte orarerukara da. Kare wa fugi o miru toki, kore ni kokoro o tomerarenude arou ka.
Shikashi no roba no ko ga hito to shite umareru toki, oroka na mono mo satori o erude arou.
Moshi anata ga kokoro o tadashiku surunaraba, kami ni mukatte te o noberude arou.
Moshi anata no te ni fugi ga arunara, sore o tooku sare, anata no tenmaku ni aku o sumawasete wa naranai.
Sou sureba, anata wa hajiru koto naku kao o ageru koto ga deki, kataku tatte, osoreru koto wa nai.
Anata wa kurushimi o wasure, anata no kore o oboeru koto wa, nagaresatta mizu no you ni naru.
Soshite anata no inochi wa mahiru yori mo hikarikagayaki, tatoi kurakute mo asa no you ni naru.
Anata wa nozomi ga aru yue ni yasunji, hogo sarete yasuraka ni ikou koto ga dekiru.
Anata wa fushite yasumi, anata o osoresaseru mono wa nai. Ooku no mono wa anata no koui o motomerude arou.
Shikashi ashiki mono no me wa otoroeru. Karera wa nigeba o ushinai, sono nozomi wa iki no taeru ni hitoshii".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Makoto ni, anata ga tanomi, hito de aru, chie wa anata gata to tomo ni shinude arou.
Shikashi watashi mo, anata gata to douyou ni satori o motsu. Watashi wa anata gata ni otoranai. Dare ga kono you na koto o shiranaidarou ka.
Watashi wa kami ni yobawatte, kikareta mono de aru no ni, sono tomo no monowarai to natte iru. Tadashiku mattakihito wa monowarai to naru.
Yasuraka na mono no omoi ni wa, fukou na mono ni taisuru anadori ga atte, ashi no suberu mono o matte iru.
Kasume ubau mono no tenmaku wa sakae, kami o ikarasu mono wa yasuraka de aru. Jibun no te ni kami o tazusaete iru mono mo douyou da.
Shikashi kemono ni toute miyo, sore wa anata ni oshieru. Sora no tori ni toute miyo, sore wa anata ni tsugeru.
Aruiha chi no kusa ya ki ni toute miyo, karera wa anata ni oshieru. Umi no uo mo mata anata ni shimesu.
Korera subete no mono no uchi, izure ka Shu no te ga kore o nashita koto o shiranu mono ga arou ka.
Subete no ikimono no inochi, oyobi subete no hito no iki wa kare no te no uchi ni aru.
Kuchi ga shokumotsu o ajiwau you ni, mimi wa kotoba o wakimaenaide arou ka.
Oita mono ni wa chie ga ari, inochi no nagai mono ni wa satori ga aru.
Chie to chikara wa kami to tomo ni ari, shinryo to satori mo kare no mono de aru.
Kare ga hakai sureba, futatabi tateru koto ga dekinai. Kare ga hito o tojikomereba, hiraki dasu koto ga dekinai.
Kare ga mizu o tomereba, sore wa kare, kare ga mizu o daseba, chi o kutsugaesu.
Chikara to fukaki chie wa kare to tomo ni ari, madowasareru mono mo madowasu mono mo kare no mono de aru.
Kare wa gishitachi o hadaka ni shite tsure iki, saba kibi tora o oroka ni shi,
Outachi no kizuna o toki, karera no koshi ni koshiobi o maki,
Saishitachi o hadaka ni shite tsure iki, chikara aru mono o horoboshi,
Mizukara tanomu monotachi no kotoba o ubai, chouroutachi no funbetsu o torisari,
Kimitachi no ue ni anadori o sosogi, tsuyoi monotachi no obi o toki,
Kurayami no naka kara kakureta kotodomo o arawashi, ankoku o hikari ni hikidashi,
Kuniguni o ookiku shi, mata kore o horoboshi, kuniguni o hiroku shi, mata torae iki,
Chi no tami no choutachi no satori o ubai, karera o michi naki arano ni samayowase,
Hikari naki kurayami ni tesaguri sase, youta mono no you ni yoromekaseru.
Miyo, watashi no me wa, kore o kotogotoku mita. Watashi no mimi wa kore o kiite satotta.
Anata gata no shitte iru koto wa, watashi mo shitte iru. Watashi wa anata gata ni otoranai.
Shikashi watashi wa zennousha ni mono o iou, watashi wa kami to ronzuru koto o nozomu.
Anata gata wa itsuwari o motte uwabe o tsukurou mono, mina, muyou no ishi da.
Dou ka, anata gata wa mattaku chinmoku suru you ni. Kore ga anata gata no chie de arou.
Ima, watashi no ronzuru koto o kiku ga yoi. Watashi no kuchi de iiarasou koto ni mimi o katamukeru ga yoi.
Anata gata wa kami no tame ni fugi o iou to suru no ka. Mata kare no tame ni itsuwari o noberu no ka.
Anata gata wa kare ni hiiki shiyou to suru no ka. Kami no tame ni arasoou to suru no ka.
Kami ga anatagata o shiraberareru toki, anata gata wa buji darou ka. Anata gata wa hito o azamuku you ni kare o azamuku koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata gata ga moshi, hisoka ni hiiki surunaraba, kare wa kanarazu anatagata o semerareru.
Sono igen wa anatagata o osoresasenaide arou ka. Kare o osoreru osore ga anata gata ni nozomanaide arou ka.
Anata gata no kakugen wa hai no kotowaza da. Anata gata no tate wa tsuchi no tate da.
Mokushite, watashi ni kakawaru na, watashi wa hanasou. Nanigoto de mo watashi ni kurunara, kuru ga yoi.
Watashi wa waga niku o waga ha ni tori, waga inochi o waga te no uchi ni oku.
Miyo, kare wa watashi o korosude arou. Watashi wa zetsubou da. Shikashi nao watashi wa watashi no michi o kare no mae ni mamori nukou.
Kore koso watashi no sukui to naru. Kami o shinjinai mono wa, kami no mae ni deru koto ga dekinaikara da.
Anata gata wa yoku watashi no kotoba o kiki, watashi no noberu tokoro o mimi ni ireyo.
Miyo, watashi wa sudeni watashi no tachi ba o iinarabeta. Watashi wa gi to sareru koto o mizukara shitte iru.
Dare ka watashi to iiarasou koto no dekiru mono ga arou ka. Moshi arunaraba, watashi wa mokushite shinude arou.
Tada watashi ni futatsu no koto o yurushite kudasai. Sou sureba, watashi wa anata no kao o sakete kakureru koto wa naideshou.
Anata no te o watashi kara hanashite kudasai. Anata no osorubeki koto o motte watashi o osoresasenaide kudasai.
Soshite ooyobi kudasai, watashi wa kotaemasu. Watashi ni mono o iwasete, anata gojishin, watashi ni okotae kudasai.
Watashi no yokoshima to, watashi no tsumi ga dore hodo aru ka. Watashi no toga to tsumi to o watashi ni shirasete kudasai.
Naniyue, anata wa mikao o kakushi, watashi o anata no teki to sareru no ka.
Anata wa fuki mawasareru konoha o odoshi, hiagatta momigara o owareru no ka.
Anata wa watashi ni tsuite niga ki kotodomo o kakishirushi, watashi ni wakai toki no tsumi o tsugase,
Watashi no ashi o ashikase ni hame, watashi no subete no michi o ukagai, watashi no ashi no shuui ni kagiri o tsukerareru.
Kono you na hito wa kusareta mono no you ni kuchi hate, mushi ni kuwareta ifuku no you ni sutareru.
Onna kara umareru hito wa hi ga mijikaku, nayami ni michite iru.
Kare wa hana no you ni sakidete kare, kage no you ni tobisatte, todomaranai.
Anata wa kono you na mono ni sae me o hiraki, anata no mae ni hikidashite, sabakarerude arou ka.
Dare ga kegareta mono no uchi kara kiyoi mono o dasu koto ga dekiyou ka, hitori mo nai.
Sono hi wa sadamerare, sono tsuki no kazu mo anata to tomo ni ari, anata ga sono kagiri o sadamete, koeru koto no dekinai you ni sareta no dakara,
Kare kara me o hanashi, te o hiite kudasai. Sou sureba kare wa yatoinin no you ni, sono hi o tanoshimu koto ga dekirudeshou.
Ki ni wa nozomi ga aru. Tatoi kirarete mo mata me o dashi, sono wakaeda wa taeru koto ga nai.
Tatoi sono ne ga chi no naka ni oi, sono miki ga tsuchi no naka ni karete mo,
Nao mizu no uruoi ni aeba me o fuki, wakagi no you ni eda o dasu.
Shikashi hito wa shineba kieuseru. Iki ga taereba, doko ni oru ka.
Mizu ga mizuumi kara kie, kawa ga karete, kawaku you ni,
Hito wa fushite ne, mata okizu, ten no tsukiru made, mezamezu, sono nemuri kara samasarenai.
Douzo, watashi o yomi ni kakushi, anata no ikari no yamu made, hisomase, watashi no tame ni toki o sadamete, watashi o oboete kudasai.
Hito ga moshi shineba, mata ikirudeshou ka. Watashi wa waga fukueki no shonichi no aida, waga kaihou no kuru made matsudeshou.
Anata ga ooyobi ni naru toki, watashi wa kotaerudeshou. Anata wa mite no waza o kaerimirarerudeshou.
Sono toki anata wa watashi no ayumi o kazoe, watashi no tsumi o minogasarerudeshou.
Watashi no toga wa fukuro no naka ni fuujirare, anata wa watashi no tsumi o nuri kakusarerudeshou.
Shikashi yama wa taorete kuzure, iwa mo sono tokoro kara utsusareru.
Mizu wa ishi o ugachi, oomizu wa chi no chiri o araisaru. Kono you ni anata wa hito no nozomi o tatareru.
Anata wa nagaku kare ni katte, kare o sariikase, kare no kaokatachi o kawarasete oiyarareru.
Kare no kora wa tattoku natte mo, kare wa sore o shiranai, iyashiku natte mo, sore o satoranai.
Tada ono ga mi ni itami o oboe, onore no tame ni nageku nomi de aru".
Soko de Teman bi to Eripazu wa kotaete itta,
"Chisha wa muna shiki chishiki o motte kotaerude arou ka. Higashikaze o motte sono hara o mitasude arou ka.
Yaku ni tatanai danwa o motte ronjirude arou ka. Mueki na kotoba o motte arasoude arou ka.
Tokoro ga anata wa kami o osoreru koto o sute, kami no mae ni inoru koto o yamete iru.
Anata no tsumi wa anata no kuchi o oshie, anata wa warugashikoi hito no shita o erabi mochiiru.
Anata no kuchi mizukara anata no tsumi o sadameru, watashi de wa nai. Anata no kuchibiru ga anata ni sakaratte shoumei suru.
Anata wa saisho ni umareta hito de aru no ka. Yama yori mo saki ni umareta no ka.
Anata wa kami no kaigi ni azukatta no ka. Anata wa chie o dokusen shite iru no ka.
Anata ga shiru mono wa wareware mo shirude wa nai ka. Anata ga satoru mono wa wareware mo satorude wa nai ka.
Wareware no naka ni wa shiraga no hito mo, toshioita hito mo atte, anata no chichi yori mo toshiue da.
Kami no nagusame oyobi anata ni taisuru yasashii kotoba mo, anata ni totte, amari ni chiisai to iu no ka.
Dou shite anata no kokoro wa kuruu no ka. Dou shite anata no me wa shibatataku no ka.
Anata ga kami ni mukatte ki o iradate, kono you na kotoba o anata no kuchi kara dasu no wa naze ka.
Hito wa ikanaru mono ka, dou shite kore wa kiyoku ari eyou. Onna kara umareta mono wa, dou shite tadashiku ari eyou.
Miyo, kami wa sono sei naru mono ni sura shin o okarenai, moromoro no ten mo kare no me ni wa kiyoku nai.
Mashite nikumubeki kegareta mono, mata fugi o mizu no you ni nomu hito ni oite wa.
Watashi wa anata ni katarou, kiku ga yoi. Watashi wa jibun no mita koto o nobeyou.
Kore wa chishatachi ga sono senzo kara ukete, kakusu tokoro naku kataritsutaeta mono de aru.
Karera ni nomi kono chi wa sazukerarete, takokujin wa sono naka ni ikiki shita koto ga nakatta.
Ashiki hito wa isshou no aida, modaekurushimu. Zankoku na hito ni wa toshi no kazu ga sadamerarete iru.
Sono mimi ni wa osoroshii oto ga kikoe, han'ei no toki ni mo horobosu mono ga kare ni nozomu.
Kare wa, kurayami kara kaeri uru to wa shinzezu, tsurugi ni nerawareru.
Kare wa shokumotsu wa doko ni aru ka to iitsutsu samayoi, kuraki hi ga tejika ni sonaerarete aru no o shiru.
Nayami to kurushimi to ga kare o osoresase, tatakai no sonae o shita ou no you ni kare ni uchikatsu.
Kore wa kare ga kami ni sakaratte sono te o nobe, zennousha ni sakaratte kouman ni furumai,
Tate no atsui men o motte goujou ni, kare ni hasemukaukara da.
Mata kare wa shibou o motte sono kao o ooi, sono koshi ni wa shibou no niku o atsume,
Horobosareta machimachi ni sumi, hito no sumanai ie, aratsuka to naru tokoro ni orukara da.
Kare wa tomeru mono to narazu, sono tomi wa nagaku tsuzukanai, mata chi ni ne o haru koto wa nai.
Kare wa kurayami kara nogareru koto ga dekinai. Honoo wa sono wakaeda o karashi, sono hana wa kaze ni fukisarareru.
Kare o shite mizukara azamuite, munashii koto ni tayorasete wa naranai. Sono mukui wa munashiikara da.
Kare no toki no konai mae ni sono koto ga nashitogerare, kare no eda wa midori to naranaide arou.
Kare wa budou no ki no you ni, sono jukusanai mi o furiotosude arou. Mata oribu no ki no you ni, sono hana o otosude arou.
Kami o shinjinai mono no yakara wa ko naku, mainai ni yoru tenmaku wa hi de yakihorobosarerukara da.
Karera wa gaiaku o harami, fugi o umi, sono hara wa itsuwari o tsukuru".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Watashi wa kono you na koto o kazuooku kiita. Anata gata wa minahito o nagusameyou to shite, kaette hito o wazurawasu mono da.
Muna shiki kotoba ni, hateshi ga arou ka. Anata wa nani ni gekishite kotae o suru no ka.
Watashi mo anata gata no you ni kataru koto ga dekiru. Moshi anata gata ga watashi to kawattanaraba, watashi wa kotoba o nette, anatagata o seme, anata gata ni mukatte atama o furu koto ga dekiru.
Mata kuchi o motte, anatagata o tsuyoku shi, kuchibiru no nagusame o motte, anata gata no kurushimi o yawarageru koto ga dekiru.
Tatoi watashi wa katatte mo, watashi no kurushimi wa yawaragerarenai. Tatoi watashi wa shinonde mo, dore hodo sore ga watashi o sarude arou ka.
Makoto ni kami wa ima watashi o tsukaresaseta. Kare wa watashi no yakara o kotogotoku arashita.
Kare wa watashi o, shiwayoraseta. Kore ga watashi ni taisuru shouko de aru. Mata watashi no yaseotoroeta sugata ga tatte, watashi o seme, watashi no kao ni mukatte shoumei suru.
Kare wa ikatte watashi o kakisaki, watashi o nikumi, watashi ni mukatte ha o kami narashita. Watashi no teki wa me o surudoku shite, watashi o semeru.
Hitobito wa watashi ni mukatte kuchi o hari, anadotte watashi no hoo o uchi, tomo ni atsumatte watashi o semeru.
Kami wa watashi o yokoshima na mono ni watashi, akunin no te ni nageirerareru.
Watashi wa yasuraka de atta no ni, kare wa watashi o kirisaki, kubi o toraete, watashi o uchikudaki, watashi o tatete mato to sareta.
Sono shashu wa watashi o kakomu. Kare wa mujihi ni mo watashi no koshi o itooshi, watashi no kimo o chi ni nagaredasaserareru.
Kare wa watashi o uchiyabutte, yabure ni yabure o kuwae, yuushi no you ni watashi ni, hase kakarareru.
Watashi wa aranuno o hada ni nuitsuke, watashi no tsuno o chiri ni fuseta.
Watashi no kao wa naite akaku nari, watashi no mabuta ni wa fukai yami ga aru.
Shikashi, watashi no te ni wa bougyaku ga naku, watashi no inori wa kiyoi.
Chi yo, watashi no chi o ootte kureru na. Watashi no sakebi ni, yasumu tokoro o esaseru na.
Miyo, ima de mo watashi no shounin wa ten ni aru. Watashi no tame ni hoshou shite kureru mono wa takai tokoro ni aru.
Watashi no tomo wa watashi o azakeru, shikashi watashi no me wa kami ni mukatte namida o sosogu.
Dou ka kare ga hito no tame ni kami to benron shi, hito to sono tomo to no aida o sabaite kureru you ni.
Suunen sugisareba, watashi wa kaeranu tabiji ni ikude arou.
Waga rei wa yabure, waga hi wa tsuki, haka wa watashi o matte iru.
Makoto ni azakeru monodomo wa watashi no mawari ni ari, waga me wa tsune ni karera no anadori o miru.
Dou ka, anata mizukara hoshou to narareru you ni. Hoka ni dare ga watashi no tame ni hoshou to natte kureru mono ga arou ka.
Anata wa karera no kokoro o tojite, satoru koto no nai you ni sareta. Sore yue, karera ni shouri o esaserareru hazu wa nai.
Wakemae o eru tame ni tomo o uttaeru mono wa, sono kora no me ga tsuburerude arou.
Kare wa watashi o tami no waraigusa to sareta. Watashi wa kao ni tsubaki sareru mono to naru.
Waga me wa urei ni yotte kasumi, waga karada wa subete kage no you da.
Tadashii mono wa kore ni odoroki, tsumi naki mono wa kami o shinzenu mono ni taishite ikidooru.
Sore de mo nao tadashii mono wa sono michi o kataku tamochi, isagiyoi te o motsu mono wa masumasu chikara o eru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa mina futatabi kuru ga yoi, watashi wa anata gata no uchi ni kashikoi mono o minai no da.
Waga hi wa sugisari, waga hakarigoto wa yabure, waga kokoro no negai mo yabureta.
Karera wa yoru o hiru ni kaeru. Karera wa iu, 'Hikari ga kurayami ni chikazuite iru' to.
Watashi ga moshi yomi o watashi no ie to shite nozomi, kurayami ni nedoko o nobe,
Ana ni mukatte 'Anata wa watashi no chichi de aru' to ii, uji ni mukatte 'Anata wa watashi no haha, watashi no shimai de aru' to iunaraba,
Watashi no nozomi wa doko ni aru ka, dare ga watashi no nozomi o miru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Kore wa kudatte yomi no kanmon ni i tari, wareware wa tomo ni chiri ni kudarude arou ka".
Soko de Shuhi bi to Birudade wa kotaete itta,
"Anata wa itsu made kotoba ni wana o moukeru no ka. Anata wa mazu satoru gayoi, sore kara wareware wa ronjiyou.
Naze, wareware wa kemono no you ni omowareru no ka. Naze, anata no me ni oroka na mono to mieru no ka.
Ikatte ono ga mi o saku mono yo, anata no tame ni chi wa suterarerudarou ka. Iwa wa sono tokoro kara utsusarerudarou ka.
Ashiki mono no hikari wa kie, sono hi no honoo wa hikari o hanatazu,
Sono tenmaku no uchi no hikari wa kuraku, kare no ue no tomoshibi wa kieru.
Sono chikara aru ayumi wa sebamerare, sono hakarigoto wa kare o taosu.
Kare wa jibun no ashi de ami ni kakari, mata otoshiana no ue o ayumu.
Wana wa kare no kakato o torae, ami wana wa kare o toraeru.
Wa nawa wa kare o toraeru tame ni chi ni kakusare, hariami wa kare o toraeru tame ni michi ni moukerareru.
Osoroshii koto ga shihou ni atte kare o osoresase, sono ayumi ni shitagatte kare o ou.
Sono chikara wa ue, wazawai wa kare o tsumazukasu tame ni sonawatte iru.
Sono hifu wa yamai ni yotte kuitsuku sare, shi no ui go wa kare no teashi o kui tsukusu.
Kare wa sono tanomu tokoro no tenmaku kara hikihanasarete, osore no ou no moto ni oiyarareru.
Kare ni zokusanai mono ga kare no tenmaku ni sumi, iou ga kare no sumai no ue ni makichirasareru.
Shita de wa sono ne ga kare, ue de wa sono eda ga kirareru.
Kare no katami wa chi kara horobi, kare no na wa chimata ni kieru.
Kare wa hikari kara yami ni oiyarare, yononaka kara oidasareru.
Kare wa sono tami no naka ni ko mo naku, mago mo naku, kare no sumika ni wa, hitori mo ikinokoru mono wa nai.
Nishi no mono wa kare no hi ni tsuite odoroki, higashi no mono wa ojiosoreru.
Makoto ni, ashiki mono no sumai wa kono you de ari, kami o shiranai mono no tokoro wa kono you de aru".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Anata gata wa itsu made watashi o nayamashi, kotoba o motte watashi o uchikudaku no ka.
Anata gata wa sudeni totabi mo watashi o hazukashime, watashi o waruku ashiratte mo nao hajinai no ka.
Tatoi watashi ga, makoto ni ayamatta to shite mo, sono ayamachi wa, watashi jishin ni todomaru.
Moshi anata ga taga, makoto ni watashi ni mukatte takaburi, watashi no haji o ronjirunaraba,
'Kami ga watashi o shi etage, sono ami de watashi o kakomareta no da' to shirubekida.
Miyo, watashi ga 'Bougyaku' to sakende mo kotaerarezu, tasuke o yobimotomete mo, sabaki wa nai.
Kare wa watashi no michi ni kaki o megurashite, koeru koto no dekinai you ni shi, watashi no iku michi ni kurayami o okareta.
Kare wa watashi no sakae o watashi kara hagitori, watashi no koube kara kanmuri o ubai,
Shihou kara watashi o torikowashite, usesase, watashi no nozomi o ki no you ni nukisari,
Watashi ni mukatte ikari o moyashi, watashi o teki no hitori no you ni omowareta.
Sono gunzei ga issei ni kite, rui o kizuite semeyose, watashi no tenmaku no mawari ni jin o hatta.
Kare wa watashi no kyoudaitachi o watashi kara tooku hanaresaserareta. Watashi o shiru hitobito wa mattaku watashi ni soen ni natta.
Watashi no shinrui oyobi shitashii tomo wa watashi o misute,
Watashi no ie ni yadoru mono wa watashi o wasure, watashi no hashi tamera wa watashi o tanin no you ni omoi, watashi wa karera no me ni takokujin to natta.
Watashi ga shimobe o yonde mo, kare wa kotaezu, watashi wa kuchi o motte kare ni kowanakereba naranai.
Watashi no iki wa waga tsuma ni itoware, watashi wa onaji hara no kotachi ni kirawareru.
Warabetachi sae mo watashi o anadori, watashi ga okiagareba, watashi o azakeru.
Shitashii hitobito wa mina watashi o imikirai, watashi no aishita hitobito wa watashi ni somuita.
Watashi no hone wa kawa to niku ni tsuki, watashi wa wazuka ni ha no kawa o motte nogareta.
Waga tomo yo, watashi o awareme, watashi o awareme, kami no mite ga watashi o uttakara de aru.
Anata gata wa, naniyue kami no you ni watashi o seme, watashi no niku o motte manzoku shinai no ka.
Dou ka, watashi no kotoba ga, kakitomerareru you ni. Dou ka, watashi no kotoba ga, shomotsu ni shirusareru you ni.
Tetsu no fude to namari to o motte, nagaku iwa ni kizamitsukerareru you ni.
Watashi wa shiru, watashi o aganau mono wa ikite orareru, nochi no hi ni kare wa kanarazu chi no ue ni tatareru.
Watashi no kawa ga kono you ni horobosareta nochi, watashi wa niku o hanarete kami o mirude arou.
Shikamo watashi no mikata to shite mirude arou. Watashi no miru mono wa kore igai no mono de wa nai. Watashi no kokoro wa kore o nozonde kogareru.
Anata gata ga moshi 'Wareware wa dou shite kare o semeyou ka' to ii, mata 'Koto no kongen wa kare no uchi ni miidasareru' to iunaraba,
Tsurugi o osoreyo, ikari wa tsurugi no batsu o kitarasukara da. Kore ni yotte, anata gata wa, sabaki no aru koto o shirude arou".
Soko de Naama bi to Zoparu wa kotaete itta,
"Kore ni yotte, watashi wa kotaeyou to no omoi o okoshi, kore ga tame ni shinjuu shikiri ni sawagitatsu.
Watashi wa watashi o hazukashimeru hinan o kiku, shikashi, watashi no satori no rei ga watashi ni kotaesaseru.
Anata wa kono koto o shiranai no ka, mukashi kara chi no ue ni hito no okarete yori konokata,
Ashiki hito no kachi hoko wa shibaraku de atte, kami o shinjinai mono no tanoshimi wa tada tsukanoma de aru koto o.
Tatoi sono takasa ga ten ni tasshi, sono atama ga kumo ni oyonde mo,
Kare wa onore no fun no you ni, tokoshie ni horobi, kare o mita mono wa iude arou, 'Kare wa doko ni oru ka' to.
Kare wa yume no you ni tobisatte, futatabi miru koto wa nai. Kare wa yoru no maboroshi no you ni oiharawarerude arou.
Kare o mita me wa kasanete kare o miru koto ga naku, kare no ita tokoro mo futatabi kare o miru koto ga nakarou.
Sono kora wa mazushii mono ni megumi o motome, sono te wa kare no kazai o tsugunaude arou.
Sono hone ni wa wakai chikara ga michite iru, shikashi sore wa kare to tomo ni chiri ni fusude arou.
Tatoi aku wa kare no kuchi ni amaku, kore o shita no ura ni kakushi,
Kore o oshinde suteru koto naku, kuchi no naka ni fukunde ite mo,
Sono shokumotsu wa kare no hara no uchi de kawari, kare no uchi de dokuhebi no doku to naru.
Kare wa kazai o nonde mo, mata sore o hakidasu, kami ga sore o kare no hara kara oshidasarerukara da.
Kare wa dokuhebi no doku o sui, mamushi no shita wa kare o korosude arou.
Kare wa mitsu to gyounyuu no nagareru kawagawa o miru koto ga dekinai.
Kare wa honeotte eta mono o kaeshite, sore o kuu koto ga dekinai. Sono akinai ni yotte eta rieki o motte tanoshimu koto ga dekinai.
Kare ga mazushii mono o shi etage, kore o sutetakara da. Kare wa ie o ubaitotte mo, sore o tateru koto ga dekinai.
Kare no yokubari wa taru koto o shiranu yue, sono tanoshimu nanimono o mo sukuu koto ga dekinaide arou.
Kare ga nokoshite tabenakatta mono tote wa hitotsu mo nai. Sore yue, sono han'ei wa nagaku tsuzukanaide arou.
Sono chikara no michite iru toki, kare wa kyuukyou ni ochiiri, nayami no te ga kotogotoku kare no ue ni nozomude arou.
Kare ga sono hara o mitasou to sureba, kami wa sono hageshii ikari o okutte, sore o kare no ue ni furisosogi, kare no shokumotsu to sareru.
Kare wa tetsu no buki o manukarete mo, seidou no ya wa kare o itoosude arou.
Kare ga kore o sono mi kara hikinukeba, kirameku yajiri ga sono kimo kara dete kite, osore ga kare no ue ni nozomu.
Moromoro no ankoku ga kare no houmotsu no tame ni takuwaerare, hito ga fuki okoshita mono de nai hi ga kare o yakitsukushi, sono tenmaku ni nokotte iru mono o horobosude arou.
Ten wa kare no tsumi o arawashi, chi wa okotte kare o semerude arou.
Sono ie no zaisan wa ubaisarare, kami no ikari no hi ni kieuserude arou.
Kore ga ashiki hito no kami kara ukeru bun, kami ni yotte sadamerareta shigyou de aru".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Anata gata wa tokuto, watashi no kotoba o kiki, kore o motte, anata gata no nagusame to suru ga yoi.
Mazu watashi o yurushite katarase nasai. Watashi ga katatta nochi, azakeru no mo yokarou.
Watashi no tsubuyaki wa hito ni taishite de arou ka. Watashi wa dou shite, iradatanaide irareyou ka.
Anata gata wa watashi o mite, odoroki, te o kuchi ni ateru ga yoi.
Watashi wa kore o omouto osoroshiku natte, karada ga shikiri ni furuewananaku.
Naniyue ashiki hito ga ikinagarae, rourei ni tasshi, katsu chikarazuyoku naru no ka.
Sono kora wa karera no mae ni kataku tachi, sono shison mo sono me no mae ni kataku tatsu.
Sono ie wa yasuraka de, osore ga naku, kami no tsue wa karera no ue ni nozomu koto ga nai.
Sono oushi wa tane o ataete, ayamaru koto naku, sono meushi wa ko o unde, sokonau koto ga nai.
Karera wa sono chiisai monodomo o mure no you ni tsuredashi, sono kora wa maiodoru.
Karera wa te tsuzumi to koto ni awasete utai, fue no ne ni yotte tanoshimi,
Sono hi o saiwai ni sugoshi, yasuraka ni yomi ni kudaru.
Karera wa kami ni iu, 'Wareware o hanareyo, wareware wa anata no michi o shiru koto o konomanai.
Zennousha wa nanimono na no de, wareware wa kore ni tsukaeneba naranai no ka. Wareware wa kore ni inotte mo, nan no eki ga aru ka' to.
Miyo, karera no han'ei wa karera no te ni aru de wa nai ka. Akunin no hakarigoto wa, watashi no tooku oyobu tokoro de nai.
Akunin no tomoshibi no kesareru koto, iku tabi aru ka. Sono wazawai no karera no ue ni nozomu koto, kami ga sono ikari o motte kurushimi o ataerareru koto, iku tabi aru ka.
Karera ga kaze no mae no wara no you ni naru koto, arashi ni fukisarareru momigara no you ni naru koto, iku tabi aru ka.
Anata gata wa iu, 'Kami wa karera no tsumi o tsumi takuwaete, sono kora ni mukuirareru no da' to. Dou ka sore o karera jishin ni mukuite, karera ni sono tsumi o shiraserareru you ni.
Sunawachi karera jishin no me ni sono horobi o misase, zennousha no ikari o karera ni nomaserareru you ni.
Sono tsuki no kazu no tsukiru toki, karera wa sono nochi no ie ni nan no kakawaru tokoro ga arou ka.
Kami wa ten ni aru monotachi o sae, sabakareru no ni, dare ga kami ni chishiki o oshieru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Aru mono wa han'ei o kiwame, mattaku yasuraka ni, katsu odayaka ni shini,
Sono karada ni wa shibou ga michi, sono hone no zui wa uruotte iru.
Aru mono wa kokoro o kurushimete shini, nan no saiwai o mo ajiwau koto ga nai.
Karera wa hitoshiku chiri ni fushi, uji ni oowareru.
Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no omoi o shiri, watashi o gaishiyou to suru takurami o shiru.
Anata gata wa iu, 'Oukou no ie wa doko ni aru ka, akunin no sumu tenmaku wa doko ni aru ka' to.
Anata gata wa michiyu ku hitobito ni towanakatta ka, karera no shougen o ukeirenai no ka.
Sunawachi, wazawai no hi ni akunin wa manukare, hageshii ikari no hi ni kare wa sukuidasareru.
Dare ga kare ni mukatte, sono michi o tsugeshiraseru mono ga aru ka, dare ga kare no shita koto o kare ni mukuiru mono ga aru ka.
Kare wa kakarete haka ni iki, tsuka no ue de mihari sare,
Tani no tsuchikure mo kare ni wa kokoroyoku, subete no hito wa sono ato ni shitagau. Kare no mae ni itta mono mo kazoe kirenai.
Sore de, anata gata wa dou shite munashii koto o motte, watashi o nagusameyou to suru no ka. Anata gata no kotae wa itsuwari igai no nanimono de mo nai".
Soko de Teman bi to Eripazu wa kotaete itta,
"Hito wa kami o ekisuru koto ga dekirude arou ka. Kashikoi hito mo, tada jishin o ekisuru nomi de aru.
Anata ga tadashikute mo, zennousha ni nan no yorokobi ga arou. Anata ga jibun no michi o mattou shite mo, kare ni nan no rieki ga arou.
Kami wa anata ga kami o osoreru koto no yue ni, anata o seme, anata o sabakarerude arou ka.
Anata no aku wa ookiide wa nai ka. Anata no tsumi wa, hateshi ga nai.
Anata wa yuenaku kyoudai no mono o shichi ni tori, hadaka na mono no kimono o hagitori,
Tsukareta mono ni mizu o nomasezu, ueta mono ni shokumotsu o ataenakatta.
Chikara aru hito wa tochi o e, na aru hito wa sono uchi ni sunda.
Anata wa, yamome o munashiku saraseta. Minashigo no ude wa orareta.
Sore yue, wana wa anata o meguri, kyoufu wa, niwaka ni anata o odorokasu.
Anata no hikari wa kuraku sare, anata wa miru koto ga dekinai. Oomizu wa anata o ooude arou.
Kami wa ten ni takaku orarerude wa nai ka. Miyo, ito takaki hoshi o. Ikani takai koto yo.
Sore de anata wa iu, 'Kami wa nani o shitte orareru ka. Kare wa kurokumo o tooshite, sabaku koto ga dekiru no ka.
Koi kumo ga kare o ooikakusuto, kare wa miru koto ga dekinai. Kare wa ten no oozora o ayumareru no da' to.
Anata wa ashiki hitobito ga funda inishie no michi o mamorou to suru no ka.
Karera wa toki ga konai uchi ni torisarare, sono motoi wa kawa no you ni oshinagasareta.
Karera wa kami ni itta, 'Wareware o hanarete kudasai' to, mata 'Zennousha wa wareware ni nani o nashi eyou ka' to.
Shikashi kami wa karera no ie o yoi mono de mitasareta. Tadashi akunin no hakarigoto wa watashi no kumisuru tokoro de wa nai.
Tadashii mono wa kore o mite yorokobi, tsumi naki mono wa karera o azawaratte iu,
'Makoto ni wareware no ada wa horobosare, sono nokoshita mono wa hi de yakihorobosareta' to.
Anata wa kami to yawaraide, heian o eru ga yoi. Sou sureba koufuku ga anata ni kurudeshou.
Dou ka, kare no kuchi kara oshie o uke, sono kotoba o anata no kokoro ni osameru you ni.
Anata ga moshi zennousha ni tachikaette, onore o hikuku shi, anata no tenmaku kara fugi o nozokisari,
Kogane o chiri no naka ni oki, Ofuru no kogane o tanigawa no ishi no naka ni oki,
Zennousha ga anata no kogane to nari, anata no kichou na shirogane to narunaraba,
Sono toki, anata wa zennousha o yorokobi, kami ni mukatte kao o ageru koto ga dekiru.
Anata ga kare ni inorunaraba, kare wa anata ni kikareru. Soshite anata wa jibun no chikai o hatasu.
Anata ga koto o nasou to sadamerunaraba, anata wa sono koto o jouju shi, anata no michi ni wa hikari ga kagayaku.
Kare wa takaburu mono o hikuku sareruga, herikudaru mono o sukuwarerukara da.
Kare wa tsumi no nai mono o sukuwareru. Anata wa sono te no isagiyoi koto ni yotte, sukuwarerude arou".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Kyou mo mata, watashi no tsubuyaki wa hageshiku, kare no te wa watashi no nageki ni kakawarazu, omoi.
Dou ka, kare o tazunete doko de aeru ka o shiri, sono miza ni itaru koto ga dekiru you ni.
Watashi wa kare no mae ni watashi no uttae o narabe, kuchi o kiwamete rongi surude arou.
Watashi wa, watashi ni kotaerareru mikotoba o shiri, watashi ni iwareru tokoro o satorou.
Kare wa ooinaru chikara o motte, watashi to arasowarerude arou ka, ina, kaette watashi o kaerimirarerude arou.
Kashiko de wa tadashii hito wa kare to iiarasou koto ga dekiru. Sou sureba, watashi wa watashi o sabaku mono kara eikyuu ni sukuwarerude arou.
Miyo, watashi ga susunde mo, kare o minai. Shirizoite mo, kare o mitomeru koto ga dekinai.
Hidari no hou ni tazunete mo, au koto ga dekinai. Migi no hou ni mukatte mo, miru koto ga dekinai.
Shikashi kare wa watashi no ayumu michi o shitte orareru. Kare ga watashi o kokoromirareru toki, watashi wa kin no you ni dete kurude arou.
Watashi no ashi wa kare no ayumi ni kataku shitagatta. Watashi wa kare no michi o mamotte hanarenakatta.
Watashi wa kare no kuchibiru no meirei ni somukazu, sono kuchi no kotoba o watashi no mune ni takuwaeta.
Shikashi kare wa kawaru koto wa nai. Dare ga kare o hirugaesu koto ga dekiyou ka. Kare wa sono kokoro no hossuru tokoro o okonawareru no da.
Kare wa watashi no tame ni sadameta koto o nashitogerareru. Soshite kono you na koto ga ooku kare no kokoro ni aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa kare no mae ni ononoku. Watashi wa kangaeru toki, kare o osoreru.
Kami wa watashi no kokoro o yowaku sareta. Zennousha wa watashi o osoresaserareta.
Watashi wa, yami ni yotte tojikomerare, ankoku ga watashi no kao o ootte iru.
Naniyue, zennousha wa sabaki no toki o sadamete okarenai no ka. Naniyue, kare o shiru mono ga sono hi o minai no ka.
Yo ni wa jizakai o utsusu mono, mure o ubatte sore o kau mono,
Minashigo no roba o oiyaru mono, yamome no ushi o shichi ni toru mono,
Mazushii mono o michi kara oshinokeru mono ga aru. Yo no yowai mono wa mina karera o sakete mi o kakusu.
Miyo, karera wa arano ni oru no roba no you ni dete hataraki, no de emono o motomete, sono kora no shokumotsu to suru.
Karera wa hatake de sono magusa o kari, mata akunin no budou hatake de hiroiatsumeru.
Karera wa kiru mono ga naku, hadaka de yoru o sugoshi, samusa ni mi o ooubeki mono mo nai.
Karera wa yama no ame ni nure, shinogi ba mo naku iwa ni sugaru.
(minashigo o sono haha no futokoro kara ubai, mazushii mono no osanago o shichi ni toru mono ga aru.)
Karera wa kiru mono ga naku, hadaka de aruki, uetsutsu mugi taba o hakobi,
Akunin no oribunami ki no naka de abura o shibori, saka bune o funde mo, kawaki o oboeru.
Machi no naka kara shi no umeki ga okori, kizutsuita mono no tamashii ga tasuke o yobimotomeru. Shikashi kami wa karera no inori o kaerimirarenai.
Hikari ni somuku monotachi ga aru. Karera wa hikari no michi o shirazu, hikari no michi ni todomaranai.
Hito o korosu mono wa kurai uchi ni okidete yowai mono to mazushii mono o koroshi, yoru wanusu bito to naru.
Kan'in suru mono no me wa tasogare o matte, 'Dare mo watashi o mite inaidarou' to ii, kao ni oou mono o ateru.
Karera wa kurayami de ie o ugachi, hiru wa tojikomotte hikari o shiranai.
Karera ni wa ankoku wa asa de aru. Karera wa ankoku no osore o tomo to surukara da.
Anata gata wa iu, 'Karera wa mizu no omote ni sumiyaka ni nagaresari, sono ukeru bun wa chi de noroware, saka bune o fumu mono wa dare mo karera no budou hatake no michi ni ikanai.
Hideri to atsusa wa yukimizu o ubaisaru, yomi ga tsumi o okashita mono ni taisuru mo, kore to douyou da.
Machi no hiroba wa karera o wasure, karera no na wa oboerareru koto naku, fugi wa ki no orareru you ni orareru' to.
Karera wa ko o umanu umazume o kurai, yamome o awaremu koto o shinai.
Shikashi kami wa sono chikara o motte, tsuyoi hitobito o ikinagaraesaserareru. Karera wa ikiru nozomi no nai toki ni mo okiagaru.
Kami ga karera ni anzen o ataerareru no de, karera wa yasuraka de aru. Kami no me wa karera no michi no ue ni aru.
Karera wa shibashi takamerarete, inaku nari, zeni aoi no you ni karete kieuse, mugi no hosaki no you ni kiritorareru.
Moshi, sou de nainara, dare ga watashi ni sono itsuwari o shoumei shi, waga kotoba no munashii koto o shimeshi urudarou ka".
Soko de Shuhi bi to Birudade wa kotaete itta,
"Taiken to osore to wa kami to tomo ni aru. Kare wa takaki tokoro de heiwa o hodokosareru.
Sono gunzei wa kazoeru koto ga dekiru ka. Nanimono ka sono hikari ni yokusanai mono ga aru ka.
Sore de hito wa dou shite kami no mae ni tadashiku ari eyou ka. Onna kara umareta mono ga dou shite kiyoku ari eyou ka.
Miyo, tsuki sae mo kagayakazu, hoshi mo kare no me ni wa kiyoku nai.
Uji no you na hito, mushi no you na hito no ko wa naosara de aru".
Soko de Yobu wa kotaete itta,
"Anata wa chikara no nai mono o dore hodo tasuketa ka shirenai. Kiryoku no nai ude o dore hodo sukutta ka shirenai.
Chie no nai mono o dore hodo oshieta ka shirenai. Satori o dore hodo ooku shimeshita ka shirenai.
Anata wa dare no tasuke ni yotte kotoba o dashita no ka. Anata kara deta no wa dare no rei na no ka.
Bourei wa mizu oyobi sono naka ni sumu mono no shita ni furuu.
Kami no mae de wa yomi mo hadaka de aru. Horobi no ana mo ooikakusu mono wa nai.
Kare wa kita no ten o kuukan ni hari, chi o nani mo nai tokoro ni kakerareru.
Kare wa mizu o koi kumo no naka ni tsutsumareruga, sono shita no kumo wa sakenai.
Kare wa tsuki no omote o ooikakushite, kumo o sono ue ni nobe,
Mizu no omote ni en o egaite, hikari to yami to no sakai to sareta.
Kare ga imashimeruto, ten no hashira wa furui, katsu odoroku.
Kare wa sono chikara o motte umi o shizume, sono chie o motte Rahabu o uchikudaki,
Sono iki o motte ten o hare watarase, sono te o motte nigeru hebi o tsukitoosareru.
Miyo, korera wa tada kare no michi no hashi ni suginai. Wareware ga kare ni tsuite kiku tokoro wa ikani kasuka na sasayaki de arou. Shikashi, sono chikara no todoroki ni itatte wa, dare ga satoru koto ga dekiru ka".
Yobu wa mata kotoba o tsuide itta,
"Kami wa ikite orareru. Kare wa watashi no gi o ubaisarareta. Zennousha wa watashi no tamashii o nayamasareta.
Watashi no iki ga watashi no uchi ni ari, kami no iki ga watashi no hana ni aru aida,
Watashi no kuchibiru wa fugi o iwanai, watashi no shita wa itsuwari o kataranai.
Watashi wa danjite, anatagata o tadashii to wa mitomenai. Watashi wa shinu made, keppaku o shuchou shite yamenai.
Watashi wa kataku waga gi o tamotte sutenai. Watashi wa ima made tsuitachi mo kokoro ni semerareta koto ga nai.
Dou ka, watashi no teki wa akunin no you ni nari, watashi ni sakarau mono wa fugi naru mono no you ni naru you ni.
Kami ga kare o tachi, sono tamashii o nukitorareru toki, kami o shinjinai mono ni nan no nozomi ga arou.
Wazawai ga kare ni nozomu toki, kami wa sono sakebi o kikarerude arou ka.
Kare wa zennousha o yorokobude arou ka, tsune ni kami o yobude arou ka.
Watashi wa kami no mite ni tsuite anata gata ni oshie, zennousha to tomo ni aru mono o kakusu koto o shinai.
Miyo, anata gata wa mina mizukara kore o mita, sore na no ni, dou shite munashii mono to natta no ka.
Kore wa akunin no kami kara ukeru bun, asseisha no zennousha kara ukeru shigyou de aru.
Sono kora ga fuereba tsurugi ni watasare, sono shison wa shokumotsu ni akiru koto ga nai.
Sono ikinokotta mono wa ekibyou de shinde umerare, sono yamomera wa nakikanashimu koto o shinai.
Tatoi kare wa gin o chiri no you ni tsumi, ifuku o tsuchi no you ni sonaete mo,
Sono sonaeru mono wa tadashii hito ga kore o ki, sono gin wa tsumi naki mono ga wakachi torude arou.
Kare no tateru ie wa, kumo no su no you de ari, bannin no tsukuru koya no you de aru.
Kare wa tomeru mi de nete mo, futatabi tomu koto ga naku, me o hirakeba sono tomi wa nai.
Osoroshii koto ga oomizu no you ni kare o osoi, yoru wa tsumujikaze ga kare o ubaisaru.
Higashikaze ga kare o ageruto, kare wa sari, kare o sono tokoro kara fukiharau.
Sore wa kare o nagetsukete, awaremu koto naku, kare wa sono chikara kara nogareyouto, mogaku.
Sore wa kare ni mukatte te o narashi, azakeriwaratte, sono tokoro kara dete ikaseru.
Shirogane ni wa horidasu ana ga ari, seiren suru kogane ni wa dedokoro ga aru.
Kurogane wa tsuchi kara tori, aka ga ne wa ishi kara tokashite toru.
Hito wa kurayami o yaburi, iya hate made mo tazune kiwamete, kurayami oyobi ankoku no naka kara kouseki o toru.
Karera wa hito no sumu tokoro o hanarete tateana o ugachi, michiyu ku hito ni wasurerare, hito o hanarete mi o tsurisage, yureugoku.
Chi wa soko kara shokumotsu o dasu. Sono shita wa hi de kutsugaesareru you ni kutsugaeru.
Sono ishi wa Safaiya no aru tokoro, soko ni wa mata kinkai ga aru.
Sono michi wa moukin mo shirazu, taka no me mo kore o mizu,
Moujuu mo kore o fumazu, shishi mo kore o tooranakatta.
Hito wa katai iwa ni te o kudashite, yama o nemoto kara kutsugaesu.
Kare wa iwa ni koudou o hori, sono me wa moromoro no tattoi mono o miru.
Kare wa suiro o fusaide, morenai you ni shi, kakureta mono o hikari ni toridasu.
Shikashi chie wa doko ni miidasareru ka. Satori no aru tokoro wa doko ka.
Hito wa soko ni itaru michi o shiranai, mata ikeru mono no chi de sore o eru koto ga dekinai.
Fuchi wa iu, 'Sore wa watashi no uchi ni nai' to. Mata umi wa iu, 'Watashi no moto ni nai' to.
Seikin mo kore to kaeru koto wa dekinai. Gin mo hakatte sono atai to suru koto wa dekinai.
Ofuru no kin o motte shite mo, sono atai o hakaru koto wa dekinai. Tattoi shima menou mo, Safaiya mo douyou de aru.
Kogane mo, hari mo kore ni narabu koto ga dekinai. Mata seikin no utsuwamono mo kore to kaeru koto ga dekinai.
Sango mo suishou mo iu ni tarinai. Chie o eru no wa shinju o eru no ni masaru.
Echiopiya no Topazu mo kore ni narabu koto ga dekinai. Junkin o motte shite mo, sono atai o hakaru koto wa dekinai.
Sore de wa chie wa doko kara kuru ka. Satori no aru tokoro wa doko ka.
Kore wa subete no ikimono no me ni kakusare, sora no tori ni mo kakusarete iru.
Horobi mo shi mo iu, 'Wareware wa sono uwasa o mimi ni kiita dake da'.
Kami wa kore ni itaru michi o satotte orareru, kare wa sono aru tokoro o shitte orareru.
Kare wa chi no hate made mo miso na washi, amegashita o mikiwamerarerukara da.
Kare ga kaze ni omosa o atae, mizu o masu de hakarareta toki,
Kare ga ame no tame ni kitei o mouke, kaminari no hirameki no tame ni michi o moukerareta toki,
Kare wa chie o mite, kore o arawashi, kore o tashikame, kore o kiwamerareta.
Soshite hito ni iwareta, 'Miyo, Shu o osoreru koto wa chie de aru, aku o hanareru koto wa satori de aru' to".
Yobu wa mata kotoba o tsuide itta,
"Aa sugita toshitsuki no you de attara yoi no daga, kami ga watashi o mamotte kudasatta hi no you de attara yoi no daga.
Ano toki ni wa, kare no tomoshibi ga watashi no atama no ue ni kagayaki, kare no hikari ni yotte watashi wa kurayami o ayunda.
Watashi no sakan na toki no you de attanara yoi no daga. Ano toki ni wa, kami no shitashimi ga watashi no tenmaku no ue ni atta.
Ano toki ni wa, zennousha ga nao watashi to tomo ni imashi, watashi no kodomotachi mo watashi no shuui ni ita.
Ano toki, watashi no ashiato wa chichi de araware, iwa mo watashi no tame ni abura no nagare o sosogi dashita.
Ano toki ni wa, watashi wa machi no mon ni dete iki, watashi no za o hiroba ni mouketa.
Wakai mono wa watashi o mite shirizoki, oita mono wa mi o okoshite tachi,
Kimi taru mono mo monoi u koto o yamete, sono kuchi ni te o ate,
Tattoi mono mo koe o osamete, sono shita o ueago ni tsuketa.
Mimi ni kiita mono wa watashi o shukufuku sareta mono to nashi, me ni mita mono wa kore o akashi shita.
Kore wa tasuke o motomeru mazushii mono o sukui, mata, minashigo oyobi tasukeru hito no nai mono o sukuttakara de aru.
Ima ni mo horobiyou to shita mono no shukufuku ga watashi ni kita. Watashi wa mata yamome no kokoro o shite yorokobiutawaseta.
Watashi wa seigi o ki, seigi wa watashi o ootta. Watashi no kougi wa uwagi no gotoku, mata kanmuri no you de atta.
Watashi wa meshi i no me to nari, ashi nae no ashi to nari,
Mazushii mono no chichi to nari, shiranai hito no uttae no riyuu o shirabete yatta.
Watashi wa mata ashiki mono no kiba o ori, sono ha no aida kara emono o hikidashita.
Sono toki, watashi wa itta, 'Watashi wa jibun no su no naka de shini, watashi no hi wa suna no you ni ooku narude arou.
Watashi no ne wa mizu no hotori ni habikori, tsuyu wa yomosugara watashi no eda ni oku de arou.
Watashi no sakae wa watashi to tomo ni atarashiku, watashi no yumi wa watashi no te ni itsu mo tsuyoi' to.
Hitobito wa watashi ni kiite machi, mokushite, watashi no oshie ni shitagatta.
Watashi ga itta nochi wa karera wa futatabi iwanakatta. Watashi no kotoba wa karera no ue ni ame no you ni furisosoida.
Karera wa ame o matsu you ni, watashi o machinozomi, haru no ame o aogu you ni kuchi o hiraite aoida.
Karera ga kibou o ushinatta toki ni mo, watashi wa karera ni mukatte hohoenda. Karera wa watashi no kao no hikari o nozoku koto ga dekinakatta.
Watashi wa karera no tame ni michi o erabi, sono kashira to shite zashi, gunchuu no ou no you ni shite ori, nageku mono o nagusameru hito no you de atta.
Shikashi ima wa watashi yori mo toshi wakai mono ga, kaette watashi o azawarau. Karera no chichi wa watashi ga iyashimete, mure no inu to issho ni sae shinakatta mono da.
Karera no te no chikara kara watashi wa nani o erude arou ka, karera wa sono kiryoku ga sudeni otoroeta hitobito da.
Karera wa toboshisa to hageshii ue to ni yotte, kawaita arechi o kamu.
Karera wa, ze ni aoi oyobi kanboku no ha o tsumi, redama no ne o motte mi o atatameru.
Karera wa hitobito no naka kara oidasare,nusu bito o ou you ni, hitobito wa karera o oi yobawaru.
Karera wa kyuuryuu no tanima ni sumi, tsuchi no ana mata wa iwa no ana ni ori,
Kanboku no naka ni inanaki, irakusa no shita ni oshiau.
Karera wa oroka na mono no ko, mata iyashii mono no ko de atte, kuni kara oidasareta mono da.
Sore na no ni, watashi wa ima karera no uta to nari, karera no waraigusa to natta.
Karera wa watashi o itoi, tooku watashi o hanare, watashi no kao ni tsubaki suru koto mo, tamerawanai.
Kami ga watashi no tsuna o toite, watashi o iyashimerareta no de, karera mo watashi no mae ni tsutsushimi o suteta.
Kono tomo gara wa watashi no migi ni tachiagari, watashi o oinoke, watashi ni mukatte horobi no michi o kizuku.
Karera wa watashi no michi o kowashi, watashi no wazawai o unagasu. Kore o sashitomeru mono wa nai.
Karera wa hiroi yabure kuchi kara wa iru you ni susumi ki tari, hakai no naka o oshiyoseru.
Osoroshii koto wa watashi ni nozomi, watashi no homare wa kaze no you ni fukiharaware, watashi no han'ei wa kumo no you ni kieuseta.
Ima wa, watashi no tamashii wa watashi no uchi ni tokete nagare, nayami no hi wa watashi o toraeta.
Yoru wa watashi no hone o hageshiku nayamashi, watashi o kamu kurushimi wa, yamu koto ga nai.
Sore wa bouryoku o motte, watashi no kimono o torae, hadagi no eri no you ni, watashi o shimetsukeru.
Kami ga watashi o doro no naka ni nageirerareta no de, watashi wa chiri hai no you ni natta.
Watashi ga anata ni mukatte yobawatte mo, anata wa kotaerarenai. Watashi ga tatte ite mo, anata wa kaerimirarenai.
Anata wa kawatte, watashi ni mujou na mono to nari, mite no chikara o motte watashi o seme nayamasareru.
Anata wa watashi o agete kaze no ue ni nose, ookaze no unarikoe no naka ni, momaserareru.
Watashi wa shitte iru, anata wa watashi o shi ni kaerase, subete no ikimono no atsumaru ie ni kaeraserareru koto o.
Sarinagara aratsuka no naka ni aru mono wa, te o nobenaide arou ka, wazawai no naka ni aru mono wa tasuke o yobimotomenaide arou ka.
Watashi wa kurushii hi o okuru mono no tame ni nakanakatta ka. Watashi no tamashii wa mazushii hito no tame ni kanashimanakatta ka.
Shikashi watashi ga saiwai o nozonda no ni wazawai ga kita. Hikari o machinozonda no ni yami ga kita.
Watashi no harawata wa wakikaette, shizumaranai. Nayami no hi ga watashi ni chikazuita.
Watashi wa hi no hikari ni yorazu ni kuroku natte aruki, koukai no naka ni tatte tasuke o yobimotomeru.
Watashi wa yamainu no kyoudai to nari, dachou no tomo to natta.
Watashi no hifu wa kuroku natte, hageochi, watashi no hone wa atsusa ni yotte moe,
Watashi no koto wa kanashimi no ne to nari, watashi no fue wa naku mono no koe to natta.
Watashi wa, watashi no me to keiyaku o musunda, dou shite, otome o shitau koto ga dekiyou ka.
Moshi sou sureba ue kara kami no kudasareru bun wa donna de arou ka. Takaki tokoro kara zennousha no ataerareru shigyou wa donna de arou ka.
Fugi naru mono ni wa wazawai ga kudaranaide arou ka. Aku o nasu mono ni wa sainan ga nozomanaide arou ka.
Kare wa watashi no michi o miso na washi, watashi no ayumi o kotogotoku kazoerarenude arou ka.
Moshi, watashi ga uso to tomo ni ayumi, watashi no ashi ga itsuwari ni mukatte isoida koto ga arunara,
(tadashii hakari o motte watashi o hakare, sou sureba kami wa watashi no keppaku o shirarerude arou.)
Moshi watashi no ayumi ga, michi o hanare, watashi no kokoro ga watashi no me ni shitagatte ayumi, watashi no te ni kegare ga tsuite itanara,
Watashi no ma ita no o ta no hito ga tabe, watashi no tame ni seichou suru mono ga, nukitorarete mo kamawanai.
Moshi, watashi no kokoro ga, onna ni mayotta koto ga aru ka, mata watashi ga tonaribito no mon de machibuse shita koto ga arunara,
Watashi no tsuma ga ta no hito no tame ni usu o hiki, ta no hito ga kanojo no ue ni nete mo kamawanai.
Kore wa omoi tsumi de atte, sabaki bito ni basserarerubeki akuji dakara de aru.
Kore wa horobi ni itaru made mo yaki tsukusu hi de atte, watashi no subete no sangyou o nekosogi yakude arou.
Watashi no shimobe, mata, hashi tame ga watashi to iiarasotta toki ni, watashi ga moshi sono iibun o shirizoketa koto ga arunara,
Kami ga tachiagarareru toki, watashi wa dou shiyou ka, kami ga tazunerareru toki, nan to okotae shiyou ka.
Watashi o tainai ni tsukurareta mono wa, kare o mo tsukurareta no de wa nai ka. Wareware o hara no uchi ni katachitsukurareta mono wa, tada hitori de wa nai ka.
Watashi ga moshi mazushii mono no negai o shirizoke, yamome no me o otoroesase,
Aruiha watashi hitori de shokumotsu o tabete, minashigo ni tabesasenakatta koto ga arunara,
(watashi wa kare no osanai toki kara chichi no you ni kare o sodate, mata sono haha no tai o deta toki kara kare o michibiita.)
Moshi kimono ga nai tame ni shinou to suru mono ya, mi o oou mono no nai mazushii hito o watashi ga mita toki ni,
Sono koshi ga watashi o shukufuku sezu, mata kare ga watashi no hitsuji no ke de atatamaranakatta koto ga arunara,
Moshi watashi o tasukeru mono ga mon ni oru no o mite, minashigo ni mukatte watashi no te o furiageta koto ga arunara,
Watashi no katahone ga, kata kara ochi, watashi no ude ga, tsukene kara orete mo kamawanai.
Watashi wa kami kara deru wazawai o osoreru, sono ikou no mae ni wa nanigoto mo nasu koto wa dekinai.
Watashi ga moshi kin o waga nozomi to shi, seikin o waga tanomi to itta koto ga arunara,
Watashi ga moshi waga tomi no ooinaru koto to, watashi no te ni ooku no mono o eta koto to o yorokonda koto ga arunara,
Watashi ga moshi hi no kagayaku no o mi, mata wa tsuki no teri watatte ugoku no o mita toki,
Kokoro hisoka ni mayotte, te ni kuchizuke shita koto ga arunara,
Kore mo mata sabaki bito ni basserarubeki akuji da. Watashi wa ue naru kami o azamuitakara de aru.
Watashi ga moshi watashi o nikumu mono no horobiru no o yorokobi, mata wa wazawai ga kare ni nozonda toki, kachihokotta koto ga arunara,
(watashi wa waga kuchi ni tsumi o okasasezu, noroi o motte kare no inochi o motometa koto wa nakatta.)
Moshi, watashi no tenmaku no hitobito de, 'Dare ka kare no niku ni akinakatta mono ga aru ka' to, iwanakatta koto ga arunara,
(takokujin wa chimata ni yadorazu, watashi wa waga mon o tabibito ni hiraita.)
Watashi ga moshi hitobito no mae ni watashi no toga o ooi, watashi no akuji o mune no naka ni kakushita koto ga arunara,
Watashi ga taishuu o osore, souzoku no anadori ni o jite, kuchi o toji, mon o denakatta koto ga arunara,
Aa, watashi ni kiite kureru mono ga areba yoi no daga, (watashi no kakihan ga koko ni aru. Dou ka, zennousha ga watashi ni kotaerareru you ni.) aa, watashi no teki no kaita kokusojou ga areba yoi no daga.
Watashi wa kanarazu kore o kata ni oi, kanmuri no you ni kore o waga mi ni musubi,
Waga ayumi no kazu o kare ni nobe, kimi taru mono no you ni shite, kare ni chikazukude arou.
Moshi waga tahata ga watashi ni mukatte yobawari, sono une mizo ga tomo ni nakisakenda koto ga arunara,
Moshi watashi ga kin o harawanaide sono sanbutsu o tabe, sono mochinushi o shinaseta koto ga arunara,
Komugi no kawari ni, ibara ga hae, oomugi no kawari ni zassou ga haete mo kamawanai". Yobu no kotoba wa owatta.
Kono you ni Yobu ga jibun no tadashii koto o shuchou shita no de, korera sannin no mono wa Yobu ni kotaeru no o yameta.
Sono toki Ramuzoku no Buzu bi to Barakeru no ko Erifu wa ikari o okoshita. Sunawachi Yobu ga kami yori mo jibun no tadashii koto o shuchou suru no de, kare wa Yobu ni mukatte ikari o okoshita.
Mata Yobu no sannin no tomo ga Yobu o tsumi ari to shinagara, kotaeru kotoba ga nakatta no de, Erifu wa karera ni mukatte mo ikari o okoshita.
Erifu wa karera ga mina, jibun yori mo nenchousha de atta no de, Yobu ni monoi u koto o hikaete matte itaga,
Koko ni Erifu wa sannin no kuchi ni kotaeru kotoba no nai no o mite ikari o okoshita.
Buzu bi to Barakeru no ko Erifu wa kotaete itta, "Watashi wa toshi wakaku, anata gata wa toshioite iru. Sore yue, watashi wa habakatte, watashi no iken o noberu koto o aete shinakatta.
Watashi wa omotta, 'Hi o kasaneta mono ga katarubekida, toshi o tsunda mono ga chie o oshierubekida' to.
Shikashi hito no uchi ni wa rei ga ari, zennousha no iki ga hito ni satori o ataeru.
Oita mono, kanarazu shimo chie ga aru no de wa naku, toshi totta mono, kanarazu shimo douri o wakimaeru no de wa nai.
Yue ni watashi wa iu, 'Watashi ni kike, watashi mo mata waga iken o nobeyou'.
Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no kotoba ni kitai shi, sono chie aru kotoba ni mimi o katamuke, anata gata ga iubeki kotoba o sagashidasu no o matte ita.
Watashi wa anata gata ni kokoro o tometaga, anata gata no uchi ni Yobu o ii fuseru mono wa hitori mo naku, mata kare no kotoba ni kotaeru mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Osoraku anata gata wa iudarou, 'Wareware wa chie o miidashita, kare ni katsu koto no dekiru no wa kami dake de, hito ni wa dekinai' to.
Kare wa sono kotoba o watashi ni mukete iwanakatta. Watashi wa anata gata no kotoba o motte kare ni kotaeru koto wa shinai.
Karera wa odoroite, mohaya kotaeru koto o sezu, karera ni wa, mohaya iubeki kotoba ga nai.
Karera wa monoi wazu, tachi todomatte, mohaya kotaeru tokoro ga nai no de, watashi wa kore ijou matsu hitsuyou ga arou ka.
Watashi mo mata watashi no bun o kotae, watashi no iken o nobeyou.
Watashi ni wa kotoba ga michi, watashi no uchi no rei ga watashi ni semarukara da.
Miyo, watashi no kokoro wa kuchi o hirakanai budoushu no you ni, atarashii budoushu no kawabukuro no you ni, ima ni mo harisakeyou to shite iru.
Watashi wa katatte, ki o harashi, kuchibiru o hiraite kotaeyou.
Watashi wa dare o mo katayori miru koto naku, mata nanibi to ni mo hetsurau koto o shinai.
Watashi wa hetsurau koto o shiranaikara da. Moshi hetsuraunaraba, watashi no tsukurinushi wa tadachini watashi o horobosarerude arou.
Dakara, Yobu yo, ima watashi no iu koto o kike, watashi no subete no kotoba ni mimi o katamukeyo.
Miyo, watashi wa kuchi o hiraki, kuchi no naka no shita wa monoi u.
Watashi no kotoba wa waga kokoro no tadashiki o katari, watashi no kuchibiru wa shinjitsu o motte sono chishiki o kataru.
Kami no rei wa watashi o tsukuri, zennousha no iki wa watashi o ikasu.
Anata ga moshi dekirunara, watashi ni kotaeyo, watashi no mae ni kotoba o totonoete, tate.
Miyo, kami ni taishite wa, watashi mo anata to douyou de ari, watashi mo mata tsuchi kara totte tsukurareta mono da.
Miyo, watashi no igen wa anata o osoresasenai, watashi no ikioi wa anata o asshinai.
Tashika ni, anata wa watashi no kiku tokoro de itta, watashi wa anata no kotoba no koe o kiita.
Anata wa iu, 'Watashi wa isagiyoku, toga wa nai. Watashi wa kiyoku, fugi wa nai.
Miyo, kare wa watashi o semeru koujitsu o mitsuke, watashi o jibun no teki to minashi,
Watashi no ashi o kase ni hame, watashi no subete no okonai ni me o tomerareru' to.
Miyo, watashi wa anata ni kotaeru, anata wa kono koto ni oite tadashiku nai. Kami wa hito yori mo ooinaru mono da.
Anata ga 'Kare wa watashi no kotoba ni sukoshi mo kotaerarenai' to itte, kare ni mukatte iiarasou no wa, dou iu wake de aru ka.
Kami wa hitotsu no houhou ni yotte katarare, mata futatsu no houhou ni yotte katarareru no daga, hito wa sore o satoranai no da.
Hitobito ga jukusui suru toki, mata wa toko ni madoromu toki, yume aruiha yoru no maboroshi no uchi de,
Kare wa hitobito no mimi o hiraki, keikoku o motte karera o osoresase,
Kou shite hito ni sono ashiki waza o hanaresase, takaburi o hito kara nozoki,
Sono tamashii o mamotte, haka ni itarasezu, sono inochi o mamotte, tsurugi ni horobinai you ni sareru.
Hito wa mata sono toko no ue de itami ni yotte korasare, sono hone ni tatakai ga taeru koto naku,
Sono inochi wa, shokumotsu o itoi, sono shokuyoku wa, oishii shokumotsu o kirau.
Sono niku wa yase ochite miezu, sono hone wa mienakatta mono made mo arawa ni nari,
Sono tamashii wa haka ni chikazuki, sono inochi wa horobosu mono ni chikazuku.
Moshi soko ni kare no tame ni hitori no tenshi ga ari, sen no uchi no hitori de atte, chuuho to nari, hito ni sono tadashii michi o shimesunaraba,
Kami wa kare o awarende iwareru, 'Kare o sukutte, haka ni kudaru koto o manukaresaseyo, watashi wa sudeni aganai shiro o eta.
Kare no niku o osanago no niku yori mo mizumizushiku narase, kare o wakai toki no genki ni kaerase yo' to.
Sono toki, kare ga kami ni inorunaraba, kami wa kare o kaerimi, yorokobi o motte, mimae ni itarase, sono sukui o hito ni tsugeshiraserareru.
Kare wa hitobito no mae ni utatte iu, 'Watashi wa tsumi o okashi, tadashii koto o mageta. Shikashi watashi ni houfuku ga nakatta.
Kare wa watashi no tamashii o aganatte, haka ni kudaraserarenakatta. Watashi no inochi wa hikari o miru koto ga dekiru' to.
Miyo, kami wa korera subete no koto o futatabi, mitabihito ni okonai,
Sono tamashii o haka kara hikikaeshi, kare ni inochi no hikari o misaserareru.
Yobu yo, mimi o katamukete watashi ni kike, mokuseyo, watashi wa katarou.
Anata ga moshi iubeki koto ga arunara, watashi ni kotaeyo, katare, watashi wa anata o tadashii mono ni shiyou to nozomukara da.
Moshi kataru koto ga nainara, watashi ni kike, mokuseyo, watashi wa anata ni chie o oshieyou".
Erifu wa mata kotaete itta,
"Anata gata chie aru hitobito yo, watashi no kotoba o kike, anata gata chishiki aru hitobito yo, watashi ni mimi o katamukeyo.
Kuchi ga shokumotsu o ajiwau you ni, mimi wa kotoba o wakimaerukara da.
Wareware wa tadashii koto o erabi, wareware no aida ni yoi koto no nani de aru ka o akiraka ni shiyou.
Yobu wa itta, 'Watashi wa tadashii, kami wa watashi no kougi o ubawareta.
Watashi wa tadashii ni mo kakawarazu, itsuwaru mono to sareta. Watashi ni wa toga ga naikeredo mo, watashi no yakizu wa ienai' to.
Dare ka Yobu no you na hito ga arou. Kare wa azakeri o mizu no you ni nomi,
Aku o nasu monodomo to majiwari, akunin to tomo ni ayumu.
Kare wa itta, 'Hito wa kami to shitashinde mo, nan no eki mo nai' to.
Sore de anata gata rikai aru hitobito yo, watashi ni kike, kami wa danjite aku o okonau koto naku, zennousha wa danjite fugi o okonau koto wa nai.
Kami wa hito no waza ni shitagatte sono mi ni mukui, onoono no michi ni shitagatte, sono mi ni furi kakaraserareru.
Makoto ni kami wa ashiki koto o okonawarenai. Zennousha wa sabaki o magerarenai.
Dare ka kono chi o kare ni yudaneta mono ga aru ka. Dare ka zensekai o kare ni owaseta mono ga aru ka.
Kami ga moshi sono rei o gojibun ni torimodoshi, sono iki o gojibun ni toriatsumerarerunaraba,
Subete no niku wa tomo ni horobi, hito wa chiri ni kaerude arou.
Moshi, anata ni satori ga arunaraba, kore o kike, watashi no iu tokoro ni mimi o katamukeyo.
Kougi o nikumu mono wa yo o osameru koto ga dekiyou ka. Tadashiku chikara aru mono o, anata wa hinan surude arou ka.
Ou taru mono ni mukatte 'Yokoshima na mono' to ii, tsukasa taru mono ni mukatte, 'Ashiki mono' to iu koto ga dekirude arou ka.
Kami wa kun taru mono o mo kata yori mirareru koto naku, tomeru mono o mazushiki mono ni masatte kaerimirareru koto wa nai. Karera wa mina mite no waza dakara de aru.
Karera wa matataku ma ni shini, tami wa yoru no aida ni fuwarete, kieuse, chikara aru mono mo hitode ni yorazu ni nozokareru.
Kami no me ga hito no michi no ue ni atte, sono subete no ayumi o mirarerukara da.
Aku o okonau mono ni wa mi o kakusubeki kurayami mo naku, ankoku mo nai.
Hito ga sabaki no tame ni kami no mae ni deru toki, kami wa hito no tame ni toki o sadamete okarenai.
Kare wa chikara aru mono o mo shiraberu koto naku uchihoroboshi, ta no hitobito o tatete, kore ni kaerareru.
Kono you ni, kami wa karera no waza o shiri, yo no ma ni karera o kutsugaesareru no de, karera wa yagate horobiru.
Kare wa hitobito no miru tokoro de, karera o sono aku no tame ni utareru.
Kore wa karera ga somuite kare ni shitagawazu, sono michi o mattaku kaeriminaikara da.
Kou shite karera wa mazushiki mono no sakebi o kare no moto ni itarase, nayameru mono no sakebi o kare ni kikaseru.
Kare ga damatte orareru toki, dare ga hinan suru koto ga dekiyou ka. Kare ga kao o kakusareru toki, dare ga kare o miru koto ga dekiyou ka. Ichikoku no ue ni mo, hitori no ue ni mo douyou da.
Kore wa kami o shinjinai mono ga yo o osameru koto ga naku, tami o wana ni kakeru koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru.
Dare ga kami ni mukatte itta ka, 'Watashi wa tsumi o okasanai no ni, kora shimerareta.
Watashi no minai mono o watashi ni oshieraretai. Moshi watashi ga warui koto o shitanara, kasanete kore o shinai' to.
Anata ga kobamu yue ni, kare wa anata no konomu you ni mukui o sarerude arou ka. Anata mizukara erabu gayoi, watashi wa shinai. Anata no shiru tokoro o ii nasai.
Satori aru hitobito wa watashi ni iudarou, watashi ni kiku tokoro no chie aru hito wa iudarou,
'Yobu no iu tokoro wa chishiki ga naku, sono kotoba wa satori ga nai' to.
Dou ka Yobu ga owari made kokoromirareru you ni, kare wa akunin no you ni kotaerukara de aru.
Kare wa jibun no tsumi ni, toga o kuwae, wareware no naka ni atte te o uchi, kami ni sakaratte, sono kotoba o shigeku suru".
Erifu wa mata kotaete itta,
"Anata wa kore o tadashii to omou no ka, anata wa 'Kami no mae ni jibun wa tadashii' to iu no ka.
Anata wa iu, 'Kore wa watashi ni nan no eki ga aru ka, tsumi o okashita no to kurabete nan no masaru tokoro ga aru ka' to.
Watashi wa anata oyobi, anata to tomo ni iru anata no yuujintachi ni kotaeyou.
Ten o aogimiyo, anata no ue naru takaki sora o nozomimi yo.
Anata ga tsumi o okashite mo, kare ni nan no sashi sawari ga aru ka. Anata no toga ga ookute mo, kare ni nani o nashi eyou ka.
Mata anata wa tadashikute mo, kare ni nani o atae eyou ka. Kare wa anata no te kara nani o ukerarerude arou ka.
Anata no aku wa tada anata no you na hito ni kakawari, anata no gi wa tada hito no ko ni kakawaru nomi da.
Shi etage no ooi tame ni sakebi, chikara aru mono no ude no yue ni yobawaru hitobito ga aru.
Shikashi, hitori to shite iu mono wa nai, 'Waga tsukurinushi naru kami wa doko ni orareru ka, kare wa yo no ma ni uta o atae,
Chi no kemono yori mo ooku, wareware o oshie, sora no tori yori mo, wareware o kashikoku sareru kata de aru' to.
Karera ga sakende mo kotaerarenai no wa, ashiki mono no takaburi ni yoru.
Makoto ni kami wa munashii sakebi o kikarenai. Mata zennousha wa kore o kaerimirarenai.
Anata ga kare o minai to iu toki wa naosara da. Sabaki wa kami no mae ni aru. Anata wa kare o matsubekide aru.
Ima kare ga ikari o motte bassezu, tsumitoga o fukaku kokoro ni tomerarenai yue ni
Yobu wa kuchi o hiraite munashii koto o nobe, muchi no kotoba o shigeku suru".
Erifu wa kasanete itta,
"Shibaraku mate, watashi wa anata ni shimesu koto ga aru. Nao kami no tame ni iubeki koto ga aru.
Watashi wa tooku kara waga chishiki o tori, waga tsukurinushi ni seigi o kisuru.
Makoto ni watashi no kotoba wa itsuwaranai. Chishiki no mattaki mono ga anata to tomo ni iru.
Miyo, kami wa chikara aru mono de aruga, nani o mo iyashimerarenai, sono satori no chikara wa ookii.
Kare wa ashiki mono o ikashite okarenai, kurushimu mono no tame ni sabaki o okonawareru.
Kare wa tadashii mono kara me o hanasazu, kurai ni aru outachi to tomo ni, tokoshie ni, karera o suwarasete, tattoku sareru.
Moshi karera ga ashikase ni tsunagare, nayami no nawa ni toraerareru toki wa,
Karera no okonaito, toga to, sono takabutta furumai o karera ni shimeshi,
Karera no mimi o hiraite, oshie o kikase, aku o hanarete kaeru koto o meijirareru.
Moshi karera ga kiite kare ni tsukaerunaraba, karera wa sono hi o koufuku ni sugoshi, sono toshi o tanoshiku okurude arou.
Shikashi karera ga kikanainaraba, tsurugi ni yotte horobi, chishiki o enaide shinude arou.
Kokoro ni kami o shinjinai monodomo wa ikari o takuwae, kami ni shibarareru toki mo, tasuke o yobimotomeru koto o shinai.
Karera wa toshi wakaku shite shini, sono inochi wa haji no uchi ni owaru.
Kami wa kurushimu mono o sono kurushimi ni yotte sukui, karera no mimi o gyakkyou ni yotte hirakareru.
Kami wa mata anata o nayamikara, sokubaku no nai hiroi tokoro ni sasoidasareta. Soshite anata no shokutaku ni okareta mono wa subete koeta mono de atta.
Shikashi anata wa akunin no ukubeki sabaki o onore ni mitashi, sabaki to kougi wa anata o toraete iru.
Anata wa ikari ni sasowarete, azakeri ni ochiiranu you ni kokoro seyo. Aganai shiro no ooinaru ga tame ni, onore o ayamaru na.
Anata no sakebi wa anata o mamotte, nayami o manukaresaserude arou ka, ikani chikara o tsukushite mo yaku ni tatanai.
Hitobito ga sono tokoro kara tatareru sono yo o shitatte wa naranai.
Tsutsushinde aku ni katamuite wa naranai. Anata wa nayami yori mo mushiro kore o erandakara da.
Miyo, kami wa sono chikara o motte agamerareru. Dare ka kare no you ni oshieru mono ga aru ka.
Dare ka kare no tame ni sono michi o sadameta mono ga aru ka. Dare ka 'Anata wa warui koto o shita' to ii uru mono ga aru ka.
Kami no miwaza o hometataeru koto o wasurete wa naranai. Kore wa hitobito no utai agameru tokoro de aru.
Subete no hito wa kore o aogimiru. Hito wa tooku kara kore o miru ni suginai.
Miyo, kami wa ooinaru mono ni imashite, wareware wa kare o shiranai. Sono toshi no kazu mo hakarishiru koto ga dekinai.
Kare wa mizu no shita tari o hikiage, sono kiri o shitatarasete ame to sareru.
Sora wa kore o furasete, hito no ue ni yutaka ni sosogu.
Dare ka kumo no hirogaru wake to, sono makuya no todoroku wake to o satoru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Miyo, kare wa sono hikari o onore no mawari ni hiroge, mata umi no soko o oowareru.
Kare wa korera o motte tami o sabaki, shokumotsu o yutaka ni tamai,
Inazuma o motte morote o tsutsumi, kore ni meijite teki o utaserareru.
Sono todoroki wa, aku ni mukatte ikari ni moeru kare o arawasu.
Kore ga tame ni waga kokoro mo mata wananaki, sono tokoro kara tobihanareru.
Kike, kami no koe no todoroki o, mata sono kuchi kara deru sasayaki o.
Kare wa kore o amegashita ni hanachi, sono hikari o chi no sumizumi made itaraserareru.
Sono nochi, koe todoroki, kare wa sono ikameshii koe o motte nari watarareru. Sono koe no kikoeru toki, kare wa inazuma o hikitomerarenai.
Kami wa sono odorokubeki koe o motte nari watari, wareware no satori enai ooinaru koto o okonawareru.
Kare wa yuki ni mukatte 'Chi ni fure' to meiji, yuudachi oyobi ame ni mukatte 'Tsuyoku fure' to meijirareru.
Kare wa subete no hito no te o fuujirareru. Kore wa subete no hito ni miwaza o shiraseru tame de aru.
Sono toki, kemono wa ana ni hairi, sono hora ni todomaru.
Tsumujikaze wa sono heya kara, samusa wa kitakaze kara kuru.
Kami no ibuki ni yotte koori ga hari, hirobiro to shita mizu wa kooru.
Kare wa koi kumo ni suiki o owase, kumo wa sono inazuma o chirasu.
Kore wa kare no michibiki ni yotte meguru. Kare no meijiru tokoro o kotogotoku sekai no omote ni okonau tame de aru.
Kami ga korera o kosaseru no wa, kora shime no tame, aruiha sono chi no tame, aruiha itsukushimi no tame de aru.
Yobu yo, kore o kike, tatte kami no kusu shikimi waza o kangae yo.
Anata wa shitte iru ka, kami ga ikani korera ni meijite, sono kumo no hikari o kagayakasareru ka o.
Anata wa shitte iru ka, kumo no tsuriai to, chishiki no mattaki mono no kusu shikimi waza o.
Minamikaze ni yotte chi ga odayaka ni naru toki, anata no kimono ga atsuku naru koto o.
Anata wa ita kagami no you ni katai oozora o, kare no you ni haru koto ga dekiru ka.
Wareware ga kare ni iubeki koto o wareware ni oshieyo, wareware wa kurakute, kotoba o tsuraneru koto wa dekinai.
Watashi wa kataru koto ga aru to kare ni tsugeru koto ga dekiyou ka, hito wa horobosareru koto o nozomude arou ka.
Hikari ga sora ni kagayaite iru toki, kaze sugite sora o kiyomeruto, hitobito wa sono hikari o miru koto ga dekinai.
Kita kara ougon no you na kagayaki ga dete kuru. Kami ni wa osorubeki ikou ga aru.
Zennousha wa - - wareware wa kore o miidasu koto ga dekinai. Kare wa chikara to kougi to ni sugure, seigi ni michite, kore o mageru koto wa nai.
Sore yue, hitobito wa kare o osoreru. Kare wa mizukara kashikoi to omou mono o kaerimirarenai".
Kono toki, Shu wa tsumujikaze no naka kara Yobu ni kotaerareta,
"Muchi no kotoba o motte, kami no hakarigoto o kuraku suru kono mono wa dare ka.
Anata wa koshi ni obishite, otokorashiku seyo. Watashi wa anata ni tazuneru, watashi ni kotae yo.
Watashi ga chi no motoi o sueta toki, doko ni ita ka. Moshi anata ga shitte irunara ie.
Anata ga moshi shitte irunara, dare ga sono doryou o sadameta ka. Dare ga hakari nawa o chi no ue ni hatta ka.
Sono dodai wa nani no ue ni okareta ka. Sono sumi no ishi wa dare ga sueta ka.
Kano toki ni wa ake no hoshi wa aitomo ni utai, kami no kotachi wa mina yorokobi yobawatta.
Umi no mizu ga nagarei de, tainai kara wakideta toki, dare ga to o motte, kore o tojikometa ka.
Ano toki, watashi wa kumo o motte koromo to shi, kurokumo o motte mutsuki to shi,
Kore ga tame ni sakai o sadame, kan oyobi to o moukete,
Itta, 'Koko made kite mo yoi, koete wa naranu, omae no takanami wa koko ni todomaru no da' to.
Anata wa umareta hi kara konokata asa ni meiji, yoake ni sono tokoro o shirase,
Kore ni chi no fuchi o toraesase, akunin o sono ue kara furiotosaseta koto ga aru ka.
Chi wa inserareta tsuchi no you ni kawari, koromo no you ni irodorareru.
Akunin wa sono hikari o ubaware, sono takaku ageta ude wa orareru.
Anata wa umi no minamoto ni itta koto ga aru ka. Fuchi no soko o aruita koto ga aru ka.
Shi no mon wa anata no tame ni hirakareta ka. Anata wa ankoku no mon o mita koto ga aru ka.
Anata wa chi no hirosa o mikiwameta ka. Moshi kore o kotogotoku shitte irunaraba ie.
Hikari no aru tokoro ni itaru michi wa izure ka. Kurayami no aru tokoro wa doko ka.
Anata wa kore o sono sakai ni michibiku koto ga dekiru ka. Sono ieji o shitte iru ka.
Anata wa shitte irudarou, anata wa kano toki sudeni umarete ori, mata anata no hikazu mo ooi no dakara.
Anata wa yuki no kura ni haitta koto ga aru ka. Hyou no kura o mita koto ga aru ka.
Korera wa nayami no toki no tame, ikusa to tatakai no hi no tame, watashi ga takuwaete oita mono da.
Hikari no hirogaru michi wa doko ka. Higashikaze no chi ni fuki wataru michi wa doko ka.
Dare ga ooame no tame ni suiro o kirihiraki, ikazuchi no hikari no tame ni michi o hiraki,
Hito naki chi ni mo, hito naki arano ni mo ame o furase,
Are sutareta chi o akitarase, kore ni wakakusa o wa e saseru ka.
Ame ni chichi ga aru ka. Tsuyu no tama wa dare ga unda ka.
Koori wa dare no tai kara deta ka. Sora no shimo wa dare ga unda ka.
Mizu wa katamatte ishi no you ni nari, fuchi no omote wa kooru.
Anata wa Pureadesu no kusari o musubu koto ga dekiru ka. Orion no tsuna o toku koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa juu nikyuu o sono toki ni shitagatte hikidasu koto ga dekiru ka. Hokuto to sono ko boshi o michibiku koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa ten no housoku o shitte iru ka, sono okite o chi ni hodokosu koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa koe o kumo ni age, ooku no mizu ni anata o oowaseru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa inazuma o tsukawashite ikase, 'Wareware wa koko ni iru' to, anata ni iwaseru koto ga dekiru ka.
Kumo ni chie o oki, kiri ni satori o ataeta no wa dare ka.
Dare ga chie o motte kumo o kazoeru koto ga dekiru ka. Dare ga ten no kawabukuro o katamukete,
Chiri o hitotsu ni nagareawasase, tsuchikure o katamaraseru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa shishi no tame ni shokumotsu o kari, ko jishi no shokuyoku o mitasu koto ga dekiru ka.
Karera ga horaana ni fushi, hayashi no naka ni machibuse suru toki, anata wa kono koto o nasu koto ga dekiru ka.
Karasu no ko ga kami ni mukatte yobawari, shokumotsu ga nakute, samayou toki, karasu ni esa o ataeru mono wa dare ka.
Anata wa iwama no yagi ga ko o umu toki o shitte iru ka. Anata wa me jika ga ko o umu no o mita koto ga aru ka.
Korera no ninshin no tsuki o kazoeru koto ga dekiru ka. Korera ga umu toki o shitte iru ka.
Korera wa mi o kagamete ko o umi, sono harami ko o umi idasu.
Sono ko wa tsuyoku natte, no ni sodachi, dete itte, sono oya no moto ni kaeranai.
Dare ga no roba o hanatte, jiyuu ni shita ka. Dare ga no roba no tsunagi o toita ka.
Watashi wa arano o sono ie to shite atae, arechi o sono sumika to shite ataeta.
Kore wa machi no sawagi o iyashime, gyosha no yobu koe o kikiirezu,
Yama o makiba to shite hasemawari, moromoro no aomono o tazunemotomeru.
Yagyuu wa kokoroyoku anata ni tsukae, anata no kaiba oke no katawara ni todomarudarou ka.
Anata wa yagyuu ni tazuna o tsukete une o arukaseru koto ga dekiru ka, kore wa anata ni shitagatte tani o tagayasude arou ka.
Sono chikara ga tsuyoikara tote, anata wa kore ni tanomude arou ka. Mata anata no shigoto o kore ni makaserude arou ka.
Anata wa kore ni tayotte, anata no kokumotsu o uchi ba ni hakobi kaeraserude arou ka.
Dachou wa isei yoku sono tsubasa o furuu. Shikashi kore ni wa kirei na hane to umou ga aru ka.
Kore wa sono tamago o tsuchi no naka ni suteoki, kore o suna no naka de atatame,
Ashi de tsubusareru koto mo, no no kemono ni fumareru koto mo wasurete iru.
Kore wa sono ko ni mujou de atte, atakamo jibun no ko de nai you ni shi, sono kurou no munashiku naru o mo osorenai.
Kore wa kami ga kore ni chie o sazukezu, satori o ataenakatta yue de aru.
Kore ga sono mi o okoshite hashiru toki ni wa, uma o mo, sono norite o mo azakeru.
Anata wa uma ni sono chikara o ataeru koto ga dekiru ka. Chikara o motte sono kubi o yosoou koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa kore o inago no you ni, tobaseru koto ga dekiru ka. Sono hana arashi no iryoku wa osoroshii.
Kore wa tani de agaki, sono chikara ni hokori, mizukara dete itte buki ni mukau.
Kore wa osore o azawaratte, odoroku koto naku, tsurugi o sakete shirizoku koto ga nai.
Yazutsu wa sono ue ni nari, yari to nageyari to, aikirameku.
Kore wa take ritsu, kurui tsu, chi o hito nomi ni shi, rappa no oto ga nari watatte mo, tachidomaru koto ga nai.
Kore wa rappa no naru goto ni Haahaa to ii, tooku kara tatakai o kagitsuke, taichou no oogoe oyobi toki no koe o kikishiru.
Taka ga maiagari, sono tsubasa o nobete minami ni mukau no wa, anata no chie ni yoru no ka,
Washi ga kakenobori, sono su o takai tokoro ni tsukuru no wa, anata no meirei ni yoru no ka.
Kore wa iwa no ue ni sumika o kamae, iwa no togari, mata wa kewashii tokoro ni ori,
Soko kara emono o ukagau. Sono me no oyobu tokoro wa tooi.
Sono hina mo mata chi o suu. Ooyoso korosareta mono no aru tokoro ni wa, kore mo soko ni iru".
Shu wa mata Yobu ni kotaete iwareta,
"Hinan suru mono ga zennousha to arasoou to suru no ka, kami to ronzuru mono wa kore ni kotaeyo".
Soko de, Yobu wa Shu ni kotaete itta,
"Miyo, watashi wa makoto ni iyashii mono desu, nan to anata ni kotaemashou ka. Tada te o kuchi ni ateru nomi desu.
Watashi wa sudeni ichi do iimashita, mata iimasen, sudeni ni do iimashita, kasanete moushimasen".
Shu wa mata tsumujikaze no naka kara Yobu ni kotaerareta,
"Anata wa koshi ni obishite, otokorashiku seyo. Watashi wa anata ni tazuneru, watashi ni kotae yo.
Anata wa nao, watashi ni sekinin o owasou to suru no ka. Anata wa watashi o hi to shi, jibun o ze to shiyou to suru no ka.
Anata wa kami no you na ude o motte iru no ka, kami no you na koe de todoroki wataru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa ikou to songen to o motte sono mi o kazari, eikou to karei to o motte sono mi o yosootte mi yo.
Anata no afururu ikari o morashi, subete no takaburu mono o mite, kore o hikuku seyo.
Subete no takaburu mono o mite, kore o kagamase, mata akunin o sono tokoro de fumitsuke,
Karera o tomo ni chiri no naka ni uzume, sono kao o kakureta tokoro ni tojikomeyo.
Sou sureba, watashi mo mata, anata o homete, anata no migi no te wa anata o sukuu koto ga dekiru to shiyou.
Kaba o miyo, kore wa anata to douyou ni watashi ga tsukutta mono de, ushi no you ni kusa o kuu.
Miyo, sono chikara wa koshi ni ari, sono ikioi wa hara no suji ni aru.
Kore wa sono o o kouhaku no you ni ugokashi, sono momo no suji wa tagai ni karamiau.
Sono hone wa seidou no kuda no you de, sono rokkotsu wa tetsu no bou no you da.
Kore wa kami no waza no daiichi no mono de atte, kore o tsukutta mono ga kore ni tsurugi o sazuketa.
Yama mo kore ga tame ni shokumotsu o idashi, moromoro no no no kemono mo soko ni asobu.
Kore wa sansou no ki no shita ni fushi, ashi no shigemi, mata wa numa ni kakurete iru.
Sansou no ki wa sono kage de kore o ooi, kawa no yanagi wa kore o meguri kakomu.
Miyo, tatoi kawa ga arete mo, kore wa odorokanai. Yorudan ga sono kuchi ni sosogi kakatte mo, kore wa awatenai.
Dare ga, kagi de kore o toraeru koto ga dekiru ka. Dare ga, wana de sono hana o tsuranuku koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa tsuribari de wani o tsuridasu koto ga dekiru ka. Ito de sono shita o osaeru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa ashi no nawa o sono hana ni toosu koto ga dekiru ka. Tsuribari de sono ago o tsukitoosu koto ga dekiru ka.
Kore wa shikiri ni, anata ni negaimotomerude arou ka. Yawaraka na kotoba o anata ni katarude arou ka.
Kore wa anata to keiyaku o musubude arou ka. Anata wa kore o totte, nagaku anata no shimobe to suru koto ga dekirude arou ka.
Anata wa tori to tawamureru you ni kore to tawamure, mata anata no otometachi no tame ni, kore o tsunaide oku koto ga dekirude arou ka.
Shounin no nakama wa kore o shouhin to shite, kouri shounin no aida ni wakerude arou ka.
Anata wa, mori de sono kawa o mitashi, yasu de sono atama o tsukitoosu koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata no te o kore no ue ni oke, anata wa tatakai o omoidashite, futatabi kore o shinaide arou.
Miyo, sono nozomi wa munashiku nari, kore o mite sura taoreru.
Aete kore o gekisuru yuuki no aru mono wa hitori mo nai. Sore de, dare ga watashi no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiru ka.
Dare ga saki ni watashi ni ataeta no de, watashi wa kore ni mukuiru no ka. Amegashita ni aru mono wa, kotogotoku watashi no mono da.
Watashi wa kore ga zenshin to, sono ichijirushii chikara to, sono utsukushii kouzou ni tsuite damatte iru koto wa dekinai.
Dare ga sono uwagi o hagu koto ga dekiru ka. Dare ga sono futae no yoroi no aida ni hairu koto ga dekiru ka.
Dare ga sono kao no to o hiraku koto ga dekiru ka. Sono mawari no ha wa osoroshii.
Sono se wa tate no retsu de dekite ite, sono kataku tojita sama wa mippuu shita you ni,
Sougo ni missetsu shite, kaze mo sono aida ni, hairu koto ga dekizu,
Tagai ni aitsuranari, kataku tsuite hanasu koto ga dekinai.
Kore ga, kushami sureba hikari o hasshi, sono me wa akebono no mabuta ni nite iru.
Sono kuchi kara wa, taimatsu ga moe ide, hibana o idasu.
Sono hana no ana kara wa kemuri ga dete kite, sanagara nietatsu nabe no mizukemuri no gotoku, moeru ashi no kemuri no you da.
Sono iki wa sumibi o okoshi, sono kuchi kara wa honoo ga deru.
Sono kubi ni wa chikara ga yadotte ite, osoroshisa ga, sono mae ni odotte iru.
Sono nikuhen wa missetsu ni aitsuranari, kataku mi ni tsuite ugokasu koto ga dekinai.
Sono shinzou wa ishi no you ni kataku, usu no shitaishi no you ni katai.
Sono mi o okosu toki wa yuushi mo osore, sono shougeki ni yotte awatemadou.
Tsurugi ga kore o utte mo, kikanai, yari mo, ya mo, mori mo you o nasanai.
Kore wa tetsu o miru koto, wara no you ni, seidou o miru koto kuchiki no you de aru.
Yumiya mo kore o nigasu koto ga dekinai. Ishinage no ishi mo kore ni wa, warakuzu to naru.
Konbou mo warakuzu no you ni minasare, nageyari no hibiki o, kore wa azawarau.
Sono kafuku wa surudoi kawara no kakera no you de, mugikoki ita no you ni sono mi o doro no ue ni nobasu.
Kore wa fuchi o kanae no you ni wakikaerase, umi o kouyu no nabe no you ni suru.
Kore wa jibun no ato ni hikaru michi o nokoshi, fuchi o shiraga no you ni omowaseru.
Chi no ue ni wa kore to narabu mono naku, kore wa osore no nai mono ni tsukurareta.
Kore wa subete no takaki mono o sagesumi, subete no hokori takaburu mono no ou de aru".
Soko de Yobu wa Shu ni kotaete itta,
"Watashi wa shirimasu, anata wa subete no koto o nasu koto ga deki, mata ikanaru oboshimeshide mo, anata ni dekinai koto wa nai koto o.
'Muchi o motte kami no hakarigoto o oou kono mono wa dare ka'. Sore yue, watashi wa mizukara satoranai koto o ii, mizukara shiranai, hakarigatai koto o nobemashita.
'Kike, watashi wa katarou, watashi wa anata ni tazuneru, watashi ni kotaeyo'.
Watashi wa anata no koto o mimi de kiite imashitaga, ima wa watashi no me de anata o haiken itashimasu.
Sore de watashi wa mizukara urami, chiri hai no naka de kuimasu".
Shu wa korera no kotoba o Yobu ni katararete nochi, Teman bi to Eripazu ni iwareta, "Watashi no ikari wa anata to anata no futari no tomo ni mukatte moeru. Anata ga taga, watashi no shimobe Yobu no you ni tadashii koto o watashi ni tsuite nobenakattakara de aru.
Sore de ima, anata gata wa oushi nanatou, ohitsuji nanatou o totte, watashi no shimobe Yobu no tokoro e iki, anata gata no tame ni hansai o sasage yo. Watashi no shimobe Yobu wa anata gata no tame ni inorude arou. Watashi wa kare no inori o ukeireru ni yotte, anata gata no oroka o bassuru koto o shinai. Anata gata wa watashi no shimobe Yobu no you ni tadashii koto o watashi ni tsuite nobenakattakara de aru".
Soko de Teman bi to Eripazu, Shuhi bi to Birudade, Naama bi to Zoparu wa itte, Shu ga karera ni meijirareta you ni shita no de, Shu wa Yobu no inori o ukeirerareta.
Yobu ga sono yuujintachi no tame ni inotta toki, Shu wa Yobu no han'ei o moto ni kaeshi, soshite Shu wa Yobu no subete no zaisan o ni bai ni masareta.
Soko de kare no subete no kyoudai, subete no shimai, oyobi kare no kyuuchi no monodomo kotogotoku kare no moto ni kite, kare to tomo ni sono ie de nomikui shi, katsu Shu ga kare ni kudasareta subete no wazawai ni tsuite kare o itawari, nagusame, onoono gin ichi Keshita to kin no wa hitotsu o kare ni okutta.
Shu wa Yobu no owari o hajime yori mo ooku megumareta. Kare wa hitsuji ichi man yonsentou, rakuda rokusentou, ushi issen kubiki, me roba issentou o motta.
Mata kare wa otokonoko nananin, onnanoko sannin o motta.
Kare wa sono daiichi no musume o Emima to nazuke, daini o Kejia to nazuke, daisan o Keren HaPpuku to nazuketa.
Zenkoku no uchi de Yobu no musumetachi hodo utsukushii onna wa nakatta. Chichi wa sono kyoudaitachi to douyou ni shigyou o karera ni mo ataeta.
Kono nochi, Yobu wa hyaku yonjuu nen ikinagaraete, sono ko to sono mago to yon dai made o mita.
Yobu wa toshioi, hi michite shinda.
Ashiki mono no hakarigoto ni ayumazu, tsumibito no michi ni tatazu, azakeru mono no za ni suwaranu hito wa saiwai de aru.
Kono you na hito wa Shu no okite o yorokobi, hiru mo yoru mo sono okite o omou.
Kono you na hito wa nagare no hotori ni uerareta ki no toki ga kuruto mi o musubi, sono ha mo shibomanai you ni, sono nasu tokoro wa mina sakaeru.
Ashiki mono wa sou de nai, kaze no fukisaru momigara no you da.
Sore yue, ashiki mono wa sabaki ni taenai. Tsumibito wa tadashii mono no tsudoi ni tatsu koto ga dekinai.
Shu wa tadashii mono no michi o shirareru. Shikashi, ashiki mono no michi wa horobiru.
