Kami yo, watashi ga toshioite, shiraga to narutomo, anata no chikara o kitaran to suru subete no yo ni nobetsutaeru made, watashi o misutenaide kudasai.
Kami yo, anata no tainou to gi to wa takai ten ni made oyobu. Anata wa ooinaru koto o nasaremashita. Kami yo, dare ka anata ni hitoshii mono ga arudeshou ka.
Anata wa watashi o ooku no omoi nayami ni awasaremashitaga, futatabi watashi o ikashi, chi no fukai tokoro kara hikiagerarerudeshou.
Anata wa watashi no homare o mashi, futatabi watashi o nagusamerarerudeshou.
Waga kami yo, watashi wa mata tategoto o motte anata to, anata no makoto to o hometataemasu. Isuraeru no seija yo, watashi wa koto o motte anata o home utaimasu.
