Shikashi, watashi ga kore o shirou to omoimegurashita toki, kore wa watashi ni mendou na shigoto no you ni omowareta.
Watashi ga kami no seijo ni itte, karera no saigo o satori eta made wa sou de atta.
Makoto ni anata wa karera o nameraka na tokoro ni oki, karera o horobi ni ochiiraserareru.
Nan to karera wa matataku ma ni horobosare, osore o motte mattaku issou sareta koto de arou.
Anata ga me o samashite karera no kage o karoshimerareru toki, karera wa yumemita hito no me o samashita toki no you de aru.
Watashi no tamashii ga itami, watashi no kokoro ga sasareta toki,
Watashi wa oroka de satori ga naku, anata ni taishite wa kemono no you de atta.
Keredo mo watashi wa tsune ni anata to tomo ni ari, anata wa watashi no migi no te o tamotareru.
Anata wa satoshi o motte watashi o michibiki, sono nochi watashi o ukete eikou ni azukaraserareru.
Watashi wa anata no hoka ni, dare o ten ni mochi eyou. Chi ni wa anata no hoka ni shitau mono wa nai.
Waga mi to waga kokoro to wa otoroeru. Shikashi kami wa tokoshie ni waga kokoro no chikara, waga shigyou de aru.
Miyo, anata ni tooi mono wa horobiru. Anata wa, anata ni somuku mono o horobosareru.
