Tokoshie no horobi no ato ni, anata no ashi o mukete kudasai. Teki wa seijo de, subete no mono o hakai shimashita.
Anata no ada wa seijo no naka de hoe sakebi, karera no shirushi o tatete, shirushi to shimashita.
Karera wa ue no iriguchi de wa, ono o motte ki no koushi kaki o kiritaoshimashita.
Mata karera wa teono to tsuchi to o motte seijo no horimono o kotogotoku uchiotoshimashita.
Karera wa anata no seijo ni hi o kake, mina no sumika o kegashite, chi ni taoshimashita.
