Warera wa jibuntachi no shirushi o mimasen. Yogensha mo ima wa imasen. Soshite itsu made tsuzuku no ka, warera no uchi ni wa, shiru mono ga arimasen.
Kami yo, ada wa itsu made azakerudeshou ka. Teki wa tokoshie ni anata no na o nonoshirudeshou ka.
Naze anata wa te o hikareru no desu ka. Naze anata wa migi no te o futokoro ni irete okareru no desu ka.
Kami wa inishie kara watashi no ou de atte, sukui o yononaka ni okonawareta.
Anata wa michikara o motte umi o wakachi, mizu no ue no ryuu no atama o kudakareta.
Anata wa rebiyatan no atama o kudaki, kore o no no kemono ni ataete ejiki to sareta.
Anata wa izumi to nagare to o hiraki, taezu nagareru moromoro no kawa o karasareta.
Hiru wa anata no mono, yoru mo mata anata no mono. Anata wa hikari to taiyou to o moukerareta.
Anata wa chi no moromoro no sakai o sadame, natsu to fuyu to o tsukurareta.
