Anata no ada no sakebi o wasurenaide kudasai. Anata no teki no taezu ageru sawagi o wasurenaide kudasai.
Kami yo, warera wa anata ni kansha shimasu. Warera wa kansha shimasu. Warera wa anata no mina o yobi, anata no kusu shikimi waza o katarimasu.
