Kou shite kare wa nao ki kokoro o motte karera o boku shi, takumi na te o motte karera o michibiita.
Kami yo, moromoro no ihoujin wa anata no shigyou no chi o okashi, anata no sei naru miya o kegashi, Erusaremu o aratsuka to shimashita.
Karera wa anata no shimobe no shikabane o sora no tori ni ataete e satoshi, anata no seito no niku o chi no kemono ni atae,
Sono chi o Erusaremu no mawari ni mizu no you ni nagashi, kore o houmuru hito ga arimasendeshita.
Warera wa tonaribito ni soshirare, mawari no hitobito ni anadorare, azakerareru mono to narimashita.
Shu yo, itsu made na no desu ka. Tokoshie ni oikari ni narareru no desu ka. Anata no netami wa hi no you ni moeru no desu ka.
Dou ka, anata o shiranai ihoujin to, anata no na o yobanai kuniguni no ue ni anata no ikari o sosoide kudasai.
Karera wa Yakobu o horoboshi, sono sumika o arashitakara desu.
Warera no senzotachi no fugi o mikokoro ni tomerarezu, awaremi o motte, sumiyaka ni warera o mukaete kudasai. Warera wa, hanahadashiku hikuku saretakara desu.
Warera no sukui no kami yo, mina no eikou no tame ni warera o tasuke, mina no tame ni warera o sukui, warera no tsumi o oyurushi kudasai.
Dou shite ihoujin wa iu no deshou, "Karera no kami wa doko ni iru no ka" to. Anata no shimobera no nagasareta chi no mukui o warera no manoatari ni nashite, ihoujin ni shirasete kudasai.
Torawarebito no nageki o anata no mimae ni itarase, anata no ooinaru chikara ni yori, shi ni sadamerareta mono o mamorinagara e sasete kudasai.
Shu yo, warera no tonaribito ga anata o soshitta so shiri o shichi bai ni shite karera no futokoro ni mukui kaeshite kudasai.
Sou sureba, anata no tami, anata no maki no hitsuji wa, tokoshie ni anata ni kansha shi, yoyo anata o hometataerudeshou.
Isuraeru no bokusha yo, hitsuji no mure no you ni Yosefu o michibikareru mono yo, mimi o katamukete kudasai. Kerubimu no ue ni zaserareru mono yo, hikari o hanatte kudasai.
Efuraimu, Beniyamin, Manase no mae ni anata no chikara o furiokoshi, kite, warera o osukui kudasai.
Kami yo, warera o moto ni kaeshi, mikao no hikari o tera shite kudasai. Sou sureba warera wa sukui o erudeshou.
Bangun no kami, Shu yo, itsu made, sono tami no inori ni mukatte oikari ni naru no desu ka.
Anata wa namida no pan o karera ni kuwase, ooku no namida o karera ni nomaseraremashita.
Anata wa warera o tonaribito no azakeri to shi, warera no teki wa tagai ni azawaraimashita.
Bangun no kami yo, warera o moto ni kaeshi, warera no sukuwareru tame, mikao no hikari o tera shite kudasai.
Anata wa, budou no ki o Ejiputo kara tazusae dashi, moromoro no kunitami o oidashite, kore o ueraremashita.
Anata wa kore ga tame ni chi o hirakareta no de, fukaku nezashite, kuni ni habikorimashita.
Yamayama wa sono kage de ooware, kami no kouhaku wa sono eda de oowaremashita.
Kore wa sono eda o umi ni made nobe, sono wakaeda o ookawa ni made nobemashita.
Anata wa naniyue, sono kaki o kuzushite michi yuku subete no hito ni sono mi o tsumitoraserareru no desu ka.
Hayashi no inoshishi wa kore o arashi, no no subete no kemono wa kore o tabemasu.
Bangun no kami yo, futatabi ten kara mioroshite, kono budou no ki o kaerimite kudasai.
Anata no migi no te no uerareta miki to, mizukara no tame ni tsuyoku sareta eda to o kaerimite kudasai.
Karera wa hi o motte kore o yaki, kore o kiritaoshimashita. Karera o mikao no togame ni yotte horoboshite kudasai.
Shikashi anata no te o sono migi no te no hito no ue ni oki, mizukara no tame ni tsuyoku sareta hito no ko no ue ni oite kudasai.
Sou sureba, warera wa anata o hanare shirizoku koto wa arimasen. Warera o ikashite kudasai. Warera wa anata no mina o yobimasu.
Bangun no kami, Shu yo, warera o moto ni kaeshi, mikao no hikari o tera shite kudasai. Sou sureba warera wa sukui o erudeshou.
Warera no chikara naru kami ni mukatte takaraka ni utae. Yakobu no kami ni mukatte yorokobi no koe o age yo.
Uta o utai, tsuzumi o ute. Yoi ne no koto to tategoto to o kakinarase.
Shingetsu to mangetsu to warera no matsuri no hi to ni rappa o fukinarase.
Kore wa Isuraeru no sadame, Yakobu no kami no okite de aru.
Kami ga dete Ejiputo no kuni o semerareta toki, Yosefu no naka ni kore o tatete, akashi to sareta. Watashi wa kashiko de mada shiranakatta kotoba o kiita,
"Watashi wa anata no kata kara omoni o nozoki, anata no te o kago kara manukaresaseta.
Anata ga nayanda toki, yobawatta no de watashi wa anata o sukutta. Watashi wa kaminari no kakureta tokoro de, anata ni kotae, Meriba no mizu no hotori de, anata o kokoromita. [sera]
Waga tami yo, kike, watashi wa anata ni kankoku suru. Isuraeru yo, anata ga watashi ni kikishitagau koto o nozomu.
Anata no uchi ni ta no kami ga atte wa naranai. Anata wa gaikoku no kami o ogande wa naranai.
Watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni kara, anata o tsuredashita anata no kami, Shu de aru. Anata no kuchi o hiroku akeyo, watashi wa sore o mitasou.
Shikashi waga tami wa watashi no koe ni kikishitagawazu, Isuraeru wa watashi o konomanakatta.
Sore yue, watashi wa karera o sono katakuna na kokoro ni makase, sono omoi no mama ni iku ni makaseta.
Watashi wa waga tami no watashi ni kikishitagai, Isuraeru no waga michi ni ayumu koto o hossuru.
Watashi wa sumiyaka ni karera no teki o shitagae, waga te o karera no ada ni mukeyou.
Shu o nikumu mono mo karera ni osore shitagai, karera no toki wa tokoshie ni tsuzukude arou.
Watashi wa mugi no mottomo yoi mono o motte anata o yashinai, iwa kara deta mitsu o motte anata o akaserude arou".
Kami wa kami no kaigi no naka ni tatareru. Kami wa kamigami no naka de, sabaki o okonawareru.
"Anata gata wa itsu made fusei na sabaki o nashi, ashiki mono ni koui o shimesu no ka. [sera]
Yowai mono to, minashigoto o kouhei ni atsukai, kurushimu mono to toboshii mono no kenri o yougo seyo.
Yowai mono to mazushii mono o sukui, karera o ashiki mono no te kara tasukedase".
Karera wa shiru koto naku, satoru koto mo nakute, kuraki naka o samayou. Chi no moromoro no motoi wa yuri ugoita.
Watashi wa iu, "Anata gata wa kami da, anata gata wa mina ito takaki mono no ko da.
Shikashi, anata gata wa hito no you ni shini, moromoro no kimi no hitori no you ni taorerude arou".
Kami yo, okite, chi o sabaite kudasai. Subete no kunitami wa anata no mono dakara desu.
Kami yo, chinmoku o mamoranaide kudasai. Kami yo, nani mo iwazu ni, damatte inaide kudasai.
Miyo, anata no teki wa sawagitachi, anata o nikumu mono wa atama o agemashita.
Karera wa anata no tami ni mukatte takumi na hakarigoto o megurashi, anata no hogo sareru mono ni mukatte aitomo ni hakarimasu.
Karera wa iimasu, "Saa, karera o tachi horoboshite kuni o tatesasezu, Isuraeru no na o futatabi omoidasasenai you ni shiyou".
Karera wa kokoro o hitotsu ni shite tomo ni hakari, anata ni sakaratte keiyaku o musubimasu.
Sunawachi Edomu no tenmaku ni sumu mono to Ishimaeru bi to, Moabu to Hagaru bi to,
Gebaru to Anmon to Amareku, Perishite to Tsuro no juumin nado desu.
ASsuriya mo mata karera ni kumishimashita. Karera wa Roto no shison o tasukemashita. [sera]
Anata ga Midean ni sareta you ni, Kishon kawa de Shisera to Yabin ni sareta you ni, karera ni shite kudasai.
Karera wa Endoru de horobosare, chi no tame ni hiryou to narimashita.
Karera no kijin o Orebu to Zeebu no you ni, sono subete no kimitachi o Zeba to Zarumunna no you ni shite kudasai.
Karera wa iimashita, "Warera wa kami no makiba o ete, warera no shoyuu ni shiyou" to.
Waga kami yo, karera o makiagerareru chiri no you ni, kaze no mae no momigara no you ni shite kudasai.
Hayashi o yaku hi no you ni, yama o moyasu honoo no you ni,
Anata no hayate o motte karera o oi, tsumuji kaze o motte karera o osoresasete kudasai.
Karera no kao ni haji o mitashite kudasai. Shu yo, sou sureba karera wa anata no na o motomerudeshou.
Karera o tokoshie ni haji osoresase, awatemadotte horobi usesasete kudasai.
Shu to iu na o omochi ni naru anata nomi, zenchi o shiroshimesu ito takaki mono de aru koto o karera ni shirasete kudasai.
Bangun no Shu yo, anata no sumai wa ikani uruwashii koto deshou.
Waga tamashii wa tae iru bakari ni Shu no ooniwa o shitai, waga kokoro to waga mi wa ikeru kami ni mukatte yorokobiutaimasu.
Suzume ga sumika o e, tsubame ga sono hina o ireru su o eru you ni, bangun no Shu, waga ou, waga kami yo, anata no saidan no katawara ni waga sumai o esasete kudasai.
Anata no ie ni sumi, tsune ni anata o hometataeru hito wa saiwai desu. [sera]
Sono chikara ga anata ni ari, sono kokoro ga Shion no ooji ni aru hito wa saiwai desu.
Karera wa Baka no tani o tootte mo, soko o izumi no aru tokoro to shimasu. Mata mae no ame wa ike o motte soko o ooimasu.
Karera wa chikara kara chikara ni susumi, Shion ni oite kamigami no kami ni mamierudeshou.
Bangun no kami, Shu yo, waga inori o okiki kudasai. Yakobu no kami yo, mimi o katamukete kudasai. [sera]
Kami yo, warera no tate o miso na washi, anata no abura sosogareta mono no kao o kaerimite kudasai.
Anata no ooniwa ni iru tsuitachi wa, yoso ni iru sen nichi ni mo masaru no desu. Watashi wa aku no tenmaku ni iru yori wa, mushiro, waga kami no ie no kadomori to naru koto o negaimasu.
Shu naru kami wa hi desu, tate desu. Shu wa megumi to homare to o atae, nao ku ayumu mono ni yoi mono o kobamareru koto wa arimasen.
Bangun no Shu yo, anata ni shinrai suru hito wa saiwai desu.
Shu yo, anata wa mikuni ni megumi o shimeshi, Yakobu no han'ei o kaifuku saremashita.
Anata wa sono tami no fugi o yurushi, karera no tsumi o kotogotoku oowaremashita. [sera]
Anata wa subete no ikari o sute, hageshii ikidoori o toozakeraremashita.
Warera no sukui no kami yo, warera o kaifuku shi, warera ni taisuru anata no ikidoori o oyame kudasai.
Anata wa tokoshie ni warera o ikari, yorozu yo made, anata no ikari o nobasareru no desu ka.
Anata no tami ga, anata ni yotte yorokobi o eru tame, warera o futatabi ikasarenai no desu ka.
Shu yo, anata no itsukushimi o warera ni shimeshi, anata no sukui o warera ni ataete kudasai.
Watashi wa Shu naru kami no katarareru koto o kikimashou. Shu wa sono tami, sono seito, narabi ni sono kokoro o Shu ni mukeru mono ni, heiwa o katararerukara desu.
Makoto ni, sono sukui wa kami o osoreru mono ni chikaku, sono eikou wa warera no kuni ni todomarudeshou.
Itsukushimito, makoto to wa tomo ni ai, gi to heiwa to wa tagai ni kuchizuke shi,
Makoto wa chi kara hae, gi wa ten kara miorosudeshou.
Shu ga yoi mono o ataerareru no de, warera no kuni wa sono sanbutsu o dashi,
Gi wa Shu no mimae ni iki, sono ashiato o michi to surudeshou.
Shu yo, anata no mimi o katamukete, watashi ni okotae kudasai. Watashi wa kurushimi katsu toboshiikara desu.
Watashi no inochi o omamori kudasai. Watashi wa kami o uyamau mono dakara desu. Anata ni shinrai suru anata no shimobe o osukui kudasai. Anata wa watashi no kami desu.
Shu yo, watashi o awarende kudasai. Watashi wa hinemosu anata ni yobawarimasu.
Anata no shimobe no tamashii o yorokobasete kudasai. Shu yo, waga tamashii wa anata o aogi nozomimasu.
Shu yo, anata wa megumi fukaku, kan'you de atte, anata ni yobawaru subete no mono ni itsukushimi o yutaka ni hodokosaremasu.
Shu yo, watashi no inori ni mimi o katamuke, watashi no negai no koe o okiki kudasai.
Watashi no nayami no hi ni watashi wa anata ni yobawarimasu. Anata wa watashi ni kotaerarerukara desu.
Shu yo, moromoro no kami no uchi ni anata ni hitoshii mono wa naku, mata, anata no miwaza ni hitoshii mono wa arimasen.
Shu yo, anata ga tsukurareta subete no kunitami wa anata no mae ni kite, fushiogami, mina o agamerudeshou.
Anata wa ooinaru kami de, kusu shikimi waza o nasaremasu. Tada anata nomi, kami de iraseraremasu.
Shu yo, anata no michi o watashi ni oshiete kudasai. Watashi wa anata no shinri ni ayumimasu. Kokoro o hitotsu ni shite mi na o osoresasete kudasai.
Waga kami, Shu yo, watashi wa kokoro o tsukushite anata ni kansha shi, tokoshie ni, mina o agamerudeshou.
Watashi ni shimesareta anata no itsukushimi wa ookiku, waga tamashii o yomi no fukai tokoro kara tasukedasaretakara desu.
Kami yo, takaburu mono wa watashi ni sakaratte okori, araburu mono no mure wa watashi no inochi o motome, karera wa jibun no mae ni anata o oku koto o shimasen.
Shikashi Shu yo, anata wa awaremi to megumi ni tomi, ikari o osoku shi, itsukushimito, makoto to ni yutaka na kami de iraseraremasu.
Watashi o kaerimi, watashi o awaremi, anata no shimobe ni michikara o atae, anata no hashi tame no ko o osukui kudasai.
Watashi ni, anata no megumi no shirushi o arawashite kudasai. Sou sureba, watashi o nikumu monodomo wa watashi o mite hajirudeshou. Shu yo, anata wa watashi o tasuke, watashi o nagusameraretakara desu.
Shu ga motoi o suerareta miyako wa sei naru yama no ue ni tatsu.
Shu wa Yakobu no subete no sumai ni masatte, Shion no moromoro no mon o aisareru.
Kami no miyako yo, anata ni tsuite, moromoro no eikou aru koto ga katarareru. [sera]
Watashi wa Rahabu to Babiron o watashi o shiru mono no uchi ni ageru. Perishite, Tsuro, mata Echiopiya o miyo. "Kono mono wa kashiko ni umareta" to iwareru.
Shikashi Shion ni tsuite wa "Kono mono mo, kano mono mo sono naka ni umareta" to iwareru. Ito takaki mono mizukara Shion o kataku taterarerukara de aru.
Shu ga moromoro no tami o touroku sareru toki, "Kono mono wa kashiko ni umareta" to shirusareru. [sera]
Utau mono to odoru mono wa mina iu, "Waga moromoro no izumi wa anata no uchi ni aru" to.
Waga kami, Shu yo, watashi wa hiru, tasuke o yobimotome, yoru, mimae ni sakebi motomemasu.
Watashi no inori o mimae ni itarase, watashi no sakebi ni mimi o katamukete kudasai.
Watashi no tamashii wa nayami ni michi, watashi no inochi wa yomi ni chikazukimasu.
Watashi wa ana ni kudaru mono no uchi ni kazoerare, chikara no nai hito no you ni narimashita.
Sunawachi shinin no uchi ni suterareta mono no you ni, haka ni yokotawaru korosareta mono no you ni, anata ga futatabi kokoro ni tomerarenai mono no you ni narimashita. Karera wa anata no mite kara tachi horobosareta mono desu.
Anata wa watashi o fukai ana, kurai tokoro, fukai fuchi ni okaremashita.
Anata no ikari wa watashi no ue ni omoku, anata wa moromoro no nami o motte watashi o kurushimeraremashita. [sera]
Anata wa waga shirihito o watashi kara toozake, watashi o karera no imikirau mono to saremashita. Watashi wa tojikomerarete, nogareru koto wa dekimasen.
Watashi no me wa kanashimi ni yotte otoroemashita. Shu yo, watashi wa higoto ni anata o yobi, anata ni mukatte waga ryoute o nobemashita.
Anata wa shinda mono no tame ni kiseki o okonawarerudeshou ka. Naki hito no tamashii wa okiagatte anata o hometataerudeshou ka. [sera]
Anata no itsukushimi wa haka no naka ni, anata no makoto wa horobi no naka ni, nobetsutaerarerudeshou ka.
Anata no kiseki wa kurayami ni, anata no gi wa wasure no kuni ni shirarerudeshou ka.
Shikashi Shu yo, watashi wa anata ni yobawarimasu. Ashita ni, waga inori o anata no mimae ni sasagemasu.
Shu yo, naze, anata wa watashi o suterareru no desu ka. Naze, watashi ni mikao o kakusareru no desu ka.
Watashi wa wakai toki kara kurushinde shinu bakari desu. Anata no obiyakashi ni atte otoroe hatemashita.
Anata no hageshii ikari ga watashi o osoi, anata no osoroshii obiyakashi ga watashi o horoboshimashita.
Korera no koto ga hinemosu oomizu no you ni watashi o meguri, watashi o mattaku torimakimashita.
Anata wa aisuru mono to tomo to o watashi kara toozake, watashi no shiribito o kurayami ni okaremashita.
Shu yo, watashi wa tokoshie ni anata no itsukushimi o utai, watashi no kuchi o motte anata no makoto o yorozu yo ni tsugeshirasemasu.
Anata no itsukushimi wa tokoshie ni kataku tachi, anata no makoto wa ten no you ni yurugu koto wa arimasen.
Anata wa iwaremashita, "Watashi wa watashi no eranda mono to keiyaku o musubi, watashi no shimobe Dabide ni chikatta,
'Watashi wa anata no shison o tokoshie ni kataku shi, anata no ouza o tatete, yorozu yo ni itaraseru' ". [sera]
Shu yo, moromoro no ten ni anata no kusu shikimi waza o hometataesase, sei naru mono no tsudoi de, anata no makoto o hometataesasete kudasai.
Oozora no uchi ni, dare ka Shu to narabu mono ga arudeshou ka. Kami no kora no uchi ni, dare ka Shu no you na mono ga arudeshou ka.
Shu wa sei naru mono no kaigi ni oite osorubeki kami, sono mawari ni aru subete no mono ni masatte ooinaru osorubeki mono desu.
Bangun no kami, Shu yo, Shu yo, dare ka anata no you ni tainou no aru mono ga arudeshou ka. Anata no makoto wa, anata o megutte imasu.
Anata wa umi no areru no o osame, sono nami no okoru toki, kore o shizumeraremasu.
Anata wa Rahabu o, korosareta mono no you ni uchikudaki, anata no teki o chikara aru ude o motte chirasaremashita.
Moromoro no ten wa anata no mono, chi mo mata anata no mono, sekai to sono naka ni aru mono to wa anata ga sono motoi o okareta mono desu.
Kita to minami wa anata ga kore o tsukuraremashita. Taboru to Herumon wa, mina o yorokobiutaimasu.
Anata wa tainou no ude o motaremasu. Anata no te wa tsuyoku, anata no migi no te wa takaku,
Gi to kouhei wa anata no mikura no motoi, itsukushimito, makoto wa anata no mae ni ikimasu.
Matsuri no hi no yorokobi no koe o shiru tami wa saiwai desu. Shu yo, karera wa mikao no hikari no naka o ayumi,
Hinemosu, mina ni yotte yorokobi, anata no gi o hometataemasu.
Anata wa karera no chikara no eikou dakara desu. Warera no tsuno wa anata no megumi ni yotte takaku agerarerudeshou.
Warera no tate wa Shu ni zokushi, warera no ou wa Isuraeru no seija ni zokushimasu.
Mukashi anata wa maboroshi o motte anata no seito ni tsugete iwaremashita, "Watashi wa yuushi ni eikan o sazuke, tami no naka kara erabareta mono o takaku ageta.
Watashi wa waga shimobe Dabide o ete, kore ni waga sei naru abura o sosoida.
Waga te wa tsune ni kare to tomo ni ari, waga ude wa mata kare o tsuyoku suru.
Teki wa kare o damasu koto naku, ashiki mono wa kare o iyashimeru koto wa nai.
Watashi wa kare no mae ni moromoro no ada o uchihoroboshi, kare o nikumu monodomo o uchitaosu.
Waga makoto to, waga itsukushimi wa kare to tomo ni ari, waga na ni yotte kare no tsuno wa takaku agerareru.
Watashi wa kare no te o umi no ue ni oki, kare no migi no te o kawa no ue ni oku.
Kare wa watashi ni mukai 'Anata wa waga chichi, waga kami, waga sukui no iwa' to yobude arou.
Watashi wa mata kare o waga ui gotoshi, chi no outachi no uchi no mottomo takai mono to suru.
Watashi wa tokoshie ni, waga itsukushimi o kare no tame ni tamochi, waga keiyaku wa kare no tame ni kataku tatsu.
Watashi wa kare no kakei o tokoshie ni kataku sadame, sono kurai o ten no hikazu no you ni nagaraesaseru.
Moshi sono shison ga waga okite o sute, waga sabaki ni shitagatte ayumanainaraba,
Moshi karera ga waga sadame o okashi, waga imashime o mamoranainaraba,
Watashi wa tsue o motte karera no toga o basshi, muchi o motte karera no fugi o bassuru.
Shikashi, watashi wa waga itsukushimi o kare kara torisaru koto naku, waga makoto ni somuku koto wa nai.
Watashi wa waga keiyaku o yaburu koto naku, waga kuchibiru kara deta kotoba o kaeru koto wa nai.
Watashi wa hitotabi waga sei ni yotte chikatta. Watashi wa Dabide ni itsuwari o iwanai.
Kare no kakei wa tokoshie ni tsuzuki, kare no kurai wa taiyou no you ni tsune ni watashi no mae ni aru.
Mata tsuki no you ni tokoshie ni kataku sadamerare, oozora no tsuzuku kagiri kataku tatsu". [sera]
Shikashi anata wa, anata no abura sosogareta mono o sutete shirizoke, kare ni taishite hageshiku ikararemashita.
Anata wa sono shimobe to no keiyaku o haiki shi, kare no kanmuri o chi ni nageutte, kega saremashita.
Anata wa sono jouheki o kotogotoku kowashi, sono toride o are sutaresaseraremashita.
Soko o toorisugiru mono wa mina kare o kasume, kare wa sono tonaribito no azakeri to narimashita.
Anata wa kare no ada no migi no te o takaku age, sono moromoro no teki o yorokobaseraremashita.
Makoto ni, anata wa kare no tsurugi no ha o kaeshite, kare o tatakai ni tataserarenakatta no desu.
Anata wa kare no te kara ou no tsue o torisari, sono ouza o chi ni nagesuteraremashita.
Anata wa kare no wakaki hi o chijime, haji o motte kare o oowaremashita. [sera]
Shu yo, itsu made na no desu ka. Tokoshie ni ookakure ni naru no desu ka. Anata no ikari wa itsu made hi no you ni moeru no desu ka.
