Ou no sakae wa tami no ooi koto ni ari, kimi no horobi wa tami o ushinau koto ni aru.
Ikari o osoku suru mono wa ooinaru satori ga ari, ki no mijikai mono wa orokasa o arawasu.
Odayaka na kokoro wa mi no inochi de aru, shikashi koufun wa hone o kusaraseru.
Mazushii mono o shi etageru mono wa sono tsukurinushi o anadoru, toboshii mono o awaremu mono wa, Shu o uyamau.
Ashiki mono wa sono ashiki okonai ni yotte horobosare, tadashii mono wa sono tadashiki ni yotte, no gareba o eru.
Chie wa satoki mono no kokoro ni todomari, oroka na mono no kokoro ni shirarenai.
Seigi wa kuni o takaku shi, tsumi wa tami o hazukashimeru.
Kashikoi shimobe wa ou no megumi o uke, haji o kitara sumono wa sono ikari ni au.
Yawarakai kotae wa ikidoori o todome, hageshii kotoba wa ikari o hikiokosu.
Chie aru mono no shita wa chishiki o wakachiatae, oroka na mono no kuchi wa oroka o hakidasu.
Shu no me wa doko ni de mo atte, akunin to zennin to o mihatte iru.
Yasashii shita wa inochi no ki de aru, ranbou na kotoba wa tamashii o kizutsukeru.
Oroka na mono wa chichi no kyoukun o karonjiru, imashime o mamoru mono wa kashikoi mono de aru.
Tadashii mono no ie ni wa ooku no takara ga aru, ashiki mono no shotoku ni wa wazurai ga aru.
Chie aru mono no kuchibiru wa chishiki o hiromeru, oroka na mono no kokoro wa sou de nai.
Ashiki mono no sonaemono wa Shu ni nikumare, tadashii mono no inori wa kare ni yorokobareru.
Ashiki mono no michi wa Shu ni nikumare, seigi o motomeru mono wa kare ni aiserareru.
Michi o suteru mono ni wa, kibishii kora shime ga ari, imashime o nikumu mono wa shi ni itaru.
Yomi to horobi to wa Shu no me no mae ni ari, hito no kokoro wa naosara de aru.
Azakeru mono wa imashimerareru koto o konomanai, mata chie aru mono ni chikazukanai.
Kokoro ni tanoshimi ga areba kaoiro mo yorokobashii, kokoro ni urei ga areba ki wa fusagu.
Satoki mono no kokoro wa chishiki o tazune, oroka na mono no kuchi wa orokasa o shokumotsu to suru.
Nayande iru mono no hibi wa kotogotoku tsuraku, kokoro no tanoshii hito wa tsune ni enkai o motsu.
Sukoshi no mono o shoyuu shite Shu o osoreru no wa, ooku no takara o motte kurou suru no ni masaru.
Yasai o tabete tagai ni aisuru no wa, koeta ushi o tabete tagai ni nikumu no ni masaru.
Ikidooriyasui mono wa arasoi o okoshi, ikari o osoku suru mono wa arasoi o todomeru.
Namakemono no michi ni wa, ibara ga wa e shigeri, tadashii mono no michi wa tairaka de aru.
Chie aru ko wa chichi o yorokobaseru, oroka na hito wa sono haha o karonjiru.
Muchi na mono wa oroka na koto o yorokobi, sa toki mono wa massugu ni ayumu.
Aihakaru koto ga nakereba, keikaku wa yabureru, hakaru mono ga ookereba, sore wa kanarazu naru.
Hito wa kuchi kara deru konomashii kotae ni yotte yorokobi o eru, toki ni kanatta kotoba wa, ikani mo yoi mono da.
Chie aru hito no michi wa nobotte inochi ni itaru, kou shite sono hito wa shita ni aru yomi o hanareru.
Shu wa takaburu mono no ie o horoboshi, yamome no jizakai o sadamerareru.
Akunin no hakarigoto wa Shu ni nikumare, keppaku na hito no kotoba wa kare ni yorokobareru.
Fusei na ri o musaboru mono wa sono ie o wazura wa seru, mainai o nikumu mono wa ikinagaraeru.
Tadashii mono no kokoro wa kotaerubeki koto o kangaeru, ashiki mono no kuchi wa aku o hakidasu.
Shu wa ashiki mono ni toozakari, tadashii mono no inori o kikareru.
Me no hikari wa kokoro o yorokobase, yoi shirase wa hone o uruosu.
Tame ni naru imashime o kiku mimi o motsu mono wa, chie aru mono no naka ni todomaru.
Kyoukun o suteru mono wa onore no inochi o karonji, imashime o omonjiru mono wa satori o eru.
Shu o osoreru koto wa chie no kyoukun de aru, kenson wa, eiyo ni sakidatsu.
Kokoro ni hakaru koto wa hito ni zokushi, shita no kotae wa Shu kara deru.
Hito no michi wa jibun no me ni kotogotoku isagiyoshi to mieru, shikashi Shu wa hito no tamashii o hakarareru.
Anata no nasubeki koto o Shu ni yudaneyo, sou sureba, anata no hakaru tokoro wa kanarazu naru.
Shu wa subete no mono o onoono sono you no tame ni tsukuri, ashiki hito o mo wazawai no hi no tame ni tsukurareta.
Subete kokoro ni takaburu mono wa Shu ni nikumareru, tashika ni, kare wa batsu o manukarenai.
Itsukushimi to makoto ni yotte, toga wa aganawareru, Shu o osoreru koto ni yotte, hito wa aku o manukareru.
Hito no michi ga Shu o yorokobaseru toki, Shu wa sono hito no teki o mo sono hito to yawaragaserareru.
Seigi ni yotte eta wazuka na mono wa, fugi ni yotte eta ooku no takara ni masaru.
Hito wa kokoro ni jibun no michi o kangae hakaru, shikashi, sono ayumi o michibiku mono wa Shu de aru.
Ou no kuchibiru ni wa kami no kettei ga aru, sabaki o suru toki, sono kuchi ni ayamari ga nai.
Tadashii hakari to tenbin to wa Shu no mono de aru, fukuro ni aru fun dou mo subete kare no tsukurareta mono de aru.
Aku o okonau koto wa ou no nikumu tokoro de aru, sono kurai ga seigi ni yotte kataku tatte irukara de aru.
Tadashii kuchibiru wa ou ni yorokobareru, kare wa tadashii koto o iu mono o aisuru.
Ou no ikari wa shi no shisha de aru, chie aru hito wa kore o nadameru.
Ou no kao no hikari ni wa inochi ga aru, kare no megumi wa harusame o motarasu kumo no you da.
Chie o eru no wa kin o eru no ni masaru, satori o eru no wa gin o eru yori mo nozomashii.
Aku o hanareru koto wa tadashii hito no michi de aru, jibun no michi o mamoru mono wa sono tamashii o mamoru.
Takaburi wa horobi ni sakidachi, hokoru kokoro wa taore ni sakidatsu.
Herikudatte mazushii hitobito to tomo ni oru no wa, takaburu mono to tomo ni ite, emono o wakeru ni masaru.
Tsutsushinde, mikotoba o okonau mono wa sakaeru, Shu ni yori tanomu mono wa saiwai de aru.
Kokoro ni chie aru mono wa satoki mono to tonaerareru, kuchibiru ga amakereba, sono oshie ni hito o tokitsukeru chikara o masu.
Chie wa kore o motsu mono ni inochi no izumi to naru, shikashi, orokasa wa oroka na mono no ukeru kora shime de aru.
Chie aru mono no kokoro wa sono iu tokoro o kashikoku shi, mata sono kuchibiru ni hito o tokitsukeru chikara o masu.
Kokochiyoi kotoba wa hachimitsu no you ni, tamashii ni amaku, karada o sukoyaka ni suru.
Hito ga mite jibun de tadashii to suru michi ga ari, sono owari wa tsuini shi ni itaru michi to naru mono ga aru.
Honeoru mono wa inshoku no tame ni honeoru, sono kuchi ga jibun ni semarukara de aru.
Yokoshima na hito wa aku o kuwadateru, sono kuchibiru ni wa hageshii hi no you na mono ga aru.
Itsuwaru mono wa arasoi o okoshi, tsugeguchi suru mono wa shitashii tomo o hanaresaseru.
Shi etageru mono wa sono tonaribito o izanai, kore o yoku nai michi ni michibiku.
Mekubase suru mono wa aku o hakari, kuchibiru o chijimeru mono wa akuji o nashitogeru.
Shiraga wa sakae no kanmuri de aru, tadashiku ikiru koto ni yotte sore ga erareru.
Ikari o osoku suru mono wa yuushi ni masari, jibun no kokoro o osameru mono wa shiro o semetoru mono ni masaru.
Hito wa kuji o hiku, shikashi koto o sadameru no wa mattaku Shu no koto de aru.
Heion de atte, hitokatamari no kawaita pan no aru no wa, arasoi ga atte, shokumotsu no yutaka na ie ni masaru.
Kashikoi shimobe wa mimochi no warui musuko o osame, katsu, sono kyoudaitachi no naka ni atte, shisan no wakemae o eru.
Gin o kokoromiru mono wa rutsubo, kin o kokoromiru mono wa ro, hito no kokoro o kokoromiru mono wa Shu de aru.
Aku o okonau mono wa itsuwari no kuchibiru ni kiki, itsuwari o iu mono wa ashiki shita ni mimi o katamukeru.
Mazushii mono o azakeru mono wa sono tsukurinushi o anadoru, hito no wazawai o yorokobu mono wa batsu o manukarenai.
Mago wa roujin no kanmuri de aru, chichi wa ko no sakae de aru.
Sugureta kotoba wa oroka na mono ni wa niawanai, mashite itsuwari o iu kuchibiru wa kimi taru mono ni wa niawanai.
Mainai wa kore o okuru hito no me ni wa kouun no tama no you da, sono mukau tokoro, doko de mo kare wa sakaeru.
Ai o oimotomeru hito wa hito no ayamachi o yurusu, hito no koto o iifurasu mono wa tomo o hanaresaseru.
Ichi do no imashime ga satoki hito ni tessuru no wa, hyaku do no kora shime ga oroka na hito ni tessuru yori mo fukai.
Ashiki mono wa tada, somuku koto nomi o motomeru, sore yue, kare ni mukatte wa zannin na shisha ga tsukawasareru.
Oroka na mono ga oroka na koto o suru no ni au yori wa, ko o torareta me guma ni au hou ga yoi.
Aku o mote zen ni mukuiru mono wa, aku ga sono ie o hanareru koto ga nai.
Arasoi no hajime wa mizu ga moreru no ni nite iru, sore yue, kenka no okoranai uchi ni sore o yameyo.
Ashiki mono o tadashii to suru mono, tadashii mono o warui to suru mono, kono futatsu no mono wa tomo ni Shu ni nikumareru.
Oroka na mono wa sudeni kokoro ga nai no ni, dou shite chie o kaou to shite te ni sono daikin o motte iru no ka.
Tomo wa izure no toki ni mo aisuru, kyoudai wa nayami no toki no tame ni umareru.
Chie no nai hito wa te o utte, sono tonaribito no mae de hoshou o suru.
Arasoi o konomu mono wa tsumi o konomu, sono mon o takaku suru mono wa horobi o motomeru.
Magatta kokoro no mono wa saiwai o enai, midari ni shita o motte kataru mono wa wazawai ni ochiiru.
Oroka na ko o umu mono wa nageki o eru, orokamono no chichi wa yorokobi o enai.
Kokoro no tanoshimi wa yoi kusuri de aru, tamashii no urei wa hone o karasu.
Ashiki mono wa hito no futokoro kara mainai o ukete, sabaki no michi o mageru.
Satoki mono wa sono kao o chie ni mukeru, shikashi, oroka na mono wa me o chi no hate ni sosogu.
Oroka na ko wa sono chichi no urei de aru, mata kore o unda haha no itami de aru.
Tadashii hito o bassuru no wa yoku nai, tattoi hito o utsu no wa warui.
Kotoba o sukunaku suru mono wa chishiki no aru mono, kokoro no reisei na hito wa satoki hito de aru.
Oroka na mono mo damatte iru toki wa, chie aru mono to omoware, sono kuchibiru o tojite iru toki wa, sa toki mono to omowareru.
Hito to majiwari o shinai mono wa koujitsu o sagashi, subete no yoi kangae ni hageshiku hantai suru.
Oroka na mono wa satoru koto o yorokobazu, tada jibun no iken o iiarawasu koto o yorokobu.
Ashiki mono ga kuruto, iyashime mo mata kuru, fumeiyo ga kuruto, hazukashime mo tomo ni kuru.
Hito no kuchi no kotoba wa fukai mizu no you da, chie no izumi wa, waite nagareru kawa de aru.
Ashiki mono o eko hiiki suru koto wa yoku nai, tadashii mono o sabaite, ashiki mono to suru koto mo yoku nai.
Oroka na mono no kuchibiru wa arasoi o okoshi, sono kuchi wa muchiutareru koto o maneku.
Oroka na mono no kuchi wa jibun no horobi to nari, sono kuchibiru wa jibun o toraeru wa na to naru.
Hito no yoshiashi o iu mono no kotoba wa oishii shokumotsu no you de, hara no oku ni shimikomu.
Sono shigoto o okotaru mono wa, horobosu mono no kyoudai de aru.
Shu no na wa kengo na yagura no you da, tadashii mono wa sono naka ni hashirikonde sukui o eru.
Tomeru mono no tomi wa sono kata kishiro de aru, sore wa takaki jouheki no you ni kare o mamoru.
Hito no kokoro no takaburi wa horobi ni sakidachi, kenson wa eiyo ni sakidatsu.
Koto o yoku kikanaide kotaeru mono wa, oroka de atte haji o koumuru.
Hito no kokoro wa byouku o mo shinobu, shikashi kokoro no itamu toki wa, dare ga sore ni taeyou ka.
Satoki mono no kokoro wa chishiki o e, chie aru mono no mimi wa chishiki o motomeru.
Hito no okurimono wa, sono hito no tame ni michi o hiraki, mata tattoi hito no mae ni kare o michibiku.
Saki ni uttaederu mono wa tadashii you ni mieru, shikashi sono uttaerareta hito ga kite, sore o shirabete, koto wa akiraka ni naru.
Kuji wa arasoi o todome, katsu tsuyoi arasoi aite no aida o kettei suru.
Tasukeau kyoudai wa kengo na shiro no you da, shikashi arasoi wa, yagura no kannoki no you da.
Hito wa jibun no kotoba no musubu mi ni yotte, michitari, sono kuchibiru no sanbutsu ni yotte mizukara akiru.
Shi to sei to wa shita ni shihai sareru, kore o aisuru mono wa sono mi o taberu.
Tsuma o eru mono wa, yoki mono o eru, katsu Shu kara megumi o ataerareru.
Mazushii mono wa, awaremi o koi, tomeru mono wa, hageshii kotae o suru.
Yo ni wa tomorashii misekake no tomo ga aru, shikashi kyoudai yori mo tanomoshii tomo mo aru.
Tadashiku ayumu mazushii mono wa, magatta koto o iu oroka na mono ni masaru.
Hito ga chishiki no nai no wa yoku nai, ashi de isogu mono wa michi ni mayou.
Hito wa jibun no orokasa ni yotte michi ni tsumazuki, kaette kokoro no uchi ni Shu o uramu.
Tomi wa ooku no atarashii tomo o tsukuru, shikashi mazushii hito wa sono tomo ni suterareru.
Itsuwari no shounin wa batsu o manukarenai, itsuwari o iu mono wa nogareru koto ga dekinai.
Kimae no yoi hito ni kobiru mono wa ooi, hito wa mina okurimono o suru hito no tomo to naru.
Mazushii mono wa sono kyoudai sura mo mina kore o nikumu, mashite sono tomo wa kore ni toozakaranaide arou ka. Kotoba o kakete kore o yonde mo, satte kaeranai no de aru.
Chie o eru mono wa jibun no tamashii o aishi, satori o tamotsu mono wa saiwai o eru.
Itsuwari no shounin wa batsu o manukarenai, itsuwari o iu mono wa horobiru.
Oroka na mono ga, zeitaku na kurashi o suru no wa, fusawashii koto de wa nai, shimobe taru mono ga, kimi taru mono o osameru nado wa, naosara de aru.
Satori wa hito ni ikari o shinobaseru, ayamachi o yurusu no wa hito no homare de aru.
Ou no ikari wa, shishi no hoeru you de ari, sono megumi wa kusa no ue ni oku tsuyu no you de aru.
Oroka na ko wa sono chichi no wazawai de aru, tsuma no arasou no wa, amamori no taenai no to hitoshii.
Ie to tomi to wa senzo kara uketsugu mono, kashikoi tsuma wa Shu kara tamawaru mono de aru.
Okotari wa hito o jukusui saseru, namakemono wa ueru.
Imashime o mamoru mono wa jibun no tamashii o mamoru, mikotoba o karonjiru mono wa shinu.
Mazushii mono o awaremu mono wa Shu ni kasu no da, sono hodokoshi wa Shu ga tsugunawareru.
Nozomi no aru uchi ni, jibun no ko o korase, kore o horobosu kokoro o okoshite wa naranai.
Ikaru koto no hageshii mono wa batsu o ukeru, tatoi kare o sukutte yatte mo, sarani kurikaesaneba naranai.
Susume o kiki, kyoukun o ukeyo, sou sureba, tsuini wa chie aru mono to naru.
Hito no kokoro ni wa ooku no keikaku ga aru, shikashi tada Shu no, mimune dake ga kataku tatsu.
Hito ni nozomashii no wa, itsukushimi fukai koto de aru, mazushii hito wa itsuwari o iu hito ni masaru.
Shu o osoreru koto wa hito o inochi ni itarase, tsune ni akitarite, wazawai ni au koto wa nai.
Namakemono wa, te o sara ni irete mo, sore o kuchi ni motte yuku koto o shinai.
Azakeru mono o ute, sou sureba shiryo no nai mono mo tsutsushimu. Sa toki mono o imashimeyo, sou sureba kare wa chishiki o eru.
Chichi ni ranbou o hataraki, haha o oidasu mono wa, haji o kitarashi, hazukashime o maneku ko de aru.
Waga ko yo, chishiki no kotoba o hanarete hito o mayowaseru kyoukun o kiku koto o yameyo.
Warui shounin wa sabaki o azakeri, ashiki mono no kuchi wa aku o musaborikuu.
Sabaki wa azakeru mono no tame ni sonaerare, muchi wa oroka na mono no se no tame ni sonaerareru.
Sake wa hito o azakeru mono to shi, koi sake wa hito o abaremono to suru, kore ni mayowasareru mono wa muchi de aru.
Ou no ikari wa, shishi ga hoeru you da, kare o ikaraseru mono wa jibun no inochi o sokonau.
Arasoi ni kankei shinai koto wa hito no homare de aru, subete oroka na mono wa ikari arasou.
Namakemono wa samui toki ni tagayasanai, sore yue kariire no toki ni natte, motomete mo nani mo nai.
Hito no kokoro ni aru hakarigoto wa fukai ido no mizu no you da, shikashi, sa toki hito wa kore o kumidasu.
Jibun wa shinjitsu da to iu hito ga ooi, shikashi, dare ga chuushin na hito ni aude arou ka.
Kaketa tokoro naku, tadashiku ayumu hito - - sono nochi no shison wa saiwai de aru.
Sabaki no za ni suwaru ou wa sono me o motte, subete no aku o furuiwakeru.
Dare ga "Watashi wa jibun no kokoro o kiyometa, watashi no tsumi wa kiyomerareta" to iu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Tagai ni chigatta ni shu no hakari, ni shu no masu wa, hitoshiku Shu ni nikumareru.
Osanago de sae mo, sono okonai ni yotte mizukara o shimeshi, sono suru koto no kiyoi ka tadashii ka o arawasu.
Kiku mimi to, miru me to wa, tomo ni Shu ga tsukurareta mono de aru.
Nemuri o aishite wa naranai, sou sureba mazushiku naru, me o hirake, sou sureba pan ni aku koto ga dekiru.
Kau mono wa, "Warui, warui" to iu, shikashi satte nochi, kare wa mizukara hokoru.
Kin mo ari, atai no takai houseki mo ooku aruga, tattoi utsuwa wa chishiki no kuchibiru de aru.
Hito no tame ni hoshou suru mono kara wa, mazu sono kimono o tore, tanin no tame ni hoshou suru mono woba teitou ni tore.
Azamuki totta pan wa oishii, shikashi nochi ni wa sono kuchi wa jari de mitasareru.
Hakarigoto wa tomo ni gisuru koto ni yotte naru, tatakaou to surunaraba, mazu yoku gishinakereba naranai.
Aruki mawatte hito no yoshiashi o iu mono wa himitsu o morasu, kuchibiru o hiraite aruku mono to majiwatte wa naranai.
Jibun no fubo o nonoshiru mono wa, sono tomoshibi wa kurayami no naka ni kieru.
Hajime ni isoide eta shisan wa, sono owari ga saiwai de nai.
"Watashi ga aku ni mukuiru" to itte wa naranai, Shu o machinozome, Shu wa anata o tasukerareru.
Tagai ni chigatta ni shu no fun dou wa Shu ni nikumareru, itsuwari no hakari wa yoku nai.
Hito no ayumi wa Shu ni yotte sadamerareru, hito wa dou shite mizukara sono michi o, akiraka ni suru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Karugarushiku "Kore wa sei naru sasagemono da" to ii, mata chikai o tatete nochi ni kangaeru koto wa, sono hito no wana to naru.
Chie aru ou wa, mino o motte aogi wakeru you ni akunin o chirashi, kuruma o motte dakkoku suru you ni, kore o bassuru.
Hito no tamashii wa Shu no tomoshibi de ari, hito no kokoro no oku o saguru.
Itsukushimito, makoto to wa ou o mamoru, sono kurai mo mata seigi ni yotte tamotareru.
Wakai hito no sakae wa sono chikara, roujin no utsukushisa wa sono shiraga de aru.
Kizutsuku made ni uteba warui tokoro wa kiyoku nari, muchi de uteba kokoro no soko made mo kiyomaru.
Ou no kokoro wa, Shu no te no uchi ni atte, mizu no nagare no you da, Shu wa mikokoro no mama ni kore o michibikareru.
Hito no michi wa jibun no me ni wa tadashiku mieru, shikashi Shu wa hito no kokoro o hakarareru.
Seigi to kouhei o okonau koto wa, gisei ni mo masatte Shu ni yorokobareru.
Takaburu me to ogoru kokoro to wa, ashiki hito no tomoshibi de atte, tsumi de aru.
Kinben na hito no keikaku wa, tsuini sono hito o yutaka ni suru, subete okotaru mono wa mazushiku naru.
Itsuwari no shita o motte takara o eru no wa, fukiharawareru kemuri, shi no wana de aru.
Ashiki mono no bougyaku wa sono mi o horobosu, karera wa kouhei o okonau koto o konomanaikara de aru.
Tsumibito no michi wa magatte iru, keppaku na hito no okonai wa massugu de aru.
Arasoi o konomu onna to issho ni ie ni oru yori wa yane no sumi ni oru hou ga yoi.
Ashiki mono no tamashii wa aku o okonau koto o negau, sono tonaribito ni mo koui o motte mirarenai.
Azakeru mono ga batsu o ukerunaraba, shiryo no nai mono wa chie o eru. Chie aru mono ga oshie o ukerunaraba chishiki o eru.
Tadashii kami wa, ashiki mono no ie o mitomete, ashiki mono o horobi ni nageirerareru.
Mimi o tojite mazushii mono no yobu koe o kikanai mono wa, jibun ga yobu toki ni, kikarenai.
Hisoka na okurimono wa ikidoori o nadameru, futokoro no mainai wa hageshii ikari o yawarageru.
Kougi o okonau koto wa, tadashii mono ni wa yorokobi de aruga, aku o okonau mono ni wa horobi de aru.
Satori no michi o hanareru hito wa, shinin no shuukai no naka ni oru.
Kairaku o konomu mono wa mazushii hitotonari, sake to abura to o konomu mono wa tomu koto ga nai.
Ashiki mono wa tadashii mono no a ga nai to nari, fushinjitsu na mono wa tadashii hito ni kawaru.
Arasoi ikaru onna to tomo ni oru yori wa, arano ni sumu hou ga mashi da.
Chie aru mono no ie ni wa tattoi takara ga ari, oroka na hito wa kore o, nomi tsukusu.
Seigi to itsukushimi to o oimotomeru mono wa, inochi to homare to o eru.
Chie aru mono wa tsuyoi mono no shiro ni nobotte, sono tanomi to suru toride o kuzusu.
Kuchi to shita to o mamoru mono wa sono tamashii o mamotte, nayami ni awasenai.
Takaburi ogoru mono o "Azakeru mono" to nazukeru, kare wa kouman burei na okonai o suru mono de aru.
