Tsune ni Shu o osoreru hito wa saiwai de aru, kokoro o katakuna ni suru mono wa wazawai ni ochiiru.
Mazushii tami o osameru warui tsukasa wa, hoerushi shi, mata wa ueta kuma no you da.
Satori no nai tsukasa wa zannin na asseisha de aru, fusei no ri o nikumu mono wa choumei o eru.
Hito o koroshite sono chi o mi ni ou mono wa shinu made, nogare bito de aru, dare mo kore o tasukete wa naranai.
Tadashiku ayumu mono wa sukui o e, magatta michi ni ayumu mono wa ana ni ochiiru.
Jibun no denchi o tagayasu mono wa shokuryou ni aki, mueki na koto ni shitagau mono wa binbou ni akiru.
Chuujitsu na hito wa ooku no shukufuku o eru, isoide tomi o eyou to suru mono wa batsu o manukarenai.
Hito o katayori miru koto wa yoku nai, hito wa ichi kire no pan no tame ni, toga o okasu koto ga aru.
Yoku no fukai hito wa isoide tomi o eyou to suru, kaette ketsubou ga jibun no tokoro ni kuru koto o shiranai.
Hito o imashimeru mono wa shita o motte hetsurau mono yori mo, ooinaru kansha o ukeru.
Chichi ya haha no mono o nusunde "Kore wa tsumi de wa nai" to iu mono wa, horobosu mono no tomo de aru.
Musaboru mono wa arasoi o okoshi, Shu ni shinrai suru mono wa yutaka ni naru.
Jibun no kokoro o tanomu mono wa oroka de aru, chie o motte ayumu mono wa sukui o eru.
Mazushii mono ni hodokosu mono wa mono ni fusoku shinai, me o ootte minai hito wa ooku no noroi o ukeru.
Ashiki mono ga okoru toki wa, tami wa mi o kakusu, sono horobiru toki wa, tadashii hito ga masu.
Shibashiba shikararete mo, nao katakuna na mono wa, tachimachi uchi yaburarete tasukaru koto wa nai.
Tadashii mono ga kenryoku o ereba tami wa yorokobi, ashiki mono ga osameru toki, tami wa umekikurushimu.
Chie o aisuru hito wa sono chichi o yorokobase, yuujo ni majiwaru mono wa sono shisan o rouhi suru.
Ou wa kougi o motte kuni o kataku suru, shikashi, juuzei o toritateru mono wa kore o horobosu.
Sono tonaribito ni hetsurau mono wa, kare no ashi no mae ni ami o haru.
Akunin wa jibun no tsumi no wana ni ochiiru, shikashi tadashii hito wa yorokobitanoshimu.
Tadashii hito wa mazushii mono no uttae o kaerimiru, ashiki hito wa sore o shirou to wa shinai.
Azakeru hito wa machi o midashi, chie aru mono wa ikari o shizumeru.
Chie aru hito ga oroka na hito to arasouto, oroka na mono wa tada ikari, aruiha waratte, yasumu koto ga nai.
Chi ni uete iru hito wa tsumi no nai mono o nikumu, ashiki mono wa kare no inochi o motomeru.
Oroka na mono wa ikari o kotogotoku arawashi, chie aru mono wa shizuka ni kore o osaeru.
Moshi osameru mono ga itsuwari no kotoba ni kikunaraba, sono yakuninra wa mina waruku naru.
Mazushii mono to, shi etageru mono to wa tomo ni yo ni oru, Shu wa karera ryousha no me ni hikari o ataerareru.
Moshi ou ga mazushii mono o kouhei ni sabakunaraba, sono kurai wa itsu made mo kataku tatsu.
Muchi to imashime to wa chie o ataeru, wagamama ni saseta ko wa sono haha ni haji o motarasu.
Ashiki mono ga kenryoku o eru to tsumi mo masu, tadashii mono wa karera no taoreru no o miru.
Anata no ko o kora shimeyo, sou sureba kare wa anata o yasuraka ni shi, mata anata no kokoro ni yorokobi o ataeru.
Yogen ga nakereba tami wa wagamama ni furumau, shikashi rippou o mamoru mono wa saiwai de aru.
Shimobe wa kotoba dake de kunren suru koto wa dekinai, kare wa kiite shitte mo, kokoro ni tomenaikara de aru.
Kotoba no keisotsu na hito o miru ka, kare yori mo kaette oroka na mono no hou ni nozomi ga aru.
Shimobe o sono osanai toki kara wagamama ni sodateru hito wa, tsuini wa sore o jibun no atotsugi ni suru.
Ikaru hito wa arasoi o okoshi, ikidooru hito wa ooku no tsumi o okasu.
Hito no takaburi wa sono hito o hikuku shi, kokoro ni herikudaru mono wa homare o eru.
Nusu bito ni kumisuru mono wa jibun no tamashii o nikumu, kare wa noroi o kiite mo nanigoto o mo kougai shinai.
Hito o osoreruto, wana ni ochiiru, Shu ni shinrai suru mono wa yasuraka de aru.
Osameru mono no kanshin o eyou to suru hito wa ooi, shikashi hito no koto o sadameru no wa Shu ni yoru.
Tadashii hito wa fusei o okonau hito o nikumi, ashiki mono wa tadashiku ayumu hito o nikumu.
Massa no hito Yake no ko Aguru no kotoba. Sono hito wa Iteeru ni mukatte itta, sunawachi Iteeru to, Ukaru to ni mukatte itta,
Watashi wa tashika ni hito yori mo oroka de ari, watashi ni wa hito no satori ga nai.
Watashi wa mada chie o narau koto ga dekizu, mata, sei naru mono o satoru koto mo dekinai.
Ten ni nobot tari, kudat tari shita no wa dare ka, kaze o kobushi no naka ni atsumeta no wa dare ka, mizu o kimono ni tsutsunda no wa dare ka, chi no subete no genkai o sadameta mono wa dare ka, sono na wa nani ka, sono ko no na wa nani ka, anata wa tashika ni sore o shitte iru.
Kami no kotoba wa mina shinjitsu de aru, kami wa kare ni yori tanomu mono no tate de aru.
Sono kotoba ni tsukekuwaete wa naranai, kare ga anata o seme, anata o itsuwari mono to sarenai tame da.
Watashi wa futatsu no koto o anata ni motomemasu, watashi no shinanai uchi ni, kore o kanaete kudasai.
Uso, itsuwari o watashi kara toozake, mazushiku mo naku, mata tomi mo sezu, tada nakute naranu shokumotsu de watashi o yashinatte kudasai.
Akitarite, anata o shiranai to ii, "Shu to wa dare ka" to iu koto no nai tame, mata mazushikute nusumi o shi, watashi no kami no na o yogosu koto no nai tame desu.
Anata wa, shimobe no koto o sono shujin ni, ashizama ni itte wa naranai, sou de naito kare wa anata o noroi, anata wa tsumi o kiserareru.
Yo ni wa chichi o norot tari, haha o shukufuku shinai mono ga aru.
Yo ni wa jibun no me ni mizukara o kiyoi mono to shite, nao sono kegare o arawarenai mono ga aru.
Yo ni wa mata, kono you na hito ga aru - - aa, sono me no ikani takaki koto yo, mata sono mabuta no ikani tsuriagatte iru koto yo.
Yo ni wa mata tsurugi no you na ha o mochi, katana no you na kiba o motte, mazushii mono o chi no ue kara, toboshii mono o hito no naka kara kuihorobosu mono ga aru.
Hiru ni futari no musume ga atte, "Ataeyo, atae yo" to iu. Aku koto o shiranai mono ga mittsu aru, iya, yontsu atte, mina "Mou, takusan desu" to iwanai.
Sunawachi yomi, funin no tai, mizu ni kawaku chi, "Mou, takusan da" to iwanai hi ga sore de aru.
Jibun no chichi o azakeri, haha ni shitagau no o iyashii koto to suru me wa, tani no karasu ga kore o tsutsukidashi, hagetaka ga kore o taberu.
Watashi ni totte fushigi ni taenai koto ga mittsu aru, iya, yontsu atte, watashi ni wa satoru koto ga dekinai.
Sunawachi sora o tobu hagetaka no michi, iwa no ue o hau hebi no michi, umi o hashiru fune no michi, otoko no onna ni au michi ga sore de aru.
Yuujo no michi mo mata sou da, kanojo wa tabete, sono kuchi o nugutte, "Watashi wa nani mo warui koto wa shinai" to iu.
Chi wa mittsu no koto ni yotte furuu, iya, yontsu no koto ni yotte, taeru koto ga dekinai.
Sunawachi dorei taru mono ga ou to nari, oroka na mono ga shokumotsu ni aki,
Imikirawareta onna ga yome ni iki, hashi tame ga onnashujin no ato ni suwaru koto de aru.
Kono chijou ni, chiisaikeredo mo, hijou ni kashikoi mono ga yontsu aru.
Ari wa chikara no nai shurui daga, sono shokuryou o natsu no uchi ni sonaeru.
Iwa da nuki wa tsuyoku nai shurui daga, sono ie o iwa ni tsukuru.
Inago wa ou ga naikeredo mo, minatai o kunde idetatsu.
Yamori wa te de tsukamaerareruga, ou no kyuuden ni oru.
Arukiburi no doudou taru mono ga mittsu aru, iya, yontsu atte, mina doudou to aruku.
Sunawachi kemono no uchi de mottomo tsuyoku, nanimono no mae ni mo shirizokanai, shishi,
O o tatete aruku ondori, o yagi, sono tami no mae o ibatte aruku ou ga sore de aru.
Anata ga moshi oroka de atte mizukara takaburi, aruiha akuji o hakattanaraba, anata no te o kuchi ni ateru ga yoi.
Chichi o shimereba gyounyuu ga deru, hana o shimereba chi ga deru, ikari o shimereba arasoi ga okoru.
Massa no ou Remueru no kotoba, sunawachi sono haha ga kare ni oshieta mono de aru.
Waga ko yo, nani o iou ka. Waga tai no ko yo, nani o iou ka. Watashi ga gan o kakete eta ko yo, nani o iou ka.
Anata no chikara o onna ni tsuiyasu na, ou o mo horobosu mono ni, anata no michi o makaseru na.
Remueru yo, sake o nomu no wa, ou no suru koto de wa nai, ou no suru koto de wa nai, koi sake o motomeru no wa kimi taru mono no suru koto de wa nai.
Karera wa sake o nonde, okite o wasure, subete nayamu mono no sabaki o mageru.
Koi sake o horobiyou to shite iru mono ni atae, sake o kokoro no kurushimu hito ni atae yo.
Karera wa nonde jibun no binbou o wasure, sono nayami o mohaya omoidasanai.
Anata wa damatte iru hito no tame ni, subete no minashigo no uttae no tame ni, kuchi o hiraku ga yoi.
Kuchi o hiraite, tadashii sabaki o okonai, mazushii mono to toboshii mono no uttae o tadase.
Dare ga kashikoi tsuma o mitsukeru koto ga dekiru ka, kanojo wa houseki yori mo sugurete tattoi.
Sono otto no kokoro wa kanojo o shinrai shite, shuueki ni kakeru koto wa nai.
Kanojo wa ikinagaraete iru aida, sono otto no tame ni yoi koto o shite, warui koto o shinai.
Kanojo wa hitsuji no ke ya ama o motomete, tezukara nozomi no you ni, sore o shiageru.
Mata shounin no fune no you ni, tooi kuni kara shokuryou o hakonde kuru.
Kanojo wa mada yoru no akenu uchi ni okite, sono ie no mono no tabemono o sonae, sono onnatachi ni nichiyou no bun o ataeru.
Kanojo wa hatake o yoku kangaete sore o kai, sono te no hataraki no mi o motte, budou batake o tsukuri,
Chikara o motte koshi ni obishi, sono ude o tsuyoku suru.
Kanojo wa sono shouhin no mouke no aru no o shitte iru, sono tomoshibi wa shuuya kieru koto ga nai.
Kanojo wa te o itotori bou ni nobe, sono te ni, tsumu o mochi,
Te o mazushii mono ni hiraki, toboshii hito ni te o sashinoberu.
Kanojo wa sono ie no mono no tame ni yuki o osorenai, sono ie no mono wa mina kurenai no kimono o kite irukara de aru.
Kanojo wa jibun no tame ni utsukushii shitone o tsukuri, amanuno to murasakinuno to o motte sono kimono to suru.
Sono otto wa sono chi no chouroutachi to tomo ni, machi no mon ni zasuru no de, hito ni shirarete iru.
Kanojo wa amanuno no kimono o tsukutte, sore o uri, obi o tsukutte shounin ni watasu.
Chikara to kihin to wa kanojo no kimono de aru, soshite nochi no hi o waratte iru.
Kanojo wa kuchi o hiraite chie o kataru, sono shita ni wa itsukushimi no oshie ga aru.
Kanojo wa ie no koto o yoku kaerimi, okotari no ka te o taberu koto o shinai.
Sono kora wa tachiagatte kanojo o shukushi, sono otto mo mata kanojo o hometataete iu,
"Rippa ni koto o nashitogeru onna wa ooikeredo mo, anata wa sono subete ni masatte iru" to.
Adeyakasa wa itsuwari de ari, utsukushisa wa tsukanoma de aru, shikashi Shu o osoreru onna wa hometataerareru.
Sono te no hataraki no mi o kanojo ni atae, sono okonai no tame ni kanojo o machi no mon de hometataeyo.
Dabide no ko, Erusaremu no ou de aru dendousha no kotoba.
Dendousha wa iu, kuu no kuu, kuu no kuu, issai wa kuu de aru.
Hi no shita de hito ga rousuru subete no rouku wa, sono mi ni nan no eki ga aru ka.
Yo wa sari, yo wa kitaru. Shikashi chi wa eien ni kawaranai.
Hi hai de, hi wa bosshi, sono deta tokoro ni isogi iku.
Kaze wa minami ni fuki, mata tenjite, kita ni mukai, meguri ni megutte, mata sono meguru tokoro ni kaeru.
Kawa wa mina, umi ni nagareiru, shikashi umi wa michiru koto ga nai. Kawa wa sono dete kita tokoro ni mata kaette iku.
Subete no koto wa hito o umitsukaresaseru, hito wa kore o ii tsukusu koto ga dekinai. Me wa miru koto ni akiru koto ga naku, mimi wa kiku koto ni manzoku suru koto ga nai.
Saki ni atta koto wa, mata nochi ni mo aru, saki ni nasareta koto wa, mata nochi ni mo nasareru. Hi no shita ni wa atarashii mono wa nai.
"Miyo, kore wa atarashii mono da" to iwareru mono ga aru ka, sore wa wareware no mae ni atta yoyo ni, sudeni atta mono de aru.
Mae no mono no koto wa oboerareru koto ga nai, mata, kitarubeki nochi no mono no koto mo, nochi ni okoru mono wa kore o oboeru koto ga nai.
Dendousha de aru watashi wa Erusaremu de, Isuraeru no ou de atta.
Watashi wa kokoro o tsukushi, chie o mochiite, amegashita ni okonawareru subete no koto o tazune, mata shirabeta. Kore wa kami ga, hito no kora ni ataete, honeoraserareru kurushii shigoto de aru.
Watashi wa hi no shita de hito ga okonau subete no waza o mitaga, mina kuu de atte kaze o toraeru you de aru.
Magatta mono wa, massugu ni suru koto ga dekinai, kaketa mono wa kazoeru koto ga dekinai.
Watashi wa kokoro no naka ni katatte itta, "Watashi wa, watashi yori saki ni Erusaremu o osameta subete no mono ni masatte, ooku no chie o eta. Watashi no kokoro wa chie to chishiki o ooku eta".
Watashi wa kokoro o tsukushite chie o shiri, mata kyouki to guchi to o shirou to shitaga, kore mo mata kaze o toraeru you na mono de aru to satotta.
Sore wa chie ga ookereba nayami ga ooku, chishiki o masu mono wa urei o masukara de aru.
Watashi wa jibun no kokoro ni itta, "Saa, kairaku o motte, omae o kokoromiyou. Omae wa yukai ni sugosu ga yoi" to. Shikashi, kore mo mata kuu de atta.
Watashi wa warai ni tsuite itta, "Kore wa kyouki de aru" to. Mata kairaku ni tsuite itta, "Kore wa nani o suru no ka" to.
Watashi no kokoro wa chie o motte watashi o michibiite iruga, watashi wa sake o motte jibun no nikutai o genki zukeyou to kokoromita. Mata, hito no ko wa amegashita de sono mijikai isshou no aida, donna koto o shitara yoi ka o, mikiwameru made wa, oroka na koto o shiyou to kokoromita.
Watashi wa ookina jigyou o shita. Watashi wa jibun no tame ni ie o tate, budou batake o mouke,
Sono to niwa o tsukuri, mata subete mi no naru ki o soko ni ue,
Ike o tsukutte, ki no oishigeru hayashi ni, soko kara mizu o sosogaseta.
Watashi wa danjo no dorei o katta. Mata watashi no ie de umareta dorei o motte ita. Watashi wa mata, watashi yori saki ni Erusaremu ni ita dare yori mo ooku no ushi ya hitsuji no zaisan o motte ita.
Watashi wa mata gin to kin o atsume, outachi to kuniguni no zaihou o atsumeta. Mata watashi wa uta utau otoko, uta utau onna o eta. Mata hito no ko no tanoshimi to suru sobame o ooku eta.
Kou shite, watashi wa ooinaru mono to nari, watashi yori saki ni Erusaremu ni ita subete no mono yori mo, ooinaru mono to natta. Watashi no chie mo mata, watashi o hanarenakatta.
Nan de mo watashi no me no konomu mono wa enryo sezu, watashi no kokoro no yorokobu mono wa kobamanakatta. Watashi no kokoro ga watashi no subete no rouku ni yotte, kairaku o etakara de aru. Soshite kore wa watashi no subete no rouku ni yotte eta mukui de atta.
Soko de, watashi wa waga te no nashita subete no koto, oyobi sore o nasu ni youshita rouku o kaerimita toki, miyo, mina, kuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you na mono de atta. Hi no shita ni wa eki to naru mono wa nai no de aru.
Watashi wa mata, mi o megurashite, chie to, kyouki to, guchi to o mita. Somosomo, ou no nochi ni kuru hito wa nani o nashi eyou ka. Sudeni kare ga nashita koto ni suginai no da.
Hikari ga kuraki ni masaru you ni, chie ga guchi ni masaru no o, watashi wa mita.
Chisha no me wa, sono atama ni aru. Shikashi gusha wa kurayami o ayumu. Keredo mo watashi wa nao douitsu no unmei ga karera no subete ni nozomu koto o shitte iru.
Watashi wa kokoro ni itta, "Gusha ni nozomu koto wa watashi ni mo nozomu no da. Sore de dou shite watashi wa kashikoi koto ga arou". Watashi wa mata kokoro ni itta, "Kore mo mata kuu de aru" to.
Somosomo, chisha mo gusha mo douyou ni nagaku oboerareru mono de wa nai. Kitarubeki hi ni wa mina wasurerarete shimau no de aru. Chisha ga gusha to onaji you ni shinu no wa, dou shita koto de arou.
Soko de, watashi wa ikiru koto o itotta. Hi no shita ni okonawareru waza wa, watashi ni ashiku mietakara de aru. Minakuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you de aru.
Watashi wa hi no shita de roushita subete no rouku o nikunda. Watashi no nochi ni kuru hito ni kore o nokosanakereba naranaikara de aru.
Soshite, sono hito ga chisha de aru ka, mata wa gusha de aru ka wa, dare ga shiri eyou. Sou de aru no ni, sono hito ga, hi no shita de watashi ga roushi, katsu chie o hatarakashite nashita subete no rouku o tsukasadoru koto ni naru no da. Kore mo mata kuu de aru.
Sore de watashi wa furikaette mite, hi no shita de watashi ga roushita subete no rouku ni tsuite, nozomi o ushinatta.
Ima koko ni hito ga atte, chie to chishiki to sainou o motte roushite mo, kore ga tame ni roushinai hito ni, subete o nokoshite, sono shoyuu to sasenakereba naranai no da. Kore mo mata kuu de atte, ooini warui.
Somosomo, hito wa hi no shita de rousuru subete no rouku to, sono kokorozukai ni yotte nan no eru tokoro ga aru ka.
Sono subete no hi wa tada urei nomi de atte, sono waza wa kurushiku, sono kokoro wa yo no ma mo yasumaru koto ga nai. Kore mo mata kuu de aru.
Hito wa kui nomi shi, sono rouku ni yotte eta mono de kokoro o tanoshimaseru yori yoi koto wa nai. Kore mo mata kami no te kara deru koto o, watashi wa mita.
Dare ga kami o hanarete, kui, katsu tanoshimu koto no dekiru mono ga arou.
Kami wa, sono kokoro ni kanau hito ni, chie to chishiki to yorokobi to o kudasaru. Shikashi tsumibito ni wa shigoto o ataete atsumeru koto to, tsumu koto o saserareru. Kore wa kami no kokoro ni kanau mono ni sore o tamawaru tame de aru. Kore mo mata kuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you de aru.
Amegashita no subete no koto ni wa kisetsu ga ari, subete no waza ni wa toki ga aru.
Uma ruru ni toki ga ari, shinuruni toki ga ari, ueru ni toki ga ari, ueta mono o nuku ni toki ga ari,
Korosu ni toki ga ari, iyasu ni toki ga ari, kowasu ni toki ga ari, tateru ni toki ga ari,
Naku ni toki ga ari, warau ni toki ga ari, kanashimu ni toki ga ari, odoru ni toki ga ari,
Ishi o nageru ni toki ga ari, ishi o atsumeru ni toki ga ari, daku ni toki ga ari, daku koto o yameru ni toki ga ari,
Sagasu ni toki ga ari, ushinau ni toki ga ari, tamotsu ni toki ga ari, suteru ni toki ga ari,
Saku ni toki ga ari, nuu ni toki ga ari, damaru ni toki ga ari, kataru ni toki ga ari,
Aisuru ni toki ga ari, nikumu ni toki ga ari, tatakau ni toki ga ari, yawaragu ni toki ga aru.
Hataraku mono wa sono rousuru koto ni yori, nan no eki o eru ka.
Watashi wa kami ga hito no kora ni ataete, honeoraserareru shigoto o mita.
Kami no nasareru koto wa mina sono toki ni kanatte utsukushii. Kami wa mata hito no kokoro ni eien o omou omoi o sazukerareta. Sore de mo nao, hito wa kami no nasareru waza o hajime kara owari made mikiwameru koto wa dekinai.
Watashi wa shitte iru. Hito ni wa sono ikinagaraete iru aida, tanoshiku yukai ni sugosu yori hoka ni yoi koto wa nai.
Mata subete no hito ga kui nomi shi, sono subete no rouku ni yotte tanoshimi o eru koto wa kami no tamamono de aru.
Watashi wa shitte iru. Subete kami ga nasaru koto wa eien ni kawaru koto ga naku, kore ni kuwaeru koto mo, kore kara toru koto mo dekinai. Kami ga kono you ni sareru no wa, hitobito ga kami no mae ni osore o motsu you ni naru tame de aru.
Ima aru mono wa, sudeni atta mono de aru. Nochi ni aru mono mo, sudeni atta mono de aru. Kami wa oiyarareta mono o tazunemotomerareru.
Watashi wa mata, hi no shita o mitaga, sabaki o okonau tokoro ni mo fusei ga ari, kougi o okonau tokoro ni mo fusei ga aru.
Watashi wa kokoro ni itta, "Kami wa tadashii mono to warui mono to o sabakareru. Kami wa subete no koto to, subete no waza ni, toki o sadameraretakara de aru" to.
Watashi wa mata, hito no kora ni tsuite kokoro ni itta, "Kami wa karera o tameshite, karera ni jibuntachi ga kemono ni suginai koto o satoraserareru no de aru" to.
Hito no kora ni nozomu tokoro wa kemono ni mo nozomukara de aru. Sunawachi ichiyou ni karera ni nozomi, kore no shinu you ni, kare mo shinu no de aru. Karera wa mina douyou no iki o motte iru. Hito wa kemono ni masaru tokoro ga nai. Subete no mono wa kuu dakara de aru.
Mina hitotsu tokoro ni iku. Mina chiri kara dete, mina chiri ni kaeru.
Dare ga shiru ka, hito no kora no rei wa ue ni nobori, kemono no rei wa chi ni kudaru ka o.
Sore de, watashi wa mita, hito wa sono hataraki ni yotte tanoshimu ni koshita koto wa nai. Kore ga kare no bun dakara de aru. Dare ga kare o tsurete itte, sono nochi no, dou naru ka o misaseru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi wa mata, hi no shita ni okonawareru subete no shi etage o mita. Miyo, shi etagerareru mono no namida o. Karera o nagusameru mono wa nai. Shi etageru mono no te ni wa kenryoku ga aru. Shikashi karera o nagusameru mono wa inai.
Sore de, watashi wa nao ikite iru seizonsha yori mo, sudeni shinda shisha o, saiwai na mono to omotta.
Shikashi, kono ryousha yori mo saiwai na no wa, mada umarenai mono de, hi no shita ni okonawareru ashiki waza o minai mono de aru.
Mata, watashi wa subete no rouku to, subete no takumi na waza o mitaga, kore wa hito ga tagai ni netami atte nasu mono de aru. Kore mo mata kuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you de aru.
Oroka naru mono wa te o tsukanete, jibun no niku o kuu.
Katate ni mono o mitashite heion de aru no wa, ryoute ni mono o mitashite rouku shi, kaze o toraeru no ni masaru.
Watashi wa mata, hi no shita ni kuu naru koto no aru no o mita.
Koko ni hito ga aru. Hitori de atte, nakama mo naku, ko mo naku, kyoudai mo nai. Sore de mo kare no rouku wa kiwamarinaku, sono me wa tomi ni aku koto ga nai. Mata kare wa iwanai, "Watashi wa dare no tame ni rousuru no ka, dou shite jibun o tanoshimasenai no ka" to. Kore mo mata kuu de atte, kurushii waza de aru.
Futari wa hitori ni masaru. Karera wa sono rouku ni yotte yoi mukui o erukara de aru.
Sunawachi karera ga taoreru toki ni wa, sono hitori ga sono tomo o tasukeokosu. Shikashi hitori de atte, sono taoreru toki, kore o tasukeokosu mono no nai mono wa wazawai de aru.
Mata futari ga issho ni nereba atataka de aru. Hitori dake de, dou shite atataka ni nari eyou ka.
Hito ga moshi, sono hitori o seme uttanara, futari de, sore ni atarude arou. Mittsu yori no tsuna wa tayasuku wa kirenai.
Mazushikute kashikoi warabe wa, oite oroka de, mohaya, isame o ireru koto o shiranai ou ni masaru.
Tatoi, sono ou ga gokuya kara dete, oui ni tsuita mono de atte mo, mata jibun no kuni ni mazushiku umarete oui ni tsuita mono de atte mo, sou de aru.
Watashi wa hi no shita ni ayumu subete no tami ga, kano warabe no you ni ou ni kawatte tatsu no o mita.
Subete no tami wa hateshi ga nai. Kare wa sono subete no tami o michibiita. Shikashi nochi ni kuru mono wa kare o yorokobanai. Tashika ni, kore mo mata kuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you de aru.
Kami no miya ni yuku toki ni wa, sono ashi o tsutsushimu ga yoi. Chikayotte kiku no wa oroka na mono no gisei o sasageru no ni masaru. Karera wa aku o okonatte iru koto o shiranaikara de aru.
Kami no mae de karugarushiku kuchi o hiraki, mata kotoba o dasou to, kokoro ni asette wa naranai. Kami wa ten ni imashi, anata wa chi ni orukara de aru. Sore yue, anata wa kotoba o sukunaku seyo.
Yume wa shigoto no ooi koto ni yotte ki tari, oroka naru mono no koe wa kotoba no ooi koto ni yotte shirareru.
Anata wa kami ni chikai o nasu toki, sore o hatasu koto o nobashite wa naranai. Kami wa oroka na mono o yorokobarenaikara de aru. Anata no chikatta koto o kanarazu hatase.
Anata ga chikai o shite, sore o hatasanai yori wa, mushiro chikai o shinai hou ga yoi.
Anata no kuchi ga, anata ni tsumi o okasasenai you ni seyo. Mata shisha no mae ni sore wa ayamari de atta to itte wa naranai. Dou shite, kami ga anata no kotoba o ikari, anata no te no waza o horoboshite yokarou ka.
Yume ga ookereba kuu naru kotoba mo ooi. Shikashi, anata wa kami o osoreyo.
Anata wa kuni no uchi ni mazushii mono o shi etage, koudou to seigi o mageru koto no aru no o mite mo, sono koto o ayashinde wa naranai. Sore wa kurai no takai hito yori mo, sarani takai mono ga atte, sono hito o ukagaukara de aru. Soshite sorera yori mo nao takai mono ga aru.
Shikashi, yousuru ni kousaku shita tahata o motsu kuni ni wa ou wa rieki de aru.
Kinsen o konomu mono wa kinsen o motte manzoku shinai. Tomi o konomu mono wa tomi o ete manzoku shinai. Kore mo mata kuu de aru.
Zaisan ga maseba, kore o kuu mono mo masu. Sono mochinushi wa me ni sore o miru dake de, nan no eki ga aru ka.
Hataraku mono wa taberu koto ga sukunakute mo ookute mo, kokoroyoku nemuru. Shikashi akitariru hodo no tomi wa, kare ni nemuru koto o yurusanai.
Watashi wa hi no shita ni kanashimubeki aku no aru no o mita. Sunawachi, tomi wa kore o takuwaeru sono mochinushi ni gai o oyobosu koto de aru.
Mata sono tomi wa fukou na dekigoto ni yotte use iku koto de aru. Sore de, sono hito ga ko o moukete mo, kare no te ni wa nani mo nokoranai.
Kare wa haha no tai kara dete kita you ni, sunawachi hadaka de dete kita you ni kaette iku. Kare wa sono rouku ni yotte eta nanimono o mo sono te ni tazusae iku koto ga dekinai.
Hito wa mattaku sono kita you ni, mata satte ikanakereba naranai. Kore mo mata kanashimubeki aku de aru. Kaze no tame ni rousuru mono ni nan no eki ga aru ka.
Hito wa isshou, kurayami to, kanashimi to, ooku no nayami to, yamai to, ikidoori no naka ni aru.
Miyo, watashi ga mita tokoro no zen katsu bi naru koto wa, kami kara tamawatta mijikai isshou no aida, kui, nomi, katsu hi no shita de rousuru subete no rouku ni yotte, tanoshimi o eru koto de aru. Kore ga sono bun dakara de aru.
Mata kami wa subete no hito ni tomi to takara to, sore o tanoshimu chikara o atae, mata sono bun o torase, sono rouku ni yotte tanoshimi o esaserareru. Kore ga kami no tamamono de aru.
Kono you na hito wa jibun no ikiru hi no koto o ooku omowanai. Kami wa yorokobi o motte kare no kokoro o mitasarerukara de aru.
Watashi wa hi no shita ni hitotsu no aku no aru no o mita. Kore wa hitobito no ue ni omoi.
Sunawachi kami wa tomi to, zaisan to, homare to o hito ni ataete, sono kokoro ni shitau mono o, hitotsu mo kakeru koto no nai you ni sareru. Shikashi kami wa, sono hito ni kore o motsu koto o yurusarenaide, tanin ga kore o motsu you ni naru. Kore wa kuu de aru. Ashiki yamai de aru.
Tatoi hito wa hyakunin no ko o mouke, mata inochi nagaku, sono yowai no hi ga ookute mo, sono kokoro ga koufuku ni manzoku sezu, mata houmurareru koto ga nakereba, watashi wa iu, ryuuzan no ko wa sono hito ni masaru to.
Kore wa munashiku kite, kurayami no naka ni satte iki, sono na wa kurayami ni oowareru.
Mata kore wa hi o mizu, mono o shiranai. Keredo mo kore wa kare yori mo yasuraka de aru.
Tatoi kare wa sen nen ni baisuru hodo ikite mo koufuku o minai. Mina hitotsu tokoro ni iku no de wa nai ka.
Hito no rouku wa mina, sono kuchi no tame de aru. Shikashi sono shokuyoku wa mitasarenai.
Kashikoi mono wa oroka na mono ni nan no masaru tokoro ga aru ka. Mata ikeru mono no mae ni ayumu koto o shiru mazushii mono mo nan no masaru tokoro ga aru ka.
Me ni miru koto wa yokubou no samayoi aruku ni masaru. Kore mo mata kuu de atte, kaze o toraeru you na mono de aru.
Ima aru mono wa, sudeni sono na ga tsukerareta. Soshite hito wa ikanaru mono de aru ka wa shirareta. Sore de hito wa jibun yori mo chikarazuyoi mono to arasou koto wa dekinai.
Kotoba ga ookereba munashii koto mo ooi. Hito ni nan no eki ga aru ka.
Hito wa sono mijikaku, munashii inochi no hi o kage no you ni okuru no ni, nani ga hito no tame ni zen de aru ka o shiru koto ga dekiyou. Dare ga sono mi no nochi ni, hi no shita ni nani ga arude arou ka o hito ni tsugeru koto ga dekiru ka.
Yoki na wa yoki abura ni masari, shinuru hi wa umaruru hi ni masaru.
Kanashimi no ie ni wa iru no wa, enkai no ie ni wa iru no ni masaru. Shi wa subete no hito no owari dakara de aru. Ikite iru mono wa, kore o kokoro ni tomeru.
Kanashimi wa warai ni masaru. Kao ni urei o motsu koto ni yotte, kokoro wa yoku narukara de aru.
Kashikoi mono no kokoro wa kanashimi no ie ni ari, oroka na mono no kokoro wa tanoshimi no ie ni aru.
Kashikoi mono no imashime o kiku no wa, oroka na mono no uta o kiku no ni masaru.
Oroka na mono no warai hakama no shita ni moeru ibara no oto no you de aru. Kore mo mata kuu de aru.
Tashika ni, shi etage wa kashikoi hito o oroka ni shi, mainai wa hito no kokoro o sokonau.
Koto no owari wa sono hajime yori mo yoi. Taeshinobu kokoro wa, ogoritakaburu kokoro ni masaru.
Ki o sekitatete ikaru na. Ikari wa oroka na mono no mune ni yadorukara de aru.
"Mukashi ga ima yori mo yokatta no wa naze ka" to iu na. Anata ga kore o tou no wa chie kara deru no de wa nai.
Chie ni zaisan ga tomonau no wa yoi. Sore wa hi o miru monodomo ni eki ga aru.
Chie ga mi o mamoru no wa, kinsen ga mi o mamoru you de aru. Shikashi, chie wa kore o motsu mono ni seimei o tamotaseru. Kore ga chishiki no sugureta tokoro de aru.
Kami no miwaza o kangae mi yo. Kami no magerareta mono o, dare ga massugu ni suru koto ga dekiru ka.
Junkyou no hi ni wa tanoshime, gyakkyou no hi ni wa kangae yo. Kami wa hito ni shourai dou iu koto ga aru ka o, shirasenai tame ni, kare to kore to o hitoshiku tsukurareta no de aru.
Watashi wa kono munashii jinsei ni oite, moromoro no koto o mita. Soko ni wa gijin ga sono gi ni yotte horobiru koto ga ari, akunin ga sono aku ni yotte nagaiki suru koto ga aru.
Anata wa gi ni sugite wa naranai. Mata kashiko ki ni sugite wa naranai. Anata wa dou shite jibun o horoboshite yokarou ka.
Aku ni sugite wa naranai. Mata oroka de atte wa naranai. Anata wa dou shite, jibun no toki no konai no ni, shinde yokarou ka.
Anata ga kore o toru no wa yoi, mata kare kara te o hiite wa naranai. Kami o kashikomu mono wa, kono subete kara nogarederu no de aru.
Chie ga chisha o tsuyoku suru no wa, juunin no tsukasa ga machi ni oru no ni masaru.
Zen o okonai, tsumi o okasanai tadashii hito wa yo ni inai.
Hito no kataru subete no koto ni kokoro o tomete wa naranai. Kore wa anata ga, jibun no shimobe no anata o norou kotoba o kikanai tame de aru.
Anata mo mata, shibashiba tanin o norotta no o jibun no kokoro ni shitte irukara de aru.
Watashi wa chie o motte kono subete no koto o kokoromite, "Watashi wa chisha to narou" to ittaga, tooku oyobanakatta.
Monogoto no ri wa tooku, mata, hanahada fukai. Dare ga kore o miidasu koto ga dekiyou.
Watashi wa, kokoro o tenjite, mono o shiri, koto o saguri, chie to douri o motomeyou to shi, mata aku no oroka na koto, guchi no kyouki de aru koto o shirou to shita.
Watashi wa, sono kokoro ga, wana to ami no you na onna, sono te ga, kase no you na onna wa, shi yori mo nigai mono de aru koto o miidashita. Kami o yorokobasu mono wa kanojo kara nogareru. Shikashi tsumibito wa kanojo ni toraerareru.
Dendousha wa iu, miyo, sono kazu o shirou to shite, ichiichi kazoete, watashi ga eta mono wa kore de aru.
Watashi wa nao kore o motometakeredo mo, enakatta. Watashi wa sennin no uchi ni hitori no danshi o etakeredo mo, sono subete no uchi ni, hitori no joshi o mo enakatta.
Miyo, watashi ga eta koto wa, tada kore dake de aru. Sunawachi, kami wa hito o tadashii mono ni tsukuraretakeredo mo, hito wa ooku no keiryaku o kangaedashita koto de aru.
Dare ga chisha no you ni nari eyou. Dare ga koto no igi o shiri eyou. Hito no chie wa sono hito no kao o kagayakase, mata sono sobou na kao o kaeru.
Ou no mei o mamore. Sudeni kami o sashite chikatta koto yue, odoroku na.
Koto ga warui toki wa, ou no mae o sare, tamerau na. Kare wa subete sono konomu tokoro o nasukara de aru.
Ou no kotoba wa ketteiteki de aru. Dare ga kare ni "Anata wa nani o suru no ka" to iu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Meirei o mamoru mono wa wazawai ni awanai. Chisha no kokoro wa toki to houhou o wakimaete iru.
Hito no aku ga kare no ue ni omokute mo, subete no waza ni wa toki to houhou ga aru.
Nochi ni okoru koto o shiru mono wa nai. Donna koto ga okoru ka o dare ga kare ni tsuge eyou.
Kaze o todomeru chikara o motsu hito wa nai. Mata shi no hi o tsukasadoru mono wa nai. Tatakai ni wa menjo wa nai. Mata aku wa kore o okonau mono o sukuu koto ga dekinai.
Watashi wa kono subete no koto o mita. Mata hi no shita ni okonawareru moromoro no waza ni kokoro o mochiita. Toki to shite wa kono hito ga, kano hito o osamete, kore ni gai o koumuraseru koto ga aru.
Mata watashi wa akunin no houmurareru no o mita. Karera wa itsu mo seijo ni deiri shi, sore o okonatta sono machi de homerareta. Kore mo mata kuu de aru.
Ashiki waza ni taisuru hanketsu ga sumiyaka ni okonawarenai tame ni, hito no kora no kokoro wa moppara aku o okonau koto ni katamuite iru.
Tsumibito de hyaku do aku o nashite, nao nagaiki suru mono ga arukeredo mo, kami o kashikomi, mimae ni osore o idaku mono ni wa koufuku ga aru koto o, watashi wa shitte iru.
Shikashi akunin ni wa koufuku ga nai. Mata sono inochi wa kage no you de atte nagaku wa tsuzukanai. Kare wa kami no mae ni osore o idakanaikara de aru.
Chi no ue ni kuu na koto ga okonawarete iru. Sunawachi, gijin de atte, akunin ni nozomubeki koto ga, sono mi ni nozomu mono ga aru. Mata, akunin de atte, gijin ni nozomubeki koto ga, sono mi ni nozomu mono ga aru. Watashi wa itta, kore mo mata kuu de aru to.
Soko de, watashi wa kanraku o tataeru. Sore wa hi no shita de wa, hito ni totte, kui, nomi, tanoshimu yori hoka ni yoi koto wa naikara de aru. Kore koso wa hi no shita de, kami ga tamawatta inochi no hi no aida, sono kinrou ni yotte sono mi ni tomonau mono de aru.
Watashi wa kokoro o tsukushite chie o shirou to shi, mata chijou ni okonawareru waza o hiru mo yoru mo nemurazu ni kiwameyou to shita toki,
Watashi wa kami no moromoro no waza o mitaga, hito wa hi no shita ni okonawareru waza o kiwameru koto wa dekinai. Hito wa kore o tazuneyou to roushite mo, kore o kiwameru koto wa dekinai. Mata, tatoi chisha ga atte, kore o shirou to omotte mo, kore o kiwameru koto wa dekinai no de aru.
Watashi wa kono subete no koto ni kokoro o mochiite, kono subete no koto o akiraka ni shiyou to shita. Sunawachi tadashii mono to kashikoi mono, oyobi karera no waza ga, kami no te ni aru koto o akiraka ni shiyou to shita. Aisuru ka nikumu ka wa hito ni wa wakaranai. Karera no mae ni aru subete no koto wa kuu de aru.
Subete no hito ni nozomu tokoro wa, mina douyou de aru. Tadashii mono ni mo tadashiku nai mono ni mo, zenryou na mono ni mo warui mono ni mo, kiyoi mono ni mo kegareta mono ni mo, gisei o sasageru mono ni mo, gisei o sasagenai mono ni mo, sono nozomu tokoro wa douyou de aru. Zenryou na hito mo tsumibito mo kotonaru koto wa nai. Chikai o nasu mono mo, chikai o nasu koto o osoreru mono mo kotonaru koto wa nai.
Subete no hito ni douitsu ni nozomu no wa, hi no shita ni okonawareru subete no koto no uchi no akuji de aru. Mata hito no kokoro wa aku ni michi, sono ikite iru aida wa, kyouki ga sono kokoro no uchi ni ari, sono nochi wa shisha no moto ni iku no de aru.
Subete ikeru mono ni tsuranaru mono ni wa nozomi ga aru. Ikeru inu wa, shi seru shishi ni masarukara de aru.
Ikite iru mono wa shinubeki koto o shitte iru. Shikashi shisha wa nanigoto o mo shiranai, mata, mohaya mukui o ukeru koto mo nai. Sono kioku ni nokoru kotogara sae mo, tsuini wasurerareru.
Sono ai mo, nikushimi mo, netami mo, sudeni kieusete, karera wa mohaya hi no shita ni okonawareru subete no koto ni, eikyuu ni kakawaru koto ga nai.
Anata wa itte, yorokobi o motte anata no pan o tabe, tanoshii kokoro o motte anata no sake o nomu ga yoi. Kami wa sudeni, anata no waza o yomiseraretakara de aru.
Anata no koromo o tsune ni shiroku seyo. Anata no atama ni abura o tayasu na.
Hi no shita de kami kara tamawatta anata no kuu naru inochi no hi no aida, anata wa sono aisuru tsuma to tomo ni tanoshiku kurasu ga yoi. Kore wa anata ga yo ni atte ukeru bun, anata ga hi no shita de rousuru rouku ni yotte eru mono dakara de aru.
Subete anata no te no nashi uru koto wa, chikara o tsukushite nase. Anata no iku yomi ni wa, waza mo, keiryaku mo, chishiki mo, chie mo naikara de aru.
Watashi wa mata hi no shita o mitaga, kanarazu shimo hayai mono ga kyousou ni katsu no de wa naku, tsuyoi mono ga tatakai ni katsu no de mo nai. Mata kashikoi mono ga pan o eru no de mo naku, sa toki mono ga tomi o eru no de mo nai. Mata chishiki aru mono ga megumi o eru no de mo nai. Shikashi toki to sainan wa subete no hito ni nozomu.
Hito wa sono toki o shiranai. Uo ga wazawai no ami ni kakari, tori ga wana ni kakaru you ni, hito no kora mo wazawai no toki ga totsuzen karera ni nozomu toki, sore ni kakaru no de aru.
Mata watashi wa hi no shita ni kono you na chie no rei o mita. Kore wa watashi ni totte ookina koto de aru.
Koko ni hitotsu no chiisai machi ga atte, soko ni sumu hito wa sukunakattaga, ooinaru ou ga semete kite, kore o kakomi, kore ni mukatte ookina untei o tateta.
Shikashi, machi no uchi ni hitori no mazushii chie no aru hito ga ite, sono chie o motte machi o sukutta. Tokoro ga dare hitori, sono mazushii hito o kioku suru mono ga nakatta.
Soko de watashi wa iu, "Chie wa chikara ni masaru. Shikashika no mazushii hito no chie wa karonzerare, sono kotoba wa kikarenakatta".
Shizuka ni kikareru chisha no kotoba wa, oroka na mono no naka no tsukasa taru mono no sakebi ni masaru.
Chie wa tatakai no buki ni masaru. Shikashi, hitori no tsumibito wa ooku no yoki waza o horobosu.
Shinda wa e wa, kouryou o tsukuru mono no abura o kusaku shi, sukoshi no guchi wa chie to homare yori mo omoi.
Chisha no kokoro wa kare o migi ni mukesase, gusha no kokoro wa hidari ni mukesaseru.
Gusha wa michi o iku toki, shiryo ga tarinai, jibun no oroka na koto o subete no hito ni tsugeru.
Tsukasa taru mono ga anata ni mukatte rippuku shite mo, anata no tokoro o hanarete wa naranai. Onjun wa ooinaru toga o yawaragerukara de aru.
Watashi wa hi no shita ni hitotsu no aku no aru no o mita. Sore wa tsukasataru mono kara deru ayamachi ni nite iru.
Sunawachi oroka naru mono ga takai chii ni okare, tomeru mono ga iyashii tokoro ni zashite iru.
Watashi wa shimobe taru mono ga uma ni nori, kun taru mono ga dorei no you ni toho de aruku no o mita.
Ana o horu mono wa mizukara kore ni ochiiri, ishigaki o kowasu mono wa, hebi ni kamareru.
Ishi o kiridasu mono wa sore ga tame ni kizu o uke, ki o waru mono wa sore ga tame ni kiken ni sarasareru.
Tetsu ga nibuku natta toki, hito ga sono ha o migakanakereba, chikara o ooku kore ni mochiineba naranai. Shikashi, chie wa hito o tasukete nashitogesaseru.
Hebi ga moshi jumon o kakerareru mae ni, kamitsukeba, hebitsukai wa eki ga nai.
Chisha no kuchi no kotoba wa megumi ga aru, shikashi gusha no kuchibiru wa sono mi o horobosu.
Gusha no kuchi no kotoba no hajime wa guchi de aru, mata sono kotoba no owari wa warui kyouki de aru.
Gusha wa kotoba o ooku suru, shikashi hito wa dare mo nochi ni okoru koto o shiranai. Dare ga sono mi no nochi ni okoru koto o tsugeru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Gusha no rouku wa sono mi o tsukaresaseru, kare wa machi ni hairu michi o sae shiranai.
Anata no ou wa warabe de atte, sono kimitachi ga asa kara, gochisou o taberu kuni yo, anata wa wazawai da.
Anata no ou wa jishu no ko de atte, sono kimitachi ga you tame de naku, chikara o eru tame ni, tekitou na toki ni gochisou o taberu kuni yo, anata wa saiwai da.
Taida ni yotte yane wa ochi, bushou ni yotte ie wa moru.
Shokuji wa warai no tame ni nasare, sake wa inochi o tanoshimaseru. Kinsen wa subete no koto ni oujiru.
Anata wa kokoro no uchi de mo ou o norotte wa naranai, mata shinshitsu de mo tomeru mono o norotte wa naranai. Sora no tori wa anata no koe o tsutae, tsubasa no aru mono wa koto o tsugerukara de aru.
Anata no pan o mizu no ue ni nageyo, ooku no hi no nochi, anata wa sore o erukara de aru.
Anata wa hitotsu no bun o nanatsu mata youtsu ni wakeyo, anata wa, donna wazawai ga chi ni okoru ka o shiranaikara da.
Kumo ga moshi ame de michirunaraba, chi ni sore o sosogu, mata ki ga moshi minami ka kita ni taorerunaraba, sono ki wa taoreta tokoro ni yokotawaru.
Kaze o keikai suru mono wa tane o makanai, kumo o kansoku suru mono wa karu koto o shinai.
Anata wa, migomotta onna no tai no naka de, dou shite rei ga hone ni wa iru ka o shiranai. Sono you ni anata wa, subete no koto o nasareru kami no waza o shiranai.
Asa no uchi ni tane o make, yuu made te o yasumete wa naranai. Minoru no wa, kore de aru ka, are de aru ka, aruiha futatsu tomo ni yoi no de aru ka, anata wa shiranaikara de aru.
