Sono toki, mihari bi to wa yobawatte itta, "Shu yo, watashi ga hinemosu yagura ni tachi, yomosugara waga miharijo ni tatte iruto,
Miyo, uma ni notte ni retsu ni naranda mono ga koko ni kimasu". Kare wa kotaete itta, "Taoreta, Babiron wa taoreta, sono kamigami no zou wa kotogotoku uchikudakarete chi ni fushita".
Aa, fuminijirareta waga tami, waga uchi ba no ko yo, Isuraeru no kami, bangun no Shu kara watashi ga kiita tokoro no mono o anata gata ni tsugeru.
Doma ni tsuite no takusen. Seiru kara watashi ni yobawaru mono ga aru, "Yomawari yo, ima wa yoru no nandoki desu ka, yomawari yo, ima wa yoru no nandoki desu ka".
Yomawari wa iu, "Asa ga kimasu, yoru mo mata kimasu. Moshi anata gata ga kikou to omounaraba kiki nasai, mata ki nasai".
Arabiya ni tsuite no takusen. Dedan bito no taishou yo, anata gata wa Arabiya no hayashi ni yadoru.
Tema no chi ni sumu tami yo, mizu o tazusaete, kawaita mono o mukae, pan o motte, nige nogareta mono o mukae yo.
Karera wa tsurugi o sake, nuita tsurugi o sake, hatta yumi o sake, mata hageshii tatakai o sakete, nigete kitakara de aru.
Shu wa watashi ni kou iwareta, "Yatoinin no nenki no you ni ichi nen inai ni Kedaru no subete no eiga wa tsuki hateru.
Kedaru no kora no yuushi de, shashu no nokoru mono wa sukunai". Kore wa Isuraeru no kami, Shu ga katarareta no de aru.
Maboroshi no tani ni tsuite no takusen. Anata gata wa naze, mina yane ni nobotta no ka.
Sakebigoe de michite iru mono, sawagashii miyako, yorokobi ni yotte iru machi yo. Anata no uchi no korosareta mono wa tsurugi de korosareta no de wa naku, mata tatakai ni taoreta no de mo nai.
Anata no tsukasatachi wa mina tomo ni nogarete ittaga, yumi o sutete toraerareta. Karera wa tooku nigete ittaga, anata no uchi no mitsukatta mono wa mina toraerareta.
Sore yue, watashi wa itta, "Watashi o kaerimite kureru na, watashi wa itaku nakikanashimu. Waga tami no musume no horobi no tame ni, watashi o nagusameyou to tsutomete wa naranai".
Bangun no kami, Shu wa maboroshi no tani ni sawagito, fuminijirito, konran no hi o kosaserareru. Jouheki wa kuzureochi, sakebigoe wa yama ni kikoeru.
Eramu wa ebira o oi, sensha to kihei to o motte ki tari, Kiru wa tate o arawashita.
Anata no mottomo utsukushii tani wa sensha de michi, kihei wa moromoro no mon ni mukatte tatta.
Yuda o mamoru ooi wa torinozokareta. Sono hi anata wa hayashi no ie no bugu o aogi nozonda.
Mata anata gata wa Dabide no machi no yabure no ooi no o mi, shita no ike no mizu o atsume,
Erusaremu no ie o kazoe, mata sono ie o kowashite jouheki o kizuki,
Hitotsu no chosuichi o futatsu no jouheki no aida ni tsukutte furuike no mizu o hiita. Shikashi anata gata wa kono koto o nasareta mono o aogi nozomazu, kono koto o mukashi kara keikaku sareta mono o kaeriminakatta.
Sono hi, bangun no kami, Shu wa nakikanashimi, atama o kaburo ni shi, aranuno o matou koto o meijiraretaga,
Miyo, anata gata wa yorokobitanoshimi, ushi o hofuri, hitsuji o koroshi, niku o kui, sake o nonde iu, "Wareware wa kui, katsu nomou, myounichi wa shinu no dakara".
Bangun no Shu wa mizukara watashi no mimi ni shimesareta, "Makoto ni, kono fugi wa anata gata ga shinu made, yurusareru koto wa nai" to bangun no kami, Shu wa iwareru.
Bangun no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Saa, ou no ie o tsukasadoru kono shitsuji Sebuna ni itte ii nasai,
'Anata wa koko ni nan no kaka wari ga arimasu ka. Anata wa dare no enko de koko ni jibun no tame ni haka o hotta no desu ka. Anata wa takai tokoro ni haka o hori, iwa o ugatte jibun no tame ni sumika o tsukutta.
Tsuyoi hito yo, miyo, Shu wa anata o hageshiku nage taosareru. Shu wa anata o kataku tsukamae,
Guruguru mawashite, mari no you ni hirobiro shita chi ni nagerareru. Shujin no ie no haji to naru mono yo, anata wa soko de shini, anata no karei na kuruma wa soko ni nokoru.
Watashi wa, anata o sono shoku kara oi, sono chii kara hikiorosu.
Sono hi, watashi wa, waga shimobe Hirukiya no ko Eriakimu o yonde,
Anata no koromo o kise, anata no obi o shimesase, anata no kenryoku o kare no te ni yudaneru. Kare wa Erusaremu no tami to Yuda no ie to no chichi to naru.
Watashi wa mata Dabide no ie no kagi o kare no kata ni oku. Kare ga hirakeba tojiru mono naku, kare ga tojireba hiraku mono wa nai.
Watashi wa kare o katai tokoro ni utta kugi no you ni suru. Soshite kare wa sono chichi no ie no homare no za to nari,
Sono chichi no ie no subete no omosa wa kare no ue ni kakaru. Sunawachi sono ko, sono mago oyobi subete no chiisai utsuwa, hachi kara subete no bin ni itaru made mina, kare no ue ni kakaru' ".
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, "Sono hi, katai tokoro ni utta kugi wa nuke, kirarete ochiru. Sono ue ni kakatte iru ni mo mata torisarareru" to Shu wa katarareta.
Tsuro ni tsuite no takusen. Tarushishi no moromoro no fune yo, nakisakebe, Tsuro wa are sutarete, ie naku, fune tomari suru minato mo naikara da. Kono koto wa Kupuro no chi kara karera ni tsugeshiraserareru.
Umibe ni sumu tami yo, Shidon no shounin yo, modase, anata gata no shisha wa umi o watari, ooinaru mizu no ue ni atta.
Tsuro no shuunyuu wa Shihoru no kokumotsu, Nairu kawa no shuukaku de atta. Tsuro wa moromoro no kunibito no shounin de atta.
Shidon yo, hajiyo, umi wa itta, umi no shiro wa iu, "Watashi wa kurushimazu, mata umanakatta. Watashi wa wakai danshi o yashinawazu, mata shojo o sodatenakatta".
Kono houdou ga Ejiputo ni tassuru toki, karera wa Tsuro ni tsuite no houdou ni yotte, itaku kurushimu.
Tarushishi ni watare, umibe ni sumu tami yo, nakisakebe.
Kore ga sono kigen mo furui machi, jibun no ashi de utsuri, tooku ni made ijuu shita machi, anata gata no yorokobi hokoru machi na no ka.
Tsuro ni mukatte kore o sadameta no wa dare ka. Tsuro wa kanmuri o sazuketa machi, sono shounin wa kimitachi, sono bouekigyousha wa chi no tattoi hitobito de atta.
Bangun no Shu wa subete no eikou no hokori o kegashi, chi no subete no tattoi mono o hazukashimeru tame ni kore o sadamerareta no da.
Tarushishi no musume yo, Nairu kawa no you ni ono ga chi ni afure yo. Mohaya sokubaku suru mono wa nai.
Shu wa sono te o umi no ue ni nobete kuniguni o furui ugokasareta. Shu wa Kanan ni tsuite mikotonori o dashi, sono toride o kowasareta.
Shu wa iwareta, "Shi etagerareta shojo Shidon no musume yo, anata wa mohaya yorokobu koto wa nai. Tatte, Kupuro ni watare, soko de mo anata wa ansoku o eru koto wa nai".
Karudeya bito no kuni o miyo, ASsuriya de wa naku, kono tami ga Tsuro o no no kemono no sumika ni sadameta. Karera wa yagura o tate, moromoro no kyuuden o kowashite aratsuka to shita.
Tarushishi no moromoro no fune yo, nakisakebe, anata gata no tori de wa are sutaretakara.
Sono hi, Tsuro wa hitori no ou no nagaraeru hi to onajiku nanajuu nen no aida wasurerare, nanajuu nen owatte nochi, Tsuro wa yuujo no uta no you ni naru,
"Wasurerareta yuujo yo, koto o totte machi o hemeguri, takumi ni danji, ooku no uta o utatte, hito ni omoidasare yo".
Nanajuu nen owatte nochi, Shu wa Tsuro o kaerimirareru. Tsuro wa futatabi inkou no atai o ete, chi no omote ni aru yo no subete no kuniguni to kan'in o okonai,
Sono shouhin to sono atai to wa Shu ni sasagerareru. Kore wa takuwaerareru koto naku, tsumareru koto naku, sono shouhin wa Shu no mae ni sumu mono no tame ni yutaka na shokumotsu to nari, migoto na ifuku to naru.
Miyo, Shu wa kono chi o munashiku shi, kore o are sutaresase, kore o kutsugaeshite, sono tami o chirasareru.
Soshite, sono tami mo saishi mo hitoshiku, shimobe mo shujin mo hitoshiku, hashi tame mo shufu mo hitoshiku, kau mono mo uru mono mo hitoshiku, kasu mono mo kariru mono mo hitoshiku, saikensha mo saimusha mo hitoshiku, kono koto ni au.
Chi wa mattaku munashiku sare, mattaku kasumerareru. Shu ga kono kotoba o tsugeraretakara de aru.
Chi wa kanashimi, otoroe, yo wa shiore, otoroe, ten mo chi to tomo ni shiore hateru.
Chi wa sono sumu tami no shita ni kegasareta. Kore wa karera ga rippou ni somuki, sadame o okashi, tokoshie no keiyaku o yabuttakara da.
Sore yue, noroi wa chi o nomi tsukushi, soko ni sumu mono wa sono tsumi ni kurushimi, mata chi no tami wa yakarete, wazuka no mono ga nokosareru.
Atarashii budoushu wa kanashimi, budou wa shiore, kokoro no tanoshii mono mo mina nageku.
Tsuzumi no oto wa shizumari, yorokobu mono no sawagi wa yami, koto no ne mo mata shizumatta.
Karera wa mohaya uta o utatte sake o nomazu, kokisake wa kore o nomu mono ni nigaku naru.
Konran seru machi wa yaburare, subete no ie wa tozasarete, hairu koto ga dekinai.
Chimata ni wa sake no fusoku no tame ni sakebu koe ga ari, subete no yorokobi wa kuraku nari, chi no tanoshimi wa oiyarareta.
Machi ni wa are sutareta tokoro nomi nokori, sono mon mo kowasarete yabureta.
Chi no uchi de, moromoro no tami no naka de nokoru mono wa, oribu no ki no utareta nochi no mi no you ni, budou no shuukaku no owatta nochi ni sono tori nokori o atsumeru toki no you ni naru.
Karera wa koe o agete yorokobiutau. Shu no ikou no yue ni, nishi kara yorokobi yobawaru.
Sore yue, higashi de Shu o agame, umizoi no kuniguni de Isuraeru no kami, Shu no na o agameyo.
Wareware wa chi no hate kara,san bi no uta o kiita, "Eikou wa tadashii mono ni aru" to. Shikashi, watashi wa iu, "Watashi wa yaseotoroeru, watashi wa yaseotoroeru, watashi wa wazawai da. Azamuku mono wa azamuki, azamuku mono wa, hanahadashiku azamuku".
Chi ni sumu mono yo, osore to, otoshiana to, wana to wa anata no ue ni aru.
Osore no koe o nogareru mono wa otoshiana ni ochiiri, otoshiana kara deru mono wa wana ni toraerareru. Ten no mado wa hirake, chi no motoi ga furui ugokukara de aru.
Chi wa mattaku kudake, chi wa sake, chi wa hageshiku furui,
Chi wa yoidore no you ni yoromeki, kari koya no you ni yuri ugoku. Sono toga wa sono ue ni omoku, tsuini taorete futatabi okiagaru koto wa nai.
Sono hi, Shu wa ten ni oite, ten no gunzei o basshi, chi no ue de, chi no moromoro no ou o basserareru.
Karera wa shuujin ga tsuchi rou no naka ni atsumerareru you ni atsumerarete, gokuya no naka ni tozasare, ooku no hi o hete nochi, basserareru.
Kou shite bangun no Shu ga Shion no yama oyobi Erusaremu de subeosame, katsu sono chouroutachi no mae ni sono eikou o arawasareru no de, tsuki wa awate, hi wa hajiru.
Shu yo, anata wa waga kami, watashi wa anata o agame, mina o hometataeru. Anata wa saki ni odorokubeki miwaza o okonai, inishie kara sadameta keikaku o shinjitsu o motte okonawaretakara.
Anata wa machi o ishizuka to shi, kengo na machi o aratsuka to sareta. Gaikokujin no yakata wa, mohaya machi de wa naku, tokoshie ni taterareru koto wa nai.
Sore yue, tsuyoi tami wa anata o tattobi, araburu kuniguni no machi wa anata o osoreru.
Anata wa mazushii mono no toride to nari, toboshii mono no nayami no toki no toride to nari, arashi o sakeru sakedokoro to nari, atsusa o sakeru kage to narareta. Araburu mono no oyobosu gai wa, ishigaki o utsu arashi no gotoku,
Kawaita chi no atsusa no you dakara de aru. Anata wa gaikokujin no sawagi o osae, kumo ga kage o motte netsu o todomeru you ni araburu mono no uta o todomerareru.
Bangun no Shu wa kono yama de, subete no tami no tame ni koeta mono o motte shukuen o mouke, hisashiku takuwaeta budoushu o motte shukuen o moukerareru. Sunawachi zui no ooi koeta mono to, yoku sunda nagaku takuwaeta budoushu o motte shukuen o moukerareru.
Mata Shu wa kono yama de, subete no tami no kabutte iru kao ooito, subete no kuni no ootte iru ooi mono to o yaburareru.
Shu wa tokoshie ni shi o horoboshi, Shu naru kami wa subete no kao kara namida o nugui, sono tami no hazukashime o zenchi no ue kara nozokareru. Kore wa Shu no katarareta koto de aru.
Sono hi, hito wa iu, "Miyo, kore wa wareware no kami de aru. Watashitachi wa kare o machinozonda. Kare wa watashitachi o sukuwareru. Kore wa Shu de aru. Watashitachi wa kare o machinozonda. Watashitachi wa sono sukui o yorokobitanoshimou" to.
Shu no te wa kono yama ni todomari, Moabu wa koedame no naka ni fumareru wara no you ni, onore no tokoro de fuminijirareru.
Kare wa sono naka de oyogu mono ga oyogou to shite te o nobasu you ni, sono te o nobasu. Shikashi Shu wa sono takaburi o, sono te no takumi na wazato tomo ni hikuku sareru.
Sono ishigaki no takai joukaku o Shu wa katamuketaoshi, chi ni nageutte, chiri ni kaesareru.
Sono hi Yuda no kuni de, kono uta o utau, "Wareware wa kengo na machi o motsu. Shu wa sukui o sono ishigaki to shi, mata toride to sareru.
Mon o hiraite, shinkou o mamoru tadashii kokumin o ireyo.
Anata wa mattaki heian o motte kokorozashi no kengo na mono o mamorareru. Kare wa anata ni shinrai shite irukara de aru.
Tokoshie ni Shu ni shinrai seyo, Shu naru kami wa tokoshie no iwa dakara de aru.
Shu wa takaki tokoro, sobietatsu machi ni sumu mono o hikioroshi, kore o fusase, kore o chi ni fusasete, chiri ni kaesareru.
Kou shite ashi de fumare, mazushii mono no ashi de fumare, toboshii mono wa sono ue o ayumu".
Tadashii mono no michi wa taira de aru. Anata wa tadashii mono no michi o nameraka ni sareru.
Shu yo, anata ga sabaki o nasaru michi de, wareware wa anata o machinozomu. Wareware no tamashii no shitau mono wa, anata no kinen no na de aru.
Waga tamashii wa yoru anata o shitai, waga uchi naru rei wa, setsu ni anata o motomeru. Anata no sabaki ga chi ni okonawareru toki, yo ni sumu mono wa seigi o manabukara de aru.
Ashiki mono wa megumarete mo, nao seigi o manabazu, tadashii chi ni atte mo fugi o okonai, Shu no ikou o aogu koto o shinai.
Shu yo, anata no mite ga takaku agarukeredo mo, karera wa sore o kaeriminai. Dou ka, anata no, ono ga tami o sukuwareru nesshin o karera ni misasete, ooini hajisase, hi o motte anata no teki o yakihoroboshite kudasai.
Shu yo, anata wa wareware no tame ni heiwa o moukerareru. Anata wa wareware no tame ni wareware no subete no waza o nashitogerareta.
Wareware no kami, Shu yo, anata igai no moromoro no Shu ga wareware o osameta. Shikashi, wareware wa tada, anata no na nomi o agameru.
Shinda mono wa mata ikinai. Bourei wa ikikaeranai. Sore de, anata wa karera o basshite horoboshi, karera no omoide o kotogotoku keshisarareta.
Shu yo, anata wa kono kokumin o mashikuwaerareta. Anata wa kono kokumin o mashikuwaerareta. Anata wa eikou o arawasareta. Anata wa chi no sakai o shihou ni hirogerareta.
Shu yo, karera wa nayami no toki, anata ni motometa. Karera ga anata no kora shime ni atta toki, inori o sasageta.
Shu yo, harameru onna no umu toki ga chikazuite kurushimi, sono itami ni yotte sakebu you ni, wareware wa anata no yue ni, sono you de atta.
Wareware wa, harami, kurushinda. Shikashi wareware no unda mono wa kaze ni suginakatta. Wareware wa sukui o chi ni hodokosu koto mo sezu, mata yo ni sumu mono o horobosu koto mo shinakatta.
Anata no shisha wa iki, karera no nakigara wa okiru. Chiri ni fusu mono yo, samete yorokobi utae. Anata no tsuyu wa hikari no tsuyu de atte, sore o bourei no kuni no ue ni furasarerukara de aru.
Saa, waga tami yo, anata no heya ni hairi, anata no ushiro no to o tojite, ikidoori no sugisaru made, shibaraku kakure yo.
Miyo, Shu wa sono orareru tokoro o dete, chi ni sumu mono no fugi o basserareru. Chi wa sono ue ni nagasareta chi o arawashite, korosareta mono o, mohaya oou koto ga nai.
Sono hi, Shu wa kataku ooinaru tsuyoi tsurugi de nigeru hebi rebiyatan, magarikuneru hebi rebiyatan o basshi, mata umi ni oru ryuu o korosareru.
Sono hi "Uruwashiki budou hatake yo, kono koto o utae.
Shu naru watashi wa kore o mamori, tsune ni mizu o sosogi, yoru mo hiru mo mamotte, sokonau mono no nai you ni suru.
Watashi wa ikidooranai. Ibara, odoro ga watashi to tatakaunara, watashi wa susunde kore o seme, mina morotomo ni yaki tsukusu.
Sore o nozomanainara, watashi no hogo ni tayotte, watashi to yawaragi o nase, watashi to yawaragi o nase".
Nochi ni nareba, Yakobu wa ne o hari, Isuraeru wa me o dashite hanasaki, sono mi o zensekai ni mitasu.
Shu wa karera o utta mono o utareta you ni karera o utareta ka. Aruiha karera o koroshita mono ga korosareta you ni karera wa korosareta ka.
Anata wa karera to arasotte, karera o tsuihou sareta. Shu wa higashikaze no hi ni, sono hageshii kaze o motte karera o utsushi yarareta.
Sore yue, Yakobu no fugi wa kore ni yotte, aganawareru. Kore ni yotte musubu mi wa kare no tsumi o nozoku. Sunawachi kare ga saidan no subete no ishi o kudaketa hakua no you ni shi, Ashira zou to kou no saidan to o futatabi tatenai koto de aru.
Kengo na machi wa arete sabishiku, sutesarareta sumai wa arano no you da. Koushi wa soko ni kusa o kui, soko ni fushite, sono ki no eda o hadaka ni suru.
Sono eda ga kareruto, oritorare, onna ga kite sore o moyasu. Kore wa muchi no tami dakara de aru. Sore yue, karera o tsukurareta Shu wa karera o awaremarenai. Karera o katachitsukurareta Shu wa, karera o megumarenai.
Isuraeru no hitobito yo, sono hi, Shu wa Yufurate kawa kara Ejiputo no kawa ni itaru made kokumotsu no ho o uchiotosareru. Soshite anata gata wa, hitoribitori atsumerareru.
Sono hi ooinaru rappa ga narihibiki, ASsuriya no chi ni aru ushinawareta mono to, Ejiputo no chi ni oiyarareta mono to ga kite, Erusaremu no seizan de Shu o ogamu.
Efuraimu no yoidore no hokoru kanmuri to, sake ni oboreta mono no koeta tani no kashira ni aru shibomi yuku hana no utsukushii kazari wa, wazawai da.
Miyo, Shu wa hitori no chikara aru tsuyoi mono o motte orareru. Kore wa hyou o majieta boufuu no you ni, yaburi, sokonau boufuuu no you ni, oomizu no afure minagiru boufuu no you ni, sore o hageshiku chi ni nageutsu.
Efuraimu no yoidore no hokoru kanmuri wa ashi de fuminijirareru.
Koeta tani no kashira ni aru shibomi yuku hana no utsukushii kazari wa, natsu mae ni jukushita hatsunari no ichijiku no you da. Hito ga kore o miruto, toru ya ina ya, tabete shimau.
Sono hi, bangun no Shu wa sono tami no nokotta mono no tame ni, sakae no kanmuri to nari, uruwashii kanmuri to narareru.
Mata, sabaki no seki ni zasuru mono ni wa sabaki no rei to nari, tatakai o mon made oikaesu mono ni wa chikara to narareru.
Shikashi, korera mo mata sake no yue ni yoromeki, kokisake no yue ni yorokeru. Saishi to yogensha to wa kokisake no yue ni yoromeki, sake no yue ni kokoro midare, kokisake no yue ni yorokeru. Karera wa maboroshi o miru toki ni ayamari, sabaki o okonau toki ni tsumazuku.
Subete no shokutaku wa haita mono de michi, kiyoi tokoro wa nai.
"Kare wa dare ni chishiki o oshieyou to suru no ka. Dare ni otozure o tokiakasou to suru no ka. Chichi o yame, chibusa o hanareta mono ni suru no darou ka.
Sore wa kyoukun ni kyoukun, kyoukun ni kyoukun, kisoku ni kisoku, kisoku ni kisoku. Koko ni mo sukoshi, soko ni mo sukoshi oshieru no da".
Ina, mushiro Shu wa ikoku no kuchibiru to, ikoku no shita to o motte kono tami ni katarareru.
Shu wa saki ni karera ni iwareta, "Kore ga ansoku da, tsukareta mono ni ansoku o atae yo. Kore ga kyuusoku da" to. Shikashi karera wa kikou to wa shinakatta.
Sore yue, Shu no kotoba wa karera ni, kyoukun ni kyoukun, kyoukun ni kyoukun, kisoku ni kisoku, kisoku ni kisoku, koko ni mo sukoshi, soko ni mo sukoshi to naru. Kore wa karera ga itte, ushiro ni taore, yaburare, wana ni kakerare, toraerareru tame de aru.
Sore yue, Erusaremu ni aru kono tami o osameru azakeru hitobito yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Anata gata wa itta, "Wareware wa shi to keiyaku o nashi, yomi to kyoutei o musunda. Minagiri afureru wazawai no sugiru toki ni mo, sore wa wareware ni konai. Wareware wa uso o sakedokoro to nashi, itsuwari o motte mi o kakushitakara de aru".
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa Shion ni hitotsu no ishi o suete motoi to shita. Kore wa kokoromi o heta ishi, kataku sueta tattoi sumi no ishi de aru. 'Shinzuru mono wa awateru koto wa nai'.
Watashi wa kouhei o, hakari nawa to shi, seigi o, sagefuri to suru. Hyou wa itsuwari no sakedokoro o horoboshi, mizu wa kakureba o oshitaosu".
Sono toki anata gata ga shi to tateta keiyaku wa torikesare, yomi to musunda kyoutei wa okonawarenai. Minagiri afureru wazawai no sugiru toki, anata gata wa kore ni yotte uchitaosareru.
Sore ga sugirugoto ni, anatagata o toraeru. Sore wa asanaasana sugi, hiru mo yoru mo sugirukara da. Kono otozure o kiki wakimaeru koto wa, mattaku no osore de aru.
Toko ga mijikakute mi o noberu koto ga dekizu, kakeru yagu ga semakute mi o oou koto ga dekinaikara da.
Shu wa Perajimu yama de tatareta you ni tachiagari, Gibeon no tani de ikidoorareta you ni ikidoorarete, sono okonai o nasareru. Sono okonai wa rui no nai mono de aru. Mata sono waza o nasareru. Sono waza wa kotonatta mono de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa azakette wa naranai. Samo naito, anata gata no nawame wa, kibishiku naru. Watashi wa Shu naru bangun no kami kara zenchi no ue ni nozomu horobi no sengen o kiitakara de aru.
Anata gata wa mimi o katamukete, waga koe o kiku ga yoi. Kokoro shite waga kotoba o kiku ga yoi.
Tane o maku tame ni tagayasu mono wa taezu tagayasudarou ka. Kare wa taezu sono chi o hiraki, maguwa o motte tsuchi o narasudarou ka.
Chi no omote o taira ni shitanaraba, inondo o maki, Kumin o maki, komugi o une ni ue, oomugi o sadameta tokoro ni ue, Superuto mugi o sono sakai ni uenaidarou ka.
Kore wa kare no kami ga tadashiku, kare o michibiki oshierarerukara de aru.
I nondo wa mugikoki ita de kokanai, Kumin wa sono ue ni sharin o korogasanai. Inondo o utsu ni wa bou o mochii, Kumin o utsu ni wa sao o mochiiru.
Hito wa panyou no mugi o utsu toki kudakudarou ka, ina, sore ga kudakeru made itsu made mo utsu koto o shinai. Uma o motte sono ue ni sharin o hikaseru toki, sore o kudaku koto o shinai.
Kore mo mata bangun no Shu kara deru koto de aru. Sono hakarigoto wa odorokubeku, sono chie wa sugurete iru.
Aa, Arieru yo, Arieru yo, Dabide ga ei o kamaeta machi yo, toshi ni toshi o kuwae, matsuri o megurikosa seyo.
Sono toki watashi wa Arieru o nayamasu. Soko ni wa kanashimi to nageki to ga atte, Arieru no you na mono to naru.
Watashi wa anata no mawari ni ei o kamae, yagura o motte anata o kakomi, rui o kizuite anata o semeru.
Sono toki anata wa fukai chi no naka kara monoii, hikui chiri no naka kara kotoba o dasu. Anata no koe wa bourei no koe no you ni chi kara de, anata no kotoba wa chiri no naka kara, saezuru you de aru.
Shikashi anata no ada no mure wa komaka na chiri no you ni nari, araburu mono no mure wa fukisarareru momigara no you ni naru. Mata, niwaka ni, matataku ma ni, kono koto ga aru.
Sunawachi bangun no Shu wa kaminari, jishin, ooinaru sakebi, tsumujikaze, boufuu oyobi yaki tsukusu hi no honoo o motte nozomareru.
Soshite Arieru o semete tatakau kuniguni no mure, sunawachi Arieru to sono shiro o semete tatakai, kore o nayamasu mono wa mina yume no you ni, yoru no maboroshi no you ni naru.
Ueta mono ga taberu koto o yumemite mo, sameruto, sono ue ga ienai you ni, aruiha, kawaita mono ga nomu koto o yumemite mo, sameruto, tsukarete sono kawaki ga tomaranai you ni, Shion no yama o semete tatakau kuniguni no mure mo sono you ni naru.
Anata gata wa chikaku o ushinatte ki ga tooku nare, me ga kurande mekura to nare. Anata gata wa yotte iyo, shikashi sake no yue de wa nai, yoromeke, shikashi kokisake no yue de wa nai.
Shu ga fukai nemuri no rei o anata gata no ue ni sosogi, anata gata no me de aru yogensha o tojikome, anata gata no atama de aru senkensha o oowaretakara de aru.
Sore yue, kono subete no maboroshi wa, anata gata ni wa fuujita shomotsu no kotoba no you ni nari, hitobito wa kore o yomu koto no dekiru mono ni watashite, "Kore o yonde kudasai" to ieba, "Kore wa fuujite arukara yomu koto ga dekinai" to kare wa iu.
Mata sono shomotsu o yomu koto no dekinai mono ni watashite, "Kore o yonde kudasai" to ieba, "Yomu koto wa dekinai" to kare wa iu.
Shu wa iwareta, "Kono tami wa kuchi o motte watashi ni chikazuki, kuchibiru o motte watashi o uyamaukeredo mo, sono kokoro wa watashi kara tooku hanare, karera no watashi o kashikomi osoreru no wa, sora de oboeta hito no imashime ni yoru no de aru.
Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa kono tami ni, futatabi odorokubeki waza o okonau, sore wa fushigi na odorokubeki waza de aru. Karera no uchi no kashikoi hito no chie wa horobi, satoi hito no chishiki wa kakusareru".
Wazawai naru ka na, ono ga hakarigoto o Shu ni fukaku kakusu mono. Karera wa kurai naka de waza o okonai, "Dare ga wareware o miru ka, dare ga wareware no koto o shiru ka" to iu.
Anata gata wa tentou shite kangaete iru. Toukishi wa nendo to onaji mono ni omowarerudarou ka. Tsukurareta mono wa sore o tsukutta mono ni tsuite, "Kare wa watashi o tsukuranakatta" to ii, katachitsukurareta mono wa katachitsukutta mono ni tsuite, "Kare wa chie ga nai" to iu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Shibaraku shite Rebanon wa kawatte koeta hatake to nari, koeta hatake wa hayashi no you ni omowareru toki ga kurude wa nai ka.
Sono hi, mimishii wa shomotsu no kotoba o kiki, me shii no me wa sono kurayami kara, miru koto ga dekiru.
Nyuuwa na mono wa Shu ni yotte arata naru yorokobi o e, hito no naka no mazushii mono wa Isuraeru no seija ni yotte tanoshimi o eru.
Araburu mono wa tae, azakeru mono wa use, aku o okonaouto, ori o ukagau mono wa, kotogotoku tachi horobosarerukara de aru.
Karera wa kotoba ni yotte hito o tsumi ni sadame, machi no mon de isameru mono o wana ni otoshiire, munashii kotoba o kamaete tadashii mono o shirizokeru.
Sore yue, mukashi Aburahamu o aganawareta Shu wa, Yakobu no ie ni tsuite kou iwareru, "Yakobu wa, mohaya hazukashime o ukezu, sono kao wa, mohaya iro o ushinau koto wa nai.
Kare no shison ga, sono naka ni waga te no waza o miru toki, karera wa waga na o sei to shi, Yakobu no seija o sei to shite, Isuraeru no kami o osoreru.
Kokoro no ayamareru mono mo, satori o e, tsubuyaku mono mo oshie o ukeru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Somukeru kora wa wazawai da, karera wa hakarigoto o okonaukeredo mo, watashi ni yotte de wa nai. Karera wa doumei o musubukeredo mo, waga rei ni yotte de wa nai, tsumi ni tsumi o kuwaeru tame da.
Karera wa waga kotoba o motomezu, Ejiputo e kudatte itte, Paro no hogo ni tayori, Ejiputo no kage ni kakureyou to suru.
Sore yue, Paro no hogo wa kaette anata gata no haji to nari, Ejiputo no kage ni kakureru koto wa anata gata no hazukashime to naru.
Tatoi, kare no kimitachi ga Zoan ni ari, kare no shishatachi ga Hanesu ni kite mo,
Karera wa mina onore o ekisuru koto no dekinai tami ni yori, sunawachi tasuke to narazu, eki to narazu, kaette haji to nari, hazukashime to naru tami ni yotte, haji o kakukara de aru".
Negebu no kemono ni tsuite no takusen. Karera wa sono tomi o wakai roba no se ni owase, sono takara o rakuda no se ni owasete, me jishi, o jishi, mamushi oyobi tobi kakeru hebi no deru nayami to kurushimi no kuni o tootte, onore o ekisuru koto no dekinai tami ni iku.
Sono Ejiputo no tasuke wa mueki de atte, munashii. Sore yue, watashi wa kore o "Yasunde iru Rahabu" to yonda.
Ima itte, kore o karera no mae de fuda ni shirushi, shomotsu ni nose, nochinoyo ni tsutaete, tokoshie ni akashi to seyo.
Karera wa somukeru tami, itsuwari o iu kora, Shu no oshie o kikou to shinai kora da.
Karera wa senkensha ni mukatte "Miru na" to ii, yogensha ni mukatte wa "Tadashii koto o wareware ni yogen suru na, mimi ni kiki yoi koto o katare, mayowashigoto o yogen seyo.
Ooji o sari, kouji o hanare, Isuraeru no seija ni tsuite katarikikasu na" to iu.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no seija wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa kono kotoba o anadori, shi etageto, yokoshima to o tanomi, kore ni tayoru ga yue ni,
Kono fugi wa anata gata ni wa tsukidete, kuzureochiyou to suru takai ishigaki no yabure no you de atte, sono toukai wa niwaka ni, matataku ma ni kuru.
Sono yabureru koto wa toukishi no utsuwa o yaburu you ni oshimu koto naku uchikudaki, sono kudake no naka ni wa, ro kara hi o tori, ike kara mizu o kumeru hodo no, hitokakera sae miidasarenai".
Shu naru kami, Isuraeru no seija wa kou iwareta, "Anata gata wa tachikaette, ochitsuite irunaraba sukuware, odayaka ni shite shinrai shite irunaraba chikara o eru". Shikashi, anata gata wa kono koto o konomanakatta.
Kaette, anata gata wa itta, "Ina, wareware wa uma ni notte, tonde ikou" to. Sore yue, anata gata wa tonde kaeru. Mata itta, "Warera wa hayai uma ni norou" to. Sore yue, anatagata o ou mono wa hayai.
Hitori no ikaku ni yotte sennin wa nige, gonin no ikaku ni yotte anata gata wa nigete, sono nokoru mono wa wazuka ni yama no itadaki ni aru hatazao no you ni, oka no ue ni aru hata no you ni naru.
Sore yue, Shu wa matte ite, anata gata ni megumi o hodokosareru. Sore yue, Shu wa tachiagatte, anatagata o awaremareru. Shu wa kouhei no kami de iraserareru. Subete Shu o machinozomu mono wa saiwai de aru.
Shion ni ori, Erusaremu ni sumu tami yo, anata wa mohaya naku koto wa nai. Shu wa anata no yobawaru koe ni oujite, kanarazu anata ni megumi o hodokosareru. Shu ga sore o kikareru toki, tadachini kotaerareru.
Tatoi Shu wa anata gata ni nayami no pan to kurushimi no mizu o ataerarete mo, anata no shi wa futatabi kakureru koto wa naku, anata no me wa anata no shi o miru.
Mata, anata ga migi ni iki, aruiha hidari ni iku toki, sono ushiro de "Kore wa michi da, kore ni ayume" to iu kotoba o mimi ni kiku.
Sono toki, anata gata wa shirogane o ootta kizanda zou to, kogane o hatta ita zou to o kegashi, kore o kitanai mono no you ni makichirashite, kore ni "Sare" to iu.
Shu wa anata ga chi ni ma ku tane ni ame o atae, chi no sanbutsu naru kokumotsu o kudasaru. Sore wa obitadashiku, katsu yutaka de aru. Sono hi anata no kachiku wa hiroi makiba de kusa o tabe,
Chi o tagayasu ushi to, roba wa, Shaberu to, ku made de yoriwakete shio o kuwaeta shiryou o taberu.
Ooinaru gyakusatsu no hi, yagura no taoreru toki, subete no sobietatsu yama to, subete no takai oka ni mizu no nagareru kawa ga aru.
Sarani Shu ga sono tami no kizu o tsutsumi, sono utareta kizu o iyasareru hi ni wa, tsuki no hikari wa hi no hikari no you ni nari, hi no hikari wa nana bai to nari, nanatsu no hi no hikari no you nini naru.
Miyo, Shu no na wa tooi tokoro kara moeru ikari to, tachiagaru koi kemuri o motte kuru. Sono kuchibiru wa ikidoori de michi, sono shita wa yaki tsukusu hi no gotoku,
Sono iki wa afurete kubi ni made tassuru nagare no you de atte, horobi no furui o motte moromoro no kuni o furui, mata madowasu tazuna o moromoro no tami no ago ni tsukeru tame ni kuru.
Anata gata wa, sei naru matsuri o mamoru yoru no you ni uta o utau. Mata fue o narashite Shu no yama ni ki tari, Isuraeru no iwa naru Shu ni mamieru toki no you ni kokoro ni yorokobu.
Shu wa sono igen aru koe o kikase, hageshii ikari to, yaki tsukusu hi no honoo to, gouu to, boufuu to, hyou to o motte sono ude no kudaru koto o shimesareru.
Shu ga sono muchi o motte utareru toki, ASsuriya no hitobito wa Shu no koe ni yotte osoreononoku.
Shu ga kora shime no tsue o karera no ue ni kuwaerareru goto ni tsuzumi o narashi, koto o hiku. Shu wa ude o furikazashite, karera to tatakawareru.
Yakiba wa sudeni moukerareta. Shikamo ou no tame ni fukaku hiroku sonaerare, hi to ooku no takigi ga tsumarete aru. Shu no iki wa kore o iou no nagare no you ni moyasu.
Tasuke o eru tame ni Ejiputo ni kudari, uma ni tayoru mono wa wazawai da. Karera wa sensha ga ooi no de, kore ni shinrai shi, kihei ga hanahada tsuyoi no de, kore ni shinrai suru. Shikashi Isuraeru no seija o aogazu, mata Shu ni hakaru koto o shinai.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu, Shu mo mata kashikoku iraserare, kanarazu wazawai o kudashi, sono kotoba o torikesu koto naku, tatte aku o nasu mono no ie o seme, mata fugi o okonau mono o tasukeru mono o semerareru.
Kano Ejiputo bi to wa hito de atte, kami de wa nai. Sono uma wa niku de atte, rei de wa nai. Shu ga mite o nobasareru toki, tasukeru mono wa tsumazuki, tasukerareru mono mo taorete, mina tomo ni horobiru.
Shu wa watashi ni kou iwareta, "Shishi mata wa wakai shishi ga emono o tsukande, hoe takeru toki, amata no hitsujikai ga yobidasarete, kore ni mukatte mo, sono koe ni yotte odorokazu, sono sakebi ni yotte osorenai you ni, bangun no Shu wa kudatte kite, Shion no yama oyobi sono oka de tatakawareru.
Tori ga hina o mamoru you ni, bangun no Shu wa Erusaremu o mamori, kore o mamotte sukui, kore o oshinde tasukerareru".
Isuraeru no hitobito yo, Shu ni kaere. Anata gata wa, hanahadashiku Shu ni somuita.
Sono hi, anata gata wa jibun no te de tsukutte tsumi o okashita shirogane no guuzou to, kogane no guuzou o meimei nagesuteru.
"ASsuriya bi to wa tsurugi ni yotte taoreru, hito no tsurugi de wa nai. Tsurugi ga karera o horobosu, hito no tsurugi de wa nai. Karera wa tsurugi no mae kara nigesari, sono wakai mono wa dorei no hataraki o shiirareru.
Karera no iwa wa osore ni yotte sugisari, sono kimitachi wa awate, hata o sutete nigesaru". Kore wa Shu no kotoba de aru. Shu no hi wa Shion ni ari, sono ro wa Erusaremu ni aru.
Miyo, hitori no ou ga seigi o motte subeosame, kimitachi wa kouhei o motte tsukasadori,
Onoono kaze o sakeru tokoro, boufuuu o nogareru tokoro no you ni nari, kawaita tokoro ni aru mizu no nagare no you ni, tsukareta chi ni aru ookina iwa no kage no you ni naru.
Kou shite, miru mono no me wa hirakare, kiku mono no mimi wa yoku kiki,
Kimijika na mono no kokoro wa satoru chishiki o e, domori no shita wa tayasuku, azayaka ni kataru koto ga dekiru.
Oroka na mono wa, mohaya tattoi hito to yobareru koto naku, akunin wa mohaya, rippa na hito to iwareru koto wa nai.
Sore wa oroka na mono wa oroka na koto o katari, sono kokoro wa fugi o takurami, yokoshima o okonai, Shu ni tsuite ayamatta koto o katari, ueta mono no nozomi o mitasazu, kawaita mono no nomimono o ubaitorukara de aru.
Akunin no okonai wa warui. Kare wa warui hakarigoto o megurashi, itsuwari no kotoba o motte mazushii mono o otoshiire, toboshii mono ga tadashii koto o katatte mo, nao, kore o otoshiireru.
Shikashi tattoi hito wa tattoi koto o katari, tsune ni tattoi koto o okonau.
Yasunjite iru onnatachi yo, okite, waga koe o kike. Omoiwazurai naki musumetachi yo, waga kotoba ni mimi o katamukeyo.
Omoiwazurai naki onnatachi yo, ichi nen amari no hi o sugite, anata gata wa furueononoku. Budou no shuukaku ga munashiku, mi o toriireru toki ga konaikara da.
Yasunjite iru onnatachi yo, furue osore yo. Omoiwazurai naki onnatachi yo, furueononoke. Koromo o nugi, hadaka ni natte koshi ni aranuno o matoe.
Yoki hatake no tame, minori yutaka na budou no ki no tame ni mune o ute.
Ibara, odoro no haete iru waga tami no chi no tame, yorokobi ni michite iru machi ni aru subete no yorokobi no ie no tame ni mune o ute.
Kyuuden wa suterare, nigiwatta machi wa are sutare, oka to, yagura to wa, tokoshie ni horaana to nari, no no roba no tanoshimu tokoro, hitsuji no mure no makiba to narukara de aru.
Shikashi, tsuini wa rei ga ue kara wareware no ue ni sosogarete, arano wa yoki hatake to nari, yoki hatake wa hayashi no gotoku mirareru you ni naru.
Sono toki, kouhei wa arano ni sumi, seigi wa yoki hatake ni yadoru.
Seigi wa heiwa o shouji, seigi no musubu mi wa tokoshie no heian to shinrai de aru.
Waga tami wa heiwa no ie ni ori, yasuraka na sumika ni ori, shizuka na yasumidokoro ni oru.
Shikashi hayashi wa kotogotoku kiritaosare, machi mo kotogotoku taosareru.
Subete no mizu no hotori ni tane o maki, ushi oyobi roba o jiyuu ni hanachi oku anata gata wa, saiwai de aru.
Wazawai naru ka na, onore mizukara horobosarenai no ni, hito o horoboshi, dare mo azamukanai no ni hito o azamuku mono yo. Anata ga horobosu koto o yameta toki, anata wa horobosare, anata ga azamuku koto o oeta toki, anata wa azamukareru.
Shu yo, wareware o omegumi kudasai, wareware wa anata o machinozomu. Asagoto ni, wareware no ude to nari, nayami no toki ni, sukui to natte kudasai.
Nari todoroku koe ni yotte, moromoro no tami wa nigesari, anata ga tachiagarareruto, moromoro no kuni wa chirasareru.
Aomushi ga mono o atsumeru you ni bundori hin wa atsumerare, inago no tobi tsudou you ni, hitobito wa sono ue ni tobi tsudou.
Shu wa takaku iraserare, takai tokoro ni sumawareru. Shu wa Shion ni kouhei to seigi to o mitasareru.
Mata Shu wa sukui to chie to chishiki o yutaka ni shite, anata no yo o kataku taterareru. Shu o osoreru koto wa sono takara de aru.
Miyo, yuushitachi wa soto ni atte sakebi, heiwa no shisha wa itaku nageku.
Ooji wa are sutarete, tabibito wa tae, keiyaku wa yaburare, shounin wa karonzerare, hito o kaerimiru koto ga nai.
Chi wa nageki otoroe, Rebanon wa hajite kare, Sharon wa arano no you ni nari, Bashan to Karumeru wa sono ha o otosu.
Shu wa iwareru, "Ima watashi wa okiyou, ima tachiagarou, ima mizukara o takaku shiyou.
Anata gata wa, momigara o harami, wara o umu. Anata gata no iki wa hi to natte, anatagata o kui tsukusu.
Moromoro no tami wa yakarete ishibai no you ni nari, ibara ga kirarete hi ni moyasareta you ni naru".
Anata gata tooku ni iru mono yo, watashi ga okonatta koto o kike. Anata gata chikaku ni iru mono yo, waga tainou o shire.
Shion no tsumibito wa osore ni mitasare, ononoki wa kami o osorenai mono o toraeta. "Wareware no uchi, dare ga yaki tsukusu hi no naka ni oru koto ga dekiyou. Wareware no uchi, dare ga tokoshie no moeru hi no naka ni oru koto ga dekiyou".
Tadashiku ayumu mono, shoujiki ni kataru mono, shi etagete eta ri o iyashimeru mono, te o futte, mainai o toranai mono, mimi o fusaide chi o nagasu bouryaku o kikanai mono, me o tojite aku o minai mono,
Kono you na hito wa takai tokoro ni sumi, katai iwa wa sono toride to nari, sono pan wa ataerare, sono mizu wa taeru koto ga nai.
Anata no me wa uruwashiku kazatta ou o mi, tooku hiroi kuni o miru.
Anata no kokoro wa kano osoroshikatta koto o omoidasu. "Kazu o shirabeta mono wa doko ni iru ka. Mitsugi o hakatta mono wa doko ni iru ka. Yagura o kazoeta mono wa doko ni iru ka".
Anata wa mohaya kouman na tami o minai. Kano tami no kotoba wa aimai de, kikitorigataku, sono shita wa domotte, satorigatai.
Sadame no matsuri no machi Shion o miyo. Anata no me wa heiwa na sumai, utsusareru koto no nai makuya Erusaremu o miru. Sono kui wa tokoshie ni nukarezu, sono tsuna wa, hitosuji mo tatareru koto wa nai.
Shu wa igen o motte kashiko ni imashi, wareware no tame ni hiroi kawa to nagare no aru tokoro to nari, sono naka ni wa, kogu fune mo irazu, ookina fune mo sugiru koto wa nai.
Shu wa wareware no sabaki Nushi, Shu wa wareware no tsukasa, Shu wa wareware no ou de atte, wareware o sukuwareru.
Anata no funa zuna wa tokete, hobashira no moto o musubi katameru koto ga dekizu, ho o haru koto mo dekinai. Sono toki ooku no emono to bundori hin wa wakerare, ashi nae made mo emono o toru.
Soko ni sumu mono no uchi ni wa, "Watashi wa byouki da" to iu mono wa naku, soko ni sumu tami wa sono tsumi ga yurusareru.
Moromoro no kuni yo, chikazuite kike. Moromoro no tami yo, mimi o katamukeyo. Chi to sore ni michiru mono, sekai to sore kara deru subete no mono yo, kike.
Shu wa subete no kuni ni mukatte ikari, sono subete no gunzei ni mukatte ikidoori, karera o kotogotoku horoboshi, karera o watashite, hofuraserareta.
Karera wa korosarete nagesuterare, sono shitai no akushuu wa tachinobori, yamayama wa sono chi de tokete nagareru.
Ten no banshou wa otoroe, moromoro no ten wa makimono no you ni makare, sono banshou wa budou no ki kara ha no ochiru you ni, ichijiku no ki kara ha no ochiru you ni ochiru.
Watashi no tsurugi wa ten ni oite ikidoori o motte yotta. Miyo, kore wa Edomu no ue ni kudari, watashi ga horobi ni sadameta tami no ue ni kudatte, kore o sabaku.
Shu no tsurugi wa chi de michi, shibou de koe, kohitsuji to yagi no chi, ohitsuji no jinzou no shibou de koete iru. Shu ga Bozura de gisei no kemono o hofuri, Edomu no chi de ooini korosaretakara de aru.
Yagyuu wa karera to tomo ni hofuri ba ni kudari, koushi wa chikara aru oushi to tomo ni kudaru. Sono kuni wa chi de yoi, sono tsuchi wa shibou de koyasareru.
Shu wa ada o kaesu hi o mochi, Shion no uttae no tame ni mukuirareru toshi o motarerukara de aru.
Edomu no moromoro no kawa wa kawatte jushi to nari, sono tsuchi wa kawatte iou to nari, sono chi wa kawatte moeru jushi to natte,
Yoru mo hiru mo kiezu, sono kemuri wa, tokoshie ni tachinoboru. Kore wa yoyo are sutarete, tokoshie made mo soko o tooru mono wa nai.
Ta ka to, yamaarashi to ga soko o sumika to shi, fukurou to, karasu ga soko ni sumu. Shu wa sono ue ni kouhai o kitaraseru hakari nawa o hari, tattoi hitobito no ue ni konran o okosu sagefuri o sagerareru.
Hitobito wa kore o nazukete "Kuni naki tokoro" to ii, sono kimitachi wa mina usete nakunaru.
Sono toride no ue ni wa, ibara ga hae, sono shiro ni wa, irakusa to, azami to ga hae, yamainu no sumika, dachou no oru tokoro to naru.
No no kemono wa Haiena to deai, kishin wa sono tomo o yobi, yoru no majo mo soko ni orite kite, yasumitokoro o eru.
Fukurou wa soko ni su o tsukutte tamago o umi, sore o kaeshite, sono hina o tsubasa no kage ni atsumeru. Tobi mo mata, onoono sono tsureai to tomo ni, soko ni atsumaru.
Anata gata wa Shu no sho o tsumabiraka ni tazunete, kore o yome. Korera no mono wa hitotsu mo kakeru koto naku, mata hitotsu mo sono tsureai o kaku mono wa nai. Kore wa Shu no kuchi ga kore o meiji, sono rei ga karera o atsumeraretakara de aru.
Shu wa karera no tame ni kuji o hiki, tezukara hakari nawa o motte, kono chi o wakeatae, nagaku karera ni shoyuu sase, yoyo koko ni sumawaserareru.
Arano to, kawaita chi to wa tanoshimi, sabaku wa yorokobite hanasaki, safuran no you ni,
Sakan ni hanasaki, katsu yorokobitanoshimi, katsu utau. Kore ni Rebanon no sakae ga ataerare, Karumeru oyobi Sharon no uruwashisa ga ataerareru. Karera wa Shu no eikou o mi, wareware no kami no uruwashisa o miru.
Anata gata wa yowatta te o tsuyoku shi, yoromeku hiza o sukoyaka ni seyo.
Kokoro ononoku mono ni ie, "Tsuyoku are, osorete wa naranai. Miyo, anata gata no kami wa houfuku o motte nozomi, kami no mukui o motte korareru. Kami wa kite, anatagata o sukuwareru" to.
Sono toki, me shii no me wa hirakare, mimishii no mimi wa akerareru.
Sono toki, ashi nae wa, shika no you ni tobihashiri, oshi no shita wa yorokobiutau. Sore wa arano ni mizu ga waki ide, sabaku ni kawa ga nagarerukara de aru.
Yaketa suna wa ike to nari, kawaita chi wa mizu no minamoto to nari, yamainu no fushita sumika wa, ashi, yoshi no shigeri au tokoro to naru.
Soko ni ooji ga ari, sono michi wa sei naru michi to tonaerareru. Kegareta mono wa kore o toorisugiru koto wa dekinai, oroka naru mono wa soko ni mayoiiru koto wa nai.
Soko ni wa, shishi wa orazu, ueta kemono mo, sono michi ni noboru koto wa naku, sono tokoro de kore ni au koto wa nai. Tada, aganawareta mono nomi, soko o ayumu.
Shu ni aganawareta mono wa kaette kite, sono atama ni, tokoshie no yorokobi o itadaki, utautaitsutsu, Shion ni kuru. Karera wa tanoshimi to yorokobi to o e, kanashimi to nageki to wa nigesaru.
Hizekiya ou no daijuu yon nen ni, ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu ga nobotte kite, Yuda no subete no kengo na machimachi o semetotta.
ASsuriya no ou wa Rakishi kara Rabushake o Erusaremu ni tsukawashi, taigun o hikiite Hizekiya ou no moto e ikaseta. Rabushake wa nuno sarashi no no e iku ooji ni sou, ue no ike no suidou no katawara ni tatta.
Kono toki Hirukiya no ko de aru kunaikyou Eriakimu, shokikan Sebuna oyobi Asafu no ko de aru shikan Yoa ga kare no tokoro ni dete kita.
Rabushake wa karera ni itta, "Hizekiya ni ii nasai, 'Daiou Assuriya no ou wa kou ooserareru, anata ga tanomi to suru mono wa nani ka.
Kuchisaki dake no kotoba ga sensou o suru keiryaku to chikara da to kangaeru no ka. Anata wa ima dare o tayonde, watashi ni somuita no ka.
Miyo, anata wa kano ore kakete iru ashi no tsue Ejiputo o tanomi to shite iruga, sore wa hito ga yorikakaru toki, sono hito no te o sashitoosu. Ejiputo no ou Paro wa subeteyori tanomu mono ni sono you ni suru no da.
Shikashi, anata ga moshi "Wareware wa wareware no kami, Shu o tanomu" to watashi ni iunaraba, Hizekiya ga Yuda to Erusaremu ni tsugete, "Anata gata wa kono saidan no mae de reihai shinakereba naranai" to itte nozoita no wa, sono kami no takaki tokoro to saidan de wa nakatta no ka.
Saa, ima watashi no shukun Assuriya no ou to kake o seyo. Moshi anata no hou ni noru hito ga arunaraba, watashi wa uma nisentou o ataeyou.
Anata wa Ejiputo o tanomi, sensha to kihei o koimotomete iruga, watashi no shukun no kerai no uchi no mottomo chiisai ichi taichou de sae, dou shite gekitai suru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi ga kono kuni o horobosu tame ni nobotte kita no wa, Shu no yurushi nashi deshita koto de arou ka. Shu wa watashi ni, kono kuni e semenobotte, kore o horobose to iwareta no da' ".
Sono toki, Eriakimu, Sebuna oyobi Yoa wa Rabushake ni itta, "Douzo, Aramu go de shimobetachi ni hanashite kudasai. Watashitachi wa sore ga wakarukara desu. Jouheki no ue ni iru tami no kiite iru tokoro de, watashitachi ni Yudaya no kotoba de hanasanaide kudasai".
Shikashi Rabushake wa itta, "Watashi no shukun wa, anata no shukun to anata ni dake de naku, jouheki no ue ni zashite iru hitobito ni mo, kono kotoba o tsugeru tame ni, watashi o tsukawasareta no de wa nai ka. Karera o mo, anata gata to tomo ni jibun no funnyou o kui nomi suru ni itaraseru tame de wa nai ka".
Soshite Rabushake wa tachiagari, Yudaya no kotoba de oogoe ni yobawatte itta, "Daiou, ASsuriya no ou no kotoba o kike.
Ou wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata wa Hizekiya ni azamukarete wa naranai. Kare wa anatagata o sukuidasu koto wa dekinai.
Hizekiya ga, Shu wa kanarazu wareware o sukuidasareru. Kono machi wa ASsuriya no ou no te ni ochiiru koto wa nai, to itte mo, anata gata wa Shu o tanomi to shite wa naranai'.
Anata gata wa Hizekiya no kotoba o kiite wa naranai. ASsuriya no ou wa kou ooserareru, 'Anata gata wa, watashi to wa boku shite, watashi ni koufuku seyo. Sou sureba, anata gata wa meimei jibun no budou no mi o tabe, meimei jibun no ichijiku no mi o tabe, meimei jibun no ido no mizu o nomu koto ga dekiru.
Yagate, watashi ga kite, anatagata o hitotsu no kuni e tsurete iku. Sore wa, anata gata no kuni no you ni kokumotsu to budoushu no ooi chi, pan to budou hatake no ooi chi da.
Hizekiya ga, Shu wa wareware o sukuwareru, to itte, anatagata o madowasu koto no nai you ni ki o tsukeyo. Moromoro no kuni no kamigami no uchi, dono kami ga sono kuni o ASsuriya no ou no te kara sukutta ka.
Hamate ya Arupade no kamigami wa doko ni iru ka. Separuwaimu no kamigami wa doko ni iru ka. Karera wa Samariya o watashi no te kara sukuidashita ka.
Korera no kuniguni no subete no kamigami no uchi ni, dare ka sono kuni o watashi no te kara sukuidashita mono ga aru ka. Shu ga dou shite Erusaremu o watashi no te kara sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou' ".
Shikashi tami wa damatte hitokoto mo kotaenakatta. Ou ga meijite, "Kare ni kotaete wa naranai" to itte oitakara de aru.
Sono toki Hirukiya no ko de aru kunaikyou Eriakimu, shokikan Sebuna oyobi Asafu no ko de aru shikan Yoa wa koromo o saki, Hizekiya no moto ni kite, Rabushake no kotoba o kare ni tsugeta.
Hizekiya ou wa kore o kiite, koromo o saki, aranuno o mi ni matotte Shu no miya ni iri,
Kunaikyou Eriakimu to shokikan Sebuna oyobi saishi no uchi no nenchousha tachi ni aranuno o matowasete, Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya no moto e tsukawashita.
Karera wa Izaya ni itta, "Hizekiya wa kou iimasu, 'Kyou wa nayami to seme to, hazukashime no hi desu. Taiji ga masani umareyou to shite, kore o umidasu chikara ga nai no desu.
Anata no kami, Shu wa, aruiha Rabushake no moromoro no kotoba o kikareta ka mo shiremasen. Kare wa sono shukun Assuriya no ou ni tsukawasarete, ikeru kami o soshirimashita. Anata no kami, Shu wa sono kotoba o kiite, aruiha semerareru ka mo shiremasen. Sore yue, kono nokotte iru mono no tame ni inori o sasagete kudasai' ".
Hizekiya ou no keraitachi ga Izaya no moto ni kita toki,
Izaya wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no shukun ni kou ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, ASsuriya no ou no shimobera ga, watashi o soshitta kotoba o kiite osoreru ni wa oyobanai.
Miyo, watashi wa hitotsu no rei o kare no uchi ni okutte, hitotsu no uwasa o kikase, kare o jibun no kuni e kaerasete, sono kuni de tsurugi ni taoresaseru' ".
Rabushake wa hikikaeshite, ASsuriya no ou ga Ribuna o semete iru tokoro e itta. Kare wa ou ga Rakishi o satta koto o kiitakara de aru.
Kono toki, ASsuriya no ou wa Echiopiya no ou Teruhaka ni tsuite, "Kare wa anata to tatakau tame ni dete kita" to hitobito ga iu no o kiita. Kare wa kono koto o kiite, shisha o Hizekiya ni tsukawasou to shite itta,
"Yuda no ou Hizekiya ni kou ii nasai, 'Anata wa, Erusaremu wa ASsuriya no ou no te ni ochiiru koto wa nai, to iu anata no shinrai suru kami ni azamukarete wa naranai.
Anata wa ASsuriya no outachi ga, kuniguni ni shita koto, karera o mattaku horoboshita koto o kiite iru. Dou shite anata wa sukuwareru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi no senzotachi wa Gozan, Haran, Rezefu oyobi Terasaru ni ita Eden no hitobito o horoboshitaga, sono kuniguni no kamigami wa karera o sukutta ka.
Hamate no ou, Arupade no ou, Separuwaimu no machi no ou, Hena no ou oyobi Iwa no ou wa doko ni iru ka' ".
Hizekiya wa shisha no te kara tegami o uketotte sore o yomi, Shu no miya ni nobotte itte, Shu no mae ni sore o hiroge,
Shu ni inotte itta,
"Kerubimu no ue ni zashite orareru Isuraeru no kami, bangun no Shu yo, chi no subete no kuni no uchi de, tada anata dake ga kami de iraseraremasu. Anata wa ten to chi o tsukuraremashita.
Shu yo, mimi o katamukete kiite kudasai. Shu yo, me o hiraite mite kudasai. Senakeribu ga ikeru kami o soshiru tame ni kakiokutta kotoba o kiite kudasai.
Shu yo, makoto ni ASsuriya no outachi wa, moromoro no tami to sono kuniguni o horoboshi,
Mata sono kamigami o hi ni nageiremashita. Sorera wa kami de wa naku, hito no te no tsukutta mono de, ki ya ishi dakara horobosareta no desu.
Ima wareware no kami, Shu yo, douzo, wareware o kare no te kara sukuidashite kudasai. Sou sureba chi no kuniguni wa mina anata dake ga Shu de iraserareru koto o shiru you ni narudeshou".
Sono toki Amotsu no ko Izaya wa hito o tsukawashite Hizekiya ni itta, "Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, anata wa ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu ni tsuite watashi ni inotta yue,
Shu ga kare ni tsuite katarareta kotoba wa kou de aru, 'Shojo de aru Shion no musume wa anata o anadori, anata o azakeru. Erusaremu no musume wa, anata no ushiro de atama o furu.
Anata wa dare o soshiri, dare o nonoshitta no ka. Anata wa dare ni mukatte koe o age, me o takaku ageta no ka. Isuraeru no seija ni mukatte da.
Anata wa, sono shimobera ni yotte Shu o soshitte itta, "Watashi wa ooku no sensha o hikiite yamayama no itadaki ni nobori, Rebanon no oku e iki, take no takai kouhaku to, mottomo yoi itosugi o kiritaoshi, mata sono hate no kouchi e iki, sono mitsurin ni haitta.
Watashi wa ido o hotte mizu o nonda. Watashi wa ashi no ura de Ejiputo no subete no kawa o fumi karashita".
Anata wa kikanakatta ka, mukashi watashi ga sore o sadameta koto o. Kengo na machimachi o, anata ga kowashite aratsuka to suru koto mo, inishie no hi kara, watashi ga keikaku shite ima sore o kitaraseta no da.
Sono uchi ni sumu tami wa chikara yowaku, ononoki haji o idaite, no no kusa no you ni, aona no you ni nari, sodatazu ni kareru yane no kusa no you ni natta.
Watashi wa, anata no zasuru koto, deiri suru koto, mata, watashi ni mukatte ikari sakenda koto o mo shitte iru.
Anata ga, watashi ni mukatte ikari sakenda koto to, anata no kouman na kotoba to ga watashi no mimi ni haitta yue, watashi wa, anata no hana ni wa o tsuke, anata no kuchi ni kutsuwa o hamete, anata o, moto kita michi e hikimodosu'.
Anata ni ataeru shirushi wa kore de aru. Sunawachi, kotoshi wa ochibo kara haeta mono o tabe, ni nenme ni wa, mata sono ochibo kara haeta mono o tabe, san nenme ni wa tane o maki, kariire, budou hatake o tsukutte sono mi o taberu.
Yuda no ie no, nogarete nokoru mono wa futatabi shita ni ne o hari, ue ni mi o musubu.
Sunawachi nokoru mono wa Erusaremu kara de, nogareru mono wa Shion no yama kara deru. Bangun no Shu no nesshin ga kore o nashitogerareru.
Sore yue, Shu wa ASsuriya no ou ni tsuite, kou ooserareru, 'Kare wa kono machi ni konai. Mata koko ni ya o hanatanai. Mata tate o motte, sono mae ni konai. Mata rui o kizuite, kore o semeru koto wa nai.
Kare wa kita michi kara kaette, kono machi ni, hairu koto wa nai, to Shu wa iu.
Watashi wa jibun no tame, mata, watashi no shimobe Dabide no tame ni machi o mamotte, kore o sukuou' ".
Shu no tsukai ga dete, ASsuriya bito no jin'ei de juu hachi man gosennin o uchikoroshita. Hitobito ga asa hayaku okite miruto, karera wa minashitai to natte ita.
ASsuriya no ou Senakeribu wa tachisari, kaette itte Ninebe ni itaga,
Sono kami Nisuroku no shinden de reihai shite ita toki, sono kora no aderan mereku to Sharezeru ga tsurugi o motte kare o koroshi, tomo ni Ararate no chi e nigete itta. Sore de, sono ko Esaruhadon ga kawatte ou to natta.
Sono koro Hizekiya wa byouki ni natte shinikakatte ita. Amotsu no ko yogensha Izaya wa kare no tokoro ni kite itta, "Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, anata no ie o totonoete oki nasai. Anata wa shinimasu, ikinagaraeru koto wa dekimasen".
Soko de Hizekiya wa kao o kabe ni mukete Shu ni inotte itta,
"Aa Shu yo, negawaku wa, watashi ga shinjitsu to magokoro to o motte, mimae ni ayumi, anata no me ni kanau koto o okonatta no o oboete kudasai". Soshite Hizekiya wa hidoku naita.
Sono toki Shu no kotoba ga Izaya ni nozonde itta,
"Itte, Hizekiya ni ii nasai, 'Anata no chichi Dabide no kami, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, "Watashi wa anata no inori o kiita. Anata no namida o mita. Miyo, watashi wa anata no yowai o juu go nen ma sou.
Watashi wa anata to, kono machi to o ASsuriya no ou no te kara sukui, kono machi o mamorou".
Shu ga yakusoku sareta koto o okonawareru koto ni tsuite wa, anata wa Shu kara kono shirushi o eru.
Miyo, watashi wa Ahazu no hi dokei no ue ni susunda hikage o juu do shirizokaseyou' ". Suruto hidokei no ue ni susunda hikage ga juu do shirizoita.
Tsugi no kotoba wa Yuda no ou Hizekiya ga byouki ni natte, sono byouki ga naotta nochi, kakishirushita mono de aru.
Watashi wa itta, watashi wa waga isshou no massakari ni, saranakereba naranai. Watashi wa yomi no mon ni tozasarete, waga nokori no toshi o ushinawanakereba naranai.
Watashi wa itta, watashi wa ikeru mono no chi de, Shu o miru koto naku, yo ni oru hitobito no uchi ni, futatabi hito o miru koto ga nai.
Waga sumai wa nukisararete hitsujikai no tenmaku no you ni watashi o hanareru. Watashi wa, waga inochi o hataori no you ni maita. Kare wa watashi o hata kara kirihanasu. Anata wa asa kara yuu made no aida ni, watashi o horobosareru.
Watashi wa asa made sakenda. Shu wa shishi no you ni waga hone o kotogotoku kudakareru. Anata wa asa kara yuu made no aida ni, watashi o horobosareru.
Watashi wa, tsubame no you ni, tsuru no you ni naki, hato no you ni umeki, waga me wa ue o mite otoroeru. Shu yo, watashi wa, shi etagerarete imasu. Dou ka, watashi no hoshounin to natte kudasai.
Shikashi, watashi wa nani o iu koto ga dekimashou. Shu wa watashi ni iware, katsu, mizukara sore o nasaretakara de aru. Waga tamashii no kurushimi ni yotte, waga nemuri wa kotogotoku nigesatta.
Shu yo, korera no koto ni yotte hito wa ikiru. Waga rei no inochi mo subete korera no koto ni yoru. Dou ka, watashi o iyashi, watashi o ikashite kudasai.
Miyo, watashi ga ooinaru kurushimi ni atta no wa, waga koufuku no tame de atta. Anata wa waga inochi o hikitomete, horobi no ana o manukaresaserareta. Kore wa, anata ga waga tsumi o kotogotoku, anata no nochi ni suteraretakara de aru.
Yomi wa, anata ni kansha suru koto wa dekinai. Shi wa anata osan bi suru koto wa dekinai. Haka ni kudaru mono wa, anata no makoto o nozomu koto wa dekinai.
Tada ikeru mono, ikeru mono nomi, kyou, watashi ga suru you ni, anata ni kansha suru. Chichi wa anata no makoto o, sono kora ni shiraseru.
Shu wa watashi o sukuwareru. Wareware wa yo ni aru kagiri, Shu no ie de koto ni awasete, uta o utaou.
Izaya wa itta, "Hi ichijiku no hitokatamari o motte kosase, sore o haremono ni tsuke nasai. Sou sureba naorudeshou".
Hizekiya wa mata itta, "Watashi ga Shu no ie ni noboru koto ni tsuite, donna shirushi ga arimashou ka".
Sono koro, Baradan no ko de aru Babiron no ou merodaku baradan wa tegami to okurimono o motasete shisetsu o Hizekiya ni tsukawashita. Kore wa Hizekiya ga byouki de attaga, naotta koto o kiitakara de aru.
Hizekiya wa karera o yorokobimukaete, houmotsu no kura, kingin, kouryou, kichou na abura oyobi bukikura, narabi ni sono souko ni aru subete no mono o karera ni miseta. Ie ni aru mono mo, kuni ni aru mono mo, Hizekiya ga karera ni misenai mono wa hitotsu mo nakatta.
Toki ni yogensha Izaya wa Hizekiya ou no moto ni kite itta, "Ano hitobito wa nani o iimashita ka. Doko kara kita no desu ka". Hizekiya wa itta, "Karera wa tooi kuni kara, sunawachi Babiron kara kita no desu".
Izaya wa itta, "Karera wa, anata no ie de nani o mimashita ka". Hizekiya wa kotaete itta, "Karera wa, watashi no ie ni aru mono o mina mimashita. Souko no uchi ni wa, karera ni misenakatta mono wa hitotsu mo arimasen".
Soko de Izaya wa Hizekiya ni itta, "Bangun no Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Miyo, subete anata no ie ni aru mono oyobi anata no senzotachi ga konnichi made ni tsumi takuwaeta mono ga Babiron ni hakobisarareru hi ga kuru. Nani mo nokoru mono wa nai, to Shu ga iwaremasu.
Mata, anata no mi kara deru anata no kotachi mo tsuresararete, Babiron no ou no kyuuden ni oite kangan to narudeshou".
Hizekiya wa Izaya ni itta, "Anata ga iwareta Shu no kotoba wa kekkou desu". Kare wa "Sukunakutomo jibun ga yo ni aru aida wa taihei to anzen ga arudarou" to omottakara de aru.
Anata gata no kami wa iwareru, "Nagusameyo, waga tami o nagusameyo,
Nengoro ni Erusaremu ni katari, kore ni yobaware, sono fukueki no ki wa owari, sono toga wa sudeni yurusare, sono moromoro no tsumi no tame ni ni bai no keibatsu o Shu no te kara uketa".
Yobawaru mono no koe ga suru, "Arano ni Shu no michi o sonae, sabaku ni, wareware no kami no tame ni, ooji o massugu ni seyo.
Moromoro no tani wa takaku serare, moromoro no yama to oka to wa hikuku serare, taka soko no aru chi wa taira ni nari, kewashii tokoro wa heichi to naru.
Kou shite Shu no eikou ga araware, hito wa mina tomo ni kore o miru. Kore wa Shu no kuchi ga katarareta no de aru".
Koe ga kikoeru, "Yobaware". Watashi wa itta, "Nan to yobawarimashou ka". "Hito wa mina kusa da. Sono uruwashisa wa, subete no no hana no you da.
Shu no iki ga sono ue ni fukeba, kusa wa kare, hana wa shibomu. Tashika ni hito wa kusa da.
Kusa wa kare, hana wa shibomu. Shikashi, wareware no kami no kotoba wa tokoshie ni kawaru koto wa nai".
Yoki otozure o Shion ni tsutaeru mono yo, takai yama ni nobore. Yoki otozure o Erusaremu ni tsutaeru mono yo, tsuyoku koe o ageyo, koe o agete osoreru na. Yuda no moromoro no machi ni ie, "Anata gata no kami o miyo" to.
Miyo, Shu naru kami wa tainou o motte korare, sono ude wa yo o osameru. Miyo, sono mukui wa Shu to tomo ni ari, sono hataraki no mukui wa, sono mimae ni aru.
Shu wa bokusha no you ni sono mure o yashinai, sono kaina ni kohitsuji o idaki, sono futokoro ni irete tazusae yuki, chichi o nomasete iru mono o yasashiku michibikareru.
Dare ga, tanagokoro o motte umi o hakari, yubi o nobashite ten o hakari, chi no chiri o masu ni mori, tenbin o motte, moromoro no yama o hakari, hakari o motte, moromoro no oka o hakatta ka.
Dare ga, Shu no rei o michibiki, sono soudan'yaku to natte Shu o oshieta ka.
Shu wa dare to soudan shite satori o eta ka. Dare ga Shu ni kougi no michi o oshie, chishiki o oshie, satori no michi o shimeshita ka.
Miyo, moromoro no kokumin wa, oke no hito shizuku no you ni, hakari no ue no chiri no you ni omowareru. Miyo, Shu wa shimajima o, hokori no you ni agerareru.
Rebanon wa, takigi ni tarinai, mata sono kemono wa, hansai ni tarinai.
Shu no mimae ni wa, moromoro no kokumin wa naki ni hitoshii. Karera wa Shu ni yotte, naki mono no you ni, munashii mono no you ni omowareru.
Sore de, anata gata wa kami o dare to kurabe, donna zou to hikaku shiyou to suru no ka.
Guuzou wa saikunin ga ite tsukuri, kaji ga, kin o motte, sore o ooi, mata, kore ga tame ni gin no kusari o tsukuru.
Mazushii mono wa, sasagemono to shite kuchiru koto no nai ki o erabi, takumi na saikunin o motomete, ugoku koto no nai zou o tataseru.
Anata gata wa shiranakatta ka. Anata gata wa kikanakatta ka. Hajime kara, anata gata ni tsutaerarenakatta ka. Chi no motoi o oita toki kara, anata gata wa satoranakatta ka.
Shu wa chikyuu no haruka ue ni zashite, chi ni sumu mono o inago no you ni mirareru. Shu wa ten o maku no you ni hiroge, kore o sumubeki tenmaku no you ni hari,
Mata, moromoro no kimi o naki mono to serare, chi no tsukasatachi o, munashiku sareru.
Karera wa, karoujite uerare, karoujite makare, sono miki ga karoujite chi ni ne o oroshita toki, kami ga sono ue o fukareruto, karera wa karete, wara no you ni, tsumujikaze ni maki sarareru.
Seija wa iwareru, "Sore de, anata gata wa, watashi o dare ni kurabe, watashi wa, dare ni hitoshii to iu no ka".
Me o takaku agete, dare ga, korera no mono o souzou shita ka o miyo. Shu wa kazu o shirabete bangun o hikii dashi, onoono o sono na de yobareru. Sono ikioi no ooinaru ni yori, mata sono chikara no tsuyoki ga yue ni, hitotsu mo kakeru koto wa nai.
Yakobu yo, naniyue anata wa, "Waga michi wa Shu ni kakurete iru" to iu ka. Isuraeru yo, naniyue anata wa, "Waga uttae wa waga kami ni kaerimirarenai" to iu ka.
Anata wa shiranakatta ka, anata wa kikanakatta ka. Shu wa tokoshie no kami, chi no hate no souzousha de atte, yowaru koto naku, mata tsukareru koto naku, sono chie wa hakarigatai.
Yowatta mono ni wa chikara o atae, ikioi no nai mono ni wa tsuyosa o mashikuwaerareru.
Nen wakai mono mo yowari, katsu tsukare, sounen no mono mo tsukare hatete taoreru.
Shikashi Shu o machinozomu mono wa arata naru chikara o e, washi no you ni tsubasa o hatte, noboru koto ga dekiru. Hashitte mo tsukareru koto naku, aruite mo yowaru koto wa nai.
Umizoi no kuniguni yo, shizuka ni shite, watashi ni kike. Moromoro no tami yo, chikara o arata ni shi, chikazuite katare. Wareware wa tomo ni sabaki no za ni chikazukou.
Dare ga higashi kara hito o okoshita ka. Kare wa sono yuku tokoro de shouri o motte mukaerare, moromoro no kuni o seifuku shi, moromoro no ou o ashi no shita ni fumitsuke, sono tsurugi o motte karera o chiri no you ni shi, sono yumi o motte fukisarareru, wara no you ni suru.
Kare wa korera no mono o otte sono ashi no mada funda koto no nai michi o, yasuraka ni sugite iku.
Dare ga kono koto o okonatta ka, nashita ka. Dare ga hajime kara yoyo no hitobito o yobidashita ka. Shu naru watashi wa hajime de atte, mata owari to tomo ni ari, watashi ga sore da.
Umizoi no kuniguni wa mite osore, chi no hate wa, ononoki, chikazuite kita.
Karera wa onoono sono tonari o tasuke, sono kyoudaitachi ni iu, "Yuuki o dase yo" to.
Saikunin wa kaji o hagemashi, tsuchi o motte tairaka ni suru mono wa kanashiki o utsu mono ni, handa zuke ni tsuite iu, "Sore wa yoi" to. Mata, kugi o motte sore o kataku shi, ugoku koto no nai you ni suru.
Shikashi, waga shimobe Isuraeru yo, watashi no eranda Yakobu, waga tomo Aburahamu no shison yo,
Watashi wa chi no hate kara, anata o tsurete ki, chi no sumizumi kara, anata o meshite, anata ni itta, "Anata wa, watashi no shimobe, watashi wa, anata o erande sutenakatta" to.
Osorete wa naranai, watashi wa anata to tomo ni iru. Odoroite wa naranai, watashi wa anata no kami de aru. Watashi wa anata o tsuyoku shi, anata o tasuke, waga shouri no migi no te o motte, anata o sasaeru.
Miyo, anata ni mukatte ikaru mono wa mina, hajite, awatefutameki, anata to arasou mono wa horobite mu ni kisuru.
Anata wa, anata to arasou mono o tazunete mo miidasazu, anata to tatakau mono wa mattaku kieuseru.
Anata no kami, Shu naru watashi wa anata no migi no te o totte anata ni iu, "Osorete wa naranai, watashi wa anata o tasukeru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Mushi ni hitoshii Yakobu yo, Isuraeru no hitobito yo, osorete wa naranai. Watashi wa anata o tasukeru. Anata o aganau mono wa Isuraeru no seija de aru.
Miyo, watashi wa anata o surudoi ha no aru atarashii dakok ki to suru. Anata wa yama o utte, kore o konagona ni shi, oka o momigara no you ni suru.
Anata ga aogeba kaze wa kore o maki sari, tsumujikaze ga kore o fukichirasu. Anata wa Shu ni yotte yorokobi Isuraeru no seija ni yotte hokoru.
Mazushii mono to toboshii mono to wa mizu o motomete mo, mizu ga naku, sono shita ga kawaite yakete iru toki, Shu naru watashi wa karera ni kotaeru, Isuraeru no kami naru watashi wa karera o suteru koto ga nai.
Watashi wa hadaka no yama ni kawa o hiraki, tani no naka ni izumi o idashi, arano o ike to nashi, kawaita chi o mizu no minamoto to suru.
Watashi wa arano ni kouhaku, akashiya, Mirutosu oyobi oribu no ki o ue, sabaku ni, ito sugi, suzukake, karamatsu o tomo ni oku.
Hitobito wa kore o mite, Shu no mite ga kore o nashi, Isuraeru no seija ga kore o souzou sareta koto o shiri, katsu, yoku kangaete tomo ni satoru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Anata gata no uttae o dase" to. Yakobu no ou wa iwareru, "Anata gata no shouko o motte koi.
Sore o motte kite, okorubeki koto o wareware ni tsuge yo. Saki no kotodomo no nani de aru ka o tsuge yo. Wareware wa yoku kangaete, sono ketsumatsu o shirou. Aruiha kitarubeki koto o wareware ni kikase yo.
Kono nochi kitarubeki koto o wareware ni tsuge yo. Wareware wa anata gata ga kami de aru koto o shirude arou. Saiwai o kudashi, aruiha wazawai o kudase. Wareware wa odoroite kimo o tsubusude arou.
Miyo, anata gata wa naki mono de aru. Anata gata no waza wa munashii. Anatagata o erabu mono wa nikumubeki mono de aru".
Watashi wa hitori o okoshite kita kara kosase, waga na o yobu mono o higashi kara kosaseru. Kare wa moromoro no tsukasa o fumitsukete shikkui no you ni shi, toukishi ga nendo o fumu you ni suru.
Dare ka, hajime kara kono koto o wareware ni tsugeshiraseta ka. Dare ka, arakajime wareware ni tsugete, "Kare wa tadashii" to iwaseta ka. Hitori mo kono koto o tsugeta mono wa nai. Hitori mo kikaseta mono wa nai. Hitori mo anata gata no kotoba o kiita mono wa nai.
Watashi wa hajimete kore o Shion ni tsugeta. Watashi wa, yoki otozure o tsutaeru mono o Erusaremu ni ataeru.
Shikashi, watashi ga miruto, hitori mo nai. Karera no naka ni wa, watashi ga tazunete mo kotae uru jogensha wa hitori mo nai.
Miyo, karera wa mina hito o madowasu mono de atte, sono waza wa naki mono, sono ita zou wa muna shiki kaze de aru.
Watashi no shiji suru waga shimobe, watashi no yorokobu waga erabihito o miyo. Watashi wa waga rei o kare ni ataeta. Kare wa moromoro no kunibito ni michi o shimesu.
Kare wa sakebu koto naku, koe o ageru koto naku, sono koe o chimata ni kikoesasezu,
Mata kizutsuita ashi o oru koto naku, honogurai toushin o kesu koto naku, shinjitsu o motte michi o shimesu.
Kare wa otoroezu, rakutan sezu, tsuini michi o chi ni kakuritsu suru. Umizoi no kuniguni wa sono oshie o machinozomu.
Ten o souzou shite kore o nobe, chi to sore ni shouzuru mono o hiraki, sono ue no tami ni iki o atae, sono naka o ayumu mono ni rei o ataerareru Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru,
"Shu naru watashi wa seigi o motte anata o meshita. Watashi wa anata no te o tori, anata o mamotta. Watashi wa anata o tami no keiyaku to shi, moromoro no kunibito no hikari to shite atae,
Moujin no me o hiraki, shuujin o chika no gokuya kara dashi, kuraki ni zasuru mono o gokuya kara dasaseru.
Watashi wa Shu de aru, kore ga watashi no na de aru. Watashi wa waga eikou o hoka no mono ni ataenai. Mata, waga homare o kizanda zou ni ataenai.
Miyo, saki ni yogen shita koto wa okotta. Watashi wa atarashii koto o tsugeyou. Sono koto ga mada okoranai mae ni, watashi wa mazu, anata gata ni shiraseyou".
Shu ni mukatte atarashiki uta o utae. Chi no hate kara Shu o hometatae yo. Umi to sono naka ni michiru mono, umizoi no kuniguni to sore ni sumu mono to wa nari doyome.
Arano to sono naka no moromoro no machi to, Kedaru bito no sumu moromoro no murazato wa koe o age yo. Sera no tami wa yorokobi utae. Yama no itadaki kara yobawari sakebe.
Eikou o Shu ni kishi, sono homare o umizoi no kuniguni de kataritsuge yo.
Shu wa yuushi no you ni dete iki, ikusahito no you ni nesshin o okoshi, toki no koe o agete yobawari, sono teki ni mukatte tainou o arawasareru.
Watashi wa hisashiku koe o dasazu, mokushite, onore o osaete ita. Ima watashi wa ko o umou to suru onna no you ni sakebu. Watashi no iki wa kire, katsu aegu.
Watashi wa yama to oka to o arashi, subete no kusa o karashi, moromoro no kawa o shima to shi, moromoro no ike o karasu.
Watashi wa me shii o karera no mada shiranai ooji ni ikase, mada shiranai michi ni michibiki, kuraki o sono mae ni hikari to shi, koutei no aru tokoro o taira ni suru. Watashi wa korera no koto o okonatte karera o sutenai.
Kizanda guuzou ni tanomi, ita guuzou ni mukatte "Anata gata wa, wareware no kami de aru" to iu mono wa shirizokerarete, ooini haji o kaku.
Mimi shi iyo, kike. Me shi iyo, me o sosoide mi yo.
Dare ka, waga shimobe no hoka ni meshi i ga aru ka. Dare ka, waga tsukawasu shisha no you na mimishii ga aru ka. Dare ka, waga kenshinmono no you na me shii ga aru ka. Dare ka, Shu no shimobe no you na me shii ga aru ka.
Kare wa ooku no koto o mite mo mitomezu, mimi o hiraite mo kikanai.
Shu wa onore no gi no tame ni, sono oshie o ooinaru mono to shi, katsu kouei aru mono to suru koto o yorokobareta.
Tokoro ga, kono tami wa kasumerare, ubawarete, mina ana no naka ni toraware, gokuya no naka ni tojikomerareta. Karera wa kasumerarete mo tasukeru mono ga naku, mono o ubawarete mo "Modose" to iu mono mo nai.
Anata gata no uchi, dare ga kono koto ni mimi o katamukerudarou ka, dare ga kokoro o mochiite nochi no tame ni kore o kikudarou ka.
Yakobu o ubawaseta mono wa dare ka. Kasumeru mono ni Isuraeru o watashita mono wa dare ka. Kore wa Shu de wa nai ka. Wareware wa Shu ni mukatte tsumi o okashi, sono michi ni ayumu koto o konomazu, mata sono oshie ni shitagau koto o konomanakatta.
Sore yue, Shu wa hageshii ikari to, mouretsu na tatakai o karera ni nozomaserareta. Sore ga hi no you ni shuui ni moete mo, karera wa satorazu, karera o yaite mo, kokoro ni tomenakatta.
Yakobu yo, anata o souzou sareta Shu wa kou iwareru. Isuraeru yo, anata o tsukurareta Shu wa ima kou iwareru, "Osoreru na, watashi wa anata o aganatta. Watashi wa anata no na o yonda, anata wa watashi no mono da.
Anata ga mizu no naka o sugiru toki, watashi wa anata to tomo ni oru. Kawa no naka o sugiru toki, mizu wa anata no ue ni afureru koto ga nai. Anata ga hi no naka o iku toki, yakareru koto mo naku, honoo mo anata ni moetsuku koto ga nai.
Watashi wa anata no kami, Shu de aru, Isuraeru no seija, anata no sukuinushi de aru. Watashi wa Ejiputo o ataete anata no aganai shiro to shi, Echiopiya to Seba to o anata no kawari to suru.
Anata wa waga me ni tattoku, omonzerareru mono, watashi wa anata o aisuru ga yue ni, anata no kawari ni hito o atae, anata no inochi no kawari ni tami o ataeru.
Osoreru na, watashi wa anata to tomo ni oru. Watashi wa, anata no shison o higashi kara kosase, nishi kara anata o atsumeru.
Watashi wa kita ni mukatte 'Yuruse' to ii, minami ni mukatte 'Tomeru na' to iu. Waga kora o tooku kara kosase, waga musumera o chi no hate kara kosase yo.
Subete waga na o motte tonaerareru mono o kosase yo. Watashi wa karera o waga eikou no tame ni souzou shi, kore o tsukuri, kore o shitateta".
Me ga atte mo meshi i no you na tami, mimi ga atte mo mimishii no you na tami o tsuredase.
Kuniguni wa mina aitsudoi, moromoro no tami wa atsumare. Karera no uchi, dare ga kono koto o tsuge, saki no kotodomo o, wareware ni kikaseru koto ga dekiru ka. Sono shounin o dashite, onore no tadashii koto o shoumei sase, sore o kiite "Kore wa shinjitsu da" to iwase yo.
Shu wa iwareru, "Anata gata wa waga shounin, watashi ga eranda waga shimobe de aru. Sore yue, anata gata wa shitte, watashi o shinji, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru koto ga dekiru. Watashi yori mae ni tsukurareta kami wa naku, watashi yori nochi ni mo nai.
Tada watashi nomi Shu de aru. Watashi no hoka ni sukuu mono wa inai.
Watashi wa saki ni tsuge, katsu sukui, katsu kikaseta. Anata gata no uchi ni wa, hoka no kami wa nakatta. Anata gata wa waga shounin de aru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa kami de aru, ima yori nochi mo watashi wa Shu de aru. Waga te kara sukuidashi uru mono wa nai. Watashi ga okonaeba, dare ga, kore o todomeru koto ga dekiyou".
Anatagata o aganau mono, Isuraeru no seija, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata no tame ni, watashi wa hito o Babiron ni tsukawashi, subete no kannoki o kowashi, Karudeya bito no yorokobi no koe o nageki ni kawaraseru.
Watashi wa Shu, anata gata no seija, Isuraeru no souzousha, anata gata no ou de aru".
Umi no naka ni ooji o mouke, ooinaru mizu no naka ni michi o tsukuri,
Sensha oyobi uma, gunzei oyobi heishi o dete kosase, kore o taoshite okiru koto ga dekinai you ni shi, tae horoboshite, toushin no kieuseru you ni sareru Shu wa kou iwareru,
"Anata gata wa, saki no koto o omoidashite wa naranai, mata, inishie no koto o kangaete wa naranai.
Miyo, watashi wa atarashii koto o nasu. Yagate sore wa okoru, anata gata wa sore o shiranai no ka. Watashi wa arano ni michi o mouke, sabaku ni kawa o nagaresaseru.
No no kemono wa watashi o agame, yamainu oyobi, dachou mo watashi o agameru. Watashi ga arano ni mizu o idashi, sabaku ni kawa o nagaresasete, watashi no eranda tami ni nomaserukara da.
Kono tami wa, waga homare o nobesaseru tame ni watashi ga jibun no tame ni tsukutta mono de aru.
Tokoro ga Yakobu yo, anata wa watashi o yobanakatta. Isuraeru yo, anata wa watashi o utonjita.
Anata wa hansai no hitsuji o watashi ni motte konakatta. Mata gisei o motte watashi o agamenakatta. Watashi wa sonaemono no omoni o anata ni owasenakatta. Mata nyuukou o motte anata o wazurawasanakatta.
Anata wa kane o dashite, watashi no tame ni shoubu o kawazu, gisei no shibou o sonaete, watashi o akasezu, kaette, anata no tsumi no omoni o watashi ni owase, anata no fugi o motte, watashi o wazurawaseta.
Watashi koso, watashi jishin no tame ni anata no toga o kesu mono de aru. Watashi wa, anata no tsumi o kokoro ni tomenai.
Anata wa, jibun no tadashii koto o shoumei suru tame ni jibun no koto o nobete, watashi ni omoidasase yo. Wareware wa tomo ni ronjiyou.
Anata no tooi senzo wa tsumi o okashi, anata no chuuhosha ra wa watashi ni somuita.
Sore yue, watashi wa seijo no kimitachi o kegashi, Yakobu o mattaki horobi ni watashi, Isuraeru o nonoshirashimeta.
Shikashi, waga shimobe Yakobu yo, watashi ga eranda Isuraeru yo, ima kike.
Anata o tsukuri, anata o tainai ni katachitsukuri, anata o tasukeru Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Waga shimobe Yakobu yo, watashi ga eranda Eshurun yo, osoreru na.
Watashi wa, kawaita chi ni mizu o sosogi, hikarabita chi ni nagare o sosogi, waga rei o anata no kora ni sosogi, waga megumi o anata no shison ni ataerukara de aru.
Kou shite, karera wa mizu no naka no kusa no you ni, nagare no hotori no yanagi no you ni, hae sodatsu.
Aru hito wa "Watashi wa Shu no mono de aru" to ii, aru hito wa Yakobu no na o motte jibun o yobi, mata aru hito wa "Shu no mono de aru" to te ni shirushite, Isuraeru no na o motte jibun o yobu' ".
Shu, Isuraeru no ou, Isuraeru o aganau mono, bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa hajime de ari, watashi wa owari de aru. Watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai.
Dare ka watashi ni hitoshii mono ga aru ka. Sono mono wa sore o shimeshi, mata sore o tsuge, waga mae ni iitsurane yo. Dare ga, mukashi kara, kitarubeki koto o kikaseta ka. Sono mono wa yagate narubeki koto o wareware ni tsuge yo.
Osorete wa naranai, mata ononoite wa naranai. Watashi wa kono koto o mukashi kara, anata gata ni kikasenakatta ka, mata tsugenakatta ka. Anata gata wa waga shounin de aru. Watashi no hoka ni kami ga aru ka. Watashi no hoka ni iwa wa nai. Watashi wa sono aru koto o shiranai".
Guuzou o tsukuru mono wa mina munashiku, karera no yorokobu tokoro no mono wa, nan no yaku ni mo tatanai. Sono shinja wa miru koto mo naku, mata shiru koto mo nai. Yue ni karera wa haji o ukeru.
Dare ga kami o tsukuri, mata nan no yaku ni mo tatanai guuzou o ita ka.
Miyo, sono nakama wa mina haji o ukeru. Sono saikunin ra wa ningen ni suginai. Karera ga mina atsumatte tatsu toki, osorete tomo ni hajiru.
Tetsu no saikunin wa kore o tsukuru no ni sumi no hi o motte saiku shi, tsuchi o motte kore o tsukuri, tsuyoi ude o motte kore o kitaeru. Kare ga uereba chikara wa otoroe, mizu o nomanakereba tsukare hateru.
Ki no saikunin wa sen o hiki, enpitsu de egaki, kanna de kezuri, Konpasu de egaki, sore o hito no utsukushii sugata ni shitagatte hito no katachi ni tsukuri, ie no naka ni anchi suru.
Kare wa kouhaku o kiritaoshi, aruiha kashi no ki, aruiha kashiwa no ki o erande, sore o hayashi no ki no naka de tsuyoku sodateru. Aruiha kouhaku o ue, ame ni sore o sodatesaseru.
Kou shite hito wa sono ichibu o totte, takigi to shi, kore o motte mi o atatame, mata kore o moyashite pan o yaki, mata ta no ichibu o kami ni tsukutte ogami, kizanda zou ni tsukutte sono mae ni hirefusu.
Sono nakaba wa hi ni moyashi, sono nakaba de niku o nite tabe, aruiha niku o abutte tabeaki, mata mi o atatamete iu, "Aa, atatamatta, atsuku natta" to.
Soshite sono amari o motte kami o tsukutte guuzou to shi, sono mae ni hirefushite ogami, kore ni inotte, "Anata wa waga kami da, watashi o sukue" to iu.
Korera no hito wa shiru koto ga naku, mata satoru koto ga nai. Sono me wa fusagarete miru koto ga dekizu, sono kokoro wa nibuku natte satoru koto ga dekinai.
Sono kokoro no uchi ni omou koto o sezu, mata chishiki ga naku, satori ga nai tame ni, "Watashi wa sono nakaba o hi ni moyashi, mata sono sumibi no ue de pan o yaki, niku o abutte tabe, sono nokori no ki o motte nikumubeki mono o tsukuru no ka. Ki no hashikure no mae ni hirefusu no ka" to iu mono mo nai.
Kare wa hai o kui, mayotta kokoro ni madowasarete, onore o sukuu koto ga dekizu, mata "Waga migi no te ni itsuwari ga aru de wa nai ka" to iwanai.
Yakobu yo, Isuraeru yo, korera no koto o kokoro ni tomeyo. Anata wa waga shimobe dakara. Watashi wa anata o tsukutta, anata wa waga shimobe da. Isuraeru yo, watashi wa anata o wasurenai.
Watashi wa anata no toga o kumo no you ni fukiharai, anata no tsumi o kiri no you ni keshita. Watashi ni tachikaere, watashi wa anata o aganattakara.
Ten yo, utae, Shu ga kono koto o nasaretakara. Chi no fukaki tokoro yo, yobaware. Moromoro no yama yo, hayashi oyobi sono naka no moromoro no ki yo, koe o hanatte utae. Shu wa Yakobu o aganai, Isuraeru no uchi ni eikou o arawasaretakara.
Anata o aganai, anata o tainai ni tsukurareta Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa Shu de aru. Watashi wa yorozu no mono o tsukuri, tada watashi dake ga ten o nobe, chi o hiraki, - - dare ga watashi to tomo ni ita ka - -
Itsuwaru mono no shirushi o munashiku shi, uranau mono o kuruwase, kashikoi mono o ushiro ni shirizokete, sono chishiki o oroka ni suru.
Watashi wa, waga shimobe no kotoba o togesase, waga tsukai no hakarigoto o narase, Erusaremu ni tsuite wa, 'Kore wa tami no sumu tokoro to naru' to ii, Yuda no moromoro no machi ni tsuite wa, 'Futatabi taterareru, watashi wa sono are ato o okosou' to ii,
Mata fuchi ni tsuite wa, 'Kawake, watashi wa anata no moromoro no kawa o hosu' to ii,
Mata Kurosu ni tsuite wa, 'Kare wa waga bokusha, waga mokuteki o kotogotoku nashitogeru' to ii, Erusaremu ni tsuite wa, 'Futatabi taterareru' to ii, shinden ni tsuite wa, 'Anata no motoi ga suerareru' to iu".
Watashi wa waga jukousha Kurosu no migi no te o totte, moromoro no kuni o sono mae ni shitagawase, moromoro no ou no koshi o toki, tobira o sono mae ni hirakasete, mon o tojisasenai, to iwareru Shu wa sono jukousha Kurosu ni kou iwareru,
"Watashi wa anata no mae ni itte, moromoro no yama o taira ni shi, seidou no tobira o kowashi, tetsu no kannoki o tachikiri,
Anata ni, kurai tokoro ni aru zaihou to, hisoka na tokoro ni kakushita houmotsu to o ataete, watashi wa Shu, anata no na o yonda Isuraeru no kami de aru koto o anata ni shiraseyou.
Waga shimobe Yakobu no tame ni, watashi no eranda Isuraeru no tame ni, watashi wa anata no na o yonda. Anata ga watashi o shiranakute mo, watashi wa anata ni na o ataeta.
Watashi wa Shu de aru. Watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai, hitori mo nai. Anata ga watashi o shiranakute mo, watashi wa anata o tsuyoku suru.
Kore wa hi no deru hou kara, mata nishi no hou kara, hitobito ga watashi no hoka ni kami no nai koto o shiru you ni naru tame de aru. Watashi wa Shu de aru, watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai.
Watashi wa hikari o tsukuri, mata kuraki o souzou shi, han'ei o tsukuri, mata wazawai o souzou suru. Watashi wa Shu de aru, subete korera no koto o nasu mono de aru.
Ten yo, ue yori mizu o sosoge, kumo wa gi o furase yo. Chi wa hirakete sukui o shouji, mata gi o mo, haesase yo. Shu naru watashi wa kore o souzou shita.
Touki ga toukishi to arasou you ni, onore o tsukutta mono to arasou mono wa wazawai da. Nendo wa toukishi ni mukatte 'Anata wa nani o tsukuru ka' to ii, aruiha 'Anata no tsukutta mono ni wa te ga nai' to iudarou ka.
Chichi ni mukatte 'Anata wa, naze ko o moukeru no ka' to ii, aruiha onna ni mukatte 'Anata wa, naze umi no kurushimi o suru no ka' to iu mono wa wazawai da".
Isuraeru no seija, Isuraeru o tsukurareta Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa, waga kora ni tsuite watashi ni toi, mata waga te no waza ni tsuite watashi ni meizuru no ka.
Watashi wa chi o tsukutte, sono ue ni hito o souzou shita. Watashi wa te o motte ten o nobe, sono bangun o shiki shita.
Watashi wa gi o motte Kurosu o okoshita. Watashi wa kare no subete no michi o massugu ni shiyou. Kare wa waga machi o tate, waga hoshuu o atai no tame de naku, mata mukui no tame de mo naku tokihanatsu" to bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Ejiputo no tomi to, Echiopiya no shouhin to, take no takai Seba bito to wa anata ni kite, anata no mono to nari, anata ni shitagai, karera wa kusari ni tsunagarete kite, anata no mae ni hirefushi, anata ni negatte iu, 'Kami wa tada anata to tomo ni imashi, kono hoka ni kami wa naku, hitori mo nai' ".
Isuraeru no kami, sukuinushi yo, makoto ni, anata wa gojibun o kakushite orareru kami de aru.
Guuzou o tsukuru mono wa mina haji o oi, hazukashime o uke, tomo ni, awatefutameite shirizoku.
Shikashi, Isuraeru wa Shu ni sukuwarete, tokoshie no sukui o eru. Anata gata wa yoyo kagirinaku, haji o owazu, hazukashime o ukenai.
Ten o souzou sareta Shu, sunawachi kami de atte mata chi o mo tsukuri nashi, kore o kataku shi, itazura ni kore o souzou sarezu, kore o hito no sumika ni tsukurareta Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa Shu de aru, watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai.
Watashi wa kakureta tokoro, chi no kurai tokoro de katarazu, Yakobu no shison ni 'Watashi o tazuneru no wa muda da' to iwanakatta. Shu naru watashi wa tadashii koto o katari, massugu na koto o tsugeru.
Moromoro no kuni kara nogarete kita mono yo, atsumatte kite, tomo ni chikayore. Mokuzou o ninai, sukuu koto no dekinai kami ni inoru mono wa muchi de aru.
Anata gata no iibun o motte kite nobe yo. Mata tomo ni soudan seyo. Kono koto o dare ga inishie kara shimeshita ka. Dare ga mukashi kara tsugeta ka. Watashi, sunawachi Shu de wa nakatta ka. Watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai. Watashi wa gi naru kami, sukuinushi de atte, watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai.
Chi no hate naru moromoro no hito yo, watashi o aogi nozome, sou sureba sukuwareru. Watashi wa kami de atte, hoka ni kami wa naikara da.
Watashi wa jibun o sashite chikatta, watashi no kuchi kara deta tadashii kotoba wa kaeru koto ga nai, 'Subete no hiza wa waga mae ni kagami, subete no shita wa chikai o tateru'.
Hito wa watashi ni tsuite iu, 'Seigi to chikara to wa Shu ni nomi aru' to. Hitobito wa Shu ni ki tari, Shu ni mukatte ikaru mono wa mina haji o ukeru.
Shikashi Isuraeru no shison wa mina Shu ni yotte kachihokoru koto ga dekiru".
Beru wa fushi, Nebo wa kagami, karera no zou wa kemono to kachiku to no ue ni aru. Anata gata ga mochiaruita mono wa ni to nari, tsukareta kemono no omoni to natta.
Karera wa kagami, karera wa tomo ni fushi, omoni to natta mono o sukuu koto ga dekizu kaette, jibun wa torawarete iku.
"Yakobu no ie yo, Isuraeru no ie no nokotta subete no mono yo, umaredeta toki kara, watashi ni oware, tai o deta toki kara, watashi ni mochihakobareta mono yo, watashi ni kike.
Watashi wa anata gata no toshioiru made kawarazu, hakuhatsu to naru made, anatagata o mochihakobu. Watashi wa tsukutta yue, kanarazu oi, mochihakobi, katsu sukuu.
Anata gata wa, watashi o dare ni tagui, dare to hitoshiku shi, dare ni kurabe, katsu nazoraeyou to suru no ka.
Karera wa fukuro kara kogane o sosogi dashi, hakari o motte, shirogane o hakari, kin zaikunin o yatotte, sore o kami ni tsukurase, kore ni hirefushite ogamu.
Karera wa kore o motagete kata ni nose, motte itte, sono tokoro ni oki, soko ni tataseru. Kore wa sono tokoro kara ugoku koto ga dekinai. Hito ga kore ni yobawatte mo kotaeru koto ga dekinai. Mata kare o sono nayami kara sukuu koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata wa kono koto o oboe, yoku kangae yo. Somukeru mono yo, kono koto o kokoro ni tomeyo,
Inishie yori konokata no koto o oboe yo. Watashi wa kami de aru, watashi no hoka ni kami wa nai. Watashi wa kami de aru, watashi to hitoshii mono wa nai.
Watashi wa owari no koto o hajime kara tsuge, mada nasarenai koto o mukashi kara tsugete iu, 'Watashi no hakarigoto wa kanarazu nari, waga mokuteki o kotogotoku nashitogeru' to.
Watashi wa higashi kara moukin o maneki, tooi kuni kara waga hakarigoto o okonau hito o maneku. Watashi wa kono koto o katatta yue, kanarazu kosaseru. Watashi wa kono koto o hakatta yue, kanarazu okonau.
Kokoro o katakuna ni shite, sukui ni tooi mono yo, watashi ni kike.
Watashi wa waga sukui o chikazukaseru yue, sono kuru koto wa tooku nai. Waga sukui wa osoku nai. Watashi wa sukui o Shion ni atae, waga eikou o Isuraeru ni ataeru".
Shojo naru Babiron no musume yo, kudatte, chiri no naka ni suware. Karudeya bito no musume yo, ouza no nai chi ni suware. Anata wa mohaya, yasashiku, taoyaka na onna to tonaerareru koto wa nai.
Ishiusu o totte kona o hike, kao ooi o torisari, uchi gi o nugi, sune o arawashite kawa o watare.
Anata no hadaka wa araware, anata no haji wa mirareru. Watashi wa ada o mukuite, nanibi to o mo tasukenai.
Wareware o aganau mono wa sono na o bangun no Shu to ii, Isuraeru no seija de aru.
Karudeya bito no musume yo, mokushite suware, mata kurai tokoro ni wa ire. Anata wa mohaya, moromoro no kuni no joou to tonaerareru koto wa nai.
Watashi wa waga tami o ikidoori, waga shigyou o kegashite, kore o anata no te ni watashita. Anata wa kore ni, awaremi o hodokosazu, toshioita mono no ue ni, hanahada omoi kubiki o owaseta.
Anata wa itta, "Watashi wa, tokoshie ni joou to naru" to. Soshite, anata wa korera no koto o kokoro ni tomezu, mata sono owari o omowanakatta.
Tanoshimi ni fukeri, yasuraka ni ori, kokoro no uchi ni "Tada watashi dake de, watashi no hoka ni dare mo naku, watashi wa kafu to naru koto wa nai, mata ko o ushinau koto wa nai" to iu mono yo, ima kono koto o kike.
Korera no futatsu no koto wa tsuitachi no uchi ni, matataku ma ni anata ni nozomu. Sunawachi ko o ushinai, kafu to naru koto wa tatoi anata ga ooku no majutsu o okonai, mahou no ooinaru chikara o motte shite mo kotogotoku anata ni nozomu.
Anata wa jibun no aku ni yori tayonde iu, "Watashi o miru mono wa nai" to. Anata no chie to, anata no chishiki to wa anata o madowashita. Anata wa kokoro no uchi ni itta, "Tada watashi dake de, watashi no hoka ni dare mo nai" to.
Shikashi, wazawai ga, anata ni nozomu, anata wa, sore o aganau koto ga dekinai. Nayami ga, anata o osou, anata wa, sore o tsugunau koto ga dekinai. Horobi ga, niwaka ni anata ni nozomu, anata wa, sore ni tsuite nani mo shiranai.
Anata ga wakai toki kara tsutome itta anata no mahou to, ooku no majutsu to o motte tachimukatte miyo, aruiha seikou suru ka mo shirenai, aruiha teki o osoresaseru ka mo shirenai.
Anata wa ooku no hakarigoto ni yotte umitsukareta. Kano ten o wakatsu mono, hoshi o miru mono, shingetsu ni yotte, anata ni nozomu koto o tsugeru mono o tachiagarasete, anata o sukuwasete mi yo.
Miyo, karera wa wara no you ni natte, hi ni yakihorobosare, jibun no mi o honoo no ikioi kara, sukuidasu koto ga dekinai. Sono hi wa mi o atatameru sumibi de wa nai, mata sono mae ni suwarubeki hi de mo nai.
Anata ga tsutomete okonatta mono to, anata no wakai toki kara anata to urikai shita mono to wa, tsuini kono you ni naru. Karera wa meimei jibun no houkou ni sasurai yuki, hitori mo anata o sukuu mono wa nai.
Yakobu no ie yo, kore o kike. Anata gata wa Isuraeru no na o motte tonaerare, Yuda no koshi kara de, Shu no na ni yotte chikai, Isuraeru no kami o tonaerukeredo mo, shinjitsu o motte sezu, seigi o motte shinai.
Karera wa mizukara sei naru miyako no mono to tonae, Isuraeru no kami ni yori tanomu. Sono na wa bangun no Shu to iu.
"Watashi wa saki ni natta koto o, inishie kara tsugeta. Watashi wa kuchi kara dashite karera ni shiraseta. Watashi wa, niwaka ni kono koto o okonai, soshite natta.
Watashi wa anata ga, katakuna de, sono kubi wa tetsu no suji, sono hitai wa seidou de aru koto o shiru yue ni,
Inishie kara, kano koto o anata ni tsuge, sono naranai saki ni, kore o anata ni kikaseta. Sou de nakereba, anata wa iudarou, 'Waga guuzou ga kore o shita no da, waga kizanda zou to, ita zou ga kore o meijita no da' to.
Anata wa sudeni kiita, subete kore ga natta koto o miyo. Anata gata wa kore o nobetsutaenai no ka. Watashi wa ima kara atarashii koto, anata ga mada shiranai kakureta koto o anata ni kikaseyou.
Korera no koto wa ima souzou sareta no de, inishie kara atta no de wa nai. Kono hi izen ni wa, anata wa kore o kikanakatta. Sou de nakereba, anata wa iudarou, 'Miyo, watashi wa kore o shitte ita' to.
Anata wa kore o kiku koto mo naku, shiru koto mo naku, anata no mimi wa, inishie kara hirakarenakatta. Watashi wa anata ga mattaku fushinjitsu de, umarenagara hangyakusha to tonaerareta koto o shitte itakara de aru.
Waga na no tame ni, watashi wa ikari o osoku suru. Waga homare no tame ni, watashi wa kore o osaete, anata o tachi horobosu koto o shinai.
Miyo, watashi wa anata o netta. Shikashi gin no you nide wa nakute, kurushimi no ro o motte anata o kokoromita.
Watashi wa jibun no tame ni, jibun no tame ni kore o okonau. Dou shite waga na o kegasaseru koto ga dekiyou. Watashi wa waga eikou o hoka no mono ni ataeru koto o shinai.
Yakobu yo, watashi no meshita Isuraeru yo, watashi ni kike. Watashi wa sore da, watashi wa hajime de ari, watashi wa mata owaride aru.
Waga te wa chi no motoi o sue, waga migi no te wa ten o nobeta. Watashi ga yobuto, karera wa morotomo ni tatsu.
Anata gata wa mina atsumatte kike. Karera no uchi, dare ga korera no koto o tsugeta ka. Shu no aiserareru kare wa Shu no mikokoro o Babiron ni okonai, sono ude wa Karudeya bito no ue ni nozomu.
Katatta no wa, tada watashi de atte, watashi wa kare o meshita. Watashi wa kare o kosaseta. Kare wa sono michi ni sakaeru.
Anata gata wa watashi ni chikayotte, kore o kike. Watashi wa hajime kara, hisoka ni kataranakatta. Sore ga natta toki kara, watashi wa soko ni ita no da". Ima Shu naru kami wa, watashi to sono rei to o tsukawasareta.
Anata no a ga nai Nushi, Isuraeru no seija, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa anata no kami, Shu de aru. Watashi wa, anata no rieki no tame ni, anata o oshie, anata o michibiite, sono ikubeki michi ni ikaseru.
Dou ka, anata wa watashi no imashime ni kikishitagau you ni. Sou sureba, anata no heian wa kawa no you ni, anata no gi wa umi no nami no you ni nari,
Anata no sue wa suna no you ni, anata no shison wa sunatsubu no you ni natte, sono na wa waga mae kara tatareru koto naku, horobosareru koto wa nai".
Anata gata wa Babiron kara de, Karudeya kara nogare yo. Yorokobi no koe o motte kore o nobe kikase, chi no hate ni made kataritsutae, "Shu wa sono shimobe Yakobu o aganawareta" to ie.
Shu ga karera o michibiite, sabaku o tooraserareta toki, karera wa, kawaita koto ga nakatta. Shu wa karera no tame ni iwa kara mizu o nagaresase, mata iwa o sakareruto, mizu ga hotobashirideta.
Shu wa iwareta, "Warui mono ni wa heian ga nai" to.
Umizoi no kuniguni yo, watashi ni kike. Tooi tokoro no moromoro no tami yo, mimi o katamukeyo. Shu wa watashi o umaredeta toki kara meshi, haha no tai o deta toki kara waga na o kataritsugerareta.
Shu wa waga kuchi o eiri na tsurugi to nashi, watashi o mite no kage ni kakushi, togisumashita ya to nashite, ebira ni watashi o kakusareta.
Mata, watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa waga shimobe, waga eikou o arawasubeki Isuraeru de aru" to.
Shikashi, watashi wa itta, "Watashi wa itazura ni hataraki, eki naku, munashiku chikara o tsuiyashita. Shikamo nao, makoto ni waga tadashiki wa Shu to tomo ni ari, waga mukui wa waga kami to tomo ni aru" to.
Yakobu o onore ni kaerase, Isuraeru o onore no moto ni atsumeru tame ni, watashi o hara no uchi kara tsukutte sono shimobe to sareta Shu wa iwareru. (watashi wa Shu no mae ni tattobare, waga kami wa waga chikara to narareta)
Shu wa iwareru, "Anata ga waga shimobe to natte, Yakobu no moromoro no buzoku o okoshi, Isuraeru no uchi no nokotta mono o kaeraseru koto wa, itomo karui koto de aru. Watashi wa anata o, moromoro no kunibito no hikari to nashite, waga sukui o chi no hate ni made itaraseyou" to.
Isuraeru no a ga nai Nushi, Isuraeru no seija naru Shu wa, hito ni anadorareru mono, tami ni imikirawareru mono, tsukasatachi no shimobe ni mukatte kou iwareru, "Moromoro no ou wa mite, tachiagari, moromoro no kimi wa tatte, haisuru. Kore wa shinjitsu naru Shu, Isuraeru no seija ga, anata o erabareta yue de aru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa megumi no toki ni, anata ni kotae, sukui no hi ni anata o tasuketa. Watashi wa anata o mamori, anata o ataete tami no keiyaku to shi, kuni o okoshi, are sutareta chi o shigyou to shite tsugaseru.
Watashi wa toraerareta hito ni 'De yo' to ii, kuraki ni oru mono ni 'Araware yo' to iu. Karera wa michisugara taberu koto ga deki, subete no hadaka no yama ni mo bokusou o eru.
Karera wa ueru koto ga naku, kawaku koto mo nai. Mata atsui kaze mo, taiyou mo karera o utsu koto wa nai. Karera o awaremu mono ga karera o michibiki, izumi no hotori ni karera o michibikarerukara da.
Watashi wa, waga moromoro no yama o michi to shi, waga ooji o takaku suru.
Miyo, hitobito wa tooku kara kuru. Miyo, hitobito wa kita kara nishi kara, mata Suene no chi kara kuru".
Ten yo, utae, chi yo, yorokobe. Moromoro no yama yo, koe o hanatte utae. Shu wa sono tami o nagusame, sono kurushimu mono o awaremarerukara da.
Shikashi Shion wa itta, "Shu wa watashi o sute, Shu wa watashi o wasurerareta" to.
"Onna ga sono chi nomi go o wasurete, sono hara no ko o, awaremanai you na koto ga arou ka. Tatoi karera ga wasureru you na koto ga atte mo, watashi wa, anata o wasureru koto wa nai.
Miyo, watashi wa, tanagokoro ni anata o horikizanda. Anata no ishigaki wa tsune ni waga mae ni aru.
Anata o tateru mono wa, anata o kowasu mono o oikoshi, anata o arashita mono wa, anata kara dete iku.
Anata no me o agete mimawase. Karera wa mina atsumatte, anata no moto ni kuru. Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, anata wa karera o mina, kazari to shite mi ni tsuke, hanayome no obi no you ni kore o musubu.
Anata no are, katsu sutareta tokoro, kowasareta chi wa, sumu hito no ooi tame ni semaku nari, anata o, nomi tsukushita mono wa, haruka ni hanaresaru.
Anata ga ko o ushinatta nochi ni umareta kora wa, nao anata no mimi ni iu, 'Kono tokoro wa watashi ni wa sema sugiru, watashi no tame ni sumubeki tokoro o esaseyo' to.
Sono toki anata wa kokoro no uchi ni iu, 'Dare ga watashi no tame ni korera no mono o unda no ka. Watashi wa ko o ushinatte, ko o motanai. Watashi wa toraware, katsu oiyarareta. Dare ga korera no mono o sodateta no ka. Miyo, watashi wa hitori nokosareta. Korera no mono wa doko kara kita no ka' to".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa te o moromoro no kuni ni mukatte age, hata o moromoro no tami ni mukatte tateru. Karera wa sono futokoro ni anata no kora o tazusae, sono kata ni anata no musumetachi o nosete kuru.
Moromoro no ou wa, anata no youfu to nari, sono ouhitachi wa, anata no uba to nari, karera wa sono kao o chi ni tsukete, anata ni hirefushi, anata no ashi no chiri o nameru. Kou shite, anata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru. Watashi o machinozomu mono wa haji o koumuru koto ga nai".
Yuushi ga ubatta emono o dou shite torikaesu koto ga dekiyou ka. Boukun ga kasumeta horyo o dou shite sukuidasu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Shikashi Shu wa kou iwareru, "Yuushi ga kasumeta horyo mo torikaesare, boukun ga ubatta emono mo sukuidasareru. Watashi wa anata to arasou mono to arasoi, anata no kora o sukuukara de aru.
Watashi wa anata o shi etageru mono ni sono niku o kuwase, sono chi o atarashii sake no you ni nomasete yowaseru. Kou shite, subete no hito wa watashi ga Shu de atte, anata no sukuinushi, mata anata no a ga nai Nushi, Yakobu no zennousha de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Watashi ga anata gata no haha o saraseta sono rienjou wa, doko ni aru ka. Watashi wa dono saishu ni anatagata o uriwatashita ka. Miyo, anata gata wa, sono fugi no tame ni urare, anata gata no haha wa, anata gata no toga no tame ni dasareta no da.
Watashi ga kita toki, naze hitori mo inakatta ka. Watashi ga yonda toki, naze hitori mo kotaeru mono ga nakatta ka. Watashi no te ga mijikakute, aganau koto ga dekinai no ka. Watashi wa sukuu chikara o motanai no ka. Miyo, watashi ga, shikaruto umi wa kare, kawa wa arano to nari, sono naka no uo wa mizu ga nai tame ni, kawaki shinde akushuu o hanatsu.
Watashi wa kuroi koromo o ten ni kise, aranuno o motte sono ooi to suru".
Shu naru kami wa oshie o uketa mono no shita o watashi ni ataete, tsukareta mono o kotoba o motte tasukeru koto o shirase, mata asagoto ni samashi, watashi no mimi o samashite, oshie o uketa mono no you ni kikaserareru.
Shu naru kami wa watashi no mimi o hirakareta. Watashi wa, somuku koto o sezu, shirizoku koto o shinakatta.
Watashi o utsu mono ni, watashi no se o makase, watashi no hige o nuku mono ni, watashi no hoo o makase, haji to tsubaki to o sakeru tame ni, kao o kakusanakatta.
Shikashi Shu naru kami wa watashi o tasukerareru. Sore yue, watashi wa hajiru koto ga nakatta. Sore yue, watashi wa kao o hiuchiishi no you ni shita. Watashi wa kesshite hazukashimerarenai koto o shiru.
Watashi o gi to suru mono ga chikaku orareru. Dare ga watashi to arasoudarou ka, wareware wa tomo ni tatou. Watashi no ada wa dare ka, watashi no tokoro e chikaku kosase yo.
Miyo, Shu naru kami wa watashi o tasukerareru. Dare ga watashi o tsumi ni sadamerudarou ka. Miyo, karera wa mina koromo no you ni furubi, shimi no tame ni kui tsukusareru.
Anata gata no uchi Shu o osore, sono shimobe no koe ni kikishitagai, kurai naka o aruite hikari o enakute mo, nao Shu no na o tanomi, onore no kami ni tayoru mono wa dare ka.
Miyo, hi o moyashi, taimatsu o tomosu mono yo, mina sono hi no honoo no naka o ayume, mata sono moyashita, taimatsu no naka o ayume. Anata gata wa, kore o watashi no te kara ukete, kurushimi no uchi ni fushi taoreru.
"Gi o oimotome, Shu o tazunemotomeru mono yo, watashi ni kike. Anata gata no kiridasareta iwa to, anata gata no horidasareta ana to o omoimi yo.
Anata gata no chichi Aburahamu to, anatagata o unda Sara to o omoimi yo. Watashi wa kare o tada hitori de atta toki ni meshi, kare o shukufuku shite, sono shison o mashikuwaeta.
Shu wa Shion o nagusame, mata sono subete areta tokoro o nagusamete, sono arano o Eden no you ni, sono sabaku o Shu no sono no you ni sareru. Kou shite, sono naka ni yorokobi to tanoshimi to ga ari, kansha to uta no koe to ga aru.
Waga tami yo, watashi ni kike, waga kunibito yo, watashi ni mimi o katamukeyo. Rippou wa watashi kara de, waga michi wa moromoro no tami no hikari to naru.
Waga gi wa sumiyaka ni chikazuki, waga sukui wa dete itta. Waga ude wa moromoro no tami o osameru. Umizoi no kuniguni wa watashi o machinozomi, waga ude ni yori tanomu.
Me o agete ten o mi, matashita naru chi o miyo. Ten wa kemuri no you ni kie, chi wa koromo no you ni furubi, sono naka ni sumu mono wa, buyo no you ni shinu. Shikashi, waga sukui wa tokoshie ni nagarae, waga gi wa kujikeru koto ga nai.
Gi o shiru mono yo, kokoro no uchi ni waga rippou o tamotsu mono yo, watashi ni kike. Hito no so shiri o osorete wa naranai, karera no nonoshiri ni odoroite wa naranai.
Karera wa koromo no you ni, shimi ni kuware, hitsuji no ke no you ni mushi ni kuwarerukara da. Shikashi, waga gi wa tokoshie ni nagarae, waga sukui wa yorozuyo ni oyobu".
Shu no kaina yo, same yo, same yo, chikara o ki yo. Samete, inishie no hi, mukashi no yo ni atta you ni nare. Rahabu o kirikoroshi, ryuu o sashitsuranuita no wa, anata de wa nakatta ka.
Umi o kawakashi, ooinaru fuchi no mizu o kawakashi, mata umi no fukaki tokoro o, aganawareta mono no sugiru michi to sareta no wa, anata de wa nakatta ka.
Shu ni aganawareta mono wa, utautaitsutsu, Shion ni kaette kite, sono koube ni, tokoshie no yorokobi o itadaki, karera wa yorokobi to tanoshimi to o e, kanashimi to nageki to wa nigesaru.
"Watashi koso anata o nagusameru mono da. Anata wa nanimono nareba, shinubeki hito o osore, kusa no you ni narubeki hito no ko o osoreru no ka.
Ten o nobe, chi no motoi o suerareta anata no tsukurinushi, Shu o wasurete, naze, shi etageru mono ga horobosou to sonae o suru toki, sono ikidoori no yue ni tsune ni hinemosu osoreru no ka. Shi etageru mono no ikidoori wa doko ni aru ka.
Mi o kagamete iru torawarebito wa, sumiyaka ni tokarete, shinu koto naku, ana ni kudaru koto naku, sono shokumotsu wa tsukiru koto ga nai.
Watashi wa umi o furuwase, sono nami o narido yomekasu anata no kami, Shu de aru. Sono na o bangun no Shu to iu.
Watashi wa waga kotoba o anata no kuchi ni oki, waga te no kage ni anata o kakushita. Kou shite, watashi wa ten o nobe, chi no motoi o sue, Shion ni mukatte, anata wa waga tami de aru to iu".
Erusaremu yo, okiyo, okiyo, tate. Anata wa saki ni Shu no te kara ikidoori no sakazuki o ukete nomi, yoromekasu oosakazuki o, ori made mo nomihoshita.
Sono unda moromoro no ko no naka ni, jibun o michibiku mono naku, sono sodateta moromoro no ko no naka ni, jibun no te o toru mono ga nai.
Korera futatsu no koto ga anata ni nozonda - - dare ga anata to tomo ni nagekudarou ka - - kouhai to metsubou, kikin to tsurugi. Dare ga anata o nagusamerudarou ka.
Anata no kora wa iki taedae ni nari, ami ni kakatta, kamoshika no you ni, subete no chimata no sumi ni yokotawari, Shu no ikidoori to, anata no kami no seme to wa, karera ni michite iru.
Sore yue, kurushimeru mono, sake ni de wa naku yotte iru mono yo, kore o kike.
Anata no Shu, ono ga tami no uttae o bengo sareru anata no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa yoromekasu sakazuki o anata no te kara torinozoki, waga ikidoori no oosakazuki o torinozoita. Anata wa futatabi kore o nomu koto wa nai.
Watashi wa kore o anata o nayamasu mono no te ni oku. Karera wa saki ni anata ni mukatte itta, 'Mi o kagameyo, wareware wa koete ikou' to. Soshite anata wa sono se o chi no you ni shi, chimata no you ni shite, karera no koete iku ni makaseta".
Shion yo, same yo, same yo, chikara o ki yo. Sei naru miyako Erusaremu yo, utsukushii koromo o ki yo. Katsurei o ukenai mono oyobi kegareta mono wa, mohaya anata no tokoro ni, hairu koto ga naikara da.
Torawareta Erusaremu yo, anata no mi kara chiri o furiotose, oki yo. Torawareta Shion no musume yo, anata no kubi no nawa o tokisuteyo.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa, tada de urareta. Kane o dasazu ni aganawareru".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Waga tami wa saki ni Ejiputo e kudatte itte, kashiko ni kiryuu shita. Mata ASsuriya bi to wa yuenaku karera o shi etageta.
Sore yue, ima watashi wa koko ni nani o shiyou ka. Waga tami wa yuenaku torawareta" to Shu wa iwareru. Shu wa iwareru, "Karera o tsukasadoru mono wa wameki, waga na wa tsune ni hinemosu anadorareru.
Sore yue, waga tami wa waga na o shiru ni itaru. Sono hi ni wa karera wa kono kotoba o kataru mono ga watashi de aru koto o shiru. Watashi wa koko ni oru".
Yoki otozure o tsutae, heiwa o tsuge, yoki otozure o tsutae, sukui o tsuge, Shion ni mukatte "Anata no kami wa ou to narareta" to iu mono no ashi wa yama no ue ni atte, nan to uruwashii koto darou.
Kikeyo, anata no mihari bi to wa koe o agete, tomo ni yorokobiutatte iru. Karera wa me to me to aiawasete, Shu ga Shion ni kaerareru no o mirukara da.
Erusaremu no are sutareta tokoro yo, koe o hanatte tomo ni utae. Shu wa sono tami o nagusame, Erusaremu o aganawaretakara da.
Shu wa sono sei naru kaina o, moromoro no kunibito no mae ni arawasareta. Chi no subete no hate wa, wareware no kami no sukui o miru.
Sareyo, sareyo, soko o dete, kegareta mono ni sawaru na. Sono naka o deyo, Shu no utsuwa o ninau mono yo, onore o kiyoku tamote.
Anata gata wa isoide deru ni oyobanai, mata, tonde iku ni mo oyobanai. Shu wa anata gata no mae ni iki, Isuraeru no kami wa anata gata no shingari to nararerukara da.
Miyo, waga shimobe wa sakaeru. Kare wa takamerare, agerare, hijou ni takaku naru.
Ooku no hito ga kare ni odoroita you ni - - kare no kaodachi wa, sokonawarete hito to kotonari, sono sugata wa hito no ko to kotonatte itakara de aru - -
Kare wa ooku no kokumin o odorokasu. Outachi wa kare no yue ni kuchi o tsumugu. Sore wa karera ga mada tsutaerarenakatta koto o mi, mada kikanakatta koto o satorukara da.
Dare ga wareware no kiita koto o shinji eta ka. Shu no ude wa, dare ni arawareta ka.
Kare wa Shu no mae ni wakagi no you ni, kawaita tsuchi kara deru ne no you ni sodatta. Kare ni wa wareware no mirubeki sugata ga naku, igen mo naku, wareware no shitaubeki utsukushisa mo nai.
Kare wa anadorarete hito ni suterare, kanashimi no hito de, yamai o shitte ita. Mata kao o ootte imikirawareru mono no you ni, kare wa anadorareta. Wareware mo kare o tattobanakatta.
Makoto ni kare wa wareware no yamai o oi, wareware no kanashimi o ni natta. Shikaru ni, wareware wa omotta, kare wa utare, kami ni tatakare, kurushimerareta no da to.
Shikashi kare wa wareware no toga no tame ni kizutsukerare, wareware no fugi no tame ni kudakareta no da. Kare wa mizukara kora shime o ukete, wareware ni heian o atae, sono utareta kizu ni yotte, wareware wa iyasareta no da.
Wareware wa mina hitsuji no you ni mayotte, onoono jibun no michi ni mukatte itta. Shu wa wareware subete no mono no fugi o, kare no ue ni okareta.
Kare wa shi etagerare, kurushimeraretakeredo mo, kuchi o hirakanakatta. Hofuriba ni hikarete iku kohitsuji no you ni, mata ke o kiru mono no mae ni damatte iru hitsuji no you ni, kuchi o hirakanakatta.
Kare wa bougyaku na sabaki ni yotte torisarareta. Sono yo no hito no uchi, dare ga omottade arou ka, kare wa waga tami no toga no tame ni utarete, ikeru mono no chi kara tatareta no da to.
Kare wa bougyaku o okonawazu, sono kuchi ni wa itsuwari ga nakattakeredo mo, sono haka wa ashiki mono to tomo ni moukerare, sono tsuka wa aku o nasu mono to tomo ni atta.
Shikamo kare o kudaku koto wa Shu no mimune de ari, Shu wa kare o nayamasareta. Kare ga jibun o, toga no sonaemono to nasu toki, sono shison o miru koto ga deki, sono inochi o nagaku suru koto ga dekiru. Katsu Shu no mimune ga kare no te ni yotte sakaeru.
Kare wa jibun no tamashii no kurushimi ni yori hikari o mite manzoku suru. Gi naru waga shimobe wa sono chishiki ni yotte, ooku no hito o gi to shi, mata karera no fugi o ou.
Sore yue, watashi wa kare ni ooinaru mono to tomo ni mono o wakachi toraseru. Kare wa tsuyoi mono to tomo ni emono o wakachi toru. Kore wa kare ga shi ni itaru made, jibun no tamashii o sosogi dashi, to ga aru mono to tomo ni kazoeraretakara de aru. Shikamo kare wa ooku no hito no tsumi o oi, to ga aru mono no tame ni tori nashi o shita.
"Ko o umanakatta umazume yo, utae. Umi no kurushimi o shinakatta mono yo, koe o hanatte utai yobaware. Otto no nai mono no ko wa, to tsuida mono no ko yori mo ooi" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Anata no tenmaku no basho o hiroku shi, anata no sumai no maku o hari hiroge, oshimu koto naku, anata no tsuna o nagaku shi, anata no kui o kyouko ni seyo.
Anata wa migi ni hidari ni hirogari, anata no shison wa moromoro no kuni o e, are sutareta machimachi o mo juumin de mitasukara da.
Osorete wa naranai. Anata wa hajiru koto ga nai. Awatefutameite wa naranai. Anata wa, hazukashimerareru koto ga nai. Anata wa wakai toki no haji o wasure, kafu de atta toki no hazukashime o, futatabi omoidasu koto ga nai.
Anata o tsukurareta mono wa anata no otto de atte, sono na wa bangun no Shu. Anata o aganawareru mono wa, Isuraeru no seija de atte, zenchi no kami to tonaerareru.
Suterarete kokoro kanashimu tsuma, mata wakai toki ni totsuide dasareta tsuma o maneku you ni Shu wa anata o manekareta" to anata no kami wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa shibashiba anata o sutetakeredo mo, ooinaru awaremi o motte anata o atsumeru.
Afureru ikidoori o motte, shibashi waga kao o kakushitakeredo mo, tokoshie no itsukushimi o motte, anata o awaremu" to anata o aganawareru Shu wa iwareru.
"Kono koto wa watashi ni wa Noa no toki no you da. Watashi wa Noa no kouzui o, futatabi chi ni afuresasenai to chikattaga, sono you ni, watashi wa futatabi anata o ikaranai, futatabi anata o semenai to chikatta.
Yama wa utsuri, oka wa ugoite mo, waga itsukushimi wa anata kara utsuru koto naku, heian o ataeru waga keiyaku wa ugoku koto ga nai" to anata o awaremareru Shu wa iwareru.
"Kurushimi o uke, arashi ni moteasobare, nagusame o enai mono yo, miyo, watashi wa Anchimonii de anata no ishi o sue, Safaiya de anata no motoi o oki,
Menou de anata no sentou o tsukuri, kougyoku de anata no mon o tsukuri, anata no jouheki o kotogotoku houseki de tsukuru.
Anata no kora wa mina Shu ni oshie o uke, anata no kora wa ooini sakaeru.
Anata wa gi o motte kataku tachi, shi etagekara toozakatte osoreru koto wa nai. Mata kyoufu kara toozakaru, sore wa anata ni chikazuku koto ga naikara de aru.
Tatoi arasoi o okosu mono ga atte mo watashi ni yoru no de wa nai. Subete anata to arasou mono wa, anata no yue ni taoreru.
Miyo, sumibi o fuki okoshite, sono mokuteki ni kanau buki o tsukuridasu kaji wa, watashi ga souzou shita mono, mata arashi horobosu mono mo, watashi ga souzou shita mono de aru.
Subete anata o semeru tame ni tsukurareru buki wa, sono mokuteki o tasshinai. Subete anata ni sakarai tatte, arasoi uttaeru shita wa, anata ni toki yaburareru. Kore ga Shu no shimobera no ukeru shigyou de ari, mata karera ga watashi kara ukeru gi de aru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Saa, kawaite iru mono wa mina mizu ni kitare. Kane no nai mono mo kitare. Kite kaimotomete tabe yo. Anata gata wa kite, kane o dasazu ni, tada de budoushu to chichi to o kaimotomeyo.
Naze, anata gata wa, ka te ni mo naranu mono no tame ni kane o tsuiyashi, akiru koto mo dekinu mono no tame ni rousuru no ka. Watashi ni yoku kikishitagae. Sou sureba, yoi mono o taberu koto ga deki, mottomo yutaka na shokumotsu de, jibun o tanoshimaseru koto ga dekiru.
Mimi o katamuke, watashi ni kite kike. Sou sureba, anata gata wa ikiru koto ga dekiru. Watashi wa, anata gata to, tokoshie no keiyaku o tatete, Dabide ni yakusoku shita kawaranai tashika na megumi o ataeru.
Miyo, watashi wa kare o tatete, moromoro no tami e no shounin to shi, mata, moromoro no tami no kimi to shi, meirei suru mono to shita.
Miyo, anata wa shiranai kunitami o maneku, anata o shiranai kunitami wa anata no moto ni hashitte kuru. Kore wa anata no kami, Shu, Isuraeru no seija no yue de ari, Shu ga anata ni kouei o ataeraretakara de aru.
Anata gata wa Shu ni oai suru koto no dekiru uchi ni, Shu o tazune yo. Chikaku orareru uchi ni yobimotomeyo.
Ashiki mono wa sono michi o sute, tadashikara nu hito wa sono omoi o sutete, Shu ni kaere. Sou sureba, Shu wa kare ni awaremi o hodokosareru. Wareware no kami ni kaere, Shu wa yutaka ni yurushi o ataerareru.
Waga omoi wa, anata gata no omoi to wa kotonari, waga michi wa, anata gata no michi to wa kotonatte iru to Shu wa iwareru.
Ten ga chi yori mo takai you ni, waga michi wa, anata gata no michi yori mo takaku, waga omoi wa, anata gata no omoi yori mo takai.
Ten kara ame ga furi, yuki ga ochite mata kaerazu, chi o uruoshite mono o haesase, me o dasasete, tane makumono ni tane o atae, taberu mono ni ka te o ataeru.
Kono you ni, waga kuchi kara deru kotoba mo, munashiku watashi ni kaeranai. Watashi no yorokobu tokoro no koto o nashi, watashi ga meiji okutta koto o hatasu.
Anata gata wa yorokobi o motte dete kite, yasuraka ni michibikarete iku. Yama to oka to wa anata no mae ni koe o hanatte yorokobiutai, no ni aru ki wa mina te o utsu.
Itosugi wa, ibara ni kawatte hae, Mirutosu no ki wa, odoro ni kawatte haeru. Kore wa Shu no kinen to nari, mata, tokoshie no shirushi to natte, taeru koto wa nai".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa kouhei o mamotte seigi o okonae. Waga sukui no kuru no wa chikaku, waga tasuke no arawareru no ga chikaikara da.
Ansokunichi o mamotte, kore o kegasazu, sono te o osaete, ashiki koto o sezu, kono you ni okonau hito, kore o kataku mamoru hito no ko wa saiwai de aru".
Shu ni tsuranatte iru ihoujin wa itte wa naranai, "Shu wa kanarazu watashi o sono tami kara wakatareru" to. Kangan mo mata itte wa naranai, "Miyo, watashi wa kareki da" to.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Waga ansokunichi o mamori, waga yorokobu koto o erande, waga keiyaku o kataku mamoru kangan ni wa,
Wagaie no uchi de, waga kaki no uchi de, musuko ni mo musume ni mo masaru kinen no shirushi to na o atae, taeru koto no nai, tokoshie no na o ataeru.
Mata Shu ni tsuranari, Shu ni tsukae, Shu no na o aishi, sono shimobe to nari, subete ansokunichi o mamotte, kore o kegasazu, waga keiyaku o kataku mamoru ihoujin wa - -
Watashi wa kore o waga sei naru yama ni kosase, waga inori no ie no uchi de tanoshimaseru, karera no hansai to gisei to wa, waga saidan no ue ni ukeirerareru. Wagaie wa subete no tami no inori no ie to tonaerarerukara de aru".
Isuraeru no oiyarareta mono o atsumerareru Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa sarani hito o atsumete, sudeni atsumerareta mono ni kuwaeyou" to.
No no subete no kemono yo, hayashi ni oru subete no kemono yo, kite kurae.
Miharininra wa miname shii de, shiru koto ga naku, mina, oshi no inu de, hoeru koto ga dekinai. Mina yumemiru mono, fushite iru mono, madoromu koto o konomu mono da.
Kono inudomo wa gouyoku de, aku koto o shiranai. Karera wa mata satoru koto no dekinai bokusha de, mina ono ga michi ni mukai yuki, onoono mina, onore no ri o motomeru.
Karera wa tagai ni iu, "Saa, wareware wa sake o te ni ire, koi sake o abiru hodo nomou. Asu mo, kyou no you de arudarou, subarashii hi da" to.
Tadashii mono ga horobite mo, kokoro ni tomeru hito ga naku, kami o uyamau hitobito ga torisararete mo, satoru mono wa nai. Tadashii mono wa wazawai no mae ni torisararete,
Heian ni irukara de aru. Subete shoujiki ni ayumu mono wa, sono toko ni yasumu koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi, anata gata onnamahoutsukai no ko yo, kanpu to yuujo no sue yo, kochira e chikayore.
Anata gata wa, dare ni mukatte tawamure o nasu no ka. Dare ni mukatte kuchi o hiraki, shita o dasu no ka. Anata gata wa haishin no kora, itsuwari no sue de wa nai ka.
Anata gata wa, kashi no kinoaida, subete no aoki no shita de kokoro o kogashi, tani no naka, iwa no hazama de kodomo o koroshita.
Anata wa tani no nameraka na ishi o jibun no shigyou to shi, kore o jibun no wakemae to shi, kore ni kansai o sosogi, sonaemono o sasageta. Watashi wa korera no mono ni yotte nadamerareyou ka.
Anata wa takaku sobieta yama no ue ni jibun no toko o mouke, mata soko ni nobotte itte gisei o sasageta.
Mata to oyobi hashira no ushiro ni, anata no shirushi o oita. Anata wa watashi o hanarete jibun no toko o arawashi, sore ni nobotte, sono toko o hiroku shita. Mata karera to keiyaku o nashi, karera no toko o aishi, sono hadaka o mita.
Anata wa, nioi abura o tazusaete Moreku ni iki, ooku no kaori mono o sasageta. Mata anata no shisha o tooku ni tsukawashi, yomi no fukai tokoro ni made tsukawashita.
Anata wa michi no nagai no ni tsukarete mo, nao "Nozomi ga nai" to wa iwanakatta. Anata wa ono ga chikara no kaifuku o eta no de, otoroeru koto ga nakatta.
Anata wa dare o ojiosorete, itsuwari o ii, watashi o oboezu, mata kokoro ni okanakatta no ka. Watashi ga hisashiku damatte ita tame ni, anata wa watashi o osorenakatta no de wa nakatta ka.
Watashi wa anata no gi to, anata no waza o tsuge shimesou, shikashi korera wa anata o ekishinai.
Anata ga yobawaru toki, anata ga atsumete oita guuzou ni anata o sukuwase yo. Kaze wa karera o hakobisari, iki wa karera o torisaru. Shikashi watashi ni yori tanomu mono wa chi o tsugi, waga sei naru yama o mamoru.
Shu wa iwareru, "Tsuchi o mori, tsuchi o motte michi o sonaeyo, waga tami no michi kara, tsumazuku mono o torisare" to.
Ito takaku, ito ue naru mono, tokoshie ni sumu mono, sono na o sei to tonaerareru mono ga kou iwareru, "Watashi wa takaku, sei naru tokoro ni sumi, mata kokoro kudakete, herikudaru mono to tomo ni sumi, herikudaru mono no rei o ikashi, kudakeru mono no kokoro o ikasu.
Watashi wa kagirinaku arasowanai, mata taezu ikaranai. Rei wa watashi kara de, inochi no iki wa watashi ga tsukuttakara da.
Kare no musabori no tsumi no yue ni, watashi wa ikatte kare o uchi, waga kao o kakushite ikatta. Shikashi kare wa nao somuite, ono ga kokoro no michi e itta.
Watashi wa kare no michi o mita. Watashi wa kare o iyashi, mata kare o michibiki, nagusame o motte kare ni mukui, kanashimeru mono no tame ni, kuchibiru no mi o tsukurou.
Tooi mono ni mo chikai mono ni mo heian are, heian are, watashi wa kare o iyasou" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shikashi ashiki mono wa nami no arai umi no you da. Shizumaru koto ga dekinaide, sono mizu wa tsuini doro to obutsu to o dasu.
Waga kami wa iwareru, "Yokoshima na mono ni wa heian ga nai" to.
"Ooini yobawatte koe o oshimu na. Anata no koe o rappa no you ni age, waga tami ni sono toga o tsuge, Yakobu no ie ni sono tsumi o tsuge shimese.
Karera wa hibi watashi o tazunemotome, gi o okonai, kami no okite o sutenai kunitami no you ni, waga michi o shiru koto o yorokobu. Karera wa tadashii sabaki o watashi ni motome, kami ni chikazuku koto o yorokobu.
Karera wa iu, 'Wareware ga danjiki shita no ni, naze, goran ni naranai no ka. Wareware ga onore o kurushimeta no ni, naze, gozonjinai no ka' to. Miyo, anata gata no danjiki no hi ni wa, ono ga tanoshimi o motome, sono hatarakihito o kotogotoku shi etageru.
Miyo, anata gata no danjiki suru no wa, tada arasoi to, isakai no tame, mata aku no kobushi o motte hito o utsu tame da. Kyou, anata gata no nasu danjiki wa, sono koe o ue ni kikoesaseru mono de wa nai.
Kono you na mono wa, watashi no erabu danjiki de arou ka. Hito ga onore o kurushimeru hi de arou ka. Sono koube o ashi no you ni fuse, aranuno to hai to o sono shita ni shiku koto de arou ka. Anata wa, kore o danjiki to tonae, Shu ni ukeirerareru hi to, tonaerude arou ka.
Watashi ga erabu tokoro no danjiki wa, aku no nawa o hodoki, kubiki no himo o toki, shi etagerareru mono o hanachi sarase, subete no kubiki o oru nado no koto de wa nai ka.
Mata ueta mono ni, anata no pan o wakeatae, sasuraeru mazushii mono o, anata no ie ni ire, hadaka no mono o mite, kore o kise, jibun no kotsuniku ni mi o kakusanai nado no koto de wa nai ka.
Sou sureba, anata no hikari ga akatsuki no you ni arawaredete, anata wa, sumiyaka ni iyasare, anata no gi wa anata no mae ni iki, Shu no eikou wa anata no shingari to naru.
Mata, anata ga yobu toki, Shu wa kotaerare, anata ga sakebu toki, 'Watashi wa koko ni oru' to iwareru. Moshi, anata no naka kara kubiki o nozoki, yubi o sasu koto, warui koto o kataru koto o nozoki,
Ueta mono ni anata no pan o hodokoshi, kurushimu mono no negai o michi taraserunaraba, anata no hikari wa kuraki ni kagayaki, anata no yami wa mahiru no you ni naru.
Shu wa tsune ni anata o michibiki, yoki mono o motte anata no negai o michi tarase, anata no hone o tsuyoku sareru. Anata wa uruotta sono no you ni, mizu no taenai izumi no you ni naru.
Anata no kora wa hisashiku are sutaretaru tokoro o okoshi, anata wa yoyo yabureta motoi o tate, hito wa anata o 'Yabure o tsukurou mono' to yobi, 'Shigai o tsukurotte sumubeki tokoro to nasu mono' to yobu you ni naru.
Moshi ansokunichi ni anata no ashi o todome, waga seijitsu ni anata no tanoshimi o nasazu, ansokunichi o yorokobi no hi to yobi, Shu no seijitsu o tattobubeki hi to tonae, kore o tattonde, ono ga michi o okonawazu, ono ga tanoshimi o motomezu, munashii kotoba o kataranainaraba,
Sono toki anata wa Shu ni yotte yorokobi o e, watashi wa, anata ni chi no takai tokoro o nori toorase, anata no senzo Yakobu no shigyou o motte, anata o yashinau". Kore wa Shu no kuchi kara katarareta mono de aru.
Miyo, Shu no te ga mijikakute, sukui enai no de wa nai. Sono mimi ga nibukute kiki enai no de mo nai.
Tada, anata gata no fugi ga anata gata to, anata gata no kami to no aida o hedateta no da. Mata anata gata no tsumi ga Shu no kao o ootta tame ni, okiki ni naranai no da.
Anata gata no te wa chi de kegare, anata gata no yubi wa fugi de kegare, anata gata no kuchibiru wa itsuwari o katari, anata gata no shita wa aku o sasayaki,
Hitori mo seigi o motte uttae, shinjitsu o motte ronsou suru mono ga nai. Karera wa muna shiki koto o tanomi, itsuwari o katari, gaiaku o harami, fugi o umu.
Karera wa mamushi no tamago o kaeshi, kumo no su o oru. Sono tamago o taberu mono wa shinu. Tamago ga fumareruto yaburete dokuhebi o dasu.
Sono oru mono wa kimono to naranai. Sono tsukuru mono o motte mi o oou koto ga dekinai. Kare no waza wa fugi no waza de ari, karera no te ni wa bougyaku no okonai ga aru.
Karera no ashi wa aku ni hashiri, tsumi no nai chi o nagasu koto ni hayai. Karera no omoi wa fugi no omoi de ari, kouhai to metsubou to ga sono michi ni aru.
Karera wa heiwa no michi o shirazu, sono yuku michi ni wa kouhei ga nai. Karera wa sono michi o mageta. Subete kore o ayumu mono wa heiwa o shiranai.
Sore yue, kouhei wa tooku wareware o hanare, seigi wa wareware ni oitsukanai. Wareware wa hikari o nozonde mo, kuraki o mi, kagayaki o nozonde mo, yami o iku.
Wareware wa moujin no you ni, kaki o tesaguri yuki, me no nai mono no you ni tesaguri yuki, mahiru de mo, tasogare no you ni tsumazuki, kyousou na mono no naka ni atte mo shinin no you da.
Wareware wa mina kuma no you ni hoe, hato no you ni itaku umeki, kouhei o nozonde mo, kitarazu, sukui o nozonde mo, tooku wareware o hanaresaru.
Wareware no toga wa, anata no mae ni ooku, tsumi wa, wareware o uttaete, akashi o nashi, toga wa, wareware to tomo ni ari, fugi wa, wareware ga kore o shiru.
Wareware wa, somuite Shu o inami, shirizoite, wareware no kami ni shitagawazu, shi etageto, somuki to o katari, itsuwari no kotoba o kokoro ni harande, sore o iiarawasu.
Kouhei wa ushiro ni shirizokerare, seigi wa haruka ni tatsu. Sore wa, shinjitsu wa hiroba ni taore, shoujiki wa, hairu koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Shinjitsu wa kaketenaku, aku o hanareru mono wa kasume ubawareru. Shu wa kore o mite, kouhei ga nakatta koto o yorokobarenakatta.
Shu wa hito no nai no o mirare, naka ni tatsu mono no nai no o ayashimareta. Sore yue, gojibun no kaina o motte, shouri o e, sono gi o motte, onore o sasaerareta.
Shu wa gi o muneate to shite matoi, sukui no kabuto o sono atama ni itadaki, houfuku no koromo o matotte kimono to shi, nesshin o gaitou to shite mi o tsutsumareta.
Shu wa karera no okonai ni shitagatte mukui o nashi, ada ni mukatte ikari, teki ni mukatte mukui o nashi, umizoi no kuniguni ni mukatte mukui o sareru.
Kou shite, hitobito wa nishi no hou kara Shu no na o osore, hi no deru hou kara sono eikou o osoreru. Shu wa, sekitometa kawa o, sono ibuki de oshinagasu you ni, korarerukara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, "Shu wa, aganau mono to shite Shion ni ki tari, Yakobu no uchi no, toga o hanareru mono ni itaru" to.
Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi ga karera to tateru keiyaku wa kore de aru. Anata no ue ni aru waga rei, anata no kuchi ni oita waga kotoba wa, ima kara nochi tokoshie ni, anata no kuchi kara, anata no kora no kuchi kara, anata no kora no ko no kuchi kara hanareru koto wa nai" to.
Okiyo, hikari o hanate. Anata no hikari ga nozomi, Shu no eikou ga anata no ue ni nobottakara.
Miyo, kuraki wa chi o ooi, yami wa moromoro no tami o oou. Shikashi, anata no ue ni wa Shu ga asahi no gotoku noborare, Shu no eikou ga anata no ue ni arawareru.
Moromoro no kuni wa, anata no hikari ni ki, moromoro no ou wa, noboru anata no kagayaki ni kuru.
Anata no me o agete mimawase, karera wa mina atsumatte anata ni kuru. Anata no kora wa tooku kara ki, anata no musumera wa, kaina ni idakarete kuru.
Sono toki anata wa mite, yorokobi ni kagayaki, anata no kokoro wa doyomeki, katsu yorokobu. Umi no tomi ga utsutte anata ni ki, moromoro no kuni no takara ga, anata ni kurukara de aru.
Ooku no raku da, Midean oyobi Epa no wakaki rakuda wa anata o ooi, Shiba no hitobito wa mina ougon, nyuukou o tazusaete kite, Shu no homare o nobetsutaeru.
Kedaru no hitsuji no mure wa mina anata ni atsumatte ki, Nebayote no ohitsuji wa anata ni tsukae, waga saidan no ue ni nobotte ukeirerareru. Kou shite, watashi wa waga eikou no ie o kagayakasu.
Kumo no you ni tobi, hato ga sono koya ni tobikaeru you ni shite kuru mono wa dare ka.
Umizoi no kuniguni wa watashi o machinozomi, Tarushishi no fune wa iya saki ni anata no kora o tooku kara nosete ki, mata karera no kingin o tomo ni nosete kite, anata no kami, Shu no na ni sasage, Isuraeru no seija ni sasageru. Shu ga anata o kagayakasaretakara de aru.
Ihoujin wa anata no jouheki o kizuki, karera no outachi wa anata ni tsukaeru. Watashi wa ikari o motte anata o uttakeredo mo, mata megumi o motte anata o awarendakara de aru.
Anata no mon wa tsune ni hiraite, hiru mo yoru mo tozasu koto wa nai. Kore wa hitobito ga kuniguni no takara o anata ni tazusaete ki, sono outachi o hikiite kuru tame de aru.
Anata ni tsukaenai kuni to tami to wa horobi, sono kuniguni wa mattaku are sutareru.
Rebanon no sakae wa anata ni ki, ito sugi, suzukake, matsu wa mina tomo ni kite, waga seijo o kazaru. Mata watashi wa waga ashi o oku tokoro o tattoku suru.
Anata o kurushimeta mono no kora wa, kagande, anata no moto ni ki, anata o sagesunda mono wa, kotogotoku anata no ashimoto ni fushi, anata o Shu no miyako, Isuraeru no seija no Shion to tonaeru.
Anata wa suterare, nikumarete, sono naka o sugiru mono mo nakattaga, watashi wa anata o, tokoshie no hokori, yoyo no yorokobi to suru.
Anata wa mata, moromoro no kuni no chichi o sui, outachi no chibusa o sui, soshite Shu naru watashi ga, anata no sukuinushi, mata, anata no a ga nai Nushi, Yakobu no zennousha de aru koto o shiru ni itaru.
Watashi wa seidou no kawari ni ougon o tazusae, kurogane no kawari ni shirogane o tazusae, ki no kawari ni seidou o, ishi no kawari ni tetsu o tazusaete kite, anata no matsurigoto o heiwa ni shi, anata no tsukasa bito o tadashiku suru.
Bougyaku wa, mohaya anata no chi ni kikarezu, kouhai to metsubou wa, mohaya anata no sakai no uchi ni kikarezu, anata wa sono jouheki o "Sukui" to tonae, sono mon o "Homare" to tonaeru.
Hiru wa, mohaya taiyou ga anata no hikari to narazu, yoru mo tsuki ga kagayaite anata o tera sazu, Shu wa tokoshie ni anata no hikari to nari, anata no kami wa anata no sakae to narareru.
Anata no taiyou wa futatabi bossezu, anata no tsuki wa kakeru koto ga nai. Shu ga tokoshie ni anata no hikari to nari, anata no kanashimi no hi ga owarukara de aru.
Anata no tami wa kotogotoku tadashii mono to natte, tokoshie ni chi o shoyuu suru. Karera wa watashi no ueta wakaeda, waga te no waza, waga eikou o arawasu mono to naru.
Sono mottomo chiisai mono wa shizoku to nari, sono mottomo yowai mono wa tsuyoi kuni to naru. Watashi wa Shu de aru. Sono toki ga kurunaraba, sumiyaka ni kono koto o nasu.
Shu naru kami no rei ga watashi ni nozonda. Kore wa Shu ga watashi ni abura o sosoide, mazushii mono ni fukuin o nobetsutaeru koto o yudane, watashi o tsukawashite kokoro no itameru mono o iyashi, toraware bito ni houmen o tsuge, shibararete iru mono ni kaihou o tsuge,
Shu no megumi no toshi to wareware no kami no houfuku no hi to o tsugesase, mata, subete no kanashimu mono o nagusame,
Shion no naka no kanashimu mono ni yorokobi o atae, hai ni kaete kanmuri o atae, kanashimi ni kaete yorokobi no abura o atae, urei no kokoro ni kaete,san bi no koromo o ataesaseru tame de aru. Kou shite, karera wa gi no kashi no ki to tonaerare, Shu ga sono eikou o arawasu tame ni uerareta mono to tonaerareru.
Karera wa inishie no areta tokoro o tatenaoshi, saki ni are sutareta tokoro o okoshi, areta machimachi o arata ni shi, yoyo sutareta tokoro o futatabi tateru.
Gaikokujin wa tatte anata gata no mure o kai, ihoujin wa anata gata no hatake o tagayasu mono to nari, budou o tsukuru mono to naru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa Shu no saishi to tonaerare, wareware no kami no yakusha to yobare, moromoro no kuni no tomi o tabe, karera no takara o ete yorokobu.
Anata gata wa, saki ni uketa haji ni kaete, ni bai no tamamono o uke, hazukashime ni kaete, sono shigyou o ete tanoshimu. Sore yue, anata gata wa sono chi ni atte, ni bai no tamamono o e, tokoshie no yorokobi o eru.
Shu naru watashi wa kouhei o aishi, goudatsu to jaaku o nikumi, shinjitsu o motte karera ni mukui o atae, karera to, tokoshie no keiyaku o musubukara de aru.
Karera no shison wa, moromoro no kuni no naka de shirare, karera no kora wa, moromoro no tami no naka ni shirareru. Subete kore o miru mono wa kore ga Shu no shukufuku sareta tami de aru koto o mitomeru.
Watashi wa Shu o ooini yorokobi, waga tamashii wa waga kami o tanoshimu. Shu ga watashi ni sukui no koromo o kise, gi no uwagi o matowasete, hanamuko ga kanmuri o itadaki, hanayome ga hougyoku o motte kazaru you ni saretakara de aru.
Chi ga me o idashi, sono ga ma ita mono o hayasu you ni, Shu naru kami wa gi to homare to o, moromoro no kuni no mae ni, hayasareru.
Shion no gi ga asahi no kagayaki no you ni araware ide, Erusaremu no sukui ga moeru taimatsu no you ni naru made, watashi wa Shion no tame ni mokusezu, Erusaremu no tame ni yasumanai.
Moromoro no kuni wa anata no gi o mi, moromoro no ou wa mina anata no sakae o miru. Soshite, anata wa Shu no kuchi ga sadamerareru atarashii na o motte tonaerareru.
Mata, anata wa Shu no te ni aru uruwashii kanmuri to nari, anata no kami no te ni aru ou no kanmuri to naru.
Anata wa mohaya "Suterareta mono" to iwarezu, anata no chi wa mohaya "Areta mono" to iwarezu, anata wa "Waga yorokobi wa kanojo ni aru" to tonaerare, anata no chi wa "Haiguu aru mono" to tonaerareru. Shu wa anata o yorokobare, anata no chi wa haiguu o erukara de aru.
Wakai mono ga shojo o metoru you ni anata no kora wa anata o metori, hanamuko ga hanayome o yorokobu you ni anata no kami wa anata o yorokobareru.
Erusaremu yo, watashi wa anata no jouheki no ue ni miharinin o oite, hiru mo yoru mo taezu, modasu koto no nai you ni shiyou. Shu ni omoidasareru koto o motomeru mono yo, mizukara yasunde wa naranai.
Shu ga Erusaremu o kataku tatete, zenchi ni homare o esaserareru made, oyasumi ni naranu you ni seyo.
Shu wa sono migi no te o sashi, tainou no kaina o sashite chikawareta, "Watashi wa futatabi anata no kokumotsu o anata no teki ni ataete tabesasenai. Mata, anata ga roushite eta budoushu o ihoujin ni ataete nomasenai.
Shikashi, kokumotsu o kariireta mono wa kore o tabete Shu o hometatae, budou o atsumeta mono wa waga seijo no niwa de kore o nomu".
Mon o tootte ike, tootte ike. Tami no michi o sonae yo. Tsuchi o mori, tsuchi o motte ooji o moukeyo. Ishi o torinoke. Moromoro no tami no ue ni hata o age yo.
Miyo, Shu wa chi no hate ni made tsugete iwareta, "Shion no musume ni ie, 'Miyo, anata no sukui wa kuru. Miyo, sono mukui wa Shu to tomo ni ari, sono hataraki no mukui wa, sono mae ni aru' to.
Karera wa 'Sei naru tami, Shu ni aganawareta mono' to tonaerare, anata wa 'Hito ni tazunemotomerareru mono, suterarenai machi' to tonaerareru".
"Kono Edomu kara kuru mono, shinku no koromo o kite, Bozura kara kuru mono wa dare ka. Sono yosooi wa, hanayaka ni, ooinaru chikara o motte susumi kuru mono wa dare ka". "Gi o motte katari, sukui o hodokosu chikara aru watashi ga sore da".
"Naniyue anata no yosooi wa akaku, anata no koromo wa saka bune o fumu mono no you ni akai no ka".
"Watashi wa hitori de saka bune o funda. Moromoro no tami no naka ni, watashi to koto o tomo ni suru mono wa nakatta. Watashi wa ikari ni yotte karera o fumi, ikidoori ni yotte karera o fuminijitta no de, karera no chi ga waga koromo ni furikakari, waga yosooi o kotogotoku kegashita.
Houfuku no hi ga waga kokoro no uchi ni ari, waga a ga nai no toshi ga kitakara de aru.
Watashi wa mitakeredo mo, tasukeru mono wa naku, ayashindakeredo mo, sasaeru mono wa nakatta. Sore yue, waga kaina ga watashi o katase, waga ikidoori ga watashi o sasaeta.
Watashi wa ikari ni yotte, moromoro no tami o fuminijiri, ikidoori ni yotte karera o yowase, karera no chi o, chi ni nagaresaseta".
Watashi wa Shu ga wareware ni nasareta subete no koto ni yotte, Shu no itsukushimito, Shu no homare to o kataritsuge, mata, sono awaremi ni yori, sono ooku no itsukushimi ni yotte, Isuraeru no ie ni hodokosareta sono ooinaru megumi o kataritsugeyou.
Shu wa iwareta, "Makoto ni karera wa waga tami, itsuwari no nai kora de aru" to. Soshite Shu wa karera no sukuinushi to narareta.
Karera no subete no nayami no toki, Shu mo nayamarete, sono mimae no tsukai o motte karera o sukui, sono ai to awaremi to ni yotte karera o aganai, inishie no hi, tsune ni karera o motage, karera o tazusaerareta.
Tokoro ga karera wa somuite sono sei naru rei o ureesaseta no de, Shu wa hirugaette karera no teki to nari, mizukara karera to tatakawareta.
Sono toki, tami wa inishie no Moose no hi o omoidashite itta, "Sono mure no bokusha o, umi kara tazusae ageta mono wa doko ni iru ka. Karera no naka ni sei naru rei o oita mono wa doko ni iru ka.
Eikou no kaina o Moose no migi ni ikase, karera no mae ni mizu o futatsu ni wakete, mizukara, tokoshie no na o tsukuri,
Karera o michibiite, uma ga no o hashiru you ni, tsumazuku koto naku fuchi o tooraseta mono wa doko ni iru ka.
Tani ni kudaru kachiku no you ni, Shu no rei wa karera o ikowaserareta. Kono you ni, anata wa onore no tami o michibiite mizukara eikou no na o tsukurareta".
Dou ka, ten kara mioroshi, sono sei naru eikou aru sumika kara goran kudasai. Anata no nesshin to, tainou to wa doko ni arimasu ka. Anata no setsu naru doujou to awaremi to wa osaerarete, watashi ni arawaremasen.
Tatoi Aburahamu ga wareware o shirazu, Isuraeru ga wareware o mitomenakute mo, anata wa wareware no chichi desu. Shu yo, anata wa wareware no chichi, inishie kara anata no na wa wareware no a nagai Nushi desu.
Shu yo, naze, wareware o anata no michi kara hanare mayowase, wareware no kokoro o katakuna ni shite, anata o osorenai you ni sareru no desu ka. Douzo, anata no shimobera no tame ni, anata no shigyou de aru buzokura no tame ni, okaeri kudasai.
Anata no sei naru tami ga, anata no seijo o ete aida mo nai no ni, wareware no ada wa, sore o fuminijirimashita.
Wareware wa anata ni yotte, inishie kara osamerarenai mono no you ni nari, anata no na o motte, tonaerarenai mono no you ni narimashita.
Dou ka, anata ga ten o saite kudari, anata no mae ni yamayama ga furui ugoku you ni.
Hi ga shibaki o moyashi, hi ga mizu o wakasu toki no gotoku kudarareru you ni. Soshite, mina o anata no ada ni arawashi, moromoro no kuni o anata no mae ni furueononokaserareru you ni.
Anata wa, wareware ga kitai shinakatta osorubeki koto o nasareta toki ni kudarareta no de, yamayama wa furui ugoita.
Inishie kara konokata, anata no hoka kami o machinozomu mono ni, kono you na koto o okonawareta kami o kiita koto wa naku, mimi ni ireta koto mo naku, me ni mita koto mo nai.
Anata wa yorokonde gi o okonai, anata no michi ni atte, anata o kinen suru mono o mukaerareru. Miyo, anata wa ikarareta, wareware wa tsumi o okashita. Wareware wa hisashiku tsumi no uchi ni atta. Wareware wa sukuwarerude arou ka.
Wareware wa mina kegareta hito no you ni nari, wareware no tadashii okonai wa, kotogotoku kegareta koromo no you de aru. Wareware wa mina konoha no you ni kare, wareware no fugi wa kaze no you ni wareware o fukisaru.
Anata no na o yobu mono wa naku, mizukara hagende, anata ni yorisugaru mono wa nai. Anata wa mikao o kakushite, wareware o kaerimirarezu, wareware o onore no fugi no te ni watasareta.
Saredo Shu yo, anata wa wareware no chichi desu. Wareware wa nendo de atte, anata wa toukishi desu. Wareware wa mina, mite no waza desu.
Shu yo, hidoku oikari ni naranu you ni, itsu made mo fugi o mikokoro ni tomerarenu you ni. Douzo, wareware o kaerimite kudasai. Wareware wa mina, anata no tami desu.
Anata no sei naru machimachi wa arano to nari, Shion wa arano to nari, Erusaremu wa are sutareta.
Wareware no senzo ga anata o hometataeta sei naru uruwashii wareware no miya wa hi de yakare, wareware ga shitatta tokoro wa kotogotoku are hateta.
Shu yo, korera no koto ga atte mo nao, anata wa mizukara o osae, mokushite, wareware o itaku kurushimerareru no desu ka.
Watashi wa watashi o motomenakatta mono ni towareru koto o yorokobi, watashi o tazunenakatta mono ni miidasareru koto o yorokonda. Watashi wa waga na o yobanakatta kokumin ni itta, "Watashi wa koko ni iru, watashi wa koko ni iru" to.
Yokaranu michi ni ayumi, jibun no omoi ni shitagau somukeru tami ni, watashi wa hinemosu te o nobete maneita.
Kono tami wa manoatari tsune ni watashi o ikarase, sono no naka de gisei o sasage, kawara no ue de kou o taki,
Hakaba ni suwari, hisoka na tokoro ni yadori, buta no niku o kurai, nikumubeki mono no, atsumono o sono utsuwa ni motte,
Iu, "Anata wa soko ni tatte, watashi ni chikazuite wa naranai. Watashi wa anata to kubetsu sareta mono dakara" to. Korera wa waga hana no kemuri, hinemosu moeru hi de aru.
Miyo, kono koto wa waga mae ni shirusareta, "Watashi wa damatte inaide mukui kaesu. Sou da, watashi wa karera no futokoro ni,
Karera no fugi to, karera no senzotachi no fugi to o tomo ni mukui kaesu. Karera ga yama no ue de kou o taki, oka no ue de watashi o soshitta yue, watashi wa karera no saki no waza o hakatte, sono futokoro ni kaesu" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Hito ga budou no fusa no naka ni, budou no shiru no aru no o mirunaraba, 'Sore o yaburu na, sono naka ni shukufuku ga arukara' to iu. Sono you ni watashi wa, waga shimobera no tame ni okonatte, kotogotoku wa horobosanai.
Watashi wa Yakobu kara shison o idashi, Yuda kara waga yamayama o uketsugubeki mono o idasu. Watashi ga eranda mono wa kore o uketsugi, waga shimobera wa soko ni sumu.
Sharon wa hitsuji no mure no makiba to nari, Akoru no tani wa ushi no mure no fusu tokoro to natte, watashi o tazunemotometa waga tami no mono to naru.
Shikashi Shu o sute, waga sei naru yama o wasure, tsukue o kafuku no kami ni sonae, mazeawaseta sake o motte unmei no kami ni sasageru anata gata yo,
Watashi wa, anatagata o tsurugi ni watasu koto ni sadameta. Anata gata wa mina ka gan de hofurareru. Anata gata wa watashi ga yonda toki ni kotaezu, watashi ga katatta toki ni kikazu, watashi no me ni warui koto o okonai, watashi no konomanakatta koto o erandakara da".
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, waga shimobetachi wa taberu, shikashi, anata gata wa ueru. Miyo, waga shimobetachi wa nomu, shikashi, anata gata wa kawaku. Miyo, waga shimobetachi wa yorokobu, shikashi, anata gata wa hajiru.
Miyo, waga shimobetachi wa kokoro no tanoshimi ni yotte utau, shikashi, anata gata wa kokoro no kurushimi ni yotte sakebi, tamashii no nayami ni yotte nakisakebu.
Anata gata no nokosu na wa waga eranda mono ni wa, noroi no monku to nari, Shu naru kami wa anatagata o korosareru. Shikashi, onore no shimobetachi o, hoka no na o motte yobareru.
Sore yue, chi ni atte onore no tame ni shukufuku o motomeru mono wa, shinjitsu no kami ni yotte onore no shukufuku o motome, chi ni atte chikau mono wa, shinjitsu no kami o sashite chikau. Saki no nayami wa wasurerarete, to waga me kara kakure userukara de aru.
Miyo, watashi wa atarashii ten to, atarashii chi to o souzou suru. Saki no koto wa oboerareru koto naku, kokoro ni omoiokosu koto wa nai.
Shikashi, anata gata wa watashi no souzou suru mono ni yori, tokoshie ni tanoshimi, yorokobi o e yo. Miyo, watashi wa Erusaremu o tsukutte yorokobi to shi, sono tami o tanoshimi to suru.
Watashi wa Erusaremu o yorokobi, waga tami o tanoshimu. Naku koe to sakebu koe wa futatabi sono naka ni kikoeru koto wa nai.
Wazuka suujitsu de shinu midorigo to, ono ga inochi no hi o mitasanai roujin to wa, mohaya sono naka ni inai. Hyakusai de shinu mono mo, nao wakai mono to serare, hyakusai de shinu mono wa, norowareta tsumibito to sareru.
Karera wa ie o tatete, sore ni sumi, budou batake o tsukutte, sono mi o taberu.
Karera ga tateru tokoro ni, hoka no hito wa sumazu, karera ga ueru mono wa, hoka no hito ga tabenai. Waga tami no inochi wa, ki no inochi no you ni nari, waga eranda mono wa, sono te no waza o nagaku tanoshimukara de aru.
Karera no kinrou wa muda de naku, sono umu tokoro no kora wa wazawai ni kakaranai. Karera wa Shu ni shukufuku sareta mono no sue de atte, sono kora mo karera to tomo ni orukara de aru.
Karera ga yobanai saki ni, watashi wa kotae, karera ga nao katatte iru toki ni, watashi wa kiku.
Ookami to kohitsuji to wa tomo ni kurai, shishi wa ushi no you ni wara o kurai, hebi wa chiri o shokumotsu to suru. Karera wa waga sei naru yama no doko de mo sokonau koto naku, yaburu koto wa nai" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Ten wa waga kurai, chi wa waga ashidai de aru. Anata gata wa watashi no tame ni donna ie o tateyou to suru no ka. Mata donna tokoro ga waga yasumitokoro to naru no ka".
Shu wa iwareru, "Waga te wa subete korera no mono o tsukutta. Korera no mono wa kotogotoku watashi no mono de aru. Shikashi, watashi ga kaerimiru hito wa kore de aru. Sunawachi, herikudatte kokoro kui, waga kotoba ni osoreononoku mono de aru.
Ushi o hofuru mono wa, mata hito o korosu mono, kohitsuji o gisei to suru mono wa, mata inu o kubirikorosu mono, sonaemono o sasageru mono wa, mata buta no chi o sasageru mono, nyuukou o kinen to shite sasageru mono wa, mata guuzou o homeru mono de aru. Kore wa ono ga michi o erabi, sono kokoro wa nikumubeki mono o tanoshimu.
Watashi mo mata karera no tame ni nayami o erabi, karera no osoreru tokoro no mono o karera ni nozomaseru. Kore wa, watashi ga yonda toki ni kotaeru mono naku, watashi ga katatta toki ni kiku koto o sezu, watashi no me ni warui koto o okonai, watashi no konomanakatta koto o erandakara de aru".
Anata gata, Shu no kotoba ni osoreononoku mono yo, Shu no kotoba o kike, "Anata gata no kyoudaitachi wa anatagata o nikumi, anatagata o waga na no tame ni oidashite itta, 'Negawaku wa Shu ga sono eikou o arawashite wareware ni anata gata no yorokobi o misaseyo' to. Shikashi karera wa haji o ukeru.
Kikeyo, machi kara okoru sawagi o. Miya kara kikoeru koe o. Shu ga sono teki ni houfuku sareru koe o.
Shion wa umi no kurushimi o nasu mae ni umi, sono kurushimi no konai mae ni danshi o unda.
Dare ga kono you na koto o kiita ka, dare ga kono you na kotodomo o mita ka. Hitotsu no kuni wa tsuitachi no kurushimi de umarerudarou ka. Hitotsu no kunitami wa hitotoki ni umarerudarou ka. Shikashi, Shion wa umi no kurushimi o suru ya ina ya sono kora o unda.
Watashi ga shussan ni nozomasete umasenai koto ga arou ka" to Shu wa iwareru. "Watashi wa umaseru mono na no ni tai o tozasude arou ka" to anata no kami wa iwareru.
"Subete Erusaremu o aisuru mono yo, kanojo to tomo ni yorokobe, kanojo no yue ni tanoshime. Subete kanojo no tame ni kanashimu mono yo, kanojo to tomo ni yorokobitanoshime.
Anata gata wa nagusame o ataeru Erusaremu no chibusa kara chichi o sutte aku koto ga deki, mata sono yutaka na sakae kara nonde tanoshimu koto ga dekirukara da".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa kawa no you ni kanojo ni han'ei o atae, minagiru nagare no you ni, moromoro no kuni no tomi o ataeru. Anata gata wa chichi o nomi, koshi ni oware, hiza no ue de ayasareru.
Haha no sono ko o nagusameru you ni, watashi mo anatagata o nagusameru. Anata gata wa Erusaremu de nagusame o eru.
Anata gata wa mite, kokoro yorokobi, anata gata no hone wa wakakusa no you ni sakaeru. Shu no te wa sono shimobera to tomo ni ari, sono ikidoori wa sono teki ni mukatte iru koto o shiru.
Miyo, Shu wa hi no naka ni arawarete korareru. Sono kuruma wa tsumujikaze no you da. Hageshii ikari o motte sono ikidoori o morashi, hi no honoo o motte semerareru.
Shu wa hi o motte, mata tsurugi o motte, subete no hito ni sabaki o okonawareru. Shu ni korosareru mono wa ooi".
"Mizukara o seibetsu shi, mizukara o kiyomete sono ni iki, sono naka ni aru mono ni shitagai, buta no niku, nikumubeki mono oyobi nezumi o kuu mono wa mina tomo ni tae useru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa karera no wazato, karera no omoi to o shitte iru. Watashi wa kite, subete no kokumin to, moromoro no yakara to o atsumeru. Karera wa kite, waga eikou o miru.
Watashi wa karera no naka ni hitotsu no shirushi o tatete, nogareta mono o moromoro no kuni, sunawachi Tarushishi, yoku yumi o hiku Puto oyobi Rude, Tobaru, Yawan, mata waga meisei o kikazu, waga eikou o minai tooku no umizoi no kuniguni ni tsukawasu. Karera wa waga eikou o moromoro no kokumin no naka ni tsutaeru.
Karera wa Isuraeru no kora ga kiyoi utsuwa ni sonaemono o motte Shu no miya ni tazusaete kuru you ni, anata gata no kyoudai o kotogotoku moromoro no kuni no naka kara uma, kuruma, kago, raba, rakuda ni nosete, waga sei naru yama Erusaremu ni kosase, Shu no sonaemono to suru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa mata karera no naka kara hito o erande saishi to shi, Rebi bito to suru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi ga tsukurou to suru atarashii ten to, atarashii chi ga watashi no mae ni nagaku todomaru you ni, anata no shison to, anata no na wa nagaku todomaru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Shingetsugoto ni, ansokunichi goto ni, subete no hito wa waga mae ni kite reihai suru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Karera wa dete, watashi ni somuita hitobito no shikabane o miru. Sono uji wa shinazu, sono hi wa kieru koto ga nai. Karera wa subete no hito ni imikirawareru".
Beniyamin no chi Anatote no saishi no hitori de aru, Hirukiya no ko Eremiya no kotoba.
Amon no ko, Yuda no ou Yoshiya no toki, sunawachi sono chisei no juu san nen ni, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Sono kotoba wa mata Yoshiya no ko, Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu no toki ni mo nozonde, Yoshiya no ko, Yuda no ou Zedekiya no juu ichi nen no owari, sunawachi sono nen no go gatsu ni Erusaremu no tami ga toraeutsusareta toki ni made oyonda.
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde iu,
"Watashi wa anata o mada haha no tai ni tsukuranai saki ni, anata o shiri, anata ga mada umarenai saki ni, anata o seibetsu shi, anata o tatete bankoku no yogensha to shita".
Sono toki watashi wa itta, "Aa, Shu naru kami yo, watashi wa tada wakamono ni sugizu, dono you ni katatte yoi ka shirimasen".
Shikashi Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa tada wakamono ni suginai to itte wa naranai. Dare ni de mo, subete watashi ga tsukawasu hito e iki, anata ni meijiru koto o mina kataranakereba naranai.
Karera o osorete wa naranai, watashi ga anata to tomo ni ite, anata o sukuukara de aru" to Shu wa ooserareru.
Soshite Shu wa mite o nobete, watashi no kuchi ni tsuke, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi no kotoba o anata no kuchi ni ireta.
Miyo, watashi wa kyou, anata o banmin no ue to, bankoku no ue ni tate, anata ni, aruiha nuki, aruiha kowashi, aruiha horoboshi, aruiha taoshi, aruiha tate, aruiha uesaseru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonde iu, "Eremiya yo, anata wa nani o miru ka". Watashi wa kotaeta, "A mendou no eda o mimasu".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Anata no mita toori da. Watashi wa jibun no kotoba o okonaou to shite mihatte iru no da".
Shu no kotoba ga futatabi watashi ni nozonde iu, "Anata wa nani o miru ka". Watashi wa kotaeta, "Nietatte iru nabe o mimasu. Kita kara kochira ni mukatte imasu".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Wazawai ga kita kara tatte, kono chi ni sumu subete no mono no ue ni nozomu".
Shu wa iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa kita no kuniguni no subete no tami o yobu. Karera wa kite, Erusaremu no mon no iriguchi to, shuui no subete no jouheki, oyobi Yuda no subete no machimachi ni mukatte, onoono sono za o moukeru.
Watashi wa, karera ga watashi o sutete, subete no akuji o okonatta yue ni, watashi no sabaki o karera ni tsugeru. Karera wa ta no kamigami ni kou o taki, jibun no te de tsukutta mono o haishita no de aru.
Shikashi anata wa koshi ni obishite tachi, watashi ga meijiru subete no koto o karera ni tsuge yo. Karera o osorete wa naranai. Samo naito, watashi wa karera no mae de anata o awatesaseru.
Miyo, watashi wa kyou, kono zenkoku to, Yuda no ou to, sono tsukasa to, sono saishi to, sono chi no tami no mae ni, anata o kata kishiro, tetsu no hashira, seidou no jouheki to suru.
Karera wa anata to tatakauga, anata ni katsu koto wa dekinai. Watashi ga anata to tomo ni ite, anata o sukuukara de aru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde iu,
"Itte, Erusaremu ni sumu mono no mimi ni tsugeyo, Shu wa kou iwareru, watashi wa anata no wakai toki no junjou, hanayome no toki no ai, arano naru, tane ma ka nu chi de watashi ni shitagatta koto o oboete iru.
Isuraeru wa Shu no tame ni seibetsu sareta mono, sono kariire no hatsuho de aru. Subete kore o taberu mono wa tsumi serare, wazawai ni au" to Shu wa iwareru.
Yakobu no ie to Isuraeru no ie no subete no yakara yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata no senzo wa, watashi ni nan no warui koto ga aru no o mite, watashi kara toozakari, munashii mono ni shitagatte, munashiku natta no ka.
Karera wa iwanakatta, 'Wareware o Ejiputo no chi yori michibikidashi, arano naru, ana no ooi areta chi, kawaita koi ankoku no chi, hito no tooranai, hito no sumanai chi o tooraseta Shu wa doko ni orareru ka' to.
Watashi wa anatagata o michibiite yutaka na chi ni ire, sono mi to yoi mono o tabesaseta. Shikashi anata gata wa koko ni haitte, watashi no chi o kegashi, watashi no shigyou o nikumubeki mono to shita.
Saishitachi wa, 'Shu wa doko ni orareru ka' to iwanakatta. Rippou o atsukau monotachi wa watashi o shirazu, tsukasatachi wa watashi ni somuki, yogensha tachi wa Baaru ni yotte yogen shi, ekinaki mono ni shitagatte itta.
Sore yue, watashi wa nao, anata gata to arasou, mata anata gata no shison to arasou" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Anata gata wa Kupuro no shimajima ni watatte miyo, mata hito o Kedaru ni tsukawashite, kono you na koto ga katsute atta ka o tsumabiraka ni, shirabete mi yo.
Sono kami o kami de wa nai mono ni torikaeta kuni ga arou ka. Tokoro ga, watashi no tami wa sono eikou o ekinaki mono to torikaeta.
Ten yo, kono koto o shitte odoroke, ononoke, itaku osoreyo" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Sore wa, watashi no tami ga futatsu no ashiki koto o okonattakara de aru. Sunawachi ikeru mizu no minamoto de aru watashi o sutete, jibun de mizu tame o hotta. Sore wa, kowareta mizu tame de, mizu o irete oku koto no dekinai mono da.
Isuraeru wa dorei de aru ka, ie ni umareta shimobe de aru ka. Sore nara naze toraware no mi to natta no ka.
Shishi wa kare ni mukatte hoe, sono koe o takaku agete, kare no chi o arashita. Sono machimachi wa horobite sumu hito mo nai.
Menpisu to Tapanesu no hitobito mo mata, anata no kashira no kanmuri o kudaita.
Anata no kami, Shu ga anata o michi ni michibikareta toki, anata wa Shu o suteta no de, kono koto ga anata ni oyonda no de wa nai ka.
Anata ga Nairu no mizu o nomou to shite, Ejiputo e iku no wa nani no tame ka. Mata Yufurate no mizu o nomou to shite, ASsuriya e iku no wa nani no tame ka.
Anata no akuji wa anata o kora shime, anata no haishin wa anata o semeru. Anata ga, anata no kami, Shu o suteru koto no ashiku katsu nigai koto de aru no o mite shiru ga yoi. Watashi o osoreru koto ga anata no uchi ni nai no da" to bangun no kami, Shu wa iwareru.
"Anata wa hisashii izen ni jibun no kubiki o ori, jibun no nawame o tachikitte, 'Watashi wa tsukaeru koto o shinai' to itta. Soshite, subete no takai oka no ue to, subete no aoki no shita de, yuujo no you ni mi o kagameta.
Watashi wa anata o, mattaku yoi tane no sugureta budou no ki to shite ueta no ni, dou shite anata wa kawatte, warui no budou no ki to natta no ka.
Tatoi Sooda o motte mizukara arai, mata ooku no aku o mochiite mo, anata no aku no kegare wa, nao watashi no mae ni aru" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
"Dou shite anata wa, 'Watashi wa kegarete inai, Baaru ni shitagawanakatta' to iu koto ga dekiyou ka. Tani no naka de no anata no okonai o miru ga yoi. Anata no shita koto o shiru ga yoi. Anata wa gyoshigatai wakai rakuda de atte, sono michi o yuki tsu modori tsu suru.
Anata wa arano ni nareta no no me roba de aru, sono yokujou no tame ni kaze ni aegu. Sono yokujou o dare ga todomeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Subete kore o tazuneru mono wa kurou suru ni oyobanai, sono tsuki de areba kore ni au koto ga dekiru.
Anata no ashi ga, hadashi ni naranai you ni, nodo ga, kawakanai you ni seyo. Tokoro ga, anata wa itta, 'Sore wa dame da, watashi wa kotonaru kuni no mono o aishite, sore ni shitagatte ikou' to.
Nusu bito ga toraerarete, hazukashime o ukeru you ni, Isuraeru no ie wa, hazukashime o ukeru. Karera wa sono ou mo, sono tsukasa mo, sono saishi mo, sono yogensha mo mina sono toori de aru.
Karera wa ki ni mukatte, 'Anata wa watashi no chichi desu' to ii, mata ishi ni mukatte, 'Anata wa watashi o unde kudasatta' to iu. Karera wa se o watashi ni mukete, sono kao o watashi ni mukenai. Shikashi karera ga wazawai ni au toki wa, 'Tatte, wareware o sukui tamae' to iu.
Anata ga jibun no tame ni tsukutta kamigami wa doko ni iru no ka. Anata ga wazawai ni au toki, moshi karera ga anata o sukuerunara, tatte morau ga yoi. Yuda yo, anata no kamigami wa, anata no machi no kazu hodo ooikara de aru.
Anata gata wa, naze watashi to arasou no ka. Anata gata wa mina watashi ni somuite iru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi ga anata gata no kodomotachi o utta no wa muda de atta. Karera wa imashime o ukezu, anata gata no tsurugi wa, takeritatsu shishi no you ni, yogensha tachi o horoboshita.
Anata ga tako no sedai no hito yo, Shu no kotoba o kike. Watashi wa Isuraeru ni totte, arano de attade arou ka. Ankoku no chi de attade arou ka. Sore nara naze, watashi no tami wa 'Wareware wa jiyuu da, mohaya anata no tokoro e wa ikanai' to iu no ka.
Otome wa sono kazarimono o wasureru koto ga dekiyou ka. Hanayome wa sono obi o wasureru koto ga dekiyou ka. Tokoro ga, watashi no tami no, watashi o wasureta hi wa kazoegatai.
Anata wa koibito o tazunete, ikani mo takumi ni sono hou ni ashi o mukeru. Sore yue warui onna sae, anata no michi o mananda.
Mata, anata no kimono no suso ni wa tsumi no nai mazushii hito no inochi no chi ga tsuite iru. Anata wa karera ga oshiiru no o mita no de wa nai. Shikamo, subete korera no koto ni mo kakawarazu,
Anata wa iu, 'Watashi wa tsumi ga nai. Kare no ikari wa, kesshite watashi ni nozomu koto ga nai' to. Anata ga 'Watashi wa tsumi o okasanakatta' to iu koto ni yotte, watashi wa anata o sabaku.
Anata wa naze karugarushiku samayotte, sono michi o kaeyou to suru no ka. Anata wa ASsuriya ni, hazukashime o uketa you ni, Ejiputo ni mo mata, hazukashime o ukeru.
Anata wa mata ryoute o atama ni oite, soko kara dete kuru. Shu ga anata no tanomi to suru monodomo o suterareta no de, anata wa karera ni yotte sakaeru koto ga naikara da.
Moshi hito ga sono tsuma o rikon shi, onna ga kare no moto o satte, tanin no tsuma to narunara, sono hito wa futatabi kanojo ni kaerude arou ka. Sono chi wa ooini kegarenaide arou ka. Anata wa ooku no koibito to kan'in o okonatta. Shikamo watashi ni kaerou to iu no ka" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Me o agete moromoro no hadaka no yama o miyo, kan'in o okonawanakatta tokoro ga doko ni aru ka. Arano ni iru Arabiya bito ga suru you ni, anata wa michi no katawara ni zashite koibito o matta. Anata wa kan'in no akuji o motte, kono chi o kegashita.
Sore yue ame wa todomerare, haru no ame wa furanakatta. Shikamo anata ni wa yuujo no hitai ga ari, sukoshi mo hajiyou to wa shinai.
Ima anata wa, watashi o yonde ittade wa nai ka, 'Waga chichi yo, anata wa watashi no wakai toki no tomo desu.
Eikyuu ni ikarareru no desu ka, owari made ikidoorareru no desu ka' to. Miyo, anata wa kou ittakeredo mo, nashi uru kagiri no moromoro no aku o okonatta".
Yoshiya ou no toki, Shu wa mata watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa, kano haishin no Isuraeru ga shita koto o mita ka. Kanojo wa subete no takai oka ni nobori, subete no aoki no shita ni itte, soko de kan'in o okonatta.
Watashi wa, kanojo ga kono subete o okonatta nochi, watashi no tokoro ni kaerude arou to omottaga, kaette konakatta. Sono fushin no shimai Yuda wa kore o mita.
Watashi ga haishin no Isuraeru o, sono subete no kan'in no yue ni, rienjou o ataete dashita no o Yuda wa mita. Shikamo sono fushin no shimai Yuda wa osorezu, jibun mo itte kan'in o okonatta.
Kanojo ni totte kan'in wa karui koto de atta no de, ishi to ki to ni kan'in o itte, kono chi o kegashita.
Kono subete no koto ga atte mo, nao sono fushin no shimai Yuda wa magokoro o motte watashi ni kaeranai, tada itsuwatte iru dake da" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa mata watashi ni iwareta, "Haishin no Isuraeru wa fushin no Yuda yori mo jibun no tsumi no sukunai koto o shimeshita.
Anata wa itte kita ni mukai, kono kotoba o nobete iu ga yoi, 'Shu wa iwareru, haishin no Isuraeru yo, kaere. Watashi wa ikari no kao o anata gata ni mukenai, watashi wa itsukushimi fukai mono de aru. Itsu made mo ikaru koto wa shinaito, Shu wa iwareru.
Tada anata wa jibun no tsumi o mitome, anata no kami, Shu ni somuite subete no aoki no shita de kotonaru kamigami ni anata no ai o oshimazu ataeta koto, watashi no koe ni kikishitagawanakatta koto o iiarawase to, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, haishin no kora yo, kaere. Watashi wa anata gata no otto dakara de aru. Machi kara hitori, shizoku kara futari o totte, anatagata o Shion e tsurete ikou.
Watashi wa jibun no kokoro ni kanau bokushatachi o anata gata ni ataeru. Karera wa chishiki to satori to o motte anatagata o yashinau.
Shu wa iwareru, anata gata ga chi ni mashite ooku naru toki, sono hi ni wa, hitobito wa kasanete "Shu no keiyaku no hako" to iwazu, kore o omoidasazu, kore o oboezu, kore o tazunezu, kore o tsukuranai.
Sono toki Erusaremu wa Shu nomi kurai to tonaerare, bankoku no tami wa koko ni atsumaru. Sunawachi Shu no na no moto ni Erusaremu ni atsumari, kasanete, katakuna ni jibun no warui kokoro ni shitagau koto wa shinai.
Sono hi ni wa, Yuda no ie wa Isuraeru no ie to issho ni nari, kita no chi kara dete, watashi ga anata gata no senzotachi ni shigyou to shite ataeta chi ni tomo ni kuru.
Dono you ni shite, anata o watashi no kodomotachi no uchi ni oki, bankoku no uchi de mottomo utsukushii shigyou de aru yoi chi o anata ni ataeyou ka to, watashi wa omotte ita. Watashi wa mata, anata ga watashi o "Waga chichi" to yobi, watashi ni shitagatte hanareru koto wa nai to omotte ita.
Isuraeru no ie yo, haishin no tsuma ga otto no moto o saru you ni, tashika ni, anata gata wa watashi ni somuita' to Shu wa iwareru".
Hadaka no yama no ue ni koe ga kikoeru, Isuraeru no tami ga kanashimi inoru no de aru. Karera ga magatta michi ni ayumi, sono kami, Shu o wasuretakara da.
"Haishin no kodomotachi yo, kaere. Watashi wa anata gata no haishin o iyasu". "Miyo, wareware wa anata no moto ni kaerimasu. Anata wa wareware no kami, Shu de araseraremasu.
Makoto ni, moromoro no oka wa mayoi de ari, yama no ue no sawagi mo onaji desu. Makoto ni, Isuraeru no sukui wa wareware no kami, Shu ni aru no desu.
Shikashi, wareware no youshou no toki kara, hazubeki koto ga, wareware no senzo no honeotte eta mono, sunawachi sono hitsuji, sono ushi, oyobi sono musuko, musumetachi o kotogotoku nomi tsukushimashita.
Wareware wa haji no naka ni fushi, hazukashime ni oowarete imasu. Sore wa wareware to senzo to ga, wareware no youshou no toki kara konnichi made, wareware no kami, Shu ni tsumi o okashi, wareware no kami, Shu no koe ni shitagawanakattakara desu".
Shu wa iwareru, "Isuraeru yo, moshi, anata ga kaerunaraba, watashi no moto ni kaeranakereba naranai. Moshi, anata ga nikumubeki mono o watashi no mae kara torinozoite, tamerau koto naku,
Mata shinjitsu to seigi to shoujiki to o motte, 'Shu wa ikite orareru' to chikaunaraba, bankoku no tami wa kare ni yotte shukufuku o uke, kare ni yotte hokoru".
Shu wa Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu hitobito ni kou iwareru, "Anata gata no shinden o tagayase, ibara no naka ni tane o maku na.
Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu hitobito yo, anata gata wa mizukara katsurei o okonatte, Shu ni zokusuru mono to nari, jibun no kokoro no mae no kawa o torisare. Samo naito, anata gata no ashiki okonai no tame ni watashi no ikari ga hi no you ni hasshite moe, kore o kesu mono wa nai".
Yuda ni tsuge, Erusaremu ni shimeshite ie, "Kunijyuu ni rappa o fuki, oogoe ni yobawatte ie, 'Atsumare, wareware wa kengo na machimachi e ikou' to.
Shion no hou o shimesu hata o tate yo. Hinan seyo, todomatte wa naranai, watashi ga kita kara wazawai to ooinaru hametsu o kosaserukara da.
Shishi wa sono mori kara dete nobori, kuniguni o horobosu mono wa susunde kita. Kare wa anata no kuni o arasou to shite, sudeni sono tokoro kara dete kita. Anata no machimachi wa horobosarete, sumu mono mo nakunaru.
Kono tame ni, anata gata wa aranuno o mi ni matotte, kanashiminageke. Shu no hageshii ikari ga, mada wareware o hanarenaikara da".
Shu wa iwareru, "Sono hi, ou to kimitachi to wa sono kokoro o ushinai, saishi wa odoroki, yogensha wa ayashimu".
Soko de watashi wa itta, "Aa Shu naru kami yo, makoto ni anata wa kono tami to Erusaremu to o mattaku azamukaremashita. 'Anata gata wa yasuraka ni naru' to iwaremashitaga, tsurugi ga inochi ni made mo oyobimashita".
Sono toki kono tami to Erusaremu to wa kou tsugerareru, "Atsui kaze ga arano no hadaka no yama kara watashi no tami no musume no hou ni fuite kuru. Kore wa aogi wakeru tame de wa naku, kiyomeru tame de mo nai.
Kore yori mo nao hageshii kaze ga watashi no tame ni fuku. Ima watashi wa karera ni sabaki o tsugeru".
Miyo, kare wa kumo no you ni nobotte kuru. Sono sensha wa tsumujikaze no you, sono uma wa washi no tobu yori mo hayai. Aa, wareware wa wazawai da, wareware wa horobosareru.
Erusaremu yo, anata no kokoro no aku o araikiyomeyo, sou surunaraba sukuwareru. Ashiki omoi wa itsu made anata no uchi ni todomaru no ka.
Dan kara tsugeru koe ga aru, Efuraimu no yama kara wazawai o shirasete iru.
Kuniguni no tami ni kare no kuru koto o tsuge, mata Erusaremu ni shirase yo. "Seme kakomu mono ga tooku no kuni kara kite, Yuda no machimachi ni mukatte sono koe o ageru.
Karera wa hatake o mamoru mono no you ni kore o seme kakomu. Sore wa watashi ni somuitakara dato, Shu wa iwareru.
Anata no michi to sono okonai to ga, anata no mi ni kore o maneita no da. Kore wa anata no aku no kekka de, makoto ni nigaku, anata no kokoro o tsuranuku".
Aa, waga harawata yo, waga harawata yo, watashi wa kurushimi ni modaeru. Aa, waga shinzou no kabe yo, watashi no shinzou wa, hageshiku kodou suru. Watashi wa chinmoku o mamoru koto ga dekinai, rappa no koe to, tatakai no sakebi o kikukara de aru.
Hakai ni tsugu ni hakai ga ari, zenchi wa arasare, watashi no tenmaku wa niwaka ni yaburare, watashi no maku wa tachimachi yaburareta.
Itsu made watashi wa hata o mi, mata rappa no koe o kikanakereba naranai no ka.
"Watashi no tami wa oroka de atte, watashi o shiranai. Karera wa gudon na kodomora de, satoru koto ga nai. Karera wa aku o okonau no ni satoikeredo mo, zen o okonau koto o shiranai".
Watashi wa chi o mitaga, sore wa katachi ga naku, mata munashikatta. Ten o aoidaga, soko ni wa hikari ga nakatta.
Watashi wa yama o mitaga, mina furue, moromoro no oka wa ugoite ita.
Watashi wa mitaga, hito wa hitori mo orazu, sora no tori wa mina tobisatte ita.
Watashi wa mitaga, yutaka na chi wa arechi to nari, sono subete no machi wa, Shu no mae ni, sono hageshii ikari no mae ni, hakai sarete ita.
Sore wa Shu ga kou iwaretakara da, "Zenchi wa arechi to naru. Shikashi watashi wa kotogotoku wa kore o horobosanai.
Kono tame ni chi wa kanashimi, ue naru ten wa kuraku naru. Watashi ga sudeni kore o ii, kore o sadametakara da. Watashi wa kuinai, mata sore o suru koto o yamenai".
Dono machi no hito mo, kihei to ite no sakebi no tame ni nigete mori ni hairi, iwa ni noboru. Machi wa mina suterare, soko ni sumu hito wa nai.
Aa, arasareta onna yo, anata ga beni no kimono o ki, kin no kazari de mi o yosooi, me o nutte ookiku suru no wa, nan no tame ka. Anata ga utsukushiku shite mo, muda de aru. Anata no koibitora wa anata o iyashime, anata no inochi o motomete iru.
Watashi wa ko o umu onna no you na koe, ui go o umu onna no kurushimu you na koe o kiita. Shion no musume no aegu sakebi de aru. Ryoute o nobete kanojo wa iu, "Watashi wa wazawai da, watashi o korosu monora no mae ni watashi wa ki ga tooku naru" to.
Erusaremu no chimata o iki meguri, mite, shiru ga yoi. Sono hiroba o tazunete, kouhei o okonai, shinjitsu o motomeru mono ga, hitori de mo aru ka sagashite mi yo. Areba, watashi wa Erusaremu o yurusu.
Karera wa, "Shu wa ikite orareru" to iukeredo mo, jitsu wa, itsuwa tte chikau no da.
Shu yo, anata no me wa, shinjitsu o kaerimirarerude wa arimasen ka. Anata ga karera o utarete mo, itami o oboezu, karera o horobosarete mo, kora shime o ukeru koto o kobami, sono kao o iwa yori mo kataku shite, kuiaratameru koto o kobamimashita.
Sore de, watashi wa itta, "Korera wa tada mazushii oroka na hitobito de, Shu no michi to, kami no okite o shirimasen.
Watashi wa erai hitotachi no tokoro e itte, karera ni katarimasu. Karera wa Shu no michi o shiri, kami no okite o shitte imasu". Tokoro ga, karera mo mina onaji you ni, kubiki o ori, nawame o tatte ita.
Sore yue hayashi kara, shishi ga dete kite karera o koroshi, arano kara, ookami ga dete kite karera o horobosu. Hyou wa karera no machimachi o neratte iru. Soko kara deru mono wa mina sakareru. Karera no tsumi ga ooku, sono haishin ga hanahadashiikara de aru.
"Watashi wa dou shite anata o, yurusu koto ga dekiyou ka. Anata no kodomora wa, watashi o sutesari, kami de mo nai mono o sashite chikatta. Watashi ga karera o michi taraseta toki, karera wa kan'in o okonai, yuujo no ie ni mureatsumatta.
Karera wa koefutotta joubu na ouma no you ni, onoono, inanaite tonari no tsuma o shitau.
Watashi wa korera no koto no tame ni karera o basshinaide irareyou ka. Kono you na kokumin ni ada o kaesanaide arou ka" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Anata gata wa Yuda no budou no nami kinoaida o, nobotte itte, horobose, tada, kotogotoku horoboshite wa naranai. Sono eda o kirinozoke, Shu no mono de wa naikara de aru.
Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie to wa watashi ni mattaku fushin de atta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Karera wa Shu ni tsuite itsuwari katatte itta, 'Shu wa nanigoto mo nasarenai, wazawai wa wareware ni konai, mata tsurugi ya, kikin o miru koto wa nai.
Yogensha ra wa kaze to nari, karera no uchi ni kotoba wa nai. Karera wa kono you ni naru' to".
Sore yue bangun no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Karera ga kono kotoba o katatta no de, miyo, watashi wa anata no kuchi ni aru watashi no kotoba o hi to shi, kono tami o takigi to suru. Hi wa karera o yaki tsukusu".
Shu wa iwareru, "Isuraeru no ie yo, miyo, watashi wa tooi kuni no tami o anata gata no tokoro ni seme kosaseru. Sono kuni wa nagaku tsuzuku kuni, furui kuni de, anata gata wa sono kuni no kotoba o shirazu, hitobito no kataru no o satoru koto mo dekinai.
Sono ebira wa hiraita haka no you de ari, karera wa mina yuushi de aru.
Karera wa anata ga kariireta mono to, anata no ryoushoku to o kui tsukushi, anata no musuko musume o kui tsukushi, anata no hitsuji to ushi o kui tsukushi, anata no budou no ki to ichijiku no ki o kui tsukushi, mata tsurugi o motte, anata ga tanomi to suru kengo na machimachi o horobosu".
Shu wa iwareru, "Shikashi sono toki de mo, watashi wa kotogotoku wa anata o horobosanai.
Anata no tami ga, 'Dou shite wareware no kami, Shu wa korera no subete no koto o wareware ni nasareta no ka' to iunaraba, anata wa karera ni kotaenakereba naranai, 'Anata gata ga watashi o sutete, jibun no chi de kotonaru kamigami ni tsukaeta you ni, anata gata wa jibun no mono de nai chi de ihou no hito ni tsukaeru you ni naru' to".
Kore o Yakobu no ie ni nobe, mata Yuda ni shimeshite ie,
"Oroka de, satori mo naku, me ga atte mo miezu, mimi ga atte mo kikoenai tami yo, kore o kike.
Shu wa iwareru, anata gata wa watashi o osorenai no ka, watashi no mae ni ononokanai no ka. Watashi wa suna o oite umi no sakai to shi, kore o eien no genkai to shite, koeru koto ga dekinai you ni shita. Nami wa sakamaite mo, katsu koto wa dekinai, nari watatte mo, kore o koeru koto wa dekinai.
Tokoro ga, kono tami ni wa goujou na, somuku kokoro ga ari, karera wa wakimichi ni sorete, satte shimatta.
Karera wa 'Wareware ni ame o atae, aki no ame to haru no ame o toki ni shitagatte furase, wareware no tame ni kariire no toki o sadamerareta wareware no kami, Shu o osoreyou' to sono kokoro no uchi ni iwanai no da.
Anata gata no toga wa, korera no koto o shirizoke, anata gata no tsumi wa, yoi mono ga anata gata ni kuru no o samatageta.
Waga tami no uchi ni wa warui mono ga atte, tori o toru hito no you ni mi o kagamete ukagai, wana o oite hito o toraeru.
Kago ni tori ga michite iru you ni, karera no ie wa fugi no takara de michite iru. Sore yue, karera wa ooinaru mono, yuufuku na mono to nari,
Koete, tsuya ga ari, sono ashiki okonai ni wa saigen ga nai. Karera wa kousei ni, minashigo no uttae o sabaite, sore o tasukeyou to wa sezu, mata mazushii hito no uttae o sabakanai.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa kono you na koto no tame ni, karera o basshinaide arou ka. Watashi wa kono you na tami ni, ada o kaesanaide arou ka".
Odorokubeki koto, osorubeki koto ga kono chi ni okotte iru.
Yogensha wa itsuwatte yogen shi, saishi wa jibun no te ni yotte osame, waga tami wa kono you ni suru koto o aishite iru. Shikashi anata gata wa sono owari ni wa dou suru tsumori ka.
Beniyamin no hitobito yo, Erusaremu no naka kara hinan seyo. Tekoa de rappa o fuki, Betehakeremu ni aizu no hi o age yo. Kita kara wazawai ga nozomi, ooinaru horobi ga kurukara de aru.
Watashi wa utsukushii, taoyaka na Shion no musume o horobosu.
Bokushatachi wa, sono mure o hikiite kite, kanojo o seme, kanojo no shuui ni tenmaku o haru. Mure wa onoono sono tokoro de kusa o kuu.
"Tatakai o hajime, kanojo o semeyo. Tate, wareware wa mahiru ni kougeki shiyou". "Wazawai naru ka na, hi wa haya katamuki, yuuhi no kage wa nagaku natta".
"Tate, wareware wa yoru no aida ni kougeki shiyou, soshite kanojo no moromoro no kyuuden o hakai shiyou".
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa kanojo no ki o kiritaoshi, Erusaremu ni mukatte rui o kizuke. Kore wa batsusubeki machi de aru, sono uchi ni wa tada assei dake ga aru.
Ido ni atarashii mizu ga waku you ni kanojo wa sono aku o tsune ni arata ni nagasu. Sono uchi ni wa bougyaku to hametsu to ga kikoeru. Watashi no mae ni yamai to kizu to ga taenai.
Erusaremu yo, imashime o ukeireyo. Samo naito, watashi wa anata kara hanare, anata o arechi to shi, sumu hito no nai chi to suru".
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Budou no nokori o tsumitoru you ni, Isuraeru no nokori no tami o nokorazu tsumitore. Budou o tsumitoru hito no you ni, anata no te o futatabi sono eda ni nobase".
Watashi wa dare ni katari, dare o imashimete, kikaseyou ka. Miyo, karera no mimi wa tozasarete, kiku koto ga dekinai. Miyo, karera wa Shu no kotoba o azakeri, sore o yorokobanai.
Sore yue, watashi no mi ni wa Shu no ikari ga michi, sore o shinobu no ni, umi tsukarete iru. "Sore o chimata ni iru kodomora to, atsumatte iru wakai hitobito to ni morase. Otto mo tsuma mo, oita hito mo, toshi no hijou ni susunda hito mo toraerare,
Karera no ie to hatake to tsuma to wa tomo ni tanin ni wataru. Watashi ga te o nobashite, kono chi ni sumu mono o utsukara de aru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Sore wa karera ga, chiisai mono kara ookii mono made, mina fusei na ri o musabori, mata yogensha kara saishi ni itaru made, mina itsuwari o okonatte irukara da.
Karera wa, tegaru ni watashi no tami no kizu o iyashi, heian ga nai no ni 'Heian, heian' to itte iru.
Karera wa nikumubeki koto o shite, hajitade arou ka. Sukoshi mo hazukashii to wa omowazu, mata hajiru koto o shiranakatta. Sore yue karera wa taoreru mono to tomo ni taoreru. Watashi ga karera o bassuru toki, karera wa taoreru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa wakaremichi ni tatte, yoku mi, inishie no michi ni tsuki, yoi michi ga dore ka o tazunete, sono michi ni ayumi, soshite anata gata no tamashii no tame ni, ansoku o e yo. Shikashi karera wa kotaete, 'Wareware wa sono michi ni ayumanai' to itta.
Watashi wa anata gata no ue ni mihari bito o tate, 'Rappa no oto ni ki o tsukeyo' to itta. Shikashi karera wa kotaete, 'Wareware wa ki o tsukeru koto wa shinai' to itta.
Sore yue kuniguni no tami yo, kike. Kaishuu yo, karera ni dono you na koto ga okoru ka o shire.
Chi yo, kike. Miyo, watashi wa kono tami ni wazawai o kudasu. Sore wa karera no takurami no mi de aru. Karera ga watashi no kotoba ni ki o tsukezu, watashi no okite o sutetakara de aru.
Shiba kara, watashi no tokoro ni nyuukou ga ki, tooi kuni kara, shoubu ga kuru no wa nan no tame ka. Anata gata no hansai wa watashi ni wa yorokobashiku naku, anata gata no gisei mo ureshiku wa nai.
Sore yue Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Miyo, watashi wa kono tami no mae ni tsumazuku ishi o oku, hitobito wa chichi mo ko mo tomo ni sore ni tsumazuki, tonaribito mo sono tomo mo horobiru' ".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, tami ga kita no kuni kara kuru, ooinaru kokumin ga chi no hate kara okoru.
Karera wa yumi to yari o toru. Karera wa zannin de, awaremi ga naku, umi no you na hibiki o tateru. Shion no musume yo, karera wa uma ni nori, ikusahito no you ni mi o yorotte, anata o semeru".
Wareware wa sono uwasa o kiite, te wa yowari, ko o umu onna ni nozomu you na nayami to kurushimi to ni toraerareta.
Hatake ni dete wa naranai, mata michi o aruite wa naranai. Teki wa tsurugi o mochi, osore ga shihou ni arukara da.
Waga tami no musume yo, aranuno o mi ni matoi, hai no naka ni marobi, hitoriko o ushinatta toki no you ni, kanashimi, itaku nageke. Horobosu mono ga, niwaka ni wareware o osoukara da.
"Watashi wa anata o tami no uchi ni tatete, tamesu mono, kokoromiru mono to shita. Anata ga karera no michi o shiri, sore o tamesu koto ga dekiru you ni suru tame de aru.
Karera wa mina, goujou na hangyakusha de atte, aruki mawatte hito o soshiru. Karera wa seidou ya tetsu de atte, mina iyashii koto o okonau.
Fuigo wa hageshiku fuki, namari wa hi ni tokete tsuki, seiren wa itazura ni susumu. Ashiki mono ga mada nozokarenaikara de aru.
Shu ga karera o suterareta no de, karera wa suterareta gin to yobareru".
Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba wa kou de aru.
"Shu no ie no mon ni tachi, sono tokoro de, kono kotoba o nobete ie, Shu o ogamu tame ni, kono mon o hairu Yuda no subete no hito yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata no michi to anata gata no okonai o aratamerunaraba, watashi wa anatagata o kono tokoro ni sumawaseru.
Anata gata wa, 'Kore wa Shu no shinden da, Shu no shinden da, Shu no shinden da' to iu itsuwari no kotoba o tanomi to shite wa naranai.
Moshi anata ga taga, makoto ni, sono michi to okonai o aratamete, tagai ni kousei o okonai,
Kiryuu no takokujin to, minashigo to, yamome o shi etageru koto naku, tsumi no nai hito no chi o kono tokoro ni nagasu koto naku, mata, hoka no kamigami ni shitagatte mizukara gai o maneku koto o shinainaraba,
Watashi wa anatagata o, watashi ga mukashi anata gata no senzo ni ataeta kono chi ni eien ni sumawaseru.
Miyo, anata gata wa itsuwari no kotoba o tanomi to shite iruga, sore wa muda de aru.
Anata gata wa nusumi, koroshi, kan'in shi, itsuwatte chikai, Baaru ni kou o taki, anata gata ga izen ni wa shiranakatta ta no kamigami ni shitagainagara,
Watashi no na o motte, tonaerareru kono ie ni kite watashi no mae ni tachi, 'Wareware wa sukuwareta' to ii, shikamo subete korera nikumubeki koto o okonau no wa, dou shita koto ka.
Watashi no na o motte, tonaerareru kono ie ga, anata gata no me ni wa touzoku no su to mieru no ka. Watashi jishin, sou mita to Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi ga hajime ni watashi no na o oita basho Shiro e iki, waga tami Isuraeru no aku no tame ni, watashi ga sono basho ni taishite okonatta koto o miyo.
Shu wa iwareru, ima anata gata wa korera no subete no koto o okonatte iru. Mata watashi wa anata gata ni, shikiri ni katattakeredo mo, anata gata wa kikazu, anatagata o yondakeredo mo kotaenakatta.
Sore yue watashi wa Shiro ni taishite okonatta you ni, watashi no na o motte, tonaerareru kono ie ni mo okonau. Sunawachi anata gata ga tanomi to suru tokoro, watashi ga anata gata to, anata gata no senzo ni ataeta kono tokoro ni okonau.
Soshite watashi wa, anata gata no subete no kyoudai, sunawachi Efuraimu no subete no shison o suteta you ni, watashi no mae kara anatagata o mo suteru.
Anata wa kono tami no tame ni inotte wa naranai. Karera no tame ni nageki, inotte wa naranai. Mata watashi ni, torinashi o shite wa naranai. Watashi wa anata no motome o kikanai.
Anata wa karera ga Yuda no machimachi to, Erusaremu no chimata deshite iru koto o minai no ka.
Kodomora wa, takigi o atsume, chichitachi wa hi o taki, onna wa kona o kone, pan o tsukutte kore o tenkou ni sonaeru. Mata karera wa ta no kamigami no mae ni sake o sosoide, watashi o ikaraseru.
Shu wa iwareru, karera ga ikaraseru no wa watashi na no ka. Jibuntachi jishin de wa nai no ka. Soshite mizukara urotaete iru.
Sore yue Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi no ikari to ikidoori o, kono tokoro to, hito to kemono to, hatake no ki to, chi no sanbutsu to ni sosogu. Ikari wa moete kieru koto ga nai".
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata no gisei ni hansai no mono o awasete niku o taberu ga yoi.
Sore wa anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita hi ni, watashi wa hansai to gisei to ni tsuite karera ni katatta koto mo naku, mata meijita koto mo naikara de aru.
Tada watashi wa kono imashime o karera ni ataete itta, 'Watashi no koe ni kiki shitagai nasai. Sou sureba, watashi wa anata gata no kami to nari, anata gata wa watashi no tami to naru. Watashi ga anata gata ni meijiru subete no michi o ayunde saiwai o e nasai' to.
Shikashi karera wa kikishitagawazu, mimi o katamukezu, jibun no warui kokoro no hakarigoto to goujou ni shitagatte ayumi, waruku naru bakari de, yoku wa naranakatta.
Anata gata no senzo ga Ejiputo no chi o deta hi kara konnichi made, watashi wa watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi o hibi karera ni tsukawashita.
Shikashi karera wa watashi ni kikazu, mimi o katamukenaide goujou ni nari, senzotachi ni mo masatte aku o okonatta.
Tatoi anata ga karera ni kono subete no kotoba o katatte mo karera wa kikanai. Mata karera o yonde mo anata ni kotaenai.
Sore yue, anata wa kou karera ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Kore wa sono kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, sono imashime o ukeirenakatta kokumin de aru. Shinjitsu wa use, karera no kuchi kara taeta.
Anata no kaminoke o kitte suteyo, hadaka no yama no ue ni nageki no koe o age yo. Shu ga, oikari ni natte iru yo no hito o shirizoke suteraretakara da'.
Shu wa iwareru, Yuda no tami wa watashi no mae ni aku o okonai, watashi no na o motte tonaerareru ie ni, nikumubeki mono o oite soko o kegashita.
Mata Benhinnomu no tani ni aru Topete no takaki tokoro o kizuite, musuko musume o hi ni yaita. Watashi wa sore o meijita koto wa naku, mata sono you na koto o kangaeta koto mo nakatta.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue ni miyo, sono tokoro o Topete, mata wa Benhinnomu no tani to yobanaide, hofuri no tani to yobu hi ga kuru. Sore wa hoka ni basho ga nai no de, Topete ni houmurukara de aru.
Kono tami no shitai wa sora no tori to chi no kemono no shokumotsu to nari, kore o oiharau mono mo nai.
Sono toki watashi wa Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu no chimata ni, yorokobi no koe, tanoshimi no koe, hanamuko no koe, hanayome no koe o tayasu. Kono chi wa are haterukara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, sono toki Yuda no outachi no hone to, sono tsukasatachi no hone to, saishitachi no hone to, yogensha tachi no hone to, Erusaremu ni sumu hitobito no hone wa haka yori horidasarete,
Karera no aishi, tsukae, shitagai, motome, mata oganda, hi to tsuki to ten no shuu gun no mae ni sarasareru. Sono hone wa atsumeru mono mo houmuru mono mo naku, chi no omote ni fundo no you ni naru.
Kono ashiki tami no uchi no nokotte iru nokori no mono wa mina, watashi ga oiyatta basho de, ikiru koto yori mo shinu koto o negau you ni naruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Anata wa karera ni iwanakereba naranai. Shu wa kou ooserareru, hito wa taoretanaraba, mata okiagaranaide arou ka. Hanarete ittanaraba, kaette konaide arou ka.
Sore ni dou shite kono tami wa, tsune ni somuite hanarete iku no ka. Karera wa itsuwari o kataku toraete, kaette kuru koto o kobande iru.
Watashi wa ki o tsukete kiitaga, karera wa tadashiku wa kataranakatta. Sono aku o kuite, 'Watashi no shita koto wa nani ka' to iu mono wa hitori mo nai. Karera wa mina senjou ni, hase iru uma no you ni, jibun no suki na michi ni mukau.
Sora no kounotori de mo sono toki o shiri, yamabato to, tsubame to, tsuru wa sono kuru toki o mamoru. Shikashi waga tami wa Shu no okite o shiranai.
Dou shite anata gata wa, 'Wareware ni wa chie ga aru, Shu no okite ga aru' to iu koto ga dekiyou ka. Miyo, makoto ni shoki no itsuwari no fude ga kore o itsuwari ni shita no da.
Chie aru mono wa, hazukashimerare, awatefutameki, toraerareru. Miyo, karera wa Shu no kotoba o suteta, karera ni nan no chie ga arou ka.
Sore yue, watashi wa karera no tsuma o tanin ni atae, sono hatake o seifukusha ni ataeru. Sore wa karera ga chiisai mono kara ookii mono ni itaru made, mina fusei na ri o musabori, yogensha kara saishi ni itaru made, mina itsuwari o itte irukara de aru.
Karera wa tegaru ni, watashi no tami no kizu o iyashi, heian ga nai no ni, 'Heian, heian' to itte iru.
Karera wa nikumubeki koto o shite, hajitade arou ka. Sukoshi mo hazukashii to wa omowazu, mata hajiru koto o shiranakatta. Sore yue karera wa taoreru mono to tomo ni taoreru. Watashi ga karera o bassuru toki, karera wa taoreruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi ga atsumeyou to omou toki, budou no ki ni budou wa naku, ichijiku no ki ni, ichijiku wa naku, ha sae, shibonde iru. Watashi ga karera ni ataeta mono mo, karera o hanarete, use satta".
Dou shite wareware wa nasu koto mo naku zashite iru no ka. Atsumatte, kengo na machi ni hairi, soko de wareware wa horobiyou. Wareware ga Shu ni tsumi o okashita no de, wareware no kami, Shu ga wareware o horobosou to shite, doku no mizu o nomaserareru no da.
Wareware wa heian o nozondaga, yoi koto wa konakatta. Iya sareru toki o nozondaga, kaette kyoufu ga kita.
"Karera no uma no inanaki wa Dan kara kikoete kuru. Karera no tsuyoi uma no koe ni yotte zenchi wa furuu. Karera wa kite, kono chi to, koko ni aru subete no mono, machi to, sono uchi ni sumu mono to o kuihorobosu.
Miyo, mahou o motte narasu koto no dekinai, hebi ya, mamushi o anata gata no uchi ni tsukawasu. Sore wa anatagata o kamu" to Shu wa iwareru.
Waga nageki wa iyashigataku, waga kokoro wa uchi ni nayamu.
Kike, chi no zenmen kara, waga tami no musume no koe ga agaru no o. "Shu wa Shion ni orarenai no ka, Shion no ou wa sono uchi ni orarenai no ka". "Naze karera wa sono chouzou to, ihou no guuzou to o motte, watashi o ikaraseta no ka".
"Kariire no toki wa sugi, natsu mohaya owatta, shikashi wareware wa mada sukuwarenai".
Waga tami no musume no kizu ni yotte, waga kokoro wa itamu. Watashi wa nageki, urotaeru.
Gireade ni nyuukou ga aru de wa nai ka. Sono tokoro ni isha ga irude wa nai ka. Sore ni dou shite waga tami no musume wa iyasareru koto ga nai no ka.
Aa, watashi no atama ga mizu to nari, watashi no me ga namida no izumi to nareba yoi no ni. Sou sureba, watashi wa tami no musume no korosareta mono no tame ni hiru mo yoru mo nageku koto ga dekiru.
Aa, watashi ga arano ni, taishou no yado o eru koto ga dekireba yoi no ni. Sou sureba, watashi wa tami o hanarete satte iku koto ga dekiru. Karera wa mina kan'in suru mono, fushin no tomogara dakara de aru.
Karera wa yumi o hiku you ni, sono shita o mageru. Shinjitsu de wa naku, itsuwari ga kono chi ni tsuyoku natta. Karera wa aku yori aku ni susumi, mata watashi o shiranaito, Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa onoono tonaribito ni ki o tsukeyo. Dono kyoudai o mo shinjite wa naranai. Kyoudai wa mina, oshinokeru mono de ari, tonaribito wa mina, nonoshitte aruku mono dakara de aru.
Hito wa mina, sono tonaribito o azamuki, shinjitsu o iu mono wa nai. Karera wa jibun no shita ni itsuwari o iu koto o oshie, aku o okonai, tsukarete kuiaratameru itoma mo naku,
Shi etage ni, shi etage o tsumikasane, itsuwari ni itsuwari o tsumikasane, watashi o shiru koto o kobande iruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Sore yue bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa karera o tokashi, kokoromiru. Kono hoka, waga tami o dou suru koto ga dekiyou.
Karera no shita wa korosu ya no you da, sore wa itsuwari o iu. Sono kuchi de wa onoono tonaribito ni odayaka ni kataruga, sono kokoro de wa kare o machibuseru hakarigoto o tateru.
Shu wa iwareru, korera no koto no tame ni, watashi ga karera o basshinaidarou ka. Watashi ga kono you na tami ni ada o kaesanaidarou ka.
Yama no tame ni nakisakebi, no no makiba no tame ni kanashime. Korera wa are sutarete, toorisugiru hito mo nai. Koko ni wa ushi, hitsuji no naku koe mo kikoezu, sora no tori mo kemono mo mina nigesatta.
Watashi wa Erusaremu o arezuka to shi, yamainu no su to suru. Mata Yuda no machimachi o arashite, sumu hito mo nai tokoro to suru".
Chie ga atte, kore o satoru koto no dekiru hito wa dare ka. Shu no kuchi no kotoba o ukete, sore o shimesu hito wa dare ka. Kono chi ga horobosarete arano no you ni nari, toorisugiru hito mo nakunatta no wa dou iu wake ka.
Shu wa iwareru, "Sore wa karera no mae ni watashi ga tateta okite o karera ga sutete, watashi no koe ni kikishitagawazu, sono toori ni arukanakattakara de aru.
Karera wa goujou ni jibun no kokoro ni shitagai, mata senzo no oshieta you ni Baaru ni shitagatta.
Sore yue bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kono tami ni, nigayomogi o tabesase, doku no mizu o nomase,
Karera mo, sono senzotachi mo shiranakatta kunibito no uchi ni karera o chirashi, mata karera o horoboshi tsukusu made, sono ushiro ni, tsurugi o tsukawasu".
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Yoku kangaete, nakionna o yobe. Mata hito o tsukawashite takumi na onna o maneke.
Karera ni isoide kosase, wareware no tame ni nakikanashimasete, wareware no me ni namida o kobosase, mabuta kara mizu o afuresase yo.
Shion kara kanashimi no koe ga kikoeru. Sore wa iu, 'Aa, wareware wa horobosare, itaku, hazukashimerarete iru. Wareware wa sono chi o sari, karera ga wareware no sumika o kowashitakara da' ".
Onnatachi yo, Shu no kotoba o kike. Anata gata no mimi ni, sono kuchi no kotoba o ireyo. Anata gata no musume ni kanashimi no uta o oshie, onoono sono tonaribito ni aitou no uta o oshie yo.
Shi ga wareware no mado ni nobotte ki, wareware no teitaku no naka ni hairi, chimata ni iru kodomora o tayashi, hiroba ni iru wakai hitotachi o korosou to shite irukara da.
Anata wa kou ii nasai, "Shu wa iwareru, 'Hito no shitai ga fundo no you ni, no ni taorete iru you ni nari, mata kariire suru hito no ushiro ni nokotte, dare mo atsumeru koto o shinai taba no you ni naru' ".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Chie aru hito wa sono chie o hokotte wa naranai. Chikara aru hito wa sono chikara o hokotte wa naranai. Tomeru mono wa sono tomi o hokotte wa naranai.
Hokoru mono wa kore o hokori to seyo. Sunawachi, satoku atte, watashi o shitte iru koto, watashi ga Shu de atte, chi ni, itsukushimito kouhei to seigi o itte iru mono de aru koto o shiru koto ga sore de aru. Watashi wa korera no koto o yorokobuto, Shu wa iwareru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Miyo, kono you na hi ga kuru. Sono hi ni wa, katsurei o ukete mo, kokoro ni katsurei o ukete inai subete no hito o watashi wa bassuru.
Ejiputo, Yuda, Edomu, Anmon no hitobito, Moabu, oyobi no ni ite, kaminoke no sumizumi o soru hitobito wa sore de aru. Korera no kunibito wa mina katsurei o ukete inai mono de ari, Isuraeru no zenka mo mina kokoro ni katsurei o ukete inai mono de aru".
Isuraeru no ie yo, Shu no anata gata ni katarareru kotoba o kike.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Ihou no hito no michi ni naratte wa naranai. Mata ihou no hito ga ten ni arawareru shirushi o osorete mo, anata gata wa sore o osorete wa naranai.
Ihou no tami no narawashi wa munashiikara da. Karera no suuhai suru mono wa, hayashi kara kiridashita ki de, mokkou no te de, ono o motte tsukutta mono da.
Hitobito wa gin ya kin o motte, sore o kazari, kugi to tsuchi o motte ugokanai you ni sore o tomeru.
Sono guuzou wa, kyuuri hatake no kakashi no you de, mono o iu koto ga dekinai. Aruku koto mo dekinaikara, hito ni hakonde morawanakereba naranai. Sore o osoreru ni oyobanai. Sore wa wazawai o kudasu koto ga dekizu, mata saiwai o kudasu chikara mo naikara da".
Shu yo, anata ni narabi uru mono wa arimasen. Anata wa ooinaru mono de ari, anata no na mo sono chikara no tame ni ooinaru mono de arimasu.
Bankoku no ou de aru anata o, osorenai mono ga arimashou ka. Anata o osoreru no wa touzen no koto de arimasu. Bankoku no subete no chie aru mono no uchi ni mo, sono kuniguni no uchi ni mo, anata ni narabi uru mono wa arimasen.
Karera wa mina, oroka de nibuku, guuzou no oshie wa, tada ki ni suginai.
Ginpaku wa Tarushishi kara torai shi, kin wa Upazu kara tazusaete kuru. Korera wa koujin to kin zaikunin no kousaku de aru. Karera no kimono wa sumireiro to murasakiiro de aru. Korera wa mina takumi na saikunin no tsukutta mono de aru.
Shikashi Shu wa makoto no kami de aru. Ikita kami de ari, eien no ou de aru. Sono ikari ni yotte chi wa furui ugoki, bankoku wa sono ikidoori ni ataru koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata wa karera ni, kou iwanakereba naranai, "Tenchi o tsukuranakatta kamigami wa chi no ue, ten no shita kara horobisaru" to.
Shu wa sono chikara o motte chi o tsukuri, sono chie o motte sekai o tate, sono satori o motte ten o noberareta.
Kare ga koe o dasareruto, ten ni ooku no mizu no zawameki ga ari, mata chi no hate kara kiri o tachiagaraserareru. Kare wa ame no tame ni, ina bi kari o okoshi, sono kura kara kaze o toridasareru.
Subete no hito wa oroka de chie ga naku, subete no kin zaikunin wa sono tsukutta guuzou no tame ni haji o koumuru. Sono guuzou wa itsuwari mono de, sono uchi ni iki ga naikara da.
Korera wa, munashii mono de, mayoi no waza de aru. Basserareru toki ni horobiru mono de aru.
Yakobu no bun de aru kare wa kono you na mono de wa nai. Kare wa banbutsu no tsukurinushi dakara de aru. Isuraeru wa kare no shigyou to shite no buzoku de aru. Kare no na o bangun no Shu to iu.
Kakomi no naka ni oru mono yo, anata no tsutsumi o chi kara toriage yo.
Shu ga kou iwarerukara da, "Miyo, watashi wa kono tabi, kono chi ni sumu mono o nagesuteru. Katsu karera o seme nayamashite, omoishiraseru".
Watashi wa i tade o uketa, aa, wazawai naru ka na, watashi no kizu wa omoi. Shikashi watashi wa itta, "Makoto ni, kore wa nayami de aru. Watashi wa kore o shinobanakereba naranai" to.
Watashi no tenmaku wa yabure, tsuna wa kotogotoku kire, kodomotachi wa watashi o sutete itte, inaku natta. Mohaya watashi no tenmaku o haru mono wa naku, maku o kakeru mono mo nai.
Bokusha wa oroka de atte, Shu ni tou koto o shinaikara de aru. Sore yue karera wa sakaeru koto mo naku, sono mure wa mina chiri satte iru.
Kikeyo, uwasa no aru no o. Miyo, kita no kuni kara ooinaru sawagi ga kuru. Kore wa Yuda no machimachi o arashite yamainu no su to suru.
Shu yo, watashi wa shitte imasu, hito no michi wa jishin ni yoru no de wa naku, ayumu hito ga, sono ayumi o jibun de kimeru koto no dekinai koto o.
Shu yo, watashi o korashite kudasai. Tadashii michi ni shitagatte, ikarazu ni korashite kudasai. Samo naito, watashi wa mu ni kishite shimaudeshou.
Anata o shiranai kunitami to, anata no na o tonaenai hitobito ni anata no ikari o sosoide kudasai. Karera wa Yakobu o kui tsukushi kore o kui tsukushite horoboshi, sono sumika o arashitakara desu.
Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba wa iu,
"Kono keiyaku no kotoba o kiki, Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu mono ni tsuge yo.
Karera ni ie, Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, kono keiyaku no kotoba ni shitagawanai hito wa, norowareru.
Kono keiyaku wa, watashi ga anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo no chi, tetsu no kamado no naka kara michibikidashita toki ni, karera ni meijita tokoro no mono de aru. Sunawachi, sono toki watashi wa karera ni itta, watashi no koe o kiki, anata gata ni meijiru subete no koto o okonaunaraba, anata gata wa watashi no tami to nari, watashi wa anata gata no kami to naru.
Soshite, watashi ga anata gata no senzo ni, chichi to mitsu to no nagareru chi o ataeru to chikatta koto o, nashitogeru to. Sunawachi konnichi no toori de aru". Sono toki watashi wa, "Shu yo, oose no toori desu" to kotaeta.
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Kono subete no kotoba o, Yuda no machimachi to, Erusaremu no chimata ni tsuge shimeshi, kono keiyaku no kotoba o kiki, kore o okonae, to ii nasai.
Watashi wa, anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita toki kara konnichi ni itaru made, ogosoka ni karera o imashime, taezu imashimete, watashi no koe ni kikishitagau you ni to itta.
Shikashi karera wa shitagawazu, sono mimi o katamukezu, onoono jibun no warui goujou na kokoro ni shitagatte ayunda. Sore yue, watashi wa kono keiyaku no kotoba o motte karera o semeta. Kore wa watashi ga karera ni okonae to meijitaga, okonawanakatta mono de aru".
Shu wa mata watashi ni iwareta, "Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu mono no uchi ni hangyaku no koto ga aru.
Karera wa, watashi no kotoba o kiku koto o kobanda sono senzotachi no tsumi ni tachikaeri, mata hoka no kamigami ni shitagatte sore ni tsukaeta. Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie to wa, watashi ga sono senzotachi to musunda keiyaku o yabutta.
Sore yue Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa wazawai o karera no ue ni kudasu. Karera wa sore o manukareru koto wa dekinai. Karera ga watashi o yonde mo, watashi wa kikanai.
Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu ni sumu mono wa, itte, jibuntachi ga sore ni kou o taite iru kamigami ni yobimotomeruga, korera wa, karera no wazawai no toki ni mo kesshite karera o sukuu koto wa dekinai.
Yuda yo, anata no kamigami wa, anata no machi no kazu hodo ooku natta. Mata anata gata wa Erusaremu no chimata no kazu hodo no saidan o hazubeki mono no tame ni tateta. Sunawachi Baaru ni kou o taku tame no saidan de aru.
Sore yue, kono tami no tame ni inotte wa naranai. Mata karera no tame ni naki, aruiha inorimotomete wa naranai. Karera ga sono wazawai no toki ni, watashi ni yobawatte mo, watashi wa karera ni kiku koto o shinaikara da.
Waga aisuru mono wa, watashi no ie de nani o suru no ka. Sudeni kore wa akuji o okonatta. Seigan to gisei no niku to ga anata ni wazawai o manukaresaseru koto ga dekirude arou ka. Sore de anata wa yorokobu koto ga dekirude arou ka.
Shu wa anata o, katsute wa 'Yoi mi no naru utsukushii aoao to shita oribu no ki' to yobaretaga, hageshii boufuu no todoroki to tomo ni, Shu wa sore ni hi o kake, sono eda o yakiharawareru no de aru.
Anata o ueta bangun no Shu wa, anata ni mukatte wazawai o iiwatasareta. Kore wa Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie to ga aku o okonai, Baaru ni kou o taite, watashi o ikarasetakara de aru".
Shu ga shirasete kudasatta no de, watashi wa sore o shitta. Sono toki, anata wa karera no ashiki waza o watashi ni shimesareta.
Shikashi watashi wa, hofurare ni iku, otonashii kohitsuji no you de, karera ga watashi o gaishiyou to, hakarigoto o megurashite iru no o shiranakatta. Karera wa iu, "Saa, ki to sono mi o tomo ni horobosou. Ikeru mono no chi kara kare o tatte, sono na o hito ni wasuresaseyou".
Tadashii sabaki o shi, hito no kokoro to omoi o sagurareru bangun no Shu yo, watashi wa jibun no uttae o anata ni omakase shimashita. Anata ga karera ni ada o kaesareru no o misasete kudasai.
Sore yue Shu wa Anatote no hitobito ni tsuite kou iwareru, karera wa anata no inochi o torou to motomete iu, "Shu no na ni yotte yogen shite wa naranai. Sore o surunaraba, anata wa wareware no te ni kakatte shinude arou".
Sore de bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa karera o bassuru. Wakai hito wa tsurugi de shini, karera no musuko musume wa, kikin de shini,
Dare mo nokoru mono wa nai. Watashi ga Anatote no hitobito ni wazawai o kudashi, karera o bassuru toshi o kosaserukara de aru".
Shu yo, watashi ga anata to ronji arasou toki, anata wa tsune ni tadashii. Shikashi nao, watashi wa anata no mae ni, sabaki no koto o ronjite mitai. Akunin no michi ga sakae, fushinjitsu na mono ga mina han'ei suru no wa naniyue desu ka.
Anata ga karera o uerareta no de, karera wa nezuki, sodatte, mi o musubimasu. Karera wa kuchi de wa anata ni chikazukimasuga, kokoro wa anata kara toozakatte imasu.
Shu yo, anata wa watashi o shiri, watashi o mi, watashi no kokoro ga anata ni taishite ikani aru ka o kokoromiraremasu. Hofuru tame ni hitsuji o hikidasu you ni, karera o hikidashi, korosu hi ni sonaete, karera o nokoshite oite kudasai.
Itsu made, kono chi wa nageki, dono hatake no yasai mo karete ite yoideshou ka. Kono chi ni sumu mono no aku ni yotte, kemono to tori wa horobi usemasu. Hitobito wa iimashita, "Kare wa wareware no owari o miru koto wa nai" to.
"Moshi anata ga, toho no hito to kyousou shite tsukarerunara, dou shite kiba no hito to kisou koto ga dekiyou ka. Moshi anzen na chi de, anata ga taorerunara, Yorudan no mitsurin de wa, dou suru tsumori ka.
Anata no kyoudaitachi, anata no chichi no ie no mono sae, anata o azamuki, oogoe o agete, anata o otte iru. Karera ga shitashige ni anata ni kataru koto ga atte mo, karera o shinjite wa naranai".
"Watashi wa wagaie o hanare, waga shigyou o sute, waga tamashii no aisuru mono o teki no te ni watashita.
Watashi no shigyou wa, watashi ni totte hayashi no naka no shishi no you ni natta. Kore wa watashi ni mukatte sono koe o ageru. Sore yue watashi wa kore o nikumu.
Watashi no shigyou wa, watashi ni totte, hanten no aru moukin no you de wa nai ka. Ta no moukin ga kore o kakonde irude wa nai ka. Itte, no no kemono o mina atsume, tsurete kite kore o tabesase yo.
Ooku no bokushatachi wa watashi no budou hatake o horoboshi, watashi no chi o fumiarashita. Watashi no uruwashii chi o areta no ni shita.
Karera wa kore o arechi to shite shimatta. Sono arechi ga watashi ni mukatte nageku no da. Zenchi wa arechi ni sareta. Shikashi, hitori mo kore o kokoro ni tomeru mono wa nai.
Horobosu monodomo ga arano no subete no, hageyama no ue ni kita. Shu no tsurugi ga, chi no, kono hate kara, kano hate made o horobosu no da. Inochi aru mono wa yasuraka de aru koto ga dekinai.
Karera wa mugi o maite, ibara o karitoru. Kurou shite mo nan no rieki mo nai. Karera wa sono shuukaku o hajiru you ni naru. Shu no hageshii ikari ni yotte de aru".
Watashi ga waga tami Isuraeru ni tsugaseta shigyou ni te o fureru subete no warui tonaribito ni tsuite, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa karera o sono chi kara nukidashi, Yuda no ie o karera no uchi kara nukidasu.
Watashi wa, karera o nukidashita nochi ni, mata karera o awarende, sorezore sono shigyou ni michibiki kaeshi, onoono o, sono chi ni kaeraseru.
Moshi karera ga watashi no tami no michi o manabi, watashi no na ni yotte, 'Shu wa ikite orareru' to itte chikau koto ga, katsute karera ga watashi no tami ni oshiete Baaru o sashite chikawaseta you ni narunaraba, karera wa watashi no tami no uchi ni taterareru.
Shikashi mimi o kasanai tami ga aru toki wa, watashi wa sono tami o nukidashite horobosuto, Shu wa iwareru".
Shu wa watashi ni kou iwareta, "Itte, amanuno no obi o kai, koshi ni musube. Mizu ni tsukete wa naranai".
Soko de, watashi wa Shu no kotoba ni shitagai, obi o katte koshi ni musunda.
Shu no kotoba wa, futatabi watashi ni nozonde itta,
"Anata ga katte koshi ni musunde iru obi o te ni tori, tatte Yufurate no kawa e iki, sono tokoro no iwa no sakeme ni kore o kakuse".
Watashi wa Shu ga meijirareta you ni, itte, kore o Yufurate no kawa no hotori ni kakushita.
Ooku no hi o hete nochi, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Tatte, Yufurate no kawa e iki, anata ni meijite, soko ni kakusaseta obi o sono tokoro kara totte ki nasai".
Soko de watashi wa Yufurate no kawa e iki, chi o hotte, kakushita tokoro kara obi o toridashitaga, sono obi wa sokonawarete, yaku ni tatanaku natte ita.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Shu wa kou ooserareru, kore to onaji you ni, watashi wa Yuda no takaburi to Erusaremu no ooinaru takaburi o, yaburu no de aru.
Kono ashiki tami wa watashi no kotoba o kiku koto o kobami, jibun no kokoro o goujou ni shite ayumi, mata ta no kamigami ni shitagatte kore ni tsukae, kore o ogande iru. Karera wa kono obi no you ni, nan no yaku ni mo tatanaku naru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Obi ga hito no koshi ni tsuku you ni, Isuraeru no subete no ie to Yuda no subete no ie to o watashi ni tsukase, kore o watashi no tami to shi, na to shi, homare to shi, sakae to shiyou to shita. Shikashi karera wa kikishitagaou to mo shinakatta".
"Anata wa kono kotoba o karera ni kataranakereba naranai, 'Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, saketsubo ni wa, mina sake ga michiru' to. Karera wa anata ni iude arou, 'Saketsubo ni, mina sake ga michiru koto o wareware ga shiranai koto ga arou ka' to.
Sono toki, anata wa karera ni iwanakereba naranai, 'Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kono chi ni sumu subete no mono to, Dabide no kurai ni zasu outachi to, saishi to yogensha oyobi Erusaremu ni sumu subete no mono ni yoi o mitashi,
Karera o tagai ni uchiatete kudaku. Chichi to ko o mo sono you ni suruto, Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa karera o awaremazu, oshimazu, kawaisou to mo omowazu ni horobosu' to".
Mimi o katamukete kike, takabutte wa naranai, Shu ga okatari ni narukara de aru.
Shu ga mada yami o okosarenai uchi ni, mata anata gata no ashi ga usukura gari no yama ni tsumazukanai uchi ni, anata gata no kami, Shu ni eikou o kise yo. Samo naito, anata gata ga hikari o nozonde iru aida ni, Shu wa sore o ankoku ni kae, sore o kurayami to sarerukara de aru.
Moshi anata gata ga kikanainaraba, watashi no tamashii wa hisoka na tokoro de, anata gata no takaburi no tame ni kanashimu. Mata Shu no mure ga, kasumerareta tame ni, watashi no me wa itaku naite, namida o nagasu no de aru.
Ou to taikou to ni tsugeyo, "Anata gata wa hikui za ni suwari nasai. Uruwashii kanmuri wa sudeni anata gata no atama kara ochite shimattakara desu".
Negebu no machimachi wa tozasarete, kore o hiraku hito ga nai. Yuda wa mina toraeutsusareru, kotogotoku toraeutsusareru.
"Me o agete, kita no hou kara kuru mono o miyo, anata ni tamawatta mure, anata no uruwashii mure wa doko ni iru no ka.
Karera ga anata no shitashimi nareta hitotachi o, anata no ue ni tatete kashira to suru toki, anata wa nani o iou to suru no ka. Anata no kurushimi wa, ko o umu onna no kurushimi no you de naide arou ka.
Anata ga kokoro no uchi ni, 'Dou shite kono you na koto ga watashi ni tatta no ka' to iunaraba, anata no tsumi ga omoi yue ni, anata no kimono no suso wa agerare, hazukashime o ukeru no da.
Echiopiya bito wa sono hifu o kaeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Hyou wa sono hanten o kaeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Moshi sore ga dekirunaraba, aku ni nareta anata gata mo, zen o okonau koto ga dekiru.
Watashi wa anatagata o chirashi, no no kaze ni fukichirasareru momigara no you ni suru.
Shu wa iwareru, kore ga anata ni sazukerareta sadame, watashi ga hakatte anata ni ataeru bun de aru. Anata ga watashi o wasurete, itsuwari o tanomi to shitakara da.
Watashi wa mata anata no kimono no suso o kao made agete, anata no haji o arawasu.
Watashi wa anata no nikumubeki okonai, anata no kan'in to, inanaki, no no oka no ue de okonatta anata no midara na okonai o mita. Erusaremu yo, anata wa wazawai da, anata no kiyomerareru no wa itsu no koto de arou ka".
Hideri no koto ni tsuite Eremiya ni nozonda Shu no kotoba.
"Yuda wa kanashimi, sono machimachi no mon wa katamuki, tami wa chi ni zashite nageki, Erusaremu no sakebi wa agaru.
Sono kimitachi wa, shimobe o tsukawashite mizu o kumaseru. Karera ga ido no tokoro ni kite mo, mizu wa mitsukarazu, munashii utsuwa o motte kaeri, haji, katsu touwaku shite, sono atama o oou.
Chi ni ame ga furazu, tsuchi ga, kawaite wareta tame, noufu wa hajite, sono atama o oou.
No ni iru me jika de sae mo ko o unde, kore o suteru. Kusa ga naikara de aru.
No roba wa, hageyama no ue ni tatte, yamainu no you ni aegi, kusa no nai tame ni, sono me wa kuramu.
Shu yo, wareware no tsumi ga wareware o uttaete furi na shougen o shite mo, anata no na no tame ni, koto o nashite kudasai. Wareware no haishin no kazu wa ooku, anata ni mukatte tsumi o okashimashita.
Isuraeru no nozomi naru Shu yo, nayami no toki no sukuinushi yo, naze, anata wa kono chi ni sumu ihou no hito no you ni shi, mata ichiya no yadori no tame ni tachiyoru tabibito no you ni nasaraneba naranai no desu ka.
Naze, anata wa, urotaete iru hito no you ni shi, mata hito o sukui enai yuushi no you ni nasaraneba naranai no desu ka. Shu yo, anata wa wareware no uchi ni iraseraremasu. Wareware wa, mina ni yotte yobarete iru mono desu. Wareware o misutenaide kudasai".
Kono tami ni tsuite Shu wa kou iwareru, "Karera wa kono you ni kononde, samayoi, sono ashi o todomeru koto o shinakatta no de, Shu wa karera o yorokobazu, ima sono toga o oboe, sono tsumi o bassuru no da".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Kono tami no tame ni megumi o inotte wa naranai.
Karera ga danjiki shite mo, watashi wa karera no yobu no o kikanai. Hansai to sosai o sasagete mo, watashi wa sore o ukenai. Kaette, tsurugi to, kikin, oyobi ekibyou o motte, karera o horoboshite shimau".
Watashi wa itta, "Aa, Shu naru kami yo, yogensha tachi wa kono tami ni mukai, 'Anata gata wa, tsurugi o miru koto wa nai. Kikin mo konai. Watashi wa kono tokoro ni tashika na heian o anata gata ni ataeru' to itte imasu".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Yogensha ra wa watashi no na ni yotte itsuwari no yogen o shite iru. Watashi wa karera o tsukawasanakatta. Mata karera ni meijita koto mo naku, hanashita koto mo nai. Karera wa itsuwari no mokushi to, yaku ni tatanai uranai, oyobi jibun no kokoro de tsukuriageta azamuki o anata gata ni yogen shite iru no da.
Sore yue, watashi ga tsukawasanai no ni, watashi no na ni yotte yogen shite, 'Tsurugi to kikin wa, kono chi ni konai' to itte iru ano yogensha ni tsuite, Shu wa kou ooserareru, kono yogensha ra wa, tsurugi to kikin ni horobosareru.
Mata karera no yogen o kiku tami wa, kikin to tsurugi to ni yotte, Erusaremu no chimata ni nagesuterareru. Dare mo kore o houmuru mono wa nai. Karera to sono tsuma, oyobi sono musuko musume mo douyou de aru. Watashi ga karera no aku o sono ue ni sosogukara de aru.
Kono kotoba o karera ni katare, 'Watashi no me wa yoru mo hiru mo taezu namida o nagasu. Waga tami no musume de aru otome ga ookina kizu to omoi dageki ni yotte horobosarerukara de aru.
Watashi ga dete hatake ni ikuto, tsurugi de korosareta mono ga aru. Machi ni hairuto, kikin de yande iru mono ga aru. Yogensha mo saishi mo tomo ni sono chi ni samayotte, shiru tokoro ga nai' ".
Anata wa mattaku Yuda o suterareta no desu ka. Anata no kokoro wa Shion o kirawareru no desu ka. Anata wa wareware o utta no ni, dou shite iyashite wa kudasaranai no desu ka. Wareware wa heian o nozondaga, yoi koto wa konakatta. Iya sareru toki o nozondaga, kaette kyoufu ga kita.
Shu yo, wareware wa jibun no aku to, senzo no toga to o mitomete imasu. Wareware wa anata ni tsumi o okashimashita.
Mina no tame ni, wareware o sutenaide kudasai. Anata no sakae aru mi kurai o hazukashimenaide kudasai. Anata ga wareware ni otate ni natta keiyaku o oboete, sore o yaburanaide kudasai.
Ihou no itsuwari no kamigami no uchi ni, ame o furase uru mono ga arude arou ka. Ten ga jibun de yuudachi o furasu koto ga dekiyou ka. Wareware no kami, Shu yo, anata koso, kore o nasaru kata de wa arimasen ka. Wareware no machinozomu no wa anata desu. Anata ga korera subete no koto o nasarukara desu.
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Tatoi Moose to Samueru to ga watashi no mae ni tatte mo, watashi no kokoro wa kono tami o kaeriminai. Karera o watashi no mae kara oidashi, koko o sarase yo.
Moshi karera ga, 'Wareware wa doko ni ikeba yoi no ka' to anata ni tazunerunaraba, karera ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, ekibyou ni sadamerareta mono wa ekibyou ni, tsurugi ni sadamerareta mono wa tsurugi ni, kikin ni sadamerareta mono wa kikin ni, toriko ni sadamerareta mono wa toriko ni iku'.
Shu wa ooserareru, watashi wa yontsu no mono o motte karera o bassuru. Sunawachi, tsurugi o motte koroshi, inu o motte kamase, sora no tori to chi no kemono o motte kuihorobosaseru.
Mata Yuda no ou Hizekiya no ko Manase ga, Erusaremu deshita okonai no yue ni, watashi wa karera o chi no subete no kuni ga mite osoreononoku mono to suru.
Erusaremu yo, dare ga anata o awaremude arou ka. Dare ga anata no tame ni nagekude arou ka. Dare ga furikaette, anata no anpi o toude arou ka.
Shu wa iwareru, anata wa watashi o suteta. Soshite masumasu shirizoite iku. Sore yue, watashi wa te o nobete anata o horoboshita. Watashi wa awaremu koto ni wa akita.
Watashi wa kono chi no mon de, mino de karera o aogi waketa. Karera ga sono michi o hanarenakatta no de, watashi wa karera no ko o ubai, waga tami o horoboshita.
Watashi wa karera no kafu no kazu o hamabe no suna yori mo ooku shita. Watashi wa mahiru ni, horobosu mono o tsurete kite, wakamonora no hahatachi o seme, odoroki to osore o, niwaka ni hahatachi ni okoshita.
Shichinin no ko o unda onna wa, yowari otoroete, iki tae, mada hiru de attaga, kanojo no hi wa bosshita. Kanojo wa haji, urotaeta. Sono nokori no mono wa, kore o teki no tsurugi ni watasu to Shu wa iwareru".
Aa, watashi wa wazawai da. Waga haha yo, anata wa, naze, watashi o unda no ka. Zenkoku no hito wa watashi to arasoi, watashi o semeru. Watashi wa hito ni kashita koto mo naku, hito ni karita koto mo nai no ni, mina watashi o norou.
Shu yo, moshi watashi ga karera no koufuku o anata ni inorimotomezu, mata teki no tame, sono nayami no toki to, wazawai no toki ni, watashi ga anata ni tori nashi o shinakatta no de areba, karera no noroi mo, yamu o enaideshou.
Hito wa tetsu o, kita kara kuru tetsu ya seidou o kudaku koto ga dekimashou ka.
"Watashi wa anata no tomi to takara o, bundori mono to shite hoka ni ataeru. Daika o ukeru koto wa dekinai. Sore wa anata no subete no tsumi ni yoru no de, ryouikinai no itarutokoro ni kono koto ga okoru.
Watashi wa anata no shiranai chi de, anata no teki ni tsukaesaseru. Watashi no ikari ni yotte hi wa tenjirare, itsu made mo moe tsuzukerukara de aru".
Shu yo, anata wa shitte oraremasu. Watashi o oboe, watashi o kaerimite kudasai. Watashi o hakugai suru mono ni, ada o kaeshi, anata no kan'you ni yotte, watashi o torisaranaide kudasai. Watashi ga anata no tame ni, hazukashime o ukeru no o shitte kudasai.
Watashi wa mikotoba o ataerarete, sore o tabemashita. Mikotoba wa, watashi ni yorokobi to nari, kokoro no tanoshimi to narimashita. Bangun no kami, Shu yo, watashi wa, anata no na o motte tonaerarete iru mono desu.
Watashi wa waraisazameku hito no tsudoi ni suwaru koto naku, mata yorokobu koto o sezu, tada hitori de suwatte imashita. Anata no te ga watashi no ue ni ari, anata ga ikidoori o motte watashi o mitasaretakara desu.
Dou shite watashi no itami wa tomarazu, kizu wa omokute, naoranai no desu ka. Anata wa watashi ni totte, mizu ga nakute hito o azamuku tanigawa no you ni narareru no desu ka.
Sore yue Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Moshi anata ga kaette kurunaraba, moto no you ni shite, watashi no mae ni tataseyou. Moshi anata ga, tsumaranai koto o iu no o yamete, kichou na koto o iunaraba, watashi no kuchi no you ni naru. Karera wa anata no tokoro ni kaette kuru. Shikashi anata ga karera no tokoro ni kaeru no de wa nai.
Watashi wa anata o kono tami no mae ni, kengo na seidou no jouheki ni suru. Karera ga anata o semete mo, anata ni katsu koto wa dekinai. Watashi ga anata to tomo ni ite, anata o tasuke, anata o sukuukara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa anata o akunin no te kara sukui, mujihi na hito no te kara aganau".
Shu no kotoba wa mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Anata wa kono tokoro de tsuma o metotte wa naranai. Mata musuko musume o motte wa naranai.
Kono tokoro de umareru musuko musume to, kono chi de kore o umu hahatachi to, kore o umu chichitachi to ni tsuite Shu wa kou iwareru,
Karera wa shi no yamai ni kakatte shini, aitou suru mono mo naku, maisou suru mono mo naku, chi no omote ni, fundo no you ni naru. Mata tsurugi to, kikin ni horobosarete, sono shitai wa sora no tori to chi no kemono no kuimono to naru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, mo no aru ie ni, haitte wa naranai. Mata itte, sore o kanashiminageite wa naranai. Watashi ga kono tami kara watashi no heian to, itsukushimito, awaremi to o torisattakara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Ooinaru mono mo chiisaki mono mo, kono chi ni shinu. Karera wa houmurarezu, mata karera no tame ni kanashimu mono mo naku, jibun no mi o kizutsukeru mono mo naku, kami o soru mono mo nai.
Kanashimu mono no tame ni pan o saite, shisha no tame ni kore o nagusameru mono wa naku, mata chichi aruiha haha no tame ni nagusame no sakazuki o kore ni ataete nomaseru mono mo nai.
Mata anata wa enkai o suru ie ni haitte, hitobito to tomo ni suwatte kui nomi shite wa naranai.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, anata no me no mae de, anata no nao konoyo ni iru aida ni, watashi wa yorokobi no koe to tanoshimi no koe, hanamuko no koe to hanayome no koe to o kono tokoro ni tayashite shimau.
Anata ga kono subete no kotoba o kono tami ni tsugeru toki, karera ga anata ni tazunete, 'Shu ga wareware ni kono ookina wazawai o senkoku sareru no wa dou shite desu ka. Wareware ni donna warui tokoro ga aru no desu ka. Wareware no kami, Shu ni somuite, wareware ga okashita tsumi to wa nan desu ka' to iunaraba,
Anata wa karera ni kotaenakereba naranai, 'Shu wa ooserareru, sore wa anata gata no senzo ga watashi o sutete ta no kamigami ni shitagai, kore ni tsukae, kore o haishi, mata watashi o sute, watashi no rippou o mamoranakattakara de aru.
Anata gata wa, anata gata no senzo yori mo, issou warui koto o shita. Miyo, anata gata wa onoono jibun no warui goujou na kokoro ni shitagai, watashi ni kikishitagau koto wa shinai.
Sore yue, watashi wa anatagata o kono chi yori oidashi, anata gata mo, anata gata no senzo mo shiranai chi ni ikaseru. Sono tokoro de anata gata wa chuuya, hoka no kamigami ni tsukaeru you ni naru. Kore wa watashi ga anata gata ni awaremi o shimesanaikara de aru' to.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue, miyo, kono nochi 'Isuraeru no tami o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita Shu wa ikite orareru' to wa iwanaide,
'Isuraeru no tami o kita no kuni to, sono subete oiyarareta kuniguni kara michibikidashita Shu wa ikite orareru' to iu hi ga kuru. Watashi ga karera o, sono senzo ni ataeta karera no chi ni michibiki kaesukara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi wa ooku no gyofu o yonde kite, karera o sunadorase, mata, sono nochi ooku no ryoushi o yonde kite, moromoro no yama, moromoro no oka, oyobi iwa no sakeme kara karera o karidasaseru.
Watashi no me wa karera no subete no michi o mite irukara de aru. Mina watashi ni kakurete wa inai. Mata sono aku wa watashi no me ni kakureru koto wa nai.
Watashi wa sono aku to sono tsumi no mukui o ni bai ni suru. Karera ga sono imubeki guuzou no shitai o motte, watashi no chi o kegashi, sono nikumubeki mono o motte, watashi no shigyou o mitashitakara de aru".
Shu, waga chikara, waga shiro, nayami no toki no, no gareba yo, bankoku no tami wa chi no hate kara anata no moto ni kite moushimasu, "Wareware no senzo ga uketsuida no wa, tada itsuwari to, yaku ni tatanai tsumaranai koto bakari desu.
Hito ga jibun de kamigami o tsukuru koto ga dekimashou ka. Sou iu mono wa kami de wa arimasen".
"Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa karera ni shiraseyou. Sunawachi, kono sai watashi no chikara to, watashi no ikioi to o shiraseyou. Karera wa watashi no na ga, Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
"Yuda no tsumi wa, tetsu no fude, kongouseki no togari o motte shirusare, karera no kokoro no ishibumi to, saidan no tsuno ni horitsukerarete iru.
Karera no kodomotachi wa aoki no shita to, takai oka no ue, no no yama no ue ni aru saidan to Ashira no koto o oboete iru.
Watashi wa anata no tomi to subete no takara to o, anata no zenryouiki no uchi de okashita tsumi no daika to shite, bundori mono to naraseru.
Watashi ga anata ni ataeta shigyou kara anata wa te o hanasu you ni naru. Mata watashi wa, anata no shiranai chi de, anata no teki ni tsukaesaseru. Watashi no ikari ni yotte, hi wa tenjirare, itsu made mo moe tsuzukerukara de aru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Ooyoso hito o tanomi to shi niku naru mono o jibun no ude to shi, sono kokoro ga Shu o hanarete iru hito wa, norowareru.
Kare wa arano ni sodatsu chiisai ki no you ni, nani mo yoi koto no kuru no o minai. Arano no, hiagatta tokoro ni sumi, hito no sumanai shio chi ni iru.
Ooyoso Shu ni tayori, Shu o tanomi to suru hito wa saiwai de aru.
Kare wa mizu no hotori ni ueta ki no you de, sono ne o kawa ni nobashi, atsusa ni atte mo osoreru koto wa nai. Sono ha wa tsune ni aoku, hideri no nen ni mo ureeru koto naku, taezu mi o musubu".
Kokoro wa yorozu no mono yori mo itsuwaru mono de, hanahadashiku akuni somatte iru. Dare ga kore o, yoku shiru koto ga dekiyou ka.
"Shu de aru watashi wa kokoro o saguri, omoi o kokoromiru. Onoono ni, sono michi ni shitagai, sono okonai no mi ni yotte mukui o suru tame de aru".
Shako ga jibun ga unda no de wa nai tamago o daku you ni, fusei na zaisan o eru mono ga aru. Sono hito wa isshou no nakaba ni sore kara hanarete, sono owari ni wa oroka na mono to naru.
Hajime kara takaku agerareta sakae aru miza wa, wareware no seijo no aru tokoro de aru.
Mata Isuraeru no nozomi de aru Shu yo, anata o suteru mono wa mina haji o kaki, anata o hanareru mono wa tsuchi ni na o shirusaremasu. Sore wa ikeru mizu no minamoto de aru Shu o sutetakara desu.
Shu yo, watashi o iyashite kudasai, sou sureba, watashi wa iemasu. Watashi o osukui kudasai, sou sureba, watashi wa sukuwaremasu. Anata wa watashi no hometataeru mono dakara desu.
Karera wa watashi ni iimasu, "Shu no kotoba wa doko ni aru no ka. Ima, sore o dashite miseyo" to.
Aku o tsukawasareru you ni to wa, watashi wa tatte motomemasendeshita. Mata wazawai no hi o negawanakatta no o, anata wa gozonji desu. Watashi no kuchibiru kara deta koto wa, mimae ni arimasu.
Dou ka, watashi o osoresasenaide kudasai. Wazawai no toki ni, anata wa watashi no no gareba desu.
Watashi o seme nayamasu mono o hazukashimete kudasai. Shikashi watashi o hazukashimenaide kudasai. Karera o osoresasete kudasai. Shikashi watashi o osoresasenaide kudasai. Wazawai no hi o karera ni kitarase, horobi o bai ni shite karera o horoboshite kudasai.
Shu wa watashi ni kou iwareta, "Itte, Yuda no outachi no deiri suru Beniyamin no mon, oyobi Erusaremu no subete no mon ni tatte,
Ii nasai, 'Korera no mon kara hairu Yuda no outachi, oyobi Yuda no subete no tami to Erusaremu ni sumu subete no mono yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Shu wa kou iwareru, inochi ga oshiinaraba ki o tsukeru ga yoi. Ansokunichi ni ni o tazusae, mata wa sore o motte Erusaremu no mon ni haitte wa naranai.
Mata ansokunichi ni anata gata no ie kara ni o hakobidashite wa naranai. Nan no waza o mo shite wa naranai. Watashi ga anata gata no senzo ni meijita you ni ansokunichi o seibetsu shite mamori nasai.
Shikashi karera wa shitagawazu mimi o katamukezu, kiku koto mo, imashime o ukeru koto o mo goujou ni kobanda.
Shu wa iwareru, moshi anata gata ga watashi ni kikishitagai, ansokunichi ni ni o tazusaete kono machi no mon ni hairazu, ansokunichi o seibetsu shite, nan no waza o mo shinainaraba,
Dabide no kurai ni zasuru outachi, tsukasatachi, Yuda no hitobito, Erusaremu ni sumu mono wa, kuruma to uma ni notte kono machi no mon kara wa iru koto ga dekiru. Soshite kono machi ni wa nagaku hito ga sumu you ni naru.
Mata hitobito wa Yuda no machimachi ya Erusaremu no shuui, Beniyamin no chi, heichi to sanchi oyobi Negebu kara kite hansai, gisei, sosai, nyuukou, kanshasai o tazusaete Shu no ie ni hairu.
Shikashi, moshi anata gata ga watashi ni kikishitagawanaide, ansokunichi o seibetsu shite mamoru koto o sezu, ansokunichi ni ni o tazusaete Erusaremu no mon ni hairunaraba, watashi wa hi o sono mon no naka ni moyashite, Erusaremu no moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu. Sono hi wa kieru koto ga nai' ".
Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba.
"Tatte, toukishi no ie ni kudatte iki nasai. Sono tokoro de watashi wa anata ni watashi no kotoba o kikaseyou".
Watashi wa toukishi no ie e kudatte itta. Miruto kare wa, rokuro de shigoto o shite itaga,
Nendo de tsukutte ita utsuwa ga, sono hito no te no naka de shison jita no de, kare wa jibun no i no mama ni, sore o motte hoka no utsuwa o tsukutta.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Shu wa ooserareru, Isuraeru no ie yo, kono toukishi ga shita you ni, watashi mo anata gata ni dekinai no darou ka. Isuraeru no ie yo, toukishi no te ni nendo ga aru you ni, anata gata wa watashi no te no uchi ni aru.
Aru toki ni wa, watashi ga tami mata wa kuni o nuku, yaburu, horobosu to iu koto ga aruga,
Moshi watashi no itta kuni ga sono aku o hanarerunaraba, watashi wa kore ni wazawai o kudasou to shita koto o omoikaesu.
Mata aru toki ni wa, watashi ga tami mata wa kuni o tateru, ueru to iu koto ga aruga,
Moshi sono kuni ga watashi no me ni aku to mieru koto o okonai, watashi no koe ni kikishitagawanainara, watashi wa kore ni saiwai o ataeyou to shita koto o omoikaesu.
Sore yue, Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu mono ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa anata gata ni wazawai o kudasou to kufuu shi, anatagata o semeru hakarigoto o tatete iru. Anata gata wa onoono sono ashiki michi o hanare, sono michi to okonai o aratame nasai' to.
Shikashi karera wa iu, 'Sore wa muda desu. Wareware wa jibun no hakaru tokoro ni shitagai, onoono sono warui goujou na kokoro ni shitagatte koudou shimasu' to.
Sore yue Shu wa kou iwareru, ihou no tami no uchi no aru mono ni tazunete miyo, kono you na koto o kiita mono ga arou ka. Otome Isuraeru wa osoroshii koto o shita.
Rebanon no yuki ga, dou shite Shirion no iwa o hanareyou ka. Yama no mizu, tsumetai kawa no nagare ga, dou shite kawaite shimaou ka.
Sore na no ni waga tami wa watashi o wasurete, itsuwari no kamigami ni kou o taite iru. Karera wa sono michi, furui michi ni tsumazuki, mata komichi ni iri, ooji kara hanareta.
Jibun no chi o are sutaresasete, itsu made mo hito ni shitauchi sareru mono to shita. Soko o tooru hito wa mina miburui shite, kubi o furu.
Watashi wa higashikaze no you ni, karera o sono teki no mae ni chirasu. Sono horobi no hi ni wa, watashi wa karera ni se o muke, kao o mukenai".
Karera wa itta, "Saa, keiryaku o megurashite, Eremiya o taosou. Saishi ni wa rippou ga ari, chie aru mono ni wa hakarigoto ga ari, yogensha ni wa kotoba ga atte, korera no mono ga horobite shimau koto wa nai. Saa, wareware wa shita o motte kare o utou. Kare no subete no kotoba ni, kokoro o tomenai koto ni shiyou".
Shu yo, douzo watashi ni mikokoro o tome, watashi no uttae o okiki kudasai.
Aku o motte zen ni mukuirubekideshou ka. Shikamo nao karera wa watashi no inochi o torou to shite ana o horimashita. Watashi ga anata no mae ni tatte, karera no koto o yoku ii, anata no ikidoori o tomeyou to shita no o oboete kudasai.
Sore yue, karera no kodomotachi o kikin ni watashi, karera o tsurugi no ha ni watashite kudasai. Karera no tsuma wa ko o ushinai, mata kafu to nari, otoko wa ekibyou ni kakatte shini, wakai mono wa, sensou de tsurugi ni korosaremasu you ni.
Anata ga teki o niwaka ni karera ni nozomaserareru toki, karera no ie kara sakebigoe ga kikoemasu you ni. Karera wa ana o hotte, watashi o toraeyou to shi, wana o tsukutte, watashi no ashi o toraeyou to shitakara desu.
Shu yo, anata wa karera ga watashi o korosu tame ni megurashite iru keiryaku o mina gozonji desu. Sono aku o yurusu koto naku, sono tsumi o anata no mae kara keshisaranaide kudasai. Karera o anata no mae ni taoresasete kudasai. Anata no oikari ni naru toki ni karera o basshite kudasai.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Itte, toukishi no bin o kai, tami no chourou to nenchou no saishi no uchi no suunin o tomonatte,
Seto kake no mon no iriguchi ni aru Benhinnomu no tani e iki, sono tokoro de, watashi ga anata ni kataru kotoba o nobete,
Ii nasai, 'Yuda no outachi, oyobi Erusaremu ni sumu mono yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa wazawai o kono tokoro ni kudasu. Ooyoso, sono wazawai no koto o kiku mono no mimi wa ryouhou to mo naru.
Karera ga watashi o sute, kono tokoro o kegashi, kono tokoro de, jibun mo senzotachi mo Yuda no outachi mo shiranakatta ta no kamigami ni kou o taki, katsu tsumi no nai mono no chi o, kono tokoro ni mitashitakara de aru.
Mata karera wa Baaru no tame ni takaki tokoro o kizuki, hi o motte jibun no kodomotachi o yaki, hansai to shite Baaru ni sasageta. Kore wa watashi no meijita koto de wa naku, sadameta koto de mo naku, mata omoi mo shinakatta koto de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue, miyo, kono tokoro o Topete mata wa Benhinnomu no tani to yobanaide, gyakusatsu no tani to yobu hi ga kuru.
Mata watashi wa kono tokoro de Yuda to Erusaremu no hakarigoto o uchiyaburi, tsurugi o motte, karera o sono teki no mae to, sono inochi o motomeru mono no te ni taoresase, mata sono shitai o sora no tori to chi no kemono no kuimono to shi,
Katsu, kono machi o are sutaresasete, hito ni shitauchi sareru mono to suru. Soko o tooru hito wa mina sono moromoro no wazawai o mite miburui shi, shitauchi suru.
Mata karera ga sono teki to sono inochi o motomeru mono to ni kakomarete kurushiminayamu toki, watashi wa karera ni jibun no musuko no niku, musume no niku o tabesaseru. Karera wa mata tagai ni sono tomo no niku o taberu you ni naru'.
Soko de, anata wa, issho ni yuku hitobito no me no mae de, sono bin o kudaki,
Soshite karera ni ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, toukishi no utsuwa o hitotabi kudakunaraba, mohaya moto no you ni suru koto wa dekinai. Kono you ni watashi wa kono tami to kono machi to o kudaku. Hitobito wa hoka ni houmurubeki basho ga nai tame ni, Topete ni houmurude arou.
Shu wa ooserareru, watashi wa kono tokoro to, koko ni sumu mono to ni kono you ni shi, kono machi o Topete no you ni suru.
Erusaremu no ie to Yuda no outachi no ie, sunawachi karera ga sono okujou de ten no shuu gun ni kou o taki, hoka no kamigami ni sake o sosoida ie wa, mina Topete no tokoro no you ni kegasareru' ".
Eremiya wa Shu ga kare o tsukawashite yogen saserareta Topete kara kaette kite, Shu no ie no niwa ni tachi, subete no tami ni itta,
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa, kono machi to sono subete no muramura ni, watashi no itta moromoro no wazawai o kudasu. Karera ga goujou de, watashi no kotoba ni kikishitagaou to shinaikara de aru".
Sate saishi Inmeru no ko de, Shu no miya no tsukasa no chou de atta Pashuru wa, Eremiya ga korera no koto o yogen suru no o kiita.
Soshite Pashuru wa yogensha Eremiya o uchi, Shu no miya ni aru ue no Beniyamin no mon no ashikase ni tsunaida.
Sono yokujitsu Pashuru ga Eremiya o ashikase kara tokihanashita toki, Eremiya wa kare ni itta, "Shu wa anata no na o Pashuru to wa yobanaide, 'Osore ga shuui ni aru' to yobareru.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa anata o, anata jishin to anata no subete no tomodachi ni osore o okosaseru mono to suru. Karera wa anata ga mite iru me no mae de teki no tsurugi ni taoreru. Watashi wa mata Yuda no subete no tami o Babiron ou no te ni watasu. Kare wa karera o toraete Babiron ni utsushi, tsurugi o motte korosu.
Watashi wa mata kono machi no subete no tomi to, sono eta subete no mono to, sono subete no kichou na mono to, Yuda no outachi no subete no houmotsu o sono teki no te ni watasu. Karera wa kore o kasume, tami o toraete Babiron ni utsusu.
Pashuru yo, anata to, anata no ie ni sumu mono to wa mina toraeutsusareru. Anata wa Babiron ni itte, sono tokoro de shini, sono tokoro ni houmurareru. Anata mo, anata ga itsuwatte yogen shita kotoba ni kikishitagatta tomo mo mina sono you ni naru".
Shu yo, anata ga watashi o azamukareta no de, watashi wa sono azamuki ni shitagaimashita. Anata wa watashi yori mo tsuyoi no de, watashi o tokifuserareta no desu. Watashi wa ichinichi jyuu, monowarai to nari, hito wa mina watashi o azakerimasu.
Sore wa, watashi ga katari, yobawaru goto ni, "Bougyaku, metsubou" to sakebukara desu. Shu no kotoba ga ichinichi jyuu, waga mi no hazukashimeto, azakeri ni narukara desu.
Moshi watashi ga, "Shu no koto wa, kasanete iwanai, kono ue sono na ni yotte kataru koto wa shinai" to ieba, Shu no kotoba ga watashi no kokoro ni atte, moeru hi no waga hone no uchi ni tojikomerarete iru you de, sore o osaeru no ni tsukare hatete, taeru koto ga dekimasen.
Ooku no hito no sasayaku no o kikukara desu. Osore ga shihou ni arimasu. "Kokuhatsu seyo. Saa, kare o kokuhatsu shiyou" to itte, waga shitashii tomo wa mina watashi no tsumazuku no o, ukagatte imasu. Mata, "Kare wa azamukarerudarou. Sono toki, wareware wa kare ni katte, ada o kaesu koto ga dekiru" to iimasu.
Shikashi Shu wa tsuyoi yuushi no you ni watashi to tomo ni orareru. Sore yue, watashi ni semarikuru mono wa tsumazuki, watashi ni uchikatsu koto wa dekinai. Karera wa, nashitogeru koto ga dekinakute, ooini haji o kaku. Sono haji wa, itsu made mo wasurerareru koto wa nai.
Tadashiki mono o kokoromi, hito no kokoro to omoi o mirareru bangun no Shu yo, anata ga karera ni, ada o kaesareru no o misete kudasai. Watashi wa anata ni, watashi no uttae o omakase shitakara desu.
Shu ni mukatte utai, Shu o hometatae yo. Shu wa mazushii mono no inochi o, akunin no te kara sukuwaretakara de aru.
Watashi no umareta hi wa noroware yo. Haha ga watashi o unda hi wa shukufuku o ukeru na.
Watashi no chichi ni "Otokonoko ga, umaremashita" to tsugete, kare o ooini yorokobaseta hito wa, noroware yo.
Sono hito wa, Shu no awaremi o ukeru koto naku, horobosareta machi no you ni nare. Asa ni wa, kare ni sakebi o kikase, hiru ni wa tatakai no koe o kikase yo.
Kare ga watashi o tainai de korosazu, waga haha o watashi no hakaba to nasazu, sono tai o itsu made mo ookiku shinakattakara de aru.
Naniyue ni watashi wa tainai o dete kite, nayami to kanashimi ni ai, haji o ukete isshou o sugosu no ka.
Zedekiya ou wa, Marukiya no ko Pashuru to saishi Maaseya no ko Zepaniya o, Eremiya no moto ni tsukawashi,
"Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga wareware o semeyou to shite iru yue, wareware no tame ni Shu ni tazunete hoshii. Shu wa sono moromoro no fushigi na waza o motte, wareware o tasuke, Babiron no ou o wareware kara shirizokaserareru ka mo shirenai" to iwaseta. Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Eremiya wa karera ni kotaete itta, "Anata gata wa Zedekiya ni kono you ni ii nasai,
'Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, anata ga taga, kono jouheki no soto ni atte, anatagata o semekakomu Babiron no ou oyobi Karudeya bito to tatakau toki, watashi wa anata gata no te ni motte iru buki o toriage, kore o machi no naka ni atsumesaseru.
Watashi wa te o nobe, tsuyoi ude o motte, ikari, ikidoori, hageshiku ikatte, anatagata o semeru.
Watashi wa mata kono machi ni sumu hito to kemono to o utsu. Karera wa mina omoi ekibyou ni kakatte shinu.
Shu wa iwareru, kono nochi, watashi wa Yuda no ou Zedekiya to sono keraitachi, oyobi ekibyou to, tsurugi to, kikin o manukarete, kono machi ni nokotte iru tami o, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te to, sono teki no te, oyobi sono inochi o motomeru mono no te ni watasu. Babiron no ou wa tsurugi no ha ni kakete karera o uchi, karera o oshimazu, kaerimizu, mata awaremu koto mo shinai'.
Anata wa mata kono tami ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa inochi no michi to shi no michi to o anata gata no mae ni oku.
Kono machi ni todomaru mono wa, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou to de shinu. Shikashi, dete itte, anatagata o semekakonde iru Karudeya bito ni koufuku suru mono wa shi o manukare, sono inochi wa jibun no bundori mono to naru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi ga kono machi ni kao o muketa no wa saiwai o ataeru tame de wa naku, wazawai o ataeru tame de aru. Kono machi wa Babiron no ou no te ni watasareru. Kare wa hi o motte, kore o yakiharau'.
Mata Yuda no ou no ie ni ii nasai, 'Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Dabide no ie yo, Shu wa kou ooserareru, asagoto ni, tadashii sabaki o okonai, mono o ubawareta hito o shi etageru mono no te kara sukue. Sou shinaito, anata gata no warui okonai no tame ni, watashi no ikari wa hi no you ni moete, sore o kesu koto wa dekinai' ".
"Shu wa iwareru, tani ni sumu mono yo, heigen no iwa yo, miyo, watashi wa anata ni tekisuru. Anata gata wa iu, 'Dare ga kudatte kite, wareware o semeru mono ka, dare ga wareware no iru tokoro ni, hairu mono ka' to.
Watashi wa anatagata o, sono okonai no mi ni yotte bassuru. Mata sono hayashi ni hi o tsukete, sono shuui no mono o mina yaki tsukusuto, Shu wa iwareru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Yuda no ou no ie ni kudari, sono tokoro ni kono kotoba o nobete,
Ii nasai, 'Dabide no kurai ni suwaru Yuda no ou yo, anata to, anata no kashin, oyobi, kono mon kara wa iru anata no tami wa Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Shu wa kou iwareru, kouhei to seigi o okonai, mono o ubawareta hito o, shi etageru mono no te kara sukui, ihou no hito, koji, kafu o nayamashi, shi etagete wa naranai. Mata kono tokoro ni, tsumi naki mono no chi o nagashite wa naranai.
Moshi anata gata ga kono kotoba o shinjitsu ni okonaunaraba, Dabide no kurai ni suwaru ou to sono kashin, oyobi sono tami wa, kuruma to uma ni notte, kono ie no mon ni hairu koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi anata gata ga kono kotoba o kikanainaraba, watashi wa jishin o sashite chikauga, kono ie wa arechi to naruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa Yuda no ou no ie ni tsuite kou iwareru, anata wa watashi ni taishite Gireade no you de ari, Rebanon no itadaki no you de aru. Shikashi, watashi wa kanarazu anata o arechi ni shi, hito no sumanai machi ni suru.
Watashi wa horobosu mono o moukete, anata o semesaseru, karera wa onoono sono buki o tori, anata no uruwashii kouhaku o kiritaoshi, hi ni nageireru.
Ooku no kuni no hito wa kono machi o sugi, tagai ni katatte, "Naze Shu wa kono ooinaru machi o kono you ni sareta no ka" to iu toki,
Hito wa kotaete, "Kore wa karera ga sono kami, Shu no keiyaku o sutete ta no kamigami o haishi, kore ni tsukaetakara de aru" to iude arou' ".
Shinda mono no tame ni naku koto naku, mata sono tame ni nageite wa naranai. Toraeutsusarete yuku mono no tame ni, hageshiku nake. Kare wa futatabi kaette kite, sono kokyou o miru koto ga naikara de aru.
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Sharumu wa chichi Yoshiya ni tsuide ou to nattaga, tsuini kono tokoro kara dete itta. Shu wa kare ni tsuite kou iwareru, "Kare wa futatabi koko ni kaeranai.
Kare wa sono torae ikareta tokoro de shini, futatabi kono chi o minai".
"Fugi o motte sono ie o tate, fuhou o motte sono takadono o tsukuri, tonaribito o yatotte nani o mo ataezu, sono chingin o harawanai mono wa wazawai de aru.
Kare wa iu, 'Watashi wa jibun no tame ni ookina ie o tate, hiroi takadono o tsukurou' to. Soshite kore ga tame ni mado o tsukuri, kouhaku no kagamiita de ooi, sore o shu de nuru.
Anata wa kisotte kouhaku o mochiiru koto ni yotte, ou de aru to omou no ka. Anata no chichi wa kui nomi shi, kouhei to seigi o okonatte, saiwai o eta no de wa nai ka.
Kare wa mazushii hito to toboshii hito no uttae o tadashite, saiwai o eta. Kou suru koto ga watashi o shiru koto de wa nai ka to Shu wa iwareru.
Shikashi, anata wa me mo kokoro mo, fusei na rieki no tame ni nomi mochii, tsumi naki mono no chi o nagasou to shi, assei to bougyaku o okonaou to suru".
Sore yue, Shu wa Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu ni tsuite kou iwareru, "Hitobito wa 'Kanashii ka na, waga ani', 'Kanashii ka na, waga ane' to itte, kare no tame ni nagekanai. Mata 'Kanashii ka na, shukun yo', 'Kanashii ka na, heika yo' to itte nagekanai.
Roba ga umerareru you ni, kare wa houmurareru. Hikarete itte, Erusaremu no mon no soto ni nagesuterareru".
"Rebanon ni nobotte yobawari, Bashan ni anata no koe o age, Abarimu kara yobaware. Anata no aisuru mono ga mina horobosarerukara da.
Anata no sakaete ita toki, watashi wa anata ni katattaga 'Kikitaku wa nai' to itta. Anata ga watashi no koe ni kikishitagawanai koto wa, anata no osanai toki kara no, narawashi de atta.
Anata no bokusha wa mina, kaze ni oitaterare, anata no aisuru mono wa toraeutsusareru. Sono toki, anata wa jibun no moromoro no aku no tame ni, haji, urotaeru.
Rebanon ni sumi, kouhaku no naka ni su o tsukutte iru mono yo, ko o umu onna ni nozomu kurushimi no you na kutsuu ga anata ni nozomu toki, anata wa donna ni nageku koto de arou ka".
"Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu no ko Koniya ga, watashi no migite no yubiwa de atte mo, watashi wa anata o nukitoru.
Anata no inochi o motomeru mono no te, anata ga sono kao o osoreru mono no te, sunawachi Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te to, Karudeya bito no te ni anata o watasu.
Watashi wa, anata to, anata o unda haha o, anata gata no umareta kuni de nai ta no kuni ni oiyaru. Anata gata wa soko de shinu.
Karera ga kaeritai to setsu ni negau kuni ni, karera wa futatabi kaeru koto ga dekinai".
Kono hito Koniya wa iyashimubeki, kowareta tsubo de arou ka, dare mo kokoro ni tomenai utsuwa de arou ka. Naze kare to sono shison wa oiyararete, shiranai chi ni nageyarareru no ka.
Aa, chi yo, chi yo, chi yo, Shu no kotoba o kikeyo.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Kono hito o, ko naki hito to shite, mata sono isshou no uchi, sakaeru koto no nai hito to shite kiroku seyo. Sono shison no uchi, hitori mo sakaete, Dabide no kurai ni suwari, Yuda o osameru mono ga futatabi okoranaikara de aru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Waga makiba no hitsuji o horoboshi chirasu bokusha wa wazawai de aru".
Sore yue Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa waga tami o yashinau bokusha ni tsuite kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa watashi no mure o chirashi, kore o oiyatte kaeriminakatta. Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no ashiki okonai ni yotte anata gata ni mukuiruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi no mure no nokotta mono o, oiyatta subete no chi kara atsume, futatabi kore o sono ori ni kaeraseyou. Karera wa ko o unde sono kazu ga ooku naru.
Watashi wa kore o yashinau bokusha o sono ue ni tateru, karera wa futatabi osoreru koto naku, mata ononoku koto naku, inaku naru koto mo naito, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa ooserareru, miyo, watashi ga Dabide no tame ni hitotsu no tadashii eda o okosu hi ga kuru. Kare wa ou to natte yo o osame, sakaete, kouhei to seigi o yo ni okonau.
Sono hi Yuda wa sukui o e, Isuraeru wa yasuraka ni oru. Sono na wa 'Shu wa wareware no seigi' to tonaerareru.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue miyo, hitobito wa 'Isuraeru no tami o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidasareta Shu wa ikite orareru' to mata iwanaide,
'Isuraeru no ie no shison o kita no chi to, sono subete oiyarareta chi kara michibikidasareta kami wa ikite orareru' to iu hi ga kuru. Sono toki, karera wa jibun no chi ni sunde iru".
Yogensha tachi ni tsuite. Waga kokoro wa watashi no uchi ni yabure, waga hone wa mina furuu. Shu to sono sei naru kotoba no tame ni, watashi wa yotte iru hito no you, sake ni uchimakasareta hito no you de aru.
Kono chi ni kan'in o okonau mono ga michite irukara da. Noroi ni yotte chi wa nageki, arano no makiba wa kawaku. Karera no michi wa waruku, sono chikara wa tadashiku nai.
"Yogensha to saishi to wa tomo ni kami o kegasu mono de aru. Watashi no ie ni oite sura karera no aku o mita to, Shu wa iwareru.
Sore yue, karera no michi wa, onozukara ankoku no naka ni aru nameraka na michi no you ni nari, karera wa osarete sono michi ni taoreru. Watashi ga karera no basserareru toshi ni, wazawai o sono ue ni nozomaserukara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa Samariya no yogensha no uchi ni fukai na koto no aru no o mita. Karera wa Baaru ni yotte yogen shi, waga tami Isuraeru o madowashita.
Shikashi Erusaremu no yogensha no uchi ni wa, osoroshii koto no aru no o mita. Karera wa kan'in o okonai, itsuwari ni ayumi, akunin no te o tsuyoku shi, hito o sono aku kara hanaresasenai. Karera wa mina watashi ni wa Sodomu no you de ari, sono tami wa Gomora no you de aru".
Sore yue bangun no Shu wa yogensha ni tsuite kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa karera ni, nigayomogi o tabesase, doku no mizu o nomaseru. Kami o kegasu koto ga Erusaremu no yogensha kara dete, zenchi ni oyonde irukara de aru".
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata ni yogen suru yogensha no kotoba o kiite wa naranai. Karera wa anata gata ni, munashii nozomi o idakase, Shu no kuchi kara deta no de nai, jibun no kokoro no mokushi o kataru no de aru.
Karera wa Shu no kotoba o karunjiru mono ni mukatte taezu, 'Anata gata wa heian o eru' to ii, mata jibun no goujou na kokoro ni shitagatte ayumu subete no hito ni mukatte, 'Anata gata ni wazawai wa konai' to iu".
Karera no uchi dare ka Shu no gikai ni tatte, sono kotoba o mikiki shita mono ga arou ka. Dare ka mimi o katamukete sono kotoba o kiita mono ga arou ka.
Miyo, Shu no boufuu ga kuru. Ikidoori to, tsumujikaze ga dete, akunin no koube o utsu.
Shu no ikari wa, mikokoro ni omoisadamerareta koto o nashitogerareru made shirizoku koto wa nai.sue no hi ni anata gata wa sore o akiraka ni satoru.
Yogensha tachi wa watashi ga tsukawasanakatta no ni, karera wa hashitta. Watashi ga, karera ni tsugenakatta no ni, karera wa yogen shita.
Moshi karera ga watashi no gikai ni tatta no de areba, watashi no tami ni waga kotoba o tsuge shimeshite, sono warui michi to warui okonai kara, hanaresasetade arou ni.
"Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa tada chikaku no kami de atte, tooku no kami de wa nai no de aru ka.
Shu wa iwareru, hito wa, hisoka na tokoro ni mi o kakushite, watashi ni mirarenai you ni suru koto ga dekiyou ka. Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa ten to chi to ni michite irude wa nai ka.
Waga na ni yotte itsuwari o yogen suru yogensha tachi ga, 'Watashi wa yume o mita, watashi wa yume o mita' to iu no o kiita.
Itsuwari o yogen suru yogensha tachi no kokoro ni, itsu made itsuwari ga aru no de aru ka. Karera wa sono kokoro no azamuki o yogen suru.
Karera wa sono senzo ga Baaru ni shitagatte waga na o wasureta you ni, tagai ni yume o katatte, watashi no tami ni waga na o wasuresaseyou to suru.
Yume o mita yogensha wa yume o kataru ga yoi. Shikashi, watashi no kotoba o uketa mono wa seijitsu ni watashi no kotoba o kataranakereba naranai. Wara to mugi to o kuraberu koto ga dekiyou ka to, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa ooserareru, watashi no kotoba wa hi no you de wa nai ka. Mata iwa o uchikudaku tsuchi no you de wa nai ka.
Sore yue miyo, watashi wa watashi no kotoba o tagai ni nusumu yogensha no teki to naruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Miyo, watashi wa, 'Shu wa iita mou' to shita o motte kataru yogensha no teki to naruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa itsuwari no yume o yogen suru mono no teki to naru. Karera wa sore o katari, mata sono itsuwari to taigen o motte watashi no tami o madowasu. Watashi ga karera o tsukawashita no de wa naku, mata karera ni meijita no de mo nai. Sore de karera wa kono tami ni sukoshi mo eki ni naranaito, Shu wa iwareru.
Kono tami no hitori, mata wa yogensha, mata wa saishi ga anata ni, 'Shu no omoni wa nan desu ka' to tounaraba, karera ni kotae nasai, 'Anata gata ga sono omoni desu. Soshite Shu wa, anatagata o suteru to itte oraremasu' to.
Soshite, 'Shu no omoni' to iu sono yogensha, saishi, mata wa tami no hitori o, sono kazoku to tomo ni watashi wa bassuru.
Anata gata wa, mina tagai ni, tonaribito ni, mata kyoudai ni, kou iwanakereba naranai, 'Shu wa nan to kotaeraremashita ka', 'Shu wa nan to iwaremashita ka' to.
Shikashi kasanete 'Shu no omoni' to itte wa naranai. Omoni wa hito onoono no jibun no kotoba dakara de aru. Anata gata wa ikeru kami, bangun no Shu naru wareware no kami no kotoba o mageru mono de aru.
Anata wa yogensha ni kou iwanakereba naranai, 'Shu wa anata ni nan to kotaeraremashita ka', 'Shu wa nan to iwaremashita ka' to.
Moshi anata gata ga 'Shu no omoni' to iunaraba, Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi ga hito o anata gata ni tsukawashite, anata gata wa "Shu no omoni" to itte wa naranai to iwaseta no ni, anata gata wa "Shu no omoni" to iu kotoba o itta no de,
Watashi wa kanarazu anatagata o toraeutsusase, anata gata to anata gata no senzo to ni ataeta kono machi to, anata gata to o, watashi no mae kara sutesaru.
Soshite, wasurerareru koto no nai eien no hazukashime to eien no haji o, anata gata ni koumuraseru' ".
Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu no ko Ekoniya oyobi Yuda no kimitachi to koushou to kaji o Erusaremu kara Babiron ni utsushite nochi, Shu wa watashi ni kono maboroshi o oshimeshi ni natta. Miyo, Shu no miya no mae ni okarete iru ichijiku o motta futatsu no kago ga atta.
Sono hitotsu no kago ni wa, hajimete jukushita you na hijou ni yoi ichijiku ga ari, hoka no kago ni wa hijou ni warukute taberarenai hodo no warui ichijiku ga irete atta.
Shu wa watashi ni, "Eremiya yo, nani o miru ka" to iwareta. Watashi wa, "Ichijiku desu. Sono yoi ichijiku wa hijou ni yoku, warui hou no ichijiku wa hijou ni warukute, taberaremasen" to kotaeta.
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, kono tokoro kara Karudeya bito no chi ni oiyatta Yuda no torawarebito o, watashi wa kono yoi ichijiku no you ni kaerimite megumou.
Watashi wa karera ni me o kakete kore o megumi, karera o kono chi ni kaeshi, karera o tatete taosazu, uete nukanai.
Watashi wa karera ni watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru kokoro o ataeyou. Karera wa watashi no tami to nari, watashi wa karera no kami to naru. Karera wa isshin ni watashi no moto ni kaette kuru.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa Yuda no ou Zedekiya to sono tsukasatachi, oyobi Erusaremu no hito no nokotte kono chi ni iru mono, narabi ni Ejiputo no chi ni sunde iru mono o, kono warukute taberarenai warui ichijiku no you ni shiyou.
Watashi wa karera o chi no moromoro no kuni de, imikirawareru mono to shi, mata watashi no oiyaru subete no tokoro de, hazukashime ni awase, kotowaza to nari, azakeri to, noroi ni awaseru.
Watashi wa tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o karera no uchi ni okutte, tsuini karera o watashi ga karera to sono senzo to ni ataeta chi kara taesaseru".
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no yon nen (Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no gannen) ni Yuda no subete no tami ni tsuite no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Yogensha Eremiya wa kono kotoba o Yuda no subete no tami to Erusaremu ni sumu subete no hito ni tsugete itta,
"Yuda no ou Amon no ko Yoshiya no juu san nen kara konnichi ni itaru made nijuu san nen no aida, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda. Watashi wa tayumazu ni sore o anata gata ni katatte kitaga, anata gata wa kikanakatta.
Shu wa tayumazu, sono shimobe de aru yogensha o, anata gata ni tsukawasaretaga, anata gata wa kikazu mata mimi o katamukete kikou to mo shinakatta.
Karera wa itta, 'Anata gata wa onoono ima sono aku no michi to warui okonai o sute nasai. Sou sureba Shu ga mukashi kara anata gata to senzotachi to ni ataerareta chi ni eien ni sumu koto ga dekiru.
Anata gata wa, hoka no kami ni shitagatte, sore ni tsukae, sore o ogande wa naranai. Anata gata no te de tsukutta mono o motte, watashi o ikarasete wa naranai. Kono you na koto o shinainara, watashi wa anatagata o sokonau koto wa nai' to.
Shikashi anata gata wa watashi ni kikishitagawazu, anata gata no te de tsukutta mono o motte, watashi o ikarasete mizukara gai o maneita to, Shu wa iwareru.
Sore yue bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata gata ga watashi no kotoba ni kikishitagawanai yue,
Miyo, watashi wa kita no hou no subete no shuzoku to, watashi no shimobe de aru Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru o yobiyosete, kono chi to sono tami to, sono mawari no kuniguni o semehorobosase, kore o imikirawareru mono to shi, hito no waraimono to shi, eien no hazukashime to suruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Mata watashi wa yorokobi no koe, tanoshimi no koe, hanamuko no koe, hanayome no koe, hikiusu no oto, tomoshibi no hikari o karera no naka ni taesaseru.
Kono chi wa mina horobosarete arechi to naru. Soshite sono kuniguni wa nanajuu nen no aida Babiron no ou ni tsukaeru.
Shu wa iwareru, nanajuu nen no owatta nochi ni, watashi wa Babiron no ou to, sono tami to, Karudeya bito no chi o, sono tsumi no tame ni basshi, eien no arechi to suru.
Watashi wa ano chi ni tsuite, watashi ga katatta subete no kotoba o sono ue ni nozomaseru. Kore wa Eremiya ga, bankoku no koto ni tsuite yogen shita mono de atte, mina kono sho ni shirusarete iru.
Ooku no kuniguni to idai na outachi to wa, karera o sae dorei to shite tsukae saseru. Watashi wa karera no okonaito, sono te no waza ni shitagatte mukuiru".
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa watashi ni kou ooserareta, "Watashi no te kara, kono ikari no sakazuki o ukete, watashi ga anata o tsukawasu kuniguni no tami ni nomase nasai.
Karera wa nonde, yoromeki kuruu. Kore wa watashi ga karera no uchi ni, tsurugi o tsukawasou to shite irukara de aru".
Kou shite watashi wa Shu no te kara sakazuki o uke, Shu ga watashi o tsukawasareta kuniguni no tami ni nomaseta.
Sunawachi Erusaremu to Yuda no subete no machi to, sono outachi oyobi sono tsukasatachi ni nomasete, sorera o horoboshi, arechi to shi, hito no waraimono to shi, norowareru mono to shita. Konnichi no toori de aru.
Mata Ejiputo no ou Paro to sono keraitachi, sono kimitachi, sono subete no tami to,
Moromoro no kiryuu no ihoujin, oyobi Uzu no chi no subete no outachi, oyobi Perishite bito no chi no subete no outachi, (Ashikeron, Gaza, Ekuron, Ashidodo no nokori no mono),
Edomu, Moabu, Anmon no shison,
Tsuro no subete no outachi, Shidon no subete no outachi, umi no kanata no umizoi no chi no outachi,
Dedan, Tema, Buzu oyobi subete kaminoke no sumizumi o soru mono,
Arabiya no subete no outachi, arano no zasshu no tami no subete no outachi,
Jimuri no subete no outachi, Eramu no subete no outachi, Medea no subete no outachi,
Kita no subete no outachi no tooki mono, chikaki mono mo tsugitsugi ni, mata subete chi no omote ni aru yo no kuniguni no outachi mo kono sakazuki o nomu. Soshite karera no tsugi ni Babiron no ou mo kore o nomu.
"Sore de anata wa karera ni ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, nome, yotte hake, taorete futatabi tatsu na, watashi ga anata gata no uchi ni, tsurugi o tsukawasukara de aru' ".
"Moshi karera ga anata no te kara sakazuki o ukete nomu koto o shinainaraba, anata wa karera ni ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata gata wa kanarazu nomanakereba naranai.
Miyo, watashi no na o motte yobareru kono machi ni sae wazawai o kudasu no da. Dou shite anata gata ga batsu o manukareru koto ga dekiyou ka. Anata gata wa batsu o manukareru koto wa dekinai. Watashi ga tsurugi o yobiyosete, chi ni sumu subete no mono o semerukara de aruto, bangun no Shu wa ooserareru'.
Sore yue, anata wa karera ni kono subete no kotoba o yogen shite ii nasai, 'Shu wa takai tokoro kara yobawari, sono sei naru sumai kara koe o dashi, jibun no sumika ni mukatte ooini yobawari, chi ni sumu subete no mono ni mukatte budou o fumu mono no you ni sakebareru.
Sakebi wa chi no hate ni made hibiki wataru. Shu ga kuniguni to arasoi, subete no niku naru mono o sabaki, akunin o tsurugi ni watasukara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru'.
Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, kuni kara kuni e wazawai ga dete iku. Ookina arashi ga chi no hate kara okoru.
Sono hi, Shu ni korosareru hitobito wa, chi no kono hate kara, kano hate ni oyobu. Karera wa kanashimarezu, atsumerarezu, mata houmurarezu ni, chi no omote ni fundo to naru.
Bokusha yo, nagekisakebe, mure no kashiratachi yo, hai no naka ni marobe. Anata gata no hofurareru hi, chirasareru hi ga kitakara da. Anata gata wa erabiwakerareta ohitsuji no you ni taoreru.
Bokusha ni wa, no gareba naku, mure no kashiratachi wa nigeru tokoro ga nai.
Bokusha no sakebigoe to, mure no kashiratachi no nageki no koe ga kikoeru. Shu ga karera no makiba o horoboshite orarerukara da.
Shu no hageshii ikari ni yotte, heiwa na makiba wa arete iku.
Shishi no you ni kare wa sono su o deta. Shu no tsurugi to, sono hageshii ikari ni yotte, karera no chi wa arechi to natta".
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu ga yo o osameta hajime no koro, Shu kara kono kotoba ga atta,
"Shu wa kou ooserareru, Shu no miya no niwa ni tachi, watashi ga anata ni meijite iwaseru subete no kotoba o, Shu no miya de reihai suru tame ni kite iru Yuda no machimachi no hitobito ni tsuge nasai. Hitokoto o mo iinokoshite oite wa naranai.
Karera ga kiite, onoono sono warui michi o hanareru koto ga aru ka mo shirenai. Sono toki, watashi wa karera no okonai no warui tame ni, wazawai o karera ni kudasou to shita no o omoinaosu.
Anata wa karera ni ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, moshi anata gata ga watashi ni kikishitagawazu, watashi ga anata gata no mae ni sadame oita rippou o okonawazu,
Watashi ga anata gata ni, shikiri ni tsukawasu watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha no kotoba ni kikishitagawanainaraba, (anata gata wa kikishitagawanakattaga,)
Watashi wa kono miya o Shiro no you ni shi, mata kono machi o chi no bankoku ni norowareru mono to suru' ".
Saishi to yogensha oyobi subete no tami wa, Eremiya ga Shu no miya de korera no kotoba o kataru no o kiita.
Eremiya ga Shu ni meijirareta subete no kotoba o tami ni tsuge owatta toki, saishi to yogensha oyobi tami wa mina kare o toraete itta, "Anata wa shinanakereba naranai.
Naze anata wa Shu no na ni yotte yogen shi, kono miya wa Shiro no you ni nari, kono machi wa arasarete sumu hito mo nakunarude arou to itta no ka" to. Tami wa mina Shu no miya ni atsumatte Eremiya o torikakonda.
Yuda no tsukasatachi wa kono koto o kiite ou no kyuuden o dete Shu no miya ni nobori, Shu no miya no "Atarashii mon" no iriguchi ni zashita.
Saishi to yogensha ra wa, tsukasatachi to subete no tami ni uttaete itta, "Kono hito wa shikei ni shosubeki mono desu. Anata gata ga jibun no mimi de kikareta you ni, kono machi ni sakarau yogen o shita no desu".
Sono toki Eremiya wa, tsukasatachi to subete no tami ni itta, "Shu wa watashi o tsukawashi, kono miya to kono machi ni mukatte, yogen o saserareta no de, sono subete no kotoba o anata gata wa kiita.
Sore de, anata gata wa ima, anata gata no michi to okonai o aratame, anata gata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagai nasai. Sou surunaraba Shu wa anata gata ni wazawai o kudasou to shita koto o omoinaosareru.
Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no te no naka ni aru. Anata gata no me ni, yoi to mie, tadashii to omou koto o watashi ni okonau ga yoi.
Tada akiraka ni kono koto o shitte oki nasai. Moshi anata gata ga watashi o korosunaraba, tsumi naki mono no chi wa anata gata no mi to, kono machi to, sono juumin to ni kisuru. Makoto ni Shu ga watashi o tsukawashite, kono subete no kotoba o anata gata no mimi ni, tsugesaseraretakara de aru".
Tsukasatachi to, subete no tami to wa, saishi to yogensha ni itta, "Kono hito wa shikei ni shosubeki mono de wa nai. Wareware no kami, Shu no na ni yotte wareware ni katatta no de aru".
Sono toki kono chi no chouroutachi suunin ga tatte, soko ni atsumatte iru subete no mono ni tsugete itta,
"Yuda no ou Hizekiya no yo ni, Moreshite bi to Mika wa Yuda no subete no tami ni yogen shite itta, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, Shion wa hatake no you ni tagayasare, Erusaremu wa ishizuka to nari, miya no yama wa ki no oishigeru takai tokoro to naru'.
Yuda no ou Hizekiya to, subete no Yuda no hito wa kare o korosou to shita koto ga arou ka. Hizekiya wa Shu o osore, Shu no megumi o motometa no de, Shu wa karera ni wazawai o kudasuto otsuge ni natta no o omoinaosaretade wa nai ka. Shikashi, wareware wa, jibun no mi ni ookina wazawai o manekou to shite iru".
Shu no na ni yotte yogen shita hito ga hoka ni mo atta. Sunawachi kiriate yarimu no Shimaya no ko Uriya de aru. Kare wa Eremiya to onaji you na kotoba o motte, kono machi to kono chi ni mukatte yogen shita.
Ehoyakimu ou to, sono subete no yuushi to, subete no tsukasatachi wa sono kotoba o kiita. Soshite ou wa kare o korosou to omottaga, Uriya wa kore o kiite osore, Ejiputo ni nigete itta no de,
Ehoyakimu ou wa hito o Ejiputo ni tsukawashita. Sunawachi Akuboru no ko Erunatan to ta no suu mei no hito o, Ejiputo ni tsukawashita.
Karera wa Uriya o Ejiputo kara hikidashi, Ehoyakimu ou no moto ni tsurete kita no de, ou wa tsurugi o motte kare o koroshi, sono shitai o kyoudou bochi ni sutesaseta.
Shikashi Shapan no ko Ahikamu wa Eremiya o tasuke, tami no te ni watasarete korosareru koto no nai you ni shita.
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Zedekiya ga yo o osame hajimeta koro, kono kotoba ga Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda.
Sunawachi Shu wa kou watashi ni ooserareta, "Tsuna to, kubiki to o tsukutte, sore o anata no kubi ni tsuke,
Erusaremu ni iru Yuda no ou Zedekiya no tokoro ni kita shishatachi ni yotte, Edomu no ou, Moabu no ou, Anmon bito no ou, Tsuro no ou, Shidon no ou ni ii okuri nasai.
Karera no shukun ni kono inochi o tsutaesase nasai, 'Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, anata gata wa shukun ni kono you ni tsugenakereba naranai.
Watashi wa ooinaru chikara to nobeta ude to o motte, chi to chi no ue ni iru hito to kemono to o tsukutta mono de aru. Soshite kokoro no mama ni chi o hito ni ataeru.
Ima watashi wa kono subete no kuni o, watashi no shimobe de aru Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no te ni atae, mata no no kemono o mo kare ni ataete kare ni tsukaesaseta.
Kare no chi ni toki ga kuru made, bankokumin wa kare to sono ko to sono mago ni tsukaeru. Sono toki ga kurunaraba, ooku no kuni to ooinaru outachi to ga kare o jibun no dorei ni suru.
Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ni tsukaezu, Babiron no ou no kubiki o jibun no kubi ni owanai tami to kuni to wa, watashi ga tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o motte basshi, tsuini wa kare no te ni yotte kotogotoku horobosu to Shu wa iwareru.
Sore de, anata gata no yogensha, uranaishi, yumemiru mono, hou jutsushi, mahoutsukai ga, "Anata gata wa Babiron no ou ni tsukaeru koto wa nai" to itte mo, kiite wa naranai.
Karera wa anata gata ni itsuwari o yogen shite, anatagata o jibun no kuni kara tooku hanaresase, watashi ni, anatagata o oidashite anatagata o horobosaseru no de aru.
Shikashi Babiron no ou no kubiki o kubi ni otte, kare ni tsukaeru kokumin o, watashi wa sono kokoku ni nokorase, sore o tagayashite, soko ni sumawaseru to Shu wa iwareru' ".
Watashi wa Yuda no ou Zedekiya ni mo onaji you ni itta, "Anata gata wa, Babiron no ou no kubiki o jibun no kubi ni otte, kare to sono tami to ni tsukae, soshite iki nasai.
Dou shite anata to, anata no tami to ga, Shu ga Babiron no ou ni tsukaenai kokumin ni tsuite iwareta you ni, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou ni shinde yokarou ka.
Anata gata wa Babiron no ou ni tsukaeru koto wa naito anata gata ni tsugeru yogensha no kotoba o kiite wa naranai. Karera ga anata gata ni yogen shite iru koto wa itsuwari de arukara da.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi ga karera o tsukawashita no de wa nai no ni, karera wa watashi no na ni yotte itsuwatte yogen shite iru. Sono tame ni, watashi wa anatagata o oiharai, anata gata to, anata gata ni yogen suru yogensha tachi o horobosu you ni naru no da".
Watashi wa mata saishi to kono subete no tami to ni katatte itta, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Miyo, Shu no miya no utsuwa wa ima, sumiyaka ni, Babiron kara kaesarete kuru' to anata gata ni yogen suru yogensha no kotoba o kiite wa naranai. Sore wa, karera ga anata gata ni yogen shite iru koto wa itsuwari de arukara da.
Karera no iu koto o kiite wa naranai. Babiron no ou ni tsukae, soshite iki nasai. Dou shite kono machi ga arechi to natte yokarou ka.
Moshi karera ga yogensha de atte, Shu no kotoba ga karera no uchi ni aru no de areba, Shu no miya to Yuda no ou no kyuuden to Erusaremu to ni nokosarete iru utsuwa ga, Babiron ni utsusarenai you ni, bangun no Shu ni, torinashi o negaubekida.
Bangun no Shu wa hashira to umi to dai, sono ta kono machi ni nokotte iru utsuwa ni tsuite, kou ooserareru.
Kore wa Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga, Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu no ko Ekoniya, oyobi Yuda to Erusaremu no subete no mibun no tattoi hitobito o toraete Erusaremu kara Babiron ni utsushita toki ni, mochisaranakatta utsuwa de aru. - -
Sunawachi bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa, Shu no miya to Yuda no ou no kyuuden to Erusaremu to ni nokosarete iru utsuwa ni tsuite, kou ooserareru.
Korera wa Babiron ni tazusae ikare, watashi ga kaerimiru hi made soko ni okarete iru. Sono nochi, watashi wa korera no mono o, kono tokoro ni tazusae kaeraseru to Shu wa iwareru".
Sono nen, sunawachi Yuda no ou Zedekiya no chisei no hajime, sono daiyon nen no go gatsu, Gibeon shusshin no yogensha de atte, Azuru no ko de aru Hananiya wa, Shu no miya de saishi to subete no tami no mae de watashi ni katatte itta,
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa Babiron no ou no kubiki o kudaita.
Ni nen no uchi ni, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ga, kono tokoro kara totte Babiron ni tazusaete itta Shu no miya no utsuwa o, mina kono tokoro ni kaeraseru.
Watashi wa mata Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu no ko Ekoniya to, Babiron ni itta Yuda no subete no torawarebito o kono tokoro ni kaeraseru. Sore wa, watashi ga Babiron no ou no kubiki o, kudakukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru".
Soko de yogensha Eremiya wa Shu no miya no uchi ni tatte iru saishi to subete no tami no mae de, yogensha Hananiya ni itta.
Sunawachi yogensha Eremiya wa itta, "Amen. Dou ka Shu ga kono you ni shite kudasaru you ni. Dou ka anata no yogen shita kotoba ga jouju shite, Babiron ni tazusaete itta Shu no miya no utsuwa to subete no torawarebito o, Shu ga Babiron kara futatabi kono tokoro ni kaerasete kudasaru you ni.
Tadashi, ima watashi ga anata to subete no tami no kiite iru tokoro de kataru kono kotoba o kiki nasai.
Watashi to, anata no saki ni deta yogensha wa, mukashi kara, ooku no chi to ookina kuni ni tsuite, tatakai to, kikin to, ekibyou no koto o yogen shita.
Heiwa o yogen suru yogensha wa, sono yogensha no kotoba ga jouju suru toki, shinjitsu ni Shu ga sono yogensha o tsukawasareta no de aru koto ga shirareru no da".
Soko de yogensha Hananiya wa yogensha Eremiya no kubi kara, kubiki o totte, sore o kudaita.
Soshite Hananiya wa, subete no tami no mae de katari, "Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa ni nen no uchi ni, kono you ni, bankokumin no kubi kara Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no kubiki o hanashite kudaku' " to itta. Yogensha Eremiya wa satte itta.
Yogensha Hananiya ga yogensha Eremiya no kubi kara, kubiki o hanashite kudaita nochi, shibaraku shite Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Itte, Hananiya ni tsuge nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata wa ki no kubiki o kudaitaga, watashi wa sore ni kaete tetsu no kubiki o tsukurou.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa tetsu no kubiki o kono bankokumin no kubi ni oite, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru ni tsukaesaseru. Karera wa kore ni tsukaeru. Watashi wa no no kemono o mo kare ni ataeta' ".
Yogensha Eremiya wa mata yogensha Hananiya ni itta, "Hananiya yo, kiki nasai. Shu ga anata o tsukawasareta no de wa nai. Anata wa kono tami ni itsuwari o shinjisaseta.
Sore yue Shu wa ooserareru, 'Watashi wa anata o chi no omote kara nozoku. Anata wa Shu ni taisuru hangyaku o katatta no de, imatoshi no uchi ni shinu no da' to".
Yogensha Hananiya wa sono nen no nana gatsu ni shinda.
Kore wa yogensha Eremiya ga Erusaremu kara, kano toraeutsusareta chouroutachi, oyobi Nebukadenezaru ni yotte Erusaremu kara Babiron ni toraeutsusareta saishi to yogensha narabi ni subete no tami ni okutta tegami ni kakishirushita kotoba de aru.
Sore wa Ekoniya ou to taikou to kangan oyobi Yuda to Erusaremu no tsukasatachi, oyobi koushou to kaji to ga Erusaremu o satte nochi ni kakareta mono de atte,
Eremiya wa sono tegami o Shapan no ko Erasa oyobi Hirukiya no ko Gemariya no te ni yotte okutta. Kono hitobito wa Yuda no ou Zedekiya ga Babiron ni ikase, Babiron no ou Nebukadenezaru no moto ni tsukawashita mono de atta. Sono tegami ni wa tsugi no you ni kaite atta.
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa, subete toraeutsusareta mono, sunawachi, watashi ga Erusaremu kara, Babiron ni toraeutsusaseta mono ni, kou iu,
Anata gata wa ie o tatete, sore ni sumi, hatake o tsukutte sono sanbutsu o tabe yo.
Tsuma o metotte, musuko musume o umi, mata, sono musuko ni yome o metori, musume o totsugasete, musuko musume o umu you ni seyo. Sono tokoro de anata gata no kazu o mashi, hette wa naranai.
Watashi ga anatagata o toraeutsusaseta tokoro no machi no heian o motome, sono tame ni Shu ni inoru ga yoi. Sono machi ga heian de areba, anata gata mo heian o erukara de aru.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata no uchi ni iru yogensha to uranaishi ni madowasarete wa naranai. Mata karera no miru yume ni kikishitagatte wa naranai.
Sore wa, karera ga watashi no na ni yotte anata gata ni itsuwari o yogen shite irukara de aru. Watashi ga karera o tsukawashita no de wa nai to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, Babiron de nanajuu nen ga michirunaraba, watashi wa anatagata o kaerimi, watashi no yakusoku o hatashi, anatagata o kono tokoro ni michibiki kaeru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi ga anata gata ni taishite idaite iru keikaku wa watashi ga shitte iru. Sore wa wazawai o ataeyou to iu no de wa naku, heian o ataeyou to suru mono de ari, anata gata ni shourai o atae, kibou o ataeyou to suru mono de aru.
Sono toki, anata gata wa watashi ni yobawari, kite, watashi ni inoru. Watashi wa anata gata no inori o kiku.
Anata gata wa watashi o tazunemotomete, watashi ni au. Moshi anata gata ga isshin ni watashi o tazunemotomerunaraba,
Watashi wa anata gata ni auto Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa anata gata no han'ei o kaifuku shi, anatagata o bankoku kara, subete watashi ga anatagata o oiyatta tokoro kara atsume, katsu, watashi ga anatagata o toraware hanaresaseta sono moto no tokoro ni, anatagata o michibiki kaerou to Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa, 'Shu wa Babiron de wareware no tame ni yogensha tachi o okosareta' to ittaga, - -
Shu wa Dabide no kurai ni zashite iru ou to, kono machi ni sumu subete no tami de, anata gata to tomo ni toraeutsusarenakatta kyoudaitachi ni tsuite, kou iwareru,
'Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o karera ni okuri, karera o warukute taberarenai kusatta ichijiku no you ni shite shimau.
Watashi wa tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o motte karera no ato o oi, mata karera o chi no bankoku ni imikirawareru mono to nashi, watashi ga karera o oiyaru kuniguni de, noroi to nari, osore to nari, monowarai to nari, hazukashime to naraseru.
Sore wa karera ga watashi no kotoba ni kikishitagawanakattakara de aru to Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa kono kotoba o, watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni yotte, shikiri ni okuttaga, anata gata wa kikou to mo shinakatta to Shu wa iwareru'. - -
Watashi ga Erusaremu kara Babiron ni okutta anata gata subete no torawarebito yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai,
'Watashi no na ni yotte, anata gata ni itsuwari o yogen shite iru Koraya no ko Ahabu to, Maaseya no ko Zedekiya ni tsuite bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa karera o Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te ni watasu. Ou wa anata gata no me no mae de karera o korosu.
Babiron ni iru Yuda no torawarebito wa mina, karera no na o, noroi no kotoba ni mochiite, "Shu ga anata o Babiron no ou ga hi de yaita Zedekiya to Ahabu no you ni sareru you ni" to iu.
Sore wa, karera ga Isuraeru no uchi de oroka na koto o shi, tonari no tsuma to fugi o okonai, watashi ga meijita no de nai itsuwari no kotoba o, watashi no na ni yotte katatta koto ni yoru no de aru. Watashi wa sore o shitte ori, mata sono shounin de aru to Shu wa iwareru' ".
Neheramu bi to Shimaya ni anata wa ii nasai,
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, anata wa jibun no na de Erusaremu ni iru subete no tami to, Maaseya no ko saishi Zepaniya oyobi subete no saishi ni tegami o okutte iu,
'Shu wa saishi Ehoyada ni kawatte anata o saishi to shi, Shu no miya o tsukasadorase, subete kurui, katsu yogen suru mono o ashikase to kubikase ni tsunagaserareru.
Sou de aru no ni, dou shite anata wa, anata gata ni yogen shite iru Anatote no Eremiya o imashimenai no ka.
Kare wa Babiron ni iru wareware no tokoro ni tegami o okutte, toraware no toki wa nao nagai yue, anata gata wa ie o tatete soko ni sumi, hatake o tsukutte sono sanbutsu o tabeyo to itte kita' ".
Saishi Zepaniya wa kono tegami o yogensha Eremiya ni yomikikaseta.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Subete no torawarebito ni kakiokutte ii nasai, Neheramu bi to Shimaya no koto ni tsuite Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi wa Shimaya o tsukawasanakatta no ni, kare ga anata gata ni yogen shite itsuwari o shinjisaseta no de,
Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa Neheramu bi to Shimaya to sono shison o bassuru. Kare wa Shu ni taisuru hangyaku o katatta yue, kare ni zokusuru mono de, kono tami no uchi ni sumi, watashi ga jibun no tami ni okonaou to shite iru yoi koto o miru mono wa hitori mo inai".
Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba.
"Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi ga anata ni katatta kotoba o, kotogotoku shomotsu ni shirushi nasai.
Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi ga waga tami Isuraeru to Yuda no han'ei o kaifuku suru hi ga kuru. Shu ga kore o iwareru. Watashi wa karera o, sono senzo ni ataeta chi ni kaerase, karera ni kore o tamotaseru".
Kore wa Shu ga Isuraeru to Yuda ni tsuite iwareta kotoba de aru.
"Shu wa kou ooserareru, wareware wa ononoki no koe o kiita. Osore ga ari, heian wa nai.
Ko o umu otoko ga aru ka, tazunete mi yo. Dou shite otoko ga mina ko o umu onna no you ni te o koshi ni oku no o watashi wa miru no ka. Naze, dono hito no kaoiro mo aoku kawatte iru no ka.
Kanashii ka na, sono hi wa ooinaru hi de atte, sore ni kuraberubeki hi wa nai. Sore wa Yakobu no nayami no toki de aru. Shikashi kare wa sore kara sukuidasareru.
Bangun no Shu wa ooserareru, sono hi watashi wa karera no kubi kara sono kubiki o kudaki hanashi, karera no sokubaku o toku. Ihou no hito wa mohaya, karera o shieki suru koto o shinai.
Karera wa sono kami, Shu to, watashi ga karera no tame ni tateru sono ou Dabide ni tsukaeru.
Shu wa ooserareru, waga shimobe Yakobu yo, osoreru koto wa nai, Isuraeru yo, odoroku koto wa nai. Miyo, watashi ga anata o sukutte, tooku kara kaeshi, anata no shison o sukutte, sono toraeutsusareta chi kara kaesukara da. Yakobu wa kaette kite, odayaka ni yasuraka ni ori, kare o osoresaseru mono wa nai.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa anata to tomo ni ite, anata o sukuu. Watashi wa anata o chirashita kuniguni o kotogotoku horoboshi tsukusu. Shikashi, anata o horoboshi tsukusu koto wa shinai. Watashi wa tadashii michi ni shitagatte anata o korashimeru. Kesshite basshinaide wa okanai.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata no itami wa iezu, anata no kizu wa omoi.
Anata no uttae o shiji suru mono wa naku, anata no kizu o tsutsumu kusuri wa naku, anata o iyasu mono mo nai.
Anata no aisuru mono wa mina anata o wasurete anata no koto o kokoro ni tomenai. Sore wa, anata no toga ga ooku, anata no tsumi ga hanahadashii no de, watashi ga ada o utsu you ni anata o uchi, zannin na teki no you ni korashitakara da.
Naze, anata no kizu no tame ni sakebu no ka, anata no nayami wa ieru koto wa nai. Anata no toga ga ooku, anata no tsumi ga hanahadashii no de, korera no koto o watashi wa anata ni shita no de aru.
Shikashi, subete anata o kuihorobosu mono wa kuihorobosare, anata o shi etageru mono wa, hitori nokorazu, toraeutsusare, anata o kasumeru mono wa, kasumerare, subete anata no mono o ubau mono wa ubawareru mono to naru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa anata no kenkou o kaifuku sase, anata no kizu o iyasu. Sore wa, hito ga anata o suterareta mono to yobi, 'Dare mo kokoro ni tomenai Shion' to iukara de aru.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa Yakobu no tenmaku o futatabi sakaesase, sono sumai ni awaremi o hodokosu. Machi wa, sono oka ni tatenaosare, kyuuden wa moto tatte ita tokoro ni tatsu.
Kansha no uta to yorokobu mono no koe to ga, sono naka kara deru. Watashi ga karera o masu yue, karera wa sukunaku wa naku, mata karera o tattobareshimeru yue, iyashimerareru koto wa nai.
Sono kora wa, inishie no you ni nari, sono kaishuu wa watashi no mae ni kataku tatsu. Subete karera o shi etageru mono o watashi wa bassuru.
Sono kimi wa karera jishin no uchi no hitori de ari, sono tsukasa wa, sono uchi kara deru. Watashi wa kare o watashi ni chikazuke, kare wa watashi ni chikazuku. Dare ka jibun no inochi o kakete watashi ni chikazuku mono ga arou ka to Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa, watashi no tami to nari, watashi wa anata gata no kami to naru".
Miyo, Shu no boufuu ga kuru. Ikidoori to, tsumujikaze ga dete, akunin no koube o utsu.
Shu no hageshii ikari wa, mikokoro ni omoisadamerareta koto o okonatte, kore o togeru made, shirizoku koto wa nai.sue no hi ni anata gata wa kore o satoru no de aru.
"Shu wa iwareru, sono toki watashi wa Isuraeru no zenbuzoku no kami to nari, karera wa watashi no tami to naru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Tsurugi o nogarete ikinokotta tami wa, arano de megumi o eta. Isuraeru ga ansoku o motometa toki,
Shu wa tooku kara kare ni arawareta. Watashi wa kagirinaki ai o motte anata o aishite iru. Sore yue, watashi wa taezu anata ni shinjitsu o tsukushite kita.
Isuraeru no otome yo, futatabi watashi wa anata o tateru, anata wa taterareru. Anata wa futatabi tsuzumi o motte mi o kazari, dete itte, yorokobitanoshimu mono to tomo ni odoru.
Mata anata wa budou no ki o Samariya no yama ni ueru. Ueru mono wa, uete sono mi o taberu koto ga dekiru.
Mimamoru mono ga Efuraimu no yama no ue ni tatte yobawaru hi ga kuru. 'Tatte, Shion ni nobori, wareware no kami, Shu ni, mou de you' to".
Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Yakobu no tame ni yorokonde koe takaku utai, bankoku no kashira no tame ni sakebigoe o age yo. Tsuge shimeshi, hometataete ie, 'Shu wa sono tami Isuraeru no nokori no mono o sukuwareta' to.
Miyo, watashi wa karera o kita no kuni kara tsurekaeri, karera o chi no hate kara atsumeru. Karera no uchi ni wa, moujin yaa shinae, ninpu, sanpu mo tomo ni iru. Karera wa ookina mure to natte, koko ni kaette kuru.
Karera wa nakikanashinde kaette kuru. Watashi wa nagusamenagara karera o michibiki kaeru. Karera ga tsumazukanai you ni, massugu na michi ni yori, mizu no nagare no soba o tooraseru. Sore wa, watashi ga Isuraeru no chichi de ari, Efuraimu wa watashi no choushi dakara de aru.
Bankoku no tami yo, anata gata wa Shu no kotoba o kiki, kore o tooi, umizoi no chi ni shimeshite ii nasai, 'Isuraeru o chirashita mono ga kore o atsumerareru. Bokusha ga sono mure o mamoru you ni kore o mamorareru' to.
Sunawachi Shu wa Yakobu o aganai, karera yori mo tsuyoi mono no te kara kare o sukuidasareta.
Karera wa kite Shion no yama de koe takaku utai, Shu kara tamawatta yoi mono no tame ni, kokumotsu to sake to abura oyobi wakaki hitsuji to ushi no tame ni, yorokobi ni kagayaku. Sono tamashii wa uruou sono no you ni nari, karera wa kasanete ureeru koto ga nai.
Sono toki otometachi wa matte tanoshimi, wakai mono mo oita mono mo tomo ni tanoshimu. Watashi wa karera no kanashimi o yorokobi ni kae, karera o nagusame, urei no kawari ni yorokobi o ataeru.
Watashi wa ooku no sasagemono de, saishi no kokoro o akase, watashi no yoki mono de, watashi no tami o michi taraseru to Shu wa iwareru".
Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Nagekikanashimi, itaku naku koe ga Rama de kikoeru. Rakeru ga sono kora no tame ni nageku no de aru. Kora ga mohaya inai no de, kanojo wa sono kora no koto de nagusamerareru no o negawanai".
Shu wa kou ooserareru, "Anata wa naku koe o todome, me kara namida o nagasu koto o yameyo. Anata no waza ni mukui ga aru. Karera wa teki no chi kara kaette kuru to Shu wa iwareru.
Anata no shourai ni wa kibou ga ari, anata no kodomotachi wa jibun no kuni ni kaette kuru to Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa tashika ni, Efuraimu ga kou itte nageku no kiita, 'Anata wa watashi o kora shimerareta, watashi wa kubiki ni narenai koushi no you ni kora shime o uketa. Shu yo, anata wa watashi no kami, Shu de iraserareru, watashi o tsurekaette, moto ni kaeshite kudasai.
Watashi wa somuki satta nochi, kui, oshie o uketa nochi, momo o utta. Wakai toki no hazukashime ga mi ni aru no de, watashi wa haji, urotaeta'.
Shu wa iwareru, Efuraimu wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no yorokobu ko de arou ka. Watashi wa kare ni tsuite kataru goto ni, nao kare o wasureru koto ga dekinai. Sore yue, watashi no kokoro wa kare o shitatte iru. Watashi wa kanarazu kare o awaremu.
Mizukara no tame ni michishirube o oki, mizukara no tame ni hyouchuu o tate yo. Ooji ni, anata no tootte itta michi ni kokoro o tomeyo. Isuraeru no otome yo, kaere, korera no, anata no machimachi ni kaere.
Fushin no musume yo, itsu made samayou no ka. Shu wa chi no ue ni atarashii koto o souzou sareta no da, onna ga otoko o hogo suru koto de aru".
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, "Watashi ga karera o futatabi sakaesaseru toki, hitobito wa mata Yuda no chi to sono machimachi de kono kotoba o iu, 'Seigi no sumika yo, sei naru yama yo, dou ka Shu ga omae o shukufuku shite kudasaru you ni'.
Yuda to sono subete no machi no hito, oyobi noufu to mure o katte arukimawaru mono wa tomo ni soko ni sumu.
Watashi ga tsukareta tamashii o akitarase, subete nayande iru tamashii o nagusamerukara de aru".
Koko de watashi wa me o samashitaga, watashi no nemuri wa, kokochiyokatta.
"Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi ga hito no tane to kemono no tane to o Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie to ni maku hi ga kuru.
Watashi wa karera o nuki, kudaki, taoshi, horoboshi, nayamasou to machikamaete ita you ni, mata karera o tate, ueyou to machikamaete iru to Shu wa iwareru.
Sono toki, karera wa mohaya, 'Chichi ga suppai budou o tabeta no de, kodomo no ha ga uku' to wa iwanai.
Hito wa meimei jibun no tsumi ni yotte shinu. Suppai budou o taberu hito wa mina, sono ha ga uku.
Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi ga Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie to ni atarashii keiyaku o tateru hi ga kuru.
Kono keiyaku wa watashi ga karera no senzo o sono te o totte Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashita hi ni tateta you na mono de wa nai. Watashi wa karera no otto de atta no daga, karera wa sono watashi no keiyaku o yabutta to Shu wa iwareru.
Shikashi, sorera no hi no nochi ni watashi ga Isuraeru no ie ni tateru keiyaku wa kore de aru. Sunawachi watashi wa, watashi no rippou o karera no uchi ni oki, sono kokoro ni shirusu. Watashi wa karera no kami to nari, karera wa watashi no tami to naruto Shu wa iwareru.
Hito wa mohaya, onoono sono tonari to sono kyoudai ni oshiete, 'Anata wa Shu o shiri nasai' to wa iwanai. Sore wa, karera ga shouyoridai ni itaru made mina, watashi o shiru you ni narukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa karera no fugi o yurushi, mohaya sono tsumi o omowanai".
Shu wa kou iwareru, sunawachi taiyou o ataete hiru no hikari to shi, tsuki to hoshi to o sadamete yoru no hikari to shi, umi o kakitatete, sono nami o nari todorokaseru mono - - sono na wa bangun no Shu to iu.
Shu wa iwareru, "Moshi kono sadame ga watashi no mae de sutarete shimaunara, Isuraeru no shison mo sutatte, eikyuu ni watashi no mae de tami de aru koto wa dekinai".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Moshi ue no ten o hakaru koto ga deki, shita no chi no motoi o saguru koto ga dekirunara, sono toki, watashi wa Isuraeru no subete no shison o sono moromoro no okonai no tame ni sutesaruto Shu wa iwareru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Miyo, kono machi ga, Hananeru no tou kara sumi no mon made, Shu no tame ni saiken sareru toki ga kuru.
Hakari nawa wa sore yori mo tooku massugu ni nobite, Garebu no oka ni tasshi, Goa no hou ni mukau.
Shitai to hai to no tani no zenbu, mata Kideron no tani ni iku made to, higashi no hou no uma no mon no sumi ni iku made to no subete no hatake wa mina Shu no sei naru tokoro to nari, eien ni watatte, futatabi nukare, mata taosareru koto wa nai".
Yuda no ou Zedekiya no juu nen, sunawachi Nebukaderezaru no juu hachi nen ni, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Sono toki, Babiron no ou no gunzei ga Erusaremu o semekakonde ite, yogensha Eremiya wa Yuda no ou no kyuuden ni aru kanshi no niwa no uchi ni kankin sarete ita.
Yuda no ou Zedekiya ga kare o tojikometa no de aruga, ou wa itta, "Naze anata wa yogen shite iu no ka, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa kono machi o Babiron no ou no te ni watashi, kare wa kore o toru.
Mata Yuda no ou Zedekiya wa Karudeya bito no te o nogareru koto naku, kanarazu Babiron no ou no te ni watasare, kao to kao o awasete kare to katari, me to me wa aimamieru.
Soshite kare wa Zedekiya o Babiron ni hiite iki, Zedekiya wa, watashi ga kare o kaerimiru toki made, soko ni iru to Shu wa iwareru. Anata gata wa, Karudeya bito to tatakatte mo katsu koto wa dekinai' to".
Eremiya wa itta, "Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde iwareru,
'Miyo, anata no oji Sharumu no ko Hanameru ga anata no tokoro ni kite iu, "Anatote ni aru watashi no hatake o kai nasai. Sore wa, kore o kaitori, aganau kenri ga anata ni arukara" to'.
Hatashite Shu no kotoba no you ni, watashi no itoko de aru Hanameru ga kanshi no niwa no uchi ni iru watashi no tokoro ni kite itta, 'Beniyamin no chi no Anatote ni aru watashi no hatake o katte kudasai. Shoyuu suru no mo, aganau no mo, anata no kenri na no desu. Kaitotte anata no mono ni shite kudasai. Kore ga Shu no kotoba de aru no o watashi wa shitte imashita'.
Soko de watashi wa, itoko no Hanameru kara Anatote ni aru hatake o kaitori, gin juu nana shikeru o hakatte kare ni shiharatta.
Sunawachi, watashi wa sono shousho o tsukutte, kore ni kimei shi, sore o fuuin shi, shounin o tate, hakari o motte gin o hakatte ataeta.
Soshite watashi wa sono yakujou o shirushite fuuin shita baishuu shousho to, fuuin no nai utsushi to o tori,
Itoko no Hanameru to, baishuu shousho ni kimei shita shounintachi, oyobi kanshi no niwa ni suwatte iru subete no Yudayahito no mae de, sono shousho o Maaseya no ko de aru Neriya no ko Baruku ni atae,
Karera no mae de, watashi wa Baruku ni meijite itta,
'Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, korera no shousho sunawachi, kono baishuu shousho no fuuin shita mono to, fuuin no nai utsushi to o tori, korera o tsuchi no utsuwa ni irete, nagaku hozon seyo.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami ga kou iwarerukara de aru, "Kono chi de hitobito wa mata ie to hatake to budou hatake o kau you ni naru" to'.
Watashi wa baishuu shousho o Neriya no ko Baruku ni watashita ato de Shu ni inotte itta,
'Aa Shu naru kami yo, anata wa ooinaru chikara to, nobeta ude o motte ten to chi o otsukuri ni natta no desu. Anata no dekinai koto wa, hitotsu mo arimasen.
Anata wa itsukushimi o sen mannin ni hodokoshi, mata chichi no tsumi o sono nochi no shison ni mukuirareru no desu. Anata wa ooinaru zennou no kami de iraserare, sono na wa bangun no Shu to mousaremasu.
Anata no hakarigoto wa ookiku, mata, koto o okonau no ni chikara ga ari, anata no me wa hitobito no ayumu subete no michi o mite, onoono no michi ni shitagai, sono okonai no mi ni yotte kore ni mukuiraremasu.
Anata wa, shirushi to, fushigi na wazato o Ejiputo no chi ni okonai, mata konnichi ni itaru made Isuraeru to zenjinrui no uchi ni okonai, soshite konnichi no you ni na o ageraremashita.
Anata wa, shirushi to, fushigi na waza to, tsuyoi te to, nobeta ude to, ooinaru osorubeki koto o motte, anata no tami Isuraeru o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashi,
Kono chi o karera ni tamawarimashita. Kore wa anata ga karera no senzotachi ni ataeyou to chikawareta chichi to mitsu no nagareru chi desu.
Kou shite karera wa, hai tte kore o eta no desuga, anata no koe ni kikishitagawazu, anata no rippou o okonawazu, subete anata ga seyo to meijirareta koto o shinakatta no de, anata wa kono wazawai o karera no ue ni okudashi ni narimashita.
Miyo, rui ga kizukiagerareta no wa, kono machi o toru tame desu. Tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou no tame ni, machi wa kore o semete iru Karudeya bito no te ni watasaremasu. Anata no iwareta you ni narimashita no wa, goran no toori de arimasu.
Shu naru kami yo, anata wa watashi ni iwaremashita, "Gin o motte hatake o kai, shounin o tateyo" to. Sou de aru no ni, machi wa Karudeya bito no te ni watasarete imasu' ".
Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Miyo, watashi wa Shu de aru, subete inochi aru mono no kami de aru. Watashi ni dekinai koto ga arou ka.
Sore yue, Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kono machi o Karudeya bito to, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te ni watasu. Kare wa kore o toru.
Kono machi o semete iru Karudeya bito ga kite, kono machi ni hi o tsukete yakiharau. Yane no ue de hitobito ga, Baaru ni kou o taki, hoka no kamigami ni sake o sosoide, watashi o ikaraseta sono ie o mo karera wa yaku.
Sore wa, Isuraeru no hitobito to Yuda no hitobito to wa, sono wakai toki kara, watashi no mae ni warui koto nomi o okonai, mata Isuraeru no tami wa sono te no waza o motte, watashi o ikaraseru koto bakari o shitakara de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Kono machi wa sore ga tatta hi kara kyou made, watashi no ikari to ikidoori to o hikiokoshite kita no de, watashi no mae kara kore o nozokisaru no de aru.
Sore wa, Isuraeru no tami to Yuda no tami to ga, moromoro no aku o itte, watashi o ikaraseta koto ni yoru no de aru. - - karera no outachi to, sono tsukasatachi, saishitachi, yogensha tachi, mata Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu no juumintachi ga mina sou de aru.
Karera wa sono senaka o watashi ni mukete kao o watashi ni mukezu, watashi ga tayumazu oshieta ni mo kakawarazu, karera wa oshie o kikazu, mata ukenai no de aru.
Karera wa nikumubeki mono o, waga na o motte yobarete iru ie ni suetsukete, soko o kegashi,
Mata Benhinnomu no tani ni Baaru no takaki tokoro o kizuite, musuko musume o Moreku ni sasageta. Watashi wa karera ni kono you na koto o meijita koto wa naku, mata karera ga kono nikumubeki koto o itte, Yuda ni tsumi o okasaseyou to wa kangae mo shinakatta.
Sore yue ima Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa, kono machi, sunawachi anata ga taga, 'Tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou no tame ni Babiron no ou no te ni watasareru' to itte iru machi ni tsuite kou ooserareru,
Miyo, watashi wa, watashi no ikari to ikidoori to ooinaru ikari o motte, karera o oiyatta moromoro no kuni kara karera o atsume, kono tokoro e michibiki kaette, yasuraka ni sumawaseru.
Soshite karera wa watashi no tami to nari, watashi wa karera no kami to naru.
Watashi wa karera ni hitotsu no kokoro to hitotsu no michi o ataete tsune ni watashi o osoresaseru. Kore wa karera ga karera jishin to sono nochi no shison no saiwai o eru tame de aru.
Watashi wa karera to eien no keiyaku o tatete, karera o misutezu ni megumi o hodokosu koto o chikai, mata watashi o osoreru osore o karera no kokoro ni oite, watashi o hanareru koto no nai you ni shiyou.
Watashi wa karera ni megumi o hodokosu koto o yorokobi to shi, kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, shinjitsu o motte karera o kono chi ni ueru.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, watashi ga kono moromoro no ookina wazawai o kono tami ni kudashita you ni, watashi ga karera ni yakusoku suru moromoro no saiwai o karera no ue ni kudasu.
Hitobito wa kono chi ni hatake o kau you ni naru. Anata ga taga, 'Sore wa arete hito mo kemono mo inaku nari, Karudeya bito no te ni watasarete shimau' to itte iru chi de aru.
Hitobito wa Beniyamin no chi to, Erusaremu no shuui to, Yuda no machimachi to, sanchi no machimachi to, heichi no machimachi to, Negebu no machimachi de, gin o motte hatake o kai, shousho o tsukutte, kore ni kimei shi fuuin shi, mata shounin o tateru. Sore wa, watashi ga karera o futatabi sakaesaserukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru".
Eremiya ga nao kanshi no niwa ni tojikomerarete iru toki, Shu no kotoba wa futatabi kare ni nozonda,
"Chi o tsukurareta Shu, sore o katachitsukutte kataku tataserareta Shu, sono na o Shu to nanotte orareru mono ga kou ooserareru,
Watashi ni yobimotomeyo, sou sureba, watashi wa anata ni kotaeru. Soshite anata no shiranai ookina kakusarete iru koto o, anata ni shimesu.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa rui to, tsurugi to o fusegu tame ni hakai sareta kono machi no ie to, Yuda no ou no ie ni tsuite kou iwareru,
Karudeya bito wa kite tatakai, watashi ga ikari to ikidoori o motte korosu hitobito no shitai o, sore ni mitasu. Watashi wa hitobito no moromoro no aku no tame ni, kono machi ni watashi no kao o ooikakushita.
Miyo, watashi wa kenkou to, iyashi to o, koko ni motarashite hitobito o iyashi, yutaka na han'ei to anzen to o karera ni shimesu.
Watashi wa Yuda to Isuraeru o futatabi sakaesase, karera o tatete, moto no you ni suru.
Watashi wa karera ga watashi ni mukatte okashita tsumi no subete no toga o kiyome, karera ga watashi ni mukatte okashita tsumi to hangyaku no subete no toga o yurusu.
Kono machi wa chi no moromoro no tami no mae ni, watashi no tame ni yorokobi no na to nari, homare to nari, sakae to naru. Karera wa watashi ga watashi no tami ni hodokosu moromoro no megumi no koto o kiku. Soshite, watashi ga kono machi ni hodokosu moromoro no megumi to, moromoro no han'ei no tame ni osorete mi o furuwasu.
Shu wa kou iwareru, anata ga taga, 'Sore wa arete, hito mo orazu kemono mo inai' to iu kono tokoro, sunawachi, arete, hito mo orazu sumu mono mo naku, kemono mo inai Yuda no machi to Erusaremu no chimata ni,
Futatabi yorokobi no koe, tanoshimi no koe, hanamuko no koe, hanayome no koe, oyobi 'Bangun no Shu ni kansha seyo, Shu wa megumi fukaku, sono itsukushimi wa, itsu made mo taeru koto ga nai' to itte, kansha no sonaemono o Shu no miya ni tazusaete kuru mono no koe ga kikoeru. Sore wa, watashi ga kono chi o futatabi sakaesasete hajime no you ni surukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, arete, hito mo orazu kemono mo inai kono tokoro to, sono subete no machimachi ni futatabi sono mure o fusaseru bokusha no sumai ga aru you ni naru.
Sanchi no machimachi to, heichi no machimachi to, Negebu no machimachi to, Beniyamin no chi, Erusaremu no shuui to, Yuda no machimachi de, mure wa futatabi sore o kazoeru mono no te no shita o toorisugiruto Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi ga Isuraeru no ie to Yuda no ie ni yakusoku shita koto o nashitogeru hi ga kuru.
Sono hi, sono toki ni narunaraba, watashi wa Dabide no tame ni hitotsu no tadashii eda o shoujisaseyou. Kare wa kouhei to seigi o chi ni okonau.
Sono hi, Yuda wa sukui o e, Erusaremu wa yasuraka ni oru. Sono na wa 'Shu wa wareware no seigi' to tonaerareru.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, Isuraeru no ie no kurai ni zasuru hito ga Dabide no shison no uchi ni kakeru koto wa nai.
Mata watashi no mae ni hansai o sasage, sosai o yaki, tsune ni gisei o sasageru hito ga, Rebi bito de aru saishi no uchi ni taeru koto wa nai".
Shu no kotoba wa Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Shu wa kou ooserareru, moshi anata ga taga, hiru to musunda watashi no keiyaku o yaburi, mata yoru to musunda watashi no keiyaku o yaburi, hiru to yoru ga sadamerareta toki ni kinai you ni suru koto ga dekirunaraba,
Shimobe Dabide to watashi ga musunda keiyaku mo mata yabure, kare wa sono kurai ni zashite ou to naru ko o ataerarenai. Mata watashi ga watashi ni tsukaeru Rebi bito de aru saishi ni tateta keiyaku mo yabureru.
Ten no hoshi wa kazoeru koto ga dekizu, hama no suna wa hakaru koto ga dekinai. Sono you ni watashi wa, shimobe Dabide no shison to, watashi ni tsukaeru Rebi bito de aru saishi no kazu o masou".
Shu no kotoba wa Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Anata wa kono tami ga, 'Shu wa mizukara eranda futatsu no yakara o suteta' to itte iru no o kikanai ka. Karera wa kono you ni watashi no tami o anadotte, kore o kuni to minasanai no de aru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, moshi watashi ga hiru to yoru to ni keiyaku o tatezu, mata tenchi no okite o sadamenakatta no de areba,
Watashi wa, Yakobu to watashi no shimobe Dabide to no shison o sutete, futatabi kare no shison no uchi kara Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu no shison o osameru mono o erabanai. Watashi wa karera o futatabi sakaesase, karera ni awaremi o tareyou".
Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga sono zengun to, kare ni shitagatte iru chi no subete no kuni no hitobito, oyobi moromoro no tami o hikiite, Erusaremu to sono machimachi o semete tatakatte ita toki ni, Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba,
"Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, itte Yuda no ou Zedekiya ni tsugete ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kono machi o Babiron no ou no te ni watasu. Kare wa hi de kore o yaku.
Anata wa sono te o nogareru koto wa dekinai, kanarazu toraerarete sono te ni watasareru. Anata wa manoatari Babiron no ou o mi, kao to kao o awasete kare to kataru. Sore kara Babiron e iku'.
Shikashi Yuda no ou Zedekiya yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Shu wa anata no koto ni tsuite kou iwareru, 'Anata wa tsurugi de shinu koto wa nai.
Anata wa yasuraka ni shinu. Tami wa anata no senzo de aru anata no saki no outachi no tame ni kou o taita you ni, anata no tame ni mo kou o taki, mata anata no tame ni nageite "Aa, shukun yo" to iu'. Watashi ga kono kotoba o iu no de aru to Shu wa iwareru".
Soko de yogensha Eremiya wa kono kotoba o kotogotoku Erusaremu de Yuda no ou Zedekiya ni tsugeta.
Sono toki Babiron no ou no gunzei wa Erusaremu, oyobi nokotte iru Yuda no subete no machi, sunawachi Rakishi to Azeka o semete tatakatte ita. Sore wa Yuda no machimachi no uchi ni, korera no kengo na machi ga nao nokotte itakara de aru.
Zedekiya ou ga Erusaremu ni iru subete no tami to keiyaku o tatete, karera ni shakuhou no koto o tsuge shimeshita nochi ni, Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba.
Sono keiyaku wa sunawachi hito ga onoono sono Heburu bito de aru danjo no dorei o kaihou shi, sono kyoudai de aru Yudayahito o dorei to shinai koto o sadameta mono de atta.
Kono keiyaku o shita tsukasatachi to, subete no tami wa hito ga onoono sono danjo no dorei o kaihou shi, futatabi kore o dorei to shinai to iu koto ni kikishitagatte, kore o kaihou shitaga,
Nochi ni kokoro o hirugaeshi, kaihou shita danjo no dorei o hikikaesase, futatabi kore o shitagawasete dorei to shita.
Soko de Shu no kotoba ga Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, watashi wa anata gata no senzo o Ejiputo no chi, sono dorei de atta ie kara michibikidashita toki, karera to keiyaku o tatete itta,
'Anata gata no kyoudai de aru Heburu bito de, anata gata ni mi o uri, roku nen no aida anata gata ni tsukaeta mono wa, roku nen no owari ni, anata gata onoono ga kore o kaihou shinakereba naranai. Anata gata wa kare o kaihou shite, anata gata ni tsukaeru koto o yamesasenakereba naranai'. Tokoro ga anata gata no senzotachi wa watashi ni kikishitagawazu, mata sono mimi o katamukenakatta.
Shikashi anata gata wa konnichi, kokoro o aratame, onoono sono tonaribito ni shakuhou no koto o tsuge shimeshite, watashi no mite tadashii to suru koto o okonai, katsu watashi no na o motte tonaerareru ie de, watashi no mae ni keiyaku o tateta.
Tokoro ga anata gata wa futatabi kokoro o hirugaeshite, watashi no na o kegashi, onoono danjo no dorei o sono negai no mama ni kaihou shita no o hikikaesase, futatabi kore o shitagawasete, anata gata no dorei to shita.
Sore yue ni, Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata gata ga watashi ni kikishitagawazu, onoono sono kyoudai to sono tonari ni shakuhou no koto o tsuge shimesanakatta no de, miyo, watashi wa anata gata no tame ni shakuhou o tsuge shimeshite, anatagata o tsurugi to, ekibyou to, kikin to ni watasu to Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa anatagata o chi no moromoro no kuni ni imikirawareru mono to suru.
Watashi no keiyaku o yaburi, watashi no mae ni tateta keiyaku no sadame ni shitagawanai hitobito o, watashi wa karera ga futatsu ni saite, sono futatsu no aida o tootta koushi no you ni suru. - -
Sunawachi futatsu ni waketa koushi no aida o tootta Yuda no tsukasatachi, Erusaremu no tsukasatachi to kangan to saishi to, kono chi no subete no tami o,
Watashi wa sono teki no te to, sono inochi o motomeru mono no te ni watasu. Sono shitai wa sora no tori to no no kemono no shokumotsu to naru.
Watashi wa mata Yuda no ou Zedekiya to, sono tsukasatachi o sono teki no te, sono inochi o motomeru mono no te, anatagata o hanarete satta Babiron no ou no gunzei no te ni watasu.
Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi wa karera ni meijite, kono machi ni hikikaeshite kosaseru. Karera wa kono machi o semete tatakai, kore o tori, hi o hanatte yakiharau. Watashi wa Yuda no machimachi o sumu hito no nai arechi to suru".
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no toki, Shu kara Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba.
"Rekabu bito no ie ni itte, karera to katari, karera o Shu no miya no isshitsu ni tsurete kite, sake o nomase nasai".
Soko de watashi wa Habajiniya no ko Eremiya no ko de aru Yazaniya to, sono kyoudai to, sono musukotachi, oyobi Rekabu bito no zenka o tsure,
Kore o Shu no miya ni aru Hanan no kotachi no shitsu ni tsurete kita. Hanan wa Igudariya no ko de atte kami no hito de atta. Sono shitsu wa, tsukasatachi no shitsu no tsugi ni atte, mon o mamoru Sharumu no ko Maaseya no shitsu no ue ni atta.
Watashi wa Rekabu bito no mae ni sake o mitashita tsubo to sakazuki o oki, karera ni, "Sake o nomi nasai" to ittaga,
Karera wa kotaeta, "Wareware wa sake o nomimasen. Sore wa, Rekabu no ko de aru wareware no senzo Yonadabu ga wareware ni meijite, 'Anata gata to anata gata no shison wa itsu made mo sake o nonde wa naranai.
Mata ie o tatezu, tane o makazu, mata budou hatake o uete wa naranai. Mata kore o shoyuu shite wa naranai. Anata gata wa ikinagaraeru aida wa makuya ni sunde i nasai. Sou surunaraba, anata gata wa sono yadotte iru chi ni nagaku ikiru koto ga dekiru to ittakara desu'.
Kou shite wareware wa, Rekabu no ko de aru wareware no senzo Yonadabu ga subete meijita kotoba ni shitagatte, wareware mo, tsuma mo, musuko musume mo ikinagaraeru aida, sake o nomazu,
Sumu ie o tatezu, budou hatake mo hatake mo tane mo motanaide,
Makuya ni sumi, subete wareware no senzo Yonadabu ga wareware ni meijita tokoro ni shitagai, sono you ni okonaimashita.
Shikashi Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga kono chi ni nobotte kita toki, wareware wa iimashita, 'Saa, wareware wa Erusaremu e ikou. Karudeya bito no gunzei to Suriya bito no gunzei ga osoroshii' to. Kou shite wareware wa Erusaremu ni sunde iru no desu".
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, itte, Yuda no hitobito to Erusaremu ni sumu mono to ni tsuge yo. Shu wa ooserareru, anata gata wa watashi no kotoba o kiite oshie o ukenai no ka.
Rekabu no ko Yonadabu ga sono shison ni sake o nomu na to meijita kotoba wa mamorarete kita. Karera wa konnichi ni itaru made sake o nomazu, sono senzo no inochi ni shitagatte kita. Tokoro ga anata gata wa watashi ga shikiri ni katattakeredo mo, watashi ni kikishitagawanakatta.
Watashi wa mata, watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi o, shikiri ni anata gata ni tsukawashite iwaseta, 'Anata gata wa ima onoono sono warui michi o hanare, sono okonai o aratame nasai. Hoka no kamigami ni shitagai tsukaete wa naranai. Sou sureba, anata gata wa watashi ga anata gata to, anata gata no senzo ni ataeta kono chi ni sumu koto ga dekiru' to. Shikashi anata gata wa mimi o katamukezu, watashi ni kikanakatta.
Rekabu no ko Yonadabu no shison wa, sono senzo ga karera ni meijita meirei o mamotte iru no de aru. Shikashi kono tami wa watashi ni shitagawanakatta.
Sore yue bangun no kami, Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, miyo, watashi wa Yuda to Erusaremu ni sumu mono to ni, watashi ga karera no ue ni senkoku shita wazawai o kudasu. Watashi ga karera ni katatte mo kikazu, karera o yonde mo kotaenakattakara de aru".
Tokoro de Eremiya wa Rekabu bito no ie no hitobito ni itta, "Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou ooserareru, anata gata wa senzo Yonadabu no inochi ni shitagai, sono subete no imashime o mamori, kare ga anata gata ni meijita koto o okonatta.
Sore yue, bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, Rekabu no ko Yonadabu ni wa, watashi no mae ni tatsu hito ga itsu made mo kakeru koto wa nai".
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no yon nen ni Shu kara kono kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Anata wa makimono o tori, watashi ga anata ni katatta hi, sunawachi Yoshiya no hi kara konnichi ni itaru made, Isuraeru to Yuda to bankoku to ni kanshite anata ni katatta subete no kotoba o, sore ni shirushi nasai.
Yuda no ie ga watashi no kudasou to shite iru subete no wazawai o kiite, onoono sono warui michi o hanarete kaeru koto mo arou. Sou sureba, watashi wa sono toga to sono tsumi o yurusu ka mo shirenai".
Soko de Eremiya wa Neriya no ko Baruku o yonda. Baruku wa Eremiya no koujutsu ni shitagatte, Shu ga kare ni otsuge ni natta kotoba o kotogotoku makimono ni kakishirushita.
Soshite Eremiya wa Baruku ni meijite itta, "Watashi wa Shu no miya ni iku koto o samatagerarete iru.
Sore de, anata ga itte, danjiki no hi ni Shu no miya de, subete no tami ga kiite iru tokoro de, anata ga watashi no koujutsu ni shitagatte, makimono ni hikki shita Shu no kotoba o yomi nasai. Mata Yuda no hitobito ga sono machimachi kara kite kiite iru tokoro de, sore o yomi nasai.
Karera wa Shu no mae ni kigan o sasage, onoono sono warui michi o hanarete kaeru koto mo arou. Shu ga kono tami ni taishite senkoku sareta ikari to ikidoori wa ookiikara de aru".
Kou shite Neriya no ko Baruku wa subete yogensha Eremiya ga jibun ni meijita you ni, Shu no miya de, sono makimono ni kakareta Shu no kotoba o yonda.
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no go nen kyuu gatsu, Erusaremu no subete no tami to, Yuda no machimachi kara Erusaremu ni kita subete no tami to wa, Shu no mae ni danjiki o okonaubeki koto o tsuge shimesareta.
Baruku wa Shu no miya no ue no niwa de, Shu no miya no atarashii mon no iriguchi no katawara ni aru shokiShapan no ko de aru Gemariya no heya de, makimono ni kakareta Eremiya no kotoba o subete no tami ni yomikikaseta.
Shapan no ko de aru Gemariya no ko Mikaya wa sono makimono ni aru Shu no kotoba o kotogotoku kiite,
Ou no ie ni aru shoki no heya ni kudatte ikuto, moromoro no tsukasatachi, sunawachi shoki Erishama, Shimaya no ko Deraya, Akaboru no ko Erunatan, Shapan no ko Gemariya, Hananiya no ko Zedekiya oyobi subete no tsukasatachi ga soko ni zashite ita.
Mikaya wa Baruku ga tami ni makimono o yonde kikaseta toki, jibun no kiita subete no kotoba o karera ni tsugeta no de,
Tsukasatachi wa Kushi no ko Seremiya no ko de aru Netaniya no ko Ehode o Baruku no moto ni tsukawashite iwaseta, "Anata ga tami ni yomikikaseta sono makimono o te ni totte, kite kudasai". Soko de Neriya no ko Baruku wa makimono o te ni totte, karera no moto ni kita no de,
Karera wa Baruku ni itta, "Zashite sore o yonde kudasai". Baruku wa sore o karera ni yomi kikaseta.
Karera wa sono subete no kotoba o kiki, osorete tagai ni mi kawashi, Baruku ni itta, "Wareware wa kono subete no kotoba o, ou ni houkoku shinakereba naranai".
Soshite Baruku ni tazunete itta, "Kono subete no kotoba o, anata ga dono you ni shite kaita no ka hanashite kudasai. Kare no koujutsu ni yoru no desu ka".
Baruku wa karera ni kotaeta, "Kare ga watashi ni kono subete no kotoba o koujutsu shita no de, watashi wa sore o bokujuu de makimono ni kaita no desu".
Tsukasatachi wa Baruku ni itta, "Itte, Eremiya to issho ni mi o kakushi nasai. Hito ni shozai o shirarete wa narimasen".
Soko de karera wa makimono o shoki Erishama no heya ni oite niwa ni hairi, ou no moto e itte, kono subete no kotoba o ou ni tsugeta no de,
Ou wa sono makimono o motte kosaseru tame ni Ehode o tsukawashita. Ehode wa shoki Erishama no heya kara makimono o totte kite, sore o ou to ou no katawara ni tatte iru subete no tsukasatachi ni yomi kikaseta.
Toki wa kyuu gatsu de atte, ou wa fuyu no ie ni zashite ita. Sono mae ni ro ga atte hi ga moete ita.
Ehode ga san dan ka yon dan o yomuto, ou wa kogatana o motte sore o kiritori, ro no hi ni nageire, tsuini makimono zenbu o ro no hi de yaki tsukushita.
Ou to sono keraitachi wa kono subete no kotoba o kiite mo osorezu, mata sono kimono o saku koto mo shinakatta.
Erunatan, Deraya oyobi Gemariya ga ou ni sono makimono o yakanai you ni to negatta toki ni mo kare wa kikiirenakatta.
Soshite ou wa ouji Erameru to Azurieru no ko Seraya to Abuderu no ko Seremiya ni, shoki Baruku to yogensha Eremiya o toraeru you ni to meijitaga, Shu wa karera o kakusareta.
Baruku ga Eremiya no koujutsu ni shitagatte hikki shita kotoba o noseta makimono o ou ga yaita nochi, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Ta no makimono o tori, Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu ga yaita, mae no makimono no uchi ni aru kotoba o mina sore ni kakishirushi nasai.
Mata Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu ni tsuite ii nasai, 'Shu wa kou ooserareru, anata wa kono makimono o yaite itta, "Dou shite anata wa kono makimono ni, Babiron no ou ga kanarazu kite kono chi o horoboshi, koko kara hito to kemono to o tayasu, to kaita no ka" to.
Sore yue Shu wa Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu ni tsuite kou iwareru, kare no shison ni wa Dabide no kurai ni suwaru mono ga nakunaru. Mata kare no shitai wa suterarete hiru wa atsusa ni ai, yoru wa shimo ni au.
Watashi wa mata kare to sono shison to sono keraitachi o sono tsumi no tame ni bassuru. Mata karera to Erusaremu no tami to Yuda no hitobito ni wa wazawai o kudasu. Kono wazawai no koto ni tsuite wa, sudeni katattakeredo mo, karera wa kiku koto o shinakatta' ".
Soko de Eremiya wa ta no makimono o tori, Neriya no ko shoki Baruku ni ataeta no de, Baruku wa Yuda no ou Ehoyakimu ga hi ni kubete yaita makimono no subete no kotoba o, Eremiya no koujutsu ni shitagatte sore ni kakishirushi, mata onaji you na kotoba o ooku sore ni kuwaeta.
Yoshiya no ko Zedekiya wa Ehoyakimu no ko Koniya ni kawatte ou to natta. Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga kare o Yuda no chi no ou to shita no de aru.
Kare mo sono keraitachi mo, sono chi no hitobito mo, Shu ga yogensha Eremiya ni yotte katarareta kotoba ni kikishitagawanakatta.
Zedekiya ou wa Seremiya no ko Yukaru to, Maaseya no ko saishi Zepaniya o yogensha Eremiya ni tsukawashite, "Wareware no tame ni, wareware no kami, Shu ni inotte kudasai" to iwaseta.
Eremiya wa tami no naka ni deiri shite ita. Mada gokuya ni irerarenakattakara de aru.
Paro no gunzei ga Ejiputo kara dete kita no de, Erusaremu o semekakonde ita Karudeya bito wa sono jouhou o kiite Erusaremu o shirizoita.
Sono toki, Shu no kotoba wa yogensha Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, anatagata o tsukawashite watashi ni motometa Yuda no ou ni kou ii nasai, 'Anatagata o sukuu tame ni dete kita Paro no gunzei wa sono kuni Ejiputo ni kaerou to shite iru.
Karudeya bito ga futatabi kite kono machi o semete tatakai, kore o totte hi de yakihorobosu.
Shu wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa, "Karudeya bito wa kitto wareware o hanaresaru" to itte jibun o azamuite wa naranai. Karera wa saru koto wa nai.
Tatoi anata gata ga jibun o semete tatakau Karudeya bito no zengun o uchiyabutte, sono tenmaku no uchi ni fushoumono nomi o nokoshite mo, karera wa tachiagatte hi de kono machi o yakihorobosu' ".
Sate Karudeya bito no gunzei ga Paro no gunzei no kuru no o kiite Erusaremu o shirizoita toki,
Eremiya wa, Beniyamin no chi de tami no uchi ni jibun no wakemae o uketoru tame, Erusaremu o tatte sono chi e ikouto,
Beniyamin no mon ni tsuita toki, soko ni Hananiya no ko Seremiya no ko de Iriya to iu na no banpei ga ite, yogensha Eremiya o torae, "Anata wa Karudeya bito no gawa ni dassou shiyou to shite iru" to itta.
Eremiya wa itta, "Sore wa machigai da. Watashi wa Karudeya bito no gawa ni dassou shiyou to shite inai". Shikashi Iriya wa kikazu, Eremiya o toraete, tsukasatachi no moto e hiite itta.
Tsukasatachi wa ikatte, Eremiya o uchitataki, shoki Yonatan no ie no gokuya ni ireta. Kono ie ga gokuya ni natte itakara de aru.
Eremiya ga chika no gokuya ni haitte, soko ni ooku no hi o okutte nochi,
Zedekiya ou wa hito o tsukawashi, kare o tsurete kosaseta. Ou wa jibun no ie de hisoka ni kare ni tazunete itta, "Shu kara nani ka okotoba ga atta ka". Eremiya wa atta to kotaeta. Soshite itta, "Anata wa Babiron no ou no te ni hikiwatasaremasu".
Eremiya wa mata Zedekiya ou ni itta, "Watashi ga gokuya ni irerareta no wa, anata ni, mata wa anata no kerai ni, aruiha kono tami ni, dono you na tsumi o okashitakara na no desu ka.
Anata gata ni yogen shite, 'Babiron no ou wa anatagata o mo, kono chi o mo seme ni konai' to itte ita anata gata no yogensha wa ima doko ni iru no desu ka.
Ou naru waga kimi yo, douzo ima okiki kudasai. Watashi no negai o okikitodoke kudasai. Watashi o shoki Yonatan no ie e kaerasenaide kudasai. Sou de naito, watashi wa soko de korosarerudeshou".
Soko de Zedekiya ou wa mei o kudashi, Eremiya o kanshi no niwa ni iresase, katsu, pan o tsukuru mono no machi kara mainichi pan ichiko o kare ni ataesaseta. Kore wa machi ni pan ga nakunaru made tsuzuita. Kou shite Eremiya wa kanshi no niwa ni ita.
MaTtan no ko Shipateya, Pashuru no ko Gedariya, Seremiya no ko Yukaru, Marukiya no ko Pashuru wa Eremiya ga subete no tami ni tsugete ita sono kotoba o kiita.
Kare wa itta, "Shu wa kou iwareru, kono machi ni todomaru mono wa, tsurugi ya, kikin ya, ekibyou de shinu. Shikashi dete Karudeya bito ni kudaru mono wa shi o manukareru. Sunawachi sono inochi o jibun no bundori mono to shite ikiru koto ga dekiru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, kono machi wa kanarazu Babiron no ou no gunzei no te ni watasareru. Kare wa kore o toru".
Suruto, tsukasatachi wa ou ni itta, "Kono hito o koroshite kudasai. Kono you na kotoba o nobete, kono machi ni nokotte iru heishi no te to, subete no tami no te o yowaku shite irukara desu. Kono hito wa tami no antai o motomenaide, sono wazawai o motomete iru no desu".
Zedekiya ou wa itta, "Miyo, kare wa anata gata no te ni aru. Ou wa anata gata ni sakaratte nanigoto o mo nashi enai".
Soko de karera wa Eremiya o torae, kanshi no niwa ni aru ouji Marukiya no ana ni nageireta. Sunawachi, tsuna o motte Eremiya o tsuri oroshitaga, sono ana ni wa mizu ga naku, doro dake de atta no de, Eremiya wa doro no naka ni shizunda.
Ou no ie no kangan Echiopiya bito Ebedemereku wa, karera ga Eremiya o ana ni nageireta koto o kiita. Sono toki, ou wa Beniyamin no mon ni zashite ita no de,
Ebedemereku wa ou no ie kara dete itte ou ni itta,
"Ou naru waga kimi yo, kono hitobito ga yogensha Eremiya ni shita koto wa mina yoi koto de wa arimasen. Kare o ana ni nageiremashita. Machi ni shokumotsu ga nakunarimashitakara, kare wa soko de gashi surudeshou".
Ou wa Echiopiya bito Ebedemereku ni meijite itta, "Koko kara sannin no hito o tsurete itte, yogensha Eremiya o, shinanai uchi ni ana kara hikiage nasai".
Soko de Ebedemereku wa sono hitobito o tsurete ou no ie no kura no ifukushitsu ni iki, soko kara furui nunokire ya, ki furu shita kimono o tori, kore o ana no naka ni iru Eremiya no tokoro e, tsuna o motte tsuri oroshita.
Soshite Echiopiya bito Ebedemereku wa, "Kono nunokire ya kimono o, anata no waki no shita ni hasande, tsuna ni ate nasai" to Eremiya ni itta. Eremiya wa sono you ni shita.
Suruto karera wa tsuna o motte Eremiya o ana kara hikiageta. Soshite Eremiya wa kanshi no niwa ni todomatta.
Zedekiya ou wa hito o tsukawashite yogensha Eremiya o Shu no miya no daisan no mon ni tsurete kosase, ou wa Eremiya ni itta, "Anata ni tazunetai koto ga aru. Nanigoto mo watashi ni kakushite wa naranai".
Eremiya wa Zedekiya ni itta, "Moshi watashi ga ohana surunara, anata wa kanarazu watashi o korosarerude wa arimasen ka. Tatoi watashi ga chuukoku o shite mo, anata wa okiki ni naranaideshou".
Sono toki Zedekiya ou wa, hisoka ni Eremiya ni chikatte itta, "Wareware no tamashii o tsukurareta Shu wa ikite orareru. Watashi wa anata o korosanai, mata anata no inochi o motomeru mono no te ni, anata o watasu koto mo shinai".
Soko de Eremiya wa Zedekiya ni itta, "Bangun no kami, Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou ooserareru, moshi anata ga Babiron no ou no tsukasatachi ni koufuku surunaraba, anata no inochi wa tasukari, mata kono machi wa hi de yakareru koto naku, anata mo, anata no ie no mono mo ikinagaraeru koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga dete Babiron no ou no tsukasatachi ni koufuku shinainaraba, kono machi wa Karudeya bito no te ni watasareru. Karera wa hi de kore o yaku. Anata wa sono te o nogareru koto ga dekinai".
Zedekiya ou wa Eremiya ni itta, "Watashi wa Karudeya bito ni dassou shita Yudayahito o osorete iru. Karudeya bito wa watashi o karera no te ni watashi, karera wa watashi o hazukashimeru".
Eremiya wa itta, "Karera wa anata o watasanaideshou. Dou ka, watashi ga anata ni tsugeta Shu no koe ni kikishitagatte kudasai. Sou sureba saiwai o e, mata inochi ga tasukarimasu.
Shikashi koufuku suru koto o kobamunaraba, Shu ga watashi ni shimesareta maboroshi o moushimashou.
Sunawachi, Yuda no ou no ie ni nokotte iru onnatachi wa, mina Babiron no ou no tsukasatachi no tokoro e hiite ikaremasu. Sono onnatachi wa iu no desu, 'Anata no shitashii tomodachi ga anata o azamuita, soshite anata ni katta. Ima anata no ashi wa doro ni shizunde iru no de, karera wa anata o sutete saru'.
Anata no tsumatachi to kodomotachi wa mina Karudeya bito no tokoro e hikidasareru. Anata jishin mo sono te o nogareru koto ga dekizu, Babiron no ou ni toraerareru. Soshite kono machi wa hi de yakarerudeshou".
Zedekiya wa Eremiya ni itta, "Korera no kotoba o hito ni shirasete wa naranai. Sou sureba anata wa korosareru koto wa nai.
Watashi ga anata to hanashi o shita koto o, tsukasatachi ga kiite, karera ga anata no tokoro ni kite, 'Anata ga ou ni hanashita koto, ou ga anata ni hanashita koto o wareware ni tsuge nasai. Nanigoto mo kakushite wa naranai. Wareware wa anata o koroshi wa shinai' to iunaraba,
Anata wa karera ni, 'Watashi wa ou ni negatte, watashi o Yonatan no ie ni okurikaesazu, soko de shinu koto no nai you ni shite kudasai to itta' to kotae nasai".
Sate, tsukasatachi wa mina Eremiya no tokoro e kite tazunetaga, ou ga kare ni oshieta you ni karera ni kotaeta no de, karera wa kare to hanasu koto o yameta. Sono kaiwa o kiita mono ga nakattakara de aru.
Eremiya wa Erusaremu no torareru hi made kanshi no niwa ni todomatte ita.
Yuda no ou Zedekiya no kyuu nen juu gatsu, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru wa sono zengun o hikii, Erusaremu ni kite kore o semekakondaga,
Zedekiya no juu ichi nen shi gatsu kokonoka ni natte machi no ikkaku ga yabureta.
Erusaremu ga torareta no de, Babiron no ou no tsukasatachi, sunawachi nerugaru sharezeru, Samugaru Nebo, Rabusarisu no Sarusekimu, Rabumagu no nerugaru sharezeru oyobi Babiron no ou no sono ta no tsukasatachi wa mina tomo ni kite naka no mon ni zashita.
Yuda no ou Zedekiya to subete no heishitachi wa kore o mite nige, yoru no uchi ni, ou no teien no michi o tootte, futatsu no jouheki no aida no mon kara machi o dete, Araba no hou e ittaga,
Karudeya bito no gunzei wa kore o otte, Eriko no heichi de Zedekiya ni oitsuki, kore o toraete, Hamate no chi Ribura ni iru Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no moto ni hiite itta no de, ou wa soko de kare no tsumi o sadameta.
Babiron no ou wa Ribura de, Zedekiya no kotachi o kare no me no mae de koroshita. Babiron no ou wa mata Yuda no subete no kizokutachi o koroshita.
Ou wa mata Zedekiya no me o tsubusase, kare o Babiron ni hiite iku tame ni, kusari ni tsunaida.
Mata Karudeya bito wa oukyuu to minka o hi de yaki, Erusaremu no jouheki o hakai shita.
Soshite jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa machi no uchi ni nokotte iru tami to, jibun ni koufuku shita mono, oyobi sono ta no nokotte iru tami o Babiron ni toraeutsushita.
Shikashi jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa, tami no mazushii musanmono o Yuda no chi ni nokoshi, douji ni budou hatake to denchi o kore ni ataeta.
Sate Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru wa Eremiya no koto ni tsuite jiei no chouNebuzaradan ni meijite itta,
"Kare o tori, yoku sewa o seyo. Gai o kuwaeru koto naku, kare ga anata ni iu you ni shite yari nasai".
Soko de jiei no chouNebuzaradan, Rabusarisu no Nebushazuban, Rabumagu no nerugaru sharezeru, oyobi Babiron no ou no tsukasatachi wa,
Hito o tsukawashite, Eremiya o kanshi no niwa kara tsurete kosase, Shapan no ko Ahikamu no ko de aru Gedariya ni takushite, ie ni tsurete ikaseta. Kou shite kare wa tami no uchi ni ita.
Eremiya ga kanshi no niwa ni tojikomerarete ita toki, Shu no kotoba ga kare ni nozonda,
"Itte, Echiopiya bito Ebedemereku ni tsuge nasai, 'Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, watashi no itta wazawai o watashi wa kono machi ni kudasu, saiwai o kore ni kudasu no de wa nai. Sono hi, kono koto ga anata no me no mae de jouju suru.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi watashi wa anata o sukuu. Anata wa jibun no osorete iru hitobito no te ni watasareru koto wa nai.
Watashi ga kanarazu anata o sukui, tsurugi ni taoreru koto no nai you ni surukara de aru. Anata no inochi wa anata no bundori mono to naru. Anata ga watashi ni yori tayondakara de aru to Shu wa iwareru' ".
Jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa, Babiron ni utsusareru Erusaremu to Yuda no hitobito no uchi ni Eremiya o kusari ni tsunaide oite, kore o toraete ittaga, tsuini Rama de kare o shakuhou shita. Sono nochi, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Jiei no chou wa Eremiya o meshite kare ni itta, "Anata no kami, Shu wa kono tokoro ni kono wazawai o kudasu to tsuge shimesareta.
Shu wa kore o kudashi, mizukara iwareta toori ni okonawareta. Anata gata ga Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashi, mikoe ni shitagawanakattakara, kono koto ga anata gata no ue ni nozonda no da.
Miyo, watashi wa kyou, anata no te no kusari o toite anata o shakuhou suru. Moshi anata ga watashi to issho ni Babiron e iku no ga yoi to omowarerunara, oide nasai. Watashi wa, juubun anata no sewa o shimasu. Moshi anata ga watashi to issho ni Babiron ni wa ikitaku nainara, ikanakute mo yoroshii. Miyo, kono chi wa mina anata no mae ni arimasu, anata ga yoi to omoi, tadashii to omou tokoro ni iki nasai.
Anata ga todomarunaraba, Babiron no ou ga Yuda no machimachi no soutoku to shite tateta Shapan no ko Ahikamu no ko de aru Gedariya no tokoro e kaeri, kare to tomo ni tami no uchi ni sumi nasai. Aruiha mata anata ga tadashii to omou tokoro e iki nasai". Kou shite jiei no chou wa kare ni ryoushoku to okurimono o ataete saraseta.
Soko de Eremiya wa Mizupa e iki, Ahikamu no ko Gedariya no tokoro e itte, kare to tomo ni sono chi ni nokotte iru tami no uchi ni sunda.
Sate yagai ni ita gunzei no choutachi to, sono haika no hitobito wa, Babiron no ou ga Ahikamu no ko Gedariya o tatete, sono chi no soutoku to shi, otoko, onna, kodomo, oyobi kuni no uchi no Babiron ni utsusarenai mazushii mono o kare ni itaku shita koto o kiita no de,
Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru to, Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi Tanhomete no ko Seraya to, Netopa bito de aru Epai no kotachi to, Maaka bi to no ko Yazaniya oyobi sono haika no hitobito wa, Mizupa ni iru Gedariya no moto e itta.
Shapan no ko de aru Ahikamu no ko Gedariya wa, karera to sono haika no hitobito ni chikatte itta, "Karudeya bito ni tsukaeru koto o osoreru ni oyobanai. Kono chi ni sunde Babiron no ou ni tsukaerunaraba, anata gata wa koufuku ni naru.
Watashi wa Mizupa ni ite, wareware no tokoro ni kuru Karudeya bito no mae ni, anata gata no tame ni tachimashou. Anata gata wa, budoushu ya natsu no kudamono, abura o atsumete, sore o utsuwa ni takuwae, anata gata no eta machimachi ni sumi nasai".
Onaji you ni, Moabu to Anmon bito no uchi, mata Edomu oyobi ta no kuniguni ni iru Yudayahito wa, Babiron no ou ga Yuda ni hito o nokoshita koto to, Shapan no ko de aru Ahikamu no ko Gedariya o tatete sono soutoku to shita koto to o kiita.
Soko de sono Yudayahitora wa mina sono oiyarareta moromoro no tokoro kara kaette kite, Yuda no chi no Mizupa ni iru Gedariya no moto ni kita. Soshite ooku no budoushu to natsu no kudamono o atsumeta.
Mata Kareya no ko Yohanan to, yagai ni ita gunzei no choutachi wa mina Mizupa ni iru Gedariya no moto ni kite,
Kare ni itta, "Anmon bito no ou Baarisu ga anata o korosu tame ni Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru o tsukawashita koto o shitte imasu ka". Shikashi Ahikamu no ko Gedariya wa karera no iu koto o shinjinakatta no de,
Kareya no ko Yohanan wa Mizupa de hisoka ni Gedariya ni itta, "Watashi ga itte, hito ni shirenai you ni, Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru o koroshimashou. Dou shite kare ga anata o koroshite, anata no shuui ni atsumatte iru Yudayahito o chirashi, Yuda no nokotta mono o horoboshite yoideshou".
Shikashi Ahikamu no ko Gedariya wa Kareya no ko Yohanan ni itta, "Kono koto o shite wa naranai. Anata wa Ishimaeru ni tsuite itsuwari o itte iru no desu".
Nana gatsu no koro, ouie no mono de, Erishama no ko Netaniya no ko de ari, mata ou no koukan no hitori de aru Ishimaeru wa, ou no juunin no tsukasatachi to tomo ni Mizupa ni ita Ahikamu no ko Gedariya no moto ni kite, Mizupa de shoku o tomo ni shitaga,
Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru oyobi tomo ni ita juunin no mono wa tachiagatte, Babiron no ou ga kono chi no soutoku to shita Shapan no ko Ahikamu no ko de aru Gedariya o katana de koroshi,
Ishimaeru wa mata Mizupa de Gedariya to tomo ni ita subete no Yudayahito to, tamatama soko ni ita Karudeya bito no heishitachi o koroshita.
Gedariya ga korosareta tsugi no hi, mada dare mo sono koto o shiranai uchi ni,
Hachijuunin no hitobito ga sono hige o sori, ifuku o saki, mi ni kizu o tsuke, te ni wa sosai no sasagemono to kou o tazusae, Shikemu, Shiro, Samariya kara kite, Shu no miya ni sasageyou to shita.
Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa Mizupa kara nakinagara dete kite karera o mukae, karera ni atte, "Ahikamu no ko Gedariya no moto ni oide nasai" to itta.
Soshite karera ga machi no naka ni haitta toki, Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa jibun to issho ni ita hitobito to tomo ni karera o koroshite, sono shitai o ana ni nageireta.
Shikashi sono uchi no juunin wa Ishimaeru ni mukai, "Watashitachi wa hatake ni komugi, oomugi, abura, oyobi mitsu o kakushite imasu, watashitachi o korosanaide kudasai" to itta no de, karera o sono nakama to tomo ni korosanaide shimatta.
Ishimaeru ga jibun no koroshita hitobito no shitai o nageireta ana wa, Asa ou ga Isuraeru no ou Baasha o osorete hotta ana de atta. Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa koroshita hitobito o kore ni mitashita.
Tsuide Ishimaeru wa Mizupa ni nokotte iru subete no tami, sunawachi ou no musumetachi to jiei no chouNebuzaradan ga Ahikamu no ko Gedariya ni takushita Mizupa ni nokotte iru subete no tami to o horyo to shita. Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa karera o horyo to shi, Anmon bito no moto ni watari ikou to shite tachisatta.
Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi kare to tomo ni iru gunzei no choutachi wa Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru no itta akuji o mina kiki,
Sono heishitachi o hikiite, Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru to tatakau tame ni dete iki, Gibeon no ooike no hotori de kare ni atta.
Ishimaeru to tomo ni iru hitobito wa, Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi kare to tomo ni iru gunzei no choutachi o mite yorokonda.
Soshite Ishimaeru ga Mizupa kara horyo ni shite kita hitobito wa mi o megurashite Kareya no ko Yohanan no moto e itta.
Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru wa hachinin no mono to tomo ni Yohanan o sakete nige, Anmon bito no tokoro e itta.
Soko de Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi kare to tomo ni iru gunzei no choutachi wa Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru ga Ahikamu no ko Gedariya o koroshite, Mizupa kara horyo to shite tsurete kita, ano nokotte ita tami, sunawachi heishi ya onna, kodomo, kangan o Gibeon kara tsurekaettaga,
Karera wa Ejiputo e ikou to shite Betsurehemu no chikaku ni aru gerute kimuhamu e itte, soko ni todomatta.
Kore wa, Netaniya no ko Ishimaeru ga, Babiron no ou ni yotte kono chi no soutoku ni ninjirareta Ahikamu no ko Gedariya o koroshita koto ni yori, Karudeya bito o osoretakara de aru.
Sono toki gunzei no choutachi, oyobi Kareya no ko Yohanan to, Hoshaya no ko Azariya, narabi ni tami no mottomo chiisai mono kara mottomo ooinaru mono ni itaru made,
Mina yogensha Eremiya no tokoro ni kite itta, "Dou ka anata no mae ni wareware no motome ga ukeireraremasu you ni. Wareware no tame, kono nokotte iru mono subete no tame ni, anata no kami, Shu ni inotte kudasai, (imagoran no toori, wareware wa ooku no uchi, wazuka ni nokotte iru mono desu)
Sou sureba, anata no kami, Shu wa, wareware no ikubeki michi to, nasubeki koto o oshimeshi ni narudeshou".
Yogensha Eremiya wa karera ni itta, "Yoku wakarimashita. Anata gata no motome ni shitagatte, anata gata no kami, Shu ni inorimashou. Shu ga anata gata ni kotaerareru koto o, nanigoto mo kakusanaide anata gata ni iimashou".
Karera wa Eremiya ni itta, "Moshi, anata no kami, Shu ga anata o tsukawashite otsuge ni naru subete no kotoba o, wareware ga okonawanai toki wa, dou ka Shu ga wareware ni taishite makoto no shinjitsu na shounin to narareru you ni.
Wareware wa yokute mo warukute mo, wareware ga anata o tsukawasou to suru wareware no kami, Shu no koe ni shitagaimasu. Wareware no kami, Shu no koe ni shitagau toki, wareware wa saiwai o erudeshou".
Tooka no nochi, Shu no kotoba ga Eremiya ni nozonda.
Eremiya wa Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi kare to tomo ni iru gunzei no choutachi, narabi ni tami no mottomo chiisai mono kara mottomo ooinaru mono made kotogotoku maneite,
Karera ni itta, "Anata gata ga watashi o tsukawashite, anata no kigan o sono mae ni nobesaseta Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa kou iwaremasu,
Moshi anata gata ga kono chi ni todomarunaraba, watashi wa anatagata o tatete taosu koto naku, anatagata o uete nuku koto wa shinai. Watashi wa anata gata ni wazawai o kudashita koto o kuite irukara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, anata ga osorete iru Babiron no ou o osorete wa naranai. Kare o osorete wa naranai, watashi ga tomo ni ite, anatagata o sukui, kare no te kara tasukedasukara de aru.
Watashi wa anatagata o awaremi, mata kare ni anatagata o awaremase, anatagata o jibun no chi ni todomaraseru.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga taga, 'Wareware wa kono chi ni todomaranai' to itte, anata gata no kami, Shu no koe ni shitagawazu,
Mata, 'Iie, wareware wa ano sensou o mizu, rappa no koe o kikazu, shokumotsu mo toboshiku nai Ejiputo no chi e itte, asoko ni sumaou' to iunaraba,
Anata gata, Yuda no nokotte iru monotachi yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, moshi anata gata ga muri ni Ejiputo e itte soko ni sumunaraba,
Anata gata no osorete iru tsurugi wa Ejiputo no chi de anata gata ni oitsuki, anata gata no osorete iru kikin wa, sugu ato o otte Ejiputo made iki, sono tokoro de anata gata wa shinu.
Subete muri ni Ejiputo e itte soko ni sumu mono wa, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou de shinu. Watashi ga karera ni kudasou to shite iru wazawai o nogarete nokoru mono wa sono uchi ni nai.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, watashi no ikari to ikidoori to o Erusaremu no juumin no ue ni sosoida you ni, watashi no ikidoori wa, anata gata ga Ejiputo e iku toki, anata gata no ue ni sosogu. Anata gata wa, noroi to nari, kyoufu to nari, nonoshiri to nari, hazukashime to naru. Anata gata wa futatabi kono tokoro o miru koto ga dekinai.
Yuda no nokotte iru monotachi yo, 'Ejiputo e itte wa naranai' to Shu wa anata gata ni iwareta. Watashi ga kyou keikoku shita koto o, anata gata wa tashika ni shiranakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa mizukara somuki satte, inochi o ushinatta. Naze nara, anata gata ga watashi o anata gata no kami, Shu ni tsukawashi, 'Wareware no kami, Shu ni inori, wareware no kami, Shu no iwareru koto o kotogotoku shimeshite kudasai. Wareware wa sore o okonaimasu' to itta no de,
Watashi wa kyou sore o shimeshitaga, anata gata wa anata gata no kami, Shu no koe o kikazu, Shu ga watashi o tsukawashite meijisaserareta koto ni wa, sukoshi mo shitagawanakattakara de aru.
Sore yue, anata gata ga itte sumau koto o negatte iru sono tokoro de, anata gata wa tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou de shinu koto o tashika ni shiranakereba naranai".
Eremiya ga subete no tami ni mukatte, karera no kami, Shu no kotoba o kotogotoku katari, karera no kami, Shu ga jibun o tsukawashite iwaserareru sono kotoba o mina tsuge owatta toki,
Hoshaya no ko Azariya to, Kareya no ko Yohanan oyobi kouman na hitobito wa mina Eremiya ni itta, "Anata wa itsuwari o itte iru. Wareware no kami, Shu ga, 'Ejiputo e itte soko ni sumu na' to iwaseru tame ni anata o tsukawasareta no de wa nai.
Neriya no ko Baruku ga anata o sosonokashite, wareware ni sakarawase, wareware o Karudeya bito no te ni watashite korosu ka, aruiha Babiron ni toraeutsusaseru no da".
Kou shite Kareya no ko Yohanan to gunzei no choutachi oyobi tamira wa mina, Shu no koe ni shitagawazu, Yuda no chi ni todomarou to shinakatta.
Soshite Kareya no ko Yohanan to gunzei no choutachi wa, Yuda ni nokotte iru mono sunawachi oiyarareta kuniguni kara Yuda no chi ni sumu tame ni kaette kita mono, - -
Otoko, onna, kodomo, ou no musumetachi, oyobi subete jiei no chouNebuzaradan ga Shapan no ko de aru Ahikamu no ko Gedariya ni watashite oita mono, narabi ni yogensha Eremiya to Neriya no ko Baruku o tsurete,
Ejiputo no chi e itta. Karera wa Shu no koe ni shitagawanakatta no de aru. Soshite karera wa tsuini Tapanesu ni itta.
Shu no kotoba wa Tapanesu de Eremiya ni nozonda,
"Ookina ishi o te ni tori, Yuda no hitobito no me no mae de, kore o Tapanesu ni aru Paro no kyuuden no iriguchi no shikiishi no shikkui no naka ni kakushite,
Karera ni ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa shisha o tsukawashite, watashi no shimobe de aru Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru o maneku. Kare wa sono kurai o kono kakushita ishi no ue ni sue, sono ue ni ou no tengai o haru.
Kare wa kite Ejiputo no chi o uchi, ekibyou ni sadamatte iru mono o ekibyou ni watashi, toriko ni sadamatte iru mono o toriko ni shi, tsurugi ni sadamatte iru mono o tsurugi ni kakeru.
Kare wa Ejiputo no kamigami no miya ni hi o tsukete kore o yaki, karera o toriko ni suru. Soshite hitsuji o kau mono ga kimono no mushi o haraikiyomeru you ni, Ejiputo no chi o kiyomeru. Kare wa yasuraka ni soko o saru.
Kare wa Ejiputo no chi ni aru Herioporisu no Oberisuku o kowashi, Ejiputo no kamigami no miya o hi de yaku' ".
Ejiputo no chi ni sunde iru Yudayahito sunawachi Migudoru, Tapanesu, Menpisu, Paterosu no chi ni sumu mono no koto ni tsuite Eremiya ni nozonda kotoba,
"Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa watashi ga Erusaremu to Yuda no machimachi ni kudashita wazawai o mita. Miyo, korera wa konnichi, sudeni arechi to natte sumu hito mo nai.
Kore wa karera ga aku o itte, watashi o ikaraseta koto ni yoru no de aru. Sunawachi karera wa jibun mo, anata gata mo, anata gata no senzotachi mo shiranakatta, hoka no kamigami ni itte, kou o taki, kore ni tsukaeta.
Watashi wa jibun no shimobe de aru subete no yogensha tachi o, shikiri ni anata gata ni tsukawashite, 'Dou ka, watashi no imikirau kono nikumubeki koto o shinai you ni' to iwasetakeredo mo,
Karera wa kikazu, mimi o katamukezu, hoka no kamigami ni kou o taite, sono aku o hanarenakatta.
Sore yue, watashi wa ikari to ikidoori o Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu no chimata ni sosogi, sore o yaita no de, sorera wa konnichi no you ni are, horobite shimatta.
Bangun no kami, Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa ima kou iwareru, anata gata wa naze ooinaru aku o itte jibun jishin o gaishi, Yuda no uchi kara, anata gata no otoko to onna to, kodomo to chi nomi go o tatte, hitori mo nokoranai you ni shiyou to suru no ka.
Naze anata gata wa sono te no waza o motte watashi o ikarase, anata gata ga itte sumau Ejiputo no chi de, hoka no kamigami ni kou o taite jibun no mi o horoboshi, chi no bankoku no uchi ni, noroi to nari, hazukashime to narou to suru no ka.
Yuda no chi to Erusaremu no chimata de itta anata gata no senzotachi no aku, Yuda no outachi no aku, sono tsumatachi no aku, oyobi anata gata jishin no aku, anata gata no tsumatachi no aku o anata gata wa wasureta no ka.
Karera wa konnichi ni itaru made kuizu, mata osorezu, anata gata to anata gata no senzotachi no mae ni tateta, watashi no rippou to watashi no sadame to ni shitagatte ayumanai no de aru.
Sore yue bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kao o anata gata ni mukete wazawai o kudashi, Yuda no hitobito o kotogotoku tatsu.
Mata watashi wa, Ejiputo no chi ni sumu tame ni, muri ni itta ano Yuda no nokori no mono o torinozoku. Karera wa mina horobosarete Ejiputo no chi ni taoreru. Karera wa, tsurugi to kikin ni horobosare, mottomo chiisai mono kara mottomo ooinaru mono made, tsurugi to kikin ni yotte shinu. Soshite, noroi to nari, kyoufu to nari, nonoshiri to nari, hazukashime to naru.
Watashi wa Erusaremu o basshita you ni, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o motte Ejiputo ni sunde iru mono o bassuru.
Sore yue, Ejiputo no chi e itte soko ni sunde iru Yuda no nokori no mono no uchi, nogare, mata wa nokotte, kaeri sumaou to negau Yuda no chi e kaeru mono wa hitori mo nai. Shousuu no nogareru mono no hoka ni wa, kaette kuru mono wa nai".
Sono toki, jibun no tsuma ga hoka no kamigami ni kou o taita koto o shitte iru hitobito, oyobi sono tokoro ni tatte iru onnatachi no ooinaru gunshuu, narabi ni Ejiputo no chi no Paterosu ni sunde iru tami wa Eremiya ni kotaete itta,
"Anata ga Shu no na ni yotte watashitachi ni noberareta kotoba wa, watashitachi wa kiku koto ga dekimasen.
Watashitachi wa chikatta koto o mina okonai, watashitachi ga, moto itte ita you ni kou o tenkou ni taki, mata sake o sono mae ni sosogimasu. Sunawachi, Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu no chimata de, watashitachi to watashitachi no senzotachi oyobi watashitachi no outachi to, watashitachi no tsukasatachi ga itta you ni itashimasu. Sono toki ni wa, watashitachi wa ryoushoku ni wa aki, shiawase de, wazawai ni aimasendeshita.
Tokoro ga, watashitachi ga, tenkou ni kou o taku koto o yame, sake o sono mae ni sosoganaku natta toki kara, subete no mono ni toboshiku nari, tsurugi to kikin ni horobosaremashita".
Mata onnatachi wa itta, "Watashitachi ga tenkou ni kou o taki, sake o sono mae ni sosogu ni atatte, kore ni katadotte pan o tsukuri, sake o sosoida no wa, watashitachi no otto ga yurushita koto de wa arimasen ka".
Soko de Eremiya wa danjo no subete no hito, oyobi kono kotae o shita subete no tami ni itta,
"Yuda no machimachi to Erusaremu no chimata de, anata gata to anata gata no senzotachi, oyobi anata gata no outachi to anata gata no tsukasatachi, oyobi sono chi no tami ga kou o taita koto wa, Shu ga kore o wasurezu, mata, kokoro ni todomete orareru koto de wa nai ka.
Shu wa anata gata no ashiki waza no tame, anata gata no nikumubeki okonai no tame ni, mohaya shinobu koto ga dekinaku narareta. Sore yue, anata gata no chi wa konnichi no gotoku arechi to nari, odoroki to nari, noroi to nari, sumu hito no nai chi to natta.
Anata gata ga kou o taki, Shu ni tsumi o okashi, Shu no koe ni kikishitagawazu, sono rippou to, sadame to, akashi ni shitagatte ayumanakatta no de, konnichi no you ni kono wazawai ga anata gata ni nozonda no de aru".
Eremiya wa mata subete no tami to onnatachi ni itta, "Anata gata subete Ejiputo no chi ni iru Yuda no hitobito yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata to anata gata no tsumatachi wa kuchi de ii, te de okonai, 'Watashitachi wa tenkou ni kou o taki, sake o sosoide tateta chikai o kanarazu nashitogeru' to iu. Sore naraba, anata gata no chikai o katame, anata gata no chikai o nashitoge nasai.
Sore yue, anata gata subete Ejiputo no chi ni iru Yuda no hitobito yo, Shu no kotoba o kiki nasai. Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa jibun no ooinaru na o sashite chikau, sunawachi Ejiputo no zenchi ni, Yuda no hitobito de, sono kuchi ni, 'Shu naru kami wa ikite orareru' to itte, watashi no na o tonaeru mono wa, mohaya hitori mo nai you ni naru.
Miyo, watashi wa karera o mimamotte iru, sore wa saiwai o ataeru tame de wa naku, wazawai o kudasu tame de aru. Ejiputo no chi ni iru Yuda no hitobito wa, tsurugi to kikin ni yotte horobi taeru.
Shikashi, tsurugi o nogareru wazuka no mono wa Ejiputo no chi o dete Yuda no chi ni kaeru. Soshite Yuda no nokotte iru tami de Ejiputo ni kite sunda mono wa, watashi no kotoba ga tatsu ka, karera no kotoba ga tatsu ka, izure de aru ka o shiru you ni naru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi ga kono tokoro de anatagata o bassuru shirushi wa kore de aru. Watashi wa kono you ni shite watashi ga anata gata ni wazawai o kudasou to itta koto no kanarazu tatsu koto o shiraseyou.
Sunawachi Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa Yuda no ou Zedekiya o, sono inochi o motomeru teki de aru Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te ni watashita you ni, Ejiputo no ou paro hofura o sono teki no te, sono inochi o motomeru mono no te ni watasu".
Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no yon nen ni, Neriya no ko Baruku ga korera no kotoba o Eremiya no koujutsu ni shitagatte sho ni shirushita toki, yogensha Eremiya ga kare ni katatta kotoba,
"Baruku yo, Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa anata ni tsuite kou iwareru,
Anata wa katsute, 'Aa, watashi wa wazawai da, Shu ga watashi no kurushimi ni kanashimi o okuwae ni natta. Watashi wa nageki tsukarete, ansoku ga erarenai' to itta.
Anata wa kou kare ni ii nasai, Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa jibun de tateta mono o kowashi, jibun de ueta mono o nuite iru - - sore wa, kono zenchi de aru.
Anata wa jibun no tame ni ooinaru koto o motomeru no ka, kore o motomete wa naranai. Miyo, watashi wa subete no hito ni wazawai o kudasou to shite iru. Shikashi anata no inochi wa anata no yuku subete no tokoro de, bundori mono to shite anata ni ataeru to Shu wa iwareru".
Moromoro no kuni no koto ni tsuite yogensha Eremiya ni nozonda Shu no kotoba.
Ejiputo no koto, sunawachi Yufurate kawa no hotori ni aru Karukemishi no chikaku ni iru Ejiputo no ou Paro Neko no gunzei no koto ni tsuite. Kore wa Yuda no ou Yoshiya no ko Ehoyakimu no yon nen ni, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga uchiyabutta mono de aru. Sono kotoba wa tsugi no toori de aru,
"Oodate to kodate to o sonae, susunde tatakae.
Kihei yo, uma o sensha ni tsunagi, uma ni nore. Kabuto o kabutte tate. Ho ko o migaki, yoroi o ki yo.
Watashi wa mitaga, naniyue ka karera wa osorete shirizoki, sono yuushitachi wa uchi yaburare, awatete nigete, ushiro o furimuku koto mo shinai, - - osore ga karera no shuui ni aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Ashibaya ki mono mo nigeru koto ga dekizu, yuushi mo nogareru koto ga dekinai. Kita no hou, Yufurate kawa no hotori de karera wa tsumazuki taoreta.
Ano Nairu kawa no you ni wakiagari, kawagawa no you ni, sono mizu no sakamaku mono wa dare ka.
Ejiputo wa Nairu kawa no you ni wakiagari, sono mizu wa kawagawa no you ni sakamaku. Soshite kore wa iu, watashi wa nobotte, chi o ooi, machimachi to sono uchi ni sumu mono o horobosou.
Uma yo, susume, kuruma yo, hageshiku hashire. Yuushi yo, tate o toru Echiopiya bito to, Pute bito yo, yumi o takumi ni hiku Rude bito yo, susumideyo.
Sono hi wa bangun no kami, Shu no hi de atte, Shu ga ada o mukuirareru hi, sono teki ni ada o kaesareru hi da. Tsurugi wa tabete aki, karera no chi ni you. Bangun no kami, Shu ga, kita no chi de, Yufurate kawa no hotori de, hofuru koto o nasarerukara da.
Otomenaru Ejiputo no musume yo, Gireade ni nobotte nyuukou o tore. Anata wa ooku no kusuri o mochiite mo, muda da. Anata wa, iya sareru koto wa nai.
Anata no haji wa kuniguni ni kikoete iru, anata no sakebi wa chi ni michite iru. Yuushi ga yuushi ni tsumazuite, tomo ni taoretakara de aru".
Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga kite, Ejiputo no chi o utou to suru koto ni tsuite, Shu ga yogensha Eremiya ni otsuge ni natta kotoba,
"Ejiputo de nobe, Migudoru de tsuge shimeshi, mata Menpisu to Tapanesu ni tsuge shimeshite ie, 'Kataku tatte, sonae seyo, tsurugi ga anata no shuui o, horoboshi tsukusukara da'.
Naze, Apisu wa nogareta no ka. Anata no oushi wa, naze tatanakatta no ka. Sore wa Shu ga kore o taosaretakara da.
Anata ni zokusuru ooku no hei wa, tsumazuite taoreta. Soshite tagai ni itta, 'Tateyo, wareware wa, shi etageru mono no tsurugi o sakete, wareware no tami ni kaeri, kokyou no chi e ikou' to.
Ejiputo no ou Paro no na o, 'Kouki o issuru sawagashii mono' to yobe.
Bangun no Shu to iu na no ou wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, kare wa yamayama no uchi no Taboru no you ni, umi no hotori no Karumeru no you ni kitari nozomu.
Ejiputo ni sumu tami yo, toraware no tame ni nimotsu o sonae yo. Menpisu wa arechi to nari, haikyo to natte sumu hito mo nakunaru.
Ejiputo wa utsukushii mesu no koushi da, shikashi kita kara, ushi bae ga kite, sore ni tomatta.
Sono uchi ni iru yatoihei de sae, koeta koushi no you da. Karera wa furikaette tomo ni nige, tatsu koto o shinakatta. Karera no sainan no hi, sono basserareru toki ga kitakara da.
Kare wa nigesaru hebi no you na oto o tateru. Sono teki ga gunzei o hikiite kare ni nozomi, kikori no you ni, ono o motte kurukara da.
Karera wa kare no hayashi ga ikani irikomigatakutomo, sore o kiritaosu. Karera wa inago yori mo ooku, kazoegataikara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Ejiputo no musume wa hazukashime o uke, kita kara kuru tami no te ni watasareru".
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa Teebe no Amon to, Paro to, Ejiputo to sono kamigami to sono outachi, sunawachi Paro to kare o tanomu mono to o bassuru.
Watashi wa karera o, sono inochi o motomeru mono no te to, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te to, sono keraitachi no te ni watasu. Sono nochi, Ejiputo wa mukashi no you ni hito no sumu tokoro to naruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi no shimobe Yakobu yo, osoreru koto wa nai, Isuraeru yo, odoroku koto wa nai. Miyo, watashi ga anata o tooku kara sukui, anata no shison o sono toraeutsusareta chi kara sukuukara da. Yakobu wa kaette kite, odayaka ni, yasuraka ni nari, kare o osoresaseru mono wa nai.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi no shimobe Yakobu yo, osoreru koto wa nai, watashi ga tomo ni irukara da. Watashi wa anata o oiyatta kuniguni o kotogotoku horoboshi tsukusu. Shikashi anata o horoboshi tsukusu koto wa shinai. Watashi wa tadashii michi ni shitagatte, anata o korashimeru, kesshite basshinaide wa okanai".
Paro ga mada Gaza o utanakatta koro, Perishite bito no koto ni tsuite yogensha Eremiya ni nozonda Shu no kotoba.
"Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, mizu wa kita kara okori, afure nagarete, kono chi to, soko ni aru subete no mono, sono machi to, sono naka ni sumu mono to ni afure kakaru. Sono toki, hitobito wa sakebi, kono chi ni sumu mono wa mina nageku.
Sono takumashii uma no hizume no fuminarasu oto no tame, sono sensha no hibiki no tame, sono sharin no todoroki no tame ni, chichi wa sono te ga yowaku natte, jibun no ko o mo kaeriminai.
Kore wa, Perishite bito o horoboshi tsukushi, Tsuro to Shidon ni nokotte tasuke o nasu mono o kotogotoku tayasu hi ga kurukara de aru. Shu wa Kafutoru no kaigan ni nokotte iru Perishite bito o horobosareru.
Gaza ni wa kami o soru koto ga hajimatte iru. Ashikeron wa horobita. Anaku bi to no nokori no tami yo, itsu made jibun no mi ni kizutsukeru no ka.
Shu no tsurugi yo, omae wa itsu ni nareba shizuka ni naru no ka. Omae no saya ni kaeri, yasunde shizuka ni shite ore.
Shu ga kore ni inochi o kudasareta no da, dou shite shizuka ni shite oreyou ka. Ashikeron to kaigan no chi o semeru koto o sadamerareta no da".
Moabu no koto ni tsuite, bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, "Aa, Nebo wa wazawai da, kore wa horobosareta. Kiriyataimu wa hazukashimerarete torare, tori de wa, hazukashimerarete kowasareta.
Moabu no homare wa, kiesatta. Heshibon de hitobito wa Moabu no gai o hakari, 'Saa, kono kuni o tachi horobosou' to iu. Mademen yo, omae mo mata horobosareru, tsurugi ga omae o ou.
Horonaimu kara sakebigoe ga kikoeru, 'Kouhai to ooinaru metsubou da' to iu.
Moabu wa horobosare, sakebi wa Zoaru ni made kikoeru.
Karera wa nakinagara Ruhite no saka o noboru. Karera wa Horonaimu no kudarizaka de, 'Metsubou' no sakebi o kiitakara da.
Nigete, jibun no mi o sukue, arano no no roba no you ni nare.
Omae ga, toride to zaihou to o tanomi ni shita no de, omae mo toraerarerukara da. Mata Kemoshi wa, sono saishi to tsukasatachi to tomo ni, toraerarete iku.
Horobosu mono wa subete no machi ni kuru, hitotsu no machi mo nogareru koto ga dekinai. Tani wa horobi, heichi wa arasareru, Shu no iwareta toori de aru.
Moabu ni tsubasa o ataete, tobisarase yo. Sono machimachi wa arete, sumu mono wa nakunaru.
Shu no waza o okonau koto o okotaru mono wa norowareru. Mata sono tsurugi o osaete chi o nagasanai mono wa norowareru.
Moabu wa sono osanai toki kara yasuraka de, sake ga, shizunda ori no ue ni todomatte, utsuwa kara utsuwa ni, kumi utsusarenakatta you ni, toraeutsusarenakatta no de, sono aji wa nao sonshi, sono kouki mo kawaru koto ga nai.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue miyo, watashi ga kore o katamukeru monodomo o tsukawasu hi ga kuru. Karera wa kore o katamuke, sono utsuwa o ake, sono kame o kudaku.
Sono toki Moabu wa Kemoshi no tame ni haji o kaku. Choudo Isuraeru no ie ga sono tanomi to shita Beteru no tame ni haji o kaita you ni naru.
Anata gata wa dou shite 'Wareware wa yuushi da. Tsuyoi senshi da' to iu no ka.
Moabu to sono machimachi o horobosu mono wa nobotte ki, Moabu no erinuki no wakamonotachi wa kudatte korosareta to bangun no Shu to nanoru ou ga iwareru.
Moabu no sainan wa chikazuite iru, sono kunan wa sumiyaka ni kuru.
Subete sono shuui ni aru mono yo, mata sono na o shiru mono yo, kare no tame ni nageite, 'Aa, tsuyoki shaku, uruwashiki tsue wa, tsuini oreta' to ie.
Debon ni sumu mono yo, a anata no sakae o hanarete kudari, kawaita chi ni zaseyo. Moabu o horobosu mono ga anata ni semenobotte kite, anata no shiro o horoboshitakara da.
Aroeru ni sumu mono yo, michi no katawara ni tatte mihari shi, nigete kuru otoko, nogarete kuru onna ni tazunete, 'Nani ga okotta no ka' to ie.
Moabu wa yaburete, haji o koumutte iru. Nageki yobaware. Arunon kawa no hotori de, Moabu wa horobosareta to tsuge yo.
Sabaki wa kougen no chi ni nozomi, Horon, Yahazu, Mepaate,
Debon, Nebo, bete deburataimu,
Kiriyataimu, bete gamuru, bete meon,
Keriote, Bozura nado Moabu no chi no subete no machi no, tooi mono ni mo chikai mono ni mo, nozonda.
Moabu no tsuno wa kudake, sono ude wa oreta to Shu wa iwareru.
Moabu o yowase yo, kare ga Shu ni tekishite mizukara takabuttakara de aru. Moabu wa jibun no haita mono no naka ni korogatte, waraigusa to naru.
Isuraeru wa anata no waraigusa de wa nakatta ka. Anata ga, kare no koto o kataru goto ni kubi o futta no wa, kare ga touzoku no naka ni ita to de mo iu no ka.
Moabu ni sumu mono yo, machi o satte iwa no aida ni sume. Tani no iriguchi no katawara ni su o tsukuru yamabato no you ni seyo.
Wareware wa Moabu no kouman na koto o kiita, sono kouman wa, hanahadashii. Sunawachi, sono sondai, kouman, ouhei, oyobi sono kokoro no takaburi no koto o kiita.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa kare no ouchaku na no o shiru, kare no jiman wa itsuwari de, sono okonai mo itsuwari de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Moabu no tame ni nageki, Moabu no zenchi no tame ni yobawaru. Kiruheresu no hitobito no tame ni watashi wa kanashimu.
Shibuma no budou no ki yo, watashi wa Yazeru no tame ni naku no ni masatte omae no tame ni naku. Omae no tsuru wa nobite umi o koe, Yazeru ni oyonda. Omae no natsu no mi to, sono shuukaku o horobosu mono ga osotte kita.
Yorokobi to tanoshimi wa, minori ooi Moabu no chi o satta. Watashi wa, budou o shiboru tokoro ni mo sake o nakushita. Tanoshiku yobawatte, budou o fumu mono mo nakunatta. Yobawatte mo, yorokonde yobawaru koe de wa nai.
Heshibon to Ereare wa sakebu. Yahazu ni itaru made, Zoaru kara Horonaimu to egurate shirishiya ni itaru made, karera wa sono koe o ageru. Nimurimu no mizu mo taetakara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa gisei o takaki tokoro ni sasage, kou o sono kami ni takumono o Moabu no uchi ni horobosu.
Sore yue, watashi no kokoro wa Moabu no tame ni fue no you ni nageki, watashi no kokoro wa Kiruheresu no hitobito no tame ni fue no you ni nageku. Karera no eta tomi ga kieusetakara de aru.
Hito wa mina kami o sori, mina hige o sori, mina te ni kizu o tsuke, koshi ni aranuno o tsukeru.
Moabu de wa doko no yane no ue mo, hiroba mo, tada kanashimi ni tsutsumarete iru. Kore wa, watashi ga, dare mo hoshigara nai utsuwa no you ni Moabu o kudaitakara de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Aa, Moabu wa tsuini horobita. Hitobito wa nageku. Aa, Moabu wa hajite kao o somuketa. Moabu wa sono shuui no subete no mono no waraigusa to nari osore to natta".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, teki wa washi no you ni hayaku tonde kite, Moabu ni mukatte tsubasa o noberu.
Machimachi wa torare, shiro wa ubawareru. Sono hi Moabu no yuushi no kokoro wa ko o umu onna no kokoro no you ni naru.
Moabu wa horobosarete, kuni o nasanai you ni naru. Shu ni tekishite mizukara hokottakara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, Moabu ni sumu mono yo, osore to, ana to, wana to ga anata ni nozonde iru.
Osore o sakete nigeru mono wa ana ni ochiiri, ana o yojinobotte deru mono wa, wana ni toraerareru. Watashi ga Moabu ni, sono basserareru toshi ni, korera no mono o nozomaserukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Nigeta mono wa Heshibon no kage ni, chikaranaku tachidomaru. Heshibon kara hi ga de, Shihon no ie kara honoo ga dete, Moabu no hitai, sawagu hitobito no atama no itadaki o yaitakara da.
Moabu yo, omae wa wazawai da. Kemoshi no tami wa horobita. Omae no musukora wa toraeutsusare, omae no musumera mo torae yukaretakara de aru.
Shikashi sue no hi ni watashi wa futatabi Moabu o sakaesaseru to Shu wa iwareru". Koko made wa Moabu no sabaki no koto o itta no de aru.
Anmon bito ni tsuite, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Isuraeru ni wa ko ga nai no ka, yotsugi ga nai no ka. Dou shite Mirukomu ga Gado o oidashite, sono tami ga sono machimachi ni sunde iru no ka.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue, miyo, Anmon bito no Raba o semeru tatakai no sakebi o, watashi ga kikoesaseru hi ga kuru. Raba wa arezuka to nari, sono muramura wa hi de yakareru. Sono toki Isuraeru wa jibun o oidashita monodomo o oidasu to Shu wa iwareru.
Heshibon yo nageke, Ai wa horobosareta. Raba no musumetachi yo yobaware. Aranuno o mi ni matoi, kanashinde, ma gaki no uchi o hashirimaware. Mirukomu to sono saishi oyobi tsukasa ga tomo ni toraeutsusarerukara da.
Fushin no musume yo, anata wa naze jibun no tani no koto o hokoru no ka. Anata wa jibun no tomi ni yori tayonde, 'Dare ga watashi ni semete kuru mono ka' to iu.
Shu naru bangun no kami wa iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata no ue ni osore o nozomaseru, sore wa anata no shuui no mono kara kuru. Anata wa owarete, onoono tadachini tanin ni tsuzuki, nigeru mono o atsumeru hito mo nai.
Shikashi, nochi ni natte, watashi wa Anmon bito o futatabi sakaesaseruto, Shu wa iwareru".
Edomu no koto ni tsuite, bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Teman ni wa, mohaya chie ga nai no ka. Satoi mono ni wa hakarigoto ga nakunatta no ka. Sono chie wa kieuseta no ka.
Dedan ni sumu mono yo, nigeyo, nogareyo, fukai tokoro ni kakure yo. Watashi ga Esau no sainan o kare no ue ni nozomase, kare o bassuru toki o kosaserukara da.
Budou o atsumeru mono ga anata no tokoro ni kitanaraba, sukoshi no mi o mo nokosanaide arou ka. Yoru,nusu bito ga kitanaraba, jibuntachi no manzoku suru dake horobosanaide arou ka.
Shikashi watashi wa Esau o hadaka ni shi, sono kakureru tokoro o arawashita no de, kare wa sono mi o kakusu koto ga dekinai. Sono kodomotachi mo, kyoudai mo, tonaribito mo horobosareru. Soshite kare wa, inaku naru.
Anata no minashigo o nokose, watashi ga sore o ikinagaraesaseru. Anata no yamome ni wa, watashi ni yori tanomase yo".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Moshi, sakazuki o nomubekide nai mono mo sore o nomanakereba naranakatta to sureba, anata wa batsu o manukareru koto ga dekiyou ka. Anata wa batsu o manukarenai. Sore o nomanakereba naranai.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa jibun o sashite chikatta, Bozura wa odoroki to nari, nonoshiri to nari, arechi to nari, noroi to naru. Sono machimachi wa nagaku arechi to naru".
Watashi wa Shu kara no otozure o kiita. Hitori no shisha ga tsukawasarete bankoku ni iki, soshite itta, "Anata gata wa atsumari, itte kare o seme, tatte tatakae.
Miyo, watashi wa anata o bankoku no uchi ni chiisai mono to shi, hitobito no uchi ni iyashimerareru mono to suru.
Iwa no wareme ni sumi, yama no takami o shimeru mono yo, anata no osoroshii koto to, anata no kokoro no takaburi ga, anata o azamuita. Anata wa, watashi no you ni su o takai tokoro ni tsukutte iruga, watashi wa sono tokoro kara anata o toriorosu to Shu wa iwareru.
Edomu wa osore to naru. Sono katawara o toorisugiru mono wa mina osore, sono wazawai no tame ni, shitauchi suru.
Shu wa iwareru, Sodomu to Gomora to sono tonari no machimachi ga kutsugaesareta toki no you ni, soko ni sumu hito wa naku, soko ni yadoru hito mo nakunaru.
Miyo, shishi ga Yorudan no mitsurin kara nobotte kite, joubu na hitsuji no ori o osou you ni, watashi wa, tachimachi karera o soko kara nigehashirase, watashi no erabu mono o sono ue ni tateru. Dare ka watashi no you na mono ga arude arou ka. Dare ga watashi o yobitsukeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Dono bokusha ga watashi no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Sore yue, Edomu ni taishite Shu ga tateta hakarigoto to, Teman ni sumu mono ni taishite shiyou to suru koto o kiku ga yoi. Karera no mure no uchi no chiisai mono made mo mina, hikarete iku. Karera no ori no mono mo sono owari o mite osoreru.
Sono taoreru oto o kiite, chi wa furui, karera no sakebigoe wa koukai ni mo kikoeru.
Miyo, teki wa washi no you ni nobori, sumiyaka ni tobi kakeri, sono tsubasa o Bozura no ue ni hari hirogeru. Sono hi Edomu no yuushi no kokoro wa ko o umu onna no kokoro no you ni naru".
Damasuko no koto ni tsuite, "Hamate to Arupade wa, urotaete iru, karera wa warui otozure o kiitakara da. Karera wa yuuki o ushinai, odayaka ni naru koto no dekinai umi no you ni nayamu.
Damasuko wa yowari, mi o megurashite nigeta, kyoufu ni osowarete iru. Ko o umu onna ni nozomu you ni itami to kanashimi to kare ni nozomu.
Aa, na aru machi, tanoshii machi wa suterareru.
Sore yue, sono hi ni, wakai mono wa, hiroba ni taore, heishi wa kotogotoku horobosareruto bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa Damasuko no jouheki no ue ni hi o moyashi, Benehadade no kyuuden o yaki tsukusu".
Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga seme utta Kedaru to Hazoru no shokoku no koto ni tsuite, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Tatte, Kedaru ni mukatte susumi, higashi no hitobito o horobose.
Karera no tenmaku to, sono hitsuji no mure to wa torare, sono taremaku to sono moromoro no utsuwa to, rakuda to wa karera no tokoro kara hakobisarare, hitobito wa karera ni mukatte sakebu, 'Osoroshii koto ga shihou ni aru' to.
Shu wa iwareru, Hazoru ni sumu mono yo, nigeyo, tooku samayoi iki, fukai tokoro ni kakure yo. Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga anatagata o semeru hakarigoto o megurashi, anatagata o semeru, tedate o mouketakara da.
Shu wa iwareru, tatte susumi, anzen na tokoro ni sumuki raku na tami o semeyo, karera wa mon mo naku, kannoki mo naku, hitori hanarete sumu.
Karera no rakuda wa, bundori mono to nari, kachiku no mure wa ubawareru. Watashi wa, kano kaminoke no sumizumi o kiru mono o shihou ni chirashi, sono sainan o happou kara kosaseru to Shu wa iwareru.
Hazoru wa yamainu no sumai to nari, itsu made mo arechi to natte iru. Dare mo soko ni sumu hito wa naku, soko ni yadoru hito mo nai".
Yuda no ou Zedekiya no chisei no hajime no koro ni, Eramu no koto ni tsuite yogensha Eremiya ni nozonda Shu no kotoba.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa Eramu ga chikara to shite tayonde iru yumi o oru.
Watashi wa ten no shihou kara, shihou no kaze o Eramu ni kosase, karera o shihou no kaze ni chirasu. Eramu kara oidasareru mono no ikanai kuni wa nai.
Shu wa iwareru, watashi wa Eramu o shite sono teki no mae, mata sono inochi o motomeru mono no mae ni osoresaseru. Watashi wa wazawai o kudashi, hageshii ikari o sono ue ni kudasu. Karera no ushiro ni, tsurugi o okutte horoboshi tsukusu.
Soshite watashi no kurai o Eramu ni sue, ou to tsukasatachi to o horobosu to Shu wa iwareru.
Shikashi sue no hi ni, watashi wa Eramu o futatabi sakaesaseruto, Shu wa iwareru".
Shu ga yogensha Eremiya ni yotte katarareta Babiron to Karudeya bito no chi no koto ni tsuite no kotoba.
"Kuniguni no uchi ni tsuge, mata fure shimeseyo, hata o tatete, kakusu koto naku fure shimeshite ie, 'Babiron wa torare, Beru wa hazukashimerare, Merodaku wa kudakare, sono zou wa hazukashimerare, sono guuzou wa kudakareru' to.
Sore wa, kita no hou kara hitotsu no kokumin ga kite, kore o seme, sono chi o arashite, sumu hito mo nai you ni surukara de aru. Hito mo kemono mo mina nigesatte shimau.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi sono toki, Isuraeru no tami to Yuda no tami wa tomo ni kaette kuru. Karera wa nagekinagara kaette kuru. Soshite sono kami, Shu o motomeru.
Karera wa kao o Shion ni mukete, sono michi o toi, 'Saa, wareware wa, eien ni wasurerareru koto no nai keiyaku o musunde Shu ni tsuranarou' to iu.
Watashi no tami wa mayoeru hitsuji no mure de aru, sono bokusha ga kore o izanatte, yama ni fumimayowaseta no de, yama kara oka e to iki meguri, sono yasumu tokoro o wasureta.
Kore ni au mono wa mina kore o tabeta. Sono teki wa itta, 'Wareware ni tsumi wa nai. Karera ga sono makoto no sumika de aru Shu, senzotachi no kibou de atta Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashita no da' to.
Babiron no uchi kara nige yo. Karudeya bito no chi kara de yo. Mure no mae ni iku o yagi no you ni seyo.
Miyo, watashi wa ookii kuniguni o okoshi atsumete, kita no chi kara Babiron ni seme kosaseru. Karera wa kore ni mukatte seizoroi o shi, kore o sono tokoro kara toru. Karera no ya wa munashiku kaeranai rouren na yuushi no you de aru.
Karudeya wa hito ni kasumerareru. Kore o kasumeru mono wa mina aku koto ga dekiruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi no shigyou o kasumeru monodomo yo, anata gata wa yorokobitanoshimi, mesu no koushi no you ni kusa ni tawamure, ouma no you ni, inanaite iruga,
Anata gata no haha wa itaku hazukashimerare, anatagata o unda mono wa haji o koumuru. Miyo, kanojo wa kuniguni no uchi no mottomo ato naru mono to nari, kawaita sunahara no arano to naru.
Shu no ikari ni yotte, koko ni sumu mono wa naku, kanzen ni arechi to naru. Babiron no katawara o tooru mono wa, mina sono kizu o mite odoroki, katsu azawarau.
Anata gata subete yumi o haru mono yo, Babiron no shuui ni seizoroi shite, kore o seme, ya o oshimazu ni, kore o iyo, kanojo ga Shu ni tsumi o okashitakara da.
Sono shuui ni sakebigoe o ageyo, kanojo wa koufuku shita. Sono tori de wa taore, sono jouheki wa kuzureta, Shu ga ada o kaesaretakara da. Kanojo ni houfuku seyo, kanojo ga okonatta you ni, kore ni okonae.
Tane makumono to, kariire doki ni, kama o toru mono o Babiron ni tayase. Horobosu mono no tsurugi o osorete, hito wa onoono jibun no tami no tokoro ni kaeri, sono furusato ni nigete iku.
Isuraeru wa, shishi ni owarete chitta hitsuji de aru. Hajime ni ASsuriya no ou ga kore o kui, soshite ima wa tsuini Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ga sono hone o kajitta.
Sore yue bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa, kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa ASsuriya no ou o basshita you ni, Babiron no ou to sono kuni ni batsu o kudasu.
Watashi wa Isuraeru o futatabi sono makiba ni kaeraseru. Kare wa Karumeru to Bashan de kusa o taberu. Mata Efuraimu no yama to Gireade de sono nozomi ga mitasareru.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi sono toki ni wa, Isuraeru no toga o sagashite mo miatarazu, Yuda no tsumi o sagashite mo nai. Sore wa watashi ga nokoshite oku hitobito o, yurusukara de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, nobotte itte, Merataimu no chi o seme, Pekode no tami o seme, karera o koroshite mattaku horoboshi, watashi ga anata gata ni meijita koto o mina, okonai nasai.
Sono chi ni, ikusa no sakebi to, ooinaru horobi ga aru.
Aa, zenchi o kudaita tsuchi wa tsuini ore kudakeru. Aa, Babiron wa tsuini kuniguni no uchi no osorubeki mimono to naru.
Babiron yo, watashi wa, omae o toraeru tame ni wana o kaketaga, omae wa sore ni kakatta. Soshite omae wa sore o shiranakatta. Omae wa Shu ni tekishita no de, tazunedasare, toraerareta.
Shu wa buki no kura o hiraite sono ikari no buki o toridasareta. Shu naru bangun no kami ga, Karudeya bito no chi ni koto o okonawarerukara de aru.
Arayuru houmen kara kite, kore o seme, sono kokugura o hiraki, kore o kokumotsu no yama no you ni tsumiage, kanzen ni horoboshi tsukushi, soko ni nokoru mono no nai you ni seyo.
Sono oushi o kotogotoku korose, sore o, hofuriba ni kudarase yo. Sorera no mono wa wazawai da, sono hi, sono batsu o ukeru toki ga kitakara da.
Kikeyo, Babiron no chi kara nige, nogarete kita mono no koe ga suru. Wareware no kami, Shu no houfuku, sono miya no houfuku no koto o Shion ni tsuge shimesu.
Yumi o haru ite o kotogotoku yobiatsumete, Babiron o semeyo. Sono shuui ni jin o shike. Hitori mo nigasu na. Sono shiwaza ni shitagatte Babiron ni mukui, kore ga okonatta tokoro ni shitagatte kore ni okonae. Kare ga Isuraeru no seija de aru Shu ni mukatte kouman ni furumattakara da.
Sore yue, sono hi, wakai mono wa, hiroba ni taore, heishi wa mina tayasareru to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu naru bangun no kami wa iwareru, takaburu mono yo, miyo, watashi wa omae no teki to naru, anata no hi, watashi ga omae o bassuru toki ga kita.
Takaburu mono wa tsumazuki taoreru, kore o tasukeokosu mono wa nai. Watashi wa sono machimachi ni hi o moyashite, sono shuui no mono o kotogotoku yaki tsukusu.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, Isuraeru no tami to Yuda no tami wa tomo ni shi etagerarete iru. Karera o toriko ni shita mono wa mina karera o kataku mamotte shakuhou suru koto o kobamu.
Karera o aganau mono wa tsuyoku, sono na wa bangun no Shu to iwareru. Kare wa kanarazu karera no uttae o tadashi, kono chi ni yasuki o ataeruga, Babiron ni sumu mono ni wa fuan o ataerareru.
Shu wa iwareru, Karudeya bito no ue to Babiron ni sumu mono no ue, sono tsukasatachi, sono chishatachi no ue ni tsurugi ga nozomu.
Uranaishi no ue ni tsurugi ga nozomi, karera wa orokamono to naru. Sono yuushi no ue ni tsurugi ga nozomi, karera wa horobosareru.
Sono uma no ue to, sono kuruma no ue ni tsurugi ga nozomi, mata sono uchi ni aru subete no yatoihei no ue ni nozomi, karera wa onna no you ni naru. Sono zaihou no ue ni tsurugi ga nozomi, sore wa kasumerareru.
Sono mizu no ue ni, hideri ga kite, sore wa kawaku. Sore wa, kono chi ga guuzou no chi de atte, hitobito ga guuzou ni kokoro ga kurutte irukara da.
Sore yue, no no kemono to yamainu to wa tomo ni Babiron ni ori, dachou mo soko ni sumu. Shikashi, itsu made mo sono chi ni sumu hito wa naku, yoyo koko ni sumu hito wa nai.
Shu wa iwareru, kami ga Sodomu to Gomora to, sono tonari no machimachi o horobosareta you ni, soko ni sumu hito wa naku, soko ni yadoru hito no ko wa nai.
Miyo, hitotsu no tami ga kita no hou kara kuru. Ooinaru kuni to ooku no ou ga chi no hate kara tachiagatte iru.
Karera wa yumi to, yari o toru. Zannin de, awaremi ga naku, sono hibiki wa umi no nari todoroku you de aru. Babiron no musume yo, karera wa uma ni nori, iku sabi to no you ni mi o yorotte, anata o semeru.
Babiron no ou wa sono uwasa o kiite, sono te wa yowari, ko o umu onna ni nozomu you na itami to kurushimi ni semarareta.
Miyo, shishi ga Yorudan no mitsurin kara nobotte kite, joubu na hitsuji no ori o osou you ni, watashi wa, tachimachi karera o soko kara nigesaraseru. Soshite watashi no erabu mono o sono ue ni tateru. Dare ka watashi no you na mono ga arude arou ka. Dare ga watashi o yobitsukeru koto ga dekiyou ka. Dono bokusha ga watashi no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Sore yue, Babiron ni taishite Shu ga tateta hakarigoto to, Karudeya bito no chi ni taishite shiyou to suru koto o kiku ga yoi. Karera no mure no uchi no chiisai mono wa, kanarazu hikarete iku. Karera no ori no mono mo kanarazu sono owari o mite osoreru.
Babiron ga torareta to no koe ni yotte chi wa furui, sono sakebi wa kuniguni no uchi ni kikoeru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa, horobosu mono no kokoro o furuiokoshite, Babiron o seme, Karudeya ni sumu mono o semesaseru.
Watashi wa Babiron ni, aogi wakeru mono o tsukawasu. Karera wa, sono wazawai no hi ni, shihou kara kore o seme, sore o aogi wakete, sono chi o munashiku suru.
Ite ni wa sono yumi o haraseru koto naku, yoroi o kite tachiagaraseru na. Sono wakaki mono o awaremu koto naku, sono gunzei o kotogotoku horobose.
Karera wa Karudeya bito no chi ni korosarete taore, sono chimata ni kizutsuite taoreru.
Isuraeru to Yuda wa sono kami, bangun no Shu ni suterarete wa inaiga, shikashi Karudeya bito no chi ni wa Isuraeru no seija ni mukatte okashita tsumi ga michite iru.
Babiron no uchi kara nogaredete, onoono sono inochi o sukue. Sono batsu ni makikomarete tachi horobosarete wa naranai. Ima wa Shu ga ada o kaesareru toki dakara, sore ni houfuku o sareru no de aru.
Babiron wa Shu no te no uchi ni aru kin no sakazuki de atte, subete no chi o yowaseta. Kuniguni wa sono sake o nonda no de, kuniguni wa kurutta.
Babiron wa tachimachi taorete yabureta. Kore ga tame ni nageke. Sono kizu no tame ni nyuukou o tore. Aruiha, ieru ka mo shirenai.
Wareware wa Babiron o iyasou to shitaga, kore wa ienakatta. Wareware wa kore o sutete, onoono jibun no kuni ni kaerou. Sono batsu ga ten ni tasshi, kumo ni made oyonde irukara da.
Shu wa wareware no tadashii koto o akiraka ni sareta. Saa, wareware wa Shion de, wareware no kami, Shu no miwaza o tsuge shimesou.
Ya o togi, tate o tore. Shu wa Medea bito no outachi no kokoro o hikitaterareru. Shu no Babiron ni omoi hakaru koto wa, kore o horobosu koto de ari, Shu ga ada o kaeshi, sono miya no ada o kaesareru no de aru.
Babiron no jouheki ni mukatte hata o tate, mihari o kyouko ni shi, banpei o oki, fukuhei o sonae yo. Shu ga Babiron ni sumu mono o semeyou to hakari, sono iwareta koto o, ima okonawarerukara da.
Ooku no mizu no hotori ni sumi, ooku no zaihou o motsu mono yo, anata no owari ga kite, sono inochi no ito wa tatareru.
Bangun no Shu wa mizukara o sashite chikai, iwareru, watashi wa kanarazu anata no uchi ni, hito o inago no you ni mitasu. Karera wa anata ni mukatte, kachidoki no koe o ageru.
Shu wa sono chikara o motte chi o tsukuri, sono chie o motte sekai o tate, sono satori o motte ten o noberareta.
Kare ga koe o dasareruto, ten ni ooku no mizu no zawameki ga ari, mata chi no hate kara kiri o tachiagaraserareru. Kare wa ame no tame ni i nabikari o okoshi, sono kura kara kaze o toridasareru.
Subete no hito wa oroka de chie ga naku, subete no kin zaikunin wa sono tsukutta guuzou no tame ni haji o koumuru. Sono guuzou wa itsuwari mono de, sono uchi ni iki ga naikara da.
Sorera wa, munashii mono, mayoi no waza de aru. Basserareru toki ni nareba horobiru mono de aru.
Yakobu no bun de aru kare wa kono you na mono de wa nai, kare wa banbutsu no tsukurinushi dakara de aru. Isuraeru wa kare no shigyou to shite no buzoku de aru. Kare no na wa bangun no Shu to iu.
Omae wa watashi no tsuchi de ari, tatakai no buki de aru. Watashi wa omae o motte subete no kuni o kudaki, omae o motte bankoku o horobosu.
Omae o motte watashi wa uma to, sono kishu to o kudaki, omae o motte sensha to sore ni noru mono to o kudaku.
Watashi wa omae o motte otoko to onna to o kudaki, omae o motte oita mono to osanai mono to o kudaki, omae o motte wakai mono to, otome to o kudaku.
Watashi wa omae o motte, hitsujikai to, sono mure to o kudaki, omae o motte noufu to, kubiki o ou kachiku to o kudaki, omae o motte osatachi to, tsukasatachi to o kudaku.
Watashi wa Babiron to Karudeya ni sumu subete no mono to ni, karera ga Shion de itta moromoro no ashiki koto no tame ni, anata gata no me no mae de mukui o suruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, zenchi o horoboshi tsukusu horoboshi no yama yo, miyo, watashi wa omae no teki to naru, watashi wa te o omae no ue ni nobete, omae o iwa kara korobashi, omae o yake yama ni suru.
Shu wa iwareru, hito ga omae kara ishi o totte, sumi no ishi to suru koto naku, mata ishizue to suru koto mo nai. Omae wa itsu made mo arechi to natte iru.
Chi ni hata o tate, kuniguni no uchi ni rappa o fuki, kuniguni no tami o atsumete sore o seme, Ararate, Minni, Ashikenazu no kuniguni o maneite sore o seme, gun no chou o tatete sore o seme, muragaru inago no you ni uma o nobori ikase yo.
Kuniguni no tami o atsumete sore o seme, Medea bito no outachi to, sono osatachi, tsukasatachi, oyobi subete no ryouchi no hitobito o atsumete kore o semeyo.
Sono chi wa furui, katsu modaekurushimu, Shu ga sono omoi hakaru koto o Babiron ni okonai, Babiron no chi o, sumu hito naki arechi to sarerukara da.
Babiron no yuushitachi wa tatakai o yamete, sono shiro ni komori, chikara wa usete, onna no you ni naru. Sono ie wa yake, sono kannoki wa kudakareru.
Hikyaku wa hashitte hikyaku ni ai, shisha wa hashitte shisha ni ai, Babiron no ou ni tsugete, machi wa kotogotoku torare,
Watashiba wa ubaware, tori de wa hi de yakare, heishi wa obiete iru to iu.
Bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa kou iwareru, Babiron no musume wa, uchi ba no you da, sono fumareru toki ga kita no da. Shibaraku shite sono karitorareru toki ga kuru".
"Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru wa watashi o kui tsukushi, watashi o horoboshi, watashi o, kara no utsuwa no you ni shi, ryuu no you ni watashi o nomi, watashi no umai mono de sono hara o mitashi, watashi o araizarai ni shita.
Watashi to watashi no nikushin ni okonatta bougyaku wa, Babiron ni furikakaru" to Shion ni sumu mono wa iwanakereba naranai. "Watashi no chi wa Karudeya ni sumu mono ni furikakaru" to Erusaremu wa iwanakereba naranai.
Sore yue Shu wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa anata no uttae o tadashi, anata no tame ni ada o kaesu. Watashi wa Babiron no umi o kawakashi, sono izumi o kawakasu.
Babiron wa arezuka to nari, yamainu no sumai to nari, odoroki to nari, warai to nari, sumu hito no nai tokoro to naru.
Karera wa shishi no you ni tomo ni hoe, wakai shishi no you ni hoeru.
Karera no yoku no moete iru toki, watashi wa utage o moukete karera o yowase, karera ga tsuini ki o ushinatte, nagai nemuri ni iri, mohaya me o samasu koto no nai you ni shiyou to Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa karera o kohitsuji no you ni, mata ohitsuji ya o yagi no you ni, hofuriba ni kudaraseyou.
Aa, Babiron wa tsuini torareta, zenchi no hito no, hometataeta mono wa toraerareta. Aa, Babiron wa tsuini kuniguni no uchi ni odoroki to natta.
Umi wa Babiron ni afure kakari, doyomeku nami ni oowareta.
Sono machimachi wa arete, kawaita chi to nari, sunahara to nari, sumu hito no nai chi to naru. Hito no ko wa hitori to shite soko o sugiru koto wa nai.
Watashi wa Babiron de Beru o basshi, sono nomikonda mono o kuchi kara toridasu. Kuniguni ga kawa no you ni kare ni nagareiru koto wa nakunaru. Babiron no jouheki wa taoreta.
Waga tami yo, anata gata wa sono naka kara dete, onoono Shu no hageshii ikari o manukare, sono inochi o sukue.
Kokoro o yowaku shite wa naranai, kono chi de kiku uwasa o osorete wa naranai. Uwasa wa kono toshi ni mo kureba, mata tsugi no toshi ni mo kuru. Kono chi ni bougyaku ga ari, tsukasa to tsukasa to ga semeau koto ga aru.
Sore yue miyo, watashi ga Babiron no guuzou o bassuru hi ga kuru. Sono zenchi wa hazukashimerare, sono korosareru mono wa mina sono naka ni taoreru.
Ten to chi to sono uchi ni aru subete no mono wa Babiron no koto de yorokobiutau. Horobosu mono ga kita no hou kara koko ni kurukara de aru to Shu wa iwareru.
Isuraeru no korosareta monotachi no tame ni, Babiron wa taorenakereba naranai, Babiron no tame ni zenchi no korosareta mono wa taoreta no da.
Tsurugi o nogarete kita anata gata wa, ike, tachi todomatte wa naranai. Tooku kara Shu o oboe, Erusaremu o kokoro ni tomeyo.
'Wareware wa nonoshiri o kiita no de, hajite iru. Ihoujin ga Shu no miya no seijo ni haitta no de, haji ga wareware no kao o ootta'.
Shu wa iwareru, sore yue miyo, watashi ga sono guuzou o bassuru hi ga kuru, kizutsukerareta mono ga, sono zenkoku ni umeku you ni naru.
Tatoi Babiron ga ten ni nobotte mo, sono shiro o takaku shite katamete mo, horobosu mono wa watashi kara dete, kore ni nozomu to Shu wa iwareru.
Kike, Babiron no sakebi o, Karudeya bito no chi ni okoru ooinaru horobi no sawagi koe o.
Shu ga Babiron o horoboshi, sono ooinaru koe o tayasareru no da. Sono nami wa oomizu no you ni nari todoroki, sono koe wa hibiki wataru.
Horobosu mono ga kore ni nozomi, Babiron ni kita. Sono yuushitachi wa toraerare, sono yumi wa orareru. Shu wa mukui o suru kami de arukara kanarazu mukuirareru no da.
Watashi wa sono kimitachi to chishatachi, osatachi, tsukasatachi, oyobi yuushitachi o yowaseru. Karera wa, nagai nemuri ni iri, me o samasu koto wa nai. Bangun no Shu to yobareru ou ga kore o iwaseru.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, Babiron no hiroi jouheki wa chi ni kuzusare, sono takai mon wa hi ni yakareru. Kou shite tami no rouku wa munashiku nari, kokumin wa tada hi no tame ni tsukareru".
Maaseya no ko de aru Neriya no ko Seraya ga, Yuda no ou Zedekiya to tomo ni, sono chisei no yon nen ni Babiron e iku toki, yogensha Eremiya ga Seraya ni meijita kotoba. Seraya wa shukuei no chou de atta.
Eremiya wa Babiron ni nozomou to suru subete no wazawai o makimono ni shirushita. Kore wa sunawachi Babiron no koto ni tsuite shirushita subete no kotoba de aru.
Eremiya wa Seraya ni itta, "Anata wa Babiron e ittanaraba, wasureru koto naku kono subete no kotoba o yomi,
Soshite ii nasai, 'Shu yo, anata wa kono tokoro o horoboshi, hito to kemono to o towazu, subete koko ni sumu mono no nai you ni shi, eikyuu ni koko o arechi to shiyou to, kono tokoro ni tsuite katararemashita' to.
Anata ga kono makimono o yomi owattanaraba, kore ni ishi o musubitsukete Yufurate kawa no naka ni nagekomi,
Soshite ii nasai, 'Babiron wa kono you ni shizunde, ni do to agatte konai. Watashi ga kore ni wazawai o kudasukara de aru' to". Koko made wa Eremiya no kotoba de aru.
Zedekiya wa ou to natta toki nijuu ichisai de attaga, Erusaremu de juu ichi nenyo o osameta. Haha no na wa Hamutaru to ii, Ribuna no Eremiya no musume de aru.
Zedekiya wa Ehoyakimu ga subete itta you ni, Shu no me no mae ni akuji o okonatta.
Tashika ni, Shu no ikari ni yotte, Erusaremu to Yuda to wa, sono mimae kara sutesarareru you na koto ni natta. Soshite Zedekiya wa Babiron no ou ni somuita.
Soko de kare no chisei no kyuu nen juu gatsu tooka ni, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru wa sono gunzei o hikii, Erusaremu ni kite, kore o houi shi, shuui ni rui o kizuite kore o semeta.
Kou shite kono machi wa semekakomarete, Zedekiya ou no juu ichi nen ni made oyondaga,
Sono yon gatsu kokonoka ni natte, machi no naka no shokuryou wa, hanahadashiku ketsubou shi, sono chi no tami wa shokumotsu o eru koto ga dekinaku natta.
Soshite machi no jouheki wa tsuini uchiyaburareta no de, heishitachi wa mina nige, yoru no uchi ni, ou no sono no chikaku no, futatsu no jouheki no aida no mon kara machi o nogaredete, Karudeya bito ga, machi o semekakonde iru uchi ni, Araba no hou e ochite itta.
Shikashi Karudeya bito no gunzei wa ou o otte itte, Eriko no heichi de Zedekiya ni oitsuitaga, kare no gunzei ga mina chitte kare no soba o hanareta no de,
Karudeya bito wa ou o torae, Hamate no chi no Ribura ni iru Babiron no ou no moto ni hiite itta no de, ou wa kare no tsumi o sadameta.
Sunawachi Babiron no ou wa Zedekiya no kotachi o sono me no mae de korosase, Yuda no tsukasatachi o kotogotoku Ribura de korosase,
Mata Zedekiya no me o tsubusaseta. Soshite Babiron no ou wa kare o kusari ni tsunaide Babiron e tsurete iki, sono shinu hi made gokuya ni irete oita.
Go gatsu tooka ni, - - sore wa Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no yo no juu kyuu nen de atta - - Babiron no ou ni tsukaeru jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa Erusaremu ni, hai tte,
Shu no miya to ou no kyuuden o yaki, Erusaremu no subete no ie o yaita. Kare wa ookina ie o mina yakiharatta.
Mata jiei no chou to tomo ni ita Karudeya bito no gunzei wa, Erusaremu no shuui no jouheki o mina torikowashita.
Soshite jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa tami no uchi no mottomo mazushii mono jakkan, sono hoka machi no uchi ni nokotta mono, oyobi Babiron no ou ni kudatta hito, sono ta koushoutachi o toraeutsushita.
Shikashi jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa sono chi no mottomo mazushii mono jakkan o nokoshite, budou o tsukuru mono to shi, noufu to shita.
Karudeya bito wa mata Shu no miya no seidou no hashira to, senban no dai to, seidou no umi o kudaite, sono seidou o kotogotoku Babiron e hakobi,
Mata, tsubo to, juunou to, shinkiri basami to, hachi to, kou o moru sara oyobi miya no tsutome ni mochiiru seidou no utsuwa o kotogotoku totte itta.
Mata karera wa kobachi to, shinto rizara to, hachi to, tsubo to, shokudai to, kou o moru sara to, kansai no hachi o totta. Kin de tsukutta mono wa kin to shite, gin de tsukutta mono wa gin to shite, jiei no chou wa hakobisatta.
Soromon ou ga Shu no miya ni tsukutta nihon no hashira to, hitotsu no umi to, umi no shita no juu ni no seidou no ushi to, dai nado, kono subete no mono no seidou no omosa wa hakaru koto mo dekinakatta.
Kono ichipon no hashira no takasa wa juu hachi kyubito, shuui wa juu ni kyubito de, yubi yonhon no atsusa ga ari, naka wa, utsuro de atta.
Sono ue ni seidou no chuutou ga ari, chuutou no takasa wa go kyubito, chuutou no shuui wa ami zaiku to, zakuro to de kazari, korera mo mina seidou de atta. Ta no hashira mo sono zakuro mo, kore to onaji de atta.
Sono shihou ni kyuujuu rokuko no zakuro ga ari, shuui no ami zaiku no ue ni aru zakuro no kazu wa hyakuko de atta.
Jiei no chou wa saishi chou Seraya to jiseki no saishi Zepaniya to sannin no mon o mamoru mono o torae,
Mata heishi o tsukasadoru hitori no yakunin to, machi ni ita ou no sokkin no mono nananin to, sono chi no tami o tsunoru gunzei no chou no shokikan to, machi no naka ni ita rokujuunin no mono o machi kara torae satta.
Jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa, korera no hito o toraete, Ribura ni iru Babiron no ou no moto ni tsurete itta.
Babiron no ou wa, Hamate no chi no Ribura de karera o uchikoroshita. Kou shite, Yuda wa jibun no chi kara toraeutsusareta.
Nebukaderezaru ga toraeutsushita tami no kazu wa tsugi no toori de aru. Dainana nen ni wa Yudayahito sanzen nijuu sannin.
Mata Nebukaderezaru wa sono daijuu hachi nen ni Erusaremu kara happyaku sanjuu ninin o toraeutsushita.
Nebukaderezaru no nijuu san nen ni jiei no chouNebuzaradan wa, Yudayahito nanahyaku yonjuu gonin o toraeutsushita. Kono sousuu wa yonsen roppyakunin de atta.
Yuda no ou Ehoyakin ga toraeutsusarete nochi sanjuu nana nen no juu ni gatsu nijuu go nichi ni, Babiron no ou Ebirumerodaku wa sono sokui no nen ni, Yuda no ou Ehoyakin o gokuya kara dashi, sono koube o agesase,
Shinsetsu ni kare o nagusame, sono kurai o, Babiron de tomo ni iru outachi no kurai yori mo takaku shita.
Kou shite Ehoyakin wa gokuya no fuku o nuida. Soshite ikite iru aida wa mainichi ou no shokutaku de shokuji shi,
Kare no kyuuyo to shite wa, sono shinu hi made isshou no aida, taezu hibi no hitsuyou ni shitagatte, Babiron no ou kara kyuuyo o tamawatta.
Aa, mukashi wa, tami no michimichite ita kono miyako, kuniguni no tami no uchi de ooinaru mono de atta kono machi, ima wa sabishii sama de zashi, yamome no you ni natta. Moromoro no machi no uchi de joou de atta mono, ima wa dorei to natta.
Kore wa yomosugara itaku nakikanashimi, sono hoo ni wa namida ga nagarete iru. Sono subete no aisuru mono no uchi ni wa, kore o nagusameru mono wa hitori mo naku, sono subete no tomo wa kore ni somuite, sono teki to natta.
Yuda wa nayami no yue ni, mata hageshii kueki no yue ni, nogarete itte, moromoro no kunitami no uchi ni sunde iruga, ansoku o ezu, kore o ou mono ga mina oitsuite miruto, nayami no uchi ni atta.
Shion no michi wa matsuri ni nobotte kuru mono no nai tame ni kanashimi, sono mon wa kotogotoku are, sono saishitachi wa nageki, sono otometachi wa hikarete iki, Shion wa mizukara itaku kurushimu.
Sono ada wa kashira to nari, sono teki wa sakaete iru. Sono toga ga ooi no de, Shu ga kore o nayamasaretakara de aru. Sono osanagotachi wa torawarete, ada no mae ni itta.
Shion no musume no eiga wa kotogotoku kanojo o hanaresari, sono kimitachi wa bokusou o enai, shika no you ni nari, jibun o ou mono no mae ni chikaranaku nigesatta.
Erusaremu wa sono nayami to kurushimi no hi ni, mukashi kara motte ita moromoro no takara o omoidasu. Sono tami ga ada no te ni ochiiri, dare mo kore o tasukeru mono no nai toki, ada wa kore o mite, sono horobi o azawaratta.
Erusaremu wa, hanahadashiku tsumi o okashita no de, kegareta mono to natta. Kore o tattonda mono mo mina sono hadaka o mita no de, kore o iyashimeru. Kore mo mata mizukara nageki, kao o somukeru.
Sono kegare wa sono koromo no suso ni ari, kore wa sono owari o omowanakatta. Sore yue, kore wa odoroku bakari ni ochibure, kore o nagusameru mono wa hitori mo nai. "Shu yo, waga nayami o kaerimite kudasai, teki wa kachihokotte imasukara".
Teki wa te o nobete, sono zaihou o kotogotoku ubatta. Anata ga saki ni ihoujin ra wa anata no koukai ni, haitte wa naranai to meijirareta no ni, karera ga sono seijo ni wa iru no o Shion wa mita.
Sono tami wa mina nageite shokumotsu o motome, sono inochi o sasaeru tame ni, zaihou o shokumotsu ni kaeta. "Shu yo, miso nawa shite, watashi no iyashimerareru no o kaerimite kudasai".
"Subete michiyu ku hito yo, anata gata wa nan to mo omowanai no ka. Shu ga sono hageshii ikari no hi ni watashi o nayamashite, watashi ni kudasareta kurushimi no you na kurushimi ga, mata yo ni arudarou ka, tazunete mi yo.
Shu wa ue kara hi o okuri, sore o waga hone ni kudashi, ami o hatte waga ashi o torae, watashi o hikikaesase, hinemosu kokoro wabishiku, katsu yamiotoroesaserareta.
Watashi no toga wa, tsukanerarete, hitotsu no kubiki to serare, Shu no mite ni yori kataku shimerarete, watashi no kubi ni okare, watashi no chikara o otoroesaserareta. Shu wa watashi o, tachimukai tokuzaru mono no te ni watasareta.
Shu wa watashi no uchi ni aru subete no yuushi o mushi shi, seikai o shoushuu shite, watashi o seme, waga wakaki hitobito o uchihorobosareta. Shu wa saka bune o fumu you ni, Yuda no musume naru otome o fumitsukerareta.
Kono tame ni, watashi wa nakikanashimi, watashi no me wa namida de afureru. Watashi o nagusameru mono, watashi o yuuki zukeru mono ga watashi kara tooku hanaretakara de aru. Waga kora wa teki ga katta tame ni, wabishii mono to natta".
Shion wa te o nobashite mo, kore o nagusameru mono wa hitori mo nai. Yakobu ni tsuite wa, Shu wa meijite, sono shuui no mono o, kore ga ada to serareta. Erusaremu wa karera no naka ni atte, kegareta mono no you ni natta.
"Shu wa tadashii, watashi wa, mikotoba ni somuita. Subete no tami yo, kike, waga kurushimi o kaerimiyo. Waga otomera mo, waga wakoudora mo torawarete itta.
Watashi wa waga aisuru mono o yondaga, karera wa watashi o azamuita. Waga saishi oyobi chouroutachi wa, sono inochi o sasaeyou to, shokumotsu o motomete iru aida ni, machi no uchi de iki taeta.
Shu yo, kaerimite kudasai, watashi wa nayami, waga harawata wa wakikaeri, waga shinzou wa watashi no uchi ni tentou shite imasu. Watashi wa, hanahadashiku somuitakara desu. Soto ni wa tsurugi ga atte, waga ko o ubai, ie no uchi ni wa shi no you na mono ga aru.
Watashi ga donna ni nageku ka o kiite kudasai. Watashi o nagusameru mono wa hitori mo naku, teki wa mina watashi no nayami o kiite, anata ga kore o nasareta no o yorokonda. Anata ga saki ni tsugeshiraseta sono hi o kitarase, karera o mo, watashi no you ni shite kudasai.
Karera no aku o kotogotoku anata no mae ni arawashi, saki ni waga moromoro no toga no tame ni, watashi ni okonawareta you ni, karera ni mo okonatte kudasai. Waga nageki wa ooku, waga kokoro wa yowari hatete irukara desu".
Aa, Shu wa ikari o okoshi, kurokumo o motte Shion no musume o oowareta. Shu wa Isuraeru no eikou o ten kara chi ni nageotoshi, sono ikari no hi ni, onore no ashidai o kokoro ni tomerarenakatta.
Shu wa Yakobu no subete no sumai o horoboshite, awaremazu, sono ikari ni yotte, Yuda no musume no toride o kowashi, kore o chi ni taoshite, sono kuni to sono tsukasatachi o hazukashimerareta.
Shu wa hageshii ikari o motte, Isuraeru no subete no chikara o tachi, teki no mae de, onore no migi no te o hikimodoshi, shuui o yaki tsukusu moeru hi no you ni, Yakobu o yakareta.
Shu wa teki no you ni yumi o hari, ada no you ni migi no te o nobete tachi, Shion no musume no tenmaku ni oru wareware no me ni hokoru mono o, kotogotoku koroshi, hi no you ni sono ikari o sosogareta.
Shu wa teki no you ni natte, Isuraeru o horoboshi, sono subete no kyuuden o horoboshi, sono toride o kowashi, Yuda no musume no ue ni urei to kanashimi to o mashikuwaerareta.
Shu wa sono no koya no you ni onore no makuya o taoshi, sono matsuri no basho o kowasareta. Shu wa matsuri to ansokunichi to o Shion ni wasuresase, hageshii ikari ni yotte, ou to saishi to o suterareta.
Shu wa sono saidan o imi, sono seijo o kiratte, moromoro no kyuuden no ishigaki o teki no te ni watasareta. Karera wa matsuri no hi no you ni, Shu no miya de koe o ageta.
Shu wa Shion no musume no jouheki o hakai shiyou to omoisadamete, nawa o hari, uchikowashite, sono te o hikazu, jouheki to ishigaki to o kanashimaserareta. Korera wa tomo ni otoroeru.
Sono mon wa chi ni uzumore, Shu wa sono kannoki o kowashi kudakareta. Sono ou to kimitachi wa moromoro no kunitami no naka ni ori, mohaya rippou wa naku, mata sono yogensha wa Shu kara maboroshi o enai.
Shion no musume no chouroutachi wa chi ni zashite mokushi, atama ni chiri o kaburi, mi ni aranuno o matotta. Erusaremu no otometachi wa koube o chi ni tareta.
Waga me wa namida no tame ni tsubure, waga harawata wa wakikaeri, waga kimo wa waga tami no musume no horobi no tame ni, chi ni sosogi dasareru. Osanako ya chi nomi go ga machi no chimata ni iki mo taeyou to shite irukara de aru.
Karera ga, kizutsuita mono no you ni machi no chimata de iki mo taeyou to suru toki, sono haha no futokoro ni sono inochi o sosogi dasou to suru toki, haha ni mukatte, "Pan to budoushu to wa doko ni arimasu ka" to sakebu.
Erusaremu no musume yo, watashi wa nani o anata ni ii, nani ni anata o kuraberu koto ga dekiyou ka. Shion no musume naru otome yo, watashi wa nani o motte anata ni nazoraete, anata o nagusameru koto ga dekiyou ka. Anata no yabure wa umi no you ni ookii, dare ga anata o iyasu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Anata no yogensha tachi wa anata no tame ni hito o azamuku itsuwari no maboroshi o mita. Karera wa anata no fugi o arawashite toraware o manukaresaseyou to wa sezu, anata no tame ni hito o mayowasu itsuwari no takusen o mita.
Subete michiyu ku hito wa, anata ni mukatte te o uchi, Erusaremu no musume ni mukatte, azawarai, katsu atama o futte iu, "Uruwashisa no kiwami, zenchi no yorokobi to tonaerareta machi wa kore na no ka" to.
Anata no moromoro no teki wa, anata o nonoshiri, azawarai, hagami shite iu, "Wareware wa kore o horoboshita, aa, kore wa wareware ga nozonda hi da, ima wareware wa kore ni ai, kore o mita" to.
Shu wa sono keikaku sareta koto o okonai, keikoku sareta koto o nashitoge, inishie kara meijite okareta you ni, horoboshite, awaremu koto o sezu, anata ni tsuite teki o yorokobase, anata no ada no chikara o takamerareta.
Shion no musume yo, koe takaraka ni Shu ni yobaware, yoru mo hiru mo kawa no you ni namida o nagase. Mizukara yasunjiru koto o sezu, anata no hitomi o yasumaseru na.
Yoru, shokou ni okite sakebe. Shu no mae ni anata no kokoro o mizu no you ni sosogi dase. Machi no kado de, uete iki mo taeyou to suru osanako no inochi no tame ni, Shu ni mukatte ryoute o age yo.
Shu yo, miso nawa shite, kaerimite kudasai. Anata wa dare ni mukatte kono you ni okonawareta no desu ka. Onna wa jibun no unda ko, sono daiji ni sodateta osanago o taberudeshou ka. Saishi to yogensha ga Shu no seijo de korosarete iideshou ka.
Oi mo wakaki mo, chimata no chiri ni fushi, waga otome mo, wakoudo mo, tsurugi de taosarete shimatta. Anata wa, sono ikari no hi ni kore o koroshi, kore o hofutte, awaremu koto o sarenakatta.
Anata wa, watashi no osoreru mono o, matsuri no hi no you ni shihou kara yobiatsumerareta. Shu no ikari no hi ni wa, nogareta mono mo nokotta mono mo nakatta. Watashi ga, idaki sodateta mono o watashi no teki wa horoboshi tsukushita.
Watashi wa kare no ikari no muchi ni yotte, nayami ni atta hito de aru.
Kare wa watashi o karitatete, hikari no nai kurai naka o arukase,
Makoto ni sono te o shibashiba kaete, hinemosu watashi o semerareta.
Kare wa waga niku to kawa o otoroesase, waga hone o kudaki,
Kurushimi to nayami o motte, watashi o kakomi, watashi o tojikome,
Tooi mukashi ni shinda mono no you ni, kurai tokoro ni sumawaserareta.
Kare wa watashi no mawari ni, kaki o megurashite, deru koto no dekinai you ni shi, omoi kusari de watashi o tsunagareta.
Watashi wa sakende tasuke o motometaga, kare wa watashi no inori o shirizoke,
Kiriishi o motte, watashi no iku michi o fusagi, watashi no michisuji o magerareta.
Kare wa watashi ni taishite machibuse suru kuma no you ni, hisomikakureru shishi no you ni,
Waga michi o hanaresase, watashi o hikisaite, miru kage mo nai mijime na mono to shi,
Sono yumi o hatte, watashi o ya no mato no you ni sareta.
Kare wa sono ebira no ya o watashi no shinzou ni uchikomareta.
Watashi wa subete no tami no monowarai to nari, hinemosu karera no uta to natta.
Kare wa watashi o nigai mono de akase, nigayomogi o watashi ni nomaserareta.
Kare wa koishi o motte, watashi no ha o kudaki, hai no naka ni watashi o korogasareta.
Waga tamashii wa heiwa o ushinai, watashi wa koufuku o wasureta.
Soko de watashi wa itta, "Waga sakae wa use sari, watashi ga Shu ni nozomu tokoro no mono mo use satta" to.
Dou ka, waga nayami to kurushimi, nigayomogi to tanjuu to o kokoro ni tomete kudasai.
Waga tamashii wa taezu kore o omotte, waga uchi ni unadareru.
Shikashi, watashi wa kono koto o kokoro ni omoiokosu. Sore yue, watashi wa nozomi o idaku.
Shu no itsukushimi wa taeru koto ga naku, sono awaremi wa tsukiru koto ga nai.
Kore wa asagoto ni atarashiku, anata no shinjitsu wa ookii.
Waga tamashii wa iu, "Shu wa watashi no u kubeki bun de aru, sore yue, watashi wa kare o machinozomu" to.
Shu wa onore o machinozomu mono to, onore o tazunemotomeru mono ni mukatte megumi fukai.
Shu no sukui o shizuka ni machinozomu koto wa, yoi koto de aru.
Hito ga wakai toki ni kubiki o ou koto wa, yoi koto de aru.
Shu ga kore o owaserareru toki, hitori suwatte mokushite iru ga yoi.
Kuchi o chiri ni tsukeyo, aruiha nao nozomi ga arude arou.
Onore o utsu mono ni hoo o muke, michitariru made ni, hazukashime o ukeyo.
Shu wa tokoshie ni kono you na hito o suterarenaikara de aru.
Kare wa nayami o ataerareruga, sono itsukushimi ga yutaka na no de, mata awaremi o tarerareru.
Kare wa kokoro kara hito no ko o kurushimenayamasu koto o sarenaikara de aru.
Chi no subete no torawarebito o ashi no shita ni fuminijiri,
Ito takaki mono no mae ni hito no kougi o mage,
Hito no uttae o kutsugaesu koto wa, Shu no yomiserarenai koto de aru.
Shu ga meijirareta no de nakereba, dare ga meijite, sono koto no natta koto ga aru ka.
Wazawai mo saiwai mo, ito takaki mono no kuchi kara derude wa nai ka.
Ikeru hito wa dou shite tsubuyakaneba naranai no ka, hito wa jibun no tsumi no basserareru no o, tsubuyaku koto ga dekiyou ka.
Wareware wa, jibun no okonai o shirabe, katsu kaerimite, Shu ni kaerou.
Wareware wa ten ni imasu kami ni mukatte, te to tomo ni kokoro o mo ageyou.
"Watashitachi wa tsumi o okashi, somukimashita, anata wa oyurushi ni narimasendeshita.
Anata wa ikari o motte gojibun o ooi, watashitachi o oi seme, koroshite, awaremazu,
Mata kumo o motte gojibun o ooi, inori o tsuujinai you ni shi,
Moromoro no tami no naka ni, watashitachi o chiriakuta to nasaimashita.
Teki wa mina watashitachi o nonoshiri,
Osore to otoshiana to, kouhai to metsubou to ga, watashitachi ni nozomimashita.
Waga tami no musume no horobi ni yotte, watashi no me ni wa namida no kawa ga nagarete imasu.
Waga me wa taezu namida o sosogi dashite, yamu koto naku,
Shu ga ten kara mioroshite, kaerimirareru toki ni made oyobudeshou.
Waga me wa waga machi no subete no musume no saigo no yue ni, watashi o itamasemasu.
Yue naku watashi ni tekisuru monodomo ni yotte, watashi wa tori no you ni owaremashita.
Karera wa ikite iru watashi o ana no naka ni nageire, watashi no ue ni ishi o nagetsukemashita.
Mizu wa watashi no atama no ue ni afure, watashi wa 'Tachi horobosareta' to iimashita.
Shu yo, watashi wa fukai ana kara mina o yobimashita.
Anata wa waga koe o kikaremashita, 'Waga nageki to sakebi ni mimi o fusaganaide kudasai'.
Watashi ga anata ni yobawatta toki, anata wa chikayotte, 'Osoreru na' to iwaremashita.
Shu yo, anata wa waga uttae o toriagete, watashi no inochi o aganawaremashita.
Shu yo, anata wa watashi ga koumutta fugi o goran ni narimashita. Watashi no uttae o osabaki kudasai.
Anata wa watashi ni taisuru karera no houfuku to, inbou to o, kotogotoku goran ni narimashita.
Shu yo, anata wa watashi ni taisuru karera no soshirito, inbou to o, kotogotoku kikaremashita.
Tatte watashi ni sakarau monodomo no kuchibiru to, sono omoi wa, hinemosu watashi o semete imasu.
Dou ka, karera no suwaru o mo, tatsu o mo, miso nawa shite kudasai. Watashi wa karera no uta to natte imasu.
Shu yo, karera no te no waza ni shitagatte, karera ni mukui,
Karera no kokoro o katakuna ni shi, anata no noroi o karera ni sosoide kudasai.
Shu yo, ikari o motte karera o oi, amegashita kara karera o horoboshite kudasai".
Aa, ougon wa hikari o ushinai, junkin wa iro o henji, seijo no ishi wa subete no chimata no kado ni nagesuterareta.
Aa, seikin ni mo hi subeki Shion no itoshigora wa, toukishi no te no waza de aru tsuchi no utsuwa no you ni minasareru.
Yamainu sae mo chibusa o tarete, sono ko ni chichi o nomaseru. Tokoro ga, waga tami no musume wa, arano no dachou no you ni mujihi ni natta.
Chi nomi go no shita wa kawaite, ueago ni, hitato tsuki, osanagora wa pan o motomete mo, kore ni ataeru mono ga nai.
Umai mono o tabete ita mono wa, ochiburete, chimata ni ori, murasaki no kimono de sodaterareta mono mo, ima wa hai damari no ue ni fushite iru.
Waga tami no musume no uketa kora shime wa, Sodomu no batsu yori mo ookikatta. Sodomu wa mukashi, hito no te ni yoranaide, matataku ma ni horobosareta no da.
Waga tami no kimitachi wa yuki yori mo kiyoraka ni, chichi yori mo shiroku, sono karada wa, sango yori mo akaku, sono sugata no utsukushisa wa Safaiya no you de atta.
Ima wa sono kao wa susu yori mo kuroku, machi no naka ni ite mo hito ni shirarezu, sono hifu wa chijinde hone ni tsuki, kawaite kareki no you ni natta.
Tsurugi de korosareru mono wa, uete shinu mono yori mo saiwai de aru. Karera wa tahata no sanbutsu no ketsubou ni yotte, sasareta mono no you ni otoroe ikukara de aru.
Waga tami no musume no horobiru toki ni wa nasakebukai onnatachi sae mo, tezukara jibun no kodomo o nite, sore o shokumotsu to shita.
Shu wa sono ikidoori o kotogotoku morashi, hageshii ikari o sosogi, Shion ni hi o moyashite, sono ishizue made mo yakiharawareta.
Chi no outachi mo, yo no tamira mo mina, Erusaremu no mon ni, ada ya teki ga, uchihairou to wa shinjinakatta.
Kore wa sono yogensha tachi no tsumi no tame, sono saishitachi no fugi no tame de atta. Karera wa gijin no chi o sono machi no naka ni nagashita mono de aru.
Karera wa moujin no you ni, chimata ni samayoi, chi de kegarete iru. Dare mo sono koromo ni sawaru koto ga dekinai.
Hitobito wa karera ni mukatte, "Sareyo, kegarawashii", "Sareyo, sareyo, sawaru na" to sakenda no de, karera wa nigesatte hourousha to nattaga, ihoujin no naka de mo hitobito wa "Mou wareware no uchi ni yadotte wa naranai" to itta.
Shu wa mizukara karera o chirashite, futatabi karera o kaerimizu, saishi o tattobazu, chourou o itawararenakatta.
Wareware no me wa, munashiku tasuke o machinozonde tsukare otoroeta. Wareware wa machinozondaga, sukui o atae enai kunibito o machinozonda.
Hitobito ga wareware no ayumi o ukagau no de, wareware wa jibun no machi no naka o mo, aruku koto ga dekinakatta. Wareware no owari wa chikazuita, hi wa tsukita. Wareware no owari ga kitakara de aru.
Wareware o ou mono wa sora no hagetaka yori mo hayaku, karera wa yama de wareware o oitate, no de wareware o machibuseru.
Wareware ga hana no iki to tanonda mono, Shu ni abura sosogareta mono wa, karera no otoshiana de toraerareta. Kare wa wareware ga "Ihoujin no naka de mo sono kage ni ikirude arou" to omotta mono de aru.
Uzu no chi ni sumu Edomu no musume yo, yorokobitanoshime, anata ni mo mata sakazuki ga megutte iku, anata mo yotte hadaka ni naru.
Shion no musume yo, anata no fugi no batsu wa owatta. Shu wa kasanete anata o toraeutsusarenai. Edomu no musume yo, Shu wa anata no fugi o basshi, anata no tsumi o arawasareru.
Shu yo, wareware ni nozonda koto o oboete kudasai. Wareware no hazukashime o kaerimite kudasai.
Wareware no shigyou wa takoku no hito ni utsuri, ie wa ihoujin no mono to natta.
Wareware wa minashigo to natte chichi wa naku, haha wa yamome ni hitoshii.
Wareware wa kane o dashite mizu o nomi, atai o haratte, takigi o enakereba naranai.
Wareware wa kubi ni kubiki o kakerarete oitsukaware, tsukarete mo yasumu koto ga dekinai.
Wareware wa tariru dake no shokumotsu o eru tame ni, Ejiputo oyobi ASsuriya ni te o sashinobeta.
Wareware no senzo wa tsumi o okashite, sudeni yo ni naku, wareware wa sono fugi no seme o otte iru.
Dorei de atta mono ga wareware o osameruga, wareware o sono te kara sukuidasu mono ga nai.
Wareware wa arano no tsurugi no yue ni, ono ga inochi o kakete shokumotsu o eru.
Wareware no hifu wa kiga no hageshii netsu no tame ni, ro no you ni atsui.
Onnatachi wa Shion de okasare, otometachi wa Yuda no machimachi de kegasareta.
Kimi taru mono mo karera no te de tsurusare, chouroutachi mo tattobarezu,
Wakamonotachi wa, hikiusu o ninawaserare, warabetachi wa, takigi o otte, yoromeki,
Chouroutachi wa mon ni atsumaru koto o yame, wakamonotachi wa sono ongaku o haishita.
Wareware no kokoro no yorokobi wa yami, odori wa kanashimi ni kawari,
Wareware no kanmuri wa koube kara ochita. Wazawai naru ka na, wareware wa tsumi o okashitakara de aru.
Kono tame ni, wareware no kokoro wa otoroe, korera no koto no tame ni, wareware no me wa kuraku natta.
Shion no yama wa are hate, yamainu ga sono ue o aruite irukara de aru.
Shikashi Shu yo, anata wa tokoshie ni subeosamerareru. Anata no, mi kurai wa yoyo taeru koto ga nai.
Naze, anata wa wareware o nagaku wasure, wareware o hisashiku suteokareru no desu ka.
Shu yo, anata ni kaerasete kudasai, wareware wa kaerimasu. Wareware no hi o arata ni shite, inishie no hi no you ni shite kudasai.
Anata wa mattaku wareware o suterareta no desu ka, hanahadashiku ikatte irareru no desu ka.
Daisanjuu nen shi gatsu itsuka ni, watashi ga Kebaru gawa no hotori de, hoshuu no hitobito no uchi ni ita toki, ten ga hirakete, kami no maboroshi o mita.
Kore wa Ehoyakin ou no toraeutsusareta daigo nen de atte, sono tsuki no itsuka ni,
Shu no kotoba ga Kebaru gawa no hotori, Karudeya bito no chi de Buji no ko saishi Ezekieru ni nozomi, Shu no te ga sono tokoro de kare no ue ni atta.
Watashi ga mite iruto, miyo, hageshii kaze to ooinaru kumo ga kita kara kite, sono shuui ni kagayaki ga ari, taezu hi o fukidashite ita. Sono hi no naka ni seidou no you ni kagayaku mono ga atta.
Mata sono naka kara yontsu no ikimono no katachi ga dete kita. Sono yousu wa kou de aru. Karera wa hito no sugata o motte ita.
Onoono yontsu no kao o mochi, mata sono onoono ni yontsu no tsubasa ga atta.
Sono ashi wa massugu de, ashi no ura wa koushi no ashi no ura no you de ari, migaita seidou no you ni hikatte ita.
Sono shihou ni, sono onoono no tsubasa no shita ni hito no te ga atta. Kono yontsu no mono wa mina kao to tsubasa o mochi,
Tsubasa wa tagai ni tsuranari, yuku toki wa mawarazu ni, onoono kao no mukau tokoro ni massugu ni susunda.
Kao no katachi wa, onoono sono zenpou ni hito no kao o motte ita. Yontsu no mono wa migi no hou ni, shishi no kao o mochi, yontsu no mono wa hidari no hou ni ushi no kao o mochi, mata yontsu no mono wa ushiro no hou ni, washi no kao o motte ita.
Karera no kao wa kono you de atta. Sono tsubasa wa takaku nobasare, sono futatsu wa tagai ni tsuranari, ta no futatsu o motte karada o ootte ita.
Karera wa onoono sono kao no mukau tokoro e massugu ni iki, rei no yuku tokoro e karera mo yuki, sono yuku toki wa mawaranai.
Kono ikimono no uchi ni wa moeru sumi no hi no you na mono ga ari, taimatsu no you ni, ikimono no naka o yukiki shite iru. Hi wa kagayaite, sono hi kara, inazuma ga dete ita.
Ikimono wa, inazuma no hirameki no you ni hayaku yukiki shite ita.
Watashi ga ikimono o mite iruto, ikimono no katawara, chi no ue ni wa ga atta. Yontsu no ikimono onoono ni, hitotsu zutsu no wa de aru.
Moromoro no wa no katachi to tsukuri wa, hikaru kikanranishi no you de aru. Yontsu no mono wa onaji katachi de, sono tsukuri wa, atakamo, wa no naka ni wa ga aru you de aru.
Sono yuku toki, karera wa shihou no izure ka ni iki, yuku toki wa mawaranai.
Yontsu no wa ni wa wabuchi to ya to ga ari, sono wabuchi no shuui wa me o motte mitasarete ita.
Ikimono ga yuku toki ni wa, wa mo sono katawara ni iki, ikimono ga chi kara agaru toki wa, wa mo agaru.
Rei no yuku tokoro ni wa karera mo iki, wa wa karera ni tomonatte agaru. Ikimono no rei ga wa no naka ni arukara de aru.
Karera ga yuku toki wa, korera mo iki, karera ga todomaru toki wa, korera mo todomari, karera ga chi kara agaru toki wa, wa mo mata korera to tomo ni agaru. Ikimono no rei ga wa no naka ni arukara de aru.
Ikimono no atama no ue ni suishou no you ni kagayaku oozora no katachi ga atte, karera no atama no ue ni hirogatte iru.,
Oozora no shita ni wa massugu ni nobashita tsubasa ga ari, tagai ni aitsuranari, ikimono wa onoono futatsu no tsubasa o motte, karada o ootte iru.
Sono yuku toki, watashi wa oomizu no koe, zennousha no koe no you na tsubasa no koe o kiita. Sono koe no hibiki wa taigun no koe no you de, sono todomaru toki wa tsubasa o tareru.
Mata karera no atama no ue no oozora kara koe ga atta. Karera ga tachi todomaru toki wa tsubasa o oroshita.
Karera no atama no ue no oozora no ue ni, Safaiya no you na kurai no katachi ga atta. Mata sono kurai no katachi no ue ni, hito no sugata no you na katachi ga atta.
Soshite sono koshi to mieru tokoro no ue no hou ni, hi no katachi no you na hikaru seidou no iro no mono ga, kore o kakonde iru no o mita. Watashi wa sono koshi to mieru tokoro no shita no hou ni, hi no you na mono o mita. Soshite kare no mawari ni kagayaki ga atta.
Sono mawari ni aru kagayaki no sama wa, ame no hi ni kumo ni okoru niji no you de atta. Shu no eikou no katachi no sama wa, kono you de atta. Watashi wa kore o mite, watashi no kao o fuseta toki, kataru mono no koe o kiita.
Kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, tachiagare, watashi wa anata ni katarou".
Soshite kare ga watashi ni katarareta toki, rei ga watashi no uchi ni iri, watashi o tachiagaraseta. Soshite kare no watashi ni katarareru no o kiita.
Kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, watashi wa anata o Isuraeru no tami, sunawachi watashi ni somuita hangyaku no tami ni tsukawasu. Karera mo sono senzo mo, watashi ni somuite konnichi ni oyonde iru.
Karera wa kougan de goujou na monotachi de aru. Watashi wa anata o karera ni tsukawasu. Anata wa karera ni 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru' to ii nasai.
Karera wa kiite mo, kobande mo, (karera wa hangyaku no ie dakara) karera no naka ni yogensha ga ita koto o shirudarou.
Hito no ko yo, karera o osorete wa naranai. Karera no kotoba o mo osorete wa naranai. Tatoi azami to ibara ga anata to issho ni atte mo, mata anata ga, sasori no naka ni sunde mo, karera no kotoba o osorete wa naranai. Karera no kao o habakatte wa naranai. Karera wa hangyaku no ie de aru.
Karera ga kiite mo, kobande mo, anata wa tada watashi no kotoba o karera ni kataranakereba naranai. Karera wa hangyaku no ie dakara.
Hito no ko yo, watashi ga anata ni kataru tokoro o kiki nasai. Hangyaku no ie no you ni somuite wa naranai. Anata no kuchi o hiraite, watashi ga ataeru mono o tabe nasai".
Kono toki watashi ga miruto, miyo, watashi no hou ni nobeta te ga atta. Mata miyo, te no naka ni makimono ga atta.
Kare ga watashi no mae ni kore o hirakuto, sono omote ni mo ura ni mo moji ga kaite atta. Sono kakarete iru koto wa kanashimi to, nageki to, wazawai no kotoba de atta.
Kare wa watashi ni iwareta. "Hito no ko yo, anata ni ataerareta mono o tabe nasai. Kono makimono o tabe, itte Isuraeru no ie ni katari nasai".
Soko de watashi ga kuchi o hirakuto, kare wa watashi ni sono makimono o tabesaseta.
Soshite kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, watashi ga anata ni ataeru kono makimono o tabe, kore de anata no hara o mitashi nasai". Watashi ga sore o taberuto, sore wa watashi no kuchi ni amai koto mitsu no you de atta.
Kare wa mata watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie ni itte, watashi no kotoba o katari nasai.
Watashi wa anata o, ikoku go o mochii, shita no omoi tami ni tsukawasu no de naku, Isuraeru no ie ni tsukawasu no de aru.
Sunawachi anata ga sono kotoba o shiranai, ikoku go no shita no omoi ooku no tami ni tsukawasu no de wa nai. Moshi watashi ga anata o sono you na tami ni tsukawashitara, karera wa anata ni kiitade arou.
Shikashi Isuraeru no ie wa anata ni kiku no o konomanai. Karera wa watashi ni kiku no o konomanaikara de aru. Isuraeru no ie wa subete kougan de mata goujou de aru.
Miyo, watashi wa anata no kao o karera no kao ni mukatte kataku shi, anata no hitai o karera no hitai ni mukatte kataku shita.
Watashi wa anata no hitai o iwa yori mo katai Daiyamondo no you ni shita. Yue ni karera o osorete wa naranai. Karera no kao o habakatte wa naranai. Karera wa hangyaku no ie de aru".
Mata kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, watashi ga anata ni kataru subete no kotoba o anata no kokoro ni osame, anata no mimi ni kiki nasai.
Soshite hoshuu no hitobito, anata no tami no hitobito no tokoro e itte, karera ga kiite mo, karera ga kobande mo, 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru' to karera ni ii nasai".
Toki ni rei ga watashi o motageta. Soshite Shu no eikou ga sono tokoro kara nobotta toki, watashi no ushiro ni ooinaru jishin no hibiki o kiita.
Sore wa tagai ni aifureru ikimono no tsubasa no oto to, sono katawara no wa no oto de, ooinaru jishin no you ni hibiita.
Rei wa watashi o motage, watashi o torisatta no de, watashi wa kokoro o atsuku shi, niganigashii omoi de dete itta. Shu no te ga tsuyoku watashi no ue ni atta.
Soshite watashi wa Kebaru gawa no hotori no Teruabibu ni iru hoshuu no hitobito no moto e iki, nanuka no aida, odorokiakirete karera no naka ni zashita.
Nanuka sugite nochi, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, watashi wa anata o Isuraeru no ie no tame ni mimamoru mono to shita. Anata wa watashi no kuchi kara kotoba o kiku tabi ni, watashi ni kawatte karera o imashime nasai.
Watashi ga akunin ni 'Anata wa kanarazu shinu' to iu toki, anata wa kare no inochi o sukuu tame ni kare o imashimezu, mata akunin o imashimete, sono warui michi kara hanareru you ni kataranainara, sono akunin wa jibun no aku no tame ni shinu. Shikashi sono chi o watashi wa anata no te kara motomeru.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga akunin o imashimete mo, kare ga sono aku o mo, mata sono warui michi o mo hanarenainara, kare wa sono aku no tame ni shinu. Shikashi anata wa jibun no inochi o sukuu.
Mata gijin ga sono gi ni somuki, fugi o okonaunara, watashi wa kare no mae ni, tsumazuki o oki, kare wa shinu. Anata ga kare o imashimenakatta yue, kare wa sono tsumi no tame ni shini, sono okonatta gi wa oboerarenai. Shikashi sono chi o watashi wa anata no te kara motomeru.
Keredo mo, moshi anata ga gijin o imashimete, tsumi o okasanai you ni katari, soshite kare ga tsumi o okasanainara, kare wa imashime o ukeireta yue ni, sono inochi o tamochi, anata wa jibun no inochi o sukuu".
Sono tokoro de Shu no te ga watashi no ue ni nozomi, kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Tatte, heiya ni dete iki nasai. Sono tokoro de watashi wa anata ni katarou".
Soko de, watashi wa tatte heiya ni dete itta. Miyo, Shu no eikou ga, katsute watashi ga Kebaru gawa no hotori de mita eikou no you ni, sono tokoro ni tachiarawareta no de, watashi wa hirefushita.
Shikashi rei ga watashi no uchi ni haitte, watashi o tachiagarase, watashi ni katatte itta, "Itte, anata no ie ni komotte i nasai.
Hito no ko yo, miyo, karera wa anata no ue ni nawa o kake, sore de anata o shibari, anata o tami no naka ni ikasenai you ni suru.
Watashi wa anata no shita o ueago ni tsukase, anata o oshi ni shite, karera o imashimeru koto ga dekinai you ni suru. Karera wa hangyaku no ie dakara de aru.
Shikashi, watashi ga anata to kataru toki wa, anata no kuchi o hiraku. Anata wa karera ni 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru' to iwanakereba naranai. Kiku mono wa kiku gayoi, kobamu mono wa kobamu ga yoi. Karera wa hangyaku no ie dakara de aru.
Hito no ko yo, ichimai no kawara o totte, anata no mae ni oki, sono ue ni Erusaremu no machi o egaki nasai.
Soshite kore o torikakomi, kore ni mukatte untei o mouke, rui o kizuki, jin o hari, sono mawari ni shiro kuzushi o sonaete kore o seme nasai.
Mata tetsu no ita o tori, sore o anata to machi no aida ni oite tetsu no kabe to nashi, anata no kao o kore ni muke nasai. Machi o kono you ni kakonde, sono houi o oshisusume nasai. Kore ga Isuraeru no ie no shirushi de aru.
Anata wa mata jibun no hidariwaki o shita ni shite ne nasai. Watashi wa anata no ue ni Isuraeru no ie no batsu o oku. Anata wa kono you ni shite nete iru hi no aida, karera no batsu o owanakereba naranai.
Watashi wa karera no batsu no nensuu ni hitoshii sono hikazu, sunawachi sanbyaku kyuujuu nichi o anata no tame ni sadameru. Sono kan anata wa Isuraeru no ie no batsu o owanakereba naranai.
Anata wa sono kikan o owattanara, mata migiwaki o shita ni shite nete, Yuda no ie no batsu o owanakereba naranai. Watashi wa tsuitachi o ichi nen to shite yonjuu nichi o anata no tame ni sadameru.
Anata wa jibun no kao o Erusaremu no houi no hou ni muke, ude o arawashi, machi ni mukatte yogen shinakereba naranai.
Miyo, watashi wa anata ni, nawa o kakete, anata no houi no kikan no owaru made, sayuu ni ugoku koto ga dekinai you ni suru.
Anata wa mata komugi, oomugi, mame, Renzu mame, awa, hadakamugi o totte, hitotsu no utsuwa ni ire, kore de pan o tsukuri, anata ga yoko ni natte neru hi no kazu, sunawachi sanbyaku kyuujuu nichi no aida kore o tabenakereba naranai.
Anata ga taberu shokumotsu wa hakatte ichi nichi ni nijuu shikeru de aru. Anata wa tsuitachi ni ichi do kore o tabenakereba naranai.
Mata mizu o hakatte ichi hin no rokubun no ichi o ichi nichi ni ichi do nomanakereba naranai.
Anata wa oomugi no kashi no you ni shite kore o tabe nasai. Sunawachi karera no me no mae de kore o hito no fun de yakanakereba naranai".
Soshite Shu wa iwareta, "Kono you ni Isuraeru no tami wa watashi ga oiyarou to suru kuniguni no naka de kegareta pan o tabenakereba naranai".
Soko de watashi wa itta, "Aa, Shu naru kami yo, watashi wa jibun o kegashita koto wa arimasen. Watashi wa osanai toki kara konnichi made, shizen ni shinda mono ya, yajuu ni saki korosareta mono o tabeta koto wa arimasen. Mata kegareta niku ga watashi no kuchi ni haitta koto wa arimasen".
Suruto kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa ushi no fun o motte hito no fun ni kaeru koto o anata ni yurusu. Anata wa sore de jibun no pan o totonoe nasai".
Mata watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, miyo, watashi wa Erusaremu de hito no tsue to suru pan o uchikudaku. Karera wa pan o hakatte, osorenagara tabe, mata mizu o hakatte odorokinagara nomu.
Kore wa karera o pan to mizu to ni toboshiku shi, tagai ni odoroite kao o miawase, sono batsu no tame ni otoroesaseru tame de aru.
Hito no ko yo, surudoi tsurugi o tori, sore o rihatsushi no kamisori to shite, anata no atama to, hige to o sori, hakari de hakatte, sono ke o wake nasai.
Sono sanbun no ichi wa houi no kikan no owaru toki, machi no naka de hi de yaki, mata sanbun no ichi o tori, tsurugi de machi no mawari de kore o uchi, sarani sanbun no ichi o kaze ni chirashi nasai. Watashi wa tsurugi o nuite, karera no ato o ou.
Anata wa sono ke o sukoshi totte, koromo no suso ni tsutsumi,
Mata sono uchi kara sukoshi o totte hi no naka ni nageire, hi de kore o yaki nasai. Hi wa sono naka kara dete, Isuraeru no zenka ni oyobu.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa kono Erusaremu o bankoku no naka ni oki, kuniguni o sono mawari ni oita.
Erusaremu wa ta no kuniguni yori mo ashiku, watashi no okite ni somuki, sono mawari no kuniguni yori mo watashi no sadame ni somuita. Sunawachi karera wa watashi no okite o sute, watashi no sadame ni ayumanakatta.
Sore yue Shu wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa sono mawari ni iru ihoujin yori mo kyoubou de atte, watashi no sadame ni ayumazu, watashi no okite o okonawazu, mushiro, anata gata no mawari ni iru ihoujin no okite o mamotte ita.
Sore yue Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata o seme, ihoujin no me no mae de, anata no naka ni sabaki o okonau.
Anata no moromoro no nikumubeki koto no tame ni, watashi ga mada shita koto no nai you na koto, mata kono nochi futatabi shinai you na koto o anata ni taishite suru.
Sore yue, anata no uchi de chichi wa sono ko o kui, ko wa sono chichi o kuu. Watashi wa anata ni taishite sabaki o okonai, anata no uchi no nokori no mono o kotogotoku shihou no kaze ni chirasu.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Anata wa sono imubeki mono to, sono nikumubeki koto to o motte, watashi no seijo o kegashita no de, watashi wa kanarazu anata no kazu o herasu. Watashi no me wa anata o oshimi mizu, mata watashi wa anata o awaremanai.
Anata no sanbun no ichi wa anata no naka de ekibyou de shini, kikin de horobi, sanbun no ichi wa anata no mawari de tsurugi ni taore, sanbun no ichi wa shihou no kaze ni chirasareru. Watashi wa tsurugi o nuite sono ato o ou.
Kou shite watashi wa ikari o morashi tsukushi, ikidoori o karera no ue ni morashite, manzoku suru. Kou shite, watashi no ikidoori o karera no ue ni morashi tsukushita toki, karera wa Shu de aru watashi ga nesshin ni katatta koto o shirude arou.
Watashi wa mawari ni aru kuniguni no naka to, subete soba o tooru mono no me no mae de anata o metsubou to azakeri ni watasu.
Watashi ga ikari to, ikidoori to, omoi choubatsu to o motte, anata ni taishite sabaki o okonau toki, anata wa sono mawari ni aru kuniguni no azakeri to nari, soshiri to nari, imashime to nari, odoroki to naru. Kore wa Shu de aru watashi ga kataru no de aru.
Sunawachi, watashi ga anata o horobosu kikin no ya, metsubou no ya o anata ni hanatsu toki, watashi wa anata o horobosu tame ni hanatsu no da. Watashi wa anata no ue ni kikin o mashikuwae, anata ga tsue to suru pan o uchikudaku.
Watashi wa anata ni kikin to yajuu o okutte, anata no ko o ubaitori, mata ekibyou to ryuuketsu ni anata no naka o toorase, mata tsurugi o anata ni okuru. Shu de aru watashi ga kore o iu".
Shu no kotoba ga, watashi ni nozonde itta,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Isuraeru no yamayama ni muke, yogen shite,
Ie. Isuraeru no yamayama yo, Shu naru kami no kotoba o kike. Shu naru kami wa yama to oka to, tani to kawa ni mukatte, kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa tsurugi o anata gata ni okuri, anata gata no takaki tokoro o horobosu.
Anata gata no saidan wa arasare, anata gata no kou no saidan wa kowasareru. Watashi wa anata gata no guuzou no mae ni, anata gata no korosareta mono o nagedasu.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no tami no shitai o karera no guuzou no mae ni oki, hone o anata gata no saidan no mawari ni chirasu.
Subete anata gata no sumu tokoro de machimachi wa horobosare, takaki tokoro wa arasareru. Kou shite anata gata no saidan wa kowashi arasare, anata gata no guuzou wa kudakarete horobi, anata gata no kou no saidan wa taosare, anata gata no waza wa keshisarareru.
Mata korosareta mono wa anata gata no uchi ni taoreru. Kore ni yotte, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Watashi wa, anata gata no aru mono o ikashite oku. Anata ga taga, tsurugi o nogarete kuniguni no naka ni ori, kuniguni ni chirasareru toki,
Anata gata no uchi no nogareta mono wa, sono toraeutsusareta kuniguni no naka de watashi o omoidasu. Kore wa watashi ga, karera no watashi o hanareta kan'in no kokoro to, guuzou o shitatte kan'in o okonau me o kujikukara de aru. Soshite karera wa sono moromoro no nikumubeki koto to, sono okashita aku no tame ni, mizukara o itou you ni naru.
Soshite karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru. Kono wazawai o karera ni taishite kudasuto, watashi ga itta no wa kesshite munashii koto de wa nai".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Anata wa te o uchi, ashi o fuminarashite ie. Aa, Isuraeru no ie no subete no ashiki nikumubeki mono wa wazawai da. Karera wa tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou ni taorerukara de aru.
Tooku ni iru mono wa ekibyou de shini, chikaku ni iru mono wa tsurugi ni taoreru. Ikinokotte mi o mattou suru mono wa kikin ni yotte shinu. Kono you ni watashi wa waga ikidoori o karera no ue ni morashi tsukusu.
Karera no korosareru mono ga sono guuzou no naka ni ari, sono saidan no mawari ni ari, subete no takaki oka no ue ni ari, subete no yama no itadaki ni ari, subete no aoki no shita ni ari, subete no shigetta kashi no ki no shita ni ari, karera ga koubashii kaori o, subete no guuzou ni sasageta tokoro ni aru toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru no de aru.
Watashi wa mata te o karera no ue ni nobete, sono chi o arashi, subete karera no sumu tokoro o, arano kara Ribura made arechi to suru. Kore ni yotte karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no chi no owari ni tsuite Shu wa kou iwareru, kono kuni no shihou no sakai ni owari ga kita.
Ima, anata no owari ga kita. Watashi wa waga ikari o anata ni morashi, anata no okonai ni shitagatte, anata o sabaki, anata no moromoro no nikumubeki mono no tame ni anata o bassuru.
Watashi no me wa anata o oshimi mizu, mata anata o awaremanai. Watashi wa anata no okonai no tame ni anata o bassuru. Anata no nikumubeki koto ga anata no uchi ni aru. Kore ni yotte, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, wazawai ga hikitsuzuite okoru. Miyo, wazawai ga kuru.
Owari ga kuru. Sono owari ga kuru. Sore ga tatte, anata ni nozomu. Miyo, sore ga kuru.
Kono chi ni sumu mono yo, anata no saigo no unmei ga anata ni kita. Toki wa kita. Hi ga chikazuita. Konran no hi de, yamayama ni kikoeru yorokobi no hi de wa nai.
Ima watashi wa, sumiyaka ni watashi no ikidoori o anata no ue ni sosogi, watashi no ikari o anata ni morashi tsukushi, anata no okonai ni shitagatte anata o sabaki, anata no moromoro no nikumubeki koto no tame ni anata o bassuru.
Watashi no me wa anata o oshimi mizu, mata anata o awaremanai. Watashi wa anata no okonai no tame ni anata o bassuru. Anata no nikumubeki koto ga anata no uchi ni aru. Kore ni yotte, anata gata wa, Shu de aru watashi ga anata o utsu koto o shiru you ni naru.
Miyo, sono hi o. Mata miyo, kano hi ga kita. Anata no saigo no unmei ga kita. Fugi wa hanasaki, takaburi wa me o dashita.
Bougyaku wa tsunotte aku no tsue to natta. Karera mo sono gunshuu mo, sono tomi mo kie, mata karera no meisei mo kiete nani mo nokoranaku naru.
Toki wa kita. Hi wa chikazuita. Kau mono wa yorokobu na. Uru mono wa kanashimu na. Ikari ga subete no gunshuu no ue ni nozomukara da.
Uru mono wa tatoi ikite ite mo, sono utta mono ni kaeru koto wa nai. Ikari ga sono subete no minshuu no ue ni arukara da. Sore wa moto ni kaeranai. Sono fugi no tame ni, dare mo inochi o mattou suru koto wa dekinai.
Hitobito ga rappa o fuite sonae o shite mo tatakai ni deru mono wa nai. Sore wa watashi no ikari ga sono subete no gunshuu no ue ni arukara da.
Soto ni wa tsurugi ga ari, uchi ni wa ekibyou to kikin ga aru. Hatake ni iru mono wa tsurugi ni shini, machi ni iru mono wa kikin to ekibyou ni horobosareru.
Sono uchi no, nogareru mono wa tanima no hato no you ni yamayama ni itte, onoono mina sono tsumi no tame ni kanashimu.
Ryoute to mo yowaku nari, ryouhizatomo mizu no you ni yowaku naru.
Karera wa aranuno o mi ni matoi, osore ga karera o ooi, subete no kao ni wa haji ga araware, subete no atama wa kami o sori otosu.
Karera wa sono gin o chimata ni sute, sono kin wa akuta no you ni naru. Shu no ikari no hi ni wa kingin mo karera o sukuu koto wa dekinai. Sorera wa karera no ue o manzoku saseru koto ga dekinai, mata sono hara o mitasu koto ga dekinai. Sore wa karera no fugi no tsumazuki de attakara da.
Karera wa sono utsukushii kazarimono o takaburi no tame ni mochii, mata kore o motte sono nikumubeki guuzou to imubeki mono o tsukutta. Sore yue watashi wa kore o karera ni taishite kegareta mono to suru.
Watashi wa kore o gaikokujin no te ni watashite ubawase, chi no akunin ni watashite kasumesaseru. Karera wa kore o kegasu.
Watashi wa karera kara kao o somukete, karera ni watashi no seijo o kegasaseru. Goutou ga kore ni haitte kegashi,
Mata arechi to suru. Kono chi wa ryuuketsu no toga ni michi, kono machi wa bougyaku ni michite iru yue,
Watashi wa kuniguni no uchi no warui monodomo o maneite, karera no ie o kasumesaseru. Watashi wa tsuyoi mono no takaburi o yamesaseru. Mata karera no seijo wa kegasareru.
Horobi ga kuru toki, karera wa heian o motomete mo erarenai.
Wazawai ni wazawai ga kasanari ki tari, shirase ni shirase ga aitsugu. Sono toki, karera wa yogensha ni maboroshi o motomeru. Shikashi rippou wa saishi no uchi ni tae, hakarigoto wa chourou no uchi ni taeru.
Ou wa kanashimi, tsukasa wa nozomi o ushinai, sono chi no tami no te wa ononoki ni yotte kowabaru. Watashi wa karera no okonai ni shitagatte karera o atsukai, sono sabaki ni shitagatte karera o sabaku. Soshite karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Dairoku nen no roku gatsu itsuka ni watashi ga watashi no ie ni zashi, Yuda no chouroutachi ga watashi no mae ni zashite ita toki, Shu naru kami no te ga watashi no ue ni kudatta.
Watashi wa mite iruto, miyo, hito no you na katachi ga atte, sono koshi to mirareru tokoro kara shita wa hi no you ni mie, koshi kara ue wa hikaru seidou no you ni kagayaite mieta.
Kare wa te no you na mono o nobete, watashi no kaminoke o tsukanda. Soshite rei ga watashi o ten to chi no aida ni hikiage, kami no maboroshi no uchi ni watashi o Erusaremu ni tazusaete iki, kita ni mukatta uchiniwa no mon no iriguchi ni itaraseta. Soko ni wa, netami o hikiokosu netami no guuzou ga atta.
Miyo, soko ni, watashi ga kano heiya de mita maboroshi no you na Isuraeru no kami no eikou ga arawareta.
Toki ni kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, me o agete kita no hou o nozome". Soko de watashi ga me o agete kita no hou o nozomuto, miyo, saidan no mon no kita ni atatte, sono iriguchi ni, kono netami no guuzou ga atta.
Kare wa mata watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, anata wa karera no shite iru koto, sunawachi Isuraeru no ie ga koko deshite iru ooinaru nikumubeki koto o miru ka. Kore wa watashi o seijo kara toozakeru mono de aru. Shikashi anata wa, sarani ooinaru nikumubeki koto o mirudarou".
Soshite kare wa watashi o niwa no mon ni ikaseta. Watashi ga miruto, miyo, kabe ni hitotsu no ana ga atta.
Kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, kabe ni ana o akeyo". Soko de watashi ga kabe ni ana o akeruto, miyo, hitotsu no to ga atta.
Kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hai tte, karera ga koko de nasu tokoro no ashiki nikumubeki koto o miyo".
Soko de watashi ga haitte miruto, moromoro no hau mono to, nikumubeki kemono no katachi, oyobi Isuraeru no ie no moromoro no guuzou ga, mawari no kabe ni egaite atta.
Mata Isuraeru no ie no chourou nanajuunin ga, sono mae ni tatte ita. Shapan no ko Yazaniya mo, karera no naka ni tatte ita. Onoono te ni kouro o mochi, soshite sono kou no kemuri ga kumo no you ni nobotta.
Toki ni kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie no chouroutachi ga kurai tokoro de okonau koto, sunawachi onoono sono guuzou no shitsu de okonau koto o miru ka. Karera wa iu, 'Shu wa wareware o mirarenai. Shu wa kono chi o suterareta' to".
Mata watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa sarani karera ga nasu ooinaru nikumubeki koto o miru".
Soshite kare wa watashi o tsurete Shu no ie no kita no mon no iriguchi ni itta. Miyo, soko ni onnatachi ga suwatte, Tanmuzu no tame ni naite ita.
Sono toki, kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, anata wa kore o mita ka. Kore yori mo sarani ooinaru nikumubeki koto o mirudarou".
Kare wa mata watashi o tsurete, Shu no ie no uchiniwa ni haitta. Miyo, Shu no miya no iriguchi ni, rou to saidan to no aida ni nijuu gonin bakari no hito ga, Shu no miya ni sono senaka o muke, kao o higashi ni muke, higashi ni mukatte taiyou o ogande ita.
Toki ni kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, anata wa kore o mita ka. Yuda no ie ni totte, karera ga koko deshite iru korera no nikumubeki waza wa karui koto de aru ka. Karera wa kono chi o bougyaku de mitashi, sarani watashi o ikaraseru. Miyo, karera wa sono hana ni ki no eda o oku.
Sore yue, watashi mo ikidootte koto o okonau. Watashi no me wa karera o oshimi mizu, mata awaremanai. Tatoi karera ga watashi no mimi ni oogoe de yobawatte mo, watashi wa karera no iu koto o kikanai".
Toki ni kare wa watashi no mimi ni oogoe ni yobawatte iwareta, "Machi o bassuru monotachi yo, onoono horobosu buki o sono te ni motte chikayore" to.
Miyo, kita ni mukau ue no mon no michi kara dete kuru rokunin no mono ga atta. Onoono sono te ni horobosu buki o mochi, karera no naka no hitori wa amanuno o ki, sono koshi ni mono o kaku sumitsubo o tsukete ita. Karera wa haitte kite, seidou no saidan no katawara ni tatta.
Koko ni Isuraeru no kami no eikou ga sono zashite iru kerubimu kara tachiagatte, miya no shikii ni made itatta. Soshite Shu wa, amanuno o kite, sono koshi ni mono o kaku sumitsubo o tsukete iru mono o yobi,
Kare ni iwareta, "Machi no naka, Erusaremu no naka o meguri, sono naka de okonawarete iru subete no nikumubeki koto ni taishite nagekikanashimu hitobito no hitai ni shirushi o tsukeyo".
Mata watashi no kiite iru tokoro de ta no mono ni iwareta, "Kare no ato ni shitagai machi o megutte, ute. Anata no me wa oshimi miru na. Mata awaremu na.
Rounyakunannyo o kotogotoku korose. Shikashi mi ni shirushi no aru mono ni wa fureru na. Mazu watashi no seijo kara hajimeyo". Soko de, karera wa miya no mae ni ita roujin kara hajimeta.
Kono toki, Shu wa karera ni iwareta, "Miya o kegashi, shinin de niwa o mitase. Ike". Soko de karera wa dete itte, machi no naka de utta.
Sate karera ga hitobito o uchikoroshite ita toki, watashi hitori dake ga nokosareta no de, hirefushite, sakende itta, "Aa Shu naru kami yo, anata ga Erusaremu no ue ni ikari o sosogareru toki, Isuraeru no nokori no mono o, kotogotoku horobosareru no desu ka".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Isuraeru to Yuda no ie no tsumi wa hijou ni ookii. Kuni wa chi de michi, machi wa fugi de michite iru. Karera wa iu, 'Shu wa kono chi o suterareta. Shu wa kaerimirarenai'.
Sore yue, watashi no me wa karera o oshimi mizu, mata awaremanai. Karera no okonau tokoro o, karera no koube ni mukuiru".
Toki ni, kano amanuno o ki, mono o kaku sumitsubo o koshi ni tsukete ita hito ga houkoku shite itta, "Watashi wa anata ga omeiji ni natta you ni okonaimashita".
Toki ni watashi wa mite itaga, miyo, kerubimu no atama no ue no oozora ni, Safaiya no you na mono ga ouza no katachi o shite, sono ue ni arawareta.
Kare wa amanuno o kita sono hito ni iwareta, "Kerubimu no shita no mawaru kuruma no aida ni hairi, kerubimu no aida kara sumibi o totte anata no te ni mitashi, kore o machijyuu ni makichirase". Soshite kare wa watashi no me no mae de wa itta.
Kono hito ga haitta toki, kerubimu wa miya no minamigawa ni tatte ita. Mata kumo wa sono uchiniwa o mitashite ita.
Shu no eikou wa kerubimu no ue kara miya no shikii no ue ni agari, miya wa kumo de michi, niwa wa Shu no eikou no kagayaki de mitasareta.
Toki ni kerubimu no tsubasa no oto ga tainou no kami ga katarareru koe no you ni sotoniwa ni made kikoeta.
Kare ga amanuno o kite iru hito ni, "Mawaru kuruma no aida, kerubimu no aida kara hi o tore". To meijita toki, sono hito wa hai tte, wa no katawara ni tatta.
Hitori no kerubu wa sono te o kerubimu no aida kara nobete, kerubimu no aida ni aru hi o tori, amanuno o kita hito no te ni oita. Suruto kare wa kore o totte dete itta.
Kerubimu wa sono tsubasa no shita ni hito no te no you na katachi no mono o motte iru you ni mieta.
Watashi ga mite iruto, miyo, kerubimu no katawara ni yontsu no wa ga ari, hitotsu no wa wa hitori no kerubu no katawara ni, ta no wa wa ta no kerubu no katawara ni atta. Wa no sama wa, hikaru kikanranishi no you de atta.
Sono sama wa yontsutomo onaji katachi de, atakamo wa no naka ni wa ga aru you de atta.
Sono yuku toki wa shihou no doko e de mo iku. Sono yuku toki wa mawaranai. Tada sentou no wa no muku tokoro ni shitagai, sono yuku toki wa mawaru koto o shinai.
Sono wafuchi, sono ya, oyobi wa ni wa, mawari ni me ga michite ita. - sono wa wa yontsu to mo kore o motte ita.
Sono wa wa watashi no kiite iru tokoro de, "Mawaru wa" to yobareta.
Sono onoono ni wa yontsu no kao ga atta. Daiichi no kao wa kerubu no kao, daini no kao wa hito no kao, daisan wa shishi no kao, daiyon wa washi no kao de atta.
Sono toki kerubimu wa nobotta. Kore ga Kebaru gawa de watashi ga mita ikimono de aru.
Kerubimu no yuku toki, wa mo sono katawara ni iki, kerubimu ga tsubasa o agete chi kara tobiagaru toki wa, wa mo sono katawara o hanarenai.
Sono tachidomaru toki wa, wa mo tachidomari, sono noboru toki wa, wa mo tomo ni noboru. Ikimono no rei ga sono naka ni arukara de aru.
Toki ni Shu no eikou ga miya no shikii kara dete itte, kerubimu no ue ni tatta.
Suruto kerubimu wa tsubasa o agete, watashi no me no mae de, chi kara nobotta. Sono dete iku toki, wa mo mata kore to tomo ni ari, Shu no miya no higashi no mon no iriguchi no tokoro e itte tomatta. Isuraeru no kami no eikou ga sono ue ni atta.
Kore ga sunawachi watashi ga Kebaru gawa no hotori de, Isuraeru no kami no shita ni mita ka no ikimono de aru. Watashi wa sore ga kerubimu de aru koto o shitte ita.
Kore ni wa onoono yontsu no kao ga ari, onoono yontsu no tsubasa ga ari, mata hito no te no you na mono ga sono tsubasa no shita ni atta.
Sono kao no katachi wa, Kebaru gawa no hotori de watashi ga mita sono mama no kao de aru. Onoono sono mae no hou ni massugu ni itta.
Toki ni rei wa watashi o agete, higashi ni mukau Shu no miya no higashi no mon ni tsurete itta. Miyo, sono mon no iriguchi ni nijuu gonin no mono ga ita. Watashi wa sono naka ni Azuru no ko Yazaniya to, Benaya no ko Perateya o mita. Tomo ni tami no tsukasa de atta.
Suruto kare wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, korera no mono wa kono machi no naka de warui koto o kangae, warui hakarigoto o megurasu hitobito de aru.
Karera wa iu, 'Ie o tateru toki wa chikaku wa nai. Kono machi wa nabe de ari, wareware wa niku de aru' to.
Sore yue, karera ni mukatte yogen seyo. Hito no ko yo, yogen seyo".
Toki ni, Shu no rei ga watashi ni kudatte, watashi ni iwareta, "Shu wa kou iwareru to ie, Isuraeru no ie yo, kangaete mi yo. Watashi wa anata gata no kokoro ni aru kotodomo o shitte iru.
Anata gata wa kono machi ni korosareru mono o mashi, korosareta mono o motte chimata o mitashita.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, machi no naka ni anata gata ga oku korosareta mono wa niku de aru. Kono machi wa nabe de aru. Shikashi, anata gata wa sono naka kara toridasareru.
Anata gata wa tsurugi o osoreta. Watashi wa anata gata ni tsurugi o nozomaseruto, Shu wa iwareru.
Mata watashi wa anatagata o sono naka kara hikidashite, takokujin no te ni watashi, anatagata o sabaku.
Anata gata wa tsurugi ni taoreru. Watashi wa anatagata o Isuraeru no sakai de sabaku. Kore ni yotte anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Kono machi wa anata gata ni taishite nabe to wa narazu, anata gata wa sono niku to wa naranai. Watashi wa Isuraeru no sakai de anatagata o sabaku.
Kore ni yotte, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru. Anata gata wa watashi no sadame ni ayumazu, mata watashi no okite o okonawazu, kaette sono shuui no takokujin no okite ni shitagatte okonatte irukara de aru".
Kono you ni watashi ga yogen shite ita toki, Benaya no ko Perateya ga shinda no de, watashi wa uchifushite, oogoe de sakende itta, "Aa Shu naru kami yo, anata wa Isuraeru no nokori no mono o kotogotoku horobosou to sareru no desu ka".
Toki ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde itta,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kyoudai, anata no tomo, anata no kyoudai de aru torawarebito, Isuraeru no zenka, Erusaremu no juumin wa itta, 'Karera ga Shu kara tooku hanareta. Kono chi wa wareware no shoyuu to shite ataerarete iru no da' to.
Sore yue, ie, 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, tatoi watashi wa karera o tooku takokujin no naka ni utsushi, kuniguni no naka ni chirashite mo, karera no itta kuniguni de, watashi wa shibaraku karera no tame ni seijo to naru' to.
Sore yue, ie, 'Shu wa kou iwareru, watashi wa anatagata o moromoro no tami no naka kara atsume, sono chirasareta kuniguni kara atsumete, Isuraeru no chi o anata gata ni ataeru' to.
Karera wa sono tokoro ni kuru toki, sono moromoro no itoubeki mono to, moromoro no nikumubeki mono to o sono tokoro kara torinozoku.
Soshite watashi wa karera ni hitotsu no kokoro o atae, karera no uchi ni atarashii rei o sazuke, karera no niku kara ishi no kokoro o torisatte, niku no kokoro o ataeru.
Kore wa karera ga watashi no sadame ni ayumi, watashi no okite o mamotte okonai, soshite karera ga watashi no tami to nari, watashi ga karera no kami to naru tame de aru.
Shikashi itoubeki mono, nikumubeki mono o sono kokoro ni shitatte ayumu mono ni wa, karera no okonai ni shitagatte sono koube ni mukuiruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Toki ni kerubimu wa sono tsubasa o ageta. Wa ga sono katawara ni ari, Isuraeru no kami no eikou ga sono ue ni atta.
Shu no eikou ga machi no naka kara nobotte, machi no higashi ni aru yama no ue ni tachidomatta.
Sono toki, rei wa watashi o age, kami no rei ni yotte, maboroshi no uchi ni watashi o Karudeya no torawarebito no tokoro e tazusaete itta. Soshite watashi ga mita maboroshi wa watashi o hanarete nobotta.
Soko de watashi wa Shu ga watashi ni shimesareta koto o kotogotoku ka no torawarebito ni tsugeta.
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata wa hangyaku no ie no naka ni iru. Karera wa miru me ga aru ga mizu, kiku mimi ga aruga kikazu, karera wa hangyaku no ie de aru.
Sore yue, hito no ko yo, hoshuu no nimotsu o totonoe, karera no me no mae de hiru no uchi ni utsure, karera no me no mae de anata no tokoro kara ta no tokoro ni utsure. Karera wa hangyaku no ie de aruga, aruiha karera wa kaerimiru tokoro ga arou.
Anata wa, hoshuu no nimotsu no you na anata no nimotsu o, karera no me no mae de hiru no uchi ni mochidase. Soshite hoshuu ni yukubeki hitobito no you ni, karera no me no mae de yuube no uchi ni dete ike.
Sunawachi karera no me no mae de kabe ni ana o ake, soko kara dete ike.
Anata wa karera no me no mae de sono nimotsu o kata ni oi, yami no uchi ni sore o hakobidase. Anata no kao o ootte chi o miru na. Watashi wa anata o shirushi to nashite, Isuraeru no ie ni shimesu no da".
Soko de watashi wa meijirareta you ni shi, hoshuu no nimotsu no you na nimotsu o hiru no uchi ni mochidashi, yuube ni wa watashi no te de kabe ni ana o ake, yami no uchi ni karera no me no mae de, kore o kata ni otte hakobidashita.
Tsugi no asa, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, hangyaku no ie de aru Isuraeru no ie wa, anata ni mukatte, 'Nani o shite iru no ka' to iwanakatta ka.
Anata wa karera ni ii nasai, 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, kono takusen wa Erusaremu no kimi, oyobi sono naka ni aru Isuraeru no zenka ni kakawaru mono de aru' to.
Mata ii nasai, 'Watashi wa anata gata no shirushi de aru. Watashi ga shita toori ni karera mo sareru. Karera wa toriko ni sarete utsusareru' to.
Karera no uchi no kimi wa, yami no uchi ni sono nimotsu o kata ni nosete dete iku. Kare wa kabe ni ana o akete, soko kara dete iku. Kare wa kao o ootte, jibun no me de kono chi o minai.
Watashi wa watashi no ami o kare no ue ni uchi kakeru. Kare wa watashi no wana ni kakaru. Watashi wa kare o Karudeya bito no chi no Babiron ni hiite iku. Shikashi kare wa sore o minaide, soko de shinude arou.
Mata subete kare no shuui ni ite kare o tasukeru mono oyobi kare no guntai o, watashi wa shihou ni chirashi, tsurugi o nuite sono ato o ou.
Watashi ga karera o shokokumin no naka ni chirashi, kuniguni ni makichirasu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Tadashi, watashi wa karera no uchi ni, wazuka no mono o nokoshite, tsurugi to, kikin to, ekibyou o manukaresase, karera ga okonatta moromoro no nikumubeki koto o, karera ga yuku kunibito no naka ni kokuhaku saseyou. Soshite karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, furuete anata no pan o tabe, ononoki to osore to o motte mizu o nome.
Soshite kono chi no tami ni tsuite ie, Shu naru kami wa Isuraeru no chi no Erusaremu no tami ni tsuite kou iwareru, karera wa osore o motte sono pan o tabe, odoroki o motte sono mizu o nomu you ni naru. Kore wa sono chi ga, subete sono naka ni sumu mono no bougyaku no tame ni otoroe, arechi to narukara de aru.
Hito no sunde ita machimachi wa are hate, chi wa aratsuka to naru. Soshite anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no chi ni tsuite, anata gata ga 'Hi wa nobi, subete no maboroshi wa munashiku natta' to iu, kono kotowaza wa nan de aru ka.
Sore yue, karera ni ie, 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa kono kotowaza o yamesase, karera ga futatabi Isuraeru de, kore o kotowaza to shinai you ni suru' to. Shikashi, anata wa karera ni ie, 'Hi to subete no maboroshi no migen to wa chikazuita' to.
Isuraeru no ie no uchi ni wa, mohaya munashii maboroshi mo, itsuwari no uranai mo nakunaru.
Shikashi Shu naru watashi wa, waga katarubeki koto o katari, sore wa kanarazu jouju suru. Kesshite nobiru koto wa nai. Aa, hangyaku no ie yo, anata no hi ni watashi wa kore o katari, kore o jouju suruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, miyo, Isuraeru no ie wa iu, 'Kare no miru maboroshi wa, nao ooku no hi no nochi no koto de aru. Kare ga yogen suru koto wa tooi nochi no toki no koto de aru' to.
Sore yue, karera ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi no kotoba wa mohaya nobinai. Watashi no kataru kotoba wa jouju suruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no yogensha tachi ni mukatte yogen seyo. Sunawachi jibun no kokoro no mama ni yogen suru hitobito ni mukatte, yogen shite ie, 'Anata gata wa Shu no kotoba o kike'.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, nani mo minaide, jibun no rei ni shitagau oroka na yogensha tachi wa wazawai da.
Isuraeru yo, anata no yogensha tachi wa, are ato ni iru kitsune no you da.
Anata gata wa Shu no hi ni tatakai ni tatsu tame, yabure kuchi ni noborazu, mata Isuraeru no ie no tame ni ishigaki o kizukou to mo shinai.
Karera wa kyogi o ii, itsuwari o uranatta. Karera wa Shu ga karera o tsukawasanai no ni 'Shu ga iwareru' to ii, nao sono kotoba no jouju suru koto o kitai suru.
Anata gata wa munashii maboroshi o mi, itsuwari no uranai o katari, watashi ga iwanai no ni 'Shu ga iwareru' to ittade wa nai ka".
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa munashii koto o katari, itsuwari no mono o miru yue, watashi wa anatagata o bassuru to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Watashi no te wa, munashii maboroshi o mi, itsuwari no uranai o iu yogensha ni tekitai suru. Karera wa waga tami no kai ni nozomazu, Isuraeru no ie no seki ni shirusarezu, Isuraeru no chi ni, hairu koto ga dekinai. Soshite anata gata wa watashi ga Shu naru kami de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Karera wa waga tami o madowashi, heiwa ga nai no ni 'Heiwa' to ii, mata tami ga hei o kizuku toki, korera no yogensha tachi wa mizu shikkui o motte kore o nuru.
Sore yue, mizu shikkui o nuru monodomo ni 'Kore wa kanarazu kuzureru' to ie. Kore ni ooame ga sosogi, hyou ga furi, arashi ga fuku.
Soshite hei ga kuzureru toki, hitobito wa anata gata ni mukatte, 'Anata gata ga nutta mizu shikkui wa doko ni aru ka' to iwanaide arou ka.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa waga ikidoori o motte ookaze o okoshi, waga ikari o motte ooame o sosogase, ikidoori o motte hyou o furasete, kore o horobosu.
Mata watashi wa anata gata ga mizu shikkui o motte nutta hei o kowashite, kore o chi ni taoshi, sono motoi o arawasu. Kore ga taoreru toki, anata gata wa sono naka ni horobiru. Soshite anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Kou shite watashi ga, sono hei to, kore o mizu shikkui de nutta mono to no ue ni, watashi no ikidoori o morashi tsukushite, anata gata ni iu, hei wa nakunari, kore o nutta mono mo nakunaru.
Kore ga sunawachi heiwa ga nai no ni heiwa no maboroshi o mi, Erusaremu ni tsuite yogen shita Isuraeru no yogensha de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Hito no ko yo, kokoro no mama ni yogen suru anata no tami no musumetachi ni taishite, anata no kao o muke, karera ni mukatte yogen shite,
Ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, te no fushibushi ni uranai himo o nuitsuke, moromoro no ookisa no hito no atama ni, kaburimono o tsukuri kabusete, tamashii o karitorou to suru onna wa wazawai da. Anata gata wa, waga tami no tamashii o karitotte, anata gata no rieki no tame ni, ta no tamashii o ikashi okou to suru no ka.
Anata gata wa sukoshi bakari no oomugi no tame, sukoshi bakari no pan no tame ni, waga tami no uchi ni, watashi o kegashi, kano itsuwari o kikiireru waga tami ni itsuwari o nobete, shinde wa naranai mono o shinase, ikite ite wa naranai mono o ikasu.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata gata ga mochiite, tamashii o karitoru tokoro no uranai himo o ubai, anata gata no ude kara uranai himo o sakitotte, anata gata ga karitoru tokoro no tamashii o, tori no you ni hanachi yaru.
Watashi wa mata anata gata no, kaburimono o saki, waga tami o anata gata no te kara sukuu. Karera wa futatabi anata gata no emono to wa naranai. Soshite anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Anata gata wa itsuwari o motte tadashii mono no kokoro o nayamashita. Watashi wa kore o nayamasanakatta. Mata anata gata wa akunin ga, sono inochi o sukuu tame ni, sono ashiki michi kara hanareyou to suru toki, sore o shinai you ni susumeru.
Sore yue, anata gata wa kasanete munashii maboroshi o miru koto ga dekizu, uranai o suru koto ga dekinai you ni naru. Watashi wa waga tami o, anata gata no te kara sukuidasu. Sono toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Koko ni Isuraeru no chourou no uchi no aru hitobito ga, watashi no tokoro ni kite, watashi no mae ni zashita.
Toki ni Shu no kotoba ga, watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, korera no hitobito wa, sono guuzou o kokoro no naka ni mochi, tsumi ni otoshi ireru tokoro no tsumazuki o, sono kao no mae ni oite iru. Watashi wa dou shite karera no negai o ireru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Sore yue karera ni tsugete ie, Shu naru kami wa, kou iwareru, Isuraeru no ie no hitobito de, sono guuzou o kokoro no naka ni mochi, sono kao no mae ni tsumi ni otoshi ireru tokoro no tsumazuku mono o okinagara, yogensha no moto ni kuru mono ni wa, sono ooku no guuzou no yue ni, Shu naru watashi wa, mizukara kore ni kotae o suru.
Kore wa sono guuzou no tame ni, subete watashi o hanareta Isuraeru no ie no kokoro o, watashi ga toraeru tame de aru.
Sore yue Isuraeru no ie ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa kuite, anata gata no guuzou o suteyo. Anata gata no kao o, sono subete no nikumubeki mono kara somukeyo.
Isuraeru no ie no mono oyobi Isuraeru ni yadoru gaikokujin no dare de mo, watashi kara hanare, sono kokoro ni guuzou o mochi, sono kao no mae ni tsumi ni otoshi ireru tokoro no tsumazuki o okinagara, yogensha ni kite, kokoro no mama ni watashi ni motomeru toki wa, Shu de aru watashi wa, mizukara kore ni kotae o suru.
Watashi wa watashi no kao o, sono hito ni muke, kare o, shirushi, oyobi kotowaza to nashi, kore o waga tami no uchi kara tachi horobosu. Sono toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Moshi yogensha ga azamukarete kotoba o dasu koto ga areba, sore wa Shu de aru watashi ga, sono yogensha o azamuita no de aru. Watashi wa te o kare no ue ni nobe, waga tami Isuraeru no uchi kara kare o horobosu.
Karera wa sono batsu o ou. Sono yogensha no batsu wa, toi motomeru mono no batsu to douyou de aru.
Kore wa Isuraeru no ie ga, kasanete watashi o hanarete mayowazu, kasanete sono moromoro no toga ni yotte, onore o kegasanai tame, mata karera ga waga tami to nari, watashi ga karera no kami to naru tame de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga, mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, moshi kuni ga watashi ni, motori somuite tsumi o okashi, watashi ga sono ue ni te o nobete, sono tsue to tanomu pan o kudaki, kore ni kikin o okuri, hito to kemono to o sono uchi kara tatsu toki,
Tatoi soko ni Noa, Danieru, Yobu no sannin ga ite mo, karera wa sono gi ni yotte, tada jibun no inochi o sukui uru nomi de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Moshi watashi ga no no kemono ni kono chi o toorase, kore o arasase, kore o arechi to nashi, sono kemono no tame ni soko o tooru mono ga nai you ni shitanara,
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, tatoi korera sannin no mono ga sono naka ni ite mo, sono musuko musume o sukuu koto wa dekinai. Tada jibun jishin o sukui uru nomi de, sono chi wa arechi to naru.
Aruiha, watashi ga moshi, tsurugi o sono chi ni nozomase, tsurugi yo, kono chi o yuki megure to itte, hito to kemono to o soko kara tatsunaraba,
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, tatoi korera sannin no mono ga sono naka ni ite mo, sono musuko musume o sukuu koto wa dekinai. Tada jibun jishin o sukui uru nomi de aru.
Aruiha, watashi ga moshi, kono chi ni ekibyou o okuri, chi o motte waga ikidoori o sono ue ni sosogi, hito to kemono to o soko kara tatsunaraba,
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, tatoi Noa, Danieru, Yobu ga soko ni ite mo, karera wa sono musuko musume o sukuu koto ga dekinai. Tada sono gi ni yotte jibun no inochi o sukui uru nomi de aru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi ga hito to kemono to o chi kara tatsu tame ni, tsurugi to, kikin to, ashiki kemono to, ekibyou to no yontsu no kibishii batsu o Erusaremu ni okuru toki wa dou de arou ka.
Shikashi, moshi sore ga anata gata ni kuru toki, musuko musumetachi o tasukedasu mono ga, sono naka ni nokotte ite, anata gata ga sono okonaito, wazato o mirunaraba, watashi ga Erusaremu no ue ni ataeta subete no wazawai ni tsuite nagusamerarerude arou.
Sunawachi, anata ga taga, sono okonaito, wazato o miru toki, karera wa anatagata o nagusame, anata gata wa watashi ga kore ni okonatta koto wa, subete yue nakushita no de wa nai koto o shiru you ni naruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, budou no ki, mori no ki no uchi ni aru budou no eda wa, hoka no ki ni nan no masaru tokoro ga aru ka.
Sono ki wa nani ka o tsukuru tame ni mochiirareru ka. Mata hito wa kore o mochiite, utsuwamono o kakeru kikugi o tsukurudarou ka.
Miyo, kore wa hi ni nageirerarete moeru. Hi ga sono ryoutan o yaita toki, mata sono nakahodo ga kogeta toki, sore wa nan no yaku ni tatsudarou ka.
Miyo, kore wa kanzen na toki de mo, nan no you o mo nasa nai. Mashite hi ga kore o yaki, kore o kogashita toki ni wa, nan no yaku ni tatsudarou ka.
Sore yue Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi ga mori no ki no naka no budou no ki o, hi ni nageirete yaku you ni, Erusaremu no juumin o sono you ni suru.
Watashi wa watashi no kao o karera ni mukete semeru. Karera ga sono hi kara nogarete mo, hi wa karera o yaki tsukusu. Watashi ga kao o karera ni mukete semeru toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Karera ga, motori somuita yue ni, watashi wa kono chi o arechi to suruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga futatabi watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Erusaremu ni sono nikumubeki kotodomo o shimeshite,
Ie. Shu naru kami wa Erusaremu ni kou iwareru, anata no okori, anata no umare wa Kanan bito no chi de aru. Anata no chichi wa Amori bi to, anata no haha wa Hete bito de aru.
Anata no umare ni tsuite ieba, sono umareta hi ni, hesonoo wa kirarezu, mizu de araikiyomerarezu, shio de kosurarezu, mata nuno de tsutsumarenakatta.
Hitori mo anata o awaremi miru mono naku, jou o motte korera no koto no hitotsu o mo, anata ni shite yaru mono mo naku, anata no umareta hi ni, anata wa kirawarete, nohara ni suterareta.
Watashi wa anata no katawara o toori, anata ga chi no naka ni korogari mawatte iru no o mita toki, watashi wa chi no naka ni iru anata ni itta, 'Ikiyo,
No no ki no you ni sodate' to. Sunawachi anata wa seichou shite ookiku nari, ichininmae no onna ni nari, sono chibusa wa katachi ga totonoi, kami wa nagaku nattaga, kimono ga naku, hadaka de atta.
Watashi wa futatabi anata no katawara o tootte, anata o mitaga, miyo, anata wa aiserareru nenrei ni tasshite ita no de, watashi wa kimono no suso de anata o ooi, anata no hadaka o kakushi, soshite anata ni chikai, anata to keiyaku o musunda. Soshite anata wa watashi no mono to natta to, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Soko de watashi wa mizu de anata o arai, anata no chi o araiotoshite abura o nuri,
Nuitori shita kimono o kise, kawa no kutsu o hakase, hosonuno o kaburase, kinu no kire de anata o ootta.
Mata kazarimono de anata o kazari, udewa o anata no te ni hame, kusari o anata no kubi ni kake,
Hana ni wa hanawa, mimi ni wa mimiwa, atama ni wa utsukushii kanmuri o ataeta.
Kono you ni anata wa kingin de kazarare, hosonuno, kinu, nuitori no fuku o anata no koromo to shi, mugiko to, mitsu to, abura to o tabeta. Anata wa hijou ni utsukushiku natte ou no chii ni susumi,
Anata no utsukushisa no tame ni, anata no meisei wa kuniguni ni hiromatta. Kore wa watashi ga, anata ni hodokoshita kazari ni yotte mattou saretakara de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Tokoro ga, anata wa jibun no utsukushisa o tanomi, jibun no meisei ni yotte kan'in o okonai, subete katawara o tooru mono to, hoshiimama ni kan'in o okonatta.
Anata wa jibun no koromo o totte, jibun no tame ni, hanayaka ni iro dotta seijo o tsukuri, sono ue de kan'in o okonatte iru. Konna koto wa katsute nakatta koto, mata atte wa naranai koto de aru.
Anata wa watashi ga ataeta kingin no utsukushii kazari no shina o tori, jibun no tame ni otoko no zou o tsukutte, kore to kan'in o okonatta.
Mata nuitori no aru jibun no koromo o totte karera ni kise, watashi no abura to kou to o sono mae ni sonae,
Mata watashi ga anata ni ataeta pan, watashi ga anata o yashinau tame no mugiko, abura oyobi mitsu o, kou ba shiki kaori to shite karera no mae ni sonaeta to, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Anata wa mata, anata ga watashi ni unda musuko, musumetachi o totte, sono zou ni sonae, karera ni kuwaseta. Kono you na anata no kan'in wa chiisai koto de arou ka.
Anata wa watashi no kodomo o koroshi, hi no naka o toorasete karera ni sasageta.
Anata ga sono subete no nikumubeki koto ya kan'in o okonau ni atatte, anata ga koromo mo naku, hadaka de, chi no naka ni korogari mawatte ita jibun no wakaki hi no koto o omowanakatta.
Anata ga moromoro no aku o okonatta nochi, (anata wa wazawai da, wazawai dato, Shu naru kami wa iwareru)
Anata wa jibun no tame ni kourou o tate, hiroba, hiroba ni dai o tsukuri,
Chimata, chimata no tsu ji ni dai o tsukutte, anata no utsukushisa o kegashi, subete katawara o tooru mono ni mi o makasete, ooini kan'in o okonatte iru.
Anata wa mata, kano nikuyokumato na tonari Ejiputo no hitobito to kan'in o okonai, ooini kan'in o okonatte, watashi o ikaraseta.
Sore yue, watashi wa watashi no te o anata no ue ni nobete, anata no tamawaru bun o herashi, anata no teki, sunawachi, anata no midara na koui o hajiru Perishite bito no musumera no yoku no mama ni, anata o watashita.
Anata wa aku koto ga nai no de, mata ASsuriya no hitobito to kan'in o okonattaga, karera to kan'in o okonatte mo, nao aku koto ga nakatta.
Anata wa mata Karudeya no shougyou chi to ooini kan'in o okonattaga, kore to kan'in o okonatte mo, nao aku koto ga nakatta.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, anata no kokoro wa donna ni koi wazurau no ka. Anata wa, korera subete no koto o okonatta. Kore wa atsukamashii kan'in no waza de aru.
Anata wa, chimata, chimata no tsu ji ni kourou o tate, hiroba, hiroba ni dai o mouketaga, atai o morau koto o azaketta no de, yuujo no you de wa nakatta.
Jibun no otto ni kaete tanin to tsuujiru kanpu yo.
Hito wa subete no yuujo ni mono o ataeru. Shikashi anata wa subete no koibito ni mono o atae, karera ni mainai shite, anata to kan'in suru tame ni, shihou kara anata no tokoro ni kosaseru.
Kono you ni anata wa kan'in o okonau ni atatte, ta no onna to chigatte iru. Sunawachi, dare mo anata ni kan'in o saseta no de wa nai. Anata wa kaette atai o harai, aite wa anata ni harawanai. Kore ga anata no chigau tokoro de aru.
Sore de yuujo yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata ga sono koibito to kan'in shite, anata no hajiru tokoro o arawashi, anata no hadaka o arawashi, mata subete no guuzou to, anata ga karera ni sasageta anata no kodomora no chi no yue ni,
Miyo, watashi wa anata to asonda anata no subete no koibito, oyobi subete anata ga koi shita mono to, subete anata ga nikunda mono to o atsume, shihou kara karera o anata no tokoro ni atsumete, anata no hadaka o karera ni arawasu. Karera wa anata no hadaka o, kotogotoku miru.
Watashi wa kan'in o okonatta onna to, chi o nagashita onna ga sabakareru you ni, anata o sabaki, ikidoori to, netami no chi to o, anata ni sosogu.
Watashi wa anata o koibito no te ni watasu. Karera wa anata no kourou o taoshi, dai o kowashi, anata no koromo o hagitori, anata no utsukushii kazari no shina o ubai, anata o ifuku no nai hadakamono ni suru.
Karera wa minshuu o karitatete anata o seme, ishi de anata o uchi, tsurugi de anata o kiri,
Hi de anata no ie o yaki, ooku no onnatachi no mae de, anata ni sabaki o okonau. Kou shite watashi wa anata ni inkou o yamesase, kasanete atai o harawasenai you ni suru.
Soshite anata ni taisuru waga ikidoori o shizume, waga netami o anata kara hanashi, watashi wa kokoro o yasunjite, futatabi ikaru koto o shinai.
Mata anata wa sono wakaki hi no koto o oboezu, subete korera no koto o motte, watashi o ikarasetakara, miyo, watashi mo anata no okonau tokoro o anata no koube ni mukuiruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru. Anata wa moromoro no nikumubeki koto ni kuwaete, kono midara na koto o okonattade wa nai ka.
Miyo, subete kotowaza o mochiiru mono wa, anata ni tsuite, 'Kono haha ni shite kono musume ari' to iu, kotowaza o mochiiru.
Anata wa, sono otto to kodomo to o suteta anata no haha no musume, mata sono otto to kodomo to o suteta shimai o motte iru. Anata no haha wa Hete bi to, anata no chichi wa Amori bi to,
Anata no ane wa Samariya, Samariya wa sono musumetachi to tomo ni, anata no kita ni sumi, anata no imouto wa Sodomu de, sono musumetachi to tomo ni, anata no minami ni sunde iru.
Anata wa karera no michi o ayumazu, karera no nikumubeki koto ni shitagatte inaiga, shibaraku suruto, anata no okonai wa, karera yori mo sarani waruku naru.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Anata no imouto Sodomu to sono musumetachi wa, anata to anata no musumetachi ga shita hodo no koto wa shinakatta.
Miyo, anata no imouto Sodomu no tsumi wa kore de aru. Sunawachi kanojo to, sono musumetachi wa takaburi, shokumotsu ni aki, antai ni kurashite itaga, karera wa, toboshii mono to mazushii mono o tasukenakatta.
Karera wa takaburi, watashi no mae ni nikumubeki koto o okonatta no de, watashi wa sore o mita toki, karera o nozoita.
Samariya wa anata no hanbun mo tsumi o okasanakatta. Anata wa karera yori mo ooku nikumubeki koto o okonai, anata no okonatta moromoro no nikumubeki koto ni yotte, anata no shimai o gi to misekaketa.
Anata wa sono shimai o yuuri ni sabaita koto ni yotte, anata mo mata jibun no hazukashime o owanakereba naranai. Sore wa anata ga karera yori mo, sarani nikumubeki koto o shita tsumi ni yotte, karera wa anata yori mo gi to sarerukara de aru. Sore de anata mo haji o uke, hazukashime o owanakereba naranai. Sore wa anata ga sono shimai o gi to misekaketakara de aru.
Watashi wa karera no koufuku o moto ni kaesu. Sunawachi Sodomu to sono musumetachi no koufuku, Samariya to sono musumetachi no koufuku, mata karera no naka ni iru anata no koufuku o moto ni kaesu.
Kore wa anata ni jibun no hazukashime o owaseru tame, mata subete anata no nashita koto o hajisaseru tame de aru. Kou shite anata wa karera no nagusame to naru.
Anata no shimai Sodomu to, sono musumetachi to wa, sono moto no tokoro ni kaeri, Samariya to, sono musumetachi to wa, sono moto no tokoro ni kaeri, anata to, anata no musumetachi to wa, sono moto no tokoro ni kaeru.
Anata no takaburi no hi ni, anata no shimai Sodomu wa, anata no kuchi ni, kotowaza to nattade wa nakatta ka.
Sunawachi anata no aku ga arawasareta toki made, sou de wa nakatta ka. Shikashi ima wa anata mo kanojo to douyou ni, Edomu no musumetachi to, subete sono shuui no mono, oyobi shihou kara anata o azakeru Perishite no musumetachi no soshiri to natta.
Anata wa anata no midara na koui to, anata no nikumubeki koto no toga to o, mi ni otte iru to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, chikai o karonji, keiyaku o yabutta anata ni wa, anata ga shita you ni, watashi mo anata ni suru.
Shikashi watashi wa anata no wakaki hi ni, anata to musunda keiyaku o oboe, eien no keiyaku o anata to tateru.
Watashi ga anata no ane oyobi imouto o uke, mata anata to no keiyaku ni yorazu ni, musume to shite karera o anata ni ataeru toki, anata wa jibun no okonai o omoidashite hajiru.
Watashi wa anata to keiyaku o tate, anata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Kou shite subete anata no okonatta koto ni tsuki, watashi ga anata o yurusu toki, anata wa sore o omoidashite haji, sono haji no yue ni kasanete kuchi o hiraku koto ga naito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Toki ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie ni nazo o kake, tatoe o katatte,
Ie. Shu naru kami ga kou iwareru, samazama no iro no umou o ooku mochi, ookina tsubasa to, nagai hane to o motsu oowashi ga Rebanon ni kite, kouhaku no kozue ni tomari,
Sono wakaeda no itadaki o tsumi kiri, kore o shougyou no chi ni hakobi, shounin no machi ni oita.
Mata sono chi no tane o totte, kore o koeta tsuchi ni ueta. Sunawachi mizu no ooi tokoro ni motte itte, yanagi o ueru you ni kore o ueta.
Kore ga seichou shite, take hikuku, habikoru budou no ki to nari, eda wa washi ni mukai, ne wa washi no shita ni ari, kou shite tsuini budou no ki to nari, eda o nobashi, ha o dashita.
Koko ni mata ookina tsubasa to, umou no ooi hoka no hitowa no oowashi ga atta. Miyo, kono budou no ki wa, uruoi o eru tame ni, sono ne o washi ni mukatte mage, sono eda o washi ni mukatte nobashita.
Kore ga eda o dashi, mi o musubi, migoto na budou no ki to naru tame ni, washi wa kore o ueta naedoko kara mizu no ooi yoi chi ni utsushiueta.
Anata wa, Shu naru kami ga kou iwareru to ie, kore wa sakaerude arou ka. Washi wa sono ne o nuki, sono eda o kiri, sono wakaba o mina karasanaide arou ka. Kore o sono ne kara ageru ni wa, tsuyoi ude ya ooku no tami o hitsuyou to shinai.
Miyo, sore ga utsushiueraretara, mata sakaerude arou ka. Higashikaze ga kore o utsu toki, sore wa karete shimawanaide arou ka. Sono sodatta naedoko de karenaide arou ka".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hangyaku no ie ni ie. Korera ga nan de aru ka o anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Karera ni ie, miyo, Babiron no ou ga Erusaremu ni kite, sono ou totsuka sato o torae, kore o Babiron ni hiite itta.
Mata ou no shison no hitori o toraete, kore to keiyaku o musubi, chikai o tatesase, mata kuni no omo datta hitobito o toraete itta.
Kore wa kono kuni o iyashiku shite, mizukara tatsu koto ga dekinai you ni shi, sono keiyaku o mamoru koto ni yotte tataseru tame de aru.
Shikashi kare wa Babiron no ou ni somuki, shisha o Ejiputo ni okutte, uma to ooku no hei to o soko kara eyou to shita. Kare wa seikou surudarou ka. Kono you na koto o nasu mono wa, nogareru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Keiyaku o yabutte nao nogareru koto ga dekiyou ka. Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, kanarazu kare wa jibun o ou to nashita ou no sumu tokoro, kare ga tateta chikai o karonji, sono keiyaku o yabutta aite no ou no iru Babiron de kare wa shinu.
Ooku no inochi o tatsu tame ni rui o kizuki, untei o tateru toki, Paro wa kesshite ooinaru gunzei to, ooku no hito to o motte, kare o tasukete tatakai o shinai.
Kare wa chikai o karonji, keiyaku o yaburi, sono te o ataete chikainagara, nao korera no koto o shita yue, nogareru koto wa dekinai.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, kare ga watashi no chikai o karonji, watashi no keiyaku o yabutta koto o, kanarazu kare no koube ni mukuiru.
Watashi wa waga ami o kare no ue ni uchi kake, kare o waga wana ni toraete, Babiron ni hiite iki, kare ga watashi ni mukatte okashita hangyaku no tame ni, sono tokoro de kare o sabaku.
Kare no subete no guntai no erinuki no heishi wa mina tsurugi ni taore, ikinokotta mono wa happou ni chirasareru. Soshite anata gata wa Shu naru watashi ga, kore o katatta koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa mata kouhaku no takai kozue kara shoueda o totte, kore o ue, sono wakame no itadaki kara yawarakai me o tsumitori, kore o takai sugureta yama ni ueru.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no takai yama ni kore o ueru. Kore wa eda o dashi, mi o musubi, migoto na kouhaku to nari, sono shita ni moromoro no shurui no kemono ga sumi, sono eda no kage ni kakushu no tori ga su o tsukuru.
Soshite no no subete no ki wa, Shu naru watashi ga takai ki o hikuku shi, hikui ki o takaku shi, midori no ki o karashi, kareki o midori ni suru koto o shiru you ni naru. Shu de aru watashi wa kore o katari, kore o suru no de aru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Anata gata ga Isuraeru no chi ni tsuite, kono kotowaza o mochii, 'Chichitachi ga, su i budou o tabeta no de kodomotachi no ha ga uku' to iu no wa donna wake ka.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, anata gata wa futatabi Isuraeru de kono kotowaza o mochiiru koto wa nai.
Miyo, subete no tamashii wa watashi no mono de aru. Chichi no tamashii mo ko no tamashii mo watashi no mono de aru. Tsumi o okashita tamashii wa kanarazu shinu.
Hito ga moshi tadashiku atte, koudou to seigi to o okonai,
Yama no ue de shokuji o sezu, mata me o agete Isuraeru no ie no guuzou o aogazu, tonaribito no tsuma o okasazu, kegare no toki ni aru onna ni chikazukazu,
Dare o moshi e tagezu, shichimotsu o kaeshi, kesshite ubawazu, shokumotsu o ueta mono ni atae, hadaka no mono ni ifuku o kise,
Risoku ya kouri o totte kasazu, te o hiite aku o okonawazu, hito to hito to no aida ni shinjitsu no sabaki o okonai,
Watashi no sadame ni ayumi, watashi no okite o chuujitsu ni mamorunaraba, kare wa tadashii hito de aru. Kare wa kanarazu ikiru koto ga dekiruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Shikashi kare ga ko o umi, sono ko ga arai mono de, hito no chi o nagashi, korera no gimu no hitotsu o mo okonawazu,
Kaette yama no ue de shokuji o shi, tonaribito no tsuma o okashi,
Toboshii mono ya mazushii mono o shi etage, mono o ubai, shichimotsu o kaesazu, me o agete guuzou o aogi, nikumubeki koto o okonai,
Risoku ya kouri o totte kasunaraba, sono ko wa ikirude arou ka. Kare wa ikiru koto wa dekinai. Kare wa korera no nikumubeki koto o shita no de, kanarazu shini, sono chi wa kare jishin ni kisuru.
Shikashi kare ga ko o umi, sono ko ga chichi no okonatta subete no tsumi o mite, osore, sono you na koto o okonawazu,
Yama no ue de shokuji sezu, me o agete Isuraeru no ie no guuzou o aogazu, tonaribito no tsuma o okasazu,
Dare o moshi e tagezu, shichimotsu o hiki tomezu, mono o ubawazu, kaette jibun no shokumotsu o ueta mono ni atae, hadaka no mono ni ifuku o kise,
Sono te o hiite aku o okonawazu, risoku ya kouri o torazu, watashi no okite o okonai, watashi no sadame ni ayumunaraba, kare wa sono chichi no aku no tame ni shinazu, kanarazu ikiru.
Shikashi sono chichi wa hito o kasume, sono kyoudai no mono o ubai, sono tami no naka de yoku nai koto o okonatta yue, miyo, kare wa sono aku no tame ni shinu.
Shikashi anata gata wa, 'Naze, ko wa chichi no aku o owanai no ka' to iu. Ko wa koudou to seigi to o okonai, watashi no subete no sadame o mamotte okonatta no de, kanarazu ikiru no de aru.
Tsumi o okasu tamashii wa shinu. Ko wa chichi no aku o owanai. Chichi wa ko no aku o owanai. Gijin no gi wa sono hito ni kishi, akunin no aku wa sono hito ni kisuru.
Shikashi, akunin ga moshi sono okonatta moromoro no tsumi o hanare, watashi no subete no sadame o mamori, koudou to seigi to o okonaunaraba, kare wa kanarazu ikiru. Shinu koto wa nai.
Sono okashita moromoro no toga wa, kare ni taishite oboerarenai. Kare wa sono nashita tadashii koto no tame ni ikiru.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa akunin no shi o konomude arou ka. Mushiro kare ga sono okonai o hanarete ikiru koto o kononde irude wa nai ka.
Shikashi gijin ga moshi sono gi o hanarete aku o okonai, akunin no nasu moromoro no nikumubeki koto o okonaunaraba, ikirude arou ka. Kare ga okonatta moromoro no tadashii koto wa oboerarenai. Kare wa sono okashita to ga to, sono okashita tsumi to no tame ni shinu.
Shikashi anata gata wa, 'Shu no okonai wa tadashiku nai' to iu. Isuraeru no ie yo, kike. Watashi no okonai wa tadashiku nai no ka. Tadashiku nai no wa, anata gata no okonaide wa nai ka.
Gijin ga sono gi o hanarete aku o okonai, sono tame ni shinunaraba, kare wa jibun no okonatta aku no tame ni shinu no de aru.
Shikashi akunin ga sono okonatta aku o hanarete, koudou to seigi to o okonaunaraba, kare wa jibun no inochi o sukuu koto ga dekiru.
Kare wa kaerimite, sono okashita subete no toga o hanareta no dakara kanarazu ikiru. Shinu koto wa nai.
Shikashi Isuraeru no ie wa 'Shu no okonai wa tadashiku nai' to iu. Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi no okonai wa, hatashite tadashiku nai no ka. Tadashiku nai no wa, anata gata no okonaide wa nai ka.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi wa anatagata o, onoono sono okonai ni shitagatte sabakuto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru. Kuiaratamete, anata gata no subete no toga o hanareyo. Samo nai to aku wa anatagata o horobosu.
Anata gata ga watashi ni taishite okonatta subete no toga o sutesari, atarashii kokoro to, atarashii rei to o e yo. Isuraeru no ie yo, anata gata wa dou shite shinde yokarou ka.
Watashi wa nanibi to no shi o mo yorokobanai no de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru. Sore yue, anata gata wa hirugaette iki yo".
Anata wa Isuraeru no kimitachi no tame ni kanashimi no uta o nobete
Ie, anata no haha wa shishi no uchi ni atte, donna me jishi de attarou. Kanojo wa wakai shishi no uchi ni fushite ko jishi o yashinatta.
Kanojo wa ko jishi no hitotsu o sodatetaga, sore wa wakai shishi to natte, emono o toru koto o manabi, hito o tabeta.
Kuniguni no hito wa kare ni taishite sakebigoe o age, otoshiana de kore o torae, kagi de kore o Ejiputo no chi ni hiite itta.
Me jishi wa jibun no omoi ga yabure, sono nozomi o ushinatta no o mita no de, hoka no ko jishi o totte, kore o wakai ko jishi to shita.
Kare wa shishi no uchi ni yukiki shi, wakai shishi to natte, emono o toru koto o manabi, hito o tabeta.
Kare wa sono yougai o arashi, sono machimachi o horoboshita. Sono hoeru koe ni yotte, sono chi to sono naka ni michiru mono to wa mina osoreta.
Soko de kuniguni no hito wa kare ni taishite shihou ni wana o mouke, kare ni ami o uchi kake, otoshiana de kare o toraeta.
Karera wa kagi o motte, kore o kago ni ire, kore o Babiron no ou no moto ni tsurete iki, kore o ori no naka ni irete, futatabi sono koe o Isuraeru no yamayama ni kikoesasenai you ni shita.
Anata no haha wa mizu no hotori ni utsushiuerareta budou hatake no budou no ki no you de, mizu ga ooi tame ni minori ga yoku, eda ga habikotta.
Sono tsuyoi miki wa kimi taru mono no tsue to natta. Sore wa shigemi no naka ni takaku sobie, ooku no eda o tsukete takaku mieta.
Shikashi kono budou no ki wa ikidoori ni yotte nukare, chi ni nageutare, higashikaze ga sore o karashi, sono mi wa mogitorare, sono tsuyoi miki wa karete, hi ni yakihorobosareta.
Ima kore wa arano ni, kawaita, mizu no nai chi ni utsushiuerare,
Hi ga sono miki kara dete, sono eda to mi to o horoboshita no de, tsuyoi miki de, kimi taru mono no tsue to narubeki mono wa soko ni nai. Kore ga kanashimi no kotoba, mata kanashimi no uta to natta.
Dainana nen no go gatsu tooka ni, Isuraeru no chouroutachi no aru hitobito ga, Shu ni tazuneru tame ni kite, watashi no mae ni zashita.
Toki ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no chouroutachi ni tsugete ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata ga watashi no moto ni kita no wa, watashi ni nani ka tazuneru tame de aru ka. Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, watashi wa anata gata no tazune ni kotaenai.
Anata wa karera o sabakou to suru no ka. Hito no ko yo, anata wa karera o sabakou to suru no ka. Sore nara karera no senzotachi no shita nikumubeki koto o karera ni shirase,
Katsu karera ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi ga Isuraeru o erabi, Yakobu no ie no shison ni chikai, Ejiputo no chi de watashi jishin o karera ni shirase karera ni chikatte, watashi wa anata gata no kami, Shu de aru to itta hi,
Sono hi ni watashi wa karera ni chikatte, Ejiputo no chi kara karera o michibikidashi, watashi ga karera no tame ni sagurimotometa chichi to mitsu to no nagareru chi, zenchi no naka de mottomo subarashii tokoro e ikaseru to itta.
Watashi wa karera ni itta, anata gata wa, onoono sono me o tanoshimaseru nikumubeki mono o suteyo. Ejiputo no guuzou o motte, sono mi o kegasu na. Watashi wa anata gata no kami, Shu de aru to.
Tokoro ga karera wa watashi ni somuki, watashi no iu koto o kikou to mo shinakatta. Karera wa, onoono sono me o tanoshimaseta nikumubeki mono o sutezu, mata Ejiputo no guuzou o sutenakatta. Sore de, watashi wa Ejiputo no chi no uchi de, watashi no ikidoori o karera ni sosogi, watashi no ikari o karera ni morasou to omotta.
Shikashi watashi wa watashi no na no tame ni koudou shita. Sore wa Ejiputo no chi kara karera o michibikidashite, shuui ni sunde ita ihoujin tachi ni, watashi no koto o shirase, watashi no na ga karera no me no mae ni, hazukashimerarenai tame de aru.
Sunawachi, watashi wa Ejiputo no chi kara karera o michibikidashite, arano ni tsurete iki,
Watashi no sadame o karera ni sazuke, watashi no okite o karera ni shimeshita. Kore wa hito ga kore o okonau koto ni yotte ikiru mono de aru.
Watashi wa mata karera ni ansokunichi o ataete, watashi to karera to no aida no shirushi to shita. Kore wa Shu naru watashi ga karera o seibetsu shita koto o, karera ni shiraseru tame de aru.
Shikashi Isuraeru no ie wa arano de watashi ni somuki, watashi no sadame ni ayumazu, hito ga sore o okonau koto ni yotte, ikiru koto no dekiru watashi no okite o sute, ooini watashi no ansokunichi o kegashita. Soko de watashi wa arano de, watashi no ikidoori o karera no ue ni sosogi, kore o horobosou to omottaga,
Watashi wa watashi no na no tame ni koudou shita. Sore wa watashi ga karera o michibikidashite miseta ihoujin no mae ni, watashi no na ga kegasarenai tame de aru.
Tadashi, watashi wa arano de karera ni chikai, watashi ga karera ni ataeta chichi to mitsu to no nagareru chi, zenchi no mottomo subarashii chi ni, karera o michibikanai to itta.
Kore wa karera ga sono kokoro ni guuzou o shitatte, waga okite o sute, waga sadame ni ayumazu, waga ansokunichi o kegashitakara de aru.
Keredo mo watashi wa karera o oshimi mite, karera o horobosazu, arano de karera o tayasanakatta.
Watashi wa mata arano de karera no kodomotachi ni itta, anata gata no senzo no sadame ni ayunde wa naranai. Sono okite o mamotte wa naranai. Sono guuzou o motte, anata gata no mi o kegashite wa naranai.
Shu naru watashi wa anata gata no kami de aru. Waga sadame ni ayumi, waga okite o mamotte kore o okonai,
Waga ansokunichi o seibetsu seyo. Kore wa watashi to anata gata to no aida no shirushi to natte, Shu naru watashi ga anata gata no kami de aru koto o, anata gata ni shiraseru tame de aru.
Shikashi sono kodomotachi wa watashi ni somuki, waga sadame ni ayumazu, hito ga kore o okonau koto ni yotte, ikiru koto no dekiru watashi no okite o mamori okonawazu, waga ansokunichi o kegashita. Soko de watashi wa waga ikidoori o karera no ue ni sosogi, arano de karera ni taishi, waga ikari o morasou to omotta.
Shikashi watashi wa waga te o hirugaeshite, waga na no tame ni koudou shita. Sore wa watashi ga karera o michibikidashite miseta ihoujin no mae ni, watashi no na ga kegasarenai tame de aru.
Tadashi watashi wa arano de karera ni chikai, watashi wa ihoujin no aida ni karera o chirashi, kuniguni no naka ni karera o furimaku to itta.
Kore wa karera ga waga okite o okonawazu, waga sadame o sute, waga ansokunichi o kegashi, karera no me ni sono senzo no guuzou o shitattakara de aru.
Mata watashi wa karera ni yoku nai sadame to, sore ni yotte ikiru koto no dekinai okite to o atae,
Soshite, karera no ui go ni hi no naka o tooraseru sono sonaemono ni yotte, karera o kegashi, karera o osoresaseta. Watashi ga kore o okonatta no wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o, karera ni shiraseru tame de aru.
Sore yue hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie ni tsugete ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata no senzo wa mata, fushin no tsumi o okashite watashi o kegashita.
Watashi ga karera ni ataeyou to chikatta chi ni, karera o michibikiireta toki, karera wa subete no takai oka to, subete no shigetta ki to o mite, sono tokoro de gisei o sasage, imubeki sonaemono o sasage, mata koubashii kaori o sono tokoro ni noborase, sono tokoro ni kansai o sosoida.
(watashi wa karera ni itta, anata gata ga kayou sono takaki tokoro wa nan de aru ka. Sore de sono na wa konnichi made Bama to tonaerarete iru.)
Sore yue, Isuraeru no ie ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa, sono senzo no okonai ni shitagatte, sono mi o kegashi, sono nikumubeki mono o shitau no ka.
Anata gata wa, sono sonaemono o sasage, sono kotomo ni hi no naka o toorasete, konnichi made subete no guuzou o motte, sono mi o kegasu no de aru. Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi wa, nao anata gata ni tazunerarerubekide arou ka. Watashi wa ikite iru. Watashi wa kesshite anata gata ni tazunerareru hazu wa naito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Anata gata no kokoro ni aru koto, sunawachi 'Wareware wa ihoujin no you ni nari, kuniguni no moromoro no yakara no you ni natte, ki ya ishi o ogamou' to no kangae wa kesshite jouju shinai.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru, watashi wa kanarazu tsuyoi te to nobeta ude to sosogareta ikidoori to o motte, anatagata o osameru.
Watashi wa waga tsuyoi te to nobeta ude to sosogareta ikidoori to o motte, anatagata o moromoro no tami no naka kara michibikidashi, sono chirasareta kuniguni kara atsume,
Moromoro no tami no arano ni michibikiire, sono tokoro de kao to kao to o awasete, anatagata o sabaku.
Sunawachi, Ejiputo no chi no arano de, anata gata no senzo o sabaita you ni, watashi wa anatagata o sabakuto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Watashi wa anata gata ni, muchi no shita o toorase, kazoete hairase,
Anata gata no uchi kara, shitagawanu mono to, watashi ni somuita mono to o wakachi, sono kiryuu shita chi kara, karera o michibikidasu. Shikashi karera wa Isuraeru no chi ni iru koto wa dekinai. Kou shite anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Sore de, Isuraeru no ie yo, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa watashi ni kikanainara, ima mo nochi mo, onoono sono guuzou ni itte tsukaeru ga yoi. Shikashi futatabi sonaemono to guuzou to o motte, watashi no sei naru na o kegashite wa naranai.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi no sei naru yama, Isuraeru no takai yama no ue de, Isuraeru no zenka wa sono chi de, kotogotoku watashi ni tsukaeru. Sono tokoro de watashi wa yorokonde karera o ukeire, anata gata no sasagemono to saijou no sonaemono to o, sono sei naru sasagemono to tomo ni motomeru.
Watashi ga anatagata o moromoro no tami no naka kara michibikidashi, katsute anatagata o chirashita kuniguni kara atsumeru toki, koubashii kaori to shite, anatagata o yorokonde ukeireru. Soshite watashi wa ihoujin no mae de, anata gata no naka ni, watashi no sei naru koto o arawasu.
Kou shite watashi ga anatagata o, Isuraeru no chi, sunawachi anata gata no senzotachi ni ataeru to chikatta chi ni, hairaseru toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Mata sono tokoro de anata gata wa, sono mi o kegashita anata gata no okonaito, subete no wazato o omoidashi, mizukara okonatta subete no akuji no tame ni, jibun o imikirau you ni naru.
Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi ga anata gata no ashiki okonai ni yorazu, mata sono kusareta waza ni yorazu, watashi no na no tame ni, anatagata o atsukau toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru no de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, kao o minami ni muke, minami ni mukatte katari, Negebu no mori no chi ni taishite yogen seyo.
Sunawachi Negebu no mori ni ie, Shu no kotoba o kike, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata no uchi ni hi o moyasu. Sono hi wa anata no uchi no subete no aoki to, subete no kareki o yakihoroboshi, sono moeru honoo wa kesareru koto ga naku, minami kara kita made, subete no chi no omote wa, kore ga tame ni yakeru.
Subete niku naru mono wa, Shu naru watashi ga kore o yaita koto o miru. Sono hi wa kesarenai".
Soko de watashi wa itta, "Aa Shu naru kami yo, karera wa watashi ni tsuite kou katatte imasu, 'Kare wa tatoe o motte kataru mono de wa nai ka' to".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Erusaremu ni muke, anata no kotoba o seijo ni mukete nobe, Isuraeru no chi ni mukatte yogen shi,
Isuraeru no chi ni ie. Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata o seme, watashi no tsurugi o saya kara nuki, anata no uchi kara, tadashii mono mo ashiki mono o mo tatte shimau.
Watashi ga anata no uchi kara, tadashii mono mo ashiki mono o mo tatsu yue ni, watashi no tsurugi wa saya kara nukedete, minami kara kita made no subete no niku naru mono o semeru.
Subete niku naru mono wa, Shu naru watashi ga, sono tsurugi o saya kara nukihanatta koto o shiru. Kono tsurugi wa futatabi saya ni osamerarenai.
Sore yue, hito no ko yo, nageke, kokoro kudakeru made ni nageki, karera no me no mae de itaku nageke.
Hito ga anata ni mukatte, 'Naze nageku no ka' to iunara, 'Kono shirase no tame de aru. Sore ga kureba hito no kokoro wa mina toke, te wa mina nae, rei wa mina yowari, hiza wa mina mizu no you ni naru. Miyo, sore wa kuru, kanarazu jouju suru' to ie" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, yogen shite ie, Shu wa kou iwareru, tsurugi ga aru, togi, katsu, migaita tsurugi ga aru.
Korosu tame ni toide ari, inazuma no you ni kirameku tame ni migaite aru. Watashitachi wa yorokobu koto ga dekiru ka. Waga ko yo, anata wa tsue to, subete ki de tsukutta mono to o karonjita.
Kono tsurugi wa te ni toru tame ni, togare, korosu mono no te ni watasu tame ni, togare migakareru no de aru.
Hito no ko yo, sakebi nageke, kono koto wa waga tami ni nozomi, Isuraeru no subete no kimitachi ni nozomukara de aru. Karera wa waga tami to tomo ni tsurugi ni watasareru. Sore yue, anata no momo o ute.
Kore wa tameshi ni suru koto de wa nai. Moshi anata ga, tsue o azakettara, dou iu koto ni narou ka" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
"Sore yue, hito no ko yo, anata wa yogen shi, te o uchinarase. Tsurugi o ni do mo san do mo nozomase yo. Kore wa hito o korosu tsurugi, ooini korosu tsurugi de atte, karera o kakomu mono de aru.
Kore ga tame ni karera no kokoro wa toke, ooku no mono ga subete no mon ni taoreru. Watashi wa hirameku tsurugi o karera ni okuru. Aa, kore wa inazuma no you ni nari, hito o korosu tame ni migakarete iru.
Anata no ha no mukau tokoro de, migi ni hidari ni nagitaose.
Watashi mo mata, watashi no te o uchinarashi, watashi no ikari o shizumeruto, Shu naru watashi wa itta".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Babiron no ou no tsurugi ga kuru tame ni, futatsu no michi o sonae yo. Kono futatsu no michi wa hitotsu no kuni kara dete iru. Anata wa michishirube o tsukuri, kore o machi ni mukau michi no hajime ni oke.
Anata wa mata Anmon no hitobito no Raba to, Yuda to, kengo na shiro no machi Erusaremu to ni tsurugi no kuru michi o moukeyo.
Babiron no ou wa michi no wakareme, futatsu no michi no hajime ni tatte uranai o shi, ya o furi, Terapimu ni toi, kimo o miru.
Kare no migi ni Erusaremu no tame ni uranai ga deru. Sunawachi kuchi o hiraite sakebi, koe o age, toki o tsukuri, mon ni mukatte shiro kuzushi o mouke, rui o kizuki, untei o tateyo to iu.
Shikashi kore wa karera no me ni wa itsuwari no uranai to omoware, karera wa kata ki chikai o nashita. Shikashi kare wa, karera o toraeru koto ni yotte, tsumi o omoidasaseru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata no tsumi wa oboerare, sono hangyaku wa araware, sono tsumi wa subete no waza ni arawareru. Kono you ni anata gata wa, sudeni oboerarete irukara, karera no te ni toraerareru.
Kegareta akunin de aru Isuraeru no kimi yo, anata no owari no keibatsu no toki de aru sono hi ga kuru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, kaburimono o nugi, kanmuri o torihanase. Subete no mono wa, sono mama ni wa nokoranai. Iyashii mono wa takaku sare, takai mono wa iyashiku sareru.
A a hametsu, hametsu, hametsu, watashi wa kore o kosaseru. Watashi ga ataeru ken'i o motsu mono ga kuru toki made, sono atokata sae mo nokoranai.
Hito no ko yo, yogen shite ie. Shu naru kami wa Anmon no hitobito to, sono azakeri ni tsuite, kou iwareru, tsurugi ga aru. Kono tsurugi wa korosu tame ni nukare, inazuma no you ni hikari kirameku you ni togarete iru.
Karera ga anata ni itsuwari no maboroshi o shimeshi, itsuwari o uranatta yue, kore wa korosarubeki ashiki mono no kubi no ue ni okareru. Karera no owari no keibatsu no toki de aru sono hi ga kite iru.
Kore o saya ni osameyo, watashi wa anata no tsukurareta tokoro, anata no umareta chi de anata o sabaku.
Watashi no ikari o anata ni sosogi, watashi no ikidoori no hi o anata ni mukete moyashi, horobosu koto ni takumi na zannin na hito no te ni anata o watasu.
Anata wa hi no tame no, takigi to nari, anata no chi wa kuni no naka ni nagasare, oboerareru koto wa nai, Shu naru watashi ga iu".
Mata Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde itta,
"Hito no ko yo, anata wa sabaku no ka. Chi o nagasu kono machi o sabaku no ka. Sore nara kono machi ni sono moromoro no nikumubeki koto o shimeshite,
Ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, jibun no uchi ni chi o nagashite, sono keibatsu no toki o maneki, guuzou o tsukutte sono mi o kegasu machi yo,
Anata wa sono nagashita chi ni yotte tsumi o e, sono tsukutta guuzou ni yotte kegare, anata no hi o chikazukase, anata no nen no sadame no toki wa kita. Sore yue watashi wa anata o moromoro no kokumin no azakeri to nashi, bankoku no monowarai to suru.
Anata ni chikai mono mo, tooi mono mo, kegare to, konran ni michite iru anata o azakeru.
Miyo, anata no uchi no Isuraeru no kimitachi wa, onoono sono chikara ni shitagatte, chi o nagasou to shite iru.
Fubo wa anata no uchi de iyashimerare, kiryuusha wa anata no uchi de gyakutai o uke, minashigo to, yamome to wa anata no uchi de nayamasarete iru.
Anata wa watashi no sei naru mono o iyashime, watashi no ansokunichi o kegashita.
Hito o nonoshitte chi o nagasou to suru mono wa, anata no uchi ni ori, hitobito wa anata no uchi de, yama no ue de shokuji o shi, anata no uchi de, midara na okonai o shi,
Anata no uchi de, chichi no hadaka o arawashi, anata no uchi de, kegare no uchi ni aru onna o okasu.
Mata anata no uchi ni, sono tonari no tsuma to nikumubeki koto o okonau mono ga ari, inkou o motte, sono yome o kegasu mono ga ari, jibun no chichi no musume de aru jibun no shimai o okasu mono ga ari,
Mata chi o nagasou to shite, anata no uchi de, mainai o toru mono ga aru. Anata wa risoku to kouri to o tori, shi etage ni yotte, anata no tonaribito no mono o kasume, soshite watashi o wasurete shimatta to, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Sore yue miyo, anata ga eta fusei no ri no koto, oyobi anata no uchi ni aru ryuuketsu no koto ni taishite, watashi wa te o uchinarasu.
Watashi ga anata o semeru hi ni wa, anata no yuuki wa, kore ni tae eyou ka. Mata anata no te wa tsuyoku ari eyou ka. Shu naru watashi wa kore o sengen shi, kore o nasu.
Watashi wa anata o, moromoro no kokumin no uchi ni chirashi, kuniguni no aida ni maki, soshite anata kara kegare o nozoku.
Watashi wa anata ni yotte, moromoro no kokumin no mae ni kegasareru. Soshite anata wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie wa watashi ni taishite, ka nakasu to natta. Karera wa subete ro no naka no gin, seidou, suzu, tetsu, namari no kana kasu to natta.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa mina ka nakasu to natta yue, miyo, watashi wa anatagata o Erusaremu no naka ni atsumeru.
Hito ga gin, seidou, tetsu, namari, suzu nado o ro no naka ni atsume, kore ni hi o fukikakete tokasu you ni, watashi wa ikari to ikidoori to o motte, anatagata o atsume irete tokasu.
Sunawachi, watashi wa anatagata o atsume, watashi no ikari no hi o, anata gata ni fukikakeru. Anata gata wa sono naka de tokeru.
Gin ga ro no naka de tokeru you ni, anata gata mo sono naka de tokeru. Soshite anata gata wa Shu naru watashi ga, anata gata no ue ni, watashi no ikari o sosoida koto o shiru you ni naru".
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, kore ni ie, anata wa ikari no hi ni kiyomerarezu, mata ame no furanai chi de aru.
Sono naka no kimitachi wa, emono o saku hoeru shishi no you na mono de, karera wa hitobito o horoboshi, takara to tattoi mono to o tori, sono uchi ni, yamome no kazu o fuyasu.
Sono saishitachi wa waga rippou o okashi, sei naru mono o kegashita. Karera wa sei naru mono to kegareta mono to o kubetsu sezu, kiyoku nai mono to kiyoi mono to no chigai o oshiezu, waga ansokunichi o mushi shi, kou shite watashi wa karera no aida ni kegasarete iru.
Sono naka ni iru kimitachi wa, emono o saku ookami no you de, chi o nagashi, fusei no ri o eru tame ni hitobito o horobosu.
Sono yogensha tachi wa, mizu shikkui de kore o nuri, itsuwari no maboroshi o mi, karera ni itsuwari o uranai, Shu ga kataranai no ni 'Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru' to iu.
Kuni no tami wa shi etage o okonai, ubau koto o nashi, toboshii mono to mazushii mono to o kasume, fuhou ni takokujin o shi eta gu.
Watashi wa, kuni no tame ni ishigaki o kizuki, watashi no mae ni atte, yabure kuchi ni tachi, watashi ni kore o horobosasenai you ni suru mono o, karera no uchi ni tazunetaga erarenakatta.
Sore yue, watashi wa waga ikari o karera no ue ni sosogi, waga ikidoori no hi o motte karera o horoboshi, karera no okonai o, sono koube ni mukuita to, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, koko ni futari no onna ga atta. Hitori no haha no musume de aru.
Karera wa Ejiputo de inkou o shita. Karera wa wakai toki ni inkou o shita. Sunawachi sono tokoro de karera no mune wa osare, sono shojo no chibusa wa ijirareta.
Karera no na wa ane wa Ahora, imouto wa Ahoriba de aru. Karera wa watashi no mono to natte, musuko musumetachi o unda. Sono honmyou wa Ahora wa Samariya, Ahoriba wa Erusaremu de aru.
Ahora wa watashi no mono de aru aida ni inkou o nashi, sono koibito naru Assuriya bito ni kogareta.
Sunawachi murasaki no koromo o kita gunjin, choukan, shireikan, subete konomashii wakamono, uma ni noru monotachi de aru.
Kanojo wa karera ni inkou o sonaeta. Karera wa subete ASsuriya no erinuki no hitobito de aru. Kanojo wa mata, sono kogareta subete no mono no moromoro no guuzou o motte, onore o kegashita.
Kanojo wa Ejiputo no hi kara okonatte ita, sono inkou o sutenakatta. Sore wa kanojo no wakai toki ni, karera ga kanojo to ne, sono shojo no chibusa o ijiri, sono jouyoku o kanojo no ue ni sosoidakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa kanojo o sono koibito no te ni watashi, sono kogareta ASsuriya no hitobito no te ni watashita.
Karera wa kanojo no hadaka o arawashi, sono musuko musumetachi o ubai, tsurugi o motte kanojo o koroshita. Kou shite kanojo ni taisuru sabaki ga okonawareta toki, kanojo wa onnatachi no aida no katarikusa to natta.
Sono imouto Ahoriba wa kore o mite, ane yori mo jouyoku o hoshiimama ni shi, ane no inkou yori mo ooku inkou o nashi,
ASsuriya no hitobito ni koi kogareta. Choukan, shireikan, seisou shita gunjin, uma ni noru monotachi de, subete konomashii wakamonotachi de aru.
Watashi wa kanojo ga mi o kegashita no o mita. Karera wa tomo ni hitotsu no michi o tadottaga,
Kanojo wa sarani sono inkou o tsuzuke, kabe ni egaita hitobito o mita. Sunawachi shu de egaita Karudeya bito no zou de,
Koshi ni wa obi o musubi, atama ni wa taresagatta zukin o itadaite ita. Korera wa mina kanri no you na sugata de, sono umareta kuni Karudeya no Babironhito ni nite ita.
Kanojo wa korera o mite, kore ni koi kogare, shisha o Karudeya no karera no moto ni okutta.
Soko de Babiron no hitobito wa kanojo no moto ni kite, koi no toko ni tsuki, jouyoku o motte kanojo o kegashitaga, kanojo wa karera ni kegasareru ni oyonde, sono kokoro wa karera kara hanareta.
Kanojo ga sono inkou o kouzen to tsuzuke, sono hadaka o sarashita no de, watashi no kokoro wa kanojo kara hanareta. Kore wa atakamo watashi no kokoro ga, kanojo no ane kara hanareta to douyou de aru.
Shikashi kanojo wa nao Ejiputo no chi de kan'in o shita sono wakaki hi o oboete, sono inkou o tsuzuke,
Sono joufutachi ni koi kogareta. Sono hito no niku wa, roba no niku no gotoku, sono sei wa uma no sei no you de atta.
Kono you ni anata wa, kano Ejiputo bito ga, anata no mune ni te o tsuke, anata no wakai chibusa o osaeta toki no, wakai toki no inkou o shitatte iru".
Sore yue, Ahoriba yo, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Miyo, watashi wa, anata no kokoro ga sudeni hanareta anata no koibitora o okoshite, anata o semesase, karera ni shihou kara kite anata o semesaseru.
Sunawachi Babiron no hitobito oyobi Karudeya no subete no hitobito, Pekode, Shoa, Koa, ASsuriya no subete no hitobito, konomashii wakamono, choukan, shireikan, kanri, gunjin nado, subete uma ni noru monotachi de aru.
Karera wa sensha, kasha, oyobi ooku no tami o hikiite, kita kara anata ni semete kuru. Oodate, kodate, kabuto o sonaete, shihou kara anata ni semekakaru. Watashi ga karera ni sabaki o yudaneru yue, karera wa, sono okite ni shitagatte, anata o sabaku.
Watashi wa anata ni mukatte watashi no ikidoori o okosu yue, karera wa ikari o motte anata o atsukai, anata no hana to mimi to o kiriotoshi, soshite nokori no mono wa tsurugi ni taoreru. Karera wa anata no musuko musumetachi o ubai, ikinokotta mono o hi de yaku.
Karera wa mata anata no ifuku o hagitori, anata no utsukushii kazari o torisaru.
Kou shite watashi wa anata no inran to, Ejiputo no chi kara motte kita inkou to o torinozoki, kasanete anata no me o, Ejiputo bito ni mukete agesasezu, karera no koto o omowanai you ni suru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata no nikumu mono no te, anata no kokoro no hanareta mono no te ni anata o watasu.
Karera wa nikushimi o motte anata o atsukai, anata no shotoku o kotogotoku torisari, anata o akahadaka ni shi, anata no inkou no hadaka o arawasu. Anata no inran to inkou to no yue ni,
Sunawachi, anata ga ihoujin o shitatte kan'in o okonai, karera no guuzou o motte mi o kegashita yue ni, korera no koto ga anata ni nozomu no da.
Anata wa sono ane no michi o ayunda no de, watashi mo kanojo no sakazuki o anata ni watasu.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa ane no fukai, ookina sakazuki o nomi, waraimono to nari, azakeri to naru, kono sakazuki ni wa sorera ga ooku komotte iru.
Anata wa yoi to urei to ni mitasareru. Odoroki to horobi no sakazuki, kore ga anata no aneSamariya no sakazuki de aru.
Anata wa kore o nomi kore o katamuke, anata no kaminoke o hikimushiri, anata no chibusa o kakisaku. Watashi ga kore o iuto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa watashi o wasure, watashi o anata no ushiro ni sutesatta yue, anata wa jibun no inran to inkou to no tsumi o owaneba naranu".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Hito no ko yo, anata wa Ahora to Ahoriba o sabaku no ka. Sore naraba karera ni sono nikumubeki koto o tsuge yo.
Karera wa kan'in o okonai, chi ga karera no te no ue ni aru. Karera wa sono guuzou to kan'in o okonai, mata watashi ni unda kora o, shokumotsu no tame ni karera ni sasageta.
Sarani karera wa, watashi ni taishite kono you ni shita. Sunawachi, karera wa onaji hi ni watashi no seijo o kegashi, watashi no ansokunichi o okashita.
Karera wa sono kora o, guuzou ni sasageru tame ni hofutta onaji hi ni, watashi no seijo ni kite, kore o kegashita. Miyo, karera ga watashi no ie no naka deshita koto wa kore de aru.
Sarani karera wa shisha o yatte, tooku kara kuru you ni hitobito o maneita. Miyo, karera wa kita. Anata wa, kono hitobito no tame ni mi o arai, me o egaki, kazarimono o mi ni tsuke,
Tattoi toko ni zashi, shokutaku o sono mae ni mouke, watashi no kou to, watashi no abura to o, sono ue ni sonaeta.
Kou shite, nonki na gunshuu no koe wa kanojo to tomo ni ari, mata, arano kara tsurete kita toorigakari no yoidore mo, karera to tomo ni ita. Karera wa onnatachi no te ni udewa o hamesase, atama ni utsukushii kanmuri o itadakaseta.
Soko de watashi wa itta, kanojo to kan'in o okonau toki, hitobito wa kan'in o okasanaide arou ka.
Hito ga yuujo no tokoro ni wa iru you ni, karera wa kanojo no tokoro ni haitta. Kou shite karera wa kan'in o okonau tame ni, Ahora oyobi Ahoriba no tokoro ni haitta.
Shikashi tadashii hitobito wa inpu no sabaki to, chi o nagashita onna no sabaki to o motte, karera o sabaku. Sore wa karera ga inpu de atte, sono te ni chi ga arukara de aru".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa guntai o karera ni mukatte semenoborase, karera o osore to ryakudatsu to ni watasu.
Guntai wa karera o ishi de uchi, tsurugi de kiri, sono musuko musumetachi o koroshi, hi de sono ie o yaku.
Kou shite watashi wa kono chi ni inran o tayasu. Subete no onna wa mizukara imashimete, anata gata ga shita you na inran o okonawanai.
Anata gata no inran no mukui wa, anata gata no ue ni kudari, anata gata wa sono guuzou reihai no tsumi o oi, soshite watashi ga Shu naru kami de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Daikyuu nen no juu gatsu tooka ni, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata wa kono hi sunawachi konnichi no na o kakishiruse. Babiron no ou wa, kono hi Erusaremu o houi shita.
Anata wa kono hangyaku no ie ni tatoe o katatte ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, kamasu o sue, kore o suete, mizu o kumiire yo.
Sono naka ni niku no kire o ireyo, subete yoi niku no kire, sunawachi, momo to kata no niku o kore ni ireyo. Yoi hone o kore ni mitase.
Hitsuji no mottomo yoi mono o tore. Kama no shita ni maki o tsumi, sono niku o ni tagirase, mata sono naka no hone o ni yo.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, wazawai naru ka na, ryuuketsu no machi, sabite iru kama. Sono sabi wa kore o hanarenai. Niku o hitotsu bitotsu musabetsu ni toridase.
Sono nagashita chi wa mada sono naka ni aru. Kanojo wa kore o hadakaiwa no ue ni nagashi, tsuchi de kore o oou tame ni, jimen ni wa sosoganakatta.
Kore wa, watashi no ikari o tsunorase, ada o kaesu tame ni, sono nagashita chi ga oowarenai you ni, hadakaiwa no ue ni nagashita no de aru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, wazawai naru ka na, ryuuketsu no machi. Watashi mo mata, maki o sarani tsumikasaneru.
Maki o tsumikasane, hi o moyashi, niku o yoku nite, ni tsukushi, hone o yake.
Soshite kama o atsuku suru tame, sore o kara ni shite sumibi no ue ni oki, sono dou o yaite, kegare o sono naka ni tokashi, sono sabi o sare.
Shikashi watashi no honeori wa, muda de atta. Sono ooku no sabi wa hi ni yotte kienai.
Sono sabi to wa, anata no fuketsu na inkou de aru. Watashi wa anata o kiyomeyou to shitaga, anata wa anata no fuketsu kara kiyomerareyou to shinaikara, watashi no ikari o anata ni morashi tsukusu made wa, anata wa kegare kara kiyomaru koto wa nai.
Shu naru watashi wa kore o itta. Soshite kore wa kanarazu naru. Watashi wa kore o nasu. Watashi wa yamenai, oshimanai, kuinai. Anata no okonai ni yori, anata no waza ni yotte, anata o sabakuto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Mata Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, miyo, watashi wa, niwaka ni anata no me no yorokobu mono o torisaru. Nageite wa naranai. Naite wa naranai. Namida o nagashite wa naranai.
Koe o tatezu ni nageke. Shinin no tame ni nagekikanashimu na. Zukin o kaburi, ashi ni kutsu o hake. Kuchi o oou na. Nageki no pan o taberu na".
Asa no uchi ni, watashi wa hitobito ni katattaga, yuube ni wa, watashi no tsuma wa shinda. Yokuasa watashi wa meijirareta you ni shita.
Hitobito wa watashi ni itta, "Anata ga suru kono koto wa, wareware ni nan no kankei ga aru no ka, sore o wareware ni tsugete wa kuremai ka".
Watashi wa karera ni itta, "Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
'Isuraeru no ie ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata gata no chikara no hokori, me no yorokobi, kokoro no nozomi de aru waga seijo o kegasu. Anata gata ga nokosu musuko musumetachi wa, tsurugi ni taoreru.
Anata gata mo watashi ga shita you ni shi, kuchi o oowazu, nageki no pan o tabezu,
Atama ni zukin o kaburi, ashi ni kutsu o haki, nagekazu, nakazu, sono tsumi no naka ni yaseotoroete, tagai ni umeku you ni naru.
Kono you ni Ezekieru wa anata gata no tame ni shirushi to naru. Kare ga shita you ni anata gata mo seyo. Kono koto ga naru toki, anata gata wa watashi ga Shu naru kami de aru koto o shiru you ni naru'.
Hito no ko yo, watashi ga, karera no tori de, karera no yorokobi to sakae, karera no me no yorokobi de ari, sono kokoro no nozomi de aru mono, mata karera no musuko musumetachi o torisaru hi,
Sono hi ni nan o nogarete kuru mono ga, anata no moto ni kite, anata ni koto o tsugeru.
Sono hi anata wa, sono no ga rete kita mono ni mukatte kuchi o hiraki, katari, mohaya chinmoku shinai. Kou shite anata wa karera no tame ni shirushi to nari, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Anmon no hitobito ni muke, kore ni mukatte yogen shi,
Anmon no hitobito ni ie. Shu naru kami no kotoba o kike. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa waga seijo no kegasareta toki, mata Isuraeru no chi no arasareta toki, mata Yuda no ie ga toraeutsusareta toki, aa, sore wa yoi kimi de aru to itta.
Sore yue, watashi wa anata o, higashi no hitobito ni watashite karera no shoyuu to suru. Karera wa anata no uchi ni jin'ei o mouke, anata no uchi ni juukyo o tsukuri, anata no kudamono o tabe, anata no chichi o nomu.
Watashi wa Raba o, rakuda o kau tokoro to shi, Anmon bito no machimachi o, hitsuji no fusu tokoro to suru. Soshite anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa Isuraeru no chi ni mukatte te o uchi, ashi o fumi, kokoro ni akui o mitashite yorokonda.
Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa waga te o anata ni mukete nobe, anata o, moromoro no kokumin ni watashite ryakudatsu ni awase, anata o, moromoro no tami no naka kara tachi, shokoku no naka kara horoboshi tayasu. Soshite anata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Shu naru kami wa watashi ni kou iwareru, Moabu wa itta, miyo, Yuda no ie wa, ta no subete no kokumin to douyou de aru to.
Sore yue, watashi wa Moabu no kyoukai no machimachi, sunawachi kuni no sakae de aru Beteeshimote, Baarumeon, Kiriataimu no yokobara o hiraki,
Kore o Anmon no hitobito to tomo ni, touhou no hitobito ni ataete, sono shoyuu to shi, Moabu no hitobito o moromoro no kokumin no naka ni kioku sasenai.
Watashi wa Moabu no ue ni sabaki o okonau. Sono toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Edomu wa urami o fukunde Yuda no ie ni tekitai shi, kore ni urami o kaeshite, hanahadashiku tsumi o okashita.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa Edomu no ue ni te o nobete, sono naka kara hito to kemono to o tachi, kore o arechi to suru. Teman kara Dedan made hitobito wa tsurugi ni taoreru.
Watashi wa waga tami Isuraeru no te o motte, Edomu ni waga ada o mukuiru. Karera ga waga ikari, waga ikidoori ni shitagatte Edomu ni okonau toki, Edomu no hitobito wa, watashi ga ada o kaesu koto o shiru you ni naruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Perishite bi to wa urami o fukunde koudou shi, kokoro ni akui o motte ada o kaeshi, fukai tekii o motte, horobosu koto o shita.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa te o Perishite bito no ue ni nobe, Kerete bito o tachi, umibe no nokori no mono o horobosu.
Watashi wa ikari ni michita choubatsu o motte, ooinaru fukushuu o karera ni nasu. Watashi ga karera ni ada o kaesu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru".
Daijuu ichi nen no daiichi nichi ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Tsuro wa Erusaremu ni tsuite itta, 'Aa, sore wa yoi kimi de aru. Moromoro no tami no mon wa yaburete, watashi ni hirakareta. Watashi wa yutaka ni nari, kare wa yabure hateta' to.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Tsuro yo, watashi wa anata o seme, umi ga sono nami o okosu you ni, watashi wa ooku no kokumin o, anata ni seme kosaseru.
Karera wa Tsuro no jouheki o kowashi, sono yagura o taosu. Watashi wa sono tsuchi o haraisatte, hadaka no iwa ni suru.
Tsuro wa umi no naka ni atte, ami o haru basho ni naru. Kore wa watashi ga itta no de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru. Tsuro wa, moromoro no tami ni kasumerare,
Sono hondo ni oru musumetachi wa, tsurugi de korosareru. Soshite karera wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa ou no ou naru Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ni, uma, sensha, kihei, oyobi ooku no gunzei o hikiite, kita kara Tsuro ni seme kosaseru.
Kare wa hondo ni oru anata no musumetachi o, tsurugi de koroshi, anata ni mukatte untei o tate, rui o kizuki, tate o sonae,
Shiro kuzushi o anata no jouheki ni muke, ono de anata no yagura o uchikudaku.
Sono ooku no uma no tsuchikemuri wa, anata o oou. Hito ga yabureta machi ni wa iru you ni, kare ga anata no mon ni wa iru toki, kihei to kasha to sensha no hibiki ni yotte, anata no ishigaki wa yurugu.
Kare wa sono uma no hizume de, anata no subete no chimata o fumi arashi, tsurugi de anata no tami o korosu. Anata no chikarazuyoi hashira wa chi ni taoreru.
Karera wa anata no zaihou o ubai, shouhin o kasume, jouheki o kuzushi, tanoshii ie o kowashi, ishi to ki to tsuchi to o mizu no naka ni nagekomu.
Watashi wa anata no uta no koe o todomeru. Koto no ne wa mohaya kikoenaku naru.
Watashi wa anata o hadaka no iwa ni suru. Anata wa ami o haru basho to nari, futatabi taterareru koto wa nai. Shu naru watashi ga kore o itta to, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Shu naru kami wa Tsuro ni kou iwareru, umizoi no kuniguni wa anata no taoreru hibiki, teoi no umeki, anata no uchi no satsujin no yue ni, miburui shinaide arou ka.
Sono toki, umi no kimitachi wa mina sono kurai kara ori, asa fuku o nugi, nuitori no ifuku o torisari, osore o mi ni matoi, chi ni zashite, itaku osore, anata no koto o odoroki,
Anata no tame ni kanashimi no uta o nobete iu, 'Anata wa umi ni atte, tsuyoi homare aru machi, hondo ni osore o ataete ita anata mo, sono juumin mo, umi kara kiesatta.
Shimajima wa anata no taoreru hi ni miburui suru. Umi no shimajima wa anata no sariiku koto o mite odoroku'.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa anata o, areta machi to nashi, sumu mono no nai machi no you ni shi, fuchi o anata ni mukatte wakiagarase, oomizu ni anata o oowaseru toki,
Anata o ana ni kudaru monodomo to tomo ni, mukashi no tami no tokoro ni kudashi, ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni shita no kuni ni, mukashi no mama no are ato no naka ni, anata o sumaseru. Sore yue, anata wa hito no sumu tokoro to narazu, mata nama aru mono no chi ni tokoro o enai.
Watashi wa anata no owari o, osorubeki mono to suru. Anata wa mu ni kisuru. Anata o tazuneru hito ga atte mo, eikyuu ni miidasanaito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Tsuro no tame ni kanashimi no uta o nobe,
Umi no iriguchi ni sunde, ooku no umizoi no kuniguni no tami no shounin de aru Tsuro ni taishite ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Tsuro yo, anata wa itta, 'Watashi no bi wa kanzen de aru' to.
Anata no sakai wa umi no naka ni ari, anata no kensetsusha wa anata no bi o kanzen ni shita.
Hitobito wa Seniru no momi no ki de anata no tame ni funaita o tsukuri, Rebanon kara kouhaku o totte, anata no tame ni hobashira o tsukuri,
Bashan no kashi no ki de, anata no tame ni kai o tsukuri, Kupuro no shima kara kuru matsu no ki ni zouge o hamete, anata no tame ni kanpan o tsukutta.
Anata no ho wa Ejiputo kara kuru a ya nuno de atte, anata no hata ni mochiirare, anata no ooi wa Erisha no kaigan kara kuru ao to murasaki no nuno de aru.
Anata no kogite wa, Shidon to Aruwade no juumin, anata no kajitori wa, anata no uchi ni iru jukuren na Zemeru no hitobito de aru.
Gebaru no roujintachi, oyobi sono jukuren na hitobito wa, anata no uchi ni ite mori o tsukuroi, umi no subete no fune oyobi sono sen'inra wa anata no uchi ni ite, anata no shouhin o koueki suru.
Perushahito, Rude bi to, Pute bito wa anata no gun ni kuwawatte, anata no senshi to naru. Karera wa anata no uchi ni, tate to kabuto o kake, anata ni kagayaki o soeta.
Aruwade to Ereku no hitobito wa, anata no shuui no jouheki no ue ni ari, Gamade no hitobito wa, anata no yagura no naka ni ari, karera wa, anata no shuui no jouheki ni sono tate o kakete, anata no bikan o mattou shita.
Anata wa sono subete no kamotsu ni tomu yue ni, Tarushishi wa anata to koueki o nashi, gin, tetsu, suzu, namari o anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Yawan, Tobaru, oyobi Meseku wa anata to torihiki shi, karera wa jinshin to seidou no utsuwa to o, anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Bete togaruma wa uma, gunba, oyobi raba o anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Roozu tou no hitobito wa anata to torihiki shi, ooku no umizoi no kuniguni wa, anata no shijou to nari, zouge to kurotan to o, mitsugi to shite anata ni motte kita.
Anata no seihin ga ooi no de, Edomu wa anata to shoubai shi, karera wa akadama, murasaki, nuitori no nuno, hosonuno, sango, menou o motte, anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Yuda to Isuraeru no chi wa, anata to torihiki shi, mugi, oribu, ichijiku, mitsu, abura, oyobi nyuukou o motte, anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Anata no seihin ga ooku, anata no tomi ga ooi no de, Damasuko wa anata to torihiki shi, Herubon no sake to, sarashita youmou to,
Uzaru no sake o motte, anata no shouhin to koukan shi, sentetsu, nikkei, shoubu o motte, anata no shouhin to koueki shita.
Dedan wa norimono no kurashiki o motte, anata to torihiki shita.
Arabiya bi to, oyobi Kedaru no subete no kimitachi wa kohitsuji, ohitsuji, yagi o motte, anata to torihiki shi, korera no mono o anata to koueki shita.
Shiba to Raama no shounin wa, anata to torihiki shi, moromoro no tattoi kouryou to, moromoro no houseki to kin to o motte, anata no shouhin to koukan shita.
Haran, Kanne, Eden, ASsuriya, Kirumade wa anata to torihiki shita.
Karera wa, hanayaka na ifuku to, aoku nuitori shita nuno to, himo de musunde, joubu ni shita shikimono nado o motte, anata to torihiki shita.
Tarushishi no fune wa anata no shouhin o hakonde mawatta. Anata wa umi no naka ni ite michitari, itaku sakaeta.
Anata no kogitera wa anata o taikai no naka ni susume, umi no naka de higashikaze ga anata no fune o yabutta.
Anata no zaihou, anata no kamotsu, anata no shouhin, anata no sen'in, anata no kajitori, anata no mori o tsukurou mono, anata no shouhin o akinau mono, anata no naka ni iru subete no gunjin, anata no naka ni iru subete no nakama wa mina, anata no hametsu no hi ni umi no naka ni shizumu.
Anata no kajitori no sakebigoe ni, kingou wa furui,
Subete kai o toru mono wa fune kara kudaru. Sen'in oyobi umi no subete no kajitori wa umibe ni tachi,
Anata no tame ni koe o agete naki, hageshiku sakebi, chiri o koube ni kaburi, hai no naka ni marobi,
Anata no tame ni kami o sori, aranuno o matoi, anata no tame ni kokoro o itamete naki, hageshiku nageku.
Karera wa kanashinde, anata no tame ni kanashimi no uta o nobe, anata o tomuratte iu, 'Dare ka Tsuro no you ni umi no naka de horobita mono ga aru ka.
Anata no shouhin ga umi o koete kita toki, anata wa ooku no tami o akase, anata no ooku no zaihou to shouhin to o motte, chi no outachi o tomaseta.
Ima anata wa umi de hasen shi, fukai mizu ni shizumi, anata no shouhin to, anata no subete no sen'in to wa, anata to tomo ni shizunda.
Umizoi no kuniguni ni sumu mono wa mina anata ni tsuite odoroki, sono outachi wa ooini osorete sono kao o furuwasu.
Moromoro no tami no naka no shouninra wa anata o azakeru. Anata wa osorubeki owari o toge, eien ni use hateru' ".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Tsuro no kimi ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa kokoro ni takabutte iu, 'Watashi wa kami de aru, kamigami no za ni suwatte, umi no naka ni iru' to. Shikashi, anata wa jibun o kami no you ni kashikoi to omotte mo, hito de atte, kami de wa nai.
Miyo, anata wa Danieru yori mo kashikoku, subete no himitsu mo anata ni wa kakurete inai.
Anata wa chie to satori to ni yotte tomi o e, kingin o kura ni takuwaeta.
Anata wa ooinaru boueki no chie ni yotte anata no tomi o mashi, sono tomi ni yotte anata no kokoro wa takabutta.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa jibun o kami no you ni kashikoi to omotte iru yue,
Miyo, watashi wa, moromoro no kokumin no mottomo osorete iru ihoujin o anata ni seme kosaseru. Karera wa tsurugi o nuite, anata ga chie o motte eta uruwashii mono ni mukai, anata no kagayaki o kegashi,
Anata o ana ni nageireru. Anata wa umi no naka de korosareta mono no you na shi o togeru.
Sore de mo nao anata wa, 'Jibun wa kami de aru' to, anata o korosu hitobito no mae de iu koto ga dekiru ka. Anata wa jibun o kizutsukeru mono no te ni kakatte wa, hito de atte, kami de wa naide wa nai ka.
Anata wa ihoujin no te ni yotte katsurei o ukenai mono no shi o togeru. Kore wa watashi ga iu no de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Mata Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Tsuro no ou no tame ni kanashimi no uta o nobete, kore ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata wa chie ni michi, bi no kiwami de aru kanzen na shirushi de aru.
Anata wa kami no sono Eden ni atte, moromoro no houseki ga, anata o ootte ita. Sunawachi akame nou, ougyoku, seigyoku, kikanranseki, ryokuchuuseki, shima menou, Safaiya, zakuroishi, Emerarudo. Soshite anata no zougan mo choukoku mo kin de nasareta. Korera wa anata no tsukurareta hi ni, anata no tame ni sonaerareta.
Watashi wa anata o abura sosogareta shugo no kerubu to issho ni oita. Anata wa kami no sei naru yama ni ite, hi no ishi no aida o aruita.
Anata wa tsukurareta hi kara, anata no naka ni aku ga miidasareta hi made wa sono okonai ga kanzen de atta.
Anata no shoubai ga sakan ni naruto, anata no naka ni bougyaku ga michite, anata wa tsumi o okashita. Sore yue, watashi wa anata o kami no yama kara kegareta mono to shite nagedashi, shugo no kerubu wa anata o hi no ishi no aida kara oidashita.
Anata wa jibun no utsukushisa no tame ni kokoro takaburi, sono kagayaki no tame ni jibun no chie o kegashita yue ni, watashi wa anata o chi ni nageuchi, outachi no mae ni oite misemono to shita.
Anata wa fusei na koueki o shite okashita ooku no tsumi ni yotte anata no seijo o kegashita yue, watashi wa anata no naka kara hi o dashite anata o yaki, anata o miru subete no mono no mae de anata o chi no ue no hai to shita.
Moromoro no tami no uchi de anata o shiru mono wa mina anata ni tsuite odoroku. Anata wa osorubeki owari o toge, eien ni use hateru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Shidon ni muke, kore ni mukatte yogen shite,
Ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Shidon yo, miyo, watashi wa anata no teki to naru, watashi wa anata no uchi de sakae o arawasu. Watashi ga Shidon no uchi ni sabaki o okonai, sono uchi ni watashi no sei naru koto o arawasu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Watashi wa ekibyou o kore ni okuri, sono chimata ni ryuuketsu o okuru. Sono shihou kara kore ni nozomu tsurugi ni yotte korosareru mono ga sono naka ni taoreru toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Isuraeru no ie ni wa, mohaya sasu ibara wa naku, kore o iyashimeta sono shuui no hitobito no uchi ni wa, kurushimeru toge mo nakunaru. Kou shite karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru you ni naru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi ga Isuraeru no ie no mono o, sono chirasareta moromoro no tami no naka kara atsume, moromoro no kokumin no me no mae de, karera ni watashi no sei naru koto o arawasu toki, karera wa watashi ga, waga shimobe Yakobu ni ataeta chi ni sumu you ni naru.
Karera wa soko ni yasuraka ni sumi, ie o tate, mata budou hatake o tsukuru. Katsute karera o iyashimeta subete no tonaribitotachi ni taishite, watashi ga sabaki o okonau toki, karera wa yasuraka ni sumu. Kou shite karera wa, watashi ga karera no kami, Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Daijuu nen no juu gatsu juu ni nichi ni, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Ejiputo no ou Paro ni muke, kare to Ejiputo zenkoku ni taishite yogen shi,
Kata tte ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Ejiputo no ou Paro yo, miyo, watashi wa anata no teki to naru. Anata wa sono kawa no naka ni fusu ooinaru ryuu de, 'Nairu gawa wa watashi no mono, watashi ga kore o tsukutta' to iu.
Watashi wa, kagi o anata no ago ni kake, anata no kawa no uo o, anata no uroko ni tsukase, anata to, anata no uroko ni tsuite iru moromoro no uo o, anata no kawa kara hikiage,
Anata to anata no kawa no moromoro no uo o, arano ni nagesuteru. Anata wa no no omote ni taore, anata o toriatsumeru mono mo, houmuru mono mo nai. Watashi wa anata o chi no kemono to sora no tori no ejiki to shite ataeru.
Soshite Ejiputo no subete no juumin wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru. Anata wa Isuraeru no ie ni taishite ashi no tsue de atta.
Karera ga anata o te ni toru toki, anata wa ore, karera no kata wa kotogotoku sakeru. Karera ga mata anata ni yorikakaru toki, anata wa yabure, karera no koshi o kotogotoku furuesaseru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa tsurugi o anata ni motte kite, hito to kemono to o anata no uchi kara tatsu.
Ejiputo no chi wa arete, munashiku naru. Soshite kare wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru. Anata wa 'Nairu gawa wa watashi no mono, watashi ga kore o tsukutta' to itte iru yue ni,
Miyo, watashi wa anata to anata no kawagawa no teki to natte, Ejiputo no chi o Migudoru kara Suene made, Echiopiya no sakai ni itaru made, kotogotoku arashi, munashiku suru.
Hito no ashi wa kore o watarazu, kemono no ashi mo kore o wataranai. Yonjuu nen no aida, koko ni sumu mono wa nai.
Watashi wa Ejiputo no chi o arashite, areta kuniguni no naka ni oki, sono machimachi wa arete, yonjuu nen no aida areta machimachi no naka ni aru. Watashi wa Ejiputo bito o, moromoro no kokumin no naka ni chirashi, moromoro no kuni no naka ni chirasu.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, yonjuu nen no nochi, watashi wa Ejiputo bito o, sono chirasareta moromoro no tami no naka kara atsumeru.
Sunawachi Ejiputo no unmei o moto ni kaeshi, karera o sono umareta chi de aru Paterosu no chi ni kaeraseru. Sono tokoro de karera wa iyashii kuni to naru.
Kore wa moromoro no kuni yori mo iyashiku nari, futatabi moromoro no kokumin no ue ni deru koto ga dekinai. Watashi wa karera o chiisaku suru yue, futatabi moromoro no kokumin o osameru koto wa nai.
Kore wa Isuraeru ga tasuke o motomeru toki, sono tsumi o omoidashite, futatabi Isuraeru no ie no tanomi to wa naranai. Kou shite karera wa, watashi ga Shu naru kami de aru koto o shiru".
Dainijuu shichi nen no ichi gatsu tsuitachi ni, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru wa, sono gunzei o Tsuro ni taishite ooini hatarakaseta. Atama wa mina hage, kata wa mina yabureta. Shikashi kare mo sono gunzei mo, Tsuro ni taishite nashita sono hataraki no tame ni, nan no mukui o mo enakatta.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru ni, Ejiputo no chi o ataeru. Kare wa sono zaihou o tori, mono o kasume, mono o ubai, sore o sono gunzei ni ataete mukui to suru.
Kare no hataraita houshuu to shite, watashi wa Ejiputo no chi o kare ni ataeru. Karera wa watashi no tame ni, kore o shitakara de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Sono hi, watashi wa Isuraeru no ie ni, hitotsu no tsuno o shoujisase, anata no kuchi o karera no uchi ni hirakaseru. Soshite karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, yogen shite ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, nageke, sono hi wa wazawai da.
Sono hi wa chikai, Shu no hi wa chikai. Kore wa kumo no hi, ihoujin no horobi no toki de aru.
Tsurugi ga Ejiputo ni nozomu. Ejiputo de korosareru mono no taoreru toki, Echiopiya ni wa kurushimi ga ari, sono zaihou wa ubaisarare, sono motoi wa yaburareru.
Echiopiya, Pute, Rude, Arabiya, Ribiya oyobi doumeikuni no hitobito wa, karera to tomo ni tsurugi ni taoreru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, Ejiputo o tasukeru mono wa taore, sono hokoru chikara wa useru. Migudoru kara Suene made, hitobito wa tsurugi ni yotte sono uchi ni taoreruto Shu naru kami ga iwareru.
Sore wa arete, are hateta kuniguni no uchi ni ari, sono machimachi wa areta machimachi no uchi ni aru.
Watashi ga Ejiputo ni hi o okuri, kore o tasukeru mono ga mina horobiru toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Sono hi, hayaashi no shisha ga watashi kara dete, nanigoto mo shiranu Echiopiya bito o osoresaseru. Soshite kano Ejiputo no horobi no hi ni, karera ni kurushimi ga kuru. Miyo, kore wa kanarazu kuru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa Babiron no ou Nebukaderezaru no te ni yotte Ejiputo no tomi o horobosu.
Kare to kare ni shitagau sono tami, sunawachi kokumin no uchi no mottomo osorubeki mono ga kite, sono chi o horobosu. Karera wa tsurugi o nuite, Ejiputo o seme, koroshita mono o kuni ni mitasu.
Watashi wa Nairu gawa o karashi, sono kuni o ashiki mono no te ni uri, ihoujin no te ni yotte kuni to sono naka no mono to o arasu. Shu naru watashi wa kore o itta.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa guuzou o kowashi, Menpisu de guuzou o horobosu. Ejiputo no kuni ni wa, mohaya kimi taru mono ga nakunaru. Watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni ni osore o ataeru.
Watashi wa Paterosu o arashi, Zoan ni hi o hanachi, Teebe ni sabaki o okonai,
Watashi no ikari o, Ejiputo no yougai de aru Perushumu ni sosogi, Teebe no gunshuu o tachi,
Ejiputo ni hi o kudasu. Perushumu wa itaku kurushimi, Teebe wa uchiyaburare, sono jouheki wa hakai sare,
On to Pibesete no wakamono wa tsurugi ni taore, onnatachi wa toraeutsusareru.
Watashi ga Ejiputo no shihai o kudaku toki, Tepanesu de wa hi wa kuraku nari, sono hokoru chikara wa tae, kumo wa kore o ooi, sono musumetachi wa toraeutsusareru.
Kono you ni watashi wa Ejiputo ni sabaki o okonau. Sono toki karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Daijuu ichi nen no ichi gatsu nanuka ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, watashi wa Ejiputo no ou Paro no ude o otta. Miyo, kore wa tsutsumarezu, iyasarezu, houtai o mo hodokosarenai. Sore wa tsuyoku natte, tsurugi o toru koto ga dekinai.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa Ejiputo no ou Paro o seme, sono tsuyoi ude to, oreta ude to o tomo ni ori, sono te kara tsurugi o otosaseru.
Watashi wa Ejiputo bito o, moromoro no kokumin no naka ni chirashi, kuniguni ni chirasu.
Watashi wa Babiron no ou no ude o tsuyoku shi, watashi no tsurugi o, sono te ni ataeru. Shikashi watashi wa Paro no ude o oru yue, kare wa fukade o otta mono no you ni, kare no mae ni umeku.
Watashi ga Babiron no ou no ude o tsuyoku shi, Paro no ude ga tareru toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru. Watashi ga watashi no tsurugi o, Babiron no ou ni sazuke, kore o Ejiputo no kuni ni mukatte nobesase,
Watashi ga Ejiputo bito o, moromoro no kokumin no naka ni chirashi, kuniguni ni chirasu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru".
Daijuu ichi nen no san gatsu tsuitachi ni Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Ejiputo no ou Paro to, sono minshuu to ni ie, anata wa sono ooinaru koto, dare ni nite iru ka.
Miyo, watashi wa anata o Rebanon no kouhaku no you ni suru. Uruwashiki eda to mori no kage ga ari, take ga takaku, sono itadaki wa kumo no naka ni aru.
Mizu wa kore o sodate, oomizu ga kore o takaku suru. Sono kawagawa wa sono ueta tokoro o megutte nagare, sono nagare o no no subete no ki ni okuru.
Kore ni yotte sono take wa, no no subete no ki yori mo takaku nari, sono sodatsu toki ooku no mizu no tame ni edaha wa shigeri, eda wa nobi,
Sono edaha ni sora no subete no tori ga, su o tsukuri, sono eda no shita ni no no subete no kemono wa ko o umi, sono kage ni moromoro no kokumin wa sumu.
Kore wa sono ookina koto to, sono eda no nagai koto ni yotte utsukushikatta. Sono ne o ooku no mizu ni, oroshite itakara de aru.
Kami no sono no kouhaku mo, kore to kisou koto wa dekinai. Momi no ki mo sono edaha ni oyobanai. Keyaki mo sono eda to kuraberarenai. Kami no sono no subete no ki mo, sono uruwashiki koto, kore ni hi subeki mono wa nai.
Watashi wa sono eda o ooku shite, kore o utsukushiku shita. Kami no sono ni aru Eden no ki wa mina kore o urayanda.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, kore wa, take ga takaku nari, sono itadaki o kumo no naka ni oki, sono kokoro ga takaburi ogoru yue,
Watashi wa kore o, moromoro no kokumin no chikara aru mono no te ni watasu. Kare wa kore ni taishite sono aku no tame ni tadashii shochi o toru. Watashi wa kore o oidashita.
Moromoro no kokumin no mottomo osorete iru ihoujin wa kore o kiritaoshite suteru. Sono eda wa moromoro no yama to, subete no tani to ni ochi, sono edaha wa kudakete, chi no subete no nagare ni ari, chi no subete no tami wa, sono kage o hanarete, kore o suteru.
Sono taoreta tokoro ni, sora no moromoro no tori wa sumi, sono eda no ue ni, no no moromoro no kemono wa iru.
Kore wa mizu no hotori no subete no ki ga, sono takasa no tame ni hokoru koto naku, sono itadaki o kumo no naka ni oku koto naku, mizu ni uruou ki ga, mizukara takaburi tatsu koto no nai tame de aru. Korera wa mina, shi ni watasare, shita no kuni ni iri, ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni ta no hitobito no uchi ni iru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, kore ga yomi ni kudaru hi ni watashi ga fuchi o kore ga tame ni kanashimase, sono kawagawa o sekitomeru no de, oomizu wa todomaru. Watashi wa Rebanon o, kore ga tame ni nagekase, no no subete no ki o, kore ga tame ni otoroesaseru.
Watashi ga kore o ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni yomi ni otosu toki, moromoro no kokumin o sono ochiru hibiki no tame ni, uchifuruesaseru. Soshite Eden no subete no ki, Rebanon no sugurete utsukushii mono, subete mizu ni uruou mono wa, shita no kuni de nagusamerareru.
Karera mo kore to tomo ni yomi ni kudari, tsurugi de korosareta mono no tokoro ni itaru. Makoto ni moromoro no kokumin no uchi de, sono kage ni sunda mono mo horobiru.
Eden no ki no uchi de, sono sakae to ooinaru koto de, anata wa dore ni nite iru no ka. Anata wa kono you ni, Eden no ki to tomo ni, shita no kuni ni otosare, tsurugi de korosareta mono to tomo ni, katsurei o ukenai mono no uchi ni sumu. Kore ga Paro to sono minshuu de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Daijuu ni nen no juu ni gatsu tsuitachi ni, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Ejiputo no ou Paro no tame ni, kanashimi no uta o nobete, kore ni ie, anata wa jibun o moromoro no kokumin no uchi no shishi de aru to kangaete iruga, anata wa umi no naka no ryuu no you na mono de aru. Anata wa kawa no naka ni, haneoki, ashi de mizu o kakimaze, kawa o nigosu.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa ooku no tami no shuudan o motte, watashi no ami o anata ni nagekake, anata o ami de hikiageru.
Watashi wa anata o chi ni nagesute, no no omote ni nageuchi, sora no subete no tori o anata no ue ni tomarase, zenchi no kemono ni anata o ataete akaseru.
Watashi wa anata no niku o yamayama ni sute, anata no shitai de tani o mitasu.
Watashi wa anata no nagareru chi de, chi o uruoshi, yamayama ni made oyobosu. Tanigawa wa anata no shitai de michiru.
Watashi wa anata o horobosu toki, sora o ooi, hoshi o kuraku shi, kumo de hi o ooi, tsuki ni hikari o hanatasenai.
Watashi wa sora no kagayaku hikari o, kotogotoku anata no ue ni kuraku shi, anata no kuni o yami to suruto Shu naru kami wa iu.
Watashi wa moromoro no kokumin, anata no shiranai kuniguni no naka ni, anata o toraeutsusu toki, ooku no tami no kokoro o itamaseru.
Watashi wa anata ni tsuite, ooku no tami o odorokaseru. Sono outachi wa, watashi ga watashi no tsurugi o, karera no mae ni furuu toki, anata no koto de ononoku. Anata no taoreru hi ni wa, karera wa onoono jibun no inochi o omotte, taezu uchifurueru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Babiron no ou no tsurugi wa anata ni nozomu.
Watashi wa anata no minshuu o yuushi no tsurugi ni taoresaseru. Karera wa mina, moromoro no kokumin no naka de, mottomo osorerarete iru monotachi de aru. Karera wa Ejiputo no hokori o tatsu, Ejiputo no minshuu wa mina horobosareru.
Watashi wa sono kachiku o kotogotoku, ooku no mizu no katawara kara horobosu. Hito no ashi wa futatabi kore o nigosazu, kachiku no hizume mo kore o midasanai.
Sono toki watashi wa sono mizu o kiyoku shi, sono kawagawa o abura no you ni nagaresaseruto, Shu naru kami wa iu.
Watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni o arashi, sono kuni ni michiru mono ga, kotogotoku torisarareru toki, watashi ga sono naka ni sumu mono o kotogotoku utsu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o shiru.
Kore wa kanashimi no uta de aru. Hitobito wa kore o utai, moromoro no kuni no musumetachi wa kore o utau. Sunawachi Ejiputo to, sono subete no minshuu to no tame ni, kore o utau no de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Daijuu ni nen no ichi gatsu juu go nichi ni, Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Ejiputo no minshuu no tame ni nageki, kore to ooinaru kuniguni no musumera to o, shita no kuni ni nage kudashi, ana ni kudatta mono no tokoro ni itarase yo.
'Anata no bi wa dare ni masatte iru ka. Kudatte, katsurei o ukenai mono to tomo ni fuseyo'.
Karera wa tsurugi ni korosareru mono no uchi ni taoreru. Sono minshuu wa kore to tomo ni fuseru.
Yuushi no shuryou wa sono tasukete to tomo ni, yomi no naka kara karera ni iu, 'Katsurei o ukenai mono, tsurugi ni korosareta mono wa kudatte fushite iru' to.
ASsuriya to sono nakama to wa sono tokoro ni ori, sono haka wa kore o kakomu. Karera wa mina korosareta mono, mata tsurugi ni taoreta mono de aru.
Karera no haka wa ana no oku ni moukerare, sono nakama wa sono haka no shuui ni ari, kore wa mina korosareta mono, tsurugi ni taoreta mono, ikeru mono no chi ni osore o okoshita mono de aru.
Sono tokoro ni Eramu ga ori, sono minshuu wa mina, sono haka no shuui ni oru. Karera wa mina korosareta mono, tsurugi ni taoreta mono, katsurei o ukenaide, shita no kuni ni kudatta mono, ikeru mono no chi ni, osore o okoshita mono de, ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni, haji o ou no de aru.
Karera wa sono subete no minshuu to tomo ni, korosareta mono no naka ni toko o oki, sono haka wa kore o kakomu. Kore wa mina, katsurei o ukenai mono, tsurugi ni korosareta mono, ikeru mono no chi ni osore o okoshita mono de, ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni haji o ou. Karera wa korosareta mono no naka ni okarete iru.
Sono tokoro ni Meseku to Tobaru, oyobi subete no minshuu ga oru. Sono haka wa kore o kakomu. Karera wa mina, katsurei o ukenai mono de, tsurugi de korosareta mono de aru. Ikeru mono no chi ni osore o okoshitakara de aru.
Karera wa mukashi no taoreta yuushi to tomo ni fusanai. Korera no yuushi wa, bugu o motte yomi ni kudari, tsurugi o makura to shi, sono tate wa hone no ue ni aru. Kore wa yuushi no osore ga, ikeru mono no chi ni attakara de aru.
Anata wa katsurei o ukenai mono no uchi ni, tsurugi de korosareta mono to tomo ni yokotawaru.
Sono tokoro ni Edomu to sono outachi to, sono subete no kimitachi ga oru. Karera wa sono chikara o motsu ni mo kakawarazu, kano tsurugi de korosareta mono to tomo ni yokotaerare, katsurei o ukenai mono oyobi ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni fushite iru.
Sono tokoro ni kita no kimitachi, oyobi Shidon bito ga mina oru. Karera wa jibun no chikara ni yotte osore o okoshita no de, korosareta mono to tomo ni haji o ukete, kudatte itta mono de aru. Karera wa tsurugi de korosareta mono to tomo ni, katsurei o ukezu ni fushi, ana ni kudaru mono to tomo ni haji o ou.
Paro wa karera o miru toki, sono subete no minshuu ni tsuite nagusamerareru. Paro to sono subete no gunzei to wa, tsurugi de korosareruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Kare wa ikeru mono no kuni ni osore o hirogeta. Sore yue, Paro to subete no minshuu to wa, katsurei o ukenai mono no uchi ni atte, tsurugi de korosareta mono to tomo ni fusuto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no tami no hitobito ni katatte ie, watashi ga tsurugi o hitotsu no kuni ni nozomaseru toki, sono kuni no tami ga karera no uchi kara hitori o erande, kore o jibuntachi no mimamoru mono to suru.
Kare wa kuni ni tsurugi ga nozomu no o mite, rappa o fuki, tami o imashimeru.
Shikashi hito ga rappa no oto o kiite mo, mizukara keikai sezu, tsuini tsurugi ga kite, sono hito o koroshitanara, sono chi wa kare no koube ni kisuru.
Kare wa rappa no oto o kiite, mizukara keikai shinakatta no de arukara, sono chi wa kare jishin ni kisuru. Shikashi sono hito ga, mizukara keikai shitanara, sono inochi wa sukuwareru.
Shikashi mimamoru mono ga, tsurugi no nozomu no o mite mo, rappa o fukazu, sono tametami ga, mizukara keikai shinaide iru uchi ni, tsurugi ga nozomi, karera no naka no hitori o ushinaunaraba, sono hito wa, jibun no tsumi no tame ni korosareruga, watashi wa sono chi no sekinin o, mimamoru mono no te ni motomeru.
Sore yue, hito no ko yo, watashi wa anata o tatete, Isuraeru no ie o mimamoru mono to suru. Anata wa watashi no kuchi kara kotoba o kiki, watashi ni kawatte karera o imashimeyo.
Watashi ga akunin ni mukatte, akunin yo, anata wa kanarazu shinu to iu toki, anata ga akunin o imashimete, sono michi kara hanaresaseru you ni kataranakattara, akunin wa jibun no tsumi ni yotte shinu. Shikashi watashi wa sono chi o, anata no te ni motomeru.
Shikashi anata ga akunin ni, sono michi o hanareru you ni imashimete mo, sono akunin ga sono michi o hanarenainara, kare wa jibun no tsumi ni yotte shinu. Shikashi anata no inochi wa sukuwareru.
Sore yue, hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no ie ni ie, anata gata wa kou itta, 'Wareware no toga to, tsumi wa wareware no ue ni aru. Wareware wa sono naka ni atte otoroe hateru. Dou shite ikiru koto ga dekiyou ka' to.
Anata wa karera ni ie, Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Watashi wa akunin no shi o yorokobanai. Mushiro akunin ga, sono michi o hanarete ikiru no o yorokobu. Anata gata wa kokoro o hirugaese, kokoro o hirugaeshite sono ashiki michi o hanareyo. Isuraeru no ie yo, anata wa dou shite shinde yokarou ka.
Hito no ko yo, anata no tami no hitobito ni ie, gijin no gi wa, kare ga tsumi o okasu toki ni wa, kare o sukuwanai. Akunin no aku wa, kare ga sono aku o hanareru toki, sono aku no tame ni taoreru koto wa nai. Gijin wa kare ga tsumi o okasu toki, sono gi no tame ni ikiru koto wa dekinai.
Watashi ga gijin ni, kare wa kanarazu ikiru to itte mo, moshi kare ga jibun no gi o tanonde, tsumi o okasunara, kare no subete no gi wa oboerarenai. Kare wa mizukara okashita tsumi no tame ni shinu.
Mata, watashi ga akunin ni 'Anata wa kanarazu shinu' to itte mo, moshi kare ga sono tsumi o hanare, koudou to seigi to o okonaunaraba,
Sunawachi sono akunin ga shichimotsu o kaeshi, ubatta mono o modoshi, inochi no sadame ni ayumi, aku o okonawanainaraba, kare wa kanarazu ikiru. Kesshite shinanai.
Kare no okashita subete no tsumi wa kare ni taishite oboerarenai. Kare wa koudou to seigi to o okonatta no de arukara, kanarazu ikiru.
Anata no tami no hitobito wa 'Shu no michi wa kouhei de nai' to iu. Shikashi karera no michi koso kouhei de nai no de aru.
Gijin ga sono gi o hanarete, tsumi o okasunaraba, kare wa kore ga tame ni shinu.
Akunin ga sono aku o hanarete, koudou to seigi to o okonaunaraba, kare wa kore ni yotte ikiru.
Sore de aru no ni, anata gata wa 'Shu no michi wa kouhei de nai' to iu. Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi wa kakuji no okonai ni shitagatte, anatagata o sabaku".
Watashitachi ga toraeutsusareta nochi, sunawachi daijuu ni nen no juu gatsu itsuka ni, Erusaremu kara nogarete kita mono ga, watashi no moto ni kite itta, "Machi wa uchiyaburareta" to.
Sono mono ga kita mae no yoru, Shu no te ga watashi ni nozonda. Tsugi no asa, sono hito ga watashi no moto ni kita koro, Shu wa watashi no kuchi o hirakareta. Watashi no kuchi ga hiraketa no de, mohaya watashi wa chinmoku shinakatta.
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no chi no, kano are ato no juuminra wa, katari tsuzukete iu, 'Aburahamu wa tada hitori de, nao kono chi o shoyuu shita. Shikashi watashitachi no kazu wa ooi. Kono chi wa wareware no shoyuu to shite ataerarete iru' to.
Sore yue, anata wa karera ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa niku o chi no tsuita mama de tabe, ono ga guuzou o aogi, chi o nagashite ite, nao kono chi o shoyuu suru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata gata wa tsurugi o tanomi, nikumubeki koto o okonai, onoono tonaribito no tsuma o kegashite, nao kono chi o shoyuu suru koto ga dekiru ka.
Anata wa karera ni ii nasai. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Ka no are ato ni iru mono wa kanarazu tsurugi ni taoreru. Watashi wa no no omote ni iru mono o, kemono ni ataete kuwase, yougai to horaana to ni iru mono wa ekibyou de shinu.
Watashi wa kono kuni o mattaku arasu. Kare no hokoru chikara wa use, Isuraeru no yamayama wa arete tooru mono mo nakunaru.
Karera ga okonatta subete no nikumubeki koto no tame ni, watashi ga kono kuni o mattaku arasu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru.
Hito no ko yo, anata no tami no hitobito wa, kaki no katawara, ie no iriguchi de, anata no koto o ronji, tagai ni katariatte iu, 'Saa, wareware wa, donna kotoba ga Shu kara deru ka o kikou' to.
Karera wa tami ga kuru you ni anata no tokoro ni ki, watashi no tami no you ni anata no mae ni zashite, anata no kotoba o kiku. Shikashi karera wa sore o okonawanai. Karera wa kuchisaki de wa ooku no ai o arawasuga, sono kokoro wa ri ni omomuite iru.
Miyo, anata wa karera ni wa, utsukushii koe de ai no uta o utau mono no you ni, mata gakki o yoku sousuru mono no you ni omowareru. Karera wa anata no kotoba wa kikuga, sore o okonaou to wa shinai.
Kono koto ga okoru toki - - kore wa kanarazu okoru - - sono toki karera no naka ni hitori no yogensha ga ita koto o karera wa satoru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no bokushatachi ni mukatte yogen seyo. Yogen shite karera bokusha ni ie, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, wazawai naru ka na, jibun jishin o yashinau Isuraeru no bokusha. Bokusha wa mure o yashinaubeki mono de wa nai ka.
Tokoro ga, anata gata wa shibou o tabe, keorimono o matoi, koeta mono o hofuruga, mure o yashinawanai.
Anata gata wa yowatta mono o tsuyoku sezu, yande iru mono o iyasazu, kizutsuita mono o tsutsumazu, mayoideta mono o hiki kaerasezu, useta mono o tazunezu, karera o tearaku, kibishiku osamete iru.
Karera wa bokusha ga nai tame ni chiri, no no moromoro no kemono no ejiki ni naru.
Waga hitsuji wa chirasarete iru. Karera wa moromoro no yama to, moromoro no takaki oka ni samayoi, waga hitsuji wa chi no zenmen ni chirasarete iruga, kore o sagasu mono mo naku, tazuneru mono mo nai.
Sore yue, bokusha yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Waga hitsuji wa kasumerare, waga hitsuji wa no no moromoro no kemono no ejiki to natte iruga, sono bokusha wa inai. Waga bokusha wa waga hitsuji o tazunenai. Bokusha wa jishin o yashinauga, waga hitsuji o yashinawanai.
Sore yue bokushara yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa bokushara no teki to nari, watashi no hitsuji o karera no te ni motome, karera ni watashi no mure o yashinau koto o yamesase, futatabi bokusha jishin o yashinawasenai. Mata waga hitsuji o karera no kuchi kara sukutte, karera no shokumotsu ni sasenai.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa, watashi mizukara waga hitsuji o tazunete, kore o sagashidasu.
Bokusha ga sono hitsuji no chiri satta toki, sono hitsuji no mure o sagashidasu you ni, watashi wa waga hitsuji o sagashidashi, kumo to kurayami no hi ni chitta, subete no tokoro kara kore o sukuu.
Watashi wa karera o moromoro no tami no naka kara michibikidashi, moromoro no kuni kara atsumete, karera no kuni ni tazusae ire, Isuraeru no yama no ue, izumi no hotori, mata kuni no uchi no hito no sumu subete no tokoro de kore o yashinau.
Watashi wa yoki makiba de karera o yashinau. Sono makiba wa Isuraeru no takai yama ni ari, sono tokoro de karera wa yoi hitsuji no ori ni fushi, Isuraeru no yamayama no ue de koeta makiba de kusa o kuu.
Watashi wa mizukara waga hitsuji o kai, kore o fusaseru to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Watashi wa, useta mono o tazune, mayoideta mono o hikikaeshi, kizutsuita mono o tsutsumi, yowatta mono o tsuyoku shi, koeta mono to tsuyoi mono to wa, kore o kantoku suru. Watashi wa kouhei o motte karera o yashinau.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, anata gata, waga mureyo, miyo, watashi wa hitsuji to hitsuji to no aida, ohitsuji to o yagi to no aida o sabaku.
Anata gata wa yoki makiba de kusa o kui, sono kusa no nokori o ashi de fumi, mata sunda mizu o nomi, sono nokori o ashi de nigosuga, kore wa, amari no koto de wa nai ka.
Waga hitsuji wa anata ga taga, ashi de funda mono o kui, anata gata no ashi de nigoshita mono o, nomanakereba naranai no ka.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou karera ni iwareru, miyo, watashi wa koeta hitsuji to, yaseta hitsuji to no aida o sabaku.
Anata gata wa, waki to kata to o motte oshi, tsuno o motte, subete yowai mono o tsuki, tsuini karera o soto ni oichirashita.
Sore yue, watashi wa waga mure o tasukete, futatabi kasumesasezu, hitsuji to hitsuji to no aida o sabaku.
Watashi wa karera no ue ni hitori no bokusha o tateru. Sunawachi waga shimobe Dabide de aru. Kare wa karera o yashinau. Kare wa karera o yashinai, karera no bokusha to naru.
Shu naru watashi wa karera no kami to nari, waga shimobe Dabide wa karera no uchi ni atte kimi to naru. Shu naru watashi wa kore o iu.
Watashi wa karera to heiwa no keiyaku o musubi, kuni no uchi kara yajuu o oiharau. Karera wa kokoro o yasunjite arano ni sumi, mori no naka ni nemuru.
Watashi wa karera oyobi waga yama no shuui no tokorodokoro o shukufuku shi, kisetsu ni shitagatte ame o furasu. Kore wa shukufuku no ame to naru.
No no ki wa mi o musubi, chi wa sanbutsu o dasu. Karera wa kokoro o yasunjite sono kuni ni ori, watashi ga karera no kubiki no bou o kudaki, karera o dorei to shita mono no te kara sukuidasu toki, karera wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru.
Karera wa kasanete, moromoro no kokumin ni kasumerareru koto naku, chi no kemono mo karera o kuu koto wa nai. Karera wa kokoro o yasunjite sumi, karera o osoresaseru mono wa nai.
Watashi wa karera no tame ni, yoi saibaijo o ataeru. Karera wa kasanete, kuni no kikin ni horobiru koto naku kasanete shokokumin no hazukashime o ukeru koto wa nai.
Karera wa sono kami, Shu naru watashi ga karera to tomo ni ori, karera Isuraeru no ie ga, waga tami de aru koto o satoruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa waga hitsuji, waga makiba no hitsuji de aru. Watashi wa anata gata no kami de aruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, anata no kao o Seiruyama ni muke, kore ni taishite yogen shi,
Kore ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Seiru yama yo, miyo, watashi wa anata o teki to shi, watashi no te o anata ni mukatte nobe, anata o mattaku arashi,
Anata no machimachi o horobosu. Anata wa are hateru. Soshite watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru.
Anata wa kagirinai tekii o idaite, Isuraeru no hitobito o sono wazawai no toki, owari no keibatsu no toki ni, tsurugi no te ni watashita.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Watashi wa anata o chi ni watasu. Chi wa anata o oikakeru. Anata ni wa chi no toga ga aru yue, chi wa anata o oikakeru
Watashi wa Seiruyama o mattaku arashi, soko ni yukiki suru mono o tachi,
Sono yamayama o korosareta mono de mitasu. Tsurugi de korosareta mono ga, anata no moromoro no oka, moromoro no tani, moromoro no kubochi ni taoreru.
Watashi wa anata o, eien no arechi to shi, anata no machimachi ni wa sumu mono ga nakunaru. Soshite anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru.
Anata wa iu, 'Korera futatsu no kokumin, futatsu no kuni wa watashi no mono, wareware wa kore o eyou' to. Shikashi Shu wa soko ni orareru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Anata ga karera o nikunde, karera ni shimeshita ikari to, netami ni shitagatte, watashi wa anata o atsukau. Watashi ga anata o sabaku toki, watashi jishin o anata ni shimesu.
Anata ga Isuraeru no yamayama ni mukatte, 'Kore wa are hatete, wareware no shoku to naru' to itta moromoro no so shiri o, Shu naru watashi ga kiita koto o anata wa satoru.
Anata gata wa, watashi ni taishite kuchi o motte hokori, mata watashi ni taishite, anata gata no kotoba o ooku shita. Watashi wa sore o kiita.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, zenchi no yorokobi no tame ni, watashi wa anata o arechi to suru.
Anata ga, Isuraeru no ie no shigyou no areru no o yorokonda you ni, watashi wa anata ni, sono you ni suru. Seiru yama yo, anata wa arechi to naru. Edomu mo subete sono you ni naru. Sono toki karera wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru you ni naru.
Hito no ko yo, Isuraeru no yamayama ni yogen shite ie. Isuraeru no yamayama yo, Shu no kotoba o kike.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, teki wa anata gata ni tsuite iu, 'Aa, mukashi no takaki tokoro ga, wareware no mono to natta' to.
Sore yue, anata wa yogen shite ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, karera wa anatagata o arashi, shihou kara anatagata o uchihoroboshita no de, anata gata wa ta no kokumin no shoyuu to nari, mata tami no warui uwasa to natta.
Sore yue, Isuraeru no yamayama yo, Shu naru kami no kotoba o kike. Shu naru kami wa, yama to, oka to, kubochi to, tani to, horobita are ato to, hito no suteta machimachi, sunawachi sono shuui ni aru shokokumin no nokotta mono ni kasumerare, azakerareru you ni natta mono ni, kou iwareru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa netami no honoo o motte, ta no kokumin to Edomu zenkoku to ni taishite iu, karera wa kokoroyuku made yorokobi, kokoro ni hokotte waga chi o jibun no shoyuu to shi, kore o ubai, kasumeta mono de aru.
Sore yue, anata wa Isuraeru no chi no koto o yogen shi, yama to, oka to, kubochi to, tani to ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, miyo, anata gata wa shokokumin no hazukashime o uketa no de, watashi wa netami to ikari to o motte kataru.
Sore yue, Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa chikatte iu, anata gata no shuui no shokokumin wa kanarazu hazukashime o ukeru.
Shikashi Isuraeru no yamayama yo, anata gata wa eda o dashi, waga tami Isuraeru no tame ni mi o musubu. Kono koto no naru no wa chikai.
Miyo, watashi wa anata gata ni nozomi, anatagata o kaerimiru. Anata gata wa tagayasare, tane o makareru.
Watashi wa anata gata no ue ni hito o fuyasu. Kore wa kotogotoku Isuraeru no ie no mono to nari, machimachi ni wa hito ga sumi, are ato wa tatenaosareru.
Watashi wa anata gata no ue ni hito to kemono to o fuyasu. Karera wa fuete, ko o umu. Watashi wa anata gata no ue ni, mukashi no you ni hito o sumase, hajime no toki yori mo, masaru megumi o anata gata ni hodokosu. Sono toki anata gata wa, watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoru.
Watashi wa waga tami Isuraeru no hitobito o anata gata no ue ni ayumaseru. Karera wa anatagata o shoyuu shi, anata gata wa sono shigyou to nari, anata gata wa kasanete karera ni ko no nai nageki o sasenai.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, karera wa anata gata ni mukatte, 'Anata wa hito o kui, anata no tami ni ko no nai nageki o saseru' to iu.
Anata wa mohaya hito o kuwanai. Anata no tami ni kasanete ko no nai nageki o saseru koto wa naito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Watashi wa kasanete shokokumin no hazukashime o anata ni kikasenai. Anata wa kasanete, moromoro no tami no hazukashime o ukeru koto wa naku, anata no tami o kasanete tsumazukaseru koto wa naito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Hito no ko yo, mukashi, Isuraeru no ie ga, jibun no kuni ni sunda toki, karera wa onore no okonaito wazato o motte, kore o kegashita. Sono okonai wa, watashi no mae ni wa, kegare ni aru onna no kegare no you de atta.
Karera ga kuni ni chi o nagashi, mata sono guuzou o motte, kuni o kegashita tame, watashi wa waga ikari o karera no ue ni sosogi,
Karera o shokokumin no naka ni chirashita no de, karera wa kuniguni no naka ni chitta. Watashi wa karera no okonaito, wazato ni shitagatte, karera o sabaita.
Karera ga sono iku tokoro no kuniguni e itta toki, waga sei naru na o kegashita. Kore wa hitobito ga karera ni tsuite 'Kore wa Shu no tami de aruga, sono kuni kara deta mono de aru' to ittakara de aru.
Shikashi watashi wa Isuraeru no ie ga, sono iku tokoro no shokokumin no naka de kegashita waga sei naru na o oshinda.
Sore yue, anata wa Isuraeru no ie ni ie. Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi ga suru koto wa anata gata no tame de wa nai. Sore wa anata gata ga itta shokokumin no naka de kegashita, waga sei naru na no tame de aru.
Watashi wa shokokumin no naka de kegasareta mono, sunawachi, anata gata ga karera no naka de kegashita, waga ooinaru na no sei naru koto o shimesu. Watashi ga anata gata ni yotte, karera no me no mae ni, watashi no sei naru koto o shimesu toki, shokokumin wa watashi ga Shu de aru koto o satoruto, Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Watashi wa anatagata o shokokumin no naka kara michibikidashi, bankoku kara atsumete, anata gata no kuni ni ikaseru.
Watashi wa kiyoi mizu o anata gata ni sosoide, subete no kegare kara kiyome, mata anatagata o, subete no guuzou kara kiyomeru.
Watashi wa atarashii kokoro o anata gata ni atae, atarashii rei o anata gata no uchi ni sazuke, anata gata no niku kara, ishi no kokoro o nozoite, niku no kokoro o ataeru.
Watashi wa mata waga rei o anata gata no uchi ni oite, waga sadame ni ayumase, waga okite o mamotte kore o okonawaseru.
Anata gata wa, watashi ga anata gata no senzo ni ataeta chi ni sunde, waga tami to nari, watashi wa anata gata no kami to naru.
Watashi wa anatagata o sono subete no kegare kara sukui, kokumotsu o yobiyosete kore o mashi, kikin o anata gata ni nozomasenai.
Mata watashi wa kinomi to, tahata no sakumotsu to o ooku suru. Anata gata wa kasanete shokokumin no aida ni, kikin no hazukashime o ukeru koto ga nai.
Sono toki anata gata wa jishin no ashiki okonaito, yokaranu wazato o oboete, sono tsumi to, sono nikumubeki koto to no tame ni, mizukara uramu.
Watashi ga nasu koto wa anata gata no tame de wa naito, Shu naru kami wa iwareru. Anata gata wa kore o shire. Isuraeru no ie yo, anata gata wa jibun no okonai o hajite kuyamubekide aru.
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, watashi wa, anata gata no subete no tsumi o kiyomeru hi ni, machimachi ni hito o sumase, sono are ato o tatenaosu.
