Sunawachi sono chisei no daiichi nen ni, ware Danieru wa Shu ga yogensha Eremiya ni nozonde tsugerareta sono kotoba ni yori, Erusaremu no kouhai no owaru made ni heneba naranu nen no kazu wa nanajuu nen de aru koto o, bunsho ni yotte satotta.
Sore de watashi wa, waga kao o Shu naru kami ni muke, danjiki o nashi, aranuno o ki, hai o kabutte inori, katsu negaimotometa.
Sunawachi watashi wa, waga kami, Shu ni inori, zange shite itta, "Aa, ooinaru osorubeki kami, Shu, onore o aishi, onore no imashime o mamoru mono no tame ni keiyaku o tamochi, itsukushimi o hodokosareru mono yo,
Wareware wa tsumi o okashi, aku o okonai, yokoshima na furumai o nashi, somuite, anata no imashime to, okite o hanaremashita.
Wareware wa mata, anata no shimobe naru yogensha tachi ga, anata no na o motte, wareware no outachi, kimitachi, senzotachi, oyobi kuni no subete no tami ni tsugeta kotoba ni kikishitagaimasendeshita.
Shu yo, seigi wa anata no mono desuga, haji wa wareware ni kuwaerarete, konnichi no you na arisama desu. Sunawachi Yuda no hitobito, Erusaremu no juumin oyobi zenIsuraeru no mono wa, chikaki mono mo, tooki mono mo mina, anata ga oiyarareta subete no kuniguni de haji o koumurimashita. Kore wa karera ga anata ni somuite okashita tsumi ni yoru no desu.
Shu yo, haji wa wareware no mono, wareware no outachi, kimitachi oyobi senzotachi no mono desu. Kore wa wareware ga anata ni mukatte tsumi o okashitakara desu.
Awaremi to, yurushi wa wareware no kami, Shu no mono desu. Kore wa wareware ga kare ni somuitakara desu.
Mata wareware no kami, Shu no mikoe ni kikishitagawazu, Shu ga sono shimobe yogensha tachi ni yotte, wareware no mae ni tamawatta rippou o okonawanakattakara desu.
Makoto ni Isuraeru no hitobito wa mina anata no rippou o okashi, hanaresatte, anata no mikoe ni kikishitagawanakatta no de, kami no shimobe Moose no rippou ni shirusareta noroi to chikaiga, wareware no ue ni sosogi kakarimashita. Kore wa wareware ga kami ni mukatte tsumi o okashitakara desu.
Sunawachi kami wa ooinaru wazawai o wareware no ue ni kudashite, saki ni wareware to, wareware o osameta tsukasatachi ni mukatte tsugerareta kotoba o jikkou sareta no desu. Ano Erusaremu ni nozonda you na koto wa, zentenka ni imada katsute nakatta koto desu.
Moose no rippou ni shirusareta you ni, kono wazawai wa subete wareware ni nozomimashitaga, nao wareware no kami, Shu no megumi o koimotomeru koto o sezu, sono fugi o hanarete, anata no shinri o satoru koto o mo shimasendeshita.
Sore yue, Shu wa kore o kokoro ni tomete, wazawai o wareware ni kudasareta no desu. Wareware no kami, Shu wa, nanigoto o sareru ni mo, tadashiku araseraremasu. Tokoro ga, wareware wa sono mikoe ni kikishitagawanakatta no desu.
Wareware no kami, Shu yo, anata wa tsuyoki mite o motte, anata no tami o Ejiputo no chi kara michibikidashite, konnichi no you ni, mina o ageraremashita. Wareware wa tsumi o okashi, yokoshima na furumai o shimashita.
Shu yo, douzo anata ga, kore made tadashii miwaza o nasareta you ni, anata no machi Erusaremu, anata no sei naru yama kara, anata no ikari to ikidoori to o torisatte kudasai. Kore wa wareware no tsumi to, wareware no senzo no fugi no tame ni, Erusaremu to, anata no tami ga, wareware no shuui no mono no monowarai to nattakara desu.
Sore yue, wareware no kami yo, shimobe no inori to negai o kiite kudasai. Shu yo, anata gojishin no tame ni, ano areta anata no seijo ni, anata no mikao o kagayakasete kudasai.
Waga kami yo, mimi o katamukete kiite kudasai. Me o hiraite, wareware no areta sama o mi, mina o motte tonaerareru machi o goran kudasai. Wareware ga anata no mae ni inori o sasageru no wa, wareware no gi ni yoru no de wa naku, tada anata no ooinaru awaremi ni yoru no desu.
Shu yo, kiite kudasai. Shu yo, yurushite kudasai. Shu yo, mikokoro ni tomete, okonatte kudasai. Waga kami yo, anata gojishin no tame ni, kore o nobasanaide kudasai. Anata no machi to, anata no tami wa, mina o motte tonaerarete irukara desu".
Watashi ga kou itte inori, katsu waga tsumi to waga tami Isuraeru no tsumi o zange shi, waga kami no sei naru yama no tame ni, waga kami, Shu no mae ni negai o shite ita toki,
Sunawachi watashi ga inori no kotoba o nobete ita toki, watashi ga hajime ni maboroshi no uchi ni mita, kano hito Gaburieru wa, sumiyaka ni tonde kite, yuu no sonaemono o sasageru koro, watashi ni chikazuki,
Watashi ni tsugete itta, "Danieru yo, watashi wa ima anata ni, chie to satori o ataeru tame ni kimashita.
Anata ga inori o hajimeta toki, mikotoba ga deta no de, sore o anata ni tsugeru tame ni kita no desu. Anata wa ooini aiserarete iru mono desu. Yue ni, kono mikotoba o kangaete, kono maboroshi o satori nasai.
Anata no tami to, anata no sei naru machi ni tsuite wa, nanajuu shuu ga sadamerarete imasu. Kore wa toga o owarase, tsumi ni owari o tsuge, fugi o aganai, eien no gi o motarashi, maboroshi to yogensha o fuuji, ito sei naru mono ni abura o sosogu tame desu.
Sore yue, Erusaremu o tatenaose to iu meirei ga dete kara, Meshiya naru hitori no kimi ga kuru made, nana shuu to rokujuu ni shuu aru koto o shiri, katsu satori nasai. Sono aida ni, shikamo fuan na jidai ni, Erusaremu wa hiroba to gairo to o motte, tatenaosarerudeshou.
Sono rokujuu ni shuu no nochi ni Meshiya wa tatarerudeshou. Tadashi jibun no tame ni de wa arimasen. Mata kitarubeki kimi no tami wa, machi to seijo to o horobosudeshou. Sono owari wa kouzui no you ni nozomudeshou. Soshite sono owari made sensou ga tsuzuki, kouhai wa sadamerarete imasu.
Kare wa isshuu no aida ooku no mono to, kataku keiyaku o musubudeshou. Soshite kare wa sono shuu no nakaba ni, gisei to sonaemono to o haisurudeshou. Mata arasu mono ga nikumubeki mono no tsubasa ni notte kurudeshou. Kou shite tsuini sono sadamatta owari ga, sono arasu mono no ue ni sosogareru no desu".
Perusha no ou Kurosu no daisan nen ni, Beruteshazaru to nazukerareta Danieru ni, hitotsu no kotoba ga keiji saretaga, sono kotoba wa shinjitsu de ari, ooinaru tatakai o imi suru mono de atta. Kare wa sono kotoba ni kokoro o tome, sono maboroshi o satotta.
