Sono nochi, kita no ou wa, minami no ou no kuni ni uchihairuga, jibun no kuni ni kaerudeshou.
Sono kora wa mata fungeki shite, amata no taigun o atsume, susunde itte, minagiri afure, toorisugiruga, mata itte, sono shiro ni made semeyoserudeshou.
Soko de minami no ou wa, ooini ikari, dete kite kita no ou to tatakaimasu. Kare wa taigun o okosukeredo mo, sono gun wa aite no te ni watasarerudeshou.
Kare ga sono gun o uchiyabutta toki, sono kokoro wa takaburi, suu mannin o taoshimasu. Shikashi, katsu koto wa arimasen.
Sore wa kita no ou ga mata hajime yori mo ooinaru gun o okoshi, suunen no nochi, ooinaru gunzei to ooku no gunjuhin to o motte, semete kurukara desu.
Sono koro ooku no mono ga okotte, minami no ou ni tekishimasu. Mata anata no tami no uchi no arakuremono ga, mizukara takabutte koto o nashi, maboroshi o jouju shiyou to suruga shippai surudeshou.
Kou shite kita no ou ga kite, rui o kizuki, kengo na machi o toruga, minami no ou no chikara wa, kore ni tachimukau koto ga dekizu, mata sono erinuki no tami mo, kore ni tachimukau chikara ga arimasen.
Kore ni semete kuru mono wa, sono kokoro no mama ni koto o nashi, sono mae ni tachimukau koto no dekiru mono wa naku, kare wa uruwashii chi ni tachi, sono chi wa mattaku kare no tame ni arasaremasu.
Kare wa zenkoku no chikara o motte uchihairouto, sono kao o mukeruga, aite to nakanaori o shi, sono musume o ataete, sono kuni o torou to shimasu. Shikashi, sono koto wa narazu, mata kare no rieki ni wa naranaideshou.
Sono nochi, kare wa kao o umizoi no kuniguni ni mukete, sono ooku no mono o torimasu. Shikashi, hitori no taishou ga atte, kare ga ataeta chijoku o sosogi, sono chijoku o kare no ue ni kaeshimasu.
Kou shite kare wa, sono kao o jibun no kuni no yougai ni mukeruga, kare wa tsumazuki taorete kieuserudeshou.
Kare ni kawatte okoru mono wa, eikou no kuni ni hito o tsukawashite, sozei o toritatesaserudeshou. Shikashi kare wa, ikari ni mo tatakai ni mo yorazu, suujitsu no uchi ni horobosaremasu.
Kare ni kawatte okoru mono wa, iyashimubeki mono de atte, kare ni wa, ou no songen ga ataerarezu, kare wa fui ni kite, kougen o motte kuni o erudeshou.
Kouzui no you na gunzei wa, kare no mae ni oshinagasarete yaburare, keiyaku no kimi taru mono mo mata yaburarerudeshou.
Kare wa, kore to doumei o musunde nochi, itsuwari no okonai o nashi, wazuka na tami o motte tsuyoku nari,
Fui ni sono shuu no mottomo koeta tokoro ni semeiri, sono chichi mo, sono chichi no chichi mo shinakatta koto o okonai, sono ubatta mono, kasumeta mono oyobi zaihou o, hitobito no naka ni chirasudeshou. Kare wa mata keiryaku o megurashite, kengo na shiro o semeruga, tadashi, sore wa toki no itaru made desu.
Kare wa sono seiryoku to yuuki to o furuiokoshi, taigun o hikiite minami no ou o sememasu. Minami no ou mo mata mizukara furui, hanahada ooinaru kyouryoku na gunzei o motte tatakaimasu. Shikashi, kare ni taishite, inbou o megurasu mono ga aru no de, kore ni tachimukau koto ga dekimasen.
Sunawachi kare no shokumotsu o taberu monotachi ga, kare o horoboshimasu. Soshite, sono gunzei wa oshinagasarete, ooku no mono ga taoreshinudeshou.
Kono futari no ou wa, gai o ataeyou to kokoro ni hakari, hitotsu shokutaku ni tomo ni shokushite, itsuwari o kataruga, sore wa seikou shimasen. Owari wa nao sadamatta toki no kuru made konaikara desu.
Kare wa ooinaru zaihou o motte, jibun no kuni ni kaerudeshou. Shikashi, kare no kokoro wa sei naru keiyaku ni somuki, hoshiimama ni koto o nashite, jibun no kuni ni kaerimasu.
Sadamatta toki ni natte, kare wa mata minami ni uchiirimasu. Shikashi, kono toki wa mae no toki no you de wa arimasen.
Sore wa KiTtemu no fune ga, kare ni tachimukatte kuru no de, kare wa obiyakasarete kaeri, sei naru keiyaku ni taishite ikidoori, koto o okonaudeshou. Kare wa kaette itte, sei naru keiyaku o suteru mono o kaerimi mochiirudeshou.
Kare kara gunzei ga okotte, shinden to joukaku o kegashi, jouku no hansai o torinozoki, arasu nikumubeki mono o taterudeshou.
Kare wa keiyaku o yaburu monodomo o, kougen o motte sosonokashi, somukaseruga, jibun no kami o shiru tami wa, kataku tatte koto o okonaimasu.
Tami no uchi no kashikoi hitobito wa, ooku no hito o satori ni itarasemasu. Sore de mo, karera wa shibaraku no aida, yai ba ni kakari, hi ni yakare, toraware, kasumerare nado shite taoremasu.
Sono taoreru toki, karera wa sukoshi no tasuke o emasu. Mata ooku no hito ga, kougen o motte karera ni kumisurudeshou.
Mata kashikoi mono no uchi no aru mono wa, owari no toki made, jibun o neri, kiyome, shiroku suru tame ni taorerudeshou. Owari wa nao sadamatta toki no kuru made konaikara desu.
Kono ou wa, sono kokoro no mama ni koto o okonai, subete no kami o koete, jibun o takaku shi, jibun o ooini shi, kamigami no kami taru mono ni mukatte, odorokubeki koto o katari, ikidoori no yamu toki made sakaerudeshou. Kore wa sadamerareta koto ga jouju surukara desu.
Kare wa sono senzo no kamigami o kaerimizu, mata fujin no konomu mono mo, ikanaru kami o mo kaeriminaideshou. Kare wa subete ni masatte, jibun o ooinaru mono to surukara desu.
Kare wa korera no mono no kawari ni, yougai no kami o agame, kin, gin, houseki, oyobi takaramono o motte, sono senzotachi no shiranakatta kami o agame,
Ihou no kami no tasuke ni yotte, mottomo kyouko na shiro ni mukatte, koto o nasudeshou. Soshite kare o mitomeru mono ni wa, eiyo o mashi atae, kore ni ooku no hito o osamesase, shouyo to shite tochi o wakeataerudeshou.
Owari no toki ni natte, minami no ou wa kare to tatakaimasu. Kita no ou wa, sensha to kihei to, ooku no fune o motte, tsumujikaze no you ni kare o seme, kuniguni ni haitte itte, minagiri afure, toorisugirudeshou.
Kare wa mata uruwashii kuni ni hairimasu. Mata kare ni yotte, ooku no mono ga horobosaremasu. Shikashi, Edomu, Moabu, Anmon bi tora no uchi no omona mono wa, kare no te kara sukuwaremashou.
Kare wa kuniguni ni sono te o nobashi, Ejiputo no chi mo manukaremasen.
Kare wa kingin no zaihou to, Ejiputo no subete no takaramono o shihai shi, Ribiya bi to, Echiopiya bito wa, kare no ato ni shitagaimasu.
Shikashi higashi to kita kara no shirase ga kare o odorokashi, kare wa ooku no hito o horoboshi tayasou to, ooinaru ikari o motte dete ikimasu.
Kare wa umi to uruwashii seizan to no aida ni, tenmaku no kyuuden o moukerudeshou. Shikashi, kare wa tsuini sono owari ni i tari, kare o tasukeru mono wa naideshou.
Sono toki anata no tami o mamotte iru ooinaru kimi Mikaeru ga tachiagarimasu. Mata kuni ga hajimatte kara, sono toki ni itaru made, katsute nakatta hodo no nayami no toki ga arudeshou. Shikashi, sono toki anata no tami wa sukuwaremasu. Sunawachi ano sho ni na o shirusareta mono wa mina sukuwaremasu.
Mata chi no chiri no naka ni nemutte iru mono no uchi, ooku no mono wa me o samasudeshou. Sono uchi eien no seimei ni itaru mono mo ari, mata haji to, kagirinaki chijoku o ukeru mono mo arudeshou.
Kashikoi mono wa, oozora no kagayaki no you ni kagayaki, mata ooku no hito o gi ni michibiku mono wa, hoshi no you ni natte eien ni itarudeshou.
Danieru yo, anata wa owari no toki made kono kotoba o hishi, kono sho o fuujite oki nasai. Ooku no mono wa, achikochi to saguri shirabe, soshite chishiki ga masudeshou".
Soko de, ware Danieru ga mite iruto, hoka ni mata futari no mono ga atte, hitori wa kawa no konata no kishi ni, hitori wa kawa no kanata no kishi ni tatte ita.
Watashi wa, kano amanuno o kite kawa no mizu no ue ni iru hito ni mukatte itta, "Kono ijou na dekigoto wa, itsu ni natte owarudeshou ka" to.
Kano amanuno o kite, kawa no mizu no ue ni ita hito ga, ten ni mukatte, sono migi no te to hidari no te o age, eien ni ikeru mono o sashite chikai, sore wa, hitotoki to futa toki to hantoki de aru. Sei naru tami o uchikudaku chikara ga kiesaru toki ni, korera no koto wa mina jouju surudarou to iu no o, watashi wa kiita.
Watashi wa kore o kiitakeredo mo satorenakatta. Watashi wa itta, "Waga Shu yo, korera no koto no ketsumatsu wa donna deshou ka".
Kare wa itta, "Danieru yo, anata no michi o iki nasai. Kono kotoba wa owari no toki made hishi, katsu fuujite okaremasu.
Ooku no mono wa, jibun o kiyome, jibun o shiroku shi, katsu nerarerudeshou. Shikashi, warui mono wa warui koto o okonai, hitori mo satoru koto wa naiga, kashikoi mono wa satorudeshou.
Jouku no hansai ga surinozokare, arasu nikumubeki mono ga taterareru toki kara, sen nihyaku kyuujuu nichi ga sadamerarete iru.
Matte ite sen sanbyaku sanjuu go nichi ni itaru mono wa saiwai desu.
Shikashi, owari made anata no michi o iki nasai. Anata wa yasumi ni hairi, sadamerareta hi no owari ni tatte, anata no bun o ukerudeshou".
Yudaya no ou Ujiya, Yotamu, Ahazu, Hizekiya no yo, Isuraeru no ou Yoashi no ko Yarabeamu no yo ni, Beeri no ko Hosea ni nozonda Shu no kotoba.
Shu ga saisho Hosea ni yotte katarareta toki, Shu wa Hosea ni iwareta, "Itte, inkou no tsuma to, inkou ni yotte umareta kora o ukeireyo. Kono kuni wa Shu ni somuite, hanahadashii inkou o nashite irukara de aru".
Soko de kare wa itte Deburaimu no musume Gomeru o metotta. Kanojo wa migomotte otokonoko o unda.
Shu wa mata kare ni iwareta, "Anata wa sono ko no na o Ezureru to nazukeyo. Shibaraku shite watashi wa Ezureru no chi no tame ni Ehiu no ie o basshi, Isuraeru no ie no kuni o horobosukara de aru.
Sono hi, watashi wa Ezureru no tani de Isuraeru no yumi o oru" to.
Gomeru wa mata migomotte onnanoko o unda. Shu wa Hosea ni iwareta, "Anata wa sono na o Roruhama to nazukeyo. Watashi wa mohaya Isuraeru no ie o awaremazu, kesshite kore o yurusanaikara de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa Yuda no ie o awaremi, sono kami, Shu ni yotte kore o sukuu. Watashi wa yumi, tsurugi, sensou, uma oyobi kihei ni yotte sukuu no de wa nai" to.
Gomeru wa Roruhama o chibanare saseta toki, mata migomotte otokonoko o unda.
Shu wa iwareta, "Sono ko no na o Roanmi to nazukeyo. Anata gata wa, watashi no tami de wa naku, watashi wa, anata gata no kami de wa naikara de aru".
Shikashi Isuraeru no hitobito no kazu wa umi no suna no you ni hakaru koto mo, kazoeru koto mo dekinai hodo ni natte, saki ni karera ga "Anata gata wa, watashi no tami de wa nai" to iwareta sono tokoro de, "Anata gata wa ikeru kami no ko de aru" to iwareru you ni naru.
Soshite Yuda no hitobito to Isuraeru no hitobito wa tomo ni atsumari, hitori no chou o tatete, sono chi kara nobotte kuru. Ezureru no hi wa ooinaru mono to naru.
Anata gata no kyoudai ni mukatte wa "Anmi (waga tami)" to ii, anata gata no shimai ni mukatte wa "Ruhama (awaremareru mono)" to ie.
"Anata gata no haha to agetsurae, agetsurae - - kanojo wa watashi no tsuma de wa nai, watashi wa kanojo no otto de wa nai - - soshite kanojo ni sono kao kara inkou o nozokase, sono chibusa no aida kara kan'in o nozokase yo.
Sou de nakereba, watashi wa kanojo no kimono o haide hadaka ni shi, sono umaredeta hi no you ni shi, mata arano no you ni shi, kawaki kitta chi no you ni shi, kawaki ni yotte kanojo o korosu.
Watashi wa sono kora o awaremanai, karera wa inkou no kora dakara de aru.
Karera no haha wa inkou o nashi, karera o haranda kanojo wa hazubeki koto o okonatta. Kanojo wa itta, 'Watashi wa waga koibitotachi ni tsuite ikou. Karera wa pan to mizu to hitsuji no ke to asa to abura to nomimono to o, watashi ni ataeru mono de aru' to.
Sore yue, watashi wa ibara de kanojo no michi o fusagi, kaki o tatete, kanojo ni wa sono michi ga wakaranai you ni suru.
Kanojo wa sono koibitotachi no ato o shitatte iku, shikashi karera ni oitsuku koto wa nai. Karera o tazuneru, shikashi miidasu koto wa nai. Soko de kanojo wa iu, 'Watashi wa itte, saki no otto ni kaerou. Ano toki wa ima yori mo watashi ni yokattakara' to.
Kanojo ni kokumotsu to sake to abura to o ataeta mono, mata Baaru no tame ni mochiita gin to kin to o ooku kanojo ni ataeta mono wa, watashi de atta koto o kanojo wa shiranakatta.
Sore yue, watashi wa kokumotsu o sono toki ni natte ubai, budoushu o sono kisetsu ni natte ubai, mata kanojo no hadaka o oou tame ni mochiiru hitsuji no ke to asa to o ubaitoru.
Watashi wa ima, kanojo no midara na koto o sono koibitotachi no me no mae ni arawasu. Dare mo kanojo o watashi no te kara sukuu mono wa nai.
Watashi wa kanojo no subete no tanoshimi, sunawachi iwai, shingetsu, ansokunichi, subete no matsuri o yamesaseru.
Watashi wa mata kanojo ga saki ni 'Kore wa watashi no koibitora ga, watashi ni ataeta houshuu da' to itta kanojo no budou no ki to, ichijiku no ki to o arashi, kore o hayashi to shi, no no kemono ni kore o kuwaseru.
Mata kanojo ga mimiwa to houseki de mi o kazari, sono koibitotachi o shitatte itte, watashi o wasure, kou o taite tsukaeta Baaru no matsuri no hi no tame ni, watashi wa kanojo o bassuru to Shu wa iwareru.
Sore yue, miyo, watashi wa kanojo o izanatte, arano ni michibiite iki, nengoro ni kanojo ni katarou.
Sono tokoro de watashi wa kanojo ni sono budou batake o atae, Akoru no tani o nozomi no mon to shite ataeru. Sono tokoro de kanojo wa wakakatta hi no you ni, Ejiputo no kuni kara nobotte kita toki no you ni, kotaerude arou.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, anata wa watashi o 'Waga otto' to yobi, mohaya 'Waga Baaru' to wa yobanai.
Watashi wa moromoro no Baaru no na o kanojo no kuchi kara torinozoki, kasanete sono na o tonaeru koto no nai you ni suru.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa mata anata no tame ni no no kemono, sora no tori oyobi chi no hau mono to keiyaku o musubi, mata yumi to, tsurugi to, sensou to o chi kara tatte, anata o yasuraka ni fusaseru.
Mata watashi wa eien ni anata to chigiri o musubu. Sunawachi seigi to, kouhei to, itsukushimito, awaremi to o motte chigiri o musubu.
Watashi wa shinjitsu o motte, anata to chigiri o musubu. Soshite anata wa Shu o shirude arou.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi watashi wa ten ni kotae, ten wa chi ni kotaeru.
Chi wa kokumotsu to sake to abura to ni kotae, mata korera no mono wa Ezureru ni kotaeru.
Watashi wa watashi no tame ni kare o chi ni maki, awaremarenu mono o awaremi, watashi no tami de nai mono ni mukatte, 'Anata wa watashi no tami de aru' to ii, kare wa 'Anata wa watashi no kami de aru' to iu".
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Anata wa futatabi itte, Isuraeru no hitobito ga ta no kamigami ni tenjite, hoshibudou no kashi o aisuru ni mo kakawarazu, Shu ga kore o aiserareru you ni, kanpu ni aiserareru onna, kan'in o okonau onna o aiseyo" to.
Soko de watashi wa gin juu go shikeru to oomugi ichi homeru han to o motte kanojo o kaitotta.
Watashi wa kanojo ni itta, "Anata wa nagaku watashi no tokoro ni todomatte, inkou o nasazu, mata ta no hito no mono to natte wa naranai. Watashi mo mata, anata ni sou shiyou" to.
Isuraeru no kora wa ooku no hi no aida, ou naku, kimi naku, gisei naku, hashira naku, Epode oyobi Terapimu mo naku sugosu.
Soshite sono nochi Isuraeru no kora wa kaette kite, sono kami, Shu to, sono ou Dabide to o tazunemotome, owari no hi ni ononoite, Shu to sono megumi ni mukatte kuru.
Isuraeru no hitobito yo, Shu no kotoba o kike. Shu wa kono chi ni sumu mono to arasowareru. Kono chi ni wa shinjitsu ga naku, aijou ga naku, mata kami o shiru koto mo naikara de aru.
Tada noroito, itsuwari to, hitogoroshi to, nusumi to, kan'in suru koto nomi de, hitobito wa mina arekurui, satsugai ni satsugai ga tsuzuite iru.
Sore yue, kono chi wa nageki, kore ni sumu mono wa mina, no no kemono mo sora no tori mo tomo ni otoroe, umi no uo sae mo tae hateru.
Shikashi, dare mo arasotte wa naranai, semete wa naranai. Saishi yo. Watashi no arasou no wa, anata to arasou no da.
Anata wa hiru tsumazuki, yogensha mo mata anata to tomo ni yoru tsumazuku. Watashi wa anata no haha o horobosu.
Watashi no tami wa chishiki ga nai tame ni horobosareru. Anata wa chishiki o suteta yue ni, watashi mo anata o sutete, watashi no saishi to shinai. Anata wa anata no kami no rippou o wasureta yue ni, watashi mo mata anata no kora o wasureru.
Karera wa ookiku naru ni shitagatte, masumasu watashi ni tsumi o okashita yue, watashi wa karera no sakae o haji ni kaeru.
Karera wa waga tami no tsumi o kuimono ni shi, sono tsumi o okasu koto o setsu ni negatte iru.
Sore yue saishi mo tami to onaji you ni naru. Watashi wa sono waza no tame ni karera o basshi, sono okonai no tame ni karera ni mukuiru.
Karera wa tabete mo aku koto naku, inkou o nashite mo sono kazu o masu koto ga nai. Karera wa Shu o sutete, inkou o aishitakara de aru.
Sake to atarashii sake to wa shiryo o ubau.
Waga tami wa ki ni mukatte koto o tazuneru. Mata sono tsue wa karera ni koto o shimesu. Kore wa inkou no rei ga karera o mayowashitakara de aru. Karera wa sono kami o sutete inkou o nashita.
Karera wa yamayama no itadaki de gisei o sasage, oka no ue, kashi no ki, yanagi no ki, Terebin no ki no shita de sonaemono o sasageru. Kore wa sono kokage ga kokochiyoi tame de aru. Sore yue, anata gata no musume wa inkou o nashi, anata gata no yome wa kan'in o okonau.
Watashi wa anata gata no musume ga inkou o shite mo basshinai. Mata anata gata no yome ga kan'in o okonatte mo basshinai. Otokotachi mizukara yuujo to tomo ni hanaresari, miya no yuujo to tomo ni gisei o sasagete irukara de aru. Satori no nai tami wa horobiru.
Isuraeru yo, anata wa inkou o nashite mo, Yuda ni tsumi o okasasete wa naranai. Girugaru e itte wa naranai. Beteaben ni nobotte wa naranai. Mata "Shu wa ikite orareru" to itte chikatte wa naranai.
Isuraeru wa goujou na meushi no you ni goujou de aru. Ima, Shu wa kohitsuji o hiroi no ni hanatsu you ni shite, karera o yashinau koto ga dekiyou ka.
Efuraimu wa guuzou ni musubi tsuranatta. Sono nasu ni makase yo.
Karera wa shuen no toriko to nari, inkou ni fukette iru. Karera wa sono kouei yori mo haji o aisuru.
Kaze wa sono tsubasa ni karera o tsutsunda. Karera wa sono saidan no yue ni haji o ukeru.
Saishitachi yo, kore o kike, Isuraeru no ie yo, kokoro o tomeyo, ou no ie yo, mimi o katamukeyo, sabaki wa anata gata ni nozomu. Anata gata wa Mizupa ni wana o mouke, Taboru no ue ni ami o hattakara da.
Karera wa Shittemu no ana o fukaku shitaga, watashi wa karera o kotogotoku korashimeru.
Watashi wa Efuraimu o shitte iru. Isuraeru wa watashi ni kakureru koto ga nai. Efuraimu yo, anata wa imainkou o nashi, Isuraeru wa kegasareta.
Karera no okonai wa karera o kami ni kaerasenai. Sore wa inkou no rei ga karera no uchi ni atte, Shu o shiru koto ga dekinaikara da.
Isuraeru no hokori wa sono kao ni mukatte shougen shite iru. Efuraimu wa sono fugi ni yotte tsumazuki, Yuda mo mata karera to tomo ni tsumazuku.
Karera wa hitsuji no mure, ushi no mure o tazusaete itte, Shu o motomete mo, Shu ni au koto wa nai. Shu wa karera kara hanaresarareta.
Karera wa Shu ni mukatte teisou o mamorazu, hoka no mono no ko o unda. Shingetsu wa karera o sono tahata to tomo ni horobosu.
Gibea de tsunobue o fuki, Rama de rappa o narashi, Beteaben de yobawari sakebe. Beniyamin yo, ononoke.
Efuraimu wa keibatsu no hi ni are sutareru. Watashi wa Isuraeru no buzoku no uchi ni, kanarazu okorubeki koto o shiraseru.
Yuda no kimitachi wa sakai o utsusu mono no you ni natta. Watashi wa waga ikari o mizu no you ni karera no ue ni sosogu.
Efuraimu wa amanjite, munashii mono ni shitagatte ayunda yue, sabaki o ukete, shi etagerare, uchihishigareru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Efuraimu ni wa, shimi no you ni, Yuda no ie ni wa kusare no you ni naru.
Efuraimu wa onore no yamai o mi, Yuda wa onore no kizu o mita toki, Efuraimu wa ASsuriya ni iki, daiou ni hito o tsukawashita. Shikashi kare wa anatagata o iyasu koto ga dekinai. Mata, anata gata no kizu o naosu koto ga dekinai.
Watashi wa Efuraimu ni taishite wa, shishi no you ni nari, Yuda no ie ni taishite wa wakaki shishi no you ni naru. Watashi wa, watashi koso, kakisaite sari, kasumete ikuga, dare mo sukuu mono wa nai.
Watashi wa karera ga sono tsumi o mitomete, waga kao o tazunemotomeru made, watashi no tokoro ni kaette iyou. Karera wa nayami ni yotte, watashi o tazunemotomete iu,
"Saa, watashitachi wa Shu ni kaerou. Shu wa watashitachi o kakisakaretaga, mata iyashi, watashitachi o utaretaga, mata tsutsunde kudasarukara da.
Shu wa, futsu ka no nochi, watashitachi o ikashi, mikkame ni watashitachi o tataserareru. Watashitachi wa mimae de ikiru.
Watashitachi wa Shu o shirou, setsu ni Shu o shiru koto o motomeyou. Shu wa ashita no hikari no you ni kanarazu araware ide, fuyu no ame no you ni, watashitachi ni nozomi, haru no ame no you ni chi o uruosareru".
Efuraimu yo, watashi wa anata ni nani o shiyou ka. Yuda yo, watashi wa anata ni nani o shiyou ka. Anata gata no ai wa ashita no kumo no gotoku, mata, tachimachi kieru tsuyu no you na mono de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa yogensha tachi ni yotte karera o kiritaoshi, waga kuchi no kotoba o motte karera o koroshita. Waga sabaki wa arawarederu hikari no you da.
Watashi wa itsukushimi o yorokobi, gisei o yorokobanai. Hansai yori mo mushiro kami o shiru koto o yorokobu.
Tokoro ga karera wa Adamu de keiyaku o yaburi, kashiko de watashi ni somuita.
Gireade wa aku o okonau mono no machi de, chi no ashiato de mitasarete iru.
Touzoku ga hito o machibuse suru you ni, saishitachi wa tou o kumi, Shikemu e yuku michi de hito o korosu. Kono you ni karera wa ashiki koto o okonau.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no ie ni osorubeki koto o mita. Kashiko de Efuraimu wa inkou o nashi, Isuraeru wa kegasareta.
Yuda yo, anata no tame ni mo kariirega sadamerarete iru. Watashi ga waga tami no han'ei o kaifuku suru toki,
Watashi ga Isuraeru o iyasu toki, Efuraimu no fugi to, Samariya no ashiki waza to wa arawareru. Karera wa itsuwari o okonai, uchi de wanusu bito ga oshiiri, soto de wa sanzoku no mure ga osoikitaru.
Shikashi, karera wa watashi ga karera no subete no aku o oboete iru koto o satoranai. Ima, sono waza wa karera o kakonde, watashi no kao no mae ni aru.
Karera wa sono aku o motte ou o yorokobase, sono itsuwari o motte kimitachi o yorokobaseru.
Karera wa mina kan'in o okonau mono de, pan o yaku mono ga atsuku suru ro no you da. Pan o yaku mono wa, neriko o konete kara, sore ga fukureru made, shibaraku, hi o okosu koto o shinai dake da.
Wareware no ou no hi ni, tsukasatachi wa sake no netsu ni yotte yami wazurai, ou wa azakeru mono to tomo ni te o nobeta.
Karera wa inbou o motte sono kokoro o ro no you ni moyasu. Sono ikari wa yodooshi kusuburi, asa ni naruto honoo no you ni moeru.
Karera wa mina, ro no you ni atsuku natte, sono sabaki bito o yakihorobosu. Sono moromoro no ou wa mina taoreru. Karera no naka ni wa watashi o yobu mono ga hitori mo nai.
Efuraimu wa moromoro no tami no naka ni hairimajiru. Efuraimu wa hi ni kakete, kaesanai kashi de aru.
Takokujinra wa kare no chikara o kui tsukusuga, kare wa sore o shiranai. Shiraga ga majitte haete mo, sore o satoranai.
Isuraeru no hokori wa mizukara ni mukatte shougen shite iru, karera wa kono moromoro no koto ga atte mo, nao sono kami, Shu ni kaerazu, mata Shu o motomenai.
Efuraimu wa chie no nai oroka na, hato no you da. Karera wa Ejiputo ni mukatte yobimotome, mata ASsuriya e iku.
Karera ga iku toki, watashi wa karera no ue ni ami o hatte, sora no tori no you ni hikiotoshi, sono ashiki okonai no yue ni, karera o korashimeru.
Wazawai naru ka na, karera wa watashi o hanarete mayoideta. Horobi wa karera ni nozomu. Karera ga watashi ni mukatte tsumi o okashitakara da. Watashi wa karera o aganaou to omouga, karera wa watashi ni sakaratte itsuwari o iu.
Karera wa magokoro o motte watashi o yobazu, tada yuka no ue de kanashimi sakebu. Karera wa kokumotsu to sake no tame ni wa atsumaruga, watashi ni sakarau.
Watashi wa karera o oshie, sono ude o tsuyoku shitaga, karera wa watashi ni sakaratte, ashiki koto o hakaru.
Karera wa Baaru ni kaeru. Karera wa azamuku yumi no you da. Karera no kimitachi wa sono shita no takaburi no tame ni, tsurugi ni taoreru. Kore wa Ejiputo no kuni de hitobito no azakeri to naru.
Rappa o anata no kuchi ni ateyo, hagetaka wa Shu no ie ni nozomu. Karera ga watashi no keiyaku o yaburi, watashi no rippou o okashitakara da.
Karera wa watashi ni mukatte sakebu, "Waga kami yo, wareware Isuraeru wa anata o shiru" to.
Isuraeru wa zen wa shirizoketa. Teki wa kore o oude arou.
Karera wa ou o tateta, shikashi, watashi ni yotte tateta no de wa nai. Karera wa kimi o tateta, shikashi, watashi wa kore o shiranai. Karera wa gin to kin o motte, jibuntachi no horobi no tame ni guuzou o tsukutta.
Samariya yo, watashi wa anata no koushi o imikirau. Watashi no ikari wa karera ni mukatte moeru. Karera wa itsu ni nareba Isuraeru de tsumi naki mono to narude arou ka.
Kore wa koujin no tsukutta mono de, kami de wa nai.Samariya no koushi wa kudakete kona to naru.
Karera wa kaze o maite, tsumujikaze o karitoru. Tatte iru kokumotsu wa ho o motazu, mata minoranai. Tatoi minotte mo, takokujin ga kore o kui tsukusu.
Isuraeru wa nomareta. Karera wa shokokumin no aida ni atte, sudeni muyou na utsuwa no you ni natta.
Karera wa hitori samayou no no roba no you ni, ASsuriya ni nobotte itta. Efuraimu wa mono o okutte koibito o eta.
Tatoi karera ga kuniguni ni mono o okutte doumeisha o ete mo, watashi wa ma mo naku karera o atsumeru. Karera wa shibaraku ni shite, ou ya kimitachi ni abura o sosogu koto o yameru.
Efuraimu wa ooku no saidan o tsukutte tsumi o okashita yue, kore wa kare ni wa tsumi o okasu tame no saidan to natta.
Watashi wa kare no tame ni, amata no rippou o kakishirushitaga, kore wa kaette ayashii mono no you ni omowareta.
Karera wa gisei o konomi, niku o sasagete kore o taberu. Shikashi Shu wa kore o yorokobarenai. Ima, karera no fugi o oboe, karera no tsumi o basserareru. Karera wa Ejiputo ni kaeru.
Isuraeru wa jibun no tsukurinushi o wasurete, moromoro no kyuuden o tateta. Yuda wa kengo na machimachi o ooku mashikuwaeta. Shikashi watashi wa hi o sono machimachi ni okutte, moromoro no shiro o yakihorobosu.
Isuraeru yo, moromoro no tami no you ni yorokobi odoru na. Anata wa inkou o nashite, anata no kami o hanare, subete no kokumotsu no uchi ba de ukeru inkou no atai o aishita.
Uchi ba to saka bune to wa karera o yashinawanai. Mata atarashii sake mo munashiku naru.
Karera wa Shu no chi ni sumu koto naku, Efuraimu wa Ejiputo ni kaeri, ASsuriya de kegareta mono o taberu.
Karera wa Shu ni mukatte sake o sosogazu, mata gisei o motte Shu o yorokobasezu, karera no pan wa mo ni oru mono no pan no you de, subete kore o taberu mono wa kegasareru. Karera no pan wa tada jibun no ue o mitasu tame de, Shu no ie ni, hairu koto wa dekinai.
Anata gata wa iwai no hi to, Shu no matsuri no hi ni, nani o shiyou to suru no ka.
Miyo, karera wa ASsuriya e iku. Ejiputo wa karera o atsume, Menpisu wa karera o houmuru. Azami wa karera no gin no takaramono o shoyuu shi, ibara wa karera no tenmaku ni habikoru.
Keibatsu no hi wa kita. Mukui no hi wa kita. Isuraeru wa kore o shiru. Yogensha wa oroka na mono, rei ni kanjita hito wa kurutta mono da. Kore wa anata gata no fugi ga ooku, urami ga ookii tame de aru.
Yogensha wa waga kami no tami Efuraimu no miharinin de aru. Shikashi yogensha no subete no michi ni wa tori o toru mono no wana ga ari, urami wa sono kami no ie ni aru.
Karera wa Gibea no hi no you ni, fukaku onore o kusaraseta. Shu wa sono fugi o oboe, sono tsumi o basserareru.
Watashi wa Isuraeru o arano no budou no you ni mi, anata gata no senzotachi o, ichijiku no ki no hajime ni musunda hatsunari no you ni mita. Tokoro ga karera wa Baaru Peoru e iki, mi o Baaru ni yudane, karera ga aishita mono to onaji you ni nikumubeki mono to natta.
Efuraimu no eikou wa, tori no you ni tobi saru. Sunawachi umu koto mo, haramu koto mo, migomoru koto mo nakunaru.
Tatoi karera ga ko o sodatete mo, watashi wa sono ko o ubatte, nokoru mono no nai you ni suru. Watashi ga karera o hanareru toki, karera wa wazawai da.
Watashi ga mita you ni, Efuraimu no kora wa ejiki ni sadamerareta. Efuraimu wa sono kora o, hito o korosu mono ni watasanakereba naranai.
Shu yo, karera ni ataete kudasai. Anata wa nani o ataeraremasu ka. Ryuuzan no tai to, kawaita chibusa o karera ni ataete kudasai.
Karera no subete no aku wa Girugaru ni aru. Watashi wa kashiko de karera o nikunda. Karera no okonai no ashiki ga yue ni, karera o wagaya kara oidashi, kasanete aisuru koto o shinai. Sono kimitachi wa mina, hangyakusha de aru.
Efuraimu wa utare, sono ne wa karete, mi o musubanai. Tatoi karera ga ko o unde mo, watashi wa sono itsukushimu kora o korosu.
Karera wa kikishitagawanai no de, waga kami wa kore o suterareru. Karera wa moromoro no kunitami no uchi ni, sasuraihito to naru.
Isuraeru wa mi o musubu shigetta budou no ki de aru. Sono mi o ooku musubu ni shitagatte, saidan o mashi, sono chi no yutaka naru ni shitagatte, hashira no zou o uruwashiku shita.
Karera no kokoro wa itsuwari de aru. Ima, karera wa sono tsumi o owanakereba naranai. Shu wa sono saidan o kowashi, sono hashira no zou o kudakareru.
Ima, karera wa iu, "Wareware wa Shu o osorenai no de, wareware ni wa ou ga nai. Ou wa wareware no tame ni nani o nashi eyou ka" to.
Karera wa muna shiki kotoba o idashi, itsuwari no chikai o motte keiyaku o musubu. Sore yue, sabaki wa hatake no une no dokusou no you ni arawareru.
Samariya no juumin wa, Beteaben no koushi no tame ni ononoki, sono tami wa kore ga tame ni nageki, sono guuzou ni tsukaeru saishitachi wa, sono eikou no usetaru ga tame ni nakikanashimu.
Sono koushi wa ASsuriya ni tazusaerare, reimotsu to shite daiou ni sasagerare, Efuraimu wa haji o uke, Isuraeru wa onore no guuzou o hajiru.
