Ejiputo wa arechi to nari, Edomu wa arano to naru. Karera wa sono kuni de Yuda no hitobito o shi etage, tsumi naki mono no chi o nagashitakara de aru.
Shikashi Yuda wa eien ni hito no sumu tokoro to nari, Erusaremu wa yoyo ni tamotsu.
Watashi wa karera ni chi no houfuku o nashi, to ga aru mono o yurusanai. Shu wa Shion ni sumawareru".
Tekoa no bokusha no hitori de aru Amosu no kotoba. Kore wa Yuda no ou Ujiya no yo, Isuraeru no ou Yoashi no ko Yarabeamu no yo, jishin no ni nen mae ni, kare ga Isuraeru ni tsuite shimesareta mono de aru.
Kare wa itta, "Shu wa Shion kara hoe, Erusaremu kara koe o dasareru. Bokusha no makiba wa nageki, Karumeru no itadaki wa kareru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Damasuko no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga tetsu no suri ita de, Gireade o fuminijittakara de aru.
Watashi wa Hazaeru no ie ni hi o okuri, Benehadade no moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu.
Watashi wa Damasuko no kannoki o kudaki, Aben no tani kara juumin o tachi, Beteeden kara ou no tsue o toru mono o tatsu. Suriya no tami wa Kiru ni toraerarete iku" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Gaza no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga hitobito o kotogotoku toraete itte, Edomu ni watashitakara de aru.
Watashi wa Gaza no ishigaki ni hi o okuri, sono moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu.
Watashi wa Ashidodo kara juumin o tachi, Ashikeron kara ou no tsue o toru mono o tatsu. Watashi wa mata te o kaeshite Ekuron o utsu. Soshite nokotta Perishite bito mo horobiru" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Tsuro no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga hitobito o kotogotoku Edomu ni watashi, mata kyoudai no keiyaku o kokoro ni tomenakattakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Tsuro no ishigaki ni hi o okuri, sono moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Edomu no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa kare ga tsurugi o motte sono kyoudai o oi, mattaku awaremi no jou o tachi, tsune ni ikatte, hito o kakisaki, nagaku sono ikidoori o tamottakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Teman ni hi o okuri, Bozura no moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Anmon no hitobito no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga sono kokkyou o hirogeru tame ni, Gireade no harande iru onna o hikisaitakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Raba no ishigaki ni hi o hanachi, sono moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu. Kore wa tatakai no hi ni, toki no koe o motte serare, tsumujikaze no hi ni, boufuu o motte serareru.
Karera no ou wa sono tsukasatachi to tomo ni toraerarete iku" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Moabu no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa kare ga Edomu no ou no hone o yaite hai ni shitakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Moabu ni hi o okuri, Keriote no moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu. Moabu wa sawagi to, toki no koe to, rappa no oto no naka ni shinu.
Watashi wa sono uchi kara, shihaisha o tachi, sono subete no tsukasa o kare to tomo ni korosu" to Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Yuda no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga Shu no rippou o sute, sono sadame o mamorazu, sono senzotachi ga shitagai aruita itsuwari no mono ni madowasaretakara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi wa Yuda ni hi o okuri, Erusaremu no moromoro no kyuuden o yakihorobosu".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Isuraeru no mittsu no to ga, yontsu no toga no tame ni, watashi wa kore o basshite yurusanai. Kore wa karera ga tadashii mono o kane no tame ni uri, mazushii mono o kutsu hitoashi no tame ni urukara de aru.
Karera wa yowai mono no atama o chi no chiri ni fumitsuke, kurushimu mono no michi o mage, mata fushi tomo ni hitori no onna no tokoro e itte, waga sei naru na o kegasu.
Karera wa subete no saidan no katawara ni shichi ni totta ifuku o shiite, sono ue ni fushi, bakkin o motte eta sake o, sono kami no ie de nomu.
Saki ni watashi wa Amori bito o karera no mae kara horoboshita. Kore wa sono takaki koto, kouhaku no gotoku, sono tsuyoki koto, kashi no ki no you de attaga, watashi wa sono ue no mi to, shita no ne to o horoboshita.
Watashi wa mata, anatagata o Ejiputo no chi kara tsurenobori, yonjuu nen no aida arano de, anatagata o michibiki, Amori bito no chi o esaseta.
Watashi wa anata gata no kora no uchi kara yogensha o okoshi, anata gata no wakamono no uchi kara Najiru bito o okoshita. Isuraeru no hitobito yo, sou de wa nai ka" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Tokoro ga anata gata wa Najiru bito ni sake o nomase, yogensha ni meijite 'Yogen suru na' to iu.
Miyo, watashi wa mugi taba o ippai tsunda kuruma ga mono o assuru you ni, anatagata o sono tokoro de assuru.
Hayaku hashiru mono mo nigeba o ushinai, tsuyoi mono mo sono chikara o furuu koto ga dekizu, yuushi mo sono inochi o sukuu koto ga dekinai.
Yumi o toru mono mo tatsu koto ga dekizu, ashibaya no mono mo jibun o sukuu koto ga dekizu, uma ni noru mono mo sono inochi o sukuu koto ga dekinai.
Yuushi no uchi no ooshii kokoro no mono mo sono hi ni wa hadaka de nigeru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Isuraeru no hitobito yo, Shu ga anata gata ni mukatte iwareta koto, watashi ga Ejiputo no chi kara michibiki nobotta zenka ni mukatte itta kono kotoba o kike.
"Chi no moromoro no yakara no uchi de, watashi wa tada, anata gata dake o shitta. Sore yue, watashi wa anata gata no moromoro no tsumi no tame, anatagata o bassuru.
Futari no mono ga moshi yakusoku shinakattanara, issho ni arukudarou ka.
Shishi ga moshi emono ga nakattanara, hayashi no naka de hoerudarou ka. Wakai shishi ga moshi mono o tsukamanakattanara, sono ana kara koe o dasudarou ka.
Moshi wana ga nakattanara, tori wa chi ni hatta ami ni kakarudarou ka. Ami ni moshi nani mo kakaranakattanara, chi kara tobiagarudarou ka.
Machi de rappa ga nattanara, tami wa odorokanaidarou ka. Shu ga nasareru no de nakereba, machi ni wazawai ga okorudarou ka.
Makoto ni Shu naru kami wa sono shimobe de aru yogensha ni sono kakureta koto o shimesanaide wa, nanigoto o mo nasarenai.
Shishi ga hoeru, dare ga osorenaide irareyou. Shu naru kami ga katarareru, dare ga yogen shinaide irareyou".
ASsuriya ni aru moromoro no kyuuden, Ejiputo no chi ni aru moromoro no kyuuden ni nobete ie, "Samariya no yamayama ni atsumari, sono uchi ni aru ooinaru sawagi to, sono naka de okonawareru bougyaku to o miyo" to.
Shu wa iwareru, "Karera wa seigi o okonau koto o shirazu, shi etage totta mono to ubaitotta mono to o sono moromoro no kyuuden ni takuwaete iru".
Sore yue Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Teki ga kite, kono kuni o kakomi, anata no boubi o anata kara torinozoki, anata no moromoro no kyuuden wa kasumerareru".
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Hitsujikai ga shishi no kuchi kara, hitsuji no ryouashi, aruiha katamimi o torikaesu you ni, Samariya ni sumu Isuraeru no hitobito mo, nagai su no sumi ya, shindai no ichibu o tazusaete sukuwarerude arou".
Bangun no kami, Shu naru kami wa iwareru, "Kike, soshite Yakobu no ie ni shougen seyo.
Watashi wa Isuraeru no moromoro no toga o bassuru hi ni Beteru no saidan o bassuru. Sono saidan no tsuno wa orete, chi ni ochiru.
Watashi wa mata fuyu no ie to natsu no ie to o utsu, zouge no ie wa horobi, ooinaru ie wa kieuseru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Bashan no meushidomo yo, kono kotoba o kike. Anata gata wa Samariya no yama ni ori, yowai mono o shi etage, mazushii mono o appaku shi, mata sono shujin ni mukatte, 'Motte kite, watashitachi ni nomase yo' to iu.
Shu naru kami wa gojibun no sei naru koto ni yotte chikawareta, miyo, anata gata no ue ni kono you na toki ga kuru. Sono toki, hitobito wa anatagata o tsuribari ni kake, anata gata no nokori no mono o uotsuri bari ni kakete hiite iku.
Anata gata wa onoono massugu ni ishigaki no yabureta tokoro o dete, Harumon ni oiyarareru" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Anata gata wa Beteru e itte tsumi o okashi, Girugaru e itte, toga o mashikuwae yo. Asagoto ni, anata gata no gisei o tazusaete ike, mikkagoto ni, anata gata no juubun no ichi o tazusaete ike.
Tane o ireta pan no kanshasai o sasage, kokoro yori no sonaemono o fure shimese. Isuraeru no hitobito yo, anata gata wa kono you ni suru no o kononde iru" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa mata, anata gata no subete no machi de anata gata no ha o kiyoku shi, anata gata no subete no tokoro de pan o toboshiku shita. Sore de mo, anata gata wa watashi ni kaeranakatta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa mata, kariire made nao san tsuki aru no ni ame o todomete, anata gata no ue ni kudasazu, kono machi ni wa ame o furashi, kano machi ni wa ame o furasazu, kono hatake wa ame o e, kano hatake wa ame o enaide kareta.
Soko de futatsu mittsu no machi ga hitotsu no machi ni yoromeite itte, mizu o nonde mo, aku koto ga dekinakatta. Sore de mo, anata gata wa watashi ni kaeranakatta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa tachigare to kusari ho to o motte anatagata o uchi, anata gata no sono to, budou batake to o arashita. Ichijiku no ki to oribu no ki to wa, inago ga kutta. Sore de mo, anata gata wa watashi ni kaeranakatta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa Ejiputo ni shita you ni anata gata no uchi ni ekibyou o okuri, tsurugi o motte anata gata no wakamono o koroshi, anata gata no uma o ubaisari, anata gata no shukuei no shuuki o noborasete, anata gata no hana o tsukaseta. Sore de mo, anata gata wa watashi ni kaeranakatta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Watashi wa anata gata no uchi no machi o kami ga Sodomu to Gomora o horobosareta toki no you ni horoboshita no de, anata gata wa honoo no naka kara toridasareta moesashi no you de atta. Sore de mo, anata gata wa watashi ni kaeranakatta" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Sore yue Isuraeru yo, watashi wa kono you ni anata ni okonau. Watashi wa kore o okonau yue, Isuraeru yo, anata no kami ni au sonae o seyo".
Miyo, kare wa yama o tsukuri, kaze o souzou shi, hito ni sono omoi no ikanaru ka o shimeshi, mata, akebono o kaete kurayami to nashi, chi no takai tokoro o fumareru mono, sono na o bangun no kami, Shu to iu.
Isuraeru no ie yo, watashi ga kanashimi no uta o motte, anata gata ni tsuite noberu kono kotoba o kike,
"Otome Isuraeru wa taorete, mata okiagarazu, kanojo wa onore no chi ni nagetaosarete kore o okosu mono ga nai".
Shu naru kami wa kou iwareru, "Isuraeru no ie de wa, sennin deta machi wa hyakunin nokori, hyakunin deta machi wa juunin nokoru".
Shu wa Isuraeru no ie ni kou iwareru, "Anata gata wa watashi o motomeyo, soshite iki yo.
Beteru o motomeru na, Girugaru ni iku na. Beerushiba ni omomuku na. Girugaru wa kanarazu toraerarete iki, Beteru wa mu ni kisurukara de aru".
Anata gata wa Shu o motomeyo, soshite iki yo. Samo nai to Shu wa hi no you ni Yosefu no ie ni ochi kudarareru. Hi wa kore o yakuga, Beteru no tame ni kore o kesu mono wa hitori mo nai.
Anata gata, koudou o nigayomogi ni kae, seigi o chi ni nagesuteru mono yo.
Pureadesu oyobi Orion o tsukuri, ankoku o asa ni henji, hiru o kuraku shite yoru to nashi, umi no mizu o yonde, chi no omote ni sosogareru mono, sono na wa Shu to iu.
Shu wa horobi o tachimachi tsuyoi mono ni nozomaserareru no de, horobi wa tsuini shiro ni nozomu.
Karera wa mon ni ite imashimeru mono o nikumi, shinjitsu o kataru mono o imikirau.
Anata gata wa mazushii mono o fumitsuke, kare kara mugi no okurimono o toru yue, anata gata wa kiriishi no ie o tatete mo, sono naka ni sumu koto wa dekinai. Utsukushii budou batake o tsukutte mo, sono sake o nomu koto wa dekinai.
Watashi wa shiru, anata gata no toga wa ooku, anata gata no tsumi wa ookiikara de aru. Anata gata wa tadashii mono o shi etage, mainai o tori, mon de mazushii mono o shirizokeru.
Sore yue, kono you na toki ni wa kashikoi mono wa chinmoku suru, kore wa warui toki dakara de aru.
Zen o motomeyo, aku o motomeru na. Sou sureba anata gata wa ikiru koto ga dekiru. Mata anata gata ga iu you ni, bangun no kami, Shu wa anata gata to tomo ni orareru.
Aku o nikumi, zen o aishi, mon de kougi o tate yo. Bangun no kami, Shu wa, aruiha Yosefu no nokori no mono o awaremarerude arou.
Sore yue, Shu naru bangun no kami, Shu wa kou iwareru, "Subete no hiroba de naku koto ga arou. Subete no chimata de hitobito wa 'Kanashii ka na, kanashii ka na' to iu. Mata karera wa noufu o yonde kite nagekase, takumi na nakionna o maneite nakase,
Mata subete no budou hatake ni mo naku koto ga arou. Sore wa watashi ga anata gata no naka o toorukara de aru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Wazawai naru ka na, Shu no hi o nozomu mono yo, anata gata wa naniyue Shu no hi o nozomu no ka. Kore wa kurakute hikari ga nai.
Hito ga shishi no mae o nogarete mo kuma ni deai, mata ie ni haitte, te o kabe ni tsukeruto, hebi ni kamareru you na mono de aru.
Shu no hi wa kurakute, hikari ga naku, usugurakute kagayaki ga naide wa nai ka.
Watashi wa anata gata no matsuri o nikumi, katsu iyashimeru. Watashi wa mata, anata gata no seikai o yorokobanai.
Tatoi anata gata wa hansai ya sosai o sasagete mo, watashi wa kore o ukeirenai. Anata gata no koeta kemono no shuuonsai wa watashi wa kore o kaeriminai.
Anata gata no uta no sawagashii oto o watashi no mae kara tate. Anata gata no koto no oto wa, watashi wa kore o kikanai.
Koudou o mizu no you ni, seigi o tsukinai kawa no you ni nagaresaseyo.
"Isuraeru no ie yo, anata gata wa yonjuu nen no aida, arano de watashi ni gisei to sonaemono o sasageta ka.
Kaette anata gata no ou Shikute o ninai, anata gata ga jibun de tsukutta anata gata no guuzou, hoshi no kami, Kiun o ni natta.
Sore yue watashi wa anatagata o Damasuko no kanata ni toraeutsusu" to, sono na o bangun no kami to tonaerareru Shu wa iwareru.
"Wazawai naru ka na, yasuraka ni Shion ni iru mono, mata anshin shite Samariya no yama ni iru mono, shokokumin no kashira no uchi no chomei na hitobito de, Isuraeru no ie ga kite shitagau mono yo.
Karune ni watatte mi yo. Soko kara ooHamate ni iki, mata Perishite bito no Gate ni kudatte mi yo. Karera wa korera no kuni ni masatte iru ka. Karera no tochi wa anata gata no tochi yori mo ookii ka.
Anata gata wa wazawai no hi o toozake, kyoubou no za o chikazukete iru.
Wazawai naru ka na, mizukara zouge no shindai ni fushi, nagai su no ue ni mi o nobashi, mure no uchi kara kohitsuji o tori, gyuusha no uchi kara koushi o totte tabe,
Koto no oto ni awasete utaisawagi, Dabide no you ni gakki o tsukuridashi,
Hachi o motte sake o nomi, itomo tattoi abura o mi ni nuri, Yosefu no hametsu o kanashimanai monotachi yo.
Sore yue ima, karera wa torawarete, torawarebito no massaki ni tatte iku. Soshite kano mi o nobashita monodomo no sawagi wa yamude arou".
Shu naru kami wa onore ni yotte chikawareta, (bangun no kami, Shu wa iwareru,) "Watashi wa Yakobu no hokori o imikirai, sono moromoro no kyuuden o nikumu. Watashi wa kono machi to subete sono naka ni iru mono o watasu".
Hitotsu no ie ni juunin no mono ga nokotte ite mo, karera wa shini,
Soshite sono shinseki, sunawachi kore o yaku mono wa, hone o ie kara hakobi dasu tame ni, kore o toriage, mata sono ie no oku ni iru mono ni mukatte, "Mada anata to tomo ni iru mono ga aru ka" to ii, "Nai" to no kotae ga aru toki, kano hito wa mata "Koe o dasu na, Shu no na o tonaeru na" to iude arou.
Miyo, Shu wa meijite, ookina ie o utte, mijin to nashi, chiisana ie o utte, kiregire to sareru.
Uma wa iwa no ue o hashirudarou ka. Hito wa ushi de umi o tagayasudarou ka. Tokoro ga anata gata wa koudou o doku ni henji, seigi no mi o nigayomogi ni henjita.
Anata gata wa Rodebaru o yorokobi, "Wareware wa jibun no chikara de Karunaimu o etade wa nai ka" to iu.
Sore yue, bangun no kami, Shu wa iwareru, "Isuraeru no ie yo, miyo, watashi wa hitotsu no kunitami o okoshite, anata gata ni tekitai saseru. Karera wa Hamate no iriguchi kara Araba no kawa made anatagata o nayamasu".
Shu naru kami wa kono you ni watashi ni shimesareta. Miyo, ni bangusa no wa e deru hajime ni Shu wa, inago o tsukurareta. Miyo, sono ni bangusa wa ou no katta nochi ni, haeta mono de aru.
Sono inago ga chi no aokusa o kui tsukushita toki, watashi wa itta, "Shu naru kami yo, douzo, yurushite kudasai. Yakobu wa chiisai mono desu, dou shite tatsu koto ga dekimashou".
Shu wa kono koto ni tsuite omoikaesare, "Kono koto wa okosanai" to Shu wa iwareta.
Shu naru kami wa kono you ni watashi ni shimesareta. Miyo, Shu naru kami wa sabaki no tame ni hi o yobareta. Hi wa oofuchi o yaki, mata chi o yakou to shita.
Sono toki watashi wa itta, "Shu naru kami yo, douzo, yamete kudasai. Yakobu wa chiisai mono desu, dou shite tatsu koto ga dekimashou".
Shu wa kono koto ni tsuite omoikaesare, "Kono koto mo mata okosanai" to Shu naru kami wa iwareta.
Mata Shu wa watashi ni shimesareta. Miyo, Shu wa hakari nawa o motte kizuita ishigaki no ue ni tachi, sono te ni hakari nawa o motte orareta.
Soshite Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Amosu yo, anata wa nani o miru ka". "Hakari na wa" to watashi ga kotaeruto, Shu wa mata iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa hakari nawa o waga tami Isuraeru no naka ni oku. Watashi wa mohaya karera o misugoshi ni shinai.
Isaku no takaki tokoro wa arasare, Isuraeru no seijo wa are hateru. Watashi wa tsurugi o motte Yarabeamu no ie ni tachimukau".
Toki ni Beteru no saishi Amajiya wa, Isuraeru no ou Yarabeamu ni hito o tsukawashite iu, "Isuraeru no ie no tadanaka de, Amosu wa anata ni somukimashita. Kono chi wa kare no moromoro no kotoba ni taeru koto ga dekimasen.
Amosu wa kono you ni itte imasu, 'Yarabeamu wa tsurugi ni yotte shinu, Isuraeru wa kanarazu toraerarete itte, sono kuni o hanareru' to".
Sore kara Amajiya wa Amosu ni itta, "Senkensha yo, itte Yuda no chi ni nogare, kano chi de pan o tabe, kano chi de yogen seyo.
Shikashi Beteru de wa ni do to yogen shite wa naranai. Koko wa ou no seijo, kuni no miya dakara".
Amosu wa Amajiya ni kotaeta, "Watashi wa yogensha de mo naku, mata yogensha no ko de mo nai. Watashi wa bokusha de aru. Watashi wa ichijiku kuwa no ki o tsukuru mono de aru.
Tokoro ga Shu wa mure ni shitagatte iru tokoro kara watashi o tori, 'Itte, waga tami Isuraeru ni yogen seyo' to, Shu wa watashi ni iwareta.
Sore yue ima, Shu no kotoba o kike. Anata wa iu, 'Isuraeru ni mukatte yogen suru na, Isaku no ie ni mukatte kataru na' to.
Sore yue, Shu wa kou iwareru, 'Anata no tsuma wa machi de yuujo to nari, anata no musuko, musumetachi wa tsurugi ni taore, anata no chi wa hakari nawa de wakatareru. Soshite anata wa kegareta chi de shini, Isuraeru wa kanarazu toraerarete itte, sono kuni o hanareru' ".
Shu naru kami wa, kono you ni watashi ni shimesareta. Miyo, hito kago no natsu no kudamono ga aru.
Shu wa iwareta, "Amosu yo, anata wa nani o miru ka". Watashi wa "Hito kago no natsu no kudamono" to kotaeta. Suru to Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Waga tami Isuraeru no owari ga kita. Watashi wa futatabi karera o misugoshi ni shinai.
Sono hi ni wa miya no uta wa nageki ni kawari, shikabane ga obitadashiku, hitobito wa mugon de kore o itarutokoro ni nagesuteru" to Shu naru kami wa iwareru.
Anata gata, mazushii mono o fumitsuke, mata kuni no toboshii mono o horobosu mono yo, kore o kike.
Anata gata wa iu, "Shingetsu wa itsu sugisarudarou, sou shitara, wareware wa kokumotsu o urou. Ansokunichi wa itsu sugisarudarou, sou shitara, wareware wa mugi o uridasou. Wareware wa Epa o chiisaku shi, shikeru o ookiku shi, itsuwari no hakari o motte azamuki,
Toboshii mono o kane de kai, mazushii mono o kutsu hitoashi de kaitori, mata, kuzu mugi o urou".
Shu wa Yakobu no hokori o sashite chikawareta, "Watashi wa kanarazu karera no subete no waza o itsu made mo wasurenai.
Kore ga tame ni chi wa furuwanaide arou ka. Chi ni sumu mono wa mina nagekanaide arou ka. Chi wa mina Nairu kawa no you ni wakiagari, Ejiputo no Nairu kawa no you ni minagitte, mata shizumanaide arou ka".
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, "Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa mahiru ni taiyou o shizumase, hakuchuu ni chi o kuraku shi,
Anata gata no matsuri o nageki ni kawarase, anata gata no uta o kotogotoku kanashimi no uta ni kawarase, subete no hito ni aranuno o koshi ni matowase, subete no hito ni kami o sori otosase, sono hi o, hitoriko o ushinatta mochuu no you ni shi, sono owari o, nigai hi no you ni suru".
Shu naru kami wa iwareru, "Miyo, watashi ga kikin o kono kuni ni okuru hi ga kuru, sore wa pan no kikin de wa nai, mizu ni kawaku no de mo nai, Shu no kotoba o kiku koto no kikin de aru.
Karera wa umi kara umi e samayoi aruki, Shu no kotoba o motomete, konata kanata e hasemawaru, shikashi kore o enaide arou.
Sono hi ni wa utsukushii otome mo, wakai otoko mo kawaki no tame ni ki o ushinau.
Kano Samariya no Ashima o sashite chikai, 'Dan yo, anata no kami wa ikite iru' to ii, mata 'Beerushiba no michi wa ikite iru' to iu monodomo wa kanarazu taoreru. Futatabi okiagaru koto wa nai".
Watashi wa saidan no katawara ni tatte orareru Shu o mita. Shu wa iwareta, "Hashira no atama o utte, shikii o furuwase, kore o uchikudaite, subete no tami no atama no ue ni ochikakarase yo. Sono nokotta mono o, watashi wa tsurugi de koroshi, sono hitori mo nige oosumono wa naku, nogare uru mono wa nai.
Tatoi karera wa yomi ni hori kudatte mo, watashi no te wa kore o soko kara hikidasu. Tatoi karera wa ten ni yojinobotte mo, watashi wa soko kara kore o hikiorosu.
Tatoi karera wa Karumeru no itadaki ni kakurete mo, watashi wa kore o sagashite, soko kara hikidasu. Tatoi karera wa watashi no me o nogarete, umi no soko ni kakurete mo, watashi wa hebi ni meijite, sono tokoro de kore o kamaseru.
Tatoi karera wa torawarete, sono teki no mae ni itte mo, watashi wa sono tokoro de tsurugi ni meijite, kore o korosaseru. Watashi wa karera no ue ni watashi no me o sosogu, sore wa wazawai no tame de atte, saiwai no tame de wa nai".
Bangun no kami, Shu ga chi ni furerareruto, chi wa toke, sono naka ni sumu mono wa mina nageki, chi wa mina Nairu kawa no you ni wakiagari, Ejiputo no Nairu kawa no you ni mata shizumu.
Shu wa gojibun no takadono o ten ni kizuki, oozora no motoi o chi no ue ni sue, umi no mizu o yonde, chi no omote ni sosogareru. Sono na wa Shu to tonaerareru.
Shu wa iwareru, "Isuraeru no kora yo, anata gata wa watashi ni totte Echiopiya bito no you de wa nai ka. Watashi wa Isuraeru o Ejiputo no kuni kara, Perishite bito o Kafutoru kara, Suriya bito o Kiru kara michibiki nobottade wa nai ka.
Miyo, Shu naru kami no me wa kono tsumi o okashita kuni no ue ni sosogarete iru. Watashi wa kore o chi no omote kara tachi horobosu. Shikashi, watashi wa Yakobu no ie o kotogotoku wa horobosanai" to Shu wa iwareru.
"Miyo, watashi wa meijite, hito ga furui de mono o furuu you ni, watashi wa Isuraeru no ie o bankokumin no uchi de furuu. Hito tsubu mo chi ni ochiru koto wa nai.
Waga tami no tsumibito, sunawachi 'Wazawai wa wareware ni chikazukanai, wareware ni nozomanai' to iu monodomo wa mina, tsurugi de korosareru.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa Dabide no taoreta makuya o okoshi, sono hason o tsukuroi, sono kuzureta tokoro o okoshi, kore o mukashi no toki no you ni tateru.
Kore wa karera ga Edomu no nokotta mono, oyobi waga na o motte yobareru subete no kunitami o shoyuu suru tame de aru" to kono koto o nasareru Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, "Miyo, kono you na toki ga kuru. Sono toki ni wa, tagayasu mono wa karu mono ni aitsugi, budou o fumu mono wa tane makumono ni aitsugu. Moromoro no yama ni wa umai sake ga shitatari, moromoro no oka wa tokete nagareru.
Watashi wa waga tami Isuraeru no koufuku o moto ni kaesu. Karera wa areta machimachi o tatete sumi, budou batake o tsukutte sono sake o nomi, sono o tsukutte sono mi o taberu.
Watashi wa karera o sono chi ni uetsukeru. Karera wa watashi ga ataeta chi kara futatabi nukitorareru koto wa nai" to anata no kami, Shu wa iwareru.
Obadeya no maboroshi. Shu naru kami wa Edomu ni tsuite kou iwareru, wareware wa Shu kara deta otozure o kiita. Hitori no shisha ga shokokumin no uchi ni tsukawasarete iu, "Tateyo, wareware wa tatte Edomu to tatakaou".
Miyo, watashi wa anata o kuniguni no uchi de chiisai mono to suru. Anata wa hidoku iyashimerareru.
Iwa no hazama ni ori, takai tokoro ni sumu mono yo, anata no kokoro no takaburi wa, anata o azamuita. Anata wa kokoro no uchi ni iu, "Dare ga watashi o chi ni hikikudaraseru koto ga dekiru ka".
Tatoi anata wa, washi no you ni takaku agari, hoshi no aida ni su o moukete mo, watashi wa soko kara anata o hikiorosu to Shu wa iwareru.
Moshinusu bito ga anata no tokoro ni ki, goutou ga yoru kite mo, karera wa, hoshii dake nusumude wa nai ka. Aa, anata wa mattaku horobosarete shimau. Moshi budou o atsumeru mono ga anata no tokoro ni kitanara, karera wa nao amari no mi o nokosanaide arou ka.
Aa, Esau wa kasumerare, sono kakushite oita takara wa saguridasareru.
Anata to keiyaku o musunda hitobito wa mina, anata o azamuki, anata o kokkyou ni oiyatta. Anata to doumei o musunda hitobito wa anata ni katta. Anata no shinrai suru tomo wa anata no shita ni wana o mouketa, shikashi sono koto o satoranai.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, watashi wa Edomu kara chisha o horoboshi, Esau no yama kara satori o tachi nozokanaidarou ka.
Teman yo, anata no yuushi wa odorokiosoreru. Hito wa mina korosarete Esau no yama kara tachi nozokareru.
Anata wa sono kyoudai Yakobu ni bougyaku o okonatta no de, haji wa anata o ooi, anata wa eien ni tatareru.
Anata ga hanarete tatte ita hi, sunawachi ihoujin ga sono zaihou o mochisari, gaikokujin ga sono mon ni oshiiri, Erusaremu o kujibiki ni shita hi, anata mo karera no hitori no you de atta.
Shikashi anata wa jibun no kyoudai no hi, sunawachi sono wazawai no hi o nagamete ite wa naranakatta. Anata wa Yuda no hitobito no horobi no hi ni, kore o yorokonde wa narazu, sono nayami no hi ni hokotte wa naranakatta.
Anata wa waga tami no wazawai no hi ni, sono mon ni haitte wa narazu, sono wazawai no hi ni sono kurushimi o nagamete wa naranakatta. Mata sono wazawai no hi ni, sono zaihou ni te o kakete wa naranakatta.
Anata wa wakaremichi ni tatte, sono no ga reru mono o kitte wa naranakatta. Anata wa nayami no hi ni sono nokotta mono o teki ni watashite wa naranakatta.
Shu no hi ga bankoku no tami ni nozomu no wa chikai. Anata ga shita you ni anata mo sareru. Anata no mukui wa anata no koube ni kisuru.
Anata ga tagawa ga sei naru yama de nonda you ni, shuui no moromoro no tami mo nomu. Sunawachi karera wa nonde yoromeki, katsute nakatta you ni naru.
Shikashi Shion no yama ni wa, nogareru mono ga ite, sei naru tokoro to naru. Mata Yakobu no ie wa sono ryouchi o eru.
Yakobu no ie wa hi to nari, Yosefu no ie wa honoo to nari, Esau no ie wa wara to naru. Karera wa sono naka ni moete, kore o yaku. Esau no ie ni wa nokoru mono ga nai you ni naruto Shu wa iwareta.
Negebu no hitobito wa Esau no yama o e, Sefera no hitobito wa Perishite bito o eru. Mata karera wa Efuraimu no chi, oyobi Samariya no chi o e, Beniyamin wa Gireade o eru.
Hara ni iru Isuraeru no hitobito no torawarebito wa, Fenikiya o Zarepate made tori, Separade ni iru Erusaremu no torawarebito wa, Negebu no machimachi o eru.
Kou shite sukuu mono wa Shion no yama ni nobotte, Esau no yama o osameru. Soshite oukoku wa Shu no mono to naru.
Shu no kotoba ga Amitai no ko Yona ni nozonde itta,
"Tatte, ano ookina machi Ninebe ni iki, kore ni mukatte yobaware. Karera no aku ga watashi no mae ni nobotte kitakara de aru".
Shikashi Yona wa Shu no mae o hanarete Tarushishi e nogareyouto, tatte Yoppa ni kudatte itta. Tokoro ga choudo, Tarushishi e iku fune ga atta no de, funachin o harai, Shu no mae o hanarete, hitobito to tomo ni Tarushishi e ikou to fune ni notta.
Toki ni, Shu wa ookaze o umi no ue ni okosareta no de, fune ga yabureru hodo no hageshii boufuu ga umi no ue ni atta.
Sore de suifutachi wa osorete, meimei jibun no kami o yobimotome, mata fune o karuku suru tame, sono naka no tsumini o umi ni nagesuteta. Shikashi, Yona wa fune no oku ni kudari, fushite jukusui shite ita.
Soko de senchou wa kite, kare ni itta, "Anata wa dou shite nemutte iru no ka. Okite, anata no kami ni yobawari nasai. Kami ga aruiha, wareware o kaerimite, tasukete kudasarudarou".
Yagate hitobito wa tagai ni itta, "Kono wazawai ga wareware ni nozonda no wa, dare no sei ka shiru tame ni, saa, kuji o hiite miyou". Soshite karera ga, kuji o hiita tokoro, kuji wa Yona ni atatta.
Soko de hitobito wa Yona ni itta, "Kono wazawai ga dare no sei de, wareware ni nozonda no ka, wareware ni tsuge nasai. Anata no shokugyou wa nani ka. Anata wa doko kara kita no ka. Anata no kuni wa doko ka. Anata wa doko no tami ka".
Yona wa karera ni itta, "Watashi wa Heburu bito desu. Watashi wa umi to riku to o otsukuri ni natta ten no kami, Shu o osoreru mono desu".
Soko de hitobito wa hanahadashiku osorete, kare ni itta, "Anata wa nantaru koto o shite kureta no ka". Hitobito wa kare ga saki ni karera ni tsugeta koto ni yotte, kare ga Shu no mae o hanarete, nogareyou to shite ita koto o shitte itakara de aru.
Hitobito wa kare ni itta, "Wareware no tame ni umi ga shizumaru ni wa, anata o dou shitara yokarou ka". Sore wa umi ga masumasu arete kitakara de aru.
Yona wa karera ni itta, "Watashi o totte umi ni nageire nasai. Sou shitara umi wa, anata gata no tame ni shizumarudeshou. Watashi ni wa yoku wakatte imasu. Kono hageshii boufuu ga anata gata ni nozonda no wa, watashi no sei desu".
Shikashi hitobito wa fune o riku ni kogi modosou to tsutometaga, seikou shinakatta. Sore wa umi ga karera ni sakaratte, iyoiyo aretakara de aru.
Soko de hitobito wa Shu ni yobawatte itta, "Shu yo, douzo, kono hito no seimei no tame ni, wareware o horobosanaide kudasai. Mata tsumi naki chi o, wareware ni kishinaide kudasai. Shu yo, kore wa mikokoro ni shitagatte, nasareta koto dakara desu".
Soshite karera wa Yona o totte umi ni nageireta. Suru to umi no areru no ga yanda.
Soko de hitobito wa ooini Shu o osore, gisei o Shu ni sasagete, seigan o tateta.
Shu wa ooinaru uo o sonaete, Yona o nomaserareta. Yona wa mikka sanyo sono uo no hara no uchi ni ita.
Yona wa uo no hara no uchi kara sono kami, Shu ni inotte,
Itta, "Watashi wa nayami no uchi kara Shu ni yobawaruto, Shu wa watashi ni kotaerareta. Watashi ga yomi no hara no uchi kara sakebuto, anata wa watashi no koe o kikareta.
Anata wa watashi o fuchi no naka, umi no mannaka ni nageirerareta. Oomizu wa watashi o meguri, anata no nami to oonami wa mina, watashi no ue o koete itta.
Watashi wa itta, 'Watashi wa anata no mae kara owarete shimatta, dou shite futatabi anata no sei naru miya o nozomi eyou ka'.
Mizu ga watashi o megutte tamashii ni made oyobi, fuchi wa watashi o torikakomi, kaisou wa yama no nemoto de watashi no atama ni matoitsuita.
Watashi wa chi ni kudari, chi no kannoki wa itsu mo watashi no ue ni atta. Shikashi waga kami, Shu yo, anata wa waga inochi o ana kara sukuiagerareta.
Waga tamashii ga watashi no uchi ni yowatte iru toki, watashi wa Shu o oboe, watashi no inori wa anata ni itari, anata no sei naru miya ni tasshita.
Munashii guuzou ni kokoro o yoseru mono wa, sono makoto no chuusetsu o suteru.
Shikashi watashi wa kansha no koe o motte, anata ni gisei o sasage, watashi no chikai o hatasu. Sukui wa Shu ni aru".
Shu wa uo ni omeiji ni natta no de, uo wa Yona o riku ni hakidashita.
Toki ni Shu no kotoba wa futatabi Yona ni nozonde itta,
"Tatte, ano ookina machi Ninebe ni iki, anata ni meijiru kotoba o kore ni tsutaeyo".
Soko de Yona wa Shu no kotoba ni shitagai, tatte, Ninebe ni itta. Ninebe wa hijou ni ookina machi de atte, kore o iki meguru ni wa, mikka o yousuru hodo de atta.
Yona wa sono machi ni hairi, hajime ichi nichiji o yuki megutte yobawari, "Yonjuu nichi o hetara Ninebe wa horobiru" to itta.
Soko de Ninebe no hitobito wa kami o shinji, danjiki o fure, ookii mono kara chiisai mono made aranuno o kita.
Kono uwasa ga Ninebe no ou ni tassuruto, kare wa sono ouza kara tachiagari, chou fuku o nugi, aranuno o matoi, hai no naka ni zashita.
Mata ou to sono daijin no fukoku o motte, Ninebenaka ni furesasete itta, "Hito mo kemono mo ushi mo hitsuji mo mina, nani o mo ajiwatte wa naranai. Mono o kui, mizu o nonde wa naranai.
Hito mo kemono mo aranuno o matoi, hitasura kami ni yobawari, onoono sono warui michi oyobi sono te ni aru kyoubou o hanareyo.
Aruiha kami wa mikokoro o kae, sono hageshii ikari o yamete, wareware o horobosarenai ka mo shirenai. Dare ga sore o shirudarou".
Kami wa karera no nasu tokoro, sono warui michi o hanareta no o mirare, karera no ue ni kudasou to iwareta wazawai o omoikaeshite, kore o oyame ni natta.
Tokoro ga Yona wa kore o hijou ni fukai to shite, hageshiku ikari,
Shu ni inotte itta, "Shu yo, watashi ga nao kuni ni orimashita toki, kono koto o moushitade wa arimasen ka. Sore de koso watashi wa, isoide Tarushishi ni nogareyou to shita no desu. Naze nara, watashi wa anata ga megumi fukai kami, awaremi ari, ikaru koto osoku, itsukushimi yutaka de, wazawai o omoikaesareru koto o, shitte itakara desu.
Sore de Shu yo, douzo ima watashi no inochi o totte kudasai. Watashi ni totte wa, ikiru yori mo shinuhou ga mashi dakara desu".
Shu wa iwareta, "Anata no ikaru no wa, yoi koto de arou ka".
Soko de Yona wa machi kara dete, machi no higashi no hou ni zashi, soko ni jibun no tame ni hitotsu no koya o tsukuri, machi no nariyuki o mikiwameyou to, sono shita no hikage ni suwatte ita.
Toki ni Shu naru kami wa, Yona o atsusa no kutsuu kara sukuu tame ni, to u goma o sonaete, sore o sodate, Yona no atama no ue ni hikage o mouketa. Yona wa kono tou goma o hijou ni yorokonda.
Tokoro ga kami wa yokujitsu no yoake ni mushi o sonaete, sono tou goma o kamaserareta no de, sore wa kareta.
Yagate taiyou ga deta toki, kami ga atsui higashikaze o sonae, mata taiyou ga Yona no atama o tera shita no de, Yona wa yowari hate, shinu koto o negatte itta, "Ikiru yori mo shinuhou ga watashi ni wa mashi da".
Shikashi kami wa Yona ni iwareta, "Tou goma no tame ni anata no ikaru no wa yoku nai". Yona wa itta, "Watashi wa ikari no amari kuruishini sou desu".
Shu wa iwareta, "Anata wa rousezu, sodatezu, ichiya ni shoujite, ichiya ni horobita kono tou goma o sae, oshinde iru.
Mashite watashi wa juu ni man amari no, migihidari o wakimaenai hitobito to, amata no kachiku to no iru kono ookina machi Ninebe o, oshimanaide irareyou ka".
Yuda no ou Yotamu, Ahazu oyobi Hizekiya no yo ni, Moreshite bi to Mika ga, Samariya to Erusaremu ni tsuite shimesareta Shu no kotoba.
Anata gata subete no tami yo, kike. Chi to sono naka ni miteru mono yo, mimi o katamukeyo. Shu naru kami wa anata gata ni mukatte shougen shi, Shu wa sono sei naru miya kara shougen sareru.
Miyo, Shu wa sono gozasho kara dete korare, kudatte kite chi no takai tokoro o fumareru.
Yama wa kare no shita ni toke, tani wa sake, hi no mae no rou no gotoku, saka ni nagareru mizu no you da.
Kore wa mina Yakobu no toga no yue, Isuraeru no ie no tsumi no yue de aru. Yakobu no toga to wa nani ka, Samariya de wa nai ka. Yuda no ie no tsumi to wa nani ka, Erusaremu de wa nai ka.
Kono yue ni watashi wa Samariya o no no ishizuka to nashi, budou o ueru tokoro to nashi, mata sono ishi o tani ni nageotoshi, sono motoi o arawa ni suru.
Sono chouzou wa mina kudakare, sono eta atai wa mina hi de yakareru. Watashi wa sono guuzou o kotogotoku kowasu. Kore wa yuujo no atai kara atsumeta no dakara, yuujo no atai ni kaeru.
Watashi wa kore ga tame ni nagekikanashimi, hadashi to hadaka de arukimawari, yamainu no you ni nageki, dachou no you ni kanashimi naku.
Samariya no kizu wa iyasu koto no dekinai mono de, Yuda made hirogari, waga tami no mon, Erusaremu made oyonde iru.
Gate ni tsugeru na, nakisakebu na. Betereafura de, chiri no naka ni korogare.
Sapiru ni sumu mono yo, hadaka ni nari, haji o koumutte susumi yuke. Zaanan ni sumu mono wa dete konai. Beteezeru no nageki wa anata gata kara sono ato o tatsu.
Marote ni sumu mono wa kizukawashi sou ni saiwai o matsu. Wazawai ga Shu kara dete, Erusaremu no mon ni nozondakara de aru.
Rakishi ni sumu mono yo, sensha ni hayauma o tsunage. Rakishi wa Shion no musume ni totte tsumi no hajime de atta. Isuraeru no toga ga, anata gata no uchi ni miraretakara de aru.
Sore yue, anata wa moresete gate ni wakare no okurimono o ataeru. Akujibu no ieie wa Isuraeru no outachi ni totte, hito o azamuku mono to naru.
Maresha ni sumu mono yo, watashi wa mata shinryakusha o anata no tokoro ni tsurete iku. Isuraeru no eikou wa Adoramu ni sarude arou.
Anata no yorokobu kora no tame ni, anata no kami o sori otose. Sono sotta tokoro o hagetaka no you ni ookiku seyo. Karera wa toraerarete anata o hanarerukara de aru.
Sono toko no ue de fugi o hakari, aku o okonau mono wa wazawai de aru. Karera wa sono te ni chikara aru yue, yo ga akeruto kore o okonau.
Karera wa tahata o musabotte kore o ubai, ie o musabotte kore o toru. Karera wa hito o shi etagete sono ie o ubai, hito o shi etagete sono shigyou o ubau.
Sore yue, Shu wa kou iwareru, miyo, watashi wa kono yakara ni mukatte wazawai o kudasou to hakaru. Anata gata wa sono kubi o kore kara, hazusu koto wa dekinai. Mata, massugu ni tatte aruku koto wa dekinai. Kore wa wazawai no toki dakara de aru.
Sono hi, hitobito wa uta o tsukutte anatagata o nonoshiri, kanashimi no uta o motte nagekikanashimi, "Wareware wa kotogotoku horobosareru, waga tami no bun wa hito ni ataerareru. Dou shite kore wa watashi kara hanareru no de arou. Wareware no tahata wa wareware o toraeta mono no aida ni wakeataerareru" to iu.
Sore yue, Shu no kaishuu no uchi ni wa kuji ni yotte hakari nawa o haru mono wa hitori mo nakunaru.
Karera wa iu, "Anata gata wa sekkyou shite wa naranai. Sono you na koto ni tsuite sekkyou shite wa naranai. Sou sureba wareware wa haji o koumuru koto ga nai" to.
Yakobu no ie yo, sonna koto wa ieru no darou ka. Shu wa kimijika na kata de arou ka. Korera wa Shu no miwaza na no de arou ka. Waga kotoba wa tadashiku ayumu mono ni, eki to naranai no de arou ka.
Tokoro ga, anata gata wa tatte waga tami no teki to nari, ikusa no koto o shirazu ni, yasuraka ni sugiyuku mono kara, heiwa na mono kara, uwagi o hagitori,
Waga tami no onnatachi o sono tanoshii ie kara oidashi, sono kodomo kara, waga sakae o tokoshie ni ubau.
Tatte sare, kore wa anata gata no yasumi basho de wa nai. Kore wa kegare no yue ni horobiru. Sono horobi wa hisan na horobi da.
Moshi hito ga kaze ni ayumi, itsuwari o ii, "Watashi wa budoushu to kokisake to ni tsuite, anata ni sekkyou shiyou" to iunaraba, sono hito wa kono tami no sekkyousha to narude arou.
Yakobu yo, watashi wa kanarazu anata o kotogotoku atsume, Isuraeru no nokoreru mono o atsumeru. Watashi wa kore o ori no hitsuji no you ni, makiba no naka no mure no you ni tomo ni oku. Kore wa hito no ooki ni yotte sawagashiku naru.
Uchiyaburu mono wa karera ni sakidatte nobori yuki, karera wa mon o uchiyaburi, kore o tootte soto ni dete iku. Karera no ou wa sono mae ni susumi, Shu wa sono sentou ni tatareru.
Watashi wa itta, Yakobu no kashiratachi yo, Isuraeru no ie no tsukasatachi yo, kike, kougi wa anata gata no shitte orubeki koto de wa nai ka.
Anata gata wa zen o nikumi, aku o aishi, waga tami no mi kara kawa o hagi, sono hone kara niku o sogi,
Mata waga tami no niku o kurai, sono kawa o hagi, sono hone o kudaki, kore o kirikizande, nabe ni ireru shokumotsu no you ni shi, oonabe ni ireru niku no you ni suru.
Kou shite karera ga Shu ni yobawatte mo, Shu wa okotae ni naranai. Kaette sono toki ni wa, mikao o karera ni kakusareru. Karera no okonai ga waruikara de aru.
Waga tami o madowasu yogensha ni tsuite Shu wa kou iwareru, karera wa tabemono no aru toki ni wa, "Heian" o sakebukeredo mo, sono kuchi ni nani mo ataenai mono ni mukatte wa, sensen o fukoku suru.
Sore yue, anata gata ni wa yoru ga atte mo maboroshi ga naku, kurayami ga atte mo uranai ga nai. Taiyou wa sono yogensha tachi ni bosshi, hiru mo karera no ue ni kuraku naru.
Senkensha wa haji o kaki, uranaishi wa kao o akarame, karera wa mina sono kuchibiru o oou. Kami no kotae ga naikara de aru.
Shikashi watashi wa Shu no mitama ni yotte chikara ni michi, kougi to yuuki to ni mitasare, Yakobu ni sono toga o shimeshi, Isuraeru ni sono tsumi o shimesu koto ga dekiru.
Yakobu no ie no kashiratachi, Isuraeru no ie no tsukasatachi yo, sunawachi kougi o nikumi, subete no tadashii koto o mageru mono yo, kore o kike.
Anata gata wa chi o motte Shion o tate, fugi o motte Erusaremu o tateta.
Sono kashiratachi wa, mainai o totte sabaki, sono saishitachi wa atai o totte oshie, sono yogensha tachi wa kin o totte uranau. Shikamo nao karera wa Shu ni yori tayonde, "Shu wa wareware no naka ni orarerude wa nai ka, dakara wazawai wa wareware ni nozomu koto ga nai" to iu.
Sore yue, Shion wa anata gata no yue ni tahata to natte tagayasare, Erusaremu wa ishizuka to nari, miya no yama wa ki no oishigeru takai tokoro to naru.
Sue no hi ni natte, Shu no ie no yama wa moromoro no yama no kashira to shite kataku taterare, moromoro no mine yori mo takaku agerare, moromoro no tami wa kore ni nagarekuru.
Ooku no kunitami wa kite iu, "Saa, wareware wa Shu no yama ni nobori, Yakobu no kami no ie ni ikou. Kare wa sono michi o wareware ni oshie, wareware wa sono michi ni ayumou" to. Rippou wa Shion kara de, Shu no kotoba wa Erusaremu kara derukara de aru.
Kare wa ooku no tami no aida o sabaki, tooi tokoro made tsuyoi kuniguni no tame ni chuusai sareru. Soko de karera wa tsurugi o uchikaete, suki to shi, sono yari o uchikaete, kama to shi, kuni wa kuni ni mukatte tsurugi o agezu, futatabi tatakai no koto o manabanai.
Karera wa mina sono budou no ki no shita ni zashi, sono ichijiku no ki no shita ni iru. Karera o osoresaseru mono wa nai. Kore wa bangun no Shu ga sono kuchi de katarareta koto de aru.
Subete no tami wa onoono sono kami no na ni yotte ayumu. Shikashi wareware wa wareware no kami, Shu no na ni yotte, tokoshie ni ayumu.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, watashi wa kano ashi no naeta mono o atsume, mata ka no oiyarareta mono oyobi watashi ga kurushimeta mono o atsume,
Sono ashi no naeta mono o nokoreru tami to shi, tooku oiyarareta mono o tsuyoi kunitami to suru. Shu wa Shion no yama de, ima yori tokoshie ni karera o osamerareru.
Hitsuji no mure no yagura, Shion no musume no yama yo, izen no shuken wa anata ni kaette kuru. Sunawachi Erusaremu no musume no kuni wa anata ni kaette kuru.
Ima anata wa naniyue wameki sakebu no ka, anata no uchi ni ou ga nai no ka. Anata no soudan aite wa tae hate, sanpu no you ni hageshii itami ga anata o toraeta no ka.
Shion no musume yo, sanpu no you ni kurushinde umeke. Anata wa ima, machi o dete no ni yadori, Babiron ni ikanakereba naranai. Sono tokoro de anata wa sukuwareru. Shu wa sono tokoro de anata o teki no te kara aganawareru.
Ima ooku no kunitami wa anata ni sakarai, atsumatte iu, "Dou ka Shion ga kegasareru you ni, wareware no me ga Shion o mite azawarau you ni" to.
Shikashi karera wa Shu no omoi o shirazu, mata sono keikaku o satoranai. Sunawachi Shu ga mugi taba o uchi ba ni atsumeru you ni, karera o atsumerareru koto o satoranai.
Shion no musume yo, tatte uchi konase. Watashi wa anata no tsuno o tetsu to nashi, anata no hizume o seidou to shiyou. Anata wa ooku no tami o uchikudaki, karera no bundori mono o Shu ni sasage, karera no tomi o zenchi no Shu ni sasageru.
Ima anata wa kabe de torimakarete iru. Teki wa wareware o semekakomi, tsue o motte Isuraeru no tsukasa no hoo o utsu.
Shikashi betsurehemu efurata yo, anata wa Yuda no shizoku no uchi de chiisai mono daga, Isuraeru o osameru mono ga anata no uchi kara watashi no tame ni deru. Sono deru no wa mukashi kara, inishie no hi kara de aru.
Sore yue, sanpu no umiotosu toki made, Shu wa karera o watashi okareru. Sono nochi sono kyoudaitachi no nokoreru mono wa Isuraeru no kora no moto ni kaeru.
Kare wa Shu no chikara ni yori, sono kami, Shu no na no ikou ni yori, tatte sono mure o yashinai, karera o yasuraka ni oraseru. Ima, kare wa ooinaru mono to natte, chi no hate ni made oyobukara de aru.
Kore wa heiwa de aru. ASsuriya bito ga wareware no kuni ni kite, wareware no tochi o fumu toki, shichinin no bokusha o okoshi, hachinin no kimi o okoshite kore ni ataraseru.
Karera wa tsurugi o motte ASsuriya no chi o osame, nu kimi no tsurugi o motte Nimurode no chi o osameru. ASsuriya bito ga wareware no chi ni kite, wareware no sakai o fumiarasu toki, karera wa Assuriya bito kara, wareware o sukuu.
Sono toki Yakobu no nokoreru mono wa ooku no tami no naka ni aru koto, hito ni yorazu, mata hito no kora o matazu ni Shu kara kudaru tsuyu no gotoku, aokusa no ue ni furu yuudachi no you de aru.
Mata Yakobu no nokoreru mono ga kuniguni no naka ni ori, ooku no tami no naka ni iru koto, hayashi no kemono no naka no shishi no gotoku, hitsuji no mure no naka no wakai shishi no you de aru. Sore ga sugiru toki wa fumi, katsu saite sukuu mono wa nai.
Anata no te wa moromoro no ada no ue ni agerare, anata no teki wa kotogotoku tatareru.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, watashi wa anata no uchi kara uma o tayashi, sensha o kowashi,
Anata no kuni no machimachi o tayashi, anata no shiro o kotogotoku kutsugaesu.
Mata anata no te kara majutsu o tayasu. Anata no uchi ni wa uranaishi ga nai you ni naru.
Mata anata no uchi kara chouzou oyobi ishi no hashira o tayasu. Anata wa kasanete te de tsukutta mono o ogamu koto wa nai.
Mata anata no uchi kara Ashira zou o nukitaoshi, anata no machimachi o horobosu.
Soshite watashi wa ikari to ikidoori to o motte sono kikishitagawanai moromoro no kunitami ni fukushuu suru.
Anata gata wa Shu no iwareru koto o kiki, tachiagatte, moromoro no yama no mae ni uttae o nobe, moromoro no oka ni anata no koe o kikase yo.
Moromoro no yama yo, chi no kawaru koto naki motoi yo, Shu no iiarasoi o kike. Shu wa sono tami to iiarasoi, Isuraeru to ronsou sarerukara de aru.
"Waga tami yo, watashi wa anata ni nani o nashita ka, nani ni yotte anata o tsukaresaseta ka, watashi ni kotae yo.
Watashi wa Ejiputo no kuni kara anata o michibiki nobori, dorei no ie kara anata o aganai dashi, Moose, Aron oyobi Miriamu o tsukawashite, anata ni sakidataseta.
Waga tami yo, Moabu no ou Baraku ga takuranda koto, Beoru no ko Baramu ga kare ni kotaeta koto, Shittemu kara Girugaru ni itaru made ni okotta kotodomo o omoiokose. Sou sureba, anata wa Shu no seigi no miwaza o shirude arou".
"Watashi wa nani o motte Shu no mimae ni iki, takaki kami o haisubeki ka. Hansai oyobi tousai no koushi o motte sono mimae ni yukubeki ka.
Shu wa suusen no ohitsuji, manryuu no abura o yorokobarerudarou ka. Waga toga no tame ni waga choushi o sasagubeki ka. Waga tamashii no tsumi no tame ni waga mi no ko o sasagubeki ka".
Hito yo, kare wa saki ni yoi koto no na n de aru ka o anata ni tsugerareta. Shu no anata ni motomerareru koto wa, tada kougi o okonai, itsukushimi o aishi, herikudatte anata no kami to tomo ni ayumu koto de wa nai ka.
Shu no koe ga machi ni mukatte yobawaru - - mattaki chie wa anata no na o osoreru koto de aru - - "Buzoku oyobi machi no kaishuu yo, kike.
Watashi wa akunin no ie ni aru fugi no zaihou, noroubeki fusei na masu o wasure eyou ka.
Fusei na hakari o mochii, itsuwari no omoshi o ireta fukuro o mochiiru hito o watashi wa tsumi nashi to surudarou ka.
Anata no uchi no tomeru hito wa bougyaku de michi, anata no juumin wa itsuwari o ii, sono shita wa kuchi de azamuku koto o nasu.
Sore yue, watashi wa anata o uchi, anata o sono tsumi no tame ni horobosu koto o hajimeta.
Anata wa tabete mo, aku koto ga naku, anata no hara wa itsu mo himojii. Anata wa utsushite mo, sukuu koto ga dekinai. Anata ga sukuu mono o, watashi wa tsurugi ni watasu.
Anata wa tane o maite mo, karu koto ga naku, oribu no mi o funde mo, sono mi ni abura o nuru koto ga naku, budou o funde mo, sono sake o nomu koto ga nai.
Anata wa Omuri no sadame o mamori, Ahabu no ie no subete no waza o okonai, karera no hakarigoto ni shitagatte ayunda. Kore wa watashi ga anata o arashi, sono juumin o waraimono to suru tame de aru. Anata gata wa tami no hazukashime o owaneba naranu".
Wazawai naru ka na, watashi wa natsu no kudamono o atsumeru toki no you ni, budou no shuukaku no nokori o atsumeru toki no you ni natta. Kuraubeki budou wa naku, waga kokoro no konomu hatsunari no ichijiku mo nai.
Kami o uyamau hito wa chi ni tae, hito no uchi ni tadashii mono wa nai. Mina chi o nagasou to machibuse shi, onoono ami o motte sono kyoudai o toraeru.
Ryoute wa warui koto o shiyou to tsutomete yamanai. Tsukasa to saibankan wa mainai o motome, ooinaru hito wa sono kokoro no warui yokubou o iiarawashi, kou shite karera wa sono aku o shikumu.
Karera no mottomo yoi mono mo ibara no gotoku, mottomo tadashii mono mo ibara no ikegaki no you da. Karera no mihari bito no hi, sunawachi karera no keibatsu no hi ga kuru. Ima ya karera no konran ga chikai.
Anata gata wa tonaribito o shinjite wa naranai. Yuujin o tanonde wa naranai. Anata no futokoro ni neru mono ni mo, anata no kuchi no to o mamore.
Musuko wa chichi o iyashime, musume wa sono haha ni somuki, yome wa sono shuutome ni somuku. Hito no teki wa sono ie no mono de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa Shu o aogimi, waga sukui no kami o matsu. Waga kami wa watashi no negai o kikareru.
Waga teki yo, watashi ni tsuite yorokobu na. Tatoi watashi ga taorerutomo okiagaru. Tatoi watashi ga kurayami no naka ni suwarutomo, Shu wa waga hikari to narareru.
Shu wa waga uttae o toriage, watashi no tame ni sabaki o okonawareru made, watashi wa Shu no ikari o owanakereba naranai. Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashitakara de aru. Shu wa watashi o hikari ni michibikidashite kudasaru. Watashi wa Shu no seigi o mirude arou.
Sono toki "Anata no kami, Shu wa doko ni iru ka" to watashi ni itta waga teki wa, kore o mite haji o koumuri, waga me wa kare o mite azawarau. Kare wa gairo no doro no you ni fumitsukerareru.
Anata no jouheki o kizuku hi ga kuru. Sono hi ni wa kunizakai ga tooku hirogaru.
Sono hi ni wa ASsuriya kara Ejiputo made, Ejiputo kara Yufurate gawa made, umi kara umi made, yama kara yama made, hitobito wa anata ni kuru.
Shikashika no chi wa sono juumin no yue ni, sono okonai no mi ni yotte are hateru.
Dou ka, anata no tsue o motte anata no tami, sunawachi sono no naka no hayashi ni hitori oru anata no shigyou no hitsuji o boku shi, inishie no hi no you ni Bashan to Gireade de, karera o yashinatte kudasai.
Anata ga Ejiputo no kuni o deta toki no you ni, watashi wa moromoro no fushigi na koto o karera ni shimesu.
Kuniguni no tami wa mite, sono subete no chikara o haji, sono te o kuchi ni ate, sono mimi wa kikoenu mimi to naru.
Karera wa hebi no you ni, chi ni hau mono no you ni chiri o name, furuenagara sono shiro kara de, ononokitsutsu, wareware no kami, Shu ni chikazuite kite, anata no tame ni osoreru.
Dare ka anata no you ni fugi o yurushi, sono shigyou no nokoreru mono no tame ni toga o misugosareru kami ga arou ka. Kami wa itsukushimi o yorokobareru no de, sono ikari o nagaku tamotazu,
Futatabi wareware o awaremi, wareware no fugi o ashi de fumitsukerareru. Anata wa wareware no moromoro no tsumi o umi no fukami ni nageire,
Mukashi kara wareware no senzotachi ni chikawareta you ni, shinjitsu o Yakobu ni shimeshi, itsukushimi o Aburahamu ni shimesareru.
Ninebe ni tsuite no takusen. Erukoshi bito Nahomu no maboroshi no sho.
Shu wa netami, katsu ada o mukuiru kami, Shu wa ada o mukuiru mono, mata ikidooru mono, Shu wa ono ga ada ni houfuku shi, ono ga teki ni taishite ikidoori o idaku.
Shu wa ikaru koto osoku, chikarazuyo ki mono, Shu wa batsusubeki mono o kesshite yurusarenai mono, Shu no michi wa tsumujikaze to ookaze no naka ni ari, kumo wa sono ashi no chiri de aru.
Kare wa umi o imashimete, kore o kawakashi, subete no kawa o karesaseru. Bashan to Karumeru wa shiore, Rebanon no hana wa shibomu.
Moromoro no yama wa kare no mae ni furui, moromoro no oka wa toke, chi wa kare no mae ni munashiku nari, sekai to sono naka ni sumu mono mo mina, munashiku naru.
Dare ga kare no ikidoori no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiyou. Dare ga kare no moeru ikari ni taeru koto ga dekiyou. Sono ikidoori wa hi no you ni sosogare, iwa mo kare ni yotte sakareru.
Shu wa megumi fukaku, nayami no hi no yougai de aru. Kare wa gojibun o sakedokoro to suru mono o shitte orareru.
Shikashi, kare wa minagiru kouzui de ada o mattaku horoboshi, ono ga teki o kurayami ni oiyarareru.
Anata gata wa Shu ni taishite nani o hakaru ka. Kare wa sono teki ni ni do to shikaeshi o suru hitsuyou ga nai you ni teki o mattaku horobosareru.
Karera wa musubi kara matta ibara no you ni, kawaita karikabu no you ni, yaki tsukusareru.
Shu ni taishite akuji o hakari, yokoshima na koto o susumeru mono ga anata no uchi kara detade wa nai ka.
Shu wa kou iwareru, "Tatoi karera wa tsuyoku, katsu ooku atte mo, kiritaosarete tae hateru. Watashi wa anata o kurushimetaga, kasanete anata o kurushimenai.
Ima watashi wa kare no kubiki o kudaite, anata kara torinozoki, anata no nawame o kirihanasu".
Shu wa anata ni tsuite omeiji ni natta, "Anata no na wa nagaku tsuzukanai. Watashi wa anata no kamigami no ie kara, chouzou oyobi chuuzou o nozokisaru. Anata wa tsumibukai mono dakara, watashi wa anata no haka o moukeru".
Miyo, yoki otozure o tsutaeru mono no ashi wa yama no ue ni aru. Kare wa heian o nobete iru. Yuda yo, anata no matsuri o okonai, anata no seigan o hatase. Yokoshima na mono wa kasanete, anata ni mukatte semete konaikara de aru. Kare wa mattaku tatareru.
Uchiyaburu mono ga anata ni mukatte nobotte kuru. Shiro o mamore, michi o ukagae. Koshi ni obiseyo, ooini chikara o tsuyoku seyo.
Shu wa Yakobu no sakae o kaifuku shite, Isuraeru no sakae no you ni sareru. Kasumeru mono ga karera o kasume, sono budou zuru o, sokonattakara de aru.
Sono yuushi no tate wa akaku irodorare, sono heishi wa kurenai ni mi o yorou. Sensha wa sono sonae no hi ni, hi no you ni kagayaki, gunba wa odoru.
Sensha wa chimata ni kurui hashiri, ooji ni tobi kakeru. Karera wa taimatsu no you ni kagayaki, inazuma no you ni tobi kakeru.
Shoushira wa shoushuu sare, karera wa sono michi de tsumazuki taore, jouheki ni mukatte isoide itte oodate o sonaeru.
Kawagawa no mon wa hirake, kyuuden wa awatefutameku.
Sono ouhi wa hadaka ni sarete, toraware yuki, sono jijotachi wa kanashimi, mune o utte, hato no you ni umeku.
Ninebe wa ike no you de attaga, sono mizu wa sosogi dasareta. "Tachidomare, tachidomare" to yonde mo, furikaeru mono mo nai.
Gin o ubae, kin o ubae. Sono takara wa kagirinaku, moromoro no tattoi mono wa obitadashii.
Kieuse, munashiku nari, are hateta. Kokoro wa kie, hiza wa furue, subete no koshi ni wa itami ga ari, subete no kao wa iro o ushinatta.
Shishi no sumika wa doko de aru ka. Wakai shishi no ana wa doko de aru ka. Soko ni o jishi wa sono emono o tazusae iki, sono ko jishi to tomo ni ite mo, kore o osoresaseru mono wa nai.
O jishi wa sono ko jishi no tame ni hikisaki, me jishi no tame ni emono o shimekoroshi, emono o motte sono ana o mitashi, hikisaita niku o motte sono sumika o mitashita.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata ni nozomu. Watashi wa anata no sensha o yaite kemuri ni suru. Tsurugi wa anata no wakai shishi o horobosu. Watashi wa mata, anata no emono o chi kara tatsu. Anata no shisha no koe wa kasanete kikarenai.
Wazawai naru ka na, chi o nagasu machi. Sono naka ni wa itsuwari to, bundori mono ga michi, ryakudatsu wa yamanai.
Muchi no oto ga suru. Sharin no todoroku oto ga kikoeru. Kakeru uma ga ari, hashiru sensha ga aru.
Kihei wa totsugeki shi, tsurugi ga kirameki, yari ga hirameku. Korosareru mono wa obitadashiku, shikabane wa yama o nasu. Shitai wa kazu kagirinaku, hitobito wa sono shitai ni tsumazuku.
Kore wa mina adeyaka na yuujo no osorubeki maryoku to, ooku no inkou no tame de atte, sono inkou o motte shokokumin o uri, sono maryoku o motte shozoku o uriwatashita mono de aru.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi wa anata ni nozomu, watashi wa anata no suso o kao no ue made age, anata no hadaka o shomin ni mise, anata no hajiru tokoro o shokoku ni miseru.
Watashi wa kegarawashii mono o, anata no ue ni nagekakete, anata o hazukashime, anata o mimono to suru.
Subete anata o miru mono wa, anata o sakete nigesatte iu, "Ninebe wa horobita" to. Dare ga kono tame ni nagekou. Watashi wa doko kara kanojo o nagusameru mono o, tazunedashi eyou.
Anata wa Teebe ni masatte iru ka. Kore wa Nairu kawa no katawara ni zashi, mizu o sono shuui ni megurashi, umi o toride to nashi, mizu o sono kaki to shite iru.
Sono chikara wa Echiopiya, mata Ejiputo de atte, kagiri ga nai. Puto bi to, Ribiya bito mo sono tasukete de atta.
Shikashi, kore mo toriko to natte toraerarete iki, sono kotomo mo subete no chimata no kado de uchikudakare, sono tattoi hitobito wa kuji de wakerare, sono ooinaru hitobito wa mina, kusari ni tsunagareta.
Anata mo mata yowasarete ki o ushinai, anata wa teki o sakete nigeba o motomeru.
Anata no tori de wa mina hatsunari no mi o motsu, ichijiku no ki no you da. Kore o yusubureba sono mi wa ochite, tabeyou to suru mono no kuchi ni hairu.
Miyo, anata no uchi ni iru heishi wa onna no you da. Anata no kuni no mon wa anata no teki no mae ni hiroku hirakare, hi wa anata no kannoki o yaita.
Roujou no tame ni mizu o kume. Anata no toride o katameyo. Nendo no naka ni haitte, shikkui o fumi, renga no kata o tore.
Sono tokoro de hi wa anata o yaki, tsurugi wa anata o kiru. Sore wa inago no you ni anata o kuihorobosu. Anata wa inago no you ni kazu o mase. Batta no you ni fue yo.
Anata wa jibun no shounin o ten no hoshi yori mo ooku shita. Inago wa hane o hatte tobisaru.
Anata no kimitachi wa, batta no you ni, anata no gakushatachi wa, inago no you ni, samui hi ni wa kaki ni tomari, hi ga dete kuruto tobisaru. Sono arika wa dare mo shiranai.
ASsuriya no ou yo, anata no bokusha wa nemuri, anata no kizoku wa madoromu. Anata no tami wa yama no ue ni chirasare, kore o atsumeru mono wa nai.
Anata no yabure wa, ieru koto ga naku, anata no kizu wa omoi. Anata no uwasa o kiku mono wa mina, anata no koto ni tsuite te o utsu. Anata no aku o tsune ni mi ni ukenakatta you na mono ga, dare hitori aru ka.
Yogensha Habakuku ga mita kami no takusen.
Shu yo, watashi ga yonde iru no ni, itsu made anata wa kikiirete kudasaranai no ka. Watashi wa anata ni "Bougyaku ga aru" to uttaetaga, anata wa tasukete kudasaranai no ka.
Anata wa naniyue, watashi ni yokoshima o mise, naniyue, watashi ni wazawai o miserareru no ka. Ryakudatsu to bougyaku ga watashi no mae ni ari, mata ronsou ga ari, tousou mo okotte iru.
Sore yue, rippou wa yurumi, kougi wa okonawarezu, akunin wa gijin o kakomi, kougi wa magete okonawarete iru.
Shokokumin no uchi o nozomimite, odoroke, soshite ayashime. Watashi wa anata gata no hi ni hitotsu no koto o suru. Hito ga kono koto o shirasete mo, anata gata wa toutei shinjimai.
Miyo, watashi wa Karudeya bito o okosu. Kore wa take ku, hageshii kokumin de atte, chi o juuou ni yuki meguri, jibuntachi no mono de nai sumika o ubau.
Kore wa kibishiku, osoroshiku, sono sabaki to igen to wa karera jishin kara deru.
Sono uma wa hyou yori mo hayaku, yoru no ookami yori mo arai. Sono kihei wa isei yoku susumu. Sunawachi, sono kihei wa tooi tokoro kara kuru. Karera wa mono o kuou to isogu washi no you ni tobu.
Karera wa mina bougyaku no tame ni kuru. Karera o osoreru osore ga karera no mae o iku. Karera wa toriko o suna no you ni atsumeru.
Karera wa outachi o anadori, tsukasatachi o azakeru. Karera wa subete no shiro o azawarai, tsuchi o tsumiagete kore o ubau.
Kou shite, karera wa kaze no you ni nagitaoshite iki sugiru. Karera wa tsumibukai mono de, onore no chikara o kami to nasu.
Waga kami, Shu, waga seija yo. Anata wa eien kara imasu kata de wa arimasen ka. Watashitachi wa shinde wa naranai. Shu yo, anata wa karera o sabaki no tame ni sonaerareta. Iwa yo, anata wa karera o kora shime no tame ni taterareta.
Anata wa me ga kiyoku, aku o mirarenai mono, mata fugi o mirarenai mono de aru no ni, naniyue fushinjitsu na mono ni me o tomete irareru no desu ka. Ashiki mono ga jibun yori mo tadashii mono o, nomi kurau no ni, naniyue damatte irareru no desu ka.
Anata wa hito o umi no uo no you ni shi, osameru mono no nai hau mushi no you ni sareru.
Kare wa tsuribari de kore o kotogotoku tsuriage, ami de kore o torae, hikiami de kore o atsume, kou shite kare wa yorokobitanoshimu.
Sore yue, kare wa sono ami ni gisei o sasage, sono hikiami ni kou o taku. Kore ni yotte kare wa zeitaku ni kurashi, sono shokumotsu mo yutaka ni narukara de aru.
Sore de, kare wa itsu made mo sono ami no emono o toriirete, mujou ni mo shokokumin o korosu no de arou ka.
Watashi wa watashi no miharijo ni tachi, monomi yagura ni mi o oki, nozomimite, kare ga watashi ni nan to katarareru ka o mi, mata watashi no uttae ni tsuite watashi mizukara nan to kotaetara yokarou ka o miyou.
Shu wa watashi ni kotaete iwareta, "Kono maboroshi o kaki, kore o ita no ue ni akiraka ni shirushi, hashirinagara mo, kore o yomi uru you ni seyo.
Kono maboroshi wa nao sadamerareta toki o machi, owari o sashite isoide iru. Sore wa itsuwari de wa nai. Moshi osokereba matte ore. Sore wa kanarazu nozomu. Todokoori wa shinai.
Miyo, sono tamashii no tadashiku nai mono wa otoroeru. Shikashi gijin wa sono shinkou ni yotte ikiru.
Mata, sake wa azamuku mono da. Takaburu mono wa sadamari ga nai. Kare no yoku wa yomi no you ni hiroi. Kare wa shi no you de atte, aku koto naku, bankoku o onore ni atsume, banmin o onore no mono to shite tsudowaseru".
Korera wa mina kotowaza o motte kare o azakeri, azakeri no nazo o motte kare o azawarawanaidarou ka. Sunawachi iu, "Wazawai naru ka na, onore ni zokusanai mono o mashikuwaeru mono yo. Itsu made kono you de arou ka. Shichimono de onore o omoku suru mono yo".
Anata no fusaisha wa, niwaka ni okoranaide arou ka. Anata o hageshiku yusuburu mono wa mezamenaide arou ka. Sono toki anata wa karera ni kasumerareru.
Anata wa ooku no kokumin o kasumeta yue, sono moromoro no tami no nokoreru mono wa mina anata o kasumeru. Kore wa hito no chi o nagashi, kuni to machi to, sono naka ni sumu subete no mono ni bougyaku o okonattakara de aru.
Wazawai naru ka na, wazawai no te o manukareru tame ni takai tokoro ni su o kamaeyou to, ono ga ie no tame ni fugi no ri o toru mono yo.
Anata wa koto o hakatte jibun no ie ni haji o maneki, ooku no tami o horoboshite, jibun no seimei o ushinatta.
Ishi wa ishigaki kara sakebi, hari wa tatemono kara kore ni kotaerukara de aru.
Wazawai naru ka na, chi o motte machi o tate, aku o motte machi o kizuku mono yo.
Miyo, moromoro no tami wa hi no tame ni roushi, moromoro no kunibito wa munashii koto no tame ni tsukareru. Kore wa bangun no Shu kara deru kotoba de wa nai ka.
Umi ga mizu de oowarete iru you ni, chi wa Shu no eikou no chishiki de mitasarerukara de aru.
Wazawai naru ka na, sono tonaribito ni ikari no hai o nomasete, kore o yowase, karera no kakushidokoro o miyou to suru mono yo.
Anata wa homare no kawari ni haji ni aki, anata mo mata nonde yoromeke. Shu no migi no te no hai wa, anata ni meguri kuru. Haji wa anata no homare ni kawaru.
Anata ga Rebanon ni nashita bougyaku wa, anata o taoshi, kemono no you na metsubou wa, anata o osoresaseru. Kore wa hito no chi o nagashi, kuni to machi to, machi no naka ni sumu subete no mono ni, bougyaku o okonattakara de aru.
Kizameru zou, chuuzou oyobi itsuwari o oshieru mono wa, sono sakusha ga kore o kizandatote nan no eki ga arou ka. Sono sakusha ga monoi wanu guuzou o tsukutte, sono tsukutta mono ni tanonde mite mo, nan no eki ga arou ka.
Wazawai naru ka na, ki ni mukatte, sameyo to ii, monoi wanu ishi ni mukatte, okiyo to iu mono yo. Kore wa mokushi o atae eyou ka. Miyo, kore wa kingin o kiseta mono de, sono naka ni wa inochi no iki wa sukoshi mo nai.
Shikashi, Shu wa sono sei naru miya ni imasu, zenchi wa sono mimae ni chinmoku seyo.
Shigiyonote no shirabe ni yoru, yogensha Habakuku no inori.
Shu yo, watashi wa anata no koto o kikimashita. Shu yo, watashi wa anata no miwaza o mite osoremasu. Kono toshi no uchi ni kore o arata ni shi, kono toshi no uchi ni kore o shirasete kudasai. Ikaru toki ni mo awaremi o omoiokoshite kudasai.
Kami wa Teman kara korare, seija wa Paran no yama kara korareta. Sono eikou wa ten o ooi, sono san bi wa chi ni michita. [sera]
Sono kagayaki wa hikari no you de ari, sono hikari wa kare no te kara hotobashiru. Kashiko ni sono chikara o kakusu.
Ekibyou wa sono mae ni iki, netsubyou wa sono ushiro ni shitagau.
Kare wa tatte, chi o hakari, kare wa mite, shokokumin o ononokaserareru. Tokoshie no yama wa chirasare, eien no oka wa shizumu. Kare no michi wa mukashi no toori de aru.
Watashi ga miruto, Kushan no tenmaku ni nayami ga ari, Midean no kuni no maku wa furuu.
Shu yo, anata ga uma ni nori, shouri no sensha ni norareru toki, anata wa kawa ni mukatte ikarareru no ka. Kawa ni mukatte ikidoorareru no ka. Aruiha umi ni mukatte rippuku sareru no ka.
Anata no yumi wa toridasareta. Ya wa, tsuru ni tsugaerareta. [sera anata wa kawa o motte chi o sakareta.]
Yamayama wa anata o mite furui, arekuruu mizu wa nagarei de, fuchi wa koe o dashite, sono te o takaku ageta.
Tobi yuku anata no ya no hikari no tame ni, denkou no you ni kirameku, anata no yari no tame ni, hi mo tsuki mo sono sumika ni tachidomatta.
Anata wa ikidootte chi o yuki meguri, ikatte shokokumin o fumitsukerareta.
Anata wa anata no tami o sukuu tame, anata no abura sosoida mono o sukuu tame ni dete ikareta. Anata wa ashiki mono no atama o kudaki, kare o koshi kara kubi made hadaka ni sareta. [sera]
Anata wa anata no yari de shougun no kubi o sashi toosareta. Karera wa watashi o chirasou to shite, tsumujikaze no you ni ki, mazushii mono o hisoka ni, nomi horobosu koto o tanoshimi to shita.
Anata wa anata no uma o tsukatte, umi to oomizu no sakamaku tokoro o fumitsukerareta.
Watashi wa kiite, watashi no karada wa wananaki, watashi no kuchibiru wa sono koe o kiite furueru. Kusare wa watashi no hone ni hairi, watashi no ayumi wa, watashi no shita ni yoromeku. Watashi wa wareware ni semeyoseru tami no ue ni nayami no hi no nozomu no o shizuka ni matou.
Ichijiku no ki wa hana sakazu, budou no ki wa minorazu, oribu no ki no san wa munashiku nari, tahata wa shokumotsu o shouzezu, ori ni wa hitsuji ga tae, gyuusha ni wa ushi ga inaku naru.
Shikashi, watashi wa Shu ni yotte tanoshimi, waga sukui no kami ni yotte yorokobu.
Shu naru kami wa watashi no chikara de atte, watashi no ashi o me jika no ashi no you ni shi, watashi ni takai tokoro o ayumaserareru. Kore o koto ni awase, seikatai no shikisha ni yotte utawaseru.
Yuda no ou Amon no ko Yoshiya no yo ni, Zepaniya ni nozonda Shu no kotoba. Zepaniya wa Kushi no ko, Kushi wa Gedariya no ko, Gedariya wa Amariya no ko, Amariya wa Hizekiya no ko de aru.
Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi wa chi no omote kara subete no mono o issou suru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi wa hito mo kemono mo issou shi, sora no tori, umi no uo o mo issou suru. Watashi wa akunin o taosu. Watashi wa chi no omote kara hito o tachi horobosu".
"Watashi wa Yuda to Erusaremu no subete no juumin to no ue ni te o noberu. Watashi wa kono tokoro kara Baaru no zantou to, guuzou no saishi no na to o tatsu.
Mata okujou de ten no banshou o ogamu mono, Shu ni chikai o tatete ogaminagara, mata Mirukomu o sashite chikau mono,
Shu ni somuite shitagawanai mono, Shu o motomezu, Shu o tazunenai mono o tatsu".
Shu naru kami no mae ni chinmoku seyo. Shu no hi wa chikazuki, Shu wa sudeni gisei o sonae, sono maneita mono o seibetsu saretakara de aru.
Shu no gisei o sasageru hi ni, "Watashi wa tsukasatachi to ou no kotachi, oyobi subete ihou no ifuku o kiru mono o bassuru.
Sono hi ni watashi wa mata, subete shikii o tobikoe, bougyaku to azamuki to o jibun no shukun no ie ni mitasu mono o bassuru".
Shu wa iwareru, "Sono hi ni wa uo no mon kara sakebigoe ga okori, daini no machi kara umekigoe ga okori, moromoro no oka kara susamajii hibiki ga okoru.
Shikkui no ie no juumin yo, nakisakebe. Akinai suru tami wa mina horobosare, gin o hakaru mono wa mina tatarerukara de aru.
Sono toki, watashi wa tomoshibi o motte, Erusaremu o tazuneru. Soshite ori no ue ni korikatamari, sono kokoro no naka de 'Shu wa yoi koto mo, warui koto mo shinai' to iu hitobito o watashi wa bassuru.
Karera no zaihou wa kasumerare, karera no ie wa are hateru. Karera wa ie o tatete mo, sore ni sumu koto ga dekinai, budou hatake o tsukutte mo, sono budoushu o nomu koto ga dekinai".
Shu no ooinaru hi wa chikai, chikazuite, sumiyaka ni kuru. Shu no hi no koe wa mimi ni itai. Soko ni, yuushi mo itaku sakebu.
Sono hi wa ikari no hi, nayami to kurushimi no hi, are, mata horobiru hi, kuraku, usugurai hi, kumo to kurokumo no hi,
Rappa to toki no koe no hi, kengo na machi to takai yagura o semeru hi de aru.
Watashi wa hitobito ni nayami o kudashite, moujin no you ni arukaseru. Karera ga Shu ni taishite tsumi o okashitakara de aru. Karera no chi wa chiri no you ni nagasare, karera no niku wa fundo no you ni suterareru.
Karera no gin mo kin mo, Shu no ikari no hi ni wa karera o sukuu koto ga dekinai. Zenchi wa Shu no netami no hi ni nomareru. Shu wa chi ni sumu hitobito o tachimachi horoboshi tsukusareru.
Anata gata, haji o shiranu tami yo, tomo ni tsudoi, atsumare.
Sunawachi, momigara no you ni oiyarareru mae ni, Shu no hageshii ikari ga mada anata gata ni nozomanai mae ni, Shu no ikidoori no hi ga mada anata gata ni kinai mae ni.
Subete Shu no meirei o okonau kono chi no herikudaru mono yo, Shu o motomeyo. Seigi o motomeyo. Kenson o motomeyo. Sou sureba anata gata wa Shu no ikari no hi ni, aruiha kakusareru koto ga arou.
Tomoare, Gaza wa suterare, Ashikeron wa are hate, Ashidodo wa mahiru ni oiharaware, Ekuron wa nukisarareru.
Wazawai naru ka na, umibe ni sumu mono, Kerete no kokumin. Perishite bito no chi, Kanan yo, Shu no kotoba ga anata gata ni nozomu. Watashi wa anata o horoboshite, sumu mono ga nai you ni suru.
Umibe yo, anata wa makiba to nari, hitsujikai no bokusou chi to nari, mata hitsuji no ori to naru.
Umibe wa Yuda no ie no nokori no mono ni kisuru. Karera wa sono tokoro de mure o yashinai, yuugure ni wa Ashikeron no ie ni fusu. Karera no kami, Shu ga karera o kaerimi, sono koufuku o kaifuku sarerukara de aru.
"Watashi wa Moabu no azakeri to, Anmon no hitobito no, nonoshiri o kiita. Karera wa waga tami o azakeri, mizukara hokotte karera no kokkyou o okashita.
Sore yue, bangun no Shu, Isuraeru no kami wa iwareru, watashi wa ikite iru. Moabu wa kanarazu Sodomu no you ni naru. Anmon no hitobito wa Gomora no you ni naru. Irakusa to shio ana to ga koko o senryou shite, eien ni arechi to naru. Waga tami no nokori no mono wa karera o kasume, waga kunitami no nokori no mono wa kore o shoyuu suru".
Kono koto no karera ni nozomu no wa sono takaburi ni yoru no da. Karera ga bangun no Shu no tami o azakeri, mizukara hokottakara de aru.
Shu wa karera ni taishite osorubeki mono to narareru. Shu wa chi no subete no kamigami o uesaserareru. Moromoro no kuni no tami wa, onoono jibun no tokoro kara dete Shu o ogamu.
Echiopiya bito yo, anata gata mo mata waga tsurugi ni yotte korosareru.
Shu wa mata kita ni mukatte te o nobe, ASsuriya o horoboshi, Ninebe o arashite, arano no you na, kawaita chi to sareru.
Kachiku no mure, moromoro no no no kemono wa sono naka ni fushi, hagetaka ya, yamaarashi wa sono hashira no itadaki ni sumi, fukurou wa, sono mado no uchi ni naki, karasu wa, sono shikii no ue ni naku. Sono kouhaku no saiku ga hadaka ni sarerukara de aru.
Kono machi wa kachihokotte, yasuraka ni ochitsuki, sono kokoro no naka de, "Tada watashi dake da, watashi no hoka ni wa dare mo nai" to itta machi de aruga, kono you ni are hatete, kemono no fusu tokoro ni natte shimatta. Koko o toorisugiru mono wa mina azakette, te o furu.
Wazawai naru ka na, kono somuki kegareta bougyaku no machi.
Kore wa dare no koe ni mo mimi o katamukezu, kora shime o ukeirezu, Shu ni yori tanomazu, onore no kami ni chikayoranai.
Sono naka ni iru tsukasatachi wa, hoerushi shi, sono sabaki bitotachi wa, yoru no ookami de, karera wa asa made nani hitotsu nokosanai.
Sono yogensha tachi wa, houjuu de itsuwari bi to, sono saishitachi wa sei naru mono o kegashi, rippou o yaburu.
Sono naka ni imasu Shu wa gi de atte, fugi o okonawarenai. Asagoto ni sono kougi o arawashite, ayamaru koto ga nai. Shikashi fugi na mono wa haji o shiranai.
"Watashi wa shokokumin o horoboshita. Sono yagura wa are hateta. Watashi wa sono chimata o arashita no de, chimata o ikiki suru mono mo nai. Sono machimachi wa are sutarete, hito no sugata mo naku, sumu mono mo nai.
Watashi wa itta, 'Kore wa kanarazu watashi o osore, kora shime o ukeru. Kore wa watashi ga meijita subete no koto o miushinawanai' to. Shikashi karera wa shikiri ni jibun no gyoujou o midashita".
Shu wa iwareru, "Sore yue, anata gata wa, watashi ga tatte, shougen suru hi o mate. Watashi no ketsui wa shokokumin o yoseatsume, moromoro no kuni o atsumete, waga ikidoori, waga hageshii ikari o kotogotoku sono ue ni sosogu koto de atte, zenchi wa, netamu watashi no ikari no hi ni yakihorobosarerukara de aru.
Sono toki watashi wa moromoro no tami ni kiyo ki kuchibiru o atae, subete karera ni Shu no na o yobase, kokoro o hitotsu ni shite Shu ni tsukaesaseru.
Watashi o ogamu mono, watashi ga chirashita mono no musume wa Echiopiya no kawagawa no mukou kara kite, watashi ni sonaemono o sasageru.
Sono hi ni wa, anata wa watashi ni somuita subete no waza no yue ni, hazukashimerareru koto wa nai. Sono toki watashi wa anata no uchi kara, takabutte hokoru monodomo o nozoku yue, anata wa kasanete waga sei naru yama de, takaburu koto wa nai.
Watashi wa nyuuwa ni shite herikudaru tami o, anata no uchi ni nokosu. Karera wa Shu no na o sakedokoro to suru.
Isuraeru no nokori no mono wa fugi o okonawazu, itsuwari o iwazu, sono kuchi ni wa azamuki no shita o minai. Sore yue, karera wa shoku o ete fushi, karera o obiyakasu mono wa inai".
Shion no musume yo, yorokobiutae. Isuraeru yo, yorokobi yobaware. Erusaremu no musume yo, kokoro no kagiri yorokobitanoshime.
Shu wa anata o uttaeru mono o torisari, anata no teki o oiharawareta. Isuraeru no ou naru Shu wa anata no uchi ni imasu. Anata wa mohaya wazawai o osoreru koto wa nai.
Sono hi, hitobito wa Erusaremu ni mukatte iu, "Shion yo, osoreru na. Anata no te o yowayowashikutareru na.
Anata no kami, Shu wa anata no uchi ni imashi, yuushi de atte, shouri o ataerareru. Kare wa anata no tame ni yorokobitanoshimi, sono ai ni yotte anata o arata ni shi, matsuri no hi no you ni anata no tame ni yorokobi yobawarareru".
"Watashi wa anata kara nayami o torisaru. Anata wa haji o ukeru koto wa nai.
Miyo, sono toki anata o shi etageru mono o watashi wa kotogotoku shobun shi, ashi nae o sukui, oiyarareta mono o atsume, karera no haji o homare ni kae, zenchi ni homerareru you ni suru.
Sono toki, watashi wa anatagata o tsurekaeru. Watashi ga anatagata o atsumeru toki, watashi ga anata gata no me no mae ni, anata gata no koufuku o kaifuku suru toki, chi no subete no tami no naka de, anata gata ni na o esase, homare o esaseru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Dariyosu ou no ni nen roku gatsu, sono tsuki no tsuitachi ni, Shu no kotoba ga yogensha Hagai ni yotte, Sharuteru no ko, Yuda no soutoku Zerubaberu, oyobi Yozadaku no ko, daisaishi Yoshua ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, kono tami wa, Shu no ie o futatabi tateru toki wa, mada konai to itte iru".
Soko de, Shu no kotoba wa mata yogensha Hagai ni nozonda,
"Shu no ie wa kono you ni are hatete iru no ni, anata gata wa, mizukara ita de hatta ie ni sunde iru toki de arou ka.
Sore de ima, bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa jibun no nasubeki koto o yoku kangaeru ga yoi.
Anata gata wa ooku maite mo, toriire wa sukunaku, tabete mo, akiru koto wa nai. Nonde mo, mitasarenai. Kite mo, atatamaranai. Chingin o ete mo, kore o yabureta fukuro ni irete iru you na mono de aru.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, anata gata wa, jibun no nasubeki koto o kangaeru ga yoi.
Yama ni nobori, ki o motte kite Shu no ie o tate yo. Sou sureba watashi wa kore o yorokobi, katsu eikou no uchi ni arawareruto Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa ooku o nozondaga, miyo, sore wa sukunakatta. Anata gata ga ie ni motte kita toki, watashi wa sore o fukiharatta. Kore wa naniyue de aru ka to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru. Kore wa watashi no ie ga are hatete iru no ni, anata gata wa, onoono jibun no ie no koto dake ni, isogashiku shite iru.
Sore yue, anata gata no ue no ten wa tsuyu o sashitome, chi wa sono sanbutsu o sashitometa.
Mata, watashi wa chi ni mo, yama ni mo, kokumotsu ni mo, atarashii sake ni mo, abura ni mo, chi ni shoujiru mono ni mo, ningen ni mo, kachiku ni mo, te de tsukuru subete no sakumotsu ni mo, hideri o yobiyoseta".
Soko de, Sharuteru no ko Zerubaberu to Yozadaku no ko, daisaishi Yoshua oyobi nokori no subete no tami wa, sono kami, Shu no koe to, sono kami, Shu no tsukawasareta yogensha Hagai no kotoba to ni kiki shitagai, soshite tami wa, Shu no mae ni osore kashiko n da.
Toki ni, Shu no shisha Hagai wa Shu no meirei ni yori, tami ni tsugete itta, "Watashi wa anata gata to tomo ni iru to Shu wa iwareru".
Soshite Shu wa, Sharuteru no ko, Yuda no soutoku Zerubaberu no kokoro to, Yozadaku no ko, daisaishi Yoshua no kokoro, oyobi nokori no subete no tami no kokoro o, furiugokasareta no de, karera wa kite, sono kami, bangun no Shu no ie no sagyou ni torikakatta.
Kore wa roku gatsu nijuu yonka no koto de atta.
Dariyosu ou no ni nen no nana gatsu nijuu ichi nichi ni, Shu no kotoba ga yogensha Hagai ni nozonda,
"Sharuteru no ko, Yuda no soutoku Zerubaberu to, Yozadaku no ko, daisaishi Yoshua, oyobi nokori no subete no tami ni tsugete ie,
'Anata gata nokori no mono no uchi, izen no eikou ni kagayaku Shu no ie o mita mono wa dare ka. Anata gata wa ima, kono joutai o dou omou ka. Kore wa anata gata no me ni wa, mu ni hitoshiide wa nai ka.
Shu wa iwareru, Zerubaberu yo, yuuki o dase. Yozadaku no ko, daisaishi Yoshua yo, yuuki o dase. Shu wa iwareru. Kono chi no subete no tami yo, yuuki o dase. Hatarake. Watashi wa anata gata to tomo ni iruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Kore wa anata gata ga Ejiputo kara deta toki, watashi ga anata gata ni, yakusoku shita kotoba de aru. Watashi no rei ga, anata gata no uchi ni yadotte iru. Osoreru na.
Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, shibaraku shite, ima ichido, watashi wa ten to, chi to, umi to, kawaita chi to o furuu.
Watashi wa mata bankokumin o furuu. Bankokumin no zaihou wa, haitte kite, watashi wa eikou o kono ie ni mitasuto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Gin wa watashi no mono, kin mo watashi no mono de aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Shu no ie no nochi no eikou wa, mae no eikou yori mo ookiito, bangun no Shu wa iwareru. Watashi wa kono tokoro ni han'ei o ataeruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru' ".
Dariyosu no ni nen no kyuu gatsu nijuu yonka ni, Shu no kotoba ga yogensha Hagai ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu wa kou iwareru, rippou ni tsuite saishitachi ni tazunete ie,
'Hito ga sono ifuku no suso de sei naru niku o hakonde iki, sono suso ga moshi, pan mata wa atsumono, mata wa sake, mata wa abura, mata wa donna shokumotsu ni de mo sawattanara, sorera wa sei naru mono to naru ka' to". Saishitachi wa "Naranai" to kotaeta.
Hagai wa mata itta, "Moshi, shitai ni yotte kegareta hito ga, korera no hitotsu ni sawattanara, sore wa kegareru ka". Saishitachi wa "Kegareru" to kotaeta.
Soko de, Hagai wa itta, "Shu wa iwareru, kono tami mo, kono kuni mo, watashi no mae de wa, sono you de aru. Mata sono te no waza mo sono you de aru. Sono tokoro de karera no sasageru mono wa, kegareta mono de aru.
Ima, anata gata wa kono hi kara, nochi no koto o omou ga yoi. Shu no miya de ishi no ue ni ishi ga tsumarenakatta mae, anata gata wa, donna de atta ka.
Ano toki ni wa, nijuu masu no mugi no tsumareru tokoro ni ittaga, wazuka ni juu masu o e, mata gojuu oke o kumou to shite, saka bune ni ittaga, nijuu oke o eta nomi de atta.
Watashi wa tachigare to, kusari ho to, hyou o motte anata gata to, anata gata no subete no te no waza o utta. Shikashi, anata gata wa, watashi ni kaeranakatta to Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa kono hi yori nochi, sunawachi, kyuu gatsu nijuu yonka yori no koto o omou ga yoi. Mata Shu no miya no motoi o sueta hi kara nochi no koto o kokoro ni tomeru ga yoi.
Tane wa nao, naya ni aru ka. Budou no ki, ichijiku no ki, zakuro no ki, oribu no ki mo mada mi o musubanai. Shikashi, watashi wa kono hi kara, anata gata ni megumi o ataeru".
Kono tsuki no nijuu yonka ni, Shu no kotoba ga futatabi Hagai ni nozonda,
"Yuda no soutoku Zerubaberu ni tsugete ie, watashi wa ten to chi o furuu.
Watashi wa kuniguni no oui o taoshi, ihou no kuniguni no chikara o horoboshi, mata sensha, oyobi kore ni noru mono o taosu. Uma oyobi kore ni noru mono wa, tagai ni sono nakama no tsurugi ni yotte taoreru.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, Sharuteru no ko, waga shimobe Zerubaberu yo, Shu wa iwareru, sono hi, watashi wa anata o tate, anata o inshou no you ni suru. Watashi wa anata o erandakara de aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru".
Dariyosu no daini nen no hachi gatsu ni, Shu no kotoba ga Ido no ko Berekiya no ko de aru yogensha Zekariya ni nozonda,
"Shu wa anata gata no senzotachi ni taishite, itaku oikari ni natta.
Sore yue, bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareruto, karera ni tsuge yo. Bangun no Shu wa ooserareru, watashi ni kaere, sou sureba, watashi mo anata gata ni kaerouto, bangun no Shu wa ooserareru.
Anata gata no senzotachi no you de atte wa naranai. Saki no yogensha tachi wa, karera ni mukatte sakende itta, 'Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, warui michi o hanare, warui okonai o sutete kaere' to. Shikashi karera wa kikiirezu, mimi o watashi ni katamukenakatta to Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata no senzotachi, karera wa doko ni iru ka. Yogensha tachi, karera wa eien ni ikite iru no ka.
Shikashi watashi no shimobe de aru yogensha tachi ni meijita waga kotoba to, waga sadame to wa, anata gata no senzotachi ni oyondade wa nai ka. Sore de karera wa tachikaette itta, 'Bangun no Shu ga wareware no michi ni shitagai, okonai ni shitagatte, wareware ni, nasou to omoisadamerareta you ni, sono toori sareta no da' to".
Dariyosu no daini nen no juu ichi gatsu, sunawachi Sebate to iu tsuki no nijuu yonka ni, Shu no kotoba ga Ido no ko Berekiya no ko de aru yogensha Zekariya ni nozonda. Soshite Zekariya wa itta,
"Watashi wa yoru, mite iruto, hitori no hito ga akauma ni notte, tanima ni aru Mirutosu no ki no naka ni tachi, sono ushiro ni akauma, kurige no uma, shirouma ga ita.
Sono toki watashi ga 'Waga Shu yo, korera wa nan desu ka' to tazuneruto, watashi to kataru ten no tsukai wa itta, 'Kore ga nan de aru ka, anata ni shimeshimashou'.
Suruto, Mirutosu no ki no naka ni tatte iru hito ga kotaete, 'Korera wa chi o mimawaraseru tame ni, Shu ga tsukawasareta mono desu' to iuto,
Karera wa kotaete, Mirutosu no naka ni tatte iru Shu no tsukai ni itta, 'Wareware wa chi o mimawattaga, zenchi wa subete heion desu'.
Suru to Shu no tsukai wa itta, 'Bangun no Shu yo, anata wa, itsu made Erusaremu to Yuda no machimachi to o, awarende kudasaranai no desu ka. Anata wa oikari ni natte, sudeni nanajuu nen ni narimashita'.
Shu wa watashi to kataru ten no tsukai ni, nengoro na nagusame no kotoba o motte kotaerareta.
Soko de, watashi to kataru ten no tsukai wa itta, 'Anata wa yobawatte ii nasai. Bangun no Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, watashi wa Erusaremu no tame, Shion no tame ni, ooinaru netami o okoshi,
Yasuraka ni iru kuniguni no tami ni taishite, ooini ikaru. Naze nara, watashi ga sukoshi bakari ikatta no ni, karera wa, ooini kore o nayamashitakara de aru to.
Sore yue, Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, watashi wa awaremi o motte Erusaremu ni kaeru. Watashi no ie wa sono naka ni taterare, hakari nawa wa Erusaremu ni harareruto, bangun no Shu wa ooseraremasu.
Anata wa mata yobawatte ii nasai. Bangun no Shu wa kou ooseraremasu, waga machimachi wa futatabi yoi mono de michiafure, Shu wa futatabi Shion o nagusame, futatabi Erusaremu o erabu' to".
Watashi ga me o agete mite iruto, miyo, yontsu no tsuno ga atta.
Watashi to kataru ten no tsukai ni "Korera wa nan desu ka" to iuto, kare wa kotaete itta, "Korera wa Yuda, Isuraeru oyobi Erusaremu o chirashita tsuno desu".
Sono toki, Shu wa yonnin no kaji o watashi ni shimesareta.
Watashi ga "Korera wa nani o suru tame ni kita no desu ka" to iuto, kare wa kotaeta, "Korera no tsuno wa Yuda o chirashite, hito ni sono atama o agesasenakatta mono desuga, kono yonnin no mono ga kita no wa karera o odoshi, kano Yuda no chi ni mukatte tsuno o age, kore o chirashita kuniguni no tami no tsuno o nageutsu tame desu".
Mata watashi ga me o agete mite iruto, miyo, hitori no hito ga, hakari nawa o te ni motte iru no de,
"Anata wa doko e iku no desu ka" to tazuneruto, sono hito wa watashi ni itta, "Erusaremu o hakatte, sono hirosa to, nagasa o miyou to suru no desu".
Suru to miyo, watashi to kataru ten no tsukai ga dete ikuto, mata hitori no ten no tsukai ga dete kite, kore ni deatte,
Itta, "Hashitte itte, ano wakai hito ni ii nasai, 'Erusaremu wa sono naka ni, hito to kachiku ga ooku naru no de, jouheki no nai murazato no you ni, hito no sumu tokoro to narudeshou.
Shu wa ooseraremasu, watashi wa sono shuui de hi no jouheki to nari, sono naka de eikou to naru' to".
Shu wa ooserareru, saa, kita no chi kara nigete ki nasai. Watashi wa anatagata o, ten no shihou no kaze no you ni chirashitakara de aru.
Saa, Babiron no musume to tomo ni iru mono yo, Shion ni nogare nasai.
Anata gata ni sawaru mono wa, kare no menotama ni sawaru no de arukara, anatagata o toraete itta kuniguni no tami ni, sono eikou ni shitagatte, watashi o tsukawasareta bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru,
"Miyo, watashi wa karera no ue ni te o furu. Karera wa jibun ni tsukaeta mono no toriko to naru. Sono toki anata gata wa bangun no Shu ga, watashi o tsukawasareta koto o shiru.
Shu wa iwareru, Shion no musume yo, yorokobiutae. Watashi ga kite, anata no naka ni sumukara de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, ooku no kokumin ga Shu ni tsuranatte, watashi no tami to naru. Watashi wa anata no naka ni sumu.
Anata wa bangun no Shu ga, watashi o anata ni tsukawasareta koto o shiru. Shu wa seichi de, Yuda o jibun no bun to shite tori, Erusaremu o futatabi erabarerude arou".
Subete niku naru mono yo, Shu no mae ni shizumare. Shu wa sono sei naru sumika kara tachiagararetakara de aru.
Toki ni Shu wa daisaishi Yoshua ga, Shu no tsukai no mae ni tachi, Satan ga sono migi ni tatte, kore o uttaete iru no o watashi ni shimesareta.
Shu wa Satan ni iwareta, "Satan yo, Shu wa anata o semeru no da. Sunawachi Erusaremu o eranda Shu wa anata o semeru no da. Kore wa hi no naka kara toridashita moesashi de wa nai ka".
Yoshua wa kegareta koromo o kite, mitsukai no mae ni tatte itaga,
Mitsukai wa jibun no mae ni tatte iru monodomo ni itta, "Kare no kegareta koromo o nugase nasai". Mata Yoshua ni mukatte itta, "Miyo, watashi wa anata no tsumi o torinozoita. Anata ni saifuku o kiseyou".
Watashi wa itta, "Kiyoi boushi o atama ni kaburase nasai". Soko de kiyoi boushi o atama ni kaburase, koromo o kare ni kiseta. Shu no tsukai wa katawara ni tatte ita.
Shu no tsukai wa, Yoshua o imashimete itta,
"Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, anata ga moshi, watashi no michi ni ayumi, watashi no tsutome o mamorunaraba, watashi no ie o tsukasadori, watashi no niwa o mamoru koto ga dekiru. Watashi wa mata, koko ni tatte iru monodomo no naka ni ikiki suru koto o esaseru.
Daisaishi Yoshua yo, anata mo, anata no mae ni suwatte iru douryoutachi mo kiki nasai. Karera wa yoi shirushi to narubeki hitobito dakara de aru. Miyo, watashi wa watashi no shimobe naru eda o shoujisaseyou.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, miyo, Yoshua no mae ni watashi ga oita ishi no ue ni, sunawachi nanatsu no me o motte iru kono hitotsu no ishi no ue ni, watashi wa mizukara moji o choukoku suru. Soshite watashi wa kono chi no tsumi o, ichi nichi no uchi ni torinozoku.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, anata gata wa meimei sono tonaribito o maneite, budou no ki no shita, ichijiku no ki no shita ni zasu no de aru".
Watashi to katatta ten no tsukai ga mata kite, watashi o yobisamashita. Watashi wa nemuri kara yobisamasareta hito no you de atta.
Kare ga watashi ni mukatte "Nani o miru ka" to itta no de, watashi wa itta, "Watashi ga mite iruto, subete kin de tsukurareta shokudai ga hitotsu atte, sono ue ni abura o ireru utsuwa ga ari, mata shokudai no ue ni nanatsu no tomoshibi sara ga ari, sono tomoshibi sara wa shokudai no ue ni atte, kore ni onoono nanahon zutsu no kan ga arimasu.
Mata shokudai no katawara ni, oribu no ki ga nihon atte, ichipon wa abura o ireru utsuwa no migi ni ari, ichipon wa sono hidari ni arimasu".
Watashi wa mata watashi to kataru ten no tsukai ni itta, "Waga Shu yo, korera wa nan desu ka".
Watashi to kataru ten no tsukai wa kotaete, "Anata wa sore ga nan de aru ka shiranai no desu ka" to itta no de, watashi wa "Waga Shu yo, shirimasen" to itta.
Suruto kare wa watashi ni itta, "Zerubaberu ni, Shu ga otsuge ni naru kotoba wa kore desu. Bangun no Shu wa ooserareru, kore wa kensei ni yorazu, nouryoku ni yorazu, watashi no rei ni yoru no de aru.
Ooinaru yama yo, omae wa nanimono ka. Omae wa Zerubaberu no mae ni heichi to naru. Kare wa 'Megumi are, kore ni megumi are' to yobawarinagara, kashira ishi o hikidasude arou".
Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonde iu ni wa,
"Zerubaberu no te wa kono miya no ishizue o sueta. Kare no te wa kore o kansei suru. Sono toki anata gata wa bangun no Shu ga, watashi o anata gata ni tsukawasareta koto o shiru.
Dare de mo chiisai koto no hi o iyashimeta mono wa, Zerubaberu no te ni, sagefuri no aru no o mite, yorokobu. Korera no nanatsu no mono wa, amaneku zenchi o ikiki suru Shu no me de aru".
Watashi wa mata kare ni tazunete, "Shokudai no sayuu ni aru, kono nihon no oribu no ki wa nan desu ka" to ii,
Kasanete mata "Kono nihon no kin no kuda ni yotte, abura o sore kara sosogi dasu oribu no ni eda wa nan desu ka" to iuto,
Kare wa watashi ni kotaete, "Anata wa sore ga nan de aru ka shiranai no desu ka" to itta no de, "Waga Shu yo, shirimasen" to itta.
Suruto kare wa itta, "Korera wa futari no abura sosogareta mono de, zenchi no Shu no katawara ni tatsu mono desu".
Watashi ga mata me o agete mite iruto, tonde iru makimono o mita.
Kare ga watashi ni "Nani o miru ka" to itta no de, "Tonde iru makimono o mimasu. Sono nagasa wa nijuu kyubito, sono haba wa juu kyubito desu" to kotaeta.
Suruto kare wa mata, watashi ni itta, "Kore wa zenchi no omote ni dete iku, noroi no kotoba desu. Subete nusumu mono wa kore ni tera shite nozokisarare, subete itsuwari chikau mono wa, kore ni tera shite nozokisarareru no desu.
Bangun no Shu wa ooseraremasu, watashi wa kore o dete ikaseru. Kore wa nusumu mono no ie ni hairi, mata watashi no na o sashite itsuwari chikau mono no ie ni hairi, sono ie no naka ni yadotte, kore o sono ki to ishi to tomo ni horobosuto".
Watashi to kataru ten no tsukai wa susunde kite, watashi ni "Me o agete, kono dete kita mono ga, nan de aru ka o mi nasai" to itta.
Watashi ga "Kore wa nan desu ka" to iuto, kare wa "Kono dete kita mono wa, epa masu desu" to ii, mata "Kore wa zenchi no tsumi desu" to itta.
Soshite miyo, namari no futa o toriageruto, sono epa masu no naka ni hitori no onna ga suwatte ita.
Suruto kare wa "Kore wa zaiaku de aru" to itte, sono onna o epa masu no naka ni oshiire, namari no omoshi o, sono masu no kuchi ni nage kabuseta.
Sore kara watashi ga me o agete mite iruto, futari no onna ga dete kita. Kore ni, kounotori no tsubasa no you na tsubasa ga ari, sono tsubasa ni kaze o harande, epa masu o ten to chi to no aida ni mochiageta.
Watashi wa, watashi to kataru ten no tsukai ni itta, "Karera wa epa masu o, doko e motte iku no desu ka".
Kare wa watashi ni itta, "Shinaru no chi de, onnatachi no tame ni ie o tateru no desu. Sore ga taterareruto, karera wa epa masu o soko ni sue, sore no dodai no ue ni oku no desu".
Watashi ga mata me o agete mite iruto, yon ryou no sensha ga futatsu no yama no aida kara dete kita. Sono yama wa seidou no yama de atta.
Daiichi no sensha ni wa akauma o tsuke, daini no sensha ni wa kurouma o tsuke,
Daisan no sensha ni wa shirouma o tsuke, daiyon no sensha ni wa, madara no nezumiiro no uma o tsukete ita.
Watashi wa, watashi to kataru mitsukai ni tazuneta, "Waga Shu yo, korera wa nan desu ka".
Ten no tsukai wa kotaete, watashi ni itta, "Korera wa zenchi no Shu no mae ni arawarete nochi, ten no shihou ni dete iku mono desu.
Kurouma o tsuketa sensha wa, kita no kuni o sashite dete iki, shirouma wa nishi no kuni o sashite dete iki, madara no uma wa minami no kuni o sashite dete iku no desu".
Uma ga dete kuruto, karera wa, chi o amaneku meguru tame ni, shikiri ni detagaru no de atta. Sore de kare ga "Itte, chi o amaneku megure" to iuto, karera wa chi o iki megutta.
Suruto kare wa watashi o yonde, "Kita no kuni o sashite iku monodomo wa, kita no kuni de watashi no kokoro o shizumarasete kureta" to itta.
Shu no kotoba ga mata watashi ni nozonda,
"Babiron kara kaette kita ka no hoshuu no naka kara, Herudai, Tobiya oyobi Edaya o tsurete, sono hi ni Zepaniya no ko Yoshiya no ie ni iki,
Karera kara kingin o uketotte, hitotsu no kanmuri o tsukuri, sore o Yozadaku no ko de aru daisaishi Yoshua no atama ni kaburasete,
Kare ni ii nasai, 'Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, miyo, sono na o eda to iu hito ga aru. Kare wa jibun no basho de seichou shite, Shu no miya o tateru.
Sunawachi kare wa Shu no miya o tate, ou to shite no kouei o obi, sono kurai ni zashite osameru. Sono kurai no katawara ni, hitori no saishi ga ite, kono futari no aida ni heiwa no itchi ga aru'.
Mata sono kanmuri wa Herudai, Tobiya, Edaya oyobi Zepaniya no ko Yoshiya no kinen to shite, Shu no miya ni osamerareru.
Mata tooi tokoro no monodomo ga kite, Shu no miya o tateru koto o tasukeru. Soshite anata gata wa bangun no Shu ga, watashi o tsukawasareta koto o shiru you ni naru. Anata gata ga moshi hagende, anata gata no kami, Shu no koe ni kikishitagaunaraba, kono you ni naru".
Dariyosu ou no daiyon nen no kyuu gatsu, sunawachi Kisuriu to iu tsuki no yonka ni, Shu no kotoba ga Zekariya ni nozonda.
Sono toki Beteru no hitobito wa, Sharezeru, regen mereku oyobi sono juusha o tsukawashite, Shu no megumi o koi,
Katsu bangun no Shu no miya ni iru saishi ni towase, katsu yogensha ni towasete itta, "Watashi wa ima made, tanen okonatte kita you ni, go gatsu ni nakikanashimi, katsu danjiki subekideshou ka".
Kono toki, bangun no Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Chi no subete no tami, oyobi saishi ni tsugete ii nasai, anata gata ga nanajuu nen no aida, go gatsu to nana gatsu to ni danjiki shi, katsu nakikanashinda toki, hatashite, watashi no tame ni danjiki shita ka.
Anata gata ga kui nomi suru toki, sore wa mattaku jibun no tame ni kui, jibun no tame ni nomu no de wa nai ka.
Mukashi Erusaremu ga sono shuui no machimachi to tomo ni, hito ga sumi, sakaete ita toki, mata minami no chi oyobi heiya ni mo, hito ga sunde ita toki ni, saki no yogensha tachi ni yotte, Shu ga otsuge ni natta kotoba wa, korera no koto de wa nakatta ka".
Shu no kotoba ga, mata Zekariya ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu wa kou ooserareru, shinjitsu no sabaki o okonai, tagai ni aiitsukushimi, aiawaremi,
Yamome, minashigo, kiryuu no takokujin oyobi mazushii hito o, shi etagete wa naranai. Tagai ni hito o gaisuru koto o, kokoro ni hakatte wa naranai".
Tokoro ga, karera wa kiku koto o kobami, kata o sobiyakashi, mimi o nibuku shite kikiirezu,
Sono kokoro o kongouseki no you ni shite, bangun no Shu ga sono mitama ni yori, saki no yogensha ni yotte tsutaerareta, rippou to kotoba to ni kikishitagawanakatta. Sore yue, ooinaru ikari ga, bangun no Shu kara dete, karera ni nozonda no de aru.
"Watashi ga yobawattakeredo mo, karera wa kikou to shinakatta. Sono toori ni, karera ga yobawatte mo, watashi wa kikanai" to bangun no Shu wa ooserareru.
"Watashi wa, tsumujikaze o motte, karera o michi no moromoro no kokumin no naka ni chirashita. Kou shite karera ga satta nochi, kono chi wa arete ikiki suru mono mo naku, kono uruwashii chi wa arechi to natta no de aru".
Bangun no Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa Shion no tame ni, ooinaru netami o okoshi, mata kore ga tame ni, ooinaru ikidoori o motte netamu'.
Shu wa kou ooserareru, 'Watashi wa Shion ni kaette, Erusaremu no naka ni sumu. Erusaremu wa chuushin na machi to tonaerare, bangun no Shu no yama wa sei naru yama to, tonaerareru'.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Erusaremu no gairo ni wa futatabi oita otoko, oita onna ga zasuru you ni naru. Mina toshiyori no hitobito de, onoono tsue o te ni motsu.
Mata sono machi no gairo ni wa, otokonoko, onnanoko ga michite, gairo ni asobitawamureru'.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Sono hi ni wa, tatoi, kono tami no nokoreru mono no me ni, fushigi na koto de atte mo, sore wa watashi no me ni mo, fushigi na koto de arou ka' to bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, 'Miyo, waga tami o higashi no kuni kara, mata nishi no kuni kara sukuidashi,
Karera o tsurete kite, Erusaremu ni sumawase, karera wa waga tami to nari, watashi wa karera no kami to natte, tomo ni shinjitsu to seigi to o motte tatsu' ".
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, "Bangun no Shu no ie de aru miya o tateru tame ni, sono ishizue o sueta hi kara konokata, yogensha tachi no kuchi kara deta korera no kotoba o, kyou kiku mono yo, anata gata no te o tsuyoku seyo.
Kono hi no izen ni wa, hito mo hataraki no atai o ezu, kemono mo hataraki no atai o ezu, mata deru mono mo hairu mono mo, ada no tame ni anzen de wa nakatta. Watashi wa mata hitobito o aitagai ni somukaseta.
Shikashi ima wa, watashi no kono tami no nokoreru mono ni taisuru koto wa, saki no hi no you de wa naito, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Soko ni wa, heiwa to han'ei to no tane ga makarerukara de aru. Sunawachi budou no ki wa mi o musubi, chi wa sanbutsu o dashi, ten wa tsuyu o ataeru. Watashi wa kono tami no nokoreru mono ni, kore o kotogotoku ataeru.
Yuda no ie oyobi Isuraeru no ie yo, anata ga taga, kuniguni no tami no naka ni, noroi to natte ita you ni, watashi wa anatagata o sukutte shukufuku to suru. Osorete wa naranai. Anata gata no te o tsuyoku seyo".
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, "Anata gata no senzo ga, watashi o ikaraseta toki ni, wazawai o kudasou to omotte, kore o yamenakatta you ni, - - bangun no Shu wa iwareru - -
Sono you ni, watashi wa mata konnichi, Erusaremu to Yuda no ie ni megumi o ataeyou. Osorete wa naranai.
Anata gata no nasubeki koto wa kore de aru. Anata gata wa tagai ni shinjitsu o katari, mata anata gata no mon de, shinjitsu to heiwa no sabaki to o, okonawanakereba naranai.
Anata gata wa, tagai ni hito o gaisuru koto o, kokoro ni hakatte wa naranai. Itsuwari no chikai o kononde wa naranai. Watashi wa korera no koto o nikumukara de aruto, Shu wa iwareru".
Bangun no Shu no kotoba ga watashi ni nozonda,
"Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, yon gatsu no danjiki to, go gatsu no danjiki to, nana gatsu no danjiki to, juu gatsu no danjiki to wa, Yuda no ie no yorokobitanoshimi no toki to nari, yoki iwai no toki to naru. Yue ni anata gata wa, shinjitsu to heiwa to o aiseyo.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, moromoro no tami oyobi ooku no machi no juumin, sunawachi, hitotsu no machi no juumin wa, ta no machi no hitobito no tokoro ni iki,
'Wareware wa, tadachini itte, Shu no megumi o koi, bangun no Shu ni yobimotomeyou' to iuto, 'Watashi mo ikou' to iu.
Ooku no tami oyobi tsuyoi kokumin wa Erusaremu ni kite, bangun no Shu o motome, Shu no megumi o kou.
Bangun no Shu wa, kou ooserareru, sono hi ni wa, moromoro no kuni kotoba no tami no naka kara juunin no mono ga, hitori no Yudayahito no koromo no suso o tsukamaete, 'Anata gata to issho ni ikou. Kami ga anata gata to tomo ni imasu koto o kiitakara' to iu".
Takusen Shu no kotoba wa Haderaku no chi ni nozomi, Damasuko no ue ni todomaru. Aramu no machimachi wa Isuraeru no subete no buzoku no you ni Shu ni zokusurukara de aru.
Kore ni sakaisuru Hamate mo mata sono toori da. Hijou ni kashikoiga, Tsuro to Shidon mo mata douyou de aru.
Tsuro wa jibun no tame ni, toride o kizuki, gin o chiri no you ni tsumi, kin o michibata no doro no you ni tsunda.
Shikashi miyo, Shu wa kore o semetori, sono tomi o umi no naka ni nageirerareru. Kore wa hi de yakihorobosareru.
Ashikeron wa kore o mite osore, Gaza mo mata mite modaekurushimi, Ekuron mo mata sono nozomu tokoro no mono ga hazukashimerarete kurushimu. Gaza ni wa ou ga tae, Ashikeron ni wa sumu mono ga nakunari,
Ashidodo ni wa konketsu no tami ga sumu. Watashi wa Perishite bito no hokori o tatsu.
Mata sono kuchi kara chi o torinozoki, sono ha no aida kara nikumubeki mono o torinozoku. Kore mo mata nokotte wareware no kami ni kishi, Yuda no ichi minzoku no you ni naru. Mata Ekuron wa Ebusu bito no you ni naru.
Sono toki watashi wa, wagaie no tame ni ei o hatte, mihari o shi, ikiki suru mono no nai you ni suru. Shi etageru mono wa, kasanete tooru koto ga nai. Watashi ga ima, jibun no me de mite irukara de aru.
Shion no musume yo, ooini yorokobe, Erusaremu no musume yo, yobaware. Miyo, anata no ou wa anata no tokoro ni kuru. Kare wa gi naru mono de atte shouri o e, nyuuwa de atte, roba ni noru. Sunawachi, roba no ko de aru kouma ni noru.
Watashi wa Efuraimu kara sensha o tachi, Erusaremu kara gunba o tatsu. Mata, ikusa yumi mo tatareru. Kare wa kuniguni no tami ni heiwa o tsuge, sono seiji wa umi kara umi ni oyobi, ookawa kara chi no hate ni made oyobu.
Anata ni tsuite wa mata, anata to no keiyaku no chi no yue ni, watashi wa kano mizu no nai ana kara, anata no torawarebito o tokihanasu.
Nozomi o idaku torawarebito yo, anata no shiro ni kaere. Watashi wa kyou mo nao tsugete iu, kanarazu baishite, anata o moto ni kaesu koto o.
Watashi wa Yuda o hatte, waga yumi to nashi, Efuraimu o sono ya to shita. Shion yo, watashi wa anata no kora o yobiokoshite, Girishiya no hitobito o semesase, anata o yuushi no tsurugi no you ni saseru.
Sono toki, Shu wa karera no ue ni arawarete, sono ya o inazuma no you ni irareru. Shu naru kami wa rappa o fukinarashi, minami no tsumujikaze ni notte dete korareru.
Bangun no Shu wa karera o mamorareru no de, karera wa ishinagedomo o kui tsukushi, fumitsukeru. Karera wa mata budoushu no you ni karera no chi o nomi, hachi no you ni sore de mitasare, saidan no sumi no you ni hitasareru.
Sono hi, karera no kami, Shu wa, karera o sukui, sono tami o hitsuji no you ni yashinawareru. Karera wa kanmuri no tama no you ni, sono chi ni kagayaku.
Sono saiwai, sono uruwashisa wa, ika bakari de arou. Kokumotsu wa wakamono o sakaesase, atarashii budoushu wa, otome o sakaesaseru.
Anata gata wa haru no ame no toki ni, ame o Shu ni koimotomeyo. Shu wa inazuma o tsukuri, ooame o hitobito ni tamai, no no aokusa o onoono ni tamawaru.
Terapimu wa, tawagoto o ii, uranaishi wa itsuwari o mi, yumemi ru mono wa itsuwari no yume o katari, munashii nagusame o ataeru. Kono yue ni, tami wa hitsuji no you ni samayoi, bokusha ga nai tame ni nayamu.
"Waga ikari wa bokusha ni mukatte moe, watashi wa o yagi o bassuru. Bangun no Shu ga, sono mure no hitsuji de aru Yuda no ie o kaerimi, kore o migoto na gunba no you ni sarerukara de aru.
Sumiishi wa karera kara de, tenmaku no kui mo karera kara de, ikusa yumi mo karera kara de, shihaisha mo mina karera no naka kara deru.
Karera ga tatakau toki wa yuushi no you ni natte, michibata no doro no naka ni teki o fuminijiru. Shu ga karera to tomo ni orareru yue ni karera wa tatakai, uma ni noru monodomo o komaraseru.
Watashi wa Yuda no ie o tsuyoku shi, Yosefu no ie o sukuu. Watashi wa karera o awarende, karera o tsurekaeru. Karera wa watashi ni suterareta koto no nai you ni naru. Watashi wa karera no kami, Shu de atte, karera ni kotaerukara de aru.
Efuraimu bito wa yuushi no you ni nari, sono kokoro wa sake o nonda you ni yorokobu. Sono kotomora wa kore o mite yorokobi, sono kokoro wa Shu ni yotte tanoshimu.
Watashi wa karera ni mukai, kuchibue o fuite karera o atsumeru, watashi ga karera o aganattakara de aru. Karera wa mukashi no you ni kazuooku naru.
Watashi wa karera o kuniguni no tami no naka ni chirashita. Shikashi karera wa tooi kuniguni de watashi o oboe, sono kodomora to tomo ni ikinagaraete kaette kuru.
Watashi wa karera o Ejiputo no kuni kara tsurekaeri, ASsuriya kara karera o atsumeru. Watashi wa Gireade no chi oyobi Rebanon ni karera o tsurete iku. Karera wa iru tokoro mo nai hodo ni ooku naru.
Karera wa Ejiputo no umi o tooru. Umi no nami wa utare, Nairu no fuchi wa kotogotoku kareta. ASsuriya no takaburi wa hikuku sare, Ejiputo no tsue wa utsurisaru.
Watashi wa karera o Shu ni yotte tsuyoku suru. Karera wa Shu no na o hokoru" to Shu wa iwareru.
Rebanon yo, omae no mon o hiraki, omae no kouhaku o hi ni yakihorobosase yo.
Ito sugiyo, nakisakebe. Kouhaku wa taore, migoto na ki wa, sokonawaretakara de aru. Bashan no kashi yo, nakisakebe. Shigetta hayashi wa taoretakara de aru.
Kike, bokusha no nakisakebu koe o. Karera no sakae ga kiesattakara de aru. Kike, shishi no hoeru koe o. Yorudan no kusamura ga are hatetakara de aru.
Waga kami, Shu wa kou ooserareta, "Hofurarubeki hitsuji no mure no bokusha to nare.
Kore o kau mono wa, kore o hofutte mo basserarenai. Kore o uru mono wa iu, 'Shu wa ho mubeki ka na, watashi wa tonda' to. Soshite sono bokusha wa, kore o awaremanai.
Watashi wa, mohaya kono chi no juumin o awaremanaito, Shu wa iwareru. Miyo, watashi wa hito o onoono sono bokusha no te ni watashi, onoono sono ou no te ni watasu. Karera wa chi o arasu. Watashi wa karera no te kara kore o sukuidasanai".
Watashi wa hitsuji no shounin no tame ni, hofurarubeki hitsuji no mure no bokusha to natta. Watashi wa nihon no tsue o tori, sono ichipon o megumi to nazuke, ichipon o musubi to nazukete, sono hitsuji o boku shita.
Watashi wa ichi kagetsu ni bokusha sannin o horoboshita. Watashi wa karera ni, gaman shi kirenaku nattaga, karera mo mata, watashi o imikiratta.
Sore de watashi wa itta, "Watashi wa anata gata no bokusha to naranai. Shinu mono wa shini, horobiru mono wa horobi, nokotta mono wa tagai ni sono niku o kuiau ga yoi".
Watashi wa megumi to iu tsue o totte, kore o otta. Kore wa watashi ga moromoro no tami to musunda keiyaku o, haisuru tame de atta.
Soshite kore wa, sono hi ni haisareta. Soko de, watashi ni me o sosoide ita hitsuji no shouninra wa, kore ga Shu no kotoba de atta koto o shitta.
Watashi wa karera ni mukatte, "Anata gata ga moshi, yoi to omounaraba, watashi ni chingin o harai nasai. Moshi, ikenakereba yame nasai" to itta no de, karera wa watashi no chingin to shite, gin sanjuu shikeru o hakatta.
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Karera ni yotte, watashi ga ne tsurareta sono tattoi atai o, miya no saisen hako ni nageireyo". Watashi wa gin sanjuu shikeru o totte, kore o Shu no miya no saisen hako ni nageireta.
Soshite watashi wa musubi to iu daini no tsue o otta. Kore wa Yuda to Isuraeru no aida no, kyoudai kankei o haisuru tame de atta.
Shu wa watashi ni iwareta, "Omae wa mata oroka na bokusha no utsuwa o tore.
Miyo, watashi wa chi ni hitori no bokusha o okosu. Kare wa horobosareru mono o kaerimizu, mayoeru mono o tazunezu, kizutsuita mono o iyasazu, sukoyaka na mono o yashinawazu, koeta mono no niku o kurai, sono hizume o sae saku mono de aru.
Sono hitsuji no mure o suteru oroka na bokusha wa wazawai da. Dou ka, tsurugi ga sono ude o uchi, sono migi no me o utsu you ni. Sono ude wa mattaku otoroe, sono migi no me wa mattaku mienaku naru you ni".
Takusen Isuraeru ni tsuite no Shu no kotoba. Sunawachi ten o nobe, chi no motoi o sue, hito no rei o sono naka ni tsukurareta Shu wa, kou ooserareru,
"Miyo, watashi wa Erusaremu o, sono shuui ni aru subete no tami o yoromekasu sakazuki ni shiyou to shite iru. Kore wa Erusaremu no semekakomareru toki, Yuda ni mo oyobu.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa Erusaremu o subete no tami ni taishite omoi ishi to suru. Kore o mochiageru mono wa mina daikizu o ukeru. Chi no kuniguni no tami wa mina atsumatte, kore o semeru.
Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, watashi wa subete no uma o utte odorokase, sono norite o utte kuruwaseru. Shikashi, moromoro no tami no uma o, kotogotoku utte, mekura to suru toki, Yuda no ie ni taishite wa, watashi no me o hiraku.
Sono toki Yuda no shozoku wa, sono kokoro no naka ni 'Erusaremu no juumin wa, sono kami, bangun no Shu ni yotte chikarazuyoku natta' to iu.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa Yuda no shozoku o, takigi no naka no hizara no you ni shi, mugi taba no naka no taimatsu no you ni suru. Karera wa migi ni hidari ni, sono shuui ni aru subete no tami o, yakihorobosu. Shikashi Erusaremu wa nao, sono moto no tokoro, sunawachi Erusaremu de, hito no sumu tokoro to naru.
Shu wa mazu Yuda no makuya o sukuwareru. Kore wa Dabide no ie no kouei to, Erusaremu no juumin no kouei to ga, Yuda no kouei ni masaru koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru.
Sono hi, Shu wa Erusaremu no juumin o mamorareru. Karera no naka no yowai mono mo, sono hi ni wa, Dabide no you ni naru. Mata Dabide no ie wa kami no you ni, karera ni sakidatsu Shu no tsukai no you ni naru.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa Erusaremu ni semete kuru kokumin o, kotogotoku horobosou to tsutomeru.
Watashi wa Dabide no ie oyobi Erusaremu no juumin ni, megumi to inori no rei to o sosogu. Karera wa sono sashita mono o miru toki, hitoriko no tame ni nageku you ni kare no tame ni nageki, ui go no tame ni kanashimu you ni, kare no tame ni itaku kanashimu.
Sono hi ni wa, Erusaremu no nageki wa, Megido no heiya ni atta hadade rinmon no tame no nageki no you ni ookii.
Kunijuu, shizoku onoono wakarete nageku. Sunawachi Dabide no ie no shizoku wa wakarete nageki, sono tsumatachi mo wakarete nageku. Natan no ie no shizoku wa wakarete nageki, sono tsumatachi mo wakarete nageku.
Rebi no ie no shizoku wa wakarete nageki, sono tsumatachi mo wakarete nageku. Shimei no shizoku wa wakarete nageki, sono tsumatachi mo wakarete nageku.
Sono ta no shizoku mo mina wakarete nageki, sono tsumatachi mo wakarete nageku no de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, tsumi to kegare to o kiyomeru hitotsu no izumi ga, Dabide no ie to Erusaremu no juumin to no tame ni hirakareru.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, sono hi ni wa, watashi wa chi kara guuzou no na o torinozoki, kasanete hito ni oboerareru koto no nai you ni suru. Watashi wa mata yogensha oyobi kegare no rei o, chi kara saraseru.
Moshi, hito ga kongo yogen surunaraba, sono umi no fubo wa kore ni mukatte, 'Anata wa Shu no na o motte itsuwari o kataru yue, ikite iru koto ga dekinai' to ii, sono umi no fubo wa kare ga yogen shite iru toki, kare o sasude arou.
Sono hi ni wa, yogensha tachi wa mina yogen suru toki, sono maboroshi o hajiru. Mata hito o azamuku tame no ke no uwagi o kinai.
Soshite 'Watashi wa yogensha de wa nai, watashi wa tochi o tagayasu mono da. Wakai toki kara tochi o motte iru' to iu.
Moshi, hito ga kare ni 'Anata no senaka no kizu wa nani ka' to tazunerunaraba, 'Kore wa watashi no tomodachi no ie de uketa kizu da' to, kare wa iude arou".
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, "Tsurugi yo, tachiagatte waga bokusha o semeyo. Watashi no tsugi ni tatsu hito o semeyo. Bokusha o ute, sono hitsuji wa chiru. Watashi wa te o kaeshite, chiisai monodomo o semeru.
Shu wa iwareru, zenchi no hito no sanbun no ni wa tatarete shini, sanbun no ichi wa ikinokoru.
Watashi wa kono sanbun no ichi o hi no naka ni ire, gin o fuki wakeru you ni, kore o fuki wake, kin o seiren suru you ni, kore o seiren suru. Karera wa watashi no na o yobi, watashi wa karera ni kotaeru. Watashi wa 'Karera wa waga tami de aru' to ii, karera wa 'Shu wa waga kami de aru' to iu".
Miyo, Shu no hi ga kuru. Sono toki anata no ubawareta mono wa, anata no naka de wakatareru.
Watashi wa bankoku no tami o atsumete, Erusaremu o seme utaseru. Machi wa torare, ie wa kasumerare, onna wa okasare, machi no nakaba wa toraerarete iku. Shikashi nokori no tami wa machi kara tatareru koto wa nai.
Sono toki, Shu wa dete kite, ikusa no hi ni mizukara tatakawareru toki no you ni, sorera no kunibito to tatakawareru.
Sono hi ni wa kare no ashi ga, higashi no hou Erusaremu no mae ni aru oribuyama no ue ni tatsu. Soshite oribuyama wa, hijou ni hiroi hitotsu no tani ni yotte, higashi kara nishi ni futatsu ni sake, sono yama no nakaba wa kita ni, nakaba wa minami ni utsuri,
Waga yama no tani wa fusagareru. Saketa yama no tani ga, sono katawara ni sesshoku surukara de aru. Soshite, anata gata wa Yuda no ou Ujiya no yo ni, jishin o sakete nigeta you ni nigeru. Kou shite, anata gata no kami, Shu wa korareru, moromoro no seija to tomo ni korareru.
Sono hi ni wa, samusa mo shimo mo nai.
Soko ni wa nagai renzoku shita hi ga aru (Shu wa kore o shirareru). Kore ni wa hiru mo naku, yoru mo nai. Yuugure ni natte mo, hikari ga arukara de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, ikeru mizu ga Erusaremu kara nagaredete, sono nakaba wa higashi no umi ni, sono nakaba wa nishi no umi ni nagare, natsu mo fuyu mo yamu koto ga nai.
Shu wa zenchi no ou to narareru. Sono hi ni wa, Shu hitori, sono na hitotsu nomi to naru.
Zenchi wa Geba kara Erusaremu no minami Rinmon made, heichi no you ni kawaru. Shikashi Erusaremu wa takaku natte, sono moto no tokoro ni todomari, Beniyamin no mon kara, saki ni atta mon no tokoro ni oyobi, sumi no mon ni itari, Hananeru no yagura kara, ou no saka bune ni made oyobu.
Sono naka ni wa hito ga sumi, mohaya noroi wa naku, Erusaremu wa yasuraka ni tatsu.
Erusaremu o kougeki shita moromoro no tami o, Shu wa wazawai o motte utareru. Sunawachi karera wa nao ashi de tatte iru uchi ni, sono niku wa kusare, me wa sono ana no naka de kusare, shita wa sono kuchi no naka de kusareru.
Sono hi ni wa, Shu wa karera o ooini awatesaserareru no de, karera wa onoono sono tonaribito o torae, te o agete sono tonaribito o semeru.
Yuda mo mata, Erusaremu ni tekishite tatakau. Sono shuui no subete no kunibito no zaihou, sunawachi kingin, ifuku nado ga, hanahada ooku atsumerareru.
Mata uma, ra, raku da, roba, oyobi sono jin'ei ni aru subete no kachiku ni mo, kono wazawai no you na wazawai ga nozomu.
Erusaremu ni semete kita moromoro no kunibito no nokotta mono wa, mina nennen nobotte kite, ou naru bangun no Shu o ogami, kariho no matsuri o mamoru you ni naru.
Chi no shozoku no uchi, ou naru bangun no Shu o ogamu tame ni, Erusaremu ni noboranai mono no ue ni wa, ame ga furanai.
Ejiputo no hitobito ga, moshi nobotte konai toki ni wa, Shu ga kariho no matsuri o mamoru tame ni, nobotte konai subete no kunibito o utareru sono wazawai ga, karera no ue ni nozomu.
Kore ga, Ejiputo bito no ukeru batsu, oyobi subete kariho no matsuri o mamoru tame ni nobotte konai kunibito no ukeru batsu de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, uma no suzu no ue ni "Shu ni sei naru mono" to, shirusu no de aru. Mata Shu no miya no nabe wa, saidan no mae no hachi no you ni, sei naru mono to naru.
Erusaremu oyobi Yuda no subete no nabe wa, bangun no Shu ni taishite sei naru mono to nari, subete gisei o sasageru mono wa kite kore o tori, sono naka de gisei no niku o niru koto ga dekiru. Sono hi ni wa, bangun no Shu no miya ni, mohaya shounin wa inai.
Maraki ni yotte Isuraeru ni nozonda Shu no kotoba no takusen.
Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi wa anatagata o aishita" to. Tokoro ga anata gata wa iu, "Anata wa donna fuu ni, wareware o aisareta ka". Shu wa iwareru, "Esau wa Yakobu no ani de wa nai ka. Shikashi watashi wa Yakobu o aishi,
Esau o nikunda. Katsu, watashi wa kare no yamachi o arashi, sono shigyou o arano no yamainu ni ataeta".
Moshi Edomu ga "Wareware wa horobosaretakeredo mo, areta tokoro o futatabi tateru" to iunaraba, bangun no Shu wa "Karera wa tateru ka mo shirenai. Shikashi watashi wa sore o taosu. Hitobito wa, karera o ashiki kuni to tonae, tokoshie ni Shu no ikari o ukeru tami to tonaeru" to iwareru.
Anata gata no me wa kore o mite, "Shu wa Isuraeru no sakai o koete ooinaru kami de aru" to iude arou.
"Ko wa sono chichi o uyamai, shimobe wa sono shujin o uyamau. Sore de watashi ga moshi chichi de arunaraba, anata gata no watashi o uyamau jijitsu ga, doko ni aru ka. Watashi ga moshi shujin de arunaraba, watashi o osoreru jijitsu ga, doko ni aru ka. Watashi no na o anadoru saishitachi yo, to bangun no Shu wa anata gata ni iwareru. Tokoro ga anata gata wa 'Wareware wa donna fuu ni anata no na o anadotta ka' to ii,
Kegareta shokumotsu o watashi no saidan no ue ni sasageru. Mata anata gata wa, Shu no dai wa iyashimubeki mono de aru to kangaete, 'Wareware wa donna fuu ni, sore o kegashita ka' to iu.
Anata gata ga moumoku no kemono o, gisei ni sasageru no wa warui koto de wa nai ka. Mata ashi no naeta mono, yameru mono o sasageru no wa warui koto de wa nai ka. Ima kore o anata no tsukasa ni sasagete mi yo. Kare wa anata o yorokobi, anata o ukeirerude arou ka to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa, kami ga wareware o awaremareru you ni, kami no megumi o motomete mi yo. Kono you na anata gata no te no sasagemono o motte, kare wa anatagata o ukeirerarerude arou ka to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Anata ga tagawa ga saidan no ue ni itazura ni, hi o taku koto no nai you ni to o tojiru mono ga anata gata no uchi ni, hitori attara ii no daga. Watashi wa anatagata o yorokobanai, mata anata gata no te kara sasagemono o ukenaito, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Hi no deru tokoro kara bossuru tokoro made, kuniguni no uchi ni waga na wa agamerarete iru. Mata, doko de mo kou to kiyoi sasagemono ga, waga na no tame ni sasagerareru. Kore wa waga na ga kuniguni no uchi ni agamerarete irukara de aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Tokoro ga anata gata wa, Shu no dai wa kegarete iru, mata kono shokumotsu wa iyashimubeki mono de aru to itte, kore o kegashita.
Anata gata wa mata 'Kore wa nan to wazurawashii koto ka' to itte, watashi o hana de ashirauto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru. Anata gata wa mata ubatta mono, ashi nae no mono, yameru mono o, sasagemono to shite tazusaete kuru. Watashi wa sore o, anata gata no te kara, ukerude arou ka to Shu wa iwareru.
Mure no uchi ni osu no kemono ga ari, sore o sasageru to chikai o tatete iru no ni, kizu no aru mono o, Shu ni sasageru itsuwarimono wa norowareru. Watashi wa ooinaru ou de, waga na wa kuniguni no uchi ni osorerarerubekide aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Saishitachi yo, ima kono meirei ga anata gata ni ataerareru.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, anata gata ga moshi kikishitagawazu, mata kore o kokoro ni tomezu, waga na ni eikou o kisanainaraba, watashi wa anata gata no ue ni, noroi o okuri, mata anata gata no shukufuku o noroi ni kaeru. Anata gata wa, kore o kokoro ni tomenai no de, watashi wa sudeni kore o norotta.
Miyo, watashi wa anata gata no shison o semeru. Mata anata gata no gisei no fun o, anata gata no kao no ue ni makichirashi, anatagata o watashi no mae kara shirizokeru.
Kou shite watashi ga, kono meirei o anata gata ni ataeta no wa, Rebi to musunda waga keiyaku ga, tamotareru tame de aru koto o, anata gata ga shiru tame de aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Kare to musunda waga keiyaku wa, seimei to heian to no keiyaku de atte, watashi ga kore o kare ni ataeta no wa, kare ni watashi o osoresaseru tame de aru. Kare wa sudeni watashi o osore, waga na no mae ni ononoita.
Kare no kuchi ni wa, makoto no rippou ga ari, sono kuchibiru ni wa, fugi ga mirarenakatta. Kare wa heian to kougi to o motte, watashi to tomo ni ayumi, mata ooku no hito o fugi kara tachikaeraseta.
Saishi no kuchibiru wa chishiki o tamochi, hitobito ga kare no kuchi kara rippou o tazuneru no ga touzen de aru. Kare wa bangun no Shu no shisha dakara da.
Tokoro ga, anata gata wa michi o hanare, ooku no hito o oshiete tsumazukase, Rebi no keiyaku o yabutta to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa watashi no michi o mamorazu, rippou o oshieru ni atatte, hito ni katayottaga tame ni, anatagata o subete no tami no mae ni anadorare, iyashimerareru you ni suru".
Wareware no chichi wa mina hitotsu de wa nai ka. Wareware o tsukutta kami wa hitotsu de wa nai ka. Naniyue, wareware wa senzotachi no keiyaku o yabutte, onoono sono kyoudai ni itsuwari o okonau no ka.
Yuda wa itsuwari o okonai, Isuraeru oyobi Erusaremu no naka ni wa nikumubeki koto ga okonawareta. Sunawachi Yuda wa Shu ga aishite orareru seijo o kegashite, ta no kami ni tsukaeru onna o metotta.
Dou ka, Shu ga kou shita koto o okonau hito woba, shougen suru mono mo, touben suru mono mo, mata bangun no Shu ni sasagemono o suru mono o mo, Yakobu no makuya kara tatareru you ni.
Anata gata wa mata kono you na koto o suru. Sunawachi kami ga mohaya sasagemono o kaerimizu, mata kore o anata gata no te kara, yorokonde ukerarenai tame ni, anata gata wa namida to, naku koto to, nageki to o motte, Shu no saidan o ooi,
"Naze kami wa ukerarenai no ka" to tazuneru. Kore wa Shu ga anata to, anata no wakai toki no tsuma to no aida no, keiyaku no shounin dattakara de aru. Kanojo wa, anata no tsureai, keiyaku ni yoru anata no tsuma de aru no ni, anata wa kanojo o uragitta.
Hitotsu kami wa, wareware no tame ni inochi no rei o tsukuri, kore o sasaeraretade wa nai ka. Kare wa nani o nozomareru ka. Kami o uyamau shison de aru yue, anata gata wa mizukara tsutsushinde, sono wakai toki no tsuma o uragitte wa naranai.
Isuraeru no kami, Shu wa iwareru, "Watashi wa rien suru mono o nikumi, mata, shi etage o motte sono koromo o oou hito o nikumuto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru. Yue ni mizukara tsutsushinde, uragiru koto o shite wa naranai".
Anata gata wa kotoba o motte Shu o wazurawashita. Shikashi anata gata wa iu, "Wareware wa donna fuu ni, kare o wazurawashita ka". Sore wa anata gata ga "Subete aku o okonau mono wa Shu no me ni yoku mie, katsu kare ni yorokobareru" to ii, mata "Sabaki o okonau kami wa doko ni aru ka" to iukara de aru.
"Miyo, watashi wa waga shisha o tsukawasu. Kare wa watashi no mae ni michi o sonaeru. Mata anata gata ga motomeru tokoro no Shu wa, tachimachi sono miya ni kuru. Miyo, anata gata no yorokobu keiyaku no shisha ga kuruto, bangun no Shu ga iwareru.
Sono kuru hi ni wa, dare ga tae eyou. Sono arawareru toki ni wa, dare ga tachi eyou. Kare wa kin o fukiwakeru mono no hi no you de ari, nuno sarashi no aku no you de aru.
Kare wa gin o fukiwakete kiyomeru mono no you ni zashite, Rebi no shison o kiyome, kingin no you ni karera o kiyomeru. Soshite karera wa gi o motte, sasagemono o Shu ni sasageru.
Sono toki Yuda to Erusaremu to no sasagemono wa, mukashi no hi no you ni, mata saki no toshi no you ni Shu ni yorokobareru.
Soshite watashi wa anata gata ni chikazuite, sabaki o nashi, uranaimono, kan'in o okonau mono, itsuwari no chikai o nasu mono ni mukai, yatoinin no chingin o kasume, yamome to, minashigoto o shi etage, kiryuu no takokujin o oshinoke, watashi o osorenai monodomo ni mukatte, sumiyaka ni akashi o tateruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Shu naru watashi wa kawaru koto ga nai. Sore yue, Yakobu no kora yo, anata gata wa horobosarenai.
Anata gata wa, sono senzo no hi kara, waga sadame o hanarete, kore o mamoranakatta. Watashi ni kaere, watashi wa anata gata ni kaerouto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru. Tokoro ga, anata gata wa 'Wareware wa dou shite kaerou ka' to tazuneru.
Hito wa kami no mono o nusumu koto o surudarou ka. Shikashi anata gata wa, watashi no mono o nusunde iru. Anata gata wa mata 'Dou shite wareware wa, anata no mono o nusunde iru no ka' to iu. Juubun no ichi to, sasagemono o motte de aru.
Anata gata wa, noroi o motte, norowareru. Anata gata subete no kokumin wa, watashi no mono o nusunde irukara de aru.
Watashi no miya ni shokumotsu no aru you ni, juubun no ichi zenbu o watashi no kura ni tazusaete ki nasai. Kore o motte watashi o kokoromi, watashi ga ten no mado o hiraite, afururu megumi o, anata gata ni sosogu ka ina ka o mi nasai to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Watashi wa kuihorobosu mono o, anata gata no tame ni osaete, anata gata no chi no sanbutsu o, horobosanai you ni shiyou. Mata, anata gata no budou no ki ga, sono jukusuru mae ni, sono mi o hatake ni otosu koto no nai you ni shiyou to, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Kou shite bankoku no hito wa, anatagata o shukufuku sareta mono to tonaerude arou. Anata gata wa tanoshii chi to narukara de aruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Shu wa iwareru, anata gata wa kotoba o hageshiku shite, watashi ni sakaratta. Shikamo anata gata wa 'Wareware wa anata ni sakaratte, donna koto o itta ka' to iu.
Anata gata wa itta, 'Kami ni tsukaeru koto wa tsumaranai. Wareware ga sono meirei o mamori, katsu bangun no Shu no mae ni, kanashinde aruitakara to itte, nan no eki ga aru ka.
Ima wareware wa takaburu mono o, shukufuku sareta mono to omou. Aku o okonau mono wa sakaeru bakari de naku, kami o kokoromite mo basserarenai' ".
Sono toki, Shu o osoreru mono wa tagai ni katatta. Shu wa mimi o katamukete kore o kikareta. Soshite Shu o osoreru mono, oyobi sono na o kokoro ni tomete iru mono no tame ni, Shu no mae ni hitotsu no oboegaki ga shirusareta.
"Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, karera wa watashi ga te o kudashite koto o okonau hi ni, watashi no mono to nari, watashi no takara to naru. Mata hito ga jibun ni tsukaeru ko o awaremu you ni, watashi wa karera o awaremu.
Sono toki anata gata wa, futatabi gijin to akunin, kami ni tsukaeru mono to, tsukaenai mono to no kubetsu o shiru you ni naru.
Bangun no Shu wa iwareru, miyo, ro no you ni moeru hi ga kuru. Sono toki subete takaburu mono to, aku o okonau mono to wa, wara no you ni naru. Sono kuru hi wa, karera o yaki tsukushite, ne mo eda mo nokosanai.
Shikashi waga na o osoreru anata gata ni wa, gi no taiyou ga nobori, sono tsubasa ni wa, iyasu chikara o sonaete iru. Anata gata wa gyuusha kara deru koushi no you ni soto ni dete, tobihaneru.
Mata, anata gata wa akunin o fumitsuke, watashi ga koto o okonau hi ni, karera wa anata gata no ashi no ura no shita ni atte, hai no you ni naruto, bangun no Shu wa iwareru.
Anata gata wa, waga shimobe Moose no rippou, sunawachi watashi ga Horebu de, Isuraeru zentai no tame ni, kare ni meijita sadame to okite to o oboe yo.
Miyo, Shu no ooinaru osorubeki hi ga kuru mae ni, watashi wa yogensha Eriya o anata gata ni tsukawasu.
Kare wa chichi no kokoro o sono kotomotachi ni mukesase, kodomotachi no kokoro o sono chichi ni mukesaseru. Kore wa watashi ga kite, noroi o motte kono kuni o utsu koto no nai you ni suru tame de aru".
Aburahamu no ko de aru Dabide no ko, Iesu Kirisuto no keizu.
Aburahamu wa Isaku no chichi de ari, Isaku wa Yakobu no chichi, Yakobu wa Yuda to sono kyoudaitachi to no chichi,
Yuda wa Tamaru ni yoru Paresu to Zara to no chichi, Paresu wa Esuron no chichi, Esuron wa Aramu no chichi,
Aramu wa Aminadabu no chichi, Aminadabu wa Naason no chichi, Naason wa Sarumon no chichi,
Sarumon wa Rahabu ni yoru Boazu no chichi, Boazu wa Rutsu ni yoru Obede no chichi, Obede wa Essai no chichi,
Essai wa Dabide ou no chichi de atta. Dabide wa Uriya no tsuma ni yoru Soromon no chichi de ari,
Soromon wa Rehabeamu no chichi, Rehabeamu wa Abiya no chichi, Abiya wa Asa no chichi,
Asa wa Yosapate no chichi, Yosapate wa Yoramu no chichi, Yoramu wa Ujiya no chichi,
Ujiya wa Yotamu no chichi, Yotamu wa Ahazu no chichi, Ahazu wa Hizekiya no chichi,
Hizekiya wa Manase no chichi, Manase wa Amon no chichi, Amon wa Yoshiya no chichi,
Yoshiya wa Babiron e utsusareta koro, Ekoniya to sono kyoudaitachi to no chichi to natta.
Babiron e utsusareta nochi, Ekoniya wa Sarateru no chichi to natta. Sarateru wa Zorobaberu no chichi,
Zorobaberu wa Abiude no chichi, Abiude wa Eriyakimu no chichi, Eriyakimu wa Azoru no chichi,
Azoru wa Sadoku no chichi, Sadoku wa Akimu no chichi, Akimu wa Eriude no chichi,
Eriude wa Ereazaru no chichi, Ereazaru wa Matan no chichi, Matan wa Yakobu no chichi,
Yakobu wa Mariya no otto Yosefu no chichi de atta. Kono Mariya kara Kirisuto to iwareru Iesu ga oumare ni natta.
Dakara, Aburahamu kara Dabide made no dai wa awasete juu yon dai, Dabide kara Babiron e utsusareru made wa juu yon dai, soshite, Babiron e utsusarete kara Kirisuto made wa juu yon dai de aru.
Iesu Kirisuto no tanjou no shidai wa kou de atta. Haha Mariya wa Yosefu to kon'yaku shite itaga, mada issho ni naranai mae ni, seirei ni yotte miomo ni natta.
Otto Yosefu wa tadashii hito de atta no de, kanojo no koto ga ooyake ni naru koto o konomazu, hisoka ni rien shiyou to kesshin shita.
Kare ga kono koto o omoimegurashite ita toki, Shu no tsukai ga yume ni arawarete itta, "Dabide no ko Yosefu yo, shinpai shinaide Mariya o tsuma to shite mukaeru ga yoi. Sono tainai ni yadotte iru mono wa seirei ni yoru no de aru.
Kanojo wa otokonoko o umude arou. Sono na o Iesu to nazuke nasai. Kare wa, onore no tami o sono moromoro no tsumi kara sukuu mono to narukara de aru".
Subete korera no koto ga okotta no wa, Shu ga yogensha ni yotte iwareta koto no jouju suru tame de aru. Sunawachi,
"Miyo, otome ga migomotte otokonoko o umude arou. Sono na wa Inmanueru to yobarerude arou". Kore wa, "Kami warera to tomo ni imasu" to iu imi de aru.
Yosefu wa nemuri kara sameta nochi ni, Shu no tsukai ga meijita toori ni, Mariya o tsuma ni mukaeta.
Shikashi, ko ga umareru made wa, kanojo o shiru koto wa nakatta. Soshite, sono ko o Iesu to nazuketa.
Iesu ga Herode ou no dai ni, Yudaya no Betsurehemu de oumare ni natta toki, miyo, higashi kara kita hakasetachi ga Erusaremu ni tsuite itta,
"Yudayajin no ou to shite oumare ni natta kata wa, doko ni oraremasu ka. Watashitachi wa higashi no hou de sono hoshi o mita no de, sono kata o ogami ni kimashita".
Herode ou wa kono koto o kiite fuan o kanjita. Erusaremu no hitobito mo mina, douyou de atta.
Soko de ou wa saishichou tachi to tami no rippougakusha tachi to o zenbu atsumete, Kirisuto wa doko ni umareru no ka to, karera ni toitadashita.
Karera wa ou ni itta, "Sore wa Yudaya no Betsurehemu desu. Yogensha ga kou shirushite imasu,
'Yuda no chi, Betsurehemu yo, omae wa Yuda no kimitachi no naka de, kesshite mottomo chiisai mono de wa nai. Omae no naka kara hitori no kimi ga dete, waga tami Isuraeru no bokusha to narude arou' ".
Soko de, Herode wa hisoka ni hakasetachi o yonde, hoshi no arawareta toki ni tsuite kuwashiku kiki,
Karera o Betsurehemu ni tsukawashite itta, "Itte, sono osanago no koto o kuwashiku shirabe, mitsukattara watashi ni shirasete kure. Watashi mo ogami ni ikukara".
Karera wa ou no iu koto o kiite dekakeruto, miyo, karera ga touhou de mita hoshi ga, karera yori saki ni susunde, osanago no iru tokoro made iki, sono ue ni todomatta.
Karera wa sono hoshi o mite, hijou na yorokobi ni afureta.
Soshite, ie ni haitte, haha Mariya no soba ni iru osanago ni ai, hirefushite ogami, mata, takara no hako o akete, ougon nyuukou motsuyaku nado no okurimono o sasageta.
Soshite, yume de Herode no tokoro ni kaeru na to no mitsuge o uketa no de, ta no michi o tootte jibun no kuni e kaette itta.
Karera ga kaette itta nochi, miyo, Shu no tsukai ga yume de Yosefu ni arawarete itta, "Tatte, osanago to sono haha o tsurete, Ejiputo ni nige nasai. Soshite, anata ni shiraseru made, soko ni todomatte i nasai. Herode ga osanago o sagashidashite, korosou to shite iru".
Soko de, Yosefu wa tatte, yoru no aida ni osanago to sono haha to o tsurete Ejiputo e iki,
Herode ga shinu made soko ni todomatte ita. Sore wa, Shu ga yogensha ni yotte "Ejiputo kara waga ko o yobidashita" to iwareta koto ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Sate, Herode wa hakasetachi ni damasareta to shitte, hijou ni rippuku shita. Soshite hitobito o tsukawashi, hakasetachi kara tashikameta toki ni motozuite, Betsurehemu to sono fukin no chihou to ni iru nisai ika no otokonoko o, kotogotoku koroshita.
Kou shite, yogensha Eremiya ni yotte iwareta koto ga, jouju shita no de aru.
"Sakebi naku ooinaru kanashimi no koe ga Rama de kikoeta. Rakeru wa sono kora no tame ni nageita. Kora ga mohaya inai no de, nagusamerareru koto sae negawanakatta".
Sate, Herode ga shinda nochi, miyo, Shu no tsukai ga Ejiputo ni iru Yosefu ni yume de arawarete itta,
"Tatte, osanago to sono haha o tsurete, Isuraeru no chi ni ike. Osanago no inochi o neratte ita hitobito wa, shinde shimatta".
Soko de Yosefu wa tatte, osanago to sono haha to o tsurete, Isuraeru no chi ni kaetta.
Shikashi, Akerao ga sono chichi Herode ni kawatte Yudaya o osamete iru to kiita no de, soko e iku koto o osoreta. Soshite yume de mitsuge o uketa no de, Gariraya no chihou ni shirizoki,
Nazare to iu machi ni itte sunda. Kore wa yogensha tachi ni yotte, "Kare wa Nazarebito to yobarerude arou" to iwareta koto ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Sono koro, baputesuma no Yohane ga araware, Yudaya no arano de oshie o nobete itta,
"Kuiaratameyo, tengoku wa chikazuita".
Yogensha Izaya ni yotte, "Arano de yobawaru mono no koe ga suru, 'Shu no michi o sonaeyo, sono michisuji o massugu ni seyo' " to iwareta no wa, kono hito no koto de aru.
Kono Yohane wa, rakuda no kegoromo o kimono ni shi, koshi ni kawa no obi o shime, inago to no mitsu to o shokumotsu to shite ita.
Suruto, Erusaremu to Yudaya zendo to Yorudan fukin ittai no hitobito ga, zokuzoku to Yohane no tokoro ni dete kite,
Jibun no tsumi o kokuhaku shi, Yorudan gawa de Yohane kara baputesuma o uketa.
Yohane wa, Parisaibito ya Sadokaibito ga oozei baputesuma o ukeyou to shite kita no o mite, karera ni itta, "Mamushi no kora yo, sematte kite iru kami no ikari kara, omaetachi wa nogarerareruto, dare ga oshieta no ka.
Dakara, kuiaratame ni fusawashii mi o musube.
Jibuntachi no chichi ni wa Aburahamu ga aru nado to, kokoro no naka de omotte mo miru na. Omaetachi ni itte oku, kami wa korera no ishikoro kara de mo, Aburahamu no ko o okosu koto ga dekiru no da.
Ono ga sudeni ki no nemoto ni okarete iru. Dakara, yoi mi o musubanai ki wa kotogotoku kirarete, hi no naka ni nagekomareru no da.
Watashi wa kuiaratame no tame ni, mizu de omaetachi ni baputesuma o sazukete iru. Shikashi, watashi no ato kara kuru hito wa watashi yori mo chikara no aru kata de, watashi wa sono kutsu o nugasete ageru neuchi mo nai. Kono kata wa, seirei to hi to ni yotte omaetachi ni baputesuma o osazuke ni narude arou.
Mata, mi o te ni motte, uchi ba no mugi o furuiwake, mugi wa kura ni osame, kara wa kienai hi de yakisuterude arou".
Sono toki Iesu wa, Gariraya o dete Yorudan gawa ni araware, Yohane no tokoro ni kite, baputesuma o ukeyou to sareta.
Tokoro ga Yohane wa, sore o omoitodomaraseyou to shite itta, "Watashi koso anata kara baputesuma o ukeru hazu desu no ni, anata ga watashi no tokoro ni oide ni naru no desu ka".
Shikashi, Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Ima wa ukesasete moraitai. Kono you ni, subete no tadashii koto o jouju suru no wa, wareware ni fusawashii koto de aru". Soko de Yohane wa Iesu no iwareru toori ni shita.
Iesu wa baputesuma o ukeruto sugu, mizu kara agarareta. Suruto, miyo, ten ga hirake, kami no mitama ga hato no you ni jibun no ue ni kudatte kuru no o, goran ni natta.
Mata ten kara koe ga atte itta, "Kore wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no kokoro ni kanau mono de aru".
Sate, Iesu wa mitama ni yotte arano ni michibikareta. Akuma ni kokoromirareru tame de aru.
Soshite, yonjuu nichi yonjuuya, danjiki o shi, sono nochi kuufuku ni narareta.
Suru to kokoromiru mono ga kite itta, "Moshi anata ga kami no ko de arunara, korera no ishi ga pan ni naru you ni meijite goran nasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, " 'Hito wa pan dake de ikiru mono de wa naku, kami no kuchi kara deru hitotsu hitotsu no kotoba de ikiru mono de aru' to kaite aru".
Sore kara akuma wa, Iesu o sei naru miyako ni tsurete iki, miya no choujou ni tatasete
Itta, "Moshi anata ga kami no ko de arunara, shita e tobiorite goran nasai. 'Kami wa anata no tame ni mitsukai tachi ni omeiji ni naruto, anata no ashi ga ishi ni uchitsukerarenai you ni, karera wa anata o te de sasaerude arou' to kaite arimasukara".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, " 'Shu naru anata no kami o kokoromite wa naranai' to mata kaite aru".
Tsugi ni akuma wa, Iesu o hijou ni takai yama ni tsurete iki, konoyo no subete no kuniguni to sono eiga to o misete
Itta, "Moshi anata ga, hirefushite watashi o ogamunara, korera no mono o mina anata ni agemashou".
Suru to Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Satan yo, shirizoke. 'Shu naru anata no kami o haishi, tada kami ni nomi tsukae yo' to kaite aru".
Soko de, akuma wa Iesu o hanaresari, soshite, mitsukai tachi ga mimoto ni kite tsukaeta.
Sate, Iesu wa Yohane ga toraerareta to kiite, Gariraya e shirizokareta.
Soshite Nazare o sari, Zeburun to Nafutari to no chihou ni aru umibe no machi Kapenaumu ni itte sumawareta.
Kore wa yogensha Izaya ni yotte iwareta kotoba ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
"Zeburun no chi, Nafutari no chi, umi ni sou chihou, Yorudan no mukou no chi, ihoujin no Gariraya,
Ankoku no naka ni sunde iru tami wa ooinaru hikari o mi, shi no chi, shi no kage ni sunde iru hitobito ni, hikari ga nobotta".
Kono toki kara Iesu wa oshie o nobe hajimete iwareta, "Kuiaratameyo, tengoku wa chikazuita".
Sate, Iesu ga Gariraya no umibe o aruite orareruto, futari no kyoudai, sunawachi, Petero to yobareta Shimon to sono kyoudai Andere to ga, umi ni ami o utte iru no o goran ni natta. Karera wa ryoushi de atta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ni tsuite ki nasai. Anatagata o, ningen o toru ryoushi ni shite ageyou".
Suruto, karera wa sugu ni ami o sutete, Iesu ni shitagatta.
Soko kara susunde ikareruto, hoka no futari no kyoudai, sunawachi, Zebedai no ko Yakobu to sono kyoudai Yohane to ga, chichi Zebedai to issho ni, fune no naka de ami o tsukurotte iru no o goran ni natta. Soko de karera o omaneki ni naruto,
Sugu fune to chichi to o oite, Iesu ni shitagatte itta.
Iesu wa Gariraya no zenchi o meguriaruite, shokaidou de oshie, mikuni no fukuin o nobetsutae, tami no naka no arayuru byouki, arayuru wazurai o oiyashi ni natta.
Soko de, sono hyouban wa Shiriya zenchi ni hiromari, hitobito ga arayuru yamai ni kakatte iru mono, sunawachi, iroiro no byouki to kurushimi to ni nayande iru mono, akurei ni tsukarete iru mono, tenkan, chuubu no mono nado o Iesu no tokoro ni tsurete kita no de, korera no hitobito o oiyashi ni natta.
Kou shite, Gariraya, Dekaporisu, Erusaremu, Yudaya oyobi Yorudan no mukou kara, obitadashii gunshuu ga kite Iesu ni shitagatta.
Iesu wa kono gunshuu o mite, yama ni nobori, za ni tsukareruto, deshitachi ga mimoto ni chikayotte kita.
Soko de, Iesu wa kuchi o hiraki, karera ni oshiete iwareta.
"Kokoro no mazushii hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, tengoku wa karera no mono de aru.
Kanashinde iru hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa nagusamerarerude arou.
Nyuuwa na hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa chi o uketsugude arou.
Gi ni uekawaite iru hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa akitariru you ni narude arou.
Awaremi bukai hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa awaremi o ukerude arou.
Kokoro no kiyoi hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa kami o mirude arou.
Heiwa o tsukuridasu hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, karera wa kami no ko to yobarerude arou.
Gi no tame ni hakugai sarete kita hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru, tengoku wa karera no mono de aru.
Watashi no tame ni hitobito ga anatagata o nonoshiri, mata hakugai shi, anata gata ni taishi itsuwatte samazama no akkou o iu toki ni wa, anata gata wa, saiwai de aru.
Yorokobi, yorokobe, ten ni oite anata gata no ukeru mukui wa ookii. Anata ga tayori mae no yogensha tachi mo, onaji you ni hakugai sareta no de aru.
Anata gata wa, chi no shio de aru. Moshi shio no kikime ga nakunattara, nani ni yotte sono aji ga torimodosareyou ka. Mohaya, nan no yaku ni mo tatazu, tada soto ni suterarete, hitobito ni fumitsukerareru dake de aru.
Anata gata wa, yo no hikari de aru. Yama no ue ni aru machi wa kakureru koto ga dekinai.
Mata, akari o tsukete, sore o masu no shita ni oku mono wa inai. Mushiro shokudai no ue ni oite, ie no naka no subete no mono o tera saseru no de aru.
Sono you ni, anata gata no hikari o hitobito no mae ni kagayakashi, soshite, hitobito ga anata gata no yoi okonai o mite, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi o agameru you ni shi nasai.
Watashi ga rippou ya yogensha o haisuru tame ni kita, to omotte wa naranai. Haisuru tame de wa naku, jouju suru tame ni kita no de aru.
Yoku itte oku. Tenchi ga horobi yuku made wa, rippou no ichi ten, ikkaku mo sutaru koto wa naku, kotogotoku mattou sareru no de aru.
Sore dakara, korera no mottomo chiisai imashime no hitotsu de mo yaburi, mata sou suru you ni hito ni oshie tari suru mono wa, tengoku de mottomo chiisai mono to yobarerude arou. Shikashi, kore o okonai mata sou oshieru mono wa, tengoku de ooinaru mono to yobarerude arou.
Watashi wa itte oku. Anata gata no gi ga rippougakusha ya Parisaibito no gi ni masatte inakereba, kesshite tengoku ni, hairu koto wa dekinai.
Mukashi no hitobito ni 'Korosu na. Korosu mono wa saiban o ukeneba naranai' to iwarete ita koto wa, anata gata no kiite iru tokoro de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Kyoudai ni taishite ikaru mono wa, dare de mo saiban o ukeneba naranai. Kyoudai ni mukatte orokamono to iu mono wa, gikai ni hikiwatasarerude arou. Mata, bakamono to iu mono wa, jigoku no hi ni nagekomarerude arou.
Dakara, saidan ni sonaemono o sasageyou to suru baai, kyoudai ga jibun ni taishite nani ka urami o idaite iru koto o, soko de omoidashitanara,
Sono sonaemono o saidan no mae ni nokoshite oki, mazu itte sono kyoudai to wakai shi, sore kara kaette kite, sonaemono o sasageru koto ni shi nasai.
Anata o uttaeru mono to issho ni michi o iku toki ni wa, sono tochuu de hayaku nakanaori o shi nasai. Sou shinaito, sono uttaeru mono wa anata o saibankan ni watashi, saibankan wa shitayaku ni watashi, soshite, anata wa goku ni irerarerude arou.
Yoku anata ni itte oku. Saigo no ichi kodoranto o shiharatte shimau made wa, kesshite soko kara dete kuru koto wa dekinai.
'Kan'in suru na' to iwarete ita koto wa, anata gata no kiite iru tokoro de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Dare de mo, jouyoku o idaite onna o miru mono wa, kokoro no naka de sudeni kan'in o shita no de aru.
Moshi anata no migi no me ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o nukidashite sute nasai. Gotai no ichibu o ushinatte mo, zenshin ga jigoku ni nageirerarenai hou ga, anata ni totte eki de aru.
Moshi anata no migi no te ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o kitte sute nasai. Gotai no ichibu o ushinatte mo, zenshin ga jigoku ni ochikomanai hou ga, anata ni totte eki de aru.
Mata 'Tsuma o dasu mono wa rienjou o watase' to iwarete iru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Dare de mo, fuhinkou igai no riyuu de jibun no tsuma o dasu mono wa, kan'in o okonawaseru no de aru. Mata dasareta onna o metoru mono mo, kan'in o okonau no de aru.
Mata mukashi no hitobito ni 'Itsuwari chikau na, chikatta koto wa, subete Shu ni taishite hatase' to iwarete ita koto wa, anata gata no kiite iru tokoro de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Issai chikatte wa naranai. Ten o sashite chikau na. Soko wa kami no miza de arukara.
Mata chi o sashite chikau na. Soko wa kami no ashidai de arukara. Mata Erusaremu o sashite chikau na. Sore wa 'Daiou no miyako' de arukara.
Mata, jibun no atama o sashite chikau na. Anata wa kaminoke hitosuji sae, shirokumo kuroku mo suru koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata no kotoba wa, tada, shikari, shikari, ina, ina, de arubekida. Sore ijou ni deru koto wa, aku kara kuru no de aru.
'Me ni wa me o, ha ni wa ha o' to iwarete ita koto wa, anata gata no kiite iru tokoro de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Akunin ni temukau na. Moshi, dare ka ga anata no migi no hoo o utsunara, hoka no hoo o mo mukete yari nasai.
Anata o uttaete, shitagi o torou to suru mono ni wa, uwagi o mo atae nasai.
Moshi, dare ka ga, anata o shiite ichi mairu ikaseyou to surunara, sono hito to tomo ni ni mairu iki nasai.
Motomeru mono ni wa atae, kariyou to suru mono o kotowaru na.
'Tonaribito o aishi, teki o nikume' to iwarete ita koto wa, anata gata no kiite iru tokoro de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Teki o aishi, hakugai suru mono no tame ni inore.
Kou shite, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi no ko to naru tame de aru. Ten no chichi wa, warui mono no ue ni mo yoi mono no ue ni mo, taiyou o noborase, tadashii mono ni mo tadashiku nai mono ni mo, ame o furashite kudasarukara de aru.
Anata gata ga jibun o aisuru mono o aishitakara tote, nan no mukui ga arou ka. Sono you na koto wa shuzeinin de mo surude wa nai ka.
Kyoudai dake ni aisatsu o shitakara tote, nan no sugureta koto o shite irudarou ka. Sono you na koto wa ihoujin de mo shite irude wa nai ka.
Sore dakara, anata gata no ten no chichi ga kanzen de arareru you ni, anata gata mo kanzen na mono to nari nasai.
Jibun no gi o, mirareru tame ni hito no mae de okonawanai you ni, chuui shi nasai. Moshi, sou shinaito, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi kara mukui o ukeru koto ga naide arou.
Dakara, hodokoshi o suru toki ni wa, gizensha tachi ga hito ni homerareru tame kaidou ya machi no naka de suru you ni, jibun no mae de rappa o fukinarasu na. Yoku itte okuga, karera wa sono mukui o ukete shimatte iru.
Anata wa hodokoshi o suru baai, migi no te no shite iru koto o hidari no te ni shiraseru na.
Sore wa, anata no suru hodokoshi ga kakurete iru tame de aru. Suruto, kakureta koto o mite orareru anata no chichi wa, mukuite kudasarude arou.
Mata inoru toki ni wa, gizensha tachi no you ni suru na. Karera wa hito ni miseyou to shite, kaidou ya oodoori no tsu ji ni tatte inoru koto o konomu. Yoku itte okuga, karera wa sono mukui o ukete shimatte iru.
Anata wa inoru toki, jibun no heya ni hairi, to o tojite, kakureta tokoro ni oide ni naru anata no chichi ni inori nasai. Suruto, kakureta koto o mite orareru anata no chichi wa, mukuite kudasarude arou.
Mata, inoru baai, ihoujin no you ni, kudokudo to inoru na. Karera wa kotoba kazu ga ookereba, kikiirerareru mono to omotte iru.
Dakara, karera no mane o suru na. Anata gata no chichi naru kami wa, motomenai saki kara, anata gata ni hitsuyou na mono wa gozonjina no de aru.
Dakara, anata gata wa kou inori nasai, ten ni imasu warera no chichi yo, mina ga agameraremasu you ni.
Mikuni ga kimasu you ni. Mikokoro ga ten ni okonawareru toori, chi ni mo okonawaremasu you ni.
Watashitachi no higoto no shokumotsu o, kyou mo oatae kudasai.
Watashitachi ni fusai no aru mono o yurushimashita you ni, watashitachi no fusai o mo oyurushi kudasai.
Watashitachi o kokoromi ni awasenaide, ashiki mono kara osukui kudasai.
Moshi mo, anata ga taga, hitobito no ayamachi o yurusunaraba, anata gata no ten no chichi mo, anatagata o yurushite kudasarude arou.
Moshi hito o yurusanainaraba, anata gata no chichi mo, anata gata no ayamachi o yurushite kudasaranaide arou.
Mata danjiki o suru toki ni wa, gizensha ga suru you ni, inki na kaotsuki o suru na. Karera wa danjiki o shite iru koto o hito ni miseyou to shite, jibun no kao o migurushiku suru no de aru. Yoku itte okuga, karera wa sono mukui o ukete shimatte iru.
Anata gata wa danjiki o suru toki ni wa, jibun no atama ni abura o nuri, kao o arai nasai.
Sore wa danjiki o shite iru koto ga hito ni shirenaide, kakureta tokoro ni oide ni naru anata no chichi ni shirareru tame de aru. Suruto, kakureta koto o mite orareru anata no chichi wa, mukuite kudasarude arou.
Anata gata wa jibun no tame ni, mushi ga kui, sabi ga tsuki, mata, nusubitora ga oshiitte nusumidasu you na chijou ni, takara o takuwaete wa naranai.
Mushiro jibun no tame, mushi mo kuwazu, sabi mo tsukazu, mata, nusubitora ga oshiitte nusumidasu koto mo nai ten ni, takara o takuwae nasai.
Anata no takara no aru tokoro ni wa, kokoro mo arukara de aru.
Me wa karada no akari de aru. Dakara, anata no me ga sunde oreba, zenshin mo akaruidarou.
Shikashi, anata no me ga warukereba, zenshin mo kuraidarou. Dakara, moshi anata no uchi naru hikari ga kurakereba, sono kurasa wa, donna de arou.
Dare mo, futari no shujin ni kanetsukaeru koto wa dekinai. Ippou o nikunde tahou o aishi, aruiha, ippou ni shitashinde tahou o utonjirukara de aru. Anata gata wa, kami to tomi to ni kanetsukaeru koto wa dekinai.
Sore dakara, anata gata ni itte oku. Nani o tabeyou ka, nani o nomou ka to, jibun no inochi no koto de omoiwazurai, nani o kiyou ka to jibun no karada no koto de omoiwazurau na. Inochi wa shokumotsu ni masari, karada wa kimono ni masaru de wa nai ka.
Sora no tori o miru ga yoi. Maku koto mo, karu koto mo sezu, kura ni toriireru koto mo shinai. Sore da no ni, anata gata no ten no chichi wa karera o yashinatte ite kudasaru. Anata gata wa karera yori mo, haruka ni sugureta mono de wa nai ka.
Anata gata no uchi, dare ga omoiwazurattakara tote, jibun no jumyou o wazuka de mo nobasu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Mata, naze, kimono no koto de omoiwazurau no ka. No no hana ga dou shite sodatte iru ka, kangaete miru ga yoi. Hataraki mo sezu, tsumugi mo shinai.
Shikashi, anata gata ni iuga, eiga o kiwameta toki no Soromon de sae, kono hana no hitotsu hodo ni mo kikazatte wa inakatta.
Kyou wa haete ite, asu wa ro ni nageirerareru no no kusa de sae, kami wa kono you ni yosootte kudasaru no nara, anata gata ni, sore ijou yoku shite kudasaranai hazu ga arou ka. Aa, shinkou no usui monotachi yo.
Dakara, nani o tabeyou ka, nani o nomou ka, aruiha nani o kiyou ka to itte omoiwazurau na.
Korera no mono wa mina, ihoujin ga setsuni motomete iru mono de aru. Anata gata no ten no chichi wa, korera no mono ga, kotogotoku anata gata ni hitsuyou de aru koto o gozonjide aru.
Mazu kami no kuni to kami no gi to o motome nasai. Sou sureba, korera no mono wa, subete soete ataerarerude arou.
Dakara, asu no koto o omoiwazurau na. Asu no koto wa, asu jishin ga omoiwazuraude arou. Tsuitachi no kurou wa, sono hi tsuitachi dake de juubun de aru.
Hito o sabaku na. Jibun ga sabakarenai tame de aru.
Anata gata ga sabaku sono sabaki de, jibun mo sabakare, anata gata no hakaru sono hakaride, jibun ni mo hakari ataerarerude arou.
Naze, kyoudai no me ni aru chiri o minagara, jibun no me ni aru hari o mitomenai no ka.
Jibun no me ni wa hari ga aru no ni, dou shite kyoudai ni mukatte, anata no me kara chiri o torasete kudasai, to ieyou ka.
Gizensha yo, mazu jibun no me kara hari o torinokeru ga yoi. Sou sureba, hakkiri mieru you ni natte, kyoudai no me kara chiri o torinokeru koto ga dekirudarou.
Sei naru mono o inu ni yaru na. Mata shinju o buta ni nagete yaru na. Osoraku karera wa sorera o ashi de fumitsuke, mukinaotte anata gata ni kamitsuite kurude arou.
Motomeyo, sou sureba, ataerarerude arou. Sagase, sou sureba, miidasude arou. Mon o tatake, sou sureba, akete moraerude arou.
Subete motomeru mono wa e, sagasu mono wa miidashi, mon o tataku mono wa akete moraerukara de aru.
Anata gata no uchi de, jibun no ko ga pan o motomeru no ni, ishi o ataeru mono ga arou ka.
Uo o motomeru no ni, hebi o ataeru mono ga arou ka.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa warui mono de atte mo, jibun no kodomo ni wa, yoi okurimono o suru koto o shitte iru to sureba, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi wa naosara, motomete kuru mono ni yoi mono o kudasaranai koto ga arou ka.
Dakara, nanigoto de mo hitobito kara shite hoshii to nozomu koto wa, hitobito ni mo sono toori ni seyo. Kore ga rippou de ari yogensha de aru.
Semai mon kara wa ire. Horobi ni itaru mon wa ookiku, sono michi wa hiroi. Soshite, soko kara hai tte iku mono ga ooi.
Inochi ni itaru mon wa semaku, sono michi wa hosoi. Soshite, sore o miidasu mono ga sukunai.
Nise yogensha o keikai seyo. Karera wa, hitsuji no koromo o kite anata gata no tokoro ni kuruga, sono uchigawa wa gouyoku na ookami de aru.
Anata gata wa, sono mi ni yotte karera o miwakerude arou. Ibara kara budou o, azami kara ichijiku o atsumeru mono ga arou ka.
Sono you ni, subete yoi ki wa yoi mi o musubi, warui ki wa warui mi o musubu.
Yoi ki ga warui mi o naraseru koto wa naishi, warui ki ga yoi mi o naraseru koto wa dekinai.
Yoi mi o musubanai ki wa kotogotoku kirarete, hi no naka ni nagekomareru.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa sono mi ni yotte karera o miwakeru no de aru.
Watashi ni mukatte 'Shu yo, Shu yo' to iu mono ga, mina tengoku ni wa iru no de wa naku, tada, ten ni imasu waga chichi no mimune o okonau mono dake ga, hairu no de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, ooku no mono ga, watashi ni mukatte 'Shu yo, Shu yo, watashitachi wa anata no na ni yotte yogen shitade wa arimasen ka. Mata, anata no na ni yotte akurei o oidashi, anata no na ni yotte ooku no chikara aru waza o okonattade wa arimasen ka' to iude arou.
Sono toki, watashi wa karera ni hakkiri, kou iou, 'Anatagata o mattaku shiranai. Fuhou o hataraku monodomo yo, itte shimae'.
Sore de, watashi no korera no kotoba o kiite okonau mono o, iwa no ue ni jibun no ie o tateta kashikoi hito ni kuraberu koto ga dekiyou.
Ame ga furi, kouzui ga oshiyose, kaze ga fuite sono ie ni uchitsukete mo, taoreru koto wa nai. Iwa o dodai to shite irukara de aru.
Mata, watashi no korera no kotoba o kiite mo okonawanai mono o, suna no ue ni jibun no ie o tateta oroka na hito ni kuraberu koto ga dekiyou.
Ame ga furi, kouzui ga oshiyose, kaze ga fuite sono ie ni uchitsukeruto, taorete shimau. Soshite sono taorekata wa hidoi no de aru".
Iesu ga korera no kotoba o katari oerareruto, gunshuu wa sono oshie ni hidoku odoroita.
Sore wa rippougakusha tachi no you nide wa naku, ken'i aru mono no you ni, oshieraretakara de aru.
Iesu ga yama o oori ni naruto, obitadashii gunshuu ga tsuite kita.
Suruto, sono toki, hitori no raibyounin ga Iesu no tokoro ni kite, hirefushite itta, "Shu yo, mikokoro deshitara, kiyomete itadakeru no desuga".
Iesu wa te o nobashite, kare ni sawari, "Sou shite ageyou, kiyoku nare" to iwareta. Suruto, raibyou wa tadachini kiyomerareta.
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Dare ni mo hanasanai you ni, chuui shi nasai. Tada itte, jibun no karada o saishi ni mise, sore kara, Moose ga meijita sonaemono o sasagete, hitobito ni shoumei shi nasai".
Sate, Iesu ga Kapenaumu ni kaette korareta toki, aru hyakusotsuchou ga mimoto ni kite uttaete itta,
"Shu yo, watashi no shimobe ga chuubu de hidoku kurushinde, ie ni nete imasu".
Iesu wa kare ni, "Watashi ga itte naoshite ageyou" to iwareta.
Soko de hyakusotsuchou wa kotaete itta, "Shu yo, watashi no yane no shita ni anata o oire suru shikaku wa, watashi ni wa gozaimasen. Tada, okotoba o kudasai. Sou sureba shimobe wa naorimasu.
Watashi mo ken'i no shita ni aru mono desuga, watashi no shita ni mo heisotsu ga imashite, hitori no mono ni 'Ike' to ieba iki, hoka no mono ni 'Koi' to ieba kimasushi, mata, shimobe ni 'Kore o seyo' to ieba, shite kureru no desu".
Iesu wa kore o kiite hijou ni kanshin sare, tsuite kita hitobito ni iwareta, "Yoku kiki nasai. Isuraeruhito no naka ni mo, kore hodo no shinkou o mita koto ga nai.
Nao, anata gata ni iuga, ooku no hito ga higashi kara nishi kara kite, tengoku de, Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu to tomo ni enkai no seki ni tsukuga,
Kono kuni no kora wa soto no yami ni oidasare, soko de nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou".
Sore kara Iesu wa hyakusotsuchou ni "Ike, anata no shinjita toori ni naru you ni" to iwareta. Suruto, choudo sono toki ni, shimobe wa iyasareta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa Petero no ie ni haitte ikare, sono shuutome ga netsubyou de, toko ni tsuite iru no o goran ni natta.
Soko de, sono te ni sawarareruto, netsu ga hiita. Soshite onna wa okiagatte Iesu o motenashita.
Yuugure ni naruto, hitobito wa akurei ni tsukareta mono o oozei, mimoto ni tsurete kita no de, Iesu wa mikotoba o motte reidomo o oidashi, byounin o kotogotoku oiyashi ni natta.
Kore wa, yogensha Izaya ni yotte "Kare wa, watashitachi no wazurai o mi ni uke, watashitachi no yamai o outa" to iwareta kotoba ga jouju suru tame de aru.
Iesu wa, gunshuu ga jibun no mawari ni muragatte iru no o mite, mukougishi ni iku you ni to deshitachi ni omeiji ni natta.
Suruto hitori no rippougakusha ga chikazuite kite itta, "Sensei, anata ga oide ni naru tokoro nara, doko e de mo shitagatte mairimasu".
Iesu wa sono hito ni iwareta, "Kitsune ni wa ana ga ari, sora no tori ni wa su ga aru. Shikashi, hito no ko ni wa makura suru tokoro ga nai".
Mata deshi no hitori ga itta, "Shu yo, mazu, chichi o houmuri ni ikasete kudasai".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai. Soshite, sono shinin o houmuru koto wa, shinin ni makasete oku ga yoi".
Sore kara, Iesu ga fune ni norikomareruto, deshitachi mo shitagatta.
Suruto totsuzen, kaijou ni hageshii boufuu ga okotte, fune wa nami ni nomare sou ni natta. Tokoro ga, Iesu wa nemutte orareta.
Soko de deshitachi wa misoba ni yotte kite Iesu o okoshi, "Shu yo, otasuke kudasai, watashitachi wa shini sou desu" to itta.
Suru to Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Naze kowagaru no ka, shinkou no usui monotachi yo". Sore kara okiagatte, kaze to umi to o oshikari ni naruto, oonagi ni natta.
Karera wa odoroite itta, "Konokata wa dou iu hito na no darou. Kaze mo umi mo shitagawaseru to wa".
Sore kara, mukougishi, Gadarabito no chi ni tsukareruto, akurei ni tsukareta futari no mono ga, hakaba kara dete kite Iesu ni deatta. Karera wa te ni oenai ranboumono de, dare mo sono hen no michi o tooru koto ga dekinai hodo de atta.
Suruto totsuzen, karera wa sakende itta, "Kami no ko yo, anata wa watashidomo to nan no kaka wari ga aru no desu. Mada sono toki de wa nai no ni, koko ni kite, watashidomo o kurushimeru no desu ka".
Sate, soko kara haruka hanareta tokoro ni, obitadashii buta no mure ga katte atta.
Akureidomo wa Iesu ni negatte itta, "Moshi watashidomo o oidasareru no nara, ano buta no mure no naka ni tsukawashite kudasai".
Soko de, Iesu ga "Ike" to iwareruto, karera wa dete itte, buta no naka e hairikonda. Suruto, sono mure zentai ga, gake kara umi e nadare o utte kakekudari, mizu no naka de shinde shimatta.
Kau monotachi wa nigete machi ni iki, akurei ni tsukareta monotachi no koto nado, issai o shiraseta.
Suruto, machijuu no mono ga Iesu ni ai ni dete kita. Soshite, Iesu ni auto, kono chihou kara satte kudasaru you ni to tanonda.
Sate, Iesu wa fune ni notte umi o watari, jibun no machi ni kaerareta.
Suruto, hitobito ga chuubu no mono o toko no ue ni nekaseta mama de mimoto ni hakonde kita. Iesu wa karera no shinkou o mite, chuubu no mono ni, "Ko yo, shikkari shi nasai. Anata no tsumi wa yurusareta no da" to iwareta.
Suruto, aru rippougakusha tachi ga kokoro no naka de itta, "Kono hito wa kami o kegashite iru".
Iesu wa karera no kangae o minuite, "Naze, anata gata wa kokoro no naka de warui koto o kangaete iru no ka.
Anata no tsumi wa yurusareta, to iu no to, okite aruke, to iu no to, dochira ga tayasui ka.
Shikashi, hito no ko wa chijou de tsumi o yurusu ken'i o motte iru koto ga, anata gata ni wakaru tame ni" to ii, chuubu no mono ni mukatte, "Okiyo, toko o toriagete ie ni kaere" to iwareta.
Suruto kare wa okiagari, ie ni kaette itta.
Gunshuu wa sore o mite osore, konna ookina ken'i o hito ni oatae ni natta kami o agameta.
Sate Iesu wa soko kara susunde ikare, Matai to iu hito ga shuuzeisho ni suwatte iru no o mite, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai" to iwareta. Suruto kare wa tachiagatte, Iesu ni shitagatta.
Sore kara, Iesu ga ie de shokuji no seki ni tsuite orareta toki no koto de aru. Ooku no shuzeinin ya tsumibitotachi ga kite, Iesu ya deshitachi to tomo ni sono seki ni tsuite ita.
Parisaibitotachi wa kore o mite, deshitachi ni itta, "Naze, anata gata no sensei wa, shuzeinin ya tsumibito nado to shokuji o tomo ni suru no ka".
Iesu wa kore o kiite iwareta, "Joubu na hito ni wa isha wa iranai. Iru no wa byounin de aru.
'Watashi ga konomu no wa, awaremi de atte, ikenie de wa nai' to wa dou iu imi ka, manande ki nasai. Watashi ga kita no wa, gijin o maneku tame de wa naku, tsumibito o maneku tame de aru".
Sono toki, Yohane no deshitachi ga Iesu no tokoro ni kite itta, "Watashitachi to Parisaibitotachi to ga danjiki o shite iru no ni, anata no deshitachi wa, naze danjiki o shinai no desu ka".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Konrei no kyaku wa, hanamuko ga issho ni iru aida wa, kanashinde orareyou ka. Shikashi, hanamuko ga ubaisarareru hi ga kuru. Sono toki ni wa danjiki o surude arou.
Dare mo, maatarashii nunogire de, furui kimono ni tsugi o ate wa shinai. Sono tsugi kire wa kimono o hikiyaburi, soshite, yabure ga motto hidoku narukara.
Dare mo, atarashii budoushu o furui kawabukuro ni ire wa shinai. Moshi sonna koto o shitara, sono kawabukuro wa harisake, sake wa nagarederushi, kawabukuro mo muda ni naru. Dakara, atarashii budoushu wa atarashii kawabukuro ni irerubekide aru. Sou sureba ryouhou to mo nagamochi ga surude arou".
Korera no koto o karera ni hanashite orareruto, soko ni hitori no kaidouzukasa ga kite, Iesu o haishite itta, "Watashi no musume ga tadaima shinimashita. Shikashi oide ni natte te o sono ue ni oite yatte kudasai. Sou shitara, musume wa ikikaerudeshou".
Soko de, Iesu ga tatte kare ni tsuite ikareruto, deshitachi mo issho ni itta.
Suruto sono toki, juu ni nenkan mo naga chi o wazuratte iru onna ga chikayotte kite, Iesu no ushiro kara mikoromo no fusa ni sawatta.
Mikoromo ni sawari sae sureba, nao shite itadakerudarou, to kokoro no naka de omotte itakara de aru.
Iesu wa furimuite, kono onna o mite iwareta, "Musume yo, shikkari shi nasai. Anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta no desu". Suruto kono onna wa sono toki ni, iyasareta.
Sore kara Iesu wa tsukasa no ie ni tsuki, fuefukidomo ya sawaide iru gunshuu o mite iwareta.
"Achira e itte i nasai. Shoujo wa shinda no de wa nai. Nemutte iru dake de aru". Suru to hitobito wa Iesu o azawaratta.
Shikashi, gunshuu o soto e dashita nochi, Iesu wa uchi e haitte, shoujo no te o otori ni naruto, shoujo wa okiagatta.
Soshite, sono uwasa ga kono chihou zentai ni hiromatta.
Soko kara susunde ikareruto, futari no moujin ga, "Dabide no ko yo, watashitachi o awarende kudasai" to sakebinagara, Iesu ni tsuite kita.
Soshite Iesu ga ie ni wa irareruto, moujintachi ga mimoto ni kita no de, karera ni "Watashi ni sore ga dekiru to shinjiru ka" to iwareta. Karera wa itta, "Shu yo, shinjimasu".
Soko de, Iesu wa karera no me ni sawatte iwareta, "Anata gata no shinkou doori, anata gata no mi ni naru you ni".
Suruto karera no me ga hirakareta. Iesu wa karera o kibishiku imashimete iwareta, "Dare ni mo shirenai you ni ki o tsuke nasai".
Shikashi, karera wa dete itte, sono chihou zentai ni Iesu no koto o ii hirometa.
Karera ga dete ikuto, hitobito wa akurei ni tsukareta oshi o Iesu no tokoro ni tsurete kita.
Suruto, akurei wa oidasarete, oshi ga mono o iu you ni natta. Gunshuu wa odoroite, "Kono you na koto ga Isuraeru no naka de mirareta koto wa, kore made ichido mo nakatta" to itta.
Shikashi, Parisaibitotachi wa itta, "Kare wa, akureidomo no kashira ni yotte akureidomo o oidashite iru no da".
Iesu wa, subete no machimachi muramura o meguriaruite, shokaidou de oshie, mikuni no fukuin o nobetsutae, arayuru byouki, arayuru wazurai o oiyashi ni natta.
Mata gunshuu ga kau mono no nai hitsuji no you ni yowari hatete, taorete iru no o goran ni natte, karera o fukaku awaremareta.
Soshite deshitachi ni iwareta, "Shuukaku wa ooiga, hatarakibito ga sukunai.
Dakara, shuukaku no Shu ni negatte, sono shuukaku no tame ni hatarakibito o okuridasu you ni shite morai nasai".
Soko de, Iesu wa juu ni deshi o yobiyosete, kegareta rei o oidashi, arayuru byouki, arayuru wazurai o iyasu ken'i o osazuke ni natta.
Juu ni shito no na wa, tsugi no toori de aru. Mazu Petero to yobareta Shimon to sono kyoudai Andere, sore kara Zebedai no ko Yakobu to sono kyoudai Yohane,
Piripo to Barutoromai, Tomasu to shuzeinin Matai, Arupayo no ko Yakobu to Tadai,
Nesshintou no Shimon to Isukariote no Yuda. Kono Yuda wa Iesu o uragitta mono de aru.
Iesu wa kono juu ninin o tsukawasu ni atari, karera ni meijite iwareta, "Ihoujin no michi ni iku na. Mata Samariyabito no machi ni hairu na.
Mushiro, Isuraeru no ie no ushinawareta hitsuji no tokoro ni ike.
Itte, 'Tengoku ga chikazuita' to nobetsutae yo.
Byounin o iyashi, shinin o yomigaerase, raibyounin o kiyome, akurei o oidase. Tada de uketa no dakara, tada de ataeru ga yoi.
Saifu no naka ni kin, gin mata wa zeni o irete iku na.
Ryokou no tame no fukuro mo, nimai no shitagi mo, kutsu mo, tsue mo motte iku na. Hatarakibito ga sono shokumotsu o eru no wa touzen de aru.
Dono machi, dono mura ni haitte mo, sono naka de dare ga fusawashii hito ka, tazune dashite, tachisaru made wa sono hito no tokoro ni todomatte ore.
Sono ie ni haittanara, heian o inotte age nasai.
Moshi heian o ukeru ni fusawashii ie de areba, anata gata no inoru heian wa sono ie ni kurude arou. Moshi fusawashiku nakereba, sono heian wa anata gata ni kaette kurude arou.
Moshi anatagata o mukae mo sezu, mata anata gata no kotoba o kiki mo shinai hito ga areba, sono ie ya machi o tachisaru toki ni, ashi no chiri o haraiotoshi nasai.
Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Sabaki no hi ni wa, Sodomu, Gomora no chi no hou ga, sono machi yori wa taeyasui de arou.
Watashi ga anatagata o tsukawasu no wa, hitsuji o ookami no naka ni okuru you na mono de aru. Dakara, hebi no you ni kashikoku, hato no you ni sunao de are.
Hitobito ni chuui shi nasai. Karera wa anatagata o shuugisho ni hikiwatashi, kaidou de muchiutsude arou.
Mata anata gata wa, watashi no tame ni choukantachi ya outachi no mae ni hikidasarerude arou. Sore wa, karera to ihoujin to ni taishite akashi o suru tame de aru.
Karera ga anatagata o hikiwatashita toki, nani o dou iou ka to shinpai shinai ga yoi. Iubeki koto wa, sono toki ni sazukerarerukara de aru.
Kataru mono wa, anatagata de wa naku, anata gata no naka ni atte kataru chichi no rei de aru.
Kyoudai wa kyoudai o, chichi wa ko o korosu tame ni watashi, mata ko wa oya ni sakaratte tachi, karera o korosaserude arou.
Mata anata gata wa, watashi no na no yue ni subete no hito ni nikumarerude arou. Shikashi, saigo made taeshinobu mono wa sukuwareru.
Hitotsu no machi de hakugai saretanara, ta no machi e nige nasai. Yoku itte oku. Anata gata ga Isuraeru no machimachi o mawari owaranai uchi ni, hito no ko wa kurude arou.
Deshi wa sono shi ijou no mono de wa naku, shimobe wa sono shujin ijou no mono de wa nai.
Deshi ga sono shi no you de ari, shimobe ga sono shujin no you de areba, sore de juubun de aru. Moshi ie no shujin ga Beruzeburu to iwarerunaraba, sono ie no monodomo wa naosara, donna ni ka waruku iwareru koto de arou.
Dakara karera o osoreru na. Oowareta mono de, arawarete konai mono wa naku, kakurete iru mono de, shirarete konai mono wa nai.
Watashi ga kurayami de anata gata ni hanasu koto o, akarumi de ie. Mimi ni sasayakareta koto o, yane no ue de ii hiromeyo.
Mata, karada o koroshite mo, tamashii o korosu koto no dekinai monodomo o osoreru na. Mushiro, karada mo tamashii mo jigoku de horobosu chikara no aru kata o osore nasai.
Futawa no suzume wa ichi Asarion de urarete irude wa nai ka. Shikamo anata gata no chichi no yurushi ga nakereba, sono hitowa mo chi ni ochiru koto wa nai.
Mata anata gata no atama no ke made mo, mina kazoerarete iru.
Sore dakara, osoreru koto wa nai. Anata gata wa ooku no suzume yori mo, masatta mono de aru.
Dakara hito no mae de watashi o ukeireru mono o, watashi mo mata, ten ni imasu watashi no chichi no mae de ukeirerude arou.
Shikashi, hito no mae de watashi o kobamu mono o, watashi mo ten ni imasu watashi no chichi no mae de kobamude arou.
Chijou ni heiwa o motarasu tame ni, watashi ga kita to omou na. Heiwa de wa naku, tsurugi o nagekomu tame ni kita no de aru.
Watashi ga kita no wa, hito o sono chichi to, musume o sono haha to, yome o sono shuutome to nakatagai saseru tame de aru.
Soshite ie no mono ga, sono hito no teki to narude arou.
Watashi yori mo chichi mata wa haha o aisuru mono wa, watashi ni fusawashiku nai. Watashi yori mo musuko ya musume o aisuru mono wa, watashi ni fusawashiku nai.
Mata jibun no juujika o totte watashi ni shitagatte konai mono wa watashi ni fusawashiku nai.
Jibun no inochi o ete iru mono wa sore o ushinai, watashi no tame ni jibun no inochi o ushinatte iru mono wa, sore o erude arou.
Anatagata o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de aru. Watashi o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta kata o ukeireru no de aru.
Yogensha no na no yue ni yogensha o ukeireru mono wa, yogensha no mukui o uke, gijin no na no yue ni gijin o ukeireru mono wa, gijin no mukui o ukerude arou.
Watashi no deshi de aru to iu na no yue ni, kono chiisai mono no hitori ni tsumetai mizu ippai de mo nomasete kureru mono wa, yoku itte okuga, kesshite sono mukui kara moreru koto wa nai".
Iesu wa juu ni deshi ni kono you ni meiji oete kara, machimachi de oshie mata nobetsutaeru tame ni, soko o tachisarareta.
Sate, Yohane wa gokuchuu de Kirisuto no miwaza ni tsuite tsutaekiki, jibun no deshitachi o tsukawashite,
Iesu ni iwaseta, " 'Kitarubeki kata' wa anata na no desu ka. Sore to mo, hoka ni dare ka o matsubekideshou ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Itte, anata gata ga mikiki shite iru koto o Yohane ni houkoku shi nasai.
Moujin wa mie, ashi nae wa aruki, raibyounin wa kiyomari, mimishii wa kikoe, shinin wa ikikaeri, mazushii hitobito wa fukuin o kikasarete iru.
Watashi ni tsumazukanai mono wa, saiwai de aru".
Karera ga kaette shimauto, Iesu wa Yohane no koto o gunshuu ni katari hajimerareta, "Anata gata wa, nani o mi ni arano ni dete kita no ka. Kaze ni yuragu ashi de aru ka.
De wa, nani o mi ni dete kita no ka. Yawarakai kimono o matotta hito ka. Yawarakai kimono o matotta hitobito nara, ou no ie ni iru.
De wa, nan no tame ni dete kita no ka. Yogensha o miru tame ka. Sou da, anata gata ni iuga, yogensha ijou no mono de aru.
'Miyo, watashi wa tsukai o anata no saki ni tsukawashi, anata no mae ni, michi o totonoesaserude arou' to kaite aru no wa, kono hito no koto de aru.
Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Onna no unda mono no naka de, baputesuma no Yohane yori ookii jinbutsu wa okoranakatta. Shikashi, tengoku de mottomo chiisai mono mo, kare yori wa ookii.
Baputesuma no Yohane no toki kara ima ni itaru made, tengoku wa hageshiku osowarete iru. Soshite hageshiku osou monotachi ga sore o ubaitotte iru.
Subete no yogensha to rippou to ga yogen shita no wa, Yohane no toki made de aru.
Soshite, moshi anata gata ga ukeireru koto o nozomeba, kono hito koso wa, kitarubeki Eriya na no de aru.
Mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi.
Ima no jidai o nani ni kurabeyou ka. Sore wa kodomotachi ga hiroba ni suwatte, hoka no kodomotachi ni yobikake,
'Watashitachi ga fue o fuita no ni, anatatachi wa odotte kurenakatta. Tomurai no uta o utatta no ni, mune o utte kurenakatta' to iu no ni nite iru.
Naze nara, Yohane ga kite, taberu koto mo, nomu koto mo shinaito, are wa akurei ni tsukarete iru no da, to ii,
Mata hito no ko ga kite, tabe tari non dari shite iruto, miyo, are wa shoku o musaboru mono, oozake o nomu mono, mata shuzeinin, tsumibito no nakama da, to iu. Shikashi, chie no tadashii koto wa, sono hataraki ga shoumei suru".
Sore kara Iesu wa, kazukazu no chikara aru waza ga nasareta no ni, kuiaratameru koto o shinakatta machimachi o, seme hajimerareta.
"Wazawai da, Korajin yo. Wazawai da, Betsusaida yo. Omaetachi no uchi de nasareta chikara aru waza ga, moshi Tsuro to Shidon de nasaretanara, karera wa tou no mukashi ni, aranuno o matoi hai o kabutte, kuiaratametade arou.
Shikashi, omaetachi ni itte oku. Sabaki no hi ni wa, Tsuro to Shidon no hou ga omaetachi yori mo, taeyasui de arou.
Aa, Kapenaumu yo, omae wa ten ni made agerareyou to de mo iu no ka. Yomi ni made otosarerude arou. Omae no naka de nasareta chikara aru waza ga, moshi Sodomu de nasaretanara, sono machi wa kyou made mo nokotte itade arou.
Shikashi, anata gata ni iu. Sabaki no hi ni wa, Sodomu no chi no hou ga omae yori wa taeyasui de arou".
Sono toki Iesu wa koe o agete iwareta, "Tenchi no Shu naru chichi yo. Anata o hometataemasu. Korera no koto o chie no aru mono ya kashikoi mono ni kakushite, osanago ni arawashite kudasaimashita.
Chichi yo, kore wa makoto ni mikokoro ni kanatta koto deshita.
Subete no koto wa chichi kara watashi ni makaserarete imasu. Soshite, ko o shiru mono wa chichi no hoka ni wa naku, chichi o shiru mono wa, ko to, chichi o arawasou to shite ko ga eranda mono to no hoka ni, dare mo arimasen.
Subete omoni o oute kurou shite iru mono wa, watashi no moto ni ki nasai. Anatagata o yasumasete ageyou.
Watashi wa nyuuwa de kokoro no herikudatta mono de arukara, watashi no kubiki o oute, watashi ni manabi nasai. Sou sureba, anata gata no tamashii ni yasumi ga ataerarerude arou.
Watashi no kubiki wa oiyasuku, watashi no ni wa karuikara de aru".
Sono koro, aru ansokunichi ni, Iesu wa mugibatake no naka o toorareta. Suruto deshitachi wa, kuufuku de atta no de, ho o tsunde tabe hajimeta.
Parisaibitotachi ga kore o mite, Iesu ni itta, "Goran nasai, anata no deshitachi ga, ansokunichi ni shite wa naranai koto o shite imasu".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, Dabide to sono tomo no monotachi to ga ueta toki, Dabide ga nani o shita ka yonda koto ga nai no ka.
Sunawachi, kami no ie ni haitte, saishitachi no hoka, jibun mo tomo no monotachi mo tabete wa naranu sonae no pan o tabeta no de aru.
Mata, ansokunichi ni miyazukae o shite iru saishitachi wa ansokunichi o yabutte mo tsumi ni wa naranai koto o, rippou de yonda koto ga nai no ka.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Miya yori mo ooinaru mono ga koko ni iru.
'Watashi ga konomu no wa, awaremi de atte, ikenie de wa nai' to wa dou iu imi ka shitte itanara, anata gata wa tsumi no nai mono o togamenakattade arou.
Hito no ko wa ansokunichi no Shu de aru".
Iesu wa soko o satte, karera no kaidou ni wa irareta.
Suruto, sono toki, katate no naeta hito ga ita. Hitobito wa Iesu o uttaeyou to omotte, "Ansokunichi ni hito o iyashite mo, sashitsukaenai ka" to tazuneta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata no uchi ni, ichipiki no hitsuji o motte iru hito ga aru to shite, moshi sore ga ansokunichi ni ana ni ochikondanara, te o kakete hikiagete yaranaidarou ka.
Hito wa hitsuji yori mo, haruka ni sugurete irude wa nai ka. Dakara, ansokunichi ni yoi koto o suru no wa, tadashii koto de aru".
Soshite Iesu wa sono hito ni, "Te o nobashi nasai" to iwareta. Soko de te o nobasuto, hoka no te no you ni yoku natta.
Parisaibitotachi wa dete itte, nan to ka shite Iesu o korosou to soudan shita.
Iesu wa kore o shitte, soko o satte ikareta. Tokoro ga ooku no hitobito ga tsuite kita no de, karera o mina iyashi,
Soshite jibun no koto o hitobito ni arawasanai you ni to, karera o imashimerareta.
Kore wa yogensha Izaya no itta kotoba ga, jouju suru tame de aru,
"Miyo, watashi ga eranda shimobe, watashi no kokoro ni kanau, aisuru mono. Watashi wa kare ni watashi no rei o sazuke, soshite kare wa seigi o ihoujin ni nobetsutaerude arou.
Kare wa arasowazu, sakebazu, mata sono koe o ooji de kiku mono wa nai.
Kare ga seigi ni kachi o esaseru toki made, itamerareta ashi o oru koto ga naku, kemutte iru toushin o kesu koto mo nai.
Ihoujin wa kare no na ni nozomi o okude arou".
Sono toki, hitobito ga akurei ni tsukareta moujin no oshi o tsurete kita no de, Iesu wa kare o iyashite, mono o ii, mata me ga mieru you ni sareta.
Suru to gunshuu wa mina odoroite itta, "Kono hito ga, aruiha Dabide no ko de wa arumai ka".
Shikashi, Parisaibitotachi wa, kore o kiite itta, "Kono hito ga akurei o oidashite iru no wa, mattaku akurei no kashira Beruzeburu ni yoru no da".
Iesu wa karera no omoi o minuite iwareta, "Ooyoso, naibu de wakare arasou kuni wa jimetsu shi, uchi wa de wakare arasou machi ya ie wa tachiikanai.
Moshi Satan ga Satan o oidasunaraba, sore wa uchi wa de wakare arasou koto ni naru. Sore de wa, sono kuni wa dou shite tachi ikeyou.
Moshi watashi ga Beruzeburu ni yotte akurei o oidasu to sureba, anata gata no nakama wa dare ni yotte oidasu no de arou ka. Dakara, karera ga anatagata o sabaku mono to narude arou.
Shikashi, watashi ga kami no rei ni yotte akurei o oidashite iru no nara, kami no kuni wa sudeni anata gata no tokoro ni kita no de aru.
Mata dare de mo, mazu tsuyoi hito o shibariagenakereba, dou shite, sono hito no ie ni oshiitte kazai o ubaitoru koto ga dekiyou ka. Shibatte kara, hajimete sono ie o ryakudatsu suru koto ga dekiru.
Watashi no mikata de nai mono wa, watashi ni hantai suru mono de ari, watashi to tomo ni atsumenai mono wa, chirasu mono de aru.
Dakara, anata gata ni itte oku. Hito ni wa, sono okasu subete no tsumi mo kami o kegasu kotoba mo, yurusareru. Shikashi, seirei o kegasu kotoba wa, yurusareru koto wa nai.
Mata hito no ko ni taishite ii sakarau mono wa, yurusarerude arou. Shikashi, seirei ni taishite ii sakarau mono wa, konoyo de mo, kitarubeki yo de mo, yurusareru koto wa nai.
Ki ga yokereba, sono mi mo yoi to shi, ki ga warukereba, sono mi mo warui to seyo. Ki wa sono mi de wakarukara de aru.
Mamushi no kora yo. Anata gata wa warui mono de aru no ni, dou shite yoi koto o kataru koto ga dekiyou ka. Ooyoso, kokoro kara afureru koto o, kuchi ga kataru mono de aru.
Zennin wa yoi kura kara yoi mono o toridashi, akunin wa warui kura kara warui mono o toridasu.
Anata gata ni iuga, shinpan no hi ni wa, hito wa sono kataru mueki na kotoba ni taishite, iihiraki o shinakereba naranaide arou.
Anata wa, jibun no kotoba ni yotte tadashii to sare, mata jibun no kotoba ni yotte tsumi ari to sarerukara de aru".
Sono toki, rippougakusha, Parisaibito no uchi no aru hitobito ga Iesu ni mukatte itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa anata kara, shirushi o misete itadakitou gozaimasu".
Suruto, karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Jaaku de fugi na jidai wa, shirushi o motomeru. Shikashi, yogensha Yona no shirushi no hoka ni wa, nan no shirushi mo ataerarenaide arou.
Sunawachi, Yona ga mikka san ban, taigyo no hara no uchi ni ita you ni, hito no ko mo mikka san ban, chi no naka ni irude arou.
Ninebe no hitobito ga, ima no jidai no hitobito to tomo ni sabaki no ba ni tatte, karera o tsumi ni sadamerude arou. Naze nara, Ninebe no hitobito wa Yona no senkyou ni yotte kuiaratametakara de aru. Shikashi miyo, Yona ni masaru mono ga koko ni iru.
Minami no joou ga, ima no jidai no hitobito to tomo ni sabaki no ba ni tatte, karera o tsumi ni sadamerude arou. Naze nara, kanojo wa Soromon no chie o kiku tame ni chi no hate kara, harubaru kitakara de aru. Shikashi miyo, Soromon ni masaru mono ga koko ni iru.
Kegareta rei ga hito kara deruto, yasumiba o motomete mizu no nai tokoro o aruki mawaruga, mitsukaranai.
Soko de, dete kita moto no ie ni kaerou to itte kaette miruto, sono ie wa aite ite, souji ga shite aru ue, kazaritsuke ga shite atta.
Soko de mata dete itte, jibun ijou ni warui ta no nanatsu no rei o issho ni hikitsurete kite naka ni hairi, soko ni sumikomu. Sou suruto, sono hito no nochi no joutai wa hajime yori mo motto waruku naru no de aru. Yokoshima na ima no jidai mo, kono you ni narude arou".
Iesu ga mada gunshuu ni hanashite orareru toki, sono haha to kyoudaitachi to ga, Iesu ni hanasou to omotte soto ni tatte ita.
Sore de, aru hito ga Iesu ni itta, "Goran nasai. Anata no hahaue to kyoudai gata ga, anata ni hanasou to omotte, soto ni tatte oraremasu".
Iesu wa shirasete kureta mono ni kotaete iwareta, "Watashi no haha to wa, dare no koto ka. Watashi no kyoudai to wa, dare no koto ka".
Soshite, deshitachi no hou ni te o sashinobete iwareta, "Goran nasai. Koko ni watashi no haha, watashi no kyoudai ga iru.
Ten ni imasu watashi no chichi no mikokoro o okonau mono wa dare de mo, watashi no kyoudai, mata shimai, mata haha na no de aru".
Sono hi, Iesu wa ie o dete, umibe ni suwatte orareta.
Tokoro ga, oozei no gunshuu ga mimoto ni atsumatta no de, Iesu wa fune ni notte suwarare, gunshuu wa minakishi ni tatte ita.
Iesu wa tatoe de ooku no koto o katari, kou iwareta, "Miyo, tanemaki ga tane o maki ni dete itta.
Ma ite iru uchi ni, michibata ni ochita tane ga atta. Suruto, tori ga kite tabete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa tsuchi no usui ishiji ni ochita. Soko wa tsuchi ga fukaku nai no de, sugu me o dashitaga,
Hi ga noboru to yakete, ne ga nai tame ni karete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa ibara no chi ni ochita. Suruto, ibara ga nobite, fusaide shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa yoi chi ni ochite mi o musubi, aru mono wa hyaku bai, aru mono wa rokujuu bai, aru mono wa sanjuu bai ni mo natta.
Mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi".
Sore kara, deshitachi ga Iesu ni chikayotte kite itta, "Naze, karera ni tatoe de ohanashi ni naru no desu ka".
Soko de Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata ni wa, tengoku no okugi o shiru koto ga yurusarete iruga, karera ni wa yurusarete inai.
Ooyoso, motte iru hito wa ataerarete, iyoiyo yutaka ni naruga, motte inai hito wa, motte iru mono made mo toriagerarerude arou.
Dakara, karera ni wa tatoe de kataru no de aru. Sore wa karera ga, mite mo mizu, kiite mo kikazu, mata satoranaikara de aru.
Kou shite Izaya no itta yogen ga, karera no ue ni jouju shita no de aru. 'Anata gata wa kiku ni wa kikuga, kesshite satoranai. Miru ni wa miruga, kesshite mitomenai.
Kono tami no kokoro wa nibuku nari, sono mimi wa kikoenikuku, sono me wa tojite iru. Sore wa, karera ga me de mizu, mimi de kikazu, kokoro de satorazu, kuiaratamete iyasareru koto ga nai tame de aru'.
Shikashi, anata gata no me wa mite ori, mimi wa kiite irukara, saiwai de aru.
Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Ooku no yogensha ya gijin wa, anata gata no mite iru koto o miyou to nesshin ni negattaga, miru koto ga dekizu, mata anata gata no kiite iru koto o kikou to shitaga, kikenakatta no de aru.
Soko de, tanemaki no tatoe o kiki nasai.
Dare de mo mikuni no kotoba o kiite satoranainaraba, warui mono ga kite, sono hito no kokoro ni makareta mono o ubaitotte iku. Michibata ni makareta mono to iu no wa, sou iu hito no koto de aru.
Ishiji ni makareta mono to iu no wa, mikotoba o kikuto, sugu ni yorokonde ukeru hito no koto de aru.
Sono naka ni ne ga nai no de, shibaraku tsuzuku dake de atte, mikotoba no tame ni konnan ya hakugai ga okotte kuruto, sugu tsumazuite shimau.
Mata, ibara no naka ni makareta mono to wa, mikotoba o kikuga, yo no kokorozukai to tomi no madowashi to ga mikotoba o fusagu no de, mi o musubanaku naru hito no koto de aru.
Mata, yoi chi ni makareta mono to wa, mikotoba o kiite satoru hito no koto de atte, sou iu hito ga mi o musubi, hyaku bai, aruiha rokujuu bai, aruiha sanjuu bai ni mo naru no de aru".
Mata, hoka no tatoe o karera ni shimeshite iwareta, "Tengoku wa, yoi tane o jibun no hatake ni maite oita hito no you na mono de aru.
Hitobito ga nemutte iru aida ni teki ga kite, mugi no naka ni dokumugi o maite tachisatta.
Me ga wa e dete mi o musubuto, douji ni dokumugi mo arawarete kita.
Shimobetachi ga kite, ie no shujin ni itta, 'Goshujinsama, hatake ni omaki ni natta no wa, yoi tane de wa arimasendeshita ka. Dou shite dokumugi ga haete kita no desu ka'.
Shujin wa itta, 'Sore wa teki no shiwaza da'. Suruto shimobetachi ga itta 'De wa itte, sore o nukiatsumemashou ka'.
Kare wa itta, 'Iya, dokumugi o atsumeyou to shite, mugi mo issho ni nuku ka mo shirenai.
Shuukaku made, ryouhou to mo sodatsu mama ni shite oke. Shuukaku no toki ni nattara, karu mono ni, mazu dokumugi o atsumete taba ni shite yaki, mugi no hou wa atsumete kura ni irete kure, to iitsukeyou' ".
Mata, hoka no tatoe o karera ni shimeshite iwareta, "Tengoku wa, ichi tsubu no karashi dane no you na mono de aru. Aru hito ga sore o totte hatake ni makuto,
Sore wa donna tane yori mo chiisaiga, seichou suruto, yasai no naka de ichiban ookiku nari, sora no tori ga kite, sono eda ni yadoru hodo no ki ni naru".
Mata hoka no tatoe o karera ni katarareta, "Tengoku wa, pan tane no you na mono de aru. Onna ga sore o totte san to no kona no naka ni mazeruto, zentai ga fukurande kuru".
Iesu wa korera no koto o subete, tatoe de gunshuu ni katarareta. Tatoe ni yoranaide wa nanigoto mo karera ni katararenakatta.
Kore wa yogensha ni yotte iwareta koto ga, jouju suru tame de aru, "Watashi wa kuchi o hiraite tatoe o katari, yo no hajime kara kakusarete iru koto o katarida sou".
Sore kara Iesu wa, gunshuu o ato ni nokoshite ie ni wa irareta. Suruto deshitachi wa, mimoto ni kite itta, "Hatake no dokumugi no tatoe o setsumei shite kudasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Yoi tane o maku mono wa, hito no ko de aru.
Hatake wa sekai de aru. Yoi tane to iu no wa mikuni no kotachi de, dokumugi wa warui mono no kotachi de aru.
Sore o maita teki wa akuma de aru. Shuukaku to wa yo no owari no koto de, karu mono wa mitsukai tachi de aru.
Dakara, dokumugi ga atsumerarete hi de yakareru you ni, yo no owari ni mo sono toori ni narude arou.
Hito no ko wa sono tsukaitachi o tsukawashi, tsumazuki to naru mono to fuhou o okonau mono to o, kotogotoku mikuni kara toriatsumete,
Ro no hi ni nageire saserude arou. Soko de wa nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou.
Sono toki, gijintachi wa karera no chichi no mikuni de, taiyou no you ni kagayaki watarude arou. Mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi.
Tengoku wa, hatake ni kakushite aru takara no you na mono de aru. Hito ga sore o mitsukeruto kakushite oki, yorokobi no amari, itte mochimono o mina uriharai, soshite sono hatake o kau no de aru.
Mata tengoku wa, yoi shinju o sagashite iru shounin no you na mono de aru.
Kouka na shinju ichiko o miidasuto, itte mochimono o mina uriharai, soshite kore o kau no de aru.
Mata tengoku wa, umi ni oroshite, arayuru shurui no uo o kakomi ireru ami no you na mono de aru.
Sore ga ippai ni naruto kishi ni hikiage, soshite suwatte, yoi no o utsuwa ni ire, warui no o soto e suteru no de aru.
Yo no owari ni mo, sono toori ni narude arou. Sunawachi, mitsukai tachi ga kite, gijin no uchi kara akunin o eriwake,
Soshite ro no hi ni nagekomude arou. Soko de wa nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou.
Anata gata wa, korera no koto ga mina wakatta ka". Karera wa "Wakarimashita" to kotaeta.
Soko de, Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Sore dakara, tengoku no koto o mananda gakusha wa, atarashii mono to furui mono to o, sono kura kara toridasu ikka no shujin no you na mono de aru".
Iesu wa korera no tatoe o katari oete kara, soko o tachisarareta.
Soshite kyouri ni iki, kaidou de hitobito o oshierareta tokoro, karera wa odoroite itta, "Kono hito wa, kono chie to korera no chikara aru wazato o, doko de naratte kita no ka.
Kono hito wa daiku no ko de wa nai ka. Haha wa Mariya to ii, kyoudaitachi wa, Yakobu, Yosefu, Shimon, Yuda de wa nai ka.
Mata sono shimaitachi mo mina, watashitachi to issho ni irude wa nai ka. Konna kazukazu no koto o, ittai, doko de naratte kita no ka".
Kou shite hitobito wa Iesu ni tsumazuita. Shikashi, Iesu wa iwareta, "Yogensha wa, jibun no kyouri ya jibun no ie igai de wa, doko de de mo uyamawarenai koto wa nai".
Soshite karera no fushinkou no yue ni, soko de wa chikara aru waza o, amari nasaranakatta.
Sono koro, ryoushu Herode wa Iesu no uwasa o kiite,
Kerai ni itta, "Are wa baputesuma no Yohane da. Shinin no naka kara yomigaetta no da. Sore de, ano you na chikara ga kare no uchi ni hataraite iru no da".
To iu no wa, Herode wa saki ni, jibun no kyoudai Piripo no tsuma Herodeya no koto de, Yohane o toraete shibari, goku ni irete ita.
Sunawachi, Yohane wa Herode ni, "Sono onna o metoru no wa, yoroshiku nai" to ittakara de aru.
Soko de Herode wa Yohane o korosou to omottaga, gunshuu o osoreta. Karera ga Yohane o yogensha to mitomete itakara de aru.
Sate Herode no tanjou bi no iwai ni, Herodeya no musume ga sono sekijou de mai o mai, Herode o yorokobaseta no de,
Kanojo no negau mono wa, nan de mo ataeyou to, kare wa chikatte yakusoku made shita.
Suruto kanojo wa haha ni sosonokasarete, "Baputesuma no Yohane no kubi o bon ni nosete, koko ni motte kite itadakitou gozaimasu" to itta.
Ou wa komattaga, ittan chikatta no to, mata retsuza no hitotachi no temae, sore o ataeru you ni meiji,
Hito o tsukawashite, gokuchuu de Yohane no kubi o kiraseta.
Sono kubi wa bon ni nosete hakobare, shoujo ni watasare, shoujo wa sore o haha no tokoro ni motte itta.
Sore kara, Yohane no deshitachi ga kite, shitai o hikitotte houmutta. Soshite, Iesu no tokoro ni itte houkoku shita.
Iesu wa kono koto o kikuto, fune ni notte soko o sari, jibun hitori de sabishii tokoro e ikareta. Shikashi, gunshuu wa sore to kiite, machimachi kara toho de ato o otte kita.
Iesu wa fune kara agatte, oozei no gunshuu o goran ni nari, karera o fukaku awarende, sono uchi no byounintachi o oiyashi ni natta.
Yuugata ni natta no de, deshitachi ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Koko wa sabishii tokoro de mo ari, mou toki mo osoku narimashita. Gunshuu o kaisan sase, meimei de shokumotsu o kai ni, muramura e ikasete kudasai".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Karera ga dekakete iku ni wa oyobanai. Anata gata no te de shokumotsu o yari nasai".
Deshitachi wa itta, "Watashitachi wa koko ni, pan itsutsu to uo nihiki shika motte imasen".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore o koko ni motte ki nasai".
Soshite gunshuu ni meijite, kusa no ue ni suwarase, itsutsu no pan to nihiki no uo to o te ni tori, ten o aoide sore o shukufuku shi, pan o saite deshitachi ni watasareta. Deshitachi wa sore o gunshuu ni ataeta.
Minna no mono wa tabete manpuku shita. Pan kuzu no nokori o atsumeruto, juu ni no kago ni ippai ni natta.
Tabeta mono wa, onna to kodomo to o nozoite, ooyoso gosennin de atta.
Sore kara sugu, Iesu wa gunshuu o kaisan sasete orareru aida ni, shiite deshitachi o fune ni norikomase, mukougishi e saki ni oyari ni natta.
Soshite gunshuu o kaisan sasete kara, inoru tame hisoka ni yama e noborareta. Yuugata ni natte mo, tada hitori soko ni orareta.
Tokoro ga fune wa, mou sudeni riku kara suuchou mo hanarete ori, gyakufuu ga fuite ita tame ni, nami ni nayamasarete ita.
Iesu wa yoake no yon ji goro, umi no ue o aruite karera no hou e ikareta.
Deshitachi wa, Iesu ga umi no ue o aruite orareru no o mite, yuurei da to itte oji madoi, kyoufu no amari sakebigoe o ageta.
Shikashi, Iesu wa sugu ni karera ni koe o kakete, "Shikkari suru no da, watashi de aru. Osoreru koto wa nai" to iwareta.
Suru to Petero ga kotaete itta, "Shu yo, anata deshita ka. De wa, watashi ni meijite, mizu no ue o watatte mi moto ni ikasete kudasai".
Iesu wa, "Oide nasai" to iwareta no de, Petero wa fune kara ori, mizu no ue o aruite Iesu no tokoro e itta.
Shikashi, kaze o mite osoroshiku nari, soshite obore kaketa no de, kare wa sakende, "Shu yo, otasuke kudasai" to itta.
Iesu wa sugu ni te o nobashi, kare o tsukamaete iwareta, "Shinkou no usui mono yo, naze utagatta no ka".
Futari ga fune ni norikomuto, kaze wa yande shimatta.
Fune no naka ni ita monotachi wa Iesu o haishite, "Hontou ni, anata wa kami no ko desu" to itta.
Sore kara, karera wa umi o watatte Genesare no chi ni tsuita.
Suruto sono tochi no hitobito wa Iesu to shitte, sono fukin zentai ni hito o tsukawashi, Iesu no tokoro ni byounin o mina tsurete kosaseta.
Soshite karera ni Iesu no uwagi no fusani de mo, sawarasete yatte itadakitai to onegai shita. Soshite sawatta mono wa mina iyasareta.
Toki ni, Parisaibito to rippougakusha tachi to ga, Erusaremu kara Iesu no moto ni kite itta,
"Anata no deshitachi wa, naze mukashi no hitobito no iitsutae o yaburu no desu ka. Karera wa shokuji no toki ni te o aratte imasen".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Naze, anata gata mo jibuntachi no iitsutae ni yotte, kami no imashime o yabutte iru no ka.
Kami wa iwareta, 'Chichi to haha to o uyamae', mata 'Chichi mata wa haha o nonoshiru mono wa, kanarazu shi ni sadamerareru' to.
Sore da no ni, anata gata wa 'Dare de mo chichi mata wa haha ni mukatte, anata ni sashiageru hazu no kono mono wa sonaemono desu, to ieba,
Chichi mata wa haha o uyamawanakute mo yoroshii' to itte iru. Kou shite anata gata wa jibuntachi no iitsutae ni yotte, kami no kotoba o mu ni shite iru.
Gizensha tachi yo, Izaya ga anata gata ni tsuite, kou iu tekisetsu na yogen o shite iru,
'Kono tami wa, kuchisaki de wa watashi o uyamauga, sono kokoro wa watashi kara tooku hanarete iru.
Ningen no imashime o oshie to shite oshie, muimi ni watashi o ogande iru' ".
Sore kara Iesu wa gunshuu o yobiyosete iwareta, "Kiite satoru ga yoi.
Kuchi ni wa iru mono wa hito o kegasu koto wa nai. Kaette, kuchi kara deru mono ga hito o kegasu no de aru".
Sono toki, deshitachi ga chikayotte kite Iesu ni itta, "Parisaibitotachi ga mikotoba o kiite tsumazuita koto o, gozonji desu ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Watashi no ten no chichi ga oue ni naranakatta mono wa, mina nukitorarerude arou.
Karera o sono mama ni shite oke. Karera wa moujin o tebiki suru moujin de aru. Moshi moujin ga moujin o tebiki surunara, futaritomo ana ni ochikomude arou".
Petero ga kotaete itta, "Sono tatoe o setsumei shite kudasai".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata mo, mada wakaranai no ka.
Kuchi ni haitte kuru mono wa, mina hara no naka ni hairi, soshite, soto ni dete iku koto o shiranai no ka.
Shikashi, kuchi kara dete iku mono wa, kokoro no naka kara dete kuru no de atte, sore ga hito o kegasu no de aru.
To iu no wa, warui omoi, sunawachi, satsujin, kan'in, fuhinkou, nusumi, gishou, soshiri wa, kokoro no naka kara dete kuru no de atte,
Korera no mono ga hito o kegasu no de aru. Shikashi, arawanai te de shokuji suru koto wa, hito o kegasu no de wa nai".
Sate, Iesu wa soko o dete, Tsuro to Shidon to no chihou e ikareta.
Suruto, soko e, sono chihoude no Kanan no onna ga dete kite, "Shu yo, Dabide no ko yo, watashi o awarende kudasai. Musume ga akurei ni toritsukarete kurushinde imasu" to itte sakebi tsuzuketa.
Shikashi, Iesu wa hitokoto mo okotae ni naranakatta. Soko de deshitachi ga mimoto ni kite negatte itta, "Kono onna o oiharatte kudasai. Sakebinagara tsuite kite imasukara".
Suru to Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Watashi wa, Isuraeru no ie no ushinawareta hitsuji igai no mono ni wa, tsukawasarete inai".
Shikashi, onna wa chikayori Iesu o haishite itta, "Shu yo, watashi o otasuke kudasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Kodomotachi no pan o totte koinu ni nagete yaru no wa, yoroshiku nai".
Suru to onna wa itta, "Shu yo, okotoba doori desu. De mo, koinu mo sono shujin no shokutaku kara ochiru pan kuzu wa, itadakimasu".
Soko de Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Onna yo, anata no shinkou wa miageta mono de aru. Anata no negai doori ni naru you ni". Sono toki ni, musume wa iyasareta.
Iesu wa soko o satte, Gariraya no umibe ni iki, sore kara yama ni nobotte soko ni suwarareta.
Suruto oozei no gunshuu ga, ashi nae, fugusha, moujin, oshi, sono hoka ooku no hitobito o tsurete kite, Iesu no ashimoto ni oita no de, karera o oiyashi ni natta.
Gunshuu wa, oshi ga mono o ii, fugusha ga naori, ashi nae ga aruki, moujin ga mieru you ni natta no o mite odoroki, soshite Isuraeru no kami o hometataeta.
Iesu wa deshitachi o yobiyosete iwareta, "Kono gunshuu ga kawaisou de aru. Mou mik kakan mo watashi to issho ni iru no ni, nani mo taberu mono ga nai. Shikashi, karera o kuufuku no mama de kaerasetaku wa nai. Osoraku tochuu de yowari kitte shimaude arou".
Deshitachi wa itta, "Arano no naka de, konna ni oozei no gunshuu ni juubun tabesaseru hodo takusan no pan o, doko de te ni iremashou ka".
Iesu wa deshitachi ni "Pan wa ikutsu aru ka" to tazunerareruto, "Nanatsu arimasu. Mata chiisai uo ga sukoshi arimasu" to kotaeta.
Soko de Iesu wa gunshuu ni, chi ni suwaru you ni to meiji,
Nanatsu no pan to uo to o tori, kansha shite kore o saki, deshitachi ni watasare, deshitachi wa kore o gunshuu ni waketa.
Ichidou no mono wa tabete manpuku shita. Soshite nokotta pan kuzu o atsumeruto, nanatsu no kago ni ippai ni natta.
Tabeta mono wa, onna to kodomo to o nozoite yonsennin de atta.
Soko de Iesu wa gunshuu o kaisan sase, fune ni notte Magadan no chihou e ikareta.
Parisaibito to Sadokaibito to ga chikayotte kite, Iesu o kokoromi, ten kara no shirushi o misete moraitai to itta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa yuugata ni naruto, 'Sora ga makka dakara, hare da' to ii,
Mata akegata ni wa 'Sora ga kumotte makka dakara, kyou wa areda' to iu. Anata gata wa sora no moyou o miwakeru koto o shirinagara, toki no shirushi o miwakeru koto ga dekinai no ka.
Jaaku de fugi na jidai wa, shirushi o motomeru. Shikashi, Yona no shirushi no hoka ni wa, nan no shirushi mo ataerarenaide arou". Soshite, Iesu wa karera o ato ni nokoshite tachisarareta.
Deshitachi wa mukougishi ni ittaga, pan o motte kuru no o wasurete ita.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Parisaibito to Sadokaibito to no pan dane o, yokuyoku keikai seyo".
Deshitachi wa, kore wa jibuntachi ga pan o motte konakatta tame de arou to itte, tagai ni ronjiatta.
Iesu wa sore to shitte iwareta, "Shinkou no usui monotachi yo, naze pan ga naikara da to tagai ni ronjiatte iru no ka.
Mada wakaranai no ka. Oboete inai no ka. Itsutsu no pan o gosennin ni waketa toki, iku kago hirotta ka.
Mata, nanatsu no pan o yonsennin ni waketa toki, iku kago hirotta ka.
Watashi ga itta no wa, pan ni tsuite de wa nai koto o, dou shite satoranai no ka. Tada, Parisaibito to Sadokaibito to no pan dane o keikai shi nasai".
Sono toki karera wa, Iesu ga keikai seyo to iwareta no wa, pan dane no koto de wa naku, Parisaibito to Sadokaibito to no oshie no koto de aru to satotta.
Iesu ga Piripo Kaizariya no chihou ni ikareta toki, deshitachi ni tazunete iwareta, "Hitobito wa hito no ko o dare to itte iru ka".
Karera wa itta, "Aru hitobito wa baputesuma no Yohane da to itte imasu. Shikashi, hoka no hitotachi wa, Eriya da to ii, mata, Eremiya aruiha yogensha no hitori da, to itte iru mono mo arimasu".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Sore de wa, anata gata wa watashi o dare to iu ka".
Shimon Petero ga kotaete itta, "Anata koso, ikeru kami no ko Kirisuto desu".
Suruto, Iesu wa kare ni mukatte iwareta, "Baruyona Shimon, anata wa saiwai de aru. Anata ni kono koto o arawashita no wa, ketsuniku de wa naku, ten ni imasu watashi no chichi de aru.
Soko de, watashi mo anata ni iu. Anata wa Petero de aru. Soshite, watashi wa kono iwa no ue ni watashi no kyoukai o tateyou. Yomi no chikara mo sore ni uchikatsu koto wa nai.
Watashi wa, anata ni tengoku no kagi o sazukeyou. Soshite, anata ga chijou de tsunagu koto wa, ten de mo tsunagare, anata ga chijou de toku koto wa ten de mo tokarerude arou".
Sono toki, Iesu wa, jibun ga Kirisuto de aru koto o dare ni mo itte wa ikenaito, deshitachi o imashimerareta.
Kono toki kara, Iesu Kirisuto wa, jibun ga kanarazu Erusaremu ni iki, chourou, saishichou, rippougakusha tachi kara ooku no kurushimi o uke, korosare, soshite mikkame ni yomigaerubeki koto o, deshitachi ni shimeshi hajimerareta.
Suruto, Petero wa Iesu o waki e hikiyosete, isame hajime, "Shu yo, tondemo nai koto desu. Sonna koto ga aru hazu wa gozaimasen" to itta.
Iesu wa furimuite, Petero ni iwareta, "Satan yo, hikisagare. Watashi no jama o suru mono da. Anata wa kami no koto o omowanaide, hito no koto o omotte iru".
Sore kara Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Dare de mo watashi ni tsuite kitai to omounara, jibun o sute, jibun no juujika o oute, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai.
Jibun no inochi o sukuou to omou mono wa sore o ushinai, watashi no tame ni jibun no inochi o ushinau mono wa, sore o miidasude arou.
Tatoi hito ga zensekai o moukete mo, jibun no inochi o sonshitara, nan no toku ni narou ka. Mata, hito wa donna daika o haratte, sono inochi o kaimodosu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Hito no ko wa chichi no eikou no uchi ni, mitsukai tachi o shitagaete kuruga, sono toki ni wa, jissai no okonai ni oujite, sorezore ni mukuirude arou.
Yoku kiite oku ga yoi, hito no ko ga mikuni no chikara o motte kuru no o miru made wa, shi o ajiwawanai mono ga, koko ni tatte iru mono no naka ni iru".
Muika no nochi, Iesu wa Petero, Yakobu, Yakobu no kyoudai Yohane dake o tsurete, takai yama ni noborareta.
Tokoro ga, karera no me no mae de Iesu no sugata ga kawari, sono kao wa hi no you ni kagayaki, sono koromo wa hikari no you ni shiroku natta.
Suruto, miyo, Moose to Eriya ga karera ni arawarete, Iesu to katariatte ita.
Petero wa Iesu ni mukatte itta, "Shu yo, watashitachi ga koko ni iru no wa, subarashii koto desu. Moshi, osashitsukaenakereba, watashi wa koko ni koya o mittsu tatemashou. Hitotsu wa anata no tame ni, hitotsu wa Moose no tame ni, hitotsu wa Eriya no tame ni".
Kare ga mada hanashi oenai uchi ni, tachimachi, kagayaku kumo ga karera o ooi, soshite kumo no naka kara koe ga shita, "Kore wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no kokoro ni kanau mono de aru. Kore ni kike".
Deshitachi wa kore o kiite hijou ni osore, kao o chi ni fuseta.
Iesu wa chikazuite kite, te o karera ni oite iwareta, "Oki nasai, osoreru koto wa nai".
Karera ga me o ageruto, Iesu no hoka ni wa, dare mo mienakatta.
Ichidou ga yama o kudatte kuru toki, Iesu wa "Hito no ko ga shinin no naka kara yomigaeru made wa, ima mita koto o dare ni mo hanashite wa naranai" to, karera ni meijirareta.
Deshitachi wa Iesu ni otazune shite itta, "Ittai, rippougakusha tachi wa, naze, Eriya ga saki ni kuru hazu da to itte iru no desu ka".
Kotaete iwareta, "Tashika ni, Eriya ga kite, banji o motodoori ni aratamerude arou.
Shikashi, anata gata ni itte oku. Eriya wa sudeni kita no da. Shikashi hitobito wa kare o mitomezu, jibun katte ni kare o ashiratta. Hito no ko mo mata, sono you ni karera kara kurushimi o ukeru koto ni narou".
Sono toki, deshitachi wa, Iesu ga baputesuma no Yohane no koto o iwareta no da to satotta.
Sate karera ga gunshuu no tokoro ni kaeruto, hitori no hito ga Iesu ni chikayotte kite, hizamazuite, itta,
"Shu yo, watashi no ko o awarende kudasai. Tenkan de kurushinde orimasu. Nan do mo nan do mo hi no naka ya mizu no naka ni taoreru no desu.
Sore de, sono ko o o deshitachi no tokoro ni tsurete kimashitaga, nao shite itadakemasendeshita".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Aa, nan to iu fushinkou na, magatta jidai de arou. Itsu made, watashi wa anata gata to issho ni orareyou ka. Itsu made anata gata ni gaman ga dekiyou ka. Sono ko o koko ni, watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai".
Iesu ga oshikari ni naruto, akurei wa sono ko kara dete itta. Soshite ko wa sono toki iyasareta.
Sore kara, deshitachi ga hisoka ni Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Watashitachi wa, dou shite rei o oidasenakatta no desu ka".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata no shinkou ga tarinaikara de aru. Yoku iikikasete okuga, moshi, karashi dane ichi tsubu hodo no shinkou ga arunara, kono yama ni mukatte 'Koko kara asoko ni utsure' to ieba, utsurude arou. Kono you ni, anata gata ni dekinai koto wa, nani mo naide arou. []
Shikashi, kono tagui wa, inori to danjiki to ni yoranakereba, oidasu koto wa dekinai]".
Karera ga Gariraya de atsumatte ita toki, Iesu wa iwareta, "Hito no ko wa hitobito no te ni watasare,
Karera ni korosare, soshite mikkame ni yomigaerude arou". Deshitachi wa hijou ni kokoro o itameta.
Karera ga Kapenaumu ni kita toki, miya no nounyuukin o atsumeru hitotachi ga Petero no tokoro ni kite itta, "Anata gata no sensei wa miya no nounyuukin o osamenai no ka".
Petero wa "Osamete oraremasu" to itta. Soshite kare ga ie ni hairuto, Iesu kara saki ni hanashikakete iwareta, "Shimon, anata wa dou omou ka. Konoyo no outachi wa zei ya mitsugi o dare kara toru no ka. Jibun no ko kara ka, sore to mo, hoka no hitotachi kara ka".
Petero ga "Hoka no hitotachi kara desu" to kotaeruto, Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore de wa, ko wa osamenakute mo yoi wake de aru.
Shikashi, karera o tsumazukasenai tame ni, umi ni itte, tsurihari o tare nasai. Soshite saisho ni tsureta uo o totte, sono kuchi o akeruto, ginka ichimai ga mitsukarude arou. Sore o toridashite, watashi to anata no tame ni osame nasai".
Sono toki, deshitachi ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Ittai, tengoku de wa dare ga ichiban erai no desu ka".
Suruto, Iesu wa osanago o yobiyose, karera no mannaka ni tatasete iwareta,
"Yoku kiki nasai. Kokoro o irekaete osanago no you ni naranakereba, tengoku ni hairu koto wa dekinaide arou.
Kono osanago no you ni jibun o hikuku suru mono ga, tengoku de ichiban erai no de aru.
Mata, dare de mo, kono you na hitori no osanago o, watashi no na no yue ni ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de aru.
Shikashi, watashi o shinzuru korera no chiisai mono no hitori o tsumazukaseru mono wa, ookina hikiusu o kubi ni kakerarete umi no fukami ni shizumerareru hou ga, sono hito no eki ni naru.
Konoyo wa, tsumi no yuuwaku ga arukara, wazawai de aru. Tsumi no yuuwaku wa kanarazu kuru. Shikashi, sore o kitaraseru hito wa, wazawai de aru.
Moshi anata no katate mata wa kataashi ga, tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o kitte sute nasai. Ryoute, ryouashi ga sorotta mama de, eien no hi ni nagekomareru yori wa, katate, kataashi ni natte inochi ni hairu hou ga yoi.
Moshi anata no katame ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o nukidashite sute nasai. Ryougan ga sorotta mama de jigoku no hi ni nageirerareru yori wa, katame ni natte inochi ni hairu hou ga yoi.
Anata gata wa, korera no chiisai mono no hitori o mo karonjinai you ni, ki o tsuke nasai. Anata gata ni iuga, karera no mitsukai tachi wa ten ni atte, ten ni imasu watashi no chichi no mikao o itsu mo aoide iru no de aru. []
Hito no ko wa, horobiru mono o sukuu tame ni kita no de aru.]
Anata gata wa dou omou ka. Aru hito ni hyakupiki no hitsuji ga ari, sono naka no ichipiki ga mayoideta to sureba, kyuujuu kyuuhiki o yama ni nokoshite oite, sono mayoidete iru hitsuji o sagashi ni dekakenaide arou ka.
Moshi sore o mitsuketanara, yoku kiki nasai, mayowanaide iru kyuujuu kyuuhiki no tame yori mo, mushiro sono ichipiki no tame ni yorokobude arou.
Sono you ni, korera no chiisai mono no hitori ga horobiru koto wa, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi no mikokoro de wa nai.
Moshi anata no kyoudai ga tsumi o okasunara, itte, kare to futari dake no tokoro de chuukoku shi nasai. Moshi kiite kuretara, anata no kyoudai o eta koto ni naru.
Moshi kiite kurenainara, hoka ni hitori futari o, issho ni tsurete iki nasai. Sore wa, futari mata wa sannin no shounin no kuchi ni yotte, subete no kotogara ga tashikamerareru tame de aru.
Moshi karera no iu koto o kikanainara, kyoukai ni moushide nasai. Moshi kyoukai no iu koto mo kikanainara, sono hito o ihoujin mata wa shuzeinin douyou ni atsukai nasai.
Yoku itte oku. Anata gata ga chijou de tsunagu koto wa, ten de mo mina tsunagare, anata gata ga chijou de toku koto wa, ten de mo mina tokarerude arou.
Mata, yoku itte oku. Moshi anata gata no uchi no futari ga, donna negaigoto ni tsuite mo chijou de kokoro o awaserunara, ten ni imasu watashi no chichi wa sore o kanaete kudasarude arou.
Futari mata wa sannin ga, watashi no na ni yotte atsumatte iru tokoro ni wa, watashi mo sono naka ni iru no de aru".
Sono toki, Petero ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Shu yo, kyoudai ga watashi ni taishite tsumi o okashita baai, iku tabi yurusaneba narimasen ka. Nana tabi made desu ka".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi wa nana tabi made to wa iwanai. Nana tabi o nanajuu bai suru made ni shi nasai.
Sore dakara, tengoku wa ou ga shimobetachi to kessan o suru you na mono da.
Kessan ga hajimaruto, ichi man taranto no fusai no aru mono ga, ou no tokoro ni tsurerarete kita.
Shikashi, kaesenakatta no de, shujin wa, sono hito jishin to sono saishi to mochimono zenbu to o utte kaesu you ni meijita.
Soko de, kono shimobe wa hirefushite aigan shita, 'Douzo omachi kudasai. Zenbu okaeshi itashimasukara'.
Shimobe no shujin wa aware ni omotte, kare o yurushi, sono fusai o menjite yatta.
Sono shimobe ga dete ikuto, hyaku denari o kashite iru hitori no nakama ni deai, kare o tsukamae, kubi o shimete 'Shakkin o kaese' to itta.
Soko de kono nakama wa hirefushi, 'Dou ka matte kure. Kaesukara' to itte tanonda.
Shikashi shouchi sezu ni, sono hito o hippatte itte, shakkin o kaesu made goku ni ireta.
Sono hito no nakamatachi wa, kono yousu o mite, hijou ni kokoro o itame, itte sono koto o nokorazu shujin ni hanashita.
Soko de kono shujin wa kare o yobitsukete itta, 'Warui shimobe, watashi ni negattakara koso, ano fusai o zenbu yurushite yatta no da.
Watashi ga awarende yatta you ni, ano nakama o awarende yarubekide wa nakatta ka'.
Soshite shujin wa rippuku shite, fusai zenbu o kaeshite shimau made, kare o gokuri ni hikiwatashita.
Anata gata meimei mo, moshi kokoro kara kyoudai o yurusanainaraba, watashi no ten no chichi mo mata anata gata ni taishite, sono you ni nasarude arou".
Iesu wa korera no koto o katari oerarete kara, Gariraya o satte Yorudan no mukou no Yudaya no chihou e ikareta.
Suruto oozei no gunshuu ga tsuite kita no de, karera o soko de oiyashi ni natta.
Sate Parisaibitotachi ga chikazuite kite, Iesu o kokoromiyou to shite itta, "Nani ka no riyuu de, otto ga sono tsuma o dasu no wa, sashitsukaenaideshou ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata wa mada yonda koto ga nai no ka. 'Souzousha wa hajime kara hito o otoko to onna to ni tsukurare,
Soshite iwareta, sore yue ni, hito wa fubo o hanare, sono tsuma to musubare, futari no mono wa ittai to narubekide aru'.
Karera wa mohaya, futari de wa naku ittai de aru. Dakara, kami ga awaserareta mono o, hito wa hanashite wa naranai".
Karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Sore de wa, naze Moose wa, tsuma o dasu baai ni wa rienjou o watase, to sadameta no desu ka".
Iesu ga iwareta, "Moose wa anata gata no kokoro ga, katakuna na no de, tsuma o dasu koto o yurushita no daga, hajime kara sou de wa nakatta.
Soko de watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Fuhinkou no yue de nakute, jibun no tsuma o dashite ta no onna o metoru mono wa, kan'in o okonau no de aru".
Deshitachi wa itta, "Moshi tsuma ni taisuru otto no tachiba ga sou da to sureba, kekkon shinai hou ga mashi desu".
Suru to Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Sono kotoba o ukeireru koto ga dekiru no wa subete no hito de wa naku, tada sore o sazukerarete iru hitobito dake de aru.
To iu no wa, haha no tainai kara dokushinsha ni umare tsuite iru mono ga ari, mata hoka kara dokushinsha ni sareta mono mo ari, mata tengoku no tame ni, mizukara susunde dokushinsha to natta mono mo aru. Kono kotoba o ukerareru mono wa, ukeireru ga yoi".
Sono toki, Iesu ni te o oite inotte itadaku tame ni, hitobito ga osanagora o mimoto ni tsurete kita. Tokoro ga, deshitachi wa karera o tashinameta.
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Osanagora o sono mama ni shite oki nasai. Watashi no tokoro ni kuru no o tomete wa naranai. Tengoku wa kono you na mono no kuni de aru".
Soshite te o karera no ue ni oite kara, soko o satte ikareta.
Suruto, hitori no hito ga Iesu ni chikayotte kite itta, "Sensei, eien no seimei o eru tame ni wa, donna yoi koto o shitara iideshou ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Naze yoi koto ni tsuite watashi ni tazuneru no ka. Yoi kata wa tada hitori dake de aru. Moshi inochi ni hairitai to omounara, imashime o mamori nasai".
Kare wa itta, "Dono imashime desu ka". Iesu wa iwareta, " 'Korosu na, kan'in suru na, nusumu na, gishou o tateru na.
Chichi to haha to o uyamae'. Mata 'Jibun o aisuru you ni, anata no tonarihito o aiseyo' ".
Kono seinen wa Iesu ni itta, "Sore wa mina mamotte kimashita. Hoka ni nani ga tarinai no deshou".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Moshi anata ga kanzen ni naritai to omounara, kaette anata no mochimono o uriharai, mazushii hitobito ni hodokoshi nasai. Sou sureba, ten ni takara o motsu you ni narou. Soshite, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai".
Kono kotoba o kiite, seinen wa kanashiminagara tachisatta. Takusan no shisan o motte itakara de aru.
Sore kara Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Yoku kiki nasai. Tonde iru mono ga tengoku ni wa iru no wa, muzukashii mono de aru.
Mata, anata gata ni iuga, tonde iru mono ga kami no kuni ni wa iru yori wa, rakuda ga hari no ana o tooru hou ga, motto yasashii".
Deshitachi wa kore o kiite hijou ni odoroite itta, "De wa, dare ga sukuwareru koto ga dekiru no darou".
Iesu wa karera o mitsumete iwareta, "Hito ni wa sore wa dekinaiga, kami ni wa nan de mo dekinai koto wa nai".
Sono toki, Petero ga Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Goran nasai, watashitachi wa issai o sutete, anata ni shitagaimashita. Tsuite wa, nani ga itadakerudeshou ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Yo ga aratamatte, hito no ko ga sono eikou no za ni tsuku toki ni wa, watashi ni shitagatte kita anata gata mo mata, juu ni no kurai ni zashite Isuraeru no juu ni no buzoku o sabakude arou.
Ooyoso, watashi no na no tame ni, ie, kyoudai, shimai, chichi, haha, ko, moshikuha hatake o suteta mono wa, sono iku bai mo o uke, mata eien no seimei o uketsugude arou.
Shikashi, ooku no saki no mono wa ato ni nari, ato no mono wa saki ni narude arou.
Tengoku wa, aru ie no shujin ga, jibun no budouen ni roudousha o yatou tame ni, yo ga akeruto douji ni, dekakete iku you na mono de aru.
Kare wa roudousha tachi to, ichi nichi ichi denari no yakusoku o shite, karera o budouen ni okutta.
Sore kara kyuu ji goro ni dete itte, ta no hitobito ga ichiba de nani mo sezu ni tatte iru no o mita.
Soshite, sono hitotachi ni itta, 'Anata gata mo, budouen ni iki nasai. Soutou na chingin o haraukara'.
Soko de, karera wa dekakete itta. Shujin wa mata, juu ni ji goro to san ji goro to ni dete itte, onaji you ni shita.
Go toki goro mata dete ikuto, mada tatte iru hitobito o mita no de, karera ni itta, 'Naze, nani mo shinaide, ichi nichijyuu koko ni tatte ita no ka'.
Karera ga 'Dare mo watashitachi o yatotte kuremasenkara' to kotaeta no de, sono hitobito ni itta, 'Anata gata mo, budouen ni iki nasai'.
Sate, yuugata ni natte, budouen no shujin wa kanrinin ni itta, 'Roudousha tachi o yobi nasai. Soshite, saigo ni kita hitobito kara hajimete junjun ni saisho ni kita hitobito ni wataru you ni, chingin o haratte yari nasai'.
Soko de, go toki goro ni yatowareta hitobito ga kite, sorezore ichi denari zutsu moratta.
Tokoro ga, saisho no hitobito ga kite, motto ooku moraerudarou to omotte ita no ni, karera mo ichi denari zutsu moratta dake de atta.
Moratta toki, ie no shujin ni mukatte fuhei o morashite
Itta, 'Kono saigo no monotachi wa ichi jikan shika hatarakanakatta no ni, anata wa ichi nichijuu, rouku to atsusa o shinbou shita watashitachi to onaji atsukai o nasaimashita'.
Soko de kare wa sono hitori ni kotaete itta, 'Tomo yo, watashi wa anata ni taishite fusei o shite wa inai. Anata wa watashi to ichi denari no yakusoku o shita de wa nai ka.
Jibun no chingin o moratte iki nasai. Watashi wa, kono saigo no mono ni mo anata to douyou ni haratte yaritai no da.
Jibun no mono o jibun ga shitai you ni suru no wa, atarimae de wa nai ka. Sore to mo watashi ga kimae yoku shite iru no de, netamashiku omou no ka'.
Kono you ni, ato no mono wa saki ni nari, saki no mono wa ato ni narude arou".
Sate, Iesu wa Erusaremu e noboru toki, juu ni deshi o hisoka ni yobiyose, sono tochuu de karera ni iwareta,
"Miyo, watashitachi wa Erusaremu e nobotte ikuga, hito no ko wa saishichou, rippougakusha tachi no te ni watasarerude arou. Karera wa kare ni shikei o senkoku shi,
Soshite kare o azakeri, muchiuchi, juujika ni tsuke saseru tame ni, ihoujin ni hikiwatasude arou. Soshite kare wa mikkame ni yomigaerude arou".
Sono toki, Zebedai no kora no haha ga, sono kora to issho ni Iesu no moto ni kite hizamazuki, nanigoto ka o onegai shita.
Soko de Iesu wa kanojo ni iwareta, "Nani o shite hoshii no ka". Kanojo wa itta, "Watashi no kono futari no musuko ga, anata no mikuni de, hitori wa anata no migi ni, hitori wa hidari ni suwareru you ni, okotoba o kudasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata wa, jibun ga nani o motomete iru no ka, wakatte inai. Watashi no nomou to shite iru sakazuki o nomu koto ga dekiru ka". Karera wa "Dekimasu" to kotaeta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Tashika ni, anata gata wa watashi no sakazuki o nomu koto ni narou. Shikashi, watashi no migi, hidari ni suwaraseru koto wa, watashi no suru koto de wa naku, watashi no chichi ni yotte sonaerarete iru hitobito dake ni yurusareru koto de aru".
Juunin no mono wa kore o kiite, kono futari no kyoudaitachi no koto de fungai shita.
Soko de, Iesu wa karera o yobiyosete iwareta, "Anata gata no shitte iru toori, ihoujin no shihaisha tachi wa sono tami o osame, mata erai hitotachi wa, sono tami no ue ni kenryoku o furutte iru.
Anata gata no aida de wa sou de atte wa naranai. Kaette, anata gata no aida de eraku naritai to omou mono wa, tsukaeru hitotonari,
Anata gata no aida de kashira ni naritai to omou mono wa, shimobe to naraneba naranai.
Sore wa, hito no ko ga kita no mo, tsukaerareru tame de wa naku, tsukaeru tame de ari, mata ooku no hito no a ga nai to shite, jibun no inochi o ataeru tame de aru no to, choudo onaji de aru".
Sore kara, karera ga Eriko o dete itta toki, oozei no gunshuu ga Iesu ni shitagatte kita.
Suruto, futari no moujin ga michibata ni suwatte itaga, Iesu ga tootte ikareru to kiite, sakende itta, "Shu yo, Dabide no ko yo, watashitachi o awarende kudasai".
Gunshuu wa karera o shikatte damaraseyou to shitaga, karera wa masumasu sakebi tsuzukete itta, "Shu yo, Dabide no ko yo, watashitachi o awarende kudasai".
Iesu wa tachidomari, karera o yonde iwareta, "Watashi ni nani o shite hoshii no ka".
Karera wa itta, "Shu yo, me o akete itadaku koto desu".
Iesu wa fukaku awarende, karera no me ni sawarareta. Suruto karera wa, tachimachi mieru you ni nari, Iesu ni shitagatte itta.
Sate, karera ga Erusaremu ni chikazuki, oribu yamazoi no Betepage ni tsuita toki, Iesu wa futari no deshi o tsukawashite iwareta,
"Mukou no mura e iki nasai. Suruto sugu, roba ga tsunagarete ite, ko roba ga soba ni iru no o mirude arou. Sore o toite watashi no tokoro ni hiite ki nasai.
Moshi dare ka ga, anata gata ni nani ka ittanara, Shu ga oiriyou na no desu, to ii nasai. Sou ieba, sugu watashite kurerude arou".
Kou shita no wa, yogensha ni yotte iwareta koto ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Sunawachi, "Shion no musume ni tsugeyo, miyo, anata no ou ga oide ni naru, nyuuwa na okata de, roba ni notte, kubiki o ou roba no ko ni notte".
Deshitachi wa dete itte, Iesu ga omeiji ni natta toori ni shi,
Roba to ko roba to o hiite kita. Soshite sono ue ni jibuntachi no uwagi o kakeruto, Iesu wa sore ni onori ni natta.
Gunshuu no uchi ooku no mono wa jibuntachi no uwagi o michi ni shiki, mata, hoka no monotachi wa ki no eda o kitte kite michi ni shiita.
Soshite gunshuu wa, mae ni yuku mono mo, ato ni shitagau mono mo, tomo ni sakebi tsuzuketa, "Dabide no ko ni, hosana. Shu no mina ni yotte kitaru mono ni, shukufuku are. Ito takaki tokoro ni, hosana".
Iesu ga Erusaremu ni haitte ikareta toki, machijuu ga kozotte sawagitachi, "Kore wa, ittai, donata darou" to itta.
Soko de gunshuu wa, "Kono hito wa Gariraya no Nazare kara deta yogensha Iesu de aru" to itta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa miya ni wa irareta. Soshite, miya no niwa de urikai shite ita hitobito o mina oidashi, mata ryougaenin no dai ya, hato o uru mono no koshikake o kutsugaesareta.
Soshite karera ni iwareta, " 'Watashi no ie wa, inori no ie to tonaerarubekide aru' to kaite aru. Sore da no ni, anata gata wa sore o goutou no su ni shite iru".
Sono toki miya no niwa de, moujin ya ashi na egami moto ni kita no de, karera o oiyashi ni natta.
Shikashi, saishichou, rippougakusha tachi wa, Iesu ga nasareta fushigi na waza o mi, mata miya no niwa de "Dabide no ko ni, hosana" to sakende iru kodomotachi o mite rippuku shi,
Iesu ni itta, "Ano kotachi ga nani o itte iru no ka, okiki desu ka". Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Sou da, kiite iru. Anata gata wa 'Osanago, chi nomi gotachi no kuchi nisan bi o sonaerareta' to aru no o yonda koto ga nai no ka".
Sore kara, Iesu wa karera o ato ni nokoshi, miyako o dete Betaniya ni iki, soko de yo o sugosareta.
Asa wa yakumiyako ni kaeru toki, Iesu wa kuufuku o oboerareta.
Soshite, michi no katawara ni ichipon no ichijiku no ki ga aru no o mite, soko ni ikaretaga, tada ha no hoka wa nani mo miataranakatta. Soko de sono ki ni mukatte, "Ima kara nochi itsu made mo, omae ni wa mi ga naranai you ni" to iwareta. Suruto, ichijiku no ki wa tachimachi kareta.
Deshitachi wa kore o mite, odoroite itta, "Ichijiku ga dou shite, kou sugu ni kareta no deshou".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Moshi anata gata ga shinjite utagawanainaraba, kono ichijiku ni atta you na koto ga, dekiru bakari de naku, kono yama ni mukatte, ugoki dashite umi no naka ni haire to itte mo, sono toori ni narude arou.
Mata, inori no toki, shinjite motomeru mono wa, mina ataerarerude arou".
Iesu ga miya ni wa irareta toki, saishichou tachi ya tami no chouroutachi ga, sono oshiete orareru tokoro ni kite itta, "Nani no ken'i ni yotte, korera no koto o suru no desu ka. Dare ga, sou suru ken'i o sazuketa no desu ka".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi mo hitotsu dake tazuneyou. Anata gata ga sore ni kotaete kuretanara, watashi mo, nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no ka, anata gata ni iou.
Yohane no baputesuma wa doko kara kita no de atta ka. Ten kara de atta ka, hito kara de atta ka". Suruto, karera wa tagai ni ronjite itta, "Moshi ten kara da to ieba, de wa, naze kare o shinjinakatta no ka, to Iesu wa iudarou.
Shikashi, moshi hito kara da to ieba, gunshuu ga osoroshii. Hitobito ga mina Yohane o yogensha to omotte iru no dakara".
Soko de karera wa, "Watashitachi ni wa wakarimasen" to kotaeta. Suruto, Iesu ga iwareta, "Watashi mo nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no ka, anata gata ni iumai.
Anata gata wa dou omou ka. Aru hito ni futari no ko ga attaga, ani no tokoro ni itte itta, 'Ko yo, kyou, budouen e itte hataraite kure'.
Suruto kare wa 'Otousan, mairimasu' to kotaetaga, ikanakatta.
Mata otouto no tokoro ni kite onaji you ni itta. Kare wa 'Iya desu' to kotaetaga, ato kara kokoro o kaete, dekaketa.
Kono futari no uchi, dochira ga chichi no nozomi doori ni shita no ka". Karera wa itta, "Ato no mono desu". Iesu wa iwareta, "Yoku kiki nasai. Shuzeinin ya yuujo wa, anata ga tayori saki ni kami no kuni ni hairu.
To iu no wa, Yohane ga anata gata no tokoro ni kite, gi no michi o toita no ni, anata gata wa kare o shinjinakatta. Tokoro ga, shuzeinin ya yuujo wa kare o shinjita. Anata gata wa sore o mita no ni, ato ni natte mo, kokoro o ire kaete kare o shinjiyou to shinakatta.
Mou hitotsu no tatoe o kiki nasai. Aru tokoro ni, hitori no ie no shujin ga itaga, budouen o tsukuri, kaki o megurashi, sono naka ni saka bune no ana o hori, yagura o tate, sore o noufutachi ni kashite, tabi ni dekaketa.
Shuukaku no kisetsu ga kita no de, sono wakemae o uketorou to shite, shimobetachi o noufu no tokoro e okutta.
Suruto, noufutachi wa, sono shimobetachi o tsukamaete, hitori o fukurodataki ni shi, hitori o koroshi, mou hitori o ishi de uchikoroshita.
Mata betsu ni, mae yori mo ooku no shimobetachi o okuttaga, karera o mo onaji you ni ashiratta.
Shikashi, saigo ni, watashi no ko wa uyamatte kurerudarou to omotte, shujin wa sono ko o karera no tokoro ni tsukawashita.
Suruto noufutachi wa, sono ko o mite tagai ni itta, 'Are wa ato tori da. Saa, kore o koroshite, sono zaisan o te ni ireyou'.
Soshite kare o tsukamaete, budouen no soto ni hikidashite koroshita.
Kono budouen no shujin ga kaette kitara, kono noufutachi o dou surudarou ka".
Karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Akunindomo o, minagoroshi ni shite, kisetsugoto ni shuukaku o osameru hoka no noufutachi ni, sono budouen o kashiataerudeshou".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, seisho de mada yonda koto ga nai no ka, 'Ietsukurira no suteta ishi ga sumi no kashira ishi ni natta. Kore wa Shu ga nasareta koto de, watashitachi no me ni wa fushigi ni mieru'.
Sore dakara, anata gata ni iuga, kami no kuni wa anata gata kara toriagerarete, mikuni ni fusawashii mi o musubu you na ihoujin ni ataerarerude arou.
Mata sono ishi no ue ni ochiru mono wa uchikudakare, sore ga dare ka no ue ni ochikakarunara, sono hito wa kona mijin ni sarerude arou".
Saishichou tachi ya Parisaibitotachi ga kono tatoe o kiita toki, jibuntachi no koto o sashite itte orareru koto o satotta no de,
Iesu o toraeyou to shitaga, gunshuu o osoreta. Gunshuu wa Iesu o yogensha da to omotte itakara de aru.
Iesu wa mata, tatoe de karera ni katatte iwareta,
"Tengoku wa, hitori no ou ga sono ouji no tame ni, kon en o moyoosu you na mono de aru.
Ou wa sono shimobetachi o tsukawashite, kono kon en ni manekarete ita hitotachi o yobasetaga, sono hitotachi wa koyou to wa shinakatta.
Soko de mata, hoka no shimobetachi o tsukawashite itta, 'Manekareta hitotachi ni ii nasai. Shokuji no youi ga dekimashita. Ushi mo koeta kemono mo hofurarete, subete no youi ga dekimashita. Saa, kon en ni oide kudasai'.
Shikashi, karera wa shiranu kao o shite, hitori wa jibun no hatake ni, hitori wa jibun no shoubai ni dete iki,
Mata hoka no hitobito wa, kono shimobetachi o tsukamaete bujoku o kuwaeta ue, koroshite shimatta.
Soko de ou wa rippuku shi, guntai o okutte sorera no hitogoroshidomo o horoboshi, sono machi o yakiharatta.
Sore kara shimobetachi ni itta, 'Kon en no youi wa dekite iruga, manekarete ita no wa, fusawashiku nai hitobito de atta.
Dakara, machi no oodoori ni dete itte, deatta hito wa dare de mo kon en ni tsurete ki nasai'.
Soko de, shimobetachi wa michi ni dete itte, deau hito wa, akunin de mo zennin de mo mina atsumete kita no de, kon en no seki wa kyaku de ippai ni natta.
Ou wa kyaku o mukaeyou to shite wa itte kitaga, soko ni reifuku o tsukete inai hitori no hito o mite,
Kare ni itta, 'Tomo yo, dou shite anata wa reifuku o tsukenaide, koko ni haitte kita no desu ka'. Shikashi, kare wa damatte ita.
Soko de, ou wa soba no monotachi ni itta, 'Kono mono no teashi o shibatte, soto no kurayami ni houridase. Soko de nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou'.
Manekareru mono wa ooiga, erabareru mono wa sukunai".
Sono toki Parisaibitotachi ga kite, dou ka shite Iesu o kotoba no wana ni kakeyou to, soudan o shita.
Soshite, karera no deshi o, Herodetou no monotachi to tomo ni, Iesu no moto ni tsukawashite iwaseta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa anata ga shinjitsu na kata de atte, shinri ni motozuite kami no michi o oshie, mata, hito ni wakehedate o shinaide, dare o mo habakararenai koto o shitte imasu.
Sore de, anata wa dou omowaremasu ka, kotaete kudasai. Kaizaru ni zeikin o osamete yoideshou ka, ikenaideshou ka".
Iesu wa karera no akui o shitte iwareta, "Gizensha tachi yo, naze watashi o tamesou to suru no ka.
Zei ni osameru kahei o mise nasai". Karera wa denari hitotsu o motte kita.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Kore wa, dare no shouzou, dare no kigou ka".
Karera wa "Kaizaru no desu" to kotaeta. Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore de wa, Kaizaru no mono wa Kaizaru ni, kami no mono wa kami ni kaeshi nasai".
Karera wa kore o kiite kyoutan shi, Iesu o nokoshite tachisatta.
Fukkatsu to iu koto wa nai to shuchou shite ita Sadokaibitotachi ga, sono hi, Iesu no moto ni kite shitsumon shita,
"Sensei, Moose wa kou itte imasu, 'Moshi, aru hito ga ko ga nakute shindanara, sono otouto wa ani no tsuma o metotte, ani no tame ni ko o moukeneba naranai'.
Sate, watashitachi no tokoro ni shichinin no kyoudai ga arimashita. Chounan wa tsuma o metottaga shinde shimai, soshite ko ga nakatta no de, sono tsuma o otouto ni nokoshimashita.
Jinan mo sannan mo, tsuini nananintomo onaji koto ni narimashita.
Saigo ni, sono onna mo shinimashita.
Suru to fukkatsu no toki ni wa, kono onna wa, shichinin no uchi dare no tsuma na no deshou ka. Minna ga kono onna o tsuma ni shita no desuga".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata wa seisho mo kami no chikara mo shiranaikara, omoichigai o shite iru.
Fukkatsu no toki ni wa, karera wa metot tari, to tsui dari suru koto wa nai. Karera wa ten ni iru mitsukai no you na mono de aru.
Mata, shinin no fukkatsu ni tsuite wa, kami ga anata gata ni iwareta kotoba o yonda koto ga nai no ka.
'Watashi wa Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami de aru' to kaite aru. Kami wa shinda mono no kami de wa naku, ikite iru mono no kami de aru".
Gunshuu wa kore o kiite, Iesu no oshie ni odoroita.
Sate, Parisaibitotachi wa, Iesu ga Sadokaibitotachi o iikomerareta to kiite, issho ni atsumatta.
Soshite karera no naka no hitori no rippougakusha ga, Iesu o tamesou to shite shitsumon shita,
"Sensei, rippou no naka de, dono imashime ga ichiban taisetsu na no desu ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, " 'Kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, omoi o tsukushite, Shu naru anata no kami o aiseyo'.
Kore ga ichiban taisetsu na, daiichi no imashime de aru.
Daini mo kore to douyou de aru, 'Jibun o aisuru you ni anata no tonaribito o aiseyo'.
Korera no futatsu no imashime ni, rippou zentai to yogensha to ga, kakatte iru".
Parisaibitotachi ga atsumatte ita toki, Iesu wa karera ni otazune ni natta,
"Anata gata wa Kirisuto o dou omou ka. Dare no ko na no ka". Karera wa "Dabide no ko desu" to kotaeta.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore de wa dou shite, Dabide ga mitama ni kanjite Kirisuto o Shu to yonde iru no ka.
Sunawachi 'Shu wa waga Shu ni oose ni natta, anata no teki o anata no ashimoto ni oku toki made wa, watashi no migi ni zashite i nasai'.
Kono you ni, Dabide jishin ga Kirisuto o Shu to yonde irunara, Kirisuto wa dou shite Dabide no ko de arou ka".
Iesu ni hitokoto de mo kotae uru mono wa, nakattashi, sono hi kara mohaya, susunde Iesu ni shitsumon suru mono mo, inaku natta.
Sono toki Iesu wa, gunshuu to deshitachi to ni katatte iwareta,
"Rippougakusha to Parisaibito to wa, Moose no za ni suwatte iru.
Dakara, karera ga anata gata ni iu koto wa, mina mamotte jikkou shi nasai. Shikashi, karera no suru koto ni wa, narau na. Karera wa iu dake de, jikkou shinaikara.
Mata, omoi nimotsu o kukutte hitobito no kata ni noseruga, sore o ugokasu tame ni, jibun de wa yubi ichipon mo kasou to wa shinai.
Sono suru koto wa, subete hito ni miseru tame de aru. Sunawachi, karera wa kyoufuda o habahiroku tsukuri, sono koromo no fusa o ookiku shi,
Mata, enkai no jouza, kaidou no jouseki o konomi,
Hiroba de aisatsu sareru koto ya, hitobito kara sensei to yobareru koto o kononde iru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa sensei to yobarete wa naranai. Anata gata no sensei wa, tada hitori de atte, anata gata wa mina kyoudai na no dakara.
Mata, chijou no dare o mo, chichi to yonde wa naranai. Anata gata no chichi wa tada hitori, sunawachi, ten ni imasu chichi de aru.
Mata, anata gata wa kyoushi to yobarete wa naranai. Anata gata no kyoushi wa tada hitori, sunawachi, Kirisuto de aru.
Soko de, anata gata no uchi de ichiban erai mono wa, tsukaeru hito de nakereba naranai.
Dare de mo jibun o takaku suru mono wa hikuku sare, jibun o hikuku suru mono wa takaku sarerude arou.
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa, tengoku o tozashite hitobito o hairasenai. Jibun mo hairanaishi, hairou to suru hito o hairase mo shinai. []
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa, yamometachi no ie o kuitaoshi, mie no tame ni nagai inori o suru. Dakara, motto kibishii sabaki o ukeru ni chigai nai.]
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa hitori no kaishuusha o tsukuru tame ni, umi to riku to o meguriaruku. Soshite, tsukuttanara, kare o jibun yori bai mo hidoi jigoku no ko ni suru.
Moumoku na annaishatachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa iu, 'Shinden o sashite chikaunara, sono mama de yoiga, shinden no kogane o sashite chikaunara, hatasu sekinin ga aru' to.
Oroka na moumoku na hitotachi yo. Kogane to, kogane o shinsei ni suru shinden to, dochira ga daiji na no ka.
Mata, anata gata wa iu, 'Saidan o sashite chikaunara, sono mama de yoiga, sono ue no sonaemono o sashite chikaunara, hatasu sekinin ga aru' to.
Moumoku na hitotachi yo. Sonaemono to sonaemono o shinsei ni suru saidan to dochira ga daiji na no ka.
Saidan o sashite chikau mono wa, saidan to, sono ue ni aru subete no mono to o sashite chikau no de aru.
Shinden o sashite chikau mono wa, shinden to sono naka ni sunde orareru kata to o sashite chikau no de aru.
Mata, ten o sashite chikau mono wa, kami no miza to sono ue ni suwatte orareru kata to o sashite chikau no de aru.
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Hakka, inondo, Kumin nado no yakumi no juubun no ichi o miya ni osamete orinagara, rippou no naka de motto juuyou na, kouhei to awaremi to chuujitsu to o minogashite iru. Sore mo shinakereba naranaiga, kore mo minogashite wa naranai.
Moumoku na annaishatachi yo. Anata gata wa, buyo wa koshite iruga, rakuda wa nomikonde iru.
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Sakazuki to sara to no sotogawa wa kiyomeruga, uchigawa wa don'yoku to houjuu to de michite iru.
Moumoku na Parisaibito yo. Mazu, sakazuki no uchigawa o kiyomeru ga yoi. Sou sureba, sotogawa mo kiyoku narude arou.
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa shiroku nutta haka ni nite iru. Sotogawa wa utsukushiku mieruga, uchigawa wa shinin no hone ya, arayuru fuketsu na mono de ippai de aru.
Kono you ni anata gata mo, sotogawa wa hito ni tadashiku mieruga, uchigawa wa gizen to fuhou to de ippai de aru.
Gizen na rippougakusha, Parisaibitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Anata gata wa yogensha no haka o tate, gijin no hi o kazaritatete, kou itte iru,
'Moshi watashitachi ga senzo no jidai ni ikite itanara, yogensha no chi o nagasu koto ni kuwawatte wa inakattadarou' to.
Kono you ni shite, anata gata wa yogensha o koroshita mono no shison de aru koto o, jibun de shoumei shite iru.
Anata gata mo mata senzotachi ga shita aku no masume o mitasu ga yoi.
Hebi yo, mamushi no kora yo, dou shite jigoku no keibatsu o nogareru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Sore dakara, watashi wa, yogensha, chisha, rippougakusha tachi o anata gata ni tsukawasuga, sono uchi no aru mono o koroshi, mata juujika ni tsuke, sono aru mono o kaidou de muchiuchi, mata machi kara machi e to hakugai shite ikude arou.
Kou shite gijin Aberu no chi kara, seijo to saidan to no aida de anata gata ga koroshita Barakiya no ko Zakariya no chi ni itaru made, chijou ni nagasareta gijin no chi no mukui ga, kotogotoku anata gata ni oyobude arou.
Yoku itte oku. Korera no koto no mukui wa, mina ima no jidai ni oyobude arou.
Aa, Erusaremu, Erusaremu, yogensha tachi o koroshi, omae ni tsukawasareta hitotachi o ishi de uchikorosu mono yo. Choudo, mendori ga tsubasa no shita ni sono hina o atsumeru you ni, watashi wa omae no kora o iku tabi atsumeyou to shita koto de arou. Sore da no ni, omaetachi wa oujiyou to shinakatta.
Miyo, omaetachi no ie wa misuterarete shimau.
Watashi wa itte oku, 'Shu no mina ni yotte kitaru mono ni, shukufuku are' to omaetachi ga iu toki made wa, kongo futatabi, watashi ni au koto wa naide arou".
Iesu ga miya kara dete ikou to shite orareruto, deshitachi wa chikayotte kite, miya no tatemono ni Iesu no chuui o unagashita.
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni mukatte iwareta, "Anata gata wa, korera subete no mono o minai ka. Yoku itte oku. Sono ishi hitotsu de mo kuzusarezu ni, soko ni ta no ishi no ue ni nokoru koto mo nakunarude arou".
Mata oribuyama de suwatte orareruto, deshitachi ga, hisoka ni mimoto ni kite itta, "Douzo ohanashi kudasai. Itsu, sonna koto ga okoru no deshou ka. Anata ga mata oide ni naru toki ya, yo no owari ni wa, donna zenchou ga arimasu ka".
Soko de Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Hito ni madowasarenai you ni ki o tsuke nasai.
Ooku no mono ga watashi no na o nanotte araware, jibun ga Kirisuto da to itte, ooku no hito o madowasude arou.
Mata, sensou to sensou no uwasa to o kikude arou. Chuui shite i nasai, awatete wa ikenai. Sore wa okoraneba naranaiga, mada owari de wa nai.
Tami wa tami ni, kuni wa kuni ni tekitai shite tachiagarude arou. Mata achikochi ni, kikin ga okori, mata jishin ga arude arou.
Shikashi, subete korera wa umi no kurushimi no hajime de aru.
Sono toki hitobito wa, anatagata o kurushimi ni awase, mata korosude arou. Mata anata gata wa, watashi no na no yue ni subete no tami ni nikumarerude arou.
Sono toki, ooku no hito ga tsumazuki, mata tagai ni uragiri, nikumiaude arou.
Mata ooku no nise yogensha ga okotte, ooku no hito o madowasude arou.
Mata fuhou ga habikoru no de, ooku no hito no ai ga hierude arou.
Shikashi, saigo made taeshinobu mono wa sukuwareru.
Soshite kono mikuni no fukuin wa, subete no tami ni taishite akashi o suru tame ni, zensekai ni nobetsutaerarerude arou. Soshite sore kara saigo ga kuru no de aru.
Yogensha Danieru ni yotte iwareta arasu nikumubeki mono ga, sei naru basho ni tatsu no o mitanaraba (dokusha yo, satore),
Sono toki, Yudaya ni iru hitobito wa yama e nige yo.
Okujou ni iru mono wa, ie kara mono o toridasou to shite shita ni oriru na.
Hatake ni iru mono wa, uwagi o tori ni ato e modoru na.
Sono hi ni wa, miomo no onna to chinomi go o motsu onna to wa, fukou de aru.
Anata gata no nigeru no ga, fuyu mata wa ansokunichi ni naranai you ni inore.
Sono toki ni wa, yo no hajime kara genzai ni itaru made, katsute naku kongo mo nai you na ookina kannan ga okorukara de aru.
Moshi sono kikan ga chijimerarenainara, sukuwareru mono wa hitori mo naide arou. Shikashi, senmin no tame ni wa, sono kikan ga chijimerarerude arou.
Sono toki, dare ka ga anata gata ni 'Miyo, koko ni Kirisuto ga iru', mata, 'Asoko ni iru' to itte mo, sore o shinjiru na.
Nise Kirisutotachi ya, nise yogensha tachi ga okotte, ooinaru shirushi to kiseki to o okonai, dekireba, senmin o mo madowasou to surude arou.
Miyo, anata gata ni mae motte itte oku.
Dakara, hitobito ga 'Miyo, kare wa arano ni iru' to itte mo, dete iku na. Mata 'Miyo, heya no naka ni iru' to itte mo, shinjiru na.
Choudo, inazuma ga higashi kara nishi ni hirameki wataru you ni, hito no ko mo arawarerude arou.
Shitai no aru tokoro ni wa, hagetaka ga atsumaru mono de aru.
Shikashi, sono toki ni okoru kannan no nochi, tachimachi hi wa kuraku nari, tsuki wa sono hikari o hanatsu koto o yame, hoshi wa sora kara ochi, tentai wa yuriugokasarerude arou.
Sono toki, hito no ko no shirushi ga ten ni arawarerude arou. Mata sono toki, chi no subete no minzoku wa nageki, soshite chikara to ooinaru eikou to o motte, hito no ko ga ten no kumo ni notte kuru no o, hitobito wa mirude arou.
Mata, kare wa ooinaru rappa no oto to tomo ni mitsukai tachi o tsukawashite, ten no hate kara hate ni itaru made, shihou kara sono senmin o yobiatsumerude arou.
Ichijiku no ki kara kono tatoe o manabi nasai. Sono eda ga yawaraka ni nari, ha ga deru you ni naruto, natsu no chikai koto ga wakaru.
Sono you ni, subete korera no koto o mitanaraba, hito no ko ga toguchi made chikazuite iru to shiri nasai.
Yoku kiite oki nasai. Korera no koto ga, kotogotoku okoru made wa, kono jidai wa horobiru koto ga nai.
Tenchi wa horobirude arou. Shikashi watashi no kotoba wa horobiru koto ga nai.
Sono hi, sono toki wa, dare mo shiranai. Ten no mitsukai tachi mo, mata ko mo shiranai, tada chichi dake ga shitte orareru.
Hito no ko no arawareru no mo, choudo Noa no toki no you de arou.
Sunawachi, kouzui no deru mae, Noa ga hakobune ni wa iru hi made, hitobito wa kui, nomi, metori, to tsugi nado shite ita.
Soshite kouzui ga osotte kite, issai no mono o saratte iku made, karera wa ki ga tsukanakatta. Hito no ko no arawareru no mo, sono you de arou.
Sono toki, futari no mono ga hatake ni iruto, hitori wa torisarare, hitori wa torinokosarerude arou.
Futari no onna ga usu o hiite iruto, hitori wa torisarare, hitori wa nokosarerude arou.
Dakara, me o samashite i nasai. Itsu no hi ni anata gata no Shu ga korareru no ka, anata gata ni wa, wakaranaikara de aru.
Kono koto o wakimaete iru ga yoi. Ie no shujin wa, touzoku ga itsugoro kuru ka wakatte irunara, me o samashite ite, jibun no ie ni oshiiru koto o yurusanaide arou.
Dakara, anata gata mo youi o shite i nasai. Omoigakenai toki ni hito no ko ga kurukara de aru.
Shujin ga sono ie no shimobetachi no ue ni tatete, toki ni oujite shokumotsu o sonaesaseru chuujitsu na shiryo bukai shimobe wa, ittai, dare de arou.
Shujin ga kaette kita toki, sono you ni tsutomete iru no o mirareru shimobe wa, saiwai de aru.
Yoku itte okuga, shujin wa kare o tatete jibun no zenzaisan o kanri saserude arou.
Moshi sore ga warui shimobe de atte, jibun no shujin wa kaeri ga osoi to kokoro no naka de omoi,
Sono shimobe nakama o tataki hajime, mata sakenomi nakama to issho ni tabe tari non dari shite irunara,
Sono shimobe no shujin wa omoigakenai hi, ki ga tsukanai toki ni kaette kite,
Kare o genbatsu ni shoshi, gizensha tachi to onaji me ni awaserude arou. Kare wa soko de nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou.
Soko de tengoku wa, juunin no otome ga sorezore akari o te ni shite, hanamuko o mukae ni dete iku no ni nite iru.
Sono naka no gonin wa shiryo ga asaku, gonin wa shiryo bukai mono de atta.
Shiryo no asai monotachi wa, akari wa motte itaga, abura o youi shite inakatta.
Shikashi, shiryo bukai monotachi wa, jibuntachi no akari to issho ni, iremono no naka ni abura o youi shite ita.
Hanamuko no kuru no ga okureta no de, karera wa mina inemuri o shite, nete shimatta.
Yonaka ni, 'Saa, hanamuko da, mukae ni de nasai' to yobu koe ga shita.
Sono toki, otometachi wa mina okite, sorezore akari o totonoeta.
Tokoro ga, shiryo no asai onnatachi ga, shiryo bukai onnatachi ni itta, 'Anata gata no abura o watashitachi ni wakete kudasai. Watashitachi no akari ga kie kakatte imasukara'.
Suruto, shiryo bukai onnatachi wa kotaete itta, 'Watashitachi to anata ga tato ni tariru dake wa, tabun naideshou. Mise ni itte, anata gata no fun o okai ni naru hou ga yoideshou'.
Karera ga kai ni dete iru uchi ni, hanamuko ga tsuita. Soko de, youi no dekite ita onnatachi wa, hanamuko to issho ni kon en no heya ni hairi, soshite to ga shimerareta.
Sono ato de, hoka no otometachi mo kite, 'Goshujinsama, goshujinsama, douzo, akete kudasai' to itta.
Shikashi kare wa kotaete, 'Hakkiri iuga, watashi wa anatagata o shiranai' to itta.
Dakara, me o samashite i nasai. Sono hi sono toki ga, anata gata ni wa wakaranaikara de aru.
Mata tengoku wa, aru hito ga tabi ni deru toki, sono shimobedomo o yonde, jibun no zaisan o azukeru you na mono de aru.
Sunawachi, sorezore no nouryoku ni oujite, aru mono ni wa go taranto, aru mono ni wa ni taranto, aru mono ni wa ichi taranto o ataete, tabi ni deta.
Go taranto o watasareta mono wa, sugu ni itte, sore de shoubai o shite, hoka ni go taranto o mouketa.
Ni taranto no mono mo douyou ni shite, hoka ni ni taranto o mouketa.
Shikashi, ichi taranto o watasareta mono wa, itte chi o hori, shujin no kane o kakushite oita.
Daibu toki ga tatte kara, korera no shimobe no shujin ga kaette kite, karera to keisan o shi hajimeta.
Suruto go taranto o watasareta mono ga susumidete, hoka no go taranto o sashidashite itta, 'Goshujinsama, anata wa watashi ni go taranto o oazuke ni narimashitaga, goran no toori, hoka ni go taranto o moukemashita'.
Shujin wa kare ni itta, 'Yoi chuujitsu na shimobe yo, yoku yatta. Anata wa wazuka na mono ni chuujitsu de attakara, ooku no mono o kanri saseyou. Shujin to issho ni yorokonde kure'.
Ni taranto no mono mo susumidete itta, 'Goshujinsama, anata wa watashi ni ni taranto o oazuke ni narimashitaga, goran no toori, hoka ni ni taranto o moukemashita'.
Shujin wa kare ni itta, 'Yoi chuujitsu na shimobe yo, yoku yatta. Anata wa wazuka na mono ni chuujitsu de attakara, ooku no mono o kanri saseyou. Shujin to issho ni yorokonde kure'.
Ichi taranto o watasareta mono mo susumidete itta, 'Goshujinsama, watashi wa anata ga, makanaitokoro kara kari, chirasanai tokoro kara atsumeru koku na hito de aru koto o shouchi shite imashita.
Soko de osoroshisa no amari, itte, anata no taranto o chi no naka ni kakushite okimashita. Goran kudasai. Koko ni anata no okane ga gozaimasu'.
Suruto, shujin wa kare ni kotaete itta, 'Warui taida na shimobe yo, anata wa watashi ga, makanaitokoro kara kari, chirasanai tokoro kara atsumeru koto o shitte iru no ka.
Sore nara, watashi no kane o ginkou ni azukete okubekide atta. Sou shitara, watashi wa kaette kite, rishi to issho ni watashi no kane o kaeshite moraetade arou ni.
Saa, sono taranto o kono mono kara toriagete, juu taranto o motte iru mono ni yari nasai.
Ooyoso, motte iru hito wa ataerarete, iyoiyo yutaka ni naruga, motte inai hito wa, motte iru mono made mo toriagerarerude arou.
Kono yaku ni tatanai shimobe o soto no kurai tokoro ni oidasu ga yoi. Kare wa, soko de nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou'.
Hito no ko ga eikou no naka ni subete no mitsukai tachi o shitagaete kuru toki, kare wa sono eikou no za ni tsukude arou.
Soshite, subete no kokumin o sono mae ni atsumete, hitsujikai ga hitsuji to yagi to o wakeru you ni, karera o yoriwake,
Hitsuji o migi ni, yagi o hidari ni oku de arou.
Sono toki, ou wa migi ni iru hitobito ni iude arou, 'Watashi no chichi ni shukufuku sareta hitotachi yo, saa, yo no hajime kara anata gata no tame ni youi sarete iru mikuni o uketsugi nasai.
Anata gata wa, watashi ga kuufuku no toki ni tabesase, kawaite ita toki ni nomase, tabibito de atta toki ni yado o kashi,
Hadaka de atta toki ni kise, byouki no toki ni mimai, goku ni ita toki ni tazunete kuretakara de aru'.
Sono toki, tadashii monotachi wa kotaete iude arou, 'Shu yo, itsu, watashitachi wa, anata ga kuufuku de aru no o mite shokumotsu o megumi, kawaite iru no o mite nomasemashita ka.
Itsu anata ga tabibito de aru no o mite yado o kashi, hadaka na no o mite kisemashita ka.
Mata, itsu anata ga byouki o shi, goku ni iru no o mite, anata no tokoro ni mairimashita ka'.
Suruto, ou wa kotaete iude arou, 'Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Watashi no kyoudai de aru korera no mottomo chiisai mono no hitori ni shita no wa, sunawachi, watashi ni shita no de aru'.
Sore kara, hidari ni iru hitobito ni mo iude arou, 'Norowareta monodomo yo, watashi o hanarete, akuma to sono tsukaitachi to no tame ni youi sarete iru eien no hi ni haitte shimae.
Anata gata wa, watashi ga kuufuku no toki ni tabesasezu, kawaite ita toki ni nomasezu,
Tabibito de atta toki ni yado o kasazu, hadaka de atta toki ni kisezu, mata byouki no toki ya, goku ni ita toki ni, watashi o tazunete kurenakattakara de aru'.
Sono toki, karera mo mata kotaete iude arou, 'Shu yo, itsu, anata ga kuufuku de ari, kawaite orare, tabibito de ari, hadaka de ari, byouki de ari, goku ni orareta no o mite, watashitachi wa osewa o shimasendeshita ka'.
Sono toki, kare wa kotaete iude arou, 'Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Korera no mottomo chiisai mono no hitori ni shinakatta no wa, sunawachi, watashi ni shinakatta no de aru'.
Soshite karera wa eien no keibatsu o uke, tadashii mono wa eien no seimei ni irude arou".
Iesu wa korera no kotoba o subete katari oete kara, deshitachi ni iwareta.
"Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, futsu ka no nochi ni wa sugikoshi no matsuri ni naruga, hito no ko wa juujika ni tsukerareru tame ni hikiwatasareru".
Sono toki, saishichou tachi ya tami no chouroutachi ga, Kayapa to iu daisaishi no nakaniwa ni atsumari,
Sakuryaku o motte Iesu o toraete korosou to soudan shita.
Shikashi karera wa itta, "Matsuri no aida wa ikenai. Minshuu no naka ni sawagi ga okoru ka mo shirenai".
Sate, Iesu ga Betaniya de, raibyounin Shimon no ie ni orareta toki,
Hitori no onna ga, kouka na kouyu ga irete aru sekkou no tsubo o motte kite, Iesu ni chikayori, shokuji no seki ni tsuite orareta Iesu no atama ni kouyu o sosogi kaketa.
Suruto, deshitachi wa kore o mite ikidootte itta, "Nan no tame ni konna mudazukai o suru no ka.
Sore o takaku utte, mazushii hitotachi ni hodokosu koto ga dekita no ni".
Iesu wa sore o kiite karera ni iwareta, "Naze, onna o komaraseru no ka. Watashi ni yoi koto o shite kureta no da.
Mazushii hitotachi wa itsu mo anata gata to issho ni iruga, watashi wa itsu mo issho ni iru wake de wa nai.
Kono onna ga watashi no karada ni kono kouyu o sosoida no wa, watashi no houmuri no youi o suru tame de aru.
Yoku kiki nasai. Zensekai no doko de de mo, kono fukuin ga nobetsutaerareru tokoro de wa, kono onna no shita koto mo kinen to shite katararerude arou".
Toki ni, juu ni deshi no hitori Isukariote no Yuda to iu mono ga, saishichou tachi no tokoro ni itte
Itta, "Kare o anata gata ni hikiwataseba, ikura kudasaimasu ka". Suruto, karera wa ginka sanjuumai o kare ni shiharatta.
Sono toki kara, Yuda wa Iesu o hikiwatasou to, kikai o neratte ita.
Sate, jokousai no daiichi nichi ni, deshitachi wa Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Sugikoshi no shokuji o nasaru tame ni, watashitachi wa doko ni youi o shitara yoideshou ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Shinai ni hairi, kanete hanashite aru hito no tokoro ni itte ii nasai, 'Sensei ga, watashi no toki ga chikazuita, anata no ie de deshitachi to issho ni sugikoshi o mamorouto, itte oraremasu' ".
Deshitachi wa Iesu ga meijirareta toori ni shite, sugikoshi no youi o shita.
Yuugata ni natte, Iesu wa juu ni deshi to issho ni shokuji no seki ni tsukareta.
Soshite, ichidou ga shokuji o shite iru toki iwareta, "Tokuni anata gata ni itte okuga, anata gata no uchi no hitori ga, watashi o uragirou to shite iru".
Deshitachi wa hijou ni shinpai shite, tsugitsugi ni "Shu yo, masaka, watashi de wa naideshou" to ii dashita.
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Watashi to issho ni onaji hachi ni te o irete iru mono ga, watashi o uragirou to shite iru.
Tashika ni hito no ko wa, jibun ni tsuite kaite aru toori ni satte iku. Shikashi, hito no ko o uragiru sono hito wa, wazawai de aru. Sono hito wa umarenakatta hou ga, kare no tame ni yokattade arou".
Iesu o uragitta Yuda ga kotaete itta, "Sensei, masaka, watashi de wa naideshou". Iesu wa iwareta, "Iya, anata da".
Ichidou ga shokuji o shite iru toki, Iesu wa pan o tori, shukufuku shite kore o saki, deshitachi ni ataete iwareta, "Totte tabeyo, kore wa watashi no karada de aru".
Mata sakazuki o tori, kansha shite karera ni ataete iwareta, "Mina, kono sakazuki kara nome.
Kore wa, tsumi no yurushi o esaseru you ni to, ooku no hito no tame ni nagasu watashi no keiyaku no chi de aru.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Watashi no chichi no kuni de anata gata to tomo ni, atarashiku nomu sono hi made wa, watashi wa kongo kesshite, budou no mi kara tsukutta mono o nomu koto o shinai".
Karera wa,san bi o utatta nochi, oribuyama e dekakete itta.
Sono toki, Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Kon'ya, anata gata wa mina watashi ni tsumazukude arou. 'Watashi wa hitsujikai o utsu. Soshite, hitsuji no mure wa chirasarerude arou' to, kaite arukara de aru.
Shikashi watashi wa, yomigaette kara, anata ga tayori saki ni Gariraya e ikude arou".
Suru to Petero wa Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Tatoi, minna no mono ga anata ni tsumazuite mo, watashi wa kesshite tsumazukimasen".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yoku anata ni itte oku. Kon'ya, niwatori ga naku mae ni, anata wa san do watashi o shiranai to iudarou".
Petero wa itta, "Tatoi anata to issho ni shinaneba naranaku natte mo, anata o shiranai nado to wa, kesshite moushimasen". Deshitachi mo mina onaji you ni itta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa karera to issho ni, Getsusemane to iu tokoro e ikareta. Soshite deshitachi ni iwareta, "Watashi ga mukou e itte inotte iru aida, koko ni suwatte i nasai".
Soshite Petero to Zebedai no ko futari to o tsurete ikaretaga, kanashimi o moyooshi mata nayami hajimerareta.
Sono toki, karera ni iwareta, "Watashi wa kanashimi no amari shinu hodo de aru. Koko ni matte ite, watashi to issho ni me o samashite i nasai".
Soshite sukoshi susunde iki, utsubushi ni nari, inotte iwareta, "Waga chichi yo, moshi dekiru koto deshitara dou ka, kono sakazuki o watashi kara sugisarasete kudasai. Shikashi, watashi no omoi no mama ni de wa naku, mikokoro no mama ni nasatte kudasai".
Sore kara, deshitachi no tokoro ni kite goran ni naruto, karera ga nemutte ita no de, Petero ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa sonna ni, hitotoki mo watashi to issho ni me o samashite iru koto ga, dekinakatta no ka.
Yuuwaku ni ochiiranai you ni, me o samashite inotte i nasai. Kokoro wa nesshite iruga, nikutai ga yowai no de aru".
Mata ni dome ni itte, inotte iwareta, "Waga chichi yo, kono sakazuki o nomu hoka ni michi ga nai no deshitara, dou ka, mikokoro ga okonawaremasu you ni".
Mata kite goran ni naruto, karera wa mata nemutte ita. Sono me ga omoku natte ita no de aru.
Sore de karera o sono mama ni shite, mata itte, san dome ni onaji kotoba de inorareta.
Sore kara deshitachi no tokoro ni kaette kite, iwareta, "Mada nemutte iru no ka, yasunde iru no ka. Miyo, toki ga sematta. Hito no ko wa tsumibitora no te ni watasareru no da.
Tate, saa ikou. Miyo, watashi o uragiru mono ga chikazuite kita".
Soshite, Iesu ga mada hanashite orareru uchi ni, soko ni, juu ni deshi no hitori no Yuda ga kita. Mata saishichou, tami no chouroutachi kara okurareta oozei no gunshuu mo, ken to bou to o motte kare ni tsuite kita.
Iesu o uragitta mono ga, arakajime karera ni, "Watashi no seppun suru mono ga, sono hito da. Sono hito o tsukamaero" to aizu o shite oita.
Kare wa sugu Iesu ni chikayori, "Sensei, ikaga desu ka" to itte, Iesu ni seppun shita.
Shikashi, Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Tomo yo, nan no tame ni kita no ka". Kono toki, hitobito ga susumiyotte, Iesu ni te o kakete tsukamaeta.
Suruto, Iesu to issho ni ita mono no hitori ga, te o nobashite ken o nuki, soshite daisaishi no shimobe ni kiri kakatte, sono katamimi o kiriotoshita.
Soko de, Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata no ken o moto no tokoro ni osame nasai. Ken o toru mono wa mina, ken de horobiru.
Sore to mo, watashi ga chichi ni negatte, ten no tsukaitachi o juu ni gundan ijou mo, ima tsukawashite itadaku koto ga dekinaito, anata wa omou no ka.
Shikashi, sore de wa, kou naraneba naranai to kaite aru seisho no kotoba wa, dou shite jouju sareyou ka".
Sono toki, Iesu wa gunshuu ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa goutou ni mukau you ni, ken ya bou o motte watashi o torae ni kita no ka. Watashi wa mainichi, miya de suwatte oshiete ita no ni, watashi o tsukamae wa shinakatta.
Shikashi, subete kou natta no wa, yogensha tachi no kaita koto ga, jouju suru tame de aru". Sono toki, deshitachi wa mina Iesu o misutete nigesatta.
Sate, Iesu o tsukamaeta hitotachi wa, daisaishi Kayapa no tokoro ni Iesu o tsurete itta. Soko ni wa rippougakusha, chouroutachi ga atsumatte ita.
Petero wa tooku kara Iesu ni tsuite, daisaishi no nakaniwa made iki, sono nariyuki o mitodokeru tame ni, naka ni haitte shitayakudomo to issho ni suwatte ita.
Sate, saishichou tachi to zengikai to wa, Iesu o shikei ni suru tame, Iesu ni furi na gishou o motomeyou to shite ita.
Soko de ooku no gishousha ga dete kitaga, shouko ga agaranakatta. Shikashi, saigo ni futari no mono ga dete kite
Itta, "Kono hito wa, watashi wa kami no miya o uchikowashi, mikka no nochi ni tateru koto ga dekiru, to iimashita".
Suruto, daisaishi ga tachiagatte Iesu ni itta, "Nani mo kotaenai no ka. Korera no hitobito ga anata ni taishite furi na shougen o moushitatete iruga, dou na no ka".
Shikashi, Iesu wa damatte orareta. Soko de daisaishi wa itta, "Anata wa kami no ko Kirisuto na no ka dou ka, ikeru kami ni chikatte wareware ni kotaeyo".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata no iu toori de aru. Shikashi, watashi wa itte oku. Anata gata wa, ma mo naku, hito no ko ga chikara aru mono no migi ni zashi, ten no kumo ni notte kuru no o mirude arou".
Suruto, daisaishi wa sono koromo o hikisaite itta, "Kare wa kami o kegashita. Dou shite kore ijou, shounin no hitsuyou ga arou. Anata gata wa ima kono kega shi goto o kiita.
Anata gata no iken wa dou ka". Suruto, karera wa kotaete itta, "Kare wa shi ni ataru mono da".
Sore kara, karera wa Iesu no kao ni tsubaki o kakete, kobushi de uchi, mata aru hito wa tenohira de tataite itta,
"Kirisuto yo, iiatete miyo, utta no wa dare ka".
Petero wa soto de nakaniwa ni suwatte ita. Suruto hitori no jochuu ga kare no tokoro ni kite, "Anata mo ano Garirayabito Iesu to issho datta" to itta.
Suru to Petero wa, minna no mae de sore o uchikeshite itta, "Anata ga nani o itte iru no ka, wakaranai".
Sou itte iriguchi no hou ni dete ikuto, hoka no jochuu ga kare o mite, soko ni iru hitobito ni mukatte, "Kono hito wa Nazarebito Iesu to issho datta" to itta.
Soko de kare wa futatabi sore o uchikeshite, "Sonna hito wa shiranai" to chikatte itta.
Shibaraku shite, soko ni tatte ita hitobito ga chikayotte kite, Petero ni itta, "Tashika ni anata mo karera no nakama da. Kotobazukai de anata no koto ga wakaru".
Kare wa "Sono hito no koto wa nani mo shiranai" to itte, hageshiku chikai hajimeta. Suruto sugu niwatori ga naita.
Petero wa "Niwatori ga naku mae ni, san do watashi o shiranai to iude arou" to iwareta Iesu no kotoba o omoidashi, soto ni dete hageshiku naita.
Yo ga akeruto, saishichou tachi, tami no chouroutachi ichidou wa, Iesu o korosou to shite kyougi o korashita ue,
Iesu o shibatte hikidashi, soutoku Pirato ni watashita.
Sono toki, Iesu o uragitta Yuda wa, Iesu ga tsumi ni sadamerareta no o mite koukai shi, ginka sanjuumai o saishichou, chouroutachi ni kaeshite
Itta, "Watashi wa tsumi no nai hito no chi o uru you na koto o shite, tsumi o okashimashita". Shikashi karera wa itta, "Sore wa, wareware no shitta koto ka. Jibun de shimatsu suru ga yoi".
Soko de, kare wa ginka o seijo ni nagekonde dete iki, kubi o tsutte shinda.
Saishichou tachi wa, sono ginka o hiroiagete itta, "Kore wa chi no daika dakara, miya no kinko ni ireru no wa yoku nai".
Soko de karera wa kyougi no ue, gaikokuhito no bochi ni suru tame ni, sono kane de toukishi no hatake o katta.
Sono tame ni, kono hatake wa kyou made chi no hatake to yobarete iru.
Kou shite yogensha Eremiya ni yotte iwareta kotoba ga, jouju shita no de aru. Sunawachi, "Karera wa, ne o tsukerareta mono, sunawachi, Isuraeru no kora ga ne o tsuketa mono no daika, ginka sanjuu o totte,
Shu ga omeiji ni natta you ni, toukishi no hatake no daika to shite, sono kane o ataeta".
Sate, Iesu wa soutoku no mae ni tatareta. Suruto soutoku wa Iesu ni tazunete itta, "Anata ga Yudayajin no ou de aru ka". Iesu wa "Sono toori de aru" to iwareta.
Shikashi, saishichou, chouroutachi ga uttaete iru aida, Iesu wa hitokoto mo okotae ni naranakatta.
Suru to Pirato wa itta, "Anna ni made tsugitsugi ni, anata ni furi na shougen o tatete iru no ga, anata ni wa kikoenai no ka".
Shikashi, soutoku ga hijou ni fushigi ni omotta hodo ni, Iesu wa nani o iwarete mo, hitokoto mo okotae ni naranakatta.
Sate, matsuri no tabigoto ni, soutoku wa gunshuu ga negaideru shuujin hitori o, yurushite yaru kanrei ni natte ita.
Toki ni, Baraba to iu hyouban no shuujin ga ita.
Sore de, karera ga atsumatta toki, Pirato wa itta, "Omaetachi wa, dare o yurushite hoshii no ka. Baraba ka, sore to mo, Kirisuto to iwareru Iesu ka".
Karera ga Iesu o hikiwatashita no wa, netami no tame de aru koto ga, Pirato ni wa yoku wakatte itakara de aru.
Mata, Pirato ga saiban no seki ni tsuite ita toki, sono tsuma ga hito o kare no moto ni tsukawashite, "Ano gijin ni wa kankei shinaide kudasai. Watashi wa kyou yume de, ano hito no tame ni sanzan kurushimimashitakara" to iwaseta.
Shikashi, saishichou, chouroutachi wa, Baraba o yurushite, Iesu o koroshite morau you ni to, gunshuu o tokifuseta.
Soutoku wa karera ni mukatte itta, "Futari no uchi, dochira o yurushite hoshii no ka". Karera wa "Baraba no hou o" to itta.
Pirato wa itta, "Sore de wa Kirisuto to iwareru Iesu wa, dou shitara yoi ka". Karera wa issei ni "Juujika ni tsukeyo" to itta.
Shikashi, Pirato wa itta, "Ano hito wa, ittai, donna akuji o shita no ka". Suruto karera wa issou hageshiku sakende, "Juujika ni tsukeyo" to itta.
Pirato wa te no tsukeyou ga naku, kaette boudou ni nari sou na no o mite, mizu o tori, gunshuu no mae de te o aratte itta, "Kono hito no chi ni tsuite, watashi ni wa sekinin ga nai. Omaetachi ga jibun de shimatsu o suru ga yoi".
Suruto, minshuu zentai ga kotaete itta, "Sono chi no sekinin wa, wareware to wareware no shison no ue ni kakatte mo yoi".
Soko de, Pirato wa Baraba o yurushite yari, Iesu o muchiutta nochi, juujika ni tsukeru tame ni hikiwatashita.
Sore kara soutoku no heishitachi wa, Iesu o kantei ni tsurete itte, zenbutai o Iesu no mawari ni atsumeta.
Soshite sono uwagi o nugasete, akai gaitou o kise,
Mata, ibara de kanmuri o ande sono atama ni kaburase, migi no te ni wa ashi no bou o motase, sore kara sono mae ni hizamazuki, chourou shite, "Yudayajin no ou, banzai" to itta.
Mata, Iesu ni tsubaki o kake, ashi no bou o toriagete sono atama o tataita.
Kou shite Iesu o chourou shita ageku, gaitou o hagitotte moto no uwagi o kise, sore kara juujika ni tsukeru tame ni hikidashita.
Karera ga dete ikuto, Shimon to iu na no Kurenebito ni deatta no de, Iesu no juujika o muri ni owaseta.
Soshite, Gorugota, sunawachi, sarekoube no ba, to iu tokoro ni kita toki,
Karera wa nigami o mazeta budoushu o nomaseyou to shitaga, Iesu wa sore o nameta dake de, nomou to sarenakatta.
Karera wa Iesu o juujika ni tsukete kara, kuji o hiite, sono kimono o wake,
Soko ni suwatte Iesu no ban o shite ita.
Soshite sono atama no ue no hou ni, "Kore wa Yudayajin no ou Iesu" to kaita zaijougaki o kakageta.
Douji ni, futari no goutou ga Iesu to issho ni, hitori wa migi ni, hitori wa hidari ni, juujika ni tsukerareta.
Soko o toorikakatta monotachi wa, atama o furinagara, Iesu o nonoshitte
Itta, "Shinden o uchikowashite mikka no uchi ni tateru mono yo. Moshi kami no ko nara, jibun o sukue. Soshite juujika kara orite koi".
Saishichou tachi mo onaji you ni, rippougakusha, chouroutachi to issho ni natte, chourou shite itta,
"Tanin o sukuttaga, jibun jishin o sukuu koto ga dekinai. Are ga Isuraeru no ou na no da. Ima juujika kara orite mi yo. Sou shitara shinjiyou.
Kare wa kami ni tayotte iruga, kami no oboshimeshi ga areba, ima, sukutte morau ga yoi. Jibun wa kami no ko da to itte ita no dakara".
Issho ni juujika ni tsukerareta goutoudomo made mo, onaji you ni Iesu o nonoshitta.
Sate, hiru no juu ni ji kara chijou no zenmen ga kuraku natte, san ji ni oyonda.
Soshite san ji goro ni, Iesu wa oogoe de sakende, "Eri, Eri, Rema, Sabakutani" to iwareta. Sore wa "Waga kami, waga kami, dou shite watashi o omisute ni natta no desu ka" to iu imi de aru.
Suruto, soko ni tatte ita aru hitobito ga, kore o kiite itta, "Are wa Eriya o yonde iru no da".
Suruto sugu, karera no uchi no hitori ga hashiriyotte, kaimen o tori, sore ni su i budoushu o fukumasete ashi no bou ni tsuke, Iesu ni nomaseyou to shita.
Hoka no hitobito wa itta, "Mate, Eriya ga kare o sukui ni kuru ka dou ka, mite iyou".
Iesu wa mou ichido oogoe de sakende, tsuini iki o hikitorareta.
Suru to miyo, shinden no maku ga ue kara shita made mapputa tsu ni saketa. Mata jishin ga ari, iwa ga sake,
Mata haka ga ake, nemutte iru ooku no seitotachi no shitai ga ikikaetta.
Soshite Iesu no fukkatsu no nochi, haka kara dete kite, sei naru miyako ni hairi, ooku no hito ni arawareta.
Hyakusotsuchou, oyobi kare to issho ni Iesu no ban o shite ita hitobito wa, jishin ya, iroiro no dekigoto o mite hijou ni osore, "Makoto ni, kono hito wa kami no ko de atta" to itta.
Mata, soko ni wa tooku no hou kara mite iru onnatachi mo ooku ita. Karera wa Iesu ni tsukaete, Gariraya kara shitagatte kita hitotachi de atta.
Sono naka ni wa, Magudara no Mariya, Yakobu to Yosefu to no haha Mariya, mata Zebedai no kotachi no haha ga ita.
Yuugata ni natte kara, Arimataya no kanemochi de, Yosefu to iu na no hito ga kita. Kare mo mata Iesu no deshi de atta.
Kono hito ga Pirato no tokoro e itte, Iesu no karada no hikitorikata o negatta. Soko de, Pirato wa sore o watasu you ni meijita.
Yosefu wa shitai o uketotte, kirei na amanuno ni tsutsumi,
Iwa o hotte tsukutta kare no atarashii haka ni osame, soshite haka no iriguchi ni ookii ishi o korogashite oite, kaetta.
Magudara no Mariya to hoka no Mariya to ga, haka ni mukatte soko ni suwatte ita.
Akuruhi wa junbi no hi no yokujitsu de attaga, sono hi ni, saishichou, Parisaibitotachi wa, Pirato no moto ni atsumatte itta,
"Choukan, ano itsuwarimono ga mada ikite ita toki, 'Mikka no nochi ni jibun wa yomigaeru' to itta no o, omoidashimashita.
Desukara, mikkame made haka no ban o suru you ni, sashizu o shite kudasai. Sou shinaito, deshitachi ga kite kare o nusumidashi, 'Iesu wa shinin no naka kara, yomigaetta' to, minshuu ni iifurasu ka mo shiremasen. Sou naruto, minna ga mae yori mo, motto hidoku damasareru koto ni narimashou".
Pirato wa karera ni itta, "Bannin ga irukara, itte dekiru kagiri, ban o saseru ga yoi".
Soko de, karera wa itte ishi ni fuuin o shi, bannin o oite haka no ban o saseta.
Sate, ansokunichi ga owatte, shuu no hajime no hi no akegata ni, Magudara no Mariya to hoka no Mariya to ga, haka o mi ni kita.
Suruto, ookina jishin ga okotta. Sore wa Shu no tsukai ga ten kara kudatte, soko ni kite ishi o waki e korogashi, sono ue ni suwattakara de aru.
Sono sugata wa inazuma no you ni kagayaki, sono koromo wa yuki no you ni masshiro de atta.
Mihari o shite ita hitotachi wa, osoroshisa no amari furueagatte, shinin no you ni natta.
Kono mitsukai wa onnatachi ni mukatte itta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Anata gata ga juujika ni okakari ni natta Iesu o sagashite iru koto wa, watashi ni wakatte iruga,
Mou koko ni wa orarenai. Kanete iwareta toori ni, yomigaerareta no de aru. Saa, Iesu ga osamerarete ita basho o goran nasai.
Soshite, isoide itte, deshitachi ni kou tsutae nasai, 'Iesu wa shinin no naka kara yomigaerareta. Miyo, anata ga tayori saki ni Gariraya e ikareru. Soko de oai dekirude arou'. Anata gata ni, kore dake itte oku".
Soko de onnatachi wa osorenagara mo ooyorokobi de, isoide haka o tachisari, deshitachi ni shiraseru tame ni hashitte itta.
Suruto, Iesu wa karera ni deatte, "Heian are" to iwareta no de, karera wa chikayori Iesu no miashi o idaite haishita.
Sono toki, Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Itte kyoudaitachi ni, Gariraya ni ike, soko de watashi ni aerude arou, to tsuge nasai".
Onnatachi ga okonatte iru aida ni, bannin no uchi no aru hitobito ga miyako ni kaette, issai no dekigoto o saishichou tachi ni hanashita.
Saishichou tachi wa chouroutachi to atsumatte kyougi o korashi, heisotsutachi ni takusan no kane o ataete itta,
" 'Deshitachi ga yonaka ni kite, wareware no nete iru aida ni kare o nusunda' to ie.
Man'ichi kono koto ga soutoku no mimi ni haitte mo, wareware ga soutoku ni toite, anata gata ni meiwaku ga kakaranai you ni shiyou".
Soko de, karera wa kane o uketotte, oshierareta toori ni shita. Soshite kono hanashi wa, kyou ni itaru made Yudayajin no aida ni hiromatte iru.
Sate, juu ichinin no deshitachi wa Gariraya ni itte, Iesu ga karera ni iku you ni meijirareta yama ni nobotta.
Soshite, Iesu ni atte haishita. Shikashi, utagau mono mo ita.
Iesu wa karera ni chikazuite kite iwareta, "Watashi wa, ten ni oite mo chi ni oite mo, issai no ken'i o sazukerareta.
Sore yue ni, anata gata wa itte, subete no kokumin o deshi to shite, chichi to ko to seirei to no na ni yotte, karera ni baputesuma o hodokoshi,
Anata gata ni meijite oita issai no koto o mamoru you ni oshie yo. Miyo, watashi wa yo no owari made, itsu mo anata gata to tomo ni iru no de aru".
Kami no ko Iesu Kirisuto no fukuin no hajime.
Yogensha Izaya no sho ni, "Miyo, watashi wa tsukai o anata no saki ni tsukawashi, anata no michi o totonoesaserude arou.
Arano de yobawaru mono no koe ga suru, 'Shu no michi o sonaeyo, sono michisuji o massugu ni seyo' " to kaite aru you ni,
Baputesuma no Yohane ga arano ni arawarete, tsumi no yurushi o esaseru kuiaratame no baputesuma o nobetsutaete ita.
Soko de, Yudaya zendo to Erusaremu no zenjuumin to ga, kare no moto ni zokuzoku to dete itte, jibun no tsumi o kokuhaku shi, Yorudan gawa de Yohane kara baputesuma o uketa.
Kono Yohane wa, rakuda no kegoromo o mi ni matoi, koshi ni kawa no obi o shime, inago to no mitsu to o shokumotsu to shite ita.
Kare wa nobetsutaete itta, "Watashi yori mo chikara no aru kata ga, ato kara oide ni naru. Watashi wa kagande, sono kutsu no himo o toku neuchi mo nai.
Watashi wa mizu de baputesuma o sazuketaga, konokata wa, seirei ni yotte baputesuma o osazuke ni narude arou".
Sono koro, Iesu wa Gariraya no Nazare kara dete kite, Yorudan gawa de, Yohane kara baputesuma o ouke ni natta.
Soshite, mizu no naka kara agarareruto sugu, ten ga sakete, seirei ga hato no you ni jibun ni kudatte kuru no o, goran ni natta.
Suruto ten kara koe ga atta, "Anata wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no kokoro ni kanau mono de aru".
Sore kara sugu ni, mitama ga Iesu o arano ni oiyatta.
Iesu wa yonjuu nichi no aida arano ni ite, Satan no kokoromi ni awareta. Soshite kemono mo soko ni itaga, mitsukai tachi wa Iesu ni tsukaete ita.
Yohane ga toraerareta nochi, Iesu wa Gariraya ni iki, kami no fukuin o nobetsutaete iwareta,
"Toki wa michita, kami no kuni wa chikazuita. Kuiaratamete fukuin o shinzeyo".
Sate, Iesu wa Gariraya no umibe o aruite ikare, Shimon to Shimon no kyoudai Andere to ga, umi de ami o utte iru no o goran ni natta. Karera wa ryoushi de atta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ni tsuite ki nasai. Anatagata o, ningen o toru ryoushi ni shite ageyou".
Suruto, karera wa sugu ni ami o sutete, Iesu ni shitagatta.
Mata sukoshi susunde ikareruto, Zebedai no ko Yakobu to sono kyoudai Yohane to ga, fune no naka de ami o tsukurotte iru no o goran ni natta.
Soko de, sugu karera o omaneki ni naruto, chichi Zebedai o yatoinintachi to issho ni fune ni oite, Iesu no ato ni tsuite itta.
Sore kara, karera wa Kapenaumu ni itta. Soshite ansokunichi ni sugu, Iesu wa kaidou ni haitte oshierareta.
Hitobito wa, sono oshie ni odoroita. Rippougakusha tachi no you nide wa naku, ken'i aru mono no you ni, oshieraretakara de aru.
Choudo sono toki, kegareta rei ni tsukareta mono ga kaidou ni ite, sakende itta,
"Nazare no Iesu yo, anata wa watashitachi to nan no kaka wari ga aru no desu. Watashitachi o horoboshi ni korareta no desu ka. Anata ga donata de aru ka, wakatte imasu. Kami no seija desu".
Iesu wa kore o shikatte, "Damare, kono hito kara dete ike" to iwareta.
Suruto, kegareta rei wa kare o hikitsukesase, oogoe o agete, sono hito kara dete itta.
Hitobito wa mina odoroki no amari, tagai ni ronjite itta, "Kore wa, ittai nanigoto ka. Ken'i aru atarashii oshie da. Kegareta rei ni sae meijirareruto, karera wa shitagau no da".
Kou shite Iesu no uwasa wa, tachimachi Gariraya no zenchihou, itarutokoro ni hiromatta.
Sore kara kaidou o deruto sugu, Yakobu to Yohane to o tsurete, Shimon to Andere to no ie ni haitte ikareta.
Tokoro ga, Shimon no shuutome ga netsubyou de toko ni tsuite ita no de, hitobito wa sassoku, sono koto o Iesu ni shiraseta.
Iesu wa chikayori, sono te o totte okosareruto, netsu ga hiki, onna wa karera o motenashita.
Yuugure ni nari hi ga shizumuto, hitobito wa byounin ya akurei ni tsukareta mono o mina, Iesu no tokoro ni tsurete kita.
Kou shite, machijuu no mono ga toguchi ni atsumatta.
Iesu wa, samazama no yamai o wazuratte iru ooku no hitobito o iyashi, mata ooku no akurei o oidasareta. Mata, akureidomo ni, monoi u koto o oyurushi ni naranakatta. Karera ga Iesu o shitte itakara de aru.
Asa hayaku, yoru no akeru yohodo mae ni, Iesu wa okite sabishii tokoro e dete iki, soko de inotte orareta.
Suruto, Shimon to sono nakama to ga, ato o otte kita.
Soshite Iesu o mitsukete, "Minna ga, anata o sagashite imasu" to itta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Hoka no, fukin no machimachi ni minna de itte, soko de mo oshie o nobetsutaeyou. Watashi wa kono tame ni dete kita no dakara".
Soshite, Gariraya zenchi o meguriaruite, shokaidou de oshie o nobetsutae, mata akurei o oidasareta.
Hitori no raibyounin ga, Iesu no tokoro ni negai ni kite, hizamazuite itta, "Mikokoro deshitara, kiyomete itadakeru no desuga".
Iesu wa fukaku awaremi, te o nobashite kare ni sawari, "Sou shite ageyou, kiyoku nare" to iwareta.
Suruto, raibyou ga tadachini satte, sono hito wa kiyoku natta.
Iesu wa kare o kibishiku imashimete, sugu ni soko o sarase, kou iikikaserareta,
"Nani mo hito ni hanasanai you ni, chuui shi nasai. Tada itte, jibun no karada o saishi ni mise, sore kara, Moose ga meijita mono o anata no kiyome no tame ni sasagete, hitobito ni shoumei shi nasai".
Shikashi, kare wa dete itte, jibun no mi ni okotta koto o sakan ni katari, mata ii hirome hajimeta no de, Iesu wa mohaya omotedatte wa machi ni, hairu koto ga dekinaku nari, soto no sabishii tokoro ni todomatte orareta. Shikashi, hitobito wa houbou kara, Iesu no tokoro ni zokuzoku to atsumatte kita.
Ikunichi kata tte, Iesu ga mata Kapenaumu ni okaeri ni natta toki, ie ni orareru to iu uwasa ga tatta no de,
Ooku no hitobito ga atsumatte kite, mohaya toguchi no atari made mo, sukima ga nai hodo ni natta. Soshite, Iesu wa mikotoba o karera ni katatte orareta.
Suruto, hitobito ga hitori no chuubu no mono o yonnin no hito ni hakobasete, Iesu no tokoro ni tsurete kita.
Tokoro ga, gunshuu no tame ni chikayoru koto ga dekinai no de, Iesu no orareru atari no yane o hagi, ana o akete, chuubu no mono o nekaseta mama, toko o tsurioroshita.
Iesu wa karera no shinkou o mite, chuubu no mono ni, "Ko yo, anata no tsumi wa yurusareta" to iwareta.
Tokoro ga, soko ni ikunin ka no rippougakusha ga suwatte ite, kokoro no naka de ronjita,
"Kono hito wa, naze anna koto o iu no ka. Sore wa kami o kegasu koto da. Kami hitori no hoka ni, dare ga tsumi o yurusu koto ga dekiru ka".
Iesu wa, karera ga naishin kono you ni ronjite iru no o, jibun no kokoro de sugu minuite, "Naze, anata gata wa kokoro no naka de sonna koto o ronjite iru no ka.
Chuubu no mono ni, anata no tsumi wa yurusareta, to iu no to, okiyo, toko o toriagete aruke, to iu no to, dochira ga tayasui ka.
Shikashi, hito no ko wa chijou de tsumi o yurusu ken'i o motte iru koto ga, anata gata ni wakaru tame ni" to karera ni ii, chuubu no mono ni mukatte,
"Anata ni meijiru. Okiyo, toko o toriagete ie ni kaere" to iwareta.
Suruto kare wa okiagari, sugu ni toko o toriagete, minna no mae o dete itta no de, ichidou wa ooini odoroki, kami o agamete, "Konna koto wa, mada ichi do mo mita koto ga nai" to itta.
Iesu wa mata umibe ni dete ikareruto, ooku no hitobito ga mimoto ni atsumatte kita no de, karera o oshierareta.
Mata tochuu de, Arupayo no ko Rebi ga shuuzeisho ni suwatte iru no o goran ni natte, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai" to iwareta. Suruto kare wa tachiagatte, Iesu ni shitagatta.
Sore kara kare no ie de, shokuji no seki ni tsuite orareta toki no koto de aru. Ooku no shuzeinin ya tsumibitotachi mo, Iesu ya deshitachi to tomo ni sono seki ni tsuite ita. Konna hitotachi ga oozei ite, Iesu ni shitagatte kita no de aru.
Parisaiha no rippougakusha tachi wa, Iesu ga tsumibito ya shuzeinin tachi to shokuji o tomo ni shite orareru no o mite, deshitachi ni itta, "Naze, kare wa shuzeinin ya tsumibito nado to shokuji o tomo ni suru no ka".
Iesu wa kore o kiite iwareta, "Joubu na hito ni wa isha wa iranai. Iru no wa byounin de aru. Watashi ga kita no wa, gijin o maneku tame de wa naku, tsumibito o maneku tame de aru".
Yohane no deshi to Parisaibito to wa, danjiki o shite ita. Soko de hitobito ga kite, Iesu ni itta, "Yohane no deshitachi to Parisaibito no deshitachi to ga danjiki o shite iru no ni, anata no deshitachi wa, naze danjiki o shinai no desu ka".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Konrei no kyaku wa, hanamuko ga issho ni iru no ni, danjiki ga dekirude arou ka. Hanamuko to issho ni iru aida wa, danjiki wa dekinai.
Shikashi, hanamuko ga ubaisarareru hi ga kuru. Sono hi ni wa danjiki o surude arou.
Dare mo, maatarashii nunogire o, furui kimono ni nuitsuke wa shinai. Moshi sou sureba, atarashii tsugi wa furui kimono o hikiyaburi, soshite, yabure ga motto hidoku naru.
Mata dare mo, atarashii budoushu o furui kawabukuro ni ire wa shinai. Moshi sou sureba, budoushu wa kawabukuro o hari saki, soshite, budoushu mo kawabukuro mo muda ni natte shimau. [dakara, atarashii budoushu wa atarashii kawabukuro ni irerubekide aru]".
Aru ansokunichi ni, Iesu wa mugibatake no naka o tootte ikareta. Sono toki deshitachi ga, arukinagara ho o tsumi hajimeta.
Suruto, Parisaibitotachi ga Iesu ni itta, "Ittai, karera wa naze, ansokunichi ni shite wa naranu koto o suru no desu ka".
Soko de karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, Dabide to sono tomo no monotachi to ga shokumotsu ga nakute ueta toki, Dabide ga nani o shita ka, mada yonda koto ga nai no ka.
Sunawachi, daisaishi Abiataru no toki, kami no ie ni haitte, saishitachi no hoka tabete wa naranu sonae no pan o, jibun mo tabe, mata tomo no monotachi ni mo ataetade wa nai ka".
Mata karera ni iwareta, "Ansokunichi wa hito no tame ni aru mono de, hito ga ansokunichi no tame ni aru no de wa nai.
Sore dakara, hito no ko wa, ansokunichi ni mo mata shuna no de aru".
Iesu ga mata kaidou ni wa irareruto, soko ni katate no naeta hito ga ita.
Hitobito wa Iesu o uttaeyou to omotte, ansokunichi ni sono hito o iyasareru ka dou ka o ukagatte ita.
Suruto, Iesu wa katate no naeta sono hito ni, "Tatte, naka e dete ki nasai" to ii,
Hitobito ni mukatte, "Ansokunichi ni zen o okonau no to aku o okonau no to, inochi o sukuu no to korosu no to, dochira ga yoi ka" to iwareta. Karera wa damatte ita.
Iesu wa ikari o fukunde karera o mimawashi, sono kokoro no katakuna na no o nageite, sono hito ni "Te o nobashi nasai" to iwareta. Soko de te o nobasuto, sono te wa motodoori ni natta.
Parisaibitotachi wa dete itte, sugu ni Herodetou no monotachi to, nan to ka shite Iesu o korosou to soudan shi hajimeta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa deshitachi to tomo ni umibe ni shirizokaretaga, Gariraya kara kita obitadashii gunshuu ga tsuite itta. Mata Yudaya kara,
Erusaremu kara, Idomaya kara, sarani Yorudan no mukou kara, Tsuro, Shidon no atari kara mo, obitadashii gunshuu ga, sono nasatte iru koto o kiite, mimoto ni kita.
Iesu wa gunshuu ga jibun ni oshisemaru no o sakeru tame ni, kobune o youi shite oketo, deshitachi ni meijirareta.
Sore wa, ooku no hito o iyasareta no de, byouku ni nayamu mono wa mina Iesu ni sawarou to shite, oshiyosete kitakara de aru.
Mata, kegareta reidomo wa Iesu o mirugoto ni, mimae ni hirefushi, sakende, "Anata koso kami no ko desu" to itta.
Iesu wa gojishin no koto o hito ni arawasanai you ni to, karera o kibishiku imashimerareta.
Sate Iesu wa yama ni nobori, mikokoro ni kanatta monotachi o yobiyoserareta no de, karera wa mimoto ni kita.
Soko de juu ninin o otate ni natta. Karera o jibun no soba ni oku tame de ari, sarani senkyou ni tsukawashi,
Mata akurei o oidasu ken'i o motaseru tame de atta.
Kou shite, kono juu ninin o otate ni natta. Soshite Shimon ni Petero to iu na o tsuke,
Mata Zebedai no ko Yakobu to, Yakobu no kyoudai Yohane, karera ni wa Boaneruge, sunawachi, kaminari no ko to iu na o tsukerareta.
Tsugi ni Andere, Piripo, Barutoromai, Matai, Tomasu, Arupayo no ko Yakobu, Tadai, nesshintou no Shimon,
Sore kara Isukariote no Yuda. Kono Yuda ga Iesu o uragitta no de aru. Iesu ga ie ni wa irareruto,
Gunshuu ga mata atsumatte kita no de, ichidou wa shokuji o suru hima mo nai hodo de atta.
Miuchi no monotachi wa kono koto o kiite, Iesu o toriosae ni dete kita. Ki ga kurutta to omottakara de aru.
Mata, Erusaremu kara kudatte kita rippougakusha tachi mo, "Kare wa Beruzeburu ni toritsukarete iru" to ii, "Akureidomo no kashira ni yotte, akureidomo o oidashite iru no da" to mo itta.
Soko de Iesu wa karera o yobiyose, tatoe o motte iwareta, "Dou shite, Satan ga Satan o oidasu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Moshi kuni ga naibu de wakare arasounara, sono kuni wa tachiikanai.
Mata, moshi ie ga uchi wa de wakare arasounara, sono ie wa tachiikanaide arou.
Moshi Satan ga naibu de tairitsu shi bunsou surunara, kare wa tachi ikezu, horonde shimau.
Dare de mo, mazu tsuyoi hito o shibariagenakereba, sono hito no ie ni oshiitte kazai o ubaitoru koto wa dekinai. Shibatte kara hajimete, sono ie o ryakudatsu suru koto ga dekiru.
Yoku iikikasete okuga, hito no kora ni wa, sono okasu subete no tsumi mo kami o kegasu kotoba mo, yurusareru.
Shikashi, seirei o kegasu mono wa, itsu made mo yurusarezu, eien no tsumi ni sadamerareru".
Sou iwareta no wa, karera ga "Iesu wa kegareta rei ni tsukarete iru" to itte itakara de aru.
Sate, Iesu no haha to kyoudaitachi to ga kite, soto ni tachi, hito o yatte Iesu o yobaseta.
Toki ni, gunshuu wa Iesu o kakonde suwatte itaga, "Goran nasai. Anata no hahaue to kyoudai, shimaitachi ga, soto de anata o tazunete oraremasu" to itta.
Suruto, Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Watashi no haha, watashi no kyoudai to wa, dare no koto ka".
Soshite, jibun o torikakonde, suwatte iru hitobito o mimawashite, iwareta, "Goran nasai, koko ni watashi no haha, watashi no kyoudai ga iru.
Kami no mikokoro o okonau mono wa dare de mo, watashi no kyoudai, mata shimai, mata haha na no de aru".
Iesu wa mata mo, umibe de oshie hajimerareta. Obitadashii gunshuu ga mimoto ni atsumatta no de, Iesu wa fune ni notte suwatta mama, kaijou ni orare, gunshuu wa mina umi ni sotte rikuchi ni ita.
Iesu wa tatoe de ooku no koto o oshieraretaga, sono oshie no naka de karera ni kou iwareta,
"Kiki nasai, tanemaki ga tane o maki ni dete itta.
Ma ite iru uchi ni, michibata ni ochita tane ga atta. Suruto, tori ga kite tabete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa tsuchi no usui ishiji ni ochita. Soko wa tsuchi ga fukaku nai no de, sugu me o dashitaga,
Hi ga noboru to yakete, ne ga nai tame ni karete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa ibara no naka ni ochita. Suruto, ibara ga nobite, fusaide shimatta no de, mi o musubanakatta.
Hoka no tane wa yoi chi ni ochita. Soshite haete, sodatte, masumasu mi o musubi, sanjuu bai, rokujuu bai, hyaku bai ni mo natta".
Soshite iwareta, "Kiku mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi".
Iesu ga hitori ni narareta toki, soba ni ita monotachi ga, juu ni deshi to tomo ni, korera no tatoe ni tsuite tazuneta.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata ni wa kami no kuni no okugi ga sazukerarete iruga, hoka no monotachi ni wa, subete ga tatoe de katarareru.
Sore wa 'Karera wa miru ni wa miruga, mitomezu, kiku ni wa kikuga, satorazu, kuiaratamete yurusareru koto ga nai' tame de aru".
Mata karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa kono tatoe ga wakaranai no ka. Sore de wa, dou shite subete no tatoe ga wakarudarou ka.
Tanemaki wa mikotoba o maku no de aru.
Michibata ni mikotoba ga makareta to wa, kou iu hitotachi no koto de aru. Sunawachi, mikotoba o kikuto, sugu ni Satan ga kite, karera no naka ni makareta mikotoba o, ubatte iku no de aru.
Onaji you ni, ishiji ni makareta mono to wa, kou iu hitotachi no koto de aru. Mikotoba o kikuto, sugu ni yorokonde ukeruga,
Jibun no naka ni ne ga nai no de, shibaraku tsuzuku dake de aru. Sono nochi, mikotoba no tame ni konnan ya hakugai ga okotte kuruto, sugu tsumazuite shimau.
Mata, ibara no naka ni makareta mono to wa, kou iu hitotachi no koto de aru. Mikotoba o kikuga,
Yo no kokorozukai to, tomi no madowashi to, sono ta iroiro na yoku to ga haitte kite, mikotoba o fusagu no de, mi o musubanaku naru.
Mata, yoi chi ni makareta mono to wa, kou iu hitotachi no koto de aru. Mikotoba o kiite ukeire, sanjuu bai, rokujuu bai, hyaku bai no mi o musubu no de aru".
Mata karera ni iwareta, "Masu no shita ya shindai no shita ni oku tame ni, akari o motte kuru koto ga arou ka. Shokudai no ue ni oku tame de wa nai ka.
Nan de mo, kakusarete iru mono de, arawarenai mono wa naku, himitsu ni sarete iru mono de, akarumi ni denai mono wa nai.
Kiku mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi".
Mata karera ni iwareta, "Kiku kotogara ni chuui shi nasai. Anata gata no hakaru sono hakaride, jibun ni mo hakari ataerare, sono ue ni nao mashikuwaerarerude arou.
Dare de mo, motte iru hito wa sarani ataerare, motte inai hito wa, motte iru mono made mo toriagerarerude arou".
Mata iwareta, "Kami no kuni wa, aru hito ga chi ni tane o maku you na mono de aru.
Yoruhiru, neoki shite iru aida ni, tane wa me o dashite sodatte ikuga, dou shite sou naru no ka, sono hito wa shiranai.
Chi wa onozukara mi o musubaseru mono de, hajime ni me, tsugi ni ho, tsugi ni ho no naka ni yutaka na mi ga dekiru.
Mi ga iruto, sugu ni kama o ireru. Kariire toki ga kitakara de aru".
Mata iwareta, "Kami no kuni o nani ni kurabeyou ka. Mata, donna tatoe de iiarawasou ka.
Sore wa ichi tsubu no karashi tane no you na mono de aru. Chi ni makareru toki ni wa, chijou no donna tane yori mo chiisaiga,
Ma kareruto, seichou shite donna yasai yori mo ookiku nari, ookina eda o hari, sono kage ni sora no tori ga yadoru hodo ni naru".
Iesu wa kono you na ooku no tatoe de, hitobito no kiku chikara ni shitagatte, mikotoba o katarareta.
Tatoe ni yoranaide wa katararenakattaga, jibun no deshitachi ni wa, hisoka ni subete no koto o tokiakasareta.
Sate sono hi, yuugata ni naruto, Iesu wa deshitachi ni, "Mukougishi e watarou" to iwareta.
Soko de, karera wa gunshuu o ato ni nokoshi, Iesu ga fune ni notte orareru mama, noridashita. Hoka no fune mo issho ni itta.
Suruto, hageshii toppuu ga okori, nami ga fune no naka ni uchikonde kite, fune ni michi sou ni natta.
Tokoro ga Iesu jishin wa, tomo no hou de makura o shite, nemutte orareta. Soko de, deshitachi wa Iesu o okoshite, "Sensei, watashidomo ga oboreshinde mo, okamai ni naranai no desu ka" to itta.
Iesu wa okiagatte kaze o shikari, umi ni mukatte, "Shizumare, damare" to iwareruto, kaze wa yande, oonagi ni natta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Naze, sonna ni kowagaru no ka. Dou shite shinkou ga nai no ka".
Karera wa osoreononoite, tagai ni itta, "Ittai, kono hou wa dare darou. Kaze mo umi mo shitagawaseru to wa".
Kou shite karera wa umi no mukougishi, gerasabito no chi ni tsuita.
Sore kara, Iesu ga fune kara agarareruto sugu ni, kegareta rei ni tsukareta hito ga hakaba kara dete kite, Iesu ni deatta.
Kono hito wa hakaba o sumika to shite ori, mohaya dare mo, kusari de sae mo kare o tsunagitomete okenakatta.
Kare wa tabitabi ashikase ya kusari de tsunagaretaga, kusari o hikichigiri, ashikase o kudaku no de, dare mo kare o osaetsukeru koto ga dekinakattakara de aru.
Soshite, yoruhiru taema naku hakaba ya yama de sakebi tsuzukete, ishi de jibun no karada o kizutsukete ita.
Tokoro ga, kono hito ga Iesu o tooku kara mite, hashiriyotte haishi,
Oogoe de sakende itta, "I to takaki kami no ko Iesu yo, anata wa watashi to nan no kaka wari ga aru no desu. Kami ni chikatte onegai shimasu. Douzo, watashi o kurushimenaide kudasai".
Sore wa, Iesu ga, "Kegareta rei yo, kono hito kara dete ike" to iwaretakara de aru.
Mata kare ni, "Nan to iu namae ka" to tazunerareruto, "Region to iimasu. Oozei na no desukara" to kotaeta.
Soshite, jibuntachi o kono tochi kara oidasanai you ni to, shikiri ni negai tsuzuketa.
Sate, soko no yama no chuufuku ni, buta no taigun ga katte atta.
Rei wa Iesu ni negatte itta, "Watashidomo o, buta ni hairasete kudasai. Sono naka e okutte kudasai".
Iesu ga oyurushi ni natta no de, kegareta reidomo wa dete itte, buta no naka e hairikonda. Suruto, sono mure wa nisenhiki bakari de attaga, gake kara umi e nadare o utte kakekudari, umi no naka de oboreshinde shimatta.
Buta o kau monotachi ga nigedashite, machi ya mura ni furemawatta no de, hitobito wa nanigoto ga okotta no ka to mi ni kita.
Soshite, Iesu no tokoro ni kite, akurei ni tsukareta hito ga kimono o kite, shouki ni natte suwatte ori, sore ga Region o yadoshite ita mono de aru no o mite, osoreta.
Mata, sore o mita hitotachi wa, akurei ni tsukareta hito no mi ni okotta koto to buta no koto to o, karera ni hanashite kikaseta.
Soko de, hitobito wa Iesu ni, kono chihou kara dete itte itadakitai to, tanomi hajimeta.
Iesu ga fune ni norou to sareruto, akurei ni tsukarete ita hito ga otomo o shitai to negaideta.
Shikashi, Iesu wa oyurushi ni naranaide, kare ni iwareta, "Anata no kazoku no moto ni kaette, Shu ga donna ni ookina koto o shite kudasatta ka, mata donna ni awarende kudasatta ka, sore o shirase nasai".
Soko de, kare wa tachisari, soshite jibun ni Iesu ga shite kudasatta koto o, kotogotoku Dekaporisu no chihou ni ii hirome dashita no de, hitobito wa mina odorokiayashinda.
Iesu ga mata fune de mukougishi e watarareruto, oozei no gunshuu ga mimoto ni atsumatte kita. Iesu wa umibe ni orareta.
Soko e, kaidouzukasa no hitori de aru Yairo to iu mono ga kite, Iesu o mikakeruto sono ashimoto ni hirefushi,
Shikiri ni negatte itta, "Watashi no osanai musume ga shinikakatte imasu. Douzo, sono ko ga nao tte tasukarimasu you ni, oide ni natte, te o oite yatte kudasai".
Soko de, Iesu wa kare to issho ni dekakerareta. Oozei no gunshuu mo Iesu ni oshisemarinagara, tsuite itta.
Sate koko ni, juu ni nenkan mo naga chi o wazuratte iru onna ga ita.
Ooku no isha ni kakatte, sanzan kurushimerare, sono mochimono o mina tsuiyashite shimattaga, nan no kai mo nai bakari ka, kaette masumasu waruku naru ippou de atta.
Kono onna ga Iesu no koto o kiite, gunshuu no naka ni magirekomi, ushiro kara, mikoromo ni sawatta.
Sore wa, semete, mikoromo ni de mo sawareba, nao shite itadakerudarou to, omotte itakara de aru.
Suruto, chi no moto ga sugu ni kawaki, onna wa byouki ga naotta koto o, sono mi ni kanjita.
Iesu wa sugu, jibun no uchi kara chikara ga dete itta koto ni kizukarete, gunshuu no naka de furimuki, "Watashi no kimono ni sawatta no wa dare ka" to iwareta.
Soko de deshitachi ga itta, "Goran no toori, gunshuu ga anata ni oshisematte imasu no ni, dare ga sawatta ka to, ossharu no desu ka".
Shikashi, Iesu wa sawatta mono o mitsukeyou to shite, mimawashite orareta.
Sono onna wa jibun no mi ni okotta koto o shitte, osoreononokinagara susumidete, mimae ni hirefushite, subete arinomama o moushiageta.
Iesu wa sono onna ni iwareta, "Musume yo, anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta no desu. Anshin shite iki nasai. Sukkari naotte, tassha de i nasai".
Iesu ga, mada hanashite orareru uchi ni, kaidouzukasa no ie kara hitobito ga kite itta, "Anata no musume wa nakunarimashita. Kono ue, sensei o wazurawasu ni wa oyobimasumai".
Iesu wa sono hanashite iru kotoba o kikinagashite, kaidouzukasa ni iwareta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Tada shinji nasai".
Soshite Petero, Yakobu, Yakobu no kyoudai Yohane no hoka wa, tsuite kuru koto o, dare ni mo oyurushi ni naranakatta.
Karera ga kaidouzukasa no ie ni tsukuto, Iesu wa hitobito ga oogoe de nai tari, saken dari shite, sawaide iru no o goran ni nari,
Uchi ni haitte, karera ni iwareta, "Naze nakisawaide iru no ka. Kodomo wa shinda no de wa nai. Nemutte iru dake de aru".
Hitobito wa Iesu o azawaratta. Shikashi, Iesu wa minna no mono o soto ni dashi, kodomo no fubo to tomo no monotachi dake o tsurete, kodomo no iru tokoro ni haitte ikareta.
Soshite kodomo no te o totte, "Tarita, Kumi" to iwareta. Sore wa, "Shoujo yo, saa, oki nasai" to iu imi de aru.
Suruto, shoujo wa sugu ni okiagatte, aruki dashita. Juu nisai ni mo natte itakara de aru. Karera wa tachimachi hijou na odoroki ni utareta.
Iesu wa, dare ni mo kono koto o shirasu na to, kibishiku karera ni meiji, mata, shoujo ni shokumotsu o ataeru you ni to iwareta.
Iesu wa soko o satte, kyouri ni ikaretaga, deshitachi mo shitagatte itta.
Soshite, ansokunichi ni natta no de, kaidou de oshie hajimerareta. Sore o kiita ooku no hitobito wa, odoroite itta, "Kono hito wa, korera no koto o doko de naratte kita no ka. Mata, kono hito no sazukatta chie wa dou darou. Kono you na chikara aru waza ga sono te de okonawarete iru no wa, dou shite ka.
Kono hito wa daiku de wa nai ka. Mariya no musuko de, Yakobu, Yose, Yuda, Shimon no kyoudai de wa nai ka. Mata sono shimaitachi mo, koko ni watashitachi to issho ni irude wa nai ka". Kou shite karera wa Iesu ni tsumazuita.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yogensha wa, jibun no kyouri, shinzoku, ie igai de wa, doko de de mo uyamawarenai koto wa nai".
Soshite, soko de wa chikara aru waza o hitotsu mo suru koto ga dekizu, tada shousuu no byounin ni te o oite iyasareta dake de atta.
Soshite, karera no fushinkou o odorokiayashimareta. Sore kara Iesu wa, fukin no muramura o meguriaruite oshierareta.
Mata juu ni deshi o yobiyose, futari zutsu tsukawasu koto ni shite, karera ni kegareta rei o seisuru ken'i o atae,
Mata tabi no tame ni, tsue ichipon no hoka ni wa nani mo motanai you ni, pan mo, bukuro mo, obi no naka ni zeni mo motazu,
Tada waraji o haku dake de, shitagi mo nimai wa kinai you ni meijirareta.
Soshite karera ni iwareta, "Doko e itte mo, ie ni haittanara, sono tochi o saru made wa, soko ni todomatte i nasai.
Mata, anatagata o mukaezu, anata gata no hanashi o kiki mo shinai tokoro ga attanara, soko kara dete iku toki, karera ni taisuru kougi no shirushi ni, ashi no ura no chiri o haraiotoshi nasai".
Soko de, karera wa dete itte, kuiaratame o nobetsutae,
Ooku no akurei o oidashi, oozei no byounin ni abura o nutte iyashita.
Sate, Iesu no na ga shire watatte, Herode ou no mimi ni haitta. Aru hitobito wa "Baputesuma no Yohane ga, shinin no naka kara yomigaette kita no da. Sore de, ano you na chikara ga kare no uchi ni hataraite iru no da" to ii,
Ta no hitobito wa "Kare wa Eriya da" to ii, mata ta no hitobito wa "Mukashi no yogensha no you na yogensha da" to itta.
Tokoro ga, Herode wa kore o kiite, "Watashi ga kubi o kitta ano Yohane ga yomigaetta no da" to itta.
Kono Herode wa, jibun no kyoudai Piripo no tsuma Herodeya o metottaga, sono koto de, hito o tsukawashi, Yohane o toraete goku ni tsunaida.
Sore wa, Yohane ga Herode ni, "Kyoudai no tsuma o metoru no wa, yoroshiku nai" to ittakara de aru.
Soko de, Herodeya wa Yohane o urami, kare o korosou to omotte itaga, dekinaide ita.
Sore wa Herode ga, Yohane wa tadashikute sei naru hito de aru koto o shitte, kare o osore, kare ni hogo o kuwae, mata sono oshie o kiite hijou ni nayaminagara mo, nao yorokonde kiite itakara de aru.
Tokoro ga, yoi kikai ga kita. Herode wa jibun no tanjou hi no iwai ni, koukan ya shoukou ya Gariraya no omodatta hitotachi o maneite enkai o moyooshitaga,
Soko e, kono Herodeya no musume ga haitte kite mai o mai, Herode o hajime retsuza no hitotachi o yorokobaseta. Soko de ou wa kono shoujo ni "Hoshii mono wa nan de mo ii nasai. Anata ni agerukara" to ii,
Sarani "Hoshikereba, kono kuni no hanbun de mo ageyou" to chikatte itta.
Soko de shoujo wa za o hazushite, haha ni "Nani o onegai shimashou ka" to tazuneruto, haha wa "Baputesuma no Yohane no kubi o" to kotaeta.
Suruto sugu, shoujo wa isoide ou no tokoro ni itte negatta, "Ima sugu ni, baputesuma no Yohane no kubi o bon ni nosete, sore o itadakitou gozaimasu".
Ou wa hijou ni komattaga, ittan chikatta no to, mata retsuza no hitotachi no temae, shoujo no negai o shirizokeru koto o konomanakatta.
Soko de, ou wa sugu ni eihei o tsukawashi, Yohane no kubi o motte kuru you ni meijita. Eihei wa dete iki, gokuchuu de Yohane no kubi o kiri,
Bon ni nosete motte kite shoujo ni atae, shoujo wa sore o haha ni watashita.
Yohane no deshitachi wa kono koto o kiki, sono shitai o hikitori ni kite, haka ni osameta.
Sate, shitotachi wa Iesu no moto ni atsumatte kite, jibuntachi ga shita koto ya oshieta koto o, mina houkoku shita.
Suru to Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Saa, anata gata wa, hito o sakete sabishii tokoro e itte, shibaraku yasumu ga yoi". Sore wa, deiri suru hito ga ookute, shokuji o suru hima mo nakattakara de aru.
Soko de karera wa hito o sake, fune ni notte sabishii tokoro e itta.
Tokoro ga, ooku no hitobito wa karera ga dekakete iku no o mi, sore to kizuite, houbou no machimachi kara soko e, issei ni kaketsuke, karera yori saki ni tsuita.
Iesu wa fune kara agatte oozei no gunshuu o goran ni nari, kau mono no nai hitsuji no you na sono arisama o fukaku awarende, iroiro to oshie hajimerareta.
Tokoro ga, haya toki mo osoku natta no de, deshitachi wa Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Koko wa sabishii tokoro de mo ari, mou toki mo osoku narimashita.
Minna o kaisan sase, meimei de nani ka taberu mono o kai ni, mawari no buraku ya muramura e ikasete kudasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata no te de shokumotsu o yari nasai". Deshitachi wa itta, "Watashitachi ga nihyaku denari mono pan o katte kite, minna ni tabesaseru no desu ka".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Pan wa ikutsu aru ka. Mite ki nasai". Karera wa tashikamete kite, "Itsutsu arimasu. Sore ni uo ga nihiki" to itta.
Soko de Iesu wa, minna o kumigumi ni wakete, aokusa no ue ni suwaraseru you ni meijirareta.
Hitobito wa, aruiha hyakunin zutsu, aruiha gojuunin zutsu, retsu o tsukutte suwatta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa itsutsu no pan to nihiki no uo to o te ni tori, ten o aoide sore o shukufuku shi, pan o saki, deshitachi ni watashite kubarase, mata, nihiki no uo mo minna ni owake ni natta.
Minna no mono wa tabete manpuku shita.
Soko de, pan kuzu ya uo no nokori o atsumeruto, juu ni no kago ni ippai ni natta.
Pan o tabeta mono wa otoko gosennin de atta.
Sore kara sugu, Iesu wa jibun de gunshuu o kaisan sasete orareru aida ni, shiite deshitachi o fune ni norikomase, mukougishi no Betsusaida hesaki ni oyari ni natta.
Soshite gunshuu ni wakarete kara, inoru tame ni yama e shirizokareta.
Yuugata ni natta toki, fune wa umi no mannaka ni dete ori, Iesu dake ga rikuchi ni orareta.
Tokoro ga gyakufuu ga fuite ita tame ni, deshitachi ga kogi nayande iru no o goran ni natte, yoake no yon ji goro, umi no ue o aruite karera ni chikazuki, sono soba o toorisugiyou to sareta.
Karera wa Iesu ga umi no ue o aruite orareru no o mite, yuurei da to omoi, oogoe de sakenda.
Minna no mono ga sore o mite, ojiosoretakara de aru. Shikashi, Iesu wa sugu karera ni koe o kake, "Shikkari suru no da. Watashi de aru. Osoreru koto wa nai" to iwareta.
Soshite, karera no fune ni norikomareruto, kaze wa yanda. Karera wa kokoro no naka de, hijou ni odoroita.
Saki no pan no koto o satorazu, sono kokoro ga nibuku natte itakara de aru.
Karera wa umi o watari, Genesare no chi ni tsuite fune o tsunaida.
Soshite fune kara agaruto, hitobito wa sugu Iesu to shitte,
Sono chihou o amaneku kakemeguri, Iesu ga orareru to kikeba, doko e de mo byounin o toko ni nosete hakobi hajimeta.
Soshite, mura de mo machi de mo buraku de mo, Iesu ga haitte ikareru tokoro de wa, byounintachi o sono hiroba ni oki, semete sono uwagi no fusani de mo, sawarasete yatte itadakitai to, onegai shita. Soshite sawatta mono wa mina iyasareta.
Sate, Parisaibito to, aru rippougakusha tachi to ga, Erusaremu kara kite, Iesu no moto ni atsumatta.
Soshite deshitachi no uchi ni, fujou na te, sunawachi arawanai te de, pan o tabete iru mono ga aru no o mita.
Motomoto, Parisaibito o hajime Yudayajin wa mina, mukashi no hito no iitsutae o kataku mamotte, nen'iri ni te o aratte kara de naito, shokuji o shinai.
Mata ichiba kara kaetta toki ni wa, mi o kiyomete kara de naito, shokuji o sezu, nao sono hoka ni mo, sakazuki, hachi, douki o arau koto nado, mukashi kara uketsuide kataku mamotte iru koto ga, takusan atta.
Soko de, Parisaibito to rippougakusha tachi to wa, Iesu ni tazuneta, "Naze, anata no deshitachi wa, mukashi no hito no iitsutae ni shitagatte ayumanaide, fujou na te de pan o taberu no desu ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Izaya wa, anata gata gizensha ni tsuite, kou kaite iruga, sore wa tekisetsu na yogen de aru, 'Kono tami wa, kuchisaki de wa watashi o uyamauga, sono kokoro wa watashi kara tooku hanarete iru.
Ningen no imashime o oshie to shite oshie, muimi ni watashi o ogande iru'.
Anata gata wa, kami no imashime o sashioite, ningen no iitsutae o koshitsu shite iru".
Mata, iwareta, "Anata gata wa, jibuntachi no iitsutae o mamoru tame ni, yoku mo kami no imashime o suteta mono da.
Moose wa ittade wa nai ka, 'Chichi to haha to o uyamae', mata 'Chichi mata wa haha o nonoshiru mono wa, kanarazu shi ni sadamerareru' to.
Sore da no ni, anata gata wa, moshi hito ga chichi mata wa haha ni mukatte, anata ni sashiageru hazu no kono mono wa Koruban, sunawachi, sonaemono desu to ieba, sore de yoi to shite,
Sono hito wa fubo ni taishite, mou nani mo shinaide sumu no da to itte iru.
Kou shite anata gata wa, jibuntachi ga uketsuida iitsutae ni yotte, kami no kotoba o mu ni shite iru. Mata, kono you na koto o shibashiba okonatte iru".
Sore kara, Iesu wa futatabi gunshuu o yobiyosete iwareta, "Anata gata wa minna, watashi no iu koto o kiite satoru ga yoi.
Subete soto kara hito no naka ni haitte, hito o kegashi uru mono wa nai. Kaette, hito no naka kara dete kuru mono ga, hito o kegasu no de aru. []
Kiku mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi]".
Iesu ga gunshuu o hanarete ie ni wa irareruto, deshitachi wa kono tatoe ni tsuite tazuneta.
Suruto, iwareta, "Anata gata mo, sonna ni nibui no ka. Subete, soto kara hito no naka ni haitte kuru mono wa, hito o kegashi enai koto ga, wakaranai no ka.
Sore wa hito no kokoro no naka ni wa iru no de wa naku, hara no uchi ni hairi, soshite, soto ni dete iku dake de aru". Iesu wa kono you ni, donna shokumotsu de mo kiyoi mono to sareta.
Sarani iwareta, "Hito kara dete kuru mono, sore ga hito o kegasu no de aru.
Sunawachi naibu kara, hito no kokoro no naka kara, warui omoi ga dete kuru. Fuhinkou, nusumi, satsujin,
Kan'in, don'yoku, jaaku, azamuki, koushoku, netami, soshiri, kouman, guchi.
Korera no aku wa subete naibu kara dete kite, hito o kegasu no de aru".
Sate, Iesu wa, soko o tachisatte, Tsuro no chihou ni ikareta. Soshite, dare ni mo shirenai you ni, ie no naka ni wa iraretaga, kakurete iru koto ga dekinakatta.
Soshite, kegareta rei ni tsukareta osanai musume o motsu onna ga, Iesu no koto o sugu kikitsukete kite, sono ashimoto ni hirefushita.
Kono onna wa Girishiyajin de, Suro Fenikiya no umare de atta. Soshite, musume kara akurei o oidashite kudasai to onegai shita.
Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Mazu kodomotachi ni juubun tabesasubekide aru. Kodomotachi no pan o totte koinu ni nagete yaru no wa, yoroshiku nai".
Suruto, onna wa kotaete itta, "Shu yo, okotoba doori desu. De mo, shokutaku no shita ni iru koinu mo, kodomotachi no pan kuzu wa, itadakimasu".
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Sono kotoba de, juubun de aru. Okaeri nasai. Akurei wa musume kara dete shimatta".
Soko de, onna ga ie ni kaette miruto, sono ko wa toko no ue ni nete ori, akurei wa dete shimatte ita.
Sore kara, Iesu wa mata Tsuro no chihou o sari, Shidon o hete Dekaporisu chihou o toorinuke, Gariraya no umibe ni korareta.
Suru to hitobito wa, mimi ga kikoezu kuchi no kikenai hito o, mimoto ni tsurete kite, te o oite yatte itadakitai to onegai shita.
Soko de, Iesu wa kare hitori o gunshuu no naka kara tsuredashi, sono ryoumimi ni yubi o sashiire, sore kara, tsubaki de sono shita o uruoshi,
Ten o aoide tameiki o tsuki, sono hito ni "Epata" to iwareta. Kore wa "Hirakeyo" to iu imi de aru.
Suruto kare no mimi ga hirake, sono shita no motsure mo sugu tokete, hakkiri to hanasu you ni natta.
Iesu wa, kono koto o dare ni mo itte wa naranu to, hitobito ni kuchidome o saretaga, kuchidome o sureba suru hodo, kaette, masumasu ii hirometa.
Karera wa, hitokata narazu odoroite itta, "Konokata no nasatta koto wa, nani mo ka mo, subarashii. Mimi no kikoenai mono o kikoeru you ni shite yari, kuchi no kikenai mono o kikeru you ni shite oyari ni natta".
Sono koro, mata oozei no gunshuu ga atsumatte itaga, nani mo taberu mono ga nakatta no de, Iesu wa deshitachi o yobiyosete iwareta,
"Kono gunshuu ga kawaisou de aru. Mou mik kakan mo watashi to issho ni iru no ni, nani mo taberu mono ga nai.
Moshi, karera o kuufuku no mama ie ni kaeraserunara, tochuu de yowari kitte shimaude arou. Sore ni, naka ni wa tooku kara kite iru mono mo aru".
Deshitachi wa kotaeta, "Konna arano de, doko kara pan o te ni irete, korera no hitobito ni juubun tabesaseru koto ga dekimashou ka".
Iesu ga deshitachi ni, "Pan wa ikutsu aru ka" to tazunerareruto, "Nanatsu arimasu" to kotaeta.
Soko de Iesu wa gunshuu ni chi ni suwaru you ni meijirareta. Soshite nanatsu no pan o tori, kansha shite kore o saki, hitobito ni kubaru you ni deshitachi ni watasareruto, deshitachi wa sore o gunshuu ni kubatta.
Mata chiisai uo ga sukoshi bakari atta no de, shukufuku shite, sore o mo hitobito ni kubaru you ni to iwareta.
Karera wa tabete manpuku shita. Soshite nokotta pan kuzu o atsumeruto, nana kago ni natta.
Hitobito no kazu wa oyoso yonsennin de atta. Sore kara Iesu wa karera o kaisan sase,
Sugu deshitachi to tomo ni fune ni notte, Darumanuta no chihou e ikareta.
Parisaibitotachi ga dete kite, Iesu o kokoromiyou to shite giron o shikake, ten kara no shirushi o motometa.
Iesu wa, kokoro no naka de fukaku tansoku shite iwareta, "Naze, ima no jidai wa shirushi o motomeru no darou. Yoku iikikasete okuga, shirushi wa ima no jidai ni wa kesshite ataerarenai".
Soshite, Iesu wa karera o ato ni nokoshi, mata fune ni notte mukougishi e ikareta.
Deshitachi wa pan o motte kuru no o wasurete ita no de, fune no naka ni wa pan hitotsu shika mochiawase ga nakatta.
Sono toki, Iesu wa karera o imashimete, "Parisaibito no pan dane to Herode no pan dane to o, yokuyoku keikai seyo" to iwareta.
Deshitachi wa, kore wa jibuntachi ga pan o motte inai tame de arouto, tagai ni ronjiatta.
Iesu wa sore to shitte, karera ni iwareta, "Naze, pan ga naikara da to ronjiatte iru no ka. Mada wakaranai no ka, satoranai no ka. Anata gata no kokoro wa nibuku natte iru no ka.
Me ga atte mo mienai no ka. Mimi ga atte mo kikoenai no ka. Mada omoidasanai no ka.
Itsutsu no pan o saite gosennin ni waketa toki, hiroiatsumeta pan kuzu wa, ikutsu no kago ni natta ka". Deshitachi wa kotaeta, "Juu ni kago desu".
"Nanatsu no pan o yonsennin ni waketa toki ni wa, pan kuzu o ikutsu no kago ni hiroiatsumeta ka". "Nana kago desu" to kotaeta.
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Mada satoranai no ka".
Sono uchi ni, karera wa Betsusaida ni tsuita. Suru to hitobito ga, hitori no moujin o tsurete kite, sawatte yatte itadakitai to onegai shita.
Iesu wa kono moujin no te o totte, mura no soto ni tsuredashi, sono ryouhou no me ni tsubaki o tsuke, ryoute o kare ni atete, "Nani ka mieru ka" to tazunerareta.
Suruto kare wa kao o agete itta, "Hito ga miemasu. Ki no you ni miemasu. Aruite iru you desu".
Sore kara, Iesu ga futatabi me no ue ni ryoute o aterareruto, moujin wa mitsumete iru uchi ni, naotte kite, subete no mono ga hakkiri to mie dashita.
Soko de Iesu wa, "Mura ni haitte wa ikenai" to itte, kare o ie ni kaesareta.
Sate, Iesu wa deshitachi to Piripo Kaizariya no muramura e dekakeraretaga, sono tochuu de, deshitachi ni tazunete iwareta, "Hitobito wa, watashi o dare to itte iru ka".
Karera wa kotaete itta, "Baputesuma no Yohane dato, itte imasu. Mata, Eriya da to ii, mata, yogensha no hitori da to itte iru mono mo arimasu".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni tazunerareta, "Sore de wa, anata gata wa watashi o dare to iu ka". Petero ga kotaete itta, "Anata koso Kirisuto desu".
Suru to Iesu wa, jibun no koto o dare ni mo itte wa ikenaito, karera o imashimerareta.
Sore kara, hito no ko wa kanarazu ooku no kurushimi o uke, chourou, saishichou, rippougakusha tachi ni suterare, mata korosare, soshite mikka no nochi ni yomigaerubeki koto o, karera ni oshie hajime,
Shikamo akarasama ni, kono koto o hanasareta. Suruto, Petero wa Iesu o waki e hikiyosete, isame hajimeta no de,
Iesu wa furikaette, deshitachi o minagara, Petero o shikatte iwareta, "Satan yo, hikisagare. Anata wa kami no koto o omowanaide, hito no koto o omotte iru".
Sore kara gunshuu o deshitachi to issho ni yobiyosete, karera ni iwareta, "Dare de mo watashi ni tsuite kitai to omounara, jibun o sute, jibun no juujika o oute, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai.
Jibun no inochi o sukuou to omou mono wa sore o ushinai, watashi no tame, mata fukuin no tame ni, jibun no inochi o ushinau mono wa, sore o sukuude arou.
Hito ga zensekai o moukete mo, jibun no inochi o sonshitara, nan no e ni narou ka.
Mata, hito wa donna daika o haratte, sono inochi o kaimodosu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Jaaku de tsumibukai kono jidai ni atte, watashi to watashi no kotoba to o hajiru mono ni taishite wa, hito no ko mo mata, chichi no eikou no uchi ni sei naru mitsukai tachi to tomo ni kuru toki ni, sono mono o hajirude arou".
Mata, karera ni iwareta, "Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Kami no kuni ga chikara o motte kuru no o miru made wa, kesshite shi o ajiwawanai mono ga, koko ni tatte iru mono no naka ni iru".
Muika no nochi, Iesu wa, tada Petero, Yakobu, Yohane dake o tsurete, takai yama ni noborareta. Tokoro ga, karera no me no mae de Iesu no sugata ga kawari,
Sono koromo wa masshiroku kagayaki, donna nuno sarashi de mo, sore hodo ni shiroku suru koto wa dekinai kurai ni natta.
Suruto, Eriya ga Moose to tomo ni karera ni arawarete, Iesu to katariatte ita.
Petero wa Iesu ni mukatte itta, "Sensei, watashitachi ga koko ni iru no wa, subarashii koto desu. Sore de, watashitachi wa koya o mittsu tatemashou. Hitotsu wa anata no tame ni, hitotsu wa Moose no tame ni, hitotsu wa Eriya no tame ni".
Sou itta no wa, minna no mono ga hijou ni osorete ita no de, Petero wa nani o itte yoi ka, wakaranakattakara de aru.
Suruto, kumo ga wakiokotte karera o ootta. Soshite, sono kumo no naka kara koe ga atta, "Kore wa watashi no aisuru ko de aru. Kore ni kike".
Karera wa isoide mimawashitaga, mohaya dare mo miezu, tada Iesu dake ga, jibuntachi to issho ni orareta.
Ichidou ga yama o kudatte kuru toki, Iesu wa "Hito no ko ga shinin no naka kara yomigaeru made wa, ima mita koto o dare ni mo hanashite wa naranai" to, karera ni meijirareta.
Karera wa kono kotoba o kokoro ni tome, shinin no naka kara yomigaeru to wa dou iu koto ka to, tagai ni ronjiatta.
Soshite Iesu ni tazuneta, "Naze, rippougakusha tachi wa, Eriya ga saki ni kuru hazu da to itte iru no desu ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Tashika ni, Eriya ga saki ni kite, banji o motodoori ni aratameru. Shikashi, hito no ko ni tsuite, kare ga ooku no kurushimi o uke, katsu hazukashimerareruto, kaite aru no wa naze ka.
Shikashi anata gata ni itte oku, Eriya wa sudeni kita no da. Soshite kare ni tsuite kaite aru you ni, hitobito wa jibun katte ni kare o ashiratta".
Sate, karera ga hoka no deshitachi no tokoro ni kite miruto, oozei no gunshuu ga deshitachi o torikakomi, soshite rippougakusha tachi ga karera to ronjiatte ita.
Gunshuu wa mina, sugu Iesu o mitsukete, hijou ni odoroki, kakeyotte kite, aisatsu o shita.
Iesu ga karera ni, "Anata gata wa karera to nani o ronjite iru no ka" to tazunerareruto,
Gunshuu no hitori ga kotaeta, "Sensei, oshi no rei ni tsukarete iru watashi no musuko o, kochira ni tsurete mairimashita.
Rei ga kono musuko ni toritsukimasuto, doko de de mo kare o hikitaoshi, sore kara kare wa awa o fuki, ha o kuishibari, karada o kowabarasete shimaimasu. Sore de odeshitachi ni, kono rei o oidashite kudasaru you ni negaimashitaga, dekimasendeshita".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Aa, nan to iu fushinkou na jidai de arou. Itsu made, watashi wa anata gata to issho ni orareyou ka. Itsu made, anata gata ni gaman ga dekiyou ka. Sono ko o watashi no tokoro ni tsurete ki nasai".
Soko de hitobito wa, sono ko o mimoto ni tsurete kita. Rei ga Iesu o miru ya ina ya, sono ko o hikitsukesaseta no de, ko wa chi ni taore, awa o fukinagara korogemawatta.
Soko de, Iesu ga chichioya ni "Itsugoro kara, konna ni natta no ka" to tazunerareruto, chichioya wa kotaeta, "Osanai toki kara desu.
Rei wa tabitabi, kono ko o hi no naka, mizu no naka ni nageirete, korosou to shimashita. Shikashi dekimasureba, watashidomo o awarende otasuke kudasai".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Moshi dekireba, to iu no ka. Shinzuru mono ni wa, donna koto de mo dekiru".
Sono ko no chichioya wa sugu sakende itta, "Shinjimasu. Fushinkou na watashi o, otasuke kudasai".
Iesu wa gunshuu ga kakeyotte kuru no o goran ni natte, kegareta rei o shikatte iwareta, "Oshi to tsunbo no rei yo, watashi ga omae ni meijiru. Kono ko kara dete ike. Ni do to, haitte kuru na".
Suruto rei wa sakebigoe o age, hageshiku hikitsukesasete dete itta. Sono ko wa shinin no you ni natta no de, ooku no hito wa, shinda no da to itta.
Shikashi, Iesu ga te o totte okosareruto, sono ko wa tachiagatta.
Ie ni wa irareta toki, deshitachi wa hisoka ni otazune shita, "Watashitachi wa, dou shite rei o oidasenakatta no desu ka".
Suruto, Iesu wa iwareta, "Kono tagui wa, inori ni yoranakereba, dou shite mo oidasu koto wa dekinai".
Sore kara karera wa soko o tachisari, Gariraya o tootte ittaga, Iesu wa hito ni kizukareru no o konomarenakatta.
Sore wa, Iesu ga deshitachi ni oshiete, "Hito no ko wa hitobito no te ni watasare, karera ni korosare, korosarete kara mikka no nochi ni yomigaerude arou" to itte oraretakara de aru.
Shikashi, karera wa Iesu no iwareta koto o satorazu, mata tazuneru no o osorete ita.
Sore kara karera wa Kapenaumu ni kita. Soshite ie ni orareru toki, Iesu wa deshitachi ni tazunerareta, "Anata gata wa tochuu de nani o ronjite ita no ka".
Karera wa damatte ita. Sore wa tochuu de, dare ga ichiban erai ka to, tagai ni ronjiatte itakara de aru.
Soko de, Iesu wa suwatte juu ni deshi o yobi, soshite iwareta, "Dare de mo ichiban saki ni narou to omounaraba, ichiban ato ni nari, minna ni tsukaeru mono to naraneba naranai".
Soshite, hitori no osanago o toriagete, karera no mannaka ni tatase, sore o daite iwareta.
"Dare de mo, kono you na osanago no hitori o, watashi no na no yue ni ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de aru. Soshite, watashi o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de wa naku, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta kata o ukeireru no de aru".
Yohane ga Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, watashitachi ni tsuite konai mono ga, anata no na o tsukatte akurei o oidashite iru no o mimashitaga, sono hito wa watashitachi ni tsuite konakatta no de, yamesasemashita".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yamesasenai ga yoi. Dare de mo watashi no na de chikara aru waza o okonainagara, sugu sono ato de, watashi o soshiru koto wa dekinai.
Watashitachi ni hantai shinai mono wa, watashitachi no mikata de aru.
Dare de mo, Kirisuto ni tsuite iru mono da to iu no de, anata gata ni mizu ippai de mo nomasete kureru mono wa, yoku itte okuga, kesshite sono mukui kara moreru koto wa naide arou.
Mata, watashi o shinjiru korera no chiisai mono no hitori o tsumazukaseru mono wa, ookina hikiusu o kubi ni kakerarete umi ni nagekomareta hou ga, haruka ni yoi.
Moshi, anata no katate ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o kirisute nasai. Ryoute ga sorotta mama de jigoku no kienai hi no naka ni ochikomu yori wa, kata wa ni natte inochi ni hairu hou ga yoi. []
Jigoku de wa, uji ga tsukizu, hi mo kieru koto ga nai.]
Moshi, anata no kataashi ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o kirisute nasai. Ryouashi ga sorotta mama de jigoku ni nageirerareru yori wa, kataashi de inochi ni hairu hou ga yoi. []
Jigoku de wa, uji ga tsukizu, hi mo kieru koto ga nai.]
Moshi, anata no katame ga tsumi o okasaserunara, sore o nukidashi nasai. Ryougan ga sorotta mama de jigoku ni nageirerareru yori wa, katame ni natte kami no kuni ni hairu hou ga yoi.
Jigoku de wa, uji ga tsukizu, hi mo kieru koto ga nai.
Hito wa subete hi de shiozuke rareneba naranai.
Shio wa yoi mono de aru. Shikashi, moshi sono shio no aji ga nuketara, nani ni yotte sono aji ga torimodosareyou ka. Anata gata jishin no uchi ni shio o mochi nasai. Soshite, tagai ni yawaragi nasai".
Sore kara, Iesu wa soko o satte, Yudaya no chihou to Yorudan no mukougawa e ikaretaga, gunshuu ga mata yoriatsumatta no de, itsu mo no you ni, mata oshiete orareta.
Sono toki, Parisaibitotachi ga chikazuite kite, Iesu o kokoromiyou to shite shitsumon shita, "Otto wa sono tsuma o dashite mo sashitsukaenaideshou ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Moose wa anata gata ni nan to meijita ka".
Karera wa itta, "Moose wa, rienjou o kaite tsuma o dasu koto o yurushimashita".
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Moose wa anata gata no kokoro ga, katakuna na no de, anata gata no tame ni kono sadame o kaita no de aru.
Shikashi, tenchi souzou no hajime kara, 'Kami wa hito o otoko to onna to ni tsukurareta.
Sore yue ni, hito wa sono fubo o hanare,
Futari no mono wa ittai to narubekide aru'. Karera wa mohaya, futari de wa naku ittai de aru.
Dakara, kami ga awaserareta mono o, hito wa hanashite wa naranai".
Ie ni haitte kara, deshitachi wa mata kono koto ni tsuite tazuneta.
Soko de, Iesu wa iwareta, "Dare de mo, jibun no tsuma o dashite ta no onna o metoru mono wa, sono tsuma ni taishite kan'in o okonau no de aru.
Mata tsuma ga, sono otto to wakarete ta no otoko ni totsugunaraba, kan'in o okonau no de aru".
Iesu ni sawatte itadaku tame ni, hitobito ga osanagora o mimoto ni tsurete kita. Tokoro ga, deshitachi wa karera o tashinameta.
Sore o mite Iesu wa ikidoori, karera ni iwareta, "Osanagora o watashi no tokoro ni kuru mama ni shite oki nasai. Tomete wa naranai. Kami no kuni wa kono you na mono no kuni de aru.
Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Dare de mo osanago no you ni kami no kuni o ukeireru mono de nakereba, soko ni hairu koto wa kesshite dekinai".
Soshite karera o idaki, te o sono ue ni oite shukufuku sareta.
Iesu ga michi ni dete ikareruto, hitori no hito ga hashiriyori, mimae ni hizamazuite tazuneta, "Yoki shi yo, eien no seimei o ukeru tame ni, nani o shitara yoideshou ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Naze watashi o yoki mono to iu no ka. Kami hitori no hoka ni yoi mono wa inai.
Imashime wa anata no shitte iru toori de aru. 'Korosu na, kan'in suru na, nusumu na, gishou o tateru na. Azamuki toru na. Chichi to haha to o uyamae' ".
Suruto, kare wa itta, "Sensei, sorera no koto wa mina, chiisai toki kara mamotte orimasu".
Iesu wa kare ni me o tome, itsukushinde iwareta, "Anata ni tarinai koto ga hitotsu aru. Kaette, motte iru mono o mina uriharatte, mazushii hitobito ni hodokoshi nasai. Sou sureba, ten ni takara o motsu you ni narou. Soshite, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai".
Suruto, kare wa kono kotoba o kiite, kao o kumorase, kanashiminagara tachisatta. Takusan no shisan o motte itakara de aru.
Sore kara, Iesu wa mimawashite, deshitachi ni iwareta, "Zaisan no aru mono ga kami no kuni ni wa iru no wa, nan to muzukashii koto de arou".
Deshitachi wa kono kotoba ni odorokiayashinda. Iesu wa sarani iwareta, "Kotachi yo, kami no kuni ni wa iru no wa, nan to muzukashii koto de arou.
Tonde iru mono ga kami no kuni ni wa iru yori wa, rakuda ga hari no ana o tooru hou ga, motto yasashii".
Suruto karera wa masumasu odoroite, tagai ni itta, "Sore de wa, dare ga sukuwareru koto ga dekiru no darou".
Iesu wa karera o mitsumete iwareta, "Hito ni wa dekinaiga, kami ni wa dekiru. Kami wa nan de mo dekirukara de aru".
Petero ga Iesu ni ii dashita, "Goran nasai, watashitachi wa issai o sutete, anata ni shitagatte mairimashita".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Dare de mo watashi no tame ni, mata fukuin no tame ni, ie, kyoudai, shimai, haha, chichi, ko, moshikuha hatake o suteta mono wa,
Kanarazu sono hyaku bai o ukeru. Sunawachi, ima kono jidai de wa ie, kyoudai, shimai, haha, ko oyobi hatake o hakugai to tomo ni uke, mata, kitarubeki yo de wa eien no seimei o ukeru.
Shikashi, ooku no saki no mono wa ato ni nari, ato no mono wa saki ni narude arou".
Sate, ichidou wa Erusaremu e noboru tojou ni attaga, Iesu ga sentou ni tatte ikareta no de, karera wa odorokiayashimi, shitagau monotachi wa osoreta. Suru to Iesu wa mata juu ni deshi o yobiyosete, jibun no mi ni okorou to suru koto ni tsuite katari hajimerareta,
"Miyo, watashitachi wa Erusaremu e nobotte ikuga, hito no ko wa saishichou, rippougakusha tachi no te ni hikiwatasareru. Soshite karera wa shikei o senkoku shita ue, kare o ihoujin ni hikiwatasude arou.
Mata kare o azakeri, tsubaki o kake, muchiuchi, tsuini koroshite shimau. Soshite kare wa mikka no nochi ni yomigaerude arou".
Sate, Zebedai no ko no Yakobu to Yohane to ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Sensei, watashitachi ga otanomi suru koto wa, nan de mo kanaete kudasaru you ni onegai shimasu".
Iesu wa karera ni "Nani o shite hoshii to, negau no ka" to iwareta.
Suruto karera wa itta, "Eikou o ouke ni naru toki, hitori o anata no migi ni, hitori o hidari ni suwaru you ni shite kudasai".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata wa jibun ga nani o motomete iru no ka, wakatte inai. Anata gata wa, watashi ga nomu sakazuki o nomi, watashi ga ukeru baputesuma o ukeru koto ga dekiru ka".
Karera wa "Dekimasu" to kotaeta. Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata wa, watashi ga nomu sakazuki o nomi, watashi ga ukeru baputesuma o ukerude arou.
Shikashi, watashi no migi, hidari ni suwaraseru koto wa, watashi no suru koto de wa naku, tada sonaerarete iru hitobito dake ni yurusareru koto de aru".
Juunin no mono wa kore o kiite, Yakobu to Yohane to no koto de fungai shi dashita.
Soko de, Iesu wa karera o yobiyosete iwareta, "Anata gata no shitte iru toori, ihoujin no shihaisha to mirarete iru hitobito wa, sono tami o osame, mata erai hitotachi wa, sono tami no ue ni kenryoku o furutte iru.
Shikashi, anata gata no aida de wa, sou de atte wa naranai. Kaette, anata gata no aida de eraku naritai to omou mono wa, tsukaeru hitotonari,
Anata gata no aida de kashira ni naritai to omou mono wa, subete no hito no shimobe to naraneba naranai.
Hito no ko ga kita no mo, tsukaerareru tame de wa naku, tsukaeru tame de ari, mata ooku no hito no a ga nai to shite, jibun no inochi o ataeru tame de aru".
Sore kara, karera wa Eriko ni kita. Soshite, Iesu ga deshitachi ya oozei no gunshuu to tomo ni Eriko kara dekakerareta toki, Temai no ko, Barutemai to iu moujin no ko ji ki ga, michibata ni suwatte ita.
Tokoro ga, Nazare no Iesu da to kiite, kare wa "Dabide no ko Iesu yo, watashi o awarende kudasai" to sakebi dashita.
Ooku no hitobito wa kare o shikatte damaraseyou to shitaga, kare wa masumasu hageshiku sakebi tsuzuketa, "Dabide no ko Iesu yo, watashi o awarende kudasai".
Iesu wa tachidomatte "Kare o yobe" to meijirareta. Soko de, hitobito wa sono moujin o yonde itta, "Yorokobe, tate, omae o yonde orareru".
Soko de kare wa uwagi o nugisute, odoriagatte Iesu no moto ni kita.
Iesu wa kare ni mukatte iwareta, "Watashi ni nani o shite hoshii no ka". Sono moujin wa itta, "Sensei, mieru you ni naru koto desu".
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Ike, anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta". Suruto kare wa, tachimachi mieru you ni nari, Iesu ni shitagatte itta.
Sate, karera ga Erusaremu ni chikazuki, oribu no yama ni sotta Betepage, Betaniya no fukin ni kita toki, Iesu wa futari no deshi o tsukawashite iwareta,
"Mukou no mura e iki nasai. Soko ni hairuto sugu, mada dare mo notta koto no nai roba no ko ga, tsunaide aru no o mirude arou. Sore o toite hiite ki nasai.
Moshi, dare ka ga anata gata ni, naze sonna koto o suru no ka to ittanara, Shu ga oiriyou na no desu. Mata sugu, koko e kaeshite kudasaimasuto, ii nasai".
Soko de, karera wa dekakete iki, soshite omotedoori no toguchi ni, roba no ko ga tsunaide aru no o mita no de, sore o toita.
Suruto, soko ni tatte ita hitobito ga itta, "Sono roba no ko o toite, dou suru no ka".
Deshitachi wa, Iesu ga iwareta toori karera ni hanashita no de, yurushite kureta.
Soko de, deshitachi wa, sono roba no ko o Iesu no tokoro ni hiite kite, jibuntachi no uwagi o sore ni nagekakeruto, Iesu wa sono ue ni onori ni natta.
Suruto ooku no hitobito wa jibuntachi no uwagi o michi ni shiki, mata ta no hitobito wa ha no tsuita eda o nohara kara kitte kite shiita.
Soshite, mae ni yuku mono mo, ato ni shitagau mono mo tomo ni sakebi tsuzuketa, "Hosana, Shu no mina ni yotte kitaru mono ni, shukufuku are.
Ima kitaru, warera no chichi Dabide no kuni ni, shukufuku are. Ito takaki tokoro ni, hosana".
Kou shite Iesu wa Erusaremu ni tsuki, miya ni wa irareta. Soshite, subete no mono o mimawatta nochi, mohaya toki mo osoku natte ita no de, juu ni deshi to tomo ni Betaniya ni dete ikareta.
Yokujitsu, karera ga Betaniya kara dekakete kita toki, Iesu wa kuufuku o oboerareta.
Soshite, ha no shigetta ichijiku no ki o tooku kara goran ni natte, sono ki ni nani ka ari wa shinai ka to chikayoraretaga, ha no hoka wa nani mo miataranakatta. Ichijiku no kisetsu de nakattakara de aru.
Soko de, Iesu wa sono ki ni mukatte, "Ima kara nochi itsu made mo, omae no mi o taberu mono ga nai you ni" to iwareta. Deshitachi wa kore o kiite ita.
Sore kara, karera wa Erusaremu ni kita. Iesu wa miya ni hairi, miya no niwa de urikai shite ita hitobito o oidashi hajime, ryougaenin no dai ya, hato o uru mono no koshikake o kutsugaeshi,
Mata utsuwa mono o motte miya no niwa o toorinukeru no o oyurushi ni naranakatta.
Soshite, karera ni oshiete iwareta, " 'Watashi no ie wa, subete no kokumin no inori no ie to tonaerarubekide aru' to kaite aru de wa nai ka. Sore da no ni, anata gata wa sore o goutou no su ni shite shimatta".
Saishichou, rippougakusha tachi wa kore o kiite, dou ka shite Iesu o korosou to hakatta. Karera wa, gunshuu ga mina sono oshie ni kandou shite ita no de, Iesu o osorete itakara de aru.
Yuugata ni naruto, Iesu to deshitachi to wa, itsu mo no you ni miyako no soto ni dete itta.
Asa hayaku michi o tootte iruto, karera wa saki no ichijiku ga nemoto kara karete iru no o mita.
Soko de, Petero wa omoidashite Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, goran nasai. Anata ga norowareta ichijiku ga, karete imasu".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Kami o shinji nasai.
Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Dare de mo kono yama ni, ugoki dashite, umi no naka ni haire to ii, sono itta koto wa kanarazu naruto, kokoro ni utagawanaide shinjirunara, sono toori ni narude arou.
Soko de, anata gata ni iuga, nan de mo inorimotomeru koto wa, sudeni kanaerareta to shinji nasai. Sou sureba, sono toori ni narude arou.
Mata tatte inoru toki, dare ka ni taishite, nani ka urami koto ga arunaraba, yurushite yari nasai. Sou sureba, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi mo, anata gata no ayamachi o, yurushite kudasarude arou. []
Moshi yurusanainaraba, ten ni imasu anata gata no chichi mo, anata gata no ayamachi o, yurushite kudasaranaide arou]".
Karera wa mata Erusaremu ni kita. Soshite, Iesu ga miya no uchi o aruite orareruto, saishichou, rippougakusha, chouroutachi ga, mimoto ni kite itta,
"Nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no desu ka. Dare ga, sou suru ken'i o sazuketa no desu ka".
Soko de, Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Hitotsu dake tazuneyou. Sore ni kotaete hoshii. Sou shitara, nani no ken'i ni yotte, watashi ga korera no koto o suru no ka, anata gata ni iou.
Yohane no baputesuma wa ten kara de atta ka, hito kara de atta ka, kotae nasai".
Suruto, karera wa tagai ni ronjite itta, "Moshi ten kara da to ieba, de wa, naze kare o shinjinakatta no ka, to Iesu wa iudarou.
Shikashi, hito kara da to ieba......". Karera wa gunshuu o osorete ita. Hitobito ga mina, Yohane o yogensha da to hontou ni omotte itakara de aru.
Sore de karera wa "Watashitachi ni wa wakarimasen" to kotaeta. Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi mo nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no ka, anata gata ni iumai".
Soko de Iesu wa tatoe de karera ni katari dasareta, "Aru hito ga budouen o tsukuri, kaki o megurashi, mata saka bune no ana o hori, yagura o tate, sore o noufutachi ni kashite, tabi ni dekaketa.
Kisetsu ni natta no de, noufutachi no tokoro e, hitori no shimobe o okutte, budouen no shuukaku no wakemae o toritatesaseyou to shita.
Suruto, karera wa sono shimobe o tsukamaete, fukurodataki ni shi, kara te de kaeraseta.
Mata ta no shimobe o okuttaga, sono atama o nagutte bujoku shita.
Soko de mata ta no mono o okuttaga, kondo wa sore o koroshite shimatta. Sono hoka, nao oozei no mono o okuttaga, karera o ut tari, koroshi tari shita.
Koko ni, mou hitori no mono ga ita. Sore wa kare no aishi de atta. Jibun no ko wa uyamatte kurerudarou to omotte, saigo ni kare o tsukawashita.
Suruto, noufutachi wa 'Are wa ato tori da. Saa, kore o koroshite shimaou. Sou shitara, sono zaisan wa wareware no mono ni naru no da' to hanashiai,
Kare o tsukamaete koroshi, budouen no soto ni nagesuteta.
Kono budouen no shujin wa, dou surudarou ka. Kare wa dete kite, noufutachi o koroshi, budouen o ta no hitobito ni ataerude arou.
Anata gata wa, kono seisho no ku o yonda koto ga nai no ka. 'Ietsukurira no suteta ishi ga sumi no kashira ishi ni natta.
Kore wa Shu ga nasareta koto de, watashitachi no me ni wa fushigi ni mieru' ".
Karera wa ima no tatoe ga, jibuntachi ni atete katarareta koto o satotta no de, Iesu o toraeyou to shitaga, gunshuu o osoreta. Soshite Iesu o soko ni nokoshite tachisatta.
Sate, hitobito wa Parisaibito ya Herodetou no mono o suunin, Iesu no moto ni tsukawashite, sono kotobajiri o toraeyou to shita.
Karera wa kite Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa anata ga shinjitsu na kata de, dare o mo, habakararenai koto o shitte imasu. Anata wa hito ni wakehedate o nasaranaide, shinri ni motozuite kami no michi o oshiete kudasaimasu. Tokoro de, Kaizaru ni zeikin o osamete yoideshou ka, ikenaideshou ka. Osamerubekideshou ka, osamete wa naranai no deshou ka".
Iesu wa karera no gizen o minuite iwareta, "Naze watashi o tamesou to suru no ka. Denari o motte kite mise nasai".
Karera wa sore o motte kita. Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Kore wa, dare no shouzou, dare no kigou ka". Karera wa "Kaizaru no desu" to kotaeta.
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Kaizaru no mono wa Kaizaru ni, kami no mono wa kami ni kaeshi nasai". Karera wa Iesu ni kyoutan shita.
Fukkatsu to iu koto wa nai to shuchou shite ita Sadokaibitotachi ga, Iesu no moto ni kite shitsumon shita,
"Sensei, Moose wa, watashitachi no tame ni kou kaite imasu, 'Moshi, aru hito no ani ga shinde, sono nokosareta tsuma ni, ko ga nai baai ni wa, otouto wa kono onna o metotte, ani no tame ni ko o moukeneba naranai'.
Koko ni, shichinin no kyoudai ga imashita. Chounan wa tsuma o metorimashitaga, ko ga nakute shini,
Jinan ga sono onna o metotte, mata ko o moukezu ni shini, sannan mo douyou deshita.
Kou shite, shichinintomo mina shison o nokoshimasendeshita. Saigo ni sono onna mo shinimashita.
Fukkatsu no toki, karera ga mina yomigaetta baai, kono onna wa dare no tsuma na no deshou ka. Nananin to mo kanojo o tsuma ni shita no desuga".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata ga sonna omoichigai o shite iru no wa, seisho mo kami no chikara mo shiranaikara de wa nai ka.
Karera ga shinin no naka kara yomigaeru toki ni wa, metot tari, to tsui dari suru koto wa nai. Karera wa ten ni iru mitsukai no you na mono de aru.
Shinin ga yomigaeru koto ni tsuite wa, Moose no sho no shiba no hen de, kami ga Moose ni ooserareta kotoba o yonda koto ga nai no ka. 'Watashi wa Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami de aru' to aru de wa nai ka.
Kami wa shinda mono no kami de wa naku, ikite iru mono no kami de aru. Anata gata wa hijou na omoichigai o shite iru".
Hitori no rippougakusha ga kite, karera ga tagai ni ronjiatte iru no o kiki, mata Iesu ga takumi ni kotaerareta no o mitomete, Iesu ni shitsumon shita, "Subete no imashime no naka de, dore ga daiichi no mono desu ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Daiichi no imashime wa kore de aru, 'Isuraeru yo, kike. Shu naru watashitachi no kami wa, tada hitori no Shu de aru.
Kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, omoi o tsukushi, chikara o tsukushite, Shu naru anata no kami o aiseyo'.
Daini wa kore de aru, 'Jibun o aisuru you ni anata no tonarihito o aiseyo'. Kore yori daiji na imashime wa, hoka ni nai".
Soko de, kono rippougakusha wa Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, oose no toori desu, 'Kami wa hitori de atte, sono hoka ni kami wa nai' to iwareta no wa, hontou desu.
Mata 'Kokoro o tsukushi, chie o tsukushi, chikara o tsukushite kami o aishi, mata jibun o aisuru you ni tonarihito o aisuru' to iu koto wa, subete no hansai ya gisei yori mo, haruka ni daiji na koto desu".
Iesu wa, kare ga tekisetsu na kotae o shita no o mite iwareta, "Anata wa kami no kuni kara tooku nai". Sore kara nochi wa, Iesu ni aete tou mono wa nakatta.
Iesu ga miya de oshiete orareta toki, kou iwareta, "Rippougakusha tachi wa, dou shite Kirisuto o Dabide no ko da to iu no ka.
Dabide jishin ga seirei ni kanjite itta, 'Shu wa waga Shu ni oose ni natta, anata no teki o anata no ashimoto ni oku toki made wa, watashi no migi ni zashite i nasai'.
Kono you ni, Dabide jishin ga Kirisuto o Shu to yonde iru. Sore nara, dou shite Kirisuto wa Dabide no ko de arou ka". Oozei no gunshuu wa, yorokonde Iesu ni mimi o katamukete ita.
Iesu wa sono oshie no naka de iwareta, "Rippougakusha ni ki o tsuke nasai. Karera wa nagai koromo o kite aruku koto ya, hiroba de aisatsu sareru koto ya,
Mata kaidou no jouseki, enkai no kamiza o kononde iru.
Mata, yamometachi no ie o kuitaoshi, mie no tame ni nagai inori o suru. Karera wa motto kibishii sabaki o ukerude arou".
Iesu wa, saisen hako ni mukatte suwari, gunshuu ga sono hako ni kane o nageireru yousu o mite orareta. Ooku no kanemochi wa, takusan no kane o nageirete ita.
Tokoro ga, hitori no mazushii yamome ga kite, reputa futatsu o ireta. Sore wa ichi kodoranto ni ataru.
Soko de, Iesu wa deshitachi o yobiyosete iwareta, "Yoku kiki nasai. Ano mazushii yamome wa, saisen hako ni nageirete iru hitotachi no naka de, dare yori mo takusan ireta no da.
Minna no mono wa ariamaru naka kara nageiretaga, ano fujin wa sono toboshii naka kara, arayuru mochimono, sono seikatsuhi zenbu o iretakara de aru".
Iesu ga miya kara dete ikareru toki, deshi no hitori ga itta, "Sensei, goran nasai. Nan to iu migoto na ishi, nan to iu rippa na tatemono deshou".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata wa, korera no ookina tatemono o nagamete iru no ka. Sono ishi hitotsu de mo kuzusarenai mama de, ta no ishi no ue ni nokoru koto mo nakunarude arou".
Mata oribuyama de, miya ni mukatte suwatte orareruto, Petero, Yakobu, Yohane, Andere ga, hisoka ni otazune shita.
"Watashitachi ni ohanashi kudasai. Itsu, sonna koto ga okoru no deshou ka. Mata sonna koto ga kotogotoku jouju suru you na baai ni wa, donna zenchou ga arimasu ka".
Soko de, Iesu wa hanashi hajimerareta, "Hito ni madowasarenai you ni ki o tsuke nasai.
Ooku no mono ga watashi no na o nanotte araware, jibun ga sore da to itte, ooku no hito o madowasude arou.
Mata, sensou to sensou no uwasa to o kiku toki ni mo, awateru na. Sore wa okoraneba naranaiga, mada owari de wa nai.
Tami wa tami ni, kuni wa kuni ni tekitai shite tachiagarude arou. Mata achikochi ni jishin ga ari, mata kikin ga okorude arou. Korera wa umi no kurushimi no hajime de aru.
Anata gata wa jibun de ki o tsukete i nasai. Anata gata wa, watashi no tame ni, shuugisho ni hikiwatasare, kaidou de utare, choukantachi ya outachi no mae ni tatasare, karera ni taishite akashi o saserarerude arou.
Kou shite, fukuin wa mazu subete no tami ni nobetsutaerareneba naranai.
Soshite, hitobito ga anatagata o tsurete itte hikiwatasu toki, nani o iou ka to, mae motte shinpai suru na. Sono baai, jibun ni shimesareru koto o kataru ga yoi. Kataru mono wa anata gata jishin de wa nakute, seirei de aru.
Mata kyoudai wa kyoudai o, chichi wa ko o korosu tame ni watashi, ko wa ryoushin ni sakaratte tachi, karera o korosaserude arou.
Mata, anata gata wa watashi no na no yue ni, subete no hito ni nikumarerude arou. Shikashi, saigo made taeshinobu mono wa sukuwareru.
Arasu nikumubeki mono ga, tatte wa naranu tokoro ni tatsu no o mitanaraba (dokusha yo, satore), sono toki, Yudaya ni iru hitobito wa yama e nige yo.
Okujou ni iru mono wa, shita ni oriru na. Mata ie kara mono o toridasou to shite uchi ni hairu na.
Hatake ni iru mono wa, uwagi o tori ni ato e modoru na.
Sono hi ni wa, miomo no onna to chinomi go o motsu onna to wa, fukou de aru.
Kono koto ga fuyu okoranu you ni inore.
Sono hi ni wa, kami ga banbutsu o tsukurareta souzou no hajime kara genzai ni itaru made, katsute naku kongo mo nai you na kannan ga okorukara de aru.
Moshi Shu ga sono kikan o chijimete kudasaranainara, sukuwareru mono wa hitori mo naide arou. Shikashi, erabareta senmin no tame ni, sono kikan o chijimete kudasatta no de aru.
Sono toki, dare ka ga anata gata ni 'Miyo, koko ni Kirisuto ga iru', 'Miyo, asoko ni iru' to itte mo, sore o shinjiru na.
Nise Kirisutotachi ya, nise yogensha tachi ga okotte, shirushi to kiseki to o okonai, dekireba, senmin o mo madowasou to surude arou.
Dakara, ki o tsukete i nasai. Issai no koto o, anata gata ni mae motte itte oku.
Sono hi ni wa, kono kannan no nochi, hi wa kuraku nari, tsuki wa sono hikari o hanatsu koto o yame,
Hoshi wa sora kara ochi, tentai wa yuriugokasarerude arou.
Sono toki, ooinaru chikara to eikou to o motte, hito no ko ga kumo ni notte kuru no o, hitobito wa mirude arou.
Sono toki, kare wa mitsukai tachi o tsukawashite, chi no hate kara ten no hate made, shihou kara sono senmin o yobiatsumerude arou.
Ichijiku no ki kara kono tatoe o manabi nasai. Sono eda ga yawaraka ni nari, ha ga deru you ni naruto, natsu no chikai koto ga wakaru.
Sono you ni, korera no koto ga okoru no o mitanaraba, hito no ko ga toguchi made chikazuite iru to shiri nasai.
Yoku kiite oki nasai. Korera no koto ga, kotogotoku okoru made wa, kono jidai wa horobiru koto ga nai.
Tenchi wa horobirude arou. Shikashi watashi no kotoba wa horobiru koto ga nai.
Sono hi, sono toki wa, dare mo shiranai. Ten ni iru mitsukai tachi mo, mata ko mo shiranai, tada chichi dake ga shitte orareru.
Ki o tsukete, me o samashite i nasai. Sono toki ga itsu de aru ka, anata gata ni wa wakaranaikara de aru.
Sore wa choudo, tabi ni tatsu hito ga ie o deru ni atari, sono shimobetachi ni, sorezore shigoto o wariatete sekinin o motase, monban ni wa me o samashite ore to, meijiru you na mono de aru.
Dakara, me o samashite i nasai. Itsu, ie no shujin ga kaette kuru no ka, yuugata ka, yonaka ka, niwatori no naku koro ka, akegata ka, wakaranaikara de aru.
Aruiha kyuu ni kaette kite, anata gata no nemutte iru tokoro o mitsukeru ka mo shirenai.
Me o samashite i nasai. Watashi ga anata gata ni iu kono kotoba wa, subete no hitobito ni iu no de aru".
Sate, sugikoshi to jokou to no matsuri no futaka mae ni natta. Saishichou tachi ya rippougakusha tachi wa, sakuryaku o motte Iesu o toraeta ue, nan to ka shite korosou to hakatte ita.
Karera wa, "Matsuri no aida wa ikenai. Minshuu ga sawagi o okosu ka mo shirenai" to itte ita.
Iesu ga Betaniya de, raibyounin Shimon no ie ni ite, shokutaku ni tsuite orareta toki, hitori no onna ga, hijou ni kouka de junsui na Narudo no kouyu ga irete aru sekkou no tsubo o motte kite, sore o kowashi, kouyu o Iesu no atama ni sosogi kaketa.
Suruto, aru hitobito ga ikidootte tagai ni itta, "Nan no tame ni kouyu o konna ni muda ni suru no ka.
Kono kouyu o sanbyaku denari ijou ni de mo utte, mazushii hitotachi ni hodokosu koto ga dekita no ni". Soshite onna o kibishiku togameta.
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Suru mama ni sasete oki nasai. Naze onna o komaraseru no ka. Watashi ni yoi koto o shite kureta no da.
Mazushii hitotachi wa itsu mo anata gata to issho ni irukara, shitai toki ni wa itsu de mo, yoi koto o shite yareru. Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata to itsu mo issho ni iru wake de wa nai.
Kono onna wa dekiru kagiri no koto o shita no da. Sunawachi, watashi no karada ni abura o sosoide, arakajime houmuri no youi o shite kureta no de aru.
Yoku kiki nasai. Zensekai no doko de de mo, fukuin ga nobetsutaerareru tokoro de wa, kono onna no shita koto mo kinen to shite katararerude arou".
Toki ni, juu ni deshi no hitori Isukariote no Yuda wa, Iesu o saishichou tachi ni hikiwatasou to shite, karera no tokoro e itta.
Karera wa kore o kiite yorokobi, kin o ataeru koto o yakusoku shita. Soko de Yuda wa, dou ka shite Iesu o hikiwatasou to, kikai o neratte ita.
Jokousai no daiichi nichi, sunawachi sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofuru hi ni, deshitachi ga Iesu ni tazuneta, "Watashitachi wa, sugikoshi no shokuji o nasaru youi o, doko e itte shitara yoideshou ka".
Soko de, Iesu wa futari no deshi o tsukai ni dashite iwareta, "Shinai ni ikuto, mizugame o motte iru otoko ni deaude arou. Sono hito ni tsuite iki nasai.
Soshite, sono hito ga hai tte iku ie no shujin ni ii nasai, 'Deshitachi to issho ni sugikoshi no shokuji o suru zashiki wa doko ka, to sensei ga itte oraremasu'.
Suruto sono shujin wa, seki o totonoete youi sareta ni kai no hiroma o misete kurerukara, soko ni watashitachi no tame ni youi o shi nasai".
Deshitachi wa dekakete shinai ni itte miruto, Iesu ga iwareta toori de atta no de, sugikoshi no shokuji no youi o shita.
Yuugata ni natte, Iesu wa juu ni deshi to issho ni soko ni ikareta.
Soshite, ichidou ga seki ni tsuite shokuji o shite iru toki iwareta, "Tokuni anata gata ni itte okuga, anata gata no naka no hitori de, watashi to issho ni shokuji o shite iru mono ga, watashi o uragirou to shite iru".
Deshitachi wa shinpai shite, hitoribitori "Masaka, watashi de wa naideshou" to ii dashita.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Juu ninin no naka no hitori de, watashi to issho ni onaji hachi ni pan o hitashite iru mono ga, sore de aru.
Tashika ni hito no ko wa, jibun ni tsuite kaite aru toori ni satte iku. Shikashi, hito no ko o uragiru sono hito wa, wazawai de aru. Sono hito wa umarenakatta hou ga, kare no tame ni yokattade arou".
Ichidou ga shokuji o shite iru toki, Iesu wa pan o tori, shukufuku shite kore o saki, deshitachi ni ataete iwareta, "Tore, kore wa watashi no karada de aru".
Mata sakazuki o tori, kansha shite karera ni ataerareruto, ichidou wa sono sakazuki kara nonda.
Iesu wa mata iwareta, "Kore wa, ooku no hito no tame ni nagasu watashi no keiyaku no chi de aru.
Anata gata ni yoku itte oku. Kami no kuni de atarashiku nomu sono hi made wa, watashi wa kesshite ni do to, budou no mi kara tsukutta mono o nomu koto o shinai".
Karera wa,san bi o utatta nochi, oribuyama e dekakete itta.
Sono toki, Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa mina, watashi ni tsumazukude arou. 'Watashi wa hitsujikai o utsu. Soshite, hitsuji wa chirasarerude arou' to kaite arukara de aru.
Shikashi watashi wa, yomigaette kara, anata ga tayori saki ni Gariraya e ikude arou".
Suru to Petero wa Iesu ni itta, "Tatoi, minna no mono ga tsumazuite mo, watashi wa tsumazukimasen".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata ni yoku itte oku. Kyou, kon'ya, niwatori ga ni do naku mae ni, sou iu anata ga, san do watashi o shiranai to iudarou".
Petero wa chikara o komete itta, "Tatoi anata to issho ni shinaneba naranaku natte mo, anata o shiranai nado to wa, kesshite moushimasen". Minna no mono mo mata, onaji you na koto o itta.
Sate, ichidou wa Getsusemane to iu tokoro ni kita. Soshite Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Watashi ga inotte iru aida, koko ni suwatte i nasai".
Soshite Petero, Yakobu, Yohane o issho ni tsurete ikaretaga, osoreononoki, mata nayami hajimete, karera ni iwareta,
"Watashi wa kanashimi no amari shinu hodo de aru. Koko ni matte ite, me o samashite i nasai".
Soshite sukoshi susunde iki, chi ni hirefushi, moshi dekiru koto nara, kono toki o sugisarasete kudasaru you ni to inori tsuzuke, soshite iwareta,
"Aba, chichi yo, anata ni wa, dekinai koto wa arimasen. Dou ka, kono sakazuki o watashi kara torinokete kudasai. Shikashi, watashi no omoi de wa naku, mikokoro no mama ni nasatte kudasai".
Sore kara, kite goran ni naruto, deshitachi ga nemutte ita no de, Petero ni iwareta, "Shimon yo, nemutte iru no ka, hitotoki mo me o samashite iru koto ga dekinakatta no ka.
Yuuwaku ni ochiiranai you ni, me o samashite inotte i nasai. Kokoro wa nesshite iruga, nikutai ga yowai no de aru".
Mata hanarete itte onaji kotoba de inorareta.
Mata kite goran ni naruto, karera wa mada nemutte ita. Sono me ga omoku natte ita no de aru. Soshite, karera wa dou okotae shite yoi ka, wakaranakatta.
San dome ni kite iwareta, "Mada nemutte iru no ka, yasunde iru no ka. Mou sore de yokarou. Toki ga kita. Miyo, hito no ko wa tsumibitora no te ni watasareru no da.
Tate, saa ikou. Miyo, watashi o uragiru mono ga chikazuite kita".
Soshite sugu, Iesu ga mada hanashite orareru uchi ni, juu ni deshi no hitori no Yuda ga susumiyotte kita. Mata saishichou, rippougakusha, chouroutachi kara okurareta gunshuu mo, ken to bou to o motte kare ni tsuite kita.
Iesu o uragiru mono wa, arakajime karera ni aizu o shite oita, "Watashi no seppun suru mono ga, sono hito da. Sono hito o tsukamaete, machigai naku hi hippatte ike".
Kare wa kuruto sugu, Iesu ni chikayori, "Sensei" to itte seppun shita.
Hitobito wa Iesu ni te o kakete tsukamaeta.
Suruto, Iesu no soba ni tatte ita mono no hitori ga, ken o nuite daisaishi no shimobe ni kiri kakari, sono katamimi o kiriotoshita.
Iesu wa karera ni mukatte iwareta, "Anata gata wa goutou ni mukau you ni, ken ya bou o motte watashi o torae ni kita no ka.
Watashi wa mainichi anata gata to issho ni miya ni ite oshiete ita no ni, watashi o tsukamae wa shinakatta. Shikashi seisho no kotoba wa jouju sareneba naranai".
Deshitachi wa mina Iesu o misutete nigesatta.
Toki ni, aru wakamono ga mi ni amanuno o matotte, Iesu no ato ni tsuite ittaga, hitobito ga kare o tsukamaeyou to shita no de,
Sono amanuno o sutete, hadaka de nigete itta.
Sore kara, Iesu o daisaishi no tokoro ni tsurete ikuto, saishichou, chourou, rippougakusha tachi ga mina atsumatte kita.
Petero wa tooku kara Iesu ni tsuite itte, daisaishi no nakaniwa made hairikomi, sono shitayakudomo ni majitte suwari, hi ni atatte ita.
Sate, saishichou tachi to zengikai to wa, Iesu o shikei ni suru tame ni, Iesu ni furi na shouko o mitsukeyou to shitaga, erarenakatta.
Ooku no mono ga Iesu ni taishite gishou o tatetaga, sono shougen ga awanakattakara de aru.
Tsuini, aru hitobito ga tachiagari, Iesu ni taishite gishou o tatete itta,
"Watashitachi wa kono hito ga 'Watashi wa te de tsukutta kono shinden o uchikowashi, mikka no nochi ni te de tsukurarenai betsu no shinden o tateru no da' to iu no o kikimashita".
Shikashi, kono you na shougen mo tagai ni awanakatta.
Soko de daisaishi ga tachiagatte, mannaka ni susumi, Iesu ni kikitadashite itta, "Nani mo kotaenai no ka. Korera no hitobito ga anata ni taishite furi na shougen o moushitatete iruga, dou na no ka".
Shikashi, Iesu wa damatte ite, nani mo okotae ni naranakatta. Daisaishi wa futatabi kikitadashite itta, "Anata wa, ho mubeki mono no ko, Kirisuto de aru ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi ga sore de aru. Anata gata wa hito no ko ga chikara aru mono no migi ni zashi, ten no kumo ni notte kuru no o mirude arou".
Suruto, daisaishi wa sono koromo o hikisaite itta, "Dou shite, kore ijou, shounin no hitsuyou ga arou.
Anata gata wa kono kega shi goto o kiita. Anata gata no iken wa dou ka". Suruto, karera wa mina, Iesu o shi ni ataru mono to dantei shita.
Soshite, aru mono wa Iesu ni tsubaki o kake, mekakushi o shi, kobushi de tataite, "Iiatete mi yo" to ii hajimeta. Mata shitayakudomo wa Iesu o hikitotte, tenohira de tataita.
Petero wa shita de nakaniwa ni itaga, daisaishi no jochuu no hitori ga kite,
Petero ga hi ni atatte iru no o miruto, kare o mitsumete, "Anata mo ano Nazarebito Iesu to issho datta" to itta.
Suru to Petero wa sore o uchikeshite, "Watashi wa shiranai. Anata no iu koto ga nan no koto ka, wakaranai" to itte, niwaguchi no hou ni dete itta.
Tokoro ga, saki no jochuu ga kare o mite, soba ni tatte ita hitobito ni, matamoya "Kono hito wa ano nakama no hitori desu" to ii dashita.
Petero wa futatabi sore o uchikeshita. Shibaraku shite, soba ni tatte ita hitotachi ga mata Petero ni itta, "Tashika ni anata wa karera no nakama da. Anata mo Garirayabito dakara".
Shikashi, kare wa, "Anata gata no hanashite iru sono hito no koto wa nani mo shiranai" to iihatte, hageshiku chikai hajimeta.
Suruto sugu, niwatori ga ni dome ni naita. Petero wa, "Niwatori ga ni do naku mae ni, san do watashi o shiranai to iude arou" to iwareta Iesu no kotoba o omoidashi, soshite omoikaeshite naki tsuzuketa.
Yo ga akeruto sugu, saishichou tachi wa chourou, rippougakusha tachi, oyobi zengikai to kyougi o korashita sue, Iesu o shibatte hikidashi, Pirato ni watashita.
Pirato wa Iesu ni tazuneta, "Anata ga Yudayajin no ou de aru ka". Iesu wa, "Sono toori de aru" to okotae ni natta.
Soko de saishichou tachi wa, Iesu no koto o iroiro to uttaeta.
Pirato wa mou ichido Iesu ni tazuneta, "Nani mo kotaenai no ka. Miyo, anata ni taishite anna ni made tsugitsugi ni uttaete irude wa nai ka".
Shikashi, Iesu wa Pirato ga fushigi ni omou hodo ni, mou nani mo okotae ni naranakatta.
Sate, matsuri no tabigoto ni, Pirato wa hitobito ga negaideru shuujin hitori o, yurushite yaru koto ni shite ita.
Koko ni, boudou o okoshi hitogoroshi o shite tsunagarete ita bouto no naka ni, Baraba to iu mono ga ita.
Gunshuu ga oshikakete kite, itsu mo no toori ni shite hoshii to youkyuu shi hajimeta no de,
Pirato wa karera ni mukatte, "Omaetachi wa Yudayajin no ou o yurushite moraitai no ka" to itta.
Sore wa, saishichou tachi ga Iesu o hikiwatashita no wa, netami no tame de aru koto ga, Pirato ni wakatte itakara de aru.
Shikashi saishichou tachi wa, Baraba no hou o yurushite morau you ni, gunshuu o sendou shita.
Soko de Pirato wa mata karera ni itta, "Sore de wa, omaetachi ga Yudayajin no ou to yonde iru ano hito wa, dou shitara yoi ka".
Karera wa, mata sakenda, "Juujika ni tsukeyo".
Pirato wa itta, "Ano hito wa, ittai, donna akuji o shita no ka". Suruto, karera wa issou hageshiku sakende, "Juujika ni tsukeyo" to itta.
Sore de, Pirato wa gunshuu o manzoku saseyou to omotte, Baraba o yurushite yari, Iesu o muchiutta nochi, juujika ni tsukeru tame ni hikiwatashita.
Heishitachi wa Iesu o, teitaku, sunawachi soutoku kantei no uchi ni tsurete iki, zenbutai o yobiatsumeta.
Soshite Iesu ni murasaki no koromo o kise, ibara no kanmuri o ande kaburase,
"Yudayajin no ou, banzai" to itte keirei o shi hajimeta.
Mata, ashi no bou de sono atama o tataki, tsubaki o kake, hizamazuite ogan dari shita.
Kou shite, Iesu o chourou shita ageku, murasaki no koromo o hagitori, moto no uwagi o kiseta. Sore kara, karera wa Iesu o juujika ni tsukeru tame ni hikidashita.
Soko e, Arekisanderu to Ruposu to no chichi Shimon to iu Kurene bito ga, kougai kara kite toorikakatta no de, hitobito wa Iesu no juujika o muri ni owaseta.
Soshite Iesu o Gorugota, sono imi wa, sarekoube, to iu tokoro ni tsurete itta.
Soshite Iesu ni, motsuyaku o mazeta budoushu o sashidashitaga, ouke ni naranakatta.
Sore kara, Iesu o juujika ni tsuketa. Soshite kuji o hiite, dare ga nani o toru ka o sadameta ue, Iesu no kimono o waketa.
Iesu o juujika ni tsuketa no wa, asa no kyuu ji goro de atta.
Iesu no zaijougaki ni wa "Yudayajin no ou" to, shirushite atta.
Mata, Iesu to tomo ni futari no goutou o, hitori o migi ni, hitori o hidari ni, juujika ni tsuketa. []
Kou shite "Kare wa tsumibitotachi no hitori ni kazoerareta" to kaite aru kotoba ga jouju shita no de aru.]
Soko o toorikakatta monotachi wa, atama o furinagara, Iesu o nonoshitte itta, "Aa, shinden o uchikowashite mikka no uchi ni tateru mono yo,
Juujika kara orite kite jibun o sukue".
Saishichou tachi mo onaji you ni, rippougakusha tachi to issho ni natte, kawarugawaru chourou shite itta, "Tanin o sukuttaga, jibun jishin o sukuu koto ga dekinai.
Isuraeru no ou Kirisuto, ima juujika kara orite miru ga yoi. Sore o mitara shinjiyou". Mata, issho ni juujika ni tsukerareta monotachi mo, Iesu o nonoshitta.
Hiru no juu ni ji ni naruto, zenchi wa kuraku natte, san ji ni oyonda.
Soshite san ji ni, Iesu wa oogoe de, "Eroi, Eroi, Rama, Sabakutani" to sakebareta. Sore wa "Waga kami, waga kami, dou shite watashi o omisute ni natta no desu ka" to iu imi de aru.
Suruto, soba ni tatte ita aru hitobito ga, kore o kiite itta, "Sora, Eriya o yonde iru".
Hitori no hito ga hashitte iki, kaimen ni su i budoushu o fukumasete ashi no bou ni tsuke, Iesu ni nomaseyou to shite itta, "Mate, Eriya ga kare o oroshi ni kuru ka dou ka, mite iyou".
Iesu wa koe takaku sakende, tsuini iki o hikitorareta.
Sono toki, shinden no maku ga ue kara shita made mapputa tsu ni saketa.
Iesu ni mukatte tatte ita hyakusotsuchou wa, kono you ni shite iki o hikitorareta no o mite itta, "Makoto ni, kono hito wa kami no ko de atta".
Mata, tooku no hou kara mite iru onnatachi mo ita. Sono naka ni wa, Magudara no Mariya, shouYakobu to Yose to no haha Mariya, mata Sarome ga ita.
Karera wa Iesu ga Gariraya ni orareta toki, sono ato ni shitagatte tsukaeta onnatachi de atta. Nao sono hoka, Iesu to tomo ni Erusaremu ni nobotte kita ooku no onnatachi mo ita.
Sate, sudeni yuugata ni nattaga, sono hi wa junbi no hi, sunawachi ansokunichi no zenjitsu de atta no de,
Arimataya no Yosefu ga daitan ni mo Pirato no tokoro e iki, Iesu no karada no hikitorikata o negatta. Kare wa chii no takai giin de atte, kare jishin, kami no kuni o machinozonde iru hito de atta.
Pirato wa, Iesu ga mohaya shinde shimatta no ka to fushin ni omoi, hyakusotsuchou o yonde, mou shinda no ka to tazuneta.
Soshite, hyakusotsuchou kara tashikameta ue, shitai o Yosefu ni watashita.
Soko de, Yosefu wa amanuno o kaimotome, Iesu o torioroshite, sono amanuno ni tsutsumi, iwa o hotte tsukutta haka ni osame, haka no iriguchi ni ishi o korogashite oita.
Magudara no Mariya to Yose no haha Mariya to wa, Iesu ga osamerareta basho o mitodoketa.
Sate, ansokunichi ga owatta no de, Magudara no Mariya to Yakobu no haha Mariya to Sarome to ga, itte Iesu ni nuru tame ni, kouryou o kaimotometa.
Soshite shuu no hajime no hi ni, souchou, hinode no koro haka ni itta.
Soshite, karera wa "Dare ga, watashitachi no tame ni, haka no iriguchi kara ishi o korogashite kureru no deshou ka" to hanashiatte ita.
Tokoro ga, me o agete miruto, ishi wa sudeni korogashite atta. Kono ishi wa hijou ni ookikatta.
Haka no naka ni hairuto, migite ni masshiro na nagai koromo o kita wakamono ga suwatte iru no o mite, hijou ni odoroita.
Suruto kono wakamono wa itta, "Odoroku koto wa nai. Anata gata wa juujika ni tsukerareta Nazarebito Iesu o sagashite iru no de arouga, Iesu wa yomigaette, koko ni wa orarenai. Goran nasai, koko ga oosame shita basho de aru.
Ima kara deshitachi to Petero to no tokoro e itte, kou tsutae nasai. Iesu wa anata ga tayori saki ni Gariraya e ikareru. Kanete, anata gata ni iwareta toori, soko de oai dekirude arou, to".
Onnatachi wa ononoki osorenagara, haka kara dete nigesatta. Soshite, hito ni wa nani mo iwanakatta. Osoroshikattakara de aru. []
Shuu no hajime no hi no asa hayaku, Iesu wa yomigaette, mazu Magudara no Mariya ni gojishin o arawasareta. Iesu wa izen ni, kono onna kara nanatsu no akurei o oidasareta koto ga aru.
Mariya wa, Iesu to issho ni ita hitobito ga nakikanashinde iru tokoro ni itte, sore o shiraseta.
Karera wa, Iesu ga ikite orareru koto to, kanojo ni gojishin o arawasareta koto to o kiitaga, shinjinakatta.
Kono nochi, sono uchi no futari ga, inaka no hou e aruite iruto, Iesu wa chigatta sugata de gojishin o arawasareta.
Kono futari mo, hoka no hitobito no tokoro ni itte hanashitaga, karera wa sono hanashi o shinjinakatta.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa juu ichi deshi ga shokutaku ni tsuite iru tokoro ni araware, karera no fushinkou to, kokoro no katakuna na koto o oseme ni natta. Karera wa, yomigaerareta Iesu o mita hitobito no iu koto o, shinjinakattakara de aru.
Soshite karera ni iwareta, "Zensekai ni dete itte, subete no tsukurareta mono ni fukuin o nobetsutae yo.
Shinjite baputesuma o ukeru mono wa sukuwareru. Shikashi, fushinkou no mono wa tsumi ni sadamerareru.
Shinjiru mono ni wa, kono you na shirushi ga tomonau. Sunawachi, karera wa watashi no na de akurei o oidashi, atarashii kotoba o katari,
Hebi o tsukamude arou. Mata, doku o nonde mo, kesshite gai o ukenai. Byounin ni te o okeba, iya sareru".
Shu Iesu wa karera ni katari owatte kara, ten ni agerare, kami no migi ni suwarareta.
Deshitachi wa dete itte, itarutokoro de fukuin o nobetsutaeta. Shu mo karera to tomo ni hataraki, mikotoba ni tomonau shirushi o motte, sono tashika na koto o oshimeshi ni natta.]
Watashitachi no aida ni jouju sareta dekigoto o, saisho kara shitashiku mita hitobito de atte,
Mikotoba ni tsukaeta hitobito ga tsutaeta toori monogatari ni kakitsuraneyouto, ooku no hito ga te o tsukemashitaga,
Teopiro kakka yo, watashi mo subete no koto o hajime kara kuwashiku shirabete imasu no de, koko ni, sore o junjo tadashiku kakitsuzutte, kakka ni kenjiru koto ni shimashita.
Sudeni okiki ni natte iru koto ga kakujitsu de aru koto o, kore ni yotte juubun ni shitte itadakitai tame de arimasu.
Yudaya no ou Herode no yo ni, Abiya no kumi no saishi de na o Zakariya to iu mono ga ita. Sono tsuma wa Aronie no musume no hitori de, na o Erisabetsu to itta.
Futaritomo kami no mimae ni tadashii hito de atte, Shu no imashime to sadame to o, mina ochido naku okonatte ita.
Tokoro ga, Erisabetsu wa funin no onna de atta tame, karera ni wa ko ga naku, soshite futaritomo sudeni toshioite ita.
Sate Zakariya wa, sono kumi ga touban ni nari kami no mimae ni saishi no tsutome o shite ita toki,
Saishi shoku no kanrei ni shitagatte kuji o hiita tokoro, Shu no seijo ni haitte kou o taku koto ni natta.
Kou o taite iru aida, ooku no minshuu wa mina soto de inotte ita.
Suru to Shu no mitsukai ga arawarete, kou dan no migi ni tatta.
Zakariya wa kore o mite, oji madoi, kyoufu no nen ni osowareta.
Soko de mitsukai ga kare ni itta, "Osoreru na, Zakariya yo, anata no inori ga kikiirerareta no da. Anata no tsuma Erisabetsu wa otokonoko o umude arou. Sono ko o Yohane to nazuke nasai.
Kare wa anata ni yorokobi to tanoshimi to o motarashi, ooku no hitobito mo sono tanjou o yorokobude arou.
Kare wa Shu no mimae ni ooinaru mono to nari, budoushu ya tsuyoi sake o issai nomazu, haha no tainai ni iru toki kara sudeni seirei ni mitasarete ori,
Soshite, Isuraeru no ooku no kora o, Shu naru karera no kami ni tachikaeraserude arou.
Kare wa Eriya no rei to chikara to o motte, mimae ni sakidatte iki, chichi no kokoro o ko ni mukesase, sakarau mono ni gijin no omoi o motasete, totonoerareta tami o Shu ni sonaerude arou".
Suruto Zakariya wa mitsukai ni itta, "Dou shite sonna koto ga, watashi ni wakarudeshou ka. Watashi wa roujin desushi, tsuma mo toshi o totte imasu".
Mitsukai ga kotaete itta, "Watashi wa kami no mimae ni tatsu Gaburieru de atte, kono yorokobashii shirase o anata ni kataritsutaeru tame ni, tsukawasareta mono de aru.
Toki ga kureba jouju suru watashi no kotoba o shinjinakattakara, anata wa oshi ni nari, kono koto no okoru hi made, mono ga ienaku naru".
Minshuu wa Zakariya o matte ita no de, kare ga seijouchi de himadotte iru no o fushigi ni omotte ita.
Tsuini kare wa dete kitaga, mono ga ienakatta no de, hitobito wa kare ga seijouchi de maboroshi o mita no da to satotta. Kare wa karera ni aizu o suru dake de, hikitsuzuki, oshi no mama de ita.
Sore kara tsutome no kijitsu ga owatta no de, ie ni kaetta.
Sono nochi, tsuma Erisabetsu wa migomori, go kagetsu no aida hikikomotte itaga,
"Shu wa, ima watashi o kokoro ni kakete kudasatte, hitobito no aida kara watashi no haji o torinozoku tame ni, kou shite kudasaimashita" to itta.
Roku kagetsume ni, mitsukai Gaburieru ga, kami kara tsukawasarete, Nazare to iu Gariraya no machi no ichi shojo no moto ni kita.
Kono shojo wa Dabideie no de de aru Yosefu to iu hito no iinazuke ni natte ite, na o Mariya to itta.
Mitsukai ga Mariya no tokoro ni kite itta, "Megumareta onna yo, omedetou, Shu ga anata to tomo ni oraremasu".
Kono kotoba ni Mariya wa hidoku munasawagi ga shite, kono aisatsu wa nan no koto de arou ka to, omoimegurashite ita.
Suru to mitsukai ga itta, "Osoreru na, Mariya yo, anata wa kami kara megumi o itadaite iru no desu.
Miyo, anata wa migomotte otokonoko o umudeshou. Sono ko o Iesu to nazuke nasai.
Kare wa ooinaru mono to nari, ito takaki mono no ko to, tonaerarerudeshou. Soshite, Shu naru kami wa kare ni chichi Dabide no ouza o oatae ni nari,
Kare wa tokoshie ni Yakobu no ie o shihai shi, sono shihai wa kagirinaku tsuzukudeshou".
Soko de Mariya wa mitsukai ni itta, "Dou shite, sonna koto ga ari emashou ka. Watashi ni wa mada otto ga arimasen no ni".
Mitsukai ga kotaete itta, "Seirei ga anata ni nozomi, ito takaki mono no chikara ga anata o ooudeshou. Sore yue ni, umarederu ko wa sei naru mono de ari, kami no ko to, tonaerarerudeshou.
Anata no shinzoku Erisabetsu mo rounennagara ko o yadoshite imasu. Funin no onna to iwarete ita no ni, haya roku kagetsu ni natte imasu.
Kami ni wa, nan de mo dekinai koto wa arimasen".
Soko de Mariya ga itta, "Watashi wa Shu no hashi tame desu. Okotoba doori kono mi ni narimasu you ni". Soshite mitsukai wa kanojo kara hanarete itta.
Sono koro, Mariya wa tatte, ooisogi de yamazato e mukai Yuda no machi ni iki,
Zakariya no ie ni haitte Erisabetsu ni aisatsu shita.
Erisabetsu ga Mariya no aisatsu o kiita toki, sono ko ga tainai de odotta. Erisabetsu wa seirei ni mitasare,
Koe takaku sakende itta, "Anata wa onna no naka de shukufuku sareta kata, anata no tai no mi mo shukufuku sarete imasu.
Shu no hahaue ga watashi no tokoro ni kite kudasaru to wa, nan to iu kouei deshou.
Goran nasai. Anata no aisatsu no koe ga watashi no mimi ni haitta toki, kodomo ga tainai de yorokobi odorimashita.
Shu no okatari ni natta koto ga kanarazu jouju suru to shinjita onna wa, nan to saiwai na koto deshou".
Suru to Mariya wa itta, "Watashi no tamashii wa Shu o agame,
Watashi no rei wa sukuinushi naru kami o tataemasu.
Kono iyashii onna o sae, kokoro ni kakete kudasaimashita. Ima kara nochi yoyo no hitobito wa, watashi o saiwai na onna to iudeshou,
Chikara aru kata ga, watashi ni ookina koto o shite kudasattakara desu. Sono mina wa kiyoku,
Sono awaremi wa, yoyo kagirinaku Shu o kashikomi osoreru mono ni oyobimasu.
Shu wa miude o motte chikara o furui, kokoro no omoi no ogoritakaburu mono o oichirashi,
Kenryoku aru mono o ouza kara hikioroshi, iyashii mono o hikiage,
Uete iru mono o yoi mono de akase, tonde iru mono o kuufuku no mama kaerase nasaimasu.
Shu wa, awaremi o owasure ni narazu, sono shimobe Isuraeru o tasukete kudasaimashita,
Watashitachi no fuso Aburahamu to sono shison to o tokoshie ni awaremu to yakusoku nasatta toori ni".
Mariya wa, Erisabetsu no tokoro ni san kagetsu hodo taizai shite kara, ie ni kaetta.
Sate Erisabetsu wa tsuki ga michite, otokonoko o unda.
Kinjo no hitobito ya shinzoku wa, Shu ga ookina awaremi o kanojo ni okake ni natta koto o kiite, tomodomo ni yorokonda.
Youkame ni natta no de, osanago ni katsurei o suru tame ni hitobito ga kite, chichi no na ni chinande Zakariya to iu na ni shiyou to shita.
Tokoro ga, hahaoya wa, "Iie, Yohane to iu na ni shinakute wa ikemasen" to itta.
Hitobito wa, "Anata no shinzoku no naka ni wa, sou iu na no tsuita mono wa, hitori mo imasen" to kanojo ni itta.
Soshite chichioya ni, donna na ni shitai no desu ka to, aizu de tazuneta.
Zakariya wa kakiita o motte kosasete, sore ni "Sono na wa Yohane" to kaita no de, minna no mono wa fushigi ni omotta.
Suruto, tachi dokoro ni Zakariya no kuchi ga hirakete shita ga yurumi, katari dashite kami o hometataeta.
Kinjo no hitobito wa mina osore o idaki, mata Yudaya no yamazato no itaru tokoro ni, korera no koto ga kotogotoku kataritsutaerareta no de,
Kiku monotachi wa mina sore o kokoro ni tomete, "Kono ko wa, ittai, donna mono ni narudarou" to katariatta. Shu no mite ga kare to tomo ni atta.
Chichi Zakariya wa seirei ni mitasare, yogen shite itta,
"Shu naru Isuraeru no kami wa, ho mubeki ka na. Kami wa sono tami o kaerimite kore o aganai,
Watashitachi no tame ni sukui no tsuno o shimobe Dabide no ie ni otate ni natta.
Furuku kara, sei naru yogensha tachi no kuchi ni yotte okatari ni natta you ni,
Watashitachi o teki kara, mata subete watashitachi o nikumu mono no te kara, sukuidasu tame de aru.
Kou shite, kami wa watashitachi no fusotachi ni awaremi o kake, sono sei naru keiyaku,
Sunawachi, fuso Aburahamu ni otate ni natta chikai o oboete,
Watashitachi o teki no te kara sukuidashi,
Ikite iru kagiri, kiyoku tadashiku, mimae ni osorenaku tsukaesasete kudasaru no de aru.
Osanago yo, anata wa, ito takaki mono no yogensha to yobarerude arou. Shu no mimae ni sakidatte iki, sono michi o sonae,
Tsumi no yurushi ni yoru sukui o sono tami ni shiraseru no de arukara.
Kore wa watashitachi no kami no awaremi fukai mikokoro ni yoru. Mata, sono awaremi ni yotte, hi no hikari ga ue kara watashitachi ni nozomi,
Ankoku to shi no kage to ni sumu mono o tera shi, watashitachi no ashi o heiwa no michi e michibikude arou".
Osanago wa seichou shi, sono rei mo tsuyoku nari, soshite Isuraeru ni arawareru hi made, arano ni ita.
Sono koro, zensekai no jinkou chousa o seyo to no chokurei ga, koutei Augusuto kara deta.
Kore wa, Kurenio ga Shiriya no soutoku de atta toki ni okonawareta saisho no jinkou chousa de atta.
Hitobito wa mina touroku o suru tame ni, sorezore jibun no machi e kaette itta.
Yosefu mo Dabide no kakei de ari, mata sono kettou de atta no de, Gariraya no machi Nazare o dete, Yudaya no Betsurehemu to iu Dabide no machi e nobotte itta.
Sore wa, sudeni miomo ni natte ita iinazuke no tsuma Mariya to tomo ni, touroku o suru tame de atta.
Tokoro ga, karera ga Betsurehemu ni taizai shite iru aida ni, Mariya wa tsuki ga michite,
Uigo o umi, nuno ni kuru n de, kaiba oke no naka ni nekaseta. Kyakuma ni wa karera no iru yochi ga nakattakara de aru.
Sate, kono chihou de hitsujikaitachi ga yoru, nojuku shinagara hitsuji no mure no ban o shite ita.
Suru to Shu no mitsukai ga araware, Shu no eikou ga karera o meguri tera shita no de, karera wa hijou ni osoreta.
Mitsukai wa itta, "Osoreru na. Miyo, subete no tami ni ataerareru ookina yorokobi o, anata gata ni tsutaeru.
Kyou Dabide no machi ni, anata gata no tame ni sukuinushi ga oumare ni natta. Kono kata koso Shu naru Kirisuto de aru.
Anata gata wa, osanago ga nuno ni kurumatte kaiba oke no naka ni nekashite aru no o mirude arou. Sore ga, anata gata ni ataerareru shirushi de aru".
Suruto tachimachi, obitadashii ten no gunzei ga araware, mitsukai to issho ni natte kami osan bi shite itta,
"I to takaki tokoro de wa, kami ni eikou ga aru you ni, chi no ue de wa, mikokoro ni kanau hitobito ni heiwa ga aru you ni".
Mitsukai tachi ga karera o hanarete ten ni kaetta toki, hitsujikaitachi wa "Saa, Betsurehemu e itte, Shu ga oshirase kudasatta sono dekigoto o mite koyoude wa nai ka" to, tagai ni katariatta.
Soshite isoide itte, Mariya to Yosefu, mata kaiba oke ni nekashite aru osanago o sagashiateta.
Karera ni atta ue de, kono ko ni tsuite jibuntachi ni tsugeshirasareta koto o, hitobito ni tsutaeta.
Hitobito wa mina, hitsujikaitachi ga hanashite kureta koto o kiite, fushigi ni omotta.
Shikashi, Mariya wa korera no koto o kotogotoku kokoro ni tomete, omoimegurashite ita.
Hitsujikaitachi wa, mikiki shita koto ga nani mo ka mo jibuntachi ni katarareta toori de atta no de, kami o agame, matasan bi shinagara kaette itta.
Youka ga sugi, katsurei o hodokosu toki to natta no de, jutai no mae ni mitsukai ga tsugeta toori, osanago o Iesu to nazuketa.
Sore kara, Moose no rippou ni yoru karera no kiyome no kikan ga sugita toki, ryoushin wa osanago o tsurete Erusaremu e nobotta.
Sore wa Shu no rippou ni "Haha no tai o hajimete hiraku otokonoko wa mina, Shu ni seibetsu sareta mono to, tonaerareneba naranai" to kaite aru to ori, osanago o Shu ni sasageru tame de ari,
Mata onaji Shu no rippou ni, "Yamabato hitotsu ga i, mata wa, iebato no hina futawa" to sadamete aru no ni shitagatte, gisei o sasageru tame de atta.
Sono toki, Erusaremu ni Shimeon to iu na no hito ga ita. Kono hito wa tadashii shinkou fukai hito de, Isuraeru no nagusamerareru no o machinozonde ita. Mata seirei ga kare ni yadotte ita.
Soshite Shu no tsukawasu sukuinushi ni au made wa shinu koto wa naito, seirei no shimeshi o ukete ita.
Kono hito ga mitama ni kanjite miya ni haitta. Suruto rippou ni sadamete aru koto o okonau tame, ryoushin mo sono ko Iesu o tsurete wa itte kita no de,
Shimeon wa osanago o ude ni idaki, kami o hometataete itta,
"Shu yo, ima koso, anata wa mikotoba no toori ni kono shimobe o yasuraka ni sarasete kudasaimasu,
Watashi no me ga ima anata no sukui o mita no desukara.
Kono sukui wa anata ga banmin no mae ni osonae ni natta mono de,
Ihoujin o tera sukeiji no hikari, mitami Isuraeru no eikou de arimasu".
Chichi to haha to wa osanago ni tsuite kono you ni katarareta koto o, fushigi ni omotta.
Suru to Shimeon wa karera o shukushi, soshite haha Mariya ni itta, "Goran nasai, kono osanago wa, Isuraeru no ooku no hito o taoresase tari tachiagarase tari suru tame ni, mata hantai o ukeru shirushi to shite, sadamerarete imasu. - -
Soshite, anata jishin mo tsurugi de mune o sashitsuranukarerudeshou. - - sore wa ooku no hito no kokoro ni aru omoi ga, arawareru you ni naru tame desu".
Mata, Aseruzoku no Panueru no musume de, Anna to iu onna yogensha ga ita. Kanojo wa hijou ni toshi o totte ita. Musume jidai ni totsuide, nana nenkan dake otto to tomo ni sumi,
Sono nochi yamome gurashi o shi, hachijuu yonsai ni natte ita. Soshite miya o hanarezu ni yoru mo hiru mo danjiki to inori to o motte kami ni tsukaete ita.
Kono roujo mo, choudo sono toki chikayotte kite, kami ni kansha o sasage, soshite kono osanago no koto o, Erusaremu no sukui o machinozonde iru subete no hitobito ni katarikikaseta.
Ryoushin wa Shu no rippou doori subete no koto o sumaseta no de, Gariraya e mukai, jibun no machi Nazare ni kaetta.
Osanago wa, masumasu seichou shite tsuyoku nari, chie ni michi, soshite kami no megumi ga sono ue ni atta.
Sate, Iesu no ryoushin wa, sugikoshi no matsuri ni wa maitoshi Erusaremu e nobotte ita.
Iesu ga juu nisai ni natta toki mo, kanrei ni shitagatte matsuri no tame ni joukyou shita.
Tokoro ga, matsuri ga owatte kaeru toki, shounen Iesu wa Erusaremu ni inokotte oraretaga, ryoushin wa sore ni kizukanakatta.
Soshite michizure no naka ni iru koto to omoikonde, ichi nichiji o itte shimai, sore kara, shinzoku ya chijin no naka o sagashi hajimetaga,
Mitsukaranai no de, sagashimawarinagara Erusaremu e hikikaeshita.
Soshite mikka no nochi ni, Iesu ga miya no naka de kyoushitachi no mannaka ni suwatte, karera no hanashi o kii tari shitsumon shi tari shite orareru no o mitsuketa.
Kiku hitobito wa mina, Iesu no kashikosa ya sono kotae ni kyoutan shite ita.
Ryoushin wa kore o mite odoroki, soshite haha ga kare ni itta, "Dou shite konna koto o shite kureta no desu. Goran nasai, otousama mo watashi mo shinpai shite, anata o sagashite ita no desu".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Dou shite osagashi ni natta no desu ka. Watashi ga jibun no chichi no ie ni iru hazu no koto o, gozonji nakatta no desu ka".
Shikashi, ryoushin wa sono katarareta kotoba o satoru koto ga dekinakatta.
Sore kara Iesu wa ryoushin to issho ni Nazare ni kudatte iki, karera ni otsukae ni natta. Haha wa korera no koto o mina kokoro ni tomete ita.
Iesu wa masumasu chie ga kuwawari, setake mo nobi, soshite kami to hito kara aisareta.
Koutei Teberio zaii no daijuu go nen, Ponteo Pirato ga Yudaya no soutoku, Herode ga Gariraya no ryoushu, sono kyoudai Piripo ga itsuriya terakonite chihou no ryoushu, Rusaniya ga Abirene no ryoushu,
Annasu to Kayapa to ga daisaishi de atta toki, kami no kotoba ga arano de Zakariya no ko Yohane ni nozonda.
Kare wa Yorudan no hotori no zenchihou ni itte, tsumi no yurushi o esaseru kuiaratame no baputesuma o nobetsutaeta.
Sore wa, yogensha Izaya no kotoba no sho ni kaite aru toori de aru. Sunawachi "Arano de yobawaru mono no koe ga suru, 'Shu no michi o sonaeyo, sono michisuji o massugu ni seyo'.
Subete no tani wa umerare, subete no yama to oka to wa, taira ni sare, magatta tokoro wa massugu ni, warui michi wa narasare,
Hito wa mina kami no sukui o mirude arou".
Sate, Yohane wa, kare kara baputesuma o ukeyou to shite dete kita gunshuu ni mukatte itta, "Mamushi no kora yo, sematte kite iru kami no ikari kara, nogarerareruto, omaetachi ni dare ga oshieta no ka.
Dakara, kuiaratame ni fusawashii mi o musube. Jibuntachi no chichi ni wa Aburahamu ga aru nado to, kokoro no naka de omotte mo miru na. Omaetachi ni itte oku. Kami wa korera no ishikoro kara de mo, Aburahamu no ko o okosu koto ga dekiru no da.
Ono ga sudeni ki no nemoto ni okarete iru. Dakara, yoi mi o musubanai ki wa kotogotoku kirarete, hi no naka ni nagekomareru no da".
Soko de gunshuu ga kare ni, "Sore de wa, watashitachi wa nani o sureba yoi no desu ka" to tazuneta.
Kare wa kotaete itta, "Shitagi o nimai motte iru mono wa, motanai mono ni wakete yari nasai. Shokumotsu o motte iru mono mo douyou ni shi nasai".
Shuzeinin mo baputesuma o uke ni kite, kare ni itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa nani o sureba yoi no desu ka".
Karera ni itta, "Kimatte iru mono ijou ni toritatete wa ikenai".
Heisotsutachi mo tazunete itta, "De wa, watashitachi wa nani o sureba yoi no desu ka". Kare wa itta, "Hito o odokashi tari, damashitot tari shite wa ikenai. Jibun no kyuuyo de manzoku shite i nasai".
Minshuu wa sukuinushi o machinozonde ita no de, mina kokoro no naka de Yohane no koto o, moshi ka shitara kono hito ga sore de wa nakarou ka to kangaete ita.
Soko de Yohane wa minna no mono ni mukatte itta, "Watashi wa mizu de omaetachi ni baputesuma o sazukeruga, watashi yori mo chikara no aru kata ga, oide ni naru. Watashi ni wa, sono kutsu no himo o toku neuchi mo nai. Kono kata wa, seirei to hi to ni yotte omaetachi ni baputesuma o osazuke ni narude arou.
Mata, mi o te ni motte, uchi ba no mugi o furuiwake, mugi wa kura ni osame, kara wa kienai hi de yakisuterude arou".
Kou shite Yohane wa hoka ni mo nao, samazama no susume o shite, minshuu ni oshie o toita.
Tokoro ga ryoushu Herode wa, kyoudai no tsuma Herodeya no koto de, mata jibun ga shita arayuru akuji ni tsuite, Yohane kara hinan sarete ita no de,
Kare o goku ni tojikomete, iroiro na akuji no ue ni, mou hitotsu kono akuji o kasaneta.
Sate, minshuu ga mina baputesuma o uketa toki, Iesu mo baputesuma o ukete inotte orareruto, ten ga hirakete,
Seirei ga hato no you na sugata o totte Iesu no ue ni kudari, soshite ten kara koe ga shita, "Anata wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no kokoro ni kanau mono de aru".
Iesu ga senkyou o hajimerareta no wa, toshi oyoso sanjuusai no toki de atte, hitobito no kangae ni yoreba, Yosefu no ko de atta. Yosefu wa Heri no ko,
Sore kara, sakanobotte, Matate, Rebi, Meruki, Yannai, Yosefu,
Matateya, Amosu, Nahomu, Esuri, Nangai,
Mahate, Matateya, Shimei, Yoseku, Yoda,
Yohanan, Resa, Zorobaberu, Sarateru, Neri,
Meruki, Adei, Kosamu, Erumadamu, Eru,
Yoshua, Eriezeru, Yorimu, Matate, Rebi,
Shimeon, Yuda, Yosefu, Yonamu, Eriyakimu,
Mereya, Mena, Matata, Natan, Dabide,
Essai, Obede, Boazu, Sara, Naason,
Aminadabu, Ademin, Aruni, Esuron, Paresu, Yuda,
Yakobu, Isaku, Aburahamu, Tera, Nahoru,
Serugu, Reu, Peregu, Eberu, Sara,
Kainan, Arupakusade, Semu, Noa, Rameku,
Metosera, Enoku, Yarede, Maharareru, Kainan,
Enosu, Setsu, Adamu, soshite kami ni itaru.
Sate, Iesu wa seirei ni michite Yorudan gawa kara kaeri,
Arano o yonjuu nichi no aida mitama ni hikimawasarete, akuma no kokoromi ni awareta. Sono aida nani mo tabezu, sono hikazu ga tsukiruto, kuufuku ni narareta.
Soko de akuma ga itta, "Moshi anata ga kami no ko de arunara, kono ishi ni, pan ni nare to meijite goran nasai".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, " 'Hito wa pan dake de ikiru mono de wa nai' to kaite aru".
Sore kara, akuma wa Iesu o takai tokoro e tsurete iki, matataku ma ni sekai no subete no kuniguni o misete
Itta, "Korera no kuniguni no ken'i to eiga to o minna, anata ni agemashou. Sorera wa watashi ni makaserarete ite, dare de mo suki na hito ni agete yoi no desukara.
Sore de, moshi anata ga watashi no mae ni hizamazukunara, kore o zenbu anata no mono ni shite agemashou".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, " 'Shu naru anata no kami o haishi, tada kami ni nomi tsukae yo' to kaite aru".
Sore kara akuma wa Iesu o Erusaremu ni tsurete iki, miya no choujou ni tatasete itta, "Moshi anata ga kami no ko de arunara, koko kara shita e tobiorite goran nasai.
'Kami wa anata no tame ni, mitsukai tachi ni meijite anata o mamoraserude arou' to ari,
Mata, 'Anata no ashi ga ishi ni uchitsukerarenai you ni, karera wa anata o te de sasaerude arou' to mo kaite arimasu".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, " 'Shu naru anata no kami o kokoromite wa naranai' to iwarete iru".
Akuma wa arayuru kokoromi o shi tsukushite, ichiji Iesu o hanareta.
Sore kara Iesu wa mitama no chikara ni michiafurete Gariraya e kaerareruto, sono uwasa ga sono chihou zentai ni hiromatta.
Iesu wa shokaidou de oshie, minna no mono kara sonkei o ouke ni natta.
Sore kara osodachi ni natta Nazare ni iki, ansokunichi ni itsu mo no you ni kaidou ni hairi, seisho o roudoku shiyou to shite tatareta.
Suru to yogensha Izaya no sho ga tewatasareta no de, sono sho o hiraite, kou kaite aru tokoro o dasareta,
"Shu no mitama ga watashi ni yadotte iru. Mazushii hitobito ni fukuin o nobetsutaesaseru tame ni, watashi o seibetsu shite kudasattakara de aru. Shu wa watashi o tsukawashite, shuujin ga kaihou sare, moujin no me ga hirakareru koto o tsugeshirase, uchihishigarete iru mono ni jiyuu o esase,
Shu no megumi no toshi o tsugeshiraseru no de aru".
Iesu wa seisho o maite kakari no mono ni kaeshi, seki ni tsukareruto, kaidou ni iru minna no mono no me ga Iesu ni sosogareta.
Soko de Iesu wa, "Kono seiku wa, anata gata ga mimi ni shita kono hi ni jouju shita" to toki hajimerareta.
Suruto, karera wa mina Iesu o home, mata sono kuchi kara dete kuru megumi no kotoba ni kantan shite itta, "Kono hito wa Yosefu no ko de wa nai ka".
Soko de karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, kitto 'Isha yo, jibun jishin o iyase' to iu kotowaza o hiite, Kapenaumu de okonawareta to kiite ita koto o, anata no kyouri no kono chi de mo shite kure, to iude arou".
Sore kara iwareta, "Yoku itte oku. Yogensha wa, jibun no kyouri de wa kangei sarenai mono de aru.
Yoku kiite oki nasai. Eriya no jidai ni, san nen roku kagetsu ni watatte ten ga toji, Isuraeru zendo ni daikikin ga atta sai, soko ni wa ooku no yamome ga ita no ni,
Eriya wa sono uchi no dare ni mo tsukawasarenaide, tada Shidon no Sareputa ni iru hitori no yamome ni dake tsukawasareta.
Mata yogensha Erisha no jidai ni, Isuraeru ni wa ooku no raibyounin ga ita no ni, sono uchi no hitori mo kiyomerarenaide, tada Shiriya no Naaman dake ga kiyomerareta".
Kaidou ni ita monotachi wa kore o kiite, mina ikidoori ni michi,
Tachiagatte Iesu o machi no soto e oidashi, sono machi ga tatte iru oka no gake made hippatte itte, tsukiotosou to shita.
Shikashi, Iesu wa karera no mannaka o toorinukete, satte ikareta.
Sore kara, Iesu wa Gariraya no machi Kapenaumu ni kudatte ikareta. Soshite ansokunichi ni naruto, hitobito o ooshie ni nattaga,
Sono kotoba ni ken'i ga atta no de, karera wa sono oshie ni odoroita.
Suruto, kegareta akurei ni tsukareta hito ga kaidou ni ite, oogoe de sakebi dashita,
"Aa, Nazare no Iesu yo, anata wa watashitachi to nan no kaka wari ga aru no desu. Watashitachi o horoboshi ni korareta no desu ka. Anata ga donata de aru ka, wakatte imasu. Kami no seija desu".
Iesu wa kore o shikatte, "Damare, kono hito kara dete ike" to iwareta. Suruto akurei wa kare o hito naka ni nagetaoshi, kizu wa owasezu ni, sono hito kara dete itta.
Minna no mono wa odoroite, tagai ni katariatte itta, "Kore wa, ittai, nan to iu kotoba darou. Ken'i to chikara to o motte kegareta rei ni meijirareruto, karera wa dete iku no da".
Kou shite Iesu no hyouban ga, sono chihou no itarutokoro ni hiromatte itta.
Iesu wa kaidou o dete Shimon no ie ni ohairi ni natta. Tokoro ga Shimon no shuutome ga takai netsu o yande ita no de, hitobito wa kanojo no tame ni Iesu ni onegai shita.
Soko de, Iesu wa sono makuramoto ni tatte, netsu ga hiku you ni meijirareruto, netsu wa hiki, onna wa sugu ni okiagatte, karera o motenashita.
Hi ga kureruto, iroiro na byouki ni nayamu mono o kakaete iru hitobito ga, mina sore o Iesu no tokoro ni tsurete kita no de, sono hitoribitori ni te o oite, oiyashi ni natta.
Akurei mo "Anata koso kami no ko desu" to sakebinagara ooku no hitobito kara dete itta. Shikashi, Iesu wa karera o imashimete, mono o iu koto o oyurushi ni naranakatta. Karera ga Iesu wa Kirisuto da to shitte itakara de aru.
Yo ga akeruto, Iesu wa sabishii tokoro e dete ikaretaga, gunshuu ga sagashimawatte, mimoto ni atsumari, jibuntachi kara hanarete ikarenai you ni to, hikitometa.
Shikashi Iesu wa, "Watashi wa, hoka no machimachi ni mo kami no kuni no fukuin o nobetsutaeneba naranai. Jibun wa sono tame ni tsukawasareta no de aru" to iwareta.
Soshite, Yudaya no shokaidou de oshie o tokareta.
Sate, gunshuu ga kami no kotoba o kikou to shite oshiyosete kita toki, Iesu wa Genesarekohan ni tatte oraretaga,
Soko ni nisou no kobune ga yosete aru no o goran ni natta. Ryoushitachi wa, fune kara orite ami o aratte ita.
Sono issou wa Shimon no fune de attaga, Iesu wa sore ni norikomi, Shimon ni tanonde kishi kara sukoshi kogidasase, soshite suwatte, fune no naka kara gunshuu ni ooshie ni natta.
Hanashi ga sumuto, Shimon ni "Oki e kogidashi, ami o oroshite ryou o shite mi nasai" to iwareta.
Shimon wa kotaete itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa yodooshi hatarakimashitaga, nani mo toremasendeshita. Shikashi, okotoba desukara, ami o oroshite mimashou".
Soshite sono toori ni shita tokoro, obitadashii uo no mure ga haitte, ami ga yabure sou ni natta.
Soko de, mou issou no fune ni ita nakama ni, kasei ni kuru you aizu o shita no de, karera ga kite uo o ryouhou no fune ippai ni ireta. Sono tame ni, fune ga shizumi sou ni natta.
Kore o mite Shimon Petero wa, Iesu no hizamoto ni hirefushite itta, "Shu yo, watashi kara hanarete kudasai. Watashi wa tsumifukai mono desu".
Kare mo issho ni ita monotachi mo mina, toreta uo ga obitadashii no ni odoroitakara de aru.
Shimon no nakama de atta Zebedai no ko Yakobu to Yohane mo, douyou de atta. Suruto, Iesu ga Shimon ni iwareta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Ima kara anata wa ningen o toru ryoushi ni naru no da".
Soko de karera wa fune o riku ni hikiage, issai o sutete Iesu ni shitagatta.
Iesu ga aru machi ni orareta toki, zenshin raibyou ni natte iru hito ga soko ni ita. Iesu o miruto, kao o chi ni fusete negatte itta, "Shu yo, mikokoro deshitara, kiyomete itadakeru no desuga".
Iesu wa te o nobashite kare ni sawari, "Sou shite ageyou, kiyoku nare" to iwareta. Suruto, raibyou ga tadachini satte shimatta.
Iesu wa, dare ni mo hanasanai you ni to kare ni iikikase, "Tada itte jibun no karada o saishi ni mise, sore kara anata no kiyome no tame, Moose ga meijita toori no sasagemono o shite, hitobito ni shoumei shi nasai" to omeiji ni natta.
Shikashi, Iesu no hyouban wa masumasu hiromatte iki, obitadashii gunshuu ga, oshie o kii tari, byouki o naoshite morat tari suru tame ni, atsumatte kita.
Shikashi Iesu wa, sabishii tokoro ni shirizoite inotte orareta.
Aru hi no koto, Iesu ga oshiete orareruto, Gariraya ya Yudaya no houbou no mura kara, mata Erusaremu kara kita Parisaibito ya rippougakusha tachi ga, soko ni suwatte ita. Shu no chikara ga hataraite, Iesu wa hitobito o iyasareta.
Sono toki, aru hitobito ga, hitori no chuubu o wazuratte iru hito o toko ni noseta mama tsurete kite, ie no naka ni hakobiire, Iesu no mae ni okou to shita.
Tokoro ga, gunshuu no tame ni dou shite mo hakobiireru houhou ga nakatta no de, yane ni nobori, kawara o haide, byounin o tokogoto gunshuu no mannaka ni tsurioroshite, Iesu no mae ni oita.
Iesu wa karera no shinkou o mite, "Hito yo, anata no tsumi wa yurusareta" to iwareta.
Suruto rippougakusha to Parisaibitotachi to wa, "Kami o kegasu koto o iu kono hito wa, ittai, nanimono da. Kami ohitori no hoka ni, dare ga tsumi o yurusu koto ga dekiru ka" to itte ronji hajimeta.
Iesu wa karera no rongi o minuite, "Anata gata wa kokoro no naka de nani o ronjite iru no ka.
Anata no tsumi wa yurusareta to iu no to, okite aruke to iu no to, dochira ga tayasui ka.
Shikashi, hito no ko wa chijou de tsumi o yurusu ken'i o motte iru koto ga, anata gata ni wakaru tame ni" to karera ni taishite ii, chuubu no mono ni mukatte, "Anata ni meijiru. Okiyo, toko o toriagete ie ni kaere" to iwareta.
Suruto byounin wa sokuza ni minna no mae de okiagari, nete ita toko o toriagete, kami o agamenagara ie ni kaette itta.
Minna no mono wa kyoutan shite shimatta. Soshite kami o agame, osore ni mitasarete, "Kyou wa odorokubeki koto o mita" to itta.
Sono nochi, Iesu ga dete ikareruto, Rebi to iu na no shuzeinin ga shuuzeisho ni suwatte iru no o mite, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai" to iwareta.
Suruto, kare wa issai o sutete tachiagari, Iesu ni shitagatte kita.
Sore kara, Rebi wa jibun no ie de, Iesu no tame ni seidai na enkai o moyooshitaga, shuzeinin ya sono hoka oozei no hitobito ga, tomo ni shokutaku ni tsuite ita.
Tokoro ga, Parisaibito ya sono rippougakusha tachi ga, Iesu no deshitachi ni taishite tsubuyaite itta, "Dou shite anata gata wa, shuzeinin ya tsumibito nado to inshoku o tomo ni suru no ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Kenkou na hito ni wa isha wa iranai. Iru no wa byounin de aru.
Watashi ga kita no wa, gijin o maneku tame de wa naku, tsumibito o maneite kuiaratamesaseru tame de aru".
Mata karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Yohane no deshitachi wa, shibashiba danjiki o shi, mata inori o shite ori, Parisaibito no deshitachi mo sou shite iru no ni, anata no deshitachi wa tabe tari non dari shite imasu".
Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata wa, hanamuko ga issho ni iru no ni, konrei no kyaku ni danjiki o saseru koto ga dekirude arou ka.
Shikashi, hanamuko ga ubaisarareru hi ga kuru. Sono hi ni wa danjiki o surude arou".
Sore kara Iesu wa mata hitotsu no tatoe o katarareta, "Dare mo, atarashii kimono kara nunogire o kiritotte, furui kimono ni tsugi o ateru mono wa nai. Moshi sonna koto o shitara, atarashii kimono o saku koto ni narushi, atarashii no kara totta nunogire mo furui no ni awanaide arou.
Mata dare mo, atarashii budoushu o furui kawabukuro ni ire wa shinai. Moshi sonna koto o shitara, atarashii budoushu wa kawabukuro o hari saki, soshite budoushu wa narederushi, kawabukuro mo muda ni narude arou.
Atarashii budoushu wa atarashii kawabukuro ni irerubekide aru.
Mata dare mo, furui sake o nonde kara, atarashii no o hoshigari wa shinai. 'Furui no ga yoi' to kangaete irukara de aru".
Aru ansokunichi ni Iesu ga mugibatake no naka o tootte ikareta toki, deshitachi ga ho o tsumi, te de mo minagara tabete ita.
Suruto, aru Parisaibitotachi ga itta, "Anata gata wa naze, ansokunichi ni shite wa naranu koto o suru no ka".
Soko de Iesu ga kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata wa, Dabide to sono tomo no monotachi to ga uete ita toki, Dabide no shita koto ni tsuite, yonda koto ga nai no ka.
Sunawachi, kami no ie ni haitte, saishitachi no hoka dare mo tabete wa naranu sonae no pan o totte tabe, mata tomo no monotachi ni mo ataetade wa nai ka".
Mata karera ni iwareta, "Hito no ko wa ansokunichi no Shu de aru".
Mata, hoka no ansokunichi ni kaidou ni haitte oshiete orareta tokoro, soko ni migite no naeta hito ga ita.
Rippougakusha ya Parisaibitotachi wa, Iesu o uttaeru koujitsu o mitsukeyou to omotte, ansokunichi ni iyasareru ka dou ka o ukagatte ita.
Iesu wa karera no omotte iru koto o shitte, sono te no naeta hito ni, "Okite, mannaka ni tachi nasai" to iwareruto, okiagatte tatta.
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni mukatte iwareta, "Anata gata ni kikuga, ansokunichi ni zen o okonau no to aku o okonau no to, inochi o sukuu no to korosu no to, dochira ga yoi ka".
Soshite karera ichidou o mimawashite, sono hito ni "Te o nobashi nasai" to iwareta. Sono toori ni suruto, sono te wa motodoori ni natta.
Soko de karera wa hageshiku ikatte, Iesu o dou ka shite yarou to, tagai ni hanashiai o hajimeta.
Kono koro, Iesu wa inoru tame ni yama e iki, yo o tesshite kami ni inorareta.
Yo ga akeruto, deshitachi o yobiyose, sono naka kara juu ninin o erabidashi, kore ni shito to iu na o oatae ni natta.
Sunawachi, Petero to mo yobareta Shimon to sono kyoudai Andere, Yakobu to Yohane, Piripo to Barutoromai,
Matai to Tomasu, Arupayo no ko Yakobu to, nesshin tou to yobareta Shimon,
Yakobu no ko Yuda, sore kara Isukariote no Yuda. Kono Yuda ga uragirimono to natta no de aru.
Soshite, Iesu wa karera to issho ni yama o kudatte hirachi ni tataretaga, oozei no deshitachi ya, Yudaya zendo, Erusaremu, Tsuro to Shidon no kaigan chihou nado kara no daigunshuu ga,
Oshie o kikou to shi, mata byouki o naoshite moraou to shite, soko ni kite ita. Soshite kegareta rei ni nayamasarete iru monotachi mo, iyasareta.
Mata gunshuu wa Iesu ni sawarou to tsutometa. Sore wa chikara ga Iesu no uchi kara dete, minna no mono o tsugitsugi ni iyashitakara de aru.
Sono toki, Iesu wa me o age, deshitachi o mite iwareta, "Anata gata mazushii hitotachi wa, saiwai da. Kami no kuni wa anata gata no mono de aru.
Anata gata ima uete iru hitotachi wa, saiwai da. Akitariru you ni narukara de aru. Anata gata ima naite iru hitotachi wa, saiwai da. Warau you ni narukara de aru.
Hitobito ga anatagata o nikumu toki, mata hito no ko no tame ni anatagata o haiseki shi, nonoshiri, omei o kiseru toki wa, anata gata wa saiwai da.
Sono hi ni wa yorokobi odore. Miyo, ten ni oite anata gata no ukeru mukui wa ookii no dakara. Karera no sosen mo, yogensha tachi ni taishite onaji koto o shita no de aru.
Shikashi anata gata tonde iru hitotachi wa, wazawai da. Nagusame o ukete shimatte irukara de aru.
Anata gata ima manpuku shite iru hitotachi wa, wazawai da. Ueru you ni narukara de aru. Anata gata ima waratte iru hitotachi wa, wazawai da. Kanashimi naku you ni narukara de aru.
Hito ga mina anatagata o homeru toki wa, anata gata wa wazawai da. Karera no sosen mo, nise yogensha tachi ni taishite onaji koto o shita no de aru.
Shikashi, kiite iru anata gata ni iu. Teki o aishi, nikumu mono ni shinsetsu ni seyo.
No roumono o shukufuku shi, hazukashimeru mono no tame ni inore.
Anata no hoo o utsu mono ni wa hoka no hoo o mo mukete yari, anata no uwagi o ubaitoru mono ni wa shitagi o mo kobamu na.
Anata ni motomeru mono ni wa ataete yari, anata no mochimono o ubau mono kara wa torimodosou to suru na.
Hitobito ni shite hoshii to, anata gata no nozomu koto o, hitobito ni mo sono toori ni seyo.
Jibun o aishite kureru mono o aishitakara tote, dore hodo no tegara ni narou ka. Tsumibito de sae, jibun o aishite kureru mono o aishite iru.
Jibun ni yoku shite kureru mono ni yoku shitatote, dore hodo no tegara ni narou ka. Tsumibito de sae, sore kurai no koto wa shite iru.
Mata kaeshite morau tsumori de kashitatote, dore hodo no tegara ni narou ka. Tsumibito de mo, onaji dake no mono o kaeshite moraou to shite, nakama ni kasu no de aru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa, teki o aishi, hito ni yoku shite yari, mata nani mo ate ni shinaide kashite yare. Sou sureba ukeru mukui wa ookiku, anata gata hai to takaki mono no ko to narude arou. Ito takaki mono wa, on o shiranu mono ni mo akunin ni mo, nasa kebukaikara de aru.
Anata gata no chichi naru kami ga jihi bukai you ni, anata gata mo jihi bukai mono to nare.
Hito o sabaku na. Sou sureba, jibun mo sabakareru koto ga naide arou. Mata hito o tsumi ni sadameru na. Sou sureba, jibun mo tsumi ni sadamerareru koto ga naide arou. Yurushite yare. Sou sureba, jibun mo yurusarerude arou.
Atae yo. Sou sureba, jibun ni mo ataerarerude arou. Hitobito wa oshiire, yusuri ire, afurederu made ni ryou o yoku shite, anata gata no futokoro ni irete kurerude arou. Anata gata no hakaru sono hakari de, jibun ni mo hakari kaesarerude aroukara".
Iesu wa mata hitotsu no tatoe o katarareta, "Moujin wa moujin no tebiki ga dekiyou ka. Futaritomo ana ni ochikomanaidarou ka.
Deshi wa sono shi ijou no mono de wa naiga, shuugyou o tsumeba, mina sono shi no you ni narou.
Naze, kyoudai no me ni aru chiri o minagara, jibun no me ni aru hari o mitomenai no ka.
Jibun no me ni aru hari wa minaide ite, dou shite kyoudai ni mukatte, kyoudai yo, anata no me ni aru chiri o torasete kudasai, to ieyou ka. Gizensha yo, mazu jibun no me kara hari o torinokeru gayoi, sou sureba, hakkiri mieru you ni natte, kyoudai no me ni aru chiri o torinokeru koto ga dekirudarou.
Warui mi no naru yoi ki wa naishi, mata yoi mi no naru warui ki mo nai.
Ki wa sorezore, sono mi de wakaru. Ibara kara ichijiku o toru koto wa naishi, nobara kara budou o tsumu koto mo nai.
Zennin wa yoi kokoro no kura kara yoi mono o toridashi, akunin wa warui kura kara warui mono o toridasu. Kokoro kara afurederu koto o, kuchi ga kataru mono de aru.
Watashi o Shu yo, Shu yo, to yobinagara, naze watashi no iu koto o okonawanai no ka.
Watashi no moto ni kite, watashi no kotoba o kiite okonau mono ga, nani ni nite iru ka, anata gata ni oshieyou.
Sore wa, chi o fukaku hori, iwa no ue ni dodai o suete ie o tateru hito ni nite iru. Kouzui ga dete gekiryuu ga sono ie ni oshiyosete kite mo, sore o yuriugokasu koto wa dekinai. Yoku tatete arukara de aru.
Shikashi kiite mo okonawanai hito wa, dodai nashi de, tsuchi no ue ni ie o tateta hito ni nite iru. Gekiryuu ga sono ie ni oshiyosete kitara, tachimachi taorete shimai, sono higai wa ookii no de aru".
Iesu wa korera no kotoba o kotogotoku hitobito ni kikasete shimatta nochi, Kapenaumu ni kaette korareta.
Tokoro ga, aru hyakusotsuchou no tanomi ni shite ita shimobe ga, byouki ni natte shinikakatte ita.
Kono hyakusotsuchou wa Iesu no koto o kiite, Yudayajin no chouroutachi o Iesu no tokoro ni tsukawashi, jibun no shimobe o tasuke ni kite kudasaru you ni to, onegai shita.
Karera wa Iesu no tokoro ni kite, nesshin ni negatte itta, "Ano hito wa sou shite itadaku neuchi ga gozaimasu.
Watashitachi no kokumin o aishi, watashitachi no tame ni kaidou o tatete kureta no desu".
Soko de, Iesu wa karera to tsuredatte odekake ni natta. Tokoro ga, sono ie kara hodotooku nai atari made korareta toki, hyakusotsuchou wa tomodachi o okutte Iesu ni iwaseta, "Shu yo, douzo, gosokurou kudasaimasen you ni. Watashi no yane no shita ni anata o oire suru shikaku wa, watashi ni wa gozaimasen.
Sore desukara, jibun de omukae ni agaru neuchi sae nai to omotte ita no desu. Tada, okotoba o kudasai. Soshite, watashi no shimobe o naoshite kudasai.
Watashi mo ken'i no shita ni fukushite iru mono desuga, watashi no shita ni mo heisotsu ga imashite, hitori no mono ni 'Ike' to ieba iki, hoka no mono ni 'Koi' to ieba kimasushi, mata, shimobe ni 'Kore o seyo' to ieba, shite kureru no desu".
Iesu wa kore o kiite hijou ni kanshin sare, tsuite kita gunshuu no hou ni furimuite iwareta, "Anata gata ni itte okuga, kore hodo no shinkou wa, Isuraeru no naka de mo mita koto ga nai".
Tsukai ni kita monotachi ga ie ni kaette miruto, shimobe wa genki ni natte ita.
Sono nochi, ma mo naku, Nain to iu machi e oide ni nattaga, deshitachi ya oozei no gunshuu mo issho ni itta.
Machi no mon ni chikazukareruto, choudo, aru yamome ni totte hitori musuko de atta mono ga shinda no de, houmuri ni dasu tokoro de atta. Oozei no machi no hitotachi ga, sono haha ni tsukisotte ita.
Shu wa kono fujin o mite fukai doujou o yoserare, "Nakanaide i nasai" to iwareta.
Soshite chikayotte kan ni te o kakerareruto, katsuide iru monotachi ga tachidomatta no de, "Wakamono yo, saa, oki nasai" to iwareta.
Suruto, shinin ga okiagatte mono o ii dashita. Iesu wa kare o sono haha ni owatashi ni natta.
Hitobito wa mina osore o idaki, "Daiyogensha ga watashitachi no aida ni arawareta", mata, "Kami wa sono tami o kaerimite kudasatta" to itte, kami o hometataeta.
Iesu ni tsuite no kono hanashi wa, Yudaya zendo oyobi sono fukin no itarutokoro ni hiromatta.
Yohane no deshitachi wa, korera no koto o zenbu kare ni houkoku shita. Suru to Yohane wa deshi no naka kara futari no mono o yonde,
Shu no moto ni okuri, " 'Kitarubeki kata' wa anata na no desu ka. Sore to mo, hoka ni dare ka o matsubekideshou ka" to tazunesaseta.
Soko de, kono hitotachi ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Watashitachi wa baputesuma no Yohane kara no tsukai desuga, 'Kitarubeki kata' wa anata na no desu ka, sore to mo, hoka ni dare ka o matsubekideshou ka, to Yohane ga tazunete imasu".
Sono toki, Iesu wa samazama no byouku to akurei to ni nayamu hitobito o iyashi, mata ooku no moujin o mieru you ni shite oraretaga,
Kotaete iwareta, "Itte, anata gata ga mikiki shita koto o, Yohane ni houkoku shi nasai. Moujin wa mie, ashi nae wa aruki, raibyounin wa kiyomari, mimishii wa kikoe, shinin wa ikikaeri, mazushii hitobito wa fukuin o kikasarete iru.
Watashi ni tsumazukanai mono wa, saiwai de aru".
Yohane no tsukai ga itte shimauto, Iesu wa Yohane no koto o gunshuu ni katari hajimerareta, "Anata gata wa, nani o mi ni arano ni dete kita no ka. Kaze ni yuragu ashi de aru ka.
De wa, nani o mi ni dete kita no ka. Yawarakai kimono o matotta hito ka. Kirabiyaka ni tsukazatte, zeitaku ni kurashite iru hitobito nara, kyuuden ni iru.
De wa, nani o mi ni dete kita no ka. Yogensha ka. Sou da, anata gata ni iuga, yogensha ijou no mono de aru.
'Miyo, watashi wa tsukai o anata no saki ni tsukawashi, anata no mae ni, michi o totonoesaserude arou' to kaite aru no wa, kono hito no koto de aru.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Onna no unda mono no naka de, Yohane yori ookii jinbutsu wa inai. Shikashi, kami no kuni de mottomo chiisai mono mo, kare yori wa ookii.
(kore o kiita minshuu wa mina, mata shuzeinin tachi mo, Yohane no baputesuma o ukete kami no tadashii koto o mitometa.
Shikashi, Parisaibito to rippougakusha tachi to wa kare kara baputesuma o ukenaide, jibuntachi ni taisuru kami no mikokoro o mu ni shita.)
Dakara ima no jidai no hitobito o nani ni kurabeyou ka. Karera wa nani ni nite iru ka.
Sore wa kodomotachi ga hiroba ni suwatte, tagai ni yobikake, 'Watashitachi ga fue o fuita no ni, anatatachi wa odotte kurenakatta. Tomurai no uta o utatta no ni, naite kurenakatta' to iu no ni nite iru.
Naze nara, baputesuma no Yohane ga kite, pan o taberu koto mo, budoushu o nomu koto mo shinaito, anata gata wa, are wa akurei ni tsukarete iru no da, to ii,
Mata hito no ko ga kite tabe tari non dari shite iruto, miyo, are wa shoku o musaboru mono, oozake o nomu mono, mata shuzeinin, tsumibito no nakama da, to iu.
Shikashi, chie no tadashii koto wa, sono subete no ko ga shoumei suru".
Aru Parisaibito ga Iesu ni, shokuji o tomo ni shitai to moushideta no de, sono Parisaibito no ie ni haitte shokutaku ni tsukareta.
Suruto sono toki, sono machi de tsumi no onna de atta mono ga, Parisaibito no ie de shokutaku ni tsuite orareru koto o kiite, kouyu ga irete aru sekkou no tsubo o motte kite,
Nakinagara, Iesu no ushiro de sono ashimoto ni yori, mazu namida de Iesu no ashi o nurashi, jibun no kaminoke de nugui, soshite, sono ashi ni seppun shite, kouyu o nutta.
Iesu o maneita Parisaibito ga sore o mite, kokoro no naka de itta, "Moshi kono hito ga yogensha de arunara, jibun ni sawatte iru onna ga dare da ka, donna onna ka wakaru hazu da. Sore wa tsumi no onna na no dakara".
Soko de Iesu wa kare ni mukatte iwareta, "Shimon, anata ni iu koto ga aru". Kare wa "Sensei, osshatte kudasai" to itta.
Iesu ga iwareta, "Aru kanekashi ni kane o karita hito ga futari itaga, hitori wa gohyaku denari, mou hitori wa gojuu denari o karite ita.
Tokoro ga, kaesu koto ga dekinakatta no de, kare wa futaritomo yurushite yatta. Kono futari no uchi de, dochira ga kare o ooku aisurudarou ka".
Shimon ga kotaete itta, "Ooku yurushite moratta hou da to omoimasu". Iesu ga iwareta, "Anata no handan wa tadashii".
Sore kara onna no hou ni furimuite, Shimon ni iwareta, "Kono onna o minai ka. Watashi ga anata no ie ni haitte kita toki ni, anata wa ashi o arau mizu o kurenakatta. Tokoro ga, kono onna wa namida de watashi no ashi o nurashi, kaminoke de fuite kureta.
Anata wa watashi ni seppun o shite kurenakattaga, kanojo wa watashi ga ie ni haitta toki kara, watashi no ashi ni seppun o shite yamanakatta.
Anata wa watashi no atama ni abura o nutte kurenakattaga, kanojo wa watashi no ashi ni kouyu o nutte kureta.
Sore de anata ni iuga, kono onna wa ooku aishitakara, sono ooku no tsumi wa yurusarete iru no de aru. Sukoshi dake yurusareta mono wa, sukoshi dake shika aisanai".
Soshite onna ni, "Anata no tsumi wa yurusareta" to iwareta.
Suru to douseki no monotachi ga kokoro no naka de ii hajimeta, "Tsumi o yurusu koto sae suru kono hito wa, ittai, nanimono darou".
Shikashi, Iesu wa onna ni mukatte iwareta, "Anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta no desu. Anshin shite iki nasai".
Sono nochi Iesu wa, kami no kuni no fukuin o toki mata tsutaenagara, machimachi muramura o junkai shi tsuzukeraretaga, juu ni deshi mo otomo o shita.
Mata akurei o oidasare byouki o iyasareta suumei no fujintachi, sunawachi, nanatsu no akurei o oidashite moratta Magudara to yobareru Mariya,
Herode no karei Kuuza no tsuma Yohanna, Suzanna, sono hoka ooku no fujintachi mo issho ni ite, jibuntachi no mochimono o motte ikkou ni houshi shita.
Sate, oozei no gunshuu ga atsumari, sono ue, machimachi kara no hitotachi ga Iesu no tokoro ni, zokuzoku to oshiyosete kita no de, hitotsu no tatoe de hanashi o sareta,
"Tanemaki ga tane o maki ni dete itta. Maite iru uchi ni, aru tane wa michibata ni ochi, fumitsukerare, soshite sora no tori ni taberarete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa iwa no ue ni ochi, hae wa shitaga mizuke ga nai no de karete shimatta.
Hoka no tane wa, ibara no aida ni ochita no de, ibara mo issho ni shigette kite, sore o fusaide shimatta.
Tokoro ga, hoka no tane wa yoi chi ni ochita no de, wa e sodatte hyaku bai mo no mi o musunda". Kou katarareta nochi, koe o agete "Kiku mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi" to iwareta.
Deshitachi wa, kono tatoe wa dou iu imi deshou ka, to Iesu ni shitsumon shita.
Soko de iwareta, "Anata gata ni wa, kami no kuni no okugi o shiru koto ga yurusarete iruga, hoka no hitotachi ni wa, mite mo miezu, kiite mo satorarenai tame ni, tatoe de hanasu no de aru.
Kono tatoe wa kou iu imi de aru. Tane wa kami no kotoba de aru.
Michibata ni ochita no wa, kiita nochi, shinjiru koto mo sukuwareru koto mo nai you ni, akuma ni yotte sono kokoro kara mikotoba ga ubaitorareru hitotachi no koto de aru.
Iwa no ue ni ochita no wa, mikotoba o kiita toki ni wa yorokonde ukeireruga, ne ga nai no de, shibaraku wa shinjite ite mo, shiren no toki ga kuruto, shinkou o suteru hitotachi no koto de aru.
Ibara no naka ni ochita no wa, kiite kara hi o sugosu uchi ni, seikatsu no kokorozukai ya tomi ya kairaku ni fusagarete, mi no jukusuru made ni naranai hitotachi no koto de aru.
Yoi chi ni ochita no wa, mikotoba o kiita nochi, kore o tadashii yoi kokoro de shikkari to mamori, taeshinonde mi o musubu ni itaru hitotachi no koto de aru.
Dare mo akari o tomoshite, sore o nani ka no utsuwa de ooikabuse tari, shindai no shita ni oi tari wa shinai. Shokudai no ue ni oite, haitte kuru hitotachi ni hikari ga mieru you ni suru no de aru.
Kakusarete iru mono de, arawa ni naranai mono wa naku, himitsu ni sarete iru mono de, tsuini wa shirare, akarumi ni dasarenai mono wa nai.
Dakara, dou kiku ka ni chuui suru ga yoi. Motte iru hito wa sarani ataerare, motte inai hito wa, motte iru to omotte iru mono made mo, toriagerarerude arou".
Sate, Iesu no haha to kyoudaitachi to ga Iesu no tokoro ni kitaga, gunshuu no tame soba chikaku ni iku koto ga dekinakatta.
Sore de, dare ka ga "Anata no hahaue to kyoudai gata ga, ome ni kakarou to omotte, soto ni tatte oraremasu" to toritsuida.
Suru to Iesu wa hitobito ni mukatte iwareta, "Kami no mikotoba o kiite okonau mono koso, watashi no haha, watashi no kyoudai na no de aru".
Aru hi no koto, Iesu wa deshitachi to fune ni norikomi, "Mizuumi no mukougishi e watarou" to iwareta no de, ichidou ga funade shita.
Watatte iku aida ni, Iesu wa nemutte shimawareta. Suruto toppuu ga mizuumi ni fukioroshite kita no de, karera wa mizu o kabutte kiken ni natta.
Soko de, misoba ni yotte kite Iesu o okoshi, "Sensei, sensei, watashitachi wa shini sou desu" to itta. Iesu wa okiagatte, kaze to aranami to o oshikari ni naruto, yande nagi ni natta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata no shinkou wa, doko ni aru no ka". Karera wa osore odoroite tagai ni iiatta, "Ittai, konokata wa dare darou. Omeiji ni naruto, kaze mo mizu mo shitagau to wa".
Sore kara, karera wa Gariraya no taigan, gerasabito no chi ni watatta.
Riku ni agarareruto, sono machi no hito de, akurei ni tsukarete nagai aida kimono mo kizu, ie ni itsukanaide hakaba ni bakari ita hito ni, deawareta.
Kono hito ga Iesu o mite sakebi dashi, mimae ni hirefushite oogoe de itta, "I to takaki kami no ko Iesu yo, anata wa watashi to nan no kaka wari ga aru no desu. Onegai desu, watashi o kurushimenaide kudasai".
Sore wa, Iesu ga kegareta rei ni, sono hito kara dete ike, to omeiji ni nattakara de aru. To iu no wa, akurei ga nan do mo kare o hiki toraeta no de, kare wa kusari to ashikase to de tsunagarete mishi sarete itaga, sore o tachikitte wa akurei ni yotte arano e oiyararete ita no de aru.
Iesu wa kare ni "Nan to iu namae ka" to otazune ni naruto, "Region to iimasu" to kotaeta. Kare no naka ni takusan no akurei ga hairikonde itakara de aru.
Akureidomo wa, soko shirenu tokoro ni ochite iku koto o jibuntachi ni omeiji ni naranu you ni to, Iesu ni negai tsuzuketa.
Tokoro ga, soko no yamabe ni obitadashii buta no mure ga katte atta no de, sono buta no naka e hairu koto o yurushite itadakitai to, akureidomo ga negaideta. Iesu wa sore o oyurushi ni natta.
Soko de akureidomo wa, sono hito kara dete buta no naka e hairikonda. Suruto sono mure wa, gake kara mizuumi e nadare o utte kakekudari, oboreshinde shimatta.
Kau monotachi wa, kono dekigoto o mite nigedashite, machi ya murazato ni furemawatta.
Hitobito wa kono dekigoto o mi ni dete kita. Soshite, Iesu no tokoro ni kite, akurei o oidashite moratta hito ga kimono o kite, shouki ni natte Iesu no ashimoto ni suwatte iru no o mite, osoreta.
Sore o mita hitotachi wa, kono akurei ni tsukarete ita mono ga sukuwareta shidai o, karera ni katarikikaseta.
Sore kara, gerasa no chihou no minshuu wa kozotte, jibuntachi no tokoro kara tachisatte kudasaru you ni to Iesu ni tanonda. Karera ga hijou na kyoufu ni osowarete itakara de aru. Soko de, Iesu wa fune ni notte kaerikakerareta.
Akurei o oidashite moratta hito wa, otomo o shitai to, shikiri ni negattaga, Iesu wa kou itte kare o okaeshi ni natta.
"Ie e kaette, kami ga anata ni donna ni ookina koto o shite kudasatta ka, katarikikase nasai". Soko de kare wa tachisatte, jibun ni Iesu ga shite kudasatta koto o, kotogotoku machijuu ni ii hirometa.
Iesu ga kaette korareruto, gunshuu wa yorokobimukaeta. Minna ga Iesu o machiukete ita no de aru.
Suruto soko ni, Yairo to iu na no hito ga kita. Kono hito wa kaidouzukasa de atta. Iesu no ashimoto ni hirefushite, jibun no ie ni oide kudasaru you ni to, shikiri ni negatta.
Kare ni juu nisai bakari ni naru hitorimusume ga attaga, shi ni kakete ita. Tokoro ga, Iesu ga dete ikareru tochuu, gunshuu ga oshisematte kita.
Koko ni, juu ni nenkan mo naga chi o wazuratte ite, isha no tame ni jibun no shindai o mina tsukai hatashite shimattaga, dare ni mo naoshite moraenakatta onna ga ita.
Kono onna ga ushiro kara chikayotte mi koromo no fusa ni sawatta tokoro, sono naga chi ga tachimachi tomatte shimatta.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi ni sawatta no wa, dare ka". Hitobito wa mina jibun de wa nai to itta no de, Petero ga "Sensei, gunshuu ga anata o torikakonde, hishimekiatte iru no desu" to kotaeta.
Shikashi Iesu wa iwareta, "Dare ka ga watashi ni sawatta. Chikara ga watashi kara dete itta no o kanjita no da".
Onna wa kakushi kirenai no o shitte, furuenagara susumidete, mimae ni hirefushi, Iesu ni sawatta wake to, sawaruto tachimachi naotta koto to o, minna no mae de hanashita.
Soko de Iesu ga onna ni iwareta, "Musume yo, anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta no desu. Anshin shite iki nasai".
Iesu ga mada hanashite orareru uchi ni, kaidouzukasa no ie kara hito ga kite, "Ojousan wa nakunararemashita. Kono ue, sensei o wazurawasu ni wa oyobimasen" to itta.
Shikashi Iesu wa kore o kiite kaidouzukasa ni mukatte iwareta, "Osoreru koto wa nai. Tada shinji nasai. Musume wa tasukaru no da".
Sore kara ie ni wa irareru toki, Petero, Yohane, Yakobu oyobi sono ko no fubo no hoka wa, dare mo issho ni haitte kuru koto o oyurushi ni naranakatta.
Hitobito wa mina, musume no tame ni nakikanashinde ita. Iesu wa iwareta, "Naku na, musume wa shinda no de wa nai. Nemutte iru dake de aru".
Hitobito wa musume ga shinda koto o shitte ita no de, Iesu o azawaratta.
Iesu wa musume no te o totte, yobikakete iwareta, "Musume yo, oki nasai".
Suruto sono rei ga modotte kite, musume wa sokuza ni tachiagatta. Iesu wa nani ka tabemono o ataeru you ni, sashizu o sareta.
Ryoushin wa odoroite shimatta. Iesu wa kono dekigoto o dare ni mo hanasanai you ni to, karera ni meijirareta.
Sore kara Iesu wa juu ni deshi o yobiatsumete, karera ni subete no akurei o seishi, byouki o iyasu chikara to ken'i to o osazuke ni natta.
Mata kami no kuni o nobetsutae, katsu byouki o naosu tame ni tsukawashite
Iwareta, "Tabi no tame ni nani mo tazusaeru na. Tsue mo fukuro mo pan mo zeni mo motazu, mata shitagi mo nimai wa motsu na.
Mata, doko ka no ie ni haittara, soko ni todomatte ore. Soshite soko kara dekakeru koto ni shi nasai.
Dare mo anatagata o mukaeru mono ga inakattara, sono machi o dete iku toki, karera ni taisuru kougi no shirushi ni, ashi kara chiri o haraiotoshi nasai".
Deshitachi wa dete itte, muramura o meguriaruki, itaru tokoro de fukuin o nobetsutae, mata byouki o iyashita.
Sate, ryoushu Herode wa iroiro na dekigoto o mimi ni shite, awatemadotte ita. Sore wa, aru hitotachi wa, Yohane ga shinin no naka kara yomigaetta to ii,
Mata aru hitotachi wa, Eriya ga arawareta to ii, mata hoka no hitotachi wa, mukashi no yogensha no hitori ga fukkatsu shita no da to itte itakara de aru.
Soko de Herode ga itta, "Yohane wa watashi ga sudeni kubi o kitta no daga, kou shite uwasa sarete iru kono hito wa, ittai, dare na no darou". Soshite Iesu ni atte miyou to omotte ita.
Shitotachi wa kaette kite, jibuntachi no shita koto o subete Iesu ni hanashita. Sore kara Iesu wa karera o tsurete, Betsusaida to iu machi e hisoka ni shirizokareta.
Tokoro ga gunshuu ga sore to shitte, tsuite kita no de, kore o mukaete kami no kuni no koto o katarikikase, mata chiryou o yousuru hitotachi o iyasareta.
Sore kara hi ga katamukikaketa no de, juu ni deshi ga Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Gunshuu o kaisan shite, mawari no muramura ya buraku e itte yado o tori, shokumotsu o te ni ireru you ni sasete kudasai. Watashitachi wa konna sabishii tokoro ni kite iru no desukara".
Shikashi Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata no te de shokumotsu o yari nasai". Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi ni wa pan itsutsu to uo nihiki shika arimasen, kono oozei no hito no tame ni shokumotsu o kai ni iku ka shinakereba".
To iu no wa, otoko ga gosennin bakari mo itakara de aru. Shikashi Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Hitobito o ooyoso gojuunin zutsu no kumi ni shite, suwarase nasai".
Karera wa sono toori ni shite, minna o suwaraseta.
Iesu wa itsutsu no pan to nihiki no uo to o te ni tori, ten o aoide sore o shukufuku shite saki, deshitachi ni watashite gunshuu ni kubaraseta.
Minna no mono wa tabete manpuku shita. Soshite, sono amari kuzu o atsumetara, juu ni kago atta.
Iesu ga hitori de inotte orareta toki, deshitachi ga chikaku ni ita no de, karera ni tazunete iwareta, "Gunshuu wa watashi o dare to itte iru ka".
Karera wa kotaete itta, "Baputesuma no Yohane dato, itte imasu. Shikashi hoka no hitotachi wa, Eriya da to ii, mata mukashi no yogensha no hitori ga fukkatsu shita no dato, itte iru mono mo arimasu".
Karera ni iwareta, "Sore de wa, anata gata wa watashi o dare to iu ka". Petero ga kotaete itta, "Kami no Kirisuto desu".
Iesu wa karera o imashime, kono koto o dare ni mo iu na to meiji, soshite iwareta,
"Hito no ko wa kanarazu ooku no kurushimi o uke, chourou, saishichou, rippougakusha tachi ni suterare, mata korosare, soshite mikkame ni yomigaeru".
Sore kara, minna no mono ni iwareta, "Dare de mo watashi ni tsuite kitai to omounara, jibun o sute, hibi jibun no juujika o oute, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai.
Jibun no inochi o sukuou to omou mono wa sore o ushinai, watashi no tame ni jibun no inochi o ushinau mono wa, sore o sukuude arou.
Hito ga zensekai o moukete mo, jibun jishin o ushinai mata wa sonshitara, nan no e ni narou ka.
Watashi to watashi no kotoba to o hajiru mono ni taishite wa, hito no ko mo mata, jibun no eikou to, chichi to sei naru mitsukai to no eikou no uchi ni arawarete kuru toki, sono mono o hajirude arou.
Yoku kiite oku ga yoi, kami no kuni o miru made wa, shi o ajiwawanai mono ga, koko ni tatte iru mono no naka ni iru".
Korera no koto o hanasareta nochi, youka hodo tatte kara, Iesu wa Petero, Yohane, Yakobu o tsurete, inoru tame ni yama ni noborareta.
Inotte orareru aida ni, mikao no sama ga kawari, mikoromo ga mabayui hodo ni shiroku kagayaita.
Suru to miyo, futari no hito ga Iesu to katariatte ita. Sore wa Moose to Eriya de attaga,
Eikou no naka ni arawarete, Iesu ga Erusaremu de togeyou to suru saigo no koto ni tsuite hanashite ita no de aru.
Petero to sono nakama no monotachi to wa jukusui shite itaga, me o samasuto, Iesu no eikou no sugata to, tomo ni tatte iru futari no hito to o mita.
Kono futari ga Iesu o hanaresarou to shita toki, Petero wa jibun ga nani o itte iru no ka wakaranaide, Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, watashitachi ga koko ni iru no wa, subarashii koto desu. Sore de, watashitachi wa koya o mittsu tatemashou. Hitotsu wa anata no tame ni, hitotsu wa Moose no tame ni, hitotsu wa Eriya no tame ni".
Kare ga kou itte iru aida ni, kumo ga wakiokotte karera o ooi hajimeta. Soshite sono kumo ni kakomareta toki, karera wa osoreta.
Suru to kumo no naka kara koe ga atta, "Kore wa watashi no ko, watashi no eranda mono de aru. Kore ni kike".
Soshite koe ga yanda toki, Iesu ga hitori dake ni natte orareta. Deshitachi wa chinmoku o mamotte, jibuntachi ga mita koto ni tsuite wa, sono koro dare ni mo hanasanakatta.
Yokujitsu, ichidou ga yama o orite kuruto, oozei no gunshuu ga Iesu o demukaeta.
Suruto totsuzen, aru hito ga gunshuu no naka kara oogoe o agete itta, "Sensei, onegai desu. Watashi no musuko o mite yatte kudasai. Kono ko wa watashi no hitori musuko desuga,
Rei ga toritsukimasuto, kare wa kyuu ni sakebi dasu no desu. Sore kara, rei wa kare o hikitsukesasete, awa o fukase, kare o yowari hatesasete, nakanaka dete ikanai no desu.
Sore de, odeshitachi ni, kono rei o oidashite kudasaru you ni negaimashitaga, dekimasendeshita".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Aa, nan to iu fushinkou na, magatta jidai de arou. Itsu made, watashi wa anata gata to issho ni orareyou ka, mata anata gata ni gaman ga dekiyou ka. Anata no ko o koko ni tsurete ki nasai".
Tokoro ga, sono ko ga Iesu no tokoro ni kuru toki ni mo, akurei ga kare o hikitaoshite, hikitsukesaseta. Iesu wa kono kegareta rei o shikaritsuke, sono kodomo o iyashite, chichioya ni owatashi ni natta.
Hitobito wa mina, kami no idai na chikara ni hijou ni odoroita. Minna no mono ga Iesu no shite orareta kazukazu no koto o fushigi ni omotte iruto, deshitachi ni iwareta,
"Anata gata wa kono kotoba o mimi ni osamete oki nasai. Hito no ko wa hitobito no te ni watasareyou to shite iru".
Shikashi, karera wa nan no koto ka wakaranakatta. Sore ga karera ni kakusarete ite, satoru koto ga dekinakatta no de aru. Mata karera wa sono koto ni tsuite tazuneru no o osorete ita.
Deshitachi no aida ni, karera no uchi de dare ga ichiban eraidarou ka to iu koto de, giron ga hajimatta.
Iesu wa karera no kokoro no omoi o minuki, hitori no osanago o toriagete jibun no soba ni tatase, karera ni iwareta,
"Dare de mo kono osanago o watashi no na no yue ni ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de aru. Soshite watashi o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta kata o ukeireru no de aru. Anata gata minna no naka de ichiban chiisai mono koso, ookii no de aru".
Suru to Yohane ga kotaete itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa aru hito ga anata no na o tsukatte akurei o oidashite iru no o mimashitaga, sono hito wa watashitachi no nakama de nai no de, yamesasemashita".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Yamesasenai ga yoi. Anata gata ni hantai shinai mono wa, anata gata no mikata na no de aru".
Sate, Iesu ga ten ni agerareru hi ga chikazuita no de, Erusaremu e ikou to ketsui shite, sono hou e kao o mukerare,
Jibun ni sakidatte shishatachi o otsukawashi ni natta. Soshite karera ga Samariyabito no mura e haitte iki, Iesu no tame ni junbi o shiyou to shita tokoro,
Murabito wa, Erusaremu e mukatte susunde ikareru to iu no de, Iesu o kangei shiyou to wa shinakatta.
Deshi no Yakobu to Yohane to wa sore o mite itta, "Shu yo, ikaga deshou. Karera o yakiharatte shimau you ni, ten kara hi o yobimotomemashou ka".
Iesu wa furikaette, karera o oshikari ni natta.
Soshite ichidou wa hoka no mura e itta.
Michi o susunde ikuto, aru hito ga Iesu ni itta, "Anata ga oide ni naru tokoro nara doko e de mo shitagatte mairimasu".
Iesu wa sono hito ni iwareta, "Kitsune ni wa ana ga ari, sora no tori ni wa su ga aru. Shikashi, hito no ko ni wa makura suru tokoro ga nai".
Mata hoka no hito ni, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai" to iwareta. Suruto sono hito ga itta, "Mazu, chichi o houmuri ni ikasete kudasai".
Kare ni iwareta, "Sono shinin o houmuru koto wa, shinin ni makasete oku ga yoi. Anata wa, dete itte kami no kuni o tsuge hirome nasai".
Mata hoka no hito ga itta, "Shu yo, shitagatte mairimasuga, mazu ie no mono ni wakare o ii ni ikasete kudasai".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Te o suki ni kakete kara, ushiro o miru mono wa, kami no kuni ni fusawashiku nai mono de aru".
Sono nochi, Shu wa betsu ni nanajuu ninin o erabi, ikou to shite orareta subete no machi ya mura e, futari zutsu saki ni otsukawashi ni natta.
Sono toki, karera ni iwareta, "Shuukaku wa ooiga, hatarakibito ga sukunai. Dakara, shuukaku no Shu ni negatte, sono shuukaku no tame ni hatarakibito o okuridasu you ni shite morai nasai.
Saa, iki nasai. Watashi ga anatagata o tsukawasu no wa, kohitsuji o ookami no naka ni okuru you na mono de aru.
Saifu mo fukuro mo kutsu mo motte iku na. Dare ni mo michi de aisatsu suru na.
Doko ka no ie ni haittara, mazu 'Heian ga kono ie ni aru you ni' to ii nasai.
Moshi heian no ko ga soko ni oreba, anata gata no inoru heian wa sono hito no ue ni todomarude arou. Moshi sou de nakattara, sore wa anata gata no ue ni kaette kurude arou.
Sore de, sono onaji ie ni todomatte ite, ie no hito ga dashite kureru mono o nomikui shi nasai. Hatarakibito ga sono mukui o eru no wa touzen de aru. Ie kara ie e to watariaruku na.
Dono machi e haitte mo, hitobito ga anatagata o mukaete kurerunara, mae ni dasareru mono o tabe nasai.
Soshite, sono machi ni iru byounin o iyashite yari, 'Kami no kuni wa anata gata ni chikazuita' to ii nasai.
Shikashi, dono machi e haitte mo, hitobito ga anatagata o mukaenai baai ni wa, oodoori ni dete itte ii nasai,
'Watashitachi no ashi ni tsuite iru kono machi no chiri mo, nugui sutete iku. Shikashi, kami no kuni ga chikazuita koto wa, shouchi shite iru ga yoi'.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Sono hi ni wa, kono machi yori mo Sodomu no hou ga taeyasui de arou.
Wazawai da, Korajin yo. Wazawai da, Betsusaida yo. Omaetachi no naka de nasareta chikara aru waza ga, moshi Tsuro to Shidon de nasaretanara, karera wa tou no mukashi ni, aranuno o matoi hai no naka ni suwatte, kuiaratametade arou.
Shikashi, sabaki no hi ni wa, Tsuro to Shidon no hou ga omaetachi yori mo, taeyasui de arou.
Aa, Kapenaumu yo, omae wa ten ni made agerareyou to de mo iu no ka. Yomi ni made otosarerude arou.
Anata gata ni kikishitagau mono wa, watashi ni kikishitagau no de ari, anatagata o kobamu mono wa, watashi o kobamu no de aru. Soshite watashi o kobamu mono wa, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta kata o kobamu no de aru".
Nanajuu ninin ga yorokonde kaette kite itta, "Shu yo, anata no na ni yotte itashimasuto, akurei made ga watashitachi ni fukujuu shimasu".
Karera ni iwareta, "Watashi wa Satan ga denkou no you ni ten kara ochiru no o mita.
Watashi wa anata gata ni, hebi ya sasori o fumitsuke, teki no arayuru chikara ni uchikatsu ken'i o sazuketa. Dakara, anata gata ni gai o oyobosu mono wa mattaku naide arou.
Shikashi, rei ga anata gata ni fukujuu suru koto o yorokobu na. Mushiro, anata gata no na ga ten ni shirusarete iru koto o yorokobi nasai".
Sono toki, Iesu wa seirei ni yotte yorokobiafurete iwareta, "Tenchi no Shu naru chichi yo. Anata o hometataemasu. Korera no koto o chie no aru mono ya kashikoi mono ni kakushite, osanago ni arawashite kudasaimashita. Chichi yo, kore wa makoto ni, mikokoro ni kanatta koto deshita.
Subete no koto wa chichi kara watashi ni makaserarete imasu. Soshite, ko ga dare de aru ka wa, chichi no hoka shitte iru mono wa arimasen. Mata chichi ga dare de aru ka wa, ko to, chichi o arawasou to shite ko ga eranda mono to no hoka, dare mo shitte iru mono wa imasen".
Sore kara deshitachi no hou ni furimuite, hisoka ni iwareta, "Anata gata ga mite iru koto o miru me wa, saiwai de aru.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Ooku no yogensha ya outachi mo, anata gata no mite iru koto o miyou to shitaga, miru koto ga dekizu, anata gata no kiite iru koto o kikou to shitaga, kikenakatta no de aru".
Suruto soko e, aru rippougakusha ga araware, Iesu o kokoromiyou to shite itta, "Sensei, nani o shitara eien no seimei ga ukeraremashou ka".
Kare ni iwareta, "Rippou ni wa nan to kaite aru ka. Anata wa dou yomu ka".
Kare wa kotaete itta, " 'Kokoro o tsukushi, seishin o tsukushi, chikara o tsukushi, omoi o tsukushite, Shu naru anata no kami o aiseyo'. Mata, 'Jibun o aisuru you ni, anata no tonaribito o aiseyo' to arimasu".
Kare ni iwareta, "Anata no kotae wa tadashii. Sono toori okonai nasai. Sou sureba, inochi ga erareru".
Suruto kare wa jibun no tachiba o bengo shiyou to omotte, Iesu ni itta, "De wa, watashi no tonaribito to wa dare no koto desu ka".
Iesu ga kotaete iwareta, "Aru hito ga Erusaremu kara Eriko ni kudatte iku tochuu, goutoudomo ga kare o osoi, sono kimono o hagitori, kizu o owase, hangoroshi ni shita mama, nigesatta.
Suruto tamatama, hitori no saishi ga sono michi o kudatte kitaga, kono hito o miruto, mukougawa o tootte itta.
Douyou ni, Rebihito mo kono basho ni sashikakatte kitaga, kare o miruto mukougawa o tootte itta.
Tokoro ga, aru Samariyabito ga tabi o shite kono hito no tokoro o toorikakari, kare o mite kinodoku ni omoi,
Chikayotte kite sono kizu ni oribu yu to budoushu to o sosoide houtai o shite yari, jibun no kachiku ni nose, yadoya ni tsurete itte kaihou shita.
Yokujitsu, denari futatsu o toridashite yadoya no shujin ni tewatashi, 'Kono hito o mite yatte kudasai. Hiyou ga yokei ni kakattara, kaerigake ni, watashi ga shiharaimasu' to itta.
Kono sannin no uchi, dare ga goutou ni osowareta hito no tonaribito ni natta to omou ka".
Kare ga itta, "Sono hito ni jihi bukai okonai o shita hito desu". Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata mo itte onaji you ni shi nasai".
Ichidou ga tabi o tsuzukete iru uchi ni, Iesu ga aru mura e hairareta. Suruto Maruta to iu na no onna ga Iesu o ie ni mukaeireta.
Kono onna ni Mariya to iu imouto ga itaga, Shu no ashimoto ni suwatte, mikotoba ni kikiitte ita.
Tokoro ga, Maruta wa settai no koto de isogashikute kokoro o torimidashi, Iesu no tokoro ni kite itta, "Shu yo, imouto ga watashi dake ni settai o sasete iru no o, nan to mo oomoi ni narimasen ka. Watashi no tetsudai o suru you ni imouto ni osshatte kudasai".
Shu wa kotaete iwareta, "Maruta yo, Maruta yo, anata wa ooku no koto ni kokoro o kubatte omoiwazuratte iru.
Shikashi, nakute naranu mono wa ooku wa nai. Iya, hitotsu dake de aru. Mariya wa sono yoi hou o eranda no da. Soshite sore wa, kanojo kara torisatte wa naranai mono de aru".
Mata, Iesu wa aru tokoro de inotte oraretaga, sore ga owatta toki, deshi no hitori ga itta, "Shu yo, Yohane ga sono deshitachi ni oshieta you ni, watashitachi ni mo inoru koto o oshiete kudasai".
Soko de karera ni iwareta, "Inoru toki ni wa, kou ii nasai, 'Chichi yo, mina ga agameraremasu you ni. Mikuni ga kimasu you ni.
Watashitachi no higoto no shokumotsu o, hibi oatae kudasai.
Watashitachi ni fusai no aru mono o mina yurushimasukara, watashitachi no tsumi o mo oyurushi kudasai. Watashitachi o kokoromi ni awasenaide kudasai' ".
Soshite karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata no uchi no dare ka ni, yuujin ga aru to shite, sono hito no tokoro e mayonaka ni iki, 'Tomo yo, pan o mittsu kashite kudasai.
Tomodachi ga tabisaki kara watashi no tokoro ni tsuita no desuga, nani mo dasu mono ga arimasenkara' to itta baai,
Kare wa uchi kara, 'Mendou o kakenaide kure. Mou to wa shimete shimattashi, kodomotachi mo watashi to issho ni toko ni haitte iru no de, ima okite nani mo ageru wake ni wa ikanai' to iude arou.
Shikashi, yoku kiki nasai, yuujin dakara to iu no de wa okite ataenaiga, shikiri ni negau no de, okiagatte hitsuyou na mono o dashite kurerude arou.
Soko de watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Motomeyo, sou sureba, ataerarerude arou. Sagase, sou sureba miidasude arou. Mon o tatake, sou sureba, akete moraerude arou.
Subete motomeru mono wa e, sagasu mono wa miidashi, mon o tataku mono wa akete moraerukara de aru.
Anata gata no uchi de, chichi de aru mono wa, sono ko ga uo o motomeru no ni, uo no kawari ni hebi o ataerudarou ka.
Tamago o motomeru no ni, sasori o ataerudarou ka.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa warui mono de atte mo, jibun no kodomo ni wa, yoi okurimono o suru koto o shitte iru to sureba, ten no chichi wa naosara, motomete kuru mono ni seirei o kudasaranai koto ga arou ka".
Sate, Iesu ga akurei o oidashite orareta. Sore wa, oshi no rei de atta. Akurei ga dete ikuto, oshi ga mono o iu you ni natta no de, gunshuu wa fushigi ni omotta.
Sono naka no aru hitobito ga, "Kare wa akurei no kashira Beruzeburu ni yotte, akureidomo o oidashite iru no da" to ii,
Mata hoka no hitobito wa, Iesu o kokoromiyou to shite, ten kara no shirushi o motometa.
Shikashi Iesu wa, karera no omoi o minuite iwareta, "Ooyoso kuni ga naibu de bunretsu sureba jimetsu shite shimai, mata ie ga wakare arasoeba taorete shimau.
Soko de Satan mo naibu de bunretsu sureba, sono kuni wa dou shite tachi ikeyou. Anata gata wa watashi ga Beruzeburu ni yotte akurei o oidashite iru to iuga,
Moshi watashi ga Beruzeburu ni yotte akurei o oidasu to sureba, anata gata no nakama wa dare ni yotte oidasu no de arou ka. Dakara, karera ga anatagata o sabaku mono to narude arou.
Shikashi, watashi ga kami no yubi ni yotte akurei o oidashite iru no nara, kami no kuni wa sudeni anata gata no tokoro ni kita no de aru.
Tsuyoi hito ga juubun ni busou shite jibun no teitaku o mamotte iru kagiri, sono mochimono wa anzen de aru.
Shikashi, motto tsuyoi mono ga osotte kite kare ni uchikateba, sono tanomi ni shite ita bugu o ubatte, sono bundori hin o wakeru no de aru.
Watashi no mikata de nai mono wa, watashi ni hantai suru mono de ari, watashi to tomo ni atsumenai mono wa, chirasu mono de aru.
Kegareta rei ga hito kara deruto, yasumiba o motomete mizu no nai tokoro o aruki mawaruga, mitsukaranai no de, dete kita moto no ie ni kaerou to itte,
Kaette miruto, sono ie wa souji ga shite aru ue, kazaritsuke ga shite atta.
Soko de mata dete itte, jibun ijou ni warui ta no nanatsu no rei o hikitsurete kite naka ni hairi, soko ni sumikomu. Sou suruto, sono hito no nochi no joutai wa hajime yori mo motto waruku naru no de aru".
Iesu ga kou hanashite orareru toki, gunshuu no naka kara hitori no onna ga koe o hariagete itta, "Anata o yadoshita tai, anata ga suwareta chibusa wa, nan to megumarete iru koto deshou".
Shikashi Iesu wa iwareta, "Iya, megumarete iru no wa, mushiro, kami no kotoba o kiite sore o mamoru hitotachi de aru".
Sate gunshuu ga muragariatsumatta no de, Iesu wa katari dasareta, "Kono jidai wa jaaku na jidai de aru. Sore wa shirushi o motomeruga, Yona no shirushi no hoka ni wa, nan no shirushi mo ataerarenaide arou.
To iu no wa, Ninebe no hitobito ni taishite Yona ga shirushi to natta you ni, hito no ko mo kono jidai ni taishite shirushi to narude arou.
Minami no joou ga, ima no jidai no hitobito to tomo ni sabaki no ba ni tatte, karera o tsumi ni sadamerude arou. Naze nara, kanojo wa Soromon no chie o kiku tame ni, chi no hate kara harubaru kitakara de aru. Shikashi miyo, Soromon ni masaru mono ga koko ni iru.
Ninebe no hitobito ga, ima no jidai no hitobito to tomo ni sabaki no ba ni tatte, karera o tsumi ni sadamerude arou. Naze nara, Ninebe no hitobito wa Yona no senkyou ni yotte kuiaratametakara de aru. Shikashi miyo, Yona ni masaru mono ga koko ni iru.
Dare mo akari o tomoshite, sore o anagura no naka ya masu no shita ni oku koto wa shinai. Mushiro haitte kuru hitotachi ni, sono akari ga mieru you ni, shokudai no ue ni oku.
Anata no me wa, karada no akari de aru. Anata no me ga sunde oreba, zenshin mo akaruiga, me ga warukereba, karada mo kurai.
Dakara, anata no uchi naru hikari ga kuraku naranai you ni chuui shi nasai.
Moshi, anata no karada zentai ga akarukute, kurai bubun ga sukoshi mo nakereba, choudo, akari ga kagayaite anata o tera sutoki no you ni, zenshin ga akaruku narude arou".
Iesu ga katatte orareta toki, aru Parisaibito ga, jibun no ie de shokuji o shite itadakitai to moushideta no de, hai tte shokutaku ni tsukareta.
Tokoro ga, shokuzen ni mazu arau koto o nasaranakatta no o mite, sono Parisaibito ga fushigi ni omotta.
Soko de Shu wa kare ni iwareta, "Ittai, anata gata Parisaibito wa, sakazuki ya bon no sotogawa o kiyomeruga, anata gata no uchigawa wa don'yoku to jaaku to de michite iru.
Oroka na monotachi yo, sotogawa o tsukutta kata wa, mata uchigawa mo tsukuraretade wa nai ka.
Tada, uchigawa ni aru mono o kiyome nasai. Sou sureba, issai ga anata gata ni totte, kiyoi mono to naru.
Shikashi, anata hou Parisaibito wa, wazawai de aru. Hakka, un kou, arayuru yasai nado no juubun no ichi o miya ni osamete orinagara, gi to kami ni taisuru ai to o naozari ni shite iru. Sore mo naozari ni wa dekinaiga, kore wa okonawaneba naranai.
Anata gata Parisaibito wa, wazawai de aru. Kaidou no jouseki ya hiroba de no keirei o kononde iru.
Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Hitome ni tsukanai haka no you na mono de aru. Sono ue o aruite mo hitobito wa kizukanaide iru".
Hitori no rippougakusha ga Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Sensei, sonna koto o iwareru no wa, watashitachi made mo bujoku suru koto desu".
Soko de iwareta, "Anata gata rippougakusha mo, wazawai de aru. Oi kirenai omoni o hito ni owasenagara, jibun de wa sono ni ni yubi ichipon de mo fureyou to shinai.
Anata gata wa, wazawai de aru. Yogensha tachi no hi o tateruga, shikashi karera o koroshita no wa, anata gata no senzo de atta no da.
Dakara, anata gata wa, jibun no senzo no shiwaza ni doui suru shounin na no da. Senzo ga karera o koroshi, anata gata ga sono hi o tateru no dakara.
Sore yue ni, 'Kami no chie' mo itte iru, 'Watashi wa yogensha to shito to o karera ni tsukawasuga, karera wa sono uchi no aru mono o koroshi tari, hakugai shi tari surude arou'.
Sore de, Aberu no chi kara saidan to shinden to no aida de korosareta Zakariya no chi ni itaru made, yo no hajime kara nagasarete kita subete no yogensha no chi ni tsuite, kono jidai ga sono sekinin o towareru.
Sou da, anata gata ni itte oku, kono jidai ga sono sekinin o towarerude arou.
Anata gata rippougakusha wa, wazawai de aru. Chishiki no kagi o toriagete, jibun ga hairanai bakari ka, hairou to suru hitotachi o samatagete kita".
Iesu ga soko o dete ikareruto, rippougakusha ya Parisaibito wa, hageshiku tsumeyori, iroiro na koto o toikakete,
Iesu no kuchi kara nani ka iigakari o eyou to, nerai hajimeta.
Sono aida ni, obitadashii gunshuu ga, tagai ni fumiau hodo ni muragatte kitaga, Iesu wa mazu deshitachi ni katari hajimerareta, "Parisaibito no pan dane, sunawachi karera no gizen ni ki o tsuke nasai.
Ooikabusareta mono de, arawarete konai mono wa naku, kakurete iru mono de, shirarete konai mono wa nai.
Dakara, anata gata ga kurayami de itta koto wa, nan de mo mina akarumi de kikare, misshitsu de mimi ni sasayaita koto wa, yane no ue de ii hiromerarerude arou.
Soko de watashi no tomo de aru anata gata ni iuga, karada o koroshite mo, sono ato de sore ijou nani mo dekinai monodomo o osoreru na.
Osorubeki mono ga dare de aru ka, oshiete ageyou. Koroshita ato de, sarani jigoku ni nagekomu ken'i no aru kata o osore nasai. Sou da, anata gata ni itte okuga, sono kata o osore nasai.
Itsuwa no suzume wa ni Asarion de urarete irude wa nai ka. Shikamo, sono hitowa mo kami no mimae de wasurerarete wa inai.
Sono ue, anata gata no atama no ke made mo, mina kazoerarete iru. Osoreru koto wa nai. Anata gata wa ooku no suzume yori mo, masatta mono de aru.
Soko de, anata gata ni iu. Dare de mo hito no mae de watashi o ukeireru mono o, hito no ko mo kami no tsukaitachi no mae de ukeirerude arou.
Shikashi, hito no mae de watashi o kobamu mono wa, kami no tsukaitachi no mae de kobamarerude arou.
Mata, hito no ko ni ii sakarau mono wa yurusarerude arouga, seirei o kegasu mono wa, yurusareru koto wa nai.
Anata gata ga kaidou ya yakunin ya koukan no mae e hippararete itta baai ni wa, nani o dou benmei shiyou ka, nani o iou ka to shinpai shinai ga yoi.
Iubeki koto wa, seirei ga sono toki ni oshiete kudasarukara de aru".
Gunshuu no naka no hitori ga Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, watashi no kyoudai ni, isan o wakete kureru you ni osshatte kudasai".
Kare ni iwareta, "Hito yo, dare ga watashi o anata gata no saibannin mata wa bunpainin ni tateta no ka".
Sore kara hitobito ni mukatte iwareta, "Arayuru don'yoku ni taishite yokuyoku keikai shi nasai. Tatoi takusan no mono o motte ite mo, hito no inochi wa, mochimono ni wa yoranai no de aru".
Soko de hitotsu no tatoe o katarareta, "Aru kanemochi no hatake ga housaku de atta.
Soko de kare wa kokoro no naka de, 'Dou shiyou ka, watashi no sakumotsu o shimatte oku tokoro ga nai no daga' to omoimegurashite
Itta, 'Kou shiyou. Watashi no kura o torikowashi, motto ookii no o tatete, soko ni kokumotsu ya shokuryou o zenbu shimaikomou.
Soshite jibun no tamashii ni iou. Tamashii yo, omae ni wa naganen bun no shokuryou ga takusan takuwaete aru. Saa anshin seyo, kue, nome, tanoshime'.
Suru to kami ga kare ni iwareta, 'Oroka na mono yo, anata no tamashii wa kon'ya no uchi ni mo torisararerude arou. So shitara, anata ga youi shita mono wa, dare no mono ni naru no ka'.
Jibun no tame ni takara o tsunde kami ni taishite tomanai mono wa, kore to onaji de aru".
Sore kara deshitachi ni iwareta, "Sore dakara, anata gata ni itte oku. Nani o tabeyou ka to, inochi no koto de omoiwazurai, nani o kiyou ka to karada no koto de omoiwazurau na.
Inochi wa shokumotsu ni masari, karada wa kimono ni masatte iru.
Karasu no koto o kangaete mi yo. Maku koto mo, karu koto mo sezu, mata, naya mo naku kura mo nai. Sore da no ni, kami wa karera o yashinatte ite kudasaru. Anata gata wa tori yori mo, haruka ni sugurete irude wa nai ka.
Anata gata no uchi, dare ga omoiwazurattakara tote, jibun no jumyou o wazuka de mo nobasu koto ga dekiyou ka.
Sonna chiisana koto sae dekinai no ni, dou shite hoka no koto o omoiwazurau no ka.
No no hana no koto o kangaete miru ga yoi. Tsumugi mo sezu, ori mo shinai. Shikashi, anata gata ni iuga, eiga o kiwameta toki no Soromon de sae, kono hana no hitotsu hodo ni mo kikazatte wa inakatta.
Kyou wa no ni atte, asu wa ro ni nageirerareru kusa de sae, kami wa kono you ni yosootte kudasaru no nara, anata gata ni, sore ijou yoku shite kudasaranai hazu ga arou ka. Aa, shinkou no usui monotachi yo.
Anata gata mo, nani o tabe, nani o nomou ka to, akuseku suru na, mata ki o tsukau na.
Korera no mono wa mina, konoyo no ihoujin ga setsuni motomete iru mono de aru. Anata gata no chichi wa, korera no mono ga anata gata ni hitsuyou de aru koto o, gozonjide aru.
Tada, mikuni o motome nasai. Sou sureba, korera no mono wa soete ataerarerude arou.
Osoreru na, chiisai mure yo. Mikuni o kudasaru koto wa, anata gata no chichi no mikokoro na no de aru.
Jibun no mochimono o utte, hodokoshi nasai. Jibun no tame ni furubiru koto no nai saifu o tsukuri, nusubito mo chikayorazu, mushi mo kuiyaburanai ten ni, tsukiru koto no nai takara o takuwae nasai.
Anata gata no takara no aru tokoro ni wa, kokoro mo arukara de aru.
Koshi ni obi o shime, akari o tomoshite i nasai.
Shujin ga kon en kara kaette kite to o tataku toki, sugu akete ageyou to matte iru hito no you ni shite i nasai.
Shujin ga kaette kita toki, me o samashite iru no o mirareru shimobetachi wa, saiwai de aru. Yoku itte oku. Shujin ga obi o shimete shimobetachi o shokutaku ni tsukase, susumiyotte kyuuji o shite kurerude arou.
Shujin ga yonaka goro, aruiha yoake goro ni kaette kite mo, sou shite iru no o mirarerunara, sono hitotachi wa saiwai de aru.
Kono koto o, wakimaete iru ga yoi. Ie no shujin wa, touzoku ga itsugoro kuru ka wakatte irunara, jibun no ie ni oshiirase wa shinaide arou.
Anata gata mo youi shite i nasai. Omoigakenai toki ni hito no ko ga kurukara de aru".
Suru to Petero ga itta, "Shu yo, kono tatoe o hanashite orareru no wa watashitachi no tame na no desu ka. Sore to mo, minna no mono no tame na no desu ka".
Soko de Shu ga iwareta, "Shujin ga, meshitsukaitachi no ue ni tatete, toki ni oujite sadame no shokuji o sonaesaseru chuujitsu na shiryo bukai karei wa, ittai dare de arou.
Shujin ga kaette kita toki, sono you ni tsutomete iru no o mirareru shimobe wa, saiwai de aru.
Yoku itte okuga, shujin wa sono shimobe o tatete jibun no zenzaisan o kanri saserude arou.
Shikashi, moshi sono shimobe ga, shujin no kaeri ga osoi to kokoro no naka de omoi, danjo no meshitsukaitachi o uchitataki, soshite tabe tari, non dari shite yoi hajimerunaraba,
Sono shimobe no shujin wa omoigakenai hi, ki ga tsukanai toki ni kaette kurude arou. Soshite, kare o genbatsu ni shoshite, fuchuujitsu na monotachi to onaji me ni awaserude arou.
Shujin no kokoro o shitte inagara, sore ni shitagatte youi mo sezu tsutome mo shinakatta shimobe wa, ooku muchiutarerude arou.
Shikashi, shirazu ni utareru you na koto o shita mono wa, utarehou ga sukunaidarou. Ooku ataerareta mono kara wa ooku motomerare, ooku makaserareta mono kara wa sarani ooku youkyuu sareru no de aru.
Watashi wa, hi o chijou ni toujiru tame ni kita no da. Hi ga sudeni moete itanara to, watashi wa donna ni negatte iru koto ka.
Shikashi, watashi ni wa ukeneba naranai baputesuma ga aru. Soshite, sore o ukete shimau made wa, watashi wa donna ni ka kurushii omoi o suru koto de arou.
Anata gata wa, watashi ga heiwa o kono chijou ni motarasu tame ni kita to omotte iru no ka. Anata gata ni itte oku. Sou de wa nai. Mushiro bunretsu de aru.
To iu no wa, ima kara nochi wa, ikka no uchi de gonin ga aiwakarete, sannin wa futari ni, futari wa sannin ni tairitsu shi,
Mata chichi wa ko ni, ko wa chichi ni, haha wa musume ni, musume wa haha ni, shuutome wa yome ni, yome wa shuutome ni, tairitsu surude arou".
Iesu wa mata gunshuu ni taishite mo iwareta, "Anata gata wa, kumo ga nishi ni okoru no o miruto sugu, niwakaame ga yatte kuru, to iu. Hatashite sono toori ni naru.
Sore kara minamikaze ga fukuto, a tsukunarudarou, to iu. Hatashite sono toori ni naru.
Gizensha yo, anata gata wa tenchi no moyou o miwakeru koto o shirinagara, dou shite ima no jidai o miwakeru koto ga dekinai no ka.
Mata, anata gata wa, naze tadashii koto o jibun de handan shinai no ka.
Tatoeba, anata o uttaeru hito to issho ni yakunin no tokoro e iku toki ni wa, tochuu de sono hito to wakai suru you ni tsutomeru ga yoi. Sou shinaito, sono hito wa anata o saibankan no tokoro e hippatte iki, saibankan wa anata o gokuri ni hikiwatashi, gokuri wa anata o goku ni nagekomude arou.
Watashi wa itte oku, saigo no ichi reputa made mo shiharatte shimau made wa, kesshite soko kara dete kuru koto wa dekinai".
Choudo sono toki, aru hitobito ga kite, Pirato ga Garirayabitotachi no chi o nagashi, sore o karera no gisei no chi ni mazeta koto o, Iesu ni shiraseta.
Soko de Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Sorera no Garirayabito ga, sono you na sainan ni attakara to itte, ta no subete no Garirayabito ijou ni tsumi ga fukakatta to omou no ka.
Anata gata ni iuga, sou de wa nai. Anata gata mo kuiaratamenakereba, mina onaji you ni horobirude arou.
Mata, Shiroamu no tou ga taoreta tame ni oshikorosareta ano juu hachinin wa, Erusaremu no ta no zenjuumin ijou ni tsumi no fusai ga atta to omou ka.
Anata gata ni iuga, sou de wa nai. Anata gata mo kuiaratamenakereba, mina onaji you ni horobirude arou".
Sore kara, kono tatoe o katarareta, "Aru hito ga jibun no budouen ni ichijiku no ki o uete oita no de, mi o sagashi ni kitaga mitsukaranakatta.
Soko de entei ni itta, 'Watashi wa san nenkan mo mi o motomete, kono ichijiku no ki no tokoro ni kita no daga, imada ni miataranai. Sono ki o kiritaoshite shimae. Nan no tame ni, tochi o muda ni fusagasete oku no ka'.
Suruto entei wa kotaete itta, 'Goshujinsama, koto shimo, sono mama ni shite oite kudasai. Sono mawari o hotte hiryou o yatte mimasukara.
Sore de rainen mi ga narimashitara kekkou desu. Moshi sore de mo dame deshitara, kiritaoshite kudasai' ".
Ansokunichi ni, aru kaidou de oshiete orareruto,
Soko ni juu hachi nenkan mo byouki no rei ni tsukare, kaganda mama de, karada o nobasu koto no mattaku dekinai onna ga ita.
Iesu wa kono onna o mite, yobiyose, "Onna yo, anata no byouki wa naotta" to itte,
Te o sono ue ni okareta. Suru to tachi dokoro ni, sono karada ga massugu ni nari, soshite kami o tatae hajimeta.
Tokoro ga kaidouzukasa wa, Iesu ga ansokunichi ni byouki o iyasareta koto o ikidoori, gunshuu ni mukatte itta, "Hatarakubeki hi wa muika aru. Sono aida ni, nao shite morai ni ki nasai. Ansokunichi ni wa ikenai".
Shu wa kore ni kotaete iwareta, "Gizensha tachi yo, anata gata wa dare de mo, ansokunichi de atte mo, jibun no ushi ya roba o kachiku koya kara toite, mizu o nomase ni hikidashite yarude wa nai ka.
Sore nara, juu hachi nenkan mo Satan ni shibararete ita, Aburahamu no musume de aru kono onna o, ansokunichi de atte mo, sono sokubaku kara toite yarubekide wa nakatta ka".
Kou iwareta no de, Iesu ni hantai shite ita hitotachi wa mina hajiitta. Soshite gunshuu wa kozotte, Iesu ga nasareta subete no subarashii miwaza o mite yorokonda.
Soko de iwareta, "Kami no kuni wa nani ni nite iru ka. Mata sore o nani ni tatoeyou ka.
Ichi tsubu no karashi dane no you na mono de aru. Aru hito ga sore o totte niwa ni makuto, sodatte ki to nari, sora no tori mo sono eda ni yadoru you ni naru".
Mata iwareta, "Kami no kuni o nani ni tatoeyou ka.
Pan dane no you na mono de aru. Onna ga sore o totte san to no kona no naka ni mazeruto, zentai ga fukurande kuru".
Sate Iesu wa oshienagara machimachi muramura o toorisugi, Erusaremu e to tabi o tsuzukerareta.
Suruto, aru hito ga Iesu ni, "Shu yo, sukuwareru hito wa sukunai no desu ka" to tazuneta.
Soko de Iesu wa hitobito ni mukatte iwareta, "Semai toguchi kara wa iru you ni tsutome nasai. Jijitsu, hairou to shite mo, wa irenai hito ga ooi no dakara.
Ie no shujin ga tatte to o tojite shimatte kara, anata gata ga soto ni tachi to o tataki hajimete, 'Goshujinsama, douzo akete kudasai' to itte mo, shujin wa sore ni kotaete, 'Anata gata ga doko kara kita hito na no ka, watashi wa shiranai' to iude arou.
Sono toki, 'Watashitachi wa anata to goissho ni nomikui shimashita. Mata, anata wa watashitachi no oodoori de oshiete kudasaimashita' to ii dashite mo,
Kare wa, 'Anata gata ga doko kara kita hito na no ka, watashi wa shiranai. Akuji o hataraku monodomo yo, minna itte shimae' to iude arou.
Anata gata wa, Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu ya subete no yogensha tachi ga, kami no kuni ni haitte iru no ni, jibuntachi wa soto ni nagedasareru koto ni nareba, soko de nakisaken dari, hagami o shi tari surude arou.
Sore kara hitobito ga, higashi kara nishi kara, mata minami kara kita kara kite, kami no kuni de enkai no seki ni tsukude arou.
Kou shite ato no mono de saki ni naru mono ga ari, mata, saki no mono de ato ni naru mono mo aru".
Choudo sono toki, aru Parisaibitotachi ga, Iesu ni chikayotte kite itta, "Koko kara dete iki nasai. Herode ga anata o korosou to shite imasu".
Soko de karera ni iwareta, "Ano kitsune no tokoro e itte kou ie, 'Miyo, watashi wa kyou mo asu mo akurei o oidashi, mata, byouki o iyashi, soshite mikkame ni waza o oerude arou.
Shikashi, kyou mo asu mo, mata sono tsugi no hi mo, watashi wa susunde ikaneba naranai. Yogensha ga Erusaremu igai no chi de shinu koto wa, ari enaikara de aru'.
Aa, Erusaremu, Erusaremu, yogensha tachi o koroshi, omae ni tsukawasareta hitobito o ishi de uchikorosu mono yo. Choudo mendori ga tsubasa no shita ni hina o atsumeru you ni, watashi wa omae no kora o iku tabi atsumeyou to shita koto de arou. Sore da no ni, omaetachi wa oujiyou to shinakatta.
Miyo, omaetachi no ie wa misuterarete shimau. Watashi wa itte oku, 'Shu no na ni yotte kitaru mono ni, shukufuku are' to omaetachi ga iu toki no kuru made wa, futatabi watashi ni au koto wa naide arou".
Aru ansokunichi no koto, shokuji o suru tame ni, aru Parisaiha no kashira no ie ni haitte ikaretaga, hitobito wa Iesu no yousu o ukagatte ita.
Suruto soko ni, suishu o wazuratte iru hito ga, mimae ni ita.
Iesu wa rippougakusha ya Parisaibitotachi ni mukatte iwareta, "Ansokunichi ni hito o iyasu no wa, tadashii koto ka dou ka".
Karera wa damatte ita. Soko de Iesu wa sono hito ni te o oite iyashite yari, soshite okaeshi ni natta.
Sore kara karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata no uchi de, jibun no musuko ka ushi ga ido ni ochikondanara, ansokunichi dakara to itte, sugu ni hikiagete yaranai mono ga irudarou ka".
Karera wa kore ni taishite kaesu kotoba ga nakatta.
Kyaku ni manekareta monotachi ga jouza o erande iru yousu o goran ni natte, karera ni hitotsu no tatoe o katarareta.
"Kon en ni manekareta toki ni wa, jouza ni tsuku na. Aruiha, anata yori mo mibun no takai hito ga manekarete iru ka mo shirenai.
Sono baai, anata to sono hito to o maneita mono ga kite, 'Konokata ni za o yuzutte kudasai' to iude arou. Sono toki, anata wa hajiitte matsuza ni tsuku koto ni narude arou.
Mushiro, manekareta baai ni wa, matsuza ni itte suwari nasai. Sou sureba, maneite kureta hito ga kite, 'Tomo yo, jouza no hou e osusumi kudasai' to iude arou. Sono toki, anata wa seki o tomo ni suru minna no mae de, menboku o hodokosu koto ni narude arou.
Ooyoso, jibun o takaku suru mono wa hikuku sare, jibun o hikuku suru mono wa takaku sarerude arou".
Mata, Iesu wa jibun o maneita hito ni iwareta, "Gosan mata wa bansan no seki o moukeru baai ni wa, yuujin, kyoudai, shinzoku, kanemochi no tonaribito nado wa yobanu ga yoi. Osoraku karera mo anata o maneki kaeshi, sore de anata wa henrei o ukeru koto ni narukara.
Mushiro, enkai o moyoosu baai ni wa, binbounin, fugusha, ashi nae, moujin nado o maneku ga yoi.
Sou sureba, karera wa henrei ga dekinaikara, anata wa saiwai ni narude arou. Tadashii hitobito no fukkatsu no sai ni wa, anata wa mukuirarerude arou".
Ressekisha no hitori ga kore o kiite Iesu ni "Kami no kuni de shokuji o suru hito wa, saiwai desu" to itta.
Soko de Iesu ga iwareta, "Aru hito ga seidai na bansan kai o moyooshite, oozei no hito o maneita.
Bansan no jikoku ni natta no de, maneite oita hitotachi no moto ni shimobe o okutte, 'Saa, oide kudasai. Mou junbi ga dekimashitakara' to iwaseta.
Tokoro ga, minna ichiyou ni kotowari hajimeta. Saisho no hito wa, 'Watashi wa tochi o kaimashita no de, itte minakereba narimasen. Douzo, oyurushi kudasai' to itta.
Hoka no hito wa, 'Watashi wa go tsui no ushi o kaimashita no de, sore o shirabe ni iku tokoro desu. Douzo, oyurushi kudasai',
Mou hitori no hito wa, 'Watashi wa tsuma o metorimashita no de, mairu koto ga dekimasen' to itta.
Shimobe wa kaette kite, ijou no koto o shujin ni houkoku shita. Suru to ie no shujin wa okotte shimobe ni itta, 'Ima sugu ni, machi no oodoori ya komichi e itte, binbounin, fugusha, moujin, ashi na e nado o, koko e tsurete ki nasai'.
Shimobe wa itta, 'Goshujinsama, oose no toori ni itashimashitaga, mada seki ga gozaimasu'.
Shujin ga shimobe ni itta, 'Michi ya kakine no atari ni dete itte, kono ie ga ippai ni naru you ni, hitobito o muriyari ni hippatte ki nasai.
Anata gata ni itte okuga, manekareta hito de, watashi no bansan ni azukaru mono wa hitori mo naide arou' ".
Oozei no gunshuu ga tsuite kita no de, Iesu wa karera no hou ni muite iwareta,
"Dare de mo, chichi, haha, tsuma, ko, kyoudai, shimai, sarani jibun no inochi made mo sutete, watashi no moto ni kuru no de nakereba, watashi no deshi to naru koto wa dekinai.
Jibun no juujika o oute watashi ni tsuite kuru mono de nakereba, watashi no deshi to naru koto wa dekinai.
Anata gata no uchi de, dare ka ga teitaku o tateyou to omounara, sore o shiageru no ni tariru dake no kane o motte iru ka dou ka o miru tame, mazu, suwatte sono hiyou o keisan shinaidarou ka.
Sou shinaito, dodai o sueta dake de kansei suru koto ga dekizu, mite iru minna no hito ga,
'Ano hito wa tate kaketaga, shiage ga dekinakatta' to itte azawarau you ni narou.
Mata, donna ou de mo, hoka no ou to tatakai o majieru tame ni dete iku baai ni wa, mazu zashite, kochira no ichi mannin o motte, ni mannin o hikiite mukatte kuru teki ni taikou dekiru ka dou ka, kangaete minaidarou ka.
Moshi jibun no chikara ni amareba, teki ga mada tooku ni iru uchi ni, shisha o okutte, wa o motomerude arou.
Sore to onaji you ni, anata gata no uchi de, jibun no zaisan o kotogotoku sute kiru mono de nakute wa, watashi no deshi to naru koto wa dekinai.
Shio wa yoi mono da. Shikashi, shio mo kikime ga nakunattara, nani ni yotte shioaji ga torimodosareyou ka.
Tsuchi ni mo hiryou ni mo yakutatazu, soto ni nagesuterarete shimau. Kiku mimi no aru mono wa kiku ga yoi".
Sate, shuzeinin ya tsumibitotachi ga mina, Iesu no hanashi o kikou to shite chikayotte kita.
Suruto Parisaibito ya rippougakusha tachi ga tsubuyaite, "Kono hito wa tsumibitotachi o mukaete issho ni shokuji o shite iru" to itta.
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni, kono tatoe o ohanashi ni natta,
"Anata gata no uchi ni, hyakupiki no hitsuji o motte iru mono ga ita to suru. Sono ichipiki ga inaku nattara, kyuujuu kyuuhiki o nohara ni nokoshite oite, inaku natta ichipiki o mitsukeru made wa sagashiarukanaide arou ka.
Soshite mitsuketara, yorokonde sore o jibun no kata ni nose,
Ie ni kaette kite yuujin ya tonaribito o yobiatsume, 'Watashi to issho ni yorokonde kudasai. Inaku natta hitsuji o mitsukemashitakara' to iude arou.
Yoku kiki nasai. Sore to onaji you ni, tsumibito ga hitori de mo kuiaratamerunara, kuiaratame o hitsuyou to shinai kyuujuu kyuunin no tadashii hito no tame ni mo masaru ookii yorokobi ga, ten ni arude arou.
Mata, aru onna ga ginka juumai o motte ite, moshi sono ichimai o nakushita to sureba, kanojo wa akari o tsukete iejuu o haki, sore o mitsukeru made wa chuuibuka ku sagasanaide arou ka.
Soshite, mitsuketanara, onna tomodachi ya kinjo no onnatachi o yobiatsumete, 'Watashi to issho ni yorokonde kudasai. Nakushita ginka ga mitsukarimashitakara' to iude arou.
Yoku kiki nasai. Sore to onaji you ni, tsumibito ga hitori de mo kuiaratamerunara, kami no mitsukai tachi no mae de yorokobi ga arude arou".
Mata iwareta, "Aru hito ni, futari no musuko ga atta.
Tokoro ga, otouto ga chichioya ni itta, 'Chichi yo, anata no zaisan no uchi de watashi ga itadaku bun o kudasai'. Soko de, chichi wa sono shindai o futari ni wakete yatta.
Sore kara ikunichi mo tatanai uchi ni, otouto wa jibun no mono o zenbu torimatomete tooi tokoro e iki, soko de houtou ni mi o mochikuzushite zaisan o tsukai hatashita.
Nani mo ka mo rouhi shite shimatta nochi, sono chihou ni hidoi kikin ga atta no de, kare wa taberu koto ni mo kyuushi hajimeta.
Soko de, sono chihou no aru juumin no tokoro ni itte mi o yoseta tokoro ga, sono hito wa kare o hatake ni yatte buta o kawaseta.
Kare wa, buta no taberu inago mame de hara o mitashitai to omou hodo de attaga, nani mo kureru hito wa nakatta.
Soko de kare wa honshin ni tachikaette itta, 'Chichi no tokoro ni wa shokumotsu no ariamatte iru yatoinin ga oozei iru no ni, watashi wa koko de uete shinou to shite iru.
Tatte, chichi no tokoro e kaette, kou iou, chichi yo, watashi wa ten ni taishite mo, anata ni mukatte mo, tsumi o okashimashita.
Mou, anata no musuko to yobareru shikaku wa arimasen. Douzo, yatoinin no hitori douyou ni shite kudasai'.
Soko de tatte, chichi no tokoro e dekaketa. Mada tooku hanarete ita no ni, chichi wa kare o mitome, aware ni omotte hashiriyori, sono kubi o daite seppun shita.
Musuko wa chichi ni itta, 'Chichi yo, watashi wa ten ni taishite mo, anata ni mukatte mo, tsumi o okashimashita. Mou anata no musuko to yobareru shikaku wa arimasen'.
Shikashi chichi wa shimobetachi ni iitsuketa, 'Saa, hayaku, saijou no kimono o dashite kite kono ko ni kise, yubiwa o te ni hame, hakimono o ashi ni hakase nasai.
Mata, koeta koushi o hiite kite hofuri nasai. Tabete tanoshimoude wa nai ka.
Kono musuko ga shinde ita no ni ikikaeri, inaku natte ita no ni mitsukatta no dakara'. Sore kara shukuen ga hajimatta.
Tokoro ga, ani wa hatake ni itaga, kaette kite ie ni chikazukuto, ongaku ya odori no oto ga kikoeta no de,
Hitori no shimobe o yonde, 'Ittai, kore wa nanigoto na no ka' to tazuneta.
Shimobe wa kotaeta, 'Anata no gokyoudai ga okaeri ni narimashita. Buji ni mukaeta to iu no de, chichiue ga koeta koushi o hofurase nasatta no desu'.
Ani wa okotte ie ni hairou to shinakatta no de, chichi ga dete kite nadameruto,
Ani wa chichi ni mukatte itta, 'Watashi wa nan ka nen mo anata ni tsukaete, ichi do de mo anata no iitsuke ni somuita koto wa nakatta no ni, tomodachi to tanoshimu tame ni koyagi ichipiki mo kudasatta koto wa arimasen.
Sore da no ni, yuujodomo to issho ni natte, anata no shindai o kuitsubushita kono anata no ko ga kaette kuruto, sono tame ni koeta koushi o hofuri nasaimashita'.
Suru to chichi wa itta, 'Ko yo, anata wa itsu mo watashi to issho ni irushi, mata watashi no mono wa zenbu anata no mono da.
Shikashi, kono anata no otouto wa, shinde ita no ni ikikaeri, inaku natte ita no ni mitsukatta no dakara, yorokobiiwau no wa atarimae de aru' ".
Iesu wa mata, deshitachi ni iwareta, "Aru kanemochi no tokoro ni hitori no karei ga itaga, kare wa shujin no zaisan o rouhi shite iruto, tsugeguchi o suru mono ga atta.
Soko de shujin wa kare o yonde itta, 'Anata ni tsuite kiite iru koto ga aruga, are wa dou na no ka. Anata no kaikei houkoku o dashi nasai. Mou karei o sasete oku wake ni wa ikanaikara'.
Kono karei wa kokoro no naka de omotta, 'Dou shiyou ka. Shujin ga watashi no shoku o toriageyou to shite iru. Tsuchi o horu ni wa chikara ga naishi, monogoi suru no wa hazukashii.
Sou da, wakatta. Kou shite okeba, shoku o yamesaserareru baai, hitobito ga watashi o sono ie ni mukaete kurerudarou'.
Sore kara kare wa, shujin no fusaisha o hitoribitori yobidashite, hajime no hito ni, 'Anata wa, watashi no shujin ni dore dake fusai ga arimasu ka' to tazuneta.
'Abura hyaku taru desu' to kotaeta. Soko de karei ga itta, 'Koko ni anata no shousho ga aru. Sugu soko ni suwatte, gojuu taru to kaki kae nasai'.
Tsugi ni, mou hitori ni, 'Anata no fusai wa dore dake desu ka' to tazuneruto, 'Mugi momoishi desu' to kotaeta. Kore ni taishite, 'Koko ni, anata no shousho ga aruga, hachijuu koku to kaki kae nasai' to itta.
Tokoro ga shujin wa, kono fusei na karei no rikou na yarihou o hometa. Konoyo no kora wa sono jidai ni taishite wa, hikari no kora yori mo rikou de aru.
Mata anata gata ni iuga, fusei no tomi o mochiite de mo, jibun no tame ni tomodachi o tsukuru ga yoi. Sou sureba, tomi ga nakunatta baai, anatagata o eien no sumai ni mukaete kurerude arou.
Shouji ni chuujitsu na hito wa, daiji ni mo chuujitsu de aru. Soshite, shouji ni fuchuujitsu na hito wa daiji ni mo fuchuujitsu de aru.
Dakara, moshi anata gata ga fusei no tomi ni tsuite chuujitsu de nakattara, dare ga shin no tomi o makaserudarou ka.
Mata, moshi hoka no hito no mono ni tsuite chuujitsu de nakattara, dare ga anata gata no mono o ataete kureyou ka.
Dono shimobe de mo, futari no shujin ni kanetsukaeru koto wa dekinai. Ippou o nikunde tahou o aishi, aruiha, ippou ni shitashinde tahou o utonjirukara de aru. Anata gata wa, kami to tomi to ni kanetsukaeru koto wa dekinai".
Yoku no fukai Parisaibitotachi ga, subete korera no kotoba o kiite, Iesu o azawaratta.
Soko de karera ni mukatte iwareta, "Anata gata wa, hitobito no mae de jibun o tadashii to suru hitotachi de aru. Shikashi, kami wa anata gata no kokoro o gozonjide aru. Hitobito no aida de tattobareru mono wa, kami no mimae de wa imikirawareru.
Rippou to yogensha to wa Yohane no toki made no mono de aru. Sore irai, kami no kuni ga nobetsutaerare, hitobito wa mina kore ni totsunyuu shite iru.
Shikashi, rippou no ikkaku ga ochiru yori wa, tenchi no horobiru hou ga, motto tayasui.
Subete jibun no tsuma o dashite ta no onna o metoru mono wa, kan'in o okonau mono de ari, mata, otto kara dasareta onna o metoru mono mo, kan'in o okonau mono de aru.
Aru kanemochi ga ita. Kare wa murasaki no koromo ya hosonuno o kite, mainichi zeitaku ni asobikurashite ita.
Tokoro ga, Razaro to iu binbounin ga zenshin deki mono de oowarete, kono kanemochi no genkan no mae ni suwari,
Sono shokutaku kara ochiru mono de ue o shinogou to nozonde ita. Sono ue, inu ga kite kare no deki mono o namete ita.
Kono binbounin ga tsuini shini, mitsukai tachi ni tsurerarete Aburahamu no futokoro ni okurareta. Kanemochi mo shinde houmurareta.
Soshite yomi ni ite kurushiminagara, me o ageruto, Aburahamu to sono futokoro ni iru Razaro to ga, haruka ni mieta.
Soko de koe o agete itta, 'Chichi, Aburahamu yo, watashi o awarende kudasai. Razaro o otsukawashi ni natte, sono yubisaki o mizu de nurashi, watashi no shita o hiyasasete kudasai. Watashi wa kono kaen no naka de kurushimimodaete imasu'.
Aburahamu ga itta, 'Ko yo, omoidasu ga yoi. Anata wa seizen yoi mono o uke, Razaro no hou wa warui mono o uketa. Shikashi ima koko de wa, kare wa nagusamerare, anata wa kurushimimodaete iru.
Sore bakari ka, watashitachi to anata gata to no aida ni wa ookina fuchi ga oite atte, kochira kara anata gata no hou e watarou to omotte mo dekinaishi, sochira kara watashitachi no hou e koete kuru koto mo dekinai'.
Soko de kanemochi ga itta, 'Chichi yo, de wa onegai shimasu. Watashi no chichi no ie e Razaro o tsukawashite kudasai.
Watashi ni gonin no kyoudai ga imasu no de, konna kurushii tokoro e kuru koto ga nai you ni, karera ni keikoku shite itadakitai no desu'.
Aburahamu wa itta, 'Karera ni wa Moose to yogensha to ga aru. Sore ni kikuga yokarou'.
Kanemochi ga itta, 'Ie ie, chichi Aburahamu yo, moshi shinin no naka kara dare ka ga kyoudaitachi no tokoro e itte kuremashitara, karera wa kuiaratamerudeshou'.
Aburahamu wa itta, 'Moshi karera ga Moose to yogensha to ni mimi o katamukenainara, shinin no naka kara yomigaette kuru mono ga atte mo, karera wa sono susume o kikiire wa shinaide arou' ".
Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Tsumi no yuuwaku ga kuru koto wa sakerarenai. Shikashi, sore o kitaraseru mono wa, wazawai de aru.
Korera no chiisai mono no hitori o tsumi ni yuuwaku suru yori wa, mushiro, hikiusu o kubi ni kakerarete umi ni nageirerareta hou ga, mashi de aru.
Anata gata wa, jibun de chuui shite i nasai. Moshi anata no kyoudai ga tsumi o okasunara, kare o isame nasai. Soshite kuiaratametara, yurushite yari nasai.
Moshi anata ni taishite ichi nichi ni shichi dotsumi o okashi, soshite nana do 'Kuiaratamemasu' to itte anata no tokoro e kaette kureba, yurushite yaru ga yoi".
Shitotachi wa Shu ni "Watashitachi no shinkou o mashite kudasai" to itta.
Soko de Shu ga iwareta, "Moshi, karashi dane ichi tsubu hodo no shinkou ga arunara, kono kuwa no ki ni, 'Nukedashite umi ni uware' to itta to shite mo, sono kotoba doori ni narude arou.
Anata gata no uchi no dare ka ni, kousaku ka bokuchiku ka o suru shimobe ga aru to suru. Sono shimobe ga hatake kara kaette kita toki, kare ni 'Sugu kite, shokutaku ni tsuki nasai' to iudarou ka.
Kaette, 'Yuushoku no youi o shite kure. Soshite watashi ga nomikui o suru aida, obi o shimete kyuuji o shi nasai. Sono ato de, nomikui o suru ga yoi' to, iude wa nai ka.
Shimobe ga meijirareta koto o shitakara to itte, shujin wa kare ni kansha surudarou ka.
Douyou ni anata gata mo, meijirareta koto o mina shite shimatta toki, 'Watashitachi wa futsutsuka na shimobe desu. Subeki koto o shita ni sugimasen' to ii nasai".
Iesu wa Erusaremu e ikareru toki, Samariya to Gariraya to no aida o toorareta.
Soshite, aru mura ni wa irareruto, juunin no raibyounin ni deawaretaga, karera wa tooku no hou de tachi todomari,
Koe o hariagete, "Iesusama, watashitachi o awarende kudasai" to itta.
Iesu wa karera o goran ni natte, "Saishitachi no tokoro ni itte, karada o mise nasai" to iwareta. Soshite, iku tochuu de karera wa kiyomerareta.
Sono uchi no hitori wa, jibun ga iyasareta koto o shiri, oogoe de kami o hometataenagara kaette kite,
Iesu no ashimoto ni hirefushite kansha shita. Kore wa Samariyabito de atta.
Iesu wa kare ni mukatte iwareta, "Kiyomerareta no wa, juunin de wa nakatta ka. Hoka no kyuunin wa, doko ni iru no ka.
Kami o hometataeru tame ni kaette kita mono wa, kono takokujin no hoka ni wa inai no ka".
Sore kara, sono hito ni iwareta, "Tatte iki nasai. Anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta no da".
Kami no kuni wa itsu kuru no ka to, Parisaibito ga tazuneta no de, Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Kami no kuni wa, mirareru katachi de kuru mono de wa nai.
Mata 'Miyo, koko ni aru' 'Asoko ni aru' nado to mo ienai. Kami no kuni wa, jitsu ni anata gata no tadanaka ni aru no da".
Sore kara deshitachi ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, hito no ko no hi o tsuitachi de mo mitai to negatte mo miru koto ga dekinai toki ga kurude arou.
Hitobito wa anata gata ni, 'Miyo, asoko ni' 'Miyo, koko ni' to iudarou. Shikashi, sochira e iku na, karera no ato o ou na.
Inazuma ga ten no hashi kara hikari dete ten no hashi e to hirameki wataru you ni, hito no ko mo sono hi ni wa onaji you de arudarou.
Shikashi, kare wa mazu ooku no kurushimi o uke, mata kono jidai no hitobito ni suterareneba naranai.
Soshite, Noa no toki ni atta you ni, hito no ko no toki ni mo douyou na koto ga okorude arou.
Noa ga hakobune ni wa iru hi made, hitobito wa kui, nomi, metori, to tsugi nado shite itaga, soko e kouzui ga osotte kite, karera o kotogotoku horoboshita.
Roto no toki ni mo onaji you na koto ga okotta. Hitobito wa kui, nomi, kai, uri, ue, tate nado shite itaga,
Roto ga Sodomu kara dete itta hi ni, ten kara hi to iou to ga futte kite, karera o kotogotoku horoboshita.
Hito no ko ga arawareru hi mo, choudo sore to douyou de arou.
Sono hi ni wa, okujou ni iru mono wa, jibun no mochimono ga ie no naka ni atte mo, tori ni oriru na. Hatake ni iru mono mo onaji you ni, ato e modoru na.
Roto no tsuma no koto o omoidashi nasai.
Jibun no inochi o sukuou to suru mono wa, sore o ushinai, sore o ushinau mono wa, tamotsu no de aru.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Sono yo, futari no otoko ga hitotsu nedoko ni irunaraba, hitori wa torisarare, ta no hitori wa nokosarerude arou.
Futari no onna ga issho ni usu o hiite irunaraba, hitori wa torisarare, ta no hitori wa nokosarerude arou. []
Futari no otoko ga hatake ni oreba, hitori wa torisarare, ta no hitori wa nokosarerude arou]".
Deshitachi wa "Shu yo, sore wa doko de aru no desu ka" to tazuneta. Suru to Iesu wa iwareta, "Shitai no aru tokoro ni wa, mata hagetaka ga atsumaru mono de aru".
Mata, Iesu wa shitsubou sezu ni tsune ni inorubeki koto o, hitobito ni tatoe de oshierareta.
"Aru machi ni, kami o osorezu, hito o hito to mo omowanu saibankan ga ita.
Tokoro ga, sono onaji machi ni hitori no yamome ga ite, kare no moto ni tabitabi kite, 'Douzo, watashi o uttaeru mono o sabaite, watashi o mamotte kudasai' to negai tsuzuketa.
Kare wa shibaraku no aida kikiirenaide itaga, sono nochi, kokoro no uchi de kangaeta, 'Watashi wa kami o mo osorezu, hito o hito to mo omowanaiga,
Kono yamome ga watashi ni mendou o kakerukara, kanojo no tame ni naru saiban o shite yarou. Sou shitara, taezu yatte kite watashi o nayamasu koto ga nakunarudarou' ".
Soko de Shu wa iwareta, "Kono fugi na saibankan no itte iru koto o kiita ka.
Mashite kami wa, nichiya sakebi motomeru senmin no tame ni, tadashii sabaki o shite kudasarazu ni nagai aida sono mama ni shite okareru koto ga arou ka.
Anata gata ni itte okuga, kami wa sumiyaka ni sabaite kudasarude arou. Shikashi, hito no ko ga kuru toki, chijou ni shinkou ga mirarerude arou ka".
Jibun o gijin da to jinin shite tanin o misagete iru hitotachi ni taishite, Iesu wa mata kono tatoe o ohanashi ni natta.
"Futari no hito ga inoru tame ni miya ni nobotta. Sono hitori wa Parisaibito de ari, mou hitori wa shuzeinin de atta.
Parisaibito wa tatte, hitori de kou inotta, 'Kami yo, watashi wa hoka no hitotachi no you na don'yoku na mono, fusei na mono, kan'in o suru mono de wa naku, mata, kono shuzeinin no you na ningen de mo nai koto o kansha shimasu.
Watashi wa ichi shuu ni ni do danjiki shite ori, zenshuunyuu no juubun no ichi o sasagete imasu'.
Tokoro ga, shuzeinin wa tooku hanarete tachi, me o ten ni mukeyou to mo shinaide, mune o uchinagara itta, 'Kamisama, tsumibito no watashi o oyurushi kudasai' to.
Anata gata ni itte oku. Kami ni gi to sarete jibun no ie ni kaetta no wa, kono shuzeinin de atte, ano Parisaibito de wa nakatta. Ooyoso, jibun o takaku suru mono wa hikuku sare, jibun o hikuku suru mono wa takaku sarerude arou".
Iesu ni sawatte itadaku tame ni, hitobito ga osanagora o mimoto ni tsurete kita. Tokoro ga, deshitachi wa sore o mite, karera o tashinameta.
Suru to Iesu wa osanagora o yobiyosete iwareta, "Osanagora o watashi no tokoro ni kuru mama ni shite oki nasai, tomete wa naranai. Kami no kuni wa kono you na mono no kuni de aru.
Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Dare de mo osanago no you ni kami no kuni o ukeireru mono de nakereba, soko ni hairu koto wa kesshite dekinai".
Mata, aru yakunin ga Iesu ni tazuneta, "Yoki shi yo, nani o shitara eien no seimei ga ukeraremashou ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Naze watashi o yoki mono to iu no ka. Kami hitori no hoka ni yoi mono wa inai.
Imashime wa anata no shitte iru toori de aru, 'Kan'in suru na, korosu na, nusumu na, gishou o tateru na, chichi to haha to o uyamae' ".
Suruto kare wa itta, "Sorera no koto wa mina, chiisai toki kara mamotte orimasu".
Iesu wa kore o kiite iwareta, "Anata no suru koto ga mada hitotsu nokotte iru. Motte iru mono o mina uriharatte, mazushii hitobito ni wakete yari nasai. Sou sureba, ten ni takara o motsu you ni narou. Soshite, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai".
Kare wa kono kotoba o kiite hijou ni kanashinda. Ooganemochi de attakara de aru.
Iesu wa kare no yousu o mite iwareta, "Zaisan no aru mono ga kami no kuni ni wa iru no wa nan to muzukashii koto de arou.
Tonde iru mono ga kami no kuni ni wa iru yori wa, rakuda ga hari no ana o tooru hou ga, motto yasashii".
Kore o kiita hitobito ga, "Sore de wa, dare ga sukuwareru koto ga dekiru no desu ka" to tazuneruto,
Iesu wa iwareta, "Hito ni wa dekinai koto mo, kami ni wa dekiru".
Petero ga itta, "Goran nasai, watashitachi wa jibun no mono o sutete, anata ni shitagaimashita".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yoku kiite oku ga yoi. Dare de mo kami no kuni no tame ni, ie, tsuma, kyoudai, ryoushin, ko o suteta mono wa,
Kanarazu kono jidai de wa sono iku bai mo o uke, mata, kitarubeki yo de wa eien no seimei o ukeru no de aru".
Iesu wa juu ni deshi o yobiyosete iwareta, "Miyo, watashitachi wa Erusaremu e nobotte ikuga, hito no ko ni tsuite yogensha tachi ga shirushita koto wa, subete jouju surude arou.
Hito no ko wa ihoujin ni hikiwatasare, azakerare, hazukashime o uke, tsubaki o kakerare,
Mata, muchiutarete kara, tsuini korosare, soshite mikkame ni yomigaerude arou".
Deshitachi ni wa, korera no koto ga nanihito tsu wakaranakatta. Kono kotoba ga karera ni kakusarete ita no de, Iesu no iwareta koto ga rikai dekinakatta.
Iesu ga Eriko ni chikazukareta toki, aru moujin ga michibata ni suwatte, monogoi o shite ita.
Gunshuu ga toorisugiru oto o mimi ni shite, kare wa nanigoto ga aru no ka to tazuneta.
Tokoro ga, Nazare no Iesu ga otoori na no da to kikasareta no de,
Koe o agete, "Dabide no ko Iesu yo, watashi o awarende kudasai" to itta.
Sentou ni tatsu hitobito ga kare o shikatte damaraseyou to shitaga, kare wa masumasu hageshiku sakebi tsuzuketa, "Dabide no ko yo, watashi o awarende kudasai".
Soko de Iesu wa tachidomatte, sono mono o tsurete kuru you ni, to omeiji ni natta. Kare ga chikazuita toki,
"Watashi ni nani o shite hoshii no ka" to otazune ni naruto, "Shu yo, mieru you ni naru koto desu" to kotaeta.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Mieru you ni nare. Anata no shinkou ga anata o sukutta".
Suruto kare wa, tachimachi mieru you ni natta. Soshite kami o agamenagara Iesu ni shitagatte itta. Kore o mite, hitobito wa mina kami osan bi shita.
Sate, Iesu wa Eriko ni haitte, sono machi o otoori ni natta.
Tokoro ga, soko ni Zaakai to iu na no hito ga ita. Kono hito wa shuzeinin no kashira de, kanemochi de atta.
Kare wa, Iesu ga donna hito ka mitai to omotte itaga, se ga hikukatta no de, gunshuu ni saegirarete miru koto ga dekinakatta.
Sore de Iesu o miru tame ni, mae no hou ni hashitte itte, ichijiku kuwa no ki ni nobotta. Soko o toorareru tokoro dattakara de aru.
Iesu wa, sono basho ni korareta toki, ue o miagete iwareta, "Zaakai yo, isoide kudarite ki nasai. Kyou, anata no ie ni tomaru koto ni shite irukara".
Soko de Zaakai wa isoide orite kite, yorokonde Iesu o mukaeireta.
Hitobito wa mina, kore o mite tsubuyaki, "Kare wa tsumibito no ie ni haitte kyaku to natta" to itta.
Zaakai wa tatte Shu ni itta, "Shu yo, watashi wa chikatte jibun no zaisan no hanbun o hinmin ni hodokoshimasu. Mata, moshi dare ka kara fusei na toritate o shite imashitara, sore o yon bai ni shite kaeshimasu".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Kyou, sukui ga kono ie ni kita. Kono hito mo Aburahamu no ko na no dakara.
Hito no ko ga kita no wa, ushinawareta mono o tazunedashite sukuu tame de aru".
Hitobito ga korera no kotoba o kiite iru toki ni, Iesu wa nao hitotsu no tatoe o ohanashi ni natta. Sore wa Erusaremu ni chikazuite koraretashi, mata hitobito ga kami no kuni wa tachimachi arawareru to omotte ita tame de aru.
Sore de iwareta, "Aru mibun no takai hito ga, oui o ukete kaette kuru tame ni tooi tokoro e tabidatsu koto ni natta.
Soko de juunin no shimobe o yobi juu mina o watashite itta, 'Watashi ga kaette kuru made, kore de shoubai o shi nasai'.
Tokoro ga, hongoku no juumin wa kare o nikunde ita no de, ato kara shisha o okutte, 'Kono hito ga ou ni naru no o wareware wa nozonde inai' to iwaseta.
Sate, kare ga oui o ukete kaette kita toki, dare ga donna mouke o shita ka o shirou to shite, kane o watashite oita shimobetachi o yonde kosaseta.
Saisho no mono ga susumidete itta, 'Goshujinsama, anata no ichi mina de juu mina o moukemashita'.
Shujin wa itta, 'Yoi shimobe yo, umaku yatta. Anata wa chiisai koto ni chuujitsu de attakara, juu no machi o shihai saseru'.
Tsugi no mono ga kite itta, 'Goshujinsama, anata no ichi mina de go mina o tsukurimashita'.
Soko de kono mono ni mo, 'De wa, anata wa itsutsu no machi no kashira ni nare' to itta.
Sore kara, mou hitori no mono ga kite itta, 'Goshujinsama, saa, koko ni anata no ichi mina ga arimasu. Watashi wa sore o fukusa ni tsutsunde, shimatte okimashita.
Anata wa kibishii hou de, oazuke ni naranakatta mono o toritate, omaki ni naranakatta mono o karu hito na no de, osoroshikatta no desu'.
Kare ni itta, 'Warui shimobe yo, watashi wa anata no itta sono kotoba de anata o sabakou. Watashi ga kibishikute, azukenakatta mono o toritate, makanakatta mono o karu ningen dato, shitte iru no ka.
De wa, naze watashi no kane o ginkou ni irenakatta no ka. Sou sureba, watashi ga kaette kita toki, sono kane o rishi to issho ni hikidashitade arou ni'.
Soshite, soba ni tatte ita hitobito ni, 'Sono ichi mina o kare kara toriagete, juu mina o motte iru mono ni atae nasai' to itta.
Karera wa itta, 'Goshujinsama, ano hito wa sudeni juu mina o motte imasu'.
'Anata gata ni iuga, ooyoso motte iru hito ni wa, nao ataerare, motte inai hito kara wa, motte iru mono made mo toriagerarerude arou.
Shikashi watashi ga ou ni naru koto o konomanakatta ano tekidomo o, koko ni hippatte kite, watashi no mae de uchikorose' ".
Iesu wa korera no koto o itta nochi, sentou ni tachi, Erusaremu e nobotte ikareta.
Soshite oribu to iu yama ni sotta Betepage to Betaniya ni chikazukareta toki, futari no deshi o tsukawashite iwareta,
"Mukou no mura e iki nasai. Soko ni haittara, mada dare mo notta koto no nai roba no ko ga tsunaide aru no o mirude arou. Sore o toite, hiite ki nasai.
Moshi dare ka ga 'Naze toku no ka' to toutara, 'Shu ga oiriyou na no desu' to, sou ii nasai".
Soko de, tsukawasareta monotachi ga itte miruto, hatashite, iwareta toori de atta.
Karera ga, sono roba no ko o toite iruto, sono mochinushitachi ga, "Naze roba no ko o toku no ka" to itta no de,
"Shu ga oiriyou na no desu" to kotaeta.
Soshite sore o Iesu no tokoro ni hiite kite, sono ko roba no ue ni jibuntachi no uwagi o kakete Iesu o onose shita.
Soshite susunde ikareruto, hitobito wa jibuntachi no uwagi o michi ni shiita.
Iyoiyo oribuyama no kudarimichi atari ni chikazukareruto, oozei no deshitachi wa mina yorokonde, karera ga mita subete no chikara aru miwaza ni tsuite, koe takaraka ni kami osan bi shite ii hajimeta,
"Shu no mina ni yotte kitaru ou ni, shukufuku are. Ten ni wa heiwa, ito takaki tokoro ni wa eikou are".
Tokoro ga, gunshuu no naka ni ita aru Parisaibitotachi ga Iesu ni itta, "Sensei, anata no deshitachi o oshikari kudasai".
Kotaete iwareta, "Anata gata ni iuga, moshi kono hitotachi ga damareba, ishi ga sakebude arou".
Iyoiyo miyako no chikaku ni kite, sore ga mieta toki, sono tame ni naite iwareta,
"Moshi omae mo, kono hi ni, heiwa o motarasu michi o shitte sae itara...... Shikashi, sore wa ima omae no me ni kakusarete iru.
Itsu ka wa, teki ga shuui ni rui o kizuki, omae o torikakonde, shihou kara oshisemari,
Omae to sono uchi ni iru kora to o chi ni uchitaoshi, jounai no hitotsu no ishi mo ta no ishi no ue ni nokoshite okanai hi ga kurude arou. Sore wa, omae ga kami no otozure no toki o shiranaide itakara de aru".
Sore kara miya ni hairi, shoubainin tachi o oidashi hajimete,
Karera ni iwareta, " 'Wagaya wa inori no ie de arubekida' to kaite aru no ni, anata gata wa sore o touzoku no su ni shite shimatta".
Iesu wa mainichi, miya de oshiete orareta. Saishichou, rippougakusha mata minshuu no omodatta monotachi wa Iesu o korosou to omotte itaga,
Minshuu ga mina nesshin ni Iesu ni mimi o katamukete ita no de, te no kudashiyou ga nakatta.
Aru hi, Iesu ga miya de hitobito ni oshie, fukuin o nobete orareruto, saishichou ya rippougakusha tachi ga, chouroutachi to tomo ni chikayotte kite,
Iesu ni itta, "Nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no desu ka. Sou suru ken'i o anata ni ataeta no wa dare desu ka, watashitachi ni itte kudasai".
Soko de, Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Watashi mo, hitokoto tazuneyou. Sore ni kotaete hoshii.
Yohane no baputesuma wa, ten kara de atta ka, hito kara de atta ka".
Karera wa tagai ni ronjite itta, "Moshi ten kara da to ieba, de wa, naze kare o shinjinakatta no ka, to Iesu wa iudarou.
Shikashi, moshi hito kara da to ieba, minshuu wa mina, Yohane o yogensha da to shinjite irukara, watashitachi o ishi de utsudarou".
Sore de karera wa "Doko kara ka, shirimasen" to kotaeta.
Iesu wa kore ni taishite iwareta, "Watashi mo nani no ken'i ni yotte korera no koto o suru no ka, anata gata ni iumai".
Soko de Iesu wa tsugi no tatoe o minshuu ni katari dasareta, "Aru hito ga budouen o tsukutte noufutachi ni kashi, nagai tabi ni deta.
Kisetsu ni natta no de, noufutachi no tokoro e, hitori no shimobe o okutte, budouen no shuukaku no wakemae o dasaseyou to shita. Tokoro ga, noufutachi wa, sono shimobe o fukurodataki ni shi, kara te de kaeraseta.
Soko de kare wa mou hitori no shimobe o okutta. Karera wa sono shimobe mo fukurodataki ni shi, bujoku o kuwaete, kara te de kaeraseta.
Soko de sarani sanninme no mono o okuttaga, karera wa kono mono mo, kizu o owasete oidashita.
Budouen no shujin wa itta, 'Dou shiyou ka. Sou da, watashi no aishi o tsukawasou. Kore nara, tabun uyamatte kurerudarou'.
Tokoro ga, noufutachi wa kare o miruto, 'Are wa ato tori da. Are o koroshite shimaou. Sou shitara, sono zaisan wa wareware no mono ni naru no da' to tagai ni hanashiai,
Kare o budouen no soto ni oidashite koroshita. Sono sai, budouen no shujin wa, karera o dou surudarou ka.
Kare wa dete kite, kono noufutachi o koroshi, budouen o ta no hitobito ni ataerude arou". Hitobito wa kore o kiite, "Sonna koto ga atte wa narimasen" to itta.
Soko de, Iesu wa karera o mitsumete iwareta, "Sore de wa, 'Ietsukurira no suteta ishi ga sumi no kashira ishi ni natta' to kaite aru no wa, dou iu koto ka.
Subete sono ishi no ue ni ochiru mono wa uchikudakare, sore ga dare ka no ue ni ochikakarunara, sono hito wa kona mijin ni sarerude arou".
Kono toki, rippougakusha tachi ya saishichou tachi wa Iesu ni te o kakeyou to omottaga, minshuu o osoreta. Ima no tatoe ga jibuntachi ni atete katarareta no dato, satottakara de aru.
Soko de, karera wa kikai o ukagai, gijin o yosoou mawashimonodomo o okutte, Iesu o soutoku no shihai to ken'i to ni hikiwatasu tame, sono kotobajiri o toraesaseyou to shita.
Karera wa tazunete itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa, anata no katari oshierareru koto ga tadashiku, mata, anata wa wakehedate o nasarazu, shinri ni motozuite kami no michi o oshiete orareru koto o, shouchi shite imasu.
Tokoro de, Kaizaru ni mitsugi o osamete yoideshou ka, ikenaideshou ka".
Iesu wa karera no warudakumi o miyabutte iwareta,
"Denari o mise nasai. Sore ni aru no wa, dare no shouzou, dare no kigou na no ka". "Kaizaru no desu" to, karera ga kotaeta.
Suru to Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Sore nara, Kaizaru no mono wa Kaizaru ni, kami no mono wa kami ni kaeshi nasai".
Soko de karera wa, minshuu no mae de Iesu no kotobajiri o toraeru koto ga dekizu, sono kotae ni kyoutan shite, damatte shimatta.
Fukkatsu to iu koto wa nai to iihatte ita Sadokaibito no aru monotachi ga, Iesu ni chikayotte kite shitsumon shita,
"Sensei, Moose wa, watashitachi no tame ni kou kaite imasu, 'Moshi aru hito no ani ga tsuma o metori, ko ga nakute shindanara, otouto wa kono onna o metotte, ani no tame ni ko o moukeneba naranai'.
Tokoro de, koko ni shichinin no kyoudai ga imashita. Chounan wa tsuma o metorimashitaga, ko ga nakute shini,
Soshite jinan, sannan to, tsugitsugi ni, sono onna o metori,
Shichinintomo douyou ni, ko o moukezu ni shinimashita.
Nochi ni, sono onna mo shinimashita.
Sate, fukkatsu no toki ni wa, kono onna wa nananin no uchi, dare no tsuma ni naru no desu ka. Nananin to mo kanojo o tsuma ni shita no desuga".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Konoyo no kora wa, metot tari, to tsui dari suruga,
Kano yo ni haitte shinin kara no fukkatsu ni azukaru ni fusawashii monotachi wa, metot tari, to tsui dari suru koto wa nai.
Karera wa tenshi ni hitoshii mono de ari, mata fukkatsu ni azukaru yue ni, kami no ko de mo aru no de, mou shinu koto wa ari enaikara de aru.
Shinin ga yomigaeru koto wa, Moose mo shiba no hen de, Shu o 'Aburahamu no kami, Isaku no kami, Yakobu no kami' to yonde, kore o shimeshita.
Kami wa shinda mono no kami de wa naku, ikite iru mono no kami de aru. Hito wa mina kami ni ikiru mono dakara de aru".
Rippougakusha no uchi no aru hitobito ga kotaete itta, "Sensei, oose no toori desu".
Karera wa sore ijou nani mo aete toikakeyou to shinakatta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Dou shite hitobito wa Kirisuto o Dabide no ko da to iu no ka.
Dabide jishin ga shihen no naka de itte iru, 'Shu wa waga Shu ni oose ni natta,
Anata no teki o anata no ashidai to suru toki made wa, watashi no migi ni zashite i nasai'.
Kono you ni, Dabide wa Kirisuto o Shu to yonde iru. Sore nara, dou shite Kirisuto wa Dabide no ko de arou ka".
Minshuu ga mina kiite iru toki, Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta,
"Rippougakusha ni ki o tsuke nasai. Karera wa nagai koromo o kite aruku no o konomi, hiroba de no keirei ya kaidou no jouseki ya enkai no jouza o yorokobi,
Yamometachi no ie o kuitaoshi, mie no tame ni nagai inori o suru. Karera wa motto kibishii sabaki o ukerude arou".
Iesu wa me o agete, kanemochitachi ga saisen hako ni kenkin o nageireru no o mirare,
Mata, aru mazushii yamome ga, reputa futatsu o ireru no o mite
Iwareta, "Yoku kiki nasai. Ano mazushii yamome wa dare yori mo takusan ireta no da.
Korera no hitotachi wa mina, ariamaru naka kara kenkin o nageiretaga, ano fujin wa, sono toboshii naka kara, motte iru seikatsuhi zenbu o iretakara de aru".
Aru hitobito ga, migoto na ishi to hounoubutsu to de miya ga kazararete iru koto o hanashite ita no de, Iesu wa iwareta,
"Anata gata wa korera no mono o nagamete iruga, sono ishi hitotsu de mo kuzusarezu ni, ta no ishi no ue ni nokoru koto mo nakunaru hi ga, kurude arou".
Soko de karera wa tazuneta, "Sensei, de wa, itsu sonna koto ga okoru no deshou ka. Mata sonna koto ga okoru you na baai ni wa, donna zenchou ga arimasu ka".
Iesu ga iwareta, "Anata gata wa, madowasarenai you ni ki o tsuke nasai. Ooku no mono ga watashi no na o nanotte araware, jibun ga sore da to ka, toki ga chikazuita to ka, iude arou. Karera ni tsuite iku na.
Sensou to souran to no uwasa o kiku toki ni mo, ojiosoreru na. Kou shita koto wa mazu okoraneba naranaiga, owari wa sugu ni wa konai".
Sore kara karera ni iwareta, "Tami wa tami ni, kuni wa kuni ni tekitai shite tachiagarude arou.
Mata daijishin ga ari, achikochi ni ekibyou ya kikin ga okori, iroiro osoroshii koto ya ten kara no monosugoi zenchou ga arude arou.
Shikashi, korera no arayuru dekigoto no aru mae ni, hitobito wa anata gata ni te o kakete hakugai o shi, kaidou ya goku ni hikiwatashi, watashi no na no yue ni ou ya soutoku no mae ni hippatte ikude arou.
Sore wa, anata gata ga akashi o suru kikai to narude arou.
Dakara, dou touben shiyou ka to, mae motte kangaete okanai koto ni kokoro o kime nasai.
Anata no hantaisha no dare mo ga kouben mo hitei mo dekinai you na kotoba to chie to o, watashi ga sazukerukara.
Shikashi, anata gata wa ryoushin, kyoudai, shinzoku, yuujin ni sae uragirarerude arou. Mata, anata gata no naka de korosareru mono mo arou.
Mata, watashi no na no yue ni subete no hito ni nikumarerude arou.
Shikashi, anata gata no kaminoke hitosuji de mo ushinawareru koto wa nai.
Anata gata wa taeshinobu koto ni yotte, jibun no tamashii o kachitorude arou.
Erusaremu ga guntai ni houi sareru no o mitanaraba, sono toki wa, sono metsubou ga chikazuita to satori nasai.
Sono toki, Yudaya ni iru hitobito wa yama e nige yo. Shichuu ni iru mono wa, soko kara dete iku ga yoi. Mata, inaka ni iru mono wa shinai ni haitte wa ikenai.
Sore wa, seisho ni shirusareta subete no koto ga jitsugen suru keibatsu no hi de arukara da.
Sono hi ni wa, miomo no onna to chinomi go o motsu onna to wa, fukou de aru. Chijou ni wa ookina kunan ga ari, kono tami ni wa miikari ga nozomi,
Karera wa tsurugi no ha ni taore, mata toraerarete shokoku e hiki yukarerude arou. Soshite Erusaremu wa, ihoujin no jiki ga michiru made, karera ni fuminijirarete irude arou.
Mata hi to tsuki to hoshi to ni, shirushi ga arawarerude arou. Soshite, chijou de wa, shokokumin ga nayami, umi to oonami to no todoroki ni oji madoi,
Hitobito wa sekai ni okorou to suru koto o omoi, kyoufu to fuan de kizetsu surude arou. Moromoro no tentai ga yuriugokasarerukara de aru.
Sono toki, ooinaru chikara to eikou to o motte, hito no ko ga kumo ni notte kuru no o, hitobito wa mirude arou.
Korera no koto ga okori hajimetara, mi o okoshi atama o motage nasai. Anata gata no sukui ga chikazuite iru no dakara".
Sore kara hitotsu no tatoe o hanasareta, "Ichijiku no ki o, mata subete no ki o mi nasai.
Haya me o daseba, anata gata wa sore o mite, natsu ga sudeni chikaito, jibun de kizuku no de aru.
Kono you ni anata gata mo, korera no koto ga okoru no o mitanara, kami no kuni ga chikai no da to satori nasai.
Yoku kiite oki nasai. Korera no koto ga, kotogotoku okoru made wa, kono jidai wa horobiru koto ga nai.
Tenchi wa horobirude arou. Shikashi watashi no kotoba wa kesshite horobiru koto ga nai.
Anata gata ga houjuu ya, deisui ya, yo no wazurai no tame ni kokoro ga nibutte iru uchi ni, omoigakenai toki, sono hi ga wana no you ni anatagata o toraeru koto ga nai you ni, yoku chuui shite i nasai.
Sono hi wa chi no zenmen ni sumu subete no hito ni nozomu no de arukara.
Korera no okorou to shite iru subete no koto kara nogarete, hito no ko no mae ni tatsu koto ga dekiru you ni, taezu me o samashite inotte i nasai".
Iesu wa hiru no aida wa miya de oshie, yoru ni wa dete itte oribu to iu yama de yo o sugoshite orareta.
Minshuu wa mina, mioshie o kikou to shite, itsu mo asa hayaku miya ni iki, Iesu no moto ni atsumatta.
Sate, sugikoshi to iwarete iru jokousai ga chikazuita.
Saishichou tachi ya rippougakusha tachi wa, dou ka shite Iesu o korosou to hakatte ita. Minshuu o osorete itakara de aru.
Sono toki, juu ni deshi no hitori de, Isukariote to yobarete ita Yuda ni, Satan ga haitta.
Sunawachi, kare wa saishichou tachi ya miyamori gashiratachi no tokoro e itte, dou shite Iesu o karera ni watasou ka to, sono houhou ni tsuite kyougi shita.
Karera wa yorokonde, Yuda ni kane o ataeru torikime o shita.
Yuda wa sore o shoudaku shita. Soshite, gunshuu no inai toki ni Iesu o hikiwatasou to, kikai o neratte ita.
Sate, sugikoshi no kohitsuji o hofurubeki jokousai no hi ga kita no de,
Iesu wa Petero to Yohane to o tsukai ni dashite iwareta, "Itte, sugikoshi no shokuji ga dekiru you ni junbi o shi nasai".
Karera wa itta, "Doko ni junbi o shitara yoi no desu ka".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Shinai ni haittara, mizugame o motte iru otoko ni deaude arou. Sono hito ga hairu ie made tsuite itte,
Sono ie no shujin ni ii nasai, 'Deshitachi to issho ni sugikoshi no shokuji o suru zashiki wa doko ka, to sensei ga itte oraremasu'.
Suruto, sono shujin wa seki no totonoerareta ni kai no hiroma o misete kurerukara, soko ni youi o shi nasai".
Deshitachi wa dete itte miruto, Iesu ga iwareta toori de atta no de, sugikoshi no shokuji no youi o shita.
Jikan ni natta no de, Iesu wa shokutaku ni tsukare, shitotachi mo tomo ni seki ni tsuita.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi wa kurushimi o ukeru mae ni, anata gata to kono sugikoshi no shokuji o shiyou to, setsuni nozonde ita.
Anata gata ni itte okuga, kami no kuni de sugikoshi ga jouju suru toki made wa, watashi wa ni do to, kono sugikoshi no shokuji o suru koto wa nai".
Soshite sakazuki o tori, kansha shite iwareta, "Kore o totte, tagai ni wakete nome.
Anata gata ni itte okuga, ima kara nochi kami no kuni ga kuru made wa, watashi wa budou no mi kara tsukutta mono o, issai nomanai".
Mata pan o tori, kansha shite kore o saki, deshitachi ni ataete iwareta, "Kore wa, anata gata no tame ni ataeru watashi no karada de aru. Watashi o kinen suru tame, kono you ni okonai nasai".
Shokuji no nochi, sakazuki mo onaji you ni shite iwareta, "Kono sakazuki wa, anata gata no tame ni nagasu watashi no chi de taterareru atarashii keiyaku de aru.
Shikashi, soko ni, watashi o uragiru mono ga, watashi to issho ni shokutaku ni te o oite iru.
Hito no ko wa sadamerareta toori ni, satte iku. Shikashi hito no ko o uragiru sono hito wa, wazawai de aru".
Deshitachi wa, jibuntachi no uchi no dare ga, sonna koto o shiyou to shite iru no darou to, tagai ni ronji hajimeta.
Sore kara, jibuntachi no naka de dare ga ichiban eraidarou ka to itte, souron ga karera no aida ni, okotta.
Soko de Iesu ga iwareta, "Ihou no outachi wa sono tami no ue ni kunrin shi, mata, kenryoku o furutte iru monotachi wa onjin to yobareru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa, sou de atte wa naranai. Kaette, anata gata no naka de ichiban erai hito wa ichiban wakai mono no you ni, shidou suru hito wa tsukaeru mono no you ni narubekide aru.
Shokutaku ni tsuku hito to kyuuji suru mono to, dochira ga erai no ka. Shokutaku ni tsuku hito no hou de wa nai ka. Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata no naka de, kyuuji o suru mono no you ni shite iru.
Anata gata wa, watashi no shiren no aida, watashi to issho ni saigo made shinonde kureta hitotachi de aru.
Sore de, watashi no chichi ga kuni no shihai o watashi ni yudanete kudasatta you ni, watashi mo sore o anata gata ni yudane,
Watashi no kuni de shokutaku ni tsuite nomikui o sase, mata kurai ni zashite Isuraeru no juu ni no buzoku o sabakaserude arou.
Shimon, Shimon, miyo, Satan wa anatagata o mugi no you ni furui ni kakeru koto o negatte yurusareta.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata no shinkou ga nakunaranai you ni, anata no tame ni inotta. Sore de, anata ga tachinaotta toki ni wa, kyoudaitachi o chikarazukete yari nasai".
Shimon ga itta, "Shu yo, watashi wa goku ni de mo, mata shi ni itaru made mo, anata to goissho ni iku kakugo desu".
Suru to Iesu ga iwareta, "Petero yo, anata ni itte oku. Kyou, niwatori ga naku made ni, anata wa san do watashi o shiranai to iudarou".
Soshite karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ga saifu mo fukuro mo kutsu mo motasezu ni anatagata o tsukawashita toki, nani ka komatta koto ga atta ka". Karera wa, "Iie, nani mo arimasendeshita" to kotaeta.
Soko de iwareta, "Shikashi ima wa, saifu no aru mono wa, sore o motte ike. Fukuro mo douyou ni motte ike. Mata, tsurugi no nai mono wa, jibun no uwagi o utte, sore o kau ga yoi.
Anata gata ni iuga, 'Kare wa tsumibito no hitori ni kazoerareta' to shirushite aru koto wa, watashi no mi ni nashitogerareneba naranai. Sou da, watashi ni kakawaru koto wa jouju shite iru".
Deshitachi ga itta, "Shu yo, goran nasai, koko ni tsurugi ga ni furi gozaimasu". Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore de yoi".
Iesu wa dete, itsu mo no you ni oribuyama ni ikareruto, deshitachi mo shitagatte itta.
Itsu mo no basho ni tsuite kara, karera ni iwareta, "Yuuwaku ni ochiiranai you ni inori nasai".
Soshite gojibun wa, ishi o nagete todoku hodo hanareta tokoro e shirizoki, hizamazuite, inotte iwareta,
"Chichi yo, mikokoro naraba, douzo, kono sakazuki o watashi kara torinokete kudasai. Shikashi, watashi no omoi de wa naku, mikokoro ga naru you ni shite kudasai".
Sono toki, mitsukai ga ten kara arawarete Iesu o chikarazuketa.
Iesu wa kurushimimodaete, masumasu setsuni inorareta. Soshite, sono ase ga chi no shitatari no you ni chi ni ochita.
Inori o oete tachiagari, deshitachi no tokoro e ikareruto, karera ga kanashimi no hate neitte iru no o goran ni natte
Iwareta, "Naze nemutte iru no ka. Yuuwaku ni ochiiranai you ni, okite inotte i nasai".
Iesu ga mada sou itte orareru uchi ni, soko ni gunshuu ga araware, juu ni deshi no hitori de Yuda to iu mono ga sentou ni tatte, Iesu ni seppun shiyou to shite chikazuite kita.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Yuda, anata wa seppun o motte hito no ko o uragiru no ka".
Iesu no soba ni ita hitotachi wa, koto no nariyuki o mite, "Shu yo, tsurugi de kiritsukete yarimashou ka" to itte,
Sono uchi no hitori ga, saishichou no shimobe ni kiritsuke, sono migi no mimi o kiriotoshita.
Iesu wa kore ni taishite iwareta, "Sore dake de yame nasai". Soshite, sono shimobe no mimi ni te o fure te, oiyashi ni natta.
Sore kara, jibun ni mukatte kuru saishichou, miyamori ga shira, chouroutachi ni taishite iwareta, "Anata gata wa, goutou ni mukau you ni ken ya bou o motte dete kita no ka.
Mainichi anata gata to issho ni miya ni ita toki ni wa, watashi ni te o kakenakatta. Daga, ima wa anata gata no toki, mata, yami no shihai no toki de aru".
Sore kara hitobito wa Iesu o torae, hippatte daisaishi no teitaku e tsurete itta. Petero wa tooku kara tsuite itta.
Hitobito wa nakaniwa no mannaka ni hi o taite, issho ni suwatte ita no de, Petero mo sono naka ni suwatta.
Suruto, aru jochuu ga, kare ga hi no soba ni suwatte iru no o mi, kare o mitsumete, "Kono hito mo Iesu to issho ni imashita" to itta.
Petero wa sore o uchikeshite, "Watashi wa sono hito o shiranai" to itta.
Shibaraku shite, hoka no hito ga Petero o mite itta, "Anata mo ano nakama no hitori da". Suru to Petero wa itta, "Iya, sore wa chigau".
Yakuichi jikan tatte kara, mata hoka no mono ga iihatta, "Tashika ni kono hito mo Iesu to issho datta. Kono hito mo Garirayabito na no dakara".
Petero wa itta, "Anata no itte iru koto wa, watashi ni wakaranai". Suruto, kare ga mada ii owaranu uchi ni, tachimachi, niwatori ga naita.
Shu wa furimuite Petero o mitsumerareta. Sono toki Petero wa, "Kyou, niwatori ga naku mae ni, san do watashi o shiranai to iude arou" to iwareta Shu no okotoba o omoidashita.
Soshite soto e dete, hageshiku naita.
Iesu o kanshi shite ita hitotachi wa, Iesu o chourou shi, uchitataki,
Mekakushi o shite, "Iiatete mi yo. Utta no wa, dare ka" to kii tari shita.
Sono hoka, iroiro na koto o itte, Iesu o gurou shita.
Yo ga aketa toki, jinmin no chourou, saishichou tachi, rippougakusha tachi ga atsumari, Iesu o gikai ni hikidashite itta,
"Anata ga Kirisuto nara, sou itte moraitai". Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi ga itte mo, anata gata wa shinjinaidarou.
Mata, watashi ga tazunete mo, kotaenaidarou.
Shikashi, hito no ko wa ima kara nochi, zennou no kami no migi ni zasurude arou".
Karera wa itta, "De wa, anata wa kami no ko na no ka". Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata no iu toori de aru".
Suruto karera wa itta, "Kore ijou, nan no shouko ga iru ka. Wareware wa chokusetsu kare no kuchi kara kiita no dakara".
Gunshuu wa mina tachiagatte, Iesu o Pirato no tokoro e tsurete itta.
Soshite uttaedete itta, "Watashitachi wa, kono hito ga kokumin o madowashi, mitsugi o Kaizaru ni osameru koto o kinji, mata jibun koso ou naru Kirisuto dato, tonaete iru tokoro o mokugeki shimashita".
Pirato wa Iesu ni tazuneta, "Anata ga Yudayajin no ou de aru ka". Iesu wa "Sono toori de aru" to okotae ni natta.
Soko de Pirato wa saishichou tachi to gunshuu to ni mukatte itta, "Watashi wa kono hito ni nan no tsumi mo mitomenai".
Tokoro ga karera wa, masumasu iitsunotte yamanakatta, "Kare wa, Gariraya kara hajimete kono tokoro made, Yudaya zenkoku ni watatte oshie, minshuu o sendou shite iru no desu".
Pirato wa kore o kiite, kono hito wa Garirayabito ka to tazune,
Soshite Herode no shihaika no mono de aru koto o tashikameta no de, choudo kono koro, Herode ga Erusaremu ni ita no o saiwai, sochira e Iesu o okuritodoketa.
Herode wa Iesu o mite hijou ni yorokonda. Sore wa, kanete Iesu no koto o kiite ita no de, atte mitai to nagai aida omotte itashi, mata Iesu ga nani ka kiseki o okonau no o mitai to nozonde itakara de aru.
Sore de, iroiro to shitsumon o kokoromitaga, Iesu wa nani mo okotae ni naranakatta.
Saishichou tachi to rippougakusha tachi to wa tatte, hageshii gochou de Iesu o uttaeta.
Mata Herode wa sono heisotsudomo to issho ni natte, Iesu o bujoku shi tari chourou shi tari shita ageku, hanayaka na kimono o kisete Pirato e okurikaeshita.
Herode to Pirato to wa izen wa tagai ni tekishi shite itaga, kono hi ni shitashii naka ni natta.
Pirato wa, saishichou tachi to yakunintachi to minshuu to o, yobiatsumete itta,
"Omaetachi wa, kono hito o minshuu o madowasu mono to shite watashi no tokoro ni tsurete kita no de, omaetachi no menzen de shirabetaga, uttaedete iru you na tsumi wa, kono hito ni sukoshi mo mitomerarenakatta.
Herode mo mata mitomenakatta. Genni kare wa Iesu o wareware ni okurikaeshite kita. Kono hito wa nanra shi ni ataru you na koto wa shite inai no de aru.
Dakara, kare o muchiutte kara, yurushite yaru koto ni shiyou". []
Matsurigoto ni Pirato ga hitori no shuujin o yurushite yaru koto ni natte ita.]
Tokoro ga, karera wa issei ni sakende itta, "Sono hito o korose. Baraba o yurushite kure".
Kono Baraba wa, miyako de okotta boudou to satsujin to no kado de, goku ni touzerarete ita mono de aru.
Pirato wa Iesu o yurushite yaritai to omotte, mou ichi do karera ni yobikaketa.
Shikashi karera wa, wamekitatete "Juujika ni tsukeyo, kare o juujika ni tsukeyo" to ii tsuzuketa.
Pirato wa san dome ni karera ni mukatte itta, "De wa, kono hito wa, ittai, donna akuji o shita no ka. Kare ni wa shi ni ataru tsumi wa mattaku mitomerarenakatta. Dakara, muchiutte kara kare o yurushite yaru koto ni shiyou".
Tokoro ga, karera wa oogoe o agete tsumeyori, Iesu o juujika ni tsukeru you ni youkyuu shita. Soshite, sono koe ga katta.
Pirato wa tsuini karera no negai doori ni suru koto ni kettei shita.
Soshite, boudou to satsujin to no kadode goku ni touzerareta mono no hou o, karera no youkyuu ni oujite yurushite yari, Iesu no hou wa karera ni hikiwatashite, sono i no mama ni makaseta.
Karera ga Iesu o hiite yuku tochuu, Shimon to iu Kurene bito ga kougai kara dete kita no o toraete juujika o owase, sore o ni natte Iesu no ato kara ikaseta.
Oozei no minshuu to, kanashiminageite yamanai onnatachi no mure to ga, Iesu ni shitagatte itta.
Iesu wa onnatachi no hou ni furimuite iwareta, "Erusaremu no musumetachi yo, watashi no tame ni naku na. Mushiro, anata gata jishin no tame, mata jibun no kodomotachi no tame ni naku ga yoi.
'Funin no onna to ko o umanakatta tai to, fukumasenakatta chibusa to wa, saiwai da' to iu hi ga, ima ni kuru.
Sono toki, hitobito wa yama ni mukatte, wareware no ue ni taore kakare to ii, mata oka ni mukatte, wareware ni ooikabusare to ii dasude arou.
Moshi, namaki de sae mo sou sarerunara, kareki wa dou sareru koto de arou".
Sate, Iesu to tomo ni kei o ukeru tame ni, hoka ni futari no hanzainin mo hikarete itta.
Sarekoube to yobarete iru tokoro ni tsukuto, hitobito wa soko de Iesu o juujika ni tsuke, hanzainintachi mo, hitori wa migi ni, hitori wa hidari ni, juujika ni tsuketa.
Sono toki, Iesu wa iwareta, "Chichi yo, karera o oyurushi kudasai. Karera wa nani o shite iru no ka, wakarazu ni iru no desu". Hitobito wa Iesu no kimono o kujihiki de wakeatta.
Minshuu wa tatte mite ita. Yakunintachi mo azawaratte itta, "Kare wa tanin o sukutta. Moshi kare ga kami no Kirisuto, erabareta mono de arunara, jibun jishin o sukuu ga yoi".
Heisotsudomo mo Iesu o nonoshiri, chikayotte kite su i budoushu o sashidashite itta,
"Anata ga Yudayajin no ou nara, jibun o sukui nasai".
Iesu no ue ni wa, "Kore wa Yudayajin no ou" to kaita fuda ga kakete atta.
Juujika ni kakerareta hanzainin no hitori ga, "Anata wa Kirisuto de wa nai ka. Sore nara, jibun o sukui, mata wareware mo sukutte mi yo" to, Iesu ni warukuchi o ii tsuzuketa.
Mou hitori wa, sore o tashinamete itta, "Omae wa onaji kei o ukete inagara, kami o osorenai no ka.
Otagai wa jibun no yatta koto no mukui o ukete iru no dakara, kou natta no wa touzen da. Shikashi, konokata wa nani mo warui koto o shita no de wa nai".
Soshite itta, "Iesu yo, anata ga mikuni no ken'i o motte oide ni naru toki ni wa, watashi o omoidashite kudasai".
Iesu wa iwareta, "Yoku itte okuga, anata wa kyou, watashi to issho ni Paradaisu ni irude arou".
Toki wa mou hiru no juu ni ji goro de attaga, taiyou wa hikari o ushinai, zenchi wa kuraku natte, san ji ni oyonda.
Soshite seijo no maku gamannaka kara saketa.
Sono toki, Iesu wa koe takaku sakende iwareta, "Chichi yo, watashi no rei o mite ni yudanemasu". Kou itte tsuini iki o hikitorareta.
Hyakusotsuchou wa kono arisama o mite, kami o agame, "Hontou ni, kono hito wa tadashii hito de atta" to itta.
Kono koukei o mi ni atsumatte kita gunshuu mo, korera no dekigoto o mite, mina mune o uchinagara kaette itta.
Subete Iesu o shitte ita mono ya, Gariraya kara shitagatte kita onnatachi mo, tooi tokoro ni tatte, korera no koto o mite ita.
Koko ni, Yosefu to iu giin ga itaga, zenryou de tadashii hito de atta.
Kono hito wa Yudaya no machi Arimataya no shusshin de, kami no kuni o machinozonde ita. Kare wa gikai no giketsu ya koudou ni wa sansei shite inakatta.
Kono hito ga Pirato no tokoro e itte, Iesu no karada no hikitorikata o negaidete,
Sore o torioroshite amanuno ni tsutsumi, mada dare mo houmutta koto no nai, iwa o hotte tsukutta haka ni osameta.
Kono hi wa junbi no hi de atte, ansokunichi ga hajimari kakete ita.
Iesu to issho ni Gariraya kara kita onnatachi wa, ato ni tsuite kite, sono haka o mi, mata Iesu no karada ga osamerareru yousu o mitodoketa.
Soshite kaette, kouryou to kouyu to o youi shita. Sore kara okite ni shitagatte ansokunichi o yasunda.
Shuu no hajime no hi, yoake mae ni, onnatachi wa youi shite oita kouryou o tazusaete, haka ni itta.
Tokoro ga, ishi ga haka kara korogashite aru no de,
Naka ni haitte miruto, Shu Iesu no karada ga miataranakatta.
Sono tame tohou ni kurete iruto, miyo, kagayaita koromo o kita futari no mono ga, karera ni arawareta.
Onnatachi wa odorokiosorete, kao o chi ni fusete iruto, kono futari no mono ga itta, "Anata gata wa, naze ikita hou o shinin no naka ni tazunete iru no ka.
Sono kata wa, koko ni wa orarenai. Yomigaerareta no da. Mada Gariraya ni orareta toki, anata gata ni ohanashi ni natta koto o omoidashi nasai.
Sunawachi, hito no ko wa kanarazu tsumibitora no te ni watasare, juujika ni tsukerare, soshite mikkame ni yomigaeru, to ooseraretade wa nai ka".
Soko de onnatachi wa sono kotoba o omoidashi,
Haka kara kaette, korera issai no koto o, juu ichi deshi ya, sono ta minna no hito ni houkoku shita.
Kono onnatachi to iu no wa, Magudara no Mariya, Yohanna, oyobi Yakobu no haha Mariya de atta. Kanojotachi to issho ni ita hoka no onnatachi mo, kono koto o shitotachi ni hanashita.
Tokoro ga, shitotachi ni wa, sore ga oroka na hanashi no you ni omowarete, sore o shinjinakatta. []
Petero wa tatte haka e hashitte iki, kagande naka o miruto, amanuno dake ga soko ni atta no de, koto no shidai o fushigi ni omoinagara kaette itta.]
Kono hi, futari no deshi ga, Erusaremu kara nana mairu bakari hanareta Emao to iu mura e ikinagara,
Kono issai no dekigoto ni tsuite tagai ni katariatte ita.
Katariai ronjiatte iruto, Iesu gojishin ga chikazuite kite, karera to issho ni aruite ikareta.
Shikashi, karera no me ga saegirarete, Iesu o mitomeru koto ga dekinakatta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Arukinagara tagai ni katariatte iru sono hanashi wa, nan no koto na no ka". Karera wa kanashi sou na kao o shite tachidomatta.
Sono hitori no Kureopa to iu mono ga, kotaete itta, "Anata wa Erusaremu ni tomatte inagara, anata dake ga, kono miyako de konogoro okotta koto o gozonji nai no desu ka".
"Sore wa, donna koto ka" to iwareruto, karera wa itta, "Nazare no Iesu no koto desu. Ano kata wa, kami to subete no minshuu to no mae de, waza ni mo kotoba ni mo chikara aru yogensha deshitaga,
Saishichou tachi ya yakunintachi ga, shikei ni shosuru tame ni hikiwatashi, juujika ni tsuketa no desu.
Watashitachi wa, Isuraeru o sukuu no wa kono hito de arouto, nozomi o kakete imashita. Shikamo sono ue ni, kono koto ga okotte kara, kyou ga mikkame na no desu.
Tokoro ga, watashitachi no nakama de aru suunin no onna ga, watashitachi o odorokasemashita. To iu no wa, karera ga asa hayaku haka ni ikimasuto,
Iesu no karada ga miataranai no de, kaette kimashitaga, sono toki mitsukai ga arawarete, 'Iesu wa ikite orareru' to tsugeta to mousu no desu.
Sore de, watashitachi no nakama ga suunin, haka ni itte mimasuto, hatashite onnatachi ga itta toori de, Iesu wa miatarimasendeshita".
Soko de Iesu ga iwareta, "Aa, oroka de kokoro no nibui tame, yogensha tachi ga toita subete no koto o shinjirarenai monotachi yo.
Kirisuto wa kanarazu, korera no kunan o ukete, sono eikou ni hairu hazu de wa nakatta no ka".
Kou itte, Moose ya subete no yogensha kara hajimete, seisho zentai ni watari, gojishin ni tsuite shirushite aru kotodomo o, tokiakasareta.
Sore kara, karera wa ikou to shite ita mura ni chikazuitaga, Iesu ga nao saki e susumi ikareru yousu de atta.
Soko de, shiite hikitomete itta, "Watashitachi to issho ni otomari kudasai. Mou yuugure ni natte ori, hi mohaya katamuite imasu". Iesu wa, karera to tomo ni tomaru tame ni, ie ni wa irareta.
Issho ni shokutaku ni tsukareta toki, pan o tori, shukufuku shite saki, karera ni watashite orareru uchi ni,
Karera no me ga hirakete, sore ga Iesu de aru koto ga wakatta. Suruto, misugata ga mienaku natta.
Karera wa tagai ni itta, "Michimichi ohanashi ni natta toki, mata seisho o toki meishite kudasatta toki, otagai no kokoro ga uchi ni moetade wa nai ka".
Soshite, sugu ni tatte Erusaremu ni kaette miruto, juu ichi deshi to sono nakama ga atsumatte ite,
"Shu wa, hontou ni yomigaette, Shimon ni araware nasatta" to itte ita.
Soko de futari no mono wa, tochuu de atta koto ya, pan o o saki ni naru yousu de Iesu da to wakatta koto nado o hanashita.
Kou hanashite iruto, Iesu ga karera no naka ni otachi ni natta. [soshite "Yasukare" to iwareta.]
Karera wa osore odoroite, rei o mite iru no da to omotta.
Soko de Iesu ga iwareta, "Naze oji madotte iru no ka. Dou shite kokoro ni utagai o okosu no ka.
Watashi no te ya ashi o mi nasai. Masashiku watashi na no da. Sawatte mi nasai. Rei ni wa niku ya hone wa naiga, anata gata ga miruto ori, watashi ni wa aru no da". []
Kou itte, te to ashi to o omise ni natta.]
Karera wa yorokobi no amari, mada shinjirarenaide fushigi ni omotte iruto, Iesu ga "Koko ni nani ka shokumotsu ga aru ka" to iwareta.
Karera ga yaita uo no ichi kire o sashiageruto,
Iesu wa sore o totte, minna no mae de taberareta.
Sore kara karera ni taishite iwareta, "Watashi ga izen anata gata to issho ni ita jibun ni hanashite kikaseta kotoba wa, kou de atta. Sunawachi, Moose no rippou to yogensho to shihen to ni, watashi ni tsuite kaite aru koto wa, kanarazu kotogotoku jouju suru".
Soko de Iesu wa, seisho o satoraseru tame ni karera no kokoro o hiraite
Iwareta, "Kou, shirushite aru. Kirisuto wa kurushimi o ukete, mikkame ni shinin no naka kara yomigaeru.
Soshite, sono na ni yotte tsumi no yurushi o esaseru kuiaratamega, Erusaremu kara hajimatte, moromoro no kokumin ni nobetsutaerareru.
Anata gata wa, korera no koto no shounin de aru.
Miyo, watashi no chichi ga yakusoku sareta mono o, anata gata ni okuru. Dakara, ue kara chikara o sazukerareru made wa, anata gata wa miyako ni todomatte i nasai".
Sore kara, Iesu wa karera o Betaniya no chikaku made tsurete iki, te o agete karera o shukufuku sareta.
Shukufuku shite orareru uchi ni, karera o hanarete, [ten ni agerareta.]
Karera wa [Iesu o haishi,] hijou na yorokobi o motte Erusaremu ni kaeri,
Taezu miya ni ite, kami o hometataete ita.
Hajime ni kotoba ga atta. Kotoba wa kami to tomo ni atta. Kotoba wa kami de atta.
Kono kotoba wa hajime ni kami to tomo ni atta.
Subete no mono wa, kore ni yotte dekita. Dekita mono no uchi, hitotsu to shite kore ni yoranai mono wa nakatta.
Kono kotoba ni inochi ga atta. Soshite kono inochi wa hito no hikari de atta.
Hikari wa yami no naka ni kagayaite iru. Soshite, yami wa kore ni katanakatta.
Koko ni hitori no hito ga atte, kami kara tsukawasarete ita. Sono na o Yohane to itta.
Kono hito wa akashi no tame ni kita. Hikari ni tsuite akashi o shi, kare ni yotte subete no hito ga shinjiru tame de aru.
Kare wa hikari de wa naku, tada, hikari ni tsuite akashi o suru tame ni kita no de aru.
Subete no hito o tera sumakoto no hikari ga atte, yo ni kita.
Kare wa yo ni ita. Soshite, yo wa kare ni yotte dekita no de aruga, yo wa kare o shirazu ni ita.
Kare wa jibun no tokoro ni kita no ni, jibun no tami wa kare o ukeirenakatta.
Shikashi, kare o ukeireta mono, sunawachi, sono na o shinjita hitobito ni wa, kare wa kami no ko to naru chikara o ataeta no de aru.
Sorera no hito wa, chisuji ni yorazu, niku no yoku ni yorazu, mata, hito no yoku ni mo yorazu, tada kami ni yotte umareta no de aru.
Soshite kotoba wa nikutai to nari, watashitachi no uchi ni yadotta. Watashitachi wa sono eikou o mita. Sore wa chichi no hitori ko to shite no eikou de atte, megumi to makoto to ni michite ita.
Yohane wa kare ni tsuite akashi o shi, sakende itta, " 'Watashi no ato ni kuru kata wa, watashi yori mo sugureta kata de aru. Watashi yori mo saki ni oraretakara de aru' to watashi ga itta no wa, kono hito no koto de aru".
Watashitachi subete no mono wa, sono michimichite iru mono no naka kara ukete, megumi ni megumi o kuwaerareta.
Rippou wa Moose o tooshite ataerare, megumi to makoto to wa, Iesu Kirisuto o tooshite kita no de aru.
Kami o mita mono wa mada hitori mo inai. Tada chichi no futokoro ni iru hitori ko naru kami dake ga, kami o arawashita no de aru.
Sate, Yudayajintachi ga, Erusaremu kara saishitachi ya Rebihitotachi o Yohane no moto ni tsukawashite, "Anata wa donata desu ka" to towasetaga, sono toki Yohane ga tateta akashi wa, kou de atta.
Sunawachi, kare wa kokuhaku shite inamazu, "Watashi wa Kirisuto de wa nai" to kokuhaku shita.
Soko de, karera wa touta, "Sore de wa, donata na no desu ka, anata wa Eriya desu ka". Kare wa "Iya, sou de wa nai" to itta. "De wa, ano yogensha desu ka". Kare wa "Iie" to kotaeta.
Soko de, karera wa itta, "Anata wa donata desu ka. Watashitachi o tsukawashita hitobito ni, kotae o motte ikeru you ni shite itadakitai. Anata jishin o dare da to kangaeru no desu ka".
Kare wa itta, "Watashi wa, yogensha Izaya ga itta you ni, 'Shu no michi o massugu ni seyo to arano de yobawaru mono no koe' de aru".
Tsukawasareta hitotachi wa, Parisaibito de atta.
Karera wa Yohane ni toute itta, "De wa, anata ga Kirisuto de mo Eriya de mo mata ano yogensha de mo nai no nara, naze baputesuma o sazukeru no desu ka".
Yohane wa karera ni kotaete itta, "Watashi wa mizu de baputesuma o sazukeruga, anata gata no shiranai ka taga, anata gata no naka ni tatte orareru.
Sore ga watashi no ato ni ato ni oide ni naru kata de atte, watashi wa sono hito no kutsu no himo o toku neuchi mo nai".
Korera no koto wa, Yohane ga baputesuma o sazukete ita Yorudan no mukou no Betaniya de atta no de aru.
Sono yokujitsu, Yohane wa Iesu ga jibun no hou ni korareru no o mite itta, "Miyo, yo no tsumi o torinozoku kami no kohitsuji.
'Watashi no ato ni kuru kata wa, watashi yori mo sugureta kata de aru. Watashi yori mo saki ni oraretakara de aru' to watashi ga itta no wa, kono hito no koto de aru.
Watashi wa konokata o shiranakatta. Shikashi, konokata ga Isuraeru ni arawarete kudasaru sono koto no tame ni, watashi wa kite, mizu de baputesuma o sazukete iru no de aru".
Yohane wa mata akashi o shite itta, "Watashi wa, mitama ga hato no you ni ten kara kudatte, kare no ue ni todomaru no o mita.
Watashi wa kono hito o shiranakatta. Shikashi, mizu de baputesuma o sazukeru you ni to, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta sono kata ga, watashi ni iwareta, 'Aru hito no ue ni, mitama ga kudatte todomaru no o mitara, sono hito koso wa, mitama ni yotte baputesuma o sazukeru kata de aru'.
Watashi wa sore o mita no de, kono kata koso kami no ko de aruto, akashi o shita no de aru".
Sono yokujitsu, Yohane wa mata futari no deshitachi to issho ni tatte itaga,
Iesu ga aruite orareru no ni me o tomete itta, "Miyo, kami no kohitsuji".
Sono futari no deshi wa, Yohane ga sou iu no o kiite, Iesu ni tsuite itta.
Iesu wa furimuki, karera ga tsuite kuru no o mite iwareta, "Nani ka negai ga aru no ka". Karera wa itta, "Rabi (yakushite ieba, sensei) doko ni otomari na no desu ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Kite goran nasai. Sou shitara wakarudarou". Soko de karera wa tsuite itte, Iesu no tomatte orareru tokoro o mita. Soshite, sono hi wa Iesu no tokoro ni tomatta. Toki wa gogo shi ji goro de atta.
Yohane kara kiite, Iesu ni tsuite itta futari no uchi no hitori wa, Shimon Petero no kyoudai Andere de atta.
Kare wa mazu jibun no kyoudai Shimon ni deatte itta, "Watashitachi wa Meshiya (yakuseba, Kirisuto) ni ima deatta".
Soshite Shimon o Iesu no moto ni tsurete kita. Iesu wa kare ni me o tomete iwareta, "Anata wa Yohane no ko Shimon de aru. Anata o Kepa (yakuseba, Petero) to yobu koto ni suru".
Sono yokujitsu, Iesu wa Gariraya ni ikou to saretaga, Piripo ni deatte iwareta, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai".
Piripo wa, Andere to Petero to no machi Betsusaida no hito de atta.
Kono Piripo ga Natanaeru ni deatte itta, "Watashitachi wa, Moose ga rippou no naka ni shirushite ori, yogensha tachi ga shirushite ita hito, Yosefu no ko, Nazare no Iesu ni ima deatta".
Natanaeru wa kare ni itta, "Nazare kara, nan no yoi mono ga deyou ka". Piripo wa kare ni itta, "Kite mi nasai".
Iesu wa Natanaeru ga jibun no hou ni kuru no o mite, kare ni tsuite iwareta, "Miyo, ano hito koso, hontou no Isuraerubito de aru. Sono kokoro ni wa itsuwari ga nai".
Natanaeru wa itta, "Dou shite watashi o gozonjina no desu ka". Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Piripo ga anata o yobu mae ni, watashi wa anata ga, ichijiku no ki no shita ni iru no o mita".
Natanaeru wa kotaeta, "Sensei, anata wa kami no ko desu. Anata wa Isuraeru no ou desu".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Anata ga, ichijiku no ki no shita ni iru no o mita to, watashi ga itta no de shinjiru no ka. Kore yori mo, motto ookina koto o, anata wa mirude arou".
Mata iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Ten ga akete, kami no mitsukai tachi ga hito no ko no ue ni noborikudari suru no o, anata gata wa mirude arou".
Mikkame ni Gariraya no Kana ni konrei ga atte, Iesu no haha ga soko ni ita.
Iesu mo deshitachi mo, sono konrei ni manekareta.
Budoushu ga nakunatta no de, haha wa Iesu ni itta, "Budoushu ga nakunatte shimaimashita".
Iesu wa haha ni iwareta, "Fujin yo, anata wa, watashi to, nan no kaka wari ga arimasu ka. Watashi no toki wa, mada kite imasen".
Haha wa shimobetachi ni itta, "Konokata ga, anata gata ni iitsukeru koto wa, nan de mo shite kudasai".
Soko ni wa, Yudayajin no kiyome no narawashi ni shitagatte, sorezore shigo to mo hairu ishi no mizugame ga, muitsu oite atta.
Iesu wa karera ni "Kame ni mizu o ippai ire nasai" to iwareta no de, karera wa kuchi no tokoro made ippai ni ireta.
Soko de karera ni iwareta, "Saa, kunde, ryouri ga shira no tokoro ni motte iki nasai". Suruto, karera wa motte itta.
Ryouri ga shira wa, budoushu ni natta mizu o namete mitaga, sore ga doko kara kita no ka shiranakatta no de, (mizu o kunda shimobetachi wa shitte ita) hanamuko o yonde
Itta, "Donna hito de mo, hajime ni yoi budoushu o dashite, yoi ga mawatta koro ni warui no o dasu mono da. Sore da no ni, anata wa yoi budoushu o ima made totte okaremashita".
Iesu wa, kono saisho no shirushi o Gariraya no Kana de okonai, sono eikou o arawasareta. Soshite deshitachi wa Iesu o shinjita.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa, sono haha, kyoudaitachi, deshitachi to issho ni, Kapenaumu ni kudatte, ikunichi ka soko ni todomarareta.
Sate, Yudayajin no sugikoshi no matsuri ga chikazuita no de, Iesu wa Erusaremu ni noborareta.
Soshite ushi, hitsuji, hato o uru mono ya ryougae suru mono nado ga miya no niwa ni suwarikonde iru no o goran ni natte,
Nawa de muchi o tsukuri, hitsuji mo ushi mo mina miya kara oidashi, ryougaenin no kane o chirashi, sono dai o hikkurikaeshi,
Hato o uru hitobito ni wa "Korera no mono o motte, koko kara dete ike. Watashi no chichi no ie o shoubai no ie to suru na" to iwareta.
Deshitachi wa, "Anata no ie o omou nesshin ga, watashi o kui tsukusude arou" to kaite aru koto o omoidashita.
Soko de, Yudayajin wa Iesu ni itta, "Konna koto o surukara ni wa, donna shirushi o watashitachi ni misete kuremasu ka".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Kono shinden o kowashitara, watashi wa mikka no uchi ni, sore o okosude arou".
Soko de, Yudayajintachi wa itta, "Kono shinden o tateru no ni wa, yonjuu roku nen mo kakatte imasu. Sore da no ni, anata wa mikka no uchi ni, sore o tateru no desu ka".
Iesu wa jibun no karada de aru shinden no koto o iwareta no de aru.
Sore de, Iesu ga shinin no naka kara yomigaetta toki, deshitachi wa Iesu ga kou iwareta koto o omoidashite, seisho to Iesu no kono kotoba to o shinjita.
Sugikoshi no matsuri no aida, Iesu ga Erusaremu ni taizai shite orareta toki, ooku no hitobito wa, sono okonawareta shirushi o mite, Iesu no na o shinjita.
Shikashi Iesu gojishin wa, karera ni jibun o omakase ni naranakatta. Sore wa, subete no hito o shitte orare,
Mata hito ni tsuite akashi suru mono o, hitsuyou to sarenakattakara de aru. Sore wa, gojishinhito no kokoro no naka ni aru koto o shitte oraretakara de aru.
Parisaibito no hitori de, sono na o Nikodemo to iu Yudayajin no shidousha ga atta.
Kono hito ga yoru Iesu no moto ni kite itta, "Sensei, watashitachi wa anata ga kami kara korareta kyoushi de aru koto o shitte imasu. Kami ga goissho de nainara, anata ga nasatte orareru you na shirushi wa, dare ni mo deki wa shimasen".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata ni itte oku. Dare de mo atarashiku umarenakereba, kami no kuni o miru koto wa dekinai".
Nikodemo wa itta, "Hito wa toshi o totte kara umareru koto ga, dou shite dekimasu ka. Mou ichido, haha no tai ni haitte umareru koto ga dekimashou ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Yokuyoku anata ni itte oku. Dare de mo, mizu to rei to kara umarenakereba, kami no kuni ni hairu koto wa dekinai.
Niku kara umareru mono wa niku de ari, rei kara umareru mono wa rei de aru.
Anata gata wa atarashiku umarenakereba naranaito, watashi ga ittakara tote, fushigi ni omou ni wa oyobanai.
Kaze wa omoi no mama ni fuku. Anata wa sono oto o kikuga, sore ga doko kara kite, doko e iku ka wa shiranai. Rei kara umareru mono mo mina, sore to onaji de aru".
Nikodemo wa Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Dou shite, sonna koto ga ari emashou ka".
Iesu wa kare ni kotaete iwareta, "Anata wa Isuraeru no kyoushi de arinagara, kore gurai no koto ga wakaranai no ka.
Yokuyoku itte oku. Watashitachi wa jibun no shitte iru koto o katari, mata jibun no mita koto o akashi shite iru no ni, anata gata wa watashitachi no akashi o ukeirenai.
Watashi ga chijou no koto o katatte iru no ni, anata gata ga shinjinainaraba, tenjou no koto o katatta baai, dou shite sore o shinjirudarou ka.
Ten kara kudatte kita mono, sunawachi hito no ko no hoka ni wa, dare mo ten ni nobotta mono wa nai.
Soshite, choudo Moose ga arano de hebi o ageta you ni, hito no ko mo mata agerarenakereba naranai.
Sore wa kare o shinjiru mono ga, subete eien no inochi o eru tame de aru".
Kami wa sono hitori ko o tamawatta hodo ni, konoyo o aishite kudasatta. Sore wa miko o shinjiru mono ga hitori mo horobinaide, eien no inochi o eru tame de aru.
Kami ga miko o yo ni tsukawasareta no wa, yo o sabaku tame de wa naku, miko ni yotte, konoyo ga sukuwareru tame de aru.
Kare o shinjiru mono wa, sabakarenai. Shinjinai mono wa, sudeni sabakarete iru. Kami no hitori ko no na o shinjiru koto o shinaikara de aru.
Sono sabaki to iu no wa, hikari ga konoyo ni kita no ni, hitobito wa sono okonai ga warui tame ni, hikari yori mo yami no hou o aishita koto de aru.
Aku o okonatte iru mono wa mina hikari o nikumu. Soshite, sono okonai ga akarumi ni dasareru no o osorete, hikari ni koyou to wa shinai.
Shikashi, shinri o okonatte iru mono wa hikari ni kuru. Sono hito no okonai no, kami ni atte nasareta to iu koto ga, akiraka ni sareru tame de aru.
Kono nochi, Iesu wa deshitachi to Yudaya no chi ni iki, karera to issho ni soko ni taizai shite, baputesuma o sazukete orareta.
Yohane mo Sarimu ni chikai Ainon de, baputesuma o sazukete ita. Soko ni wa mizu ga takusan attakara de aru. Hitobito ga zokuzoku to yatte kite baputesuma o ukete ita.
Sono toki, Yohane wa mada goku ni irerarete wa inakatta.
Tokoro ga, Yohane no deshitachi to hitori no Yudayajin to no aida ni, kiyome no koto de souron ga okotta.
Soko de karera wa Yohane no tokoro ni kite itta, "Sensei, goran kudasai. Yorudan no mukou de anata to issho ni ita koto ga ari, soshite, anata ga akashi o shite orareta ano kata ga, baputesuma o sazukete ori, mina no mono ga, sono kata no tokoro e dekakete imasu".
Yohane wa kotaete itta, "Hito wa ten kara ataerarenakereba, nanimono mo ukeru koto wa dekinai.
'Watashi wa Kirisuto de wa naku, sono kata yori mo saki ni tsukawasareta mono de aru' to itta koto o akashi shite kureru no wa, anata gata jishin de aru.
Hanayome o motsu mono wa hanamuko de aru. Hanamuko no yuujin wa tatte kare no koe o kiki, sono koe o kiite ooini yorokobu. Kou shite, kono yorokobi wa watashi ni michitarite iru.
Kare wa kanarazu sakae, watashi wa otoroeru.
Ue kara kuru mono wa, subete no mono no ue ni aru. Chi kara deru mono wa, chi ni zokusuru mono de atte, chi no koto o kataru. Ten kara kuru mono wa, subete no mono no ue ni aru.
Kare wa sono mita tokoro, kiita tokoro o akashi shite iruga, dare mo sono akashi o ukeirenai.
Shikashi, sono akashi o ukeireru mono wa, kami ga makoto de aru koto o, tashika ni mitometa no de aru.
Kami ga otsukawashi ni natta kata wa, kami no kotoba o kataru. Kami wa seirei o kagirinaku tamaukara de aru.
Chichi wa miko o aishite, banbutsu o sono te ni oatae ni natta.
Miko o shinjiru mono wa eien no inochi o motsu. Miko ni shitagawanai mono wa, inochi ni azukaru koto ga nai bakari ka, kami no ikari ga sono ue ni todomaru no de aru".
Iesu ga, Yohane yori mo ooku deshi o tsukuri, mata baputesuma o sazukete orareru to iu koto o, Parisaibitotachi ga kiki, sore o Shu ga shirareta toki,
(shikashi, Iesu mizukara ga, baputesuma o osazuke ni natta no de wa naku, sono deshitachi de atta)
Yudaya o satte, mata Gariraya e ikareta.
Shikashi, Iesu wa Samariya o tsuuka shinakereba naranakatta.
Soko de, Iesu wa Samariya no Sukaru to iu machi ni oide ni natta. Kono machi wa, Yakobu ga sono ko Yosefu ni ataeta tochi no chikaku ni attaga,
Soko ni Yakobu no ido ga atta. Iesu wa tabi no tsukare o oboete, sono mama, kono ido no soba ni suwatte orareta. Toki wa hiru no juu ni ji goro de atta.
Hitori no Samariya no onna ga mizu o kumi ni kita no de, Iesu wa kono onna ni, "Mizu o nomasete kudasai" to iwareta.
Deshitachi wa shokumotsu o kai ni machi ni itte ita no de aru.
Suruto, Samariya no onna wa Iesu ni itta, "Anata wa Yudayajin de arinagara, dou shite Samariya no onna no watashi ni, nomasete kure to ossharu no desu ka". Kore wa, Yudayajin wa Samariyabito to kousai shite inakattakara de aru.
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Moshi anata ga kami no tamamono no koto o shiri, mata, 'Mizu o nomasete kure' to itta mono ga, dare de aru ka shitte itanaraba, anata no hou kara negaidete, sono hito kara ikeru mizu o moratta koto de arou".
Onna wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, anata wa, kumu mono o omochi ni narazu, sono ue, ido wa fukai no desu. Sono ikeru mizu o, doko kara te ni ireru no desu ka.
Anata wa, kono ido o kudasatta watashitachi no chichi Yakobu yori mo, erai kata na no desu ka. Yakobu jishin mo nomi, sono kora mo, sono kachiku mo, kono ido kara nonda no desuga".
Iesu wa onna ni kotaete iwareta, "Kono mizu o nomu mono wa dare de mo, mata kawakude arou.
Shikashi, watashi ga ataeru mizu o nomu mono wa, itsu made mo, kawaku koto ga nai bakari ka, watashi ga ataeru mizu wa, sono hito no uchi de izumi to nari, eien no inochi ni itaru mizu ga, wakiagarude arou".
Onna wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, watashi ga kawaku koto ga naku, mata, koko ni kumi ni konakute mo yoi you ni, sono mizu o watashi ni kudasai".
Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Anata no otto o yobi ni itte, koko ni tsurete ki nasai".
Onna wa kotaete itta, "Watashi ni wa otto wa arimasen". Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Otto ga nai to itta no wa, mottomo da.
Anata ni wa gonin no otto ga attaga, ima no wa anata no otto de wa nai. Anata no kotoba no toori de aru".
Onna wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, watashi wa anata o yogensha to mimasu.
Watashitachi no senzo wa, kono yama de reihai o shita no desuga, anata gata wa reihai subeki basho wa, Erusaremu ni aru to itte imasu".
Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Onna yo, watashi no iu koto o shinji nasai. Anata ga taga, kono yama de mo, mata Erusaremu de mo nai tokoro de, chichi o reihai suru toki ga kuru.
Anata gata wa jibun no shiranai mono o ogande iruga, watashitachi wa shitte iru kata o reihai shite iru. Sukui wa Yudayajin kara kurukara de aru.
Shikashi, makoto no reihai o suru monotachi ga, rei to makoto to o motte chichi o reihai suru toki ga kuru. Sou da, ima kite iru. Chichi wa, kono you na reihai o suru monotachi o motomete orarerukara de aru.
Kami wa rei de arukara, reihai o suru mono mo, rei to makoto to o motte reihai subekide aru".
Onna wa Iesu ni itta, "Watashi wa, Kirisuto to yobareru Meshiya ga korareru koto o shitte imasu. Sono kata ga koraretanaraba, watashitachi ni, issai no koto o shirasete kudasarudeshou".
Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Anata to hanashi o shite iru kono watashi ga, sore de aru".
Sono toki, deshitachi ga kaette kite, Iesu ga hitori no onna to hanashite orareru no o mite fushigi ni omottaga, shikashi, "Nani o motomete oraremasu ka" to mo, "Nani o kanojo to hanashite orareru no desu ka" to mo, tazuneru mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Kono onna wa mizugame o sono mama soko ni oite machi ni iki, hitobito ni itta,
"Watashi no shita koto o nani mo ka mo, iiateta hito ga imasu. Saa, mi ni kite goran nasai. Moshi ka shitara, kono hito ga Kirisuto ka mo shiremasen".
Hitobito wa machi o dete, zokuzoku to Iesu no tokoro e itta.
Sono aida ni deshitachi wa Iesu ni, "Sensei, meshiagatte kudasai" to susumeta.
Tokoro ga, Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi ni wa, anata gata no shiranai shokumotsu ga aru".
Soko de, deshitachi ga tagai ni itta, "Dare ka ga, nani ka taberu mono o motte kite sashiageta no de arou ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi no shokumotsu to iu no wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no mikokoro o okonai, sono miwaza o nashitogeru koto de aru.
Anata gata wa, kariire toki ga kuru made ni wa, mada yon kagetsu aruto, itte irude wa nai ka. Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata ni iu. Me o agete hatake o mi nasai. Haya irozuite kariire o matte iru.
Karu mono wa houshuu o ukete, eien no inochi ni itaru mi o atsumete iru. Makumono mo karu mono mo, tomodomo ni yorokobu tame de aru.
Soko de, 'Hitori ga maki, hitori ga karu' to iu kotowaza ga, hontou no koto to naru.
Watashi wa, anatagata o tsukawashite, anata gata ga sono tame ni rouku shinakatta mono o karitoraseta. Hoka no hitobito ga rouku shi, anata gata wa, karera no rouku no mi ni azukatte iru no de aru".
Sate, kono machi kara kita ooku no Samariyahito wa, "Kono hito wa, watashi no shita koto o nani mo ka mo iiateta" to akashi shita onna no kotoba ni yotte, Iesu o shinjita.
Soko de, Samariyahitotachi wa Iesu no moto ni kite, jibuntachi no tokoro ni taizai shite itadakitai to negatta no de, Iesu wa soko ni futsu ka taizai sareta.
Soshite nao ooku no hitobito ga, Iesu no kotoba o kiite shinjita.
Karera wa onna ni itta, "Watashitachi ga shinjiru no wa, mou anata ga hanashite kuretakara de wa nai. Jibun jishin de shitashiku kiite, kono hito koso makoto ni yo no sukuinushi de aru koto ga, wakattakara de aru".
Futsu ka no nochi ni, Iesu wa koko o satte Gariraya e ikareta.
Iesu wa mizukara hakkiri, "Yogensha wa jibun no kokyou de wa uyamawarenai mono da" to iwareta no de aru.
Gariraya ni tsukareruto, Gariraya no hitotachi wa Iesu o kangei shita. Sore wa, karera mo matsuri ni itte ita no de, sono matsuri no toki, Iesu ga Erusaremu de nasareta koto o kotogotoku mite itakara de aru.
Iesu wa, mata Gariraya no Kana ni ikareta. Soko wa, katsute mizu o budoushu ni kaerareta tokoro de aru. Tokoro ga, byouki o shite iru musuko o motsu aru yakunin ga Kapenaumu ni ita.
Kono hito ga, Yudaya kara Gariraya ni Iesu no kite orareru koto o kiki, mimoto ni kite, Kapenaumu ni kudatte, kare no ko o naoshite itadakitai to, negatta. Sono ko ga shinikakatte itakara de aru.
Soko de, Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa, shirushi to kiseki to o minai kagiri, kesshite shinjinaidarou".
Kono yakunin wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, douzo, kodomo ga shinanai uchi ni kite kudasai".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Okaeri nasai. Anata no musuko wa tasukaru no da". Kare wa jibun ni iwareta Iesu no kotoba o shinjite kaette itta.
Sono kudatte iku tochuu, shimobetachi ga kare ni deai, sono ko ga tasukatta koto o tsugeta.
Soko de, kare wa shimobetachi ni, sono naori hajimeta jikoku o tazunete mitara, "Kinou no gogo ichi ji ni netsu ga hikimashita" to kotaeta.
Sore wa, Iesu ga "Anata no musuko wa tasukaru no da" to iwareta no to onaji jikoku de atta koto o, kono chichi wa shitte, kare jishin mo sono kazoku ichidou mo shinjita.
Kore wa, Iesu ga Yudaya kara Gariraya ni kite nasareta daini no shirushi de aru.
Kono nochi, Yudayajin no matsuri ga atta no de, Iesu wa Erusaremu ni noborareta.
Erusaremu ni aru hitsuji no mon no soba ni, Heburu go de Betesuda to yobareru ike ga atta. Soko ni wa itsutsu no rou ga atta.
Sono rou no naka ni wa, byounin, moujin, ashi nae, yaseotoroeta mono nado ga, oozei karada o yokotaete ita. [karera wa mizu no ugoku no o matte ita no de aru.]
Sore wa, tokidoki, Shu no mitsukai ga kono ike ni orite kite mizu o ugokasu koto ga aruga, mizu ga ugoita toki massaki ni hairu mono wa, donna byouki ni kakatte ite mo, iyasaretakara de aru.]
Sate, soko ni sanjuu hachi nen no aida, byouki ni nayande iru hito ga atta.
Iesu wa sono hito ga yoko ni natte iru no o mi, mata nagai aida wazuratte ita no o shitte, sono hito ni "Naoritai no ka" to iwareta.
Kono byounin wa Iesu ni kotaeta, "Shu yo, mizu ga ugoku toki ni, watashi o ike no naka ni irete kureru hito ga imasen. Watashi ga hairi kakeruto, hoka no hito ga saki ni orite iku no desu".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Okite, anata no toko o toriage, soshite aruki nasai".
Suruto, kono hito wa sugu ni iyasare, toko o toriagete aruite itta. Sono hi wa ansokunichi de atta.
Soko de Yudayajintachi wa, sono iyasareta hito ni itta, "Kyou wa ansokunichi da. Toko o toriageru no wa, yoroshiku nai".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Watashi o naoshite kudasatta kata ga, toko o toriagete aruke to, watashi ni iwaremashita".
Karera wa tazuneta, "Toriagete aruke to itta hito wa, dare ka".
Shikashi, kono iyasareta hito wa, sore ga dare de aru ka shiranakatta. Gunshuu ga sono ba ni ita no de, Iesu wa sotto dete ikaretakara de aru.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa miya de sono hito ni deatta no de, kare ni iwareta, "Goran, anata wa yoku natta. Mou tsumi o okashite wa ikenai. Nani ka motto warui koto ga, anata no mi ni okoru ka mo shirenaikara".
Kare wa dete itte, jibun o iyashita no wa Iesu de atta to, Yudayajintachi ni tsugeta.
Sono tame Yudayajintachi wa, ansokunichi ni kono you na koto o shita to itte, Iesu o semeta.
Soko de, Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Watashi no chichi wa ima ni itaru made hataraite orareru. Watashi mo hataraku no de aru".
Kono tame ni Yudayajintachi wa, masumasu Iesu o korosou to hakaru you ni natta. Sore wa, Iesu ga ansokunichi o yaburareta bakari de wa naku, kami o jibun no chichi to yonde, jibun o kami to hitoshii mono to saretakara de aru.
Sate, Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Ko wa chichi no nasaru koto o mite suru igai ni, jibun kara wa nanigoto mo suru koto ga dekinai. Chichi no nasaru koto de areba subete, ko mo sono toori ni suru no de aru.
Naze nara, chichi wa ko o aishite, mizukara nasaru koto wa, subete ko ni oshimeshi ni narukara de aru. Soshite, sore yori mo nao ookina waza o, oshimeshi ni narude arou. Anata ga taga, sore ni yotte fushigi ni omou tame de aru.
Sunawachi, chichi ga shinin o okoshite inochi o oatae ni naru you ni, ko mo mata, sono kokoro ni kanau hitobito ni inochi o ataerude arou.
Chichi wa dare o mo sabakanai. Sabaki no koto wa subete, ko ni yudaneraretakara de aru.
Sore wa, subete no hito ga chichi o uyamauto douyou ni, ko o uyamau tame de aru. Ko o uyamawanai mono wa, ko o tsukawasareta chichi o mo uyamawanai.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Watashi no kotoba o kiite, watashi o tsukawasareta kata o shinjiru mono wa, eien no inochi o uke, mata sabakareru koto ga naku, shi kara inochi ni utsutte iru no de aru.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Shinda hitotachi ga, kami no ko no koe o kiku toki ga kuru. Ima sudeni kite iru. Soshite kiku hito wa ikirude arou.
Sore wa, chichi ga gojibun no uchi ni seimei o omochi ni natte iruto douyou ni, ko ni mo mata, jibun no uchi ni seimei o motsu koto o oyurushi ni nattakara de aru.
Soshite ko wa hito no ko de arukara, ko ni sabaki o okonau ken'i o oatae ni natta.
Kono koto o odoroku ni wa oyobanai. Haka no naka ni iru monotachi ga mina kami no ko no koe o kiki,
Zen o okonatta hitobito wa, seimei o ukeru tame ni yomigaeri, aku o okonatta hitobito wa, sabaki o ukeru tame ni yomigaette, sorezore dete kuru toki ga kurude arou.
Watashi wa, jibun kara wa nanigoto mo suru koto ga dekinai. Tada kiku mama ni sabaku no de aru. Soshite, watashi no kono sabaki wa tadashii. Sore wa, watashi jishin no kangae de suru no de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no, mimune o motomete irukara de aru.
Moshi, watashi ga jibun jishin ni tsuite akashi o surunaraba, watashi no akashi wa hontou de wa nai.
Watashi ni tsuite akashi o suru kataha hoka ni ari, soshite, sono hito ga suru akashi ga hontou de aru koto o, watashi wa shitte iru.
Anata gata wa Yohane no moto e hito o tsukawashitaga, sono toki kare wa shinri ni tsuite akashi o shita.
Watashi wa hito kara akashi o ukenaiga, kono koto o iu no wa, anata gata ga sukuwareru tame de aru.
Yohane wa moete kagayaku akari de atta. Anata gata wa, shibaraku no aida sono hikari o yorokobitanoshimou to shita.
Shikashi, watashi ni wa, Yohane no akashi yori mo, motto chikara aru akashi ga aru. Chichi ga watashi ni jouju saseyou to shite oatae ni natta waza, sunawachi, ima watashi ga shite iru kono waza ga, chichi no watashi o tsukawasareta koto o akashi shite iru.
Mata, watashi o tsukawasareta chichi mo, gojibun de watashi ni tsuite akashi o sareta. Anata gata wa, mada sono mikoe o kiita koto mo naku, sono misugata o mita koto mo nai.
Mata, kami ga tsukawasareta mono o shinjinaikara, kami no mikotoba wa anata gata no uchi ni todomatte inai.
Anata gata wa, seisho no naka ni eien no inochi ga aru to omotte shirabete iruga, kono seisho wa, watashi ni tsuite akashi o suru mono de aru.
Shikamo, anata gata wa, inochi o eru tame ni watashi no moto ni koyou to mo shinai.
Watashi wa hito kara no homare o ukeru koto wa shinai.
Shikashi, anata gata no uchi ni wa kami o aisuru ai ga nai koto o shitte iru.
Watashi wa chichi no na ni yotte kita no ni, anata gata wa watashi o ukeirenai. Moshi, hoka no hito ga kare jishin no na ni yotte kurunaraba, sono hito o ukeireru no de arou.
Tagai ni homare o ukenagara, tada hitori no kami kara no homare o motomeyou to shinai anata gata wa, dou shite shinjiru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Watashi ga anata gata no koto o chichi ni uttaeruto, kangaete wa ikenai. Anatagata o uttaeru mono wa, anata gata ga tanomi to shite iru Moose sono hito de aru.
Moshi, anata gata ga Moose o shinjitanaraba, watashi o mo shinjitade arou. Moose wa, watashi ni tsuite kaita no de aru.
Shikashi, Moose no kaita mono o shinjinainaraba, dou shite watashi no kotoba o shinjirudarou ka".
Sono nochi, Iesu wa Gariraya no umi, sunawachi, Teberiyamizuumi no mukougishi e watarareta.
Suruto, oozei no gunshuu ga Iesu ni tsuite kita. Byounintachi ni nasatte ita shirushi o mitakara de aru.
Iesu wa yama ni nobotte, deshitachi to issho ni soko de za ni tsukareta.
Toki ni, Yudayajin no matsuri de aru sugikoshi ga majika ni natte ita.
Iesu wa me o age, oozei no gunshuu ga jibun no hou ni atsumatte kuru no o mite, Piripo ni iwareta, "Doko kara pan o katte kite, kono hitobito ni tabesaseyou ka".
Kore wa Piripo o tamesou to shite iwareta no de atte, gojibun de wa shiyou to suru koto o, yoku goshouchi de atta.
Suruto, Piripo wa Iesu ni kotaeta, "Nihyaku denari no pan ga atte mo, meimei ga sukoshi zutsu itadaku ni mo tarimasumai".
Deshi no hitori, Shimon Petero no kyoudai Andere ga Iesu ni itta,
"Koko ni, oomugi no pan itsutsu to, sakana nihiki to o motte iru kodomo ga imasu. Shikashi, konna ni oozei no hito de wa, sore ga nani ni narimashou".
Iesu wa "Hitobito o suwarase nasai" to iwareta. Sono basho ni wa kusa ga ookatta. Soko ni suwatta otoko no kazu wa gosennin hodo de atta.
Soko de, Iesu wa pan o tori, kansha shite kara, suwatte iru hitobito ni wakeatae, mata, sakana o mo douyou ni shite, karera no nozomu dake wakeataerareta.
Hitobito ga juubun ni tabeta nochi, Iesu wa deshitachi ni iwareta, "Sukoshi de mo muda ni naranai you ni, pan kuzu no amari o atsume nasai".
Soko de karera ga atsumeruto, itsutsu no oomugi no pan o tabete nokotta pan kuzu wa, juu ni no kago ni ippai ni natta.
Hitobito wa Iesu no nasatta kono shirushi o mite, "Hontou ni, kono hito koso yo ni kitarubeki yogensha de aru" to itta.
Iesu wa hitobito ga kite, jibun o toraete ou ni shiyou to shite iru to shitte, tada hitori, mata yama ni shirizokareta.
Yuugata ni natta toki, deshitachi wa umibe ni kudari,
Fune ni notte umi o watari, mukougishi no Kapenaumu ni ikikaketa. Sudeni kuraku natte ita no ni, Iesu wa mada karera no tokoro ni oide ni naranakatta.
Sono ue, tsuyoi kaze ga fuite kite, umi wa are dashita.
Yon, gojuu chou kogidashita toki, Iesu ga umi no ue o aruite fune ni chikazuite korareru no o mite, karera wa osoreta.
Suruto, Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi da, osoreru koto wa nai".
Soko de, karera wa yorokonde Iesu o fune ni mukaeyou to shita. Suru to fune wa, sugu, karera ga ikou to shite ita chi ni tsuita.
Sono yokujitsu, umi no mukougishi ni tatte ita gunshuu wa, soko ni kobune ga issou shika naku, mata Iesu wa deshitachi to issho ni kobune ni onori ni narazu, tada deshitachi dake ga funade shita no o mita.
Shikashi, suusou no kobune ga Teberiya kara kite, Shu ga kansha sareta nochi pan o hitobito ni tabesaseta basho ni chikazuita.
Gunshuu wa, Iesu mo deshitachi mo soko ni inai to shitte, sorera no kobune ni nori, Iesu o tazunete Kapenaumu ni itta.
Soshite, umi no mukougishi de Iesu ni deatta no de itta, "Sensei, itsu, koko ni oide ni natta no desu ka".
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Anata gata ga watashi o tazunete kite iru no wa, shirushi o mita tame de wa naku, pan o tabete manpuku shitakara de aru.
Kuchiru shokumotsu no tame de wa naku, eien no inochi ni itaru kuchinai shokumotsu no tame ni hataraku ga yoi. Kore wa hito no ko ga anata gata ni ataeru mono de aru. Chichi naru kami wa, hito no ko ni sore o yudanerareta no de aru".
Soko de, karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Kami no waza o okonau tame ni, watashitachi wa nani o shitara yoideshou ka".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Kami ga tsukawasareta mono o shinjiru koto ga, kami no waza de aru".
Karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Watashitachi ga mite anata o shinjiru tame ni, donna shirushi o okonatte kudasaimasu ka. Donna koto o shite kudasaimasu ka.
Watashitachi no senzo wa arano de mana o tabemashita. Sore wa 'Ten yori no pan o karera ni ataete tabesaseta' to kaite aru toori desu".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Yokuyoku itte oku. Ten kara no pan o anata gata ni ataeta no wa, Moose de wa nai. Ten kara no makoto no pan o anata gata ni ataeru no wa, watashi no chichi na no de aru.
Kami no pan wa, ten kara kudatte kite, konoyo ni inochi o ataeru mono de aru".
Karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, sono pan o itsu mo watashitachi ni kudasai".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ga inochi no pan de aru. Watashi ni kuru mono wa kesshite ueru koto ga naku, watashi o shinjiru mono wa kesshite kawaku koto ga nai.
Shikashi, anata gata ni ittaga, anata gata wa watashi o mita no ni shinjiyou to wa shinai.
Chichi ga watashi ni ataete kudasaru mono wa mina, watashi ni kurude arou. Soshite, watashi ni kuru mono o kesshite kobami wa shinai.
Watashi ga ten kara kudatte kita no wa, jibun no kokoro no mama o okonau tame de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no mikokoro o okonau tame de aru.
Watashi o tsukawasareta kata no mikokoro wa, watashi ni ataete kudasatta mono o, watashi ga hitori mo ushinawazu ni, owari no hi ni yomigaeraseru koto de aru.
Watashi no chichi no mikokoro wa, ko o mite shinjiru mono ga, kotogotoku eien no inochi o eru koto na no de aru. Soshite, watashi wa sono hitobito o owari no hi ni yomigaeraserude arou".
Yudayajinra wa, Iesu ga "Watashi wa ten kara kudatte kita pan de aru" to iwareta no de, Iesu ni tsuite tsubuyaki hajimeta.
Soshite itta, "Kore wa Yosefu no ko Iesu de wa nai ka. Watashitachi wa sono fubo o shitte irude wa nai ka. Watashi wa ten kara kudatte kita to, dou shite ima iu no ka".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Tagai ni tsubuyaite wa ikenai.
Watashi o tsukawasareta chichi ga hikiyosete kudasaranakereba, dare mo watashi ni kuru koto wa dekinai. Watashi wa, sono hitobito o owari no hi ni yomigaeraserude arou.
Yogensha no sho ni, 'Karera wa mina kami ni oshierarerude arou' to kaite aru. Chichi kara kiite mananda mono wa, mina watashi ni kuru no de aru.
Kami kara deta mono no hoka ni, dare ka ga chichi o mita no de wa nai. Sono mono dake ga chichi o mita no de aru.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Shinjiru mono ni wa eien no inochi ga aru.
Watashi wa inochi no pan de aru.
Anata gata no senzo wa arano de mana o tabetaga, shinde shimatta.
Shikashi, ten kara kudatte kita pan o taberu hito wa, kesshite shinu koto wa nai.
Watashi wa ten kara kudatte kita ikita pan de aru. Sore o taberu mono wa, itsu made mo ikirude arou. Watashi ga ataeru pan wa, yo no inochi no tame ni ataeru watashi no niku de aru".
Soko de, Yudayajinra ga tagai ni ronjite itta, "Kono hito wa dou shite, jibun no niku o watashitachi ni ataete tabesaseru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Yokuyoku itte oku. Hito no ko no niku o tabezu, mata, sono chi o nomanakereba, anata gata no uchi ni inochi wa nai.
Watashi no niku o tabe, watashi no chi o nomu mono ni wa, eien no inochi ga ari, watashi wa sono hito o owari no hi ni yomigaeraserude arou.
Watashi no niku wa makoto no shokumotsu, watashi no chi wa makoto no nomimono de aru.
Watashi no niku o tabe, watashi no chi o nomu mono wa watashi ni ori, watashi mo mata sono hito ni oru.
Ikeru chichi ga watashi o tsukawasare, mata, watashi ga chichi ni yotte ikite iru you ni, watashi o taberu mono mo watashi ni yotte ikirude arou.
Ten kara kudatte kita pan wa, senzotachi ga tabetaga shinde shimatta you na mono de wa nai. Kono pan o taberu mono wa, itsu made mo ikirude arou".
Korera no koto wa, Iesu ga Kapenaumu no kaidou de oshiete orareta toki ni iwareta mono de aru.
Deshitachi no uchi no ooku no mono wa, kore o kiite itta, "Kore wa, hidoi kotoba da. Dare ga sonna koto o kiite orareyou ka".
Shikashi Iesu wa, deshitachi ga sono koto de tsubuyaite iru no o miyabutte, karera ni iwareta, "Kono koto ga anata gata no tsumazuki ni naru no ka.
Sore de wa, moshi hito no ko ga mae ni ita tokoro ni noboru no o mitara, dou naru no ka.
Hito o ikasu mono wa rei de atte, niku wa nan no yaku ni mo tatanai. Watashi ga anata gata ni hanashita kotoba wa rei de ari, mata inochi de aru.
Shikashi, anata gata no naka ni wa shinjinai mono ga iru". Iesu wa, hajime kara, dare ga shinjinai ka, mata, dare ga kare o uragiru ka o shitte orareta no de aru.
Soshite Iesu wa iwareta, "Sore dakara, chichi ga ataete kudasatta mono de nakereba, watashi ni kuru koto wa dekinaito, itta no de aru".
Sore irai, ooku no deshitachi wa satte itte, mohaya Iesu to koudou o tomo ni shinakatta.
Soko de Iesu wa juu ni deshi ni iwareta, "Anata gata mo sarou to suru no ka".
Shimon Petero ga kotaeta, "Shu yo, watashitachi wa, dare no tokoro ni ikimashou. Eien no inochi no kotoba o motte iru no wa anata desu.
Watashitachi wa, anata ga kami no seija de aru koto o shinji, mata shitte imasu".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Anata gata juu ninin o eranda no wa, watashi de wa nakatta ka. Sore da no ni, anata gata no uchi no hitori wa akuma de aru".
Kore wa, Isukariote no Shimon no ko Yuda o sashite iwareta no de aru. Kono Yuda wa, juu ni deshi no hitori de arinagara, Iesu o uragirou to shite ita.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa Gariraya o junkai shite orareta. Yudayajintachi ga jibun o korosou to shite ita no de, Yudaya o junkai shiyou to wa sarenakatta.
Toki ni, Yudayajin no kariio no matsuri ga chikazuite ita.
Soko de, Iesu no kyoudaitachi ga Iesu ni itta, "Anata ga shite orareru waza o deshitachi ni mo miseru tame ni, koko o sari Yudaya ni itte wa ikaga desu.
Jibun o ooyakeke ni arawasou to omotte iru hito de, kakurete shigoto o suru mono wa arimasen. Anata ga korera no koto o surukara ni wa, jibun o hakkiri to yo ni arawashi nasai".
Kou itta no wa, kyoudaitachi mo Iesu o shinjite inakattakara de aru.
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi no toki wa mada kite inai. Shikashi, anata gata no toki wa itsu mo sonawatte iru.
Yo wa anatagata o nikumi enaiga, watashi o nikunde iru. Watashi ga yo no okonai no warui koto o, akashi shite irukara de aru.
Anata gata koso matsuri ni iki nasai. Watashi wa kono matsuri ni wa ikanai. Watashi no toki wa mada michite inaikara".
Karera ni kou itte, Iesu wa Gariraya ni todomatte orareta.
Shikashi, kyoudaitachi ga matsuri ni itta ato de, Iesu mo hitome ni tatanu you ni, hisoka ni ikareta.
Yudayajinra wa matsuri no toki ni, "Ano hito wa doko ni iru no ka" to itte, Iesu o sagashite ita.
Gunshuu no naka ni, Iesu ni tsuite iroiro to uwasa ga tatta. Aru hitobito wa, "Are wa yoi hito da" to ii, ta no hitobito wa, "Iya, are wa gunshuu o madowashite iru" to itta.
Shikashi, Yudayajinra o osorete, Iesu no koto o kouzen to kuchi ni suru mono wa inakatta.
Matsuri mo nakaba ni natte kara, Iesu wa miya ni nobotte oshie hajimerareta.
Suruto, Yudayajintachi wa odoroite itta, "Kono hito wa gakumon o shita koto mo nai no ni, dou shite rippou no chishiki o motte iru no darou".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Watashi no oshie wa watashi jishin no oshie de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no oshie de aru.
Kami no mikokoro o okonaou to omou mono de areba, dare de mo, watashi no katatte iru kono oshie ga kami kara no mono ka, sore to mo, watashi jishin kara deta mono ka, wakarude arou.
Jibun kara deta koto o kataru mono wa, jibun no eikou o motomeruga, jibun o tsukawasareta kata no eikou o motomeru mono wa shinjitsu de atte, sono hito no uchi ni wa itsuwari ga nai.
Moose wa anata gata ni rippou o ataetade wa nai ka. Sore da no ni, anata gata no uchi ni wa, sono rippou o okonau mono ga hitori mo nai. Anata gata wa, naze watashi o korosou to omotte iru no ka".
Gunshuu wa kotaeta, "Anata wa akurei ni toritsukarete iru. Dare ga anata o korosou to omotte iru mono ka".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Watashi ga hitotsu no waza o shita tokoro, anata gata wa mina sore o mite odoroite iru.
Moose wa anata gata ni katsurei o meijita no de, (kore wa, jitsu wa, Moose kara hajimatta no de wa naku, senzotachi kara hajimatta mono de aru) anata gata wa ansokunichi ni mo hito ni katsurei o hodokoshite iru.
Moshi, Moose no rippou ga yaburarenai you ni, ansokunichi de atte mo katsurei o ukeru no nara, ansokunichi ni hito no zenshin o joubu ni shite yattakara to itte, dou shite, sonna ni okoru no ka.
Uwabe de hito o sabakanaide, tadashii sabaki o suru ga yoi".
Sate, Erusaremu no aru hitotachi ga itta, "Kono hito wa hitobito ga korosou to omotte iru mono de wa nai ka.
Miyo, kare wa kouzen to katatte iru no ni, hitobito wa kore ni taishite nani mo iwanai. Yakunintachi wa, kono hito ga Kirisuto de aru koto o, hontou ni shitte iru no de wa nakarou ka.
Watashitachi wa kono hito ga doko kara kita no ka shitte iru. Shikashi, Kirisuto ga arawareru toki ni wa, doko kara kuru no ka shitte iru mono wa, hitori mo inai".
Iesu wa miya no uchi de oshienagara, sakende iwareta, "Anata gata wa, watashi o shitte ori, mata, watashi ga doko kara kita ka mo shitte iru. Shikashi, watashi wa jibun kara kita no de wa nai. Watashi o tsukawasareta kata wa shinjitsu de aruga, anata gata wa, sono kata o shiranai.
Watashi wa, sono kata o shitte iru. Watashi wa sono kata no moto kara kita mono de, sono kata ga watashi o tsukawasareta no de aru".
Soko de hitobito wa Iesu o toraeyou to hakattaga, dare hitori te o kakeru mono wa nakatta. Iesu no toki ga, mada kite inakattakara de aru.
Shikashi, gunshuu no naka no ooku no mono ga, Iesu o shinjite itta, "Kirisuto ga kite mo, kono hito ga okonatta yori mo ooku no shirushi o okonaudarou ka".
Gunshuu ga Iesu ni tsuite kono you na uwasa o shite iru no o, Parisaibitotachi wa mimi ni shita. Soko de, saishichou tachi ya Parisaibitotachi wa, Iesu o toraeyou to shite, shitayakudomo o tsukawashita.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Ima shibaraku no aida, watashi wa anata gata to issho ni ite, sore kara, watashi o otsukawashi ni natta kata no mimoto ni iku.
Anata gata wa watashi o sagasude arouga, mitsukeru koto wa dekinai. Soshite watashi no iru tokoro ni, anata gata wa kuru koto ga dekinai".
Soko de Yudayajintachi wa tagai ni itta, "Watashitachi ga mitsukeru koto ga dekinai to iu no wa, doko e ikou to shite iru no darou. Girishiyajin no naka ni risan shite iru hitotachi no tokoro ni de mo itte, Girishiyajin o oshieyou to iu no darou ka.
Mata, 'Watashi o sagasuga, mitsukeru koto wa dekinai. Soshite watashi no iru tokoro ni wa kuru koto ga dekinaidarou' to itta sono kotoba wa, dou iu imi darou".
Matsuri no owari no daiji na hi ni, Iesu wa tatte, sakende iwareta, "Dare de mo kawaku mono wa, watashi no tokoro ni kite nomu ga yoi.
Watashi o shinjiru mono wa, seisho ni kaite aru to ori, sono hara kara ikeru mizu ga kawa to natte narederude arou".
Kore wa, Iesu o shinjiru hitobito ga ukeyou to shite iru mitama o sashite iwareta no de aru. Sunawachi, Iesu wa mada eikou o ukete orarenakatta no de, mitama ga mada kudatte inakatta no de aru.
Gunshuu no aru mono ga korera no kotoba o kiite, "Konokata wa, hontou ni, ano yogensha de aru" to ii,
Hoka no hitotachi wa "Konokata wa Kirisuto de aru" to ii, mata, aru hitobito wa, "Kirisuto wa masaka, Gariraya kara wa dete konaidarou.
Kirisuto wa, Dabide no shison kara, mata Dabide no ita Betsurehemu no mura kara deruto, seisho ni kaite aru de wa nai ka" to itta.
Kou shite, gunshuu no aida ni Iesu no koto de bunsou ga shoujita.
Karera no uchi no aru hitobito wa, Iesu o toraeyou to omottaga, dare hitori te o kakeru mono wa nakatta.
Sate, shitayakudomo ga saishichou tachi ya Parisaibitotachi no tokoro ni kaette kita no de, karera wa sono shitayakudomo ni itta, "Naze, ano hito o tsurete konakatta no ka".
Shitayakudomo wa kotaeta, "Kono hito no kataru you ni katatta mono wa, kore made ni arimasendeshita".
Parisaibitotachi ga karera ni kotaeta, "Anata gata made ga, damasarete iru no de wa nai ka.
Yakunintachi ya Parisaibitotachi no naka de, hitori de mo kare o shinjita mono ga attadarou ka.
Rippou o wakimaenai kono gunshuu wa, norowarete iru".
Karera no naka no hitori de, izen ni Iesu ni ai ni kita koto no aru Nikodemo ga, karera ni itta,
"Watashitachi no rippou ni yoreba, mazu sono hito no iibun o kiki, sono hito no shita koto o shitta ue de nakereba, sabaku koto o shinai no de wa nai ka".
Karera wa kotaete itta, "Anata mo Garirayade na no ka. Yoku shirabete mi nasai, Gariraya kara wa yogensha ga deru mono de wa nai koto ga, wakarudarou". []
Soshite, hitobito wa onoono ie ni kaette itta.
Iesu wa oribuyama ni ikareta.
Asa hayaku mata miya ni wa irareruto, hitobito ga mina mimoto ni atsumatte kita no de, Iesu wa suwatte karera o oshiete orareta.
Suruto, rippougakusha tachi ya Parisaibitotachi ga, kan'in o shite iru toki ni tsukamaerareta onna o hippatte kite, naka ni tataseta ue, Iesu ni itta,
"Sensei, kono onna wa kan'in no ba de tsukamaeraremashita.
Moose wa rippou no naka de, kou iu onna o ishi de uchikorose to meijimashitaga, anata wa dou omoimasu ka".
Karera ga sou itta no wa, Iesu o tameshite, uttaeru koujitsu o eru tame de atta. Shikashi, Iesu wa mi o kagamete, yubi de jimen ni nani ka kaite orareta.
Karera ga toi tsuzukeru no de, Iesu wa mi o okoshite karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata no naka de tsumi no nai mono ga, mazu kono onna ni ishi o nagetsukeru ga yoi".
Soshite mata mi o kagamete, jimen ni mono o kaki tsuzukerareta.
Kore o kikuto, karera wa toshiyori kara hajimete, hitoribitori dete iki, tsuini, Iesu dake ni nari, onna wa naka ni ita mama nokosareta.
Soko de Iesu wa mi o okoshite onna ni iwareta, "Onna yo, minna wa doko ni iru ka. Anata o bassuru mono wa nakatta no ka".
Onna wa itta, "Shu yo, dare mo gozaimasen". Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi mo anata o basshinai. Okaeri nasai. Kongo wa mou tsumi o okasanai you ni".]
Iesu wa, mata hitobito ni katatte kou iwareta, "Watashi wa yo no hikari de aru. Watashi ni shitagatte kuru mono wa, yami no uchi o aruku koto ga naku, inochi no hikari o motsude arou".
Suruto Parisaibitotachi ga Iesu ni itta, "Anata wa, jibun no koto o akashi shite iru. Anata no akashi wa shinjitsu de wa nai".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaete iwareta, "Tatoi, watashi ga jibun no koto o akashi shite mo, watashi no akashi wa shinjitsu de aru. Sore wa, watashi ga doko kara kita no ka, mata, doko e iku no ka o shitte irukara de aru. Shikashi, anata gata wa, watashi ga doko kara kite, doko e iku no ka o shiranai.
Anata gata wa niku ni yotte hito o sabakuga, watashi wa dare mo sabakanai.
Shikashi, moshi watashi ga sabaku to sureba, watashi no sabaki wa tadashii. Naze nara, watashi wa hitori de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta kata ga, watashi to issho dakara de aru.
Anata gata no rippou ni wa, futari ni yoru shougen wa shinjitsu dato, kaite aru.
Watashi jishin no koto o akashi suru no wa, watashi de arushi, watashi o tsukawasareta chichi mo, watashi no koto o akashi shite kudasaru no de aru".
Suruto, karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Anata no chichi wa doko ni iru no ka". Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata gata wa, watashi o mo watashi no chichi o mo shitte inai. Moshi, anata gata ga watashi o shitte itanara, watashi no chichi o mo shitte itade arou".
Iesu ga miya no uchi de oshiete ita toki, korera no kotoba o saisen hako no soba de katarareta no de aruga, Iesu no toki ga mada kite inakatta no de, dare mo toraeru mono ga nakatta.
Sate, mata karera ni iwareta, "Watashi wa satte iku. Anata gata wa watashi o sagashimotomerude arou. Soshite jibun no tsumi no uchi ni shinude arou. Watashi no iku tokoro ni wa, anata gata wa kuru koto ga dekinai".
Soko de Yudayajintachi wa itta, "Watashi no iku tokoro ni, anata gata wa kuru koto ga dekinaito, itta no wa, aruiha jisatsu de mo shiyou to suru tsumori ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Anata gata wa shita kara deta mono daga, watashi wa ue kara kita mono de aru. Anata gata wa konoyo no mono de aruga, watashi wa konoyo no mono de wa nai.
Dakara watashi wa, anata gata wa jibun no tsumi no uchi ni shinude arouto, itta no de aru. Moshi watashi ga sou iu mono de aru koto o anata gata ga shinjinakereba, tsumi no uchi ni shinu koto ni narukara de aru".
Soko de karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Anata wa, ittai, dou iu kata desu ka". Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ga dou iu mono de aru ka wa, hajime kara anata gata ni itte irude wa nai ka.
Anata gata ni tsuite, watashi no iubeki koto, sabakubeki koto ga, takusan aru. Shikashi, watashi o tsukawasareta kata wa shinjitsu na kata de aru. Watashi wa, sono kata kara kiita mama o yo ni mukatte kataru no de aru".
Karera wa, Iesu ga chichi ni tsuite hanashite orareta koto o satoranakatta.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Anata gata ga hito no ko o agete shimatta nochi hajimete, watashi ga sou iu mono de aru koto, mata, watashi wa jibun kara wa nani mo sezu, tada chichi ga oshiete kudasatta mama o hanashite ita koto ga, wakatte kurude arou.
Watashi o tsukawasareta kata wa, watashi to issho ni orareru. Watashi wa, itsu mo kami no mikokoro ni kanau koto o shite irukara, watashi o hitori okizari ni nasaru koto wa nai".
Korera no koto o katarareta tokoro, ooku no hitobito ga Iesu o shinjita.
Iesu wa jibun o shinjita Yudayajintachi ni iwareta, "Moshi watashi no kotoba no uchi ni todomatte orunara, anata gata wa, hontou ni watashi no deshi na no de aru.
Mata shinri o shirude arou. Soshite shinri wa, anata gata ni jiyuu o esaserude arou".
Soko de, karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Watashitachi wa Aburahamu no shison de atte, hito no dorei ni natta koto nado wa, ichido mo nai. Dou shite, anata gata ni jiyuu o esaserude arouto, iwareru no ka".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Subete tsumi o okasu mono wa tsumi no dorei de aru.
Soshite, dorei wa itsu made mo ie ni iru mono de wa nai. Shikashi, ko wa itsu made mo iru.
Dakara, moshi ko ga anata gata ni jiyuu o esaserunaraba, anata gata wa, hontou ni jiyuu na mono to naru no de aru.
Watashi wa, anata gata ga Aburahamu no shison de aru koto o shitte iru. Sore da no ni, anata gata wa watashi o korosou to shite iru. Watashi no kotoba ga, anata gata no uchi ni ne o oroshite inaikara de aru.
Watashi wa watashi no chichi no moto de mita koto o katatte iruga, anata gata wa jibun no chichi kara kiita koto o okonatte iru".
Karera wa Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Watashitachi no chichi wa Aburahamu de aru". Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Moshi Aburahamu no ko de arunara, Aburahamu no waza o suru ga yoi.
Tokoro ga ima, kami kara kiita shinri o anata gata ni katatte kita kono watashi o, korosou to shite iru. Sonna koto o Aburahamu wa shinakatta.
Anata gata wa, anata gata no chichi no waza o okonatte iru no de aru". Karera wa itta, "Watashitachi wa, fuhinkou no kekka umareta mono de wa nai. Watashitachi ni wa hitori no chichi ga aru. Sore wa kami de aru".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Kami ga anata gata no chichi de arunaraba, anata gata wa watashi o aisuru hazu de aru. Watashi wa kami kara deta mono, mata kami kara kite iru mono de arukara da. Watashi wa jibun kara kita no de wa naku, kami kara tsukawasareta no de aru.
Dou shite anata gata wa, watashi no hanasu koto ga wakaranai no ka. Anata ga taga, watashi no kotoba o satoru koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Anata gata wa jibun no chichi, sunawachi, akuma kara dete kita mono de atte, sono chichi no yokubou doori o okonaou to omotte iru. Kare wa hajime kara, hitogoroshi de atte, shinri ni tatsu mono de wa nai. Kare no uchi ni wa shinri ga naikara de aru. Kare ga itsuwari o iu toki, itsu mo jibun no honne o haite iru no de aru. Kare wa itsuwarimono de ari, itsuwari no chichi de arukara da.
Shikashi, watashi ga shinri o katatte iru no de, anata gata wa watashi o shinjiyou to shinai.
Anata gata no uchi, dare ga watashi ni tsumi ga aru to seme uru no ka. Watashi wa shinri o katatte iru no ni, naze anata gata wa, watashi o shinjinai no ka.
Kami kara kita mono wa kami no kotoba ni kikishitagauga, anata gata ga kikishitagawanai no wa, kami kara kita mono de naikara de aru".
Yudayajintachi wa Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Anata wa Samariyabito de, akurei ni toritsukarete iruto, watashitachi ga iu no wa, touzen de wa nai ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi wa, akurei ni toritsukarete iru no de wa nakute, watashi no chichi o omonjite iru no daga, anata gata wa watashi o karonjite iru.
Watashi wa jibun no eikou o motomete wa inai. Sore o motomeru kata ga betsu ni aru. Sono kata wa, mata sabaku kata de aru.
Yokuyoku itte oku. Moshi hito ga watashi no kotoba o mamorunaraba, sono hito wa itsu made mo shi o miru koto ga naide arou".
Yudayajintachi ga itta, "Anata ga akurei ni toritsukarete iru koto ga, ima wakatta. Aburahamu wa shini, yogensha tachi mo shinde iru. Sore da no ni, anata wa, watashi no kotoba o mamoru mono wa itsu made mo shi o ajiwau koto ga naide arouto, iwareru.
Anata wa, watashitachi no chichi Aburahamu yori erai no darou ka. Kare mo shini, yogensha tachi mo shindade wa nai ka. Anata wa, ittai, jibun o dare to omotte iru no ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi ga moshi jibun ni eikou o kisurunara, watashi no eikou wa, munashii mono de aru. Watashi ni eikou o ataeru kata wa, watashi no chichi de atte, anata gata ga jibun no kami da to itte iru no wa, sono kata no koto de aru.
Anata gata wa sono kami o shitte inaiga, watashi wa shitte iru. Moshi watashi ga kami o shiranai to iunaraba, anata gata to onaji you na itsuwarimono de arou. Shikashi, watashi wa sono kata o shiri, sono mikotoba o mamotte iru.
Anata gata no chichi Aburahamu wa, watashi no kono hi o miyou to shite tanoshinde ita. Soshite sore o mite yorokonda".
Soko de Yudayajintachi wa Iesu ni itta, "Anata wa mada gojuu ni mo naranai no ni, Aburahamu o mita no ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Aburahamu no umareru mae kara watashi wa, iru no de aru".
Soko de karera wa ishi o totte, Iesu ni nagetsukeyou to shita. Shikashi, Iesu wa mi o kakushite, miya kara dete ikareta.
Iesu ga michi o tootte orareru toki, umaretsuki no moujin o mirareta.
Deshitachi wa Iesu ni tazunete itta, "Sensei, kono hito ga umaretsuki moujin na no wa, dare ga tsumi o okashita tame desu ka. Honnin desu ka, sore to mo sono ryoushin desu ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Honnin ga tsumi o okashita no de mo naku, mata, sono ryoushin ga okashita no de mo nai. Tada kami no miwaza ga, kare no ue ni arawareru tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no waza o, hiru no aida ni shinakereba naranai. Yoru ga kuru. Suruto, dare mo hatarakenaku naru.
Watashi wa, konoyo ni iru aida wa, yo no hikari de aru".
Iesu wa sou itte, chi ni tsubaki o shi, sono tsubaki de, doro o tsukuri, sono doro o moujin no me ni nutte iwareta,
"Shiroamu (tsukawasareta mono, no i) no ike ni itte arai nasai". Soko de kare wa itte aratta. Soshite mieru you ni natte, kaette itta.
Kinjo no hitobito ya, kare ga moto, kojikide atta no o mishitte ita hitobito ga itta, "Kono hito wa, suwat teko jiki o shite ita mono de wa nai ka".
Aru hitobito wa "Sono hito da" to ii, ta no hitobito wa "Iya, tada ano hito ni nite iru dake da" to itta. Shikashi, honnin wa "Watashi ga sore da" to itta.
Soko de hitobito wa kare ni itta, "De wa, omae no me wa dou shite a ita no ka".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Iesu to iu kata ga, doro o tsukutte, watashi no me ni nuri, 'Shiroamu ni itte arae' to iwaremashita. Sore de, itte arauto, mieru you ni narimashita".
Hitobito wa kare ni itta, "Sono hito wa doko ni iru no ka". Kare wa "Shirimasen" to kotaeta.
Hitobito wa, moto moujin de atta kono hito o, Parisaibitotachi no tokoro ni tsurete itta.
Iesu ga doro o tsukutte kare no me o aketa no wa, ansokunichi de atta.
Parisaibitotachi mo mata, "Dou shite mieru you ni natta no ka", to kare ni tazuneta. Kare wa kotaeta, "Ano kata ga watashi no me ni doro o nuri, watashi ga sore o arai, soshite mieru you ni narimashita".
Soko de, aru Parisaibitotachi ga itta, "Sono hito wa kami kara kita hito de wa nai. Ansokunichi o mamotte inai no dakara". Shikashi, hoka no hitobito wa itta, "Tsumi no aru hito ga, dou shite sono you na shirushi o okonau koto ga dekiyou ka". Soshite karera no aida ni bunsou ga shoujita.
Soko de karera wa, mou ichi do kono moujin ni kiita, "Omae no me o akete kureta sono hito o, dou omou ka". "Yogensha da to omoimasu" to kare wa itta.
Yudayajintachi wa, kare ga moto moujin de attaga mieru you ni natta koto o, mada shinjinakatta. Tsuini karera wa, me ga mieru you ni natta kono hito no ryoushin o yonde,
Tazunete itta, "Kore ga, umaretsuki moujin de atta to, omaetachi no itte iru musuko ka. Sore de wa dou shite, imame ga mieru no ka".
Ryoushin wa kotaete itta, "Kore ga watashidomo no musuko de aru koto, mata umaretsuki moujin de atta koto wa zonjite imasu.
Shikashi, dou shite ima mieru you ni natta no ka, sore wa shirimasen. Mata, dare ga sono me o akete kudasatta no ka mo shirimasen. Are ni kiite kudasai. Are wa mou otona desukara, jibun no koto wa jibun de hanaserudeshou".
Ryoushin wa Yudayajintachi o osorete ita no de, kou kotaeta no de aru. Sore wa, moshi Iesu o Kirisuto to kokuhaku suru mono ga areba, kaidou kara oidasu koto ni, Yudayajintachi ga sudeni kimete itakara de aru.
Kare no ryoushin ga "Otona desukara, are ni kiite kudasai" to itta no wa, sono tame de atta.
Soko de karera wa, moujin de atta hito o mou ichido yonde itta, "Kami ni eikou o kisuru ga yoi. Ano hito ga tsumibito de aru koto wa, watashitachi ni wa wakatte iru".
Suruto kare wa itta, "Ano kata ga tsumibito de aru ka dou ka, watashi wa shirimasen. Tada hitotsu no koto dake shitte imasu. Watashi wa mekura de attaga, ima wa mieru to iu koto desu".
Soko de karera wa itta, "Sono hito wa omae ni nani o shita no ka. Donna ni shite omae no me o aketa no ka".
Kare wa kotaeta, "Sono koto wa mou hanashite ageta no ni, kiite kuremasendeshita. Naze mata kikou to suru no desu ka. Anata gata mo, ano hito no deshi ni naritai no desu ka".
Soko de karera wa kare o nonoshitte itta, "Omae wa are no deshi daga, watashitachi wa Moose no deshi da.
Moose ni kami ga katarareta to iu koto wa shitte iru. Daga, ano hito ga doko kara kita mono ka, watashitachi wa shiranu".
Soko de kare ga kotaete itta, "Watashi no me o akete kudasatta no ni, sono kata ga doko kara kita ka, gozonji nai to wa, fushigi senban desu.
Watashitachi wa kono koto o shitte imasu. Kami wa tsumibito no iu koto wa okikiire ni narimasenga, kami o uyamai, sono mikokoro o okonau hito no iu koto wa, kikiirete kudasaimasu.
Umaretsuki mekura de atta mono no me o aketa hito ga aru to iu koto wa, sekai ga hajimatte irai, kiita koto ga arimasen.
Moshi ano kata ga kami kara kita hito de nakattara, nanihito tsu dekinakatta hazu desu".
Kore o kiite karera wa itta, "Omae wa mattaku tsumi no naka ni umarete inagara, watashitachi o oshieyou to suru no ka". Soshite kare o soto e oidashita.
Iesu wa, sono hito ga soto e oidasareta koto o kikareta. Soshite kare ni atte iwareta, "Anata wa hito no ko o shinjiru ka".
Kare wa kotaete itta, "Shu yo, sore wa donata desu ka. Sono kata o shinjitai no desuga".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata wa, mou sono hito ni atte iru. Ima anata to hanashite iru no ga, sono hito de aru".
Suruto kare wa, "Shu yo, shinjimasu" to itte, Iesu o haishita.
Soko de Iesu wa iwareta, "Watashi ga konoyo ni kita no wa, sabaku tame de aru. Sunawachi, mienai hitotachi ga mieru you ni nari, mieru hitotachi ga mienai you ni naru tame de aru".
Soko ni Iesu to issho ni ita aru Parisaibitotachi ga, sore o kiite Iesu ni itta, "Sore de wa, watashitachi mo mekura na no deshou ka".
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Moshi anata gata ga moujin de attanara, tsumi wa nakattade arou. Shikashi, ima anata gata ga 'Mieru' to iiharu tokoro ni, anata gata no tsumi ga aru.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Hitsuji no kakoi ni wa iru no ni, mon kara de naku, hoka no tokoro kara norikoete kuru mono wa, nusubito de ari, goutou de aru.
Mon kara wa iru mono wa, hitsuji no hitsujikai de aru.
Monban wa kare no tame ni mon o hiraki, hitsuji wa kare no koe o kiku. Soshite kare wa jibun no hitsuji no na o yonde tsuredasu.
Jibun no hitsuji o mina dashite shimauto, kare wa hitsuji no sentou ni tatte iku. Hitsuji wa sono koe o shitte iru no de, kare ni tsuite iku no de aru.
Hoka no hito ni wa, tsuite ikanaide nigesaru. Sono hito no koe o shiranaikara de aru".
Iesu wa karera ni kono hiyu o hanasaretaga, karera wa jibuntachi ni ohanashi ni natte iru no ga nani no koto da ka, wakaranakatta.
Soko de, Iesu wa mata iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Watashi wa hitsuji no mon de aru.
Watashi yori mo mae ni kita hito wa, mina nusubito de ari, goutou de aru. Hitsuji wa karera ni kikishitagawanakatta.
Watashi wa mon de aru. Watashi o tootte wa iru mono wa sukuware, mata deiri shi, bokusou ni aritsukude arou.
Nusubito ga kuru no wa, nusun dari, koroshi tari, horoboshi tari suru tame ni hoka naranai. Watashi ga kita no wa, hitsuji ni inochi o esase, yutaka ni esaseru tame de aru.
Watashi wa yoi hitsujikai de aru. Yoi hitsujikai wa, hitsuji no tame ni inochi o suteru.
Hitsujikai de wa naku, hitsuji ga jibun no mono de mo nai yatoinin wa, ookami ga kuru no o miruto, hitsuji o sutete nigesaru. Soshite, ookami wa hitsuji o ubai, mata oichirasu.
Kare wa yatoinin de atte, hitsuji no koto o kokoro ni kakete inaikara de aru.
Watashi wa yoi hitsujikai de atte, watashi no hitsuji o shiri, watashi no hitsuji wa mata, watashi o shitte iru.
Sore wa choudo, chichi ga watashi o shitte orare, watashi ga chichi o shitte iru no to onaji de aru. Soshite, watashi wa hitsuji no tame ni inochi o suteru no de aru.
Watashi ni wa mata, kono kakoi ni inai ta no hitsuji ga aru. Watashi wa karera o mo michibikaneba naranai. Karera mo, watashi no koe ni kikishitagaude arou. Soshite, tsuini hitotsu no mure, hitori no hitsujikai to narude arou.
Chichi wa, watashi ga jibun no inochi o suterukara, watashi o aishite kudasaru no de aru. Inochi o suteru no wa, sore o futatabi eru tame de aru.
Dare ka ga, watashi kara sore o torisaru no de wa nai. Watashi ga, jibun kara sore o suteru no de aru. Watashi ni wa, sore o suteru chikara ga ari, mata sore o ukeru chikara mo aru. Kore wa watashi no chichi kara sazukatta sadame de aru".
Korera no kotoba o katarareta tame, Yudayajin no aida ni mata mo bunsou ga shoujita.
Sono uchi no ooku no mono ga itta, "Kare wa akurei ni toritsukarete, ki ga kurutte iru. Dou shite, anata gata wa sono iu koto o kiku no ka".
Ta no hitobito wa itta, "Sore wa akurei ni toritsukareta mono no kotoba de wa nai. Akurei wa moujin no me o akeru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Sono koro, Erusaremu de miya kiyome no matsuri ga okonawareta. Toki wa fuyu de atta.
Iesu wa, miya no naka ni aru Soromon no rou o aruite orareta.
Suruto Yudayajintachi ga, Iesu o torikakonde itta, "Itsu made watashitachi o fuan no mama ni shite oku no ka. Anata ga Kirisuto de arunara, sou to hakkiri itte itadakitai".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Watashi wa hanashita no daga, anata gata wa shinjiyou to shinai. Watashi no chichi no na ni yotte shite iru subete no waza ga, watashi no koto o akashi shite iru.
Anata gata ga shinjinai no wa, watashi no hitsuji de naikara de aru.
Watashi no hitsuji wa watashi no koe ni kikishitagau. Watashi wa karera o shitte ori, karera wa watashi ni tsuite kuru.
Watashi wa, karera ni eien no inochi o ataeru. Dakara, karera wa itsu made mo horobiru koto ga naku, mata, karera o watashi no te kara ubaisaru mono wa nai.
Watashi no chichi ga watashi ni kudasatta mono wa, subete ni masaru mono de aru. Soshite dare mo chichi no mite kara, sore o ubaitoru koto wa dekinai.
Watashi to chichi to wa hitotsu de aru".
Soko de Yudayajintachi wa, Iesu o uchikorosou to shite, mata ishi o toriageta.
Suru to Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Watashi wa, chichi ni yoru ooku no yoi waza o, anata gata ni shimeshita. Sono naka no dono waza no tame ni, watashi o ishi de uchikorosou to suru no ka".
Yudayajintachi wa kotaeta, "Anata o ishi de korosou to suru no wa, yoi waza o shitakara de wa naku, kami o kegashitakara de aru. Mata, anata wa ningen de aru no ni, jibun o kami to shite irukara de aru".
Iesu wa karera ni kotaerareta, "Anata gata no rippou ni, 'Watashi wa iu, anata gata wa kamigami de aru' to kaite aru de wa nai ka.
Kami no kotoba o takusareta hitobito ga, kamigami to iwarete oru to sureba, (soshite seisho no kotoba wa, sutaru koto ga ari enai)
Chichi ga seibetsu shite, yo ni tsukawasareta mono ga, 'Watashi wa kami no ko de aru' to ittakara tote, dou shite 'Anata wa kami o kegasu mono da' to iu no ka.
Moshi watashi ga chichi no waza o okonawanai to sureba, watashi o shinjinakute mo yoi.
Shikashi, moshi okonatte irunara, tatoi watashi o shinjinakute mo, watashi no waza o shinjiru ga yoi. Sou sureba, chichi ga watashi ni ori, mata, watashi ga chichi ni oru koto o shitte satorude arou".
Soko de, karera wa mata Iesu o toraeyou to shitaga, Iesu wa karera no te o nogarete, satte ikareta.
Sate, Iesu wa mata Yorudan no mukougishi, sunawachi, Yohane ga hajime ni baputesuma o sazukete ita tokoro ni iki, soko ni taizai shite orareta.
Ooku no hitobito ga Iesu no tokoro ni kite, tagai ni itta, "Yohane wa nan no shirushi mo okonawanakattaga, Yohane ga konokata ni tsuite itta koto wa, minahontou de atta".
Soshite, soko de ooku no mono ga Iesu o shinjita.
Sate, hitori no byounin ga ita. Razaro to ii, Mariya to sono shimai Maruta no mura Betaniya no hito de atta.
Kono Mariya wa Shu ni kouyu o nuri, jibun no kaminoke de, Shu no ashi o fuita onna de atte, byouki de atta no wa, kanojo no kyoudai Razaro de atta.
Shimaitachi wa hito o Iesu no moto ni tsukawashite, "Shu yo, tada ima, anata ga aishite orareru mono ga byouki o shite imasu" to iwaseta.
Iesu wa sore o kiite iwareta, "Kono byouki wa shinu hodo no mono de wa nai. Sore wa kami no eikou no tame, mata, kami no ko ga sore ni yotte eikou o ukeru tame no mono de aru".
Iesu wa, Maruta to sono shimai to Razaro to o aishite orareta.
Razaro ga byouki de aru koto o kiite kara, nao futsu ka, sono orareta tokoro ni taizai sareta.
Sore kara deshitachi ni, "Mou ichi do Yudaya ni ikou" to iwareta.
Deshitachi wa itta, "Sensei, Yudayajinra ga, sakihodo mo anata o ishi de korosou to shite imashita no ni, mata soko ni ikareru no desu ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Ichi nichi ni wa juu ni jikan aru de wa nai ka. Hiruma arukeba, hito wa tsumazuku koto wa nai. Konoyo no hikari o mite irukara de aru.
Shikashi, yoru arukeba, tsumazuku. Sono hito no uchi ni, hikari ga naikara de aru".
Sou iwaretaga, sore kara mata, karera ni iwareta, "Watashitachi no tomo Razaro ga nemutte iru. Watashi wa kare o okoshi ni iku".
Suruto deshitachi wa itta, "Shu yo, nemutte iru no deshitara, tasukarudeshou".
Iesu wa Razaro ga shinda koto o iwareta no de aruga, deshitachi wa, nemutte yasunde iru koto o sashite iwareta no da to omotta.
Suru to Iesu wa, akarasama ni karera ni iwareta, "Razaro wa shinda no da.
Soshite, watashi ga soko ni iawasenakatta koto o, anata gata no tame ni yorokobu. Sore wa, anata gata ga shinjiru you ni naru tame de aru. De wa, kare no tokoro ni ikou".
Suruto Dedomo to yobarete iru Tomasu ga, nakama no deshitachi ni itta, "Watashitachi mo itte, sensei to issho ni shinoude wa nai ka".
Sate, Iesu ga itte goran ni naruto, Razaro wa sudeni yon kakan mo haka no naka ni okarete ita.
Betaniya wa Erusaremu ni chikaku, nijuu go chou bakari hanareta tokoro ni atta.
Oozei no Yudayajin ga, sono kyoudai no koto de, Maruta to Mariya to o nagusameyou to shite kite ita.
Maruta wa Iesu ga korareta to kiite, demukae ni ittaga, Mariya wa ie de suwatte ita.
Maruta wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, moshi anata ga koko ni ite kudasattanara, watashi no kyoudai wa shinanakattadeshou.
Shikashi, anata ga donna koto o onegai ni natte mo, kami wa kanaete kudasaru koto o, watashi wa ima de mo zonjite imasu".
Iesu wa Maruta ni iwareta, "Anata no kyoudai wa yomigaerude arou".
Maruta wa itta, "Owari no hi no yomigaeri no toki yomigaeru koto wa, zonjite imasu".
Iesu wa kanojo ni iwareta, "Watashi wa yomigaeride ari, inochi de aru. Watashi o shinjiru mono wa, tatoi shinde mo ikiru.
Mata, ikite ite, watashi o shinjiru mono wa, itsu made mo shinanai. Anata wa kore o shinjiru ka".
Maruta wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, shinjimasu. Anata ga konoyo ni kitarubeki Kirisuto, kami no miko de aru to shinjite orimasu".
Maruta wa kou itte kara, kaette shimai no Mariya o yobi, "Sensei ga oide ni natte, anata o yonde oraremasu" to kogoe de itta.
Kore o kiita Mariya wa sugu tachiagatte, Iesu no moto ni itta.
Iesu wa mada mura ni, haitte korarezu, Maruta ga omukae shita sono basho ni orareta.
Mariya to issho ni ie ni ite kanojo o nagusamete ita Yudayajintachi wa, Mariya ga isoide tachiagatte dete iku no o mite, kanojo wa haka ni naki ni iku no de arou to omoi, sono ato kara tsuite itta.
Mariya wa, Iesu no orareru tokoro ni itte ome ni kakari, sono ashimoto ni hirefushite itta, "Shu yo, moshi anata ga koko ni ite kudasattanara, watashi no kyoudai wa shinanakattadeshou".
Iesu wa, kanojo ga naki, mata, kanojo to issho ni kita Yudayajintachi mo naite iru no o goran ni nari, hageshiku kandou shi, mata kokoro o sawagase, soshite iwareta,
"Kare o doko ni oita no ka". Karera wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, kite, goran kudasai".
Iesu wa namida o nagasareta.
Suruto Yudayajintachi wa itta, "Aa, nan to kare o aishite orareta koto ka".
Shikashi, karera no aru hitotachi wa itta, "Ano moujin no me o aketa kono hito de mo, Razaro o shinasenai you ni wa, dekinakatta no ka".
Iesu wa mata hageshiku kandou shite, haka ni wa irareta. Sore wa horaana de atte, soko ni ishi ga hamete atta.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Ishi o torinoke nasai". Shinda Razaro no shimai Maruta ga itta, "Shu yo, mou kusaku natte orimasu. Yonka mo tatte imasukara".
Iesu wa kanojo ni iwareta, "Moshi shinjirunara kami no eikou o mirude arouto, anata ni ittade wa nai ka".
Hitobito wa ishi o torinoketa. Suruto, Iesu wa me o ten ni mukete iwareta, "Chichi yo, watashi no negai o okiki kudasatta koto o kansha shimasu.
Anata ga itsu de mo watashi no negai o kikiirete kudasaru koto o, yoku shitte imasu. Shikashi, kou moushimasu no wa, soba ni tatte iru hitobito ni, anata ga watashi o tsukawasareta koto o, shinjisaseru tame de arimasu".
Kou iinagara, oogoe de "Razaro yo, dete ki nasai" to yobawareta.
Suruto, shinin wa teashi o nuno de makare, kao mo kao ooi de tsutsumareta mama, dete kita. Iesu wa hitobito ni iwareta, "Kare o hodoite yatte, kaerase nasai".
Mariya no tokoro ni kite, Iesu no nasatta koto o mita ooku no Yudayajintachi wa, Iesu o shinjita.
Shikashi, sono uchi no suunin ga Parisaibitotachi no tokoro ni itte, Iesu no sareta koto o tsugeta.
Soko de, saishichou tachi to Parisaibitotachi to wa, gikai o shoushuu shite itta, "Kono hito ga ooku no shirushi o okonatte iru no ni, otagai wa nani o shite iru no da.
Moshi kono mama ni shite okeba, minna ga kare o shinjiru you ni narudarou. Sono ue, Roomajin ga yatte kite, watashitachi no tochi mo jinmin mo ubatte shimaude arou".
Karera no uchi no hitori de, sono toshi no daisaishi de atta Kayapa ga, karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa, nani mo wakatte inaishi,
Hitori no hito ga jinmin ni kawatte shinde, zenkokumin ga horobinai you ni naru no ga watashitachi ni totte e da to iu koto o, kangaete mo inai".
Kono koto wa kare ga jibun kara itta no de wa nai. Kare wa kono toshi no daisaishi de atta no de, yogen o shite, Iesu ga kokumin no tame ni,
Tada kokumin no tame dake de wa naku, mata sanzai shite iru kami no kora o hitotsu ni atsumeru tame ni, shinu koto ni natte iruto, itta no de aru.
Karera wa kono hi kara Iesu o korosou to soudan shita.
Sono tame Iesu wa, mohaya kouzen to Yudayajin no aida o arukanaide, soko o dete, arano ni chikai chihou no Efuraimu to iu machi ni ikare, soko ni deshitachi to issho ni taizai shite orareta.
Sate, Yudayajin no sugikoshi no matsuri ga chikazuita no de, ooku no hitobito wa mi o kiyomeru tame ni, matsuri no mae ni, chihou kara Erusaremu e nobotta.
Hitobito wa Iesu o sagashimotome, miya no niwa ni tatte tagai ni itta, "Anata gata wa dou omou ka. Iesu wa kono matsuri ni konai no darou ka".
Saishichou tachi to Parisaibitotachi to wa, Iesu o toraeyou to shite, sono idokoro o shitte iru mono ga areba moushideyo, to iu shirei o dashite ita.
Sugikoshi no matsuri no muika mae ni, Iesu wa Betaniya ni ikareta. Soko wa, Iesu ga shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta Razaro no ita tokoro de aru.
Iesu no tame ni soko de yuushoku no youi ga sare, Maruta wa kyuuji o shite ita. Iesu to issho ni shokutaku ni tsuite ita mono no uchi ni, Razaro mo kuwawatte ita.
Sono toki, Mariya wa kouka de junsui na Narudo no kouyu ichi kin o motte kite, Iesu no ashi ni nuri, jibun no kaminoke de sore o fuita. Suruto, kouyu no kaori ga ie ni ippai ni natta.
Deshi no hitori de, Iesu o uragirou to shite ita Isukariote no Yuda ga itta,
"Naze kono kouyu o sanbyaku denari ni utte, mazushii hitotachi ni, hodokosanakatta no ka".
Kare ga kou itta no wa, mazushii hitotachi ni taisuru omoiyari ga attakara de wa naku, jibun ga nusubito de ari, saifu o azukatte ite, sono nakami o gomakashite itakara de atta.
Iesu wa iwareta, "Kono onna no suru mama ni sasete oki nasai. Watashi no houmuri no hi no tame ni, sore o totte oita no dakara.
Mazushii hitotachi wa itsu mo anata gata to tomo ni iruga, watashi wa itsu mo tomo ni iru wake de wa nai".
Oozei no Yudayajintachi ga, soko ni Iesu no orareru no o shitte, oshiyosete kita. Sore wa Iesu ni au tame dake de wa naku, Iesu ga shinin no naka kara, yomigaeraseta Razaro o miru tame de mo atta.
Soko de saishichou tachi wa, Razaro mo korosou to soudan shita.
Sore wa, Razaro no koto de, ooku no Yudayajin ga karera o hanaresatte, Iesu o shinjiru ni itattakara de aru.
Sono yokujitsu, matsuri ni kite ita oozei no gunshuu wa, Iesu ga Erusaremu ni korareru to kiite,
Shuro no eda o te ni tori, mukae ni dete itta. Soshite sakenda, "Hosana, Shu no mina ni yotte kitaru mono ni shukufuku are, Isuraeru no ou ni".
Iesu wa, roba no ko o mitsukete, sono ue ni norareta. Sore wa
"Shion no musume yo, osoreru na. Miyo, anata no ou ga roba no ko ni notte oide ni naru" to kaite aru toori de atta.
Deshitachi wa hajime ni wa kono koto o satoranakattaga, Iesu ga eikou o ukerareta toki ni, kono koto ga Iesu ni tsuite kakarete ari, mata sono toori ni, hitobito ga Iesu ni taishite shita no da to iu koto o, omoiokoshita.
Mata, Iesu ga Razaro o haka kara yobidashite, shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta toki, Iesu to issho ni ita gunshuu ga, sono akashi o shita.
Gunshuu ga Iesu o mukae ni deta no wa, Iesu ga kono you na shirushi o okonawareta koto o, kiite itakara de aru.
Soko de, Parisaibitotachi wa tagai ni itta, "Nani o shite mo muda datta. Yo o agete kare no ato o otte ittade wa nai ka".
Matsuri de reihai suru tame ni nobotte kita hitobito no uchi ni, suunin no Girishiyajin ga ita.
Karera wa Gariraya no Betsusaidade de aru Piripo no tokoro ni kite, "Kimi yo, Iesu ni ome ni kakaritai no desuga" to itte tanonda.
Piripo wa Andere no tokoro ni itte sono koto o hanashi, Andere to Piripo wa, Iesu no moto ni itte tsutaeta.
Suruto, Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Hito no ko ga eikou o ukeru toki ga kita.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Ichi tsubu no mugi ga chi ni ochite shinanakereba, sore wa tada ichi tsubu no mama de aru. Shikashi, moshi shindanara, yutaka ni mi o musubu you ni naru.
Jibun no inochi o aisuru mono wa sore o ushinai, konoyo de jibun no inochi o nikumu mono wa, sore o tamotte eien no inochi ni itarude arou.
Moshi watashi ni tsukaeyou to suru hito ga areba, sono hito wa watashi ni shitagatte kuru ga yoi. Sou sureba, watashi no oru tokoro ni, watashi ni tsukaeru mono mo mata, orude arou. Moshi watashi ni tsukaeyou to suru hito ga areba, sono hito o chichi wa omonjite kudasarude arou.
Ima watashi wa kokoro ga sawaide iru. Watashi wa nan to iou ka. Chichi yo, kono toki kara watashi o osukui kudasai. Shikashi, watashi wa kono tame ni, kono toki ni itatta no desu.
Chichi yo, mina ga agameraremasu you ni". Suruto ten kara koe ga atta, "Watashi wa sudeni eikou o arawashita. Soshite, sarani sore o arawasude arou".
Suruto, soko ni tatte ita gunshuu ga kore o kiite, "Kaminari ga natta no da" to ii, hoka no hitotachi wa, "Mitsukai ga kare ni hanashikaketa no da" to itta.
Iesu wa kotaete iwareta, "Kono koe ga atta no wa, watashi no tame de wa naku, anata gata no tame de aru.
Ima wa konoyo ga sabakareru toki de aru. Ima koso konoyo no kimi wa oidasarerude arou.
Soshite, watashi ga kono chi kara agerareru toki ni wa, subete no hito o watashi no tokoro ni hikiyoserude arou".
Iesu wa kou itte, jibun ga donna shinihou de shinou to shite ita ka o, oshimeshi ni natta no de aru.
Suru to gunshuu wa Iesu ni mukatte itta, "Watashitachi wa rippou ni yotte, Kirisuto wa itsu made mo ikite oide ni naru no da, to kiite imashita. Sore da no ni, dou shite hito no ko wa agerareneba naranaito, iwareru no desu ka. Sono hito no ko to wa, dare no koto desu ka".
Soko de Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Mou shibaraku no aida, hikari wa anata gata to issho ni koko ni aru. Hikari ga aru aida ni aruite, yami ni oitsukarenai you ni shi nasai. Yami no naka o aruku mono wa, jibun ga doko e iku no ka wakatte inai.
Hikari no aru aida ni, hikari no ko to naru tame ni, hikari o shinji nasai". Iesu wa korera no koto o hanashite kara, soko o tachisatte, karera kara mi o okakushi ni natta.
Kono you ni ooku no shirushi o karera no mae de nasattaga, karera wa Iesu o shinjinakatta.
Sore wa, yogensha Izaya no tsugi no kotoba ga jouju suru tame de aru, "Shu yo, watashitachi no toku tokoro o, dare ga shinjitadeshou ka. Mata, Shu no miude wa dare ni shimesaretadeshou ka".
Kou iu wake de, karera wa shinjiru koto ga dekinakatta. Izaya wa mata, kou mo itta,
"Kami wa karera no me o kuramashi, kokoro o katakuna ni nasatta. Sore wa, karera ga me de mizu, kokoro de satorazu, kuiaratamete iyasareru koto ga nai tame de aru".
Izaya ga kou itta no wa, Iesu no eikou o mitakara de atte, Iesu no koto o katatta no de aru.
Shikashi, yakunintachi no naka ni mo, Iesu o shinjita mono ga ookattaga, Parisaibito o habakatte, kokuhaku wa shinakatta. Kaidou kara oidasareru no o osorete ita no de aru.
Karera wa kami no homare yori mo, hito no homare o konondakara de aru.
Iesu wa oogoe de iwareta, "Watashi o shinjiru mono wa, watashi o shinjiru no de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta kata o shinjiru no de ari,
Mata, watashi o miru mono wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata o miru no de aru.
Watashi wa hikari to shite konoyo ni kita. Sore wa, watashi o shinjiru mono ga, yami no uchi ni todomaranai you ni naru tame de aru.
Tatoi, watashi no iu koto o kiite sore o mamoranai hito ga atte mo, watashi wa sono hito o sabakanai. Watashi ga kita no wa, konoyo o sabaku tame de wa naku, konoyo o sukuu tame de aru.
Watashi o sutete, watashi no kotoba o ukeirenai hito ni wa, sono hito o sabaku mono ga aru. Watashi no katatta sono kotoba ga, owari no hi ni sono hito o sabakude arou.
Watashi wa jibun kara katatta no de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta chichi gojishin ga, watashi no iubeki koto, katarubeki koto o omeiji ni natta no de aru.
Watashi wa, kono meirei ga eien no inochi de aru koto o shitte iru. Sore yue ni, watashi ga katatte iru koto wa, watashi no chichi ga watashi ni oose ni natta koto o, sono mama katatte iru no de aru".
Sugikoshi no matsuri no mae ni, Iesu wa, konoyo o satte chichi no mimoto ni ikubeki jibun no toki ga kita koto o shiri, yo ni iru jibun no monotachi o aishite, karera o saigo made aishi toosareta.
Yuushoku no toki, akuma wa sudeni Shimon no ko Isukariote no Yuda no kokoro ni, Iesu o uragirou to suru omoi o irete itaga,
Iesu wa, chichi ga subete no mono o jibun no te ni oatae ni natta koto, mata, jibun wa kami kara dete kite, kami ni kaerou to shite iru koto o omoi,
Yuushoku no seki kara tachiagatte, uwagi o nugi, tenugui o totte koshi ni maki,
Sore kara mizu o tarai ni irete, deshitachi no ashi o arai, koshi ni maita tenugui de fuki hajimerareta.
Kou shite, Shimon Petero no ban ni natta. Suruto kare wa Iesu ni, "Shu yo, anata ga watashi no ashi o oarai ni naru no desu ka" to itta.
Iesu wa kare ni kotaete iwareta, "Watashi no shite iru koto wa ima anata ni wa wakaranaiga, ato de wakaru you ni narudarou".
Petero wa Iesu ni itta, "Watashi no ashi o kesshite arawanaide kudasai". Iesu wa kare ni kotaerareta, "Moshi watashi ga anata no ashi o arawanainara, anata wa watashi to nan no kakawari mo nakunaru".
Shimon Petero wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, de wa, ashi dake de wa naku, douzo, te mo atama mo".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Sudeni karada o aratta mono wa, ashi no hoka wa arau hitsuyou ga nai. Zenshin ga kirei na no dakara. Anata gata wa kirei na no da. Shikashi, minna ga sou na no de wa nai".
Iesu wa jibun o uragiru mono o shitte orareta. Sore de, "Minna ga kirei na no de wa nai" to iwareta no de aru.
Kou shite karera no ashi o aratte kara, uwagi o tsuke, futatabi seki ni modotte, karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ga anata gata ni shita koto ga wakaru ka.
Anata gata wa watashi o kyoushi, mata Shu to yonde iru. Sou iu no wa tadashii. Watashi wa sono toori de aru.
Shikashi, Shu de ari, mata kyoushi de aru watashi ga, anata gata no ashi o arattakara ni wa, anata gata mo mata, tagai ni ashi o araiaubekide aru.
Watashi ga anata gata ni shita toori ni, anata gata mo suru you ni, watashi wa tehon o shimeshita no da.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Shimobe wa sono shujin ni masaru mono de wa naku, tsukawasareta mono wa tsukawashita mono ni masaru mono de wa nai.
Moshi korera no koto ga wakatte ite, sore o okonaunara, anata gata wa saiwai de aru.
Anata gata zenbu no mono ni tsuite, kou itte iru no de wa nai. Watashi wa jibun ga eranda hitotachi o shitte iru. Shikashi, 'Watashi no pan o tabete iru mono ga, watashi ni mukatte sono kakato o ageta' to aru seisho wa jouju sarenakereba naranai.
Sono koto ga mada okoranai ima no uchi ni, anata gata ni itte oku. Iyoiyo koto ga okotta toki, watashi ga sore de aru koto o, anata gata ga shinjiru tame de aru.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Watashi ga tsukawasu mono o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o ukeireru no de aru. Watashi o ukeireru mono wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata o, ukeireru no de aru".
Iesu ga korera no koto o iwareta nochi, sono kokoro ga sawagi, ogosoka ni iwareta, "Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Anata gata no uchi no hitori ga, watashi o uragirou to shite iru".
Deshitachi wa dare no koto o iwareta no ka sasshikanete, tagai ni kao o miawaseta.
Deshitachi no hitori de, Iesu no aishite orareta mono ga, mimune ni chikaku seki ni tsuite ita.
Soko de, Shimon Petero wa kare ni aizu o shite itta, "Dare no koto o osshatta no ka, shirasete kure".
Sono deshi wa sono mama Iesu no mune ni yori kakatte, "Shu yo, dare no koto desu ka" to tazuneruto,
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi ga ichi kire no shokumotsu o hitashite ataeru mono ga, sore de aru". Soshite, ichi kire no shokumotsu o hitashite toriage, Shimon no ko Isukariote no Yuda ni oatae ni natta.
Kono ichi kire no shokumotsu o ukeru ya ina ya, Satan ga Yuda ni haitta. Soko de Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Shiyou to shite iru koto o, ima sugu suru ga yoi".
Seki o tomo ni shite ita mono no uchi, naze Yuda ni kou iwareta no ka, wakatte ita mono wa hitori mo nakatta.
Aru hitobito wa, Yuda ga kaneire o azukatte ita no de, Iesu ga kare ni, "Matsuri no tame ni hitsuyou na mono o kae" to iwareta ka, aruiha, mazushii mono ni nani ka hodokosaseyou to sareta no da to omotte ita.
Yuda wa ichi kire no shokumotsu o ukeruto, sugu ni dete itta. Toki wa yoru de atta.
Sate, kare ga dete ikuto, Iesu wa iwareta, "Ima ya hito no ko wa eikou o uketa. Kami mo mata kare ni yotte eikou o ouke ni natta.
Kare ni yotte eikou o ouke ni natta no nara, kami gojishin mo kare ni eikou o osazuke ni narude arou. Sugu ni mo osazuke ni narude arou.
Kotachi yo, watashi wa mada shibaraku, anata gata to issho ni iru. Anata gata wa watashi o sagasudarouga, sudeni Yudayajintachi ni itta toori, ima anata gata ni mo iu, 'Anata gata wa watashi no iku tokoro ni kuru koto wa dekinai'.
Watashi wa, atarashii imashime o anata gata ni ataeru, tagai ni aishiai nasai. Watashi ga anatagata o aishita you ni, anata gata mo tagai ni aishiai nasai.
Tagai ni aishiaunaraba, sore ni yotte, anata gata ga watashi no deshi de aru koto o, subete no mono ga mitomerude arou".
Shimon Petero ga Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, doko e oide ni naru no desu ka". Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata wa watashi no iku tokoro ni, ima wa tsuite kuru koto wa dekinai. Shikashi, ato ni natte kara, tsuite kuru koto ni narou".
Petero wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, naze, ima anata ni tsuite iku koto ga dekinai no desu ka. Anata no tame ni wa, inochi mo sutemasu".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi no tame ni inochi o suteru to iu no ka. Yokuyoku anata ni itte oku. Niwatori ga naku mae ni, anata wa watashi o san do shiranai to iude arou".
"Anata gata wa, kokoro o sawagasenai ga yoi. Kami o shinji, mata watashi o shinji nasai.
Watashi no chichi no ie ni wa, sumai ga takusan aru. Mo shinakattanaraba, watashi wa sou itte oitade arou. Anata gata no tame ni, basho o youi shi ni iku no dakara.
Soshite, itte, basho no youi ga dekitanaraba, mata kite, anatagata o watashi no tokoro ni mukaeyou. Watashi no oru tokoro ni anata gata mo oraseru tame de aru.
Watashi ga doko e iku no ka, sono michi wa anata gata ni wakatte iru".
Tomasu wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, doko e oide ni naru no ka, watashitachi ni wa wakarimasen. Dou shite sono michi ga wakarudeshou".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi wa michi de ari, shinri de ari, inochi de aru. Dare de mo watashi ni yoranaide wa, chichi no mimoto ni iku koto wa dekinai.
Moshi anata gata ga watashi o shitte itanaraba, watashi no chichi o mo shittade arou. Shikashi, ima wa chichi o shitte ori, mata sudeni chichi o mita no de aru".
Piripo wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, watashitachi ni chichi o shimeshite kudasai. Sou shite kudasareba, watashitachi wa manzoku shimasu".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Piripo yo, konna ni nagaku anata gata to issho ni iru no ni, watashi ga wakatte inai no ka. Watashi o mita mono wa, chichi o mita no de aru. Dou shite, watashitachi ni chichi o shimeshite hoshii to, iu no ka.
Watashi ga chichi ni ori, chichi ga watashi ni orareru koto o anata wa shinjinai no ka. Watashi ga anata gata ni hanashite iru kotoba wa, jibun kara hanashite iru no de wa nai. Chichi ga watashi no uchi ni orarete, miwaza o nasatte iru no de aru.
Watashi ga chichi ni ori, chichi ga watashi ni orareru koto o shinji nasai. Moshi sore ga shinjirarenainaraba, waza sono mono ni yotte shinji nasai.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Watashi o shinjiru mono wa, mata watashi no shite iru waza o surude arou. Sore bakari ka, motto ookii waza o surude arou. Watashi ga chichi no mimoto ni ikukara de aru.
Watashi no na ni yotte negau koto wa, nan de mo kanaete ageyou. Chichi ga ko ni yotte eikou o ouke ni naru tame de aru.
Nanigoto de mo watashi no na ni yotte negaunaraba, watashi wa sore o kanaete ageyou.
Moshi anata gata ga watashi o aisurunaraba, watashi no imashime o mamorubekide aru.
Watashi wa chichi ni onegai shiyou. Sou sureba, chichi wa betsu ni tasukenushi o okutte, itsu made mo anata gata to tomo ni orasete kudasarude arou.
Sore wa shinri no mitama de aru. Konoyo wa sore o miyou to mo sezu, shirou to mo shinai no de, sore o ukeru koto ga dekinai. Anata gata wa sore o shitte iru. Naze nara, sore wa anata gata to tomo ni ori, mata anata gata no uchi ni irukara de aru.
Watashi wa anatagata o sutete koji to wa shinai. Anata gata no tokoro ni kaette kuru.
Mou shibaraku shitara, yo wa mohaya watashi o minaku narudarou. Shikashi, anata gata wa watashi o miru. Watashi ga ikiru no de, anata gata mo ikirukara de aru.
Sono hi ni wa, watashi wa watashi no chichi ni ori, anata gata wa watashi ni ori, mata, watashi ga anata gata ni oru koto ga, wakarude arou.
Watashi no imashime o kokoro ni idaite kore o mamoru mono wa, watashi o aisuru mono de aru. Watashi o aisuru mono wa, watashi no chichi ni aisarerude arou. Watashi mo sono hito o aishi, sono hito ni watashi jishin o arawasude arou".
Isukariote de nai hou no Yuda ga Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, anata gojishin o watashitachi ni arawasou to shite, yo ni wa arawasou to sarenai no wa naze desu ka".
Iesu wa kare ni kotaete iwareta, "Moshi dare de mo watashi o aisurunaraba, watashi no kotoba o mamorude arou. Soshite, watashi no chichi wa sono hito o aishi, mata, watashitachi wa sono hito no tokoro ni itte, sono hito to issho ni sumude arou.
Watashi o aisanai mono wa watashi no kotoba o mamoranai. Anata gata ga kiite iru kotoba wa, watashi no kotoba de wa naku, watashi o tsukawasareta chichi no kotoba de aru.
Korera no koto wa, anata gata to issho ni ita toki, sudeni katatta koto de aru.
Shikashi, tasukenushi, sunawachi, chichi ga watashi no na ni yotte tsukawasareru seirei wa, anata gata ni subete no koto o oshie, mata watashi ga hanashite oita koto o, kotogotoku omoiokosaserude arou.
Watashi wa heian o anata gata ni nokoshite iku. Watashi no heian o anata gata ni ataeru. Watashi ga ataeru no wa, yo ga ataeru you na mono to wa kotonaru. Anata gata wa kokoro o sawagaseru na, mata ojikeru na.
'Watashi wa satte ikuga, mata anata gata no tokoro ni kaette kuru' to, watashi ga itta no o, anata gata wa kiite iru. Moshi watashi o aishite irunara, watashi ga chichi no moto ni iku no o yorokonde kurerude arou. Chichi ga watashi yori ookii kata de arukara de aru.
Ima watashi wa, sono koto ga okoranai saki ni anata gata ni katatta. Sore wa, koto ga okotta toki ni anata gata ga shinjiru tame de aru.
Watashi wa mohaya, anata gata ni, ooku o katarumai. Konoyo no kimi ga kurukara de aru. Daga, kare wa watashi ni taishite, nan no chikara mo nai.
Shikashi, watashi ga chichi o aishite iru koto o yo ga shiru you ni, watashi wa chichi ga omeiji ni natta toori no koto o okonau no de aru. Tate. Saa, koko kara dekakete ikou.
Watashi wa makoto no budou no ki, watashi no chichi wa noufu de aru.
Watashi ni tsunagatte iru eda de mi o musubanai mono wa, chichi ga subete kore o torinozoki, mi o musubu mono wa, motto yutaka ni minoraseru tame ni, teire shite kore o kirei ni nasaru no de aru.
Anata gata wa, watashi ga katatta kotoba ni yotte sudeni kiyoku sarete iru.
Watashi ni tsunagatte i nasai. Sou sureba, watashi wa anata gata to tsunagatte iyou. Eda ga budou no ki ni tsunagatte inakereba, jibun dake de wa mi o musubu koto ga dekinai you ni, anata gata mo watashi ni tsunagatte inakereba mi o musubu koto ga dekinai.
Watashi wa budou no ki, anata gata wa sono eda de aru. Moshi hito ga watashi ni tsunagatte ori, mata watashi ga sono hito to tsunagatte oreba, sono hito wa mi o yutaka ni musubu you ni naru. Watashi kara hanarete wa, anata gata wa nanihito tsu dekinaikara de aru.
Hito ga watashi ni tsunagatte inainaraba, eda no you ni soto ni nagesuterarete kareru. Hitobito wa sore o kakiatsume, hi ni nageirete, yaite shimau no de aru.
Anata gata ga watashi ni tsunagatte ori, watashi no kotoba ga anata gata ni todomatte irunaraba, nan de mo nozomu mono o motomeru ga yoi. Sou sureba, ataerarerude arou.
Anata gata ga mi o yutaka ni musubi, soshite watashi no deshi to narunaraba, sore ni yotte, watashi no chichi wa eikou o ouke ni narude arou.
Chichi ga watashi o aisareta you ni, watashi mo anatagata o aishita no de aru. Watashi no ai no uchi ni i nasai.
Moshi watashi no imashime o mamorunaraba, anata gata wa watashi no ai no uchi ni oru no de aru. Sore wa watashi ga watashi no chichi no imashime o mamotta no de, sono ai no uchi ni oru no to onaji de aru.
Watashi ga korera no koto o hanashita no wa, watashi no yorokobi ga anata gata no uchi ni mo yadoru tame, mata, anata gata no yorokobi ga michiafureru tame de aru.
Watashi no imashime wa, kore de aru. Watashi ga anatagata o aishita you ni, anata gata mo tagai ni aishiai nasai.
Hito ga sono tomo no tame ni jibun no inochi o suteru koto, kore yori mo ookina ai wa nai.
Anata gata ni watashi ga meijiru koto o okonaunaraba, anata gata wa watashi no tomo de aru.
Watashi wa mou, anatagata o shimobe to wa yobanai. Shimobe wa shujin no shite iru koto o shiranaikara de aru. Watashi wa anatagata o tomo to yonda. Watashi no chichi kara kiita koto o mina, anata gata ni shirasetakara de aru.
Anata gata ga watashi o eranda no de wa nai. Watashi ga anatagata o eranda no de aru. Soshite, anatagata o tateta. Sore wa, anata gata ga itte mi o musubi, sono mi ga itsu made mo nokoru tame de ari, mata, anata gata ga watashi no na ni yotte chichi ni motomeru mono wa nan de mo, chichi ga ataete kudasaru tame de aru.
Korera no koto o meijiru no wa, anata gata ga tagai ni aishiau tame de aru.
Moshi konoyo ga anatagata o nikumunaraba, anata ga tayori mo saki ni watashi o nikunda koto o, shitte oku ga yoi.
Moshi anata gata ga konoyo kara deta mono de attanara, konoyo wa, anatagata o jibun no mono to shite aishitade arou. Shikashi, anata gata wa konoyo no mono de wa nai. Kaette, watashi ga anatagata o konoyo kara erabidashita no de aru. Dakara, konoyo wa anatagata o nikumu no de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata ni 'Shimobe wa sono shujin ni masaru mono de wa nai' to itta koto o, oboete i nasai. Moshi hitobito ga watashi o hakugai shitanara, anatagata o mo hakugai surude arou. Mata, moshi karera ga watashi no kotoba o mamotte itanara, anata gata no kotoba o mo mamorude arou.
Karera wa watashi no na no yue ni, anata gata ni taishite subete sorera no koto o surude arou. Sore wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata o karera ga shiranaikara de aru.
Moshi watashi ga kite karera ni kataranakattanaraba, karera wa tsumi o okasanai desu n dade arou. Shikashi ima to natte wa, karera ni wa, sono tsumi ni tsuite iinogareru michi ga nai.
Watashi o nikumu mono wa, watashi no chichi o mo nikumu.
Moshi, hoka no dare mo ga shinakatta you na waza o, watashi ga karera no aida de shinakattanaraba, karera wa tsumi o okasanai desu n dade arou. Shikashi jijitsu, karera wa watashi to watashi no chichi to o mite, nikunda no de aru.
Sore wa, 'Karera wa riyuu nashi ni watashi o nikunda' to kaite aru karera no rippou no kotoba ga jouju suru tame de aru.
Watashi ga chichi no mimoto kara anata gata ni tsukawasou to shite iru tasukenushi, sunawachi, chichi no mimoto kara kuru shinri no mitama ga kudaru toki, sore wa watashi ni tsuite akashi o surude arou.
Anata gata mo, hajime kara watashi to issho ni ita no de arukara, akashi o suru no de aru.
Watashi ga korera no koto o katatta no wa, anata gata ga tsumazuku koto no nai tame de aru.
Hitobito wa anatagata o kaidou kara oidasude arou. Sarani anatagata o korosu mono ga mina, sore ni yotte jibuntachi wa kami ni tsukaete iru no da to omou toki ga kurude arou.
Karera ga sono you na koto o suru no wa, chichi o mo watashi o mo shiranaikara de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata ni korera no koto o itta no wa, karera no toki ga kita baai, watashi ga karera ni tsuite itta koto o, omoiokosaseru tame de aru. Korera no koto o hajime kara iwanakatta no wa, watashi ga anata gata to issho ni itakara de aru.
Keredo mo ima watashi wa, watashi o tsukawasareta kata no tokoro ni ikou to shite iru. Shikashi, anata gata no uchi, dare mo 'Doko e iku no ka' to tazuneru mono wa nai.
Kaette, watashi ga korera no koto o itta tame ni, anata gata no kokoro wa urei de mitasarete iru.
Shikashi, watashi wa hontou no koto o anata gata ni iuga, watashi ga satte iku koto wa, anata gata no eki ni naru no da. Watashi ga satte ikanakereba, anata gata no tokoro ni tasukenushi wa konaide arou. Moshi ikeba, sore o anata gata ni tsukawasou.
Sore ga kitara, tsumi to gi to sabaki to ni tsuite, yo no hito no me o hirakude arou.
Tsumi ni tsuite to itta no wa, karera ga watashi o shinjinaikara de aru.
Gi ni tsuite to itta no wa, watashi ga chichi no mimoto ni iki, anata gata wa, mohaya watashi o minaku narukara de aru.
Sabaki ni tsuite to itta no wa, konoyo no kimi ga sabakarerukara de aru.
Watashi ni wa, anata gata ni iubeki koto ga mada ooku aruga, anata gata wa ima wa sore ni taerarenai.
Keredo mo shinri no mitama ga kuru toki ni wa, anatagata o arayuru shinri ni michibiite kurerude arou. Sore wa jibun kara kataru no de wa naku, sono kiku tokoro o katari, kitarubeki koto o anata gata ni shiraserude arou.
Mitama wa watashi ni eikou o esaserude arou. Watashi no mono o ukete, sore o anata gata ni shiraserukara de aru.
Chichi ga omochi ni natte iru mono wa mina, watashi no mono de aru. Mitama wa watashi no mono o ukete, sore o anata gata ni shiraseru no dato, watashi ga itta no wa, sono tame de aru.
Shibaraku sureba, anata gata wa mou watashi o minaku naru. Shikashi, mata shibaraku sureba, watashi ni aerude arou".
Soko de, deshitachi no uchi no aru mono wa tagai ni iiatta, " 'Shibaraku sureba, watashi o minaku naru. Mata shibaraku sureba, watashi ni aerude arou' to iware, 'Watashi no chichi no tokoro ni iku' to iwareta no wa, ittai, dou iu koto na no de arou".
Karera wa mata itta, " 'Shibaraku sureba' to iwareru no wa, dou iu koto ka. Watashitachi ni wa, sono kotoba no imi ga wakaranai".
Iesu wa, karera ga tazunetagatte iru koto ni ki ga tsuite, karera ni iwareta, "Shibaraku sureba watashi o minaku naru, mata shibaraku sureba watashi ni aerude arouto, watashi ga itta koto de, tagai ni ronjiatte iru no ka.
Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Anata gata wa nakikanashimuga, konoyo wa yorokobude arou. Anata gata wa ureete iruga, sono urei wa yorokobi ni kawarude arou.
Onna ga ko o umu baai ni wa, sono toki ga kita to iu no de, fuan o kanjiru. Shikashi, ko o unde shimaeba, mohaya sono kurushimi o oboete wa inai. Hitori no hito ga konoyo ni umareta, to iu yorokobi ga aru tame de aru.
Kono you ni, anata gata ni mo ima wa fuan ga aru. Shikashi, watashi wa futatabi anata gata to aude arou. Soshite, anata gata no kokoro wa yorokobi ni mitasarerude arou. Sono yorokobi o anata gata kara torisaru mono wa inai.
Sono hi ni wa, anata gata ga watashi ni tou koto wa, nani mo naide arou. Yokuyoku anata gata ni itte oku. Anata gata ga chichi ni motomeru mono wa nan de mo, watashi no na ni yotte kudasarude arou.
Ima made wa, anata gata wa watashi no na ni yotte motometa koto wa nakatta. Motome nasai, sou sureba, ataerarerude arou. Soshite, anata gata no yorokobi ga michiafurerude arou.
Watashi wa korera no koto o hiyu de hanashitaga, mohaya hiyu de wa hanasanaide, akarasama ni, chichi no koto o anata gata ni hanashite kikaseru toki ga kurude arou.
Sono hi ni wa, anata gata wa, watashi no na ni yotte motomerude arou. Watashi wa, anata gata no tame ni chichi ni negatte ageyou to wa iumai.
Chichi gojishin ga anatagata o aishite oide ni narukara de aru. Sore wa, anata gata ga watashi o aishita tame, mata, watashi ga kami no mimoto kara kita koto o shinjita tame de aru.
Watashi wa chichi kara dete konoyo ni kitaga, mata konoyo o satte, chichi no mimoto ni iku no de aru".
Deshitachi wa itta, "Ima wa akarasama ni ohanashi ni natte, sukoshi mo hiyu de wa ohanashi ni narimasen.
Anata wa subete no koto o gozonjide ari, dare mo anata ni otazune suru hitsuyou no nai koto ga, ima wakarimashita. Kono koto ni yotte, watashitachi wa anata ga kami kara korareta kata de aru to shinjimasu".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata gata wa imashinjite iru no ka.
Miyo, anata gata wa chirasarete, sorezore jibun no ie ni kaeri, watashi o hitori dake nokosu toki ga kurude arou. Iya, sudeni kite iru. Shikashi, watashi wa hitori de iru no de wa nai. Chichi ga watashi to issho ni orareru no de aru.
Korera no koto o anata gata ni hanashita no wa, watashi ni atte heian o eru tame de aru. Anata gata wa, konoyo de wa nayami ga aru. Shikashi, yuuki o dashi nasai. Watashi wa sudeni yo ni katte iru".
Korera no koto o katari oeruto, Iesu wa ten o miagete iwareta, "Chichi yo, toki ga kimashita. Anata no ko ga anata no eikou o arawasu you ni, ko no eikou o arawashite kudasai.
Anata wa, ko ni tamawatta subete no mono ni, eien no inochi o sazukesaseru tame, banmin o shihai suru ken'i o ko ni oatae ni natta no desukara.
Eien no inochi to wa, yuiitsu no, makoto no kami de imasu anata to, mata, anata ga tsukawasareta Iesu Kirisuto to o shiru koto de arimasu.
Watashi wa, watashi ni saseru tame ni osazuke ni natta waza o nashitogete, chijou de anata no eikou o arawashimashita.
Chichi yo, yo ga tsukurareru mae ni, watashi ga misoba de motte ita eikou de, ima mimae ni watashi o kagayakasete kudasai.
Watashi wa, anata ga yo kara erande watashi ni tamawatta hitobito ni, mina o arawashimashita. Karera wa anata no mono de arimashitaga, watashi ni kudasaimashita. Soshite, karera wa anata no kotoba o mamorimashita.
Ima karera wa, watashi ni tamawatta mono wa subete, anata kara deta mono de aru koto o shirimashita.
Naze nara, watashi wa anata kara itadaita kotoba o karera ni atae, soshite karera wa sore o uke, watashi ga anata kara deta mono de aru koto o hontou ni shiri, mata, anata ga watashi o tsukawasareta koto o shinjiru ni itattakara desu.
Watashi wa karera no tame ni onegai shimasu. Watashi ga onegai suru no wa, konoyo no tame ni de wa naku, anata ga watashi ni tamawatta monotachi no tame desu. Karera wa anata no mono na no desu.
Watashi no mono wa mina anata no mono, anata no mono wa watashi no mono desu. Soshite, watashi wa karera ni yotte eikou o ukemashita.
Watashi wa mou konoyo ni wa inaku narimasuga, karera wa konoyo ni nokotte ori, watashi wa mimoto ni mairimasu. Sei naru chichi yo, watashi ni tamawatta mina ni yotte karera o mamotte kudasai. Sore wa watashitachi ga hitotsu de aru you ni, karera mo hitotsu ni naru tame de arimasu.
Watashi ga karera to issho ni ita aida wa, anata kara itadaita mina ni yotte karera o mamori, mata hogo shite mairimashita. Karera no uchi, dare mo horobizu, tada horobi no ko dake ga horobimashita. Sore wa seisho ga jouju suru tame deshita.
Ima watashi wa mimoto ni mairimasu. Soshite yo ni iru aida ni korera no koto o kataru no wa, watashi no yorokobi ga karera no uchi ni michiafureru tame de arimasu.
Watashi wa karera ni mikotoba o ataemashitaga, yo wa karera o nikumimashita. Watashi ga yo no mono de nai you ni, karera mo yo no mono de wa naikara desu.
Watashi ga onegai suru no wa, karera o yo kara torisaru koto de wa naku, karera o ashiki mono kara mamotte kudasaru koto de arimasu.
Watashi ga yo no mono de nai you ni, karera mo yo no mono de wa arimasen.
Shinri ni yotte karera o seibetsu shite kudasai. Anata no mikotoba wa shinri de arimasu.
Anata ga watashi o yo ni tsukawasareta you ni, watashi mo karera o yo ni tsukawashimashita.
Mata karera ga shinri ni yotte seibetsu sareru you ni, karera no tame watashi jishin o seibetsu itashimasu.
Watashi wa karera no tame bakari de wa naku, karera no kotoba o kiite watashi o shinjite iru hitobito no tame ni mo, onegai itashimasu.
Chichi yo, sore wa, anata ga watashi no uchi ni orare, watashi ga anata no uchi ni iru you ni, minna no mono ga hitotsu to naru tame de arimasu. Sunawachi, karera o mo watashitachi no uchi ni oraseru tame de ari, sore ni yotte, anata ga watashi o otsukawashi ni natta koto o, yo ga shinjiru you ni naru tame de arimasu.
Watashi wa, anata kara itadaita eikou o karera ni mo ataemashita. Sore wa, watashitachi ga hitotsu de aru you ni, karera mo hitotsu ni naru tame de arimasu.
Watashi ga karera ni ori, anata ga watashi ni imasu no wa, karera ga kanzen ni hitotsu to naru tame de ari, mata, anata ga watashi o tsukawashi, watashi o aisareta you ni, karera o oaishi ni natta koto o, yo ga shiru tame de arimasu.
Chichi yo, anata ga watashi ni tamawatta hitobito ga, watashi no iru tokoro ni issho ni iru you ni shite kudasai. Tenchi ga tsukurareru mae kara watashi o aishite kudasatte, watashi ni tamawatta eikou o, karera ni misasete kudasai.
Tadashii chichi yo, konoyo wa anata o shitte imasen. Shikashi, watashi wa anata o shiri, mata karera mo, anata ga watashi o otsukawashi ni natta koto o shitte imasu.
Soshite watashi wa karera ni mina o shirasemashita. Mata kore kara mo shirasemashou. Sore wa, anata ga watashi o aishite kudasatta sono ai ga karera no uchi ni ari, mata watashi mo karera no uchi ni oru tame de arimasu".
Iesu wa korera no koto o katari oete, deshitachi to issho ni Kederon no tani no mukou e ikareta. Soko ni wa sono ga atte, Iesu wa deshitachi to issho ni sono naka ni wa irareta.
Iesu o uragitta Yuda wa, sono tokoro o yoku shitte ita. Iesu to deshitachi to ga tabitabi soko de atsumatta koto ga arukara de aru.
Sate Yuda wa, ittai no heisotsu to saishichou ya Parisaibitotachi no okutta shitayakudomo o hikitsure, taimatsu ya akari ya buki o motte, soko e yatte kita.
Shikashi Iesu wa, jibun no mi ni okorou to suru koto o kotogotoku shouchi shite orare, susumidete karera ni iwareta, "Dare o sagashite iru no ka".
Karera wa "Nazare no Iesu o" to kotaeta. Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Watashi ga, sore de aru". Iesu o uragitta Yuda mo, karera to issho ni tatte ita.
Iesu ga karera ni "Watashi ga, sore de aru" to iwareta toki, karera wa ushiro ni hikisagatte chi ni taoreta.
Soko de mata karera ni, "Dare o sagashite iru no ka" to otazune ni naruto, karera wa "Nazare no Iesu o" to itta.
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi ga sore de aruto, ittade wa nai ka. Watashi o sagashite iru no nara, kono hitotachi o sarasete moraitai".
Sore wa, "Anata ga ataete kudasatta hitotachi no naka no hitori mo, watashi wa ushinawanakatta" to Iesu no iwareta kotoba ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Shimon Petero wa ken o motte itaga, sore o nuite, daisaishi no shimobe ni kiri kakari, sono migi no mimi o kiriotoshita. Sono shimobe no na wa Marukosu de atta.
Suruto, Iesu wa Petero ni iwareta, "Ken o saya ni osame nasai. Chichi ga watashi ni kudasatta sakazuki wa, nomubekide wa nai ka".
Sore kara ittai no heisotsu ya sono sensotsuchou ya Yudayajin no shitayakudomo ga, Iesu o torae, shibariagete,
Mazu Annasu no tokoro ni hikitsurete itta. Kare wa sono toshi no daisaishi Kayapa no shuuto de atta.
Kayapa wa mae ni, hitori no hito ga tami no tame ni shinu no wa yoi koto dato, Yudayajin ni jogen shita mono de atta.
Shimon Petero to mou hitori no deshi to ga, Iesu ni tsuite itta. Kono deshi wa daisaishi no shiriai de atta no de, Iesu to issho ni daisaishi no nakaniwa ni haitta.
Shikashi, Petero wa soto de toguchi ni tatte ita. Suruto daisaishi no shiriai de aru sono deshi ga, soto ni dete itte monban no onna ni hanashi, Petero o uchi ni irete yatta.
Suruto, kono monban no onna ga Petero ni itta, "Anata mo, ano hito no deshi no hitori de wa arimasen ka". Petero wa "Iya, sou de wa nai" to kotaeta.
Shimobe ya shitayakudomo wa, samui toki de atta no de, sumibi o okoshi, soko ni tatte atatte ita. Petero mo mata karera ni majiri, tatte atatte ita.
Daisaishi wa Iesu ni, deshitachi no koto ya Iesu no oshie no koto o tazuneta.
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi wa konoyo ni taishite kouzen to katatte kita. Subete no Yudayajin ga atsumaru kaidou ya miya de, itsu mo oshiete ita. Nanigoto mo kakurete katatta koto wa nai.
Naze, watashi ni tazuneru no ka. Watashi ga karera ni katatta koto wa, sore o kiita hitobito ni tazuneru ga yoi. Watashi no itta koto wa, karera ga shitte iru no dakara".
Iesu ga kou iwareruto, soko ni tatte ita shitayaku no hitori ga, "Daisaishi ni mukatte, sono you na kotae o suru no ka" to itte, hirate de Iesu o utta.
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Moshi watashi ga nani ka warui koto o itta no nara, sono warui riyuu o ii nasai. Shikashi, tadashii koto o itta no nara, naze watashi o utsu no ka".
Sore kara Annasu wa, Iesu o shibatta mama daisaishi Kayapa no tokoro e okutta.
Shimon Petero wa, tatte hi ni atatte ita. Suru to hitobito ga kare ni itta, "Anata mo, ano hito no deshi no hitori de wa nai ka". Kare wa sore o uchikeshite, "Iya, sou de wa nai" to itta.
Daisaishi no shimobe no hitori de, Petero ni mimi o kiriotosareta hito no shinzoku no mono ga itta, "Anata ga sono de ano hito to issho ni iru no o, watashi wa mitade wa nai ka".
Petero wa mata sore o uchikeshita. Suruto sugu ni, niwatori ga naita.
Sore kara hitobito wa, Iesu o Kayapa no tokoro kara kantei ni tsurete itta. Toki wa yoake de atta. Karera wa, kegare o ukenaide sugikoshi no shokuji ga dekiru you ni, kantei ni hairanakatta.
Soko de, Pirato wa karera no tokoro ni dete kite itta, "Anata gata wa, kono hito ni taishite donna uttae o okosu no ka".
Karera wa Pirato ni kotaete itta, "Moshi kono hito ga akuji o hatarakanakattanara, anata ni hikiwatasu you na koto wa shinakattadeshou".
Soko de Pirato wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata wa kare o hikitotte, jibuntachi no rippou de sabaku ga yoi". Yudayajinra wa kare ni itta, "Watashitachi ni wa, hito o shikei ni suru kengen ga arimasen".
Kore wa, gojishin ga donna shinikata o shiyou to shite iru ka o shimesu tame ni iwareta Iesu no kotoba ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Sate, Pirato wa mata kantei ni hairi, Iesu o yobidashite itta, "Anata wa, Yudayajin no ou de aru ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata ga sou iu no wa, jibun no kangae kara ka. Sore to mo hoka no hitobito ga, watashi no koto o anata ni sou itta no ka".
Pirato wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa Yudayajin na no ka. Anata no douzoku ya saishichou tachi ga, anata o watashi ni hikiwatashita no da. Anata wa, ittai, nani o shita no ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Watashi no kuni wa konoyo no mono de wa nai. Moshi watashi no kuni ga konoyo no mono de areba, watashi ni shitagatte iru monotachi wa, watashi o Yudayajin ni watasanai you ni tatakattade arou. Shikashi jijitsu, watashi no kuni wa konoyo no mono de wa nai".
Soko de Pirato wa Iesu ni itta, "Sore de wa, anata wa ou na no da na". Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata no iu toori, watashi wa ou de aru. Watashi wa shinri ni tsuite akashi o suru tame ni umare, mata, sono tame ni konoyo ni kita no de aru. Dare de mo shinri ni tsuku mono wa, watashi no koe ni mimi o katamukeru".
Pirato wa Iesu ni itta, "Shinri to wa nani ka". Kou itte, kare wa mata Yudayajin no tokoro ni dete iki, karera ni itta, "Watashi ni wa, kono hito ni nan no tsumi mo miidasenai.
Sugikoshi no toki ni wa, watashi ga anata gata no tame ni, hitori no hito o yurushite yaru no ga, anata gata no shikitari ni natte iru. Tsuite wa, anata gata wa, kono Yudayajin no ou o yurushite moraitai no ka".
Suruto karera wa, mata sakende "Sono hito de wa naku, Baraba o" to itta. Kono Baraba wa goutou de atta.
Soko de Pirato wa, Iesu o torae, muchi de utaseta.
Heisotsutachi wa, ibara de kanmuri o a nde, Iesu no atama ni kaburase, murasaki no uwagi o kise,
Sore kara, sono mae ni susumidete, "Yudayajin no ou, banzai" to itta. Soshite hirate de Iesu o uchi tsuzuketa.
Suru to Pirato wa, mata dete itte Yudayajintachi ni itta, "Miyo, watashi wa kono hito o anata gata no mae ni hikidasuga, sore wa kono hito ni nan no tsumi mo miidasenai koto o, anata gata ni shitte morau tame de aru".
Iesu wa ibara no kanmuri o kaburi, murasaki no uwagi o kita mama de soto e derareruto, Pirato wa karera ni itta, "Miyo, kono hito da".
Saishichou tachi ya shitayakudomo wa Iesu o miruto, sakende "Juujika ni tsukeyo, juujika ni tsukeyo" to itta. Pirato wa karera ni itta, "Anata ga taga, kono hito o hikitotte juujika ni tsukeru ga yoi. Watashi wa, kare ni wa nan no tsumi mo miidasenai".
Yudayajintachi wa kare ni kotaeta, "Watashitachi ni wa rippou ga arimasu. Sono rippou ni yoreba, kare wa jibun o kami no ko to shita no dakara, shizai ni ataru mono desu".
Pirato ga kono kotoba o kiita toki, masumasu osore,
Mou ichi do kantei ni haitte Iesu ni itta, "Anata wa, motomoto, doko kara kita no ka". Shikashi, Iesu wa nan no kotae mo nasaranakatta.
Soko de Pirato wa itta, "Nani mo kotaenai no ka. Watashi ni wa, anata o yurusu ken'i ga ari, mata juujika ni tsukeru ken'i ga aru koto o, shiranai no ka".
Iesu wa kotaerareta, "Anata wa, ue kara tamawaru no de nakereba, watashi ni taishite nan no ken'i mo nai. Dakara, watashi o anata ni hikiwatashita mono no tsumi wa, motto ookii".
Kore o kiite, Pirato wa Iesu o yurusou to tsutometa. Shikashi Yudayajintachi ga sakende itta, "Moshi kono hito o yurushitanara, anata wa Kaizaru no mikata de wa arimasen. Jibun o ou to suru mono wa subete, Kaizaru ni somuku mono desu".
Pirato wa korera no kotoba o kiite, Iesu o soto e hikidashite iki, shikiishi (Heburu go de wa Gabata) to iu basho de saiban no seki ni tsuita.
Sono hi wa sugikoshi no junbi no hi de atte, toki wa hiru no juu ni ji koro de atta. Pirato wa Yudayajinra ni itta, "Miyo, kore ga anata gata no ou da".
Suruto karera wa sakenda, "Korose, korose, kare o juujika ni tsukeyo". Pirato wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata no ou o, watashi ga juujika ni tsukeru no ka". Saishichou tachi wa kotaeta, "Watashitachi ni wa, Kaizaru igai ni ou wa arimasen".
Soko de Pirato wa, juujika ni tsuke saseru tame ni, Iesu o karera ni hikiwatashita. Karera wa Iesu o hikitotta.
Iesu wa mizukara juujika o seotte, sarekoube (Heburu go de wa Gorugoda) to iu basho ni dete ikareta.
Karera wa soko de, Iesu o juujika ni tsuketa. Iesu o mannaka ni shite, hoka no futari no mono o ryougawa ni, Iesu to issho ni juujika ni tsuketa.
Pirato wa zaijougaki o kaite, juujika no ue ni kakesaseta. Sore ni wa "Yudayajin no ou, Nazare no Iesu" to kaite atta.
Iesu ga juujika ni tsukerareta basho wa miyako ni chikakatta no de, ooku no Yudayajin ga kono zaijougaki o yonda. Sore wa Heburu, Rooma, Girishiya no kokugo de kaite atta.
Yudayajin no saishichou tachi ga Pirato ni itta, " 'Yudayajin no ou' to kakazu ni, 'Kono hito wa Yudayajin no ou to jishou shite ita' to kaite hoshii".
Pirato wa kotaeta, "Watashi ga kaita koto wa, kaita mama ni shite oke".
Sate, heisotsutachi wa Iesu o juujika ni tsukete kara, sono uwagi o totte yontsu ni wake, onoono, sono hitotsu o totta. Mata shitagi o te ni totte mitaga, sore ni wa nuime ga naku, ue no hou kara zenbu hitotsu ni otta mono de atta.
Soko de karera wa tagai ni itta, "Sore o sakanaide, dare no mono ni naru ka, kuji o hikou". Kore wa, "Karera wa tagai ni watashi no uwagi o wakeai, watashi no koromo o kujibiki ni shita" to iu seisho ga jouju suru tame de, heisotsutachi wa sono you ni shita no de aru.
Sate, Iesu no juujika no soba ni wa, Iesu no haha to, haha no shimai to, Kuropa no tsuma Mariya to, Magudara no Mariya to ga, tatazunde ita.
Iesu wa, sono haha to aideshi to ga soba ni tatte iru no o goran ni natte, haha ni iwareta, "Fujin yo, goran nasai. Kore wa anata no ko desu".
Sore kara kono deshi ni iwareta, "Goran nasai. Kore wa anata no haha desu". Sono toki irai, kono deshi wa Iesu no haha o jibun no ie ni hikitotta.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa ima ya banji ga owatta koto o shitte, "Watashi wa, kawaku" to iwareta. Sore wa, seisho ga mattou sareru tame de atta.
Soko ni, su i budoushu ga ippai irete aru utsuwa ga oite atta no de, hitobito wa, kono budoushu o fukumaseta kaimen o hisopu no kuki ni musubitsukete, Iesu no kuchimoto ni sashidashita.
Suruto, Iesu wa sono budoushu o ukete, "Subete ga owatta" to iware, kubi o tarete iki o hikitorareta.
Sate Yudayajintachi wa, sono hi ga junbi no hi de atta no de, ansokunichi ni shitai o juujika no ue ni nokoshite okumaito, (tokuni sono ansokunichi wa daiji na hi de attakara), Pirato ni negatte, ashi o otta ue de, shitai o toriorosu koto ni shita.
Soko de heisotsura ga kite, Iesu to issho ni juujika ni tsukerareta hajime no mono to, mou hitori no mono to no ashi o otta.
Shikashi, karera ga Iesu no tokoro ni kita toki, Iesu wa mou shinde orareta no o mite, sono ashi o oru koto wa shinakatta.
Shikashi, hitori no heisotsu ga yaride sono waki o tsukisasuto, sugu chi to mizu to ga nagaredeta.
Sore o mita mono ga akashi o shita. Soshite, sono akashi wa shinjitsu de aru. Sono hito wa, jibun ga shinjitsu o katatte iru koto o shitte iru. Sore wa, anata gata mo shinzuru you ni naru tame de aru.
Korera no koto ga okotta no wa, "Sono hone wa kudakarenaide arou" to no seisho no kotoba ga, jouju suru tame de aru.
Mata seisho no hoka no tokoro ni, "Karera wa jibun ga sashitooshita mono o mirude arou" to aru.
Sono nochi, Yudayajin o habakatte, hisoka ni Iesu no deshi to natta Arimataya no Yosefu to iu hito ga, Iesu no shitai o torioroshitai to, Pirato ni negaideta. Pirato wa sore o yurushita no de, kare wa Iesu no shitai o torioroshi ni itta.
Mata, mae ni, yoru, Iesu no mimoto ni itta Nikodemo mo, motsuyaku to jinkou to o mazeta mono o hyaku kin hodo motte kita.
Karera wa, Iesu no shitai o torioroshi, Yudayajin no maisou no shuukan ni shitagatte, kouryou o irete amanuno de maita.
Iesu ga juujika ni kakerareta tokoro ni wa, hitotsu no sono ga ari, soko ni wa mada dare mo houmurareta koto no nai atarashii haka ga atta.
Sono hi wa Yudayajin no junbi no hi de atta no de, sono haka ga chikaku ni atta tame, Iesu o soko ni osameta.
Sate, ichi shuu no hajime no hi ni, asa hayaku mada kurai uchi ni, Magudara no Mariya ga haka ni ikuto, haka kara ishi ga torinokete aru no o mita.
Soko de hashitte, Shimon Petero to Iesu ga aishite orareta, mou hitori no deshi no tokoro e itte, karera ni itta, "Dare ka ga, Shu o haka kara torisarimashita. Doko e oita no ka, wakarimasen".
Soko de Petero to mou hitori no deshi wa dekakete, haka e mukatte itta.
Futari wa issho ni hashiri dashitaga, sono mou hitori no deshi no hou ga, Petero yori mo hayaku hashitte saki ni haka ni tsuki,
Soshite mi o kagamete miruto, amanuno ga soko ni oite aru no o mitaga, naka e wa hairanakatta.
Shimon Petero mo tsuzuite kite, haka no naka ni haitta. Kare wa amanuno ga soko ni oite aru no o mitaga,
Iesu no atama ni maite atta nuno wa amanuno no soba ni wa nakute, hanareta betsu no basho ni kurumete atta.
Suruto, saki ni haka ni tsuita mou hitori no deshi mo haitte kite, kore o mite shinjita.
Shikashi, karera wa shinin no uchi kara Iesu ga yomigaerubeki koto o shirushita seiku o, mada satotte inakatta.
Sore kara, futari no deshitachi wa jibun no ie ni kaette itta.
Shikashi, Mariya wa haka no soto ni tatte naite ita. Soshite nakinagara, mi o kagamete haka no naka o nozokuto,
Shiroi koromo o kita futari no mitsukai ga, Iesu no shitai no okarete ita basho ni, hitori wa atama no hou ni, hitori wa ashi no hou ni, suwatte iru no o mita.
Suruto, karera wa Mariya ni, "Onna yo, naze naite iru no ka" to itta. Mariya wa karera ni itta, "Dare ka ga, watashi no Shu o torisarimashita. Soshite, doko ni oita no ka, wakaranai no desu".
Sou itte, ushiro o furimukuto, soko ni Iesu ga tatte orareru no o mita. Shikashi, sore ga Iesu de aru koto ni ki ga tsukanakatta.
Iesu wa onna ni iwareta, "Onna yo, naze naite iru no ka. Dare o sagashite iru no ka". Mariya wa, sono hito ga sono no bannin da to omotte itta, "Moshi anata ga, ano kata o utsushita no deshitara, doko e oita no ka, douzo, osshatte kudasai. Watashi ga sono kata o hikitorimasu".
Iesu wa kanojo ni "Mariya yo" to iwareta. Mariya wa furikaette, Iesu ni mukatte Heburu go de "Raboni" to itta. Sore wa, sensei to iu imi de aru.
Iesu wa kanojo ni iwareta, "Watashi ni sawatte wa ikenai. Watashi wa, mada chichi no mimoto ni nobotte inai no dakara. Tada, watashi no kyoudaitachi no tokoro ni itte, 'Watashi wa, watashi no chichi mata anata gata no chichi de atte, watashi no kami mata anata gata no kami de arareru kata no mimoto e nobotte iku' to, karera ni tsutae nasai".
Magudara no Mariya wa deshitachi no tokoro ni itte, jibun ga Shu ni atta koto, mata Iesu ga kore kore no koto o jibun ni oose ni natta koto o, houkoku shita.
Sono hi, sunawachi, ichi shuu no hajime no hi no yuugata, deshitachi wa Yudayajin o osorete, jibuntachi no oru tokoro no to o minashimete iruto, Iesu ga haitte kite, karera no naka ni tachi, "Yasukare" to iwareta.
Sou itte, te to waki to o, karera ni omise ni natta. Deshitachi wa Shu o mite yorokonda.
Iesu wa mata karera ni iwareta, "Yasukare. Chichi ga watashi o otsukawashi ni natta you ni, watashi mo mata anatagata o tsukawasu".
Sou itte, karera ni iki o fukikakete oose ni natta, "Seirei o ukeyo.
Anata gata ga yurusu tsumi wa, dare no tsumi de mo yurusare, anata gata ga yurusazu ni oku tsumi wa, sono mama nokorude arou".
Juu ni deshi no hitori de, Dedomo to yobarete iru Tomasu wa, Iesu ga korareta toki, karera to issho ni inakatta.
Hoka no deshitachi ga, kare ni "Watashitachi wa Shu ni ome ni kakatta" to iuto, Tomasu wa karera ni itta, "Watashi wa, sono te ni kugi ato o mi, watashi no yubi o sono kugi ato ni sashiire, mata, watashi no te o sono waki ni sashiirete minakereba, kesshite shinjinai".
Youka no nochi, Iesu no deshitachi wa mata ie no uchi ni ori, Tomasu mo issho ni ita. To wa mina tozasarete itaga, Iesu ga haitte korare, naka ni tatte "Yasukare" to iwareta.
Sore kara Tomasu ni iwareta, "Anata no yubi o koko ni tsukete, watashi no te o mi nasai. Te o nobashite watashi no waki ni sashiirete mi nasai. Shinjinai mono ni naranaide, shinjiru mono ni nari nasai".
Tomasu wa Iesu ni kotaete itta, "Waga Shu yo, waga kami yo".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Anata wa watashi o mita no de shinjita no ka. Minaide shinzuru mono wa, saiwai de aru".
Iesu wa, kono sho ni kakarete inai shirushi o, hoka ni mo ooku, deshitachi no mae de okonawareta.
Shikashi, korera no koto o kaita no wa, anata gata ga Iesu wa kami no ko Kirisuto de aru to shinjiru tame de ari, mata, sou shinjite, Iesu no na ni yotte inochi o eru tame de aru.
Sono nochi, Iesu wa Teberiya no umibe de, gojishin o mata deshitachi ni arawasareta. Sono arawasareta shidai wa, kou de aru.
Shimon Petero ga, Dedomo to yobarete iru Tomasu, Gariraya no Kana no Natanaeru, Zebedai no kora ya, hoka no futari no deshitachi to issho ni ita toki no koto de aru.
Shimon Petero wa karera ni "Watashi wa ryou ni iku no da" to iuto, karera wa "Watashitachi mo issho ni ikou" to itta. Karera wa dete itte fune ni notta. Shikashi, sono yo wa nan no emono mo nakatta.
Yo ga aketa koro, Iesu ga kishi ni tatte orareta. Shikashi deshitachi wa sore ga Iesu da to wa shiranakatta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Kotachi yo, nani ka taberu mono ga aru ka". Karera wa "Arimasen" to kotaeta.
Suruto, Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Fune no migi no hou ni ami o oroshite mi nasai. Sou sureba, nani ka torerudarou". Karera wa ami o orosuto, uo ga ooku toreta no de, sore o hikiageru koto ga dekinakatta.
Iesu no aishite orareta deshi ga, Petero ni "Are wa Shu da" to itta. Shimon Petero wa Shu de aru to kiite, hadaka ni natte ita tame, uwagi o matotte umi ni tobikonda.
Shikashi, hoka no deshitachi wa fune ni notta mama, uo no haitte iru ami o hikinagara kaette itta. Riku kara wa amari tooku nai gojuu ken hodo no tokoro ni itakara de aru.
Karera ga riku ni nobotte miruto, sumibi ga okoshite atte, sono ue ni uo ga nosete ari, mata soko ni pan ga atta.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Ima totta uo o sukoshi motte ki nasai".
Shimon Petero ga itte, ami o riku e hikiageruto, hyaku gojuu sanbiki no ookina uo de ippai ni natte ita. Sonna ni ookattaga, ami wa sakenaide ita.
Iesu wa karera ni iwareta, "Saa, asa no shokuji o shi nasai". Deshitachi wa, Shu de aru koto ga wakatte ita no de, dare mo "Anata wa donata desu ka" to susunde tazuneru mono ga nakatta.
Iesu wa soko ni kite, pan o tori karera ni atae, mata uo mo onaji you ni sareta.
Iesu ga shinin no naka kara yomigaetta nochi, deshitachi ni arawareta no wa, kore de sudeni san dome de aru.
Karera ga shokuji o sumaseruto, Iesu wa Shimon Petero ni iwareta, "Yohane no ko Shimon yo, anata wa kono hitotachi ga aisuru ijou ni, watashi o aisuru ka". Petero wa itta, "Shu yo, sou desu. Watashi ga anata o aisuru koto wa, anata ga gozonji desu". Iesu wa kare ni "Watashi no kohitsuji o yashinai nasai" to iwareta.
Mata mou ichido kare ni iwareta, "Yohane no ko Shimon yo, watashi o aisuru ka". Kare wa Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, sou desu. Watashi ga anata o aisuru koto wa, anata ga gozonji desu". Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi no hitsuji o kai nasai".
Iesu wa san dome ni iwareta, "Yohane no ko Shimon yo, watashi o aisuru ka". Petero wa "Watashi o aisuru ka" to Iesu ga san do mo iwareta no de, kokoro o itamete Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, anata wa subete o gozonji desu. Watashi ga anata o aishite iru koto wa, owakari ni natte imasu". Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Watashi no hitsuji o yashinai nasai.
Yokuyoku anata ni itte oku. Anata ga wakakatta toki ni wa, jibun de obi o shimete, omoi no mama ni aruki mawatte ita. Shikashi toshi o totte kara wa, jibun no te o nobasu koto ni narou. Soshite, hoka no hito ga anata ni obi o musubitsuke, ikitaku nai tokoro e tsurete ikude arou".
Kore wa, Petero ga donna shinikata de, kami no eikou o arawasu ka o shimesu tame ni, ohanashi ni natta no de aru. Kou hanashite kara, "Watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai" to iwareta.
Petero wa furikaeruto, Iesu no aishite orareta deshi ga tsuite kuru no o mita. Kono deshi wa, ano yuushoku no toki Iesu no mune chikaku ni yorikakatte, "Shu yo, anata o uragiru mono wa, dare na no desu ka" to tazuneta hito de aru.
Petero wa kono deshi o mite, Iesu ni itta, "Shu yo, kono hito wa dou na no desu ka".
Iesu wa kare ni iwareta, "Tatoi, watashi no kuru toki made kare ga ikinokotte iru koto o, watashi ga nozonda to shite mo, anata ni wa nan no kaka wari ga aru ka. Anata wa, watashi ni shitagatte ki nasai".
Kou iu wake de, kono deshi wa shinu koto ga nai to iu uwasa ga, kyoudaitachi no aida ni hiromatta. Shikashi, Iesu wa kare ga shinu koto wa nai to iwareta no de wa naku, tada "Tatoi, watashi no kuru toki made kare ga ikinokotte iru koto o, watashi ga nozonda to shite mo, anata ni wa nan no kaka wari ga aru ka" to iwareta dake de aru.
Korera no koto ni tsuite akashi o shi, mata korera no koto o kaita no wa, kono deshi de aru. Soshite kare no akashi ga shinjitsu de aru koto o, watashitachi wa shitte iru.
Iesu no nasatta koto wa, kono hoka ni mada kazuooku aru. Moshi ichiichi kakitsukerunaraba, sekai mo sono kakareta bunsho o osame kirenaide arou to omou.
Teopiro yo, watashi wa saki ni daiichi kan o arawashite, Iesu ga okonai, mata oshie hajimete kara,
Oerabi ni natta shitotachi ni, seirei ni yotte meijita nochi, ten ni agerareta hi made no koto o, kotogotoku shirushita.
Iesu wa kunan o uketa nochi, jibun no ikite iru koto o kazukazu no tashika na shouko ni yotte shimeshi, yonjuu nichi ni watatte tabitabi karera ni arawarete, kami no kuni no koto o katarareta.
Soshite shokuji o tomo ni shite iru toki, karera ni omeiji ni natta, "Erusaremu kara hanarenaide, kanete watashi kara kiite ita chichi no yakusoku o matte iru ga yoi.
Sunawachi, Yohane wa mizu de baputesuma o sazuketaga, anata gata wa ma mo naku seirei ni yotte, baputesuma o sazukerarerude arou".
Sate, deshitachi ga issho ni atsumatta toki, Iesu ni toute itta, "Shu yo, Isuraeru no tame ni kuni o fukkou nasaru no wa, kono toki na no desu ka".
Karera ni iwareta, "Jiki ya baai wa, chichi ga gojibun no ken'i ni yotte sadamete orareru no de atte, anata gata no shiru kagiri de wa nai.
Tada, seirei ga anata gata ni kudaru toki, anata gata wa chikara o ukete, Erusaremu, Yudaya to Samariya no zendo, sarani chi no hate made, watashi no shounin to narude arou".
Kou ii owaruto, Iesu wa karera no mite iru mae de ten ni agerare, kumo ni mukaerarete, sono sugata ga mienaku natta.
Iesu no nobo tte ikareru toki, karera ga ten o mitsumete iruto, miyo, shiroi koromo o kita futari no hito ga, karera no soba ni tatte ite
Itta, "Gariraya no hitotachi yo, naze ten o aoide tatte iru no ka. Anatagata o hanarete ten ni agerareta kono Iesu wa, ten ni nobotte ikareru no o anata gata ga mita no to onaji arisama de, mata oide ni narude arou".
Sore kara karera wa, oribu to iu yama o kudatte Erusaremu ni kaetta. Kono yama wa Erusaremu ni chikaku, ansokunichi ni yurusarete iru kyori no tokoro ni aru.
Karera wa, shinai ni itte, sono tomatte ita okujou no ma ni agatta. Sono hitotachi wa, Petero, Yohane, Yakobu, Andere, Piripo to Tomasu, Barutoromai to Matai, Arupayo no ko Yakobu to nesshintou no Shimon to Yakobu no ko Yuda to de atta.
Karera wa mina, fujintachi, tokuni Iesu no haha Mariya, oyobi Iesu no kyoudaitachi to tomo ni, kokoro o awasete, hitasura inori o shite ita.
Sono koro, hyaku nijuu mei bakari no hitobito ga, ichidan to natte atsumatte itaga, Petero wa korera no kyoudaitachi no naka ni tatte itta,
"Kyoudaitachi yo, Iesu o toraeta monotachi no tebiki ni natta Yuda ni tsuite wa, seirei ga Dabide no kuchi o tooshite yogen shita sono kotoba wa, jouju shinakereba naranakatta.
Kare wa watashitachi no nakama ni kuwaerare, kono tsutome o sazukatte ita mono de atta. (
Kare wa fugi no houshuu de, aru jisho o te ni iretaga, soko e mas sakasama ni ochite, hara gamannaka kara hikisake, harawata ga mina nagaredete shimatta.
Soshite, kono koto wa Erusaremu no zenjuumin ni shire watari, soko de, kono jisho ga karera no kokugo de Akerudama to yobareru you ni natta. "Chi no jisho" to no i de aru.)
Shihen ni, 'Sono yashiki wa are hateyo, soko ni wa hitori mo sumu mono ga inaku nare' to kaite ari, mata 'Sono shoku wa, hoka no mono ni torase yo' to aru toori de aru.
Sou iu wake de, Shu Iesu ga watashitachi no aida ni yukiki sareta kikanchuu,
Sunawachi, Yohane no baputesuma no toki kara hajimatte, watashitachi o hanarete ten ni agerareta hi ni itaru made, shijuu watashitachi to koudou o tomo ni shita hitotachi no uchi, dare ka hitori ga, watashitachi ni kuwawatte Shu no fukkatsu no shounin ni naraneba naranai".
Soko de ichidou wa, Barusaba to yobare, mata no na o Yusuto to iu Yosefu to, Matteya to no futari o tate,
Inotte itta, "Subete no hito no kokoro o gozonjide aru Shu yo. Kono futari no uchi no dochira o erande,
Yuda ga kono shito no shokumu kara ochite, jibun no ikubeki tokoro e itta sono ato o tsugase nasaimasu ka, oshimeshi kudasai".
Sore kara, futari no tame ni kuji o hiita tokoro, Matteya ni atatta no de, kono hito ga juu ichinin no shitotachi ni kuwaerareru koto ni natta.
Gojunsetsu no hi ga kite, minna no mono ga issho ni atsumatte iruto,
Totsuzen, hageshii kaze ga fuite kita you na oto ga ten kara okotte kite, ichidou ga suwatte ita ie ippai ni hibiki watatta.
Mata, shita no you na mono ga, honoo no you ni wakarete araware, hitoribitori no ue ni todomatta.
Suruto, ichidou wa seirei ni mitasare, mitama ga kataraseru mama ni, iroiro no takoku no kotoba de katari dashita.
Sate, Erusaremu ni wa, tenka no arayuru kuniguni kara, shinkou bukai Yudayajintachi ga kite sunde itaga,
Kono monooto ni oozei no hito ga atsumatte kite, karera no umare kokyou no kokugo de, shitotachi ga hanashite iru no o, dare mo kare mo kiite akke ni torareta.
Soshite odorokiayashinde itta, "Miyo, ima hanashite iru kono hitotachi wa, mina Garirayabito de wa nai ka.
Sore da no ni, watashitachi ga sorezore, umare kokyou no kokugo o karera kara kikasareru to wa, ittai, dou shita koto ka.
Watashitachi no naka ni wa, Paruteyabito, Mejiyabito, Eramubito mo oreba, Mesopotamiya, Yudaya, Kapadokiya, Ponto to Ajiya,
Furugiya to Panfuriya, Ejiputo to Kurene ni chikai Ribiya chihou nado ni sumu mono mo irushi, mata Roomajin de tabi ni kite iru mono,
Yudayajin to kaishuusha, Kuretebito to Arabiyajin mo iru no daga, ano hitobito ga watashitachi no kokugo de, kami no ookina hataraki o noberu no o kiku to wa, dou shita koto ka".
Minna no mono wa odoroki madotte, tagai ni iiatta, "Kore wa, ittai, dou iu wake na no darou".
Shikashi, hoka no hitotachi wa azawaratte, "Ano hitotachi wa atarashii sake de yotte iru no da" to itta.
Soko de, Petero ga juu ichinin no mono to tomo ni tachiagari, koe o agete hitobito ni katarikaketa. "Yudaya no hitotachi, narabi ni Erusaremu ni sumu subete no katagata, dou ka, kono koto o shitte itadakitai. Watashi no iu koto ni mimi o katamukete itadakitai.
Ima wa asa no kyuu ji de arukara, kono hitotachi wa, anata gata ga omotte iru you ni, sake ni yotte iru no de wa nai.
Sou de wa naku, kore wa yogensha Yoeru ga yogen shite ita koto ni hoka naranai no de aru. Sunawachi,
'Kami ga kou oose ni naru. Owari no toki ni wa, watashi no rei o subete no hito ni sosogou. Soshite, anata gata no musuko musume wa yogen o shi, wakamonotachi wa maboroshi o mi, roujintachi wa yume o mirude arou.
Sono toki ni wa, watashi no danjo no shimobetachi ni mo watashi no rei o sosogou. Soshite karera mo yogen o surude arou.
Mata, ue de wa, ten ni kiseki o mise, shita de wa, chi ni shirushi o, sunawachi, chi to hi to tachikomeru kemuri to o, miserude arou.
Shu no ooinaru kagayakashii hi ga kuru mae ni, hi wa yami ni tsuki wa chi ni kawarude arou.
Sono toki, Shu no na o yobimotomeru mono wa, mina sukuwarerude arou'.
Isuraeru no hitotachi yo, ima watashi no kataru koto o kiki nasai. Anata gata ga yoku shitte iru toori, Nazarebito Iesu wa, kami ga kare o tooshite, anata gata no naka de okonawareta kazukazu no chikara aru wazato kiseki to shirushi to ni yori, kami kara tsukawasareta mono de aru koto o, anata gata ni shimesareta kata de atta.
Kono Iesu ga watasareta no wa kami no sadameta keikaku to yochi to ni yoru no de aruga, anata gata wa kare o fuhou no hitobito no te de juujika ni tsukete koroshita.
Kami wa kono Iesu o shi no kurushimi kara tokihanatte, yomigaeraseta no de aru. Iesu ga shini shihai sarete iru hazu wa nakattakara de aru.
Dabide wa Iesu ni tsuite kou itte iru, 'Watashi wa tsune ni me no mae ni Shu o mita. Shu wa, watashi ga ugokasarenai tame, watashi no migi ni ite kudasarukara de aru.
Sore yue, watashi no kokoro wa tanoshimi, watashi no shita wa yorokobi utatta. Watashi no nikutai mo mata, nozomi ni ikirude arou.
Anata wa, watashi no tamashii o yomi ni suteoku koto o sezu, anata no seija ga kuchi hateru no o, oyurushi ni naranaide arou.
Anata wa, inochi no michi o watashi ni shimeshi, mimae ni atte, watashi o yorokobi de mitashite kudasarude arou'.
Kyoudaitachi yo, zokuchou Dabide ni tsuite wa, watashi wa anata gata ni mukatte daitan ni iu koto ga dekiru. Kare wa shinde houmurare, genni sono haka ga kyou ni itaru made, watashitachi no aida ni nokotte iru.
Kare wa yogensha de atte, 'Sono shison no hitori o oui ni tsukaseyou' to, kami ga kataku kare ni chikawareta koto o mitomete ita no de,
Kirisuto no fukkatsu o arakajime shitte, 'Kare wa yomi ni suteokareru koto ga naku, mata sono nikutai ga kuchi hateru koto mo nai' to katatta no de aru.
Kono Iesu o, kami wa yomigaeraseta. Soshite, watashitachi wa mina sono shounin na no de aru.
Sore de, Iesu wa kami no migi ni agerare, chichi kara yakusoku no seirei o ukete, sore o watashitachi ni sosogareta no de aru. Kono koto wa, anata gata ga genni mikiki shite iru toori de aru.
Dabide ga ten ni nobotta no de wa nai. Kare jishin kou itte iru, 'Shu wa waga Shu ni oose ni natta,
Anata no teki o anata no ashidai ni suru made wa, watashi no migi ni zashite i nasai'.
Dakara, Isuraeru no zenka wa, kono koto o shikato shitte oku ga yoi. Anata gata ga juujika ni tsuketa kono Iesu o, kami wa, Shu mata Kirisuto to shite otate ni natta no de aru".
Hitobito wa kore o kiite, tsuyoku kokoro o sasare, Petero ya hoka no shitotachi ni, "Kyoudaitachi yo, watashitachi wa, dou shitara yoi no deshou ka" to itta.
Suruto, Petero ga kotaeta, "Kuiaratame nasai. Soshite, anata gata hitoribitori ga tsumi no yurushi o eru tame ni, Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte, baputesuma o uke nasai. Sou sureba, anata gata wa seirei no tamamono o ukerude arou.
Kono yakusoku wa, warera no Shu naru kami no meshi ni azukaru subete no mono, sunawachi anata gata to, anata gata no kora to, tooku no mono ichidou to ni, ataerarete iru mono de aru".
Petero wa, hoka ni nao ooku no kotoba de akashi o nashi, hitobito ni "Kono magatta jidai kara sukuwareyo" to itte susumeta.
Soko de, kare no susume no kotoba o ukeireta monotachi wa, baputesuma o uketaga, sono hi, nakama ni kuwawatta mono ga sanzennin hodo atta.
Soshite ichidou wa hitasura, shitotachi no oshie o mamori, shinto no majiwari o nashi, tomo ni pan o saki, inori o shite ita.
Minna no mono ni osore no nen ga shouji, ooku no kiseki to shirushi to ga, shitotachi ni yotte, tsugitsugi ni okonawareta.
Shinjatachi wa mina issho ni ite, issai no mono o kyouyuu ni shi,
Shisan ya mochimono o utte wa, hitsuyou ni oujite minna no mono ni wakeataeta.
Soshite hibi kokoro o hitotsu ni shite, taezu miya mo ude o nashi, ie de wa pan o saki, yorokobi to, magokoro to o motte, shokuji o tomo ni shi,
Kami osan bishi, subete no hito ni koui o motarete ita. Soshite Shu wa, sukuwareru mono o hibi nakama ni kuwaete kudasatta no de aru.
Sate, Petero to Yohane to ga, gogo san ji no inori no toki ni miya ni noborou to shite iruto,
Umarenagara ashi no kikanai otoko ga, kakaerarete kita. Kono otoko wa, miya mo ude ni kuru hitobito ni hodokoshi o kou tame, mainichi, "Utsukushi no mon" to yobareru miya no mon no tokoro ni, okarete ita mono de aru.
Kare wa, Petero to Yohane to ga, miya ni haitte ikou to shite iru no o mite, hodokoshi o kouta.
Petero to Yohane to wa kare o jitto mite, "Watashitachi o mi nasai" to itta.
Kare wa nani ka moraeru no darou to kitai shite, futari ni chuumoku shite iruto,
Petero ga itta, "Kingin wa watashi ni wa nai. Shikashi, watashi ni aru mono o ageyou. Nazarebito Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte aruki nasai".
Kou itte kare no migite o totte okoshite yaruto, ashi to, kurubushi to ga, tachi dokoro ni tsuyoku natte,
Odoriagatte tachi, aruki dashita. Soshite, arukimawat tari odot tari shite kami osan bi shinagara, karera to tomo ni miya ni haitte itta.
Minshuu wa mina, kare ga arukimawari, mata kami osan bi shite iru no o mi,
Kore ga miya no "Utsukushi no mon" no soba ni suwatte, hodokoshi o koute ita mono de aru to shiri, kare no mi ni okotta koto ni tsuite, odorokiayashinda.
Kare ga nao mo Petero to Yohane to ni tsukimatotte iru toki, hitobito wa mina hidoku odoroite, "Soromon no rou" to yobareru chuurou ni ita karera no tokoro ni kakeatsumatte kita.
Petero wa kore o mite, hitobito ni mukatte itta, "Isuraeru no hitotachi yo, naze kono koto o fushigi ni omou no ka. Mata, watashitachi ga jibun no chikara ya shinjin de, ano hito o arukaseta ka no you ni, naze watashitachi o mitsumete iru no ka.
Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu no kami, watashitachi no senzo no kami wa, sono shimobe Iesu ni eikou o tamawatta no de aruga, anata gata wa, kono Iesu o hikiwatashi, Pirato ga yurusu koto ni kimete ita no ni, sore o kare no menzen de kobanda.
Anata gata wa, kono sei naru tadashii kata o kobande, hitogoroshi no otoko o yurusu you ni youkyuu shi,
Inochi no kimi o koroshite shimatta. Shikashi, kami wa kono Iesu o shinin no naka kara, yomigaeraseta. Watashitachi wa, sono koto no shounin de aru.
Soshite, Iesu no na ga, sore o shinjiru shinkou no yue ni, anata gata no ima mite shitte iru kono hito o, tsuyoku shita no de ari, Iesu ni yoru shinkou ga, kare o anata gata ichidou no mae de, kono toori kanzen ni iyashita no de aru.
Sate, kyoudaitachi yo, anata gata wa shirazu ni ano you na koto o shita no de ari, anata gata no shidousha tachi totemo douyou de atta koto wa, watashi ni wakatte iru.
Kami wa arayuru yogensha no kuchi o tooshite, Kirisuto no junan o yokoku shite oraretaga, sore o kono you ni jouju nasatta no de aru.
Dakara, jibun no tsumi o nuguisatte itadaku tame ni, kuiaratamete honshin ni tachikaeri nasai.
Sore wa, Shu no mimae kara nagusame no toki ga kite, anata gata no tame ni arakajime sadamete atta Kirisuto naru Iesu o, kami ga tsukawashite kudasaru tame de aru.
Kono Iesu wa, kami ga sei naru yogensha tachi no kuchi o tooshite, mukashi kara yogen shite orareta banbutsu koushin no toki made, ten ni todomete okareneba naranakatta.
Moose wa itta, 'Shu naru kami wa, watashi o otate ni natta you ni, anata gata no kyoudai no naka kara, hitori no yogensha o otate ni narude arou. Sono yogensha ga anata gata ni kataru koto ni wa, kotogotoku kiki shitagai nasai.
Kare ni kiki shitagawanai mono wa, minatami no naka kara horoboshisararerude arou'.
Samueru o hajime, sono nochi tsuzuite katatta hodo no yogensha wa mina, kono toki no koto o yokoku shita.
Anata gata wa yogensha no ko de ari, kami ga anata gata no senzotachi to musubareta keiyaku no ko de aru. Kami wa Aburahamu ni taishite, 'Chijou no shominzoku wa, anata no shison ni yotte shukufuku o ukerude arou' to ooserareta.
Kami ga mazu anata gata no tame ni, sono shimobe o tatete, otsukawashi ni natta no wa, anata gata hitoribitori o, aku kara tachikaerasete, shukufuku ni azukaraseru tame na no de aru".
Karera ga hitobito ni kono you ni katatte iru aida ni, saishitachi, miyamori ga shira, Sadokaibitotachi ga chikayotte kite,
Karera ga hitobito ni oshie o toki, Iesu jishin ni okotta shinin no fukkatsu o senden shite iru no ni ki o iratate,
Karera ni te o kakete torae, haya hi ga kurete ita no de, yokuasa made ryuuchi shite oita.
Shikashi, karera no hanashi o kiita ooku no hitotachi wa shinjita. Soshite, sono otoko no kazu ga gosennin hodo ni natta.
Akuruhi, yakunin, chourou, rippougakusha tachi ga, Erusaremu ni shoushuu sareta.
Daisaishi Annasu o hajime, Kayapa, Yohane, Arekisanderu, sono hoka daisaishi no ichizoku mo mina atsumatta.
Soshite, sono mannaka ni shitotachi o tatasete jinmon shita, "Anata gata wa, ittai, nan no ken'i, mata, dare no na ni yotte, kono koto o shita no ka".
Sono toki, Petero ga seirei ni mitasarete itta, "Tami no yakunintachi, narabi ni chouroutachi yo,
Watashitachi ga, kyou, torishirabe o ukete iru no wa, byounin ni taishite shita yoi waza ni tsuite de ari, kono hito ga dou shite iyasareta ka ni tsuite de arunara,
Anata gata goichidou mo, mata Isuraeru no hitobito zentai mo, shitte ite moraitai. Kono hito ga genki ni natte minna no mae ni tatte iru no wa, hitoeni, anata gata ga juujika ni tsukete koroshita no o, kami ga shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta Nazarebito Iesu Kirisuto no mina ni yoru no de aru.
Kono Iesu koso wa 'Anata gata ietsukurira ni suteraretaga, sumi no kashira ishi to natta ishi' na no de aru.
Kono hito ni yoru igai ni sukui wa nai. Watashitachi o sukui uru na wa, kore o betsu ni shite wa, tenka no dare ni mo ataerarete inaikara de aru".
Hitobito wa Petero to Yohane to no daitan na hanashiburi o mi, mata douji ni, futari ga mugaku na, tada no hitotachi de aru koto o shitte, fushigi ni omotta. Soshite karera ga Iesu to tomo ni ita mono de aru koto o mitome,
Katsu, karera ni iyasareta mono ga sono soba ni tatte iru no o mite wa, mattaku kaesu kotoba ga nakatta.
Soko de, futari ni gikai kara taijou suru you ni meijite kara, tagai ni kyougi o tsuzukete
Itta, "Ano hitotachi o, dou shitara yokarou ka. Karera ni yotte ichijirushii shirushi ga okonawareta koto wa, Erusaremu no juumin zentai ni shire watatte iru no de, hitei shiyou mo nai.
Tada, kore ijou kono koto ga minshuu no aida ni hiromaranai you ni, kongo wa kono na ni yotte, issai dare ni mo katatte wa ikenaito, odoshite yaroude wa nai ka".
Soko de, futari o yobiirete, Iesu no na ni yotte kataru koto mo toku koto mo, issai ainaranu to iiwatashita.
Petero to Yohane to wa, kore ni taishite itta, "Kami ni kikishitagau yori mo, anata gata ni kikishitagau hou ga, kami no mae ni tadashii ka dou ka, handan shite moraitai.
Watashitachi to shite wa, jibun no mita koto kiita koto o, kataranai wake ni wa ikanai".
Soko de, karera wa futari o sarani odoshita ue, yurushite yatta. Minna no mono ga, kono dekigoto no tame ni, kami o agamete ita no de, sono hitobito no temae, futari o bassuru sube ga nakattakara de aru.
Sono shirushi ni yotte iyasareta no wa, yonjuusai amari no hito de atta.
Futari wa yurusarete kara, nakama no monotachi no tokoro ni kaette, saishichou tachi ya chouroutachi ga itta issai no koto o houkoku shita.
Ichidou wa kore o kikuto, kuchi o soroete, kami ni mukai koe o agete itta, "Ten to chi to umi to, sono naka no subete no mono to no tsukuri nushi naru Shu yo.
Anata wa, watashitachi no senzo, anata no shimobe Dabide no kuchi o tooshite, seirei ni yotte, kou oose ni narimashita, 'Naze, ihoujin ra wa, sawagitachi, moromoro no tami wa, munashii koto o hakari,
Chijou no outachi wa, tachi kamae, shihaisha tachi wa, tou o kunde, Shu to sono Kirisuto to ni sakaratta no ka'.
Makoto ni, Herode to Ponteo Pirato to wa, ihoujin ra ya Isuraeru no tami to issho ni natte, kono miyako ni atsumari, anata kara abura o sosogareta sei naru shimobe Iesu ni sakarai,
Mite to mimune to ni yotte, arakajime sadamerarete ita koto o, nashitogeta no desu.
Shu yo, ima, karera no kyouhaku ni me o tome, shimobetachi ni, omoikitte daitan ni mikotoba o katarasete kudasai.
Soshite mite o nobashite iyashi o nashi, sei naru shimobe Iesu no na ni yotte, shirushi to kiseki to o okonawasete kudasai".
Karera ga inori oeruto, sono atsumatte ita basho ga yureugoki, ichidou wa seirei ni mitasarete, daitan ni kami no kotoba o katari dashita.
Shinjita mono no mure wa, kokoro o hitotsu ni shi omoi o hitotsu ni shite, dare hitori sono mochimono o jibun no mono da to shuchou suru mono ga naku, issai no mono o kyouyuu ni shite ita.
Shitotachi wa Shu Iesu no fukkatsu ni tsuite, hijou ni chikarazuyoku akashi o shita. Soshite ookina megumi ga, karera ichidou ni sosogareta.
Karera no naka ni toboshii mono wa, hitori mo inakatta. Jisho ya kaoku o motte iru hitotachi wa, sore o uri, utta mono no daikin o motte kite,
Shitotachi no ashimoto ni oita. Soshite sorezore no hitsuyou ni oujite, dare ni de mo wakeataerareta.
Kupuro umare no Rebibito de, shitotachi ni Barunaba ("Nagusame no ko" to no i) to yobarete ita Yosefu wa,
Jibun no shoyuu suru hatake o uri, sono daikin o motte kite, shitotachi no ashimoto ni oita.
Tokoro ga, Ananiya to iu hito to sono tsuma Sappira to wa tomo ni shisan o uttaga,
Kyoubou shite, sono daikin o gomakashi, ichibu dake o motte kite, shitotachi no ashimoto ni oita.
Soko de, Petero ga itta, "Ananiya yo, dou shite anata wa, jibun no kokoro o Satan ni ubawarete, seirei o azamuki, jisho no daikin o gomakashita no ka.
Urazu ni nokoshite okeba, anata no mono de ari, utte shimatte mo, anata no jiyuu ni natta hazu de wa nai ka. Dou shite, konna koto o suru ki ni natta no ka. Anata wa hito o azamuita no de wa nakute, kami o azamuita no da".
Ananiya wa kono kotoba o kiite iru uchi ni, taorete iki ga taeta. Kono koto o tsutaekiita hitobito wa, mina hijou na osore o kanjita.
Sore kara, wakamonotachi ga tatte, sono shitai o tsutsumi, hakobidashite houmutta.
San jikan bakari tatte kara, tamatama kare no tsuma ga, kono dekigoto o shirazu ni, haitte kita.
Soko de, Petero ga kanojo ni mukatte itta, "Ano jisho wa, kore kore no nedan de utta no ka. Sono toori ka". Kanojo wa "Sou desu, sono nedan desu" to kotaeta.
Petero wa itta, "Anata gata futari ga, kokoro o awasete Shu no mitama o kokoromiru to wa, nanigoto de aru ka. Miyo, anata no otto o houmutta hitotachi no ashi ga, soko no kadoguchi ni kite iru. Anata mo hakobidasarerude arou".
Suru to onna wa, tachimachi kare no ashimoto ni taorete, iki ga taeta. Soko ni wakamonotachi ga haitte kite, onna ga shinde shimatte iru no o mi, sore o hakobidashite sono otto no soba ni houmutta.
Kyoukai zentai narabi ni kore o tsutaekiita hitotachi wa, mina hijou na osore o kanjita.
Sono koro, ooku no shirushi to kiseki to ga, tsugitsugi ni shitotachi no te ni yori hitobito no naka de okonawareta. Soshite, ichidou wa kokoro o hitotsu ni shite, Soromon no rou ni atsumatte ita.
Hoka no monotachi wa, dare hitori, sono majiwari ni irou to wa shinakattaga, minshuu wa karera o sonkei shite ita.
Shikashi, Shu o shinjite nakama ni kuwawaru mono ga, danjotomo, masumasu ooku natte kita.
Tsuini wa, byounin o oodoori ni hakobidashi, shindai ya nedoko no ue ni oite, Petero ga tooru toki, kare no kage narito, sono uchi no dare ka ni kakaru you ni shita hodo de atta.
Mata Erusaremu fukin no machimachi kara mo, oozei no hito ga, byounin ya kegareta rei ni kurushimerarete iru hitotachi o hikitsurete, atsumatte kitaga, sono zenbu no mono ga, hitori nokorazu iyasareta.
Soko de, daisaishi to sono nakama no mono, sunawachi, Sadokaiha no hitotachi ga, mina shitto no nen ni mitasarete tachiagari,
Shitotachi ni te o kakete torae, koukyou no ryuuchijou ni ireta.
Tokoro ga yoru, Shu no tsukai ga goku no to o hiraki, karera o tsuredashite itta,
"Saa iki nasai. Soshite, miya no niwa ni tachi, kono inochi no kotoba o morenaku, hitobito ni katari nasai".
Karera wa kore o kiki, yoake goro miya ni haitte oshie hajimeta. Ippou de wa, daisaishi to sono nakama no mono to ga, atsumatte kite, gikai to Isuraerubito no chourou ichidou to o shoushuu shi, shitotachi o hikidashite kosaseru tame ni, hito o goku ni tsukawashita.
Soko de, shitayakudomo ga itte miruto, shitotachi ga goku ni inai no de, hikikaeshite houkoku shita,
"Goku ni wa, shikkari to jou ga kakete ari, toguchi ni wa, bannin ga tatte imashita. Tokoro ga, akete mitara, naka ni wa dare mo imasendeshita".
Miyamori gashira to saishichou tachi to wa, kono houkoku o kiite, kore wa, ittai, donna koto ni naru no darou to, awatemadotte ita.
Soko e, aru hito ga kite shiraseta, "Itte goran nasai. Anata gata ga goku ni ireta ano hitotachi ga, miya no niwa ni tatte, minshuu o oshiete imasu".
Soko de miyamori ga shiraga, shitayakudomo to issho ni dekakete itte, shitotachi o tsurete kita. Shikashi, hitobito ni ishi de uchikorosareru no o osorete, teara na koto wa sezu,
Karera o tsurete kite, gikai no naka ni tataseta. Suruto, daisaishi ga toute
Itta, "Ano na o tsukatte oshiete wa naranaito, kibishiku meijite oitade wa nai ka. Sore da no ni, nan to iu koto da. Erusaremunaka ni anata gata no oshie o, hanran sasete iru. Anata gata wa tashika ni, ano hito no chi no sekinin o watashitachi ni owaseyou to, takurande iru no da".
Kore ni taishite, Petero o hajime shitotachi wa itta, "Ningen ni shitagau yori wa, kami ni shitagaubekide aru.
Watashitachi no senzo no kami wa, anata gata ga ki ni kakete koroshita Iesu o yomigaerase,
Soshite, Isuraeru o kuiaratamesasete kore ni tsumi no yurushi o ataeru tame ni, kono Iesu o michibikite to shi sukuinushi to shite, gojishin no migi ni agerareta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa korera no koto no shounin de aru. Kami ga gojishin ni shitagau mono ni tamawatta seirei mo mata, sono shounin de aru".
Kore o kiita monotachi wa, hageshii ikari no amari, shitotachi o korosou to omotta.
Tokoro ga, kokumin zentai ni sonkei sarete ita rippougakusha Gamarieru to iu Parisaibito ga, gikai de tatte, shitotachi o shibaraku no aida soto ni dasu you ni youkyuu shite kara,
Ichidou ni mukatte itta, "Isuraeru no shokun, ano hitotachi o dou atsukau ka, yoku ki o tsukeru ga yoi.
Sakigoro, Chuda ga okotte, jibun o nani ka erai mono no you ni iifurashita tame, kare ni shitagatta otoko no kazu ga, yonhyakunin hodo mo attaga, kekkyoku, kare wa korosarete shimai, shitagatta mono mo mina shisan shite, mattaku atohou mo nakunatte iru.
Sono nochi, jinkou chousa no toki ni, Garirayahito Yuda ga minshuu o hikiite hanran o okoshitaga, kono hito mo horobi, shitagatta mono mo mina chirasarete shimatta.
Soko de, kono sai, shokun ni moushiageru. Ano hitotachi kara te o hiite, sono nasu mama ni shite oki nasai. Sono kuwadate ya, shiwaza ga, ningen kara deta mono nara, jimetsu surudarou.
Shikashi, moshi kami kara deta mono nara, ano hitotachi o horobosu koto wa dekimai. Makari chigaeba, shokun wa kami o teki ni mawasu koto ni naru ka mo shirenai". Soko de karera wa sono kankoku ni shitagai,
Shitotachi o yobiirete, muchiutta nochi, kongo Iesu no na ni yotte kataru koto wa ainaranu to iiwatashite, yurushite yatta.
Shitotachi wa, mina no tame ni haji o kuwaerareru ni taru mono to sareta koto o yorokobinagara, gikai kara dete kita.
Soshite, mainichi, miya ya ie de, Iesu ga Kirisuto de aru koto o, hikitsuzuki oshie tari nobetsutae tari shita.
Sono koro, deshi no kazu ga fuete kuru ni tsurete, Girishiya go o tsukau Yudayajintachi kara, Heburu go o tsukau Yudayajintachi ni taishite, jibuntachi no yamomera ga, hibi no haikyuu de, orosoka ni saregachi dato, kujou o moushitateta.
Soko de, juu ni shito wa deshi zentai o yobiatsumete itta, "Watashitachi ga kami no kotoba o sashioite, shokutaku no koto ni tazusawaru no wa omoshiroku nai.
Soko de, kyoudaitachi yo, anata gata no naka kara, mitama to chie to ni michita, hyouban no yoi hitotachi nananin o sagashidashite hoshii. Sono hitotachi ni kono shigoto o makase,
Watashitachi wa, moppara inori to mikotoba no goyou ni ataru koto ni shiyou".
Kono teian wa kaishuu ichidou no sansei suru tokoro to natta. Soshite shinkou to seirei to ni michita hito Sutepano, sore kara Piripo, Purokoro, Nikanoru, Temon, Parumena, oyobi Anteoke no kaishuusha Nikorao o erabidashite,
Shitotachi no mae ni tataseta. Suruto, shitotachi wa inotte te o karera no ue ni oita.
Kou shite kami no kotoba wa, masumasu hiromari, Erusaremu ni okeru deshi no kazu ga, hijou ni fuete iki, saishitachi mo tasuu, shinkou o ukeireru you ni natta.
Sate, Sutepano wa megumi to chikara to ni michite, minshuu no naka de, mezamashii kiseki to shirushi to o okonatte ita.
Suruto, iwayuru "Riberuten" no kaidou ni zokusuru hitobito, Kurenebito, Arekisandoriyabito, Kirikiya ya Ajiya kara kita hitobito nado ga tatte, Sutepano to giron shitaga,
Kare wa chie to mitama to de katatte ita no de, sore ni taikou dekinakatta.
Soko de, karera wa hitobito o sosonokashite, "Watashitachi wa, kare ga Moose to kami to o kegasu kotoba o haku no o kiita" to iwaseta.
Sono ue, minshuu ya chouroutachi ya rippougakusha tachi o sendou shi, kare o osotte toraesase, gikai ni hippatte kosaseta.
Sore kara, itsuwari no shounintachi o tatete iwaseta, "Kono hito wa, kono seijo to rippou to ni sakarau kotoba o haite, dou shite mo, yameyou to wa shimasen.
'Ano Nazarebito Iesu wa, kono seijo o uchikowashi, Moose ga watashitachi ni tsutaeta kanrei o kaete shimaudarou' nado to, kare ga iu no o, watashitachi wa kikimashita".
Gikai de seki ni tsuite ita hitotachi wa mina, Sutepano ni me o sosoidaga, kare no kao wa, choudo tenshi no kao no you ni mieta.
Daisaishi wa "Sono toori ka" to tazuneta.
Soko de, Sutepano ga itta, "Kyoudaitachi, chichitachi yo, okiki kudasai. Watashitachi no fuso Aburahamu ga, Karan ni sumu mae, mada Mesopotamiya ni ita toki, eikou no kami ga kare ni arawarete
Oose ni natta, 'Anata no tochi to shinzoku kara hanarete, anata ni sashishimesu chi ni iki nasai'.
Soko de, Aburahamu wa Karudeyabito no chi o dete, Karan ni sunda. Soshite, kare no chichi ga shinda nochi, kami wa kare o soko kara, ima anata gata no sunde iru kono chi ni ijuu sasetaga,
Soko de wa, isan to naru mono wa nani hitotsu, ippo no haba no tochi sura mo, ataerarenakatta. Tada, sono chi o shoryou to shite sazukeyou to no yakusoku o, kare to, soshite kare ni wa mada ko ga nakatta no ni, sono shison to ni ataerareta no de aru.
Kami wa kou oose ni natta, 'Kare no shison wa takoku ni mi o yoserude arou. Soshite, soko de yonhyaku nen no aida, dorei ni sarete gyakutai o ukerude arou'.
Sore kara, sarani oose ni natta, 'Karera o dorei ni suru kokumin o, watashi wa sabaku de arou. Sono nochi, karera wa soko kara nogaredete, kono basho de watashi o reihai surude arou'.
Soshite, kami wa Aburahamu ni, katsurei no keiyaku o oatae ni natta. Kou shite, kare wa Isaku no chichi to nari, kore ni youkame ni katsurei o hodokoshi, sore kara, Isaku wa Yakobu no chichi to nari, Yakobu wa juu ninin no zokuchoutachi no chichi to natta.
Zokuchoutachi wa, Yosefu o netande, Ejiputo ni uritobashita. Shikashi, kami wa kare to tomo ni imashite,
Arayuru kunan kara kare o sukuidashi, Ejiputo ou Paro no mae de megumi o atae, chie o arawasaseta. Soko de, Paro wa kare o saishou no nin ni tsukase, Ejiputo narabi ni ouke zentai no shihai ni ataraseta.
Toki ni, Ejiputo to Kanan to no zendo ni watatte, kikin ga okori, ookina kunan ga osotte kite, watashitachi no senzotachi wa, shokumotsu ga erarenaku natta.
Yakobu wa, Ejiputo ni wa shokuryou ga aru to kiite, hajime ni senzotachi o tsukawashitaga,
Ni kaime no toki ni, Yosefu ga kyoudaitachi ni, jibun no minoue o uchiaketa no de, kare no shinzoku kankei ga Paro ni shirete kita.
Yosefu wa tsukai o yatte, chichi Yakobu to nanajuu gonin ni noboru shinzoku ichidou to o maneita.
Kou shite, Yakobu wa Ejiputo ni kudari, kare jishin mo senzotachi mo soko de shini,
Sore kara karera wa, Shikemu ni utsusarete, kanete Aburahamu ga ikura ka no kane o dashite kono chi no Hamoru no kora kara katte oita haka ni, houmurareta.
Kami ga Aburahamu ni taishite taterareta yakusoku no jiki ga chikazuku ni tsure, tami wa fuete Ejiputo zendo ni hirogatta.
Yagate, Yosefu no koto o shiranai betsu na ou ga, Ejiputo ni okotta.
Kono ou wa, watashitachi no douzoku ni taishi sakuryaku o megurashite, senzotachi o gyakutai shi, sono osanagora o ikashite okanai you ni sutesaseta.
Moose ga umareta no wa, choudo kono koro no koto de aru. Kare wa mare ni miru utsukushii ko de atta. San kagetsu no aida wa, chichi no ie de sodateraretaga,
Sono nochi suterareta no o, Paro no musume ga hiroiagete, jibun no ko to shite sodateta.
Moose wa Ejiputojin no arayuru gakumon o oshiekomare, kotoba ni mo waza ni mo, chikara ga atta.
Yonjuusai ni natta toki, Moose wa jibun no kyoudai de aru Isuraerubitotachi no tame ni tsukusu koto o, omoitatta.
Tokoro ga, sono hitori ga ijimerarete iru no o mite, kore o kabai, gyakutai sarete iru sono hito no tame ni, aite no Ejiputojin o utte shikaeshi o shita.
Kare wa, jibun no te ni yotte kami ga kyoudaitachi o sukutte kudasaru koto o, minna ga satoru mono to omotte itaga, jissai wa sore o satoranakatta no de aru.
Yokujitsu Moose wa, karera ga arasoiatte iru tokoro ni araware, chuusai shiyou to shite itta, 'Mate, kimitachi wa kyoudai doushi de wa nai ka. Dou shite tagai ni kizutsuke atte iru no ka'.
Suruto, nakama o ijimete ita mono ga, Moose o tsukitobashite itta, 'Dare ga, kimi o wareware no shihaisha ya saibannin ni shita no ka.
Kimi wa, kinou, Ejiputojin o koroshita you ni, watashi mo korosou to omotte iru no ka'.
Moose wa, kono kotoba o kiite nige, Midean no chi ni mi o yose, soko de otokonoko futari o mouketa.
Yonjuu nen tatta toki, Shinai zan no arano ni oite, mitsukai ga shiba no moeru honoo no naka de Moose ni arawareta.
Kare wa kono koukei o mite fushigi ni omoi, sore o mikiwameru tame ni chikayotta tokoro, Shu no koe ga kikoete kita,
'Watashi wa, anata no senzotachi no kami, Aburahamu, Isaku, Yakobu no kami de aru'. Moose wa osoreononoite, mou sore o miru yuuki mo nakunatta.
Suruto, Shu ga kare ni iwareta, 'Anata no ashi kara, kutsu o nugi nasai. Anata no tatte iru kono basho wa, sei naru chi de aru.
Watashi wa, Ejiputo ni iru watashi no tami ga gyakutai sarete iru arisama o tashika ni mitodoke, sono kunou no umekigoe o kiita no de, karera o sukuidasu tame ni kudatte kita no de aru. Saa, ima anata o Ejiputo ni tsukawasou'.
Kou shite, 'Dare ga, kimi o shihaisha ya saibannin ni shita no ka' to itte haiseki sareta kono Moose o, kami wa, shiba no naka de kare ni arawareta mitsukai no te ni yotte, shihaisha, kaihousha to shite, otsukawashi ni natta no de aru.
Kono hito ga, hitobito o michibikidashite, Ejiputo no chi ni oite mo, koukai ni oite mo, mata yonjuu nen no aida arano ni oite mo, kiseki to shirushi to o okonatta no de aru.
Kono hito ga, Isuraeruhitotachi ni, 'Kami wa watashi o otate ni natta you ni, anata gata no kyoudaitachi no naka kara, hitori no yogensha o otate ni narude arou' to itta Moose de aru.
Kono hito ga, Shinai zan de, kare ni katarikaketa mitsukai ya senzotachi to tomo ni, arano ni okeru shuukai ni ite, ikeru mikotoba o sazukari, sore o anata gata ni tsutaeta no de aru.
Tokoro ga, senzotachi wa kare ni shitagaou to wa sezu, kaette kare o shirizoke, kokoro no naka de Ejiputo ni akogarete,
'Watashitachi o michibiite kureru kamigami o tsukutte kudasai. Watashitachi o Ejiputo no chi kara michibiite kita ano Moose ga dou natta no ka, wakarimasenkara' to Aron ni itta.
Sono koro, karera wa koushi no zou o tsukuri, sono guuzou ni sonaemono o sasage, jibuntachi no te de tsukutta mono o matsutte uchi kyoujite ita.
Soko de, kami wa kao o somuke, karera o ten no hoshi o ogamu mama ni makaserareta. Yogensha no sho ni kou kaite aru toori de aru, 'Isuraeru no ie yo, yonjuu nen no aida arano ni ita toki ni, ikenie to sonaemono to o, watashi ni sasageta koto ga atta ka.
Anata gata wa, Moroku no makuya ya Ronpa no hoshi no kami o, katsugi mawatta. Sorera wa, ogamu tame ni jibun de tsukutta guuzou ni suginu. Dakara watashi wa, anatagata o Babiron no kanata e, utsushite shimaude arou'.
Watashitachi no senzo ni wa, arano ni akashi no makuya ga atta. Sore wa, mita mama no kata ni shitagatte tsukuru you ni to, Moose ni katatta kata no gomeirei doori ni tsukutta mono de aru.
Kono makuya wa, watashitachi no senzo ga, Yoshua ni hikiirare, kami ni yotte shominzoku o karera no mae kara oiharai, sono shoryou o nori totta toki ni, soko ni mochikomare, tsugitsugi ni uketsugarete, Dabide no jidai ni oyonda mono de aru.
Dabide wa, kami no megumi o koumuri, soshite, Yakobu no kami no tame ni miya o zouei shitai to negatta.
Keredo mo, jissai ni sono miya o tateta no wa, Soromon de atta.
Shikashi, ito takaki mono wa, te de tsukutta ie no uchi ni wa osumi ni naranai. Yogensha ga itte iru toori de aru,
'Shu ga ooserareru, donna ie o watashi no tame ni tateru no ka. Watashi no ikoi no basho wa, dore ka. Ten wa watashi no ouza, chi wa watashi no ashidai de aru.
Kore wa mina watashi no te ga tsukutta mono de wa nai ka'.
Aa, goujou de, kokoro ni mo mimi ni mo katsurei no nai hitotachi yo. Anata gata wa, itsu mo seirei ni sakaratte iru. Sore wa, anata gata no senzotachi to onaji de aru.
Ittai, anata gata no senzo ga hakugai shinakatta yogensha ga, hitori de mo ita ka. Karera wa tadashii kata no kuru koto o yokoku shita hitotachi o koroshi, ima ya anata gata wa, sono tadashii kata o uragiru mono, mata korosu mono to natta.
Anata gata wa, mitsukai tachi ni yotte tsutaerareta rippou o uketa no ni, sore o mamoru koto o shinakatta".
Hitobito wa kore o kiite, kokoro no soko kara hageshiku ikari, Sutepano ni mukatte, hagishiri o shita.
Shikashi, kare wa seirei ni mitasarete, ten o mitsumete iruto, kami no eikou ga araware, Iesu ga kami no migi ni tatte orareru no ga mieta.
Soko de, kare wa "Aa, ten ga hirakete, hito no ko ga kami no migi ni tatte oide ni naru no ga mieru" to itta.
Hitobito wa oogoe de sakebinagara, mimi o ooi, Sutepano o megakete, issei ni sattou shi,
Kare o shigai ni hikidashite, ishi de utta. Kore ni tachiatta hitotachi wa, jibun no uwagi o nuide, Sauro to iu wakamono no ashimoto ni oita.
Kou shite, karera ga Sutepano ni ishi o nagetsukete iru aida, Sutepano wa inori tsuzukete itta, "Shu Iesu yo, watashi no rei o ouke kudasai".
Soshite, hizamazuite, oogoe de sakenda, "Shu yo, douzo, kono tsumi o karera ni owasenaide kudasai". Kou itte, kare wa nemuri ni tsuita.
Sauro wa, Sutepano o korosu koto ni sansei shite ita. Sono hi, Erusaremu no kyoukai ni taishite oohakugai ga okori, shito igai no mono wa kotogotoku, Yudaya to Samariya to no chihou ni chirasarete itta.
Shinkou bukai hitotachi wa Sutepano o houmuri, kare no tame ni mune o utte, hijou ni kanashinda.
Tokoro ga, Sauro wa ieie ni oshiitte, otoko ya onna o hikizuri dashi, tsugitsugi ni goku ni watashite, kyoukai o arashimawatta.
Sate, chirasarete itta hitotachi wa, mikotoba o nobetsutaenagara, meguriaruita.
Piripo wa Samariya no machi ni kudatte iki, hitobito ni Kirisuto o nobe hajimeta.
Gunshuu wa Piripo no hanashi o kiki, sono okonatte ita shirushi o mite, kozotte kare no kataru koto ni mimi o katamuketa.
Kegareta rei ni tsukareta ooku no hitobito kara wa, sono rei ga oogoe de wamekinagara dete ikushi, mata, ooku no chuubu o wazuratte iru mono ya, ashi no kikanai mono ga iyasaretakara de aru.
Sore de, kono machi de wa hitobito ga, taihen na yorokobikata de atta.
Sate, kono machi ni izen kara Shimon to iu hito ga ita. Kare wa majutsu o okonatte Samariya no hitotachi o odorokashi, jibun o samo erai mono no you ni iifurashite ita.
Sore de, chiisai mono kara ookii mono ni itaru made mina, kare ni tsuite iki, "Kono hito koso wa 'Tainou' to yobareru kami no chikara de aru" to itte ita.
Karera ga kono hito ni tsuite itta no wa, nagai aida sono majutsu ni odorokasarete ita tame de atta.
Tokoro ga, Piripo ga kami no kuni to Iesu Kirisuto no na ni tsuite nobetsutaeru ni oyonde, otoko mo onna mo shinjite, zokuzoku to baputesuma o uketa.
Shimon jishin mo shinjite, baputesuma o uke, sore kara, hikitsuzuki Piripo ni tsuite itta. Soshite, kazukazu no shirushi ya mezamashii kiseki ga okonawareru no o mite, odoroite ita.
Erusaremu ni iru shitotachi wa, Samariya no hitobito ga, kami no kotoba o ukeireta to kiite, Petero to Yohane to o, soko ni tsukawashita.
Futari wa Samariya ni kudatte itte, minna ga seirei o ukeru you ni to, karera no tame ni inotta.
Sore wa, karera wa tada Shu Iesu no na ni yotte baputesuma o ukete ita dake de, seirei wa mada dare ni mo kudatte inakattakara de aru.
Soko de, futari ga te o karera no ue ni oita tokoro, karera wa seirei o uketa.
Shimon wa, shitotachi ga te o oita tame ni, mitama ga hitobito ni sazukerareta no o mite, kane o sashidashi,
"Watashi ga te o okeba dare ni de mo seirei ga sazukerareru you ni, sono chikara o watashi ni mo kudasai" to itta.
Soko de, Petero ga kare ni itta, "Omae no kane wa, omae morotomo, usete shimae. Kami no tamamono ga, kane de erareru nado to omotte iru no ka.
Omae no kokoro ga kami no mae ni tadashiku naikara, omae wa, toutei, kono koto ni azukaru koto ga dekinai.
Dakara, kono akuji o kuite, Shu ni inore. Sou sureba aruiha sonna omoi o kokoro ni idaita koto ga, yurusareru ka mo shirenai.
Omae ni wa, mada nigai tanjuu ga ari, fugi no nawame ga karamitsuite iru. Sore ga, watashi ni wakatte iru".
Shimon wa kore o kiite itta, "Oose no you na koto ga, watashi no mi ni okoranai you ni, douzo, watashi no tame ni Shu ni inotte kudasai".
Shitotachi wa chikarazuyoku akashi o nashi, mata Shu no kotoba o katatta nochi, Samariyahito no ooku no muramura ni fukuin o nobetsutaete, Erusaremu ni kaetta.
Shikashi, Shu no tsukai ga Piripo ni mukatte itta, "Tatte nanpou ni iki, Erusaremu kara Gaza e kudaru michi ni de nasai" (kono Gaza wa, ima wa are hatete iru).
Soko de, kare wa tatte dekaketa. Suruto, choudo, Echiopiyajin no joou Kandake no koukan de, joou no zaihou zenbu o kanri shite ita kangan de aru Echiopiyajin ga, reihai no tame Erusaremu ni nobori,
Sono kito ni tsuite ita tokoro de atta. Kare wa jibun no basha ni notte, yogensha Izaya no sho o yonde ita.
Mitama ga Piripo ni "Susumiyotte, ano basha ni narande iki nasai" to itta.
Soko de Piripo ga kakete ikuto, yogensha Izaya no sho o yonde iru sono hito no koe ga kikoeta no de, "Anata wa, yonde iru koto ga, owakari desu ka" to tazuneta.
Kare wa "Dare ka ga, tebiki o shite kurenakereba, dou shite wakarimashou" to kotaeta. Soshite, basha ni notte issho ni suwaru you ni to, Piripo ni susumeta.
Kare ga yonde ita seisho no kasho wa, kore de atta, "Kare wa, hofuriba ni hikarete iku hitsuji no you ni, mata, mokumoku to shite, ke o karu mono no mae ni tatsu kohitsuji no you ni, kuchi o hirakanai.
Kare wa, iyashimerarete, sono sabaki mo okonawarenakatta. Dare ga, kare no shison no koto o kataru koto ga dekiyou ka, kare no inochi ga chijou kara torisararete irukara ni wa".
Kangan wa Piripo ni mukatte itta, "Otazune shimasuga, koko de yogensha wa dare no koto o itte iru no desu ka. Jibun no koto desu ka, sore to mo, dare ka hoka no hito no koto desu ka".
Soko de Piripo wa kuchi o hiraki, kono seiku kara tokiokoshite, Iesu no koto o nobetsutaeta.
Michi o susunde iku uchi ni, mizu no aru tokoro ni kita no de, kangan ga itta, "Koko ni mizu ga arimasu. Watashi ga baputesuma o ukeru no ni, nan no sashitsukae ga arimasu ka". []
Kore ni taishite, Piripo wa, "Anata ga magokoro kara shinjirunara, ukete sashitsukae wa arimasen" to itta. Suruto, kare wa "Watashi wa, Iesu Kirisuto o kami no ko to shinjimasu" to kotaeta.]
Soko de kuruma o tomesase, Piripo to kangan to, futaritomo, mizu no naka ni orite iki, Piripo ga kangan ni baputesuma o sazuketa.
Futari ga mizu kara agaruto, Shu no rei ga Piripo o saratte itta no de, kangan wa mou kare o miru koto ga dekinakatta. Kangan wa yorokobinagara tabi o tsuzuketa.
Sono nochi, Piripo wa Azoto ni sugata o arawashite, machimachi o meguriaruki, itaru tokoro de fukuin o nobetsutaete, tsuini Kaizariya ni tsuita.
Sate Sauro wa, nao mo Shu no deshitachi ni taisuru kyouhaku, satsugai no iki o hazumasenagara, daisaishi no tokoro ni itte,
Damasuko no shokaidouate no tensho o motometa. Sore wa, kono michi no mono o mitsuke shidai, danjo no betsu naku shibariagete, Erusaremu ni hippatte kuru tame de atta.
Tokoro ga, michi o isoide Damasuko no chikaku ni kita toki, totsuzen, ten kara hikari ga sashite, kare o meguri tera shita.
Kare wa chi ni taoretaga, sono toki "Sauro, Sauro, naze watashi o hakugai suru no ka" to yobikakeru koe o kiita.
Soko de kare wa "Shu yo, anata wa, donata desu ka" to tazuneta. Suru to kotae ga atta, "Watashi wa, anata ga hakugai shite iru Iesu de aru.
Saa tatte, machi ni haitte iki nasai. Sou sureba, soko de anata no nasubeki koto ga tsugerarerude arou".
Sauro no doukousha tachi wa mono mo iezu ni tatte ite, koe dake wa kikoetaga, dare mo mienakatta.
Sauro wa chi kara okiagatte me o hiraite mitaga, nani mo mienakatta. Soko de hitobito wa, kare no te o hiite Damasuko e tsurete itta.
Kare wa mik kakan, me ga miezu, mata taberu koto mo nomu koto mo shinakatta.
Sate, Damasuko ni Ananiya to iu hitori no deshi ga ita. Kono hito ni Shu ga maboroshi no naka ni arawarete, "Ananiya yo" to oyobi ni natta. Kare wa "Shu yo, watashi de gozaimasu" to kotaeta.
Soko de Shu ga kare ni iwareta, "Tatte, 'Ma sugu' to iu na no roji ni iki, Yuda no ie de Sauro to iu Tarusobito o tazune nasai. Kare wa ima inotte iru.
Kare wa Ananiya to iu hito ga haitte kite, te o jibun no ue ni oite futatabi mieru you ni shite kureru no o, maboroshi de mita no de aru".
Ananiya wa kotaeta, "Shu yo, ano hito ga Erusaremu de, donna ni hidoi koto o anata no seitotachi ni shita ka ni tsuite wa, ooku no hitotachi kara kiite imasu.
Soshite kare wa koko de mo, mina o tonaeru monotachi o mina hobaku suru ken o, saishichou tachi kara ete kite iru no desu".
Shikashi, Shu wa oose ni natta, "Saa, iki nasai. Ano hito wa, ihoujin tachi, outachi, mata Isuraeru no kora ni mo, watashi no na o tsutaeru utsuwa to shite, watashi ga eranda mono de aru.
Watashi no na no tame ni kare ga donna ni kurushimanakereba naranai ka o, kare ni shiraseyou".
Soko de Ananiya wa, dekakete itte sono ie ni hairi, te o Sauro no ue ni oite itta, "Kyoudai Sauro yo, anata ga kuru tochuu de arawareta Shu Iesu wa, anata ga futatabi mieru you ni naru tame, soshite seirei ni mitasareru tame ni, watashi o koko ni otsukawashi ni natta no desu".
Suru to tachidokoro ni, Sauro no me kara, uroko no you na mono ga ochite, motodoori mieru you ni natta. Soko de kare wa tatte baputesuma o uke,
Mata shokuji o totte genki o torimodoshita. Sauro wa, Damasuko ni iru deshitachi to tomo ni suujitsukan o sugoshite kara,
Tadachini shokaidou de Iesu no koto o nobetsutae, kono Iesu koso kami no ko de aru to toki hajimeta.
Kore o kiita hitotachi wa mina hijou ni odoroite itta, "Are wa, Erusaremu de kono na o tonaeru monotachi o kurushimeta otoko de wa nai ka. Sono ue koko ni yatte kita no mo, karera o shibariagete, saishichou tachi no tokoro e hippatte iku tame de wa nakatta ka".
Shikashi, Sauro wa masumasu chikara ga kuwawari, kono Iesu ga Kirisuto de aru koto o ronshou shite, Damasuko ni sumu Yudayajintachi o iifuseta.
Soutou no nissuu ga tatta koro, Yudayajintachi wa Sauro o korosu soudan o shita.
Tokoro ga, sono inbou ga kare no shiru tokoro to natta. Karera wa Sauro o korosou to shite, yoruhiru, machi no mon o mimamotte ita no de aru.
Soko de kare no deshitachi ga, yoru no aida ni kare o kago ni nosete, machi no jouhekizutai ni tsurioroshita.
Sauro wa Erusaremu ni tsuite, deshitachi no nakama ni kuwawarou to tsutometaga, minna no mono wa kare o deshi da to wa shinjinaide, osorete ita.
Tokoro ga, Barunaba wa kare no sewa o shite shitotachi no tokoro e tsurete iki, tochuu de Shu ga kare ni arawarete katarikaketa koto ya, kare ga Damasuko de Iesu no na de daitan ni nobetsutaeta shidai o, karera ni setsumei shite kikaseta.
Sore irai, kare wa shitotachi no nakama ni kuwawari, Erusaremu ni deiri shi, Shu no na ni yotte daitan ni katari,
Girishiya go o tsukau Yudayajintachi to shibashiba katariai, mata ronjiatta. Shikashi, karera wa kare o korosou to neratte ita.
Kyoudaitachi wa sore to shitte, kare o Kaizariya ni tsurete kudari, Taruso e okuridashita.
Kou shite kyoukai wa, Yudaya, Gariraya, Samariya zenchihou ni watatte heian o tamochi, kiso ga katamari, Shu o osore seirei ni hagemasarete ayumi, shidai ni shinto no kazu o mashite itta.
Petero wa houbou o meguriaruitaga, Ruda ni sumu seitotachi no tokoro e mo kudatte itta.
Soshite, soko de, hachi nenkan mo toko ni tsuite iru Aineya to iu hito ni atta. Kono hito wa chuubu de atta.
Petero ga kare ni itta, "Aineya yo, Iesu Kirisuto ga anata o iyashite kudasaru no da. Oki nasai. Soshite toko o toriage nasai". Suruto, kare wa tadachini okiagatta.
Ruda to Saron ni sumu hitotachi wa, mina sore o mite, Shu ni kie shita.
Yoppa ni Tabita (kore o yakusuto, Dorukasu, sunawachi, kamoshika) to iu onnadeshi ga ita. Kazukazu no yoi hataraki ya hodokoshi o shite ita fujin de atta.
Tokoro ga, sono koro byouki ni natte shinda no de, hitobito wa sono karada o aratte, okujou no ma ni anchi shita.
Ruda wa Yoppa ni chikakatta no de, deshitachi wa Petero ga Ruda ni kite iru to kiki, futari no mono o kare no moto ni yatte, "Douzo, hayaku kochira ni oide kudasai" to tanonda.
Soko de Petero wa tatte, futari no mono ni tsurerarete kita. Kare ga tsukuto sugu, okujou no ma ni annai sareta. Suruto, yamometachi ga minna kare no soba ni yotte kite, Dorukasu ga seizen tsukutta shitagi ya uwagi no kazukazu o, nakinagara miseru no de atta.
Petero wa minna no mono o soto ni dashi, hizamazuite inotta. Sore kara shitai no hou ni muite, "Tabita yo, oki nasai" to itta. Suruto kanojo wa me o ake, Petero o mite okinaotta.
Petero wa kanojo ni te o kashite tataseta. Sore kara, seitotachi ya, yamometachi o yobiirete, kanojo ga ikikaette iru no o miseta.
Kono koto ga Yoppachuu ni shire watari, ooku no hitobito ga Shu o shinjita.
Petero wa, kawa nameshi Shimon to iu hito no ie ni tomari, shibaraku no aida Yoppa ni taizai shita.
Sate, Kaizariya ni Korunerio to iu na no hito ga ita. Itariyatai to yobareta butai no hyakusotsuchou de,
Shinjin bukaku, kazoku ichidou to tomo ni kami o uyamai, tami ni kazukazu no hodokoshi o nashi, taezu kami ni inori o shite ita.
Aru hi no gogo san ji goro, kami no tsukai ga kare no tokoro ni kite, "Korunerio yo" to yobu no o, maboroshi de hakkiri mita.
Kare wa mitsukai o mitsumete itaga, osoroshiku natte, "Shu yo, nan de gozaimasu ka" to itta. Suru to mitsukai ga itta, "Anata no inori ya hodokoshi wa kami no mimae ni todoite, oboerarete iru.
Tsuite wa ima, Yoppa ni hito o yatte, Petero to yobareru Shimon to iu hito o maneki nasai.
Kono hito wa, umibe ni ie o motsu kawa nameshi Shimon to iu mono no kyaku to natte iru".
Kono otsuge o shita mitsukai ga tachisatta nochi, Korunerio wa, shimobe futari to, buka no naka de shinjin bukai heisotsu hitori to o yobi,
Issai no koto o setsumei shite kikase, Yoppa e okuridashita.
Yokujitsu, kono sannin ga tabi o tsuzukete machi no chikaku ni kita koro, Petero wa inori o suru tame okujou ni nobotta. Toki wa hiru no juu ni ji goro de atta.
Kare wa kuufuku o oboete, nani ka tabetai to omotta. Soshite, hitobito ga shokuji no youi o shite iru aida ni, yumegokochi ni natta.
Suruto, ten ga hirake, ookina nuno no you na iremono ga, yo sumi o tsurusarete, chijou ni orite kuru no o mita.
Sono naka ni wa, chijou no yotsuashi ya hau mono, mata sora no tori nado, kakushu no ikimono ga haitte ita.
Soshite koe ga kare ni kikoete kita, "Petero yo. Tatte, sorera o hofutte tabe nasai".
Petero wa itta, "Shu yo, sore wa dekimasen. Watashi wa ima made ni, kiyoku nai mono, kegareta mono wa, nanihito tsu tabeta koto ga arimasen".
Suruto, koe ga ni dome ni kakatte kita, "Kami ga kiyometa mono o, kiyoku nai nado to itte wa naranai".
Konna koto ga san do mo atte kara, sono iremono wa sugu ten ni hikiagerareta.
Petero ga, ima mita maboroshi wa nan no koto darou ka to, hitori shian ni kurete iruto, choudo sono toki, Korunerio kara okurareta hitotachi ga, Shimon no ie o tazuneatete, sono kadoguchi ni tatte ita.
Soshite koe o kakete, "Petero to yobareru Shimon to iu kata ga, kochira ni otomaride wa gozaimasen ka" to tazuneta.
Petero wa nao mo maboroshi ni tsuite, omoimegurashite iruto, mitama ga itta, "Goran nasai, sannin no hitotachi ga, anata o tazunete kite iru.
Saa, tatte shita ni ori, tamerawanaide, karera to issho ni dekakeru ga yoi. Watashi ga karera o yokoshita no de aru".
Soko de Petero wa, sono hitotachi no tokoro ni orite itte itta, "Watashi ga otazune no Petero desu. Donna goyou de oide ni natta no desu ka".
Karera wa kotaeta, "Tadashii hito de, kami o uyamai, Yudaya no zenkokumin ni koukan o motarete iru hyakusotsuchou Korunerio ga, anata o ie ni maneite ohanashi o ukagau you ni to no otsuge o, sei naru mitsukai kara ukemashita no de, mairimashita".
Soko de, Petero wa, karera o mukaete tomaraseta. Yokujitsu, Petero wa tatte, karera to tsuredatte dehas shita. Yoppa no kyoudaitachi suunin mo issho ni itta.
Sono tsugi no hi ni, ikkou wa Kaizariya ni tsuita. Korunerio wa shinzoku ya shitashii yuujintachi o yobiatsumete, matte ita.
Petero ga iyoiyo touchaku suruto, Korunerio wa demukaete, kare no ashimoto ni hirefushite haishita.
Suru to Petero wa, kare o hikiokoshite itta, "Otachi nasai. Watashi mo onaji ningen desu".
Sore kara tomo ni hanashinagara, heya ni haitte ikuto, soko ni wa, sudeni oozei no hito ga atsumatte ita.
Petero wa karera ni itta, "Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, Yudayajin ga takoku no hito to kousai shi tari, deiri shi tari suru koto wa, kinjirarete imasu. Tokoro ga, kami wa, donna ningen o mo kiyoku nai to ka, kegarete iru to ka itte wa naranaito, watashi ni oshimeshi ni narimashita.
Omaneki ni azukatta toki, sukoshi mo tamerawazu ni maitta no wa, sono tame na no desu. Soko de ukagaimasuga, dou iu wake de, watashi o maneite kudasatta no desu ka".
Kore ni taishite Korunerio ga kotaeta, "Yonka mae, choudo kono jikoku ni, watashi ga jitaku de gogo san ji no inori o shite imasuto, totsuzen, kagayaita koromo o kita hito ga, mae ni tatte moushimashita,
'Korunerio yo, anata no inori wa kikiirerare, anata no hodokoshi wa kami no mimae ni oboerarete iru.
Soko de Yoppa ni hito o okutte Petero to yobareru Shimon o maneki nasai. Sono hito wa kawa nameshi Shimon no umizoi no ie ni tomatte iru'.
Sore de, sassoku anata o o yobi shita no desu. You koso oide kudasaimashita. Ima watashitachi wa, Shu ga anata ni otsuge ni natta koto o nokorazu ukagaou to shite, mina kami no mimae ni makaridete iru no desu".
Soko de Petero wa kuchi o hiraite itta, "Kami wa hito o katayori minai kata de,
Kami o uyamai gi o okonau mono wa dono kokumin de mo ukeirete kudasaru koto ga, hontou ni yoku wakatte kimashita.
Anata gata wa, kami ga subete no mono no Shu naru Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte heiwa no fukuin o nobetsutaete, Isuraeru no kora ni ookuri kudasatta mikotoba o gozonjideshou.
Sore wa, Yohane ga baputesuma o toita nochi, Gariraya kara hajimatte Yudaya zendo ni hiromatta fukuin o nobeta mono desu.
Kami wa Nazare no Iesu ni seirei to chikara to o sosogaremashita. Kono Iesu wa, kami ga tomo ni orareru no de, yoi hataraki o shinagara, mata akuma ni osaetsukerarete iru hitobito o kotogotoku iya shinagara, junkai saremashita.
Watashitachi wa, Iesu ga kou shite Yudayajin no chi ya Erusaremu de nasatta subete no koto no shounin de arimasu. Hitobito wa kono Iesu o ki ni kakete koroshita no desu.
Shikashi kami wa Iesu o mikkame ni yomigaerase,
Zenbu no hitobito ni de wa nakattaga, watashitachi shounin to shite arakajime erabareta monotachi ni arawareru you ni shite kudasaimashita. Watashitachi wa, Iesu ga shinin no naka kara fukkatsu sareta nochi, tomo ni inshoku shimashita.
Sore kara, Iesu gojishin ga seija to shisha to no shinpansha to shite kami ni sadamerareta kata de aru koto o, hitobito ni nobetsutae, mata akashi suru you ni to, kami wa watashitachi ni omeiji ni natta no desu.
Yogensha tachi mo mina, Iesu o shinjiru mono wa kotogotoku, sono na ni yotte tsumi no yurushi ga ukerareruto, akashi o shite imasu".
Petero ga korera no kotoba o mada katari oenai uchi ni, sore o kiite ita minna no hitotachi ni, seirei gaku datta.
Katsurei o ukete iru shinja de, Petero ni tsuite kita hitotachi wa, ihoujin tachi ni mo seirei no tamamono ga sosogareta no o mite, odoroita.
Sore wa, karera ga igen o katatte kami osan bi shite iru no o kiitakara de aru. Soko de, Petero ga ii dashita,
"Kono hitotachi ga watashitachi to onaji you ni seirei o uketakara ni wa, karera ni mizu de baputesuma o sazukeru no o, dare ga kobami eyou ka".
Kou itte, Petero wa sono hitobito ni meijite, Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte baputesuma o ukesaseta. Sore kara, karera wa Petero ni negatte, nao suujitsu no aida taizai shite moratta.
Sate, ihoujin tachi mo kami no kotoba o ukeireta to iu koto ga, shitotachi ya Yudaya ni iru kyoudaitachi ni kikoete kita.
Soko de Petero ga Erusaremu ni nobotta toki, katsurei o omonjiru monotachi ga kare o togamete itta,
"Anata wa, katsurei no nai hitotachi no tokoro ni itte, shokuji o tomo ni shita to iu koto daga".
Soko de Petero wa kuchi o hiraite, junjo tadashiku setsumei shite itta,
"Watashi ga Yoppa no machi de inotte iruto, yumegokochi ni natte maboroshi o mita. Ookina nuno no you na iremono ga, yo sumi o tsurusarete, ten kara orite kite, watashi no tokoro ni todoita.
Chuui shite mitsumete iruto, chijou no yotsuashi, no no kemono, hau mono, sora no tori nado ga, haitte ita.
Sore kara koe ga shite, 'Petero yo, tatte, sorera o hofutte tabe nasai' to, watashi ni iu no ga kikoeta.
Watashi wa itta, 'Shu yo, sore wa dekimasen. Watashi wa ima made ni, kiyoku nai mono ya kegareta mono o kuchi ni ireta koto ga ichido mo gozaimasen'.
Suruto, ni dome ni ten kara koe ga kakatte kita, 'Kami ga kiyometa mono o, kiyoku nai nado to itte wa naranai'.
Konna koto ga san do mo atte kara, zenbu no mono ga mata ten ni hikiagerarete shimatta.
Choudo sono toki, Kaizariya kara tsukawasarete kita sannin no hito ga, watashitachi no tomatte ita ie ni tsuita.
Mitama ga watashi ni, tamerawazu ni karera to tomo ni ike to itta no de, koko ni iru rokunin no kyoudaitachi mo, watashi to issho ni dekakete iki, ichidou ga sono hito no ie ni haitta.
Suruto kare wa watashitachi ni, mitsukai ga kare no ie ni arawarete, 'Yoppa ni hito o yatte, Petero to yobareru Shimon o maneki nasai.
Kono hito wa, anata to anata no zenkazoku to ga sukuwareru kotoba o katatte kudasarude arou' to tsugeta shidai o, hanashite kureta.
Soko de watashi ga katari dashita tokoro, seirei ga, choudo saisho watashitachi no ue ni kudatta to onaji you ni, karera no ue ni kudatta.
Sono toki watashi wa, Shu ga 'Yohane wa mizu de baputesuma o sazuketaga, anata gata wa seirei ni yotte baputesuma o ukerude arou' to oose ni natta kotoba o omoidashita.
Kono you ni, watashitachi ga Shu Iesu Kirisuto o shinjita toki ni kudasatta no to onaji tamamono o, kami ga karera ni mo oatae ni natta to sureba, watashi no you na mono ga, dou shite kami o samatageru koto ga dekiyou ka".
Hitobito wa kore o kiite damatte shimatta. Sore kara kami osan bi shite, "Sore de wa kami wa, ihoujin ni mo inochi ni itaru kuiaratame o oatae ni natta no da" to itta.
Sate, Sutepano no koto de okotta hakugai no tame ni chirasareta hitobito wa, Pinike, Kupuro, Anteoke made mo susunde ittaga, Yudayajin igai no mono ni wa, dare ni mo mikotoba o katatte inakatta.
Tokoro ga, sono naka ni suunin no Kupurobito to Kurenebito ga ite, Anteoke ni itte kara Girishiyajin ni mo yobikake, Shu Iesu o nobetsutaete ita.
Soshite, Shu no mite ga karera to tomo ni atta tame, shinjite Shu ni kie suru mono no kazu ga ookatta.
Kono uwasa ga Erusaremu ni aru kyoukai ni tsutawatte kita no de, kyoukai wa Barunaba o Anteoke ni tsukawashita.
Kare wa, soko ni tsuite, kami no megumi o mite yorokobi, Shu ni taisuru shinkou o yuruganai kokoro de mochi tsuzukeru you ni to, minna no mono o hagemashita.
Kare wa seirei to shinkou to ni michita rippa na hito de attakara de aru. Kou shite Shu ni kuwawaru hitobito ga, oozei ni natta.
Soko de Barunaba wa Sauro o sagashi ni Taruso e dekakete iki,
Kare o mitsuketa ue, Anteoke ni tsurete kaetta. Futari wa, maruichi nen, tomodomo ni kyoukai de atsumari o shi, oozei no hitobito o oshieta. Kono Anteoke de hajimete, deshitachi ga Kurisuchan to yobareru you ni natta.
Sono koro, yogensha tachi ga Erusaremu kara Anteoke ni kudatte kita.
Sono naka no hitori de aru Agabo to iu mono ga tatte, sekaijuu ni daikikin ga okorudarou to, mitama ni yotte yogen shita tokoro, hatashite sore ga Kuraudeo tei no toki ni okotta.
Soko de deshitachi wa, sorezore no chikara ni oujite, Yudaya ni sunde iru kyoudaitachi ni enjo o okuru koto ni kimeta.
Soshite, sore o Barunaba to Sauro to no te ni takushite, chouroutachi ni okuritodoketa.
Sono koro, Herode ou wa kyoukai no aru monotachi ni appaku no te o nobashi,
Yohane no kyoudai Yakobu o tsurugi de kirikoroshita.
Soshite, sore ga Yudayajintachi no i ni kanatta no o mite, sarani Petero o mo torae ni kakatta. Sore wa jokousai no toki no koto de atta.
Herode wa Petero o toraete goku ni touji, yonnin hito kumi no heisotsu yon kumi ni hikiwatashite, mihari o sasete oita. Sugikoshi no matsuri no ato de, kare o minshuu no mae ni hikidasu tsumori de atta no de aru.
Kou shite, Petero wa goku ni irerarete ita. Kyoukai de wa, kare no tame ni nesshin na inori ga kami ni sasagerareta.
Herode ga kare o hikidasou to shite ita sono yoru, Petero wa nijuu no kusari ni tsunagare, futari no heisotsu no aida ni okarete nemutte ita. Banpeitachi wa toguchi de goku o mihatte ita.
Suruto, totsuzen, Shu no tsukai ga soba ni tachi, hikari ga gokunai o tera shita. Soshite mitsukai wa Petero no wakibara o tsutsuite okoshi, "Hayaku okiagari nasai" to itta. Suru to kusari ga kare no ryoute kara, wa zureochita.
Mitsukai ga "Obi o shime, kutsu o haki nasai" to itta no de, kare wa sono toori ni shita. Sore kara "Uwagi o kite, tsuite ki nasai" to iwareta no de,
Petero wa tsuite dete itta. Kare ni wa mitsukai no shiwaza ga genjitsu no koto to wa kangaerarezu, tada maboroshi o mite iru you ni omowareta.
Karera wa daiichi, daini no eisho o toori sugite, machi ni nukeru tetsumon no tokoro ni kuruto, sore ga hitorideni hiraita no de, soko o dete hitotsu no tsuuro ni susunda totan ni, mitsukai wa kare o hanaresatta.
Sono toki Petero wa ware ni kaette itta, "Ima hajimete, hontou no koto ga wakatta. Shu ga mitsukai o tsukawashite, Herode no te kara, mata Yudayajintachi no machimoukete ita arayuru wazawai kara, watashi o sukuidashite kudasatta no da".
Petero wa kou to wakatte kara, Maruko to yobarete iru Yohane no haha Mariya no ie ni itta. Sono ie ni wa oozei no hito ga atsumatte inotte ita.
Kare ga mon no to o tataita tokoro, Roda to iu jochuu ga toritsugi ni dete kitaga,
Petero no koe da to wakaruto, yorokobi no amari, mon o ake mo shinaide ie ni kakekomi, Petero ga kadoguchi ni tatte iru to houkoku shita.
Hitobito wa "Anata wa ki ga kurutte iru" to ittaga, kanojo wa jibun no iu koto ni machigai wa naito, iihatta. Soko de karera wa "Sore de wa, Petero no mitsukai darou" to itta.
Shikashi, Petero ga mon o tataki tsuzukeru no de, karera ga akeruto, soko ni Petero ga ita no o mite odoroita.
Petero wa te o futte karera o shizume, Shu ga goku kara kare o tsuredashite kudasatta shidai o setsumei shi, "Kono koto o, Yakobu ya hoka no kyoudaitachi ni tsutaete kudasai" to iinokoshite, doko ka hoka no tokoro e dete itta.
Yo ga akeruto, heisotsutachi no aida ni, Petero wa ittai dou natta no darou to, taihen na sawagi ga okotta.
Herode wa Petero o sagashite mo mitsukaranai no de, banpeitachi o torishirabeta ue, karera o shikei ni shosuru you ni meiji, soshite, Yudaya kara Kaizariya ni kudatte itte, soko ni taizai shita.
Sate, Tsuro to Shidon to no hitobito wa, Herode no ikari ni furete ita no de, ichidou uchi sorotte ou o otozure, ou no jijuukan Burasuto ni toriitte, wakai kata o irai shita. Karera no chihou ga, ou no kuni kara shokuryou o ete itakara de aru.
Sadamerareta hi ni, Herode wa ou fuku o matotte ouza ni suwari, karera ni mukatte enzetsu o shita.
Atsumatta hitobito wa, "Kore wa kami no koe da, ningen no koe de wa nai" to sakebi tsuzuketa.
Suruto tachimachi, Shu no tsukai ga kare o utta. Kami ni eikou o kisuru koto o shinakattakara de aru. Kare wa mushi ni kamarete iki ga taete shimatta.
Kou shite, Shu no kotoba wa masumasu sakan ni hiromatte itta.
Barunaba to Sauro to wa, sono ninmu o hatashita nochi, Maruko to yobarete ita Yohane o tsurete, Erusaremu kara kaette kita.
Sate, Anteoke ni aru kyoukai ni wa, Barunaba, Nigeru to yobareru Shimeon, Kurenebito Rukio, ryoushu Herode no chikyoudai Manaen, oyobi Sauro nado no yogensha ya kyoushi ga ita.
Ichidou ga Shu ni reihai o sasage, danjiki o shite iruto, seirei ga "Saa, Barunaba to Sauro to o, watashi no tame ni seibetsu shite, karera ni sazukete oita shigoto ni atarase nasai" to tsugeta.
Soko de ichidou wa, danjiki to inori to o shite, te o futari no ue ni oita nochi, shuppatsu saseta.
Futari wa seirei ni okuridasarete, Serukiya ni kudari, soko kara fune de Kupuro ni watatta.
Soshite Saramisu ni tsukuto, Yudayajin no shokaidou de kami no kotoba o nobe hajimeta. Karera wa Yohane o tasukete to shite tsurete ita.
Shimazentai o junkai shite, Paposu made itta tokoro, soko de Yudayajin no majutsushi, Baruiesu to iu nise yogensha ni deatta.
Kare wa chihou soutoku Serugio Pauro no tokoro ni deiri o shite ita. Kono soutoku wa kenmei na hito de atte, Barunaba to Sauro to o maneite, kami no kotoba o kikou to shita.
Tokoro ga majutsushi Eruma (kare no na wa "Majutsushi" to no i) wa, soutoku o shinkou kara sorasou to shite, shikiri ni futari no jama o shita.
Sauro, mata no na wa Pauro, wa seirei ni mitasare, kare o niramitsukete
Itta, "Aa, arayuru itsuwari to jaaku to de katamatte iru akuma no ko yo, subete tadashii mono no teki yo. Shu no massugu na michi o mageru koto o yamenai no ka.
Miyo, Shu no mite ga omae no ue ni oyonde iru. Omae wa mekura ni natte, toubun, hi no hikari ga mienaku naru no da". Tachimachi, kasumi to yami to ga kare ni kakatta tame, kare wa tesaguri shinagara, te o hiite kureru hito o sagashimawatta.
Soutoku wa kono dekigoto o mite, Shu no oshie ni sukkari odoroki, soshite shinjita.
Pauro to sono ikkou wa, Paposu kara funade shite, Panfuriya no Peruga ni watatta. Koko de Yohane wa ikkou kara mi o hiite, Erusaremu ni kaette shimatta.
Shikashi futari wa, Peruga kara sarani susunde, Pishideya no Anteoke ni iki, ansokunichi ni kaidou ni haitte seki ni tsuita.
Rippou to yogensho no roudoku ga atta nochi, kaidouzukasa tachi ga karera no tokoro ni hito o tsukawashite, "Kyoudaitachi yo, moshi anata gata no uchi, donata ka, kono hitobito ni nani ka shourei no kotoba ga arimashitara, douzo ohanashi kudasai" to iwaseta.
Soko de Pauro ga tachiagari, te o furinagara itta. "Isuraeru no hitotachi, narabi ni kami o uyamau katagata yo, okiki kudasai.
Kono tami Isuraeru no kami wa, watashitachi no senzo o erabi, Ejiputo no chi ni taizaichuu, kono tami o ooinaru mono to shi, miude o takaku sashiagete, karera o sono chi kara michibikidasareta.
Soshite yakuyonjuu nen ni watatte, arano de karera o hagukumi,
Kanan no chi de wa nanatsu no iminzoku o uchihoroboshi, sono chi o karera ni yuzuriataerareta.
Sorera no koto ga yakuyonhyaku gojuu nen no nengetsu ni watatta. Sono nochi, kami wa sabakihitotachi o otsukawashi ni nari, yogensha Samueru no toki ni oyonda.
Sono toki, hitobito ga ou o youkyuu shita no de, kami wa Beniyaminzoku no hito, Kisu no ko Sauro o yonjuu nenkan, karera ni otsukawashi ni natta.
Sore kara kami wa Sauro o shirizoke, Dabide o tatete ou to saretaga, kare ni tsuite akashi o shite, 'Watashi wa Essai no ko Dabide o mitsuketa. Kare wa watashi no kokoro ni kanatta hito de, watashi no omou tokoro o, kotogotoku jikkou shite kurerude arou' to iwareta.
Kami wa yakusoku ni shitagatte, kono Dabide no shison no naka kara sukuinushi Iesu o Isuraeru ni okuraretaga,
Sono korareru mae ni, Yohane ga Isuraeru no subete no tami ni kuiaratame no baputesuma o, arakajime nobetsutaete ita.
Yohane wa sono isshou no koutei o owarou to suru ni atatte itta, 'Watashi wa, anata gata ga kangaete iru you na mono de wa nai. Shikashi, watashi no ato kara kuru kata ga iru. Watashi wa sono kutsu o nugasete ageru neuchi mo nai'.
Kyoudaitachi, Aburahamu no shison no katagata, narabi ni minasan no naka no kami o uyamau hitotachi yo. Kono sukui no kotoba wa watashitachi ni okurareta no de aru.
Erusaremu ni sumu hitobito ya sono shidousha tachi wa, Iesu o mitomezu ni kei ni shoshi, sore ni yotte, ansokunichi goto ni yomu yogensha no kotoba ga jouju shita.
Mata, nanra shi ni ataru riyuu ga miidasenakatta no ni, Pirato ni kyouyou shite Iesu o koroshite shimatta.
Soshite, Iesu ni tsuite kaite aru koto o, mina nashitogete kara, hitobito wa Iesu o ki kara torioroshite haka ni houmutta.
Shikashi, kami wa Iesu o shinin no naka kara, yomigaeraseta no de aru.
Iesu wa, Gariraya kara Erusaremu e issho ni nobotta hitotachi ni, ikunichi mo no aida araware, soshite, karera wa ima ya, hitobito ni taishite Iesu no shounin to natte iru.
Watashitachi wa, kami ga senzotachi ni taishite nasareta yakusoku o, koko ni nobetsutaete iru no de aru.
Kami wa, Iesu o yomigaerasete, watashitachi shison ni kono yakusoku o, ohatashi ni natta. Sore wa shihen no daini hen ni mo, 'Anata koso wa, watashi no ko. Kyou, watashi wa anata o unda' to kaite aru toori de aru.
Mata, kami ga Iesu o shinin no naka kara yomigaerasete, itsu made mo kuchi hateru koto no nai mono to sareta koto ni tsuite wa, 'Watashi wa, Dabide ni yakusoku shita tashika na sei naru shukufuku o, anata gata ni sazukeyou' to iwareta.
Dakara, hoka no kasho de mo kou itte orareru, 'Anata no seija ga kuchi hateru you na koto wa, oyurushi ni naranaide arou'.
Jijitsu, Dabide wa, sono jidai no hitobito ni kami no mimune ni shitagatte tsukaetaga, yagate nemuri ni tsuki, senzotachi no naka ni kuwaerarete, tsuini kuchi hatete shimatta.
Shikashi, kami ga yomigaeraseta kata wa, kuchi hateru koto ga nakatta no de aru.
Dakara, kyoudaitachi yo, kono koto o shouchi shite oku ga yoi. Sunawachi, kono Iesu ni yoru tsumi no yurushi no fukuin ga, ima ya anata gata ni nobetsutaerarete iru. Soshite, Moose no rippou de wa gi to sareru koto ga dekinakatta subete no koto ni tsuite mo,
Shinjiru mono wa morenaku, Iesu ni yotte gi to sareru no de aru.
Dakara yogensha tachi no sho ni kaite aru tsugi no you na koto ga, anata gata no mi ni okoranai you ni ki o tsuke nasai.
'Miyo, anadoru monotachi yo. Odoroke, soshite horobisare. Watashi wa, anata gata no jidai ni hitotsu no koto o suru. Sore wa, hito ga donna ni setsumei shite kikasete mo, anata gata no toutei shinjinai you na koto na no de aru' ".
Futari ga kaidou o deru toki, hitobito wa tsugi no ansokunichi ni mo, kore to onaji hanashi o shite kureru you ni to, shikiri ni negatta.
Soshite shuukai ga owatte kara mo, oozei no Yudayajin ya shinjin bukai kaishuusha tachi ga, Pauro to Barunaba to ni tsuite kita no de, futari wa, karera ga hikitsuzuki kami no megumi ni todomatte iru you ni to, tokisusumeta.
Tsugi no ansokunichi ni wa, hotondo zenshi o agete, kami no kotoba o kiki ni atsumatte kita.
Suruto Yudayajintachi wa, sono gunshuu o mite netamashiku omoi, Pauro no kataru koto ni kuchigitanaku hantai shita.
Pauro to Barunaba to wa daitan ni katatta, "Kami no kotoba wa, mazu, anata gata ni kataritsutaerarenakereba naranakatta. Shikashi, anata gata wa sore o shirizoke, jibun jishin o eien no inochi ni fusawashi karanu mono ni shite shimattakara, saa, watashitachi wa kore kara houkou o kaete, ihoujin tachi no hou ni iku no da.
Shu wa watashitachi ni, kou meijite orareru, 'Watashi wa, anata o tatete ihoujin no hikari to shita. Anata ga chi no hate made mo sukui o motarasu tame de aru' ".
Ihoujin tachi wa kore o kiite yorokobi, Shu no mikotoba o hometataete yamanakatta. Soshite, eien no inochi ni azukaru you ni sadamerarete ita mono wa, mina shinjita.
Kou shite, Shu no mikotoba wa kono chihou zentai ni hiromatte itta.
Tokoro ga, Yudayajintachi wa, shinjin bukai kifujin tachi ya machi no yuuryokushatachi o sendou shite, Pauro to Barunaba o hakugai sase, futari o sono chihou kara oidasaseta.
Futari wa, karera ni mukete ashi no chiri o haraiotoshite, Ikoniomu e itta.
Deshitachi wa, masumasu yorokobi to seirei to ni mitasarete ita.
Futari wa, Ikoniomu de mo onaji you ni Yudayajin no kaidou ni haitte katatta kekka, Yudayajin ya Girishiyajin ga oozei shinjita.
Tokoro ga, shinjinakatta Yudayajintachi wa ihoujin tachi o sosonokashite, kyoudaitachi ni taishite akui o idakaseta.
Sore ni mo kakawarazu, futari wa nagai kikan o soko de sugoshite, daitan ni Shu no koto o katatta. Shu wa, karera no te ni yotte shirushi to kiseki to o okonawase, sono megumi no kotoba o akashi sareta.
Soko de machi no hitobito ga niha ni wakare, aru hitotachi wa Yudayajin no gawa ni tsuki, aru hitotachi wa shito no gawa ni tsuita.
Sono toki, ihoujin ya Yudayajin ga yakunintachi to issho ni natte hantai undou o okoshi, shitotachi o hazukashime, ishi de utou to shita no de,
Futari wa sore to kizuite, Rukaoniya no machimachi, Rusutera, Derube oyobi sono fukin no chi e nogare,
Soko de hikitsuzuki fukuin o tsutaeta.
Tokoro ga, Rusutera ni ashi no kikanai hito ga, suwatte ita. Kare wa umarenagara no ashi na e de, aruita keiken ga mattaku nakatta.
Kono hito ga Pauro no kataru no o kiite itaga, Pauro wa kare o jitto mite, iya sareru hodo no shinkou ga kare ni aru no o mitome,
Oogoe de "Jibun no ashi de, massugu ni tachi nasai" to itta. Suruto kare wa odoriagatte aruki dashita.
Gunshuu wa Pauro no shita koto o mite, koe o hariage, Rukaoniya no chihou go de, "Kamigami ga ningen no sugata o totte, watashitachi no tokoro ni okudari ni natta no da" to sakenda.
Karera wa Barunaba o Zeusu to yobi, Pauro wa omoni kataru hito na no de, kare o Herumesu to yonda.
Soshite, kougai ni aru Zeusu shinden no saishi ga, gunshuu to tomo ni, futari ni gisei o sasageyou to omotte, oushi suutou to hanawa to o monzen ni motte kita.
Futari no shito Barunaba to Pauro to wa, kore o kiite jibun no uwagi o hikisaki, gunshuu no naka ni tobikonde iki, sakende
Itta, "Minasan, naze konna koto o suru no ka. Watashitachi totemo, anata gata to onaji you na ningen de aru. Soshite, anata gata ga kono you na gu ni mo tsukanu mono o sutete, ten to chi to umi to, sono naka no subete no mono o otsukuri ni natta ikeru kami ni tachikaeru you ni to, fukuin o toite iru mono de aru.
Kami wa sugisatta jidai ni wa, subete no kuniguni no hito ga, sorezore no michi o iku mama ni shite okaretaga,
Sore de mo, gojibun no koto o akashi shinaide orareta wake de wa nai. Sunawachi, anata gata no tame ni ten kara ame o furase, minori no kisetsu o atae, shokumotsu to yorokobi to de, anata gata no kokoro o mitasu nado, iroiro no megumi o oatae ni natte iru no de aru".
Kou itte, futari wa, yatto no koto de, gunshuu ga jibuntachi ni gisei o sasageru no o, omoitodomaraseta.
Tokoro ga, aru Yudayajintachi wa Anteoke ya Ikoniomu kara oshikakete kite, gunshuu o nakama ni hikiireta ue, Pauro o ishi de uchi, shinde shimatta to omotte, kare o machi no soto ni hikizuri dashita.
Shikashi, deshitachi ga Pauro o torikakonde iru aida ni, kare wa okiagatte machi ni haitte itta. Soshite yokujitsu ni wa, Barunaba to issho ni Derube ni mukatte dekaketa.
Sono machi de fukuin o tsutaete, oozei no hito o deshi to shita nochi, Rusutera, Ikoniomu, Anteoke no machimachi ni kaette iki,
Deshitachi o chikarazuke, shinkou o mochi tsuzukeru you ni to shourei shi, "Watashitachi ga kami no kuni ni wa iru no ni wa, ooku no kunan o henakereba naranai" to katatta.
Mata kyoukaigoto ni karera no tame ni chouroutachi o ninmei shi, danjiki o shite inori, karera o sono shinjite iru Shu ni yudaneta.
Sore kara, futari wa Pishideya o tsuuka shite Panfuriya ni kitaga,
Peruga de mikotoba o katatta nochi, Atariya ni kudari,
Soko kara fune de Anteoke ni kaetta. Karera ga ima nashi owatta hataraki no tame ni, kami no shukufuku o ukete okuridasareta no wa, kono Anteoke kara de atta.
Karera wa touchaku sousou, kyoukai no hitobito o yobiatsumete, kami ga karera to tomo ni ite shite kudasatta kazukazu no koto, mata shinkou no mon o ihoujin ni hiraite kudasatta koto nado o, houkoku shita.
Soshite, futari wa shibaraku no aida, deshitachi to issho ni sugoshita.
Sate, aru hitotachi ga Yudaya kara kudatte kite, kyoudaitachi ni "Anata gata mo, Moose no kanrei ni shitagatte katsurei o ukenakereba, sukuwarenai" to, toite ita.
Soko de, Pauro ya Barunaba to karera to no aida ni, sukunakaranu funkyuu to souron to ga shoujita no de, Pauro, Barunaba sono hoka suunin no mono ga Erusaremu ni nobori, shitotachi ya chouroutachi to, kono mondai ni tsuite kyougi suru koto ni natta.
Karera wa kyoukai no hitobito ni miokurare, Pinike, Samariya o tootte, michisugara, ihoujin tachi no kaishuu no moyou o kuwashiku setsumei shi, subete no kyoudaitachi o ooini yorokobaseta.
Erusaremu ni tsukuto, karera wa kyoukai to shitotachi, chouroutachi ni mukaerarete, kami ga karera to tomo ni ite nasareta koto o, kotogotoku houkoku shita.
Tokoro ga, Parisaiha kara shinkou ni haitte kita hitotachi ga tatte, "Ihoujin ni mo katsurei o hodokoshi, mata Moose no rippou o mamoraserubekide aru" to shuchou shita.
Soko de, shitotachi ya chouroutachi ga, kono mondai ni tsuite shingi suru tame ni atsumatta.
Hageshii souron ga atta nochi, Petero ga tatte itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, goshouchi no toori, ihoujin ga watashi no kuchi kara fukuin no kotoba o kiite shinjiru you ni to, kami wa hajime no koro ni, shokun no naka kara watashi o oerabi ni natta no de aru.
Soshite, hito no kokoro o gozonjide aru kami wa, seirei o wareware ni tamawatta to douyou ni karera ni mo tamawatte, karera ni taishite akashi o nashi,
Mata, sono shinkou ni yotte karera no kokoro o kiyome, wareware to karera to no aida ni, nan no wakehedate mo nasaranakatta.
Shikaru ni, shokun wa naze, ima wareware no senzo mo wareware jishin mo, oi kirenakatta kubiki o ano deshitachi no kubi ni kakete, kami o kokoromiru no ka.
Tashika ni, Shu Iesu no megumi ni yotte, wareware wa sukuwareru no da to shinjiruga, karera totemo douyou de aru".
Suruto, zenkaishuu wa damatte shimatta. Sore kara, Barunaba to Pauro to ga, karera o tooshite ihoujin no aida ni kami ga okonawareta kazukazu no shirushi to kiseki no koto o, setsumei suru no o kiita.
Futari ga katari oeta nochi, Yakobu wa sore ni oujite nobeta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, watashi no iken o kiite itadakitai.
Kami ga hajime ni ihoujin tachi o kaerimite, sono naka kara mina o ou tami o erabidasareta shidai wa, Shimeon ga sudeni setsumei shita.
Yogensha tachi no kotoba mo, sore to itchi shite iru. Sunawachi, kou kaite aru,
'Sono nochi, watashi wa kaette kite, taoreta Dabide no makuya o tatekae, kuzureta kasho o shuuri shi, sore o tatenaosou.
Nokotte iru hitobito mo, watashi no na o tonaete iru subete no ihoujin mo, Shu o tazunemotomeru you ni naru tame de aru.
Yo no hajime kara korera no koto o shirasete orareru Shu ga, kou oose ni natta'.
Soko de, watashi no iken de wa, ihoujin no naka kara kami ni kie shite iru hitotachi ni, wazurai o kakete wa ikenai.
Tada, guuzou ni sonaete kegareta mono to, fuhinkou to, shimekoroshita mono to, chi to o, sakeru you ni to, karera ni kakiokuru koto ni shitai.
Furui jidai kara, dono machi ni mo Moose no rippou o nobetsutaeru mono ga ite, ansokunichi goto ni sore o shokaidou de roudoku suru narawashi de arukara".
Soko de, shitotachi ya chouroutachi wa, zenkyoukai to kyougi shita sue, otagai no naka kara hitobito o erande, Pauro ya Barunaba to tomo ni, Anteoke ni haken suru koto ni kimeta. Erabareta no wa, Barusaba to iu Yuda to Shirasu to de attaga, izure mo kyoudaitachi no aida de omonjirarete ita hitotachi de atta.
Kono hitotachi ni takusareta shomen wa kou de aru. "Anata gata no kyoudai de aru shito oyobi chouroutachi kara, Anteoke, Shiriya, Kirikiya ni iru ihoujin no kyoudai gata ni, aisatsu o okuru.
Kochira kara itta aru monotachi ga, watashitachi kara no shiji mo nai no ni, iroiro na koto o itte, anatagata o sawagase, anata gata no kokoro o midashita to tsutaekiita.
Soko de, watashitachi wa hitobito o erande, aisuru Barunaba oyobi Pauro to tomo ni, anata gata no moto ni haken suru koto ni, shuugi ikketsu shita.
Kono futari wa, warera no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no na no tame ni, sono inochi o nagedashita hitobito de aruga,
Karera to tomo ni, Yuda to Shirasu to o haken suru shidai de aru. Kono hitotachi wa, anata gata ni, onaji shushi no koto o, koutou de mo tsutaerude arou.
Sunawachi, seirei to watashitachi to wa, tsugi no hitsuyou jikou no hoka wa, donna futan o mo, anata gata ni owasenai koto ni kimeta.
Sore wa, guuzou ni sonaeta mono to, chi to, shimekoroshita mono to, fuhinkou to o, sakeru to iu koto de aru. Korera no mono kara toozakatte oreba, sore de yoroshii. Ijou".
Sate, ikkou wa hitobito ni miokurarete, Anteoke ni kudatte iki, kaishuu o atsumete, sono shomen o tewatashita.
Hitobito wa sore o yonde, sono susume no kotoba o yorokonda.
Yuda to Shirasu to wa tomo ni yogensha de atta no de, ooku no kotoba o motte kyoudaitachi o hagemashi, mata chikarazuketa.
Futari wa, shibaraku no toki o, soko de sugoshita nochi, kyoudaitachi kara, tabi no heian o inorarete, miokuri o uke, jibunra o haken shita hitobito no tokoro ni kaette itta. []
Shikashi, Shirasu dake wa, hikitsuzuki todomaru koto ni shita.]
Pauro to Barunaba to wa Anteoke ni taizai o tsuzukete, hoka no ooku no hitotachi to tomo ni, Shu no kotoba o oshie katsu nobetsutaeta.
Ikunichi ka no nochi, Pauro wa Barunaba ni itta, "Saa, mae ni Shu no kotoba o tsutaeta subete no machimachi ni iru kyoudaitachi o, mata houmon shite, minna ga dou shite iru ka o mite koyoude wa nai ka".
Soko de, Barunaba wa Maruko to iu Yohane mo issho ni tsurete iku tsumori de ita.
Shikashi, Pauro wa, mae ni Panfuriya de ikkou kara hanarete, hataraki o tomo ni shinakatta you na mono wa, tsurete ikanai ga yoi to kangaeta.
Kou shite gekiron ga okori, sono kekka futari wa tagai ni wakarewakare ni nari, Barunaba wa Maruko o tsurete Kupuro ni watatte iki,
Pauro wa Shirasu o erabi, kyoudaitachi kara Shu no megumi ni yudanerarete, dehas shita.
Soshite Pauro wa, Shiriya, Kirikiya no chihou o tootte, shokyoukai o chikarazuketa.
Sore kara, kare wa Derube ni iki, tsugi ni Rusutera ni itta. Soko ni Temote to iu na no deshi ga ita. Shinja no Yudaya fujin o haha to shi, Girishiyajin o chichi to shite ori,
Rusutera to Ikoniomu no kyoudaitachi no aida de, hyouban no yoi jinbutsu de atta.
Pauro wa kono Temote o tsurete ikitakatta no de, sono chihou ni iru Yudayajin no temae, mazu kare ni katsurei o ukesaseta. Kare no chichi ga Girishiyajin de aru koto wa, minna shitte itakara de aru.
Sore kara karera wa tooru machimachi de, Erusaremu no shitotachi ya chouroutachi no torikimeta jikou o mamoru you ni to, hitobito ni sore o watashita.
Kou shite, shokyoukai wa sono shinkou o tsuyomerare, higoto ni kazu o mashite itta.
Sore kara karera wa, Ajiya de mikotoba o kataru koto o seirei ni kinjirareta no de, Furugiya Garateya chihou o tootte itta.
Soshite, Mushiya no atari ni kite kara, Biteniya ni susunde ikou to shita tokoro, Iesu no mitama ga kore o yurusanakatta.
Sore de, Mushiya o tsuuka shite, Toroasu ni kudatte itta.
Koko de yoru, Pauro wa hitotsu no maboroshi o mita. Hitori no Makedoniya bito ga tatte, "Makedoniya ni watatte kite, watashitachi o tasukete kudasai" to, kare ni kongan suru no de atta.
Pauro ga kono maboroshi o mita toki, kore wa karera ni fukuin o tsutaeru tame ni, kami ga watashitachi o omaneki ni natta no da to kakushin shite, watashitachi wa, tadachini Makedoniya ni watatte iku koto ni shita.
Soko de, watashitachi wa Toroasu kara funade shite, Samotorake ni chokkou shi, yokujitsu Neaporisu ni tsuita.
Soko kara Piripi e itta. Kore wa Makedoniya no kono chihou daiichi no machi de, shokumin toshi de atta. Watashitachi wa, kono machi ni suujitsukan taizai shita.
Aru ansokunichi ni, watashitachi wa machi no mon o dete, inori ba ga aru to omotte, kawa no hotori ni itta. Soshite, soko ni suwari, atsumatte kita fujintachi ni hanashi o shita.
Tokoro ga, Teatera shi no murasakinuno no shounin de, kami o uyamau Rudeya to iu fujin ga kiite ita. Shu wa kanojo no kokoro o hiraite, Pauro no kataru koto ni mimi o katamukesaseta.
Soshite, kono fujin mo sono kazoku mo, tomo ni baputesuma o uketaga, sono toki, kanojo wa "Moshi, watashi o Shu o shinjiru mono to oomoi deshitara, douzo, watashi no ie ni kite tomatte kudasai" to konmou shi, shiite watashitachi o tsurete itta.
Aru toki, watashitachi ga, inori ba ni iku tochuu, uranai no rei ni tsukareta onnadorei ni deatta. Kanojo wa uranai o shite, sono shujintachi ni ooku no rieki o esasete ita mono de aru.
Kono onna ga, Pauro ya watashitachi no ato o otte kite wa, "Kono hitotachi wa, ito takaki kami no shimobetachi de, anata gata ni sukui no michi o tsutaeru kata da" to, sakebi dasu no de atta.
Soshite, sonna koto o iku nichikan mo tsuzukete ita. Pauro wa komari hatete, sono rei ni mukai "Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte meijiru. Sono onna kara dete ike" to itta. Suruto, sono shunkan ni rei ga onna kara dete itta.
Kanojo no shujintachi wa, jibunra no rieki o eru nozomi ga taeta no o mite, Pauro to Shirasu to o torae, yakunin ni hikiwatasu tame hiroba ni hikizutte itta.
Sore kara, futari o choukantachi no mae ni hikidashite uttaeta, "Kono hitotachi wa Yudayajin de arimashite, watashitachi no machi o kakimidashi,
Watashitachi Roomajin ga, saiyou mo jikkou mo shite wa naranai fuushuu o senden shite iru no desu".
Gunshuu mo issei ni tatte, futari o semetateta no de, choukantachi wa futari no uwagi o hagitori, muchi de utsu koto o meijita.
Sore de, futari ni nani do mo muchi o kuwaesaseta nochi, goku ni ire, gokuri ni shikkari ban o suru you ni to meijita.
Gokuri wa kono genmei o uketa no de, futari o oku no gokuya ni ire, sono ashi ni ashikase o shikkato kakete oita.
Mayonaka goro, Pauro to Shirasu to wa, kami ni inori,san bi o utai tsuzuketaga, shuujintachi wa mimi o sumashite kiki itte ita.
Tokoro ga totsuzen, oojishin ga okotte, goku no dodai ga yureugoki, to wa zenbu tachimachi hiraite, minna no mono no kusari ga tokete shimatta.
Gokuri wa me o samashi, goku no to ga hiraite shimatte iru no o mite, shuujintachi ga nigedashita mono to omoi, tsurugi o nuite jisatsu shi kaketa.
Soko de Pauro wa oogoe o agete itta, "Jigai shite wa ikenai. Wareware wa mina hitori nokorazu, koko ni iru".
Suruto, gokuri wa, akari o te ni ireta ue, goku ni kakekonde kite, ononokinagara Pauro to Shirasu no mae ni hirefushita.
Sore kara, futari o soto ni tsuredashite itta, "Sensei gata, watashi wa sukuwareru tame ni, nani o subekideshou ka".
Futari ga itta, "Shu Iesu o shinji nasai. Sou shitara, anata mo anata no kazoku mo sukuwaremasu".
Sore kara, kare to sono kazoku ichidou to ni, kami no kotoba o katatte kikaseta.
Kare wa mayonaka ni mo kakawarazu, futari o hikitotte, sono uchikizu o aratte yatta. Soshite, sono ba de jibun mo kazoku mo, hitori nokorazu baputesuma o uke,
Sarani, futari o jibun no ie ni annai shite shokuji no motenashi o shi, kami o shinjiru mono to natta koto o, zenkazoku to tomo ni kokoro kara yorokonda.
Yo ga akeruto, choukantachi wa keirira o tsukawashite, "Ano hitotachi o shakuhou seyo" to iwaseta.
Soko de, gokuri wa kono kotoba o Pauro ni tsutaete itta, "Choukantachi ga, anatagata o shakuhou saseru you ni to, tsukai o yokoshimashita. Saa, dete kite, buji ni okaeri nasai".
Tokoro ga, Pauro wa keirira ni itta, "Karera wa, Roomajin de aru wareware o, saiban ni kake mo sezu ni, koushuu no mae de muchiutta ageku, goku ni irete shimatta. Shikaru ni ima ni natte, hisoka ni, wareware o dasou to suru no ka. Sore wa, ikenai. Karera jishin ga koko ni kite, wareware o tsuredasubekide aru".
Keirira wa kono kotoba o choukantachi ni houkoku shita. Suruto choukantachi wa, futari ga Roomajin da to kiite osore,
Jibun de yatte kite wabita ue, futari o goku kara tsuredashi, machi kara tachisaru you ni to tanonda.
Futari wa goku o dete, Rudeya no ie ni itta. Soshite, kyoudaitachi ni atte susume o nashi, sore kara dekaketa.
Ikkou wa, Amupiporisu to Aporoniya to o tootte, Tesaronike ni itta. Koko ni wa Yudayajin no kaidou ga atta.
Pauro wa rei ni yotte, sono kaidou ni haitte itte, mittsu no ansokunichi ni watari, seisho ni motozuite karera to ronji,
Kirisuto wa kanarazu kunan o uke, soshite shinin no naka kara yomigaerubeki koto, mata "Watashi ga anata gata ni tsutaete iru kono Iesu koso wa, Kirisuto de aru" to no koto o, setsumei mo shi ronshou mo shita.
Aru hitotachi wa nattoku ga itte, Pauro to Shirasu ni shitagatta. Sono naka ni wa, shinjin bukai Girishiyajin ga tasuu ari, kifujin tachi mo sukunaku nakatta.
Tokoro ga, Yudayajintachi wa, sore o netande, machi o buratsuite iru narazumonora o atsumete boudou o okoshi, machi o sawagaseta. Sore kara Yason no ie o osoi, futari o minshuu no mae ni hippari dasou to, shikiri ni sagashita.
Shikashi, futari ga mitsukaranai no de, Yason to kyoudaitachi suunin o, shi no toukyokusha no tokoro ni hikizutte iki, sakende itta, "Tenka o kakimawashite kita kono hitotachi ga, koko ni mo hairikonde imasu.
Sono hitotachi o Yason ga jibun no ie ni mukaeiremashita. Kono renchuu wa, mina Kaizaru no shouchoku ni somuite koudou shi, Iesu to iu betsu no ou ga iru nado to itte imasu".
Kore o kiite, gunshuu to shi no toukyokusha wa fuan ni kanjita.
Soshite, Yason ya hoka no monotachi kara, hoshoukin o totta ue, karera o shakuhou shita.
Soko de, kyoudaitachi wa tadachini, Pauro to Shirasu to o, yoru no aida ni Bereya e okuridashita. Futari wa Bereya ni touchaku suruto, Yudayajin no kaidou ni itta.
Koko ni iru Yudayajin wa Tesaronike no monotachi yori mo sunao de atte, kokoro kara oshie o ukeire, hatashite sono toori ka dou ka o shirou to shite, hibi seisho o shirabete ita.
Sou iu wake de, karera no uchi no ooku no mono ga shinja ni natta. Mata, Girishiya no kifujin ya danshi de shinjita mono mo, sukunaku nakatta.
Tesaronike no Yudayajintachi wa, Pauro ga Bereya de mo kami no kotoba o tsutaete iru koto o shiri, soko ni mo oshikakete kite, gunshuu o sendou shite sawagaseta.
Soko de, kyoudaitachi wa, tadachini Pauro o okuridashite, umibe made ikase, Shirasu to Temote to wa Bereya ni inokotta.
Pauro o annai shita hitotachi wa, kare o Atene made tsurete iki, Temote to Shirasu to ni narubeku hayaku kuru you ni to no Pauro no dengon o ukete, kaetta.
Sate, Pauro wa Atene de karera o matte iru aida ni, shinai ni guuzou ga obitadashiku aru no o mite, kokoro ni ikidoori o kanjita.
Soko de kare wa, kaidou de wa Yudayajin ya shinjin bukai hitotachi to ronji, hiroba de wa mainichi soko de deau hitobito o aite ni ronjita.
Mata, Epikurosuha ya Sutoaha no tetsugakusha suunin mo, Pauro to giron o tatakawasete itaga, sono naka no aru monotachi ga itta, "Kono oshaberi wa, ittai, nani o iou to shite iru no ka". Mata, hoka no monotachi wa, "Are wa, ikoku no kamigami o tsutaeyou to shite irurashii" to itta. Pauro ga, Iesu to fukkatsu to o, nobetsutaete itakara de atta.
Soko de, karera wa Pauro o Areopagosu no hyougisho ni tsurete itte, "Kimi no katatte iru atarashii oshie ga donna mono ka, shirasete moraemai ka.
Kimi ga nan da ka mezurashii koto o wareware ni kikasete iru no de, sore ga nan no koto na no ka shiritai to omou no da" to itta.
Ittai, Atenebito mo soko ni taizai shite iru gaikokujin mo mina, nani ka mimiatarashii koto o hanashi tari kii tari suru koto nomi ni, toki o sugoshite ita no de aru.
Soko de Pauro wa, Areopagosu no hyougisho no mannaka ni tatte itta. "Atene no hitotachi yo, anata gata wa, arayuru ten ni oite, sukoburu shuukyoukokoro ni tonde orareruto, watashi wa mite iru.
Jitsu wa, watashi ga michi o toorinagara, anata gata no ogamu iroiro na mono o, yoku mite iru uchi ni, 'Shirarenai kami ni' to kizamareta saidan mo aru no ni ki ga tsuita. Soko de, anata gata ga shirazu ni ogande iru mono o, ima shirasete ageyou.
Kono sekai to, sono naka ni aru banbutsu to o tsukutta kami wa, tenchi no Shu de aru no dakara, te de tsukutta miya nado ni wa osumi ni naranai.
Mata, nani ka fusoku de mo shite oru ka no you ni, hito no te ni yotte tsukaerareru hitsuyou mo nai. Kami wa, subete no hitobito ni inochi to iki to banbutsu to o atae,
Mata, hitori no hito kara, arayuru minzoku o tsukuriridashite, chi no zenmen ni sumawase, sorezore ni jidai o kubun shi, kokudo no kyoukai o sadamete kudasatta no de aru.
Kou shite, hitobito ga nesshin ni oimotomete sagashi sae sureba, kami o miidaseru you ni shite kudasatta. Jijitsu, kami wa wareware hitoribitori kara tooku hanarete oide ni naru no de wa nai.
Wareware wa kami no uchi ni iki, ugoki, sonzai shite irukara de aru. Anata gata no aru shijintachi mo itta you ni, 'Wareware mo, tashika ni sono shison de aru'.
Kono you ni, wareware wa kami no shison na no de arukara, kami taru mono o, ningen no gikou ya kuusou de kin ya gin ya ishi nado ni horitsuketa mono to onaji to, minasubekide wa nai.
Kami wa, kono you na muchi no jidai o, kore made wa misugoshi ni sarete itaga, ima wa doko ni oru hito de mo, mina kuiaratamenakereba naranai koto o meijite orareru.
Kami wa, gi o motte kono sekai o sabaku tame sono hi o sadame, oerabi ni natta kata ni yotte sore o nashitogeyou to sarete iru. Sunawachi, konokata o shinin no naka kara yomigaerase, sono kakushou o subete no hito ni shimesareta no de aru".
Shinin no yomigaeri no koto o kikuto, aru monotachi wa azawarai, mata aru monotachi wa, "Kono koto ni tsuite wa, izure mata kiku koto ni suru" to itta.
Kou shite, Pauro wa karera no naka kara dete itta.
Shikashi, kare ni shitagatte shinjita mono mo, ikunin ka atta. Sono naka ni wa, Areopagosu no saibannin Deonushio to Damarisu to iu onna, mata, sono ta no hitobito mo ita.
Sono nochi, Pauro wa Atene o satte Korinto e itta.
Soko de, Akura to iu Ponto umare no Yudayajin to, sono tsuma Purisukira to ni deatta. Kuraudeo tei ga, subete no Yudayajin o Rooma kara taikyo saseru you ni to, meirei shita tame, karera wa chikagoro Itariya kara dete kita no de aru.
Pauro wa karera no tokoro ni ittaga, tagai ni dougyou de atta no de, sono ie ni sumikonde, issho ni shigoto o shita. Tenmaku tsukuri ga sono shokugyou de atta.
Pauro wa ansokunichi goto ni kaidou de ronjite wa, Yudayajin ya Girishiyajin no settoku ni tsutometa.
Shirasu to Temote ga, Makedoniya kara kudatte kite kara wa, Pauro wa mikotoba o tsutaeru koto ni sennen shi, Iesu ga Kirisuto de aru koto o, Yudayajintachi ni chikarazuyoku akashi shita.
Shikashi, karera ga kore ni hankou shite nonoshiri tsuzuketa no de, Pauro wa jibun no uwagi o furiharatte, karera ni itta, "Anata gata no chi wa, anata gata jishin ni kaere. Watashi ni wa sekinin ga nai. Ima kara watashi wa ihoujin no hou ni iku".
Kou itte, kare wa soko o sari, teteo yusuto to iu kami o uyamau hito no ie ni itta. Sono ie wa kaidou to tonariatte ita.
Kaidouzukasa Kurisupo wa, sono kazoku ichidou to tomo ni Shu o shinjita. Mata ooku no Korintobito mo, Pauro no hanashi o kiite shinji, zokuzoku to baputesuma o uketa.
Suruto, aru yo, maboroshi no uchi ni Shu ga Pauro ni iwareta, "Osoreru na. Katari tsuzukeyo, damatte iru na.
Anata ni wa, watashi ga tsuite iru. Dare mo anata o osotte, kigai o kuwaeru you na koto wa nai. Kono machi ni wa, watashi no tami ga oozei iru".
Pauro wa ichi nen roku kagetsu no aida koko ni koshi o suete, kami no kotoba o karera no aida ni oshie tsuzuketa.
Tokoro ga, Gario ga Akaya no soutoku de atta toki, Yudayajintachi wa issho ni natte Pauro o osoi, kare o houtei ni hippatte itte uttaeta,
"Kono hito wa, rippou ni somuite kami o ogamu you ni, hitobito o sosonokashite imasu".
Pauro ga kuchi o hirakou to suruto, Gario wa Yudayajintachi ni itta, "Yudayajin shokun, nani ka fuhou koui to ka, akushitsu no hanzai to ka no koto nara, watashi wa touzen, shokun no uttae o toriage mo shiyouga,
Kore wa shokun no kotoba ya meishou ya rippou ni kansuru mondai na no dakara, shokun mizukara shimatsu suruga yokarou. Watashi wa sonna koto no saibannin ni wa naritaku nai".
Kou itte, karera o houtei kara oiharatta.
Soko de, minna no mono wa, kaidouzukasa Sosutene o hikitorae, houtei no mae de uchitataita. Gario wa sore ni taishite, soshiranu kao o shite ita.
Sate Pauro wa, nao ikunichi mo no aida taizai shita nochi, kyoudaitachi ni wakare o tsugete, Shiriya e muke shuppan shita. Purisukira to Akura mo doukou shita. Pauro wa, kanete kara, aru seigan o tatete ita no de, Kenkureya de atama o sotta.
Ikkou ga Epeso ni tsukuto, Pauro wa futari o soko ni nokoshite oki, jibun dake kaidou ni haitte, Yudayajintachi to ronjita.
Hitobito wa, Pauro ni motto nagai aida taizai suru you ni negattaga, kare wa kikiirenaide,
"Kami no mikokoro nara, mata anata gata no tokoro ni kaette koyou" to itte, wakare o tsuge, Epeso kara funade shita.
Sore kara, Kaizariya de jouriku shite Erusaremu ni nobori, kyoukai ni aisatsu shite kara, Anteoke ni kudatte itta.
Soko ni shibaraku ite kara, kare wa mata dekake, Garateya oyobi Furugiya no chihou o rekihou shite, subete no deshitachi o chikarazuketa.
Sate, Arekisanderiya umare de, seisho ni seitsuu shi, shikamo, yuuben na Aporo to iu Yudayajin ga, Epeso ni kita.
Kono hito wa Shu no michi ni tsuujite ori, mata, rei ni moete Iesu no koto o kuwashiku katat tari oshie tari shite itaga, tada Yohane no baputesuma shika shitte inakatta.
Kare wa kaidou de daitan ni katari hajimeta. Sore o Purisukira to Akura to ga kiite, kare o manekiire, sarani kuwashiku kami no michi o toki kikaseta.
Sore kara, Aporo ga Akaya ni wataritai to omotte ita no de, kyoudaitachi wa kare o hagemashi, senpou no deshitachi ni, kare o yoku mukaeru you ni to, tegami o kakiokutta. Kare wa touchaku shite, sudeni megumi ni yotte shinja ni natte ita hitotachi ni, ooini chikara ni natta.
Kare wa Iesu ga Kirisuto de aru koto o, seisho ni motozuite shimeshi, kouzen to, Yudayajintachi o hageshii gochou de ronpa shitakara de aru.
Aporo ga Korinto ni ita toki, Pauro wa okuchi o tootte Epeso ni kita. Soshite, aru deshitachi ni deatte,
Karera ni "Anata gata wa, shinkou ni haitta toki ni, seirei o uketa no ka" to tazuneta tokoro, "Iie, seirei naru mono ga aru koto sae, kiita koto ga arimasen" to kotaeta.
"De wa, dare no na ni yotte baputesuma o uketa no ka" to kare ga kikuto, karera wa "Yohane no na ni yoru baputesuma o ukemashita" to kotaeta.
Soko de, Pauro ga itta, "Yohane wa kuiaratame no baputesuma o sazuketaga, sore ni yotte, jibun no ato ni kuru kata, sunawachi, Iesu o shinjiru you ni, hitobito ni susumeta no de aru".
Hitobito wa kore o kiite, Shu Iesu no na ni yoru baputesuma o uketa.
Soshite, Pauro ga karera no ue ni te o okuto, seirei ga karera ni kudari, sore kara karera wa igen o katat tari, yogen o shi tari shi dashita.
Sono hitotachi wa minna de juu ninin hodo de atta.
Sore kara, Pauro wa kaidou ni haitte, san kagetsu no aida, daitan ni kami no kuni ni tsuite ronji, mata susume o shita.
Tokoro ga, aru hitotachi wa kokoro o katakuna ni shite, shinjiyou to sezu, kaishuu no mae de kono michi o ashizama ni itta no de, kare wa deshitachi o hikitsurete, sono hitotachi kara hanare, Tsurano no koudou de mainichi ronjita.
Sore ga ni nenkan mo tsuzuita no de, Ajiya ni sunde iru mono wa, Yudayajin mo Girishiyajin mo mina, Shu no kotoba o kiita.
Kami wa, Pauro no te ni yotte, ijou na chikara aru waza o tsugitsugi ni nasareta.
Tatoeba, hitobito ga, kare no mi ni tsukete iru tenugui ya maekake o totte byounin ni ateruto, sono byouki ga nozokare, akurei ga dete iku no de atta.
Soko de, Yudayajin no majinaishi de, henreki shite iru monotachi ga, akurei ni tsukarete iru mono ni mukatte, Shu Iesu no na o tonae, "Pauro no nobetsutaete iru Iesu ni yotte meijiru. Dete ike" to, tameshi ni itte mita.
Yudaya no saishichou Sukewa to iu mono no shichinin no musukotachi mo, sonna koto o shite ita.
Suruto akurei ga kore ni taishite itta, "Iesu nara jibun wa shitte iru. Pauro mo wakatte iru. Daga, omaetachi wa, ittai nanimono da".
Soshite, akurei ni tsukarete iru hito ga, karera ni tobikakari, minna o osaetsukete makashita no de, karera wa kizu o otta mama hadaka ni natte, sono ie o nigedashita.
Kono koto ga Epeso ni sumu subete no Yudayajin ya Girishiyajin ni shire watatte, minna kyoufu ni osoware, soshite, Shu Iesu no na ga agamerareta.
Mata shinja ni natta mono ga oozei kite, jibun no koui o uchiakete kokuhaku shita.
Sore kara, majutsu o okonatte ita ooku no mono ga, majutsu no hon o mochidashite kite wa, minna no mae de yakisuteta. Sono nedan o soukei shita tokoro, gin go man ni mo noboru koto ga wakatta.
Kono you ni shite, Shu no kotoba wa masumasu sakan ni hiromari, mata chikara o mashikuwaete itta.
Korera no koto ga atta nochi, Pauro wa mitama ni kanjite, Makedoniya, Akaya o tootte, Erusaremu e iku kesshin o shita. Soshite itta, "Watashi wa, soko ni itta nochi, zehi Rooma o mo minakereba naranai".
Soko de, jibun ni tsukaete iru mono no naka kara, Temote to Erasuto to no futari o, mazu Makedoniya ni okuridashi, Pauro jishin wa, nao shibaraku Ajiya ni todomatta.
Sono koro, kono michi ni tsuite youi naranu soudou ga okotta.
Sono ikisatsu wa, kou de aru. Demeterio to iu ginzaikunin ga, gin de Arutemisu shinden no mokei o tsukutte, shokunintachi ni sukunakaranu rieki o esasete ita.
Kono otoko ga sono shokunintachi ya, dourui no shigoto o shite ita monotachi o atsumete itta, "Shokun, wareware ga kono shigoto de, kanemouke o shite iru koto wa, goshouchi no toori da.
Shikaru ni, shokun no mikiki shite iru you ni, ano Pauro ga, te de tsukurareta mono wa kamisama de wa nai nado to itte, Epeso bakari ka, hotondo Ajiya zentai ni watatte, oozei no hitobito o tokitsukete ayamaraseta.
Kore de wa, otagai no shigoto ni akuhyou ga tatsu osore ga aru bakari ka, oomegami Arutemisu no miya mo karonjirare, hiiteha zenAjiya, iya zensekai ga ogande iru kono oomegami no goikou sae mo, kiete shimai sou de aru".
Kore o kikuto, hitobito wa ikari ni moe, oogoe de "Ooinaru ka na, Epesobito no Arutemisu" to sakebi tsuzuketa.
Soshite, machijuu ga daikonran ni ochiiri, hitobito wa Pauro no michizure de aru Makedoniyabito Gaio to Arisutaruko to o toraete, issei ni gekijou e nadarekonda.
Pauro wa gunshuu no naka ni haitte ikou to shitaga, deshitachi ga sore o sasenakatta.
Ajiya shuu no giin de, Pauro no yuujin de atta hitotachi mo, kare ni tsukai o yokoshite, gekijou ni haitte ikanai you ni to, shikiri ni tanonda.
Naka de wa, shuukai ga konran ni ochiitte shimatte, aru mono wa kono koto o, hoka no mono wa ano koto o, donari tsuzukete ita no de, daitasuu no mono wa, nan no tame ni atsumatta no ka mo, wakaranaide ita.
Soko de, Yudayajintachi ga, mae ni oshidashita Arekisanderu naru mono o, gunshuu no naka no aru hitotachi ga unagashita tame, kare wa te o futte, hitobito ni benmei o kokoromiyou to shita.
Tokoro ga, kare ga Yudayajin da to wakaruto, minna no mono ga issei ni "Ooinaru ka na, Epesobito no Arutemisu" to ni jikan bakari mo sakebi tsuzuketa.
Tsuini, shi no shoki yaku ga gunshuu o oshi shizumete itta, "Epeso no shokun, Epeso shi ga oomegami Arutemisu to, ama kudatta goshintai to no shugo yaku de aru koto o shiranai mono ga, hitori de mo irudarou ka.
Kore wa hitei no dekinai jijitsu de arukara, shokun wa yoroshiku shizuka ni shite irubekide, ranbou na koudou wa, issai shite wa naranai.
Shokun wa kono hitotachi o koko ni hippatte kitaga, karera wa miya o arasu mono de mo, wareware no megami o soshiru mono de mo nai.
Dakara, moshi Demeterionari sono shokunin nakama nariga, dare ka ni taishite uttae koto ga arunara, saiban no hi wa arushi, soutoku mo iru no dakara, sorezore uttaederu ga yoi.
Shikashi, nani ka motto youkyuu shitai koto ga areba, sore wa seishiki no gikai de kaiketsu shite moraubekida.
Kyou no jiken ni tsuite wa, kono sawagi o bengo dekiru you na riyuu ga mattaku nai no dakara, wareware wa chian o midasu tsumi ni towareru osore ga aru".
Kou itte, kare wa kono shuukai o kaisan saseta.
Sawagi ga yanda nochi, Pauro wa deshitachi o yobiatsumete gekirei o ataeta ue, wakare no aisatsu o nobe, Makedoniya e mukatte shuppatsu shita.
Soshite, sono chihou o toori, ooku no kotoba de hitobito o hagemashita nochi, Girishiya ni kita.
Kare wa soko de san kagetsu o sugoshita. Sore kara Shiriya e mukatte, funade shiyou to shite ita yasaki, kare ni taisuru Yudayajin no inbou ga okotta no de, Makedoniya o keiyu shite kaeru koto ni kesshita.
Puro no ko de aru Epesobito Sopatero, Tesaronikebito Arisutaruko to Sekundo, Derubebito Gaio, sore kara Temote, mata Ajiyabito Tekiko to Toropimo ga Pauro no doukousha de atta.
Kono hitotachi wa senpatsu shite, Toroasu de watashitachi o matte ita.
Watashitachi wa, jokousai ga owatta nochi ni, Piripi kara shuppan shi, go ka kakatte Toroasu ni touchaku shite, karera to ochiai, soko ni nanukakan taizai shita.
Shuu no hajime no hi ni, watashitachi ga pan o saku tame ni atsumatta toki, Pauro wa yokujitsu shuppatsu suru koto ni shite ita no de, shikiri ni hitobito to katariai, yonaka made katari tsuzuketa.
Watashitachi ga atsumatte ita okujou no ma ni wa, akari ga takusan tomoshite atta.
Yuteko to iu wakamono ga mado ni koshi o kakete ita tokoro, Pauro no hanashi ga naganaga to tsuzuku no de, hidoku nemuke ga sashite kite, toutou gussuri neitte shimai, san kai kara shita ni ochita. Idakiokoshite mitara, mou shinde ita.
Soko de Pauro wa orite kite, wakamono no ue ni mi o kagame, kare o idakiagete, "Sawagu koto wa nai. Mada inochi ga aru" to itta.
Soshite, mata agatte itte, pan o saite tabete kara, akegata made nagai aida hitobito to katariatte, tsuini shuppatsu shita.
Hitobito wa ikikaetta wakamono o tsurekaeri, hitokata narazu nagusamerareta.
Sate, watashitachi wa saki ni fune ni norikomi, Asosu e mukatte shuppan shita. Soko kara Pauro o fune ni nosete iku koto ni shite ita. Kare dake wa rikuro o toru koto ni kimete itakara de aru.
Pauro ga Asosu de, watashitachi to ochiatta toki, watashitachi wa kare o fune ni nosete Miterene ni itta.
Soko kara shuppan shite, yokujitsu Kiyosu no okiai ni i tari, tsugi no hi ni Samosu ni yori, sono yokujitsu Mireto ni tsuita.
Sore wa, Pauro ga Ajiya de jikan o torarenai tame, Epeso ni wa yoranaide zokkou suru koto ni kimete itakara de aru. Kare wa, dekireba Pentekosute no hi ni wa, Erusaremu ni tsuite itakatta no de, tabi o isoida wake de aru.
Soko de Pauro wa, Mireto kara Epeso ni tsukai o yatte, kyoukai no chouroutachi o yobiyoseta.
Soshite, kare no tokoro ni yoriatsumatte kita toki, karera ni itta. "Watashi ga, Ajiya no chi ni ashi o fumiireta saisho no hi irai, itsu mo anata gata to donna fuu ni sugoshite kita ka, yoku gozonjide aru.
Sunawachi, kenson no kagiri o tsukushi, namida o nagashi, Yudayajin no inbou ni yotte watashi no mi ni oyonda kazukazu no shiren no naka ni atte, Shu ni tsukaete kita.
Mata, anata gata no eki ni naru koto wa, koushuu no mae de mo, mata ieie de mo, subete amasu tokoro naku hanashite kikase, mata oshie,
Yudayajin ni mo Girishiyajin ni mo, kami ni taisuru kuiaratameto, watashitachi no Shu Iesu ni taisuru shinkou to o, tsuyoku susumete kita no de aru.
Ima ya, watashi wa mitama ni semararete Erusaremu e iku. Ano miyako de, donna koto ga watashi no mi ni furikakatte kuru ka, watashi ni wa wakaranai.
Tada, seirei ga itaru tokoro no machimachi de, watashi ni hakkiri tsugete iru no wa, tougoku to kannan to ga, watashi o machiukete iru to iu koto da.
Shikashi, watashi wa jibun no koutei o hashiri oe, Shu Iesu kara tamawatta, kami no megumi no fukuin o akashi suru ninmu o hatashi e sae shitara, kono inochi wa jibun ni totte, sukoshi mo oshii to wa omowanai.
Watashi wa ima shinjite iru, anata gata no aida o arukimawatte mikuni o nobetsutaeta kono watashi no kao o, minna ga kongo ni do to miru koto wa arumai.
Dakara, kyou, kono hi ni anata gata ni dangen shite oku. Watashi wa, subete no hito no chi ni tsuite, nanra sekinin ga nai.
Kami no mimune o mina amasu tokoro naku, anata gata ni tsutaete oitakara de aru.
Dou ka, anata gata jishin ni ki o tsuke, mata, subete no mure ni ki o kubatte itadakitai. Seirei wa, kami ga miko no chi de aganai torareta kami no kyoukai o boku saseru tame ni, anatagata o sono mure no kantokusha ni otate ni natta no de aru.
Watashi ga satta nochi, kyoubou na ookami ga, anata gata no naka ni hairikonde kite, yousha naku mure o arasu you ni naru koto o, watashi wa shitte iru.
Mata, anata gata jishin no naka kara mo, iroiro magatta koto o itte, deshitachi o jibun no hou ni, hippari komou to suru monora ga okorude arou.
Dakara, me o samashite i nasai. Soshite, watashi ga san nen no aida, yoru mo hiru mo namida o motte, anata gata hitoribitori o taezu satoshite kita koto o, wasurenaide hoshii.
Ima watashi wa, Shu to sono megumi no kotoba to ni, anatagata o yudaneru. Mikotoba ni wa, anata gata no toku o tate, seibetsu sareta subete no hitobito to tomo ni, mikuni o tsugaseru chikara ga aru.
Watashi wa, hito no kin ya gin ya ifuku o hoshigat ta koto wa nai.
Anata gata jishin ga shitte iru toori, watashi no kono ryoute wa, jibun no seikatsu no tame ni mo, mata issho ni ita hitotachi no tame ni mo, hataraite kita no da.
Watashi wa, anata gata mo kono you ni hataraite, yowai mono o tasukenakereba naranai koto, mata 'Ukeru yori wa ataeru hou ga, saiwai de aru' to iwareta Shu Iesu no kotoba o kioku shite irubeki koto o, banji ni tsuite oshieshimeshita no de aru".
Kou itte, Pauro wa ichidou to tomo ni hizamazuite inotta.
Minna no mono wa, hageshiku nakikanashimi, Pauro no kubi o idaite, ikudo mo seppun shi,
Mou ni do to jibun no kao o miru koto wa arumai to kare ga itta no de, tokuni kokoro o itameta. Sore kara kare o fune made miokutta.
Sate, watashitachi wa hitobito to wakarete funade shite kara, Kosu ni chokkou shi, tsugi no hi wa Rodosu ni, soko kara Patara ni tsuita.
Koko de Pinikeiki no fune o mitsuketa no de, sore ni norikonde shuppan shita.
Yagate Kupuro ga miete kitaga, sore o hidarite ni shite toorisugi, Shiriya e koukou o tsuzuke, Tsuro ni nyuukou shita. Koko de tsumini ga rikuage sareru koto ni natte itakara de aru.
Watashitachi wa, deshitachi o sagashidashite, soko ni nanukakan tomatta. Tokoro ga karera wa, mitama no shimeshi o ukete, Erusaremu ni wa nobotte ikanai you ni to, shikiri ni Pauro ni chuui shita.
Shikashi, taizai kikan ga owatta toki, watashitachi wa mata tabidatsu koto ni shita no de, minna no mono wa, tsuma ya kodomo o hikitsurete, machihazure made, watashitachi o miokuri ni kite kureta. Soko de, tomo ni kaigan ni hizamazuite inori,
Tagai ni wakare o tsugeta. Sore kara, watashitachi wa fune ni norikomi, karera wa sorezore jibun no ie ni kaetta.
Watashitachi wa, Tsuro kara no koukou o owatte Toremai ni tsuki, soko no kyoudaitachi ni aisatsu o shi, karera no tokoro ni ichi nichi taizai shita.
Yokujitsu soko o tatte, Kaizariya ni tsuki, kano nananin no hitori de aru dendousha Piripo no ie ni iki, soko ni tomatta.
Kono hito ni yonnin no musume ga attaga, izure mo shojo de atte, yogen o shite ita.
Ikunichi ka taizai shite iru aida ni, Agabo to iu yogensha ga Yudaya kara kudatte kita.
Soshite, watashitachi no tokoro ni kite, Pauro no obi o tori, sore de jibun no teashi o shibatte itta, "Seirei ga kou otsuge ni natte iru, 'Kono obi no mochinushi o, Yudayajintachi ga Erusaremu de kono you ni shibatte, ihoujin no te ni watasude arou' ".
Watashitachi wa kore o kiite, tochi no hitotachi to issho ni natte, Erusaremu ni wa nobotte ikanai you ni to, Pauro ni negai tsuzuketa.
Sono toki Pauro wa kotaeta, "Anata gata wa, nai tari, watashi no kokoro o kujii tari shite, ittai, dou shiyou to suru no ka. Watashi wa, Shu Iesu no na no tame nara, Erusaremu de shibarareru dake de naku, shinu koto o mo kakugo shite iru no da".
Kou shite, Pauro ga kankoku o kikiirete kurenai no de, watashitachi wa "Shu no mikokoro ga okonawaremasu you ni" to itta dake de, sore ijou, nani mo iwanakatta.
Suujitsugo, watashitachi wa ryosou o totonoete Erusaremu e nobotte itta.
Kaizariya no deshitachi mo suunin, watashitachi to doukou shite, furuku kara no deshi de aru Kupurobito manason no ie ni annai shite kureta. Watashitachi wa sono ie ni tomaru koto ni natte ita no de aru.
Watashitachi ga Erusaremu ni touchaku suruto, kyoudaitachi wa yorokonde mukaete kureta.
Yokujitsu Pauro wa watashitachi o tsurete, Yakobu o houmon shi ni itta. Soko ni chouroutachi ga mina atsumatte ita.
Pauro wa karera ni aisatsu o shita nochi, kami ga jibun no hataraki o tooshite, ihoujin no aida ni nasatta kotodomo o ichiichi setsumei shita.
Ichidou wa kore o kiite kami o hometatae, soshite kare ni itta, "Kyoudai yo, goshouchi no you ni, Yudayajin no naka de shinja ni natta mono ga, suuman ni mo nobotte iruga, minna rippou ni nesshin na hitotachi de aru.
Tokoro ga, karera ga tsutaekiite iru tokoro ni yoreba, anata wa ihoujin no naka ni iru Yudayajin ichidou ni taishite, kodomo ni katsurei o hodokosu na, mata Yudaya no kanrei ni shitagau na to itte, Moose ni somuku koto o oshiete iru, to iu koto de aru.
Dou shitara yoi ka. Anata ga koko ni kite iru koto wa, karera mo kitto kikikomu ni chigai nai.
Tsuite wa, ima watashitachi ga iu toori no koto o shi nasai. Watashitachi no naka ni, seigan o tatete iru mono ga yonnin iru.
Kono hitotachi o tsurete itte, karera to tomo ni kiyome o okonai, mata karera no atama o soru hiyou o hikiukete yari nasai. Sou sureba, anata ni tsuite, uwasa sarete iru koto wa, ne mo ha mo nai koto de, anata wa rippou o mamotte, tadashii seikatsu o shite iru koto ga, minna ni wakarude arou.
Ihoujin de shinja ni natta hitotachi ni wa, sudeni tegami de, guuzou ni sonaeta mono to, chi to, shimekoroshita mono to, fuhinkou to o, tsutsushimu you ni to no ketsugi ga, watashitachi kara shirasete aru".
Soko de Pauro wa, sono tsugi no hi ni yonnin no mono o tsurete, karera to tomo ni kiyome o ukete kara miya ni haitta. Soshite kiyome no kikan ga owatte, hitoribitori no tame ni sonaemono o sasageru toki o houkoku shite oita.
Nanuka no kikan ga owarou to shite ita toki, Ajiya kara kita Yudayajintachi ga, miya no uchi de Pauro o mikakete, gunshuu zentai o sendou shi hajime, Pauro ni te o kakete sakebitateta,
"Isuraeru no hitobito yo, kasei ni kite kure. Kono hito wa, itaru tokoro de tami to rippou to kono basho ni somuku koto o, minna ni oshiete iru. Sono ue ni, Girishiyajin o miya no uchi ni tsurekonde, kono shinsei na basho o kegashita no da".
Karera wa, mae ni Epesobito Toropimo ga, Pauro to issho ni machi o aruite ita no o mikakete, sono hito o Pauro ga miya no uchi ni tsurekonda no da to omotta no de aru.
Soko de, shi zentai ga sawagi dashi, minshuu ga kakeatsumatte kite, Pauro o torae, miya no soto ni hikizuri dashita. Soshite, sugu sono ato ni miya no mon ga tozasareta.
Karera ga Pauro o korosou to shite ita toki ni, Erusaremu zentai ga konran joutai ni ochiitte iru to no jouhou ga, shubitai no sensotsuchou ni todoita.
Soko de, kare wa sassoku, heisotsu ya hyakusotsuchou tachi o hikiite, sono ba ni kaketsuketa. Hitobito wa sensotsuchou ya heisotsutachi o mite, Pauro o uchitataku no o yameta.
Sensotsuchou wa chikayotte kite Pauro o torae, kare o nijuu no kusari de shibatte oku you ni meijita ue, Pauro wa nanimono ka, mata nani o shita no ka, to tazuneta.
Shikashi, gunshuu ga sorezore chigatta koto o sakebi tsuzukeru tame, sawagashikute, tashika na koto ga wakaranai no de, kare wa Pauro o heiei ni tsurete iku you ni meijita.
Pauro ga kaidan ni sashikakatta toki ni wa, gunshuu no boukou o sakeru tame, heisotsutachi ni katsugarete iku to iu shimatsu de atta.
Oozei no minshuu ga "Are o yattsukete shimae" to sakebinagara, tsuite kitakara de aru.
Pauro ga heiei no naka ni tsurete ikareyou to shita toki, sensotsuchou ni, "Hitokoto anata ni ohanashite mo yoroshii desu ka" to tazuneruto, sensotsuchou ga itta, "Omae wa Girishiya go ga hanaseru no ka.
De wa, moshi ka omae wa, sakigoro hanran o okoshita nochi, yonsennin no shikaku o hikitsurete arano e nigete itta ano Ejiputojin de wa nai no ka".
Pauro wa kotaeta, "Watashi wa Taruso umare no Yudayajin de, Kirikiya no rekki to shita toshi no shimin desu. Onegai desuga, minshuu ni hanashi o sasete kudasai".
Sensotsuchou ga yurushite kureta no de, Pauro wa kaidan no ue ni tachi, minshuu ni mukatte te o futta. Suruto, ichidou ga sukkari seishuku ni natta no de, Pauro wa Heburu go de hanashi dashita.
"Kyoudaitachi, chichitachi yo, ima moushiageru watashi no benmei o kiite itadakitai".
Pauro ga, Heburu go de kou katarikakeru no o kiite, hitobito wa masumasu seishuku ni natta.
Soko de kare wa kotoba o tsuide itta, "Watashi wa Kirikiya no Taruso de umareta Yudayajin de aruga, kono miyako de sodaterare, Gamarieru no hizamoto de senzo denrai no rippou ni tsuite, kibishii kuntou o uke, kyou no minasan to onajiku kami ni taishite nesshin na mono de atta.
Soshite, kono michi o hakugai shi, otoko de are onna de are, shibariagete goku ni touji, karera o shi ni itaraseta.
Kono koto wa, daisaishi mo chouroutachi ichidou mo, shoumei suru tokoro de aru. Sarani watashi wa, kono hitotachi kara Damasuko no doushitachi e ateta tegami o moratte, sono chi ni iru monotachi o shibariage, Erusaremu ni hippatte kite, shobatsu suru tame, dekakete itta.
Tabi o tsuzukete Damasuko no chikaku ni kita toki ni, mahirugoro, totsuzen, tsuyoi hikari ga ten kara watashi o meguri tera shita.
Watashi wa chi ni taoreta. Soshite, 'Sauro, Sauro, naze watashi o hakugai suru no ka' to, yobikakeru koe o kiita.
Kore ni taishite watashi wa, 'Shu yo, anata wa donata desu ka' to itta. Suruto, sono koe ga, 'Watashi wa, anata ga hakugai shite iru Nazarebito Iesu de aru' to kotaeta.
Watashi to issho ni ita monotachi wa, sono hikari wa mitaga, watashi ni katarikaketa kata no koe wa kikanakatta.
Watashi ga 'Shu yo, watashi wa nani o shitara yoideshou ka' to tazuneta tokoro, Shu wa iwareta, 'Okiagatte Damasuko ni iki nasai. Sou sureba, anata ga suru you ni kimete aru koto ga, subete soko de tsugerarerude arou'.
Watashi wa, hikari no kagayaki de me ga kurami, nani mo mienaku natte ita no de, tsure no monotachi ni te o hikarenagara, Damasuko ni itta.
Suruto, rippou ni chuujitsu de, Damasuko zaijuu no Yudayajin zentai ni hyouban no yoi Ananiya to iu hito ga,
Watashi no tokoro ni kite, soba ni tachi, 'Kyoudai Sauro yo, mieru you ni nari nasai' to itta. Suruto sono shunkan ni, watashi no me ga hiraite, kare no sugata ga mieta.
Kare wa itta, 'Watashitachi no senzo no kami ga, anata o erande mimune o shirase, kano gijin o misase, sono kuchi kara koe o okikase ni natta.
Sore wa anata ga, sono mikiki shita koto ni tsuki, subete no hito ni taishite, kare no shounin ni naru tame de aru.
Soko de ima, nan no tamerau koto ga arou ka. Sugu tatte, mina o tonaete baputesuma o uke, anata no tsumi o araiotoshi nasai'.
Sore kara watashi wa, Erusaremu ni kaette miya de inotte iru uchi ni, yumeutsutsu ni nari,
Shu ni mamietaga, Shu wa iwareta, 'Isoide, sugu ni Erusaremu o dete iki nasai. Watashi ni tsuite no anata no akashi o, hitobito ga ukeirenaikara'.
Soko de, watashi ga itta, 'Shu yo, karera wa, watashi ga itaru tokoro no kaidou de, anata o shinjiru hitobito o goku ni touji tari, muchiut tari shite ita koto o, shitte imasu.
Mata, anata no shounin Sutepano no chi ga nagasareta toki mo, watashi wa tachiatte ite sore ni sansei shi, mata kare o koroshita hitotachi no uwagi no ban o shite ita no desu'.
Suruto, Shu ga watashi ni iwareta, 'Iki nasai. Watashi ga, anata o tooku ihou no tami e tsukawasu no da' ".
Kare no kotoba o koko made kiite ita hitobito wa, kono toki, koe o hariagete itta, "Konna otoko wa chijou kara torinozoite shimae. Ikashi okubekide wa nai".
Hitobito ga kou wamekitatete, kuuchuu ni uwagi o nage, chiri o makichirasu shimatsu de atta no de,
Sensotsuchou wa Pauro o heiei ni hikiireru you ni meiji, dou iu wake de, kare ni taishite konna ni wamekitatete iru no ka o tashikameru tame, kare o muchi no goumon ni kakete, torishiraberu you ni iiwatashita.
Karera ga muchi o ateru tame, kare o shibaritsukete ita toki, Pauro wa soba ni tatte iru hyakusotsuchou ni itta, "Rooma no shimin taru mono o, saiban ni kake mo shinaide, muchiutte yoi no ka".
Hyakusotsuchou wa kore o kiki, sensotsuchou no tokoro ni itte houkoku shi, soshite itta, "Dou nasaimasu ka. Ano hito wa Rooma no shimin na no desu".
Soko de, sensotsuchou ga Pauro no tokoro ni kite itta, "Watashi ni itte kure. Anata wa Rooma no shimin na no ka". Pauro wa "Sou desu" to itta.
Kore ni taishite sensotsuchou ga itta, "Watashi wa kono shiminken o, tagaku no kane de kaitotta no da". Suru to Pauro wa itta, "Watashi wa umarenagara no shimin desu".
Soko de, Pauro o torishirabeyou to shite ita hitotachi wa, tadachini kare kara mi o hiita. Sensotsuchou mo, Pauro ga Rooma no shimin de aru koto, mata, sou iu hito o shibatte ita koto ga wakatte, osoreta.
Yokujitsu, kare wa, Yudayajin ga naze Pauro o uttaedeta no ka, sono shinsou o shirou to omotte kare o toite yari, douji ni saishichou tachi to zengikai to o shoushuu sase, soko ni kare o hikidashite, karera no mae ni tataseta.
Pauro wa gikai o mitsumete itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, watashi wa kyou made, kami no mae ni, hitasura akiraka na ryoushin ni shitagatte koudou shite kita".
Suruto, daisaishi Ananiya ga, Pauro no soba ni tatte iru monotachi ni, kare no kuchi o ute to meijita.
Sono toki, Pauro wa Ananiya ni mukatte itta, "Shiroku nurareta kabe yo, kami ga anata o utsude arou. Anata wa, rippou ni shitagatte, watashi o sabaku tame ni za ni tsuite iru no ni, rippou ni somuite, watashi o utsu koto o meijiru no ka".
Suruto, soba ni tatte iru monotachi ga itta, "Kami no daisaishi ni taishite burei na koto o iu no ka".
Pauro wa itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, kare ga daisaishi da to wa shiranakatta. Seisho ni 'Tami no kashira o waruku itte wa ikenai' to, kaite aru no datta".
Pauro wa, giin no ichibu ga Sadokaibito de ari, ichibu wa Parisaibito de aru no o mite, gikai no naka de koe o takamete itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, watashi wa Parisaibito de ari, Parisaibito no ko de aru. Watashi wa, shinin no fukkatsu no nozomi o idaite iru koto de, saiban o ukete iru no de aru".
Kare ga kou itta tokoro, Parisaibito to Sadokaibito to no aida ni souron ga shouji, kaishuu ga aiwakareta.
Ganrai, Sadokaibito wa, fukkatsu to ka tenshi to ka rei to ka wa, issai sonzai shinai to ii, Parisaibito wa, sorera wa, mina sonzai suru to shuchou shite iru.
Soko de, oosawagi to natta. Parisaiha no aru rippougakusha tachi ga tatte, tsuyoku shuchou shite itta, "Wareware wa, kono hito ni wa nani mo warui koto ga nai to omou. Aruiha, rei ka tenshi ka ga, kare ni tsugeta no ka mo shirenai".
Kou shite, souron ga hageshiku natta no de, sensotsuchou wa, Pauro ga karera ni hikisakareru no o kizukatte, heisotsudomo ni, orite itte Pauro o karera no naka kara chikara zukude hikidashi, heiei ni tsurete kuru you ni, meijita.
Sono yo, Shu ga Pauro ni nozonde iwareta, "Shikkari seyo. Anata wa, Erusaremu de watashi no koto o akashi shita you ni, Rooma de mo akashi o shinakute wa naranai".
Yo ga akeruto, Yudayajinra wa moushiawase o shite, Pauro o korosu made wa inshoku o issai tatsuto, chikaiatta.
Kono inbou ni kuwawatta mono wa, yonjuunin amari de atta.
Karera wa, saishichou tachi ya chouroutachi no tokoro ni itte, kou itta. "Wareware wa, Pauro o korosu made wa nani mo tabenaito, kataku chikaiaimashita.
Tsuite wa, anata gata wa gikai to kunde, kare no koto de nao kuwashiku torishirabe o suru you ni misekake, Pauro o anata gata no tokoro ni tsuredasu you ni, sensotsuchou ni tanonde kudasai. Wareware to shite wa, Pauro ga soko ni konai uchi ni koroshite shimau tehazu o shite imasu".
Tokoro ga, Pauro no shimai no ko ga, kono machibuse no koto o mimi ni shi, heiei ni haitte itte, Pauro ni sore o shiraseta.
Soko de Pauro wa, hyakusotsuchou no hitori o yonde itta, "Kono wakamono o sensotsuchou no tokoro ni tsurete itte kudasai. Nani ka houkoku suru koto ga aru you desukara".
Kono hyakusotsuchou wa wakamono o tsurete iki, sensotsuchou ni hikiawasete itta, "Shuujin no Pauro ga, kono wakamono ga anata ni hanashitai koto ga aru no de, anata no tokoro ni tsurete itte kureru you ni to, watashi o yonde tanomimashita".
Soko de sensotsuchou wa, wakamono no te o tori, hito no inai tokoro e tsurete itte tazuneta, "Watashi ni hanashitai koto to iu no wa, nani ka".
Wakamono ga itta, "Yudayajintachi ga, Pauro no koto o motto kuwashiku torishirabe o suru to misekakete, asu gikai ni kare o tsuredasu you ni, anata ni tanomu koto ni kimete imasu.
Douzo, karera no tanomi o toriagenaide kudasai. Yonjuunin amari no mono ga, Pauro o machibuse shite iru no desu. Karera wa, Pauro o korosu made wa inshoku o issai tatsuto, kataku chikaiatte imasu. Soshite, ima tehazu o totonoete, anata no kyoka o matte iru tokoro na no desu".
Soko de sensotsuchou wa, "Kono koto o watashi ni shiraseta koto wa, dare ni mo kougai suru na" to meijite, wakamono o kaeshita.
Sore kara kare wa, hyakusotsuchou futari o yonde itta, "Hohei nihyaku mei, kihei nanajuu mei, sou hei nihyaku mei o, Kaizariya ni muke shuppatsu dekiru you ni, kon'ya kyuu ji made ni youi seyo.
Mata, Pauro o noseru tame ni uma o youi shite, kare o soutoku Perikusu no moto e buji ni tsurete ike".
Sarani kare wa, tsugi no you na bunmen no tegami o kaita.
"Kuraudeo rushiya, tsutsushinde soutoku Perikusu kakka no heian o inorimasu.
Honnin no Pauro ga, Yudayajinra ni toraerare, masani korosareyou to shite ita no o, kare no Rooma shimin de aru koto o shitta no de, watashi wa heisotsutachi o hikiite itte, kare o sukuidashimashita.
Sore kara, kare ga uttaerareta riyuu o shirou to omoi, kare o gikai ni tsurete ikimashita.
Tokoro ga, kare wa Yudayajin no rippou no mondai de uttaerareta mono de ari, nanra shikei mata wa tougoku ni ataru tsumi no nai koto ga wakarimashita.
Shikashi, kono hito ni taishite inbou ga megurasarete iru to no houkoku ga arimashita no de, watashi wa toriaezu, kare o kakka no moto ni ookuri suru koto ni shi, uttaeru monotachi ni wa, kakka no mae de, kare ni taisuru moushitate o suru you ni to, meijite okimashita".
Soko de hoheitachi wa, meijirareta toori Pauro o hikitotte, yoru no aida ni Antepatorisu made tsurete iki,
Yokujitsu wa, kiheitachi ni Pauro o gosou saseru koto ni shite, heiei ni kaette itta.
Kiheitachi wa, Kaizariya ni tsukuto, tegami o soutoku ni tewatashi, sarani Pauro o kare ni hikiawaseta.
Soutoku wa tegami o yonde kara, Pauro ni, dono shuu no mono ka to tazune, Kirikiya no de da to shitte,
"Uttae hitotachi ga kita toki ni, omae o shiraberu koto ni suru" to itta. Soshite, Herode no kantei ni kare o mamotte oku you ni meijita.
Itsuka no nochi, daisaishi Ananiya wa, chourou suumei to, Terutoro to iu bengonin to o tsurete kudari, soutoku ni Pauro o uttaedeta.
Pauro ga yobidasareta no de, Terutoro wa ronkoku o hajimeta. "Perikusu kakka, watashitachi ga, kakka no okage de juubun ni heiwa o tanoshimi, mata kono kuni ga, gohairyo ni yotte,
Arayuru houmen ni, mata itaru tokoro de kaizen sarete iru koto wa, watashitachi no kansha shite yamanai tokoro de arimasu.
Shikashi, gomeiwaku o kakenai you ni, kudokudo to nobezu ni, temijikaka ni moushiagemasukara, douzo, shinonde okikitori no hodo, onegai itashimasu.
Sate, kono otoko wa, ekibyou no you na ningen de, sekaijuu no subete no Yudayajin no naka ni sawagi o okoshite iru mono de ari, mata, Nazarebitora no itan no kashira de arimasu.
Kono mono ga miya made mo kegasou to shite ita no de, watashitachi wa kare o hobaku shita no desu. [soshite, rippou ni shitagatte, sabakou to shite ita tokoro,]
Sensotsuchou Rushiya ga kanshou shite, kare o muri ni watashitachi no te kara hikihanashite shimai,
Kare o uttaeta hitotachi ni wa, kakka no tokoro ni kuru you ni to meijimashita.] Sore de, kakka gojishin de oshirabe ni nareba, watashitachi ga kare o uttaedeta riyuu ga, zenbu owakari ni narudeshou".
Yudayajintachi mo, kono uttae ni douchou shite, mattaku sono toori da to itta.
Soko de, soutoku ga aizu o shite hatsugen o unagashita no de, Pauro wa touben shite itta. "Kakka ga, tanen ni watari, kono kokumin no saiban o tsukasadotte orareru koto o, yoku shouchi shite imasu no de, watashi wa yorokonde, jibun no koto o benmei itashimasu.
Oshirabe ni nareba wakaru hazu desuga, watashi ga reihai o shi ni Erusaremu ni nobotte kara, mada juu ni nichi sokosoko ni shika narimasen.
Soshite, miya no uchi de mo, kaidouuchi de mo, aruiha shinai de mo, watashi ga dare ka to souron shi tari, gunshuu o sendou shi tari suru no o mita mono wa arimasenshi,
Ima watashi o uttaedete iru koto ni tsuite, kakka no mae ni, sono shouko o age uru mono wa arimasen.
Tada, watashi wa kono koto wa mitomemasu. Watashi wa, karera ga itan da to shite iru michi ni shitagatte, watashitachi no senzo no kami ni tsukae, rippou no oshieru tokoro, mata yogensha no sho ni kaite aru koto o, kotogotoku shinji,
Mata, tadashii mono mo tadashiku nai mono mo, yagate yomigaeru to no kibou o, kami o aoide idaite iru mono desu. Kono kibou wa, karera jishin mo motte iru no desu.
Watashi wa mata, kami ni taishi mata hito ni taishite, ryoushin ni semerareru koto no nai you ni, tsune ni tsutomete imasu.
Sate watashi wa, ikunen buri ka ni kaette kite, douhou ni hodokoshi o shi, mata, sonaemono o shite imashita.
Sono toki, karera wa watashi ga miya deki yome o okonatte iru no o mita dake de atte, gunshuu mo izu, soudou mo nakatta no desu.
Tokoro ga, Ajiya kara kita suunin no Yudayajin ga - - karera ga, watashi ni taishite, nani ka togametate o suru koto ga attanara, yoroshiku kakka no mae ni kite, uttaerubekideshita.
Aruiha, nani ka watashi ni fusei na koto ga attanara, watashi ga gikai no mae ni tatte ita toki, karera mizukara, sore o shiteki subekideshita.
Tada, watashi wa, karera no naka ni tatte, 'Watashi wa, shinin no yomigaeri no koto de, kyou, anata gata no mae de sabaki o ukete iru no da' to sakenda dake no koto desu".
Koko de Perikusu wa, kono michi no koto o soutou wakimaete ita no de, "Sensotsuchou Rushiya ga kudatte kuru no o matte, omaetachi no jiken o hanketsu suru koto ni suru" to itte, saiban o enki shita.
Soshite hyakusotsuchou ni, Pauro o kankin suru you ni, shikashi kare o kandai ni toriatsukai, yuujinra ga sewa o suru no o tomenai you ni to, meijita.
Suujitsu tatte kara, Perikusu wa, Yudayajin de aru tsuma Dorushira to issho ni kite, Pauro o yobidashi, Kirisuto Iesu ni taisuru shinkou no koto o, kare kara kiita.
Soko de, Pauro ga, seigi, sessei, mirai no shinpan nado ni tsuite ronjite iruto, Perikusu wa fuan o kanjite kite, itta, "Kyou wa kore de kaeru ga yoi. Mata, yoi kikai o etara, yobidasu koto ni suru".
Kare wa, sore to douji ni, Pauro kara kane o moraitai shita gokoro ga atta no de, tabitabi Pauro o yobidashite wa katariatta.
Sate, ni kanen tatta toki, porukio fesuto ga, Perikusu to koutai shite nin ni tsuita. Perikusu wa, Yudayajin no kanshin o kaou to omotte, Pauro o kankin shita mama ni shite oita.
Sate, Fesuto wa, ninchi ni tsuite kara mikka no nochi, Kaizariya kara Erusaremu ni nobotta tokoro,
Saishichou tachi ya Yudayajin no omodatta monotachi ga, Pauro o uttaedete,
Kare o Erusaremu ni yobidasu you torihakaratte itadakitai to, shikiri ni negatta. Karera wa tochuu de machibuse shite, kare o korosu kangae de atta.
Tokoro ga Fesuto wa, Pauro ga Kaizariya ni kankin shite ari, jibun mo sugu soko e kaeru koto ni natte iru to kotae,
Soshite itta, "De wa, moshi ano otoko ni nani ka futsugou na koto ga arunara, omaetachi no uchi no yuuryokushara ga, watashi to issho ni kudatte itte, uttaeruga yokarou".
Fesuto wa, karera no aida ni youka ka tooka hodo taizai shita nochi, Kaizariya ni kudatte iki, sono yokujitsu, saiban no seki ni tsuite, Pauro o hikidasu you ni meijita.
Pauro ga sugata o arawasuto, Erusaremu kara kudatte kita Yudayajintachi ga, kare o torikakomi, kare ni taishite samazama no omoi zaijou o moushitatetaga, izure mo sono shouko o ageru koto wa dekinakatta.
Pauro wa "Watashi wa, Yudayajin no rippou ni taishite mo, miya ni taishite mo, mata Kaizaru ni taishite mo, nanra tsumi o okashita koto wa nai" to benmei shita.
Tokoro ga, Fesuto wa Yudayajin no kanshin o kaou to omotte, Pauro ni mukatte itta, "Omae wa Erusaremu ni nobori, kono jiken ni kanshi, watashi kara soko de saiban o ukeru koto o shouchi suru ka".
Pauro wa itta, "Watashi wa ima, Kaizaru no houtei ni tatte imasu. Watashi wa kono houtei de saiban sarerubeki desu. Yoku goshouchi no toori, watashi wa Yudayajintachi ni, nani mo warui koto o shite wa imasen.
Moshi watashi ga warui koto o shi, shi ni ataru you na koto o shite iru no nara, shi o manukareyou to wa shimasen. Shikashi, moshi karera no uttaeru koto ni, nan no konkyo mo nai to sureba, dare mo watashi o karera ni hikiwatasu kenri wa arimasen. Watashi wa Kaizaru ni jouso shimasu".
Soko de Fesuto wa, baiseki no monotachi to kyougi shita ue kotaeta, "Omae wa Kaizaru ni jouso o moushideta. Kaizaru no tokoro ni iku ga yoi".
Suujitsu tatta nochi, Agurippa ou to Berunike to ga, Fesuto ni keii o hyousuru tame, Kaizariya ni kita.
Futari wa, soko ni nani nichikan mo taizai shite ita no de, Fesuto wa, Pauro no koto o ou ni hanashite itta, "Koko ni, Perikusu ga shuujin to shite nokoshite itta hitori no otoko ga iru.
Watashi ga Erusaremu ni itta toki, kono otoko no koto o, saishichou tachi ya Yudayajin no chouroutachi ga, watashi ni houkoku shi, kare o tsumi ni sadameru you ni to youkyuu shita.
Soko de watashi wa, karera ni kotaeta, 'Uttaerareta mono ga, uttaeta mono no mae ni tatte, kokuso ni taishi benmei suru kikai o ataerarenai mae ni, sono hito o mihanashite shimau no wa, Roomajin no kanrei ni wa nai koto de aru'.
Sore de, karera ga koko ni atsumatte kita toki, watashi wa toki o utsusazu, tsugi no hi ni saiban no seki ni tsuite, sono otoko o hikidasaseta.
Uttaeta monotachi wa tachiagattaga, watashi ga suisoku shite ita you na akuji wa, kare ni tsuite nanihito tsu moushitate wa shinakatta.
Tada, kare to arasoiatte iru no wa, karera jishin no shuukyou ni kanshi, mata, shinde shimatta no ni ikite iru to Pauro ga shuchou shite iru Iesu naru mono ni kansuru mondai ni suginai.
Korera no mondai o, dou toriatsukatte yoi ka wakaranakatta no de, watashi wa kare ni, 'Erusaremu ni itte, korera no mondai ni tsuite, soko de sabaite moraitaku wa nai ka' to tazunete mita.
Tokoro ga Pauro wa, koutei no hanketsu o ukeru toki made, kono mama jibun o todomete oite hoshii to iu no de, Kaizaru ni kare o okuritodokeru toki made todomete oku you ni to, meijite oita".
Soko de, Agurippa ga Fesuto ni "Watashi mo, sono hito no iibun o kiite mitai" to itta no de, Fesuto wa, "De wa, asu kare kara kikitoru you ni shite ageyou" to kotaeta.
Yokujitsu, Agurippa to Berunike to wa, ooini igi o totonoete, sensotsuchou tachi ya shi no omodatta hitotachi to tomo ni, inkenjo ni haitte kita. Suruto, Fesuto no mei ni yotte, Pauro ga soko ni hikidasareta.
Soko de, Fesuto ga itta, "Agurippa ou, narabi ni gorinseki no shokun. Goran ni natte iru kono jinbutsu wa, Yudayajintachi ga kozotte, Erusaremu ni oite mo, mata, kono chi ni oite mo, kore ijou, ikashite okubekide nai to sakende, watashi ni uttaedete iru mono de aru.
Shikashi, kare wa shi ni ataru koto wa nani mo shite inaito, watashi wa mite iru no daga, kare jishin ga koutei ni jouso suru to ii dashita no de, kare o sochira e okuru koto ni kimeta.
Tokoro ga, kare ni tsuite, shukun ni kakiokuru tashika na mono ga nani mo nai no de, watashi wa, kare o shokun no mae ni, tokuni, Agurippa ou yo, anata no mae ni hikidashite, torishirabe o shita nochi, jousho subeki zairyou o eyou to omou.
Shuujin o okuru no ni, sono kokuso no riyuu o shimesanai to iu koto wa, fugouri da to omoerukara de aru".
Agurippa wa Pauro ni, "Omae jishin no koto o hanashite mo yoi" to itta. Soko de Pauro wa, te o sashinobete, benmei o shi hajimeta.
"Agurippa ou yo, Yudayajintachi kara uttaerarete iru subete no koto ni kanshite, kyou, anata no mae de benmei suru koto ni natta no wa, watashi no shiawase ni omou tokoro de arimasu.
Anata wa, Yudayajin no arayuru kanrei ya mondai o, yoku shiri nuite orareru kata desukara, watashi no mousu koto o, kandai na okokoro de kiite itadakitai no desu.
Sate, watashi wa wakai jidai ni wa, hajime kara jikokumin no naka de, mata Erusaremu de sugoshita no desuga, sono koro no watashi no seikatsuburi wa, Yudayajin ga minna yoku shitte iru tokoro desu.
Karera wa watashi o hajime kara shitte iru no de, shougen shiyou to omoeba dekiru no desuga, watashi wa, watashitachi no shuukyou no mottomo genkaku na ha ni shitagatte, Parisaibito to shite no seikatsu o shite ita no desu.
Ima watashi wa, kami ga watashitachi no senzo ni yakusoku nasatta kibou o idaite iru tame ni, saiban o ukete iru no de arimasu.
Watashitachi no juu ni no buzoku wa, yoruhiru, nesshin ni kami ni tsukaete, sono yakusoku o eyou to nozonde iru no desu. Ou yo, kono kibou no tame ni, watashi wa Yudayajin kara uttaerarete imasu.
Kami ga shinin o yomigaeraseru to iu koto ga, anata gata ni wa, dou shite shinjirarenai koto to omoeru no deshou ka.
Watashi jishin mo, izen ni wa, Nazarebito Iesu no na ni sakaratte hantai no koudou o subekidato, omotte imashita.
Soshite watashi wa, sore o Erusaremu de kankou shi, saishichou tachi kara kengen o ataerarete, ooku no seitotachi o goku ni tojikome, karera ga korosareru toki ni wa, sore ni sansei no i o arawashimashita.
Sore kara, itaru tokoro no kaidou de, shibashiba karera o basshite, muriyari ni kami o kegasu kotoba o iwaseyou to shi, karera ni taishite hidoku arekurui, tsuini gaikoku no machimachi ni made, hakugai no te o nobasu ni itarimashita.
Kou shite, watashi wa, saishichou tachi kara kengen to inin to o ukete, Damasuko ni itta no desuga,
Ou yo, sono tochuu, mahiru ni, hikari ga ten kara sashite kuru no o mimashita. Sore wa, taiyou yori mo, motto hikarikagayaite, watashi to doukousha tachi to o meguri tera shimashita.
Watashitachi wa mina chi ni taoremashitaga, sono toki Heburu go de watashi ni kou yobikakeru koe o kikimashita, 'Sauro, Sauro, naze watashi o hakugai suru no ka. Toge no aru muchi o kereba, kizu o ou dake de aru'.
Soko de, watashi ga 'Shu yo, anata wa donata desu ka' to tazuneruto, Shu wa iwareta, 'Watashi wa, anata ga hakugai shite iru Iesu de aru.
Saa, okiagatte, jibun no ashi de tachi nasai. Watashi ga anata ni arawareta no wa, anata ga watashi ni atta koto to, anata ni arawarete shimesou to shite iru koto to o akashi shi, kore o tsutaeru tsutome ni, anata o ninjiru tame de aru.
Watashi wa, kono kokumin to ihoujin to no naka kara, anata o sukuidashi, aratamete anata o karera ni tsukawasuga,
Sore wa, karera no me o hiraki, karera o yami kara hikari e, akuma no shihai kara kami no mimoto e kaerase, mata, karera ga tsumi no yurushi o e, watashi o shinjiru shinkou ni yotte, seibetsu sareta hitobito ni kuwawaru tame de aru'.
Sore desukara, Agurippa ou yo, watashi wa ten yori no keiji ni somukazu,
Mazu hajime ni Damasuko ni iru hitobito ni, sore kara Erusaremu ni iru hitobito, sarani Yudaya zendo, narabi ni ihoujin tachi ni, kuiaratamete kami ni tachikaeri, kuiaratame ni fusawashii waza o okonau you ni to, tokisusumemashita.
Sono tame ni, Yudayajin wa, watashi o miya de hikitoraete korosou to shita no desu.
Shikashi, watashi wa konnichi ni itaru made kami no kago o uke, kono you ni tatte, chiisai mono ni mo ookii mono ni mo akashi o nashi, yogensha tachi ya Moose ga, kongo okorubekida to katatta koto o, sono mama nobete kimashita.
Sunawachi, Kirisuto ga kunan o ukeru koto, mata, shinin no naka kara saisho ni yomigaette, kono kokumin to ihoujin to ni, hikari o nobetsutaeru ni itaru koto o, akashi shita no desu".
Pauro ga kono you ni benmei o shite iruto, Fesuto wa oogoe de itta, "Pauro yo, omae wa ki ga kurutte iru. Hakugaku ga, omae o kuruwasete iru".
Pauro ga itta, "Fesuto kakka yo, watashi wa ki ga kurutte wa imasen. Watashi wa, majime na shinjitsu no kotoba o katatte iru dake desu.
Ou wa korera no koto o yoku shitte orareru no de, ou ni taishite mo, sotchoku ni moushiagete iru no desu. Sore wa, katasumi de okonawareta no de wa nai no desukara, hitotsu to shite, ou ga minogasareta koto wa nai to shinjimasu.
Agurippa ou yo, anata wa yogensha o shinjimasu ka. Shinjite orareru to omoimasu".
Agurippa ga Pauro ni itta, "Omae wa sukoshi toita dake de, watashi o Kurisuchan ni shiyou to shite iru".
Pauro ga itta, "Toku koto ga sukoshi de arouto, ooku de arouto, watashi ga kami ni inoru no wa, tada anata dake de naku, kyou, watashi no kotoba o kiita hito mo mina, watashi no you ni natte kudasaru koto desu. Kono you na kusari wa betsu desuga".
Sore kara, ou mo soutoku mo Berunike mo, mata resseki no hitobito mo, mina tachiagatta.
Taijou shite kara, tagai ni katariatte itta, "Ano hito wa, shi ya tougoku ni ataru you na koto o shite wa inai".
Soshite, Agurippa ga Fesuto ni itta, "Ano hito wa, Kaizaru ni jouso shite inakattara, yurusaretade arou ni".
Sate, watashitachi ga, fune de Itariya ni iku koto ga kimatta toki, Pauro to sono hoka suunin no shuujin to wa, konoetai no hyakusotsuchou Yuriasu ni takusareta.
Soshite watashitachi wa, Ajiya engan no kakusho ni kikou suru koto ni natte iru Adoramiteo no fune ni norikonde, shuppan shita. Tesaronike no Makedoniyabito Arisutaruko mo doukou shita.
Tsugi no hi, Shidon ni nyuukou shitaga, Yuriasu wa, Pauro o shinsetsu ni toriatsukai, yuujin o otozurete kantai o ukeru koto o, yurushita.
Sore kara watashitachi wa, koko kara funade shitaga, gyakufuu ni atta no de, Kupuro no shimakage o koukou shi,
Kirikiya to Panfuriya no oki o sugite, Rukiya no Mira ni nyuukou shita.
Soko ni, Itariyaiki no Arekisandoriya no fune ga atta no de, hyakusotsuchou wa, watashitachi o sono fune ni norikomaseta.
Ikunichi mo no aida, fune no susumi ga osokute, watashitachi wa, karoujite Kunido no okiai ni kitaga, kaze ga watashitachi no yukute o habamu no de, Sarumone no oki, Kurete no shimakage o koukou shi,
Sono kishi ni sotte susumi, karoujite "Yoki minato" to yobareru tokoro ni tsuita. Sono chikaku ni Rasaya no machi ga atta.
Nagai toki ga keika shi, danjiki ki mo sugite shimai, sudeni koukai ga kiken na kisetsu ni natta no de, Pauro wa hitobito ni keikoku shite itta,
"Minasan, watashi no miru tokoro de wa, kono koukai de wa, tsumini ya sentai bakari de naku, wareware no seimei ni mo, kigai to ookina sonshitsu ga oyobude arou".
Shikashi hyakusotsuchou wa, Pauro no imi yori mo, senchou ya senshu no hou o shinrai shita.
Nao, kono minato wa fuyu o sugosu no ni tekishinai no de, daitasuu no mono wa, koko kara dete, dekireba nan to ka shite, nansei to hokusei to ni menshite iru Kurete no Pinikusukou ni itte, soko de fuyu o sugoshitai to shuchou shita.
Toki ni, nanpuu ga shizuka ni fuite kita no de, karera wa, kono toki to bakari ni ikari o agete, Kurete no kishi ni sotte koukou shita.
Suruto ma mo naku, Yuurakuron to yobareru boufuu ga, shima kara fukioroshite kita.
Sono tame ni, fune ga nagasarete kaze ni sakarau koto ga dekinai no de, watashitachi wa fukinagasareru mama ni makaseta.
Sore kara, Kurauda to iu kojima no kage ni, hairikonda no de, watashitachi wa, yatto no koto de kobune o shochi suru koto ga deki,
Sore o fune ni hikiagete kara, tsuna de sentai o makitsuketa. Mata, Surutesu no su ni noriageru no o osore, ho o oroshite nagareru mama ni shita.
Watashitachi wa, boufuu ni hidoku nayamasare tsuzuketa no de, tsugi no hi ni, hitobito wa tsumini o sute hajime,
Mikkame ni wa, funagu made mo, te zukara nagesuteta.
Ikunichi mo no aida, taiyou mo hoshi mo miezu, boufuu wa hageshiku fukisusabu no de, watashitachi no tasukaru saigo no nozomi mo nakunatta.
Minna no mono wa, nagai aida shokuji mo shinaide itaga, sono toki, Pauro ga karera no naka ni tatte itta, "Minasan, anata ga taga, watashi no chuukoku o kikiirete, Kurete kara denakattara, kono you na kigai ya sonshitsu o koumuranakute sunda hazu de atta.
Daga, kono sai, osusume suru. Genki o dashi nasai. Fune ga ushinawareru dake de, anata gata no naka de seimei o ushinau mono wa, hitori mo inaide arou.
Sakuya, watashi ga tsukae, mata ogande iru kami kara no mitsukai ga, watashi no soba ni tatte itta,
'Pauro yo, osoreru na. Anata wa kanarazu Kaizaru no mae ni tatanakereba naranai. Tashika ni kami wa, anata to dousen no mono o, kotogotoku anata ni tamawatte iru'.
Dakara, minasan, genki o dashi nasai. Banji wa watashi ni tsugerareta toori ni natte ikuto, watashi wa, kami kakete shinjite iru.
Wareware wa, doko ka no shima ni uchiagerareru ni soui nai".
Watashitachi ga Adoriyaumi ni tadayotte kara juu yonkame no yoru ni natta toki, mayonaka goro, suifura wa doko ka no rikuchi ni chikazuita you ni kanjita.
Soko de, mizu no fukasa o hakatte mita tokoro, nijuu hiro de aru koto ga wakatta. Sore kara sukoshi susunde, mou ichido hakatte mitara, juu go hiro de atta.
Watashitachi ga, man'ichi anshou ni noriagete wa taihen dato, hitobito wa kizukatte, tomo kara yontsu no ikari o nage oroshi, yo no akeru no o machiwabite ita.
Sono toki, suifura ga fune kara nigedasou to omotte, hesaki kara ikari o nage orosu to misekake, kobune o umi ni oroshite ita no de,
Pauro wa, hyakusotsuchou ya heisotsutachi ni itta, "Ano hitotachi ga, fune ni nokotte inakereba, anata gata wa tasukaranai".
Soko de heisotsutachi wa, kobune no tsuna o tachikitte, sono nagarete iku mama ni makaseta.
Yo ga ake kaketa koro, Pauro wa ichidou no mono ni, shokuji o suru you ni susumete itta, "Anata gata ga shokuji mo sezu ni, mihari o tsuzukete kara, nani mo tabenaide, kyou ga juu yonkame ni ataru.
Dakara, ima shokuji o toru koto o osusume suru. Sore ga, anatagata o sukuu koto ni naru no dakara. Tashika ni kaminoke hitosuji de mo, anata gata no atama kara ushinawareru koto wa naide arou".
Kare wa kou itte, pan o tori, minna no mae de kami ni kansha shi, sore o saite tabe hajimeta.
Soko de, minna no mono mo motoki zuite shokuji o shita.
Fune ni ita watashitachi wa, awasete nihyaku nanajuu rokunin de atta.
Minna no mono wa, juubun ni shokuji o shita nochi, kokumotsu o umi ni nagesutete fune o karoku shita.
Yo ga akete, doko no tochi ka yoku wakaranakattaga, sunahama no aru irie ga mieta no de, dekireba, sore ni fune o noriireyou to iu koto ni natta.
Soko de, ikari o kirihanashite umi ni sute, douji ni kaji no tsuna o yurume, kaze ni mae no ho o agete, sunahama ni mukatte susunda.
Tokoro ga, chouryuu no nagareau tokoro ni tsukisusunda tame, fune o asase ni noriagete shimatte, hesaki ga merikonde ugokanaku nari, tomo no hou wa gekirou no tame ni kowasareta.
Heisotsutachi wa, shuujinra ga oyoide nigeru osore ga aru no de, koroshite shimaou to hakattaga,
Hyakusotsuchou wa, Pauro o sukuitai to omou tokoro kara, sono ito o shirizoke, oyogeru mono wa mazu umi ni tobikonde riku ni iki,
Sono ta no mono wa, ita ya fune no hahen ni notte iku you ni meijita. Kou shite, zenbu no mono ga jouriku shite sukuwareta no de atta.
Watashitachi ga, kou shite sukuwarete kara wakattaga, kore wa Maruta to yobareru shima de atta.
Tochi no hitobito wa, watashitachi ni naminami naranu shinsetsu o arawashite kureta. Sunawachi, furishikiru ame ya samusa o shinogu tame ni, hi o taite watashitachi ichidou o negiratte kureta no de aru.
Sono toki, Pauro wa hitokakae no shiba o tabanete hi ni kubeta tokoro, nekki no tame ni mamushi ga dete kite, kare no te ni kamitsuita.
Tochi no hitobito wa, kono ikimono ga Pauro no te kara burasagatte iru no o mite, tagai ni itta, "Kono hito wa, kitto hitogoroshi ni chigai nai. Umi kara wa nogaretaga, Dikee no kamisama ga kare o ikashite wa okanai no da".
Tokoro ga Pauro wa, mamushi o hi no naka ni furiotoshite, nan no gai mo koumuranakatta.
Karera wa, kare ga ma mo naku hareagaru ka, aruiha, tachimachi taorete shinudarou to, yousu o ukagatte ita. Shikashi, nagai aida ukagatte ite mo, kare no mi ni nan no kawatta koto mo okoranai no o mite, karera wa kangae o kaete, "Kono hito wa kamisama da" to ii dashita.
Sate, sono basho no chikaku ni, shima no shuchou, Popurio to iu hito no shoyuu chi ga atta. Kare wa, soko ni watashitachi o shoutai shite, mikka no aida shinsetsu ni motenashite kureta.
Tamatama, Popurio no chichi ga sekiri o wazurai, kounetsu de toko ni tsuite ita. Soko de Pauro wa, sono hito no tokoro ni haitte itte inori, te o kare no ue ni oite iyashite yatta.
Kono koto ga atte kara, hoka ni byouki o shite iru shima no hitotachi ga, zokuzoku to yatte kite, mina iyasareta.
Karera wa watashitachi o hijou ni sonkei shi, shuppan no toki ni wa, hitsuyou na shinajina o motte kite kureta.
San kagetsu tatta nochi, watashitachi wa, kono shima ni fuyugomori o shite ita Deosukuri no fune kazari no aru Arekisandoriya no fune de, shuppan shita.
Soshite, Shirakusa ni kikou shite mikka no aida teihaku shi,
Soko kara susunde Region ni itta. Sore kara tsuitachi oite, nanpuu ga fuite kita no ni jouji, futsu ka me ni Poteori ni tsuita.
Soko de kyoudaitachi ni ai, susumerareru mama, karera no tokoro ni nanukakan mo taizai shita. Sore kara watashitachi wa, tsuini Rooma ni touchaku shita.
Tokoro ga, kyoudaitachi wa, watashitachi no koto o kiite, Apio Poro oyobi Toresu Taberune made demukaete kureta. Pauro wa karera ni atte, kami ni kansha shi isamitatta.
Watashitachi ga Rooma ni tsuita nochi, Pauro wa, hitori no banpei o tsukerare, hitori de sumu koto o yurusareta.
Mikka tatte kara, Pauro wa, omodatta Yudayajintachi o maneita. Minna no mono ga atsumatta toki, karera ni itta, "Kyoudaitachi yo, watashi wa, waga kokumin ni taishite mo, aruiha senzo denrai no kanrei ni taishite mo, nanihito tsu somuku koui ga nakatta no ni, Erusaremu de shuujin to shite Roomajintachi no te ni hikiwatasareta.
Karera wa watashi o torishirabeta kekka, nanra shi ni ataru zaijou mo nai no de, watashi o shakuhou shiyou to omotta no de aruga,
Yudayajintachi ga kore ni hantai shita tame, watashi wa yamu o ezu, Kaizaru ni jouso suru ni itatta no de aru. Shikashi watashi wa, waga douhou o uttaeyou nado to shite iru no de wa nai.
Kou iu wake de, anata gata ni atte katariaitai to negatte ita. Jijitsu, watashi wa, Isuraeru no idaite iru kibou no yue ni, kono kusari ni tsunagarete iru no de aru".
Soko de karera wa, Pauro ni itta, "Watashitachi wa, Yudayajintachi kara, anata ni tsuite, nan no bunsho mo uketotte inaishi, mata, kyoudaitachi no naka kara koko ni kite, anata ni tsuite furi na houkoku o shi tari, akkou o it tari shita mono mo nakatta.
Watashitachi wa, anata no kangaete iru koto o, chokusetsu anata kara kiku no ga, tadashii koto da to omotte iru. Jitsu wa, kono shuuha ni tsuite wa, itaru tokoro de hantai no aru koto ga, watashitachi no mimi ni mo haitte iru".
Soko de, hi o sadamete, oozei no hito ga, Pauro no yado ni tsumekakete kita no de, asa kara ban made, Pauro wa katari tsuzuke, kami no kuni no koto o akashi shi, mata Moose no rippou ya yogensha no sho o hiite, Iesu ni tsuite karera no settoku ni tsutometa.
Aru mono wa Pauro no iu koto o ukeire, aru mono wa shinjiyou to mo shinakatta.
Tagai ni iken ga awanakute, minna no mono ga kaerou to shite ita toki, Pauro wa hitokoto nobete itta, "Seirei wa yoku mo yogensha Izaya ni yotte, anata gata no senzo ni katatta mono de aru.
'Kono tami ni itte ie, anata gata wa kiku ni wa kikuga, kesshite satoranai. Miru ni wa miruga, kesshite mitomenai.
Kono tami no kokoro wa nibuku nari, sono mimi wa kikoenikuku, sono me wa tojite iru. Sore wa, karera ga me de mizu, mimi de kikazu, kokoro de satorazu, kuiaratamete iyasareru koto ga nai tame de aru'.
Soko de, anata gata wa shitte oku ga yoi. Kami no kono sukui no kotoba wa, ihoujin ni okurareta no da. Karera wa, kore ni kiki shitagaude arou". []
Pauro ga korera no koto o nobe owaruto, Yudayajinra wa, tagai ni ronjiainagara kaette itta.]
Pauro wa, jibun no karita ie ni man ni nen no aida sunde, tazunete kuru hitobito o mina mukaeire,
Habakarazu, mata samatagerareru koto mo naku, kami no kuni o nobetsutae, Shu Iesu Kirisuto no koto o oshie tsuzuketa.
Kirisuto Iesu no shimobe, kami no fukuin no tame ni erabi wakatare, mesarete shito to natta Pauro kara - -
Kono fukuin wa, kami ga, yogensha tachi ni yori, seisho no naka de, arakajime yakusoku sareta mono de atte,
Miko ni kansuru mono de aru. Miko wa, niku ni yoreba Dabide no shison kara umare,
Sei naru rei ni yoreba, shinin kara no fukkatsu ni yori, michikara o motte kami no miko to sadamerareta. Kore ga watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto de aru.
Watashitachi wa, sono mina no tame ni, subete no ihoujin o shinkou no juujun ni itaraseru you ni to, kare ni yotte megumi to shito no tsutome to o uketa no de ari,
Anata gata mo mata, karera no naka ni atte, mesarete Iesu Kirisuto ni zokusuru mono to natta no de aru - -
Rooma ni iru, kami ni aisare, mesareta seito ichidou e. Watashitachi no chichi naru kami oyobi Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Mazu daiichi ni, watashi wa, anata gata no shinkou ga zensekai ni iitsutaerarete iru koto o, Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, anata gata ichidou no tame ni, watashi no kami ni kansha suru.
[9-10] Watashi wa, inori no tabigoto ni, taezu anatagata o oboe, itsu ka wa mimune ni kanatte michi ga hirakare, dou ni ka shite, anata gata no tokoro ni ikeru you ni to negatte iru. Kono koto ni tsuite, watashi no tame ni akashi o shite kudasaru no wa, watashi ga rei ni yori, miko no fukuin o nobetsutaete tsukaete iru kami de aru.
[9-10] Watashi wa, inori no tabigoto ni, taezu anatagata o oboe, itsu ka wa mimune ni kanatte michi ga hirakare, dou ni ka shite, anata gata no tokoro ni ikeru you ni to negatte iru. Kono koto ni tsuite, watashi no tame ni akashi o shite kudasaru no wa, watashi ga rei ni yori, miko no fukuin o nobetsutaete tsukaete iru kami de aru.
Watashi wa, anata gata ni au koto o netsubou shite iru. Anata gata ni rei no tamamono o ikubun de mo wakeataete, chikarazuketaikara de aru.
Sore wa, anata gata no naka ni ite, anata gata to watashi to no otagai no shinkou ni yotte, tomo ni hagemashiau tame ni hoka naranai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Kono koto o shirazu ni ite moraitaku nai. Watashi wa hoka no ihoujin no aida de eta you ni, anata gata no aida de mo ikubun ka no mi o eru tame ni, anata gata no tokoro ni ikou to shibashiba kuwadatetaga, ima made samatagerarete kita.
Watashi ni wa, Girishiyajin ni mo mikai no hito ni mo, kashikoi mono ni mo muchi na mono ni mo, hatasubeki sekinin ga aru.
Soko de, watashi to shite no setsu naru negai wa, Rooma ni iru anata gata ni mo, fukuin o nobetsutaeru koto na no de aru.
Watashi wa fukuin o haji to shinai. Sore wa, Yudayajin o hajime, Girishiyajin ni mo, subete shinjiru mono ni, sukui o esaseru kami no chikara de aru.
Kami no gi wa, sono fukuin no naka ni keiji sare, shinkou ni hajimari shinkou ni itaraseru. Kore wa, "Shinkou ni yoru gijin wa ikiru" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Kami no ikari wa, fugi o motte shinri o habamou to suru ningen no arayuru fushinjin to fugi to ni taishite, ten kara keiji sareru.
Naze nara, kami ni tsuite shiri uru kotogara wa, karera ni wa akiraka de ari, kami ga sore o karera ni akiraka ni sareta no de aru.
Kami no mienai seishitsu, sunawachi, kami no eien no chikara to shinsei to wa, tenchi souzou konokata, hizoubutsu ni oite shirarete ite, akiraka ni mitomerarerukara de aru. Shitagatte, karera ni wa benkai no yochi ga nai.
Naze nara, karera wa kami o shitte inagara, kami to shite agamezu, kansha mo sezu, kaette sono omoi wa munashiku nari, sono muchi na kokoro wa kuraku nattakara de aru.
Karera wa mizukara chisha to shoushinagara, oroka ni nari,
Fukyuu no kami no eikou o kaete, kuchiru ningen ya tori ya kemono ya hau mono no zou ni niseta no de aru.
Yue ni, kami wa, karera ga kokoro no yokujou ni karare, jibun no karada o tagai ni hazukashimete, kegasu mama ni makaserareta.
Karera wa kami no shinri o kaete kyogi to shi, souzousha no kawari ni hizoubutsu o ogami, kore ni tsukaeta no de aru. Souzousha koso eien ni ho mubeki mono de aru, amen.
Sore yue, kami wa karera o hazubeki jouyoku ni makaserareta. Sunawachi, karera no naka no onna wa, sono shizen no kankei o fushizen na mono ni kae,
Otoko mo mata onaji you ni onna to no shizen no kankei o sutete, tagai ni sono jouyoku no honoo o moyashi, otoko wa otoko ni taishite hazubeki koto o nashi, soshite sono rangyou no touzen no mukui o, mi ni uketa no de aru.
Soshite, karera wa kami o mitomeru koto o tadashii to shinakatta no de, kami wa karera o tadashikaranu omoi ni watashi, nasubekarazaru koto o nasu ni makaserareta.
Sunawachi, karera wa, arayuru fugi to aku to don'yoku to akui to ni afure, netami to satsui to arasoi to sagi to akunen to ni michi, mata, zangen suru mono,
Soshiru mono, kami o nikumu mono, fuson na mono, kouman na mono, taigensougo suru mono, akuji o takuramu mono, oya ni sakarau mono to nari,
Muchi, fuseijitsu, mujou, mujihi na mono to natte iru.
Karera wa, kou shita koto o okonau monodomo ga shini atai suru to iu kami no sadame o yoku shirinagara, mizukara sore o okonau bakari de wa naku, sore o okonau monodomo o zenin sae shite iru.
Dakara, aa, subete hito o sabaku mono yo. Anata ni wa benkai no yochi ga nai. Anata wa, tanin o sabaku koto ni yotte, jibun jishin o tsumi ni sadamete iru. Sabaku anata mo, onaji koto o okonatte irukara de aru.
Watashitachi wa, kami no sabaki ga, kono you na koto o okonau monodomo no ue ni tadashiku kudaru koto o, shitte iru.
Aa, kono you na koto o okonau monodomo o sabakinagara, shikamo mizukara onaji koto o okonau hito yo. Anata wa, kami no sabaki o nogare uru to omou no ka.
Sore to mo, kami no jiai ga anata o kuiaratame ni michibiku koto mo shiranaide, sono jiai to nintai to kan'you to no tomi o karonjiru no ka.
Anata no katakuna na, kuiaratame no nai kokoro no yue ni, anata wa, kami no tadashii sabaki no arawareru ikari no hi no tame ni kami no ikari o, jibun no mi ni tsunde iru no de aru.
Kami wa, onoono ni, sono waza ni shitagatte mukuirareru.
Sunawachi, ippou de wa, taeshinonde zen o okonatte, kouei to homare to kuchinu mono to o motomeru hito ni, eien no inochi ga ataerare,
Tahou de wa, touhashin o idaki, shinri ni shitagawanaide fugi ni shitagau hito ni, ikari to hageshii ikidoori to ga kuwaerareru.
Aku o okonau subete no hito ni wa, Yudayajin o hajime Girishiyajin ni mo, kannan to kunou to ga ataerare,
Zen o okonau subete no hito ni wa, Yudayajin o hajime Girishiyajin ni mo, kouei to homare to heian to ga ataerareru.
Naze nara, kami ni wa, kata yori miru koto ga naikara de aru.
Sono wake wa, rippou nashi ni tsumi o okashita mono wa, mata rippou nashi ni horobi, rippou no moto de tsumi o okashita mono wa, rippou ni yotte sabakareru.
Naze nara, rippou o kiku mono ga, kami no mae ni gi naru mono de wa naku, rippou o okonau mono ga, gi to sarerukara de aru.
Sunawachi, rippou o motanai ihoujin ga, shizen no mama de, rippou no meijiru koto o okonaunara, tatoi rippou o motanakute mo, karera ni totte wa jibun jishin ga rippou na no de aru.
Karera wa rippou no youkyuu ga sono kokoro ni shirusarete iru koto o arawashi, sono koto o karera no ryoushin mo tomo ni akashi o shite, sono handan ga tagai ni aruiha uttae, aruiha benmei shi au no de aru.
Soshite, korera no koto wa, watashi no fukuin ni yoreba, kami ga Kirisuto Iesu ni yotte hitobito no kakureta kotogara o sabakareru sono hi ni, akiraka ni sarerude arou.
Moshi anata ga, mizukara Yudayajin to shoushi, rippou ni yasunji, kami o hokori to shi,
Mimune o shiri, rippou ni oshierarete, nasubeki koto o wakimaete ori,
[19-20] Sarani, chishiki to shinri to ga rippou no naka ni katachi o totte iru to shite, mizukara moujin no tebiki, yami ni oru mono no hikari, oroka na mono no michibikite, osanago no kyoushi o motte ninjite iru no nara,
[19-20] Sarani, chishiki to shinri to ga rippou no naka ni katachi o totte iru to shite, mizukara moujin no tebiki, yami ni oru mono no hikari, oroka na mono no michibikite, osanago no kyoushi o motte ninjite iru no nara,
Naze, hito o oshiete jibun o oshienai no ka. Nusumu na to hito ni toite, mizukara wa nusumu no ka.
Kan'in suru na to itte, mizukara wa kan'in suru no ka. Guuzou o imikirainagara, mizukara wa miya no mono o kasumeru no ka.
Rippou o hokori to shinagara, mizukara wa rippou ni ihan shite, kami o anadotte iru no ka.
Seisho ni kaite aru to ori, "Kami no mina wa, anata gata no yue ni, ihoujin no aida de kegasarete iru".
Moshi, anata ga rippou o okonaunara, naruhodo, katsurei wa yaku ni tatou. Shikashi, moshi rippou o okasunara, anata no katsurei wa mukatsurei to natte shimau.
Dakara, moshi mukatsurei no mono ga rippou no kitei o mamorunara, sono mukatsurei wa katsurei to minasarerude wa nai ka.
Katsu, umarenagara mukatsurei no mono de atte rippou o mattou suru mono wa, rippou no monji to katsurei to o mochinagara rippou o okashite iru anata o, sabaku no de aru.
To iu no wa, gaikenue no Yudayajin ga Yudayajin de wa naku, mata, gaikenue no niku ni okeru katsurei ga katsurei de mo nai.
Kaette, kakureta Yudayajin ga Yudayajin de ari, mata, monji ni yorazu rei ni yoru kokoro no katsurei koso katsurei de atte, sono homare wa hito kara de wa naku, kami kara kuru no de aru.
De wa, Yudayajin no sugurete iru ten wa nani ka. Mata katsurei no eki wa nani ka.
Sore wa, iroiro no ten de kazuooku aru. Mazu daiichi ni, kami no kotoba ga karera ni yudanerareta koto de aru.
Suruto, dou naru no ka. Moshi, karera no uchi ni fushinjitsu no mono ga atta to shitara, sono fushinjitsu ni yotte, kami no shinjitsu wa mu ni narude arou ka.
Danjite sou de wa nai. Arayuru hito o itsuwari mono to shite mo, kami o shinjitsu na mono to subekide aru. Sore wa, "Anata ga kotoba o noberu toki wa, gi to serare, anata ga sabaki o ukeru toki, shouri o eru tame" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Shikashi, moshi watashitachi no fugi ga, kami no gi o akiraka ni suru to shitara, nan to iubeki ka. Ikari o kudasu kami wa, fugi de aru to iu no ka (kore wa ningenteki na iikata de wa aru).
Danjite sou de wa nai. Moshi sou de attara, kami wa konoyo o, dou sabakarerudarou ka.
Shikashi, moshi kami no shinjitsu ga, watashi no itsuwari ni yori issou akiraka ni sarete, kami no eikou to narunara, dou shite, watashi wa nao mo tsumibito to shite sabakareru no darou ka.
Mushiro, "Zen o kitaraseru tame ni, watashitachi wa aku o shiyoude wa nai ka" (watashitachi ga sou itte iruto, aru hitobito wa soshitte iru). Karera ga basserareru no wa touzen de aru.
Suruto, dou naru no ka. Watashitachi ni wa nani ka masatta tokoro ga aru no ka. Zettai ni nai. Yudayajin mo Girishiyajin mo, kotogotoku tsumi no moto ni aru koto o, watashitachi wa sudeni shiteki shita.
Tsugi no you ni kaite aru, "Gijin wa inai, hitori mo inai.
Satori no aru hito wa inai, kami o motomeru hito wa inai.
Subete no hito wa mayoidete, kotogotoku mueki na mono ni natte iru. Zen o okonau mono wa inai, hitori mo inai.
Karera no nodo wa, hiraita haka de ari, karera wa, sono shita de hito o azamuki, karera no kuchibiru ni wa, mamushi no doku ga ari,
Karera no kuchi wa, noroito nigai kotoba to de michite iru.
Karera no ashi wa, chi o nagasu no ni hayaku,
Karera no michi ni wa, hakai to hisan to ga aru.
Soshite, karera wa heiwa no michi o shiranai.
Karera no me no mae ni wa, kami ni taisuru osore ga nai".
Sate, watashitachi ga shitte iru you ni, subete rippou no iu tokoro wa, rippou no moto ni aru monotachi ni taishite katararete iru. Sore wa, subete no kuchi ga fusagare, zensekai ga kami no sabaki ni fukusuru tame de aru.
Naze nara, rippou o okonau koto ni yotte wa, subete no ningen wa kami no mae ni gi to serarenaikara de aru. Rippou ni yotte wa, tsumi no jikaku ga shoujiru nomi de aru.
Shikashi ima ya, kami no gi ga, rippou to wa betsu ni, shikamo rippou to yogensha to ni yotte akashi sarete, arawasareta.
Sore wa, Iesu Kirisuto o shinjiru shinkou ni yoru kami no gi de atte, subete shinjiru hito ni ataerareru mono de aru. Soko ni wa nanra no sabetsu mo nai.
Sunawachi, subete no hito wa tsumi o okashita tame, kami no eikou o ukerarenaku natte ori,
Karera wa, atai nashi ni, kami no megumi ni yori, Kirisuto Iesu ni yoru aganai ni yotte gi to sareru no de aru.
Kami wa kono Kirisuto o tatete, sono chi ni yoru, shinkou o motte u kubeki a ga nai no sonaemono to sareta. Sore wa kami no gi o shimesu tame de atta. Sunawachi, ima made ni okasareta tsumi o, kami wa nintai o motte minogashite oraretaga,
Sore wa, ima no toki ni, kami no gi o shimesu tame de atta. Kou shite, kami mizukara ga gi to nari, sarani, Iesu o shinjiru mono o gi to sareru no de aru.
Suruto, doko ni watashitachi no hokori ga aru no ka. Mattaku nai. Nan no housoku ni yotte ka. Okonai no housoku ni yotte ka. Sou de wa naku, shinkou no housoku ni yotte de aru.
Watashitachi wa, kou omou. Hito ga gi to sareru no wa, rippou no okonai ni yoru no de wa naku, shinkou ni yoru no de aru.
Sore to mo, kami wa Yudayajin dake no kami de arou ka. Mata, ihoujin no kami de aru no de wa nai ka. Tashika ni, ihoujin no kami de mo aru.
Makoto ni, kami wa yuiitsu de atte, katsurei no aru mono o shinkou ni yotte gi to shi, mata, mukatsurei no mono o mo shinkou no yue ni gi to sareru no de aru.
Suruto, shinkou no yue ni, watashitachi wa rippou o mukou ni suru no de aru ka. Danjite sou de wa nai. Kaette, sore ni yotte rippou o kakuritsu suru no de aru.
Sore de wa, niku ni yoru watashitachi no senzo Aburahamu no baai ni tsuite wa, nan to ittara yoi ka.
Moshi Aburahamu ga, sono okonai ni yotte gi to sareta no de areba, kare wa hokoru koto ga dekiyou. Shikashi, kami no mimae de wa, dekinai.
Naze nara, seisho wa nan to itte iru ka, "Aburahamu wa kami o shinjita. Sore ni yotte, kare wa gi to mitomerareta" to aru.
Ittai, hataraku hito ni taisuru houshuu wa, onkei to shite de wa naku, touzen no shiharai to shite mitomerareru.
Shikashi, hataraki wa nakute mo, fushinjin na mono o gi to suru kata o shinjiru hito wa, sono shinkou ga gi to mitomerareru no de aru.
Dabide mo mata, okonai ga nakute mo kami ni gi to mitomerareta hito no koufuku ni tsuite, tsugi no you ni itte iru,
"Fuhou o yurusare, tsumi o oowareta hitotachi wa, saiwai de aru.
Tsumi o Shu ni mitomerarenai hito wa, saiwai de aru".
Sate, kono koufuku wa, katsurei no mono dake ga ukeru no ka. Sore to mo, mukatsurei no mono ni mo oyobu no ka. Watashitachi wa iu, "Aburahamu ni wa, sono shinkou ga gi to mitomerareta" no de aru.
Sore de wa, dou iu baai ni sou mitomerareta no ka. Katsurei o ukete kara ka, sore to mo ukeru mae ka. Katsurei o ukete kara de wa naku, mukatsurei no toki de atta.
Soshite, Aburahamu wa katsurei to iu shirushi o uketaga, sore wa, mukatsurei no mama de shinkou ni yotte uketa gi no shouin de atte, kare ga, mukatsurei no mama de shinjite gi to sareru ni itaru subete no hito no chichi to nari,
Katsu, katsurei no mono no chichi to naru tame na no de aru. Katsurei no mono to iu no wa, katsurei o uketa mono bakari de wa naku, warera no chichi Aburahamu ga mukatsurei no toki ni motte ita shinkou no ashiato o fumu hitobito o mo sasu no de aru.
Naze nara, sekai o souzoku saseru to no yakusoku ga, Aburahamu to sono shison to ni taishite nasareta no wa, rippou ni yoru no de wa naku, shinkou no gi ni yorukara de aru.
Moshi, rippou ni tatsu hitobito ga souzokunin de aru to sureba, shinkou wa munashiku nari, yakusoku mo mata mukou ni natte shimau.
Ittai, rippou wa ikari o maneku mono de atte, rippou no nai tokoro ni wa ihan naru mono wa nai.
Kono you na wake de, subete wa shinkou ni yoru no de aru. Sore wa megumi ni yoru no de atte, subete no shison ni, sunawachi, rippou ni tatsu mono dake ni de wa naku, Aburahamu no shinkou ni shitagau mono ni mo, kono yakusoku ga hoshou sareru no de aru. Aburahamu wa, kami no mae de, watashitachi subete no mono no chichi de atte,
"Watashi wa, anata o tatete ooku no kokumin no chichi to shita" to kaite aru toori de aru. Kare wa kono kami, sunawachi, shinin o ikashi, mukara yuu o yobidasareru kami o shinjita no de aru.
Kare wa nozomi enai no ni, nao mo nozomitsutsu shinjita. Sono tame ni, "Anata no shison wa kou narude arou" to iwarete iru toori, ooku no kokumin no chichi to natta no de aru.
Sunawachi, oyoso hyakusai to natte, kare jishin no karada ga shinda joutai de ari, mata, Sara no tai ga funin de aru no o mitomenagara mo, nao kare no shinkou wa yowaranakatta.
Kare wa, kami no yakusoku o fushinkou no yue ni utagau you na koto wa sezu, kaette shinkou ni yotte tsuyomerare, eikou o kami ni kishi,
Kami wa sono yakusoku sareta koto o, mata jouju suru koto ga dekiru to kakushin shita.
Dakara, kare wa gi to mitomerareta no de aru.
Shikashi "Gi to mitomerareta" to kaite aru no wa, Aburahamu no tame dake de wa naku,
Watashitachi no tame de mo atte, watashitachi no Shu Iesu o shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta kata o shinjiru watashitachi mo, gi to mitomerareru no de aru.
Shu wa, watashitachi no zaika no tame ni shi ni watasare, watashitachi ga gi to sareru tame ni, yomigaerasareta no de aru.
Kono you ni, watashitachi wa, shinkou ni yotte gi to sareta no dakara, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yori, kami ni taishite heiwa o ete iru.
Watashitachi wa, sarani kare ni yori, ima tatte iru kono megumi ni shinkou ni yotte michibikiirerare, soshite, kami no eikou ni azukaru kibou o motte yorokonde iru.
Sore dake de wa naku, kannan o mo yorokonde iru. Naze nara, kannan wa nintai o umidashi,
Nintai wa rentatsu o umidashi, rentatsu wa kibou o umidasu koto o, shitte irukara de aru.
Soshite, kibou wa shitsubou ni owaru koto wa nai. Naze nara, watashitachi ni tamawatte iru seirei ni yotte, kami no ai ga watashitachi no kokoro ni sosogarete irukara de aru.
Watashitachi ga mada yowakatta koro, Kirisuto wa, toki itatte, fushinjin na monotachi no tame ni shinde kudasatta no de aru.
Tadashii hito no tame ni shinu mono wa, hotondo inaide arou. Zennin no tame ni wa, susunde shinu mono mo aruiha irude arou.
Shikashi, mada tsumibito de atta toki, watashitachi no tame ni Kirisuto ga shinde kudasatta koto ni yotte, kami wa watashitachi ni taisuru ai o shimesareta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, Kirisuto no chi ni yotte ima wa gi to sarete iru no dakara, naosara, kare ni yotte kami no ikari kara sukuwarerude arou.
Moshi, watashitachi ga teki de atta toki de sae, miko no shi ni yotte kami to no wakai o uketa to sureba, wakai o ukete iru ima wa, naosara, kare no inochi ni yotte sukuwarerude arou.
Sore bakari de wa naku, watashitachi wa, ima ya wakai o esasete kudasatta watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, kami o yorokobu no de aru.
Kono you na wake de, hitori no hito ni yotte, tsumi ga konoyo ni hairi, mata tsumi ni yotte shi ga haitte kita you ni, kou shite, subete no hito ga tsumi o okashita no de, shi ga zenjinrui ni hairikonda no de aru.
To iu no wa, rippou izen ni mo tsumi wa yo ni attaga, rippou ga nakereba, tsumi wa tsumi to shite mitomerarenai no de aru.
Shikashi, Adamu kara Moose made no aida ni oite mo, Adamu no ihan to onaji you na tsumi o okasanakatta mono mo, shi no shihai o manugarenakatta. Kono Adamu wa, kitarubeki mono no kata de aru.
Shikashi, megumi no tamamono wa zaika no baai to wa kotonatte iru. Sunawachi, moshi hitori no zaika no tame ni ooku no hito ga shinda to sureba, mashite, kami no megumi to, hitori no hito Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ni yoru tamamono to wa, sarani yutaka ni ooku no hitobito ni michiafureta hazu de wa nai ka.
Katsu, kono tamamono wa, hitori no okashita tsumi no kekka to wa kotonatte iru. Naze nara, sabaki no baai wa, hitori no zaika kara, tsumi ni sadameru koto ni nattaga, megumi no baai ni wa, ooku no hito no zaika kara, gi to suru kekka ni narukara de aru.
Moshi, hitori no zaika ni yotte, sono hitori o tooshite shi ga shihai suru ni itatta to sureba, mashite, afureru bakari no megumi to gi no tamamono to o ukete iru monotachi wa, hitori no Iesu Kirisuto o tooshi, inochi ni atte, sarani chikarazuyoku shihai suru hazu de wa nai ka.
Kono you na wake de, hitori no zaika ni yotte subete no hito ga tsumi ni sadamerareta you ni, hitori no gi naru koui ni yotte, inochi o esaseru gi ga subete no hito ni oyobu no de aru.
Sunawachi, hitori no hito no fujuujun ni yotte, ooku no hito ga tsumibito to sareta to onaji you ni, hitori no juujun ni yotte, ooku no hito ga gijin to sareru no de aru.
Rippou ga hairikonde kita no wa, zaika no mashi kuwawaru tame de aru. Shikashi, tsumi no mashi kuwawatta tokoro ni wa, megumi mo masumasu michiafureta.
Sore wa, tsumi ga shi ni yotte shihai suru ni itatta you ni, megumi mo mata gi ni yotte shihai shi, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yori, eien no inochi o esaseru tame de aru.
De wa, watashitachi wa, nan to iou ka. Megumi ga mashi kuwawaru tame ni, tsumi ni todomarubekide arou ka.
Danjite sou de wa nai. Tsumi ni taishite shinda watashitachi ga, dou shite, nao, sono naka ni ikite orerudarou ka.
Sore to mo, anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Kirisuto Iesu ni azukaru baputesuma o uketa watashitachi wa, kare no shi ni azukaru baputesuma o uketa no de aru.
Sunawachi, watashitachi wa, sono shi ni azukaru baputesuma ni yotte, kare to tomo ni houmurareta no de aru. Sore wa, Kirisuto ga chichi no eikou ni yotte, shinin no naka kara yomigaerasareta you ni, watashitachi mo mata, atarashii inochi ni ikiru tame de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga, kare ni musubitsuite sono shi no sama ni hitoshiku narunara, sarani, kare no fukkatsu no sama ni mo hitoshiku narude arou.
Watashitachi wa, kono koto o shitte iru. Watashitachi no uchi no furuki hito wa Kirisuto to tomo ni juujika ni tsukerareta. Sore wa, kono tsumi no karada ga horobi, watashitachi ga mohaya, tsumi no dorei to naru koto ga nai tame de aru.
Sore wa, sudeni shinda mono wa, tsumi kara kaihou sarete irukara de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga, Kirisuto to tomo ni shindanara, mata kare to tomo ni ikiru koto o shinjiru.
Kirisuto wa shinin no naka kara yomigaerasarete, mohaya shinu koto ga naku, shi wa mohaya kare o shihai shinai koto o, shitte irukara de aru.
Naze nara, Kirisuto ga shinda no wa, tada ichi dotsumi ni taishite shinda no de ari, Kirisuto ga ikiru no wa, kami ni ikiru no dakara de aru.
Kono you ni, anata gata jishin mo, tsumi ni taishite shinda mono de ari, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte kami ni ikite iru mono de aru koto o,mito mubekide aru.
Dakara, anata gata no shinubeki karada o tsumi no shihai ni yudanete, sono jouyoku ni shitagawaseru koto o sezu,
Mata, anata gata no shitai o fugi no buki to shite tsumi ni sasagete wa naranai. Mushiro, shinin no naka kara ikasareta mono to shite, jibun jishin o kami ni sasage, jibun no shitai o gi no buki to shite kami ni sasageru ga yoi.
Naze nara, anata gata wa rippou no moto ni aru no de wa naku, megumi no moto ni aru no de, tsumi ni shihai sareru koto wa naikara de aru.
Sore de wa, dou na no ka. Rippou no moto ni de wa naku, megumi no moto ni arukara to itte, watashitachi wa tsumi o okasubekide arou ka. Danjite sou de wa nai.
Anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Anata gata jishin ga, dare ka no shimobe ni natte fukujuu surunara, anata gata wa jibun no fukujuu suru sono mono no shimobe de atte, shi ni itaru tsumi no shimobe to mo nari, aruiha, gi ni itaru juujun no shimobe to mo naru no de aru.
Shikashi, kami wa kansha subeki ka na. Anata gata wa tsumi no shimobe de attaga, tsutaerareta oshie no kijun ni kokoro kara fukujuu shite,
Tsumi kara kaihou sare, gi no shimobe to natta.
Watashi wa ningenteki na iikata o suruga, sore wa, anata gata no niku no yowasa no yue de aru. Anata gata wa, katsute jibun no shitai o kegare to fuhou to no shimobe to shite sasagete fuhou ni ochiitta you ni, ima ya jibun no shitai o gi no shimobe to shite sasagete, kiyoku naraneba naranai.
Anata gata ga tsumi no shimobe de atta toki wa, gi to wa en no nai mono de atta.
Sono toki anata gata wa, donna mi o musunda no ka. Sore wa, ima de wa haji to suru you na mono de atta. Sorera no mono no shuukyoku wa, shi de aru.
Shikashi ima ya, anata gata wa tsumi kara kaihou sarete kami ni tsukae, kiyokini itaru mi o musunde iru. Sono shuukyoku wa eien no inochi de aru.
Tsumi no shiharau houshuu wa shi de aru. Shikashi kami no tamamono wa, watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu ni okeru eien no inochi de aru.
Sore to mo, kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Watashi wa rippou o shitte iru hitobito ni kataru no de aruga, rippou wa hito o sono ikite iru kikan dake shihai suru mono de aru.
Sunawachi, otto no aru onna wa, otto ga ikite iru aida wa, rippou ni yotte kare ni tsunagarete iru. Shikashi, otto ga shineba, otto no rippou kara kaihou sareru.
De arukara, otto no seizonchuu ni ta no otoko ni ikeba, sono onna wa inpu to yobareruga, moshi otto ga shineba, sono rippou kara tokareru no de, ta no otoko ni itte mo, inpu to wa naranai.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Kono you ni, anata gata mo, Kirisuto no karada o tooshite, rippou ni taishite shinda no de aru. Sore wa, anata gata ga ta no hito, sunawachi, shinin no naka kara yomigaerareta kata no mono to nari, kou shite, watashitachi ga kami no tame ni mi o musubu ni itaru tame na no de aru.
To iu no wa, watashitachi ga niku ni atta toki ni wa, rippou ni yoru tsumi no yokujou ga, shi no tame ni mi o musubaseyou to shite, watashitachi no shitai no uchi ni hataraite ita.
