Sore de wa, watashitachi wa, nan to iou ka. Rippou wa tsumi na no ka. Danjite sou de wa nai. Shikashi, rippou ni yoranakereba, watashi wa tsumi o shiranakattade arou. Sunawachi, moshi rippou ga "Musaboru na" to iwanakattara, watashi wa musaborinaru mono o shiranakattade arou.
Shikaru ni, tsumi wa imashime ni yotte kikai o torae, watashi no uchi ni hataraite, arayuru musabori o okosaseta. Sunawachi, rippou ga nakattara, tsumi wa shinde iru no de aru.
Watashi wa katsute wa, rippou nashi ni ikite itaga, imashime ga kuru ni oyonde, tsumi wa ikikaeri,
Watashi wa shinda. Soshite, inochi ni michibikubeki imashime sono mono ga, kaette watashi o shi ni michibiite iku koto ga wakatta.
Naze nara, tsumi wa imashime ni yotte kikai o torae, watashi o azamuki, imashime ni yotte watashi o koroshitakara de aru.
Kono you na wake de, rippou sono mono wa sei naru mono de ari, imashime mo sei de atte, tadashiku, katsu zen naru mono de aru.
De wa, zen naru mono ga, watashi ni totte shi to natta no ka. Danjite sou de wa nai. Sore wa mushiro, tsumi no tsumi taru koto ga arawareru tame no, tsumi no shiwaza de aru. Sunawachi, tsumi wa, imashime ni yotte, hanahadashiku akusei na mono to naru tame ni, zen naru mono ni yotte watashi o shi ni itaraseta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, rippou wa reiteki na mono de aru to shitte iru. Shikashi, watashi wa niku ni tsukeru mono de atte, tsumi no moto ni urarete iru no de aru.
Watashi wa jibun no shite iru koto ga, wakaranai. Naze nara, watashi wa jibun no hossuru koto wa okonawazu, kaette jibun no nikumu koto o shite irukara de aru.
Moshi, jibun no hosshinai koto o shite iru to sureba, watashi wa rippou ga yoi mono de aru koto o shounin shite iru koto ni naru.
