Watashi no uchi ni, sunawachi, watashi no niku no uchi ni wa, zen naru mono ga yadotte inai koto o, watashi wa shitte iru. Naze nara, zen o shiyou to suru ishi wa, jibun ni aruga, sore o suru chikara ga naikara de aru.
Sunawachi, watashi no hosshite iru zen wa shinaide, hosshite inai aku wa, kore o okonatte iru.
Moshi, hosshinai koto o shite iru to sureba, sore o shite iru no wa, mohaya watashi de wa naku, watashi no uchi ni yadotte iru tsumi de aru.
Soko de, zen o shiyou to hosshite iru watashi ni, aku ga hairikonde iru to iu housoku ga aru no o miru.
Sunawachi, watashi wa, uchi naru hito to shite wa kami no rippou o yorokonde iruga,
Watashi no shitai ni wa betsu no rippou ga atte, watashi no kokoro no housoku ni taishite tatakai o idomi, soshite, shitai ni sonzai suru tsumi no housoku no naka ni, watashi o toriko ni shite iru no o miru.
Watashi wa, nan to iu mijime na ningen na no darou. Dare ga, kono shi no karada kara, watashi o sukutte kurerudarou ka.
Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, kami wa kansha subeki ka na. Kono you ni shite, watashi jishin wa, kokoro de wa kami no rippou ni tsukaete iruga, niku de wa tsumi no rippou ni tsukaete iru no de aru.
Kou iu wake de, ima ya Kirisuto Iesu ni aru mono wa tsumi ni sadamerareru koto ga nai.
Naze nara, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru inochi no mitama no housoku wa, tsumi to shi to no housoku kara anata o kaihou shitakara de aru.
Rippou ga niku ni yori muryoku ni natte iru tame ni nashi enakatta koto o, kami wa nashitogete kudasatta. Sunawachi, miko o, tsumi no niku no sama de tsumi no tame ni tsukawashi, niku ni oite tsumi o basserareta no de aru.
Kore wa rippou no youkyuu ga, niku ni yorazu rei ni yotte aruku watashitachi ni oite, mitasareru tame de aru.
Naze nara, niku ni shitagau mono wa niku no koto o omoi, rei ni shitagau mono wa rei no koto o omoukara de aru.
Niku no omoi wa shi de aruga, rei no omoi wa, inochi to heian to de aru.
Naze nara, niku no omoi wa kami ni tekisurukara de aru. Sunawachi, sore wa kami no rippou ni shitagawazu, ina, shitagai enai no de aru.
Mata, niku ni aru mono wa, kami o yorokobaseru koto ga dekinai.
Shikashi, kami no mitama ga anata gata no uchi ni yadotte irunara, anata gata wa niku ni oru no de wa naku, rei ni oru no de aru. Moshi, Kirisuto no rei o motanai hito ga irunara, sono hito wa Kirisuto no mono de wa nai.
Moshi, Kirisuto ga anata gata no uchi ni orarerunara, karada wa tsumi no yue ni shinde ite mo, rei wa gi no yue ni ikite iru no de aru.
