Sore yue ni, kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa, hatasubeki sekinin o otte iru mono de aruga, niku ni shitagatte ikiru sekinin o niku ni taishite otte iru no de wa nai.
Naze nara, moshi, niku ni shitagatte ikirunara, anata gata wa shinu hoka wa naikara de aru. Shikashi, rei ni yotte kara da no hataraki o korosunara, anata gata wa ikirude arou.
Subete kami no mitama ni michibikarete iru mono wa, sunawachi, kami no ko de aru.
Anata gata wa futatabi osore o idakaseru dorei no rei o uketa no de wa naku, ko taru mibun o sazukeru rei o uketa no de aru. Sono rei ni yotte, watashitachi wa "Aba, chichi yo" to yobu no de aru.
Mitama mizukara, watashitachi no rei to tomo ni, watashitachi ga kami no ko de aru koto o akashi shite kudasaru.
Moshi ko de areba, souzokunin de mo aru. Kami no souzokunin de atte, Kirisuto to eikou o tomo ni suru tame ni kunan o mo tomo ni shite iru ijou, Kirisuto to kyoudou no souzokunin na no de aru.
Watashi wa omou. Ima no kono toki no kurushimi wa, yagate watashitachi ni arawasareyou to suru eikou ni kuraberuto, iu ni tarinai.
Hizoubutsu wa, jitsu ni, setsu naru omoi de kami no kotachi no shutsugen o machinozonde iru.
Naze nara, hizoubutsu ga kyomu ni fukushita no wa, jibun no ishi ni yoru no de wa naku, fukujuu saseta kata ni yoru no de ari,
Katsu, hizoubutsu jishin ni mo, horobi no nawame kara kaihou sarete, kami no kotachi no eikou no jiyuu ni hairu nozomi ga nokosarete irukara de aru.
Jitsu ni, hizoubutsu zentai ga, ima ni itaru made, tomo ni umeki tomo ni umi no kurushimi o tsuzukete iru koto o, watashitachi wa shitte iru.
Sore dake de wa naku, mitama no saisho no mi o motte iru watashitachi jishin mo, kokoro no uchi de umekinagara, ko taru mibun o sazukerareru koto, sunawachi, karada no aganawareru koto o machinozonde iru.
Watashitachi wa, kono nozomi ni yotte sukuwarete iru no de aru. Shikashi, me ni mieru nozomi wa nozomi de wa nai. Naze nara, genni mite iru koto o, dou shite, nao nozomu hito ga arou ka.
Moshi, watashitachi ga minai koto o nozomunara, watashitachi wa nintai shite, sore o machinozomu no de aru.
Mitama mo mata onaji you ni, yowai watashitachi o tasukete kudasaru. Naze nara, watashitachi wa dou inottara yoi ka wakaranaiga, mitama mizukara, kotoba ni arawasenai setsu naru umeki o motte, watashitachi no tame ni torinashite kudasarukara de aru.
Soshite, hito no kokoro o saguri shiru kata wa, mitama no omou tokoro ga nan de aru ka o shitte orareru. Naze nara, mitama wa, seito no tame ni, kami no mimune ni kanau torinashi o shite kudasarukara de aru.
Kami wa, kami o aisuru monotachi, sunawachi, gokeikaku ni shitagatte mesareta monotachi to tomo ni hataraite, banji o eki to naru you ni shite kudasaru koto o, watashitachi wa shitte iru.
Kami wa arakajime shitte orareru monotachi o, sarani miko no katachi ni nita mono to shiyou to shite, arakajime sadamete kudasatta. Sore wa, miko o ooku no kyoudai no naka de choushi to naraseru tame de atta.
Soshite, arakajime sadameta monotachi o sarani meshi, meshita monotachi o sarani gi to shi, gi to shita monotachi ni wa, sarani eikou o ataete kudasatta no de aru.
Sore de wa, korera no koto ni tsuite, nan to iou ka. Moshi, kami ga watashitachi no mikata de arunara, dare ga watashitachi ni tekishi eyou ka.
Gojishin no miko o sae oshimanaide, watashitachi subete no mono no tame ni shi ni watasareta kata ga, dou shite, miko nomi narazu banbutsu o mo tamawaranai koto ga arou ka.
Dare ga, kami no erabareta monotachi o uttaeru no ka. Kami wa karera o gi to sareru no de aru.
Dare ga, watashitachi o tsumi ni sadameru no ka. Kirisuto Iesu wa, shinde, ina, yomigaette, kami no migi ni zashi, mata, watashitachi no tame ni torinashite kudasaru no de aru.
Dare ga, Kirisuto no ai kara watashitachi o hanaresaseru no ka. Kannan ka, kunou ka, hakugai ka, ue ka, hadaka ka, kinan ka, tsurugi ka.
"Watashitachi wa anata no tame ni shuujitsu, shi ni sadamerarete ori, hofurareru hitsuji no you ni mirarete iru" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi o aishite kudasatta kata ni yotte, watashitachi wa, korera subete no koto ni oite kachiete amari ga aru.
Watashi wa kakushin suru. Shi mo seimo, tenshi mo shihaisha mo, genzai no mono mo shourai no mono mo, chikara aru mono mo,
Takai mono mo fukai mono mo, sono ta donna hizoubutsu mo, watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu ni okeru kami no ai kara, watashitachi o hikihanasu koto wa dekinai no de aru.
Watashi wa Kirisuto ni atte shinjitsu o kataru. Itsuwari wa iwanai. Watashi no ryoushin mo seirei ni yotte, watashi ni kou akashi o shite iru.
Sunawachi, watashi ni ookina kanashimi ga ari, watashi no kokoro ni taezaru itami ga aru.
Jissai, watashi no kyoudai, niku ni yoru douzoku no tame nara, watashi no kono mi ga norowarete, Kirisuto kara hanasarete mo itowanai.
Karera wa Isuraerubito de atte, ko taru mibun o sazukerareru koto mo, eikou mo, moromoro no keiyaku mo, rippou o sazukerareru koto mo, reihai mo, kazukazu no yakusoku mo karera no mono,
Mata fusotachi mo karera no mono de ari, niku ni yoreba Kirisuto mo mata karera kara derareta no de aru. Banbutsu no ue ni imasu kami wa, eien ni ho mubeki ka na, amen.
Shikashi, kami no kotoba ga mukou ni natta to iu wake de wa nai. Naze nara, Isuraeru kara deta mono ga zenbu Isuraeru na no de wa naku,
Mata, Aburahamu no shison dakara to itte, sono zenbu ga ko de aru no de wa naikara de aru. Kaette "Isaku kara deru mono ga, anata no shison to yobarerude arou".
Sunawachi, niku no ko ga sono mama kami no ko na no de wa naku, mushiro yakusoku no ko ga shison to shite mitomerareru no de aru.
Yakusoku no kotoba wa kou de aru. "Rainen no imagoro, watashi wa mata kuru. Soshite, Sara ni danshi ga ataerarerude arou".
Sore bakari de wa naku, hitori no hito, sunawachi, watashitachi no fuso Isaku ni yotte jutai shita Ribeka no baai mo, mata douyou de aru.
Mada kodomora ga umare mo sezu, zen mo aku mo shinai saki ni, kami no erabi no keikaku ga,
Waza ni yorazu, meshita kata ni yotte okonawareru tame ni, "Ani wa otouto ni tsukaerude arou" to, kanojo ni ooserareta no de aru.
"Watashi wa Yakobu o aishi Esau o nikunda" to kaite aru toori de aru.
De wa, watashitachi wa nan to iou ka. Kami no gawa ni fusei ga aru no ka. Danjite sou de wa nai.
Kami wa Moose ni iwareta, "Watashi wa jibun no awaremou to suru mono o awaremi, itsukushimou to suru mono o, itsukushimu".
Yue ni, sore wa ningen no ishi ya doryoku ni yoru no de wa naku, tada kami no awaremi ni yoru no de aru.
Seisho wa Paro ni kou itte iru, "Watashi ga anata o tateta no wa, kono koto no tame de aru. Sunawachi, anata ni yotte watashi no chikara o arawashi, mata, watashi no na ga zensekai ni ii hiromerareru tame de aru".
Dakara, kami wa sono awaremou to omou mono o awaremi, katakuna ni shiyou to omou mono o, katakuna ni nasaru no de aru.
Soko de, anata wa iude arou, "Naze kami wa, nao mo hito o semerareru no ka. Dare ga, kami no ito ni sakarai eyou ka".
Aa hito yo. Anata wa, kami ni ii sakarau to wa, ittai, nanimono na no ka. Tsukurareta mono ga tsukutta mono ni mukatte, "Naze, watashi o kono you ni tsukutta no ka" to iu koto ga arou ka.
Touki o tsukuru mono wa, onaji tsuchikure kara, hitotsu o tattoi utsuwa ni, hoka o iyashii utsuwa ni tsukuriageru kennou ga nai no de arou ka.
Moshi, kami ga ikari o arawashi, katsu, gojishin no chikara o shiraseyou to omowaretsutsu mo, horobiru koto ni natte iru ikari no utsuwa o, ooinaru kan'you o motte shinobareta to sureba,
Katsu, eikou ni azukaraseru tame ni, arakajime youi sareta awaremi no utsuwa ni gojishin no eikou no tomi o shiraseyou to sareta to sureba, dou de arou ka.
Kami wa, kono awaremi no utsuwa to shite, mata watashitachi o mo, Yudayajin no naka kara dake de wa naku, ihoujin no naka kara mo mesareta no de aru.
Sore wa, Hosea no sho de mo iwarete iru toori de aru, "Watashi wa, watashi no tami de nai mono o, watashi no tami to yobi, aisarenakatta mono o, aisareru mono to yobude arou.
Anata gata wa watashi no tami de wa naito, karera ni itta sono basho de, karera wa ikeru kami no kora de aruto, yobarerude arou".
Mata, Izaya wa Isuraeru ni tsuite sakende iru, "Tatoi, Isuraeru no kora no kazu wa, hama no suna no you de atte mo, sukuwareru no wa, nokosareta mono dake de arou.
Shu wa, mikotoba o kibishiku mata sumiyaka ni, chijou ni nashitogerarerude arou".
Sarani, Izaya wa yogen shita, "Moshi, bangun no Shu ga watashitachi ni shison o nokosarenakattanara, watashitachi wa Sodomu no you ni nari, Gomora to onaji you ni nattade arou".
De wa, watashitachi wa nan to iou ka. Gi o oimotomenakatta ihoujin wa, gi, sunawachi, shinkou ni yoru gi o eta.
Shikashi, gi no rippou o oimotomete ita Isuraeru wa, sono rippou ni tasshinakatta.
Naze de aru ka. Shinkou ni yoranaide, okonai ni yotte erareru ka no you ni, oimotometakara de aru. Karera wa, tsumazuki no ishi ni tsumazuita no de aru.
"Miyo, watashi wa Shion ni, tsumazuki no ishi, samatage no iwa o oku. Sore ni yori tanomu mono wa, shitsubou ni owaru koto ga nai" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi no kokoro no negai, karera no tame ni kami ni sasageru inori wa, karera ga sukuwareru koto de aru.
Watashi wa, karera ga kami ni taishite nesshin de aru koto wa akashi suruga, sono nesshin wa fukai chishiki ni yoru mono de wa nai.
Naze nara, karera wa kami no gi o shiranaide, jibun no gi o tateyou to tsutome, kami no gi ni shitagawanakattakara de aru.
Kirisuto wa, subete shinjiru mono ni gi o esaseru tame ni, rippou no owari to narareta no de aru.
Moose wa, rippou ni yoru gi o okonau hito wa, sono gi ni yotte ikiru, to kaite iru.
Shikashi, shinkou ni yoru gi wa, kou itte iru, "Anata wa kokoro no uchi de, dare ga ten ni noborude arou ka to iu na". Sore wa, Kirisuto o hikiorosu koto de aru.
Mata, "Dare ga soko shirenu tokoro ni kudarude arou ka to iu na". Sore wa, Kirisuto o shinin no naka kara hikiageru koto de aru.
De wa, nan to itte iru ka. "Kotoba wa anata no chikaku ni aru. Anata no kuchi ni ari, kokoro ni aru". Kono kotoba to wa, watashitachi ga nobetsutaete iru shinkou no kotoba de aru.
Sunawachi, jibun no kuchi de, Iesu wa Shu de aru to kokuhaku shi, jibun no kokoro de, kami ga shinin no naka kara Iesu o yomigaeraseta to shinjirunara, anata wa sukuwareru.
Naze nara, hito wa kokoro ni shinjite gi to sare, kuchi de kokuhaku shite sukuwarerukara de aru.
Seisho wa, "Subete kare o shinjiru mono wa, shitsubou ni owaru koto ga nai" to itte iru.
Yudayajin to Girishiyajin to no sabetsu wa nai. Douitsu no Shu ga banmin no Shu de atte, kare o yobimotomeru subete no hito o yutaka ni megunde kudasarukara de aru.
Naze nara, "Shu no mina o yobimotomeru mono wa, subete sukuwareru" to arukara de aru.
Shikashi, shinjita koto no nai mono o, dou shite yobimotomeru koto ga arou ka. Kiita koto no nai mono o, dou shite shinjiru koto ga arou ka. Nobetsutaeru mono ga inakute wa, dou shite kiku koto ga arou ka.
Tsukawasarenakute wa, dou shite nobetsutaeru koto ga arou ka. "Aa, uruwashii ka na, yoki otozure o tsugeru mono no ashi wa" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Shikashi, subete no hito ga fukuin ni kikishitagatta no de wa nai. Izaya wa, "Shu yo, dare ga watashitachi kara kiita koto o shinjimashita ka" to itte iru.
Shitagatte, shinkou wa kiku koto ni yoru no de ari, kiku koto wa Kirisuto no kotoba kara kuru no de aru.
Shikashi watashi wa iu, karera ni wa kikoenakatta no de arou ka. Ina, mushiro "Sono koe wa zenchi ni hibiki watari, sono kotoba wa sekai no hate ni made oyonda".
Nao, watashi wa iu, Isuraeru wa shiranakatta no de arou ka. Mazu Moose wa itte iru, "Watashi wa anata gata ni, kokumin de nai mono ni taishite netami o okosase, muchi na kokumin ni taishite, ikari o idakaserude arou".
Izaya mo daitan ni itte iru, "Watashi wa, watashi o motomenai monotachi ni miidasare, watashi o tazunenai mono ni, jibun o arawashita".
Soshite, Isuraeru ni tsuite wa, "Watashi wa fukujuu sezu ni hankou suru tami ni, shuujitsu watashi no te o sashinobete ita" to itte iru.
Soko de, watashi wa tou, "Kami wa sono tami o suteta no de arou ka". Danjite sou de wa nai. Watashi mo Isuraeruhito de ari, Aburahamu no shison, Beniyaminzoku no mono de aru.
Kami wa, arakajime shitte orareta sono tami o, suteru koto wa sarenakatta. Seisho ga Eriya ni tsuite nan to itte iru ka, anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Sunawachi, kare wa Isuraeru o kami ni uttaete kou itta.
"Shu yo, karera wa anata no yogensha tachi o koroshi, anata no saidan o ko bo chi, soshite, watashi hitori ga torinokosareta no ni, karera wa watashi no inochi o mo motomete imasu".
Shikashi, kare ni taisuru mitsuge wa nan de atta ka, "Baaru ni hiza o kagamenakatta nanasennin o, watashi no tame ni nokoshite oita".
Sore to onaji you ni, ima no toki ni mo, megumi no erabi ni yotte nokosareta mono ga iru.
Shikashi, megumi ni yoru no de areba, mohaya okonai ni yoru no de wa nai. Sou de naito, megumi wa mohaya megumi de naku narukara de aru.
De wa, dou naru no ka. Isuraeru wa sono oimotomete iru mono o enaide, tada erabareta mono ga, sore o eta. Soshite, ta no monotachi wa katakuna ni natta.
"Kami wa, karera ni nibui kokoro to, mienai me to, kikoenai mimi to o ataete, kyou, kono hi ni oyonde iru" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Dabide mo mata itte iru, "Karera no shokutaku wa, karera no wana to nare, ami to nare, tsumazuki to nare, houfuku to nare.
Karera no me wa, kurande mienaku nare, karera no se wa, itsu made mo magatte ore".
Soko de, watashi wa tou, "Karera ga tsumazuita no wa, taoreru tame de atta no ka". Danjite sou de wa nai. Kaette, karera no zaika ni yotte, sukui ga ihoujin ni oyobi, sore ni yotte Isuraeru o funki saseru tame de aru.
Shikashi, moshi, karera no zaika ga yo no tomi to nari, karera no shippai ga ihoujin no tomi to natta to sureba, mashite karera ga zenbu sukuwaretanara, donna ni ka subarashii koto de arou.
Soko de watashi wa, anata gata ihoujin ni iu. Watashi jishin wa ihoujin no shito na no de arukara, watashi no tsutome o kouei to shi,
Dou ni ka shite watashi no kotsuniku o funki sase, karera no ikunin ka o sukuou to negatte iru.
Moshi karera no suterareta koto ga yo no wakai to natta to sureba, karera no ukeirerareru koto wa, shinin no naka kara ikikaeru koto de wa nai ka.
Moshi, mugiko no hatsuho ga kiyokereba, sono katamari mo kiyoi. Moshi ne ga kiyokereba, sono eda mo kiyoi.
Shikashi, moshi aru eda ga kirisararete, yasei no oribu de aru anata ga sore ni tsugare, oribu no ne no yutaka na youbun ni azukatte iru to sureba,
Anata wa sono eda ni taishite hokotte wa naranai. Tatoe hokoru to shite mo, anata ga ne o sasaete iru no de wa naku, ne ga anata o sasaete iru no de aru.
Suruto, anata wa, "Eda ga kirisarareta no wa, watashi ga tsugareru tame de atta" to iude arou.
Masani, sono toori de aru. Karera wa fushinkou no yue ni kirisarare, anata wa shinkou no yue ni tatte iru no de aru. Takabutta omoi o idakanaide, mushiro osore nasai.
Moshi kami ga motoki no eda o oshimanakatta to sureba, anata o oshimu you na koto wa naide arou.
Kami no jiai to shungen to o miyo. Kami no shungen wa taoreta monotachi ni mukerare, kami no jiai wa, moshi anata ga sono jiai ni todomatte irunara, anata ni mukerareru. Sou de naito, anata mo kiritorarerude arou.
Shikashi karera mo, fushinkou o tsuzukenakereba, tsugarerude arou. Kami ni wa karera o futatabi tsugu chikara ga aru.
Naze nara, moshi anata ga shizen no mama no yasei no oribu kara kiritorare, shizen no seishitsu ni hanshite yoi oribu ni tsugareta to sureba, mashite, korera shizen no mama no yoi eda wa, motto tayasuku, moto no oribu ni tsugarenaide arou ka.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ga chisha da to jifu suru koto no nai tame ni, kono okugi o shiranaide ite moraitaku nai. Ichibu no Isuraerubito ga katakuna ni natta no wa, ihoujin ga zenbu sukuwareru ni itaru toki made no koto de atte,
Kou shite, Isuraerubito wa, subete sukuwarerude arou. Sunawachi, tsugi no you ni kaite aru, "Sukuu mono ga Shion kara kite, Yakobu kara fushinjin o oiharaude arou.
Soshite, kore ga, karera no tsumi o nozokisaru toki ni, karera ni taishite tateru watashi no keiyaku de aru".
Fukuin ni tsuite ieba, karera wa, anata gata no yue ni, kami no teki to sarete iruga, erabi ni tsuite ieba, fusotachi no yue ni, kami ni aiserareru mono de aru.
Kami no tamamono to meshi to wa, kaerareru koto ga nai.
Anata ga taga, katsute wa kami ni fujuujun de attaga, ima wa karera no fujuujun ni yotte awaremi o uketa you ni,
Karera mo ima wa fujuujun ni natte iruga, sore wa, anata gata no uketa awaremi ni yotte, karera jishin mo ima awaremi o ukeru tame na no de aru.
Sunawachi, kami wa subete no hito o awaremu tame ni, subete no hito o fujuujun no naka ni tojikometa no de aru.
Aa fukai ka na, kami no chie to chishiki to no tomi wa. Sono sabaki wa kiwamegataku, sono michi wa hakarigatai.
"Dare ga, Shu no kokoro o shitte ita ka. Dare ga, Shu no keikaku ni azukatta ka.
Mata, dare ga, mazu Shu ni ataete, sono mukui o ukerude arou ka".
Banbutsu wa, kami kara ide, kami ni yotte nari, kami ni kisuru no de aru. Eikou ga tokoshie ni kami ni aru you ni, amen.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Sou iu wake de, kami no awaremi ni yotte anata gata ni susumeru. Anata gata no karada o, kami ni yorokobareru, ikita, sei naru sonaemono to shite sasage nasai. Sore ga, anata gata no nasubeki reiteki na reihai de aru.
Anata gata wa, konoyo to dakyou shite wa naranai. Mushiro, kokoro o arata ni suru koto ni yotte, tsukurikaerare, nani ga kami no mimune de aru ka, nani ga zen de atte, kami ni yorokobare, katsu mattaki koto de aru ka o, wakimaeshirubekide aru.
Watashi wa, jibun ni ataerareta megumi ni yotte, anata gata hitoribitori ni iu. Omoubeki gendo o koete omoiagaru koto naku, mushiro, kami ga kakuji ni wakeataerareta shinkou no hakari ni shitagatte, tsutsushimifukaku omoubekide aru.
Naze nara, hitotsu no karada ni takusan no shitai ga aruga, sorera no shitai ga mina onaji hataraki o shite wa inai you ni,
Watashitachi mo kazu wa ooiga, Kirisuto ni atte hitotsu no karada de ari, mata kakuji wa tagai ni shitai dakara de aru.
Kono you ni, watashitachi wa ataerareta megumi ni yotte, sorezore kotonatta tamamono o motte iru no de, moshi, sore ga yogen de areba, shinkou no teido ni oujite yogen o shi,
Houshi de areba houshi o shi, mata oshieru mono de areba oshie,
Susume o suru mono de areba susume, kifu suru mono wa oshiminaku kifu shi, shidou suru mono wa nesshin ni shidou shi, jizen o suru mono wa kokoroyoku jizen o subekide aru.
Ai ni wa itsuwari ga atte wa naranai. Aku wa nikumi shirizoke, zen ni wa shitashimi musubi,
Kyoudai no ai o motte tagai ni itsukushimi, susunde tagai ni sonkei shi ai nasai.
Nesshin de, umu koto naku, rei ni moe, Shu ni tsukae,
Nozomi o idaite yorokobi, kannan ni tae, tsune ni inori nasai.
Mazushii seito o tasuke, tsutomete tabibito o motenashi nasai.
Anatagata o hakugai suru mono o shukufuku shi nasai. Shukufuku shite, norotte wa naranai.
Yorokobu mono to tomo ni yorokobi, naku mono to tomo ni naki nasai.
Tagai ni omou koto o hitotsu ni shi, takabutta omoi o idakazu, kaette hikui monotachi to majiwaru ga yoi. Jibun ga chisha da to omoiagatte wa naranai.
Dare ni taishite mo aku o motte aku ni mukuizu, subete no hito ni taishite zen o hakari nasai.
Anata gata wa, dekiru kagiri subete no hito to heiwa ni sugoshi nasai.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Jibun de fukushuu o shinaide, mushiro, kami no ikari ni makase nasai. Naze nara, "Shu ga iwareru. Fukushuu wa watashi no suru koto de aru. Watashi jishin ga houfuku suru" to kaite arukara de aru.
Mushiro, "Moshi anata no teki ga uerunara, kare ni kuwase, kawakunara, kare ni nomase nasai. Sou suru koto ni yotte, anata wa kare no atama ni moesakaru sumibi o tsumu koto ni naru no de aru".
Aku ni makete wa ikenai. Kaette, zen o motte aku ni kachi nasai.
Subete no hito wa, ue ni tatsu ken'i ni shitagaubekide aru. Naze nara, kami ni yoranai ken'i wa naku, ooyoso sonzai shite iru ken'i wa, subete kami ni yotte taterareta mono dakara de aru.
Shitagatte, ken'i ni sakarau mono wa, kami no sadame ni somuku mono de aru. Somuku mono wa, jibun no mi ni sabaki o maneku koto ni naru.
Ittai, shihaisha tachi wa, zenji o suru mono ni wa kyoufu de naku, akuji o suru mono ni koso kyoufu de aru. Anata wa ken'i o osorenai koto o negau no ka. Sore de wa, zenji o suru ga yoi. Sou sureba, kare kara homerarerude arou.
Kare wa, anata ni eki o ataeru tame no kami no shimobe na no de aru. Shikashi, moshi anata ga akuji o sureba, osorenakereba naranai. Kare wa itazura ni ken o obite iru no de wa nai. Kare wa kami no shimobe de atte, akuji o okonau mono ni taishite wa, ikari o motte mukuirukara de aru.
Dakara, tada ikari o nogareru tame dake de wa naku, ryoushin no tame ni mo shitagaubekide aru.
Anata gata ga mitsugi o osameru no mo, mata onaji riyuu kara de aru. Karera wa kami ni tsukaeru mono to shite, moppara kono tsutome ni tazusawatte iru no de aru.
Anata gata wa, karera subete ni taishite, gimu o hatashi nasai. Sunawachi, mitsugi o osame mubeki mono ni wa mitsugi o osame, zei o osame mubeki mono ni wa zei o osame, osorubeki mono wa osore, uyamaubeki mono wa uyamai nasai.
Tagai ni aishiau koto no soto wa, nanibito ni mo kari ga atte wa naranai. Hito o aisuru mono wa, rippou o mattou suru no de aru.
"Kan'in suru na, korosu na, nusumu na, musaboru na" nado, sono hoka ni, donna imashime ga atte mo, kekkyoku "Jibun o aisuru you ni anata no tonarihito o aiseyo" to iu kono kotoba ni kisuru.
Ai wa tonarihito ni gai o kuwaeru koto wa nai. Dakara, ai wa rippou o kansei suru mono de aru.
Nao, anata gata wa toki o shitte iru no dakara, tokuni, kono koto o hagemaneba naranai. Sunawachi, anata gata no nemuri kara samerubeki toki ga, sudeni kite iru. Naze nara ima wa, watashitachi no sukui ga, hajime shinjita toki yori mo, motto chikazuite irukara de aru.
Yo wa fuke, hi ga chikazuite iru. Sore dakara, watashitachi wa, yami no waza o sutete, hikari no bugu o tsukeyoude wa nai ka.
Soshite, enraku to deisui, inran to koushoku, arasoi to netami o sutete, hiru aruku you ni, tsutsumashiku arukoude wa nai ka.
Anata gata wa, Shu Iesu Kirisuto o ki nasai. Niku no yoku o mitasu koto ni kokoro o mukete wa naranai.
Shinkou no yowai mono o ukeire nasai. Tada, iken o hihyou suru tame de atte wa naranai.
Aru hito wa, nani o tabete mo sashitsukaenai to shinjite iruga, yowai hito wa yasai dake o taberu.
Taberu mono wa tabenai mono o karonjite wa narazu, tabenai mono mo taberu mono o sabaite wa naranai. Kami wa kare o ukeirete kudasatta no de arukara.
Tanin no shimobe o sabaku anata wa, ittai, nanimono de aru ka. Kare ga tatsu no mo taoreru no mo, sono shujin ni yoru no de aru. Shikashi, kare wa tatsu you ni naru. Shu wa kare o tataseru koto ga dekirukara de aru.
Mata, aru hito wa, kono hi ga kano hi yori mo daiji de aru to kangae, hoka no hito wa dono hi mo onaji da to kangaeru. Kakuji wa sorezore kokoro no naka de, kakushin o motte orubekide aru.
Hi o omonjiru mono wa, Shu no tame ni omonjiru. Mata taberu mono mo Shu no tame ni taberu. Kami ni kansha shite taberukara de aru. Tabenai mono mo Shu no tame ni tabenai. Soshite, kami ni kansha suru.
Sunawachi, watashitachi no uchi, dare hitori jibun no tame ni ikiru mono wa naku, dare hitori jibun no tame ni shinu mono wa nai.
Watashitachi wa, ikiru no mo Shu no tame ni iki, shinu no mo Shu no tame ni shinu. Dakara, ikiru ni shite mo shinu ni shite mo, watashitachi wa Shu no mono na no de aru.
Naze nara, Kirisuto wa, shisha to seisha to no Shu to naru tame ni, shinde ikikaeraretakara de aru.
Sore da no ni, anata wa, naze kyoudai o sabaku no ka. Anata wa, naze kyoudai o karonjiru no ka. Watashitachi wa mina, kami no sabaki no za no mae ni tatsu no de aru.
Sunawachi, "Shu ga iwareru. Watashi wa ikite iru. Subete no hiza wa, watashi ni taishite kagami, subete no shita wa, kami nisan bi o sasagerude arou" to kaite aru.
Dakara, watashitachi hitoribitori wa, kami ni taishite jibun no ii hiraki o subekide aru.
Sore yue, kongo watashitachi wa, tagai ni sabaki au koto o yameyou. Mushiro, anata gata wa, samatage to naru mono ya, tsumazuki to naru mono o kyoudai no mae ni okanai koto ni, kimeru ga yoi.
Watashi wa, Shu Iesu ni atte shiri katsu kakushin shite iru. Sore jitai, kegarete iru mono wa hitotsu mo nai. Tada, sore ga kegarete iru to kangaeru hito ni dake, kegarete iru no de aru.
Moshi shokumotsu no yue ni kyoudai o kurushimerunara, anata wa, mohaya ai ni yotte aruite iru no de wa nai. Anata no shokumotsu ni yotte, kyoudai o horoboshite wa naranai. Kirisuto wa kare no tame ni mo, shinareta no de aru.
Sore dakara, anata gata ni totte yoi koto ga, soshiri no tane ni naranu you ni shi nasai.
Kami no kuni wa inshoku de wa naku, gi to, heiwa to, seirei ni okeru yorokobi to de aru.
Kou shite Kirisuto ni tsukaeru mono wa, kami ni yorokobare, katsu, hito ni mo ukeirerareru no de aru.
Kou iu wake de, heiwa ni yakudatsu koto ya, tagai no toku o takameru koto o, oimotomeyoude wa nai ka.
Shokumotsu no koto de, kami no miwaza o hakai shite wa naranai. Subete no mono wa kiyoi. Tada, sore o tabete hito o tsumazukaseru mono ni wa, aku to naru.
Niku o kuwazu, sake o nomazu, sono hoka kyoudai o tsumazukasenai no wa, yoi koto de aru.
Anata no motte iru shinkou o, kami no mimae ni, jibun jishin ni motte i nasai. Mizukara yoi to sadameta koto ni tsuite, yamashii to omowanai hito wa, saiwai de aru.
Shikashi, utagainagara taberu mono wa, shinkou ni yoranaikara, tsumi ni sadamerareru. Subete shinkou ni yoranai koto wa, tsumi de aru.
Watashitachi tsuyoi mono wa, tsuyoku nai monotachi no yowasa o ninaubekide atte, jibun dake o yorokobaseru koto o shite wa naranai.
Watashitachi hitoribitori wa, tonarihito no toku o takameru tame ni, sono eki o hakatte karera o yorokobasubekide aru.
Kirisuto sae, gojishin o yorokobaseru koto wa nasaranakatta. Mushiro "Anata o soshiru mono no soshiriga, watashi ni furikakatta" to kaite aru toori de atta.
Kore made ni kakareta kotogara wa, subete watashitachi no oshie no tame ni kakareta no de atte, sore wa seisho no ataeru nintai to nagusame to ni yotte, nozomi o idakaseru tame de aru.
Dou ka, nintai to nagusame to no kami ga, anata gata ni, Kirisuto Iesu ni naratte tagai ni onaji omoi o idakase,
Kou shite, kokoro o hitotsu ni shi, koe o awasete, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chichi naru kami o agamesasete kudasaru you ni.
Kou iu wake de, Kirisuto mo watashitachi o ukeirete kudasatta you ni, anata gata mo tagai ni ukeirete, kami no eikou o arawasubekide aru.
Watashi wa iu, Kirisuto wa kami no shinjitsu o akiraka ni suru tame ni, katsurei no aru mono no shimobe to narareta. Sore wa fusotachi no uketa yakusoku o hoshou suru to tomo ni,
Ihoujin mo awaremi o ukete kami o agameru you ni naru tame de aru, "Sore yue, watashi wa, ihoujin no naka de anata nisan bi o sasage, mata, mina o home utau" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Mata, kou itte iru, "Ihoujin yo, Shu no tami to tomo ni yorokobe".
Mata, "Subete no ihoujin yo, Shu o home matsure. Moromoro no tami yo, Shu o hometataeyo".
Mata Izaya wa itte iru, "Essai no ne kara me ga dete, ihoujin o osameru tame ni tachiagaru mono ga kuru. Ihoujin wa kare ni nozomi o okude arou".
Dou ka, nozomi no kami ga, shinkou kara kuru arayuru yorokobi to heian to o, anata gata ni mitashi, seirei no chikara ni yotte, anatagata o, nozomi ni afuresasete kudasaru you ni.
Sate, watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata jishin ga, zen'i ni afure, arayuru chie ni mitasare, soshite tagai ni kunkai shi au chikara no aru koto o, watashi wa kataku shinjite iru.
Shikashi, watashi wa anata gata no kioku o arata ni suru tame ni, tokorodokoro, kanari omoikitte kaita. Sore wa, kami kara watashi ni tamawatta megumi ni yotte, kaita no de aru.
Kono you ni megumi o uketa no wa, watashi ga ihoujin no tame ni Kirisuto Iesu ni tsukaeru mono to nari, kami no fukuin no tame ni saishi no yaku o tsutome, kou shite ihoujin o, seirei ni yotte kiyomerareta, mimune ni kanau sasagemono to suru tame de aru.
Dakara, watashi wa kami e no houshi ni tsuite wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte hokori uru no de aru.
Watashi wa, ihoujin o juujun ni suru tame ni, Kirisuto ga watashi o mochiite, kotoba to waza,
Shirushi to fushigi to no chikara, seirei no chikara ni yotte, hatarakasete kudasatta koto no hoka ni wa, aete nani mo katarou to wa omowanai. Kou shite, watashi wa Erusaremu kara hajimari, megurimegutte Iruriko ni itaru made, Kirisuto no fukuin o mitashite kita.
Sono sai, watashi no setsuni nozonda tokoro wa, tanin no dodai no ue ni tateru koto o shinaide, Kirisuto no mina ga mada tonaerarete inai tokoro ni fukuin o nobetsutaeru koto de atta.
Sunawachi, "Kare no koto o nobetsutaerarete inakatta hitobito ga mi, kiite inakatta hitobito ga satorude arou" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Kou iu wake de, watashi wa anata gata no tokoro ni iku koto o, tabitabi samatagerarete kita.
Shikashi ima de wa, kono chihou ni wa mohaya hataraku yochi ga naku, katsu Isupaniya ni omomuku baai, anata gata no tokoro ni iku koto o, tanen, netsubou shite ita no de, - -
Sono tochuu anata gata ni ai, mazu ikubun de mo watashi no negai ga anata gata ni yotte mitasaretara, anata gata ni okurarete soko e iku koto o, nozonde iru no de aru.
Shikashi ima no baai, seitotachi ni tsukaeru tame ni, watashi wa Erusaremu ni ikou to shite iru.
Naze nara, Makedoniya to Akaya to no hitobito wa, Erusaremu ni oru seito no naka no mazushii hitobito o enjo suru koto ni sansei shitakara de aru.
Tashika ni, karera wa sansei shita. Shikashi douji ni, karera wa kano hitobito ni fusai ga aru. To iu no wa, moshi ihoujin ga karera no rei no mono ni azukatta to sureba, niku no mono o motte karera ni tsukaeru no wa, touzen dakara de aru.
Soko de watashi wa, kono shigoto o sumasete karera ni kono mi o tewatashita nochi, anata gata no tokoro o tootte, Isupaniya ni ikou to omou.
Soshite anata gata no tokoro ni yuku toki ni wa, Kirisuto no michiafureru shukufuku o motte yuku koto to, shinjite iru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yori, katsu mitama no ai ni yotte, anata gata ni onegai suru. Dou ka, tomo ni chikara o tsukushite, watashi no tame ni kami ni inotte hoshii.
Sunawachi, watashi ga Yudaya ni oru fushin no to kara sukuware, soshite Erusaremu ni taisuru watashi no houshi ga seitotachi ni ukeirerareru mono to naru you ni,
Mata, kami no mimune ni yori, yorokobi o motte anata gata no tokoro ni iki, tomo ni nagusame au koto ga dekiru you ni inotte moraitai.
Dou ka, heiwa no kami ga anata gata ichidou to tomo ni imasu you ni, amen.
Kenkureya ni aru kyoukai no shitsuji, watashitachi no shimai Fibe o, anata gata ni shoukai suru.
Dou ka, seito taru ni fusawashiku, Shu ni atte kanojo o mukae, soshite, kanojo ga anata gata ni shite moraitai koto ga areba, nanigoto de mo, tasukete agete hoshii. Kanojo wa ooku no hito no enjosha de ari, mata watashi jishin no enjosha de mo atta.
Kirisuto Iesu ni aru watashi no dourousha Purisuka to Akura to ni, yoroshiku itte hoshii.
Karera wa, watashi no inochi o sukuu tame ni, jibun no kubi o sae sashidashite kureta no de aru. Karera ni taishite wa, watashi dake de wa naku, ihoujin no subete no kyoukai mo, kansha shite iru.
Mata, karera no ie no kyoukai ni mo, yoroshiku. Watashi no aisuru Epaneto ni, yoroshiku itte hoshii. Kare wa, Kirisuto ni sasagerareta Ajiya no hatsuho de aru.
Anata gata no tame ni hitokata narazu rouku shita Mariya ni, yoroshiku itte hoshii.
Watashi no douzoku de atte, watashi to issho ni tougoku sareta koto no aru Anderoniko to Yuniasu to ni, yoroshiku. Karera wa shitotachi no aida de hyouban ga yoku, katsu, watashi yori mo saki ni Kirisuto o shinjita hitobito de aru.
Shu ni atte aisuru Amupuriato ni, yoroshiku.
Kirisuto ni aru watashitachi no dourousha Urubano to, aisuru Sutakisu to ni, yoroshiku.
Kirisuto ni atte rentatsu naa Pere ni, yoroshiku. Arisutoburo no ie no hitotachi ni, yoroshiku.
Douzoku no Herodeon ni, yoroshiku. Narukiso no ie no, Shu ni aru hitotachi ni, yoroshiku.
Shu ni atte rouku shite iru Tsurupana to Tsuruposa to ni, yoroshiku. Shu ni atte hitokata narazu rouku shita aisuru Perushisu ni, yoroshiku.
Shu ni atte erabareta Ruposuto, kare no haha to ni, yoroshiku. Kare no haha wa, watashi no haha de mo aru.
Asunkurito, Furegon, Herumesu, Patoroba, Herumasu oyobi karera to issho ni iru kyoudaitachi ni, yoroshiku.
Pirorogo to Yuriya to ni, mata Nereo to sono shimai to ni, Orunpa ni, mata karera to issho ni iru subete no seitotachi ni, yoroshiku itte hoshii.
Kiyoi seppun o motte, tagai ni aisatsu o kawashi nasai. Kirisuto no subete no kyoukai kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Sate kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ni kankoku suru. Anata gata ga mananda oshie ni somuite bunretsu o hikiokoshi, tsumazuki o ataeru hitobito o keikai shi, katsu karera kara toozakaru ga yoi.
Naze nara, kou shita hitobito wa, watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto ni tsukaenaide, jibun no hara ni tsukae, soshite kangen to biji to o motte, junboku na hitobito no kokoro o azamuku monodomo dakara de aru.
Anata gata no juujun wa, subete no hitobito no mimi ni tasshite ori, sore o anata gata no tame ni yorokonde iru. Shikashi, watashi no negau tokoro wa, anata gata ga zen ni satoku, aku ni wa, utoku atte hoshii koto de aru.
Heiwa no kami wa, Satan o sumiyaka ni anata gata no ashi no shita ni fumikudakude arou. Dou ka, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Watashi no dourousha Temote oyobi douzoku no Rukio, Yason, Soshipatero kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
(kono tegami o hikki shita watashi Teruteo mo, Shu ni atte anata gata ni aisatsu no kotoba o okuru.)
Watashi to zenkyoukai to no yanushi Gaio kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku. Shi no kaikei gakari Erasuto to kyoudai Kuwaruto kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku. []
Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata ichidou to tomo ni aru you ni, amen.]
[25-26] Negawaku wa, watashi no fukuin to Iesu Kirisuto no senkyou to ni yori, katsu, nagaki yoyo ni watatte, kakusarete itaga, ima ya arawasare, yogen no sho o tooshite, eien no kami no meirei ni shitagai, shinkou no juujun ni itaraseru tame ni, moromoro no kunihito ni tsugeshirasareta okugi no keiji ni yotte, anatagata o chikarazukeru koto no dekiru kata,
[25-26] Negawaku wa, watashi no fukuin to Iesu Kirisuto no senkyou to ni yori, katsu, nagaki yoyo ni watatte, kakusarete itaga, ima ya arawasare, yogen no sho o tooshite, eien no kami no meirei ni shitagai, shinkou no juujun ni itaraseru tame ni, moromoro no kunihito ni tsugeshirasareta okugi no keiji ni yotte, anatagata o chikarazukeru koto no dekiru kata,
Sunawachi, yuiitsu no chie fukaki kami ni, Iesu Kirisuto ni yori, eikou ga eien yori eien ni aru you ni, amen.
Kami no mimune ni yori mesarete Kirisuto Iesu no shito to natta Pauro to, kyoudai Sosutene kara,
Korinto ni aru kami no kyoukai, sunawachi, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no mina o itarutokoro de yobimotomete iru subete no hitobito to tomo ni, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte kiyomerare, seito to shite mesareta katagata e. Kono Kirisuto wa, watashitachi no Shu de ari, mata karera no Shu de arareru.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Watashi wa, anata gata ga Kirisuto Iesu ni atte ataerareta kami no megumi o omotte, itsu mo kami ni kansha shite iru.
Anata gata wa Kirisuto ni atte, subete no koto ni, sunawachi, subete no kotoba ni mo subete no chishiki ni mo megumare,
Kirisuto no tame no akashi ga, anata gata no uchi ni tashika na mono to sare,
Kou shite, anata gata wa megumi no tamamono ni isasaka mo kakeru koto ga naku, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no arawareru no o machinozonde iru.
Shu mo mata, anatagata o saigo made kataku sasaete, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no hi ni, semerareru tokoro no nai mono ni shite kudasarude arou.
Kami wa shinjitsu na kata de aru. Anata gata wa kami ni yotte mesare, miko, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto to no majiwari ni, hairasete itadaita no de aru.
Sate kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte, anata gata ni susumeru. Mina kataru koto o hitotsu ni shi, otagai no aida ni bunsou ga nai you ni shi, onaji kokoro, onaji omoi ni natte, kataku musubiatte ite hoshii.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Jitsu wa, Kuroe no ie no monotachi kara, anata gata no aida ni arasoi ga aru to kikasarete iru.
Hakkiri iuto, anata gata ga sorezore, "Watashi wa Pauro ni tsuku" "Watashi wa Aporo ni" "Watashi wa Kepa ni" "Watashi wa Kirisuto ni" to iiatte iru koto de aru.
Kirisuto wa, ikutsu ni mo wakerareta no ka. Pauro wa, anata gata no tame ni juujika ni tsukerareta koto ga aru no ka. Sore to mo, anata gata wa, Pauro no na ni yotte baputesuma o uketa no ka.
Watashi wa kansha shite iruga, Kurisupo to Gaioigai ni wa, anata gata no uchi no dare ni mo, baputesuma o sazuketa koto ga nai.
Sore wa anata gata ga watashi no na ni yotte baputesuma o uketa no dato, dare ni mo iwareru koto no nai tame de aru.
Mottomo, Sutepana no ie no monotachi ni wa, baputesuma o sazuketa koto ga aru. Shikashi, sono hoka ni wa, dare ni mo sazuketa oboe ga nai.
Ittai, Kirisuto ga watashi o tsukawasareta no wa, baputesuma o sazukeru tame de wa naku, fukuin o nobetsutaeru tame de ari, shikamo chie no kotoba o mochiizu ni nobetsutaeru tame de atta. Sore wa, Kirisuto no juujika ga muryoku na mono ni natte shimawanai tame na no de aru.
Juujika no kotoba wa, horobi iku mono ni wa oroka de aruga, sukui ni azukaru watashitachi ni wa, kami no chikara de aru.
Sunawachi, seisho ni, "Watashi wa chisha no chie o horoboshi, kashikoi mono no kashikosa o munashii mono ni suru" to kaite aru.
Chisha wa doko ni iru ka. Gakusha wa doko ni iru ka. Konoyo no ronsha wa doko ni iru ka. Kami wa konoyo no chie o, oroka ni saretade wa nai ka.
Konoyo wa, jibun no chie ni yotte kami o mitomeru ni itaranakatta. Sore wa, kami no chie ni kanatte iru. Soko de kami wa, senkyou no orokasa ni yotte, shinjiru mono o sukuu koto to sareta no de aru.
Yudayajin wa shirushi o koi, Girishiyajin wa chie o motomeru.
Shikashi watashitachi wa, juujika ni tsukerareta Kirisuto o nobetsutaeru. Kono Kirisuto wa, Yudayajin ni wa tsumazukaseru mono, ihoujin ni wa oroka na mono de aruga,
Mesareta mono jishin ni totte wa, Yudayajin ni mo Girishiyajin ni mo, kami no chikara, kami no chie taru Kirisuto na no de aru.
Kami no orokasa wa hito yori mo kashikoku, kami no yowasa wa hito yori mo tsuyoikara de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ga mesareta toki no koto o kangaete miru ga yoi. Ningenteki ni wa, chie no aru mono ga ooku wa naku, kenryoku no aru mono mo ooku wa naku, mibun no takai mono mo ooku wa inai.
Sore da no ni kami wa, chisha o hazukashimeru tame ni, konoyo no oroka na mono o erabi, tsuyoi mono o hazukashimeru tame ni, konoyo no yowai mono o erabi,
Yuuryoku na mono o muryoku na mono ni suru tame ni, konoyo de mibun no hikui mono ya karonjirarete iru mono, sunawachi, naki ni hitoshii mono o, aete erabareta no de aru.
Sore wa, donna ningen de mo, kami no mimae ni hokoru koto ga nai tame de aru.
Anata gata ga Kirisuto Iesu ni aru no wa, kami ni yoru no de aru. Kirisuto wa kami ni taterarete, watashitachi no chie to nari, gi to sei to a ga nai to ni narareta no de aru.
Sore wa, "Hokoru mono wa Shu o hokore" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi mo mata, anata gata no tokoro ni itta toki, kami no akashi o nobetsutaeru no ni, sugureta kotoba ya chie o mochiinakatta.
Naze nara, watashi wa Iesu Kirisuto, shikamo juujika ni tsukerareta Kirisuto igai no koto wa, anata gata no aida de wa nani mo shirumaito, kesshin shitakara de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni itta toki ni wa, yowaku katsu osore, hidoku fuan de atta.
Soshite, watashi no kotoba mo watashi no senkyou mo, takumi na chie no kotoba ni yoranaide, rei to chikara to no shoumei ni yotta no de aru.
Sore wa, anata gata no shinkou ga hito no chie ni yoranaide, kami no chikara ni yoru mono to naru tame de atta.
Shikashi watashitachi wa, enjuku shite iru mono no aida de wa, chie o kataru. Kono chie wa, konoyo no mono no chie de wa naku, konoyo no horobi iku shihaisha tachi no chie de mo nai.
Mushiro, watashitachi ga kataru no wa, kakusareta okugi to shite no kami no chie de aru. Sore wa kami ga, watashitachi no ukeru eikou no tame ni, yo no hajimaranu saki kara, arakajime sadamete okareta mono de aru.
Konoyo no shihaisha tachi no uchi de, kono chie o shitte ita mono wa, hitori mo inakatta. Moshi shitte itanara, eikou no Shu o juujika ni tsuke wa shinakattade arou.
Shikashi, seisho ni kaite aru to ori, "Me ga mada mizu, mimi ga mada kikazu, hito no kokoro ni omoiukabi mo shinakatta koto o, kami wa, gojibun o aisuru monotachi no tame ni sonaerareta" no de aru.
Soshite, sore o kami wa, mitama ni yotte watashitachi ni keiji shite kudasatta no de aru. Mitama wa subete no mono o kiwame, kami no fukami made mo kiwameru no dakara de aru.
Ittai, ningen no omoi wa, sono uchi ni aru ningen no rei igai ni, dare ga shitte iyou ka. Sore to onaji you ni kami no omoi mo, kami no mitama igai ni wa, shiru mono wa nai.
Tokoro ga, watashitachi ga uketa no wa, konoyo no rei de wa naku, kami kara no rei de aru. Sore ni yotte, kami kara tamawatta megumi o satoru tame de aru.
Kono tamamono ni tsuite kataru ni mo, watashitachi wa ningen no chie ga oshieru kotoba o mochiinaide, mitama no oshieru kotoba o mochii, rei ni yotte rei no koto o kaishaku suru no de aru.
Umarenagara no hito wa, kami no mitama no tamamono o ukeirenai. Sore wa kare ni wa oroka na mono dakara de aru. Mata, mitama ni yotte handan sarerubekide arukara, kare wa sore o rikai suru koto ga dekinai.
Shikashi, rei no hito wa, subete no mono o handan suruga, jibun jishin wa dare kara mo handan sareru koto wa nai.
"Dare ga Shu no omoi o shitte, kare o oshieru koto ga dekiyou ka". Shikashi, watashitachi wa Kirisuto no omoi o motte iru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi wa anata gata ni wa, rei no hito ni taisuru you ni hanasu koto ga dekizu, mushiro, niku ni zokusuru mono, sunawachi, Kirisuto ni aru osanago ni hanasu you ni hanashita.
Anata gata ni chichi o nomasete, katai shokumotsu wa ataenakatta. Taberu chikara ga, mada anata gata ni nakattakara de aru. Ima ni natte mo sono chikara ga nai.
Anata gata wa mada, niku no hito dakara de aru. Anata gata no aida ni, netami ya arasoi ga aru no wa, anata gata ga niku no hito de atte, futsuu no ningen no you ni aruite iru tame de wa nai ka.
Sunawachi, aru hito wa "Watashi wa Pauro ni" to ii, hoka no hito wa "Watashi wa Aporo ni" to itte iru you de wa, anata gata wa futsuu no ningen de wa nai ka.
Aporo wa, ittai, nanimono ka. Mata, Pauro wa nanimono ka. Anatagata o shinkou ni michibiita hito ni suginai. Shikamo sorezore, Shu kara ataerareta bun ni oujite tsukaete iru no de aru.
Watashi wa ue, Aporo wa mizu o sosoida. Shikashi seichou sasete kudasaru no wa, kami de aru.
Dakara, ueru mono mo mizu o sosogu mono mo, tomo ni toru ni tarinai. Daiji na no wa, seichou sasete kudasaru kami nomi de aru.
Ueru mono to mizu o sosogu mono to wa hitotsu de atte, sorezore sono hataraki ni oujite houshuu o erude arou.
Watashitachi wa kami no dourousha de aru. Anata gata wa kami no hatake de ari, kami no tatemono de aru.
Kami kara tamawatta megumi ni yotte, watashi wa jukuren shita kenchikushi no you ni, dodai o sueta. Soshite ta no hito ga sono ue ni ie o tateru no de aru. Shikashi, dou iu fuu ni tateru ka, sorezore ki o tsukeru ga yoi.
Naze nara, sudeni suerarete iru dodai igai no mono o sueru koto wa, dare ni mo dekinai. Soshite, kono dodai wa Iesu Kirisuto de aru.
Kono dodai no ue ni, dare ka ga kin, gin, houseki, ki, kusa, mata wa, wara o mochiite taterunaraba,
Sorezore no shigoto wa, hakkiri to wakatte kuru. Sunawachi, kano hi wa hi no naka ni arawarete, sore o akiraka ni shi, mata sono hi wa, sorezore no shigoto ga donna mono de aru ka o, tamesude arou.
Moshi aru hito no tateta shigoto ga sono mama nokoreba, sono hito wa houshuu o ukeruga,
Sono shigoto ga yakete shimaeba, sonshitsu o koumurude arou. Shikashi kare jishin wa, hi no naka o kugutte kita mono no you nide wa aruga, sukuwarerude arou.
Anata gata wa kami no miya de atte, kami no mitama ga jibun no uchi ni yadotte iru koto o shiranai no ka.
Moshi hito ga, kami no miya o hakai surunara, kami wa sono hito o horobosude arou. Naze nara, kami no miya wa sei naru mono de ari, soshite, anata gata wa sono miya na no dakara de aru.
Dare mo jibun o azamuite wa naranai. Moshi anata gata no uchi ni, jibun ga konoyo no chisha da to omou hito ga irunara, sono hito wa chisha ni naru tame ni oroka ni naru ga yoi.
Naze nara, konoyo no chie wa, kami no mae de wa oroka na mono dakara de aru. "Kami wa, chishatachi o sono warujie ni yotte toraeru" to kaite ari,
Sarani mata, "Shu wa, chishatachi no rongi no munashii koto o gozonjide aru" to kaite aru.
Dakara, dare mo ningen o hokotte wa ikenai. Subete wa, anata gata no mono na no de aru.
Pauro mo, Aporo mo, Kepa mo, sekai mo, sei mo, shi mo, genzai no mono mo, shourai no mono mo, kotogotoku, anata gata no mono de aru.
Soshite, anata gata wa Kirisuto no mono, Kirisuto wa kami no mono de aru.
Kono you na wake dakara, hito wa watashitachi o, Kirisuto ni tsukaeru mono, kami no okugi o kanri shite iru mono to miru ga yoi.
Kono baai, kanrisha ni youkyuu sarete iru no wa, chuujitsu de aru koto de aru.
Watashi wa anata gata ni sabakare tari, ningen no saiban ni kakerare tari shite mo, nanra i ni kaishinai. Iya, watashi wa jibun o sabaku koto mo shinai.
Watashi wa mizukara kaerimite, nanra yamashii koto wa naiga, sore de gi to sarete iru wake de wa nai. Watashi o sabaku kata wa, Shu de aru.
Dakara, Shu ga korareru made wa, nanigoto ni tsuite mo, sakibashiri o shite sabaite wa ikenai. Shu wa kurai naka ni kakurete iru koto o akarumi ni dashi, kokoro no naka de kuwadaterarete iru koto o, arawa ni sarerude arou. Sono toki ni wa, kami kara sorezore homare o ukerude arou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Korera no koto o watashi jishin to Aporo to ni atehamete itte kikasetaga, sore wa anata ga taga, watashitachi o rei ni totte, "Shirusarete iru sadame o koenai" koto o manabi, hitori no hito o agame, hoka no hito o misagete takaburu koto no nai tame de aru.
Ittai, anata o eraku shite iru no wa, dare na no ka. Anata no motte iru mono de, moratte inai mono ga aru ka. Moshi moratte irunara, naze moratte inai mono no you ni hokoru no ka.
Anata gata wa, sudeni manpuku shite iru no da. Sudeni tomisakaete iru no da. Watashitachi o sashi oite, ou ni natte iru no da. Aa, ou ni natte ite kuretara to omou. Sou de attanara, watashitachi mo, anata gata to tomo ni ou ni naretade arou.
Watashi wa kou kangaeru. Kami wa watashitachi shito o shikeishuu no you ni, saigo ni shutsujou suru mono to shite hikidashi, kou shite watashitachi wa, zensekai ni, tenshi ni mo hitobito ni mo misemono ni sareta no da.
Watashitachi wa Kirisuto no yue ni oroka na mono to nari, anata gata wa Kirisuto ni atte kashikoi mono to natte iru. Watashitachi wa yowaiga, anata gata wa tsuyoi. Anata gata wa tattobare, watashitachi wa iyashimerarete iru.
Ima no ima made, watashitachi wa ue, kawaki, hadaka ni sare, utare, yado nashi de ari,
Kurou shite jibun no te de hataraite iru. Hazukashimerarete wa shukufuku shi, hakugai sarete wa taeshinobi,
Nonoshirarete wa yasashii kotoba o kakete iru. Watashitachi wa ima ni itaru made, konoyo no chiri no you ni, ningen no kuzu no you ni sarete iru.
Watashi ga kono you na koto o kaku no wa, anatagata o hazukashimeru tame de wa naku, mushiro, watashi no aiji to shite satosu tame de aru.
Tatoi anata gata ni, Kirisuto ni aru youikugakari ga ichi mannin atta to shite mo, chichi ga ooku aru no de wa nai. Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, fukuin ni yori anatagata o unda no wa, watashi na no de aru.
Soko de, anata gata ni susumeru. Watashi ni narau mono to nari nasai.
