Shikashi aru hitobito wa, watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni kuru koto wa arumai to mite, takabutte iru to iu koto de aru.
Shikashi Shu no mikokoro de areba, watashi wa sugu ni de mo anata gata no tokoro ni itte, takabutte iru monotachi no kotoba de wa naku, sono chikara o misete moraou.
Kami no kuni wa kotoba de wa naku, chikara de aru.
Anata gata wa, dochira o nozomu no ka. Watashi ga muchi o motte, anata gata no tokoro ni yuku koto ka, sore to mo, ai to nyuuwa na kokoro to o motte yuku koto de aru ka.
Genni kiku tokoro ni yoruto, anata gata no aida ni fuhinkou na mono ga ari, shikamo sono fuhinkou wa, ihoujin no aida ni mo nai hodo no mono de, aru hito ga sono chichi no tsuma to issho ni sunde iru to iu koto de aru.
Sore da no ni, nao, anata gata wa takabutte iru. Mushiro, sonna okonai o shite iru mono ga, anata gata no naka kara nozokareneba naranai koto o omotte, kanashimubekide wa nai ka.
Shikashi, watashi jishin to shite wa, karada wa hanarete ite mo, rei de wa issho ni ite, sono ba ni iru mono no you ni, sonna okonai o shita mono o, sudeni sabaite shimatte iru.
Sunawachi, Shu Iesu no na ni yotte, anata gata mo watashi no rei mo tomo ni, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no ken'i no moto ni atsumatte,
Kare no niku ga horobosarete mo, sono rei ga Shu no sabaki no hi ni sukuwareru you ni, kare o Satan ni hikiwatashite shimatta no de aru.
Anata gata ga hokotte iru no wa, yoroshiku nai. Anata gata wa, sukoshi no pan dane ga kona no katamari zentai o fukuramaseru koto o, shiranai no ka.
Atarashii kona no katamari ni naru tame ni, furui pan dane o torinozoki nasai. Anata gata wa, jijitsu pan dane no nai mono na no dakara. Watashitachi no sugikoshi no kohitsuji de aru Kirisuto wa, sudeni hofurareta no da.
Yue ni, watashitachi wa, furui pan dane ya, mata akui to jaaku to no pan dane o mochiizu ni, pan dane no haitte inai junsui de shinjitsu na pan o motte, matsuri o shiyoude wa nai ka.
Watashi wa mae no tegami de, fuhinkou na monotachi to kousai shite wa ikenai to kaitaga,
Sore wa, konoyo no fuhinkou na mono, don'yoku na mono, ryakudatsu o suru mono, guuzou reihai o suru mono nado to zenzen kousai shite wa ikenaito, itta no de wa nai. Moshi sou da to shitara, anata gata wa konoyo kara dete ikaneba naranai koto ni naru.
Shikashi, watashi ga jissai ni kaita no wa, kyoudai to yobareru hito de, fuhinkou na mono, don'yoku na mono, guuzou reihai o suru mono, hito o soshiru mono, sake ni you mono, ryakudatsu o suru mono ga areba, sonna hito to kousai o shite wa ikenai, shokuji o tomo ni shite mo ikenai, to iu koto de atta.
Soto no hitotachi o sabaku no wa, watashi no suru koto de arou ka. Anata gata no sabakubeki mono wa, uchinohitotachi de wa nai ka. Soto no hitotachi wa, kami ga sabaku no de aru.
Sono akunin o, anata gata no naka kara nozoite shimai nasai.
Anata gata no naka no hitori ga, nakama no mono to nani ka arasoi o okoshita baai, sore o seito ni uttaenaide, tadashiku nai mono ni uttaederu you na koto o suru no ka.
Sore to mo, seito wa yo o sabaku mono de aru koto o, anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Soshite, yo ga anata gata ni yotte sabakarerubekide aru no ni, kiwamete chiisai jiken de mo sabakuchikara ga nai no ka.
Anata gata wa shiranai no ka, watashitachi wa mitsukai o sae sabaku mono de aru. Mashite konoyo no jiken nado wa, iu made mo naide wa nai ka.
Sore da no ni, konoyo no jiken ga okoruto, kyoukai de karonjirarete iru hitotachi o, saiban no seki ni tsukaseru no ka.
