Shikaru ni, kyoudai ga kyoudai o uttae, shikamo sore o fushinja no mae ni mochidasu no ka.
Somosomo, tagai ni uttaeau koto jitai ga, sudeni anata gata no haiboku na no da. Naze, mushiro fugi o ukenai no ka. Naze, mushiro damasarete inai no ka.
Shikaru ni, anata gata wa fugi o hataraki, damashitori, shikamo kyoudai ni taishite sou shite iru no de aru.
Sore to mo, tadashiku nai mono ga kami no kuni o tsugu koto wa nai no o, shiranai no ka. Machigatte wa ikenai. Fuhinkou na mono, guuzou o reihai suru mono, kan'in o suru mono, danshou to naru mono, nanshoku o suru mono, nusumu mono,
Don'yoku na mono, sake ni you mono, soshiru mono, ryakudatsu suru mono wa, izure mo kami no kuni o tsugu koto wa nai no de aru.
Anata gata no naka ni wa, izen wa sonna hito mo ita. Shikashi, anata gata wa, Shu Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte, mata watashitachi no kami no rei ni yotte, araware, kiyomerare, gi to sareta no de aru.
Subete no koto wa, watashi ni yurusarete iru. Shikashi, subete no koto ga eki ni naru wake de wa nai. Subete no koto wa, watashi ni yurusarete iru. Shikashi, watashi wa nanimono ni mo shihai sareru koto wa nai.
Shokumotsu wa hara no tame, hara wa shokumotsu no tame de aru. Shikashi kami wa, sore mo kore mo horobosude arou. Kara da wa fuhinkou no tame de wa naku, Shu no tame de ari, Shu wa karada no tame de aru.
Soshite, kami wa Shu o yomigaerasetaga, sono chikara de, watashitachi o mo yomigaerasete kudasarude arou.
Anata gata wa jibun no karada ga Kirisuto no shitai de aru koto o, shiranai no ka. Sore da no ni, Kirisuto no shitai o totte yuujo no shitai to shite yoi no ka. Danjite ikenai.
Sore to mo, yuujo ni tsuku mono wa sore to hitotsu no karada ni naru koto o, shiranai no ka. "Futari no mono wa ittai to narubekide aru" to arukara de aru.
Shikashi Shu ni tsuku mono wa, Shu to hitotsu no rei ni naru no de aru.
Fuhinkou o sake nasai. Hito no okasu subete no tsumi wa, karada no soto ni aru. Shikashi fuhinkou o suru mono wa, jibun no karada ni taishite tsumi o okasu no de aru.
Anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Jibun no karada wa, kami kara ukete jibun no uchi ni yadotte iru seirei no miya de atte, anata gata wa, mohaya jibun jishin no mono de wa nai no de aru.
Anata gata wa, daika o haratte kaitorareta no da. Sore dakara, jibun no karada o motte, kami no eikou o arawashi nasai.
Sate, anata gata ga kaite yokoshita koto ni tsuite kotaeruto, danshi wa fujin ni furenai ga yoi.
Shikashi, fuhinkou ni ochiiru koto no nai tame ni, danshi wa sorezore jibun no tsuma o mochi, fujin mo sorezore jibun no otto o motsu ga yoi.
Otto wa tsuma ni sono bun o hatashi, tsuma mo douyou ni otto ni sono bun o hatasubekide aru.
Tsuma wa jibun no karada o jiyuu ni suru koto wa dekinai. Sore ga dekiru no wa otto de aru. Otto mo douyou ni jibun no karada o jiyuu ni suru koto wa dekinai. Sore ga dekiru no wa tsuma de aru.
Tagai ni kobande wa ikenai. Tadashi, goui no ue de inori ni senshin suru tame ni, shibaraku aiwakare, sore kara mata issho ni naru koto wa, sashitsukaenai. Sou de naito, jiseiryoku no nai no ni joujite, Satan ga anatagata o yuuwaku suru ka mo shirenai.
Ijou no koto wa, jouho no tsumori de iu no de atte, meirei suru no de wa nai.
Watashi to shite wa, minna no mono ga watashi jishin no you ni natte hoshii. Shikashi, hitoribitori kami kara sorezore no tamamono o itadaite ite, aru hito wa kou shite ori, ta no hito wa sou shite iru.
Tsugi ni, mikonsha tachi to yamometachi to ni iuga, watashi no you ni, hitori de oreba, sore ga ichiban yoi.
Shikashi, moshi jisei suru koto ga dekinainara, kekkon suru ga yoi. Jou no moeru yori wa, kekkon suru hou ga, yoikara de aru.
Sarani, kekkon shite iru monotachi ni meijiru. Meijiru no wa, watashi de wa naku Shu de aruga, tsuma wa otto kara wakarete wa ikenai.
(shikashi, man'ichi wakarete irunara, kekkon shinaide iru ka, sore to mo otto to wakai suru ka shi nasai). Mata otto mo tsuma to rikon shite wa naranai.
Sono hoka no hitobito ni iu. Kore o iu no wa, Shu de wa naku, watashi de aru. Aru kyoudai ni fushinja no tsuma ga ari, soshite tomo ni iru koto o yorokonde iru baai ni wa, rikon shite wa ikenai.
Mata, aru fujin no otto ga fushinja de ari, soshite tomo ni iru koto o yorokonde iru baai ni wa, rikon shite wa ikenai.
Naze nara, fushinja no otto wa tsuma ni yotte kiyomerarete ori, mata, fushinja no tsuma mo otto ni yotte kiyomerarete irukara de aru. Moshi sou de nakereba, anata gata no ko wa kegarete iru koto ni naruga, jissai wa kiyoide wa nai ka.
Shikashi, moshi fushinja no hou ga hanarete iku no nara, hanareru mama ni shite oku ga yoi. Kyoudai mo shimai mo, kou shita baai ni wa, sokubaku sarete wa inai. Kami wa, anatagata o heiwa ni kurasaseru tame ni, mesareta no de aru.
Naze nara, tsuma yo, anata ga otto o sukui uru ka dou ka, dou shite wakaru ka. Mata, otto yo, anata mo tsuma o sukui uru ka dou ka, dou shite wakaru ka.
Tada, kakuji wa, Shu kara tamawatta bun ni ouji, mata kami ni mesareta mama no joutai ni shitagatte, ayumubekide aru. Kore ga, subete no kyoukai ni taishite watashi no meijiru tokoro de aru.
Mesareta toki katsurei o ukete itara, sono ato o nakusou to shinai ga yoi. Mata, mesareta toki katsurei o ukete inakattara, katsurei o ukeyou to shinai ga yoi.
Katsurei ga atte mo nakute mo, sore wa mondai de wa nai. Daiji na no wa, tada kami no imashime o mamoru koto de aru.
Kakuji wa, mesareta mama no joutai ni todomatte irubekide aru.
Mesareta toki dorei de atte mo, sore o ki ni shinai ga yoi. Shikashi, moshi jiyuu no mi ni nari urunara, mushiro jiyuu ni nari nasai.
Shu ni atte mesareta dorei wa, Shu ni yotte jiyuujin to sareta mono de ari, mata, mesareta jiyuujin wa Kirisuto no dorei na no de aru.
Anata gata wa, daika o haratte kaitorareta no da. Hito no dorei to natte wa ikenai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Kakuji wa, sono mesareta mama no joutai de, kami no mimae ni irubekide aru.
