Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi no iu koto o kiite hoshii. Toki wa chijimatte iru. Ima kara wa tsuma no aru mono wa nai mono no you ni,
Naku mono wa nakanai mono no you ni, yorokobu mono wa yorokobanai mono no you ni, kau mono wa motanai mono no you ni,
Yo to koushou no aru mono wa, sore ni fukairi shinai you ni subekide aru. Naze nara, konoyo no arisama wa sugisarukara de aru.
Watashi wa anata ga taga, omoiwazurawanai you ni shite ite hoshii. Mikon no danshi wa Shu no koto ni kokoro o kubatte, dou ka shite Shu o yorokobaseyou to suruga,
Kekkon shite iru danshi wa konoyo no koto ni kokoro o kubatte, dou ka shite tsuma o yorokobaseyou to shite, sono kokoro ga wakareru no de aru.
Mikon no fujin to otome to wa, Shu no koto ni kokoro o kubatte, mi mo tamashii mo kiyoku narou to suruga, kekkon shita fujin wa konoyo no koto ni kokoro o kubatte, dou ka shite otto o yorokobaseyou to suru.
Watashi ga kou iu no wa, anata gata no rieki ni naru to omoukara de atte, anatagata o sokubaku suru tame de wa nai. Sou de wa naku, tadashii seikatsu o okutte, yonen naku Shu ni houshi sasetaikara de aru.
Moshi aru hito ga, aite no otome ni taishite, jounetsu o idaku you ni natta baai, sore wa tekitou de nai to omoitsutsu mo, yamu o enakereba, nozomi doori ni shite mo yoi. Sore wa tsumi o okasu koto de wa nai. Futari wa kekkon suru ga yoi.
