Moshi hito ga, jibun wa nani ka shitte iru to omounara, sono hito wa, shiranakereba naranai hodo no koto sura, mada shitte inai.
Shikashi, hito ga kami o aisurunara, sono hito wa kami ni shirarete iru no de aru.
Sate, guuzou e no sonaemono o taberu koto ni tsuite wa, watashitachi wa, guuzou naru mono wa jissai wa yo ni sonzai shinai koto, mata, yuiitsu no kami no hoka ni wa kami ga nai koto o, shitte iru.
To iu no wa, tatoi kamigami to iwareru mono ga, aruiha ten ni, aruiha chi ni aru to shite mo, soshite, ooku no kami, ooku no Shu ga aru you de wa aruga,
Watashitachi ni wa, chichi naru yuiitsu no kami nomi ga imasu no de aru. Banbutsu wa kono kami kara dete, watashitachi mo kono kami ni kisuru. Mata, yuiitsu no Shu Iesu Kirisuto nomi ga imasu no de aru. Banbutsu wa kono Shu ni yori, watashitachi mo kono Shu ni yotte iru.
