Shokumotsu wa, watashitachi o kami ni michibiku mono de wa nai. Tabenakute mo son wa naishi, tabete mo eki ni wa naranai.
Shikashi, anata gata no kono jiyuu ga, yowai monotachi no tsumazuki ni naranai you ni, ki o tsuke nasai.
