Suruto sono yowai hito wa, anata no chishiki ni yotte horobiru koto ni naru. Kono yowai kyoudai no tame ni mo, Kirisuto wa shinareta no de aru.
Kono you ni anata ga taga, kyoudaitachi ni taishite tsumi o okashi, sono yowai ryoushin o itameru no wa, Kirisuto ni taishite tsumi o okasu koto na no de aru.
Dakara, moshi shokumotsu ga watashi no kyoudai o tsumazukaserunara, kyoudai o tsumazukasenai tame ni, watashi wa eikyuu ni, danjite niku o taberu koto wa shinai.
Watashi wa jiyuu na mono de wa nai ka. Shito de wa nai ka. Watashitachi no Shu Iesu o mitade wa nai ka. Anata gata wa, Shu ni aru watashi no hataraki no mi de wa nai ka.
Watashi wa, hoka no hito ni taishite wa shito de nai to shite mo, anata gata ni wa shito de aru. Anata gata ga Shu ni aru koto wa, watashi no shito shoku no shirushi na no de aru.
Watashi no hihansha tachi ni taisuru benmei wa, kore de aru.
Watashitachi ni wa, nomikui o suru kenri ga nai no ka.
Watashitachi ni wa, hoka no shitotachi ya Shu no kyoudaitachi ya Kepa no you ni, shinja de aru tsuma o tsurete aruku kenri ga nai no ka.
Sore to mo, watashi to Barunaba to dake ni wa, roudou o sezu ni iru kenri ga nai no ka.
Ittai, jibun de hiyou o dashite guntai ni kuwawaru mono ga arou ka. Budou hatake o tsukutte ite, sono mi o tabenai mono ga arou ka. Mata, hitsuji o katte ite, sono chichi o nomanai mono ga arou ka.
Watashi wa, ningen no kangae de kou iu no de wa nai. Rippou mo mata, sono you ni itte irude wa nai ka.
Sunawachi, Moose no rippou ni, "Kokumotsu o konashite iru ushi ni, kutsuko o kakete wa naranai" to kaite aru. Kami wa, ushi no koto o kokoro ni kakete orareru no darou ka.
Sore to mo, moppara, watashitachi no tame ni itte orareru no ka. Mochiron, sore wa watashitachi no tame ni shirusareta no de aru. Sunawachi, tagayasu mono wa nozomi o motte tagayashi, kokumotsu o konasu mono wa, sono wakemae o morau nozomi o motte konasu no de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga, anata gata no tame ni rei no mono o maita no nara, niku no mono o anata gata kara karitoru no wa, yuki sugidarou ka.
