Watashi ga fukuin o nobetsutaete mo, sore wa hokori ni wa naranai. Naze nara, watashi wa, sou sezu ni wa orenaikara de aru. Moshi fukuin o nobetsutaenainara, watashi wa wazawai de aru.
Susunde sore o sureba, houshuu o ukerude arou. Shikashi, susunde shinai to shite mo, sore wa, watashi ni yudanerareta tsutome na no de aru.
