Yowai hito ni wa yowai mono ni natta. Yowai hito o eru tame de aru. Subete no hito ni taishite wa, subete no hito no you ni natta. Nan to ka shite ikunin ka o sukuu tame de aru.
Fukuin no tame ni, watashi wa donna koto de mo suru. Watashi mo tomo ni fukuin ni azukaru tame de aru.
Anata gata wa shiranai no ka. Kyougijou de hashiru mono wa, mina hashiri wa suruga, shou o eru mono wa hitori dake de aru. Anata gata mo, shou o eru you ni hashiri nasai.
Shikashi, subete kyougi o suru mono wa, nanigoto ni mo sessei o suru. Karera wa kuchiru kanmuri o eru tame ni sou suruga, watashitachi wa kuchinai kanmuri o eru tame ni sou suru no de aru.
Soko de, watashi wa mokuhyou no hakkiri shinai you na hashirikata o sezu, kuu o utsu you na kentou wa shinai.
Sunawachi, jibun no karada o uchitataite fukujuu saseru no de aru. Sou shinaito, hoka no hito ni nobetsutaete okinagara, jibun wa shikkakusha ni naru ka mo shirenai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Kono koto o shirazu ni ite moraitaku nai. Watashitachi no senzo wa mina kumo no shita ni ori, mina umi o toori,
Mina kumo no naka, umi no naka de, Moose ni tsuku baputesuma o uketa.
Mata, mina onaji rei no shokumotsu o tabe,
Mina onaji rei no nomimono o nonda. Sunawachi, karera ni tsuite kita rei no iwa kara nonda no de aruga, kono iwa wa Kirisuto ni hoka naranai.
Shikashi, karera no naka no daitasuu wa, kami no mikokoro ni kanawanakatta no de, arano de horobosarete shimatta.
Korera no dekigoto wa, watashitachi ni taisuru keikoku de atte, karera ga aku o musabotta you ni, watashitachi mo aku o musaboru koto no nai tame na no de aru.
Dakara, karera no naka no aru monotachi no you ni, guuzou reihaisha ni natte wa naranai. Sunawachi, "Tami wa zashite nomikui o shi, mata tatte odori tawamureta" to kaite aru.
Mata, aru monotachi ga shita you ni, watashitachi wa fuhinkou o shite wa naranai. Fuhinkou o shita tame taosareta mono ga, ichi nichi ni ni man sanzennin mo atta.
Mata, aru monotachi ga shita you ni, watashitachi wa Shu o kokoromite wa naranai. Shu o kokoromita mono wa, hebi ni korosareta.
Mata, aru monotachi ga tsubuyaita you ni, tsubuyaite wa naranai. Tsubuyaita mono wa, "Shi no tsukai" ni horobosareta.
Korera no koto ga karera ni okotta no wa, hoka ni taisuru keikoku to shite de atte, sore ga kakareta no wa, yo no owari ni nozonde iru watashitachi ni taisuru kunkai no tame de aru.
Dakara, tatte iru to omou mono wa, taorenai you ni ki o tsukeru ga yoi.
Anata gata no atta shiren de, yo no tsune de nai mono wa nai. Kami wa shinjitsu de aru. Anatagata o taerarenai you na shiren ni awaseru koto wa nai bakari ka, shiren to douji ni, sore ni taerareru you ni, nogareru michi mo sonaete kudasaru no de aru.
Sore dakara, aisuru monotachi yo. Guuzou reihai o sake nasai.
Kenmei na anata gata ni uttaeru. Watashi no iu koto o, mizukara handan shite miru ga yoi.
Watashitachi ga shukufuku suru shukufuku no sakazuki, sore wa Kirisuto no chi ni azukaru koto de wa nai ka. Watashitachi ga saku pan, sore wa Kirisuto no karada ni azukaru koto de wa nai ka.
Pan ga hitotsu de arukara, watashitachi wa ooku ite mo, hitotsu no karada na no de aru. Minna no mono ga hitotsu no pan o tomo ni itadakukara de aru.
Niku ni yoru Isuraeru o miru ga yoi. Sonaemono o taberu hitotachi wa, saidan ni azukaru no de wa nai ka.
Suruto, nan to ittara yoi ka. Guuzou ni sasageru sonaemono wa, nani ka imi ga aru no ka. Mata, guuzou wa nani ka hontou ni aru mono ka.
Sou de wa nai. Hitobito ga sonaeru mono wa, akureidomo, sunawachi, kami naranu mono ni sonaeru no de aru. Watashi wa, anata gata ga akurei no nakama ni naru koto o nozomanai.
Shu no sakazuki to akureidomo no sakazuki to o, douji ni nomu koto wa dekinai. Shu no shokutaku to akureidomo no shokutaku to ni, douji ni azukaru koto wa dekinai.
Sore to mo, watashitachi wa Shu no netami o okoshisou to suru no ka. Watashitachi wa, Shu yori mo tsuyoi no darou ka.
Subete no koto wa yurusarete iru. Shikashi, subete no koto ga eki ni naru wake de wa nai. Subete no koto wa yurusarete iru. Shikashi, subete no koto ga hito no toku o takameru no de wa nai.
Dare de mo, jibun no eki o motomenaide, hoka no hito no eki o motomerubekide aru.
Subete ichiba de urarete iru mono wa, ichiichi ryoushin ni tou koto o shinaide, taberu ga yoi.
Chi to sore ni michite iru mono to wa, Shu no mono dakara de aru.
Moshi anata ga taga, fushinja no dare ka ni manekarete, soko ni ikou to omou baai, jibun no mae ni dasareru mono wa nan de mo, ichiichi ryoushin ni tou koto o shinaide, taberu ga yoi.
Shikashi, dare ka ga anata gata ni, kore wa sasagemono no niku da to ittanara, sore o shirasete kureta hito no tame ni, mata ryoushin no tame ni, tabenai ga yoi.
Ryoushin to itta no wa, jibun no ryoushin de wa naku, tanin no ryoushin no koto de aru. Naze nara, watashi no jiyuu ga, dou shite tanin no ryoushin ni yotte sayuu sareru koto ga arou ka.
Moshi watashi ga kansha shite taberu baai, sono kansha suru mono ni tsuite, dou shite hito no so shiri o ukeru wake ga arou ka.
Dakara, nomu ni mo taberu ni mo, mata nanigoto o suru ni mo, subete kami no eikou no tame ni subekide aru.
Yudayajin ni mo Girishiyajin ni mo kami no kyoukai ni mo, tsumazuki ni natte wa ikenai.
Watashi mo mata, nanigoto ni mo subete no hito ni yorokobareru you ni tsutome, ooku no hito ga sukuwareru tame ni, jibun no eki de wa naku karera no eki o motomete iru.
Watashi ga Kirisuto ni narau mono de aru you ni, anata gata mo watashi ni narau mono ni nari nasai.
Anata ga taga, nani ka ni tsuke watashi o oboete ite, anata gata ni tsutaeta toori ni iitsutae o mamotte iru no de, watashi wa manzoku ni omou.
Shikashi, anata gata ni shitte ite moraitai. Subete no otoko no kashira wa Kirisuto de ari, onna no kashira wa otoko de ari, Kirisuto no kashira wa kami de aru.
Inori o shi tari yogen o shi tari suru toki, kashira ni mono o kaburu otoko wa, sono kashira o hazukashimeru mono de aru.
Inori o shi tari yogen o shi tari suru toki, kashira ni ooi o kakenai onna wa, sono kashira o hazukashimeru mono de aru. Sore wa, kami o sotta no to mattaku onaji dakara de aru.
Moshi onna ga ooi o kakenainara, kami o kitte shimau ga yoi. Kami o kit tari sot tari suru no ga, onna ni totte hazubeki koto de arunara, ooi o kakerubekide aru.
Otoko wa, kami no katachi de ari eikou de arukara, kashira ni mono o kaburubekide wa nai. Onna wa, mata otoko no kouei de aru.
Naze nara, otoko ga onna kara deta no de wa naku, onna ga otoko kara deta no dakara de aru.
Mata, otoko wa onna no tame ni tsukurareta no de wa naku, onna ga otoko no tame ni tsukurareta no de aru.
