Onna ni nagai kami ga areba kanojo no kouei ni naru no de aru. Nagai kami wa ooi no kawari ni onna ni ataerarete iru mono dakara de aru.
Shikashi, dare ka ga sore ni hantai no iken o motte ite mo, sonna fuushuu wa watashitachi ni wa naku, kami no shokyoukai ni mo nai.
Tokoro de, tsugi no koto o meijiru ni tsuite wa, anatagata o homeru wake ni wa ikanai. To iu no wa, anata gata no atsumari ga rieki ni naranaide, kaette sonshitsu ni natte irukara de aru.
Mazu, anata gata ga kyoukai ni atsumaru toki, otagai no aida ni bunsou ga aru koto o, watashi wa mimi ni shite ori, soshite ikubun ka, sore o shinjite iru.
Tashika ni, anata gata no naka de hontou no mono ga akiraka ni sareru tame ni wa, bunpa mo nakereba narumai.
Soko de, anata gata ga issho ni atsumaru toki, Shu no bansan o mamoru koto ga dekinaide iru.
To iu no wa, shokuji no sai, kakuji ga jibun no bansan o katte ni saki ni taberu no de, uete iru hito ga aru ka to omoeba, yotte iru hito ga aru shimatsu de aru.
Anata gata ni wa, nomikui o suru ie ga nai no ka. Sore to mo, kami no kyoukai o karonji, mazushii hitobito o hazukashimeru no ka. Watashi wa anata gata ni taishite, nan to iou ka. Anatagata o, homeyou ka. Kono koto de wa, homeru wake ni wa ikanai.
