Anata gata wa Kirisuto no karada de ari, hitoribitori wa sono shitai de aru.
Soshite, kami wa kyoukai no naka de, hitobito o tatete, daiichi ni shito, daini ni yogensha, daisan ni kyoushi to shi, tsugi ni chikara aru waza o okonau mono, tsugi ni iyashi no tamamono o motsu mono, mata hojosha, kanrisha, shuju no igen o kataru mono o okareta.
Minna ga shito darou ka. Minna ga yogensha darou ka. Minna ga kyoushi darou ka. Minna ga chikara aru waza o okonau mono darou ka.
Minna ga iyashi no tamamono o motte iru no darou ka. Minna ga igen o kataru no darou ka. Minna ga igen o toku no darou ka.
Daga, anata gata wa, sarani ooinaru tamamono o eyou to nesshin ni tsutome nasai. Soko de, watashi wa mottomo sugureta michi o anata gata ni shimesou.
Tatoi watashi ga, hitobito no kotoba ya mitsukai tachi no kotoba o katatte mo, moshi ai ga nakereba, watashi wa, yakamashii kane ya sawagashii nyouhachi to onaji de aru.
Tatoi mata, watashi ni yogen o suru chikara ga ari, arayuru okugi to arayuru chishiki to ni tsuujite ite mo, mata, yama o utsusu hodo no tsuyoi shinkou ga atte mo, moshi ai ga nakereba, watashi wa mu ni hitoshii.
Tatoi mata, watashi ga jibun no zenzaisan o hito ni hodokoshite mo, mata, jibun no karada o yakareru tame ni watashite mo, moshi ai ga nakereba, issai wa mueki de aru.
Ai wa kan'you de ari, ai wa nasakebukai. Mata, netamu koto o shinai. Ai wa takaburanai, hokoranai,
Busahou o shinai, jibun no rieki o motomenai, iradatanai, urami o idakanai.
Fugi o yorokobanaide shinri o yorokobu.
Soshite, subete o shinobi, subete o shinji, subete o nozomi, subete o taeru.
Ai wa itsu made mo taeru koto ga nai. Shikashi, yogen wa sutare, igen wa yami, chishiki wa sutarerude arou.
Naze nara, watashitachi no shiru tokoro wa ichi bubun de ari, yogen suru tokoro mo ichi bubun ni suginai.
Mattakimono ga kuru toki ni wa, bubunteki na mono wa sutareru.
Watashitachi ga osanago de atta toki ni wa, osanagorashiku katari, osanagorashiku kanji, mata, osanagorashiku kangaete ita. Shikashi, otona to natta ima wa, osanagorashii koto o sutete shimatta.
Watashitachi wa, ima wa, kagami ni utsushite miru you ni oboroge ni mite iru. Shikashi sono toki ni wa, kao to kao to o awasete, mirude arou. Watashi no shiru tokoro wa, ima wa ichi bubun ni suginai. Shikashi sono toki ni wa, watashi ga kanzen ni shirarete iru you ni, kanzen ni shirude arou.
Kono you ni, itsu made mo sonzoku suru mono wa, shinkou to kibou to ai to, kono mittsu de aru. Kono uchi de mottomo ooinaru mono wa, ai de aru.
Ai o oimotome nasai. Mata, rei no tamamono o, koto ni yogen suru koto o, nesshin ni motome nasai.
Igen o kataru mono wa, hito ni mukatte kataru no de wa naku, kami ni mukatte kataru no de aru. Sore wa dare ni mo wakaranai. Kare wa tada, rei ni yotte okugi o katatte iru dake de aru.
Shikashi yogen o suru mono wa, hito ni katatte sono toku o takame, kare o hagemashi, nagusameru no de aru.
Igen o kataru mono wa jibun dake no toku o takameruga, yogen o suru mono wa kyoukai no toku o takameru.
Watashi wa jissai, anata gata ga hitori nokorazu igen o kataru koto o nozomuga, tokuni yogen o shite moraitai. Kyoukai no toku o takameru you ni igen o tokanai kagiri, igen o kataru mono yori mo, yogen o suru mono no hou ga masatte iru.
Dakara, kyoudaitachi yo. Tatoi watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni itte igen o kataru to shite mo, keiji ka chishiki ka yogen ka oshie ka o kataranakereba, anata gata ni, nan no yaku ni tatsudarou ka.
Mata, fue ya tategoto no you na gakki de mo, moshi sono oto ni henka ga nakereba, nani o fuite iru no ka, hiite iru no ka, dou shite shiru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Mata, moshi rappa ga hakkiri shita oto o dasanainara, dare ga sentou no junbi o surudarou ka.
Sore to douyou ni, moshi anata gata ga igen de hakkiri shinai kotoba o katareba, dou shite sono kataru koto ga wakarudarou ka. Sore de wa, kuu ni mukatte katatte iru koto ni naru.
Yo ni wa tashu tayou no kotoba ga arudarouga, imi no nai mono wa hitotsu mo nai.
Moshi sono kotoba no imi ga wakaranainara, katatte iru hito ni totte wa, watashi wa ikokujin de ari, katatte iru hito mo, watashi ni totte wa ikokujin de aru.
Dakara, anata gata mo, rei no tamamono o nesshin ni motomete iru ijou wa, kyoukai no toku o takameru tame ni, sore o yutaka ni itadaku you ni hagemu ga yoi.
Kono you na wake de arukara, igen o kataru mono wa, jibun de sore o toku koto ga dekiru you ni inori nasai.
Moshi watashi ga igen o motte inorunara, watashi no rei wa inoruga, chisei wa mi o musubanaikara de aru.
Suruto, dou shitara yoi no ka. Watashi wa rei de inoruto tomo ni, chisei de mo inorirou. Rei desan bi o utauto tomo ni, chisei de mo utaou.
Sou de naito, moshi anata ga rei de shukufuku no kotoba o tonaete mo, shoshinja no seki ni iru mono wa, anata no kansha ni taishite, dou shite amen to ieyou ka. Anata ga nani o itte iru no ka, kare ni wa tsuujinai.
Kansha suru no wa kekkou daga, sore de, hoka no hito no toku o takameru koto ni wa naranai.
Watashi wa, anata gata no uchi no dare yori mo ooku igen ga katareru koto o, kami ni kansha suru.
Shikashi kyoukai de wa, ichi man no kotoba o igen de kataru yori mo, hoka no hitotachi o mo oshieru tame ni, mushiro itsutsu no kotoba o chisei ni yotte kataru hou ga negawashii.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Mono no kangaekata de wa, kodomo to natte wa ikenai. Akuji ni tsuite wa osanago to naru no wa yoiga, kangaekata de wa, otona to nari nasai.
Rippou ni kou kaite aru, "Watashi wa, ikoku no shita to ikoku no kuchibiru to de, kono tami ni kataruga, sore de mo, karera wa watashi ni mimi o katamukenai, to Shu ga oose ni naru".
Kono you ni, igen wa shinja no tame de wa naku mishinja no tame no shirushi de aruga, yogen wa mishinja no tame de wa naku shinja no tame no shirushi de aru.
Moshi zenkyoukai ga issho ni atsumatte, zen'in ga igen o katatte iru tokoro ni, shoshinja ka fushinja ka ga haitte kitara, karera wa anatagata o kichigai da to iudarou.
Shikashi, zen'in ga yogen o shite iru tokoro ni, fushinja ka shoshinja ga haitte kitara, kare no ryoushin wa minna no mono ni semerare, minna no mono ni sabakare,
Sono kokoro no himitsu ga abakare, sono kekka, hirefushite kami o ogami, "Makoto ni, kami ga anata gata no uchi ni imasu" to kokuhaku suru ni itarude arou.
Suruto, kyoudaitachi yo. Dou shitara yoi no ka. Anata gata ga issho ni atsumaru toki, kakuji wasan bi o utai, oshie o nashi, keiji o tsuge, igen o katari, sore o toku no de aruga, subete wa toku o takameru tame ni subekide aru.
Moshi igen o kataru mono ga areba, futari ka, ookute sannin no mono ga, junjun ni katari, soshite, hitori ga sore o tokubekide aru.
Moshi toku mono ga inai toki ni wa, kyoukai de wa damatte ite, jibun ni taishi mata kami ni taishite katatte irubekide aru.
Yogen o suru mono no baai ni mo, futari ka sannin ka ga katari, hoka no mono wa sore o ginmi subekide aru.
Shikashi, seki ni iru ta no mono ga keiji o uketa baai ni wa, hajime no mono wa damaru ga yoi.
Anata gata wa, minna ga manabi minna ga susume o ukeru tame ni, hitori zutsu nokorazu yogen o suru koto ga dekiru no dakara.
Katsu, yogensha no rei wa yogensha ni fukujuu suru mono de aru.
Kami wa muchitsujo no kami de wa naku, heiwa no kami de aru. Seitotachi no subete no kyoukai de okonawarete iru you ni,
Fujintachi wa kyoukai de wa damatte inakereba naranai. Karera wa kataru koto ga yurusarete inai. Dakara, rippou mo meijite iru you ni, fukujuu subekide aru.
Moshi nani ka manabitai koto ga areba, ie de jibun no otto ni tazuneru ga yoi. Kyoukai de kataru no wa, fujin ni totte wa hazubeki koto de aru.
Sore to mo, kami no kotoba wa anata gata no tokoro kara deta no ka. Aruiha, anata gata dake ni kita no ka.
Moshi aru hito ga, jibun wa yogensha ka rei no hito de aru to omotte irunara, watashi ga anata gata ni kaite iru koto wa, Shu no meirei da to mitomerubekide aru.
Moshi sore o mushi suru mono ga areba, sono hito mo mata mushi sareru.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Kono you na wake dakara, yogen suru koto o nesshin ni motome nasai. Mata, igen o kataru koto o samatagete wa naranai.
Shikashi, subete no koto o tekigi ni, katsu chitsujo o tadashite okonau ga yoi.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi ga izen anata gata ni tsutaeta fukuin, anata gata ga ukeire, sore ni yotte tatte kita ano fukuin o, omoiokoshite moraitai.
Moshi anata ga taga, itazura ni shinjinaide, watashi no nobetsutaeta toori no kotoba o kataku mamotte oreba, kono fukuin ni yotte sukuwareru no de aru.
Watashi ga mottomo daiji na koto to shite anata gata ni tsutaeta no wa, watashi jishin mo uketa koto de atta. Sunawachi Kirisuto ga, seisho ni kaite aru to ori, watashitachi no tsumi no tame ni shinda koto,
Soshite houmurareta koto, seisho ni kaite aru to ori, mikkame ni yomigaetta koto,
Kepa ni araware, tsugi ni, juu ninin ni arawareta koto de aru.
Sono nochi, gohyakunin ijou no kyoudaitachi ni, douji ni arawareta. Sono naka ni wa sudeni nemutta monotachi mo iruga, daitasuu wa ima nao seizon shite iru.
Sono nochi, Yakobu ni araware, tsugi ni, subete no shitotachi ni araware,
Soshite saigo ni, iwaba, tsukitarazu ni umareta you na watashi ni mo, arawareta no de aru.
Jissai watashi wa, kami no kyoukai o hakugai shita no de arukara, shitotachi no naka de ichiban chiisai mono de atte, shito to yobareru neuchi no nai mono de aru.
Shikashi, kami no megumi ni yotte, watashi wa konnichi aru o ete iru no de aru. Soshite, watashi ni tamawatta kami no megumi wa muda ni narazu, mushiro, watashi wa karera no naka no dare yori mo ooku hataraite kita. Shikashi sore wa, watashi jishin de wa naku, watashi to tomo ni atta kami no megumi de aru.
Tonikaku, watashi ni seyo karera ni seyo, sono you ni, watashitachi wa nobetsutaete ori, sono you ni, anata gata wa shinjita no de aru.
Sate, Kirisuto wa shinin no naka kara yomigaetta no da to nobetsutaerarete iru no ni, anata gata no naka no aru mono ga, shinin no fukkatsu nado wa nai to itte iru no wa, dou shita koto ka.
Moshi shinin no fukkatsu ga nainaraba, Kirisuto mo yomigaeranakattade arou.
Moshi Kirisuto ga yomigaeranakatta to shitara, watashitachi no senkyou wa munashiku, anata gata no shinkou mo mata munashii.
Suruto, watashitachi wa kami ni somuku gishounin ni sae naru wake da. Naze nara, man'ichi shinin ga yomigaeranai to shitara, watashitachi wa kami ga jissai yomigaerasenakatta hazu no Kirisuto o, yomigaeraseta to itte, kami ni hansuru akashi o tateta koto ni narukara de aru.
Moshi shinin ga yomigaeranainara, Kirisuto mo yomigaeranakattade arou.
Moshi Kirisuto ga yomigaeranakatta to sureba, anata gata no shinkou wa kuukyo na mono to nari, anata gata wa, ima na otsumi no naka ni iru koto ni narou.
Sou da to suruto, Kirisuto ni atte nemutta monotachi wa, horonde shimatta no de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga, konoyo no seikatsu de Kirisuto ni atte tannaru nozomi o idaite iru dake da to sureba, watashitachi wa, subete no hito no naka de mottomo awaremubeki sonzai to naru.
Shikashi jijitsu, Kirisuto wa nemutte iru mono no hatsuho to shite, shinin no naka kara yomigaetta no de aru.
Sore wa, shi ga hitori no hito ni yotte kita no dakara, shinin no fukkatsu mo mata, hitori no hito ni yotte konakereba naranai.
Adamu ni atte subete no hito ga shinde iru no to onaji you ni, Kirisuto ni atte subete no hito ga ikasareru no de aru.
Tada, kakuji wa sorezore no junjo ni shitagawaneba naranai. Saisho wa Kirisuto, tsugi ni, Shu no rairin ni saishite Kirisuto ni zokusuru monotachi,
Sore kara shuumatsu to natte, sono toki ni, Kirisuto wa subete no kimitachi, subete no ken'i to kenryoku to o uchihoroboshite, kuni o chichi naru kami ni watasareru no de aru.
Naze nara, Kirisuto wa arayuru teki o sono ashimoto ni oku toki made wa, shihai o tsuzukeru koto ni natte irukara de aru.
Saigo no teki to shite horobosareru no ga, shi de aru.
"Kami wa banbutsu o kare no ashimoto ni shitagawaseta" kara de aru. Tokoro ga, banbutsu o shitagawaseta to iwareru toki, banbutsu o shitagawaseta kata ga sore ni fukumarete inai koto wa, akiraka de aru.
Soshite, banbutsu ga kami ni shitagau toki ni wa, miko jishin mo mata, banbutsu o shitagawaseta sono kata ni shitagaude arou. Sore wa, kami ga subete no mono ni atte, subete to narareru tame de aru.
Sou de nai to sureba, shisha no tame ni baputesuma o ukeru hitobito wa, naze sore o suru no darou ka. Moshi shisha ga mattaku yomigaeranai to sureba, naze hitobito ga shisha no tame ni baputesuma o ukeru no ka.
Mata, nan no tame ni, watashitachi wa itsu mo kiken o okashite iru no ka.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, watashi ga anata gata ni tsuki motte iru hokori ni kakete iuga, watashi wa hibi shinde iru no de aru.
Moshi, watashi ga ningen no kangae ni yotte Epeso de kemono to tatakatta to sureba, sore wa nan no yaku ni tatsu no ka. Moshi shinin ga yomigaeranai no nara, "Watashitachi wa nomikui shiyoude wa nai ka. Asu mo wakaranu inochi na no da".
Machigatte wa ikenai. "Warui majiwari wa, yoi narawashi o sokonau".
Mezamete mi o tadashi, tsumi o okasanai you ni shi nasai. Anata gata no uchi ni wa, kami ni tsuite muchi na hitobito ga iru. Anatagata o hazukashimeru tame ni, watashi wa kou iu no da.
Shikashi, aru hito wa iudarou. "Donna fuu ni shite, shinin ga yomigaeru no ka. Donna karada o shite kuru no ka".
Oroka na hito de aru. Anata no maku mono wa, shinanakereba, ikasarenaide wa nai ka.
Mata, anata no maku no wa, yagate narubeki karada o maku no de wa nai. Mugi de atte mo, hoka no tane de atte mo, tada no tanetsubu ni suginai.
Tokoro ga, kami wa mikokoro no mama ni, kore ni karada o atae, sono hitotsu hitotsu no tane ni sorezore no karada o oatae ni naru.
Subete no niku ga, onaji niku na no de wa nai. Hito no niku ga ari, kemono no niku ga ari, tori no niku ga ari, sakana no niku ga aru.
Ten ni zokusuru karada mo areba, chi ni zokusuru karada mo aru. Ten ni zokusuru mono no eikou wa, chi ni zokusuru mono no eikou to chigatte iru.
Hi no eikou ga ari, tsuki no eikou ga ari, hoshi no eikou ga aru. Mata, kono hoshi to ano hoshi to no aida ni, eikou no sa ga aru.
Shinin no fukkatsu mo, mata douyou de aru. Kuchiru mono de makare, kuchinai mono ni yomigaeri,
Iyashii mono de makare, eikou aru mono ni yomigaeri, yowai mono de makare, tsuyoi mono ni yomigaeri,
Niku no karada de makare, rei no karada ni yomigaeru no de aru. Niku no karada ga aru no dakara, rei no karada mo aru wake de aru.
Seisho ni "Saisho no hito Adamu wa ikita mono to natta" to kaite aru toori de aru. Shikashi saigo no Adamu wa inochi o ataeru rei to natta.
Saisho ni atta no wa, rei no mono de wa naku niku no mono de atte, sono nochi ni rei no mono ga kuru no de aru.
Daiichi no hito wa chi kara dete tsuchi ni zokushi, daini no hito wa ten kara kuru.
Kono tsuchi ni zokusuru hito ni, tsuchi ni zokushite iru hitobito wa hitoshiku, kono ten ni zokusuru hito ni, ten ni zokushite iru hitobito wa hitoshii no de aru.
Sunawachi, watashitachi wa, tsuchi ni zokushite iru katachi o totte iru no to douyou ni, mata ten ni zokushite iru katachi o torude arou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi wa kono koto o itte oku. Niku to chi to wa kami no kuni o tsugu koto ga dekinaishi, kuchiru mono wa kuchinai mono o tsugu koto ga nai.
Koko de, anata gata ni okugi o tsugeyou. Watashitachi subete wa, nemuri tsuzukeru no de wa nai. Owari no rappa no hibiki to tomo ni, matataku aida ni, isshun ni shite kaerareru.
To iu no wa, rappa ga hibiite, shinin wa kuchinai mono ni yomigaerasare, watashitachi wa kaerareru no de aru.
Naze nara, kono kuchiru mono wa kanarazu kuchinai mono o ki, kono shinu mono wa kanarazu shinanai mono o kiru koto ni narukara de aru.
Kono kuchiru mono ga kuchinai mono o ki, kono shinu mono ga shinanai mono o kiru toki, seisho ni kaite aru kotoba ga jouju suru no de aru.
"Shi wa shouri ni nomarete shimatta. Shi yo, omae no shouri wa, doko ni aru no ka. Shi yo, omae no toge wa, doko ni aru no ka".
Shi no toge wa tsumi de aru. Tsumi no chikara wa rippou de aru.
Shikashi kansha subeki koto ni wa, kami wa watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, watashitachi ni shouri o tamawatta no de aru.
Dakara, aisuru kyoudaitachi yo. Kataku tatte ugokasarezu, itsu mo zenryoku o sosoide Shu no waza ni hagemi nasai. Shu ni atte wa, anata gata no rouku ga muda ni naru koto wa naito, anata gata wa shitte irukara de aru.
Seitotachi e no kenkin ni tsuite wa, watashi wa Garateya no shokyoukai ni meijite oitaga, anata gata mo sono toori ni shi nasai.
Ichi shuu no hajime no higoto ni, anata gata wa sorezore, ikura de mo shuunyuu ni oujite temoto ni takuwaete oki, watashi ga tsuita toki ni natte hajimete atsumeru koto no nai you ni shi nasai.
Watashi ga touchaku shitara, anata gata ga eranda hitobito ni tegami o tsuke, anata gata no okurimono o motasete, Erusaremu ni okuridasu koto ni shiyou.
Moshi watashi mo yuku hou ga yokereba, issho ni yuku koto ni narou.
Watashi wa, Makedoniya o tsuuka shite kara, anata gata no tokoro ni yuku koto ni narou. Makedoniya wa tsuuka suru dake daga,
Anata gata no tokoro de wa, tabun taizai suru you ni nari, aruiha fuyu o sugosu ka mo shirenai. Sou nareba, watashi ga doko e iku ni shite mo, anata gata ni okutte moraerudarou.
Watashi wa ima, anata gata ni tabi no tsuide ni au koto wa konomanai. Moshi Shu no oyurushi ga areba, shibaraku anata gata no tokoro ni taizai shitai to nozonde iru.
Shikashi gojunsetsu made wa, Epeso ni taizai suru tsumori da. To iu no wa, yuuryoku na hataraki no mon ga watashi no tame ni ookiku hirakarete irushi,
Mata tekitai suru mono mo ooikara de aru.
Moshi Temote ga tsuitara, anata gata no tokoro de fuan nashi ni sugoseru you ni shite agete hoshii. Kare wa watashi to douyou ni, Shu no goyou ni atatte iru no dakara.
Dare mo kare o karonjite wa ikenai. Soshite, watashi no tokoro ni kuru you ni, dou ka kare o yasuraka ni okuridashite hoshii. Watashi wa kare ga kyoudaitachi to issho ni kuru no o matte iru.
Kyoudai Aporo ni tsuite wa, kyoudaitachi to issho ni anata gata no tokoro ni iku you ni, tabitabi susumete mita. Shikashi kare ni wa, ima yuku ishi wa, mattaku nai. Tekitou na kikai ga areba, ikudarou.
Me o samashite i nasai. Shinkou ni tachi nasai. Otokorashiku, tsuyoku atte hoshii.
Issai no koto o, ai o motte okonai nasai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ni susumeru. Anata gata ga shitte iru you ni, Sutepana no ie wa Akaya no hatsuho de atte, karera wa mi o motte seito ni houshi shite kureta.
Dou ka, kono you na hitobito to, mata subete karera to tomo ni hataraki tomo ni rousuru hitobito to ni, shitagatte hoshii.
Watashi wa, Sutepana to Porutonato to Akaiko to ga kite kureta no o yorokonde iru. Karera wa anata gata no tarinai tokoro o mitashi,
Watashi no kokoro to anata gata no kokoro to o, yasuraka ni shite kureta. Kou shita hitobito wa, omonjinakereba naranai.
Ajiya no shokyoukai kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku. Akura to Purisuka to sono ie no kyoukai kara, Shu ni atte kokoro kara yoroshiku.
Subete no kyoudaitachi kara, yoroshiku. Anata gata mo tagai ni, kiyoi seppun o motte aisatsu o kawashi nasai.
Koko de Pauro ga, tezukara aisatsu o shirusu.
Moshi Shu o aisanai mono ga areba, noroware yo. Marana ta (warera no Shu yo, kitarimase).
Shu Iesu no megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Watashi no ai ga, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, anata gata ichidou to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kami no mimune ni yori Kirisuto Iesu no shito to natta Pauro to, kyoudai Temote to kara, Korinto ni aru kami no kyoukai, narabi ni Akaya zendo ni iru subete no seitotachi e.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Ho mubeki ka na, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chichi naru kami, awaremi bukaki chichi, nagusame ni michitaru kami.
Kami wa, ikanaru kannan no naka ni iru toki de mo watashitachi o nagusamete kudasari, mata, watashitachi jishin mo, kami ni nagusamete itadaku sono nagusame o motte, arayuru kannan no naka ni aru hitobito o nagusameru koto ga dekiru you ni shite kudasaru no de aru.
Sore wa, Kirisuto no kunan ga watashitachi ni michiafurete iru you ni, watashitachi no ukeru nagusame mo mata, Kirisuto ni yotte michiafurete irukara de aru.
Watashitachi ga kannan ni aunara, sore wa anata gata no nagusame to sukui to no tame de ari, nagusame o ukerunara, sore wa anata gata no nagusame no tame de atte, sono nagusame wa, watashitachi ga ukete iru no to onaji kunan ni taesaseru chikara to naru no de aru.
Dakara, anata gata ni taishite idaite iru watashitachi no nozomi wa, ugoku koto ga nai. Anata ga taga, watashitachi to tomo ni kunan ni azukatte iru you ni, nagusame ni mo tomo ni azukatte iru koto o shitte irukara de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi ga Ajiya de atta kannan o, shirazu ni ite moraitaku nai. Watashitachi wa kyokudo ni, taerarenai hodo appaku sarete, ikiru nozomi o sae ushinatte shimai,
Kokoro no uchi de shi o kakugo shi, jibun jishin o tanomi to shinaide, shinin o yomigaerasete kudasaru kami o tanomi to suru ni itatta.
Kami wa kono you na shi no kiken kara, watashitachi o sukuidashite kudasatta, mata sukuidashite kudasarude arou. Watashitachi wa, kami ga kongo mo sukuidashite kudasaru koto o nozonde iru.
Soshite, anata gata mo mata inori o motte, tomodomo ni, watashitachi o tasukete kurerude arou. Kore wa ooku no hitobito no negai ni yori watashitachi ni tamawatta megumi ni tsuite, ooku no hito ga kansha o sasageru you ni naru tame de aru.
Sate, watashitachi ga konoyo de, koto ni anata gata ni taishi, ningen no chie ni yotte de wa naku kami no megumi ni yotte, kami no shinsei to shinjitsu to ni yotte koudou shite kita koto wa, jitsu ni watashitachi no hokori de atte, ryoushin no akashi suru tokoro de aru.
Watashitachi ga kaite iru koto wa, anata gata ga yonde rikai dekinai koto de wa nai. Sore o kanzen ni rikai shite kureru you ni, watashi wa kibou suru.
Sudeni aru teido watashitachi o rikai shite kurete iru toori, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no hi ni wa, anata gata ga watashitachi no hokori de aru you ni, watashitachi mo anata gata no hokori na no de aru.
Kono kakushin o motte, watashitachi wa mou ichido megumi o esasetai no de, mazu anata gata no tokoro ni iki,
Sore kara sochira o tootte Makedoniya ni omomuki, soshite futatabi Makedoniya kara anata gata no tokoro ni kaeri, anata gata no miokuri o ukete Yudaya ni yuku keikaku o tateta no de aru.
Kono keikaku o tateta no wa, keisotsu na koto de attade arou ka. Sore to mo, jibun no keikaku o niku no omoi ni yotte keikaku shita tame, watashi no "Shikari, shikari" ga douji ni "Ina, ina" de atta no darou ka.
Kami no shinjitsu ni kakete iuga, anata gata ni taisuru watashi no kotoba wa, "Shikari" to douji ni "Ina" to iu you na mono de wa nai.
Naze nara, watashitachi, sunawachi, watashi to Shiruwano to Temote to ga, anata gata ni nobetsutaeta kami no ko Kirisuto Iesu wa, "Shikari" to naruto douji ni "Ina" to natta no de wa nai. Sou de wa naku, "Shikari" ga Iesu ni oite jitsugen sareta no de aru.
Naze nara, kami no yakusoku wa kotogotoku, kare ni oite "Shikari" to nattakara de aru. Dakara, watashitachi wa, kare ni yotte "Amen" to tonaete, kami ni eikou o kisuru no de aru.
Anata gata to tomo ni watashitachi o, Kirisuto no uchi ni kataku sasae, abura o sosoide kudasatta no wa, kami de aru.
Kami wa mata, watashitachi ni shouin o oshi, sono hoshou to shite, watashitachi no kokoro ni mitama o tamawatta no de aru.
Watashi wa jibun no tamashii o kake, kami o shounin ni yobimotomete iuga, watashi ga Korinto ni ikanaide iru no wa, anata gata ni taishite kandai de aritai tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata no shinkou o shihai suru mono de wa naku, anata gata no yorokobi no tame ni tomo ni hataraite iru mono ni suginai. Anata gata wa, shinkou ni kataku tatte irukara de aru.
Soko de watashi wa, anata gata no tokoro ni futatabi kanashimi o motte yuku koto wa sumaito, kesshin shita no de aru.
Moshi anatagata o kanashimaseru to sureba, watashi ga kanashimasete iru sono hito igai ni, dare ga watashi o yorokobasete kureru no ka.
Kono you na koto o kaita no wa, watashi ga yuku toki, watashi o yorokobasete kureru hazu no hitobito kara, kanashii omoi o saseraretaku nai tame de aru. Watashi jishin no yorokobi wa anata gata zentai no yorokobi de aru koto o, anata gata subete ni tsuite kakushin shite irukara de aru.
Watashi wa ookina kannan to kokoro no urei no naka kara, ooku no namida o motte anata gata ni kakiokutta. Sore wa, anatagata o kanashimaseru tame de wa naku, anata gata ni taishite afureru bakari ni idaite iru watashi no ai o, shitte morau tame de atta.
Shikashi, moshi dare ka ga hito o kanashimaseta to sureba, sore wa watashi o kanashimaseta no de wa naku, hikaeme ni iuga, aru teido, anata gata ichidou o kanashimaseta no de aru.
Sono hito ni totte wa, tasuu no mono kara uketa ano shobatsu de mou juubun na no dakara,
Anata gata wa mushiro kare o yurushi, mata nagusamete yarubekide aru. Sou shinaito, sono hito wa masumasu bukai kanashimi ni shizumu ka mo shirenai.
Soko de watashi wa, kare ni taishite ai o shimesu you ni, anata gata ni susumeru.
Watashi ga kakiokutta no mo, anata gata ga subete no koto ni tsuite juujun de aru ka dou ka o, tamesu tame ni hoka naranakatta.
Moshi anata ga taga, nani ka no koto ni tsuite hito o yurusunara, watashi mo mata yuru sou. Soshite, moshi watashi ga nani ka no koto de yurushita to sureba, sore wa, anata gata no tame ni Kirisuto no mimae de yurushita no de aru.
Sou suru no wa, Satan ni azamukareru koto no nai tame de aru. Watashitachi wa, kare no sakuryaku o shiranai wake de wa nai.
Sate, Kirisuto no fukuin no tame ni Toroasu ni itta toki, watashi no tame ni Shu no mon ga hirakareta ni mo kakawarazu,
Kyoudai Tetosu ni aenakatta no de, watashi wa ki ga ki de naku, hitobito ni wakarete, Makedoniya ni dekakete itta.
Shikaru ni, kami wa kansha subeki ka na. Kami wa itsu mo watashitachi o Kirisuto no gaisen ni tomonai yuki, watashitachi o tooshite Kirisuto o shiru chishiki no kaori o, itarutokoro ni hanatte kudasaru no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, sukuwareru mono ni totte mo horobiru mono ni totte mo, kami ni taisuru Kirisuto no kaori de aru.
Kousha ni totte wa, shi kara shi ni itaraseru kaori de ari, zensha ni totte wa, inochi kara inochi ni itaraseru kaori de aru. Ittai, kono you na ninmu ni, dare ga tae eyou ka.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa, ooku no hito no you ni kami no kotoba o urimono ni sezu, magokoro o komete, kami ni tsukawasareta mono to shite kami no mimae de, Kirisuto ni atte kataru no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, matamoya, jiko suisen o shi hajimete iru no darou ka. Sore to mo, aru hitobito no you ni, anata gata ni ateta, aruiha, anata gata kara no suisenjou ga hitsuyou na no darou ka.
Watashitachi no suisenjou wa, anatagata na no de aru. Sore wa, watashitachi no kokoro ni shirusarete ite, subete no hito ni shirare, katsu yomarete iru.
Soshite, anata gata wa jibun jishin ga, watashitachi kara okurareta Kirisuto no tegami de atte, sumi ni yorazu ikeru kami no rei ni yotte kakare, ishi no ita ni de wa naku hito no kokoro no ita ni kakareta mono de aru koto o, hakkiri to arawashite iru.
Kou shita kakushin o, watashitachi wa Kirisuto ni yori kami ni taishite idaite iru.
Mochiron, jibun jishin de koto o sadameru chikara ga jibun ni aru, to iu no de wa nai. Watashitachi no kou shita chikara wa, kami kara kite iru.
Kami wa watashitachi ni chikara o ataete, atarashii keiyaku ni tsukaeru mono to sareta no de aru. Sore wa, monji ni tsukaeru mono de wa naku, rei ni tsukaeru mono de aru. Monji wa hito o koroshi, rei wa hito o ikasu.
Moshi ishi ni horitsuketa monji ni yoru shi no tsutome ga eikou no uchi ni okonaware, sono tame Isuraeru no kora wa, Moose no kao no kiesarubeki eikou no yue ni, sono kao o mitsumeru koto ga dekinakatta to sureba,
Mashite rei no tsutome wa, haruka ni eikou aru mono de wa nakarou ka.
Moshi tsumi o senkoku suru tsutome ga eikou aru mono da to sureba, gi o senkoku suru tsutome wa, haruka ni eikou ni michita mono de aru.
Soshite, sudeni eikou o uketa mono mo, kono baai, haruka ni masatta eikou no mae ni, sono eikou o ushinatta no de aru.
Moshi kiesarubeki mono ga eikou o motte arawareta no nara, mashite eizonsubeki mono wa, motto eikou no arubeki mono de aru.
Kou shita nozomi o idaite iru no de, watashitachi wa omoikitte daitan ni katari,
Soshite Moose ga, kiesatte iku mono no saigo o Isuraeru no kora ni miraremai to shite, kao ni ooi o kaketa you na koto wa shinai.
Jissai, karera no omoi wa nibuku natte ita. Konnichi ni itaru made, karera ga furui keiyaku o roudoku suru baai, sono onaji ooi ga torisararenai mama de nokotte iru. Sore wa, Kirisuto ni atte hajimete torinozokareru no de aru.
Konnichi ni itaru mo nao, Moose no sho ga roudoku sareru tabi ni, ooi ga karera no kokoro ni kakatte iru.
Shikashi Shu ni muku toki ni wa, sono ooi wa torinozokareru.
Shu wa rei de aru. Soshite, Shu no rei no aru tokoro ni wa, jiyuu ga aru.
Watashitachi wa mina, kao ooi nashi ni, Shu no eikou o kagami ni utsusu you ni mitsutsu, eikou kara eikou e to, Shu to onaji sugata ni kaerarete iku. Kore wa rei naru Shu no hataraki ni yoru no de aru.
Kono you ni watashitachi wa, awaremi o ukete kono tsutome ni tsuite iru no dakara, rakutan sezu ni,
Hazubeki kakureta koto o sutesari, warudakumi ni yotte arukazu, kami no kotoba o magezu, shinri o akiraka ni shi, kami no mimae ni, subete no hito no ryoushin ni jibun o suisen suru no de aru.
Moshi watashitachi no fukuin ga oowarete irunara, horobiru monodomo ni totte oowarete iru no de aru.
Karera no baai, konoyo no kami ga fushin no monotachi no omoi o kuramasete, kami no katachi de aru Kirisuto no eikou no fukuin no kagayaki o, mienaku shite iru no de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa jibun jishin o nobetsutaeru no de wa naku, Shu naru Kirisuto Iesu o nobetsutaeru. Watashitachi jishin wa, tada Iesu no tame ni hataraku anata gata no shimobe ni suginai.
"Yami no naka kara hikari ga teri ideyo" to oose ni natta kami wa, Kirisuto no kao ni kagayaku kami no eikou no chishiki o akiraka ni suru tame ni, watashitachi no kokoro o tera shite kudasatta no de aru.
Shikashi watashitachi wa, kono takara o tsuchi no utsuwa no naka ni motte iru. Sono hakarishirenai chikara wa kami no mono de atte, watashitachi kara deta mono de nai koto ga, arawareru tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, shihou kara kannan o ukete mo kyuushinai. Tohou ni kurete mo yukizumaranai.
Hakugai ni atte mo misuterarenai. Taosarete mo horobinai.
Itsu mo Iesu no shi o kono mi ni oute iru. Sore wa mata, Iesu no inochi ga, kono mi ni arawareru tame de aru.
Watashitachi ikite iru mono wa, Iesu no tame ni taezu shi ni watasarete iru no de aru. Sore wa Iesu no inochi ga, watashitachi no shinubeki nikutai ni arawareru tame de aru.
Kou shite, shi wa watashitachi no uchi ni hataraki, inochi wa anata gata no uchi ni hataraku no de aru.
"Watashi wa shinjita. Sore yue ni katatta" to shirushite aru to ori, sore to onaji shinkou no rei o motte iru no de, watashitachi mo shinjite iru. Sore yue ni kataru no de aru.
Sore wa, Shu Iesu o yomigaeraseta kata ga, watashitachi o mo Iesu to tomo ni yomigaerase, soshite, anata gata to tomo ni mimae ni tatasete kudasaru koto o, shitte irukara de aru.
Subete no koto wa, anata gata no eki de atte, megumi ga masumasu ooku no hito ni mashi kuwawaru ni tsure, kansha ga michiafurete, kami no eikou to naru no de aru.
Dakara, watashitachi wa rakutan shinai. Tatoi watashitachi no soto naru hito wa horobite mo, uchi naru hito wa higoto ni atarashiku sarete iku.
Naze nara, kono shibaraku no karui kannan wa hataraite, eien no omoi eikou o, afureru bakari ni watashitachi ni e saserukara de aru.
Watashitachi wa, mieru mono ni de wa naku, mienai mono ni me o sosogu. Mieru mono wa ichijiteki de ari, mienai mono wa eien ni tsuzuku no de aru.
Watashitachi no sunde iru chijou no makuya ga kowareruto, kami kara itadaku tatemono, sunawachi ten ni aru, hito no te ni yoranai eien no ie ga sonaete aru koto o, watashitachi wa shitte iru.
Soshite, ten kara tamawaru sono sumika o, ue ni kiyouto setsuni nozominagara, kono makuya no naka de kurushimimodaete iru.
Sore o kitanara, hadaka no mama de wa inai koto ni narou.
Kono makuya no naka ni iru watashitachi wa, omoni o otte kurushimimodaete iru. Sore o nugou to negaukara de wa naku, sono ue ni kiyou to negaukara de ari, sore ni yotte, shinubeki mono ga inochi ni nomarete shimau tame de aru.
Watashitachi o, kono koto ni kanau mono ni shite kudasatta no wa, kami de aru. Soshite, kami wa sono hoshou to shite mitama o watashitachi ni tamawatta no de aru.
Dakara, watashitachi wa itsu mo kokorozuyoi. Soshite, nikutai o yado to shite iru aida wa Shu kara hanarete iru koto o, yoku shitte iru.
Watashitachi wa, mieru mono ni yoranaide, shinkou ni yotte aruite iru no de aru.
Sore de, watashitachi wa kokorozuyoi. Soshite, mushiro nikutai kara hanarete Shu to tomo ni sumu koto ga, negawashii to omotte iru.
Sou iu wake dakara, nikutai o yado to shite iru ni shite mo, sore kara hanarete iru ni shite mo, tada Shu ni yorokobareru mono to naru no ga, kokoro kara no negai de aru.
Naze nara, watashitachi wa mina, Kirisuto no sabaki no za no mae ni araware, zen de are aku de are, jibun no okonatta koto ni oujite, sorezore mukui o ukeneba naranaikara de aru.
Kono you ni watashitachi wa, Shu no osorubeki koto o shitte iru no de, hitobito ni tokisusumeru. Watashitachi no koto wa, kami no mimae ni wa akiraka ni natte iru. Sarani, anata gata no ryoushin ni mo akiraka ni naru you ni to nozomu.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata ni taishite, matamoya jiko suisen o shiyou to suru no de wa nai. Tada watashitachi o hokoru kikai o, anata gata ni motase, kokoro o hokoru no de wa naku uwabe dake o hokoru hitobito ni kotae uru you ni sasetai no de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga, ki ga kurutte iru no nara, sore wa kami no tame de ari, ki ga tashika de aru no nara, sore wa anata gata no tame de aru.
Naze nara, Kirisuto no ai ga watashitachi ni tsuyoku sematte irukara de aru. Watashitachi wa kou kangaete iru. Hitori no hito ga subete no hito no tame ni shinda ijou, subete no hito ga shinda no de aru.
Soshite, kare ga subete no hito no tame ni shinda no wa, ikite iru mono ga mohaya jibun no tame ni de wa naku, jibun no tame ni shinde yomigaetta kata no tame ni, ikiru tame de aru.
Sore dakara, watashitachi wa kongo, dare o mo niku ni yotte shiru koto wa sumai. Katsute wa Kirisuto o niku ni yotte shitte ita to shite mo, ima wa mou sono you na shirikata o sumai.
Dare de mo Kirisuto ni arunaraba, sono hito wa atarashiku tsukurareta mono de aru. Furui mono wa sugisatta, miyo, subete ga atarashiku natta no de aru.
Shikashi, subete korera no koto wa, kami kara dete iru. Kami wa Kirisuto ni yotte, watashitachi o gojibun ni wakai sase, katsu wakai no tsutome o watashitachi ni sazukete kudasatta.
Sunawachi, kami wa Kirisuto ni oite yo o gojibun ni wakai sase, sono zaika no sekinin o kore ni owaseru koto o shinaide, watashitachi ni wakai no fukuin o yudanerareta no de aru.
Kami ga watashitachi o tooshite susume o nasaru no de arukara, watashitachi wa Kirisuto no shisha na no de aru. Soko de, Kirisuto ni kawatte negau, kami no wakai o uke nasai.
Kami wa watashitachi no tsumi no tame ni, tsumi o shiranai kata o tsumi to sareta. Sore wa, watashitachi ga, kare ni atte kami no gi to naru tame na no de aru.
Watashitachi wa mata, kami to tomo ni hataraku mono to shite, anata gata ni susumeru. Kami no megumi o itazura ni ukete wa naranai.
Kami wa kou iwareru, "Watashi wa, megumi no toki ni anata no negai o kikiire, sukui no hi ni anata o tasuketa". Miyo, ima wa megumi no toki, miyo, ima wa sukui no hi de aru.
Kono tsutome ga so shiri o manekanai tame ni, watashitachi wa donna koto ni mo, hito ni tsumazuki o ataenai you ni shi,
Kaette, arayuru baai ni, kami no shimobe to shite, jibun o hitobito ni arawashite iru. Sunawachi, kyokudo no ninku ni mo, kannan ni mo, kiki ni mo, yukizumari ni mo,
Muchiutareru koto ni mo, nyuugoku ni mo, souran ni mo, rouku ni mo, tetsuya ni mo, kiga ni mo,
Shinjitsu to chishiki to kan'you to, jiai to seirei to itsuwari no nai ai to,
Shinri no kotoba to kami no chikara to ni yori, sayuu ni motte iru gi no buki ni yori,
Homerarete mo, soshirarete mo, akuhyou o ukete mo, kouhyou o hakushite mo, kami no shimobe to shite jibun o arawashite iru. Watashitachi wa, hito o madowashite iru you de aruga, shikamo shinjitsu de ari,
Hito ni shirarete inai you de aruga, mitomerare, shinikakatte iru you de aruga, miyo, ikite ori, korashimerarete iru you de aruga, korosarezu,
Kanashinde iru you de aruga, tsune ni yorokonde ori, mazushii you de aruga, ooku no hito o tomase, nani mo motanai you de aruga, subete no mono o motte iru.
Korinto no hitobito yo. Anata gata ni mukatte watashitachi no kuchi wa hirakarete ori, watashitachi no kokoro wa hiroku natte iru.
Anata gata wa, watashitachi ni kokoro o sebamerarete ita no de wa naku, jibun de kokoro o sebamete ita no da.
Watashi wa kodomotachi ni taisuru you ni iuga, dou ka anata gata no hou de mo kokoro o hiroku shite, watashi ni oujite hoshii.
Fushinja to, tsuriawanai kubiki o tomo ni suru na. Gi to fugi to nan no kaka wari ga aru ka. Hikari to yami to nan no majiwari ga aru ka.
Kirisuto to Beriaru to nan no chouwa ga aru ka. Shinkou to fushinkou to nan no kankei ga aru ka.
Kami no miya to guuzou to nan no itchi ga aru ka. Watashitachi wa, ikeru kami no miya de aru. Kami ga kou oose ni natte iru, "Watashi wa karera no aida ni sumi, katsu deiri o surude arou. Soshite, watashi wa karera no kami to nari, karera wa watashi no tami to narude arou".
Dakara, "Karera no aida kara dete iki, karera to bunri seyo, to Shu wa iwareru. Soshite, kegareta mono ni fure te wa naranai. Fure nakereba, watashi wa anatagata o ukeireyou.
Soshite watashi wa, anata gata no chichi to nari, anata gata wa, watashi no musuko, musume to narude arou. Zennou no Shu ga, kou iwareru".
Aisuru monotachi yo. Watashitachi wa, kono you na yakusoku o ataerarete iru no dakara, niku to rei to no issai no kegare kara jibun o kiyome, kami o osorete mattaku kiyoku naroude wa nai ka.
Dou ka, watashitachi ni kokoro o hiraite hoshii. Watashitachi wa, dare ni mo fugi o shita koto ga naku, dare o mo hametsu ni otoshiireta koto ga naku, dare kara mo damashitotta koto ga nai.
Watashi wa, semeru tsumori de kou iu no de wa nai. Mae ni mo itta you ni, anata gata wa watashi no kokoro no uchi ni ite, watashitachi to seishi o tomo ni shite iru no de aru.
Watashi wa anatagata o ooini shinrai shi, ooini hokotte iru. Mata, afureru bakari nagusame o uke, arayuru kannan no naka ni atte yorokobi ni michiafurete iru.
Sate, Makedoniya ni tsuita toki, watashitachi no mi ni sukoshi no yasumi mo naku, samazama no kannan ni ai, soto ni wa tatakai, uchi ni wa osore ga atta.
Shikaru ni, uchishiorete iru mono o nagusameru kami wa, Tetosu no tourai ni yotte, watashitachi o nagusamete kudasatta.
Tada kare no tourai ni yoru bakari de wa naku, kare ga anata gata kara uketa sono nagusame o motte, nagusamete kudasatta. Sunawachi, anata gata ga watashi o shitatte iru koto, nageite iru koto, mata watashi ni taishite nesshin de aru koto o shirasete kureta no de, watashi no yorokobi wa iyoiyo mashi kuwawatta no de aru.
Soko de, tatoi, ano tegami de anatagata o kanashimaseta to shite mo, watashi wa sore o kuite inai. Ano tegami ga shibaraku no aida de wa aruga, anatagata o kanashimaseta no o mite kuita to shite mo,
Ima wa yorokonde iru. Sore wa, anata gata ga kanashindakara de wa naku, kanashinde kuiaratameru ni itattakara de aru. Anata gata ga sono you ni kanashinda no wa, kami no mikokoro ni souta koto de atte, watashitachi kara wa nan no songai mo ukenakatta no de aru.
Kami no mikokoro ni souta kanashimi wa, kui no nai sukui o esaseru kuiaratame ni michibiki, konoyo no kanashimi wa shi o kitaraseru.
Miyo, kami no mikokoro ni souta sono kanashimi ga, donna ni ka netsujou o anata gata ni okosaseta koto ka. Mata, benmei, gifun, osore, aibo, netsui, sore kara shobatsu ni itaraseta koto ka. Anata gata wa ano mondai ni tsuite wa, subete no ten ni oite keppaku de aru koto o shoumei shita no de aru.
Dakara, watashi ga anata gata ni kakiokutta no wa, fugi o shita hito no tame de mo, fugi o uketa hito no tame de mo naku, watashitachi ni taisuru anata gata no netsujou ga, kami no mae ni anata gata no aida de akiraka ni naru tame de aru.
Kou iu wake de, watashitachi wa nagusamerareta no de aru. Korera no nagusame no ue ni Tetosu no yorokobi ga kuwawatte, watashitachi wa nao issou yorokonda. Kare ga anata gata ichidou ni yotte anshin saseraretakara de aru.
Soshite, watashi wa kare ni taishite anata gata no koto o sukoshiku hokottaga, sore wa watashi no haji ni naranai desu n da. Anata gata ni issai no koto o shinjitsu ni katatta you ni, Tetosu ni taishite hokotta koto mo shinjitsu to natte kita no de aru.
Mata kare wa, anata gata ichidou ga juujun de atte, osoreononokitsutsu jibun o mukaete kureta koto o omoidashite, masumasu kokoro o anata gata no hou ni yosete iru.
Watashi wa, anata gata ni mattaku shinrai suru koto ga dekite, yorokonde iru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa koko de, Makedoniya no shokyoukai ni ataerareta kami no megumi o, anata gata ni shiraseyou.
Sunawachi, karera wa, kannan no tame ni hageshii shiren o uketaga, sono michiafureru yorokobi wa, kyokudo no mazushisa ni mo kakawarazu, afuredete oshiminaku hodokosu tomi to natta no de aru.
Watashi wa akashi suruga, karera wa chikara ni oujite, ina, chikara ijou ni hodokoshi o shita. Sunawachi, mizukara susunde,
Seitotachi e no houshi ni kuwawaru megumi ni azukaritai to, watashitachi ni nesshin ni negaidete,
Watashitachi no kibou doori ni shita bakari ka, jibun jishin o mazu, kami no mikokoro ni shitagatte, Shu ni sasage, mata, watashitachi ni mo sasageta no de aru.
Soko de, kono bokin o Tetosu ga anata gata no tokoro de, sudeni hajimeta ijou, mata sore o kansei suru you ni to, watashitachi wa kare ni susumeta no de aru.
Sate, anata gata ga arayuru kotogara ni tsuite tonde iru you ni, sunawachi, shinkou ni mo kotoba ni mo chishiki ni mo, arayuru netsujou ni mo, mata, anata gata ni taisuru watashitachi no ai ni mo tonde iru you ni, kono megumi no waza ni mo tonde hoshii.
Kou itte mo, watashi wa meirei suru no de wa nai. Tada, ta no hitotachi no netsujou ni yotte, anata gata no ai no junshinsa o tamesou to suru no de aru.
Anata gata wa, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi o shitte iru. Sunawachi, Shu wa tonde orareta no ni, anata gata no tame ni mazushiku narareta. Sore wa, anata ga taga, kare no mazushisa ni yotte tomu mono ni naru tame de aru.
Soko de, watashi wa, kono megumi no waza ni tsuite iken o nobeyou. Sore ga anata gata no eki ni narukara de aru. Anata gata wa kono koto o, sakunen irai, hoka ni sakinjite jikkou shita bakari de wa naku, sore o negatte ita.
Dakara ima, sore o yaritoge nasai. Anata gata ga kokoro kara negatte iru you ni, motte iru tokoro ni oujite, sore o yaritoge nasai.
Moshi kokoro kara negatte sou surunara, motanai tokoro ni yorazu, motte iru tokoro ni yotte, kami ni ukeirerareru no de aru.
Sore wa, hoka no hitobito ni raku o sasete, anata gata ni kurou o saseyou to suru no de wa naku, mochimono o hitoshiku suru tame de aru.
Sunawachi, ima no baai wa, anata gata no yoyuu ga ano hitotachi no ketsubou o oginai, nochi ni wa, karera no yoyuu ga anata gata no ketsubou o oginai, kou shite hitoshiku naru you ni suru no de aru.
Sore wa "Ooku eta mono mo amaru koto ga naku, sukoshi shika enakatta mono mo tarinai koto wa nakatta" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata ni taishite motte iru onaji netsujou o, Tetosu no kokoro ni mo ataete kudasatta kami ni kansha suru.
Kare wa watashi no susume o ukeire, soshite sarani nesshin ni natte, jibun kara susunde anata gata no tokoro ni itta.
Watashitachi wa mata, Tetosu to issho ni, hitori no kyoudai o okuru. Kono kyoudai ga fukuin senden no ue de eta homare wa, subete no kyoukai ni kikoete iruga,
Sono ue, kare wa, Shu gojishin no eikou ga arawareru tame, mata, watashitachi no koui o shimesu tame ni, hone o otte okurimono o atsumete iru watashitachi no douhansha to shite, shokyoukai kara erabareta no de aru.
Sou shita no wa, watashitachi ga atsumete iru kono kifukin no koto ni tsuite, hito ni karekore iwareru no o sakeru tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, Shu no mimae bakari de wa naku, hito no mae de mo kousei de aru you ni, ki o kubatte iru no de aru.
Mata, mou hitori no kyoudai o karera to issho ni okuru. Watashitachi wa, ooku no koto ni tsuite kare ga nesshin de atta koto o, tabitabi mitometa. Kare wa ima, anatagata o hijou ni shinrai shite, masumasu nesshin ni natte iru.
Tetosu ni tsuite ieba, kare wa watashi no nakama de ari, anata gata ni taisuru watashi no kyouryokusha de aru. Kono kyoudaitachi ni tsuite ieba, karera wa shokyoukai no shisha, Kirisuto no eikou de aru.
Dakara, anata gata no ai to, mata, anata gata ni tsuite watashitachi ga idaite iru hokori to ga, shinjitsu de aru koto o, shokyoukai no mae de karera ni akashi shite itadakitai.
Seitotachi ni taisuru enjo ni tsuite wa, imasara, anata gata ni kakiokuru hitsuyou wa nai.
Watashi wa, anata gata no koui o shitte ori, sono tame ni, anata gata no koto o Makedoniya no hitobito ni hokotte, Akaya de wa sakunen irai, sudeni junbi o shite iru no da to itta. Soshite, anata gata no nesshin wa, ooku no hito o funki saseta no de aru.
Watashi ga kyoudaitachi o okuru koto ni shita no wa, anata gata ni tsuite watashitachi no hokotta koto ga, kono baai munashiku naranaide, watashi ga itta toori junbi shite ite moraitaikara de aru.
Sou de naito, man'ichi Makedoniya bito ga watashi to issho ni itte, junbi ga dekite inai no o mitara, anata gata wa mochiron, watashitachi mo, kayou ni shinji kitte ita dake ni, haji o kaku koto ni narou.
Dakara, watashi wa kyoudaitachi o unagashite, anata gata no tokoro e saki ni ikase, izen anata gata ga yakusoku shite ita okurimono no junbi o sasete oku koto ga hitsuyou da to omotta. Sore o shiburinagara de wa naku, kokoro o komete youi shite ite hoshii.
Watashi no kangae wa kou de aru. Sukoshi shika makanaimono wa, sukoshi shika karitorazu, yutaka ni makumono wa, yutaka ni karitoru koto ni naru.
Kakuji wa oshimu kokoro kara de naku, mata, shi irarete de mo naku, mizukara kokoro de kimeta toori ni subekide aru. Kami wa yorokonde hodokosu hito o aishite kudasaru no de aru.
Kami wa anata gata ni arayuru megumi o yutaka ni atae, anatagata o tsune ni subete no koto ni michi tarase, subete no yoi waza ni tomaseru chikara no arukata na no de aru.
"Kare wa mazushii hitotachi ni chirashite ataeta. Sono gi wa eien ni tsuzukude arou" to kaite aru toori de aru.
Tane makuhito ni tane to taberu tame no pan to o sonaete kudasaru kata wa, anata gata ni mo tane o sonae, sore o fuyashi, soshite anata gata no gi no mi o mashite kudasaru no de aru.
Kou shite, anata gata wa subete no koto ni yutaka ni natte, oshiminaku hodokoshi, sono hodokoshi wa watashitachi no te ni yotte okonaware, kami ni kansha suru ni itaru no de aru.
Naze nara, kono enjo no hataraki wa, seitotachi no ketsubou o oginae dake de wa naku, kami ni taisuru ooku no kansha ni yotte masumasu yutaka ni narukara de aru.
Sunawachi, kono enjo o okonatta kekka to shite, anata gata ga Kirisuto no fukuin no kokuhaku ni taishite juujun de aru koto ya, karera ni mo, subete no hito ni mo, oshiminaku hodokoshi o shite iru koto ga wakatte kite, karera wa kami ni eikou o kishi,
Soshite, anata gata ni tamawatta kiwamete yutaka na kami no megumi no yue ni, anatagata o shitai, anata gata no tame ni inoru no de aru.
Ii tsukusenai tamamono no yue ni, kami ni kansha suru.
Sate, "Anata gata no aida ni ite men to mukatte wa otonashiiga, hanarete iruto, ki ga tsuyoku naru" kono Pauro ga, Kirisuto no yasashisa, kandaisa o motte, anata gata ni susumeru.
Watashitachi o niku ni shitagatte aruite iru ka no you ni omotte iru hitobito ni taishite wa, watashi wa yuukan ni koudou suru tsumori de aruga, anata gata no tokoro de wa, dou ka, sono you na omoikitta koto o shinaide sumu you de aritai.
Watashitachi wa, niku ni atte aruite wa iruga, niku ni shitagatte tatakatte iru no de wa nai.
Watashitachi no tatakai no buki wa, niku no mono de wa naku, kami no tame ni wa yousai o mo hakai suru hodo no chikara aru mono de aru. Watashitachi wa samazama na giron o yaburi,
Kami no chie ni sakaratte taterareta arayuru shougaibutsu o uchikowashi, subete no omoi o toriko ni shite Kirisuto ni fukujuu sase,
Soshite, anata gata ga kanzen ni fukujuu shita toki, subete fujuujun na mono o shobatsu shiyou to, youi shite iru no de aru.
Anata gata wa, uwabe no koto dake o mite iru. Moshi aru hito ga, Kirisuto ni zokusuru mono da to jinin shite irunara, sono hito wa mou ichido yoku hansei subekide aru. Sono hito ga Kirisuto ni zokusuru mono de aru you ni, watashitachi mo sou de aru.
Tatoi, anatagata o taosu tame de wa naku takameru tame ni Shu kara watashitachi ni tamawatta ken'i ni tsuite, watashi ga yaya hokori sugita to shite mo, haji ni wa narumai.
Tada, watashi wa, tegami de anatagata o odoshite iru no dato, omowaretaku wa nai.
Hito wa iu, "Kare no tegami wa omomi ga atte chikarazuyoiga, atte miruto gaiken wa yowayowashiku, hanashi wa tsumaranai".
Sou iu hito wa kokoroete iru ga yoi. Watashitachi wa, hanarete ite kakiokuru tegami no kotoba doori ni, issho ni iru toki de mo onaji you ni furumau no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, jiko suisen o suru you na hitobito to jibun o douretsu ni oi tari hikaku shi tari wa shinai. Karera wa nakama doushi de tagai ni hakari at tari, tagai ni kurabeat tari shite iruga, chie no nai shiwaza de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa gendo o koete hokoru you na koto wa shinai. Mushiro, kami ga wariatete kudasatta chiiki no gendonai de hokoru ni suginai. Watashi wa sono gendo ni shitagatte, anata gata no tokoro made itta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata no tokoro made ikenai mono de aru ka no you ni, muri ni te o nobashite iru no de wa nai. Jijitsu, watashitachi ga saisho ni Kirisuto no fukuin o tazusaete, anata gata no tokoro made mo itta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa gendo o koete, tanin no hataraki o hokoru you na koto wa shinai. Tada, anata gata no shinkou ga seichou suru ni tsurete, watashitachi no hataraki no han'i ga anata gata no naka de masumasu ookiku naru koto o nozonde iru.
Kou shite, watashitachi wa hoka no hito no chiiki de sudeni nasarete iru koto o hokoru koto wa sezu ni, anatagata o koeta sakizaki ni made, fukuin o nobetsutaetai.
Hokoru mono wa Shu o hokorubekide aru.
Jibun de jibun o suisen suru hito de wa naku, Shu ni suisen sareru hito koso, tashika na hito na no de aru.
Watashi ga sukoshi bakari oroka na koto o iu no o, dou ka, shinonde hoshii. Mochiron shinonde kureru no da.
Watashi wa kami no netsujou o motte, anatagata o netsuai shite iru. Anatagata o, kiyoi otome to shite, tada hitori no danshi Kirisuto ni sasageru tame ni, kon'yaku saseta no de aru.
Tada osoreru no wa, Eba ga hebi no warudakumi de yuuwaku sareta you ni, anata gata no omoi ga kegasarete, Kirisuto ni taisuru junjou to teisou to o ushinai wa shinai ka to iu koto de aru.
To iu no wa, moshi aru hito ga kite, watashitachi ga nobetsutae mo shinakatta you na kotonaru Iesu o nobetsutae, aruiha, anata gata ga uketa koto no nai chigatta rei o uke, aruiha, ukeireta koto no nai chigatta fukuin o kiku baai ni, anata gata wa yoku mo sore o shinonde iru.
Jijitsu, watashi wa, ano daishito tachi ni isasaka mo ototte wa inai to omou.
Tatoi benzetsu wa tsutanakute mo, chishiki wa sou de nai. Watashi wa, kotogoto ni, iroiro no baai ni, anata gata ni taishite sore o akiraka ni shita.
Sore to mo, anatagata o takameru tame ni jibun o hikuku shite, kami no fukuin o atai nashi ni anata gata ni nobetsutaeta koto ga, tsumi ni naru no darou ka.
Watashi wa ta no shokyoukai o kasumeta to iwarenagara eta kane de, anata gata ni houshi shi,
Anata gata no tokoro ni ite binbou o shita toki ni mo, dare ni mo futan o kaketa koto wa nakatta. Watashi no ketsubou wa, Makedoniya kara kita kyoudaitachi ga, oginatte kureta. Kou shite, watashi wa subete no koto ni tsuki, anata gata ni omoni o owasemai to tsutomete kitashi, kongo mo tsutomeyou.
Watashi no uchi ni aru Kirisuto no shinjitsu ni kakete iu, kono hokori ga Akaya chihou de fuujirareru you na koto wa, kesshite nai.
Naze de aru ka. Watashi ga anatagata o aishite inaikara ka. Sore wa, kami ga gozonjide aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa, genzai shite iru koto o kongo mo shite ikou. Sore wa, watashitachi to onaji you ni hokori uru tachi ba o eyou to kikai o neratte iru monodomo kara, sono kikai o tachikitte shimau tame de aru.
Kou iu hitobito wa nise shito, hito o damasu hatarakibito de atte, Kirisuto no shito ni gisou shite iru ni suginaikara de aru.
Shikashi, odoroku ni wa oyobanai. Satan mo hikari no tenshi ni gisou suru no dakara.
Dakara, tatoi Satan no teshitadomo ga, gi no houshisha no you ni gisou shita to shite mo, fushigi de wa nai. Karera no saigo wa, sono shiwaza ni atta mono to narou.
Kurikaeshite iuga, dare mo, watashi o orokamono to omowanaide hoshii. Moshi sou omounara, orokamono atsukai ni sarete mo yoikara, watashi ni mo, sukoshi hokorasete hoshii.
Ima iu koto wa, Shu ni yo tte iu no de wa naku, orokamono no you ni, jibun no hokori to suru tokoro o shinji kitte iu no de aru.
Ooku no hito ga niku ni yotte hokotte irukara, watashi mo hokorou.
Anata gata wa kashikoi hitotachi na no dakara, yorokonde orokamono o shinonde kurerudarou.
Jissai, anata gata wa dorei ni sarete mo, kuitaosarete mo, ryakudatsu sarete mo, ibararete mo, kao o tatakarete mo, sore o shinonde iru.
Iu no mo hazukashii koto daga, watashitachi wa yowa sugita no da. Moshi aru hito ga aete hokorunara, watashi wa orokamono ni natte iuga, watashi mo aete hokorou.
Karera wa Heburubito na no ka. Watashi mo sou de aru. Karera wa Isuraerubito na no ka. Watashi mo sou de aru. Karera wa Aburahamu no shison na no ka. Watashi mo sou de aru.
Karera wa Kirisuto no shimobe na no ka. Watashi wa ki ga kurutta you ni natte iu, watashi wa karera ijou ni sou de aru. Kurou shita koto wa motto ooku, tougoku sareta koto mo motto ooku, muchiutareta koto wa, haruka ni obitadashiku, shi ni menshita koto mo shibashiba atta.
Yudayajin kara yonjuu ni hitotsu tarinai muchi o uketa koto ga go do,
Roomajin ni muchi de utareta koto ga san do, ishi de utareta koto ga ichido, nansen shita koto ga san do, soshite, itchuuya, umi no ue o tadayotta koto mo aru.
Iku tabi mo tabi o shi, kawa no nan, touzoku no nan, doukokumin no nan, ihoujin no nan, tokai no nan, arano no nan, kaijou no nan, nise kyoudai no nan ni ai,
Roushi kurushimi, tabitabi nemurarenu yoru o sugoshi, uekawaki, shibashiba shokumotsu ga naku, samusa ni kogoe, hadaka de ita koto mo atta.
Nao iroiro no koto ga atta hoka ni, hibi watashi ni sematte kuru shokyoukai no shinpaigoto ga aru.
Dare ka ga yowatte iru no ni, watashi mo yowaranaide oreyou ka. Dare ka ga tsumi o okashite iru no ni, watashi no kokoro ga moenaide oreyou ka.
Moshi hokoraneba naranai no nara, watashi wa jibun no yowasa o hokorou.
Eien ni ho mubeki, Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chichi naru kami wa, watashi ga itsuwari o itte inai koto o, gozonjide aru.
Damasuko de Areta ou no daikan ga, watashi o toraeru tame ni Damasukobito no machi o kanshi shita koto ga attaga,
Sono toki watashi wa mado kara machi no jouhekizutai ni, kago de tsuri orosarete, kare no te kara nogareta.
Watashi wa hokorazaru o enai no de, mueki de wa arouga, Shu no maboroshi to keiji to ni tsuite katarou.
Watashi wa Kirisuto ni aru hitori no hito o shitte iru. Kono hito wa juu yon nen mae ni daisan no ten ni made hikiagerareta - - sore ga, karada no mama de atta ka, watashi wa shiranai. Karada o hanarete de atta ka, sore mo shiranai. Kami ga gozonjide aru.
Kono hito ga - - sore ga, karada no mama de atta ka, karada o hanarete de atta ka, watashi wa shiranai. Kami ga gozonjide aru - -
Paradaisu ni hikiagerare, soshite kuchi ni iiarawasenai, ningen ga katatte wa naranai kotoba o kiita no o, watashi wa shitte iru.
Watashi wa kou iu hito ni tsuite hokorou. Shikashi, watashi jishin ni tsuite wa, jibun no yowasa igai ni wa hokoru koto o sumai.
Mottomo, watashi ga hokorou to sureba, hontou no koto o iu no dakara, orokamono ni wa naranaidarou. Shikashi, sore wa sashihikaeyou. Watashi ga sugureta keiji o ukete iru no de, watashi ni tsuite mi tari kii tari shite iru ijou ni, hito ni kaikaburareru ka mo shirenaikara.
Soko de, kouman ni naranai you ni, watashi no nikutai ni hitotsu no toge ga ataerareta. Sore wa, kouman ni naranai you ni, watashi o utsu Satan no tsukai na no de aru.
Kono koto ni tsuite, watashi wa kare o hanaresarasete kudasaru you ni to, san do mo Shu ni inotta.
Tokoro ga, Shu ga iwareta, "Watashi no megumi wa anata ni taishite juubun de aru. Watashi no chikara wa yowai tokoro ni kanzen ni arawareru". Sore dakara, Kirisuto no chikara ga watashi ni yadoru you ni, mushiro, yorokonde jibun no yowasa o hokorou.
Dakara, watashi wa Kirisuto no tame naraba, yowasa to, bujoku to, kiki to, hakugai to, yukizumari to ni amanjiyou. Naze nara, watashi ga yowai toki ni koso, watashi wa tsuyoikara de aru.
Watashi wa orokamono to natta. Anata ga taga, muri ni watashi o sou shite shimatta no da. Jissai wa, anata gata kara suisen sarerubekide atta. To iu no wa, tatoi watashi wa toru ni tarinai mono da to shite mo, ano daishito tachi ni wa nanra otoru tokoro ga naikara de aru.
Watashi wa, shito taru no jitsu o, shirushi to kiseki to chikara aru wazato ni yori, nintai o tsukushite, anata gata no aida de arawashite kita.
Ittai, anata gata ga ta no kyoukai yori mo ototte iru ten wa nani ka. Tada, kono watashi ga anata gata ni futan o kakenakatta koto dake de wa nai ka. Kono fugi wa, dou ka, yurushite moraitai.
Sate, watashi wa ima, san dome ni anata gata no tokoro ni yuku youi o shite iru. Shikashi, futan wa kakenai tsumori de aru. Watashi no motomete iru no wa, anata gata no mochimono de wa naku, anata gata jishin na no dakara. Ittai, kodomo wa oya no tame ni zai o takuwaete oku hitsuyou wa naku, oya ga kodomo no tame ni takuwaete okubekide aru.
Soko de watashi wa, anata gata no tamashii no tame ni wa, ooini yorokonde hiyou o tsukai, mata, watashi jishin o mo tsukai tsukusou. Watashi ga anatagata o aisureba aisuru hodo, anata gata kara masumasu aisarenaku naru no de arou ka.
Watashi wa, anata gata ni omoni o owasenakatta to shite mo, warugashikokute, anata gata kara damashitotta no dato, hito wa iu.
Watashi wa, anata gata ni tsukawashita hitotachi no uchi no dare ka o tooshite, anata gata kara musabori tottadarou ka.
Watashi wa, Tetosu ni susumete sochira ni ikase, mata, kano kyoudai o doukou saseta. Tetosu wa, anata gata kara musabori totta koto ga arou ka. Watashitachi wa, mina onaji kokoro de aruitade wa nai ka. Onaji ashinami de aruitade wa nai ka.
Anata gata wa, watashitachi ga anata gata ni taishite benmei o shite iru no dato, ima made zutto omotte kitade arou. Shikashi, watashitachi wa, kami no mimae de Kirisuto ni atte katatte iru no de aru. Aisuru monotachi yo. Korera subete no koto wa, anata gata no toku o takameru tame na no de aru.
Watashi wa, konna shinpai o shite iru. Watashi ga itte miruto, moshi ka shitara, anata gata ga watashi no negatte iru you na mono de wa naku, watashi mo, anata gata no negatte iru you na mono de nai koto ni nari wa sumai ka. Moshi ka shitara, arasoi, netami, ikari, touhashin, soshiri, zange n, kouman, souran nado ga ari wa sumai ka.
Watashi ga futatabi sochira ni itta baai, watashi no kami ga, anata gata no mae de watashi ni haji o kakase, sono ue, ooku no hito ga mae ni tsumi o okashite inagara, sono kegare to fuhinkou to koushoku to o kuiaratamete inai no de, watashi o kanashimaseru koto ni nari wa sumai ka.
Watashi wa ima, san dome ni anata gata no tokoro ni ikou to shite iru. Subete no kotogara wa, futari ka sannin no shounin no shougen ni yotte kakutei suru.
Watashi wa, mae ni tsumi o okashita monotachi ya sono ta no subete no hitobito ni, ni dome ni taizai shite ita toki keikoku shite oitaga, hanarete iru ima mata arakajime itte oku. Kondo itta toki ni wa, kesshite yousha wa shinai.
Naze nara, anata ga taga, Kirisuto no watashi ni atte katatte orareru to iu shouko o motomete irukara de aru. Kirisuto wa, anata gata ni taishite yowaku wa naku, anata gata no uchi ni atte tsuyoi.
Sunawachi, Kirisuto wa yowasa no yue ni juujika ni tsukeraretaga, kami no chikara ni yotte ikite orareru no de aru. Kono you ni, watashitachi mo Kirisuto ni atte yowai mono de aruga, anata gata ni taishite wa, kami no chikara ni yotte, Kirisuto to tomo ni ikiru no de aru.
Anata gata wa, hatashite shinkou ga aru ka dou ka, jibun o hansei shi, jibun o ginmi suru ga yoi. Sore to mo, Iesu Kirisuto ga anata gata no uchi ni orareru koto o, satoranai no ka. Moshi satoranakereba, anata gata wa, nisemono to shite misuterareru.
Shikashi watashi wa, jibuntachi ga misuterareta mono de wa nai koto o, shitte ite moraitai.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata ga donna aku o mo okonawanai you ni to, kami ni inoru. Sore wa, jibuntachi ga hontou no mono de aru koto o miseru tame de wa naku, tatoi watashitachi ga misuterareta mono no you ni natte mo, anata gata ni yoi okonai o shite moraitai tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, shinri ni sakaratte wa nani o suru chikara mo naku, shinri ni shitagaeba chikara ga aru.
Watashitachi wa, jibun wa yowakute mo, anata gata ga tsuyokereba, sore o yorokobu. Watashitachi ga tokuni inoru no wa, anata gata ga kanzen ni yoku natte kureru koto de aru.
Kou iu wake de, hanarete ite ijou no you na koto o kaita no wa, watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni itta toki, taosu tame de wa naku takameru tame ni Shu ga sazukete kudasatta ken'i o mochiite, kibishii shochi o suru hitsuyou ga nai you ni shitai tame de aru.
Saigo ni, kyoudaitachi yo. Itsu mo yorokobi nasai. Mattaki mono to nari nasai. Tagai ni hagemashiai nasai. Omoi o hitotsu ni shi nasai. Heiwa ni sugoshi nasai. Sou sureba, ai to heiwa no kami ga anata gata to tomo ni ite kudasarude arou.
Kiyoi seppun o motte tagai ni aisatsu o kawashi nasai. Seitotachi ichidou ga, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi to, kami no ai to, seirei no majiwari to ga, anata gata ichidou to tomo ni aru you ni.

Hitobito kara de mo naku, hito ni yotte de mo naku, Iesu Kirisuto to kare o shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta chichi naru kami to ni yotte taterareta shito Pauro,
Narabi ni watashi to tomo ni iru kyoudaitachi ichidou kara, Garateya no shokyoukai e.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Kirisuto wa, watashitachi no chichi naru kami no mimune ni shitagai, watashitachi o ima no aku no yo kara sukuidasou to shite, gojishin o watashitachi no tsumi no tame ni sasagerareta no de aru.
Eikou ga yoyo kagirinaku kami ni aru you ni, amen.
Anata gata ga konna ni mo hayaku, anatagata o Kirisuto no megumi no uchi e omaneki ni natta kata kara hanarete, chigatta fukuin ni ochite iku koto ga, watashi ni wa fushigi de naranai.
Sore wa fukuin to iubeki mono de wa naku, tada, aru tane no hitobito ga anatagata o kakimidashi, Kirisuto no fukuin o mageyou to shite iru dake no koto de aru.
Shikashi, tatoi watashitachi de arouto, ten kara no mitsukai de arouto, watashitachi ga nobetsutaeta fukuin ni hansuru koto o anata gata ni nobetsutaerunara, sono hito wa norowarubekide aru.
Watashitachi ga mae ni itte oita you ni, ima watashi wa kasanete iu. Moshi aru hito ga, anata gata no ukeireta fukuin ni hansuru koto o nobetsutaete irunara, sono hito wa norowarubekide aru.
Ima watashi wa, hito ni yorokobareyou to shite iru no ka, sore to mo, kami ni yorokobareyou to shite iru no ka. Aruiha, hito no kanshin o kaou to tsutomete iru no ka. Moshi, ima mo nao hito no kanshin o kaou to shite iru to sureba, watashi wa Kirisuto no shimobe de wa arumai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ni, hakkiri itte oku. Watashi ga nobetsutaeta fukuin wa ningen ni yoru mono de wa nai.
Watashi wa, sore o ningen kara uketa no de mo oshierareta no de mo naku, tada Iesu Kirisuto no keiji ni yotta no de aru.
Yudayakyou o shinjite ita koro no watashi no koudou ni tsuite wa, anata gata wa sudeni yoku kiite iru. Sunawachi, watashi wa hageshiku kami no kyoukai o hakugai shi, mata arashimawatte ita.
Soshite, doukokujin no naka de watashi to dounenpai no ooku no mono ni masatte Yudayakyou ni shoujin shi, senzotachi no iitsutae ni taishite, dare yori mo haruka ni nesshin de atta.
Tokoro ga, haha no tainai ni aru toki kara watashi o seibetsu shi, mimegumi o motte watashi o omeshi ni natta kata ga,
Ihoujin no aida ni nobetsutaesaseru tame ni, miko o watashi no uchi ni keiji shite kudasatta toki, watashi wa tadachini, ketsuniku ni soudan mo sezu,
Mata senpai no shitotachi ni au tame ni Erusaremu ni mo noborazu, Arabiya ni dete itta. Sore kara futatabi Damasuko ni kaetta.
Sono nochi san nen tatte kara, watashi wa Kepa o tazunete Erusaremu ni nobori, kare no moto ni juu go nichikan, taizai shita.
Shikashi, Shu no kyoudai Yakobu igai ni wa, hoka no dono shito ni mo awanakatta.
Koko ni kaite iru koto wa, kami no mimae de iuga, kesshite itsuwari de wa nai.
Sono nochi, watashi wa Shiriya to Kirikiya to no chihou ni itta.
Shikashi, Kirisuto ni aru Yudaya no shokyoukai ni wa, kao o shirarete inakatta.
Tada karera wa, "Katsute jibuntachi o hakugai shita mono ga, izen ni wa bokumetsu shiyou to shite ita sono shinkou o, ima wa nobetsutaete iru" to kiki,
Watashi no koto de, kami o hometataeta.
Sono nochi juu yon nen tatte kara, watashi wa Barunaba to issho ni, Tetosu o mo tsurete, futatabi Erusaremu ni nobotta.
Soko ni nobotta no wa, keiji ni yotte de aru. Soshite, watashi ga ihoujin no aida ni nobetsutaete iru fukuin o, hitobito ni shimeshi, "Omo datta hitotachi" ni wa kojinteki ni shimeshita. Sore wa, watashi ga genni hashitte ori, mata sudeni hashitte kita koto ga, muda ni naranai tame de aru.
Shikashi, watashi ga tsurete ita Tetosu de sae, Girishiyajin de atta no ni, katsurei o shi irarenakatta.
Sore wa, shinobikonde kita nise kyoudaira ga ita no de - - karera ga shinobikonde kita no wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte motte iru watashitachi no jiyuu o neratte, watashitachi o dorei ni suru tame de atta.
Watashitachi wa, fukuin no shinri ga anata gata no moto ni tsune ni todomatte iru you ni, shunji mo karera no kyouyou ni kuppuku shinakatta.
Soshite, kano "Omo datta hitotachi" kara wa - - karera ga donna hito de atta ni shite mo, sore wa, watashi ni wa mattaku mondai de wa nai. Kami wa hito o wakehedate nasaranai no dakara - - jijitsu, kano "Omo datta hitotachi" wa, watashi ni nani mo kuwaeru koto o shinakatta.
Sore dokoro ka, karera wa, Petero ga katsurei no mono e no fukuin o yudanerarete iru you ni, watashi ni wa mukatsurei no mono e no fukuin ga yudanerarete iru koto o mitome,
(to iu no wa, Petero ni hatarakikakete katsurei no mono e no shito no tsutome ni tsukaseta kata wa, watashi ni mo hatarakikakete, ihoujin ni tsukawashite kudasattakara de aru),
Katsu, watashi ni tamawatta megumi o shitte, hashira to shite omonjirarete iru Yakobu to Kepa to Yohane to wa, watashi to Barunaba to ni, majiwari no te o sashinobeta. Soko de, watashitachi wa ihoujin ni iki, karera wa katsurei no mono ni iku koto ni natta no de aru.
Tada hitotsu, watashitachi ga mazushii hitobito o kaerimiru you ni to no koto de attaga, watashi wa motoyori, kono koto no tame ni mo ooini tsutomete kita no de aru.
Tokoro ga, Kepa ga Anteoke ni kita toki, kare ni hinan subeki koto ga atta no de, watashi wa men to mukatte kare o najitta.
To iu no wa, Yakobu no moto kara aru hitobito ga kuru made wa, kare wa ihoujin to shoku o tomo ni shite ita no ni, karera ga kite kara wa, katsurei no monodomo o osore, shidai ni mi o hiite hanarete ittakara de aru.
Soshite, hoka no Yudayajintachi mo kare to tomo ni gizen no koui o shi, Barunaba made ga sono you na gizen ni hikizuri komareta.
Karera ga fukuin no shinri ni shitagatte massugu ni aruite inai no o mite, watashi wa shuujin no menzen de Kepa ni itta, "Anata wa, Yudayajin de aru no ni, jibun jishin wa Yudayajin no you ni seikatsu shinaide, ihoujin no you ni seikatsu shite inagara, dou shite ihoujin ni Yudayajin no you ni naru koto o shi iru no ka".
Watashitachi wa umarenagara no Yudayajin de atte, ihoujin naru tsumibito de wa naiga,
Hito no gi to sareru no wa rippou no okonai ni yoru no de wa naku, tada Kirisuto Iesu o shinjiru shinkou ni yoru koto o mitomete, watashitachi mo Kirisuto Iesu o shinjita no de aru. Sore wa, rippou no okonai ni yoru no de wa naku, Kirisuto o shinjiru shinkou ni yotte gi to sareru tame de aru. Naze nara, rippou no okonai ni yotte wa, dare hitori gi to sareru koto ga naikara de aru.
Shikashi, Kirisuto ni atte gi to sareru koto o motomeru koto ni yotte, watashitachi jishin ga tsumibito de aru to sareru no nara, Kirisuto wa tsumi ni tsukaeru mono na no de arou ka. Danjite sou de wa nai.
Moshi watashi ga, ittan uchikowashita mono o, futatabi tateru to sureba, sore koso, jibun ga ihansha de aru koto o hyoumei suru koto ni naru.
Watashi wa, kami ni ikiru tame ni, rippou ni yotte rippou ni shinda. Watashi wa Kirisuto to tomo ni juujika ni tsukerareta.
Ikite iru no wa, mohaya, watashi de wa nai. Kirisuto ga, watashi no uchi ni ikite orareru no de aru. Shikashi, watashi ga ima niku ni atte ikite iru no wa, watashi o aishi, watashi no tame ni gojishin o sasagerareta kami no miko o shinjiru shinkou ni yotte, ikite iru no de aru.
Watashi wa, kami no megumi o mu ni wa shinai. Moshi, gi ga rippou ni yotte erareru to sureba, Kirisuto no shi wa muda de atta koto ni naru.
Aa, monowakari no warui Garateyabito yo. Juujika ni tsukerareta Iesu Kirisuto ga, anata gata no me no mae ni egakidasareta no ni, ittai, dare ga anatagata o madowashita no ka.
Watashi wa, tada kono hitotsu no koto o, anata gata ni kiite mitai. Anata gata ga mitama o uketa no wa, rippou o okonattakara ka, sore to mo, kiite shinjitakara ka.
Anata gata wa, sonna ni monowakari ga warui no ka. Mitama de hajimeta no ni, ima ni natte niku de shiageru to iu no ka.
Are hodo no ookina keiken o shita koto wa, muda de atta no ka. Masaka, muda de wa arumai.
Suruto, anata gata ni mitama o tamai, chikara aru waza o anata gata no aida de nasareta no wa, rippou o okonattakara ka, sore to mo, kiite shinjitakara ka.
Kono you ni, Aburahamu wa "Kami o shinjita. Sore ni yotte, kare wa gi to mitomerareta" no de aru.
Dakara, shinkou ni yoru mono koso Aburahamu no ko de aru koto o, shirubekide aru.
Seisho wa, kami ga ihoujin o shinkou ni yotte gi to sareru koto o, arakajime shitte, Aburahamu ni, "Anata ni yotte, subete no kokumin wa shukufuku sarerude arou" to no yoi shirase o, yokoku shita no de aru.
Kono you ni, shinkou ni yoru mono wa, shinkou no hito Aburahamu to tomo ni, shukufuku o ukeru no de aru.
Ittai, rippou no okonai ni yoru mono wa, mina noroi no moto ni aru. "Rippou no sho ni kaite aru issai no koto o mamorazu, kore o okonawanai mono wa, mina norowareru" to kaite arukara de aru.
Soko de, rippou ni yotte wa, kami no mimae ni gi to sareru mono wa hitori mo nai koto ga, akiraka de aru. Naze nara, "Shinkou ni yoru gijin wa ikiru" kara de aru.
Rippou wa shinkou ni motozuite iru mono de wa nai. Kaette, "Rippou o okonau mono wa rippou ni yotte ikiru" no de aru.
Kirisuto wa, watashitachi no tame ni noroi to natte, watashitachi o rippou no noroi kara aganai dashite kudasatta. Seisho ni, "Ki ni kakerareru mono wa, subete norowareru" to kaite aru.
Sore wa, Aburahamu no uketa shukufuku ga, Iesu Kirisuto ni atte ihoujin ni oyobu tame de ari, yakusoku sareta mitama o, watashitachi ga shinkou ni yotte ukeru tame de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Yo no narawashi o rei ni totte iou. Ningen no yuigon de sae, ittan sakusei saretara, kore o mukou ni shi tari, kore ni tsukekuwae tari suru koto wa, dare ni mo dekinai.
Sate, yakusoku wa, Aburahamu to kare no shison to ni taishite nasareta no de aru. Sore wa, tasuu o sashite "Shisontachi to ni" to iwazu ni, hitori o sashite "Anata no shison to ni" to itte iru. Kore wa, Kirisuto no koto de aru.
Watashi no iu imi wa, kou de aru. Kami ni yotte arakajime taterareta keiyaku ga, yonhyaku sanjuu nen no nochi ni dekita rippou ni yotte haki sarete, sono yakusoku ga munashiku naru you na koto wa nai.
Moshi souzoku ga, rippou ni motozuite nasareru to sureba, mohaya yakusoku ni motozuita mono de wa nai. Tokoro ga jijitsu, kami wa yakusoku ni yotte, souzoku no megumi o Aburahamu ni tamawatta no de aru.
Sore de wa, rippou wa nan de aru ka. Sore wa ihan o unagasu tame, ato kara kuwaerareta no de atte, yakusoku sarete ita shison ga kuru made sonzoku suru dake no mono de ari, katsu, tenshitachi o tooshi, chuukaisha no te ni yotte seitei sareta mono ni suginai.
Chuukaisha naru mono wa, ippou dake ni zokusuru mono de wa nai. Shikashi, kami wa hitori de aru.
De wa, rippou wa kami no yakusoku to aiirenai mono ka. Danjite sou de wa nai. Moshi hito o ikasu chikara no aru rippou ga ataerarete ita to sureba, gi wa tashika ni rippou ni yotte jitsugen saretade arou.
Shikashi, yakusoku ga, shinjiru hitobito ni Iesu Kirisuto ni taisuru shinkou ni yotte ataerareru tame ni, seisho wa subete no hito o tsumi no moto ni tojikometa no de aru.
Shikashi, shinkou ga arawareru mae ni wa, watashitachi wa rippou no moto de kanshi sarete ori, yagate keiji sareru shinkou no toki made tojikomerarete ita.
Kono you ni shite rippou wa, shinkou ni yotte gi to sareru tame ni, watashitachi o Kirisuto ni tsurete yuku youikugakari to natta no de aru.
Shikashi, ittan shinkou ga arawareta ijou, watashitachi wa, mohaya youikugakari no moto ni wa inai.
Anata gata wa mina, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru shinkou ni yotte, kami no ko na no de aru.
Kirisuto ni au baputesuma o uketa anata gata wa, mina Kirisuto o kita no de aru.
Mohaya, Yudayajin mo Girishiyajin mo naku, dorei mo jiyuujin mo naku, otoko mo onna mo nai. Anata gata wa mina, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte hitotsu dakara de aru.
Moshi Kirisuto no mono de arunara, anata gata wa Aburahamu no shison de ari, yakusoku ni yoru souzokunin na no de aru.
Watashi no iu imi wa, kou de aru. Souzokunin ga kodomo de aru aida wa, zenzaisan no mochinushi de arinagara, shimobe to nan no sabetsu mo naku,
Chichioya no sadameta jiki made wa, kanrinin ya koukennin no kantoku no moto ni okarete iru no de aru.
Sore to onajiku, watashitachi mo kodomo de atta toki ni wa, iwayuru konoyo no moromoro no reiryoku no moto ni, shibararete ita mono de atta.
Shikashi, toki no michiru ni oyonde, kami wa miko o onna kara umaresase, rippou no moto ni umaresasete, otsukawashi ni natta.
Sore wa, rippou no moto ni aru mono o aganai dasu tame, watashitachi ni ko taru mibun o sazukeru tame de atta.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa ko de aru no dakara, kami wa watashitachi no kokoro no naka ni, "Aba, chichi yo" to yobu miko no rei o okutte kudasatta no de aru.
Shitagatte, anata gata wa mohaya shimobe de wa naku, ko de aru. Ko de aru ijou, mata kami ni yoru souzokunin de aru.
Kami o shiranakatta touji, anata gata wa, honrai kami naranu kamigami no dorei ni natte ita.
Shikashi, ima de wa kami o shitte iru no ni, ina, mushiro kami ni shirarete iru no ni, dou shite, ano muryoku de hinjaku na, moromoro no reiryoku ni gyakumodori shite, matamoya, arata ni sono dorei ni narou to suru no ka.
Anata gata wa, hi ya tsuki ya kisetsu ya toshi nado o mamotte iru.
Watashi wa, anata gata no tame ni doryoku shite kita koto ga, aruiha, muda ni natta no de wa nai ka to, anata gata no koto ga shinpai de naranai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Onegai suru. Dou ka, watashi no you ni natte hoshii. Watashi mo, anata gata no you ni natta no dakara. Anata gata wa, ichi do mo watashi ni taishite futsugou na koto o shita koto wa nai.
Anata gata mo shitte iru toori, saisho watashi ga anata gata ni fukuin o tsutaeta no wa, watashi no nikutai ga yowatte ita tame de atta.
Soshite, watashi no nikutai ni wa anata gata ni totte shiren to naru mono ga atta no ni, sore o iyashime mo sezu, mata kirai mo sezu, kaette watashi o, kami no tsukai ka Kirisuto Iesu ka de mo aru you ni, mukaete kureta.
Sono toki no anata gata no kangeki wa, ima doko ni aru no ka. Hakkiri iuga, anata gata wa, dekiru koto nara, jibun no me o eguridashite de mo, watashi ni kuretakatta no da.
Sore da no ni, shinri o katatta tame ni, watashi wa anata gata no teki ni natta no ka.
Karera ga anata gata ni taishite nesshin na no wa, zen'i kara de wa nai. Mushiro, jibunra ni nesshin ni naraseru tame ni, anatagata o watashi kara hikihanasou to shite iru no de aru.
Watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni iru toki dake de naku, itsu mo, yoi koto ni tsuite nesshin ni shitawareru no wa, yoi koto de aru.
Aa, watashi no osanagotachi yo. Anata gata no uchi ni Kirisuto no katachi ga dekiru made wa, watashi wa, matamoya, anata gata no tame ni umi no kurushimi o suru.
Dekiru koto nara, watashi wa ima anata gata no tokoro ni ite, gochou o kaete hanashite mitai. Watashi wa, anata gata no koto de, tohou ni kurete iru.
Rippou no moto ni todomatte itai to omou hitotachi yo. Watashi ni kotae nasai. Anata gata wa rippou no iu tokoro o kikanai no ka.
Sono shirusu tokoro ni yoruto, Aburahamu ni futari no ko ga attaga, hitori wa onnadorei kara, hitori wa jiyuu no onna kara umareta.
Onnadorei no ko wa niku ni yotte umareta no de ari, jiyuu no onnanoko wa yakusoku ni yotte umareta no de atta.
Sate, kono monogatari wa hiyu to shite mirareru. Sunawachi, kono onnatachi wa futatsu no keiyaku o sasu. Sono hitori wa Shinai zan kara dete, dorei to naru mono o umu. Hagaru ga sore de aru.
Hagaru to ieba, Arabiya de wa Shinai zan no koto de, ima no Erusaremu ni ataru. Naze nara, sore wa kotachi to tomo ni, dorei to natte irukara de aru.
Shikashi, ue naru Erusaremu wa, jiyuu no onna de atte, watashitachi no haha o sasu.
Sunawachi, kou kaite aru, "Yorokobe, funin no onna yo. Koe o agete yorokobe, umi no kurushimi o shiranai onna yo. Hitorimono to natte iru onna wa ooku no ko o umi, sono kazu wa, otto aru onnanokora yori mo ooi".
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa, Isaku no you ni, yakusoku no ko de aru.
Shikashi, sono touji, niku ni yotte umareta mono ga, rei ni yotte umareta mono o hakugai shita you ni, ima de mo douyou de aru.
Shikashi, seisho wa nan to itte iru ka. "Onnadorei to sono ko to o oidase. Onnadorei no ko wa, jiyuu no onnanoko to tomo ni souzoku o shite wa naranai" to aru.
Dakara, kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa onnadorei no ko de wa naku, jiyuu no onnanoko na no de aru.
Jiyuu o esaseru tame ni, Kirisuto wa watashitachi o kaihou shite kudasatta no de aru. Dakara, kataku tatte, ni do to dorei no kubiki ni tsunagarete wa naranai.
Miyo, kono Pauro ga anata gata ni iu. Moshi katsurei o ukerunara, Kirisuto wa anata ga taniyou no nai mono ni narou.
Katsurei o ukeyou to suru subete no hitotachi ni, mou ichi do itte oku. Sou iu hitotachi wa, rippou no zenbu o okonau gimu ga aru.
Rippou ni yotte gi to sareyou to suru anata gata wa, Kirisuto kara hanarete shimatte iru. Megumi kara ochite iru.
Watashitachi wa, mitama no tasuke ni yori, shinkou ni yotte gi to sareru nozomi o tsuyoku idaite iru.
Kirisuto Iesu ni atte wa, katsurei ga atte mo nakute mo, mondai de wa nai. Tattoi no wa, ai ni yotte hataraku shinkou dake de aru.
Anata gata wa yoku hashiri tsuzukete kita no ni, dare ga jama o shite, shinri ni somukaseta no ka.
Sono you na kan'yuu wa, anatagata o mesareta kata kara deta mono de wa nai.
Sukoshi no pan tane de mo, kona no katamari zentai o fukuramaseru.
Anata gata wa isasaka mo watashi to chigatta omoi o idaku koto wa naito, Shu ni atte shinrai shite iru. Shikashi, anatagata o douyou sasete iru mono wa, sore ga dare de arouto, sabaki o ukerude arou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi ga moshi ima de mo katsurei o nobetsutaete itara, dou shite, ima nao hakugai sareru hazu ga arou ka. Sou shite itara, juujika no tsumazuki wa, nakunatte irude arou.
Anata gata no sendoushadomo wa, mizukara fugu ni naru ga yokarou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ga mesareta no wa, jitsu ni, jiyuu o eru tame de aru. Tada, sono jiyuu o, niku no hataraku kikai to shinaide, ai o motte tagai ni tsukae nasai.
Rippou no zentai wa, "Jibun o aisuru you ni, anata no tonarihito o aiseyo" to iu kono ikku ni tsukirukara de aru.
Ki o tsukeru ga yoi. Moshi tagai ni kamiai, kuiatte irunara, anata gata wa tagai ni horobosarete shimaudarou.
Watashi wa meijiru, mitama ni yotte aruki nasai. Sou sureba, kesshite niku no yoku o mitasu koto wa nai.
Naze nara, niku no hossuru tokoro wa mitama ni hanshi, mata mitama no hossuru tokoro wa niku ni hansurukara de aru. Kou shite, futatsu no mono wa tagai ni aisakarai, sono kekka, anata gata wa jibun de shiyou to omou koto o, suru koto ga dekinai you ni naru.
Moshi anata gata ga mitama ni michibikarerunara, rippou no moto ni wa inai.
Niku no hataraki wa meihaku de aru. Sunawachi, fuhinkou, kegare, koushoku,
Guuzou reihai, majinai, tekii, arasoi, sonemi, ikari, touhashin, bunretsu, bunpa,
Netami, deisui, enraku, oyobi, sono tagui de aru. Watashi wa izen mo itta you ni, ima mo mae motte itte oku. Kono you na koto o okonau mono wa, kami no kuni o tsugu koto ga nai.
Shikashi, mitama no mi wa, ai, yorokobi, heiwa, kan'you, jiai, zen'i, chuujitsu,
Nyuuwa, jisei de atte, korera o hitei suru rippou wa nai.
Kirisuto Iesu ni zokusuru mono wa, jibun no niku o, sono jou to yoku to tomo ni juujika ni tsukete shimatta no de aru.
Moshi watashitachi ga mitama ni yotte ikiru no nara, mata mitama ni yotte susumumoude wa nai ka.
Tagai ni idomi ai, tagai ni netami atte, kyoei ni ikite wa naranai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Moshi mo aru hito ga zaika ni ochiitte iru koto ga wakattanara, rei no hito de aru anata gata wa, nyuuwa na kokoro o motte, sono hito o tadashi nasai. Sore to douji ni, moshi ka jibun jishin mo yuuwaku ni ochiiru koto ga ari wa shinai ka to, hansei shi nasai.
Tagai ni omoni o oi ai nasai. Sou sureba, anata gata wa Kirisuto no rippou o mattou surude arou.
Moshi aru hito ga, jijitsu sou de nai no ni, jibun ga nani ka erai mono de aru you ni omotte iru to sureba, sono hito wa jibun o azamuite iru no de aru.
Hitoribitori, jibun no okonai o kentou shite miru ga yoi. Sou sureba, jibun dake ni wa hokoru koto ga dekite mo, hoka no hito ni wa hokorenaku narude arou.
Hito wa sorezore, jibun jishin no omoni o oubekide aru.
Mikotoba o oshiete morau hito wa, oshieru hito to, subete yoi mono o wakeai nasai.
Machigatte wa ikenai, kami wa anadorareru you na kata de wa nai. Hito wa jibun no ma ita mono o, karitoru koto ni naru.
Sunawachi, jibun no niku ni makumono wa, niku kara horobi o karitori, rei ni makumono wa, rei kara eien no inochi o karitorude arou.
Watashitachi wa, zen o okonau koto ni, umitsukarete wa naranai. Tayumanaide iruto, toki ga kureba karitoru you ni naru.
Dakara, kikai no arugoto ni, dare ni taishite mo, tokuni shinkou no nakama ni taishite, zen o okonaoude wa nai ka.
Goran nasai. Watashi jishin ima fude o totte, konna ni ookii ji de, anata gata ni kaite iru koto o.
Ittai, niku ni oite mie o kazarou to suru monotachi wa, Kirisuto Iesu no juujika no yue ni, hakugai o uketaku nai bakari ni, anata gata ni shiite katsurei o ukesaseyou to suru.
Jijitsu, katsurei no aru mono jishin ga rippou o mamorazu, tada, anata gata no niku ni tsuite hokoritai tame ni, katsurei o ukesaseyou to shite iru no de aru.
Shikashi, watashi jishin ni wa, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no juujika igai ni, hokori to suru mono wa, danjite atte wa naranai. Kono juujika ni tsukerarete, konoyo wa watashi ni taishite shini, watashi mo konoyo ni taishite shinde shimatta no de aru.
Katsurei no aru nashi wa mondai de wa naku, tada, atarashiku tsukurareru koto koso, juuyou na no de aru.
Kono housoku ni shitagatte susumu hitobito no ue ni, heiwa to awaremi to ga aru you ni. Mata, kami no Isuraeru no ue ni aru you ni.
Dare mo kongo wa, watashi ni wazurai o kakenaide hoshii. Watashi wa, Iesu no yakiin o mi ni obite iru no dakara.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata no rei to tomo ni aru you ni, amen.
Kami no mimune ni yoru Kirisuto Iesu no shito Pauro kara, Epeso ni iru, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte chuujitsu na seitotachi e.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Ho mubeki ka na, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chichi naru kami. Kami wa Kirisuto ni atte, tenjou de rei no moromoro no shukufuku o motte, watashitachi o shukufuku shi,
Mimae ni kiyoku kizu no nai mono to naru you ni to, tenchi no tsukurareru mae kara, Kirisuto ni atte watashitachi o erabi,
Watashitachi ni, Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte kami no ko taru mibun o sazukeru you ni to, mimune no yoshi to suru tokoro ni shitagai, ai no uchi ni arakajime sadamete kudasatta no de aru.
Kore wa, sono aisuru miko ni yotte tamawatta eikou aru megumi o, watashitachi ga hometataeru tame de aru.
Watashitachi wa, miko ni atte, kami no yutaka na megumi no yue ni, sono chi ni yoru aganai, sunawachi, zaika no yurushi o uketa no de aru.
Kami wa sono megumi o sarani mashikuwaete, arayuru chie to satori to o watashitachi ni tamawari,
Mimune no okugi o, mizukara arakajime sadamerareta keikaku ni shitagatte, watashitachi ni shimeshite kudasatta no de aru.
Sore wa, toki no michiru ni oyonde jitsugen sareru gokeikaku ni hoka naranai. Sore ni yotte, kami wa ten ni aru mono chi ni aru mono o, kotogotoku, Kirisuto ni atte hitotsu ni kiseshimeyou to sareta no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, mimune no hossuru mama ni subete no koto o nasaru kata no mokuteki no moto ni, Kirisuto ni atte arakajime sadamerare, kami no tami to shite erabareta no de aru.
Sore wa, hayaku kara Kirisuto ni nozomi o oite iru watashitachi ga, kami no eikou o hometataeru mono to naru tame de aru.
Anata gata mo mata, Kirisuto ni atte, shinri no kotoba, sunawachi, anata gata no sukui no fukuin o kiki, mata, kare o shinjita kekka, yakusoku sareta seirei no shouin o osareta no de aru.
Kono seirei wa, watashitachi ga kami no kuni o tsugu koto no hoshou de atte, yagate kami ni tsukeru mono ga mattaku aganaware, kami no eikou o hometataeru ni itaru tame de aru.
Kou iu wake de, watashi mo, Shu Iesu ni taisuru anata gata no shinkou to, subete no seito ni taisuru ai to o mimi ni shi,
Watashi no inori no tabigoto ni anatagata o oboete, taezu anata gata no tame ni kansha shite iru.
Dou ka, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no kami, eikou no chichi ga, chie to keiji to no rei o anata gata ni tamawatte kami o mitomesase,
Anata gata no kokoro no me o akiraka ni shite kudasaru you ni, soshite, anata gata ga kami ni mesarete idaite iru nozomi ga donna mono de aru ka, seitotachi ga tsugubeki kami no kuni ga ikani eikou ni tonda mono de aru ka,
Mata, kami no chikarazuyoi katsudou ni yotte hataraku chikara ga, watashitachi shinjiru mono ni totte ikani zetsudai na mono de aru ka o, anata gata ga shiru ni itaru you ni, to inotte iru.
Kami wa sono chikara o Kirisuto no uchi ni hatarakasete, kare o shinin no naka kara yomigaerase, tenjou ni oite gojibun no migi ni zaseshime,
Kare o, subete no shihai, ken'i, kenryoku, kensei no ue ni oki, mata, konoyo bakari de naku kitarubeki yo ni oite mo tonaerareru, arayuru na no ue ni okareta no de aru.
Soshite, banbutsu o Kirisuto no ashi no shita ni shitagawase, kare o banbutsu no ue ni kashira to shite kyoukai ni ataerareta.
Kono kyoukai wa Kirisuto no karada de atte, subete no mono o, subete no mono no uchi ni mitashite iru ka taga, michimichite iru mono ni, hoka naranai.
Sate anata gata wa, saki ni wa jibun no zaika to tsumi to ni yotte shinde ita mono de atte,
Katsute wa sorera no naka de, konoyo no narawashi ni shitagai, kuuchuu no ken o motsu kimi, sunawachi, fujuujun no kora no naka ni ima mo hataraite iru rei ni shitagatte, aruite ita no de aru.
Mata, watashitachi mo mina, katsute wa karera no naka ni ite, niku no yoku ni shitagatte hi o sugoshi, niku to sono omoi to no hossuru mama o okonai, hoka no hitobito to onajiku, umarenagara no ikari no ko de atta.
Shikaru ni, awaremi ni tomu kami wa, watashitachi o aishite kudasatta sono ookina ai o motte,
Zaika ni yotte shinde ita watashitachi o, Kirisuto to tomo ni ikashi - - anata gata no sukuwareta no wa, megumi ni yoru no de aru - -
Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, tomo ni yomigaerase, tomo ni tenjou de za ni tsukasete kudasatta no de aru.
Sore wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte watashitachi ni tamawatta jiai ni yoru kami no megumi no zetsudai na tomi o, kitarubeki yoyo ni shimesu tame de atta.
Anata gata no sukuwareta no wa, jitsu ni, megumi ni yori, shinkou ni yoru no de aru. Sore wa, anata gata jishin kara deta mono de wa naku, kami no tamamono de aru.
Kesshite okonai ni yoru no de wa nai. Sore wa, dare mo hokoru koto ga nai tame na no de aru.
Watashitachi wa kami no sakuhin de atte, yoi okonai o suru you ni, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte tsukurareta no de aru. Kami wa, watashitachi ga, yoi okonai o shite hi o sugosu you ni to, arakajime sonaete kudasatta no de aru.
Dakara, kioku shite oki nasai. Anata gata wa izen ni wa, niku ni yoreba ihoujin de atte, te de okonatta niku no katsurei aru mono to shouserareru hitobito kara wa, mukatsurei no mono to yobarete ori,
Mata sono touji wa, Kirisuto o shirazu, Isuraeru no kokuseki ga naku, yakusoku sareta iroiro no keiyaku ni en ga naku, kono yononaka de kibou mo naku kami mo nai mono de atta.
Tokoro ga, anata gata wa, kono you ni izen wa tooku hanarete itaga, ima de wa Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, Kirisuto no chi ni yotte chikai mono to natta no de aru.
Kirisuto wa watashitachi no heiwa de atte, futatsu no mono o hitotsu ni shi, tekii to iu hedate no nakagaki o torinozoki, gojibun no niku ni yotte,
Kazukazu no kitei kara natte iru imashime no rippou o haiki shita no de aru. Sore wa, kare ni atte, futatsu no mono o hitori no atarashii hito ni tsukurikaete heiwa o kitarase,
Juujika ni yotte, futatsu no mono o hitotsu no karada to shite kami to wakai sase, tekii o juujika ni kakete horoboshite shimatta no de aru.
Sore kara kare wa, korareta ue de, tooku hanarete iru anata gata ni heiwa o nobetsutae, mata chikaku ni iru monotachi ni mo heiwa o nobetsutaerareta no de aru.
To iu no wa, kare ni yotte, watashitachi ryouhou no mono ga hitotsu no mitama no naka ni atte, chichi no mimoto ni chikazuku koto ga dekirukara de aru.
Soko de anata gata wa, mohaya ikokujin de mo yadori bito de mo naku, seitotachi to onaji kokuseki no mono de ari, kami no kazoku na no de aru.
Mata anata gata wa, shitotachi ya yogensha tachi to iu dodai no ue ni taterareta mono de atte, Kirisuto Iesu gojishin ga sumi no kashira ishi de aru.
Kono Kirisuto ni atte, tatemono zentai ga kumiawasare, Shu ni aru sei naru miya ni seichou shi,
Soshite anata gata mo, Shu ni atte tomo ni taterarete, rei naru kami no sumai to naru no de aru.
Kou iu wake de, anata gata ihoujin no tame ni Kirisuto Iesu no shuujin to natte iru kono Pauro - -
Watashi ga anata gata no tame ni kami kara tamawatta megumi no tsutome ni tsuite, anata gata wa tashika ni kiitade arou.
Sunawachi, sudeni kantan ni kakiokutta you ni, watashi wa keiji ni yotte okugi o shirasareta no de aru.
Anata gata wa sore o yomeba, Kirisuto no okugi o watashi ga dou rikai shite iru ka ga wakaru.
Kono okugi wa, ima wa, mitama ni yotte kare no sei naru shitotachi to yogensha tachi to ni keiji sarete iruga, mae no jidai ni wa, hito no kora ni taishite, sono you ni shirasarete wa inakatta no de aru.
Sore wa, ihoujin ga, fukuin ni yori Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, watashitachi to tomo ni kami no kuni o tsugu mono to nari, tomo ni hitotsu no karada to nari, tomo ni yakusoku ni azukaru mono to naru koto de aru.
Watashi wa, kami no chikara ga watashi ni hataraite, jibun ni ataerareta kami no megumi no tamamono ni yori, fukuin no shimobe to sareta no de aru.
Sunawachi, seitotachi no uchi de mottomo chiisai mono de aru watashi ni kono megumi ga ataeraretaga, sore wa, Kirisuto no mujinzou no tomi o ihoujin ni nobetsutae,
Sarani mata, banbutsu no tsukurishu de aru kami no naka ni yoyo kakusarete ita okugi ni azukaru tsutome ga donna mono de aru ka o, akiraka ni shimesu tame de aru.
Sore wa ima, tenjou ni aru moromoro no shihai ya ken'i ga, kyoukai o tooshite, kami no tashu tayou na chie o shiru ni itaru tame de atte,
Watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu ni atte jitsugen sareta kami no eien no mokuteki ni sou mono de aru.
Kono Shu Kirisuto ni atte, watashitachi wa, kare ni taisuru shinkou ni yotte, kakushin o motte daitan ni kami ni chikazuku koto ga dekiru no de aru.
Dakara, anata gata no tame ni watashi ga ukete iru kannan o mite, rakutan shinaide ite moraitai. Watashi no kannan wa, anata gata no kouei na no de aru.
Kou iu wake de, watashi wa hiza o kagamete,
Tenjou ni ari chijou ni atte "Chichi" to yobarete iru arayuru mono no minamoto naru chichi ni inoru.
Dou ka chichi ga, sono eikou no tomi ni shitagai, mitama ni yori, chikara o motte anata gata no uchi naru hito o tsuyoku shite kudasaru you ni,
Mata, shinkou ni yotte, Kirisuto ga anata gata no kokoro no uchi ni sumi, anata gata ga ai ni nezashi ai o motoi to shite seikatsu suru koto ni yori,
Subete no seito to tomo ni, sono hirosa, nagasa, takasa, fukasa o rikai suru koto ga deki,
Mata jinchi o haruka ni koeta Kirisuto no ai o shitte, kami ni michite iru mono no subete o motte, anata gata ga mitasareru you ni, to inoru.
Dou ka, watashitachi no uchi ni hataraku chikara ni yotte, watashitachi ga motome mata omou tokoro no issai o, haruka ni koete kanaete kudasaru koto ga dekiru kata ni,
Kyoukai ni yori, mata, Kirisuto Iesu ni yotte, eikou ga yoyo kagirinaku aru you ni, amen.
Sate, Shu ni aru shuujin de aru watashi wa, anata gata ni susumeru. Anata gata ga mesareta sono meshi ni fusawashiku aruki,
Dekiru kagiri kenkyo de, katsu nyuuwa de ari, kan'you o shimeshi, ai o motte tagai ni shinobiai,
Heiwa no kizuna de musubarete, seirei ni yoru itchi o mamori tsuzukeru you ni tsutome nasai.
Karada wa hitotsu, mitama mo hitotsu de aru. Anata gata ga mesareta no wa, hitotsu no nozomi o mezashite mesareta no to douyou de aru.
Shu wa hitotsu, shinkou wa hitotsu, baputesuma wa hitotsu.
Subete no mono no ue ni ari, subete no mono o tsuranuki, subete no mono no uchi ni imasu, subete no mono no chichi naru kami wa hitotsu de aru.
Shikashi, Kirisuto kara tamawaru tamamono no hakari ni shitagatte, watashitachi hitoribitori ni, megumi ga ataerarete iru.
Soko de, kou iwarete iru, "Kare wa takai tokoro ni nobotta toki, toriko o toraete hiki yuki, hitobito ni tamamono o wakeataeta".
Sate "Nobotta" to iu ijou, mata chika no hikui soko ni mo orite korareta wake de wa nai ka.
Orite korareta mono jishin wa, douji ni, arayuru mono ni michiru tame ni, moromoro no ten no ue ni made noborareta kata na no de aru.
Soshite kare wa, aru hito o shito to shi, aru hito o yogensha to shi, aru hito o dendousha to shi, aru hito o bokushi, kyoushi to shite, otate ni natta.
Sore wa, seitotachi o totonoete houshi no waza o sase, Kirisuto no karada o tatesase,
Watashitachi subete no mono ga, kami no ko o shinjiru shinkou no itchi to kare o shiru chishiki no itchi to ni toutatsu shi, mattakihito to nari, tsuini, Kirisuto no michimichita toku no takasa ni made itaru tame de aru.
Kou shite, watashitachi wa mohaya kodomo de wa nai no de, damashi madowasu sakuryaku ni yori, hitobito no warudakumi ni yotte okoru samazama na oshie no kaze ni fuki mawasare tari, moteasobare tari suru koto ga naku,
Ai ni atte shinri o katari, arayuru ten ni oite seichou shi, kashira naru Kirisuto ni tassuru no de aru.
Mata, Kirisuto o motoi to shite, zenshin wa subete no fushibushi no tasuke ni yori, shikkari to kumiawasare musubiawasare, sorezore no bubun wa bun ni oujite hataraki, karada o seichou sase, ai no uchi ni sodaterarete iku no de aru.
Soko de, watashi wa Shu ni atte ogosoka ni susumeru. Anata gata wa kongo, ihoujin ga munashii kokoro de aruite iru you ni aruite wa naranai.
Karera no chiryoku wa kuraku nari, sono uchi naru muchi to kokoro no kouka to ni yori, kami no inochi kara tooku hanare,
Mizukara mukankaku ni natte, hoshiimama ni arayuru fuketsu na okonai o shite, houjuu ni mi o yudanete iru.
Shikashi anata gata wa, sono you ni Kirisuto ni mananda no de wa nakatta.
Anata gata wa tashika ni kare ni kiki, kare ni atte oshierarete, Iesu ni aru shinri o sono mama mananda hazu de aru.
Sunawachi, anata gata wa, izen no seikatsu ni zokusuru, jouyoku ni mayotte horobi iku furuki hito o nugisute,
Kokoro no fukami made arata ni sarete,
Shin no gi to sei to o sonaeta kami ni katadotte tsukurareta atarashiki hito o kirubekide aru.
Kou iu wake dakara, anata gata wa itsuwari o sutete, onoono tonarihito ni taishite, shinjitsu o katari nasai. Watashitachi wa, otagai ni shitai na no de arukara.
Ikaru koto ga atte mo, tsumi o okashite wa naranai. Ikidootta mama de, hi ga kureru you de atte wa naranai.
Mata, akuma ni kikai o ataete wa ikenai.
Nusunda mono wa, kongo, nusunde wa naranai. Mushiro, mazushii hitobito ni wakeataeru you ni naru tame ni, jibun no te de seitou na hataraki o shi nasai.
Warui kotoba o issai, anata gata no kuchi kara dashite wa ikenai. Hitsuyou ga areba, hito no toku o takameru no ni yakudatsu you na kotoba o katatte, kiite iru mono no eki ni naru you ni shi nasai.
Kami no seirei o kanashimasete wa ikenai. Anata gata wa, a ga nai no hi no tame ni, seirei no shouin o uketa no de aru.
Subete no mujihi, ikidoori, ikari, sawagi, soshiri, mata, issai no akui o sutesari nasai.
Tagai ni nasakebukaku, awaremi bukai mono to nari, kami ga Kirisuto ni atte anatagata o yurushite kudasatta you ni, anata gata mo tagai ni yurushi ai nasai.
Kou shite, anata gata wa, kami ni aisarete iru kodomo to shite, kami ni narau mono ni nari nasai.
Mata ai no uchi o aruki nasai. Kirisuto mo anatagata o aishite kudasatte, watashitachi no tame ni, gojishin o, kami e no kanbashii kaori no sasagemono, mata, ikenie to shite sasagerareta no de aru.
Mata, fuhinkou to iroiro na kegare ya don'yoku nado o, seito ni fusawashiku, anata gata no aida de wa, kuchi ni suru koto sae shite wa naranai.
Mata, iyashii kotoba to oroka na hanashi ya midara na joudan o sake nasai. Korera wa, yoroshiku nai koto de aru. Sore yori wa, mushiro kansha o sasage nasai.
Anata gata wa, yoku shitte okaneba naranai. Subete fuhinkou na mono, kegareta koto o suru mono, don'yoku na mono, sunawachi, guuzou o reihai suru mono wa, Kirisuto to kami to no kuni o tsugu koto ga dekinai.
Anata gata wa, dare ni mo fuseijitsu na kotoba de damasarete wa ikenai. Korera no koto kara, kami no ikari wa fujuujun no kora ni kudaru no de aru.
Dakara, karera no nakama ni natte wa ikenai.
Anata gata wa, izen wa yami de attaga, ima wa Shu ni atte hikari to natte iru. Hikari no korashiku aruki nasai - -
Hikari wa arayuru zen'i to seigi to shinjitsu to no mi o musubaseru mono de aru - -
Shu ni yorokobareru mono ga nan de aru ka o, wakimaeshiri nasai.
Mi o musubanai yami no waza ni kuwawaranaide, mushiro, sore o shiteki shite yari nasai.
Karera ga kakurete okonatte iru koto wa, kuchi ni suru dake de mo hazukashii koto de aru.
Shikashi, hikari ni sarasareru toki, subete no mono wa, akiraka ni naru.
Akiraka ni sareta mono wa mina, hikari to naru no de aru. Dakara, kou kaite aru, "Nemutte iru mono yo, oki nasai. Shinin no naka kara, tachiagari nasai. Sou sureba, Kirisuto ga anata o tera sude arou".
Soko de, anata gata no arukikata ni yoku chuui shite, kashikoku nai mono no you nide wa naku, kashikoi mono no you ni aruki,
Ima no toki o ikashite mochii nasai. Ima wa warui jidai na no de aru.
Dakara, oroka na mono ni naranaide, Shu no mimune ga nan de aru ka o satori nasai.
Sake ni yotte wa ikenai. Sore wa rangyou no moto de aru. Mushiro mitama ni mitasarete,
Shi tosan bito rei no uta to o motte katariai, Shu ni mukatte kokoro karasan bi no uta o utai nasai.
Soshite subete no koto ni tsuki, itsu mo, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no mina ni yotte, chichi naru kami ni kansha shi,
Kirisuto ni taisuru osore no kokoro o motte, tagai ni tsukae aubekide aru.
Tsuma taru mono yo. Shu ni tsukaeru you ni jibun no otto ni tsukae nasai.
Kirisuto ga kyoukai no kashira de atte, mizukara wa, karada naru kyoukai no sukuinushi de arareru you ni, otto wa tsuma no kashira de aru.
Soshite kyoukai ga Kirisuto ni tsukaeru you ni, tsuma mo subete no koto ni oite, otto ni tsukaerubekide aru.
Otto taru mono yo. Kirisuto ga kyoukai o aishite sono tame ni gojishin o sasagerareta you ni, tsuma o aishi nasai.
Kirisuto ga sou nasatta no wa, mizu de arau koto ni yori, kotoba ni yotte, kyoukai o kiyomete sei naru mono to suru tame de ari,
Mata, shimi mo, shiwa mo, sono tagui no mono ga issai naku, kiyokute kizu no nai eikou no sugata no kyoukai o, gojibun ni mukaeru tame de aru.
Sore to onajiku, otto mo jibun no tsuma o, jibun no karada no you ni aisaneba naranai. Jibun no tsuma o aisuru mono wa, jibun jishin o aisuru no de aru.
Jibun jishin o nikunda mono wa, imada katsute, hitori mo inai. Kaette, Kirisuto ga kyoukai ni nasatta you ni shite, onore o sodate yashinau no ga tsune de aru.
Watashitachi wa, Kirisuto no karada no shitai na no de aru.
"Sore yue ni, hito wa fubo o hanarete sono tsuma to musubare, futari no mono wa ittai to narubekide aru".
Kono okugi wa ookii. Sore wa, Kirisuto to kyoukai to o sashite iru.
Izure ni shite mo, anata gata wa, sorezore, jibun no tsuma o jibun jishin no you ni aishi nasai. Tsuma mo mata otto o uyamai nasai.
Ko taru mono yo. Shu ni atte ryoushin ni shitagai nasai. Kore wa tadashii koto de aru.
"Anata no chichi to haha to o uyamae". Kore ga daiichi no imashime de atte, tsugi no yakusoku ga sore ni tsuite iru,
"Sou sureba, anata wa koufuku ni nari, chijou de nagaku ikinagaraerude arou".
Chichi taru mono yo. Kodomo o okorasenaide, Shu no kuntou to kunkai to ni yotte, karera o sodate nasai.
Shimobe taru mono yo. Kirisuto ni shitagau you ni, osoreononokitsutsu, magokoro o komete, niku ni yoru shujin ni shitagai nasai.
Hito ni hetsuraou to shite mesaki dake no tsutome o suru no de naku, Kirisuto no shimobe to shite kokoro kara kami no mimune o okonai,
Hito ni de wa naku Shu ni tsukaeru you ni, kokoroyoku tsukae nasai.
Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, dare de mo yoi koto o okonaeba, shimobe de are, jiyuujin de are, sore ni soutou suru mukui o, sorezore Shu kara ukerude arou.
Shujin taru mono yo. Shimobetachi ni taishite, douyou ni shi nasai. Odosu koto o, shite wa naranai. Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, karera to anata gata to no Shu wa ten ni imasu no de ari, katsu hito o katayori miru koto o nasaranai no de aru.
Saigo ni iu. Shu ni atte, sono idai na chikara ni yotte, tsuyoku nari nasai.
Akuma no sakuryaku ni taikou shite tachi uru tame ni, kami no bugu de mi o katame nasai.
Watashitachi no tatakai wa, ketsuniku ni taisuru mono de wa naku, moromoro no shihai to, ken'i to, yami no yo no shukensha, mata tenjou ni iru aku no rei ni taisuru tatakai de aru.
Sore dakara, ashiki hi ni atatte, yoku teikou shi, kanzen ni kachi nuite, kataku tachi uru tame ni, kami no bugu o mi ni tsuke nasai.
Sunawachi, tatte shinri no obi o koshi ni shime, seigi no muneate o mune ni tsuke,
Heiwa no fukuin no sonae o ashi ni haki,
Sono ue ni, shinkou no tate o te ni tori nasai. Sore o motte, ashiki mono no hanatsu hi no ya o kesu koto ga dekirude arou.
Mata, sukui no kabuto o kaburi, mitama no tsurugi, sunawachi, kami no kotoba o tori nasai.
Taezu inori to negai o shi, donna toki de mo mitama ni yotte inori, sono tame ni me o samashite umu koto ga naku, subete no seito no tame ni inori tsuzuke nasai.
Mata, watashi ga kuchi o hiraku toki ni katarubeki kotoba o tamawari, daitan ni fukuin no okugi o akiraka ni shimeshi uru you ni, watashi no tame ni mo inotte hoshii.
Watashi wa kono fukuin no tame no shisetsu de ari, soshite kusari ni tsunagarete iru no de aruga, tsunagarete ite mo, katarubeki toki ni wa daitan ni katareru you ni inotte hoshii.
Watashi ga dou iu yousu ka, nani o shite iru ka o, anata gata ni shitte morau tame ni, Shu ni atte chuujitsu ni tsukaete iru aisuru kyoudai Tekiko ga, issai no koto o houkoku surude arou.
Kare o anata gata no moto ni okuru no wa, anata gata ga watashitachi no yousu o shiri, mata kare ni yotte kokoro ni hagemashi o ukeru you ni naru tame na no de aru.
Chichi naru kami to watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara heian narabi ni shinkou ni tomonau ai ga, kyoudaitachi ni aru you ni.
Kawaranai shinjitsu o motte, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto o aisuru subete no hitobito ni, megumi ga aru you ni.
Kirisuto Iesu no shimobetachi, Pauro to Temote kara, Piripi ni iru, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru subete no seitotachi, narabi ni kantokutachi to shitsujitachi e.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Watashi wa anatagata o omou tabigoto ni, watashi no kami ni kansha shi,
Anata gata ichidou no tame ni inoru toki, itsu mo yorokobi o motte inori,
Anata gata ga saisho no hi kara konnichi ni itaru made, fukuin ni azukatte iru koto o kansha shite iru.
Soshite, anata gata no uchi ni yoi waza o hajimerareta ka taga, Kirisuto Iesu no hi made ni sore o kansei shite kudasaru ni chigai naito, kakushin shite iru.
Watashi ga, anata gata ichidou no tame ni, sou kangaeru no wa touzen de aru. Sore wa, watashi ga goku ni torawarete iru toki ni mo, fukuin o benmei shi risshou suru toki ni mo, anatagata o mina, tomo ni megumi ni azukaru mono to shite, watashi no kokoro ni fukaku tomete irukara de aru.
Watashi ga Kirisuto Iesu no netsuai o motte, donna ni fukaku anata gata ichidou o omotte iru koto ka, sore o shoumei shite kudasaru kata wa kami de aru.
Watashi wa kou inoru. Anata gata no ai ga, fukai chishiki ni oite, surudoi kankaku ni oite, iyoiyo mashi kuwawari,
Sore ni yotte, anata ga taga, nani ga juuyou de aru ka o hanbetsu suru koto ga deki, Kirisuto no hi ni sonaete, junshin de semerareru tokoro no nai mono to nari,
Iesu Kirisuto ni yoru gi no mi ni mitasarete, kami no eikou to homare to o arawasu ni itaru you ni.
Sate, kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi no mi ni okotta koto ga, mushiro fukuin no zenshin ni yakudatsu you ni natta koto o, anata gata ni shitte moraitai.
Sunawachi, watashi ga goku ni torawarete iru no wa Kirisuto no tame de aru koto ga, heiei zentai ni mo sono hoka no subete no hitobito ni mo akiraka ni nari,
Soshite kyoudaitachi no uchi ooku no mono wa, watashi no nyuugoku ni yotte Shu ni aru kakushin o e, osoreru koto naku, masumasu yuukan ni, kami no kotoba o kataru you ni natta.
Ippou de wa, netami ya tousoushin kara Kirisuto o nobetsutaeru mono ga ori, tahou de wa zen'i kara sou suru mono ga iru.
Kousha wa, watashi ga fukuin o benmei suru tame ni taterarete iru koto o shiri, ai no kokoro de Kirisuto o tsutae,
Zensha wa, watashi no nyuugoku no kurushimi ni sarani kannan o kuwaeyou to omotte, junshin na kokoro kara de wa naku, touhashin kara sou shite iru.
Suruto, dou na no ka. Mie kara de aru ni shite mo, shinjitsu kara de aru ni shite mo, yousuru ni, tsutaerarete iru no wa Kirisuto na no dakara, watashi wa sore o yorokonde irushi, mata yorokobude arou.
Naze nara, anata gata no inori to, Iesu Kirisuto no rei no tasuke to ni yotte, kono koto ga tsuini wa, watashi no sukui to naru koto o shitte irukara de aru.
Soko de, watashi ga setsujitsu na omoi de machinozomu koto wa, watashi ga, donna koto ga atte mo hajiru koto naku, kaette, itsu mo no you ni ima mo, daitan ni kataru koto ni yotte, ikiru ni mo shinu ni mo, watashi no mi ni yotte Kirisuto ga agamerareru koto de aru.
Watashi ni totte wa, ikiru koto wa Kirisuto de ari, shinu koto wa eki de aru.
Shikashi, nikutai ni oite ikite iru koto ga, watashi ni totte wa minori ooi hataraki ni naru no da to sureba, dochira o erandara yoi ka, watashi ni wa wakaranai.
Watashi wa, korera futatsu no mono no aida ni itabasami ni natte iru. Watashi no negai o ieba, konoyo o satte Kirisuto to tomo ni iru koto de ari, jitsu wa, sono hou ga haruka ni nozomashii.
Shikashi, nikutai ni todomatte iru koto wa, anata gata no tame ni wa, sarani hitsuyou de aru.
Kou kakushin shite iru no de, watashi wa ikinagaraete, anata gata ichidou no tokoro ni todomari, anata gata no shinkou o susumase, sono yorokobi o esaseyou to omou.
Sou nareba, watashi ga futatabi anata gata no tokoro ni iku no de, anata gata wa watashi ni yotte Kirisuto Iesu ni aru hokori o masu koto ni narou.
Tada, anata gata wa Kirisuto no fukuin ni fusawashiku seikatsu shi nasai. Soshite, watashi ga itte anata gata ni au ni shite mo, hanarete iru ni shite mo, anata gata ga hitotsu no rei ni yotte kataku tachi, hitotsu kokoro ni natte fukuin no shinkou no tame ni chikara o awasete tatakai,
Katsu, nanigoto ni tsuite mo, tekitai suru monodomo ni roubai saserarenaide iru yousu o, kikasete hoshii. Kono koto wa, karera ni wa horobi no shirushi, anata gata ni wa sukui no shirushi de atte, sore wa kami kara kuru no de aru.
Anata gata wa Kirisuto no tame ni, tada kare o shinjiru koto dake de wa naku, kare no tame ni kurushimu koto o mo tamawatte iru.
Anata gata wa, saki ni watashi ni tsuite mi, ima mata watashi ni tsuite kiite iru no to onaji kutou o, tsuzukete iru no de aru.
Soko de, anata gata ni, Kirisuto ni yoru susume, ai no hagemashi, mitama no majiwari, netsuai to awaremi to ga, ikura ka de mo arunara,
Dou ka onaji omoi to nari, onaji ai no kokoro o mochi, kokoro o awase, hitotsu omoi ni natte, watashi no yorokobi o mitashite hoshii.
Nanigoto mo touhashin ya kyoei kara suru no de naku, herikudatta kokoro o motte tagai ni hito o jibun yori sugureta mono to shi nasai.
Onoono, jibun no koto bakari de naku, tanin no koto mo kangae nasai.
Kirisuto Iesu ni atte idaite iru no to onaji omoi o, anata gata no aida de mo tagai ni ikashi nasai.
Kirisuto wa, kami no katachi de araretaga, kami to hitoshiku aru koto o koshu subeki koto to wa omowazu,
Kaette, onore o munashi u shite shimobe no katachi o tori, ningen no sugata ni narareta. Sono arisama wa hito to kotonarazu,
Onore o hikuku shite, shi ni itaru made, shikamo juujika no shi ni itaru made juujun de arareta.
Sore yue ni, kami wa kare o takaku hikiage, subete no na ni masaru na o kare ni tamawatta.
Sore wa, Iesu no mina ni yotte, tenjou no mono, chijou no mono, chika no mono nado, arayuru mono ga hiza o kagame,
Mata, arayuru shita ga, "Iesu Kirisuto wa Shu de aru" to kokuhaku shite, eikou o chichi naru kami ni kisuru tame de aru.
Watashi no aisuru monotachi yo. Sou iu wake dakara, anata gata ga itsu mo juujun de atta you ni, watashi ga issho ni iru toki dake de naku, inai ima wa, issou juujun de ite, osoreononoite jibun no sukui no tassei ni tsutome nasai.
Anata gata no uchi ni hatarakikakete, sono negai o okosase, katsu jitsugen ni itaraseru no wa kami de atte, sore wa kami no yoshi to sareru tokoro dakara de aru.
Subete no koto o, tsubuyakazu utagawanaide shi nasai.
Sore wa, anata gata ga semerareru tokoro no nai junshin na mono to nari, magatta jaaku na jidai no tadanaka ni atte, kizu no nai kami no ko to naru tame de aru. Anata gata wa, inochi no kotoba o kataku motte, karera no aida de hoshi no you ni konoyo ni kagayaite iru.
Kono you ni shite, Kirisuto no hi ni, watashi wa jibun no hashitta koto ga muda de naku, rou shita koto mo muda de wa nakatta to hokoru koto ga dekiru.
Soshite, tatoi, anata gata no shinkou no sonaemono o sasageru saidan ni, watashi no chi o sosogu koto ga atte mo, watashi wa yorokobou. Anata gata ichidou to tomo ni yorokobou.
Onaji you ni, anata gata mo yorokobi nasai. Watashi to tomo ni yorokobi nasai.
Sate, watashi wa, ma mo naku Temote o anata gata no tokoro ni okuritai to, Shu Iesu ni atte negatte iru. Sore wa, anata gata no yousu o shitte, watashi mo chikarazukeraretaikara de aru.
Temote no you na kokoro de, shinmi ni natte anata gata no koto o shinpai shite iru mono wa, hoka ni hitori mo nai.
Hito wa mina, jibun no koto o motomeru dake de, Kirisuto Iesu no koto wa motomete inai.
Shikashi, Temote no rentatsu buri wa, anata gata no shitte iru toori de aru. Sunawachi, ko ga chichi ni taisuru you ni shite, watashi to issho ni fukuin ni tsukaete kita no de aru.
Soko de, kono hito o, watashi no nariyuki ga wakari shidai, sugu ni de mo, sochira e okuritai to negatte iru.
Watashi jishin mo ma mo naku ikeru mono to, Shu ni atte kakushin shite iru.
Shikashi, sashiatari, watashi no dourousha de sen'yuu de aru kyoudai, mata, anata gata no shisha to shite watashi no kyuubou o oginatte kureta Epafurodeto o, anata gata no moto ni okurikaesu koto ga hitsuyou da to omotte iru.
Kare wa, anata gata ichidou ni shikiri ni aitagatte irukara de aru. Sono ue, jibun no byouki no koto ga anata gata ni kikoeta no de, kare wa kokorogurushiku omotte iru.
Kare wa jitsu ni, hinshi no byouki ni kakattaga, kami wa kare o awarende kudasatta. Kare bakari de wa naku, watashi o mo awarende kudasatta no de, watashi wa kanashimi ni kanashimi o kasanenai desu n da no de aru.
Soko de, ooisogi de kare o okurikaesu. Kore de, anata gata wa kare to futatabi atte yorokobi, watashi mo mata, shinpai o yawarageru koto ga dekiyou.
Kou iu wake dakara, ooini yorokonde, Shu ni atte kare o mukaete hoshii. Mata, kou shita hitobito wa sonchou seneba naranai.
Kare wa, watashi ni taishite anata gata ga houshi no dekinakatta bun o oginaou to shite, Kirisuto no waza no tame ni inochi o kake, shinu bakari ni natta no de aru.
Saigo ni, watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Shu ni atte yorokobi nasai. Saki ni kaita no to onaji koto o koko de kurikaesuga, sore wa, watashi ni wa wazura washi i koto de wa naku, anata gata ni wa anzen na koto ni naru.
Ano inudomo o keikai shi nasai. Warui hatarakibitotachi o keikai shi nasai. Niku ni katsurei no kizu o tsukete iru hitotachi o keikai shi nasai.
Kami no rei ni yotte reihai o shi, Kirisuto Iesu o hokori to shi, niku o tanomi to shinai watashitachi koso, katsurei no mono de aru.
Motoyori, niku no tanomi nara, watashi ni mo naku wa nai. Moshi, dare ka hoka no hito ga niku o tanomi to shite iru to iunara, watashi wa sore o motto tanomi to shite iru.
Watashi wa youkame ni katsurei o uketa mono, Isuraeru no minzoku ni zokusuru mono, Beniyaminzoku no shusshin, Heburubito no naka no Heburubito, rippou no ue de wa Parisaibito,
Nesshin no ten de wa kyoukai no hakugaisha, rippou no gi ni tsuite wa ochido no nai mono de aru.
Shikashi, watashi ni totte eki de atta korera no mono o, Kirisuto no yue ni son to omou you ni natta.
Watashi wa, sarani susunde, watashi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu o shiru chishiki no zetsudai na kachi no yue ni, issai no mono o son to omotte iru. Kirisuto no yue ni, watashi wa subete o ushinattaga, sorera no mono o, fun do no you ni omotte iru. Sore wa, watashi ga Kirisuto o eru tame de ari,
Rippou ni yoru jibun no gi de wa naku, Kirisuto o shinjiru shinkou ni yoru gi, sunawachi, shinkou ni motozuku kami kara no gi o ukete, Kirisuto no uchi ni jibun o miidasu you ni naru tame de aru.
Sunawachi, Kirisuto to sono fukkatsu no chikara to o shiri, sono kunan ni azukatte, sono shi no sama to hitoshiku nari,
Nan to ka shite shinin no uchi kara no fukkatsu ni tasshitai no de aru.
Watashi ga sudeni sore o eta to ka, sudeni kanzen na mono ni natte iru to ka iu no de wa naku, tada toraeyou to shite oimotomete iru no de aru. Sou suru no wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni yotte toraerarete irukara de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi wa sudeni toraeta to wa omotte inai. Tada kono ichiji o tsutomete iru. Sunawachi, ushiro no mono o wasure, mae no mono ni mukatte karada o nobashitsutsu,
Mokuhyou o mezashite hashiri, Kirisuto Iesu ni oite ue ni meshite kudasaru kami no shouyo o eyou to tsutomete iru no de aru.
Dakara, watashitachi no naka de mattakihitotachi wa, sono you ni kangaerubekide aru. Shikashi, anata gata ga chigatta kangae o motte irunara, kami wa sono koto mo shimeshite kudasarude arou.
Tada, watashitachi wa, tasshi eta tokoro ni shitagatte susumubekide aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Dou ka, watashi ni narau mono to natte hoshii. Mata, anata gata no mohan ni sarete iru watashitachi ni naratte aruku hitotachi ni, me o tome nasai.
Watashi ga sou iu no wa, Kirisuto no juujika ni tekitai shite aruite iru mono ga ooikara de aru. Watashi wa, karera no koto o shibashiba anata gata ni hanashitaga, ima mata namida o nagashite kataru.
Karera no saigo wa horobi de aru. Karera no kami wa sono hara, karera no eikou wa sono haji, karera no omoi wa chijou no koto de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi no kokuseki wa ten ni aru. Soko kara, sukuinushi, Shu Iesu Kirisuto no korareru no o, watashitachi wa machinozonde iru.
Kare wa, banbutsu o gojishin ni shitagawase uru chikara no hataraki ni yotte, watashitachi no iyashii karada o, gojishin no eikou no karada to onaji katachi ni kaete kudasarude arou.
Dakara, watashi no aishi shitatte iru kyoudaitachi yo. Watashi no yorokobi de arikanmuri de aru aisuru monotachi yo. Kono you ni, Shu ni atte kataku tachi nasai.
Watashi wa Yuuodeya ni susume, mata Suntoke ni susumeru. Dou ka, Shu ni atte hitotsu omoi ni natte hoshii.
Tsuite wa, shinjitsu na kyouryokusha yo. Anata ni onegai suru. Kono futari no onna o tasukete age nasai. Karera wa, "Inochi no sho" ni na o kakitomerarete iru Kuremensu ya, sono ta no dourousha tachi to kyouryoku shite, fukuin no tame ni watashi to tomo ni tatakatte kureta onnatachi de aru.
Anata gata wa, Shu ni atte itsu mo yorokobi nasai. Kurikaeshite iuga, yorokobi nasai.
Anata gata no kan'you o, minna no hito ni shimeshi nasai. Shu wa chikai.
Nanigoto mo omoiwazuratte wa naranai. Tada, kotogoto ni, kansha o motte inori to negai to o sasage, anata gata no motomeru tokoro o kami ni moushiageru ga yoi.
Sou sureba, jinchi de wa toutei hakarishiru koto no dekinai kami no heian ga, anata gata no kokoro to omoi to o, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte mamorude arou.
Saigo ni, kyoudaitachi yo. Subete shinjitsu na koto, subete tattobubeki koto, subete tadashii koto, subete junshin na koto, subete aisubeki koto, subete homare aru koto, mata toku to iwareru mono, shousan ni atai suru mono ga areba, sorera no mono o kokoro ni tome nasai.
Anata ga taga, watashi kara mananda koto, uketa koto, kiita koto, mita koto wa, kore o jikkou shi nasai. Sou sureba, heiwa no kami ga, anata gata to tomo ni imasude arou.
Sate, watashi ga Shu ni atte ooini yorokonde iru no wa, watashi o omou kokoro ga, anata gata ni ima mata tsuini mebaete kita koto de aru. Jitsu wa, anata gata wa, watashi no koto o kokoro ni kakete kurete wa itaga, yoi kikai ga nakatta no de aru.
Watashi wa toboshiikara, kou iu no de wa nai. Watashi wa, donna kyouguu ni atte mo, taru koto o mananda.
Watashi wa hin ni shosuru michi o shitte ori, tomi ni oru michi mo shitte iru. Watashi wa, aku koto ni mo ueru koto ni mo, tomu koto ni mo toboshii koto ni mo, ari to arayuru kyouguu ni shosuru hiketsu o kokoroete iru.
Watashi o tsuyoku shite kudasaru kata ni yotte, nanigoto de mo suru koto ga dekiru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa, yoku mo watashi to kannan o tomo ni shite kureta.
Piripi no hitotachi yo. Anata gata mo shitte iru toori, watashi ga fukuin o senden shi hajimeta koro, Makedoniya kara dekakete itta toki, mono no yaritori o shite watashi no hataraki ni sanka shita kyoukai wa, anata gata no hoka ni wa mattaku nakatta.
Mata Tesaronike de mo, issai narazu, mono o okutte watashi no ketsubou o oginatte kureta.
Watashi wa, okurimono o motomete iru no de wa nai. Watashi no motomete iru no wa, anata gata no kanjou o fuyashite iku kajitsu na no de aru.
Watashi wa, subete no mono o ukete ariamaru hodo de aru. Epafurodeto kara, anata gata no okurimono o itadaite, akitarite iru. Sore wa, kanbashii kaori de ari, kami no yorokonde ukete kudasaru sonaemono de aru.
Watashi no kami wa, gojishin no eikou no tomi no naka kara, anata gata no issai no hitsuyou o, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte mitashite kudasarude arou.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami ni, eikou ga yoyo kagirinaku aru you ni, amen.
Kirisuto Iesu ni aru seito no hitoribitori ni, yoroshiku. Watashi to issho ni iru kyoudaitachi kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Subete no seitotachi kara, tokuni Kaizaru no ie no monotachi kara, yoroshiku.
Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata no rei to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kami no mimune ni yoru Kirisuto Iesu no shito Pauro to kyoudai Temote kara,
Korosai ni iru, Kirisuto ni aru seitotachi, chuujitsu na kyoudaitachi e. Watashitachi no chichi naru kami kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Watashitachi wa, itsu mo anata gata no tame ni inori, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chichi naru kami ni kansha shite iru.
Kore wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni taisuru anata gata no shinkou to, subete no seito ni taishite idaite iru anata gata no ai to o, mimi ni shitakara de aru.
Kono ai wa, anata gata no tame ni ten ni takuwaerarete iru nozomi ni motozuku mono de ari, sono nozomi ni tsuite wa, anata gata wa sudeni, anata gata no tokoro made tsutaerareta fukuin no shinri no kotoba ni yotte kiite iru.
Soshite, kono fukuin wa, sekaijuu itaru tokoro de sou de aru you ni, anata gata no tokoro de mo, kore o kiite kami no megumi o shitta toki irai, mi o musunde seichou shite iru no de aru.
Anata gata wa kono fukuin o, watashitachi to onaji shimobe de aru, aisuru Epefurasu kara mananda no de atta. Kare wa anata gata no tame no Kirisuto no chuujitsu na houshisha de atte,
Anata gata ga mitama ni yotte idaite iru ai o, watashitachi ni shirasete kureta no de aru.
Sou iu wake de, korera no koto o mimi ni shite irai, watashitachi mo taezu anata gata no tame ni inorimotomete iru no wa, anata gata ga arayuru reiteki na chie to rikairyoku to o motte, kami no mimune o fukaku shiri,
Shu no mikokoro ni kanatta seikatsu o shite shin ni Shu o yorokobase, arayuru yoi waza o okonatte mi o musubi, kami o shiru chishiki o iyoiyo mashikuwaeru ni itaru koto de aru.
Sarani mata inoru no wa, anata ga taga, kami no eikou no ikioi ni shitagatte tamawaru subete no chikara ni yotte tsuyoku sare, nanigoto mo yorokonde tae katsu shinobi,
Hikari no uchi ni aru seitotachi no tokken ni azukaru ni taru mono to narasete kudasatta chichi naru kami ni, kansha suru koto de aru.
Kami wa, watashitachi o yami no chikara kara sukuidashite, sono aisuru miko no shihaika ni utsushite kudasatta.
Watashitachi wa, kono miko ni yotte aganai, sunawachi, tsumi no yurushi o ukete iru no de aru.
Miko wa, mienai kami no katachi de atte, subete no tsukurareta mono ni sakidatte umareta kata de aru.
Banbutsu wa, ten ni aru mono mo chi ni aru mono mo, mieru mono mo mienai mono mo, kurai mo shuken mo, shihai mo ken'i mo, mina miko ni atte tsukuraretakara de aru. Korera issai no mono wa, miko ni yotte tsukurare, miko no tame ni tsukurareta no de aru.
Kare wa banbutsu yori mo saki ni ari, banbutsu wa kare ni atte naritatte iru.
Soshite mizukara wa, sono karada naru kyoukai no kashira de aru. Kare wa hajime no mono de ari, shinin no naka kara saisho ni umareta kata de aru. Sore wa, gojishin ga subete no koto ni oite daiichi no mono to naru tame de aru.
Kami wa, mimune ni yotte, miko no uchi ni subete no michimichita toku o yadorase,
Soshite, sono juujika no chi ni yotte heiwa o tsukuri, banbutsu, sunawachi, chi ni aru mono, ten ni aru mono o, kotogotoku, kare ni yotte gojibun to wakai sasete kudasatta no de aru.
Anata gata mo, katsute wa warui okonai o shite kami kara hanare, kokoro no naka de kami ni tekitai shite ita.
Shikashi ima de wa, miko wa sono niku no karada ni yori, sono shi o tooshite, anatagata o kami to wakai sase, anatagata o sei naru, kizu no nai, semerareru tokoro no nai mono to shite, mimae ni tatasete kudasatta no de aru.
Tadashi, anata gata wa, yurugu koto ga naku, shikkari to shinkou ni fumitodomari, sudeni kiite iru fukuin no nozomi kara utsuriiku koto no nai you ni subekide aru. Kono fukuin wa, ten no shita ni aru subete no tsukurareta mono ni taishite nobetsutaerareta mono de atte, sore ni kono Pauro ga houshi shite iru no de aru.
Ima watashi wa, anata gata no tame no kunan o yorokonde ukete ori, Kirisuto no karada naru kyoukai no tame ni, Kirisuto no kurushimi no nao tarinai tokoro o, watashi no nikutai o motte oginatte iru.
Watashi wa, kami no kotoba o tsuge hiromeru tsutome o, anata gata no tame ni kami kara ataerarete iruga, sono tame ni kyoukai ni houshi suru mono ni natte iru no de aru.
Sono kotoba no okugi wa, yoyo ni watatte konoyo kara kakusarete itaga, ima ya kami no seitotachi ni akiraka ni sareta no de aru.
Kami wa karera ni, ihoujin no u kubeki kono okugi ga, ikani eikou ni tonda mono de aru ka o, shiraseyou to sareta no de aru. Kono okugi wa, anata gata no uchi ni imasu Kirisuto de ari, eikou no nozomi de aru.
Watashitachi wa kono Kirisuto o nobetsutae, chie o tsukushite subete no hito o kunkai shi, mata, subete no hito o oshiete iru. Sore wa, karera ga Kirisuto ni atte mattaki mono to shite tatsu you ni naru tame de aru.
Watashi wa kono tame ni, watashi no uchi ni chikarazuyoku hataraite orareru kata no chikara ni yori, kutou shinagara doryoku shite iru no de aru.
Watashi ga, anata gata to Raodekiya ni iru hitotachi no tame, mata, chokusetsu ni wa mada atta koto no nai hitobito no tame ni, donna ni kutou shite iru ka, wakatte moraitai.
Sore wa karera ga, kokoro o hagemasare, ai ni yotte musubiawasare, yutaka na rikairyoku o juubun ni ataerare, kami no okugi naru Kirisuto o shiru ni itaru tame de aru.
Kirisuto no uchi ni wa, chie to chishiki to no takara ga, issai kakusarete iru.
Watashi ga kou iu no wa, anata ga taga, dare ni mo takumi na kotoba de mayowasareru koto no nai tame de aru.
Tatoi, watashi wa nikutai ni oite wa hanarete ite mo, rei ni oite wa anata gata to issho ni ite, anata gata no chitsujo tadashii yousu to Kirisuto ni taisuru anata gata no kyouko na shinkou to o mite, yorokonde iru.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa Shu Kirisuto Iesu o ukeireta no dakara, kare ni atte aruki nasai.
Mata, kare ni nezashi, kare ni atte taterare, soshite oshierareta you ni, shinkou ga kakuritsu sarete, afureru bakari kansha shi nasai.
Anata gata wa, munashii damashigoto no tetsugaku de, hito no toriko ni sarenai you ni, ki o tsuke nasai. Sore wa Kirisuto ni shitagawazu, yo no moromoro no reiryoku ni shitagau ningen no iitsutae ni motozuku mono ni suginai.
Kirisuto ni koso, michimichite iru issai no kami no toku ga, katachi o totte yadotte ori,
Soshite anata gata wa, Kirisuto ni atte, sore ni mitasarete iru no de aru. Kare wa subete no shihai to ken'i to no kashira de ari,
Anata gata wa mata, kare ni atte, te ni yoranai katsurei, sunawachi, Kirisuto no katsurei o ukete, niku no karada o nugisuteta no de aru.
Anata gata wa baputesuma o ukete kare to tomo ni houmurare, douji ni, kare o shinin no naka kara yomigaeraseta kami no chikara o shinjiru shinkou ni yotte, kare to tomo ni yomigaerasareta no de aru.
Anata gata wa, saki ni wa tsumi no naka ni ari, katsu niku no katsurei ga nai mama de shinde ita mono de aruga, kami wa, anatagata o Kirisuto to tomo ni ikashi, watashitachi no issai no tsumi o yurushite kudasatta.
Kami wa, watashitachi o semete furi ni otoshiireru shousho o, sono kitei morotomo nuri keshi, kore o torinozoite, juujika ni tsukete shimawareta.
Soshite, moromoro no shihai to ken'i to no busou o kaijo shi, Kirisuto ni atte gaisen shi, karera o sono gyouretsu ni kuwaete, sarashimono to sareta no de aru.
Dakara, anata gata wa, shokumotsu to nomimono to ni tsuki, aruiha matsuri ya shingetsu ya ansokunichi nado ni tsuite, dare ni mo hihyou sarete wa naranai.
Korera wa, kitarubeki mono no kage de atte, sono hontai wa Kirisuto ni aru.
Anata gata wa, wazatorashii kenson to tenshi reihai to ni oborete iru hitobito kara, iroiro to akuhyou sarete wa naranai. Karera wa maboroshi o mita koto o omonji, niku no omoi ni yotte itazura ni hokoru dake de,
Kirisuto naru kashira ni, shikkari to tsuku koto o shinai. Kono kashira kara dete, karada zentai wa, fushi to fushi, suji to suji to ni yotte tsuyomerare musubiawasare, kami ni sodaterarete seichou shite iku no de aru.
Moshi anata ga taga, Kirisuto to tomo ni shinde yo no moromoro no reiryoku kara hanareta no nara, naze, nao konoyo ni ikite iru mono no you ni,
"Sawaru na, ajiwau na, fureru na" nado to iu kitei ni shibararete iru no ka.
Korera wa mina, tsukaeba tsukite shimau mono, ningen no kitei ya oshie ni yotte iru mono de aru.
Korera no koto wa, hitoriyogari no reihai to wazatorashii kenson to, karada no kugyou to o tomonau no de, chie no aru shiwazarashiku mieruga, jitsu wa, hoshiimama na nikuyoku o fusegu no ni, nan no yaku ni mo tatsu mono de wa nai.
Kono you ni, anata gata wa Kirisuto to tomo ni yomigaerasareta no dakara, ue ni aru mono o motome nasai. Soko de wa Kirisuto ga kami no migi ni zashite orareru no de aru.
Anata gata wa ue ni aru mono o omoubekide atte, chijou no mono ni kokoro o hikarete wa naranai.
Anata gata wa sudeni shinda mono de atte, anata gata no inochi wa, Kirisuto to tomo ni kami no uchi ni kakusarete iru no de aru.
Watashitachi no inochi naru Kirisuto ga arawareru toki ni wa, anata gata mo, Kirisuto to tomo ni eikou no uchi ni arawarerude arou.
Dakara, chijou no shitai, sunawachi, fuhinkou, kegare, jouyoku, akuyoku, mata don'yoku o koroshite shimai nasai. Don'yoku wa guuzou reihai ni hoka naranai.
Korera no koto no tame ni, kami no ikari ga kudaru no de aru.
Anata gata mo, izen korera no uchi ni hi o sugoshite ita toki ni wa, korera no koto o shite aruite ita.
Shikashi ima wa, korera issai no koto o sute, ikari, ikidoori, akui, soshiri, kuchi kara deru hazubeki kotoba o, sutete shimai nasai.
Tagai ni uso o itte wa naranai. Anata gata wa, furuki hito o sono okonai to issho ni nugisute,
Tsukurishu no katachi ni shitagatte atarashiku sare, shin no chishiki ni itaru atarashiki hito o kita no de aru.
Soko ni wa, mohaya Girishiyajin to Yudayajin, katsurei to mukatsurei, mikai no hito, Sukuteyabito, dorei, jiyuujin no sabetsu wa nai. Kirisuto ga subete de ari, subete no mono no uchi ni imasu no de aru.
Dakara, anata gata wa, kami ni erabareta mono, sei naru, aisarete iru mono de arukara, awaremi no kokoro, jiai, kenson, nyuuwa, kan'you o mi ni tsuke nasai.
Tagai ni shinobiai, moshi tagai ni seme mubeki koto ga areba, yurushi ai nasai. Shu mo anatagata o yurushite kudasatta no dakara, sono you ni, anata gata mo yurushi ai nasai.
Korera issai no mono no ue ni, ai o kuwae nasai. Ai wa, subete o kanzen ni musubu obi de aru.
Kirisuto no heiwa ga, anata gata no kokoro o shihai suru you ni shi nasai. Anata gata ga mesarete ittai to natta no wa, kono tame de mo aru. Itsu mo kansha shite i nasai.
Kirisuto no kotoba o, anata gata no uchi ni yutaka ni yadorase nasai. Soshite, chie o tsukushite tagai ni oshie mata kunkai shi, shi tosan bito rei no uta to ni yotte, kansha shite kokoro kara kami o hometatae nasai.
Soshite, anata no suru koto wa subete, kotoba ni yoruto waza ni yoru to o towazu, issai Shu Iesu no na ni yotte nashi, kare ni yotte chichi naru kami ni kansha shi nasai.
Tsuma taru mono yo, otto ni tsukae nasai. Sore ga, Shu ni aru mono ni fusawashii koto de aru.
Otto taru mono yo, tsuma o aishi nasai. Tsuraku atatte wa ikenai.
Ko taru mono yo, nanigoto ni tsuite mo ryoushin ni shitagai nasai. Kore ga Shu ni yorokobareru koto de aru.
Chichi taru mono yo, kodomo o iradatasete wa ikenai. Kokoro ga ijikeru ka mo shirenaikara.
Shimobe taru mono yo, nanigoto ni tsuite mo, niku ni yoru shujin ni shitagai nasai. Hito ni hetsuraou to shite, mesaki dake no tsutome o suru no de wa naku, magokoro o komete Shu o osoretsutsu, shitagai nasai.
Nani o suru ni mo, hito ni taishite de wa naku, Shu ni taishite suru you ni, kokoro kara hataraki nasai.
Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, anata gata wa mikuni o tsugu koto o, mukui to shite Shu kara ukerude arou. Anata gata wa, Shu Kirisuto ni tsukaete iru no de aru.
Fusei o okonau mono wa, jibun no okonatta fusei ni taishite mukui o ukerude arou. Sore ni wa sabetsu atsukai wa nai.
Shujin taru mono yo, shimobe o tadashiku kouhei ni atsukai nasai. Anata gata ni mo Shu ga ten ni imasu koto ga, wakatte iru no dakara.
Me o samashite, kansha no uchi ni inori, hitasura inori tsuzuke nasai.
Douji ni watashitachi no tame ni mo, kami ga mikotoba no tame ni mon o hiraite kudasatte, watashitachi ga Kirisuto no okugi o katareru you ni (watashi wa, jitsu wa, sono tame ni goku ni tsunagarete iru no de aru),
Mata, watashi ga katarubeki koto o hakkiri to katareru you ni, inotte hoshii.
Ima no toki o ikashite mochii, soto no hito ni taishite kashikoku koudou shi nasai.
Itsu mo, shio de ajitsuke rareta, yasashii kotoba o tsukai nasai. Sou sureba, hitoribitori ni taishite dou kotaerubeki ka, wakarude arou.
Watashi no yousu ni tsuite wa, Shu ni atte tomo ni shimobe de ari, mata chuujitsu ni tsukaete iru aisuru kyoudai Tekiko ga, anata gata ni issai no koto o houkoku surude arou.
Watashi ga kare o anata gata no moto ni okuru no wa, watashitachi no yousu o shiri, mata kare ni yotte kokoro ni hagemashi o ukeru tame na no de aru.
Anata gata no hitori, chuujitsu na aisuru kyoudai Oneshimo o mo, kare to tomo ni okuru. Karera wa anata gata ni, kochira no issai no jijou o shiraserude arou.
Watashi to issho ni toraware no mi to natte iru Arisutaruko to, Barunaba no itoko Maruko to ga, anata gata ni yoroshiku to itte iru. Kono Maruko ni tsuite wa, moshi kare ga anata gata no moto ni ikunara, mukaete yaru you ni to no sashizu o, anata gata wa sudeni ukete iru hazu de aru.
Mata, Yusuto to yobarete iru Iesu kara mo yoroshiku. Katsurei no mono no naka de, kono sannin dake ga kami no kuni no tame ni hataraku dourousha de atte, watashi no nagusame to natta mono de aru.
Anata gata no uchi no hitori, Kirisuto Iesu no shimobe Epafurasu kara, yoroshiku. Kare wa itsu mo, inori no uchi de anatagata o oboe, anata gata ga mattakihito to nari, kami no mimune o kotogotoku kakushin shite tatsu you ni to, nesshin ni inotte iru.
Watashi wa, kare ga anata gata no tame, mata Raodekiya to Hieraporisu no hitobito no tame ni, hijou ni shinrou shite iru koto o, shougen suru.
Aisuru isha Ruka to Demasu to ga, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Raodekiya no kyoudaitachi ni, mata Nunpa to sono ie ni aru kyoukai to ni, yoroshiku.
Kono tegami ga anata gata no tokoro de roudoku saretara, Raodekiya no kyoukai de mo roudoku sareru you ni, torihakaratte hoshii. Mata Raodekiya kara mawatte kuru tegami o, anata gata mo roudoku shite hoshii.
Arukipo ni, "Shu ni atte uketa tsutome o yoku hatasu you ni" to tsutaete hoshii.
Pauro jishin ga, tezukara kono aisatsu o kaku. Watashi ga goku ni tsunagarete iru koto o, oboete ite hoshii. Megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Pauro to Shiruwano to Temote kara, chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto to ni aru Tesaronikebitotachi no kyoukai e. Megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Watashitachi wa inori no toki ni anatagata o oboe, anata gata ichidou no koto o, itsu mo kami ni kansha shi,
Anata gata no shinkou no hataraki to, ai no rouku to, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni taisuru nozomi no nintai to o, watashitachi no chichi naru kami no mimae ni, taezu omoiokoshite iru.
Kami ni aisarete iru kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa, anata gata ga kami ni erabarete iru koto o shitte iru.
Naze nara, watashitachi no fukuin ga anata gata ni tsutaerareta toki, sore wa kotoba dake ni yorazu, chikara to seirei to tsuyoi kakushin to ni yottakara de aru. Watashitachi ga, anata gata no aida de, minna no tame ni donna koto o shita ka, anata gata no shitte iru toori de aru.
Soshite anata gata wa, ooku no kannan no naka de, seirei ni yoru yorokobi o motte mikotoba o ukeire, watashitachi to Shu to ni narau mono to nari,
Kou shite, Makedoniya to Akaya to ni iru shinja zentai no mohan ni natta.
Sunawachi, Shu no kotoba wa anata gata kara dete, tada Makedoniya to Akaya to ni hibiki watatte iru bakari de wa naku, itaru tokoro de, kami ni taisuru anata gata no shinkou no koto ga ii hiromerareta no de, kore ni tsuite wa nani mo noberu hitsuyou wa nai hodo de aru.
Watashitachi ga, donna ni shite anata gata no tokoro ni haitte itta ka, mata, anata ga taga, donna ni shite guuzou o sutete kami ni tachikaeri, ikeru makoto no kami ni tsukaeru you ni nari,
Soshite, shinin no naka kara yomigaetta kami no miko, sunawachi, watashitachi o kitarubeki ikari kara sukuidashite kudasaru Iesu ga, ten kara kudatte korareru no o matsu you ni natta ka o, karera jishin ga ii hiromete iru no de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata jishin ga shitte iru toori, watashitachi ga anata gata no tokoro ni haitte itta koto wa, muda de wa nakatta.
Sore dokoro ka, anata gata ga shitte iru you ni, watashitachi wa, saki ni Piripi de kurushimerare, hazukashimerareta ni mo kakawarazu, watashitachi no kami ni yuuki o ataerarete, hageshii kutou no uchi ni kami no fukuin o anata gata ni katatta no de aru.
Ittai, watashitachi no senkyou wa, mayoi ya kegareta kokoro kara deta mono de mo naku, damashigoto de mo nai.
Kaette, watashitachi wa kami no shinnin o ukete fukuin o takusareta no de, ningen ni yorokobareru tame de wa naku, watashitachi no kokoro o miwakeru kami ni yorokobareru you ni, fukuin o kataru no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata ga shitte iru you ni, kesshite hetsurai no kotoba o mochiita koto mo naku, koujitsu o moukete, musabotta koto mo nai. Sore wa, kami ga akashi shite kudasaru.
Mata, watashitachi wa, Kirisuto no shito to shite omonjirareru koto ga dekita no de aruga, anata ga takara ni mo seyo, hoka no hitobito kara ni mo seyo, ningen kara no eiyo o motomeru koto wa shinakatta.
Mushiro, anata gata no aida de, choudo haha ga sono kodomo o sodateru you ni, yasashiku furumatta.
Kono you ni, anatagata o shitawashiku omotte ita no de, tada kami no fukuin bakari de wa naku, jibun no inochi made mo anata gata ni ataetai to negatta hodo ni, anatagata o aishita no de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa watashitachi no rouku to doryoku to o kioku shite iru koto de arou. Sunawachi, anata gata no dare ni mo futan o kakemai to omotte, nichiya hatarakinagara, anata gata ni kami no fukuin o nobetsutaeta.
Anata gata mo akashi shi, kami mo akashi shite kudasaru you ni, watashitachi wa anata gata shinja no mae de, shinjin bukaku, tadashiku, semerareru tokoro ga nai you ni, seikatsu o shita no de aru.
Soshite, anata gata mo shitte iru toori, chichi ga sono ko ni taishite suru you ni, anata gata no hitoribitori ni taishite,
Mikuni to sono eikou to ni meshite kudasatta kami no mikokoro ni kanatte aruku you ni to, susume, hagemashi, mata, satoshita no de aru.
Korera no koto o kangaete, watashitachi ga mata taezu kami ni kansha shite iru no wa, anata gata ga watashitachi no toita kami no kotoba o kiita toki ni, sore o ningen no kotoba to shite de wa naku, kami no kotoba to shite - - jijitsu sono toori de aruga - - ukeirete kureta koto de aru. Soshite, kono kami no kotoba wa, shinjiru anata gata no uchi ni hataraite iru no de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa, Yudaya no, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru kami no shokyoukai ni narau mono to natta. Sunawachi, karera ga Yudayajintachi kara kurushimerareta to onaji you ni, anata gata mo mata doukokujin kara kurushimerareta.
Yudayajintachi wa Shu Iesu to yogensha tachi to o koroshi, watashitachi o hakugai shi, kami o yorokobasezu, subete no hito ni sakarai,
Watashitachi ga ihoujin ni sukui no kotoba o kataru no o samatagete, taezu jibun no tsumi o mitashite iru. Soko de, kami no ikari wa mottomo hageshiku karera ni nozomu ni itatta no de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa, shibaraku no aida, anata gata kara hikihanasarete ita no de - - kokoro ni oite de wa naku, karada dake de wa aruga - - naosara, anata gata no kao o mitai to setsu ni koinegatta.
Dakara, watashitachi wa, anata gata no tokoro ni ikou to shita. Koto ni, kono Pauro wa, issai narazu ikou to shita no de aru. Sore da no ni, watashitachi wa Satan ni samatagerareta.
Jissai, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no rairin ni atatte, watashitachi no nozomi to yorokobi to hokori no kanmuri to narubeki mono wa, anatagata o hoka ni shite, dare ga arudarou ka.
Anata gata koso, jitsu ni watashitachi no homare de ari, yorokobi de aru.
Soko de, watashitachi wa kore ijou taerarenaku natte, watashitachi dake ga Atene ni tomaru koto ni sadame,
Watashitachi no kyoudai de, Kirisuto no fukuin ni okeru kami no dourousha Temote o tsukawashita. Sore wa, anata gata no shinkou o tsuyome,
Kono you na kannan no naka ni atte, douyou suru mono ga hitori mo nai you ni hagemasu tame de atta. Anata gata no shitte iru toori, watashitachi wa kannan ni au you ni sadamerarete iru no de aru.
Soshite, anata gata no tokoro ni ita toki, watashitachi ga yagate kannan ni au koto o arakajime itte oitaga, anata gata no shitte iru you ni, ima sono toori ni natta no de aru.
Soko de, watashi wa kore ijou taerarenaku natte, moshi ya "Kokoromiru mono" ga anatagata o kokoromi, sono tame ni watashitachi no rouku ga muda ni nari wa shinai ka to kizukatte, anata gata no shinkou o shiru tame ni, kare o tsukawashita no de aru.
Tokoro ga ima Temote ga, anata gata no tokoro kara watashitachi no moto ni kaette kite, anata gata no shinkou to ai to ni tsuite shirase, mata, anata gata ga itsu mo watashitachi no koto o oboe, watashitachi ga anata gata ni aitaku omotte iruto onaji you ni, watashitachi ni shikiri ni aitagatte iru to iu kippou o motarashita.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Sore ni yotte, watashitachi wa arayuru kunan to kannan to no naka ni arinagara, anata gata no shinkou ni yotte nagusamerareta.
Naze nara, anata gata ga Shu ni atte kataku tatte kurerunara, watashitachi wa ima ikiru koto ni narukara de aru.
Hontou ni, watashitachi no kami no mimae de, anata gata no koto de yorokobu ookina yorokobi no tame ni, donna kansha o kami ni sasagetara yoidarou ka.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata no kao o mi, anata gata no shinkou no tarinai tokoro o oginaitai to, nichiya shikiri ni negatte iru no de aru.
Dou ka, watashitachi no chichi naru kami gojishin to, watashitachi no Shu Iesu to ga, anata gata no tokoro e iku michi o, watashitachi ni hiraite kudasaru you ni.
Dou ka, Shu ga, anata gata sougo no ai to subete no hito ni taisuru ai to o, watashitachi ga anatagata o aisuru ai to onaji you ni, mashikuwaete yutaka ni shite kudasaru you ni.
Soshite, dou ka, watashitachi no Shu Iesu ga, sono subete no sei naru mono to tomo ni korareru toki, kami no mimae ni, anata gata no kokoro o tsuyome, kiyoku, semerareru tokoro no nai mono ni shite kudasaru you ni.
Saigo ni, kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa Shu Iesu ni atte anata gata ni negai katsu susumeru. Anata ga taga, dono you ni aruite kami o yorokobasubeki ka o watashitachi kara mananda you ni, mata, ima aruite iru toori ni, masumasu aruki tsuzuke nasai.
Watashitachi ga dou iu oshie o Shu Iesu ni yotte ataeta ka, anata gata wa yoku shitte iru.
