Kakuji, ki o tsukete jibun no karada o kiyoku tattoku tamochi,
Kami o shiranai ihoujin no you ni jouyoku o hoshiimama ni sezu,
Mata, kono you na koto de kyoudai o fumitsuke tari, damashi tari shite wa naranai. Mae ni mo anata gata ni kibishiku keikoku shite oita you ni, Shu wa korera subete no koto ni tsuite, mukui o nasarukara de aru.
Kami ga watashitachi o mesareta no wa, kegareta koto o suru tame de wa naku, kiyoku naru tame de aru.
Kou iu wake de arukara, korera no keikoku o kobamu mono wa, hito o kobamu no de wa naku, seirei o anata gata no kokoro ni tamawaru kami o kobamu no de aru.
Kyoudai ai ni tsuite wa, imasara kakiokuru hitsuyou wa nai. Anata gata wa, tagai ni aishiau you ni kami ni chokusetsu oshierarete ori,
Mata, jijitsu Makedoniya zendo ni iru subete no kyoudai ni taishite, sore o jikkou shite iru no dakara. Shikashi, kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ni susumeru. Masumasu, sou shite hoshii.
Soshite, anata gata ni meijite oita you ni, tsutomete ochitsuita seikatsu o shi, jibun no shigoto ni mi o ire, tezukara hataraki nasai.
Sou sureba, gaibu no hitobito ni taishite hin'i o tamochi, mata dare no sewa ni mo narazu ni, seikatsu dekirude arou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Nemutte iru hitobito ni tsuite wa, muchi de ite moraitaku nai. Nozomi o motanai hoka no hitobito no you ni, anata gata ga kanashimu koto no nai tame de aru.
Watashitachi ga shinjite iru you ni, Iesu ga shinde fukkatsu saretakara ni wa, douyou ni kami wa Iesu ni atte nemutte iru hitobito o mo, Iesu to issho ni michikidashite kudasarude arou.
Watashitachi wa Shu no kotoba ni yotte iuga, ikinagaraete Shu no rairin no toki made nokoru watashitachi ga, nemutta hitobito yori saki ni naru koto wa, kesshite naide arou.
Sunawachi, Shu gojishin ga tenshi no kashira no koe to kami no rappa no narihibiku uchi ni, aizu no koe de, ten kara kudatte korareru. Sono toki, Kirisuto ni atte shinda hitobito ga, mazu saisho ni yomigaeri,
Sore kara ikinokotte iru watashitachi ga, karera to tomo ni kumo ni tsutsumarete hikiagerare, kuuchuu de Shu ni ai, kou shite, itsu mo Shu to tomo ni irude arou.
Dakara, anata gata wa, korera no kotoba o motte tagai ni nagusameai nasai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Sono jiki to baai to ni tsuite wa, kakiokuru hitsuyou wa nai.
Anata gata jishin ga yoku shitte iru toori, Shu no hi wa nusubito ga yoru kuru you ni kuru.
Hitobito ga heiwa da buji da to itte iru sono yasaki ni, choudo ninpu ni umi no kurushimi ga nozomu you ni, totsujo to shite horobi ga karera o osotte kuru. Soshite, sore kara nogareru koto wa kesshite dekinai.
Shikashi kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa kurayami no naka ni inai no dakara, sono hi ga, nusubito no you ni anatagata o fui ni osou koto wa naide arou.
Anata gata wa mina hikari no ko de ari, hiru no ko na no de aru. Watashitachi wa, yoru no mono de mo yami no mono de mo nai.
Dakara, hoka no hitobito no you ni nemutte inaide, me o samashite tsutsushinde iyou.
Nemuru mono wa yoru nemuri, you mono wa yoru you no de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa hiru no mono na no dakara, shinkou to ai to no muneate o mi ni tsuke, sukui no nozomi no kabuto o kabutte, tsutsushinde iyou.
Kami wa, watashitachi o ikari ni awaseru you ni sadamerareta no de wa naku, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte sukui o eru you ni sadamerareta no de aru.
Kirisuto ga watashitachi no tame ni shinareta no wa, samete ite mo nemutte ite mo, watashitachi ga Shu to tomo ni ikiru tame de aru.
Dakara, anata gata wa, ima shite iru you ni, tagai ni nagusameai, sougo no toku o takame nasai.
