Karera no hataraki o omotte, tokuni aishi uyamai nasai. Tagai ni heiwa ni sugoshi nasai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata ni osusume suru. Taida na mono o imashime, shoushin na mono o hagemashi, yowai mono o tasuke, subete no hito ni taishite kan'you de ari nasai.
Dare mo aku o motte aku ni mukuinai you ni kokorogake, otagai ni, mata minna ni taishite, itsu mo zen o oimotome nasai.
Itsu mo yorokonde i nasai.
Taezu inori nasai.
Subete no koto ni tsuite, kansha shi nasai. Kore ga, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, kami ga anata gata ni motomete orareru koto de aru.
Mitama o keshite wa ikenai.
Yogen o karonjite wa naranai.
Subete no mono o shikibetsu shite, yoi mono o mamori,
Arayuru shurui no aku kara toozakari nasai.
