Anatagata o mesareta kata wa shinjitsu de ararerukara, kono koto o shite kudasarude arou.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no tame ni mo, inotte hoshii.
Subete no kyoudaitachi ni, kiyoi seppun o motte, yoroshiku tsutaete hoshii.
Watashi wa Shu ni yotte meijiru. Kono tegami o, minna no kyoudai ni yomikikase nasai.
Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Pauro to Shiruwano to Temote kara, watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto to ni aru Tesaronikebitotachi no kyoukai e.
Chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa, itsu mo anata gata no koto o kami ni kansha sezu ni wa orarenai. Mata sou suru no ga touzen de aru. Sore wa, anata gata no shinkou ga ooini seichou shi, anata gata hitoribitori no ai ga, otagai no aida ni mashi kuwawatte irukara de aru.
Sono tame ni, watashitachi jishin wa, anata gata ga ima ukete iru arayuru hakugai to kannan to no tadanaka de shimeshite iru nintai to shinkou to ni tsuki, kami no shokyoukai ni taishite anatagata o hokori to shite iru.
Kore wa, anatagata o, kami no kuni ni fusawashii mono ni shiyou to suru kami no sabaki ga tadashii koto o, shouko dateru mono de aru. Sono kami no kuni no tame ni, anata gata mo kurushinde iru no de aru.
Sunawachi, anatagata o nayamasu mono ni wa kannan o motte mukui, nayamasarete iru anata gata ni wa, watashitachi to tomo ni, kyuusoku o motte mukuite kudasaru no ga, kami ni totte tadashii koto dakara de aru.
Sore wa, Shu Iesu ga honoo no naka de chikara aru tenshitachi o hikiite ten kara arawareru toki ni jitsugen suru.
Sono toki, Shu wa kami o mitomenai monotachi ya, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no fukuin ni kikishitagawanai monotachi ni houfuku shi,
Soshite, karera wa Shu no mikao to sono chikara no eikou kara shirizokerarete, eien no horobi ni itaru keibatsu o ukerude arou.
Sono hi ni, Iesu wa kudatte korare, seitotachi no naka de agamerare, subete shinjiru monotachi no aida de kyoutan sarerude arou - - watashitachi no kono akashi wa, anata gata ni yotte shinjirarete iru no de aru.
Kono tame ni mata, watashitachi wa, watashitachi no kami ga anatagata o meshi ni kanau mono to nashi, zen ni taisuru arayuru negai to shinkou no hataraki to o chikarazuyoku mitashite kudasaru you ni to, anata gata no tame ni taezu inotte iru.
Sore wa, watashitachi no kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto to no megumi ni yotte, watashitachi no Shu Iesu no mina ga anata gata no aida de agamerare, anata gata mo Shu ni atte eikou o ukeru tame de aru.
Sate kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no rairin to, watashitachi ga mimoto ni atsumerareru koto to ni tsuite, anata gata ni onegai suru koto ga aru.
Rei ni yori, aruiha kotoba ni yori, aruiha watashitachi kara deta to iu tegami ni yotte, Shu no hi wa sudeni kita to furemawaru mono ga atte mo, sugusama kokoro o ugokasare tari, awate tari shite wa ikenai.
Dare ga donna koto o shite mo, sore ni damasarete wa naranai. Mazu haikyou no koto ga okori, fuhou no mono, sunawachi, horobi no ko ga arawareru ni chigai nai.
Kare wa, subete kami to yobare tari ogamare tari suru mono ni hankou shite tachiagari, mizukara kami no miya ni zashite, jibun wa kami da to sengen suru.
Watashi ga mada anata gata no tokoro ni ita toki, korera no koto o kurikaeshite itta no o omoidasanai no ka.
Soshite, anata gata ga shitte iru toori, kare ga jibun ni sadamerareta toki ni natte kara arawareru you ni, ima kare o soshi shite iru mono ga aru.
Fuhou no himitsu no chikara ga, sudeni hataraite iru no de aru. Tada sore wa, ima soshi shite iru mono ga torinozokareru toki made no koto de aru.
Sono toki ni naruto, fuhou no mono ga arawareru. Kono mono o, Shu Iesu wa kuchi no iki o motte koroshi, rairin no kagayaki ni yotte horobosude arou.
Fuhou no mono ga kuru no wa, Satan no hataraki ni yoru no de atte, arayuru itsuwari no chikara to, shirushi to, fushigi to,
Mata, arayuru fugi no madowashi to o, horobubeki monodomo ni taishite okonau tame de aru. Karera ga horobiru no wa, jibunra no sukui to narubeki shinri ni taisuru ai o ukeirenakatta mukui de aru.
Soko de kami wa, karera ga itsuwari o shinjiru you ni, mayowasu chikara o okuri,
Kou shite, shinri o shinjinaide fugi o yorokonde ita subete no hito o, sabaku no de aru.
Shikashi, Shu ni aisarete iru kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi wa itsu mo anata gata no koto o, kami ni kansha sezu ni wa orarenai. Sore wa, kami ga anatagata o hajime kara erande, mitama ni yoru kiyometo, shinri ni taisuru shinkou to ni yotte, sukui o esaseyou to shi,
Sono tame ni, watashitachi no fukuin ni yori anatagata o meshite, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no eikou ni azukarasete kudasarukara de aru.
Soko de, kyoudaitachi yo. Kataku tatte, watashitachi no kotoba ya tegami de oshierareta iitsutae o, shikkari to mamori tsuzuke nasai.
Dou ka, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto gojishin to, watashitachi o aishi, megumi o motte eien no nagusame to tashika na nozomi to o tamawaru watashitachi no chichi naru kami to ga,
Anata gata no kokoro o hagemashi, anatagata o tsuyomete, subete no yoi waza o okonai, tadashii kotoba o kataru mono to shite kudasaru you ni.
Saigo ni, kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no tame ni inotte hoshii. Dou ka Shu no kotoba ga, anata gata no tokoro to onaji you ni, koko de mo hayaku hiromari, mata, agamerareru you ni.
Mata, dou ka, watashitachi ga futsugou na akunin kara sukuwareru you ni. Jijitsu, subete no hito ga shinkou o motte iru wake de wa nai.
Shikashi, Shu wa shinjitsu na kata de arukara, anatagata o tsuyome, ashiki mono kara mamotte kudasarude arou.
Watashitachi ga meijiru koto o, anata gata wa genni jikkou shite ori, mata, jikkou surude arouto, watashitachi wa, Shu ni atte kakushin shite iru.
Dou ka, Shu ga anata gata no kokoro o michibiite, kami no ai to Kirisuto no nintai to o motasete kudasaru you ni.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Shu Iesu Kirisuto no na ni yotte anata gata ni meijiru. Taida na seikatsu o shite, watashitachi kara uketa iitsutae ni shitagawanai subete no kyoudaitachi kara, toozakari nasai.
Watashitachi ni, dou naraubekide aru ka wa, anata gata jishin ga shitte iru hazu de aru. Anata gata no tokoro ni ita toki ni wa, watashitachi wa taida na seikatsu o shinakattashi,
Hito kara pan o moratte taberu koto mo shinakatta. Sore dokoro ka, anata gata no dare ni mo futan o kakemaito, nichiya, rouku shi doryoku shite hataraki tsuzuketa.
Sore wa, watashitachi ni sono kenri ga naikara de wa naku, tada watashitachi ni anata gata ga minarau you ni, mi o motte mohan o shimeshita no de aru.
Mata, anata gata no tokoro ni ita toki ni, "Hatarakou to shinai mono wa, taberu koto mo shite wa naranai" to meijite oita.
Tokoro ga, kiku tokoro ni yoruto, anata gata no uchi no aru mono wa taida na seikatsu o okuri, hatarakanaide, tada itazura ni ugokimawatte iru to no koto de aru.
Kou shita hitobito ni taishite wa, shizuka ni hataraite jibun de eta pan o taberu you ni, Shu Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte meiji mata susumeru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa, tayumazu ni yoi hataraki o shi nasai.
Moshi kono tegami ni shirushita watashitachi no kotoba ni kikishitagawanai hito ga areba, sono you na hito ni wa chuui o shite, kousai shinai ga yoi. Kare ga mizukara hajiru you ni naru tame de aru.
Shikashi, kare o teki no you ni omowanaide, kyoudai to shite kunkai shi nasai.
Dou ka, heiwa no Shu gojishin ga, itsu ikanaru baai ni mo, anata gata ni heiwa o ataete kudasaru you ni. Shu ga anata gata ichidou to tomo ni orareru you ni.
Koko de Pauro jishin ga, tezukara aisatsu o kaku. Kore wa, watashi no dono tegami ni mo kaku shirushi de aru. Watashi wa, kono you ni kaku.
Dou ka, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata ichidou to tomo ni aru you ni.
Watashitachi no sukuinushi naru kami to, watashitachi no nozomi de aru Kirisuto Iesu to no ninmei ni yoru Kirisuto Iesu no shito Pauro kara,
Shinkou ni yoru watashi no shinjitsu na ko Temote e. Chichi naru kami to watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu kara, megumi to awaremi to heian to ga, anata ni aru you ni.
Watashi ga Makedoniya ni mukatte shuppatsu suru sai, tanonde oita you ni, anata wa Epeso ni todomatte ite, aru hitobito ni, chigatta oshie o toku koto o sezu,
Tsukuribanashi ya hateshi no nai keizu nado ni ki o torareru koto mo nai you ni, meiji nasai. Sono you na koto wa shinkou ni yoru kami no tsutome o hatasu mono de wa naku, mushiro rongi o hikiokosaseru dake no mono de aru.
Watashi no kono meirei wa, kiyoi kokoro to tadashii ryoushin to itsuwari no nai shinkou to kara dete kuru ai o mokuhyou to shite iru.
Aru hitobito wa korera no mono kara sore te kuuron ni hashiri,
Rippou no kyoushi taru koto o kokorozashite inagara, jibun no itte iru koto mo shuchou shite iru koto mo, wakaranaide iru.
Watashitachi ga shitte iru toori, rippou naru mono wa, hou ni shitagatte mochiirunara, yoi mono de aru.
Sunawachi, rippou wa tadashii hito no tame ni sadamerareta no de wa naku, fuhou na mono to hou ni fukusanai mono, fushinjin na mono to tsumi aru mono, shinsei o kegasu mono to zokuaku na mono, chichi o korosu mono to haha o korosu mono, hito o korosu mono,
Fuhinkou na mono, nanshoku o suru mono, yuukai suru mono, itsuwaru mono, itsuwari chikau mono, sono hoka kenzen na oshie ni motoru koto ga areba, sono tame ni sadamerarete iru koto omito mubekide aru.
Kore wa, shukufuku ni michita kami no eikou no fukuin ga shimesu tokoro de atte, watashi wa kono fukuin o yudanerarete iru no de aru.
Watashi wa, jibun o tsuyoku shite kudasatta watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu ni kansha suru. Shu wa watashi o chuujitsu na mono to mite, kono tsutome ni ninjite kudasatta no de aru.
Watashi wa izen ni wa, kami o soshiru mono, hakugai suru mono, fuson na mono de atta. Shikashi watashi wa, korera no koto o, shinkou ga nakatta toki, muchi na tame ni shita no dakara, awaremi o koumutta no de aru.
Sono ue, watashitachi no Shu no megumi ga, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru shinkou to ai to ni tomonai, masumasu mashi kuwawatte kita.
"Kirisuto Iesu wa, tsumibito o sukuu tame ni konoyo ni kite kudasatta" to iu kotoba wa, kakujitsu de, sono mama ukeireru ni taru mono de aru. Watashi wa, sono tsumibito no kashira na no de aru.
Shikashi, watashi ga awaremi o koumutta no wa, Kirisuto Iesu ga, mazu watashi ni taishite kagirinai kan'you o shimeshi, soshite, watashi ga kongo, kare o shinjite eien no inochi o ukeru mono no mohan to naru tame de aru.
Yoyo no shihaisha, fukyuu ni shite miezaru yuiitsu no kami ni, yoyo kagirinaku, homare to eikou to ga aru you ni, amen.
Watashi no ko Temote yo. Izen anata ni taishite nasareta kazukazu no yogen no kotoba ni shitagatte, kono meirei o ataeru. Anata wa, korera no kotoba ni hagemasarete, shinkou to tadashii ryoushin to o tamochinagara, rippa ni tatakai nuki nasai.
Aru hitobito wa, tadashii ryoushin o suteta tame, shinkou no hasen ni atta.
Sono naka ni, Himenao to Arekisanderu to ga iru. Watashi wa, kami o kegasanai koto o manabaseru tame, kono futari o Satan no te ni watashita no de aru.
Soko de, mazu daiichi ni susumeru. Subete no hito no tame ni, outachi to ue ni tatte iru subete no hitobito no tame ni, negai to, inori to, torinashi to, kansha to o sasage nasai.
Sore wa watashitachi ga, yasuraka de shizuka na isshou o, shin ni shinjin bukaku mata kingen ni sugosu tame de aru.
Kore wa, watashitachi no sukuinushi de aru kami no mimae ni yoi koto de ari, mata, mikokoro ni kanau koto de aru.
Kami wa, subete no hito ga sukuwarete, shinri o satoru ni itaru koto o nozonde orareru.
Kami wa yuiitsu de ari, kami to hito to no aida no chuuhosha mo tada hitori de atte, sore wa hito naru Kirisuto Iesu de aru.
Kare wa, subete no hito no a ga nai to shite gojishin o sasageraretaga, sore wa, sadamerareta toki ni nasareta akashi ni hoka naranai.
Sono tame ni, watashi wa taterarete senkyousha, shito to nari (watashi wa shinjitsu o itte iru, itsuwatte wa inai), mata ihoujin ni shinkou to shinri to o oshieru kyoushi to natta no de aru.
Otoko wa, ikat tari arasot tari shinaide, donna basho de mo, kiyoi te o agete inotte hoshii.
Mata, onna wa tsutsumashii minari o shi, tekido ni tsutsushimibukaku mi o kazarubekide atte, kami o an dari, kin ya shinju o tsuke tari, kouka na kimono o ki tari shite wa ikenai.
Mushiro, yoi waza o motte kazari to suru koto ga, shinkou o iiarawashite iru onna ni nitsukawashii.
Onna wa shizuka ni shite ite, banji ni tsuke juujun ni oshie o manabu ga yoi.
Onna ga oshie tari, otoko no ue ni tat tari suru koto o, watashi wa yurusanai. Mushiro, shizuka ni shite irubekide aru.
Naze nara, Adamu ga saki ni tsukurare, sore kara Eba ga tsukuraretakara de aru.
Mata Adamu wa madowasarenakattaga, onna wa madowasarete, ayamachi o okashita.
Shikashi, onna ga tsutsushimibukaku, shinkou to ai to kiyosa to o mochi tsuzukerunara, ko o umu koto ni yotte sukuwarerude arou.
"Moshi hito ga kantoku no shoku o nozomunara, sore wa yoi shigoto o negau koto de aru" to wa tadashii kotoba de aru.
Sate, kantoku wa, hinan no nai hito de, hitori no tsuma no otto de ari, mizukara o seishi, tsutsushimibukaku, reigi tadashiku, tabibito o motenashi, yoku oshieru koto ga deki,
Sake o konomazu, ranbou de naku, kan'you de atte, hito to arasowazu, kane ni tanpaku de,
Jibun no ie o yoku osame, kingen de atte, kodomotachi o juujun na mono ni sodatete iru hito de nakereba naranai.
Jibun no ie o osameru koto mo kokoroete inai hito ga, dou shite kami no kyoukai o azukaru koto ga dekiyou ka.
Kare wa mata, shinja ni natte aida mo nai mono de atte wa naranai. Sou de aruto, kouman ni natte, akuma to onaji shinpan o ukeru ka mo shirenai.
Sarani mata, kyoukaigai no hitobito ni mo yoku omowarete iru hito de nakereba naranai. Sou de naito, so shiri o uke, akuma no wana ni kakarude arou.
Sore to douyou ni, shitsuji mo kingen de atte, nimaijita o tsukawazu, oozake o nomazu, ri o musaborazu,
Kiyoi ryoushin o motte, shinkou no okugi o tamotte inakereba naranai.
Karera wa mazu shiraberarete, futsugou na koto ga nakattanara, sore kara shitsuji no shoku ni tsukasubekide aru.
Onnatachi mo, douyou ni kingen de, tanin o soshirazu, mizukara o seishi, subete no koto ni chuujitsu de nakereba naranai.
Shitsuji wa hitori no tsuma no otto de atte, kodomo to jibun no ie to o yoku osameru mono de nakereba naranai.
Shitsuji no shoku o yoku tsutometa mono wa, yoi chii o e, sarani Kirisuto Iesu o shinjiru shinkou ni yoru, ooinaru kakushin o erude arou.
Watashi wa, anata no tokoro ni sugu ikitai to nozominagara, kono tegami o kaite iru.
Man'ichi watashi ga okureru baai ni wa, kami no ie de ikani seikatsu subeki ka o, anata ni shitte moraitaikara de aru. Kami no ie to iu no wa, ikeru kami no kyoukai no koto de atte, sore wa shinri no hashira, shinri no kiso na no de aru.
Tashika ni idai na no wa, kono shinjin no okugi de aru, "Kirisuto wa niku ni oite araware, rei ni oite gi to serare, mitsukai tachi ni mirare, shokokumin no aida ni tsutaerare, sekai no naka de shinjirare, eikou no uchi ni ten ni agerareta".
Shikashi, mitama wa akiraka ni tsugete iu. Nochi no toki ni naruto, aru hitobito wa, madowasu rei to akuryou no oshie to ni ki o torarete, shinkou kara hanaresarude arou.
Sore wa, ryoushin ni yakiin o osarete iru itsuwarimono no gizen no shiwaza de aru.
Korera no itsuwarimonodomo wa, kekkon o kinji tari, shokumotsu o tatsu koto o meiji tari suru. Shikashi shokumotsu wa, shinkou ga ari shinri o mitomeru mono ga, kansha shite ukeru you ni to, kami no tsukurareta mono de aru.
Kami no tsukurareta mono wa, mina yoi mono de atte, kansha shite ukerunara, nani hitotsu suterubeki mono wa nai.
Sorera wa, kami no kotoba to inori to ni yotte, kiyomerarerukara de aru.
Korera no koto o kyoudaitachi ni oshierunara, anata wa, shinkou no kotoba to anata no shitagatte kita yoi oshie no kotoba to ni yashinawarete, Kirisuto Iesu no yoi houshisha ni narude arou.
Shikashi, zokuaku de gu ni mo tsukanai tsukuribanashi wa sake nasai. Shinjin no tame ni jibun o kunren shi nasai.
Karada no kunren wa sukoshi wa ekisuru tokoro ga aruga, shinjin wa, ima no inochi to nochinoyo no inochi to ga yakusoku sarete aru no de, banji ni eki to naru.
Kore wa kakujitsu de, sono mama ukeireru ni taru kotoba de aru.
Watashitachi wa, kono tame ni roushi kurushinde iru. Sore wa, subete no hito no sukuinushi, tokuni shinjiru monotachi no sukuinushi naru ikeru kami ni, nozomi o oite kitakara de aru.
Korera no koto o meiji, mata oshie nasai.
Anata wa, toshi ga wakai tame ni hito ni karonjirarete wa naranai. Mushiro, kotoba ni mo, gyoujou ni mo, ai ni mo, shinkou ni mo, junketsu ni mo, shinja no mohan ni nari nasai.
Watashi ga sochira ni yuku toki made, seisho o roudoku suru koto to, susume o suru koto to, oshieru koto to ni kokoro o mochii nasai.
Chourou no anshu o uketa toki, yogen ni yotte anata ni ataerarete uchi ni motte iru megumi no tamamono o, keishi shite wa naranai.
Subete no koto ni anata no shinpo ga arawareru tame, korera no koto o jikkou shi, sore o hagemi nasai.
Jibun no koto to oshie no koto to ni ki o tsuke, sorera o tsune ni tsutome nasai. Sou sureba, anata wa, jibun jishin to anata no oshie o kiku monotachi to o, sukuu koto ni naru.
Roujin o togamete wa ikenai. Mushiro chichioya ni taisuru you ni, hanashite age nasai. Wakai otoko ni wa kyoudai ni taisuru you ni,
Toshi totta onna ni wa hahaoya ni taisuru you ni, wakai onna ni wa, shin ni junketsu na omoi o motte, shimai ni taisuru you ni, kankoku shi nasai.
Yamome ni tsuite wa, shin ni tayori no nai yamometachi o, yoku shite age nasai.
Yamome ni ko ka mago ka ga aru baai ni wa, korera no mono ni, mazu jibun no ie de kouyou o tsukushi, oya no on ni mukuiru koto o manabaserubekide aru. Sore ga, kami no mikokoro ni kanau koto na no de aru.
Shin ni tayori no nai, hitorigurashi no yamome wa, nozomi o kami ni oite, nichiya, taezu negai to inori to ni senshin suruga,
Kore ni hanshite, midara na seikatsu o shite iru yamome wa, ikeru shikabane ni suginai.
Korera no koto o meijite, kanojotachi o hinan no nai mono to shi nasai.
Moshi aru hito ga, sono shinzoku o, koto ni jibun no kazoku o kaeriminai baai ni wa, sono shinkou o suteta koto ni naru no de atte, fushinja ijou ni warui.
Yamome to shite touroku sarubeki mono wa, rokujuusai ika no mono de wa nakute, hitori no otto no tsuma de atta mono,
Mata shijo o yoku youiku shi, tabibito o motenashi, seito no ashi o arai, komatte iru hito o tasuke, shuju no zenkou ni tsutomeru nado, sono yoi waza de hiroku mitomerarete iru mono de nakereba naranai.
Wakai yamome wa jogai subekide aru. Kanojotachi ga Kirisuto ni somuite kimama ni naruto, kekkon o shitagaru you ni nari,
Hajime no chikai o mushi shita to iu hinan o ukeneba naranaikara de aru.
Sono ue, kanojotachi wa namakete ite, ieie o asobiaruku koto o oboe, namakeru bakari ka, mudagoto o shabette, itazura ni ugokimawari, kuchi ni shite wa naranai koto o iu.
Sou iu wake dakara, wakai yamome wa kekkon shite ko o umi, ie o osame, soshite, hantaisha ni soshirareru suki o tsukuranai you ni shite hoshii.
Kanojotachi no uchi ni wa, Satan no ato o otte michi o fumihazushita mono mo aru.
Onna no shinja ga ie ni yamome o motte iru baai ni wa, jibun de sono yamome no sewa o shite age nasai. Kyoukai no yakkai ni natte wa ikenai. Kyoukai wa, shin ni tayori no nai yamome no sewa o shinakereba naranai.
Yoi shidou o shite iru chourou, tokuni senkyou to oshie to no tame ni roushite iru chourou wa, ni bai no sonkei o ukeru ni fusawashii mono de aru.
Seisho wa, "Kokumotsu o konashite iru ushi ni, kutsuko o kakete wa naranai" mata "Hatarakibito ga sono houshuu o ukeru no wa touzen de aru" to itte iru.
Chourou ni taisuru soshou wa, futari ka sannin no shounin ga nai baai ni wa, juri shite wa naranai.
Tsumi o okashita mono ni taishite wa, hoka no hitobito mo osore o idaku ni itaru tame ni, subete no hito no mae de sono tsumi o togamubekide aru.
Watashi wa, kami to Kirisuto Iesu to erabareta mitsukai tachi to no mae de, ogosoka ni anata ni meijiru. Korera no koto o henken nashi ni mamori, nanigoto ni tsuite mo, fukouhei na shikata o shite wa naranai.
Karugarushiku hito ni te o oite wa naranai. Mata, hoka no hito no tsumi ni kuwawatte wa ikenai. Jibun o kiyoku mamori nasai.
(kore kara wa, mizu bakari o nomanaide, i no tame, mata, tabitabi no itami o yawarageru tame ni, shouryou no budoushu o mochii nasai.)
Aru hito no tsumi wa meihaku de atte, sugu saiban ni kakerareruga, hoka no hito no tsumi wa, ato ni natte wakatte kuru.
Sore to onajiku, yoi waza mo sugu akiraka ni nari, sou naranai baai de mo, kakurete iru koto wa ari enai.
Kubiki no shita ni aru dorei wa subete, jibun no shujin o, shin ni sonkei subeki mono to shite aogubekide aru. Sore wa, kami no mina to oshie to ga, so shiri o ukenai tame de aru.
Shinja de aru shujin o motte iru monotachi wa, sono shujin ga kyoudai de aru to iu no de keishi shite wa naranai. Mushiro, masumasu hagende tsukaerubekide aru. Sono eki o ukeru shujin wa, shinja de ari aisarete iru hito dakara de aru. Anata wa, korera no koto o oshie katsu susume nasai.
Moshi chigatta koto o oshiete, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no kenzen na kotoba, narabi ni shinjin ni kanau oshie ni doui shinai you na mono ga areba,
Kare wa kouman de atte, nani mo shirazu, tada rongi to kotoba no arasoi to ni yamaimitsuite iru mono de aru. Soko kara, netami, arasoi, soshiri, saigi no kokoro ga shouji,
Mata chisei ga kusatte, shinri ni somuki, shinjin o ritoku to kokoroeru monodomo no aida ni, hateshi no nai igamiai ga okoru no de aru.
Shikashi, shinjin ga atte taru koto o shiru no wa, ookina ritoku de aru.
Watashitachi wa, nani hitotsu motanaide konoyo ni kita. Mata, nani hitotsu motanaide konoyo o satte iku.
Tada ishoku ga areba, sore de tareri to subekide aru.
Tomu koto o negaimotomeru mono wa, yuuwaku to, wana to ni ochiiri, mata, hito o horobi to hakai to ni shizumaseru, mufunbetsu na osoroshii samazama no jouyoku ni ochiiru no de aru.
Kinsen o aisuru koto wa, subete no aku no ne de aru. Aru hitobito wa yokubatte kinsen o motometa tame, shinkou kara mayoidete, ooku no kutsuu o motte jibun jishin o sashi tooshita.
Shikashi, kami no hito yo. Anata wa korera no koto o sake nasai. Soshite, gi to shinjin to shinkou to ai to nintai to nyuuwa to o oimotome nasai.
Shinkou no tatakai o rippa ni tatakai nuite, eien no inochi o kakutoku shi nasai. Anata wa, sono tame ni mesare, ooku no shounin no mae de, rippa na akashi o shita no de aru.
Watashi wa subete no mono o ikashite kudasaru kami no mimae to, mata Ponteo Pirato no menzen de rippa na akashi o nasatta Kirisuto Iesu no mimae de, anata ni meijiru.
Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no shutsugen made, sono imashime o kegasu koto ga naku, mata, sore o hinan no nai you ni mamori nasai.
Toki ga kureba, shukufuku ni michita, tada hitori no chikara aru kata, moromoro no ou no ou, moromoro no Shu no Shu ga, Kirisuto o shutsugen sasete kudasarude arou.
Kami wa tada hitori fushi o tamochi, chikazukigatai hikari no naka ni sumi, ningen no naka de dare mo mita mono ga naku, miru koto mo dekinai kata de aru. Homare to eien no shihai to ga, kami ni aru you ni, amen.
Konoyo de tonde iru monotachi ni, meiji nasai. Kouman ni narazu, tayori ni naranai tomi ni nozomi o okazu, mushiro, watashitachi ni subete no mono o yutaka ni sonaete tanoshimasete kudasaru kami ni, nozomi o oku you ni,
Mata, yoi okonai o shi, yoi waza ni tomimi, oshiminaku hodokoshi, hito ni wakeataeru koto o yorokobi,
Kou shite, shin no inochi o eru tame ni, mirai ni sonaete yoi dodai o jibun no tame ni kizukiageru you ni, meiji nasai.
Temote yo. Anata ni yudanerarete iru koto o mamori nasai. Soshite, zokuaku na mudahanashi to, itsuwari no "Chishiki" ni yoru hantai ron to o sake nasai.
Aru hitobito wa sore ni netchuu shite, shinkou kara sorete shimatta no de aru. Megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kami no mimune ni yori, Kirisuto Iesu ni aru inochi no yakusoku ni yotte taterareta Kirisuto Iesu no shito Pauro kara,
Aisuru ko Temote e. Chichi naru kami to watashitachi no Shu Kirisuto Iesu kara, megumi to awaremi to heian to ga, anata ni aru you ni.
Watashi wa, nichiya, inori no naka de, taezu anata no koto o omoidashite wa, kiyoi ryoushin o motte senzo irai tsukaete iru kami ni kansha shite iru.
Watashi wa, anata no namida o oboete ori, anata ni atte yorokobi de mitasaretai to, setsuni negatte iru.
Mata, anata ga idaite iru itsuwari no nai shinkou o omoiokoshite iru. Kono shinkou wa, mazu anata no sobo Roisu to anata no haha Yunike to ni yadotta mono de attaga, ima anata ni mo yadotte iruto, watashi wa kakushin shite iru.
Kou iu wake de, anata ni chuui shitai. Watashi no anshu ni yotte uchi ni itadaita kami no tamamono o, futatabi moetatase nasai.
To iu no wa, kami ga watashitachi ni kudasatta no wa, okusuru rei de wa naku, chikara to ai to tsutsushimi to no rei na no de aru.
Dakara, anata wa, watashitachi no Shu no akashi o suru koto ya, watashi ga Shu no shuujin de aru koto o, kesshite hazukashiku omotte wa naranai. Mushiro, kami no chikara ni sasaerarete, fukuin no tame ni, watashi to kurushimi o tomo ni shite hoshii.
Kami wa watashitachi o sukui, sei naru maneki o motte meshite kudasatta no de aruga, sore wa, watashitachi no waza ni yoru no de wa naku, kami gojishin no keikaku ni motozuki, mata, eien no mukashi ni Kirisuto Iesu ni atte watashitachi ni tamawatte ita megumi,
Soshite ima ya, watashitachi no sukuinushi Kirisuto Iesu no shutsugen ni yotte akiraka ni sareta megumi ni yoru no de aru. Kirisuto wa shi o horoboshi, fukuin ni yotte inochi to fushi to o akiraka ni shimesareta no de aru.
Watashi wa, kono fukuin no tame ni taterarete, sono senkyousha, shito, kyoushi ni natta.
Sono tame ni mata, watashi wa kono you na kurushimi o ukete iruga, sore o haji to shinai. Naze nara, watashi wa jibun no shinjite kita kata o shitte ori, mata sono kata wa, watashi ni yudanerarete iru mono o, kano hi ni itaru made mamotte kudasaru koto ga dekiruto, kakushin shite irukara de aru.
Anata wa, Kirisuto Iesu ni taisuru shinkou to ai to o motte, watashi kara kiita kenzen na kotoba o mohan ni shi nasai.
Soshite, anata ni yudanerarete iru tattoi mono o, watashitachi no uchi ni yadotte iru seirei ni yotte mamori nasai.
Anata no shitte iru you ni, Ajiya ni iru monotachi wa, mina watashi kara hanarete itta. Sono naka ni wa, Fugero to Herumogene mo iru.
Dou ka, Shu ga, Oneshiporo no ie ni awaremi o tarete kudasaru you ni. Kare wa tabitabi, watashi o nagusamete kure, mata watashi no kusari o haji to mo omowanaide,
Rooma ni tsuita toki ni wa, nesshin ni watashi o sagashimawatta sue, tazunedashite kureta no de aru.
Dou ka, Shu ga kano hi ni, awaremi o kare ni tamawaru you ni. - - kare ga Epeso de, dore hodo watashi ni tsukaete kureta ka wa, dare yori mo anata ga yoku shitte iru.
Soko de, watashi no ko yo. Anata wa Kirisuto Iesu ni aru megumi ni yotte, tsuyoku nari nasai.
Soshite, anata ga ooku no shounin no mae de watashi kara kiita koto o, sarani hoka no monotachi ni mo oshieru koto no dekiru you na chuujitsu na hitobito ni, yudane nasai.
Kirisuto Iesu no yoi heisotsu to shite, watashi to kurushimi o tomo ni shite hoshii.
Heieki ni fukushite iru mono wa, nichijou seikatsu no koto ni wazurawasarete wa inai. Tada, hei o tsunotta shireikan o yorokobaseyou to tsutomeru.
Mata, kyougi o suru ni shite mo, kitei ni shitagatte kyougi o shinakereba, eikan wa erarenai.
Rouku o suru noufu ga, dare yori mo saki ni, seisanbutsu no bunpai ni azukarubekide aru.
Watashi no iu koto o, yoku kangaete mi nasai. Shu wa, sore o juubun ni rikai suru chikara o anata ni tamawarude arou.
Dabide no shison to shite umare, shinin no uchi kara yomigaetta Iesu Kirisuto o, itsu mo omotte i nasai. Kore ga watashi no fukuin de aru.
Kono fukuin no tame ni, watashi wa warumono no you ni kurushimerare, tsuini kusari ni tsunagareru ni itatta. Shikashi, kami no kotoba wa tsunagarete wa inai.
Sore dakara, watashi wa erabareta hitotachi no tame ni, issai no koto o taeshinobu no de aru. Sore wa, karera mo Kirisuto Iesu ni yoru sukui o uke, mata, sore to tomo ni eien no eikou o ukeru tame de aru.
Tsugi no kotoba wa kakujitsu de aru. "Moshi watashitachi ga, kare to tomo ni shindanara, mata kare to tomo ni ikirude arou.
Moshi taeshinobunara, kare to tomo ni shihaisha to narude arou. Moshi kare o inamunara, kare mo watashitachi o inamude arou.
Tatoi, watashitachi wa fushinjitsu de atte mo, kare wa tsune ni shinjitsu de aru. Kare wa jibun o itsuwaru koto ga, dekinai no de aru".
Anata wa, korera no koto o karera ni omoidasasete, nan no eki mo naku, kiite iru hitobito o hametsu ni otoshiireru dake de aru kotoba no arasoi o shinai you ni, kami no mimae de ogosoka ni meiji nasai.
Anata wa shinri no kotoba o tadashiku oshie, hajiru tokoro no nai rentatsu shita hatarakibito ni natte, kami ni jibun o sasageru you ni tsutome hagemi nasai.
Zokuaku na mudahanashi o sake nasai. Sore ni yotte hitobito wa, masumasu fushinjin ni ochite iki,
Karera no kotoba wa, gan no you ni kusare hirogarude arou. Sono naka ni wa Himenao to Pireto to ga iru.
Karera wa shinri kara hazure, fukkatsu wa sudeni sunde shimatta to ii, soshite, aru hitobito no shinkou o kutsugaeshite iru.
Shikashi, kami no yuruganai dodai wa suerarete ite, sore ni tsugi no ku ga shouin to shite, shirusarete iru. "Shu wa jibun no monotachi o shiru". Mata "Shu no na o yobu mono wa, subete fugi kara hanare yo".
Ookina ie ni wa, kin ya gin no utsuwa bakari de wa naku, ki ya tsuchi no utsuwa mo ari, soshite, aru mono wa tattoi koto ni mochiirare, aru mono wa iyashii koto ni mochiirareru.
Moshi hito ga iyashii mono o torisatte jibun o kiyomerunara, kare wa tattoi kiyomerareta utsuwa to natte, shujin ni yakudatsu mono to nari, subete no yoi waza ni aidaniau you ni naru.
Soko de, anata wa wakai toki no jouyoku o sake nasai. Soshite, kiyoi kokoro o motte Shu o yobimotomeru hitobito to tomo ni, gi to shinkou to ai to heiwa to o oimotome nasai.
Oroka de muchi na rongi o yame nasai. Sore wa, anata ga shitte iru toori, tada arasoi ni owaru dake de aru.
Shu no shimobe taru mono wa arasotte wa naranai. Dare ni taishite mo shinsetsu de atte, yoku oshie, yoku shinobi,
Hantai suru mono o nyuuwa na kokoro de oshiemichibikubekide aru. Osoraku kami wa, karera ni kuiaratame no kokoro o ataete, shinri o shirase,
Ichi do wa akuma ni toraerarete sono hossuru mama ni natte ite mo, mezamete kare no wana kara nogaresasete kudasarude arou.
Shikashi, kono koto wa shitte okaneba naranai. Owari no toki ni wa, kunan no jidai ga kuru.
Sono toki, hitobito wa jibun o aisuru mono, kane o aisuru mono, taigensougo suru mono, kouman na mono, kami o soshiru mono, oya ni sakarau mono, on o shiranu mono, shinsei o kegasu mono,
Mujou na mono, yuuwa shinai mono, soshiru mono, musessei na mono, sobou na mono, zen o konomanai mono,
Uragirimono, ranboumono, kougen o suru mono, kami yori mo kairaku o aisuru mono,
Shinjin bukai yousu o shinagara sono jitsu o suteru mono to narude arou. Kou shita hitobito o sake nasai.
Karera no naka ni wa, hito no ie ni mogurikomi, soshite, samazama no yoku ni kokoro o ubawarete, ooku no tsumi o tsumikasanete iru oroka na onnadomo o, toriko ni shite iru mono ga aru.
Kanojotachi wa, tsune ni manande wa iruga, itsu ni natte mo shinri no chishiki ni tassuru koto ga dekinai.
Choudo, Yanne to Yanbure to ga Moose ni sakaratta you ni, kou shita hitobito mo shinri ni sakarau no de aru. Karera wa chisei no kusatta, shinkou no shikkakusha de aru.
Shikashi, karera wa sono mama susunde ikeru hazu ga nai. Karera no orokasa wa, ano futari no baai to onaji you ni, ooku no hito ni shirete kurude arou.
Shikashi anata wa, watashi no oshie, ayumi, kokorozashi, shinkou, kan'you, ai, nintai,
Sore kara, watashi ga Anteoke, Ikoniomu, Rusutera de uketa kazukazu no hakugai, kunan ni, yoku mo tsuzuite kite kureta. Sono hidoi hakugai ni watashi wa taete kitaga, Shu wa sorera issai no koto kara, sukuidashite kudasatta no de aru.
Ittai, Kirisuto Iesu ni atte shinjin bukaku ikiyou to suru mono wa, mina, hakugai o ukeru.
Akunin to sagishi to wa hito o madowashi hito ni madowasarete, aku kara aku e to ochite iku.
Shikashi, anata wa, jibun ga manande kakushin shite iru tokoro ni, itsu mo todomatte i nasai. Anata wa, sore o dare kara mananda ka shitte ori,
Mata osanai toki kara, seisho ni shitashimi, sore ga, Kirisuto Iesu ni taisuru shinkou ni yotte sukui ni itaru chie o, anata ni atae uru shomotsu de aru koto o shitte iru.
Seisho wa, subete kami no reikan o ukete kakareta mono de atte, hito o oshie, imashime, tadashiku shi, gi ni michibiku no ni yuueki de aru.
Sore ni yotte, kami no hito ga, arayuru yoi waza ni taishite juubun na junbi ga dekite, kanzen ni totonoerareta mono ni naru no de aru.
Kami no mimae to, ikite iru mono to shinda mono to o sabakubeki Kirisuto Iesu no mimae de, Kirisuto no shutsugen to sono mikuni to o omoi, ogosoka ni meijiru.
Mikotoba o nobetsutae nasai. Toki ga yokute mo warukute mo, sore o hagemi, akumade mo kan'you na kokoro de yoku oshiete, seme, imashime, susume nasai.
Hitobito ga kenzen na oshie ni taerarenaku nari, mimizawari no yoi hanashi o shite moraou to shite, jibun katte na konomi ni makasete kyoushitachi o yoseatsume,
Soshite, shinri kara wa mimi o somukete, tsukuribanashi no hou ni sorete iku toki ga kurude arou.
Shikashi, anata wa, nanigoto ni mo tsutsushimi, kunan o shinobi, dendousha no waza o nashi, jibun no tsutome o mattou shi nasai.
Watashi wa, sudeni jishin o gisei to shite sasagete iru. Watashi ga yo o sarubeki toki wa kita.
Watashi wa tatakai o rippa ni tatakai nuki, hashirubeki koutei o hashiri tsukushi, shinkou o mamori tooshita.
Ima ya, gi no kanmuri ga watashi o matte iru bakari de aru. Kano hi ni wa, kouhei na shinpansha de aru Shu ga, sore o sazukete kudasarude arou. Watashi bakari de wa naku, Shu no shutsugen o kokoro kara machinozonde ita subete no hito ni mo sazukete kudasarude arou.
Watashi no tokoro ni, isoide hayaku kite hoshii.
Demasu wa konoyo o aishi, watashi o sutete Tesaronike ni itte shimai, Kuresukensu wa Garateya ni, Tetosu wa Darumateya ni itta.
Tada Ruka dake ga, watashi no moto ni iru. Maruko o tsurete, issho ni ki nasai. Kare wa watashi no tsutome no tame ni yaku ni tatsukara.
Watashi wa Tekiko o Epeso ni tsukawashita.
Anata ga kuru toki ni, Toroasu no Karupo no tokoro ni nokoshite oita uwagi o motte kite hoshii. Mata shomotsu mo, tokuni, youhishi no o motte kite moraitai.
Douzaikunin no Arekisanderu ga, watashi o ooini kurushimeta. Shu wa sono shiwaza ni taishite, kare ni mukui nasarudarou.
Anata mo, kare o keikai shi nasai. Kare wa, watashitachi no iu koto ni tsuyoku hantai shita no dakara.
Watashi no daiichi kai no benmei no sai ni wa, watashi ni mikata o suru mono wa hitori mo naku, mina watashi o sutete itta. Dou ka, karera ga, sono tame ni semerareru koto ga nai you ni.
Shikashi, watashi ga mikotoba o amasu tokoro naku nobetsutaete, subete no ihoujin ni kikaseru you ni, Shu wa watashi o tasuke, chikarazukete kudasatta. Soshite, watashi wa, shishi no kuchi kara sukuidasareta no de aru.
Shu wa watashi o, subete no aku no waza kara tasukedashi, ten ni aru mikuni ni sukui irete kudasarude arou. Eikou ga eien kara eien ni watatte Shu ni aru you ni, amen.
Purisuka to Akura to ni, mata Oneshiporo no ie ni, yoroshiku tsutaete hoshii.
Erasuto wa Korinto ni todomatte ori, Toropimo wa byouki na no de, Mireto ni nokoshite kita.
Fuyu ni naru mae ni, isoide kite hoshii. Yuburo, Pudesu, Rinosu, Kuraudeya narabi ni subete no kyoudaitachi kara, anata ni yoroshiku.
Shu ga, anata no rei to tomo ni imasu you ni. Megumi ga, anata gata to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kami no shimobe, Iesu Kirisuto no shito Pauro kara - - watashi ga shito to sareta no wa, kami ni erabareta monotachi no shinkou o tsuyome, mata, shinjin ni kanau shinri no chishiki o karera ni e saseru tame de ari,
Itsuwari no nai kami ga eien no mukashi ni yakusoku sareta eien no inochi no nozomi ni motozuku no de aru.
Kami wa, sadamerareta toki ni oyonde, mikotoba o senkyou ni yotte akiraka ni saretaga, watashi wa, watashitachi no sukuinushi naru kami no ninmei ni yotte, kono senkyou o yudanerareta no de aru - -
Shinkou o onaji u suru watashi no shinjitsu no ko Tetosu e. Chichi naru kami to watashitachi no sukuinushi Kirisuto Iesu kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata ni aru you ni.
Anata o Kurete ni oite kita no wa, watashi ga anata ni meijite oita you ni, soko ni shinokoshite aru koto o seiri shite morai, mata, machimachi ni chourou o tatete morau tame ni hoka naranai.
Chourou wa, semerareru ten ga naku, hitori no tsuma no otto de atte, sono kotachi mo fuhinkou no uwasa o taterarezu, oyafukou o shinai shinja de nakute wa naranai.
Kantoku taru mono wa, kami ni tsukaeru mono to shite, semerareru ten ga naku, wagamama de naku, karugarushiku ikarazu, sake o konomazu, ranbou de naku, ri o musaborazu,
Kaette, tabibito o motenashi, zen o aishi, tsutsushimifukaku, tadashiku, shinkou bukaku, jisei suru mono de ari,
Oshie ni kanatta shinrai subeki kotoba o mamoru hito de nakereba naranai. Sore wa, kare ga kenzen na oshie ni yotte hito o satoshi, mata, hantaisha no ayamari o shiteki suru koto ga dekiru tame de aru.
Jitsu wa, hou ni fukusanai mono, kuuron ni hashiru mono, hito no kokoro o madowasu mono ga ooku ori, tokuni, katsurei no aru mono no naka ni ooi.
Karera no kuchi o fuu zubekide aru. Karera wa hazubeki ri no tame ni, oshiete wa naranai koto o oshiete, kazukazu no katei o hakai shite shimatte iru.
Kuretebito no uchi no aru yogensha ga "Kuretebito wa, itsu mo usotsuki, tachi no warui kemono, namakemono no kuishinbou" to itte iruga,
Kono hinan wa atatte iru. Dakara, karera o kibishiku semete, sono shinkou o kenzen na mono ni shi,
Yudayajin no tsukuribanashi ya, shinri kara sorete itta hitobito no sadame nado ni, ki o torareru koto ga nai you ni sase nasai.
Kiyoi hito ni wa, subete no mono ga kiyoi. Shikashi, kegarete iru fushinkou na hito ni wa, kiyoi mono wa hitotsu mo naku, sono chisei mo ryoushin mo kegarete shimatte iru.
Karera wa kami o shitte iruto, kuchi de wa iuga, okonai de wa sore o hitei shite iru. Karera wa imawashii mono, mata fujuujun na mono de atte, issai no yoi waza ni kanshite wa, shikkakusha de aru.
Shikashi, anata wa, kenzen na oshie ni kanau koto o katari nasai.
Roujintachi ni wa mizukara o seishi, kingen de, tsutsushimifukaku shi, mata, shinkou to ai to nintai to ni oite kenzen de aru you ni susume,
Toshioita onnatachi ni mo, onaji you ni, tachi i furumai o uyauyashiku shi, hito o soshit tari taishu no dorei ni nat tari sezu, yoi koto o oshieru mono to naru you ni, susume nasai.
Sou sureba, kanojotachi wa, wakai onnatachi ni, otto o aishi, kodomo o aishi,
Tsutsushimifukaku, junketsu de, kaji ni tsutome, zenryou de, jibun no otto ni juujun de aru you ni oshieru koto ni nari, shitagatte, kami no kotoba ga so shiri o ukenai you ni narude arou.
Wakai otoko ni mo, onajiku, banji ni tsuke tsutsushimibukaku aru you ni, susume nasai.
Anata jishin o yoi waza no mohan to shite shimeshi, hito o oshieru baai ni wa, seiren to kingen to o motte shi,
Hinan no nai kenzen na kotoba o mochii nasai. Sou sureba, hantaisha mo, watashitachi ni tsuite nan no akkou mo ienaku nari, mizukara hajiirude arou.
Dorei ni wa, banji ni tsuke sono shujin ni fukujuu shite, yorokobareru you ni nari, hankou o sezu,
Nusumi o sezu, doko made mo kokoro o kometa shinjitsu o shimesu you ni to, susume nasai. Sou sureba, karera wa banji ni tsuke, watashitachi no sukuinushi naru kami no oshie o kazaru koto ni narou.
Subete no hito o sukuu kami no megumi ga arawareta.
Soshite, watashitachi o michibiki, fushinjin to konoyo no jouyoku to o sutete, tsutsushimibukaku, tadashiku, shinjin bukaku konoyo de seikatsu shi,
Shukufuku ni michita nozomi, sunawachi, ooinaru kami, watashitachi no sukuinushi Kirisuto Iesu no eikou no shutsugen o machinozomu you ni to, oshiete iru.
Kono Kirisuto ga, watashitachi no tame ni gojishin o sasagerareta no wa, watashitachi o subete no fuhou kara aganai dashite, yoi waza ni nesshin na erabi no tami o, gojishin no mono to shite seibetsu suru tame ni hoka naranai.
Anata wa, ken'i o motte korera no koto o katari, susume, mata seme nasai. Dare ni mo karonjirarete wa naranai.
Anata wa karera ni susumete, shihaisha, ken'i aru mono ni fukushi, kore ni shitagai, itsu de mo yoi waza o suru youi ga ari,
Dare o mo soshirazu, arasowazu, kan'you de atte, subete no hito ni taishite doko made mo nyuuwa na taido o shimesubeki koto o, omoidasase nasai.
Watashitachi mo izen ni wa, mufunbetsu de, fujuujun na, mayotte ita mono de atte, samazama no jouyoku to kairaku to no dorei ni nari, akui to netami to de hi o sugoshi, hito ni nikumare, tagai ni nikumiatte ita.
Tokoro ga, watashitachi no sukuinushi naru kami no jihi to hakuai to ga arawareta toki,
Watashitachi no okonatta gi no waza ni yotte de wa naku, tada kami no awaremi ni yotte, saisei no arai o uke, seirei ni yori arata ni sarete, watashitachi wa sukuwareta no de aru.
Kono seirei wa, watashitachi no sukuinushi Iesu Kirisuto o tooshite, watashitachi no ue ni yutaka ni sosogareta.
Kore wa, watashitachi ga, Kirisuto no megumi ni yotte gi to sare, eien no inochi o nozomu koto ni yotte, mikuni o tsugu mono to naru tame de aru.
Kono kotoba wa kakujitsu de aru. Watashi wa, anata ga sorera no koto o shuchou suru no o negatte iru. Sore wa, kami o shinjite iru monotachi ga, tsutomete yoi waza o hagemu koto o kokorogakeru you ni naru tame de aru. Kore wa yoi koto de atte, hitobito no eki to naru.
Shikashi, oroka na giron to, keizu to, arasoi to, rippou ni tsuite no ronsou to o, sake nasai. Sorera wa mueki katsu kuukyo na koto de aru.
Itansha wa, ichi, ni do, kunkai o kuwaeta ue de shirizoke nasai.
Tashika ni, kou iu hitotachi wa, jadou ni ochiiri, mizukara aku to shiritsutsu mo, tsumi o okashite irukara de aru.
Watashi ga Arutemasu ka Tekiko ka o anata no tokoro ni okuttanara, isoide Nikopori ni iru watashi no tokoro ni ki nasai. Watashi wa, soko de fuyu o sugosu koto ni shita.
Hougakusha Zenasu to, Aporo to o, isoide tabi ni tsukase, fujiyuu no nai you ni shite age nasai.
Watashitachi no nakama mo, sashisematta hitsuyou ni sonaete, tsutomete yoi waza o hagemi, mi o musubanu mono to naranai you ni, kokorogakerubekide aru.
Watashi to tomo ni iru ichidou no mono kara, anata ni yoroshiku. Watashitachi o aishite iru shintotachi ni, yoroshiku. Megumi ga, anata gata ichidou to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kirisuto Iesu no shuujin Pauro to kyoudai Temote kara, watashitachi no aisuru dourousha Piremon,
Shimai Apiya, watashitachi no sen'yuu Arukipo, narabi ni, anata no ie ni aru kyoukai e.
Watashitachi no chichi naru kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto kara, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni aru you ni.
Watashi wa, inori no toki ni anata o oboete, itsu mo watashi no kami ni kansha shite iru.
Sore wa, Shu Iesu ni taishi, mata, subete no seito ni taisuru anata no ai to shinkou to ni tsuite, kiite irukara de aru.
Dou ka, anata no shinkou no majiwari ga tsuyomerarete, watashitachi no aida de Kirisuto no tame ni nasarete iru subete no yoi koto ga, shirarete kuru you ni natte hoshii.
Kyoudai yo. Watashi wa, anata no ai ni yotte ooku no yorokobi to nagusame to o ataerareta. Seitotachi no kokoro ga, anata ni yotte chikarazukeraretakara de aru.
Kou iu wake de, watashi wa, Kirisuto ni atte anata no nasubeki koto o, kiwamete sotchoku ni shiji shite mo yoi to omouga,
Mushiro, ai no yue ni onegai suru. Sudeni rounen ni nari, ima mata Kirisuto Iesu no shuujin to natte iru kono Pauro ga,
Toraware no mi de unda watashi no kodomo Oneshimo ni tsuite, anata ni onegai suru.
Kare wa izen wa, anata ni totte mueki na mono de attaga, ima wa, anata ni mo, watashi ni mo, yuueki na mono ni natta.
Kare o anata no moto ni okurikaesu. Kare wa watashi no kokoro de aru.
Watashi wa kare o mijika ni hikitomete oite, watashi ga fukuin no tame ni torawarete iru aida, anata ni kawatte tsukaete moraitakatta no de aru.
Shikashi, watashi wa, anata no shoudaku nashi ni wa nani mo shitaku nai. Anata ga kyousei sarete yoi okonai o suru no de wa naku, jihatsuteki ni suru koto o negatte iru.
Kare ga shibaraku no aida anata kara hanarete ita no wa, anata ga kare o itsu made mo tomete oku tame de atta ka mo shirenai.
Shikamo, mohaya dorei to shite de wa naku, dorei ijou no mono, aisuru kyoudai to shite de aru. Toriwake, watashi ni totte sou de aruga, mashite anata ni totte wa, niku ni oite mo, Shu ni atte mo, sore ijou de arou.
Soko de, moshi watashi o anata no shinkou no tomo to omotte kurerunara, watashi douyou ni kare o ukeirete hoshii.
Moshi, kare ga anata ni nani ka futsugou na koto o shita ka, aruiha, nani ka fusai ga areba, sore o watashi no kari ni shite oite hoshii.
Kono Pauro ga tezukara shirusu, watashi ga sore o hensai suru. Kono sai, anata ga, anata jishin o watashi ni oute iru koto ni tsuite wa, nani mo iumai.
Kyoudai yo. Watashi wa anata kara, Shu ni atte nani ka eki o etai mono de aru. Watashi no kokoro o, Shu ni atte chikarazukete moraitai.
Watashi wa anata no juujun o kataku shinjite, kono tegami o kaku. Anata wa, tashika ni watashi ga iu ijou no koto o shite kurerudarou.
Tsuide ni onegai suruga, watashi no tame ni yado o youi shite oite hoshii. Anata gata no inori ni yotte, anata gata no tokoro ni ikasete moraeru you ni nozonde iru no dakara.
Kirisuto Iesu ni atte, watashi to tomo ni toraware no mi ni natte iru Epafurasu kara, anata ni yoroshiku.
Watashi no dourousha tachi, Maruko, Arisutaruko, Demasu, Ruka kara mo, yoroshiku.
Shu Iesu Kirisuto no megumi ga, anata gata no rei to tomo ni aru you ni.
Kami wa, mukashi wa, yogensha tachi ni yori, iroiro na toki ni, iroiro na houhou de, senzotachi ni katararetaga,
Kono owari no toki ni wa, miko ni yotte, watashitachi ni katarareta no de aru. Kami wa miko o banbutsu no souzokusha to sadame, mata, miko ni yotte, moromoro no sekai o tsukurareta.
Miko wa kami no eikou no kagayaki de ari, kami no honshitsu no shin no sugata de atte, sono chikara aru kotoba o motte banbutsu o tamotte orareru. Soshite tsumi no kiyome no waza o nashi oete kara, ito takaki tokoro ni imasu tainousha no migi ni, za ni tsukareta no de aru.
Miko wa, sono uketsugareta na ga mitsukai tachi no na ni masatte iru no de, karera yori mo sugureta mono to narareta.
Ittai, kami wa mitsukai tachi no dare ni taishite, "Anata koso wa, watashi no ko. Kyou, watashi wa anata o unda" to ii, sarani mata, "Watashi wa kare no chichi to nari, kare wa watashi no ko to narude arou" to iwareta koto ga aru ka.
Sarani mata, kami wa, sono choushi o sekai ni michibikiireru ni atatte, "Kami no mitsukai tachi wa kotogotoku, kare o haisubekide aru" to iwareta.
Mata, mitsukai tachi ni tsuite wa, "Kami wa, mitsukai tachi o kaze to shi, gojibun ni tsukaeru monotachi o honoo to sareru" to iwarete iruga,
Miko ni tsuite wa, "Kami yo, anata no miza wa, yoyo kagirinaku tsuzuki, anata no shihai no tsue wa, kouhei no tsue de aru.
Anata wa gi o aishi, fuhou o nikumareta. Sore yue ni, kami, anata no kami wa, yorokobi no abura o, anata no tomo ni sosogu yori mo ooku, anata ni sosogareta" to ii,
Sarani, "Shu yo, anata wa hajime ni, chi no motoi o o sue ni natta. Moromoro no ten mo, mite no waza de aru.
Korera no mono wa horobite shimauga, anata wa, itsu made mo imasu kata de aru. Subete no mono wa koromo no you ni furubi,
Sorera o anata wa, gaitou no you ni makareru. Korera no mono wa, koromo no you ni kawaruga, anata wa, itsu mo kawaru koto ga naku, anata no yowai wa, tsukiru koto ga nai" to mo iwarete iru.
Kami wa, mitsukai tachi no dare ni taishite, "Anata no teki o, anata no ashidai to suru toki made wa, watashi no migi ni zashite i nasai" to iwareta koto ga aru ka.
Mitsukai tachi wa subete tsukaeru rei de atte, sukui o uketsugubeki hitobito ni houshi suru tame, tsukawasareta mono de wa nai ka.
Kou iu wake dakara, watashitachi wa kikasarete iru koto o, issou tsuyoku kokoro ni tomeneba naranai. Sou de naito, oshinagasarete shimau.
To iu no wa, mitsukai tachi o tooshite katarareta mikotoba ga kouryoku o mochi, arayuru zaika to fujuujun to ni taishite seitou na mukui ga kuwaerareta to sureba,
Watashitachi wa, konna ni tattoi sukui o naozari ni shite wa, dou shite mukui o nogareru koto ga dekiyou ka. Kono sukui wa, hajime Shu ni yotte katarareta mono de atte, kiita hitobito kara watashitachi ni akashi sare,
Sarani kami mo, shirushi to fushigi to samazama na chikara aru wazato ni yori, mata, mimune ni shitagai seirei o kakuji ni tamau koto ni yotte, akashi o sareta no de aru.
Ittai, kami wa, watashitachi ga koko de katatte iru kitarubeki sekai o, mitsukai tachi ni fukujuu saseru koto wa, nasaranakatta.
Seisho wa aru kasho de, kou akashi shite iru, "Ningen ga nanimono dakara, kore o mikokoro ni tomerareru no darou ka. Hito no ko ga nanimono dakara, kore o kaerimirareru no darou ka.
Anata wa, shibaraku no aida, kare o mitsukai tachi yori mo hikui mono to nashi, eikou to homare to o kanmuri to shite kare ni atae,
Banbutsu o sono ashi no shita ni fukujuu sasete kudasatta". "Banbutsu o kare ni fukujuu sasete kudasatta" to iu ijou, fukujuu shinai mono wa, nani hitotsu nokosarete inai hazu de aru. Shikashi, ima mo nao banbutsu ga kare ni fukujuu shite iru jijitsu o, watashitachi wa mite inai.
Tada, "Shibaraku no aida, mitsukai tachi yori mo hikui mono to sareta" Iesu ga, shi no kurushimi no yue ni, eikou to homare to o kanmuri to shite ataerareta no o miru. Sore wa, kare ga kami no megumi ni yotte, subete no hito no tame ni shi o ajiwawareru tame de atta.
Naze nara, banbutsu no kisubeki kata, banbutsu o tsukurareta kata ga, ooku no kora o eikou ni michibiku no ni, karera no sukui no kimi o, kunan o tooshite mattou sareta no wa, kare ni fusawashii koto de attakara de aru.
Jitsu ni, kiyomeru kata mo, kiyomerareru monotachi mo, mina hitori no kata kara dete iru. Sore yue ni Shu wa, karera o kyoudai to yobu koto o haji to sarenai.
Sunawachi, "Watashi wa, mina o watashi no kyoudaitachi ni tsugeshirase, kyoukai no naka de, anata o home utaou" to ii,
Mata, "Watashi wa, kare ni yori tanomu", mata, "Miyo, watashi to, kami ga watashi ni tamawatta kora to wa" to iwareta.
Kono you ni, kotachi wa chi to niku to ni tomo ni azukatte iru no de, Iesu mo mata douyou ni, sorera o sonaete orareru. Sore wa, shi no chikara o motsu mono, sunawachi akuma o, gojibun no shi ni yotte horoboshi,
Shi no kyoufu no tame ni is shougai, dorei to natte ita monotachi o, tokihanatsu tame de aru.
Tashika ni, kare wa tenshitachi o tasukeru koto wa shinaide, Aburahamu no shison o tasukerareta.
Soko de, Iesu wa, kami no mimae ni awaremi bukai chuujitsu na daisaishi to natte, tami no tsumi o aganau tame ni, arayuru ten ni oite kyoudaitachi to onaji you ni naraneba naranakatta.
Shu gojishin, shiren o ukete kurushimaretakara koso, shiren no naka ni aru monotachi o tasukeru koto ga dekiru no de aru.
Soko de, ten no meshi ni azukatte iru sei naru kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata wa, watashitachi ga kokuhaku suru shinkou no shisha mata daisaishi naru Iesu o, omoimirubekide aru.
Kare wa, Moose ga kami no ie no zentai ni taishite chuujitsu de atta you ni, jibun o tateta kata ni taishite chuujitsu de arareta.
Ooyoso, ie o tsukuru mono ga ie sono mono yori mo sarani tattobareru you ni, kare wa, Moose ijou ni, ooinaru kouei o ukeru ni fusawashii mono to sareta no de aru.
Ie wa subete, dare ka ni yotte tsukurareru mono de aruga, subete no mono o tsukurareta kata wa, kami de aru.
Sate, Moose wa, nochi ni katararubeki kotogara ni tsuite akashi o suru tame ni, tsukaeru mono to shite, kami no ie no zentai ni taishite chuujitsu de attaga,
Kirisuto wa miko to shite, kami no ie o osameru no ni chuujitsu de arareta no de aru. Moshi watashitachi ga, nozomi no kakushin to hokori to o saigo made shikkari to mochi tsuzukerunara, watashitachi wa kami no ie na no de aru.
Dakara, seirei ga itte iru you ni, "Kyou, anata gata ga mikoe o kiitanara,
Arano ni okeru shiren no hi ni, kami ni somuita toki no you ni, anata gata no kokoro o, katakuna ni shite wa ikenai.
Anata gata no senzotachi wa, soko de watashi o kokoromi tameshi,
Shikamo, yonjuu nen no aida watashi no waza o mita no de aru. Dakara, watashi wa sono jidai no hitobito ni taishite, ikidootte itta, karera no kokoro wa, itsu mo mayotte ori, karera wa, watashi no michi o mitomenakatta.
Soko de, watashi wa ikatte, karera o watashi no ansoku ni hairaseru koto wa shinai, to chikatta".
Kyoudaitachi yo. Ki o tsuke nasai. Anata gata no naka ni wa, aruiha, fushinkou na warui kokoro o idaite, ikeru kami kara hanaresaru mono ga aru ka mo shirenai.
Anata gata no naka ni, tsumi no madowashi ni ochiitte, kokoro o katakuna ni suru mono ga nai you ni, "Kyou" to iu uchi ni, hibi, tagai ni hagemashiai nasai.
Moshi saisho no kakushin o, saigo made shikkari to mochi tsuzukerunaraba, watashitachi wa Kirisuto ni azukaru mono to naru no de aru.
Sore ni tsuite, kou iwarete iru, "Kyou, mikoe o kiitanara, kami ni somuita toki no you ni, anata gata no kokoro o, katakuna ni shite wa ikenai".
Suruto, kiita no ni somuita no wa, dare de atta no ka. Moose ni hikiirarete, Ejiputo kara dete itta subete no hitobito de wa nakatta ka.
Mata, yonjuu nen no aida, kami ga ikidoorareta no wa dare ni taishite de atta ka. Tsumi o okashite, sono shi kabane o arano ni sarashita monotachi ni taishite de wa nakatta ka.
Mata, kami ga, watashi no ansoku ni, hairaseru koto wa shinai, to chikawareta no wa, dare ni mukatte de atta ka. Fujuujun na mono ni mukatte de wa nakatta ka.
Kou shite, karera ga hairu koto no dekinakatta no wa, fushinkou no yue de aru koto ga wakaru.
Sore dakara, kami no ansoku ni hairubeki yakusoku ga, mada sonzoku shite iru ni kakawarazu, man'ichi ni mo, hairi sokonau mono ga, anata gata no naka kara deru koto ga nai you ni, chuui shiyoude wa nai ka.
To iu no wa, karera to onajiku, watashitachi ni mo fukuin ga tsutaerarete iru no de aru. Shikashi, sono kiita mikotoba wa, karera ni wa mueki de atta. Sore ga, kiita monotachi ni, shinkou ni yotte musubitsukerarenakattakara de aru.
Tokoro ga, watashitachi shinjite iru mono wa, ansoku ni hairu koto ga dekiru. Sore wa, "Watashi ga ikatte, karera o watashi no ansoku ni, hairaseru koto wa shinaito, chikatta you ni" to iwarete iru toori de aru. Shikamo, miwaza wa yo no hajime ni, dekiagatte ita.
Sunawachi, seisho no aru kasho de, nanuka me no koto ni tsuite, "Kami wa, nanuka me ni subete no waza o yamete yasumareta" to iwarete ori,
Mata koko de, "Karera o watashi no ansoku ni, hairaseru koto wa shinai" to iwarete iru.
Soko de, sono ansoku ni hairu kikai ga, hitobito ni nao nokosarete iru no de ari, shikamo, hajime ni fukuin o tsutaerareta hitobito wa, fujuujun no yue ni, hairu koto o shinakatta no de arukara,
Kami wa, aratamete, aru hi o "Kyou" to shite sadame, nagaku toki ga tatte kara, saki ni in'you shita toori, "Kyou, mikoe o kiitanara, anata gata no kokoro o, katakuna ni shite wa ikenai" to Dabide o tooshite iwareta no de aru.
Moshi Yoshua ga karera o yasumasete ita to sureba, kami wa ato ni natte, hoka no hi no koto ni tsuite katarareta hazu wa nai.
Kou iu wake de, ansokunichi no yasumi ga, kami no tami no tame ni mada nokosarete iru no de aru.
Naze nara, kami no ansoku ni haitta mono wa, kamigami waza o yamete yasumareta you ni, jibun mo waza o yasundakara de aru.
Shitagatte, watashitachi wa, kono ansoku ni wa iru you ni doryoku shiyoude wa nai ka. Sou de naito, onaji you na fujuujun no akurei ni naratte, ochite yuku mono ga deru ka mo shirenai.
To iu no wa, kami no kotoba wa ikite ite, chikara ga ari, moroha no tsurugi yori mo surudokute, seishin to reikon to, kansetsu to kotsuzui to o kirihanasu made ni sashi tooshite, kokoro no omoi to kokorozashi to o miwakeru koto ga dekiru.
Soshite, kami no mimae ni wa, arawa de nai hizoubutsu wa hitotsu mo naku, subete no mono wa, kami no me ni wa hadaka de ari, arawa ni sarete iru no de aru. Kono kami ni taishite, watashitachi wa iihiraki o shinakute wa naranai.
Sate, watashitachi ni wa, moromoro no ten o tootte ikareta daisaishi naru kami no ko Iesu ga imasu no de arukara, watashitachi no kokuhaku suru shinkou o kataku mamoroude wa nai ka.
Kono daisaishi wa, watashitachi no yowasa o omoiyaru koto no dekinai you na kata de wa nai. Tsumi wa okasarenakattaga, subete no koto ni tsuite, watashitachi to onaji you ni shiren ni awareta no de aru.
Dakara, watashitachi wa, awaremi o uke, mata, megumi ni azukatte jiki o eta tasuke o ukeru tame ni, habakaru koto naku megumi no miza ni chikazukoude wa nai ka.
Daisaishi naru mono wa subete, ningen no naka kara erabarete, tsumi no tame ni sonaemono to ikenie to o sasageru you ni, hitobito no tame ni kami ni tsukaeru yaku ni ninjirareta mono de aru.
Kare wa jibun jishin, yowasa o mi ni oute iru no de, muchi na mayotte iru hitobito o, omoiyaru koto ga dekiru to tomo ni,
Sono yowasa no yue ni, tami no tame dake de wa naku jibun jishin no tame ni mo, tsumi ni tsuite sasage mono o shinakereba naranai no de aru.
Katsu, dare mo kono eiyo aru tsutome o jibun de eru no de wa naku, Aron no baai no you ni, kami no meshi ni yotte ukeru no de aru.
Douyou ni, Kirisuto mo mata, daisaishi no eiyo o jibun de eta no de wa naku, "Anata koso wa, watashi no ko. Kyou, watashi wa anata o unda" to iwareta kata kara, ouke ni natta no de aru.
Mata, hoka no kasho de kou iwarete iru, "Anata koso wa, eien ni, Merukizedeku ni hitoshii saishi de aru".
Kirisuto wa, sono niku no seikatsu no toki ni wa, hageshii sakebi to namida to o motte, gojibun o shi kara sukuu chikara no aru kata ni, inori to negai to o sasage, soshite, sono fukai shinkou no yue ni kikiirerareta no de aru.
Kare wa miko de arareta ni mo kakawarazu, samazama no kurushimi ni yotte juujun o manabi,
Soshite, mattaki mono to sareta no de, kare ni juujun de aru subete no hito ni taishite, eien no sukui no minamoto to nari,
Kami ni yotte, Merukizedeku ni hitoshii daisaishi to, tonaerareta no de aru.
Kono koto ni tsuite wa, iitai koto ga takusan aruga, anata gata no mimi ga nibuku natte iru no de, sore o tokiakasu koto wa muzukashii.
Anata gata wa, hisashii izen kara sudeni kyoushi to natte iru hazu na no ni, mou ichi do kami no kotoba no shoho o, hito kara tehodoki shite morawaneba naranai shimatsu de aru. Anata gata wa katai shokumotsu de wa naku, chichi o hitsuyou to shite iru.
Subete chichi o nonde iru mono wa, osanago na no dakara, gi no kotoba o ajiwau koto ga dekinai.
Shikashi, katai shokumotsu wa, zen'aku o miwakeru kankaku o jissai ni hatarakasete kunren sareta seijin no torubeki mono de aru.
Sou iu wake dakara, watashitachi wa, Kirisuto no oshie no shoho o ato ni shite, kansei o mezashite susumumoude wa nai ka. Imasara, shinda okonai no kuiaratame to kami e no shinkou,
Araigoto ni tsuite no oshie to anshu, shinin no fukkatsu to eien no sabaki, nado no kihon no oshie o kurikaeshi manabu koto o yameyoude wa nai ka.
Kami no yurushi o ete, sou suru koto ni shiyou.
Ittan, hikari o ukete ten yori no tamamono o ajiwai, seirei ni azukaru mono to nari,
Mata, kami no yoki mikotoba to, kitarubeki yo no chikara to o ajiwatta monotachi ga,
Sono nochi daraku shita baai ni wa, matamoya kami no miko o, mizukara juujika ni tsukete, sarashimono ni suru wake de arukara, futatabi kuiaratame ni tachi kaeru koto wa fukanou de aru.
Tatoeba, tochi ga, sono ue ni tabitabi furu ame o suikon de, tagayasu hitobito ni yakudatsu sakumotsu o sodaterunara, kami no shukufuku ni azukaru.
Shikashi, ibara ya azami o wa e saserunara, sore wa muyou ni nari, yagate noroware, tsuini wa yakarete shimau.
Shikashi, aisuru monotachi yo. Kou wa iu mono no, watashitachi wa, sukui ni kakawaru sarani yoi koto ga aru no o, anata gata ni tsuite kakushin shite iru.
Kami wa fugi na kata de wa naikara, anata gata no hataraki ya, anata gata ga katsute seito ni tsukae, ima mo nao tsukaete, mina no tame ni shimeshite kureta ai o, owasure ni naru koto wa nai.
Watashitachi wa, anata gata ga hitori nokorazu, saigo made nozomi o mochi tsuzukeru tame ni mo, onaji netsui o shimeshi,
Okotaru koto ga naku, shinkou to nintai to o motte yakusoku no mono o uketsugu hitobito ni minarau mono to naru you ni, to negatte yamanai.
Sate, kami ga Aburahamu ni taishite yakusoku sareta toki, sashite chikau no ni, gojibun yori mo ue no mono ga nai no de, gojibun o sashite chikatte,
"Watashi wa, kanarazu anata o shukufuku shi, kanarazu anata no shison o fuyasu" to iwareta.
Kono you ni shite, Aburahamu wa nintai zuyoku matta no de, yakusoku no mono o eta no de aru.
Ittai, ningen wa jibun yori ue no mono o sashite chikau no de ari, soshite, sono chikai wa subete no hantai ron o fuujiru hoshou to naru no de aru.
Soko de, kami wa, yakusoku no mono o uketsugu hitobito ni, gokeikaku no fuhen de aru koto o, issou hakkiri shimesou to omoware, chikai ni yotte hoshou sareta no de aru.
Sore wa, itsuwaru koto no ari enai kami ni taterareta futatsu no fuhen no kotogara ni yotte, mae ni okarete iru nozomi o toraeyou to shite yo o nogarete kita watashitachi ga, chikarazuyoi hagemashi o ukeru tame de aru.
Kono nozomi wa, watashitachi ni totte, iwaba, tamashii o anzen ni shi fudou ni suru ikari de ari, katsu "Makunouchi" ni hairi ikaseru mono de aru.
Sono makunouchi ni, Iesu wa, eien ni Merukizedeku ni hitoshii daisaishi to shite, watashitachi no tame ni sakigake to natte, hairareta no de aru.
Kono Merukizedeku wa Saremu no ou de ari, ito takaki kami no saishi de attaga, outachi o gekiha shite kaeru Aburahamu o mukaete shukufuku shi,
Sore ni taishite, Aburahamu wa kare ni subete no mono no juubun no ichi o wakeataeta no de aru. Sono na no imi wa, daiichi ni gi no ou, tsugi ni mata Saremu no ou, sunawachi heiwa no ou de aru.
Kare ni wa chichi ga naku, haha ga naku, keizu ga naku, shougai no hajime mo naku, seimei no owari mo naku, kami no ko no you de atte, itsu made mo saishi na no de aru.
Soko de, zokuchou no Aburahamu ga mottomo yoi bundori hin no juubun no ichi o ataeta no dakara, kono hito ga donna ni sugureta jinbutsu de atta ka ga, anata gata ni wakarude arou.
Sate, Rebi no ko no uchi de saishi no tsutome o shite iru monotachi wa, kyoudai de aru tami kara, onajiku Aburahamu no shison de aru ni mo kakawarazu, juubun no ichi o toru you ni, rippou ni yotte meijirarete iru.
Tokoro ga, karera no kettou ni zokusanai kono hito ga, Aburahamu kara juubun no ichi o uketori, yakusoku o ukete iru mono o shukufuku shita no de aru.
Iu made mo naku, shounaru mono ga oo naru mono kara shukufuku o ukeru no de aru.
Sono ue, ippou de wa shinubeki ningen ga, juubun no ichi o ukete iruga, tahou de wa "Kare wa ikite iru mono" to akashi sareta hito ga, sore o ukete iru.
Soko de, juubun no ichi o ukerubeki Rebi de sae mo, Aburahamu o tsuujite juubun no ichi o osameta, to ieru.
Naze nara, Merukizedeku ga Aburahamu o mukaeta toki ni wa, Rebi wa mada kono fuso no koshi no naka ni itakara de aru.
Moshi mattou sareru koto ga Rebikei no saishisei ni yotte kanou de attara - - tami wa saishisei no moto ni rippou o ataerareta no de aruga - - nan no hitsuyou ga atte, nao, "Aron ni hitoshii" to yobarenai, betsu na "Merukizedeku ni hitoshii" saishi ga taterareru no de aru ka.
Saishisei ni henkou ga areba, rippou ni mo kanarazu henkou ga aru hazu de aru.
Sate, korera no koto wa, imada katsute saidan ni houshi shita koto no nai, ta no buzoku ni kanshite iwarete iru no de aru.
To iu no wa, watashitachi no Shu ga Yudazoku no naka kara derareta koto wa, akiraka de aruga, Moose wa, kono buzoku ni tsuite, saishi ni kansuru koto de wa, hitokoto mo itte inai.
Soshite kono koto wa, Merukizedeku to douyou na, hoka no saishi ga taterareta koto ni yotte, masumasu meihaku ni naru.
Kare wa, niku ni tsukeru imashime no rippou ni yoranaide, kuchiru koto no nai inochi no chikara ni yotte taterareta no de aru.
Sore ni tsuite wa, seisho ni "Anata koso wa, eien ni, Merukizedeku ni hitoshii saishi de aru" to akashi sarete iru.
Kono you ni shite, ippou de wa, mae no imashime ga yowaku katsu mueki de atta tame ni mukou ni naruto tomo ni,
(rippou wa, nanigoto o mo mattou shi enakattakara de aru), tahou de wa, sarani sugureta nozomi ga arawarete kite, watashitachi o kami ni chikazukaseru no de aru.
Sono ue ni, kono koto wa chikai o motte nasareta. Hitobito wa, chikai o shinaide saishi to sareru no de aruga,
Kono hito no baai wa, tsugi no you na chikai o motte sareta no de aru. Sunawachi, kare ni tsuite, kou iwarete iru, "Shu wa chikawaretaga, kokoro o kaeru koto o sarenakatta. Anata koso wa, eien ni saishi de aru".
Kono you ni shite, Iesu wa sarani sugureta keiyaku no hoshou to narareta no de aru.
Katsu, shi to iu koto ga aru tame ni, tsutome o tsuzukeru koto ga dekinai no de, ooku no hitobito ga saishi ni taterareru no de aru.
Shikashi kare wa, eien ni imasu kata de aru no de, kawaranai saishi no tsutome o mochi tsuzukete orareru no de aru.
Soko de mata, kare wa, itsu mo ikite ite karera no tame ni torinashite orareru no de, kare ni yotte kami ni kuru hitobito o, itsu mo sukuu koto ga dekiru no de aru.
Kono you ni, sei ni shite, aku mo kegare mo naku, tsumibito to wa kubetsu sare, katsu, moromoro no ten yori mo takaku sarete iru daisaishi koso, watashitachi ni totte fusawashii kata de aru.
Kare wa, hoka no daisaishi no you ni, mazu jibun no tsumi no tame, tsugi ni tami no tsumi no tame ni, hibi, ikenie o sasageru hitsuyou wa nai. Naze nara, jibun o sasagete, ichi do dake, sore o saretakara de aru.
Rippou wa, yowasa o mi ni ou ningen o tatete daisaishi to suruga, rippou no nochi ni kita chikai no mikotoba wa, eien ni mattou sareta miko o tatete, daisaishi to shita no de aru.
Ijou nobeta koto no youten wa, kono you na daisaishi ga watashitachi no tame ni orare, ten ni atte tainousha no miza no migi ni zashi,
Ningen ni yorazu Shu ni yotte moukerareta shin no makuya naru seijo de tsukaete orareru, to iu koto de aru.
Ooyoso, daisaishi ga taterareru no wa, sonaemono ya ikenie o sasageru tame ni hoka naranai. Shitagatte, kono daisaishi mo mata, nani ka sasagubeki mono o motte orareneba naranai.
Soko de, moshi kare ga chijou ni oraretanara, rippou ni shitagatte sonaemono o sasageru saishitachi ga, genni iru no dakara, kare wa saishi de wa ari enakattade arou.
Karera wa, ten ni aru seijo no hinagata to kage to ni tsukaete iru mono ni suginai. Sore ni tsuite wa, Moose ga makuya o tateyou to shita toki, mitsuge o uke, "Yama de shimesareta katadoori ni, chuui shite sono issai o tsukuri nasai" to iwareta no de aru.
Tokoro ga Kirisuto wa, haruka ni sugureta tsutome o erareta no de aru. Sore wa, sarani masatta yakusoku ni motozuite taterareta, sarani masatta keiyaku no chuuhosha to narareta koto ni yoru.
Moshi hajime no keiyaku ni kaketa tokoro ga nakattanara, ato no mono ga taterareru yochi wa nakattade arou.
Tokoro ga, kami wa karera o semete iwareta, "Shu wa iwareru, miyo, watashi ga Isuraeru no ie oyobi Yuda no ie to, atarashii keiyaku o musubu hi ga kuru.
Sore wa, watashi ga karera no senzotachi no te o totte, Ejiputo no chi kara michikidashita hi ni, karera to musunda keiyaku no you na mono de wa nai. Karera ga watashi no keiyaku ni todomaru koto o shinai no de, watashi mo karera o kaeriminakattakara de aruto, Shu ga iwareru.
Watashi ga, sorera no hi no nochi, Isuraeru no ie to tateyou to suru keiyaku wa kore de aru, to Shu ga iwareru. Sunawachi, watashi no rippou o karera no omoi no naka ni ire, karera no kokoro ni kakitsukeyou. Kou shite, watashi wa karera no kami to nari, karera wa watashi no tami to narude arou.
Karera wa, sorezore, sono douhou ni, mata, sorezore, sono kyoudai ni, Shu o shire, to itte oshieru koto wa nakunaru. Naze nara, oo naru mono kara shounaru mono ni itaru made, karera wa kotogotoku, watashi o shiru you ni narukara de aru.
Watashi wa, karera no fugi o awaremi, mohaya, karera no tsumi o omoidasu koto wa shinai".
Kami wa, "Atarashii" to iwareta koto ni yotte, hajime no keiyaku o furui to sareta no de aru. Toshi o hete furubita mono wa, yagate kiete iku.
Sate, hajime no keiyaku ni mo, reihai ni tsuite no samazama na kitei to, chijou no seijo to ga atta.
Sunawachi, mazu makuya ga moukerare, sono mae no basho ni wa shokudai to tsukue to sonae no pan to ga okarete ita. Kore ga, seijo to yobareta.
Mata daini no maku no nochi ni, betsu no basho ga ari, sore wa shiseijo to yobareta.
Soko ni wa kin no kou dan to zenmenkin de oowareta keiyaku no hako to ga okare, sono naka ni wa mana no wa itte iru kin no tsubo to, me o dashita Aron no tsue to, keiyaku no ishiita to ga irete ari,
Hako no ue ni wa eikou ni kagayaku kerubimu ga atte, shokuzaisho o ootte ita. Korera no koto ni tsuite wa, ima koko de, ichiichi noberu koto ga dekinai.
Korera no mono ga, ijou no you ni totonoerareta ue de, saishitachi wa tsune ni makuya no mae no basho ni haitte reihai o suru no de aruga,
Makuya no oku ni wa daisaishi ga nen ni ichi do dake wa iru no de ari, shikamo jibun jishin to tami to no ayamachi no tame ni sasageru chi o tazusaenaide yuku koto wa nai.
Sore ni yotte seirei wa, zenpou no makuya ga sonzai shite iru kagiri, seijo ni hairu michi wa mada hirakarete inai koto o, akiraka ni shimeshite iru.
Kono makuya to iu no wa ima no jidai ni taisuru hiyu de aru. Sunawachi, sonaemono ya ikenie wa sasagerareruga, gishiki ni tazusawaru mono no ryoushin o mattou suru koto wa dekinai.
Sorera wa, tada shokumotsu to nomimono to shuju no araigoto ni kansuru gyouji de atte, kaikaku no toki made kaserarete iru niku no kitei ni suginai.
Shikashi Kirisuto ga sudeni arawareta shukufuku no daisaishi to shite korareta toki, te de tsukurarezu, kono sekai ni zokusanai, sarani ookiku, kanzen na makuya o toori,
Katsu, yagi to koushi to no chi ni yorazu, gojishin no chi ni yotte, ichi do dake seijo ni wa irare, sore ni yotte eien no a ga nai o mattou sareta no de aru.
Moshi, yagi ya oushi no chi ya meushi no hai ga, kegareta hitotachi no ue ni makikakerarete, nikutai o kiyome seibetsu suru to sureba,
Eien no seirei ni yotte, gojishin o kizu naki mono to shite kami ni sasagerareta Kirisuto no chi wa, naosara, watashitachi no ryoushin o kiyomete shinda waza o torinozoki, ikeru kami ni tsukaeru mono to shinaide arou ka.
Sore dakara, Kirisuto wa atarashii keiyaku no chuuhosha na no de aru. Sore wa, kare ga hajime no keiyaku no moto de okashita zaika o aganau tame ni shinareta kekka, mesareta monotachi ga, yakusoku sareta eien no kuni o uketsugu tame ni hoka naranai.
Ittai, yuigon ni wa, yuigonsha no shi no shoumei ga hitsuyou de aru.
Yuigon wa shi ni yotte nomi sono kouryoku o shouji, yuigonsha ga ikite iru aida wa, kouryoku ga nai.
Dakara, hajime no keiyaku mo, chi o nagasu koto nashi ni seiritsu shita no de wa nai.
Sunawachi, Moose ga, rippou ni shitagatte subete no imashime o tami zentai ni sengen shita toki, mizu to akairo no youmou to hisopu to no hoka ni, koushi to yagi to no chi o totte, keiyakusho to tami zentai to ni furikake,
Soshite, "Kore wa, kami ga anata gata ni taishite taterareta keiyaku no chi de aru" to itta.
Kare wa mata, makuya to gishikiyou no kigu issai ni mo, douyou ni chi o furikaketa.
Kou shite, hotondo subete no mono ga, rippou ni shitagai, chi ni yotte kiyomerareta no de aru. Chi o nagasu koto nashi ni wa, tsumi no yurushi wa ari enai.
Kono you ni, ten ni aru mono no hinagata wa, korera no mono de kiyomerareru hitsuyou ga aruga, ten ni aru mono wa, korera yori sarani sugureta ikenie de, kiyomerareneba naranai.
Tokoro ga, Kirisuto wa, hontou no mono no mokei ni suginai, te de tsukutta seijo ni hairanaide, ue naru ten ni hairi, ima ya watashitachi no tame ni kami no mimae ni dete kudasatta no de aru.
Daisaishi wa, toshigoto ni, jibun igai no mono no chi o tazusaete seijo ni wa iruga, Kirisuto wa, sono you ni, tabitabi gojishin o sasagerareru no de wa nakatta.
Moshi sou da to sureba, yo no hajime kara, tabitabi kunan o ukeneba naranakattade arou. Shikashi jijitsu, gojishin o ikenie to shite sasagete tsumi o torinozoku tame ni, yo no owari ni, ichi do dake arawareta no de aru.
Soshite, ichi do dake shinu koto to, shinda nochi sabaki o ukeru koto to ga, ningen ni sadamatte iru you ni,
Kirisuto mo mata, ooku no hito no tsumi o ou tame ni, ichi do dake gojishin o sasagerareta nochi, kare o machinozonde iru hitobito ni, tsumi o ou tame de wa nashi ni ni dome ni arawarete, sukui o ataerareru no de aru.
Ittai, rippou wa kitarubeki yoi koto no kage o yadosu ni sugizu, sono mono no shin no katachi o sonaete iru mono de wa naikara, toshigoto ni hikitsuzuki sasagerareru onaji you na ikenie ni yotte mo, mimae ni chikazuite kuru monotachi o, mattou suru koto wa dekinai no de aru.
Moshi dekita to sureba, gishiki ni tazusawaru monotachi wa, ichi do kiyomerareta ijou, mohaya tsumi no jikaku ga nakunaru no de arukara, sasagemono o suru koto ga yanda hazu de wa arumai ka.
Shikashi jissai wa, toshigoto ni, ikenie ni yotte tsumi no omoide ga yomigaette kuru no de aru.
Naze nara, oushi ya yagi nado no chi wa, tsumi o nozokisaru koto ga dekinaikara de aru.
Sore dakara, Kirisuto ga konoyo ni korareta toki, tsugi no you ni iwareta, "Anata wa, ikenie ya sasagemono o nozomarenaide, watashi no tame ni, karada o sonaete kudasatta.
Anata wa hansai ya zaisai o konomarenakatta.
Sono toki, watashi wa itta, 'Kami yo, watashi ni tsuki, makimono no shomotsu ni kaite aru to ori, miyo, mimune o okonau tame ni mairimashita' ".
Koko de, hajime ni, "Anata wa, ikenie to sasagemono to hansai to zaisai to (sunawachi, rippou ni shitagatte sasagerareru mono) o nozomarezu, konomare mo shinakatta" to ari,
Tsugi ni, "Miyo, watashi wa mimune o okonau tame ni mairimashita" to aru. Sunawachi, kare wa, nochi no mono o tateru tame ni, hajime no mono o haishi sareta no de aru.
Kono mimune ni motozuki tada ichi do Iesu Kirisuto no karada ga sasagerareta koto ni yotte, watashitachi wa kiyomerareta no de aru.
Kou shite, subete no saishi wa tatte higoto ni gishiki o okonai, tabitabi onaji you na ikenie o sasageruga, sorera wa kesshite tsumi o nozokisaru koto wa dekinai.
Shikaru ni, Kirisuto wa ooku no tsumi no tame ni hitotsu no eien no ikenie o sasageta nochi, kami no migi ni zashi,
Sore kara, teki o sono ashidai to suru toki made, matte orareru.
Kare wa hitotsu no sasagemono ni yotte, kiyomerareta monotachi o eien ni mattou sareta no de aru.
Seirei mo mata, watashitachi ni akashi o shite,
"Watashi ga, sorera no hi no nochi, karera ni taishite tateyou to suru keiyaku wa kore de aruto, Shu ga iwareru. Watashi no rippou o karera no kokoro ni atae, karera no omoi no uchi ni kakitsukeyou" to ii,
Sarani, "Mohaya, karera no tsumi to karera no fuhou to o, omoidasu koto wa shinai" to nobete iru.
Korera no koto ni taisuru yurushi ga aru ijou, tsumi no tame no sasagemono wa, mohaya ari enai.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Kou iu wake de, watashitachi wa Iesu no chi ni yotte, habakaru koto naku seijo ni hairu koto ga deki,
Kare no nikutai naru maku o toori, watashitachi no tame ni hiraite kudasatta atarashii ikita michi o tootte, hai tte yuku koto ga dekiru no de ari,
Sarani, kami no ie o osameru ooinaru saishi ga aru no dakara,
Kokoro wa susugarete ryoushin no togame o sari, karada wa kiyoi mizu de araware, magokoro o motte shinkou no kakushin ni mitasaretsutsu, mimae ni chikazukoude wa nai ka.
Mata, yakusoku o shite kudasatta no wa chuujitsu na kata de arukara, watashitachi no kokuhaku suru nozomi o, ugoku koto naku shikkari to mochi tsuzuke,
Ai to zenkou to o hagemu you ni tagai ni tsutome,
Aru hitotachi ga itsu mo shite iru you ni, shuukai o yameru koto wa shinaide tagai ni hagemashi, kano hi ga chikazuite iru no o mite, masumasu, sou shiyoude wa nai ka.
Moshi watashitachi ga, shinri no chishiki o uketa nochi ni mo nao, koto sarani tsumi o okashi tsuzukerunara, tsumi no tame no ikenie wa, mohaya ari enai.
Tada, sabaki to, sakarau monotachi o yaki tsukusu hageshii hi to o, osoretsutsu matsu koto dake ga aru.
Moose no rippou o mushi suru mono ga, awaremi o ukeru koto nashi ni, nisan no hito no shougen ni motozuite shikei ni shoserareru to sureba,
Kami no ko o fumitsuke, jibun ga kiyomerareta keiyaku no chi o kegareta mono to shi, sarani megumi no mitama o anadoru mono wa, donna ni ka omoi keibatsu ni atai suru koto de arou.
"Fukushuu wa watashi no suru koto de aru. Watashi jishin ga houfuku suru" to iware, mata "Shu wa sono tami o sabakareru" to iwareta kata o, watashitachi wa shitte iru.
Ikeru kami no mite no uchi ni ochiru no wa, osoroshii koto de aru.
Anata gata wa, hikari ni tera sareta nochi, kurushii ookina tatakai ni yoku taeta hajime no koro no koto o, omoidashite hoshii.
Soshirare kurushimerarete misemono ni sareta koto mo areba, kono you na me ni atta hitobito no nakama ni sareta koto mo atta.
Sarani goku ni irerareta hitobito o omoiyari, mata, motto masatta eien no takara o motte iru koto o shitte, jibun no zaisan ga ubawarete mo yorokonde sore o shinonda.
Dakara, anata gata wa jibun no motte iru kakushin o houki shite wa ikenai. Sono kakushin ni wa ookina mukui ga tomonatte iru no de aru.
Kami no mimune o okonatte yakusoku no mono o ukeru tame, anata gata ni hitsuyou na no wa, nintai de aru.
"Mou shibaraku sureba, kitarubeki kata ga omie ni naru. Osoku naru koto wa nai.
Waga gijin wa, shinkou ni yotte ikiru. Moshi shinkou o suterunara, watashi no tamashii wa kore o yorokobanai".
Shikashi watashitachi wa, shinkou o sutete horobiru mono de wa naku, shinkou ni tatte, inochi o eru mono de aru.
Sate, shinkou to wa, nozonde iru kotogara o kakushin shi, mada mite inai jijitsu o kakunin suru koto de aru.
Mukashi no hitotachi wa, kono shinkou no yue ni shousan sareta.
Shinkou ni yotte, watashitachi wa, kono sekai ga kami no kotoba de tsukurareta no de ari, shitagatte, mieru mono wa arawarete iru mono kara dete kita no de nai koto o, satoru no de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Aberu wa Kain yori mo masatta ikenie o kami ni sasage, shinkou ni yotte gi naru mono to mitomerareta. Kami ga, kare no sonaemono o yoshi to saretakara de aru. Kare wa shindaga, shinkou ni yotte ima mo nao katatte iru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Enoku wa shi o minai you ni ten ni utsusareta. Kami ga outsushi ni natta no de, kare wa mienaku natta. Kare ga utsusareru mae ni, kami ni yorokobareta mono to, akashi sarete itakara de aru.
Shinkou ga nakute wa, kami ni yorokobareru koto wa dekinai. Naze nara, kami ni kuru mono wa, kami no imasu koto to, gojishin o motomeru mono ni mukuite kudasaru koto to o, kanarazu shinjiru hazu dakara de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Noa wa mada mite inai kotogara ni tsuite mitsuge o uke, osore kashikomitsutsu, sono kazoku o sukuu tame ni hakobune o tsukuri, sono shinkou ni yotte yo no tsumi o sabaki, soshite, shinkou ni yoru gi o uketsugu mono to natta.
Shinkou ni yotte, Aburahamu wa, uketsugubeki chi ni dete ike to no meshi o koumutta toki, sore ni shitagai, yuku saki o shiranaide dete itta.
Shinkou ni yotte, takoku ni iru you ni shite yakusoku no chi ni yadori, onaji yakusoku o tsugu Isaku, Yakobu to tomo ni, makuya ni sunda.
Kare wa, yuruganu dodai no ue ni taterareta miyako o, machinozonde ita no de aru. Sono miyako o mokuromi, mata tateta no wa, kami de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Sara mo mata, toshioite itaga, tane o yadosu chikara o ataerareta. Yakusoku o nasatta kata wa shinjitsu de aruto, shinjite itakara de aru.
Kono you ni shite, hitori no shinda to douyou na hito kara, ten no hoshi no you ni, umibe no kazoegatai suna no you ni, obitadashii hito ga umarete kita no de aru.
Korera no hito wa mina, shinkou o idaite shinda. Mada yakusoku no mono wa ukete inakattaga, haruka ni sore o nozomimite yorokobi, soshite, chijou de wa tabibito de ari kiryuusha de aru koto o, mizukara iiarawashita.
Sou iiarawasu koto ni yotte, karera ga furusato o motomete iru koto o shimeshite iru.
Moshi sono dete kita tokoro no koto o kangaete itanara, kaeru kikai wa attade arou.
Shikashi jissai, karera ga nozonde ita no wa, motto yoi, ten ni aru furusato de atta. Dakara kami wa, karera no kami to yobarete mo, sore o haji to wa sarenakatta. Jijitsu, kami wa karera no tame ni, miyako o youi sarete ita no de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Aburahamu wa, shiren o uketa toki, Isaku o sasageta. Sunawachi, yakusoku o ukete ita kare ga, sono hitori ko o sasageta no de aru.
Kono ko ni tsuite wa, "Isaku kara deru mono ga, anata no shison to yobarerude arou" to iwarete ita no de atta.
Kare wa, kami ga shinin no naka kara hito o yomigaeraseru chikara ga aru, to shinjite ita no de aru. Dakara kare wa, iwaba, Isaku o iki kaeshite watasareta wake de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, Isaku wa, kitarubeki koto ni tsuite, Yakobu to Esau to o shukufuku shita.
Shinkou ni yotte, Yakobu wa shi no magiwa ni, Yosefu no kora o hitoribitori shukufuku shi, soshite sono tsue no kashira ni yori kakatte reihai shita.
Shinkou ni yotte, Yosefu wa sono rinjuu ni, Isuraeru no kora no dete yuku koto o omoi, jibun no hone no koto ni tsuite sashizu shita.
Shinkou ni yotte, Moose no umareta toki, ryoushin wa, san kagetsu no aida kare o kakushita. Sore wa, karera ga kodomo no uruwashii no o mitakara de aru. Karera wa mata, ou no meirei o mo osorenakatta.
Shinkou ni yotte, Moose wa, seijin shita toki, Paro no musume no ko to iwareru koto o kobami,
Tsumi no hakanai kanraku ni fukeru yori wa, mushiro kami no tami to tomo ni gyakutai sareru koto o erabi,
Kirisuto no yue ni ukeru so shiri o, Ejiputo no takara ni masaru tomi to kangaeta. Sore wa, kare ga mukui o nozomimite itakara de aru.
Shinkou ni yotte, kare wa ou no ikidoori o mo osorezu, Ejiputo o tachisatta. Kare wa, mienai kata o mite iru you ni shite, shinobi to oshita.
Shinkou ni yotte, horobosu mono ga, choushira ni te o kudasu koto no nai you ni, kare wa sugikoshi o okonai chi o nutta.
Shinkou ni yotte, hitobito wa koukai o kawaita tochi o tooru you ni watattaga, onaji koto o kuwadateta Ejiputojin wa oboreshinda.
Shinkou ni yotte, Eriko no jouheki wa, nanuka ni watatte mawatta tame ni, kuzureochita.
Shinkou ni yotte, yuujo Rahabu wa, saguri ni kita monotachi o odayaka ni mukaeta no de, fujuujun na monodomo to issho ni horobiru koto wa nakatta.
Kono hoka, nani o iou ka. Moshi Gideon, Baraku, Samuson, Efuta, Dabide, Samueru oyobi yogensha tachi ni tsuite katari dasunara, jikan ga tarinaide arou.
Karera wa shinkou ni yotte, kuniguni o seifuku shi, gi o okonai, yakusoku no mono o uke, shishi no kuchi o fusagi,
Hi no ikioi o keshi, tsurugi no ha o nogare, yowai mono wa tsuyoku sare, tatakai no yuusha to nari, takoku no gun o shirizokaseta.
Onnatachi wa, sono shishatachi o yomigaerasasete moratta. Hoka no mono wa, sarani masatta inochi ni yomigaeru tame ni, goumon no kurushimi ni amanji, houmen sareru koto o negawanakatta.
Nao hoka no monotachi wa, azakerare, muchiutare, shibariagerare, tougoku sareru hodo no me ni atta.
Aruiha, ishi de utare, sainamare, nokogiri de hikare, tsurugi de kirikorosare, hitsuji no kawa ya, yagi no kawa o kite arukimawari, muichimotsu ni nari, nayamasare, kurushimerare,
(konoyo wa karera no sumu tokoro de wa nakatta), arano to yama no naka to iwa no ana to tsuchi no ana to o, samayoi tsuzuketa.
Sate, korera no hitobito wa mina, shinkou ni yotte akashi saretaga, yakusoku no mono wa ukenakatta.
Kami wa watashitachi no tame ni, sarani yoi mono o arakajime sonaete kudasatte iru no de, watashitachi o hoka ni shite wa karera ga mattou sareru koto wa nai.
Kou iu wake de, watashitachi wa, kono you na ooku no shounin ni kumo no you ni kakomarete iru no de arukara, issai no omoni to, karamitsuku tsumi to o kanagurisutete, watashitachi no sanka subeki kyousou o, taeshinonde hashiri nukoude wa nai ka.
Shinkou no michibikite de ari, mata sono kanseimono de aru Iesu o aogimitsutsu, hashiroude wa nai ka. Kare wa, jibun no mae ni okarete iru yorokobi no yue ni, haji o mo itowanaide juujika o shinobi, kami no miza no migi ni zasuru ni itatta no de aru.
Anata gata wa, yowari hatete iki sosou shinai tame ni, tsumibitora no kono you na hankou o taeshinonda kata no koto o, omoimirubekide aru.
Anata gata wa, tsumi to torikunde tatakau toki, mada chi o nagasu hodo no teikou o shita koto ga nai.
Mata kotachi ni taisuru you ni, anata gata ni katarareta kono susume no kotoba o wasurete iru, "Watashi no ko yo, Shu no kunren o karonjite wa ikenai. Shu ni semerareru toki, yowari hatete wa naranai.
Shu wa aisuru mono o kunren shi, ukeireru subete no ko o, muchiutareru no de aru".
Anata gata wa kunren to shite taeshinobi nasai. Kami wa anatagata o, ko to shite toriatsukatte orareru no de aru. Ittai, chichi ni kunren sarenai ko ga arudarou ka.
Dare de mo ukeru kunren ga, anata gata ni ataerarenai to sureba, sore koso, anata gata wa shiseiji de atte, hontou no ko de wa nai.
Sono ue, nikushin no chichi wa watashitachi o kunren suru no ni, nao kare o uyamau to sureba, naosara, watashitachi wa, tamashii no chichi ni fukujuu shite, shin ni ikirubekide wa nai ka.
Nikushin no chichi wa, shibaraku no aida, jibun no kangae ni shitagatte kunren o ataeruga, tamashii no chichi wa, watashitachi no eki no tame, sono kiyosa ni azukaraseru tame ni, sou sareru no de aru.
Subete no kunren wa, touza wa, yorokobashii mono to wa omowarezu, mushiro kanashii mono to omowareru. Shikashi nochi ni nareba, sore ni yotte kitaerareru mono ni, heian na gi no mi o musubaseru you ni naru.
Sore dakara, anata gata no naeta te to, yowaku natte iru hiza to o, massugu ni shi nasai.
Mata, ashi no naete iru mono ga fumihazusu koto naku, mushiro iyasareru you ni, anata gata no ashi no tame ni, massugu na michi o tsukuri nasai.
Subete no hito to aiwashi, mata, mizukara kiyoku naru you ni tsutome nasai. Kiyoku naranakereba, dare mo Shu o miru koto wa dekinai.
Ki o tsukete, kami no megumi kara moreru koto ga nai you ni, mata, nigai ne ga wa e dete, anatagata o nayamashi, sore ni yotte ooku no hito ga kegasareru koto no nai you ni shi nasai.
Mata, ippai no shoku no tame ni choushi no kenri o utta Esau no you ni, fuhinkou na zokuaku na mono ni naranai you ni shi nasai.
Anata gata no shitte iru you ni, kare wa sono nochi, shukufuku o uketsugou to negattakeredo mo, suterarete shimai, namida o nagashite sore o motometaga, kuiaratame no kikai o enakatta no de aru.
Anata gata ga chikazuite iru no wa, te de fureru koto ga deki, hi ga moe, kurokumo ya kurayami ya arashi ni tsutsumare,
Mata, rappa no hibiki ya, kiita monotachi ga sore ijou, mimi ni shitaku nai to negatta you na kotoba ga hibiite kita yama de wa nai.
Soko de wa, karera wa, "Kemono de atte mo, yama ni fure tara, ishi de uchikorosarete shimae" to iu meirei no kotoba ni, taeru koto ga dekinakatta no de aru.
Sono koukei ga osoroshikatta no de Moose sae mo, "Watashi wa osoroshisa no amari, ononoite iru" to itta hodo de aru.
Shikashi anata gata ga chikazuite iru no wa, Shion no yama, ikeru kami no miyako, ten ni aru Erusaremu, musuu no tenshi no iwai kai,
Ten ni touroku sarete iru choushitachi no kyoukai, banmin no shinpansha naru kami, mattou sareta gijin no rei,
Atarashii keiyaku no chuuhosha Iesu, narabi ni, Aberu no chi yori mo chikarazuyoku kataru sosogareta chi de aru.
Anata gata wa, katatte orareru kata o kobamu koto ga nai you ni, chuui shi nasai. Moshi chijou de mimune o tsugeta mono o kobanda hitobito ga, batsu o nogareru koto ga dekinakattanara, ten kara tsuge shimesu kata o shirizokeru watashitachi wa, naosara sou naru no de wa nai ka.
Ano toki ni wa, mikoe ga chi o furuwaseta. Shikashi ima wa, yakusoku shite iwareta, "Watashi wa mou ichi do, chi bakari de naku ten o mo furuwasou".
Kono "Mou ichi do" to iu kotoba wa, furuwarenai mono ga nokoru tame ni, furuwareru mono ga, tsukurareta mono to shite torinozokareru koto o shimeshite iru.
Kono you ni, watashitachi wa furuwarenai kuni o ukete iru no dakara, kansha o shiyoude wa nai ka. Soshite kansha shitsutsu, osore kashikomi, kami ni yorokobareru you ni, tsukaete ikou.
Watashitachi no kami wa, jitsu ni, yaki tsukusu hi de aru.
Kyoudai ai o tsuzuke nasai.
Tabibito o motenasu koto o wasurete wa naranai. Kono you ni shite, aru hitobito wa, kizukanaide mitsukai tachi o motenashita.
Goku ni tsunagarete iru hitotachi o, jibun mo issho ni tsunagarete iru kokoromochi de omoiyari nasai. Mata, jibun mo onaji nikutai ni aru mono dakara, kurushimerarete iru hitotachi no koto o, kokoro ni tome nasai.
Subete no hito wa, kekkon o omonzubekide aru. Mata nedoko o kegashite wa naranai. Kami wa, fuhinkou na mono ya kan'in o suru mono o sabakareru.
Kinsen o aisuru koto o shinaide, jibun no motte iru mono de manzoku shi nasai. Shu wa, "Watashi wa, kesshite anata o hanarezu, anata o sutenai" to iwareta.
Dakara, watashitachi wa, habakarazu ni iou, "Shu wa watashi no tasukenushi de aru. Watashi ni wa osore wa nai. Hito wa, watashi ni nani ga dekiyou ka".
Kami no kotoba o anata gata ni katatta shidousha tachi no koto o, itsu mo omoiokoshi nasai. Karera no seikatsu no saigo o mite, sono shinkou ni narai nasai.
Iesu Kirisuto wa, kinou mo, kyou mo, itsu made mo kawaru koto ga nai.
Samazama na chigatta oshie ni yotte, mayowasarete wa naranai. Shokumotsu ni yorazu, megumi ni yotte, kokoro o tsuyoku suru ga yoi. Shokumotsu ni yotte aruita mono wa, eki o eru koto ga nakatta.
Watashitachi ni wa hitotsu no saidan ga aru. Makuya de tsukaete iru monotachi wa, sono saidan no shokumotsu o taberu kenri wa nai.
Naze nara, daisaishi ni yotte tsumi no tame ni sasagerareru kemono no chi wa, seijo no naka ni tazusaete ikareruga, sono karada wa, eisho no soto de yakarete shimaukara de aru.
Dakara, Iesu mo mata, gojibun no chi de tami o kiyomeru tame ni, mon no soto de kunan o ukerareta no de aru.
Shitagatte, watashitachi mo, kare no hazukashime o mi ni oi, eisho no soto ni dete, mimoto ni ikoude wa nai ka.
Kono chijou ni wa, eien no miyako wa nai. Kitara n to suru miyako koso, watashitachi no motomete iru mono de aru.
Dakara, watashitachi wa Iesu ni yotte,san bi no ikenie, sunawachi, kare no mina o tataeru kuchibiru no mi o, taezu kami ni sasageyoude wa nai ka.
Soshite, zen o okonau koto to hodokoshi o suru koto to o, wasurete wa ikenai. Kami wa, kono you na ikenie o yorokobareru.
Anata gata no shidousha tachi no iu koto o kikiirete, shitagai nasai. Karera wa, kami ni ii hiraki o subeki mono to shite, anata gata no tamashii no tame ni, me o samashite iru. Karera ga nagekanaide, yorokonde kono koto o suru you ni shi nasai. Sou de naito, anata gata no eki ni naranai.
Watashitachi no tame ni, inotte hoshii. Watashitachi wa akiraka na ryoushin o motte iru to shinjite ori, nanigoto ni tsuite mo, tadashiku koudou shiyou to negatte iru.
Watashi ga anata gata no tokoro ni hayaku kaereru tame, inotte kureru you ni, tokuni onegai suru.
Eien no keiyaku no chi ni yoru hitsuji no daibokusha, watashitachi no Shu Iesu o, shinin no naka kara hikiagerareta heiwa no kami ga,
Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, mikokoro ni kanau koto o watashitachi ni shite kudasari, anata gata ga mimune o okonau tame ni, subete no yoki mono o sonaete kudasaru you ni koinegau. Eikou ga, yoyo kagirinaku kami ni aru you ni, amen.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Dou ka watashi no susume no kotoba o ukeirete hoshii. Watashi wa, tada temijika ni kaita no dakara.
Watashitachi no kyoudai Temote ga yurusareta koto o, oshirase suru. Moshi kare ga hayaku kureba, kare to issho ni watashi wa anata gata ni aerudarou.
Anata gata no shidousha ichidou to seitotachi ichidou ni, yoroshiku tsutaete hoshii. Itariya kara kita hitobito kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Megumi ga, anata gata ichidou ni aru you ni.
Kami to Shu Iesu Kirisuto to no shimobe Yakobu kara, risan shite iru juu ni buzoku no hitobito e, aisatsu o okuru.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Anata ga taga, iroiro na shiren ni atta baai, sore o mushiro hijou ni yorokobashii koto to omoi nasai.
Anata gata no shitte iru toori, shinkou ga tamesareru koto ni yotte, nintai ga umidasarerukara de aru.
Dakara, nanra ketten no nai, kanzen na, dekiagatta hito to naru you ni, sono nintairyoku o juubun ni hatarakaseru ga yoi.
Anata gata no uchi, chie ni fusoku shite iru mono ga areba, sono hito wa, togame mo sezu ni oshiminaku subete no hito ni ataeru kami ni, negaimotomeru ga yoi. Sou sureba, ataerarerude arou.
Tada, utagawanaide, shinkou o motte negaimotome nasai. Utagau hito wa, kaze no fuku mama ni yureugoku umi no nami ni nite iru.
Sou iu hito wa, Shu kara nani ka o itadakeru mono no you ni omoubekide wa nai.
Sonna ningen wa, futagokoro no mono de atte, sono subete no koudou ni antei ga nai.
Hikui mibun no kyoudai wa, jibun ga takaku sareta koto o yorokobi nasai.
Mata, tonde iru mono wa, jibun ga hikuku sareta koto o yorokobu ga yoi. Tonde iru mono wa, kusabana no you ni sugisarukara de aru.
Tatoeba, taiyou ga nobotte neppuu o okuruto, kusa o karasu. Soshite sono hana wa ochi, sono utsukushii sugata wa kieusete shimau. Sore to onaji you ni, tonde iru mono mo, sono isshou no tabi nakaba de botsuraku surude arou.
Shiren o taeshinobu hito wa, saiwai de aru. Sore o shinobi tooshitanara, kami o aisuru monotachi ni yakusoku sareta inochi no kanmuri o ukerude arou.
Dare de mo yuuwaku ni au baai, "Kono yuuwaku wa, kami kara kita mono da" to itte wa naranai. Kami wa aku no yuuwaku ni ochiiru you na kata de wa naku, mata mizukara susunde hito o yuuwaku suru koto mo nasaranai.
Hito ga yuuwaku ni ochiiru no wa, sorezore, yoku ni hikare, sasowarerukara de aru.
Yoku ga harande tsumi o umi, tsumi ga jukushite shi o umidasu.
Aisuru kyoudaitachi yo. Omoichigai o shite wa ikenai.
Arayuru yoi okurimono, arayuru kanzen na tamamono wa, ue kara, hikari no chichi kara kudatte kuru. Chichi ni wa, henka to ka kaiten no kage to ka iu mono wa nai.
Chichi wa, watashitachi o, iwaba hizoubutsu no hatsuho to suru tame ni, shinri no kotoba ni yotte mimune no mama ni, umidashite kudasatta no de aru.
Aisuru kyoudaitachi yo. Kono koto o shitte oki nasai. Hito wa subete, kiku ni hayaku, kataru ni osoku, ikaru ni osoku arubekide aru.
Hito no ikari wa, kami no gi o mattou suru mono de wa naikara de aru.
Dakara, subete no kegare ya, hanahadashii aku o sutesatte, kokoro ni uetsukerarete iru mikotoba o, sunao ni ukeire nasai. Mikotoba ni wa, anata gata no tamashii o sukuu chikara ga aru.
Soshite, mikotoba o okonau hito ni nari nasai. Onore o azamuite, tada kiku dake no mono to natte wa ikenai.
Ooyoso mikotoba o kiku dake de okonawanai hito wa, choudo, jibun no umaretsuki no kao o kagami ni utsushite miru hito no you de aru.
Kare wa jibun o utsushite mite soko kara tachisaruto, sono totan ni, jibun no sugata ga donna de atta ka o wasurete shimau.
Kore ni hanshite, kanzen na jiyuu no rippou o isshin ni mitsumete tayumanai hito wa, kiite wasurete shimau hito de wa nakute, jissai ni okonau hito de aru. Kou iu hito wa, sono okonai ni yotte shukufuku sareru.
Moshi hito ga shinjin bukai mono da to jinin shinagara, shita o seisuru koto o sezu, jibun no kokoro o azamuite irunaraba, sono hito no shinjin wa munashii mono de aru.
Chichi naru kami no mimae ni kiyoku kegare no nai shinjin to wa, komatte iru koji ya, yamome o mimai, mizukara wa yo no kegare ni somazu ni, mi o kiyoku tamotsu koto ni hoka naranai.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Watashitachi no eikou no Shu Iesu Kirisuto e no shinkou o mamoru no ni, wakehedate o shite wa naranai.
Tatoeba, anata gata no kaidou ni, kin no yubiwa o hame, rippa na kimono o kita hito ga haitte kuruto douji ni, misuborashii kimono o kita mazushii hito ga haitte kita to suru.
Sono sai, rippa na kimono o kita hito ni taishite wa, uyauyashiku "Douzo, kochira no yoi seki ni okake kudasai" to ii, mazushii hito ni wa, "Anata wa, soko ni tatte i nasai. Sore to mo, watashi no ashimoto ni suwatte iru ga yoi" to itta to shitara,
Anata gata wa, jibuntachi no aida de sabetsu date o shi, yokaranu kangae de hito o sabaku mono ni natta wake de wa nai ka.
Aisuru kyoudaitachi yo. Yoku kiki nasai. Kami wa, konoyo no mazushii hitotachi o erande shinkou ni tomase, kami o aisuru monotachi ni yakusoku sareta mikuni no souzokusha to saretade wa nai ka.
Shikaru ni, anata gata wa mazushii hito o hazukashimeta no de aru. Anatagata o shiitage, saibansho ni hikizuri komu no wa, tonde iru monotachi de wa nai ka.
Anata gata ni taishite tonaerareta tattoi mina o kegasu no wa, jitsu ni karera de wa nai ka.
Shikashi, moshi anata ga taga, "Jibun o aisuru you ni, anata no tonarihito o aiseyo" to iu seisho no kotoba ni shitagatte, kono kiwamete tattoi rippou o mamorunaraba, sore wa yoi koto de aru.
Shikashi, moshi wakehedate o surunaraba, anata gata wa tsumi o okasu koto ni nari, rippou ni yotte ihansha to shite senkoku sareru.
Naze nara, rippou o kotogotoku mamotta to shite mo, sono hitotsu no ten ni de mo ochido ga areba, zentai o okashita koto ni narukara de aru.
Tatoeba, "Kan'in suru na" to iwareta kata wa, mata "Korosu na" to mo oose ni natta. Soko de, tatoi kan'in wa shinakute mo, hitogoroshi o sureba, rippou no ihansha ni natta koto ni naru.
Dakara, jiyuu no rippou ni yotte sabakarubeki monorashiku katari, katsu okonai nasai.
Awaremi o okonawanakatta mono ni taishite wa, kashaku no nai sabaki ga kudasareru. Awaremi wa, sabaki ni uchikatsu.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Aru hito ga jibun ni wa shinkou ga aru to shoushite ite mo, moshi okonai ga nakattara, nan no yaku ni tatsu ka. Sono shinkou wa kare o sukuu koto ga dekiru ka.
Aru kyoudai mata wa shimai ga hadaka de ite, sono hi no shokumotsu ni mo kotokaite iru baai,
Anata gata no uchi, dare ka ga, "Yasuraka ni iki nasai. Atatamatte, tabeaki nasai" to iu dake de, sono karada ni hitsuyou na mono o nani hitotsu ataenakatta to shitara, nan no yaku ni tatsu ka.
Shinkou mo, sore to douyou ni, okonai o tomonawanakereba, sore dake de wa shinda mono de aru.
Shikashi, "Aru hito ni wa shinkou ga ari, mata hoka no hito ni wa okonai ga aru" to iu mono ga arou. Sore nara, okonai no nai anata no shinkou naru mono o misete hoshii. Sou shitara, watashi no okonai ni yotte shinkou o misete ageyou.
Anata wa, kami wa tada hitori de aru to shinjite iru no ka. Sore wa kekkou de aru. Akuryoudomo de sae, shinjite ononoite iru.
Aa, oroka na hito yo. Okonai o tomonawanai shinkou no munashii koto o shiritai no ka.
Watashitachi no fuso Aburahamu wa, sono ko Isaku o saidan ni sasageta toki, okonai ni yotte gi to sareta no de wa nakatta ka.
Anata ga shitte iru toori, kare ni oite wa, shinkou ga okonai to tomo ni hataraki, sono okonai ni yotte shinkou ga mattou sare,
Kou shite, "Aburahamu wa kami o shinjita. Sore ni yotte, kare wa gi to mitomerareta" to iu seisho no kotoba ga jouju shi, soshite, kare wa "Kami no tomo" to tonaerareta no de aru.
Kore de wakaru you ni, hito ga gi to sareru no wa, okonai ni yoru no de atte, shinkou dake ni yoru no de wa nai.
Onaji you ni, kano yuujo Rahabu de sae mo, shishatachi o motenashi, karera o betsu na michi kara okuridashita toki, okonai ni yotte gi to saretade wa nai ka.
Reikon no nai karada ga shinda mono de aru to douyou ni, okonai no nai shinkou mo shinda mono na no de aru.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Anata gata no uchi ooku no mono wa, kyoushi ni naranai ga yoi. Watashitachi kyoushi ga, ta no hitotachi yori mo, motto kibishii sabaki o ukeru koto ga, yoku wakatte irukara de aru.
Watashitachi wa mina, ooku no ayamachi o okasu mono de aru. Moshi, kotoba no ue de ayamachi no nai hito ga areba, sou iu hito wa, zenshin o mo seigyo suru koto no dekiru kanzen na hito de aru.
Uma o gyosuru tame ni, sono kuchi ni kutsuwa o hamerunara, sono zenshin o hikimawasu koto ga dekiru.
Mata fune o miru ga yoi. Sentai ga hijou ni ookiku, mata hageshii kaze ni fuki makurarete mo, goku chiisana kaji hitotsu de, soujuusha no omoi no mama ni unten sareru.
Sore to onajiku, shita wa chiisana kikan de wa aruga, yoku taigensougo suru. Miyo, goku chiisana hi de mo, hijou ni ookina mori o moyasude wa nai ka.
Shita wa hi de aru. Fugi no sekai de aru. Shita wa, watashitachi no kikan no hitotsu to shite sonaerareta mono de aruga, zenshin o kegashi, seizon no sharin o moyashi, mizukara wa jigoku no hi de yakareru.
Arayuru shurui no kemono, tori, hau mono, umi no seibutsu wa, subete jinrui ni seiserarerushi, mata seiserarete kita.
Tokoro ga, shita o seishi uru hito wa, hitori mo inai. Sore wa, seishinikui aku de atte, shi no doku ni michite iru.
Watashitachi wa, kono shita de chichi naru Shu osan bishi, mata, sono onaji shita de, kami ni katadotte tsukurareta ningen o norotte iru.
Onaji kuchi kara,san bito noroi to ga dete kuru. Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Kono you na koto wa, arubekide nai.
Izumi ga, amai mizu to nigai mizu to o, onaji ana kara fukidasu koto ga arou ka.
Watashi no kyoudaitachi yo. Ichijiku no ki ga oribu no mi o musubi, budou no ki ga ichijiku no mi o musubu koto ga dekiyou ka. Shiomizu mo, amai mizu o dasu koto wa dekinai.
