Kataru mono wa, kami no mikotoba o kataru mono ni fusawashiku katari, houshi suru mono wa, kami kara tamawaru chikara ni yoru mono ni fusawashiku houshi subekide aru. Sore wa, subete no koto ni oite Iesu Kirisuto ni yotte, kami ga agamerareru tame de aru. Eikou to chikara to ga yoyo kagirinaku, kare ni aru you ni, amen.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Anatagata o kokoromiru tame ni furikakatte kuru hi no you na shiren o, nani ka omoigakenai koto ga okotta ka no you ni odoroki ayashimu koto naku,
Mushiro, Kirisuto no kurushimi ni azukareba azukaru hodo, yorokobu ga yoi. Sore wa, Kirisuto no eikou ga arawareru sai ni, yorokobi ni afureru tame de aru.
Kirisuto no na no tame ni soshirarerunara, anata gata wa saiwai de aru. Sono toki ni wa, eikou no rei, kami no rei ga, anata gata ni yadorukara de aru.
Anata gata no uchi, dare mo, hitogoroshi, nusubito, aku o okonau mono, aruiha, tanin ni kanshou suru mono to shite kurushimi ni au koto no nai you ni shi nasai.
Shikashi, Kurisuchan to shite kurushimi o ukeru no de areba, hajiru koto wa nai. Kaette, kono na ni yotte kami o agame nasai.
Sabaki ga kami no ie kara hajimerareru toki ga kita. Sore ga, watashitachi kara mazu hajimerareru to shitara, kami no fukuin ni shitagawanai hitobito no yukusue wa, donna de arou ka.
Mata gijin de sae, karoujite sukuwareru no da to sureba, fushin naru mono ya tsumibito wa, dou narude arou ka.
Dakara, kami no mimune ni shitagatte kurushimi o ukeru hitobito wa, zen o okonai, soshite, shinjitsu de arareru souzousha ni, jibun no tamashii o yudaneru ga yoi.
Soko de, anata gata no uchi no chouroutachi ni susumeru. Watashi mo, chourou no hitori de, Kirisuto no kunan ni tsuite no shounin de ari, mata, yagate arawareyou to suru eikou ni azukaru mono de aru.
Anata gata ni yudanerarete iru kami no hitsuji no mure o boku shi nasai. Shi irarete suru no de wa naku, kami ni shitagatte mizukara susunde nashi, hazubeki ritoku no tame de wa naku, honshin kara, sore o shi nasai.
Mata, yudanerareta monotachi no ue ni kenryoku o furuu koto o shinaide, mushiro, mure no mohan to narubekide aru.
Sou sureba, daibokusha ga arawareru toki ni wa, shibomu koto no nai eikou no kanmuri o ukerude arou.
Onaji you ni, wakai hitotachi yo. Chouroutachi ni shitagai nasai. Mata, mina tagai ni kenson o mi ni tsuke nasai. Kami wa takaburu mono o shirizoke, herikudaru mono ni megumi o tamaukara de aru.
Dakara, anata gata wa, kami no chikarazuyoi mite no moto ni, mizukara o hikuku shi nasai. Toki ga kureba kami wa anatagata o takaku shite kudasarude arou.
Kami wa anatagata o kaerimite ite kudasaru no de arukara, jibun no omoiwazurai o, issai kami ni yudaneru ga yoi.
Mi o tsutsushimi, me o samashite i nasai. Anata gata no teki de aru akuma ga, hoe takeru shishi no you ni, kui tsukusubeki mono o motomete arukimawatte iru.
Kono akuma ni mukai, shinkou ni kataku tatte, teikou shi nasai. Anata gata no yoku shitte iru toori, zensekai ni iru anata gata no kyoudaitachi mo, onaji you na kurushimi no kazukazu ni atte iru no de aru.
Anatagata o Kirisuto ni aru eien no eikou ni manekiirete kudasatta afururu megumi no kami wa, shibaraku no kurushimi no nochi, anatagata o iyashi, tsuyome, chikarazuke, fudou no mono to shite kudasarude arou.
Dou ka, chikara ga yoyo kagirinaku, kami ni aru you ni, amen.
Watashi wa, chuujitsu na kyoudai to shite shinrai shite iru Shiruwano no te ni yotte, kono mijikai tegami o anata gata ni okuri, susume o shi, mata, kore ga kami no makoto no megumi de aru koto o akashi shita. Kono megumi no uchi ni, kataku tatte i nasai.
Anata gata to tomo ni erabarete Babiron ni aru kyoukai, narabi ni, watashi no ko Maruko kara, anata gata ni yoroshiku.
Ai no seppun o motte tagai ni aisatsu o kawashi nasai. Kirisuto ni aru anata gata ichidou ni, heian ga aru you ni.
Iesu Kirisuto no shimobe mata shito de aru Shimeon Petero kara, watashitachi no kami to sukuinushi Iesu Kirisuto to no gi ni yotte, watashitachi to onaji tattoi shinkou o sazukatta hitobito e.
Kami to watashitachi no Shu Iesu to o shiru koto ni yotte, megumi to heian to ga, anata gata ni yutaka ni kuwawaru you ni.
Inochi to shinjin to ni kakawaru subete no koto wa, Shu Iesu no shinsei na chikara ni yotte, watashitachi ni ataerarete iru. Sore wa, gojishin no eikou to toku to ni yotte, watashitachi o mesareta kata o shiru chishiki ni yoru no de aru.
Mata, sorera no mono ni yotte, tattoku, ooinaru yakusoku ga, watashitachi ni ataerarete iru. Sore wa, anata ga taga, yo ni aru yoku no tame ni horobiru koto o manukare, kami no seishitsu ni azukaru mono to naru tame de aru.
Sore dakara, anata gata wa, chikara no kagiri o tsukushite, anata gata no shinkou ni toku o kuwae, toku ni chishiki o,
Chishiki ni sessei o, sessei ni nintai o, nintai ni shinjin o,
Shinjin ni kyoudai ai o, kyoudai ai ni ai o kuwae nasai.
Korera no mono ga anata gata ni sonawatte, iyoiyo yutaka ni narunaraba, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto o shiru chishiki ni tsuite, anata gata wa, okotaru mono, mi o musubanai mono to naru koto wa naide arou.
Korera no mono o sonaete inai mono wa, moujin de ari, kinshi no mono de ari, jibun no izen no tsumi ga kiyomerareta koto o wasurete iru mono de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Sore dakara, masumasu hagende, anata gata no uketa meshi to erabi to o, tashika na mono ni shi nasai. Sou sureba, kesshite ayamachi ni ochiiru koto wa nai.
Kou shite, watashitachi no Shu mata sukuinushi Iesu Kirisuto no eien no kuni ni hairu megumi ga, anata gata ni yutaka ni ataerarerukara de aru.
Sore dakara, anata gata wa sudeni korera no koto o shitte ori, mata, ima motte iru shinri ni kataku tatte wa iruga, watashi wa, korera no koto o itsu mo, anata gata ni omoiokosasetai no de aru.
Watashi ga kono makuya ni iru aida, anata gata ni omoiokosasete, furuitataseru koto ga tekitou to omou.
Sore wa, watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto mo watashi ni shimeshite kudasatta you ni, watashi no kono makuya o nugisaru toki ga majika de aru koto o shitte irukara de aru.
Watashi ga yo o satta nochi ni mo, korera no koto o, anata gata ni itsu mo omoidasaseru you ni tsutomeyou.
Watashitachi no Shu Iesu Kirisuto no chikara to rairin to o, anata gata ni shiraseta toki, watashitachi wa, takumi na tsukuribanashi o mochiiru koto wa shinakatta. Watashitachi ga, sono goikou no mokugekisha na no dakara de aru.
Iesu wa chichi naru kami kara homare to eikou to o ouke ni nattaga, sono toki, ogosoka na eikou no naka kara tsugi no you na mikoe ga kakatta no de aru, "Kore wa watashi no aisuru ko, watashi no kokoro ni kanau mono de aru".
Watashitachi mo Iesu to tomo ni sei naru yama ni ite, ten kara deta kono koe o kiita no de aru.
Kou shite, yogen no kotoba wa, watashitachi ni issou kakujitsu na mono ni natta. Anata gata mo, yoru ga ake, myoujou ga nobotte, anata gata no kokoro no naka o tera suma de, kono yogen no kotoba o kurayami ni kagayaku tomoshibi to shite, sore ni me o tomete iru ga yoi.
Seisho no yogen wa subete, jibun katte ni kaishaku subekide nai koto o, mazu daiichi ni shirubekide aru.
Naze nara, yogen wa kesshite ningen no ishi kara deta mono de wa naku, hitobito ga seirei ni kanji, kami ni yotte katatta mono dakara de aru.
Shikashi, tami no aida ni, nise yogensha ga okotta koto ga aruga, sore to onajiku, anata gata no aida ni mo, nise kyoushi ga arawarerude arou. Karera wa, horobi ni itaraseru itan o hisoka ni mochikomi, jibuntachi o aganatte kudasatta Shu o hitei shite, sumiyaka na metsubou o jibun no mi ni maneite iru.
Mata, oozei no hito ga karera no houshou o minarai, sono tame ni, shinri no michi ga so shiri o ukeru ni itaru no de aru.
Karera wa, don'yoku no tame ni, kangen o motte anatagata o azamuki, ri o musaborude arou. Karera ni taisuru sabaki wa mukashi kara yuuyo naku okonaware, karera no metsubou mo todokooru koto wa nai.
Kami wa, tsumi o okashita mitsukai tachi o yurushite okanaide, karera o gekai ni otoshiire, sabaki no toki made kurayami no ana ni tojikomete okareta.
Mata, furui sekai o sono mama ni shite okanaide, sono fushinkou na sekai ni kouzui o kitarase, tada, gi no sendensha Noatachi hachinin no mono dake o hogo sareta.
Mata, Sodomu to Gomora no machimachi o hai ni kiseshimete hametsu ni shoshi, fushinkou ni hashirou to suru hitobito no miseshime to shi,
Tada, hidou no monodomo no houjuu na okonai ni yotte nayamasarete ita gijin Roto dake o sukuidasareta.
(kono gijin wa, karera no aida ni sumi, karera no fuhou no okonai o hibi mikiki shite, sono tadashii kokoro o itamete ita no de aru.)
Kou iu wake de, Shu wa, shinjin bukai mono o shiren no naka kara sukuidashi, mata, fugi na monodomo,
Tokuni, kegareta jouyoku ni obore niku ni shitagatte ayumi, mata, ken'i aru mono o karonjiru hitobito o basshite, sabaki no hi made tojikomete okubeki koto o, yoku gozonjina no de aru. Kou iu hitobito wa, daitan futeki na wagamamamono de atte, eikou aru monotachi o soshitte habakaru tokoro ga nai.
Shikashi, mitsukai tachi wa, ikioi ni oite mo chikara ni oite mo, karera ni masatte iru ni kakawarazu, karera o Shu no mimae ni uttae soshiru koto wa shinai.
Korera no mono wa, toraerare, hofurareru tame ni umarete kita, funbetsu no nai doubutsu no you na mono de, jibun ga shiri mo shinai koto o soshiri, sono fugi no mukui to shite batsu o uke, kanarazu horobosarete shimau no de aru.
Karera wa, mahiru de sae shushoku o tanoshimi, anata gata to enkai ni douseki shite, damashigoto ni fukette iru. Karera wa, shimi de ari, kizu de aru.
Sono me wa inkou o oi, tsumi o okashite aku koto o shiranai. Karera wa kokoro no sadamaranai mono o yuuwaku shi, sono kokoro wa don'yoku ni nare, noroi no ko to natte iru.
Karera wa tadashii michi kara hazurete mayoi ni ochiiri, Beoru no ko Baramu no michi ni shitagatta. Baramu wa fugi no mi o aishi,
Sono tame ni, jibun no ayamachi ni taisuru togame o uketa. Mono o iwanai roba ga, ningen no koe de mono o ii, kono yogensha no kyoukijimi ta furumai o habanda no de aru.
Kono hitobito wa, iwaba, mizu no nai ido, toppuu ni fukiharawareru kiri de atte, karera ni wa kurayami ga youi sarete iru.
Karera wa munashii hokori o katari, mayoi no naka ni ikite iru hitobito no aida kara, karoujite nogarete kita monotachi o, nikuyoku to shikijou to ni yotte yuuwaku shi,
Kono hitobito ni jiyuu o ataeru to yakusoku shinagara, karera jishin wa metsubou no dorei ni natte iru. Ooyoso, hito wa seifukusha no dorei to naru mono de aru.
Karera ga, Shu mata sukuinushi naru Iesu Kirisuto o shiru koto ni yori, konoyo no kegare kara nogareta nochi, mata sore ni makikomarete seifuku sarerunaraba, karera no nochi no joutai wa hajime yori mo, motto waruku naru.
Gi no michi o kokoroete inagara, jibun ni sazukerareta sei naru imashime ni somuku yori wa, mushiro gi no michi o shiranakatta hou ga yoi.
Kotowaza ni, "Inu wa jibun no haita mono ni kaeri, buta wa arawarete mo, mata, doro no naka ni korogatte iku" to aruga, karera no mi ni okotta koto wa, sono toori de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Watashi wa ima kono daini no tegami o anata gata ni kakiokuri, korera no tegami ni yotte kioku o yobiokoshi, anata gata no junshin na kokoro o furuitataseyou to shita.
Sore wa, sei naru yogensha tachi ga arakajime katatta kotoba to, anata gata no shitotachi ga tsutaeta Shu naru sukuinushi no imashime to o, omoidasaseru tame de aru.
Mazu tsugi no koto o shirubekide aru. Owari no toki ni azakeru monotachi ga, azakerinagara dete kite, jibun no yokujou no mama ni seikatsu shi,
"Shu no rairin no yakusoku wa dou natta no ka. Senzotachi ga nemuri ni tsuite kara, subete no mono wa tenchi souzou no hajime kara sono mama de atte, kawatte wa inai" to iude arou.
Sunawachi, karera wa kono koto o mitomeyou to wa shinai. Furui mukashi ni ten ga sonzai shi, chi wa kami no kotoba ni yotte, mizu ga moto ni nari, mata, mizu ni yotte natta no de aruga,
Sono toki no sekai wa, mikotoba ni yori mizu de oowarete horonde shimatta.
Shikashi, ima no ten to chi to wa, onaji mikotoba ni yotte hozon sare, fushinkou na hitobito ga sabakare, horobosarubeki hi ni hi de yakareru toki made, sono mama tamotarete iru no de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Kono ichiji o wasurete wa naranai. Shu ni atte wa, ichi nichi wa sen nen no you de ari, sen nen wa tsuitachi no you de aru.
Aru hitobito ga osoi to omotte iru you ni, Shu wa yakusoku no jikkou o osoku shite orareru no de wa nai. Tada, hitori mo horobiru koto ga naku, subete no mono ga kuiaratame ni itaru koto o nozomi, anata gata ni taishite nagaku nintai shite orareru no de aru.
Shikashi, Shu no hi wa nusubito no you ni osotte kuru. Sono hi ni wa, ten wa daionkyou o tatete kiesari, tentai wa yakete kuzure, chi to sono ue ni tsukuridasareta mono mo, mina yaki tsukusarerude arou.
Kono you ni, korera wa mina kuzureochite iku mono de arukara, kami no hi no tourai o nesshin ni machinozonde iru anata gata wa,
Kyokuryoku, kiyoku shinjin bukai okonai o shite inakereba naranai. Sono hi ni wa, ten wa moe kuzure, tentai wa yakeusete shimau.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa, kami no yakusoku ni shitagatte, gi no sumu atarashii ten to atarashii chi to o machinozonde iru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Sore dakara, kono hi o matte iru anata gata wa, shimi mo naku kizu mo naku, yasuraka na kokoro de, kami no mimae ni derareru you ni hagemi nasai.
Mata, watashitachi no Shu no kan'you wa sukui no tame de aru to omoi nasai. Kono koto wa, watashitachi no aisuru kyoudai Pauro ga, kare ni ataerareta chie ni yotte, anata gata ni kakiokutta toori de aru.
Kare wa, dono tegami ni mo korera no koto o nobete iru. Sono tegami no naka ni wa, tokorodokoro, wakarinikui kasho mo atte, mugaku de kokoro no sadamaranai monotachi wa, hoka no seisho ni tsuite mo shite iru you ni, muri na kaishaku o hodokoshite, jibun no metsubou o maneite iru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Sore dakara, anata gata wa kanete kara kokorogakete iru you ni, hidou no mono no madowashi ni sasoikomarete, anata gata jishin no kakushin o ushinau koto no nai you ni kokorogake nasai.
Soshite, watashitachi no Shu mata sukuinushi Iesu Kirisuto no megumi to chishiki to ni oite, masumasu yutaka ni nari nasai. Eikou ga, ima mo, mata eien no hi ni itaru made mo, Shu ni aru you ni, amen.
Hajime kara atta mono, watashitachi ga kiita mono, me de mita mono, yoku mite te de sawatta mono, sunawachi, inochi no kotoba ni tsuite - -
Kono inochi ga arawareta no de, kono eien no inochi o watashitachi wa mite, sono akashi o shi, katsu, anata gata ni tsugeshiraseru no de aru. Kono eien no inochi wa, chichi to tomo ni imashitaga, ima ya watashitachi ni arawareta mono de aru - -
Sunawachi, watashitachi ga mita mono, kiita mono o, anata gata ni mo tsugeshiraseru. Sore wa, anata gata mo, watashitachi no majiwari ni azukaru you ni naru tame de aru. Watashitachi no majiwari to wa, chichi narabi ni miko Iesu Kirisuto to no majiwari no koto de aru.
Kore o kakiokuru no wa, watashitachi no yorokobi ga michiafureru tame de aru.
Watashitachi ga Iesu kara kiite, anata gata ni tsutaeru otozure wa, kou de aru. Kami wa hikari de atte, kami ni wa sukoshi no kurai tokoro mo nai.
Kami to majiwari o shite iru to iinagara, moshi, yami no naka o aruite irunara, watashitachi wa itsuwatte iru no de atte, shinri o okonatte iru no de wa nai.
Shikashi, kami ga hikari no naka ni imasu you ni, watashitachi mo hikari no naka o arukunaraba, watashitachi wa tagai ni majiwari o mochi, soshite, miko Iesu no chi ga, subete no tsumi kara watashitachi o kiyomeru no de aru.
Moshi, tsumi ga nai to iunara, sore wa jibun o azamuku koto de atte, shinri wa watashitachi no uchi ni nai.
Moshi, watashitachi ga jibun no tsumi o kokuhaku surunaraba, kami wa shinjitsu de tadashii kata de arukara, sono tsumi o yurushi, subete no fugi kara watashitachi o kiyomete kudasaru.
Moshi, tsumi o okashita koto ga nai to iunara, sore wa kami o itsuwari mono to suru no de atte, kami no kotoba wa watashitachi no uchi ni nai.
Watashi no kotachi yo. Korera no koto o kakiokuru no wa, anata gata ga tsumi o okasanai you ni naru tame de aru. Moshi, tsumi o okasu mono ga areba, chichi no mimoto ni wa, watashitachi no tame ni tasukenushi, sunawachi, gi naru Iesu Kirisuto ga orareru.
Kare wa, watashitachi no tsumi no tame no, a ga nai no sonaemono de aru. Tada, watashitachi no tsumi no tame bakari de wa naku, zensekai no tsumi no tame de aru.
Moshi, watashitachi ga kare no imashime o mamorunaraba, sore ni yotte kare o shitte iru koto o satoru no de aru.
"Kare o shitte iru" to iinagara, sono imashime o mamoranai mono wa, itsuwarimono de atte, shinri wa sono hito no uchi ni nai.
Shikashi, kare no mikotoba o mamoru mono ga areba, sono hito no uchi ni, kami no ai ga shin ni mattou sareru no de aru. Sore ni yotte, watashitachi ga kare ni aru koto o shiru no de aru.
"Kare ni oru" to iu mono wa, kare ga arukareta you ni, sono hito jishin mo arukubekide aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Watashi ga anata gata ni kakiokuru no wa, atarashii imashime de wa naku, anata gata ga hajime kara ukete ita furui imashime de aru. Sono furui imashime to wa, anata gata ga sudeni kiita mikotoba de aru.
Shikamo, atarashii imashime o, anata gata ni kakiokuru no de aru. Soshite, sore wa, kare ni totte mo anata gata ni totte mo, shinri na no de aru. Naze nara, yami wa sugisari, makoto no hikari ga sudeni kagayaite irukara de aru.
"Hikari no naka ni iru" to iinagara, sono kyoudai o nikumu mono wa, ima nao, yami no naka ni iru no de aru.
Kyoudai o aisuru mono wa, hikari ni oru no de atte, tsumazuku koto wa nai.
Kyoudai o nikumu mono wa, yami no naka ni ori, yami no naka o aruku no de atte, jibun de wa doko e iku no ka wakaranai. Yami ga kare no me o mienaku shitakara de aru.
Kotachi yo. Anata gata ni kore o kakiokuru no wa, mina no yue ni, anata gata no ooku no tsumi ga yurusaretakara de aru.
Chichitachi yo. Anata gata ni kakiokuru no wa, anata ga taga, hajime kara imasu kata o shittakara de aru. Wakamonotachi yo. Anata gata ni kakiokuru no wa, anata ga taga, ashiki mono ni uchikattakara de aru.
Kodomotachi yo. Anata gata ni kakiokutta no wa, anata gata ga chichi o shittakara de aru. Chichitachi yo. Anata gata ni kakiokutta no wa, anata ga taga, hajime kara imasu kata o shittakara de aru. Wakamonotachi yo. Anata gata ni kakiokutta no wa, anata gata ga tsuyoi mono de ari, kami no kotoba ga anata gata ni yadori, soshite, anata gata ga ashiki mono ni uchikattakara de aru.
Yo to yo ni aru mono to o, aishite wa ikenai. Moshi, yo o aisuru mono ga areba, chichi no ai wa kare no uchi ni nai.
Subete yo ni aru mono, sunawachi, niku no yoku, me no yoku, mochimono no hokori wa, chichi kara deta mono de wa naku, yo kara deta mono de aru.
Yo to yo no yoku to wa sugisaru. Shikashi, kami no mimune o okonau mono wa, eien ni nagaraeru.
Kodomotachi yo. Ima wa owari no toki de aru. Anata gata ga kanete hanKirisuto ga kuru to kiite ita you ni, ima ya ooku no hanKirisuto ga arawarete kita. Sore ni yotte ima ga owari no toki de aru koto o shiru.
Karera wa watashitachi kara dete itta. Shikashi, karera wa watashitachi ni zokusuru mono de wa nakatta no de aru. Moshi zokusuru mono de attanara, watashitachi to issho ni todomatte itade arou. Shikashi, dete itta no wa, ganrai, karera ga mina watashitachi ni zokusanai mono de aru koto ga, akiraka ni sareru tame de aru.
Shikashi, anata gata wa sei naru mono ni abura o sosogarete iru no de, anata gata subete ga, sono koto o shitte iru.
Watashi ga kakiokutta no wa, anata gata ga shinri o shiranaikara de wa naku, sore o shitte irukara de ari, mata, subete no itsuwari wa shinri kara deru mono de nai koto o, shitte irukara de aru.
Itsuwarimono to wa, dare de aru ka. Iesu no Kirisuto de aru koto o hitei suru mono de wa nai ka. Chichi to miko to o hitei suru mono wa, hanKirisuto de aru.
Miko o hitei suru mono wa chichi o motazu, miko o kokuhaku suru mono wa, mata chichi o mo motsu no de aru.
Hajime kara kiita koto ga, anata gata no uchi ni, todomaru you ni shi nasai. Hajime kara kiita koto ga, anata gata no uchi ni todomatte oreba, anata gata mo miko to chichi to no uchi ni, todomaru koto ni naru.
Kore ga, kare mizukara watashitachi ni yakusoku sareta yakusoku de atte, sunawachi, eien no inochi de aru.
Watashi wa, anatagata o madowasu monotachi ni tsuite, korera no koto o kakiokutta.
Anata gata no uchi ni wa, Kirisuto kara itadaita abura ga todomatte iru no de, dare ni mo oshiete morau hitsuyou wa nai. Kono abura ga, subete no koto o anata gata ni oshieru. Sore wa makoto de atte, itsuwari de wa naikara, sono abura ga oshieta you ni, anata gata wa kare no uchi ni todomatte i nasai.
Soko de, kotachi yo. Kirisuto no uchi ni todomatte i nasai. Sore wa, kare ga arawareru toki ni, kakushin o mochi, sono rairin ni saishite, mimae ni hajiiru koto ga nai tame de aru.
Kare no gi naru kata de aru koto ga wakareba, gi o okonau mono wa mina kare kara umareta mono de aru koto o, shirude arou.
Watashitachi ga kami no ko to yobareru tame ni wa, donna ni ookina ai o chichi kara tamawatta koto ka, yoku kangaete mi nasai. Watashitachi wa, sudeni kami no ko na no de aru. Yo ga watashitachi o shiranai no wa, chichi o shiranakattakara de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Watashitachi wa ima ya kami no ko de aru. Shikashi, watashitachi ga dou naru no ka, mada akiraka de wa nai. Kare ga arawareru toki, watashitachi wa, jibuntachi ga kare ni niru mono to naru koto o shitte iru. Sono makoto no misugata o mirukara de aru.
Kare ni tsuite kono nozomi o idaite iru mono wa mina, kare ga kiyoku arareru you ni, mizukara o kiyoku suru.
Subete tsumi o okasu mono wa, fuhou o okonau mono de aru. Tsumi wa fuhou de aru.
Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, kare wa tsumi o torinozoku tame ni arawareta no de atte, kare ni wa nanra no tsumi ga nai.
Subete kare ni oru mono wa, tsumi o okasanai. Subete tsumi o okasu mono wa kare o mita koto mo naku, shitta koto mo nai mono de aru.
Kotachi yo. Dare ni mo madowasarete wa naranai. Kare ga gijin de aru to douyou ni, gi o okonau mono wa gijin de aru.
Tsumi o okasu mono wa, akuma kara deta mono de aru. Akuma wa hajime kara tsumi o okashite irukara de aru. Kami no ko ga arawareta no wa, akuma no waza o horoboshite shimau tame de aru.
Subete kami kara umareta mono wa, tsumi o okasanai. Kami no tane ga, sono hito no uchi ni todomatte irukara de aru. Mata, sono hito wa, kami kara umareta mono de arukara, tsumi o okasu koto ga dekinai.
Kami no ko to akuma no ko to no kubetsu wa, kore ni yotte akiraka de aru. Sunawachi, subete gi o okonawanai mono wa, kami kara deta mono de wa nai. Kyoudai o aisanai mono mo, douyou de aru.
Watashitachi wa tagai ni aishiaubekide aru. Kore ga, anata gata no hajime kara kiite ita otozure de aru.
Kain no you ni natte wa ikenai. Kare wa ashiki mono kara dete, sono kyoudai o koroshita no de aru. Naze kyoudai o koroshita no ka. Kare no waza ga waruku, sono kyoudai no waza wa tadashikattakara de aru.
Kyoudaitachi yo. Yo ga anatagata o nikunde mo, odoroku ni wa oyobanai.
Watashitachi wa, kyoudai o aishite iru no de, shi kara inochi e utsutte kita koto o, shitte iru. Aisanai mono wa, shi no uchi ni todomatte iru.
Anata gata ga shitte iru toori, subete kyoudai o nikumu mono wa hitogoroshi de ari, hitogoroshi wa subete, sono uchi ni eien no inochi o todomete wa inai.
Shu wa, watashitachi no tame ni inochi o sutete kudasatta. Sore ni yotte, watashitachi wa ai to iu koto o shitta. Sore yue ni, watashitachi mo mata, kyoudai no tame ni inochi o suterubekide aru.
Yo no tomi o motte inagara, kyoudai ga komatte iru no o mite, awaremi no kokoro o tojiru mono ni wa, dou shite kami no ai ga, kare no uchi ni arou ka.
Kotachi yo. Watashitachi wa kotoba ya kuchisaki dake de aisuru no de wa naku, okonai to shinjitsu to o motte aishiaou de wa nai ka.
Sore ni yotte, watashitachi ga shinri kara deta mono de aru koto ga wakaru. Soshite, kami no mimae ni kokoro o yasunjite iyou.
Naze nara, tatoi watashitachi no kokoro ni semerareru you na koto ga atte mo, kami wa watashitachi no kokoro yori mo ooinaru kata de atte, subete o gozonjidakara de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Moshi kokoro ni semerareru you na koto ga nakereba, watashitachi wa kami ni taishite kakushin o motsu koto ga dekiru.
Soshite, negaimotomeru mono wa, nan de mo itadakeru no de aru. Sore wa, watashitachi ga kami no imashime o mamori, mikokoro ni kanau koto o, okonatte irukara de aru.
Sono imashime to iu no wa, kami no ko Iesu Kirisuto no mina o shinji, watashitachi ni meijirareta you ni, tagai ni aishiaubeki koto de aru.
Kami no imashime o mamoru hito wa, kami ni ori, kami mo mata sono hito ni imasu. Soshite, kami ga watashitachi no uchi ni imasu koto wa, kami ga watashitachi ni tamawatta mitama ni yotte shiru no de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Subete no rei o shinjiru koto wa shinaide, sorera no rei ga kami kara deta mono de aru ka dou ka, tameshi nasai. Ooku no nise yogensha ga yo ni dete kite irukara de aru.
Anata gata wa, kou shite kami no rei o shiru no de aru. Sunawachi, Iesu Kirisuto ga nikutai o totte korareta koto o kokuhaku suru rei wa, subete kami kara dete iru mono de ari,
Iesu o kokuhaku shinai rei wa, subete kami kara dete iru mono de wa nai. Kore wa, hanKirisuto no rei de aru. Anata gata wa, sore ga kuruto kanete kiite itaga, ima yasude ni yo ni kite iru.
Kotachi yo. Anata gata wa kami kara deta mono de atte, karera ni uchikatta no de aru. Anata gata no uchi ni imasu no wa, yo ni aru mono yori mo ooinaru mono na no de aru.
Karera wa yo kara deta mono de aru. Dakara, karera wa yo no koto o katari, yo mo karera no iu koto o kiku no de aru.
Shikashi, watashitachi wa kami kara deta mono de aru. Kami o shitte iru mono wa, watashitachi no iu koto o kiki, kami kara denai mono wa, watashitachi no iu koto o kikanai. Kore ni yotte, watashitachi wa, shinri no rei to mayoi no rei to no kubetsu o shiru no de aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Watashitachi wa tagai ni aishiaou de wa nai ka. Ai wa, kami kara deta mono na no de aru. Subete aisuru mono wa, kami kara umareta mono de atte, kami o shitte iru.
Aisanai mono wa, kami o shiranai. Kami wa ai de aru.
Kami wa sono hitori ko o yo ni tsukawashi, kare ni yotte watashitachi o ikiru you ni shite kudasatta. Sore ni yotte, watashitachi ni taisuru kami no ai ga akiraka ni sareta no de aru.
Watashitachi ga kami o aishita no de wa naku, kami ga watashitachi o aishite kudasatte, watashitachi no tsumi no tame ni aganai no sonaemono to shite, miko o otsukawashi ni natta. Koko ni ai ga aru.
Aisuru monotachi yo. Kami ga kono you ni watashitachi o aishite kudasatta no de arukara, watashitachi mo tagai ni aishiaubekide aru.
Kami o mita mono wa, mada hitori mo inai. Moshi watashitachi ga tagai ni aishiaunara, kami wa watashitachi no uchi ni imashi, kami no ai ga watashitachi no uchi ni mattou sareru no de aru.
Kami ga mitama o watashitachi ni tamawatta koto ni yotte, watashitachi ga kami ni ori, kami ga watashitachi ni imasu koto o shiru.
Watashitachi wa, chichi ga miko o yo no sukuinushi to shite otsukawashi ni natta no o mite, sono akashi o suru no de aru.
Moshi hito ga, Iesu o kami no ko to kokuhaku sureba, kami wa sono hito no uchi ni imashi, sono hito wa kami no uchi ni iru no de aru.
Watashitachi wa, kami ga watashitachi ni taishite motte orareru ai o shiri, katsu shinjite iru. Kami wa ai de aru. Ai no uchi ni iru mono wa, kami ni ori, kami mo kare ni imasu.
Watashitachi mo konoyo ni atte kare no you ni ikite iru no de, sabaki no hi ni kakushin o motte tatsu koto ga dekiru. Sono koto ni yotte, ai ga watashitachi ni mattou sarete iru no de aru.
Ai ni wa osore ga nai. Kanzen na ai wa osore o torinozoku. Osore ni wa korashime ga tomonai, katsu osoreru mono ni wa, ai ga mattou sarete inaikara de aru.
Watashitachi ga aishiau no wa, kami ga mazu watashitachi o aishite kudasattakara de aru.
"Kami o aishite iru" to iinagara kyoudai o nikumu mono wa, itsuwarimono de aru. Genni mite iru kyoudai o aisanai mono wa, me ni mienai kami o aisuru koto wa dekinai.
Kami o aisuru mono wa, kyoudai o mo aisubekide aru. Kono imashime o, watashitachi wa kami kara sazukatte iru.
Subete Iesu no Kirisuto de aru koto o shinjiru mono wa, kami kara umareta mono de aru. Subete unde kudasatta kata o aisuru mono wa, sono kata kara umareta mono o mo aisuru no de aru.
Kami o aishite sono imashime o okonaeba, sore ni yotte watashitachi wa, kami no kotachi o aishite iru koto o shiru no de aru.
Kami o aisuru to wa, sunawachi, sono imashime o mamoru koto de aru. Soshite, sono imashime wa muzukashii mono de wa nai.
Naze nara, subete kami kara umareta mono wa, yo ni katsukara de aru. Soshite, watashitachi no shinkou koso, yo ni katashimeta shouri no chikara de aru.
Yo ni katsu mono wa dare ka. Iesu o kami no ko to shinjiru mono de wa nai ka.
Kono Iesu Kirisuto wa, mizu to chi to o tootte korareta kata de aru. Mizu ni yoru dake de wa naku, mizu to chi to ni yotte korareta no de aru. Sono akashi o suru mono wa, mitama de aru. Mitama wa shinri dakara de aru.
Akashi o suru mono ga, mittsu aru.
Mitama to mizu to chi to de aru. Soshite, kono mittsu no mono wa itchi suru.
