Shimeon no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin, Rebi no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin, Isakaru no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin,
Zeburun no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin, Yosefu no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin, Beniyamin no buzoku no uchi, ichi man nisennin ga in o osareta.
Sono nochi, watashi ga mite iruto, miyo, arayuru kokumin, buzoku, minzoku, kokugo no uchi kara, kazoe kirenai hodo no oozei no gunshuu ga, shiroi koromo o mi ni matoi, shuro no eda o te ni motte, miza to kohitsuji to no mae ni tachi,
Oogoe de sakende itta, "Sukui wa, miza ni imasu warera no kami to kohitsuji kara kitaru".
Mitsukai tachi wa mina, miza to chouroutachi to yontsu no ikimono to no mawari ni tatte itaga, miza no mae ni hirefushi, kami o haishite itta,
"Amen,san bi, eikou, chie, kansha, homare, chikara, ikioi ga, yoyo kagirinaku, warera no kami ni aru you ni, amen".
Chouroutachi no hitori ga, watashi ni mukatte itta, "Kono shiroi koromo o mi ni matotte iru hitobito wa, dare ka. Mata, doko kara kita no ka".
Watashi wa kare ni kotaeta, "Watashi no Shu yo, sore wa anata ga gozonji desu". Suruto, kare wa watashi ni itta, "Karera wa ookina kannan o tootte kita hitotachi de atte, sono koromo o kohitsuji no chi de arai, sore o shiroku shita no de aru.
Sore dakara karera wa, kami no miza no mae ni ori, hiru mo yoru mo sono seijo de kami ni tsukaete iru no de aru. Miza ni imasu kata wa, karera no ue ni makuya o hatte tomo ni sumawarerude arou.
Karera wa, mohaya ueru koto ga naku, kawaku koto mo nai. Taiyou mo ensho mo, karera o okasu koto wa nai.
Miza no shoumen ni imasu kohitsuji wa karera no bokusha to natte, inochi no mizu no izumi ni michibiite kudasarude arou. Mata kami wa, karera no me kara namida o kotogotoku nuguitotte kudasarude arou".
Kohitsuji ga dainana no fuuin o toita toki, han jikan bakari ten ni shizukesa ga atta.
Sore kara watashi wa, kami no mimae ni tatte iru nananin no mitsukai o mita. Soshite, nanatsu no rappa ga karera ni ataerareta.
Mata, betsu no mitsukai ga dete kite, kin no kouro o te ni motte saidan no mae ni tatta. Takusan no kou ga kare ni ataerarete itaga, kore wa, subete no seito no inori ni kuwaete, miza no mae no kin no saidan no ue ni sasageru tame no mono de atta.
Kou no kemuri wa, mitsukai no te kara, seitotachi no inori to tomo ni kami no mimae ni tachinobotta.
Mitsukai wa sono kouro o tori, kore ni saidan no hi o mitashite, chi ni nagetsuketa. Suruto, ooku no raimei to, moromoro no koe to, inazuma to, jishin to ga okotta.
Soko de, nanatsu no rappa o motte iru nananin no mitsukai ga, sore o fuku youi o shita.
Daiichi no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, chi no majitta hyou to hi to ga arawarete, chijou ni futte kita. Soshite, chi no sanbun no ichi ga yake, ki no sanbun no ichi ga yake, mata, subete no aokusa mo yakete shimatta.
Daini no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, hi no moesakatte iru ookina yama no you na mono ga, umi ni nagekomareta. Soshite, umi no sanbun no ichi wa chi to nari,
Umi no naka no tsukurareta ikimono no sanbun no ichi wa shini, fune no sanbun no ichi ga kowasarete shimatta.
Daisan no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, taimatsu no you ni moete iru ookina hoshi ga, sora kara ochite kita. Soshite sore wa, kawa no sanbun no ichi to sono suigen to no ue ni ochita.
Kono hoshi no na wa "Niga yomogi" to ii, mizu no sanbun no ichi ga "Niga yomogi" no you ni nigaku natta. Mizu ga nigaku natta no de, sono tame ni ooku no hito ga shinda.
Daiyon no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, taiyou no sanbun no ichi to, tsuki no sanbun no ichi to, hoshi no sanbun no ichi to ga utarete, korera no mono no sanbun no ichi wa kuraku nari, hiru no sanbun no ichi wa akaruku naku nari, yoru mo onaji you ni natta.
Mata, watashi ga mite iruto, hitowa no washi ga nakazora o tobi, ookina koe de kou iu no o kiita, "Aa, wazawai da, wazawai da, chi ni sumu hitobito wa, wazawai da. Nao sannin no mitsukai ga rappa o fukinarasou to shite iru".
Daigo no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto watashi wa, hitotsu no hoshi ga ten kara chi ni ochite kuru no o mita. Kono hoshi ni, soko shirenu tokoro no ana o hiraku kagi ga ataerareta.
Soshite, kono soko shirenu tokoro no ana ga hirakareta. Suruto, sono ana kara kemuri ga ookina ro no kemuri no you ni tachinobori, sono ana no kemuri de, taiyou mo kuuki mo kuraku natta.
Sono kemuri no naka kara, inago ga chijou ni dete kitaga, chi no sasori ga motte iru you na chikara ga, karera ni ataerareta.
Karera wa, chi no kusa ya subete no aokusa, mata subete no ki o sokonatte wa naranaiga, hitai ni kami no in ga nai hitotachi ni wa gai o kuwaete mo yoi to, iiwatasareta.
Karera wa, ningen o korosu koto wa shinaide, go kagetsu no aida kurushimeru koto dake ga yurusareta. Karera no ataeru kutsuu wa, hito ga sasori ni sasareru toki no you na kutsuu de atta.
Sono toki ni wa, hitobito wa shi o motomete mo ataerarezu, shinitai to negatte mo, shi wa nigete iku no de aru.
Korera no inago wa, shutsujin no youi no totonoerareta uma ni yoku nite ori, sono atama ni wa kin no kanmuri no you na mono o tsuke, sono kao wa ningen no kao no you de ari,
Mata, sono kami no ke wa onna no kami no you de ari, sono ha wa shishi no ha no you de atta.
Mata, tetsu no muneate no you na muneate o tsukete ori, sono hane no oto wa, uma ni hikarete senjou ni isogu ooku no sensha no hibiki no you de atta.
Sono ue, sasori no you na o to hari to o motte iru. Sono o ni wa, go kagetsu no aida ningen o sokonau chikara ga aru.
Karera wa, soko shirenu tokoro no tsukai o ou ni itadaite ori, sono na o Heburu go de Abadon to ii, Girishiya go de wa Aporuon to iu.
Daiichi no wazawai wa, sugisatta. Miyo, kono nochi, nao futatsu no wazawai ga kuru.
Dairoku no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, hitotsu no koe ga, kami no mimae ni aru kin no saidan no yontsu no tsuno kara dete,
Rappa o motte iru dairoku no mitsukai ni kou yobikakeru no o, watashi wa kiita. "DaiYuufurate gawa no hotori ni tsunagarete iru yonnin no mitsukai o, toite yare".
Suruto, sono toki, sono hi, sono tsuki, sono toshi ni sonaete okareta yonnin no mitsukai ga, ningen no sanbun no ichi o korosu tame ni, tokihanatareta.
Kiheitai no kazu wa ni oku de atta. Watashi wa sono kazu o kiita.
Soshite, maboroshi no naka de, sorera no uma to sore ni notte iru monotachi to o miruto, notte iru monotachi wa, hi no iro to seigyokushoku to iou no iro no muneate o tsukete ita. Soshite, sorera no uma no atama wa shishi no atama no you de atte, sono kuchi kara hi to kemuri to iou to ga, dete ita.
Kono mittsu no saigai, sunawachi, karera no kuchi kara dete kuru hi to kemuri to iou to ni yotte, ningen no sanbun no ichi wa korosarete shimatta.
Uma no chikara wa sono kuchi to o to ni aru. Sono o wa hebi ni nite ite, sore ni atama ga ari, sono atama de hito ni gai o kuwaeru no de aru.
Korera no saigai de korosarezu ni nokotta hitobito wa, jibun no te de tsukutta mono ni tsuite, kuiaratameyou to sezu, mata akurei no tagui ya, kin, gin, dou, ishi, ki de tsukurare, miru koto mo kiku koto mo aruku koto mo dekinai guuzou o reihai shite, yameyou to mo shinakatta.
Mata, karera wa, sono okashita satsujin ya, majinai ya, fuhinkou ya, nusumi o kuiaratameyou to shinakatta.
Watashi wa, mou hitori no tsuyoi mitsukai ga, kumo ni tsutsumarete, ten kara orite kuru no o mita. Sono atama ni, niji o itadaki, sono kao wa taiyou no you de, sono ashi wa hi no hashira no you de atta.
Kare wa, hirakareta chiisana makimono o te ni motte ita. Soshite, migiashi o umi no ue ni, hidariashi o chi no ue ni fumioroshite,
Shishi ga hoeru you ni oogoe de sakenda. Kare ga sakebuto, nanatsu no kaminari ga onoono sono koe o hasshita.
Nanatsu no kaminari ga koe o hasshita toki, watashi wa sore o kakitomeyou to shita. Suruto, ten kara koe ga atte, "Nanatsu no kaminari no katatta koto o fuuin seyo. Sore o kakitomeru na" to iu no o kiita.
Sore kara, umi to chi no ue ni tatte iru no o watashi ga mita ano mitsukai wa, ten ni mukete migite o age,
Ten to sono naka ni aru mono, chi to sono naka ni aru mono, umi to sono naka ni aru mono o tsukuri, yoyo kagirinaku ikite orareru kata o sashite chikatta, "Mou toki ga nai.
Dainana no mitsukai ga fukinarasu rappa no oto ga suru toki ni wa, kami ga sono shimobe, yogensha tachi ni otsuge ni natta toori, kami no okugi wa jouju sareru".
Suruto, mae ni ten kara kikoete kita koe ga, mata watashi ni katatte itta, "Saa itte, umi to chi to no ue ni tatte iru mitsukai no te ni hirakarete iru makimono o, uketori nasai".
Soko de, watashi wa sono mitsukai no moto ni itte, "Sono chiisana makimono o kudasai" to itta. Suruto, kare wa itta, "Totte, sore o tabete shimai nasai. Anata no hara ni wa nigaiga, kuchi ni wa mitsu no you ni amai".
Watashi wa mitsukai no te kara sono chiisana makimono o uketotte tabete shimatta. Suruto, watashi no kuchi ni wa mitsu no you ni amakattaga, sore o tabetara, hara ga nigaku natta.
Sono toki, "Anata wa, mou ichido, ooku no minzoku, kokumin, kokugo, outachi ni tsuite, yogen seneba naranai" to iu koe ga shita.
Sore kara, watashi wa tsue no you na hakari zao o ataerarete, kou meijirareta, "Saa tatte, kami no seijo to saidan to, soko de reihai shite iru hitobito to o, hakari nasai.
Seijo no soto no niwa wa sono mama ni shite oki nasai. Sore o hakatte wa naranai. Soko wa ihoujin ni ataerareta tokoro dakara. Karera wa, yonjuu ni kagetsu no aida kono sei naru miyako o fuminijirude arou.
Soshite watashi wa, watashi no futari no shounin ni, aranuno o kite, sen nihyaku rokujuu nichi no aida yogen suru koto o yurusou".
Karera wa, zenchi no Shu no mimae ni tatte iru nihon no oribu no ki, mata, futatsu no shokudai de aru.
Moshi karera ni gai o kuwaeyou to suru mono ga areba, karera no kuchi kara hi ga dete, sono teki o horobosude arou. Moshi karera ni gai o kuwaeyou to suru mono ga areba, sono mono wa kono you ni korosareneba naranai.
Yogen o shite iru kikan, karera wa, ten o tojite ame o furasenai you ni suru chikara o motte iru. Sarani mata, mizu o chi ni kae, nani do de mo omou mama ni, arayuru saigai de chi o utsu chikara o motte iru.
Soshite, karera ga sono akashi o oeruto, soko shirenu tokoro kara nobotte kuru kemono ga, karera to tatakatte uchikachi, karera o korosu.
Karera no shitai wa Sodomu ya, Ejiputo ni tatoerarete iru ooinaru miyako no oodoori ni sarasareru. Karera no Shu mo, kono miyako de juujika ni tsukerareta no de aru.
Iroiro na minzoku, buzoku, kokugo, kokumin ni zokusuru hitobito ga, mikka han no aida, karera no shitai o nagameruga, sono shitai o haka ni osameru koto wa yurusanai.
Chi ni sumu hitobito wa, karera no koto de yorokobitanoshimi, tagai ni okurimono o shiau. Kono futari no yogensha wa, chi ni sumu monotachi o nayamashitakara de aru.
Mikka han no nochi, inochi no iki ga, kami kara dete karera no naka ni hairi, soshite, karera ga tachiagatta no de, sore o mita hitobito wa hijou na kyoufu ni osowareta.
Sono toki, ten kara ookina koe ga shite, "Koko ni nobotte ki nasai" to iu no o, karera wa kiita. Soshite, karera wa kumo ni notte ten ni nobotta. Karera no teki wa sore o mita.
Kono toki, daijishin ga okotte, miyako no juubun no ichi wa taore, sono jishin de nanasennin ga shini, ikinokotta hitobito wa odorokiosorete, ten no kami ni eikou o kishita.
Daini no wazawai wa, sugisatta. Miyo, daisan no wazawai ga sugu ni kuru.
Dainana no mitsukai ga, rappa o fukinarashita. Suruto, ookina koegoe ga ten ni okotte itta, "Konoyo no kuni wa, warera no Shu to sono Kirisuto to no kuni to natta. Shu wa yoyo kagirinaku shihai nasarude arou".
Soshite, kami no mimae de za ni tsuite iru nijuu yonnin no chourou wa, hirefushi, kami o haishite itta,
"Ima imashi, mukashi imaseru, zennousha ni shite Shu naru kami yo. Ooinaru michikara o furutte shihai nasatta koto o, kansha shimasu.
Shokokumin wa ikarikuruimashitaga, anata mo ikari o arawasaremashita. Soshite, shinin o sabaki, anata no shimobe naru yogensha, seito, chiisaki mono mo, ooinaru mono mo, subete mina o osoreru monotachi ni mukui o atae, mata, chi o horobosu monodomo o horoboshite kudasaru toki ga kimashita".
Soshite, ten ni aru kami no seijo ga hirakete, seijo no naka ni keiyaku no hako ga mieta. Mata, inazuma to, moromoro no koe to, raimei to, jishin to ga okori, ootsubu no hyou ga futta.
Mata, ooinaru shirushi ga ten ni arawareta. Hitori no onna ga taiyou o kite, ashi no shita ni tsuki o fumi, sono atama ni juu ni no hoshi no kanmuri o kabutte ita.
Kono onna wa ko o yadoshite ori, umi no kurushimi to nayami to no tame ni, nakisakende ita.
Mata, mou hitotsu no shirushi ga ten ni arawareta. Miyo, ookina, akai ryuu ga ita. Sore ni nanatsu no atama to juu no tsuno to ga ari, sono atama ni nanatsu no kanmuri o kabutte ita.
Sono o wa ten no hoshi no sanbun no ichi o hakiyose, sorera o chi ni nageotoshita. Ryuu wa ko o umou to shite iru onna no mae ni tachi, umaretanara, sono ko o kui tsukusou to kamaete ita.
Onna wa otokonoko o undaga, kare wa tetsu no tsue o motte subete no kokumin o osamerubeki mono de aru. Kono ko wa, kami no mimoto ni, sono miza no tokoro ni, hikiagerareta.
Onna wa arano e nigete itta. Soko ni wa, kanojo ga sen nihyaku rokujuu nichi no aida yashinawareru you ni, kami no youi sareta basho ga atta.
Sate, ten de wa tatakai ga okotta. Mikaeru to sono mitsukai tachi to ga, ryuu to tatakatta no de aru. Ryuu mo sono tsukaitachi mo ousen shitaga,
Katenakatta. Soshite, mohaya ten ni wa karera no oru tokoro ga nakunatta.
Kono kyodai na ryuu, sunawachi, akuma to ka, Satan to ka yobare, zensekai o madowasu toshi o heta hebi wa, chi ni nageotosare, sono tsukaitachi mo, morotomo ni nageotosareta.
Sono toki watashi wa, ookina koe ga ten de kou iu no o kiita, "Ima ya, warera no kami no sukui to chikara to kuni to, kami no Kirisuto no ken'i to wa, arawareta. Warera no kyoudaira o uttaeru mono, yoruhiru warera no kami nomi ma e de karera o uttaeru mono wa, nageotosareta.
Kyoudaitachi wa, kohitsuji no chi to karera no akashi no kotoba to ni yotte, kare ni uchikachi, shi ni itaru made mo sono inochi o oshimanakatta.
Sore yue ni, ten to sono naka ni sumu monotachi yo, ooini yorokobe. Shikashi, chi to umi yo, omaetachi wa wazawai de aru. Akuma ga, jibun no toki ga mijikai no o shiri, hageshii ikari o motte, omaetachi no tokoro ni kudatte kitakara de aru".
Ryuu wa, jibun ga chijou ni nageotosareta to shiruto, danshi o unda onna o oikaketa.
Shikashi, onna wa jibun no basho de aru arano ni tonde iku tame ni, ookina washi no futatsu no tsubasa o ataerareta. Soshite soko de hebi kara nogarete, ichi nen, ni nen, mata, hantoshi no aida, yashinawareru koto ni natte ita.
Hebi wa onna no ushiro ni mizu o kawa no you ni, kuchi kara hakidashite, onna o oshinagasou to shita.
Shikashi, chi wa onna o tasuketa. Sunawachi, chi wa sono kuchi o hiraite, ryuu ga kuchi kara hakidashita kawa o nomihoshita.
Ryuu wa, onna ni taishite ikari o hasshi, onna no nokori no kora, sunawachi, kami no imashime o mamori, Iesu no akashi o motte iru monotachi ni taishite, tatakai o idomu tame ni, dete itta. [18] Soshite, umi no suna no ue ni tatta.
Watashi wa mata, ichipiki no kemono ga umi kara nobotte kuru no o mita. Sore ni wa tsuno ga juupon, atama ga nanatsu ari, sorera no tsuno ni wa juu no kanmuri ga atte, atama ni wa kami o kegasu na ga tsuite ita.
Watashi no mita kono kemono wa hyou ni nite ori, sono ashi wa kuma no ashi no you de, sono kuchi wa shishi no kuchi no you de atta. Ryuu wa jibun no chikara to kurai to ooinaru ken'i to o, kono kemono ni ataeta.
Sono atama no hitotsu ga, shinu hodo no kizu o uketaga, sono chimeiteki na kizu mo naotte shimatta. Soko de, zenchi no hitobito wa odorokiosorete, sono kemono ni shitagai,
Mata, ryuu ga sono ken'i o kemono ni ataeta no de, hitobito wa ryuu o ogami, sarani, sono kemono o ogande itta, "Dare ga, kono kemono ni hitteki shi eyou ka. Dare ga, kore to tatakau koto ga dekiyou ka".
Kono kemono ni wa, mata, taigen o haki kegashigoto o kataru kuchi ga ataerare, yonjuu ni kagetsu no aida katsudou suru ken'i ga ataerareta.
Soko de, kare wa kuchi o hiraite kami o kegashi, kami no mina to, sono makuya, sunawachi, ten ni sumu monotachi to o kegashita.
Soshite kare wa, seito ni tatakai o idonde kore ni katsu koto o yurusare, sarani, subete no buzoku, minzoku, kokugo, kokumin o shihai suru ken'i o ataerareta.
Chi ni sumu mono de, hofurareta kohitsuji no inochi no sho ni, sono na o yo no hajime kara shirusarete inai mono wa mina, kono kemono o ogamude arou.
Mimi no aru mono wa, kiku ga yoi.
Toriko ni narubeki mono wa, toriko ni natte iku. Tsurugi de korosu mono wa, mizukara mo tsurugi de korosareneba naranai. Koko ni, seitotachi no nintai to shinkou to ga aru.
Watashi wa mata, hoka no kemono ga chi kara nobotte kuru no o mita. Sore ni wa kohitsuji no you na tsuno ga futatsu atte, ryuu no you ni mono o itta.
Soshite, saki no kemono no motsu subete no kenryoku o sono mae de hatarakaseta. Mata, chi to chi ni sumu hitobito ni, chimeiteki na kizu ga iyasareta saki no kemono o ogamaseta.
Mata, ooinaru shirushi o okonatte, hitobito no mae de hi o ten kara chi ni furaseru koto sae shita.
Sarani, saki no kemono no mae de okonau no o yurusareta shirushi de, chi ni sumu hitobito o madowashi, katsu, tsurugi no kizu o ukete mo nao ikite iru saki no kemono no zou o tsukuru koto o, chi ni sumu hitobito ni meijita.
Sore kara, sono kemono no zou ni iki o fukikonde, sono kemono no zou ga mono o iu koto sae dekiru you ni shi, mata, sono kemono no zou o ogamanai mono o mina korosaseta.
Mata, chiisaki mono ni mo, ooinaru mono ni mo, tomeru mono ni mo, mazushiki mono ni mo, jiyuujin ni mo, dorei ni mo, subete no hitobito ni, sono migi no te aruiha hitai ni kokuin o osase,
Kono kokuin no nai mono wa mina, mono o kau koto mo uru koto mo dekinai you ni shita. Kono kokuin wa, sono kemono no na, mata wa, sono na no suuji no koto de aru.
Koko ni, chie ga hitsuyou de aru. Shiryo no aru mono wa, kemono no suuji o toku ga yoi. Sono suuji to wa, ningen o sasu mono de aru. Soshite, sono suuji wa roppyaku rokujuu roku de aru.
Nao, watashi ga mite iruto, miyo, kohitsuji ga Shion no yama ni tatte ita. Mata, juu yon man yonsen no hitobito ga kohitsuji to tomo ni ori, sono hitai ni kohitsuji no na to sono chichi no na to ga kakarete ita.
Mata watashi wa, oomizu no todoroki no you na, hageshii raimei no you na koe ga, ten kara deru no o kiita. Watashi no kiita sono koe wa, koto o hiku hito ga tategoto o hiku oto no you de mo atta.
Karera wa, miza no mae, yontsu no ikimono to chouroutachi to no mae de, atarashii uta o utatta. Kono uta wa, chi kara aganawareta juu yon man yonsennin no hoka wa, dare mo manabu koto ga dekinakatta.
Karera wa, onna ni fureta koto no nai mono de aru. Karera wa, junketsu na mono de aru. Soshite, kohitsuji no iku tokoro e wa, doko e de mo tsuite iku. Karera wa, kami to kohitsuji to ni sasagerareru hatsuho to shite, ningen no naka kara aganawareta mono de aru.
Karera no kuchi ni wa itsuwari ga naku, karera wa kizu no nai mono de atta.
Watashi wa, mou hitori no mitsukai ga nakazora o tobu no o mita. Kare wa chi ni sumu mono, sunawachi, arayuru kokumin, buzoku, kokugo, minzoku ni nobetsutaeru tame ni, eien no fukuin o tazusaete kite,
Oogoe de itta, "Kami o osore, kami ni eikou o kise yo. Kami no sabaki no toki ga kitakara de aru. Ten to chi to umi to mizu no minamoto to o tsukurareta kata o, fushiogame".
Mata, hoka no daini no mitsukai ga, tsuzuite kite itta, "Taoreta, ooinaru Babiron wa taoreta. Sono fuhinkou ni taisuru hageshii ikari no budoushu o, arayuru kokumin ni nomaseta mono".
Hoka no daisan no mitsukai ga karera ni tsuzuite kite, oogoe de itta, "Ooyoso, kemono to sono zou to o ogami, hitai ya te ni kokuin o ukeru mono wa,
Kami no ikari no sakazuki ni mazemono nashi ni morareta, kami no hageshii ikari no budoushu o nomi, sei naru mitsukai tachi to kohitsuji to no mae de, hi to iou to de kurushimerareru.
Sono kurushimi no kemuri wa yoyo kagirinaku tachinobori, soshite, kemono to sono zou to o ogamu mono, mata, dare de mo sono na no kokuin o ukete iru mono wa, hiru mo yoru mo yasumi ga erarenai.
Koko ni, kami no imashime o mamori, Iesu o shinjiru shinkou o mochi tsuzukeru seito no nintai ga aru".
Mata watashi wa, ten kara no koe ga kou iu no o kiita, "Kakishiruse, 'Ima kara nochi, Shu ni atte shinu shinin wa saiwai de aru' ". Mitama mo iu, "Shikari, karera wa sono rouku o tokarete yasumi, sono waza wa karera ni tsuite iku".
Mata mite iruto, miyo, shiroi kumo ga atte, sono kumo no ue ni hito no ko no you na mono ga zashite ori, atama ni wa kin no kanmuri o itadaki, te ni wa surudoi kama o motte ita.
Suruto, mou hitori no mitsukai ga seijo kara dete kite, kumo no ue ni zashite iru mono ni mukatte oogoe de sakenda, "Kama o irete karitori nasai. Chi no kokumotsu wa mattaku minori, karitorubeki toki ga kita".
Kumo no ue ni zashite iru mono wa, sono kama o chi ni nageireta. Suruto, chi no mono ga karitorareta.
Mata, mou hitori no mitsukai ga, ten no seijo kara dete kitaga, kare mo mata surudoi kama o motte ita.
Sarani, mou hitori no mitsukai de, hi o shihai suru ken'i o motte iru mono ga, saidan kara dete kite, surudoi kama o motsu mitsukai ni mukai, oogoe de itta, "Sono surudoi kama o chi ni irete, chi no budou no fusa o kariatsume nasai. Budou no mi ga sudeni jukushite irukara".
Soko de, mitsukai wa sono kama o chi ni nageirete, chi no budou o kariatsume, kami no hageshii ikari no ookina saka bune ni nagekonda.
Soshite, sono saka bune ga miyako no soto de fumareta. Suruto, chi ga saka bune kara nagaredete, uma no kutsuwa ni todoku hodo ni nari, issen roppyaku chou ni watatte hirogatta.
Mata watashi wa, ten ni ooinaru odorokubeki hoka no shirushi o mita. Nananin no mitsukai ga, saigo no nanatsu no saigai o tazusaete ita. Korera no saigai de kami no hageshii ikari ga sono chouten ni tassuru no de aru.
Mata watashi wa, hi no majitta garasu no umi no you na mono o mita. Soshite, kono garasu no umi no soba ni, kemono to sono zou to sono na no suuji to ni uchikatta hitobito ga, kami no tategoto o te ni shite tatte iru no o mita.
Karera wa, kami no shimobe Moose no uta to kohitsuji no uta to o utatte itta, "Zennousha ni shite Shu naru kami yo. Anata no miwaza wa, ooinaru, mata odorokubeki mono de arimasu. Banmin no ou yo, anata no michi wa tadashiku, katsu shinjitsu de arimasu.
Shu yo, anata o osorezu, mina o hometataenai mono ga, arimashou ka. Anata dake ga sei naru kata de ari, arayuru kokumin wa kite, anata o fushiogamudeshou. Anata no tadashii sabaki ga, arawareru ni itattakara de arimasu".
Sono nochi, watashi ga mite iruto, ten ni aru, akashi no makuya no seijo ga hirakare,
Sono seijo kara, nanatsu no saigai o tazusaete iru nananin no mitsukai ga, kegare no nai, hikarikagayaku amanuno o mi ni matoi, kin no obi o mune ni shimete, dete kita.
Soshite, yontsu no ikimono no hitotsu ga, yoyo kagirinaku ikite orareru kami no hageshii ikari no michita nanatsu no kin no hachi o, shichinin no mitsukai ni watashita.
Suruto, seijo wa kami no eikou to sono chikara to kara tachinoboru kemuri de mitasare, shichinin no mitsukai no nanatsu no saigai ga owatte shimau made wa, dare mo seijo ni hairu koto ga dekinakatta.
Sore kara, ookina koe ga seijo kara dete, shichinin no mitsukai ni mukai, "Saa itte, kami no hageshii ikari no nanatsu no hachi o, chi ni katamukeyo" to iu no o kiita.
Soshite, daiichi no mono ga dete itte, sono hachi o chi ni katamuketa. Suruto, kemono no kokuin o motsu hitobito to, sono zou o ogamu hitobito to no karada ni, hidoi akusei no deki mono ga dekita.
Daini no mono ga, sono hachi o umi ni katamuketa. Suruto, umi wa shinin no chi no you ni natte, sono naka no ikimono ga mina shinde shimatta.
Daisan no mono ga sono hachi o kawa to mizu no minamoto to ni katamuketa. Suruto, mina chi ni natta.
Sore kara, mizu o tsukasadoru mitsukai ga kou iu no o, kiita, "Ima imashi, mukashi imaseru sei naru mono yo. Kono you ni osadame ni natta anata wa, tadashii kata de arimasu.
Seito to yogensha to no chi o nagashita monotachi ni, chi o onomase ni narimashitaga, sore wa touzen no koto de arimasu".
Watashi wa mata saidan ga kou iu no o kiita, "Zennousha ni shite Shu naru kami yo. Shikari, anata no sabaki wa shinjitsu de, katsu tadashii sabaki de arimasu".
Daiyon no mono ga, sono hachi o taiyou ni katamuketa. Suruto, taiyou wa hi de hitobito o yaku koto o yurusareta.
Hitobito wa, hageshii ennetsu de yakaretaga, korera no saigai o shihai suru kami no mina o kegashi, kuiaratamete kami ni eikou o kisuru koto o shinakatta.
Daigo no mono ga, sono hachi o kemono no za ni katamuketa. Suruto, kemono no kuni wa kuraku nari, hitobito wa kutsuu no amari shita o kami,
Sono kutsuu to deki mono to no yue ni, ten no kami o norotta. Soshite, jibun no okonai o kuiaratamenakatta.
Dairoku no mono ga, sono hachi o daiYuufurate gawa ni katamuketa. Suruto, sono mizu wa, hi no deru hou kara kuru outachi ni taishi michi o sonaeru tame ni, karete shimatta.
Mata miruto, ryuu no kuchi kara, kemono no kuchi kara, nise yogensha no kuchi kara, kaeru no you na mittsu no kegareta rei ga dete kita.
Korera wa, shirushi o okonau akurei no rei de atte, zensekai no outachi no tokoro ni iki, karera o shoushuu shitaga, sore wa, zennou naru kami no ooinaru hi ni, tatakai o suru tame de atta.
(miyo, watashi wa nusubito no you ni kuru. Hadaka no mama de arukanai you ni, mata, hadaka no haji o mirarenai you ni, me o samashi kimono o mi ni tsukete iru mono wa, saiwai de aru.)
Mittsu no rei wa, Heburu go de Harumagedon to iu tokoro ni, outachi o shoushuu shita.
Dainana no mono ga, sono hachi o kuuchuu ni katamuketa. Suruto, ookina koe ga seijo no naka kara, miza kara dete, "Koto wa sudeni natta" to itta.
Suruto, inazuma to, moromoro no koe to, raimei to ga okori, mata hageshii jishin ga atta. Sore wa ningen ga chijou ni arawarete irai, katsute nakatta you na mono de, sore hodo ni hageshii jishin de atta.
Ooinaru miyako wa mittsu ni sakare, shokokumin no machimachi wa taoreta. Kami wa ooinaru Babiron o omoiokoshi, kore ni kami no hageshii ikari no budoushu no sakazuki o ataerareta.
Shimajima wa mina nigesari, yamayama wa mienaku natta.
Mata ichi taranto no omosa hodo no ookina hyou ga, ten kara hitobito no ue ni futte kita. Hitobito wa, kono hyou no saigai no yue ni kami o norotta. Sono saigai ga, hijou ni ookikattakara de aru.
Sore kara, nanatsu no hachi o motsu nananin no mitsukai no hitori ga kite, watashi ni katatte itta, "Saa, ki nasai. Ooku no mizu no ue ni suwatte iru ooinpu ni taisuru sabaki o, miseyou.
Chi no outachi wa kono onna to kan'in o okonai, chi ni sumu hitobito wa kono onna no kan'in no budoushu ni yoishirete iru".
Mitsukai wa, watashi o mitama ni kanjita mama, arano e tsurete itta. Watashi wa, soko de hitori no onna ga akai kemono ni notte iru no o mita. Sono kemono wa kami o kegasu kazukazu no na de ooware, mata, sore ni nanatsu no atama to juu no tsuno to ga atta.
Kono onna wa murasaki to aka no koromo o matoi, kin to houseki to shinju to de mi o kazari, nikumubeki mono to jibun no kan'in no kegare to de michite iru kin no sakazuki o te ni mochi,
Sono hitai ni wa, hitotsu no na ga shirusarete ita. Sore wa okugi de atte, "Ooinaru Babiron, inpudomo to chi no nikumubeki monora to no haha" to iu no de atta.
Watashi wa, kono onna ga seito no chi to Iesu no shounin no chi ni yoishirete iru no o mita. Kono onna o mita toki, watashi wa hijou ni odoroki ayashinda.
Suruto, mitsukai wa watashi ni itta, "Naze sonna ni odoroku no ka. Kono onna no okugi to, onna o nosete iru nanatsu no atama to juu no tsuno no aru kemono no okugi to o, hanashite ageyou.
Anata no mita kemono wa, mukashi wa itaga, ima wa orazu, soshite, yagate soko shirenu tokoro kara nobotte kite, tsuini wa horobi ni itaru mono de aru. Chi ni sumu mono no uchi, yo no hajime kara inochi no sho ni na o shirusarete inai monotachi wa, kono kemono ga, mukashi wa itaga ima wa orazu, yagate kuru no o mite, odoroki ayashimude arou.
Koko ni, chie no aru kokoro ga hitsuyou de aru. Nanatsu no atama wa, kono onna no suwatte iru nanatsu no yama de ari, mata, shichinin no ou no koto de aru.
Sono uchi no gonin wa sudeni taore, hitori wa ima ori, mou hitori wa, mada kite inai. Sore ga kureba, shibaraku no aida dake oru koto ni natte iru.
Mukashi wa itaga ima wa inai to iu kemono wa, sunawachi daihachi no mono de aruga, mata sore wa, kano nananin no naka no hitori de atte, tsuini wa horobi ni itaru mono de aru.
Anata no mita juu no tsuno wa, juunin no ou no koto de atte, karera wa mada kuni o ukete wa inaiga, kemono to tomo ni, hitotoki dake ou to shite no ken'i o ukeru.
Karera wa kokoro o hitotsu ni shite iru. Soshite, jibuntachi no chikara to ken'i to o kemono ni ataeru.
Karera wa kohitsuji ni tatakai o idonde kuruga, kohitsuji wa, Shu no Shu, ou no ou de arukara, karera ni uchikatsu. Mata, kohitsuji to tomo ni iru mesareta, erabareta, chuujitsu na monotachi mo, shouri o eru".
Mitsukai wa mata, watashi ni itta, "Anata no mita mizu, sunawachi, inpu no suwatte iru tokoro wa, arayuru minzoku, gunshuu, kokumin, kokugo de aru.
Anata no mita juu no tsuno to kemono to wa, kono inpu o nikumi, mijime na mono ni shi, hadaka ni shi, kanojo no niku o kui, hi de yaki tsukusude arou.
Kami wa, mikotoba ga jouju suru toki made, karera no kokoro no naka ni, mimune o okonai, omoi o hitotsu ni shi, karera no shihaiken o kemono ni ataeru omoi o motsu you ni saretakara de aru.
Anata no mita ka no onna wa, chi no outachi o shihai suru ooinaru miyako no koto de aru".
Kono nochi, watashi wa, mou hitori no mitsukai ga, ooinaru ken'i o motte, ten kara orite kuru no o mita. Chi wa kare no eikou ni yotte akaruku sareta.
Kare wa chikarazuyoi koe de sakende itta, "Taoreta, ooinaru Babiron wa taoreta. Soshite, sore wa akuma no sumu tokoro, arayuru kegareta rei no sou kutsu, mata, arayuru kegareta nikumubeki tori no sou kutsu to natta.
Subete no kokumin wa, kanojo no kan'in ni taisuru hageshii ikari no budoushu o nomi, chi no outachi wa kanojo to kan'in o okonai, chijou no shounintachi wa, kanojo no kyokudo no zeitaku ni yotte tomi o etakara de aru".
Watashi wa mata, mou hitotsu no koe ga ten kara deru no o kiita, "Watashi no tami yo. Kanojo kara hanaresatte, sono tsumi ni azukaranai you ni shi, sono saigai ni makikomarenai you ni seyo.
Kanojo no tsumi wa tsumoritsutte ten ni tasshite ori, kami wa sono fugi no okonai o oboete orareru.
Kanojo ga shita toori ni kanojo ni shikaeshi, sono shiwaza ni oujite ni bai ni houfuku o shi, kanojo ga mazete ireta sakazuki no naka ni, sono bai no ryou o, irete yare.
Kanojo ga mizukara takaburi, zeitaku o hoshiimama ni shita no de, sore ni taishite, onaji hodo no kurushimi to kanashimi to o ajiwawasete yare. Kanojo wa kokoro no naka de 'Watashi wa joou no kurai ni tsuite iru mono de atte, yamome de wa nai no dakara, kanashimi o shiranai' to itte iru.
Sore yue, samazama no saigai ga, shi to kanashimi to kikin to ga, ichi nichi no uchi ni kanojo o osoi, soshite, kanojo wa hi de yakarete shimau. Kanojo o sabaku Shu naru kami wa, chikarazuyoi kata na no de aru.
Kanojo to kan'in o okonai, zeitaku o hoshiimama ni shite ita chi no outachi wa, kanojo ga yakareru hi no kemuri o mite, kanojo no tame ni mune o utte nakikanashimi,
Kanojo no kurushimi ni osore o idaki, tooku ni tatte iude arou, 'Aa, wazawai da, ooinaru miyako, fuo no miyako, Babiron wa, wazawai da. Omae ni taisuru sabaki wa, isshun ni shite kita'.
Mata, chi no shounintachi mo kanojo no tame ni nakikanashimu. Mohaya, karera no shouhin o kau mono ga, hitori mo naikara de aru.
Sono shouhin wa, kin, gin, houseki, shinju, asanuno, murasakinuno, kinu, hinuno, kakushu no kouboku, kakushu no zouge zaiku, kouka na mokuzai, dou, tetsu, dairiseki nado no utsuwa,
Nikkei, kouryou, kou, nioi abura, nyuukou, budoushu, oribu yu, mugiko, mugi, ushi, hitsuji, uma, kuruma, dorei, soshite jinshin nado de aru.
Omae no kokoro no yorokobi de atta kudamono wa nakunari, arayuru hade na, hanayaka na mono wa omae kara kiesatta. Sorera no mono wa mohaya mirarenai.
Korera no shinajina o utte, kanojo kara tomi o eta shounin wa, kanojo no kurushimi ni osore o idaite tooku ni tachi, nakikanashinde iu,
'Aa, wazawai da, asanuno to murasakinuno to hinuno o matoi, kin ya houseki ya shinju de mi o kazatte ita ooinaru miyako wa, wazawai da.
Kore hodo no tomi ga, isshun ni shite mu ni kishite shimau to wa'. Mata, subete no senchou, koukaisha, suifu, subete umi de hataraite iru hitotachi wa, tooku ni tachi,
Kanojo ga yakareru hi no kemuri o mite, sakende iu, 'Kore hodo no ooinaru miyako wa, doko ni arou'.
Karera wa atama ni chiri o kaburi, nakikanashinde sakebu, 'Aa, wazawai da, kono ooinaru miyako wa, wazawai da. Sono ogori ni yotte, umi ni fune o motsu subete no hito ga tomi o ete ita no ni, kono miyako mo isshun ni shite mu ni kishite shimatta'.
Ten yo, seitotachi yo, shitotachi yo, yogensha tachi yo. Kono miyako ni tsuite ooini yorokobe. Kami wa, anata gata no tame ni, kono miyako o sabakareta no de aru".
Suruto, hitori no chikarazuyoi mitsukai ga, ookina hikiusu no you na ishi o mochiage, sore o umi ni nagekonde itta, "Ooinaru miyako Babiron wa, kono you ni hageshiku uchitaosare, soshite, mattaku sugata o keshite shimau.
Mata, omae no naka de wa, tategoto o hiku mono, uta o utau mono, fue o fuku mono, rappa o fukinarasu mono no gaku no ne wa mattaku kikarezu, arayuru shigoto no shokunintachi mo mattaku sugata o keshi, mata, hikiusu no oto mo, mattaku kikarenai.
Mata, omae no naka de wa, akari mo tomosarezu, hanamuko, hanayome no koe mo kikarenai. To iu no wa, omae no shounintachi wa chijou de seiryoku o haru mono to nari, subete no kokumin wa omae no majinai de damasare,
Mata, yogensha ya seito no chi, sarani, chijou de korosareta subete no mono no chi ga, kono miyako de nagasaretakara de aru".
Kono nochi, watashi wa ten no taigungunshuu ga oogoe de tonaeru you na koe o kiita, "Hareruya, sukui to eikou to chikara to wa, warera no kami no mono de ari,
Sono sabaki wa, shinjitsu de tadashii. Kami wa, kan'in de chi o kegashita daiinpu o sabaki, kami no shimobetachi no chi no houfuku o kanojo ni nasattakara de aru".
Futatabi koe ga atte, "Hareruya, kanojo ga yakareru hi no kemuri wa, yoyo kagirinaku tachinoboru" to itta.
Suruto, nijuu yonnin no chourou to yontsu no ikimono to ga hirefushi, miza ni imasu kami o haishite itta, "Amen, hareruya".
Sono toki, miza kara koe ga dete itta, "Subete no kami no shimobetachi yo, kami o osoreru monotachi yo. Chiisaki mono mo ooinaru mono mo, tomo ni, warera no kami osan bi seyo".
Watashi wa mata, daigunshuu no koe, ooku no mizu no oto, mata hageshii raimei no you na mono o kiita. Sore wa kou itta, "Hareruya, zennousha ni shite Shu naru warera no kami wa, ou naru shihaisha de arareru.
Watashitachi wa yorokobitanoshimi, kami o agame matsurou. Kohitsuji no kon'in no toki ga kite, hanayome wa sono youi o shitakara de aru.
Kanojo wa, hikarikagayaku, kegare no nai asanuno no koromo o kiru koto o yurusareta. Kono asanuno no koromo wa, seitotachi no tadashii okonai de aru".
Sore kara, mitsukai wa watashi ni itta, "Kakishiruse. Kohitsuji no kon en ni manekareta mono wa, saiwai de aru". Mata watashi ni itta, "Korera wa, kami no shinjitsu no kotoba de aru".
Soko de, watashi wa kare no ashimoto ni hirefushite, kare o haisou to shita. Suruto, kare wa itta, "Sono you na koto o shite wa ikenai. Watashi wa, anata to onaji shimobe nakama de ari, mata Iesu no akashi bito de aru anata no kyoudaitachi to onaji shimobe nakama de aru. Tada kami dake o haishi nasai. Iesu no akashi wa, sunawachi yogen no rei de aru".
Mata watashi ga mite iruto, ten ga hirakare, miyo, soko ni shiroi uma ga ita. Sore ni notte iru kata wa, "Chuujitsu de shinjitsu na mono" to yobare, gi ni yotte sabaki, mata, tatakau kata de aru.
Sono me wa moeru honoo de ari, sono atama ni wa ooku no kanmuri ga atta. Mata, kare igai ni wa dare mo shiranai na ga sono mi ni shirusarete ita.
Kare wa chizome no koromo o matoi, sono na wa "Kami no kotoba" to yobareta.
Soshite, ten no gunzei ga, junpaku de, kegare no nai asanuno no koromo o kite, shiroi uma ni nori, kare ni shitagatta.
Sono kuchi kara wa, shokokumin o utsu tame ni, surudoi tsurugi ga dete ita. Kare wa, tetsu no tsue o motte shokokumin o osame, mata, zennousha naru kami no hageshii ikari no saka bune o fumu.
Sono kimono ni mo, sono momo ni mo, "Ou no ou, Shu no Shu" to iu na ga shirusarete ita.
Mata mite iruto, hitori no mitsukai ga taiyou no naka ni tatte ita. Kare wa, nakazora o tonde iru subete no tori ni mukatte, oogoe de sakenda, "Saa, kami no daienkai ni atsumatte koi.
Soshite, outachi no niku, shougun no niku, yuusha no niku, uma no niku, uma ni notte iru mono no niku, mata, subete no jiyuujin to dorei to no niku, chiisaki mono to ooinaru mono to no niku o kurae".
Nao mite iruto, kemono to chi no outachi to karera no gunzei to ga atsumari, uma ni notte iru kata to sono gunzei to ni taishite, tatakai o idonda.
Shikashi, kemono wa toraerare, mata, kono kemono no mae de shirushi o okonatte, kemono no kokuin o uketa mono to sono zou o ogamu mono to o madowashita nise yogensha mo, kemono to tomo ni toraerareta. Soshite, kono ryoushatomo, ikinagara, iou no moete iru hi no ike ni nagekomareta.
Sore igai no monotachi wa, uma ni notte orareru kata no kuchi kara deru tsurugi de kirikorosare, sono niku o, subete no tori ga akiru made tabeta.
Mata watashi ga mite iruto, hitori no mitsukai ga, soko shirenu tokoro no kagi to ookina kusari to o te ni motte, ten kara orite kita.
Kare wa, akuma de ari Satan de aru ryuu, sunawachi, kano toshi o heta hebi o toraete sen nen no aida tsunagi oki,
Soshite, soko shirenu tokoro ni nagekomi, iriguchi o tojite sono ue ni fuuin shi, sen nen no kikan ga owaru made, shokokumin o madowasu koto ga nai you ni shite oita. Sono nochi, shibaraku no aida dake kaihou sareru koto ni natte ita.
Mata mite iruto, kazu ooku no za ga ari, sono ue ni hitobito ga suwatte ita. Soshite, karera ni sabaki no ken ga ataerarete ita. Mata, Iesu no akashi o shi kami no kotoba o tsutaeta tame ni kubi o kirareta hitobito no rei ga soko ni ori, mata, kemono o mo sono zou o mo ogamazu, sono kokuin o hitai ya te ni ukeru koto o shinakatta hitobito ga ita. Karera wa ikikaette, Kirisuto to tomo ni sen nen no aida, shihai shita.
(sore igai no shinin wa, sen nen no kikan ga owaru made ikikaeranakatta.) kore ga daiichi no fukkatsu de aru.
Kono daiichi no fukkatsu ni azukaru mono wa, saiwai na mono de ari, mata sei naru mono de aru. Kono hitotachi ni taishite wa, daini no shi wa nan no chikara mo nai. Karera wa kami to Kirisuto to no saishi to nari, Kirisuto to tomo ni sen nen no aida, shihai suru.
Sen nen no kikan ga owaruto, Satan wa sono goku kara kaihou sareru.
Soshite, dete iki, chi no shihou ni iru shokokumin, sunawachi Gogu, Magogu o madowashi, karera o tatakai no tame ni shoushuu suru. Sono kazu wa, umi no suna no you ni ooi.
Karera wa chijou no hiroi tokoro ni nobotte kite, seitotachi no jin'ei to aisarete ita miyako to o houi shita. Suruto, ten kara hi ga kudatte kite, karera o yaki tsukushita.
Soshite, karera o madowashita akuma wa, hi to iou to no ike ni nagekomareta. Soko ni wa, kemono mo nise yogensha mo ite, karera wa yoyo kagirinaku nichiya, kurushimerareru no de aru.
Mata mite iruto, ookina shiroi miza ga ari, soko ni imasu kata ga atta. Ten mo chi mo mikao no mae kara nigesatte, atokata mo nakunatta.
Mata, shinde ita mono ga, ooinaru mono mo chiisaki mono mo tomo ni, miza no mae ni tatte iru no ga mieta. Kazukazu no shomotsu ga hirakaretaga, mou hitotsu no shomotsu ga hirakareta. Kore wa inochi no sho de atta. Shinin wa sono shiwaza ni ouji, kono shomotsu ni kakarete iru koto ni shitagatte, sabakareta.
Umi wa sono naka ni iru shinin o dashi, shi mo yomi mo sono naka ni iru shinin o dashi, soshite, onoono sono shiwaza ni oujite, sabaki o uketa.
Sore kara, shi mo yomi mo hi no ike ni nagekomareta. Kono hi no ike ga daini no shi de aru.
Kono inochi no sho ni na ga shirusarete inai mono wa mina, hi no ike ni nagekomareta.
Watashi wa mata, atarashii ten to atarashii chi to o mita. Saki no ten to chi to wa kiesari, umi mo nakunatte shimatta.
Mata, sei naru miyako, atarashii Erusaremu ga, otto no tame ni kikazatta hanayome no you ni youi o totonoete, kami no moto o dete, ten kara kudatte kuru no o mita.
Mata, miza kara ookina koe ga sakebu no o kiita, "Miyo, kami no makuya ga hito to tomo ni ari, kami ga hito to tomo ni sumi, hito wa kami no tami to nari, kami mizukara hito to tomo ni imashite,
Hito no me kara namida o mattaku nuguitotte kudasaru. Mohaya, shi mo naku, kanashimi mo, sakebi mo, itami mo nai. Saki no mono ga, sudeni sugisattakara de aru".
Suruto, miza ni imasu kata ga iwareta, "Miyo, watashi wa subete no mono o arata ni suru". Mata iwareta, "Kakishiruse. Korera no kotoba wa, shin zu bekide ari, makoto de aru".
Soshite, watashi ni ooserareta, "Koto wa sudeni natta. Watashi wa, Arupa de ari Omega de aru. Hajime de ari owaride aru. Kawaite iru mono ni wa, inochi no mizu no izumi kara atai nashi ni nomaseyou.
Shouri o eru mono wa, korera no mono o uketsugude arou. Watashi wa kare no kami to nari, kare wa watashi no ko to naru.
Shikashi, okubyou na mono, shinjinai mono, imubeki mono, hitogoroshi, kan'in o okonau mono, majinai o suru mono, guuzou o ogamu mono, subete itsuwari o iu mono ni wa, hi to iou no moete iru ike ga, karera no u kubeki mukui de aru. Kore ga daini no shi de aru".
Saigo no nanatsu no saigai ga michite iru nanatsu no hachi o motte ita nananin no mitsukai no hitori ga kite, watashi ni katatte itta, "Saa, ki nasai. Kohitsuji no tsuma naru hanayome o miseyou".
Kono mitsukai wa, watashi o mitama ni kanjita mama, ookina takai yama ni tsurete iki, seimiyako Erusaremu ga, kami no eikou no uchi ni, kami no mimoto o dete ten kara kudatte kuru no o misete kureta.
Sono miyako no kagayaki wa, kouka na houseki no you de ari, toumei na hekigyoku no you de atta.
Sore ni wa ookina, takai jouheki ga atte, juu ni no mon ga ari, sorera no mon ni wa, juu ni no mitsukai ga ori, Isuraeru no kora no juu ni buzoku no na ga, sore ni kaite atta.
Higashi ni mittsu no mon, kita ni mittsu no mon, minami ni mittsu no mon, nishi ni mittsu no mon ga atta.
Mata miyako no jouheki ni wa juu ni no dodai ga ari, sore ni wa kohitsuji no juu ni shito no juu ni no na ga kaite atta.
Watashi ni katatte ita mono wa, miyako to sono mon to jouheki to o hakaru tame ni, kin no hakari zao o motte ita.
Miyako wa houkei de atte, sono nagasa to haba to wa onaji de aru. Kare ga sono hakari zao de miyako o hakaruto, ichi man nisen chou de atta. Nagasa to haba to takasa to wa, izure mo onaji de aru.
Mata jouheki o hakaruto, hyaku yonjuu yon kyubito de atta. Kore wa ningen no, sunawachi, mitsukai no shakudo ni yoru no de aru.
Jouheki wa hekigyoku de kizukare, miyako wa sukitootta garasu no you na junkin de tsukurarete ita.
Miyako no jouheki no dodai wa, samazama na houseki de kazararete ita. Daiichi no dodai wa hekigyoku, daini wa Safaiya, daisan wa menou, daiyon wa ryokugyoku,
Daigo wa shima menou, dairoku wa akame nou, dainana wa kanranseki, daihachi wa ryokuchuuseki, daikyuu wa ougyokuseki, daijuu wa hisui, daijuu ichi wa seigyoku, daijuu ni wa murasakizuishou de atta.
Juu ni no mon wa juu ni no shinju de ari, mon wa sorezore hitotsu no shinju de tsukurare, miyako no oodoori wa, sukitootta garasu no you na junkin de atta.
Watashi wa, kono miyako no naka ni wa seijo o minakatta. Zennousha ni shite Shu naru kami to kohitsuji to ga, sono seijo na no de aru.
Miyako wa, hi ya tsuki ga sore o tera suhitsuyou ga nai. Kami no eikou ga miyako o akaruku shi, kohitsuji ga miyako no akari dakara de aru.
Shokokumin wa miyako no hikari no naka o aruki, chi no outachi wa, jibuntachi no kouei o soko ni tazusaete kuru.
Miyako no mon wa, shuujitsu, tozasareru koto wa nai. Soko ni wa yoru ga naikara de aru.
Hitobito wa, shokokumin no kouei to homare to o soko ni tazusaete kuru.
Shikashi, kegareta mono ya, imubeki koto oyobi itsuwari o okonau mono wa, sono naka ni kesshite wa irenai. Haireru mono wa, kohitsuji no inochi no sho ni na o shirusarete iru mono dake de aru.
Mitsukai wa mata, suishou no you ni kagayaite iru inochi no mizu no kawa o watashi ni misete kureta. Kono kawa wa, kami to kohitsuji to no miza kara dete,
Miyako no oodoori no chuuou o nagarete iru. Kawa no ryougawa ni wa inochi no ki ga atte, juu ni shu no mi o musubi, sono jitsu wa maitsuki minori, sono kinoha wa shokokumin o iyasu.
Norowarubeki mono wa, mohaya nani hitotsu nai. Kami to kohitsuji to no miza wa miyako no naka ni ari, sono shimobetachi wa kare o reihai shi,
Mikao o aogimiru no de aru. Karera no hitai ni wa, mina ga shirusarete iru.
Yoru wa, mohaya nai. Akari mo taiyou no hikari mo, iranai. Shu naru kami ga karera o tera shi, soshite, karera wa yoyo kagirinaku shihai suru.
Kare wa mata, watashi ni itta, "Korera no kotoba wa shin zu bekide ari, makoto de aru. Yogensha tachi no tamashii no kami naru Shu wa, sugu ni mo okorubeki koto o sono shimobetachi ni shimesou to shite, mitsukai o tsukawasareta no de aru.
Miyo, watashi wa, sugu ni kuru. Kono sho no yogen no kotoba o mamoru mono wa, saiwai de aru".
Korera no koto o mikiki shita mono wa, kono Yohane de aru. Watashi ga mikiki shita toki, sorera no koto o shimeshite kureta mitsukai no ashimoto ni hirefushite haisou to suruto,
Kare wa itta, "Sono you na koto o shite wa ikenai. Watashi wa, anata ya, anata no kyoudai de aru yogensha tachi ya, kono sho no kotoba o mamoru monotachi to, onaji shimobe nakama de aru. Tada kami dake o haishi nasai".
Mata watashi ni itta, "Kono sho no yogen no kotoba o fuujite wa naranai. Toki ga chikazuite irukara de aru.
Fugi na mono wa sarani fugi o okonai, kegareta mono wa sarani kegareta koto o okonai, gi naru mono wa sarani gi o okonai, sei naru mono wa sarani sei naru koto o okonau mama ni sase yo".
"Miyo, watashi wa sugu ni kuru. Mukui o tazusaete kite, sorezore no shiwaza ni oujite mukuiyou.
Watashi wa Arupa de ari, Omega de aru. Saisho no mono de ari, saigo no mono de aru. Hajime de ari, owari de aru.
Inochi no ki ni azukaru tokken o ataerare, mata mon o tootte miyako ni wa iru tame ni, jibun no kimono o arau monotachi wa, saiwai de aru.
Inudomo, majinai o suru mono, kan'in o okonau mono, hitogoroshi, guuzou o ogamu mono, mata, itsuwari o konomi katsu kore o okonau mono wa mina, soto ni dasarete iru.
Watashi Iesu wa, tsukai o tsukawashite, shokyoukai no tame ni, korera no koto o anata gata ni akashi shita. Watashi wa, Dabide no wakaeda mata shison de ari, kagayaku ake no myoujou de aru".
Mitama mo hanayome mo tomo ni itta, "Kitarimase". Mata, kiku mono mo "Kitarimase" to ii nasai. Kawaite iru mono wa koko ni kuru ga yoi. Inochi no mizu ga hoshii mono wa, atai nashi ni sore o ukeru ga yoi.
Kono sho no yogen no kotoba o kiku subete no hitobito ni taishite, watashi wa keikoku suru. Moshi kore ni kakikuwaeru mono ga areba, kami wa sono hito ni, kono sho ni kakarete iru saigai o kuwaerareru.
Mata, moshi kono yogen no sho no kotoba o torinozoku mono ga areba, kami wa sono hito no u kubeki fun o, kono sho ni kakarete iru inochi no ki to sei naru miyako kara, torinozokareru.
Korera no koto o akashi suru kata ga oose ni naru, "Shikari, watashi wa sugu ni kuru". Amen, Shu Iesu yo, kitarimase.
Shu Iesu no megumi ga, ichidou no mono to tomo ni aru you ni.

